o de Código SOP: Fluxo de Trabalho Completo","ru":"SOP-код-ревью: Комплексный поток работ","ar":"استعراض كود SOP: تدفق عمل شاملة","en":"sop-code-review"},"description":{"zh":"代码审查工作流程是一种全面代码审查方法，使用专门的审查员对不同质量方面进行审查","ja":"コードレビュー ワークフローは、専門のレビュアーを使用してコードの品質のさまざまな側面を徹底的にレビューする方法","ko":"코드 리뷰 워크플로는 다양한 코드 품질 측면에 대한 전문가 리뷰를 통해 코드 품질을 향상시키는 방법","es":"El flujo de trabajo de revisión de código SOP es un proceso de revisión de código integral que utiliza comprobaciones automatizadas y revisiones especializad...","fr":"Le workflow de révision de code SOP est un processus de révision de code complet qui utilise des vérifications automatisées et des révisions spécialisées pou...","de":"Der Code-Review-Workfluss SOP ist ein umfassender Code-Überprüfungsprozess, der automatisierte Prüfungen und spezialisierte Überprüfungen verwendet, um die Q...","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho de revisão de código SOP é um processo completo que envolve verificação automática, revisões especializadas e aprovação final para garant...","ru":"Поток работ код-ревью SOP - это комплексный процесс, включающий автоматическую проверку, специализированные обзоры и окончательное одобрение для обеспечения ...","ar":"تدفق عمل استعراض كود SOP هو عملية شاملة تشمل الفحص الآلي والاستعراضات المتخصصة والموافقة النهائية لضمان جودة الكود","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动化检查","专门的代码审查员","集成审查","最终批准"],"ja":["自動化チェック","専門のコードレビュアー","統合レビュー","最終承認"],"ko":["자동화된 체크","전문가 코드 리뷰어","통합 리뷰","최종 승인"],"es":["Comprobaciones automatizadas","Revisiones especializadas","Revisión de integración","Aprobación final"],"fr":["Vérifications automatisées","Révisions spécialisées","Révision d''intégration","Approbation finale"],"de":["Automatisierte Prüfungen","Spezialisierte Überprüfungen","Integration-Überprüfung","Endgültige Genehmigung"],"pt":["Verificação automática de qualidade","Revisões especializadas para diferentes aspectos de qualidade","Revisão de integração para garantir a coesão do código","Aprovação final para garantir a qualidade do código"],"ru":["Автоматическая проверка качества","Специализированные обзоры для различных аспектов качества","Обзор интеграции для обеспечения сплоченности кода","Окончательное одобрение для обеспечения качества кода"],"ar":["الفحص الآلي لجودة الكود","الاستعراضات المتخصصة لمختلف جوانب الجودة","استعراض التكامل لضمان سلامة الكود","الموافقة النهائية لضمان جودة الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查","代码质量","自动化检查","专门的代码审查员","集成审查","最终批准"],"ja":["コードレビュー","コード品質","自動化チェック","専門のコードレビュアー","統合レビュー","最終承認"],"ko":["코드 리뷰","코드 품질","자동화된 체크","전문가 코드 리뷰어","통합 리뷰","최종 승인"],"es":["revisión de código","flujo de trabajo","comprobaciones automatizadas","revisiones especializadas","calidad del código","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["révision de code","workflow","vérifications automatisées","révisions spécialisées","qualité du code","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Code-Überprüfung","Workfluss","automatisierte Prüfungen","spezialisierte Überprüfungen","Code-Qualität","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["revisão de código","fluxo de trabalho","verificação automática","revisões especializadas","aprovação final","qualidade do código","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["код-ревью","поток работ","автоматическая проверка","специализированные обзоры","окончательное одобрение","качество кода","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["استعراض كود","تدفق عمل","الفحص الآلي","الاستعراضات المتخصصة","الموافقة النهائية","جودة الكود","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"DNYoussef","repo":"ai-chrome-extension","repoPath":"DNYoussef/ai-chrome-extension","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.404Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sop-code-review","description":"Comprehensive code review workflow coordinating quality, security, performance, and documentation reviewers. 4-hour timeline for thorough multi-agent review.","bodyPreview":"# SOP: Code Review Workflow\n\nComprehensive code review using specialized reviewers for different quality aspects.\n\n## Timeline: 4 Hours\n\n**Phases**:\n1. Automated Checks (30 min)\n2. Specialized Reviews (2 hours)\n3. Integration Review (1 hour)\n4. Final Approval (30 min)\n\n---\n\n## Phase 1: Automated Checks (30 minutes)\n\n### Quick Quality Checks\n\n**Parallel Automated Testing**:\n\n```javascript\n// Initialize review swarm\nawait mcp__ruv-swarm__swarm_init({\n  topology: ''star'',  // Coordinator pattern for","body":"# SOP: Code Review Workflow\n\nComprehensive code review using specialized reviewers for different quality aspects.\n\n## Timeline: 4 Hours\n\n**Phases**:\n1. Automated Checks (30 min)\n2. Specialized Reviews (2 hours)\n3. Integration Review (1 hour)\n4. Final Approval (30 min)\n\n---\n\n## Phase 1: Automated Checks (30 minutes)\n\n### Quick Quality Checks\n\n**Parallel Automated Testing**:\n\n```javascript\n// Initialize review swarm\nawait mcp__ruv-swarm__swarm_init({\n  topology: ''star'',  // Coordinator pattern for reviews\n  maxAgents: 6,\n  strategy: ''specialized''\n});\n\n// Run all automated checks in parallel\nconst [lint, tests, coverage, build] = await Promise.all([\n  Task(\"Linter\", `\nRun linting checks:\n- ESLint for JavaScript/TypeScript\n- Pylint for Python\n- RuboCop for Ruby\n- Check for code style violations\n\nStore results: code-review/${prId}/lint-results\n`, \"reviewer\"),\n\n  Task(\"Test Runner\", `\nRun test suite:\n- Unit tests\n- Integration tests\n- E2E tests (if applicable)\n- All tests must pass\n\nStore results: code-review/${prId}/test-results\n`, \"tester\"),\n\n  Task(\"Coverage Analyzer\", `\nCheck code coverage:\n- Overall coverage > 80%\n- New code coverage > 90%\n- No critical paths uncovered\n\nGenerate coverage report\nStore: code-review/${prId}/coverage-report\n`, \"reviewer\"),\n\n  Task(\"Build Validator\", `\nValidate build:\n- Clean build (no warnings)\n- Type checking passes\n- No broken dependencies\n- Bundle size within limits\n\nStore build results: code-review/${prId}/build-status\n`, \"reviewer\")\n]);\n\n// If any automated check fails, stop and request fixes\nif (hasFailures([lint, tests, coverage, build])) {\n  await Task(\"Review Coordinator\", `\nAutomated checks failed. Request fixes from author:\n${summarizeFailures([lint, tests, coverage, build])}\n\nStore feedback: code-review/${prId}/automated-feedback\n`, \"pr-manager\");\n  return; // Stop review until fixed\n}\n```\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- All automated checks passing\n- Test results documented\n- Coverage report generated\n\n---\n\n## Phase 2: Specialized Reviews (2 hours)\n\n### Parallel Expert Reviews\n\n**Sequential coordination of parallel reviews**:\n\n```javascript\n// Spawn specialized reviewers in parallel\nconst [codeQuality, security, performance, architecture, docs] = await Promise.all([\n  Task(\"Code Quality Reviewer\", `\nReview for code quality:\n\n**Readability**:\n- Clear, descriptive names (variables, functions, classes)\n- Appropriate function/method length (< 50 lines)\n- Logical code organization\n- Minimal cognitive complexity\n\n**Maintainability**:\n- DRY principle (no code duplication)\n- SOLID principles followed\n- Clear separation of concerns\n- Proper error handling\n\n**Best Practices**:\n- Following language idioms\n- Proper use of design patterns\n- Appropriate comments (why, not what)\n- No code smells (magic numbers, long parameter lists)\n\nStore review: code-review/${prId}/quality-review\nRating: 1-5 stars\n`, \"code-analyzer\"),\n\n  Task(\"Security Reviewer\", `\nReview for security issues:\n\n**Authentication & Authorization**:\n- Proper authentication checks\n- Correct authorization rules\n- No privilege escalation risks\n- Secure session management\n\n**Data Security**:\n- Input validation (prevent injection attacks)\n- Output encoding (prevent XSS)\n- Sensitive data encryption\n- No hardcoded secrets or credentials\n\n**Common Vulnerabilities** (OWASP Top 10):\n- SQL Injection prevention\n- XSS prevention\n- CSRF protection\n- Secure dependencies (no known vulnerabilities)\n\nStore review: code-review/${prId}/security-review\nSeverity: Critical/High/Medium/Low for each finding\n`, \"security-manager\"),\n\n  Task(\"Performance Reviewer\", `\nReview for performance issues:\n\n**Algorithmic Efficiency**:\n- Appropriate time complexity (no unnecessary O(n²))\n- Efficient data structures chosen\n- No unnecessary iterations\n- Lazy loading where appropriate\n\n**Resource Usage**:\n- No memory leaks\n- Proper cleanup (connections, files, timers)\n- Efficient database queries (avoid N+1)\n- Batch operations where possible\n\n**Optimization Opportunities**:\n- Caching potential\n- Parallelization opportunities\n- Database index needs\n- API call optimization\n\nStore review: code-review/${prId}/performance-review\nImpact: High/Medium/Low for each finding\n`, \"perf-analyzer\"),\n\n  Task(\"Architecture Reviewer\", `\nReview for architectural consistency:\n\n**Design Patterns**:\n- Follows established patterns in codebase\n- Appropriate abstraction level\n- Proper dependency injection\n- Clean architecture principles\n\n**Integration**:\n- Fits well with existing code\n- No unexpected side effects\n- Backward compatibility maintained\n- API contracts respected\n\n**Scalability**:\n- Design supports future growth\n- No hardcoded limits\n- Stateless where possible\n- Horizontally scalable\n\nStore review: code-review/${prId}/architecture-review\nConcerns: Blocker/Major/Minor for each finding\n`, \"system-architect\"),\n\n  Task(\"Documentation Reviewer\", `\nReview documentation:\n\n**Code Documentation**:\n- Public APIs documented (JSDoc/docstring)\n- Complex logic explained\n- Non-obvious behavior noted\n- Examples provided where helpful\n\n**External Documentation**:\n- README updated (if needed)\n- API docs updated (if API changed)\n- Migration guide (if breaking changes)\n- Changelog updated\n\n**Tests as Documentation**:\n- Test names are descriptive\n- Test coverage demonstrates usage\n- Edge cases documented in tests\n\nStore review: code-review/${prId}/docs-review\nCompleteness: 0-100%\n`, \"api-docs\")\n]);\n\n// Aggregate all reviews\nawait Task(\"Review Aggregator\", `\nAggregate specialized reviews:\n- Quality: ${codeQuality}\n- Security: ${security}\n- Performance: ${performance}\n- Architecture: ${architecture}\n- Documentation: ${docs}\n\nIdentify:\n- Blocking issues (must fix before merge)\n- High-priority suggestions\n- Nice-to-have improvements\n\nGenerate summary\nStore: code-review/${prId}/aggregated-review\n`, \"reviewer\");\n```\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- 5 specialized reviews completed\n- Issues categorized by severity\n- Aggregated review summary\n\n---\n\n## Phase 3: Integration Review (1 hour)\n\n### End-to-End Impact Assessment\n\n**Sequential Analysis**:\n\n```javascript\n// Step 1: Integration Testing\nawait Task(\"Integration Tester\", `\nTest integration with existing system:\n- Does this change break any existing functionality?\n- Are all integration tests passing?\n- Does it play well with related modules?\n- Any unexpected side effects?\n\nRun integration test suite\nStore results: code-review/${prId}/integration-tests\n`, \"tester\");\n\n// Step 2: Deployment Impact\nawait Task(\"DevOps Reviewer\", `\nAssess deployment impact:\n- Infrastructure changes needed?\n- Database migrations required?\n- Configuration updates needed?\n- Backward compatibility maintained?\n- Rollback plan clear?\n\nStore assessment: code-review/${prId}/deployment-impact\n`, \"cicd-engineer\");\n\n// Step 3: User Impact\nawait Task(\"Product Reviewer\", `\nAssess user impact:\n- Does this change improve user experience?\n- Are there any user-facing changes?\n- Is UX/UI consistent with design system?\n- Are analytics/tracking updated?\n\nStore assessment: code-review/${prId}/user-impact\n`, \"planner\");\n\n// Step 4: Risk Assessment\nawait Task(\"Risk Analyzer\", `\nOverall risk assessment:\n- What''s the blast radius of this change?\n- What''s the worst-case failure scenario?\n- Do we have rollback procedures?\n- Should this be feature-flagged?\n- Monitoring and alerting adequate?\n\nStore risk assessment: code-review/${prId}/risk-analysis\nRecommendation: Approve/Conditional/Reject\n`, \"reviewer\");\n```\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Integration test results\n- Deployment impact assessment\n- User impact assessment\n- Risk analysis\n\n---\n\n## Phase 4: Final Approval (30 minutes)\n\n### Review Summary & Decision\n\n**Sequential Finalization**:\n\n```javascript\n// Step 1: Generate Final Summary\nawait Task(\"Review Coordinator\", `\nGenerate final review summary:\n\n**Automated Checks**: ✅ All passing\n**Quality Review**: ${qualityScore}/5\n**Security Review**: ${securityIssues} issues (${criticalCount} critical)\n**Performance Review**: ${perfIssues} issues (${highImpactCount} high-impact)\n**Architecture Review**: ${archConcerns} concerns (${blockerCount} blockers)\n**Documentation Review**: ${docsCompleteness}% complete\n**Integration Tests**: ${integrationStatus}\n**Deployment Impact**: ${deploymentImpact}\n**User Impact**: ${userImpact}\n**Risk Level**: ${riskLevel}\n\n**Blocking Issues**:\n${listBlockingIssues()}\n\n**Recommendations**:\n${generateRecommendations()}\n\n**Overall Decision**: ${decision} (Approve/Request Changes/Reject)\n\nStore final summary: code-review/${prId}/final-summary\n`, \"pr-manager\");\n\n// Step 2: Author Notification\nawait Task(\"Notification Agent\", `\nNotify PR author:\n- Review complete\n- Summary of findings\n- Action items (if any)\n- Next steps\n\nSend notification\nStore: code-review/${prId}/author-notification\n`, \"pr-manager\");\n\n// Step 3: Decision Actions\nif (decision === ''Approve'') {\n  await Task(\"Merge Coordinator\", `\nApproved for merge:\n- Add \"approved\" label\n- Update PR status\n- Queue for merge (if auto-merge enabled)\n- Notify relevant teams\n\nStore: code-review/${prId}/merge-approval\n`, \"pr-manager\");\n} else if (decision === ''Request Changes'') {\n  await Task(\"Feedback Coordinator\", `\nRequest changes:\n- Create detailed feedback comment\n- Label as \"changes-requested\"\n- Assign back to author\n- Schedule follow-up review\n\nStore: code-review/${prId}/change-request\n`, \"pr-manager\");\n} else {\n  await Task(\"Rejection Handler\", `\nReject PR:\n- Create detailed explanation\n- Suggest alternative approaches\n- Label as \"rejected\"\n- Close PR (or request fundamental rework)\n\nStore: code-review/${prId}/rejection\n`, \"pr-manager\");\n}\n```\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Final review summary\n- Author notification\n- Decision and next steps\n\n---\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n### Review Quality\n- **Coverage**: All aspects reviewed (quality, security, performance, architecture, docs)\n- **Consistency**: Reviews follow established guidelines\n- **Actionability**: All feedback is specific and actionable\n- **Timeliness**: Reviews completed within 4 hours\n\n### Code Quality Gates\n- **Automated Tests**: 100% passing\n- **Code Coverage**: > 80% overall, > 90% for new code\n- **Linting**: 0 violations\n- **Security**: 0 critical issues, 0 high-severity issues\n- **Performance**: No high-impact performance regressions\n- **Documentation**: 100% of public APIs documented\n\n### Process Metrics\n- **Review Turnaround**: < 4 hours (business hours)\n- **Author Satisfaction**: > 4/5 (feedback is helpful)\n- **Defect Escape Rate**: < 1% (issues found in production that should have been caught)\n\n---\n\n## Review Guidelines\n\n### What Reviewers Should Focus On\n\n**DO Review**:\n- Logic correctness\n- Edge case handling\n- Error handling robustness\n- Security vulnerabilities\n- Performance implications\n- Code clarity and maintainability\n- Test coverage and quality\n- API design and contracts\n- Documentation completeness\n\n**DON''T Nitpick**:\n- Personal style preferences (use automated linting)\n- Minor variable naming (unless truly confusing)\n- Trivial formatting (use automated formatting)\n- Subjective \"better\" ways (unless significantly better)\n\n### Giving Feedback\n\n**Effective Feedback**:\n- ✅ \"This function has O(n²) complexity. Consider using a hash map for O(n).\"\n- ✅ \"This input isn''t validated. Add validation to prevent SQL injection.\"\n- ✅ \"This error isn''t logged. Add error logging for debugging.\"\n\n**Ineffective Feedback**:\n- ❌ \"I don''t like this.\"\n- ❌ \"This could be better.\"\n- ❌ \"Change this.\" (without explanation)\n\n**Tone**:\n- Be respectful and constructive\n- Assume good intent\n- Ask questions rather than make demands\n- Suggest, don''t dictate (unless security/critical issue)\n\n---\n\n## Agent Coordination Summary\n\n**Total Agents Used**: 12-15\n**Execution Pattern**: Star topology (coordinator with specialists)\n**Timeline**: 4 hours\n**Memory Namespaces**: code-review/{pr-id}/*\n\n**Key Agents**:\n1. reviewer - Lint, build, coordination\n2. tester - Test execution, integration testing\n3. code-analyzer - Code quality review\n4. security-manager - Security review\n5. perf-analyzer - Performance review\n6. system-architect - Architecture review\n7. api-docs - Documentation review\n8. cicd-engineer - Deployment impact\n9. planner - Product/user impact\n10. pr-manager - Review coordination, notifications\n\n---\n\n## Usage\n\n```javascript\n// Invoke this SOP skill for a PR\nSkill(\"sop-code-review\")\n\n// Or execute with specific PR\nTask(\"Code Review Orchestrator\", `\nExecute comprehensive code review for PR #${prNumber}\nRepository: ${repoName}\nAuthor: ${authorName}\nChanges: ${changesSummary}\n`, \"pr-manager\")\n```\n\n---\n\n**Status**: Production-ready SOP\n**Complexity**: Medium (12-15 agents, 4 hours)\n**Pattern**: Star topology with specialized reviewers\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:12:30.969Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring structured quality assurance workflows with automated checks and specialized reviewer integration.","zh":"适用于需要结构化质量保证工作流程的代码审查代理，具有自动化检查和专业审查员集成。","ja":"構造化された品質保証ワークフローと自動化されたチェック、および専門のレビュアー統合を必要とするコードレビュー代理に最適です。","ko":"구조화된 품질 보증 워크플ロー와 자동화된 체크 및 전문 리뷰어 통합이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisión de Código que requieren flujos de trabajo de aseguramiento de la calidad estructurados con comprobaciones automatizadas e integración de revisores especializados.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Revue de Code nécessitant des flux de travail de garantie de la qualité structurés avec des vérifications automatisées et une intégration de relecteurs spécialisés.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agenten, die strukturierte Qualitätsicherungs-Workflows mit automatisierten Prüfungen und spezieller Gutachterintegration erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que requerem fluxos de trabalho de garantia de qualidade estruturados com verificações automatizadas e integração de revisores especializados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодового обзора, требующих структурированных потоков обеспечения качества с автоматическими проверками и специализированной интеграцией рецензентов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات مراجعة الكود التي تتطلب سير عمل ضمان جودة منظم مع فحوصات آلية وتكامل منقحين متخصصين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct comprehensive code reviews using parallel automated testing, specialized reviews for different quality aspects, and integration reviews, all leveraging a coordinator pattern for efficient swarm initialization with libraries like JavaScript.","zh":"赋予代理进行全面代码审查的能力，使用并行自动化测试、不同质量方面的专业审查和集成审查，所有这些都利用协调器模式来高效地初始化群集，借助像JavaScript这样的库。","ja":"並列自動テスト、さまざまな品質の側面の専門的なレビュー、統合レビューなどを使用して、包括的なコードレビューを実施するエージェントの能力を提供します。また、JavaScriptなどのライブラリを利用した効率的なスウォーム初期化のためのコーディネーター パターンを活用します。","ko":"병렬 자동 테스트, 다양한 품질 측면의 전문 리뷰 및 통합 리뷰 등을 사용하여 포괄적인 코드 리뷰를 수행할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, JavaScript와 같은 라이브러리를 사용한 효율적인 스와ーム 초기화를 위한 코디네이터 패턴을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar revisiones de código exhaustivas utilizando pruebas automatizadas paralelas, revisiones especializadas para diferentes aspectos de la calidad y revisiones de integración, todo aprovechando un patrón de coordinador para una inicialización eficiente de enjambre con bibliotecas como JavaScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser des revues de code exhaustives en utilisant des tests automatisés parallèles, des revues spécialisées pour différents aspects de la qualité et des revues d''intégration, le tout en exploitant un modèle de coordinateur pour une initialisation efficace de l''essaim avec des bibliothèques comme JavaScript.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Code-Reviews durchzuführen, indem sie parallele automatisierte Tests, spezielle Überprüfungen für verschiedene Qualitätsaspekte und Integrationsüberprüfungen nutzen, all dies unter Ausnutzung eines Koordinator-Musters für eine effiziente Schwarminitialisierung mit Bibliotheken wie JavaScript.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar revisões de código abrangentes usando testes automatizados paralelos, revisões especializadas para diferentes aspectos de qualidade e revisões de integração, todos aproveitando um padrão de coordenador para inicialização eficiente de enxame com bibliotecas como JavaScript.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить всесторонние обзоры кода с помощью параллельного автоматизированного тестирования, специализированных обзоров для различных аспектов качества и обзоров интеграции, все это опираясь на шаблон координатора для эффективной инициализации роя с помощью библиотек như JavaScript.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكلاء من إجراء مراجعات شاملة للكود باستخدام الاختبارات الآلية المتوازية والمراجعات المتخصصة لمختلف جوانب الجودة ومراجعات التكامل، كل ذلك بالاستفادة من نمط منسق لتحسين初始化 السرب باستخدام مكتبات مثل جافا سكريبت."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code quality checks","Conducting specialized reviews for security and performance","Integrating code changes with automated testing and validation"],"zh":["自动化代码质量检查","进行安全性和性能的专业审查","将代码更改与自动化测试和验证集成"],"ja":["コード品質チェックの自動化","セキュリティとパフォーマンスの専門的なレビューの実施","コード変更の自動テストと検証との統合"],"ko":["코드 품질 체크 자동화","보안 및 성능의 전문 리뷰 수행","코드 변경의 자동 테스트 및 검증 통합"],"es":["Automatización de comprobaciones de calidad de código","Realización de revisiones especializadas para seguridad y rendimiento","Integración de cambios de código con pruebas y validación automatizadas"],"fr":["Automatisation des vérifications de la qualité du code","Réalisations de revues spécialisées pour la sécurité et les performances","Intégration des modifications de code avec des tests et une validation automatisés"],"de":["Automatisierung von Code-Qualitätsprüfungen","Durchführung spezieller Überprüfungen für Sicherheit und Leistung","Integration von Code-Änderungen mit automatisierter Testung und Validierung"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações de qualidade de código","Realizar revisões especializadas para segurança e desempenho","Integrar alterações de código com testes e validação automatizados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверки качества кода","Провести специализированные обзоры для безопасности и производительности","Интегрировать изменения кода с автоматизированными тестами и проверкой"],"ar":["أتمتة فحوصات جودة الكود","إجراء مراجعات متخصصة للأمان والأداء","دمج تغييرات الكود مع الاختبارات والتحقق الآلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires 4 hours for complete workflow execution","Dependent on availability of specialized reviewers for different quality aspects","Limited to codebases compatible with automated testing and review tools"],"zh":["需要4小时才能完成工作流执行","依赖于不同质量方面的专业审查员的可用性","仅限于与自动化测试和审查工具兼容的代码库"],"ja":["ワークフローの完全な実行には4時間の時間が必要","さまざまな品質の側面の専門的なレビュワーの可用性に依存","自動テストおよびレビューツールと互換性のあるコードベースに限定"],"ko":["작업 흐름을 완전히 실행하기 위해 4시간의 시간이 필요","다양한 품질 측면의 전문 리뷰어의 가용성에 의존","자동 테스트 및 리뷰 도구와 호환되는 코드베이스에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere 4 horas para la ejecución completa del flujo de trabajo","Depende de la disponibilidad de revisores especializados para diferentes aspectos de la calidad","Limitado a bases de código compatibles con herramientas de prueba y revisión automatizadas"],"fr":["Nécessite 4 heures pour l''exécution complète du flux de travail","Dépend de la disponibilité de relecteurs spécialisés pour différents aspects de la qualité","Limité aux bases de code compatibles avec des outils de test et de revue automatisés"],"de":["Benötigt 4 Stunden für die vollständige Ausführung des Workflows","Hängt von der Verfügbarkeit von spezialisierten Gutachtern für verschiedene Qualitätsaspekte ab","Begrenzt auf Codebasen, die mit automatisierten Test- und Überprüfungstools kompatibel sind"],"pt":["Requer 4 horas para execução completa do fluxo de trabalho","Depende da disponibilidade de revisores especializados para diferentes aspectos de qualidade","Limitado a codebases compatíveis com ferramentas de teste e revisão automatizados"],"ru":["Требует 4 часов для полного выполнения рабочего процесса","Зависит от наличия специализированных рецензентов для различных аспектов качества","Ограничен кодбазами, совместимыми с автоматизированными инструментами тестирования и обзора"],"ar":["يتطلب 4 ساعات لتنفيذ كامل لسير العمل","يعتمد على توافر منقحين متخصصين لمختلف جوانب الجودة","محدود بالكودبايس المتوافقة مع أدوات الاختبار والمراجعة الآلية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
