uverlässigkeit von APIs"],"pt":["Teste de endpoints REST","Teste de endpoints GraphQL","Verificação de status de resposta","Verificação de conteúdo de resposta","Suporte a testes automáticos","Integração com o framework Playwright"],"ru":["Тестирование точек REST","Тестирование точек GraphQL","Проверка статуса ответа","Проверка содержимого ответа","Поддержка автоматических тестов","Интеграция с фреймворком Playwright"],"ar":["اختبار نقاط نهاية REST","اختبار نقاط نهاية GraphQL","التحقق من حالة الاستجابة","التحقق من محتوى الاستجابة","الدعم للاختبارات الآلية","التكامل مع إطار عمل Playwright"]},"keywords":{"zh":["API 测试","Playwright","REST","GraphQL","自动化测试","接口测试","软件测试","质量保证"],"ja":["API テスト","Playwright","REST","GraphQL","自動テスト","インターフェイス テスト","ソフトウェア テスト","品質保証"],"ko":["API 테스트","Playwright","REST","GraphQL","자동화 테스트","인터페이스 테스트","소프트웨어 테스트","품질 보증"],"es":["pruebas de API","testing de API","Playwright","endpoints REST","endpoints GraphQL","calidad de API","confiabilidad de API","desarrollo de API"],"fr":["test d''API","testing d''API","Playwright","points de terminaison REST","points de terminaison GraphQL","qualité d''API","fiabilité d''API","développement d''API"],"de":["API-Test","API-Testing","Playwright","REST-Endpunkte","GraphQL-Endpunkte","API-Qualität","API-Zuverlässigkeit","API-Entwicklung"],"pt":["teste de api","playwright","rest","graphql","teste automatizado","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de software","testes de unidade","testes de integração"],"ru":["тестирование api","playwright","rest","graphql","автоматическое тестирование","разработка программного обеспечения","качество программного обеспечения","юнит-тесты","тесты интеграции"],"ar":["اختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","playwright","rest","graphql","اختبار آلي","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة البرمجيات","اختبارات الوحدة","اختبارات التكامل"]}},"owner":"adaptationio","repo":"Skrillz","repoPath":"adaptationio/Skrillz","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.404Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api-testing","description":"REST and GraphQL API testing with Playwright. Use when testing APIs, mocking endpoints, validating responses, or integrating API tests with E2E flows.","version":"1.0.0","tags":["testing","api","rest","graphql","playwright","automation"],"bodyPreview":"# API Testing with Playwright\n\nComprehensive API testing for REST and GraphQL endpoints using Playwright''s built-in API testing capabilities.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```typescript\nimport { test, expect } from ''@playwright/test'';\n\ntest(''GET /api/users returns users'', async ({ request }) => {\n  const response = await request.get(''/api/users'');\n\n  expect(response.ok()).toBeTruthy();\n  expect(response.status()).toBe(200);\n\n  const users = await response.json();\n  expect(users).toHaveLength(10);\n  expect(us","body":"# API Testing with Playwright\n\nComprehensive API testing for REST and GraphQL endpoints using Playwright''s built-in API testing capabilities.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```typescript\nimport { test, expect } from ''@playwright/test'';\n\ntest(''GET /api/users returns users'', async ({ request }) => {\n  const response = await request.get(''/api/users'');\n\n  expect(response.ok()).toBeTruthy();\n  expect(response.status()).toBe(200);\n\n  const users = await response.json();\n  expect(users).toHaveLength(10);\n  expect(users[0]).toHaveProperty(''email'');\n});\n```\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Playwright includes API testing - no extra packages needed\nnpm install -D @playwright/test\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\n**playwright.config.ts:**\n```typescript\nimport { defineConfig } from ''@playwright/test'';\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  testDir: ''./tests'',\n  use: {\n    baseURL: ''http://localhost:3000'',\n    extraHTTPHeaders: {\n      ''Accept'': ''application/json'',\n    },\n  },\n  projects: [\n    {\n      name: ''api'',\n      testMatch: /.*\\.api\\.spec\\.ts/,\n    },\n    {\n      name: ''e2e'',\n      testMatch: /.*\\.e2e\\.spec\\.ts/,\n      use: { browserName: ''chromium'' },\n    },\n  ],\n});\n```\n\n## REST API Testing\n\n### GET Requests\n\n```typescript\ntest(''fetch user by ID'', async ({ request }) => {\n  const response = await request.get(''/api/users/123'');\n\n  expect(response.ok()).toBeTruthy();\n\n  const user = await response.json();\n  expect(user.id).toBe(123);\n  expect(user.email).toMatch(/@/);\n});\n```\n\n### POST Requests\n\n```typescript\ntest(''create new user'', async ({ request }) => {\n  const response = await request.post(''/api/users'', {\n    data: {\n      name: ''John Doe'',\n      email: ''john@example.com'',\n    },\n  });\n\n  expect(response.status()).toBe(201);\n\n  const user = await response.json();\n  expect(user.id).toBeDefined();\n  expect(user.name).toBe(''John Doe'');\n});\n```\n\n### PUT/PATCH Requests\n\n```typescript\ntest(''update user'', async ({ request }) => {\n  const response = await request.put(''/api/users/123'', {\n    data: {\n      name: ''Jane Doe'',\n    },\n  });\n\n  expect(response.ok()).toBeTruthy();\n\n  const user = await response.json();\n  expect(user.name).toBe(''Jane Doe'');\n});\n```\n\n### DELETE Requests\n\n```typescript\ntest(''delete user'', async ({ request }) => {\n  const response = await request.delete(''/api/users/123'');\n  expect(response.status()).toBe(204);\n\n  // Verify deletion\n  const getResponse = await request.get(''/api/users/123'');\n  expect(getResponse.status()).toBe(404);\n});\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Bearer Token\n\n```typescript\ntest.describe(''authenticated requests'', () => {\n  let token: string;\n\n  test.beforeAll(async ({ request }) => {\n    const response = await request.post(''/api/auth/login'', {\n      data: {\n        email: ''test@example.com'',\n        password: ''password123'',\n      },\n    });\n    const data = await response.json();\n    token = data.token;\n  });\n\n  test(''access protected endpoint'', async ({ request }) => {\n    const response = await request.get(''/api/protected'', {\n      headers: {\n        ''Authorization'': `Bearer ${token}`,\n      },\n    });\n    expect(response.ok()).toBeTruthy();\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### Cookie-Based Auth\n\n```typescript\ntest(''login and access dashboard'', async ({ request, context }) => {\n  // Login (sets cookie automatically)\n  await request.post(''/api/auth/login'', {\n    data: { email: ''test@example.com'', password: ''pass'' },\n  });\n\n  // Cookie is automatically included in subsequent requests\n  const response = await request.get(''/api/dashboard'');\n  expect(response.ok()).toBeTruthy();\n});\n```\n\n## GraphQL Testing\n\n### Query\n\n```typescript\ntest(''GraphQL query users'', async ({ request }) => {\n  const response = await request.post(''/graphql'', {\n    data: {\n      query: `\n        query GetUsers {\n          users {\n            id\n            name\n            email\n          }\n        }\n      `,\n    },\n  });\n\n  const { data, errors } = await response.json();\n  expect(errors).toBeUndefined();\n  expect(data.users).toHaveLength(10);\n});\n```\n\n### Mutation\n\n```typescript\ntest(''GraphQL create user'', async ({ request }) => {\n  const response = await request.post(''/graphql'', {\n    data: {\n      query: `\n        mutation CreateUser($input: CreateUserInput!) {\n          createUser(input: $input) {\n            id\n            name\n            email\n          }\n        }\n      `,\n      variables: {\n        input: {\n          name: ''John Doe'',\n          email: ''john@example.com'',\n        },\n      },\n    },\n  });\n\n  const { data, errors } = await response.json();\n  expect(errors).toBeUndefined();\n  expect(data.createUser.id).toBeDefined();\n});\n```\n\n### With Authentication\n\n```typescript\ntest(''GraphQL with auth'', async ({ request }) => {\n  const response = await request.post(''/graphql'', {\n    headers: {\n      ''Authorization'': `Bearer ${token}`,\n    },\n    data: {\n      query: `\n        query Me {\n          me {\n            id\n            email\n            role\n          }\n        }\n      `,\n    },\n  });\n\n  const { data } = await response.json();\n  expect(data.me.role).toBe(''admin'');\n});\n```\n\n## API Mocking (for E2E tests)\n\n### Mock API Responses\n\n```typescript\ntest(''display mocked products'', async ({ page }) => {\n  // Mock the API\n  await page.route(''**/api/products'', route => {\n    route.fulfill({\n      status: 200,\n      contentType: ''application/json'',\n      body: JSON.stringify([\n        { id: 1, name: ''Mock Product'', price: 99.99 },\n      ]),\n    });\n  });\n\n  await page.goto(''/products'');\n  await expect(page.locator(''.product'')).toHaveCount(1);\n  await expect(page.locator(''.product-name'')).toHaveText(''Mock Product'');\n});\n```\n\n### Simulate Errors\n\n```typescript\ntest(''handle API error gracefully'', async ({ page }) => {\n  await page.route(''**/api/products'', route => {\n    route.fulfill({\n      status: 500,\n      body: JSON.stringify({ error: ''Server error'' }),\n    });\n  });\n\n  await page.goto(''/products'');\n  await expect(page.locator(''.error-message'')).toBeVisible();\n});\n```\n\n### Delay Responses\n\n```typescript\ntest(''show loading state'', async ({ page }) => {\n  await page.route(''**/api/products'', async route => {\n    await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 2000));\n    route.fulfill({\n      status: 200,\n      body: JSON.stringify([]),\n    });\n  });\n\n  await page.goto(''/products'');\n  await expect(page.locator(''.loading-spinner'')).toBeVisible();\n});\n```\n\n## Response Validation\n\n### JSON Schema Validation\n\n```typescript\nimport Ajv from ''ajv'';\n\nconst ajv = new Ajv();\nconst userSchema = {\n  type: ''object'',\n  properties: {\n    id: { type: ''number'' },\n    name: { type: ''string'' },\n    email: { type: ''string'', format: ''email'' },\n  },\n  required: [''id'', ''name'', ''email''],\n};\n\ntest(''validate response schema'', async ({ request }) => {\n  const response = await request.get(''/api/users/1'');\n  const user = await response.json();\n\n  const validate = ajv.compile(userSchema);\n  expect(validate(user)).toBeTruthy();\n});\n```\n\n### Response Headers\n\n```typescript\ntest(''check response headers'', async ({ request }) => {\n  const response = await request.get(''/api/users'');\n\n  expect(response.headers()[''content-type'']).toContain(''application/json'');\n  expect(response.headers()[''x-rate-limit-remaining'']).toBeDefined();\n});\n```\n\n## File Upload\n\n```typescript\nimport path from ''path'';\n\ntest(''upload file'', async ({ request }) => {\n  const response = await request.post(''/api/upload'', {\n    multipart: {\n      file: {\n        name: ''test.pdf'',\n        mimeType: ''application/pdf'',\n        buffer: Buffer.from(''PDF content''),\n      },\n      description: ''Test document'',\n    },\n  });\n\n  expect(response.ok()).toBeTruthy();\n  const result = await response.json();\n  expect(result.filename).toBe(''test.pdf'');\n});\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Separate API and E2E tests** - Use different test files/projects\n2. **Use fixtures for common data** - Avoid repetition\n3. **Test error cases** - 400, 401, 403, 404, 500 responses\n4. **Validate response schemas** - Catch breaking changes early\n5. **Mock external APIs** - Don''t depend on third-party availability\n6. **Clean up test data** - Use `afterEach` or `afterAll` hooks\n\n## References\n\n- `references/graphql-testing.md` - Advanced GraphQL patterns\n- `references/schema-validation.md` - JSON Schema with Ajv\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:12:47.082Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for API-focused Agents requiring comprehensive testing of REST and GraphQL endpoints using Playwright''s API testing capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要对 REST 和 GraphQL 端点进行全面测试的 API 关注型代理，利用 Playwright 的 API 测试功能。","ja":"REST と GraphQL エンドポイントの包括的なテストが必要な API 対応エージェントに最適で、Playwright の API テスト機能を使用します。","ko":"REST 및 GraphQL 엔드포인트에 대한 포괄적인 테스트가 필요한 API 중심 에이전트에 적합하며 Playwright의 API 테스트 기능을 사용합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes centrados en API que requieren pruebas exhaustivas de puntos de conexión REST y GraphQL utilizando las capacidades de prueba de API de Playwright.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents axés sur l''API nécessitant des tests complets des points de terminaison REST et GraphQL en utilisant les capacités de test d''API de Playwright.","de":"Ideal für API-fokussierte Agenten, die umfassende Tests von REST- und GraphQL-Endpunkten unter Verwendung der API-Testfunktionen von Playwright erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes focados em API que exigem testes abrangentes de endpoints REST e GraphQL usando as capacidades de teste de API do Playwright.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на API, требующих всестороннего тестирования точек REST и GraphQL с использованием возможностей тестирования API Playwright.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء المُركّزين على واجهة برمجة التطبيقات التي تتطلب اختبارات شاملة لنقاط نهاية REST وGraphQL باستخدام إمكانيات اختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات في Playwright."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform comprehensive API testing for REST and GraphQL endpoints, leveraging Playwright''s built-in API testing capabilities, including request validation and JSON response parsing.","zh":"赋予代理执行 REST 和 GraphQL 端点的全面 API 测试的能力，利用 Playwright 的内置 API 测试功能，包括请求验证和 JSON 响应解析。","ja":"エージェントが REST と GraphQL エンドポイントの包括的な API テストを実行できるようにし、Playwright の組み込み API テスト機能を利用し、リクエストの検証と JSON 応答の解析が含まれます。","ko":"에이전트가 REST 및 GraphQL 엔드포인트에 대한 포괄적인 API 테스트를 수행할 수 있도록 하며 Playwright의 내장 API 테스트 기능을 사용하여 요청 검증 및 JSON 응답 파싱을 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar pruebas de API exhaustivas para puntos de conexión REST y GraphQL, aprovechando las capacidades de prueba de API integradas de Playwright, incluida la validación de solicitudes y el análisis de respuestas JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des tests d''API complets pour les points de terminaison REST et GraphQL, en exploitant les capacités de test d''API intégrées de Playwright, y compris la validation des requêtes et l''analyse des réponses JSON.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende API-Tests für REST- und GraphQL-Endpunkte durchzuführen, indem es die in Playwright integrierten API-Testfunktionen nutzt, einschließlich Anforderungsvalidierung und JSON-Antwortanalyse.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar testes de API abrangentes para endpoints REST e GraphQL, aproveitando as capacidades de teste de API integradas do Playwright, incluindo validação de solicitação e análise de resposta JSON.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять всестороннее тестирование API для точек REST и GraphQL, используя встроенные возможности тестирования API Playwright, включая проверку запроса и парсинг ответа JSON.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من أداء اختبارات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الشاملة لنقاط نهاية REST وGraphQL، مستفيدة من إمكانيات اختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات المدمجة في Playwright، بما في ذلك التحقق من الطلب وتحليل استجابة JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating tests for API endpoints","Validating JSON responses from REST and GraphQL APIs","Debugging API request failures using Playwright''s request logging"],"zh":["自动化 API 端点测试","验证 REST 和 GraphQL API 的 JSON 响应","使用 Playwright 的请求日志功能调试 API 请求故障"],"ja":["API エンドポイントのテストを自動化する","REST と GraphQL API からの JSON 応答を検証する","Playwright のリクエスト ロギング機能を使用して API リクエストの障害をデバッグする"],"ko":["API 엔드포인트 테스트 자동화","REST 및 GraphQL API의 JSON 응답 유효성 검사","Playwright의 요청 로깅 기능을 사용하여 API 요청 오류 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas para puntos de conexión de API","Validar respuestas JSON de API de REST y GraphQL","Depurar fallos de solicitudes de API utilizando el registro de solicitudes de Playwright"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests pour les points de terminaison d''API","Valider les réponses JSON des API REST et GraphQL","Déboguer les défaillances des requêtes d''API en utilisant le journal des requêtes de Playwright"],"de":["Automatisieren von Tests für API-Endpunkte","Validieren von JSON-Antworten von REST- und GraphQL-APIs","Fehler bei API-Anfragen mithilfe der Anfrage-Protokollierung von Playwright debuggen"],"pt":["Automatizar testes para endpoints de API","Validar respostas JSON de APIs REST e GraphQL","Depurar falhas de solicitação de API usando o registro de solicitação do Playwright"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тесты для точек API","Проверять ответы JSON от API REST и GraphQL","Отлаживать сбой запросов API с помощью журнала запросов Playwright"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبارات لنقاط واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"," التحقق من استجابات JSON من واجهات برمجة التطبيقات REST وGraphQL","تصحيح أخطاء طلب واجهة برمجة التطبيقات باستخدام سجل طلبات Playwright"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Playwright installation and configuration","Limited to testing REST and GraphQL endpoints"],"zh":["需要 Playwright 安装和配置","仅限测试 REST 和 GraphQL 端点"],"ja":["Playwright のインストールと設定が必要","REST と GraphQL エンドポイントのテストのみ"],"ko":["Playwright 설치 및 구성이 필요","REST 및 GraphQL 엔드포인트 테스트만 가능"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de Playwright","Limitado a la prueba de puntos de conexión REST y GraphQL"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Playwright","Limité aux tests des points de terminaison REST et GraphQL"],"de":["Erfordert Installation und Konfiguration von Playwright","Begrenzt auf Tests von REST- und GraphQL-Endpunkten"],"pt":["Exige instalação e configuração do Playwright","Limitado a testar endpoints REST e GraphQL"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки Playwright","Ограничен тестированием точек REST и GraphQL"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين Playwright","محدود باختبار نقاط نهاية REST وGraphQL"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
