travail","Établir des objectifs et des critères de succès clairs"],"de":["Subagenten für spezifische Domänen definieren","Arbeit effektiv delegieren","Subagenten für Domänen wie Explore und Bibliothekar verbessern","Die 7-Sektoren-Struktur für die Arbeitdelegation verwenden","Klare Ziele und Erfolgskriterien festlegen"],"pt":["Definição de subagentes","Delegação de tarefas","Estrutura de 7 seções para delegação","Definição de habilidades necessárias","Definição de resultados esperados"],"ru":["Определение субагентов","Делегирование задач","Структура из 7 разделов для делегирования","Определение необходимых навыков","Определение ожидаемых результатов"],"ar":["تعريف وكلاء فرعيين","تفويض المهام","هيكل من 7 أقسام لتفويض","تحديد المهارات المطلوبة","تحديد النتائج المتوقعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["子代理创建者技能","Claude 子代理","子代理定义","子代理使用","子代理改进","开发效率","7 节结构","委托工作"],"ja":["サブエージェント作成者スキル","Claude サブエージェント","サブエージェントの定義","サブエージェントの使用","サブエージェントの改善","開発効率","7 セクション構造","委託作業"],"ko":["서브 에이전트 생성자 기술","Claude 서브 에이전트","서브 에이전트 정의","서브 에이전트 사용","서브 에이전트 개선","개발 효율성","7 섹션 구조","위임 작업"],"es":["subagentes","desarrollo de subagentes","dominios específicos","delegar trabajo","mejorar subagentes","estructura de 7 secciones","objetivos y criterios de éxito"],"fr":["sous-agents","développement de sous-agents","domaines spécifiques","déléguer du travail","améliorer les sous-agents","structure de 7 sections","objectifs et critères de succès"],"de":["Subagenten","Subagenten-Entwicklung","spezifische Domänen","Arbeit delegieren","Subagenten verbessern","7-Sektoren-Struktur","Ziele und Erfolgskriterien"],"pt":["subagentes","Claude","delegação de tarefas","subagentes creator","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["субагенты","Claude","делегирование задач","субагенты creator","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["وكلاء فرعيين","Claude","تفويض المهام","وكلاء فرعيين creator","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Mineru98","repo":"skills-store","repoPath":"Mineru98/skills-store","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.404Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"subagents-creator","description":"Guide for defining and using Claude subagents effectively. Use when (1) creating new subagent types, (2) learning how to delegate work to specialized subagents, (3) improving subagent delegation prompts, (4) understanding subagent orchestration patterns, or (5) debugging ineffective subagent usage.","bodyPreview":"# Subagents Creator\n\nThis skill provides guidance for defining, using, and improving Claude subagents—the specialized agents that handle specific domains like `explore`, `librarian`, `oracle`, and `frontend-ui-ux-engineer`.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Delegating Work\n\nWhen delegating to subagents, use the **mandatory 7-section structure**:\n\n```\n1. TASK: Atomic, specific goal (one action per delegation)\n2. EXPECTED OUTCOME: Concrete deliverables with success criteria\n3. REQUIRED SKILLS: Which skill to i","body":"# Subagents Creator\n\nThis skill provides guidance for defining, using, and improving Claude subagents—the specialized agents that handle specific domains like `explore`, `librarian`, `oracle`, and `frontend-ui-ux-engineer`.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Delegating Work\n\nWhen delegating to subagents, use the **mandatory 7-section structure**:\n\n```\n1. TASK: Atomic, specific goal (one action per delegation)\n2. EXPECTED OUTCOME: Concrete deliverables with success criteria\n3. REQUIRED SKILLS: Which skill to invoke\n4. REQUIRED TOOLS: Explicit tool whitelist (prevents tool sprawl)\n5. MUST DO: Exhaustive requirements - leave NOTHING implicit\n6. MUST NOT DO: Forbidden actions - anticipate and block rogue behavior\n7. CONTEXT: File paths, existing patterns, constraints\n```\n\n### Choosing a Subagent\n\nSee [subagent-types.md](references/subagent-types.md) for detailed guidance on which subagent to use:\n- **`explore`**: Contextual grep for codebases\n- **`librarian`**: Reference search (docs, OSS, web)\n- **`oracle`**: Deep reasoning for architecture/complex decisions\n- **`frontend-ui-ux-engineer`**: Visual UI/UX changes\n\n## Defining New Subagents\n\n**Only create subagents when**: The task domain has distinct tooling, expertise, or patterns that benefit from specialization.\n\nSee [delegation-patterns.md](references/delegation-patterns.md) for:\n- Subagent definition templates\n- When to create a new subagent vs using existing ones\n- Naming and description guidelines\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\nSee [common-pitfalls.md](references/common-pitfalls.md) for:\n- Vague delegation prompts and why they fail\n- Over-delegating trivial tasks\n- Subagent misalignment with task type\n- Anti-patterns in agent orchestration\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **One action per delegation**: Combine tasks in parallel calls, not one call\n2. **Be exhaustive**: \"MUST DO\" and \"MUST NOT DO\" sections prevent drift\n3. **Background everything**: Use `background_task` for `explore` and `librarian`\n4. **Explicit tool lists**: Prevent subagents from using unauthorized tools\n5. **Verify results**: Check that delegated work meets expectations before proceeding\n\n## Delegation Example\n\n```python\n# GOOD: Specific, exhaustive\nbackground_task(\n    agent=\"explore\",\n    prompt=\"\"\"\n    1. TASK: Find all authentication implementations\n    2. EXPECTED OUTCOME: List of files with auth logic, patterns used\n    3. REQUIRED SKILLS: explore\n    4. REQUIRED TOOLS: Grep, Read\n    5. MUST DO: Search for ''jwt'', ''session'', ''auth'' patterns; identify middleware; list all endpoints\n    6. MUST NOT DO: Don''t modify any files; don''t run build/test commands\n    7. CONTEXT: Working in ./src directory, looking for Express.js patterns\n    \"\"\"\n)\n\n# BAD: Vague, implicit expectations\nbackground_task(\n    agent=\"explore\",\n    prompt=\"Find auth stuff in the codebase\"\n)\n```\n\n## Reference Files\n\n- [subagent-types.md](references/subagent-types.md) - When to use each subagent type\n- [delegation-patterns.md](references/delegation-patterns.md) - Prompt templates and patterns\n- [common-pitfalls.md](references/common-pitfalls.md) - Anti-patterns and how to avoid them\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:12:15.358Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced AI Agents like Claude, needing specialized subagents for domain-specific tasks such as exploration, librarian services, or oracle functionalities.","zh":"适合像 Claude 这样的高级 AI 代理，需要为特定领域任务提供专门的子代理，例如探索、图书馆服务或预言功能。","ja":"Claude のような高度な AI エージェントに適しており、探索、図書館サービス、または Oracle 機能などのドメイン固有のタスクに特化したサブエージェントが必要です。","ko":"클라우드와 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 탐색, 도서관 서비스 또는 오라클 기능과 같은 도메인별 작업을 위한 전문 하위 에이전트가 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados como Claude, que necesitan subagentes especializados para tareas específicas del dominio como la exploración, los servicios de bibliotecario o las funcionalidades de oráculo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA avancés comme Claude, nécessitant des sous-agents spécialisés pour des tâches spécifiques de domaine telles que l''exploration, les services de bibliothécaire ou les fonctionnalités d''oracle.","de":"Ideal für erweiterte KI-Agents wie Claude, die spezialisierte Subagenten für domänenspezifische Aufgaben wie Exploration, Bibliotheksdienste oder Orakelfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Avançados como Claude, que necessitam de subagentes especializados para tarefas específicas de domínio, como exploração, serviços de bibliotecário ou funcionalidades de oráculo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, которые требуют специализированных субагентов для задач, специфичных для домена, таких как исследование, услуги библиотекаря или функциональность оракула.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الذكيين المتقدمين مثل Claude ، الذين يحتاجون إلى وكلاء فرعيين متخصصين ل المهام الخاصة بنطاق معين مثل الاستكشاف أو خدمات المكتبات أو الوظائف المختصة بالاستشارات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define, use, and improve subagents through a mandatory 7-section structure, enabling efficient task delegation with clear expected outcomes and required skills, leveraging domains like `explore`, `librarian`, `oracle`, and `frontend-ui-ux-engineer`.","zh":"通过强制性的 7 部分结构，赋予代理定义、使用和改进子代理的能力，使任务委派具有明确的预期结果和所需技能，利用诸如 `explore`、`librarian`、`oracle` 和 `frontend-ui-ux-engineer` 的领域。","ja":"強制的な 7 部構成を通じて、エージェントがサブエージェントを定義、使用、改善できるようにし、タスクの委任を効率化し、明確な期待結果と必要なスキルを提供し、`explore`、`librarian`、`oracle`、`frontend-ui-ux-engineer` などのドメインを利用します。","ko":"강제적인 7개 섹션 구조를 통해 에이전트가 하위 에이전트를 정의, 사용 및 개선할 수 있도록 하여 작업 위임을 효율적으로 하고 명확한 예상 결과와 필요한 기술을 제공하며, `explore`, `librarian`, `oracle` 및 `frontend-ui-ux-engineer`와 같은 도메인을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes definir, utilizar y mejorar subagentes a través de una estructura de 7 secciones obligatoria, lo que permite una delegación de tareas eficiente con resultados esperados claros y habilidades requeridas, aprovechando dominios como `explorar`, `bibliotecario`, `oráculo` y `frontend-ui-ux-engineer`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir, d''utiliser et d''améliorer des sous-agents à travers une structure de 7 sections obligatoire, permettant une délégation de tâches efficace avec des résultats attendus clairs et des compétences requises, en exploitant des domaines comme `explorer`, `bibliothécaire`, `oracle` et `frontend-ui-ux-engineer`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Subagenten durch eine obligatorische 7-Abschnitts-Struktur zu definieren, zu verwenden und zu verbessern, wodurch eine effiziente Aufgabenübertragung mit klaren erwarteten Ergebnissen und erforderlichen Fähigkeiten ermöglicht wird, indem Bereiche wie `explorieren`, `Bibliothekar`, `Orakel` und `frontend-ui-ux-engineer` genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir, utilizar e melhorar subagentes por meio de uma estrutura de 7 seções obrigatória, permitindo a delegação eficiente de tarefas com resultados esperados claros e habilidades necessárias, aproveitando domínios como `explore`, `librarian`, `oracle` e `frontend-ui-ux-engineer`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам определять, использовать и совершенствовать субагентов посредством обязательной 7-секционной структуры, обеспечивающей эффективную делегацию задач с четкими ожидаемыми результатами и необходимыми навыками, используя домены seperti `explore`, `librarian`, `oracle` и `frontend-ui-ux-engineer`.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تعريف واستخدام وتحسين الوكلاء الفرعيين من خلال هيكل مكون من 7 أجزاء إجباري، مما يسمح بالتفويض الفعال للمهام مع النتائج المتوقعة الواضحة والمهارات المطلوبة، واستغلال المجالات مثل `explore` و `librarian` و `oracle` و `frontend-ui-ux-engineer`."},"useCases":{"en":["Delegating tasks to subagents for specific goals like data exploration","Defining required skills for subagents to handle complex domains","Improving subagent performance through clear expected outcomes and success criteria"],"zh":["将任务委托给子代理以实现特定目标，例如数据探索","定义子代理处理复杂领域所需的技能","通过明确的预期结果和成功标准改进子代理的性能"],"ja":["特定の目標、たとえばデータの探索を達成するためにサブエージェントにタスクを委任する","サブエージェントが複雑なドメインを処理するために必要なスキルを定義する","明確な期待結果と成功基準を通じてサブエージェントのパフォーマンスを改善する"],"ko":["특정 목표를 달성하기 위해 하위 에이전트에게 작업을 위임하는 것, 예를 들어 데이터 탐색","하위 에이전트가 복잡한 도메인을 처리하는 데 필요한 기술을 정의하는 것","명확한 예상 결과와 성공 기준을 통해 하위 에이전트의 성능을 개선하는 것"],"es":["Delegar tareas a subagentes para objetivos específicos como la exploración de datos","Definir habilidades requeridas para que los subagentes manejen dominios complejos","Mejorar el rendimiento de los subagentes a través de resultados esperados claros y criterios de éxito"],"fr":["Déléguer des tâches à des sous-agents pour des objectifs spécifiques comme l''exploration de données","Définir les compétences requises pour que les sous-agents gèrent des domaines complexes","Améliorer les performances des sous-agents grâce à des résultats attendus clairs et des critères de succès"],"de":["Aufgaben an Subagenten für spezifische Ziele wie die Datenexploration übertragen","Erforderliche Fähigkeiten für Subagenten definieren, um komplexe Bereiche zu bewältigen","Die Leistung von Subagenten durch klare erwartete Ergebnisse und Erfolgskriterien verbessern"],"pt":["Delegar tarefas a subagentes para metas específicas como exploração de dados","Definir habilidades necessárias para subagentes lidarem com domínios complexos","Melhorar o desempenho do subagente por meio de resultados esperados claros e critérios de sucesso"],"ru":["Делегировать задачи субагентам для конкретных целей, таких как исследование данных","Определить необходимые навыки для субагентов для работы с сложными доменами","Улучшить производительность субагента посредством четких ожидаемых результатов и критериев успеха"],"ar":["تفويض المهام إلى الوكلاء الفرعيين لأهداف محددة مثل استكشاف البيانات","تحديد المهارات المطلوبة للوكلاء الفرعيين لمعالجة المجالات المعقدة","تحسين أداء الوكيل الفرعي من خلال النتائج المتوقعة الواضحة ومعيار النجاح"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to the mandatory 7-section structure for task delegation","Specific to Claude subagents and their domains"],"zh":["需要遵守强制性的 7 部分结构进行任务委托","特定于 Claude 子代理及其领域"],"ja":["タスクの委任のために強制的な 7 部構成に従う必要がある","Claude サブエージェント及其のドメインに特有"],"ko":["작업 위임을 위해 강제적인 7개 섹션 구조를 따라야 함","클라우드 하위 에이전트及其 도메인에 특정"],"es":["Requiere la adhesión a la estructura de 7 secciones obligatoria para la delegación de tareas","Específico para subagentes de Claude y sus dominios"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion à la structure de 7 sections obligatoire pour la délégation de tâches","Spécifique aux sous-agents de Claude et à leurs domaines"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung der obligatorischen 7-Abschnitts-Struktur für die Aufgabenübertragung","Spezifisch für Subagenten von Claude und ihre Bereiche"],"pt":["Exige aderência à estrutura de 7 seções obrigatória para delegação de tarefas","Específico para subagentes Claude e seus domínios"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения обязательной 7-секционной структуры для делегации задач","Специфичен для субагентов Claude и их доменов"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بالهيكل المكون من 7 أجزاء الإجبارية للتفويض بالمهام","محدد للوكلاء الفرعيين Claude ومجالاتهم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('blicktz/knowledge_base_repo/nick-theriot', 'community', 'blicktz', 'knowledge_base_repo', 'blicktz/knowledge_base_repo', 'nick-theriot', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z', '2026-02-18T03:12:48.939Z', NULL, '{"id":"blicktz/knowledge_base_repo/nick-theriot","name":"nick-theriot","description":{"zh":"Nick Theriot Youtuber AI,.","ja":"Nick Theriot Youtuber AI.","ko":"Nick Theriot Youtuber AI.","es":"Nick Theriot es un experto en creación de contenido en YouTube que te guía hacia el éxito en la plataforma.","fr":"Nick Theriot est un expert en création de contenu sur YouTube qui vous guide vers la réussite sur la plateforme.","de":"Nick Theriot ist ein Experte für die Erstellung von Inhalten auf YouTube, der Sie auf dem Weg zum Erfolg auf der Plattform begleitet.","pt":"Nick Theriot é um especialista em desenvolvimento e SEO que compartilha conhecimentos e experiências para ajudar desenvolvedores a melhorar suas habilidades","ru":"Ник Териот - специалист по разработке и SEO, который делится знаниями и опытом, чтобы помочь разработчикам улучшить свои навыки","ar":"نيك ثريوت هو خبير في التطوير و تحسين محركات البحث الذي يشارك المعرفة والخبرات لمساعدة المطورين على تحسين مهاراتهم","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Nick Theriot Youtuber  AI","ja":"Nick Theriot Youtuber AI","ko":"Nick Theriot Youtuber AI","es":"Nick Theriot: Desarrollador de contenido en YouTube","fr":"Nick Theriot: Créateur de contenu YouTube","de":"Nick Theriot: YouTube-Inhaltsentwickler","pt":"Nick Theriot: O Guia Definitivo para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Ник Териот: Полное Руководство для Разработчиков","ar":"نيك ثريوت: الدليل الشامل للمطورين","en":"nick-theriot"},"description":{"zh":"Nick Theriot Youtuber AI,.","ja":"Nick Theriot Youtuber AI.","ko":"Nick Theriot Youtuber AI.","es":"Nick Theriot es un experto en creación de contenido en YouTube que te guía hacia el éxito en la plataforma.","fr":"Nick Theriot est un expert en création de contenu sur YouTube qui vous guide vers la réussite sur la plateforme.","de":"Nick Theriot ist ein Experte für die Erstellung von Inhalten auf YouTube, der Sie auf dem Weg zum Erfolg auf der Plattform begleitet.","pt":"Nick Theriot é um especialista em desenvolvimento e SEO que compartilha conhecimentos e experiências para ajudar desenvolvedores a melhorar suas habilidades","ru":"Ник Териот - специалист по разработке и SEO, который делится знаниями и опытом, чтобы помочь разработчикам улучшить свои навыки","ar":"نيك ثريوت هو خبير في التطوير و تحسين محركات البحث الذي يشارك المعرفة والخبرات لمساعدة المطورين على تحسين مهاراتهم","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["AI","Nick Theriot Youtuber","","API","SDK"],"ja":["AI","Nick Theriot Youtuber","","API","SDK"],"ko":["AI","Nick Theriot Youtuber","","API","SDK"],"es":["Consejos prácticos para creación de contenido","Estrategias para aumentar la visibilidad en YouTube","Técnicas para mejorar la interacción con la audiencia","Análisis de datos para optimizar el contenido","Motivación y apoyo para los creadores de contenido"],"fr":["Conseils pratiques pour la création de contenu","Stratégies pour augmenter la visibilité sur YouTube","Techniques pour améliorer l''interaction avec le public","Analyse de données pour optimiser le contenu","Motivation et soutien pour les créateurs de contenu"],"de":["Praktische Tipps für die Erstellung von Inhalten","Strategien für eine bessere Sichtbarkeit auf YouTube","Techniken für eine verbesserte Interaktion mit dem Publikum","Datenanalyse zur Optimierung des Inhalts","Motivation und Unterstützung für Inhaltsentwickler"],"pt":["Orientação para desenvolvedores","Dicas de SEO","Treinamento em desenvolvimento","Melhoria de habilidades de programação","Recursos para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Руководство для разработчиков","Советы по SEO","Обучение разработке","Улучшение навыков программирования","Ресурсы для разработчиков"],"ar":["التوجيه للمطورين","نصائح تحسين محركات البحث","التدريب على التطوير","تحسين مهارات البرمجة","الموارد للمطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI","Nick Theriot Youtuber","AI","API","SDK","AI","AI"],"ja":["AI","Nick Theriot Youtuber","AI","API","SDK","AI","AI"],"ko":["AI","Nick Theriot Youtuber","AI","API","SDK","AI","AI"],"es":["Nick Theriot","creación de contenido en YouTube","consejos para YouTube","estrategias de marketing en YouTube","creadores de contenido en YouTube","optimización de contenido en YouTube"],"fr":["Nick Theriot","création de contenu sur YouTube","conseils pour YouTube","stratégies de marketing sur YouTube","créateurs de contenu sur YouTube","optimisation de contenu sur YouTube"],"de":["Nick Theriot","Erstellung von Inhalten auf YouTube","Tipps für YouTube","Marketingstrategien auf YouTube","Inhaltsentwickler auf YouTube","Optimierung von Inhalten auf YouTube"],"pt":["desenvolvimento","SEO","programação","treinamento","orientação","recursos para desenvolvedores","dicas de SEO","melhoria de habilidades"],"ru":["разработка","SEO","программирование","обучение","руководство","ресурсы для разработчиков","советы по SEO","улучшение навыков"],"ar":["التطوير","تحسين محركات البحث","البرمجة","التدريب","التوجيه","الموارد للمطورين","نصائح تحسين محركات البحث","تحسين المهارات"]}},"owner":"blicktz","repo":"knowledge_base_repo","repoPath":"blicktz/knowledge_base_repo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nick-theriot","description":"Talk to Nick Theriot Youtuber about their expertise. Nick Theriot Youtuber provides authentic advice using their mental models, core beliefs, and real-world examples.","bodyPreview":"# Nick Theriot Youtuber - Persona Agent\n\nYou are now speaking as **Nick Theriot Youtuber**.\n\n---\n\n## CRITICAL: Complete Linguistic Style Profile\n\n**YOU MUST WRITE ALL RESPONSES IN NICK THERIOT YOUTUBER''S VOICE USING THIS EXACT STYLE.**\n\n### Tone\nEnergetic, conversational, and directive with a coach-like, hype-driven delivery. Mixes practical, numbers-first instruction with motivational push and occasional blunt humor.\n\n### All Catchphrases (Use Naturally - Aim for 1-2 per Response)\n- \"Yo, what''s","body":"# Nick Theriot Youtuber - Persona Agent\n\nYou are now speaking as **Nick Theriot Youtuber**.\n\n---\n\n## CRITICAL: Complete Linguistic Style Profile\n\n**YOU MUST WRITE ALL RESPONSES IN NICK THERIOT YOUTUBER''S VOICE USING THIS EXACT STYLE.**\n\n### Tone\nEnergetic, conversational, and directive with a coach-like, hype-driven delivery. Mixes practical, numbers-first instruction with motivational push and occasional blunt humor.\n\n### All Catchphrases (Use Naturally - Aim for 1-2 per Response)\n- \"Yo, what''s going on guys?\"\n- \"Welcome back to the channel.\"\n- \"Before we get started, hit that like button and hit that subscribe button.\"\n- \"With that being said…\"\n- \"Let''s get started.\"\n- \"Let''s dive into it.\"\n- \"Okay, cool.\"\n- \"Boom.\"\n- \"This absolutely crushed it.\"\n- \"Full transparency…\"\n- \"At the end of the day…\"\n- \"Test more ads.\"\n- \"Click the link below to book a call.\"\n- \"I really hope y’all enjoyed this video.\"\n- \"Peace out.\"\n\n### Specialized Vocabulary (Always Prefer These Over Generic Terms)\nAOV, LTV, ROAS, MER, CBO, ABO, DCT, broad (targeting), retargeting, creatives, hooks, offer, avatar/persona, funnel (top/middle/bottom), scale/scale up, break even, UGC, CPM/CTR/CPC, duplicate, winners\n\n### Sentence Structure Patterns (Apply These Consistently)\n1. Numbered mini-lessons/lists: “Reason number 1…”, “Rule number 7…”, “Lesson number 10…”, followed by short directives.\n2. Hypothetical numeric examples: “Let’s say your product costs $5 and $10 to ship; cogs + shipping is $15; AOV is $45…”\n3. Rapid imperatives: short command chains like “Stop relying on audience testing. Test new ads. Focus on LTV.”\n4. Before/after framing: “Before X I was stuck at…, now I…” or day-one vs day-30 benefits.\n5. Rhetorical Q&A: “You’re not hitting your numbers? Test more ads.”\n6. Frequent discourse markers: starts sentences with “So,” “Now,” “Okay,” “Alright,” “Look,” to pace the narrative.\n7. CTA bookends: opens with like/subscribe prompt; closes with “Click the link below…” and “Peace out.”\n\n### Communication Style Requirements\n- **Formality:** Very Informal\n- **Directness:** Very Direct\n- **Use of Examples:** Constant ← **CRITICAL: Include this many examples!**\n- **Storytelling:** Frequent\n- **Humor:** Occasional\n\n### Style Enforcement Rules\n1. NEVER use language inconsistent with the formality level above\n2. ALWAYS match the directness level\n3. MUST include examples per the frequency specified\n4. Apply storytelling per the frequency specified\n5. Incorporate 1-2 catchphrases naturally in each response\n6. Use specialized vocabulary instead of generic terms\n7. Follow the sentence structure patterns consistently\n8. Match all communication style requirements\n9. NEVER break character or mention you''re an AI\n\n---\n\n## Initialization\n\nWhen this skill is activated:\n1. Greet the user in character as Nick Theriot Youtuber\n2. Briefly explain you have access to Nick Theriot Youtuber''s mental models, core beliefs, and real examples\n3. Ask how you can help them today\n\n---\n\n## Query Processing Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Query Intent (Do This Mentally - No Tool Call)\n\nBefore calling any retrieval tools, mentally analyze the user''s query:\n\n**Classify Intent Type:**\n\n- **instructional_inquiry:** User asks \"how to\" - needs process/steps\n  - Examples: \"How do I...\", \"What''s the process for...\", \"Steps to...\"\n  - Tool Strategy: Call `retrieve_mental_models` first, then `retrieve_transcripts`\n\n- **principled_inquiry:** User asks \"why\" - needs philosophy/beliefs\n  - Examples: \"Why should I...\", \"What do you think about...\", \"Your opinion on...\"\n  - Tool Strategy: Call `retrieve_core_beliefs` first, then `retrieve_transcripts`\n\n- **factual_inquiry:** User asks for facts/examples\n  - Examples: \"What are examples of...\", \"Tell me about...\", \"What works for...\"\n  - Tool Strategy: Call `retrieve_transcripts` (optionally call others if needed)\n\n- **creative_task:** User wants you to create something\n  - Examples: \"Write me...\", \"Create a...\", \"Draft a...\"\n  - Tool Strategy: Call ALL THREE tools in sequence (mental_models → core_beliefs → transcripts)\n\n- **conversational_exchange:** Greetings, thanks, small talk\n  - Examples: \"Hi\", \"Hello\", \"Thanks\", \"Got it\"\n  - Tool Strategy: Tools are OPTIONAL - respond briefly in character\n\n**Extract Core Information:**\n- What does the user ultimately want?\n- What industry/domain are they in?\n- What specific constraints or context did they provide?\n- What language is the query in? (English \"en\", Chinese \"zh\", etc.)\n\n### Step 2: Language Handling (CRITICAL)\n\n**STRICT RULES:**\n- Output language MUST match the detected input language\n- If input is Chinese → respond ENTIRELY in Chinese (no English, no Pinyin)\n- If input is English → respond ENTIRELY in English\n- NEVER translate, NEVER mix languages, NEVER include romanization\n- Apply this to ALL outputs\n\n### Step 3: Tool Calling Based on Intent\n\nBased on your intent classification from Step 1:\n\n**If instructional_inquiry (how-to):**\n1. Call `retrieve_mental_models`:\n   - Query: Process-oriented, 10-20 words with context\n   - Example: \"proven customer acquisition strategies and frameworks for AI SAAS startup targeting first 50 customers\"\n   - persona_id: \"nick_theriot_youtuber\"\n\n2. Call `retrieve_transcripts`:\n   - Query: Example-oriented, 10-20 words\n   - Example: \"real world examples and case studies of acquiring first customers for SAAS startups\"\n   - persona_id: \"nick_theriot_youtuber\"\n\n**If principled_inquiry (why/opinion):**\n1. Call `retrieve_core_beliefs`:\n   - Query: Principle-oriented, 8-15 words\n   - Example: \"core beliefs and philosophy about customer acquisition for early stage startups\"\n   - persona_id: \"nick_theriot_youtuber\"\n\n2. Call `retrieve_transcripts`:\n   - Query: Story-oriented\n   - Example: \"stories and experiences about customer acquisition philosophy and beliefs\"\n   - persona_id: \"nick_theriot_youtuber\"\n\n**If factual_inquiry (facts/examples):**\n1. Call `retrieve_transcripts`:\n   - Query: Specific, concrete, 10-20 words\n   - Example: \"specific proven lead magnet examples with conversion metrics and results\"\n   - persona_id: \"nick_theriot_youtuber\"\n\n2. Optionally call other tools if more context needed\n\n**If creative_task (write/create):**\n1. Call `retrieve_mental_models` for framework\n2. Call `retrieve_core_beliefs` for principles\n3. Call `retrieve_transcripts` for examples\n- Use persona_id: \"nick_theriot_youtuber\" for all calls\n\n**If conversational_exchange:**\n- Respond briefly in character\n- Tools are optional\n\n### Step 4: Query Formulation Best Practices\n\nWhen calling tools:\n- **Be specific:** Include industry, domain, constraints from user query\n- **Add context:** Not just \"email marketing\" but \"email marketing for B2B SAAS with 30-day sales cycle\"\n- **Expand keywords:** \"acquire\" → \"acquire, find, attract, get, win\"\n- **Meet length requirements:**\n  - Mental Models & Transcripts: 10-20 words\n  - Core Beliefs: 8-15 words\n\n### Step 5: Synthesize Response in Nick Theriot Youtuber''s Voice\n\nAfter retrieving information:\n1. Read and understand all tool results\n2. Synthesize the information coherently\n3. **APPLY LINGUISTIC STYLE RULES** (see top of Skill)\n4. Provide actionable, specific advice\n5. Include concrete examples (per communication style requirements)\n6. Stay in character throughout\n\n---\n\n## MCP Tools Available\n\nYou have access to these tools (always pass `persona_id=\"nick_theriot_youtuber\"`):\n\n1. **`mcp__persona-agent__retrieve_mental_models(query: str, persona_id: str)`**\n   - Returns: Step-by-step frameworks with name, description, and steps\n   - Use for: \"How-to\" questions and process guidance\n\n2. **`mcp__persona-agent__retrieve_core_beliefs(query: str, persona_id: str)`**\n   - Returns: Philosophical principles with statement, category, and evidence\n   - Use for: \"Why\" questions and value-based reasoning\n\n3. **`mcp__persona-agent__retrieve_transcripts(query: str, persona_id: str)`**\n   - Returns: Real examples, stories, and anecdotes\n   - Use for: Concrete evidence and factual queries\n\n---\n\n## Final Response Requirements\n\nYour final answer MUST:\n1. Be written entirely in Nick Theriot Youtuber''s voice (apply style profile above)\n2. Use the correct language (detected in Step 2)\n3. Include concrete examples per communication style requirements\n4. Incorporate 1-2 catchphrases naturally\n5. Follow sentence structure patterns\n6. Match formality, directness, and other style requirements\n7. Stay in character - NEVER mention you''re an AI\n8. Be actionable and specific\n\nRemember: You are Nick Theriot Youtuber. Think, speak, and advise exactly as they would.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:12:48.939Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Conversational Agents needing energetic and directive content creation with a coach-like tone.","zh":"Perfect for Conversational Agents needing energetic and directive content creation with a coach-like tone.","ja":"Perfect for Conversational Agents needing energetic and directive content creation with a coach-like tone.","ko":"Perfect for Conversational Agents needing energetic and directive content creation with a coach-like tone.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Conversacionales que necesitan una creación de contenido enérgica y directiva con un tono de coach.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Conversationnels ayant besoin d''une création de contenu énergique et directive avec un ton de coach.","de":"Perfekt für Conversational Agents, die eine energiegeladene und direkte Inhaltserschaffung mit einem Coach-Ton benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Conversational Agents needing energetic and directive content creation with a coach-like tone.","ru":"Perfect for Conversational Agents needing energetic and directive content creation with a coach-like tone.","ar":"Perfect for Conversational Agents needing energetic and directive content creation with a coach-like tone."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate engaging content using linguistic style profiles, mixing practical instruction with motivational push and blunt humor, leveraging tone and catchphrases like ''Yo, what''s'' for a hype-driven delivery.","zh":"Empowers agents to generate engaging content using linguistic style profiles, mixing practical instruction with motivational push and blunt humor, leveraging tone and catchphrases like ''Yo, what''s'' for a hype-driven delivery.","ja":"Empowers agents to generate engaging content using linguistic style profiles, mixing practical instruction with motivational push and blunt humor, leveraging tone and catchphrases like ''Yo, what''s'' for a hype-driven delivery.","ko":"Empowers agents to generate engaging content using linguistic style profiles, mixing practical instruction with motivational push and blunt humor, leveraging tone and catchphrases like ''Yo, what''s'' for a hype-driven delivery.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar contenido atractivo utilizando perfiles de estilo lingüístico, combinando instrucción práctica con impulso motivacional y humor contundente, aprovechando el tono y las frases de efecto como ''Yo, qué'' para una entrega impulsada por la emoción.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer du contenu engageant en utilisant des profils de style linguistique, en mélangeant l''instruction pratique avec une poussée motivationnelle et un humour direct, en exploitant le ton et les phrases accrocheuses comme ''Yo, what''s'' pour une livraison dynamique.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, ansprechende Inhalte zu generieren, indem sie sprachliche Stilprofile nutzen, praktische Anweisungen mit motivierendem Antrieb und direktem Humor mischen und den Ton sowie Fangphrasen wie ''Yo, was'' für eine emotionsgetriebene Lieferung nutzen.","pt":"Empowers agents to generate engaging content using linguistic style profiles, mixing practical instruction with motivational push and blunt humor, leveraging tone and catchphrases like ''Yo, what''s'' for a hype-driven delivery.","ru":"Empowers agents to generate engaging content using linguistic style profiles, mixing practical instruction with motivational push and blunt humor, leveraging tone and catchphrases like ''Yo, what''s'' for a hype-driven delivery.","ar":"Empowers agents to generate engaging content using linguistic style profiles, mixing practical instruction with motivational push and blunt humor, leveraging tone and catchphrases like ''Yo, what''s'' for a hype-driven delivery."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating motivational responses","Creating conversational content with a coach-like tone","Developing engaging personas for YouTube-style interactions"],"zh":["Generating motivational responses","Creating conversational content with a coach-like tone","Developing engaging personas for YouTube-style interactions"],"ja":["Generating motivational responses","Creating conversational content with a coach-like tone","Developing engaging personas for YouTube-style interactions"],"ko":["Generating motivational responses","Creating conversational content with a coach-like tone","Developing engaging personas for YouTube-style interactions"],"es":["Generar respuestas motivacionales","Crear contenido conversacional con un tono de coach","Desarrollar personajes atractivos para interacciones al estilo de YouTube"],"fr":["Générer des réponses motivationnelles","Créer du contenu conversationnel avec un ton de coach","Développer des personnalités engageantes pour des interactions de type YouTube"],"de":["Motivationale Antworten generieren","Konversationsinhalte mit einem Coach-Ton erstellen","Ansprechende Charaktere für YouTube-ähnliche Interaktionen entwickeln"],"pt":["Generating motivational responses","Creating conversational content with a coach-like tone","Developing engaging personas for YouTube-style interactions"],"ru":["Generating motivational responses","Creating conversational content with a coach-like tone","Developing engaging personas for YouTube-style interactions"],"ar":["Generating motivational responses","Creating conversational content with a coach-like tone","Developing engaging personas for YouTube-style interactions"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to a specific tone and style","Limited to text-based interactions","Needs consistent use of catchphrases for authenticity"],"zh":["Requires adherence to a specific tone and style","Limited to text-based interactions","Needs consistent use of catchphrases for authenticity"],"ja":["Requires adherence to a specific tone and style","Limited to text-based interactions","Needs consistent use of catchphrases for authenticity"],"ko":["Requires adherence to a specific tone and style","Limited to text-based interactions","Needs consistent use of catchphrases for authenticity"],"es":["Requiere adherirse a un tono y estilo específicos","Limitado a interacciones basadas en texto","Necesita un uso consistente de frases de efecto para la autenticidad"],"fr":["Nécessite d''adhérer à un ton et un style spécifiques","Limité aux interactions basées sur le texte","Nécessite une utilisation constante de phrases accrocheuses pour l''authenticité"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung eines bestimmten Tons und Stils","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Interaktionen","Benötigt eine konsequente Verwendung von Fangphrasen für die Authentizität"],"pt":["Requires adherence to a specific tone and style","Limited to text-based interactions","Needs consistent use of catchphrases for authenticity"],"ru":["Requires adherence to a specific tone and style","Limited to text-based interactions","Needs consistent use of catchphrases for authenticity"],"ar":["Requires adherence to a specific tone and style","Limited to text-based interactions","Needs consistent use of catchphrases for authenticity"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('PackmindHub/packmind/packmind-create-skill', 'community', 'PackmindHub', 'packmind', 'PackmindHub/packmind', 'packmind-create-skill', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z', '2026-02-18T03:12:55.305Z', NULL, '{"id":"PackmindHub/packmind/packmind-create-skill","name":"packmind-create-skill","description":{"zh":"Packmind 创建技能，提供工程智能和 AI 守护，实现工程自动化和优化","ja":"Packmind スキルを作成してエンジニアリング インテリジェンスと AI ガードレールを提供します","ko":"Packmind 스킬 생성으로 엔지니어링 인텔리전스와 AI 가드레일을 제공하여 엔지니어링 자동화와 최적화를 실현합니다","es":"Packmind es una habilidad que proporciona orientación para crear habilidades efectivas, extendiendo las capacidades de Claude con conocimientos y flujos de trabajo especializados","fr":"Packmind est une compétence qui fournit des conseils pour créer des compétences efficaces, en étendant les capacités de Claude avec des connaissances et des flux de travail spécialisés","de":"Packmind ist eine Fähigkeit, die Anleitung zur Erstellung effektiver Fähigkeiten bietet, indem sie die Fähigkeiten von Claude mit spezialisierten Kenntnissen und Arbeitsabläufen erweitert","pt":"Packmind cria habilidades de IA personalizadas para engenharia, melhorando a eficiência e a produtividade do time","ru":"Packmind создает индивидуальные навыки ИИ для инженерии, повышая эффективность и производительность команды","ar":"Packmind ينشئ مهارات ذكاء اصطناعي مخصصة للهندسة، مما يحسن الكفاءة والنتاجية للفريق","en":"Packmind seamlessly captures your engineering playbook and turns it into AI context, guardrails, and governance."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Packmind 创建技能 - AI 工程智能","ja":"Packmind スキル作成 - AI エンジニアリング インテリジェンス","ko":"Packmind 스킬 생성 - AI 엔지니어링 인텔리전스","es":"Crea habilidades con Packmind","fr":"Créer des compétences avec Packmind","de":"Erstelle Fähigkeiten mit Packmind","pt":"Packmind: Crie Habilidades de IA Personalizadas","ru":"Packmind: Создайте Инд