スアダプターを使用","ko":"NextAuth.js v5는 인증을 위해 사용되는 JavaScript 라이브러리로 OAuth 제공자와 Prisma 데이터베이스 어댑터를 사용","es":"NextAuth.js v5 es una biblioteca de autenticación que utiliza proveedores de OAuth y un adaptador de base de datos Prisma","fr":"NextAuth.js v5 est une bibliothèque d''authentification qui utilise des fournisseurs OAuth et un adaptateur de base de données Prisma","de":"NextAuth.js v5 ist eine Authentifizierungsbibliothek, die OAuth-Anbieter und einen Prisma-Datenbankadapter verwendet","pt":"NextAuth.js é uma biblioteca de autenticação para aplicações web que suporta provedores de OAuth e persistência de sessão com Prisma","ru":"NextAuth.js — это библиотека аутентификации для веб-приложений, поддерживающая провайдеров OAuth и сохранение сессии с Prisma","ar":"NextAuth.js هي مكتبة مصادقة لتقسيمات الويب التي تدعم مزودي OAuth والاستمرارية للجلسات مع Prisma","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持 OAuth 提供者","Prisma 数据库适配器","快速开始","简单的身份验证配置","支持多种身份验证提供者"],"ja":["OAuth プロバイダーのサポート","Prisma データベースアダプター","クイックスタート","認証設定の簡素化","複数の認証プロバイダーのサポート"],"ko":["OAuth 제공자의 지원","Prisma 데이터베이스 어댑터","快速 시작","인증 설정의 간소화","여러 인증 제공자의 지원"],"es":["Autenticación con proveedores de OAuth","Soporte para base de datos Prisma","Sesiones persistentes","Implementación fácil con Next.js","Compatibilidad con múltiples proveedores de autenticación"],"fr":["Authentification avec des fournisseurs OAuth","Prise en charge de la base de données Prisma","Sessions persistantes","Mise en œuvre facile avec Next.js","Compatibilité avec plusieurs fournisseurs d''authentification"],"de":["Authentifizierung mit OAuth-Anbietern","Unterstützung für Prisma-Datenbank","Persistente Sitzungen","Einfache Implementierung mit Next.js","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Authentifizierungsanbietern"],"pt":["Suporte a provedores de OAuth","Persistência de sessão com Prisma","Instalação simples com dependências","Configuração personalizada de autenticação","Suporte a várias plataformas"],"ru":["Поддержка провайдеров OAuth","Сохранение сессии с Prisma","Простая установка с зависимостями","Настройка аутентификации под заказ","Поддержка нескольких платформ"],"ar":["دعم مزودي OAuth","الاستمرارية للجلسات مع Prisma","تركيب بسيط مع التبعيات","تكوين مصادقة مخصص","دعم منصات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["NextAuth.js","身份验证","OAuth","Prisma","JavaScript","FTC Metrics","认证库"],"ja":["NextAuth.js","認証","OAuth","Prisma","JavaScript","FTC Metrics","認証ライブラリ"],"ko":["NextAuth.js","인증","OAuth","Prisma","JavaScript","FTC Metrics","인증 라이브러리"],"es":["NextAuth.js v5","autenticación","OAuth","Prisma","Next.js","sesiones persistentes","autenticación web"],"fr":["NextAuth.js v5","authentification","OAuth","Prisma","Next.js","sessions persistantes","authentification web"],"de":["NextAuth.js v5","Authentifizierung","OAuth","Prisma","Next.js","persistente Sitzungen","Webauthentifizierung"],"pt":["NextAuth.js","autenticação","OAuth","Prisma","desenvolvimento web","segurança","bibliotecas de autenticação","provedores de OAuth"],"ru":["NextAuth.js","аутентификация","OAuth","Prisma","веб-разработка","безопасность","библиотеки аутентификации","провайдеры OAuth"],"ar":["NextAuth.js","مصادقة","OAuth","Prisma","تطوير الويب","أمان","مكتبات مصادقة","مزودي OAuth"]}},"owner":"ftc8569","repo":"ftcmetrics","repoPath":"ftc8569/ftcmetrics","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nextauth","description":">-","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# NextAuth.js v5 Authentication Guide\n\nNextAuth.js v5 (Auth.js) is the authentication library for FTC Metrics. It uses OAuth providers (Google, Discord, GitHub) with a Prisma database adapter for session persistence.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### 1. Install Dependencies\n\n```bash\nbun add next-auth@beta @auth/prisma-adapter\n```\n\n### 2. Create Auth Configuration\n\nCreate `src/lib/auth.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nimport NextAuth from \"next-auth\";\nimport { PrismaAdapter } from \"@auth/prisma-adapter\";\nimport Google fro","body":"# NextAuth.js v5 Authentication Guide\n\nNextAuth.js v5 (Auth.js) is the authentication library for FTC Metrics. It uses OAuth providers (Google, Discord, GitHub) with a Prisma database adapter for session persistence.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### 1. Install Dependencies\n\n```bash\nbun add next-auth@beta @auth/prisma-adapter\n```\n\n### 2. Create Auth Configuration\n\nCreate `src/lib/auth.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nimport NextAuth from \"next-auth\";\nimport { PrismaAdapter } from \"@auth/prisma-adapter\";\nimport Google from \"next-auth/providers/google\";\nimport Discord from \"next-auth/providers/discord\";\nimport GitHub from \"next-auth/providers/github\";\nimport { prisma } from \"@ftcmetrics/db\";\n\nexport const { handlers, auth, signIn, signOut } = NextAuth({\n  adapter: PrismaAdapter(prisma),\n  providers: [\n    Google({\n      clientId: process.env.GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID!,\n      clientSecret: process.env.GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET!,\n    }),\n    Discord({\n      clientId: process.env.DISCORD_CLIENT_ID!,\n      clientSecret: process.env.DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET!,\n    }),\n    GitHub({\n      clientId: process.env.GITHUB_CLIENT_ID!,\n      clientSecret: process.env.GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET!,\n    }),\n  ],\n  pages: {\n    signIn: \"/login\",\n    error: \"/login\",\n  },\n  callbacks: {\n    async session({ session, user }) {\n      if (session.user) {\n        session.user.id = user.id;\n      }\n      return session;\n    },\n  },\n  session: {\n    strategy: \"database\",\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### 3. Create API Route Handler\n\nCreate `src/app/api/auth/[...nextauth]/route.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { handlers } from \"@/lib/auth\";\n\nexport const { GET, POST } = handlers;\n```\n\n### 4. Add Session Provider\n\nCreate `src/components/providers.tsx`:\n\n```typescript\n\"use client\";\n\nimport { SessionProvider } from \"next-auth/react\";\n\nexport function Providers({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return <SessionProvider>{children}</SessionProvider>;\n}\n```\n\nWrap your app in `src/app/layout.tsx`:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Providers } from \"@/components/providers\";\n\nexport default function RootLayout({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  return (\n    <html lang=\"en\">\n      <body>\n        <Providers>{children}</Providers>\n      </body>\n    </html>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Prisma Schema Requirements\n\nRequired models for NextAuth with database sessions:\n\n```prisma\nmodel User {\n  id            String    @id @default(cuid())\n  name          String?\n  email         String?   @unique\n  emailVerified DateTime? @map(\"email_verified\")\n  image         String?\n  createdAt     DateTime  @default(now()) @map(\"created_at\")\n  updatedAt     DateTime  @updatedAt @map(\"updated_at\")\n\n  accounts Account[]\n  sessions Session[]\n\n  @@map(\"users\")\n}\n\nmodel Account {\n  id                String  @id @default(cuid())\n  userId            String  @map(\"user_id\")\n  type              String\n  provider          String\n  providerAccountId String  @map(\"provider_account_id\")\n  refresh_token     String? @db.Text\n  access_token      String? @db.Text\n  expires_at        Int?\n  token_type        String?\n  scope             String?\n  id_token          String? @db.Text\n  session_state     String?\n\n  user User @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n\n  @@unique([provider, providerAccountId])\n  @@map(\"accounts\")\n}\n\nmodel Session {\n  id           String   @id @default(cuid())\n  sessionToken String   @unique @map(\"session_token\")\n  userId       String   @map(\"user_id\")\n  expires      DateTime\n\n  user User @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n\n  @@map(\"sessions\")\n}\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\nAdd to `.env`:\n\n```bash\n# NextAuth\nAUTH_SECRET=\"generate-with-openssl-rand-base64-32\"\n\n# Google OAuth\nGOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=\"your-google-client-id\"\nGOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=\"your-google-client-secret\"\n\n# Discord OAuth\nDISCORD_CLIENT_ID=\"your-discord-client-id\"\nDISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET=\"your-discord-client-secret\"\n\n# GitHub OAuth\nGITHUB_CLIENT_ID=\"your-github-client-id\"\nGITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=\"your-github-client-secret\"\n```\n\nGenerate AUTH_SECRET:\n\n```bash\nopenssl rand -base64 32\n```\n\n## Session Management Patterns\n\n### Server Components (Recommended)\n\nUse the `auth()` function directly in Server Components:\n\n```tsx\nimport { auth } from \"@/lib/auth\";\nimport { redirect } from \"next/navigation\";\n\nexport default async function DashboardPage() {\n  const session = await auth();\n\n  if (!session?.user) {\n    redirect(\"/login\");\n  }\n\n  return <div>Welcome, {session.user.name}</div>;\n}\n```\n\n### Protected Layouts\n\nProtect entire route groups with layout-level auth:\n\n```tsx\nimport { auth } from \"@/lib/auth\";\nimport { redirect } from \"next/navigation\";\n\nexport default async function ProtectedLayout({\n  children,\n}: {\n  children: React.ReactNode;\n}) {\n  const session = await auth();\n\n  if (!session?.user) {\n    redirect(\"/login\");\n  }\n\n  return <>{children}</>;\n}\n```\n\n### Client Components\n\nUse the `useSession` hook in Client Components:\n\n```tsx\n\"use client\";\n\nimport { useSession, signOut } from \"next-auth/react\";\n\nexport function UserMenu() {\n  const { data: session, status } = useSession();\n\n  if (status === \"loading\") {\n    return <div>Loading...</div>;\n  }\n\n  if (!session?.user) {\n    return <a href=\"/login\">Sign in</a>;\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <img src={session.user.image} alt={session.user.name} />\n      <span>{session.user.name}</span>\n      <button onClick={() => signOut({ callbackUrl: \"/\" })}>\n        Sign out\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Sign In with Providers\n\n```tsx\n\"use client\";\n\nimport { signIn } from \"next-auth/react\";\n\nexport function LoginButtons() {\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <button onClick={() => signIn(\"google\", { callbackUrl: \"/dashboard\" })}>\n        Continue with Google\n      </button>\n      <button onClick={() => signIn(\"discord\", { callbackUrl: \"/dashboard\" })}>\n        Continue with Discord\n      </button>\n      <button onClick={() => signIn(\"github\", { callbackUrl: \"/dashboard\" })}>\n        Continue with GitHub\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Adding User ID to Session\n\nThe session callback extends the session with the database user ID:\n\n```typescript\ncallbacks: {\n  async session({ session, user }) {\n    if (session.user) {\n      session.user.id = user.id;\n    }\n    return session;\n  },\n},\n```\n\nAccess the user ID in components:\n\n```tsx\n// Server Component\nconst session = await auth();\nconst userId = session?.user?.id;\n\n// Client Component\nconst { data: session } = useSession();\nconst userId = session?.user?.id;\n```\n\n## OAuth Provider Setup\n\n### Google\n\n1. Go to [Google Cloud Console](https://console.cloud.google.com)\n2. Create OAuth 2.0 credentials\n3. Add authorized redirect URI: `http://localhost:3000/api/auth/callback/google`\n\n### Discord\n\n1. Go to [Discord Developer Portal](https://discord.com/developers/applications)\n2. Create application and OAuth2 credentials\n3. Add redirect URI: `http://localhost:3000/api/auth/callback/discord`\n\n### GitHub\n\n1. Go to [GitHub Developer Settings](https://github.com/settings/developers)\n2. Create OAuth App\n3. Add callback URL: `http://localhost:3000/api/auth/callback/github`\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n### Session Not Available\n\n- Ensure `SessionProvider` wraps your entire app in the root layout\n- Ensure the API route exists at `app/api/auth/[...nextauth]/route.ts`\n\n### User ID Missing from Session\n\n- Add the session callback to include `user.id`\n- When using database strategy, user info comes from the `user` parameter, not `token`\n\n### Database Session Issues\n\n- Ensure Prisma schema matches NextAuth requirements exactly\n- Use `onDelete: Cascade` on relations to handle user deletion\n- Run `prisma migrate dev` after schema changes\n\n### OAuth Callback Errors\n\n- Verify redirect URIs match exactly in provider console\n- Include the full path: `/api/auth/callback/[provider]`\n- For production, update URIs to use HTTPS and your domain\n\n### AUTH_SECRET Missing\n\n- Generate with `openssl rand -base64 32`\n- Required in production, auto-generated in development\n\n## TypeScript Type Extensions\n\nExtend session types in `src/types/next-auth.d.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { DefaultSession } from \"next-auth\";\n\ndeclare module \"next-auth\" {\n  interface Session {\n    user: {\n      id: string;\n    } & DefaultSession[\"user\"];\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## File Structure Reference\n\n```\npackages/web/src/\n  lib/\n    auth.ts                           # NextAuth configuration\n  components/\n    providers.tsx                     # SessionProvider wrapper\n  app/\n    api/auth/[...nextauth]/\n      route.ts                        # API route handler\n    layout.tsx                        # Root layout with Providers\n    login/\n      page.tsx                        # Login page (server)\n      login-form.tsx                  # OAuth buttons (client)\n    dashboard/\n      layout.tsx                      # Protected layout\n      page.tsx                        # Uses auth() for session\n```\n\n## References\n\n- [NextAuth.js v5 Documentation](https://authjs.dev)\n- [Prisma Adapter](https://authjs.dev/getting-started/adapters/prisma)\n- [OAuth Providers](https://authjs.dev/getting-started/providers)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:13:08.573Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full Stack Agents requiring advanced authentication and session management capabilities with NextAuth.js and OAuth providers.","zh":"适合需要使用 NextAuth.js 和 OAuth 提供商进行高级身份验证和会话管理的全栈代理。","ja":"NextAuth.js および OAuth プロバイダーを使用した高度な認証およびセッション管理機能を必要とするフルスタックエージェントに最適。","ko":"NextAuth.js 및 OAuth 제공업체를 사용한 고급 인증 및 세션 관리 기능이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes Full Stack que requieren capacidades avanzadas de autenticación y gestión de sesiones con NextAuth.js y proveedores OAuth.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Full Stack nécessitant des capacités avancées d''authentification et de gestion de session avec NextAuth.js et des fournisseurs OAuth.","de":"Ideal für Full Stack Agents, die erweiterte Authentifizierungs- und Sitzungsverwaltungsfunktionen mit NextAuth.js und OAuth-Anbietern benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Full Stack que exigem capacidades avançadas de autenticação e gerenciamento de sessão com NextAuth.js e provedores OAuth.","ru":"Идеально подходит для полнофункциональных агентов, требующихadvanced возможностей аутентификации и управления сессиями с помощью NextAuth.js и провайдеров OAuth.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الويب الكامل الذي يتطلب قابليات متقدمة للتأكيد والتحكم في الجلسات مع NextAuth.js ومقدمي OAuth."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to authenticate users via Google, Discord, and GitHub using OAuth, while persisting sessions with a Prisma database adapter, enabling secure and scalable authentication workflows with NextAuth.js v5 and Prisma.","zh":"赋予代理人通过 OAuth 使用 Google、Discord 和 GitHub 进行用户身份验证的能力，同时使用 Prisma 数据库适配器持久化会话，实现使用 NextAuth.js v5 和 Prisma 的安全且可扩展的身份验证工作流。","ja":"OAuth を使用して Google、Discord、GitHub でユーザーを認証するエージェントの能力を提供し、Prisma データベースアダプタを使用してセッションを永続化し、NextAuth.js v5 および Prisma を使用したセキュアでスケーラブルな認証ワークフローを可能にします。","ko":"OAuth를 사용하여 Google, Discord, GitHub에서 사용자를 인증할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, Prisma 데이터베이스 어댑터를 사용하여 세션을 영구적이며, NextAuth.js v5 및 Prisma를 사용한 보안이면서 확장 가능한 인증 워크플로우를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes autenticar usuarios mediante Google, Discord y GitHub utilizando OAuth, mientras persisten las sesiones con un adaptador de base de datos Prisma, permitiendo flujos de trabajo de autenticación seguros y escalables con NextAuth.js v5 y Prisma.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''authentifier les utilisateurs via Google, Discord et GitHub en utilisant OAuth, tout en conservant les sessions avec un adaptateur de base de données Prisma, permettant des workflows d''authentification sécurisés et évolutifs avec NextAuth.js v5 et Prisma.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Benutzer über Google, Discord und GitHub mit OAuth zu authentifizieren, während Sitzungen mit einem Prisma-Datenbankadapter persistent gespeichert werden, was sichere und skalierbare Authentifizierungs-Workflows mit NextAuth.js v5 und Prisma ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a autenticar usuários via Google, Discord e GitHub usando OAuth, enquanto persiste as sessões com um adaptador de banco de dados Prisma, permitindo fluxos de trabalho de autenticação seguros e escaláveis com NextAuth.js v5 e Prisma.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью аутентифицировать пользователей через Google, Discord и GitHub с помощью OAuth, сохраняя при этом сессии с помощью адаптера базы данных Prisma, что позволяет создавать безопасные и масштабируемые потоки аутентификации с NextAuth.js v5 и Prisma.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التحقق من هوية المستخدمين عبر جوجل وديسكورد وغيت هاب باستخدام OAuth، مع الحفاظ على الجلسات باستخدام محول قاعدة بيانات بريما، وتمكين سير العمل الآمنة والموسعة للتأكيد مع NextAuth.js v5 وبريما."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing OAuth-based authentication flows","Configuring session persistence with Prisma","Integrating NextAuth.js with existing applications"],"zh":["实现基于 OAuth 的身份验证流程","使用 Prisma 配置会话持久性","将 NextAuth.js 与现有应用程序集成"],"ja":["OAuth ベースの認証フローを実装する","Prisma を使用してセッション永続化を構成する","NextAuth.js を既存のアプリケーションに統合する"],"ko":["OAuth 기반 인증 흐름 구현","Prisma를 사용하여 세션 영속성 구성","NextAuth.js를 기존 애플리케이션과 통합"],"es":["Implementación de flujos de autenticación basados en OAuth","Configuración de persistencia de sesiones con Prisma","Integración de NextAuth.js con aplicaciones existentes"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de flux d''authentification basés sur OAuth","Configuration de la persistance de session avec Prisma","Intégration de NextAuth.js avec des applications existantes"],"de":["Implementierung OAuth-basierter Authentifizierungsabläufe","Konfiguration der Sitzungspersistenz mit Prisma","Integration von NextAuth.js in bestehende Anwendungen"],"pt":["Implementação de fluxos de autenticação baseados em OAuth","Configuração da persistência de sessão com Prisma","Integração do NextAuth.js com aplicações existentes"],"ru":["Реализация потоков аутентификации на основе OAuth","Настройка сохранения сессий с помощью Prisma","Интеграция NextAuth.js с существующими приложениями"],"ar":["تنفيذ تدفقات التأكيد القائمة على OAuth","تكوين استمرار الجلسات مع بريما","دمج NextAuth.js مع التطبيقات الحالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Prisma database adapter installation","NextAuth.js v5 compatibility required","OAuth provider setup necessary"],"zh":["需要安装 Prisma 数据库适配器","需要 NextAuth.js v5 兼容性","需要 OAuth 提供程序设置"],"ja":["Prisma データベースアダプタのインストールが必要","NextAuth.js v5 との互換性が必要","OAuth プロバイダーの設定が必要"],"ko":["Prisma 데이터베이스 어댑터 설치가 필요합니다.","NextAuth.js v5 호환성 필요","OAuth 제공자 설정 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del adaptador de base de datos Prisma","Se requiere compatibilidad con NextAuth.js v5","Configuración del proveedor OAuth necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de l''adaptateur de base de données Prisma","Compatibilité NextAuth.js v5 requise","Configuration du fournisseur OAuth nécessaire"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation des Prisma-Datenbankadapters","NextAuth.js v5-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Einrichtung eines OAuth-Anbieters notwendig"],"pt":["Exige instalação do adaptador de banco de dados Prisma","Compatibilidade com NextAuth.js v5 necessária","Configuração do provedor OAuth necessária"],"ru":["Требует установки адаптера базы данных Prisma","Необходима совместимость с NextAuth.js v5","Необходима настройка провайдера OAuth"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت محول قاعدة بيانات بريما","التوافق مع NextAuth.js v5 مطلوب","إعداد مقدم OAuth ضروري"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
