ze seu Assistente","ru":"Настройка Claude: Индивидуализируйте своего Помощника","ar":"تخصيص كلود: قم بتخصيص مساعدك","en":"customize"},"description":{"zh":"MicroClaw定制技能允许开发者添加或修改功能，通过AskUserQuestion理解用户需求","ja":"MicroClawカスタマイズスキルは、開発者が機能を追加または変更できるようにし、AskUserQuestionでユーザーのニーズを理解する","ko":"마이크로클로 커스터마이즈 스킬은 개발자가 기능을 추가하거나 수정할 수 있으며 AskUserQuestion을 통해 사용자의 요구를 이해","es":"MicroClaw es una herramienta personalizable que permite a los usuarios agregar capacidades o modificar su comportamiento. Nuestro enfoque garantiza una imple...","fr":"MicroClaw est un outil personnalisable qui permet aux utilisateurs d''ajouter des fonctionnalités ou de modifier son comportement. Notre approche garantit une...","de":"MicroClaw ist ein anpassbares Tool, das es Benutzern ermöglicht, Funktionen hinzuzufügen oder sein Verhalten zu ändern. Unser Ansatz gewährleistet eine siche...","pt":"O skill de customização permite que os usuários adicionem capacidades ou modifiquem comportamentos no assistente Claude.","ru":"Навык настройки позволяет пользователям добавлять возможности или изменять поведение в помощнике Claude.","ar":"مهارة التخصيص تمكن المستخدمين من إضافة القدرات أو تعديل السلوك في مساعد كلود.","en":"My personal Claude assistant that runs in Apple containers. Lightweight, secure, and built to be understood and customized for your own needs."},"definition":{"en":"My personal Claude assistant that runs in Apple containers. Lightweight, secure, and built to be understood and customized for your own needs."},"features":{"zh":["轻量级和安全","可自定义和扩展","支持AskUserQuestion","可以直接修改代码","提供测试指导"],"ja":["軽量で安全","カスタマイズおよび拡張可能","AskUserQuestionをサポート","コードを直接変更可能","テストガイダンスを提供"],"ko":["가벼우며 안전","커스터마이즈 및 확장 가능","AskUserQuestion 지원","코드를 직접 수정 가능","테스트 가이드 제공"],"es":["Modificación del comportamiento del asistente","Adición de nuevas capacidades","Implementación segura y ligera","Personalización de la configuración","Guías paso a paso para la implementación"],"fr":["Modification du comportement de l''assistant","Ajout de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Mise en œuvre sécurisée et légère","Personnalisation de la configuration","Guides étape par étape pour la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Modifizierung des Verhaltens des Assistenzsystems","Hinzufügen neuer Funktionen","Sichere und leichte Implementierung","Anpassung der Konfiguration","Schritt-für-Schritt-Anleitungen für die Implementierung"],"pt":["Modifique o comportamento do assistente","Adicione capacidades personalizadas","Entenda como usar o AskUserQuestion","Modifique arquivos de configuração","Teste e verifique as alterações"],"ru":["Измените поведение помощника","Добавьте индивидуальные возможности","Поймите, как использовать AskUserQuestion","Измените файлы конфигурации","Тестируйте и проверяйте изменения"],"ar":["عدّل السلوك المساعد","أضف قدرات مخصصة","افهم كيفية استخدام AskUserQuestion","عدّل ملفات التكوين","اجري اختبارات وتأكد من التغييرات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["MicroClaw定制技能","开发者工具","自定义功能","修改行为","AskUserQuestion","代码修改","测试指导"],"ja":["MicroClawカスタマイズスキル","開発者ツール","カスタム機能","動作の変更","AskUserQuestion","コードの変更","テストガイダンス"],"ko":["마이크로클로 커스터마이즈 스킬","개발자 도구","커스텀 기능","동작 수정","AskUserQuestion","코드 수정","테스트 가이드"],"es":["personalización de MicroClaw","modificación de asistentes","adición de capacidades","implementación segura","desarrollo de software","personalización de herramientas"],"fr":["personnalisation de MicroClaw","modification d''assistants","ajout de fonctionnalités","mise en œuvre sécurisée","développement de logiciels","personnalisation d''outils"],"de":["Anpassung von MicroClaw","Modifizierung von Assistenzsystemen","Hinzufügen von Funktionen","sichere Implementierung","Software-Entwicklung","Anpassung von Tools"],"pt":["customização de assistente","desenvolvimento de assistente"," Claude personalizado","askuserquestion","modificação de comportamento","desenvolvimento de IA"],"ru":["настройка помощника","разработка помощника","индивидуальный Claude","askuserquestion","изменение поведения","разработка ИИ"],"ar":["تخصيص المساعد","تطوير المساعد","كلود مخصص","askuserquestion","تعديل السلوك","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"cosmin","repo":"microclaw","repoPath":"cosmin/microclaw","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"customize","description":"Add new capabilities or modify MicroClaw behavior. Use when user wants to add channels (Telegram, Slack, email input), change triggers, add integrations, modify the router, or make any other customizations. This is an interactive skill that asks questions to understand what the user wants.","bodyPreview":"# MicroClaw Customization\n\nThis skill helps users add capabilities or modify behavior. Use AskUserQuestion to understand what they want before making changes.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Understand the request** - Ask clarifying questions\n2. **Plan the changes** - Identify files to modify\n3. **Implement** - Make changes directly to the code\n4. **Test guidance** - Tell user how to verify\n\n## Key Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `src/config.ts` | Assistant name, trigger pattern, directories |","body":"# MicroClaw Customization\n\nThis skill helps users add capabilities or modify behavior. Use AskUserQuestion to understand what they want before making changes.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Understand the request** - Ask clarifying questions\n2. **Plan the changes** - Identify files to modify\n3. **Implement** - Make changes directly to the code\n4. **Test guidance** - Tell user how to verify\n\n## Key Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `src/config.ts` | Assistant name, trigger pattern, directories |\n| `src/index.ts` | Message routing, WhatsApp connection, agent invocation |\n| `src/db.ts` | Database initialization and queries |\n| `src/types.ts` | TypeScript interfaces |\n| `src/whatsapp-auth.ts` | Standalone WhatsApp authentication script |\n| `.mcp.json` | MCP server configuration (reference) |\n| `groups/CLAUDE.md` | Global memory/persona |\n\n## Common Customization Patterns\n\n### Adding a New Input Channel (e.g., Telegram, Slack, Email)\n\nQuestions to ask:\n- Which channel? (Telegram, Slack, Discord, email, SMS, etc.)\n- Same trigger word or different?\n- Same memory hierarchy or separate?\n- Should messages from this channel go to existing groups or new ones?\n\nImplementation pattern:\n1. Find/add MCP server for the channel\n2. Add connection and message handling in `src/index.ts`\n3. Store messages in the database (update `src/db.ts` if needed)\n4. Ensure responses route back to correct channel\n\n### Adding a New MCP Integration\n\nQuestions to ask:\n- What service? (Calendar, Notion, database, etc.)\n- What operations needed? (read, write, both)\n- Which groups should have access?\n\nImplementation:\n1. Add MCP server to the `mcpServers` config in `src/index.ts`\n2. Add tools to `allowedTools` array\n3. Document in `groups/CLAUDE.md`\n\n### Changing Assistant Behavior\n\nQuestions to ask:\n- What aspect? (name, trigger, persona, response style)\n- Apply to all groups or specific ones?\n\nSimple changes → edit `src/config.ts`\nPersona changes → edit `groups/CLAUDE.md`\nPer-group behavior → edit specific group''s `CLAUDE.md`\n\n### Adding New Commands\n\nQuestions to ask:\n- What should the command do?\n- Available in all groups or main only?\n- Does it need new MCP tools?\n\nImplementation:\n1. Add command handling in `processMessage()` in `src/index.ts`\n2. Check for the command before the trigger pattern check\n\n### Changing Deployment\n\nQuestions to ask:\n- Target platform? (Linux server, Docker, different Mac)\n- Service manager? (systemd, Docker, supervisord)\n\nImplementation:\n1. Create appropriate service files\n2. Update paths in config\n3. Provide setup instructions\n\n## After Changes\n\nAlways tell the user:\n```bash\n# Rebuild and restart\nnpm run build\nlaunchctl unload ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.microclaw.plist\nlaunchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.microclaw.plist\n```\n\n## Example Interaction\n\nUser: \"Add Telegram as an input channel\"\n\n1. Ask: \"Should Telegram use the same @Andy trigger, or a different one?\"\n2. Ask: \"Should Telegram messages create separate conversation contexts, or share with WhatsApp groups?\"\n3. Find Telegram MCP or library\n4. Add connection handling in index.ts\n5. Update message storage in db.ts\n6. Tell user how to authenticate and test\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:13:37.772Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for agents like Claude, needing advanced customization and modification capabilities to enhance user experience and assistant behavior.","zh":"适用于需要高级定制和修改功能以提升用户体验和助手行为的代理，如 Claude。","ja":"Claude のようなエージェントが高度なカスタマイズと修正機能を必要とする場合に最適です。ユーザー体験とアシスタントの動作を強化するために。","ko":"고급 사용자 지정 및 수정 기능이 필요하여 Claude와 같은 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 사용자 경험과 보조 프로그램 동작을 강화하는 데에 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes como Claude, que necesitan capacidades de personalización y modificación avanzadas para mejorar la experiencia del usuario y el comportamiento del asistente.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents comme Claude, nécessitant des capacités de personnalisation et de modification avancées pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur et le comportement de l''assistant.","de":"Ideal für Agenten wie Claude, die erweiterte Anpassungs- und Modifizierungsmöglichkeiten benötigen, um die Benutzererfahrung und das Verhalten des Assistenten zu verbessern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes como Claude, que precisam de personalização e capacidades de modificação avançadas para melhorar a experiência do usuário e o comportamento do assistente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, таких как Claude, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности настройки и модификации для улучшения пользовательского опыта и поведения помощника.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مثل Claude ، الذي يحتاج إلى تخصيص وتعديلات متقدمة لتحسين تجربة المستخدم وسلوك المساعد."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to modify their behavior and add capabilities using direct code modifications, leveraging files like `src/config.ts` for customized assistant settings and trigger patterns, and implementing changes through a structured workflow.","zh":"赋予代理修改其行为和添加功能的能力，使用直接的代码修改，利用文件如 `src/config.ts` 进行自定义的助手设置和触发模式，并通过结构化的工作流实施变化。","ja":"エージェントに動作を修正し、機能を追加する能力を与え、直接のコード修正を使用し、ファイル such as `src/config.ts` を使用してカスタマイズされたアシスタント設定とトリガーパターンを実施し、構造化されたワークフローを通じて変更を実施します。","ko":"에이전트에게 행동을 수정하고 기능을 추가할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 직접적인 코드 수정을 사용하고 파일 such as `src/config.ts`를 사용하여 사용자 지정된 보조 프로그램 설정과 트리거 패턴을 구현하고 구조화된 워크플로우를 통해 변경을 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes modificar su comportamiento y agregar capacidades mediante modificaciones de código directas, aprovechando archivos como `src/config.ts` para configuraciones de asistentes personalizadas y patrones de activación, e implementando cambios a través de un flujo de trabajo estructurado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de modifier leur comportement et d''ajouter des capacités en utilisant des modifications de code directes, en exploitant des fichiers comme `src/config.ts` pour des paramètres d''assistant personnalisés et des modèles de déclenchement, et en mettant en œuvre des changements à travers un flux de travail structuré.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, ihr Verhalten zu modifizieren und Fähigkeiten hinzuzufügen, indem sie direkte Codeänderungen vornehmen, Dateien wie `src/config.ts` für benutzerdefinierte Assistenteneinstellungen und Triggermuster nutzen und Änderungen durch einen strukturierten Workflow implementieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes modifiquem seu comportamento e adicionem capacidades usando modificações de código direto, aproveitando arquivos como `src/config.ts` para configurações de assistente personalizadas e padrões de gatilho, e implementando alterações por meio de um fluxo de trabalho estruturado.","ru":"Позволяет агентам изменять свое поведение и добавлять возможности с помощью прямых изменений кода, используя файлы, такие как `src/config.ts`, для настраиваемых настроек помощника и шаблонов триггера, и реализуя изменения через структурированный рабочий процесс.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تعديل سلوكهم وإضافة القدرات باستخدام تعديلات مباشرة للشفرة ، واستخدام الملفات مثل `src/config.ts` لإعدادات المساعد المخصصة وأنماط الزناد ، وتنفيذ التغييرات من خلال سير عمل منظم."},"useCases":{"en":["Modifying assistant trigger patterns","Customizing assistant names and directories","Implementing new capabilities through code changes"],"zh":["修改助手触发模式","自定义助手名称和目录","通过代码更改实现新的功能"],"ja":["アシスタントのトリガーパターンを修正する","アシスタントの名前とディレクトリをカスタマイズする","コードの変更を通じて新しい機能を実装する"],"ko":["보조 프로그램의 트리거 패턴을 수정하는 것","보조 프로그램의 이름과 디렉토리를 사용자 지정하는 것","코드 변경을 통해 새로운 기능을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Modificar los patrones de activación del asistente","Personalizar los nombres y directorios del asistente","Implementar nuevas capacidades a través de cambios de código"],"fr":["Modifier les modèles de déclenchement de l''assistant","Personnaliser les noms et les répertoires de l''assistant","Mettre en œuvre de nouvelles capacités à travers des changements de code"],"de":["Die Triggermuster des Assistenten modifizieren","Die Namen und Verzeichnisse des Assistenten anpassen","Neue Fähigkeiten durch Codeänderungen implementieren"],"pt":["Modificar padrões de gatilho do assistente","Personalizar nomes e diretórios do assistente","Implementar novas capacidades por meio de alterações de código"],"ru":["Изменение шаблонов триггера помощника","Настройка имен и директорий помощника","Реализация новых возможностей через изменения кода"],"ar":["تعديل أنماط الزناد للمساعد","تخصيص أسماء والمكتبات للمساعد","تنفيذ قدرات جديدة من خلال تغييرات الشفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Apple containers","Modification of code files like `src/config.ts` necessary","Testing and verification steps required after implementation"],"zh":["需要访问 Apple 容器","需要修改代码文件如 `src/config.ts`","需要在实施后进行测试和验证步骤"],"ja":["Apple コンテナへのアクセスが必要","コードファイル such as `src/config.ts` の修正が必要","実施後のテストと検証ステップが必要"],"ko":["Apple 컨테이너에 대한 액세스가 필요함","코드 파일 such as `src/config.ts`의 수정이 필요함","구현 후 테스트 및 검증 단계가 필요함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a contenedores de Apple","Modificación de archivos de código como `src/config.ts` necesaria","Pasos de prueba y verificación necesarios después de la implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux conteneurs Apple","Modification de fichiers de code comme `src/config.ts` nécessaire","Étapes de test et de vérification nécessaires après la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Apple-Container","Änderung von Code-Dateien wie `src/config.ts` erforderlich","Test- und Überprüfungsschritte nach der Implementierung erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer acesso a contêineres da Apple","Modificação de arquivos de código como `src/config.ts` necessária","Etapa de teste e verificação necessária após implementação"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к контейнерам Apple","Необходимо изменение файлов кода, таких как `src/config.ts`","Требуются шаги тестирования и верификации после реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى حاويات Apple","تعديل ملفات الشفرة مثل `src/config.ts` ضروري","خطوة الاختبار والتحقق مطلوبة بعد التنفيذ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('CongDon1207/AGENTS.md/angular-api-service', 'community', 'CongDon1207', 'AGENTS.md', 'CongDon1207/AGENTS.md', 'angular-api-service', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z', '2026-02-18T03:14:11.941Z', NULL, '{"id":"CongDon1207/AGENTS.md/angular-api-service","name":"angular-api-service","description":{"zh":"Angular API ","ja":"Angular API","ko":"Angular API ","es":"El servicio de API de Angular es un flujo de trabajo de desarrollo para crear servicios de API para la comunicación con el backend. Incluye caché y descargas de archivos.","fr":"Le service API Angular est un flux de travail de développement pour créer des services API pour la communication avec le backend. Il inclut la mise en cache et les téléchargements de fichiers.","de":"Der Angular API-Service ist ein Entwicklungswerkfluss zum Erstellen von API-Diensten für die Kommunikation mit dem Backend. Er umfasst Caching und Dateidownloads.","en":"Copy .* folder and AGENTS.md then paste  /root of project "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Angular API ","ja":"Angular API","ko":"Angular API ","es":"Servicio de API de Angular: Flujo de trabajo de desarrollo","fr":"Service API Angular: Flux de travail de développement","de":"Angular API-Service: Entwicklungswerkfluss","en":"angular-api-service"},"description":{"zh":"Angular API ","ja":"Angular API","ko":"Angular API ","es":"El servicio de API de Angular es un flujo de trabajo de desarrollo para crear servicios de API para la comunicación con el backend. Incluye caché y descargas...","fr":"Le service API Angular est un flux de travail de développement pour créer des services API pour la communication avec le backend. Il inclut la mise en cache ...","de":"Der Angular API-Service ist ein Entwicklungswerkfluss zum Erstellen von API-Diensten für die Kommunikation mit dem Backend. Er umfasst Caching und Dateidownl...","en":"Copy .* folder and AGENTS.md then paste  /root of project "},"definition":{"en":"Copy .* folder and AGENTS.md then paste  /root of project "},"features":{"zh":["API","API","API","API"],"ja":["API","API","API","API"],"ko":["API","API","API","API"],"es":["Creación de servicios de API para la comunicación con el backend","Implementación de caché para llamadas a la API","Descargas y subidas de archivos","Adición de encabezados personalizados o interceptores"],"fr":["Création de services API pour la communication avec le backend","Mise en cache des appels à l''API","Téléchargements et uploads de fichiers","Ajout d''en-têtes personnalisés ou d''intercepteurs"],"de":["Erstellung von API-Diensten für die Kommunikation mit dem Backend","Implementierung von Caching für API-Anfragen","Dateidownloads und -uploads","Hinzufügen von benutzerdefinierten Headern oder Interzeptoren"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular API","API","Angular","API","Angular API","API"],"ja":["Angular API","API","Angular","API","Angular API","API"],"ko":["Angular API","API","Angular","API","Angular API","API"],"es":["angular api service","flujo de trabajo de desarrollo","comunicación con el backend","caché","descargas de archivos","desarrollo de api","angular backend","servicios de api"],"fr":["service api angular","flux de travail de développement","communication avec le backend","mise en cache","téléchargements de fichiers","développement d''api","angular backend","services api"],"de":["angular api service","entwicklungswerkfluss","kommunikation mit dem backend","caching","dateidownloads","api-entwicklung","angular backend","api-dienste"]}},"owner":"CongDon1207","repo":"AGENTS.md","repoPath":"CongDon1207/AGENTS.md","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"angular-api-service","description":"Use when creating API services for backend communication with proper patterns for caching, error handling, and type safety.","bodyPreview":"# Angular API Service Development Workflow\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating new API service for backend communication\n- Adding caching to API calls\n- Implementing file upload/download\n- Adding custom headers or interceptors\n\n## Pre-Flight Checklist\n\n- [ ] Identify backend API base URL\n- [ ] **Read the design system docs** for the target application (see below)\n- [ ] List all endpoints to implement\n- [ ] Determine caching requirements\n- [ ] Search existing services: `grep \"{Feature}ApiServi","body":"# Angular API Service Development Workflow\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating new API service for backend communication\n- Adding caching to API calls\n- Implementing file upload/download\n- Adding custom headers or interceptors\n\n## Pre-Flight Checklist\n\n- [ ] Identify backend API base URL\n- [ ] **Read the design system docs** for the target application (see below)\n- [ ] List all endpoints to implement\n- [ ] Determine caching requirements\n- [ ] Search existing services: `grep \"{Feature}ApiService\" --include=\"*.ts\"`\n\n## 🎨 Design System Documentation (MANDATORY)\n\n**Before creating any API service, read the design system documentation for your target application:**\n\n| Application                       | Design System Location                           |\n| --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| **WebV2 Apps**                    | `docs/design-system/`                            |\n| **TextSnippetClient**             | `src/PlatformExampleAppWeb/apps/playground-text-snippet/docs/design-system/` |\n\n**Key docs to read:**\n\n- `README.md` - Component overview, base classes, library summary\n- `07-technical-guide.md` - Implementation checklist, best practices\n- `06-state-management.md` - State management and API integration patterns\n\n## File Location\n\n```\nsrc/PlatformExampleAppWeb/libs/apps-domains/src/lib/\n└── {domain}/\n    └── services/\n        └── {feature}-api.service.ts\n```\n\n## Pattern 1: Basic CRUD API Service\n\n```typescript\n// {feature}-api.service.ts\nimport { Injectable } from ''@angular/core'';\nimport { Observable } from ''rxjs'';\nimport { PlatformApiService } from ''@libs/platform-core'';\nimport { environment } from ''@env/environment'';\n\n// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n// DTOs (can be in separate file)\n// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nexport interface FeatureDto {\n    id: string;\n    name: string;\n    code: string;\n    status: FeatureStatus;\n    createdDate: Date;\n}\n\nexport interface FeatureListQuery {\n    searchText?: string;\n    statuses?: FeatureStatus[];\n    skipCount?: number;\n    maxResultCount?: number;\n}\n\nexport interface PagedResult<T> {\n    items: T[];\n    totalCount: number;\n}\n\nexport interface SaveFeatureCommand {\n    id?: string;\n    name: string;\n    code: string;\n    status: FeatureStatus;\n}\n\n// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n// API SERVICE\n// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class FeatureApiService extends PlatformApiService {\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // CONFIGURATION\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    protected get apiUrl(): string {\n        return environment.apiUrl + ''/api/Feature'';\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // QUERY METHODS\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    getList(query?: FeatureListQuery): Observable<PagedResult<FeatureDto>> {\n        return this.get<PagedResult<FeatureDto>>('''', query);\n    }\n\n    getById(id: string): Observable<FeatureDto> {\n        return this.get<FeatureDto>(`/${id}`);\n    }\n\n    getByCode(code: string): Observable<FeatureDto> {\n        return this.get<FeatureDto>(''/by-code'', { code });\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // COMMAND METHODS\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    save(command: SaveFeatureCommand): Observable<FeatureDto> {\n        return this.post<FeatureDto>('''', command);\n    }\n\n    update(id: string, command: Partial<SaveFeatureCommand>): Observable<FeatureDto> {\n        return this.put<FeatureDto>(`/${id}`, command);\n    }\n\n    delete(id: string): Observable<void> {\n        return this.deleteRequest<void>(`/${id}`);\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // VALIDATION METHODS\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    checkCodeExists(code: string, excludeId?: string): Observable<boolean> {\n        return this.get<boolean>(''/check-code-exists'', { code, excludeId });\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Pattern 2: API Service with Caching\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class LookupApiService extends PlatformApiService {\n    protected get apiUrl(): string {\n        return environment.apiUrl + ''/api/Lookup'';\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // CACHED METHODS\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    getCountries(): Observable<CountryDto[]> {\n        return this.get<CountryDto[]>(''/countries'', null, {\n            enableCache: true,\n            cacheKey: ''countries'',\n            cacheDurationMs: 60 * 60 * 1000 // 1 hour\n        });\n    }\n\n    getCurrencies(): Observable<CurrencyDto[]> {\n        return this.get<CurrencyDto[]>(''/currencies'', null, {\n            enableCache: true,\n            cacheKey: ''currencies''\n        });\n    }\n\n    getTimezones(): Observable<TimezoneDto[]> {\n        return this.get<TimezoneDto[]>(''/timezones'', null, {\n            enableCache: true\n        });\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // CACHE INVALIDATION\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    invalidateCountriesCache(): void {\n        this.clearCache(''countries'');\n    }\n\n    invalidateAllCache(): void {\n        this.clearAllCache();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Pattern 3: File Upload/Download\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class DocumentApiService extends PlatformApiService {\n    protected get apiUrl(): string {\n        return environment.apiUrl + ''/api/Document'';\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // FILE UPLOAD\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    upload(file: File, metadata?: DocumentMetadata): Observable<DocumentDto> {\n        const formData = new FormData();\n        formData.append(''file'', file, file.name);\n\n        if (metadata) {\n            formData.append(''metadata'', JSON.stringify(metadata));\n        }\n\n        return this.postFormData<DocumentDto>(''/upload'', formData);\n    }\n\n    uploadMultiple(files: File[]): Observable<DocumentDto[]> {\n        const formData = new FormData();\n        files.forEach((file, index) => {\n            formData.append(`files[${index}]`, file, file.name);\n        });\n\n        return this.postFormData<DocumentDto[]>(''/upload-multiple'', formData);\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // FILE DOWNLOAD\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    download(id: string): Observable<Blob> {\n        return this.getBlob(`/${id}/download`);\n    }\n\n    downloadAsBase64(id: string): Observable<string> {\n        return this.get<string>(`/${id}/base64`);\n    }\n\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n    // HELPER: Trigger browser download\n    // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n    downloadAndSave(id: string, fileName: string): Observable<void> {\n        return this.download(id).pipe(\n            tap(blob => {\n                const url = window.URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n                const link = document.createElement(''a'');\n                link.href = url;\n                link.download = fileName;\n                link.click();\n                window.URL.revokeObjectURL(url);\n            }),\n            map(() => void 0)\n        );\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Pattern 4: API Service with Custom Headers\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class ExternalApiService extends PlatformApiService {\n    protected get apiUrl(): string {\n        return environment.externalApiUrl;\n    }\n\n    // Override to add custom headers\n    protected override getDefaultHeaders(): HttpHeaders {\n        return super.getDefaultHeaders().set(''X-Api-Key'', environment.externalApiKey).set(''X-Request-Id'', this.generateRequestId());\n    }\n\n    // Method with custom headers\n    getWithCustomHeaders(endpoint: string): Observable<any> {\n        return this.get(endpoint, null, {\n            headers: {\n                ''X-Custom-Header'': ''custom-value''\n            }\n        });\n    }\n\n    private generateRequestId(): string {\n        return `${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9)}`;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Pattern 5: Search/Autocomplete API\n\n```typescript\n@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })\nexport class EmployeeApiService extends PlatformApiService {\n\n  protected get apiUrl(): string {\n    return environment.apiUrl + ''/api/Employee'';\n  }\n\n  // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  // SEARCH WITH DEBOUNCE (use in component)\n  // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n  search(term: string): Observable<EmployeeDto[]> {\n    if (!term || term.length < 2) {\n      return of([]);\n    }\n\n    return this.get<EmployeeDto[]>(''/search'', {\n      searchText: term,\n      maxResultCount: 10\n    });\n  }\n\n  // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n  // AUTOCOMPLETE WITH CACHING\n  // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n  autocomplete(prefix: string): Observable<AutocompleteItem[]> {\n    return this.get<AutocompleteItem[]>(''/autocomplete'', { prefix }, {\n      enableCache: true,\n      cacheKey: `autocomplete-${prefix}`,\n      cacheDurationMs: 30 * 1000  // 30 seconds\n    });\n  }\n}\n\n// Usage in component with debounce:\n@Component({...})\nexport class EmployeeSearchComponent {\n  private searchSubject = new Subject<string>();\n\n  search$ = this.searchSubject.pipe(\n    debounceTime(300),\n    distinctUntilChanged(),\n    switchMap(term => this.employeeApi.search(term))\n  );\n\n  onSearchInput(term: string): void {\n    this.searchSubject.next(term);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Base PlatformApiService Methods\n\n| Method               | Purpose              | Example                                  |\n| -------------------- | -------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `get<T>()`           | GET request          | `this.get<User>(''/users/1'')`             |\n| `post<T>()`          | POST request         | `this.post<User>(''/users'', data)`        |\n| `put<T>()`           | PUT request          | `this.put<User>(''/users/1'', data)`       |\n| `patch<T>()`         | PATCH request        | `this.patch<User>(''/users/1'', partial)`  |\n| `deleteRequest<T>()` | DELETE request       | `this.deleteRequest(''/users/1'')`         |\n| `postFormData<T>()`  | POST with FormData   | `this.postFormData(''/upload'', formData)` |\n| `getBlob()`          | GET binary data      | `this.getBlob(''/file/download'')`         |\n| `clearCache()`       | Clear specific cache | `this.clearCache(''cacheKey'')`            |\n| `clearAllCache()`    | Clear all cache      | `this.clearAllCache()`                   |\n\n## Request Options\n\n```typescript\ninterface RequestOptions {\n    // Caching\n    enableCache?: boolean;\n    cacheKey?: string;\n    cacheDurationMs?: number;\n\n    // Headers\n    headers?: { [key: string]: string };\n\n    // Response handling\n    responseType?: ''json'' | ''text'' | ''blob'' | ''arraybuffer'';\n\n    // Progress tracking\n    reportProgress?: boolean;\n    observe?: ''body'' | ''events'' | ''response'';\n}\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns to AVOID\n\n:x: **Using HttpClient directly**\n\n```typescript\n// WRONG - bypasses platform features\nconstructor(private http: HttpClient) { }\n\n// CORRECT - extend PlatformApiService\nexport class MyApiService extends PlatformApiService { }\n```\n\n:x: **Hardcoding URLs**\n\n```typescript\n// WRONG\nreturn this.get(''https://api.example.com/users'');\n\n// CORRECT - use environment\nprotected get apiUrl() { return environment.apiUrl + ''/api/User''; }\n```\n\n:x: **Not handling errors in service**\n\n```typescript\n// WRONG - let errors propagate unhandled\nreturn this.get(''/users'');\n\n// CORRECT - component handles via tapResponse\nthis.userApi.getUsers().pipe(\n    this.tapResponse(\n        users => {\n            /* success */\n        },\n        error => {\n            /* handle error */\n        }\n    )\n);\n```\n\n:x: **Missing type safety**\n\n```typescript\n// WRONG - returns any\ngetUser(id: string) {\n  return this.get(`/users/${id}`);\n}\n\n// CORRECT - typed response\ngetUser(id: string): Observable<UserDto> {\n  return this.get<UserDto>(`/users/${id}`);\n}\n```\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\n- [ ] Extends `PlatformApiService`\n- [ ] `apiUrl` getter returns correct base URL\n- [ ] All methods have return type annotations\n- [ ] DTOs defined for request/response\n- [ ] Caching configured for appropriate endpoints\n- [ ] File operations use `postFormData`/`getBlob`\n- [ ] Validation endpoints return `boolean`\n- [ ] `@Injectable({ providedIn: ''root'' })` for singleton\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:14:11.941Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents specializing in Angular development needing streamlined API service integration for backend communication","zh":"适用于专注于Angular开发的前端代理，需要简化API服务集成以进行后端通信","ja":"Angular開発に特化したフロントエンドエージェントがバックエンド通信のためにストリームライン化されたAPIサービス統合を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"앵귤러 개발에 전문적인 프론트엔드 에이전트가 백엔드 통신을 위한 스트림라인화된 API 서비스 통합을 필요로 할 때 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes Frontend especializados en desarrollo de Angular que necesitan una integración de servicio de API optimizada para la comunicación con el backend","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend spécialisés dans le développement Angular nécessitant une intégration de service d''API rationalisée pour la communication avec le backend","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agenten, die sich auf die Entwicklung von Angular spezialisiert haben und eine optimierte API-Service-Integration für die Backend-Kommunikation benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend especializados em desenvolvimento Angular que necessitam de integração de serviços de API simplificados para comunicação de backend","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, специализирующихся на разработке Angular, требующих упрощенной интеграции сервисов API для взаимодействия с бэкендом","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المتخصص في تطوير Angular الذي يحتاج إلى دمج خدمة API مبسط لاتصالات الخلفية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create new API services with caching capabilities, implement file upload/download functionality, and add custom headers or interceptors using Angular''s API service development workflow, leveraging design system docs and grep for efficient service implementation","zh":"赋予代理创建新的API服务，具有缓存能力，实现文件上传/下载功能，并使用Angular的API服务开发工作流添加自定义头或拦截器，利用设计系统文档和grep进行高效的服务实现","ja":"エージェントが新しいAPIサービスを作成できるようにし、キャッシング機能を実装し、ファイルのアップロード/ダウンロード機能を実装し、AngularのAPIサービス開発ワークフローを使用してカスタムヘッダーまたはインターセプターを追加し、設計システムドキュメントとgrepを使用して効率的なサービス実装を行う","ko":"에이전트가 새로운 API 서비스를 생성하고 캐싱 기능을 구현하고 파일 업로드/다운로드 기능을 구현하며 앵귤러의 API 서비스 개발 워크플로를 사용하여 사용자 지정 헤더 또는 인터셉터를 추가하며 디자인 시스템 문서와 grep를 사용하여 효율적인 서비스 구현을 하는 것","es":"Permite a los agentes crear nuevos servicios de API con capacidades de caché, implementar funcionalidad de carga y descarga de archivos y agregar encabezados personalizados o interceptores utilizando el flujo de trabajo de desarrollo de servicios de API de Angular, aprovechando la documentación del sistema de diseño y grep para una implementación de servicio eficiente","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer de nouveaux services d''API avec des capacités de mise en cache, de mettre en œuvre la fonctionnalité de téléchargement et de téléchargement de fichiers et d''ajouter des en-têtes personnalisés ou des intercepteurs en utilisant le flux de travail de développement de services d''API d''Angular, en exploitant la documentation du système de conception et grep pour une mise en œuvre de service efficace","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, neue API-Dienste mit Cachefunktionen zu erstellen, Datei-Upload-/Download-Funktionalität zu implementieren und benutzerdefinierte Header oder Interceptor unter Verwendung des API-Service-Entwicklungsworkflows von Angular zu hinzufügen, wobei die Design-System-Dokumentation und grep für eine effiziente Service-Implementierung genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar novos serviços de API com capacidades de cache, implementar funcionalidade de upload/download de arquivos e adicionar cabeçalhos personalizados ou interceptores usando o fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento de serviços de API do Angular, aproveitando a documentação do sistema de design e grep para implementação de serviço eficiente","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать новые сервисы API с возможностями кэширования, реализовывать функциональность загрузки/выгрузки файлов и добавлять пользовательские заголовки или перехватчики с помощью рабочего процесса разработки сервисов API Angular, используя документацию системы дизайна и grep для эффективной реализации сервиса","ar":"يمكن للعميل إنشاء خدمات API جديدة مع القدرات المخبأة، وتنفيذ وظيفة تحميل/تنزيل الملفات، وإضافة رؤوس مخصصة أو حاجز باستخدام سير عمل تطوير خدمة API Angular، والاستفادة من وثائق نظام التصميم و grep لتنفيذ خدمة فعالة"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new API services for backend communication","Implementing caching to optimize API calls","Adding custom headers or interceptors for enhanced security"],"zh":["为后端通信创建新的API服务","实现缓存以优化API调用","为增强安全性添加自定义头或拦截器"],"ja":["バックエンド通信のために新しいAPIサービスを作成する","キャッシングを実装してAPI呼び出しを最適化する","セキュリティを強化するためにカスタムヘッダーまたはインターセプターを追加する"],"ko":["백엔드 통신을 위한 새로운 API 서비스 생성","캐싱을 구현하여 API 호출을 최적화","보안성을 강화하기 위해 사용자 지정 헤더 또는 인터셉터 추가"],"es":["Crear nuevos servicios de API para la comunicación con el backend","Implementar caché para optimizar las llamadas a la API","Agregar encabezados personalizados o interceptores para una mayor seguridad"],"fr":["Créer de nouveaux services d''API pour la communication avec le backend","Mettre en œuvre la mise en cache pour optimiser les appels d''API","Ajouter des en-têtes personnalisés ou des intercepteurs pour une sécurité renforcée"],"de":["Erstellen neuer API-Dienste für die Backend-Kommunikation","Implementieren von Caching, um API-Anrufe zu optimieren","Hinzufügen benutzerdefinierter Header oder Interceptor für eine erhöhte Sicherheit"],"pt":["Criar novos serviços de API para comunicação de backend","Implementar cache para otimizar chamadas de API","Adicionar cabeçalhos personalizados ou interceptores para segurança aprimorada"],"ru":["Создание новых сервисов API для взаимодействия с бэкендом","Реализация кэширования для оптимизации вызовов API","Добавление пользовательских заголовков или перехватчиков для повышения безопасности"],"ar":["إنشاء خدمات API جديدة لاتصالات الخلفية","تنفيذ التخزين المؤقت لتحسين مكالمات API","إضافة رؤوس مخصصة أو حاجز لتعزيز الأمان"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires identification of backend API base URL","Needs access to design system documentation","Limited to Angular framework"],"zh":["需要识别后端API基URL","需要访问设计系统文档","仅限于Angular框架"],"ja":["バックエンドAPIのベースURLを識別する必要がある","設計システムドキュメントにアクセスする必要がある","Angularフレームワークのみに限定"],"ko":["백엔드 API 기본 URL을 식별해야 함","디자인 시스템 문서에 접근해야 함","앵귤러 프레임워크에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la identificación de la URL base de la API de backend","Necesita acceso a la documentación del sistema de diseño","Limitado al marco de Angular"],"fr":["Nécessite l''identification de l''URL de base de l''API de backend","A besoin d''un accès à la documentation du système de conception","Limité au framework Angular"],"de":["Erfordert die Identifizierung der Basis-URL der Backend-API","Benötigt Zugriff auf die Design-System-Dokumentation","Begrenzt auf das Angular-Framework"],"pt":["Requer identificação da URL de base da API de backend","Necessita acesso à documentação do sistema de design","Limitado ao framework Angular"],"ru":["Требует идентификации базового URL API бэкенда","Требует доступа к документации системы дизайна","Ограничен фреймворком Angular"],"ar":["يتطلب تحديد URL القاعدة لبروتوكول API الخلفية","يتطلب الوصول إلى وثائق نظام التصميم","محدود بإطار العمل Angular"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('pr-pm/prpm/thoroughness', 'community', 'pr-pm', 'prpm', 'pr-pm/prpm', 'thoroughness', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z', '2026-02-18T03:14:04.951Z', NULL, '{"id":"pr-pm/prpm/thoroughness","name":"thoroughness","description":{"zh":"代码彻底性是一种确保复杂任务完整实现的技能，优先考虑质量和完整性","ja":"徹底性は、複雑なタスクを完全に実装することを保証するスキルであり、品質と完全性を優先します","ko":"코드 철저성은 복잡한 태스크를 완전히 구현하는 것을 보장하는 스킬로, 품질과 완전성을 우선시합니다","es":"Thoroughness es el registro universal para herramientas de codificación AI, que garantiza la implementación completa de tareas complejas","fr":"Thoroughness est le registre universel pour les outils de codage IA, qui assure la mise en œuvre complète de tâches complexes","de":"Thoroughness ist das universelle Register für AI-Coding-Tools, das die vollständige Implementierung komplexer Aufgaben gewährleistet","en":"The universal registry for AI coding tools"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"代码彻底性：确保质量和完整性","ja":"徹底性：コードの品質と完全性を確保","ko":"코드 철저성: 품질과 완전성을 보장","es":"Herramientas de codificación AI: Thoroughness","fr":"Outils de codage IA: Thoroughness","de":"AI-Coding-Tools: Thoroughness","en":"thoroughness"},"description":{"zh":"代码彻底性是一种确保复杂任务完整实现的技能，优先考虑质量和完整性","ja":"徹底性は、複雑なタスクを完全に実装することを保証するスキルであり、品質と完全性を優先します","ko":"코드 철저성은 복잡한 태스크를 완전히 구현하는 것을 보장하는 스킬로, 품질과 완전성을 우선시합니다","es":"Thoroughness es el registro universal para herramientas de codificación AI, que garantiza la implementación completa de tareas complejas","fr":"Thoroughness est le registre universel pour les outils de codage IA, qui assure la mise en œuvre complète de tâches complexes","de":"Thoroughness ist das universelle Register für AI-Coding-Tools, das die vollständige Implementierung komplexer Aufgaben gewährleistet","en":"The universal registry for AI coding tools"},"definition":{"en":"The universal registry for AI coding tools"},"features":{"zh":["确保复杂任务的完整实现","优先考虑质量和完整性","避免未来问题","提高代码可维护性","增强代码可靠性"],"ja":["複雑なタスクの完全な実装を確保","品質と完全性を優先","将来の問題を避ける","コードの保守性を高める","コードの信頼性を高める"],"ko":["복잡한 태스크의 완전한 구현을 보장","품질과 완전성을 우선시","미래의 문제를 피하기","코드의 유지 보수성을 높이기","코드의 신뢰성을 높이기"],"es":["Análisis comprehensivo","Implementación de características multi-paso","Depuración de fallas de prueba","Reestructuración de grandes bases de código","Despliegues de producción","Evitación de atajos que pueden causar problemas futuros"],"fr":["Analyse complète","Mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités multi-étapes","Débogage des échecs de test","Réorganisation de grandes bases de code","Déploiements de production","Évitement des raccourcis qui peuvent causer des problèmes futurs"],"de":["Umfassende Analyse","Implementierung von Multi-Schritt-Funktionen","Fehlerbehebung bei Testfehlern","Neustrukturierung großer Codebasen","Produktionsbereitstellung","Vermeidung von Abkürzungen, die zukünftige Probleme verursachen können"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码彻底性","代码质量","代码完整性","复杂任务","未来问题","代码可维护性","代码可靠性"],"ja":["徹底性","コード品質","コード完全性","複雑なタスク","将来の問題","コード保守性","コード信頼性"],"ko":["코드 철저성","코드 품질","코드 완전성","복잡한 태스크","미래의 문제","코드 유지 보수성","코드 신뢰성"],"es":["herramientas de codificación AI","desarrollo de software","implementación de tareas complejas","análisis comprehensivo","depuración de fallas","reestructuración de código","despliegues de producción","calidad del código"],"fr":["outils de codage IA","développement de logiciels","mise en œuvre de tâches complexes","analyse complète","débogage des échecs","réorganisation de code","déploiements de production","qualité du code"],"de":["AI-Coding-Tools","Softwareentwicklung","Implementierung komplexer Aufgaben","umfassende Analyse","Fehlerbehebung","Neustrukturierung von Code","Produktionsbereitstellung","Codequalität"]}},"owner":"pr-pm","repo":"prpm","repoPath":"pr-pm/prpm","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"thoroughness","description":"Use when implementing complex multi-step tasks, fixing critical bugs, or when quality and completeness matter more than speed - ensures comprehensive implementation without shortcuts through systematic analysis, implementation, and verification phases","bodyPreview":"# Thoroughness\n\n## Purpose\nThis skill ensures comprehensive, complete implementation of complex tasks without shortcuts. Use this when quality and completeness matter more than speed.\n\n## When to Use\n- Fixing critical bugs or compilation errors\n- Implementing complex multi-step features\n- Debugging test failures\n- Refactoring large codebases\n- Production deployments\n- Any task where shortcuts could cause future problems\n\n## Methodology\n\n### Phase 1: Comprehensive Analysis (20% of time)\n1. **Iden","body":"# Thoroughness\n\n## Purpose\nThis skill ensures comprehensive, complete implementation of complex tasks without shortcuts. Use this when quality and completeness matter more than speed.\n\n## When to Use\n- Fixing critical bugs or compilation errors\n- Implementing complex multi-step features\n- Debugging test failures\n- Refactoring large codebases\n- Production deployments\n- Any task where shortcuts could cause future problems\n\n## Methodology\n\n### Phase 1: Comprehensive Analysis (20% of time)\n1. **Identify All Issues**\n   - List every error, warning, and failing test\n   - Group related issues together\n   - Prioritize by dependency order\n   - Create issue hierarchy (what blocks what)\n\n2. **Root Cause Analysis**\n   - Don''t fix symptoms, find root causes\n   - Trace errors to their source\n   - Identify patterns in failures\n   - Document assumptions that were wrong\n\n3. **Create Detailed Plan**\n   - Break down into atomic steps\n   - Estimate time for each step\n   - Identify dependencies between steps\n   - Plan verification for each step\n   - Schedule breaks/checkpoints\n\n### Phase 2: Systematic Implementation (60% of time)\n1. **Fix Issues in Dependency Order**\n   - Start with foundational issues\n   - Fix one thing completely before moving on\n   - Test after each fix\n   - Document what was changed and why\n\n2. **Verify Each Fix**\n   - Write/run tests for the specific fix\n   - Check for side effects\n   - Verify related functionality still works\n   - Document test results\n\n3. **Track Progress**\n   - Mark issues as completed\n   - Update plan with new discoveries\n   - Adjust time estimates\n   - Note any blockers immediately\n\n### Phase 3: Comprehensive Verification (20% of time)\n1. **Run All Tests**\n   - Unit tests\n   - Integration tests\n   - E2E tests\n   - Manual verification\n\n2. **Cross-Check Everything**\n   - Review all changed files\n   - Verify compilation succeeds\n   - Check for console errors/warnings\n   - Test edge cases\n\n3. **Documentation**\n   - Update relevant docs\n   - Add inline comments for complex fixes\n   - Document known limitations\n   - Create issues for future work\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n- ❌ Fixing multiple unrelated issues at once\n- ❌ Moving on before verifying a fix works\n- ❌ Assuming similar errors have the same cause\n- ❌ Skipping test writing \"to save time\"\n- ❌ Copy-pasting solutions without understanding\n- ❌ Ignoring warnings \"because it compiles\"\n- ❌ Making changes without reading existing code first\n\n## Quality Checkpoints\n- [ ] Can I explain why this fix works?\n- [ ] Have I tested this specific change?\n- [ ] Are there any side effects?\n- [ ] Is this the root cause or a symptom?\n- [ ] Will this prevent similar issues in the future?\n- [ ] Is the code readable and maintainable?\n- [ ] Have I documented non-obvious decisions?\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n### Bad Approach (Shortcut-Driven)\n```\n1. See 24 TypeScript errors\n2. Add @ts-ignore to all of them\n3. Hope tests pass\n4. Move on\n```\n\n### Good Approach (Thoroughness-Driven)\n```\n1. List all 24 errors systematically\n2. Group by error type (7 missing types, 10 unknown casts, 7 property access)\n3. Find root causes:\n   - Missing @types/tar package\n   - No type assertions on fetch responses\n   - Implicit any types in callbacks\n4. Fix by category:\n   - Install @types/tar (fixes 7 errors)\n   - Add proper type assertions to registry-client.ts (fixes 10 errors)\n   - Add explicit parameter types (fixes 7 errors)\n5. Test after each category\n6. Run full test suite\n7. Document what was learned\n```\n\n## Time Investment\n- Initial: 2-3x slower than shortcuts\n- Long-term: 10x faster (no debugging later, no rework)\n- Quality: Near-perfect first time\n- Maintenance: Minimal\n\n## Success Metrics\n- ✅ 100% of tests passing\n- ✅ Zero warnings in production build\n- ✅ All code has test coverage\n- ✅ Documentation is complete and accurate\n- ✅ No known issues or TODOs left behind\n- ✅ Future developers can understand the code\n\n## Mantras\n- \"Slow is smooth, smooth is fast\"\n- \"Do it right the first time\"\n- \"Test everything, assume nothing\"\n- \"Document for your future self\"\n- \"Root causes, not symptoms\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:14:04.951Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing rigorous implementation and debugging capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要严格实现和调试能力的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが厳格な実装とデバッグ機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":" 엄격한 구현 및 디버깅 기능이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan una implementación y capacidades de depuración rigurosas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une mise en œuvre et des capacités de débogage rigoureuses.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agenten, die eine strenge Implementierung und Debugging-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de implementação rigorosa e capacidades de depuração.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодового обзора, требующих тщательной реализации и возможностей отладки.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يحتاج إلى تنفيذ صارم وقدرات فحص الأخطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ensure comprehensive and complete implementation of complex tasks, leveraging methodologies like Comprehensive Analysis and phased implementation, ideal for critical bug fixing, complex feature implementation, and production deployments, utilizing protocols like debug logging and test validation.","zh":"赋予代理确保复杂任务的全面和完整实现的能力，利用综合分析和分阶段实施等方法，适合关键错误修复、复杂功能实施和生产部署，使用调试日志和测试验证等协议。","ja":"エージェントに、包括的分析や段階的な実装などの方法論を利用して、複雑なタスクの包括的かつ完全な実装を保証する能力を与え、クリティカルなバグ修正、複雑な機能実装、生产デプロイメントに最適であり、デバッグログやテストバリデーションなどのプロトコルを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 종합 분석 및 단계적 구현 등의 방법론을 활용하여 복잡한 태스크의 포괄적이고 완전한 구현을 보장하는 능력을 부여하며, 중요한 버그 수정, 복잡한 기능 구현, 생산 배포에 적합하며, 디버깅 로깅 및 테스트 검증 등의 프로토콜을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a garantizar una implementación integral y completa de tareas complejas, aprovechando metodologías como Análisis Integral y implementación por fases, ideal para la corrección de errores críticos, la implementación de características complejas y despliegues de producción, utilizando protocolos como registro de depuración y validación de pruebas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de garantir une mise en œuvre complète et intégrale de tâches complexes, en exploitant des méthodologies comme l''Analyse Complète et la mise en œuvre par phases, idéale pour la correction de bogues critiques, la mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités complexes et les déploiements de production, en utilisant des protocoles tels que la journalisation de débogage et la validation de tests.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine umfassende und vollständige Implementierung komplexer Aufgaben sicherzustellen, indem Methoden wie Umfassende Analyse und phasenweise Implementierung genutzt werden, ideal für die Behebung kritischer Fehler, die Implementierung komplexer Funktionen und Produktionsbereitstellungen, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie Debug-Protokollierung und Testvalidierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a garantir uma implementação abrangente e completa de tarefas complexas, aproveitando metodologias como Análise Abrangente e implementação por fases, ideal para correção de bugs críticos, implementação de recursos complexos e implantações de produção, utilizando protocolos como registro de depuração e validação de teste.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить всестороннюю и полную реализацию сложных задач, используя методологии, такие как Всесторонний анализ и поэтапная реализация, идеально подходящие для критического исправления ошибок, реализации сложных функций и производственных развертываний, используя протоколы, такие как ведение журнала отладки и проверка валидации.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على ضمان تنفيذ شامل وكامل للمهام المعقدة، مستفيداً من منهجيات مثل التحليل الشامل والتنفيذ المتدرج، مثالية لتصحيح الأخطاء الحرجة وتنفيذ ميزات معقدة وتنفيذ الإنتاج، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل تسجيل فحص الأخطاء وتحقق التحقق."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging critical test failures","Implementing complex multi-step features","Refactoring large codebases for production"],"zh":["调试关键测试失败","实现复杂的多步骤功能","重构大型代码库以适应生产"],"ja":["クリティカルなテスト失敗のデバッグ","複雑なマルチステップ機能の実装","大規模なコードベースのリファクタリングによる生産性向上"],"ko":["임계 테스트 실패 디버깅","복잡한 멀티스텝 기능 구현","대형 코드베이스 리팩토링을 통한 생산성 향상"],"es":["Depuración de fallos de prueba críticos","Implementación de características complejas de varios pasos","Reestructuración de grandes bases de código para producción"],"fr":["Débogage des échecs de test critiques","Mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités complexes à plusieurs étapes","Réorganisation de grandes bases de code pour la production"],"de":["Behandlung kritischer Testfehler","Implementierung komplexer Funktionen mit mehreren Schritten","Umstrukturierung großer Codebasen für die Produktion"],"pt":["Depuração de falhas de teste críticas","Implementação de recursos multi-etapa complexos","Reestruturação de grandes bases de código para produção"],"ru":["Отладка критических сбоев тестов","Реализация сложных многоступенчатых функций","Рефакторинг больших кодовых баз для производства"],"ar":["فحص أخطاء الفشل الحرجة","تنفيذ ميزات متعددة المراحل المعقدة","إعادة هيكلة قواعد بيانات الكود الكبيرة للانتاج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires significant computational resources for comprehensive analysis","May incur increased time costs due to thorough methodology"],"zh":["需要大量的计算资源来进行全面分析","可能由于彻底的方法而导致时间成本增加"],"ja":["包括的分析には大量の計算リソースが必要","徹底した方法により時間コストが増加する可能性がある"],"ko":["포괄적인 분석을 위해大量의 계산 리소스가 필요","철저한 방법으로 인해 시간 비용이 증가할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere recursos computacionales significativos para un análisis integral","Puede incurrir en costos de tiempo aumentados debido a la metodología exhaustiva"],"fr":["Nécessite des ressources computationnelles significatives pour une analyse complète","Peut entraîner des coûts de temps accrus en raison de la méthodologie exhaustive"],"de":["Benötigt erhebliche Rechenressourcen für eine umfassende Analyse","Kann aufgrund der gründlichen Methodik zu erhöhten Zeitaufwänden führen"],"pt":["Requer recursos computacionais significativos para análise abrangente","Pode incorrer em custos de tempo aumentados devido à metodologia minuciosa"],"ru":["Требует значительных вычислительных ресурсов для всестороннего анализа","Может привести к увеличению временных затрат из-за тщательной методологии"],"ar":["يتطلب موارد حسابية كبيرة للتحليل الشامل","يمكن أن يؤدي إلى زيادة التكاليف الزمنية بسبب المنهجية الشاملة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
