n":"home-network-admin"},"description":{"zh":"家居网络管理使用yadm管理dotfiles，管理Tailscale、Synology NAS和Mac设备","ja":"ホームネットワーク管理はyadmを使用してdotfilesを管理し、Tailscale、Synology NAS、Macデバイスを管理します","ko":"홈 네트워크 관리는 yadm을 사용하여 dotfiles를 관리하고 Tailscale, Synology NAS 및 Mac 장치를 관리합니다","es":"La administración de red doméstica con yadm permite gestionar dispositivos conectados a Tailscale y acceso SSH a Synology NAS y Macs","fr":"L''administration du réseau domestique avec yadm permet de gérer les appareils connectés à Tailscale et l''accès SSH à Synology NAS et Mac","de":"Die Verwaltung des Heimnetzwerks mit yadm ermöglicht die Verwaltung von Geräten, die mit Tailscale verbunden sind, und den SSH-Zugriff auf Synology NAS und Macs","pt":"A administração de rede doméstica com yadm permite gerenciar dispositivos conectados via Tailscale e acessar Macs e Synology NAS via SSH","ru":"Администрирование домашней сети с yadm позволяет управлять устройствами, подключенными через Tailscale, и доступом к Mac и Synology NAS через SSH","ar":"تتيح إدارة الشبكة المنزلية مع yadm إدارة الأجهزة المتصلة عبر Tailscale ووصول إلى Macs و Synology NAS عبر SSH","en":"The new dotfiles repo managed with yadm"},"definition":{"en":"The new dotfiles repo managed with yadm"},"features":{"zh":["使用yadm管理dotfiles","管理Tailscale设备","管理Synology NAS设备","管理Mac设备","使用SSH访问设备","自定义SSH配置"],"ja":["yadmを使用してdotfilesを管理","Tailscaleデバイスの管理","Synology NASデバイスの管理","Macデバイスの管理","SSHを使用してデバイスにアクセス","SSH構成のカスタマイズ"],"ko":["yadm을 사용하여 dotfiles 관리","Tailscale 장치 관리","Synology NAS 장치 관리","Mac 장치 관리","SSH를 사용하여 장치에 액세스","SSH 구성 사용자 정의"],"es":["Gestión de dispositivos conectados a Tailscale","Acceso SSH a Synology NAS","Acceso SSH a Macs","Configuración de SSH con alias personalizados","Inventario de red con IPs y topología de red"],"fr":["Gestion des appareils connectés à Tailscale","Accès SSH à Synology NAS","Accès SSH à Mac","Configuration SSH avec des alias personnalisés","Inventaire du réseau avec des IPs et une topologie de réseau"],"de":["Verwaltung von Geräten, die mit Tailscale verbunden sind","SSH-Zugriff auf Synology NAS","SSH-Zugriff auf Macs","SSH-Konfiguration mit benutzerdefinierten Aliassen","Netzwerkinventar mit IPs und Netzwerktopologie"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de dispositivos conectados via Tailscale","Acesso SSH a Macs e Synology NAS","Configuração de SSH personalizada","Inventário de rede completo","Acesso a dispositivos via aliases de SSH","Gerenciamento de rede com yadm"],"ru":["Управление устройствами, подключенными через Tailscale","Доступ SSH к Mac и Synology NAS","Пользовательская конфигурация SSH","Полный инвентарь сети","Доступ к устройствам через псевдонимы SSH","Управление сетью с помощью yadm"],"ar":["إدارة الأجهزة المتصلة عبر Tailscale","وصول SSH إلى Macs و Synology NAS","تكوين SSH مخصص","جرد شبكة كامل","وصول إلى الأجهزة عبر أسماء مستعارة SSH","إدارة الشبكة باستخدام yadm"]},"keywords":{"zh":["家居网络管理","yadm","dotfiles","Tailscale","Synology NAS","Mac","SSH","网络管理","设备管理"],"ja":["ホームネットワーク管理","yadm","dotfiles","Tailscale","Synology NAS","Mac","SSH","ネットワーク管理","デバイス管理"],"ko":["홈 네트워크 관리","yadm","dotfiles","Tailscale","Synology NAS","Mac","SSH","네트워크 관리","장치 관리"],"es":["administración de red doméstica","yadm","Tailscale","Synology NAS","SSH","Macs","inventario de red","configuración de SSH","alias personalizados"],"fr":["administration du réseau domestique","yadm","Tailscale","Synology NAS","SSH","Mac","inventaire du réseau","configuration SSH","alias personnalisés"],"de":["Verwaltung des Heimnetzwerks","yadm","Tailscale","Synology NAS","SSH","Macs","Netzwerkinventar","SSH-Konfiguration","benutzerdefinierte Aliasse"],"pt":["administração de rede doméstica","yadm","Tailscale","SSH","Synology NAS","Macs","gerenciamento de rede","inventário de rede","aliases de SSH"],"ru":["администрирование домашней сети","yadm","Tailscale","SSH","Synology NAS","Mac","управление сетью","инвентарь сети","псевдонимы SSH"],"ar":["إدارة الشبكة المنزلية","yadm","Tailscale","SSH","Synology NAS","Macs","إدارة الشبكة","جرد الشبكة","أسماء مستعارة SSH"]}},"owner":"tdhopper","repo":"dotfiles2.0","repoPath":"tdhopper/dotfiles2.0","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"home-network-admin","description":"Manage and troubleshoot Tims home network, SSH into devices, administer the Synology NAS, and work with Tailscale. Use when the user wants to (1) SSH into or run commands on remote machines (synology, dobro), (2) manage the Synology NAS (files, packages, Docker, backups, Surveillance Station), (3) troubleshoot network connectivity or DNS, (4) check Tailscale status or manage the tailnet, (5) transfer files between machines, (6) check device health or disk usage, (7) manage the Caddy reverse proxy on dobro (*.hopperhosted.com), (8) any home server or home network administration task.","bodyPreview":"# Home Network Admin\n\nAdminister Tim''s home network: devices connected over Tailscale, with a Synology NAS and Macs accessible via SSH.\n\nRead [references/network-inventory.md](references/network-inventory.md) for the full device list, IPs, SSH config, and network topology before performing any task.\n\n## SSH Access\n\nSSH configs are defined in `~/.ssh/config`. Use the short aliases:\n\n- `ssh synology` - Synology NAS (custom port, user tdhopper)\n- `ssh dobro` - Mac (default port, user thopper)\n\nSSH","body":"# Home Network Admin\n\nAdminister Tim''s home network: devices connected over Tailscale, with a Synology NAS and Macs accessible via SSH.\n\nRead [references/network-inventory.md](references/network-inventory.md) for the full device list, IPs, SSH config, and network topology before performing any task.\n\n## SSH Access\n\nSSH configs are defined in `~/.ssh/config`. Use the short aliases:\n\n- `ssh synology` - Synology NAS (custom port, user tdhopper)\n- `ssh dobro` - Mac (default port, user thopper)\n\nSSH keys are managed via 1Password agent. If SSH fails with auth errors, verify 1Password is unlocked and the SSH agent is running.\n\n## Synology NAS Administration\n\nThe Synology runs DSM. Common admin tasks via SSH:\n\n- **Packages**: `synopkg list` (installed), `synopkg status <pkg>`, `synopkg start/stop <pkg>`\n- **Docker/Container Manager**: `sudo docker ps`, `sudo docker logs <container>`, `sudo docker compose` (compose files often in `/volume1/docker/`)\n- **Disk/volume health**: `df -h`, `cat /proc/mdstat`, `synodisk --enum`\n- **Shared folders**: typically under `/volume1/`\n- **DSM web UI**: `https://synology:5001` or `https://100.86.145.18:5001`\n- **Logs**: `/var/log/` and DSM log center\n\nFor destructive operations (deleting files, stopping services, modifying configs), confirm with the user first.\n\n## Tailscale\n\nTailscale connects all devices over a WireGuard mesh. Run `tailscale status` to discover the tailnet name and device list.\n\n- On macOS, the `tailscale` CLI may not be on PATH. Use: `/Applications/Tailscale.app/Contents/MacOS/Tailscale`\n- Check status: `tailscale status` (or the full path above)\n- Verify connectivity: `tailscale ping <hostname>`\n- All devices are reachable via MagicDNS (e.g., `synology.<tailnet>.ts.net`)\n\n## Caddy Reverse Proxy (on dobro)\n\nCaddy runs on dobro, providing HTTPS reverse proxy for `*.hopperhosted.com`. The Caddyfile is at `~/Caddyfile` (tracked in yadm). TLS uses Cloudflare DNS-01 challenge.\n\nSee [references/network-inventory.md](references/network-inventory.md) for the full list of proxied subdomains and backends.\n\n- **Manage Caddy on dobro**: `ssh dobro` then `brew services restart caddy`, `caddy reload --config ~/Caddyfile`\n- **Logs**: `journalctl -u caddy` or `brew services info caddy` depending on how it''s managed\n- **Edit Caddyfile locally**: it''s tracked in yadm dotfiles at `~/Caddyfile`\n\n## File Transfer\n\n- Between local and remote hosts: `scp` or `rsync` using the SSH aliases\n- Example: `rsync -avz ~/files/ synology:/volume1/backup/files/`\n- For large transfers, prefer `rsync` with `--progress`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n1. **Can''t SSH**: Check 1Password is unlocked, verify Tailscale is connected (`tailscale status`), ping the Tailscale IP\n2. **DNS issues**: Check if MagicDNS resolves (`dig @100.100.100.100 synology.<tailnet>.ts.net`), fall back to Tailscale IPs directly\n3. **NAS unresponsive**: Try ping, check DSM web UI, SSH may still work even if DSM is sluggish\n4. **Slow network**: Check if traffic is going through Tailscale relay (`tailscale status` shows DERP relay vs direct connection)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:14:24.076Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Network Administration Agents requiring secure SSH access and Tailscale network management capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要安全SSH访问和Tailscale网络管理功能的网络管理代理。","ja":"セキュアなSSHアクセスとTailscaleネットワーク管理機能を必要とするネットワーク管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"보안 SSH 액세스 및 Tailscale 네트워크 관리 기능이 필요한 네트워크 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de administración de redes que requieren acceso seguro SSH y capacidades de administración de redes Tailscale.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''administration réseau nécessitant un accès SSH sécurisé et des capacités de gestion de réseau Tailscale.","de":"Ideal für Netzwerksadministration-Agenten, die sicheren SSH-Zugriff und Tailscale-Netzwerkleistungsmerkmale erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Administração de Rede que requerem acesso SSH seguro e capacidades de gerenciamento de rede Tailscale.","ru":"Идеально для агентов сетевой администрации, требующих безопасного доступа SSH и возможностей управления сетью Tailscale.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة الشبكة الذي يحتاج إلى وصول آمن عبر SSH وقدرات إدارة شبكة Tailscale."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage home networks via SSH configs, leveraging Tailscale for secure device connections and a Synology NAS for centralized storage, utilizing SSH protocols for Mac and NAS interactions.","zh":"使代理能够通过SSH配置管理家庭网络，利用Tailscale进行安全的设备连接，并使用Synology NAS进行集中存储，使用SSH协议进行Mac和NAS交互。","ja":"エージェントがSSH設定を介してホームネットワークを管理できるようにし、Tailscaleを使用してセキュアなデバイス接続と集中ストレージのためのSynology NASを利用し、MacとNASのやり取りにSSHプロトコルを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 SSH 구성 통해 홈 네트워크를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, Tailscale을 사용하여 보안 장치 연결과集中 저장을 위한 Synology NAS를 활용하며, Mac 및 NAS 상호 작용에 SSH 프로토콜을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar redes domésticas a través de configuraciones SSH, aprovechando Tailscale para conexiones de dispositivos seguras y un NAS Synology para almacenamiento centralizado, utilizando protocolos SSH para interacciones con Mac y NAS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les réseaux domestiques via des configurations SSH, en exploitant Tailscale pour des connexions de périphériques sécurisées et un NAS Synology pour un stockage centralisé, en utilisant des protocoles SSH pour les interactions Mac et NAS.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Heimnetzwerke über SSH-Konfigurationen zu verwalten, indem Tailscale für sichere Geräteverbindungen und ein Synology-NAS für zentralisierten Speicher genutzt wird, wobei SSH-Protokolle für Mac- und NAS-Interaktionen verwendet werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem redes domésticas via configurações SSH, utilizando Tailscale para conexões de dispositivos seguras e um Synology NAS para armazenamento centralizado, utilizando protocolos SSH para interações Mac e NAS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять сетями дома через конфигурации SSH, используя Tailscale для безопасных подключений устройств и Synology NAS для централизованного хранилища, используя протоколы SSH для взаимодействия Mac и NAS.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل إمكانية إدارة الشبكات المنزلية من خلال تكوينات SSH، مستخدماً Tailscale لاتصالات الأجهزة الآمنة و Synology NAS لتخزين مركزي، مستخدماً بروتوكولات SSH للتفاعل مع Mac و NAS."},"useCases":{"en":["Administering devices connected over Tailscale","Managing SSH access to Macs and Synology NAS","Maintaining network inventory and topology documentation"],"zh":["通过Tailscale管理连接的设备","管理Mac和Synology NAS的SSH访问","维护网络清单和拓扑文档"],"ja":["Tailscaleを介して接続されたデバイスを管理する","MacとSynology NASのSSHアクセスを管理する","ネットワークインベントリとトポロジー文書を維持する"],"ko":["Tailscale을 통해 연결된 장치를 관리합니다","Mac 및 Synology NAS의 SSH 액세스를 관리합니다","네트워크 인벤토리 및 토폴로지 문서를 유지합니다"],"es":["Administrar dispositivos conectados a través de Tailscale","Administrar el acceso SSH a Macs y Synology NAS","Mantener la documentación del inventario y la topología de la red"],"fr":["Administrer les périphériques connectés via Tailscale","Gérer l''accès SSH aux Mac et au NAS Synology","Maintenir la documentation de l''inventaire et de la topologie du réseau"],"de":["Geräte verwalten, die über Tailscale verbunden sind","SSH-Zugriff auf Macs und Synology NAS verwalten","Netzbestands- und Topologiedokumentation aufrechterhalten"],"pt":["Administrar dispositivos conectados via Tailscale","Gerenciar acesso SSH a Macs e Synology NAS","Manter documentação de inventário e topologia de rede"],"ru":["Администрирование устройств, подключенных через Tailscale","Управление доступом SSH к Mac и Synology NAS","Ведение документации инвентаризации и топологии сети"],"ar":["إدارة الأجهزة المتصلة عبر Tailscale","إدارة الوصول عبر SSH إلى أجهزة Mac و Synology NAS","صيانة توثيق الجرد وتوبولوجيا الشبكة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SSH access and configuration","Tailscale and Synology NAS dependencies","Mac and SSH protocol compatibility necessary"],"zh":["需要SSH访问和配置","依赖Tailscale和Synology NAS","需要Mac和SSH协议兼容性"],"ja":["SSHアクセスと設定が必要","TailscaleとSynology NASに依存","MacとSSHプロトコルの互換性が必要"],"ko":["SSH 액세스 및 구성이 필요합니다","Tailscale 및 Synology NAS에 의존합니다","Mac 및 SSH 프로토콜 호환성이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso y configuración SSH","Dependencias de Tailscale y Synology NAS","Compatibilidad de protocolo Mac y SSH necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès et une configuration SSH","Dépendances de Tailscale et de NAS Synology","Compatibilité du protocole Mac et SSH nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt SSH-Zugriff und -Konfiguration","Tailscale- und Synology-NAS-Abhängigkeiten","Mac- und SSH-Protokollkompatibilität erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer acesso e configuração SSH","Dependências de Tailscale e Synology NAS","Compatibilidade de protocolo Mac e SSH necessária"],"ru":["Требует доступа и конфигурации SSH","Зависимости Tailscale и Synology NAS","Необходима совместимость протоколов Mac и SSH"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى SSH وتكوينه","اعتمادات Tailscale و Synology NAS","التوافق مع بروتوكول Mac و SSH ضروري"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
