下文和SESSION_CONTEXT.md时间戳","ja":"セッション開始チェックリストは、現在の会話コンテキストとSESSION_CONTEXT.mdのタイムスタンプを確認することで、セッションフローをスムーズにします","ko":"세션 시작 체크리스트는 현재 대화 컨텍스트와 SESSION_CONTEXT.md 타임스탬프를 확인하여 세션 흐름을 매끄럽게 합니다","es":"La skill ''session-begin'' ayuda a detectar sesiones duplicadas a través de una checklist de verificación","fr":"La compétence ''session-begin'' aide à détecter les sessions en double via une checklist de vérification","de":"Die Fähigkeit ''session-begin'' hilft bei der Erkennung von Duplikatsitzungen durch eine Überprüfungs-Checklist","pt":"A checklist de início de sessão é crucial para evitar duplicatas. Verifique o contexto da conversa e o carimbo de data para garantir a unicidade da sessão.","ru":"Проверочная листа начала сессии имеет решающее значение для предотвращения дубликатов. Проверьте контекст разговора и штамп даты, чтобы гарантировать уникаль...","ar":"قائمة التحقق من بدء الجلسة حاسمة لمنع التكرارات. تحقق من سياق المحادثة وتوقيع التاريخ لضمان الفردية الجلسة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["检测会话重复","检查当前对话上下文","验证SESSION_CONTEXT.md时间戳","确保会话流程顺畅","提高开发效率"],"ja":["セッションの重複を検出","現在の会話コンテキストを確認","SESSION_CONTEXT.mdのタイムスタンプを検証","セッションフローをスムーズにする","開発効率を向上させる"],"ko":["세션의 중복을 감지","현재 대화 컨텍스트를 확인","SESSION_CONTEXT.md 타임스탬프를 검증","세션 흐름을 매끄럽게 한다","개발 효율을 향상"],"es":["Detección de sesiones duplicadas","Verificación del contexto de conversación","Comprobación de la fecha de última actualización","Evitación de sesiones en paralelo"],"fr":["Détection des sessions en double","Vérification du contexte de conversation","Vérification de la date de dernière mise à jour","Évitement des sessions parallèles"],"de":["Erkennung von Duplikatsitzungen","Überprüfung des Konversationskontexts","Überprüfung des Datums der letzten Aktualisierung","Vermeidung von parallelen Sitzungen"],"pt":["Verificação de duplicatas","Leitura do contexto da conversa","Verificação do carimbo de data","Garantia de unicidade da sessão","Prevenção de sessões duplicadas"],"ru":["Обнаружение дубликатов","Чтение контекста разговора","Проверка штампа даты","Гарантия уникальности сессии","Предотвращение дубликатов сессий"],"ar":["الكشف عن التكرارات","قراءة سياق المحادثة","التحقق من توقيع التاريخ","ضمان الفردية الجلسة","منع الجلسات المكررة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["会话开始检查清单","会话流程","SESSION_CONTEXT.md","会话重复检测","开发效率","软件开发","会话管理"],"ja":["セッション開始チェックリスト","セッションフロー","SESSION_CONTEXT.md","セッションの重複を検出","開発効率","ソフトウェア開発","セッション管理"],"ko":["세션 시작 체크리스트","세션 흐름","SESSION_CONTEXT.md","세션의 중복을 감지","개발 효율","소프트웨어 개발","세션 관리"],"es":["session-begin","detección de sesiones duplicadas","verificación de contexto","comprobación de fecha","evitación de sesiones en paralelo","desarrollo de sesiones","skill de sesión"],"fr":["session-begin","détection des sessions en double","vérification du contexte","vérification de date","évitement des sessions parallèles","développement de sessions","compétence de session"],"de":["session-begin","erkennung von duplikatsitzungen","überprüfung des kontexts","überprüfung des datums","vermeidung von parallelen sitzungen","entwicklung von sitzungen","fähigkeit zur sitzungsverwaltung"],"pt":["iniciar sessão","verificação de duplicatas","contexto da conversa","carimbo de data","unicidade da sessão","prevenção de sessões duplicadas"],"ru":["начало сессии","обнаружение дубликатов","контекст разговора","штамп даты","уникальность сессии","предотвращение дубликатов сессий"],"ar":["بدء الجلسة","الكشف عن التكرارات","سياق المحادثة","توقيع التاريخ","الفردية الجلسة","منع الجلسات المكررة"]}},"owner":"jasonmichaelbell78-creator","repo":"sonash-v0","repoPath":"jasonmichaelbell78-creator/sonash-v0","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"session-begin","description":"Complete verification steps before starting any work session","bodyPreview":"# Session Begin Checklist\n\n**⚠️ IMPORTANT - Duplicate Detection:**\n\nBefore proceeding with the full checklist, check if this session was already\nstarted:\n\n1. **Read the current conversation context** - Have I already completed this\n   checklist in the current conversation?\n2. **Check SESSION_CONTEXT.md timestamp** - Was \"Last Updated\" modified today?\n   - **Note**: Field stores date only (YYYY-MM-DD), not time. Sub-day duplicate\n     detection relies on conversation context check (#1) and sessio","body":"# Session Begin Checklist\n\n**⚠️ IMPORTANT - Duplicate Detection:**\n\nBefore proceeding with the full checklist, check if this session was already\nstarted:\n\n1. **Read the current conversation context** - Have I already completed this\n   checklist in the current conversation?\n2. **Check SESSION_CONTEXT.md timestamp** - Was \"Last Updated\" modified today?\n   - **Note**: Field stores date only (YYYY-MM-DD), not time. Sub-day duplicate\n     detection relies on conversation context check (#1) and session counter\n     check (#3).\n3. **Check session counter** - Did I already increment the session counter\n   earlier in this conversation?\n\n**If ANY of these are true:**\n\n- ✅ Session is already active\n- ⚠️ DO NOT re-run the checklist\n- ⚠️ DO NOT re-increment the session counter\n- ⚠️ DO NOT re-run startup scripts\n- 💬 Example response: \"Session #35 already active (started earlier in this\n  conversation). Checklist completed earlier. What would you like to work on?\"\n\n**If ALL are false:**\n\n- ✅ This is a new session\n- ✅ Proceed with full checklist below\n\n---\n\nBefore starting any work, complete these verification steps:\n\n## 0. Secrets Decryption Check (REMOTE SESSIONS)\n\n**Check if MCP tokens need decrypting:**\n\n```bash\n# Check secrets status\nif [ -f \".env.local.encrypted\" ] && [ ! -f \".env.local\" ]; then\n  echo \"⚠️ Encrypted secrets found but not decrypted\"\nfi\n```\n\n**If secrets need decrypting:**\n\n1. **Ask the user for their passphrase** - Example: \"Your MCP tokens need\n   decrypting. What''s your passphrase?\"\n2. **Run the decrypt command** using stdin (avoids shell history exposure):\n   ```bash\n   echo \"<user_passphrase>\" | node scripts/secrets/decrypt-secrets.js --stdin\n   ```\n3. **Verify success** - Check that `.env.local` now exists with tokens\n4. **Never store or log the passphrase** - Only use it for the decrypt command\n\n**Security note:** Using `--stdin` with echo pipe is safer than env vars, which\ncan leak to shell history and process listings.\n\n**If secrets are already decrypted or no encrypted file exists:**\n\n- Skip this step and continue to Context Loading\n\n---\n\n## 0b. Cross-Session Validation (AUTOMATIC)\n\nHandled by SessionStart hook. **If you see a \"Cross-Session Warning\":** check\n`git status`, `git log --oneline -5`, and run `npm run hooks:health`. Update\nSESSION_CONTEXT.md if prior session missed /session-end.\n\n---\n\n## 0c. Episodic Memory Search (RECOMMENDED)\n\nSearch past conversations for relevant context using episodic memory. This helps\nrecover decisions, solutions, and patterns from previous sessions.\n\n**Use `mcp__plugin_episodic-memory_episodic-memory__search` with these\nqueries:**\n\n```javascript\n// Search for context on current work\nsearch({ query: [\"current branch/feature name\", \"decisions\"] });\n\n// Search for past errors if debugging\nsearch({ query: \"error message or pattern\" });\n\n// Search for established patterns\nsearch({ query: [\"component/module name\", \"patterns\"] });\n```\n\n**When to search:**\n\n| Situation             | Query Example                               |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| Starting feature work | `[\"feature-name\", \"decisions\", \"approach\"]` |\n| Debugging an error    | `\"TypeError: Cannot read property\"`         |\n| Code review prep      | `[\"module-name\", \"review\", \"patterns\"]`     |\n| Resuming paused work  | `[\"branch-name\", \"context\", \"next steps\"]`  |\n\n**Tips:**\n\n- Single string = semantic search (fuzzy, meaning-based)\n- Array of 2-5 terms = AND search (all terms must match)\n- Use `limit: 5` for focused results, `limit: 20` for broader search\n- Current conversation is NOT indexed yet (only previous sessions)\n\n**Summarize findings** for the user if relevant context is found.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Context Loading (MANDATORY)\n\n- [ ] Read [SESSION_CONTEXT.md](../../SESSION_CONTEXT.md) - Current status,\n      active blockers, next goals\n- [ ] Increment session counter in\n      [SESSION_CONTEXT.md](../../SESSION_CONTEXT.md)\n- [ ] Read [ROADMAP.md](../../ROADMAP.md) lines 1-100 (Active Sprint section\n      only — use offset/limit)\n\n## 1b. Session Gap Detection (AUTOMATIC - Session #138)\n\nAutomated via `npm run session:gaps` (run in Section 7). Compares\ncommit-log.jsonl against SESSION_CONTEXT.md.\n\n**If gaps are detected:** Run `npm run session:gaps:fix`, review suggestions,\nand add to SESSION_CONTEXT.md. See `scripts/check-session-gaps.js` for details.\n\n## 1c. Stale Documentation Check (MANDATORY)\n\n**Documentation often drifts from reality.** Before trusting any status in docs,\nverify against actual commits:\n\n```bash\n# Check recent commits to see actual work done\ngit log --oneline -30\n\n# Check commits since last documented session date\ngit log --oneline --since=\"YYYY-MM-DD\"\n```\n\n**Compare commits against documented status:**\n\n1. Look for PR/feature commits (e.g., \"feat:\", \"fix:\", \"refactor:\")\n2. Cross-reference with ROADMAP.md Active Sprint checkboxes\n3. If commits show work done but docs show incomplete → **UPDATE THE DOCS**\n\n**Common discrepancies to check:**\n\n- Sprint track items: Check commits against Active Sprint checkboxes in\n  ROADMAP.md\n- Session counter: Check AI_REVIEW_LEARNINGS_LOG.md version history for session\n  numbers\n- Test counts: Run `npm test` to verify actual vs documented\n\n**If docs are stale:**\n\n1. Update the stale document with correct status\n2. Note which sessions failed to update docs\n3. Commit the corrections before proceeding\n\n## 2. Consolidation Status Check\n\nFully automated by SessionStart hook (`run-consolidation.js --auto`). If it\nfailed (check SessionStart output), run:\n`node scripts/run-consolidation.js --apply`\n\n## 3. Documentation & Planning Awareness\n\n- [ ] Read [ROADMAP.md](../../ROADMAP.md) Active Sprint section (first ~100\n      lines — use offset/limit) for current work\n- [ ] Note: Archive files in `docs/archive/` are excluded from linting\n- [ ] Completed plans are archived to `docs/archive/completed-plans/`\n- [ ] Reference: INTEGRATED_IMPROVEMENT_PLAN.md is ✅ COMPLETE (archived\n      2026-01-14)\n\n## 4. Skill Selection (BEFORE starting work)\n\n```\nDECISION TREE:\n├─ New project/domain? → Use ''/find-skills'' to discover capabilities\n├─ Bug/Error? → Use ''systematic-debugging'' skill FIRST\n├─ Writing code? → Use ''code-reviewer'' agent AFTER completion\n├─ Security work? → Use ''security-auditor'' agent\n├─ UI/Frontend? → Use ''frontend-design'' skill\n├─ Complex task? → Check available skills with /skills\n└─ Multi-step task? → Use TodoWrite to track progress\n```\n\n## 5. Code Review Handling Procedures\n\nWhen receiving code review feedback (CodeRabbit, Qodo, etc.):\n\n1. **Analyze ALL suggestions** - Read through every comment multiple times\n2. **Create TodoWrite checklist** - Track each suggestion as a task\n3. **Address systematically** - Don''t skip items; mark as resolved or note why\n   skipped\n4. **Verify CI impact** - Check if changes affect workflows (ci.yml,\n   docs-lint.yml)\n5. **Test after changes** - Run `npm test` and `npm run lint` before committing\n\n## 6. Anti-Pattern Awareness\n\n**Before writing code**, scan claude.md Section 4 \"Critical Anti-Patterns\" and\nread [CODE_PATTERNS.md](../../docs/agent_docs/CODE_PATTERNS.md) lines 1-60\n(Quick Reference section only — use offset/limit). Key patterns:\n\n- **Read before edit** - Always read files before attempting to edit\n- **Regex performance** - Avoid greedy `.*` in patterns; use bounded\n  `[\\s\\S]{0,N}?`\n- **ESLint flat config** - Spread plugin configs, don''t use directly\n- **Path-based filtering** - Add pathFilter for directory-specific patterns\n- **Archive exclusions** - Historical docs should be excluded from strict\n  linting\n\n## 6b. Velocity & Task Dependencies (RECOMMENDED)\n\n**Show recent velocity and available tasks:**\n\n```bash\n# Show velocity summary (if data exists)\nnode scripts/velocity/generate-report.js 2>/dev/null || true\n\n# Show dependency-resolved available tasks\nnode scripts/tasks/resolve-dependencies.js 2>/dev/null || true\n```\n\nShare the output with the user at session start so they can see:\n\n- Recent velocity trend and sprint burn-down\n- Which tasks are unblocked and ready to work on\n\n## 7. Session Start Scripts (AUTO-RUN)\n\n**Execute these scripts automatically** when processing this command:\n\n```bash\n# Surface known anti-patterns (errors should be visible, not suppressed)\nnpm run patterns:check\n\n# Check if multi-AI review thresholds reached\nnpm run review:check\n\n# Surface past lessons relevant to current work\nnpm run lessons:surface\n\n# Check for undocumented sessions (Layer D - compaction gap detector)\nnpm run session:gaps\n\n# Check ROADMAP hygiene (unarchived completed items, sync issues)\nnpm run roadmap:hygiene\n\n# Check review JSONL sync and auto-repair drift (Session #166)\nnpm run reviews:sync -- --apply\n\n# Check review archive health (heading format, gaps, duplicates — Session #162)\nnpm run reviews:check-archive\n\n# Check if active reviews exceed threshold (>20) and suggest archival\n# If overdue, suggest: npm run reviews:archive -- --apply\nnpm run reviews:archive\n```\n\n**Important**: These scripts are **required**. If any script fails:\n\n1. Note the error in session summary\n2. Investigate if it''s a real issue vs missing script\n3. If script missing, note it as \"N/A\" in audit\n\n**Record results in session audit** - these must be marked as \"Ran\" or \"Failed\n(reason)\" in `/session-end` audit.\n\n## 8. Technical Debt Awareness (NEW - Session #98)\n\n**Check current technical debt status:**\n\n- [ ] Read [Technical Debt INDEX](../../docs/technical-debt/INDEX.md) for\n      prioritized tech debt\n- [ ] Note any S0/S1 items that should be addressed this session\n- [ ] Check if any items from previous session need updating\n\n**Key tracking documents:**\n\n| Document                       | Purpose                                    |\n| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `docs/technical-debt/INDEX.md` | Single source of truth for all tech debt   |\n| `AUDIT_TRACKER.md`             | Audit completion and threshold tracking    |\n| `ROADMAP.md` Track D           | Performance-critical items for this sprint |\n\n**After resolving tech debt items:**\n\n1. Mark item as resolved in `docs/technical-debt/MASTER_DEBT.jsonl`\n2. Update ROADMAP.md if item was in a sprint track\n3. Note in session summary\n\n## 9. Cross-Document Dependency Check\n\n**Before starting work**, verify cross-document consistency:\n\n```bash\n# Check cross-document dependencies\nnpm run crossdoc:check\n```\n\n**Key dependencies to verify:**\n\n- ROADMAP.md ↔ SESSION_CONTEXT.md (priorities match)\n- `MASTER_DEBT.jsonl` ↔ ROADMAP.md (tech debt section current)\n- Audit findings ↔ `MASTER_DEBT.jsonl` (new findings consolidated)\n\n**See:** [DOCUMENT_DEPENDENCIES.md](../../docs/DOCUMENT_DEPENDENCIES.md) for\nfull dependency matrix.\n\n## 10. Incident Documentation Reminder\n\n**After encountering any significant errors or issues:**\n\n- Document the issue in\n  [AI_REVIEW_LEARNINGS_LOG.md](../../docs/AI_REVIEW_LEARNINGS_LOG.md)\n- Use the standard \"Review #XX\" format\n- Include: cause, fix, pattern identified, prevention steps\n- This builds institutional knowledge for future sessions\n\n---\n\nReady to begin session. What would you like to work on?\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:15:01.873Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Memory Management Agents requiring robust session initialization and duplicate detection.","zh":"适用于需要强大的会话初始化和重复检测的内存管理代理。","ja":"メモリ管理エージェントが強力なセッション初期化と重複検出を必要とする場合に不可欠です。","ko":"강력한 세션 초기화 및 중복 감지를 요구하는 메모리 관리 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de gestión de memoria que requieren una inicialización de sesión robusta y detección de duplicados.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de gestion de mémoire nécessitant une initialisation de session robuste et une détection de doublons.","de":"Wesentlich für Memory-Management-Agents, die eine robuste Sitzungsinitialisierung und eine Duplikaterkennung erfordern.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Memória que exigem inicialização de sessão robusta e detecção de duplicatas.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов управления памятью, требующих прочной инициализации сеанса и обнаружения дубликатов.","ar":"ضروري لعمليات إدارة الذاكرة التي تتطلب تهيئة جلسة قوية وتحديد التكرارات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to implement duplicate session detection by checking conversation context and validating SESSION_CONTEXT.md timestamps. Prevents redundant initialization workflows through date-based (YYYY-MM-DD) tracking and sub-day conversation analysis.","zh":"使代理能够通过检查对话上下文和验证SESSION_CONTEXT.md时间戳来实现重复会话检测。通过基于日期（YYYY-MM-DD）的跟踪和子天对话分析防止冗余的初始化工作流。","ja":"エージェントが会話コンテキストを確認し、SESSION_CONTEXT.mdのタイムスタンプを検証することで重複セッションの検出を実装できるようにします。日付ベース（YYYY-MM-DD）の追跡と日の対話分析を通じて冗長な初期化ワークフローを防ぎます。","ko":"에이전트가 대화 맥락을 확인하고 SESSION_CONTEXT.md 타임스탬프를 검증하여 중복 세션 감지를 구현할 수 있도록 합니다. 날짜 기반(YYYY-MM-DD) 추적 및 일 대화 분석을 통해 불필요한 초기화 워크플로를 방지합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar la detección de sesiones duplicadas mediante la comprobación del contexto de conversación y la validación de las fechas de SESSION_CONTEXT.md. Evita los flujos de trabajo de inicialización redundantes a través de un seguimiento basado en fechas (YYYY-MM-DD) y un análisis de conversación subdiario.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre la détection de sessions en double en vérifiant le contexte de conversation et en validant les horodatages de SESSION_CONTEXT.md. Évite les flux de travail d''initialisation redondants grâce à un suivi basé sur les dates (YYYY-MM-DD) et à une analyse de conversation sous-journalière.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die Erkennung von Duplikatsitzungen durch Überprüfung des Konversationskontexts und Validierung der SESSION_CONTEXT.md-Timestamps umzusetzen. Verhindert redundante Initialisierungsworkflows durch eine datumsbasierte (YYYY-MM-DD) Nachverfolgung und eine subtagliche Konversationsanalyse.","pt":"Permite que os agentes implementem a detecção de sessões duplicadas verificando o contexto da conversa e validando os carimbos de data/hora do arquivo SESSION_CONTEXT.md. Evita fluxos de trabalho de inicialização redundantes por meio do rastreamento baseado em data (YYYY-MM-DD) e análise de conversa sub-diária.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать обнаружение дубликатов сеансов путем проверки контекста разговора и проверки меток времени файла SESSION_CONTEXT.md. Предотвращает избыточные рабочие процессы инициализации посредством отслеживания на основе даты (YYYY-MM-DD) и анализа поддневного разговора.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتنفيذ اكتشاف الجلسات المكررة من خلال التحقق من سياق المحادثة والتحقق من أوقات التوقيت في ملف SESSION_CONTEXT.md. يمنع سير عمل التهيئة الزائدة من خلال تتبع التاريخ (YYYY-MM-DD) وتحليل المحادثة الفرعية اليومية."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing new development sessions","Detecting duplicate session starts","Maintaining session state consistency","Validating timestamp-based workflows"],"zh":["初始化新的开发会话","检测重复会话开始","保持会话状态的一致性","验证基于时间戳的工作流"],"ja":["新しい開発セッションを初期化する","重複セッションの開始を検出する","セッション状態の一貫性を維持する","タイムスタンプベースのワークフローを検証する"],"ko":["새로운 개발 세션을 초기화하는 것","중복 세션 시작을 감지하는 것","세션 상태의 일관성을 유지하는 것","타임스탬프 기반 워크플로를 검증하는 것"],"es":["Inicialización de nuevas sesiones de desarrollo","Detección de inicios de sesión duplicados","Mantenimiento de la consistencia del estado de sesión","Validación de flujos de trabajo basados en fechas"],"fr":["Initialisation de nouvelles sessions de développement","Détection de débuts de session en double","Maintenance de la cohérence de l''état de session","Validation de flux de travail basés sur les dates"],"de":["Initialisierung neuer Entwicklungsitzungen","Erkennung von Duplikatsitzungsstarts","Aufrechterhaltung der Konsistenz des Sitzungszustands","Validierung von datumsbasierten Workflows"],"pt":["Inicializando novas sessões de desenvolvimento","Detectando inícios de sessão duplicados","Mantendo a consistência do estado da sessão","Validando fluxos de trabalho baseados em carimbos de data/hora"],"ru":["Инициализация новых сеансов разработки","Обнаружение дубликатов сеансов","Поддержание согласованности состояния сеанса","Проверка рабочих процессов на основе меток времени"],"ar":["تهيئة جلسات التطوير الجديدة","اكتشاف بداية الجلسات المكررة","الحفاظ على توافق حالة الجلسة","التحقق من سير عمل التوقيت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to SESSION_CONTEXT.md file","Limited to date-only timestamp validation","Relies on conversation context for sub-day detection"],"zh":["需要访问SESSION_CONTEXT.md文件","仅限于日期时间戳的验证","依赖于对话上下文进行子天检测"],"ja":["SESSION_CONTEXT.mdファイルへのアクセスが必要","日付のみのタイムスタンプの検証に限定される","子の検出には会話コンテキストに依存する"],"ko":["SESSION_CONTEXT.md 파일에 접근해야 함","일자만의 타임스탬프 검증에 제한됨","일자 내 감지에는 대화 맥락에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere acceso al archivo SESSION_CONTEXT.md","Limitado a la validación de fechas de solo fecha","Depende del contexto de conversación para la detección subdiaria"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au fichier SESSION_CONTEXT.md","Limité à la validation des dates de seule date","Dépend du contexte de conversation pour la détection sous-journalière"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die SESSION_CONTEXT.md-Datei","Begrenzt auf die Validierung von Datumstimestamps","Baut auf dem Konversationskontext für die subtagliche Erkennung auf"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao arquivo SESSION_CONTEXT.md","Limitado à validação de carimbo de data apenas","Depende do contexto da conversa para detecção sub-diária"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлу SESSION_CONTEXT.md","Ограниченная только проверкой метки даты","Полагается на контекст разговора для поддневного обнаружения"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملف SESSION_CONTEXT.md","محدود بالتحقق من وقت التاريخ فقط","يعتمد على سياق المحادثة لاكتشاف الفرعية اليومية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
