 a demonstration skill showing all possible subdirectories.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. Check `references/patterns.md` for detailed patterns\n2. Use `assets/component-template.tsx` as a starter\n3. Run `scripts/validate.sh` to check your code\n4. See `examples/good-example.tsx` for reference\n\n## Structure\n\n- `scripts/` - Executable automation scripts\n- `references/` - Detailed documentation\n- `assets/` - Templates and resources\n- `examples/` - Real code examples","body":"# Example Skill\n\nThis is a demonstration skill showing all possible subdirectories.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. Check `references/patterns.md` for detailed patterns\n2. Use `assets/component-template.tsx` as a starter\n3. Run `scripts/validate.sh` to check your code\n4. See `examples/good-example.tsx` for reference\n\n## Structure\n\n- `scripts/` - Executable automation scripts\n- `references/` - Detailed documentation\n- `assets/` - Templates and resources\n- `examples/` - Real code examples\n\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:14:50.125Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web3 Agents needing to integrate digital assets into custom gaming applications","zh":"非常适合需要将数字资产集成到自定义游戏应用程序的 Web3 代理","ja":"Web3 エージェントがデジタル資産をカスタムゲームアプリケーションに統合する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"웹3 에이전트가 디지털 자산을 사용자 지정 게임 애플리케이션에 통합해야 하는 경우 최적","es":"Perfecto para agentes Web3 que necesitan integrar activos digitales en aplicaciones de juegos personalizadas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Web3 qui doivent intégrer des actifs numériques dans des applications de jeux personnalisées","de":"Perfekt für Web3-Agents, die digitale Vermögenswerte in benutzerdefinierte Gaming-Anwendungen integrieren müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Web3 que precisam integrar ativos digitais em aplicações de jogos personalizadas","ru":"Идеально для агентов Web3, которым необходимо интегрировать цифровые активы в пользовательские игровые приложения","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء Web3 الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج الأصول الرقمية في تطبيقات الألعاب المخصصة"},"recommenda