","ar":"تطوير مكونات فيو المخصصة","en":"vue"},"description":{"zh":"Vue 组件开发技能提供高质量的 Vue 代码生成和审查功能，支持开发模式和审查模式","ja":"Vue コンポーネント開発スキルは、高品質の Vue コード生成と審査機能を提供し、開発モードと審査モードをサポートします","ko":"Vue 컴포넌트 개발 스킬은 고품질의 Vue 코드 생성 및審査 기능을 제공하며 개발 모드 및 審査 모드를 지원합니다","es":"El skill de Vue permite generar código personalizado para componentes y auditorías de código. Aprende a desarrollar componentes de alta calidad.","fr":"Le skill de Vue permet de générer du code personnalisé pour les composants et les audits de code. Découvrez comment développer des composants de haute qualité.","de":"Das Vue-Skill ermöglicht die Generierung von benutzerdefiniertem Code für Komponenten und Code-Audits. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie hochwertige Komponenten entwickeln.","pt":"O Vue é uma estrutura JavaScript para criar componentes personalizados e reutilizáveis. Com as regras de código personalizadas, você pode melhorar a qualidad...","ru":"Vue — это JavaScript-фреймворк для создания пользовательских и многократно используемых компонентов. С помощью индивидуальных правил кода вы можете улучшить ...","ar":"فيو هي إطار عمل جافا سكريبت لإنشاء مكونات مخصصة و قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام. باستخدام قواعد الكود المخصصة ، يمكنك تحسين جودة و كفاءة الكود الخاص بك.","en":"Customized claudecode rules"},"definition":{"en":"Customized claudecode rules"},"features":{"zh":["高质量的 Vue 代码生成","支持开发模式和审查模式","自定义 ClaudeCode 规则","TypeScript 类型定义支持","代码审查功能"],"ja":["高品質の Vue コード生成","開発モードと審査モードのサポート","カスタマイズされた ClaudeCode ルール","TypeScript 型定義のサポート","コード審査機能"],"ko":["고품질의 Vue 코드 생성","개발 모드 및 審査 모드 지원","사용자 지정 ClaudeCode 규칙","TypeScript 유형 정의 지원","코드 審査 기능"],"es":["Generación de código personalizado para componentes","Auditoría de código con reglas de claudecode","Desarrollo de componentes de alta calidad","Compatibilidad con TypeScript","Generación de código con decisiones basadas en árboles de decisión"],"fr":["Génération de code personnalisé pour les composants","Audit de code avec des règles de claudecode","Développement de composants de haute qualité","Compatibilité avec TypeScript","Génération de code avec des décisions basées sur des arbres de décision"],"de":["Generierung von benutzerdefiniertem Code für Komponenten","Code-Audit mit claudecode-Regeln","Entwicklung von hochwertigen Komponenten","Kompatibilität mit TypeScript","Generierung von Code mit Entscheidungen basierend auf Entscheidungsbäumen"],"pt":["Criação de componentes personalizados","Regras de código personalizadas","Melhoria da qualidade e eficiência do código","Compatibilidade com TypeScript","Análise de código em tempo real"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских компонентов","Индивидуальные правила кода","Улучшение качества и эффективности кода","Совместимость с TypeScript","Анализ кода в реальном времени"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات مخصصة","قواعد الكود المخصصة","تحسين جودة و كفاءة الكود","التوافق مع TypeScript","تحليل الكود في الوقت الفعلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vue 组件开发","高质量代码生成","ClaudeCode 规则","开发模式","审查模式","TypeScript 类型定义"],"ja":["Vue コンポーネント開発","高品質コード生成","ClaudeCode ルール","開発モード","審査モード","TypeScript 型定義"],"ko":["Vue 컴포넌트 개발","고품질 코드 생성","ClaudeCode 규칙","개발 모드","審査 모드","TypeScript 유형 정의"],"es":["vue","generación de código","claudecode","componentes personalizados","auditoría de código","TypeScript","desarrollo de componentes","code generation","vue components"],"fr":["vue","génération de code","claudecode","composants personnalisés","audit de code","TypeScript","développement de composants","code generation","vue components"],"de":["vue","codegenerierung","claudecode","benutzerdefinierte komponenten","code-audit","TypeScript","entwicklung von komponenten","code generation","vue-komponenten"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de componentes vue","regras de código personalizadas","typescript","análise de código","melhoria da qualidade","eficiência do código","componentes personalizados","reutilizáveis"],"ru":["создание компонентов vue","индивидуальные правила кода","typescript","анализ кода","улучшение качества","эффективность кода","пользовательские компоненты","многократно используемые"],"ar":["تطوير مكونات فيو","قواعد الكود المخصصة","typescript","تحليل الكود","تحسين الجودة","كفاءة الكود","مكونات مخصصة","قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام"]}},"owner":"TTT1231","repo":"claude-rules","repoPath":"TTT1231/claude-rules","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vue","description":"Vue 组件开发与代码审查技能 - 开发模式：描述需求时生成高质量 Vue 组件/Composable - 审查模式：/vue <path> 审查该路径下所有 Vue 文件","bodyPreview":"# Vue 组件开发技能\n\n## 功能说明\n\n### 开发模式\n\n当用户描述需求时，生成高质量的 Vue 代码：\n\n```\n创建一个用户列表组件\n封装 Element Plus 的 Table 组件\n写一个 useTable composable\n这个组件太大了，帮我拆分\n```\n\n**触发条件**：用户描述包含\"创建\"、\"生成\"、\"封装\"、\"编写\"、\"拆分\"等关键词\n\n### 审查模式\n\n当用户使用 `/vue <path>` 命令时，审查指定路径下的 Vue 文件：\n\n```\n/vue src/components\n/vue src/views/Dashboard.vue\n/vue                          # 审查当前目录\n```\n\n---\n\n## 模式分发\n\n### 1. 开发模式\n\n**执行流程**：\n\n1. **需求解析** — 理解用户想要实现的功能\n2. **类型判断** — 使用决策树确定组件类型\n3. **代码生成** — 按照规范生成代码\n4. **类型提示** — 确保完整的 TypeScript 类型定义\n\n### 2. 审查模式\n\n*","body":"# Vue 组件开发技能\n\n## 功能说明\n\n### 开发模式\n\n当用户描述需求时，生成高质量的 Vue 代码：\n\n```\n创建一个用户列表组件\n封装 Element Plus 的 Table 组件\n写一个 useTable composable\n这个组件太大了，帮我拆分\n```\n\n**触发条件**：用户描述包含\"创建\"、\"生成\"、\"封装\"、\"编写\"、\"拆分\"等关键词\n\n### 审查模式\n\n当用户使用 `/vue <path>` 命令时，审查指定路径下的 Vue 文件：\n\n```\n/vue src/components\n/vue src/views/Dashboard.vue\n/vue                          # 审查当前目录\n```\n\n---\n\n## 模式分发\n\n### 1. 开发模式\n\n**执行流程**：\n\n1. **需求解析** — 理解用户想要实现的功能\n2. **类型判断** — 使用决策树确定组件类型\n3. **代码生成** — 按照规范生成代码\n4. **类型提示** — 确保完整的 TypeScript 类型定义\n\n### 2. 审查模式\n\n**执行流程**：\n\n1. **文件扫描** — 使用 Glob 查找指定路径下的所有 `.vue` 和 composables 文件\n2. **展示检查清单** — 展示可检查项，等待用户确认：\n\n   ```\n   以下是可执行的检查项，请确认需要检查哪些（默认全选，回复排除项的编号即可）：\n\n   1. [x] 组件结构\n   2. [x] TypeScript 类型\n   3. [x] 组件封装\n   4. [x] Composable\n   5. [x] 性能\n   6. [x] 现代语法\n   7. [x] 代码规范\n   8. [x] 可访问性 (a11y)\n   9. [ ] 测试（默认不选，需明确指定）\n   ```\n\n3. **逐项检查** — 按照清单扫描代码，记录问题\n4. **输出诊断报告** — 按统一格式输出结果（见下方）\n\n---\n\n## 快速决策树\n\n```\n用户请求 → 判断类型\n\n是纯逻辑复用吗？\n  → YES: Composable (useXxx)\n  → NO: 继续\n\n是封装组件库组件吗？\n  → YES: 二次封装（保证类型透传）\n  → NO: 继续\n\n业务逻辑复杂 或 >1300 行？\n  → YES: 拆分为子组件 + Composable\n  → NO: 单文件组件\n```\n\n---\n\n## 审查输出格式\n\n```markdown\n## 📋 [文件名] 审查结果\n\n### ✅ 通过项\n\n- [x] 组件结构合理\n- [x] TypeScript 类型完整\n- [x] ...\n\n### ❌ 问题项\n\n- [ ] **[问题标题]**\n   - 位置：[文件:行号]\n   - 问题：[描述]\n   - 建议：[改进方案]\n\n### 📊 总评：X/10\n```\n\n---\n\n## 引用文件\n\n详细规则位于 `references/` 目录：\n\n- `references/component-types.md` — 组件分类、大组件拆分规则\n- `references/wrapper-pattern.md` — 二次封装完整指南\n- `references/composable-rules.md` — Composable 编写规则\n- `references/modern-features.md` — Vue 3.3+ / 3.5+ 新特性\n- `references/review-checklist.md` — 详细的审查清单\n- `references/project-setup.md` — Vue Web 项目配置（unplugin-vue-components 等）\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:15:22.757Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced Vue component development capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Vue组件开发能力的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが高度なVueコンポーネント開発機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 Vue 컴포넌트 개발 기능을 필요로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo de componentes Vue avanzados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités de développement de composants Vue avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die erweiterte Vue-Component-Entwicklungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento de componentes Vue.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы расширенные возможности разработки компонентов Vue.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتطوير مكونات Vue."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality Vue code using customized ClaudeCode rules, supporting Element Plus integration and TypeScript type definitions. It provides automated code generation and review for Vue components, including useTable composables and Table component encapsulation.","zh":"赋予代理生成高质量的Vue代码的能力，使用自定义的ClaudeCode规则，支持Element Plus集成和TypeScript类型定义。它提供了Vue组件的自动代码生成和审查，包括useTable组合和Table组件封装。","ja":"エージェントがカスタマイズされたClaudeCodeルールを使用して、高品質のVueコードを生成し、Element Plusの統合やTypeScriptの型定義をサポートすることを可能にします。Vueコンポーネントの自動コード生成とレビューを提供し、useTableの組み合わせやTableコンポーネントのカプセル化も含みます。","ko":"에이전트가 고유한 ClaudeCode 규칙을 사용하여 고품질의 Vue 코드를 생성하고, Element Plus 통합 및 TypeScript 타입 정의를 지원하는 것을 가능하게 합니다. Vue 컴포넌트의 자동 코드 생성 및 검토를 제공하며, useTable 컴포지블 및 Table 컴포넌트 캡슐화를 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar código Vue de alta calidad utilizando reglas personalizadas de ClaudeCode, que admiten la integración de Element Plus y definiciones de tipo de TypeScript. Proporciona generación y revisión de código automatizadas para componentes de Vue, incluyendo componentes componibles useTable y encapsulación del componente Table.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer du code Vue de haute qualité en utilisant des règles personnalisées de ClaudeCode, prenant en charge l''intégration d''Element Plus et les définitions de type TypeScript. Il fournit une génération et une révision de code automatisées pour les composants Vue, y compris les composables useTable et l''encapsulation du composant Table.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, hochwertigen Vue-Code unter Verwendung von benutzerdefinierten ClaudeCode-Regeln zu generieren, die die Integration von Element Plus und TypeScript-Typdefinitionen unterstützen. Bietet automatisierte Codegenerierung und -prüfung für Vue-Komponenten, einschließlich der useTable-Komponiblen und der Table-Komponenten-Kapselung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar código Vue de alta qualidade usando regras personalizadas do ClaudeCode, com suporte à integração do Element Plus e definições de tipo TypeScript. Ele fornece geração e revisão automatizadas de código para componentes Vue, incluindo composáveis useTable e encapsulamento de componentes de tabela.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать код Vue высокого качества с помощью настроенных правил ClaudeCode, поддерживающих интеграцию с Element Plus и определения типов TypeScript. Он обеспечивает автоматическую генерацию и проверку кода для компонентов Vue, включая составные компоненты useTable и инкапсуляцию компонентов таблицы.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توليد код Vue عالي الجودة باستخدام قواعد مخصصة من ClaudeCode ، مع دعم تكامل Element Plus وتعريفات نوع TypeScript. يوفر توليدًا وتحققًا автомatikًا للكود لمكونات Vue ، بما في ذلك المكونات القابلة للتأليف useTable و封装 مكونات الجدول."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Vue component development for user lists","Generating encapsulated Element Plus Table components","Reviewing and optimizing existing Vue codebases"],"zh":["自动化用户列表的Vue组件开发","生成封装的Element Plus表格组件","审查和优化现有的Vue代码库"],"ja":["ユーザーリストのVueコンポーネント開発の自動化","カプセル化されたElement Plusテーブルコンポーネントの生成","既存のVueコードベースのレビューと最適化"],"ko":["사용자 목록의 Vue 컴포넌트 개발 자동화","캡슐화된 Element Plus 테이블 컴포넌트 생성","기존 Vue 코드베이스의 검토 및 최적화"],"es":["Automatización del desarrollo de componentes de Vue para listas de usuarios","Generación de componentes de tabla de Element Plus encapsulados","Revisión y optimización de código existente de Vue"],"fr":["Automatisation du développement de composants Vue pour les listes d''utilisateurs","Génération de composants de tableau Element Plus encapsulés","Révision et optimisation des bases de code Vue existantes"],"de":["Automatisierung der Entwicklung von Vue-Komponenten für Benutzerlisten","Generierung von in Element Plus eingekapselten Tabellenkomponenten","Überprüfung und Optimierung bestehender Vue-Codebasen"],"pt":["Automatizar o desenvolvimento de componentes Vue para listas de usuários","Gerar componentes de tabela do Element Plus encapsulados","Revisar e otimizar bases de código Vue existentes"],"ru":["Автоматизация разработки компонентов Vue для списков пользователей","Генерация инкапсулированных компонентов таблицы Element Plus","Проверка и оптимизация существующих баз кода Vue"],"ar":["أتمتة تطوير مكونات Vue لقوائم المستخدمين","توليد مكونات الجدول المضمنة من Element Plus","مراجعة وتحسين قواعد الكود Vue الحالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ClaudeCode compatibility","Vue-specific functionality only"],"zh":["需要ClaudeCode兼容性","仅限Vue特定功能"],"ja":["ClaudeCodeの互換性が必要","Vue特有の機能のみ"],"ko":["ClaudeCode 호환성이 필요","Vue 전용 기능만"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con ClaudeCode","Funcionalidad específica de Vue solo"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec ClaudeCode","Fonctionnalité spécifique à Vue uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt ClaudeCode-Kompatibilität","Nur Vue-spezifische Funktionalität"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com o ClaudeCode","Funcionalidade específica do Vue apenas"],"ru":["Требуется совместимость с ClaudeCode","Только функциональность específica do Vue"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع ClaudeCode","وظائف محددة لVue فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('adaptationio/Skrillz/ralph-prompt-builder', 'community', 'adaptationio', 'Skrillz', 'adaptationio/Skrillz', 'ralph-prompt-builder', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z', '2026-02-18T03:15:17.026Z', NULL, '{"id":"adaptationio/Skrillz/ralph-prompt-builder","name":"ralph-prompt-builder","description":{"zh":"Ralph 提示生成器是一种自动化循环技术的主技能，用于生成优化的提示。它分析您的任务描述并路由到适当的专用生成器。","ja":"Ralph プロンプトビルダーは、自動化ループ技術のマスタースキルであり、最適化されたプロンプトを生成します。タスクの説明を分析して、適切な専用生成器にルーティングします。","ko":"Ralph 프롬프트 빌더는 자동화 루프 기술의 마스터 스킬로, 최적화된 프롬프트를 생성합니다. 태스크 설명을 분석하여 적절한 전문 생성기에 라우팅합니다.","es":"El constructor de prompts Ralph es una habilidad maestra para generar prompts optimizados para la técnica de bucle autónomo Ralph Wiggum","fr":"Le générateur de prompts Ralph est une compétence maître pour générer des prompts optimisés pour la technique de boucle autonome Ralph Wiggum","de":"Der Ralph-Prompt-Builder ist eine Master-Fähigkeit für die Generierung von optimierten Prompts für die autonome Schleifentechnik Ralph Wiggum","pt":"O Ralph Prompt Builder é uma ferramenta de Master Orchestrator que gera prompts otimizados para a técnica de loop autônomo Ralph Wiggum","ru":"Ralph Prompt Builder - это инструмент Master Orchestrator, который генерирует оптимизированные промпты для техники автономного цикла Ральфа Виггума","ar":"رالف برومبت بيلدر هو أداة ماستر أوركسترатор التي تتولى إنشاء برومبتات محسنة لتقنية الحلق الذاتي رالف ويغوم","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Ralph 提示生成器 - 自动化循环技术","ja":"Ralph プロンプトビルダー - 自動化ループ技術","ko":"Ralph 프롬프트 빌더 - 자동화 루프 기술","es":"Constructor de Prompts Ralph","fr":"Générateur de Prompts Ralph","de":"Ralph-Prompt-Builder","pt":"Ralph Prompt Builder: Otimização de Prompts para Desenvol...","ru":"Ralph Prompt Builder: Оптимизация Промптов для Разработчиков","ar":"رالف برومبت بيلدر: تحسين البرومبتات للdevelopers","en":"ralph-prompt-builder"},"description":{"zh":"Ralph 提示生成器是一种自动化循环技术的主技能，用于生成优化的提示。它分析您的任务描述并路由到适当的专用生成器。","ja":"Ralph プロンプトビルダーは、自動化ループ技術のマスタースキルであり、最適化されたプロンプトを生成します。タスクの説明を分析して、適切な専用生成器にルーティングします。","ko":"Ralph 프롬프트 빌더는 자동화 루프 기술의 마스터 스킬로, 최적화된 프롬프트를 생성합니다. 태스크 설명을 분석하여 적절한 전문 생성기에 라우팅합니다.","es":"El constructor de prompts Ralph es una habilidad maestra para generar prompts optimizados para la técnica de bucle autónomo Ralph Wiggum","fr":"Le générateur de prompts Ralph est une compétence maître pour générer des prompts optimisés pour la technique de boucle autonome Ralph Wiggum","de":"Der Ralph-Prompt-Builder ist eine Master-Fähigkeit für die Generierung von optimierten Prompts für die autonome Schleifentechnik Ralph Wiggum","pt":"O Ralph Prompt Builder é uma ferramenta de Master Orchestrator que gera prompts otimizados para a técnica de loop autônomo Ralph Wiggum","ru":"Ralph Prompt Builder - это инструмент Master Orchestrator, который генерирует оптимизированные промпты для техники автономного цикла Ральфа Виггума","ar":"رالف برومبت بيلدر هو أداة ماستر أوركسترатор التي تتولى إنشاء برومبتات محسنة لتقنية الحلق الذاتي رالف ويغوم","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持单一任务和多个相关任务","自动路由到适当的专用生成器","优化任务描述以提高生产力","支持 Ralph Wiggum 自动化循环技术","易于使用和集成"],"ja":["単一タスクと複数の関連タスクをサポート","適切な専用生成器に自動でルーティング","タスクの説明を最適化して生産性を向上","Ralph Wiggum 自動化ループ技術をサポート","使用しやすく統合が簡単"],"ko":["단일 태스크와 여러 관련 태스크를 지원","적절한 전문 생성기에 자동으로 라우팅","태스크 설명을 최적화하여 생산성을 향상","Ralph Wiggum 자동화 루프 기술을 지원","사용하기 쉽고 통합이 간단"],"es":["Análisis de descripciones de tareas","Enrutamiento a generadores especializados","Optimización para técnicas de bucle autónomo","Compatibilidad con tareas simples y múltiples","Generación de prompts personalizados"],"fr":["Analyse des descriptions de tâches","Acheminement aux générateurs spécialisés","Optimisation pour les techniques de boucle autonome","Compatibilité avec les tâches simples et multiples","Génération de prompts personnalisés"],"de":["Analyse von Aufgabenbeschreibungen","Weiterleitung an spezialisierte Generatoren","Optimierung für autonome Schleifentechniken","Kompatibilität mit einfachen und mehrfachen Aufgaben","Generierung von personalisierten Prompts"],"pt":["Geração de prompts otimizados","Análise de descrição de tarefas","Encaminhamento para geradores especializados","Suporte a tarefas únicas e múltiplas","Otimização para a técnica de loop autônomo Ralph Wiggum"],"ru":["Генерация оптимизированных промптов","Анализ описания задач","Направление в специализированные генераторы","Поддержка единичных и множественных задач","Оптимизация для техники автономного цикла Ральфа Виггума"],"ar":["إنشاء برومبتات محسنة","تحليل وصف المهام","توجيه إلى مولدات متخصصة","دعم المهام الفردية والمножية","تحسين لتقنية الحلق الذاتي رالف ويغوم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Ralph 提示生成器","自动化循环技术","任务描述优化","生产力提高","Ralph Wiggum","专用生成器","单一任务","多个相关任务"],"ja":["Ralph プロンプトビルダー","自動化ループ技術","タスクの説明最適化","生産性向上","Ralph Wiggum","専用生成器","単一タスク","複数の関連タスク"],"ko":["Ralph 프롬프트 빌더","자동화 루프 기술","태스크 설명 최적화","생산성 향상","Ralph Wiggum","전문 생성기","단일 태스크","여러 관련 태스크"],"es":["constructor de prompts","técnicas de bucle autónomo","Ralph Wiggum","generador de prompts","optimización de tareas","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["générateur de prompts","techniques de boucle autonome","Ralph Wiggum","constructeur de prompts","optimisation de tâches","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Prompt-Builder","autonome Schleifentechniken","Ralph Wiggum","Generator für Prompts","Optimierung von Aufgaben","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Ingenieurwesen"],"pt":["Ralph Prompt Builder","Otimização de prompts","Desenvolvimento de software","Técnica de loop autônomo","Geração de prompts","Análise de descrição de tarefas"],"ru":["Ralph Prompt Builder","Оптимизация промптов","Разработка программного обеспечения","Техника автономного цикла","Генерация промптов","Анализ описания задач"],"ar":["رالف برومبت بيلدر","تحسين البرومبتات","تطوير البرمجيات","تقنية الحلق الذاتي","إنشاء البرومبتات","تحليل وصف المهام"]}},"owner":"adaptationio","repo":"Skrillz","repoPath":"adaptationio/Skrillz","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ralph-prompt-builder","description":"Master orchestrator for generating Ralph Wiggum-compatible prompts. Analyzes task requirements and routes to appropriate generator (single-task, multi-task, project, or research). Use when you need to create any Ralph loop prompt and want automatic selection of the right generator.","bodyPreview":"# Ralph Prompt Builder (Master Orchestrator)\n\n## Overview\n\nMaster skill for generating prompts optimized for the Ralph Wiggum autonomous loop technique. This orchestrator analyzes your task description and routes to the appropriate specialized generator:\n\n| Task Type | Generator | Best For |\n|-----------|-----------|----------|\n| Single focused task | `ralph-prompt-single-task` | Bug fixes, single features, refactoring |\n| Multiple related tasks | `ralph-prompt-multi-task` | CRUD, multi-step fea","body":"# Ralph Prompt Builder (Master Orchestrator)\n\n## Overview\n\nMaster skill for generating prompts optimized for the Ralph Wiggum autonomous loop technique. This orchestrator analyzes your task description and routes to the appropriate specialized generator:\n\n| Task Type | Generator | Best For |\n|-----------|-----------|----------|\n| Single focused task | `ralph-prompt-single-task` | Bug fixes, single features, refactoring |\n| Multiple related tasks | `ralph-prompt-multi-task` | CRUD, multi-step features, migrations |\n| Complete project | `ralph-prompt-project` | Greenfield apps, libraries, tools |\n| Research/Analysis | `ralph-prompt-research` | Audits, planning, investigations |\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Generate any Ralph prompt:**\n```\nUse ralph-prompt-builder to create a prompt for: [describe your task]\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```\nUse ralph-prompt-builder to create a prompt for: Implementing user authentication with JWT for our Express API\n```\n\nThe skill will:\n1. Classify your task\n2. Route to the appropriate generator\n3. Guide you through required inputs\n4. Output a ready-to-use Ralph prompt\n\n## Task Classification\n\n### How Tasks Are Classified\n\n| Indicators | Classification | Generator |\n|------------|----------------|-----------|\n| Fix, repair, single change, one module | Single Task | `ralph-prompt-single-task` |\n| Multiple features, CRUD, several endpoints | Multi-Task | `ralph-prompt-multi-task` |\n| Build from scratch, new app, create tool | Project | `ralph-prompt-project` |\n| Analyze, audit, compare, plan, investigate | Research | `ralph-prompt-research` |\n\n### Classification Questions\n\nTo classify your task, consider:\n\n1. **Is this creating something new from scratch or modifying existing code?**\n   - New from scratch → Project or Multi-Task\n   - Modifying existing → Single Task or Multi-Task\n\n2. **How many distinct deliverables?**\n   - One deliverable → Single Task\n   - 2-5 related deliverables → Multi-Task\n   - Complete application/tool → Project\n   - Analysis document → Research\n\n3. **Does it involve investigation before action?**\n   - Yes, research required → Research\n   - No, implementation focus → Single/Multi/Project\n\n4. **What''s the completion criteria?**\n   - Tests pass → Single Task\n   - Multiple features working → Multi-Task\n   - Complete app running → Project\n   - Document produced → Research\n\n## Classification Examples\n\n### Single Task Examples\n- \"Fix the race condition in token refresh\"\n- \"Add pagination to the users endpoint\"\n- \"Refactor database queries to use async/await\"\n- \"Write tests for the auth module\"\n- \"Optimize the image upload function\"\n\n### Multi-Task Examples\n- \"Implement CRUD for Products resource\"\n- \"Add login, signup, logout, and password reset\"\n- \"Set up CI/CD pipeline with lint, test, build, deploy\"\n- \"Add validation, error handling, and logging to API\"\n- \"Create user, profile, and settings endpoints\"\n\n### Project Examples\n- \"Build a REST API for a todo list application\"\n- \"Create a CLI tool for database migrations\"\n- \"Build a URL shortener service\"\n- \"Create a markdown documentation generator\"\n- \"Build an authentication microservice\"\n\n### Research Examples\n- \"Analyze the codebase for security vulnerabilities\"\n- \"Compare React vs Vue vs Svelte for our needs\"\n- \"Create a migration plan from MongoDB to PostgreSQL\"\n- \"Audit dependencies for outdated packages\"\n- \"Document the current API architecture\"\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Describe Your Task\n\nProvide a description including:\n- What needs to be done\n- What technology/context\n- Any specific requirements\n- Desired outcome\n\n**Template:**\n```\nTask: [What you want to accomplish]\nContext: [Relevant background - tech stack, existing code, etc.]\nRequirements: [Specific requirements or constraints]\nOutcome: [What success looks like]\n```\n\n### Step 2: Review Classification\n\nThe orchestrator will classify your task and explain why:\n\n```\nCLASSIFICATION: [Task Type]\nREASONING: [Why this classification]\nGENERATOR: ralph-prompt-[type]\n\nDoes this classification look correct? If not, specify your preferred type.\n```\n\n### Step 3: Provide Generator Inputs\n\nEach generator requires specific inputs:\n\n**Single Task:**\n- Task description\n- Success criteria (how to verify)\n- Completion promise text\n\n**Multi-Task:**\n- List of tasks\n- Dependencies between tasks\n- Final completion promise\n\n**Project:**\n- Project description\n- Tech stack\n- Feature list\n- Completion promise\n\n**Research:**\n- Research objective\n- Scope (in/out)\n- Deliverable format\n- Completion promise\n\n### Step 4: Generate & Review\n\nThe appropriate generator creates the prompt. Review and customize:\n\n1. Verify requirements are complete\n2. Check verification commands are correct\n3. Confirm completion criteria match your needs\n4. Adjust max-iterations recommendation\n\n### Step 5: Execute with Ralph\n\n```bash\n/ralph-wiggum:ralph-loop \"[generated prompt]\" --completion-promise \"[YOUR_PROMISE]\" --max-iterations [recommended]\n```\n\n## Generator Summaries\n\n### ralph-prompt-single-task\n\n**Purpose:** Focused tasks with clear success criteria\n\n**Structure:**\n1. Task title and objective\n2. Context\n3. Requirements\n4. Success criteria (checkboxes)\n5. Verification steps with commands\n6. TDD approach\n7. Completion conditions\n8. If stuck guidance\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Include actual test commands\n- Make criteria binary (pass/fail)\n- Include TDD loop\n\n**Recommended iterations:** 15-35\n\n---\n\n### ralph-prompt-multi-task\n\n**Purpose:** Multiple related tasks organized in phases\n\n**Structure:**\n1. Task inventory table\n2. Phase breakdown (Foundation → Core → Enhancement → Validation)\n3. Per-phase tasks with deliverables\n4. Phase checkpoints\n5. Progress tracking\n6. Final verification\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Group tasks into logical phases\n- Clear dependencies\n- Document checkpoints\n\n**Recommended iterations:** 35-100\n\n---\n\n### ralph-prompt-project\n\n**Purpose:** Complete projects from scratch\n\n**Structure:**\n1. Project vision and specs\n2. Six phases:\n   - Phase 0: Setup\n   - Phase 1: Architecture\n   - Phase 2: Core\n   - Phase 3: Features\n   - Phase 4: Testing\n   - Phase 5: Documentation\n3. Per-phase tasks and deliverables\n4. Final verification\n5. Progress tracking\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Define non-goals explicitly\n- Complete all phases in order\n- Don''t skip testing/documentation\n\n**Recommended iterations:** 60-200\n\n---\n\n### ralph-prompt-research\n\n**Purpose:** Analysis, audits, planning, investigations\n\n**Structure:**\n1. Research objective and scope\n2. Five phases:\n   - Phase 1: Discovery\n   - Phase 2: Analysis\n   - Phase 3: Synthesis\n   - Phase 4: Recommendations\n   - Phase 5: Documentation\n3. Deliverables at each phase\n4. Evidence-based conclusions\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Define scope boundaries clearly\n- Create artifacts as you go\n- Support conclusions with evidence\n\n**Recommended iterations:** 30-100\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Choosing a Completion Promise\n\n**Good promises are:**\n- Specific to the task\n- Verifiable (you can check if it''s true)\n- Action-oriented\n\n**Examples:**\n| Task Type | Good Promise | Why |\n|-----------|--------------|-----|\n| Bug fix | `AUTH_FIX_COMPLETE` | Specific to what was fixed |\n| CRUD | `PRODUCT_CRUD_DONE` | Names the resource |\n| Project | `TODO_API_V1_COMPLETE` | Identifies the project |\n| Research | `SECURITY_AUDIT_DELIVERED` | References deliverable |\n\n### The Ralph Philosophy\n\nThe Ralph Wiggum technique is built on a key insight: **failures are deterministic and fixable**.\n\n- **Deterministically bad**: When prompts fail, they fail in predictable ways\n- **Fixable through iteration**: Each failure provides data to improve\n- **Prompt tuning > tool changing**: Fix failures by improving the prompt, not switching approaches\n\nThis means: Don''t fear failures. They''re expected and correctable. The loop will iterate until success.\n\n### Setting Max Iterations\n\nBase recommendations by complexity:\n\n| Complexity | Single Task | Multi-Task | Project | Research |\n|------------|-------------|------------|---------|----------|\n| Simple | 15 | 35 | 60 | 30 |\n| Medium | 25 | 50 | 100 | 50 |\n| Complex | 35 | 70 | 150 | 80 |\n| Very Complex | - | 100 | 200 | 100 |\n\n**Adjust based on:**\n- Familiarity with codebase (-20%)\n- External dependencies (+30%)\n- Unclear requirements (+50%)\n- Comprehensive testing needed (+25%)\n\n### Splitting Large Tasks\n\nIf task feels too large, consider splitting:\n\n**Project → Multiple Projects:**\n```\nInstead of: \"Build complete e-commerce platform\"\nSplit into:\n1. Project: User authentication service\n2. Project: Product catalog API\n3. Project: Shopping cart service\n4. Project: Order processing service\n```\n\n**Multi-Task → Separate Multi-Tasks:**\n```\nInstead of: \"Build full admin dashboard\"\nSplit into:\n1. Multi-Task: User management (CRUD + roles)\n2. Multi-Task: Analytics dashboard\n3. Multi-Task: Settings panel\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Task Won''t Complete\n\n**Symptoms:** Hitting max iterations without completion\n\n**Causes and fixes:**\n1. **Scope too large** → Split into smaller tasks\n2. **Unclear criteria** → Make success criteria more specific\n3. **External dependencies** → Document or mock dependencies\n4. **Infinite tests** → Check for flaky tests\n\n### Wrong Generator Selected\n\n**Fix:** Specify the generator explicitly:\n```\nUse ralph-prompt-single-task (not multi-task) for: [task]\n```\n\n### Prompt Too Vague\n\n**Fix:** Ensure your input includes:\n- Specific files/modules affected\n- Actual test commands\n- Concrete success criteria\n- Technology context\n\n## Integration with Ralph Loop\n\nAfter generating a prompt:\n\n```bash\n# Copy the generated prompt to a file or use directly\n/ralph-wiggum:ralph-loop \"[YOUR_GENERATED_PROMPT]\" \\\n  --completion-promise \"YOUR_PROMISE\" \\\n  --max-iterations 50\n\n# Monitor progress\nhead -10 .claude/ralph-loop.local.md\n\n# Cancel if needed\n/ralph-wiggum:cancel-ralph\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### DO:\n- Start with the right generator for your task type\n- Provide complete context and requirements\n- Include specific verification commands\n- Set appropriate max-iterations for complexity\n- Review generated prompts before running\n\n### DON''T:\n- Use vague task descriptions\n- Skip the classification step\n- Ignore the \"If Stuck\" guidance in generated prompts\n- Set max-iterations too low (iterations are normal)\n- Expect first-try perfection—Ralph embraces iteration\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Task Type Decision Tree\n\n```\nIs this research/analysis/planning?\n├─ YES → ralph-prompt-research\n└─ NO → Is this building a complete app from scratch?\n         ├─ YES → ralph-prompt-project\n         └─ NO → Are there multiple related deliverables?\n                  ├─ YES → ralph-prompt-multi-task\n                  └─ NO → ralph-prompt-single-task\n```\n\n### Input Checklist\n\nBefore generating, have ready:\n- [ ] Clear task description\n- [ ] Technology context (language, framework)\n- [ ] Success criteria (how to verify done)\n- [ ] Completion promise text\n- [ ] Any specific requirements\n\n### Output Checklist\n\nBefore running the prompt:\n- [ ] All requirements captured\n- [ ] Verification commands are correct\n- [ ] Success criteria are binary (pass/fail)\n- [ ] TDD/iteration approach included\n- [ ] \"If Stuck\" guidance provided\n- [ ] Max iterations set appropriately\n\n---\n\n**Specialized Generators:**\n- `ralph-prompt-single-task` - Single focused implementations\n- `ralph-prompt-multi-task` - Multiple related tasks\n- `ralph-prompt-project` - Complete projects\n- `ralph-prompt-research` - Analysis and planning\n\n**Ralph Loop Commands:**\n- `/ralph-wiggum:ralph-loop` - Start a loop\n- `/ralph-wiggum:cancel-ralph` - Cancel active loop\n- `/ralph-wiggum:help` - Get help\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:15:17.026Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous Loop Agents needing optimized prompt generation for the Ralph Wiggum technique.","zh":"非常适合需要针对 Ralph Wiggum 技术优化提示生成的Autonomous Loop Agent。","ja":"Ralph Wiggum 技術向けのプロンプト生成を最適化する必要があるAutonomous Loop Agent に最適です。","ko":"Ralph Wiggum 기술을 위한 최적화된 프롬프트 생성이 필요한 자율 루프 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Bucle Autónomo que necesitan generación de solicitudes de prompts optimizados para la técnica de Ralph Wiggum.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Boucle Autonome ayant besoin d''une génération de solicitation de prompts optimisés pour la technique Ralph Wiggum.","de":"Perfekt für autarke Loop-Agents, die optimierte Prompt-Generierung für die Ralph-Wiggum-Technik benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Loop Autônomo que necessitam de geração de prompts otimizados para a técnica Ralph Wiggum.","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов цикла, которым необходима оптимизированная генерация подсказок для техники Ральфа Уиггума.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الدورة الذاتي الذي يحتاج إلى توليد مساعدات محسّنة لتقنية رالف ويغوم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate prompts optimized for single focused tasks and multiple related tasks using specialized generators like `ralph-prompt-single-task` and `ralph-prompt-multi-task`, supporting task types such as bug fixes, single features, refactoring, CRUD, and multi-step features.","zh":"赋予代理生成针对单一集中任务和多个相关任务的优化提示，使用诸如 `ralph-prompt-single-task` 和 `ralph-prompt-multi-task` 的专用生成器，支持诸如 bug 修复、单一功能、重构、CRUD 和多步骤功能等任务类型。","ja":"エージェントに、単一の集中タスクと複数の関連タスク向けのプロンプトを最適化して生成する能力を付与し、`ralph-prompt-single-task` と `ralph-prompt-multi-task` などの専用ジェネレーターを使用し、バグ修正、単一機能、リファクタリング、CRUD、及びマルチステップ機能などのタスクタイプをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 단일 집중 작업과 여러 관련 작업을 위한 최적화된 프롬프트를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, `ralph-prompt-single-task` 및 `ralph-prompt-multi-task`와 같은 전문 제네레이터를 사용하여 버그 수정, 단일 기능, 리팩토링, CRUD 및 다단계 기능 등의 작업 유형을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar solicitudes de prompts optimizadas para tareas individuales enfocadas y múltiples tareas relacionadas utilizando generadores especializados como `ralph-prompt-single-task` y `ralph-prompt-multi-task`, que admiten tipos de tareas como correcciones de errores, características individuales, refactorización, CRUD y características de varios pasos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des solicitation de prompts optimisés pour des tâches individuelles ciblées et des tâches multiples liées en utilisant des générateurs spécialisés tels que `ralph-prompt-single-task` et `ralph-prompt-multi-task`, prenant en charge des types de tâches tels que la correction de bogue, les fonctionnalités uniques, la refactorisation, CRUD et les fonctionnalités multi-étapes.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, optimierte Prompt-Anfragen für einzelne fokussierte Aufgaben und mehrere verwandte Aufgaben zu generieren, indem sie spezialisierte Generatoren wie `ralph-prompt-single-task` und `ralph-prompt-multi-task` verwenden, die Aufgabentypen wie Fehlernachbesserungen, einzelne Funktionen, Refactoring, CRUD und Funktionen mit mehreren Schritten unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar prompts otimizados para tarefas únicas e focadas e múltiplas tarefas relacionadas, utilizando geradores especializados como `ralph-prompt-single-task` e `ralph-prompt-multi-task`, com suporte a tipos de tarefas como correções de bugs, recursos únicos, refatoração, CRUD e recursos de múltiplos passos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать подсказки, оптимизированные для единичных и сосредоточенных задач, а также для нескольких связанных задач, используя такие специализированные генераторы, как `ralph-prompt-single-task` и `ralph-prompt-multi-task`, поддерживающие типы задач, как исправление ошибок, единичные функции, рефакторинг, CRUD и многоступенчатые функции.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من توليد مساعدات محسّنة للمهام المنفردة والمُركّزة والمهام المتعدّدة المترابطة، باستخدام مولّدات محددة مثل `ralph-prompt-single-task` و `ralph-prompt-multi-task`، مع دعم أنواع المهام مثل إصلاح العيوب والخصائص المنفردة وإعادة هيكلة والعمليات CRUD والخصائص متعدّدة الخطوات."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating prompts for bug fixes and single feature implementations","Creating prompts for multi-step features and CRUD operations","Optimizing task descriptions for the Ralph Wiggum autonomous loop technique"],"zh":["为 bug 修复和单一功能实现生成提示","为多步骤功能和 CRUD 操作创建提示","为 Ralph Wiggum 自主循环技术优化任务描述"],"ja":["バグ修正と単一機能実装のプロンプトを生成する","マルチステップ機能とCRUD操作のプロンプトを作成する","Ralph Wiggum 自動ループ技術向けのタスク記述を最適化する"],"ko":["버그 수정 및 단일 기능 구현을 위한 프롬프트 생성","다단계 기능 및 CRUD 작업을 위한 프롬프트 생성","Ralph Wiggum 자율 루프 기술을 위한 작업 설명 최적화"],"es":["Generar solicitudes de prompts para correcciones de errores y implementaciones de características individuales","Crear solicitudes de prompts para características de varios pasos y operaciones CRUD","Optimizar las descripciones de tareas para la técnica de bucle autónomo de Ralph Wiggum"],"fr":["Générer des solicitation de prompts pour la correction de bogue et la mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités uniques","Créer des solicitation de prompts pour des fonctionnalités multi-étapes et des opérations CRUD","Optimiser les descriptions de tâches pour la technique de boucle autonome de Ralph Wiggum"],"de":["Generieren von Prompt-Anfragen für Fehlernachbesserungen und Einzelfunktionsimplementierungen","Erstellen von Prompt-Anfragen für Funktionen mit mehreren Schritten und CRUD-Operationen","Optimieren der Aufgabenbeschreibungen für die autarke Loop-Technik von Ralph Wiggum"],"pt":["Gerar prompts para correções de bugs e implementações de recursos únicos","Criar prompts para recursos de múltiplos passos e operações CRUD","Otimizar descrições de tarefas para a técnica de loop autônomo Ralph Wiggum"],"ru":["Генерировать подсказки для исправления ошибок и реализации единичных функций","Создавать подсказки для многоступенчатых функций и операций CRUD","Оптимизировать описания задач для автономной циклической техники Ральфа Уиггума"],"ar":["توليد مساعدات لتصحيح العيوب وتطبيق الخصائص المنفردة","إنشاء مساعدات للخصائص متعدّدة الخطوات والعمليات CRUD","تحسين وصف المهام لتقنية الدورة الذاتية رالف ويغوم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires task description input","Limited to generating prompts for the Ralph Wiggum technique"],"zh":["需要任务描述输入","仅限于为 Ralph Wiggum 技术生成提示"],"ja":["タスク記述入力を必要とする","Ralph Wiggum 技術向けのプロンプト生成のみ"],"ko":["작업 설명 입력이 필요","Ralph Wiggum 기술을 위한 프롬프트 생성만"],"es":["Requiere entrada de descripción de tarea","Limitado a generar solicitudes de prompts para la técnica de Ralph Wiggum"],"fr":["Nécessite une entrée de description de tâche","Limité à la génération de solicitation de prompts pour la technique Ralph Wiggum"],"de":["Benötigt Aufgabenbeschreibungseingabe","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von Prompt-Anfragen für die Ralph-Wiggum-Technik"],"pt":["Requer entrada de descrição de tarefa","Limitado a gerar prompts para a técnica Ralph Wiggum"],"ru":["Требует ввода описания задачи","Ограничен генерацией подсказок только для техники Ральфа Уиггума"],"ar":["يتطلب إدخال وصف المهمة","محدود بتوليد المساعدات لتقنية رالف ويغوم فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
