jour de spécifications"],"de":["Konvertierung von PRD-Markdown-Dateien in prd.json-Format","Verwaltung der autonomen Entwicklung","Validierung von prd.json-Dateien","Zurücksetzen von Fortschritt","Analyse von Projekten und Aktualisierung von Spezifikationen"],"pt":["Conversão de arquivos PRD Markdown em prd.json","Gerenciamento de desenvolvimento autônomo","Comandos para validar e resetar projetos","Análise de projetos e atualização de especificações","Suporte a comandos personalizados"],"ru":["Конвертация файлов PRD Markdown в prd.json","Управление автономным развитием","Команды для проверки и сброса проектов","Анализ проектов и обновление спецификаций","Поддержка пользовательских команд"],"ar":["تحويل ملفات PRD Markdown إلى prd.json","إدارة التطوير المستقل","أوامر للتحقق ومسح المشاريع","تحليل المشاريع وتحديث المواصفات","دعم الأوامر المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["RALPH 技能","PRD 转换","PRD 管理","开发效率","自动化开发","项目管理","代码生成","技术开发"],"ja":["RALPH スキル","PRD 変換","PRD 管理","開発効率","自動化開発","プロジェクト管理","コード生成","技術開発"],"ko":["RALPH 기술","PRD 변환","PRD 관리","개발 효율성","자율 개발","프로젝트 관리","코드 생성","기술 개발"],"es":["conversión de PRD","administración de PRD","desarrollo autónomo","validación de prd.json","restablecimiento de progreso","análisis de proyectos","especificaciones de proyecto"],"fr":["conversion de PRD","gestion de PRD","développement autonome","validation de prd.json","réinitialisation de progrès","analyse de projets","spécifications de projet"],"de":["Konvertierung von PRD","Verwaltung von PRD","autonome Entwicklung","Validierung von prd.json","Zurücksetzen von Fortschritt","Analyse von Projekten","Projektspezifikationen"],"pt":["RALPH","Conversão de PRD","Gerenciamento de PRD","Desenvolvimento autônomo","PRD Markdown","prd.json","Comandos personalizados"],"ru":["RALPH","Конвертация PRD","Управление PRD","Автономное развитие","PRD Markdown","prd.json","Пользовательские команды"],"ar":["RALPH","تحويل PRD","إدارة PRD","التطوير المستقل","PRD Markdown","prd.json","أوامر مخصصة"]}},"owner":"doravidan","repo":"supreme-ralph","repoPath":"doravidan/supreme-ralph","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ralph","description":"Run RALPH autonomous development loop. Converts PRD markdown to prd.json and runs autonomous implementation.","bodyPreview":"# RALPH Skill - PRD Conversion & Management\n\nConvert PRD Markdown files to prd.json format and manage RALPH autonomous development.\n\n## Triggers\n\nThis skill activates when:\n- `/ralph` - Show status and help\n- `/ralph --status` - Show detailed PRD status\n- `/ralph --validate` - Validate prd.json\n- `/ralph --reset` - Reset progress.txt for fresh start\n- `/ralph --analyze` - Re-analyze project and update specs\n- `/ralph-convert <file>` - Convert PRD markdown to prd.json\n\n## Commands\n\n### `/ralph` -","body":"# RALPH Skill - PRD Conversion & Management\n\nConvert PRD Markdown files to prd.json format and manage RALPH autonomous development.\n\n## Triggers\n\nThis skill activates when:\n- `/ralph` - Show status and help\n- `/ralph --status` - Show detailed PRD status\n- `/ralph --validate` - Validate prd.json\n- `/ralph --reset` - Reset progress.txt for fresh start\n- `/ralph --analyze` - Re-analyze project and update specs\n- `/ralph-convert <file>` - Convert PRD markdown to prd.json\n\n## Commands\n\n### `/ralph` - Status & Help\n\nShow current PRD status and available commands:\n\n```bash\n# Check if prd.json exists\nif [ -f prd.json ]; then\n  echo \"=== RALPH Status ===\"\n  cat prd.json | jq ''{\n    project: .project,\n    branch: .branchName,\n    total: (.userStories | length),\n    complete: ([.userStories[] | select(.passes == true)] | length),\n    remaining: ([.userStories[] | select(.passes == false)] | length)\n  }''\n\n  echo \"\"\n  echo \"=== Stories ===\"\n  cat prd.json | jq -r ''.userStories[] | \"\\(.id): \\(.title) [\\(if .passes then \"✓\" else \"○\" end)]\"''\nelse\n  echo \"No prd.json found.\"\n  echo \"\"\n  echo \"Create one with:\"\n  echo \"  /prd [feature description]\"\nfi\n```\n\n### `/ralph --status` - Detailed Status\n\n```bash\necho \"=== PRD Status ===\"\ncat prd.json | jq ''.''\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Progress Log (last 50 lines) ===\"\ntail -50 progress.txt 2>/dev/null || echo \"No progress.txt found\"\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Git Status ===\"\ngit status --short\ngit log --oneline -5\n```\n\n### `/ralph --validate` - Validate PRD\n\nCheck prd.json for issues:\n\n```bash\n# Validation checks:\n# 1. JSON is valid\n# 2. Required fields exist\n# 3. All stories have acceptance criteria\n# 4. Stories have quality gate criteria\n# 5. Priorities are sequential\n# 6. Branch name follows convention\n```\n\n**Validation Rules:**\n- `project` - Required, non-empty string\n- `branchName` - Required, format: `ralph/[slug]`\n- `userStories` - Required, non-empty array\n- Each story must have:\n  - `id` - Format: `US-XXX`\n  - `title` - Non-empty string\n  - `acceptanceCriteria` - Array with at least 2 items\n  - `priority` - Number 1-10\n  - `passes` - Boolean\n\n**Output:**\n```\nValidating prd.json...\n\n✓ JSON is valid\n✓ Project name: [name]\n✓ Branch: ralph/[slug]\n✓ Stories: [N] total\n\nStory Validation:\n  US-001: [Title] ✓\n  US-002: [Title] ✓\n  ...\n\n⚠ Warnings:\n  - US-003: Missing \"Tests pass\" in acceptance criteria\n  - US-005: Large story (6+ criteria), consider splitting\n\n✓ PRD is valid and ready for RALPH\n```\n\n### `/ralph --reset` - Reset Progress\n\nReset progress.txt while preserving patterns:\n\n```bash\n# Archive current progress\nif [ -f progress.txt ]; then\n  mkdir -p archive/$(date +%Y-%m-%d)\n  cp progress.txt archive/$(date +%Y-%m-%d)/progress-backup.txt\nfi\n\n# Extract patterns section from current progress\nPATTERNS=$(sed -n ''/## Codebase Patterns/,/^---$/p'' progress.txt 2>/dev/null)\n\n# Get branch name from prd.json\nBRANCH=$(cat prd.json | jq -r ''.branchName'')\n\n# Create fresh progress.txt\ncat > progress.txt << EOF\n# Progress Log - $BRANCH\n\nReset: $(date +%Y-%m-%d)\n\n$PATTERNS\n\n---\n\nEOF\n\necho \"Progress reset. Previous progress archived.\"\n```\n\n### `/ralph --analyze` - Re-analyze Project\n\nRe-run project analysis and update specs:\n\n```bash\n# This triggers the project analyzer to refresh:\n# - PROJECT_SPEC.md\n# - scripts/ralph/CLAUDE.md context\n# - progress.txt patterns\n\nnode scripts/run-ralph.js --analyze\n```\n\n### `/ralph-convert <file>` - Convert PRD to JSON\n\nConvert a PRD markdown file to prd.json:\n\n```\nConverting: tasks/prd-[feature].md\n\nReading PRD...\nExtracting project info...\nParsing user stories...\nValidating structure...\n\nGenerated prd.json:\n- Project: [Feature Name]\n- Branch: ralph/[feature-slug]\n- Stories: [N] total\n\nInitializing progress.txt...\nDone!\n\nNext: ./scripts/ralph/ralph.sh 20\n```\n\n## PRD Conversion Process\n\n### Step 1: Read the PRD\n\n```bash\ncat tasks/prd-[feature-name].md\n```\n\n### Step 2: Extract Information\n\nParse the PRD to extract:\n- **Project name** - From `# PRD: [Name]` title\n- **Description** - From `## Overview` section\n- **Project Context** - From `## Project Context` if present\n- **User stories** with:\n  - ID (US-001, US-002, etc.)\n  - Title\n  - Description (As a... I want... So that...)\n  - Acceptance criteria (bullet points)\n  - Priority\n\n### Step 3: Generate prd.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"[Feature Name]\",\n  \"branchName\": \"ralph/[feature-slug]\",\n  \"description\": \"[Overview text]\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"[Today''s date]\",\n  \"projectContext\": {\n    \"name\": \"[Project name from PROJECT_SPEC.md]\",\n    \"language\": \"[typescript/python/go]\",\n    \"framework\": \"[react/express/fastapi]\",\n    \"hasTypes\": true,\n    \"testFramework\": \"[vitest/pytest]\"\n  },\n  \"existingPatterns\": {\n    \"moduleSystem\": \"[ES modules/CommonJS]\",\n    \"testFramework\": \"[vitest/jest/pytest]\",\n    \"linter\": \"[eslint/biome/ruff]\"\n  },\n  \"userStories\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-001\",\n      \"title\": \"[Story title]\",\n      \"description\": \"[Full story description]\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"[Criterion 1]\",\n        \"[Criterion 2]\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Step 4: Archive Previous PRD\n\nIf prd.json already exists:\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p archive/$(date +%Y-%m-%d)\ncp prd.json archive/$(date +%Y-%m-%d)/prd-backup.json\ncp progress.txt archive/$(date +%Y-%m-%d)/progress-backup.txt 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n### Step 5: Initialize Progress\n\nCreate fresh progress.txt:\n\n```markdown\n# Progress Log - ralph/[feature-slug]\n\nStarted: [Date]\nFeature: [Feature description]\n\n## Project Context\n[From PROJECT_SPEC.md if available]\n\n## Codebase Patterns\n[Patterns from analysis or PROJECT_SPEC.md]\n\n## Quality Commands\n```bash\n[typecheck command]\n[lint command]\n[test command]\n```\n\n---\n\n```\n\n## Story Conversion Rules\n\n### 1. Story Sizing\n\nIf a PRD story is too large, split it:\n- Data model → separate story\n- Backend logic → separate story\n- API endpoint → separate story\n- UI component → separate story\n- Tests → integrated into each story\n\n### 2. Priority Assignment\n\nAssign priorities based on dependencies:\n\n| Priority | Category | Examples |\n|----------|----------|----------|\n| 1 | Foundation | Schema, types, interfaces |\n| 2 | Core Logic | Services, business logic |\n| 3 | API/Backend | Routes, controllers, middleware |\n| 4 | UI Components | Forms, displays, interactions |\n| 5 | Polish | Optimization, edge cases, docs |\n\n### 3. Required Acceptance Criteria\n\nAlways ensure these criteria exist based on tech stack:\n\n**TypeScript/JavaScript:**\n- \"TypeScript compiles without errors\" or \"No type errors\"\n- \"ESLint/Biome passes\"\n- \"Tests pass\"\n\n**Python:**\n- \"Type hints complete\"\n- \"Ruff/Pylint passes\"\n- \"Pytest passes\"\n\n**Go:**\n- \"`go build` succeeds\"\n- \"`golangci-lint` passes\"\n- \"`go test ./...` passes\"\n\n**For specific story types:**\n- UI stories: \"Verify in browser\", \"Accessible\"\n- API stories: \"Response format correct\", \"Error handling complete\"\n- Auth stories: \"Security best practices followed\"\n\n### 4. Branch Naming\n\nConvert feature name to slug:\n- \"User Authentication\" → `ralph/user-authentication`\n- \"Dark Mode Toggle\" → `ralph/dark-mode-toggle`\n- Use lowercase, replace spaces with hyphens\n- Max 30 characters\n\n## Output Format\n\nAfter conversion:\n\n```\n=== PRD Converted ===\n\nProject: [Feature Name]\nBranch: ralph/[feature-slug]\nStories: [N] total\n\nStory Summary:\n  1. US-001: [Title] (Priority 1) - Foundation\n  2. US-002: [Title] (Priority 2) - Core logic\n  3. US-003: [Title] (Priority 3) - API\n  ...\n\nFiles Created/Updated:\n  - prd.json\n  - progress.txt\n\nNext Steps:\n  1. Review prd.json for accuracy\n  2. Create branch: git checkout -b ralph/[feature-slug]\n  3. Start RALPH: ./scripts/ralph/ralph.sh 20\n```\n\n## Example Conversion\n\n**Input** (`tasks/prd-user-auth.md`):\n```markdown\n# PRD: User Authentication\n\n## Overview\nAdd user authentication with email/password login.\n\n## User Stories\n\n### US-001: Create user model\n**As a** developer\n**I want** a User model with proper types\n**So that** I can store user data securely\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] User interface with id, email, passwordHash\n- [ ] Validation for email format\n- [ ] TypeScript compiles\n\n**Priority:** 1\n```\n\n**Output** (`prd.json`):\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"User Authentication\",\n  \"branchName\": \"ralph/user-auth\",\n  \"description\": \"Add user authentication with email/password login.\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-01-22\",\n  \"userStories\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-001\",\n      \"title\": \"Create user model\",\n      \"description\": \"As a developer, I want a User model with proper types so that I can store user data securely\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"User interface with id, email, passwordHash\",\n        \"Validation for email format\",\n        \"TypeScript compiles\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Integration with RALPH\n\nAfter prd.json is created:\n\n1. **Create feature branch:**\n   ```bash\n   git checkout -b ralph/[feature-slug]\n   ```\n\n2. **Start RALPH:**\n   ```bash\n   ./scripts/ralph/ralph.sh 20\n   ```\n\n3. **Monitor progress:**\n   ```bash\n   tail -f progress.txt\n   cat prd.json | jq ''.userStories[] | {id, title, passes}''\n   ```\n\n4. **When complete:**\n   ```bash\n   git log --oneline\n   # Review changes, create PR\n   ```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:15:37.315Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing PRD conversion and management capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要PRD转换和管理能力的开发代理。","ja":"PRD変換および管理機能を必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"PRD 변환 및 관리 기능을 필요로 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan capacidades de conversión y gestión de PRD.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de capacités de conversion et de gestion de PRD.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine PRD-Konvertierung und -verwaltungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de capacidades de conversão e gerenciamento de PRD.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы возможности преобразования и управления PRD.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات تحويل وإدارة PRD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert PRD Markdown files to prd.json format, validate prd.json, and manage RALPH autonomous development using commands like `/ralph --status` and `/ralph-convert <file>`.","zh":"赋予代理转换PRD Markdown文件为prd.json格式、验证prd.json以及使用命令（如 `/ralph --status` 和 `/ralph-convert <file>`）管理RALPH自动化开发的能力。","ja":"エージェントにPRD Markdownファイルをprd.json形式に変換したり、prd.jsonを検証したり、コマンド（例： `/ralph --status` および `/ralph-convert <file>`）を使用してRALPH自動開発を管理する機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 PRD Markdown 파일을 prd.json 형식으로 변환하고 prd.json을 검증하며 명령어(예: `/ralph --status` 및 `/ralph-convert <file>`)를 사용하여 RALPH 자동 개발을 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes convertir archivos Markdown de PRD al formato prd.json, validar prd.json y gestionar el desarrollo autónomo de RALPH mediante comandos como `/ralph --status` y `/ralph-convert <file>`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des fichiers Markdown PRD au format prd.json, de valider prd.json et de gérer le développement autonome de RALPH à l''aide de commandes telles que `/ralph --status` et `/ralph-convert <file>`.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, PRD-Markdown-Dateien in das prd.json-Format zu konvertieren, prd.json zu validieren und die autonome Entwicklung von RALPH mithilfe von Befehlen wie `/ralph --status` und `/ralph-convert <file>` zu verwalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter arquivos PRD Markdown para formato prd.json, validar prd.json e gerenciar o desenvolvimento autônomo RALPH usando comandos como `/ralph --status` e `/ralph-convert <file>`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью конвертировать файлы PRD Markdown в формат prd.json, проверять прд.json и управлять автономным развитием RALPH с помощью команд, таких как `/ralph --status` и `/ralph-convert <file>`.","ar":"يُمكّن العميل من تحويل ملفات PRD Markdown إلى تنسيق prd.json، التحقق من صحة prd.json، وإدارة التطوير المستقل لRALPH باستخدام أوامر مثل `/ralph --status` و `/ralph-convert <file>`."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting PRD Markdown files to prd.json format","Validating prd.json files for consistency","Resetting progress for fresh starts in RALPH projects"],"zh":["将PRD Markdown文件转换为prd.json格式","验证prd.json文件的一致性","重置RALPH项目的进度以进行新开始"],"ja":["PRD Markdownファイルをprd.json形式に変換する","prd.jsonファイルの整合性を検証する","RALPHプロジェクトの進度をリセットして新しい開始を行う"],"ko":["PRD Markdown 파일을 prd.json 형식으로 변환하는 것","prd.json 파일의 일관성을 검증하는 것","RALPH 프로젝트의 진행을 초기화하여 새로운 시작을 하는 것"],"es":["Conversión de archivos Markdown de PRD al formato prd.json","Validación de archivos prd.json para garantizar la coherencia","Restablecimiento del progreso para nuevos comienzos en proyectos de RALPH"],"fr":["Conversion de fichiers Markdown PRD au format prd.json","Validation de fichiers prd.json pour assurer la cohérence","Réinitialisation de la progression pour de nouveaux départs dans les projets RALPH"],"de":["Konvertierung von PRD-Markdown-Dateien in das prd.json-Format","Validierung von prd.json-Dateien für Konsistenz","Zurücksetzen des Fortschritts für neue Starts in RALPH-Projekten"],"pt":["Conversão de arquivos PRD Markdown para formato prd.json","Validação de arquivos prd.json para consistência","Reinicialização do progresso para novos começos em projetos RALPH"],"ru":["Преобразование файлов PRD Markdown в формат prd.json","Проверка файлов prd.json на согласованность","Сброс прогресса для новых начинаний в проектах RALPH"],"ar":["تحويل ملفات PRD Markdown إلى تنسيق prd.json","التحقق من صحة ملفات prd.json لاتساقها","إعادة تعيين التقدم للبدء الجديد في مشاريع RALPH"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PRD Markdown files as input","Limited to managing RALPH autonomous development"],"zh":["需要PRD Markdown文件作为输入","仅限于管理RALPH自动化开发"],"ja":["PRD Markdownファイルを入力として必要とする","RALPH自動開発の管理のみに限定される"],"ko":["PRD Markdown 파일을 입력으로 필요로 함","RALPH 자동 개발 관리에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere archivos Markdown de PRD como entrada","Limitado a la gestión del desarrollo autónomo de RALPH"],"fr":["Nécessite des fichiers Markdown PRD comme entrée","Limité à la gestion du développement autonome de RALPH"],"de":["Benötigt PRD-Markdown-Dateien als Eingabe","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung der autonomen Entwicklung von RALPH"],"pt":["Exige arquivos PRD Markdown como entrada","Limitado ao gerenciamento do desenvolvimento autônomo RALPH"],"ru":["Требует файлов PRD Markdown в качестве входных данных","Ограничен управлением автономным развитием RALPH"],"ar":["يتطلب ملفات PRD Markdown كمدخلات","محدود بإدارة التطوير المستقل لRALPH"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('deanmoses/tacocat-gallery-hosting-aws/commit', 'community', 'deanmoses', 'tacocat-gallery-hosting-aws', 'deanmoses/tacocat-gallery-hosting-aws', 'commit', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z', '2026-02-18T03:15:56.339Z', NULL, '{"id":"deanmoses/tacocat-gallery-hosting-aws/commit","name":"commit","description":{"zh":"Commit 消息采用 Conventional Commits 格式，规范代码提交的描述和格式","ja":"コミットメッセージは Conventional Commits 形式を使用し、コードの変更を明確に記述します","ko":"커밋 메시지는 Conventional Commits 형식을 사용하여 코드 제출의 내용과 형식을 표준화합니다","es":"El formato de Commit es una convención para escribir mensajes de confirmación claros y consistentes, mejorando la colaboración en equipo","fr":"Le format de commit est une convention pour écrire des messages de validation clairs et cohérents, améliorant la collaboration d''équipe","de":"Das Commit-Format ist eine Konvention für die Erstellung klarer und konsistenter Commit-Nachrichten, um die Teamzusammenarbeit zu verbessern","pt":"O padrão de mensagens Commit é uma convenção para formatar mensagens de commit de forma clara e consistente, ajudando a melhorar a colaboração e a organização do código.","ru":"Стандарт сообщений Коммит — это конвенция для форматирования сообщений коммита в четкой и последовательной форме, giúpая улучшить сотрудничество и организацию кода.","ar":"نمط رسائل الالتزام هو اتفاقية لتنسيق رسائل الالتزام بطريقة واضحة ومستمرة، مما يساعد على تحسين التعاون وتنظيم الكود","en":"Tacocat gallery static SPA website hosting"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Commit 消息格式指南","ja":"コミットメッセージの形式ガイド","ko":"커밋 메시지 형식 가이드","es":"Commit: Estandarización de mensajes de confirmación","fr":"Commit: Standardisation des messages de validation","de":"Commit: Standardisierung von Commit-Nachrichten","pt":"Commit: Padrão de Mensagens para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Коммит: Стандарт сообщений для разработчиков","ar":"التزام: نمط رسائل للمطورين","en":"commit"},"description":{"zh":"Commit 消息采用 Conventional Commits 格式，规范代码提交的描述和格式","ja":"コミットメッセージは Conventional Commits 形式を使用し、コードの変更を明確に記述します","ko":"커밋 메시지는 Conventional Commits 형식을 사용하여 코드 제출의 내용과 형식을 표준화합니다","es":"El formato de Commit es una convención para escribir mensajes de confirmación claros y consistentes, mejorando la colaboración en equipo","fr":"Le format de commit est une convention pour écrire des messages de validation clairs et cohérents, améliorant la collaboration d''équipe","de":"Das Commit-Format ist eine Konvention für die Erstellung klarer und konsistenter Commit-Nachrichten, um die Teamzusammenarbeit zu verbessern","pt":"O padrão de mensagens Commit é uma convenção para formatar mensagens de commit de forma clara e consistente, ajudando a melhorar a colaboração e a organizaçã...","ru":"Стандарт сообщений Коммит — это конвенция для форматирования сообщений коммита в четкой и последовательной форме, giúpая улучшить сотрудничество и организаци...","ar":"نمط رسائل الالتزام هو اتفاقية لتنسيق رسائل الالتزام بطريقة واضحة ومستمرة، مما يساعد على تحسين التعاون وتنظيم الكود","en":"Tacocat gallery static SPA website hosting"},"definition":{"en":"Tacocat gallery static SPA website hosting"},"features":{"zh":["采用 Conventional Commits 格式","支持 feat、fix、docs、style、refactor、test、chore 类型","可选的正文描述","提高代码提交的可读性和质量"],"ja":["Conventional Commits 形式を使用","feat、fix、docs、style、refactor、test、chore タイプをサポート","オプションの本文の説明","コードの品質と可読性を向上させる"],"ko":["Conventional Commits 형식을 사용","feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore 유형을 지원","선택적인 본문 설명","코드 제출의 품질과 가독성을 향상"],"es":["Estructura de mensaje de confirmación estándar","Tipos de commit: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test y chore","Cuerpo opcional para describir cambios detallados","Mejora la colaboración en equipo con mensajes claros","Compatibilidad con Conventional Commits"],"fr":["Structure de message de validation standard","Types de commit : feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test et chore","Corps optionnel pour décrire les modifications détaillées","Amélioration de la collaboration d''équipe avec des messages clairs","Compatibilité avec Conventional Commits"],"de":["Standardmäßige Commit-Nachrichtenstruktur","Commit-Typen: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test und chore","Optional kann ein Nachrichtentext hinzugefügt werden, um detaillierte Änderungen zu beschreiben","Verbesserung der Teamzusammenarbeit durch klare Nachrichten","Kompatibilität mit Conventional Commits"],"pt":["Formato de mensagens de commit padrão","Tipos de commits: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test e chore","Melhoria da colaboração e organização do código","Compatibilidade com Conventional Commits","Ajuda na criação de histórico de commit claro e consistente"],"ru":["Стандартный формат сообщений коммита","Типы коммитов: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test и chore","Улучшение сотрудничества и организации кода","Совместимость с Conventional Commits","Помощь в создании четкой и последовательной истории коммитов"],"ar":["تنسيق رسائل الالتزام القياسي","أنواع الالتزامات: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test و chore","تحسين التعاون وتنظيم الكود","التوافق مع الالتزامات التقليدية","مساعدة في إنشاء تاريخ الالتزام الواضح والمتسق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Commit 消息","Conventional Commits","代码提交","可读性","代码质量","feat","fix","docs"],"ja":["コミットメッセージ","Conventional Commits","コードの変更","可読性","コードの品質","feat","fix","docs"],"ko":["커밋 메시지","Conventional Commits","코드 제출","가독성","코드 품질","feat","fix","docs"],"es":["commit","mensaje de confirmación","formato de commit","colaboración en equipo","Conventional Commits","desarrollo de software","gestión de código"],"fr":["commit","message de validation","format de commit","collaboration d''équipe","Conventional Commits","développement de logiciels","gestion de code"],"de":["commit","Commit-Nachricht","Commit-Format","Teamzusammenarbeit","Conventional Commits","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Verwaltung"],"pt":["commit","mensagens de commit","conventional commits","formato de commit","tipos de commits","colaboração","organização do código","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["коммит","сообщения коммита","конвенциональные коммиты","формат коммита","типы коммитов","сотрудничество","организация кода","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["التزام","رسائل الالتزام","التزامات تقليدية","تنسيق الالتزام","أنواع الالتزامات","التعاون","تنظيم الكود","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"deanmoses","repo":"tacocat-gallery-hosting-aws","repoPath":"deanmoses/tacocat-gallery-hosting-aws","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commit","description":"Generates commit messages and creates commits. Use when writing commit messages, committing changes, or reviewing staged changes.","bodyPreview":"# Commit Messages\n\nUse [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) format.\n\n## Format\n\n```text\n<type>(<scope>): <description>\n\n[optional body]\n```\n\n## Types\n\n- `feat`: User-facing features or behavior changes (must change production code)\n- `fix`: Bug fixes (must change production code)\n- `docs`: Documentation only\n- `style`: Code style/formatting (no logic changes)\n- `refactor`: Code restructuring without behavior change\n- `test`: Adding or updating tests\n- `chore`: CI/CD, tool","body":"# Commit Messages\n\nUse [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) format.\n\n## Format\n\n```text\n<type>(<scope>): <description>\n\n[optional body]\n```\n\n## Types\n\n- `feat`: User-facing features or behavior changes (must change production code)\n- `fix`: Bug fixes (must change production code)\n- `docs`: Documentation only\n- `style`: Code style/formatting (no logic changes)\n- `refactor`: Code restructuring without behavior change\n- `test`: Adding or updating tests\n- `chore`: CI/CD, tooling, dependency bumps, configs (no production code)\n\n## Scopes\n\nOptional. Use when it adds clarity. Examples: `cloudfront`, `s3`, `ci`.\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\nUse `!` suffix: `feat!: remove deprecated resource`\n\n## Examples\n\n```text\nfeat(cloudfront): add immutable cache headers\nfix: correct CloudFront Function ARN attribute\nchore: add husky pre-commit hooks\ndocs: update architecture documentation\n```\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Run `git diff --staged` to see staged changes\n2. Analyze the changes and determine the appropriate type\n3. Write a concise description (under 72 characters)\n4. Add body only if the \"why\" isn''t obvious from the description\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:15:56.339Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Management Agents needing standardized commit message formatting.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化提交消息格式的代码管理代理。","ja":"コード管理エージェントが標準化されたコミットメッセージの形式を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"표준화된 커밋 메시지 형식을 필요로 하는 코드 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de código que necesitan un formato de mensaje de confirmación estandarizado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de code nécessitant un format de message de validation standardisé.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Management-Agents, die ein standardisiertes Commit-Nachrichten-Format benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Código que necessitam de formatação de mensagens de commit padronizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления кодом, требующих стандартизированного форматирования сообщений о коммитах.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة الشيفرة التي تحتاج إلى تنسيق رسائل الالتزام المعيارية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce Conventional Commits format, utilizing specific types such as ''feat'', ''fix'', and ''docs'' to streamline version control and collaboration through clear commit descriptions and optional bodies.","zh":"赋予代理人强制执行约定提交格式的能力，利用诸如 ''feat''、''fix'' 和 ''docs'' 之类的特定类型，以清晰的提交描述和可选正文简化版本控制和协作。","ja":"エージェントに、''feat''、''fix''、''docs'' などの特定のタイプを使用して、バージョン管理とコラボレーションを明確なコミットの説明とオプションのボディで簡素化する、従慣的コミット形式を強制する機能を付与します。","ko":"에이전트에게 ''feat'', ''fix'', ''docs''와 같은 특정 유형을 사용하여 버전 관리와 협력을 명확한 커밋 설명과 선택적 본문으로 간소화하는, 전통적인 커밋 형식을 강제하는 기능을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a hacer cumplir el formato de Commits Convencionales, utilizando tipos específicos como ''feat'', ''fix'' y ''docs'' para simplificar el control de versiones y la colaboración a través de descripciones de confirmación claras y cuerpos opcionales.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer le format de Commits Conventionnels, en utilisant des types spécifiques tels que ''feat'', ''fix'' et ''docs'' pour rationaliser le contrôle de version et la collaboration grâce à des descriptions de validation claires et des corps facultatifs.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, das Format von Conventional Commits durchzusetzen, wobei spezifische Typen wie ''feat'', ''fix'' und ''docs'' verwendet werden, um die Versionskontrolle und Zusammenarbeit durch klare Commit-Beschreibungen und optionale Textkörper zu rationalisieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor o formato Conventional Commits, utilizando tipos específicos como ''feat'', ''fix'' e ''docs'' para otimizar o controle de versão e a colaboração por meio de descrições de commit claras e corpos opcionais.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить соблюдение формата Conventional Commits, используя конкретные типы, такие как ''feat'', ''fix'' и ''docs'', для оптимизации контроля версий и сотрудничества посредством ясных описаний коммитов и необязательных тел.","ar":"تمكّن العوامل من فرض تنسيق الالتزامات التقليدية، باستخدام أنواع محددة مثل ''feat'' و ''fix'' و ''docs'' لتحسين مراقبة الإصدار والتعاون من خلال وصفات الالتزام الواضحة والأجسام الإختيارية."},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing commit messages","Automating changelog generation","Enforcing coding standards"],"zh":["标准化提交消息","自动化变更日志生成","强制编码标准"],"ja":["コミットメッセージの標準化","変更ログの自動生成","コーディング規約の強制"],"ko":["提交 메시지 표준화","변경 기록 자동 생성","코딩 표준 강제"],"es":["Estandarizar mensajes de confirmación","Automatizar la generación de registros de cambios","Hacer cumplir los estándares de codificación"],"fr":["Standardiser les messages de validation","Automatiser la génération de journaux de modifications","Faire respecter les normes de codage"],"de":["Standardisieren von Commit-Nachrichten","Automatisieren der Erstellung von Änderungsprotokollen","Durchsetzen von Codierungsstandards"],"pt":["Padronização de mensagens de commit","Geração automática de changelog","Impaginação de padrões de codificação"],"ru":["Стандартизация сообщений о коммитах","Автоматическая генерация changelog","Обеспечение соблюдения стандартов кодирования"],"ar":["مواءمة رسائل الالتزام","توليد سجل التغييرات تلقائيًا","فرض معايير الترميز"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to Conventional Commits specification","Limited to text-based commit messages"],"zh":["需要遵守约定提交规范","仅限文本基于提交消息"],"ja":["従慣的コミット仕様への準拠が必要","テキストベースのコミットメッセージのみ"],"ko":["전통적인 커밋 사양을 준수해야 함","텍스트 기반 커밋 메시지만"],"es":["Requiere adherirse a la especificación de Commits Convencionales","Limitado a mensajes de confirmación basados en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite de se conformer à la spécification de Commits Conventionnels","Limité aux messages de validation basés sur du texte"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung der Spezifikation von Conventional Commits","Begrenzt auf textbasierte Commit-Nachrichten"],"pt":["Exige aderência à especificação Conventional Commits","Limitado a mensagens de commit baseadas em texto"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения спецификации Conventional Commits","Ограничен сообщениями о коммитах на основе текста"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بمواصفات الالتزامات التقليدية","محدود بالرسائل النصية لعمليات الالتزام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
