g für benutzerdefinierte Skripte"],"pt":["Automatização de testes de navegador","Uso de Webdriver para interagir com browsers","Suporte a múltiplos navegadores","Execução de testes de forma rápida e eficiente","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Автоматизация тестирования браузера","Использование Webdriver для взаимодействия с браузерами","Поддержка нескольких браузеров","Выполнение тестов быстро и эффективно","Интеграция с инструментами разработки"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار المتصفح","استخدام Webdriver للتفاعل مع المتصفحات","دعم متصفحات متعددة","تشغيل الاختبارات بسرعة وكفاءة","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Selenium 测试","浏览器自动化","视觉测试","自动化测试","WebDriver","截图功能"],"ja":["Selenium テスティング","ブラウザの自動化","視覚テスト","自動化テスト","WebDriver","スクリーンショット機能"],"ko":["Selenium 테스팅","브라우저 자동화","시각적 테스트","자동화 테스트","WebDriver","스크린샷 기능"],"es":["pruebas de selenium","automatización de navegador","testing de software","desarrollo de software","herramientas de testing","selenium webdriver"],"fr":["tests selenium","automatisation de navigateur","testing de logiciel","développement de logiciel","outils de testing","selenium webdriver"],"de":["selenium tests","browser automatisierung","software testing","software entwickeln","testing tools","selenium webdriver"],"pt":["selenium","testes de navegador","automatização de testes","webdriver","desenvolvimento de software","testes de software","qualidade de software"],"ru":["selenium","тестирование браузера","автоматизация тестирования","webdriver","разработка программного обеспечения","тестирование программного обеспечения","качество программного обеспечения"],"ar":["سي伦يوم","اختبارات المتصفح","أتمتة الاختبارات","webdriver","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات البرمجيات","جودة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"paunchygent","repo":"skriptoteket","repoPath":"paunchygent/skriptoteket","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"selenium-testing","description":"Browser automation with Selenium WebDriver for Python. (project)","bodyPreview":"# Selenium Testing\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Browser automation, visual testing\n- Mentions: \"selenium\", \"webdriver\", \"screenshot\"\n\n## Canonical Repo Rules\n\nFor Skriptoteket-specific login/env conventions, follow:\n\n- `.agent/rules/075-browser-automation.md`\n\n## Run\n\n```bash\npdm run python -m scripts.<module>\n```\n\n## Quick Pattern\n\n```python\nimport os\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom selenium import webdriver\nfrom selenium.webdriver.common.by import By\nfrom selenium.webdriver.support.ui import WebDriverWai","body":"# Selenium Testing\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Browser automation, visual testing\n- Mentions: \"selenium\", \"webdriver\", \"screenshot\"\n\n## Canonical Repo Rules\n\nFor Skriptoteket-specific login/env conventions, follow:\n\n- `.agent/rules/075-browser-automation.md`\n\n## Run\n\n```bash\npdm run python -m scripts.<module>\n```\n\n## Quick Pattern\n\n```python\nimport os\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom selenium import webdriver\nfrom selenium.webdriver.common.by import By\nfrom selenium.webdriver.support.ui import WebDriverWait\nfrom selenium.webdriver.support import expected_conditions as EC\n\n\ndef _read_dotenv(path: Path) -> dict[str, str]:\n    if not path.exists():\n        return {}\n\n    values: dict[str, str] = {}\n    for line in path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\").splitlines():\n        stripped = line.strip()\n        if not stripped or stripped.startswith(\"#\") or \"=\" not in stripped:\n            continue\n        key, value = stripped.split(\"=\", 1)\n        values[key.strip()] = value.strip()\n    return values\n\n\ndotenv = _read_dotenv(Path(os.environ.get(\"DOTENV_PATH\", \".env\")))\n\n\ndef _get_config_value(*, key: str, default: str | None = None) -> str | None:\n    return os.environ.get(key) or dotenv.get(key) or default\n\n\nbase_url = _get_config_value(key=\"BASE_URL\", default=\"http://127.0.0.1:8000\") or \"http://127.0.0.1:8000\"\nemail = _get_config_value(key=\"PLAYWRIGHT_EMAIL\") or _get_config_value(key=\"BOOTSTRAP_SUPERUSER_EMAIL\")\npassword = _get_config_value(key=\"PLAYWRIGHT_PASSWORD\") or _get_config_value(\n    key=\"BOOTSTRAP_SUPERUSER_PASSWORD\"\n)\n\nif not email or not password:\n    raise SystemExit(\n        \"Missing credentials. Either set PLAYWRIGHT_EMAIL/PLAYWRIGHT_PASSWORD (recommended for prod) \"\n        \"or BOOTSTRAP_SUPERUSER_EMAIL/BOOTSTRAP_SUPERUSER_PASSWORD (dev). \"\n        \"Provide them in DOTENV_PATH (default: .env) or export them in your shell.\"\n    )\n\noptions = webdriver.ChromeOptions()\noptions.add_argument(\"--headless=new\")\ndriver = webdriver.Chrome(options=options)\ndriver.set_window_size(1440, 900)\n\n# Login\ndriver.get(f\"{base_url}/login\")\ndriver.find_element(By.NAME, \"email\").send_keys(email)\ndriver.find_element(By.NAME, \"password\").send_keys(password)\ndriver.find_element(By.CSS_SELECTOR, \"button[type=''submit'']\").click()\nWebDriverWait(driver, 10).until(EC.presence_of_element_located((By.XPATH, \"//*[contains(., ''Inloggad som'')]\")))\n\n# Screenshot\nPath(\".artifacts\").mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\ndriver.get(f\"{base_url}/admin/tools\")\ndriver.save_screenshot(\".artifacts/selenium-admin-tools.png\")\ndriver.quit()\n```\n\n## HTMX Caveat\n\nUse explicit `WebDriverWait` with `EC.url_contains()` instead of implicit waits.\n\n## Context7\n\nUse `mcp__context7__get-library-docs` with `/seleniumhq/selenium` for API details.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:16:05.794Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing advanced browser interaction and visual testing capabilities with Selenium and WebDriver.","zh":"适用于需要高级浏览器交互和视觉测试能力的自动化代理，支持Selenium和WebDriver。","ja":"自動化エージェントが高度なブラウザーの相互作用と視覚テスト機能を必要とする場合に適しています。SeleniumとWebDriverをサポートしています。","ko":"고급 브라우저 상호 작용 및 시각적 테스트 기능이 필요한 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다. Selenium 및 WebDriver를 지원합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización que necesitan interacción avanzada con el navegador y capacidades de pruebas visuales con Selenium y WebDriver.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation ayant besoin d''une interaction avancée avec le navigateur et de capacités de tests visuels avec Selenium et WebDriver.","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die erweiterte Browser-Interaktion und visuelle Testfunktionen mit Selenium und WebDriver benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que precisam de interação avançada do navegador e capacidades de teste visual com Selenium e WebDriver.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, которым необходима продвинутая интеракция с браузером и функции визуального тестирования с помощью Selenium и WebDriver.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين الذين يحتاجون إلى تفاعل متقدم مع المتصفح وقدرات اختبار بصرية مع سيلينيوم وويب درايفر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate browser interactions using Selenium, capture screenshots, and perform visual testing with WebDriver, leveraging Python scripts and the WebDriverWai library for enhanced UI testing.","zh":"赋予代理自动化浏览器交互的能力，使用Selenium捕获屏幕截图，并使用WebDriver进行视觉测试，利用Python脚本和WebDriverWai库增强UI测试。","ja":"エージェントにブラウザーの相互作用を自動化する能力を与え、Seleniumを使用してスクリーンショットをキャプチャし、WebDriverを使用して視覚テストを実行します。PythonスクリプトとWebDriverWaiライブラリを使用してUIテストを強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 브라우저 상호 작용을 자동화 할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, Selenium을 사용하여 스크린샷을 캡처하고 WebDriver를 사용하여 시각적 테스트를 수행하며, Python 스크립트와 WebDriverWai 라이브러리를 사용하여 UI 테스트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las interacciones del navegador utilizando Selenium, capturar pantallas y realizar pruebas visuales con WebDriver, aprovechando scripts de Python y la biblioteca WebDriverWai para pruebas de UI mejoradas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les interactions du navigateur en utilisant Selenium, de capturer des écrans et de réaliser des tests visuels avec WebDriver, en exploitant des scripts Python et la bibliothèque WebDriverWai pour des tests d''interface utilisateur améliorés.","de":"Ermächtigt Ag