трументы Разработки","ar":"استكشاف OpenSpec: أدوات تطوير متقدمة","en":"openspec-explore"},"description":{"zh":"OpenSpec Explore允许您深入探索和可视化代码库，思考和设计新功能","ja":"OpenSpec Exploreはコードベースを深く探索し、可視化し、新しい機能を設計することを可能にします","ko":"OpenSpec Explore는 코드베이스를 심도 있게 탐색하고 시각화하여 새로운 기능을 설계하는 것을 가능하게 합니다","es":"OpenSpec Explore es un modo de exploración que te permite investigar y visualizar código de manera libre, ideal para planificar y diseñar proyectos","fr":"OpenSpec Explore est un mode d''exploration qui vous permet d''investiguer et de visualiser du code de manière libre, idéal pour planifier et concevoir des pro...","de":"OpenSpec Explore ist ein Explorationsmodus, der es Ihnen ermöglicht, Code frei zu untersuchen und zu visualisieren, ideal zum Planen und Entwerfen von Projekten","pt":"O OpenSpec Explore é um conjunto de ferramentas de desenvolvimento avançadas que permitem explorar e visualizar código de forma eficaz.","ru":"OpenSpec Explore - это набор продвинутых инструментов разработки, которые позволяют исследовать и визуализировать код эффективно.","ar":"OpenSpec Explore هو مجموعة من أدوات التطوير المتقدمة التي تمكنك من استكشاف وترى الرمز بفعالية.","en":"Lightdash tools (HTTP client, CLI, MCP and more)"},"definition":{"en":"Lightdash tools (HTTP client, CLI, MCP and more)"},"features":{"zh":["探索模式","代码库可视化","设计新功能","创建OpenSpec文档","搜索代码","阅读文件"],"ja":["探索モード","コードベースの可視化","新しい機能の設計","OpenSpecドキュメントの作成","コードの検索","ファイルの読み取り"],"ko":["탐색 모드","코드베이스 시각화","새로운 기능 설계","OpenSpec 문서 생성","코드 검색","파일 읽기"],"es":["Investigación de código","Búsqueda de código","Creación de artefactos OpenSpec","Visualización de código","Planificación de proyectos","Diseño de proyectos"],"fr":["Investigation de code","Recherche de code","Création d''artefacts OpenSpec","Visualisation de code","Planification de projets","Conception de projets"],"de":["Code-Untersuchung","Code-Suche","Erstellung von OpenSpec-Artefakten","Code-Visualisierung","Projektplanung","Projektentwurf"],"pt":["Cliente HTTP para requisições","Interface de linha de comando (CLI) para controle","MCP para gerenciamento de código","Criação de artefatos OpenSpec","Modo de exploração para investigação de código"],"ru":["HTTP-клиент для запросов","Интерфейс командной строки (CLI) для управления","MCP для управления кодом","Создание артефактов OpenSpec","Режим исследования для изучения кода"],"ar":["عميل HTTP لطلبات","واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI) للتحكم","MCP لإدارة الرمز","إنشاء مكونات OpenSpec","وضع استكشاف للتحقيق في الرمز"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OpenSpec Explore","代码库探索","可视化工具","设计新功能","开发者工具","代码搜索","文件阅读","OpenSpec文档"],"ja":["OpenSpec Explore","コードベースの探索","可視化ツール","新しい機能の設計","開発者ツール","コードの検索","ファイルの読み取り","OpenSpecドキュメント"],"ko":["OpenSpec Explore","코드베이스 탐색","시각화 도구","새로운 기능 설계","개발자 도구","코드 검색","파일 읽기","OpenSpec 문서"],"es":["OpenSpec Explore","Herramientas de Lightdash","Desarrollo de software","Investigación de código","Planificación de proyectos","Diseño de proyectos","Artefactos OpenSpec","Visualización de código","Desarrolladores"],"fr":["OpenSpec Explore","Outils Lightdash","Développement de logiciels","Investigation de code","Planification de projets","Conception de projets","Artefacts OpenSpec","Visualisation de code","Développeurs"],"de":["OpenSpec Explore","Lightdash-Tools","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Untersuchung","Projektplanung","Projektentwurf","OpenSpec-Artefakte","Code-Visualisierung","Entwickler"],"pt":["OpenSpec","Desenvolvimento de software","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Exploração de código","Visualização de código","Cliente HTTP","CLI","MCP"],"ru":["OpenSpec","Разработка программного обеспечения","Инструменты разработки","Исследование кода","Визуализация кода","HTTP-клиент","CLI","MCP"],"ar":["OpenSpec","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","استكشاف الرمز","رؤية الرمز","عميل HTTP","CLI","MCP"]}},"owner":"yu-iskw","repo":"lightdash-tools","repoPath":"yu-iskw/lightdash-tools","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-explore","description":"Enter explore mode - a thinking partner for exploring ideas, investigating problems, and clarifying requirements. Use when the user wants to think through something before or during a change.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# OpenSpec Explore\n\nEnter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if th","body":"# OpenSpec Explore\n\nEnter explore mode. Think deeply. Visualize freely. Follow the conversation wherever it goes.\n\n**IMPORTANT: Explore mode is for thinking, not implementing.** You may read files, search code, and investigate the codebase, but you must NEVER write code or implement features. If the user asks you to implement something, remind them to exit explore mode first (e.g., start a change with `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`). You MAY create OpenSpec artifacts (proposals, designs, specs) if the user asks—that''s capturing thinking, not implementing.\n\n**This is a stance, not a workflow.** There are no fixed steps, no required sequence, no mandatory outputs. You''re a thinking partner helping the user explore.\n\n---\n\n## The Stance\n\n- **Curious, not prescriptive** - Ask questions that emerge naturally, don''t follow a script\n- **Open threads, not interrogations** - Surface multiple interesting directions and let the user follow what resonates. Don''t funnel them through a single path of questions.\n- **Visual** - Use ASCII diagrams liberally when they''d help clarify thinking\n- **Adaptive** - Follow interesting threads, pivot when new information emerges\n- **Patient** - Don''t rush to conclusions, let the shape of the problem emerge\n- **Grounded** - Explore the actual codebase when relevant, don''t just theorize\n\n---\n\n## What You Might Do\n\nDepending on what the user brings, you might:\n\n**Explore the problem space**\n\n- Ask clarifying questions that emerge from what they said\n- Challenge assumptions\n- Reframe the problem\n- Find analogies\n\n**Investigate the codebase**\n\n- Map existing architecture relevant to the discussion\n- Find integration points\n- Identify patterns already in use\n- Surface hidden complexity\n\n**Compare options**\n\n- Brainstorm multiple approaches\n- Build comparison tables\n- Sketch tradeoffs\n- Recommend a path (if asked)\n\n**Visualize**\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│     Use ASCII diagrams liberally        │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                         │\n│   ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        │\n│   │ State  │────────▶│ State  │        │\n│   │   A    │         │   B    │        │\n│   └────────┘         └────────┘        │\n│                                         │\n│   System diagrams, state machines,      │\n│   data flows, architecture sketches,    │\n│   dependency graphs, comparison tables  │\n│                                         │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n**Surface risks and unknowns**\n\n- Identify what could go wrong\n- Find gaps in understanding\n- Suggest spikes or investigations\n\n---\n\n## OpenSpec Awareness\n\nYou have full context of the OpenSpec system. Use it naturally, don''t force it.\n\n### Check for context\n\nAt the start, quickly check what exists:\n\n```bash\ncd docs && openspec list --json\n```\n\nThis tells you:\n\n- If there are active changes\n- Their names, schemas, and status\n- What the user might be working on\n\n### When no change exists\n\nThink freely. When insights crystallize, you might offer:\n\n- \"This feels solid enough to start a change. Want me to create one?\"\n  → Can transition to `/opsx:new` or `/opsx:ff`\n- Or keep exploring - no pressure to formalize\n\n### When a change exists\n\nIf the user mentions a change or you detect one is relevant:\n\n1. **Read existing artifacts for context**\n   - `docs/openspec/changes/<name>/proposal.md`\n   - `docs/openspec/changes/<name>/design.md`\n   - `docs/openspec/changes/<name>/tasks.md`\n   - etc.\n\n2. **Reference them naturally in conversation**\n   - \"Your design mentions using Redis, but we just realized SQLite fits better...\"\n   - \"The proposal scopes this to premium users, but we''re now thinking everyone...\"\n\n3. **Offer to capture when decisions are made**\n\n   | Insight Type               | Where to Capture             |\n   | -------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n   | New requirement discovered | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Requirement changed        | `specs/<capability>/spec.md` |\n   | Design decision made       | `design.md`                  |\n   | Scope changed              | `proposal.md`                |\n   | New work identified        | `tasks.md`                   |\n   | Assumption invalidated     | Relevant artifact            |\n\n   Example offers:\n   - \"That''s a design decision. Capture it in design.md?\"\n   - \"This is a new requirement. Add it to specs?\"\n   - \"This changes scope. Update the proposal?\"\n\n4. **The user decides** - Offer and move on. Don''t pressure. Don''t auto-capture.\n\n---\n\n## What You Don''t Have To Do\n\n- Follow a script\n- Ask the same questions every time\n- Produce a specific artifact\n- Reach a conclusion\n- Stay on topic if a tangent is valuable\n- Be brief (this is thinking time)\n\n---\n\n## Handling Different Entry Points\n\n**User brings a vague idea:**\n\n```\nUser: I''m thinking about adding real-time collaboration\n\nYou: Real-time collab is a big space. Let me think about this...\n\n      COLLABORATION SPECTRUM\n      ════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n      Awareness          Coordination         Sync\n          │                   │                 │\n          ▼                   ▼                 ▼\n      ┌────────┐         ┌────────┐        ┌────────┐\n      │Presence│         │Cursors │        │  CRDT  │\n      │  \"3    │         │ Multi  │        │Conflict│\n      │online\" │         │ select │        │  free  │\n      └────────┘         └────────┘        └────────┘\n          │                   │                 │\n       trivial            moderate           complex\n\n      Where''s your head at?\n```\n\n**User brings a specific problem:**\n\n```\nUser: The auth system is a mess\n\nYou: [reads codebase]\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │              CURRENT AUTH FLOW              │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                        │\n          ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐\n          ▼             ▼             ▼\n     ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐  ┌─────────┐\n     │ Google  │  │  GitHub │  │  Email  │\n     │  OAuth  │  │  OAuth  │  │  Magic  │\n     └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘  └────┬────┘\n          │             │             │\n          └─────────────┼─────────────┘\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │  Session  │\n                  └─────┬─────┘\n                        │\n                        ▼\n                  ┌───────────┐\n                  │   Perms   │\n                  └───────────┘\n\n     I see three tangles. Which one''s burning?\n```\n\n**User is stuck mid-implementation:**\n\n```\nUser: /opsx:explore add-auth-system\n      The OAuth integration is more complex than expected\n\nYou: [reads change artifacts]\n\n     You''re on task 4: \"Implement OAuth flow\"\n\n     Let me trace what''s involved...\n\n     [draws diagram, explores options, suggests paths]\n\n     Want to update the design to reflect this?\n     Or add a spike task to investigate?\n```\n\n**User wants to compare options:**\n\n```\nUser: Should we use Postgres or SQLite?\n\nYou: Generic answer is boring. What''s the context?\n\nUser: A CLI tool that tracks local dev environments\n\nYou: That changes everything.\n\n     ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n     │         CLI TOOL DATA STORAGE                  │\n     └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n     Key constraints:\n     • No daemon running\n     • Must work offline\n     • Single user\n\n                  SQLite          Postgres\n     Deployment   embedded ✓      needs server ✗\n     Offline      yes ✓           no ✗\n     Single file  yes ✓           no ✗\n\n     SQLite. Not even close.\n\n     Unless... is there a sync component?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Ending Discovery\n\nThere''s no required ending. Discovery might:\n\n- **Flow into action**: \"Ready to start? /opsx:new or /opsx:ff\"\n- **Result in artifact updates**: \"Updated design.md with these decisions\"\n- **Just provide clarity**: User has what they need, moves on\n- **Continue later**: \"We can pick this up anytime\"\n\nWhen it feels like things are crystallizing, you might summarize:\n\n```\n## What We Figured Out\n\n**The problem**: [crystallized understanding]\n\n**The approach**: [if one emerged]\n\n**Open questions**: [if any remain]\n\n**Next steps** (if ready):\n- Create a change: /opsx:new <name>\n- Fast-forward to tasks: /opsx:ff <name>\n- Keep exploring: just keep talking\n```\n\nBut this summary is optional. Sometimes the thinking IS the value.\n\n---\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- **Don''t implement** - Never write code or implement features. Creating OpenSpec artifacts is fine, writing application code is not.\n- **Don''t fake understanding** - If something is unclear, dig deeper\n- **Don''t rush** - Discovery is thinking time, not task time\n- **Don''t force structure** - Let patterns emerge naturally\n- **Don''t auto-capture** - Offer to save insights, don''t just do it\n- **Do visualize** - A good diagram is worth many paragraphs\n- **Do explore the codebase** - Ground discussions in reality\n- **Do question assumptions** - Including the user''s and your own\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:16:15.406Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing advanced OpenSpec exploration capabilities for deep thinking and visualization.","zh":"适用于 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT 等需要高级 OpenSpec 探索能力的 AI Agents，用于深入思考和可视化。","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの高度な OpenSpec 探索機能を必要とする AI エージェントに適しています。深い思考と視覚化に使用されます。","ko":"클라우드 코드 및 오토 GPT와 같은 고급 오픈 스펙 탐색 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 깊은 사고와 시각화를 위해 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que necesitan capacidades de exploración avanzadas de OpenSpec para pensamiento profundo y visualización.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant des capacités de recherche avancées OpenSpec pour une réflexion approfondie et une visualisation.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die erweiterte OpenSpec-Explorationsfunktionen für tiefes Denken und Visualisierung benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que necessitam de capacidades de exploração avançadas do OpenSpec para pensamento profundo e visualização.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, которым требуются продвинутые возможности исследования OpenSpec для глубокого мышления и визуализации.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT التي تحتاج إلى قدرات استكشافية متقدمة من OpenSpec للتفكير العميق والتصور."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to freely explore and visualize codebases using HTTP clients, CLI, and MCP, while creating OpenSpec artifacts like proposals, designs, and specs, all within a secure explore mode that prevents code implementation.","zh":"赋予代理自由探索和可视化代码库的能力，使用 HTTP 客户端、CLI 和 MCP，同时在安全的探索模式下创建 OpenSpec 文档，如提案、设计和规格，不会实现代码。","ja":"HTTP クライアント、CLI、MCP を使用してコードベースを自由に探索して視覚化する機能をエージェントに与え、安全な探索モードで OpenSpec アーティファクト（提案、設計、仕様など）を作成しますが、コードの実装は行いません。","ko":"에이전트가 HTTP 클라이언트, CLI 및 MCP를 사용하여 코드베이스를 자유롭게 탐색하고 시각화할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. 또한 안전한 탐색 모드에서 오픈 스펙 아티팩트(제안, 설계, 사양 등)를 생성하지만 코드를 구현하지는 않습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes explorar y visualizar libremente las bases de código utilizando clientes HTTP, CLI y MCP, al mismo tiempo que crea artefactos OpenSpec como propuestas, diseños y especificaciones, todo dentro de un modo de exploración seguro que evita la implementación de código.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''explorer et de visualiser librement les bases de code en utilisant des clients HTTP, CLI et MCP, tout en créant des artefacts OpenSpec tels que des propositions, des conceptions et des spécifications, le tout dans un mode d''exploration sécurisé qui empêche la mise en œuvre du code.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Codebasen mithilfe von HTTP-Clients, CLI und MCP frei zu erkunden und zu visualisieren, während OpenSpec-Artefakte wie Vorschläge, Entwürfe und Spezifikationen erstellt werden, alles innerhalb eines sicheren Explorationsmodus, der die Codeimplementierung verhindert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a explorar e visualizar livremente as bases de código usando clientes HTTP, CLI e MCP, ao mesmo tempo em que cria artefatos OpenSpec, como propostas, projetos e especificações, tudo dentro de um modo de exploração seguro que impede a implementação de código.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью свободно исследовать и визуализировать кодовые базы, используя HTTP-клиенты, CLI и MCP, а также создавать артефакты OpenSpec, такие как предложения, проекты и спецификации, все в безопасном режиме исследования, который предотвращает реализацию кода.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استكشاف قواعد البيانات والتصور بحرية باستخدام العملاء HTTP و CLI و MCP، وفي الوقت نفسه يقومون بإنشاء مكونات متوفرة من OpenSpec مثل المقترحات والتصاميم والمواصفات، كل ذلك داخل وضع استكشاف آمن يمنع تنفيذ الشفرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Investigating codebases for potential security vulnerabilities","Generating OpenSpec proposals for new features","Visualizing complex system architectures"],"zh":["调查代码库中的潜在安全漏洞","为新功能生成 OpenSpec 提案","可视化复杂系统架构"],"ja":["コードベースの潜在的なセキュリティ脆弱性の調査","新しい機能の OpenSpec 提案の生成","複雑なシステムアーキテクチャの視覚化"],"ko":["코드베이스의 잠재적인 보안 취약성 조사","새로운 기능의 오픈 스펙 제안 생성","복잡한 시스템 아키텍처 시각화"],"es":["Investigar las bases de código en busca de vulnerabilidades de seguridad potenciales","Generar propuestas OpenSpec para nuevas características","Visualizar arquitecturas de sistemas complejos"],"fr":["Enquêter sur les bases de code pour détecter les vulnérabilités de sécurité potentielles","Générer des propositions OpenSpec pour de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Visualiser des architectures de systèmes complexes"],"de":["Untersuchung von Codebasen auf potenzielle Sicherheitslücken","Erstellung von OpenSpec-Vorschlägen für neue Funktionen","Visualisierung komplexer Systemarchitekturen"],"pt":["Investigação de bases de código para vulnerabilidades de segurança potenciais","Geração de propostas OpenSpec para recursos novos","Visualização de arquiteturas de sistemas complexas"],"ru":["Изучение кодовых баз для потенциальных уязвимостей безопасности","Генерация предложений OpenSpec для новых функций","Визуализация сложных системных архитектур"],"ar":["التحقيق في قواعد البيانات لتحديد نقاط الضعف الأمنية المحتملة","generação de مقترحات OpenSpec لسمات جديدة","التصور للمعمارية النظم المعقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Must not write code or implement features in explore mode","Requires exit from explore mode to start new changes"],"zh":["探索模式下不得编写代码或实现功能","需要退出探索模式以开始新更改"],"ja":["探索モードではコードを書いたり機能を実装したりしてはならない","新しい変更を開始するには探索モードを終了する必要がある"],"ko":["탐색 모드에서 코드를 작성하거나 기능을 구현할 수 없음","새로운 변경을 시작하려면 탐색 모드를 종료해야 함"],"es":["No debe escribir código o implementar características en el modo de exploración","Requiere la salida del modo de exploración para iniciar nuevos cambios"],"fr":["Ne doit pas écrire de code ou mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités en mode d''exploration","Nécessite la sortie du mode d''exploration pour commencer de nouveaux changements"],"de":["Darf im Explorationsmodus keinen Code schreiben oder Funktionen implementieren","Erfordert das Verlassen des Explorationsmodus, um neue Änderungen zu starten"],"pt":["Não deve escrever código ou implementar recursos no modo de exploração","Requer saída do modo de exploração para iniciar novas alterações"],"ru":["Не должен писать код или реализовывать функции в режиме исследования","Требуется выход из режима исследования, чтобы начать новые изменения"],"ar":["لا يجب كتابة الشفرة أو تنفيذ الميزات في وضع الاستكشاف","يتطلب الخروج من وضع الاستكشاف لبدء تغييرات جديدة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('AbdullahMalik17/Digital-FTE/project-designer', 'community', 'AbdullahMalik17', 'Digital-FTE', 'AbdullahMalik17/Digital-FTE', 'project-designer', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z', '2026-02-18T03:16:02.053Z', NULL, '{"id":"AbdullahMalik17/Digital-FTE/project-designer","name":"project-designer","description":{"zh":"项目设计师通过系统分析和技术推荐，帮助您设计全面项目。它涵盖了结构化的理念、架构决策和战略规划","ja":"プロジェクトデザイナーは、システム分析と技術推奨を通じて、包括的なプロジェクト設計を支援します。構造化されたアイデア、建築決定、戦略計画などを網羅しています","ko":"프로젝트 디자이너는 시스템 분석 및 기술 추천을 통해 종합 프로젝트 디자인을 지원합니다. 구조화된 아이디어, 아키텍처 결정 및 전략 계획 등을 포함합니다","es":"El diseñador de proyectos te guía a través de la ideación estructurada y la planificación estratégica para proyectos de AI/ML y aplicaciones web y móviles.","fr":"Le conceleur de projets vous guide à travers l''idéation structurée et la planification stratégique pour les projets d''IA/ML et les applications web et mobiles.","de":"Der Projekt-Designer führt Sie durch die strukturierte Ideenfindung und strategische Planung für AI/ML-Projekte und Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen.","pt":"O Project Designer transforma conceitos iniciais em designs abrangentes com análise sistemática e recomendações de tecnologia","ru":"Проектировщик Проектов преобразует первоначальные концепции в полноценные проекты с помощью системного анализа и рекомендаций по технологиям","ar":"مصمم المشروع يستبدل المفاهيم الأولية بتصاميم شاملة من خلال التحليل المنهجي وتوصيات التكنولوجيا","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"项目设计师 - 全面项目设计解决方案","ja":"プロジェクトデザイナー - 包括的なプロジェクト設計ソリューション","ko":"프로젝트 디자이너 - 종합 프로젝트 디자인 솔루션","es":"Diseñador de Proyectos: Transforma Conceptos en Diseños","fr":"Conceleur de Projets: Transformer les Concepts en Concept...","de":"Projekt-Designer: Konzepte in Designs umwandeln","pt":"Projetar Soluções de Projeto","ru":"Проектировщик Проектов","ar":"مصمم المشروع","en":"project-designer"},"description":{"zh":"项目设计师通过系统分析和技术推荐，帮助您设计全面项目。它涵盖了结构化的理念、架构决策和战略规划","ja":"プロジェクトデザイナーは、システム分析と技術推奨を通じて、包括的なプロジェクト設計を支援します。構造化されたアイデア、建築決定、戦略計画などを網羅しています","ko":"프로젝트 디자이너는 시스템 분석 및 기술 추천을 통해 종합 프로젝트 디자인을 지원합니다. 구조화된 아이디어, 아키텍처 결정 및 전략 계획 등을 포함합니다","es":"El diseñador de proyectos te guía a través de la ideación estructurada y la planificación estratégica para proyectos de AI/ML y aplicaciones web y móviles.","fr":"Le conceleur de projets vous guide à travers l''idéation structurée et la planification stratégique pour les projets d''IA/ML et les applications web et mobiles.","de":"Der Projekt-Designer führt Sie durch die strukturierte Ideenfindung und strategische Planung für AI/ML-Projekte und Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen.","pt":"O Project Designer transforma conceitos iniciais em designs abrangentes com análise sistemática e recomendações de tecnologia","ru":"Проектировщик Проектов преобразует первоначальные концепции в полноценные проекты с помощью системного анализа и рекомендаций по технологиям","ar":"مصمم المشروع يستبدل المفاهيم الأولية بتصاميم شاملة من خلال التحليل المنهجي وتوصيات التكنولوجيا","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["结构化的理念","架构决策","战略规划","系统分析","功能增强"],"ja":["構造化されたアイデア","建築決定","戦略計画","システム分析","機能強化"],"ko":["구조화된 아이디어","아키텍처 결정","전략 계획","시스템 분석","기능 강화"],"es":["Ideación estructurada","Análisis de tecnologías","Planificación estratégica","Diseño de arquitectura","Recomendaciones de características"],"fr":["Idéation structurée","Analyse des technologies","Planification stratégique","Conception d''architecture","Recommandations de fonctionnalités"],"de":["Strukturierte Ideenfindung","Technologieanalyse","Strategische Planung","Architekturdesign","Funktionsempfehlungen"],"pt":["Análise sistemática de conceitos iniciais","Recomendações de tecnologia personalizadas","Desenvolvimento de designs abrangentes","Planejamento estratégico para projetos","Tomada de decisões arquiteturais informadas"],"ru":["Системный анализ первоначальных концепций","Персонализированные рекомендации по технологиям","Разработка полноценных проектов","Стратегическое планирование для проектов","Информированное архитектурное решение"],"ar":["التحليل المنهجي للمفاهيم الأولية","توصيات التكنولوجيا المخصصة","تصميم تصاميم شاملة","التخطيط الاستراتيجي للمشاريع","اتخاذ قرارات معمارية مدروسة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["项目设计","系统分析","功能增强","技术推荐","结构化理念","架构决策","战略规划"],"ja":["プロジェクト設計","システム分析","機能強化","技術推奨","構造化されたアイデア","建築決定","戦略計画"],"ko":["프로젝트 디자인","시스템 분석","기능 강화","기술 추천","구조화된 아이디어","아키텍처 결정","전략 계획"],"es":["diseñador de proyectos","desarrollo de proyectos","proyectos de AI/ML","aplicaciones web","aplicaciones móviles","ideación estructurada","planificación estratégica"],"fr":["conceleur de projets","développement de projets","projets d''IA/ML","applications web","applications mobiles","idéation structurée","planification stratégique"],"de":["Projekt-Designer","Projektentwicklung","AI/ML-Projekte","Web-Anwendungen","Mobile-Anwendungen","strukturierte Ideenfindung","strategische Planung"],"pt":["projeto de design","desenvolvimento de projetos","análise de conceitos","recomendações de tecnologia","planejamento estratégico","tomada de decisões arquiteturais","projetos de AI/ML","projetos web","projetos móveis"],"ru":["проектирование проектов","разработка проектов","анализ концепций","рекомендации по технологиям","стратегическое планирование","архитектурное решение","проекты AI/ML","веб-проекты","мобильные проекты"],"ar":["تصميم المشروع","تطوير المشاريع","تحليل المفاهيم","توصيات التكنولوجيا","التخطيط الاستراتيجي","اتخاذ قرارات معمارية","مشاريع الذكاء الاصطناعي","مشاريع الويب","مشاريع الهاتف المحمول"]}},"owner":"AbdullahMalik17","repo":"Digital-FTE","repoPath":"AbdullahMalik17/Digital-FTE","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-designer","description":"Comprehensive project design and ideation skill for AI/ML and web/mobile applications. Use when users present initial project ideas that need enhancement, architectural guidance, technology stack recommendations, feature expansion, or implementation strategy. Triggers include requests like help me design a [project type], I want to build [concept] but need to flesh out the idea, what features should I add to [project], recommend a tech stack for [idea], or enhance my project concept. Provides structured design thinking, architectural patterns, feature frameworks, and technology recommendations through progressive disclosure of specialized reference materials.","bodyPreview":"# Project Designer\n\n## Overview\n\nTransform initial project concepts into comprehensive, well-architected designs through systematic analysis, feature enhancement, and technology recommendations. This skill guides you through structured ideation, architectural decision-making, and strategic planning for AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Concept Understanding\n\n**Objective**: Thoroughly understand the user''s core idea, goals, and constraints.\n\n**Actions","body":"# Project Designer\n\n## Overview\n\nTransform initial project concepts into comprehensive, well-architected designs through systematic analysis, feature enhancement, and technology recommendations. This skill guides you through structured ideation, architectural decision-making, and strategic planning for AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Concept Understanding\n\n**Objective**: Thoroughly understand the user''s core idea, goals, and constraints.\n\n**Actions**:\n1. **Extract Core Information**:\n   - Project type (AI/ML agent, web app, mobile app)\n   - Primary problem being solved\n   - Target users or personas\n   - Key constraints (budget, timeline, team size, technical expertise)\n\n2. **Identify Gaps**:\n   - Missing requirements or specifications\n   - Unclear objectives or success criteria\n   - Undefined user needs\n\n3. **Ask Clarifying Questions**:\n   Use the AskUserQuestion tool when:\n   - Project scope is ambiguous\n   - Multiple architectural approaches are viable\n   - Technical requirements are unclear\n   - User needs are not fully specified\n\n### Phase 2: Architecture and Technology Guidance\n\n**Objective**: Recommend appropriate architectural patterns and technology stacks based on project requirements.\n\n**Reference Materials**: Load based on project type and needs:\n- **`references/ai-ml-patterns.md`**: For AI/ML agents, RAG systems, conversational AI, ML pipelines\n- **`references/web-app-patterns.md`**: For web/mobile applications, API design, full-stack systems\n- **`references/tech-stack-matrix.md`**: For technology selection across all project types\n\n**Actions**:\n1. Identify project type and match to established architectural patterns\n2. Recommend technology stack based on team expertise, budget, scalability needs\n3. Explain architectural decisions with clear rationale and trade-offs\n\n### Phase 3: Feature Discovery and Enhancement\n\n**Objective**: Expand the initial concept with comprehensive, prioritized features.\n\n**Reference Material**: `references/feature-frameworks.md`\n\n**Actions**:\n1. Apply feature discovery methods (Jobs-to-be-Done, User Story Mapping, Feature Analogies)\n2. Categorize features: Must-Have (MVP), Should-Have (Post-MVP), Could-Have (Future)\n3. Apply prioritization framework (RICE, ICE, Kano model)\n4. Consider enhancement dimensions: capability, UX, integration, intelligence\n\n### Phase 4: Structured Documentation\n\n**Objective**: Produce comprehensive project documentation using standardized templates.\n\n**Asset Templates**: Use appropriate templates based on user needs:\n- **`assets/templates/project-brief.md`**: Complete project specification\n- **`assets/templates/architecture-blueprint.md`**: Detailed technical architecture\n- **`assets/templates/feature-roadmap.md`**: Prioritized feature timeline\n\n### Phase 5: Iterative Refinement\n\n**Objective**: Refine the design based on user feedback and emerging requirements.\n\n**Actions**:\n1. Present recommendations clearly with critical decisions highlighted\n2. Respond to user feedback and adjust recommendations\n3. Provide detailed explanations of recommendations\n4. Start high-level, drill down into specifics as needed\n\n## Usage Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: New Project Ideation\nUser presents initial idea → Understand requirements → Recommend architecture/stack → Enhance features → Generate project-brief.md\n\n### Pattern 2: Existing Project Enhancement\nUser has working system → Understand current state → Apply feature frameworks → Prioritize enhancements → Generate feature-roadmap.md\n\n### Pattern 3: Technology Stack Consultation\nUser needs tech guidance → Clarify requirements → Consult tech-stack-matrix.md → Recommend stack with rationale\n\n### Pattern 4: Architecture Design\nUser needs technical design → Gather requirements → Recommend pattern → Define components → Generate architecture-blueprint.md\n\n## Best Practices\n\n**Communication**:\n- Follow workflow phases sequentially\n- Use progressive disclosure (high-level first, details when needed)\n- Provide concrete, implementable recommendations\n\n**Technical Recommendations**:\n- Balance pragmatism with best practices\n- Consider team capabilities and constraints\n- Provide primary recommendation + alternatives with trade-offs\n\n**Feature Design**:\n- Ground features in user problems and needs\n- Define clear MVP scope\n- Use quantitative prioritization frameworks\n\n## Reference Material Usage\n\n**Load references/ai-ml-patterns.md when**: AI agents, RAG systems, ML pipelines, NLP/CV applications\n\n**Load references/web-app-patterns.md when**: Web/mobile apps, API design, authentication, database patterns\n\n**Load references/tech-stack-matrix.md when**: Technology selection, team/budget considerations, scalability needs\n\n**Load references/feature-frameworks.md when**: Feature ideation, prioritization, user-centric design, roadmap planning\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n**Don''t**:\n- Suggest over-engineered solutions for simple problems\n- Ignore constraints (budget, timeline, expertise)\n- Skip Phase 1 understanding to rush to recommendations\n- Load all references unnecessarily\n- Make assumptions without clarifying\n\n**Do**:\n- Ask clarifying questions when unclear\n- Tailor recommendations to specific context\n- Provide rationale for recommendations\n- Use reference materials to support recommendations\n- Balance comprehensiveness with actionability\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:16:02.053Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI/ML Agents needing structured project planning and comprehensive design capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化项目规划和全面设计能力的AI/ML智能体。","ja":"構造化されたプロジェクト計画と包括的な設計機能を必要とするAI/MLエージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 프로젝트 계획과 포괄적인 설계 기능이 필요한 AI/ML 에이전트에 완벽하게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA/ML que necesitan una planificación de proyectos estructurada y capacidades de diseño comprehensivo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA/ML ayant besoin d''une planification de projet structurée et de capacités de conception complètes.","de":"Perfekt für AI/ML-Agents, die eine strukturierte Projektplanung und umfassende Designfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA/ML que necessitam de planejamento de projetos estruturado e capacidades de design abrangentes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ/МЛ, которым необходимы структурированное планирование проектов и всесторонние возможности проектирования.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي/التعلم الآلي التي تحتاج إلى تخطيط مشروع منظم وقدرات تصميم شاملة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform initial concepts into well-architected designs through systematic analysis, feature enhancement, and technology recommendations, leveraging strategic planning for AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects.","zh":"通过系统分析、功能增强和技术建议，利用针对AI/ML智能体、Web应用程序和移动项目的战略规划，赋能智能体将初始概念转化为架构良好的设计。","ja":"体系的な分析、機能強化、技術推奨を通じて、AI/MLエージェント、Webアプリケーション、モバイルプロジェクトのための戦略的計画を活用し、初期コンセプトをよく構造化された設計に変換することをエージェントに可能にします。","ko":"체계적인 분석, 기능 향상, 기술 권장 사항을 통해 AI/ML 에이전트, 웹 애플리케이션 및 모바일 프로젝트를 위한 전략적 계획을 활용하여 초기 개념을 구조화된 설계로 변환하는 것을 에이전트에 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar conceptos iniciales en diseños bien arquitectados a través del análisis sistemático, la mejora de características y las recomendaciones tecnológicas, aprovechando la planificación estratégica para agentes de IA/ML, aplicaciones web y proyectos móviles.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des concepts initiaux en conceptions bien architecturées grâce à une analyse systématique, une amélioration des fonctionnalités et des recommandations technologiques, en exploitant la planification stratégique pour les agents IA/ML, les applications web et les projets mobiles.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Initialkonzepte in gut architektierte Designs durch systematische Analyse, Funktionsverbesserung und Technologieempfehlungen umzuwandeln, indem sie die strategische Planung für AI/ML-Agents, Webanwendungen und Mobile-Projekte nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar conceitos iniciais em designs bem arquitetados por meio de análise sistemática, melhoria de recursos e recomendações tecnológicas, aproveitando o planejamento estratégico para agentes de IA/ML, aplicações web e projetos móveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать первоначальные концепции в хорошо спроектированные решения посредством систематического анализа, улучшения функций и технологических рекомендаций, используя стратегическое планирование для агентов ИИ/МЛ, веб-приложений и мобильных проектов.","ar":"تمكن الوكيل من تحويل المفاهيم الأولية إلى تصاميم معمارية جيدة من خلال التحليل المنهجي وتحسين الميزات والتوصيات التكنولوجية، واستغلال التخطيط الاستراتيجي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي/التعلم الآلي والتطبيقات الويب والمشاريع المتنقلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Systematically analyzing project concepts","Generating comprehensive project designs","Enhancing features through technological recommendations"],"zh":["系统分析项目概念","生成全面的项目设计","通过技术建议增强功能"],"ja":["プロジェクトコンセプトの体系的分析","包括的なプロジェクト設計の生成","技術的推奨による機能の強化"],"ko":["프로젝트 개념의 체계적 분석","포괄적인 프로젝트 설계 생성","기술 권장 사항을 통한 기능 향상"],"es":["Analizar sistemáticamente los conceptos del proyecto","Generar diseños de proyecto comprehensivos","Mejorar características a través de recomendaciones tecnológicas"],"fr":["Analyser systématiquement les concepts de projet","Générer des conceptions de projet complètes","Améliorer les fonctionnalités grâce à des recommandations technologiques"],"de":["Projektkonzepte systematisch analysieren","Umfassende Projektdesigns generieren","Funktionen durch Technologieempfehlungen verbessern"],"pt":["Analisar sistematicamente conceitos de projeto","Gerar projetos de design abrangentes","Melhorar recursos por meio de recomendações tecnológicas"],"ru":["Систематически анализировать концепции проекта","Генерировать всесторонние проектные конструкции","Улучшать функции посредством технологических рекомендаций"],"ar":["التحليل المنهجي لمفاهيم المشروع","إنتاج تصميمات مشروع شاملة","تحسين الميزات من خلال التوصيات التكنولوجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires thorough understanding of user''s core idea, goals, and constraints","Limited to AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects"],"zh":["需要透彻理解用户的核心想法、目标和约束","仅限于AI/ML智能体、Web应用程序和移动项目"],"ja":["ユーザーの核心的なアイデア、目標、制約の徹底的な理解が必要","AI/MLエージェント、Webアプリケーション、モバイルプロジェクトに限定"],"ko":["사용자의 핵심 아이디어, 목표 및 제약 조건에 대한 철저한 이해 필요","AI/ML 에이전트, 웹 애플리케이션 및 모바일 프로젝트로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una comprensión exhaustiva de la idea central, los objetivos y las limitaciones del usuario","Limitado a agentes de IA/ML, aplicaciones web y proyectos móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension approfondie de l''idée centrale, des objectifs et des contraintes de l''utilisateur","Limité aux agents IA/ML, aux applications web et aux projets mobiles"],"de":["Benötigt ein umfassendes Verständnis der Kernidee, Ziele und Einschränkungen des Benutzers","Begrenzt auf AI/ML-Agents, Webanwendungen und Mobile-Projekte"],"pt":["Exige uma compreensão aprofundada da ideia central do usuário, metas e restrições","Limitado a agentes de IA/ML, aplicações web e projetos móveis"],"ru":["Требует глубокого понимания основной идеи пользователя, целей и ограничений","Ограничен агентами ИИ/МЛ, веб-приложениями и мобильными проектами"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا متعمقًا لفكرة المستخدم الأساسية والأهداف والقيود","محدود بالعمليات الذكية/التعلم الآلي والتطبيقات الويب والمشاريع المتنقلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
