des hooks dans Flutter Desktop, idéal pour le développement de jeux avec l''éditeur de texture atlas.","de":"Die Hook-Entwicklung ist ein Tool zum Erstellen von Hooks in Flutter Desktop, ideal für die Entwicklung von Spielen mit dem Texture-Atlas-Editor.","pt":"O hook-development é uma ferramenta de edição de atlas de textura para desenvolvimento de jogos no Flutter Desktop","ru":"Hook-development - это инструмент для редактирования атласа текстур для разработки игр в Flutter Desktop","ar":"تعد hook-development أداة لتحرير أطلس النسيج لتطوير الألعاب في Flutter Desktop","en":"Flutter Desktop texture atlas editor for game development"},"definition":{"en":"Flutter Desktop texture atlas editor for game development"},"features":{"zh":["LLM","bash","Flutter","API","Plugin"," "],"ja":["LLM","bash","Flutter","API","Plugin"," "],"ko":["LLM","bash","Flutter","API","Plugin"," "],"es":["Creación de hooks para validación de operaciones","Integración con herramientas externas","Compatibilidad con Flutter Desktop","Soporte para texture atlas editor","Eventos de Claude Code para desencadenar hooks","Tomada de decisiones basada en LLM"],"fr":["Création de hooks pour la validation des opérations","Intégration avec des outils externes","Compatibilité avec Flutter Desktop","Prise en charge de l''éditeur de texture atlas","Événements de Claude Code pour déclencher des hooks","Prise de décision basée sur LLM"],"de":["Erstellung von Hooks für die Überprüfung von Operationen","Integration mit externen Tools","Kompatibilität mit Flutter Desktop","Unterstützung für den Texture-Atlas-Editor","Claude-Code-Ereignisse zum Auslösen von Hooks","Entscheidungsfindung basierend auf LLM"],"pt":["Criação de hooks personalizados","Automatização de tarefas no Flutter Desktop","Edição de atlas de textura para desenvolvimento de jogos","Integração com Claude Code Plugins","Suporte a Prompt-Based Hooks e Command Hooks"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских хуков","Автоматизация задач в Flutter Desktop","Редактирование атласа текстур для разработки игр","Интеграция с Claude Code Plugins","Поддержка Prompt-Based Hooks и Command Hooks"],"ar":["إنشاء hooks مخصصة","تحسين تجربة تطوير الألعاب في Flutter Desktop","تحرير أطلس النسيج لتطوير الألعاب","التكامل مع Claude Code Plugins","دعم Prompt-Based Hooks و Command Hooks"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Flutter","hook","LLM","bash","Plugin","API","Flutter","Flutter","Flutter"],"ja":["Flutter","hook","LLM","bash","Plugin","API","Flutter","Flutter","Flutter"],"ko":["Flutter","hook","LLM","bash","Plugin","API","Flutter","Flutter","Flutter"],"es":["desarrollo de hooks","Flutter Desktop","texture atlas editor","juegos de Flutter","automatización de Claude Code","validación de operaciones","integración con herramientas externas","LLM","eventos de Claude Code"],"fr":["développement de hooks","Flutter Desktop","éditeur de texture atlas","jeux de Flutter","automatisation de Claude Code","validation des opérations","intégration avec des outils externes","LLM","événements de Claude Code"],"de":["Hook-Entwicklung","Flutter Desktop","Texture-Atlas-Editor","Flutter-Spiele","Claude-Code-Automatisierung","Überprüfung von Operationen","Integration mit externen Tools","LLM","Claude-Code-Ereignisse"],"pt":["hook-development","Flutter Desktop","desenvolvimento de jogos","automatização de tarefas","edição de atlas de textura","Claude Code Plugins","Prompt-Based Hooks","Command Hooks"],"ru":["hook-development","Flutter Desktop","разработка игр","автоматизация задач","редактирование атласа текстур","Claude Code Plugins","Prompt-Based Hooks","Command Hooks"],"ar":["hook-development","Flutter Desktop","تطوير الألعاب","تحسين تجربة تطوير الألعاب","تحرير أطلس النسيج","Claude Code Plugins","Prompt-Based Hooks","Command Hooks"]}},"owner":"CANTAGESTUDIO","repo":"CosmicAtlasPacker","repoPath":"CANTAGESTUDIO/CosmicAtlasPacker","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.405Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"hook-development","description":"[Utility] Guide for developing Claude Code hooks - shell commands that execute automatically in response to tool calls and notifications. Use this when users want to create, debug, or optimize hooks for automating workflows like linting, formatting, notifications, or custom validations. Supports PreToolUse, PostToolUse, Stop, SubagentStop, SessionStart, SessionEnd, UserPromptSubmit, PreCompact, Notification events.","bodyPreview":"# Hook Development for Claude Code Plugins\n\n## Overview\n\nHooks are event-driven automation scripts that execute in response to Claude Code events. Use hooks to validate operations, enforce policies, add context, and integrate external tools into workflows.\n\n## Hook Types\n\n### Prompt-Based Hooks (Recommended)\nUse LLM-driven decision making for context-aware validation.\n\n### Command Hooks\nExecute bash commands for deterministic checks.\n\n## Hook Events\n\n| Event | When | Use For |\n|-------|------|--","body":"# Hook Development for Claude Code Plugins\n\n## Overview\n\nHooks are event-driven automation scripts that execute in response to Claude Code events. Use hooks to validate operations, enforce policies, add context, and integrate external tools into workflows.\n\n## Hook Types\n\n### Prompt-Based Hooks (Recommended)\nUse LLM-driven decision making for context-aware validation.\n\n### Command Hooks\nExecute bash commands for deterministic checks.\n\n## Hook Events\n\n| Event | When | Use For |\n|-------|------|---------|\n| PreToolUse | Before tool | Validation, modification |\n| PostToolUse | After tool | Feedback, logging |\n| UserPromptSubmit | User input | Context, validation |\n| Stop | Agent stopping | Completeness check |\n| SubagentStop | Subagent done | Task validation |\n| SessionStart | Session begins | Context loading |\n| SessionEnd | Session ends | Cleanup, logging |\n| PreCompact | Before compact | Preserve context |\n| Notification | User notified | Logging, reactions |\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n- `$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR` - Project root path\n- `$CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT` - Plugin directory\n- `$CLAUDE_ENV_FILE` - SessionStart only: persist env vars here\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Use prompt-based hooks for complex logic\n- Use ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT} for portability\n- Validate all inputs in command hooks\n- Set appropriate timeouts"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:16:14.098Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude Code needing event-driven automation and integration with external tools via hook-development.","zh":"非常适合需要事件驱动自动化和通过钩子开发与外部工具集成的AI代理，如Claude Code。","ja":"Claude Codeのようなイベント駆動型の自動化とフック開発を介した外部ツールとの統合が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Claude Code와 같은 이벤트 驱动 자동화 및 hook 개발을 통한 외부 도구와의 통합이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Claude Code que necesitan automatización basada en eventos y integración con herramientas externas a través del desarrollo de ganchos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA comme Claude Code ayant besoin d''une automatisation basée sur les événements et d''une intégration avec des outils externes via le développement de crochets.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, die eine ereignisgesteuerte Automatisierung und Integration mit externen Tools über Hook-Entwicklung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA, como Claude Code, que necessitam de automação baseada em eventos e integração com ferramentas externas via desenvolvimento de ganchos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, требующих событийно-ориентированной автоматизации и интеграции с внешними инструментами через разработку крючков.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code الذي يحتاج إلى آليّة أتمتة مدفوعة بالأحداث وتكامل مع أدوات خارجية من خلال تطوير المشابك."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to execute context-aware validation using LLM-driven decision making and bash commands for deterministic checks, integrating seamlessly with workflows via prompt-based hooks and command hooks.","zh":"赋予代理执行上下文感知验证，使用LLM驱动的决策和bash命令进行确定性检查，并通过提示基的钩子和命令钩子与工作流无缝集成。","ja":"LLM駆動の意思決定とbashコマンドを使用した決定性チェックによるコンテキスト認識の検証をエージェントが実行できるようにし、プロンプトベースのフックとコマンドフックを介してワークフローとシームレスに統合します。","ko":"LLM 구동 의사 결정 및 bash 명령을 사용한 결정적 체크를 통한 컨텍스트 인식 검증을 에이전트가 실행할 수 있도록 하며, 프롬프트 기반 훅과 명령 훅을 통해 워크플로와 무縫으로 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar una validación consciente del contexto utilizando la toma de decisiones impulsada por LLM y comandos bash para comprobaciones deterministas, integrándose perfectamente con flujos de trabajo a través de ganchos basados en solicitudes y ganchos de comando.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter une validation consciente du contexte en utilisant la prise de décision pilotée par LLM et des commandes bash pour des vérifications déterministes, s''intégrant parfaitement avec les flux de travail via des crochets basés sur les invites et des crochets de commande.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, kontextbewusste Validierungen mit LLM-gesteuerter Entscheidungsfindung und Bash-Befehlen für deterministische Prüfungen auszuführen, und integriert sich nahtlos in Workflows über promptbasierte Hooks und Befehlshooks.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar validação consciente do contexto usando tomada de decisão impulsionada por LLM e comandos bash para verificações determinísticas, integrando-se perfeitamente com fluxos de trabalho via ganchos baseados em prompts e ganchos de comando.","ru":"Наделяет агентов способностью выполнять контекстно-зависимую валидацию с помощью принятия решений на основе LLM и команд bash для детерминированных проверок, интегрируясь без проблем с рабочими процессами через крючки, основанные на подсказках, и командные крючки.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تنفيذ التحقق المُدرك للسياق باستخدام اتخاذ القرارات المدفوع بالـ LLM وأوامر bash للفحص القاطع ، والاندماج بشكل متجانس مع سير العمل عبر مشابك قائمة على الدفعات ومشابك أوامر."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating validation of operations using prompt-based hooks","Enforcing policies with command hooks","Integrating external tools into workflows using hook events"],"zh":["使用提示基的钩子自动化操作的验证","使用命令钩子强制执行策略","使用钩子事件将外部工具集成到工作流中"],"ja":["プロンプトベースのフックを使用した操作の検証の自動化","コマンドフックを使用したポリシーの適用","フックイベントを使用した外部ツールのワークフローへの統合"],"ko":["프롬프트 기반 훅을 사용한 작업의 검증 자동화","명령 훅을 사용한 정책 적용","훅 이벤트를 사용한 외부 도구의 워크플로 통합"],"es":["Automatización de la validación de operaciones mediante ganchos basados en solicitudes","Aplicación de políticas con ganchos de comando","Integración de herramientas externas en flujos de trabajo mediante eventos de ganchos"],"fr":["Automatisation de la validation des opérations à l''aide de crochets basés sur les invites","Application de politiques avec des crochets de commande","Intégration d''outils externes dans les flux de travail via des événements de crochets"],"de":["Automatisierung der Überprüfung von Operationen mithilfe von promptbasierten Hooks","Durchsetzung von Richtlinien mit Befehlshooks","Integration externer Tools in Workflows über Hook-Ereignisse"],"pt":["Automatizar a validação de operações usando ganchos baseados em prompts","Aplicar políticas com ganchos de comando","Integrar ferramentas externas em fluxos de trabalho usando eventos de ganchos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать валидацию операций с помощью крючков, основанных на подсказках","Применять политики с помощью командных крючков","Интегрировать внешние инструменты в рабочие процессы с помощью событий крючков"],"ar":["أتمتة التحقق من العمليات باستخدام مشابك قائمة على الدفعات","فرض السياسات باستخدام مشابك الأوامر","دمج أدوات خارجية في سير العمل باستخدام أحداث المشابك"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code events for triggering hooks","Limited to executing bash commands for deterministic checks"],"zh":["需要Claude Code事件来触发钩子","仅限执行bash命令进行确定性检查"],"ja":["フックをトリガーするためにClaude Codeイベントが必要","決定性チェックを行うためにbashコマンドの実行のみ"],"ko":["훅을 트리거하기 위해 Claude Code 이벤트가 필요","결정적 체크를 위해 bash 명령의 실행만"],"es":["Requiere eventos de Claude Code para activar ganchos","Limitado a la ejecución de comandos bash para comprobaciones deterministas"],"fr":["Nécessite des événements Claude Code pour déclencher des crochets","Limité à l''exécution de commandes bash pour des vérifications déterministes"],"de":["Benötigt Claude Code-Ereignisse zum Auslösen von Hooks","Begrenzt auf die Ausführung von Bash-Befehlen für deterministische Prüfungen"],"pt":["Requer eventos Claude Code para acionar ganchos","Limitado a executar comandos bash para verificações determinísticas"],"ru":["Требует событий Claude Code для вызова крючков","Ограничен выполнением команд bash для детерминированных проверок"],"ar":["يتطلب أحداث Claude Code لتشغيل المشابك","محدود بتنفيذ أوامر bash للفحص القاطع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
