de synchronisation","Compatibilité avec SQLite","Synchronisation en arrière-plan","Réessais en cas d''échec","Prise en charge des applications Expo"],"de":["Synchronisationswarteschlangen-Architektur","Kompatibilität mit SQLite","Hintergrundsynchronisation","Wiederholungsversuche im Falle eines Fehlers","Unterstützung für Expo-Apps"],"pt":["Arquitetura de sincronização baseada em fila","Suporte a aplicativos Expo offline-first","Integração com SQLite e Supabase","Retry on failure para garantir a consistência dos dados","Suporte a operações de criação, leitura, atualização e exclusão"],"ru":["Архитектура синхронизации на основе очереди","Поддержка приложений Expo offline-first","Интеграция с SQLite и Supabase","Повторная попытка при сбое для обеспечения согласованности данных","Поддержка операций создания, чтения, обновления и удаления"],"ar":["هندسة مزامنة قائمة على الطوابير","دعم تطبيقات Expo غير متصل بالإنترنت في erste","التكامل مع SQLite و سوبر بيز","إعادة المحاولة في حالة الفشل لضمان الاتساق البيانات","دعم عمليات الإنشاء والقراءة والتحديث والحذف"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Supabase","离线同步","队列同步","Expo 应用","SQLite","数据同步","Background Worker"],"ja":["Supabase","オフライン同期","キュー同期","Expo アプリ","SQLite","データ同期","Background Worker"],"ko":["Supabase","오프라인 동기화","큐 동기화","Expo 애플리케이션","SQLite","데이터 동기화","Background Worker"],"es":["sincronización offline","Supabase","Expo","SQLite","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","arquitectura de cola de sincronización"],"fr":["synchronisation hors ligne","Supabase","Expo","SQLite","développement d''applications mobiles","architecture de file d''attente de synchronisation"],"de":["Offline-Synchronisation","Supabase","Expo","SQLite","Mobile-App-Entwicklung","Synchronisationswarteschlangen-Architektur"],"pt":["sincronização offline","supabase","sqlite","expo","aplicativos móveis","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","arquitetura de sincronização","fila de sincronização","retry on failure"],"ru":["синхронизация в режиме offline","supabase","sqlite","expo","мобильные приложения","разработка приложений","архитектура синхронизации","очередь синхронизации","повторная попытка при сбое"],"ar":["مزامنة البيانات离线","سوبر بيز","sqlite","expo","تطبيقات الجوال","تنمية التطبيقات","هندسة مزامنة","طابور مزامنة","إعادة المحاولة في حالة الفشل"]}},"owner":"RipKDR","repo":"Steps-to-recovery","repoPath":"RipKDR/Steps-to-recovery","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.406Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"supabase-offline-sync","description":"Implement offline-first sync between Expo SQLite and Supabase with queue-based reconciliation. Use when building offline-first mobile apps, syncing local SQLite with cloud PostgreSQL, handling conflict resolution, implementing background sync, or managing sync queues with retry logic.","bodyPreview":"# Supabase Offline-First Sync\n\nQueue-based sync architecture for offline-first Expo apps using SQLite and Supabase.\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\nLocal Write → SQLite → Sync Queue → Background Worker → Supabase\n                              ↑____________↓ (retry on failure)\n```\n\n## Database Schema\n\n### Sync Queue Table\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE sync_queue (\n  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n  table_name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  record_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n  operation TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (operation IN (''I","body":"# Supabase Offline-First Sync\n\nQueue-based sync architecture for offline-first Expo apps using SQLite and Supabase.\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\nLocal Write → SQLite → Sync Queue → Background Worker → Supabase\n                              ↑____________↓ (retry on failure)\n```\n\n## Database Schema\n\n### Sync Queue Table\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE sync_queue (\n  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n  table_name TEXT NOT NULL,\n  record_id TEXT NOT NULL,\n  operation TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (operation IN (''INSERT'', ''UPDATE'', ''DELETE'')),\n  data TEXT, -- JSON string for INSERT/UPDATE\n  retry_count INTEGER DEFAULT 0,\n  error_message TEXT,\n  created_at INTEGER NOT NULL,\n  processed_at INTEGER\n);\n\nCREATE INDEX idx_sync_queue_created ON sync_queue(created_at);\nCREATE INDEX idx_sync_queue_processed ON sync_queue(processed_at) WHERE processed_at IS NULL;\n```\n\n## Core Implementation\n\n### 1. Queue Operations\n\n```typescript\ninterface SyncQueueItem {\n  id?: number;\n  table_name: string;\n  record_id: string;\n  operation: ''INSERT'' | ''UPDATE'' | ''DELETE'';\n  data?: string;\n  retry_count: number;\n  created_at: number;\n}\n\nasync function enqueueSync(\n  db: SQLiteDatabase,\n  table: string,\n  recordId: string,\n  operation: ''INSERT'' | ''UPDATE'' | ''DELETE'',\n  data?: object,\n): Promise<void> {\n  await db.runAsync(\n    `INSERT INTO sync_queue (table_name, record_id, operation, data, retry_count, created_at)\n     VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, 0, ?)`,\n    table,\n    recordId,\n    operation,\n    data ? JSON.stringify(data) : null,\n    Date.now(),\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Process Queue\n\n```typescript\nasync function processSyncQueue(db: SQLiteDatabase, supabase: SupabaseClient): Promise<void> {\n  const pending = await db.getAllAsync<SyncQueueItem>(\n    `SELECT * FROM sync_queue \n     WHERE processed_at IS NULL AND retry_count < 5\n     ORDER BY created_at ASC\n     LIMIT 50`,\n  );\n\n  // Process DELETEs first to avoid FK conflicts\n  const deletes = pending.filter((p) => p.operation === ''DELETE'');\n  const others = pending.filter((p) => p.operation !== ''DELETE'');\n\n  for (const item of [...deletes, ...others]) {\n    try {\n      await processQueueItem(db, supabase, item);\n    } catch (error) {\n      await markFailed(db, item.id!, error.message);\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Process Individual Item\n\n```typescript\nasync function processQueueItem(\n  db: SQLiteDatabase,\n  supabase: SupabaseClient,\n  item: SyncQueueItem,\n): Promise<void> {\n  const { error } = await supabase.from(item.table_name).upsert(\n    {\n      id: item.record_id,\n      ...(item.data ? JSON.parse(item.data) : {}),\n      updated_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n    },\n    { onConflict: ''id'' },\n  );\n\n  if (error) throw error;\n\n  // Mark as processed\n  await db.runAsync(''UPDATE sync_queue SET processed_at = ? WHERE id = ?'', Date.now(), item.id);\n}\n```\n\n## React Integration\n\n### Sync Context Provider\n\n```typescript\nexport function SyncProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n  const { db } = useDatabase();\n  const { supabase } = useSupabase();\n  const netInfo = useNetInfo();\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!db || !supabase || !netInfo.isConnected) return;\n\n    // Sync on connection restore\n    const interval = setInterval(() => {\n      processSyncQueue(db, supabase);\n    }, 30000); // Every 30 seconds\n\n    return () => clearInterval(interval);\n  }, [db, supabase, netInfo.isConnected]);\n\n  return children;\n}\n```\n\n## Optimistic Updates Pattern\n\n```typescript\nfunction useCreateJournal() {\n  const queryClient = useQueryClient();\n  const { db } = useDatabase();\n\n  return useMutation({\n    mutationFn: async (entry: JournalEntry) => {\n      // 1. Save locally\n      await db.runAsync(\n        ''INSERT INTO journal (id, encrypted_body, created_at) VALUES (?, ?, ?)'',\n        entry.id,\n        await encryptContent(entry.content),\n        entry.created_at,\n      );\n\n      // 2. Queue for sync\n      await enqueueSync(db, ''journal'', entry.id, ''INSERT'', entry);\n\n      return entry;\n    },\n    onSuccess: () => {\n      queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: [''journal''] });\n    },\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## Conflict Resolution\n\nLast-write-wins with server timestamp:\n\n```typescript\nasync function resolveConflict(local: JournalEntry, remote: JournalEntry): Promise<JournalEntry> {\n  const localTime = new Date(local.updated_at).getTime();\n  const remoteTime = new Date(remote.updated_at).getTime();\n\n  return remoteTime > localTime ? remote : local;\n}\n```\n\n## Background Sync (Expo)\n\n```typescript\nimport * as BackgroundFetch from ''expo-background-fetch'';\nimport * as TaskManager from ''expo-task-manager'';\n\nconst SYNC_TASK = ''background-sync'';\n\nTaskManager.defineTask(SYNC_TASK, async () => {\n  const db = await openDatabase();\n  const supabase = createClient();\n\n  try {\n    await processSyncQueue(db, supabase);\n    return BackgroundFetch.BackgroundFetchResult.NewData;\n  } catch {\n    return BackgroundFetch.BackgroundFetchResult.Failed;\n  }\n});\n\nasync function registerBackgroundSync() {\n  await BackgroundFetch.registerTaskAsync(SYNC_TASK, {\n    minimumInterval: 15 * 60, // 15 minutes\n    stopOnTerminate: false,\n    startOnBoot: true,\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## Retry Strategy\n\nExponential backoff for failed items:\n\n```typescript\nasync function markFailed(db: SQLiteDatabase, queueId: number, error: string): Promise<void> {\n  await db.runAsync(\n    `UPDATE sync_queue \n     SET retry_count = retry_count + 1,\n         error_message = ?,\n         created_at = ? -- Delay retry\n     WHERE id = ?`,\n    error,\n    Date.now() + Math.pow(2, retry_count) * 60000, // Exponential backoff\n    queueId,\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Process DELETEs first** - Avoids foreign key constraint errors\n2. **Batch operations** - Process 50 items at a time\n3. **Encrypt before sync** - Never send plaintext sensitive data\n4. **User-scoped sync** - Always filter by `user_id` in Supabase RLS\n5. **Retry limit** - Max 5 retries before manual intervention\n6. **Conflict timestamps** - Use `updated_at` for last-write-wins\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:19:59.071Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Mobile Agents requiring seamless offline data synchronization with Supabase and SQLite","zh":"适用于需要与 Supabase 和 SQLite 实现无缝离线数据同步的移动代理","ja":"Supabase と SQLite とのシームレスなオフラインデータ同期を必要とするモバイルエージェントに最適","ko":"Supabase 및 SQLite와의 무결점 오프라인 데이터 동기화를 요구하는 모바일 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes móviles que requieren una sincronización de datos sin conexión con Supabase y SQLite","fr":"Idéal pour les agents mobiles nécessitant une synchronisation de données hors ligne transparente avec Supabase et SQLite","de":"Ideal für Mobile Agents, die eine nahtlose Offline-Datensynchronisation mit Supabase und SQLite erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Móveis que exigem sincronização de dados offline sem interrupções com Supabase e SQLite","ru":"Идеально для мобильных агентов, требующих бесшовную синхронизацию данных в автономном режиме с Supabase и SQLite","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحمولين الذين يتطلبون تنسيق بيانات غير متصل بسلاسة مع Supabase و SQLite"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement queue-based sync architecture for offline-first Expo apps, leveraging SQLite and Supabase for reliable data synchronization, and automatically retrying failed operations via background workers","zh":"赋予代理实现基于队列的同步架构，以实现离线优先的 Expo 应用，利用 SQLite 和 Supabase 实现可靠的数据同步，并通过后台工作线程自动重试失败的操作","ja":"エージェントに、キューをベースにした同期アーキテクチャを実装することを可能にし、オフライン優先の Expo アプリを実現し、SQLite と Supabase を使用して信頼性の高いデータ同期を実現し、バックグラウンドワーカーを介して失敗した操作を自動的に再試行する","ko":"에이전트가 큐 기반의 동기화 아키텍처를 구현하여 오프라인 우선의 Expo 애플리케이션을 가능하게 하며, SQLite 및 Supabase를 사용하여 신뢰할 수 있는 데이터 동기화를 구현하고, 백그라운드 작업자 통해 실패한 작업을 자동으로 재시도하는 것을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar una arquitectura de sincronización basada en cola para aplicaciones Expo de primera línea de datos sin conexión, aprovechando SQLite y Supabase para una sincronización de datos confiable y volviendo a intentar operaciones fallidas automáticamente a través de trabajadores en segundo plano","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre une architecture de synchronisation basée sur des files d''attente pour des applications Expo de première ligne de données hors ligne, en exploitant SQLite et Supabase pour une synchronisation de données fiable et en réessayant automatiquement les opérations ayant échoué via des travailleurs en arrière-plan","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine warteschlangenbasierte Synchronisationsarchitektur für Offline-First-Expo-Apps umzusetzen, indem SQLite und Supabase für eine zuverlässige Datensynchronisation genutzt und fehlgeschlagene Operationen automatisch über Hintergrundarbeiter neu versucht werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar arquitetura de sincronização baseada em fila para aplicativos Expo offline-first, aproveitando o SQLite e o Supabase para sincronização de dados confiável e repetindo automaticamente operações com falha por meio de trabalhadores em segundo plano","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать архитектуру синхронизации на основе очереди для приложений Expo с приоритетом автономного режима, используя SQLite и Supabase для надежной синхронизации данных и автоматического повторения неудавшихся операций через фоновых работников","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنفيذ هندسة متوافقة مع تقنية التخزين المؤقتة للبيانات للبرامج Expo التي تعمل بالوضع غير المتصل، باستخدام SQLite و Supabase لتنسيق البيانات الموثوقة وإعادة تشغيل العمليات الفاشلة تلقائيًا من خلال عمال الخلفية"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing offline-first data storage using SQLite","Synchronizing local data with Supabase in the background","Handling failed sync operations with automatic retries"],"zh":["使用 SQLite 实现离线优先的数据存储","在后台将本地数据与 Supabase 同步","使用自动重试处理失败的同步操作"],"ja":["SQLite を使用したオフライン優先のデータストレージの実装","バックグラウンドでローカルデータを Supabase と同期する","自動再試行を使用して失敗した同期操作を処理する"],"ko":["SQLite를 사용한 오프라인 우선의 데이터 저장 구현","백그라운드에서 로컬 데이터를 Supabase와 동기화","자동 재시도를 사용하여 실패한 동기화 작업을 처리"],"es":["Implementar el almacenamiento de datos de primera línea de datos sin conexión con SQLite","Sincronizar datos locales con Supabase en segundo plano","Controlar operaciones de sincronización fallidas con reintentos automáticos"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre un stockage de données de première ligne de données hors ligne avec SQLite","Synchroniser les données locales avec Supabase en arrière-plan","Gérer les opérations de synchronisation ayant échoué avec des réessais automatiques"],"de":["Implementierung von Offline-First-Datenspeicherung mit SQLite","Synchronisierung von lokalen Daten mit Supabase im Hintergrund","Behandlung fehlgeschlagener Synchronisationsvorgänge mit automatischen Wiederholungen"],"pt":["Implementação de armazenamento de dados offline-first usando SQLite","Sincronização de dados locais com Supabase em segundo plano","Manipulação de operações de sincronização com falha com repetições automáticas"],"ru":["Реализация хранилища данных в автономном режиме с помощью SQLite","Синхронизация локальных данных с Supabase в фоновом режиме","Обработка неудавшихся операций синхронизации с автоматическим повторением"],"ar":["تنفيذ تخزين البيانات غير المتصل باستخدام SQLite","تنسيق البيانات المحلية مع Supabase في الخلفية","معالجة عمليات التنسيق الفاشلة مع إعادة التشغيل التلقائي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Expo app setup","Dependent on Supabase and SQLite availability","Background worker setup necessary for automatic retries"],"zh":["需要 Expo 应用设置","依赖于 Supabase 和 SQLite 的可用性","需要后台工作线程设置以实现自动重试"],"ja":["Expo アプリのセットアップが必要","Supabase と SQLite の可用性に依存する","自動再試行を実現するためにバックグラウンドワーカーのセットアップが必要"],"ko":["Expo 애플리케이션 설정이 필요","Supabase 및 SQLite의 가용성에 의존","자동 재시도를 위해 백그라운드 작업자 설정이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de la aplicación Expo","Dependiente de la disponibilidad de Supabase y SQLite","Configuración del trabajador en segundo plano necesaria para reintentos automáticos"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration de l''application Expo","Dépend de la disponibilité de Supabase et SQLite","Configuration du travailleur en arrière-plan nécessaire pour les réessais automatiques"],"de":["Benötigt Expo-App-Setup","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit von Supabase und SQLite","Hintergrundarbeiter-Setup erforderlich für automatische Wiederholungen"],"pt":["Exige configuração do aplicativo Expo","Dependente da disponibilidade do Supabase e do SQLite","Configuração do trabalhador em segundo plano necessária para repetições automáticas"],"ru":["Требует настройки приложения Expo","Зависит от доступности Supabase и SQLite","Настройка фоновых работников необходима для автоматического повторения"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق Expo","يعتمد على توافر Supabase و SQLite","إعداد عامل الخلفية ضروري لإعادة التشغيل التلقائي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('AWolf81/memory-lane/memorylane', 'community', 'AWolf81', 'memory-lane', 'AWolf81/memory-lane', 'memorylane', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.406Z', '2026-02-18T03:20:09.261Z', NULL, '{"id":"AWolf81/memory-lane/memorylane","name":"memorylane","description":{"es":"MemoryLane proporciona memoria persistente para Claude, con un ahorro de costos del 84,3%. Aprende automáticamente de los commits de git y cambios de archivos.","fr":"MemoryLane offre une mémoire persistante à Claude, avec une économie de coûts de 84,3 %. Apprend automatiquement à partir des commits Git et des modifications de fichiers.","de":"MemoryLane verleiht Claude ein dauerhaftes Projektgedächtnis, mit 84,3% Kostenersparnis. Lernen Sie automatisch aus Git-Commits und Dateiänderungen.","pt":"O MemoryLane fornece memória persistente para Claude, permitindo que ele lembre de informações importantes em diferentes sessões. Com uma taxa de compressão de contexto de 6,4x, você pode economizar até 84,3% de custos.","ru":"MemoryLane обеспечивает долгосрочную память для Claude, позволяя ему запоминать важную информацию в разных сессиях. С коэффициентом сжатия контекста 6,4, вы можете сэкономить до 84,3% затрат.","ar":"يوفر MemoryLane ذاكرة مستدامة ل Claude، مما يسمح له بتذكر المعلومات المهمة في الجلسات المختلفة. مع نسبة ضغط سياق تبلغ 6.4، يمكنك توفير التكاليف حتى 84.3٪.","en":"MemoryLane gives Claude Code durable project memory by extracting knowledge locally and injecting only what matters. "},"seo":{"title":{"es":"MemoryLane: Memoria duradera para proyectos de Claude","fr":"MemoryLane : Mémoire durable pour les projets Claude","de":"MemoryLane: Dauerhaftes Projektgedächtnis für Claude","pt":"Memória Persistente com MemoryLane","ru":"MemoryLane: Долгосрочная память для Claude","ar":"記憶Lane: ذاكرة مستدامة ل Claude","en":"memorylane"},"description":{"es":"MemoryLane proporciona memoria persistente para Claude, con un ahorro de costos del 84,3%. Aprende automáticamente de los commits de git y cambios de archivos.","fr":"MemoryLane offre une mémoire persistante à Claude, avec une économie de coûts de 84,3 %. Apprend automatiquement à partir des commits Git et des modification...","de":"MemoryLane verleiht Claude ein dauerhaftes Projektgedächtnis, mit 84,3% Kostenersparnis. Lernen Sie automatisch aus Git-Commits und Dateiänderungen.","pt":"O MemoryLane fornece memória persistente para Claude, permitindo que ele lembre de informações importantes em diferentes sessões. Com uma taxa de compressão ...","ru":"MemoryLane обеспечивает долгосрочную память для Claude, позволяя ему запоминать важную информацию в разных сессиях. С коэффициентом сжатия контекста 6,4, вы ...","ar":"يوفر MemoryLane ذاكرة مستدامة ل Claude، مما يسمح له بتذكر المعلومات المهمة في الجلسات المختلفة. مع نسبة ضغط سياق تبلغ 6.4، يمكنك توفير التكاليف حتى 84.3٪.","en":"MemoryLane gives Claude Code durable project memory by extracting knowledge locally and injecting only what matters. "},"definition":{"en":"MemoryLane gives Claude Code durable project memory by extracting knowledge locally and injecting only what matters. "},"features":{"es":["Memoria persistente","Compresión de contexto","Seguimiento de costos","Aprendizaje pasivo","Zero configuración"],"fr":["Mémoire persistante","Compression de contexte","Suivi des coûts","Apprentissage passif","Zero configuration"],"de":["Dauerhaftes Projektgedächtnis","Kontextkomprimierung","Kostenverfolgung","Passives Lernen","Null-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Memória persistente em 4 categorias","Compressão de contexto com taxa de 6,4x","Acompanhamento de custos em tempo real","Aprendizado passivo com commits e alterações de arquivos","Zero configuração necessária"],"ru":["Долгосрочная память в 4 категориях","Сжатие контекста с коэффициентом 6,4","Отслеживание затрат в режиме реального времени","Пассивное обучение с помощью коммитов и изменений файлов","Нет необходимости в конфигурации"],"ar":["ذاكرة مستدامة في 4 فئات","ضغط السياق بنسبة 6.4","تتبع التكاليف في الوقت الفعلي","التعلم السلبي باستخدام التعديلات والملفات","لا يوجد حاجة للتكوين"]},"keywords":{"es":["memoria duradera","proyectos de Claude","ahorro de costos","aprendizaje automático","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["mémoire durable","projets Claude","économie de coûts","apprentissage automatique","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["dauerhaftes Projektgedächtnis","Claude-Projekte","Kostenersparnis","automatisches Lernen","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools"],"pt":["memória persistente","compressão de contexto","aprendizado passivo","Claude","desenvolvimento de software","otimização de custos"],"ru":["долгосрочная память","сжатие контекста","пассивное обучение","Claude","разработка программного обеспечения","оптимизация затрат"],"ar":["ذاكرة مستدامة","ضغط السياق","التعلم السلبي","Claude","تطوير البرمجيات","تحسين التكاليف"]}},"owner":"AWolf81","repo":"memory-lane","repoPath":"AWolf81/memory-lane","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.406Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"memorylane","description":"Zero-config persistent memory for Claude with automatic cost savings. Use when you need to remember project context, reduce API token costs, track learned patterns, manage memories across sessions, or curate/clean up memories. Automatically compresses context 6x and saves 84% on API costs. Keywords: memory, remember, recall, context, cost savings, reduce tokens, learn, patterns, insights, curate, clean up memories, review memories.","bodyPreview":"# MemoryLane Skill\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nMemoryLane provides persistent memory for Claude with proven 84.3% cost savings:\n\n- **Persistent Memory**: Remember information across sessions in 4 categories (patterns, insights, learnings, context)\n- **Context Compression**: 6.4x average compression ratio (20K → 3K tokens)\n- **Cost Tracking**: Real-time API cost savings monitoring\n- **Passive Learning**: Automatically learns from git commits and file changes\n- **Zero Configuration**: Works out of t","body":"# MemoryLane Skill\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nMemoryLane provides persistent memory for Claude with proven 84.3% cost savings:\n\n- **Persistent Memory**: Remember information across sessions in 4 categories (patterns, insights, learnings, context)\n- **Context Compression**: 6.4x average compression ratio (20K → 3K tokens)\n- **Cost Tracking**: Real-time API cost savings monitoring\n- **Passive Learning**: Automatically learns from git commits and file changes\n- **Zero Configuration**: Works out of the box with smart defaults\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate MemoryLane when the user:\n- Asks to \"remember\" something about the project\n- Wants to know \"what you remember\" or \"what you know\"\n- Mentions \"API costs\", \"token usage\", or \"reduce costs\"\n- Asks about \"project patterns\" or \"insights\"\n- Wants to see \"learned\" information\n- Requests \"context compression\" or \"optimize context\"\n- Asks to \"curate memories\", \"clean up memories\", or \"review memory quality\"\n- Mentions memories seem low quality, self-referential, or not useful\n\n## Core Commands\n\n### Check Status\n```bash\npython3 src/cli.py status\n```\nShows memory statistics, category breakdown, and cost savings.\n\n### Recall Memories\n```bash\npython3 src/cli.py recall \"<query>\"\n```\nSearch memories by keyword. Example:\n```bash\npython3 src/cli.py recall \"authentication\"\n```\n\n### View Insights\n```bash\npython3 src/cli.py insights\n```\nDisplay learned project insights (high-value patterns).\n\n### View Cost Savings\n```bash\npython3 src/cli.py costs\n```\nDetailed breakdown of token savings and cost reduction.\n\n### Configure Settings\n```bash\n# Get a setting\npython3 src/cli.py config get memory.max_context_tokens\n\n# Set a setting\npython3 src/cli.py config set memory.max_context_tokens 3000\n\n# List all settings\npython3 src/cli.py config list\n```\n\n### Export Memories as Markdown\n```bash\npython3 src/cli.py export-markdown --category patterns --output context.md\n```\n\n### Backup/Restore\n```bash\n# Create backup\npython3 src/cli.py backup --output backup.json\n\n# Restore from backup\npython3 src/cli.py restore backup.json\n```\n\n### Reset Memories\n```bash\npython3 src/cli.py reset --force\n```\n\n## Individual Memory Management\n\n### Get a Memory\n```bash\npython3 src/cli.py memory get <id>\n```\nExample: `python3 src/cli.py memory get lear-009`\n\n### Delete a Memory\n```bash\npython3 src/cli.py memory delete <id>\n```\nExample: `python3 src/cli.py memory delete lear-009`\n\n### Update a Memory\n```bash\npython3 src/cli.py memory update <id> --content \"New content\"\n```\nExample: `python3 src/cli.py memory update patt-001 --content \"Chose Unix sockets for lower latency\"`\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Always use these commands instead of editing memories.json directly.\n\n## Batch Curation Commands\n\n### Check Curation Status\n```bash\npython3 src/cli.py curate\n```\nShows if curation is needed based on memory count and age.\n\n### List Memories for Review\n```bash\npython3 src/cli.py curate --list\n```\nShows all uncurated memories with their IDs and content.\n\n### Apply Curation Decisions\n```bash\npython3 src/cli.py curate --apply ''<JSON>''\n```\nApply curation decisions. JSON format:\n```json\n{\n  \"decisions\": [\n    {\"id\": \"patt-001\", \"action\": \"KEEP\"},\n    {\"id\": \"lear-002\", \"action\": \"DELETE\", \"reason\": \"off-topic\"},\n    {\"id\": \"insi-003\", \"action\": \"REWRITE\", \"new_content\": \"Improved content\"}\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Proactive Memory Quality Check\n**IMPORTANT**: When you see MemoryLane context injected via `# Project Context (from MemoryLane)` in system messages, quickly scan for poor quality memories:\n\nSigns of poor quality memories that warrant curation:\n- Status summaries: \"Based on git status...\", \"Current status of...\"\n- Meta/self-referential: \"The curation should...\", \"The hook detected...\"\n- Debug fragments: \"Let me check...\", \"Looking at the debug log...\"\n- Incomplete: Sentences ending with \"...\" or starting mid-thought\n- Duplicates of CLAUDE.md content\n\n**If you detect 2+ poor quality memories in the injected context**, proactively ask:\n> \"I notice some of the injected memories appear to be low quality (status summaries, debug notes). Would you like me to clean these up?\"\n\nIf user confirms, proceed with LLM-assisted curation below.\n\n### LLM-Assisted Curation\nWhen the user requests curation OR confirms after you detect poor memories:\n\n1. List and evaluate all memories:\n```bash\npython3 src/cli.py curate --list\n```\n\n2. Evaluate each memory for:\n   - **Usefulness**: Is this actionable knowledge or just meta/debug info?\n   - **Duplication**: Is this already covered by CLAUDE.md or another memory?\n   - **Quality**: Is it complete, clear, and well-formed?\n   - **Relevance**: Would this help with future development work?\n\n3. Apply decisions (DELETE/KEEP/REWRITE):\n```bash\npython3 src/cli.py curate --apply ''<JSON decisions>''\n```\n\n**DELETE these types:**\n- Meta observations about the current session\n- Debug notes and action statements\n- Status summaries\n- Duplicates of CLAUDE.md content\n- Incomplete fragments\n\n**KEEP these types:**\n- Architectural decisions with rationale\n- Bug fixes with solutions\n- Actual project context (not about MemoryLane itself)\n- Configuration knowledge\n\nExample evaluation:\n- ❌ \"Based on git status, here''s the current status...\" → DELETE (status summary)\n- ❌ \"Let me check the debug log...\" → DELETE (debug action)\n- ❌ \"The Stop hook only triggers when...\" → DELETE if in CLAUDE.md\n- ✅ \"stdio:ignore hiding Python errors - fixed by capturing stderr\" → KEEP (bug fix)\n- ✅ \"Chose Unix sockets over HTTP for 10x lower latency\" → KEEP (decision)\n\n## Learning Commands\n\n### Initial Learning\n```bash\npython3 src/learner.py initial\n```\nPerform initial learning from git history (last 20 commits) and workspace structure.\n\n### Scan Workspace\n```bash\npython3 src/learner.py scan\n```\nScan and index all Python/JS/TS files in the workspace.\n\n### Analyze Git History\n```bash\npython3 src/learner.py git\n```\nExtract patterns from recent git commits.\n\n### Continuous Learning (Background)\n```bash\npython3 src/learner.py watch\n```\nWatch for file changes and git commits continuously (runs until stopped).\n\n## Server Commands\n\n### Start Sidecar Server\n```bash\npython3 src/server.py start\n```\nStart background server with Unix socket IPC (for low-latency memory operations).\n\n### Check Server Status\n```bash\npython3 src/server.py status\n```\n\n### Stop Server\n```bash\npython3 src/server.py stop\n```\n\n## Testing Commands\n\n### Run All Tests\n```bash\npytest\n```\n\n### Validate Cost Savings\n```bash\npytest tests/test_cost_savings.py -v -s\n```\nRuns comprehensive cost validation tests (shows 84.3% savings proof).\n\n### Test Memory Store\n```bash\npytest tests/test_memory_store.py -v\n```\n\n## Usage Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Remember Important Information\nWhen the user says: \"Remember that this project uses PostgreSQL with SSL mode required\"\n\n```bash\n# (You would typically use the Python API, but for CLI:)\npython3 -c \"\nimport sys; sys.path.insert(0, ''src'')\nfrom memory_store import MemoryStore\nstore = MemoryStore(''.memorylane/memories.json'')\nstore.add_memory(''context'', ''Project uses PostgreSQL with SSL mode required'', ''manual'', 0.9)\nprint(''✓ Remembered'')\n\"\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Recall Project Knowledge\nWhen the user asks: \"What do you know about our database setup?\"\n\n```bash\npython3 src/cli.py recall \"database\"\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Show Cost Savings\nWhen the user asks: \"How much money has MemoryLane saved me?\"\n\n```bash\npython3 src/cli.py costs\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Learn from Project History\nWhen starting work on a project:\n\n```bash\npython3 src/learner.py initial\npython3 src/cli.py insights\n```\n\n## Integration with Workflows\n\n### Daily Development Workflow\n```bash\n# Morning: Start server and check status\npython3 src/server.py start\npython3 src/cli.py status\n\n# During work: MemoryLane learns passively\n# (no action needed - watches git commits and file changes)\n\n# Evening: Check what was learned\npython3 src/cli.py insights\npython3 src/cli.py costs\n```\n\n### Project Onboarding Workflow\n```bash\n# Step 1: Initial learning\npython3 src/learner.py initial\n\n# Step 2: Review learned patterns\npython3 src/cli.py recall \"primary language\"\npython3 src/cli.py insights\n\n# Step 3: Export context for sharing\npython3 src/cli.py export-markdown --output project-context.md\n```\n\n## Configuration Options\n\nKey settings in `.memorylane/config.json`:\n\n- `memory.max_context_tokens`: Target token count for compression (default: 2000)\n- `memory.compression_ratio_target`: Target compression ratio (default: 7.0x)\n- `context_rot.model_context_tokens`: Advertised model window for context rot guard (default: 200000)\n- `context_rot.safe_fraction`: Fraction of model window allowed for prompt + injected context (default: 0.5)\n- `context_rot.reserve_tokens`: Buffer reserved for assistant response (default: 1200)\n- `learning.watch_file_changes`: Enable file watching (default: true)\n- `learning.watch_git_commits`: Learn from commits (default: true)\n- `privacy.exclude_patterns`: Files to ignore (default: *.env, secrets/, etc.)\n\n## Performance Metrics\n\nValidated through comprehensive testing:\n\n- **Cost Savings**: 84.3% (baseline $17.25/week → $2.70/week)\n- **Compression Ratio**: 6.4x average (2.3M tokens → 360K tokens)\n- **Retrieval Latency**: <100ms (target, server not benchmarked yet)\n- **Memory Quality**: Relevance scoring with automatic pruning\n\n## Important Notes\n\n1. **Privacy**: All data stored locally in `.memorylane/` directory\n2. **No Dependencies**: Pure Python 3.8+ (no external packages needed for production)\n3. **Automatic Exclusions**: Respects `.env`, `secrets/`, and other sensitive patterns\n4. **Backup Before Reset**: Always creates backup before destructive operations\n5. **Server Optional**: CLI works standalone; server adds performance for frequent operations\n\n## Example Conversation Flow\n\n**User**: \"Remember that our API uses JWT tokens with 24-hour expiration\"\n\n**You**: Let me store that in MemoryLane''s context.\n```bash\npython3 -c \"...\"  # Add to memory\n```\n✓ Remembered in context category with 0.9 relevance.\n\n**User**: \"What do you know about our authentication?\"\n\n**You**: Let me recall what I know about authentication.\n```bash\npython3 src/cli.py recall \"authentication\"\n```\nFound 2 memories:\n1. [context] API uses JWT tokens with 24-hour expiration ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n2. [patterns] Project uses authentication middleware ⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nBased on what I''ve learned, your project uses JWT tokens for authentication with 24-hour expiration...\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Server won''t start**: Check if already running with `python3 src/server.py status`\n\n**No memories found**: Run initial learning with `python3 src/learner.py initial`\n\n**Cost tracking shows $0**: Metrics file not initialized yet (will populate after server usage)\n\n**Tests failing**: Install dev dependencies with `pip install -r requirements-dev.txt`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:20:09.261Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Claude Code Agents needing durable project memory and cost optimization through context compression and passive learning","zh":"非常适合需要持久项目内存和通过上下文压缩以及被动学习实现成本优化的 Claude Code Agents","ja":"Claude Code エージェントが耐久性のあるプロジェクトメモリとコンテキスト圧縮およびパッシブ学習によるコスト最適化を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"클라우드 코드 에이전트가 지속적인 프로젝트 메모리와 컨텍스트 압축 및 수동 학습을 통한 비용 최적화를 필요로 할 때 완벽","es":"Perfecto para los agentes de Claude Code que necesitan una memoria de proyecto duradera y optimización de costos a través de la compresión de contexto y el aprendizaje pasivo","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Claude Code ayant besoin d''une mémoire de projet durable et d''une optimisation des coûts grâce à la compression de contexte et à l''apprentissage passif","de":"Perfekt für Claude Code-Agents, die eine langlebige Projektmemorie und Kosteneinsparungen durch Kontextkomprimierung und passives Lernen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Código Claude que necessitam de memória de projeto durável e otimização de custos por meio da compressão de contexto e aprendizado passivo","ru":"Идеально для агентов Claude Code, которым требуется прочная память проекта и оптимизация затрат за счет сжатия контекста и пассивного обучения","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء كلود كود الذين يحتاجون إلى ذاكرة مشروع متينة وتحسين التكلفة من خلال ضغط السياق والتعلم السلبي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to retain persistent memory across sessions, leveraging context compression for a 6.4x average compression ratio and real-time API cost savings monitoring through protocols like git commits and file changes","zh":"赋予代理在会话之间保留持久内存的能力，利用上下文压缩实现平均 6.4 倍的压缩比，并通过 git 提交和文件更改等协议实现实时 API 成本节省监控","ja":"セッション間で持続的なメモリを保持するエージェントを可能にし、コンテキスト圧縮を利用して平均 6.4 倍の圧縮率を実現し、git コミットやファイル変更などのプロトコルを介してリアルタイムの API コスト節約監視を行う","ko":"에이전트가 세션 간에 지속적인 메모리를 유지할 수 있도록 하며, 컨텍스트 압축을 이용하여 평균 6.4 배의 압축 비율을 달성하고, git 커밋 및 파일 변경 등의 프로토콜을 통해 실시간 API 비용 절감 모니터링을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a retener la memoria persistente entre sesiones, aprovechando la compresión de contexto para una relación de compresión promedio de 6,4x y seguimiento de ahorros de costos de API en tiempo real a través de protocolos como confirmaciones de git y cambios de archivos","fr":"Permet aux agents de conserver une mémoire persistante entre les sessions, en exploitant la compression de contexte pour un ratio de compression moyen de 6,4x et un suivi en temps réel des économies de coûts d''API via des protocoles tels que les validations git et les modifications de fichiers","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, eine beständige Speichermemorie über Sitzungen hinweg beizubehalten, indem sie die Kontextkomprimierung für ein durchschnittliches Komprimierungsverhältnis von 6,4x und eine Echtzeitüberwachung der API-Kosteneinsparungen durch Protokolle wie git-Commits und Dateiänderungen nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a reter memória persistente entre sessões, aproveitando a compressão de contexto para uma média de 6,4x de relação de compressão e monitoramento de economia de custos de API em tempo real por meio de protocolos como commits git e alterações de arquivos","ru":"Позволяет агентам сохранять постоянную память между сессиями, используя сжатие контекста для среднего коэффициента сжатия 6,4 и мониторинг экономии затрат API в реальном времени через протоколы, такие как коммиты git и изменения файлов","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من الاحتفاظ بذاكرة مستمرة عبر الجلسات، واستخدام ضغط السياق لتحقيق متوسط نسبة ضغط 6.4x ومراقبة توفير تكاليف واجهة برمجة التطبيقات في الوقت الفعلي من خلال بروتوكولات مثل التعهدات Git وتغييرات الملفات"},"useCases":{"en":["Remembering key patterns and insights across project sessions","Automatically learning from git commits and file changes for improved context","Tracking and optimizing API costs in real-time for better resource allocation"],"zh":["在项目会话之间记住关键模式和见解","自动从 git 提交和文件更改中学习以提高上下文","实时跟踪和优化 API 成本以实现更好的资源分配"],"ja":["セッション間で重要なパターンとインサイトを覚える","git コミットやファイル変更から自動的に学習してコンテキストを改善する","リアルタイムで API コストを追跡して最適化し、より良いリソース割り当てを実現する"],"ko":["프로젝트 세션 간에 주요 패턴과 인사이트를 기억","git 커밋 및 파일 변경에서 자동으로 학습하여 컨텍스트를 개선","실시간으로 API 비용을 추적 및 최적화하여 더 나은 리소스 할당을 제공"],"es":["Recordar patrones e ideas clave en sesiones de proyecto","Aprender automáticamente de confirmaciones de git y cambios de archivos para mejorar el contexto","Seguimiento y optimización de costos de API en tiempo real para una mejor asignación de recursos"],"fr":["Mémoriser les modèles et les idées clés lors des sessions de projet","Apprendre automatiquement à partir des validations git et des modifications de fichiers pour améliorer le contexte","Suivi et optimisation des coûts d''API en temps réel pour une meilleure allocation des ressources"],"de":["Wichtige Muster und Erkenntnisse über Projektsitzungen hinweg merken","Automatisches Lernen aus git-Commits und Dateiänderungen zur Verbesserung des Kontexts","Verfolgung und Optimierung der API-Kosten in Echtzeit für eine bessere Ressourcenzuweisung"],"pt":["Lembrar padrões e insights-chave em todo o projeto","Aprender automaticamente com commits git e alterações de arquivos para melhorar o contexto","Rastrear e otimizar custos de API em tempo real para melhor alocação de recursos"],"ru":["Помнить ключевые закономерности и идеи на протяжении всего проекта","Автоматически учиться на коммитах git и изменениях файлов для улучшения контекста","Отслеживать и оптимизировать затраты API в реальном времени для лучшего распределения ресурсов"],"ar":["تذكر الأنماط والمعلومات الرئيسية في جميع أنحاء المشروع","التعلم التلقائي من التعهدات Git وتغييرات الملفات لتحسين السياق","تتبع وتحسين تكاليف واجهة برمجة التطبيقات في الوقت الفعلي من أجل تحسين تخصيص الموارد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with Claude Code","Dependent on local knowledge extraction capabilities"],"zh":["需要与 Claude Code 集成","依赖于本地知识提取能力"],"ja":["Claude Code との統合が必要","ローカルの知識抽出能力に依存"],"ko":["클라우드 코드와의 통합이 필요","로컬 지식 추출 능력에 의존"],"es":["Requiere integración con Claude Code","Dependiente de las capacidades de extracción de conocimientos locales"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec Claude Code","Dépend des capacités d''extraction de connaissances locales"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit Claude Code","Abhängig von den lokalen Wissensextraktionsfähigkeiten"],"pt":["Requer integração com Claude Code","Dependente de capacidades de extração de conhecimento local"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с Claude Code","Зависит от возможностей локальной экстракции зна