ative","ru":"Создание нового конечного пункта API с TypeScript и React...","ar":"إنشاء نقطة نهاية جديدة ل API باستخدام TypeScript و React ...","en":"new-endpoint"},"description":{"zh":"创建新端点，包括创建所需的文件和模板，用于全面金融跟踪monorepo","ja":"新しいエンドポイントを作成し、包括的な金融追跡monorepo用の必要なファイルとテンプレートを作成します","ko":"새로운 엔드포인트를 생성하고 종합 금융 추적 monorepo용 필요한 파일과 템플릿을 생성합니다","es":"El nuevo punto de conexión API es una característica que permite a los desarrolladores crear fácilmente nuevos puntos de conexión para su aplicación de segui...","fr":"La nouvelle terminaison d''API est une fonctionnalité qui permet aux développeurs de créer facilement de nouvelles terminaisons pour leur application de suivi...","de":"Der neue API-Endpunkt ist eine Funktion, die es Entwicklern ermöglicht, neue Endpunkte für ihre Finanzverfolgungsanwendung einfach zu erstellen","pt":"O novo endpoint é um recurso de rastreamento financeiro que utiliza TypeScript e React Native. Ele fornece uma estrutura de código para criar endpoints de API.","ru":"Новый конечный пункт - это функция отслеживания финансов, которая использует TypeScript и React Native. Он предоставляет структуру кода для создания конечных...","ar":"النقطة النهاية الجديدة هي ميزة لتتبع المالية التي تستخدم TypeScript و React Native. توفر هيكلاً للكود لإنشاء نقاط نهاية API.","en":"Comprehensive financial tracking monorepo with TypeScript API and React Native mobile app"},"definition":{"en":"Comprehensive financial tracking monorepo with TypeScript API and React Native mobile app"},"features":{"zh":["创建所需的文件和模板","使用TypeScript API和React Native移动应用","全面金融跟踪monorepo","创建新端点","请求处理","路由定义"],"ja":["必要なファイルとテンプレートを作成","TypeScript APIとReact Nativeモバイルアプリを使用","包括的な金融追跡monorepo","新しいエンドポイントを作成","リクエスト処理","ルート定義"],"ko":[" 필요한 파일과 템플릿을 생성","TypeScript API와 React Native 모바일 애플리케이션을 사용","종합 금융 추적 monorepo","새로운 엔드포인트를 생성","요청 처리","라우팅 정의"],"es":["Crear nuevos puntos de conexión API con TypeScript","Definir rutas con React Native","Crear modelos de datos personalizados","Controlar solicitudes y respuestas con Express","Integrar con aplicaciones de seguimiento financiero"],"fr":["Créer de nouvelles terminaisons d''API avec TypeScript","Définir des routes avec React Native","Créer des modèles de données personnalisés","Contrôler les requêtes et les réponses avec Express","Intégrer avec des applications de suivi financier"],"de":["Erstellen von neuen API-Endpunkten mit TypeScript","Definieren von Routen mit React Native","Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Datenmodellen","Steuerung von Anfragen und Antworten mit Express","Integration mit Finanzverfolgungsanwendungen"],"pt":["Criação de endpoints de API com TypeScript","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis com React Native","Estrutura de código para aplicativos financeiros","Criação de arquivos necessários para endpoints de API","Suporte a solicitações e respostas HTTP"],"ru":["Создание конечных пунктов API с помощью TypeScript","Разработка мобильных приложений с помощью React Native","Структура кода для финансовых приложений","Создание необходимых файлов для конечных пунктов API","Поддержка запросов и ответов HTTP"],"ar":["إنشاء نقاط نهاية API باستخدام TypeScript","تطوير تطبيقات移动 باستخدام React Native","هيكل الكود لتطبيقات مالية","إنشاء الملفات الضرورية لنقاط نهاية API","دعم الطلبات والاستجابات HTTP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["新端点","全面金融跟踪monorepo","TypeScript API","React Native移动应用","请求处理","路由定义","创建新端点","金融追踪"],"ja":["新しいエンドポイント","包括的な金融追跡monorepo","TypeScript API","React Nativeモバイルアプリ","リクエスト処理","ルート定義","新しいエンドポイントを作成","金融追跡"],"ko":["새로운 엔드포인트","종합 금융 추적 monorepo","TypeScript API","React Native 모바일 애플리케이션","요청 처리","라우팅 정의","새로운 엔드포인트를 생성","금융 추적"],"es":["nuevo punto de conexión API","TypeScript","React Native","seguimiento financiero","API","desarrollo de aplicaciones","programación","tecnología"],"fr":["nouvelle terminaison d''API","TypeScript","React Native","suivi financier","API","développement d''applications","programmation","technologie"],"de":["neuer API-Endpunkt","TypeScript","React Native","Finanzverfolgung","API","Anwendungsentwicklung","Programmierung","Technologie"],"pt":["novo endpoint","TypeScript","React Native","aplicativos financeiros","API","desenvolvimento de software","programação","tecnologia"],"ru":["новый конечный пункт","TypeScript","React Native","финансовые приложения","API","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование","технологии"],"ar":["نقطة نهاية جديدة","TypeScript","React Native","تطبيقات مالية","API","تطوير البرمجيات","برمجة","تكنولوجيا"]}},"owner":"pabloibanezcom","repo":"fintrak","repoPath":"pabloibanezcom/fintrak","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.406Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"new-endpoint","description":"Create a new API endpoint with controller, route, and Swagger documentation","bodyPreview":"# Create New API Endpoint\n\nWhen the user asks to create a new endpoint, create all required files:\n\n## File Structure\n\n```\napps/api/src/\n├── controllers/FeatureController.ts  # Request handling\n├── routes/featureRoutes.ts           # Route definitions\n└── models/FeatureModel.ts            # (if new data model needed)\n```\n\n## Templates\n\n### Controller (controllers/FeatureController.ts)\n\n```typescript\nimport type { Request, Response } from ''express'';\n\nexport const FeatureController = {\n  async get","body":"# Create New API Endpoint\n\nWhen the user asks to create a new endpoint, create all required files:\n\n## File Structure\n\n```\napps/api/src/\n├── controllers/FeatureController.ts  # Request handling\n├── routes/featureRoutes.ts           # Route definitions\n└── models/FeatureModel.ts            # (if new data model needed)\n```\n\n## Templates\n\n### Controller (controllers/FeatureController.ts)\n\n```typescript\nimport type { Request, Response } from ''express'';\n\nexport const FeatureController = {\n  async getAll(req: Request, res: Response) {\n    try {\n      const userId = req.user?.id;\n      // Implementation\n      res.json({ data: [] });\n    } catch (error) {\n      console.error(''FeatureController.getAll error:'', error);\n      res.status(500).json({ error: ''Internal server error'' });\n    }\n  },\n\n  async getById(req: Request, res: Response) {\n    try {\n      const { id } = req.params;\n      // Implementation\n      res.json({ data: null });\n    } catch (error) {\n      console.error(''FeatureController.getById error:'', error);\n      res.status(500).json({ error: ''Internal server error'' });\n    }\n  },\n\n  async create(req: Request, res: Response) {\n    try {\n      const userId = req.user?.id;\n      const data = req.body;\n      // Implementation\n      res.status(201).json({ data: null });\n    } catch (error) {\n      console.error(''FeatureController.create error:'', error);\n      res.status(500).json({ error: ''Internal server error'' });\n    }\n  },\n\n  async update(req: Request, res: Response) {\n    try {\n      const { id } = req.params;\n      const data = req.body;\n      // Implementation\n      res.json({ data: null });\n    } catch (error) {\n      console.error(''FeatureController.update error:'', error);\n      res.status(500).json({ error: ''Internal server error'' });\n    }\n  },\n\n  async delete(req: Request, res: Response) {\n    try {\n      const { id } = req.params;\n      // Implementation\n      res.status(204).send();\n    } catch (error) {\n      console.error(''FeatureController.delete error:'', error);\n      res.status(500).json({ error: ''Internal server error'' });\n    }\n  },\n};\n```\n\n### Routes (routes/featureRoutes.ts)\n\n```typescript\nimport { Router } from ''express'';\nimport { FeatureController } from ''../controllers/FeatureController'';\nimport { authenticate } from ''../middleware/auth'';\n\nconst router = Router();\n\n/**\n * @swagger\n * /api/features:\n *   get:\n *     summary: Get all features\n *     tags: [Features]\n *     security:\n *       - bearerAuth: []\n *     responses:\n *       200:\n *         description: List of features\n */\nrouter.get(''/'', authenticate, FeatureController.getAll);\n\n/**\n * @swagger\n * /api/features/{id}:\n *   get:\n *     summary: Get feature by ID\n *     tags: [Features]\n *     security:\n *       - bearerAuth: []\n *     parameters:\n *       - in: path\n *         name: id\n *         required: true\n *         schema:\n *           type: string\n *     responses:\n *       200:\n *         description: Feature details\n */\nrouter.get(''/:id'', authenticate, FeatureController.getById);\n\n/**\n * @swagger\n * /api/features:\n *   post:\n *     summary: Create a new feature\n *     tags: [Features]\n *     security:\n *       - bearerAuth: []\n *     responses:\n *       201:\n *         description: Feature created\n */\nrouter.post(''/'', authenticate, FeatureController.create);\n\n/**\n * @swagger\n * /api/features/{id}:\n *   put:\n *     summary: Update a feature\n *     tags: [Features]\n *     security:\n *       - bearerAuth: []\n *     parameters:\n *       - in: path\n *         name: id\n *         required: true\n *         schema:\n *           type: string\n *     responses:\n *       200:\n *         description: Feature updated\n */\nrouter.put(''/:id'', authenticate, FeatureController.update);\n\n/**\n * @swagger\n * /api/features/{id}:\n *   delete:\n *     summary: Delete a feature\n *     tags: [Features]\n *     security:\n *       - bearerAuth: []\n *     parameters:\n *       - in: path\n *         name: id\n *         required: true\n *         schema:\n *           type: string\n *     responses:\n *       204:\n *         description: Feature deleted\n */\nrouter.delete(''/:id'', authenticate, FeatureController.delete);\n\nexport default router;\n```\n\n## After Creation\n\n1. Register route in `apps/api/src/index.ts`:\n   ```typescript\n   import featureRoutes from ''./routes/featureRoutes'';\n   app.use(''/api/features'', featureRoutes);\n   ```\n\n2. Verify Swagger docs at `http://localhost:3000/api/docs`\n\n3. Run `pnpm lint-fix` in the api package\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL: Update Postman Collection\n\n**MANDATORY STEP**: Whenever you create, modify, or delete ANY API endpoint, you **MUST** update the Postman collection file:\n\n**File Location**: `apps/api/Fintrak-API.postman_collection.json`\n\n### What to Update\n\nFor **new endpoints**:\n- Add a new request item to the appropriate folder/category\n- Include request method, URL, headers, and body examples\n- Add response examples with status codes\n- Include descriptions for the endpoint\n\nFor **modified endpoints**:\n- Update request parameters, body schema, or headers\n- Update response examples if the response structure changed\n- Update descriptions if functionality changed\n\nFor **deleted endpoints**:\n- Remove the corresponding request item from the collection\n\n### Postman Request Template\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Endpoint Name\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"method\": \"GET|POST|PUT|DELETE\",\n    \"header\": [\n      {\n        \"key\": \"Authorization\",\n        \"value\": \"Bearer {{auth_token}}\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"key\": \"Content-Type\",\n        \"value\": \"application/json\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"body\": {\n      \"mode\": \"raw\",\n      \"raw\": \"{\\\"example\\\": \\\"data\\\"}\"\n    },\n    \"url\": {\n      \"raw\": \"{{rootUrl}}/api/endpoint\",\n      \"host\": [\"{{rootUrl}}\"],\n      \"path\": [\"api\", \"endpoint\"]\n    },\n    \"description\": \"Description of what this endpoint does\"\n  },\n  \"response\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Success\",\n      \"originalRequest\": { /* same as request */ },\n      \"status\": \"OK\",\n      \"code\": 200,\n      \"_postman_previewlanguage\": \"json\",\n      \"header\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"Content-Type\",\n          \"value\": \"application/json\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"cookie\": [],\n      \"body\": \"{\\\"example\\\": \\\"response\\\"}\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Important Notes\n\n- The Postman collection serves as the **primary API documentation** for external consumers\n- Keeping it updated ensures developers and testers have accurate API references\n- Always test the updated Postman requests to verify they work correctly\n- Use environment variables like `{{rootUrl}}` and `{{auth_token}}` for flexibility\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:21:21.893Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing automated API endpoint creation with TypeScript and React Native","zh":"适合需要自动化API端点创建的全栈代理，使用TypeScript和React Native","ja":"TypeScriptとReact Nativeを使用した自動APIエンドポイント作成が必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"TypeScript와 React Native를 사용하여 자동 API 엔드포인트 생성이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Full Stack que necesitan la creación automática de puntos de conexión de API con TypeScript y React Native","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin de la création automatique de points de terminaison d''API avec TypeScript et React Native","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die die automatisierte Erstellung von API-Endpunkten mit TypeScript und React Native benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de criação automática de endpoints de API com TypeScript e React Native","ru":"Идеально подходит для полнофункциональных агентов, которым требуется автоматизированное создание конечных точек API с помощью TypeScript и React Native","ar":"مثالي لعميل البرمجيات الكامل الذي يحتاج إلى إنشاء نقطة نهاية واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الآلي مع TypeScript و React Native"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive API endpoints with Express.js, complete with controller templates, route definitions, and data models, utilizing TypeScript for robust typing and React Native for seamless mobile app integration","zh":"赋予代理生成全面API端点的能力，包括使用TypeScript进行强大的类型检查和使用React Native进行无缝的移动应用集成的Express.js控制器模板、路由定义和数据模型","ja":"Express.jsのコントローラーテンプレート、ルート定義、データモデルを使用して、TypeScriptによる強力な型付けとReact Nativeによるシームレスなモバイルアプリ統合で包括的なAPIエンドポイントを生成するエージェントの能力を付与","ko":"에이전트가 Express.js의 컨트롤러 템플릿, 라우트 정의, 데이터 모델을 사용하여 강력한 타이핑을 위한 TypeScript와 모바일 앱 통합을 위한 React Native로 완벽한 API 엔드포인트를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar puntos de conexión de API completos con Express.js, completos con plantillas de controladores, definiciones de rutas y modelos de datos, utilizando TypeScript para una tipificación robusta y React Native para una integración de aplicaciones móviles sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des points de terminaison d''API complets avec Express.js, complets avec des modèles de contrôleurs, des définitions de routes et des modèles de données, en utilisant TypeScript pour une typage robuste et React Native pour une intégration d''applications mobiles sans problème","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, umfassende API-Endpunkte mit Express.js zu generieren, komplett mit Controller-Vorlagen, Routendefinitionen und Datenmodellen, unter Verwendung von TypeScript für robustes Typisieren und React Native für nahtlose mobile App-Integration","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar pontos finais de API abrangentes com Express.js, completo com modelos de controlador, definições de rota e modelos de dados, utilizando TypeScript para digitação robusta e React Native para integração de aplicativos móveis sem problemas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать полные конечные точки API с Express.js, полные шаблонами контроллера, определениями маршрутов и моделями данных, используя TypeScript для прочной типизации и React Native для бесшовной интеграции мобильных приложений","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء نقاط نهاية واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الشاملة مع Express.js، و كاملة مع قوالب التحكم و تعريفات المسار و نماذج البيانات، و باستخدام TypeScript للتنميط القوي و React Native للاندماج السلس للهواتف المحمولة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating API endpoint creation for new features","Generating boilerplate code for Express.js controllers and routes","Creating data models for new API endpoints with TypeScript"],"zh":["自动化新功能的API端点创建","为Express.js控制器和路由生成样板代码","使用TypeScript为新API端点创建数据模型"],"ja":["新機能のAPIエンドポイントの自動作成","Express.jsコントローラーとルートのボイラープレートコードの生成","新しいAPIエンドポイントのデータモデルを作成するためにTypeScriptを使用"],"ko":["새로운 기능의 API 엔드포인트 자동 생성","Express.js 컨트롤러와 라우트의 보일러 플레이트 코드 생성","새로운 API 엔드포인트에 대한 데이터 모델 생성을 위해 TypeScript 사용"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de puntos de conexión de API para nuevas características","Generación de código de caldera para controladores y rutas de Express.js","Creación de modelos de datos para nuevos puntos de conexión de API con TypeScript"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de points de terminaison d''API pour de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Génération de code de base pour les contrôleurs et les routes Express.js","Création de modèles de données pour de nouveaux points de terminaison d''API avec TypeScript"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von API-Endpunkten für neue Funktionen","Generierung von Boilerplate-Code für Express.js-Controller und -Routen","Erstellung von Datenmodellen für neue API-Endpunkte mit TypeScript"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de pontos finais de API para recursos novos","Gerar código de inicialização para controladores e rotas do Express.js","Criar modelos de dados para novos pontos finais de API com TypeScript"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание конечных точек API для новых функций","Генерировать код-заготовку для контроллеров и маршрутов Express.js","Создавать модели данных для новых конечных точек API с помощью TypeScript"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء نقاط نهاية واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للسمات الجديدة","إنشاء شفرة قوالب لمراقبي و مسارات Express.js","إنشاء نماذج بيانات لنقاط نهاية واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الجديدة مع TypeScript"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing Express.js project setup","Limited to TypeScript and React Native technologies","File system access needed for generating endpoint files"],"zh":["需要现有的Express.js项目设置","仅限于TypeScript和React Native技术","需要文件系统访问权限以生成端点文件"],"ja":["既存のExpress.jsプロジェクトの設定が必要","TypeScriptとReact Native技術のみに限定","エンドポイントファイルを生成するためにファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["既存의 Express.js 프로젝트 설정이 필요","TypeScript와 React Native 기술만으로 제한","엔드포인트 파일을 생성하기 위해 파일 시스템에 대한 접근 권한이 필요"],"es":["Requiere una configuración de proyecto existente de Express.js","Limitado a las tecnologías TypeScript y React Native","Se necesita acceso al sistema de archivos para generar archivos de puntos de conexión"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet Express.js existante","Limité aux technologies TypeScript et React Native","L''accès au système de fichiers est nécessaire pour générer des fichiers de points de terminaison"],"de":["Benötigt eine bestehende Express.js-Projekt-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf die Technologien TypeScript und React Native","Zugriff auf das Dateisystem erforderlich, um Endpunktdateien zu generieren"],"pt":["Exige configuração de projeto Express.js existente","Limitado às tecnologias TypeScript e React Native","Acesso ao sistema de arquivos necessário para gerar arquivos de pontos finais"],"ru":["Требует наличия настроенного проекта Express.js","Ограничен технологиями TypeScript и React Native","Требуется доступ к файловой системе для генерации файлов конечных точек"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع Express.js موجود","محدود بالتكنولوجيا TypeScript و React Native","يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام الملفات لإنشاء ملفات نقاط النهاية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
