a de tipos estáticos y validación en tiempo de ejecución","fr":"Zod v4 est une bibliothèque de validation de schémas en TypeScript qui offre une inférence de types statiques et une validation à l''exécution","de":"Zod v4 ist eine Bibliothek für Schema-Validierung in TypeScript, die eine statische Typinferenz und eine Laufzeit-Validierung bietet","pt":"Zod v4 é uma biblioteca de validação de esquema TypeScript que fornece inferência de tipo estática e desempenho excepcional.","ru":"Zod v4 — это библиотека валидации схем TypeScript, которая обеспечивает статическую инференцию типов и исключительный производительность.","ar":"Zod v4 هي مكتبة التحقق من مخطط TypeScript التي توفر الاستدلال النوعي الثابت والأداء الاستثنائي.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["14","66","TypeScript","",""],"ja":["14","66","TypeScript","",""],"ko":["14","66","TypeScript","",""],"es":["Inferencia de tipos estáticos","Validación en tiempo de ejecución","Rendimiento excepcional","Compatibilidad con TypeScript","Validación de esquemas personalizados"],"fr":["Inférence de types statiques","Validation à l''exécution","Performances exceptionnelles","Compatibilité avec TypeScript","Validation de schémas personnalisés"],"de":["Statische Typinferenz","Laufzeit-Validierung","Außergewöhnliche Leistung","Kompatibilität mit TypeScript","Validierung von benutzerdefinierten Schemata"],"pt":["Inferência de tipo estática","Validação em tempo de execução","Desempenho excepcional","14x mais rápido na análise","66% menor no tamanho do bundle","Manutenção da segurança de tipo"],"ru":["Статическая инференция типов","Валидация в runtime","Исключительный производительность","14x быстрее в парсинге","66% меньше в размере бандла","Сохранение безопасности типов"],"ar":["الاستدلال النوعي الثابت","التحقق في وقت التشغيل","الأداء الاستثنائي","14x أسرع في التحليل","66% أصغر في حجم الحزمة","الحفاظ على أمان النوع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Zod v4","TypeScript","","14","66","TypeScript"],"ja":["Zod v4","TypeScript","","14","66","TypeScript"],"ko":["Zod v4","TypeScript","","14","66","TypeScript"],"es":["Zod v4","validación de esquemas","TypeScript","inferencia de tipos estáticos","validación en tiempo de ejecución","rendimiento excepcional","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Zod v4","validation de schémas","TypeScript","inférence de types statiques","validation à l''exécution","performances exceptionnelles","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Zod v4","Schema-Validierung","TypeScript","statische Typinferenz","Laufzeit-Validierung","außergewöhnliche Leistung","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Zod v4","validação de esquema","TypeScript","inferência de tipo estática","desempenho excepcional","biblioteca de validação","declaração de esquema","validação em tempo de execução"],"ru":["Zod v4","валидация схем","TypeScript","статическая инференция типов","исключительный производительность","библиотека валидации","декларация схем","валидация в runtime"],"ar":["Zod v4","التحقق من مخطط","TypeScript","الاستدلال النوعي الثابت","الأداء الاستثنائي","مكتبة التحقق","الاعلان عن مخطط","التحقق في وقت التشغيل"]}},"owner":"SlanyCukr","repo":"riot-api-project","repoPath":"SlanyCukr/riot-api-project","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.406Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Zod v4","description":"TypeScript-first schema validation library with static type inference and runtime validation","bodyPreview":"# Zod v4 - Schema Validation Skill\n\nZod v4 is a TypeScript-first schema declaration and validation library that provides static type inference, runtime validation, and exceptional performance. Version 4 delivers 14x faster parsing and 66% smaller bundles while maintaining full type safety.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nnpm install zod@^4.0.0\n```\n\n```typescript\nimport * as z from \"zod\";\n\n// Basic schema creation and validation\nconst UserSchema = z.object({\n  id: z.number().int().positive(),\n  email: z","body":"# Zod v4 - Schema Validation Skill\n\nZod v4 is a TypeScript-first schema declaration and validation library that provides static type inference, runtime validation, and exceptional performance. Version 4 delivers 14x faster parsing and 66% smaller bundles while maintaining full type safety.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nnpm install zod@^4.0.0\n```\n\n```typescript\nimport * as z from \"zod\";\n\n// Basic schema creation and validation\nconst UserSchema = z.object({\n  id: z.number().int().positive(),\n  email: z.email(),\n  username: z.string().min(3).max(20),\n  age: z.number().int().min(18).optional(),\n});\n\ntype User = z.infer<typeof UserSchema>;\n\n// Parse and validate\nconst user = UserSchema.parse({\n  id: 1,\n  email: \"user@example.com\",\n  username: \"johndoe\",\n  age: 25,\n});\n\n// Safe parsing with error handling\nconst result = UserSchema.safeParse(input);\nif (!result.success) {\n  console.log(result.error);\n}\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Object Schemas with Validation\n\n```typescript\n// Comprehensive user validation\nconst UserProfile = z.object({\n  id: z.number().int().positive(),\n  email: z.email(),\n  username: z\n    .string()\n    .min(3, \"Username must be at least 3 characters\")\n    .max(20, \"Username cannot exceed 20 characters\")\n    .regex(/^[a-zA-Z0-9_]+$/, \"Only alphanumeric characters and underscores\"),\n  age: z.number().int().min(13).max(120),\n  role: z.enum([\"user\", \"admin\", \"moderator\"]).default(\"user\"),\n  bio: z.string().max(500).optional(),\n  website: z.url().optional(),\n  createdAt: z.date().default(() => new Date()),\n});\n\n// Extending schemas\nconst AdminProfile = UserProfile.extend({\n  permissions: z.array(z.string()),\n  accessLevel: z.number().min(1).max(10),\n});\n```\n\n### String Format Validation\n\n```typescript\n// Built-in format validators\nconst Validations = {\n  email: z.email(),\n  uuid: z.uuidv4(),\n  url: z.url(),\n  ipv4: z.ipv4(),\n  ipv6: z.ipv6(),\n  base64: z.base64(),\n  jwt: z.jwt(),\n\n  // ISO formats\n  isoDate: z.iso.date(),\n  isoDateTime: z.iso.datetime(),\n  isoTime: z.iso.time(),\n\n  // Custom email with specific pattern\n  strictEmail: z.email({ pattern: z.regexes.rfc5322Email }),\n};\n\n// Template literal validation\nconst VersionString = z.templateLiteral([\n  z.number(),\n  \".\",\n  z.number(),\n  \".\",\n  z.number(),\n]);\n\nconst CSSValue = z.templateLiteral([\n  z.number(),\n  z.enum([\"px\", \"em\", \"rem\", \"%\", \"vh\", \"vw\"]),\n]);\n```\n\n### Array and Collection Validation\n\n```typescript\n// Array with constraints\nconst NumberArray = z.array(z.number()).min(1).max(100);\n\n// Tuple validation\nconst Coordinates = z.tuple([z.number(), z.number()]);\nconst MixedTuple = z.tuple([z.string(), z.number()], z.boolean());\n\n// Set validation\nconst UniqueStrings = z.set(z.string()).min(3);\n\n// Map validation\nconst UserPermissions = z.map(\n  z.string(), // user ID\n  z.array(z.string()), // permissions\n);\n\n// Record validation\nconst StringToNumber = z.record(z.string(), z.number());\nconst StatusRecord = z.record(\n  z.enum([\"pending\", \"active\", \"complete\"]),\n  z.boolean(),\n);\n```\n\n### Union and Discriminated Unions\n\n```typescript\n// Simple union\nconst StringOrNumber = z.union([z.string(), z.number()]);\n\n// Discriminated union for API responses\nconst ApiResponse = z.discriminatedUnion(\"status\", [\n  z.object({\n    status: z.literal(\"success\"),\n    data: z.unknown(),\n  }),\n  z.object({\n    status: z.literal(\"error\"),\n    error: z.string(),\n    code: z.number(),\n  }),\n  z.object({\n    status: z.literal(\"loading\"),\n    message: z.string().optional(),\n  }),\n]);\n\n// Nested discriminated unions\nconst BaseError = z.object({\n  status: z.literal(\"error\"),\n  message: z.string(),\n});\n\nconst DetailedError = z.discriminatedUnion(\"code\", [\n  BaseError.extend({ code: z.literal(400), field: z.string() }),\n  BaseError.extend({ code: z.literal(401), realm: z.string() }),\n  BaseError.extend({ code: z.literal(500), stack: z.string() }),\n]);\n```\n\n### Custom Refinements and Validation\n\n```typescript\n// Custom validation with refinements\nconst PasswordSchema = z\n  .string()\n  .min(8, \"Password must be at least 8 characters\")\n  .refine((val) => /[A-Z]/.test(val), \"Must contain uppercase letter\")\n  .refine((val) => /[a-z]/.test(val), \"Must contain lowercase letter\")\n  .refine((val) => /[0-9]/.test(val), \"Must contain number\")\n  .refine((val) => /[^A-Za-z0-9]/.test(val), \"Must contain special character\");\n\n// Complex validation with superRefine\nconst UserRegistration = z\n  .object({\n    email: z.email(),\n    password: z.string(),\n    confirmPassword: z.string(),\n    age: z.number(),\n    termsAccepted: z.boolean(),\n  })\n  .superRefine((data, ctx) => {\n    if (data.password !== data.confirmPassword) {\n      ctx.addIssue({\n        code: \"custom\",\n        path: [\"confirmPassword\"],\n        message: \"Passwords must match\",\n      });\n    }\n\n    if (data.age < 18 && !data.termsAccepted) {\n      ctx.addIssue({\n        code: \"custom\",\n        path: [\"termsAccepted\"],\n        message: \"Parental consent required for users under 18\",\n      });\n    }\n  });\n```\n\n### Transformations and Data Processing\n\n```typescript\n// Transform data during validation\nconst StringToNumber = z\n  .string()\n  .transform((val) => parseInt(val, 10))\n  .refine((val) => !isNaN(val), \"Must be a valid number\");\n\nconst TimestampToDate = z\n  .number()\n  .transform((timestamp) => new Date(timestamp));\n\nconst NormalizeEmail = z.string().transform((val) => val.toLowerCase().trim());\n\n// Overwrite for type-preserving transforms\nconst RoundNumber = z.number().overwrite((val) => Math.round(val));\n\n// Pipeline transformations\nconst ProcessUrl = z\n  .string()\n  .transform((val) => val.trim())\n  .transform((val) => val.toLowerCase())\n  .transform((val) => {\n    try {\n      return new URL(val);\n    } catch {\n      throw new Error(\"Invalid URL format\");\n    }\n  });\n```\n\n### Recursive Schemas\n\n```typescript\n// Recursive category structure\nconst Category = z.object({\n  id: z.number(),\n  name: z.string(),\n  get subcategories() {\n    return z.array(Category);\n  },\n});\n\n// Mutually recursive types\nconst User = z.object({\n  id: z.number(),\n  name: z.string(),\n  get posts() {\n    return z.array(Post);\n  },\n});\n\nconst Post = z.object({\n  id: z.number(),\n  title: z.string(),\n  content: z.string(),\n  get author() {\n    return User;\n  },\n  get comments() {\n    return z.array(Comment);\n  },\n});\n\nconst Comment = z.object({\n  id: z.number(),\n  text: z.string(),\n  get author() {\n    return User.pick({ id: true, name: true });\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### File Validation\n\n```typescript\n// File upload validation\nconst ImageUpload = z.object({\n  avatar: z\n    .file()\n    .max(5_000_000, \"File must be less than 5MB\")\n    .mime([\"image/jpeg\", \"image/png\", \"image/webp\"], \"Must be an image\"),\n\n  banner: z\n    .file()\n    .max(10_000_000, \"File must be less than 10MB\")\n    .mime([\"image/jpeg\", \"image/png\"], \"Must be JPEG or PNG\")\n    .optional(),\n});\n\n// Document validation\nconst DocumentUpload = z\n  .file()\n  .min(1000, \"File must be at least 1KB\")\n  .max(50_000_000, \"File must be less than 50MB\")\n  .mime([\n    \"application/pdf\",\n    \"application/msword\",\n    \"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document\",\n  ]);\n```\n\n### Function Validation\n\n```typescript\n// Define validated functions\nconst CalculateTax = z.function({\n  input: [z.number().min(0), z.number().min(0).max(1)],\n  output: z.number(),\n});\n\nconst taxCalculator = CalculateTax.implement((amount, rate) => {\n  return amount * rate;\n});\n\n// Async function validation\nconst FetchUser = z.function({\n  input: [z.number().int().positive()],\n  output: z.object({\n    id: z.number(),\n    name: z.string(),\n    email: z.email(),\n  }),\n});\n\nconst getUser = FetchUser.implementAsync(async (id) => {\n  const response = await fetch(`/api/users/${id}`);\n  return response.json();\n});\n```\n\n### Error Handling\n\n```typescript\n// Custom error messages\nconst CustomValidation = z.object({\n  username: z\n    .string({\n      error: (issue) => {\n        if (issue.input === undefined) return \"Username is required\";\n        if (typeof issue.input !== \"string\") return \"Username must be a string\";\n        return \"Invalid username\";\n      },\n    })\n    .min(3, \"Username must be at least 3 characters\"),\n});\n\n// Error handling patterns\nconst validateInput = (input: unknown) => {\n  const result = UserSchema.safeParse(input);\n\n  if (!result.success) {\n    const error = result.error;\n\n    // Pretty print errors\n    console.log(z.prettifyError(error));\n\n    // Extract field errors\n    const fieldErrors = error.issues.reduce(\n      (acc, issue) => {\n        const field = issue.path.join(\".\");\n        acc[field] = issue.message;\n        return acc;\n      },\n      {} as Record<string, string>,\n    );\n\n    return { success: false, errors: fieldErrors };\n  }\n\n  return { success: true, data: result.data };\n};\n```\n\n### Default Values and Coercion\n\n```typescript\n// Schema with defaults\nconst ConfigSchema = z.object({\n  theme: z.enum([\"light\", \"dark\"]).default(\"light\"),\n  notifications: z.boolean().default(true),\n  fontSize: z.number().min(10).max(30).default(14),\n  timeout: z.number().default(5000),\n});\n\n// Type coercion\nconst CoercedConfig = z.object({\n  port: z.coerce.number().default(3000),\n  https: z.coerce.boolean().default(false),\n  maxConnections: z.coerce.number().int().positive().default(100),\n});\n\n// Environment variable parsing\nconst EnvSchema = z.object({\n  NODE_ENV: z\n    .enum([\"development\", \"production\", \"test\"])\n    .default(\"development\"),\n  PORT: z.coerce.number().default(3000),\n  DEBUG: z.stringbool().default(\"false\"),\n});\n```\n\n### Zod Mini (Tree-Shakable)\n\n```typescript\nimport * as z from \"zod/mini\";\n\n// Functional API for smaller bundles\nconst OptionalString = z.optional(z.string());\nconst StringArray = z.array(z.string());\nconst StringOrNumber = z.union([z.string(), z.number()]);\n\n// Check functions for validations\nconst ValidatedEmail = z\n  .string()\n  .check(z.regex(/@/), z.minLength(5), z.maxLength(100));\n\nconst PositiveInt = z.number().check(z.int(), z.positive(), z.lt(1000));\n\nconst NonEmptyArray = z.array(z.any()).check(z.minSize(1));\n```\n\n## Practical Examples\n\n### Form Validation\n\n```typescript\n// Contact form validation\nconst ContactForm = z.object({\n  name: z.string().min(1, \"Name is required\").max(100),\n  email: z.email(\"Please provide a valid email\"),\n  subject: z.string().min(5, \"Subject must be at least 5 characters\"),\n  message: z.string().min(10, \"Message must be at least 10 characters\"),\n  newsletter: z.boolean().default(false),\n});\n\n// React form integration\nconst handleSubmit = (formData: FormData) => {\n  const data = {\n    name: formData.get(\"name\"),\n    email: formData.get(\"email\"),\n    subject: formData.get(\"subject\"),\n    message: formData.get(\"message\"),\n    newsletter: formData.get(\"newsletter\") === \"on\",\n  };\n\n  const result = ContactForm.safeParse(data);\n  if (!result.success) {\n    const errors = result.error.flatten();\n    return { errors: errors.fieldErrors };\n  }\n\n  // Process valid data\n  return { success: true, data: result.data };\n};\n```\n\n### API Response Validation\n\n```typescript\n// API response schemas\nconst UserResponse = z.object({\n  data: z.object({\n    id: z.number(),\n    name: z.string(),\n    email: z.email(),\n    createdAt: z.string().transform((val) => new Date(val)),\n  }),\n  meta: z.object({\n    total: z.number(),\n    page: z.number(),\n    totalPages: z.number(),\n  }),\n});\n\n// Typed API client\nconst apiClient = {\n  async getUser(id: number): Promise<z.infer<typeof UserResponse>[\"data\"]> {\n    const response = await fetch(`/api/users/${id}`);\n    const data = await response.json();\n\n    const result = UserResponse.safeParse(data);\n    if (!result.success) {\n      throw new Error(`Invalid API response: ${result.error.message}`);\n    }\n\n    return result.data.data;\n  },\n};\n```\n\n### Configuration Validation\n\n```typescript\n// Application configuration\nconst AppConfig = z.object({\n  server: z.object({\n    port: z.coerce.number().min(1).max(65535).default(3000),\n    host: z.string().default(\"localhost\"),\n    cors: z.boolean().default(true),\n  }),\n  database: z.object({\n    url: z.string(),\n    ssl: z.boolean().default(false),\n    maxConnections: z.coerce.number().int().positive().default(10),\n  }),\n  auth: z.object({\n    jwtSecret: z.string().min(32),\n    tokenExpiry: z.string().default(\"24h\"),\n    refreshExpiry: z.string().default(\"7d\"),\n  }),\n});\n\n// Load and validate config\nconst loadConfig = (configPath: string) => {\n  const rawConfig = require(configPath);\n  const config = AppConfig.parse(rawConfig);\n  return config;\n};\n```\n\n## Requirements\n\n- **TypeScript**: 4.5+ (recommended for best inference)\n- **Runtime**: Node.js, browsers, Deno, Bun\n- **Bundle size**: 5.36kb gzipped (full), 1.88kb gzipped (mini)\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Full Zod v4\nnpm install zod@^4.0.0\n\n# For minimal bundle size\nnpm install zod@^4.0.0\n# Then import from \"zod/mini\"\n```\n\n## Key Features\n\n- **Static Type Inference**: Automatic TypeScript type generation from schemas\n- **Runtime Validation**: Comprehensive input validation with detailed errors\n- **Performance**: 14x faster parsing than v3, optimized for production\n- **Tree Shakable**: Zod Mini provides 85% bundle size reduction\n- **Template Literals**: Validate string patterns matching TypeScript template literals\n- **File Validation**: Built-in File object validation with size and MIME type constraints\n- **Recursive Types**: Full support for recursive and self-referential schemas\n- **JSON Schema**: First-party JSON Schema generation\n- **Function Validation**: Type-safe function definitions with validated inputs/outputs\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:21:19.281Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for TypeScript-based AI Agents needing advanced schema validation and runtime type safety.","zh":"非常适合需要高级模式验证和运行时类型安全的基于TypeScript的AI代理。","ja":"TypeScriptベースのAIエージェントに適しています。高度なスキーマ検証とランタイム型の安全性が必要です。","ko":"고급 스키마 유효성 검사 및 런타임 유형 안전성이 필요한 TypeScript 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en TypeScript que necesitan una validación de esquemas avanzada y seguridad de tipos en tiempo de ejecución.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur TypeScript nécessitant une validation de schémas avancée et une sécurité de types à l''exécution.","de":"Perfekt für TypeScript-basierte KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Schemavalidierung und Laufzeit-Typensicherheit benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em TypeScript que necessitam de validação de esquema avançada e segurança de tipo em tempo de execução.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе TypeScript, которым требуется продвинутая проверка схемы и безопасность типов во время выполнения.","ar":"مثالي لعميل العميل الذكاء الاصطناعي القائم على TypeScript الذي يحتاج إلى التحقق من صحة مخطط متقدم وأمان النوع في وقت التشغيل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to validate complex data structures using static type inference and runtime validation with exceptional performance, leveraging Zod v4''s 14x faster parsing and 66% smaller bundles while maintaining full type safety, utilizing TypeScript-first schema declaration and validation libraries.","zh":"赋予代理使用静态类型推理和运行时验证来验证复杂的数据结构的能力，利用Zod v4的14倍更快的解析和66％更小的包同时保持完全的类型安全，使用TypeScript优先的模式声明和验证库。","ja":"静的型推論とランタイム検証を使用して複雑なデータ構造を検証する機能をエージェントに与え、Zod v4の14倍高速な解析と66％小さいバンドルを活用しながら完全な型の安全性を維持し、TypeScript優先のスキーマ宣言と検証ライブラリを使用します。","ko":"에이전트에게 정적 유형 추론 및 런타임 유효성 검사를 사용하여 복잡한 데이터 구조를 유효성 검사할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여 Zod v4의 14배 빠른 파싱 및 66％ 더 작은 번들을 사용하여 완전한 유형 안전성을 유지하며 TypeScript 우선의 스키마 선언 및 유효성 검사 라이브러리를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a validar estructuras de datos complejas utilizando inferencia de tipo estático y validación en tiempo de ejecución con un rendimiento excepcional, aprovechando la versión 4 de Zod con un análisis 14 veces más rápido y paquetes un 66% más pequeños, manteniendo al mismo tiempo la seguridad de tipos completa, utilizando bibliotecas de declaración y validación de esquemas de TypeScript en primer lugar.","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider des structures de données complexes en utilisant l''inférence de type statique et la validation à l''exécution avec des performances exceptionnelles, en exploitant la version 4 de Zod avec un parsing 14 fois plus rapide et des bundles 66% plus petits, tout en maintenant la sécurité de types complète, en utilisant des bibliothèques de déclaration et de validation de schémas TypeScript en premier.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, komplexe Datenstrukturen mithilfe statischer Typinferenz und Laufzeitvalidierung mit außergewöhnlicher Leistung zu validieren, indem es Zod v4 mit 14-mal schnellerem Parsing und 66% kleineren Bundles nutzt, während die vollständige Typsicherheit beibehalten wird, unter Verwendung von TypeScript-ersten Schemadeklarations- und Validierungsbibliotheken.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a validar estruturas de dados complexas usando inferência de tipo estático e validação em tempo de execução com desempenho excepcional, aproveitando a análise 14 vezes mais rápida e pacotes 66% menores da Zod v4, mantendo a segurança total de tipo, utilizando bibliotecas de declaração e validação de esquema em primeiro lugar do TypeScript.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять сложные структуры данных с помощью статического вывода типов и проверки во время выполнения с исключительной производительностью, используя 14-кратное ускорение парсинга и на 66% меньшие пакеты Zod v4, сохраняя при этом полную безопасность типов, используя библиотеки TypeScript-первой декларации и проверки схем.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من التحقق من صحة هيكل البيانات المعقدة باستخدام الاستدلال النوعي الثابت والتحقق في وقت التشغيل الأداء الاستثنائي، واستخدام تحليل Zod v4 أسرع 14 مرة وحزمة 66% أصغر مع الحفاظ على سلامة النوع الكاملة، واستخدام مكتبات الإعلان والتحقق من مخطط TypeScript أولاً."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating user input data against predefined schemas","Generating type-safe data models for complex applications","Debugging runtime errors with Zod v4''s exceptional performance and smaller bundles"],"zh":["验证用户输入数据与预定义的模式","为复杂应用程序生成类型安全的数据模型","使用Zod v4的卓越性能和更小的包调试运行时错误"],"ja":["ユーザー入力データを事前に定義されたスキーマに対して検証する","複雑なアプリケーション用に型安全なデータモデルを生成する","Zod v4の優れたパフォーマンスと小さいバンドルを使用してランタイムエラーをデバッグする"],"ko":["사용자 입력 데이터를 사전에 정의된 스키마와 비교하여 유효성 검사","복잡한 애플리케이션에 대한 유형 안전 데이터 모델 생성","Zod v4의卓越한 성능 및 더 작은 번들을 사용하여 런타임 오류 디버깅"],"es":["Validar datos de entrada de usuario contra esquemas predefinidos","Generar modelos de datos seguros para aplicaciones complejas","Depurar errores en tiempo de ejecución con el rendimiento excepcional y los paquetes más pequeños de Zod v4"],"fr":["Valider les données d''entrée de l''utilisateur contre des schémas prédéfinis","Générer des modèles de données sécurisés pour des applications complexes","Déboguer les erreurs à l''exécution avec les performances exceptionnelles et les bundles plus petits de Zod v4"],"de":["Validieren von Benutzereingabedaten gegen vordefinierte Schemata","Generieren typsicherer Datamodelle für komplexe Anwendungen","Fehler in der Laufzeit mit der außergewöhnlichen Leistung und den kleineren Bundles von Zod v4 debuggen"],"pt":["Validar dados de entrada do usuário contra esquemas predefinidos","Gerar modelos de dados seguros contra tipo para aplicações complexas","Depurar erros de tempo de execução com o desempenho excepcional e pacotes menores da Zod v4"],"ru":["Проверять данные входного пользователя против заранее определенных схем","Генерировать модели данных, безопасные для типа, для сложных приложений","Отлаживать ошибки во время выполнения с исключительной производительностью и меньшими пакетами Zod v4"],"ar":["التحقق من صحة بيانات الإدخال للمستخدم ضد مخططات محددة مسبقًا","توليد نماذج بيانات آمنة للنوع لتطبيقات معقدة","تصحيح أخطاء وقت التشغيل الأداء الاستثنائي والحزم الأصغر من Zod v4"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript environment","Version 4 specific features may not be compatible with older versions of Zod"],"zh":["需要TypeScript环境","版本4特定的功能可能与Zod的旧版本不兼容"],"ja":["TypeScript環境が必要","バージョン4特有の機能はZodの古いバージョンと互換性がない可能性がある"],"ko":["TypeScript 환경이 필요","버전 4의 특정 기능은 Zod의 이전 버전과 호환되지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de TypeScript","Las características específicas de la versión 4 pueden no ser compatibles con versiones anteriores de Zod"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement TypeScript","Les fonctionnalités spécifiques à la version 4 peuvent ne pas être compatibles avec les versions antérieures de Zod"],"de":["Benötigt eine TypeScript-Umgebung","Version-4-spezifische Funktionen sind möglicherweise nicht mit älteren Versionen von Zod kompatibel"],"pt":["Exige ambiente TypeScript","Recursos específicos da versão 4 podem não ser compatíveis com versões anteriores da Zod"],"ru":["Требует окружения TypeScript","Функции, специфичные для версии 4, могут быть несовместимы со старыми версиями Zod"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة TypeScript","ميزات محددة للإصدار 4 قد لا تكون متوافقة مع إصدارات أقدم من Zod"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
