al-bot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.406Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"instagram-api","description":"Instagram Graph API entegrasyonu. Use when publishing content, fetching insights, or working with Instagram media.","bodyPreview":"# Instagram Graph API\n\n**Version:** v21.0 | **Base:** `https://graph.instagram.com/v21.0`\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Action | Endpoint | Method |\n|--------|----------|--------|\n| Create Container | `/{user_id}/media` | POST |\n| Publish | `/{user_id}/media_publish` | POST |\n| Check Status | `/{container_id}` | GET |\n| Get Insights | `/{media_id}/insights` | GET |\n\n## Two-Phase Publishing\n\n```\n1. Create Container → container_id\n2. (Video only) Poll until FINISHED\n3. Publish Container → post_id\n```\n\n##","body":"# Instagram Graph API\n\n**Version:** v21.0 | **Base:** `https://graph.instagram.com/v21.0`\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Action | Endpoint | Method |\n|--------|----------|--------|\n| Create Container | `/{user_id}/media` | POST |\n| Publish | `/{user_id}/media_publish` | POST |\n| Check Status | `/{container_id}` | GET |\n| Get Insights | `/{media_id}/insights` | GET |\n\n## Two-Phase Publishing\n\n```\n1. Create Container → container_id\n2. (Video only) Poll until FINISHED\n3. Publish Container → post_id\n```\n\n## Publishing Functions\n\n```python\nfrom app.instagram_helper import (\n    post_photo_to_instagram,\n    post_video_to_instagram,\n    post_carousel_to_instagram\n)\n\n# Image\nresult = await post_photo_to_instagram(image_url, caption)\n\n# Reels\nresult = await post_video_to_instagram(video_url, caption)\n\n# Carousel (2-10 images)\nresult = await post_carousel_to_instagram(image_urls, caption)\n```\n\n## Video Requirements\n\n| Spec | Value |\n|------|-------|\n| Resolution | 720x1280 (9:16) |\n| Codec | H.264 video, AAC audio |\n| FPS | 30 |\n| Max | 90 seconds |\n\n```python\n# Auto-convert\nfrom app.instagram_helper import convert_video_for_instagram\nresult = await convert_video_for_instagram(input_path)\n# Returns: {success, output_path, converted, file_size_mb}\n```\n\n## Insights\n\n```python\nfrom app.insights_helper import get_instagram_media_insights\n\ninsights = await get_instagram_media_insights(media_id)\n# Returns: {plays, reach, saves, shares, likes, comments, engagement_rate}\n```\n\n**Reels metrics:** plays, reach, saved, shares, comments, likes\n**Image metrics:** impressions, reach, saved\n\n## Rate Limiting\n\n- Container creation: 2s delay\n- Video polling: 10s interval, max 30 attempts\n- Insights fetch: 0.3s delay between calls\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```bash\nINSTAGRAM_ACCESS_TOKEN=...\nINSTAGRAM_USER_ID=...\nINSTAGRAM_BUSINESS_ID=...  # Optional\n```\n\n## Return Format\n\n```python\n# Success\n{\"success\": True, \"id\": \"17901234567890123\", \"platform\": \"instagram\"}\n\n# Error\n{\"success\": False, \"error\": \"Error message\"}\n```\n\n## Common Errors\n\n| Error | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| OAuthException | Token expired - refresh |\n| MediaTypeNotSupported | Wrong format - convert |\n| RateLimitError | Too many calls - add delay |\n\n## Deep Links\n\n- `app/instagram_helper.py` - Publishing\n- `app/insights_helper.py` - Metrics\n- `app/cloudinary_helper.py` - Video CDN\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:21:45.128Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Social Media Agents needing advanced Instagram Graph API integration for automated content publishing and insights retrieval.","zh":"适用于需要高级Instagram Graph API集成的社交媒体代理，用于自动内容发布和洞察检索。","ja":"Instagram Graph APIの高度な統合が必要なソーシャルメディアエージェントに最適で、自動コンテンツ公開とインサイトの取得に使用されます。","ko":"고급 인스타그램 그래프 API 통합이 필요한 소셜 미디어 에이전트에게 적합하며 자동 콘텐츠 게시 및 인사이트 조회에 사용됩니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de medios sociales que necesitan una integración avanzada de la API de Instagram Graph para la publicación automática de contenido y la recuperación de informes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de médias sociaux ayant besoin d''une intégration avancée de l''API Instagram Graph pour la publication automatisée de contenu et la récupération d''analyses.","de":"Ideal für Social-Media-Agents, die eine erweiterte Integration der Instagram-Graph-API für die automatisierte Veröffentlichung von Inhalten und die Abrufung von Analysen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Mídia Social que necessitam de integração avançada da API do Instagram Graph para publicação automatizada de conteúdo e recuperação de insights.","ru":"Идеально подходит для социальных медиа-агентов, которым требуется продвинутая интеграция с Instagram Graph API для автоматизированной публикации контента и получения аналитики.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الوسائط الاجتماعية الذين يحتاجون إلى تكامل متقدم مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Instagram Graph من أجل نشر المحتوى التلقائي واسترجاع المعلومات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create containers, publish media, and retrieve insights using the Instagram Graph API v21.0, supporting endpoints like /{user_id}/media and /{media_id}/insights, and handling two-phase publishing for videos.","zh":"赋予代理创建容器、发布媒体、检索洞察的能力，使用Instagram Graph API v21.0，支持诸如/{user_id}/media和/{media_id}/insights等端点，并处理视频的两阶段发布。","ja":"エージェントがコンテナを作成し、メディアを公開し、インサイトを取得する機能を提供します。Instagram Graph API v21.0を使用し、/{user_id}/mediaや/{media_id}/insightsなどのエンドポイントをサポートし、動画の2段階の公開を処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 컨테이너를 생성하고 미디어를 게시하고 인사이트를 조회할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며 인스타그램 그래프 API v21.0을 사용하며 /{user_id}/media 및 /{media_id}/insights 등의 엔드포인트를 지원하며 비디오의 2단계 공개를 처리합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear contenedores, publicar medios y recuperar informes utilizando la API de Instagram Graph v21.0, que admite puntos de conexión como /{user_id}/media y /{media_id}/insights, y maneja la publicación en dos fases para vídeos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des conteneurs, de publier des médias et de récupérer des analyses en utilisant l''API Instagram Graph v21.0, qui prend en charge des points de terminaison tels que /{user_id}/media et /{media_id}/insights, et gère la publication en deux phases pour les vidéos.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Container zu erstellen, Medien zu veröffentlichen und Analysen abzurufen, indem es die Instagram-Graph-API v21.0 verwendet, die Endpunkte wie /{user_id}/media und /{media_id}/insights unterstützt und eine zweiphasige Veröffentlichung für Videos handhabt.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem contêineres, publiquem mídia e recuperem insights usando a API do Instagram Graph v21.0, com suporte a endpoints como /{user_id}/media e /{media_id}/insights, e manipulam a publicação em duas etapas para vídeos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать контейнеры, публиковать медиа и получать аналитику с помощью Instagram Graph API v21.0, поддерживая конечные точки типа /{user_id}/media и /{media_id}/insights, и обрабатывая двухфазную публикацию видео.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء حاويات ونشر الوسائط و استرجاع informações باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Instagram Graph v21.0 ، مع دعم نقاط النهاية مثل /{user_id}/media و /{media_id}/insights ، و معالجة نشر الفيديوهات في مرحلتين"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Instagram content publishing using the POST /{user_id}/media_publish endpoint","Retrieving engagement insights for published media via GET /{media_id}/insights","Polling container status for video uploads until FINISHED"],"zh":["使用POST /{user_id}/media_publish端点自动化Instagram内容发布","通过GET /{media_id}/insights检索发布媒体的参与度洞察","轮询容器状态以上传视频，直到完成"],"ja":["POST /{user_id}/media_publishエンドポイントを使用してInstagramコンテンツの公開を自動化する","GET /{media_id}/insightsを使用して公開メディアのエンゲージメントインサイトを取得する","コンテナの状態をポーリングしてビデオをアップロードするまで、完了する"],"ko":["POST /{user_id}/media_publish 엔드포인트를 사용하여 인스타그램 콘텐츠 게시를 자동화하는 것","GET /{media_id}/insights를 사용하여 게시된 미디어의 참여 인사이트를 조회하는 것","컨테이너 상태를 폴링하여 비디오 업로드를 완료할 때까지"],"es":["Automatizar la publicación de contenido de Instagram mediante el punto de conexión POST /{user_id}/media_publish","Recuperar informes de participación para medios publicados a través de GET /{media_id}/insights","Sondear el estado del c