ja":"画像分析スキルは、GLM-4.6vサブエージェントに視覚的な品質評価を委任するために使用され、ゲームのスクリーンショットとスプライトに適しています","ko":"이미지 분석 스킬은 GLM-4.6v 서브 에이전트에 시각적 품질 평가를 위임하는 데 사용되며, 게임 스크린샷과 스프라이트에 적합합니다","es":"La habilidad de análisis de imágenes delega tareas de revisión visual a un subagente para evaluar la calidad de capturas de pantalla y sprites de juegos.","fr":"La capacité d''analyse d''images délègue des tâches de révision visuelle à un sous-agent pour évaluer la qualité des captures d''écran et des sprites de jeux.","de":"Die Bildanalyse-Fähigkeit delegiert Aufgaben zur visuellen Überprüfung an einen Subagenten, um die Qualität von Bildschirmfotos und Sprites von Spielen zu be...","pt":"A análise de imagens é uma habilidade que permite delegar tarefas de avaliação de qualidade visual de imagens ao subagente GLM-4.6v","ru":"Анализ изображений - это навык, который позволяет делегировать задачи оценки визуального качества изображений субагенту GLM-4.6v","ar":"تحليل الصور هو مهارة يسمح بتفويض مهام تقييم الجودة البصرية للصور إلى وكيل GLM-4.6v الفرعي","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["视觉质量评估","游戏截图分析","精灵分析","GLM-4.6v子代理集成","自动化图像检查"],"ja":["視覚的な品質評価","ゲームスクリーンショット分析","スプライト分析","GLM-4.6vサブエージェント統合","自動画像チェック"],"ko":["시각적 품질 평가","게임 스크린샷 분석","스프라이트 분석","GLM-4.6v 서브 에이전트 통합","자동 이미지 체크"],"es":["Revisión automática de sprites y capturas de pantalla","Evaluación de la calidad visual de elementos gráficos","Detección de fondos bloqueados o problemas de transparencia","Comparación de activos con el estilo Harvest Moon SNES","Integración con glm-image-gen para generar sprites","Validación de la calidad visual antes de los commits"],"fr":["Révision automatique de sprites et de captures d''écran","Évaluation de la qualité visuelle des éléments graphiques","Détection de fonds bloqués ou de problèmes de transparence","Comparaison d''actifs avec le style Harvest Moon SNES","Intégration avec glm-image-gen pour générer des sprites","Validation de la qualité visuelle avant les commits"],"de":["Automatische Überprüfung von Sprites und Bildschirmfotos","Bewertung der visuellen Qualität von Grafikelementen","Erkennung von blockierten Hintergründen oder Transparenzproblemen","Vergleich von Assets mit dem Harvest Moon SNES-Stil","Integration mit glm-image-gen zur Generierung von Sprites","Validierung der visuellen Qualität vor den Commits"],"pt":["Avaliação de qualidade visual de capturas de tela de jogos","Análise de sprites e imagens de jogos","Detecção de problemas de transparência e blocos","Comparação de ativos com o estilo Harvest Moon SNES"],"ru":["Оценка визуального качества скриншотов игр","Анализ спрайтов и изображений игр","Обнаружение проблем с прозрачностью и блоками","Сравнение активов со стилем Harvest Moon SNES"],"ar":["تقييم الجودة البصرية لصور الشاشة للألعاب","تحليل الصور والألعاب","كشف مشاكل الشفافية والكتل","مقارنة الأصول بنمط Harvest Moon SNES"]},"keywords":{"zh":["图像分析","视觉质量评估","游戏开发","GLM-4.6v","子代理","自动化图像检查"],"ja":["画像分析","視覚的な品質評価","ゲーム開発","GLM-4.6v","サブエージェント","自動画像チェック"],"ko":["이미지 분석","시각적 품질 평가","게임 개발","GLM-4.6v","서브 에이전트","자동 이미지 체크"],"es":["análisis de imágenes","calidad visual","juegos","sprites","capturas de pantalla","glm-image-gen","validación de calidad","desarrollo de juegos","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["analyse d''images","qualité visuelle","jeux","sprites","captures d''écran","glm-image-gen","validation de qualité","développement de jeux","outils de développement"],"de":["Bildanalyse","visuelle Qualität","Spiele","Sprites","Bildschirmfotos","glm-image-gen","Qualitätsvalidierung","Spieleentwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["análise de imagens","qualidade visual","capturas de tela de jogos","sprites","glm-4.6v","desenvolvimento de jogos"],"ru":["анализ изображений","визуальное качество","скриншоты игр","спрайты","glm-4.6v","разработка игр"],"ar":["تحليل الصور","الجودة البصرية","صور الشاشة للألعاب","الألعاب","glm-4.6v","تطوير الألعاب"]}},"owner":"OpenSourceSam","repo":"v2_heras_garden","repoPath":"OpenSourceSam/v2_heras_garden","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"image-analysis","description":"GLM-4.6v image analysis subagent for game screenshot and sprite quality assessment","bodyPreview":"# Image Analysis Skill\n\n**Purpose:** Delegate image analysis tasks to GLM-4.6v subagent for visual quality assessment of game screenshots and sprites.\n\n## When to Use\n\nInvoke this skill when:\n- New sprites are generated (via glm-image-gen)\n- Screenshots captured during playtesting\n- Visual quality validation needed before commits\n- Checking for blocky backgrounds or transparency issues\n- Comparing assets against Harvest Moon SNES style\n\n## Direct vs Delegated Analysis\n\n**Claude Opus can analyze","body":"# Image Analysis Skill\n\n**Purpose:** Delegate image analysis tasks to GLM-4.6v subagent for visual quality assessment of game screenshots and sprites.\n\n## When to Use\n\nInvoke this skill when:\n- New sprites are generated (via glm-image-gen)\n- Screenshots captured during playtesting\n- Visual quality validation needed before commits\n- Checking for blocky backgrounds or transparency issues\n- Comparing assets against Harvest Moon SNES style\n\n## Direct vs Delegated Analysis\n\n**Claude Opus can analyze images directly** via the Read tool. Choose the right approach:\n\n| Scenario | Approach | Why |\n|----------|----------|-----|\n| 1-3 images | Claude Direct | No overhead, faster |\n| Quick quality check | Claude Direct | Immediate feedback |\n| Batch analysis (10+) | MiniMax Parallel | Token efficiency |\n| Extensive visual QA | MiniMax Parallel | 50x cheaper |\n\n### Claude Direct Pattern\n```\nRead image file → Analyze in-context → Continue workflow\n```\n\n### MiniMax/GLM Delegation Pattern (for batches)\n```\nSpawn parallel agents → Each analyzes subset → Aggregate results\n```\n\n**Default:** Use Claude Direct for small tasks, delegate batches to save tokens.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Analyze Screenshot\n```bash\nmcp__4_5v_mcp__analyze_image \\\n  --imageSource \"temp/screenshots/[filename].png\" \\\n  --prompt \"Analyze this game screenshot for visual quality. Check for: blocky backgrounds, tiling seams, sprite transparency issues, pixel art scaling problems, overall Harvest Moon SNES readability. Provide specific, actionable feedback.\"\n```\n\n### Analyze Sprite Asset\n```bash\nmcp__4_5v_mcp__analyze_image \\\n  --imageSource \"assets/sprites/placeholders/[filename].png\" \\\n  --prompt \"Analyze this pixel art sprite for Harvest Moon SNES style quality. Check: transparency (clean edges), silhouette (strong/readable), proportions (compact not stretched), color palette (dusk-friendly), pixel detail (minimal noise). Reference: assets/sprites/PLACEHOLDER_ASSET_SPEC.txt\"\n```\n\n### Analyze NPC Sprite\n```bash\nmcp__4_5v_mcp__analyze_image \\\n  --imageSource \"assets/sprites/placeholders/npc_[name].png\" \\\n  --prompt \"Analyze this 64x64 NPC sprite. Target proportions: ~48h x 32w centered. Check: strong silhouette, Mediterranean theme alignment, clean transparency, no elongation. Harvest Moon SNES style reference.\"\n```\n\n## Standard Prompts\n\n### Full Quality Assessment\n```\nAnalyze this image for Circe''s Garden game quality standards:\n\nVisual Style:\n- Harvest Moon SNES readability (clean pixel art, strong silhouettes)\n- Stardew Valley influence (but more mythic/moody)\n- Mediterranean ancient Greek island theme\n- Dusk-friendly palette (muted, not oversaturated)\n- 32px tiles, 2x camera zoom\n\nCheck For:\n1. Background issues: blocky patterns, tiling seams, color banding\n2. Transparency: clean edges (no halos), proper alpha channel\n3. Pixel art: minimal noise, clear details, proper scaling\n4. Proportions: compact bodies, not stretched/elongated\n5. Colors: natural earth tones, muted jewel accents\n6. Lighting: soft ambient, no harsh specular\n7. Silhouette: strong, recognizable at small size\n\nProvide specific feedback: what works, what needs fixing, file references.\n```\n\n### Transparency Check (Focused)\n```\nCheck this sprite for transparency issues:\n- Halo effect (light/dark ring around edges)\n- Color bleeding (background showing through)\n- Harsh edges (no smooth curves on diagonals)\n- Partial transparency (should be opaque or transparent, not in-between)\n\nReport specific pixel locations and severity.\n```\n\n### Style Comparison\n```\nCompare this asset to Harvest Moon SNES style:\n- Clean pixel art with minimal noise\n- Strong silhouette (recognizable at 32x32)\n- Soft, natural color palette\n- Proper alpha blending\n- No anti-aliasing on edges\n- Cozy, approachable aesthetic\n\nReport what matches style and what deviates.\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\nExpected response should include:\n\n```markdown\n## Analysis Summary\n[One-line assessment: PASS / NEEDS WORK / FAIL]\n\n### Issues Found\n**Critical (P0):**\n- [Specific issue with location]\n\n**Important (P1):**\n- [Issue description]\n\n**Minor (P2):**\n- [Minor detail]\n\n### What Works\n- [Positive aspects to preserve]\n\n### Recommendations\n1. [Actionable fix 1]\n2. [Actionable fix 2]\n```\n\n## Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Detection | Fix |\n|-------|-----------|-----|\n| Blocky background | Visible pixel grid, tiling patterns | Regenerate with better seam handling |\n| Halo effect | Light/dark ring around sprite | Fix alpha channel, clean edges |\n| Color bleeding | Background color in transparent pixels | Re-export with proper transparency |\n| Stretched proportions | Elongated body/limbs | Regenerate with compact proportions |\n| Oversaturated colors | Too bright/vibrant | Adjust palette to dusk-friendly tones |\n| Poor silhouette | Not recognizable at small size | Strengthen outline, simplify details |\n\n## File Locations\n\n**Input:**\n- Screenshots: `temp/screenshots/`\n- Sprites: `assets/sprites/`\n- Placeholders: `assets/sprites/placeholders/`\n\n**Reference:**\n- Asset specs: `assets/sprites/PLACEHOLDER_ASSET_SPEC.txt`\n- Style guide: `assets/sprites/PLACEHOLDER_README.md`\n\n## Integration\n\n### With glm-image-gen\n```bash\n# After generating new sprite\n./generate-image.sh ''{\"subject\":\"...\"}'' 1024x1024 standard\n./process-image.sh \"$TEMP\" \"32x32\" \"assets/sprites/output.png\"\n\n# Then analyze quality\nmcp__4_5v_mcp__analyze_image --imageSource \"assets/sprites/output.png\" --prompt \"[standard prompt]\"\n```\n\n### With HPV (Playtesting)\n```bash\n# During screenshot review\nls temp/screenshots/\nmcp__4_5v_mcp__analyze_image --imageSource \"temp/screenshots/world_map.png\" --prompt \"[screenshot prompt]\"\n```\n\n### Pre-commit Check\n```bash\n# Before committing asset changes\ngit status\nmcp__4_5v_mcp__analyze_image --imageSource \"assets/sprites/new_asset.png\" --prompt \"[validation prompt]\"\n```\n\n## Subagent Role\n\nFull subagent configuration: `.claude/roles/image-analysis-subagent.md`\n\n**Model:** GLM-4.6v (vision-capable)\n**Tool:** `mcp__4_5v_mcp__analyze_image`\n**Purpose:** Specialized visual quality assessment\n\n## Success Criteria\n\nAnalysis is effective when:\n- Issues match human findings (80%+ accuracy)\n- False positives < 20%\n- Actionable feedback provided\n- Response time < 30 seconds\n- Consistent report format\n\n---\n\n**Related:**\n- `.claude/skills/glm-image-gen/SKILL.md` (sprite generation)\n- `assets/sprites/PLACEHOLDER_ASSET_SPEC.txt` (asset specifications)\n- `.claude/roles/image-analysis-subagent.md` (full subagent docs)\n\n[Kimi Code CLI - 2026-01-26]\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:22:35.983Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Inspection Agents needing advanced image quality assessment capabilities for game development and sprite validation.","zh":"非常适合需要高级图像质量评估能力的视觉检查代理，特别适用于游戏开发和精灵验证。","ja":"高度な画像品質評価能力を必要とするビジュアルインスペクションエージェントに最適で、ゲーム開発およびスプライトの検証に特に適しています。","ko":"고급 이미지 품질 평가 기능이 필요한 시각적 검사 에이전트에게 적합하며, 게임 개발 및 스프라이트 검증에 특히 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Inspección Visual que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de evaluación de la calidad de imagen para el desarrollo de juegos y la validación de sprites.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''inspection visuelle ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''évaluation de la qualité d''image pour le développement de jeux et la validation de sprites.","de":"Perfekt für Visuelle Inspektionsagenten, die erweiterte Bildqualitätsbewertungsfähigkeiten für die Spieleentwicklung und die Validierung von Sprites benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Inspeção Visual que precisam de capacidades avançadas de avaliação de qualidade de imagem para desenvolvimento de jogos e validação de sprites.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Визуальных Инспекционных Агентов, требующих продвинутых возможностей оценки качества изображений для разработки игр и проверки спрайтов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التفتيش المرئي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتقييم جودة الصورة لتنمية الألعاب وتصديق الصور المصغرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform visual quality assessment of game screenshots and sprites, checking for issues like blocky backgrounds or transparency problems, and comparing assets against specific styles like Harvest Moon SNES, utilizing subagents like GLM-4.6v for delegated analysis.","zh":"赋予代理执行游戏截图和精灵的视觉质量评估，检查诸如背景块状或透明度问题等问题，并将资产与特定风格（如超级任天堂的《牧场物语》）进行比较，利用像GLM-4.6v这样的子代理进行委派分析。","ja":"エージェントにゲームのスクリーンショットやスプライトの視覚的な品質評価を実行させることで、背景のブロック状や透明度の問題などの問題をチェックし、特定のスタイル（例：スーパーファミコンの『牧場物語』）と比較することができ、GLM-4.6vのようなサブエージェントを利用して委託分析を行うことができます。","ko":"에이전트가 게임 스크린샷과 스프라이트의 시각적 품질 평가를 수행하도록 해주며, 배경 블록이나 투명도 문제와 같은 문제를 확인하고, 특정 스타일(예: 하베스트 문 SNES)과 비교하며, GLM-4.6v와 같은 하위 에이전트를 사용하여 위임 분석을 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar evaluaciones de la calidad visual de capturas de pantalla de juegos y sprites, comprobando problemas como fondos de bloques o problemas de transparencia, y comparando activos con estilos específicos como Harvest Moon SNES, utilizando subagentes como GLM-4.6v para el análisis delegado.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer une évaluation de la qualité visuelle des captures d''écran de jeux et des sprites, en vérifiant des problèmes tels que des arrières-plans bloqués ou des problèmes de transparence, et en comparant des ressources avec des styles spécifiques comme Harvest Moon SNES, en utilisant des sous-agents comme GLM-4.6v pour l''analyse déléguée.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die visuelle Qualitätsbewertung von Spielbildschirmen und Sprites durchzuführen, indem sie Probleme wie blockierte Hintergründe oder Transparenzprobleme überprüfen und Ressourcen mit spezifischen Stilen wie Harvest Moon SNES vergleichen, wobei Subagenten wie GLM-4.6v für die delegierte Analyse verwendet werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes realizem avaliações de qualidade visual de capturas de tela de jogos e sprites, verificando problemas como fundos quadriculados ou problemas de transparência, e comparando ativos contra estilos específicos como Harvest Moon SNES, utilizando subagentes como GLM-4.6v para análise delegada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять визуальную оценку качества скриншотов игр и спрайтов, проверяя проблемы, такие как блокированные фоны или проблемы с прозрачностью, и сравнивая активы с конкретными стилями, такими как Harvest Moon SNES, используя субагентов, такие как GLM-4.6v, для делегированного анализа.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على أداء تقييم جودة مرئي لصور الشاشة والألعاب والصور المصغرة، وفحص مشاكل مثل الخلفيات الكتلة أو مشاكل الشفافية، ومقارنة الأصول ضد أساليب محددة مثل Harvest Moon SNES، باستخدام وكلاء فرعيين مثل GLM-4.6v للتحليل المفوض."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating sprite quality after generation via glm-image-gen","Analyzing screenshots for visual issues during playtesting","Comparing game assets against a reference style for consistency"],"zh":["通过glm-image-gen生成后验证精灵质量","在游戏测试过程中分析截图的视觉问题","将游戏资产与参考风格进行比较以确保一致性"],"ja":["glm-image-genを使用して生成した後のスプライト品質を検証する","ゲームテスト中にスクリーンショットの視覚的な問題を分析する","ゲームアセットを参考スタイルと比較して一貫性を確保する"],"ko":["glm-image-gen을 통해 생성된 후 스프라이트 품질을 검증하는 것","게임 테스트 중에 스크린샷의 시각적 문제를 분석하는 것","게임 자산을 참조 스타일과 비교하여 일관성을 보장하는 것"],"es":["Validar la calidad de los sprites después de la generación a través de glm-image-gen","Analizar las capturas de pantalla en busca de problemas visuales durante las pruebas de juego","Comparar los activos del juego con un estilo de referencia para la coherencia"],"fr":["Valider la qualité des sprites après la génération via glm-image-gen","Analyser les captures d''écran pour les problèmes visuels lors des tests de jeu","Comparer les ressources du jeu avec un style de référence pour la cohérence"],"de":["Die Qualität von Sprites nach der Generierung über glm-image-gen überprüfen","Bildschirmfotos auf visuelle Probleme während der Spieltests analysieren","Vergleichen von Spielressourcen mit einem Referenzstil für die Konsistenz"],"pt":["Validar a qualidade do sprite após geração via glm-image-gen","Analizar capturas de tela para problemas visuais durante testes de jogabilidade","Comparar ativos de jogos contra um estilo de referência para consistência"],"ru":["Проверять качество спрайта после генерации через glm-image-gen","Анализировать скриншоты на предмет визуальных проблем во время тестирования игры","Сравнивать активы игры с эталонным стилем для последовательности"],"ar":["التحقق من جودة الصورة المصغرة بعد التوليد عبر glm-image-gen","تحليل لقطات الشاشة للمشاكل المرئية أثناء اختبار اللعبة","مقارنة أصول اللعبة مع نمط مرجعي للاتساق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GLM-4.6v subagent for delegated analysis","Specifically designed for game development and sprite validation use cases"],"zh":["需要GLM-4.6v子代理进行委派分析","专门为游戏开发和精灵验证用例设计"],"ja":["GLM-4.6vサブエージェントを使用して委託分析を行う必要がある","ゲーム開発およびスプライト検証用途のために特別に設計されている"],"ko":["GLM-4.6v 하위 에이전트를 사용하여 위임 분석을 수행해야 함","게임 개발 및 스프라이트 검증용으로 특별히 설계됨"],"es":["Requiere el subagente GLM-4.6v para el análisis delegado","Diseñado específicamente para casos de uso de desarrollo de juegos y validación de sprites"],"fr":["Nécessite le sous-agent GLM-4.6v pour l''analyse déléguée","Conçu spécifiquement pour les cas d''utilisation de développement de jeux et de validation de sprites"],"de":["Benötigt den Subagenten GLM-4.6v für die delegierte Analyse","Speziell für die Anwendungsfälle der Spieleentwicklung und der Validierung von Sprites konzipiert"],"pt":["Requer subagente GLM-4.6v para análise delegada","Especificamente projetado para casos de uso de desenvolvimento de jogos e validação de sprites"],"ru":["Требует субагента GLM-4.6v для делегированного анализа","Специально разработан для случаев использования разработки игр и проверки спрайтов"],"ar":["يتطلب وكيل GLM-4.6v الفرعي للتحليل المفوض","صمّم özellikle لاستخدامات تطوير الألعاب وتصديق الصور المصغرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
