, Hono, Flutter 및 TypeScript의 생...","es":"Estructura de repositorio innozverse","fr":"Structure de référentiel innozverse","de":"Innozverse-Repository-Struktur","pt":"Estrutura de Repositório Innozverse: Monorepo com Next.js...","ru":"Структура репозитория Innozverse: монорепозиторий с Next....","ar":"هيكل مستودع Innozverse: تطبيق ويب أحادي مع Next.js و Type...","en":"innozverse-repo-structure"},"description":{"zh":"Innozverse仓库结构是一个生产级的单体仓库应用，使用Next.js、Hono、Flutter和TypeScript构建，提供身份验证和其他功能","ja":"Innozverseリポジトリ構造は、Next.js、Hono、Flutter、TypeScriptを使用して構築されたプロダクショングレードモノレポアプリケーションであり、認証などの機能を提供","ko":"Innozverse 저장소 구조는 Next.js, Hono, Flutter 및 TypeScript를 사용하여 구축 된 생산급 모노레포 애플리케이션으로, 인증 및 기타 기능을 제공","es":"La estructura de repositorio innozverse es una aplicación web de monorepo de nivel de producción con autenticación, construida con Next.js, Hono, Flutter y T...","fr":"La structure de référentiel innozverse est une application web de monorepo de niveau de production avec authentification, construite avec Next.js, Hono, Flut...","de":"Die Innozverse-Repository-Struktur ist eine Produktions-Webanwendung mit Monorepo und Authentifizierung, erstellt mit Next.js, Hono, Flutter und TypeScript","pt":"O Innozverse é um aplicativo web de monorepo de nível de produção com autenticação, construído com Next.js, Hono, Flutter e TypeScript.","ru":"Innozverse - это производственный монорепозиторий веб-приложения с аутентификацией, построенный с Next.js, Hono, Flutter и TypeScript.","ar":"Innozverse هو تطبيق ويب أحادي المستودع من المستوى الإنتاجي مع المصادقة، مبني على Next.js و Hono و Flutter و TypeScript.","en":"Production-grade monorepo web application with authentication, built with Next.js, Hono, Flutter, and TypeScript"},"definition":{"en":"Production-grade monorepo web application with authentication, built with Next.js, Hono, Flutter, and TypeScript"},"features":{"zh":["生产级单体仓库应用","使用Next.js、Hono、Flutter和TypeScript构建","提供身份验证功能","支持多应用和共享包","包含文档和GitHub工作流","使用pnpm工作空间配置"],"ja":["プロダクショングレードモノレポアプリケーション","Next.js、Hono、Flutter、TypeScriptを使用して構築","認証機能を提供","複数のアプリケーションと共有パッケージをサポート","ドキュメントとGitHubワークフローを含む","pnpmワークスペース構成を使用"],"ko":["생산급 모노레포 애플리케이션","Next.js, Hono, Flutter 및 TypeScript를 사용하여 구축","인증 기능을 제공","여러 애플리케이션과 공유 패키지를 지원","문서 및 GitHub 워크플로를 포함","pnpm 작업공간 구성 사용"],"es":["Aplicación web de monorepo de nivel de producción","Autenticación integrada","Construida con Next.js, Hono, Flutter y TypeScript","Estructura de repositorio organizada","Configuración de pnpm y turbo.js"],"fr":["Application web de monorepo de niveau de production","Authentification intégrée","Construite avec Next.js, Hono, Flutter et TypeScript","Structure de référentiel organisée","Configuration de pnpm et turbo.js"],"de":["Produktions-Webanwendung mit Monorepo","Integrierte Authentifizierung","Erstellt mit Next.js, Hono, Flutter und TypeScript","Organisierte Repository-Struktur","pnpm- und turbo.js-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Estrutura de monorepo para aplicações web","Autenticação integrada","Compartilhamento de pacotes entre aplicações","Construído com Next.js, Hono, Flutter e TypeScript","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Структура монорепозитория для веб-приложений","Встроенная аутентификация","Обмен пакетами между приложениями","Построенный с Next.js, Hono, Flutter и TypeScript","Поддержка нескольких сред разработки"],"ar":["هيكل مستودع أحادي للتطبيقات الويب","المصادقة المدمجة","مشاركة الحزم بين التطبيقات","مبني على Next.js و Hono و Flutter و TypeScript","دعم بيئات متعددة من تطوير البرامج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Innozverse仓库结构","Next.js","Hono","Flutter","TypeScript","单体仓库","生产级应用","身份验证","pnpm工作空间"],"ja":["Innozverseリポジトリ構造","Next.js","Hono","Flutter","TypeScript","モノレポ","プロダクショングレードアプリケーション","認証","pnpmワークスペース"],"ko":["Innozverse 저장소 구조","Next.js","Hono","Flutter","TypeScript","모노레포","생산급 애플리케이션","인증","pnpm 작업공간"],"es":["estructura de repositorio","monorepo","autenticación","Next.js","Hono","Flutter","TypeScript","desarrollo web","producción"],"fr":["structure de référentiel","monorepo","authentification","Next.js","Hono","Flutter","TypeScript","développement web","production"],"de":["Repository-Struktur","Monorepo","Authentifizierung","Next.js","Hono","Flutter","TypeScript","Webentwicklung","Produktion"],"pt":["monorepo","Next.js","Hono","Flutter","TypeScript","autenticação","compartilhamento de pacotes","desenvolvimento web","aplicações web","produção"],"ru":["монорепозиторий","Next.js","Hono","Flutter","TypeScript","аутентификация","обмен пакетами","веб-разработка","веб-приложения","производство"],"ar":["مستودع أحادي","Next.js","Hono","Flutter","TypeScript","المصادقة","مشاركة الحزم","تطوير الويب","تطبيقات الويب","الإنتاج"]}},"owner":"lastcow","repo":"innozverse","repoPath":"lastcow/innozverse","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"innozverse-repo-structure","description":"Navigate and understand the innozverse repository structure, file organization, naming conventions, and module boundaries. Use when creating new files, organizing code, or understanding where to add features.","bodyPreview":"# innozverse Repository Structure Skill\n\nWhen navigating and modifying the innozverse repository, follow these structure conventions.\n\n## Top-Level Structure\n\n```\ninnozverse/\n├── apps/                 # Applications\n├── packages/             # Shared packages\n├── docs/                 # Documentation\n├── .claude/              # Claude AI skills\n├── .github/              # GitHub workflows\n├── package.json          # Root package.json\n├── pnpm-workspace.yaml   # pnpm workspace config\n├── turbo.js","body":"# innozverse Repository Structure Skill\n\nWhen navigating and modifying the innozverse repository, follow these structure conventions.\n\n## Top-Level Structure\n\n```\ninnozverse/\n├── apps/                 # Applications\n├── packages/             # Shared packages\n├── docs/                 # Documentation\n├── .claude/              # Claude AI skills\n├── .github/              # GitHub workflows\n├── package.json          # Root package.json\n├── pnpm-workspace.yaml   # pnpm workspace config\n├── turbo.json            # Turborepo config\n└── README.md             # Main README\n```\n\n## Apps Directory\n\n### apps/web (Next.js)\n```\napps/web/\n├── src/\n│   └── app/              # App Router pages\n│       ├── layout.tsx    # Root layout\n│       ├── page.tsx      # Home page\n│       └── globals.css   # Global styles\n├── public/               # Static assets\n├── next.config.js        # Next.js config\n├── tsconfig.json         # TypeScript config\n├── .eslintrc.json        # ESLint config\n├── .env.example          # Environment template\n└── package.json          # Package dependencies\n```\n\n**Key Points**:\n- Use App Router (not Pages Router)\n- Pages in `src/app/`\n- Static files in `public/`\n- Environment vars start with `NEXT_PUBLIC_`\n\n### apps/api (Fastify)\n```\napps/api/\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts          # Server entry point\n│   └── routes/\n│       ├── health.ts     # Health check route\n│       └── v1/           # Versioned API routes\n│           └── index.ts  # v1 routes\n├── Dockerfile            # Fly.io deployment\n├── fly.toml              # Fly.io config\n├── tsconfig.json         # TypeScript config\n├── .eslintrc.js          # ESLint config\n├── .env.example          # Environment template\n└── package.json          # Package dependencies\n```\n\n**Key Points**:\n- Routes organized by version (`v1/`, `v2/`)\n- Health check at root level\n- Dockerfile for Fly.io deployment\n- Environment vars in `.env` (never commit)\n\n### apps/mobile (Flutter)\n```\napps/mobile/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── main.dart         # App entry point\n│   └── services/\n│       └── api_service.dart  # API client\n├── android/              # Android-specific\n├── ios/                  # iOS-specific\n├── pubspec.yaml          # Dart dependencies\n├── README.md             # Mobile-specific docs\n└── analysis_options.yaml # Dart linter config\n```\n\n**Key Points**:\n- Main app in `lib/main.dart`\n- Services in `lib/services/`\n- Models in `lib/models/` (when added)\n- Widgets in `lib/widgets/` (when added)\n\n## Packages Directory\n\n### packages/shared\n```\npackages/shared/\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts          # Main export\n│   ├── types.ts          # Type definitions\n│   ├── schemas.ts        # Zod schemas\n│   └── constants.ts      # Shared constants\n├── dist/                 # Compiled output (gitignored)\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── .eslintrc.js\n└── package.json\n```\n\n**Purpose**: Domain types, Zod schemas, shared constants\n\n**Usage**:\n```typescript\nimport { HealthResponse, healthResponseSchema } from ''@innozverse/shared'';\n```\n\n### packages/api-client\n```\npackages/api-client/\n├── src/\n│   └── index.ts          # API client implementation\n├── dist/                 # Compiled output (gitignored)\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── .eslintrc.js\n└── package.json\n```\n\n**Purpose**: Typed HTTP client for web app\n\n**Usage**:\n```typescript\nimport { ApiClient } from ''@innozverse/api-client'';\nconst client = new ApiClient(''http://localhost:8080'');\n```\n\n### packages/config\n```\npackages/config/\n├── eslint-preset.js      # Shared ESLint config\n├── tsconfig.base.json    # Base TypeScript config\n└── package.json\n```\n\n**Purpose**: Shared tooling configuration\n\n**Usage**:\n```json\n// tsconfig.json\n{\n  \"extends\": \"@innozverse/config/tsconfig.base.json\"\n}\n```\n\n## Documentation\n\n```\ndocs/\n├── architecture.md       # System architecture\n├── conventions.md        # Coding conventions\n├── deployment-flyio.md   # Fly.io deployment\n└── contracts.md          # API contracts strategy\n```\n\n## File Naming Conventions\n\n### TypeScript\n- **Files**: `kebab-case.ts` (e.g., `api-client.ts`)\n- **React Components**: `PascalCase.tsx` (e.g., `Button.tsx`)\n- **Tests**: `*.test.ts` or `*.test.tsx`\n- **Types**: `types.ts` or `<module>.types.ts`\n\n### Dart\n- **Files**: `snake_case.dart` (e.g., `api_service.dart`)\n- **Tests**: `*_test.dart`\n\n### Configuration\n- **ESLint**: `.eslintrc.js` or `.eslintrc.json`\n- **TypeScript**: `tsconfig.json`\n- **Environment**: `.env.example` (committed), `.env` (gitignored)\n\n## Where to Add New Code\n\n### New API Endpoint\n```\napps/api/src/routes/v1/users.ts  # New endpoint file\n```\n\nUpdate `apps/api/src/routes/v1/index.ts` to register\n\n### New Shared Type\n```\npackages/shared/src/types.ts  # Add interface\npackages/shared/src/schemas.ts  # Add Zod schema\n```\n\nExport from `packages/shared/src/index.ts`\n\n### New Web Page\n```\napps/web/src/app/users/page.tsx  # New page at /users\n```\n\n### New Mobile Screen\n```\napps/mobile/lib/screens/users_screen.dart  # New screen\n```\n\n### New Shared Utility\n```\npackages/shared/src/utils/helper.ts  # New utility\n```\n\nExport from `packages/shared/src/index.ts`\n\n## Import Paths\n\n### Within innozverse Packages\n```typescript\n// ✅ Use package name\nimport { HealthResponse } from ''@innozverse/shared'';\n\n// ❌ Don''t use relative paths across packages\nimport { HealthResponse } from ''../../../packages/shared/src/types'';\n```\n\n### Within the Same Package\n```typescript\n// ✅ Use relative imports\nimport { helper } from ''./utils/helper'';\n\n// ❌ Don''t use absolute package imports for same package\nimport { helper } from ''@innozverse/shared/utils/helper'';\n```\n\n### Next.js @ Alias\n```typescript\n// In apps/web only\nimport { Component } from ''@/app/components/Component'';\n```\n\n## Build Artifacts\n\n### What''s Gitignored\n```\nnode_modules/\ndist/\n.next/\n.turbo/\nbuild/\n.env\n.env.local\n*.log\n```\n\n### What''s Committed\n```\nsrc/\npublic/\npackage.json\ntsconfig.json\n.env.example\nREADME.md\n```\n\n## Scripts Organization\n\n### Root package.json\n- `dev`: Run web + API\n- `build`: Build all packages and apps\n- `lint`: Lint everything\n- `test`: Run all tests\n\n### Individual Packages\n- `dev`: Start dev server\n- `build`: Build package\n- `lint`: Lint package\n- `typecheck`: Type check\n\n## Adding New Packages\n\n1. **Create directory**: `mkdir packages/new-package`\n2. **Initialize**: `cd packages/new-package && pnpm init`\n3. **Name**: Use `@innozverse/` prefix\n4. **Add to workspace**: Already covered by `packages/*` in `pnpm-workspace.yaml`\n5. **Build config**: Copy `tsconfig.json` from similar package\n6. **Add scripts**: `build`, `lint`, `typecheck`\n\n## Directory Depth Guidelines\n\n### Maximum Nesting\n- **Apps**: 3-4 levels deep\n  ```\n  apps/web/src/app/users/[id]/page.tsx  ✅\n  ```\n\n- **Packages**: 2-3 levels deep\n  ```\n  packages/shared/src/utils/validation.ts  ✅\n  ```\n\n### When to Create Subdirectories\n- **3+ related files**: Create a subdirectory\n- **Single file**: Keep at current level\n- **Shared concern**: Extract to `utils/` or `lib/`\n\n## Module Boundaries\n\n### Apps Cannot Import from Other Apps\n```typescript\n// ❌ Never do this\nimport { something } from ''../../api/src/utils'';\n```\n\n### Apps Can Import from Packages\n```typescript\n// ✅ This is fine\nimport { HealthResponse } from ''@innozverse/shared'';\n```\n\n### Packages Can Import from Other Packages\n```typescript\n// ✅ This is fine (with workspace dependency)\nimport { schema } from ''@innozverse/shared'';\n```\n\n## Special Directories\n\n### .claude/skills/\nAI agent instructions for project-specific patterns\n\n### .github/workflows/\nGitHub Actions CI/CD pipelines\n\n### public/ (in apps/web)\nStatic assets served at root URL\n\n### dist/ (in packages)\nCompiled TypeScript output (gitignored, created on build)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:22:41.033Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing structured monorepo management with Next.js, Hono, Flutter, and TypeScript","zh":"非常适合需要结构化的单体仓库管理的全栈代理，支持 Next.js、Hono、Flutter 和 TypeScript","ja":"Next.js、Hono、Flutter、TypeScript を使用した構造化されたモノリポ管理が必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"Next.js, Hono, Flutter 및 TypeScript를 사용한 구조화된 모노레포 관리가 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Full Stack que necesitan una gestión de monorepo estructurada con Next.js, Hono, Flutter y TypeScript","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin d''une gestion de monorepo structurée avec Next.js, Hono, Flutter et TypeScript","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine strukturierte Monorepo-Verwaltung mit Next.js, Hono, Flutter und TypeScript benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de gerenciamento de monorepo estruturado com Next.js, Hono, Flutter e TypeScript","ru":"Идеально для агентов Full Stack, которым необходима структурированная система управления монорепозиторием с Next.js, Hono, Flutter и TypeScript","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء كامل الحزمة الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة مونو ريبوزيتوري منظم مع Next.js و Hono و Flutter و TypeScript"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage production-grade monorepo web applications with authentication, leveraging TypeScript, Next.js, and Hono for scalable architecture, while utilizing pnpm workspace for efficient package management and GitHub workflows for streamlined CI/CD pipelines","zh":"赋予代理管理生产级别的单体仓库 Web 应用程序的能力，利用 TypeScript、Next.js 和 Hono 实现可扩展的架构，同时使用 pnpm workspace 进行高效的包管理和 GitHub 工作流进行流畅的 CI/CD 流水线","ja":"TypeScript、Next.js、Hono を使用してスケーラブルなアーキテクチャを実現し、pnpm workspace を使用して効率的なパッケージ管理を行い、GitHub ワークフローを使用してシームレスな CI/CD パイプラインを実現することで、エージェントがプロダクショングレードのモノリポ Web アプリケーションを管理できるようにする","ko":"TypeScript, Next.js 및 Hono를 사용하여 확장 가능한 아키텍처를 구현하고, pnpm workspace를 사용하여 효율적인 패키지 관리를 수행하며, GitHub 워크플로우를 사용하여 원활한 CI/CD 파이프라인을 구현함으로써 에이전트가 프로덕션급 모노레포 웹 애플리케이션을 관리할 수 있도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar aplicaciones web de grado de producción con autenticación, aprovechando TypeScript, Next.js y Hono para una arquitectura escalable, mientras utiliza pnpm workspace para una gestión de paquetes eficiente y flujos de trabajo de GitHub para canalizaciones de CI/CD optimizadas","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des applications web de production de niveau avec authentification, en exploitant TypeScript, Next.js et Hono pour une architecture évolutuve, tout en utilisant pnpm workspace pour une gestion de paquets efficace et des workflows GitHub pour des pipelines CI/CD rationalisés","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, produktionsreife Webanwendungen mit Authentifizierung zu verwalten, indem es TypeScript, Next.js und Hono für eine skalierbare Architektur nutzt, während pnpm-Arbeitsbereiche für eine effiziente Paketverwaltung und GitHub-Workflows für optimierte CI/CD-Pipelines verwendet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar aplicações web de monorepo de produção com autenticação, utilizando TypeScript, Next.js e Hono para arquitetura escalável, enquanto utiliza o pnpm workspace para gerenciamento de pacotes eficiente e fluxos de trabalho do GitHub para pipelines de CI/CD otimizados","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять веб-приложениями монорепозитория производственного уровня с аутентификацией, используя TypeScript, Next.js и Hono для масштабируемой архитектуры, а также использует pnpm workspace для эффективного управления пакетами и рабочие процессы GitHub для оптимизированных конвейеров CI/CD","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة تطبيقات الويب مونو ريبوزيتوري المستوى الإنتاجي مع المصادقة، باستخدام TypeScript و Next.js و Hono من أجل هندسة قابلة للتوسيع، في حين استخدام مساحة العمل pnpm لإدارة الحزم الفعالة وعمليات العمل من GitHub من أجل خطوط أنابيب CI/CD المُثلى"},"useCases":{"en":["Organizing large-scale web applications into structured monorepos","Implementing authentication mechanisms using Next.js and Hono","Streamlining development workflows with pnpm workspace and GitHub actions"],"zh":["将大规模 Web 应用程序组织成结构化的单体仓库","使用 Next.js 和 Hono 实现身份验证机制","使用 pnpm workspace 和 GitHub Actions 流畅开发工作流"],"ja":["大規模な Web アプリケーションを構造化されたモノリポに組織する","Next.js と Hono を使用して認証メカニズムを実装する","pnpm workspace と GitHub Actions を使用して開発ワークフローを効率化する"],