a la experiencia del usuario","Diseño de componentes y páginas web","Desarrollo de aplicaciones web y móviles"],"fr":["Création d''interfaces utilisateur personnalisées","Implémentation de code de production de haute qualité","Attention exceptionnelle aux détails esthétiques","Options créatives pour l''expérience utilisateur","Conception de composants et de pages web","Développement d''applications web et mobiles"],"de":["Erstellung von personalisierten Benutzeroberflächen","Implementierung von hochwertigem Produktionscode","Außergewöhnliche Aufmerksamkeit für ästhetische Details","Kreative Optionen für die Benutzererfahrung","Design von Komponenten und Webseiten","Entwicklung von Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces de usuário personalizadas","Implementação de código de trabalho real","Atenção aos detalhes estéticos","Evitação da estética genérica","Desenvolvimento de componentes e páginas web","Criação de aplicações web responsivas"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных пользовательских интерфейсов","Реализация рабочего кода","Учет эстетических деталей","Избежание generic эстетики","Разработка компонентов и страниц веб-приложений","Создание адаптивных веб-приложений"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","تنفيذ رمز العمل الحقيقي","اهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية","تجنب الجمالية العامة","تنمية مكونات وصفحات التطبيقات الوب","إنشاء تطبيقات الوب المتجاوبة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","生产级前端界面","AI设计","用户界面","用户体验","Web应用","前端开发"],"ja":["フロントエンド設計","プロダクションレベルのフロントエンドインターフェース","AIデザイン","ユーザーインターフェース","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","Webアプリケーション","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스","AI 디자인","사용자 인터페이스","사용자 경험","웹 애플리케이션","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["diseño frontend","interfaces de usuario","desarrollo web","aplicaciones móviles","experiencia del usuario","código de producción","detalles estéticos","opciones creativas"],"fr":["conception frontend","interfaces utilisateur","développement web","applications mobiles","expérience utilisateur","code de production","détails esthétiques","options créatives"],"de":["Frontend-Design","Benutzeroberflächen","Webentwicklung","Mobile-Anwendungen","Benutzererfahrung","Produktionscode","ästhetische Details","kreative Optionen"],"pt":["frontend design","desenvolvimento de frontend","interfaces de usuário personalizadas","código de trabalho real","estética de frontend","desenvolvimento web","aplicações web responsivas","componentes web"],"ru":["фронтенд-дизайн","разработка фронтенда","индивидуальные пользовательские интерфейсы","рабочий код","эстетика фронтенда","веб-разработка","адаптивные веб-приложения","компоненты веб-приложений"],"ar":["تصميم الواجهة الأمامية","تنمية الواجهة الأمامية","واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","رمز العمل الحقيقي","الجمالية الأمامية","تنمية الوب","تطبيقات الوب المتجاوبة","مكونات تطبيقات الوب"]}},"owner":"seanchiuai","repo":"claude-web-template","repoPath":"seanchiuai/claude-web-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, or applications. Generates creative, polished code that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices. This skill is invoked when the user makes a design-specific request or when the user interface is being designed or changed.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or te","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices. This skill is invoked when the user makes a design-specific request or when the user interface is being designed or changed.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:22:55.708Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI-focused Agents needing to create production-grade, custom frontend interfaces with attention to aesthetic details.","zh":"非常适合需要创建生产级、自定义前端界面并注重美观细节的UI焦点代理。","ja":"UIに焦点を当てたエージェントが、生产レベルのカスタムフロントエンドインターフェースを作成し、美観の細部に注意するのに最適です。","ko":"생산급의 사용자 지정 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성하고 미적 세부 사항에 주의하는 UI 중심 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfect for UI-focused Agents needing to create production-grade, custom frontend interfaces with attention to aesthetic details.","fr":"Perfect for UI-focused Agents needing to create production-grade, custom frontend interfaces with attention to aesthetic details.","de":"Perfect for UI-focused Agents needing to create production-grade, custom frontend interfaces with attention to aesthetic details.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em UI que precisam criar interfaces de frontend personalizadas de nível de produção, com atenção aos detalhes estéticos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на UI, которым необходимо создавать индивидуальные интерфейсы frontend уровня производства с вниманием к эстетическим деталям.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يركزون على واجهة المستخدم و kteří يحتاجون إلى إنشاء واجهات أمامية مخصصة من الدرجة الأولى مع اهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details, generating distinctive interfaces using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, while avoiding generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics, and supporting various file formats like .svg.","zh":"赋予代理实现真正的工作代码，具有对美观细节的异常关注，使用HTML、CSS和JavaScript生成独特的界面，同时避免通用的''AI乱码''美学，并支持各种文件格式，如.svg。","ja":"エージェントに、実際の動作コードを実装する力を与え、美観の細部に例外的な注意を払い、HTML、CSS、JavaScriptを使用して独自のインターフェースを生成し、汎用の''AI汚れ''の美学を避け、.svgなどの様々なファイル形式をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 실제 작동하는 코드를 구현할 수 있도록 해주며, 미적 세부 사항에 예외적인 주의를 기울이며 HTML, CSS 및 JavaScript를 사용하여 고유한 인터페이스를 생성하고 일반적인 ''AI 비주얼 노이즈'' 미학을 피하고 .svg와 같은 다양한 파일 형식을 지원합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details, generating distinctive interfaces using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, while avoiding generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics, and supporting various file formats like .svg.","fr":"Empowers agents to implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details, generating distinctive interfaces using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, while avoiding generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics, and supporting various file formats like .svg.","de":"Empowers agents to implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details, generating distinctive interfaces using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, while avoiding generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics, and supporting various file formats like .svg.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar código de trabalho real com atenção excepcional aos detalhes estéticos, gerando interfaces distintas usando HTML, CSS e JavaScript, evitando estéticas genéricas de ''slop de IA'' e suportando vários formatos de arquivo, como .svg.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать рабочий код с исключительным вниманием к эстетическим деталям, создавая отличительные интерфейсы с использованием HTML, CSS и JavaScript, избегая.generic ''сlop ИИ'' эстетики и поддерживая различные форматы файлов, такие как .svg.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تنفيذ رموز عمل حقيقي مع اهتمام استثنائي بالتفاصيل الجمالية، مما يولد واجهات متميزة باستخدام HTML و CSS و JavaScript، وتجنب الجماليات العامة ل ''سلوك ذكاء اصطناعي''، ودعم صيغ ملفات مختلفة مثل .svg."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing responsive web applications","Generating custom UI components","Creating wireframes for new page layouts","Developing accessible and interactive frontend interfaces"],"zh":["设计响应式网页应用程序","生成自定义UI组件","为新页面布局创建线框","开发可访问且交互式的前端接口"],"ja":["レスポンシブなWebアプリケーションの設計","カスタムUIコンポーネントの生成","新しいページレイアウトのワイヤーフレームの作成","アクセス可能でインタラクティブなフロントエンドインターフェースの開発"],"ko":["반응형 웹 애플리케이션 설계","사용자 지정 UI 구성 요소 생성","새 페이지 레이아웃을 위한 와이어프레임 생성","접근성 및 상호 작용 가능한 프론트엔드 인터페이스 개발"],"es":["Designing responsive web applications","Generating custom UI components","Creating wireframes for new page layouts","Developing accessible and interactive frontend interfaces"],"fr":["Designing responsive web applications","Generating custom UI components","Creating wireframes for new page layouts","Developing accessible and interactive frontend interfaces"],"de":["Designing responsive web applications","Generating custom UI components","Creating wireframes for new page layouts","Developing accessible and interactive frontend interfaces"],"pt":["Projetar aplicações web responsivas","Gerar componentes de UI personalizados","Criar wireframes para layouts de página novos","Desenvolver interfaces de frontend interativas e acessíveis"],"ru":["Проектирование отзывчивых веб-приложений","Генерация индивидуальных компонентов UI","Создание эскизов для новых макетов страниц","Разработка интерактивных и доступных интерфейсов frontend"],"ar":["تصميم تطبيقات ويب مستجيبة","generando مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة","إنشاء مخططات لتصاميم صفحة جديدة","تطوير واجهات أمامية تفاعلية وقابلة للاستخدام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user-provided frontend requirements","Dependent on design-specific requests or interface changes"],"zh":["需要用户提供的前端要求","依赖于设计特定的请求或接口更改"],"ja":["ユーザー提供のフロントエンド要件が必要","設計特有のリクエストまたはインターフェースの変更に依存"],"ko":["사용자 제공 프론트엔드 요구 사항 필요","디자인 특정 요청 또는 인터페이스 변경에 의존"],"es":["Requires user-provided frontend requirements","Dependent on design-specific requests or interface changes"],"fr":["Requires user-provided frontend requirements","Dependent on design-specific requests or interface changes"],"de":["Requires user-provided frontend requirements","Dependent on design-specific requests or interface changes"],"pt":["Exige requisitos de frontend fornecidos pelo usuário","Dependente de solicitações de design específicas ou alterações de interface"],"ru":["Требует наличия требований к frontend, предоставленных пользователем","Зависит от конкретных дизайнерских запросов или изменений интерфейса"],"ar":["يتطلب متطلبات واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المقدمة من قبل المستخدم","يعتمد على طلبات تصميم محددة أو تغييرات في الواجهة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
