依存関係の管理が可能","ko":"Convex 컴포넌트 작성은 개발자가 자체 포함 및 재사용 가능한 컴포넌트를 작성할 수 있도록 하며, 적절한 격리, 내보내기 및 의존성 관리가 가능","es":"Los componentes Convex son elementos autocontenidos y reutilizables que facilitan la creación de proyectos escalables","fr":"Les composants Convex sont des éléments autocontenus et réutilisables qui facilitent la création de projets évolutifs","de":"Convex-Komponenten sind selbstenthaltene und wiederverwendbare Elemente, die die Erstellung von skalierbaren Projekten erleichtern","pt":"Desenvolva componentes Convex autocontidos e reutilizáveis com isolamento, exportação e gerenciamento de dependências adequados.","ru":"Разрабатывайте самодостаточные и повторно используемые компоненты Convex с правильной изоляцией, экспортом и управлением зависимостями.","ar":"طور مكونات Convex مستقلة وقابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع العزل والتصدير وإدارة التبعيات المناسبة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自包含的 Convex 组件","可重用的组件","适当的隔离","导出和依赖管理","跨项目共享"],"ja":["自包含的 Convex コンポーネント","再利用可能なコンポーネント","適切な隔離","エクスポートと依存関係の管理","プロジェクト間の共有"],"ko":["자체 포함 Convex 컴포넌트","재사용 가능한 컴포넌트","적절한 격리","내보내기 및 의존성 관리","프로젝트 간 공유"],"es":["Creación de componentes autocontenidos","Gestión de dependencias","Exportación de componentes","Aislamiento de componentes","Reutilización de componentes"],"fr":["Création de composants autocontenus","Gestion de dépendances","Exportation de composants","Isolation de composants","Réutilisation de composants"],"de":["Erstellung von selbstenthaltenden Komponenten","Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Export von Komponenten","Isolation von Komponenten","Wiederverwendung von Komponenten"],"pt":["Criação de componentes autocontidos","Gerenciamento de dependências","Exportação de componentes","Isolamento de componentes","Reutilização de componentes","Documentação de componentes"],"ru":["Создание самодостаточных компонентов","Управление зависимостями","Экспорт компонентов","Изоляция компонентов","Повторное использование компонентов","Документация компонентов"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات مستقلة","إدارة التبعيات","تصدير المكونات","عزل المكونات","إعادة استخدام المكونات","توثيق المكونات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex 组件","Convex 组件创作","自包含的组件","可重用的组件","隔离","导出","依赖管理","Convex 开发"],"ja":["Convex コンポーネント","Convex コンポーネントの作成","自包含的コンポーネント","再利用可能なコンポーネント","隔離","エクスポート","依存関係の管理","Convex 開発"],"ko":["Convex 컴포넌트","Convex 컴포넌트 작성","자체 포함 컴포넌트","재사용 가능한 컴포넌트","격리","내보내기","의존성 관리","Convex 개발"],"es":["componentes Convex","creación de componentes","gestión de dependencias","exportación de componentes","aislamiento de componentes","reutilización de componentes","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["composants Convex","création de composants","gestion de dépendances","exportation de composants","isolation de composants","réutilisation de composants","développement de logiciel"],"de":["Convex-Komponenten","Erstellung von Komponenten","Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Export von Komponenten","Isolation von Komponenten","Wiederverwendung von Komponenten","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["componentes Convex","desenvolvimento de componentes","reutilização de componentes","gerenciamento de dependências","exportação de componentes","isolamento de componentes","documentação de componentes","criação de componentes autocontidos"],"ru":["компоненты Convex","разработка компонентов","повторное использование компонентов","управление зависимостями","экспорт компонентов","изоляция компонентов","документация компонентов","создание самодостаточных компонентов"],"ar":["مكونات Convex","تطوير المكونات","إعادة استخدام المكونات","إدارة التبعيات","تصدير المكونات","عزل المكونات","توثيق المكونات","إنشاء مكونات مستقلة"]}},"owner":"blocknavi","repo":"convex-batch-processor","repoPath":"blocknavi/convex-batch-processor","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convex-component-authoring","description":"How to create, structure, and publish self-contained Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","components","reusable","packages","npm"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex component","body":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex components are self-contained packages that include:\n- Database tables (isolated from the main app)\n- Functions (queries, mutations, actions)\n- TypeScript types and validators\n- Optional frontend hooks\n\n### Component Structure\n\n```\nmy-convex-component/\n├── package.json\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── README.md\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts           # Main exports\n│   ├── component.ts       # Component definition\n│   ├── schema.ts          # Component schema\n│   └── functions/\n│       ├── queries.ts\n│       ├── mutations.ts\n│       └── actions.ts\n└── convex.config.ts       # Component configuration\n```\n\n### Creating a Component\n\n#### 1. Component Configuration\n\n```typescript\n// convex.config.ts\nimport { defineComponent } from \"convex/server\";\n\nexport default defineComponent(\"myComponent\");\n```\n\n#### 2. Component Schema\n\n```typescript\n// src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  // Tables are isolated to this component\n  items: defineTable({\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  }).index(\"by_name\", [\"name\"]),\n  \n  config: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    value: v.any(),\n  }).index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"]),\n});\n```\n\n#### 3. Component Definition\n\n```typescript\n// src/component.ts\nimport { defineComponent, ComponentDefinition } from \"convex/server\";\nimport schema from \"./schema\";\nimport * as queries from \"./functions/queries\";\nimport * as mutations from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\nconst component = defineComponent(\"myComponent\", {\n  schema,\n  functions: {\n    ...queries,\n    ...mutations,\n  },\n});\n\nexport default component;\n```\n\n#### 4. Component Functions\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/queries.ts\nimport { query } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const list = query({\n  args: {\n    limit: v.optional(v.number()),\n  },\n  returns: v.array(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  })),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .take(args.limit ?? 10);\n  },\n});\n\nexport const get = query({\n  args: { name: v.string() },\n  returns: v.union(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  }), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_name\", (q) => q.eq(\"name\", args.name))\n      .unique();\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const create = mutation({\n  args: {\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"items\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"items\", {\n      name: args.name,\n      data: args.data,\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n\nexport const update = mutation({\n  args: {\n    id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.patch(args.id, { data: args.data });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\nexport const remove = mutation({\n  args: { id: v.id(\"items\") },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.delete(args.id);\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n#### 5. Main Exports\n\n```typescript\n// src/index.ts\nexport { default as component } from \"./component\";\nexport * from \"./functions/queries\";\nexport * from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\n// Export types for consumers\nexport type { Id } from \"./_generated/dataModel\";\n```\n\n### Using a Component\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"myComponent\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s code\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction MyApp() {\n  // Access component functions through the app''s API\n  const items = useQuery(api.myComponent.list, { limit: 10 });\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.myComponent.create);\n  \n  return (\n    <div>\n      {items?.map((item) => (\n        <div key={item._id}>{item.name}</div>\n      ))}\n      <button onClick={() => createItem({ name: \"New\", data: {} })}>\n        Add Item\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Component Configuration Options\n\n```typescript\n// convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\n// Basic usage\napp.use(myComponent);\n\n// With custom name\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"customName\" });\n\n// Multiple instances\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance1\" });\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance2\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n### Providing Component Hooks\n\n```typescript\n// src/hooks.ts\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { FunctionReference } from \"convex/server\";\n\n// Type-safe hooks for component consumers\nexport function useMyComponent(api: {\n  list: FunctionReference<\"query\">;\n  create: FunctionReference<\"mutation\">;\n}) {\n  const items = useQuery(api.list, {});\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.create);\n  \n  return {\n    items,\n    createItem,\n    isLoading: items === undefined,\n  };\n}\n```\n\n### Publishing a Component\n\n#### package.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-convex-component\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"A reusable Convex component\",\n  \"main\": \"dist/index.js\",\n  \"types\": \"dist/index.d.ts\",\n  \"files\": [\n    \"dist\",\n    \"convex.config.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"tsc\",\n    \"prepublishOnly\": \"npm run build\"\n  },\n  \"peerDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.17.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"convex\",\n    \"component\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n#### tsconfig.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2020\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"declaration\": true,\n    \"outDir\": \"dist\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src/**/*\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Rate Limiter Component\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  requests: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    timestamp: v.number(),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"])\n    .index(\"by_key_and_time\", [\"key\", \"timestamp\"]),\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const checkLimit = mutation({\n  args: {\n    key: v.string(),\n    limit: v.number(),\n    windowMs: v.number(),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({\n    allowed: v.boolean(),\n    remaining: v.number(),\n    resetAt: v.number(),\n  }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const now = Date.now();\n    const windowStart = now - args.windowMs;\n    \n    // Clean old entries\n    const oldEntries = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key_and_time\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"key\", args.key).lt(\"timestamp\", windowStart)\n      )\n      .collect();\n    \n    for (const entry of oldEntries) {\n      await ctx.db.delete(entry._id);\n    }\n    \n    // Count current window\n    const currentRequests = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key\", (q) => q.eq(\"key\", args.key))\n      .collect();\n    \n    const remaining = Math.max(0, args.limit - currentRequests.length);\n    const allowed = remaining > 0;\n    \n    if (allowed) {\n      await ctx.db.insert(\"requests\", {\n        key: args.key,\n        timestamp: now,\n      });\n    }\n    \n    const oldestRequest = currentRequests[0];\n    const resetAt = oldestRequest \n      ? oldestRequest.timestamp + args.windowMs \n      : now + args.windowMs;\n    \n    return { allowed, remaining: remaining - (allowed ? 1 : 0), resetAt };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// Usage in consuming app\nimport { useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction useRateLimitedAction() {\n  const checkLimit = useMutation(api.rateLimiter.checkLimit);\n  \n  return async (action: () => Promise<void>) => {\n    const result = await checkLimit({\n      key: \"user-action\",\n      limit: 10,\n      windowMs: 60000,\n    });\n    \n    if (!result.allowed) {\n      throw new Error(`Rate limited. Try again at ${new Date(result.resetAt)}`);\n    }\n    \n    await action();\n  };\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Keep component tables isolated (don''t reference main app tables)\n- Export clear TypeScript types for consumers\n- Document all public functions and their arguments\n- Use semantic versioning for component releases\n- Include comprehensive README with examples\n- Test components in isolation before publishing\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Cross-referencing tables** - Component tables should be self-contained\n2. **Missing type exports** - Export all necessary types\n3. **Hardcoded configuration** - Use component options for customization\n4. **No versioning** - Follow semantic versioning\n5. **Poor documentation** - Document all public APIs\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Components: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:23:26.868Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced Convex component creation with proper isolation and dependency management.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Convex 组件创建的 AI Agent，具有适当的隔离和依赖管理。","ja":"Convex コンポーネントの作成に高度な隔離と依存関係管理が必要な AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Convex 컴포넌트 생성과 적절한 분리 및 의존성 관리가 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan creación avanzada de componentes Convex con aislamiento y gestión de dependencias adecuados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant une création avancée de composants Convex avec une isolation et une gestion des dépendances appropriées.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Erstellung von Convex-Komponenten mit ordnungsgemäßer Isolation und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de criação avançada de componentes Convex com isolamento e gerenciamento de dependências adequados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходима продвинутая создание компонентов Convex с правильной изоляцией и управлением зависимостями.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكي التي تحتاج إلى إنشاء متقدم لمكونات Convex مع العزل والإدارة التابعة المناسبة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create self-contained, reusable Convex components with exports and dependency management, leveraging the latest documentation from https://docs.convex.dev/components and https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring, for seamless sharing across projects.","zh":"赋予代理创建自包含、可重用的 Convex 组件的能力，具有导出和依赖管理，利用 https://docs.convex.dev/components 和 https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring 的最新文档，以便在项目之间无缝共享。","ja":"エージェントが自己完結型の再利用可能な Convex コンポーネントを作成できるようにし、https://docs.convex.dev/components および https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring の最新のドキュメントを利用して、エクスポートと依存関係管理を行い、プロジェクト間でシームレスに共有できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 자체적으로 포함된 재사용 가능한 Convex 컴포넌트를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, https://docs.convex.dev/components 및 https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring의 최신 문서를 활용하여 내보내기 및 의존성 관리를 수행하여 프로젝트 간에 원활하게 공유할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes Convex autocontenidos y reutilizables con exportaciones y gestión de dependencias, aprovechando la última documentación de https://docs.convex.dev/components y https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring, para un intercambio transparente entre proyectos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants Convex autocontenus et réutilisables avec des exportations et une gestion des dépendances, en exploitant la dernière documentation de https://docs.convex.dev/components et https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring, pour un partage transparent entre les projets.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, selbstenthaltene und wiederverwendbare Convex-Komponenten mit Exporten und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung zu erstellen, indem sie die neueste Dokumentation von https://docs.convex.dev/components und https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring nutzen, für eine nahtlose Weitergabe zwischen Projekten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes Convex autocontidos e reutilizáveis com exportações e gerenciamento de dependências, utilizando a documentação mais recente de https://docs.convex.dev/components e https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring, para compartilhamento fácil entre projetos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать самодостаточные и многократно используемые компоненты Convex с экспортами и управлением зависимостями, используя последнюю документацию по https://docs.convex.dev/components и https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring, для беспрепятственного обмена между проектами.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مكونات Convex مستقلة ومتعددة الاستخدامات مع الصادرات وإدارة التبعيات، باستخدام أحدث الوثائق من https://docs.convex.dev/components و https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring، من أجل المشاركة السهلة عبر المشاريع."},"useCases":{"en":["Authoring reusable Convex components for multiple projects","Managing dependencies across Convex components","Exporting Convex components for easy integration"],"zh":["为多个项目创建可重用的 Convex 组件","跨 Convex 组件管理依赖","导出 Convex 组件以便于集成"],"ja":["複数のプロジェクト用に再利用可能な Convex コンポーネントを作成する","Convex コンポーネント間の依存関係を管理する","Convex コンポーネントをエクスポートして容易に統合する"],"ko":["여러 프로젝트용 재사용 가능한 Convex 컴포넌트 작성","Convex 컴포넌트 간 의존성 관리","Convex 컴포넌트 내보내기 및 쉽게 통합"],"es":["Creación de componentes Convex reutilizables para múltiples proyectos","Gestión de dependencias entre componentes Convex","Exportación de componentes Convex para una integración sencilla"],"fr":["Création de composants Convex réutilisables pour plusieurs projets","Gestion des dépendances entre les composants Convex","Exportation de composants Convex pour une intégration facile"],"de":["Erstellung wiederverwendbarer Convex-Komponenten für mehrere Projekte","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten zwischen Convex-Komponenten","Export von Convex-Komponenten für eine einfache Integration"],"pt":["Criação de componentes Convex reutilizáveis para vários projetos","Gerenciamento de dependências entre componentes Convex","Exportação de componentes Convex para integração fácil"],"ru":["Создание многократно используемых компонентов Convex для нескольких проектов","Управление зависимостями между компонентами Convex","Экспорт компонентов Convex для легкой интеграции"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات Convex قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لعدة مشاريع","إدارة التبعيات بين مكونات Convex","تصدير مكونات Convex من أجل التكامل السهل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Convex documentation","Convex components only","Proper isolation and dependency management required"],"zh":["需要访问 Convex 文档","仅限 Convex 组件","需要适当的隔离和依赖管理"],"ja":["Convex ドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","Convex コンポーネントのみ","適切な隔離と依存関係管理が必要"],"ko":["Convex 문서에 접근해야 함","Convex 컴포넌트만 해당","적절한 분리 및 의존성 관리가 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación de Convex","Solo componentes Convex","Se requiere un aislamiento y gestión de dependencias adecuados"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation Convex","Composants Convex uniquement","Un isolement et une gestion des dépendances appropriés sont requis"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Convex-Dokumentation","Nur Convex-Komponenten","Eine ordnungsgemäße Isolation und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer acesso à documentação Convex","Apenas componentes Convex","Requer isolamento e gerenciamento de dependências adequados"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к документации Convex","Только компоненты Convex","Требуется правильное изоляция и управление зависимостями"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى وثائق Convex","مكونات Convex فقط","يتطلب عزل وإدارة تابعة مناسبة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
