とサイドカーの構成を使用して分散アプリケーションを構築する方法を提供します","ko":"Dapr 통합 스킬은 Dapr의 컴포넌트와 사이드카 구성으로 분산 애플리케이션을 구축하는 방법을 제공합니다","es":"Dapr es un framework de código abierto para construir aplicaciones distribuidas. Esta guía rápida te muestra cómo integrar Dapr en tus proyectos","fr":"Dapr est un framework open source pour construire des applications distribuées. Ce guide rapide vous montre comment intégrer Dapr dans vos projets","de":"Dapr ist ein Open-Source-Framework für den Bau von verteilten Anwendungen. Diese Schnellstart-Anleitung zeigt Ihnen, wie Sie Dapr in Ihre Projekte integrieren","pt":"A integração Dapr é um framework que facilita a criação de aplicações distribuídas. Aprenda a iniciá-la em 6 passos","ru":"Dapr интеграция - это фреймворк, который облегчает создание распределенных приложений. Узнайте, как его использовать в 6 шагах","ar":"دمج Dapr هو إطار عمل يسهل إنشاء التطبيقات الموزعة. تعلم كيفية تشغيله في 6 خطوات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["快速开始","Dapr组件配置","sidecar注解","本地测试","Kubernetes部署","分布式应用构建"],"ja":["クイックスタート","Daprコンポーネントの構成","サイドカーの注釈","ローカルテスト","Kubernetesデプロイ","分散アプリケーションの構築"],"ko":["빠른 시작","Dapr 컴포넌트 구성","사이드카 注釈","로컬 테스트","Kubernetes 배포","분산 애플리케이션 구축"],"es":["Inicialización de Dapr","Creación de componentes","Configuración de sidecar","Pruebas locales","Integración con Kubernetes","Uso de comandos Dapr"],"fr":["Initialisation de Dapr","Création de composants","Configuration de sidecar","Tests locaux","Intégration avec Kubernetes","Utilisation de commandes Dapr"],"de":["Initialisierung von Dapr","Erstellung von Komponenten","Konfiguration von Sidecar","Lokale Tests","Integration mit Kubernetes","Verwendung von Dapr-Befehlen"],"pt":["Iniciação rápida com 6 passos","Criação de componentes personalizados","Configuração de sidecar para implantações em Kubernetes","Testes locais com comandos Dapr","Integração com aplicações existentes","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes"],"ru":["Быстрый старт в 6 шагах","Создание пользовательских компонентов","Настройка sidecar для развертываний в Kubernetes","Местное тестирование с командами Dapr","Интеграция с существующими приложениями","Поддержка нескольких сред"],"ar":["بدء سريع في 6 خطوات","إنشاء مكونات مخصصة","تكوين sidecar لتنصيب Kubernetes","اختبار محلي بأوامر Dapr","دمج مع التطبيقات الحالية","دعم بيئات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Dapr","分布式应用","Dapr集成","sidecar","Kubernetes","Dapr组件","本地测试","分散アプリケーション"],"ja":["Dapr","分散アプリケーション","Dapr統合","サイドカー","Kubernetes","Daprコンポーネント","ローカルテスト","分散アプリケーション構築"],"ko":["Dapr","분산 애플리케이션","Dapr 통합","사이드카","Kubernetes","Dapr 컴포넌트","로컬 테스트","분산 애플리케이션 구축"],"es":["dapr","integración de dapr","desarrollo de aplicaciones distribuidas","framework de código abierto","kubernetes","sidecar","pruebas locales","comandos dapr"],"fr":["dapr","intégration dapr","développement d''applications distribuées","framework open source","kubernetes","sidecar","tests locaux","commandes dapr"],"de":["dapr","dapr-integration","entwicklung von verteilten anwendungen","open-source-framework","kubernetes","sidecar","lokale tests","dapr-befehle"],"pt":["Dapr","integração Dapr","desenvolvimento de aplicações distribuídas","Kubernetes","sidecar","testes locais","componentes personalizados","aplicações escaláveis"],"ru":["Dapr","Dapr интеграция","создание распределенных приложений","Kubernetes","sidecar","местное тестирование","пользовательские компоненты","масштабируемые приложения"],"ar":["Dapr","دمج Dapr","تحديث التطبيقات الموزعة","Kubernetes","sidecar","اختبار محلي","مكونات مخصصة","تطبيقات قابلة للتوسيع"]}},"owner":"maneeshanif","repo":"todo-spec-driven","repoPath":"maneeshanif/todo-spec-driven","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dapr-integration","description":"Integrate Dapr building blocks for event-driven microservices - Pub/Sub, State Management, Secrets, Service Invocation, and Jobs API. Use when implementing event-driven architecture for Phase 5. (project)","bodyPreview":"# Dapr Integration Skill\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Read Phase 5 Constitution** - `constitution-prompt-phase-5.md`\n2. **Check Dapr installation** - `dapr --version`\n3. **Initialize Dapr** - `dapr init` or `dapr init -k` for Kubernetes\n4. **Create component files** - In `dapr-components/` directory\n5. **Configure sidecar** - Annotations for Kubernetes deployments\n6. **Test locally** - `dapr run` commands\n\n## Dapr Building Blocks Overview\n\n| Building Block | Purpose | Phase 5 Usage |\n|----------------|","body":"# Dapr Integration Skill\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Read Phase 5 Constitution** - `constitution-prompt-phase-5.md`\n2. **Check Dapr installation** - `dapr --version`\n3. **Initialize Dapr** - `dapr init` or `dapr init -k` for Kubernetes\n4. **Create component files** - In `dapr-components/` directory\n5. **Configure sidecar** - Annotations for Kubernetes deployments\n6. **Test locally** - `dapr run` commands\n\n## Dapr Building Blocks Overview\n\n| Building Block | Purpose | Phase 5 Usage |\n|----------------|---------|---------------|\n| **Pub/Sub** | Event messaging | Task events, reminders, audit logs |\n| **State** | Key-value storage | Cache, session state |\n| **Secrets** | Secret management | API keys, DB credentials |\n| **Service Invocation** | Service-to-service calls | Microservice communication |\n| **Jobs API** | Scheduled tasks | Recurring task scheduling |\n\n## Component Configuration\n\n### Pub/Sub Component (Kafka)\n\nCreate `dapr-components/pubsub.yaml`:\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: dapr.io/v1alpha1\nkind: Component\nmetadata:\n  name: taskpubsub\n  namespace: todo-app\nspec:\n  type: pubsub.kafka\n  version: v1\n  metadata:\n    - name: brokers\n      value: \"kafka:9092\"\n    - name: consumerGroup\n      value: \"todo-consumer-group\"\n    - name: authType\n      value: \"none\"\n    - name: disableTls\n      value: \"true\"\nscopes:\n  - backend\n  - notification-service\n  - recurring-service\n  - audit-service\n```\n\n### State Store Component\n\nCreate `dapr-components/statestore.yaml`:\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: dapr.io/v1alpha1\nkind: Component\nmetadata:\n  name: statestore\n  namespace: todo-app\nspec:\n  type: state.redis\n  version: v1\n  metadata:\n    - name: redisHost\n      value: \"redis:6379\"\n    - name: redisPassword\n      value: \"\"\n    - name: actorStateStore\n      value: \"true\"\nscopes:\n  - backend\n```\n\n### Secrets Component\n\nCreate `dapr-components/secrets.yaml`:\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: dapr.io/v1alpha1\nkind: Component\nmetadata:\n  name: kubernetes-secrets\n  namespace: todo-app\nspec:\n  type: secretstores.kubernetes\n  version: v1\n  metadata: []\n```\n\n## Python SDK Integration\n\n### Installation\n\n```bash\nuv add dapr dapr-ext-fastapi\n```\n\n### Pub/Sub Publisher\n\n```python\nfrom dapr.clients import DaprClient\n\nasync def publish_task_event(event_type: str, task_data: dict):\n    \"\"\"Publish task event to Kafka via Dapr.\"\"\"\n    with DaprClient() as client:\n        client.publish_event(\n            pubsub_name=\"taskpubsub\",\n            topic_name=\"task-events\",\n            data=json.dumps({\n                \"event_type\": event_type,\n                \"task\": task_data,\n                \"timestamp\": datetime.utcnow().isoformat()\n            }),\n            data_content_type=\"application/json\"\n        )\n```\n\n### Pub/Sub Subscriber (FastAPI)\n\n```python\nfrom dapr.ext.fastapi import DaprApp\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp = FastAPI()\ndapr_app = DaprApp(app)\n\n@dapr_app.subscribe(pubsub=\"taskpubsub\", topic=\"task-events\")\nasync def handle_task_event(event: dict):\n    \"\"\"Handle incoming task events.\"\"\"\n    event_type = event.get(\"event_type\")\n    task_data = event.get(\"task\")\n\n    if event_type == \"task.created\":\n        await process_new_task(task_data)\n    elif event_type == \"task.completed\":\n        await process_completed_task(task_data)\n```\n\n### State Management\n\n```python\nfrom dapr.clients import DaprClient\n\nasync def save_state(key: str, value: dict):\n    \"\"\"Save state to Dapr state store.\"\"\"\n    with DaprClient() as client:\n        client.save_state(\n            store_name=\"statestore\",\n            key=key,\n            value=json.dumps(value)\n        )\n\nasync def get_state(key: str) -> dict | None:\n    \"\"\"Get state from Dapr state store.\"\"\"\n    with DaprClient() as client:\n        state = client.get_state(store_name=\"statestore\", key=key)\n        return json.loads(state.data) if state.data else None\n```\n\n### Service Invocation\n\n```python\nfrom dapr.clients import DaprClient\n\nasync def invoke_notification_service(user_id: str, message: str):\n    \"\"\"Invoke notification service via Dapr.\"\"\"\n    with DaprClient() as client:\n        response = client.invoke_method(\n            app_id=\"notification-service\",\n            method_name=\"send\",\n            data=json.dumps({\n                \"user_id\": user_id,\n                \"message\": message\n            }),\n            http_verb=\"POST\"\n        )\n        return response.json()\n```\n\n### Jobs API (Scheduled Tasks)\n\n```python\nfrom dapr.clients import DaprClient\n\nasync def schedule_reminder(reminder_id: str, due_at: datetime):\n    \"\"\"Schedule a reminder using Dapr Jobs API.\"\"\"\n    with DaprClient() as client:\n        # Create a scheduled job\n        client.start_workflow(\n            workflow_component=\"dapr\",\n            workflow_name=\"reminder-workflow\",\n            input={\n                \"reminder_id\": reminder_id,\n                \"scheduled_time\": due_at.isoformat()\n            }\n        )\n```\n\n## Kubernetes Deployment Annotations\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: backend\nspec:\n  template:\n    metadata:\n      annotations:\n        dapr.io/enabled: \"true\"\n        dapr.io/app-id: \"backend\"\n        dapr.io/app-port: \"8000\"\n        dapr.io/enable-api-logging: \"true\"\n        dapr.io/log-level: \"info\"\n        dapr.io/config: \"dapr-config\"\n    spec:\n      containers:\n        - name: backend\n          image: evolution-todo/backend:latest\n```\n\n## Local Development with Dapr\n\n### Run with Dapr Sidecar\n\n```bash\n# Run backend with Dapr\ndapr run --app-id backend \\\n         --app-port 8000 \\\n         --dapr-http-port 3500 \\\n         --components-path ./dapr-components \\\n         -- uv run uvicorn src.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000\n\n# Run notification service with Dapr\ndapr run --app-id notification-service \\\n         --app-port 8002 \\\n         --dapr-http-port 3502 \\\n         --components-path ./dapr-components \\\n         -- uv run uvicorn services.notification.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8002\n```\n\n### Test Pub/Sub\n\n```bash\n# Publish test event\ndapr publish --publish-app-id backend \\\n             --pubsub taskpubsub \\\n             --topic task-events \\\n             --data ''{\"event_type\":\"task.created\",\"task\":{\"id\":\"123\",\"title\":\"Test\"}}''\n```\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\n- [ ] Dapr CLI installed (`dapr --version`)\n- [ ] Dapr initialized (`dapr init` or `dapr init -k`)\n- [ ] Component files created in `dapr-components/`\n- [ ] Python SDK installed (`dapr`, `dapr-ext-fastapi`)\n- [ ] Pub/Sub working (publish → subscribe)\n- [ ] State store working (save → get)\n- [ ] Service invocation working\n- [ ] Kubernetes annotations configured\n- [ ] All services have Dapr sidecars\n\n## Event Topics\n\n| Topic | Publisher | Subscribers | Purpose |\n|-------|-----------|-------------|---------|\n| `task-events` | Backend | Notification, Audit, WebSocket | Task CRUD events |\n| `reminder-events` | Recurring Service | Notification, Backend | Reminder triggers |\n| `audit-events` | All Services | Audit Service | Audit logging |\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Issue | Cause | Solution |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| Sidecar not starting | Missing annotations | Add `dapr.io/enabled: \"true\"` |\n| Pub/Sub not working | Component not loaded | Check component scope |\n| Connection refused | Wrong port | Verify `app-port` matches app |\n| State not persisting | Redis not running | Start Redis container |\n\n## References\n\n- [Dapr Documentation](https://docs.dapr.io/)\n- [Dapr Python SDK](https://github.com/dapr/python-sdk)\n- [Dapr Pub/Sub](https://docs.dapr.io/developing-applications/building-blocks/pubsub/)\n- [Dapr State Management](https://docs.dapr.io/developing-applications/building-blocks/state-management/)\n- [Phase 5 Constitution](../../../constitution-prompt-phase-5.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:23:28.203Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Native Agents requiring seamless distributed system integration with Dapr''s building blocks","zh":"非常适合需要与 Dapr 构建块无缝集成分布式系统的云原生智能体","ja":"Daprのビルディングブロックを使用した分散システムとのシームレスな統合を必要とするクラウドネイティブエージェントに最適","ko":"Dapr의 빌딩 블록과 원활한 분산 시스템 통합이 필요한 클라우드 네이티브 에이전트에 이상적","es":"Ideal para Agentes Nativos de la Nube que requieren una integración de sistema distribuido sin problemas con los bloques de construcción de Dapr","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud Native nécessitant une intégration de système distribué transparente avec les briques de construction de Dapr","de":"Ideal für Cloud Native Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration von verteilten Systemen mit Daprs Bausteinen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Nativos em Nuvem que exigem integração de sistema distribuído sem interrupções com os blocos de construção do Dapr","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, требующих бесшовной интеграции распределенных систем с строительными блоками Dapr","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأصليين في السحابة الذين يتطلبون تكامل نظام موزع بدون انقطاع مع كتلة البناء من Dapr"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Dapr''s sidecar architecture, enabling efficient component creation, Kubernetes deployment, and local testing with `dapr run` commands, while utilizing Dapr''s component model for scalable and secure distributed systems","zh":"使智能体能够利用 Dapr 的边车架构，从而支持高效的组件创建、Kubernetes 部署以及使用 `dapr run` 命令进行本地测试，同时利用 Dapr 的组件模型构建可扩展且安全的分布式系统","ja":"Daprのサイドカーアーキテクチャを活用して、効率的なコンポーネント作成、Kubernetesへのデプロイ、`dapr run`コマンドを使用したローカルテストを可能にし、スケーラブルで安全な分散システムを構築するためのDaprのコンポーネントモデルを利用します","ko":"Dapr의 사이드카 아키텍처를 활용하여 효율적인 컴포넌트 생성, Kubernetes 배포, `dapr run` 명령어로 로컬 테스트를 가능하게 하고, 확장 가능하고 안전한 분산 시스템을 위해 Dapr의 컴포넌트 모델을 활용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar la arquitectura sidecar de Dapr, lo que permite una creación de componentes eficiente, una implementación de Kubernetes y pruebas locales con comandos `dapr run`, al mismo tiempo que utiliza el modelo de componentes de Dapr para sistemas distribuidos escalables y seguros","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter l''architecture sidecar de Dapr, permettant une création de composants efficace, un déploiement Kubernetes et des tests locaux avec des commandes `dapr run`, tout en utilisant le modèle de composants de Dapr pour des systèmes distribués escalables et sécurisés","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Daprs Sidecar-Architektur zu nutzen, wodurch eine effiziente Erstellung von Komponenten, eine Kubernetes-Bereitstellung und lokale Tests mit `dapr run`-Befehlen ermöglicht werden, während gleichzeitig Daprs Komponentenmodell für skalierbare und sichere verteilte Systeme genutzt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitarem a arquitetura sidecar do Dapr, permitindo a criação eficiente de componentes, implantação no Kubernetes e testes locais com comandos `dapr run`, ao mesmo tempo em que utiliza o modelo de componentes do Dapr para sistemas distribuídos escaláveis e seguros","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать архитектуру sidecar Dapr, обеспечивая эффективное создание компонентов, развертывание в Kubernetes и локальное тестирование с командами `dapr run`, а также использует модель компонентов Dapr для масштабируемых и безопасных распределенных систем","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من استخدام هندسة Sidecar من Dapr، وتمكينهم من إنشاء المكونات بكفاءة، وتحميل Kubernetes، والاختبار المحلي مع أوامر `dapr run`، وفي الوقت نفسه استخدام نموذج المكونات من Dapr لنظم موزعة قابلة للتوسيع وأمنها"},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing Dapr for Kubernetes deployments","Creating and configuring Dapr components for distributed systems","Testing Dapr integrations locally with `dapr init` and `dapr run`"],"zh":["为 Kubernetes 部署初始化 Dapr","为分布式系统创建和配置 Dapr 组件","使用 `dapr init` 和 `dapr run` 在本地测试 Dapr 集成"],"ja":["Kubernetesデプロイメント用のDaprの初期化","分散システム用のDaprコンポーネントの作成と設定","`dapr init`および`dapr run`を使用したDapr統合のローカルテスト"],"ko":["Kubernetes 배포를 위한 Dapr 초기화","분산 시스템을 위한 Dapr 컴포넌트 생성 및 구성","`dapr init` 및 `dapr run`으로 Dapr 통합 로컬 테스트"],"es":["Inicializar Dapr para implementaciones de Kubernetes","Crear y configurar componentes de Dapr para sistemas distribuidos","Probar integraciones de Dapr de forma local con `dapr init` y `dapr run`"],"fr":["Initialiser Dapr pour les déploiements Kubernetes","Créer et configurer les composants Dapr pour les systèmes distribués","Tester les intégrations Dapr localement avec `dapr init` et `dapr run`"],"de":["Dapr für Kubernetes-Bereitstellungen initialisieren","Dapr-Komponenten für verteilte Systeme erstellen und konfigurieren","Dapr-Integrationen lokal mit `dapr init` und `dapr run` testen"],"pt":["Inicializar o Dapr para implantações do Kubernetes","Criar e configurar componentes do Dapr para sistemas distribuídos","Testar integrações do Dapr localmente com `dapr init` e `dapr run`"],"ru":["Инициализация Dapr для развертывания в Kubernetes","Создание и настройка компонентов Dapr для распределенных систем","Локальное тестирование интеграций Dapr с помощью `dapr init` и `dapr run`"],"ar":["تهيئة Dapr لتحميل Kubernetes","إنشاء وتكوين مكونات Dapr لنظم موزعة","اختبار التكاملات المحلية من Dapr باستخدام `dapr init` و `dapr run`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Dapr installation and initialization","Kubernetes environment needed for full deployment capabilities","Familiarity with Dapr''s component model and building blocks necessary"],"zh":["需要安装和初始化 Dapr","需要 Kubernetes 环境以实现完整的部署功能","需要熟悉 Dapr 的组件模型和构建块"],"ja":["Daprのインストールと初期化が必要","完全なデプロイ機能にはKubernetes環境が必要","Daprのコンポーネントモデルとビルディングブロックに関する知識が必要"],"ko":["Dapr 설치 및 초기화 필요","전체 배포 기능에는 Kubernetes 환경 필요","Dapr의 컴포넌트 모델 및 빌딩 블록에 대한 숙련도 필요"],"es":["Requiere instalación y inicialización de Dapr","Se necesita un entorno de Kubernetes para las capacidades de implementación completa","Se requiere familiaridad con el modelo de componentes de Dapr y los bloques de construcción"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et l''initialisation de Dapr","Un environnement Kubernetes est nécessaire pour les capacités de déploiement complet","Une familiarité avec le modèle de composants de Dapr et les briques de construction est nécessaire"],"de":["Erfordert Dapr-Installation und -Initialisierung","Ein Kubernetes-Umgebung ist für die vollständigen Bereitstellungsfähigkeiten erforderlich","Kenntnisse des Dapr-Komponentenmodells und der Bausteine sind erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige instalação e inicialização do Dapr","Ambiente do Kubernetes necessário para capacidades de implantação completa","Familiaridade com o modelo de componentes do Dapr e blocos de construção necessária"],"ru":["Требует установки и инициализации Dapr","Среда Kubernetes необходима для полных возможностей развертывания","Знакомство с моделью компонентов Dapr и строительными блоками необходимо"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Dapr وتهيئته","بيئة Kubernetes مطلوبة للقدرات الكاملة للتحميل","الاطلاع على نموذج المكونات من Dapr والكتلة البناء ضروري"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
