プロセス","ko":"실험 루프 최적화 기술은 콘텐츠 변화를 추적하고, 그에 대한 트래픽과 순위에 대한 영향을 측정하여 유지, 반복 또는 취소 여부를 결정하는 과정","es":"Experiment Loop es una herramienta que ayuda a medir el impacto de los cambios en el contenido en el tráfico y los rankings","fr":"Experiment Loop est un outil qui aide à mesurer l''impact des modifications de contenu sur le trafic et les classements","de":"Experiment Loop ist ein Tool, das hilft, die Auswirkungen von Inhaltänderungen auf den Traffik und die Rankings zu messen","pt":"O Experiment Loop é uma ferramenta que ajuda a otimizar o conteúdo, medindo seu impacto nas métricas de tráfego e classificação","ru":"Экспериментальный Цикл - это инструмент, помогающий оптимизировать контент, измеряя его влияние на трафик и рейтинг","ar":"حلقات التجربة هي أداة تساعد على تحسين المحتوى، بقياس تأثيره على حركة المرور والتصنيف","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["跟踪内容变化","衡量流量和排名的影响","决定是否保留、迭代或撤销","支持YMYL内容","考虑SEO和AEO延迟","每周运行"],"ja":["コンテンツの変更を追跡","トラフィックとランキングへの影響を測定","保持、反復、または取り消しを決定","YMYLコンテンツをサポート","SEOとAEOの遅延を考慮","毎週実行"],"ko":["콘텐츠 변화를 추적","트래픽과 순위에 대한 영향을 측정","유지, 반복 또는 취소 여부를 결정","YMYL 콘텐츠 지원","SEO와 AEO의 지연을 고려","매주 실행"],"es":["Seguimiento de cambios en el contenido","Medición del impacto en el tráfico y los rankings","Decisión de mantener, iterar o revertir cambios","Ejecución semanal","Consideración de tiempos de demora para contenido YMYL"],"fr":["Suivi des modifications de contenu","Mesure de l''impact sur le trafic et les classements","Décision de maintenir, d''itérer ou d''annuler les modifications","Exécution hebdomadaire","Prise en compte des délais pour le contenu YMYL"],"de":["Verfolgung von Inhaltänderungen","Messung der Auswirkungen auf den Traffik und die Rankings","Entscheidung, ob Änderungen beibehalten, iteriert oder rückgängig gemacht werden","Wöchentliche Ausführung","Berücksichtigung von Lagzeiten für YMYL-Inhalte"],"pt":["Otimização de conteúdo","Medição do impacto nas métricas de tráfego","Medição do impacto nas métricas de classificação","Análise de lag times para conteúdo YMYL","Avaliação de alterações em páginas de serviço"],"ru":["Оптимизация контента","Измерение влияния на трафик","Измерение влияния на рейтинг","Анализ задержек для контента YMYL","Оценка изменений на страницах сервиса"],"ar":["تحسين المحتوى","قياس التأثير على حركة المرور","قياس التأثير على التصنيف","تحليل التأخيرات لملفات تعريف YMYL","تقييم التغييرات على صفحات الخدمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["实验循环优化","内容优化","SEO","AEO","YMYL","流量优化","排名优化","内容跟踪"],"ja":["実験ループ最適化","コンテンツ最適化","SEO","AEO","YMYL","トラフィック最適化","ランキング最適化","コンテンツ追跡"],"ko":["실험 루프 최적화","콘텐츠 최적화","SEO","AEO","YMYL","트래픽 최적화","순위 최적화","콘텐츠 추적"],"es":["experiment loop","optimización SEO","medición de impacto","contenido YMYL","tiempos de demora","traficó y rankings"],"fr":["boucle d''expérimentation","optimisation SEO","mesure d''impact","contenu YMYL","délais","trafic et classements"],"de":["experiment loop","SEO-Optimierung","Messung von Auswirkungen","YMYL-Inhalte","Lagzeiten","Traffik und Rankings"],"pt":["experiment loop","otimização de conteúdo","métricas de tráfego","classificação","lag times","conteúdo YMYL","desenvolvedores","ferramentas de SEO"],"ru":["экспериментальный цикл","оптимизация контента","трафик","рейтинг","задержки","контент YMYL","разработчики","инструменты SEO"],"ar":["حلقات التجربة","تحسين المحتوى","حركة المرور","التصنيف","التأخيرات","ملفات تعريف YMYL","مطوري البرامج","أدوات تحسين محركات البحث"]}},"owner":"adscorp100","repo":"mdhomecarebuild","repoPath":"adscorp100/mdhomecarebuild","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"experiment-loop","description":"Weekly experiment tracking loop for MD Home Care. Scans content changes, measures traffic impact via PostHog and GSC, and makes keep/iterate/revert decisions with lag-adjusted attribution.","bodyPreview":"# Experiment Loop for MD Home Care\n\nTracks content changes, measures their impact on traffic and rankings, and decides whether to keep, iterate, or revert. Runs weekly.\n\n## CRITICAL: Lag Times for YMYL Content\n\nYMYL content (aged care, disability services) has longer lag times than SaaS content. Do not evaluate changes too early.\n\n| Change Type | SEO Lag | AEO Lag | Evaluation Window |\n|-------------|---------|---------|-------------------|\n| Service page optimization | 10-21 days | 3-7 days | 3","body":"# Experiment Loop for MD Home Care\n\nTracks content changes, measures their impact on traffic and rankings, and decides whether to keep, iterate, or revert. Runs weekly.\n\n## CRITICAL: Lag Times for YMYL Content\n\nYMYL content (aged care, disability services) has longer lag times than SaaS content. Do not evaluate changes too early.\n\n| Change Type | SEO Lag | AEO Lag | Evaluation Window |\n|-------------|---------|---------|-------------------|\n| Service page optimization | 10-21 days | 3-7 days | 3 weeks minimum |\n| Location page creation | 14-21 days | 7-14 days | 3 weeks minimum |\n| Blog post publishing | 7-14 days | 3-7 days | 2 weeks minimum |\n| Provider comparison addition | 7-14 days | 3-7 days | 2 weeks minimum |\n| Trust signal enhancement | 10-21 days | 7-14 days | 3 weeks minimum |\n| FAQ addition | 7-14 days | 3-7 days | 2 weeks minimum |\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Weekly Git Scan\n\nIdentify all content changes from the past week:\n\n```bash\ncd ~/Projects/mdhomecarebuild\n\n# All content changes in last 7 days\ngit log --since=\"7 days ago\" --name-only --pretty=format:\"%h %s\" -- \"src/content/**/*.md\" \"src/content/**/*.mdx\"\n\n# Summarize by type\ngit log --since=\"7 days ago\" --name-only --pretty=format:\"\" -- \"src/content/blog/*.md\" | sort -u | head -20\ngit log --since=\"7 days ago\" --name-only --pretty=format:\"\" -- \"src/content/services/*.md\" | sort -u | head -20\ngit log --since=\"7 days ago\" --name-only --pretty=format:\"\" -- \"src/content/providers/*.md\" | sort -u | head -20\n```\n\nCategorize each change:\n\n- **New page:** Completely new content file\n- **Major edit:** Structural changes (new sections, comparison tables, rewritten H1/H2)\n- **Minor edit:** Small fixes (typos, link updates, frontmatter changes)\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: Baseline Measurement\n\nFor each changed page, capture the pre-change baseline. If baseline was not captured before the change, use the previous period as proxy.\n\n### GSC Baseline\n\n```bash\ncd ~/Projects/mdhomecarebuild\n\n# For each changed page, get keyword data\npython3 src/scripts/advanced_gsc_analyzer.py --page \"/services/[slug]\"\npython3 src/scripts/advanced_gsc_analyzer.py --page \"/blog/[slug]\"\n```\n\nRecord:\n- Top 10 keywords by clicks\n- Average position for primary keyword\n- Total impressions and clicks (last 7 days)\n\n### PostHog Baseline\n\n```bash\n# Page traffic\npython3 src/scripts/posthog_analytics.py --page \"/services/[slug]\" --days 7\n\n# AI referral traffic\npython3 src/scripts/posthog_analytics.py --ai-referrals --days 7\n```\n\nRecord:\n- Total pageviews (last 7 days)\n- AI referral visits to that page\n- Traffic sources breakdown\n\n---\n\n## Step 3: Post-Change Measurement\n\nAfter the evaluation window has passed (see lag times table), measure again.\n\n```bash\n# GSC: same page analysis\npython3 src/scripts/advanced_gsc_analyzer.py --page \"/services/[slug]\"\n\n# PostHog: same page traffic\npython3 src/scripts/posthog_analytics.py --page \"/services/[slug]\" --days 7\npython3 src/scripts/posthog_analytics.py --ai-referrals --days 7\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 4: Attribution and Decision\n\n### Compare Metrics\n\nFor each experiment, calculate:\n\n| Metric | Before | After | Change |\n|--------|--------|-------|--------|\n| Organic clicks (7d) | X | Y | +/- % |\n| Impressions (7d) | X | Y | +/- % |\n| Avg position (primary KW) | X | Y | +/- positions |\n| AI referral visits (7d) | X | Y | +/- % |\n| Total pageviews (7d) | X | Y | +/- % |\n\n### Decision Framework\n\n**KEEP** if:\n- Organic clicks increased >10%\n- OR average position improved by 2+ positions\n- OR AI referral visits increased >20%\n- OR impressions increased >15% (leading indicator)\n- AND no negative impact on other pages (cannibalization check)\n\n**ITERATE** if:\n- Mixed signals (some metrics up, some flat)\n- OR small positive movement (<10% clicks) that suggests potential\n- OR evaluation window has not fully elapsed\n- Action: Make targeted refinements and re-evaluate after another cycle\n\n**REVERT** if:\n- Organic clicks decreased >15%\n- AND average position dropped by 3+ positions\n- AND no compensating AI referral increase\n- Action: Restore previous version via git, document what went wrong\n\n**WAIT** if:\n- Change is too recent (within lag window)\n- Action: Re-evaluate next week\n\n---\n\n## Step 5: Log to Playbook\n\nRecord every experiment result in PLAYBOOK.md:\n\n```markdown\n## [Date] - [Experiment Name]\n\n**Category:** [Service page optimization / Location page / Blog post / Comparison / Trust signal / FAQ]\n**Page:** [URL path]\n**Change:** [Brief description of what was changed]\n**Hypothesis:** [What we expected to happen]\n\n**Baseline (pre-change):**\n- Organic clicks (7d): X\n- Avg position (primary KW): X\n- AI referrals (7d): X\n\n**Result (post-change, measured [date]):**\n- Organic clicks (7d): Y (+/- %)\n- Avg position (primary KW): Y (+/- positions)\n- AI referrals (7d): Y (+/- %)\n\n**Decision:** KEEP / ITERATE / REVERT / WAIT\n**Lesson:** [What we learned]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Experiment Categories\n\n### Service Page Optimizations\n- Adding comparison tables\n- Rewriting H1/byline\n- Adding trust signal sections\n- Expanding FAQ sections\n- Adding AI differentiation paragraphs\n\n### Location Page Creation\n- New suburb-specific service pages\n- Measure: local keyword rankings, location-specific traffic\n\n### Blog Post Publishing\n- New informational content\n- Template/download posts\n- Provider comparison posts\n- Measure: organic clicks, keyword coverage expansion\n\n### Provider Comparison Additions\n- New comparison tables on existing pages\n- New \"vs\" blog posts\n- Measure: comparison keyword rankings, AI referral traffic\n\n### Trust Signal Enhancements\n- Adding registration numbers\n- Adding testimonials\n- Adding clinical governance sections\n- Measure: overall page authority signals, position changes\n\n### FAQ Additions\n- New FAQ sections\n- Expanding existing FAQs with PAA questions\n- Measure: featured snippet captures, PAA appearances\n\n---\n\n## Weekly Routine\n\nEvery week:\n\n1. Run git scan (Step 1)\n2. For changes past their evaluation window, measure results (Step 3)\n3. Make keep/iterate/revert decisions (Step 4)\n4. Log results to PLAYBOOK.md (Step 5)\n5. Capture baselines for new changes (Step 2)\n\n---\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/experiment-loop\n```\n\nRuns the full weekly cycle: scan, measure, decide, log.\n\n```\n/experiment-loop --check \"/services/sil-services\"\n```\n\nCheck status of a specific page experiment.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:22:49.418Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SEO Optimization Agents needing data-driven content iteration and evaluation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要数据驱动内容迭代和评估能力的SEO优化代理","ja":"SEO最適化エージェントがデータ駆動型のコンテンツのイテレーションと評価機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"데이터 주도형 콘텐츠 반복 및 평가 기능이 필요한 SEO 최적화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de SEO que necesitan capacidades de iteración y evaluación de contenido basadas en datos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation de SEO ayant besoin de capacités d''itération et d''évaluation de contenu basées sur les données.","de":"Perfekt für SEO-Optimierungsagenten, die datengetriebene Inhaltsiteration- und Bewertungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de SEO que precisam de capacidades de iteração e avaliação de conteúdo baseadas em dados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации SEO, которым необходимы возможности итерации и оценки контента на основе данных.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تحسين محركات البحث الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات تكرار المحتوى وتقييمه القائم على البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to track content changes, measure their impact on traffic and rankings using SEO Lag and AEO Lag metrics, and decide whether to keep, iterate, or revert changes within a specified evaluation window, leveraging protocols like weekly review cycles.","zh":"赋予代理跟踪内容更改、使用SEO滞后和AEO滞后指标衡量其对流量和排名的影响，并决定在指定的评估窗口内是否保留、迭代或还原更改，利用诸如每周审查周期等协议","ja":"エージェントがコンテンツの変更を追跡し、SEO LagとAEO Lagメトリクスを使用してそのコンテンツの変更がトラフィックとランキングに与える影響を測定し、評価ウィンドウ内で変更を保持、イテレート、または元に戻すかどうかを決定することができ、毎週のレビューサイクルなどのプロトコルを活用できる","ko":"에이전트가 콘텐츠 변경을 추적하고 SEO 지연 및 AEO 지연 메트릭스를 사용하여 해당 콘텐츠 변경이 트래픽 및 순위에 미치는 영향을 측정하여 지정된 평가 창에서 변경을 유지, 반복 또는 되돌리기 여부를 결정하고 주간 검토 주기 등의 프로토콜을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar un seguimiento de los cambios de contenido, medir su impacto en el tráfico y los rankings utilizando las métricas de retardo de SEO y AEO, y decidir si mantener, iterar o revertir los cambios dentro de una ventana de evaluación especificada, aprovechando protocolos como ciclos de revisión semanales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de suivre les modifications de contenu, de mesurer leur impact sur le trafic et les classements à l''aide des métriques de retard de SEO et AEO, et de décider s''il faut conserver, itérer ou rétablir les modifications dans une fenêtre d''évaluation spécifiée, en exploitant des protocoles tels que des cycles de révision hebdomadaires.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Inhaltsänderungen zu verfolgen, deren Auswirkungen auf den Datenverkehr und die Rankings mithilfe der SEO-Lag- und AEO-Lag-Metriken zu messen und zu entscheiden, ob Änderungen innerhalb eines bestimmten Bewertungsfensters beibehalten, iteriert oder rückgängig gemacht werden sollen, indem Protokolle wie wöchentliche Überprüfungszyklen genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a acompanharem as alterações de conteúdo, medirem seu impacto no tráfego e nos rankings usando métricas de Lag de SEO e Lag de AEO, e decidirem se manter, iterar ou reverter alterações dentro de uma janela de avaliação especificada, aproveitando protocolos como ciclos de revisão semanais.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отслеживать изменения контента, измерять их влияние на трафик и рейтинги с использованием метрик SEO Lag и AEO Lag, и решать, сохранять, итерировать или отменять изменения в течение указанного окна оценки, используя протоколы, такие как еженедельные циклы обзора.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تتبع تغييرات المحتوى، وقياس تأثيرها على حركة المرور والتصنيف باستخدام مقاييس تأخر محركات البحث وتأخر AEO، والقرار فيما إذا كان بالإبقاء على التغييرات أو إعادة تشكيلها أو إعادةها إلى وضعها السابق خلال نافذة تقييم محددة، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل دورات المراجعة الأسبوعية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating content evaluation for YMYL content with longer lag times","Generating data-driven reports on service page optimization","Iterating content strategies based on traffic and ranking impact"],"zh":["自动评估YMYL内容的更长滞后时间","生成优化服务页的数据驱动报告","根据流量和排名影响迭代内容策略"],"ja":["長いラグ時間を持つYMYLコンテンツの自動評価","サービスページの最適化に関するデータ駆動レポートの生成","トラフィックとランキングへの影響に基づいてコンテンツ戦略のイテレーション"],"ko":["긴 지연 시간을 가진 YMYL 콘텐츠에 대한 자동 평가","서비스 페이지 최적화에 대한 데이터 주도 보고서 생성","트래픽 및 순위에 대한 영향에 따라 콘텐츠 전략 반복"],"es":["Automatización de la evaluación de contenido para contenido YMYL con tiempos de retardo más largos","Generación de informes basados en datos sobre la optimización de páginas de servicio","Iteración de estrategias de contenido en función del impacto en el tráfico y el ranking"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''évaluation de contenu pour le contenu YMYL avec des temps de retard plus longs","Génération de rapports basés sur les données sur l''optimisation des pages de service","Itération des stratégies de contenu en fonction de l''impact sur le trafic et le classement"],"de":["Automatisierung der Inhaltsbewertung für YMYL-Inhalte mit längeren Verzögerungszeiten","Erstellung von datenbasierten Berichten zur Optimierung von Dienstseiten","Iterierung von Inhaltsstrategien basierend auf dem Einfluss auf den Datenverkehr und das Ranking"],"pt":["Automatizar a avaliação de conteúdo para conteúdo YMYL com tempos de lag mais longos","Gerar relatórios baseados em dados sobre a otimização de páginas de serviço","Iterar estratégias de conteúdo com base no impacto no tráfego e no ranking"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оценку контента для контента YMYL с более длительными лагами","Генерировать отчеты на основе данных об оптимизации страницы сервиса","Итерировать стратегии контента на основе влияния на трафик и рейтинг"],"ar":["تأتمتة تقييم المحتوى للمحتوى YMYL مع أوقات تأخر أطول","توليد تقارير قائمة على البيانات حول تحسين صفحات الخدمة","إعادة تشكيل استراتيجيات المحتوى بناءً على تأثيرها على حركة المرور والتصنيف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires consideration of lag times for different content types","Evaluation window must be adjusted according to change type and lag metrics","Weekly review cycles may not be suitable for all content types or industries"],"zh":["需要考虑不同内容类型的滞后时间","评估窗口必须根据更改类型和滞后指标进行调整","每周审查周期可能不适合所有内容类型或行业"],"ja":["さまざまなコンテンツタイプのラグ時間を考慮する必要がある","評価ウィンドウは変更タイプとラグメトリクスに応じて調整する必要がある","毎週のレビューサイクルはすべてのコンテンツタイプまたは業界に適さない可能性がある"],"ko":["다양한 콘텐츠 유형의 지연 시간을 고려해야 함","평가 창은 변경 유형 및 지연 메트릭스에 따라 조정해야 함","주간 검토 주기는 모든 콘텐츠 유형 또는 산업에 적합하지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere consideración de los tiempos de retardo para diferentes tipos de contenido","La ventana de evaluación debe ajustarse según el tipo de cambio y las métricas de retardo","Los ciclos de revisión semanales pueden no ser adecuados para todos los tipos de contenido o industrias"],"fr":["Nécessite la prise en compte des temps de retard pour les différents types de contenu","La fenêtre d''évaluation doit être ajustée en fonction du type de modification et des métriques de retard","Les cycles de révision hebdomadaires peuvent ne pas convenir à tous les types de contenu ou à toutes les industries"],"de":["Erfordert die Berücksichtigung von Verzögerungszeiten für verschiedene Inhaltsarten","