"de":["Ursachenanalyse","Iteration zur Problemlösung","Verifizierung von Lösungen","Integration mit Next.js und Supabase","Verwendung von Claude AI für die Problemlösung","Strukturierter Problemlösungsprozess"],"pt":["Pipeline de resolução de problemas baseado em IA","Tecnologia de triagem e reprodução de problemas","Análise de causa raiz e impacto","Sistema de verificação de soluções","Integração com Next.js, Supabase e Claude AI"],"ru":["Конвейер решения проблем на основе ИИ","Технология трегирования и воспроизведения проблем","Анализ коренной причины и воздействия","Система верификации решений","Интеграция с Next.js, Supabase и Claude AI"],"ar":["خط أنابيب حل المشكلات بالذكاء الاصطناعي","تكنولوجيا التriage واعادة الإنتاج للمشكلات","تحليل السبب الجذري والتأثير","نظام التحقق من الحلول","التكامل مع Next.js و Supabase و Claude AI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["问题解决","AI驱动","生产力伴侣","任务管理","Next.js","Supabase","Claude AI","迭代诊断","验证修复"],"ja":["問題解決","AI駆動","生産性コンパニオン","タスク管理","Next.js","Supabase","Claude AI","イテレーティブな診断","検証済みの修復"],"ko":["문제 해결","AI 기반","생산성 동반자","태스크 관리","Next.js","Supabase","Claude AI","반복적 진단","검증된 수정"],"es":["resolución de problemas con IA","tecnología de resolución de problemas","productividad con IA","análisis de causa raíz","iteración para solucionar problemas","verificación de soluciones","Next.js","Supabase","Claude AI"],"fr":["résolution de problèmes avec IA","technologie de résolution de problèmes","productivité avec IA","analyse de cause profonde","itération pour résoudre les problèmes","vérification des solutions","Next.js","Supabase","Claude AI"],"de":["Problemlösung mit KI","Technologie zur Problemlösung","Produktivität mit KI","Ursachenanalyse","Iteration zur Problemlösung","Verifizierung von Lösungen","Next.js","Supabase","Claude AI"],"pt":["resolução de problemas","pipeline de resolução de problemas","IA para resolução de problemas","desenvolvimento de software","Next.js","Supabase","Claude AI"],"ru":["решение проблем","конвейер решения проблем","ИИ для решения проблем","разработка программного обеспечения","Next.js","Supabase","Claude AI"],"ar":["حل المشكلات","خط أنابيب حل المشكلات","الذكاء الاصطناعي لحل المشكلات","تطوير البرمجيات","Next.js","Supabase","Claude AI"]}},"owner":"mthangtr","repo":"groaly","repoPath":"mthangtr/groaly","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"issue-resolution","description":"Systematically diagnose and fix bugs through triage, reproduction, root cause analysis, and verified fixes. Use when resolving bugs, errors, failing tests, or investigating unexpected behavior.","bodyPreview":"# Issue Resolution Pipeline\n\nSystematically resolve issues through iterative diagnosis and verified fixes.\n\n## Pipeline Overview\n\n```\nINPUT → Triage → Reproduction → Root Cause Analysis → Impact → Fix → Verify\n              ◄──────────────►◄────────────────────►\n                    (Iterative loops allowed)\n```\n\n| Phase                  | Purpose                            | Output              |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| 0. Triage","body":"# Issue Resolution Pipeline\n\nSystematically resolve issues through iterative diagnosis and verified fixes.\n\n## Pipeline Overview\n\n```\nINPUT → Triage → Reproduction → Root Cause Analysis → Impact → Fix → Verify\n              ◄──────────────►◄────────────────────►\n                    (Iterative loops allowed)\n```\n\n| Phase                  | Purpose                            | Output              |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| 0. Triage              | Normalize input, classify severity | Issue Brief         |\n| 1. Reproduction        | Prove the bug, trace code path     | Repro Report + Test |\n| 2. Root Cause Analysis | Find WHY, not just WHERE           | RCA Report          |\n| 3. Impact Assessment   | Blast radius, regression risk      | Impact Report       |\n| 4. Fix Decomposition   | Break into beads                   | .beads/\\*.md        |\n| 5. Verification        | Prove fix works, no regressions    | Passing tests       |\n\n## Phase 0: Triage\n\nNormalize different input types to a structured Issue Brief.\n\n### Input Types\n\n| Type                  | Triage Strategy                       |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Vague report**      | Clarify → Explore → Reproduce         |\n| **Error/Stack trace** | Parse trace → Locate code → Reproduce |\n| **Failing test**      | Run test → Extract assertion → Trace  |\n\n### Vague Report Triage\n\n```\nUser: \"Login is broken\"\n         │\n         ▼\nAsk clarification questions:\n• What error do you see?\n• When did it start working / stop working?\n• What steps trigger it?\n• Specific user/browser/environment?\n         │\n         ▼ (if user can''t clarify)\nExplore:\n• mcp__gkg__search_codebase_definitions: Find auth/login related code\n• git log: Recent changes in area\n• Check logs if available\n```\n\n### Error/Stack Trace Triage\n\n```\nParse the stack trace:\n• Extract file:line locations\n• mcp__gkg__get_definition on functions in trace\n• Read surrounding context\n         │\n         ▼\nIdentify reproduction conditions:\n• What input caused this?\n• Can we write a test?\n```\n\n### Failing Test Triage\n\n```\nRun test in isolation:\n• bun test <file> --filter \"<test name>\"\n• Read test file for setup/assertions\n• Check git log: was it passing before?\n         │\n         ▼\nTrace implementation:\n• What code does test exercise?\n• mcp__gkg__get_references on tested function\n• Recent changes to implementation?\n```\n\n### Severity Classification\n\nDetermines reproduction requirements:\n\n| Severity                            | Reproduction Required  |\n| ----------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| **CRITICAL** (production, security) | Failing test REQUIRED  |\n| **REGRESSION** (was working)        | Failing test REQUIRED  |\n| **RACE CONDITION** (timing)         | Failing test REQUIRED  |\n| **LOGIC BUG**                       | Failing test PREFERRED |\n| **UI/VISUAL**                       | Manual + screenshot OK |\n| **PERFORMANCE**                     | Benchmark/profile OK   |\n| **QUICK FIX** (obvious cause)       | Manual repro OK        |\n\n### Issue Brief Template\n\nSave to `history/issues/<id>/brief.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Issue Brief: <Short Title>\n\n**Severity**: CRITICAL / HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW\n**Type**: Regression / Edge case / Race condition / UI / Performance / Other\n**Repro Required**: Failing test / Manual OK\n\n## Symptom\n\n<What is happening>\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\n<What should happen>\n\n## Reproduction\n\n<Steps, test command, or code path>\n\n## Evidence\n\n<Error message, stack trace, test output>\n\n## Affected Area\n\n<Files, modules, features involved>\n\n## Timeline\n\n<When started, recent changes if known>\n```\n\n## Phase 1: Reproduction\n\nProve the bug exists and trace the code path.\n\n### If Failing Test Required\n\n```bash\n# Create test file\n# packages/<area>/src/__tests__/<feature>.regression.test.ts\n\n# Test should:\n# 1. Set up conditions that trigger bug\n# 2. Assert expected behavior (currently fails)\n# 3. Be deterministic\n```\n\n### Reproduction Checklist\n\n- [ ] Bug is reproducible on demand\n- [ ] Exact error/behavior captured\n- [ ] Minimal reproduction (simplest case that fails)\n- [ ] Code path identified (stack trace or tracing)\n\n### Code Path Tracing\n\n```\nmcp__gkg__get_definition     → Find where error originates\nmcp__gkg__get_references     → Find callers\ngit blame <file>       → Who changed it, when\ngit log -p <file>      → What changed recently\n```\n\n### Repro Report Template\n\nSave to `history/issues/<id>/repro.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Reproduction Report: <Issue Title>\n\n## Reproduction Method\n\n☐ Failing test: `<test file and name>`\n☐ Manual: <steps>\n\n## Error/Behavior Captured\n\n<Exact error message, stack trace>\n\n## Code Path\n\n1. Entry: `<file>:<line>` - <function>\n2. Calls: `<file>:<line>` - <function>\n3. Fails at: `<file>:<line>` - <reason>\n\n## Recent Changes (if relevant)\n\n- <commit>: <summary>\n```\n\n## Phase 2: Root Cause Analysis\n\nFind WHY the bug happens, not just WHERE.\n\n### RCA Framework\n\n```\nSTEP 1: Generate hypotheses (3-5)\n         │\n         ▼\nSTEP 2: Gather evidence for/against each\n         │\n         ▼\nSTEP 3: Eliminate hypotheses\n         │\n         ▼\nSTEP 4: Confirm root cause\n```\n\n### Bug Type → RCA Strategy\n\n| Bug Type            | Strategy                  | Key Tools                       |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Regression**      | Find breaking change      | `git bisect`, `git blame`       |\n| **Edge case**       | Analyze boundary inputs   | Type inspection, boundary tests |\n| **Race condition**  | Trace async flow          | Timing logs, async analysis     |\n| **Data corruption** | Trace state changes       | Data flow analysis              |\n| **External dep**    | Check version/API changes | Changelogs, API docs            |\n\n### Oracle for RCA\n\n**Hypothesis Generation:**\n\n```\noracle(\n  task: \"Generate root cause hypotheses\",\n  context: \"\"\"\n    Symptom: <error>\n    Code path: <trace>\n    Recent changes: <git log>\n\n    Generate 3-5 hypotheses ranked by likelihood.\n    For each, what evidence would support/refute it?\n  \"\"\",\n  files: [\"<affected files>\"]\n)\n```\n\n**Hypothesis Validation:**\n\n```\noracle(\n  task: \"Validate root cause hypothesis\",\n  context: \"\"\"\n    Hypothesis: <proposed cause>\n    Evidence: <gathered evidence>\n\n    1. Does evidence support or refute?\n    2. Explain causal chain: cause → symptom\n    3. What would confirm this?\n  \"\"\",\n  files: [\"<relevant files>\"]\n)\n```\n\n### Iteration: RCA → Reproduction Loop\n\nIf hypothesis needs more evidence:\n\n```\nIN RCA: \"Need timing logs to confirm race condition\"\n    │\n    ▼\nBACK TO REPRO:\n• Add instrumentation\n• Run with specific conditions\n• Capture new evidence\n    │\n    ▼\nRETURN TO RCA with new evidence\n```\n\n### RCA Report Template\n\nSave to `history/issues/<id>/rca.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Root Cause Analysis: <Issue Title>\n\n## Iteration: <N>\n\n## Hypotheses Considered\n\n### Hypothesis A: <Description>\n\n- **Likelihood**: HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW\n- **Supporting evidence**: ...\n- **Refuting evidence**: ...\n- **Verdict**: ✓ CONFIRMED / ✗ ELIMINATED\n\n### Hypothesis B: ...\n\n## Root Cause (Confirmed)\n\n**Cause**: <Clear statement>\n\n**Causal chain**:\n\n1. <Step> leads to\n2. <Step> leads to\n3. <Symptom>\n\n## Why This Happened\n\n<Underlying reason - missing validation, wrong assumption, etc.>\n\n## Fix Approach\n\n**Immediate**: <What to change>\n**Preventive**: <How to prevent similar bugs>\n```\n\n## Phase 3: Impact Assessment\n\nBefore fixing, understand blast radius.\n\n### Impact Analysis\n\n```\nmcp__gkg__get_references <affected function>\n    → Who else calls this?\n\nGrep for related patterns\n    → Similar code that might have same bug?\n\nReview test coverage\n    → What tests cover this area?\n```\n\n### Regression Risk\n\n| Factor              | Risk Level |\n| ------------------- | ---------- |\n| High usage function | HIGH       |\n| Shared utility      | HIGH       |\n| Public API change   | HIGH       |\n| Internal helper     | LOW        |\n| Isolated module     | LOW        |\n\n### Spike for Complex Fixes\n\nIf fix approach is uncertain:\n\n```bash\nbd create \"Spike: Validate fix approach for <issue>\" -t task -p 0\n```\n\nExecute via MULTI_AGENT_WORKFLOW, write to `.spikes/<issue-id>/`.\n\n### Impact Report Template\n\nSave to `history/issues/<id>/impact.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Impact Assessment: <Issue Title>\n\n## Blast Radius\n\n### Direct Impact\n\n- <File/function directly changed>\n\n### Callers Affected\n\n- <List from mcp__gkg__get_references>\n\n### Related Code\n\n- <Similar patterns that may need same fix>\n\n## Regression Risk\n\n**Level**: HIGH / MEDIUM / LOW\n**Reason**: <Why this risk level>\n\n## Test Coverage\n\n- Existing tests: <list>\n- Tests to add: <list>\n\n## Fix Validation\n\n☐ Spike completed (if needed): `.spikes/<id>/`\n☐ Fix approach validated\n```\n\n## Phase 4: Fix Decomposition\n\nBreak fix into beads.\n\n### Simple Fix (Single Bead)\n\n```bash\nbd create \"Fix: <issue title>\" -t bug -p <priority>\n```\n\nBead includes:\n\n- Root cause reference\n- Fix implementation\n- Test (failing → passing)\n- Docs update (if behavior change)\n\n### Complex Fix (Multiple Beads)\n\n```bash\nbd create \"Epic: Fix <issue>\" -t epic -p <priority>\nbd create \"Add regression test for <issue>\" -t task --blocks <epic>\nbd create \"Fix <component A>\" -t bug --blocks <epic> --deps <test>\nbd create \"Fix <component B>\" -t bug --blocks <epic> --deps <test>\nbd create \"Update docs for <behavior change>\" -t task --blocks <epic> --deps <fix-a>,<fix-b>\n```\n\n### Fix Bead Template\n\n```markdown\n# Fix: <Issue Title>\n\n**Type**: bug\n**Priority**: <0-4>\n**Fixes**: <issue reference>\n\n## Root Cause\n\n<From RCA report>\n\n## Fix Implementation\n\n<What to change and why>\n\n## Files to Modify\n\n- `<file>`: <change description>\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Regression test passes\n- [ ] Original symptom no longer reproducible\n- [ ] No new test failures\n- [ ] `bun run check-types` passes\n- [ ] `bun run build` passes\n```\n\n## Phase 5: Verification\n\nProve fix works and nothing else broke.\n\n### Verification Checklist\n\n```bash\n# 1. Regression test passes\nbun test <regression-test-file>\n\n# 2. Original symptom gone\n<manual verification or test>\n\n# 3. No new failures\nbun run test\n\n# 4. Types and build\nbun run check-types\nbun run build\n```\n\n### Iteration: Verify → RCA Loop\n\nIf fix doesn''t work:\n\n```\nTest still fails after fix\n    │\n    ▼\nRoot cause was wrong or incomplete\n    │\n    ▼\nBACK TO RCA:\n• Eliminate current hypothesis\n• Generate new hypotheses\n• Update RCA Report with iteration\n```\n\n### Verify → Impact Loop\n\nIf fix causes regressions:\n\n```\nNew test failures after fix\n    │\n    ▼\nFix has unintended side effects\n    │\n    ▼\nBACK TO IMPACT:\n• Reassess blast radius\n• Consider alternative fix approach\n```\n\n## Loop Limits\n\nPrevent infinite iteration:\n\n| Loop         | Soft Limit | Hard Limit | At Hard Limit               |\n| ------------ | ---------- | ---------- | --------------------------- |\n| RCA → Repro  | 2          | 4          | Escalate / pair debug       |\n| RCA → Triage | 1          | 2          | Re-evaluate original report |\n| Verify → RCA | 2          | 3          | Oracle deep review          |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Tool Selection\n\n| Need                  | Tool                            |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| Parse stack trace     | Read + mcp**gkg**get_definition |\n| Find callers          | mcp**gkg**get_references        |\n| Recent changes        | git log, git blame              |\n| Binary search commits | git bisect                      |\n| Reasoning about cause | oracle                          |\n| Validate fix approach | Spike via MULTI_AGENT_WORKFLOW  |\n\n### Common Mistakes\n\n- **Fixing symptom, not cause** → Leads to recurrence\n- **Skipping reproduction** → Can''t verify fix\n- **No regression test** → Bug returns later\n- **Ignoring impact** → Fix breaks other things\n- **Not iterating** → Wrong diagnosis persists\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:24:19.445Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Debugging and Productivity Agents needing systematic issue resolution pipelines with iterative diagnosis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要系统性问题解决管道和迭代诊断能力的调试和生产力代理。","ja":"デバッグと生産性エージェントに適しています。システム的な問題解決パイプラインと反復診断機能が必要です。","ko":"시스템적인 문제 해결 파이프라인과 반복적인 진단 기능이 필요한 디버깅 및 생산성 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de depuración y productividad que necesitan tuberías de resolución de problemas sistemáticos con capacidades de diagnóstico iterativo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de débogage et de productivité ayant besoin de pipelines de résolution de problèmes systématiques avec des capacités de diagnostic itératif.","de":"Perfekt für Debugging- und Produktivitätsagenten, die systematische Problemlösungspipelines mit iterativen Diagnosefunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de depuração e produtividade que necessitam de pipelines de resolução de problemas sistemáticos com capacidades de diagnóstico iterativo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов отладки и производительности, которым требуются системные конвейеры решения проблем с итеративными возможностями диагностики.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات调试 و إنتاجية التي تحتاج إلى أنابيب حل المشكلات المتسلسلة مع قدرات التشخيص المتكرر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform chaotic inputs into structured resolution workflows using triage, reproduction, root cause analysis, and verification phases. Built with Next.js and Supabase integration for persistent issue tracking across multiple life goals.","zh":"使代理能够使用三级筛查、重现、根因分析和验证阶段将混乱的输入转化为结构化的解决方案工作流。使用Next.js和Supabase集成，实现多个生命周期目标的持久性问题跟踪。","ja":"エージェントが混沌とした入力を триаж、再現、根本原因分析、検証の各段階を使用して構造化された解決ワークフローに変換できるようにします。Next.jsとSupabaseの統合により、複数のライフサイクル目標の永続的な問題追跡が可能です。","ko":"에이전트가 混沌的な 입력을 3단계 분류, 재현, 근본 원인 분석 및 검증 단계를 사용하여 구조화된 해결 워크플로로 변환할 수 있도록 합니다. Next.js 및 Supabase 통합을 통해 여러 生命周期 목표에 대한 지속적인 문제 추적이 가능합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes transformar entradas caóticas en flujos de trabajo de resolución estructurados utilizando fases de triage, reproducción, análisis de causa raíz y verificación. Construido con Next.js y integración de Supabase para un seguimiento de problemas persistente en múltiples objetivos de vida.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des entrées chaotiques en flux de travail de résolution structurés en utilisant des phases de triage, de reproduction, d''analyse de cause racine et de vérification. Conçu avec Next.js et intégration Supabase pour un suivi des problèmes persistant sur plusieurs objectifs de vie.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, chaotische Eingaben in strukturierte Workflow-Lösungen umzuwandeln, indem sie Phasen der Triage, Reproduktion, Root-Cause-Analyse und Verifizierung verwenden. Erstellt mit Next.js und Supabase-Integration für eine persistente Problemmeldung in mehreren Lebenszielen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes transformem entradas caóticas em fluxos de trabalho de resolução estruturados usando fases de triagem, reprodução, análise de causa raiz e verificação. Construído com integração do Next.js e Supabase para rastreamento de problemas persistente em vários objetivos de vida.","ru":"Позволяет агентам преобразовывать хаотичные входные данные в структурированные рабочие процессы решения, используя фазы триажа, воспроизведения, анализа коренной причины и верификации. Построен с интеграцией Next.js и Supabase для постоянного отслеживания проблем на нескольких целях жизни.","ar":"يسمح للعمليات بتحويل الإدخالات العشوائية إلى عمليات عمل محددة باستخدام مراحل التriage و إعادة الإنتاج و تحليل السبب الجذري و التحقق. مبني على 통합 Next.js و Supabase لتتبع المشكلات المستمر عبر أهداف الحياة المتعددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating bug reproduction workflows","Generating root cause analysis reports","Validating fix implementations","Tracking issue resolution progress across projects"],"zh":["自动化缺陷再现工作流程","生成根因分析报告","验证修复实现","跨项目跟踪问题解决进度"],"ja":["バグ再現ワークフローの自動化","根本原因分析レポートの生成","修正実装の検証","プロジェクト間の問題解決進度の追跡"],"ko":["버그 재현 워크플로 자동화","근본 원인 분석 보고서 생성","수정 구현 검증","프로젝트 간 문제 해결 진행 추적"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de reproducción de errores","Generación de informes de análisis de causa raíz","Validación de implementaciones de soluciones","Seguimiento del progreso de resolución de problemas en varios proyectos"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail de reproduction de bogues","Génération de rapports d''analyse de cause racine","Validation des mises en œuvre de corrections","Suivi de la progression de la résolution de problèmes sur plusieurs projets"],"de":["Automatisierung von Fehlerreproduktions-Workflows","Erstellung von Root-Cause-Analyse-Berichten","Validierung von Fix-Implementierungen","Verfolgung des Fortschritts der Problemlösung in mehreren Projekten"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de reprodução de bugs","Gerar relatórios de análise de causa raiz","Validar implementações de correção","Rastrear progresso da resolução de problemas em vários projetos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рабочие процессы воспроизведения ошибок","Генерировать отчеты анализа коренной причины","Проверять реализации исправлений","Отслеживать прогресс решения проблем в нескольких проектах"],"ar":["تأتمتة تدفقات العمل لإعادة إنتاج الأخطاء","توليد تقارير تحليل السبب الجذري","التحقق من تنفيذ الإصلاحات","تتبع تقدم حل المشكلات عبر المشاريع المتعددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with Claude AI API","Depends on Supabase backend infrastructure","Limited to web-based issue tracking environments"],"zh":["需要集成Claude AI API","依赖Supabase后端基础设施","仅限于基于Web的问题跟踪环境"],"ja":["Claude AI APIとの統合が必要","Supabaseバックエンドインフラストラクチャに依存","Webベースの問題追跡環境のみ"],"ko":["Claude AI API와의 통합이 필요","Supabase 백엔드 인프라스트ラク처에 의존","웹 기반 문제 추적 환경만"],"es":["Requiere integración con la API de Claude AI","Depende de la infraestructura de backend de Supabase","Limitado a entornos de seguimiento de problemas basados en web"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec l''API Claude AI","Dépend de l''infrastructure backend Supabase","Limité aux environnements de suivi de problèmes basés sur le web"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit der Claude AI-API","Hängt von der Supabase-Backend-Infrastruktur ab","Begrenzt auf webbasierte Problemmeldungsumgebungen"],"pt":["Requer integração com a API do Claude AI","Depende da infraestrutura de backend do Supabase","Limitado a ambientes de rastreamento de problemas baseados na web"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с API Claude AI","Зависит от инфраструктуры бэкенда Supabase","Ограничен веб-окружениями отслеживания проблем"],"ar":["يتطلب دمجًا مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Claude AI","يعتمد على بنية الخلفية من Supabase","محدود بيئات تتبع المشكلات المستندة إلى الويب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('yuki-programmer/savesmart_app/ui-ux-psychology', 'community', 'yuki-programmer', 'savesmart_app', 'yuki-programmer/savesmart_app', 'ui-ux-psychology', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z', '2026-02-18T03:24:26.681Z', NULL, '{"id":"yuki-programmer/savesmart_app/ui-ux-psychology","name":"ui-ux-psychology","description":{"zh":"UI/UX心理学是一门研究如何优化用户体验的学科，涵盖认知偏见、行为触发、知觉法则等方面","ja":"UI/UX心理学は、ユーザーエクスペリエンスを最適化するための学問で、認知バイアス、行動トリガー、知覚法則などを含む","ko":"UI/UX 심리학은 사용자 경험을 최적화하는 학문으로, 인지 편향, 행동 트리거, 지각 법칙 등이 포함","es":"La psicología de UI/UX se enfoca en aplicar principios psicológicos para mejorar la experiencia del usuario. Esto incluye el uso de sesgos cognitivos, desencadenantes conductuales y leyes de percepción para diseñar interfaces más efectivas.","fr":"La psychologie UI/UX consiste à appliquer des principes psychologiques pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur. Cela inclut l''utilisation de biais cognitifs, de déclencheurs comportementaux et de lois de perception pour concevoir des interfaces plus efficaces.","de":"Die UI/UX-Psychologie konzentriert sich auf die Anwendung psychologischer Prinzipien, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern. Dazu gehören die Verwendung von kognitiven Verzerrungen, verhaltensbedingten Auslösern und Wahrnehmungsgesetzen, um effektivere Schnittstellen zu entwerfen.","pt":"A Psicologia de UI/UX é uma referência para designers e desenvolvedores que buscam melhorar a experiência do usuário","ru":"Психология UI/UX - это справочник для дизайнеров и разработчиков, которые стремятся улучшить пользовательский опыт","ar":"علم النفس لوي/ux هو مرجع للمصممين والمطورين الذين يبحثون عن تحسين تجربة المستخدم","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"UI/UX心理学：优化用户体验","ja":"UI/UX心理学：ユーザーエクスペリエンスを最適化","ko":"UI/UX 심리학: 사용자 경험 최적화","es":"Psicología de UI/UX: Mejora la experiencia del usuario","fr":"Psychologie UI/UX : Améliorer l''expérience utilisateur","de":"UI/UX-Psychologie: Benutzererfahrung optimieren","pt":"Psicologia de UI/UX: Melhore a Experiência do Usuário","ru":"Психология UI/UX: Улучшение Пользовательского Опыта","ar":"علم النفس لوي/ux: تحسين تجربة المستخدم","en":"ui-ux-psychology"},"description":{"zh":"UI/UX心理学是一门研究如何优化用户体验的学科，涵盖认知偏见、行为触发、知觉法则等方面","ja":"UI/UX心理学は、ユーザーエクスペリエンスを最適化するための学問で、認知バイアス、行動トリガー、知覚法則などを含む","ko":"UI/UX 심리학은 사용자 경험을 최적화하는 학문으로, 인지 편향, 행동 트리거, 지각 법칙 등이 포함","es":"La psicología de UI/UX se enfoca en aplicar principios psicológicos para mejorar la experiencia del usuario. Esto incluye el uso de sesgos cognitivos, desenc...","fr":"La psychologie UI/UX consiste à appliquer des principes psychologiques pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur. Cela inclut l''utilisation de biais cognitifs,...","de":"Die UI/UX-Psychologie konzentriert sich auf die Anwendung psychologischer Prinzipien, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern. Dazu gehören die Verwendung von...","pt":"A Psicologia de UI/UX é uma referência para designers e desenvolvedores que buscam melhorar a experiência do usuário","ru":"Психология UI/UX - это справочник для дизайнеров и разработчиков, которые стремятся улучшить пользовательский опыт","ar":"علم النفس لوي/ux هو مرجع للمصممين والمطورين الذين يبحثون عن تحسين تجربة المستخدم","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["认知偏见分析","行为触发技术","知觉法则应用","情感和社会性因素考虑","暗模式识别"],"ja":["認知バイアス分析","行動トリガーテクニック","知覚法則の適用","感情と社会性の要素の考慮","ダークパターンの識別"],"ko":["인지 편향 분석","행동 트리거 기술","지각 법칙 적용","정서와 사회성 요소 고려","다크 패턴 식별"],"es":["Aplicación de sesgos cognitivos","Uso de desencadenantes conductuales","Diseño de interfaces con leyes de percepción","Mejora de la experiencia del usuario","Aumento de la conversión"],"fr":["Application de biais cognitifs","Utilisation de déclencheurs comportementaux","Conception d''interfaces avec des lois de perception","Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","Augmentation de la conversion"],"de":["Anwendung von kognitiven Verzerrungen","Verwendung von verhaltensbedingten Auslösern","Entwurf von Schnittstellen mit Wahrnehmungsgesetzen","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Erhöhung der Konvertierung"],"pt":["Princípios de cognição e percepção","Técnicas de comportamento e engajamento","Análise de viés cognitivo e tomada de decisão","Estratégias de design para melhorar a experiência do usuário","Referências para design de interface do usuário","Técnicas para aumentar a conversão"],"ru":["Принципы когнитивных и перцептивных процессов","Техники поведения и вовлечения","Анализ когнитивных предубеждений и принятия решений","Стратегии дизайна для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Справочные материалы для дизайна пользовательского интерфейса","Техники для увеличения конверсии"],"ar":["مبادئ الإدراك والانطباع","تقنيات السلوك والتفاعل","تحليل الانحياز المعرفي و processo اتخاذ القرار","استراتيجيات التصميم لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","مراجع لتصميم واجهة المستخدم","تقنيات لزيادة التحويل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI/UX设计","用户体验","心理学","认知偏见","行为触发","知觉法则","情感和社会性","暗模式"],"ja":["UI/UXデザイン","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","心理学","認知バイアス","行動トリガー","知覚法則","感情と社会性","ダークパターン"],"ko":["UI/UX 디자인","사용자 경험","심리학","인지 편향","행동 트리거","지각 법칙","정서와 사회성","다크 패턴"],"es":["psicología de UI/UX","diseño de interfaces","experiencia del usuario","sesgos cognitivos","desencadenantes conductuales","leyes de percepción","conversión","eficacia de las interfaces"],"fr":["psychologie UI/UX","conception d''interfaces","expérience utilisateur","biais cognitifs","déclencheurs comportementaux","lois de perception","conversion","efficacité des interfaces"],"de":["UI/UX-Psychologie","Schnittstellendesign","Benutzererfahrung","kognitive Verzerrungen","verhaltensbedingte Auslöser","Wahrnehmungsgesetze","Konvertierung","Effektivität von Schnittstellen"],"pt":["psicologia de ui/ux","design de interface do usuário","experiência do usuário","princípios psicológicos","cognição e percepção","comportamento e engajamento","viés cognitivo","tomada de decisão","conversão"],"ru":["психология ui/ux","дизайн пользовательского интерфейса","пользовательский опыт","психологические принципы","когнитивные и перцептивные процессы","поведение и вовлечение","когнитивные предубеждения","принятие решений","конверсия"],"ar":["علم النفس لوي/ux","تصميم واجهة المستخدم","تجربة المستخدم","مبادئ نفسية","عمليات الإدراك والانطباع","السلوك والتفاعل","انحياز معرفي","عملية اتخاذ القرار","التحويل"]}},"owner":"yuki-programmer","repo":"savesmart_app","repoPath":"yuki-programmer/savesmart_app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-psychology","description":"UI/UXデザインにおける心理学的手法・原則の知識ベース。アプリやWebサービスのUI設計、ユーザー行動誘導、コンバージョン最適化、UXライティングなどのタスクで活用。「ユーザーに○○させたい」「離脱を防ぎたい」「課金率を上げたい」「UIの改善案」などの相談時にトリガー。","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Psychology Skill\n\nUI/UXデザインに活用できる心理学的手法・原則のリファレンス。\n\n## 使い方\n\n1. ユーザーの目的（行動誘導、離脱防止、エンゲージメント向上など）を確認\n2. 該当するカテゴリの原則を参照\n3. 具体的な実装案を提案\n\n## リファレンス\n\n目的に応じて以下を参照：\n\n- [cognitive-biases.md](references/cognitive-biases.md) - 認知バイアス（意思決定への影響）\n- [behavioral-triggers.md](references/behavioral-triggers.md) - 行動誘導・ナッジ\n- [perception-laws.md](references/perception-laws.md) - 知覚・認知法則（UI配置）\n- [emotional-social.md](references/emotional-social.md) - 感情・社会性・信頼\n- [dark-patterns.md](references/dark-patterns.md)","body":"# UI/UX Psychology Skill\n\nUI/UXデザインに活用できる心理学的手法・原則のリファレンス。\n\n## 使い方\n\n1. ユーザーの目的（行動誘導、離脱防止、エンゲージメント向上など）を確認\n2. 該当するカテゴリの原則を参照\n3. 具体的な実装案を提案\n\n## リファレンス\n\n目的に応じて以下を参照：\n\n- [cognitive-biases.md](references/cognitive-biases.md) - 認知バイアス（意思決定への影響）\n- [behavioral-triggers.md](references/behavioral-triggers.md) - 行動誘導・ナッジ\n- [perception-laws.md](references/perception-laws.md) - 知覚・認知法則（UI配置）\n- [emotional-social.md](references/emotional-social.md) - 感情・社会性・信頼\n- [dark-patterns.md](references/dark-patterns.md) - ダークパターン（NG例）\n- [practical-examples.md](references/practical-examples.md) - アプリ種別ごとの実践例\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:24:26.681Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Human-Computer Interaction Agents seeking to leverage cognitive biases, behavioral triggers, and perception laws to enhance user experience.","zh":"适合于人类计算机交互代理，利用认知偏见、行为触发器和感知法则来增强用户体验。","ja":"認知バイアス、行動トリガー、認識法則を利用してユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させることを目指す人間コンピュータ相互作用エージェントに適しています。","ko":"인간-컴퓨터 상호작용 에이전트가 인지 편향, 행동 트리거 및 지각 법칙을 사용하여 사용자 경험을 향상시키는 데 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Interacción Humano-Computadora que buscan aprovechar sesgos cognitivos, desencadenantes conductuales y leyes de percepción para mejorar la experiencia del usuario.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''interaction homme-ordinateur qui cherchent à exploiter les biais cognitifs, les déclencheurs de comportement et les lois de perception pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur.","de":"Ideal für Human-Computer-Interaction-Agents, die kognitive Verzerrungen, Verhaltensauslöser und Wahrnehmungsgesetze nutzen möchten, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Interação Humano-Computador que buscam aproveitar vieses cognitivos, gatilhos comportamentais e leis de percepção para melhorar a experiência do usuário.","ru":"Идеально для агентов взаимодействия человека и компьютера, стремящихся использовать когнитивные предубеждения, поведенческие триггеры и законы восприятия для улучшения пользовательского опыта.","ar":"مثالية لعميل التفاعل بين الإنسان والحاسوب الذين يسعون إلى الاستفادة من التحيزات المعرفية والزجاجات السلوكية وقوانين الإدراك لتحسين تجربة المستخدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft intuitive UI/UX designs by applying psychological principles such as cognitive biases, behavioral triggers, and perception laws, thereby improving user engagement and decision-making through informed design choices.","zh":"赋予代理人通过应用认知偏见、行为触发器和感知法则等心理学原理来设计直观的UI/UX设计的能力，从而通过明智的设计选择提高用户参与度和决策能力。","ja":"認知バイアス、行動トリガー、認識法則などの心理学的原理を適用して、直感的で使いやすいUI/UX設計を作成することで、ユーザーの関与度と意思決定能力を高めることができるエージェントをエンパワーメントします。","ko":"인간-컴퓨터 상호작용 에이전트가 인지 편향, 행동 트리거 및 지각 법칙 등의 심리학적 원리를 적용하여 사용자 참여도와 의사결정을 향상시키는 직관적인 UI/UX 디자인을 만들 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear diseños de UI/UX intuitivos aplicando principios psicológicos como sesgos cognitivos, desencadenantes conductuales y leyes de percepción, mejorando así la participación del usuario y la toma de decisiones a través de opciones de diseño informadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des conceptions d''interface utilisateur/intuition utilisateur (UI/UX) intuitives en appliquant des principes psychologiques tels que les biais cognitifs, les déclencheurs de comportement et les lois de perception, améliorant ainsi l''engagement de l''utilisateur et la prise de décision grâce à des choix de conception éclairés.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, intuitive UI/UX-Designs zu erstellen, indem sie psychologische Prinzipien wie kognitive Verzerrungen, Verhaltensauslöser und Wahrnehmungsgesetze anwenden, wodurch die Benutzerbeteiligung und Entscheidungsfindung durch fundierte Designentscheidungen verbessert werden.","pt":"Habilite os agentes a criar projetos de UI/UX intuitivos aplicando princípios psicológicos, como vieses cognitivos, gatilhos comportamentais e leis de percepção, melhorando assim o engajamento do usuário e a tomada de decisões por meio de escolhas de design informadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать интуитивно понятные дизайны UI/UX, применяя психологические принципы, такие как когнитивные предубеждения, поведенческие триггеры и законы восприятия, тем самым улучшая вовлеченность пользователя и принятие решений за счет обоснованных дизайнерских решений.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إنشاء تصاميم UI/UX直观 من خلال تطبيق المبادئ النفسية مثل التحيزات المعرفية والزجاجات السلوكية وقوانين الإدراك، وبالتالي تحسين مشاركة المستخدم وصنع القرار من خلال خيارات التصميم المستنيرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing persuasive onboarding flows using behavioral triggers","Optimizing user interfaces to mitigate cognitive biases in decision-making","Enhancing user engagement through the strategic application of perception laws"],"zh":["使用行为触发器设计说服性的入门流程","优化用户界面以减轻决策中的认知偏见","通过战略性地应用感知法则来提高用户参与度"],"ja":["行動トリガーを使用して説得力のあるオンボーディングフローを設計する","ユーザーインターフェイスを最適化して意思決定における認知バイアスを軽減する","認識法則を戦略的に適用してユーザーの関与度を高める"],"ko":["행동 트리거를 사용하여 설득력 있는 온보딩 흐름을 설계한다","사용자 인터페이스를 최적화하여 의사결정에서 인지 편향을 완화한다","지각 법칙을 전략적으로 적용하여 사용자 참여도를 향상한다"],"es":["Diseñar flujos de incorporación persuasivos utilizando desencadenantes conductuales","Optimizar las interfaces de usuario para mitigar los sesgos cognitivos en la toma de decisiones","Mejorar la participación del usuario a través de la aplicación estratégica de las leyes de percepción"],"fr":["Concevoir des flux d''intégration persuasifs en utilisant des déclencheurs de comportement","Optimiser les interfaces utilisateur pour atténuer les biais cognitifs dans la prise de décision","Améliorer l''engagement de l''utilisateur grâce à l''application stratégique des lois de perception"],"de":["Überzeugende Onboarding-Flüsse mithilfe von Verhaltensauslösern entwerfen","Benutzeroberflächen optimieren, um kognitive Verzerrungen bei der Entscheidungsfindung zu mindern","Benutzerbeteiligung durch strategische Anwendung der Wahrnehmungsgesetze verbessern"],"pt":["Projetar fluxos de onboarding persuasivos usando gatilhos comportamentais","Otimizar interfaces de usuário para mitigar vieses cognitivos na tomada de decisões","Melhorar o engajamento do usuário por meio da aplicação estratégica de leis de percepção"],"ru":["Разработка убедительных потоков ввода в эксплуатацию с использованием поведенческих триггеров","Оптимизация интерфейсов пользователя для смягчения когнитивных предубеждений в принятии решений","Повышение вовлеченности пользователя за счет стратегического применения законов восприятия"],"ar":["تصميم تدفقات الإعداد الفعّالة باستخدام الزجاجات السلوكية","تحسين واجهات المستخدم لتخفيف التحيزات المعرفية في صنع القرار","تحسين مشاركة المستخدم من خلال التطبيق الاستراتيجي لقوانين الإدراك"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of psychological principles","Limited to UI/UX design applications","Dependent on accurate user behavior analysis"],"zh":["需要了解心理学原理","仅限于UI/UX设计应用","依赖于准确的用户行为分析"],"ja":["心理学的原理の理解が必要","UI/UX設計アプリケーションに限定される","正確なユーザーの行動分析に依存する"],"ko":["심리학적 원리의 이해가 필요하다","UI/UX 디자인 응용 프로그램에만 제한된다","정확한 사용자 행동 분석에 의존한다"],"es":["Requiere una comprensión de los principios psicológicos","Limitado a aplicaciones de diseño de UI/UX","Dependiente del análisis preciso del comportamiento del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes psychologiques","Limité aux applications de conception d''interface utilisateur/intuition utilisateur (UI/UX)","Dépendant de l''analyse précise du comportement de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Erfordert ein Verständnis der psychologischen Prinzipien","Begrenzt auf UI/UX-Designanwendungen","Abhängig von der genauen Analyse des Benutzerverhaltens"],"pt":["Requer entendimento de princípios psicológicos","Limitado a aplicações de design UI/UX","Dependente de análise precisa do comportamento do usuário"],"ru":["Требует понимания психологических принципов","Ограничен дизайном UI/UX","Зависит от точного анализа поведения пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم المبادئ النفسية","محدود لتطبيقات تصميم UI/UX","يعتمد على تحليل دقيق لسلوك المستخدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('asnar00/miso/android-stop-app', 'community', 'asnar00', 'miso', 'asnar00/miso', 'android-stop-app', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z', '2026-02-18T03:24:27.943Z', NULL, '{"id":"asnar00/miso/android-stop-app","name":"android-stop-app","description":{"zh":"Android ","ja":"Android","ko":"Android ","es":"La habilidad ''android-stop-app'' detiene la aplicación Android en un dispositivo conectado, terminando todos los procesos y liberando memoria.","fr":"La compétence ''android-stop-app'' arrête l''application Android sur un appareil connecté, terminant tous les processus et libérant la mémoire.","de":"Die Fähigkeit ''android-stop-app'' beendet die Android-App auf einem verbundenen Gerät, beendet alle Prozesse und befreit Speicher.","pt":"O skill android-stop-app termina o aplicativo Android em execução em um dispositivo conectado","ru":"Навык android-stop-app останавливает приложение Android, работающее на подключенном устройстве","ar":"مهارة android-stop-app تتوقف عن تشغيل تطبيق الأندرويد على جهاز متصل","en":"make it so"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Android ","ja":"Android","ko":"Android ","es":"Detener Aplicación Android","fr":"Arrêter Application Android","de":"Android App Beenden","pt":"Parar Aplicativo Android","ru":"Остановить Приложение Android","ar":"إيقاف تطبيق الأندرويد","en":"android-stop-app"},"description":{"zh":"Android ","ja":"Android","ko":"Android ","es":"La habilidad ''android-stop-app'' detiene la aplicación Android en un dispositivo conectado, terminando todos los procesos y liberando memoria.","fr":"La compétence ''android-stop-app'' arrête l''application Android sur un appareil connecté, terminant tous les processus et libérant la mémoire.","de":"Die Fähigkeit ''android-stop-app'' beendet die Android-App auf einem verbundenen Gerät, beendet alle Prozesse und befreit Speicher.","pt":"O skill android-stop-app termina o aplicativo Android em execução em um dispositivo conectado","ru":"Навык android-stop-app останавливает приложение Android, работающее на подключенном устройстве","ar":"مهارة android-stop-app تتوقف عن تشغيل تطبيق الأندرويد على جهاز متصل","en":"make it so"},"definition":{"en":"make it so"},"features":{"zh":["Android ","adb shell am force-stop","API","SDK","Android "],"ja":["Android","adb shell am force-stop","API","SDK","Android"],"ko":["Android ","adb shell am force-stop","API","SDK","Android "],"es":["Detiene la aplicación Android en un dispositivo conectado","Termina todos los procesos de la aplicación","Libera memoria","Preserva los datos de la aplicación","Se utiliza con adb shell am force-stop"],"fr":["Arrête l''application Android sur un appareil connecté","Termine tous les processus de l''application","Libère la mémoire","Préserve les données de l''application","Est utilisé avec adb shell am force-stop"],"de":["Beendet die Android-App auf einem verbundenen Gerät","Beendet alle Prozesse der App","Befreit Speicher","Bewahrt die App-Daten","Wird mit adb shell am force-stop verwendet"],"pt":["Termina o aplicativo Android em execução","Limpa a memória do dispositivo","Preserva os dados do aplicativo","Usa adb shell am force-stop","Permite a reinstalação do aplicativo"],"ru":["Останавливает приложение Android","Очищает память устройства","Сохраняет данные приложения","Использует adb shell am force-stop","Позволяет переустановить приложение"],"ar":["يتوقف عن تشغيل تطبيق الأندرويد","ي清ي الذاكرة","يحافظ على بيانات التطبيق","يستخدم adb shell am force-stop","يسمح بإعادة تثبيت التطبيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Android ","Android SDK","Android API","ADB","Android ","Android "],"ja":["Android","Android SDK","Android API","ADB","Android","Android"],"ko":["Android ","Android SDK","Android API","ADB","Android ","Android "],"es":["detener aplicación android","android stop app","adb shell am force-stop","desarrollo de aplicaciones android","pruebas de aplicaciones android","depuración de aplicaciones android"],"fr":["arrêter application android","android stop app","adb shell am force-stop","développement d''applications android","tests d''applications android","débogage d''applications android"],"de":["android app beenden","android stop app","adb shell am force-stop","entwicklung von android apps","tests von android apps","fehlersuche von android apps"],"pt":["parar aplicativo android","android stop app","adb shell am force-stop","terminar aplicativo","limpar memória","preservar dados"],"ru":["остановить приложение android","android stop app","adb shell am force-stop","завершить приложение","очистить память","сохранить данные"],"ar":["إيقاف تطبيق الأندرويد","android stop app","adb shell am force-stop","إيقاف تشغيل التطبيق","تنظيف الذاكرة","حفظ البيانات"]}},"owner":"asnar00","repo":"miso","repoPath":"asnar00/miso","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"android-stop-app","description":"Stop the Android app running on connected device. Cleanly terminates the app using force-stop. Use when stopping the app for debugging, testing, or cleanup.","bodyPreview":"# Android Stop App\n\n## Overview\n\nStops the Android app running on a connected device by using `adb shell am force-stop`. This cleanly terminates all app processes, clearing memory while preserving app data.\n\n## When to Use\n\nInvoke this skill when the user:\n- Asks to \"stop the Android app\"\n- Wants to \"kill the app\"\n- Says \"terminate the Android app on device\"\n- Mentions shutting down or closing the Android app\n- Needs to stop before deploying new version\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Android device connec","body":"# Android Stop App\n\n## Overview\n\nStops the Android app running on a connected device by using `adb shell am force-stop`. This cleanly terminates all app processes, clearing memory while preserving app data.\n\n## When to Use\n\nInvoke this skill when the user:\n- Asks to \"stop the Android app\"\n- Wants to \"kill the app\"\n- Says \"terminate the Android app on device\"\n- Mentions shutting down or closing the Android app\n- Needs to stop before deploying new version\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Android device connected via USB\n- USB debugging enabled\n- ADB installed (`brew install android-platform-tools`)\n- Device authorized\n- App must be running on the device\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Navigate to the Android app directory:\n   ```bash\n   cd path/to/android/app\n   ```\n\n2. Run the stop script:\n   ```bash\n   ./stop-app.sh\n   ```\n\n3. The script will:\n   - Use `adb shell am force-stop` to terminate the app\n   - Report success\n\n4. Inform the user:\n   - The app has been stopped\n   - Safe to call even if app isn''t running\n   - Uses force-stop for clean shutdown (not kill)\n\n## Expected Output\n\n```\n🛑 Stopping NoobTest on device...\n✅ App stopped\n```\n\n## How It Works\n\nThe script uses:\n- `adb shell am force-stop com.miso.noobtest`\n\nThis Android framework command:\n- Stops all processes associated with the package\n- Clears app from memory\n- Preserves app data and settings\n- Clean shutdown (not emergency kill)\n\n## force-stop vs kill\n\n**force-stop** (recommended):\n- Android framework command\n- Clean shutdown\n- Preserves app data\n- Safe for development\n\n**kill** (not recommended):\n- OS-level signal\n- Abrupt termination\n- May leave resources in inconsistent state\n- Only use if force-stop fails\n\n## Common Use Cases\n\n**Before deploying new version**:\n```bash\n./stop-app.sh\n./install-device.sh\n```\n\n**Pairing with restart**:\n```bash\n./stop-app.sh\n# Make configuration changes\n./restart-app.sh\n```\n\n**Clean state testing**:\n```bash\n./stop-app.sh\n# Clear app data manually if needed\nadb shell pm clear com.miso.noobtest\n# Then install fresh\n```\n\n## Common Issues\n\n**\"no devices found\"**:\n- Check USB connection\n- Ensure USB debugging enabled\n- Verify authorized: `adb devices`\n- Try: `adb kill-server && adb start-server`\n\n**\"adb: command not found\"**:\n- Install Android platform tools: `brew install android-platform-tools`\n- Check PATH includes adb\n\n**App still running after force-stop**:\n- Rare, but check with: `adb shell pidof com.miso.noobtest`\n- If still running, restart device\n- Or use: `adb shell pm clear com.miso.noobtest` (nukes app data too)\n\n## Safety\n\nThis script is safe to call repeatedly:\n- Won''t error if app isn''t running\n- Uses clean shutdown method\n- Reports status clearly\n- No risk to app data or installation\n\n## Package Name\n\nThe script is configured for the specific app''s package name (e.g., `com.miso.noobtest` for Firefly/NoobTest). Package name is defined in build.gradle.kts under `applicationId`.\n\n## Data Preservation\n\n`force-stop` does NOT clear:\n- App installation\n- App data (SharedPreferences, databases, files)\n- App permissions\n- User settings\n\nTo fully clear app state, use:\n```bash\nadb shell pm clear com.miso.noobtest\n```\n\nBut this will require reinstallation and setup.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:24:27.943Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Mobile Automation Agents requiring seamless Android app management capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要无缝Android应用管理能力的移动自动化代理。","ja":"Androidアプリの管理機能を必要とするモバイル自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"무결한 안드로이드 앱 관리 기능을 필요로 하는 모바일 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización Móvil que requieren capacidades de gestión de aplicaciones de Android sin problemas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation mobile nécessitant des capacités de gestion d''applications Android sans interruption.","de":"Ideal für Mobile Automation Agents, die ein reibungsloses Android-App-Management erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação Móvel que requerem capacidades de gerenciamento de aplicativos Android sem interrupções.","ru":"Идеально для агентов мобильной автоматизации, требующих бесшовных возможностей управления приложениями Android.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التutomatioن المتنقل الذي يتطلب إمكانيات إدارة التطبيقات أندرويد دون انقطاع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to cleanly terminate Android app processes using adb shell am force-stop, preserving app data while clearing memory, and supports deployment of new app versions.","zh":"赋予代理干净终止Android应用进程的能力，使用adb shell am force-stop命令，保留应用数据同时清除内存，并支持部署新的应用版本。","ja":"エージェントにAndroidアプリのプロセスをクリーンに終了する機能を提供します。adb shell am force-stopコマンドを使用して、アプリデータを保持しながらメモリをクリアし、新しいアプリバージョンのデプロイもサポートします。","ko":"에이전트에게 안드로이드 애플리케이션 프로세스를 깨끗하게 종료할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, adb shell am force-stop 명령을 사용하여 애플리케이션 데이터를 유지하면서 메모리를 очист하고 새로운 애플리케이션 버전의 배포도 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes terminar limpiamente los procesos de aplicaciones de Android utilizando adb shell am force-stop, preservando los datos de la aplicación mientras se borra la memoria, y admite la implementación de nuevas versiones de aplicaciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de terminer proprement les processus d''applications Android en utilisant adb shell am force-stop, en préservant les données de l''application tout en effaçant la mémoire, et prend en charge le déploiement de nouvelles versions d''applications.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Android-App-Prozesse mithilfe von adb shell am force-stop sauber zu beenden, wobei die App-Daten erhalten bleiben, während der Speicher gelöscht wird, und unterstützt die Bereitstellung neuer App-Versionen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes terminem processos de aplicativos Android de forma limpa usando adb shell am force-stop, preservando os dados do aplicativo enquanto limpa a memória, e suporta a implantação de novas versões de aplicativos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью чисто завершать процессы приложений Android с помощью adb shell am force-stop, сохраняя данные приложения при очистке памяти, и поддерживает развертывание новых версий приложений.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على إنهاء عمليات التطبيقات أندرويد بطريقة نظيفة باستخدام adb shell am force-stop، مع الحفاظ على بيانات التطبيق أثناء مسح الذاكرة، ودعم نشر إصدارات جديدة من التطبيقات."},"useCases":{"en":["Terminating unresponsive Android apps","Stopping apps before deploying updates","Automating Android app testing workflows"],"zh":["终止无响应的Android应用","在部署更新之前停止应用","自动化Android应用测试工作流"],"ja":["応答しないAndroidアプリを終了する","更新をデプロイする前にアプリを停止する","Androidアプリのテストワークフローを自動化する"],"ko":["반응하지 않는 안드로이드 애플리케이션을 종료하는 것","업데이트를 배포하기 전에 애플리케이션을 중지하는 것","안드로이드 애플리케이션 테스트 워크플로를 자동화하는 것"],"es":["Terminación de aplicaciones de Android no respondientes","Detención de aplicaciones antes de implementar actualizaciones","Automatización de flujos de trabajo de prueba de aplicaciones de Android"],"fr":["Termination d''applications Android non responsives","Arrêt des applications avant de déployer des mises à jour","Automatisation des flux de travail de test d''applications Android"],"de":["Beenden nicht reagierender Android-Apps","Beenden von Apps vor der Bereitstellung von Updates","Automatisierung von Android-App-Testworkflows"],"pt":["Encerrar aplicativos Android não responsivos","Parar aplicativos antes de implantar atualizações","Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de teste de aplicativos Android"],"ru":["Завершение некорректно работающих приложений Android","Остановка приложений перед развертыванием обновлений","Автоматизация рабочих процессов тестирования приложений Android"],"ar":["إيقاف تشغيل التطبيقات أندرويد غير المستجيبة","إيقاف التطبيقات قبل نشر التحديثات","توسيط تدفقات عمل اختبار التطبيقات أندرويد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires connected Android device","ADB shell access needed"],"zh":["需要连接的Android设备","需要ADB shell访问"],"ja":["接続されたAndroidデバイスが必要","ADBシェルアクセスが必要"],"ko":["연결된 안드로이드 디바이스가 필요","ADB 쉘 접근이 필요"],"es":["Requiere un dispositivo Android conectado","Se necesita acceso a la shell ADB"],"fr":["Nécessite un appareil Android connecté","L''accès à la shell ADB est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt ein verbundenes Android-Gerät","Zugriff auf die ADB-Shell erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer dispositivo Android conectado","É necessário acesso ao shell ADB"],"ru":["Требуется подключенное устройство Android","Требуется доступ к оболочке ADB"],"ar":["يتطلب جهاز أندرويد متصل","يتطلب الوصول إلى غلاف ADB"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Deefunxion/pixel-flick-frenzy/game-development', 'community', 'Deefunxion', 'pixel-flick-frenzy', 'Deefunxion/pixel-flick-frenzy', 'game-development', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z', '2026-02-18T03:23:51.002Z', NULL, '{"id":"Deefunxion/pixel-flick-frenzy/game-development","name":"game-development","description":{"zh":"游戏开发综合指南，介绍Unity、Unreal和Godot引擎的比较和项目结构","ja":"ゲーム開発の総合ガイド。Unity、Unreal、Godotエンジンの比較とプロジェクト構造について紹介します","ko":"게임 개발을 위한 종합 가이드입니다. Unity, Unreal, Godot 엔진 비교 및 프로젝트 구조에 대해 설명합니다","es":"Guía completa para desarrollar juegos en Unity, Unreal y Godot, con comparación de motores y estructura de proyectos","fr":"Guide complet pour développer des jeux avec Unity, Unreal et Godot, avec comparaison de moteurs et structure de projets","de":"Umfassender Leitfaden für die Entwicklung von Spielen mit Unity, Unreal und Godot, mit Motorvergleich und Projektstruktur","pt":"Guia completo para desenvolvimento de jogos em diferentes motores e plataformas, incluindo Unity, Unreal e Godot.","ru":"Полное руководство по разработке игр на разных движках и платформах, включая Unity, Unreal и Godot.","ar":"دليل شامل لتطوير الألعاب على مختلف المحركات والمنصات، بما في ذلك Unity و Unreal و Godot.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"游戏开发指南","ja":"ゲーム開発ガイド","ko":"게임 개발 가이드","es":"Desarrollo de Juegos: Guía Completa","fr":"Développement de Jeux: Guide Complet","de":"Spiele-Entwicklung: Umfassender Leitfaden","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Jogos: Guia Completo","ru":"Разработка Игр: Полное Руководство","ar":"تطوير الألعاب: دليل شامل","en":"game-development"},"description":{"zh":"游戏开发综合指南，介绍Unity、Unreal和Godot引擎的比较和项目结构","ja":"ゲーム開発の総合ガイド。Unity、Unreal、Godotエンジンの比較とプロジェクト構造について紹介します","ko":"게임 개발을 위한 종합 가이드입니다. Unity, Unreal, Godot 엔진 비교 및 프로젝트 구조에 대해 설명합니다","es":"Guía completa para desarrollar juegos en Unity, Unreal y Godot, con comparación de motores y estructura de proyectos","fr":"Guide complet pour développer des jeux avec Unity, Unreal et Godot, avec comparaison de moteurs et structure de projets","de":"Umfassender Leitfaden für die Entwicklung von Spielen mit Unity, Unreal und Godot, mit Motorvergleich und Projektstruktur","pt":"Guia completo para desenvolvimento de jogos em diferentes motores e plataformas, incluindo Unity, Unreal e Godot.","ru":"Полное руководство по разработке игр на разных движках и платформах, включая Unity, Unreal и Godot.","ar":"دليل شامل لتطوير الألعاب على مختلف المحركات والمنصات، بما في ذلك Unity و Unreal و Godot.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["Unity、Unreal和Godot引擎的比较","项目结构和组织","C#、C++和GDScript编程语言","支持多种平台，包括移动设备和PC","VR/AR和2D游戏开发支持"],"ja":["Unity、Unreal、Godotエンジンの比較","プロジェクト構造と組織","C#、C++、GDScriptプログラミング言語","モバイルデバイスやPCなどの複数のプラットフォームをサポート","VR/ARや2Dゲーム開発をサポート"],"ko":["Unity, Unreal, Godot 엔진 비교","프로젝트 구조 및 조직","C#, C++, GDScript 프로그래밍 언어","모바일 장치 및 PC를 포함한 여러 플랫폼 지원","VR/AR 및 2D 게임 개발 지원"],"es":["Comparación de motores de juego","Estructura de proyectos en Unity","Desarrollo de juegos en Unreal","Uso de GDScript en Godot","Creación de juegos en 2D y 3D","Despliegue en diversas plataformas"],"fr":["Comparaison de moteurs de jeu","Structure de projets dans Unity","Développement de jeux avec Unreal","Utilisation de GDScript dans Godot","Création de jeux en 2D et 3D","Déploiement sur diverses plateformes"],"de":["Vergleich von Spiel-Engines","Projektstruktur in Unity","Spiele-Entwicklung mit Unreal","Verwendung von GDScript in Godot","Erstellung von 2D- und 3D-Spielen","Bereitstellung auf verschiedenen Plattformen"],"pt":["Comparação de motores de jogo","Desenvolvimento de jogos em Unity","Desenvolvimento de jogos em Unreal","Desenvolvimento de jogos em Godot","Criação de jogos para diferentes plataformas"],"ru":["Сравнение игровых движков","Разработка игр на Unity","Разработка игр на Unreal","Разработка игр на Godot","Создание игр для разных платформ"],"ar":["مقارنة بين محركات الألعاب","تطوير ألعاب على Unity","تطوير ألعاب على Unreal","تطوير ألعاب على Godot","إنشاء ألعاب لمنصات مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["游戏开发","Unity","Unreal","Godot","C#","C++","GDScript","游戏引擎","游戏开发工具"],"ja":["ゲーム開発","Unity","Unreal","Godot","C#","C++","GDScript","ゲームエンジン","ゲーム開発ツール"],"ko":["게임 개발","Unity","Unreal","Godot","C#","C++","GDScript","게임 엔진","게임 개발 도구"],"es":["desarrollo de juegos","unity","unreal","godot","gdscript","c#","c++","motores de juego","juegos electrónicos"],"fr":["développement de jeux","unity","unreal","godot","gdscript","c#","c++","moteurs de jeu","jeux électroniques"],"de":["spiele-entwicklung","unity","unreal","godot","gdscript","c#","c++","spiele-engines","elektronische spiele"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de jogos","motores de jogo","Unity","Unreal","Godot","criação de jogos","jogos eletrônicos"],"ru":["разработка игр","игровые движки","Unity","Unreal","Godot","создание игр","электронные игры"],"ar":["تطوير الألعاب","محركات الألعاب","Unity","Unreal","Godot","إنشاء ألعاب","ألعاب إلكترونية"]}},"owner":"Deefunxion","repo":"pixel-flick-frenzy","repoPath":"Deefunxion/pixel-flick-frenzy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"game-development","description":"Game development with Unity, Unreal Engine, and Godot. Use when building games, implementing game mechanics, physics, AI, or working with game engines.","bodyPreview":"# Game Development\n\nComprehensive guide for building games across major engines and platforms.\n\n## Engine Comparison\n\n| Engine | Language | Best For | Platforms |\n|--------|----------|----------|-----------|\n| **Unity** | C# | Mobile, indie, VR/AR | All |\n| **Unreal** | C++, Blueprints | AAA, realistic graphics | All |\n| **Godot** | GDScript, C# | 2D, indie, open source | All |\n\n---\n\n## Unity (C#)\n\n### Project Structure\n\n```\nAssets/\n├── Scripts/\n│   ├── Player/\n│   │   ├── PlayerController.cs\n│","body":"# Game Development\n\nComprehensive guide for building games across major engines and platforms.\n\n## Engine Comparison\n\n| Engine | Language | Best For | Platforms |\n|--------|----------|----------|-----------|\n| **Unity** | C# | Mobile, indie, VR/AR | All |\n| **Unreal** | C++, Blueprints | AAA, realistic graphics | All |\n| **Godot** | GDScript, C# | 2D, indie, open source | All |\n\n---\n\n## Unity (C#)\n\n### Project Structure\n\n```\nAssets/\n├── Scripts/\n│   ├── Player/\n│   │   ├── PlayerController.cs\n│   │   └── PlayerInput.cs\n│   ├── Enemies/\n│   ├── Systems/\n│   └── Utils/\n├── Prefabs/\n├── Scenes/\n├── Materials/\n├── Animations/\n└── Resources/\n```\n\n### Player Controller\n\n```csharp\nusing UnityEngine;\nusing UnityEngine.InputSystem;\n\n[RequireComponent(typeof(CharacterController))]\npublic class PlayerController : MonoBehaviour\n{\n    [Header(\"Movement\")]\n    [SerializeField] private float moveSpeed = 5f;\n    [SerializeField] private float sprintMultiplier = 1.5f;\n    [SerializeField] private float jumpHeight = 2f;\n    [SerializeField] private float gravity = -9.81f;\n\n    [Header(\"Look\")]\n    [SerializeField] private float lookSensitivity = 2f;\n    [SerializeField] private float maxLookAngle = 80f;\n\n    private CharacterController _controller;\n    private Vector2 _moveInput;\n    private Vector2 _lookInput;\n    private Vector3 _velocity;\n    private float _xRotation;\n    private bool _isSprinting;\n\n    private void Awake()\n    {\n        _controller = GetComponent<CharacterController>();\n        Cursor.lockState = CursorLockMode.Locked;\n    }\n\n    private void Update()\n    {\n        HandleMovement();\n        HandleLook();\n        ApplyGravity();\n    }\n\n    private void HandleMovement()\n    {\n        float speed = _isSprinting ? moveSpeed * sprintMultiplier : moveSpeed;\n        Vector3 move = transform.right * _moveInput.x + transform.forward * _moveInput.y;\n        _controller.Move(move * speed * Time.deltaTime);\n    }\n\n    private void HandleLook()\n    {\n        float mouseX = _lookInput.x * lookSensitivity * Time.deltaTime;\n        float mouseY = _lookInput.y * lookSensitivity * Time.deltaTime;\n\n        _xRotation -= mouseY;\n        _xRotation = Mathf.Clamp(_xRotation, -maxLookAngle, maxLookAngle);\n\n        Camera.main.transform.localRotation = Quaternion.Euler(_xRotation, 0f, 0f);\n        transform.Rotate(Vector3.up * mouseX);\n    }\n\n    private void ApplyGravity()\n    {\n        if (_controller.isGrounded && _velocity.y < 0)\n        {\n            _velocity.y = -2f;\n        }\n\n        _velocity.y += gravity * Time.deltaTime;\n        _controller.Move(_velocity * Time.deltaTime);\n    }\n\n    // Input System callbacks\n    public void OnMove(InputAction.CallbackContext context) =>\n        _moveInput = context.ReadValue<Vector2>();\n\n    public void OnLook(InputAction.CallbackContext context) =>\n        _lookInput = context.ReadValue<Vector2>();\n\n    public void OnJump(InputAction.CallbackContext context)\n    {\n        if (context.performed && _controller.isGrounded)\n        {\n            _velocity.y = Mathf.Sqrt(jumpHeight * -2f * gravity);\n        }\n    }\n\n    public void OnSprint(InputAction.CallbackContext context) =>\n        _isSprinting = context.performed;\n}\n```\n\n### State Machine\n\n```csharp\npublic interface IState\n{\n    void Enter();\n    void Update();\n    void Exit();\n}\n\npublic class StateMachine\n{\n    private IState _currentState;\n\n    public void ChangeState(IState newState)\n    {\n        _currentState?.Exit();\n        _currentState = newState;\n        _currentState.Enter();\n    }\n\n    public void Update() => _currentState?.Update();\n}\n\n// Example: Enemy AI States\npublic class IdleState : IState\n{\n    private readonly EnemyAI _enemy;\n\n    public IdleState(EnemyAI enemy) => _enemy = enemy;\n\n    public void Enter() => _enemy.Animator.SetTrigger(\"Idle\");\n\n    public void Update()\n    {\n        if (_enemy.CanSeePlayer())\n        {\n            _enemy.StateMachine.ChangeState(new ChaseState(_enemy));\n        }\n    }\n\n    public void Exit() { }\n}\n\npublic class ChaseState : IState\n{\n    private readonly EnemyAI _enemy;\n\n    public ChaseState(EnemyAI enemy) => _enemy = enemy;\n\n    public void Enter() => _enemy.Animator.SetTrigger(\"Run\");\n\n    public void Update()\n    {\n        _enemy.NavAgent.SetDestination(_enemy.Player.position);\n\n        if (_enemy.InAttackRange())\n        {\n            _enemy.StateMachine.ChangeState(new AttackState(_enemy));\n        }\n        else if (!_enemy.CanSeePlayer())\n        {\n            _enemy.StateMachine.ChangeState(new IdleState(_enemy));\n        }\n    }\n\n    public void Exit() { }\n}\n```\n\n### Object Pooling\n\n```csharp\npublic class ObjectPool<T> where T : Component\n{\n    private readonly T _prefab;\n    private readonly Transform _parent;\n    private readonly Queue<T> _pool = new();\n\n    public ObjectPool(T prefab, int initialSize, Transform parent = null)\n    {\n        _prefab = prefab;\n        _parent = parent;\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < initialSize; i++)\n        {\n            CreateInstance();\n        }\n    }\n\n    public T Get()\n    {\n        if (_pool.Count == 0) CreateInstance();\n\n        T obj = _pool.Dequeue();\n        obj.gameObject.SetActive(true);\n        return obj;\n    }\n\n    public void Return(T obj)\n    {\n        obj.gameObject.SetActive(false);\n        _pool.Enqueue(obj);\n    }\n\n    private void CreateInstance()\n    {\n        T obj = Object.Instantiate(_prefab, _parent);\n        obj.gameObject.SetActive(false);\n        _pool.Enqueue(obj);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Unreal Engine (C++)\n\n### Actor Component\n\n```cpp\n// PlayerMovementComponent.h\n#pragma once\n\n#include \"CoreMinimal.h\"\n#include \"Components/ActorComponent.h\"\n#include \"PlayerMovementComponent.generated.h\"\n\nUCLASS(ClassGroup=(Custom), meta=(BlueprintSpawnableComponent))\nclass MYGAME_API UPlayerMovementComponent : public UActorComponent\n{\n    GENERATED_BODY()\n\npublic:\n    UPlayerMovementComponent();\n\n    virtual void TickComponent(float DeltaTime, ELevelTick TickType,\n        FActorComponentTickFunction* ThisTickFunction) override;\n\n    UFUNCTION(BlueprintCallable, Category = \"Movement\")\n    void Move(FVector2D Input);\n\n    UFUNCTION(BlueprintCallable, Category = \"Movement\")\n    void Jump();\n\nprotected:\n    virtual void BeginPlay() override;\n\nprivate:\n    UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere, Category = \"Movement\")\n    float MoveSpeed = 600.0f;\n\n    UPROPERTY(EditAnywhere, Category = \"Movement\")\n    float JumpForce = 400.0f;\n\n    UPROPERTY()\n    class UCharacterMovementComponent* MovementComponent;\n};\n\n// PlayerMovementComponent.cpp\n#include \"PlayerMovementComponent.h\"\n#include \"GameFramework/CharacterMovementComponent.h\"\n\nUPlayerMovementComponent::UPlayerMovementComponent()\n{\n    PrimaryComponentTick.bCanEverTick = true;\n}\n\nvoid UPlayerMovementComponent::BeginPlay()\n{\n    Super::BeginPlay();\n\n    if (ACharacter* Owner = Cast<ACharacter>(GetOwner()))\n    {\n        MovementComponent = Owner->GetCharacterMovement();\n    }\n}\n\nvoid UPlayerMovementComponent::Move(FVector2D Input)\n{\n    if (!MovementComponent) return;\n\n    FVector Forward = GetOwner()->GetActorForwardVector();\n    FVector Right = GetOwner()->GetActorRightVector();\n\n    FVector Direction = (Forward * Input.Y + Right * Input.X).GetSafeNormal();\n    MovementComponent->AddInputVector(Direction * MoveSpeed);\n}\n\nvoid UPlayerMovementComponent::Jump()\n{\n    if (ACharacter* Character = Cast<ACharacter>(GetOwner()))\n    {\n        Character->Jump();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Gameplay Ability System (GAS)\n\n```cpp\n// MyGameplayAbility.h\n#pragma once\n\n#include \"Abilities/GameplayAbility.h\"\n#include \"MyGameplayAbility.generated.h\"\n\nUCLASS()\nclass MYGAME_API UMyGameplayAbility : public UGameplayAbility\n{\n    GENERATED_BODY()\n\npublic:\n    UMyGameplayAbility();\n\n    virtual void ActivateAbility(const FGameplayAbilitySpecHandle Handle,\n        const FGameplayAbilityActorInfo* ActorInfo,\n        const FGameplayAbilityActivationInfo ActivationInfo,\n        const FGameplayEventData* TriggerEventData) override;\n\n    virtual void EndAbility(const FGameplayAbilitySpecHandle Handle,\n        const FGameplayAbilityActorInfo* ActorInfo,\n        const FGameplayAbilityActivationInfo ActivationInfo,\n        bool bReplicateEndAbility, bool bWasCancelled) override;\n\nprotected:\n    UPROPERTY(EditDefaultsOnly, Category = \"Ability\")\n    float Damage = 50.0f;\n\n    UPROPERTY(EditDefaultsOnly, Category = \"Ability\")\n    TSubclassOf<UGameplayEffect> DamageEffect;\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n## Godot (GDScript)\n\n### Player Controller\n\n```gdscript\nextends CharacterBody3D\n\n@export var move_speed: float = 5.0\n@export var jump_velocity: float = 4.5\n@export var mouse_sensitivity: float = 0.002\n\nvar gravity: float = ProjectSettings.get_setting(\"physics/3d/default_gravity\")\n\n@onready var camera: Camera3D = $Camera3D\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n    Input.mouse_mode = Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED\n\nfunc _input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n    if event is InputEventMouseMotion:\n        rotate_y(-event.relative.x * mouse_sensitivity)\n        camera.rotate_x(-event.relative.y * mouse_sensitivity)\n        camera.rotation.x = clamp(camera.rotation.x, -PI/2, PI/2)\n\nfunc _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n    # Gravity\n    if not is_on_floor():\n        velocity.y -= gravity * delta\n\n    # Jump\n    if Input.is_action_just_pressed(\"jump\") and is_on_floor():\n        velocity.y = jump_velocity\n\n    # Movement\n    var input_dir := Input.get_vector(\"move_left\", \"move_right\", \"move_forward\", \"move_back\")\n    var direction := (transform.basis * Vector3(input_dir.x, 0, input_dir.y)).normalized()\n\n    if direction:\n        velocity.x = direction.x * move_speed\n        velocity.z = direction.z * move_speed\n    else:\n        velocity.x = move_toward(velocity.x, 0, move_speed)\n        velocity.z = move_toward(velocity.z, 0, move_speed)\n\n    move_and_slide()\n```\n\n### State Machine (GDScript)\n\n```gdscript\n# state_machine.gd\nclass_name StateMachine\nextends Node\n\n@export var initial_state: State\n\nvar current_state: State\nvar states: Dictionary = {}\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n    for child in get_children():\n        if child is State:\n            states[child.name.to_lower()] = child\n            child.transitioned.connect(_on_child_transitioned)\n\n    if initial_state:\n        initial_state.enter()\n        current_state = initial_state\n\nfunc _process(delta: float) -> void:\n    if current_state:\n        current_state.update(delta)\n\nfunc _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n    if current_state:\n        current_state.physics_update(delta)\n\nfunc _on_child_transitioned(state: State, new_state_name: String) -> void:\n    if state != current_state:\n        return\n\n    var new_state: State = states.get(new_state_name.to_lower())\n    if not new_state:\n        return\n\n    current_state.exit()\n    new_state.enter()\n    current_state = new_state\n\n# state.gd\nclass_name State\nextends Node\n\nsignal transitioned(state: State, new_state_name: String)\n\nfunc enter() -> void:\n    pass\n\nfunc exit() -> void:\n    pass\n\nfunc update(_delta: float) -> void:\n    pass\n\nfunc physics_update(_delta: float) -> void:\n    pass\n```\n\n---\n\n## Game Patterns\n\n### Entity Component System (ECS)\n\n```csharp\n// Unity DOTS example\nusing Unity.Entities;\nusing Unity.Mathematics;\nusing Unity.Transforms;\n\npublic struct MoveSpeed : IComponentData\n{\n    public float Value;\n}\n\npublic partial class MovementSystem : SystemBase\n{\n    protected override void OnUpdate()\n    {\n        float deltaTime = SystemAPI.Time.DeltaTime;\n\n        Entities.ForEach((ref LocalTransform transform, in MoveSpeed speed) =>\n        {\n            transform.Position += new float3(0, 0, speed.Value * deltaTime);\n        }).ScheduleParallel();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Event System\n\n```csharp\npublic static class GameEvents\n{\n    public static event Action<int> OnScoreChanged;\n    public static event Action<float> OnHealthChanged;\n    public static event Action OnGameOver;\n\n    public static void ScoreChanged(int newScore) => OnScoreChanged?.Invoke(newScore);\n    public static void HealthChanged(float newHealth) => OnHealthChanged?.Invoke(newHealth);\n    public static void GameOver() => OnGameOver?.Invoke();\n}\n\n// Usage\npublic class UIManager : MonoBehaviour\n{\n    private void OnEnable()\n    {\n        GameEvents.OnScoreChanged += UpdateScoreUI;\n        GameEvents.OnHealthChanged += UpdateHealthUI;\n    }\n\n    private void OnDisable()\n    {\n        GameEvents.OnScoreChanged -= UpdateScoreUI;\n        GameEvents.OnHealthChanged -= UpdateHealthUI;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Save System\n\n```csharp\n[Serializable]\npublic class SaveData\n{\n    public int Level;\n    public float PlayTime;\n    public Vector3Serializable PlayerPosition;\n    public List<string> UnlockedAchievements;\n}\n\npublic static class SaveSystem\n{\n    private static readonly string SavePath =\n        Path.Combine(Application.persistentDataPath, \"save.json\");\n\n    public static void Save(SaveData data)\n    {\n        string json = JsonUtility.ToJson(data, true);\n        File.WriteAllText(SavePath, json);\n    }\n\n    public static SaveData Load()\n    {\n        if (!File.Exists(SavePath)) return new SaveData();\n\n        string json = File.ReadAllText(SavePath);\n        return JsonUtility.FromJson<SaveData>(json);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### LOD (Level of Detail)\n\n```csharp\n// Unity LOD Group setup\n[RequireComponent(typeof(LODGroup))]\npublic class LODSetup : MonoBehaviour\n{\n    public Renderer[] lodRenderers;\n    public float[] screenRelativeTransitions = { 0.5f, 0.2f, 0.01f };\n\n    void Start()\n    {\n        LODGroup lodGroup = GetComponent<LODGroup>();\n        LOD[] lods = new LOD[lodRenderers.Length];\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < lodRenderers.Length; i++)\n        {\n            lods[i] = new LOD(screenRelativeTransitions[i], new[] { lodRenderers[i] });\n        }\n\n        lodGroup.SetLODs(lods);\n        lodGroup.RecalculateBounds();\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Spatial Partitioning\n\n```csharp\npublic class QuadTree<T> where T : class\n{\n    private readonly int _maxObjects = 10;\n    private readonly int _maxLevels = 5;\n    private readonly int _level;\n    private readonly List<(Rect bounds, T obj)> _objects = new();\n    private readonly Rect _bounds;\n    private QuadTree<T>[] _nodes;\n\n    public QuadTree(int level, Rect bounds)\n    {\n        _level = level;\n        _bounds = bounds;\n    }\n\n    public void Insert(Rect objBounds, T obj)\n    {\n        if (_nodes != null)\n        {\n            int index = GetIndex(objBounds);\n            if (index != -1)\n            {\n                _nodes[index].Insert(objBounds, obj);\n                return;\n            }\n        }\n\n        _objects.Add((objBounds, obj));\n\n        if (_objects.Count > _maxObjects && _level < _maxLevels)\n        {\n            if (_nodes == null) Split();\n\n            int i = 0;\n            while (i < _objects.Count)\n            {\n                int index = GetIndex(_objects[i].bounds);\n                if (index != -1)\n                {\n                    var item = _objects[i];\n                    _objects.RemoveAt(i);\n                    _nodes[index].Insert(item.bounds, item.obj);\n                }\n                else i++;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    public List<T> Retrieve(Rect area)\n    {\n        List<T> result = new();\n        RetrieveAll(area, result);\n        return result;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\n### Pre-Production\n- [ ] Game Design Document (GDD)\n- [ ] Technical Design Document\n- [ ] Art style guide\n- [ ] Target platforms defined\n- [ ] Performance budgets set\n\n### Development\n- [ ] Version control setup\n- [ ] CI/CD for builds\n- [ ] Automated testing\n- [ ] Performance profiling regular\n- [ ] Memory leak checks\n\n### Release\n- [ ] Platform certification requirements\n- [ ] Localization complete\n- [ ] Accessibility options\n- [ ] Analytics integration\n- [ ] Crash reporting\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:23:51.002Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents specializing in interactive application development, particularly those leveraging C#, C++, or GDScript for cross-platform game development.","zh":"适合专攻交互式应用开发的AI代理，尤其是那些利用C#、C++或GDScript进行跨平台游戏开发的代理。","ja":"C#、C++、またはGDScriptを使用したクロスプラットフォームゲーム開発を行うAIエージェント、特にインタラクティブアプリケーション開発を専門とするエージェントに適しています。","ko":"C#、C++ 또는 GDScript를 사용하여 크로스 플랫폼 게임 개발을 수행하는 AI 에이전트, 특히 인터랙티브 애플리케이션 개발을 전문으로 하는 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que se especializan en el desarrollo de aplicaciones interactivas, en particular aquellos que utilizan C#, C++ o GDScript para el desarrollo de juegos de plataforma cruzada.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA spécialisés dans le développement d''applications interactives, en particulier ceux qui utilisent C#, C++ ou GDScript pour le développement de jeux multiplateformes.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die sich auf die Entwicklung interaktiver Anwendungen spezialisieren, insbesondere solche, die C#, C++ oder GDScript für die Entwicklung von Cross-Platform-Spielen verwenden.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA especializados em desenvolvimento de aplicações interativas, particularmente aqueles que utilizam C#, C++ ou GDScript para desenvolvimento de jogos cross-platform.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, специализирующихся на разработке интерактивных приложений, особенно тех, кто использует C#, C++ или GDScript для разработки кроссплатформенных игр.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتخصصين في تطوير التطبيقات التفاعلية، خاصة تلك التي تعتمد على C# و C++ و GDScript لتطوير ألعاب متعددة المنصات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and deploy immersive gaming experiences across major engines like Unity and Unreal, utilizing platforms such as VR/AR and supporting 2D or AAA game development with languages including C# and C++.","zh":"使代理能够设计和部署跨主要引擎（如Unity和Unreal）的沉浸式游戏体验，利用平台如VR/AR，并支持使用C#和C++等语言进行2D或AAA游戏开发。","ja":"エージェントがUnityやUnrealなどの主要エンジンを使用して、VR/ARなどのプラットフォームを利用し、C#やC++などの言語を使用して2DまたはAAAゲーム開発をサポートする、没入感のあるゲーム体験を設計してデプロイできるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 Unity나 Unrealなどの 주요 엔진을 사용하여 VR/ARなどの 플랫폼을 활용하고 C# 또는 C++などの 언어를 사용하여 2D 또는 AAA 게임 개발을 지원하는 몰입형 게임 경험을 설계하고 배포할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes diseñar y desplegar experiencias de juego inmersivas en los principales motores como Unity y Unreal, utilizando plataformas como VR/AR y admitiendo el desarrollo de juegos 2D o AAA con lenguajes como C# y C++.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de déployer des expériences de jeu immersives sur les principaux moteurs tels que Unity et Unreal, en utilisant des plateformes telles que VR/AR et en prenant en charge le développement de jeux 2D ou AAA avec des langages tels que C# et C++.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, immersive Gaming-Erfahrungen über große Motoren wie Unity und Unreal zu entwerfen und bereitzustellen, indem Plattformen wie VR/AR genutzt und 2D- oder AAA-Spiele-Entwicklung mit Sprachen wie C# und C++ unterstützt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e implantar experiências de jogos imersivas em principais motores como Unity e Unreal, utilizando plataformas como VR/AR e suportando desenvolvimento de jogos 2D ou AAA com linguagens incluindo C# e C++.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и развертывать иммерсивные игровые trải nghiệm на основных движках, таких как Unity и Unreal, используя платформы, такие как VR/AR, и поддерживая разработку 2D- или AAA-игр на языках, включая C# и C++.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم وتحديث تجارب ألعاب غامرة عبر محركات رئيسية مثل Unity و Unreal ، باستخدام منصات مثل VR/AR ودعم تطوير ألعاب 2D أو AAA بلغات تشمل C# و C++."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing cross-platform games with Unity and Unreal Engine","Optimizing game performance for mobile and VR/AR platforms","Creating 2D games with open-source engines like Godot"],"zh":["使用Unity和Unreal Engine开发跨平台游戏","为移动和VR/AR平台优化游戏性能","使用开源引擎如Godot创建2D游戏"],"ja":["UnityとUnreal Engineを使用したクロスプラットフォームゲーム開発","モバイルとVR/ARプラットフォーム向けのゲームパフォーマンスの最適化","Godotなどのオープンソースエンジンを使用した2Dゲーム作成"],"ko":["Unity와 Unreal Engine을 사용한 크로스 플랫폼 게임 개발","모바일 및 VR/AR 플랫폼을 위한 게임 성능 최적화","Godotなどの 오픈 소스 엔진을 사용한 2D 게임 생성"],"es":["Desarrollar juegos de plataforma cruzada con Unity y Unreal Engine","Optimizar el rendimiento de los juegos para plataformas móviles y VR/AR","Crear juegos 2D con motores de código abierto como Godot"],"fr":["Développer des jeux multiplateformes avec Unity et Unreal Engine","Optimiser les performances des jeux pour les plateformes mobiles et VR/AR","Créer des jeux 2D avec des moteurs open source comme Godot"],"de":["Entwicklung von Cross-Platform-Spielen mit Unity und Unreal Engine","Optimierung der Spielperformance für mobile und VR/AR-Plattformen","Erstellung von 2D-Spielen mit Open-Source-Engines wie Godot"],"pt":["Desenvolver jogos cross-platform com Unity e Unreal Engine","Otimizar o desempenho do jogo para plataformas móveis e VR/AR","Criar jogos 2D com motores de código aberto como Godot"],"ru":["Разработка кроссплатформенных игр с Unity и Unreal Engine","Оптимизация производительности игры для мобильных и VR/AR-платформ","Создание 2D-игр с открытыми движками, такими как Godot"],"ar":["تطوير ألعاب متعددة المنصات باستخدام Unity و Unreal Engine","تحسين أداء اللعبة على منصات الموبايل و VR/AR","إنشاء ألعاب 2D باستخدام محركات مفتوحة المصدر مثل Godot"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires proficiency in C#, C++, or GDScript","Engine-specific knowledge necessary for Unity, Unreal, or Godot","Platform dependencies for deployment on mobile, PC, or consoles"],"zh":["需要C#、C++或GDScript的熟练度","需要Unity、Unreal或Godot的引擎特定知识","需要针对移动、PC或主机的平台依赖"],"ja":["C#、C++、またはGDScriptの熟練度が必要","Unity、Unreal、またはGodotのエンジン特有の知識が必要","モバイル、PC、またはコンソール向けのプラットフォーム依存が必要"],"ko":["C#、C++ 또는 GDScript의 숙련도가 필요","Unity, Unreal 또는 Godot의 엔진 특정 지식이 필요","모바일, PC 또는 콘솔을 위한 플랫폼 종속성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere competencia en C#, C++ o GDScript","Conocimiento específico del motor necesario para Unity, Unreal o Godot","Dependencias de plataforma para la implementación en móviles, PC o consolas"],"fr":["Nécessite une compétence en C#, C++ ou GDScript","Connaissances spécifiques au moteur nécessaires pour Unity, Unreal ou Godot","Dépendances de plateforme pour le déploiement sur mobile, PC ou consoles"],"de":["Erfordert Kompetenz in C#, C++ oder GDScript","Motor-spezifisches Wissen erforderlich für Unity, Unreal oder Godot","Plattform-Abhängigkeiten für die Bereitstellung auf Mobilgeräten, PC oder Konsolen"],"pt":["Exige proficiência em C#, C++ ou GDScript","Conhecimento específico do motor necessário para Unity, Unreal ou Godot","Dependências de plataforma para implantação em dispositivos móveis, PC ou consoles"],"ru":["Требует профессионализма в C#, C++ или GDScript","Необходимо знание конкретного движка для Unity, Unreal или Godot","Зависимости платформы для развертывания на мобильных устройствах, ПК или консолях"],"ar":["يتطلب إتقانًا في C# و C++ و GDScript","معلومات محددة بالمحرك ضرورية ل Unity و Unreal و Godot","اعتماديات المنصة للتثبيت على الأجهزة المحمولة أو الحاسوب أو أجهزة الترفيه"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
