出"],"ko":["부동산 데이터 추출","스크레이핑 툴","AI 기반","비디오 생성","구조화된 JSON 데이터","자바스크립트 렌더링","반 스크레이핑 조치","이미지 추출"],"es":["Firecrawl","extracción de datos","listados inmobiliarios","generación de video","IA","JavaScript","anti-bot","extraction de imágenes","Gemini 3 Pro","Veo 3.1"],"fr":["Firecrawl","extraction de données","listes immobilières","génération de vidéos","IA","JavaScript","anti-bot","extraction d''images","Gemini 3 Pro","Veo 3.1"],"de":["Firecrawl","Datenextraktion","Immobilienlisten","Videogenerierung","KI","JavaScript","Anti-Bot","Bildextraktion","Gemini 3 Pro","Veo 3.1"],"pt":["Firecrawl Scraper","Extração de dados de imóveis","IA para imóveis","Geração de vídeo","JavaScript rendering","Medidas anti-bot","Extração de imagens","Dados JSON","Imóveis de luxo"],"ru":["Firecrawl Скрапер","Извлечение данных о недвижимости","ИИ для недвижимости","Генерация видео","Отображение JavaScript","Меры против ботов","Извлечение изображений","Данные JSON","Роскошная недвижимость"],"ar":["فايركرول سكرابر","استخراج بيانات العقارات","الذكاء الاصطناعي للعقارات","توليد الفيديو","عرض جافاسكريبت","ضد إجراءات الروبوتات","استخراج الصور","بيانات JSON","العقارات الفاخرة"]}},"owner":"Bobby44-max","repo":"boston-luxury-re-producer","repoPath":"Bobby44-max/boston-luxury-re-producer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"firecrawl-scraper","description":"Extract property data from real estate listing URLs using Firecrawl AI. Use when scraping Zillow, Redfin, Realtor.com, or any property listing site. Returns structured data ready for video generation.","bodyPreview":"# Firecrawl Property Extraction\n\n## Overview\nFirecrawl transforms any real estate listing URL into structured JSON data for video generation. It handles JavaScript rendering, anti-bot measures, and image extraction automatically.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```typescript\nimport Firecrawl from ''@mendable/firecrawl-js'';\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\n\nconst firecrawl = new Firecrawl({\n  apiKey: process.env.FIRECRAWL_API_KEY\n});\n\nconst result = await firecrawl.extract({\n  urls: [listingUrl],\n  prompt: ''Extract prop","body":"# Firecrawl Property Extraction\n\n## Overview\nFirecrawl transforms any real estate listing URL into structured JSON data for video generation. It handles JavaScript rendering, anti-bot measures, and image extraction automatically.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```typescript\nimport Firecrawl from ''@mendable/firecrawl-js'';\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\n\nconst firecrawl = new Firecrawl({\n  apiKey: process.env.FIRECRAWL_API_KEY\n});\n\nconst result = await firecrawl.extract({\n  urls: [listingUrl],\n  prompt: ''Extract property details for video generation'',\n  schema: PropertySchema\n});\n```\n\n## Supported Sites\n\n| Site | URL Pattern | Data Quality |\n|------|-------------|--------------|\n| Zillow | zillow.com/homedetails/* | Excellent |\n| Redfin | redfin.com/*/home/* | Excellent |\n| Realtor.com | realtor.com/realestateandhomes-detail/* | Excellent |\n| Trulia | trulia.com/home/* | Good |\n| Homes.com | homes.com/property/* | Good |\n| MLS Sites | Varies by region | Good |\n| Broker Sites | Any | Variable |\n\n## Property Schema\n\nSee [rules/property-extraction.md](rules/property-extraction.md) for complete schema.\n\n```typescript\nconst PropertySchema = z.object({\n  address: z.string(),\n  city: z.string(),\n  state: z.string(),\n  zipCode: z.string(),\n  price: z.number(),\n  bedrooms: z.number(),\n  bathrooms: z.number(),\n  sqft: z.number(),\n  lotSize: z.string().optional(),\n  yearBuilt: z.number().optional(),\n  propertyType: z.string(),\n  description: z.string(),\n  features: z.array(z.string()),\n  images: z.array(z.string()),\n  agent: z.object({\n    name: z.string(),\n    phone: z.string().optional(),\n    brokerage: z.string().optional(),\n  }).optional(),\n});\n```\n\n## Advanced Extraction\n\n### Competitor Analysis\n```typescript\nconst CompetitorSchema = z.object({\n  listings: z.array(z.object({\n    address: z.string(),\n    price: z.number(),\n    daysOnMarket: z.number(),\n    pricePerSqft: z.number(),\n  })),\n  marketTrends: z.object({\n    medianPrice: z.number(),\n    averageDaysOnMarket: z.number(),\n    inventoryCount: z.number(),\n  }),\n});\n```\n\n### Market Data\nSee [rules/market-data.md](rules/market-data.md)\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Rate Limiting**: Max 10 requests/minute on standard plan\n2. **Error Handling**: Always wrap in try/catch\n3. **Image Quality**: Request high-res images when available\n4. **Caching**: Cache results for 24 hours to save credits\n5. **Validation**: Always validate extracted data with Zod\n\n## API Integration\n\n### Next.js Route Handler\n```typescript\n// /app/api/scrape/route.ts\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  const { url } = await request.json();\n\n  const firecrawl = new Firecrawl({\n    apiKey: process.env.FIRECRAWL_API_KEY!\n  });\n\n  const result = await firecrawl.extract({\n    urls: [url],\n    prompt: ''Extract property listing data'',\n    schema: PropertySchema,\n  });\n\n  return Response.json({\n    success: true,\n    data: result.data\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## Credit Usage\n\n| Operation | Credits |\n|-----------|---------|\n| /scrape (single page) | 1 |\n| /crawl (per page) | 1 |\n| /extract (AI) | Tokens-based |\n| /map (URL discovery) | 1 per 100 URLs |\n\n## Error Handling\n\n```typescript\ntry {\n  const result = await firecrawl.extract({ ... });\n} catch (error) {\n  if (error.statusCode === 429) {\n    // Rate limited - wait and retry\n  } else if (error.statusCode === 403) {\n    // Site blocked - try alternative approach\n  } else {\n    // Log and return fallback\n  }\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:25:15.011Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Real Estate Agents needing automated video production and property data extraction from listing URLs.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化视频制作和从列表 URL 中提取房产数据的房地产经纪人。","ja":"オートメーションされた動画制作とリスト URL から物件データを抽出する必要がある不動産エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화된 비디오 제작 및 목록 URL에서 부동산 데이터를 추출하는 데 필요한 부동산 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes inmobiliarios que necesitan producción de video automatizada y extracción de datos de propiedades desde URLs de listados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents immobiliers ayant besoin d''une production de vidéos automatisée et d''une extraction de données de propriétés à partir d''URL de listes.","de":"Perfekt für Immobilienmakler, die eine automatisierte Videoproduktion und eine Datenextraktion von Eigenschaften aus Listing-URLs benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para corretores de imóveis que precisam de produção de vídeo automatizada e extração de dados de propriedades a partir de URLs de listagens.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по недвижимости, которым требуется автоматизированная производство видео и извлечение данных о свойствах из URL-адресов списков.","ar":"مثالي لوسيطي العقارات الذين يحتاجون إلى إنتاج فيديو آلي واستخراج بيانات العقارات من عناوين URL للقوائم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract structured JSON data from real estate listings using JavaScript rendering and anti-bot measures, while also handling image extraction automatically with libraries like Gemini 3 Pro and Veo 3.1.","zh":"赋予代理商使用 JavaScript 渲染和反爬措施从不动产列表中提取结构化的 JSON 数据的能力，同时还可以使用 Gemini 3 Pro 和 Veo 3.1 等库自动处理图像提取。","ja":"JavaScript のレンダリングとアンチボット対策を使用して不動産リストから構造化された JSON データを抽出する機能をエージェントに与え、Gemini 3 Pro や Veo 3.1 などのライブラリを使用して画像の抽出を自動で処理する。","ko":"자바스크립트 렌더링 및反봇 조치를 사용하여 부동산 목록에서 구조화된 JSON 데이터를 추출할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여하고 Gemini 3 Pro 및 Veo 3.1과 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 이미지 추출을 자동으로 처리합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes extraer datos JSON estructurados de listados inmobiliarios mediante renderizado de JavaScript y medidas anti-bot, además de manejar la extracción de imágenes de forma automática con bibliotecas como Gemini 3 Pro y Veo 3.1.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire des données JSON structurées à partir de listes immobilières en utilisant le rendu JavaScript et des mesures anti-robot, tout en gérant automatiquement l''extraction d''images avec des bibliothèques comme Gemini 3 Pro et Veo 3.1.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, strukturierte JSON-Daten aus Immobilienlisten mithilfe von JavaScript-Rendering und Anti-Bot-Maßnahmen zu extrahieren, und automatisiert gleichzeitig die Bildextraktion mit Bibliotheken wie Gemini 3 Pro und Veo 3.1.","pt":"Permite que os agentes extraiam dados JSON estruturados de listagens de imóveis usando renderização JavaScript e medidas anti-robô, além de lidar com a extração de imagens automaticamente com bibliotecas como Gemini 3 Pro e Veo 3.1.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать структурированные данные JSON из списков недвижимости, используя рендеринг JavaScript и анти-бот меры, а также автоматически обрабатывать извлечение изображений с помощью библиотек, таких как Gemini 3 Pro и Veo 3.1.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية استخراج بيانات JSON المنظمة من قوائم العقارات باستخدام عرض JavaScript وخطوات مكافحة البوتات ، بالإضافة إلى التعامل مع استخراج الصور تلقائيًا باستخدام مكتبات مثل Gemini 3 Pro و Veo 3.1."},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting property details from listing URLs","Automating video production for luxury real estate agents","Generating structured JSON data for further analysis"],"zh":["从列表 URL 中提取房产详细信息","为豪华房地产经纪人自动化视频制作","生成结构化 JSON 数据以进行进一步分析"],"ja":["リスト URL から物件の詳細を抽出","豪華不動産エージェントの動画制作を自動化","構造化された JSON データを生成してさらに分析"],"ko":["목록 URL에서 부동산 세부 정보 추출","豪华 부동산 에이전트를 위한 비디오 제작 자동화","추가 분석을 위한 구조화된 JSON 데이터 생성"],"es":["Extraer detalles de propiedades desde URLs de listados","Automatizar la producción de video para agentes inmobiliarios de lujo","Generar datos JSON estructurados para un análisis posterior"],"fr":["Extraire des détails de propriétés à partir d''URL de listes","Automatiser la production de vidéos pour les agents immobiliers de luxe","Générer des données JSON structurées pour une analyse ultérieure"],"de":["Eigenschaftsdetails aus Listing-URLs extrahieren","Videoproduktion für Luxus-Immobiliensmakler automatisieren","Strukturierte JSON-Daten für eine weitere Analyse generieren"],"pt":["Extração de detalhes de propriedades a partir de URLs de listagens","Automação da produção de vídeo para corretores de imóveis de luxo","Geração de dados JSON estruturados para análise posterior"],"ru":["Извлечение деталей объектов недвижимости из URL-адресов списков","Автоматизация производства видео для агентов по недвижимости роскоши","Генерация структурированных данных JSON для дальнейшего анализа"],"ar":["استخراج تفاصيل العقارات من عناوين URL للقوائم","التنفيذ الآلي لإنتاج الفيديو لوسيطي العقارات الفاخرة","توليد بيانات JSON المنظمة للتحليل اللاحق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Firecrawl API Key","Limited to real estate listing URLs"],"zh":["需要 Firecrawl API 密钥","仅限于房地产列表 URL"],"ja":["Firecrawl API キーが必要","不動産リスト URL にのみ対応"],"ko":["Firecrawl API 키가 필요합니다.","부동산 목록 URL로만 제한"],"es":["Requiere una clave de API de Firecrawl","Limitado a URLs de listados inmobiliarios"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé d''API Firecrawl","Limité aux URL de listes immobilières"],"de":["Benötigt einen Firecrawl-API-Schlüssel","Begrenzt auf Immobilien-Listing-URLs"],"pt":["Exige Chave de API do Firecrawl","Limitado a URLs de listagens de imóveis"],"ru":["Требуется ключ API Firecrawl","Ограничен до URL-адресов списков недвижимости"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح API Firecrawl","محدود إلى عناوين URL للقوائم العقارية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
