ry Manager GitHub","ja":"State Directory Manager GitHub","ko":"State Directory Manager GitHub","es":"El gestor de directorios de estado es un sistema de gestión centralizado para directorios de estado, configuración y caché en scripts bash","fr":"Le gestionnaire de répertoires d''état est un système de gestion centralisé pour les répertoires d''état, de configuration et de cache dans les scripts bash","de":"Der Statusverzeichnis-Manager ist ein zentrales Verwaltungssystem für Status-, Konfigurations- und Cache-Verzeichnisse in Bash-Skripten","pt":"O State Directory Manager é um sistema de gerenciamento centralizado para múltiplos repositórios GitHub com organização modular","ru":"Менеджер директории состояния - это централизованная система управления для нескольких репозиториев GitHub с модульной организацией","ar":"مدير دليل الحالة هو نظام إدارة مركزي لمختلف مستودعات GitHub مع تنظيم متوحد","en":"A centralized management system for multiple GitHub repositories with modular organization"},"definition":{"en":"A centralized management system for multiple GitHub repositories with modular organization"},"features":{"zh":["GitHub","XDG","bash","CLI","50"],"ja":["GitHub","XDG","bash","CLI","50"],"ko":["GitHub","XDG","bash","CLI","50"],"es":["Gestión centralizada de directorios de estado","Organización modular de directorios","Compatibilidad con la especificación XDG Base Directory","Almacenamiento de preferencias de usuario y configuración","Caché de resultados para mejorar el rendimiento","Gestión de archivos de registro con rotación"],"fr":["Gestion centralisée des répertoires d''état","Organisation modulaire des répertoires","Compatibilité avec la spécification XDG Base Directory","Stockage des préférences utilisateur et de la configuration","Cache des résultats pour améliorer les performances","Gestion des fichiers de journal avec rotation"],"de":["Zentrales Verwaltungssystem für Statusverzeichnisse","Modulare Organisation von Verzeichnissen","Kompatibilität mit der XDG Base Directory-Spezifikation","Speicherung von Benutzereinstellungen und Konfiguration","Cachspeicherung von Ergebnissen zur Leistungsverbesserung","Verwaltung von Log-Dateien mit Rotation"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de estado e configuração","Organização modular de diretórios","Suporte a caching e log","Compatibilidade com XDG Base Directory specification","Desenvolvimento de ferramentas CLI portáteis"],"ru":["Управление состоянием и конфигурацией","Модульная организация директорий","Поддержка кеширования и логирования","Совместимость с XDG Base Directory specification","Разработка портативных инструментов CLI"],"ar":["إدارة الحالة والتهيئة","تنظيم متوحد للدلائل","دعم الذاكرة المؤقتة والتسجيل","التوافق مع مواصفات دليل XDG الأساسي","تطوير أدوات CLI محمولة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub","State Directory Manager","XDG","bash","CLI","50","GitHub","devops","script"],"ja":["GitHub","State Directory Manager","XDG","bash","CLI","50","GitHub","devops","script"],"ko":["GitHub","State Directory Manager","XDG","bash","CLI","50","GitHub","devops","script"],"es":["gestor de directorios de estado","scripts bash","XDG Base Directory","almacenamiento de estado","caché de resultados","gestión de configuración","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","scripting"],"fr":["gestionnaire de répertoires d''état","scripts bash","XDG Base Directory","stockage d''état","cache de résultats","gestion de configuration","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","scripting"],"de":["Statusverzeichnis-Manager","Bash-Skripte","XDG Base Directory","Statusspeicherung","Cachspeicherung von Ergebnissen","Konfigurationsverwaltung","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Scripting"],"pt":["gerenciamento de estado","configuração de scripts","caching em bash","XDG Base Directory","desenvolvimento de ferramentas CLI","GitHub repositories","modular organization"],"ru":["управление состоянием","конфигурация скриптов","кеширование в bash","XDG Base Directory","разработка инструментов CLI","репозитории GitHub","модульная организация"],"ar":["إدارة الحالة","تهيئة البرامج النصية","الذاكرة المؤقتة في bash","دليل XDG الأساسي","تطوير أدوات CLI","مستودعات GitHub","تنظيم متوحد"]}},"owner":"vamseeachanta","repo":"workspace-hub","repoPath":"vamseeachanta/workspace-hub","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"state-directory-manager","description":"Manage persistent state directories for bash scripts","version":"1.0.0","tags":["bash","state","persistence","config","directory","xdg"],"bodyPreview":"# State Directory Manager\n\nPatterns for managing persistent state, configuration, and cache directories in bash scripts following XDG Base Directory specification.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n✅ **Use when:**\n- Scripts need to persist data between runs\n- Storing user preferences or configuration\n- Caching results for performance\n- Managing log files with rotation\n- Creating portable CLI tools\n\n❌ **Avoid when:**\n- One-time scripts that don''t need state\n- Scripts that should be purely stateless\n- W","body":"# State Directory Manager\n\nPatterns for managing persistent state, configuration, and cache directories in bash scripts following XDG Base Directory specification.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n✅ **Use when:**\n- Scripts need to persist data between runs\n- Storing user preferences or configuration\n- Caching results for performance\n- Managing log files with rotation\n- Creating portable CLI tools\n\n❌ **Avoid when:**\n- One-time scripts that don''t need state\n- Scripts that should be purely stateless\n- When environment variables are sufficient\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. XDG Base Directory Standard\n\nFollow the XDG specification for directory locations:\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# ABOUTME: XDG Base Directory compliant state management\n# ABOUTME: Cross-platform directory locations\n\n# XDG Base Directories with fallbacks\nXDG_CONFIG_HOME=\"${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}\"\nXDG_DATA_HOME=\"${XDG_DATA_HOME:-$HOME/.local/share}\"\nXDG_STATE_HOME=\"${XDG_STATE_HOME:-$HOME/.local/state}\"\nXDG_CACHE_HOME=\"${XDG_CACHE_HOME:-$HOME/.cache}\"\n\n# Application-specific directories\nAPP_NAME=\"my-tool\"\nCONFIG_DIR=\"$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/$APP_NAME\"\nDATA_DIR=\"$XDG_DATA_HOME/$APP_NAME\"\nSTATE_DIR=\"$XDG_STATE_HOME/$APP_NAME\"\nCACHE_DIR=\"$XDG_CACHE_HOME/$APP_NAME\"\nLOG_DIR=\"$STATE_DIR/logs\"\n\n# Initialize directories\ninit_directories() {\n    mkdir -p \"$CONFIG_DIR\"\n    mkdir -p \"$DATA_DIR\"\n    mkdir -p \"$STATE_DIR\"\n    mkdir -p \"$CACHE_DIR\"\n    mkdir -p \"$LOG_DIR\"\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Workspace-Hub Pattern\n\nAlternative using home directory (from workspace-hub scripts):\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# ABOUTME: Workspace-hub style state directory management\n# ABOUTME: Simple $HOME/.app-name pattern\n\nAPP_NAME=\"workspace-hub\"\nAPP_DIR=\"${HOME}/.${APP_NAME}\"\n\n# Directory structure\nCONFIG_DIR=\"$APP_DIR/config\"\nDATA_DIR=\"$APP_DIR/data\"\nLOGS_DIR=\"$APP_DIR/logs\"\nCACHE_DIR=\"$APP_DIR/cache\"\nTEMP_DIR=\"$APP_DIR/tmp\"\n\n# Initialize with proper permissions\ninit_app_dirs() {\n    local dirs=(\"$CONFIG_DIR\" \"$DATA_DIR\" \"$LOGS_DIR\" \"$CACHE_DIR\" \"$TEMP_DIR\")\n\n    for dir in \"${dirs[@]}\"; do\n        if [[ ! -d \"$dir\" ]]; then\n            mkdir -p \"$dir\"\n            chmod 700 \"$dir\"  # Private by default\n        fi\n    done\n}\n\n# Clean old temp files\nclean_temp() {\n    find \"$TEMP_DIR\" -type f -mtime +1 -delete 2>/dev/null || true\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Configuration File Management\n\nRead and write configuration files:\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# ABOUTME: Configuration file management\n# ABOUTME: Key-value pairs with defaults\n\nCONFIG_FILE=\"$CONFIG_DIR/config\"\n\n# Default configuration\ndeclare -A DEFAULT_CONFIG=(\n    [\"parallel_workers\"]=\"5\"\n    [\"log_level\"]=\"INFO\"\n    [\"auto_sync\"]=\"true\"\n    [\"timeout\"]=\"30\"\n)\n\n# Initialize config with defaults\ninit_config() {\n    if [[ ! -f \"$CONFIG_FILE\" ]]; then\n        {\n            echo \"# Configuration for $APP_NAME\"\n            echo \"# Generated: $(date)\"\n            echo \"\"\n            for key in \"${!DEFAULT_CONFIG[@]}\"; do\n                echo \"${key}=${DEFAULT_CONFIG[$key]}\"\n            done\n        } > \"$CONFIG_FILE\"\n    fi\n}\n\n# Read config value\nget_config() {\n    local key=\"$1\"\n    local default=\"${2:-${DEFAULT_CONFIG[$key]:-}}\"\n\n    if [[ -f \"$CONFIG_FILE\" ]]; then\n        local value\n        value=$(grep \"^${key}=\" \"$CONFIG_FILE\" 2>/dev/null | cut -d''='' -f2-)\n        echo \"${value:-$default}\"\n    else\n        echo \"$default\"\n    fi\n}\n\n# Write config value\nset_config() {\n    local key=\"$1\"\n    local value=\"$2\"\n\n    init_config\n\n    if grep -q \"^${key}=\" \"$CONFIG_FILE\" 2>/dev/null; then\n        # Update existing\n        sed -i \"s|^${key}=.*|${key}=${value}|\" \"$CONFIG_FILE\"\n    else\n        # Add new\n        echo \"${key}=${value}\" >> \"$CONFIG_FILE\"\n    fi\n}\n\n# Load all config into associative array\nload_config() {\n    declare -gA CONFIG\n\n    # Start with defaults\n    for key in \"${!DEFAULT_CONFIG[@]}\"; do\n        CONFIG[$key]=\"${DEFAULT_CONFIG[$key]}\"\n    done\n\n    # Override with file values\n    if [[ -f \"$CONFIG_FILE\" ]]; then\n        while IFS=''='' read -r key value; do\n            [[ \"$key\" =~ ^#.*$ || -z \"$key\" ]] && continue\n            CONFIG[$key]=\"$value\"\n        done < \"$CONFIG_FILE\"\n    fi\n}\n\n# Usage\ninit_config\nload_config\necho \"Parallel workers: ${CONFIG[parallel_workers]}\"\nset_config \"parallel_workers\" \"10\"\n```\n\n### 4. State File Operations\n\nTrack persistent state between runs:\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# ABOUTME: State file operations\n# ABOUTME: Track last run, progress, etc.\n\nSTATE_FILE=\"$STATE_DIR/state.json\"\n\n# Initialize state\ninit_state() {\n    if [[ ! -f \"$STATE_FILE\" ]]; then\n        cat > \"$STATE_FILE\" << EOF\n{\n    \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n    \"created\": \"$(date -Iseconds)\",\n    \"last_run\": null,\n    \"run_count\": 0,\n    \"last_status\": null\n}\nEOF\n    fi\n}\n\n# Get state value (requires jq)\nget_state() {\n    local key=\"$1\"\n    local default=\"${2:-null}\"\n\n    if [[ -f \"$STATE_FILE\" ]] && command -v jq &>/dev/null; then\n        jq -r \".$key // $default\" \"$STATE_FILE\"\n    else\n        echo \"$default\"\n    fi\n}\n\n# Update state value (requires jq)\nset_state() {\n    local key=\"$1\"\n    local value=\"$2\"\n\n    init_state\n\n    if command -v jq &>/dev/null; then\n        local temp=$(mktemp)\n        jq \".$key = $value\" \"$STATE_FILE\" > \"$temp\" && mv \"$temp\" \"$STATE_FILE\"\n    fi\n}\n\n# Record run\nrecord_run() {\n    local status=\"$1\"\n\n    set_state \"last_run\" \"\\\"$(date -Iseconds)\\\"\"\n    set_state \"last_status\" \"\\\"$status\\\"\"\n    set_state \"run_count\" \"$(($(get_state run_count 0) + 1))\"\n}\n\n# Simple key-value state (no jq required)\nSTATE_KV_FILE=\"$STATE_DIR/state.kv\"\n\nget_state_kv() {\n    local key=\"$1\"\n    local default=\"$2\"\n\n    if [[ -f \"$STATE_KV_FILE\" ]]; then\n        grep \"^${key}=\" \"$STATE_KV_FILE\" 2>/dev/null | cut -d''='' -f2- || echo \"$default\"\n    else\n        echo \"$default\"\n    fi\n}\n\nset_state_kv() {\n    local key=\"$1\"\n    local value=\"$2\"\n\n    mkdir -p \"$(dirname \"$STATE_KV_FILE\")\"\n\n    if [[ -f \"$STATE_KV_FILE\" ]] && grep -q \"^${key}=\" \"$STATE_KV_FILE\"; then\n        sed -i \"s|^${key}=.*|${key}=${value}|\" \"$STATE_KV_FILE\"\n    else\n        echo \"${key}=${value}\" >> \"$STATE_KV_FILE\"\n    fi\n}\n```\n\n### 5. Cache Management\n\nImplement caching with expiration:\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# ABOUTME: Cache management with TTL\n# ABOUTME: Store and retrieve cached data\n\nCACHE_TTL=\"${CACHE_TTL:-3600}\"  # 1 hour default\n\n# Get cache file path\ncache_path() {\n    local key=\"$1\"\n    local hash=$(echo -n \"$key\" | md5sum | cut -c1-16)\n    echo \"$CACHE_DIR/${hash}\"\n}\n\n# Check if cache is valid\ncache_valid() {\n    local key=\"$1\"\n    local ttl=\"${2:-$CACHE_TTL}\"\n    local path=$(cache_path \"$key\")\n\n    if [[ -f \"$path\" ]]; then\n        local age=$(($(date +%s) - $(stat -c %Y \"$path\" 2>/dev/null || stat -f %m \"$path\")))\n        [[ $age -lt $ttl ]]\n    else\n        return 1\n    fi\n}\n\n# Get from cache\ncache_get() {\n    local key=\"$1\"\n    local ttl=\"${2:-$CACHE_TTL}\"\n    local path=$(cache_path \"$key\")\n\n    if cache_valid \"$key\" \"$ttl\"; then\n        cat \"$path\"\n        return 0\n    fi\n    return 1\n}\n\n# Set cache\ncache_set() {\n    local key=\"$1\"\n    local value=\"$2\"\n    local path=$(cache_path \"$key\")\n\n    mkdir -p \"$CACHE_DIR\"\n    echo \"$value\" > \"$path\"\n}\n\n# Delete cache\ncache_delete() {\n    local key=\"$1\"\n    local path=$(cache_path \"$key\")\n    rm -f \"$path\"\n}\n\n# Clear all cache\ncache_clear() {\n    rm -rf \"$CACHE_DIR\"/*\n}\n\n# Clean expired cache entries\ncache_clean() {\n    local ttl=\"${1:-$CACHE_TTL}\"\n    find \"$CACHE_DIR\" -type f -mmin \"+$((ttl / 60))\" -delete 2>/dev/null || true\n}\n\n# Usage with automatic caching\nget_with_cache() {\n    local key=\"$1\"\n    local command=\"$2\"\n    local ttl=\"${3:-$CACHE_TTL}\"\n\n    if cache_valid \"$key\" \"$ttl\"; then\n        cache_get \"$key\"\n    else\n        local result\n        result=$(eval \"$command\")\n        cache_set \"$key\" \"$result\"\n        echo \"$result\"\n    fi\n}\n\n# Example\nresult=$(get_with_cache \"api_response\" \"curl -s https://api.example.com/data\" 300)\n```\n\n### 6. Log File Management\n\nManage logs with rotation:\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# ABOUTME: Log file management with rotation\n# ABOUTME: Automatic cleanup of old logs\n\nLOG_FILE=\"$LOG_DIR/app.log\"\nLOG_MAX_SIZE=$((10 * 1024 * 1024))  # 10MB\nLOG_MAX_FILES=5\n\n# Initialize logging\ninit_logging() {\n    mkdir -p \"$LOG_DIR\"\n    touch \"$LOG_FILE\"\n}\n\n# Write to log\nlog_to_file() {\n    local level=\"$1\"\n    shift\n    local message=\"$*\"\n    local timestamp=$(date ''+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S'')\n\n    echo \"[$timestamp] $level: $message\" >> \"$LOG_FILE\"\n\n    # Check if rotation needed\n    maybe_rotate_logs\n}\n\n# Rotate logs if needed\nmaybe_rotate_logs() {\n    if [[ -f \"$LOG_FILE\" ]]; then\n        local size=$(stat -c %s \"$LOG_FILE\" 2>/dev/null || stat -f %z \"$LOG_FILE\")\n\n        if [[ $size -gt $LOG_MAX_SIZE ]]; then\n            rotate_logs\n        fi\n    fi\n}\n\n# Perform log rotation\nrotate_logs() {\n    # Remove oldest\n    rm -f \"${LOG_FILE}.${LOG_MAX_FILES}\"\n\n    # Shift existing\n    for ((i=LOG_MAX_FILES-1; i>=1; i--)); do\n        if [[ -f \"${LOG_FILE}.$i\" ]]; then\n            mv \"${LOG_FILE}.$i\" \"${LOG_FILE}.$((i+1))\"\n        fi\n    done\n\n    # Rotate current\n    if [[ -f \"$LOG_FILE\" ]]; then\n        mv \"$LOG_FILE\" \"${LOG_FILE}.1\"\n        touch \"$LOG_FILE\"\n    fi\n}\n\n# Clean old logs\nclean_old_logs() {\n    local days=\"${1:-30}\"\n    find \"$LOG_DIR\" -name \"*.log*\" -mtime \"+$days\" -delete 2>/dev/null || true\n}\n\n# View recent logs\ntail_logs() {\n    local lines=\"${1:-50}\"\n    tail -n \"$lines\" \"$LOG_FILE\"\n}\n\n# Search logs\nsearch_logs() {\n    local pattern=\"$1\"\n    grep -h \"$pattern\" \"$LOG_DIR\"/*.log* 2>/dev/null | tail -100\n}\n```\n\n## Complete Example: State Manager Module\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# ABOUTME: Complete state directory manager\n# ABOUTME: Reusable module for bash scripts\n\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# State Directory Manager v1.0.0\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n# Application identity (override in your script)\n: \"${STATE_APP_NAME:=my-app}\"\n\n# Directory setup\nSTATE_BASE_DIR=\"${HOME}/.${STATE_APP_NAME}\"\nSTATE_CONFIG_DIR=\"$STATE_BASE_DIR/config\"\nSTATE_DATA_DIR=\"$STATE_BASE_DIR/data\"\nSTATE_CACHE_DIR=\"$STATE_BASE_DIR/cache\"\nSTATE_LOG_DIR=\"$STATE_BASE_DIR/logs\"\nSTATE_TMP_DIR=\"$STATE_BASE_DIR/tmp\"\n\n# File paths\nSTATE_CONFIG_FILE=\"$STATE_CONFIG_DIR/config\"\nSTATE_STATE_FILE=\"$STATE_DATA_DIR/state\"\nSTATE_LOG_FILE=\"$STATE_LOG_DIR/app.log\"\n\n# Settings\nSTATE_CACHE_TTL=\"${STATE_CACHE_TTL:-3600}\"\nSTATE_LOG_MAX_SIZE=\"${STATE_LOG_MAX_SIZE:-10485760}\"\nSTATE_LOG_MAX_FILES=\"${STATE_LOG_MAX_FILES:-5}\"\n\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# Initialization\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nstate_init() {\n    local dirs=(\n        \"$STATE_CONFIG_DIR\"\n        \"$STATE_DATA_DIR\"\n        \"$STATE_CACHE_DIR\"\n        \"$STATE_LOG_DIR\"\n        \"$STATE_TMP_DIR\"\n    )\n\n    for dir in \"${dirs[@]}\"; do\n        if [[ ! -d \"$dir\" ]]; then\n            mkdir -p \"$dir\"\n            chmod 700 \"$dir\"\n        fi\n    done\n\n    # Initialize files\n    [[ -f \"$STATE_CONFIG_FILE\" ]] || touch \"$STATE_CONFIG_FILE\"\n    [[ -f \"$STATE_STATE_FILE\" ]] || touch \"$STATE_STATE_FILE\"\n    [[ -f \"$STATE_LOG_FILE\" ]] || touch \"$STATE_LOG_FILE\"\n}\n\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# Config Functions\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nstate_config_get() {\n    local key=\"$1\"\n    local default=\"$2\"\n    grep \"^${key}=\" \"$STATE_CONFIG_FILE\" 2>/dev/null | cut -d''='' -f2- || echo \"$default\"\n}\n\nstate_config_set() {\n    local key=\"$1\"\n    local value=\"$2\"\n\n    if grep -q \"^${key}=\" \"$STATE_CONFIG_FILE\" 2>/dev/null; then\n        sed -i \"s|^${key}=.*|${key}=${value}|\" \"$STATE_CONFIG_FILE\"\n    else\n        echo \"${key}=${value}\" >> \"$STATE_CONFIG_FILE\"\n    fi\n}\n\nstate_config_list() {\n    cat \"$STATE_CONFIG_FILE\" 2>/dev/null | grep -v ''^#'' | grep -v ''^$''\n}\n\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# State Functions\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nstate_get() {\n    local key=\"$1\"\n    local default=\"$2\"\n    grep \"^${key}=\" \"$STATE_STATE_FILE\" 2>/dev/null | cut -d''='' -f2- || echo \"$default\"\n}\n\nstate_set() {\n    local key=\"$1\"\n    local value=\"$2\"\n\n    if grep -q \"^${key}=\" \"$STATE_STATE_FILE\" 2>/dev/null; then\n        sed -i \"s|^${key}=.*|${key}=${value}|\" \"$STATE_STATE_FILE\"\n    else\n        echo \"${key}=${value}\" >> \"$STATE_STATE_FILE\"\n    fi\n}\n\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# Cache Functions\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nstate_cache_key() {\n    echo -n \"$1\" | md5sum | cut -c1-16\n}\n\nstate_cache_get() {\n    local key=\"$1\"\n    local ttl=\"${2:-$STATE_CACHE_TTL}\"\n    local path=\"$STATE_CACHE_DIR/$(state_cache_key \"$key\")\"\n\n    if [[ -f \"$path\" ]]; then\n        local age=$(($(date +%s) - $(stat -c %Y \"$path\" 2>/dev/null || stat -f %m \"$path\")))\n        if [[ $age -lt $ttl ]]; then\n            cat \"$path\"\n            return 0\n        fi\n    fi\n    return 1\n}\n\nstate_cache_set() {\n    local key=\"$1\"\n    local value=\"$2\"\n    local path=\"$STATE_CACHE_DIR/$(state_cache_key \"$key\")\"\n    echo \"$value\" > \"$path\"\n}\n\nstate_cache_clear() {\n    rm -rf \"$STATE_CACHE_DIR\"/*\n}\n\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# Log Functions\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nstate_log() {\n    local level=\"$1\"\n    shift\n    local message=\"$*\"\n    echo \"[$(date ''+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S'')] $level: $message\" >> \"$STATE_LOG_FILE\"\n\n    # Auto-rotate\n    local size=$(stat -c %s \"$STATE_LOG_FILE\" 2>/dev/null || echo 0)\n    if [[ $size -gt $STATE_LOG_MAX_SIZE ]]; then\n        state_log_rotate\n    fi\n}\n\nstate_log_rotate() {\n    rm -f \"${STATE_LOG_FILE}.${STATE_LOG_MAX_FILES}\"\n    for ((i=STATE_LOG_MAX_FILES-1; i>=1; i--)); do\n        [[ -f \"${STATE_LOG_FILE}.$i\" ]] && mv \"${STATE_LOG_FILE}.$i\" \"${STATE_LOG_FILE}.$((i+1))\"\n    done\n    mv \"$STATE_LOG_FILE\" \"${STATE_LOG_FILE}.1\"\n    touch \"$STATE_LOG_FILE\"\n}\n\nstate_log_tail() {\n    tail -n \"${1:-50}\" \"$STATE_LOG_FILE\"\n}\n\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# Cleanup Functions\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nstate_cleanup() {\n    # Clean temp files older than 1 day\n    find \"$STATE_TMP_DIR\" -type f -mtime +1 -delete 2>/dev/null || true\n\n    # Clean expired cache\n    find \"$STATE_CACHE_DIR\" -type f -mmin \"+$((STATE_CACHE_TTL / 60))\" -delete 2>/dev/null || true\n\n    # Clean old logs\n    find \"$STATE_LOG_DIR\" -name \"*.log.*\" -mtime +30 -delete 2>/dev/null || true\n}\n\nstate_reset() {\n    rm -rf \"$STATE_BASE_DIR\"\n    state_init\n}\n\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# Auto-initialize\n# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\nstate_init\n```\n\n## Usage in Scripts\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\n# Your script that uses the state manager\n\n# Set app name before sourcing\nSTATE_APP_NAME=\"my-tool\"\n\n# Source the state manager\nsource /path/to/state-manager.sh\n\n# Now use it\nstate_config_set \"api_key\" \"abc123\"\napi_key=$(state_config_get \"api_key\")\n\nstate_set \"last_run\" \"$(date -Iseconds)\"\nstate_log \"INFO\" \"Script started\"\n\n# Use cache\nif ! result=$(state_cache_get \"api_response\"); then\n    result=$(curl -s https://api.example.com/data)\n    state_cache_set \"api_response\" \"$result\"\nfi\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use Standard Locations** - Follow XDG or `$HOME/.app-name`\n2. **Initialize Early** - Call init before any operations\n3. **Handle Permissions** - Use 700 for private data\n4. **Clean Up Regularly** - Remove old temp/cache files\n5. **Rotate Logs** - Prevent unbounded growth\n\n## Resources\n\n- [XDG Base Directory Spec](https://specifications.freedesktop.org/basedir-spec/basedir-spec-latest.html)\n- [File Hierarchy Standard](https://refspecs.linuxfoundation.org/FHS_3.0/fhs/index.html)\n\n---\n\n## Version History\n\n- **1.0.0** (2026-01-14): Initial release - extracted from workspace-hub patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:25:22.092Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for CLI Agents requiring modular organization and management of persistent state, configuration, and cache directories across multiple GitHub repositories.","zh":"适用于需要模块化组织和管理持久状态、配置和缓存目录的CLI代理，尤其是跨多个GitHub仓库时。","ja":"CLIエージェントがモジュラーな組織と管理を必要とする場合、特に複数のGitHubリポジトリを横断して永続的な状態、構成、およびキャッシュディレクトリを管理する場合に最適です。","ko":"CLI 에이전트가 모듈식으로 조직하고 관리해야 하는 경우, 특히 여러 GitHub 리포지토리를横断하여 지속적인 상태, 구성 및 캐시 디렉토리를 관리해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de CLI que requieren una organización y gestión modulares del estado persistente, la configuración y los directorios de caché en varios repositorios de GitHub.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents CLI nécessitant une organisation et une gestion modulaires de l''état persistant, de la configuration et des répertoires de cache à travers plusieurs référentiels GitHub.","de":"Ideal für CLI-Agents, die eine modulare Organisation und Verwaltung des persistenten Zustands, der Konfiguration und der Cache-Verzeichnisse über mehrere GitHub-Repositorys hinweg erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes CLI que exigem organização modular e gerenciamento de estado persistente, configuração e diretórios de cache em várias repositórios GitHub.","ru":"Идеально для агентов CLI, требующих модульной организации и управления постоянным состоянием, конфигурацией и директориями кэша в нескольких репозиториях GitHub.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة سطر الأوامر الذي يتطلب التنظيم المودولي وإدارة الحالة المستدامة والإعدادات ومجلدات الذاكرة المؤقتة عبر العديد من مستودعات جيت هاب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage persistent data between script runs, store user preferences, and cache results for performance using the XDG Base Directory specification and bash scripts, facilitating the creation of portable CLI tools with features like log file rotation.","zh":"赋予代理管理脚本运行之间的持久数据、存储用户首选项和缓存结果以提高性能的能力，使用XDG基础目录规范和bash脚本，促进可移植的CLI工具的创建，具有日志文件轮换等功能。","ja":"スクリプトの実行間で永続的なデータを管理し、ユーザーの предпочтенияを保存し、パフォーマンスを向上させるために結果をキャッシュするためのエージェントをEmpowerする。XDG Base Directory仕様とbashスクリプトを使用して、ログファイルのローテーションなどの機能を備えたポータブルなCLIツールの作成を促進する。","ko":"스크립트 실행 사이에서 지속적인 데이터를 관리하고 사용자 предпоч성을 저장하며 성능을 향상시키기 위해 결과를 캐시하는 에이전트를 강화합니다. XDG 기본 디렉토리 사양 및 bash 스크립트를 사용하여 로그 파일 회전과 같은 기능을 갖춘 이식 가능한 CLI 도구의 생성을 촉진합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar datos persistentes entre ejecuciones de scripts, almacenar preferencias de usuario y almacenar en caché resultados para mejorar el rendimiento utilizando la especificación de directorios base XDG y scripts de bash, lo que facilita la creación de herramientas de CLI portátiles con características como la rotación de archivos de registro.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des données persistantes entre les exécutions de scripts, de stocker les préférences des utilisateurs et de mettre en cache les résultats pour améliorer les performances en utilisant la spécification de répertoires de base XDG et les scripts bash, ce qui facilite la création d''outils CLI portables avec des fonctionnalités comme la rotation des fichiers journaux.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, persistente Daten zwischen Skriptausführungen zu verwalten, Benutzervorlieben zu speichern und Ergebnisse zur Leistungssteigerung mit der XDG-Base-Directory-Spezifikation und Bash-Skripten zu cachen, was die Erstellung portabler CLI-Tools mit Funktionen wie Log-Datei-Rotation erleichtert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar dados persistentes entre execuções de scripts, armazenar preferências de usuário e armazenar resultados em cache para desempenho usando a especificação XDG Base Directory e scripts bash, facilitando a criação de ferramentas CLI portáteis com recursos como rotação de arquivos de log.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять постоянными данными между запусками скриптов, хранить пользовательские предпочтения и кэшировать результаты для производительности с использованием спецификации XDG Base Directory и скриптов bash, облегчая создание портативных инструментов CLI с функциями, такими как ротация лог-файлов.","ar":"يمنح العميل قدرة إدارة البيانات المستدامة بين تشغيلات البرامج النصية، وتخزين تفضيلات المستخدم وتخزين النتائج في الذاكرة المؤقتة من أجل الأداء باستخدام مواصفات دليل قاعدة XDG والبرامج النصية bash، مما يسهل إنشاء أدوات واجهة سطر الأوامر المحمولة التي تحتوي على ميزات مثل دوران سجلات النظام."},"useCases":{"en":["Managing log files with rotation for enhanced debugging","Caching results for improved performance in data-intensive tasks","Storing user preferences and configuration for personalized CLI experiences"],"zh":["增强调试的日志文件管理和轮换","数据密集型任务中性能的改善，通过缓存结果","存储用户首选项和配置，以实现个性化的CLI体验"],"ja":["デバッグの強化のためのログファイル管理とローテーション","データ密集型タスクでのパフォーマンスの向上、結果のキャッシュを使用","ユーザーの предпочтенияと構成を保存して、パーソナライズされたCLIエクスペリエンスを実現"],"ko":["로깅 디버깅을 강화하기 위한 로그 파일 관리 및 회전","데이터 집약적 작업에서 캐시된 결과를 사용하여 성능을 향상","사용자 선호도 및 구성 저장을 통해 개인화된 CLI 경험을 구현"],"es":["Gestión de archivos de registro con rotación para una depuración mejorada","Almacenamiento en caché de resultados para una mejor rendimiento en tareas intensivas de datos","Almacenamiento de preferencias y configuración de usuario para experiencias de CLI personalizadas"],"fr":["Gestion des fichiers journaux avec rotation pour un débogage amélioré","Mise en cache des résultats pour une meilleure performance dans les tâches intensives de données","Stockage des préférences et de la configuration de l''utilisateur pour des expériences CLI personnalisées"],"de":["Verwaltung von Log-Dateien mit Rotation für eine verbesserte Fehlersuche","Cachen von Ergebnissen für eine bessere Leistung bei datenintensiven Aufgaben","Speichern von Benutzervorlieben und -konfiguration für personalisierte CLI-Erfahrungen"],"pt":["Gerenciar arquivos de log com rotação para depuração aprimorada","Armazenar resultados em cache para melhorar o desempenho em tarefas intensivas de dados","Armazenar preferências e configuração de usuário para experiências CLI personalizadas"],"ru":["Управление лог-файлами с ротацией для улучшенной отладки","Кэширование результатов для повышения производительности в задачах, интенсивно использующих данные","Хранение пользовательских предпочтений и конфигурации для персонализированных опытов CLI"],"ar":["إدارة سجلات النظام مع الدوران لتحسين التصحيح","تخزين النتائج في الذاكرة المؤقتة لتحسين الأداء في مهام كثيفة البيانات","تخزين تفضيلات المستخدم والإعدادات لتجارب واجهة سطر الأوامر المخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires bash scripting capabilities","Intended for scripts that need to persist data between runs","Not suitable for one-time scripts or purely stateless applications"],"zh":["需要bash脚本能力","针对需要在运行间保持数据的脚本","不适用于一次性脚本或纯粹的无状态应用"],"ja":["bashスクリプティングの機能が必要","データを実行間で保持する必要があるスクリプトのために意図","一度限りのスクリプトまたは純粋なステートレスアプリケーションには適していない"],"ko":["bash 스크립팅 기능이 필요","실행 사이에서 데이터를 유지해야 하는 스크립트를 위한 것으로 의도","한 번만 실행되는 스크립트 또는 순수한 무상태 애플리케이션에는 적합하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de scripting de bash","Diseñado para scripts que necesitan persistir datos entre ejecuciones","No es adecuado para scripts de un solo uso o aplicaciones puramente sin estado"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités de scripting bash","Conçu pour les scripts qui ont besoin de persister des données entre les exécutions","N''est pas adapté pour les scripts à usage unique ou les applications purement sans état"],"de":["Benötigt Bash-Scripting-Fähigkeiten","Für Skripte gedacht, die Daten zwischen Ausführungen persistieren müssen","Nicht geeignet für Skripte mit einmaligem Gebrauch oder rein staatlosen Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige capacidades de script bash","Destina-se a scripts que precisam manter dados entre execuções","Não é adequado para scripts de uso único ou aplicações puramente sem estado"],"ru":["Требует возможностей скриптов bash","Предназначен для скриптов, которым необходимо сохранять данные между запусками","Не подходит для одноразовых скриптов или чисто бесстатных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب قدرات البرامج النصية bash","مصمم للبرامج النصية التي تحتاج إلى الحفاظ على البيانات بين التشغيلات","لا يصلح لبرامج نصية لاستخدام مرة واحدة أو تطبيقات خالية من الحالة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":85}');
