ests et structure de projet appropriée"],"de":["Produktionsreife Projektstrukturen","Asynchrone Muster für Hochleistungs-APIs","Abhängigkeitsinjektion und Middleware","Best Practices für den Bau von skalierbaren APIs","Kompatibilität mit PostgreSQL und MongoDB","Tests und geeignete Projektstruktur"],"pt":["Padrões assíncronos para APIs de alta performance","Injeção de dependência para gerenciamento de dependências","Middleware para tratamento de requisições e respostas","Estruturas de projeto prontas para produção","Suporte a bancos de dados como PostgreSQL e MongoDB"],"ru":["Асинхронные шаблоны для высокопроизводительных API","Внедрение зависимостей для управления зависимостями","Middleware для обработки запросов и ответов","Готовые к производству структуры проектов","Поддержка баз данных, таких как PostgreSQL и MongoDB"],"ar":["أنماط غير متزامنة لتحقيق أداء_API العالي","إدارة التبعيات لتحسين الأداء","Middleware لمعالجة الطلبات والاستجابات","هياكل مشروع جاهزة للإنتاج","دعم قواعد البيانات مثل PostgreSQL و MongoDB"]},"keywords":{"zh":["FastAPI","异步API","依赖注入","中间件","PostgreSQL","MongoDB","API项目结构","高性能API"],"ja":["FastAPI","非同期API","依存性注入","ミドルウェア","PostgreSQL","MongoDB","APIプロジェクト構造","高性能API"],"ko":["FastAPI","비동기 API","의존성 주입","미들웨어","PostgreSQL","MongoDB","API 프로젝트 구조","고성능 API"],"es":["FastAPI","plantillas de proyecto","proyectos de alto rendimiento","patrones asíncronos","inyección de dependencias","middleware","mejores prácticas","APIs escalables","PostgreSQL","MongoDB"],"fr":["FastAPI","modèles de projet","projets haute performance","modèles asynchrones","injection de dépendances","middleware","meilleures pratiques","APIs escalables","PostgreSQL","MongoDB"],"de":["FastAPI","Projektvorlagen","Hochleistungsprojekte","asynchrone Muster","Abhängigkeitsinjektion","Middleware","Best Practices","skalierbare APIs","PostgreSQL","MongoDB"],"pt":["FastAPI","APIs de alta performance","padrões assíncronos","injeção de dependência","middleware","banco de dados","PostgreSQL","MongoDB"],"ru":["FastAPI","высокопроизводительные API","асинхронные шаблоны","внедрение зависимостей","middleware","база данных","PostgreSQL","MongoDB"],"ar":["FastAPI","APIs ذات أداء عالي","أنماط غير متزامنة","إدارة التبعيات","middleware","قاعدة البيانات","PostgreSQL","MongoDB"]}},"owner":"xiangteng007","repo":"XXT-AGENT","repoPath":"xiangteng007/XXT-AGENT","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fastapi-templates","description":"Create production-ready FastAPI projects with async patterns, dependency injection, and comprehensive error handling. Use when building new FastAPI applications or setting up backend API projects.","bodyPreview":"# FastAPI Project Templates\n\nProduction-ready FastAPI project structures with async patterns, dependency injection, middleware, and best practices for building high-performance APIs.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Starting new FastAPI projects from scratch\n- Implementing async REST APIs with Python\n- Building high-performance web services and microservices\n- Creating async applications with PostgreSQL, MongoDB\n- Setting up API projects with proper structure and testing\n\n## Do not use this skill when","body":"# FastAPI Project Templates\n\nProduction-ready FastAPI project structures with async patterns, dependency injection, middleware, and best practices for building high-performance APIs.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Starting new FastAPI projects from scratch\n- Implementing async REST APIs with Python\n- Building high-performance web services and microservices\n- Creating async applications with PostgreSQL, MongoDB\n- Setting up API projects with proper structure and testing\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to fastapi project templates\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Resources\n\n- `resources/implementation-playbook.md` for detailed patterns and examples.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:25:25.533Z","qualityScore":55}');
