:"AST-Grep es una herramienta de búsqueda y transformación de código que utiliza análisis de árbol de sintaxis abstracta para buscar patrones en el código","fr":"AST-Grep est un outil de recherche et de transformation de code qui utilise l''analyse de l''arbre de syntaxe abstrait pour rechercher des modèles dans le code","de":"AST-Grep ist ein Tool für strukturale Code-Suche und -Transformation, das die Analyse des abstrakten Syntaxbaums verwendet, um Muster im Code zu suchen","pt":"AST-Grep é uma ferramenta rápida e poliglota para busca e transformação de código estrutural","ru":"AST-Grep - быстрый и полиглотный инструмент для поиска и преобразования кода","ar":"AST-Grep هي أداة سريعة ومتعددة اللغات للبحث و تحويل الشفرة الهيكلية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["结构化代码搜索","代码转换","支持多语言","快速搜索","基于抽象语法树分析"],"ja":["構造化コード検索","コード変換","マルチ言語対応","高速検索","抽象構文木による分析"],"ko":["구조화된 코드 검색","코드 변환","다중 언어 지원","빠른 검색","추상 구문 트리 분석"],"es":["Búsqueda estructural de código","Transformación de código","Análisis de árbol de sintaxis abstracta","Compatibilidad con múltiples lenguajes de programación","Búsqueda de patrones en código"],"fr":["Recherche structurale de code","Transformation de code","Analyse de l''arbre de syntaxe abstrait","Compatibilité avec plusieurs langages de programmation","Recherche de modèles dans le code"],"de":["Strukturelle Code-Suche","Code-Transformation","Analyse des abstrakten Syntaxbaums","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen","Suche nach Mustern im Code"],"pt":["Busca de padrões de código estrutural","Transformação de código em múltiplos arquivos","Análise de Árvore de Sintaxe Abstrata","Suporte a múltiplas linguagens de programação","Busca rápida e eficiente"],"ru":["Поиск структур кода","Преобразование кода в нескольких файлах","Анализ абстрактного синтаксического дерева","Поддержка нескольких языков программирования","Быстрый и эффективный поиск"],"ar":["بحث الأنماط الهيكلية للشفرة","تحويل الشفرة في عدة ملفات","تحليل شجرة الصياغة المجردة","دعم لعدة لغات برمجة","بحث سريع وفعال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AST-Grep","代码搜索","代码转换","抽象语法树","结构化搜索","多语言支持"],"ja":["AST-Grep","コード検索","コード変換","抽象構文木","構造化検索","マルチ言語対応"],"ko":["AST-Grep","코드 검색","코드 변환","추상 구문 트리","구조화된 검색","다중 언어 지원"],"es":["AST-Grep","búsqueda de código","transformación de código","análisis de árbol de sintaxis abstracta","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","búsqueda estructural de código"],"fr":["AST-Grep","recherche de code","transformation de code","analyse de l''arbre de syntaxe abstrait","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","recherche structurale de code"],"de":["AST-Grep","Code-Suche","Code-Transformation","Analyse des abstrakten Syntaxbaums","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools","strukturelle Code-Suche"],"pt":["AST-Grep","busca de código","transformação de código","Árvore de Sintaxe Abstrata","análise de código","ferramenta de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["AST-Grep","поиск кода","преобразование кода","абстрактное синтаксическое дерево","анализ кода","инструмент для разработчиков"],"ar":["AST-Grep","بحث الشفرة","تحويل الشفرة","شجرة الصياغة المجردة","تحليل الشفرة","أداة تطوير"]}},"owner":"jayleekr","repo":"hypeprooflab","repoPath":"jayleekr/hypeprooflab","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"moai-tool-ast-grep","description":">","version":"1.2.0","tags":"ast, refactoring, code-search, lint, structural-search, security, codemod","bodyPreview":"# AST-Grep Integration\n\nStructural code search, lint, and transformation tool using Abstract Syntax Tree analysis.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### What is AST-Grep\n\nAST-Grep (sg) is a fast, polyglot tool for structural code search and transformation. Unlike regex-based search, it understands code syntax and matches patterns based on AST structure.\n\n### When to Use\n\n- Searching for code patterns that regex cannot capture such as nested function calls\n- Refactoring code across multiple files with semanti","body":"# AST-Grep Integration\n\nStructural code search, lint, and transformation tool using Abstract Syntax Tree analysis.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### What is AST-Grep\n\nAST-Grep (sg) is a fast, polyglot tool for structural code search and transformation. Unlike regex-based search, it understands code syntax and matches patterns based on AST structure.\n\n### When to Use\n\n- Searching for code patterns that regex cannot capture such as nested function calls\n- Refactoring code across multiple files with semantic awareness\n- Security scanning for vulnerability patterns including SQL injection and XSS\n- API migration and deprecation handling\n- Enforcing code style rules at the syntax level\n\n### Core Commands\n\nPattern search: Execute sg run with pattern option specifying the code pattern to find, lang option for the programming language, and the source directory path.\n\nSecurity scan with rules: Execute sg scan with config option pointing to your sgconfig.yml file.\n\nCode transformation: Execute sg run with pattern option for the code to find, rewrite option for the replacement, lang option for the language, and source directory path.\n\nTest rules: Execute sg test to validate your rule definitions.\n\n### Pattern Syntax Basics\n\nThe dollar sign followed by a variable name such as VAR matches any single AST node and acts as a meta-variable for capturing.\n\nThe dollar sign followed by three dollar signs and a variable name such as ARGS matches zero or more nodes using variadic capture.\n\nThe double dollar sign followed by underscore matches any single node as an anonymous capture when the value is not needed.\n\n### Supported Languages\n\nPython, JavaScript, TypeScript, Go, Rust, Java, Kotlin, C, C++, Ruby, Swift, C#, PHP, Scala, Elixir, Lua, HTML, Vue, Svelte, and 30+ more.\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Guide\n\n### Installation\n\nFor macOS, use brew install ast-grep.\n\nFor cross-platform via npm, use npm install -g @ast-grep/cli.\n\nFor Rust via Cargo, use cargo install ast-grep.\n\n### Basic Pattern Matching\n\n#### Simple Pattern Search\n\nTo find all console.log calls, run sg with pattern console.log($MSG) and lang javascript.\n\nTo find all Python function definitions, run sg with pattern def $FUNC($$$ARGS): $$$BODY and lang python.\n\nTo find React useState hooks, run sg with pattern useState($INIT) and lang tsx.\n\n#### Explore/Search Performance Optimization\n\nAST-Grep provides significant performance benefits for codebase exploration compared to text-based search:\n\n**Why AST-Grep is Faster for Exploration**\n- Structural understanding eliminates false positives (50-80% reduction in irrelevant results)\n- Syntax-aware matching reduces full file scans\n- Single pass through AST vs multiple regex passes\n\n**Common Exploration Patterns**\n\nFind all function calls matching a pattern:\n```bash\nsg -p ''authenticate($$$)'' --lang python -r src/\n```\n\nFind all classes inheriting from a base class:\n```bash\nsg -p ''class $A extends BaseService'' --lang python -r src/\n```\n\nFind specific import patterns:\n```bash\nsg -p ''import fastapi'' --lang python -r src/\n```\n\nFind React hooks usage:\n```bash\nsg -p ''useState($$)'' --lang tsx -r src/\n```\n\nFind async function declarations:\n```bash\nsg -p ''async def $NAME($$$ARGS):'' --lang python -r src/\n```\n\n**Performance Comparison**\n- `grep -r \"class.*Service\" src/` - scans all files textually (~10s for large codebase)\n- `sg -p ''class $X extends Service'' --lang python -r src/` - structural match (~2s)\n\n**Integration with Explore Agent**\nWhen using the Explore agent, AST-Grep is automatically prioritized for:\n- Class hierarchy analysis\n- Function signature matching\n- Import dependency mapping\n- API usage pattern detection\n\n#### Meta-variables\n\nMeta-variables capture matching AST nodes in patterns.\n\nSingle node capture uses $NAME syntax. For example, pattern const $NAME = require($PATH) captures the variable name and path.\n\nVariadic capture uses $$$ARGS syntax. For example, pattern function $NAME($$$ARGS) captures function name and all arguments.\n\nAnonymous single capture uses $$_ syntax when you need to match but not reference the value.\n\n### Code Transformation\n\n#### Simple Rewrite\n\nTo rename a function, run sg with pattern oldFunc($ARGS), rewrite newFunc($ARGS), and lang python.\n\nTo update an API call, run sg with pattern axios.get($URL), rewrite fetch($URL), and lang typescript.\n\n#### Complex Transformation with YAML Rules\n\nCreate a YAML rule file with the following structure. Set the id field to a unique rule identifier such as convert-var-to-const. Set language to the target language such as javascript. Under the rule section, specify the pattern to match such as var $NAME = $VALUE. Set the fix field to the replacement pattern such as const $NAME = $VALUE. Add a message describing the issue and set severity to warning or error.\n\nRun sg scan with the rule option pointing to your rule file and the source directory.\n\n### Rule-Based Scanning\n\n#### Configuration File\n\nCreate an sgconfig.yml file with the following sections. The ruleDirs section lists directories containing rule files such as ./rules/security and ./rules/quality. The testConfigs section specifies test file patterns. The languageGlobs section maps languages to file patterns, mapping python to .py files, typescript to .ts and .tsx files, and javascript to .js and .jsx files.\n\n#### Security Rule Example\n\nCreate a security rule file for SQL injection detection. Set the id to sql-injection-risk. Set language to python and severity to error. Write a descriptive message about the vulnerability. Under the rule section, use the any operator to match multiple patterns including cursor.execute with percent formatting, cursor.execute with format method, and cursor.execute with f-string interpolation. Set the fix to show the parameterized query alternative.\n\n### Relational Rules\n\n#### Inside Rule for Scoped Search\n\nCreate a rule that searches for console.log calls only inside function declarations. Set the pattern to console.log($$$ARGS) and add an inside constraint with pattern function $NAME($$$PARAMS).\n\n#### Has Rule for Contains Check\n\nCreate a rule to find async functions without await. Set the pattern to async function $NAME($$$PARAMS) with a not constraint containing a has rule with pattern await $EXPR. Add message indicating async function without await.\n\n#### Follows and Precedes Rules\n\nCreate a rule to detect missing error handling. Set the pattern to match error assignment $ERR := $CALL and add a not constraint with follows rule checking for if $ERR != nil error handling block.\n\n### Composite Rules\n\nCreate complex rules using the all operator to combine multiple conditions. For example, combine pattern useState($INIT) with inside constraint for function component and not precedes constraint for useEffect call.\n\n---\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\nFor comprehensive documentation including complex multi-file transformations, custom language configuration, CI/CD integration patterns, and performance optimization tips, see the following module files.\n\nPattern syntax reference is available in modules/pattern-syntax.md.\n\nSecurity scanning rule templates are documented in modules/security-rules.md.\n\nCommon refactoring patterns are covered in modules/refactoring-patterns.md.\n\nLanguage-specific patterns are detailed in modules/language-specific.md.\n\n### Context7 Integration\n\nFor latest AST-Grep documentation, follow this two-step process.\n\nStep 1: Use mcp__context7__resolve-library-id with query ast-grep to resolve the library identifier.\n\nStep 2: Use mcp__context7__get-library-docs with the resolved library ID to fetch current documentation.\n\n### MoAI-ADK Integration\n\nAST-Grep is integrated into MoAI-ADK through the Tool Registry as AST_ANALYZER type in tool_registry.py, PostToolUse Hook for automatic security scanning after Write/Edit operations, and Permissions with Bash(sg:*) and Bash(ast-grep:*) auto-allowed.\n\n### Running Scans\n\nTo scan with MoAI-ADK rules, execute sg scan with config pointing to .claude/skills/moai-tool-ast-grep/rules/sgconfig.yml.\n\nTo scan a specific directory, execute sg scan with config sgconfig.yml and the src/ directory.\n\nFor JSON output suitable for CI/CD, execute sg scan with config and json flag, redirecting to results.json.\n\n---\n\n## Works Well With\n\n- moai-workflow-testing: DDD integration and test pattern detection\n- moai-foundation-quality: TRUST 5 compliance and code quality gates\n- moai-domain-backend: API pattern detection and security scanning\n- moai-domain-frontend: React/Vue pattern optimization\n- moai-lang-python: Python-specific security and style rules\n- moai-lang-typescript: TypeScript type safety patterns\n\n### Related Agents\n\n- expert-refactoring: AST-based large-scale refactoring\n- expert-security: Security vulnerability scanning\n- manager-quality: Code complexity analysis\n- expert-debug: Pattern-based debugging\n\n---\n\n## Reference\n\nFor additional information, consult the AST-Grep Official Documentation at ast-grep.github.io, the AST-Grep GitHub Repository at github.com/ast-grep/ast-grep, the Pattern Playground at ast-grep.github.io/playground.html, and the Rule Configuration Reference at ast-grep.github.io/reference/yaml.html.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:25:37.897Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing advanced structural pattern matching across multiple programming languages.","zh":"非常适合需要在多种编程语言中进行高级结构模式匹配的代码分析代理。","ja":"複数のプログラミング言語での高度な構造パターンマッチングを必要とするコード分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"다중 프로그래밍 언어에서 고급 구조 패턴 매칭이 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de código que necesitan coincidencia de patrones estructurales avanzada en varios lenguajes de programación.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant une correspondance de modèles structurels avancée sur plusieurs langages de programmation.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agenten, die eine erweiterte strukturelle Mustererkennung in mehreren Programmiersprachen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de correspondência de padrões estruturais avançada em várias linguagens de programação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, которым требуется продвинутая структура сопоставления шаблонов в нескольких языках программирования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى مطابقة الأنماط الهيكلية المتقدمة عبر لغات برمجة متعددة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables structural code search, linting, and transformation using Abstract Syntax Tree analysis instead of regex patterns. Provides polyglot support for semantic refactoring across codebases with precise AST-based pattern matching.","zh":"启用结构代码搜索、linting和转换，使用抽象语法树分析而不是正则表达式模式。为语义重构提供多语言支持，实现精确的AST基于模式匹配。","ja":"構造コード検索、linting、変換を有効にし、正規表現パターンではなく抽象構文木分析を使用します。コードベースの意味的リファクタリングに多言語対応を提供し、精密なASTベースのパターンマッチングを実現します。","ko":"구조 코드 검색, 린팅 및 변환을 활성화하고 정규 표현식 패턴 대신 추상 구문 트리 분석을 사용합니다. 코드베이스의 의미적 리팩토링을 위해 다중 언어 지원을 제공하고 정확한 AST 기반 패턴 매칭을 구현합니다.","es":"Permite la búsqueda de código estructural, la revisión y la transformación utilizando el análisis del Árbol de Sintaxis Abstracta en lugar de patrones de regex. Proporciona soporte poliglota para la refactorización semántica en codebases con coincidencia de patrones basada en AST precisa.","fr":"Permet la recherche de code structurel, la mise en forme et la transformation en utilisant l''analyse de l''Arbre de Syntaxe Abstrait au lieu de modèles regex. Fournit un support polyglotte pour la réorganisation sémantique dans les bases de code avec une correspondance de modèles basée sur l''AST précise.","de":"Ermöglicht die strukturelle Code-Suche, die Überprüfung und die Transformation unter Verwendung der Analyse des Abstrakten Syntaxbaums anstelle von Regex-Mustern. Bietet Polyglott-Unterstützung für semantische Refaktorierung in Codebasen mit genauer AST-basierter Mustervergleichung.","pt":"Permite a busca de código estrutural, linting e transformação usando análise de Árvore de Sintaxe Abstrata em vez de padrões regex. Fornece suporte poliglota para refatoração semântica em repositórios de código com correspondência de padrões baseada em AST precisa.","ru":"Позволяет выполнять поиск структурализированного кода, линтинг и трансформацию с использованием анализа абстрактного синтаксического дерева вместо шаблонов regex. Обеспечивает полиглотскую поддержку семантического рефакторинга по репозиториям кода с точной сопоставлением шаблонов на основе АСТ.","ar":"يمكّن البحث عن الكود الهيكلي والتنسيق والتحويل باستخدام تحليل شجرة البناء المجردة بدلاً من أنماط Regex. يوفر الدعم المتعدد اللغات لإعادة الهيكلة الدلالية عبر مخازن الشفرة بمطابقة الأنماط القائمة على شجرة البناء المجردة بدقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring nested function calls across multiple files","Linting complex code patterns regex cannot capture","Transforming code structures with semantic accuracy","Searching for AST-based patterns in polyglot codebases"],"zh":["跨多个文件的嵌套函数调用重构","linting复杂的代码模式，正则表达式无法捕获","使用语义准确性转换代码结构","在多语言代码库中搜索AST基于模式"],"ja":["複数のファイルを跨ぐネストされた関数呼び出しのリファクタリング","正規表現では捉えられない複雑なコードパターンのlinting","セマンティック精度でコード構造を変換する","多言語コードベースでASTベースのパターンを検索する"],"ko":["다중 파일의 중첩된 함수 호출을 리팩토링","정규 표현식으로 捕获할 수 없는 복잡한 코드 패턴의 린팅","코드 구조를 의미적 정확성으로 변환","다중 언어 코드베이스에서 AST 기반 패턴을 검색"],"es":["Reestructuración de llamadas a funciones anidadas en varios archivos","Revisión de patrones de código complejos que regex no puede capturar","Transformación de estructuras de código con precisión semántica","Búsqueda de patrones basados en AST en codebases poliglotas"],"fr":["Réorganisation d''appels de fonctions imbriqués dans plusieurs fichiers","Mise en forme de modèles de code complexes que regex ne peut pas capturer","Transformation de structures de code avec une précision sémantique","Recherche de modèles basés sur l''AST dans les bases de code polyglottes"],"de":["Umstrukturierung von verschachtelten Funktionsaufrufen in mehreren Dateien","Überprüfung komplexer Code-Muster, die Regex nicht erfassen kann","Transformation von Code-Strukturen mit semantischer Genauigkeit","Suche nach AST-basierten Mustern in Polyglott-Codebasen"],"pt":["Reestruturação de chamadas de funções aninhadas em vários arquivos","Verificação de padrões de código complexos que regex não consegue capturar","Transformação de estruturas de código com precisão semântica","Pesquisa de padrões baseados em AST em repositórios de código poliglotas"],"ru":["Рефакторинг вложенных вызовов функций в нескольких файлах","Линтинг сложных шаблонов кода, которые не могут быть захвачены с помощью regex","Трансформация структур кода с семантической точностью","Поиск шаблонов на основе АСТ в полиглотских репозиториях кода"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة دعوات الدوال المترابطة عبر عدة ملفات","فحص أنماط شفرة معقدة لا يمكن لـregex التقاطها","تحويل هياكل الشفرة بدقة دلالية","البحث عن أنماط شجرة البناء المجردة في مخازن الشفرة متعددة اللغات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of AST patterns","Limited to structural code operations only"],"zh":["需要了解AST模式","仅限于结构代码操作"],"ja":["ASTパターンの理解が必要","構造コード操作のみに限定"],"ko":["AST 패턴에 대한 이해 필요","구조 코드 작업만 제한"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de patrones de AST","Limitado a operaciones de código estructural solo"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des modèles d''AST","Limité aux opérations de code structurel uniquement"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis von AST-Mustern","Begrenzt auf strukturelle Code-Operationen nur"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de padrões de AST","Limitado a operações de código estrutural apenas"],"ru":["Требует понимания шаблонов АСТ","Ограничен только структурализированными операциями кода"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم أنماط شجرة البناء المجردة","محدود للعمليات الهيكلية للشفرة فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
