des prédictions est un agrégateur d''intelligence de recherche IA qui évalue la précision des prédictions des chercheurs et critiques","de":"Die Fähigkeit zur Vorhersage-Verfolgung ist ein Aggregator für KI-Forschungsintelligenz, der die Genauigkeit von Vorhersagen von Forschern und Kritikern bewe...","pt":"O rastreamento de previsões de IA permite capturar e avaliar a precisão das previsões feitas por pesquisadores e críticos de inteligência artificial.","ru":"Отслеживание прогнозов ИИ позволяет захватить и оценить точность прогнозов, сделанных исследователями и критиками искусственного интеллекта.","ar":"تتبع توقعات الذكاء الاصطناعي يسمح بالتقاط وتقييم دقة التوقعات التي قدمها باحثو ونقاد الذكاء الاصطناعي.","en":"AI research intelligence aggregator"},"definition":{"en":"AI research intelligence aggregator"},"features":{"zh":["AI ","AI ","AI ","AI ","AI "],"ja":["AI","AI","AI","AI","AI"],"ko":["AI ","AI ","AI ","AI ","AI "],"es":["Registro de predicciones","Evaluación de la precisión","Seguimiento de la confianza del autor","Análisis de la temporalidad de las predicciones","Asignación de temas de IA","Inclusión de fuentes y enlaces"],"fr":["Enregistrement des prédictions","Évaluation de la précision","Suivi de la confiance de l''auteur","Analyse de la temporalité des prédictions","Assignation de thèmes d''IA","Inclusion de sources et de liens"],"de":["Registrierung von Vorhersagen","Bewertung der Genauigkeit","Verfolgung des Vertrauens des Autors","Analyse der Zeitlichkeit von Vorhersagen","Zuweisung von KI-Themen","Einbeziehung von Quellen und Links"],"pt":["Captação de previsões de pesquisadores e críticos de IA","Avaliação da precisão das previsões ao longo do tempo","Registro de previsões com campos obrigatórios e opcionais","Análise de confiança e expectativas de previsões","Integração com fontes de informação de IA","Relatórios personalizados de previsões e precisão"],"ru":["Захват прогнозов исследователей и критиков ИИ","Оценка точности прогнозов во времени","Регистрация прогнозов с обязательными и необязательными полями","Анализ уверенности и ожиданий прогнозов","Интеграция с источниками информации ИИ","Пользовательские отчеты о прогнозах и точности"],"ar":["التقاط توقعات باحثي ونقاد الذكاء الاصطناعي","تقييم دقة التوقعات بمرور الوقت","التسجيل التوقعات مع الحقول الإلزامية والخيارية","تحليل الثقة والتوقعات للتوقعات","التكامل مع مصادر المعلومات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التقارير المخصصة للتوقعات ودقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI ","AI ","AI ","AI ","AI ","AI "],"ja":["AI","AI","AI","AI","AI","AI"],"ko":["AI ","AI ","AI ","AI ","AI ","AI "],"es":["seguimiento de predicciones","inteligencia de investigación de IA","evaluación de la precisión","análisis de predicciones","registros de predicciones","investigación de IA","desarrollo de IA","IA y machine learning"],"fr":["suivi des prédictions","intelligence de recherche IA","évaluation de la précision","analyse de prédictions","enregistrement de prédictions","recherche IA","développement IA","IA et apprentissage automatique"],"de":["Vorhersage-Verfolgung","KI-Forschungsintelligenz","Bewertung der Genauigkeit","Analyse von Vorhersagen","Registrierung von Vorhersagen","KI-Forschung","KI-Entwicklung","KI und maschinelles Lernen"],"pt":["rastreamento de previsões de IA","inteligência artificial","pesquisadores de IA","críticos de IA","previsões de IA","análise de previsões","avaliação de precisão","registro de previsões","confiança de previsões","expectativas de previsões"],"ru":["отслеживание прогнозов ИИ","искусственный интеллект","исследователи ИИ","критики ИИ","прогнозы ИИ","анализ прогнозов","оценка точности","регистрация прогнозов","уверенность прогнозов","ожидания прогнозов"],"ar":["تتبع توقعات الذكاء الاصطناعي","الذكاء الاصطناعي","باحثو الذكاء الاصطناعي","نقاد الذكاء الاصطناعي","توقعات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحليل التوقعات","تقييم الدقة","التسجيل التوقعات","ثقة التوقعات","توقعات التوقعات"]}},"owner":"rickoslyder","repo":"HypeDelta","repoPath":"rickoslyder/HypeDelta","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prediction-tracking","description":"Track and evaluate AI predictions over time to assess accuracy. Use when reviewing past predictions to determine if they came true, failed, or remain uncertain.","bodyPreview":"# Prediction Tracking Skill\n\nTrack predictions made by AI researchers and critics, evaluate their accuracy over time.\n\n## Prediction Recording\n\nWhen recording a new prediction, capture:\n\n### Required Fields\n- **text**: The prediction as stated\n- **author**: Who made it\n- **madeAt**: When it was made\n- **timeframe**: When they expect it to happen\n- **topic**: What area of AI\n- **confidence**: How confident they seemed\n\n### Optional Fields\n- **sourceUrl**: Where the prediction was made\n- **targetD","body":"# Prediction Tracking Skill\n\nTrack predictions made by AI researchers and critics, evaluate their accuracy over time.\n\n## Prediction Recording\n\nWhen recording a new prediction, capture:\n\n### Required Fields\n- **text**: The prediction as stated\n- **author**: Who made it\n- **madeAt**: When it was made\n- **timeframe**: When they expect it to happen\n- **topic**: What area of AI\n- **confidence**: How confident they seemed\n\n### Optional Fields\n- **sourceUrl**: Where the prediction was made\n- **targetDate**: Specific date if mentioned\n- **conditions**: Any caveats or conditions\n- **metrics**: How to measure success\n\n## Evaluation Status\n\nWhen evaluating predictions, assign one of:\n\n### `verified`\nClearly came true as stated.\n- The predicted capability/event occurred\n- Within the stated timeframe\n- Substantially as described\n\n### `falsified`\nClearly did not come true.\n- Timeframe passed without occurrence\n- Contradictory evidence emerged\n- Author retracted or modified claim\n\n### `partially-verified`\nPartially accurate.\n- Some aspects came true, others didn''t\n- Capability exists but weaker than claimed\n- Timeframe was off but direction correct\n\n### `too-early`\nNot enough time has passed.\n- Still within stated timeframe\n- No definitive evidence either way\n\n### `unfalsifiable`\nCannot be objectively assessed.\n- Too vague to measure\n- No clear success criteria\n- Moved goalposts\n\n### `ambiguous`\nPrediction was too vague to evaluate.\n- Multiple interpretations possible\n- Success criteria unclear\n\n## Evaluation Process\n\nFor each prediction being evaluated:\n\n### 1. Restate the prediction\nWhat exactly was claimed?\n\n### 2. Identify timeframe\nHas enough time passed to evaluate?\n\n### 3. Gather evidence\nWhat has happened since?\n- Relevant releases or announcements\n- Benchmark results\n- Real-world deployments\n- Counter-evidence\n\n### 4. Assess status\nWhich evaluation status applies?\n\n### 5. Score accuracy\nIf verifiable, rate 0.0-1.0:\n- 1.0: Exactly as predicted\n- 0.7-0.9: Substantially correct\n- 0.4-0.6: Partially correct\n- 0.1-0.3: Mostly wrong\n- 0.0: Completely wrong\n\n### 6. Note lessons\nWhat does this tell us about:\n- The author''s forecasting ability\n- The topic''s predictability\n- Common prediction pitfalls\n\n## Output Format\n\nFor evaluation:\n```json\n{\n  \"evaluations\": [\n    {\n      \"predictionId\": \"id\",\n      \"status\": \"verified\",\n      \"accuracyScore\": 0.85,\n      \"evidence\": \"Description of evidence\",\n      \"notes\": \"Additional context\",\n      \"evaluatedAt\": \"timestamp\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nFor accuracy statistics:\n```json\n{\n  \"author\": \"Author name\",\n  \"totalPredictions\": 15,\n  \"verified\": 5,\n  \"falsified\": 3,\n  \"partiallyVerified\": 2,\n  \"pending\": 4,\n  \"unfalsifiable\": 1,\n  \"averageAccuracy\": 0.62,\n  \"topicBreakdown\": {\n    \"reasoning\": { \"predictions\": 5, \"accuracy\": 0.7 },\n    \"agents\": { \"predictions\": 3, \"accuracy\": 0.4 }\n  },\n  \"calibration\": \"Assessment of how well-calibrated they are\"\n}\n```\n\n## Calibration Assessment\n\nEvaluate whether predictors are well-calibrated:\n\n### Well-Calibrated\n- High-confidence predictions usually come true\n- Low-confidence predictions have mixed results\n- Acknowledges uncertainty appropriately\n\n### Overconfident\n- High-confidence predictions often fail\n- Rarely expresses uncertainty\n- Doesn''t update on evidence\n\n### Underconfident\n- Low-confidence predictions often come true\n- Hedges even on likely outcomes\n- Too conservative\n\n### Inconsistent\n- Confidence doesn''t correlate with accuracy\n- Random relationship between stated and actual accuracy\n\n## Tracking Notable Predictors\n\nKeep running assessments of key voices:\n\n| Predictor | Total | Accuracy | Calibration | Notes |\n|-----------|-------|----------|-------------|-------|\n| Sam Altman | 20 | 55% | Overconfident | Timeline optimism |\n| Gary Marcus | 15 | 70% | Well-calibrated | Conservative |\n| Dario Amodei | 12 | 65% | Slightly over | Safety-focused |\n\n## Red Flags\n\nWatch for prediction patterns that suggest bias:\n- Always bullish regardless of topic\n- Never acknowledges failed predictions\n- Moves goalposts when wrong\n- Predictions align suspiciously with financial interests\n- Vague enough to claim credit for anything\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:26:02.680Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Research Agents requiring advanced prediction analysis and tracking capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级预测分析和跟踪能力的AI研究代理。","ja":"高度な予測分析および追跡機能を必要とするAI研究エージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 예측 분석 및 추적 기능이 필요한 AI 연구 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de investigación de IA que requieren análisis y capacidades de seguimiento de predicción avanzados.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de recherche en IA nécessitant une analyse et des capacités de suivi de prédiction avancées.","de":"Ideal für KI-Forschungsagenten, die erweiterte Vorhersageanalysen und Nachverfolgungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Pesquisa de IA que exigem análise de previsão avançada e capacidades de rastreamento.","ru":"Идеально для агентов исследований ИИ, требующих расширенного анализа прогнозов и возможностей отслеживания.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء البحث الاصطناعي الذين يتطلبون تحليل التوقعات المتقدم و القدرات التتبعية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to evaluate prediction accuracy over time using fields like text, author, madeAt, timeframe, topic, and confidence, while also supporting optional fields such as sourceUrl, enhancing their ability to track and analyze AI researcher and critic predictions.","zh":"赋予代理评估预测准确性随时间推移的能力，使用字段如文本、作者、madeAt、时间范围、主题和置信度，同时也支持可选字段，如源URL，增强其跟踪和分析AI研究人员和评论员预测的能力。","ja":"エージェントがテキスト、著者、madeAt、時間枠、トピック、信頼性などのフィールドを使用して、時間の経過とともに予測の精度を評価する機能を提供し、同時にsourceUrlなどのオプションフィールドもサポートして、AI研究者や批評家の予測を追跡および分析する能力を強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 텍스트, 저자, madeAt, 시간 범위, 주제 및 신뢰도와 같은 필드를 사용하여 시간이 지남에 따라 예측 정확성을 평가할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며,同時에 sourceUrl과 같은 선택적 필드를 지원하여 AI 연구자 및 비평가의 예측을 추적 및 분석하는 기능을 강화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes evaluar la precisión de las predicciones con el tiempo utilizando campos como texto, autor, fechahora, plazo, tema y confianza, y también admite campos opcionales como urlfuente, lo que mejora su capacidad para seguir y analizar las predicciones de investigadores y críticos de IA.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''évaluer la précision des prédictions dans le temps en utilisant des champs tels que texte, auteur, dateheure, période, sujet et confiance, et prend également en charge des champs facultatifs tels que urlsource, améliorant ainsi leur capacité à suivre et analyser les prédictions des chercheurs et critiques en IA.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Vorhersagegenauigkeit im Laufe der Zeit unter Verwendung von Feldern wie Text, Autor, Zeitstempel, Zeitrahmen, Thema und Vertrauen zu bewerten, und unterstützt auch optionale Felder wie Quell-URL, wodurch ihre Fähigkeit verbessert wird, Vorhersagen von KI-Forschern und -Kritikern zu verfolgen und zu analysieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a avaliar a precisão das previsões ao longo do tempo utilizando campos como texto, autor, feitoEm, período de tempo, tópico e confiança, além de suportar campos opcionais como urlDeFonte, melhorando sua capacidade de rastrear e analisar previsões de pesquisadores e críticos de IA.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оценивать точность прогнозов во времени с использованием полей, таких как текст, автор, сделано, временной интервал, тема и уверенность, а также поддерживает необязательные поля, такие как url-адрес источника, повышая их способность отслеживать и анализировать прогнозы исследователей и критиков ИИ.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من تقييم دقة التوقعات بمرور الوقت باستخدام حقول مثل النص و الكاتب و وقت الإنجاز و الفترة الزمنية و الموضوع و الثقة ، بالإضافة إلى دعم الحقول الاختيارية مثل عنوان المصدر ، مما يعزز قدرتهم على تتبع وتحليل توقعات باحثي النقد الاصطناعي."},"useCases":{"en":["Tracking AI researcher predictions","Evaluating critic prediction accuracy","Analyzing prediction trends over time","Recording new predictions with required fields"],"zh":["跟踪AI研究人员预测","评估评论员预测准确性","分析预测趋势随时间推移","记录具有必需字段的新预测"],"ja":["AI研究者の予測を追跡する","批評家の予測精度を評価する","時間の経過とともに予測の傾向を分析する","必須フィールドを備えた新しい予測を記録する"],"ko":["AI 연구자의 예측을 추적하는 것","비평가의 예측 정확성을 평가하는 것","시간이 지남에 따라 예측 트렌드를 분석하는 것","필수 필드를 갖춘 새로운 예측을 기록하는 것"],"es":["Seguimiento de las predicciones de los investigadores de IA","Evaluación de la precisión de las predicciones de los críticos","Análisis de las tendencias de las predicciones con el tiempo","Grabación de nuevas predicciones con campos obligatorios"],"fr":["Suivi des prédictions des chercheurs en IA","Évaluation de la précision des prédictions des critiques","Analyse des tendances des prédictions dans le temps","Enregistrement de nouvelles prédictions avec des champs obligatoires"],"de":["Verfolgung der Vorhersagen von KI-Forschern","Bewertung der Vorhersagegenauigkeit von Kritikern","Analyse der Vorhersagetrends im Laufe der Zeit","Aufzeichnung neuer Vorhersagen mit obligatorischen Feldern"],"pt":["Rastreamento de previsões de pesquisadores de IA","Avaliação da precisão das previsões dos críticos","Análise de tendências de previsões ao longo do tempo","Gravação de novas previsões com campos obrigatórios"],"ru":["Отслеживание прогнозов исследователей ИИ","Оценка точности прогнозов критиков","Анализ тенденций прогнозов во времени","Запись новых прогнозов с обязательными полями"],"ar":["تتبع توقعات باحثي النقد الاصطناعي","تقييم دقة توقعات النقاد","تحليل اتجاهات التوقعات بمرور الوقت","تسجيل توقعات جديدة مع الحقول المطلوبة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires accurate and consistent prediction data","Limited to tracking predictions made by AI researchers and critics","Dependent on manual recording of predictions"],"zh":["需要准确且一致的预测数据","仅限于跟踪AI研究人员和评论员的预测","依赖于预测的手动记录"],"ja":["正確で一貫性のある予測データが必要","AI研究者や批評家の予測のみを追跡する","予測の手動記録に依存する"],"ko":["정확하고 일관된 예측 데이터가 필요함","AI 연구자 및 비평가의 예측만을 추적함","예측의 수동 기록에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere datos de predicción precisos y coherentes","Limitado al seguimiento de las predicciones realizadas por investigadores y críticos de IA","Dependiente de la grabación manual de las predicciones"],"fr":["Nécessite des données de prédiction précises et cohérentes","Limité au suivi des prédictions faites par les chercheurs et critiques en IA","Dépend de l''enregistrement manuel des prédictions"],"de":["Benötigt genaue und konsistente Vorhersagedaten","Begrenzt auf die Nachverfolgung von Vorhersagen, die von KI-Forschern und -Kritikern gemacht werden","Abhängig von der manuellen Aufzeichnung von Vorhersagen"],"pt":["Exige dados de previsão precisos e consistentes","Limitado ao rastreamento de previsões feitas por pesquisadores e críticos de IA","Dependente da gravação manual das previsões"],"ru":["Требует точных и последовательных прогнозных данных","Ограничен отслеживанием прогнозов, сделанных исследователями и критиками ИИ","Зависит от ручного ввода прогнозов"],"ar":["يتطلب بيانات توقعات دقيقة ومستمرة","محدود بتتبع توقعات الصانعين من باحثي النقد الاصطناعي والنقاد","يعتمد على تسجيل يدوى للتوقعات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('LeighAtkins/OpenPaint/Writing Hookify Rules', 'community', 'LeighAtkins', 'OpenPaint', 'LeighAtkins/OpenPaint', 'Writing Hookify Rules', 0, 0, 85, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z', '2026-02-18T03:25:38.432Z', NULL, '{"id":"LeighAtkins/OpenPaint/Writing Hookify Rules","name":"Writing Hookify Rules","description":{"zh":"Hookify 规则是一种 markdown 文件，用于定义模式和显示消息。通过编写规则，开发者可以提高工作效率","ja":"Hookify ルールは、パターンとメッセージを定義するための markdown ファイルです。ルールを書くことで、開発者の生産性を向上させることができます","ko":"Hookify 규칙은 패턴과 메시지를 정의하는 마크다운 파일입니다. 규칙을 작성함으로써 개발자는 작업 효율성을 높일 수 있습니다","es":"Las reglas Hookify son archivos markdown que definen patrones y mensajes personalizados para desarrolladores","fr":"Les règles Hookify sont des fichiers markdown qui définissent des modèles et des messages personnalisés pour les développeurs","de":"Hookify-Regeln sind Markdown-Dateien, die Muster und benutzerdefinierte Nachrichten für Entwickler definieren","pt":"As regras Hookify são arquivos markdown com frontmatter YAML que definem padrões e mensagens de alerta. Aprenda a criá-las","ru":"Правила Hookify представляют собой файлы markdown с YAML-заголовком, определяющие шаблоны и сообщения. Узнайте, как их создавать","ar":"قواعد Hookify هي ملفات markdown مع YAML-الرأس التي تحدد الأنماط ورسائل الإشعار. تعلم كيفية كتابتها","en":"This is a paint tool that can be used to draw diagrams on top of photos."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Hookify 规则编写","ja":"Hookify ルールの書き方","ko":"Hookify 규칙 작성","es":"Crear reglas Hookify para desarrolladores","fr":"Écrire des règles Hookify pour les développeurs","de":"Hookify-Regeln für Entwickler erstellen","pt":"Crie Regras Hookify Personalizadas","ru":"Напишите Настройки Hookify","ar":"اكتب قواعد Hookify","en":"Writing Hookify Rules"},"description":{"zh":"Hookify 规则是一种 markdown 文件，用于定义模式和显示消息。通过编写规则，开发者可以提高工作效率","ja":"Hookify ルールは、パターンとメッセージを定義するための markdown ファイルです。ルールを書くことで、開発者の生産性を向上させることができます","ko":"Hookify 규칙은 패턴과 메시지를 정의하는 마크다운 파일입니다. 규칙을 작성함으로써 개발자는 작업 효율성을 높일 수 있습니다","es":"Las reglas Hookify son archivos markdown que definen patrones y mensajes personalizados para desarrolladores","fr":"Les règles Hookify sont des fichiers markdown qui définissent des modèles et des messages personnalisés pour les développeurs","de":"Hookify-Regeln sind Markdown-Dateien, die Muster und benutzerdefinierte Nachrichten für Entwickler definieren","pt":"As regras Hookify são arquivos markdown com frontmatter YAML que definem padrões e mensagens de alerta. Aprenda a criá-las","ru":"Правила Hookify представляют собой файлы markdown с YAML-заголовком, определяющие шаблоны и сообщения. Узнайте, как их создавать","ar":"قواعد Hookify هي ملفات markdown مع YAML-الرأس التي تحدد الأنماط ورسائل الإشعار. تعلم كيفية كتابتها","en":"This is a paint tool that can be used to draw diagrams on top of photos."},"definition":{"en":"This is a paint tool that can be used to draw diagrams on top of photos."},"features":{"zh":["支持 markdown 语法","定义模式和显示消息","提高开发效率","支持 YAML 前置语法","规则文件存储在 `.claude` 目录中"],"ja":["markdown 構文をサポート","パターンとメッセージを定義","開発効率を向上させる","YAML フロントマターをサポート","ルールファイルは `.claude` ディレクトリに保存される"],"ko":["마크다운 문법 지원","패턴과 메시지를 정의","개발 효율성을 높인다","YAML 프론티어 문법 지원","규칙 파일은 `.claude` 디렉토리에 저장됨"],"es":["Definir patrones personalizados con expresiones regulares","Crear mensajes personalizados con formato markdown","Almacenar reglas en archivos markdown locales","Habilitar o deshabilitar reglas según sea necesario","Compatibilidad con eventos como bash, archivo, parada y prompt"],"fr":["Définir des modèles personnalisés avec des expressions régulières","Créer des messages personnalisés avec un format markdown","Stockage des règles dans des fichiers markdown locaux","Activer ou désactiver les règles selon les besoins","Compatibilité avec des événements tels que bash, fichier, arrêt et invite"],"de":["Definieren von benutzerdefinierten Mustern mit regulären Ausdrücken","Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Nachrichten mit Markdown-Format","Speichern von Regeln in lokalen Markdown-Dateien","Aktivieren oder deaktivieren von Regeln nach Bedarf","Kompatibilität mit Ereignissen wie Bash, Datei, Stopp und Prompt"],"pt":["Crie regras personalizadas com markdown e YAML","Defina padrões e mensagens de alerta","Armazene regras em arquivos `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md`","Use regex para definir padrões complexos","Inclua formatação markdown em mensagens de alerta"],"ru":["Создавайте настраиваемые правила с помощью markdown и YAML","Определите шаблоны и сообщения","Храните правила в файлах `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md`","Используйте regex для определения сложных шаблонов","Включайте форматирование markdown в сообщениях"],"ar":["اكتب قواعد مخصصة باستخدام markdown و YAML","حدد الأنماط ورسائل الإشعار","احفظ القواعد في ملفات `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md`","استخدم regex لتحديد أنماط معقدة","شمل تنسيق markdown في رسائل الإشعار"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Hookify 规则","markdown 文件","YAML 前置语法","开发效率","模式匹配","消息显示"],"ja":["Hookify ルール","markdown ファイル","YAML フロントマター","開発効率","パターンマッチング","メッセージ表示"],"ko":["Hookify 규칙","마크다운 파일","YAML 프론티어 문법","개발 효율성","패턴 매칭","메시지 표시"],"es":["reglas Hookify","desarrollo de software","patrones personalizados","mensajes personalizados","markdown","expresiones regulares","evento bash","evento archivo"],"fr":["règles Hookify","développement de logiciels","modèles personnalisés","messages personnalisés","markdown","expressions régulières","événement bash","événement fichier"],"de":["Hookify-Regeln","Software-Entwicklung","benutzerdefinierte Muster","benutzerdefinierte Nachrichten","Markdown","reguläre Ausdrücke","Bash-Ereignis","Datei-Ereignis"],"pt":["regras hookify","markdown","yaml","padrões","mensagens de alerta","desenvolvimento de software","programação"],"ru":["правила hookify","markdown","yaml","шаблоны","сообщения","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование"],"ar":["قواعد hookify","markdown","yaml","أنماط","رسائل إشعار","تطوير البرمجيات","برمجة"]}},"owner":"LeighAtkins","repo":"OpenPaint","repoPath":"LeighAtkins/OpenPaint","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.407Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Writing Hookify Rules","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to create a hookify rule, write a hook rule, configure hookify, add a hookify rule, or needs guidance on hookify rule syntax and patterns.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Writing Hookify Rules\n\n## Overview\n\nHookify rules are markdown files with YAML frontmatter that define patterns to watch for and messages to show when those patterns match. Rules are stored in `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` files.\n\n## Rule File Format\n\n### Basic Structure\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: rule-identifier\nenabled: true\nevent: bash|file|stop|prompt|all\npattern: regex-pattern-here\n---\n\nMessage to show Claude when this rule triggers.\nCan include markdown formatting, warnings, suggest","body":"# Writing Hookify Rules\n\n## Overview\n\nHookify rules are markdown files with YAML frontmatter that define patterns to watch for and messages to show when those patterns match. Rules are stored in `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` files.\n\n## Rule File Format\n\n### Basic Structure\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: rule-identifier\nenabled: true\nevent: bash|file|stop|prompt|all\npattern: regex-pattern-here\n---\n\nMessage to show Claude when this rule triggers.\nCan include markdown formatting, warnings, suggestions, etc.\n```\n\n### Frontmatter Fields\n\n**name** (required): Unique identifier for the rule\n- Use kebab-case: `warn-dangerous-rm`, `block-console-log`\n- Be descriptive and action-oriented\n- Start with verb: warn, prevent, block, require, check\n\n**enabled** (required): Boolean to activate/deactivate\n- `true`: Rule is active\n- `false`: Rule is disabled (won''t trigger)\n- Can toggle without deleting rule\n\n**event** (required): Which hook event to trigger on\n- `bash`: Bash tool commands\n- `file`: Edit, Write, MultiEdit tools\n- `stop`: When agent wants to stop\n- `prompt`: When user submits a prompt\n- `all`: All events\n\n**action** (optional): What to do when rule matches\n- `warn`: Show message but allow operation (default)\n- `block`: Prevent operation (PreToolUse) or stop session (Stop events)\n- If omitted, defaults to `warn`\n\n**pattern** (simple format): Regex pattern to match\n- Used for simple single-condition rules\n- Matches against command (bash) or new_text (file)\n- Python regex syntax\n\n**Example:**\n```yaml\nevent: bash\npattern: rm\\s+-rf\n```\n\n### Advanced Format (Multiple Conditions)\n\nFor complex rules with multiple conditions:\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: warn-env-file-edits\nenabled: true\nevent: file\nconditions:\n  - field: file_path\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: \\.env$\n  - field: new_text\n    operator: contains\n    pattern: API_KEY\n---\n\nYou''re adding an API key to a .env file. Ensure this file is in .gitignore!\n```\n\n**Condition fields:**\n- `field`: Which field to check\n  - For bash: `command`\n  - For file: `file_path`, `new_text`, `old_text`, `content`\n- `operator`: How to match\n  - `regex_match`: Regex pattern matching\n  - `contains`: Substring check\n  - `equals`: Exact match\n  - `not_contains`: Substring must NOT be present\n  - `starts_with`: Prefix check\n  - `ends_with`: Suffix check\n- `pattern`: Pattern or string to match\n\n**All conditions must match for rule to trigger.**\n\n## Message Body\n\nThe markdown content after frontmatter is shown to Claude when the rule triggers.\n\n**Good messages:**\n- Explain what was detected\n- Explain why it''s problematic\n- Suggest alternatives or best practices\n- Use formatting for clarity (bold, lists, etc.)\n\n**Example:**\n```markdown\n⚠️ **Console.log detected!**\n\nYou''re adding console.log to production code.\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- Debug logs shouldn''t ship to production\n- Console.log can expose sensitive data\n- Impacts browser performance\n\n**Alternatives:**\n- Use a proper logging library\n- Remove before committing\n- Use conditional debug builds\n```\n\n## Event Type Guide\n\n### bash Events\n\nMatch Bash command patterns:\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: bash\npattern: sudo\\s+|rm\\s+-rf|chmod\\s+777\n---\n\nDangerous command detected!\n```\n\n**Common patterns:**\n- Dangerous commands: `rm\\s+-rf`, `dd\\s+if=`, `mkfs`\n- Privilege escalation: `sudo\\s+`, `su\\s+`\n- Permission issues: `chmod\\s+777`, `chown\\s+root`\n\n### file Events\n\nMatch Edit/Write/MultiEdit operations:\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: file\npattern: console\\.log\\(|eval\\(|innerHTML\\s*=\n---\n\nPotentially problematic code pattern detected!\n```\n\n**Match on different fields:**\n```markdown\n---\nevent: file\nconditions:\n  - field: file_path\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: \\.tsx?$\n  - field: new_text\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: console\\.log\\(\n---\n\nConsole.log in TypeScript file!\n```\n\n**Common patterns:**\n- Debug code: `console\\.log\\(`, `debugger`, `print\\(`\n- Security risks: `eval\\(`, `innerHTML\\s*=`, `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`\n- Sensitive files: `\\.env$`, `credentials`, `\\.pem$`\n- Generated files: `node_modules/`, `dist/`, `build/`\n\n### stop Events\n\nMatch when agent wants to stop (completion checks):\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: stop\npattern: .*\n---\n\nBefore stopping, verify:\n- [ ] Tests were run\n- [ ] Build succeeded\n- [ ] Documentation updated\n```\n\n**Use for:**\n- Reminders about required steps\n- Completion checklists\n- Process enforcement\n\n### prompt Events\n\nMatch user prompt content (advanced):\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: prompt\nconditions:\n  - field: user_prompt\n    operator: contains\n    pattern: deploy to production\n---\n\nProduction deployment checklist:\n- [ ] Tests passing?\n- [ ] Reviewed by team?\n- [ ] Monitoring ready?\n```\n\n## Pattern Writing Tips\n\n### Regex Basics\n\n**Literal characters:** Most characters match themselves\n- `rm` matches \"rm\"\n- `console.log` matches \"console.log\"\n\n**Special characters need escaping:**\n- `.` (any char) → `\\.` (literal dot)\n- `(` `)` → `\\(` `\\)` (literal parens)\n- `[` `]` → `\\[` `\\]` (literal brackets)\n\n**Common metacharacters:**\n- `\\s` - whitespace (space, tab, newline)\n- `\\d` - digit (0-9)\n- `\\w` - word character (a-z, A-Z, 0-9, _)\n- `.` - any character\n- `+` - one or more\n- `*` - zero or more\n- `?` - zero or one\n- `|` - OR\n\n**Examples:**\n```\nrm\\s+-rf         Matches: rm -rf, rm  -rf\nconsole\\.log\\(   Matches: console.log(\n(eval|exec)\\(    Matches: eval( or exec(\nchmod\\s+777      Matches: chmod 777, chmod  777\nAPI_KEY\\s*=      Matches: API_KEY=, API_KEY =\n```\n\n### Testing Patterns\n\nTest regex patterns before using:\n\n```bash\npython3 -c \"import re; print(re.search(r''your_pattern'', ''test text''))\"\n```\n\nOr use online regex testers (regex101.com with Python flavor).\n\n### Common Pitfalls\n\n**Too broad:**\n```yaml\npattern: log    # Matches \"log\", \"login\", \"dialog\", \"catalog\"\n```\nBetter: `console\\.log\\(|logger\\.`\n\n**Too specific:**\n```yaml\npattern: rm -rf /tmp  # Only matches exact path\n```\nBetter: `rm\\s+-rf`\n\n**Escaping issues:**\n- YAML quoted strings: `\"pattern\"` requires double backslashes `\\\\s`\n- YAML unquoted: `pattern: \\s` works as-is\n- **Recommendation**: Use unquoted patterns in YAML\n\n## File Organization\n\n**Location:** All rules in `.claude/` directory\n**Naming:** `.claude/hookify.{descriptive-name}.local.md`\n**Gitignore:** Add `.claude/*.local.md` to `.gitignore`\n\n**Good names:**\n- `hookify.dangerous-rm.local.md`\n- `hookify.console-log.local.md`\n- `hookify.require-tests.local.md`\n- `hookify.sensitive-files.local.md`\n\n**Bad names:**\n- `hookify.rule1.local.md` (not descriptive)\n- `hookify.md` (missing .local)\n- `danger.local.md` (missing hookify prefix)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Creating a Rule\n\n1. Identify unwanted behavior\n2. Determine which tool is involved (Bash, Edit, etc.)\n3. Choose event type (bash, file, stop, etc.)\n4. Write regex pattern\n5. Create `.claude/hookify.{name}.local.md` file in project root\n6. Test immediately - rules are read dynamically on next tool use\n\n### Refining a Rule\n\n1. Edit the `.local.md` file\n2. Adjust pattern or message\n3. Test immediately - changes take effect on next tool use\n\n### Disabling a Rule\n\n**Temporary:** Set `enabled: false` in frontmatter\n**Permanent:** Delete the `.local.md` file\n\n## Examples\n\nSee `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/examples/` for complete examples:\n- `dangerous-rm.local.md` - Block dangerous rm commands\n- `console-log-warning.local.md` - Warn about console.log\n- `sensitive-files-warning.local.md` - Warn about editing .env files\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Minimum viable rule:**\n```markdown\n---\nname: my-rule\nenabled: true\nevent: bash\npattern: dangerous_command\n---\n\nWarning message here\n```\n\n**Rule with conditions:**\n```markdown\n---\nname: my-rule\nenabled: true\nevent: file\nconditions:\n  - field: file_path\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: \\.ts$\n  - field: new_text\n    operator: contains\n    pattern: any\n---\n\nWarning message\n```\n\n**Event types:**\n- `bash` - Bash commands\n- `file` - File edits\n- `stop` - Completion checks\n- `prompt` - User input\n- `all` - All events\n\n**Field options:**\n- Bash: `command`\n- File: `file_path`, `new_text`, `old_text`, `content`\n- Prompt: `user_prompt`\n\n**Operators:**\n- `regex_match`, `contains`, `equals`, `not_contains`, `starts_with`, `ends_with`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:25:38.432Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents needing customized event handling and notification capabilities through markdown-based rule definitions.","zh":"非常适合需要自定义事件处理和通知功能的高级 AI 代理，通过基于 markdown 的规则定义来实现。","ja":"カスタムイベントハンドリングおよび通知機能を必要とする高度な AI エージェントに最適です。マークダウン ベースのルール定義を使用します。","ko":"고급 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 사용자 지정 이벤트 처리 및 알림 기능을 제공하며, 마크다운 기반 규칙 정의를 통해 구현할 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA avanzados que necesitan manejo de eventos personalizados y capacidades de notificación a través de definiciones de reglas basadas en markdown.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA avancés nécessitant une gestion d''événements personnalisée et des capacités de notification via des définitions de règles basées sur markdown.","de":"Perfekt für erweiterte KI-Agents, die benutzerdefinierte Ereignisverwaltung und Benachrichtigungsfunktionen über markdown-basierte Regeldefinitionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados que necessitam de tratamento de eventos personalizados e capacidades de notificação por meio de definições de regras baseadas em markdown.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, которым требуются индивидуальные обработчики событий и возможности уведомления через определения правил на основе markdown.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم الذين يحتاجون إلى معالجة أحداث مخصصة وقدرات الإشعار من خلال تعريفات القواعد القائمة على markdown."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define patterns and messages using YAML frontmatter and regex patterns, stored in `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` files, enabling advanced event-driven interactions with support for markdown formatting and warnings.","zh":"赋予代理定义使用 YAML 前置内容和正则表达式模式的模式和消息的能力，存储在 `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` 文件中，支持高级事件驱动交互，具有对马克다운格式和警告的支持。","ja":"エージェントが YAML フロントマターと正則表現パターンを使用してパターンとメッセージを定義する機能を提供します。`.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` ファイルに保存され、Markdown フォーマットと警告のサポートを備えた高度なイベント駆動型のやり取りが可能になります。","ko":"에이전트가 YAML 프론티어와 정규식 패턴을 사용하여 패턴과 메시지를 정의할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` 파일에 저장되며, 마크다운 형식 및 경고를 지원하는 고급 이벤트 驱动 상호 작용이 가능합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir patrones y mensajes utilizando frontmatter YAML y patrones regex, almacenados en archivos `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md`, lo que permite interacciones avanzadas basadas en eventos con soporte para formato de markdown y advertencias.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir des modèles et des messages en utilisant le frontmatter YAML et des modèles regex, stockés dans des fichiers `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md`, ce qui permet des interactions avancées basées sur les événements avec prise en charge du format markdown et des avertissements.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Muster und Nachrichten mithilfe von YAML-Frontmatter und Regex-Mustern zu definieren, die in Dateien `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` gespeichert sind, was erweiterte ereignisgesteuerte Interaktionen mit Unterstützung für Markdown-Formatierung und Warnungen ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir padrões e mensagens usando frontmatter YAML e padrões regex, armazenados em arquivos `.claude/hookify.{nome-da-regra}.local.md`, permitindo interações avançadas baseadas em eventos com suporte a formatação markdown e avisos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью определять шаблоны и сообщения с помощью YAML-заголовков и шаблонов regex, хранящихся в файлах `.claude/hookify.{имя-правила}.local.md`, что позволяет выполнять продвинутые событийные взаимодействия с поддержкой форматирования markdown и предупреждений.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تعريف الأنماط والرسائل باستخدام YAML ونمط regex، المخزنة في الملفات `.claude/hookify.{اسم-القاعدة}.local.md`، مما يتيح تفاعلات متقدمة مدفوعة بالأحداث مع دعم تنسيق markdown والتحذيرات."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining custom event handlers for bash, file, stop, prompt, or all events","Creating notification rules with complex regex patterns","Generating markdown-formatted messages with warnings and suggestions"],"zh":["为 bash、文件、停止、提示或所有事件定义自定义事件处理程序","使用复杂的正则表达式模式创建通知规则","生成带有警告和建议的 markdown 格式化消息"],"ja":["bash、ファイル、停止、プロンプト、またはすべてのイベントのカスタムイベントハンドラーを定義する","複雑な正則表現パターンを使用して通知ルールを作成する","警告と提案を含む Markdown 形式のメッセージを生成する"],"ko":["bash, 파일, 정지, 프롬프트 또는 모든 이벤트에 대한 사용자 지정 이벤트 핸들러 정의","複雑한 정규식 패턴을 사용하여 알림 규칙 생성","경고 및 제안을 포함하는 마크다운 형식의 메시지 생성"],"es":["Definir controladores de eventos personalizados para bash, archivo, detener, prompt o todos los eventos","Crear reglas de notificación con patrones regex complejos","Generar mensajes con formato markdown y advertencias y sugerencias"],"fr":["Définir des gestionnaires d''événements personnalisés pour bash, fichier, arrêter, invite ou tous les événements","Créer des règles de notification avec des modèles regex complexes","Générer des messages au format markdown avec des avertissements et des suggestions"],"de":["Definieren von benutzerdefinierten Ereignishandlern für bash, Datei, stoppen, Prompt oder alle Ereignisse","Erstellen von Benachrichtigungsregeln mit komplexen Regex-Mustern","Generieren von markdown-formatierten Nachrichten mit Warnungen und Vorschlägen"],"pt":["Definir manipuladores de eventos personalizados para bash, arquivo, parar, prompt ou todos os eventos","Criar regras de notificação com padrões regex complexos","Gerar mensagens formatadas em markdown com avisos e sugestões"],"ru":["Определить индивидуальные обработчики событий для bash, файла, остановки, приглашения или всех событий","Создать правила уведомления с сложными шаблонами regex","Генерировать сообщения, отформатированные в markdown, с предупреждениями и предложениями"],"ar":["تعريف معالجات أحداث مخصصة لمجموعة أوامر، ملف، إيقاف، سؤال أو جميع الأحداث","إنشاء قواعد الإشعار بنمط regex المعقد","توليد رسائل مع تنسيق markdown والتحذيرات والمقترحات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `.claude` directory for rule file storage","Limited to markdown files with YAML frontmatter","Dependent on regex pattern accuracy for effective rule triggering"],"zh":["需要 `.claude` 目录来存储规则文件","仅限于具有 YAML 前置内容的 markdown 文件","规则触发的有效性依赖于正则表达式模式的准确性"],"ja":["ルールファイルを保存するために `.claude` ディレクトリが必要","YAML フロントマターを含む Markdown ファイルのみに限定","ルールの有効なトリガーには正則表現パターンの正確さに依存"],"ko":["규칙 파일을 저장하기 위해 `.claude` 디렉토리가 필요","YAML 프론티어를 포함하는 마크다운 파일만 해당","규칙 트리거의 효과는 정규식 패턴의 정확도에 의존"],"es":["Requiere un directorio `.claude` para el almacenamiento de archivos de reglas","Limitado a archivos markdown con frontmatter YAML","Dependiente de la precisión de los patrones regex para un disparo efectivo de reglas"],"fr":["Nécessite un répertoire `.claude` pour le stockage de fichiers de règles","Limité aux fichiers markdown avec frontmatter YAML","Dépendant de la précision des modèles regex pour un déclenchement efficace des règles"],"de":["Benötigt ein Verzeichnis `.claude` für die Speicherung von Regeldateien","Begrenzt auf Markdown-Dateien mit YAML-Frontmatter","Abhängig von der Genauigkeit von Regex-Mustern für ein effektives Auslösen von Regeln"],"pt":["Requer diretório `.claude` para armazenamento de arquivos de regras","Limitado a arquivos markdown com frontmatter YAML","Dependente da precisão do padrão regex para disparo eficaz de regras"],"ru":["Требует директории `.claude` для хранения файлов правил","Ограничен файлами markdown с YAML-заголовками","Зависит от точности шаблона regex для эффективного срабатывания правил"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف `.claude` لتخزين ملفات القواعد","محدود بملفات markdown مع YAML","يعتمد على دقة نمط regex للتنفيذ الفعال للقواعد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":85}');
