,"de":["Erstellung von Mason-Brick-Vorlagen","Modifizierung von Strukturen und Variablen von Bricks","Entfernung von Bricks aus Projekten","Integration mit CI-Workflows","Testabdeckung für Bricks","Kompatibilität mit Flutter"],"pt":["Criação de novos bricks","Modificação de estrutura de bricks existentes","Remoção de bricks do projeto","Integração com fluxo de trabalho de CI","Estrutura de projeto organizada"],"ru":["Создание новых bricks","Изменение структуры существующих bricks","Удаление bricks из проекта","Интеграция с рабочим процессом CI","Организованная структура проекта"],"ar":["إنشاء حجارة جديدة","تعديل هيكل الحجارة الحالية","إزالة الحجارة من المشروع","التكامل مع عمليات العمل CI","هيكل مشروع منظم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Mason Brick模板","Flutter应用开发","模板开发技能","测试覆盖率","CI工作流集成","开发效率提高"],"ja":["Mason Brickテンプレート","Flutterアプリ開発","テンプレート開発スキル","テストカバレッジ","CIワークフロー統合","開発効率向上"],"ko":["메이슨 브릭 템플릿","플러터 애플리케이션 개발","템플릿 개발 스킬","테스트 커버리지","CI 워크플로 통합","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["plantilla de aplicaciones Flutter","ladrillos Mason","codificadores AI","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","Flutter","CI","pruebas automatizadas","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["modèle d''application Flutter","briques Mason","codeurs AI","développement d''applications mobiles","Flutter","CI","tests automatisés","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Flutter-Anwendungsvorlage","Mason-Bricks","AI-Coder","Mobile-Anwendungs-Entwicklung","Flutter","CI","automatisierte Tests","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["template mason brick","aplicativo flutter","codificação ai","criação de bricks","modificação de bricks","remoção de bricks","fluxo de trabalho de ci"],"ru":["шаблон mason brick","приложение flutter","кодирование ai","создание bricks","изменение bricks","удаление bricks","рабочий процесс ci"],"ar":["قالب ماسون بريك","تطبيق فلتر","ترميز ai","إنشاء حجارة","تعديل حجارة","إزالة حجارة","عمليات العمل سي"]}},"owner":"gsmlg-app","repo":"flutter-app-template","repoPath":"gsmlg-app/flutter-app-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"template-mason-brick","description":"Guide for creating, updating, or removing Mason bricks with corresponding tests and CI workflow (project)","bodyPreview":"# Mason Brick Development Skill\n\nThis skill guides the creation, modification, and removal of Mason bricks, ensuring test coverage and CI workflow integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\nTrigger this skill when:\n- Creating a new Mason brick template\n- Updating an existing brick''s structure or variables\n- Removing a brick from the project\n- User asks to \"create a brick\", \"add a mason template\", \"update brick\", or \"remove brick\"\n\n## Project Structure\n\nBricks are organized in three locations:\n\n```\nbricks/","body":"# Mason Brick Development Skill\n\nThis skill guides the creation, modification, and removal of Mason bricks, ensuring test coverage and CI workflow integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\nTrigger this skill when:\n- Creating a new Mason brick template\n- Updating an existing brick''s structure or variables\n- Removing a brick from the project\n- User asks to \"create a brick\", \"add a mason template\", \"update brick\", or \"remove brick\"\n\n## Project Structure\n\nBricks are organized in three locations:\n\n```\nbricks/                    # Mason template definitions\n├── brick_name/\n│   ├── brick.yaml         # Brick configuration and variables\n│   ├── __brick__/         # Template files with Mustache syntax\n│   └── hooks/             # Optional pre/post generation hooks\n\ntest_bricks/               # Brick tests (one folder per brick)\n├── brick_name/\n│   └── brick_name_test.dart\n\n.github/workflows/\n└── brick-test.yml         # Parallel CI jobs for each brick\n```\n\n## Creating a New Brick\n\n### Step 1: Create Brick Directory\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p bricks/new_brick/__brick__\n```\n\n### Step 2: Create brick.yaml\n\n```yaml\nname: new_brick\ndescription: Description of what this brick generates\nversion: 0.1.0+1\n\nenvironment:\n  mason: ^0.1.1\n\nvars:\n  name:\n    type: string\n    description: The name for the generated component\n    prompt: What is the name?\n\n  # Add more variables as needed\n  optional_var:\n    type: boolean\n    description: Optional feature flag\n    default: true\n```\n\n### Step 3: Create Template Files\n\nIn `__brick__/`, create files using Mustache syntax:\n\n```\n__brick__/\n├── {{name.snakeCase()}}/\n│   ├── lib/\n│   │   └── {{name.snakeCase()}}.dart\n│   ├── pubspec.yaml\n│   └── README.md\n```\n\nUse these Mustache helpers:\n- `{{name}}` - raw value\n- `{{name.snakeCase()}}` - snake_case\n- `{{name.pascalCase()}}` - PascalCase\n- `{{name.camelCase()}}` - camelCase\n- `{{name.paramCase()}}` - param-case\n- `{{#flag}}...{{/flag}}` - conditional block\n- `{{^flag}}...{{/flag}}` - inverted conditional\n\n### Step 4: Create Brick Test\n\nCreate `test_bricks/new_brick/new_brick_test.dart`:\n\n```dart\nimport ''dart:io'';\nimport ''package:mason/mason.dart'';\nimport ''package:path/path.dart'' as path;\nimport ''package:test/test.dart'';\n\nvoid main() {\n  group(''New Brick Tests'', () {\n    late Directory tempDir;\n\n    setUp(() async {\n      tempDir = await Directory.systemTemp.createTemp(''new_brick_test_'');\n    });\n\n    tearDown(() async {\n      if (await tempDir.exists()) {\n        await tempDir.delete(recursive: true);\n      }\n    });\n\n    test(''generates correct structure'', () async {\n      final brick = Brick.path(path.join(''..'', ''..'', ''bricks'', ''new_brick''));\n\n      final generator = await MasonGenerator.fromBrick(brick);\n      await generator.generate(\n        DirectoryGeneratorTarget(tempDir),\n        vars: {''name'': ''test_name''},\n      );\n\n      // Verify generated files exist\n      final file = File(path.join(tempDir.path, ''test_name'', ''pubspec.yaml''));\n      expect(await file.exists(), isTrue);\n    });\n\n    // Add more tests for different variable combinations\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### Step 5: Add Workflow Job\n\nAdd a new job to `.github/workflows/brick-test.yml`:\n\n```yaml\n  new-brick:\n    name: Test new_brick\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v6\n\n      - uses: flutter-actions/setup-flutter@v4\n\n      - name: Cache dependencies\n        uses: actions/cache@v5\n        with:\n          path: |\n            ~/.pub-cache\n            .dart_tool\n          key: ${{ runner.os }}-pub-${{ hashFiles(''**/pubspec.lock'') }}\n          restore-keys: ${{ runner.os }}-pub-\n\n      - name: Install tools\n        run: dart pub global activate melos\n\n      - name: Prepare project\n        run: |\n          melos run prepare\n          mason get\n\n      - name: Test new_brick brick\n        run: dart run test_bricks/new_brick/new_brick_test.dart\n```\n\n### Step 6: Register Brick\n\nAdd to root `mason.yaml`:\n\n```yaml\nbricks:\n  new_brick:\n    path: bricks/new_brick\n```\n\nThen run `mason get` to register.\n\n## Updating an Existing Brick\n\nWhen modifying a brick:\n\n1. Update `brick.yaml` if adding/removing variables\n2. Update template files in `__brick__/`\n3. **Update tests** in `test_bricks/brick_name/` to cover changes\n4. Run test locally: `dart run test_bricks/brick_name/brick_name_test.dart`\n5. Increment version in `brick.yaml`\n\n## Removing a Brick\n\nWhen removing a brick, update all three locations:\n\n1. Remove brick directory: `rm -rf bricks/brick_name`\n2. Remove test directory: `rm -rf test_bricks/brick_name`\n3. Remove workflow job from `.github/workflows/brick-test.yml`\n4. Remove from `mason.yaml`\n5. Update CLAUDE.md if the brick was documented\n\n## Testing Locally\n\n```bash\n# Register bricks\nmason get\n\n# Test a specific brick\ndart run test_bricks/brick_name/brick_name_test.dart\n\n# Test brick generation manually\nmason make brick_name -o /tmp/test_output --var1=value1\n```\n\n## Existing Bricks Reference\n\n| Brick | Purpose | Key Variables |\n|-------|---------|---------------|\n| `screen` | Flutter screen with routing | `name`, `folder`, `has_adaptive_scaffold` |\n| `widget` | Reusable widget | `name`, `type`, `folder` |\n| `simple_bloc` | Basic BLoC package | `name` |\n| `list_bloc` | List management BLoC | `name` |\n| `form_bloc` | Form validation BLoC | `name`, `field_names` |\n| `repository` | Data repository | `name` |\n| `api_client` | API client package | `package_name` |\n| `native_federation_plugin` | Federated native plugin | `name`, `package_prefix`, `support_*` |\n\n## Checklist\n\nWhen creating/updating a brick:\n\n- [ ] `brick.yaml` has name, description, version, and vars\n- [ ] Template files use correct Mustache syntax\n- [ ] Test file exists in `test_bricks/brick_name/`\n- [ ] Tests cover main generation paths\n- [ ] Workflow job added/updated in `brick-test.yml`\n- [ ] Brick registered in `mason.yaml`\n- [ ] Run `mason get` to verify registration\n- [ ] Run test locally before committing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:27:05.454Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Flutter Development Agents needing streamlined Mason brick template management and CI workflow integration.","zh":"非常适合需要简化Mason砖模板管理和CI工作流集成的Flutter开发代理。","ja":"Mason ブリック テンプレートの管理と CI ワークフロー統合を簡素化する必要がある Flutter 開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Mason 브릭 템플릿 관리 및 CI 워크플로 통합을 간소화해야 하는 Flutter 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Flutter que necesitan una gestión de plantillas de ladrillos Mason optimizada y una integración de flujo de trabajo de integración continua.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Flutter qui ont besoin d''une gestion de modèles de briques Mason rationalisée et d''une intégration de workflow de CI.","de":"Perfekt für Flutter-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine optimierte Mason-Backstein-Vorlagenverwaltung und eine CI-Workflow-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Flutter que necessitam de gerenciamento de modelo de tijolo Mason otimizado e integração de fluxo de trabalho de CI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Flutter, которым необходим упрощенный менеджмент шаблонов кирпичей Mason и интеграция с рабочим процессом CI.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير Flutter الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة قوالب طوب ماسون المتدفقة وتكامل تدفق العمل CI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, modify, and remove Mason bricks with test coverage and CI workflow integration, utilizing Flutter application templates and ensuring seamless project structure organization within the bricks/ directory.","zh":"赋予代理创建、修改和删除 Mason 砖的能力，具有测试覆盖和 CI 工作流集成，利用 Flutter 应用程序模板，确保砖/目录中的项目结构组织无缝。","ja":"エージェントが Mason ブリックを作成、変更、削除できるようにし、テストカバレッジと CI ワークフロー統合を実現し、Flutter アプリケーションテンプレートを利用し、bricks/ ディレクトリ内のプロジェクト構造の組織をシームレスに保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 Mason 브릭을 생성, 수정 및 제거할 수 있도록 하며, 테스트 커버리지 및 CI 워크플로 통합을 사용하여 Flutter 애플리케이션 템플릿을 활용하고, bricks/ 디렉토리 내의 프로젝트 구조 조직을 무결하게 유지합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, modificar y eliminar ladrillos Mason con cobertura de pruebas y integración de flujo de trabajo de CI, utilizando plantillas de aplicaciones Flutter y garantizando una organización de estructura de proyecto sin problemas dentro del directorio bricks/","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, de modifier et de supprimer des briques Mason avec une couverture de tests et une intégration de workflow de CI, en utilisant des modèles d''applications Flutter et en garantissant une organisation de structure de projet sans problème au sein du répertoire bricks/","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Mason-Steine zu erstellen, zu ändern und zu entfernen, mit Testabdeckung und CI-Workflow-Integration, unter Verwendung von Flutter-Anwendungsvorlagen und sicherstellen einer reibungslosen Projektstrukturorganisation innerhalb des Verzeichnisses bricks/","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar, modificar e remover tijolos Mason com cobertura de teste e integração de fluxo de trabalho de CI, utilizando modelos de aplicativos Flutter e garantindo organização de estrutura de projeto sem problemas dentro do diretório bricks/","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать, изменять и удалять кирпичи Mason с покрытием тестами и интеграцией с рабочим процессом CI, используя шаблоны приложений Flutter и обеспечивая бесперебойную организацию структуры проекта внутри директории bricks/","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء وتعديل وإزالة طوب ماسون مع تغطية الاختبار وتكامل تدفق العمل CI، باستخدام قوالب تطبيقات Flutter وضمان تنظيم هيكل المشروع دون مشاكل داخل دليل bricks/"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new Mason brick templates for Flutter applications","Updating existing brick structures or variables while maintaining test coverage","Removing bricks from projects while ensuring CI workflow integrity","Automating brick template generation based on user requests"],"zh":["为Flutter应用程序创建新的Mason砖模板","更新现有的砖结构或变量，同时保持测试覆盖","从项目中删除砖块，同时确保CI工作流的完整性","基于用户请求自动生成砖模板"],"ja":["Flutterアプリケーションのための新しいMasonブリックテンプレートを作成する","テストカバレッジを維持しながら、既存のブリック構造または変数を更新する","CIワークフローの完全性を確保しながら、プロジェクトからブリックを削除する","ユーザーのリクエストに基づいてブリックテンプレートを自動生成する"],"ko":["Flutter 애플리케이션을 위한 새로운 Mason 브릭 템플릿을 생성합니다.","테스트 커버리지를 유지하면서 기존의 브릭 구조 또는 변수를 업데이트합니다.","CI 워크플로의 무결성을 보장하면서 프로젝트에서 브릭을 제거합니다.","사용자 요청에 따라 브릭 템플릿을 자동으로 생성합니다."],"es":["Crear nuevos modelos de ladrillos Mason para aplicaciones Flutter","Actualizar estructuras o variables de ladrillos existentes manteniendo la cobertura de pruebas","Eliminar ladrillos de proyectos garantizando la integridad del flujo de trabajo de CI","Automatizar la generación de plantillas de ladrillos basada en solicitudes de usuario"],"fr":["Créer de nouveaux modèles de briques Mason pour des applications Flutter","Mettre à jour des structures ou des variables de briques existantes en maintenant la couverture de tests","Supprimer des briques de projets en garantissant l''intégrité du workflow de CI","Automatiser la génération de modèles de briques en fonction des demandes des utilisateurs"],"de":["Erstellen neuer Mason-Backstein-Vorlagen für Flutter-Anwendungen","Aktualisieren bestehender Backsteinstrukturen oder -variablen unter Beibehaltung der Testabdeckung","Entfernen von Backsteinen aus Projekten unter Gewährleistung der CI-Workflow-Integrität","Automatisieren der Backstein-Vorlagenerzeugung basierend auf Benutzeranfragen"],"pt":["Criação de novos modelos de tijolo Mason para aplicações Flutter","Atualização de estruturas de tijolo existentes ou variáveis enquanto mantém a cobertura de teste","Remoção de tijolos de projetos enquanto garante a integridade do fluxo de trabalho de CI","Automação da geração de modelos de tijolo com base em solicitações de usuário"],"ru":["Создание новых шаблонов кирпичей Mason для приложений Flutter","Обновление существующих структур кирпичей или переменных при сохранении покрытия тестами","Удаление кирпичей из проектов при обеспечении целостности рабочего процесса CI","Автоматизация генерации шаблонов кирпичей на основе запросов пользователя"],"ar":["إنشاء قوالب طوب ماسون جديدة لتطبيقات Flutter","تحديث هياكل الطوب الحالية أو المتغيرات مع الحفاظ على تغطية الاختبار","إزالة الطوب من المشاريع مع ضمان سلامة تدفق العمل CI","تأتمة توليد قوالب الطوب بناءً على طلبات المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Flutter application setup","Limited to Mason brick development and management","Needs CI workflow configuration for integration"],"zh":["需要Flutter应用程序设置","仅限Mason砖开发和管理","需要CI工作流配置以实现集成"],"ja":["Flutterアプリケーションの設定が必要","Masonブリックの開発と管理のみ","統合のためにCIワークフローの構成が必要"],"ko":["Flutter 애플리케이션 설정이 필요합니다.","Mason 브릭 개발 및 관리에만 제한됩니다.","통합을 위해 CI 워크플로 구성이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere configuración de aplicación Flutter","Limitado al desarrollo y la gestión de ladrillos Mason","Necesita configuración de flujo de trabajo de CI para integración"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''application Flutter","Limité au développement et à la gestion de briques Mason","Nécessite une configuration de workflow de CI pour l''intégration"],"de":["Benötigt Flutter-Anwendungskonfiguration","Begrenzt auf Mason-Backstein-Entwicklung und -verwaltung","Benötigt CI-Workflow-Konfiguration für Integration"],"pt":["Exige configuração de aplicativo Flutter","Limitado ao desenvolvimento e gerenciamento de tijolo Mason","Necessita de configuração de fluxo de trabalho de CI para integração"],"ru":["Требует настройки приложения Flutter","Ограничен разработкой и управлением кирпичами Mason","Требует конфигурации рабочего процесса CI для интеграции"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تطبيق Flutter","محدود بتطوير وإدارة طوب ماسون","يحتاج إلى تكوين تدفق العمل CI للتكامل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
