e habilidades","Manter habilidades bem testadas e documentadas"],"ru":["Вклад навыков в упстрим-репозиторий","Улучшение командной работы","Обмен знаниями и техниками","Следование руководству по написанию навыков","Поддержание навыков в хорошем состоянии и документации"],"ar":["المساهمة في المهارات للمستودع الرئيسي","تحسين التعاون الفريق","مشاركة المعارف والتقنيات","اتباع إرشادات كتابة المهارات","الحفاظ على المهارات جيدة الاختبار والتوثيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码共享","团队协作","代码质量","共享技能","个人技能","代码开发","上游仓库"],"ja":["コード共有","チームコラボレーション","コード品質","スキルの共有","個人スキル","コード開発","アップストリームリポジトリ"],"ko":["코드 공유","팀 협력","코드 품질","스킬 공유","개인 스킬","코드 개발","업스트림 리포지토리"],"es":["compartir habilidades de desarrollo","contribuir al repositorio","flujo de trabajo de contribución","mejores prácticas de desarrollo","desarrollo colaborativo","repositorio upstream"],"fr":["partager des compétences de développement","contribuer au référentiel","flux de travail de contribution","meilleures pratiques de développement","développement collaboratif","référentiel upstream"],"de":["Teilen von Entwicklungsfähigkeiten","Beitrag zum Repository","Arbeitsablauf der Beiträge","besten Praktiken der Entwicklung","kollaborative Entwicklung","Upstream-Repository"],"pt":["compartilhamento de habilidades","repositórios upstream","colaboração em equipe","desenvolvimento de habilidades","documentação de habilidades","teste de habilidades"],"ru":["обмен навыками","упстрим-репозиторий","командная работа","развитие навыков","документация навыков","тестирование навыков"],"ar":["مشاركة المهارات","المستودع الرئيسي","التعاون الفريق","تنمية المهارات","توثيق المهارات","اختبار المهارات"]}},"owner":"Blurjp","repo":"ImagePrepMCP","repoPath":"Blurjp/ImagePrepMCP","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Sharing Skills","description":"Contribute skills back to upstream via branch and PR","version":"2.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Sharing Skills\n\n## Overview\n\nContribute skills from your local branch back to the upstream repository.\n\n**Workflow:** Branch → Edit/Create skill → Commit → Push → PR\n\n## When to Share\n\n**Share when:**\n- Skill applies broadly (not project-specific)\n- Pattern/technique others would benefit from\n- Well-tested and documented\n- Follows skills/meta/writing-skills guidelines\n\n**Keep personal when:**\n- Project-specific or organization-specific\n- Experimental or unstable\n- Contains sensitive informatio","body":"# Sharing Skills\n\n## Overview\n\nContribute skills from your local branch back to the upstream repository.\n\n**Workflow:** Branch → Edit/Create skill → Commit → Push → PR\n\n## When to Share\n\n**Share when:**\n- Skill applies broadly (not project-specific)\n- Pattern/technique others would benefit from\n- Well-tested and documented\n- Follows skills/meta/writing-skills guidelines\n\n**Keep personal when:**\n- Project-specific or organization-specific\n- Experimental or unstable\n- Contains sensitive information\n- Too narrow/niche for general use\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `gh` CLI installed and authenticated\n- Working directory is `~/.config/superpowers/skills/` (your local clone)\n- Skill has been tested (see skills/meta/writing-skills for TDD process)\n\n## Sharing Workflow\n\n### 1. Ensure You''re on Main and Synced\n\n```bash\ncd ~/.config/superpowers/skills/\ngit checkout main\ngit pull upstream main\ngit push origin main  # Push to your fork\n```\n\n### 2. Create Feature Branch\n\n```bash\n# Branch name: add-skillname-skill\nskill_name=\"your-skill-name\"\ngit checkout -b \"add-${skill_name}-skill\"\n```\n\n### 3. Create or Edit Skill\n\n```bash\n# Work on your skill in skills/\n# Create new skill or edit existing one\n# Skill should be in skills/category/skill-name/SKILL.md\n```\n\n### 4. Commit Changes\n\n```bash\n# Add and commit\ngit add skills/your-skill-name/\ngit commit -m \"Add ${skill_name} skill\n\n$(cat <<''EOF''\nBrief description of what this skill does and why it''s useful.\n\nTested with: [describe testing approach]\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n### 5. Push to Your Fork\n\n```bash\ngit push -u origin \"add-${skill_name}-skill\"\n```\n\n### 6. Create Pull Request\n\n```bash\n# Create PR to upstream using gh CLI\ngh pr create \\\n  --repo upstream-org/upstream-repo \\\n  --title \"Add ${skill_name} skill\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\nBrief description of the skill and what problem it solves.\n\n## Testing\nDescribe how you tested this skill (pressure scenarios, baseline tests, etc.).\n\n## Context\nAny additional context about why this skill is needed and how it should be used.\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n## Complete Example\n\nHere''s a complete example of sharing a skill called \"async-patterns\":\n\n```bash\n# 1. Sync with upstream\ncd ~/.config/superpowers/skills/\ngit checkout main\ngit pull upstream main\ngit push origin main\n\n# 2. Create branch\ngit checkout -b \"add-async-patterns-skill\"\n\n# 3. Create/edit the skill\n# (Work on skills/async-patterns/SKILL.md)\n\n# 4. Commit\ngit add skills/async-patterns/\ngit commit -m \"Add async-patterns skill\n\nPatterns for handling asynchronous operations in tests and application code.\n\nTested with: Multiple pressure scenarios testing agent compliance.\"\n\n# 5. Push\ngit push -u origin \"add-async-patterns-skill\"\n\n# 6. Create PR\ngh pr create \\\n  --repo upstream-org/upstream-repo \\\n  --title \"Add async-patterns skill\" \\\n  --body \"## Summary\nPatterns for handling asynchronous operations correctly in tests and application code.\n\n## Testing\nTested with multiple application scenarios. Agents successfully apply patterns to new code.\n\n## Context\nAddresses common async pitfalls like race conditions, improper error handling, and timing issues.\"\n```\n\n## After PR is Merged\n\nOnce your PR is merged:\n\n1. Sync your local main branch:\n```bash\ncd ~/.config/superpowers/skills/\ngit checkout main\ngit pull upstream main\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n2. Delete the feature branch:\n```bash\ngit branch -d \"add-${skill_name}-skill\"\ngit push origin --delete \"add-${skill_name}-skill\"\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**\"gh: command not found\"**\n- Install GitHub CLI: https://cli.github.com/\n- Authenticate: `gh auth login`\n\n**\"Permission denied (publickey)\"**\n- Check SSH keys: `gh auth status`\n- Set up SSH: https://docs.github.com/en/authentication\n\n**\"Skill already exists\"**\n- You''re creating a modified version\n- Consider different skill name or coordinate with the skill''s maintainer\n\n**PR merge conflicts**\n- Rebase on latest upstream: `git fetch upstream && git rebase upstream/main`\n- Resolve conflicts\n- Force push: `git push -f origin your-branch`\n\n## Multi-Skill Contributions\n\n**Do NOT batch multiple skills in one PR.**\n\nEach skill should:\n- Have its own feature branch\n- Have its own PR\n- Be independently reviewable\n\n**Why?** Individual skills can be reviewed, iterated, and merged independently.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **skills/meta/writing-skills** - How to create well-tested skills\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:27:40.620Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Collaborative AI Agents needing streamlined skill contribution workflows.","zh":"适用于需要简化技能贡献工作流的协作AI代理。","ja":"コラボレーションAIエージェントがスキル貢献ワークフローを簡素化する必要がある場合に適しています。","ko":"스킬 기여 워크플로를 간소화해야 하는 협력 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Colaborativos que necesitan flujos de trabajo de contribución de habilidades optimizados.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''IA Collaboratifs ayant besoin de flux de travail de contribution de compétences rationalisés.","de":"Ideal für kollaborierende KI-Agenten, die optimierte Fertigkeitsbeitrags-Workflows benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Colaborativos que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho de contribuição de habilidades otimizados.","ru":"Идеально для коллаборативных агентов ИИ, которым необходимы оптимизированные рабочие процессы вклада навыков.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكلاء الذكية التعاونية التي تحتاج إلى سير عمل مساهمات المهارات المُتدفق"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to contribute skills back to the upstream repository using Git workflows, including branching, committing, and pushing, while following skills/meta/writing-skills guidelines for well-tested and documented skills.","zh":"使代理能够使用Git工作流将技能贡献回上游存储库，包括分支、提交和推送，同时遵循技能/元数据/编写技能指南，确保技能经过充分测试和文档化。","ja":"エージェントがGitワークフローを使用してスキルを上流リポジトリに貢献できるようにし、ブランチ、コミット、プッシュを含み、スキル/メタデータ/スキル書き込みガイドラインに従って、十分にテストされ、文書化されたスキルを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 Git 워크플로를 사용하여 스킬을 업스트림 저장소에 기여할 수 있도록 하며, 분기, 커밋, 푸시를 포함하며, 스킬/메타데이터/스킬 작성 가이드라인을 준수하여 충분히 테스트되고 문서화된 스킬을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a contribuir habilidades al repositorio upstream utilizando flujos de trabajo de Git, incluyendo ramificación, confirmación y envío, mientras sigue las pautas de habilidades/meta/escritura-de-habilidades para habilidades bien probadas y documentadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de contribuer des compétences au référentiel en amont en utilisant des flux de travail Git, y compris la création de branches, la validation et la publication, tout en suivant les directives de compétences/meta/écriture-de-compétences pour des compétences bien testées et documentées.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Fertigkeiten an das Upstream-Repository mithilfe von Git-Workflows beizutragen, einschließlich Verzweigung, Commit und Push, während sie den Richtlinien für Fertigkeiten/Meta/Schreiben-von-Fertigkeiten für gut getestete und dokumentierte Fertigkeiten folgen.","pt":"Habilita agentes a contribuir habilidades de volta ao repositório upstream usando fluxos de trabalho Git, incluindo ramificação, confirmação e envio, seguindo as diretrizes skills/meta/writing-skills para habilidades bem testadas e documentadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью вносить вклад навыки обратно в репозиторий upstream, используя рабочие процессы Git, включая ветвление, фиксацию и отправку, при этом следуя рекомендациям skills/meta/writing-skills для хорошо протестированных и задокументированных навыков.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من المساهمة في المهارات إلى مستودع Upstream باستخدام سير عمل Git، بما في ذلك التفرع والالتزام والإرسال، مع اتباع إرشادات skills/meta/writing-skills للمهارات التي تم اختبارها وتوثيقها جيدًا"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating skill sharing for broadly applicable techniques","Generating pull requests for new skills","Documenting skills for community benefit"],"zh":["自动化广泛适用的技术的技能共享","为新技能生成拉取请求","为社区利益记录技能"],"ja":["広く適用可能な技術のスキル共有を自動化する","新しいスキルのプルリクエストを生成する","コミュニティの利益のためにスキルを文書化する"],"ko":["광범위하게 적용 가능한 기술의 스킬 공유를 자동화하는 것","새로운 스킬에 대한 풀 리퀘스트 생성","커뮤니티의 이익을 위해 스킬을 문서화하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar el intercambio de habilidades para técnicas de amplia aplicación","Generar solicitudes de extracción para nuevas habilidades","Documentar habilidades para beneficio de la comunidad"],"fr":["Automatiser le partage de compétences pour des techniques largement applicables","Générer des demandes d''extraction pour de nouvelles compétences","Documenter des compétences pour le bénéfice de la communauté"],"de":["Automatisieren des Fertigkeitsaustauschs für breit anwendbare Techniken","Erstellen von Pull-Anfragen für neue Fertigkeiten","Dokumentieren von Fertigkeiten zum Nutzen der Community"],"pt":["Automatizar a partilha de habilidades para técnicas de aplicação ampla","Gerar pedidos de pull para novas habilidades","Documentar habilidades para benefício da comunidade"],"ru":["Автоматизация обмена навыками для широко применимых методов","Генерация запросов на включение новых навыков","Документирование навыков для пользы сообщества"],"ar":["تحويل المشاركة التلقائي للمهارات لأسلوب واسع النطاق","توليد طلبات السحب للمهارات الجديدة","توثيق المهارات لمصلحة المجتمع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git version control system access","Skills must be well-tested and documented","Excludes project-specific or sensitive information"],"zh":["需要Git版本控制系统访问","技能必须经过充分测试和文档化","排除项目特定或敏感信息"],"ja":["Gitバージョン管理システムへのアクセスが必要","スキルは十分にテストされ、文書化されている必要がある","プロジェクト固有の情報や機密情報は除外される"],"ko":["Git 버전 관리 시스템 액세스가 필요함","스킬은 충분히 테스트되고 문서화되어야 함","프로젝트 특정 또는 민감한 정보는 제외됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de control de versiones Git","Las habilidades deben estar bien probadas y documentadas","Excluye información específica del proyecto o sensible"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de contrôle de version Git","Les compétences doivent être bien testées et documentées","Exclut les informations spécifiques au projet ou sensibles"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Git-Versionierungssystem","Fertigkeiten müssen gut getestet und dokumentiert sein","Schließt projektspezifische oder sensible Informationen aus"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de controle de versão Git","As habilidades devem ser bem testadas e documentadas","Exclui informações específicas do projeto ou sensíveis"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к системе контроля версий Git","Навыки должны быть хорошо протестированы и задокументированы","Исключает проектно-специфическую или чувствительную информацию"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام التحكم في الإصدار Git","يجب أن تكون المهارات مدروسة جيدًا ومتوثقة","استبعاد المعلومات المحددة للمشروع أو الحساسة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
