Definição de projeto","Análise de requisitos"],"ru":["Создание обзора архитектуры","Превращение требований в архитектурные решения","Документация ADR","Определение проекта","Анализ требований"],"ar":["إنشاء نظرة عامة على الهندسة","تحويل المتطلبات إلى قرارات هندسية","توثيق ADR","تحديد المشروع","تحليل المتطلبات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["架构设计","项目管理","技术决策","ADR文档","软件开发","系统设计"],"ja":["アーキテクチャ設計","プロジェクト管理","技術的決定","ADRドキュメント","ソフトウェア開発","システム設計"],"ko":["아키텍처 디자인","프로젝트 관리","기술적 결정","ADR 문서","소프트웨어 개발","시스템 디자인"],"es":["diseñador de arquitectura","arquitectura de software","requisitos de proyecto","documentación ADR","decisiones informadas","visión general de la arquitectura"],"fr":["conception d''architecture","architecture logicielle","exigences de projet","documentation ADR","décisions éclairées","vue d''ensemble de l''architecture"],"de":["Architektur-Designer","Software-Architektur","Projekterfordernisse","ADR-Dokumentation","informierte Entscheidungen","Übersicht der Architektur"],"pt":["arquitetura de software","ADR","requisitos de projeto","decisões arquiteturais","visão geral da arquitetura","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["архитектура программного обеспечения","ADR","требования проекта","архитектурные решения","обзор архитектуры","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["هندسة البرمجيات","ADR","متطلبات المشروع","قرارات هندسية","نظرة عامة على الهندسة","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"edumesones","repo":"azure--demo","repoPath":"edumesones/azure--demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"architecture-designer","description":"Define technical architecture and create ADRs. Triggers on Help me define the architecture, Define architecture, Lets design the architecture.","bodyPreview":"# Architecture Designer (Fase 0)\n\nTransform project requirements into concrete architectural decisions with proper ADR documentation.\n\n## Triggers\n\n- \"Help me define the architecture\"\n- \"Define architecture\"\n- \"Let''s design the architecture\"\n- \"Help me with technical architecture\"\n- `/architecture`\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `docs/project.md` should exist with project definition\n- If not exists, suggest: \"Let''s first interview about the project\"\n\n## Purpose\n\nCreate:\n1. **Architecture overview** in `do","body":"# Architecture Designer (Fase 0)\n\nTransform project requirements into concrete architectural decisions with proper ADR documentation.\n\n## Triggers\n\n- \"Help me define the architecture\"\n- \"Define architecture\"\n- \"Let''s design the architecture\"\n- \"Help me with technical architecture\"\n- `/architecture`\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `docs/project.md` should exist with project definition\n- If not exists, suggest: \"Let''s first interview about the project\"\n\n## Purpose\n\nCreate:\n1. **Architecture overview** in `docs/architecture/_index.md`\n2. **ADRs** (Architecture Decision Records) in `docs/decisions/`\n3. **Technical foundation** for feature development\n\n## Process\n\n### 1. Read Project Context\n\n```bash\n# Read project definition\ncat docs/project.md\n\n# Check existing architecture docs\nls -la docs/architecture/ 2>/dev/null\nls -la docs/decisions/ 2>/dev/null\n```\n\n### 2. Identify Key Decisions\n\nBased on project.md, identify decisions needed:\n\n| Category | Typical Decisions |\n|----------|-------------------|\n| **Language/Runtime** | Python, Node, Go, Rust |\n| **Framework** | FastAPI, Django, Express, Next.js |\n| **Database** | PostgreSQL, MongoDB, SQLite, Redis |\n| **Authentication** | JWT, OAuth, Session, API Keys |\n| **Hosting** | AWS, GCP, Azure, Vercel, Self-hosted |\n| **API Style** | REST, GraphQL, gRPC |\n| **Frontend** | React, Vue, Gradio, CLI |\n| **Caching** | Redis, Memcached, In-memory |\n| **Queue/Async** | Celery, RQ, SQS, None |\n| **Monitoring** | CloudWatch, Datadog, Prometheus |\n\n### 3. Interview for Each Decision\n\nFor each major decision, ask:\n\n```\n\"For [CATEGORY], I see a few options:\n\nA) [Option A] - [Pros: X, Y] [Cons: Z]\nB) [Option B] - [Pros: X, Y] [Cons: Z]\nC) [Option C] - [Pros: X, Y] [Cons: Z]\n\nBased on your project (MVP timeline, team size, scale needs),\nI''d recommend [X] because [reason].\n\nWhat''s your preference?\"\n```\n\n### 4. Create ADRs\n\nFor each decision, create `docs/decisions/ADR-NNN-title.md`\n\n### 5. Create Architecture Overview\n\nUpdate `docs/architecture/_index.md` with:\n- System diagram\n- Tech stack table linking to ADRs\n- Project structure\n- Key patterns\n\n### 6. Interview Rules\n\n```\nARCHITECTURE INTERVIEW RULES\n\n1. Always provide options with trade-offs\n   Never ask \"what database?\" - ask \"PostgreSQL or MongoDB? Here''s why...\"\n\n2. Make recommendations based on project context\n   \"Given your MVP timeline, I recommend X\"\n\n3. Create ADR immediately after each decision\n   Don''t wait until the end\n\n4. Challenge over-engineering\n   \"Do you really need Kubernetes for MVP? ECS is simpler.\"\n\n5. Document the WHY, not just the WHAT\n   Future you will thank present you\n```\n\n### 7. Completion Check\n\nBefore ending, verify:\n- [ ] All major categories have decisions\n- [ ] Each decision has an ADR\n- [ ] Architecture overview exists\n- [ ] Project structure is defined\n- [ ] No conflicting decisions\n\n### 8. Handoff\n\nWhen complete:\n\n```\nArchitecture defined. Created:\n- docs/architecture/_index.md (overview)\n- docs/decisions/ADR-001-*.md through ADR-00N-*.md\n\nNext step:\n\"Define MVP features\" -> Creates feature folders ready for implementation\n\nOr: \"Let''s start with the first feature\"\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:27:50.702Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Technical Agents requiring structured architecture design and ADR documentation capabilities.","zh":"适合需要结构化架构设计和ADR文档功能的技术代理","ja":"技術エージェントが構造化されたアーキテクチャ設計とADRドキュメント機能を必要とする場合に適しています","ko":"구조화된 아키텍처 설계 및 ADR 문서 기능을 필요로 하는 기술 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes Técnicos que requieren diseño de arquitectura estructurada y capacidades de documentación de ADR.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents techniques nécessitant une conception d''architecture structurée et des capacités de documentation ADR.","de":"Ideal für technische Agenten, die ein strukturiertes Architekturentwurf und ADR-Dokumentationsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Técnicos que requerem design de arquitetura estruturada e capacidades de documentação de ADR.","ru":"Идеально для технических агентов, требующих структурированного архитектурного проектирования и возможностей документирования ADR.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تقني يتطلب تصميم بنية موحد وقدرات توثيق ADR."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform project requirements into concrete architectural decisions with proper ADR documentation, utilizing triggers like ''Help me define the architecture'' and generating architecture overviews in markdown format, stored in files like `docs/architecture.md`.","zh":"赋予代理将项目需求转化为具体的架构决策，并利用诸如''帮助我定义架构''的触发器生成markdown格式的架构概述，并将其存储在诸如docs/architecture.md的文件中","ja":"エージェントがプロジェクトの要件を具体的なアーキテクチャの決定に変換し、''アーキテクチャを定義してください''などのトリガーを使用してマークダウン形式のアーキテクチャの概要を生成し、docs/architecture.mdなどのファイルに保存します","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트 요구 사항을 구체적인 아키텍처 quyết策으로 변환하고 ''아키텍처를 정의하십시오''와 같은 트리거를 사용하여 마크다운 형식의 아키텍처 개요를 생성하여 docs/architecture.md와 같은 파일에 저장합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar los requisitos del proyecto en decisiones arquitectónicas concretas con la documentación ADR adecuada, utilizando desencadenantes como ''Ayúdame a definir la arquitectura'' y generando vistas generales de la arquitectura en formato markdown, almacenadas en archivos como docs/arquitectura.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer les exigences du projet en décisions architecturales concrètes avec une documentation ADR appropriée, en utilisant des déclencheurs tels que ''Aidez-moi à définir l''architecture'' et en générant des vues d''ensemble de l''architecture au format markdown, stockées dans des fichiers tels que docs/architecture.md.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Projektanforderungen in konkrete architektonische Entscheidungen mit geeigneter ADR-Dokumentation umzuwandeln, indem Trigger wie ''Helfen Sie mir, die Architektur zu definieren'' verwendet werden und Architekturübersichten im Markdown-Format generiert werden, die in Dateien wie docs/architektur.md gespeichert sind.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar os requisitos do projeto em decisões arquiteturais concretas com documentação de ADR adequada, utilizando gatilhos como ''Ajude-me a definir a arquitetura'' e gerando visões gerais da arquitetura em formato markdown, armazenadas em arquivos como docs/arquitetura.md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать требования проекта в конкретные архитектурные решения с правильной документацией ADR, используя триггеры, такие как ''Помогите мне определить архитектуру'' и генерируя обзоры архитектуры в формате markdown, хранящиеся в файлах, таких как docs/architecture.md.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تحويل متطلبات المشروع إلى قرارات معمارية ملموسة مع توثيق ADR適当، باستخدام مسارات مثل ''ساعدني في تعريف البنية'' وتوليد نظرة عامة على البنية بформات markdown، مخزنة في ملفات مثل docs/بنية.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining technical architecture for new projects","Generating ADR documentation for existing projects","Creating architecture overviews based on project definitions in `docs/project.md`"],"zh":["为新项目定义技术架构","为现有项目生成ADR文档","根据docs/project.md中的项目定义创建架构概述"],"ja":["新しいプロジェクトの技術アーキテクチャを定義する","既存のプロジェクトのADRドキュメントを生成する","docs/project.md内のプロジェクト定義に基づいてアーキテクチャの概要を作成する"],"ko":["새로운 프로젝트의 기술 아키텍처를 정의하는 것","기존 프로젝트의 ADR 문서를 생성하는 것","docs/project.md에 있는 프로젝트 정의를 기반으로 아키텍처 개요를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Definir la arquitectura técnica para nuevos proyectos","Generar documentación de ADR para proyectos existentes","Crear vistas generales de la arquitectura basadas en definiciones de proyecto en docs/proyecto.md"],"fr":["Définir l''architecture technique pour les nouveaux projets","Générer la documentation ADR pour les projets existants","Créer des vues d''ensemble de l''architecture basées sur les définitions de projet dans docs/projet.md"],"de":["Definieren der technischen Architektur für neue Projekte","Erstellen von ADR-Dokumentation für bestehende Projekte","Erstellen von Architekturübersichten basierend auf Projektdaten in docs/projekt.md"],"pt":["Definir arquitetura técnica para novos projetos","Gerar documentação de ADR para projetos existentes","Criar visões gerais da arquitetura com base nas definições do projeto em docs/projeto.md"],"ru":["Определение технической архитектуры для новых проектов","Генерация документации ADR для существующих проектов","Создание обзоров архитектуры на основе определений проекта в docs/projeto.md"],"ar":["تعريف البنية الفنية للمشاريع الجديدة","توليد توثيق ADR للمشاريع الحالية","إنشاء نظرة عامة على البنية بناءً على تعريفات المشروع في docs/مشروع.md"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires project definition in `docs/project.md`","Limited to markdown format for documentation"],"zh":["需要在docs/project.md中定义项目","仅限于markdown格式的文档"],"ja":["docs/project.md内でプロジェクトを定義する必要がある","ドキュメントはマークダウン形式のみ"],"ko":["docs/project.md에 프로젝트를 정의해야 함","문서는 마크다운 형식만 지원"],"es":["Requiere definición de proyecto en docs/proyecto.md","Limitado al formato markdown para la documentación"],"fr":["Nécessite une définition de projet dans docs/projet.md","Limité au format markdown pour la documentation"],"de":["Benötigt eine Projektdaten in docs/projekt.md","Begrenzt auf Markdown-Format für die Dokumentation"],"pt":["Requer definição do projeto em docs/projeto.md","Limitado ao formato markdown para documentação"],"ru":["Требует определения проекта в docs/projeto.md","Ограничен форматом markdown для документации"],"ar":["يتطلب تعريف المشروع في docs/مشروع.md","محدود بформات markdown للتوثيق"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
