un flujo de trabajo estandarizado","Compatibilidad con PWA y soporte offline"],"fr":["Automatisation du flux de travail de mise à jour de la page de destination","Capture d''écrans et traitement d''images","Mises à jour HTML et déploiement","Consolidation de processus en un flux de travail standardisé","Compatibilité avec PWA et support hors ligne"],"de":["Automatisierung des Workflows für die Aktualisierung der Landingpage","Screenshot-Erfassung und Bildverarbeitung","HTML-Aktualisierungen und Implementierung","Konsolidierung von Prozessen in einem standardisierten Workflow","Kompatibilität mit PWA und Offline-Unterstützung"],"pt":["Automatização do fluxo de trabalho de atualização da página de destino","Consolidação de captura de tela, processamento de imagem e atualizações de HTML","Implantação padrão","Suporte offline","PWA com funcionalidades avançadas"],"ru":["Автоматизация процесса обновления посадочной страницы","Объединение захвата экрана, обработки изображений и обновлений HTML","Стандартизированное развертывание","Поддержка offline","PWA с расширенными функциями"],"ar":["توفير الوقت من خلال توفير عملية تحديث صفحة الهبوط","توحيد撮影 الشاشة ومعالجة الصور وتحديثات HTML","التنفيذ المعياري","دعم离线","PWA مع ميزات متقدمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["landing-page-marketing","AI","PWA","HTML","API","SEO"],"ja":["landing-page-marketing","AI","PWA","HTML","API","SEO"],"ko":["landing-page-marketing","AI","PWA","HTML","API","SEO"],"es":["marketing de página de aterrizaje","automatización de flujo de trabajo","captura de pantallas","procesamiento de imágenes","actualizaciones de HTML","implementación de PWA","soporte offline","desarrollo web"],"fr":["marketing de page de destination","automatisation du flux de travail","capture d''écrans","traitement d''images","mises à jour HTML","déploiement de PWA","support hors ligne","développement web"],"de":["Landingpage-Marketing","Automatisierung des Workflows","Screenshot-Erfassung","Bildverarbeitung","HTML-Aktualisierungen","Implementierung von PWA","Offline-Unterstützung","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["marketing de landing page","otimização de páginas de destino","automatização de fluxo de trabalho","PWA","suporte offline","captura de tela","processamento de imagem"],"ru":["маркетинг посадочных страниц","оптимизация посадочных страниц","автоматизация процесса","PWA","поддержка offline","захват экрана","обработка изображений"],"ar":["تسويق صفحات الهبوط","تحسين صفحات الهبوط","توفير الوقت من خلال توفير عملية","PWA","دعم离线","撮影 الشاشة","معالجة الصور"]}},"owner":"vitorsilva","repo":"saberloop","repoPath":"vitorsilva/saberloop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"landing-page-marketing","description":"Automate landing page updates and marketing asset capture following established patterns","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Landing Page Marketing Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill automates the complete workflow for updating the Saberloop landing page and capturing marketing assets. It consolidates screenshot capture, image processing, HTML updates, and deployment into a standardized process.\n\n## Landing Page Architecture\n\n```\nsaberloop.com/\n├── index.html          # Landing page (from ./landing/)\n├── app/                # PWA application\n├── app-staging/        # Staging PWA\n└── [other endpoints]\n\n./landing/\n├── ind","body":"# Landing Page Marketing Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill automates the complete workflow for updating the Saberloop landing page and capturing marketing assets. It consolidates screenshot capture, image processing, HTML updates, and deployment into a standardized process.\n\n## Landing Page Architecture\n\n```\nsaberloop.com/\n├── index.html          # Landing page (from ./landing/)\n├── app/                # PWA application\n├── app-staging/        # Staging PWA\n└── [other endpoints]\n\n./landing/\n├── index.html          # Main landing page HTML\n├── images/             # Landing page images (304x584 for mobile screenshots)\n│   ├── demo.webm\n│   ├── landing-*.png\n│   └── party-demo.webm\n└── [deployed to root]\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when ANY of these are true:\n- [ ] Adding a new feature to showcase on landing page\n- [ ] Updating marketing copy or CTAs\n- [ ] Capturing new app screenshots\n- [ ] Creating demo videos\n- [ ] Refreshing existing screenshots after UI changes\n- [ ] Deploying landing page updates\n\n## Landing Page Sections\n\n| Section | Location (lines) | Purpose |\n|---------|------------------|---------|\n| Hero | ~668-694 | Main headline, video demo, primary CTAs |\n| Features | ~697-733 | Feature cards grid (6-7 cards) |\n| Party Mode | ~736-759 | Dedicated party mode section |\n| How It Works | ~762-788 | 4-step process explanation |\n| Screenshots | ~791-803 | App screenshot gallery |\n| Share Section | ~806-819 | Social sharing preview |\n| CTA | ~822-848 | Final call-to-action columns |\n| Footer | ~851-862 | Links and copyright |\n\n## Complete Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Screenshot Capture\n\n#### Step 1.1: Create Capture Script\n\n**File:** `tests/e2e/capture-[feature]-screenshots.spec.js`\n\n```javascript\nimport { test, expect } from ''@playwright/test'';\nimport { setupAuthenticatedState, clearSessions } from ''./helpers.js'';\n\nconst MOBILE_VIEWPORT = { width: 375, height: 667 };\nconst SCREENSHOT_DIR = ''landing/images'';\n\ntest.use({ viewport: MOBILE_VIEWPORT });\n\ntest.describe(''Capture [Feature] Screenshots'', () => {\n\n  test(''[Feature] screenshot'', async ({ page }) => {\n    // Setup authenticated state if needed\n    await setupAuthenticatedState(page);\n    await clearSessions(page);\n    await page.reload();\n    await page.waitForSelector(''[data-testid=\"welcome-heading\"]'', { timeout: 10000 });\n\n    // Navigate to the screen to capture\n    await page.goto(''/#/[route]'');\n    await page.waitForTimeout(500);\n\n    // Setup the UI state (scroll, open modals, etc.)\n    // ...\n\n    // Capture screenshot\n    await page.screenshot({\n      path: `${SCREENSHOT_DIR}/landing-[feature-name].png`,\n      fullPage: false\n    });\n\n    console.log(''✓ Captured: [Feature] screenshot'');\n  });\n\n});\n```\n\n#### Step 1.2: Run Capture Script\n\n```bash\n# Run with visible browser\nnpx playwright test tests/e2e/capture-[feature]-screenshots.spec.js --headed\n\n# Or run all capture scripts\nnpm run test:e2e:capture\n```\n\n#### Step 1.3: Process Images\n\n```bash\n# Resize to landing page dimensions (304x584)\n# Option 1: Using Sharp CLI\nnpx sharp-cli landing/images/landing-[feature].png -o landing/images/landing-[feature].png resize 304 584\n\n# Option 2: Using ImageMagick\nconvert landing/images/landing-[feature].png -resize 304x584 landing/images/landing-[feature].png\n\n# Verify file size (should be <50KB for fast loading)\nls -la landing/images/landing-[feature].png\n```\n\n### Phase 2: HTML Updates\n\n#### Step 2.1: Add Feature Card\n\n**Location:** Features grid in `landing/index.html` (~line 700)\n\n```html\n<!-- Add after existing feature cards -->\n<div class=\"feature-card\">\n    <div class=\"feature-icon\">[EMOJI]</div>\n    <h3>[Feature Name]</h3>\n    <p>[Short description - 1-2 sentences]</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n**Available emojis for consistency:**\n- 🧠 AI/Learning\n- 🌍 Languages/Global\n- 🎓 Education/Levels\n- 📱 Mobile/Offline\n- 🔒 Privacy/Security\n- 🎉 Social/Party\n- 🤖 AI Models/Tech\n- ⚡ Performance\n- 💰 Pricing/Value\n\n#### Step 2.2: Update CTA Section\n\n**Location:** CTA columns in `landing/index.html` (~line 822)\n\n```html\n<div class=\"cta-column\">\n    <h3>[Column Title]</h3>\n    <ul>\n        <li>[Benefit 1]</li>\n        <li>[Benefit 2]</li>\n        <li>[Benefit 3]</li>\n        <li>[Benefit 4]</li>\n    </ul>\n    <a href=\"[URL]\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-track=\"[tracking_id]\">[Button Text]</a>\n</div>\n```\n\n#### Step 2.3: Add Screenshot to Gallery\n\n**Location:** Screenshots grid in `landing/index.html` (~line 794)\n\n```html\n<img src=\"images/landing-[feature].png\"\n     alt=\"[Descriptive alt text]\"\n     width=\"304\" height=\"584\"\n     loading=\"lazy\">\n```\n\n#### Step 2.4: Update Structured Data\n\n**Location:** JSON-LD in `<head>` (~line 52)\n\n```json\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"SoftwareApplication\",\n    \"name\": \"Saberloop\",\n    \"description\": \"[Updated description including new feature]\",\n    \"featureList\": [\n        \"AI-powered quiz generation\",\n        \"[New feature description]\",\n        \"Multi-language support\",\n        \"Offline mode\",\n        \"Party Mode multiplayer\"\n    ]\n}\n```\n\n### Phase 3: Testing\n\n#### Step 3.1: Local Preview\n\n```bash\n# Serve landing page locally\nnpx serve landing -p 8080\n\n# Or use Python\ncd landing && python -m http.server 8080\n```\n\n#### Step 3.2: Responsive Testing\n\nTest at these breakpoints:\n- Mobile: 375px (primary)\n- Tablet: 768px\n- Desktop: 1200px+\n\n```bash\n# Use Playwright for responsive screenshots\nnpx playwright test tests/e2e/capture-landing-responsive.spec.js\n```\n\n### Phase 4: Deployment\n\n#### Step 4.1: Deploy to Staging\n\n```bash\n# Build and deploy to staging first\nnpm run deploy:landing -- --staging\n\n# Staging URL: https://saberloop.com/staging/ (if configured)\n# Or test via: https://saberloop.com/app-staging/\n```\n\n#### Step 4.2: Verify Staging\n\nChecklist:\n- [ ] All images load correctly\n- [ ] Feature cards display properly\n- [ ] CTA buttons work\n- [ ] Mobile layout is correct\n- [ ] No console errors\n- [ ] Tracking events fire (check GA)\n\n#### Step 4.3: Deploy to Production\n\n```bash\n# Deploy landing page to production\nnpm run deploy:landing\n\n# Production URL: https://saberloop.com/\n```\n\n#### Step 4.4: Post-Deploy Verification\n\n```bash\n# Clear CDN cache if needed (depends on hosting)\n# Verify in incognito/private browsing\n# Test on actual mobile device\n```\n\n## Templates\n\n### Feature Card Template\n\n```html\n<div class=\"feature-card\">\n    <div class=\"feature-icon\">🤖</div>\n    <h3>Feature Name</h3>\n    <p>Brief description of the feature benefit to users. Keep it to 1-2 sentences.</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Hero Button Template\n\n```html\n<a href=\"/app/\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-track=\"[tracking_id]\">\n    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <!-- SVG path here -->\n    </svg>\n    Button Text\n</a>\n```\n\n### Screenshot Capture Script Template\n\n```javascript\nimport { test, expect } from ''@playwright/test'';\nimport { setupAuthenticatedState, clearSessions } from ''./helpers.js'';\n\nconst MOBILE_VIEWPORT = { width: 375, height: 667 };\nconst SCREENSHOT_DIR = ''landing/images'';\n\ntest.use({ viewport: MOBILE_VIEWPORT });\n\ntest.describe(''Capture Screenshots for Landing Page'', () => {\n\n  test.beforeEach(async ({ page }) => {\n    await setupAuthenticatedState(page);\n    await clearSessions(page);\n    await page.reload();\n    await page.waitForSelector(''[data-testid=\"welcome-heading\"]'', { timeout: 10000 });\n  });\n\n  test(''Screenshot 1: [Description]'', async ({ page }) => {\n    await page.goto(''/#/[route]'');\n    await page.waitForTimeout(500);\n\n    // Setup UI state...\n\n    await page.screenshot({\n      path: `${SCREENSHOT_DIR}/landing-[name].png`,\n      fullPage: false\n    });\n    console.log(''✓ Captured: [Description]'');\n  });\n\n});\n```\n\n## CSS Reference\n\n### Feature Card Styles\n\n```css\n.feature-card {\n    background: var(--background-light);  /* #252542 */\n    padding: 32px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n.feature-icon {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.feature-card h3 {\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.feature-card p {\n    color: var(--text-muted);  /* #a0a0b0 */\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n}\n```\n\n### Button Styles\n\n```css\n.btn {\n    padding: 16px 32px;\n    border-radius: 50px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n    background: var(--primary);  /* #FF6B35 */\n    color: white;\n}\n\n.btn-secondary {\n    background: var(--background-light);\n    color: var(--text);\n    border: 2px solid var(--background-light);\n}\n```\n\n### Color Variables\n\n```css\n:root {\n    --primary: #FF6B35;\n    --primary-dark: #e55a2b;\n    --background: #1a1a2e;\n    --background-light: #252542;\n    --text: #ffffff;\n    --text-muted: #a0a0b0;\n}\n```\n\n## Tracking Events\n\nAll clickable elements should have `data-track` attribute:\n\n```html\n<a href=\"/app/\" data-track=\"web_app_hero\">Try in Browser</a>\n```\n\nEvents are automatically tracked via the script at the bottom of the landing page:\n\n```javascript\ndocument.addEventListener(''click'', function(e) {\n    const trackable = e.target.closest(''[data-track]'');\n    if (trackable && typeof gtag === ''function'') {\n        gtag(''event'', trackable.dataset.track, {\n            ''event_category'': ''engagement'',\n            ''event_label'': trackable.dataset.track\n        });\n    }\n});\n```\n\n## Image Specifications\n\n| Type | Dimensions | Format | Max Size | Location |\n|------|------------|--------|----------|----------|\n| App Screenshot | 304x584 | PNG | 50KB | `landing/images/` |\n| Demo Video | 375x667 | WebM | 500KB | `landing/images/` |\n| Hero Video | 300x600 | WebM | 500KB | `landing/images/` |\n\n## Deployment Commands\n\n```bash\n# Landing page only\nnpm run deploy:landing\n\n# With staging flag (if configured)\nnpm run deploy:landing -- --staging\n\n# Full app + landing\nnpm run deploy && npm run deploy:landing\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Images Not Loading\n1. Check file path is correct (relative to landing/index.html)\n2. Verify file was uploaded (FTP deployment)\n3. Clear browser cache\n4. Check file permissions on server\n\n### Layout Issues\n1. Test at all breakpoints (375, 768, 1200)\n2. Check CSS grid/flexbox rules\n3. Verify image dimensions match expected\n4. Check for overflow issues\n\n### Tracking Not Working\n1. Verify `data-track` attribute exists\n2. Check GA is loaded (no ad blockers)\n3. Verify gtag function is available\n4. Check browser console for errors\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\nThis skill integrates with:\n- **testing-suite-management** - For E2E capture scripts\n- **cicd-pipeline-management** - For deployment workflows\n- **documentation-generation** - For marketing docs\n\n## References\n\n### Developer Guides\n- [E2E Testing Guide](../../../docs/developer-guide/E2E_TESTING.md)\n- [Deployment Guide](../../../docs/architecture/DEPLOYMENT.md)\n- [Staging Deployment](../../../docs/developer-guide/STAGING_DEPLOYMENT.md)\n\n### Existing Capture Scripts\n- `tests/e2e/capture-landing-assets.spec.js`\n- `tests/e2e/capture-playstore-screenshots.spec.js`\n- `tests/e2e/capture-party-demo.spec.js`\n\n### Previous Landing Updates\n- [Epic 6: Party Mode Update](../../../docs/learning/epic06_sharing/LANDING_PAGE_PARTY_UPDATE.md)\n- [Epic 11 Phase 6: Multi-Provider](../../../docs/learning/epic11_llm_support/PHASE6_MARKETING_UPDATE.md)\n\n---\n\n**Version:** 1.0.0\n**Last Updated:** 2026-01-23\n**Compatible with:** Saberloop v2.0.0+\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:28:00.791Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Marketing Automation Agents seeking streamlined landing page updates and HTML deployment","zh":"适用于寻求简化登录页面更新和HTML部署的营销自动化代理","ja":"マーケティング自動化エージェントがストリームライン化されたランディングページの更新とHTMLのデプロイを求める場合に最適","ko":"마케팅 자동화 에이전트가 간소화된 랜딩 페이지 업데이트와 HTML 배포를 찾는 경우에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización de marketing que buscan actualizaciones de página de destino optimizadas y despliegue de HTML","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation du marketing qui recherchent des mises à jour de page de destination rationalisées et un déploiement HTML","de":"Ideal für Marketing-Automatisierungsagenten, die optimierte Landingpage-Updates und HTML-Bereitstellung suchen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Marketing que buscam atualizações de página de destino otimizadas e implantação de HTML","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по автоматизации маркетинга, ищущих оптимизированные обновления целевой страницы и развертывание HTML","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء آتمتة التسويق الذين يبحثون عن تحديثات صفحة الهبوط المُيسرة وتنفيذ HTML"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate screenshot capture, image processing, and HTML updates using standardized workflows, leveraging PWA capabilities and offline support for seamless marketing asset deployment via protocols like HTTP and HTTPS, while consolidating content into a unified landing page architecture","zh":"赋予代理自动化截图捕获、图像处理和HTML更新的能力，使用标准化的工作流，利用PWA功能和离线支持，通过HTTP和HTTPS等协议实现无缝的营销资产部署，同时将内容整合到统一的登录页面架构中","ja":"エージェントがスクリーンショットのキャプチャ、画像処理、HTMLの更新を自動化する能力を付与し、標準化されたワークフローを使用してPWAの機能とオフラインサポートを活用し、HTTPとHTTPSなどのプロトコルを介してマーケティング資産のデプロイを無停止で実現し、同時にコンテンツを統一されたランディングページアーキテクチャに統合する","ko":"에이전트가 스크린샷 캡처, 이미지 처리, HTML 업데이트를 자동화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 표준화된 워크플로우를 사용하여 PWA 기능과 오프라인 지원을 활용하여 HTTP와 HTTPS 등의 프로토콜을 통해 마케팅 자산을 无중단으로 배포하며,同時に コンテンツ를統一された 랜딩 페이지 아키텍처에統合する","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la captura de pantalla, el procesamiento de imágenes y las actualizaciones de HTML utilizando flujos de trabajo estandarizados, aprovechando las capacidades de PWA y el soporte sin conexión para una implementación de activos de marketing sin problemas a través de protocolos como HTTP y HTTPS, al mismo tiempo que consolida el contenido en una arquitectura de página de destino unificada","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la capture d''écran, le traitement d''images et les mises à jour HTML en utilisant des flux de travail standardisés, en exploitant les capacités de PWA et le support hors ligne pour un déploiement d''actifs marketing sans interruption via des protocoles tels que HTTP et HTTPS, tout en consolidant le contenu dans une architecture de page de destination unifiée","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Screenshot-Erfassung, Bildverarbeitung und HTML-Updates mithilfe standardisierter Workflows zu automatisieren, die PWA-Fähigkeiten und Offline-Unterstützung für eine nahtlose Bereitstellung von Marketing-Inhalten über Protokolle wie HTTP und HTTPS nutzt, während der Inhalt in eine einheitliche Landingpage-Architektur konsolidiert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a captura de tela, processamento de imagem e atualizações de HTML usando fluxos de trabalho padronizados, aproveitando as capacidades de PWA e suporte offline para implantação de ativos de marketing sem interrupções via protocolos como HTTP e HTTPS, ao mesmo tempo em que consolida o conteúdo em uma arquitetura de página de destino unificada","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать захват экрана, обработку изображений и обновления HTML с использованием стандартизированных рабочих процессов, используя возможности PWA и поддержку offline для бесшовного развертывания маркетинговых активов через протоколы, такие как HTTP и HTTPS, а также консолидирует содержимое в единую архитектуру целевой страницы","ar":"يُمكن الوكلاء من آتمتة التقاط الشاشة ومعالجة الصور وتحديث HTML باستخدام سير عمل معيارية، واستغلال إمكانيات PWA ودعم العمل离 الخط لتنفيذ أصول التسويق بلا انقطاع عبر بروتوكولات مثل HTTP وHTTPS، في الوقت نفسه الذي يُوحّد فيه المحتوى في هيكل صفحة الهبوط الموحد"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating landing page updates with AI-generated content","Generating and processing marketing assets for PWA applications","Deploying optimized HTML content for improved user experience"],"zh":["使用AI生成的内容自动化登录页面更新","为PWA应用程序生成和处理营销资产","部署优化的HTML内容以改善用户体验"],"ja":["AI生成のコンテンツを使用してランディングページの更新を自動化する","PWAアプリケーションのためのマーケティング資産の生成と処理","最適化されたHTMLコンテンツをデプロイしてユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させる"],"ko":["AI 생성된 콘텐츠를 사용하여 랜딩 페이지 업데이트를 자동화하는 것","PWA 애플리케이션을 위한 마케팅 자산의 생성 및 처리","최적화된 HTML 콘텐츠를 배포하여 사용자 경험을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Automatizar actualizaciones de págin