和维护健身追踪器应用的导航结构，确保类型安全和一致性","ja":"React Native ナビゲーションビルダーは、フィットネストラッカー アプリのナビゲーション構造を作成および維持し、タイプ セーフティと一貫性を確保します","ko":"React Native 네비게이션 빌더는 피트니스 트래커 앱의 네비게이션 구조를 생성하고 유지하며, 유형 안전성과 일관성을 보장합니다","es":"El Constructor de Navegación React Native ayuda a crear y mantener la estructura de navegación de tu app","fr":"Le Constructeur de Navigation React Native aide à créer et maintenir la structure de navigation de votre application","de":"Der React Native Navigation Builder hilft bei der Erstellung und Pflege der Navigationsstruktur Ihrer App","pt":"O construtor de navegação React Native ajuda a criar e manter a estrutura de navegação do aplicativo, garantindo segurança de tipos e consistência","ru":"Строитель навигации React Native помогает создавать и поддерживать структуру навигации приложения, обеспечивая безопасность типов и согласованность","ar":"بناء نظام الملاحة رياكت نيتيف يساعد على إنشاء و الحفاظ على هيكل التوجيه للتطبيق، و ضمان سلامة أنواع و التماسك","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建和维护导航结构","确保类型安全和一致性","添加新屏幕到 AppStack 或 MainTabs","创建新嵌套导航器","定义导航类型"],"ja":["ナビゲーション構造を作成および維持","タイプ セーフティと一貫性を確保","新しいスクリーンを AppStack または MainTabs に追加","新しいネストされたナビゲーターを作成","ナビゲーション タイプを定義"],"ko":["네비게이션 구조 생성 및 유지","유형 안전성 및 일관성 보장","새로운 스크린을 AppStack 또는 MainTabs에 추가","새로운 중첩된 네비게이터 생성","네비게이션 유형 정의"],"es":["Crea pantallas nuevas en la pila de la app o en las pestañas principales","Define tipos de navegación para rutas nuevas","Configura opciones de navegación como encabezados y barras de pestañas","Establece propiedades de pantalla para componentes","Crea navegadores anidados como subpilas o pestañas"],"fr":["Créez de nouveaux écrans dans la pile de l''application ou dans les onglets principaux","Définissez des types de navigation pour de nouvelles routes","Configurez des options de navigation comme des en-têtes et des barres d''onglets","Définissez des propriétés d''écran pour les composants","Créez des navigateurs imbriqués comme des sous-piles ou des onglets"],"de":["Erstellen Sie neue Bildschirme im App-Stack oder in den Hauptregisterkarten","Definieren Sie Navigationsarten für neue Routen","Konfigurieren Sie Navigationsoptionen wie Kopfzeilen und Registerkartenleisten","Legen Sie Bildschirmeigenschaften für Komponenten fest","Erstellen Sie verschachtelte Navigatoren wie Substacks oder Registerkarten"],"pt":["Criação de telas novas","Criação de navegadores aninhados","Definição de tipos de navegação","Configuração de opções de navegação"],"ru":["Создание новых экранов","Создание вложенных навигаторов","Определение типов навигации","Настройка опций навигации"],"ar":["إنشاء شاشات جديدة","إنشاء مُوجهات مُضمنة","تحديد أنواع الملاحة","تكوين خيارات الملاحة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Native","导航构建器","健身追踪器","应用开发","类型安全","一致性"],"ja":["React Native","ナビゲーションビルダー","フィットネストラッカー","アプリ開発","タイプ セーフティ","一貫性"],"ko":["React Native","네비게이션 빌더","피트니스 트래커","애플리케이션 개발","유형 안전성","일관성"],"es":["React Native","navegación","constructor de navegación","seguridad de tipos","consistencia","aplicaciones móviles","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["React Native","navigation","constructeur de navigation","sécurité de types","cohérence","applications mobiles","développement d''applications"],"de":["React Native","Navigation","Navigations-Builder","Typsicherheit","Konsistenz","Mobile Anwendungen","Anwendungs-Entwicklung"],"pt":["React Native","Navegação","Construtor de navegação","Segurança de tipos","Consistência","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos"],"ru":["React Native","Навигация","Строитель навигации","Безопасность типов","Согласованность","Разработка приложений"],"ar":["رياكت نيتيف","نظام الملاحة","بناء نظام الملاحة","سلامة الأنواع","التماسك","تطوير التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"PlaneInABottle","repo":"fitnessMobileApp","repoPath":"PlaneInABottle/fitnessMobileApp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"react-native-navigation-builder","description":"Creates navigation structures following the apps nested navigator pattern. Handles type-safe navigation, stack and tab setup, and screen parameter management in Fitness Tracker App.","bodyPreview":"# React Native Navigation Builder\n\nThis skill helps create and maintain the navigation structure of the Fitness Tracker App, ensuring type safety and consistency across nested navigators.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Add a new screen to the `AppStack` or `MainTabs`\n- Create a new nested navigator (e.g., a sub-stack or tabs)\n- Define navigation types for new routes\n- Set up screen props for components\n- Configure navigation options (headers, tab bar, presentation","body":"# React Native Navigation Builder\n\nThis skill helps create and maintain the navigation structure of the Fitness Tracker App, ensuring type safety and consistency across nested navigators.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Add a new screen to the `AppStack` or `MainTabs`\n- Create a new nested navigator (e.g., a sub-stack or tabs)\n- Define navigation types for new routes\n- Set up screen props for components\n- Configure navigation options (headers, tab bar, presentation modes)\n\n## Navigation Structure\n\nThe app uses a nested navigation structure:\n1. **AppNavigator**: The top-level `NavigationContainer`.\n2. **AppStack**: A `NativeStack` containing global screens (Welcome, Legal, Modals) and the `MainTabs`.\n3. **MainTabs**: A `BottomTab` navigator for the primary app features (Home, Capture, Map, Profile).\n\n## Type Safety\n\n### Defining Parameters\n```typescript\n// app/navigators/navigationTypes.ts\nexport type AppStackParamList = {\n  Welcome: undefined\n  MainTabs: NavigatorScreenParams<MainTabParamList>\n  RoutineDetail: { routineId: string }\n  // ...\n}\n```\n\n### Screen Props\n```typescript\nexport type AppStackScreenProps<T extends keyof AppStackParamList> = \n  NativeStackScreenProps<AppStackParamList, T>\n\nexport type MainTabScreenProps<T extends keyof MainTabParamList> = \n  CompositeScreenProps<\n    BottomTabScreenProps<MainTabParamList, T>,\n    AppStackScreenProps<keyof AppStackParamList>\n  >\n```\n\n## Adding a New Screen\n\n### 1. Update Param List\nAdd the screen name and its parameters to `navigationTypes.ts`.\n\n### 2. Update Navigator\nAdd a `<Stack.Screen>` or `<Tab.Screen>` to the appropriate navigator file.\n\n### 3. Implement Component\nUse the defined props in your screen component:\n```tsx\nexport const MyNewScreen = (props: AppStackScreenProps<\"MyNewScreen\">) => {\n  const { navigation, route } = props\n  // ...\n}\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Modal Presentation\n```tsx\n<Stack.Screen\n  name=\"RoutineEdit\"\n  component={RoutineEditScreen}\n  options={{ presentation: \"modal\" }}\n/>\n```\n\n### Tab Bar Icons\n```tsx\n<Tab.Screen\n  name=\"Home\"\n  component={HomeScreen}\n  options={{\n    tabBarLabel: \"Home\",\n    tabBarIcon: ({ color }) => <Home size={24} color={color} />,\n  }}\n/>\n```\n\n## References\n\nSee [NAVIGATION_TYPES.md](references/NAVIGATION_TYPES.md) for detailed type patterns.\n\nSee [NAVIGATOR_SETUP.md](references/NAVIGATOR_SETUP.md) for stack and tab configuration examples.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:27:23.394Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Development Agents needing streamlined React Native navigation management.","zh":"Perfect for Mobile App Development Agents needing streamlined React Native navigation management.","ja":"Perfect for Mobile App Development Agents needing streamlined React Native navigation management.","ko":"Perfect for Mobile App Development Agents needing streamlined React Native navigation management.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles que necesitan una gestión de navegación de React Native optimizada.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement d''applications mobiles ayant besoin d''une gestion de navigation React Native rationalisée.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile App Development Agents, die eine optimierte React Native Navigation Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Aplicativos Móveis que necessitam de gerenciamento de navegação do React Native simplificado.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки мобильных приложений, которым необходим упрощенный менеджмент навигации React Native.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير تطبيقات الجوال التي تحتاج إلى إدارة.moves ميسرة لتنقل React Native."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and maintain complex navigation structures with type safety, ensuring consistency across nested navigators in React Native apps using AppStack and MainTabs, while defining navigation types and configuring navigation options.","zh":"Empowers agents to create and maintain complex navigation structures with type safety, ensuring consistency across nested navigators in React Native apps using AppStack and MainTabs, while defining navigation types and configuring navigation options.","ja":"Empowers agents to create and maintain complex navigation structures with type safety, ensuring consistency across nested navigators in React Native apps using AppStack and MainTabs, while defining navigation types and configuring navigation options.","ko":"Empowers agents to create and maintain complex navigation structures with type safety, ensuring consistency across nested navigators in React Native apps using AppStack and MainTabs, while defining navigation types and configuring navigation options.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y mantener estructuras de navegación complejas con seguridad de tipos, garantizando la coherencia en los navegadores anidados en aplicaciones de React Native que utilizan AppStack y MainTabs, al mismo tiempo que se definen los tipos de navegación y se configuran las opciones de navegación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de maintenir des structures de navigation complexes avec une sécurité de types, en garantissant la cohérence entre les navigateurs imbriqués dans les applications React Native utilisant AppStack et MainTabs, tout en définissant les types de navigation et en configurant les options de navigation.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Navigationsstrukturen mit Typsicherheit zu erstellen und zu warten, wodurch Konsistenz über verschachtelte Navigatoren in React Native-Apps mit AppStack und MainTabs sichergestellt wird, während Navigationsarten definiert und Navigationsoptionen konfiguriert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e manter estruturas de navegação complexas com segurança de tipo, garantindo consistência em navegadores aninhados em aplicativos React Native que utilizam AppStack e MainTabs, ao mesmo tempo em que define tipos de navegação e configura opções de navegação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и поддерживать сложные навигационные структуры с безопасностью типа, обеспечивая последовательность во вложенных навигаторах в приложениях React Native, использующих AppStack и MainTabs, а также определяя типы навигации и настраивая параметры навигации.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء وبقاء هياكل ملاحة معقدة مع أمان النوع، وضمان الاتساق عبر الملاحة المتداخلة في تطبيقات React Native التي تستخدم AppStack و MainTabs، مع تعريف أنواع الملاحة وتكوين خيارات الملاحة."},"useCases":{"en":["Adding new screens to AppStack or MainTabs","Creating nested navigators for sub-stacks or tabs","Defining navigation types for new routes and setting up screen props"],"zh":["Adding new screens to AppStack or MainTabs","Creating nested navigators for sub-stacks or tabs","Defining navigation types for new routes and setting up screen props"],"ja":["Adding new screens to AppStack or MainTabs","Creating nested navigators for sub-stacks or tabs","Defining navigation types for new routes and setting up screen props"],"ko":["Adding new screens to AppStack or MainTabs","Creating nested navigators for sub-stacks or tabs","Defining navigation types for new routes and setting up screen props"],"es":["Agregar nuevas pantallas a AppStack o MainTabs","Crear navegadores anidados para subpilas o pestañas","Definir tipos de navegación para nuevas rutas y configurar propiedades de pantalla"],"fr":["Ajouter de nouveaux écrans à AppStack ou MainTabs","Créer des navigateurs imbriqués pour des sous-piles ou des onglets","Définir des types de navigation pour de nouvelles routes et configurer les propriétés d''écran"],"de":["Hinzufügen neuer Bildschirme zu AppStack oder MainTabs","Erstellen verschachtelter Navigatoren für Substacks oder Registerkarten","Definieren von Navigationsarten für neue Routen und Konfigurieren von Bildschirmeigenschaften"],"pt":["Adicionar novas telas ao AppStack ou MainTabs","Criar navegadores aninhados para sub-pilhas ou abas","Definir tipos de navegação para novas rotas e configurar propriedades de tela"],"ru":["Добавление новых экранов в AppStack или MainTabs","Создание вложенных навигаторов для суб-стеков или вкладок","Определение типов навигации для новых маршрутов и настройка свойств экрана"],"ar":["إضافة شاشات جديدة إلى AppStack أو MainTabs","إنشاء ملاحة متداخلة للمجموعات الفرعية أو الألسن","تحديد أنواع الملاحة لطرق جديدة وتكوين خصائص الشاشة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React Native environment","Limited to navigation structure management"],"zh":["Requires React Native environment","Limited to navigation structure management"],"ja":["Requires React Native environment","Limited to navigation structure management"],"ko":["Requires React Native environment","Limited to navigation structure management"],"es":["Requiere entorno de React Native","Limitado a la gestión de la estructura de navegación"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement React Native","Limité à la gestion de la structure de navigation"],"de":["Benötigt React Native-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Verwaltung der Navigationsstruktur"],"pt":["Exige ambiente React Native","Limitado ao gerenciamento da estrutura de navegação"],"ru":["Требует среды React Native","Ограничен менеджментом навигационной структуры"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة React Native","محدود بإدارة هيكل الملاحة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
