ctices","Erklärung bevorzugter Muster","Hilfe für das Refaktorisieren von Code, um Standards zu erfüllen"],"pt":["Revisão de código para conformidade com diretrizes","Sugestões de melhoria com base em melhores práticas","Explicação de padrões preferidos","Refatoração de código para atender aos padrões"],"ru":["Проверка кода на соответствие руководящим принципам","Предложения по улучшению на основе лучших практик","Объяснение предпочитаемых шаблонов","Рефакторинг кода для соответствия стандартам"],"ar":["مراجعة الكود لتوافق الإرشادات","اقتراحات تحسين بناءً على أفضل الممارسات","تفسير الأنماط المفضلة","إعادة هيكلة الكود لتحقيق المعايير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Fiber 日志","项目结构","编码标准","代码审查","代码重构","最佳实践"],"ja":["ファイバーロギング","プロジェクト構造","コード標準","コードレビュー","コードリファクタリング","ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["파이버 로깅","프로젝트 구조","코드 표준","코드 리뷰","코드 리팩토링","베스트 프랙티스"],"es":["registro de fiber","estructura de proyecto","mejores prácticas","pautas de código","desarrollo de software","calidad del código"],"fr":["journalisation de fiber","structure de projet","meilleures pratiques","lignes directrices de code","développement de logiciels","qualité du code"],"de":["Fiber-Protokollierung","Projektstruktur","Best Practices","Code-Richtlinien","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Qualität"],"pt":["logging de fibra","estrutura de projeto","codificação","melhores práticas","diretrizes de codificação","refatoração de código"],"ru":["журналирование волокна","структура проекта","кодирование","лучшие практики","руководящие принципы кодирования","рефакторинг кода"],"ar":["تسجيل الألياف","هيكلة المشروع","البرمجة","أفضل الممارسات","إرشادات البرمجة","إعادة هيكلة الكود"]}},"owner":"oimiragieo","repo":"agent-studio","repoPath":"oimiragieo/agent-studio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fiber-logging-and-project-structure","description":"Applies best practices for logging, project structure, and environment variable usage specifically to the main application file.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Fiber Logging And Project Structure Skill\n\n<identity>\nYou are a coding standards expert specializing in fiber logging and project structure.\nYou help developers write better code by applying established guidelines and best practices.\n</identity>\n\n<capabilities>\n- Review code for guideline compliance\n- Suggest improvements based on best practices\n- Explain why certain patterns are preferred\n- Help refactor code to meet standards\n</capabilities>\n\n<instructions>\nWhen reviewing or writing code, ap","body":"# Fiber Logging And Project Structure Skill\n\n<identity>\nYou are a coding standards expert specializing in fiber logging and project structure.\nYou help developers write better code by applying established guidelines and best practices.\n</identity>\n\n<capabilities>\n- Review code for guideline compliance\n- Suggest improvements based on best practices\n- Explain why certain patterns are preferred\n- Help refactor code to meet standards\n</capabilities>\n\n<instructions>\nWhen reviewing or writing code, apply these guidelines:\n\n- Implement proper logging with Fiber''s Logger middleware\n- Follow Fiber''s best practices for project structure\n- Use environment variables for configuration\n  </instructions>\n\n<examples>\nExample usage:\n```\nUser: \"Review this code for fiber logging and project structure compliance\"\nAgent: [Analyzes code against guidelines and provides specific feedback]\n```\n</examples>\n\n## Memory Protocol (MANDATORY)\n\n**Before starting:**\n\n```bash\ncat .claude/context/memory/learnings.md\n```\n\n**After completing:** Record any new patterns or exceptions discovered.\n\n> ASSUME INTERRUPTION: Your context may reset. If it''s not in memory, it didn''t happen.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:28:25.834Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents specializing in guideline compliance and project structure optimization","zh":"适合专门从事指南合规性和项目结构优化的代码审查代理","ja":"ガイドラインのコンプライアンスとプロジェクト構造の最適化を専門とするコードレビューエージェントに適しています","ko":"가이드ライン 준수 및 프로젝트 구조 최적화를 전문으로 하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de revisión de código especializados en cumplimiento de pautas y optimización de estructura de proyectos","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de revue de code spécialisés dans la conformité aux lignes directrices et l''optimisation de la structure de projet","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agenten, die auf Richtlinienkonformität und Projektstruktur-Optimierung spezialisiert sind","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código especializados em conformidade com diretrizes e otimização da estrutura de projetos","ru":"Идеально для агентов код-ревью, специализирующихся на соблюдении руководящих принципов и оптимизации структуры проекта","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء المراجعين للشفرة الذين يختصون في الامتثال للإرشادات وتحسين هيكل المشروع"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to review code for guideline compliance, suggest improvements based on best practices, and refactor code to meet established standards, utilizing expertise in fiber logging and project structure to ensure high-quality codebases","zh":"赋予代理审查代码以确保指南合规性，根据最佳实践提出改进建议，并重构代码以满足既定的标准，利用纤维日志记录和项目结构的专业知识以确保高质量的代码库","ja":"エージェントがコードをガイドラインのコンプライアンスのためにレビューし、ベストプラクティスに基づいて改善を提案し、既定の標準を満たすためにコードをリファクタリングすることを可能にします。ファイバーロギングとプロジェクト構造の専門知識を利用して、高品質のコードベースを確保します","ko":"에이전트가 코드를 가이드라인 준수 여부를 검토하고, 베스트 프랙티스에 따라 개선 사항을 제안하며, 확립된 표준을 충족하도록 코드를 리팩토링할 수 있도록 합니다. 또한, 파이버 로깅과 프로젝트 구조에 대한 전문 지식을 활용하여 고품질의 코드베이스를 보장합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes revisar el código para el cumplimiento de las pautas, sugerir mejoras basadas en las mejores prácticas y refactorizar el código para cumplir con los estándares establecidos, utilizando la experiencia en registro de fibra y estructura de proyecto para garantizar bases de código de alta calidad","fr":"Permet aux agents de revoir le code pour la conformité aux lignes directrices, de suggérer des améliorations basées sur les meilleures pratiques et de réorganiser le code pour répondre aux normes établies, en utilisant l''expertise en journalisation de fibre et en structure de projet pour assurer des bases de code de haute qualité","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Code für die Einhaltung von Richtlinien zu überprüfen, Vorschläge für Verbesserungen auf der Grundlage von Best Practices zu machen und Code umzustrukturieren, um festgelegten Standards zu entsprechen, unter Nutzung von Fachwissen im Bereich Faser-Protokollierung und Projektstruktur, um hochwertige Codebasen sicherzustellen","pt":"Habilita agentes a revisar o código para garantir a conformidade com as diretrizes, sugerir melhorias com base nas melhores práticas e reestruturar o código para atender aos padrões estabelecidos, utilizando a especialização em registro de fibras e estrutura de projeto para garantir repositórios de código de alta qualidade","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять код на соответствие руководящим принципам, предлагать улучшения на основе передового опыта и рефакторить код для соблюдения установленных стандартов, используя экспертизу в области ведения журнала волокна и структуры проекта для обеспечения высококачественных кодовых баз","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من مراجعة الشفرة للامتثال للإرشادات، واقتراح تحسينات بناءً على أفضل الممارسات، وإعادة هيكلة الشفرة لتحقيق المعايير المعمول بها، مستخدمين الخبرة في تسجيل الألياف وهيكل المشروع لضمان قواعد الشفرة عالية الجودة"},"useCases":{"en":["Reviewing code for compliance with fiber logging guidelines","Refactoring projects to adhere to established structure standards","Improving code quality through targeted suggestions and explanations"],"zh":["查看代码是否符合纤维日志记录指南","将项目重构为遵循既定的结构标准","通过有针对性的建议和解释提高代码质量"],"ja":["ファイバーロギングのガイドラインに準拠したコードのレビュー","既定の構造標準に従ったプロジェクトのリファクタリング","ターゲットを絞った提案と説明を通じてコード品質の向上"],"ko":["파이버 로깅 가이드라인 준수 여부를 확인하기 위한 코드 검토","확립된 구조 표준을 준수하도록 프로젝트 리팩토링","목표를 명확히 한 제안 및 설명을 통해 코드 품질 개선"],"es":["Revisar el código para el cumplimiento de las pautas de registro de fibra","Reorganizar proyectos para que cumplan con los estándares de estructura establecidos","Mejorar la calidad del código a través de sugerencias y explicaciones dirigidas"],"fr":["Revoir le code pour la conformité aux lignes directrices de journalisation de fibre","Réorganiser les projets pour qu''ils répondent aux normes de structure établies","Améliorer la qualité du code par des suggestions et des explications ciblées"],"de":["Code auf die Einhaltung von Faser-Protokollierungs-Richtlinien überprüfen","Projekte umstrukturieren, um festgelegten Strukturstandards zu entsprechen","Code-Qualität durch gezielte Vorschläge und Erklärungen verbessern"],"pt":["Revisar o código para conformidade com as diretrizes de registro de fibras","Reestruturar projetos para atender aos padrões de estrutura estabelecidos","Melhorar a qualidade do código por meio de sugestões e explicações direcionadas"],"ru":["Проверка кода на соответствие руководящим принципам ведения журнала волокна","Переструктуризация проектов для соблюдения установленных стандартов структуры","Улучшение качества кода посредством целевых предложений и объяснений"],"ar":["مراجعة الشفرة للامتثال للإرشادات لتسجيل الألياف","إعادة هيكلة المشاريع لامتثال معايير الهيكل المعمول بها","تحسين جودة الشفرة من خلال اقتراحات وإيضاحات محددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to code repositories","Limited to programming languages with established fiber logging and project structure guidelines"],"zh":["需要访问代码仓库","仅限于具有既定纤维日志记录和项目结构指南的编程语言"],"ja":["コードリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","ファイバーロギングとプロジェクト構造のガイドラインが既定されているプログラミング言語に限定される"],"ko":["코드 저장소에 대한 액세스가 필요함","파이버 로깅 및 프로젝트 구조에 대한 가이드라인이 이미 정의된 프로그래밍 언어로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los repositorios de código","Limitado a lenguajes de programación con pautas de registro de fibra y estructura de proyecto establecidas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux référentiels de code","Limité aux langages de programmation ayant des lignes directrices de journalisation de fibre et de structure de projet établies"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Code-Repositorys","Begrenzt auf Programmiersprachen mit etablierten Faser-Protokollierungs- und Projektstruktur-Richtlinien"],"pt":["Requer acesso aos repositórios de código","Limitado a linguagens de programação com diretrizes de registro de fibras e estrutura de projeto estabelecidas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиториям кода","Ограничен языками программирования с установленными руководящими принципами ведения журнала волокна и структуры проекта"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودعات الشفرة","محدود بلغات البرمجة التي لديها إرشادات لتسجيل الألياف وهيكل المشروع المعمول بها"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('DW225/ree-board/signal-state-management', 'community', 'DW225', 'ree-board', 'DW225/ree-board', 'signal-state-management', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z', '2026-02-18T03:28:37.689Z', NULL, '{"id":"DW225/ree-board/signal-state-management","name":"signal-state-management","description":{"zh":"信号状态管理是一种高效的客户端应用状态管理方式，用于优化重新渲染和性能","ja":"シグナルステート管理は、高性能なクライアントサイドアプリケーション状態管理方式です","ko":"신호 상태 관리는 효율적인 클라이언트 사이드 애플리케이션 상태 관리 방식으로 재 렌더링과 성능을 최적화합니다","es":"Signal State Management es una técnica para gestionar el estado de las aplicaciones, mejorando el rendimiento y la escalabilidad","fr":"Signal State Management est une technique pour gérer l''état des applications, améliorant les performances et la scalabilité","de":"Signal State Management ist eine Technik zur Verwaltung des Zustands von Anwendungen, um die Leistung und Skalierbarkeit zu verbessern","pt":"O Signal State Management é uma habilidade que permite gerenciar o estado do lado do cliente de forma eficiente, criando atualizações de UI reativas e otimizando re-renders","ru":"Управление состоянием сигнала — это навык, который позволяет эффективно управлять состоянием клиента, создавая реактивные обновления UI и оптимизируя повторные рендеринги","ar":"إدارة حالة الإشارة هي مهارة تسمح بإدارة حالة العميل بفعالية، وإنشاء تحديثات واجهة المستخدم التفاعلية وتحسين إعادة العرض","en":"Retro board build using Turso, Next.js and Supabase Auth"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"信号状态管理 - 高效的客户端应用状态管理","ja":"シグナルステート管理 - 高性能なクライアントサイドアプリケーション状態管理","ko":"신호 상태 관리 - 효율적인 클라이언트 사이드 애플리케이션 상태 관리","es":"Gestión de Estado de Señal","fr":"Gestion d''État de Signal","de":"Signal Zustandsverwaltung","pt":"Gerenciamento de Estado de Sinal","ru":"Управление состоянием сигнала","ar":"إدارة حالة الإشارة","en":"signal-state-management"},"description":{"zh":"信号状态管理是一种高效的客户端应用状态管理方式，用于优化重新渲染和性能","ja":"シグナルステート管理は、高性能なクライアントサイドアプリケーション状態管理方式です","ko":"신호 상태 관리는 효율적인 클라이언트 사이드 애플리케이션 상태 관리 방식으로 재 렌더링과 성능을 최적화합니다","es":"Signal State Management es una técnica para gestionar el estado de las aplicaciones, mejorando el rendimiento y la escalabilidad","fr":"Signal State Management est une technique pour gérer l''état des applications, améliorant les performances et la scalabilité","de":"Signal State Management ist eine Technik zur Verwaltung des Zustands von Anwendungen, um die Leistung und Skalierbarkeit zu verbessern","pt":"O Signal State Management é uma habilidade que permite gerenciar o estado do lado do cliente de forma eficiente, criando atualizações de UI reativas e otimiz...","ru":"Управление состоянием сигнала — это навык, который позволяет эффективно управлять состоянием клиента, создавая реактивные обновления UI и оптимизируя повторн...","ar":"إدارة حالة الإشارة هي مهارة تسمح بإدارة حالة العميل بفعالية، وإنشاء تحديثات واجهة المستخدم التفاعلية وتحسين إعادة العرض","en":"Retro board build using Turso, Next.js and Supabase Auth"},"definition":{"en":"Retro board build using Turso, Next.js and Supabase Auth"},"features":{"zh":["高效的客户端应用状态管理","优化重新渲染","计算信号","信号与React组件集成","域组织状态","批量状态更新"],"ja":["高性能なクライアントサイドアプリケーション状態管理","再描画の最適化","計算シグナル","シグナルとReactコンポーネントの統合","ドメインによる状態の組織化","バッチ状態更新"],"ko":["효율적인 클라이언트 사이드 애플리케이션 상태 관리","재 렌더링 최적화","계산 신호","신호와 React 컴포넌트 통합","도메인 상태 조직","배치 상태 업데이트"],"es":["Gestión de estado de lado del cliente","Actualizaciones de interfaz de usuario reactivas","Valores computados","Actualizaciones de estado por lotes para mejorar el rendimiento","Organización de estado por dominio"],"fr":["Gestion de l''état côté client","Mises à jour d''interface utilisateur réactives","Valeurs calculées","Mises à jour d''état par lots pour améliorer les performances","Organisation de l''état par domaine"],"de":["Client-seitige Zustandsverwaltung","Reaktive Benutzeroberflächen-Aktualisierungen","Berechnete Werte","Zustandsaktualisierungen in Batches zur Leistungsverbesserung","Zustandsorganisation nach Domäne"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de estado do lado do cliente","Criação de atualizações de UI reativas","Otimização de re-renders","Integração com React components","Organização de estado por domínio"],"ru":["Управление состоянием клиента","Создание реактивных обновлений UI","Оптимизация повторных рендерингов","Интеграция с компонентами React","Организация состояния по домену"],"ar":["إدارة حالة العميل","إنشاء تحديثات واجهة المستخدم التفاعلية","تحسين إعادة العرض","التكامل مع مكونات React","تنظيم الحالة حسب المجال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["信号状态管理","客户端应用状态管理","React状态管理","信号与React","计算信号","状态优化"],"ja":["シグナルステート管理","クライアントサイドアプリケーション状態管理","React状態管理","シグナルとReact","計算シグナル","状態最適化"],"ko":["신호 상태 관리","클라이언트 사이드 애플리케이션 상태 관리","React 상태 관리","신호와 React","계산 신호","상태 최적화"],"es":["gestión de estado","señales","reactividad","rendimiento","escalabilidad","desarrollo de aplicaciones","Signal State Management","Turso","Next.js","Supabase Auth"],"fr":["gestion d''état","signaux","réactivité","performances","scalabilité","développement d''applications","Signal State Management","Turso","Next.js","Supabase Auth"],"de":["Zustandsverwaltung","Signale","Reaktivität","Leistung","Skalierbarkeit","Anwendungsentwicklung","Signal State Management","Turso","Next.js","Supabase Auth"],"pt":["gerenciamento de estado","estado do lado do cliente","atualizações de UI reativas","otimização de re-renders","react","signal state management"],"ru":["управление состоянием","состояние клиента","реактивные обновления UI","оптимизация повторных рендерингов","react","управление состоянием сигнала"],"ar":["إدارة الحالة","حالة العميل","تحديثات واجهة المستخدم التفاعلية","تحسين إعادة العرض","react","إدارة حالة الإشارة"]}},"owner":"DW225","repo":"ree-board","repoPath":"DW225/ree-board","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"signal-state-management","description":"Preact Signals for reactive state management, signal vs computed signal usage, batch updates for performance, action creator patterns, signal integration with React components, state management by domain (boards posts members), reactive patterns, and signal best practices for ree-board project","bodyPreview":"# Signal State Management\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when working on:\n\n- Managing client-side application state\n- Creating reactive UI updates\n- Implementing computed values\n- Batching state updates for performance\n- Organizing state by domain (boards, posts, members)\n- Integrating signals with React components\n- Optimizing re-renders\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### Signal vs Computed Signal\n\n**Simple Signal:** Holds mutable state\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal } from \"@preact/signal","body":"# Signal State Management\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate this skill when working on:\n\n- Managing client-side application state\n- Creating reactive UI updates\n- Implementing computed values\n- Batching state updates for performance\n- Organizing state by domain (boards, posts, members)\n- Integrating signals with React components\n- Optimizing re-renders\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### Signal vs Computed Signal\n\n**Simple Signal:** Holds mutable state\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal } from \"@preact/signals-react\";\n\n// ✅ Simple signal for primitive values\nexport const currentBoardId = signal<string | null>(null);\n\n// ✅ Simple signal for complex state\nexport const postsSignal = signal<Post[]>([]);\n```\n\n**Computed Signal:** Derives value from other signals\n\n```typescript\nimport { signal, computed } from \"@preact/signals-react\";\n\nexport const postsSignal = signal<Post[]>([]);\nexport const filterSignal = signal<PostFilter>(\"all\");\n\n// ✅ Computed signal automatically updates\nexport const filteredPosts = computed(() => {\n  const posts = postsSignal.value;\n  const filter = filterSignal.value;\n\n  if (filter === \"all\") return posts;\n  return posts.filter((p) => p.type === filter);\n});\n```\n\n### State Organization by Domain\n\n**Separate Files for Each Domain:**\n\n```typescript\n// lib/signal/postSignals.ts\nimport { signal, computed } from \"@preact/signals-react\";\n\n// State\nexport const postsSignal = signal<Post[]>([]);\nexport const selectedPostId = signal<string | null>(null);\n\n// Computed values\nexport const selectedPost = computed(() => {\n  const id = selectedPostId.value;\n  if (!id) return null;\n  return postsSignal.value.find((p) => p.id === id);\n});\n\nexport const postsByType = computed(() => {\n  const posts = postsSignal.value;\n  return {\n    wentWell: posts.filter((p) => p.type === \"went_well\"),\n    toImprove: posts.filter((p) => p.type === \"to_improve\"),\n    actionItems: posts.filter((p) => p.type === \"action_items\"),\n  };\n});\n\n// Actions\nexport const addPost = (post: Post) => {\n  postsSignal.value = [...postsSignal.value, post];\n};\n\nexport const updatePost = (id: string, updates: Partial<Post>) => {\n  postsSignal.value = postsSignal.value.map((p) =>\n    p.id === id ? { ...p, ...updates } : p\n  );\n};\n\nexport const deletePost = (id: string) => {\n  postsSignal.value = postsSignal.value.filter((p) => p.id !== id);\n};\n```\n\n### Action Creator Pattern\n\n**Encapsulate State Updates:**\n\n```typescript\n// lib/signal/boardSignals.ts\nimport { signal } from \"@preact/signals-react\";\n\nexport const boardsSignal = signal<Board[]>([]);\nexport const loadingSignal = signal<boolean>(false);\nexport const errorSignal = signal<string | null>(null);\n\n// ✅ Action creators for complex operations\nexport const loadBoards = async () => {\n  loadingSignal.value = true;\n  errorSignal.value = null;\n\n  try {\n    const boards = await fetchBoards();\n    boardsSignal.value = boards;\n  } catch (error) {\n    errorSignal.value = \"Failed to load boards\";\n    console.error(error);\n  } finally {\n    loadingSignal.value = false;\n  }\n};\n\nexport const createBoard = async (name: string) => {\n  try {\n    const newBoard = await createBoardAction(name);\n    // Optimistic update\n    boardsSignal.value = [...boardsSignal.value, newBoard];\n    return newBoard;\n  } catch (error) {\n    errorSignal.value = \"Failed to create board\";\n    throw error;\n  }\n};\n```\n\n### Batch Updates for Performance\n\n**Update Multiple Signals Together:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { batch } from \"@preact/signals-react\";\n\n// ❌ Bad: Triggers 3 re-renders\nconst updateBoard = (id: string, data: BoardUpdate) => {\n  boardsSignal.value = updateBoardList(id, data);\n  selectedBoardId.value = id;\n  lastUpdatedSignal.value = Date.now();\n};\n\n// ✅ Good: Triggers 1 re-render\nconst updateBoard = (id: string, data: BoardUpdate) => {\n  batch(() => {\n    boardsSignal.value = updateBoardList(id, data);\n    selectedBoardId.value = id;\n    lastUpdatedSignal.value = Date.now();\n  });\n};\n```\n\n### Integration with React Components\n\n**Reading Signals:**\n\n```typescript\n\"use client\";\n\nimport { postsSignal, filteredPosts } from \"@/lib/signal/postSignals\";\n\nexport function PostList() {\n  // ✅ Component re-renders when signal changes\n  const posts = filteredPosts.value;\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {posts.map((post) => (\n        <PostCard key={post.id} post={post} />\n      ))}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n**Updating Signals:**\n\n```typescript\n\"use client\";\n\nimport { updatePost } from \"@/lib/signal/postSignals\";\n\nexport function EditPostForm({ postId }: { postId: string }) {\n  const handleSubmit = (content: string) => {\n    // ✅ Update signal\n    updatePost(postId, { content });\n\n    // Persist to database\n    updatePostAction(postId, content);\n  };\n\n  return <form onSubmit={handleSubmit}>...</form>;\n}\n```\n\n### Combining Signals with Server Actions\n\n**Pattern:** Update signal first (optimistic), then persist\n\n```typescript\n\"use client\";\n\nimport { addPost, deletePost } from \"@/lib/signal/postSignals\";\nimport { createPost as createPostAction } from \"@/lib/actions/post/createPost\";\n\nexport function CreatePostButton({ boardId }: { boardId: string }) {\n  const handleCreate = async () => {\n    // Create temporary post for optimistic UI\n    const tempPost: Post = {\n      id: `temp-${Date.now()}`,\n      boardId,\n      content: \"\",\n      type: \"went_well\",\n      createdAt: new Date(),\n    };\n\n    // ✅ Optimistic update\n    addPost(tempPost);\n\n    try {\n      // Persist to database\n      const savedPost = await createPostAction(boardId, \"\", \"went_well\");\n\n      // Replace temp with real post\n      deletePost(tempPost.id);\n      addPost(savedPost);\n    } catch (error) {\n      // Rollback on error\n      deletePost(tempPost.id);\n      showError(\"Failed to create post\");\n    }\n  };\n\n  return <button onClick={handleCreate}>Create Post</button>;\n}\n```\n\n### Signal Performance Patterns\n\n**Avoid Unnecessary Signal Subscriptions:**\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Bad: Creates new computed signal on every render\nfunction PostCount() {\n  const count = computed(() => postsSignal.value.length);\n  return <div>{count.value}</div>;\n}\n\n// ✅ Good: Computed signal defined once outside component\nconst postCount = computed(() => postsSignal.value.length);\n\nfunction PostCount() {\n  return <div>{postCount.value}</div>;\n}\n```\n\n**Use Signal Peeking for Non-Reactive Reads:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { postsSignal } from \"@/lib/signal/postSignals\";\n\nfunction logCurrentPosts() {\n  // ✅ Read without subscribing (doesn''t trigger re-render)\n  console.log(\"Current posts:\", postsSignal.peek());\n}\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Mutating Signal Values Directly\n\n**Bad:**\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Never mutate signal values directly\npostsSignal.value.push(newPost);\n```\n\n**Good:**\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Create new array\npostsSignal.value = [...postsSignal.value, newPost];\n```\n\n### ❌ Creating Signals Inside Components\n\n**Bad:**\n\n```typescript\nfunction MyComponent() {\n  // ❌ Creates new signal on every render\n  const localSignal = signal(0);\n  return <div>{localSignal.value}</div>;\n}\n```\n\n**Good:**\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Define signals outside components\nconst counterSignal = signal(0);\n\nfunction MyComponent() {\n  return <div>{counterSignal.value}</div>;\n}\n```\n\n### ❌ Not Using Batch for Multiple Updates\n\n**Bad:**\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Triggers 3 re-renders\nconst resetFilters = () => {\n  filterSignal.value = \"all\";\n  sortSignal.value = \"date\";\n  searchSignal.value = \"\";\n};\n```\n\n**Good:**\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Triggers 1 re-render\nimport { batch } from \"@preact/signals-react\";\n\nconst resetFilters = () => {\n  batch(() => {\n    filterSignal.value = \"all\";\n    sortSignal.value = \"date\";\n    searchSignal.value = \"\";\n  });\n};\n```\n\n### ❌ Forgetting .value Accessor\n\n**Bad:**\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Comparing signal object, not value\nif (currentBoardId === \"board-123\") {\n  // This will never be true\n}\n```\n\n**Good:**\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Access signal value\nif (currentBoardId.value === \"board-123\") {\n  // Correct comparison\n}\n```\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n- **[nextjs-app-router](../nextjs-app-router/SKILL.md):** Signals used in client components\n- **[ably-realtime](../ably-realtime/SKILL.md):** Update signals from real-time messages\n- **[drizzle-patterns](../drizzle-patterns/SKILL.md):** Sync signals with database state\n- **[testing-patterns](../testing-patterns/SKILL.md):** Reset signals in test setup\n\n## Project-Specific Context\n\n### Key Files\n\n- `lib/signal/boardSignals.ts` - Board listing and management\n- `lib/signal/postSignals.ts` - Post state within boards\n- `lib/signal/memberSignals.ts` - Board member management\n- `components/board/PostProvider.tsx` - Signal updates from real-time\n\n### Domain-Specific Signals\n\n**Board Management:**\n\n```typescript\n// lib/signal/boardSignals.ts\nexport const boardsSignal = signal<Board[]>([]);\nexport const currentBoardId = signal<string | null>(null);\nexport const currentBoard = computed(() =>\n  boardsSignal.value.find((b) => b.id === currentBoardId.value)\n);\n```\n\n**Post Management:**\n\n```typescript\n// lib/signal/postSignals.ts\nexport const postsSignal = signal<Post[]>([]);\nexport const postFilter = signal<PostType | \"all\">(\"all\");\nexport const filteredPosts = computed(() => {\n  const filter = postFilter.value;\n  if (filter === \"all\") return postsSignal.value;\n  return postsSignal.value.filter((p) => p.type === filter);\n});\n```\n\n**Member Management:**\n\n```typescript\n// lib/signal/memberSignals.ts\nexport const membersSignal = signal<Member[]>([]);\nexport const currentUserRole = computed(() => {\n  const members = membersSignal.value;\n  const userId = currentUserId.value;\n  return members.find((m) => m.userId === userId)?.role || \"guest\";\n});\n```\n\n### Real-Time Integration\n\n**Update Signals from Ably Messages:**\n\n```typescript\n// components/board/PostProvider.tsx\nuseChannel(`board:${boardId}`, (message) => {\n  switch (message.name) {\n    case \"post:create\":\n      addPost(message.data);\n      break;\n\n    case \"post:update\":\n      updatePost(message.data.id, message.data);\n      break;\n\n    case \"post:delete\":\n      deletePost(message.data.id);\n      break;\n  }\n});\n```\n\n### Testing Signals\n\n**Reset Signals in beforeEach:**\n\n```typescript\nimport { postsSignal, filterSignal } from \"@/lib/signal/postSignals\";\n\nbeforeEach(() => {\n  postsSignal.value = [];\n  filterSignal.value = \"all\";\n});\n\ntest(\"filters posts by type\", () => {\n  postsSignal.value = [\n    { id: \"1\", type: \"went_well\", content: \"Test\" },\n    { id: \"2\", type: \"to_improve\", content: \"Test\" },\n  ];\n\n  filterSignal.value = \"went_well\";\n  expect(filteredPosts.value).toHaveLength(1);\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n**Last Updated:** 2026-01-10\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:28:37.689Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring efficient client-side state management and reactive UI updates using Turso, Next.js, and Supabase Auth","zh":"适用于需要高效客户端状态管理和使用 Turso、Next.js 和 Supabase Auth 的反应式 UI 更新的前端代理","ja":"Turso、Next.js、Supabase Auth を使用した効率的なクライアント側の状態管理とリアクティブ UI 更新が必要なフロントエンド エージェントに最適","ko":"Turso, Next.js 및 Supabase Auth를 사용하는 효율적인 클라이언트 측 상태 관리 및 반응형 UI 업데이트가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes frontend que requieren una gestión eficiente del estado del lado del cliente y actualizaciones de interfaz de usuario reactivas utilizando Turso, Next.js y Supabase Auth","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend nécessitant une gestion efficace de l''état côté client et des mises à jour d''interface utilisateur réactives utilisant Turso, Next.js et Supabase Auth","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die eine effiziente Client-Seitige Zustandsverwaltung und reaktive Benutzeroberflächen-Aktualisierungen unter Verwendung von Turso, Next.js und Supabase Auth erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que exigem gerenciamento eficiente de estado do lado do cliente e atualizações de UI reativas usando Turso, Next.js e Supabase Auth","ru":"Идеально для Фронтенд-агентов, требующих эффективного управления состоянием клиента и реактивного обновления интерфейса с помощью Turso, Next.js и Supabase Auth","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامي الذي يتطلب إدارة حالة العميل بكفاءة وتحديث واجهة المستخدم التفاعلية باستخدام Turso و Next.js و Supabase Auth"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage complex application state using signals, computed values, and batching updates for optimized performance, while seamlessly integrating with React components and Supabase Auth for secure authentication","zh":"赋予代理管理复杂应用程序状态的能力，使用信号、计算值和批量更新以优化性能，同时无缝集成 React 组件和 Supabase Auth 以实现安全身份验证","ja":"シグナル、計算値、およびバッチ更新を使用して複雑なアプリケーションの状態を管理し、パフォーマンスを最適化するエージェントを可能にし、React コンポーネントおよび Supabase Auth とシームレスに統合して安全な認証を実現","ko":"시그널, 계산된 값 및 배치 업데이트를 사용하여 복잡한 애플리케이션 상태를 관리하고 성능을 최적화하며, React 컴포넌트 및 Supabase Auth와 무결점으로 통합하여 안전한 인증을 구현하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar estados de aplicaciones complejos utilizando señales, valores computados y actualizaciones por lotes para un rendimiento optimizado, mientras se integra de forma transparente con componentes de React y Supabase Auth para una autenticación segura","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des états d''applications complexes en utilisant des signaux, des valeurs calculées et des mises à jour par lots pour des performances optimisées, tout en s''intégrant de manière transparente avec des composants React et Supabase Auth pour une authentification sécurisée","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe Anwendungszustände mit Signalen, berechneten Werten und Batch-Aktualisierungen für optimierte Leistung zu verwalten, während sie nahtlos in React-Komponenten und Supabase Auth für eine sichere Authentifizierung integriert werden","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem estados de aplicação complexos usando sinais, valores computados e atualizações em lote para desempenho otimizado, integrando-se perfeitamente com componentes React e Supabase Auth para autenticação segura","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять сложными состояниями приложений с помощью сигналов, вычисляемых значений и пакетных обновлений для оптимизированной производительности, а также обеспечивает бесшовную интеграцию с компонентами React и Supabase Auth для безопасной аутентификации","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إدارة حالة تطبيقات معقدة باستخدام الإشارات والقيم المحسوبة وتحديثات الدفعة لتحسين الأداء، وتكاملها بشكل متجانس مع مكونات React و Supabase Auth لأغراض التأشير الأمني"},"useCases":{"en":["Managing client-side application state with Turso signals","Creating reactive UI updates with Next.js and computed values","Implementing domain-organized state management for boards, posts, and members","Optimizing re-renders and batching state updates for improved performance"],"zh":["使用 Turso 信号管理客户端应用程序状态","使用 Next.js 和计算值创建反应式 UI 更新","为板块、帖子和成员实现域组织的状态管理","优化重新渲染和批量状态更新以提高性能"],"ja":["Turso シグナルを使用してクライアント側アプリケーションの状態を管理","Next.js と計算値を使用してリアクティブ UI 更新を作成","ボード、投稿、メンバーのドメイン組織化された状態管理を実装","再描画とバッチ状態更新を最適化してパフォーマンスを向上させる"],"ko":["Turso 시그널을 사용하여 클라이언트 측 애플리케이션 상태 관리","Next.js 및 계산된 값을 사용하여 반응형 UI 업데이트를 생성","판, 게시글, 회원의 도메인 조직화된 상태 관리 구현","재 렌더링 및 배치 상태 업데이트 최적화하여 성능 향상"],"es":["Gestión del estado de la aplicación del lado del cliente con señales de Turso","Creación de actualizaciones de interfaz de usuario reactivas con Next.js y valores computados","Implementación de una gestión de estado organizada por dominios para tableros, publicaciones y miembros","Optimización de las nuevas representaciones y actualizaciones de estado por lotes para un mejor rendimiento"],"fr":["Gestion de l''état de l''application côté client avec des signaux Turso","Création de mises à jour d''interface utilisateur réactives avec Next.js et des valeurs calculées","Mise en œuvre d''une gestion d''état organisée par domaines pour des tableaux, des publications et des membres","Optimisation des nouvelles représentations et des mises à jour d''état par lots pour de meilleures performances"],"de":["Verwaltung des Client-Seitigen Anwendungszustands mit Turso-Signalen","Erstellung reaktiver Benutzeroberflächen-Aktualisierungen mit Next.js und berechneten Werten","Implementierung einer domänenorganisierten Zustandsverwaltung für Boards, Posts und Mitglieder","Optimierung der Neudarstellungen und Batch-Zustandsaktualisierungen für eine verbesserte Leistung"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de estado de aplicação do lado do cliente com sinais Turso","Criação de atualizações de UI reativas com Next.js e valores computados","Implementação de gerenciamento de estado organizado por domínio para quadros, posts e membros","Otimização de re-renderizações e atualizações de estado em lote para melhorar o desempenho"],"ru":["Управление состоянием приложения на стороне клиента с помощью сигналов Turso","Создание реактивных обновлений интерфейса с помощью Next.js и вычисляемых значений","Реализация доменно-организованного управления состоянием для досок, постов и членов","Оптимизация повторных рендеров и пакетных обновлений состояния для улучшения производительности"],"ar":["إدارة حالة تطبيق العميل باستخدام إشارات Turso","إنشاء تحديثات واجهة المستخدم التفاعلية باستخدام Next.js والقيم المحسوبة","تنفيذ إدارة حالة منظمة بال домين للوحات والمنشورات والأعضاء","تحسين إعادة عرض وتحديثات الحالة الكتلة لتحسين الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Turso, Next.js, and Supabase Auth setup","Limited to client-side application state management","Dependent on React components for UI integration"],"zh":["需要 Turso、Next.js 和 Supabase Auth 设置","仅限客户端应用程序状态管理","依赖 React 组件进行 UI 集成"],"ja":["Turso、Next.js、Supabase Auth の設定が必要","クライアント側アプリケーションの状態管理に限定","UI 統合のために React コンポーネントに依存"],"ko":["Turso, Next.js 및 Supabase Auth 설정이 필요","클라이언트 측 애플리케이션 상태 관리에만 제한","UI 통합을 위해 React 컴포넌트에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Turso, Next.js y Supabase Auth","Limitado a la gestión del estado de la aplicación del lado del cliente","Dependiente de componentes de React para la integración de la interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Turso, Next.js et Supabase Auth","Limité à la gestion de l''état de l''application côté client","Dépendant de composants React pour l''intégration de l''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt eine Konfiguration von Turso, Next.js und Supabase Auth","Begrenzt auf die Client-Seitige Anwendungszustandsverwaltung","Abhängig von React-Komponenten für die Benutzeroberflächen-Integration"],"pt":["Exige configuração de Turso, Next.js e Supabase Auth","Limitado ao gerenciamento de estado de aplicação do lado do cliente","Dependente de componentes React para integração de UI"],"ru":["Требует настройки Turso, Next.js и Supabase Auth","Ограничен управлением состоянием приложения на стороне клиента","Зависит от компонентов React для интеграции интерфейса"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Turso و Next.js و Supabase Auth","محدود بإدارة حالة تطبيق العميل","يعتمد على مكونات React لتكامل واجهة المستخدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
