 usage examples","Different variants and states","Interactividade"],"ru":["Следуйте существующим шаблонам","Используйте разделы","Полное покрытие","Базовые примеры использования","Различные варианты и состояния","Интерактивность"],"ar":["اتبع النمط الموجूद","استخدم الأقسام","التغطية الشاملة","أمثلة استخدام أساسية","متنوعات وطوارئ مختلفة","التفاعل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["组件故事生成器","终端体验","高效开发","组件示例","文档生成","开发工具"],"ja":["コンポーネントストーリー生成ツール","ターミナル体験","効率的な開発","コンポーネントの例","ドキュメント生成","開発ツール"],"ko":["컴포넌트 스토리 생성기","터미널 경험","고효율 개발","컴포넌트 예","문서 생성","개발 도구"],"es":["historias de componentes","diseño de interfaces de usuario","eficiencia","personalización","patrones de diseño","desarrollo de software","componentes reutilizables","experiencia del usuario","interactividad"],"fr":["histoires de composants","conception d''interfaces utilisateur","efficacité","personnalisation","modèles de conception","développement de logiciels","composants réutilisables","expérience utilisateur","interactivité"],"de":["Komponenten-Geschichten","Benutzeroberflächen-Design","Effizienz","Anpassung","Designmuster","Software-Entwicklung","wiederverwendbare Komponenten","Benutzererfahrung","Interaktivität"],"pt":["geração de componentes","histórias de componentes","experiência do usuário","eficiência","componentes personalizados","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software","tecnologias web"],"ru":["генерация компонентов","истории компонентов","пользовательский опыт","эффективность","индивидуальные компоненты","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения","веб-технологии"],"ar":["توليد المكونات","قصص المكونات","تجربة المستخدم","الكفاءة","مكونات مخصصة","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","تقنيات الويب"]}},"owner":"zerx-lab","repo":"zTerm","repoPath":"zerx-lab/zTerm","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"generate-component-story","description":"Create story examples for components. Use when writing stories, creating examples, or demonstrating component usage.","bodyPreview":"## Instructions\n\nWhen creating component stories:\n\n1. **Follow existing patterns**: Base stories on the styles found in `crates/story/src/stories` (examples: `tabs_story.rs`, `group_box_story.rs`, etc.)\n2. **Use sections**: Organize the story with `section!` calls for each major part\n3. **Comprehensive coverage**: Include all options, variants, and usage examples of the component\n\n## Examples\n\nA typical story structure includes:\n- Basic usage examples\n- Different variants and states\n- Interactiv","body":"## Instructions\n\nWhen creating component stories:\n\n1. **Follow existing patterns**: Base stories on the styles found in `crates/story/src/stories` (examples: `tabs_story.rs`, `group_box_story.rs`, etc.)\n2. **Use sections**: Organize the story with `section!` calls for each major part\n3. **Comprehensive coverage**: Include all options, variants, and usage examples of the component\n\n## Examples\n\nA typical story structure includes:\n- Basic usage examples\n- Different variants and states\n- Interactive examples\n- Edge cases and error states\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:29:07.228Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents needing structured component storytelling for next-generation terminal experiences.","zh":"适用于需要结构化组件故事讲述的下一代终端体验的前端代理。","ja":"構造化されたコンポーネントのストーリーテリングが必要な次世代のターミナルエクスペリエンスを必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 컴포넌트 스토리텔링이 필요한 차세대 터미널 경험을 위한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que necesitan una narrativa de componentes estructurada para experiencias de terminal de próxima generación.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de frontend ayant besoin d''une narration de composants structurée pour des expériences de terminal de nouvelle génération.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die eine strukturierte Komponenten-Erzählung für Terminal-Erfahrungen der nächsten Generation benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de storytelling de componentes estruturados para experiências de terminal de próxima geração.","ru":"Идеально для агентов фронтенда, которым необходимы структурированные истории компонентов для терминальных опытов нового поколения.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى سرد مكونات منظم لتحسين تجارب الطرفية من الجيل التالي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive component stories with organized sections and variant coverage, utilizing Rust programming language and crates like `crates/story/src/stories` for efficient terminal interactions.","zh":"赋予代理创建全面的组件故事的能力，具有组织化的部分和变体覆盖，利用Rust编程语言和类似`crates/story/src/stories`的crate，实现高效的终端交互。","ja":"Rustプログラミング言語と`crates/story/src/stories`などのクレートを使用して、エージェントが包括的なコンポーネントストーリーを作成できるようにし、組織化されたセクションとバリアントカバレッジを提供して、効率的なターミナルインタラクションを実現します。","ko":"Rust 프로그래밍 언어와 `crates/story/src/stories` 같은 크레이트를 사용하여 에이전트가 포괄적인 컴포넌트 스토리를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 조직화된 섹션과 변형 커버리지 제공으로 효율적인 터미널 상호작용을 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear historias de componentes integrales con secciones organizadas y cobertura de variantes, utilizando el lenguaje de programación Rust y crates como `crates/story/src/stories` para interacciones de terminal eficientes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des histoires de composants complètes avec des sections organisées et une couverture de variantes, en utilisant le langage de programmation Rust et des crates comme `crates/story/src/stories` pour des interactions de terminal efficaces.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, umfassende Komponenten-Geschichten mit organisierten Abschnitten und Variantenabdeckung zu erstellen, unter Verwendung der Rust-Programmiersprache und von Crates wie `crates/story/src/stories` für effiziente Terminal-Interaktionen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar histórias de componentes abrangentes com seções organizadas e cobertura de variantes, utilizando a linguagem de programação Rust e crates como `crates/story/src/stories` para interações de terminal eficientes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать всеобъемлющие истории компонентов с организованными разделами и покрытием вариантов, используя язык программирования Rust и crates как `crates/story/src/stories` для эффективного взаимодействия с терминалом.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إنشاء قصص مكونات شاملة مع أقسام منظمة وتغطية متغيرات، مستخدمين لغة برمجة رست وكرات مثل `crates/story/src/stories` من أجل تفاعلات طرفية فعالة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating interactive component demos","Creating variant-rich stories for UI components","Organizing story structures with section calls"],"zh":["生成交互式组件演示","创建富含变体的UI组件故事","使用部分调用组织故事结构"],"ja":["インタラクティブなコンポーネントデモを生成する","UIコンポーネントのバリアントに富んだストーリーを作成する","セクション呼び出しを使用してストーリーの構造を整理する"],"ko":["인터랙티브 컴포넌트 데모 생성","리치한 변형의 UI 컴포넌트 스토리 생성","섹션 호출을 사용하여 스토리 구조 조직"],"es":["Generación de demos de componentes interactivos","Creación de historias ricas en variantes para componentes de interfaz de usuario","Organización de estructuras de historias con llamadas de sección"],"fr":["Génération de démos de composants interactifs","Création d''histoires riches en variantes pour les composants d''interface utilisateur","Organisation de structures d''histoires avec des appels de section"],"de":["Generierung interaktiver Komponenten-Demos","Erstellung variantenreicher Geschichten für Benutzeroberflächen-Komponenten","Organisation von Geschichten-Strukturen mit Sektionsaufrufen"],"pt":["Geração de demonstrações interativas de componentes","Criação de histórias ricas em variantes para componentes de interface do usuário","Organização de estruturas de história com chamadas de seção"],"ru":["Генерация интерактивных демонстраций компонентов","Создание историй, богатых вариантами, для компонентов пользовательского интерфейса","Организация структуры истории с помощью вызовов разделов"],"ar":["توليد عروض توضيحية تفاعلية للمكونات","إنشاء قصص غنية بالمتغيرات لمكونات واجهة المستخدم","تنظيم هيكل القصة باستخدام مكالمات القسم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust programming knowledge","Specific to terminal experiences","Follows existing patterns in `crates/story/src/stories`"],"zh":["需要Rust编程知识","仅限于终端体验","遵循`crates/story/src/stories`中的现有模式"],"ja":["Rustプログラミングの知識が必要","ターミナルエクスペリエンスに特有","`crates/story/src/stories`内の既存のパターンに従う"],"ko":["Rust 프로그래밍 지식이 필요","터미널 경험에만 특화","`crates/story/src/stories` 내의 기존 패턴을 따름"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de programación en Rust","Específico para experiencias de terminal","Sigue patrones existentes en `crates/story/src/stories`"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en programmation Rust","Spécifique aux expériences de terminal","Suive des modèles existants dans `crates/story/src/stories`"],"de":["Benötigt Rust-Programmierkenntnisse","Spezifisch für Terminal-Erfahrungen","Folgt bestehenden Mustern in `crates/story/src/stories`"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de programação em Rust","Específico para experiências de terminal","Sigue padrões existentes em `crates/story/src/stories`"],"ru":["Требует знаний программирования на Rust","Спецефичен для терминальных опытов","Следует существующим шаблонам в `crates/story/src/stories`"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بلغة برمجة رست","محدد لتجارب الطرفية","يتبع الأنماط الحالية في `crates/story/src/stories`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('beggan78/f2016-6-dif/sport-wizard-translator', 'community', 'beggan78', 'f2016-6-dif', 'beggan78/f2016-6-dif', 'sport-wizard-translator', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z', '2026-02-18T03:28:44.376Z', NULL, '{"id":"beggan78/f2016-6-dif/sport-wizard-translator","name":"sport-wizard-translator","description":{"zh":"5v5Swedish","ja":"5v55v5Swedish","ko":"5v55v5Swedish","es":"El traductor de fútbol 5v5 Sport Wizard Translator traduce texto de la aplicación al sueco con terminología adecuada. Analiza el contexto y prioriza la naturalidad.","fr":"Le traducteur de football 5v5 Sport Wizard Translator traduit le texte de l''application en suédois avec terminologie appropriée. Il analyse le contexte et privilégie la naturalité.","de":"Der Fußball-Übersetzer 5v5 Sport Wizard Translator übersetzt Text der Anwendung ins Schwedische mit geeigneter Terminologie. Er analysiert den Kontext und priorisiert die Natürlichkeit.","pt":"O Sport Wizard Translator é uma ferramenta de tradução de contexto para treinadores de futebol 5v5, garantindo uma comunicação clara e eficaz.","ru":"Sport Wizard Translator - это инструмент контекстного перевода для тренеров по футболу 5х5, обеспечивающий четкую и эффективную коммуникацию.","ar":"مترجم سبوورت ويزارد هو أداة ترجمة سياقية لمدربي كرة القدم 5x5، مما يضمن تواصلا واضحا وفعالا.","en":"Soccer coach helper for 5v5 "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"5v5 ","ja":"5v5","ko":"5v55 ","es":"Traductor de fútbol 5v5: Sport Wizard Translator","fr":"Traducteur de football 5v5: Sport Wizard Translator","de":"Fußball-Übersetzer 5v5: Sport Wizard Translator","pt":"Tradutor de Futebol 5v5 para Treinadores","ru":"Переводчик футбола 5х5 для тренеров","ar":"مترجم كرة قدم 5x5 للمدربين","en":"sport-wizard-translator"},"description":{"zh":"5v5Swedish","ja":"5v55v5Swedish","ko":"5v55v5Swedish","es":"El traductor de fútbol 5v5 Sport Wizard Translator traduce texto de la aplicación al sueco con terminología adecuada. Analiza el contexto y prioriza la natur...","fr":"Le traducteur de football 5v5 Sport Wizard Translator traduit le texte de l''application en suédois avec terminologie appropriée. Il analyse le contexte et pr...","de":"Der Fußball-Übersetzer 5v5 Sport Wizard Translator übersetzt Text der Anwendung ins Schwedische mit geeigneter Terminologie. Er analysiert den Kontext und pr...","pt":"O Sport Wizard Translator é uma ferramenta de tradução de contexto para treinadores de futebol 5v5, garantindo uma comunicação clara e eficaz.","ru":"Sport Wizard Translator - это инструмент контекстного перевода для тренеров по футболу 5х5, обеспечивающий четкую и эффективную коммуникацию.","ar":"مترجم سبوورت ويزارد هو أداة ترجمة سياقية لمدربي كرة القدم 5x5، مما يضمن تواصلا واضحا وفعالا.","en":"Soccer coach helper for 5v5 "},"definition":{"en":"Soccer coach helper for 5v5 "},"features":{"zh":["5v5","Swedish","Deep context analysis","Domain-appropriate terminology","Natural phrasing","Consistency"],"ja":["5v5","Swedish","Deep context analysis","Domain-appropriate terminology","Natural phrasing","Consistency"],"ko":["5v5","Swedish","5v5","Deep context analysis","Domain-appropriate terminology","Natural phrasing"],"es":["Análisis de contexto profundo","Terminología adecuada para fútbol","Fraseo natural","Consistencia en la traducción"],"fr":["Analyse de contexte approfondie","Terminologie appropriée pour le football","Phrase naturelle","Consistance dans la traduction"],"de":["Tiefe Kontextanalyse","Geeignete Fußball-Terminologie","Natürliche Formulierung","Konsistenz in der Übersetzung"],"pt":["Análise de contexto profunda","Terminologia apropriada para o domínio","Frasologia natural","Consistência na tradução"],"ru":["Глубокий контекстный анализ","Терминология, подходящая для области","Естественная фразеология","Последовательность перевода"],"ar":["تحليل سياق عميق","مصطلحات مناسبة للنطاق","صياغة طبيعية","اتساق في الترجمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["5v5","Swedish","Deep context analysis","Domain-appropriate terminology","Natural phrasing","Consistency","5v5","Swedish"],"ja":["5v5","Swedish","Deep context analysis","Domain-appropriate terminology","Natural phrasing","Consistency","5v5","Swedish"],"ko":["5v5","Swedish","5v5","Deep context analysis","Domain-appropriate terminology","Natural phrasing","Consistency","5v5","Swedish"],"es":["traductor de fútbol 5v5","Sport Wizard Translator","traducción de texto","terminología de fútbol","análisis de contexto","naturalidad en la traducción"],"fr":["traducteur de football 5v5","Sport Wizard Translator","traduction de texte","terminologie de football","analyse de contexte","naturalité dans la traduction"],"de":["Fußball-Übersetzer 5v5","Sport Wizard Translator","Textübersetzung","Fußball-Terminologie","Kontextanalyse","Natürlichkeit in der Übersetzung"],"pt":["tradutor de futebol 5v5","ferramenta de tradução de contexto","comunicação de treinadores","aplicativos esportivos","terminologia esportiva","tradução natural"],"ru":["переводчик футбола 5х5","инструмент контекстного перевода","коммуникация тренеров","спортивные приложения","спортивная терминология","естественный перевод"],"ar":["مترجم كرة قدم 5x5","أداة ترجمة سياقية","تواصل مدربي كرة القدم","تطبيقات رياضية","مصطلحات رياضية","ترجمة طبيعية"]}},"owner":"beggan78","repo":"f2016-6-dif","repoPath":"beggan78/f2016-6-dif","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sport-wizard-translator","description":"Context-aware Swedish translation for Sport Wizard youth soccer coaching application. Use when the user explicitly requests translation of components, screens, features, or user-facing text to Swedish (e.g., Translate ConfigurationScreen to Swedish, Add Swedish translations for the game screen, Translate the new player rotation UI). This skill provides domain-specific soccer terminology, natural Swedish phrasing patterns, and automated translation workflow that updates both JSON translation files and component code.","bodyPreview":"# Sport Wizard Swedish Translator\n\nTranslate Sport Wizard application text to natural, context-aware Swedish with proper soccer terminology.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Deep context analysis** - Read and understand the component before translating\n2. **Domain-appropriate terminology** - Use Swedish soccer terms, not literal translations\n3. **Natural phrasing** - Prioritize natural Swedish word order over literal translation\n4. **Consistency** - Follow existing translation patterns in the codebase","body":"# Sport Wizard Swedish Translator\n\nTranslate Sport Wizard application text to natural, context-aware Swedish with proper soccer terminology.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Deep context analysis** - Read and understand the component before translating\n2. **Domain-appropriate terminology** - Use Swedish soccer terms, not literal translations\n3. **Natural phrasing** - Prioritize natural Swedish word order over literal translation\n4. **Consistency** - Follow existing translation patterns in the codebase\n5. **Preserve names** - Never translate app name, player names, or team names\n\n## Translation Workflow\n\nWhen the user requests translation (e.g., \"Translate GameScreen to Swedish\"):\n\n### Step 1: Analyze the Component\n\nRead the target component file to understand:\n- **Purpose**: What does this component do?\n- **User flow**: How does the user interact with it?\n- **Context**: Where does it appear in the app?\n- **Relationships**: What other components/features does it connect to?\n- **Existing translations**: Are any parts already translated?\n\n**Critical**: Do not just extract strings. Understand the domain context to choose appropriate terminology.\n\n### Step 2: Identify Translatable Text\n\nFind all user-facing text:\n- UI labels and headers\n- Button text\n- Placeholder text\n- Error/warning messages\n- Success messages\n- Helper text and tooltips\n- Modal content\n- Dropdown options\n\n**Exclude**:\n- Variable names and code identifiers\n- Comments (unless they become user-facing)\n- App name \"Sport Wizard\"\n- Player names\n- Team names\n- Log messages (unless user-visible)\n\n### Step 3: Determine Translation Strategy\n\nBefore translating, consult these references:\n\n1. **Soccer terminology** - Read `references/soccer-terminology.md`\n   - Check if text contains soccer-specific terms (defender, midfielder, formation, etc.)\n   - Use domain-appropriate Swedish terms (e.g., \"Back\" not \"Försvarare\")\n\n2. **Natural phrasing** - Read `references/translation-patterns.md`\n   - Check for common UI patterns (buttons, labels, errors)\n   - Apply natural Swedish word order and compound rules\n\n3. **Existing translations** - Read `references/existing-translations.md`\n   - Check if similar text is already translated\n   - Maintain consistent terminology across the app\n\n### Step 4: Create Translation Keys\n\nOrganize translations by namespace:\n\n**Namespace selection:**\n- Use `common` for generic/shared UI (buttons like \"Save\", \"Cancel\", \"Delete\")\n- Use component-specific namespace for component-unique text (e.g., `configuration`, `game`, `profile`)\n- Create new namespace if needed (e.g., `game.json`, `profile.json`)\n\n**Key structure:**\n- Use nested keys for logical grouping: `\"header.title\"`, `\"buttons.save\"`, `\"errors.validation\"`\n- Use descriptive names: `\"squad.selectTitle\"` not `\"label1\"`\n- Group related items: `\"goalies.header\"`, `\"goalies.periodLabel\"`, `\"goalies.placeholder\"`\n\n**Example structure:**\n```json\n{\n  \"header\": {\n    \"title\": \"Screen Title\"\n  },\n  \"buttons\": {\n    \"primary\": \"Primary Action\",\n    \"secondary\": \"Secondary Action\"\n  },\n  \"messages\": {\n    \"success\": \"Success message\",\n    \"error\": \"Error message\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 5: Generate Swedish Translations\n\nFor each translatable string:\n\n1. **Understand the context** - What is this text doing? What action/state does it represent?\n2. **Check references** - Is there domain terminology or existing pattern?\n3. **Choose natural Swedish** - Prioritize natural phrasing over literal translation\n4. **Maintain interpolation** - Preserve `{{variables}}` for dynamic content\n5. **Apply grammar** - Ensure proper Swedish grammar (gender, plural, word order)\n\n**Example process:**\n\nEnglish: \"Add Player to Team\"\n1. Context: Button action to add a player\n2. Check: \"Add\" → \"Lägg till\" (from existing-translations.md)\n3. Natural: \"Lägg till Spelare i Laget\"\n4. No interpolation needed\n5. Grammar: ✅ Natural Swedish word order\n\nEnglish: \"You have selected {{count}} players\"\n1. Context: Feedback message showing selection count\n2. Check: \"Select\" → \"Välj\" → \"Vald/Valda\"\n3. Natural: \"Du har valt {{count}} spelare\"\n4. Keep: `{{count}}` variable\n5. Grammar: ✅ \"Valda\" plural form matches \"spelare\"\n\n### Step 6: Update Translation Files\n\nUpdate or create JSON files in `src/locales/sv/{namespace}.json`:\n\n**If file exists:**\n- Read current content\n- Merge new translations (preserve existing keys)\n- Maintain nested structure\n- Keep consistent formatting\n\n**If creating new file:**\n- Create both `src/locales/en/{namespace}.json` (English) and `src/locales/sv/{namespace}.json` (Swedish)\n- Update `src/locales/i18n.js` to import new namespace files\n- Add namespace to i18n.init resources configuration\n\n**Example update to existing file:**\n\nBefore:\n```json\n{\n  \"header\": {\n    \"title\": \"Spel- och Lagkonfiguration\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nAfter (adding new section):\n```json\n{\n  \"header\": {\n    \"title\": \"Spel- och Lagkonfiguration\"\n  },\n  \"buttons\": {\n    \"save\": \"Spara\",\n    \"cancel\": \"Avbryt\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 7: Update Component Code\n\nModify the component to use translations:\n\n1. **Add import** (if not present):\n```javascript\nimport { useTranslation } from ''react-i18next'';\n```\n\n2. **Add hook** (if not present):\n```javascript\nconst { t } = useTranslation(''namespace'');\n```\n\n3. **Replace hardcoded strings** with `t()` calls:\n\nBefore:\n```javascript\n<h1>Game & Squad Configuration</h1>\n<button>Save Configuration</button>\n<p>You have selected {count} players</p>\n```\n\nAfter:\n```javascript\n<h1>{t(''configuration:header.title'')}</h1>\n<button>{t(''common:buttons.save'')}</button>\n<p>{t(''configuration:squad.selectTitle'', { count })}</p>\n```\n\n**Translation key format:**\n- Same namespace: `t(''key.path'')`\n- Different namespace: `t(''namespace:key.path'')`\n- With variables: `t(''key.path'', { variable: value })`\n\n4. **Handle multi-namespace usage**:\n\nIf component uses multiple namespaces:\n```javascript\n// Option 1: Multiple useTranslation calls\nconst { t } = useTranslation(''configuration'');\nconst { t: tCommon } = useTranslation(''common'');\n\n// Option 2: Single call with array\nconst { t } = useTranslation([''configuration'', ''common'']);\n// Then use: t(''configuration:key'') or t(''common:key'')\n```\n\n### Step 8: Verify Implementation\n\nAfter updates:\n\n1. **Check JSON validity** - Ensure valid JSON syntax (no trailing commas, proper quotes)\n2. **Check i18n.js** - Verify new namespaces are imported and registered\n3. **Check imports** - Ensure component has correct useTranslation import\n4. **Check keys** - Verify all translation keys exist in JSON files\n5. **Check variables** - Ensure interpolation variables match between English and Swedish\n\n## Domain-Specific Guidelines\n\n### Soccer Terminology\n\n**Always use soccer-specific Swedish terms:**\n- Defender → \"Back\" (NOT \"Försvarare\")\n- Midfielder → \"Mittfält\"\n- Forward/Attacker → \"Forward\"\n- Goalkeeper → \"Målvakt\"\n- Substitute → \"Avbytare\"\n\n**For positions, use natural Swedish compounds:**\n- Left Back → \"Vänsterback\"\n- Right Midfielder → \"Höger mittfält\"\n- Left Forward → \"Vänsterforward\"\n\nSee `references/soccer-terminology.md` for complete glossary.\n\n### Natural Swedish Phrasing\n\n**Prioritize natural word order:**\n- ❌ \"Application Language\" → \"Applikationsspråk\" (too literal)\n- ✅ \"Application Language\" → \"Språk i appen\" (natural)\n\n**Use appropriate compounds:**\n- ✅ \"matchformat\" (one word)\n- ✅ \"lagkapten\" (one word)\n- ❌ \"motståndarlagsnamn\" (too long, use \"motståndarlags namn\")\n\n**Use natural actions:**\n- ❌ \"Addera Spelare\" (too formal)\n- ✅ \"Lägg till Spelare\" (natural)\n\nSee `references/translation-patterns.md` for patterns and examples.\n\n### Consistency with Codebase\n\n**Always check existing translations first:**\n- Read `references/existing-translations.md` for established patterns\n- Use same terms for same concepts across the app\n- Maintain consistent namespace organization\n\n**Common established terms:**\n- Squad → \"Trupp\"\n- Team → \"Lag\"\n- Game/Match → \"Match\" (always)\n- Period → \"Period\"\n- Rotation → \"Byte\"\n\n## Common Mistakes to Avoid\n\n❌ **Literal translation without context**\n- \"Defender\" → \"Försvarare\" (wrong - should be \"Back\")\n\n❌ **Ignoring natural Swedish word order**\n- \"Application Language\" → \"Applikationsspråk\" (wrong - should be \"Språk i appen\")\n\n❌ **Translating names**\n- \"Sport Wizard\" → \"Sport Trollkarl\" (wrong - keep original)\n\n❌ **Inconsistent terminology**\n- Using both \"Trupp\" and \"Lag\" for \"squad\" (wrong - use \"Trupp\" consistently)\n\n❌ **Breaking interpolation**\n- Original: \"Selected: {{count}}\"\n- Wrong: \"Valda: {antal}\" (changed variable name)\n- Correct: \"Valda: {{count}}\" (kept variable name)\n\n❌ **Not updating component code**\n- Only creating JSON files without updating components to use t() calls\n\n## Output Format\n\nAfter completing translation, provide:\n\n1. **Summary** of what was translated\n2. **Translation files** created/updated (show file paths and new content)\n3. **Component changes** made (show the diff or updated code sections)\n4. **Namespace info** if new namespace was created (show i18n.js updates)\n\nExample output:\n\n```\nTranslated ConfigurationScreen to Swedish:\n\nUpdated files:\n- src/locales/sv/configuration.json (added 15 new keys)\n- src/locales/en/configuration.json (added 15 new keys)\n- src/components/setup/ConfigurationScreen.js (replaced hardcoded strings with t() calls)\n\nNew translation keys added:\n- squad.selectTitle\n- squad.addPlayerTitle\n- buttons.saveConfig\n- goalies.header\n...\n\nComponent now uses useTranslation(''configuration'') hook with proper t() calls.\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- **Always read the component first** - Don''t translate blindly\n- **Context is king** - Same English word may have different Swedish translations based on context\n- **Natural over literal** - Swedish should sound natural to native speakers\n- **Consistency matters** - Check existing translations to maintain app-wide consistency\n- **Test interpolation** - Ensure {{variables}} work correctly in Swedish sentences\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:28:44.376Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Language Agents requiring domain-specific translation capabilities for soccer terminology in Swedish.","zh":"非常适合需要瑞典语特定领域翻译能力的语言代理，特别是足球术语。","ja":"サッカー用語のスウェーデン語への翻訳能力が必要な言語エージェントに最適です。","ko":"스웨덴어 축구 용어에 대한 도메인별 번역 기능이 필요한 언어 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de lenguaje que requieren capacidades de traducción específicas de dominio para la terminología del fútbol en sueco.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de langage nécessitant des capacités de traduction spécifiques au domaine de la terminologie du football en suédois.","de":"Perfekt für Sprachagenten, die domänen-spezifische Übersetzungsfähigkeiten für Fußballterminologie auf Schwedisch erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Linguagem que exigem capacidades de tradução específicas de domínio para terminologia de futebol em sueco.","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, требующих возможностей перевода с учетом домена для футбольной терминологии на шведском языке.","ar":"مثالي لعميل اللغة الذين يتطلبون khảيات الترجمة المحددة بالمجال لمصطلحات كرة القدم باللغة السويدية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to translate Sport Wizard application text into natural, context-aware Swedish using proper soccer terminology, prioritizing consistency and natural phrasing over literal translations, leveraging deep context analysis and domain-appropriate terminology.","zh":"赋予代理将 Sport Wizard 应用程序文本翻译成自然、上下文感知的瑞典语，使用适当的足球术语，优先考虑一致性和自然的表达方式而不是逐字翻译，利用深度上下文分析和领域适当的术语。","ja":"Sport Wizard アプリケーションのテキストを自然で状況に応じたスウェーデン語に翻訳する能力をエージェントに与え、サッカー用語を適切に使用し、一貫性と自然なフレージングを優先し、深いコンテキスト分析とドメインに適した用語を利用する。","ko":"에이전트는 Sport Wizard 애플리케이션 텍스트를 자연스럽고 문맥적으로 인식 가능한 스웨덴어로 번역할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 적절한 축구 용어를 사용하고 일관성과 자연스러운 문구를 우선시하며 깊은 문맥 분석과 도메인 적합한 용어를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a traducir texto de la aplicación Sport Wizard a sueco natural y consciente del contexto, utilizando la terminología del fútbol adecuada, priorizando la coherencia y la fraseología natural sobre traducciones literales, aprovechando el análisis profundo del contexto y la terminología adecuada para el dominio.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traduire le texte de l''application Sport Wizard en suédois naturel et conscient du contexte, en utilisant la terminologie du football appropriée, en donnant la priorité à la cohérence et à la phraséologie naturelle plutôt qu''aux traductions littérales, en exploitant l''analyse approfondie du contexte et la terminologie appropriée au domaine.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Text der Sport Wizard-Anwendung in natürlichen, kontextbewussten Schwedisch zu übersetzen, unter Verwendung geeigneter Fußballterminologie, mit Priorisierung von Konsistenz und natürlicher Formulierung gegenüber wörtlichen Übersetzungen, unter Ausnutzung tiefer Kontextanalyse und domänen-adäquater Terminologie.","pt":"Habilita agentes a traduzir texto do aplicativo Sport Wizard para sueco natural, com análise de contexto e terminologia apropriada, priorizando a consistência e a fraseologia natural em detrimento de traduções literais, aproveitando a análise profunda de contexto e terminologia apropriada ao domínio.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью переводить текст приложения Sport Wizard на естественный, контекстно-зависимый шведский язык с использованием правильной футбольной терминологии, отдаёт предпочтение последовательности и естественному словопорядку над буквальными переводами, используя глубокий контекстный анализ и терминологию, соответствующую домену.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكيل من ترجمة نص تطبيق Sport Wizard إلى سويدية طبيعية وواعية للسياق باستخدام المصطلحات الصحيحة لكرة القدم، وأولوية للاتساق والصياغة الطبيعية على الترجمات الحرفية، واستخدام تحليل السياق العميق والمصطلحات المناسبة للمجال."},"useCases":{"en":["Translating soccer coaching strategies for 5v5 teams","Generating natural-sounding Swedish text for soccer-related applications","Ensuring consistency in Swedish translations across the Sport Wizard codebase"],"zh":["为 5v5 队伍翻译足球教练战略","为足球相关应用程序生成自然听起来的瑞典语文本","确保 Sport Wizard 代码库中瑞典语翻译的一致性"],"ja":["5 対 5 チームのサッカー コーチング戦略の翻訳","サッカー関連アプリケーションの自然なスウェーデン語テキストの生成","Sport Wizard コードベースのスウェーデン語翻訳の一貫性の確保"],"ko":["5대5 팀을 위한 축구 코칭 전략 번역","축구 관련 애플리케이션을 위한 자연스러운 스웨덴어 텍스트 생성","Sport Wizard 코드베이스에서 스웨덴어 번역의 일관성 보장"],"es":["Traducir estrategias de entrenamiento de fútbol para equipos de 5v5","Generar texto sueco natural para aplicaciones relacionadas con el fútbol","Asegurar la coherencia en las traducciones al sueco en todo el código base de Sport Wizard"],"fr":["Traduire les stratégies d''entraînement de football pour les équipes 5v5","Générer du texte suédois naturel pour les applications liées au football","Assurer la cohérence des traductions en suédois dans l''ensemble du code base de Sport Wizard"],"de":["Übersetzen von Fußball-Trainingsstrategien für 5-gegen-5-Teams","Erzeugen von natürlich klingendem Schwedisch für Fußbal