Unternehmensumgebungen","Berechtigungsarchitektur in zwei Schichten","Muster für Lese-, Bearbeitungs- und Befehlsausführung"],"pt":["Controle de acesso granular","Políticas de permissão abrangentes","Automação segura em ambientes empresariais","Arquitetura de permissão em duas camadas","Suporte a padrões de leitura e edição"],"ru":["Гранулярный контроль доступа","Комплексные политики разрешений","Безопасная автоматизация в корпоративных средах","Двухслойная архитектура разрешений","Поддержка шаблонов чтения и редактирования"],"ar":["التحكم في الوصول المتقن","سياسات الإذن الشاملة","التحكم الآمن في البيئات التجارية","هيكل الإذن ذو الطبقتين","دعم أنماط القراءة والتعديل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Moai CC Permission Mode","LiveKit","权限管理","工具访问控制","命令执行控制","系统操作控制","企业环境"],"ja":["Moai CC パーミッション モード","LiveKit","権限管理","ツールアクセス制御","コマンド実行制御","システム操作制御","企業環境"],"ko":["모아이 CC 퍼미션 모드","라이브킷","권한 관리","도구 액세스 제어","명령 실행 제어","시스템 작업 제어","기업 환경"],"es":["modo de permiso Moai-CC","gestión de permisos","acceso a herramientas","operaciones del sistema","automatización segura","arquitectura de permisos","LiveKit","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["mode de permission Moai-CC","gestion de permissions","accès aux outils","opérations du système","automatisation sécurisée","architecture de permissions","LiveKit","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Moai-CC-Berechtigungsmodus","Berechtigungsmanagement","Zugriff auf Tools","Systemoperationen","sichere Automatisierung","Berechtigungsarchitektur","LiveKit","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["modo de permissão","gerenciamento de permissões","controle de acesso","automação segura","LiveKit","plataforma de permissões","políticas de permissão","arquitetura de permissão"],"ru":["режим разрешения","управление разрешениями","контроль доступа","безопасная автоматизация","LiveKit","платформа разрешений","политики разрешений","архитектура разрешений"],"ar":["وضع الإذن","إدارة الإذن","التحكم في الوصول","التحكم الآمن","LiveKit","منصة الإذن","سياسات الإذن","هيكل الإذن"]}},"owner":"jg-chalk-io","repo":"Nora-LiveKit","repoPath":"jg-chalk-io/Nora-LiveKit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"moai-cc-permission-mode","description":"Claude Code permission configuration and policy management strategies for enterprise security. Covers permission modes, tool access control, whitelist/blacklist patterns, and enterprise deployment best practices.","version":"4.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Claude Code Permission Modes\n\n## Overview\n\nClaude Code permission management provides fine-grained control over tool access, command execution, and system operations through comprehensive permission policies. Enables secure, controlled automation in enterprise environments.\n\n## Permission Architecture\n\n### Two-Layer Permission System\n\n```\nLayer 1: allowedTools (Whitelist)\n  ├─ Read patterns: Read(**/*.{js,ts})\n  ├─ Edit patterns: Edit(src/**)\n  └─ Bash patterns: Bash(git:*), Bash(npm:*)\n\nLayer","body":"# Claude Code Permission Modes\n\n## Overview\n\nClaude Code permission management provides fine-grained control over tool access, command execution, and system operations through comprehensive permission policies. Enables secure, controlled automation in enterprise environments.\n\n## Permission Architecture\n\n### Two-Layer Permission System\n\n```\nLayer 1: allowedTools (Whitelist)\n  ├─ Read patterns: Read(**/*.{js,ts})\n  ├─ Edit patterns: Edit(src/**)\n  └─ Bash patterns: Bash(git:*), Bash(npm:*)\n\nLayer 2: deniedTools (Blacklist Override)\n  ├─ Secrets files: .env*, .aws/**, .vercel/**\n  ├─ Destructive: rm -rf:*, sudo:*\n  └─ Dangerous: chmod 777:*\n```\n\n## Permission Modes\n\n### Whitelist Approach (Recommended)\n\nDefine explicitly allowed tool patterns:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"permissions\": {\n    \"allowedTools\": [\n      \"Read(**/*.{js,ts,json,md})\",\n      \"Edit(**/*.{js,ts})\",\n      \"Bash(git:*)\",\n      \"Bash(npm:*)\",\n      \"Bash(uv:*)\",\n      \"Bash(pytest:*)\",\n      \"Bash(mypy:*)\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Benefits**:\n- Secure by default (deny unless explicitly allowed)\n- Clear audit trail\n- Easy to review\n- Enterprise-ready\n\n### Blacklist Approach (Not Recommended)\n\nExplicitly block dangerous operations:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"permissions\": {\n    \"deniedTools\": [\n      \"Edit(/config/secrets.json)\",\n      \"Edit(.env*)\",\n      \"Edit(.aws/**)\",\n      \"Bash(rm -rf:*)\",\n      \"Bash(sudo:*)\",\n      \"Bash(chmod 777:*)\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Issues**:\n- Requires knowing all dangerous patterns\n- New vulnerabilities not covered\n- Hard to maintain\n- Not enterprise-recommended\n\n## Tool Pattern Syntax\n\n### Read Operations\n\n```\nRead(glob_pattern)\n\nExamples:\n- Read(**/*.{js,ts})          # All JS/TS files recursively\n- Read(.claude/**)            # All Claude files\n- Read(docs/api/**/*.md)      # API documentation\n- Read(config/production.json) # Specific file\n```\n\n### Edit Operations\n\n```\nEdit(glob_pattern)\n\nExamples:\n- Edit(src/**/*.py)           # Source code only\n- Edit(src/services/*.ts)     # Specific directory\n```\n\n**Never Edit**:\n- `.env*` files\n- `.aws/` credentials\n- `.vercel/` project config\n- `secrets.json`, `credentials.json`\n\n### Bash Commands\n\n```\nBash(command:*)\n\nExamples:\n- Bash(git:*)                 # All git operations\n- Bash(npm:*)                 # NPM package management\n- Bash(uv:*)                  # UV (Python) operations\n- Bash(pytest:*)              # Testing\n- Bash(mypy:*)                # Type checking\n- Bash(ruff:*)                # Python linting\n\nDangerous (Block):\n- Bash(rm -rf:*)              # Recursive delete\n- Bash(sudo:*)                # Superuser access\n- Bash(chmod 777:*)           # Permission changes\n- Bash(find.*-delete:*)       # File deletion\n```\n\n## Security Patterns\n\n### Production-Grade Configuration\n\n```json\n{\n  \"permissions\": {\n    \"allowedTools\": [\n      \"Read(**)\",\n      \"Edit(src/**)\",\n      \"Edit(tests/**)\",\n      \"Bash(git:*)\",\n      \"Bash(uv:*)\",\n      \"Bash(pytest:*)\",\n      \"Bash(mypy:*)\",\n      \"Bash(ruff:*)\"\n    ],\n    \"deniedTools\": [\n      \"Edit(.*)\",\n      \"Edit(.env*)\",\n      \"Edit(.aws/**)\",\n      \"Edit(.vercel/**)\",\n      \"Bash(rm:*)\",\n      \"Bash(sudo:*)\",\n      \"Bash(chmod:*)\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"sandbox\": {\n    \"allowUnsandboxedCommands\": false\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Sensitive Data Protection\n\nCritical patterns to block:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"deniedTools\": [\n    \"Edit(.env*)\",\n    \"Edit(.env.local)\",\n    \"Edit(.env.production)\",\n    \"Edit(.aws/**)\",\n    \"Edit(.aws/credentials)\",\n    \"Edit(.aws/config)\",\n    \"Edit(.vercel/**)\",\n    \"Edit(config/**/secrets.json)\",\n    \"Edit(**/*credentials*.json)\",\n    \"Edit(**/*password*.json)\",\n    \"Edit(**/*token*.json)\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Permission Validation\n\nAlways validate permission configurations:\n\n```bash\n# Check current settings\ncat .claude/settings.json | jq ''.permissions''\n\n# Verify allowedTools patterns\ncat .claude/settings.json | jq ''.permissions.allowedTools[]''\n\n# Verify deniedTools patterns\ncat .claude/settings.json | jq ''.permissions.deniedTools[]''\n\n# Test specific operation\n# Try Read(test_file.md) → allowed?\n# Try Edit(.env) → denied?\n# Try Bash(git status) → allowed?\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Security-First Approach\n\n- ✅ Use whitelist (allowedTools) instead of blacklist\n- ✅ Protect secrets files (.env*, .aws/, .vercel/)\n- ✅ Block destructive commands (rm -rf, sudo, chmod)\n- ✅ Enable sandbox mode\n- ✅ Regularly review permissions\n- ✅ Audit permission violations\n- ✅ Document permission decisions\n\n### Team Collaboration\n\n- ✅ Document permission changes in commit\n- ✅ Explain security rationale\n- ✅ Test with different roles\n- ✅ Keep audit log of changes\n\n## Common Patterns by Use Case\n\n### Development Environment\n\n```json\n{\n  \"allowedTools\": [\n    \"Read(**)\",\n    \"Edit(src/**)\",\n    \"Edit(tests/**)\",\n    \"Edit(.claude/**)\",\n    \"Bash(git:*)\",\n    \"Bash(uv:*)\",\n    \"Bash(pytest:*)\",\n    \"Bash(mypy:*)\",\n    \"Bash(ruff:*)\"\n  ],\n  \"deniedTools\": [\n    \"Edit(.env*)\",\n    \"Edit(.aws/**)\",\n    \"Bash(rm -rf:*)\",\n    \"Bash(sudo:*)\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### CI/CD Pipeline\n\n```json\n{\n  \"allowedTools\": [\n    \"Read(src/**)\",\n    \"Read(tests/**)\",\n    \"Read(.github/workflows/**)\",\n    \"Bash(git:*)\",\n    \"Bash(uv:*)\",\n    \"Bash(pytest:*)\",\n    \"Bash(mypy:*)\"\n  ],\n  \"deniedTools\": [\n    \"Edit(**)\",\n    \"Bash(sudo:*)\",\n    \"Bash(rm:*)\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Read-Only Analysis\n\n```json\n{\n  \"allowedTools\": [\n    \"Read(**)\",\n    \"Bash(git:log)\",\n    \"Bash(git:show)\"\n  ],\n  \"deniedTools\": [\n    \"Edit(**)\",\n    \"Bash(git:push)\",\n    \"Bash(git:pull)\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## TRUST 5 Compliance\n\n- **Test-First**: Permission patterns tested with actual Claude Code usage scenarios\n- **Readable**: Clear permission naming and organization, documented rationale\n- **Unified**: Consistent permission approach across all environments\n- **Secured**: Whitelist-based, blocking all dangerous operations\n- **Trackable**: Audit trail of permission modifications and changes\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- `moai-cc-hooks` - Hook execution for pre/post-tool validation\n- `moai-core-env-security` - Environment variable security\n- `moai-cc-sandbox-isolation` - Sandbox mode configuration\n\n---\n\n**Last Updated**: 2025-11-19\n**Version**: 4.0.0\n**Enterprise Production Ready**: Yes ✅\n**Maturity**: Stable\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:28:44.458Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Security-Conscious Agents needing fine-grained permission management in LiveKit based platforms","zh":"非常适合需要在LiveKit基于平台上进行细粒度权限管理的安全意识强的代理","ja":"LiveKitベースのプラットフォームで細粒度のパーミッション管理を必要とするセキュリティ意識の高いエージェントに最適","ko":"LiveKit 기반 플랫폼에서 세분화된 권한 관리가 필요한 보안 의식이 높은 에이전트에게 완벽한 솔루션","es":"Perfecto para agentes conscientes de la seguridad que necesitan un control de permisos detallado en plataformas basadas en LiveKit","fr":"Parfait pour les agents sensibles à la sécurité nécessitant une gestion de permissions détaillée sur les plateformes basées sur LiveKit","de":"Perfekt für sicherheitsbewusste Agenten, die eine feingranulare Berechtigungsverwaltung in LiveKit-basierten Plattformen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Conscientes de Segurança que precisam de gerenciamento de permissões granular em plataformas baseadas em LiveKit","ru":"Идеально для агентов, осознающих проблемы безопасности, которым необходим细ный контроль разрешений в платформах на основе LiveKit","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الواعين لأمن المعلومات الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة صلاحيات دقيقة في منصات تعتمد على LiveKit"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce comprehensive permission policies, enabling secure and controlled automation in enterprise environments through a two-layer permission system, including allowedTools whitelisting and command execution control using Bash and Read/Edit patterns","zh":"赋予代理实施综合权限策略的能力，通过两层权限系统实现企业环境中的安全和受控自动化，包括允许的工具白名单和使用Bash和读/编辑模式的命令执行控制","ja":"エージェントに包括的なパーミッションポリシーを実施する能力を与え、Bashおよび読み/編集パターンを使用するコマンド実行制御と許可されたツールの白名単に基づく二層のパーミッションシステムを通じて、企業環境における安全で制御された自動化を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 권한 정책을 시행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, Bash 및 읽기/편집 패턴을 사용하는 명령어 실행 제어와 허용된 도구의 白名單에 기반한 2차 권한 시스템을 통해 기업 환경에서 보안이 보장되고 통제된 자동화를 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar políticas de permisos integrales, permitiendo la automatización segura y controlada en entornos empresariales a través de un sistema de permisos de dos capas, que incluye la lista de herramientas permitidas y el control de ejecución de comandos utilizando Bash y patrones de lectura/edición","fr":"Habilite les agents à appliquer des politiques de permissions complètes, permettant l''automatisation sécurisée et contrôlée dans les environnements d''entreprise via un système de permissions en deux couches, comprenant la liste blanche d''outils et le contrôle d''exécution de commandes en utilisant Bash et des modèles de lecture/édition","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Berechtigungsrichtlinien durchzusetzen, ermöglicht sichere und kontrollierte Automation in Unternehmensumgebungen durch ein zweischichtiges Berechtigungssystem, das Whitelisting von Tools und Befehlsausführungskontrolle unter Verwendung von Bash und Lese-/Bearbeitungsmustern umfasst","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar políticas de permissão abrangentes, permitindo automação segura e controlada em ambientes empresariais por meio de um sistema de permissão em duas camadas, incluindo whitelisting de allowedTools e controle de execução de comandos usando Bash e padrões de Leitura/Edição","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать комплексные политики разрешений, обеспечивая безопасную и контролируемую автоматизацию в корпоративных средах посредством двухслойной системы разрешений, включая белый список allowedTools и контроль выполнения команд с использованием Bash и шаблонов чтения/редактирования","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنفيذ سياسات الصلاحيات الشاملة، مما يتيح Automação آمنة ومراقبة في بيئات الشركات من خلال نظام صلاحيات مكون من طبقتين، بما في ذلك قائمة AllowedTools البيضاء ومراقبة تنفيذ الأوامر باستخدام Bash وأنماط القراءة/التحرير"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing role-based access control for tool execution","Configuring whitelisted Read patterns for secure data access","Managing Bash command permissions for automated system operations"],"zh":["为工具执行实施基于角色的访问控制","为安全数据访问配置白名单读取模式","管理Bash命令权限以进行自动系统操作"],"ja":["ツールの実行に対するロールベースのアクセス制御の実施","セキュアなデータアクセスのために許可された読み取りパターンの設定","自動システム操作のためのBashコマンドのパーミッション管理"],"ko":["도구 실행을 위한 역할 기반 접근 제어 구현","보안 데이터 접근을 위한 허용된 읽기 패턴 구성","자동 시스템 연산을 위한 Bash 명령어 권한 관리"],"es":["Implementar el control de acceso basado en roles para la ejecución de herramientas","Configurar patrones de lectura permitidos para un acceso de datos seguro","Administrar permisos de comandos de Bash para operaciones de sistema automatizadas"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre le contrôle d''accès basé sur les rôles pour l''exécution d''outils","Configurer des modèles de lecture autorisés pour un accès sécurisé aux données","Gérer les permissions de commandes Bash pour les opérations de système automatisées"],"de":["Implementierung von rollenbasiertem Zugriffsschutz für die Ausführung von Tools","Konfigurieren von Lese-Patterns für einen sicheren Datenzugriff","Verwalten von Bash-Befehlsberechtigungen für automatisierte Systemoperationen"],"pt":["Implementar controle de acesso baseado em funções para execução de ferramentas","Configurar padrões de leitura whitelisted para acesso seguro a dados","Gerenciar permissões de comando Bash para operações de sistema automatizadas"],"ru":["Реализация контроля доступа на основе ролей для выполнения инструментов","Настройка белого списка шаблонов чтения для безопасного доступа к данным","Управление разрешениями команд Bash для автоматизированных системных операций"],"ar":["تنفيذ التحكم في الوصول temel على الأدوار لتنفيذ الأدوات","تكوين أنماط القراءة البيضاء لوصول آمن إلى البيانات","إدارة صلاحيات أوامر Bash للعمليات النظامية المُتمتة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires LiveKit based platform integration","Dependent on Claude Code permission architecture"],"zh":["需要LiveKit基于平台集成","依赖于Claude Code权限架构"],"ja":["LiveKitベースのプラットフォームとの統合が必要","Claude Codeのパーミッションアーキテクチャに依存"],"ko":["LiveKit 기반 플랫폼 통합 필요","Claude Code 권한 아키텍처에 의존"],"es":["Requiere integración con plataforma basada en LiveKit","Dependiente de la arquitectura de permisos de Claude Code"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec une plateforme basée sur LiveKit","Dépend de l''architecture de permissions de Claude Code"],"de":["Benötigt Integration in eine LiveKit-basierte Plattform","Abhängig von der Berechtigungsarchitektur von Claude Code"],"pt":["Requer integração com plataforma baseada em LiveKit","Dependente da arquitetura de permissão do Claude Code"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с платформой на основе LiveKit","Зависит от архитектуры разрешений Claude Code"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع منصة تعتمد على LiveKit","يعتمد على هيكل صلاحيات Claude Code"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('pr-pm/prpm/creating-skills', 'community', 'pr-pm', 'prpm', 'pr-pm/prpm', 'creating-skills', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z', '2026-02-18T03:29:27.959Z', NULL, '{"id":"pr-pm/prpm/creating-skills","name":"creating-skills","description":{"zh":"创建技能是为了帮助未来的 Claude 实例快速找到和应用有效的 AI 编码技术和工具。技能必须是可发现的、可扫描的和可执行的","ja":"スキルを作成するのは、将来の Claude インスタンスが有効な AI コーディング技術とツールをすぐに見つけて適用できるようにするためです。スキルは発見可能、スキャナブル、実行可能でなければなりません","ko":"스��을 생성하는 것은 미래의 Claude 인스턴스가 효과적인 AI 코딩 기술과 도구를 빠르게 발견하고 적용할 수 있도록 하는 것입니다. 스킬은 발견 가능, 스캔 가능, 실행 가능해야 합니다","es":"Las habilidades son guías de referencia para técnicas, patrones y herramientas comprobadas. Ayudan a futuras instancias de Claude a encontrar y aplicar enfoques efectivos.","fr":"Les compétences sont des guides de référence pour des techniques, des modèles et des outils éprouvés. Ils aident les futures instances de Claude à trouver et à appliquer des approches efficaces.","de":"Fähigkeiten sind Referenzleitfäden für bewährte Techniken, Muster und Tools. Sie helfen zukünftigen Claude-Instanzen, effektive Ansätze zu finden und anzuwenden.","pt":"Habilidades de codificação são guias de referência para técnicas, padrões ou ferramentas comprovadas, projetadas para ajudar futuras instâncias do Claude a encontrar e aplicar abordagens eficazes rapidamente.","ru":"Навыки кодирования являются справочными руководствами для проверенных техник, шаблонов или инструментов, предназначенных для того, чтобы помочь будущим экземплярам Claude быстро найти и применить эффективные подходы.","ar":"مهارات الكود هي أدلة مرجعية للتقنيات والمواصفات والأدوات المثبتة، مصممة لمساعدة مثيلات الكلود المستقبلية على العثور على نهج فعال وتطبيقه بسرعة.","en":"The universal registry for AI coding tools"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"创建技能：AI 编码工具的通用注册表","ja":"スキルの作成：AI コーディングツールのユニバーサルレジストリ","ko":"스킬 생성: AI 코딩 도구의 유니버설 레지