тор рабочих процессов n8n: Автоматизируйте с помощ...","ar":"مهندس تيار العمل n8n: أتمتة مع ذكاء اصطناعي","en":"n8n-workflow-architect"},"description":{"zh":"n8n 工作流架构师是企业级自动化解决方案，提供战略性指导以构建可靠的自动化系统","ja":"n8n ワークフロー アーキテクトは、企業向けの自動化ソリューションであり、信頼性の高い自動化システムを構築するための戦略的ガイダンスを提供","ko":"n8n 워크플로 아키텍트는 기업용 자동화 솔루션으로 안정적인 자동화 시스템을 구축하기 위한 전략적 지침을 제공","es":"El arquitecto de flujos de trabajo n8n es un experto en automatización que ayuda a planificar y ejecutar proyectos de automatización empresarial","fr":"L''architecte de workflow n8n est un expert en automatisation qui aide à planifier et à exécuter des projets d''automatisation d''entreprise","de":"Der n8n-Workflow-Architekt ist ein Automatisierungsexperte, der bei der Planung und Durchführung von Unternehmensautomatisierungsprojekten hilft","pt":"O Arquiteto de Fluxo de Trabalho n8n é um skill que fornece orientação estratégica para construir sistemas de automação que sobrevivem à produção.","ru":"Архитектор рабочих процессов n8n - это навык, который предоставляет стратегическое руководство для построения систем автоматизации, которые выдерживают произ...","ar":"مهندس تيار العمل n8n هو مهارة توفر إرشادات استراتيجية لإنشاء أنظمة أتمتة تتحمل الإنتاج.","en":"Enterprise Lead Generation with AI-powered Slovak outreach for dentists"},"definition":{"en":"Enterprise Lead Generation with AI-powered Slovak outreach for dentists"},"features":{"zh":["自动化项目规划","多服务集成","架构决策支持","可行性评估","n8n 和 Python 集成"],"ja":["自動化プロジェクトの計画","複数のサービス統合","アーキテクチャの決定支援","実行可能性の評価","n8n と Python の統合"],"ko":["자동화 프로젝트 계획","다중 서비스 통합","아키텍처 결정 지원","구현 가능성 평가","n8n 및 Python 통합"],"es":["Planificación de proyectos de automatización","Integración de múltiples servicios","Toma de decisiones arquitectónicas","Evaluación de la viabilidad de los proyectos"],"fr":["Planification de projets d''automatisation","Intégration de plusieurs services","Prise de décisions architecturales","Évaluation de la viabilité des projets"],"de":["Planung von Automatisierungsprojekten","Integration mehrerer Dienste","Architekturentscheidungen","Bewertung der Machbarkeit von Projekten"],"pt":["Orientação estratégica para automação","Integração de múltiplos serviços","Tomada de decisões arquiteturais","Avaliação de viabilidade","Planejamento de projetos de automação"],"ru":["Стратегическое руководство для автоматизации","Интеграция нескольких сервисов","Архитектурные решения","Оценка целесообразности","Планирование проектов автоматизации"],"ar":["الإرشاد الاستراتيجي للأتمتة","دمج خدمات متعددة","اتخاذ قرارات معمارية","تقييم الجدوى","تخطيط مشاريع الأتمتة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["n8n","自动化","企业级自动化","销售流程自动化","服务集成","AI 技术"],"ja":["n8n","自動化","企業向け自動化","セールス プロセス自動化","サービス統合","AI 技術"],"ko":["n8n","자동화","기업용 자동화","판매 프로세스 자동화","서비스 통합","AI 기술"],"es":["automatización empresarial","arquitecto de flujos de trabajo n8n","integración de servicios","planificación de proyectos","evaluación de viabilidad","automatización de procesos"],"fr":["automatisation d''entreprise","architecte de workflow n8n","intégration de services","planification de projets","évaluation de la viabilité","automatisation de processus"],"de":["Unternehmensautomatisierung","n8n-Workflow-Architekt","Integration von Diensten","Projektplanung","Machbarkeitsbewertung","Prozessautomatisierung"],"pt":["automação de negócios","inteligência artificial","arquiteto de fluxo de trabalho","n8n","automação de processos","integração de serviços","tomada de decisões arquiteturais"],"ru":["автоматизация бизнеса","искусственный интеллект","архитектор рабочих процессов","n8n","автоматизация процессов","интеграция сервисов","архитектурные решения"],"ar":["أتمتة الأعمال","الذكاء الاصطناعي","مهندس تيار العمل","n8n","أتمتة العمليات","دمج الخدمات","اتخاذ قرارات معمارية"]}},"owner":"Brmbobo","repo":"Lead-Gen","repoPath":"Brmbobo/Lead-Gen","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"n8n-workflow-architect","description":"Strategic automation architecture advisor. Use when users want to plan automation solutions, evaluate their tech stack (Shopify, Zoho, HubSpot, etc.), decide between n8n vs Python/Claude Code, or need guidance on production-ready automation design. Invokes plan mode for complex architectural decisions.","bodyPreview":"# n8n Workflow Architect\n\nThe Intelligent Automation Architect (IAA) - Strategic guidance for building automation systems that survive production.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when users:\n\n1. **Want to plan an automation project** - \"I need to automate my sales pipeline\"\n2. **Have multiple services to integrate** - \"I use Shopify, Klaviyo, and Notion\"\n3. **Need architecture decisions** - \"Should I use n8n or Python for this?\"\n4. **Are evaluating feasibility** - \"Can I autom","body":"# n8n Workflow Architect\n\nThe Intelligent Automation Architect (IAA) - Strategic guidance for building automation systems that survive production.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when users:\n\n1. **Want to plan an automation project** - \"I need to automate my sales pipeline\"\n2. **Have multiple services to integrate** - \"I use Shopify, Klaviyo, and Notion\"\n3. **Need architecture decisions** - \"Should I use n8n or Python for this?\"\n4. **Are evaluating feasibility** - \"Can I automate X with my current stack?\"\n5. **Want production-ready guidance** - \"How do I make this reliable?\"\n\n---\n\n## The Core Philosophy\n\n> **Viability over Possibility**\n\nThe gap between what''s technically possible and what''s actually viable in production is enormous. This skill helps users build systems that:\n\n- Won''t break at 3 AM on a Saturday\n- Don''t require a PhD to maintain\n- Respect data security, scale, and state management\n- Deliver actual business value, not just technical cleverness\n\n---\n\n## Architecture Decision Framework\n\n### Step 1: Stack Analysis\n\nWhen a user mentions their tools, evaluate each for:\n\n| Tool Category | Common Examples | n8n Native Support | Auth Complexity |\n|---------------|-----------------|-------------------|-----------------|\n| E-commerce | Shopify, WooCommerce, BigCommerce | Yes | OAuth |\n| CRM | HubSpot, Salesforce, Zoho CRM | Yes | OAuth |\n| Marketing | Klaviyo, Mailchimp, ActiveCampaign | Yes | API Key/OAuth |\n| Productivity | Notion, Airtable, Google Sheets | Yes | OAuth |\n| Communication | Slack, Discord, Teams | Yes | OAuth |\n| Payments | Stripe, PayPal, Square | Yes | API Key |\n| Support | Zendesk, Intercom, Freshdesk | Yes | API Key/OAuth |\n\n**Action**: Use `search_nodes` from n8n MCP to verify node availability.\n\n### Step 2: Tool Selection Matrix\n\nApply these decision rules:\n\n#### Use n8n When:\n\n| Condition | Why |\n|-----------|-----|\n| OAuth authentication required | n8n manages token lifecycle automatically |\n| Non-technical maintainers | Visual workflows are self-documenting |\n| Multi-day processes with waits | Built-in Wait node handles suspension |\n| Standard SaaS integrations | Pre-built nodes eliminate boilerplate |\n| < 5,000 records per execution | Within memory limits |\n| < 20 nodes of business logic | Maintains visual clarity |\n\n#### Use Python/Claude Code When:\n\n| Condition | Why |\n|-----------|-----|\n| > 5,000 records to process | Stream processing, memory management |\n| > 20MB files | Chunked processing capabilities |\n| Complex algorithms | Code is more maintainable than 50+ nodes |\n| Cutting-edge AI libraries | Access to latest packages |\n| Heavy data transformation | Pandas, NumPy optimization |\n| Custom ML models | Full Python ecosystem access |\n\n#### Use Hybrid (Recommended for Complex Systems):\n\n```\nn8n (Orchestration Layer)\n├── Webhooks & triggers\n├── OAuth authentication\n├── User-facing integrations\n├── Flow coordination\n│\n└── Calls Python Service (Processing Layer)\n    ├── Heavy computation\n    ├── Complex logic\n    ├── AI/ML operations\n    └── Returns results to n8n\n```\n\n---\n\n## Business Stack Quick Assessment\n\nWhen user describes their stack, respond with this analysis:\n\n### Template Response:\n\n```markdown\n## Stack Analysis: [User''s Business Type]\n\n### Services Identified:\n1. **[Service 1]** - [Category] - n8n Support: [Yes/Partial/No]\n2. **[Service 2]** - [Category] - n8n Support: [Yes/Partial/No]\n...\n\n### Recommended Approach: [n8n / Python / Hybrid]\n\n**Rationale:**\n- [Key decision factor 1]\n- [Key decision factor 2]\n- [Key decision factor 3]\n\n### Integration Complexity: [Low/Medium/High]\n- Auth complexity: [Simple API keys / OAuth required]\n- Data volume: [Estimate based on use case]\n- Processing needs: [Simple transforms / Complex logic]\n\n### Next Steps:\n1. [Specific action using other n8n skills]\n2. [Pattern to follow from n8n-workflow-patterns]\n3. [Validation approach from n8n-validation-expert]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Business Scenarios\n\n### Scenario 1: E-commerce Automation\n**Stack**: Shopify + Klaviyo + Slack + Google Sheets\n\n**Verdict**: Pure n8n\n- All services have native nodes\n- OAuth handled automatically\n- Standard webhook patterns\n- Use: `n8n-workflow-patterns` → webhook_processing\n\n### Scenario 2: AI-Powered Lead Qualification\n**Stack**: Typeform + HubSpot + OpenAI + Custom Scoring\n\n**Verdict**: Hybrid\n- n8n: Typeform webhook, HubSpot sync, notifications\n- Python/Code Node: Complex scoring algorithm, AI prompts\n- Use: `n8n-workflow-patterns` → ai_agent_workflow\n\n### Scenario 3: Data Pipeline / ETL\n**Stack**: PostgreSQL + BigQuery + 50k+ daily records\n\n**Verdict**: Python with n8n Trigger\n- n8n: Schedule trigger, success/failure notifications\n- Python: Batch processing, streaming, transformations\n- Reason: Memory limits in n8n for large datasets\n\n### Scenario 4: Multi-Step Approval Workflow\n**Stack**: Slack + Notion + Email + 3-day wait periods\n\n**Verdict**: Pure n8n\n- Built-in Wait node for delays\n- Native Slack/Notion integrations\n- Human approval patterns built-in\n- Use: `n8n-workflow-patterns` → scheduled_tasks\n\n---\n\n## Production Readiness Checklist\n\nBefore any automation goes live, verify:\n\n### Observability\n- [ ] Error notification workflow exists\n- [ ] Execution logging to database\n- [ ] Health check workflow for critical paths\n- [ ] Structured alerting by severity\n\n### Idempotency\n- [ ] Duplicate webhook handling\n- [ ] Check-before-create patterns\n- [ ] Idempotency keys for payments\n- [ ] Safe re-run capability\n\n### Cost Awareness\n- [ ] AI API costs calculated and approved\n- [ ] Rate limits documented\n- [ ] Caching strategy for repeated calls\n- [ ] Model right-sizing (Haiku vs Sonnet vs Opus)\n\n### Operational Control\n- [ ] Kill switch accessible to non-technical staff\n- [ ] Approval queues for high-stakes actions\n- [ ] Audit trail for all actions\n- [ ] Configuration externalized\n\nUse `n8n-validation-expert` skill to validate workflows before deployment.\n\n---\n\n## Integration with Other n8n Skills\n\nThis skill works as the **planning layer** that coordinates other skills:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                  n8n-workflow-architect                      │\n│            (Strategic Decisions & Planning)                  │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n                              │\n         ┌────────────────────┼────────────────────┐\n         ▼                    ▼                    ▼\n┌─────────────────┐  ┌─────────────────┐  ┌─────────────────┐\n│ n8n-workflow-   │  │ n8n-node-       │  │ n8n-validation- │\n│ patterns        │  │ configuration   │  │ expert          │\n│ (Architecture)  │  │ (Node Setup)    │  │ (Quality)       │\n└─────────────────┘  └─────────────────┘  └─────────────────┘\n         │                    │                    │\n         └────────────────────┼────────────────────┘\n                              ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                     n8n MCP Tools                            │\n│    (search_nodes, validate_workflow, create_workflow, etc.) │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Skill Handoff Guide:\n\n| After Architect Decides... | Hand Off To |\n|---------------------------|-------------|\n| Pattern type identified | `n8n-workflow-patterns` for detailed structure |\n| Specific nodes needed | `n8n-node-configuration` for setup |\n| Code node required | `n8n-code-javascript` or `n8n-code-python` |\n| Expressions needed | `n8n-expression-syntax` for correct syntax |\n| Ready to validate | `n8n-validation-expert` for pre-deploy checks |\n| Need node info | n8n MCP → `get_node_essentials`, `search_nodes` |\n\n---\n\n## Plan Mode Activation\n\nFor complex architectural decisions, enter plan mode to:\n\n1. **Analyze the full business context**\n2. **Evaluate all integration points**\n3. **Design the data flow architecture**\n4. **Identify failure modes and mitigations**\n5. **Create implementation roadmap**\n\n### Trigger Plan Mode When:\n\n- User has 3+ services to integrate\n- Unclear whether n8n or Python is better\n- High-stakes automation (payments, customer data)\n- Complex multi-step processes\n- AI/ML components involved\n\n### Plan Mode Output Structure:\n\n```markdown\n## Automation Architecture Plan\n\n### 1. Business Context\n[What problem are we solving?]\n\n### 2. Stack Analysis\n[Each service, its role, integration complexity]\n\n### 3. Recommended Architecture\n[n8n / Python / Hybrid with rationale]\n\n### 4. Data Flow Design\n[Visual representation of the flow]\n\n### 5. Implementation Phases\nPhase 1: [Core workflow]\nPhase 2: [Error handling & observability]\nPhase 3: [Optimization & scaling]\n\n### 6. Risk Assessment\n[What could go wrong, how we prevent it]\n\n### 7. Maintenance Plan\n[Who maintains, what skills needed]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Decision Tree\n\n```\nSTART: User wants to automate something\n  │\n  ├─► Does it involve OAuth? ────────────────────► Use n8n\n  │\n  ├─► Will non-developers maintain it? ──────────► Use n8n\n  │\n  ├─► Does it need to wait days/weeks? ──────────► Use n8n\n  │\n  ├─► Processing > 5000 records? ────────────────► Use Python\n  │\n  ├─► Files > 20MB? ─────────────────────────────► Use Python\n  │\n  ├─► Cutting-edge AI/ML? ───────────────────────► Use Python\n  │\n  ├─► Complex algorithm (would need 20+ nodes)? ─► Use Python\n  │\n  └─► Mix of above? ─────────────────────────────► Use Hybrid\n```\n\n---\n\n## MCP Tool Integration\n\nUse these n8n MCP tools during architecture planning:\n\n| Planning Phase | MCP Tools to Use |\n|----------------|------------------|\n| Stack analysis | `search_nodes` - verify node availability |\n| Pattern selection | `list_node_templates` - find similar workflows |\n| Feasibility check | `get_node_essentials` - understand capabilities |\n| Complexity estimate | `get_node_documentation` - auth & config needs |\n| Template reference | `get_template` - study existing patterns |\n\n---\n\n## Red Flags to Watch For\n\nWarn users when you see these patterns:\n\n| Red Flag | Risk | Recommendation |\n|----------|------|----------------|\n| \"I want AI to do everything\" | Cost explosion, unpredictability | Scope AI to specific tasks, cache results |\n| \"It needs to process millions of rows\" | Memory crashes | Python with streaming, not n8n loops |\n| \"The workflow has 50 nodes\" | Unmaintainable | Consolidate to code blocks or split workflows |\n| \"We''ll add error handling later\" | Silent failures | Build error handling from day one |\n| \"It should work on any input\" | Fragile system | Define and validate expected inputs |\n| \"The intern will maintain it\" | Single point of failure | Use n8n for visual clarity, document thoroughly |\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\n**This skill answers**: \"Given my business stack and requirements, what''s the smartest way to build this automation?\"\n\n**Key outputs**:\n1. Stack compatibility analysis\n2. n8n vs Python vs Hybrid recommendation\n3. Pattern and skill handoffs\n4. Production readiness guidance\n5. Implementation roadmap via plan mode\n\n**Works with**:\n- All n8n-* skills for implementation details\n- n8n MCP tools for node discovery and workflow creation\n- Plan mode for complex architectural decisions\n\n---\n\n## Related Files\n\n- [tool-selection-matrix.md](tool-selection-matrix.md) - Detailed decision criteria\n- [business-stack-analysis.md](business-stack-analysis.md) - Common SaaS integration guides\n- [production-readiness.md](production-readiness.md) - Pre-launch checklist details\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:29:43.608Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing advanced workflow architecture and integration capabilities with n8n","zh":"非常适合需要高级工作流架构和与n8n集成能力的自动化代理","ja":"n8nとの高度なワークフロー・アーキテクチャと統合機能を必要とする自動化エージェントに最適","ko":"n8n과 고급 워크플로 아키텍처 및 통합 기능이 필요한 자동화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización que necesitan una arquitectura de flujo de trabajo avanzada y capacidades de integración con n8n","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Automation qui nécessitent une architecture de workflow avancée et des capacités d''intégration avec n8n","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die eine fortschrittliche Workflow-Architektur und Integrationsfähigkeiten mit n8n benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que necessitam de arquitetura de fluxo de trabalho avançada e capacidades de integração com n8n","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации, которым требуются продвинутые архитектуры рабочих процессов и возможности интеграции с n8n","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين الذين يحتاجون إلى بنية工作 متقدمة وقدرات على الاندماج مع n8n"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement automated workflows using n8n, integrating multiple services like Shopify, Klaviyo, and Notion, and providing strategic guidance for building scalable automation systems","zh":"赋予代理设计和实施使用n8n的自动化工作流的能力，集成了像Shopify、Klaviyo和Notion这样的多个服务，并为构建可扩展的自动化系统提供战略指导","ja":"エージェントがn8nを使用した自動化ワークフローを設計・実装できるようにし、Shopify、Klaviyo、Notionなどの複数のサービスを統合し、スケーラブルな自動化システムの構築に対する戦略的ガイダンスを提供する","ko":"에이전트가 n8n을 사용하여 자동화 워크플로를 설계하고 구현할 수 있도록 해주며, Shopify, Klaviyo, Notion 등의 여러 서비스를 통합하고, 확장 가능한 자동화 시스템을 구축하기 위한 전략적 지침을 제공하는 것","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar e implementar flujos de trabajo automatizados utilizando n8n, integrando múltiples servicios como Shopify, Klaviyo y Notion, y brindando orientación estratégica para la construcción de sistemas de automatización escalables","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre des flux de travail automatisés en utilisant n8n, en intégrant plusieurs services tels que Shopify, Klaviyo et Notion, et en fournissant des conseils stratégiques pour la construction de systèmes d''automatisation évolutifs","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, automatisierte Workflows mit n8n zu entwerfen und umzusetzen, mehrere Dienste wie Shopify, Klaviyo und Notion zu integrieren und strategische Richtlinien für den Aufbau von skalierbaren Automatisierungssystemen bereitzustellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e implementar fluxos de trabalho automatizados usando n8n, integrando vários serviços como Shopify, Klaviyo e Notion, e fornecendo orientação estratégica para a construção de sistemas de automação escaláveis","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и реализовывать автоматизированные рабочие процессы с использованием n8n, интегрируя множество сервисов, таких как Shopify, Klaviyo и Notion, и предоставляя стратегические рекомендации для создания масштабируемых систем автоматизации","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم وتنفيذ عمليات工作 آلية باستخدام n8n، ودمج الخدمات المتعددة مثل Shopify وKlaviyo وNotion، وتقديم إرشادات إستراتيجية لإنشاء أنظمة أتمتة قابلة للتوسع"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating sales pipelines","Integrating multiple services for seamless data flow","Evaluating feasibility of automation projects","Architecting workflows for production environments"],"zh":["自动化销售管道","集成多个服务以实现无缝数据流","评估自动化项目的可行性","为生产环境架构化工作流"],"ja":["セールスパイプラインの自動化","複数のサービスを統合してシームレスなデータフローを実現","自動化プロジェクトの実現可能性を評価","生産環境向けのワークフローをアーキテクチャ化"],"ko":["영업 파이프라인 자동화","여러 서비스 통합을 통한 무결점 데이터 흐름","자동화 프로젝트의 실현 가능성 평가","생산 환경을 위한 워크플로 아키텍처"],"es":["Automatizar tuberías de ventas","Integrar múltiples servicios para un flujo de datos sin problemas","Evaluar la viabilidad de proyectos de automatización","Diseñar flujos de trabajo para entornos de producción"],"fr":["Automatiser les pipelines de vente","Intégrer plusieurs services pour un flux de données sans interruption","Évaluer la faisabilité des projets d''automatisation","Concevoir des flux de travail pour les environnements de production"],"de":["Verkaufspipelines automatisieren","Mehrere Dienste für einen reibungslosen Datenfluss integrieren","Die Machbarkeit von Automatisierungsprojekten bewerten","Workflows für Produktionsumgebungen entwerfen"],"pt":["Automatizar pipelines de vendas","Integrar vários serviços para fluxo de dados sem interrupção","Avaliar a viabilidade de projetos de automação","Arquitetar fluxos de trabalho para ambientes de produção"],"ru":["Автоматизация продажных трубопроводов","Интеграция нескольких сервисов для бесперебойного потока данных","Оценка осуществимости проектов автоматизации","Проектирование рабочих процессов для производственных сред"],"ar":["أتمتة خطوط أنابيب المبيعات","دمج الخدمات المتعددة لتدفق البيانات دون انقطاع","تقييم جدوى مشاريع الأتمتة","تصميم عمليات العمل للبيئات الإنتاجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires n8n workflow knowledge","Dependent on service APIs for integration","Limited to automation projects with defined workflows"],"zh":["需要n8n工作流知识","依赖服务API进行集成","仅限于具有定义工作流的自动化项目"],"ja":["n8nワークフローの知識が必要","サービスAPIに依存して統合","定義されたワークフローを持つ自動化プロジェクトのみ"],"ko":["n8n 워크플로 지식이 필요","서비스 API에 의존하여 통합","정의된 워크플로를 갖는 자동화 프로젝트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de flujos de trabajo de n8n","Depende de las API de 