de trabajo analíticos reproducibles"],"fr":["Importation et exportation de données de spectrométrie de masse","Standardisation des métadonnées","Filtrage des pics","Calcul de similarités spectrales","Création de flux de travail analytiques reproductibles"],"de":["Importieren und Exportieren von Massenspektrometrie-Daten","Standardisierung von Metadaten","Filtrieren von Peaks","Berechnen von Spektralähnlichkeiten","Erstellen von reproduzierbaren analytischen Workflows"],"pt":["Importação de espectros de vários formatos","Filtragem de picos","Cálculo de similaridades espectrais","Construção de fluxos de trabalho analíticos reprodutíveis","Exportação de dados processados"],"ru":["Импорт спектров из различных форматов","Фильтрация пиков","Расчет спектральных сходств","Создание воспроизводимых аналитических рабочих процессов","Экспорт обработанных данных"],"ar":["استيراد الأطياف من صيغ متعددة","تصفية الذروة","حساب التشابه الطيفي","بناء سير عمل تحليلي قابلة للتكرار","تصدير البيانات المعالجة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Matchms","Python","Matchms","Matchms","Matchms","Matchms","Matchms"],"ja":["Matchms","Python","Matchms","Matchms","Matchms","Matchms","Matchms"],"ko":["Matchms","Python","Matchms","Matchms","Matchms","Matchms","Matchms"],"es":["espectrometría de masas","procesamiento de datos","análisis de datos","biblioteca Python","massenspektrometrie","datos de espectrometría de masas"],"fr":["spectrométrie de masse","traitement de données","analyse de données","bibliothèque Python","données de spectrométrie de masse"],"de":["Massenspektrometrie","Datenverarbeitung","Datenanalyse","Python-Bibliothek","Massenspektrometrie-Daten","Spektralanalyse"],"pt":["espectrometria de massa","análise de dados","biblioteca python","processamento de dados","matchms","mass spectrometry","data analysis","python library"],"ru":["масс-спектрометрия","анализ данных","библиотека python","обработка данных","matchms","масс-спектрометрия","анализ данных","библиотека python"],"ar":["مطياف الكتلة","تحليل البيانات","مكتبة بايثون","معالجة البيانات","matchms","مطياف الكتلة","تحليل البيانات","مكتبة بايثون"]}},"owner":"pur3v4d3r","repo":"pur3-pkb-codebase","repoPath":"pur3v4d3r/pur3-pkb-codebase","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"matchms","description":"Mass spectrometry analysis. Process mzML/MGF/MSP, spectral similarity (cosine, modified cosine), metadata harmonization, compound ID, for metabolomics and MS data processing.","bodyPreview":"# Matchms\n\n## Overview\n\nMatchms is an open-source Python library for mass spectrometry data processing and analysis. Import spectra from various formats, standardize metadata, filter peaks, calculate spectral similarities, and build reproducible analytical workflows.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Importing and Exporting Mass Spectrometry Data\n\nLoad spectra from multiple file formats and export processed data:\n\n```python\nfrom matchms.importing import load_from_mgf, load_from_mzml, load_from_msp,","body":"# Matchms\n\n## Overview\n\nMatchms is an open-source Python library for mass spectrometry data processing and analysis. Import spectra from various formats, standardize metadata, filter peaks, calculate spectral similarities, and build reproducible analytical workflows.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Importing and Exporting Mass Spectrometry Data\n\nLoad spectra from multiple file formats and export processed data:\n\n```python\nfrom matchms.importing import load_from_mgf, load_from_mzml, load_from_msp, load_from_json\nfrom matchms.exporting import save_as_mgf, save_as_msp, save_as_json\n\n# Import spectra\nspectra = list(load_from_mgf(\"spectra.mgf\"))\nspectra = list(load_from_mzml(\"data.mzML\"))\nspectra = list(load_from_msp(\"library.msp\"))\n\n# Export processed spectra\nsave_as_mgf(spectra, \"output.mgf\")\nsave_as_json(spectra, \"output.json\")\n```\n\n**Supported formats:**\n- mzML and mzXML (raw mass spectrometry formats)\n- MGF (Mascot Generic Format)\n- MSP (spectral library format)\n- JSON (GNPS-compatible)\n- metabolomics-USI references\n- Pickle (Python serialization)\n\nFor detailed importing/exporting documentation, consult `references/importing_exporting.md`.\n\n### 2. Spectrum Filtering and Processing\n\nApply comprehensive filters to standardize metadata and refine peak data:\n\n```python\nfrom matchms.filtering import default_filters, normalize_intensities\nfrom matchms.filtering import select_by_relative_intensity, require_minimum_number_of_peaks\n\n# Apply default metadata harmonization filters\nspectrum = default_filters(spectrum)\n\n# Normalize peak intensities\nspectrum = normalize_intensities(spectrum)\n\n# Filter peaks by relative intensity\nspectrum = select_by_relative_intensity(spectrum, intensity_from=0.01, intensity_to=1.0)\n\n# Require minimum peaks\nspectrum = require_minimum_number_of_peaks(spectrum, n_required=5)\n```\n\n**Filter categories:**\n- **Metadata processing**: Harmonize compound names, derive chemical structures, standardize adducts, correct charges\n- **Peak filtering**: Normalize intensities, select by m/z or intensity, remove precursor peaks\n- **Quality control**: Require minimum peaks, validate precursor m/z, ensure metadata completeness\n- **Chemical annotation**: Add fingerprints, derive InChI/SMILES, repair structural mismatches\n\nMatchms provides 40+ filters. For the complete filter reference, consult `references/filtering.md`.\n\n### 3. Calculating Spectral Similarities\n\nCompare spectra using various similarity metrics:\n\n```python\nfrom matchms import calculate_scores\nfrom matchms.similarity import CosineGreedy, ModifiedCosine, CosineHungarian\n\n# Calculate cosine similarity (fast, greedy algorithm)\nscores = calculate_scores(references=library_spectra,\n                         queries=query_spectra,\n                         similarity_function=CosineGreedy())\n\n# Calculate modified cosine (accounts for precursor m/z differences)\nscores = calculate_scores(references=library_spectra,\n                         queries=query_spectra,\n                         similarity_function=ModifiedCosine(tolerance=0.1))\n\n# Get best matches\nbest_matches = scores.scores_by_query(query_spectra[0], sort=True)[:10]\n```\n\n**Available similarity functions:**\n- **CosineGreedy/CosineHungarian**: Peak-based cosine similarity with different matching algorithms\n- **ModifiedCosine**: Cosine similarity accounting for precursor mass differences\n- **NeutralLossesCosine**: Similarity based on neutral loss patterns\n- **FingerprintSimilarity**: Molecular structure similarity using fingerprints\n- **MetadataMatch**: Compare user-defined metadata fields\n- **PrecursorMzMatch/ParentMassMatch**: Simple mass-based filtering\n\nFor detailed similarity function documentation, consult `references/similarity.md`.\n\n### 4. Building Processing Pipelines\n\nCreate reproducible, multi-step analysis workflows:\n\n```python\nfrom matchms import SpectrumProcessor\nfrom matchms.filtering import default_filters, normalize_intensities\nfrom matchms.filtering import select_by_relative_intensity, remove_peaks_around_precursor_mz\n\n# Define a processing pipeline\nprocessor = SpectrumProcessor([\n    default_filters,\n    normalize_intensities,\n    lambda s: select_by_relative_intensity(s, intensity_from=0.01),\n    lambda s: remove_peaks_around_precursor_mz(s, mz_tolerance=17)\n])\n\n# Apply to all spectra\nprocessed_spectra = [processor(s) for s in spectra]\n```\n\n### 5. Working with Spectrum Objects\n\nThe core `Spectrum` class contains mass spectral data:\n\n```python\nfrom matchms import Spectrum\nimport numpy as np\n\n# Create a spectrum\nmz = np.array([100.0, 150.0, 200.0, 250.0])\nintensities = np.array([0.1, 0.5, 0.9, 0.3])\nmetadata = {\"precursor_mz\": 250.5, \"ionmode\": \"positive\"}\n\nspectrum = Spectrum(mz=mz, intensities=intensities, metadata=metadata)\n\n# Access spectrum properties\nprint(spectrum.peaks.mz)           # m/z values\nprint(spectrum.peaks.intensities)  # Intensity values\nprint(spectrum.get(\"precursor_mz\")) # Metadata field\n\n# Visualize spectra\nspectrum.plot()\nspectrum.plot_against(reference_spectrum)\n```\n\n### 6. Metadata Management\n\nStandardize and harmonize spectrum metadata:\n\n```python\n# Metadata is automatically harmonized\nspectrum.set(\"Precursor_mz\", 250.5)  # Gets harmonized to lowercase key\nprint(spectrum.get(\"precursor_mz\"))   # Returns 250.5\n\n# Derive chemical information\nfrom matchms.filtering import derive_inchi_from_smiles, derive_inchikey_from_inchi\nfrom matchms.filtering import add_fingerprint\n\nspectrum = derive_inchi_from_smiles(spectrum)\nspectrum = derive_inchikey_from_inchi(spectrum)\nspectrum = add_fingerprint(spectrum, fingerprint_type=\"morgan\", nbits=2048)\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\nFor typical mass spectrometry analysis workflows, including:\n- Loading and preprocessing spectral libraries\n- Matching unknown spectra against reference libraries\n- Quality filtering and data cleaning\n- Large-scale similarity comparisons\n- Network-based spectral clustering\n\nConsult `references/workflows.md` for detailed examples.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nuv pip install matchms\n```\n\nFor molecular structure processing (SMILES, InChI):\n```bash\nuv pip install matchms[chemistry]\n```\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\nDetailed reference documentation is available in the `references/` directory:\n- `filtering.md` - Complete filter function reference with descriptions\n- `similarity.md` - All similarity metrics and when to use them\n- `importing_exporting.md` - File format details and I/O operations\n- `workflows.md` - Common analysis patterns and examples\n\nLoad these references as needed for detailed information about specific matchms capabilities.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:30:18.280Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Scientific Analysis Agents needing advanced mass spectrometry data processing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级质谱数据处理能力的科学分析代理。","ja":"高度な質量分析データ処理能力が必要な科学分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 질량 분광 데이터 처리 기능이 필요한 과학 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis Científico que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de procesamiento de datos de espectrometría de masas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse scientifique ayant besoin de capacités avancées de traitement de données de spectrométrie de masse.","de":"Perfekt für wissenschaftliche Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Datenverarbeitung von Massenspektrometrie benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Científica que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de processamento de dados de espectrometria de massa.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов научного анализа, которым требуются продвинутые возможности обработки данных масс-спектрометрии.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل العلوم التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لمعالجة بيانات مطياف الكتلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to import and export mass spectrometry data from various formats like MGF, MZML, and MSP, and calculate spectral similarities using Python libraries.","zh":"使代理能够导入和导出来自各种格式（如MGF、MZML和MSP）的质谱数据，并使用Python库计算光谱相似性。","ja":"エージェントが様々な形式（MGF、MZML、MSPなど）の質量分析データをインポート、エクスポートし、Pythonライブラリを使用してスペクトル類似性を計算する機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 다양한 형식(MGF, MZML, MSP 등)의 질량 분석 데이터를 가져오고 내보내고 Python 라이브러리를 사용하여 스펙트럼 유사성을 계산할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes importar y exportar datos de espectrometría de masas desde varios formatos como MGF, MZML y MSP, y calcular similitudes espectrales utilizando bibliotecas de Python.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''importer et d''exporter des données de spectrométrie de masse à partir de différents formats tels que MGF, MZML et MSP, et de calculer des similitudes spectrales à l''aide de bibliothèques Python.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Massenspektrometriedaten aus verschiedenen Formaten wie MGF, MZML und MSP zu importieren und zu exportieren und spektrale Ähnlichkeiten mit Python-Bibliotheken zu berechnen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a importar e exportar dados de espectrometria de massa de vários formatos como MGF, MZML e MSP, e calcular semelhanças espectrais usando bibliotecas Python.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью импортировать и экспортировать данные масс-спектрометрии из различных форматов, таких как MGF, MZML и MSP, и рассчитывать спектральные сходства с помощью библиотек Python.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من استيراد وتصدير بيانات مطياف الكتلة من صيغ مختلفة مثل MGF و MZML و MSP ، و حساب الشبه بين الأطياف باستخدام مكتبات Python."},"useCases":{"en":["Importing mass spectrometry data from MGF files","Filtering peaks and calculating spectral similarities","Building reproducible analytical workflows"],"zh":["从MGF文件导入质谱数据","过滤峰值和计算光谱相似性","构建可复现的分析工作流"],"ja":["MGFファイルからの質量分析データのインポート","ピークのフィルタリングとスペクトル類似性の計算","再現可能な分析ワークフローを構築"],"ko":["MGF 파일에서 질량 분석 데이터 가져오기","피크 필터링 및 스펙트럼 유사성 계산","재현 가능한 분석 워크플ロー 구축"],"es":["Importación de datos de espectrometría de masas desde archivos MGF","Filtrado de picos y cálculo de similitudes espectrales","Creación de flujos de trabajo analíticos reproducibles"],"fr":["Importation de données de spectrométrie de masse à partir de fichiers MGF","Filtrage de pics et calcul de similitudes spectrales","Création de flux de travail analytiques reproductibles"],"de":["Import von Massenspektrometriedaten aus MGF-Dateien","Filtern von Peaks und Berechnen von spektralen Ähnlichkeiten","Erstellen reproduzierbarer analytischer Workflows"],"pt":["Importação de dados de espectrometria de massa de arquivos MGF","Filtragem de picos e cálculo de semelhanças espectrais","Construção de fluxos de trabalho analíticos reprodutíveis"],"ru":["Импорт данных масс-спектрометрии из файлов MGF","Фильтрация пиков и расчет спектральных сходств","Создание воспроизводимых аналитических рабочих процессов"],"ar":["استيراد بيانات مطياف الكتلة من ملفات MGF","تصفية القمم و حساب الشبه بين الأطياف","بناء سلاسل عمل تحليلية قابلة للتكرار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Limited to mass spectrometry data formats"],"zh":["需要Python环境","仅限质谱数据格式"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","質量分析データ形式に限定"],"ko":["Python 환경 필요","질량 분석 데이터 형식만 해당"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Limitado a formatos de datos de espectrometría de masas"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Limité aux formats de données de spectrométrie de masse"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Massenspektrometriedaten-Formate"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Limitado a formatos de dados de espectrometria de massa"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Ограничен форматами данных масс-спектрометрии"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Python","محدود بصيغ بيانات مطياف الكتلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
