cs","Calcul de similitudes spectrales","Création de flux de travail analytiques reproductibles"],"de":["Import und Export von Massenspektrometrie-Daten","Standardisierung von Metadaten","Filtrierung von Peaks","Berechnung von Spektralähnlichkeiten","Erstellung von reproduzierbaren analytischen Workflows"],"pt":["Importação de espectros de vários formatos","Padronização de metadados","Filtragem de picos","Cálculo de semelhanças espectrais","Construção de fluxos de trabalho analíticos reprodutíveis"],"ru":["Импорт спектров из различных форматов","Стандартизация метаданных","Фильтрация пиков","Расчет спектральных сходств","Строение воспроизводимых аналитических рабочих процессов"],"ar":["استيراد الأطياف من صيغ مختلفة","تقييس البيانات الوصفية","مرشح القمم","حساب الشبه بين الأطياف","بناء سلاسل عمل تحليلية قابلة للتكرار"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Matchms","Python","MGF","mzML","MSP","Python"],"ja":["Matchms","Python","MGF","mzML","MSP","Python"],"ko":["Matchms","Python","MGF","mzML","MSP","Python"],"es":["espectrometría de masas","procesamiento de datos","análisis de datos","biblioteca de Python","Massenspektrometrie","datos de espectrometría de masas"],"fr":["spectrométrie de masse","traitement de données","analyse de données","bibliothèque Python","données de spectrométrie de masse"],"de":["Massenspektrometrie","Datenverarbeitung","Datenanalyse","Python-Bibliothek","Massenspektrometrie-Daten","Spektralanalyse"],"pt":["Matchms","espectrometria de massa","processamento de dados","análise de dados","biblioteca Python","mass spectrometry","data processing","data analysis"],"ru":["Matchms","масс-спектрометрия","обработка данных","анализ данных","библиотека Python","mass spectrometry","data processing","data analysis"],"ar":["Matchms","مطياف الكتلة","معالجة البيانات","تحليل البيانات","مكتبة بايثون","mass spectrometry","data processing","data analysis"]}},"owner":"overtimepog","repo":"AgentTheo","repoPath":"overtimepog/AgentTheo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"matchms","description":"Mass spectrometry analysis. Process mzML/MGF/MSP, spectral similarity (cosine, modified cosine), metadata harmonization, compound ID, for metabolomics and MS data processing.","bodyPreview":"# Matchms\n\n## Overview\n\nMatchms is an open-source Python library for mass spectrometry data processing and analysis. Import spectra from various formats, standardize metadata, filter peaks, calculate spectral similarities, and build reproducible analytical workflows.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Importing and Exporting Mass Spectrometry Data\n\nLoad spectra from multiple file formats and export processed data:\n\n```python\nfrom matchms.importing import load_from_mgf, load_from_mzml, load_from_msp,","body":"# Matchms\n\n## Overview\n\nMatchms is an open-source Python library for mass spectrometry data processing and analysis. Import spectra from various formats, standardize metadata, filter peaks, calculate spectral similarities, and build reproducible analytical workflows.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Importing and Exporting Mass Spectrometry Data\n\nLoad spectra from multiple file formats and export processed data:\n\n```python\nfrom matchms.importing import load_from_mgf, load_from_mzml, load_from_msp, load_from_json\nfrom matchms.exporting import save_as_mgf, save_as_msp, save_as_json\n\n# Import spectra\nspectra = list(load_from_mgf(\"spectra.mgf\"))\nspectra = list(load_from_mzml(\"data.mzML\"))\nspectra = list(load_from_msp(\"library.msp\"))\n\n# Export processed spectra\nsave_as_mgf(spectra, \"output.mgf\")\nsave_as_json(spectra, \"output.json\")\n```\n\n**Supported formats:**\n- mzML and mzXML (raw mass spectrometry formats)\n- MGF (Mascot Generic Format)\n- MSP (spectral library format)\n- JSON (GNPS-compatible)\n- metabolomics-USI references\n- Pickle (Python serialization)\n\nFor detailed importing/exporting documentation, consult `references/importing_exporting.md`.\n\n### 2. Spectrum Filtering and Processing\n\nApply comprehensive filters to standardize metadata and refine peak data:\n\n```python\nfrom matchms.filtering import default_filters, normalize_intensities\nfrom matchms.filtering import select_by_relative_intensity, require_minimum_number_of_peaks\n\n# Apply default metadata harmonization filters\nspectrum = default_filters(spectrum)\n\n# Normalize peak intensities\nspectrum = normalize_intensities(spectrum)\n\n# Filter peaks by relative intensity\nspectrum = select_by_relative_intensity(spectrum, intensity_from=0.01, intensity_to=1.0)\n\n# Require minimum peaks\nspectrum = require_minimum_number_of_peaks(spectrum, n_required=5)\n```\n\n**Filter categories:**\n- **Metadata processing**: Harmonize compound names, derive chemical structures, standardize adducts, correct charges\n- **Peak filtering**: Normalize intensities, select by m/z or intensity, remove precursor peaks\n- **Quality control**: Require minimum peaks, validate precursor m/z, ensure metadata completeness\n- **Chemical annotation**: Add fingerprints, derive InChI/SMILES, repair structural mismatches\n\nMatchms provides 40+ filters. For the complete filter reference, consult `references/filtering.md`.\n\n### 3. Calculating Spectral Similarities\n\nCompare spectra using various similarity metrics:\n\n```python\nfrom matchms import calculate_scores\nfrom matchms.similarity import CosineGreedy, ModifiedCosine, CosineHungarian\n\n# Calculate cosine similarity (fast, greedy algorithm)\nscores = calculate_scores(references=library_spectra,\n                         queries=query_spectra,\n                         similarity_function=CosineGreedy())\n\n# Calculate modified cosine (accounts for precursor m/z differences)\nscores = calculate_scores(references=library_spectra,\n                         queries=query_spectra,\n                         similarity_function=ModifiedCosine(tolerance=0.1))\n\n# Get best matches\nbest_matches = scores.scores_by_query(query_spectra[0], sort=True)[:10]\n```\n\n**Available similarity functions:**\n- **CosineGreedy/CosineHungarian**: Peak-based cosine similarity with different matching algorithms\n- **ModifiedCosine**: Cosine similarity accounting for precursor mass differences\n- **NeutralLossesCosine**: Similarity based on neutral loss patterns\n- **FingerprintSimilarity**: Molecular structure similarity using fingerprints\n- **MetadataMatch**: Compare user-defined metadata fields\n- **PrecursorMzMatch/ParentMassMatch**: Simple mass-based filtering\n\nFor detailed similarity function documentation, consult `references/similarity.md`.\n\n### 4. Building Processing Pipelines\n\nCreate reproducible, multi-step analysis workflows:\n\n```python\nfrom matchms import SpectrumProcessor\nfrom matchms.filtering import default_filters, normalize_intensities\nfrom matchms.filtering import select_by_relative_intensity, remove_peaks_around_precursor_mz\n\n# Define a processing pipeline\nprocessor = SpectrumProcessor([\n    default_filters,\n    normalize_intensities,\n    lambda s: select_by_relative_intensity(s, intensity_from=0.01),\n    lambda s: remove_peaks_around_precursor_mz(s, mz_tolerance=17)\n])\n\n# Apply to all spectra\nprocessed_spectra = [processor(s) for s in spectra]\n```\n\n### 5. Working with Spectrum Objects\n\nThe core `Spectrum` class contains mass spectral data:\n\n```python\nfrom matchms import Spectrum\nimport numpy as np\n\n# Create a spectrum\nmz = np.array([100.0, 150.0, 200.0, 250.0])\nintensities = np.array([0.1, 0.5, 0.9, 0.3])\nmetadata = {\"precursor_mz\": 250.5, \"ionmode\": \"positive\"}\n\nspectrum = Spectrum(mz=mz, intensities=intensities, metadata=metadata)\n\n# Access spectrum properties\nprint(spectrum.peaks.mz)           # m/z values\nprint(spectrum.peaks.intensities)  # Intensity values\nprint(spectrum.get(\"precursor_mz\")) # Metadata field\n\n# Visualize spectra\nspectrum.plot()\nspectrum.plot_against(reference_spectrum)\n```\n\n### 6. Metadata Management\n\nStandardize and harmonize spectrum metadata:\n\n```python\n# Metadata is automatically harmonized\nspectrum.set(\"Precursor_mz\", 250.5)  # Gets harmonized to lowercase key\nprint(spectrum.get(\"precursor_mz\"))   # Returns 250.5\n\n# Derive chemical information\nfrom matchms.filtering import derive_inchi_from_smiles, derive_inchikey_from_inchi\nfrom matchms.filtering import add_fingerprint\n\nspectrum = derive_inchi_from_smiles(spectrum)\nspectrum = derive_inchikey_from_inchi(spectrum)\nspectrum = add_fingerprint(spectrum, fingerprint_type=\"morgan\", nbits=2048)\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\nFor typical mass spectrometry analysis workflows, including:\n- Loading and preprocessing spectral libraries\n- Matching unknown spectra against reference libraries\n- Quality filtering and data cleaning\n- Large-scale similarity comparisons\n- Network-based spectral clustering\n\nConsult `references/workflows.md` for detailed examples.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nuv pip install matchms\n```\n\nFor molecular structure processing (SMILES, InChI):\n```bash\nuv pip install matchms[chemistry]\n```\n\n## Reference Documentation\n\nDetailed reference documentation is available in the `references/` directory:\n- `filtering.md` - Complete filter function reference with descriptions\n- `similarity.md` - All similarity metrics and when to use them\n- `importing_exporting.md` - File format details and I/O operations\n- `workflows.md` - Common analysis patterns and examples\n\nLoad these references as needed for detailed information about specific matchms capabilities.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:30:32.711Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Scientific Analysis Agents needing advanced mass spectrometry data processing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级质谱数据处理能力的科学分析代理。","ja":"高度な質量分析データ処理機能を必要とする科学分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 질량 분석 데이터 처리 기능이 필요한 과학적 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis Científico que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de procesamiento de datos de espectrometría de masas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse Scientifique nécessitant des capacités de traitement avancées de données de spectrométrie de masse.","de":"Perfekt für wissenschaftliche Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Datenverarbeitung bei der Massenspektrometrie benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Científica que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de processamento de dados de espectrometria de massa.","ru":"Идеально для агентов научного анализа, которым требуются продвинутые возможности обработки данных масс-спектрометрии.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التحليل العلمي التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لمعالجة بيانات مطياف الكتلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to import and export mass spectrometry data from various formats like MGF, MZML, and MSP, standardize metadata, filter peaks, and calculate spectral similarities using the matchms Python library.","zh":"使代理能够导入和导出来自各种格式（如MGF、MZML和MSP）的大量光谱数据，标准化元数据，过滤峰值，并使用matchms Python库计算光谱相似性。","ja":"エージェントがさまざまな形式（MGF、MZML、MSPなど）からの大量の質量分析データをインポートおよびエクスポートし、メタデータを標準化し、ピークをフィルタリングし、matchms Pythonライブラリを使用してスペクトル類似性を計算することを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 다양한 형식(MGF, MZML, MSP 등)의 대량의 질량 분석 데이터를 가져오고 내보내고, 메타데이터를 표준화하고, 피크를 필터링하고, matchms Python 라이브러리를 사용하여 스펙트럼 유사성을 계산할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes importar y exportar datos de espectrometría de masas desde varios formatos como MGF, MZML y MSP, estandarizar metadatos, filtrar picos y calcular similitudes espectrales utilizando la biblioteca Python matchms.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''importer et d''exporter des données de spectrométrie de masse à partir de différents formats tels que MGF, MZML et MSP, de normaliser les métadonnées, de filtrer les pics et de calculer des similitudes spectrales à l''aide de la bibliothèque Python matchms.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Massenspektrometriedaten aus verschiedenen Formaten wie MGF, MZML und MSP zu importieren und zu exportieren, Metadaten zu standardisieren, Peaks zu filtern und spektrale Ähnlichkeiten mit der Python-Bibliothek matchms zu berechnen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a importar e exportar dados de espectrometria de massa de vários formatos como MGF, MZML e MSP, padronizar metadados, filtrar picos e calcular semelhanças espectrais usando a biblioteca Python matchms.","ru":"Позволяет агентам импортировать и экспортировать данные масс-спектрометрии из различных форматов, таких как MGF, MZML и MSP, стандартизировать метаданные, фильтровать пики и рассчитывать спектральные сходства с использованием библиотеки Python matchms.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من استيراد وتصدير بيانات مطياف الكتلة من صيغ متعددة مثل MGF و MZML و MSP، وتمكين البيانات الوصفية، وتصفية القمم و حساب الشبه بين الطيفية باستخدام مكتبة بايثون matchms."},"useCases":{"en":["Importing and exporting mass spectrometry data from multiple file formats","Standardizing metadata for reproducible analytical workflows","Filtering peaks and calculating spectral similarities for advanced data analysis"],"zh":["从多种文件格式导入和导出大量光谱数据","标准化元数据以实现可复现的分析工作流","过滤峰值并计算光谱相似性以实现高级数据分析"],"ja":["複数のファイル形式からの大量の質量分析データのインポートおよびエクスポート","再現可能な分析ワークフローを実現するためのメタデータの標準化","フィルタリングとスペクトル類似性の計算による高度なデータ分析"],"ko":["여러 파일 형식에서 대량의 질량 분석 데이터를 가져오고 내보내는 것","재현 가능한 분석 워크플로를 구현하기 위한 메타데이터 표준화","피크 필터링 및 스펙트럼 유사성 계산을 통한 고급 데이터 분석"],"es":["Importación y exportación de datos de espectrometría de masas desde múltiples formatos de archivo","Estandarización de metadatos para flujos de trabajo analíticos reproducibles","Filtrado de picos y cálculo de similitudes espectrales para un análisis de datos avanzado"],"fr":["Importation et exportation de données de spectrométrie de masse à partir de plusieurs formats de fichiers","Normalisation des métadonnées pour des flux de travail analytiques reproductibles","Filtrage des pics et calcul des similitudes spectrales pour une analyse de données avancée"],"de":["Importieren und Exportieren von Massenspektrometriedaten aus mehreren Dateiformaten","Standardisierung von Metadaten für reproduzierbare analytische Workflows","Filtern von Peaks und Berechnen von spektralen Ähnlichkeiten für eine erweiterte Datenanalyse"],"pt":["Importação e exportação de dados de espectrometria de massa de vários formatos de arquivo","Padronização de metadados para fluxos de trabalho analíticos reprodutíveis","Filtragem de picos e cálculo de semelhanças espectrais para análise de dados avançada"],"ru":["Импорт и экспорт данных масс-спектрометрии из нескольких форматов файлов","Стандартизация метаданных для воспроизводимых аналитических рабочих процессов","Фильтрация пиков и расчет спектральных сходств для продвинутого анализа данных"],"ar":["استيراد وتصدير بيانات مطياف الكتلة من صيغ ملفات متعددة","تمكين البيانات الوصفية لتدفقات العمل التحليلية القابلة للتكرار","تصفية القمم و حساب الشبه بين الطيفية للتحليل المتقدم للبيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Limited to mass spectrometry data processing and analysis"],"zh":["需要Python环境","仅限于质谱数据处理和分析"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","質量分析データ処理および分析に限定される"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요합니다","질량 분석 데이터 처리 및 분석에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Limitado al procesamiento y análisis de datos de espectrometría de masas"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Limité au traitement et à l''analyse de données de spectrométrie de masse"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Verarbeitung und Analyse von Massenspektrometriedaten"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Limitado ao processamento e análise de dados de espectrometria de massa"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Ограничен обработкой и анализом данных масс-спектрометрии"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون","محدود بمعالجة و تحليل بيانات مطياف الكتلة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('alex-tgk/saasquatch/ffmpeg', 'community', 'alex-tgk', 'saasquatch', 'alex-tgk/saasquatch', 'ffmpeg', 0, 0, 85, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z', '2026-02-18T03:30:38.995Z', NULL, '{"id":"alex-tgk/saasquatch/ffmpeg","name":"ffmpeg","description":{"zh":"FFmpeg是处理视频音频文件的开源多媒体框架，提供命令行工具和库","ja":"FFmpegはビデオオーディオファイルを処理するオープンソースのマルチメディアフレームワークであり、コマンドラインツールとライブラリを提供する","ko":"FFmpeg는 비디오 오디오 파일을 처리하는 오픈소스 멀티미디어 프레임워크이며, 명령줄 도구와 라이브러리를 제공합니다","es":"FFmpeg es un framework de multimedia de código abierto que maneja archivos y flujos de video, audio y otros medios. Proporciona herramientas de línea de comandos y bibliotecas para grabar, convertir y transmitir audio y video.","fr":"FFmpeg est un cadre multimédia open-source qui gère les fichiers et les flux de vidéo, d''audio et d''autres médias. Il fournit des outils de ligne de commande et des bibliothèques pour enregistrer, convertir et diffuser de l''audio et de la vidéo.","de":"FFmpeg ist ein Open-Source-Multimedia-Framework, das Dateien und Streams von Video, Audio und anderen Medien verarbeitet. Es bietet Kommandozeilen-Tools und Bibliotheken zum Aufnehmen, Konvertieren und Streamen von Audio und Video.","pt":"O FFmpeg é uma ferramenta de código aberto para processamento de mídia que lida com arquivos e transmissões de vídeo e áudio. Ele fornece ferramentas de linha de comando e bibliotecas para gravação, conversão e transmissão de áudio e vídeo.","ru":"FFmpeg - это открытая мультимедийная платформа, которая обрабатывает видео, аудио и другие мультимедийные файлы и потоки. Он предоставляет командные инструменты и библиотеки для записи, конвертации и передачи аудио и видео.","ar":"إف إم بيه إج هو إطار متعدد الوسائط مفتوح المصدر يتعامل مع ملفات الفيديو والصوت والوسائط المتعددة الأخرى. يقدم أدوات سطر الأوامر والمكتبات لتسجيل وتصنيع ونقل الصوت والفيديو.","en":"SaaSQuatch - A production-ready CLI tool that generates complete microservices architectures using Fastify"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"FFmpeg技能：视频音频处理和转码","ja":"FFmpegスキル：ビデオオーディオ処理と変換","ko":"FFmpeg 스킬: 비디오 오디오 처리 및 변환","es":"FFmpeg: Herramienta de multimedia de código abierto","fr":"FFmpeg: Cadre multimédia open-source","de":"FFmpeg: Open-Source-Multimedia-Framework","pt":"FFmpeg: Ferramenta de Processamento de Mídia","ru":"FFmpeg: Инструмент обработки мультимедиа","ar":"إف إم بيه إج: أداة обработة الوسائط المتعددة","en":"ffmpeg"},"description":{"zh":"FFmpeg是处理视频音频文件的开源多媒体框架，提供命令行工具和库","ja":"FFmpegはビデオオーディオファイルを処理するオープンソースのマルチメディアフレームワークであり、コマンドラインツールとライブラリを提供する","ko":"FFmpeg는 비디오 오디오 파일을 처리하는 오픈소스 멀티미디어 프레임워크이며, 명령줄 도구와 라이브러리를 제공합니다","es":"FFmpeg es un framework de multimedia de código abierto que maneja archivos y flujos de video, audio y otros medios. Proporciona herramientas de línea de coma...","fr":"FFmpeg est un cadre multimédia open-source qui gère les fichiers et les flux de vidéo, d''audio et d''autres médias. Il fournit des outils de ligne de commande...","de":"FFmpeg ist ein Open-Source-Multimedia-Framework, das Dateien und Streams von Video, Audio und anderen Medien verarbeitet. Es bietet Kommandozeilen-Tools und ...","pt":"O FFmpeg é uma ferramenta de código aberto para processamento de mídia que lida com arquivos e transmissões de vídeo e áudio. Ele fornece ferramentas de linh...","ru":"FFmpeg - это открытая мультимедийная платформа, которая обрабатывает видео, аудио и другие мультимедийные файлы и потоки. Он предоставляет командные инструме...","ar":"إف إم بيه إج هو إطار متعدد الوسائط مفتوح المصدر يتعامل مع ملفات الفيديو والصوت والوسائط المتعددة الأخرى. يقدم أدوات سطر الأوامر والمكتبات لتسجيل وتصنيع ونقل ...","en":"SaaSQuatch - A production-ready CLI tool that generates complete microservices architectures using Fastify"},"definition":{"en":"SaaSQuatch - A production-ready CLI tool that generates complete microservices architectures using Fastify"},"features":{"zh":["媒体文件转码","视频编码","音频处理","直播","支持多种格式"],"ja":["メディアファイルの変換","ビデオのエンコード","オーディオの処理","ライブストリーミング","多種形式のサポート"],"ko":["미디어 파일 변환","비디오 인코딩","오디오 처리","라이브 스트리밍","다양한 형식 지원"],"es":["Conversión de archivos de multimedia entre formatos","Codificación y decodificación de video con diferentes códecs","Procesamiento de archivos de audio","Transmisión en vivo","Herramientas de línea de comandos y bibliotecas"],"fr":["Conversion de fichiers multimédias entre formats","Encodage et décodage de la vidéo avec différents codecs","Traitement de fichiers audio","Diffusion en direct","Outils de ligne de commande et bibliothèques"],"de":["Konvertierung von Multimedia-Dateien zwischen Formaten","Codierung und Decodierung von Video mit verschiedenen Codecs","Verarbeitung von Audio-Dateien","Live-Streaming","Kommandozeilen-Tools und Bibliotheken"],"pt":["Conversão de arquivos de mídia entre formatos","Codificação e decodificação de vídeo com diferentes codecs","Processamento de arquivos de áudio","Transmissão ao vivo","Ferramentas de linha de comando e bibliotecas"],"ru":["Конвертация мультимедийных файлов между форматами","Кодирование и декодирование видео с разными кодеками","Обработка аудиофайлов","Прямая трансляция","Командные инструменты и библиотеки"],"ar":["تحويل ملفات الوسائط المتعددة بين الصيغ","ترميز وفك ترميز الفيديو باستخدام ترميزات مختلفة","معالجة ملفات الصوت","بث مباشر","أدوات سطر الأوامر والمكتبات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["FFmpeg","视频处理","音频处理","媒体文件转码","直播","命令行工具"],"ja":["FFmpeg","ビデオ処理","オーディオ処理","メディアファイル変換","ライブストリーミング","コマンドラインツール"],"ko":["FFmpeg","비디오 처리","오디오 처리","미디어 파일 변환","라이브 스트리밍","명령줄 도구"],"es":["FFmpeg","multimedia","video","audio","conversión","codificación","transmisión en vivo","herramientas de línea de comandos","bibliotecas"],"fr":["FFmpeg","multimédia","vidéo","audio","conversion","encodage","diffusion en direct","outils de ligne de commande","bibliothèques"],"de":["FFmpeg","Multimedia","Video","Audio","Konvertierung","Codierung","Live-Streaming","Kommandozeilen-Tools","Bibliotheken"],"pt":["FFmpeg","processamento de mídia","conversão de arquivos","codificação de vídeo","processamento de áudio","transmissão ao vivo","desenvolvimento de aplicações de mídia"],"ru":["FFmpeg","обработка мультимедиа","конвертация файлов","кодирование видео","обработка аудио","прямая трансляция","разработка мультимедийных приложений"],"ar":["إف إم بيه إج","معالجة الوسائط المتعددة","تحويل ملفات","ترميز الفيديو","معالجة الصوت","بث مباشر","تطوير تطبيقات الوسائط المتعددة"]}},"owner":"alex-tgk","repo":"saasquatch","repoPath":"alex-tgk/saasquatch","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ffmpeg","description":"Guide for using FFmpeg - a comprehensive multimedia framework for video/audio encoding, conversion, streaming, and filtering. Use when processing media files, converting formats, extracting audio, creating streams, applying filters, or optimizing video/audio quality.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# FFmpeg Skill\n\nFFmpeg is a comprehensive open-source multimedia framework that handles video, audio, and other multimedia files and streams. It provides command-line tools and libraries for recording, converting, and streaming audio and video.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Converting media files between formats (MP4, MKV, WebM, AVI, etc.)\n- Encoding/decoding video with different codecs (H.264, H.265, VP9, AV1)\n- Processing audio files (AAC, MP3, FLAC, Opus)\n- Live streaming","body":"# FFmpeg Skill\n\nFFmpeg is a comprehensive open-source multimedia framework that handles video, audio, and other multimedia files and streams. It provides command-line tools and libraries for recording, converting, and streaming audio and video.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Converting media files between formats (MP4, MKV, WebM, AVI, etc.)\n- Encoding/decoding video with different codecs (H.264, H.265, VP9, AV1)\n- Processing audio files (AAC, MP3, FLAC, Opus)\n- Live streaming to platforms (Twitch, YouTube, RTMP servers)\n- Creating HLS/DASH adaptive streams\n- Extracting audio from video files\n- Applying video/audio filters (scale, crop, denoise, volume)\n- Screen recording and capture\n- Optimizing video quality and file size\n- Batch processing media files\n- Analyzing media file properties\n\n## Core Components\n\n### Command-Line Tools\n\n**ffmpeg**: Primary tool for transcoding, conversion, and streaming\n**ffprobe**: Media analysis and inspection tool\n**ffplay**: Minimalist multimedia player for testing\n\n### Libraries\n\n- **libavcodec**: Encoding/decoding codecs\n- **libavformat**: Container formats and I/O\n- **libavfilter**: Audio/video filtering framework\n- **libavutil**: Utility functions\n- **libswscale**: Video scaling and color conversion\n- **libswresample**: Audio resampling and mixing\n\n## Common Video Codecs\n\n### Modern Codecs\n\n**H.264 (libx264)**: Most widely supported, excellent compression/quality balance\n- Best for: Universal compatibility, streaming, web video\n- Quality range: CRF 17-28 (lower = better quality)\n\n**H.265/HEVC (libx265)**: 25-50% better compression than H.264\n- Best for: 4K video, file size reduction\n- Slower encoding, limited browser support\n\n**VP9**: Royalty-free, WebM format\n- Best for: YouTube, open-source projects\n- Good quality/compression, Chrome/Firefox support\n\n**AV1 (libaom-av1, libsvtav1)**: Next-generation codec, best compression\n- Best for: Future-proofing, ultimate quality/size ratio\n- Very slow encoding (improving with SVT-AV1)\n\n### Legacy Codecs\n- MPEG-4 (Xvid/DivX)\n- MPEG-2\n- VP8\n\n## Common Audio Codecs\n\n**AAC**: Industry standard, excellent quality\n**MP3**: Universal compatibility, good quality\n**Opus**: Best quality at low bitrates, ideal for voice/streaming\n**FLAC**: Lossless compression, archival quality\n**Vorbis**: Open-source, good quality\n**AC-3/DTS**: Surround sound formats\n\n## Container Formats\n\n**MP4**: Universal compatibility, streaming-friendly\n**MKV (Matroska)**: Feature-rich, supports multiple tracks/subtitles\n**WebM**: Web-optimized (VP8/VP9 + Vorbis/Opus)\n**AVI**: Legacy format, broad compatibility\n**MOV**: Apple QuickTime format\n**TS**: Transport stream for broadcasting\n**FLV**: Flash video (legacy streaming)\n\n## Basic Operations\n\n### Format Conversion\n\nSimple format conversion without re-encoding:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mkv -c copy output.mp4\n```\n\nConvert with specific codecs:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.avi -c:v libx264 -c:a aac output.mp4\n```\n\n### Quality-Based Encoding (CRF)\n\nConstant Rate Factor - best for quality-focused encoding:\n\n```bash\n# H.264 encoding (CRF 23 = default, 17-28 recommended range)\nffmpeg -i input.mkv -c:v libx264 -preset slow -crf 22 -c:a copy output.mp4\n\n# H.265 encoding (higher compression)\nffmpeg -i input.mkv -c:v libx265 -preset medium -crf 24 -c:a copy output.mp4\n\n# VP9 encoding (WebM)\nffmpeg -i input.mkv -c:v libvpx-vp9 -crf 30 -b:v 0 -c:a libopus output.webm\n```\n\n**CRF Scale:**\n- 0 = Lossless (huge file size)\n- 17-18 = Visually lossless\n- 20-23 = High quality (recommended)\n- 24-28 = Medium quality\n- 30+ = Low quality\n- 51 = Worst quality\n\n**Presets** (speed vs compression):\n- ultrafast, superfast, veryfast, faster, fast\n- medium (default)\n- slow, slower, veryslow (better compression)\n- placebo (not recommended - minimal gains)\n\n### Bitrate-Based Encoding (Two-Pass)\n\nFor targeting specific file sizes:\n\n```bash\n# Pass 1 (analysis)\nffmpeg -y -i input.mkv -c:v libx264 -b:v 2600k -pass 1 -an -f null /dev/null\n\n# Pass 2 (encoding)\nffmpeg -i input.mkv -c:v libx264 -b:v 2600k -pass 2 -c:a aac -b:a 128k output.mp4\n```\n\n### Audio Extraction\n\nExtract audio without re-encoding:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -vn -c:a copy audio.m4a\n```\n\nExtract and convert to MP3:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -vn -q:a 0 audio.mp3\n```\n\nExtract with specific bitrate:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -vn -c:a libmp3lame -b:a 192k audio.mp3\n```\n\n### Video Scaling/Resizing\n\nScale to specific dimensions:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf scale=1280:720 output.mp4\n```\n\nScale maintaining aspect ratio:\n```bash\n# Width 1280, height auto-calculated\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf scale=1280:-1 output.mp4\n\n# Height 720, width auto-calculated\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf scale=-1:720 output.mp4\n```\n\nScale to half resolution:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf scale=iw/2:ih/2 output.mp4\n```\n\n### Trimming/Cutting Video\n\nCut without re-encoding (fast but less precise):\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -ss 00:01:30 -to 00:03:00 -c copy output.mp4\n```\n\nCut with re-encoding (precise):\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -ss 00:01:30 -t 00:01:30 -c:v libx264 -c:a aac output.mp4\n```\n\nParameters:\n- `-ss`: Start time (HH:MM:SS or seconds)\n- `-to`: End time\n- `-t`: Duration (instead of end time)\n\n### Concatenation\n\n**Method 1: Concat demuxer (same codec/format)**\n\nCreate `concat.txt`:\n```\nfile ''input1.mp4''\nfile ''input2.mp4''\nfile ''input3.mp4''\n```\n\nRun:\n```bash\nffmpeg -f concat -safe 0 -i concat.txt -c copy output.mp4\n```\n\n**Method 2: Concat filter (different formats)**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input1.mp4 -i input2.mp4 -i input3.mp4 \\\n  -filter_complex \"[0:v][0:a][1:v][1:a][2:v][2:a]concat=n=3:v=1:a=1[v][a]\" \\\n  -map \"[v]\" -map \"[a]\" output.mp4\n```\n\n## Advanced Filtering\n\n### Video Filters\n\n**Multiple filters (chain with comma):**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"scale=1280:720,hqdn3d\" output.mp4\n```\n\n**Denoise:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf hqdn3d output.mp4\n```\n\n**Deinterlace:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf yadif output.mp4\n```\n\n**Crop:**\n```bash\n# Crop to 1280x720 from top-left (0,0)\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"crop=1280:720:0:0\" output.mp4\n\n# Auto-detect and remove black borders\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"cropdetect\" output.mp4\n```\n\n**Rotate:**\n```bash\n# Rotate 90 degrees clockwise\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"transpose=1\" output.mp4\n\n# Rotate 180 degrees\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"transpose=1,transpose=1\" output.mp4\n```\n\n**Watermark/Logo:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -i logo.png \\\n  -filter_complex \"overlay=10:10\" output.mp4\n```\n\n**Speed adjustment:**\n```bash\n# 2x speed\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"setpts=0.5*PTS\" -af \"atempo=2.0\" output.mp4\n\n# 0.5x speed (slow motion)\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"setpts=2.0*PTS\" -af \"atempo=0.5\" output.mp4\n```\n\n### Audio Filters\n\n**Volume adjustment:**\n```bash\n# Increase volume by 10dB\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -af \"volume=10dB\" output.mp4\n\n# Set to 50% volume\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -af \"volume=0.5\" output.mp4\n```\n\n**Normalize audio:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -af loudnorm output.mp4\n```\n\n**Crossfade between audio:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i audio1.mp3 -i audio2.mp3 \\\n  -filter_complex \"[0][1]acrossfade=d=5\" output.mp3\n```\n\n**Mix multiple audio tracks:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input1.mp3 -i input2.mp3 \\\n  -filter_complex \"[0:a][1:a]amix=inputs=2:duration=longest\" output.mp3\n```\n\n## Streaming\n\n### RTMP Streaming (Twitch/YouTube)\n\n**Basic stream:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -re -i input.mp4 -c:v libx264 -preset veryfast \\\n  -maxrate 3000k -bufsize 6000k -pix_fmt yuv420p -g 50 \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 128k -ar 44100 \\\n  -f flv rtmp://live.twitch.tv/app/YOUR_STREAM_KEY\n```\n\n**Screen capture + stream (Linux):**\n```bash\nffmpeg -f x11grab -s 1920x1080 -framerate 30 -i :0.0 \\\n  -f pulse -ac 2 -i default \\\n  -c:v libx264 -preset veryfast -tune zerolatency \\\n  -maxrate 2500k -bufsize 5000k -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 128k -ar 44100 \\\n  -f flv rtmp://live.twitch.tv/app/YOUR_STREAM_KEY\n```\n\n**Screen capture (Windows DirectShow):**\n```bash\nffmpeg -f dshow -i video=\"screen-capture-recorder\":audio=\"Stereo Mix\" \\\n  -c:v libx264 -preset ultrafast -tune zerolatency \\\n  -maxrate 750k -bufsize 3000k \\\n  -f flv rtmp://live.twitch.tv/app/YOUR_STREAM_KEY\n```\n\n**Important streaming parameters:**\n- `-re`: Read input at native frame rate (real-time)\n- `-tune zerolatency`: Optimize for low latency\n- `-g 50`: Keyframe every 50 frames (2 seconds @ 25fps)\n- `-maxrate`: Maximum bitrate\n- `-bufsize`: Rate control buffer (typically 2x maxrate)\n\n### HLS Streaming\n\nGenerate adaptive HLS stream:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 \\\n  -c:v libx264 -preset fast -crf 22 -g 48 -sc_threshold 0 \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 128k \\\n  -f hls -hls_time 6 -hls_playlist_type vod \\\n  -hls_segment_filename \"segment_%03d.ts\" \\\n  playlist.m3u8\n```\n\n**Multi-bitrate HLS:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 \\\n  -map 0:v -map 0:a -map 0:v -map 0:a \\\n  -c:v libx264 -crf 22 -c:a aac -b:a 128k \\\n  -b:v:0 2000k -s:v:0 1280x720 -b:v:1 5000k -s:v:1 1920x1080 \\\n  -var_stream_map \"v:0,a:0 v:1,a:1\" \\\n  -master_pl_name master.m3u8 \\\n  -f hls -hls_time 6 -hls_list_size 0 \\\n  stream_%v/index.m3u8\n```\n\n### UDP/RTP Streaming\n\n**UDP stream:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -re -i input.mp4 -c copy -f mpegts udp://192.168.1.100:1234\n```\n\n**RTP audio stream:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -re -i audio.mp3 -c:a libopus -f rtp rtp://192.168.1.100:5004\n```\n\n## Hardware Acceleration\n\n### NVIDIA NVENC\n\n```bash\n# H.264 with NVENC\nffmpeg -hwaccel cuda -i input.mp4 -c:v h264_nvenc -preset fast -crf 22 output.mp4\n\n# H.265 with NVENC\nffmpeg -hwaccel cuda -i input.mp4 -c:v hevc_nvenc -preset fast -crf 24 output.mp4\n```\n\n### Intel QuickSync (QSV)\n\n```bash\nffmpeg -hwaccel qsv -c:v h264_qsv -i input.mp4 \\\n  -c:v h264_qsv -preset fast -global_quality 22 output.mp4\n```\n\n### AMD VCE\n\n```bash\nffmpeg -hwaccel auto -i input.mp4 \\\n  -c:v h264_amf -quality balanced -rc cqp -qp 22 output.mp4\n```\n\n## Media Analysis\n\n### Inspect media file\n\n```bash\n# Detailed information\nffprobe -v quiet -print_format json -show_format -show_streams input.mp4\n\n# Human-readable format\nffprobe input.mp4\n\n# Get duration\nffprobe -v error -show_entries format=duration \\\n  -of default=noprint_wrappers=1:nokey=1 input.mp4\n\n# Get resolution\nffprobe -v error -select_streams v:0 \\\n  -show_entries stream=width,height \\\n  -of csv=s=x:p=0 input.mp4\n\n# Get bitrate\nffprobe -v error -show_entries format=bit_rate \\\n  -of default=noprint_wrappers=1:nokey=1 input.mp4\n```\n\n## Batch Processing\n\n### Bash loop for batch conversion\n\n```bash\n# Convert all MKV files to MP4\nfor file in *.mkv; do\n  ffmpeg -i \"$file\" -c:v libx264 -crf 22 -c:a aac \"${file%.mkv}.mp4\"\ndone\n\n# Resize all videos to 720p\nfor file in *.mp4; do\n  ffmpeg -i \"$file\" -vf scale=-1:720 \"720p_${file}\"\ndone\n```\n\n### Parallel processing with GNU Parallel\n\n```bash\n# Install: sudo apt-get install parallel\n\n# Process multiple files in parallel\nls *.mkv | parallel ffmpeg -i {} -c:v libx264 -crf 22 -c:a aac {.}.mp4\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Create GIF from video\n\n```bash\n# High quality GIF\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"fps=15,scale=640:-1:flags=lanczos,split[s0][s1];[s0]palettegen[p];[s1][p]paletteuse\" output.gif\n\n# Simple GIF\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"fps=10,scale=320:-1\" output.gif\n```\n\n### Extract frames as images\n\n```bash\n# Extract all frames\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 frame_%04d.png\n\n# Extract 1 frame per second\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf fps=1 frame_%04d.png\n\n# Extract single frame at 5 seconds\nffmpeg -ss 00:00:05 -i input.mp4 -frames:v 1 frame.png\n```\n\n### Create video from images\n\n```bash\n# From numbered images\nffmpeg -framerate 30 -i frame_%04d.png -c:v libx264 -crf 22 -pix_fmt yuv420p output.mp4\n\n# From pattern\nffmpeg -framerate 24 -pattern_type glob -i ''*.png'' -c:v libx264 output.mp4\n```\n\n### Add subtitles\n\n```bash\n# Burn subtitles into video\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -vf subtitles=subtitles.srt output.mp4\n\n# Embed subtitle track (soft subtitles)\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -i subtitles.srt -c copy -c:s mov_text output.mp4\n```\n\n### Remove audio\n\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -an -c:v copy output.mp4\n```\n\n### Replace audio\n\n```bash\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -i audio.mp3 -c:v copy -c:a aac -map 0:v:0 -map 1:a:0 output.mp4\n```\n\n### Create thumbnail\n\n```bash\n# Single thumbnail at 5 seconds\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -ss 00:00:05 -vframes 1 -vf scale=320:-1 thumb.jpg\n\n# Multiple thumbnails (one per minute)\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf fps=1/60,scale=320:-1 thumb_%03d.jpg\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### Speed vs Quality Trade-offs\n\n**Fast encoding (real-time processing):**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -c:v libx264 -preset ultrafast -crf 23 output.mp4\n```\n\n**Balanced (default):**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -c:v libx264 -preset medium -crf 22 output.mp4\n```\n\n**High quality (archival):**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -c:v libx264 -preset veryslow -crf 18 output.mp4\n```\n\n### Multi-threading\n\nFFmpeg automatically uses multiple CPU cores. Override with:\n```bash\nffmpeg -threads 8 -i input.mp4 -c:v libx264 output.mp4\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use CRF for quality-focused encoding** - Better than bitrate for most use cases\n2. **Two-pass for size targets** - When file size is critical\n3. **Copy streams when possible** - Use `-c copy` to avoid re-encoding\n4. **Choose appropriate presets** - Balance speed vs compression\n5. **Match output to source** - Don''t upscale or use higher quality than source\n6. **Test short clips first** - Verify settings before batch processing\n7. **Hardware acceleration** - Use GPU encoding for faster processing\n8. **Audio matters** - Don''t neglect audio codec/bitrate choices\n9. **Use filters efficiently** - Chain multiple filters with commas\n10. **Verify output** - Always check quality after encoding\n\n## Common Parameters Reference\n\n### Video Parameters\n- `-c:v` or `-vcodec`: Video codec\n- `-b:v`: Video bitrate (e.g., `2M`, `2500k`)\n- `-crf`: Constant Rate Factor (0-51)\n- `-preset`: Encoding speed/quality (ultrafast to veryslow)\n- `-tune`: Encoding optimization (film, animation, zerolatency)\n- `-pix_fmt`: Pixel format (yuv420p for compatibility)\n- `-r`: Frame rate (e.g., `30`, `60`)\n- `-g`: GOP size (keyframe interval)\n\n### Audio Parameters\n- `-c:a` or `-acodec`: Audio codec\n- `-b:a`: Audio bitrate (e.g., `128k`, `192k`)\n- `-ar`: Audio sample rate (e.g., `44100`, `48000`)\n- `-ac`: Audio channels (1=mono, 2=stereo)\n- `-q:a`: Audio quality for VBR (0=best for MP3)\n\n### General Parameters\n- `-i`: Input file\n- `-y`: Overwrite output without asking\n- `-n`: Never overwrite output\n- `-t`: Duration to encode\n- `-ss`: Start time offset\n- `-to`: End time\n- `-vf`: Video filters\n- `-af`: Audio filters\n- `-map`: Stream selection\n- `-metadata`: Set metadata\n- `-f`: Force format\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### \"Unknown encoder\" errors\nInstall codec libraries:\n```bash\n# Ubuntu/Debian\nsudo apt-get install ffmpeg libx264-dev libx265-dev libvpx-dev\n\n# Check available encoders\nffmpeg -encoders\n```\n\n### Output compatibility issues\nUse safe defaults for maximum compatibility:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mkv -c:v libx264 -profile:v high -level 4.0 \\\n  -pix_fmt yuv420p -c:a aac -b:a 128k output.mp4\n```\n\n### Performance issues\n- Use hardware acceleration (`-hwaccel`)\n- Choose faster presets (`-preset fast`)\n- Reduce resolution with scale filter\n- Use multiple threads explicitly\n\n### Quality issues\n- Lower CRF value (18-22 for high quality)\n- Use slower preset (`-preset slow`)\n- Use two-pass encoding for better bitrate distribution\n- Match or exceed source bitrate\n\n## Resources\n\n- Official Documentation: https://ffmpeg.org/documentation.html\n- FFmpeg Wiki: https://trac.ffmpeg.org/\n- Codec Guides: https://trac.ffmpeg.org/wiki/Encode\n- Filter Documentation: https://ffmpeg.org/ffmpeg-filters.html\n- GitHub Repository: https://github.com/ffmpeg/ffmpeg\n- Community Examples: https://trac.ffmpeg.org/wiki/\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n\nWhen using FFmpeg:\n\n- [ ] Verify FFmpeg installation (`ffmpeg -version`)\n- [ ] Check available codecs for your use case\n- [ ] Test encoding settings on short clip first\n- [ ] Choose appropriate codec for target platform\n- [ ] Set quality level (CRF or bitrate)\n- [ ] Configure audio codec and bitrate\n- [ ] Apply necessary filters (scale, crop, etc.)\n- [ ] Consider hardware acceleration if available\n- [ ] Verify output quality and file size\n- [ ] Test output compatibility on target devices\n- [ ] Document settings for reproducibility\n- [ ] Create batch scripts for repetitive tasks\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:30:38.995Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Media Processing Agents requiring advanced video and audio manipulation capabilities with FFmpeg","zh":"适用于需要高级视频和音频操作能力的媒体处理代理，支持FFmpeg","ja":"FFmpegを使用した高度なビデオおよびオーディオ操作機能を必要とするメディア処理エージェントに適しています","ko":"고급 비디오 및 오디오 조작 기능이 필요한 미디어 처리 에이전트에게 적합하며 FFmpeg를 지원합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Procesamiento de Medios que requieren capacidades avanzadas de manipulación de video y audio con FFmpeg","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Traitement des Médias nécessitant des capacités avancées de manipulation de vidéo et d''audio avec FFmpeg","de":"Ideal für Media-Processing-Agents, die erweiterte Video- und Audio-Manipulationsfunktionen mit FFmpeg benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Processamento de Mídia que exigem capacidades avançadas de manipulação de vídeo e áudio com FFmpeg","ru":"Идеально для агентов обработки медиа, требующих продвинутых возможностей манипулирования видео и аудио с помощью FFmpeg","ar":"مثالي لعميل معالجة الوسائط المتعددة الذي يتطلب إمكانيات متقدمة لتعديل الفيديو والصوت باستخدام FFmpeg"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert media files between formats like MP4, MKV, and WebM, encode and decode video with codecs such as H.264 and H.265, and process audio files in formats like AAC and MP3, enabling robust live streaming and multimedia handling","zh":"能够让代理转换媒体文件的格式，如MP4、MKV和WebM，使用H.264和H.265等编解码器编码和解码视频，并处理AAC和MP3等格式的音频文件，从而实现强大的实时流媒体和多媒体处理","ja":"エージェントがMP4、MKV、WebMなどの形式のメディアファイルを相互に変換したり、H.264およびH.265などのコーデックを使用してビデオをエンコードおよびデコードしたり、AACおよびMP3などの形式のオーディオファイルを処理したりすることを可能にし、強力なリアルタイムストリーミングおよびマルチメディア処理を実現します","ko":"에이전트가 MP4, MKV, WebM 등의 형식의 미디어 파일을 변환하거나 H.264 및 H.265 등의 코덱을 사용하여 비디오를 인코딩 및 디코딩하거나 AAC 및 MP3 등의 형식의 오디오 파일을 처리하여 강력한 실시간 스트리밍 및 멀티미디어 처리를 가능하게 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir archivos de medios entre formatos como MP4, MKV y WebM, codificar y decodificar video con codecs como H.264 y H.265, y procesar archivos de audio en formatos como AAC y MP3, lo que permite un streaming en vivo robusto y un manejo de multimedia","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des fichiers multimédias entre des formats tels que MP4, MKV et WebM, de coder et de décoder la vidéo avec des codecs tels que H.264 et H.265, et de traiter des fichiers audio dans des formats tels que AAC et MP3, permettant ainsi un streaming en direct robuste et une gestion multimédia","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Mediendateien zwischen Formaten wie MP4, MKV und WebM zu konvertieren, Video mit Codecs wie H.264 und H.265 zu codieren und zu decodieren und Audiodateien in Formaten wie AAC und MP3 zu verarbeiten, wodurch ein robustes Live-Streaming und eine Multimedia-Bewirtschaftung ermöglicht werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter arquivos de mídia entre formatos como MP4, MKV e WebM, codificar e decodificar vídeo com codecs como H.264 e H.265, e processar arquivos de áudio em formatos como AAC e MP3, permitindo transmissão ao vivo robusta e manipulação de multimídia","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью конвертировать медиафайлы между форматами, такими как MP4, MKV и WebM, кодировать и декодировать видео с кодеками, такими как H.264 и H.265, и обрабатывать аудиофайлы в форматах, таких как AAC и MP3, обеспечивая прочную прямую трансляцию и обработку мультимедиа","ar":"تمكين العميل من تحويل ملفات الوسائط المتعددة بين صيغ مثل MP4 و MKV و WebM ، وتشفير وفك تشفير الفيديو باستخدام ترميزات مثل H.264 و H.265 ، ومعالجة ملفات الصوت بصيغ مثل AAC و MP3 ، مما يتيح بثًا حيًا قويًا وتحكمًا في الوسائط المتعددة"},"useCases":{"en":["Converting video files for cross-platform compatibility","Encoding audio streams with VP9 and AV1 codecs","Processing live video feeds for real-time streaming"],"zh":["跨平台兼容性转换视频文件","使用VP9和AV1编解码器对音频流进行编码","处理实时视频源以实现实时流媒体"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォームの互換性のためにビデオファイルを変換する","VP9とAV1などのコーデックを使用してオーディオストリームをエンコードする","リアルタイムストリーミングのためにリアルタイムビデオフィードを処理する"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 호환성을 위해 비디오 파일을 변환하는 것","VP9 및 AV1 등의 코덱을 사용하여 오디오 스트림을 인코딩하는 것","실시간 스트리밍을 위해 실시간 비디오 피드를 처리하는 것"],"es":["Conversión de archivos de video para compatibilidad entre plataformas","Codificación de flujos de audio con codecs VP9 y AV1","Procesamiento de flujos de video en vivo para streaming en tiempo real"],"fr":["Conversion de fichiers vidéo pour la compatibilité multi-plateforme","Codage de flux audio avec les codecs VP9 et AV1","Traitement de flux vidéo en direct pour le streaming en temps réel"],"de":["Konvertierung von Videodateien für Cross-Platform-Kompatibilität","Codierung von Audio-Streams mit VP9- und AV1-Codecs","Verarbeitung von Live-Videoflüssen für Echtzeit-Streaming"],"pt":["Conversão de arquivos de vídeo para compatibilidade entre plataformas","Codificação de fluxos de áudio com codecs VP9 e AV1","Processamento de feeds de vídeo ao vivo para transmissão em tempo real"],"ru":["Преобразование видеофайлов для совместимости между платформами","Кодирование аудиопотоков с помощью кодеков VP9 и AV1","Обработка видеопотоков в реальном времени для прямой трансляции"],"ar":["تحويل ملفات الفيديو لتوافق المنصات المتعددة","تشفير تدفقات الصوت باستخدام ترميزات VP9 و AV1","معالجة تدفقات الفيديو الحية للبث المباشر في الوقت الفعلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires FFmpeg installation and configuration","Command-line interface dependency"],"zh":["需要安装和配置FFmpeg","命令行接口依赖"],"ja":["FFmpegのインストールと構成が必要","コマンドラインインターフェイスへの依存"],"ko":["FFmpeg 설치 및 구성이 필요함","명령줄 인터페이스 의존"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de FFmpeg","Dependencia de la interfaz de línea de comandos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de FFmpeg","Dépendance de l''interface en ligne de commande"],"de":["Benötigt FFmpeg-Installation und -Konfiguration","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstellen-Abhängigkeit"],"pt":["Exige instalação e configuração do FFmpeg","Dependência da interface de linha de comando"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации FFmpeg","Зависимость от командной строки"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين FFmpeg","اعتماد واجهة سطر الأوامر"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":85}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('kienhaminh/speed-reader/ffmpeg', 'community', 'kienhaminh', 'speed-reader', 'kienhaminh/speed-reader', 'ffmpeg', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z', '2026-02-18T03:30:32.602Z', NULL, '{"id":"kienhaminh/speed-reader/ffmpeg","name":"ffmpeg","description":{"zh":"FFmpeg是一种综合的开源多媒体框架，用于处理和转码多媒体文件","ja":"FFmpegは、マルチメディアファイルの処理と変換に使用される包括的なオープンソースマルチメディアフレームワークです","ko":"FFmpeg는 멀티미디어 파일을 처리하고 변환하는 데 사용되는 포괄적인 오픈 소스 멀티미디어 프레임워크입니다","es":"FFmpeg es un framework de código abierto para el procesamiento de archivos de multimedia. Permite convertir, codificar y transmitir archivos de video y audio.","fr":"FFmpeg est un framework open-source pour le traitement de fichiers multimédia. Il permet de convertir, d''encoder et de diffuser des fichiers vidéo et audio.","de":"FFmpeg ist ein Open-Source-Framework für die Verarbeitung von Multimedia-Dateien. Es ermöglicht die Konvertierung, Kodierung und Übertragung von Video- und Audio-Dateien.","pt":"O FFmpeg é uma ferramenta de processamento de mídia de código aberto que lida com arquivos e transmissões de vídeo e áudio.","ru":"FFmpeg - это открытый мультимедийный фреймворк, который работает с видео, аудио и другими мультимедийными файлами и потоками.","ar":"إف إف إم بِي جي هو إطار đa الوسائط مفتوح المصدر يتعامل مع الملفات والبث التلفزيوني والصوتي.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"FFmpeg技能：多媒体处理和转码","ja":"FFmpegスキル：マルチメディア処理と変換","ko":"FFmpeg 스킬: 멀티미디어 처리 및 변환","es":"FFmpeg: Herramienta de Procesamiento de Multimedia","fr":"FFmpeg: Outil de Traitement de Multimédia","de":"FFmpeg: Multimedia-Verarbeitungstool","pt":"FFmpeg: Ferramenta de Processamento de Mídia","ru":"FFmpeg: Мультимедийный Фреймворк","ar":"إف إف إم بِي جي: إطار đa الوسائط الشامل","en":"ffmpeg"},"description":{"zh":"FFmpeg是一种综合的开源多媒体框架，用于处理和转码多媒体文件","ja":"FFmpegは、マルチメディアファイルの処理と変換に使用される包括的なオープンソースマルチメディアフレームワークです","ko":"FFmpeg는 멀티미디어 파일을 처리하고 변환하는 데 사용되는 포괄적인 오픈 소스 멀티미디어 프레임워크입니다","es":"FFmpeg es un framework de código abierto para el procesamiento de archivos de multimedia. Permite convertir, codificar y transmitir archivos de video y audio.","fr":"FFmpeg est un framework open-source pour le traitement de fichiers multimédia. Il permet de convertir, d''encoder et de diffuser des fichiers vidéo et audio.","de":"FFmpeg ist ein Open-Source-Framework für die Verarbeitung von Multimedia-Dateien. Es ermöglicht die Konvertierung, Kodierung und Übertragung von Video- und A...","pt":"O FFmpeg é uma ferramenta de processamento de mídia de código aberto que lida com arquivos e transmissões de vídeo e áudio.","ru":"FFmpeg - это открытый мультимедийный фреймворк, который работает с видео, аудио и другими мультимедийными файлами и потоками.","ar":"إف إف إم بِي جي هو إطار đa الوسائط مفتوح المصدر يتعامل مع الملفات والبث التلفزيوني والصوتي.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持多种多媒体格式","提供命令行工具和库","支持视频和音频编码和解码","支持实时流媒体","支持媒体文件转换"],"ja":["複数のマルチメディア形式をサポート","コマンドラインツールとライブラリを提供","ビデオとオーディオのエンコードとデコードをサポート","リアルタイムストリーミングをサポート","メディアファイルの変換をサポート"],"ko":["여러 멀티미디어 형식을 지원","명령줄 도구 및 라이브러리를 제공","비디오 및 오디오 인코딩 및 디코딩을 지원","실시간 스트리밍을 지원","미디어 파일 변환을 지원"],"es":["Conversión de archivos de multimedia entre formatos","Codificación y decodificación de video con diferentes codecs","Procesamiento de archivos de audio","Transmisión en vivo","Compatibilidad con múltiples formatos de archivo","Herramientas de línea de comandos y bibliotecas para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Conversion de fichiers multimédia entre formats","Encodage et décodage de vidéo avec différents codecs","Traitement de fichiers audio","Diffusion en direct","Compatibilité avec de nombreux formats de fichier","Outils de ligne de commande et bibliothèques pour les développeurs"],"de":["Konvertierung von Multimedia-Dateien zwischen Formaten","Kodierung und Dekodierung von Video mit verschiedenen Codecs","Verarbeitung von Audio-Dateien","Live-Streaming","Kompatibilität mit vielen Dateiformaten","Kommandozeilen-Tools und Bibliotheken für Entwickler"],"pt":["Conversão de arquivos de mídia entre formatos","Codificação e decodificação de vídeo com diferentes codecs","Processamento de arquivos de áudio","Transmissão ao vivo","Bibliotecas e ferramentas de linha de comando"],"ru":["Преобразование мультимедийных файлов между форматами","Кодирование и декодирование видео с помощью разных кодеков","Обработка аудиофайлов","Прямая трансляция","Библиотеки и инструменты командной строки"],"ar":["تحويل ملفات الوسائط بين الصيغ","تشفير وفك تشفير الفيديو باستخدام كوديكات مختلفة","معالجة ملفات الصوت","البث المباشر","المكتبات وأدوات سطر الأوامر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["FFmpeg","多媒体处理","视频转码","音频转码","实时流媒体","媒体文件转换"],"ja":["FFmpeg","マルチメディア処理","ビデオ変換","オーディオ変換","リアルタイムストリーミング","メディアファイル変換"],"ko":["FFmpeg","멀티미디어 처리","비디오 변환","오디오 변환","실시간 스트리밍","미디어 파일 변환"],"es":["ffmpeg","procesamiento de multimedia","conversión de archivos","codificación de video","transmisión en vivo","desarrollo de aplicaciones","herramientas de línea de comandos","bibliotecas para desarrolladores"],"fr":["ffmpeg","traitement de multimédia","conversion de fichiers","encodage de vidéo","diffusion en direct","développement d''applications","outils de ligne de commande","bibliothèques pour les développeurs"],"de":["ffmpeg","multimedia-verarbeitung","dateikonvertierung","videokodierung","live-streaming","anwendungsentwicklung","kommandozeilen-tools","bibliotheken für entwickler"],"pt":["FFmpeg","processamento de mídia","conversão de vídeo","codificação de áudio","transmissão ao vivo","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de linha de comando"],"ru":["FFmpeg","мультимедийный фреймворк","преобразование видео","кодирование аудио","прямая трансляция","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты командной строки"],"ar":["إف إف إم بِي جي","إطار đa الوسائط","تحويل الفيديو","تشفير الصوت","البث المباشر","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات سطر الأوامر"]}},"owner":"kienhaminh","repo":"speed-reader","repoPath":"kienhaminh/speed-reader","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ffmpeg","description":"Guide for using FFmpeg - a comprehensive multimedia framework for video/audio encoding, conversion, streaming, and filtering. Use when processing media files, converting formats, extracting audio, creating streams, applying filters, or optimizing video/audio quality.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# FFmpeg Skill\n\nFFmpeg is a comprehensive open-source multimedia framework that handles video, audio, and other multimedia files and streams. It provides command-line tools and libraries for recording, converting, and streaming audio and video.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Converting media files between formats (MP4, MKV, WebM, AVI, etc.)\n- Encoding/decoding video with different codecs (H.264, H.265, VP9, AV1)\n- Processing audio files (AAC, MP3, FLAC, Opus)\n- Live streaming","body":"# FFmpeg Skill\n\nFFmpeg is a comprehensive open-source multimedia framework that handles video, audio, and other multimedia files and streams. It provides command-line tools and libraries for recording, converting, and streaming audio and video.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Converting media files between formats (MP4, MKV, WebM, AVI, etc.)\n- Encoding/decoding video with different codecs (H.264, H.265, VP9, AV1)\n- Processing audio files (AAC, MP3, FLAC, Opus)\n- Live streaming to platforms (Twitch, YouTube, RTMP servers)\n- Creating HLS/DASH adaptive streams\n- Extracting audio from video files\n- Applying video/audio filters (scale, crop, denoise, volume)\n- Screen recording and capture\n- Optimizing video quality and file size\n- Batch processing media files\n- Analyzing media file properties\n\n## Core Components\n\n### Command-Line Tools\n\n**ffmpeg**: Primary tool for transcoding, conversion, and streaming\n**ffprobe**: Media analysis and inspection tool\n**ffplay**: Minimalist multimedia player for testing\n\n### Libraries\n\n- **libavcodec**: Encoding/decoding codecs\n- **libavformat**: Container formats and I/O\n- **libavfilter**: Audio/video filtering framework\n- **libavutil**: Utility functions\n- **libswscale**: Video scaling and color conversion\n- **libswresample**: Audio resampling and mixing\n\n## Common Video Codecs\n\n### Modern Codecs\n\n**H.264 (libx264)**: Most widely supported, excellent compression/quality balance\n- Best for: Universal compatibility, streaming, web video\n- Quality range: CRF 17-28 (lower = better quality)\n\n**H.265/HEVC (libx265)**: 25-50% better compression than H.264\n- Best for: 4K video, file size reduction\n- Slower encoding, limited browser support\n\n**VP9**: Royalty-free, WebM format\n- Best for: YouTube, open-source projects\n- Good quality/compression, Chrome/Firefox support\n\n**AV1 (libaom-av1, libsvtav1)**: Next-generation codec, best compression\n- Best for: Future-proofing, ultimate quality/size ratio\n- Very slow encoding (improving with SVT-AV1)\n\n### Legacy Codecs\n- MPEG-4 (Xvid/DivX)\n- MPEG-2\n- VP8\n\n## Common Audio Codecs\n\n**AAC**: Industry standard, excellent quality\n**MP3**: Universal compatibility, good quality\n**Opus**: Best quality at low bitrates, ideal for voice/streaming\n**FLAC**: Lossless compression, archival quality\n**Vorbis**: Open-source, good quality\n**AC-3/DTS**: Surround sound formats\n\n## Container Formats\n\n**MP4**: Universal compatibility, streaming-friendly\n**MKV (Matroska)**: Feature-rich, supports multiple tracks/subtitles\n**WebM**: Web-optimized (VP8/VP9 + Vorbis/Opus)\n**AVI**: Legacy format, broad compatibility\n**MOV**: Apple QuickTime format\n**TS**: Transport stream for broadcasting\n**FLV**: Flash video (legacy streaming)\n\n## Basic Operations\n\n### Format Conversion\n\nSimple format conversion without re-encoding:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mkv -c copy output.mp4\n```\n\nConvert with specific codecs:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.avi -c:v libx264 -c:a aac output.mp4\n```\n\n### Quality-Based Encoding (CRF)\n\nConstant Rate Factor - best for quality-focused encoding:\n\n```bash\n# H.264 encoding (CRF 23 = default, 17-28 recommended range)\nffmpeg -i input.mkv -c:v libx264 -preset slow -crf 22 -c:a copy output.mp4\n\n# H.265 encoding (higher compression)\nffmpeg -i input.mkv -c:v libx265 -preset medium -crf 24 -c:a copy output.mp4\n\n# VP9 encoding (WebM)\nffmpeg -i input.mkv -c:v libvpx-vp9 -crf 30 -b:v 0 -c:a libopus output.webm\n```\n\n**CRF Scale:**\n- 0 = Lossless (huge file size)\n- 17-18 = Visually lossless\n- 20-23 = High quality (recommended)\n- 24-28 = Medium quality\n- 30+ = Low quality\n- 51 = Worst quality\n\n**Presets** (speed vs compression):\n- ultrafast, superfast, veryfast, faster, fast\n- medium (default)\n- slow, slower, veryslow (better compression)\n- placebo (not recommended - minimal gains)\n\n### Bitrate-Based Encoding (Two-Pass)\n\nFor targeting specific file sizes:\n\n```bash\n# Pass 1 (analysis)\nffmpeg -y -i input.mkv -c:v libx264 -b:v 2600k -pass 1 -an -f null /dev/null\n\n# Pass 2 (encoding)\nffmpeg -i input.mkv -c:v libx264 -b:v 2600k -pass 2 -c:a aac -b:a 128k output.mp4\n```\n\n### Audio Extraction\n\nExtract audio without re-encoding:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -vn -c:a copy audio.m4a\n```\n\nExtract and convert to MP3:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -vn -q:a 0 audio.mp3\n```\n\nExtract with specific bitrate:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -vn -c:a libmp3lame -b:a 192k audio.mp3\n```\n\n### Video Scaling/Resizing\n\nScale to specific dimensions:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf scale=1280:720 output.mp4\n```\n\nScale maintaining aspect ratio:\n```bash\n# Width 1280, height auto-calculated\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf scale=1280:-1 output.mp4\n\n# Height 720, width auto-calculated\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf scale=-1:720 output.mp4\n```\n\nScale to half resolution:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf scale=iw/2:ih/2 output.mp4\n```\n\n### Trimming/Cutting Video\n\nCut without re-encoding (fast but less precise):\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -ss 00:01:30 -to 00:03:00 -c copy output.mp4\n```\n\nCut with re-encoding (precise):\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -ss 00:01:30 -t 00:01:30 -c:v libx264 -c:a aac output.mp4\n```\n\nParameters:\n- `-ss`: Start time (HH:MM:SS or seconds)\n- `-to`: End time\n- `-t`: Duration (instead of end time)\n\n### Concatenation\n\n**Method 1: Concat demuxer (same codec/format)**\n\nCreate `concat.txt`:\n```\nfile ''input1.mp4''\nfile ''input2.mp4''\nfile ''input3.mp4''\n```\n\nRun:\n```bash\nffmpeg -f concat -safe 0 -i concat.txt -c copy output.mp4\n```\n\n**Method 2: Concat filter (different formats)**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input1.mp4 -i input2.mp4 -i input3.mp4 \\\n  -filter_complex \"[0:v][0:a][1:v][1:a][2:v][2:a]concat=n=3:v=1:a=1[v][a]\" \\\n  -map \"[v]\" -map \"[a]\" output.mp4\n```\n\n## Advanced Filtering\n\n### Video Filters\n\n**Multiple filters (chain with comma):**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"scale=1280:720,hqdn3d\" output.mp4\n```\n\n**Denoise:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf hqdn3d output.mp4\n```\n\n**Deinterlace:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf yadif output.mp4\n```\n\n**Crop:**\n```bash\n# Crop to 1280x720 from top-left (0,0)\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"crop=1280:720:0:0\" output.mp4\n\n# Auto-detect and remove black borders\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"cropdetect\" output.mp4\n```\n\n**Rotate:**\n```bash\n# Rotate 90 degrees clockwise\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"transpose=1\" output.mp4\n\n# Rotate 180 degrees\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"transpose=1,transpose=1\" output.mp4\n```\n\n**Watermark/Logo:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -i logo.png \\\n  -filter_complex \"overlay=10:10\" output.mp4\n```\n\n**Speed adjustment:**\n```bash\n# 2x speed\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"setpts=0.5*PTS\" -af \"atempo=2.0\" output.mp4\n\n# 0.5x speed (slow motion)\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"setpts=2.0*PTS\" -af \"atempo=0.5\" output.mp4\n```\n\n### Audio Filters\n\n**Volume adjustment:**\n```bash\n# Increase volume by 10dB\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -af \"volume=10dB\" output.mp4\n\n# Set to 50% volume\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -af \"volume=0.5\" output.mp4\n```\n\n**Normalize audio:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -af loudnorm output.mp4\n```\n\n**Crossfade between audio:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i audio1.mp3 -i audio2.mp3 \\\n  -filter_complex \"[0][1]acrossfade=d=5\" output.mp3\n```\n\n**Mix multiple audio tracks:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input1.mp3 -i input2.mp3 \\\n  -filter_complex \"[0:a][1:a]amix=inputs=2:duration=longest\" output.mp3\n```\n\n## Streaming\n\n### RTMP Streaming (Twitch/YouTube)\n\n**Basic stream:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -re -i input.mp4 -c:v libx264 -preset veryfast \\\n  -maxrate 3000k -bufsize 6000k -pix_fmt yuv420p -g 50 \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 128k -ar 44100 \\\n  -f flv rtmp://live.twitch.tv/app/YOUR_STREAM_KEY\n```\n\n**Screen capture + stream (Linux):**\n```bash\nffmpeg -f x11grab -s 1920x1080 -framerate 30 -i :0.0 \\\n  -f pulse -ac 2 -i default \\\n  -c:v libx264 -preset veryfast -tune zerolatency \\\n  -maxrate 2500k -bufsize 5000k -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 128k -ar 44100 \\\n  -f flv rtmp://live.twitch.tv/app/YOUR_STREAM_KEY\n```\n\n**Screen capture (Windows DirectShow):**\n```bash\nffmpeg -f dshow -i video=\"screen-capture-recorder\":audio=\"Stereo Mix\" \\\n  -c:v libx264 -preset ultrafast -tune zerolatency \\\n  -maxrate 750k -bufsize 3000k \\\n  -f flv rtmp://live.twitch.tv/app/YOUR_STREAM_KEY\n```\n\n**Important streaming parameters:**\n- `-re`: Read input at native frame rate (real-time)\n- `-tune zerolatency`: Optimize for low latency\n- `-g 50`: Keyframe every 50 frames (2 seconds @ 25fps)\n- `-maxrate`: Maximum bitrate\n- `-bufsize`: Rate control buffer (typically 2x maxrate)\n\n### HLS Streaming\n\nGenerate adaptive HLS stream:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 \\\n  -c:v libx264 -preset fast -crf 22 -g 48 -sc_threshold 0 \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 128k \\\n  -f hls -hls_time 6 -hls_playlist_type vod \\\n  -hls_segment_filename \"segment_%03d.ts\" \\\n  playlist.m3u8\n```\n\n**Multi-bitrate HLS:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 \\\n  -map 0:v -map 0:a -map 0:v -map 0:a \\\n  -c:v libx264 -crf 22 -c:a aac -b:a 128k \\\n  -b:v:0 2000k -s:v:0 1280x720 -b:v:1 5000k -s:v:1 1920x1080 \\\n  -var_stream_map \"v:0,a:0 v:1,a:1\" \\\n  -master_pl_name master.m3u8 \\\n  -f hls -hls_time 6 -hls_list_size 0 \\\n  stream_%v/index.m3u8\n```\n\n### UDP/RTP Streaming\n\n**UDP stream:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -re -i input.mp4 -c copy -f mpegts udp://192.168.1.100:1234\n```\n\n**RTP audio stream:**\n```bash\nffmpeg -re -i audio.mp3 -c:a libopus -f rtp rtp://192.168.1.100:5004\n```\n\n## Hardware Acceleration\n\n### NVIDIA NVENC\n\n```bash\n# H.264 with NVENC\nffmpeg -hwaccel cuda -i input.mp4 -c:v h264_nvenc -preset fast -crf 22 output.mp4\n\n# H.265 with NVENC\nffmpeg -hwaccel cuda -i input.mp4 -c:v hevc_nvenc -preset fast -crf 24 output.mp4\n```\n\n### Intel QuickSync (QSV)\n\n```bash\nffmpeg -hwaccel qsv -c:v h264_qsv -i input.mp4 \\\n  -c:v h264_qsv -preset fast -global_quality 22 output.mp4\n```\n\n### AMD VCE\n\n```bash\nffmpeg -hwaccel auto -i input.mp4 \\\n  -c:v h264_amf -quality balanced -rc cqp -qp 22 output.mp4\n```\n\n## Media Analysis\n\n### Inspect media file\n\n```bash\n# Detailed information\nffprobe -v quiet -print_format json -show_format -show_streams input.mp4\n\n# Human-readable format\nffprobe input.mp4\n\n# Get duration\nffprobe -v error -show_entries format=duration \\\n  -of default=noprint_wrappers=1:nokey=1 input.mp4\n\n# Get resolution\nffprobe -v error -select_streams v:0 \\\n  -show_entries stream=width,height \\\n  -of csv=s=x:p=0 input.mp4\n\n# Get bitrate\nffprobe -v error -show_entries format=bit_rate \\\n  -of default=noprint_wrappers=1:nokey=1 input.mp4\n```\n\n## Batch Processing\n\n### Bash loop for batch conversion\n\n```bash\n# Convert all MKV files to MP4\nfor file in *.mkv; do\n  ffmpeg -i \"$file\" -c:v libx264 -crf 22 -c:a aac \"${file%.mkv}.mp4\"\ndone\n\n# Resize all videos to 720p\nfor file in *.mp4; do\n  ffmpeg -i \"$file\" -vf scale=-1:720 \"720p_${file}\"\ndone\n```\n\n### Parallel processing with GNU Parallel\n\n```bash\n# Install: sudo apt-get install parallel\n\n# Process multiple files in parallel\nls *.mkv | parallel ffmpeg -i {} -c:v libx264 -crf 22 -c:a aac {.}.mp4\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Create GIF from video\n\n```bash\n# High quality GIF\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"fps=15,scale=640:-1:flags=lanczos,split[s0][s1];[s0]palettegen[p];[s1][p]paletteuse\" output.gif\n\n# Simple GIF\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf \"fps=10,scale=320:-1\" output.gif\n```\n\n### Extract frames as images\n\n```bash\n# Extract all frames\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 frame_%04d.png\n\n# Extract 1 frame per second\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf fps=1 frame_%04d.png\n\n# Extract single frame at 5 seconds\nffmpeg -ss 00:00:05 -i input.mp4 -frames:v 1 frame.png\n```\n\n### Create video from images\n\n```bash\n# From numbered images\nffmpeg -framerate 30 -i frame_%04d.png -c:v libx264 -crf 22 -pix_fmt yuv420p output.mp4\n\n# From pattern\nffmpeg -framerate 24 -pattern_type glob -i ''*.png'' -c:v libx264 output.mp4\n```\n\n### Add subtitles\n\n```bash\n# Burn subtitles into video\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -vf subtitles=subtitles.srt output.mp4\n\n# Embed subtitle track (soft subtitles)\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -i subtitles.srt -c copy -c:s mov_text output.mp4\n```\n\n### Remove audio\n\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -an -c:v copy output.mp4\n```\n\n### Replace audio\n\n```bash\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -i audio.mp3 -c:v copy -c:a aac -map 0:v:0 -map 1:a:0 output.mp4\n```\n\n### Create thumbnail\n\n```bash\n# Single thumbnail at 5 seconds\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -ss 00:00:05 -vframes 1 -vf scale=320:-1 thumb.jpg\n\n# Multiple thumbnails (one per minute)\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -vf fps=1/60,scale=320:-1 thumb_%03d.jpg\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### Speed vs Quality Trade-offs\n\n**Fast encoding (real-time processing):**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -c:v libx264 -preset ultrafast -crf 23 output.mp4\n```\n\n**Balanced (default):**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -c:v libx264 -preset medium -crf 22 output.mp4\n```\n\n**High quality (archival):**\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -c:v libx264 -preset veryslow -crf 18 output.mp4\n```\n\n### Multi-threading\n\nFFmpeg automatically uses multiple CPU cores. Override with:\n```bash\nffmpeg -threads 8 -i input.mp4 -c:v libx264 output.mp4\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use CRF for quality-focused encoding** - Better than bitrate for most use cases\n2. **Two-pass for size targets** - When file size is critical\n3. **Copy streams when possible** - Use `-c copy` to avoid re-encoding\n4. **Choose appropriate presets** - Balance speed vs compression\n5. **Match output to source** - Don''t upscale or use higher quality than source\n6. **Test short clips first** - Verify settings before batch processing\n7. **Hardware acceleration** - Use GPU encoding for faster processing\n8. **Audio matters** - Don''t neglect audio codec/bitrate choices\n9. **Use filters efficiently** - Chain multiple filters with commas\n10. **Verify output** - Always check quality after encoding\n\n## Common Parameters Reference\n\n### Video Parameters\n- `-c:v` or `-vcodec`: Video codec\n- `-b:v`: Video bitrate (e.g., `2M`, `2500k`)\n- `-crf`: Constant Rate Factor (0-51)\n- `-preset`: Encoding speed/quality (ultrafast to veryslow)\n- `-tune`: Encoding optimization (film, animation, zerolatency)\n- `-pix_fmt`: Pixel format (yuv420p for compatibility)\n- `-r`: Frame rate (e.g., `30`, `60`)\n- `-g`: GOP size (keyframe interval)\n\n### Audio Parameters\n- `-c:a` or `-acodec`: Audio codec\n- `-b:a`: Audio bitrate (e.g., `128k`, `192k`)\n- `-ar`: Audio sample rate (e.g., `44100`, `48000`)\n- `-ac`: Audio channels (1=mono, 2=stereo)\n- `-q:a`: Audio quality for VBR (0=best for MP3)\n\n### General Parameters\n- `-i`: Input file\n- `-y`: Overwrite output without asking\n- `-n`: Never overwrite output\n- `-t`: Duration to encode\n- `-ss`: Start time offset\n- `-to`: End time\n- `-vf`: Video filters\n- `-af`: Audio filters\n- `-map`: Stream selection\n- `-metadata`: Set metadata\n- `-f`: Force format\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### \"Unknown encoder\" errors\nInstall codec libraries:\n```bash\n# Ubuntu/Debian\nsudo apt-get install ffmpeg libx264-dev libx265-dev libvpx-dev\n\n# Check available encoders\nffmpeg -encoders\n```\n\n### Output compatibility issues\nUse safe defaults for maximum compatibility:\n```bash\nffmpeg -i input.mkv -c:v libx264 -profile:v high -level 4.0 \\\n  -pix_fmt yuv420p -c:a aac -b:a 128k output.mp4\n```\n\n### Performance issues\n- Use hardware acceleration (`-hwaccel`)\n- Choose faster presets (`-preset fast`)\n- Reduce resolution with scale filter\n- Use multiple threads explicitly\n\n### Quality issues\n- Lower CRF value (18-22 for high quality)\n- Use slower preset (`-preset slow`)\n- Use two-pass encoding for better bitrate distribution\n- Match or exceed source bitrate\n\n## Resources\n\n- Official Documentation: https://ffmpeg.org/documentation.html\n- FFmpeg Wiki: https://trac.ffmpeg.org/\n- Codec Guides: https://trac.ffmpeg.org/wiki/Encode\n- Filter Documentation: https://ffmpeg.org/ffmpeg-filters.html\n- GitHub Repository: https://github.com/ffmpeg/ffmpeg\n- Community Examples: https://trac.ffmpeg.org/wiki/\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n\nWhen using FFmpeg:\n\n- [ ] Verify FFmpeg installation (`ffmpeg -version`)\n- [ ] Check available codecs for your use case\n- [ ] Test encoding settings on short clip first\n- [ ] Choose appropriate codec for target platform\n- [ ] Set quality level (CRF or bitrate)\n- [ ] Configure audio codec and bitrate\n- [ ] Apply necessary filters (scale, crop, etc.)\n- [ ] Consider hardware acceleration if available\n- [ ] Verify output quality and file size\n- [ ] Test output compatibility on target devices\n- [ ] Document settings for reproducibility\n- [ ] Create batch scripts for repetitive tasks\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:30:32.602Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Media Processing Agents requiring advanced video and audio manipulation capabilities with FFmpeg.","zh":"适合需要高级视频和音频操作能力的媒体处理代理，特别是使用FFmpeg。","ja":"FFmpegを使用した高度なビデオおよびオーディオ操作機能を必要とするメディア処理エージェントに最適。","ko":"FFmpeg를 사용한 고급 비디오 및 오디오 조작 기능을 필요로 하는 미디어 처리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Procesamiento de Medios que requieren capacidades avanzadas de manipulación de video y audio con FFmpeg.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de traitement des médias nécessitant des capacités de manipulation de vidéos et d''audio avancées avec FFmpeg.","de":"Ideal für Medienverarbeitungsagenten, die erweiterte Video- und Audio-Manipulationsfunktionen mit FFmpeg benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Processamento de Mídia que exigem capacidades avançadas de manipulação de vídeo e áudio com FFmpeg.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов обработки медиа, требующих расширенных возможностей манипулирования видео и аудио с помощью FFmpeg.","ar":"مثالية لوكلاء معالجة الوسائط المتعددة التي تتطلب إمكانيات متقدمة لتعديل الفيديو والصوت باستخدام FFmpeg."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert media files between formats like MP4, MKV, and WebM, utilizing codecs such as H.264, H.265, VP9, and AV1, while also processing audio files in AAC, MP3, FLAC, and Opus formats for live streaming and other multimedia applications.","zh":"赋予代理转换媒体文件的能力，如MP4、MKV和WebM格式之间的转换，利用H.264、H.265、VP9和AV1等编码器，同时处理AAC、MP3、FLAC和Opus格式的音频文件，以适应直播和其他多媒体应用。","ja":"エージェントに、MP4、MKV、WebMなどのフォーマット間のメディアファイルの変換機能を提供します。H.264、H.265、VP9、AV1などのコーデックを利用し、AAC、MP3、FLAC、Opusなどのフォーマットのオーディオファイルを処理して、ライブストリーミングやその他のマルチメディアアプリケーションに最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 MP4, MKV, WebM 등의 형식 간에 미디어 파일을 변환할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다. H.264, H.265, VP9, AV1 등의 코덱을 사용하며, AAC, MP3, FLAC, Opus 등의 형식의 오디오 파일을 처리하여 라이브 스트리밍 및 기타 멀티미디어 애플리케이션에 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir archivos de medios entre formatos como MP4, MKV y WebM, utilizando codecs como H.264, H.265, VP9 y AV1, y también procesar archivos de audio en formatos AAC, MP3, FLAC y Opus para transmisiones en vivo y otras aplicaciones multimedia.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des fichiers multimédias entre des formats tels que MP4, MKV et WebM, en utilisant des codecs tels que H.264, H.265, VP9 et AV1, et de traiter également des fichiers audio aux formats AAC, MP3, FLAC et Opus pour la diffusion en direct et d''autres applications multimédias.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Mediendateien zwischen Formaten wie MP4, MKV und WebM zu konvertieren, indem Codecs wie H.264, H.265, VP9 und AV1 verwendet werden, und verarbeitet auch Audiodateien in Formaten wie AAC, MP3, FLAC und Opus für Live-Streaming und andere Multimedia-Anwendungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter arquivos de mídia entre formatos como MP4, MKV e WebM, utilizando codecs como H.264, H.265, VP9 e AV1, além de processar arquivos de áudio nos formatos AAC, MP3, FLAC e Opus para transmissão ao vivo e outras aplicações multimídia.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью конвертировать медиафайлы между форматами, такими как MP4, MKV и WebM, используя кодеки, такие как H.264, H.265, VP9 и AV1, а также обрабатывать аудиофайлы в форматах AAC, MP3, FLAC и Opus для прямой трансляции и других мультимедийных приложений.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل ملفات الوسائط المتعددة بين صيغ مثل MP4 و MKV و WebM، باستخدام ترميزات مثل H.264 و H.265 و VP9 و AV1، بالإضافة إلى معالجة ملفات الصوت في صيغ AAC و MP3 و FLAC و Opus لبث المباشر وتطبيقات الوسائط المتعددة الأخرى."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting video files for cross-platform compatibility","Encoding audio streams with specific codecs for live broadcasting","Processing multimedia files for web optimization"],"zh":["跨平台兼容性转换视频文件","使用特定编码器对音频流进行编码以进行直播","处理多媒体文件以优化网络性能"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォームの互換性のためにビデオファイルを変換する","特定のコーデックを使用してオーディオストリームをエンコードしてライブ放送を行う","マルチメディアファイルを処理してWebの最適化を行う"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 호환성을 위한 비디오 파일 변환","라이브 방송을 위한 특정 코덱을 사용한 오디오 스트림 인코딩","웹 최적화를 위한 멀티미디어 파일 처리"],"es":["Convertir archivos de video para la compatibilidad entre plataformas","Codificar flujos de audio con codecs específicos para la transmisión en vivo","Procesar archivos multimedia para la optimización web"],"fr":["Convertir des fichiers vidéo pour la compatibilité entre plates-formes","Encoder des flux audio avec des codecs spécifiques pour la diffusion en direct","Traiter des fichiers multimédias pour l''optimisation web"],"de":["Konvertieren von Videodateien für die Kompatibilität zwischen Plattformen","Codieren von Audiodatenströmen mit spezifischen Codecs für das Live-Streaming","Verarbeiten von Multimedia-Dateien für die Web-Optimierung"],"pt":["Conversão de arquivos de vídeo para compatibilidade entre plataformas","Codificação de fluxos de áudio com codecs específicos para transmissão ao vivo","Processamento de arquivos multimídia para otimização da web"],"ru":["Преобразование видеофайлов для совместимости на разных платформах","Кодирование аудиопотоков с помощью конкретных кодеков для прямого вещания","Обработка мультимедийных файлов для оптимизации веб-приложений"],"ar":["تحويل ملفات الفيديو للتوافق بين المنصات","ترميز تدفقات الصوت باستخدام ترميزات محددة للبث المباشر","معالجة ملفات الوسائط المتعددة لتحسين الويب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires command-line interface access","Dependent on system resources for processing intensive tasks"],"zh":["需要命令行接口访问","处理密集型任务依赖于系统资源"],"ja":["コマンドラインインターフェースへのアクセスが必要","リソースの集中的なタスクの処理はシステムリソースに依存する"],"ko":["명령줄 인터페이스 액세스가 필요함","자원 집중적인 작업의 처리는 시스템 자원에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la interfaz de línea de comandos","Dependiente de los recursos del sistema para tareas de procesamiento intensivo"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''interface de ligne de commande","Dépend des ressources du système pour les tâches de traitement intensif"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle","Abhängig von den Systemressourcen für ressourcenintensive Aufgaben"],"pt":["Exige acesso à interface de linha de comando","Depende dos recursos do sistema para tarefas intensivas de processamento"],"ru":["Требует доступа к командной строке","Зависит от системных ресурсов для интенсивных задач обработки"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة سطر الأوامر","يعتمد على موارد النظام لمهام معالجة مكثفة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
