web et mobiles","Recommandations technologiques personnalisées","Création de conceptions complètes et bien structurées"],"de":["Systematische Analyse von anfänglichen Konzepten","Strategische Planung für AI/ML-Projekte","Entwurf von Architekturen für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen","Maßgeschneiderte Technologie-Empfehlungen","Erstellung von umfassenden und gut strukturierten Designs"],"pt":["Análise sistemática de conceitos","Recomendações tecnológicas personalizadas","Desenvolvimento de designs abrangentes","Planejamento estratégico para agentes de IA/ML","Arquitetura de aplicações web e móveis"],"ru":["Систематический анализ концепций","Персональные технологические рекомендации","Разработка комплексных дизайнов","Стратегическое планирование для агентов ИИ/МЛ","Архитектура веб- и мобильных приложений"],"ar":["التحليل المنهجي للمفاهيم","التوصيات التكنولوجية المخصصة","إنشاء تصميمات شاملة","التخطيط الاستراتيجي لعمليات الإنسان والآلة","هندسة تطبيقات الويب والجوال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["项目设计","初步项目概念","全面设计","系统分析","特性增强","技术推荐","AI/ML代理","Web应用程序","移动项目"],"ja":["プロジェクト設計","初期のプロジェクト概念","包括的な設計","体系的な分析","特性の強化","技術の勧告","AI/MLエージェント","Webアプリケーション","モバイルプロジェクト"],"ko":["프로젝트 디자인","초기 프로젝트 개념","완전한 디자인","체계적인 분석","특성 강화","기술 추천","AI/ML 에이전트","웹 애플리케이션","모바일 프로젝트"],"es":["Diseñador de Proyectos","AI/ML","aplicaciones web","aplicaciones móviles","análisis sistemático","planificación estratégica","recomendaciones tecnológicas"],"fr":["Conceleur de Projets","AI/ML","applications web","applications mobiles","analyse systématique","planification stratégique","recommandations technologiques"],"de":["Projekt-Designer","AI/ML","Web-Anwendungen","Mobile-Anwendungen","systematische Analyse","strategische Planung","Technologie-Empfehlungen"],"pt":["designer de projeto","desenvolvimento de projeto","análise de conceitos","recomendações tecnológicas","agentes de IA/ML","aplicações web e móveis","arquitetura de software"],"ru":["дизайнер проекта","разработка проекта","анализ концепций","технологические рекомендации","агенты ИИ/МЛ","веб- и мобильные приложения","архитектура программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مصمم المشروع","تنمية المشروع","تحليل المفاهيم","التوصيات التكنولوجية","عمليات الإنسان والآلة","تطبيقات الويب والجوال","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"AbdullahMalik17","repo":"My_skills","repoPath":"AbdullahMalik17/My_skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-designer","description":"Comprehensive project design and ideation skill for AI/ML and web/mobile applications. Use when users present initial project ideas that need enhancement, architectural guidance, technology stack recommendations, feature expansion, or implementation strategy. Triggers include requests like help me design a [project type], I want to build [concept] but need to flesh out the idea, what features should I add to [project], recommend a tech stack for [idea], or enhance my project concept. Provides structured design thinking, architectural patterns, feature frameworks, and technology recommendations through progressive disclosure of specialized reference materials.","bodyPreview":"# Project Designer\n\n## Overview\n\nTransform initial project concepts into comprehensive, well-architected designs through systematic analysis, feature enhancement, and technology recommendations. This skill guides you through structured ideation, architectural decision-making, and strategic planning for AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Concept Understanding\n\n**Objective**: Thoroughly understand the user''s core idea, goals, and constraints.\n\n**Actions","body":"# Project Designer\n\n## Overview\n\nTransform initial project concepts into comprehensive, well-architected designs through systematic analysis, feature enhancement, and technology recommendations. This skill guides you through structured ideation, architectural decision-making, and strategic planning for AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Concept Understanding\n\n**Objective**: Thoroughly understand the user''s core idea, goals, and constraints.\n\n**Actions**:\n1. **Extract Core Information**:\n   - Project type (AI/ML agent, web app, mobile app)\n   - Primary problem being solved\n   - Target users or personas\n   - Key constraints (budget, timeline, team size, technical expertise)\n\n2. **Identify Gaps**:\n   - Missing requirements or specifications\n   - Unclear objectives or success criteria\n   - Undefined user needs\n\n3. **Ask Clarifying Questions**:\n   Use the AskUserQuestion tool when:\n   - Project scope is ambiguous\n   - Multiple architectural approaches are viable\n   - Technical requirements are unclear\n   - User needs are not fully specified\n\n### Phase 2: Architecture and Technology Guidance\n\n**Objective**: Recommend appropriate architectural patterns and technology stacks based on project requirements.\n\n**Reference Materials**: Load based on project type and needs:\n- **`references/ai-ml-patterns.md`**: For AI/ML agents, RAG systems, conversational AI, ML pipelines\n- **`references/web-app-patterns.md`**: For web/mobile applications, API design, full-stack systems\n- **`references/tech-stack-matrix.md`**: For technology selection across all project types\n\n**Actions**:\n1. Identify project type and match to established architectural patterns\n2. Recommend technology stack based on team expertise, budget, scalability needs\n3. Explain architectural decisions with clear rationale and trade-offs\n\n### Phase 3: Feature Discovery and Enhancement\n\n**Objective**: Expand the initial concept with comprehensive, prioritized features.\n\n**Reference Material**: `references/feature-frameworks.md`\n\n**Actions**:\n1. Apply feature discovery methods (Jobs-to-be-Done, User Story Mapping, Feature Analogies)\n2. Categorize features: Must-Have (MVP), Should-Have (Post-MVP), Could-Have (Future)\n3. Apply prioritization framework (RICE, ICE, Kano model)\n4. Consider enhancement dimensions: capability, UX, integration, intelligence\n\n### Phase 4: Structured Documentation\n\n**Objective**: Produce comprehensive project documentation using standardized templates.\n\n**Asset Templates**: Use appropriate templates based on user needs:\n- **`assets/templates/project-brief.md`**: Complete project specification\n- **`assets/templates/architecture-blueprint.md`**: Detailed technical architecture\n- **`assets/templates/feature-roadmap.md`**: Prioritized feature timeline\n\n### Phase 5: Iterative Refinement\n\n**Objective**: Refine the design based on user feedback and emerging requirements.\n\n**Actions**:\n1. Present recommendations clearly with critical decisions highlighted\n2. Respond to user feedback and adjust recommendations\n3. Provide detailed explanations of recommendations\n4. Start high-level, drill down into specifics as needed\n\n## Usage Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: New Project Ideation\nUser presents initial idea → Understand requirements → Recommend architecture/stack → Enhance features → Generate project-brief.md\n\n### Pattern 2: Existing Project Enhancement\nUser has working system → Understand current state → Apply feature frameworks → Prioritize enhancements → Generate feature-roadmap.md\n\n### Pattern 3: Technology Stack Consultation\nUser needs tech guidance → Clarify requirements → Consult tech-stack-matrix.md → Recommend stack with rationale\n\n### Pattern 4: Architecture Design\nUser needs technical design → Gather requirements → Recommend pattern → Define components → Generate architecture-blueprint.md\n\n## Best Practices\n\n**Communication**:\n- Follow workflow phases sequentially\n- Use progressive disclosure (high-level first, details when needed)\n- Provide concrete, implementable recommendations\n\n**Technical Recommendations**:\n- Balance pragmatism with best practices\n- Consider team capabilities and constraints\n- Provide primary recommendation + alternatives with trade-offs\n\n**Feature Design**:\n- Ground features in user problems and needs\n- Define clear MVP scope\n- Use quantitative prioritization frameworks\n\n## Reference Material Usage\n\n**Load references/ai-ml-patterns.md when**: AI agents, RAG systems, ML pipelines, NLP/CV applications\n\n**Load references/web-app-patterns.md when**: Web/mobile apps, API design, authentication, database patterns\n\n**Load references/tech-stack-matrix.md when**: Technology selection, team/budget considerations, scalability needs\n\n**Load references/feature-frameworks.md when**: Feature ideation, prioritization, user-centric design, roadmap planning\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n**Don''t**:\n- Suggest over-engineered solutions for simple problems\n- Ignore constraints (budget, timeline, expertise)\n- Skip Phase 1 understanding to rush to recommendations\n- Load all references unnecessarily\n- Make assumptions without clarifying\n\n**Do**:\n- Ask clarifying questions when unclear\n- Tailor recommendations to specific context\n- Provide rationale for recommendations\n- Use reference materials to support recommendations\n- Balance comprehensiveness with actionability\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:30:52.414Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI/ML Agents needing systematic project design and technology recommendations through structured ideation and architectural decision-making.","zh":"非常适合需要系统化项目设计和技术推荐的 AI/ML 代理，通过结构化的想法产生和架构决策。","ja":"AI/ML エージェントが体系的なプロジェクト設計と技術の推奨を必要とする場合に最適です。構造化されたアイデア生成とアーキテクチャの意思決定を通じて。","ko":"시스템적인 프로젝트 설계와 기술 추천이 필요한 AI/ML 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 구조화된 아이디어 생성과 아키텍처 의사결정을 통해","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA/ML que necesitan un diseño de proyecto sistemático y recomendaciones tecnológicas a través de una ideación estructurada y una toma de decisiones arquitectónica.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA/ML ayant besoin d''une conception de projet systématique et de recommandations technologiques grâce à une idéation structurée et à une prise de décision architecturale.","de":"Perfekt für AI/ML-Agents, die ein systematisches Projekt-Design und Technologie-Empfehlungen durch strukturierte Ideenfindung und architektonische Entscheidungsfindung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA/ML que necessitam de design de projeto sistemático e recomendações de tecnologia por meio de ideação estruturada e tomada de decisões arquitetônicas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ/МЛ, которым необходим системный дизайн проекта и рекомендации по технологиям посредством структурированного мозгового штурма и архитектурного принятия решений.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي/التعلم الآلي الذين يحتاجون إلى تصميم مشروع منهجي وتوصيات تكنولوجية من خلال الأفكار الهيكلية وصنع القرار المعماري."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform initial project concepts into comprehensive designs through feature enhancement and strategic planning, utilizing systematic analysis and technology recommendations for AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects.","zh":"赋予代理将初始项目概念转化为全面设计的能力，通过特性增强和战略规划，利用系统分析和技术推荐为 AI/ML 代理、Web 应用和移动项目提供服务。","ja":"初期のプロジェクト概念を包括的な設計に変換するためのエージェントを提供します。機能強化と戦略的計画を通じて、AI/ML エージェント、Web アプリケーション、モバイル プロジェクトのための体系的な分析と技術の推奨を利用します。","ko":"초기 프로젝트 개념을 포괄적인 설계로 변환할 수 있는 에이전트를 제공합니다. 기능 강화와 전략적 계획을 통해, AI/ML 에이전트, 웹 애플리케이션, 모바일 프로젝트를 위한 체계적인 분석과 기술 추천을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar los conceptos de proyecto iniciales en diseños comprehensivos a través de la mejora de características y la planificación estratégica, utilizando un análisis sistemático y recomendaciones tecnológicas para agentes de IA/ML, aplicaciones web y proyectos móviles.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer les concepts de projet initiaux en conceptions complètes grâce à l''amélioration des fonctionnalités et à la planification stratégique, en utilisant une analyse systématique et des recommandations technologiques pour les agents IA/ML, les applications Web et les projets mobiles.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, erste Projekt-Konzepte in umfassende Designs durch Features-Verbesserung und strategische Planung umzuwandeln, unter Nutzung systematischer Analyse und Technologie-Empfehlungen für AI/ML-Agents, Web-Anwendungen und mobile Projekte.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar conceitos iniciais de projeto em designs abrangentes por meio do aprimoramento de recursos e planejamento estratégico, utilizando análise sistemática e recomendações de tecnologia para agentes de IA/ML, aplicações web e projetos móveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью превратить первоначальные концепции проекта в комплексные дизайны посредством улучшения функций и стратегического планирования, используя системный анализ и рекомендации по технологиям для агентов ИИ/МЛ, веб-приложений и мобильных проектов.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتحويل المفاهيم الأولية للمشروع إلى تصاميم شاملة من خلال تعزيز الميزات والتخطيط الاستراتيجي، باستخدام التحليل المنهجي والتوصيات التكنولوجية لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي/التعلم الآلي والتطبيقات الويب والمشاريع المتنقلة."},"useCases":{"en":["Systematically analyzing project concepts for comprehensive design","Enhancing features through structured ideation for AI/ML projects","Providing technology recommendations for web and mobile applications"],"zh":["系统地分析项目概念以进行全面设计","通过结构化的想法产生增强 AI/ML 项目的功能","为 Web 和移动应用提供技术推荐"],"ja":["包括的な設計のためのプロジェクト概念の体系的な分析","構造化されたアイデア生成を通じて AI/ML プロジェクトの機能を強化する","Web およびモバイル アプリケーション向けの技術の推奨"],"ko":["포괄적인 설계를 위한 프로젝트 개념의 체계적인 분석","구조화된 아이디어 생성을 통해 AI/ML 프로젝트의 기능을 강화하는 것","웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션을 위한 기술 추천"],"es":["Analizar sistemáticamente los conceptos de proyecto para un diseño comprehensivo","Mejorar las características a través de la ideación estructurada para proyectos de IA/ML","Proporcionar recomendaciones tecnológicas para aplicaciones web y móviles"],"fr":["Analyser systématiquement les concepts de projet pour une conception complète","Améliorer les fonctionnalités grâce à l''idéation structurée pour les projets IA/ML","Fournir des recommandations technologiques pour les applications Web et mobiles"],"de":["Systematisch Projekt-Konzepte für umfassendes Design analysieren","Funktionen durch strukturierte Ideenfindung für AI/ML-Projekte verbessern","Technologie-Empfehlungen für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen bereitstellen"],"pt":["Analisar sistematicamente conceitos de projeto para design abrangente","Aprimorar recursos por meio de ideação estruturada para projetos de IA/ML","Fornecer recomendações de tecnologia para aplicações web e móveis"],"ru":["Систематически анализировать концепции проекта для комплексного дизайна","Улучшать функции посредством структурированного мозгового штурма для проектов ИИ/МЛ","Предоставлять рекомендации по технологиям для веб-приложений и мобильных проектов"],"ar":["تحليل المفاهيم الأولية للمشروع بشكل منهجي لتصميم شامل","تعزيز الميزات من خلال الأفكار الهيكلية لمشاريع الذكاء الاصطناعي/التعلم الآلي","توفير التوصيات التكنولوجية للتطبيقات الويب والمشاريع المتنقلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires thorough understanding of user''s core idea, goals, and constraints","Limited to project design and planning phase"],"zh":["需要对用户的核心思想、目标和约束有彻底的理解","仅限于项目设计和规划阶段"],"ja":["ユーザーの核となるアイデア、目標、制約について包括的な理解が必要","プロジェクト設計および計画段階に限定される"],"ko":["사용자의 핵심 아이디어, 목표, 제약에 대한 완전한 이해가 필요","프로젝트 설계 및 계획 단계에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una comprensión exhaustiva de la idea central, los objetivos y las limitaciones del usuario","Limitado a la fase de diseño y planificación del proyecto"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension approfondie de l''idée centrale, des objectifs et des contraintes de l''utilisateur","Limité à la phase de conception et de planification du projet"],"de":["Benötigt ein umfassendes Verständnis der Kernidee, Ziele und Einschränkungen des Benutzers","Begrenzt auf die Projekt-Design- und Planungsphase"],"pt":["Exige uma compreensão aprofundada da ideia central do usuário, metas e restrições","Limitado à fase de design e planejamento do projeto"],"ru":["Требует глубокого понимания основной идеи пользователя, целей и ограничений","Ограничен фазой дизайна и планирования проекта"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا متعمقًا لفكرة المستخدم الأساسية والأهداف والقيود","محدود بمرحلة التصميم والتخطيط للمشروع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
