项目概念转化为成熟的设计","ja":"プロジェクトデザイナーは体系的な分析と技術の推奨を通じて、開発者がプロジェクトの概念を成熟した設計に変換することをサポート","ko":"프로젝트 디자이너는 체계적인 분석과 기술 추천을 통해 개발자가 프로젝트 개념을 완성된 디자인으로 변환하도록 지원","es":"El diseñador de proyectos transforma conceptos iniciales en diseños integrales a través del análisis sistemático y la planificación estratégica.","fr":"La conception de projet transforme les concepts initiaux en conceptions complètes grâce à l''analyse systématique et à la planification stratégique.","de":"Der Projekt-Designer wandelt anfängliche Konzepte in umfassende Designs durch systematische Analyse und strategische Planung.","pt":"O projeto-designer é uma habilidade que ajuda a transformar conceitos iniciais de projeto em designs abrangentes e bem arquitetados","ru":"Проект-дизайнер - это навык, который помогает преобразовать первоначальные концепции проекта в комплексные, хорошо спроектированные дизайны","ar":"مشروع التصميم هو مهارة تساعد على تحويل المفاهيم الأولية للمشروع إلى تصاميم شاملة ومصممة جيدًا","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["系统分析","功能增强","技术推荐","结构化理念","架构决策","战略规划"],"ja":["体系的な分析","機能の強化","技術の推奨","構造化されたアイデア","アーキテクチャの決定","戦略的計画"],"ko":["체계적인 분석","기능 강화","기술 추천","구조화된 아이디어","아키텍처 결정","전략적 계획"],"es":["Análisis sistemático","Planificación estratégica","Diseño de proyectos integrales","Mejora de características","Recomendaciones tecnológicas"],"fr":["Analyse systématique","Planification stratégique","Conception de projet complète","Amélioration des fonctionnalités","Recommandations technologiques"],"de":["Systematische Analyse","Strategische Planung","Umfassendes Projektdesign","Funktionsverbesserung","Technologische Empfehlungen"],"pt":["Análise sistemática de conceitos de projeto","Melhoria de recursos e recomendações de tecnologia","Planejamento estratégico para agentes de IA/ML, aplicações web e móveis","Desenvolvimento de designs abrangentes e bem arquitetados","Tomada de decisões arquitetônicas informadas"],"ru":["Системный анализ концепций проекта","Улучшение функций и рекомендации по технологиям","Стратегическое планирование для агентов ИИ/МЛ, веб- и мобильных приложений","Разработка комплексных и хорошо спроектированных дизайнов","Информированное архитектурное решение"],"ar":["تحليل منهجي لمفاهيم المشروع","تحسين الميزات وتوصيات التكنولوجيا","التخطيط الاستراتيجي لعمليات الذكاء الاصطناعي والتعلم الآلي والتطبيقات الويب والجوال","إنشاء تصاميم شاملة ومصممة جيدًا","اتخاذ قرارات معمارية مدروسة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["项目设计","系统分析","功能增强","技术推荐","结构化理念","架构决策","战略规划","AI/ML 项目","web 应用程序","移动项目"],"ja":["プロジェクト設計","体系的な分析","機能の強化","技術の推奨","構造化されたアイデア","アーキテクチャの決定","戦略的計画","AI/ML プロジェクト","web アプリケーション","モバイル プロジェクト"],"ko":["프로젝트 디자인","체계적인 분석","기능 강화","기술 추천","구조화된 아이디어","아키텍처 결정","전략적 계획","AI/ML 프로젝트","web 애플리케이션","모바일 프로젝트"],"es":["diseñador de proyectos","análisis sistemático","planificación estratégica","diseño de proyectos integrales","desarrollo de software","IA","ML"],"fr":["conception de projet","analyse systématique","planification stratégique","conception de projet complète","développement de logiciels","IA","ML"],"de":["Projekt-Designer","systematische Analyse","strategische Planung","umfassendes Projektdesign","Software-Entwicklung","KI","ML"],"pt":["projeto-designer","desenvolvimento de projetos","análise de conceitos","melhoria de recursos","recomendações de tecnologia","planejamento estratégico","agentes de IA/ML","aplicações web e móveis"],"ru":["проект-дизайнер","разработка проектов","анализ концепций","улучшение функций","рекомендации по технологиям","стратегическое планирование","агенты ИИ/МЛ","веб- и мобильные приложения"],"ar":["مشروع التصميم","تطوير المشاريع","تحليل المفاهيم","تحسين الميزات","توصيات التكنولوجيا","التخطيط الاستراتيجي","عمليات الذكاء الاصطناعي والتعلم الآلي","التطبيقات الويب والجوال"]}},"owner":"AbdullahMalik17","repo":"Hacathan_5","repoPath":"AbdullahMalik17/Hacathan_5","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-designer","description":"Comprehensive project design and ideation skill for AI/ML and web/mobile applications. Use when users present initial project ideas that need enhancement, architectural guidance, technology stack recommendations, feature expansion, or implementation strategy. Triggers include requests like help me design a [project type], I want to build [concept] but need to flesh out the idea, what features should I add to [project], recommend a tech stack for [idea], or enhance my project concept. Provides structured design thinking, architectural patterns, feature frameworks, and technology recommendations through progressive disclosure of specialized reference materials.","bodyPreview":"# Project Designer\n\n## Overview\n\nTransform initial project concepts into comprehensive, well-architected designs through systematic analysis, feature enhancement, and technology recommendations. This skill guides you through structured ideation, architectural decision-making, and strategic planning for AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Concept Understanding\n\n**Objective**: Thoroughly understand the user''s core idea, goals, and constraints.\n\n**Actions","body":"# Project Designer\n\n## Overview\n\nTransform initial project concepts into comprehensive, well-architected designs through systematic analysis, feature enhancement, and technology recommendations. This skill guides you through structured ideation, architectural decision-making, and strategic planning for AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Concept Understanding\n\n**Objective**: Thoroughly understand the user''s core idea, goals, and constraints.\n\n**Actions**:\n1. **Extract Core Information**:\n   - Project type (AI/ML agent, web app, mobile app)\n   - Primary problem being solved\n   - Target users or personas\n   - Key constraints (budget, timeline, team size, technical expertise)\n\n2. **Identify Gaps**:\n   - Missing requirements or specifications\n   - Unclear objectives or success criteria\n   - Undefined user needs\n\n3. **Ask Clarifying Questions**:\n   Use the AskUserQuestion tool when:\n   - Project scope is ambiguous\n   - Multiple architectural approaches are viable\n   - Technical requirements are unclear\n   - User needs are not fully specified\n\n### Phase 2: Architecture and Technology Guidance\n\n**Objective**: Recommend appropriate architectural patterns and technology stacks based on project requirements.\n\n**Reference Materials**: Load based on project type and needs:\n- **`references/ai-ml-patterns.md`**: For AI/ML agents, RAG systems, conversational AI, ML pipelines\n- **`references/web-app-patterns.md`**: For web/mobile applications, API design, full-stack systems\n- **`references/tech-stack-matrix.md`**: For technology selection across all project types\n\n**Actions**:\n1. Identify project type and match to established architectural patterns\n2. Recommend technology stack based on team expertise, budget, scalability needs\n3. Explain architectural decisions with clear rationale and trade-offs\n\n### Phase 3: Feature Discovery and Enhancement\n\n**Objective**: Expand the initial concept with comprehensive, prioritized features.\n\n**Reference Material**: `references/feature-frameworks.md`\n\n**Actions**:\n1. Apply feature discovery methods (Jobs-to-be-Done, User Story Mapping, Feature Analogies)\n2. Categorize features: Must-Have (MVP), Should-Have (Post-MVP), Could-Have (Future)\n3. Apply prioritization framework (RICE, ICE, Kano model)\n4. Consider enhancement dimensions: capability, UX, integration, intelligence\n\n### Phase 4: Structured Documentation\n\n**Objective**: Produce comprehensive project documentation using standardized templates.\n\n**Asset Templates**: Use appropriate templates based on user needs:\n- **`assets/templates/project-brief.md`**: Complete project specification\n- **`assets/templates/architecture-blueprint.md`**: Detailed technical architecture\n- **`assets/templates/feature-roadmap.md`**: Prioritized feature timeline\n\n### Phase 5: Iterative Refinement\n\n**Objective**: Refine the design based on user feedback and emerging requirements.\n\n**Actions**:\n1. Present recommendations clearly with critical decisions highlighted\n2. Respond to user feedback and adjust recommendations\n3. Provide detailed explanations of recommendations\n4. Start high-level, drill down into specifics as needed\n\n## Usage Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: New Project Ideation\nUser presents initial idea → Understand requirements → Recommend architecture/stack → Enhance features → Generate project-brief.md\n\n### Pattern 2: Existing Project Enhancement\nUser has working system → Understand current state → Apply feature frameworks → Prioritize enhancements → Generate feature-roadmap.md\n\n### Pattern 3: Technology Stack Consultation\nUser needs tech guidance → Clarify requirements → Consult tech-stack-matrix.md → Recommend stack with rationale\n\n### Pattern 4: Architecture Design\nUser needs technical design → Gather requirements → Recommend pattern → Define components → Generate architecture-blueprint.md\n\n## Best Practices\n\n**Communication**:\n- Follow workflow phases sequentially\n- Use progressive disclosure (high-level first, details when needed)\n- Provide concrete, implementable recommendations\n\n**Technical Recommendations**:\n- Balance pragmatism with best practices\n- Consider team capabilities and constraints\n- Provide primary recommendation + alternatives with trade-offs\n\n**Feature Design**:\n- Ground features in user problems and needs\n- Define clear MVP scope\n- Use quantitative prioritization frameworks\n\n## Reference Material Usage\n\n**Load references/ai-ml-patterns.md when**: AI agents, RAG systems, ML pipelines, NLP/CV applications\n\n**Load references/web-app-patterns.md when**: Web/mobile apps, API design, authentication, database patterns\n\n**Load references/tech-stack-matrix.md when**: Technology selection, team/budget considerations, scalability needs\n\n**Load references/feature-frameworks.md when**: Feature ideation, prioritization, user-centric design, roadmap planning\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n**Don''t**:\n- Suggest over-engineered solutions for simple problems\n- Ignore constraints (budget, timeline, expertise)\n- Skip Phase 1 understanding to rush to recommendations\n- Load all references unnecessarily\n- Make assumptions without clarifying\n\n**Do**:\n- Ask clarifying questions when unclear\n- Tailor recommendations to specific context\n- Provide rationale for recommendations\n- Use reference materials to support recommendations\n- Balance comprehensiveness with actionability\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:30:59.987Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI/ML Agents needing structured project planning and architectural decision-making capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化项目规划和架构决策能力的AI/ML代理。","ja":"AI/MLエージェントが構造化されたプロジェクト計画とアーキテクチャの意思決定能力を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"구조화된 프로젝트 계획 및 아키텍처 의사 결정 능력이 필요한 AI/ML 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA/ML que necesitan una planificación de proyectos estructurada y capacidades de toma de decisiones arquitectónicas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA/ML nécessitant une planification de projet structurée et des capacités de prise de décision architecturale.","de":"Perfekt für AI/ML-Agents, die eine strukturierte Projektplanung und architektonische Entscheidungskapazitäten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA/ML que necessitam de planejamento de projetos estruturado e capacidades de tomada de decisões arquitetônicas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ/МЛ, которым необходимы структурированное планирование проектов и возможности принятия архитектурных решений.","ar":"مثالي ل와كلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي/التعلم الالي الذين يحتاجون إلى تخطيط مشروع منظم وقدرات اتخاذ قرارات هندسية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform initial concepts into comprehensive designs through systematic analysis, feature enhancement, and technology recommendations, utilizing strategic planning for AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects.","zh":"使代理能够通过系统分析、功能增强和技术推荐，利用AI/ML代理、Web应用程序和移动项目的战略规划，将初始概念转化为全面设计。","ja":"エージェントが初期の概念を、体系的な分析、機能の強化、技術の推奨を通じて、AI/MLエージェント、Webアプリケーション、モバイルプロジェクトの戦略的計画を利用して包括的な設計に変換できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 초기 개념을 체계적인 분석, 기능 강화 및 기술 추천을 통해 AI/ML 에이전트, 웹 애플리케이션 및 모바일 프로젝트의 전략적 계획을 활용하여 포괄적인 설계로 변환할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar conceptos iniciales en diseños completos a través de un análisis sistemático, mejora de características y recomendaciones tecnológicas, utilizando la planificación estratégica para agentes de IA/ML, aplicaciones web y proyectos móviles.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer les concepts initiaux en conceptions complètes grâce à une analyse systématique, une amélioration des fonctionnalités et des recommandations technologiques, en utilisant la planification stratégique pour les agents IA/ML, les applications Web et les projets mobiles.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, erste Konzepte in umfassende Designs durch systematische Analyse, Funktionsverbesserung und Technologieempfehlungen umzuwandeln, unter Verwendung der strategischen Planung für AI/ML-Agents, Webanwendungen und Mobile-Projekte.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar conceitos iniciais em projetos abrangentes por meio de análise sistemática, melhoria de recursos e recomendações de tecnologia, utilizando planejamento estratégico para agentes de IA/ML, aplicações web e projetos móveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью превратить первоначальные концепции в полноценные проекты посредством систематического анализа, улучшения функций и технологических рекомендаций, используя стратегическое планирование для агентов ИИ/МЛ, веб-приложений и мобильных проектов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحويل المفاهيم الأولية إلى تصاميم شاملة من خلال التحليل المنهجي وتحسين الميزات والتوصيات التكنولوجية، باستخدام التخطيط الاستراتيجي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي/التعلم الالي والتطبيقات الويب والمشاريع المتنقلة"},"useCases":{"en":["Systematically analyzing project concepts for well-architected designs","Generating feature enhancements and technology recommendations for AI/ML projects","Creating strategic plans for web and mobile applications"],"zh":["系统地分析项目概念以获得良好的架构设计","为AI/ML项目生成功能增强和技术推荐","为Web和移动应用程序创建战略计划"],"ja":["プロジェクトの概念を体系的に分析して、よく構造化された設計を得る","AI/MLプロジェクトの機能の強化と技術の推奨を生成する","Webおよびモバイルアプリケーションの戦略的計画を作成する"],"ko":["프로젝트 개념을 체계적으로 분석하여 잘 구조화된 설계를 얻는 것","AI/ML 프로젝트의 기능 강화 및 기술 추천을 생성하는 것","웹 및 모바일 애플리케이션의 전략적 계획을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Analizar sistemáticamente los conceptos de proyecto para diseños bien arquitecturados","Generar mejoras de características y recomendaciones tecnológicas para proyectos de IA/ML","Crear planes estratégicos para aplicaciones web y móviles"],"fr":["Analyser systématiquement les concepts de projet pour des conceptions bien architecturées","Générer des améliorations de fonctionnalités et des recommandations technologiques pour les projets IA/ML","Créer des plans stratégiques pour les applications Web et mobiles"],"de":["Systematische Analyse von Projektkonzepten für gut architektierte Designs","Generierung von Funktionsverbesserungen und Technologieempfehlungen für AI/ML-Projekte","Erstellung von strategischen Plänen für Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Analisar sistematicamente conceitos de projeto para obtenção de projetos bem arquitetados","Gerar melhorias de recursos e recomendações de tecnologia para projetos de IA/ML","Criar planos estratégicos para aplicações web e móveis"],"ru":["Систематически анализировать концепции проекта для получения хорошо спроектированных проектов","Генерировать улучшения функций и технологические рекомендации для проектов ИИ/МЛ","Создавать стратегические планы для веб-приложений и мобильных проектов"],"ar":["تحليل المفاهيم الأولية للمشروع بشكل منهجي للحصول على تصاميم محكمة","generando تحسينات للميزات والتوصيات التكنولوجية للمشاريع الذكاء الاصطناعي/التعلم الالي","إنشاء خطط استراتيجية للتطبيقات الويب والمشاريع المتنقلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires thorough understanding of user''s core idea, goals, and constraints","Limited to project design and planning phase"],"zh":["需要对用户的核心思想、目标和约束有深入的理解","仅限于项目设计和规划阶段"],"ja":["ユーザーの核となるアイデア、目標、制約について包括的な理解が必要","プロジェクト設計および計画段階のみに限定される"],"ko":["사용자의 핵심 아이디어, 목표 및 제약에 대한 포괄적인 이해가 필요함","프로젝트 설계 및 계획 단계에만 محدود됨"],"es":["Requiere una comprensión exhaustiva de la idea principal, los objetivos y las limitaciones del usuario","Limitado a la fase de diseño y planificación del proyecto"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension approfondie de l''idée principale, des objectifs et des contraintes de l''utilisateur","Limité à la phase de conception et de planification du projet"],"de":["Benötigt ein gründliches Verständnis der Kernidee, Ziele und Einschränkungen des Benutzers","Begrenzt auf die Phase der Projektdesign- und Planung"],"pt":["Exige uma compreensão aprofundada da ideia central, metas e restrições do usuário","Limitado à fase de planejamento e design do projeto"],"ru":["Требует глубокого понимания основной идеи, целей и ограничений пользователя","Ограничен фазой планирования и проектирования проекта"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا عميقًا لفكرة المستخدم الأساسية وأهدافه وقيوده","محدود بمرحلة تخطيط وتصميم المشروع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
