andations technologiques personnalisées","Conceptions complètes et bien structurées"],"de":["Systematische Analyse von anfänglichen Konzepten","Informierte architektonische Entscheidungen","Strategische Planung für AI/ML-Agenten und Web- und Mobile-Anwendungen","Maßgeschneiderte Technologie-Empfehlungen","Umfassende und gut strukturierte Designs"],"pt":["Ideação estruturada","Tomada de decisões arquiteturais","Planejamento estratégico","Desenvolvimento de soluções personalizadas","Análise de requisitos","Recomendações de tecnologia"],"ru":["Структурированная идеация","Архитектурное решение","Стратегическое планирование","Разработка индивидуальных решений","Анализ требований","Технологические рекомендации"],"ar":["الفكرة المنظمة","اتخاذ القرارات المعمارية","التخطيط الاستراتيجي","تطوير حلول مخصصة","تحليل المتطلبات","توصيات التكنولوجيا"]},"keywords":{"zh":["项目设计","系统分析","功能增强","技术推荐","AI/ML 项目","Web 应用程序","移动项目"],"ja":["プロジェクト設計","体系的な分析","機能強化","技術勧告","AI/ML プロジェクト","Web アプリケーション","モバイル プロジェクト"],"ko":["프로젝트 디자인","체계적인 분석","기능 강화","기술 권고","AI/ML 프로젝트","웹 애플리케이션","모바일 프로젝트"],"es":["diseñador de proyectos","desarrollo de software","arquitectura de sistemas","planificación estratégica","análisis de requerimientos","diseño de sistemas","tecnologías de la información","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["conception de projets","développement de logiciels","architecture de systèmes","planification stratégique","analyse des exigences","conception de systèmes","technologies de l''information","développement d''applications"],"de":["Projekt-Designer","Software-Entwicklung","Systemarchitektur","strategische Planung","Anforderungsanalyse","Systemdesign","Informationstechnologie","Anwendungs-Entwicklung"],"pt":["project-designer","desenvolvimento de projetos","arquitetura de soluções","ideação estruturada","tomada de decisões arquiteturais","planejamento estratégico","desenvolvimento de soluções personalizadas","análise de requisitos","recomendações de tecnologia"],"ru":["дизайнер проектов","разработка проектов","архитектура решений","структурированная идеация","архитектурное решение","стратегическое планирование","разработка индивидуальных решений","анализ требований","технологические рекомендации"],"ar":["مصمم المشروع","تطوير المشاريع","هندسة الحلول","الفكرة المنظمة","اتخاذ القرارات المعمارية","التخطيط الاستراتيجي","تطوير حلول مخصصة","تحليل المتطلبات","توصيات التكنولوجيا"]}},"owner":"AbdullahMalik17","repo":"Projects_of_AI_400","repoPath":"AbdullahMalik17/Projects_of_AI_400","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-designer","description":"Comprehensive project design and ideation skill for AI/ML and web/mobile applications. Use when users present initial project ideas that need enhancement, architectural guidance, technology stack recommendations, feature expansion, or implementation strategy. Triggers include requests like help me design a [project type], I want to build [concept] but need to flesh out the idea, what features should I add to [project], recommend a tech stack for [idea], or enhance my project concept. Provides structured design thinking, architectural patterns, feature frameworks, and technology recommendations through progressive disclosure of specialized reference materials.","bodyPreview":"# Project Designer\n\n## Overview\n\nTransform initial project concepts into comprehensive, well-architected designs through systematic analysis, feature enhancement, and technology recommendations. This skill guides you through structured ideation, architectural decision-making, and strategic planning for AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Concept Understanding\n\n**Objective**: Thoroughly understand the user''s core idea, goals, and constraints.\n\n**Actions","body":"# Project Designer\n\n## Overview\n\nTransform initial project concepts into comprehensive, well-architected designs through systematic analysis, feature enhancement, and technology recommendations. This skill guides you through structured ideation, architectural decision-making, and strategic planning for AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Phase 1: Concept Understanding\n\n**Objective**: Thoroughly understand the user''s core idea, goals, and constraints.\n\n**Actions**:\n1. **Extract Core Information**:\n   - Project type (AI/ML agent, web app, mobile app)\n   - Primary problem being solved\n   - Target users or personas\n   - Key constraints (budget, timeline, team size, technical expertise)\n\n2. **Identify Gaps**:\n   - Missing requirements or specifications\n   - Unclear objectives or success criteria\n   - Undefined user needs\n\n3. **Ask Clarifying Questions**:\n   Use the AskUserQuestion tool when:\n   - Project scope is ambiguous\n   - Multiple architectural approaches are viable\n   - Technical requirements are unclear\n   - User needs are not fully specified\n\n### Phase 2: Architecture and Technology Guidance\n\n**Objective**: Recommend appropriate architectural patterns and technology stacks based on project requirements.\n\n**Reference Materials**: Load based on project type and needs:\n- **`references/ai-ml-patterns.md`**: For AI/ML agents, RAG systems, conversational AI, ML pipelines\n- **`references/web-app-patterns.md`**: For web/mobile applications, API design, full-stack systems\n- **`references/tech-stack-matrix.md`**: For technology selection across all project types\n\n**Actions**:\n1. Identify project type and match to established architectural patterns\n2. Recommend technology stack based on team expertise, budget, scalability needs\n3. Explain architectural decisions with clear rationale and trade-offs\n\n### Phase 3: Feature Discovery and Enhancement\n\n**Objective**: Expand the initial concept with comprehensive, prioritized features.\n\n**Reference Material**: `references/feature-frameworks.md`\n\n**Actions**:\n1. Apply feature discovery methods (Jobs-to-be-Done, User Story Mapping, Feature Analogies)\n2. Categorize features: Must-Have (MVP), Should-Have (Post-MVP), Could-Have (Future)\n3. Apply prioritization framework (RICE, ICE, Kano model)\n4. Consider enhancement dimensions: capability, UX, integration, intelligence\n\n### Phase 4: Structured Documentation\n\n**Objective**: Produce comprehensive project documentation using standardized templates.\n\n**Asset Templates**: Use appropriate templates based on user needs:\n- **`assets/templates/project-brief.md`**: Complete project specification\n- **`assets/templates/architecture-blueprint.md`**: Detailed technical architecture\n- **`assets/templates/feature-roadmap.md`**: Prioritized feature timeline\n\n### Phase 5: Iterative Refinement\n\n**Objective**: Refine the design based on user feedback and emerging requirements.\n\n**Actions**:\n1. Present recommendations clearly with critical decisions highlighted\n2. Respond to user feedback and adjust recommendations\n3. Provide detailed explanations of recommendations\n4. Start high-level, drill down into specifics as needed\n\n## Usage Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: New Project Ideation\nUser presents initial idea → Understand requirements → Recommend architecture/stack → Enhance features → Generate project-brief.md\n\n### Pattern 2: Existing Project Enhancement\nUser has working system → Understand current state → Apply feature frameworks → Prioritize enhancements → Generate feature-roadmap.md\n\n### Pattern 3: Technology Stack Consultation\nUser needs tech guidance → Clarify requirements → Consult tech-stack-matrix.md → Recommend stack with rationale\n\n### Pattern 4: Architecture Design\nUser needs technical design → Gather requirements → Recommend pattern → Define components → Generate architecture-blueprint.md\n\n## Best Practices\n\n**Communication**:\n- Follow workflow phases sequentially\n- Use progressive disclosure (high-level first, details when needed)\n- Provide concrete, implementable recommendations\n\n**Technical Recommendations**:\n- Balance pragmatism with best practices\n- Consider team capabilities and constraints\n- Provide primary recommendation + alternatives with trade-offs\n\n**Feature Design**:\n- Ground features in user problems and needs\n- Define clear MVP scope\n- Use quantitative prioritization frameworks\n\n## Reference Material Usage\n\n**Load references/ai-ml-patterns.md when**: AI agents, RAG systems, ML pipelines, NLP/CV applications\n\n**Load references/web-app-patterns.md when**: Web/mobile apps, API design, authentication, database patterns\n\n**Load references/tech-stack-matrix.md when**: Technology selection, team/budget considerations, scalability needs\n\n**Load references/feature-frameworks.md when**: Feature ideation, prioritization, user-centric design, roadmap planning\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n**Don''t**:\n- Suggest over-engineered solutions for simple problems\n- Ignore constraints (budget, timeline, expertise)\n- Skip Phase 1 understanding to rush to recommendations\n- Load all references unnecessarily\n- Make assumptions without clarifying\n\n**Do**:\n- Ask clarifying questions when unclear\n- Tailor recommendations to specific context\n- Provide rationale for recommendations\n- Use reference materials to support recommendations\n- Balance comprehensiveness with actionability\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:31:17.760Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Architect Agents needing to transform conceptual ideas into fully-realized technical designs.","zh":"适合需要将概念性想法转化为完全实现的技术设计的 AI 架构代理。","ja":"AI アーキテクト エージェントが概念的なアイデアを完全に実現された技術設計に変換する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"概念적 아이디어를 완전히 구현된 기술 설계로 변환해야 하는 AI 아키텍트 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfect for AI Architect Agents needing to transform conceptual ideas into fully-realized technical designs.","fr":"Perfect for AI Architect Agents needing to transform conceptual ideas into fully-realized technical designs.","de":"Perfect for AI Architect Agents needing to transform conceptual ideas into fully-realized technical designs.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Arquiteto de IA que precisam transformar ideias conceituais em projetos técnicos completamente realizados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-архитекторов ИИ, которым необходимо превратить концептуальные идеи в полностью реализованные технические проекты.","ar":"مثالي لعمال وكلاء الهندسة المعمارية بالذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى تحويل الأفكار المفاهيمية إلى تصاميم تقنية كاملة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables systematic project analysis and architectural decision-making through structured ideation workflows. Provides comprehensive technology recommendations and feature enhancement strategies for AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects.","zh":"通过结构化的头脑风暴工作流程实现系统的项目分析和架构决策。为 AI/ML 代理、Web 应用程序和移动项目提供全面技术推荐和功能增强策略。","ja":"構造化されたアイデア生成ワークフローを通じて、体系的なプロジェクト分析とアーキテクチャの意思決定を可能にします。AI/ML エージェント、Web アプリケーション、モバイル プロジェクト向けの包括的な技術推奨と機能強化戦略を提供します。","ko":"구조화된 아이디어 생성 워크플로우를 통해 체계적인 프로젝트 분석 및 아키텍처 의사 결정이 가능합니다. AI/ML 에이전트, 웹 애플리케이션, 모바일 프로젝트를 위한 포괄적인 기술 추천 및 기능 강화 전략을 제공합니다.","es":"Enables systematic project analysis and architectural decision-making through structured ideation workflows. Provides comprehensive technology recommendations and feature enhancement strategies for AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects.","fr":"Enables systematic project analysis and architectural decision-making through structured ideation workflows. Provides comprehensive technology recommendations and feature enhancement strategies for AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects.","de":"Enables systematic project analysis and architectural decision-making through structured ideation workflows. Provides comprehensive technology recommendations and feature enhancement strategies for AI/ML agents, web applications, and mobile projects.","pt":"Permite análise sistemática de projetos e tomada de decisões arquiteturais por meio de fluxos de trabalho de ideação estruturada. 