tomatischer Zusammenfassungen"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de documentos de referência externa","Indexação para uso no RAG","Busca rápida e eficaz","Criação de resumo automático","Validação de arquivos"],"ru":["Управление внешними документами ссылок","Индексация для использования в RAG","Быстрый и эффективный поиск","Автоматическое создание резюме","Валидация файлов"],"ar":["إدارة مستندات المراجع الخارجية","التفهرس لاستخدامها في RAG","البحث السريع والفعال","إنشاء ملخص تلقائي","التحقق من صحة الملفات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Reference Indexer","外部参考文档","RAG","PDF","Word","文档管理","索引","搜索"],"ja":["Reference Indexer","外部参照ドキュメント","RAG","PDF","Word","ドキュメント管理","索引","検索"],"ko":["참조 인덱서","외부 참조 문서","RAG","PDF","Word","문서 관리","인덱스","검색"],"es":["índice de referencia","desarrollo de software","búsqueda en tiempo real","gestión de documentos","indexación de documentos","RAG","desarrolladores"],"fr":["indexeur de référence","développement de logiciels","recherche en temps réel","gestion de documents","indexation de documents","RAG","développeurs"],"de":["Referenz-Indexer","Software-Entwicklung","Echtzeitsuche","Dokumentenverwaltung","Dokumentenindexierung","RAG","Entwickler"],"pt":["reference indexer","gerenciamento de documentos","indexação de referências","busca em tempo real","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["система индексации ссылок","управление документами","индексация ссылок","поиск в режиме реального времени","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["مؤشر المراجع","إدارة المستندات","التفهرس المراجع","البحث في الوقت الفعلي","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"arbgjr","repo":"satra","repoPath":"arbgjr/satra","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"reference-indexer","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Reference Indexer Skill\n\n## Proposito\n\nEsta skill gerencia documentos de referencia externa, indexando-os para uso no RAG.\n\n## Comandos\n\n### /ref-add {path}\n\nAdiciona documento ao indice de referencias:\n\n```bash\n/ref-add .agentic_sdlc/references/legal/lei-13775-2018.pdf\n```\n\nAcoes:\n1. Valida o arquivo\n2. Extrai texto (se PDF/Word)\n3. Cria resumo automatico\n4. Adiciona ao corpus RAG\n5. Atualiza indice\n\n### /ref-search {query}\n\nBusca nos documentos de referencia:\n\n```bash\n/ref-search \"prazo de a","body":"# Reference Indexer Skill\n\n## Proposito\n\nEsta skill gerencia documentos de referencia externa, indexando-os para uso no RAG.\n\n## Comandos\n\n### /ref-add {path}\n\nAdiciona documento ao indice de referencias:\n\n```bash\n/ref-add .agentic_sdlc/references/legal/lei-13775-2018.pdf\n```\n\nAcoes:\n1. Valida o arquivo\n2. Extrai texto (se PDF/Word)\n3. Cria resumo automatico\n4. Adiciona ao corpus RAG\n5. Atualiza indice\n\n### /ref-search {query}\n\nBusca nos documentos de referencia:\n\n```bash\n/ref-search \"prazo de aceite duplicata\"\n```\n\nRetorna:\n- Documentos relevantes\n- Trechos com contexto\n- Score de relevancia\n\n### /ref-list\n\nLista todos os documentos indexados:\n\n```bash\n/ref-list\n```\n\nMostra:\n- Documentos por categoria\n- Status de indexacao\n- Data de adicao\n\n### /ref-remove {path}\n\nRemove documento do indice:\n\n```bash\n/ref-remove .agentic_sdlc/references/legal/documento-antigo.pdf\n```\n\n## Formatos Suportados\n\n| Formato | Extensao | Metodo de Extracao |\n|---------|----------|-------------------|\n| PDF | .pdf | pdftotext / PyPDF2 |\n| Word | .docx | python-docx |\n| Markdown | .md | Direto |\n| Texto | .txt | Direto |\n| HTML | .html | BeautifulSoup |\n\n## Estrutura de Referencias\n\n```\n.agentic_sdlc/references/\n├── legal/              # Leis, regulamentos, normas\n├── technical/          # RFCs, especificacoes tecnicas\n├── business/           # Regras de negocio, manuais\n├── internal/           # Documentos internos\n└── _index.yml          # Indice de documentos\n```\n\n## Indice de Documentos\n\nArquivo `_index.yml`:\n\n```yaml\nindex:\n  version: 1\n  updated_at: \"2026-01-12T...\"\n\ndocuments:\n  - id: \"ref-001\"\n    path: \"legal/lei-13775-2018.pdf\"\n    title: \"Lei 13.775/2018 - Duplicatas Eletrônicas\"\n    category: legal\n    added_at: \"2026-01-12T...\"\n    indexed: true\n    summary: \"Lei que regulamenta as duplicatas escriturais...\"\n    keywords:\n      - duplicata\n      - escritural\n      - eletronica\n    page_count: 5\n\n  - id: \"ref-002\"\n    path: \"technical/icp-brasil.pdf\"\n    title: \"Padrões ICP-Brasil\"\n    category: technical\n    added_at: \"2026-01-12T...\"\n    indexed: true\n```\n\n## Extracao de Texto\n\n### PDF\n\n```bash\n# Usando pdftotext (poppler-utils)\npdftotext -layout input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Usando Python\npython3 << ''EOF''\nimport PyPDF2\n\nwith open(''input.pdf'', ''rb'') as f:\n    reader = PyPDF2.PdfReader(f)\n    text = ''''\n    for page in reader.pages:\n        text += page.extract_text() + ''\\n''\n    print(text)\nEOF\n```\n\n### Word (docx)\n\n```python\nfrom docx import Document\n\ndoc = Document(''input.docx'')\ntext = ''\\n''.join([p.text for p in doc.paragraphs])\nprint(text)\n```\n\n## Integracao com RAG\n\nDocumentos indexados sao adicionados ao corpus RAG:\n\n```yaml\ncorpus_entry:\n  id: \"ref-001\"\n  source: \"references/legal/lei-13775-2018.pdf\"\n  type: \"reference\"\n  category: \"legal\"\n  content: \"{texto extraido}\"\n  embeddings: [...]  # Gerado pelo RAG\n  metadata:\n    title: \"Lei 13.775/2018\"\n    page: 1\n    section: \"Art. 1\"\n```\n\n## Workflow de Indexacao\n\n```yaml\nindexing_workflow:\n  1_validate:\n    - Verificar formato suportado\n    - Verificar tamanho (max 50MB)\n    - Verificar permissoes\n\n  2_extract:\n    - Extrair texto do documento\n    - Limpar formatacao\n    - Dividir em chunks\n\n  3_analyze:\n    - Gerar resumo automatico\n    - Extrair keywords\n    - Classificar categoria\n\n  4_index:\n    - Adicionar ao corpus RAG\n    - Gerar embeddings\n    - Atualizar indice\n\n  5_verify:\n    - Testar busca\n    - Verificar qualidade\n```\n\n## Configuracao\n\nNo `settings.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"memory\": {\n    \"rag_corpus\": \".agentic_sdlc/corpus\",\n    \"max_document_size_mb\": 50,\n    \"chunk_size\": 1000,\n    \"chunk_overlap\": 200\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Boas Praticas\n\n1. **Nomeie arquivos descritivamente**: `lei-13775-2018-duplicatas.pdf`\n2. **Organize por categoria**: legal, technical, business\n3. **Mantenha versoes**: Nao sobrescreva, versione\n4. **Documente a fonte**: Adicione de onde veio\n5. **Resuma docs longos**: Crie resumos para PDFs grandes\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### PDF nao extrai texto\n\nAlguns PDFs sao imagens escaneadas. Use OCR:\n\n```bash\nocrmypdf input.pdf output.pdf\npdftotext output.pdf -\n```\n\n### Documento muito grande\n\nDivida em partes menores ou aumente `max_document_size_mb`.\n\n### Encoding incorreto\n\nForce UTF-8 na extracao:\n\n```bash\npdftotext -enc UTF-8 input.pdf output.txt\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:31:31.409Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT that require advanced document indexing and search capabilities for efficient information retrieval.","zh":"适用于 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT 等需要高级文档索引和搜索功能的 AI 代理，以实现高效的信息检索。","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの、高度な文書索引と検索機能を必要とする AI エージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 문서 색인 및 검색 기능을 필요로 하는 Claude Code 및 AutoGPT와 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que requieren capacidades avanzadas de indexación y búsqueda de documentos para una recuperación de información eficiente.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT qui nécessitent des capacités de indexation et de recherche de documents avancées pour une récupération d''informations efficace.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die erweiterte Dokumenten-Indexierung- und Suchfunktionen für eine effiziente Informationsabruf benötigen.","pt":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT that require advanced document indexing and search capabilities for efficient information retrieval.","ru":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT that require advanced document indexing and search capabilities for efficient information retrieval.","ar":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT that require advanced document indexing and search capabilities for efficient information retrieval."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage external reference documents by indexing and summarizing PDF and Word files, enabling efficient search and retrieval using queries, and updating the RAG corpus for enhanced knowledge graph capabilities.","zh":"能够使代理管理外部参考文档，通过索引和总结 PDF 和 Word 文件，实现使用查询的高效搜索和检索，并更新 RAG 语料库以增强知识图谱功能。","ja":"エージェントが外部リファレンスドキュメントを管理できるようにし、PDF および Word ファイルの索引付けおよび要約を実行し、クエリを使用した効率的な検索および取得を可能にし、RAG コーパスを更新して知識グラフ機能を強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 외부 참조 문서를 관리 할 수있게 해주며, PDF 및 Word 파일의 색인 및 요약을 통해 쿼리를 사용한 효율적인 검색 및检索를 가능하게 하며, RAG 코퍼스를 업데이트하여 지식 그래프 기능을 강화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar documentos de referencia externos indexando y resumiendo archivos PDF y Word, lo que permite una búsqueda y recuperación eficientes utilizando consultas y actualizando el corpus RAG para mejorar las capacidades del gráfico de conocimiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des documents de référence externes en indexant et en résumant des fichiers PDF et Word, ce qui permet une recherche et une récupération efficaces à l''aide de requêtes et une mise à jour du corpus RAG pour améliorer les capacités du graphique de connaissances.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, externe Referenzdokumente durch Indexierung und Zusammenfassung von PDF- und Word-Dateien zu verwalten, wodurch eine effiziente Suche und Abruf mithilfe von Abfragen ermöglicht wird und das RAG-Korpus für erweiterte Wissensgraphenfunktionen aktualisiert wird.","pt":"Empowers agents to manage external reference documents by indexing and summarizing PDF and Word files, enabling efficient search and retrieval using queries, and updating the RAG corpus for enhanced knowledge graph capabilities.","ru":"Empowers agents to manage external reference documents by indexing and summarizing PDF and Word files, enabling efficient search and retrieval using queries, and updating the RAG corpus for enhanced knowledge graph capabilities.","ar":"Empowers agents to manage external reference documents by indexing and summarizing PDF and Word files, enabling efficient search and retrieval using queries, and updating the RAG corpus for enhanced knowledge graph capabilities."},"useCases":{"en":["Indexing legal documents for quick reference and search","Automating summary generation for lengthy PDF files","Searching and retrieving specific information from indexed documents using natural language queries"],"zh":["快速参考和搜索的法律文档索引","自动为长PDF文件生成摘要","使用自然语言查询从索引文档中搜索和检索特定信息"],"ja":["迅速参照および検索のための法的文書の索引付け","長い PDF ファイルの自動要約生成","自然言語クエリを使用した索引付きドキュメントからの特定情報の検索および取得"],"ko":["빠른 참조 및 검색을 위한 법적 문서의 색인 생성","긴 PDF 파일에 대한 자동 요약 생성","자연어 쿼리를 사용한 색인 된 문서에서 특정 정보의 검색 및 검색"],"es":["Indexación de documentos legales para referencia y búsqueda rápida","Automatización de la generación de resúmenes para archivos PDF extensos","Búsqueda y recuperación de información específica de documentos indexados utilizando consultas de lenguaje natural"],"fr":["Indexation de documents juridiques pour référence et recherche rapides","Automatisation de la génération de résumés pour des fichiers PDF longs","Recherche et récupération d''informations spécifiques à partir de documents indexés à l''aide de requêtes en langage naturel"],"de":["Indexierung von Rechtsdokumenten für schnellen Verweis und Suchen","Automatisierung der Generierung von Zusammenfassungen für umfangreiche PDF-Dateien","Suchen und Abrufen spezifischer Informationen aus indizierten Dokumenten unter Verwendung von natürlichen Sprachabfragen"],"pt":["Indexing legal documents for quick reference and search","Automating summary generation for lengthy PDF files","Searching and retrieving specific information from indexed documents using natural language queries"],"ru":["Indexing legal documents for quick reference and search","Automating summary generation for lengthy PDF files","Searching and retrieving specific information from indexed documents using natural language queries"],"ar":["Indexing legal documents for quick reference and search","Automating summary generation for lengthy PDF files","Searching and retrieving specific information from indexed documents using natural language queries"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires file system access to read and process documents","Limited to PDF and Word file formats for text extraction and summarization","Dependent on RAG corpus for indexing and search functionality"],"zh":["需要文件系统访问权限来读取和处理文档","仅限于 PDF 和 Word 文件格式进行文本提取和总结","依赖于 RAG 语料库进行索引和搜索功能"],"ja":["ドキュメントの読み取りおよび処理のためにファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","テキスト抽出および要約のために PDF および Word ファイル形式に限定","索引付けおよび検索機能のために RAG コーパスに依存"],"ko":["문서의 읽기 및 처리를 위해 파일 시스템에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","텍스트 추출 및 요약을 위해 PDF 및 Word 파일 형식으로 제한됩니다.","색인 및 검색 기능을 위해 RAG 코퍼스에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos para leer y procesar documentos","Limitado a formatos de archivo PDF y Word para extracción y resumen de texto","Dependiente del corpus RAG para la funcionalidad de indexación y búsqueda"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers pour lire et traiter des documents","Limité aux formats de fichiers PDF et Word pour l''extraction et le résumé de texte","Dépendant du corpus RAG pour la fonctionnalité d''indexation et de recherche"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Dateisystem, um Dokumente zu lesen und zu verarbeiten","Begrenzt auf PDF- und Word-Dateiformate für Textextraktion und -zusammenfassung","Abhängig vom RAG-Korpus für die Indexierungs- und Suchfunktion"],"pt":["Requires file system access to read and process documents","Limited to PDF and Word file formats for text extraction and summarization","Dependent on