し、次のステップを計画するのに役立ちます。","ko":"미리 생각하는 기술은 전략적 파트너로서 완료된 작업을 이해하고 의존성 및 장애물을 발견하여 다음 단계를 계획하는 데 도움을 줍니다.","es":"Think Ahead es una habilidad que te permite planificar y anticipar problemas en tus proyectos de desarrollo, mejorando la eficiencia y la productividad","fr":"Think Ahead est une compétence qui vous permet de planifier et d''anticiper les problèmes dans vos projets de développement, améliorant l''efficacité et la pro...","de":"Think Ahead ist eine Fähigkeit, die es Ihnen ermöglicht, Probleme in Ihren Entwicklungsvorhaben zu planen und zu anticipieren, wodurch die Effizienz und Prod...","pt":"O Think Ahead é um skill que ajuda desenvolvedores a planejar estrategicamente e antecipar problemas","ru":"Think Ahead - это навык, который помогает разработчикам планировать стратегически и предвидеть проблемы","ar":"Think Ahead هو مهارة تساعد المطورين على التخطيط الاستراتيجي وتوقع المشكلات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["理解已完成的工作","发现依赖和障碍","提前规划下一步","协调任务","预测问题"],"ja":["完了した作業を理解する","依存関係や障害を特定する","次のステップを計画する","タスクを調整する","問題を予測する"],"ko":["완료된 작업을 이해한다","의존성 및 장애물을 발견한다","다음 단계를 계획한다","작업을 조정한다","문제를 예측한다"],"es":["Entiende qué se ha construido","Detecta dependencias y bloqueos","Planifica la próxima característica de manera reflexiva","Coordina entre tareas","Anticipa problemas antes de que ocurran"],"fr":["Comprenez ce qui a été construit","Détectez les dépendances et les bloqueurs","Planifiez la prochaine fonctionnalité de manière réfléchie","Coordonnez entre les tâches","Anticipez les problèmes avant qu''ils ne se produisent"],"de":["Verstehen Sie, was gebaut wurde","Erkennen Sie Abhängigkeiten und Blockierungen","Planen Sie die nächste Funktion sorgfältig","Koordinieren Sie zwischen Aufgaben","Antizipieren Sie Probleme, bevor sie auftreten"],"pt":["Entendimento do progresso do projeto","Detecção de dependências e bloqueadores","Planejamento de recursos pensando no futuro","Coordenação entre tarefas","Antecipação de problemas"],"ru":["Понимание прогресса проекта","Обнаружение зависимостей и блокировщиков","Планирование ресурсов с учетом будущего","Координация между задачами","Предвидение проблем"],"ar":["فهم تقدم المشروع","كشف التبعيات والحاجزات","تخطيط الموارد بالتفكير في المستقبل","تنسيق العمل بين المهام","توقع المشكلات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["提前思考技能","策略规划","开发者工具","工作流优化","任务管理","依赖管理"],"ja":["先を見に行くスキル","戦略的計画","開発者ツール","ワークフロー最適化","タスク管理","依存管理"],"ko":["미리 생각하는 기술","전략적 계획","개발자 도구","작업 흐름 최적화","작업 관리","의존성 관리"],"es":["planificación de proyectos","desarrollo de software","gestión de proyectos","planificación estratégica","anticipación de problemas","eficiencia en el desarrollo"],"fr":["planification de projets","développement de logiciels","gestion de projets","planification stratégique","anticipation de problèmes","efficacité dans le développement"],"de":["Projektplanung","Softwareentwicklung","Projektmanagement","strategische Planung","Problemtantisipation","Effizienz im Entwicklungsvorhaben"],"pt":["planejamento estratégico","desenvolvimento de software","antecipação de problemas","gestão de projetos","desenvolvedores","tecnologia"],"ru":["стратегическое планирование","разработка программного обеспечения","предвидение проблем","управление проектами","разработчики","технологии"],"ar":["التخطيط الاستراتيجي","تطوير البرمجيات","توقع المشكلات","إدارة المشاريع","المطورون","التكنولوجيا"]}},"owner":"AbeJitsu","repo":"Resume","repoPath":"AbeJitsu/Resume","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.408Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"think-ahead","description":"AI thinking partner for strategy and planning. Reads the current work state, analyzes progress, and helps you plan the next phase while the worker instance builds. Triggered by think ahead.","bodyPreview":"# Think Ahead\n\nYour strategic planning partner. While the worker instance executes, you stay one step ahead—understanding what''s been built, spotting opportunities, and planning the next moves.\n\n## The Role\n\nYou''re the **thinking partner** ↔ They''re the **working partner**\n\nThis skill reads their progress and helps you:\n- Understand what just shipped\n- Spot dependencies and blockers\n- Plan the next feature thoughtfully\n- Coordinate between tasks\n- Anticipate problems before they happen\n\n## When","body":"# Think Ahead\n\nYour strategic planning partner. While the worker instance executes, you stay one step ahead—understanding what''s been built, spotting opportunities, and planning the next moves.\n\n## The Role\n\nYou''re the **thinking partner** ↔ They''re the **working partner**\n\nThis skill reads their progress and helps you:\n- Understand what just shipped\n- Spot dependencies and blockers\n- Plan the next feature thoughtfully\n- Coordinate between tasks\n- Anticipate problems before they happen\n\n## When To Use\n\nSay: **\"think ahead\"**\n\nPerfect for:\n- **Between work cycles** - Worker finishes a task, you plan the next one\n- **Strategic pauses** - Before committing to a direction, validate the approach\n- **Blocking detection** - Spot if work is waiting on external setup (Google Cloud, credentials, etc.)\n- **Dependency mapping** - See what needs what, plan build order\n- **Opportunity spotting** - Notice refactoring chances or improvements\n- **Coordination** - When multiple features are in flight, stay synchronized\n\n## What This Delivers\n\nI''ll:\n\n1. **Read current state** - `git status`, `git diff`, last 10 commits\n2. **Check plan alignment** - What was TODO, what actually got built\n3. **Analyze trajectory** - See patterns in commits and progress\n4. **Flag blockers** - External setup, missing credentials, test failures\n5. **Suggest next moves** - What logically comes next, in priority order\n\nThen present it as:\n\n```\n### Current State\nBranch, staged changes, unstaged work\n\n### What Just Shipped\nStaged changes ready to commit\nTests, screenshots, infrastructure\n\n### What''s In Progress\nUnstaged changes still being polished\nIncomplete work that needs finishing\n\n### The Arc\nRecent commits showing the direction\nHow pieces fit together\nWhat the pattern suggests\n\n### Strategic Recommendations\nPriority 1: What must happen next\nPriority 2: What depends on that\nPriority 3: What''s blocked and why\nWhat should the worker tackle next?\n```\n\n## The Workflow\n\n```\nWorker builds → You think ahead → Plan next task → Worker executes\n     ↓\n   Repeat\n```\n\nThink of it like:\n- **Worker** = Getting things done, implementing features\n- **You** = Understanding the landscape, planning strategically\n- **This skill** = Bridging the gap, keeping strategy and execution aligned\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:31:53.456Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Strategic Planning Agents needing anticipatory and coordinative capabilities to stay ahead of task execution.","zh":"非常适合需要预测和协调能力的战略规划代理，以便在任务执行中保持领先地位。","ja":"タスクの実行を先導するために予測および調整能力が必要な戦略的計画エージェントに最適です。","ko":"작업 수행에서 앞서나가기 위해 예측 및 조정 기능이 필요한 전략적 계획 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de planificación estratégica que necesitan capacidades anticipatorias y coordinativas para mantenerse por delante de la ejecución de tareas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de planification stratégique ayant besoin de capacités anticipatoires et coordinatives pour rester en avance sur l''exécution des tâches.","de":"Perfekt für strategische Planungsagenten, die anticipatorische und koordinative Fähigkeiten benötigen, um der Aufgabenausführung voraus zu sein.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Planejamento Estratégico que necessitam de capacidades antecipatórias e de coordenação para permanecer à frente da execução de tarefas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов стратегического планирования, которым необходимы антиципаторные и координирующие возможности для поддержания лидерства в выполнении задач.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التخطيط الاستراتيجي الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات استباقية وتنسيقية للبقاء في مقدمة تنفيذ المهام."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to understand shipped features, spot dependencies and blockers, and plan next moves through thoughtful coordination and anticipation of problems using progress analysis and dependency mapping protocols.","zh":"使代理能够理解已发布的功能，识别依赖项和阻塞点，并通过进度分析和依赖项映射协议的深思熟虑的协调和预测问题来规划下一步行动。","ja":"エージェントがリリースされた機能を理解し、依存関係とブロッカーを特定し、進捗分析と依存関係マッピングのプロトコルを使用して問題の予測と調整を通じて次のステップを計画することを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 배포된 기능을 이해하고 의존성 및 차단 지점을 식별하고 진행 상황 분석 및 의존성 매핑 프로토콜을 사용하여 문제를 예측하고 조정하여 다음 단계를 계획할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a comprender las características enviadas, detectar dependencias y bloqueos, y planificar los próximos movimientos a través de una coordinación y anticipación reflexiva de problemas utilizando protocolos de análisis de progreso y mapeo de dependencias.","fr":"Permet aux agents de comprendre les fonctionnalités expédiées, de détecter les dépendances et les bloqueurs, et de planifier les prochaines étapes grâce à une coordination et une anticipation réfléchie des problèmes en utilisant des protocoles d''analyse de progrès et de cartographie des dépendances.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, versandte Funktionen zu verstehen, Abhängigkeiten und Blockierungen zu erkennen und die nächsten Schritte durch eine sorgfältige Koordination und Antizipation von Problemen unter Verwendung von Protokollen für Fortschrittsanalyse und Abhängigkeitszuordnung zu planen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a compreender recursos enviados, identificar dependências e bloqueios, e planejar os próximos passos por meio de coordenação e antecipação reflexiva de problemas usando protocolos de análise de progresso e mapeamento de dependências.","ru":"Позволяет агентам понимать отправленные функции, выявлять зависимости и блокировки, и планировать следующие шаги посредством вдумчивой координации и антиципации проблем с помощью протоколов анализа прогресса и картографирования зависимостей.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء فهم الميزات المرسلة، وتحديد الاعتماديات والحواجز، وتخطيط الخطوات التالية من خلال التنسيق والاس