ravail","Apprentissage de flux de travail en cours d''exécution"],"de":["Tägliche Portfolioanalyse","Implementierung der Permanent-Portfolio-Strategie von Harry Browne","Mehrschrittiger Arbeitsablauf","Definition neuer Arbeitsabläufe","Lernen von laufenden Arbeitsabläufen"],"pt":["Análise de portfólio automatizada","Implementação da estratégia de Portfólio Permanente de Harry Browne","Criação e gerenciamento de fluxos de trabalho multi-etapa","Definição de novos trabalhos interativos","Aprendizado com a execução de trabalhos"],"ru":["Автоматический анализ портфеля","Реализация стратегии Постоянного портфеля Гарри Брауна","Создание и управление многоступенчатыми рабочими процессами","Определение новых интерактивных заданий","Обучение на выполнении заданий"],"ar":["تحليل المحفظة الآلي","تنفيذ استراتيجية المحفظة الدائمة لهاري براون","إنشاء وإدارة تدفقات العمل المتعددة","تحديد مهام جديدة تفاعلية","التعلم من تشغيل المهام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["DeepWork Jobs","自动化投资组合分析","永久投资组合策略","多步骤工作流","AI 工作流","开发者工具"],"ja":["DeepWork Jobs","自動化ポートフォリオ分析","永久ポートフォリオ戦略","マルチステップ・ワークフロー","AI ワークフロー","開発者ツール"],"ko":["딥워크 잡스","자동화된 포트폴리오 분석","영원한 投資組合 전략","다단계 작업 흐름","AI 작업 흐름","개발자 도구"],"es":["análisis de cartera","estrategia de cartera permanente","flujo de trabajo multi-paso","deepwork_jobs","automatización de análisis","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["analyse de portefeuille","stratégie de portefeuille permanent","flux de travail multi-étapes","deepwork_jobs","automatisation d''analyse","outils de développement"],"de":["Portfolioanalyse","Permanent-Portfolio-Strategie","mehrschrittiger Arbeitsablauf","deepwork_jobs","Automatisierung von Analysen","Entwicklertools"],"pt":["análise de portfólio","portfólio permanente","harry browne","fluxo de trabalho multi-etapa","desenvolvimento de software","automatização de processos"],"ru":["анализ портфеля","постоянный портфель","гарри браун","многоступенчатый рабочий процесс","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматизация процессов"],"ar":["تحليل المحفظة","المحفظة الدائمة","هاري براون","تدفق العمل المتعدد","تطوير البرمجيات","تأتمة العمليات"]}},"owner":"ncrmro","repo":"deepwork-permanent-portfolio","repoPath":"ncrmro/deepwork-permanent-portfolio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.409Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deepwork_jobs","description":"Creates and manages multi-step AI workflows. Use when defining, implementing, or improving DeepWork jobs.","bodyPreview":"# deepwork_jobs\n\n**Multi-step workflow**: Creates and manages multi-step AI workflows. Use when defining, implementing, or improving DeepWork jobs.\n\n> **CRITICAL**: Always invoke steps using the Skill tool. Never copy/paste step instructions directly.\n\nCore commands for managing DeepWork jobs. These commands help you define new multi-step\nworkflows and learn from running them.\n\nThe `define` command guides you through an interactive process to create a new job by\nasking structured questions about","body":"# deepwork_jobs\n\n**Multi-step workflow**: Creates and manages multi-step AI workflows. Use when defining, implementing, or improving DeepWork jobs.\n\n> **CRITICAL**: Always invoke steps using the Skill tool. Never copy/paste step instructions directly.\n\nCore commands for managing DeepWork jobs. These commands help you define new multi-step\nworkflows and learn from running them.\n\nThe `define` command guides you through an interactive process to create a new job by\nasking structured questions about your workflow, understanding each step''s inputs and outputs,\nand generating all necessary files.\n\nThe `learn` command reflects on conversations where DeepWork jobs were run, identifies\nconfusion or inefficiencies, and improves job instructions. It also captures bespoke\nlearnings specific to the current run into AGENTS.md files in the working folder.\n\n\n## Available Steps\n\n1. **define** - Creates a job.yml specification by gathering workflow requirements through structured questions. Use when starting a new multi-step workflow.\n2. **review_job_spec** - Reviews job.yml against quality criteria using a sub-agent for unbiased validation. Use after defining a job specification. (requires: define)\n3. **implement** - Generates step instruction files and syncs slash commands from the job.yml specification. Use after job spec review passes. (requires: review_job_spec)\n4. **learn** - Analyzes conversation history to improve job instructions and capture learnings. Use after running a job to refine it.\n\n## Execution Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Intent\n\nParse any text following `/deepwork_jobs` to determine user intent:\n- \"define\" or related terms → start at `deepwork_jobs.define`\n- \"review_job_spec\" or related terms → start at `deepwork_jobs.review_job_spec`\n- \"implement\" or related terms → start at `deepwork_jobs.implement`\n- \"learn\" or related terms → start at `deepwork_jobs.learn`\n\n### Step 2: Invoke Starting Step\n\nUse the Skill tool to invoke the identified starting step:\n```\nSkill tool: deepwork_jobs.define\n```\n\n### Step 3: Continue Workflow Automatically\n\nAfter each step completes:\n1. Check if there''s a next step in the sequence\n2. Invoke the next step using the Skill tool\n3. Repeat until workflow is complete or user intervenes\n\n### Handling Ambiguous Intent\n\nIf user intent is unclear, use AskUserQuestion to clarify:\n- Present available steps as numbered options\n- Let user select the starting point\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- Do NOT copy/paste step instructions directly; always use the Skill tool to invoke steps\n- Do NOT skip steps in the workflow unless the user explicitly requests it\n- Do NOT proceed to the next step if the current step''s outputs are incomplete\n- Do NOT make assumptions about user intent; ask for clarification when ambiguous\n\n## Context Files\n\n- Job definition: `.deepwork/jobs/deepwork_jobs/job.yml`"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:32:44.405Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Financial Analysis Agents implementing Harry Browne''s Permanent Portfolio strategy and requiring automated daily portfolio analysis","zh":"适合于实施哈里·布朗永久投资组合策略并需要自动化每日投资组合分析的金融分析代理","ja":"ハリー・ブラウン永久ポートフォリオ戦略を実装し、自動化された毎日のポートフォリオ分析を必要とする財務分析エージェントに最適","ko":"해리 브라운의 영구 포트폴리오 전략을 구현하고 자동화된 일일 포트폴리오 분석을 요구하는 재무 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis Financiero que implementan la estrategia de Cartera Permanente de Harry Browne y requieren un análisis de cartera automatizado diario","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''analyse financière mettant en œuvre la stratégie de portefeuille permanent de Harry Browne et nécessitant une analyse de portefeuille automatisée quotidienne","de":"Ideal für Finanzanalyse-Agents, die die Permanent-Portfolio-Strategie von Harry Browne implementieren und eine automatisierte tägliche Portfolio-Analyse benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise Financeira que implementam a estratégia de Carteira Permanente de Harry Browne e necessitam de análise de carteira automatizada diariamente","ru":"Идеально подходит для финансовых аналитических агентов, реализующих стратегию Постоянного портфеля Гарри Брауна и требующих автоматизированного ежедневного анализа портфеля","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل مالية تطبق استراتيجية المحفظة الدائمة لهاري براون وتحتاج إلى تحليل محفظة يومي تلقائي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage multi-step workflows for portfolio analysis using interactive step definitions and critical command invocations via the Skill tool, supporting structured workflow improvements and learning from running jobs","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理多步骤工作流程的能力，以实现投资组合分析，使用交互式步骤定义和关键命令调用，通过 Skill 工具支持结构化工作流程改进和从运行作业中学习","ja":"エージェントがインタラクティブなステップ定義と重要なコマンド呼び出しを使用して、ポートフォリオ分析のためのマルチステップのワークフローを作成および管理する能力を付与し、Skillツールを介して構造化されたワークフローの改善と実行中のジョブからの学習をサポートする","ko":"에이전트가 상호 작용형 단계 정의와 중요한 명령 호출을 통해 포트폴리오 분석을 위한 멀티스텝 워크플로を作成 및 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, Skill 도구를 통해 구조화된 워크플로우 개선과 실행 중인 작업에서 학습할 수 있도록 지원","es":"Permite a los agentes crear y gestionar flujos de trabajo multipaso para el análisis de carteras utilizando definiciones de pasos interactivos y invocaciones de comandos críticos a través de la herramienta Skill, lo que admite mejoras de flujos de trabajo estructurados y aprendizaje de trabajos en ejecución","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des flux de travail mult étapes pour l''analyse de portefeuille en utilisant des définitions de pas interactifs et des invocations de commandes critiques via l''outil Skill, ce qui prend en charge les améliorations de flux de travail structurés et l''apprentissage de travaux en cours d''exécution","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, mehrschrittige Workflows für die Portfolio-Analyse zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem interaktive Schritterfinitionen und kritische Befehlsaufrufe über das Skill-Tool verwendet werden, was strukturierte Workflow-Verbesserungen und Lernen aus laufenden Jobs unterstützt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem e gerenciarem fluxos de trabalho multi-etapas para análise de carteira usando definições de etapas interativas e invocações de comandos críticos via a ferramenta Skill, apoiando melhorias de fluxo de trabalho estruturadas e aprendizado a partir de trabalhos em execução","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и управлять многоступенчатыми рабочими процессами для анализа портфеля с помощью интерактивных определений шагов и критических вызовов команд через инструмент Skill, поддерживая структурированные улучшения рабочего процесса и обучение на основе выполняемых заданий","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء وإدارة تدفقات عمل متعددة المراحل لتحليل المحفظة باستخدام تعريفات خطوات تفاعلية ودعوات أوامر حرجة عبر أداة المهارة، ودعم تحسينات هيكلية لتدفق العمل والتعلم من الوظائف القائمة"},"useCases":{"en":["Defining new multi-step workflows for portfolio management","Implementing Harry Browne''s Permanent Portfolio strategy through automated analysis","Improving existing DeepWork jobs for enhanced portfolio performance"],"zh":["定义新的多步骤工作流程用于投资组合管理","通过自动化分析实施哈里·布朗永久投资组合策略","提高现有的 DeepWork 作业以增强投资组合性能"],"ja":["ポートフォリオ管理のための新しいマルチステップワークフローを定義する","自動化された分析を通じてハリー・ブラウンの永久ポートフォリオ戦略を実装する","既存のDeepWorkジョブを改善してポートフォリオのパフォーマンスを高める"],"ko":["포트폴리오 관리를 위한 새로운 멀티스텝 워크플로우를 정의","자동화된 분석을 통해 해리 브라운의 영구 포트폴리오 전략을 구현","기존의 DeepWork 작업을 개선하여 포트폴리오 성능을 향상"],"es":["Definir nuevos flujos de trabajo multipaso para la gestión de carteras","Implementar la estrategia de Cartera Permanente de Harry Browne a través de un análisis automatizado","Mejorar los trabajos existentes de DeepWork para un mejor rendimiento de la cartera"],"fr":["Définir de nouveaux flux de travail mult étapes pour la gestion de portefeuille","Mettre en œuvre la stratégie de portefeuille permanent de Harry Browne via une analyse automatisée","Améliorer les travaux DeepWork existants pour une meilleure performance de portefeuille"],"de":["Neue mehrschrittige Workflows für das Portfolio-Management definieren","Die Permanent-Portfolio-Strategie von Harry Browne durch eine automatisierte Analyse implementieren","Bestehende DeepWork-Jobs für eine verbesserte Portfolio-Leistung verbessern"],"pt":["Definir novos fluxos de trabalho multi-etapas para gestão de carteira","Implementar a estratégia de Carteira Permanente de Harry Browne por meio de análise automatizada","Melhorar trabalhos existentes do DeepWork para desempenho de carteira aprimorado"],"ru":["Определение новых многоступенчатых рабочих процессов для управления портфелем","Реализация стратегии Постоянного портфеля Гарри Брауна посредством автоматизированного анализа","Улучшение существующих заданий DeepWork для повышения производительности портфеля"],"ar":["تحديد تدفقات عمل متعددة المراحل جديدة لإدارة المحفظة","تطبيق استراتيجية المحفظة الدائمة لهاري براون من خلال التحليل التلقائي","تحسين الوظائف الحالية لبرنامج DeepWork لتحسين أداء المحفظة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires use of Skill tool for step invocations","Specific to DeepWork jobs and Harry Browne''s Permanent Portfolio strategy"],"zh":["需要使用 Skill 工具进行步骤调用","仅限于 DeepWork 作业和哈里·布朗永久投资组合策略"],"ja":["Skillツールを使用してステップ呼び出しを行う必要がある","DeepWorkジョブとハリー・ブラウンの永久ポートフォリオ戦略に限定"],"ko":["Skill 도구를 사용하여 단계 호출을 수행해야 함","DeepWork 작업과 해리 브라운의 영구 포트폴리오 전략에만 한정"],"es":["Requiere el uso de la herramienta Skill para las invocaciones de pasos","Específico para los trabajos de DeepWork y la estrategia de Cartera Permanente de Harry Browne"],"fr":["Nécessite l''utilisation de l''outil Skill pour les invocations de pas","Spécifique aux travaux DeepWork et à la stratégie de portefeuille permanent de Harry Browne"],"de":["Erfordert die Verwendung des Skill-Tools für Schrittaufrufe","Spezifisch für DeepWork-Jobs und die Permanent-Portfolio-Strategie von Harry Browne"],"pt":["Requer o uso da ferramenta Skill para invocações de etapas","Específico para trabalhos do DeepWork e estratégia de Carteira Permanente de Harry Browne"],"ru":["Требует использования инструмента Skill для вызовов шагов","Относится конкретно к заданиям DeepWork и стратегии Постоянного портфеля Гарри Брауна"],"ar":["يتطلب استخدام أداة المهارة لدعوات الخطوات","محدد لبرنامج DeepWork و استراتيجية المحفظة الدائمة لهاري براون"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
