":"エージェントチームワークフローは、自動化された並列開発ワークフローであり、明確なファイル所有権とタスク分解によってチームの効率を向上させる","ko":"에이전트 팀 워크플로우는 자동화된 병렬 개발 워크플로우로, 명확한 파일 소유권과 태스크 분해를 통해 팀의 효율성을 높입니다","es":"El flujo de trabajo para equipos de agentes permite una colaboración eficiente en proyectos de desarrollo, con fases claras y acciones definidas","fr":"Le flux de travail pour les équipes d''agents permet une collaboration efficace dans les projets de développement, avec des phases claires et des actions défi...","de":"Der Workflow für Agenten-Teams ermöglicht eine effiziente Zusammenarbeit in Entwicklungsprojekten, mit klaren Phasen und definierten Aktionen","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho da equipe de agentes é um processo autônomo que permite o desenvolvimento paralelo. Ele ajuda a melhorar a produtividade da equipe","ru":"Командный рабочий процесс - это автономный процесс, который позволяет параллельное развитие. Он помогает улучшить производительность команды","ar":"تدفق العمل بالفريق هو عملية tự động يسمح بالتطوير المتوازي. يساعد على تحسين إنتاجية الفريق","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动化并行开发","清晰的文件所有权","任务分解","提高团队效率","支持多语言"],"ja":["自動化された並列開発","明確なファイル所有権","タスク分解","チームの効率の向上","多言語対応"],"ko":["자동화된 병렬 개발","명확한 파일 소유권","태스크 분해","팀의 효율성 향상","다국어 지원"],"es":["Planificación de proyectos","Asignación de tareas","Gestión de dependencias","Colaboración en tiempo real","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Planification de projets","Attribution de tâches","Gestion de dépendances","Collaboration en temps réel","Intégration avec des outils de développement"],"de":["Projektplanung","Aufgabenverteilung","Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Echtzeit-Kollaboration","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento paralelo autônomo","Melhoria da produtividade da equipe","Definição de tarefas com propriedade de arquivo clara","Análise do escopo da tarefa e identificação de dependências","Leitura de documentos de projeto e estrutura"],"ru":["Автономное параллельное развитие","Улучшение производительности команды","Определение задач с ясной собственностью файла","Анализ объема задачи и определение зависимостей","Чтение документов проекта и структуры"],"ar":["التطوير المتوازي tự động","تحسين إنتاجية الفريق","تحديد المهام مع ملكية الملف واضحة","تحليل نطاق المهمة وتحديد التبعيات","قراءة وثائق المشروع والهيكل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Agent Teams","工作流程","自动化开发","并行开发","团队效率","文件所有权","任务分解"],"ja":["エージェントチーム","ワークフロー","自動化開発","並列開発","チーム効率","ファイル所有権","タスク分解"],"ko":["에이전트 팀","워크플로우","자동화 개발","병렬 개발","팀 효율성","파일 소유권","태스크 분해"],"es":["flujo de trabajo","equipo de agentes","desarrollo de software","colaboración en tiempo real","gestión de proyectos","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["flux de travail","équipe d''agents","développement de logiciels","collaboration en temps réel","gestion de projets","outils de développement"],"de":["workflow","agenten-team","software-entwicklung","echtzeit-kollaboration","projektmanagement","entwicklungstools"],"pt":["fluxo de trabalho da equipe","desenvolvimento paralelo","produtividade da equipe","autonomia","tarefas","dependências","projeto","estrutura"],"ru":["командный рабочий процесс","параллельное развитие","производительность команды","автономность","задачи","зависимости","проект","структура"],"ar":["تدفق العمل بالفريق","التطوير المتوازي","إنتاجية الفريق","الاستقلالية","المهام","التبعيات","المشروع","الهيكل"]}},"owner":"onepunch-tk","repo":"claude-rr7-starterkit","repoPath":"onepunch-tk/claude-rr7-starterkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.409Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"workflow-team","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Agent Teams Workflow\n\nAutonomous parallel development workflow for Agent Teams.\nInvoke with: `/workflow-team lead` or `/workflow-team teammate`\n\n---\n\n## For Team Lead (`/workflow-team lead`)\n\n### Phase 1: Plan\n\n| Step | Action |\n|------|--------|\n| 1 | Enter `PlanMode` |\n| 2 | Read `CLAUDE.md`, `docs/PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md`, `docs/ROADMAP.md` |\n| 3 | Analyze task scope, identify required files and dependencies |\n| 4 | Break work into tasks with **clear file ownership** (no overlapping files) |\n|","body":"# Agent Teams Workflow\n\nAutonomous parallel development workflow for Agent Teams.\nInvoke with: `/workflow-team lead` or `/workflow-team teammate`\n\n---\n\n## For Team Lead (`/workflow-team lead`)\n\n### Phase 1: Plan\n\n| Step | Action |\n|------|--------|\n| 1 | Enter `PlanMode` |\n| 2 | Read `CLAUDE.md`, `docs/PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md`, `docs/ROADMAP.md` |\n| 3 | Analyze task scope, identify required files and dependencies |\n| 4 | Break work into tasks with **clear file ownership** (no overlapping files) |\n| 5 | Create detailed step-by-step plan with task breakdown |\n| 6 | Exit `PlanMode` → wait for plan approval |\n\n> After plan approval, create tasks via `TaskCreate` and spawn teammates immediately. No separate confirmation needed.\n\n### Phase 2: Execute (after user approval)\n\n| Step | Action |\n|------|--------|\n| 1 | Switch to `development` branch, create a working branch for the team |\n| 2 | Spawn teammates with detailed prompts (see Spawn Example below) |\n| 3 | Use **Delegate Mode** (Shift+Tab) — do NOT implement yourself |\n| 4 | Monitor teammate progress, unblock as needed |\n\n> Enable **Plan Approval** for complex/risky tasks.\n> All teammates work on the **same feature branch** (file ownership prevents conflicts).\n\n#### Spawn Example\n\n```\nCreate an agent team with N teammates:\n1. \"{name}\" — Read {task-file-path}. Own files: {file-list}.\n2. \"{name}\" — Read {task-file-path}. Own files: {file-list}.\nUse Opus for all teammates. Require plan approval.\n```\n\n### Phase 3: Review & Merge (after all teammates complete)\n\n| Step | Action |\n|------|--------|\n| 1 | Run the project''s test command (see CLAUDE.md Commands) to verify integration |\n| 2 | Run `code-reviewer` sub-agent on all changed files |\n| 3 | Run `e2e-tester` sub-agent to validate user flows |\n| 4 | Read report in `/docs/reports/code-review/` → fix ALL issues where status ≠ \"complete\" |\n| 5 | Merge working branch → `development` |\n| 6 | Update `ROADMAP.md` and `PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md` |\n\n### Merge Strategy\n\n```\nmain\n └── development\n      └── {working-branch}  ← single branch, all teammates work here\n           ├── teammate-A commits (owns: file-list-A)\n           ├── teammate-B commits (owns: file-list-B)\n           └── teammate-C commits (owns: file-list-C)\n\nAfter all teammates done → Phase 3\n```\n\n### Git Conventions\n\nSee [workflow-commits.md](../git/references/workflow-commits.md)\n\n---\n\n## For Teammates (`/workflow-team teammate`)\n\n### Execution Steps\n\n| Step | Action |\n|------|--------|\n| 1 | Read `CLAUDE.md`, `docs/PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md`, assigned task file |\n| 2 | Run `unit-test-writer` sub-agent (Red Phase). **NEVER analyze patterns or write test code yourself — always delegate to the `unit-test-writer` subagent.** |\n| 3 | Implement code to pass tests (Green Phase) → run the project''s test command (see CLAUDE.md Commands) |\n| 4 | Run the project''s coverage command (see CLAUDE.md Commands) |\n| 5 | Commit per [workflow-commits.md](../git/references/workflow-commits.md) |\n| 6 | Message lead: files changed, test results, remaining issues |\n\n### Teammate Rules\n\n- **ONLY modify files** assigned to you\n- **NEVER touch** files owned by another teammate\n- **Shared files** (barrel `index.ts`, `routes.ts`): message lead before modifying\n- **New files**: create freely within your task scope\n- **Do NOT create branches** — work on the feature branch created by lead\n\n### Failure Recovery (Autonomous)\n\n```\nIF any step fails:\n  1. Log to docs/reports/failures/{teammate-name}-{timestamp}.md\n  2. Retry SAME approach (1 attempt)\n  3. Retry DIFFERENT approach (1 attempt)\n  4. After 3 failures:\n     → Message lead: \"Blocked on [issue]. Attempted [approaches].\"\n     → Pick up next available task\n     → DO NOT STOP\n```\n\n### Communication\n\n| Event | Action |\n|-------|--------|\n| Task complete | Message lead with summary |\n| Blocked by another task | Message lead, pick up next task |\n| Found issue in shared code | Message lead (don''t fix directly) |\n| Need design decision | Message lead with options + recommendation |\n\n---\n\n## Cost Notes\n\n- Use `opus` model for teammates\n- Teammates: **NO code-reviewer** — TDD cycle is the quality gate, lead handles all review in Phase 3\n- Lead runs `code-reviewer` + `e2e-tester` as the single review gate post-merge\n- Minimize sub-agent calls per teammate\n- Avoid broadcast messages — message lead directly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:32:53.012Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous Agents needing structured workflow management for team collaboration and parallel development.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化工作流管理的自主代理，用于团队协作和并行开发。","ja":"チームコラボレーションおよび並列開発のための構造化されたワークフローマネジメントが必要な自律エージェントに最適です。","ko":"팀 협업 및 병렬 개발을 위한 구조화된 워크플로우 관리가 필요한 자율 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Autónomos que necesitan una gestión de flujo de trabajo estructurada para la colaboración en equipo y el desarrollo paralelo.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Autonomes ayant besoin d''une gestion de workflow structurée pour la collaboration d''équipe et le développement parallèle.","de":"Perfekt für autonome Agenten, die eine strukturierte Workflow-Verwaltung für Teamzusammenarbeit und parallele Entwicklung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Autônomos que necessitam de gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho estruturado para colaboração em equipe e desenvolvimento paralelo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов, которым требуется структурированное управление рабочим процессом для командного сотрудничества и параллельного развития.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المستقلة التي تحتاج إلى إدارة تدفق العمل المنظم للتعاون الفريق والتنمية الموازية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage complex project workflows by invoking `/workflow-team lead` or `/workflow-team teammate`, utilizing clear file ownership and dependency analysis through `CLAUDE.md`, `PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md`, and `ROADMAP.md` documentation.","zh":"通过调用 `/workflow-team lead` 或 `/workflow-team teammate`，利用 `CLAUDE.md`、`PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md` 和 `ROADMAP.md` 文档中的明确文件所有权和依赖关系分析，赋予代理管理复杂项目工作流的能力。","ja":"`/workflow-team lead` または `/workflow-team teammate` を呼び出して、`CLAUDE.md`、`PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md`、`ROADMAP.md` ドキュメントを介した明確なファイル所有権と依存関係分析を利用し、複雑なプロジェクトワークフローを管理するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"`/workflow-team lead` 또는 `/workflow-team teammate`를 호출하여 `CLAUDE.md`, `PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md`, `ROADMAP.md` 문서를 통해 명확한 파일 소유권 및 의존성 분석을 사용하여 복잡한 프로젝트 워크플로우를 관리할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar flujos de trabajo de proyectos complejos invocando `/workflow-team lead` o `/workflow-team teammate`, utilizando una clara propiedad de archivos y análisis de dependencias a través de la documentación `CLAUDE.md`, `PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md` y `ROADMAP.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer des flux de travail de projet complexes en invoquant `/workflow-team lead` ou `/workflow-team teammate`, en utilisant une propriété de fichiers claire et une analyse de dépendances via la documentation `CLAUDE.md`, `PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md` et `ROADMAP.md`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplexe Projekt-Workflows zu verwalten, indem sie `/workflow-team lead` oder `/workflow-team teammate` aufrufen, wobei sie eine klare Dateieigentümerschaft und Abhängigkeitsanalyse über die Dokumentation `CLAUDE.md`, `PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md` und `ROADMAP.md` nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar fluxos de trabalho de projeto complexos, invocando `/workflow-team lead` ou `/workflow-team teammate`, utilizando análise de propriedade e dependência de arquivos claras por meio da documentação `CLAUDE.md`, `PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md` e `ROADMAP.md`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять сложными рабочими процессами проекта, вызывая `/workflow-team lead` или `/workflow-team teammate`, используя четкий анализ владения и зависимости файлов через документацию `CLAUDE.md`, `PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md` и `ROADMAP.md`.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إدارة سير عمل المشروع المعقد عن طريق استدعاء `/workflow-team lead` أو `/workflow-team teammate` ، واستخدام تحليل ملكية الملفات واعتماده بوضوح من خلال توثيق `CLAUDE.md` و `PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md` و `ROADMAP.md` ."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task assignments with clear file ownership","Generating project roadmaps based on `ROADMAP.md`","Debugging workflow bottlenecks through dependency analysis"],"zh":["使用明确的文件所有权自动分配任务","根据 `ROADMAP.md` 生成项目路线图","通过依赖关系分析进行工作流瓶颈调试"],"ja":["明確なファイル所有権を使用してタスクを自動的に割り当てる","`ROADMAP.md` に基づいてプロジェクトのロードマップを生成する","依存関係分析を使用してワークフローのボトルネックをデバッグする"],"ko":["명확한 파일 소유권을 사용하여 작업을 자동으로 할당합니다","`ROADMAP.md`를 기준으로 프로젝트 로드맵을 생성합니다","의존성 분석을 사용하여 워크플로우의 병목 현상을 디버깅합니다"],"es":["Automatizar las asignaciones de tareas con una clara propiedad de archivos","Generar hojas de ruta de proyecto basadas en `ROADMAP.md`","Depurar cuellos de botella de flujo de trabajo a través del análisis de dependencias"],"fr":["Automatiser les affectations de tâches avec une propriété de fichiers claire","Générer des feuilles de route de projet basées sur `ROADMAP.md`","Déboguer les goulets d''étranglement de flux de travail via l''analyse de dépendances"],"de":["Automatisieren von Aufgabenzuweisungen mit klaren Dateieigentumsverhältnissen","Erstellen von Projekt-Roadmaps basierend auf `ROADMAP.md`","Fehlerbehebung von Workflow-Engpässen durch Abhängigkeitsanalyse"],"pt":["Automatizar tarefas de atribuição com propriedade de arquivo clara","Gerar mapas de estrada do projeto com base em `ROADMAP.md`","Depurar gargalos de fluxo de trabalho por meio de análise de dependência"],"ru":["Автоматизировать задачи назначения с четкой собственностью файла","Генерировать карты дорог проекта на основе `ROADMAP.md`","Отлаживать瓶 Kloпки рабочего процесса посредством анализа зависимости"],"ar":["توفير مهام التخصيص مع ملكية الملفات واضحة","توليد خرائط الطريق للمشروع بناءً على `ROADMAP.md`","تصحيح أخطاء تحديد العوائق في سير العمل من خلال تحليل الاعتماد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires invocation through `/workflow-team lead` or `/workflow-team teammate`","Needs access to project documentation files (`CLAUDE.md`, `PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md`, `ROADMAP.md`)"],"zh":["需要通过 `/workflow-team lead` 或 `/workflow-team teammate` 调用","需要访问项目文档文件 (`CLAUDE.md`、`PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md`、`ROADMAP.md`)"],"ja":["`/workflow-team lead` または `/workflow-team teammate` を介して呼び出される必要がある","プロジェクト ドキュメント ファイル (`CLAUDE.md`、`PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md`、`ROADMAP.md`) にアクセスする必要がある"],"ko":["`/workflow-team lead` 또는 `/workflow-team teammate`를 통해 호출해야 합니다","프로젝트 문서 파일 (`CLAUDE.md`, `PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md`, `ROADMAP.md`)에 접근해야 합니다"],"es":["Requiere la invocación a través de `/workflow-team lead` o `/workflow-team teammate`","Necesita acceso a los archivos de documentación del proyecto (`CLAUDE.md`, `PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md`, `ROADMAP.md`)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''invocation via `/workflow-team lead` ou `/workflow-team teammate`","Nécessite l''accès aux fichiers de documentation de projet (`CLAUDE.md`, `PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md`, `ROADMAP.md`)"],"de":["Erfordert die Aufrufung über `/workflow-team lead` oder `/workflow-team teammate`","Benötigt den Zugriff auf die Projekt-Dokumentationsdateien (`CLAUDE.md`, `PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md`, `ROADMAP.md`)"],"pt":["Requer invocação por meio de `/workflow-team lead` ou `/workflow-team teammate`","Necessita acesso a arquivos de documentação do projeto (`CLAUDE.md`, `PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md`, `ROADMAP.md`)"],"ru":["Требует вызова через `/workflow-team lead` или `/workflow-team teammate`","Требует доступа к файлам документации проекта (`CLAUDE.md`, `PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md`, `ROADMAP.md`)"],"ar":["يتطلب استدعاء من خلال `/workflow-team lead` أو `/workflow-team teammate`","يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات توثيق المشروع (`CLAUDE.md` و `PROJECT-STRUCTURE.md` و `ROADMAP.md`)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
