":"Индивидуальный Фронтенд-Дизайн","ar":"تصميم واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المخصصة","en":"frontend-design"},"description":{"zh":"该技能指导创建独特的生产级前端界面，实现实用的代码，注重美观细节和创意选择","ja":"このスキルは、独自のプロダクションレベルのフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成し、実用的コードを実装し、美観の細部と創造的な選択に注目することを支援します","ko":"이 스킬은 독특한 생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성하고 실용적인 코드를 구현하며 미적인细节 및 창의적인 선택에 주목합니다","es":"Esta habilidad guía la creación de interfaces de frontend distintivas y de alta calidad, evitando estéticas genéricas","fr":"Cette compétence guide la création d''interfaces de frontend distinctives et de haute qualité, évitant les esthétiques génériques","de":"Diese Fähigkeit leitet die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten und hochwertigen Frontend-Oberflächen, vermeidet generische Ästhetik","pt":"O skill de frontend-design ajuda a criar interfaces de usuário personalizadas e de alta qualidade, evitando estéticas genéricas. Implemente código de trabalh...","ru":"Навык frontend-design помогает создавать индивидуальные и высококачественные интерфейсы пользователя, избегая.generic \"AI slop\" эстетики. Реализуйте рабочий ...","ar":"تساعد مهارة تصميم واجهة المستخدم الأمامية على إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة وعالية الجودة، وتتجنب الجماليات العامة. قم بتطبيق رمز العمل الحقيقي مع انتباه استثنائ...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建独特的生产级前端界面","实现实用的代码","注重美观细节","创意选择","支持设计特定请求","支持用户界面设计"],"ja":["独自のプロダクションレベルのフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成","実用的コードを実装","美観の細部に注目","創造的な選択","デザイン特定のリクエストをサポート","ユーザーインターフェイスの設計をサポート"],"ko":["독특한 생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성","실용적인 코드를 구현","미적인细节에 주목","창의적인 선택","디자인 특정 요청을 지원","유저 인터페이스 디자인을 지원"],"es":["Creación de interfaces de usuario personalizadas","Atención al detalle estético","Implementación de código funcional","Diseño de componentes y páginas web","Desarrollo de aplicaciones y interfaces","Opciones de personalización para el usuario"],"fr":["Création d''interfaces utilisateur sur mesure","Attention aux détails esthétiques","Mise en œuvre de code fonctionnel","Conception de composants et de pages web","Développement d''applications et d''interfaces","Options de personnalisation pour l''utilisateur"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen","Beachtung von ästhetischen Details","Implementierung von funktionsfähigem Code","Entwicklung von Komponenten und Webseiten","Entwicklung von Anwendungen und Oberflächen","Anpassungsoptionen für den Benutzer"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces de usuário personalizadas","Desenvolvimento de soluções de frontend inovadoras","Atenção excepcional aos detalhes estéticos","Implementação de código de trabalho real","Escolhas criativas e inovadoras"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных интерфейсов пользователя","Разработка инновационных решений для frontend","Исключительное внимание к деталям","Реализация рабочего кода","Творческие и инновационные решения"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","تطوير حلول واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المبتكرة","انتباه استثنائي للتفاصيل الجمالية","تطبيق رمز العمل الحقيقي","الخيارات الإبداعية والمبتكرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","生产级前端界面","实用代码","美观细节","创意选择","设计特定请求","用户界面设计","前端开发"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","プロダクションレベルのフロントエンドインターフェイス","実用的コード","美観の細部","創造的な選択","デザイン特定のリクエスト","ユーザーインターフェイスの設計","フロントエンド開発"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스","실용적인 코드","미적인细节","창의적인 선택","디자인 특정 요청","유저 인터페이스 디자인","프론트엔드 개발"],"es":["diseño de frontend","interfaces de usuario personalizadas","desarrollo web","aplicaciones móviles","experiencia del usuario","diseño de componentes","desarrollo de software","tecnologías web","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["conception de frontend","interfaces utilisateur sur mesure","développement web","applications mobiles","expérience utilisateur","conception de composants","développement de logiciels","technologies web","développement d''applications"],"de":["benutzerdefiniertes Frontend-Design","individuelle Benutzeroberflächen","Webentwicklung","mobile Anwendungen","Benutzererfahrung","Komponenten-Design","Software-Entwicklung","Web-Technologien","Anwendungs-Entwicklung"],"pt":["frontend-design","desenvolvimento de frontend","interfaces de usuário personalizadas","soluções de frontend inovadoras","código de trabalho real","detalhes estéticos","escolhas criativas"],"ru":["frontend-design","разработка frontend","индивидуальные интерфейсы пользователя","инновационные решения для frontend","рабочий код","деталям","творческие решения"],"ar":["تصميم واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","حلول واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المبتكرة","رمز العمل الحقيقي","الجماليات","الخيارات الإبداعية"]}},"owner":"seanchiuai","repo":"PRD-generator","repoPath":"seanchiuai/PRD-generator","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.409Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, or applications. Generates creative, polished code that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices. This skill is invoked when the user makes a design-specific request or when the user interface is being designed or changed.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or te","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices. This skill is invoked when the user makes a design-specific request or when the user interface is being designed or changed.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:32:56.951Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI-focused Agents needing to create production-grade, custom frontend interfaces with exceptional aesthetic details","zh":"非常适合需要创建生产级、自定义前端界面且注重细节的UI焦点代理","ja":"UI に焦点を当てたエージェントが、生産レベルのカスタム フロントエンド インターフェイスを作成する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"UI에 중점을 둔 에이전트가 생산급의 사용자 정의 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성해야 하는 경우에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes centrados en la interfaz de usuario que necesitan crear interfaces de frontend personalizadas de grado de producción con detalles estéticos excepcionales","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents axés sur l''interface utilisateur nécessitant la création d''interfaces de frontend personnalisées de niveau de production avec des détails esthétiques exceptionnels","de":"Perfekt für an die Benutzeroberfläche ausgerichtete Agenten, die benutzerdefinierte Frontend-Schnittstellen mit außergewöhnlichen ästhetischen Details im Produktionsgrad erstellen müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em UI que precisam criar interfaces de frontend personalizadas de grau de produção com detalhes estéticos excepcionais","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на UI, которым необходимо создавать производственные, индивидуальные интерфейсы frontend с исключительными эстетическими деталями","ar":"مثالي لعميل الواجهة المستخدمة الذي يحتاج إلى إنشاء واجهات أمامية مخصصة من الدرجة الإنتاجية مع تفاصيل جمالية استثنائية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate distinctive, real-world frontend code with attention to creative choices, implementing interfaces using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, and leveraging design-specific protocols like HTTP and WebSocket for dynamic interactions","zh":"赋予代理生成独特的、现实世界的前端代码，并注意创造性的选择，使用HTML、CSS和JavaScript实现接口，并利用HTTP和WebSocket等设计特定的协议实现动态交互","ja":"エージェントが独自のリアルワールド フロントエンド コードを生成できるようにし、創造的な選択に注目し、HTML、CSS、JavaScript を使用してインターフェイスを実装し、HTTP や WebSocket などのデザイン固有のプロトコルを使用してダイナミックなインタラクションを行う","ko":"에이전트가 현실 세계의 고유한 프론트엔드 코드를 생성하도록 하는데, 창의적인 선택에 주의를 기울이고 HTML, CSS 및 JavaScript를 사용하여 인터페이스를 구현하며 HTTP 및 WebSocket와 같은 디자인 특정 프로토콜을 사용하여 동적 상호 작용을 구현하는 것","es":"Habilita a los agentes para generar código de frontend distintivo y del mundo real con atención a las elecciones creativas, implementando interfaces mediante HTML, CSS y JavaScript, y aprovechando protocolos específicos de diseño como HTTP y WebSocket para interacciones dinámicas","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer du code de frontend distinctif et du monde réel en prêtant attention aux choix créatifs, en mettant en œuvre des interfaces à l''aide de HTML, CSS et JavaScript, et en exploitant des protocoles spécifiques à la conception comme HTTP et WebSocket pour des interactions dynamiques","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eigenständiges, realweltliches Frontend-Code mit Beachtung kreativer Entscheidungen zu generieren, indem sie Schnittstellen mithilfe von HTML, CSS und JavaScript implementieren und designspezifische Protokolle wie HTTP und WebSocket für dynamische Interaktionen nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar código de frontend distinto e do mundo real, com atenção às escolhas criativas, implementando interfaces usando HTML, CSS e JavaScript, e aproveitando protocolos específicos de design, como HTTP e WebSocket, para interações dinâmicas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать особый, реальный код frontend с учетом творческих выборов, реализуя интерфейсы с использованием HTML, CSS и JavaScript, и используя дизайн-специфические протоколы, такие как HTTP и WebSocket, для динамических взаимодействий","ar":"يتمكن العميل من توليد رمز واجهة استخدام متميز و 실제 مع مراعاة الاختيارات الإبداعية، وتنفيذ الواجهات باستخدام HTML و CSS و JavaScript، واستخدام بروتوكولات تصميم محددة مثل HTTP و WebSocket للتفاعلات الديناميكية"},"useCases":{"en":["Designing responsive web applications","Building custom UI components with SVG and CSS","Creating interactive frontend interfaces for web pages and applications"],"zh":["设计响应式Web应用程序","使用SVG和CSS构建自定义UI组件","为Web页面和应用程序创建交互式前端接口"],"ja":["レスポンシブ Web アプリケーションの設計","SVG と CSS を使用したカスタム UI コンポーネントの構築","Web ページおよびアプリケーションのインタラクティブ フロントエンド インターフェイスの作成"],"ko":["반응형 웹 애플리케이션 설계","SVG 및 CSS를 사용한 사용자 지정 UI 구성 요소 구축","웹 페이지 및 애플리케이션의 상호 작용형 프론트엔드 인터페이스 생성"],"es":["Diseñar aplicaciones web responsivas","Crear componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizados con SVG y CSS","Crear interfaces de frontend interactivas para páginas web y aplicaciones"],"fr":["Concevoir des applications web réactives","Créer des composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisés avec SVG et CSS","Créer des interfaces de frontend interactives pour les pages web et les applications"],"de":["Reaktive Webanwendungen entwerfen","Benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit SVG und CSS erstellen","Interaktive Frontend-Schnittstellen für Webseiten und Anwendungen erstellen"],"pt":["Projetar aplicações web responsivas","Construir componentes de UI personalizados com SVG e CSS","Criar interfaces de frontend interativas para páginas e aplicações web"],"ru":["Проектирование отзывчивых веб-приложений","Создание индивидуальных компонентов UI с помощью SVG и CSS","Создание интерактивных интерфейсов frontend для веб-страниц и приложений"],"ar":["تصميم تطبيقات ويب متجاوبة","بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة مع SVG و CSS","إنشاء واجهات أمامية تفاعلية للصفحات والتطبيقات الويب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user-provided frontend requirements and context","Limited to frontend design and development"],"zh":["需要用户提供前端要求和上下文","仅限前端设计和开发"],"ja":["ユーザーが提供するフロントエンドの要件とコンテキストが必要","フロントエンドの設計と開発のみ"],"ko":["사용자 제공 프론트엔드 요구 사항 및 컨텍스트 필요","프론트엔드 디자인 및 개발만 해당"],"es":["Requiere requisitos y contexto de frontend proporcionados por el usuario","Limitado al diseño y desarrollo de frontend"],"fr":["Nécessite des exigences et un contexte de frontend fournis par l''utilisateur","Limité à la conception et au développement de frontend"],"de":["Benötigt von Benutzern bereitgestellte Frontend-Anforderungen und -Kontext","Begrenzt auf Frontend-Design und -Entwicklung"],"pt":["Requer especificações e contexto de frontend fornecidos pelo usuário","Limitado ao design e desenvolvimento de frontend"],"ru":["Требует спецификаций и контекста frontend, предоставленных пользователем","Ограничен дизайном и разработкой frontend"],"ar":["يتطلب مواصفات و سياق واجهة استخدام أمامية مقدمة من قبل المستخدم","محدود بتصميم و تطوير واجهة استخدام أمامية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
