意选择。","ja":"このスキルは、独自のプロダクショングレードのフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成し、実際の動作コードを実装し、美的細部と創造的選択に焦点を当てます。","ko":"이 스킬은 독특한 생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성하고 실제 작동 코드를 구현하며 미적 세부 사항과 창의적 선택에 중점을 둡니다.","es":"Este skill guía la creación de interfaces de frontend personalizadas y de alta calidad","fr":"Ce skill guide la création d''interfaces de frontend sur mesure et de haute qualité","de":"Dieses Skill leitet die Erstellung benutzerdefinierter und hochwertiger Frontend-Oberflächen","pt":"Este skill orienta a criação de interfaces frontend distintas e de produção, evitando estéticas genéricas. Implemente código de trabalho real com atenção exc...","ru":"Этот навык руководит созданием отличительных и промышленных интерфейсов frontend, избегая общих эстетических решений. Реализуйте рабочий код с исключительным...","ar":"يوجه هذا المهارة إنشاء واجهات مستخدم أمامية متميزة ومنتجة، وتجنب الجماليات العامة. نفذ رمز العمل الحقيقي مع اهتمام استثنائي بال细يات الجمالية والخيارات الإبدا...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建独特的生产级前端界面","实现真实工作代码","注重美学细节和创意选择","支持多种前端组件和页面","易于使用和集成"],"ja":["独自のプロダクショングレードのフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成","実際の動作コードを実装","美的細部と創造的選択に焦点を当て","多種のフロントエンドコンポーネントとページをサポート","使用しやすく、統合が簡単"],"ko":["독특한 생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성","실제 작동 코드를 구현","미적 세부 사항과 창의적 선택에 중점을 둡니다","다양한 프론트엔드 컴포넌트와 페이지를 지원","사용하기 쉽고 통합이 간단"],"es":["Creación de interfaces de usuario personalizadas","Atención al detalle y opciones creativas","Implementación de código de trabajo real","Diseño de componentes, páginas y aplicaciones","Consideración del propósito, audiencia y contexto"],"fr":["Conception d''interfaces utilisateur sur mesure","Attention aux détails et options créatives","Mise en œuvre de code de travail réel","Conception de composants, pages et applications","Prise en compte du but, du public et du contexte"],"de":["Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Benutzeroberflächen","Aufmerksamkeit für Details und kreative Optionen","Implementierung von echtem Arbeitscode","Design von Komponenten, Seiten und Anwendungen","Berücksichtigung des Zwecks, der Zielgruppe und des Kontexts"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces frontend personalizadas","Atenção aos detalhes estéticos e criativos","Implementação de código de trabalho real","Desenvolvimento de componentes, páginas e aplicações web","Otimização para experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных интерфейсов frontend","Внимание к эстетическим деталям и творческим решениям","Реализация рабочего кода","Разработка компонентов, страниц и веб-приложений","Оптимизация для пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات المستخدم الأمامية المخصصة","اهتمام بال细يات الجمالية والخيارات الإبداعية","تنفيذ رمز العمل الحقيقي","تطوير المكونات والصفحات والتطبيقات الويب","تحسين لتحقيق تجربة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","生产级前端界面","美学细节","创意选择","真实工作代码","前端组件","页面设计"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","プロダクショングレードのフロントエンドインターフェイス","美的細部","創造的選択","実際の動作コード","フロントエンドコンポーネント","ページデザイン"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스","미적 세부 사항","창의적 선택","실제 작동 코드","프론트엔드 컴포넌트","페이지 디자인"],"es":["diseño de frontend","interfaces de usuario personalizadas","desarrollo de frontend","creación de interfaces de usuario","diseño de componentes","desarrollo de aplicaciones web"],"fr":["conception de frontend","interfaces utilisateur sur mesure","développement de frontend","création d''interfaces utilisateur","conception de composants","développement d''applications web"],"de":["Frontend-Design","benutzerdefinierte Benutzeroberflächen","Frontend-Entwicklung","Erstellung von Benutzeroberflächen","Design von Komponenten","Entwicklung von Webanwendungen"],"pt":["desenvolvimento frontend","interfaces personalizadas","experiência do usuário","design frontend","desenvolvimento web","aplicações web","componentes frontend","páginas web"],"ru":["разработка frontend","индивидуальные интерфейсы","пользовательский опыт","дизайн frontend","веб-разработка","веб-приложения","компоненты frontend","веб-страницы"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات المستخدم الأمامية","تطوير الويب","تطبيقات الويب","مكونات واجهات المستخدم الأمامية","صفحات الويب","تجربة المستخدم","تصميم واجهات المستخدم الأمامية","تطوير تطبيقات الويب"]}},"owner":"seanchiuai","repo":"path-finder","repoPath":"seanchiuai/path-finder","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.409Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, or applications. Generates creative, polished code that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices. This skill is invoked when the user makes a design-specific request or when the user interface is being designed or changed.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or te","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices. This skill is invoked when the user makes a design-specific request or when the user interface is being designed or changed.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:32:58.605Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Visual AI Agents requiring production-grade frontend interface creation with attention to aesthetic details.","zh":"适合需要生产级前端接口创建的视觉AI代理，且注重美学细节。","ja":"ビジュアルAIエージェントが美的詳細に注目したプロダクショングレードのフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"시각적 인공지능 에이전트가 생산급 프론트엔드 인터페이스 생성을 필요로하며, 미적 세부사항에 주의를 기울이는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA Visuales que requieren la creación de una interfaz de usuario de frontend de grado de producción con atención a los detalles estéticos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA Visuels nécessitant la création d''une interface frontend de production de grade avec attention aux détails esthétiques.","de":"Ideal für Visuelle KI-Agenten, die eine produktionssreife Frontend-Oberfläche mit Aufmerksamkeit auf ästhetische Details erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Visuais que exigem a criação de interfaces de frontend de produção com atenção aos detalhes estéticos.","ru":"Идеально для визуальных агентов ИИ, требующих создания производственных интерфейсов frontend с учетом эстетических деталей.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإلكترونيين الذين يتطلبون إنشاء واجهة مستخدم أمامية من الدرجة الإنتاجية مع اهتمام بال细یات الجمالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft distinctive, custom frontend designs using real working code, incorporating creative choices and avoiding generic aesthetics, all while leveraging HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to implement responsive and interactive interfaces.","zh":"赋予代理创建独特的自定义前端设计的能力，使用真实的工作代码，融入创造性的选择，避免通用美学，同时利用HTML、CSS和JavaScript来实现响应式和交互式接口。","ja":"エージェントに独自のカスタムフロントエンドデザインを作成する能力を与え、実際の動作コードを使用し、創造的な選択を組み込み、汎用的な美学を回避し、同時にHTML、CSS、JavaScriptを使用してレスポンシブでインタラクティブなインターフェイスを実装する。","ko":"에이전트가 고유한 맞춤형 프론트엔드 디자인을 만들 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 실제 작동 코드를 사용하고 창의적인 선택을 통합하며 일반적인 미학을 피하며 HTML, CSS, JavaScript를 사용하여 반응형 및 상호 작용형 인터페이스를 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear diseños de frontend personalizados y distintivos utilizando código real que funcione, incorporando elecciones creativas y evitando estéticas genéricas, todo mientras aprovecha HTML, CSS y JavaScript para implementar interfaces responsivas e interactivas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des conceptions de frontend personnalisées et distinctives en utilisant du code réel qui fonctionne, en incorporant des choix créatifs et en évitant des esthétiques génériques, le tout en exploitant HTML, CSS et JavaScript pour mettre en œuvre des interfaces réactives et interactives.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, einzigartige und maßgeschneiderte Frontend-Designs zu erstellen, indem sie echten Arbeitscode verwenden, kreative Entscheidungen einbeziehen und generische Ästhetik vermeiden, und zwar indem sie HTML, CSS und JavaScript nutzen, um responsive und interaktive Oberflächen umzusetzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar designs de frontend personalizados e distintos usando código real em funcionamento, incorporando escolhas criativas e evitando estéticas genéricas, tudo isso aproveitando HTML, CSS e JavaScript para implementar interfaces responsivas e interativas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать отличительные, индивидуальные дизайны frontend с помощью рабочего кода, включающего творческие решения и избегающего общих эстетических решений, все это при помощи HTML, CSS и JavaScript для реализации отзывчивых и интерактивных интерфейсов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم واجهات مستخدم أمامية مخصصة ومتميزة باستخدام رمز يعمل، ويتضمن خيارات إبداعية وتجنب جماليات عامة، وكل هذا مع الاستفادة من HTML و CSS و JavaScript لتنفيذ واجهات مستجدة وتفاعلية."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing bespoke component libraries for web applications","Generating production-ready page layouts with exceptional attention to detail","Creating custom, interactive frontend interfaces for unique user experiences"],"zh":["为Web应用程序设计定制的组件库","生成具有异常细节关注的生产就绪页面布局","为独特的用户体验创建自定义的交互式前端接口"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションのためのカスタムコンポーネントライブラリを設計する","例外的な詳細に注目したプロダクションレディページレイアウトを生成する","ユニークなユーザーエクスペリエンスのためのカスタムインタラクティブフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成する"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 맞춤형 구성 요소 라이브러리 설계","예외적인 세부 사항에 주의를 기울인 생산 준비 페이지 레이아웃 생성","유니크한 사용자 경험을 위한 맞춤형 상호 작용형 프론트엔드 인터페이스 생성"],"es":["Diseñar bibliotecas de componentes personalizadas para aplicaciones web","Generar diseños de página listos para la producción con una atención excepcional al detalle","Crear interfaces de frontend personalizadas e interactivas para experiencias de usuario únicas"],"fr":["Concevoir des bibliothèques de composants sur mesure pour les applications web","Générer des dispositions de page prêtes pour la production avec une attention exceptionnelle aux détails","Créer des interfaces frontend personnalisées et interactives pour des expériences utilisateur uniques"],"de":["Entwerfen von maßgeschneiderten Komponentenbibliotheken für Webanwendungen","Erzeugen von produktionsreifen Seiteneinrichtungen mit außergewöhnlicher Aufmerksamkeit für Details","Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten, interaktiven Frontend-Oberflächen für einzigartige Benutzeroberflächen"],"pt":["Projeto de bibliotecas de componentes personalizadas para aplicações web","Geração de layouts de página prontos para produção com atenção excepcional aos detalhes","Criação de interfaces de frontend interativas personalizadas para experiências de usuário únicas"],"ru":["Проектирование индивидуальных библиотек компонентов для веб-приложений","Генерация готовых к производству макетов страниц с исключительным вниманием к деталям","Создание индивидуальных интерактивных интерфейсов frontend для уникальных пользовательских trải nghiệm"],"ar":["تصميم مكتبات مكونات مخصصة لتطبيقات الويب","إنشاء تخطيطات صفحة جاهزة للإنتاج مع اهتمام استثنائي بال细یات","إنشاء واجهات مستخدم أمامية تفاعلية مخصصة لتجارب مستخدم فريدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user-provided frontend requirements and context","Dependent on agent''s ability to interpret design-specific requests"],"zh":["需要用户提供的前端要求和上下文","依赖于代理解释设计特定请求的能力"],"ja":["ユーザー提供のフロントエンド要件とコンテキストが必要","エージェントのデザイン固有のリクエストを解釈する能力に依存する"],"ko":["사용자 제공의 프론트엔드 요구 사항 및 컨텍스트 필요","에이전트의 디자인 관련 요청을 해석하는 능력에 의존"],"es":["Requiere requisitos y contexto de frontend proporcionados por el usuario","Depende de la capacidad del agente para interpretar solicitudes de diseño específicas"],"fr":["Nécessite des exigences et un contexte de frontend fournis par l''utilisateur","Dépend de la capacité de l''agent à interpréter des demandes de conception spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt von den Benutzern bereitgestellte Frontend-Anforderungen und Kontext","Hängt von der Fähigkeit des Agents ab, designspezifische Anfragen zu interpretieren"],"pt":["Exige requisitos e contexto de frontend fornecidos pelo usuário","Depende da capacidade do agente de interpretar solicitações específicas de design"],"ru":["Требует предоставления пользователями требований и контекста frontend","Зависит от способности агента интерпретировать дизайн-специфические запросы"],"ar":["يتطلب متطلبات وسياق واجهة مستخدم أمامية مقدمة من قبل المستخدم","يعتمد على قدرة الوكيل على تفسير الطلبات المحددة التصميم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
