ción de código de producción","Atención al detalle estético","Opciones creativas para el diseño","Desarrollo de componentes y páginas"],"fr":["Création d''interfaces personnalisées","Mise en œuvre de code de production","Attention aux détails esthétiques","Options créatives pour la conception","Développement de composants et de pages"],"de":["Erstellung maßgeschneiderter Interfaces","Implementierung von Produktionscode","Aufmerksamkeit für ästhetische Details","Kreative Optionen für das Design","Entwicklung von Komponenten und Seiten"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces de usuário personalizadas","Desenvolvimento de código de trabalho real","Atenção excepcional aos detalhes estéticos","Escolhas criativas para melhorar a experiência do usuário","Suporte para aplicações web e móveis"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных пользовательских интерфейсов","Разработка рабочего кода","Исключительное внимание к деталям","Творческие решения для улучшения опыта пользователя","Поддержка веб- и мобильных приложений"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","تحقيق كود العمل الحقيقي","الانتباه الاستثنائي للتفاصيل الجمالية","الخيارات الإبداعية لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","دعم تطبيقات الويب والجوال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","生产级界面","AI风格","真实工作代码","美观细节","设计特定请求","用户界面设计"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","プロダクショングレードインターフェース","AIスタイル","実際の動作コード","美観の細部","設計特定のリクエスト","ユーザーインターフェース設計"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","생산급 인터페이스","AI 스타일","실제 동작 코드","미학적 세부 사항","디자인 특정 요청","사용자 인터페이스 디자인"],"es":["diseño frontend","interfaces de usuario","desarrollo web","código de producción","detalles estéticos","opciones creativas","componentes personalizados"],"fr":["conception frontend","interfaces utilisateur","développement web","code de production","détails esthétiques","options créatives","composants personnalisés"],"de":["Frontend-Design","Benutzeroberflächen","Webentwicklung","Produktionscode","ästhetische Details","kreative Optionen","maßgeschneiderte Komponenten"],"pt":["frontend-design","desenvolvimento de frontend","interfaces de usuário personalizadas","código de trabalho real","experiência do usuário","aplicações web","aplicações móveis"],"ru":["фронтенд-дизайн","разработка фронтенда","индивидуальные пользовательские интерфейсы","рабочий код","опыт пользователя","веб-приложения","мобильные приложения"],"ar":["تصميم واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","تنمية واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","كود العمل الحقيقي","تجربة المستخدم","تطبيقات الويب","تطبيقات الجوال"]}},"owner":"seanchiuai","repo":"bookmarkai","repoPath":"seanchiuai/bookmarkai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.409Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, or applications. Generates creative, polished code that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices. This skill is invoked when the user makes a design-specific request or when the user interface is being designed or changed.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or te","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices. This skill is invoked when the user makes a design-specific request or when the user interface is being designed or changed.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:33:11.062Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Visual AI Agents requiring production-grade frontend interface creation with attention to aesthetic details.","zh":"适合需要生产级前端界面创建并注重美观细节的视觉AI代理。","ja":"美観の細部に注意した生産性の高いフロントエンドインターフェイス作成を必要とするビジュアルAIエージェントに最適。","ko":"생산성 높은 프론트엔드 인터페이스 생성과 미적 세부 사항에 주의를 필요로 하는 시각적 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Visuales que requieren la creación de interfaz de usuario de frontend de grado de producción con atención a los detalles estéticos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA visuels nécessitant la création d''une interface frontend de production de grade supérieur avec attention aux détails esthétiques.","de":"Ideal für visuelle KI-Agents, die eine Produktion von Frontend-Schnittstellen mit Beachtung von ästhetischen Details erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Inteligência Artificial Visuais que requerem a criação de interface de frontend de produção com atenção aos detalhes estéticos.","ru":"Идеально для визуальных агентов ИИ, требующих создания интерфейса frontend производственного класса с учетом эстетических деталей.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي البصري الذين يتطلبون إنشاء واجهة أمامية من الدرجة الإنتاجية مع اهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft distinctive, real working code for frontend interfaces, incorporating exceptional aesthetic choices and implementing protocols like HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript, while avoiding generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics, and utilizing file formats such as .svg for vector graphics.","zh":"赋予代理人创建独特的、真正可用的前端界面代码的能力，融入异常的美学选择并实施HTML5、CSS3和JavaScript等协议，同时避免通用的''AI乱码''美学，并利用.svg等文件格式进行矢量图形。","ja":"代理は、HTML5、CSS3、JavaScriptなどのプロトコルを実装し、優れた美的選択を取り入れ、汎用的な「AI汚れ」の美学を避け、.svgなどのファイル形式を使用してベクターグラフィックスを作成することで、独自の実際に動作するフロントエンドインターフェイスのコードを作成する能力を有します。","ko":"에이전트가 독특한 실제 작동하는 코드를 프론트엔드 인터페이스에 대한 예외적인 미적 선택을 통합하고 HTML5, CSS3 및 JavaScript와 같은 프로토콜을 구현하며 일반적인 ''AI 지저분함'' 미학을 피하고 벡터 그래픽을 위한 .svg와 같은 파일 형식을 사용하여 프론트엔드 인터페이스에 대한 코드를 만들 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear código de trabajo real y distintivo para interfaces de frontend, incorporando opciones estéticas excepcionales e implementando protocolos como HTML5, CSS3 y JavaScript, evitando al mismo tiempo la estética genérica de ''suciedad de IA'' y utilizando formatos de archivo como .svg para gráficos vectoriales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer un code de travail réel et distinctif pour les interfaces frontend, incorporant des choix esthétiques exceptionnels et mettant en œuvre des protocoles tels que HTML5, CSS3 et JavaScript, tout en évitant l''esthétique générique de ''slop d''IA'' et en utilisant des formats de fichier tels que .svg pour les graphiques vectoriels.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, einzigartigen, funktionierenden Code für Frontend-Schnittstellen zu erstellen, der außergewöhnliche ästhetische Entscheidungen beinhaltet und Protokolle wie HTML5, CSS3 und JavaScript implementiert, während gleichzeitig die generische ''KI-Schweinerei''-Ästhetik vermieden wird und Dateiformate wie .svg für Vektorgrafiken verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar código de trabalho real e distinto para interfaces de frontend, incorporando escolhas estéticas excepcionais e implementando protocolos como HTML5, CSS3 e JavaScript, evitando ao mesmo tempo estéticas genéricas de ''slop'' de IA e utilizando formatos de arquivo como .svg para gráficos vetoriais.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать реальный, отличный от других код для интерфейсов frontend, включающий исключительные эстетические выборы и реализацию протоколов như HTML5, CSS3 и JavaScript, избегая при этом.generic ''сlop'' эстетики ИИ и используя форматы файлов seperti .svg для векторной графики.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء код فعّال حقيقي ومميز ل_interfaces frontend، متضمّنًا خيارات جمالية استثنائية وتنفيذ بروتوكولات مثل HTML5 و CSS3 و JavaScript، وتجنب في الوقت نفسه جماليات ''سلو'' الإصطناعي العام وتحقيق تنسيقات الملفات مثل .svg للرسومات المتجهة."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing responsive web application interfaces","Generating custom UI components with precise aesthetic control","Building production-grade single-page applications with modern frontend frameworks"],"zh":["设计响应式网页应用程序接口","生成自定义UI组件，具有精确的美观控制","使用现代前端框架构建生产级单页应用程序"],"ja":["レスポンシブウェブアプリケーションインターフェイスの設計","カスタムUIコンポーネントの生成、正確な美観制御","モダンなフロントエンドフレームワークを使用した生産性の高いシングルページアプリケーションの構築"],"ko":["응답형 웹 애플리케이션 인터페이스 