ами в проектах","Многократное использование кода","Документация и поддержка"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات معزولة","إدارة التبعيات","مشاركة المكونات في المشاريع","إعادة استخدام الكود","التوثيق والدعم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex 组件","Convex 组件作者化","可重用组件","依赖管理","导出","跨项目共享"],"ja":["Convex コンポーネント","Convex コンポーネント作成","再利用可能なコンポーネント","依存関係管理","エクスポート","プロジェクト間の共有"],"ko":["Convex 컴포넌트","Convex 컴포넌트 작성","재사용 가능한 컴포넌트","의존성 관리","내보내기","프로젝트 간 공유"],"es":["componentes Convex","creación de componentes","reutilización de componentes","aislamiento de componentes","gestión de dependencias","desarrollo de software","Convex"],"fr":["composants Convex","création de composants","réutilisation de composants","isolation de composants","gestion de dépendances","développement de logiciel","Convex"],"de":["Convex-Komponenten","Erstellung von Komponenten","Wiederverwendung von Komponenten","Isolation von Komponenten","Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Software-Entwicklung","Convex"],"pt":["componentes convex","criação de componentes","reutilização de código","gerenciamento de dependências","compartilhamento de componentes","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["компоненты convex","создание компонентов","многократное использование кода","управление зависимостями","обмен компонентами","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مكونات convex","إنشاء مكونات","إعادة استخدام الكود","إدارة التبعيات","مشاركة المكونات","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"LucaDeLeo","repo":"alignment-journal","repoPath":"LucaDeLeo/alignment-journal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.409Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convex-component-authoring","description":"How to create, structure, and publish self-contained Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","components","reusable","packages","npm"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex component","body":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex components are self-contained packages that include:\n- Database tables (isolated from the main app)\n- Functions (queries, mutations, actions)\n- TypeScript types and validators\n- Optional frontend hooks\n\n### Component Structure\n\n```\nmy-convex-component/\n├── package.json\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── README.md\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts           # Main exports\n│   ├── component.ts       # Component definition\n│   ├── schema.ts          # Component schema\n│   └── functions/\n│       ├── queries.ts\n│       ├── mutations.ts\n│       └── actions.ts\n└── convex.config.ts       # Component configuration\n```\n\n### Creating a Component\n\n#### 1. Component Configuration\n\n```typescript\n// convex.config.ts\nimport { defineComponent } from \"convex/server\";\n\nexport default defineComponent(\"myComponent\");\n```\n\n#### 2. Component Schema\n\n```typescript\n// src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  // Tables are isolated to this component\n  items: defineTable({\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  }).index(\"by_name\", [\"name\"]),\n  \n  config: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    value: v.any(),\n  }).index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"]),\n});\n```\n\n#### 3. Component Definition\n\n```typescript\n// src/component.ts\nimport { defineComponent, ComponentDefinition } from \"convex/server\";\nimport schema from \"./schema\";\nimport * as queries from \"./functions/queries\";\nimport * as mutations from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\nconst component = defineComponent(\"myComponent\", {\n  schema,\n  functions: {\n    ...queries,\n    ...mutations,\n  },\n});\n\nexport default component;\n```\n\n#### 4. Component Functions\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/queries.ts\nimport { query } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const list = query({\n  args: {\n    limit: v.optional(v.number()),\n  },\n  returns: v.array(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  })),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .take(args.limit ?? 10);\n  },\n});\n\nexport const get = query({\n  args: { name: v.string() },\n  returns: v.union(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  }), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_name\", (q) => q.eq(\"name\", args.name))\n      .unique();\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const create = mutation({\n  args: {\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"items\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"items\", {\n      name: args.name,\n      data: args.data,\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n\nexport const update = mutation({\n  args: {\n    id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.patch(args.id, { data: args.data });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\nexport const remove = mutation({\n  args: { id: v.id(\"items\") },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.delete(args.id);\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n#### 5. Main Exports\n\n```typescript\n// src/index.ts\nexport { default as component } from \"./component\";\nexport * from \"./functions/queries\";\nexport * from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\n// Export types for consumers\nexport type { Id } from \"./_generated/dataModel\";\n```\n\n### Using a Component\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"myComponent\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s code\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction MyApp() {\n  // Access component functions through the app''s API\n  const items = useQuery(api.myComponent.list, { limit: 10 });\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.myComponent.create);\n  \n  return (\n    <div>\n      {items?.map((item) => (\n        <div key={item._id}>{item.name}</div>\n      ))}\n      <button onClick={() => createItem({ name: \"New\", data: {} })}>\n        Add Item\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Component Configuration Options\n\n```typescript\n// convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\n// Basic usage\napp.use(myComponent);\n\n// With custom name\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"customName\" });\n\n// Multiple instances\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance1\" });\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance2\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n### Providing Component Hooks\n\n```typescript\n// src/hooks.ts\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { FunctionReference } from \"convex/server\";\n\n// Type-safe hooks for component consumers\nexport function useMyComponent(api: {\n  list: FunctionReference<\"query\">;\n  create: FunctionReference<\"mutation\">;\n}) {\n  const items = useQuery(api.list, {});\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.create);\n  \n  return {\n    items,\n    createItem,\n    isLoading: items === undefined,\n  };\n}\n```\n\n### Publishing a Component\n\n#### package.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-convex-component\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"A reusable Convex component\",\n  \"main\": \"dist/index.js\",\n  \"types\": \"dist/index.d.ts\",\n  \"files\": [\n    \"dist\",\n    \"convex.config.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"tsc\",\n    \"prepublishOnly\": \"npm run build\"\n  },\n  \"peerDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.17.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"convex\",\n    \"component\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n#### tsconfig.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2020\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"declaration\": true,\n    \"outDir\": \"dist\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src/**/*\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Rate Limiter Component\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  requests: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    timestamp: v.number(),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"])\n    .index(\"by_key_and_time\", [\"key\", \"timestamp\"]),\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const checkLimit = mutation({\n  args: {\n    key: v.string(),\n    limit: v.number(),\n    windowMs: v.number(),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({\n    allowed: v.boolean(),\n    remaining: v.number(),\n    resetAt: v.number(),\n  }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const now = Date.now();\n    const windowStart = now - args.windowMs;\n    \n    // Clean old entries\n    const oldEntries = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key_and_time\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"key\", args.key).lt(\"timestamp\", windowStart)\n      )\n      .collect();\n    \n    for (const entry of oldEntries) {\n      await ctx.db.delete(entry._id);\n    }\n    \n    // Count current window\n    const currentRequests = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key\", (q) => q.eq(\"key\", args.key))\n      .collect();\n    \n    const remaining = Math.max(0, args.limit - currentRequests.length);\n    const allowed = remaining > 0;\n    \n    if (allowed) {\n      await ctx.db.insert(\"requests\", {\n        key: args.key,\n        timestamp: now,\n      });\n    }\n    \n    const oldestRequest = currentRequests[0];\n    const resetAt = oldestRequest \n      ? oldestRequest.timestamp + args.windowMs \n      : now + args.windowMs;\n    \n    return { allowed, remaining: remaining - (allowed ? 1 : 0), resetAt };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// Usage in consuming app\nimport { useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction useRateLimitedAction() {\n  const checkLimit = useMutation(api.rateLimiter.checkLimit);\n  \n  return async (action: () => Promise<void>) => {\n    const result = await checkLimit({\n      key: \"user-action\",\n      limit: 10,\n      windowMs: 60000,\n    });\n    \n    if (!result.allowed) {\n      throw new Error(`Rate limited. Try again at ${new Date(result.resetAt)}`);\n    }\n    \n    await action();\n  };\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Keep component tables isolated (don''t reference main app tables)\n- Export clear TypeScript types for consumers\n- Document all public functions and their arguments\n- Use semantic versioning for component releases\n- Include comprehensive README with examples\n- Test components in isolation before publishing\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Cross-referencing tables** - Component tables should be self-contained\n2. **Missing type exports** - Export all necessary types\n3. **Hardcoded configuration** - Use component options for customization\n4. **No versioning** - Follow semantic versioning\n5. **Poor documentation** - Document all public APIs\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Components: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:33:29.995Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents needing reusable and modular Convex components for efficient project sharing and collaboration.","zh":"适合需要可重用和模块化 Convex 组件的高级 AI 代理，以实现高效的项目共享和协作。","ja":"再利用可能でモジュラーな Convex コンポーネントを必要とする高度な AI エージェントに適しています。プロジェクトの共有とコラボレーションを効率的に行うことができます。","ko":"재사용 및 모듈화 가능한 Convex 구성 요소를 필요로 하는 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합하여 프로젝트 공유 및 협력을 효율적으로 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA avanzados que necesitan componentes Convex reutilizables y modulares para compartir y colaborar en proyectos de manera eficiente.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA avancés ayant besoin de composants Convex réutilisables et modulaires pour un partage de projet et une collaboration efficaces.","de":"Perfekt für fortgeschrittene KI-Agenten, die wiederverwendbare und modulare Convex-Komponenten für effizientes Projekt-Sharing und Zusammenarbeit benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Avançados que precisam de componentes Convex reutilizáveis e modulares para compartilhamento de projetos eficiente e colaboração.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов ИИ, которым необходимы многократно используемые и модульные компоненты Convex для эффективного обмена проектами и сотрудничества.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتقدم الذي يحتاج إلى مكونات Convex قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام ومتوافرة لتقاسم المشاريع بكفاءة وتعاون."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create self-contained Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management, utilizing the latest documentation from https://docs.convex.dev/components and https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring for seamless integration and sharing across projects.","zh":"赋予代理创建具有适当隔离、导出和依赖管理的自包含 Convex 组件的能力，利用 https://docs.convex.dev/components 和 https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring 的最新文档实现无缝集成和跨项目共享。","ja":"エージェントが適切な分離、エクスポート、依存関係管理を備えたセルフコンテンド Convex コンポーネントを作成できるようにし、https://docs.convex.dev/components および https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring の最新ドキュメントを使用して、シームレスな統合とプロジェクト間の共有を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 적절한 격리, 내보내기 및 종속성 관리를 갖춘 자체 포함 Convex 구성 요소를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 https://docs.convex.dev/components 및 https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring의 최신 문서를 사용하여 무제한 통합 및 프로젝트 간 공유를 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear componentes Convex autónomos con un aislamiento adecuado, exportaciones y gestión de dependencias, utilizando la documentación más reciente de https://docs.convex.dev/components y https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring para una integración y compartición perfectas entre proyectos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants Convex autonomes avec un isolement approprié, des exports et une gestion des dépendances, en utilisant la dernière documentation de https://docs.convex.dev/components et https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring pour une intégration et un partage transparents entre les projets.","de":"Ermöglicht Agenten die Erstellung eigenständiger Convex-Komponenten mit ordnungsgemäßer Isolation, Exporten und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung unter Verwendung der neuesten Dokumentation von https://docs.convex.dev/components und https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring für nahtlose Integration und Freigabe über Projekte hinweg.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes Convex autossuficientes com isolamento adequado, exportações e gerenciamento de dependências, utilizando a documentação mais recente de https://docs.convex.dev/components e https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring para integração e compartilhamento sem problemas em projetos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать самодостаточные компоненты Convex с правильной изоляцией, экспортами и управлением зависимостями, используя последнюю документацию с https://docs.convex.dev/components и https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring для беспрепятственной интеграции и обмена между проектами.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مكونات Convex محددة الذات مع عزل مناسب وتصدير وإدارة التبعيات، باستخدام أحدث وثائق من https://docs.convex.dev/components و https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring من أجل التكامل والتبادل السلس بين المشاريع."},"useCases":{"en":["Authoring reusable Convex components for sharing across multiple projects","Implementing proper dependency management for Convex components","Creating self-contained Convex components with exports for efficient collaboration"],"zh":["为跨多个项目共享而创建可重用 Convex 组件","为 Convex 组件实现适当的依赖管理","创建具有导出功能的自包含 Convex 组件以实现高效协作"],"ja":["複数のプロジェクトで共有するために再利用可能な Convex コンポーネントを作成する","Convex コンポーネントの依存関係管理を適切に実装する","エクスポート機能を備えたセルフコンテンド Convex コンポーネントを作成して効率的なコラボレーションを実現する"],"ko":["여러 프로젝트에서 공유하기 위해 재사용 가능한 Convex 구성 요소를 생성하는 것","Convex 구성 요소에 대한 적절한 종속성 관리를 구현하는 것","내보내기 기능을 갖춘 자체 포함 Convex 구성 요소를 생성하여 효율적인 협力を 구현하는 것"],"es":["Creación de componentes Convex reutilizables para compartir en múltiples proyectos","Implementación de una gestión de dependencias adecuada para componentes Convex","Creación de componentes Convex autónomos con exportaciones para una colaboración eficiente"],"fr":["Création de composants Convex réutilisables à partager sur plusieurs projets","Mise en œuvre d''une gestion des dépendances appropriée pour les composants Convex","Création de composants Convex autonomes avec des exports pour une collaboration efficace"],"de":["Erstellung wiederverwendbarer Convex-Komponenten zur Freigabe in mehreren Projekten","Implementierung einer ordnungsgemäßen Abhängigkeitsverwaltung für Convex-Komponenten","Erstellung eigenständiger Convex-Komponenten mit Exporten für eine effiziente Zusammenarbeit"],"pt":["Criação de componentes Convex reutilizáveis para compartilhamento entre vários projetos","Implementação de gerenciamento de dependência adequado para componentes Convex","Criação de componentes Convex autossuficientes com exportações para colaboração eficiente"],"ru":["Создание многократно используемых компонентов Convex для обмена между несколькими проектами","Реализация правильного управления зависимостями для компонентов Convex","Создание самодостаточных компонентов Convex с экспортами для эффективного сотрудничества"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات Convex قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لمشاركتها بين مشاريع متعددة","تطبيق إدارة التبعيات المناسبة لمكونات Convex","إنشاء مكونات Convex محددة الذات مع تصدير للتعاون الفعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the latest Convex documentation","Dependent on Convex component authoring guidelines","Needs proper understanding of Convex components and their applications"],"zh":["需要访问 Convex 的最新文档","依赖于 Convex 组件创作指南","需要正确理解 Convex 组件及其应用"],"ja":["Convex の最新ドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","Convex コンポーネントの作成ガイドラインに依存している","Convex コンポーネントとその応用について正しく理解する必要がある"],"ko":["Convex의 최신 문서에 액세스해야 함","Convex 구성 요소 작성 지침에 종속됨","Convex 구성 요소 및 해당 응용 프로그램을 올바르게 이해해야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación más reciente de Convex","Depende de las directrices de creación de componentes Convex","Necesita una comprensión adecuada de los componentes Convex y sus aplicaciones"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation la plus récente de Convex","Dépend des directives de création de composants Convex","Nécessite une compréhension appropriée des composants Convex et de leurs applications"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die neueste Convex-Dokumentation","Abhängig von den Richtlinien zur Erstellung von Convex-Komponenten","Erfordert ein angemessenes Verständnis von Convex-Komponenten und deren Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige acesso à documentação mais recente do Convex","Depende das diretrizes de criação de componentes Convex","Necessita de compreensão adequada dos componentes Convex e suas aplicações"],"ru":["Требует доступа к последней документации Convex","Зависит от руководящих принципов создания компонентов Convex","Требует правильного понимания компонентов Convex и их применения"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى أحدث وثائق Convex","يعتمد على إرشادات إنشاء مكونات Convex","يحتاج إلى فهم مناسب لمكونات Convex وتطبيقاتها"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
