、再利用可能なコンポーネントを構築してプロジェクト間で共有できます","ko":"Convex 컴포넌트 작성은 프로젝트 간에 공유할 수 있는 자체 포함 및 재사용 가능한 컴포넌트를 생성할 수 있습니다","es":"Convex Component Authoring permite crear componentes reutilizables con aislamiento y gestión de dependencias adecuados.","fr":"La création de composants Convex permet de créer des composants réutilisables avec un isolement et une gestion des dépendances appropriés.","de":"Die Erstellung von Convex-Komponenten ermöglicht die Erstellung von wiederverwendbaren Komponenten mit ordnungsgemäßer Isolation und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung.","pt":"Crie componentes Convex autocontidos e reutilizáveis com isolamento, exportação e gerenciamento de dependências adequados.","ru":"Создайте самодостаточные и переиспользуемые компоненты Convex с правильной изоляцией, экспортом и управлением зависимостями.","ar":"إنشاء مكونات Convex محتوية بذاتها وقابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع العزل والتصدير وإدارة التبعيات المناسبة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建自包含的 Convex 组件","实现组件的重用","支持依赖管理","提供组件导出","确保组件的隔离","支持跨项目共享"],"ja":["再利用可能な Convex コンポーネントの構築","コンポーネントの再利用","依存関係管理のサポート","コンポーネントのエクスポート","コンポーネントの隔離","プロジェクト間の共有のサポート"],"ko":["자체 포함 Convex 컴포넌트 생성","컴포넌트 재사용","의존성 관리 지원","컴포넌트 내보내기","컴포넌트 격리","프로젝트 간 공유 지원"],"es":["Creación de componentes reutilizables","Aislamiento adecuado","Exportación y gestión de dependencias","Compatibilidad con proyectos múltiples","Documentación detallada"],"fr":["Création de composants réutilisables","Isolement approprié","Exportation et gestion des dépendances","Compatibilité avec plusieurs projets","Documentation détaillée"],"de":["Erstellung von wiederverwendbaren Komponenten","Ordungsgemäße Isolation","Export und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Projekten","Detaillierte Dokumentation"],"pt":["Criação de componentes autocontidos","Isolamento de componentes","Exportação de componentes","Gerenciamento de dependências","Reutilização de componentes","Compartilhamento de componentes entre projetos"],"ru":["Создание самодостаточных компонентов","Изоляция компонентов","Экспорт компонентов","Управление зависимостями","Переиспользование компонентов","Обмен компонентами между проектами"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات محتوية بذاتها","عزل المكونات","تصدير المكونات","إدارة التبعيات","إعادة استخدام المكونات","مشاركة المكونات بين المشاريع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex 组件创建","可重用组件","组件作者","Convex 开发","组件管理","依赖管理","组件导出","组件隔离"],"ja":["Convex コンポーネント著作","再利用可能なコンポーネント","コンポーネント著者","Convex 開発","コンポーネント管理","依存関係管理","コンポーネントエクスポート","コンポーネント隔離"],"ko":["Convex 컴포넌트 작성","재사용 가능한 컴포넌트","컴포넌트 작성자","Convex 개발","컴포넌트 관리","의존성 관리","컴포넌트 내보내기","컴포넌트 격리"],"es":["Convex Component Authoring","componentes reutilizables","aislamiento","gestión de dependencias","proyectos múltiples","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Création de composants Convex","composants réutilisables","isolement","gestion des dépendances","projets multiples","développement de logiciels"],"de":["Erstellung von Convex-Komponenten","wiederverwendbare Komponenten","Isolation","Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","mehrere Projekte","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["componentes Convex","criação de componentes","reutilização de componentes","isolamento de componentes","exportação de componentes","gerenciamento de dependências","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["компоненты Convex","создание компонентов","переиспользование компонентов","изоляция компонентов","экспорт компонентов","управление зависимостями","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مكونات Convex","إنشاء مكونات","إعادة استخدام المكونات","عزل المكونات","تصدير المكونات","إدارة التبعيات","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"benfwalla","repo":"things-to-be-happy-about","repoPath":"benfwalla/things-to-be-happy-about","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.409Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convex-component-authoring","description":"How to create, structure, and publish self-contained Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","components","reusable","packages","npm"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex component","body":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex components are self-contained packages that include:\n- Database tables (isolated from the main app)\n- Functions (queries, mutations, actions)\n- TypeScript types and validators\n- Optional frontend hooks\n\n### Component Structure\n\n```\nmy-convex-component/\n├── package.json\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── README.md\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts           # Main exports\n│   ├── component.ts       # Component definition\n│   ├── schema.ts          # Component schema\n│   └── functions/\n│       ├── queries.ts\n│       ├── mutations.ts\n│       └── actions.ts\n└── convex.config.ts       # Component configuration\n```\n\n### Creating a Component\n\n#### 1. Component Configuration\n\n```typescript\n// convex.config.ts\nimport { defineComponent } from \"convex/server\";\n\nexport default defineComponent(\"myComponent\");\n```\n\n#### 2. Component Schema\n\n```typescript\n// src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  // Tables are isolated to this component\n  items: defineTable({\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  }).index(\"by_name\", [\"name\"]),\n  \n  config: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    value: v.any(),\n  }).index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"]),\n});\n```\n\n#### 3. Component Definition\n\n```typescript\n// src/component.ts\nimport { defineComponent, ComponentDefinition } from \"convex/server\";\nimport schema from \"./schema\";\nimport * as queries from \"./functions/queries\";\nimport * as mutations from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\nconst component = defineComponent(\"myComponent\", {\n  schema,\n  functions: {\n    ...queries,\n    ...mutations,\n  },\n});\n\nexport default component;\n```\n\n#### 4. Component Functions\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/queries.ts\nimport { query } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const list = query({\n  args: {\n    limit: v.optional(v.number()),\n  },\n  returns: v.array(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  })),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .take(args.limit ?? 10);\n  },\n});\n\nexport const get = query({\n  args: { name: v.string() },\n  returns: v.union(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  }), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_name\", (q) => q.eq(\"name\", args.name))\n      .unique();\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const create = mutation({\n  args: {\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"items\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"items\", {\n      name: args.name,\n      data: args.data,\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n\nexport const update = mutation({\n  args: {\n    id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.patch(args.id, { data: args.data });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\nexport const remove = mutation({\n  args: { id: v.id(\"items\") },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.delete(args.id);\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n#### 5. Main Exports\n\n```typescript\n// src/index.ts\nexport { default as component } from \"./component\";\nexport * from \"./functions/queries\";\nexport * from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\n// Export types for consumers\nexport type { Id } from \"./_generated/dataModel\";\n```\n\n### Using a Component\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"myComponent\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s code\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction MyApp() {\n  // Access component functions through the app''s API\n  const items = useQuery(api.myComponent.list, { limit: 10 });\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.myComponent.create);\n  \n  return (\n    <div>\n      {items?.map((item) => (\n        <div key={item._id}>{item.name}</div>\n      ))}\n      <button onClick={() => createItem({ name: \"New\", data: {} })}>\n        Add Item\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Component Configuration Options\n\n```typescript\n// convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\n// Basic usage\napp.use(myComponent);\n\n// With custom name\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"customName\" });\n\n// Multiple instances\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance1\" });\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance2\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n### Providing Component Hooks\n\n```typescript\n// src/hooks.ts\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { FunctionReference } from \"convex/server\";\n\n// Type-safe hooks for component consumers\nexport function useMyComponent(api: {\n  list: FunctionReference<\"query\">;\n  create: FunctionReference<\"mutation\">;\n}) {\n  const items = useQuery(api.list, {});\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.create);\n  \n  return {\n    items,\n    createItem,\n    isLoading: items === undefined,\n  };\n}\n```\n\n### Publishing a Component\n\n#### package.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-convex-component\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"A reusable Convex component\",\n  \"main\": \"dist/index.js\",\n  \"types\": \"dist/index.d.ts\",\n  \"files\": [\n    \"dist\",\n    \"convex.config.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"tsc\",\n    \"prepublishOnly\": \"npm run build\"\n  },\n  \"peerDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.17.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"convex\",\n    \"component\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n#### tsconfig.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2020\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"declaration\": true,\n    \"outDir\": \"dist\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src/**/*\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Rate Limiter Component\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  requests: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    timestamp: v.number(),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"])\n    .index(\"by_key_and_time\", [\"key\", \"timestamp\"]),\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const checkLimit = mutation({\n  args: {\n    key: v.string(),\n    limit: v.number(),\n    windowMs: v.number(),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({\n    allowed: v.boolean(),\n    remaining: v.number(),\n    resetAt: v.number(),\n  }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const now = Date.now();\n    const windowStart = now - args.windowMs;\n    \n    // Clean old entries\n    const oldEntries = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key_and_time\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"key\", args.key).lt(\"timestamp\", windowStart)\n      )\n      .collect();\n    \n    for (const entry of oldEntries) {\n      await ctx.db.delete(entry._id);\n    }\n    \n    // Count current window\n    const currentRequests = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key\", (q) => q.eq(\"key\", args.key))\n      .collect();\n    \n    const remaining = Math.max(0, args.limit - currentRequests.length);\n    const allowed = remaining > 0;\n    \n    if (allowed) {\n      await ctx.db.insert(\"requests\", {\n        key: args.key,\n        timestamp: now,\n      });\n    }\n    \n    const oldestRequest = currentRequests[0];\n    const resetAt = oldestRequest \n      ? oldestRequest.timestamp + args.windowMs \n      : now + args.windowMs;\n    \n    return { allowed, remaining: remaining - (allowed ? 1 : 0), resetAt };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// Usage in consuming app\nimport { useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction useRateLimitedAction() {\n  const checkLimit = useMutation(api.rateLimiter.checkLimit);\n  \n  return async (action: () => Promise<void>) => {\n    const result = await checkLimit({\n      key: \"user-action\",\n      limit: 10,\n      windowMs: 60000,\n    });\n    \n    if (!result.allowed) {\n      throw new Error(`Rate limited. Try again at ${new Date(result.resetAt)}`);\n    }\n    \n    await action();\n  };\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Keep component tables isolated (don''t reference main app tables)\n- Export clear TypeScript types for consumers\n- Document all public functions and their arguments\n- Use semantic versioning for component releases\n- Include comprehensive README with examples\n- Test components in isolation before publishing\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Cross-referencing tables** - Component tables should be self-contained\n2. **Missing type exports** - Export all necessary types\n3. **Hardcoded configuration** - Use component options for customization\n4. **No versioning** - Follow semantic versioning\n5. **Poor documentation** - Document all public APIs\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Components: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:33:22.008Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced Convex component creation with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management.","zh":"适合需要高级 Convex 组件创建、合理隔离、导出和依赖管理的 AI 代理。","ja":"Convex コンポーネントの高度な作成、適切な分離、エクスポート、および依存関係管理が必要な AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Convex 컴포넌트 생성, 적절한 분리, 내보내기 및 종속성 관리가 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan creación avanzada de componentes Convex con aislamiento adecuado, exportaciones y gestión de dependencias.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de création avancée de composants Convex avec une isolation appropriée, des exportations et une gestion des dépendances.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Erstellung von Convex-Komponenten mit ordnungsgemäßer Isolation, Exporten und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de criação avançada de componentes Convex com isolamento adequado, exportações e gerenciamento de dependências.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым требуется продвинутая создание компонентов Convex с правильной изоляцией, экспортами и управлением зависимостями.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء متقدم لمكونات Convex مع عزل مناسب وتصدير وإدارة التبعيات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create self-contained, reusable Convex components using the latest documentation from https://docs.convex.dev/components, enabling efficient sharing across projects with proper dependency management and exports, while leveraging Convex''s component authoring guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理创建自包含、可重用的 Convex 组件的能力，使用来自 https://docs.convex.dev/components 的最新文档，实现跨项目的高效共享，具有适当的依赖管理和导出，同时利用 Convex 的组件编写指南。","ja":"エージェントが https://docs.convex.dev/components からの最新のドキュメントを使用して、自己完結型で再利用可能な Convex コンポーネントを作成できるようにし、プロジェクト間で効率的に共有できるようにします。適切な依存関係管理とエクスポートが可能で、Convex のコンポーネントの作成ガイドラインを活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 https://docs.convex.dev/components 에서의 최신 문서를 사용하여 자체적으로 포함된 재사용 가능한 Convex 컴포넌트를 만들 수 있도록 하여 프로젝트 간에 효율적으로 공유할 수 있도록 하며, 적절한 종속성 관리 및 내보내기와 함께 Convex의 컴포넌트 작성 지침을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes Convex autocontenidos y reutilizables utilizando la última documentación de https://docs.convex.dev/components, lo que permite un intercambio eficiente entre proyectos con una gestión adecuada de dependencias y exportaciones, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha las directrices de autoría de componentes de Convex.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants Convex autocontenus et réutilisables en utilisant la dernière documentation de https://docs.convex.dev/components, ce qui permet un partage efficace entre les projets avec une gestion appropriée des dépendances et des exportations, tout en exploitant les lignes directrices d''authoring de composants Convex.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, selbstenthaltene und wiederverwendbare Convex-Komponenten mit der neuesten Dokumentation von https://docs.convex.dev/components zu erstellen, was eine effiziente Weitergabe zwischen Projekten mit ordnungsgemäßer Abhängigkeitsverwaltung und Exporten ermöglicht, während gleichzeitig die Richtlinien für die Erstellung von Convex-Komponenten genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes Convex autocontidos e reutilizáveis usando a documentação mais recente de https://docs.convex.dev/components, permitindo o compartilhamento eficiente entre projetos com gerenciamento de dependências adequado e exportações, aproveitando as diretrizes de autorização de componentes do Convex.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать самодостаточные и многоразовые компоненты Convex, используя последнюю документацию с https://docs.convex.dev/components, что позволяет эффективно делиться между проектами с правильным управлением зависимостями и экспортами, используя рекомендации Convex по написанию компонентов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء مكونات Convex مستقلة وقابلة لإعادة الاستخدام باستخدام أحدث الوثائق من https://docs.convex.dev/components، مما يسمح بمشاركة فعالة عبر المشاريع مع إدارة التبعيات適合 والتصدير، مستفيدا من إرشادات كتابة مكونات Convex."},"useCases":{"en":["Authoring reusable Convex components for cross-project sharing","Implementing proper isolation and dependency management for Convex components","Generating and exporting Convex components with the latest documentation"],"zh":["为跨项目共享编写可重用的 Convex 组件","为 Convex 组件实现适当的隔离和依赖管理","使用最新文档生成和导出 Convex 组件"],"ja":["プロジェクト間で共有するための再利用可能な Convex コンポーネントの作成","Convex コンポーネントの適切な分離と依存関係管理の実装","最新のドキュメントを使用した Convex コンポーネントの生成とエクスポート"],"ko":["프로젝트 간에 공유하기 위한 재사용 가능한 Convex 컴포넌트 작성","Convex 컴포넌트에 대한 적절한 분리 및 종속성 관리 구현","최신 문서를 사용한 Convex 컴포넌트 생성 및 내보내기"],"es":["Creación de componentes Convex reutilizables para el intercambio entre proyectos","Implementación de un aislamiento adecuado y gestión de dependencias para los componentes Convex","Generación y exportación de componentes Convex con la última documentación"],"fr":["Création de composants Convex réutilisables pour le partage entre les projets","Mise en œuvre d''une isolation appropriée et d''une gestion des dépendances pour les composants Convex","Génération et exportation de composants Convex avec la dernière documentation"],"de":["Erstellung wiederverwendbarer Convex-Komponenten für den Austausch zwischen Projekten","Implementierung einer ordnungsgemäßen Isolation und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung für Convex-Komponenten","Erzeugung und Export von Convex-Komponenten mit der neuesten Dokumentation"],"pt":["Criação de componentes Convex reutilizáveis para compartilhamento entre projetos","Implementação de isolamento e gerenciamento de dependências adequados para componentes Convex","Geração e exportação de componentes Convex com a documentação mais recente"],"ru":["Создание многоразовых компонентов Convex для обмена между проектами","Реализация правильной изоляции и управления зависимостями для компонентов Convex","Генерация и экспорт компонентов Convex с последней документацией"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات Convex قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لمشاركتها عبر المشاريع","تنفيذ عزل وتدارة التبعيات المناسبة لمكونات Convex","توليد وتصدير مكونات Convex مع أحدث الوثائق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the latest Convex documentation","Dependent on Convex''s component authoring guidelines","Needs proper understanding of Convex components and their implementation"],"zh":["需要访问最新的 Convex 文档","依赖于 Convex 的组件编写指南","需要正确理解 Convex 组件及其实现"],"ja":["最新の Convex ドキュメントへのアクセ