evitando estéticas genéricas","fr":"Ce skill guide la création d''interfaces de frontend distinctives et de haute qualité, évitant les esthétiques génériques","de":"Dieses Skill leitet die Erstellung von einzigartigen und hochwertigen Frontend-Oberflächen, vermeidet generische Ästhetik","pt":"Este skill permite a criação de interfaces frontend personalizadas e de alta qualidade, evitando a estética genérica","ru":"Этот навык позволяет создавать уникальные и высококачественные интерфейсы frontend, избегая общего дизайна","ar":"يسمح هذا الخبرة بإنشاء واجهات المستخدم الأمامية الفريدة والعالية الجودة، وتجنب الجماليات العامة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建独特的生产级前端界面","避免通用AI设计","实现功能性和美观的设计","支持多种设计请求","提供灵活的设计选择"],"ja":["独自のプロダクションレベルのフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成","汎用的なAIデザインを避ける","機能性と美観の設計を実現","多様な設計要求に対応","柔軟な設計選択を提供"],"ko":["독특한 프로덕션급 프론트엔드 인터페이스를 생성","일반적인 AI 디자인 피하기","기능적이고 아름다운 디자인 구현","다양한 디자인 요청 지원","유연한 디자인 선택 제공"],"es":["Creación de interfaces de usuario personalizadas","Atención al detalle y opciones creativas","Evitación de estéticas genéricas","Implementación de código de trabajo real","Diseño de componentes, páginas y aplicaciones"],"fr":["Création d''interfaces utilisateur personnalisées","Attention aux détails et options créatives","Évitement d''esthétiques génériques","Mise en œuvre de code de travail réel","Conception de composants, pages et applications"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen","Aufmerksamkeit für Details und kreative Optionen","Vermeidung von generischer Ästhetik","Implementierung von funktionalem Code","Entwurf von Komponenten, Seiten und Anwendungen"],"pt":["Criação de interfaces frontend personalizadas","Atenção aos detalhes estéticos","Escolhas criativas","Desenvolvimento de componentes","Construção de páginas e aplicações","Interface de usuário de alta qualidade"],"ru":["Создание уникальных интерфейсов frontend","Внимание к деталям","Креативные решения","Разработка компонентов","Строительство страниц и приложений","Интерфейс пользователя высокого качества"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات المستخدم الأمامية الفريدة","الاهتمام بالتفاصيل الجمالية","الخيارات الإبداعية","إنشاء المكونات","بناء الصفحات والتطبيقات","واجهة المستخدم عالية الجودة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端设计","生产级界面","AI设计","功能性设计","美观设计","设计技能"],"ja":["フロントエンドデザイン","プロダクションレベルのインターフェイス","AIデザイン","機能性設計","美観設計","設計スキル"],"ko":["프론트엔드 디자인","프로덕션급 인터페이스","AI 디자인","기능적 디자인","아름다운 디자인","디자인 스킬"],"es":["diseño de frontend","interfaces de usuario","desarrollo web","creación de aplicaciones","estéticas de alta calidad","experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["conception de frontend","interfaces utilisateur","développement web","création d''applications","esthétiques de haute qualité","expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Frontend-Design","Benutzeroberflächen","Webentwicklung","Erstellung von Anwendungen","hochwertige Ästhetik","Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento frontend","interfaces de usuário","design de interface","criação de componentes","construção de páginas","aplicações web","frontend-design","desenvolvedores web","tecnologias frontend"],"ru":["разработка frontend","интерфейсы пользователя","дизайн интерфейса","создание компонентов","строительство страниц","веб-приложения","frontend-design","веб-разработчики","технологии frontend"],"ar":["تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","واجهات المستخدم","تصميم واجهة","إنشاء المكونات","بناء الصفحات","تطبيقات الويب","تصميم واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","مطورو الويب","تقنيات واجهة المستخدم الأمامية"]}},"owner":"Nightwolf7570","repo":"donna2.0","repoPath":"Nightwolf7570/donna2.0","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.409Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-design","description":"Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use this skill when the user asks to build web components, pages, or applications. Generates creative, polished code that avoids generic AI aesthetics.","bodyPreview":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices. This skill is invoked when the user makes a design-specific request or when the user interface is being designed or changed.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or te","body":"This skill guides creation of distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces that avoid generic \"AI slop\" aesthetics. Implement real working code with exceptional attention to aesthetic details and creative choices. This skill is invoked when the user makes a design-specific request or when the user interface is being designed or changed.\n\nThe user provides frontend requirements: a component, page, application, or interface to build. They may include context about the purpose, audience, or technical constraints.\n\n## Design Thinking\n\nBefore coding, understand the context and commit to a BOLD aesthetic direction:\n- **Purpose**: What problem does this interface solve? Who uses it?\n- **Tone**: Pick an extreme: brutally minimal, maximalist chaos, retro-futuristic, organic/natural, luxury/refined, playful/toy-like, editorial/magazine, brutalist/raw, art deco/geometric, soft/pastel, industrial/utilitarian, etc. There are so many flavors to choose from. Use these for inspiration but design one that is true to the aesthetic direction.\n- **Constraints**: Technical requirements (framework, performance, accessibility).\n- **Differentiation**: What makes this UNFORGETTABLE? What''s the one thing someone will remember?\n\n**CRITICAL**: Choose a clear conceptual direction and execute it with precision. Bold maximalism and refined minimalism both work - the key is intentionality, not intensity.\n\nThen implement working code (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Vue, etc.) that is:\n- Production-grade and functional\n- Visually striking and memorable\n- Cohesive with a clear aesthetic point-of-view\n- Meticulously refined in every detail\n\n## Frontend Aesthetics Guidelines\n\nFocus on:\n- **Typography**: Choose fonts that are beautiful, unique, and interesting. Avoid generic fonts like Arial and Inter; opt instead for distinctive choices that elevate the frontend''s aesthetics; unexpected, characterful font choices. Pair a distinctive display font with a refined body font.\n- **Color & Theme**: Commit to a cohesive aesthetic. Use CSS variables for consistency. Dominant colors with sharp accents outperform timid, evenly-distributed palettes.\n- **Motion**: Use animations for effects and micro-interactions. Prioritize CSS-only solutions for HTML. Use Motion library for React when available. Focus on high-impact moments: one well-orchestrated page load with staggered reveals (animation-delay) creates more delight than scattered micro-interactions. Use scroll-triggering and hover states that surprise.\n- **Spatial Composition**: Unexpected layouts. Asymmetry. Overlap. Diagonal flow. Grid-breaking elements. Generous negative space OR controlled density.\n- **Backgrounds & Visual Details**: Create atmosphere and depth rather than defaulting to solid colors. Add contextual effects and textures that match the overall aesthetic. Apply creative forms like gradient meshes, noise textures, geometric patterns, layered transparencies, dramatic shadows, decorative borders, custom cursors, and grain overlays.\n\nNEVER use generic AI-generated aesthetics like overused font families (Inter, Roboto, Arial, system fonts), cliched color schemes (particularly purple gradients on white backgrounds), predictable layouts and component patterns, and cookie-cutter design that lacks context-specific character.\n\nInterpret creatively and make unexpected choices that feel genuinely designed for the context. No design should be the same. Vary between light and dark themes, different fonts, different aesthetics. NEVER converge on common choices (Space Grotesk, for example) across generations.\n\n**IMPORTANT**: Match implementation complexity to the aesthetic vision. Maximalist designs need elaborate code with extensive animations and effects. Minimalist or refined designs need restraint, precision, and careful attention to spacing, typography, and subtle details. Elegance comes from executing the vision well.\n\nRemember: Claude is capable of extraordinary creative work. Don''t hold back, show what can truly be created when thinking outside the box and committing fully to a distinctive vision.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:33:05.619Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Visual AI Agents seeking to craft bespoke, production-grade frontend interfaces with meticulous attention to aesthetic details.","zh":"适合于视觉AI代理，旨在打造定制的、生产级的前端接口，并对美学细节有着细致的关注。","ja":"ビジュアルAIエージェントが、美的細節にこだわったカスタマイズされたプロダクショングレードのフロントエンドインターフェイスを作成しようとする場合に適しています。","ko":"비주얼 AI 에이전트가 미적 세부 사항에주의를 기울인 커스텀 생산 급 전면 인터페이스를 구축하려는 경우 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial Visuales que buscan crear interfaces de frontend personalizadas y de grado de producción con una atención meticulosa a los detalles estéticos.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle Visuels qui cherchent à créer des interfaces de frontend sur mesure et de niveau de production avec une attention méticuleuse aux détails esthétiques.","de":"Ideal für visuelle KI-Agenten, die maßgeschneiderte, produktionsreife Frontend-Schnittstellen mit peinlicher Beachtung ästhetischer Details erstellen möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Visuais que buscam criar interfaces de frontend personalizadas, de grau de produção, com atenção meticulosa aos detalhes estéticos.","ru":"Идеально для визуальных агентов ИИ, стремящихся создавать индивидуальные, промышленные интерфейсы frontend с тщательным вниманием к эстетическим деталям.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوكيل المرئي للذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يسعى إلى صنع واجهات المستخدم الأمامية المخصصة الدرجة الإنتاجية مع اهتمام دقيق بالتفاصيل الجمالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate distinctive, real-world frontend code with exceptional attention to creative choices, leveraging HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to avoid generic ''AI slop'' aesthetics, and implementing responsive designs using protocols like HTTP and HTTPS, while supporting various file formats such as .svg and .png.","zh":"赋予代理生成具有创造力选择的独特的现实世界的前端代码，利用HTML、CSS和JavaScript避免通用的''AI slop''美学，并使用HTTP和HTTPS等协议实现响应式设计，同时支持诸如.svg和.png等各种文件格式。","ja":"エージェントが、HTML、CSS、JavaScriptを利用して、独自のリアルワールドのフロントエンドコードを生成し、創造的な選択に優れた注意を払い、一般的な''AI slop''エステティクスを避け、HTTPとHTTPSなどのプロトコルを使用してレスポンシブデザインを実装し、.svgや.pngなどの様々なファイル形式をサポートする。","ko":"에이전트가 독특한 실제 세계의 전면 코드를 생성하도록 하여 창의적인 선택에 예외적인 주의를 기울이며 HTML, CSS 및 JavaScript를 사용하여 일반적인 ''AI 슬럽'' 미학을 피하고 HTTP 및 HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 반응형 디자인을 구현하며 .svg 및 .png와 같은 다양한 파일 형식을 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar código de frontend distintivo y del mundo real con una atención excepcional a las elecciones creativas, aprovechando HTML, CSS y JavaScript para evitar estéticas genéricas de ''slop'' de IA, e implementando diseños responsivos utilizando protocolos como HTTP y HTTPS, mientras admite varios formatos de archivo como .svg y .png.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer du code de frontend distinctif et du monde réel avec une attention exceptionnelle aux choix créatifs, en exploitant HTML, CSS et JavaScript pour éviter les esthétiques génériques de ''slop'' d''IA, et en mettant en œuvre des conceptions responsives en utilisant des protocoles tels que HTTP et HTTPS, tout en prenant en charge divers formats de fichiers tels que .svg et .png.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eindeutiges, realweltliches Frontend-Code mit außergewöhnlicher Aufmerksamkeit für kreative Entscheidungen zu generieren, indem es HTML, CSS und JavaScript nutzt, um generische ''KI-Slop''-Ästhetik zu vermeiden, und responsive Designs mithilfe von Protokollen wie HTTP und HTTPS implementiert, während es verschiedene Dateiformate wie .svg und .png unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar código frontend distinto, do mundo real, com atenção excepcional às escolhas criativas, aproveitando HTML, CSS e JavaScript para evitar estéticas genéricas de ''sloppiness'' do IA, e implementando designs responsivos usando protocolos como HTTP e HTTPS, enquanto suporta vários formatos de arquivo, como .svg e .png.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать отличительный, реальный код frontend с исключительным вниманием к творческим решениям, используя HTML, CSS и JavaScript, чтобы избежать генерических ''слоppy'' эстетики ИИ, и реализуя отзывчивые дизайны с использованием протоколов, таких как HTTP и HTTPS, а также поддерживая различные форматы файлов, такие как .svg и .png.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكيل من توليد كود واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المميزة وعالمية الحقيقية مع اهتمام استثنائي بالخيارات الإبداعية، واستغلال HTML و CSS و JavaScript لتجنب الجماليات العامة لخلال الذكاء الاصطناعي، وتنفيذ تصاميم مستجيب باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTP و HTTPS، ودعم تنسيقات الملفات المختلفة مثل .svg و .png."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing responsive web applications","Building custom UI components","Creating visually appealing landing pages","Developing accessible and user-friendly interfaces"],"zh":["设计响应式的Web应用程序","构建自定义的UI组件","创建视觉上吸引人的着陆页","开发无障碍和用户友好的接口"],"ja":["レスポンシブなWebアプリケーションの設計","カスタムUIコンポーネントの構築","視覚的に魅力的なランディングページの作成","アクセシビリティとユーザーフレンドリーなインターフェイスの開発"],"ko":["반응형 웹 애플리케이션 설계","사용자 정의 UI 구성 요소 구축","시각적으로 매력적인 랜딩 페이지 생성","접근성 및 사용자 친화적 인터페이스 개발"],"es":["Diseñar aplicaciones web responsivas","Crear componentes de interfaz de usuario personalizados","Crear páginas de aterrizaje visualmente atractivas","Desarrollar interfaces accesibles y fáciles de usar"],"fr":["Concevoir des applications web responsives","Créer des composants d''interface utilisateur personnalisés","Créer des pages d''atterrissage visuellement attrayantes","Développer des interfaces accessibles et conviviales"],"de":["Responsive Webanwendungen entwerfen","Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten anpassen","Visuell ansprechende Landeseiten erstellen","Zugängliche und benutzerfreundliche Schnittstellen entwickeln"],"pt":["Projetar aplicações web responsivas","Construir componentes de UI personalizados","Criar páginas de destino visualmente atraentes","Desenvolver interfaces acessíveis e amigáveis ao usuário"],"ru":["Проектировать отзывчивые веб-приложения","Создавать индивидуальные компоненты интерфейса","Создавать визуально привлекательные посадочные страницы","Разрабатывать доступные и удобные интерфейсы"],"ar":["تصميم تطبيقات الويب المستجيبة","بناء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة","إنشاء صفحات هبوط جذابة بصريًا","تطوير واجهات المستخدم المتوافقة وسهلة الاستخدام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires user-provided frontend requirements","Limited to frontend design and development","Dependent on user context for purpose, audience, or technical specifications"],"zh":["需要用户提供前端需求","仅限前端设计和开发","依赖于用户上下文以确定用途、受众或技术规格"],"ja":["ユーザーがフロントエンドの要件を提供する必要がある","フロントエンド設計と開発のみに限定される","目的、対象ユーザー、または技術仕様を決定するためにユーザーのコンテキストに依存する"],"ko":["사용자가 전면 요구 사항을 제공해야 함","전면 설계 및 개발에만 제한됨","목적, 대상 또는 기술 사양을 결정하기 위해 사용자 컨텍스트에 의존"],"es":["Requiere requisitos de frontend proporcionados por el usuario","Limitado al diseño y desarrollo de frontend","Dependiente del contexto del usuario para el propósito, la audiencia o las especificaciones técnicas"],"fr":["Nécessite des exigences de frontend fournies par l''utilisateur","Limité à la conception et au développement de frontend","Dépendant du contexte de l''utilisateur pour l''objectif, le public ou les spécifications techniques"],"de":["Benötigt von Benutzern bereitgestellte Frontend-Anforderungen","Begrenzt auf Frontend-Design und -Entwicklung","Abhängig vom Benutzerkontext für Zweck, Zielgruppe oder technische Spezifikationen"],"pt":["Exige requisitos de frontend fornecidos pelo usuário","Limitado ao design e desenvolvimento de frontend","Dependente do contexto do usuário para propósito, audiência ou especificações técnicas"],"ru":["Требует предоставления пользователем требований к frontend","Ограничен дизайном и разработкой frontend","Зависит от контекста пользователя для цели, аудитории или технических спецификаций"],"ar":["يتطلب متطلبات واجهة المستخدم الأمامية المقدمة من المستخدم","محدود بتصميم واجهة المستخدم الأمامية وتنميتها","يعتمد على سياق المستخدم لغرض أو جمهور أو مواصفات فنية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":25}');
