vex 컴포넌트 작성은 자체 포함 Convex 컴포넌트를 생성하고 분리,导出 및 종속성 관리를 제공","es":"Convex Component Authoring permite crear componentes reutilizables con aislamiento y gestión de dependencias adecuadas.","fr":"La création de composants Convex permet de créer des composants réutilisables avec isolation et gestion de dépendances appropriées.","de":"Die Erstellung von Convex-Komponenten ermöglicht die Erstellung von wiederverwendbaren Komponenten mit ordnungsgemäßer Isolation und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung.","pt":"A criação de componentes Convex permite desenvolver módulos autônomos e reutilizáveis para compartilhar em projetos.","ru":"Создание компонентов Convex позволяет разработать автономные и многократно используемые модули для обмена в проектах.","ar":"إنشاء مكونات Convex يسمح بتطوير الوحدات المستقلة والقابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لمشاركتها في المشاريع.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建自包含的 Convex 组件","实现隔离和导出","依赖管理","跨项目共享","提高代码复用性","简化组件开发"],"ja":["自己包含的な Convex コンポーネントを作成","隔離とエクスポートを実現","依存関係管理","プロジェクト間で共有","コードの再利用性を高める","コンポーネント開発を簡素化"],"ko":["자체 포함 Convex 컴포넌트 생성","분리와导出 구현","종속성 관리","프로젝트 간 공유","코드 재사용성 향상","컴포넌트 개발 단순화"],"es":["Creación de componentes reutilizables","Aislamiento adecuado","Exportaciones y gestión de dependencias","Compatibilidad con proyectos múltiples","Documentación detallada","Integración con Convex"],"fr":["Création de composants réutilisables","Isolation appropriée","Exportations et gestion de dépendances","Compatibilité avec plusieurs projets","Documentation détaillée","Intégration avec Convex"],"de":["Erstellung von wiederverwendbaren Komponenten","Ordentliche Isolation","Exporte und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Projekten","Detaillierte Dokumentation","Integration mit Convex"],"pt":["Criação de componentes autônomos","Reutilização de componentes em projetos","Isolamento de componentes","Gerenciamento de dependências","Exportação de componentes","Compartilhamento de componentes"],"ru":["Создание автономных компонентов","Многократное использование компонентов в проектах","Изоляция компонентов","Управление зависимостями","Экспорт компонентов","Обмен компонентами"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات مستقلة","إعادة استخدام المكونات في المشاريع","عزل المكونات","إدارة التبعيات","تصدير المكونات","مشاركة المكونات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex 组件","Convex 组件作者","自包含组件","隔离和导出","依赖管理","跨项目共享","代码复用性","组件开发"],"ja":["Convex コンポーネント","Convex コンポーネントオーサリング","自己包含コンポーネント","隔離とエクスポート","依存関係管理","プロジェクト間で共有","コードの再利用性","コンポーネント開発"],"ko":["Convex 컴포넌트","Convex 컴포넌트 작성","자체 포함 컴포넌트","분리와导出","종속성 관리","프로젝트 간 공유","코드 재사용성","컴포넌트 개발"],"es":["convex component authoring","componentes reutilizables","aislamiento","exportaciones","gestión de dependencias","desarrollo de software","programación","convex"],"fr":["création de composants Convex","composants réutilisables","isolation","exportations","gestion de dépendances","développement de logiciels","programmation","convex"],"de":["erstellung von convex-komponenten","wiederverwendbare komponenten","isolation","exporte","abhängigkeitsverwaltung","softwareentwicklung","programmierung","convex"],"pt":["componentes convex","criação de componentes","reutilização de componentes","isolamento de componentes","gerenciamento de dependências","exportação de componentes","compartilhamento de componentes","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["компоненты convex","создание компонентов","многократное использование компонентов","изоляция компонентов","управление зависимостями","экспорт компонентов","обмен компонентами","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مكونات convex","إنشاء مكونات","إعادة استخدام المكونات","عزل المكونات","إدارة التبعيات","تصدير المكونات","مشاركة المكونات","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Pratikkadam254","repo":"LinkedinLeadGen","repoPath":"Pratikkadam254/LinkedinLeadGen","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.409Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convex-component-authoring","description":"How to create, structure, and publish self-contained Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","components","reusable","packages","npm"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex component","body":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex components are self-contained packages that include:\n- Database tables (isolated from the main app)\n- Functions (queries, mutations, actions)\n- TypeScript types and validators\n- Optional frontend hooks\n\n### Component Structure\n\n```\nmy-convex-component/\n├── package.json\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── README.md\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts           # Main exports\n│   ├── component.ts       # Component definition\n│   ├── schema.ts          # Component schema\n│   └── functions/\n│       ├── queries.ts\n│       ├── mutations.ts\n│       └── actions.ts\n└── convex.config.ts       # Component configuration\n```\n\n### Creating a Component\n\n#### 1. Component Configuration\n\n```typescript\n// convex.config.ts\nimport { defineComponent } from \"convex/server\";\n\nexport default defineComponent(\"myComponent\");\n```\n\n#### 2. Component Schema\n\n```typescript\n// src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  // Tables are isolated to this component\n  items: defineTable({\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  }).index(\"by_name\", [\"name\"]),\n  \n  config: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    value: v.any(),\n  }).index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"]),\n});\n```\n\n#### 3. Component Definition\n\n```typescript\n// src/component.ts\nimport { defineComponent, ComponentDefinition } from \"convex/server\";\nimport schema from \"./schema\";\nimport * as queries from \"./functions/queries\";\nimport * as mutations from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\nconst component = defineComponent(\"myComponent\", {\n  schema,\n  functions: {\n    ...queries,\n    ...mutations,\n  },\n});\n\nexport default component;\n```\n\n#### 4. Component Functions\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/queries.ts\nimport { query } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const list = query({\n  args: {\n    limit: v.optional(v.number()),\n  },\n  returns: v.array(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  })),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .take(args.limit ?? 10);\n  },\n});\n\nexport const get = query({\n  args: { name: v.string() },\n  returns: v.union(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  }), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_name\", (q) => q.eq(\"name\", args.name))\n      .unique();\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const create = mutation({\n  args: {\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"items\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"items\", {\n      name: args.name,\n      data: args.data,\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n\nexport const update = mutation({\n  args: {\n    id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.patch(args.id, { data: args.data });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\nexport const remove = mutation({\n  args: { id: v.id(\"items\") },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.delete(args.id);\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n#### 5. Main Exports\n\n```typescript\n// src/index.ts\nexport { default as component } from \"./component\";\nexport * from \"./functions/queries\";\nexport * from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\n// Export types for consumers\nexport type { Id } from \"./_generated/dataModel\";\n```\n\n### Using a Component\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"myComponent\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s code\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction MyApp() {\n  // Access component functions through the app''s API\n  const items = useQuery(api.myComponent.list, { limit: 10 });\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.myComponent.create);\n  \n  return (\n    <div>\n      {items?.map((item) => (\n        <div key={item._id}>{item.name}</div>\n      ))}\n      <button onClick={() => createItem({ name: \"New\", data: {} })}>\n        Add Item\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Component Configuration Options\n\n```typescript\n// convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\n// Basic usage\napp.use(myComponent);\n\n// With custom name\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"customName\" });\n\n// Multiple instances\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance1\" });\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance2\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n### Providing Component Hooks\n\n```typescript\n// src/hooks.ts\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { FunctionReference } from \"convex/server\";\n\n// Type-safe hooks for component consumers\nexport function useMyComponent(api: {\n  list: FunctionReference<\"query\">;\n  create: FunctionReference<\"mutation\">;\n}) {\n  const items = useQuery(api.list, {});\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.create);\n  \n  return {\n    items,\n    createItem,\n    isLoading: items === undefined,\n  };\n}\n```\n\n### Publishing a Component\n\n#### package.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-convex-component\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"A reusable Convex component\",\n  \"main\": \"dist/index.js\",\n  \"types\": \"dist/index.d.ts\",\n  \"files\": [\n    \"dist\",\n    \"convex.config.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"tsc\",\n    \"prepublishOnly\": \"npm run build\"\n  },\n  \"peerDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.17.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"convex\",\n    \"component\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n#### tsconfig.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2020\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"declaration\": true,\n    \"outDir\": \"dist\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src/**/*\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Rate Limiter Component\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  requests: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    timestamp: v.number(),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"])\n    .index(\"by_key_and_time\", [\"key\", \"timestamp\"]),\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const checkLimit = mutation({\n  args: {\n    key: v.string(),\n    limit: v.number(),\n    windowMs: v.number(),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({\n    allowed: v.boolean(),\n    remaining: v.number(),\n    resetAt: v.number(),\n  }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const now = Date.now();\n    const windowStart = now - args.windowMs;\n    \n    // Clean old entries\n    const oldEntries = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key_and_time\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"key\", args.key).lt(\"timestamp\", windowStart)\n      )\n      .collect();\n    \n    for (const entry of oldEntries) {\n      await ctx.db.delete(entry._id);\n    }\n    \n    // Count current window\n    const currentRequests = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key\", (q) => q.eq(\"key\", args.key))\n      .collect();\n    \n    const remaining = Math.max(0, args.limit - currentRequests.length);\n    const allowed = remaining > 0;\n    \n    if (allowed) {\n      await ctx.db.insert(\"requests\", {\n        key: args.key,\n        timestamp: now,\n      });\n    }\n    \n    const oldestRequest = currentRequests[0];\n    const resetAt = oldestRequest \n      ? oldestRequest.timestamp + args.windowMs \n      : now + args.windowMs;\n    \n    return { allowed, remaining: remaining - (allowed ? 1 : 0), resetAt };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// Usage in consuming app\nimport { useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction useRateLimitedAction() {\n  const checkLimit = useMutation(api.rateLimiter.checkLimit);\n  \n  return async (action: () => Promise<void>) => {\n    const result = await checkLimit({\n      key: \"user-action\",\n      limit: 10,\n      windowMs: 60000,\n    });\n    \n    if (!result.allowed) {\n      throw new Error(`Rate limited. Try again at ${new Date(result.resetAt)}`);\n    }\n    \n    await action();\n  };\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Keep component tables isolated (don''t reference main app tables)\n- Export clear TypeScript types for consumers\n- Document all public functions and their arguments\n- Use semantic versioning for component releases\n- Include comprehensive README with examples\n- Test components in isolation before publishing\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Cross-referencing tables** - Component tables should be self-contained\n2. **Missing type exports** - Export all necessary types\n3. **Hardcoded configuration** - Use component options for customization\n4. **No versioning** - Follow semantic versioning\n5. **Poor documentation** - Document all public APIs\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Components: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:33:30.695Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced Convex component creation with isolation, exports, and dependency management for project sharing.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Convex 组件创建、隔离、导出和依赖管理的 AI 代理，以便项目共享。","ja":"プロジェクトの共有のために隔離、エクスポート、依存関係の管理を必要とする高度なConvexコンポーネントの作成が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"프로젝트 공유를 위해 격리, 내보내기, 의존성 관리가 필요한 고급 Convex 구성 요소 생성이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan creación avanzada de componentes Convex con aislamiento, exportaciones y gestión de dependencias para compartir proyectos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant une création avancée de composants Convex avec isolation, exportations et gestion des dépendances pour le partage de projets.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Erstellung von Convex-Komponenten mit Isolation, Exporten und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung für Projektteilung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de criação avançada de componentes Convex com isolamento, exportações e gerenciamento de dependências para compartilhamento de projetos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым необходима продвинутая создание компонентов Convex с изоляцией, экспортами и управлением зависимостями для обмена проектами.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء متقدم لمكونات Convex مع العزل والتصدير وإدارة التبعيات لمشاركة المشاريع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper dependency management, utilizing the latest documentation from https://docs.convex.dev/components, and implementing components as described in https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring, all while considering broader context from https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt.","zh":"赋予代理创建自包含、可重用的Convex组件的能力，利用https://docs.convex.dev/components的最新文档，并按照https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring中描述的实现组件，同时考虑https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt中的更广泛的背景。","ja":"https://docs.convex.dev/componentsの最新のドキュメントを利用し、https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoringに記載されているようにコンポーネントを実装し、https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txtのより広いコンテキストを考慮しながら、セルフコンテイニング可能で再利用可能なConvexコンポーネントを作成するエージェントを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 https://docs.convex.dev/components의 최신 문서를 사용하여 자체 포함 가능한 재사용 가능한 Convex 구성 요소를 만들 수 있도록 하며, https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring에 설명된 대로 구성 요소를 구현하며, https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt의 더 广い 컨텍스트를 고려합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes Convex autocontenidos y reutilizables con una gestión adecuada de dependencias, utilizando la última documentación de https://docs.convex.dev/components, e implementando componentes como se describe en https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring, considerando al mismo tiempo el contexto más amplio de https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt.","fr":"Habilite les agents à créer des composants Convex autocontenus et réutilisables avec une gestion appropriée des dépendances, en utilisant la dernière documentation de https://docs.convex.dev/components, et en implémentant des composants comme décrit dans https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring, en tenant compte du contexte plus large de https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, selbstenthaltene und wiederverwendbare Convex-Komponenten mit ordnungsgemäßer Abhängigkeitsverwaltung zu erstellen, unter Verwendung der neuesten Dokumentation von https://docs.convex.dev/components und Implementierung von Komponenten wie in https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring beschrieben, unter Berücksichtigung des umfassenderen Kontexts von https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem componentes Convex autocontidos e reutilizáveis com gerenciamento de dependências adequado, utilizando a documentação mais recente de https://docs.convex.dev/components, e implementando componentes como descrito em https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring, considerando também o contexto mais amplo de https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать самодостаточные, многократно используемые компоненты Convex с правильным управлением зависимостями, используя последнюю документацию с https://docs.convex.dev/components, и реализуя компоненты, как описано в https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring, учитывая также более широкий контекст из https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء مكونات Convex متكاملة ويمكن إعادة استخدامها مع إدارة التبعيات المناسبة، باستخدام أحدث الوثائق من https://docs.convex.dev/components، وتنفيذ المكونات كما هو موضح في https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring، مع مراعاة السياق الأوسع من https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt."},"useCases":{"en":["Authoring reusable Convex components for sharing across projects","Implementing proper isolation and exports for Convex components","Managing dependencies for Convex components using the latest documentation"],"zh":["编写可在项目间共享的可重用Convex组件","实现Convex组件的适当隔离和导出","使用最新文档管理Convex组件的依赖关系"],"ja":["プロジェクト間で共有可能な再利用可能なConvexコンポーネントの作成","Convexコンポーネントの適切な隔離とエクスポートの実装","最新のドキュメントを使用したConvexコンポーネントの依存関係の管理"],"ko":["프로젝트 간에 공유 가능한 재사용 가능한 Convex 구성 요소를 작성하는 것","Convex 구성 요소에 대한 적절한 격리 및 내보내기 구현","최신 문서를 사용하여 Convex 구성 요소의 의존성 관리"],"es":["Creación de componentes Convex reutilizables para compartir entre proyectos","Implementación de aislamiento y exportaciones adecuados para componentes Convex","Gestión de dependencias para componentes Convex utilizando la última documentación"],"fr":["Création de composants Convex réutilisables pour partager entre les projets","Mise en œuvre d''une isolation et d''exportations appropriées pour les composants Convex","Gestion des dépendances pour les composants Convex en utilisant la dernière documentation"],"de":["Erstellung wiederverwendbarer Convex-Komponenten zur Teilung zwischen Projekten","Implementierung von Isolation und Exporten für Convex-Komponenten","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten für Convex-Komponenten unter Verwendung der neuesten Dokumentation"],"pt":["Criação de componentes Convex reutilizáveis para compartilhamento entre projetos","Implementação de isolamento e exportações adequados para componentes Convex","Gerenciamento de dependências para componentes Convex usando a documentação mais recente"],"ru":["Создание многократно используемых компонентов Convex для обмена между проектами","Реализация правильной изоляции и экспортов для компонентов Convex","Управление зависимостями для компонентов Convex с использованием последней документации"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات Convex يمكن إعادة استخدامها لمشاركتها عبر المشاريع","تنفيذ العزل والتصدير المناسبين لمكونات Convex","إدارة التبعيات لمكونات Convex باستخدام أحدث الوثائق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the latest Convex documentation","Limited to Convex components and their specific implementation details"],"zh":["需要访问最新的Convex文档","仅限Convex组件及其特定的实现细节"],"ja":["最新のConvexドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","Convexコンポーネントとその特定の実装の詳細のみ"],"ko":["최신 Convex 문서에 대한 액세스가 필요함","Convex 구성 요소 및 해당 특정 구현 세부 정보에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la última documentación de Convex","Limitado a componentes Convex y sus detalles de implementación específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la dernière documentation de Convex","Limité aux composants Convex et à leurs détails d''implémentation spécifiques"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die neueste Convex-Dokumentation","Begrenzt auf Convex-Komponenten und deren spezifische Implementierungsdetails"],"pt":["Exige acesso à documentação mais recente do Convex","Limitado a componentes Convex e detalhes específicos de implementação"],"ru":["Требует доступа к последней документации Convex","Ограничен компонентами Convex и их конкретными деталями реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى أحدث وثائق Convex","محدود بمكونات Convex وتفاصيل تنفيذها المحددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
