ssages personnalisés avec markdown","Stocker des règles dans des fichiers markdown","Utiliser le frontmatter YAML pour configurer les règles","Compatibilité avec des événements tels que bash, fichier et invite"],"de":["Muster mit regulären Ausdrücken definieren","Benutzerdefinierte Nachrichten mit Markdown erstellen","Regeln in Markdown-Dateien speichern","Frontmatter YAML zur Konfiguration von Regeln verwenden","Kompatibilität mit Ereignissen wie Bash, Datei und Prompt"],"pt":["Defina padrões para assistir","Crie mensagens personalizadas","Armazene regras em arquivos Markdown","Use YAML frontmatter para configurar regras","Habilite ou desabilite regras facilmente"],"ru":["Определите шаблоны для отслеживания","Создайте персонализированные сообщения","Храните правила в файлах Markdown","Используйте YAML-frontend для настройки правил","Включите или выключите правила легко"],"ar":["حدد الأنماط للمراقبة","أنشئ رسائل مخصصة","احفظ القواعد في ملفات Markdown","استخدم YAML-frontend لتهيئة القواعد","تمكين أو تعطيل القواعد بسهولة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Hookify 规则","markdown 文件","模式匹配","消息显示","开发工具","代码编辑"],"ja":["Hookify ルール","Markdown ファイル","パターン マッチング","メッセージ表示","開発ツール","コード エディター"],"ko":["Hookify 규칙","markdown 파일","패턴 매칭","메시지 표시","개발 도구","코드 편집기"],"es":["reglas de Hookify","markdown","YAML","patrones","mensajes personalizados","desarrollo de software","Claude","expresiones regulares"],"fr":["règles Hookify","markdown","YAML","modèles","messages personnalisés","développement de logiciels","Claude","expressions régulières"],"de":["Hookify-Regeln","Markdown","YAML","Muster","benutzerdefinierte Nachrichten","Softwareentwicklung","Claude","reguläre Ausdrücke"],"pt":["Regras Hookify","Automatização de tarefas","Padrões deassistência","Mensagens personalizadas","Arquivos Markdown","YAML frontmatter"],"ru":["Правила Hookify","Автоматизация задач","Шаблоны для отслеживания","Персонализированные сообщения","Файлы Markdown","YAML-frontend"],"ar":["قواعد Hookify","أتمتة المهام","أنماط للمراقبة","رسائل مخصصة","ملفات Markdown","YAML-frontend"]}},"owner":"haxllo","repo":"repolens","repoPath":"haxllo/repolens","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.409Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Writing Hookify Rules","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to create a hookify rule, write a hook rule, configure hookify, add a hookify rule, or needs guidance on hookify rule syntax and patterns.","version":"0.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Writing Hookify Rules\n\n## Overview\n\nHookify rules are markdown files with YAML frontmatter that define patterns to watch for and messages to show when those patterns match. Rules are stored in `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` files.\n\n## Rule File Format\n\n### Basic Structure\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: rule-identifier\nenabled: true\nevent: bash|file|stop|prompt|all\npattern: regex-pattern-here\n---\n\nMessage to show Claude when this rule triggers.\nCan include markdown formatting, warnings, suggest","body":"# Writing Hookify Rules\n\n## Overview\n\nHookify rules are markdown files with YAML frontmatter that define patterns to watch for and messages to show when those patterns match. Rules are stored in `.claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md` files.\n\n## Rule File Format\n\n### Basic Structure\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: rule-identifier\nenabled: true\nevent: bash|file|stop|prompt|all\npattern: regex-pattern-here\n---\n\nMessage to show Claude when this rule triggers.\nCan include markdown formatting, warnings, suggestions, etc.\n```\n\n### Frontmatter Fields\n\n**name** (required): Unique identifier for the rule\n- Use kebab-case: `warn-dangerous-rm`, `block-console-log`\n- Be descriptive and action-oriented\n- Start with verb: warn, prevent, block, require, check\n\n**enabled** (required): Boolean to activate/deactivate\n- `true`: Rule is active\n- `false`: Rule is disabled (won''t trigger)\n- Can toggle without deleting rule\n\n**event** (required): Which hook event to trigger on\n- `bash`: Bash tool commands\n- `file`: Edit, Write, MultiEdit tools\n- `stop`: When agent wants to stop\n- `prompt`: When user submits a prompt\n- `all`: All events\n\n**action** (optional): What to do when rule matches\n- `warn`: Show message but allow operation (default)\n- `block`: Prevent operation (PreToolUse) or stop session (Stop events)\n- If omitted, defaults to `warn`\n\n**pattern** (simple format): Regex pattern to match\n- Used for simple single-condition rules\n- Matches against command (bash) or new_text (file)\n- Python regex syntax\n\n**Example:**\n```yaml\nevent: bash\npattern: rm\\s+-rf\n```\n\n### Advanced Format (Multiple Conditions)\n\nFor complex rules with multiple conditions:\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: warn-env-file-edits\nenabled: true\nevent: file\nconditions:\n  - field: file_path\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: \\.env$\n  - field: new_text\n    operator: contains\n    pattern: API_KEY\n---\n\nYou''re adding an API key to a .env file. Ensure this file is in .gitignore!\n```\n\n**Condition fields:**\n- `field`: Which field to check\n  - For bash: `command`\n  - For file: `file_path`, `new_text`, `old_text`, `content`\n- `operator`: How to match\n  - `regex_match`: Regex pattern matching\n  - `contains`: Substring check\n  - `equals`: Exact match\n  - `not_contains`: Substring must NOT be present\n  - `starts_with`: Prefix check\n  - `ends_with`: Suffix check\n- `pattern`: Pattern or string to match\n\n**All conditions must match for rule to trigger.**\n\n## Message Body\n\nThe markdown content after frontmatter is shown to Claude when the rule triggers.\n\n**Good messages:**\n- Explain what was detected\n- Explain why it''s problematic\n- Suggest alternatives or best practices\n- Use formatting for clarity (bold, lists, etc.)\n\n**Example:**\n```markdown\n⚠️ **Console.log detected!**\n\nYou''re adding console.log to production code.\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- Debug logs shouldn''t ship to production\n- Console.log can expose sensitive data\n- Impacts browser performance\n\n**Alternatives:**\n- Use a proper logging library\n- Remove before committing\n- Use conditional debug builds\n```\n\n## Event Type Guide\n\n### bash Events\n\nMatch Bash command patterns:\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: bash\npattern: sudo\\s+|rm\\s+-rf|chmod\\s+777\n---\n\nDangerous command detected!\n```\n\n**Common patterns:**\n- Dangerous commands: `rm\\s+-rf`, `dd\\s+if=`, `mkfs`\n- Privilege escalation: `sudo\\s+`, `su\\s+`\n- Permission issues: `chmod\\s+777`, `chown\\s+root`\n\n### file Events\n\nMatch Edit/Write/MultiEdit operations:\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: file\npattern: console\\.log\\(|eval\\(|innerHTML\\s*=\n---\n\nPotentially problematic code pattern detected!\n```\n\n**Match on different fields:**\n```markdown\n---\nevent: file\nconditions:\n  - field: file_path\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: \\.tsx?$\n  - field: new_text\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: console\\.log\\(\n---\n\nConsole.log in TypeScript file!\n```\n\n**Common patterns:**\n- Debug code: `console\\.log\\(`, `debugger`, `print\\(`\n- Security risks: `eval\\(`, `innerHTML\\s*=`, `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`\n- Sensitive files: `\\.env$`, `credentials`, `\\.pem$`\n- Generated files: `node_modules/`, `dist/`, `build/`\n\n### stop Events\n\nMatch when agent wants to stop (completion checks):\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: stop\npattern: .*\n---\n\nBefore stopping, verify:\n- [ ] Tests were run\n- [ ] Build succeeded\n- [ ] Documentation updated\n```\n\n**Use for:**\n- Reminders about required steps\n- Completion checklists\n- Process enforcement\n\n### prompt Events\n\nMatch user prompt content (advanced):\n\n```markdown\n---\nevent: prompt\nconditions:\n  - field: user_prompt\n    operator: contains\n    pattern: deploy to production\n---\n\nProduction deployment checklist:\n- [ ] Tests passing?\n- [ ] Reviewed by team?\n- [ ] Monitoring ready?\n```\n\n## Pattern Writing Tips\n\n### Regex Basics\n\n**Literal characters:** Most characters match themselves\n- `rm` matches \"rm\"\n- `console.log` matches \"console.log\"\n\n**Special characters need escaping:**\n- `.` (any char) → `\\.` (literal dot)\n- `(` `)` → `\\(` `\\)` (literal parens)\n- `[` `]` → `\\[` `\\]` (literal brackets)\n\n**Common metacharacters:**\n- `\\s` - whitespace (space, tab, newline)\n- `\\d` - digit (0-9)\n- `\\w` - word character (a-z, A-Z, 0-9, _)\n- `.` - any character\n- `+` - one or more\n- `*` - zero or more\n- `?` - zero or one\n- `|` - OR\n\n**Examples:**\n```\nrm\\s+-rf         Matches: rm -rf, rm  -rf\nconsole\\.log\\(   Matches: console.log(\n(eval|exec)\\(    Matches: eval( or exec(\nchmod\\s+777      Matches: chmod 777, chmod  777\nAPI_KEY\\s*=      Matches: API_KEY=, API_KEY =\n```\n\n### Testing Patterns\n\nTest regex patterns before using:\n\n```bash\npython3 -c \"import re; print(re.search(r''your_pattern'', ''test text''))\"\n```\n\nOr use online regex testers (regex101.com with Python flavor).\n\n### Common Pitfalls\n\n**Too broad:**\n```yaml\npattern: log    # Matches \"log\", \"login\", \"dialog\", \"catalog\"\n```\nBetter: `console\\.log\\(|logger\\.`\n\n**Too specific:**\n```yaml\npattern: rm -rf /tmp  # Only matches exact path\n```\nBetter: `rm\\s+-rf`\n\n**Escaping issues:**\n- YAML quoted strings: `\"pattern\"` requires double backslashes `\\\\s`\n- YAML unquoted: `pattern: \\s` works as-is\n- **Recommendation**: Use unquoted patterns in YAML\n\n## File Organization\n\n**Location:** All rules in `.claude/` directory\n**Naming:** `.claude/hookify.{descriptive-name}.local.md`\n**Gitignore:** Add `.claude/*.local.md` to `.gitignore`\n\n**Good names:**\n- `hookify.dangerous-rm.local.md`\n- `hookify.console-log.local.md`\n- `hookify.require-tests.local.md`\n- `hookify.sensitive-files.local.md`\n\n**Bad names:**\n- `hookify.rule1.local.md` (not descriptive)\n- `hookify.md` (missing .local)\n- `danger.local.md` (missing hookify prefix)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Creating a Rule\n\n1. Identify unwanted behavior\n2. Determine which tool is involved (Bash, Edit, etc.)\n3. Choose event type (bash, file, stop, etc.)\n4. Write regex pattern\n5. Create `.claude/hookify.{name}.local.md` file in project root\n6. Test immediately - rules are read dynamically on next tool use\n\n### Refining a Rule\n\n1. Edit the `.local.md` file\n2. Adjust pattern or message\n3. Test immediately - changes take effect on next tool use\n\n### Disabling a Rule\n\n**Temporary:** Set `enabled: false` in frontmatter\n**Permanent:** Delete the `.local.md` file\n\n## Examples\n\nSee `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/examples/` for complete examples:\n- `dangerous-rm.local.md` - Block dangerous rm commands\n- `console-log-warning.local.md` - Warn about console.log\n- `sensitive-files-warning.local.md` - Warn about editing .env files\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Minimum viable rule:**\n```markdown\n---\nname: my-rule\nenabled: true\nevent: bash\npattern: dangerous_command\n---\n\nWarning message here\n```\n\n**Rule with conditions:**\n```markdown\n---\nname: my-rule\nenabled: true\nevent: file\nconditions:\n  - field: file_path\n    operator: regex_match\n    pattern: \\.ts$\n  - field: new_text\n    operator: contains\n    pattern: any\n---\n\nWarning message\n```\n\n**Event types:**\n- `bash` - Bash commands\n- `file` - File edits\n- `stop` - Completion checks\n- `prompt` - User input\n- `all` - All events\n\n**Field options:**\n- Bash: `command`\n- File: `file_path`, `new_text`, `old_text`, `content`\n- Prompt: `user_prompt`\n\n**Operators:**\n- `regex_match`, `contains`, `equals`, `not_contains`, `starts_with`, `ends_with`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:33:56.799Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Claude, needing customized event handling and notification capabilities through markdown files with YAML frontmatter.","zh":"非常适合像 Claude 这样的 AI 代理，需要通过带有 YAML 前置内容的 Markdown 文件自定义事件处理和通知功能。","ja":"Claude のような AI エージェントに最適で、YAML フロントマターを備えた Markdown ファイルを使用してカスタマイズされたイベントハンドリングと通知機能が必要です。","ko":"Claude 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, YAML 프론트매터를 가진 마크다운 파일을 통해 사용자 정의 이벤트 처리 및 알림 기능을 필요로 합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA como Claude, que necesitan manejo de eventos personalizados y capacidades de notificación a través de archivos markdown con frontmatter YAML.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Claude, ayant besoin d''un traitement d''événements personnalisé et de capacités de notification via des fichiers markdown avec frontmatter YAML.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Claude, die ein benutzerdefiniertes Ereignishandling und Benachrichtigungsfähigkeiten über Markdown-Dateien mit YAML-Frontmatter benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Claude, que necessitam de tratamento de eventos personalizados e capacidades de notificação por meio de arquivos markdown com frontmatter YAML.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, которым необходимы настраиваемые обработчики событий и возможности уведомления через файлы markdown с YAML-заголовком.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude ، الذي يحتاج إلى معالجة أحداث مخصصة وقدرات إعلام عبر ملفات markdown مع YAML.frontmatter."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define patterns and messages using regex patterns and markdown formatting, triggering notifications for events like bash, file, stop, prompt, or all, stored in .claude/hookify.{rule-name}.local.md files.","zh":"赋予代理定义使用正则表达式模式和 Markdown 格式的模式和消息的能力，触发诸如 bash、文件、停止、提示或所有事件的通知，并将其存储在 .claude/hookify.{规则名称}.local.md 文件中。","ja":"エージェントが正規表現パターンと Markdown フォーマットを使用してパターンとメッセージを定義する機能を提供し、bash、ファイル、停止、プロンプト、またはすべてのイベントなどの通知をトリガーし、.claude/hookify.{ルール名}.local.md ファイルに保存します。","ko":"에이전트가 정규식 패턴과 마크다운 형식을 사용하여 패턴과 메시지를 정의할 수 있는 능력을 제공하며, bash, 파일, 중지, 프롬프트 또는 모든 이벤트 등의 알림을 트리거하고 .claude/hookify.{규칙 이름}.local.md 파일에 저장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir patrones y mensajes utilizando patrones de expresiones regulares y formato markdown, desencadenando notificaciones para eventos como bash, archivo, detención, prompt o todos, almacenados en archivos .claude/hookify.{nombre-de-regla}.local.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir des modèles et des messages en utilisant des modèles d''expressions régulières et un format markdown, déclenchant des notifications pour des événements tels que bash, fichier, arrêt, invite ou tous, stockés dans des fichiers .claude/hookify.{nom-de-règle}.local.md.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Muster und Nachrichten mithilfe von Regex-Mustern und Markdown-Formatierung zu definieren, die Benachrichtigungen für Ereignisse wie bash, Datei, Stopp, Prompt oder alle auslösen, die in Dateien .claude/hookify.{regel-name}.local.md gespeichert sind.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir padrões e mensagens usando padrões regex e formatação markdown, acionando notificações para eventos como bash, arquivo, parar, prompt ou todos, armazenados em arquivos .claude/hookify.{nome-da-regra}.local.md.","ru":"Позволяет агентам определять шаблоны и сообщения с помощью шаблонов regex и форматирования markdown, запуская уведомления для событий, таких как bash, файл, остановка, приглашение или все, хранящиеся в файлах .claude/hookify.{имя-правила}.local.md.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تعريف الأنماط والرسائل باستخدام أنماط regex وتنسيق markdown ، وتفعيل الإشعارات للأحداث مثل bash ، ملف ، إيقاف ، محفز أو جميعها ، المخزنة في الملفات .claude/hookify.{اسم-القاعدة}.local.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining custom event handlers for bash and file events","Creating notification rules with regex pattern matching","Generating markdown-formatted messages for agent notifications"],"zh":["为 bash 和文件事件定义自定义事件处理程序","使用正则表达式模式匹配创建通知规则","为代理通知生成 Markdown 格式的消息"],"ja":["bash とファイルのイベント用にカスタムイベントハンドラーを定義する","正規表現パターンマッチングを使用して通知ルールを作成する","エージェント通知用に Markdown フォーマットのメッセージを生成する"],"ko":["bash 및 파일 이벤트에 대한 사용자 정의 이벤트 처리기를 정의합니다","정규식 패턴 매칭을 사용하여 알림 규칙을 생성합니다","에이전트 알림용 마크다운 형식의 메시지를 생성합니다"],"es":["Definir controladores de eventos personalizados para eventos de bash y archivo","Crear reglas de notificación con coincidencia de patrones de expresiones regulares","Generar mensajes con formato markdown para notificaciones de agentes"],"fr":["Définir des gestionnaires d''événements personnalisés pour les événements bash et fichier","Créer des règles de notification avec une correspondance de modèles d''expressions régulières","Générer des messages au format markdown pour les notifications d''agents"],"de":["Definieren benutzerdefinierter Ereignishandler für bash- und Dateiereignisse","Erstellen von Benachrichtigungsregeln mit Regex-Mustervergleich","Generieren von markdown-formatierten Nachrichten für Agentenbenachrichtigungen"],"pt":["Definir manipuladores de eventos personalizados para eventos bash e arquivo","Criar regras de notificação com correspondência de padrão regex","Gerar mensagens formatadas markdown para notificações de agente"],"ru":["Определение пользовательских обработчиков событий для событий bash и файла","Создание правил уведомления с соответствием шаблона regex","Генерация сообщений формата markdown для уведомлений агента"],"ar":["تحديد معالجات أحداث مخصصة لأحداث bash وملف","إنشاء قواعد إعلام بالتطابق مع نمط regex","توليد رسائل تنسيق markdown لإشعارات العميل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires .claude directory for rule storage","Limited to events defined in the event parameter (bash, file, stop, prompt, all)","Dependent on YAML frontmatter and markdown file format"],"zh":["需要 .claude 目录来存储规则","仅限于事件参数中定义的事件（bash、文件、停止、提示、所有）","依赖于 YAML 前置内容和 Markdown 文件格式"],"ja":["ルールの保存に .claude ディレクトリが必要","イベントパラメータで定義されたイベント (bash、ファイル、停止、プロンプト、すべて) だけが使用可能","YAML フロントマターと Markdown ファイル形式に依存"],"ko":["규칙을 저장하려면 .claude 디렉토리가 필요합니다","이벤트 매개 변수에서 정의한 이벤트(bash, 파일, 중지, 프롬프트, 모든)만 사용할 수 있습니다","YAML 프론트매터 및 마크다운 파일 형식에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere un directorio .claude para el almacenamiento de reglas","Limitado a eventos definidos en el parámetro de eventos (bash, archivo, detención, prompt, todos)","Dependiente del frontmatter YAML y del formato de archivo markdown"],"fr":["Nécessite un répertoire .claude pour le stockage des règles","Limité aux événements définis dans le paramètre d''événements (bash, fichier, arrêt, invite, tous)","Dépendant du frontmatter YAML et du format de fichier markdown"],"de":["Benötigt ein .claude-Verzeichnis für die Speicherung von Regeln","Begrenzt auf in der Ereignisparameter definierte Ereignisse (bash, Datei, Stopp, Prompt, alle)","Abhängig vom YAML-Frontmatter und dem Markdown-Dateiformat"],"pt":["Requer diretório .claude para armazenamento de regras","Limitado a eventos definidos no parâmetro de evento (bash, arquivo, parar, prompt, todos)","Dependente do formato de frontmatter YAML e arquivo markdown"],"ru":["Требуется каталог .claude для хранения правил","Ограничен событиями, определёнными в параметре события (bash, файл, остановка, приглашение, все)","Зависит от формата YAML-заголовка и файла markdown"],"ar":["يتطلب دليل .claude لتخزين القواعد","محدد بالأحداث المحددة في معامل الحدث (bash ، ملف ، إيقاف ، محفز ، جميعها)","يعتمد على تنسيق YAML.frontmatter وملف markdown"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
