계 매핑을 갖춘다","관계 무결성","타입 안전성 및 비동기 호환성","PostgreSQL 최적화","이벤트 주도 아키텍처"],"es":["Definición de esquemas de base de datos robustos","Compatibilidad con Better Auth","Optimización para PostgreSQL","Modelo de usuario personalizable","Modelo de tarea con capacidad CRUD","Integridad relacional"],"fr":["Définition de schémas de base de données robustes","Compatibilité avec Better Auth","Optimisation pour PostgreSQL","Modèle d''utilisateur personnalisable","Modèle de tâche avec fonctionnalité CRUD","Intégrité relationnelle"],"de":["Definition robuster Datenbankschemata","Kompatibilität mit Better Auth","Optimierung für PostgreSQL","Anpassbares Benutzermodell","Aufgabenmodell mit CRUD-Funktion","Relationale Integrität"],"pt":["Modelo de usuário compatível com Better Auth","Modelo de tarefa com capacidade CRUD completa","Mapeamento relacional para usuários","Integridade relacional","Compatibilidade com PostgreSQL","Desenvolvimento assíncrono"],"ru":["Модель пользователя, совместимая с Better Auth","Модель задачи с полной возможностью CRUD","Реляционное сопоставление для пользователей","Реляционная целостность","Совместимость с PostgreSQL","Асинхронное развитие"],"ar":["نموذج المستخدم المتوافق مع Better Auth","نموذج المهمة مع القدرة الكاملة على CRUD","التحويل العلاقي للمستخدمين","السلامة العلاقية","التوافق مع PostgreSQL","التطوير غير المتزامن"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SQLModel","任务模型","数据库架构","Todo 应用程序","类型安全","异步兼容性","PostgreSQL","事件驱动架构"],"ja":["SQLModel","タスクモデル","データベース構造","Todo アプリケーション","タイプセーフ","非同期互換性","PostgreSQL","イベントドリブンアーキテクチャ"],"ko":["SQLModel","태스크 모델","데이터베이스 아키텍처","Todo 애플리케이션","타입 안전성","비동기 호환성","PostgreSQL","이벤트 주도 아키텍처"],"es":["SQLModel","aplicaciones Todo","esquemas de base de datos","gestión de tareas","Better Auth","PostgreSQL","CRUD","integridad relacional","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["SQLModel","applications Todo","schémas de base de données","gestion des tâches","Better Auth","PostgreSQL","CRUD","intégrité relationnelle","développement d''applications"],"de":["SQLModel","Todo-Anwendungen","Datenbankschemata","Aufgabenverwaltung","Better Auth","PostgreSQL","CRUD","relationale Integrität","Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["SQLModel","esquema de banco de dados","aplicações Todo","Better Auth","PostgreSQL","desenvolvimento assíncrono","modelo de usuário","modelo de tarefa","integridade relacional"],"ru":["SQLModel","схема базы данных","приложения Todo","Better Auth","PostgreSQL","асинхронное развитие","модель пользователя","модель задачи","реляционная целостность"],"ar":["نماذج SQLModel","مخطط قاعدة البيانات","برامج Todo","Better Auth","PostgreSQL","التطوير غير المتزامن","نموذج المستخدم","نموذج المهمة","السلامة العلاقية"]}},"owner":"SyedaNabila559","repo":"phase5","repoPath":"SyedaNabila559/phase5","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.409Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sqlmodel-task-models","description":"This skill should be used when defining a robust, type-safe, and async-compatible database schema for the Todo application using SQLModel, ensuring compatibility with Better Auth and optimized for PostgreSQL.","bodyPreview":"# SQLModel Task Models\n\nThis skill providing guidance on defining a robust database schema using SQLModel for the Todo application.\n\n## Purpose\nDefining a robust, type-safe, and async-compatible database schema for the Todo application using SQLModel, ensuring compatibility with Better Auth and optimized for PostgreSQL.\n\n## Capabilities\n- **User Model**: Schema aligned with Better Auth requirements.\n- **Task Model**: Full CRUD capability with relational mapping to Users.\n- **Relational Integrity","body":"# SQLModel Task Models\n\nThis skill providing guidance on defining a robust database schema using SQLModel for the Todo application.\n\n## Purpose\nDefining a robust, type-safe, and async-compatible database schema for the Todo application using SQLModel, ensuring compatibility with Better Auth and optimized for PostgreSQL.\n\n## Capabilities\n- **User Model**: Schema aligned with Better Auth requirements.\n- **Task Model**: Full CRUD capability with relational mapping to Users.\n- **Relational Integrity**: Proper foreign key constraints and back-references.\n- **Performance**: Strategic indexing on `user_id` and `completed` fields.\n- **Safety**: Automated timestamp management (`created_at`, `updated_at`).\n\n## Implementation Details\n\n### Models Definition\n```python\nfrom sqlmodel import SQLModel, Field, Relationship\nfrom typing import List, Optional\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\nclass User(SQLModel, table=True):\n    id: str = Field(primary_key=True)\n    email: str = Field(unique=True, index=True)\n    name: Optional[str] = None\n    created_at: datetime = Field(default_factory=datetime.utcnow)\n    tasks: List[\"Task\"] = Relationship(back_populates=\"user\")\n\nclass Task(SQLModel, table=True):\n    id: Optional[int] = Field(default=None, primary_key=True)\n    user_id: str = Field(foreign_key=\"user.id\", index=True)\n    title: str\n    description: Optional[str] = None\n    completed: bool = Field(default=False, index=True)\n    created_at: datetime = Field(default_factory=datetime.utcnow)\n    updated_at: datetime = Field(default_factory=datetime.utcnow)\n    user: Optional[User] = Relationship(back_populates=\"tasks\")\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n- Using `table=True` for models that map to database tables.\n- Explicitly defining indexes for fields used in `WHERE` clauses (e.g., `user_id`, `completed`).\n- Using `datetime.utcnow` for consistent cross-region timestamping.\n- Keeping `user_id` as a string to match Better Auth''s UUID/ID format.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:34:49.848Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full-Stack Agents requiring robust database schema design with SQLModel and async-compatible PostgreSQL integration.","zh":"适用于需要使用 SQLModel 进行强大的数据库架构设计以及异步兼容 PostgreSQL 集成的全栈代理。","ja":"SQLModel を使用した強力なデータベース スキーマ設計と async 互換性のある PostgreSQL 統合を必要とするフルスタック エージェントに最適。","ko":"SQLModel을 사용한 강력한 데이터베이스 스키마 설계 및 비동기 호환 PostgreSQL 통합을 필요로 하는 풀스택 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes Full-Stack que requieren un diseño de esquema de base de datos robusto con SQLModel y integración compatible con PostgreSQL asíncrono.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Full-Stack nécessitant une conception robuste de schéma de base de données avec SQLModel et une intégration PostgreSQL compatible avec async.","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Agents, die ein robustes Datenbank-Schema-Design mit SQLModel und async-kompatibler PostgreSQL-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Full-Stack que exigem um projeto de esquema de banco de dados robusto com SQLModel e integração com PostgreSQL compatível com async.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full-Stack, требующих прочного проектирования схемы базы данных с SQLModel и асинхронно-совместимой интеграцией с PostgreSQL.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مُصنّف كامل يتطلب تصميم مخطط قاعدة بيانات قوي مع SQLModel وتكامل PostgreSQL متوافق مع Async."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define type-safe and relational database schemas using SQLModel, ensuring compatibility with Better Auth and optimized for PostgreSQL, while leveraging Dapr and Kafka for event-driven architecture.","zh":"赋予代理定义类型安全和关系型数据库模式的能力，使用 SQLModel 确保与 Better Auth 兼容，并针对 PostgreSQL 优化，同时利用 Dapr 和 Kafka 实现事件驱动架构。","ja":"SQLModel を使用して、Better Auth と互換性があり、PostgreSQL に最適化された型安全で関係型のデータベース スキーマを定義するエージェントの能力を提供し、Dapr と Kafka を使用してイベント ドリブン アーキテクチャを実現。","ko":"SQLModel을 사용하여 Better Auth와 호환되고 PostgreSQL에 최적화된 유형 안전 및 관계형 데이터베이스 스키마를 정의하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며 Dapr 및 Kafka를 사용하여 이벤트 驱动 아키텍처를 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes definir esquemas de base de datos relacionales y seguros mediante SQLModel, garantizando la compatibilidad con Better Auth y optimizados para PostgreSQL, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha Dapr y Kafka para una arquitectura orientada a eventos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir des schémas de base de données relationnels et sécurisés à