des actualizadas y estables"],"fr":["Contribuer des compétences au référentiel principal","Améliorer la collaboration sur les projets","Partager des modèles et des techniques utiles","Documenter des compétences pour leur réutilisation","Suivre les directives d''écriture de compétences","Maintenir des compétences à jour et stables"],"de":["Fähigkeiten zum Hauptrepository beitragen","Zusammenarbeit in Projekten verbessern","Nützliche Muster und Techniken teilen","Fähigkeiten für Wiederverwendung dokumentieren","Richtlinien für die Erstellung von Fähigkeiten befolgen","Fähigkeiten auf dem neuesten Stand und stabil halten"],"pt":["Compartilhe habilidades de forma eficaz","Aprenda o fluxo de trabalho para compartilhar habilidades","Entenda quando compartilhar habilidades","Siga as diretrizes para compartilhar habilidades","Melhore a colaboração com o compartilhamento de habilidades","Aumente a produtividade com o compartilhamento de habilidades"],"ru":["Эффективно делитесь навыками","Ознакомьтесь с рабочим процессом для обмена навыками","Поймите, когда делиться навыками","Следуйте рекомендациям для обмена навыками","Улучшите сотрудничество с помощью обмена навыками","Повысьте производительность с помощью обмена навыками"],"ar":["مشاركة المهارات بفعالية","تعرف على تدفق العمل لمشاركة المهارات","افهم متى مشاركة المهارات","اتبع الإرشادات لمشاركة المهارات","حسن التنسيق مع مشاركة المهارات","زيادة الإنتاجية مع مشاركة المهارات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["共享技能","本地分支","上游仓库","代码质量","可重用性","技能共享","代码协作","代码管理"],"ja":["スキルの共有","ローカルブランチ","アップストリームリポジトリ","コードの品質","再利用性","スキル共有","コードコラボレーション","コードマネジメント"],"ko":["스킬 공유","로컬 브랜치","업스트림 저장소","코드 품질","재사용성","스킬 공유","코드 협력","코드 관리"],"es":["compartir habilidades","colaboración en proyectos","desarrollo de software","contribución al repositorio","patrones y técnicas de programación","documentación de habilidades","mejora de la colaboración","desarrollo de proyectos","gestión de habilidades"],"fr":["partage de compétences","collaboration sur les projets","développement de logiciels","contribution au référentiel","modèles et techniques de programmation","documentation de compétences","amélioration de la collaboration","développement de projets","gestion de compétences"],"de":["Fähigkeiten teilen","Zusammenarbeit in Projekten","Softwareentwicklung","Beitrag zum Repository","Muster und Techniken der Programmierung","Dokumentation von Fähigkeiten","Verbesserung der Zusammenarbeit","Projektentwicklung","Fähigkeitsmanagement"],"pt":["compartilhamento de habilidades","desenvolvimento de habilidades","colaboração em equipe","fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento","repositório upstream","branch local","compartilhamento de conhecimento","desenvolvimento de software","produtividade em equipe"],"ru":["обмен навыками","развитие навыков","командное сотрудничество","рабочий процесс разработки","репозиторий upstream","локальная ветка","обмен знаниями","разработка программного обеспечения","производительность команды"],"ar":["مشاركة المهارات","تطوير المهارات","تنسيق الفريق","تدفق العمل للتطوير","مستودع الرئيسي","فرع محلي","مشاركة المعرفة","تطوير البرمجيات","إنتاجية الفريق"]}},"owner":"julien51","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"julien51/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.409Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Sharing Skills","description":"Contribute skills back to upstream via branch and PR","version":"2.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Sharing Skills\n\n## Overview\n\nContribute skills from your local branch back to the upstream repository.\n\n**Workflow:** Branch → Edit/Create skill → Commit → Push → PR\n\n## When to Share\n\n**Share when:**\n- Skill applies broadly (not project-specific)\n- Pattern/technique others would benefit from\n- Well-tested and documented\n- Follows skills/meta/writing-skills guidelines\n\n**Keep personal when:**\n- Project-specific or organization-specific\n- Experimental or unstable\n- Contains sensitive informatio","body":"# Sharing Skills\n\n## Overview\n\nContribute skills from your local branch back to the upstream repository.\n\n**Workflow:** Branch → Edit/Create skill → Commit → Push → PR\n\n## When to Share\n\n**Share when:**\n- Skill applies broadly (not project-specific)\n- Pattern/technique others would benefit from\n- Well-tested and documented\n- Follows skills/meta/writing-skills guidelines\n\n**Keep personal when:**\n- Project-specific or organization-specific\n- Experimental or unstable\n- Contains sensitive information\n- Too narrow/niche for general use\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `gh` CLI installed and authenticated\n- Working directory is `~/.config/superpowers/skills/` (your local clone)\n- Skill has been tested (see skills/meta/writing-skills for TDD process)\n\n## Sharing Workflow\n\n### 1. Ensure You''re on Main and Synced\n\n```bash\ncd ~/.config/superpowers/skills/\ngit checkout main\ngit pull upstream main\ngit push origin main  # Push to your fork\n```\n\n### 2. Create Feature Branch\n\n```bash\n# Branch name: add-skillname-skill\nskill_name=\"your-skill-name\"\ngit checkout -b \"add-${skill_name}-skill\"\n```\n\n### 3. Create or Edit Skill\n\n```bash\n# Work on your skill in skills/\n# Create new skill or edit existing one\n# Skill should be in skills/category/skill-name/SKILL.md\n```\n\n### 4. Commit Changes\n\n```bash\n# Add and commit\ngit add skills/your-skill-name/\ngit commit -m \"Add ${skill_name} skill\n\n$(cat <<''EOF''\nBrief description of what this skill does and why it''s useful.\n\nTested with: [describe testing approach]\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n### 5. Push to Your Fork\n\n```bash\ngit push -u origin \"add-${skill_name}-skill\"\n```\n\n### 6. Create Pull Request\n\n```bash\n# Create PR to upstream using gh CLI\ngh pr create \\\n  --repo upstream-org/upstream-repo \\\n  --title \"Add ${skill_name} skill\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\nBrief description of the skill and what problem it solves.\n\n## Testing\nDescribe how you tested this skill (pressure scenarios, baseline tests, etc.).\n\n## Context\nAny additional context about why this skill is needed and how it should be used.\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n## Complete Example\n\nHere''s a complete example of sharing a skill called \"async-patterns\":\n\n```bash\n# 1. Sync with upstream\ncd ~/.config/superpowers/skills/\ngit checkout main\ngit pull upstream main\ngit push origin main\n\n# 2. Create branch\ngit checkout -b \"add-async-patterns-skill\"\n\n# 3. Create/edit the skill\n# (Work on skills/async-patterns/SKILL.md)\n\n# 4. Commit\ngit add skills/async-patterns/\ngit commit -m \"Add async-patterns skill\n\nPatterns for handling asynchronous operations in tests and application code.\n\nTested with: Multiple pressure scenarios testing agent compliance.\"\n\n# 5. Push\ngit push -u origin \"add-async-patterns-skill\"\n\n# 6. Create PR\ngh pr create \\\n  --repo upstream-org/upstream-repo \\\n  --title \"Add async-patterns skill\" \\\n  --body \"## Summary\nPatterns for handling asynchronous operations correctly in tests and application code.\n\n## Testing\nTested with multiple application scenarios. Agents successfully apply patterns to new code.\n\n## Context\nAddresses common async pitfalls like race conditions, improper error handling, and timing issues.\"\n```\n\n## After PR is Merged\n\nOnce your PR is merged:\n\n1. Sync your local main branch:\n```bash\ncd ~/.config/superpowers/skills/\ngit checkout main\ngit pull upstream main\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n2. Delete the feature branch:\n```bash\ngit branch -d \"add-${skill_name}-skill\"\ngit push origin --delete \"add-${skill_name}-skill\"\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**\"gh: command not found\"**\n- Install GitHub CLI: https://cli.github.com/\n- Authenticate: `gh auth login`\n\n**\"Permission denied (publickey)\"**\n- Check SSH keys: `gh auth status`\n- Set up SSH: https://docs.github.com/en/authentication\n\n**\"Skill already exists\"**\n- You''re creating a modified version\n- Consider different skill name or coordinate with the skill''s maintainer\n\n**PR merge conflicts**\n- Rebase on latest upstream: `git fetch upstream && git rebase upstream/main`\n- Resolve conflicts\n- Force push: `git push -f origin your-branch`\n\n## Multi-Skill Contributions\n\n**Do NOT batch multiple skills in one PR.**\n\nEach skill should:\n- Have its own feature branch\n- Have its own PR\n- Be independently reviewable\n\n**Why?** Individual skills can be reviewed, iterated, and merged independently.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **skills/meta/writing-skills** - How to create well-tested skills\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:35:14.974Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Collaborative AI Agents seeking to contribute and synchronize skills across repositories.","zh":"适合于寻求跨存储库贡献和同步技能的协作式AI代理。","ja":"リポジトリ間でスキルを貢献して同期したいコラボレーションAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"저장소 간에 스킬을 기여하고 동기화하려는 협력 인공지능 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Inteligencia Artificial Colaborativa que buscan contribuir y sincronizar habilidades a través de repositorios.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle Collaboratifs cherchant à contribuer et à synchroniser des compétences à travers des référentiels.","de":"Ideal für kollaborative KI-Agents, die dazu beitragen und Fähigkeiten über Repositorys hinweg synchronisieren möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Colaborativos que buscam contribuir e sincronizar habilidades em repositórios.","ru":"Идеально для Коллаборативных ИИ Агентов, стремящихся внести свой вклад и синхронизировать навыки в репозиториях.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي التعاوني الذين يسعون للمساهمة وتنسيق المهارات عبر المستودعات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to contribute skills from their local branch back to the upstream repository, utilizing Git workflow with Commit, Push, and PR protocols, ensuring skills are well-tested, documented, and follow specific guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理从本地分支向上游存储库贡献技能的能力，利用Git工作流程和提交、推送、PR协议，确保技能得到充分测试、文档记录并遵循特定指南。","ja":"ローカルブランチからアップストリームリポジトリにスキルを貢献するエージェントの能力を可能にし、Gitワークフローとコミット、プッシュ、PRプロトコルを利用して、スキルが十分にテストされ、文書化され、特定のガイドラインに従ったものとなるようにします。","ko":"로컬 브랜치에서 업스트림 저장소로 스킬을 기여하는 에이전트의 능력을 가능하게 하며, Git 워크플로와 커밋, 푸시, PR 프로토콜을 활용하여 스킬이 충분히 테스트되고 문서화되고 특정 가이드라인을 따르는 것을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes contribuir con habilidades desde su rama local hasta el repositorio de origen, utilizando el flujo de trabajo Git con protocolos de Commit, Push y PR, asegurando que las habilidades estén bien probadas, documentadas y sigan pautas específicas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de contribuer des compétences depuis leur branche locale jusqu''au référentiel en amont, en utilisant le flux de travail Git avec les protocoles Commit, Push et PR, en garantissant que les compétences soient bien testées, documentées et suivent des lignes directrices spécifiques.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Fähigkeiten von ihrem lokalen Branch zum Upstream-Repository beizutragen, indem sie den Git-Workflow mit Commit-, Push- und PR-Protokollen verwenden, um sicherzustellen, dass die Fähigkeiten gründlich getestet, dokumentiert und bestimmten Richtlinien folgen.","pt":"Habilita agentes a contribuir habilidades da sua branch local de volta ao repositório upstream, utilizando o fluxo de trabalho Git com protocolos Commit, Push e PR, garantindo que as habilidades sejam bem testadas, documentadas e sigam diretrizes específicas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам вносить свой вклад в навыки из их локальной ветки обратно в репозиторий upstream, используя рабочий процесс Git с протоколами Commit, Push и PR, обеспечивая, чтобы навыки были хорошо протестированы, задокументированы и следовали конкретным руководящим принципам.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من المساهمة في المهارات من فرعهم المحلي إلى المستودع الرئيسي، باستخدام تدفق العمل Git مع بروتوكولات Commit و Push و PR، مما يضمن أن تكون المهارات قد خضعت للاختبار جيدًا وتوثيقها وتتبع إرشادات محددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Contributing broadly applicable skills to upstream repositories","Sharing well-tested and documented patterns or techniques","Synchronizing skills across multiple repositories"],"zh":["向上游存储库贡献广泛适用的技能","分享经过充分测试和文档记录的模式或技术","跨多个存储库同步技能"],"ja":["アップストリームリポジトリに広く適用可能なスキルを貢献する","十分にテストされ、文書化されたパターンまたはテクニックを共有する","複数のリポジトリ間でスキルを同期する"],"ko":["업스트림 저장소에 폭넓게 적용 가능한 스킬을 기여하는 것","충분히 테스트되고 문서화된 패턴이나 기술을 공유하는 것","여러 저장소 간에 스킬을 동기화하는 것"],"es":["Contribuir con habilidades de aplicación amplia a los repositorios de origen","Compartir patrones o técnicas bien probadas y documentadas","Sincronizar habilidades a través de múltiples repositorios"],"fr":["Contribuer des compétences d''application large aux référentiels en amont","Partager des modèles ou des techniques bien testés et documentés","Synchroniser des compétences à travers plusieurs référentiels"],"de":["Beitragen von breit anwendbaren Fähigkeiten zu Upstream-Repositorys","Teilen von gut getesteten und dokumentierten Mustern oder Techniken","Synchronisieren von Fähigkeiten über mehrere Repositorys hinweg"],"pt":["Contribuir habilidades amplamente aplicáveis para repositórios upstream","Compartilhar padrões ou técnicas bem testadas e documentadas","Sincronizar habilidades em vários repositórios"],"ru":["Вносить свой вклад в навыки, которые широко применимы для репозиториев upstream","Обмениваться хорошо протестированными и задокументированными шаблонами или техниками","Синхронизировать навыки в нескольких репозиториях"],"ar":["المساهمة في المهارات التي تطبيقها واسع النطاق في المستودعات الرئيسية","مشاركة الأنماط أو التقنيات التي خضعت للاختبار جيدًا وتوثيقها","تنسيق المهارات عبر عدة مستودعات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to skills/meta/writing-skills guidelines","Skills must be broadly applicable and not project-specific","Experimental or unstable skills should not be shared"],"zh":["需要遵守技能/元数据/写作技能指南","技能必须广泛适用而不是项目特定","实验性或不稳定的技能不应共享"],"ja":["スキル/メタデータ/執筆スキルガイドラインに従う必要がある","スキルはプロジェクト特有ではなく広く適用可能でなければならない","実験的または不安定なスキルは共有してはならない"],"ko":["스킬/메타데이터/글쓰기 스킬 가이드라인을 따라야 함","스킬은 프로젝트 특유의 것이 아니라 널리 적용 가능한 것이어야 함","실험적이거나 불안定的 스킬은 공유되어서는 안 됨"],"es":["Requiere la adhesión a las pautas de habilidades/meta/habilidades de escritura","Las habilidades deben ser de aplicación amplia y no específicas de proyecto","No se deben compartir habilidades experimentales o inestables"],"fr":["Requiert l''adhésion aux lignes directrices de compétences/meta/compétences d''écriture","Les compétences doivent être d''application large et non spécifiques de projet","Les compétences expérimentales ou instables ne devraient pas être partagées"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung der Richtlinien für Fähigkeiten/meta/Schreibfähigkeiten","Fähigkeiten müssen breit anwendbar und nicht projektspezifisch sein","Experimentelle oder instabile Fähigkeiten sollten nicht geteilt werden"],"pt":["Exige adesão às diretrizes de habilidades/meta/escrita de habilidades","Habilidades devem ser amplamente aplicáveis e não específicas de projeto","Habilidades experimentais ou instáveis não devem ser compartilhadas"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения руководящих принципов навыков/meta/письма навыков","Навыки должны быть широко применимы и не специфичны для проекта","Экспериментальные или нестабильные навыки не должны быть обменены"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بإرشادات المهارات/المETA/كتابة المهارات","المهارات يجب أن تكون قابلة للتطبيق على نطاق واسع وليست محددة لمشروع معين","لا ينبغي مشاركة المهارات التجريبية أو غير المستقرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
