igo","Verificação de cobertura de teste","Análise de segurança","Compatibilidade com versões anteriores"],"ru":["Проверка запросов на добавление","Анализ качества кода","Проверка покрытия тестов","Анализ безопасности","Совместимость с предыдущими версиями"],"ar":["مراجعة الطلبات بالسحب","تحليل جودة الكود","التحقق من تغطية الاختبار","تحليل الأمان","التوافق مع الإصدارات السابقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PyTorch","PR审查","代码质量","安全性","GPU加速","Python","自动化","代码审查"],"ja":["PyTorch","PRレビュー","コード品質","セキュリティ","GPUアクセラレーション","Python","自動化","コードレビュー"],"ko":["PyTorch","PR 리뷰","코드 품질","보안","GPU 가속","Python","자동화","코드 리뷰"],"es":["revisión de PR de PyTorch","análisis de código","seguridad de PyTorch","compatibilidad hacia atrás","cobertura de pruebas","GPU Python","desarrollo de PyTorch"],"fr":["révision PR PyTorch","analyse de code","sécurité PyTorch","compatibilité descendante","couverture des tests","GPU Python","développement PyTorch"],"de":["PyTorch-PR-Überprüfung","Codeanalyse","PyTorch-Sicherheit","Abwärtskompatibilität","Testabdeckung","GPU Python","PyTorch-Entwicklung"],"pt":["revisão de PR PyTorch","qualidade de código","cobertura de teste","segurança","compatibilidade com versões anteriores","desenvolvimento de software","PyTorch"],"ru":["проверка PR PyTorch","качество кода","покрытие тестов","безопасность","совместимость с предыдущими версиями","разработка программного обеспечения","PyTorch"],"ar":["مراجعة برمجة PyTorch","جودة الكود","تغطية الاختبار","أمان","توافق مع الإصدارات السابقة","تطوير البرمجيات","PyTorch"]}},"owner":"pytorch","repo":"pytorch","repoPath":"pytorch/pytorch","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.409Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pr-review","description":"Review PyTorch pull requests for code quality, test coverage, security, and backward compatibility. Use when reviewing PRs, when asked to review code changes, or when the user mentions review PR, code review, or check this PR.","bodyPreview":"# PyTorch PR Review Skill\n\nReview PyTorch pull requests focusing on what CI cannot check: code quality, test coverage adequacy, security vulnerabilities, and backward compatibility. Linting, formatting, type checking, and import ordering are handled by CI.\n\n## Usage Modes\n\n### No Argument\n\nIf the user invokes `/pr-review` with no arguments, **do not perform a review**. Instead, ask the user what they would like to review:\n\n> What would you like me to review?\n> - A PR number or URL (e.g., `/pr-re","body":"# PyTorch PR Review Skill\n\nReview PyTorch pull requests focusing on what CI cannot check: code quality, test coverage adequacy, security vulnerabilities, and backward compatibility. Linting, formatting, type checking, and import ordering are handled by CI.\n\n## Usage Modes\n\n### No Argument\n\nIf the user invokes `/pr-review` with no arguments, **do not perform a review**. Instead, ask the user what they would like to review:\n\n> What would you like me to review?\n> - A PR number or URL (e.g., `/pr-review 12345`)\n> - A local branch (e.g., `/pr-review branch`)\n\n### Local CLI Mode\n\nThe user provides a PR number or URL:\n\n```\n/pr-review 12345\n/pr-review https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/12345\n```\n\nFor a detailed review with line-by-line specific comments:\n\n```\n/pr-review 12345 detailed\n```\n\nUse `gh` CLI to fetch PR data:\n\n```bash\n# Get PR details\ngh pr view <PR_NUMBER> --json title,body,author,baseRefName,headRefName,files,additions,deletions,commits\n\n# Get the diff\ngh pr diff <PR_NUMBER>\n\n# Get PR comments\ngh pr view <PR_NUMBER> --json comments,reviews\n```\n\n### Local Branch Mode\n\nReview changes in the current branch that are not in `main`:\n\n```\n/pr-review branch\n/pr-review branch detailed\n```\n\nUse git commands to get branch changes:\n\n```bash\n# Get current branch name\ngit branch --show-current\n\n# Get list of changed files compared to main\ngit diff --name-only main...HEAD\n\n# Get full diff compared to main\ngit diff main...HEAD\n\n# Get commit log for the branch\ngit log main..HEAD --oneline\n\n# Get diff stats (files changed, insertions, deletions)\ngit diff --stat main...HEAD\n```\n\nFor local branch reviews:\n- The \"Summary\" should describe what the branch changes accomplish based on commit messages and diff\n- Use the current branch name in the review header instead of a PR number\n- All other review criteria apply the same as PR reviews\n\n### GitHub Actions Mode\n\nWhen invoked via workflow, PR data is passed as context. The PR number or diff will be available in the prompt.\n\n## Review Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Fetch PR Information\n\nFor local mode, use `gh` commands to get:\n1. PR metadata (title, description, author)\n2. List of changed files\n3. Full diff of changes\n4. Existing comments/reviews\n5. Fetch associated issue information when applicable\n\n### Step 2: Analyze Changes\n\nRead through the diff systematically:\n1. Identify the purpose of the change from title/description/issue\n2. Group changes by type (new code, tests, config, docs)\n3. Note the scope of changes (files affected, lines changed)\n\n### Step 3: Deep Review\n\nPerform thorough line-by-line analysis using the review checklist. See [review-checklist.md](review-checklist.md) for detailed criteria covering:\n- Code quality and design\n- Testing adequacy\n- Security considerations\n- Performance implications\n- Any behavior change not expected by author\n\n### Step 4: Check Backward Compatibility\n\nEvaluate BC implications. See [bc-guidelines.md](bc-guidelines.md) for:\n- What constitutes a BC-breaking change\n- Required deprecation patterns\n- Common BC pitfalls\n\n### Step 5: Formulate Review\n\nStructure your review with actionable feedback organized by category.\n\n## Review Areas\n\n| Area | Focus | Reference |\n|------|-------|-----------|\n| Code Quality | Abstractions, patterns, complexity | [review-checklist.md](review-checklist.md) |\n| API Design | New patterns, flag-based access, broader implications | [review-checklist.md](review-checklist.md) |\n| Testing | Coverage, patterns, edge cases | [review-checklist.md](review-checklist.md) |\n| Security | Injection, credentials, input handling | [review-checklist.md](review-checklist.md) |\n| Performance | Regressions, device handling, memory | [review-checklist.md](review-checklist.md) |\n| BC | Breaking changes, deprecation | [bc-guidelines.md](bc-guidelines.md) |\n\n## Output Format\n\nStructure your review as follows:\n\n```markdown\n## PR Review: #<number>\n<!-- Or for local branch reviews: -->\n## Branch Review: <branch-name> (vs main)\n\n### Summary\nBrief overall assessment of the changes (1-2 sentences).\n\n### Code Quality\n[Issues and suggestions, or \"No concerns\" if none]\n\n### API Design\n[Flag new patterns, internal-access flags, or broader implications if any. Otherwise omit this section.]\n\n### Testing\n- [ ] Tests exist for new functionality\n- [ ] Edge cases covered\n- [ ] Tests follow PyTorch patterns (TestCase, assertEqual)\n[Additional testing feedback]\n\n### Security\n[Issues if any, or \"No security concerns identified\"]\n\n### Backward Compatibility\n[BC concerns if any, or \"No BC-breaking changes\"]\n\n### Performance\n[Performance concerns if any, or \"No performance concerns\"]\n\n### Recommendation\n**Approve** / **Request Changes** / **Needs Discussion**\n\n[Brief justification for recommendation]\n```\n\n### Specific Comments (Detailed Review Only)\n\n**Only include this section if the user requests a \"detailed\" or \"in depth\" review.**\n\n**Do not repeat observations already made in other sections.** This section is for additional file-specific feedback that doesn''t fit into the categorized sections above.\n\nWhen requested, add file-specific feedback with line references:\n\n```markdown\n### Specific Comments\n- `src/module.py:42` - Consider extracting this logic into a named function for clarity\n- `test/test_feature.py:100-105` - Missing test for error case when input is None\n- `torch/nn/modules/linear.py:78` - This allocation could be moved outside the loop\n```\n\n## Key Principles\n\n1. **No repetition** - Each observation appears in exactly one section. Never repeat the same issue, concern, or suggestion across multiple sections. If an issue spans categories (e.g., a security issue that also affects performance), place it in the most relevant section only.\n2. **Focus on what CI cannot check** - Don''t comment on formatting, linting, or type errors\n3. **Be specific** - Reference file paths and line numbers\n4. **Be actionable** - Provide concrete suggestions, not vague concerns\n5. **Be proportionate** - Minor issues shouldn''t block, but note them\n6. **Assume competence** - The author knows PyTorch; explain only non-obvious context\n\n## Files to Reference\n\nWhen reviewing, consult these project files for context:\n- `CLAUDE.md` - Coding style philosophy and testing patterns\n- `CONTRIBUTING.md` - PR requirements and review process\n- `torch/testing/_internal/common_utils.py` - Test patterns and utilities\n- `torch/testing/_internal/opinfo/core.py` - OpInfo test framework\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:35:36.746Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing advanced PyTorch pull request analysis capabilities with strong GPU acceleration","zh":"非常适合需要高级 PyTorch 拉取请求分析能力并具有强大 GPU 加速的代码审查代理","ja":"PyTorch のプルリクエスト分析機能に強力な GPU アクセラレーションを必要とするコードレビューエージェントに最適","ko":"고급 PyTorch 풀 리퀘스트 분석 기능과 강력한 GPU 가속이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de análisis de solicitudes de extracción de PyTorch con una fuerte aceleración de GPU","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''examen de code nécessitant des capacités d''analyse avancées de demande d''extraction de PyTorch avec une forte accélération de GPU","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die erweiterte PyTorch-Pull-Request-Analysefunktionen mit starker GPU-Beschleunigung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de análise de solicitações de pull do PyTorch com forte aceleração de GPU","ru":"Идеально для агентов проверки кода, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности анализа запросов на включение PyTorch с сильным ускорением GPU","ar":"مثالية لعميل مراجعة الشفرة الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحليل طلبات السحب من PyTorch مع تسريع قوي للوحدة المركزية الرسومية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to review PyTorch pull requests focusing on code quality, test coverage adequacy, security vulnerabilities, and backward compatibility, leveraging CI for linting, formatting, type checking, and import ordering with PyTorch and Python","zh":"赋予代理查看 PyTorch 拉取请求的能力，关注代码质量、测试覆盖充分性、安全漏洞和向后兼容性，利用 CI 进行 linting、格式化、类型检查和导入排序，支持 PyTorch 和 Python","ja":"PyTorch のプルリクエストをレビューするエージェントの能力を提供し、コードの品質、テストカバレッジの適切性、セキュリティ脆弱性、バックワードコンパチビリティに焦点を当て、CI を使用して linting、フォーマット、型チェック、インポート順序を実行し、PyTorch と Python をサポート","ko":"에이전트가 PyTorch 풀 리퀘스트를 리뷰할 수 있도록하며, 코드 품질, 테스트 커버리지 적절성, 보안 취약점 및 후방 호환성을 중점적으로 하여 CI를 사용하여 linting, 포맷팅, 유형 확인 및 가져오기 순서를 수행하며 PyTorch 및 Python을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a revisar solicitudes de extracción de PyTorch centrándose en la calidad del código, la adecuación de la cobertura de pruebas, las vulnerabilidades de seguridad y la compatibilidad hacia atrás, aprovechando la integración continua para el linter, el formato, la comprobación de tipos y el orden de importación con PyTorch y Python","fr":"Permet aux agents d''examiner les demandes d''extraction de PyTorch en se concentrant sur la qualité du code, l''adéquation de la couverture des tests, les vulnérabilités de sécurité et la compatibilité ascendante, en exploitant l''intégration continue pour le linter, le formatage, la vérification de type et l''ordre d''importation avec PyTorch et Python","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, PyTorch-Pull-Requests zu überprüfen und sich dabei auf Codequalität, Testabdeckungsadäquanz, Sicherheitslücken und Abwärtskompatibilität zu konzentrieren, wobei die kontinuierliche Integration für Linter, Formatierung, Typüberprüfung und Importreihenfolge mit PyTorch und Python genutzt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a revisar solicitações de pull do PyTorch, focando na qualidade do código, adequação da cobertura de teste, vulnerabilidades de segurança e compatibilidade com versões anteriores, utilizando CI para linting, formatação, verificação de tipo e ordenação de importação com PyTorch e Python","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверки запросов на включение PyTorch, сосредоточив внимание на качестве кода, достаточности тестового покрытия, уязвимостях безопасности и обратной совместимости, используя CI для линтинга, форматирования, проверки типов и упорядочения импорта с PyTorch и Python","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من مراجعة طلبات السحب من PyTorch مع التركيز على جودة الشفرة وكفاية تغطية الاختبار والثغرات الأمنية والتوافق العكسي، باستخدام CI للتنسيق والتدوين والتحقق من النوع وتحديد ترتيب الاستيراد مع PyTorch وPython"},"useCases":{"en":["Reviewing PyTorch pull requests for code quality and security","Analyzing test coverage adequacy in PyTorch projects","Ensuring backward compatibility in PyTorch dynamic neural networks"],"zh":["审查 PyTorch 拉取请求的代码质量和安全性","分析 PyTorch 项目中的测试覆盖充分性","确保 PyTorch 动态神经网络中的向后兼容性"],"ja":["PyTorch のプルリクエストのコード品質とセキュリティをレビューする","PyTorch プロジェクトのテストカバレッジの適切性を分析する","PyTorch の動的ニューラルネットワークのバックワードコンパチビリティを確保する"],"ko":["PyTorch 풀 리퀘스트의 코드 품질 및 보안 리뷰","PyTorch 프로젝트의 테스트 커버리지 적절성 분석","PyTorch 동적 신경망의 후방 호환성 보장"],"es":["Revisar solicitudes de extracción de PyTorch para la calidad del código y la seguridad","Analizar la adecuación de la cobertura de pruebas en proyectos de PyTorch","Asegurar la compatibilidad hacia atrás en redes neuronales dinámicas de PyTorch"],"fr":["Examiner les demandes d''extraction de PyTorch pour la qualité du code et la sécurité","Analyser l''adéquation de la couverture des tests dans les projets PyTorch","Assurer la compatibilité ascendante dans les réseaux de neurones dynamiques de PyTorch"],"de":["Überprüfen von PyTorch-Pull-Requests auf Codequalität und Sicherheit","Analyse der Testabdeckungsadäquanz in PyTorch-Projekten","Sicherstellung der Abwärtskompatibilität in dynamischen neuronalen Netzen von PyTorch"],"pt":["Revisar solicitações de pull do PyTorch para qualidade de código e segurança","Analizar a adequação da cobertura de teste em projetos PyTorch","Garantir a compatibilidade com versões anteriores em redes neurais dinâmicas PyTorch"],"ru":["Проверка запросов на включение PyTorch для качества кода и безопасности","Анализ достаточности тестового покрытия в проектах PyTorch","Обеспечение обратной совместимости в динамических нейронных сетях PyTorch"],"ar":["مراجعة طلبات السحب من PyTorch لجودة الشفرة والأمان","تحليل كفاية تغطية الاختبار في مشاريع PyTorch","ضمان التوافق العكسي في الشبكات العصبية الديناميكية PyTorch"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PyTorch project context","Limited to Python with strong GPU acceleration","No argument invocation requires user input for review target"],"zh":["需要 PyTorch 项目上下文","仅限 Python 且需要强大 GPU 加速","无参数调用需要用户输入以获取审查目标"],"ja":["PyTorch プロジェクトのコンテキストが必要","Python に限定され、強力な GPU アクセラレーションが必要","引数の呼び出しがないため、ユーザー入力を必要とするためレビュー対象の入力を必要とする"],"ko":["PyTorch 프로젝트 컨텍스트 필요","파이썬으로 제한되며 강력한 GPU 가속 필요","인수 호출이 필요 없으므로 사용자 입력을 필요로 하므로 리뷰 대상을 입력해야 함"],"es":["Requiere contexto de proyecto de PyTorch","Limitado a Python con una fuerte aceleración de GPU","No se requiere invocación de argumentos, lo que requiere una entrada de usuario para el objetivo de revisión"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de projet PyTorch","Limité à Python avec une forte accélération de GPU","Aucune invocation d''argument n''est requise, ce qui nécessite une entrée utilisateur pour la cible d''examen"],"de":["Benötigt PyTorch-Projekt-Kontext","Begrenzt auf Python mit starker GPU-Beschleunigung","Keine Argumentaufruf erforderlich, was eine Benutzereingabe für das Überprüfungsziel erfordert"],"pt":["Exige contexto do projeto PyTorch","Limitado a Python com forte aceleração de GPU","Nenhuma invocação de argumento requer entrada de usuário para destino de revisão"],"ru":["Требует контекста проекта PyTorch","Ограничен до Python с сильным ускорением GPU","Нет вызова аргумента требует ввода пользователя для цели проверки"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق مشروع PyTorch","محدود بال파이썬 مع تسريع قوي للوحدة المركزية الرسومية","لا يوجد استدعاء حجة يتطلب إدخال المستخدم لهدف المراجعة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
