"review-pr"},"description":{"zh":"Review PR是一种安全审查工具，帮助开发者检测代码中的安全风险和质量问题","ja":"Review PRは、開発者がコード内のセキュリティリスクと品質の問題を検出するためのセキュリティレビューツールです","ko":"리뷰 PR는 개발자가 코드 내의 보안 위험과 품질 문제를 감지하기 위한 보안 검토 도구입니다","es":"Nuestra herramienta de revisión de solicitudes de extracción garantiza la seguridad y la calidad del código","fr":"Notre outil de révision de pull requests garantit la sécurité et la qualité du code","de":"Unser Tool zur Überprüfung von Pull-Requests gewährleistet die Sicherheit und Qualität des Codes","pt":"O skill review-pr oferece uma revisão de pull request segura e eficiente, verificando alterações prejudiciais, padrões de código maliciosos e compatibilidade...","ru":"Умение review-pr предоставляет безопасный и эффективный обзор запроса на слияние, проверяя вредоносные изменения, злонамеренные шаблоны кода и обратную совме...","ar":"توفر مهارة review-pr مراجعة طلب سحب آمنة وفعالة، وتتحقق من التغييرات الضارة و أنماط الكود الخبيثة و القدرة على التوافق العكسي.","en":"Optimized and Maintenance-free Kubernetes on Hetzner Cloud in one command!"},"definition":{"en":"Optimized and Maintenance-free Kubernetes on Hetzner Cloud in one command!"},"features":{"zh":["自动化代码审查","安全风险检测","代码质量评估","破坏性更改检测","恶意代码模式识别"],"ja":["自動化コードレビュー","セキュリティリスクの検出","コード品質の評価","破壊的な変更の検出","悪意のあるコードパターンの識別"],"ko":["자동화된 코드 검토","보안 위험 감지","코드 품질 평가","파괴적인 변경 감지","악성 코드 패턴 인식"],"es":["Detección de cambios de ruptura","Análisis de patrones de código malicioso","Verificación de compatibilidad hacia atrás","Evaluación de la calidad del código"],"fr":["Détection de changements de rupture","Analyse de modèles de code malveillant","Vérification de la compatibilité descendante","Évaluation de la qualité du code"],"de":["Erkennung von Brechungen","Analyse von schädlichen Code-Mustern","Überprüfung der Abwärtskompatibilität","Bewertung der Code-Qualität"],"pt":["Revisão de pull request segura","Verificação de alterações prejudiciais","Detecção de padrões de código maliciosos","Verificação de compatibilidade backwards","Seguimento das diretrizes do CLAUDE.md"],"ru":["Безопасный обзор запроса на слияние","Проверка вредоносных изменений","Обнаружение злонамеренных шаблонов кода","Проверка обратной совместимости","Следование руководящим принципам CLAUDE.md"],"ar":["مراجعة طلب سحب آمنة","التحقق من التغييرات الضارة","اكتشاف أنماط الكود الخبيثة","التحقق من القدرة على التوافق العكسي","اتباع إرشادات CLAUDE.md"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查","安全审查","代码质量","破坏性更改","恶意代码","Kubernetes","CLAUDE.md","自动化测试"],"ja":["コードレビュー","セキュリティレビュー","コード品質","破壊的な変更","悪意のあるコード","Kubernetes","CLAUDE.md","自動化テスト"],"ko":["코드 검토","보안 검토","코드 품질","파괴적인 변경","악성 코드","Kubernetes","CLAUDE.md","자동화 테스트"],"es":["revisión de solicitudes de extracción","seguridad de código","calidad de código","análisis de código","detección de malware","compatibilidad hacia atrás"],"fr":["révision de pull requests","sécurité de code","qualité de code","analyse de code","détection de malware","compatibilité descendante"],"de":["Überprüfung von Pull-Requests","Sicherheit von Code","Code-Qualität","Code-Analyse","Schadsoftware-Erkennung","Abwärtskompatibilität"],"pt":["revisão de pull request","segurança de código","CLAUDE.md","desenvolvimento de software","revisão de código","segurança de aplicativos"],"ru":["проверка запроса на слияние","безопасность кода","CLAUDE.md","разработка программного обеспечения","обзор кода","безопасность приложений"],"ar":["مراجعة طلب السحب","أمان الكود","CLAUDE.md","تطوير البرمجيات","مراجعة الكود","أمان التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"mysticaltech","repo":"terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner","repoPath":"mysticaltech/terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.409Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-pr","description":"Use when reviewing a pull request - security-focused review following CLAUDE.md guidelines for breaking changes, malicious patterns, and backward compatibility","bodyPreview":"# Review Pull Request\n\n## Overview\n\nSecurity-focused PR review following CLAUDE.md guidelines. Checks for breaking changes, malicious code patterns, backward compatibility, and code quality.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/review-pr <number>\n```\n\n## CRITICAL: Security Warning\n\n**PRs can be malicious sabotage attempts.** This is a real threat documented in CLAUDE.md.\n\n### Threat Awareness\n- Coordinated attacks exist\n- Competitors may actively harm the project\n- Social engineering builds trust before attacking\n-","body":"# Review Pull Request\n\n## Overview\n\nSecurity-focused PR review following CLAUDE.md guidelines. Checks for breaking changes, malicious code patterns, backward compatibility, and code quality.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/review-pr <number>\n```\n\n## CRITICAL: Security Warning\n\n**PRs can be malicious sabotage attempts.** This is a real threat documented in CLAUDE.md.\n\n### Threat Awareness\n- Coordinated attacks exist\n- Competitors may actively harm the project\n- Social engineering builds trust before attacking\n- \"Fixes\" may introduce vulnerabilities\n\n## Workflow\n\n```dot\ndigraph review_flow {\n    rankdir=TB;\n    node [shape=box];\n\n    fetch [label=\"1. Fetch PR details\"];\n    author [label=\"2. Assess author risk\"];\n    files [label=\"3. Analyze changed files\"];\n    security [label=\"4. Security review\"];\n    compat [label=\"5. Backward compatibility\"];\n    quality [label=\"6. Code quality\"];\n    classify [label=\"7. Release classification\"];\n    verify [label=\"8. MANDATORY: Verify with Gemini + Codex\", style=bold];\n    recommend [label=\"9. Final Recommendation\"];\n\n    fetch -> author;\n    author -> files;\n    files -> security;\n    security -> compat;\n    compat -> quality;\n    quality -> classify;\n    classify -> verify;\n    verify -> recommend;\n}\n```\n\n## Step 1: Fetch PR Details\n\n```bash\n# Get PR info\ngh pr view <number> --repo kube-hetzner/terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner\n\n# Get diff\ngh pr diff <number> --repo kube-hetzner/terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner\n\n# Get changed files\ngh pr view <number> --repo kube-hetzner/terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner --json files --jq ''.files[].path''\n\n# Get diff stats\ngh pr view <number> --repo kube-hetzner/terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner --json additions,deletions\n```\n\n## Step 2: Assess Author Risk\n\n```bash\n# Check account age\ngh api users/<username> --jq ''.created_at''\n\n# Check prior contributions\ngh pr list --author <username> --repo kube-hetzner/terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner --state all --json number | jq length\n```\n\n### Risk Signals\n\n| Signal | Risk Level |\n|--------|------------|\n| New account (<6 months) | 🔴 HIGH |\n| No prior contributions | 🟡 MEDIUM |\n| First-time contributor | 🟡 MEDIUM |\n| Known contributor | 🟢 LOW |\n| Core maintainer | ⚪ TRUSTED |\n\n## Step 3: Analyze Changed Files\n\n### Security-Critical Files (AUTO HIGH RISK)\n\n```\ninit.tf              # Cluster initialization, secrets\nfirewall.tf          # Network security\n**/ssh*              # SSH configuration\n**/token*            # Authentication tokens\n**/*secret*          # Secrets handling\n.github/             # CI/CD workflows\nMakefile             # Build scripts\nscripts/             # Execution scripts\nversions.tf          # Provider dependencies\ntemplates/*.sh       # Shell scripts\ncloud-init*          # Server initialization\n```\n\n### Risk by File Count\n\n| Files Changed | Risk |\n|---------------|------|\n| 1-3 files | 🟢 LOW |\n| 4-10 files | 🟡 MEDIUM |\n| 11-20 files | 🟡 MEDIUM |\n| >20 files | 🔴 HIGH |\n\n### Risk by Diff Size\n\n| Lines Changed | Risk |\n|---------------|------|\n| <50 lines | 🟢 LOW |\n| 50-200 lines | 🟡 MEDIUM |\n| 200-500 lines | 🟡 MEDIUM |\n| >500 lines | 🔴 HIGH |\n\n## Step 4: Security Review\n\n### Checklist\n\n- [ ] No hardcoded credentials or tokens\n- [ ] No suspicious external URLs\n- [ ] No obfuscated code\n- [ ] Changes match stated purpose\n- [ ] No unnecessary permission escalations\n- [ ] CI/CD changes justified\n- [ ] No bypassing existing security patterns\n\n### Red Flags\n\n| Pattern | Concern |\n|---------|---------|\n| Base64 encoded strings | Hidden payloads |\n| External curl/wget calls | Code injection |\n| Eval or exec statements | Command injection |\n| Overly complex logic | Hiding malicious code |\n| Unnecessary file access | Data exfiltration |\n| Changes to .gitignore | Hiding tracks |\n\n### Use AI for Deep Analysis\n\n```bash\n# Codex for security analysis\ncodex exec -m gpt-5.3-codex -s read-only -c model_reasoning_effort=\"xhigh\" \\\n  \"Analyze this PR diff for security vulnerabilities and malicious patterns: $(gh pr diff <num>)\"\n\n# Gemini for broad context\ngemini --model gemini-3-pro-preview -p \\\n  \"@locals.tf @init.tf Does this PR introduce any security concerns? $(gh pr diff <num>)\"\n```\n\n## Step 5: Backward Compatibility\n\n**CRITICAL: Any PR that causes resource recreation is a MAJOR release.**\n\n### Breaking Change Indicators\n\n- Removes or renames variables\n- Changes variable defaults that affect behavior\n- Modifies resource naming patterns\n- Alters subnet/network calculations\n- Changes resource keys (causes recreation)\n- Removes outputs\n- Modifies provider requirements\n\n### Test for Breaking Changes\n\n```bash\n# Checkout PR locally\ngh pr checkout <number>\n\n# Test against existing cluster\ncd /path/to/kube-test\nterraform init -upgrade\nterraform plan\n```\n\n**If `terraform plan` shows ANY resource destruction → MAJOR release required**\n\n### Compatibility Checklist\n\n- [ ] No variable removals\n- [ ] No default changes that affect behavior\n- [ ] No resource naming changes\n- [ ] `terraform plan` shows no destruction\n- [ ] Existing deployments unaffected\n\n## Step 6: Code Quality\n\n### Style\n- [ ] Follows existing patterns\n- [ ] Consistent naming\n- [ ] Proper formatting (`terraform fmt`)\n- [ ] No unnecessary complexity\n\n### Logic\n- [ ] Changes are correct\n- [ ] Edge cases handled\n- [ ] No regressions introduced\n- [ ] Tests pass\n\n## Step 7: Release Classification\n\n### PATCH (x.x.PATCH)\n- Bug fixes only\n- No new features\n- Fully backward compatible\n- No terraform state impact\n\n### MINOR (x.MINOR.0)\n- New features (backward compatible)\n- New optional variables with defaults\n- Deprecation warnings (not removals)\n\n### MAJOR (MAJOR.0.0)\n- Breaking changes\n- Removed/renamed variables\n- Changed defaults affecting behavior\n- State migrations required\n- Resource recreations\n\n## Step 8: MANDATORY - Verify with Gemini and Codex\n\n**CRITICAL: Before making your final recommendation, you MUST run both Gemini and Codex to triple-verify the PR.**\n\nThis is not optional. External AI verification catches issues that may be missed in the initial review.\n\n### Run Both in Parallel\n\n```bash\n# Gemini - Broad context analysis (run first or in parallel)\ngemini --model gemini-3-pro-preview -p \"@control_planes.tf @locals.tf @init.tf\n\nAnalyze this PR diff for the kube-hetzner terraform module:\n\n$(gh pr diff <number> --repo kube-hetzner/terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner)\n\nQuestions:\n1. Is this change consistent with existing patterns in the codebase?\n2. Are there any security concerns?\n3. Could this cause breaking changes or resource recreation?\n4. Is this a legitimate bug fix or could it be malicious?\"\n\n# Codex - Deep reasoning security analysis (run in parallel)\ncodex exec -m gpt-5.3-codex -s read-only -c model_reasoning_effort=\"xhigh\" \\\n\"Analyze this Terraform PR for the kube-hetzner module.\n\nDIFF:\n$(gh pr diff <number> --repo kube-hetzner/terraform-hcloud-kube-hetzner)\n\nSECURITY ANALYSIS QUESTIONS:\n1. Could this change introduce any security vulnerabilities?\n2. Could this be a malicious change disguised as a bug fix?\n3. Will this cause any Terraform state changes or resource recreation?\n4. Is this pattern safe and consistent with Terraform best practices?\n5. Any edge cases or potential issues?\"\n```\n\n### Verification Checklist\n\n- [ ] Gemini analysis completed\n- [ ] Codex analysis completed\n- [ ] Both agree the change is safe\n- [ ] No concerns raised by either tool\n- [ ] If concerns raised, they have been addressed or explained\n\n### When Reviewers Disagree\n\nIf Gemini or Codex raises concerns that you didn''t catch:\n1. **Take the concern seriously** - investigate further\n2. **Re-read the code** with the concern in mind\n3. **Request changes** if the concern is valid\n4. **Document** why the concern was dismissed if you determine it''s a false positive\n\n### Output in Final Review\n\nInclude a summary of external verification:\n\n```markdown\n### External AI Verification\n\n| Reviewer | Verdict | Key Finding |\n|----------|---------|-------------|\n| Claude | ✅/❌ | <summary> |\n| Gemini | ✅/❌ | <summary> |\n| Codex | ✅/❌ | <summary> |\n\n**Consensus:** All reviewers agree / Disagreement on X\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 9: Final Recommendation\n\n### PR Review Output Template\n\n```markdown\n## PR Review: #<number>\n\n**Title:** <title>\n**Author:** @<username>\n**Files:** <count> files changed (+<additions>/-<deletions>)\n\n### Risk Assessment\n\n| Factor | Value | Risk |\n|--------|-------|------|\n| Author tenure | X months | 🟢/🟡/🔴 |\n| Prior contributions | N PRs | 🟢/🟡/🔴 |\n| Files changed | N files | 🟢/🟡/🔴 |\n| Lines changed | +X/-Y | 🟢/🟡/🔴 |\n| Security-critical files | Yes/No | 🟢/🔴 |\n| External dependencies | Yes/No | 🟢/🔴 |\n\n**Overall Risk:** 🔴 HIGH / 🟡 MEDIUM / 🟢 LOW\n\n### Security Review\n\n- [ ] No hardcoded credentials\n- [ ] No suspicious external URLs\n- [ ] No obfuscated code\n- [ ] Changes match stated purpose\n\n### Backward Compatibility\n\n- [ ] No breaking changes\n- [ ] terraform plan shows no destruction\n- [ ] Existing deployments unaffected\n\n### Release Classification\n\n**Type:** PATCH / MINOR / MAJOR\n**Reason:** <explanation>\n\n### External AI Verification\n\n| Reviewer | Verdict | Key Finding |\n|----------|---------|-------------|\n| Claude | ✅/❌ | <summary> |\n| Gemini | ✅/❌ | <summary> |\n| Codex | ✅/❌ | <summary> |\n\n**Consensus:** All agree / Disagreement on X\n\n### Recommendation\n\n**Action:** APPROVE / REQUEST CHANGES / CLOSE\n**Notes:** <specific concerns or required changes>\n```\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n```bash\n# Approve PR\ngh pr review <num> --approve --body \"LGTM! ...\"\n\n# Request changes\ngh pr review <num> --request-changes --body \"Please address: ...\"\n\n# Comment\ngh pr review <num> --comment --body \"...\"\n\n# Merge (after approval)\ngh pr merge <num> --squash --delete-branch\n```\n\n## Never Merge Directly to Master\n\nAll PRs go through staging branches first:\n\n1. Create staging branch\n2. Test thoroughly\n3. Get AI review (Codex + Gemini)\n4. Then merge to master\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:35:46.742Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Security-focused AI Agents needing advanced pull request analysis and code review capabilities following CLAUDE.md guidelines.","zh":"非常适合需要高级拉取请求分析和代码审查功能的安全性专注的 AI 代理，遵循 CLAUDE.md 指南。","ja":"セキュリティに焦点を当てたAIエージェントが、CLAUDE.mdのガイドラインに従って高度なプルリクエスト分析とコードレビュー機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"CLAUDE.md 가이드라인을 따라 고급 풀 요청 분석 및 코드 리뷰 기능이 필요한 보안 중심 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA con enfoque en seguridad que necesitan un análisis avanzado de solicitudes de incorporación y capacidades de revisión de código siguiendo las pautas de CLAUDE.md.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA axés sur la sécurité nécessitant une analyse avancée des demandes d''extraction et des capacités de révision de code suivant les directives de CLAUDE.md.","de":"Perfekt für sicherheitsorientierte KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Pull-Request-Analyse und Code-Review-Funktionen gemäß den CLAUDE.md-Richtlinien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA com foco em Segurança que necessitam de análise avançada de solicitações de pull e capacidades de revisão de código seguindo as diretrizes do CLAUDE.md.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на безопасность, которым необходима расширенная分析 запросов на принятие и возможности проверки кода, следующих руководящим принципам CLAUDE.md.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تركز على الأمن وتحتاج إلى تحليل متقدم لطلبات السحب وقدرات مراجعة الشفرة اتباع إرشادات CLAUDE.md."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform security-focused PR reviews, checking for breaking changes, malicious code patterns, backward compatibility, and code quality, utilizing Kubernetes on Hetzner Cloud and adhering to CLAUDE.md protocols.","zh":"赋予代理执行安全性专注的PR审查的能力，检查破坏性更改、恶意代码模式、向后兼容性和代码质量，利用Hetzner Cloud上的Kubernetes并遵循CLAUDE.md协议。","ja":"セキュリティに焦点を当てたPRレビューを実行するエージェントの能力を与え、破壊的な変更、悪意のあるコードパターン、後方互換性、コード品質をチェックし、Hetzner Cloud上のKubernetesを利用し、CLAUDE.mdプロトコルに従います。","ko":"보안 중심의 PR 리뷰를 수행할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하여 깨지기 쉬운 변경, 악성 코드 패턴, 후방 호환성 및 코드 품질을 확인하고 Hetzner Cloud의 Kubernetes를 사용하며 CLAUDE.md 프로토콜을 준수합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar revisiones de PR con enfoque en seguridad, comprobando cambios de ruptura, patrones de código maliciosos, compatibilidad hacia atrás y calidad del código, utilizando Kubernetes en Hetzner Cloud y siguiendo los protocolos de CLAUDE.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des révisions de PR axées sur la sécurité, en vérifiant les changements de rupture, les modèles de code malveillants, la compatibilité descendante et la qualité du code, en utilisant Kubernetes sur Hetzner Cloud et en respectant les protocoles de CLAUDE.md.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Sicherheits-PR-Überprüfungen durchzuführen, indem sie auf Brechungsänderungen, bösartige Code-Muster, Abwärtskompatibilität und Code-Qualität prüfen, Kubernetes auf Hetzner Cloud verwendend und den CLAUDE.md-Protokollen folgend.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar revisões de solicitações de pull com foco em segurança, verificando alterações quebradas, padrões de código maliciosos, compatibilidade backwards e qualidade de código, utilizando Kubernetes na Hetzner Cloud e aderindo aos protocolos do CLAUDE.md.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность выполнять проверки запросов на принятие, ориентированные на безопасность, проверяя разрывные изменения, злонамеренные модели кода, обратную совместимость и качество кода, используя Kubernetes в Hetzner Cloud и соблюдая протоколы CLAUDE.md.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إجراء استعراضات طلبات السحب مع التركيز على الأمن، واختبار التغييرات التي كسرة، ونماذج الشفرة الخبيثة، والتوافق العكسي وجودة الشفرة، واستخدام Kubernetes على Hetzner Cloud والامتثال لبروتوكولات CLAUDE.md."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating security audits for pull requests","Detecting malicious code patterns in Kubernetes deployments","Validating backward compatibility of updated codebases"],"zh":["自动执行拉取请求的安全审计","检测Kubernetes部署中的恶意代码模式","验证更新代码库的向后兼容性"],"ja":["プルリクエストのセキュリティ監査を自動化する","Kubernetesデプロイメントの中の悪意のあるコードパターンを検出する","更新されたコードベースの後方互換性を検証する"],"ko":["풀 요청의 보안 감사를 자동화하는","쿠버네트스 배포에서 악성 코드 패턴을 감지하는","업데이트된 코드베이스의 후방 호환성을 확인하는"],"es":["Automatización de auditorías de seguridad para solicitudes de incorporación","Detección de patrones de código maliciosos en implementaciones de Kubernetes","Validación de la compatibilidad hacia atrás de bases de código actualizadas"],"fr":["Automatisation des audits de sécurité pour les demandes d''extraction","Détection de modèles de code malveillants dans les déploiements de Kubernetes","Validation de la compatibilité descendante des bases de code mises à jour"],"de":["Automatisierung von Sicherheitsaudits für Pull-Requests","Erkennung bösartiger Code-Muster in Kubernetes-Deployments","Validierung der Abwärtskompatibilität von aktualisierten Codebasen"],"pt":["Automatizar auditorias de segurança para solicitações de pull","Detectar padrões de código maliciosos em implantações do Kubernetes","Validar a compatibilidade backwards de bases de código atualizadas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать аудиты безопасности для запросов на принятие","Обнаруживать злонамеренные модели кода в развертываниях Kubernetes","Проверять обратную совместимость обновленных баз кода"],"ar":["تأتمتة تدقيق الأمن لطلبات السحب","اكتشاف نماذج الشفرة الخبيثة في عمليات النشر الكوبرنيتيس","التحقق من توافق الشفرات المحدثة الى الوراء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires CLAUDE.md guidelines compliance","Kubernetes on Hetzner Cloud setup necessary","Security threat awareness and mitigation strategies needed"],"zh":["需要遵循CLAUDE.md指南","需要在Hetzner Cloud上设置Kubernetes","需要安全威胁意识和缓解策略"],"ja":["CLAUDE.mdガイドラインに従う必要がある","Hetzner Cloud上でKubernetesを設定する必要がある","セキュリティ脅威の認識と緩和戦略が必要"],"ko":["CLAUDE.md 지침을 따라야 함","Hetzner Cloud에서 쿠버네트스를 설정해야 함","보안 위협 인식 및 완화 전략이 필요"],"es":["Requiere cumplimiento de las pautas de CLAUDE.md","Configuración de Kubernetes en Hetzner Cloud necesaria","Conocimiento y estrategias de mitigación de amenazas de seguridad necesarias"],"fr":["Nécessite le respect des directives de CLAUDE.md","Configuration de Kubernetes sur Hetzner Cloud nécessaire","Connaissance et stratégies d''atténuation des menaces de sécurité nécessaires"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung der CLAUDE.md-Richtlinien","Kubernetes auf Hetzner Cloud-Setup erforderlich","Sicherheitsbedrohungskenntnis und -minderungsstrategien erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige conformidade com as diretrizes do CLAUDE.md","Configuração do Kubernetes na Hetzner Cloud necessária","Necessário ter estratégias de conscientização e mitigação de ameaças de segurança"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения руководящих принципов CLAUDE.md","Необходимо настроить Kubernetes в Hetzner Cloud","Необходимы стратегии осведомленности и смягчения угроз безопасности"],"ar":["يتطلب الامتثال لإرشادات CLAUDE.md","تكوين Kubernetes على Hetzner Cloud ضروري","استراتيجيات الوعي والتخفيف من угроз الأمن ضرورية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('pydantic/monty/python-playground', 'community', 'pydantic', 'monty', 'pydantic/monty', 'python-playground', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.409Z', '2026-02-18T03:35:44.765Z', NULL, '{"id":"pydantic/monty/python-playground","name":"python-playground","description":{"zh":"Python Playground是一个使用Rust实现的安全Python解释器，允许在隔离的环境中运行Python代码","ja":"Python Playgroundは、Rustで実装されたセキュアなPythonインタープリターであり、隔離された環境でPythonコードを実行することを可能にします","ko":"Python Playground는 Rust로 구현된 보안 Python 인터프리터로, 격리된 환경에서 Python 코드를 실행할 수 있습니다","es":"El entorno de Python es un intérprete minimalista y seguro escrito en Rust para uso de AI. Permite ejecutar código Python de forma aislada","fr":"L''environnement Python est un interpréteur minimaliste et sécurisé écrit en Rust pour une utilisation par l''IA. Il permet d''exécuter du code Python de manière isolée","de":"Die Python-Umgebung ist ein minimalistischer und sicherer Interpreter, der in Rust für die Verwendung durch KI geschrieben wurde. Er ermöglicht die isolierte Ausführung von Python-Code","pt":"O Python Playground é um ambiente de testes minimalista e seguro para executar código Python, escrito em Rust.","ru":"Python Playground - это минимальный и безопасный интерпретатор Python, написанный на Rust для изолированного выполнения кода Python.","ar":"بيثون بلاي جراوند هو مترجم بايثون آمن ومصغر مكتوب بلغة الرست لتشغيل كود بايثون في بيئة معزولة.","en":"A minimal, secure Python interpreter written in Rust for use by AI"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Python Playground: Rust实现的安全Python解释器","ja":"Python Playground: RustによるセキュアなPythonインタープリター","ko":"Python Playground: Rust로 구현된 보안 Python 인터프리터","es":"Entorno de Python: Ejecuta código de forma segura","fr":"Environnement Python: Exécutez du code de manière sécurisée","de":"Python-Umgebung: Führen Sie Code sicher aus","pt":"Python Playground: Ambiente de Testes em Rust","ru":"Python Playground: Минимальный интерпретатор Python на Rust","ar":"بيثون بلاي جراوند: مترجم بايثون آمن مصغر مكتوب بلغة الرست","en":"python-playground"},"description":{"zh":"Python Playground是一个使用Rust实现的安全Python解释器，允许在隔离的环境中运行Python代码","ja":"Python Playgroundは、Rustで実装されたセキュアなPythonインタープリターであり、隔離された環境でPythonコードを実行することを可能にします","ko":"Python Playground는 Rust로 구현된 보안 Python 인터프리터로, 격리된 환경에서 Python 코드를 실행할 수 있습니다","es":"El entorno de Python es un intérprete minimalista y seguro escrito en Rust para uso de AI. Permite ejecutar código Python de forma aislada","fr":"L''environnement Python est un interpréteur minimaliste et sécurisé écrit en Rust pour une utilisation par l''IA. Il permet d''exécuter du code Python de manièr...","de":"Die Python-Umgebung ist ein minimalistischer und sicherer Interpreter, der in Rust für die Verwendung durch KI geschrieben wurde. Er ermöglicht die isolierte...","pt":"O Python Playground é um ambiente de testes minimalista e seguro para executar código Python, escrito em Rust.","ru":"Python Playground - это минимальный и безопасный интерпретатор Python, написанный на Rust для изолированного выполнения кода Python.","ar":"بيثون بلاي جراوند هو مترجم بايثون آمن ومصغر مكتوب بلغة الرست لتشغيل كود بايثون في بيئة معزولة.","en":"A minimal, secure Python interpreter written in Rust for use by AI"},"definition":{"en":"A minimal, secure Python interpreter written in Rust for use by AI"},"features":{"zh":["隔离的playground目录","支持cpython行为","支持monty行为","安全的Python解释器","使用Rust实现"],"ja":["隔離されたplaygroundディレクトリ","cpythonの動作をサポート","montyの動作をサポート","セキュアなPythonインタープリター","Rustで実装"],"ko":["격리된 playground 디렉토리","cpython 동작 지원","monty 동작 지원","보안 Python 인터프리터","Rust로 구현"],"es":["Entorno de Python minimalista y seguro","Escrito en Rust para uso de AI","Ejecución de código Python de forma aislada","Compatibilidad con cpython y monty","Uso de herramientas de escritura y ejecución"],"fr":["Environnement Python minimaliste et sécurisé","Écrit en Rust pour une utilisation par l''IA","Exécution de code Python de manière isolée","Compatibilité avec cpython et monty","Utilisation d''outils d''écriture et d''exécution"],"de":["Minimalistische und sichere Python-Umgebung","Geschrieben in Rust für die Verwendung durch KI","Isolierte Ausführung von Python-Code","Kompatibilität mit cpython und monty","Verwendung von Schreib- und Ausführungstools"],"pt":["Ambiente isolado para testes","Execução de código Python seguro","Escrito em Rust para performance","Compatível com cpython e monty","Fácil de usar e configurar"],"ru":["Изолированная среда для тестирования","Безопасное выполнение кода Python","Написан на Rust для высокой производительности","Совместим с cpython и monty","Легко использовать и настраивать"],"ar":["بيئة معزولة للاختبارات","تشغيل كود بايثون آمن","مكتوب بلغة الرست لأداء عالي","متوافق مع cpython و monty","سهل الاستخدام والتهيئة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Python Playground","Rust Python解释器","安全Python解释器","隔离环境","cpython","monty","Python开发"],"ja":["Python Playground","Rust Pythonインタープリター","セキュアなPythonインタープリター","隔離環境","cpython","monty","Python開発"],"ko":["Python Playground","Rust Python 인터프리터","보안 Python 인터프리터","격리 환경","cpython","monty","Python 개발"],"es":["entorno de python","python seguro","intérprete de python","rust para ai","ejecución de código python","desarrollo de ai","python para inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["environnement python","python sécurisé","interpréteur python","rust pour ia","exécution de code python","développement d''ia","python pour intelligence artificielle"],"de":["python-umgebung","sicherer python","python-interpreter","rust für ki","ausführung von python-code","entwicklung von ki","python für künstliche intelligenz"],"pt":["Python Playground","interpretador Python","Rust","ambiente de testes","segurança","desenvolvimento de software","programação em Python"],"ru":["Python Playground","интерпретатор Python","Rust","среда для тестирования","безопасность","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование на Python"],"ar":["بيثون بلاي جراوند","مترجم بايثون","رست","بيئة الاختبارات","الأمان","تطوير البرمجيات","برمجة بايثون"]}},"owner":"pydantic","repo":"monty","repoPath":"pydantic/monty","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.409Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"python-playground","description":"Run and test Python code in a dedicated playground directory. Use when you need to execute Python scripts, test code snippets, investigate CPython behavior, or experiment with Python without affecting the main codebase.","bodyPreview":"# Python Playground\n\nRun Python code in an isolated playground directory for testing and experimentation.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. First, ensure the playground directory exists: `mkdir -p playground`\n2. Use the Write tool to create the Python file at `playground/test.py`\n3. Run with: `uv run playground/test.py` to test cpython behavior or `cargo run -- playground/test.py` to test monty behavior\n\nIMPORTANT: Use separate tool calls for each step - do NOT chain commands with `&&` or use heredocs. This","body":"# Python Playground\n\nRun Python code in an isolated playground directory for testing and experimentation.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. First, ensure the playground directory exists: `mkdir -p playground`\n2. Use the Write tool to create the Python file at `playground/test.py`\n3. Run with: `uv run playground/test.py` to test cpython behavior or `cargo run -- playground/test.py` to test monty behavior\n\nIMPORTANT: Use separate tool calls for each step - do NOT chain commands with `&&` or use heredocs. This allows the pre-approved commands to work without prompting.\n\n## Example workflow\n\nStep 1 - Create directory (Bash, already allowed):\n```bash\nmkdir -p playground\n```\n\nStep 2 - Write code (use Write tool, not cat):\nWrite to `playground/test.py`:\n```python\ndef foo():\n    raise ValueError(''test'')\n\nfoo()\n```\n\nStep 3 - Run script (Bash, already allowed):\n```bash\nuv run playground/test.py\n```\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- The `playground/` directory is gitignored\n- Use a different file name for each test you want to run, give the files recognizable names like `test_value_error.py`\n- Use `uv run ...` to run scripts (uses project Python)\n- Or, `cargo run -- ...` to run scripts using Monty\n- Use Write tool for creating files (avoids permission prompts)\n- Run mkdir and uv as separate commands (not chained)\n- do NOT delete files from playground after you''ve finished testing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:35:44.765Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Execution Agents requiring secure Python sandboxing with Rust-level isolation.","zh":"非常适合需要安全Python沙盒且具有Rust级隔离的代码执行代理。","ja":"セキュアなPythonサンドボックスとRustレベルの隔離が必要なコード実行エージェントに最適です。","ko":"보안이 필요한 Python 샌드박스 및 러스트 수준의 격리 기능이 필요한 코드 실행 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de ejecución de código que requieren aislamiento de Python seguro con aislamiento de nivel Rust.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''exécution de code nécessitant un bac à sable Python sécurisé avec une isolation de niveau Rust.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Ausführungsagenten, die sicheres Python-Sandboxing mit Rust-Isolation erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Execução de Código que exigem sandboxing Python seguro com isolamento de nível Rust.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов выполнения кода, требующих безопасную песочницу Python с изоляцией уровня Rust.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التنفيذيين للرمز الذين يحتاجون إلى حماية صندوق رمل Python آمن مع عزل مستوى الرست"},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables AI agents to execute Python code in an isolated playground directory with Rust-based security guarantees. Provides deterministic CPython behavior testing through uv and Monty interpreter compatibility via cargo run.","zh":"允许AI代理在隔离的游乐场目录中执行Python代码，具有基于Rust的安全保证。通过uv和Monty解释器兼容性提供确定性的CPython行为测试，方法是使用cargo run。","ja":"AIエージェントが、Rustベースのセキュリティ保証を備えた隔離されたプレイグラウンドディレクトリでPythonコードを実行できるようにします。uvおよびMontyインタープリターの互換性を使用して、cargo runで決定的なCPython動作テストを提供します。","ko":"AI 에이전트가 Rust 기반의 보안 보장을 갖춘 격리된 플레이그라운드 디렉토리에서 Python 코드를 실행할 수 있도록 합니다. uv 및 Monty 인터프리터 호환성을 사용하여 cargo run에서 결정적인 CPython 동작 테스트를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes de inteligencia artificial ejecutar código Python en un directorio de área de juego aislado con garantías de seguridad basadas en Rust. Proporciona un comportamiento de prueba determinista de CPython a través de la compatibilidad de uv y el intérprete Monty a través de cargo run.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intelligence artificielle d''exécuter du code Python dans un répertoire de zone de jeu isolé avec des garanties de sécurité basées sur Rust. Fournit un comportement de test déterministe de CPython via la compatibilité uv et l''interpréteur Monty via cargo run.","de":"Ermöglicht KI-Agents die Ausführung von Python-Code in einem isolierten Spielbereich-Verzeichnis mit Rust-basierten Sicherheitsgarantien. Bietet deterministisches CPython-Verhaltens-Testen durch uv- und Monty-Interpreter-Kompatibilität über cargo run.","pt":"Permite que os agentes de IA executem código Python em um diretório de playground isolado com garantias de segurança baseadas em Rust. Fornece teste de comportamento determinístico do CPython por meio da compatibilidade do interpretador Monty via cargo run e uv.","ru":"Позволяет агентам ИИ выполнять код Python в изолированном каталоге-песочнице с гарантиями безопасности на основе Rust. Предоставляет детерминированное тестирование поведения CPython через совместимость интерпретатора Monty с помощью cargo run и uv.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي بتنفيذ رمز البايثون في دليل لعب معزول مع ضمانات أمان تستند إلى الرست. يوفر اختبار سلوك محدد من CPython من خلال متوافقية مترجم مونتي عبر تشغيل الحمولة و uv."},"useCases":{"en":["Testing CPython compatibility for code snippets","Experimenting with Python syntax in secure sandbox","Validating Monty interpreter behavior","Isolating potentially unsafe code execution"],"zh":["测试代码片段的CPython兼容性","在安全沙盒中实验Python语法","验证Monty解释器行为","隔离潜在的不安全代码执行"],"ja":["コードスニペットのCPython互換性をテストする","セキュアなサンドボックスでPythonの構文を実験する","Montyインタープリターの動作を検証する","潜在的に安全でないコードの実行を隔離する"],"ko":["코드 조각의 CPython 호환성 테스트","보안 샌드박스에서 Python 구문을 실험","Monty 인터프리터 동작의 유효성 검사","잠재적으로 안전하지 않은 코드 실행의 격리"],"es":["Prueba de compatibilidad de CPython para fragmentos de código","Experimentación con la sintaxis de Python en un entorno de sandbox seguro","Validación del comportamiento del intérprete Monty","Aislamiento de la ejecución de código potencialmente inseguro"],"fr":["Test de compatibilité de CPython pour les extraits de code","Expérimentation avec la syntaxe Python dans un environnement de bac à sable sécurisé","Validation du comportement de l''interpréteur Monty","Isolement de l''exécution de code potentiellement dangereux"],"de":["Testen der CPython-Kompatibilität für Code-Snippets","Experimentieren mit Python-Syntax in einem sicheren Sandbox-Umfeld","Validierung des Verhaltens des Monty-Interpreters","Isolieren der potenziell unsicheren Code-Ausführung"],"pt":["Testar a compatibilidade do CPython para trechos de código","Experimentar a sintaxe Python em uma caixa de areia segura","Validar o comportamento do interpretador Monty","Isolar a execução de código potencialmente inseguro"],"ru":["Тестировать совместимость CPython для фрагментов кода","Экспериментировать с синтаксисом Python в безопасной песочнице","Проверять поведение интерпретатора Monty","Изолировать потенциально небезопасное выполнение кода"],"ar":["اختبار التوافق مع مترجم CPython لأجزاء من الرمز","التجربة مع بناء الجملة البايثون في صندوق رمل آمن","التحقق من سلوك مترجم مونتي","عزل تنفيذ رمز محتملا عدم أمان"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires manual playground directory creation (mkdir -p playground)","Separate tool calls needed for each execution step","No command chaining support (&&/heredocs prohibited)"],"zh":["需要手动创建游乐场目录（mkdir -p playground）","每个执行步骤都需要单独的工具调用","不支持命令链（&&/heredocs禁止）"],"ja":["プレイグラウンドディレクトリの手動作成（mkdir -p playground）が必要","各実行ステップには個別のツール呼び出しが必要","コマンドチェーンのサポートはありません（&&/heredocsは禁止）"],"ko":["플레이그라운드 디렉토리의 수동 생성(mkdir -p playground)이 필요","각 실행 단계에 대해 별도의 도구 호출이 필요","명령어 체인 지원되지 않음(&&/heredocs 금지)"],"es":["Requiere la creación manual del directorio de área de juego (mkdir -p playground)","Se necesitan llamadas de herramientas separadas para cada paso de ejecución","No se admite la cadena de comandos (&&/heredocs prohibidos)"],"fr":["Nécessite la création manuelle du répertoire de zone de jeu (mkdir -p playground)","Des appels d''outils séparés sont nécessaires pour chaque étape d''exécution","Le chaînage de commandes n''est pas pris en charge (&&/heredocs interdits)"],"de":["Erfordert manuelle Erstellung des Spielbereich-Verzeichnisses (mkdir -p playground)","Getrennte Werkzeugaufrufe sind für jeden Ausführungsschritt erforderlich","Befehlsverkettung wird nicht unterstützt (&&/heredocs verboten)"],"pt":["Requer a criação manual do diretório de playground (mkdir -p playground)","Chamadas de ferramentas separadas necessárias para cada etapa de execução","Não há suporte para encadeamento de comandos (&&/heredocs proibidos)"],"ru":["Требует ручного создания каталога-песочницы (mkdir -p playground)","Отдельные вызовы инструментов необходимы для каждого шага выполнения","Нет поддержки цепочки команд (&&/heredocs запрещены)"],"ar":["يتطلب إنشاء دليل اللعب بشكل يدوي (mkdir -p playground)","مكالمات أدوات منفصلة ضرورية لكل خطوة من خطوات التنفيذ","لا يدعم ربط الأوامر (&&/heredocs ممنوع)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('TheOrcDev/8bitcn-ui/rerender-memo', 'community', 'TheOrcDev', '8bitcn-ui', 'TheOrcDev/8bitcn-ui', 'rerender-memo', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z', '2026-02-18T03:36:18.738Z', NULL, '{"id":"TheOrcDev/8bitcn-ui/rerender-memo","name":"rerender-memo","description":{"zh":"rerender-memo 技术是一种优化代码性能的方法，通过提取昂贵的计算到 memoized 组件中，实现早期返回和减少计算","ja":"rerender-memo 技術は、コードのパフォーマンスを最適化する方法で、計算コストの高い処理を memoized コンポーネントに抽出して早期リターンと計算の削減を実現する","ko":"rerender-memo 기술은 코드 성능을 최적화하는 방법으로, 비싼 계산을 memoized 컴포넌트로 추출하여 초기 반환과 계산을 줄이는 것을 가능하게 합니다","es":"rerender-memo es un conjunto de componentes accesibles y una plataforma de distribución de código de código abierto que permite extraer componentes costosos en componentes memorizados","fr":"rerender-memo est un ensemble de composants accessibles et une plateforme de distribution de code open source qui permet d''extraire des composants coûteux en composants mémorisés","de":"rerender-memo ist ein Satz von zugänglichen Komponenten und einer Code-Verteilungsplattform mit Open-Source-Code, der es ermöglicht, teure Komponenten in memoisierte Komponenten zu extrahieren","pt":"A habilidade rerender-memo permite extrair componentes caros e melhorar o desempenho da aplicação","ru":"Навык rerender-memo позволяет извлечь дорогие компоненты и улучшить производительность приложения","ar":"تسمح مهارة rerender-memo بإستخراج المكونات الغالية وتحسين أداء التطبيق","en":"A set of retro-designed, accessible components and a code distribution platform. Open Source. Open Code."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"rerender-memo 技术：优化代码性能","ja":"rerender-memo 技術：コードのパフォーマンスを最適化","ko":"rerender-memo 기술: 코드 성능 최적화","es":"Optimiza rendimiento con rerender-memo","fr":"Améliorez les performances avec rerender-memo","de":"Leistung optimieren mit rerender-memo","pt":"Otimização de Rerender com Memo","ru":"Оптимизация перерендера с Memo","ar":"تحسين إعادة التصيير مع Memo","en":"rerender-memo"},"description":{"zh":"rerender-memo 技术是一种优化代码性能的方法，通过提取昂贵的计算到 memoized 组件中，实现早期返回和减少计算","ja":"rerender-memo 技術は、コードのパフォーマンスを最適化する方法で、計算コストの高い処理を memoized コンポーネントに抽出して早期リターンと計算の削減を実現する","ko":"rerender-memo 기술은 코드 성능을 최적화하는 방법으로, 비싼 계산을 memoized 컴포넌트로 추출하여 초기 반환과 계산을 줄이는 것을 가능하게 합니다","es":"rerender-memo es un conjunto de componentes accesibles y una plataforma de distribución de código de código abierto que permite extraer componentes costosos ...","fr":"rerender-memo est un ensemble de composants accessibles et une plateforme de distribution de code open source qui permet d''extraire des composants coûteux en...","de":"rerender-memo ist ein Satz von zugänglichen Komponenten und einer Code-Verteilungsplattform mit Open-Source-Code, der es ermöglicht, teure Komponenten in mem...","pt":"A habilidade rerender-memo permite extrair componentes caros e melhorar o desempenho da aplicação","ru":"Навык rerender-memo позволяет извлечь дорогие компоненты и улучшить производительность приложения","ar":"تسمح مهارة rerender-memo بإستخراج المكونات الغالية وتحسين أداء التطبيق","en":"A set of retro-designed, accessible components and a code distribution platform. Open Source. Open Code."},"definition":{"en":"A set of retro-designed, accessible components and a code distribution platform. Open Source. Open Code."},"features":{"zh":["优化代码性能","减少计算","实现早期返回","开源和可访问","支持 memoized 组件"],"ja":["コードのパフォーマンスを最適化","計算を削減","早期リターンを実現","オープンソースとアクセシブル","memoized コンポーネントをサポート"],"ko":["코드 성능 최적화","계산을 줄임","초기 반환을 구현","오픈소스이고 접근성이 뛰어난","memoized 컴포넌트를 지원"],"es":["Componentes accesibles","Plataforma de distribución de código de código abierto","Extrae componentes costosos en componentes memorizados","Mejora el rendimiento de la aplicación","Compatible con useMemo y memo"],"fr":["Composants accessibles","Plateforme de distribution de code open source","Extrait des composants coûteux en composants mémorisés","Améliore les performances de l''application","Compatible avec useMemo et memo"],"de":["Zugängliche Komponenten","Code-Verteilungsplattform mit Open-Source-Code","Extrahiert teure Komponenten in memoisierte Komponenten","Verbessert die Leistung der Anwendung","Kompatibel mit useMemo und memo"],"pt":["Extração de componentes caros","Melhoria do desempenho da aplicação","Uso de memoização para evitar cálculos desnecessários","Compatibilidade com componentes personalizados","Otimização de renderização de componentes"],"ru":["Извлечение дорогих компонентов","Улучшение производительности приложения","Использование кэширования для избежания ненужных вычислений","Возможность использования пользовательских компонентов","Оптимизация рендеринга компонентов"],"ar":["إستخراج المكونات الغالية","تحسين أداء التطبيق","استخدام التخزين المؤقت لتجنب الحسابات غير الضرورية","دعم المكونات المخصصة","تحسين إعادة التصيير للمكونات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["rerender-memo","代码性能优化","memoized 组件","早期返回","开源","可访问"],"ja":["rerender-memo","コードのパフォーマンス最適化","memoized コンポーネント","早期リターン","オープンソース","アクセシブル"],"ko":["rerender-memo","코드 성능 최적화","memoized 컴포넌트","초기 반환","오픈소스","접근성이 뛰어난"],"es":["rerender-memo","optimización de rendimiento","componentes accesibles","plataforma de distribución de código","open source","useMemo","memo","react","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["rerender-memo","optimisation des performances","composants accessibles","plateforme de distribution de code","open source","useMemo","memo","react","développement d''applications"],"de":["rerender-memo","Leistungsoptimierung","zugängliche Komponenten","Code-Verteilungsplattform","Open-Source-Code","useMemo","memo","react","Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["rerender-memo","otimização de desempenho","memoização","componentes caros","renderização de componentes","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","melhoria de desempenho"],"ru":["rerender-memo","оптимизация производительности","кэширование","дорогие компоненты","рендеринг компонентов","разработка приложений","улучшение производительности"],"ar":["rerender-memo","تحسين الأداء","التخزين المؤقت","المكونات الغالية","إعادة التصيير للمكونات","تطوير التطبيقات","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"TheOrcDev","repo":"8bitcn-ui","repoPath":"TheOrcDev/8bitcn-ui","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rerender-memo","description":"Extract expensive work into memoized components with React.memo. Apply when components perform expensive computations that can be skipped when props havent changed.","bodyPreview":"## Extract to Memoized Components\n\nExtract expensive work into memoized components to enable early returns before computation.\n\n**Incorrect (computes avatar even when loading):**\n\n```tsx\nfunction Profile({ user, loading }: Props) {\n  const avatar = useMemo(() => {\n    const id = computeAvatarId(user)\n    return <Avatar id={id} />\n  }, [user])\n\n  if (loading) return <Skeleton />\n  return <div>{avatar}</div>\n}\n```\n\n**Correct (skips computation when loading):**\n\n```tsx\nconst UserAvatar = memo(funct","body":"## Extract to Memoized Components\n\nExtract expensive work into memoized components to enable early returns before computation.\n\n**Incorrect (computes avatar even when loading):**\n\n```tsx\nfunction Profile({ user, loading }: Props) {\n  const avatar = useMemo(() => {\n    const id = computeAvatarId(user)\n    return <Avatar id={id} />\n  }, [user])\n\n  if (loading) return <Skeleton />\n  return <div>{avatar}</div>\n}\n```\n\n**Correct (skips computation when loading):**\n\n```tsx\nconst UserAvatar = memo(function UserAvatar({ user }: { user: User }) {\n  const id = useMemo(() => computeAvatarId(user), [user])\n  return <Avatar id={id} />\n})\n\nfunction Profile({ user, loading }: Props) {\n  if (loading) return <Skeleton />\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <UserAvatar user={user} />\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**Note:** If your project has [React Compiler](https://react.dev/learn/react-compiler) enabled, manual memoization with `memo()` and `useMemo()` is not necessary. The compiler automatically optimizes re-renders.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:36:18.738Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized rendering and memoization techniques.","zh":"非常适合需要优化渲染和记忆化技术的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが最適化されたレンダリングとメモ化技術を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"최적화된 렌더링과 메모화 기술이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan técnicas de renderizado optimizado y memoización.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend nécessitant un rendu optimisé et des techniques de mémorisation.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die optimierte Rendering- und Memoisierungstechniken benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de renderização otimizada e técnicas de memoização.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы оптимизированная отрисовка и техники мемоизации.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى تقديم محسّن وتقنيات التخزين المؤقت."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract expensive work into memoized components using React''s useMemo hook, enabling early returns before computation and skipping unnecessary re-renders, while leveraging TypeScript for type safety and open-source code distribution for community-driven development.","zh":"赋予代理从 memoized 组件中提取昂贵的工作，使用 React 的 useMemo hook，实现计算前提前返回和跳过不必要的重新渲染，同时利用 TypeScript 实现类型安全和开源代码分发以实现社区驱动的开发。","ja":"React の useMemo フックを使用してメモ化されたコンポーネントから高価な作業を抽出することで、計算前に早期に返し、不要な再描画をスキップし、同時に TypeScript を使用して型の安全性を確保し、オープンソース コードの配布を使用してコミュニティ主導の開発を可能にします。","ko":"React의 useMemo hook를 사용하여 메모화된 컴포넌트에서 비싼 작업을 추출하여 계산 전에 조기 반환하고 불필요한 재렌더링을 건너뛰며 동시에 TypeScript를 사용하여 유형 안전性과 오픈소스 코드 배포를 사용하여 커뮤니티 주도 개발을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer trabajo costoso en componentes memorizados utilizando el hook useMemo de React, lo que permite devoluciones anticipadas antes del cálculo y saltar las re-renderezas innecesarias, mientras aprovecha TypeScript para la seguridad de tipos y la distribución de código de código abierto para el desarrollo impulsado por la comunidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire des travaux coûteux dans des composants mémorisés en utilisant l''hook useMemo de React, ce qui permet des retours anticipés avant le calcul et la suppression des réaffichages inutiles, tout en exploitant TypeScript pour la sécurité des types et la distribution de code open-source pour le développement piloté par la communauté.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, teure Arbeit in memoisierte Komponenten zu extrahieren, indem sie den useMemo-Hook von React verwenden, wodurch frühe Rückgaben vor der Berechnung und das Überspringen unnötiger Neurenderings ermöglicht werden, während TypeScript für die Typsicherheit und die Open-Source-Code-Verteilung für die communitygetriebene Entwicklung genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair trabalhos caros em componentes memoizados usando o hook useMemo do React, permitindo retornos antecipados antes do cálculo e pulando re-renderizações desnecessárias, ao mesmo tempo em que aproveita o TypeScript para segurança de tipo e distribuição de código de código aberto para desenvolvimento impulsionado pela comunidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать дорогостоящие работы в мемоизированные компоненты, используя хук useMemo из React, что позволяет производить ранние возвращения до вычисления и пропускать ненужные повторные отрисовки, а также использовать TypeScript для безопасности типов и распространение открытоГО кода для разработки, управляемой сообществом.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استخراج عمل مكلف إلى مكونات مؤقتة باستخدام كروك useMemo من ري액ت، وتمكين الإرجاع المبكر قبل الحساب وتجاوز إعادة العرض غير الضرورية، مع الاستفادة من TypeScript لأمان النوع وتوزيع الشفرة مفتوحة المصدر لتطوير مدفوع بالمجتمع."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing component re-renders with memoization","Extracting expensive computations into separate components","Improving application performance by skipping unnecessary computations during loading states"],"zh":["使用记忆化技术优化组件重渲染","将昂贵的计算提取到单独的组件中","通过在加载状态期间跳过不必要的计算来提高应用程序性能"],"ja":["メモ化技術を使用してコンポーネントの再描画を最適化する","高価な計算を個別のコンポーネントに抽出する","ロード状態中に不要な計算をスキップすることでアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを向上させる"],"ko":["메모화 기술을 사용하여 컴포넌트 재렌더링을 최적화하는 것","비싼 계산을 별개의 컴포넌트로 추출하는 것","로드 상태 중에 불필요한 계산을 건너뛰어 애플리케이션 성능을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Optimizar las re-renderezas de componentes con memoización","Extraer cálculos costosos en componentes separados","Mejorar el rendimiento de la aplicación saltando cálculos innecesarios durante los estados de carga"],"fr":["Optimiser les réaffichages de composants avec la mémorisation","Extraire des calculs coûteux dans des composants séparés","Améliorer les performances de l''application en sautant les calculs inutiles pendant les états de chargement"],"de":["Optimieren des Neurenderns von Komponenten mit Memoisierung","Extrahieren teurer Berechnungen in separate Komponenten","Verbessern der Anwendungsleistung, indem unnötige Berechnungen während der Ladezustände übersprungen werden"],"pt":["Otimizando re-renderizações de componentes com memoização","Extraindo cálculos caros em componentes separados","Melhorando o desempenho da aplicação pulando cálculos desnecessários durante os estados de carregamento"],"ru":["Оптимизация повторной отрисовки компонентов с помощью мемоизации","Извлечение дорогостоящих вычислений в отдельные компоненты","Улучшение производительности приложения, пропуская ненужные вычисления во время состояний загрузки"],"ar":["تحسين إعادة عرض المكونات باستخدام التخزين المؤقت","استخراج الحسابات المكلفة إلى مكونات منفصلة","تحسين أداء التطبيق بتجاوز الحسابات غير الضرورية أثناء حالات التحميل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React and TypeScript setup","Limited to optimizing rendering performance within React applications"],"zh":["需要 React 和 TypeScript 设置","仅限于优化 React 应用程序中的渲染性能"],"ja":["React と TypeScript の設定が必要","React アプリケーション内のレンダリング パフォーマンスの最適化のみに限定される"],"ko":["React와 TypeScript 설정이 필요","React 애플리케이션 내의 렌더링 성능 최적화에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración de React y TypeScript","Limitado a la optimización del rendimiento de renderizado dentro de aplicaciones React"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration React et TypeScript","Limité à l''optimisation des performances de rendu à l''intérieur des applications React"],"de":["Benötigt React- und TypeScript-Setup","Begrenzt auf die Optimierung der Rendering-Leistung innerhalb von React-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer configuração do React e TypeScript","Limitado à otimização do desempenho de renderização dentro de aplicações React"],"ru":["Требует настройки React и TypeScript","Ограничен оптимизацией производительности отрисовки внутри приложений React"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد ري액ت و타입سكريبت","محدود بتحسين أداء العرض داخل تطبيقات ري액ت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
