a":"変更ログの更新には、対象ファイルの特定とブランチ変更の分析が含まれます。対象ファイルには、migration_notes.mdとchangelog/v{major}.mdが含まれます","ko":"변경 로그를 업데이트하는 것은 대상 파일을 결정하고 브랜치 변경을 분석하는 것을 포함합니다. 대상 파일에는 migration_notes.md와 changelog/v{major}.md가 포함됩니다","es":"Actualiza el registro de cambios siguiendo nuestros pasos para desarrolladores de Aztec y operadores de nodos","fr":"Mettez à jour le journal des modifications en suivant nos étapes pour les développeurs d''Aztèque et les opérateurs de nœuds","de":"Aktualisieren Sie das Änderungsprotokoll, indem Sie unsere Schritte für Aztec-Entwickler und Node-Operatoren befolgen","pt":"Atualize o changelog com facilidade. Este guia fornece os passos necessários para manter seu projeto atualizado.","ru":"Обновите журнал изменений легко. Это руководство предоставляет необходимые шаги для поддержания вашего проекта в актуальном состоянии.","ar":"حدّث سجل التغييرات بسهولة. هذا الدليل يوفر الخطوات اللازمة للحفاظ على مشروعك محدثًا.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["确定目标文件","分析分支更改","更新变更日志","使用git diff命令","编辑版本文件","记录代码更改"],"ja":["対象ファイルの特定","ブランチ変更の分析","変更ログの更新","git diffコマンドの使用","バージョンファイルの編集","コード変更の記録"],"ko":["대상 파일을 결정","브랜치 변경을 분석","변경 로그 업데이트","git diff 명령어 사용","버전 파일 편집","코드 변경 기록"],"es":["Determinar archivos objetivo","Analizar cambios en la rama","Actualizar registro de cambios","Utilizar comandos Git","Actualizar versión en archivos de registro"],"fr":["Déterminer les fichiers cibles","Analyser les modifications de la branche","Mettre à jour le journal des modifications","Utiliser des commandes Git","Mettre à jour la version dans les fichiers de journal"],"de":["Ziel-Dateien bestimmen","Änderungen im Branch analysieren","Änderungsprotokoll aktualisieren","Git-Befehle verwenden","Version in Protokoll-Dateien aktualisieren"],"pt":["Determinar arquivos alvo","Analisar alterações no branch","Atualizar changelog com base nas alterações","Utilizar comandos Git para análise","Manter documentação atualizada"],"ru":["Определение целевых файлов","Анализ изменений в ветке","Обновление журнала изменений на основе изменений","Использование команд Git для анализа","Поддержание актуальной документации"],"ar":["تحديد الملفات المستهدفة","تحليل التغييرات في الفرع","تحديث سجل التغييرات بناءً على التغييرات","استخدام أوامر Git للتحليل","الحفاظ على توثيق محدث"]},"keywords":{"zh":["更新变更日志","软件开发","代码更改","git diff","版本控制","变更管理","软件工程","代码管理","开发流程"],"ja":["変更ログの更新","ソフトウェア開発","コード変更","git diff","バージョン管理","変更管理","ソフトウェアエンジニアリング","コード管理","開発プロセス"],"ko":["변경 로그 업데이트","소프트웨어 개발","코드 변경","git diff","버전 관리","변경 관리","소프트웨어 공학","코드 관리","개발 프로세스"],"es":["actualización de registro de cambios","desarrollo de software","git","ramas","archivos de registro","versiones","desarrolladores de Aztec","operadores de nodos"],"fr":["mise à jour du journal des modifications","développement de logiciels","git","branches","fichiers de journal","versions","développeurs d''Aztèque","opérateurs de nœuds"],"de":["Aktualisierung des Änderungsprotokolls","Software-Entwicklung","git","Branches","Protokoll-Dateien","Versionen","Aztec-Entwickler","Node-Operatoren"],"pt":["atualizar changelog","desenvolvimento de software","git","documentação","controle de versão","desenvolvedores","projeto de software"],"ru":["обновление журнала изменений","разработка программного обеспечения","git","документация","контроль версий","разработчики","проект программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تحديث سجل التغييرات","تطوير البرمجيات","git","توثيق","مراقبة الإصدار","مطورون","مشروع برمجي"]}},"owner":"AztecProtocol","repo":"aztec-packages","repoPath":"AztecProtocol/aztec-packages","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.409Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"updating-changelog","description":"Updates changelog documentation for contract developers and node operators by analyzing branch changes relative to next. Use when preparing a PR, updating migration notes, documenting breaking changes, or when asked to update changelog/release notes.","bodyPreview":"# Updating Changelog\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Determine Target Files\n\nRead `.release-please-manifest.json` to get the version (e.g., `{\".\" : \"4.0.0\"}` → edit `v4.md`).\n\n**Target files:**\n\n- Aztec contract developers: `docs/docs-developers/docs/resources/migration_notes.md`\n- Node operators and Ethereum contract developers: `docs/docs-operate/operators/reference/changelog/v{major}.md`\n\n### 2. Analyze Branch Changes\n\nRun `git diff next...HEAD --stat` for overview, then `git diff next...HEAD` for details.","body":"# Updating Changelog\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Determine Target Files\n\nRead `.release-please-manifest.json` to get the version (e.g., `{\".\" : \"4.0.0\"}` → edit `v4.md`).\n\n**Target files:**\n\n- Aztec contract developers: `docs/docs-developers/docs/resources/migration_notes.md`\n- Node operators and Ethereum contract developers: `docs/docs-operate/operators/reference/changelog/v{major}.md`\n\n### 2. Analyze Branch Changes\n\nRun `git diff next...HEAD --stat` for overview, then `git diff next...HEAD` for details.\n\n**Categorize changes:**\n\n- Breaking changes (API modifications, removals, renames)\n- New features (APIs, CLI flags, configuration)\n- Deprecations\n- Configuration changes (CLI flags, environment variables)\n\n### 3. Generate Draft Entries\n\nPresent draft entries for review BEFORE editing files. Match the formatting conventions by reading existing entries in each file.\n\n### 4. Edit Documentation\n\nAfter approval, add entries to the appropriate files.\n\n## Migration Notes Format\n\n**File:** `docs/docs-developers/docs/resources/migration_notes.md`\n\nAdd entries under `## TBD` section:\n\n````markdown\n### [Component] Brief description\n\nExplanation of what changed.\n\n**Migration:**\n\n```diff\n- old code\n+ new code\n```\n````\n\n**Impact**: Effect on existing code.\n\n**Component tags:** `[Aztec.nr]`, `[Aztec.js]`, `[PXE]`, `[Aztec Node]`, `[AVM]`, `[L1 Contracts]`, `[CLI]`\n\n## Node Operator Changelog Format\n\n**File:** `docs/docs-operate/operators/reference/changelog/v{major}.md`\n\n**Breaking changes:**\n````markdown\n### Feature Name\n\n**v{previous}:**\n```bash\n--old-flag <value>                    ($OLD_ENV_VAR)\n```\n\n**v{current}:**\n```bash\n--new-flag <value>                    ($NEW_ENV_VAR)\n```\n\n**Migration**: How to migrate.\n````\n\n**New features:**\n````markdown\n### Feature Name\n\n```bash\n--new-flag <value>                    ($ENV_VAR)\n```\n\nDescription of the feature.\n````\n\n**Changed defaults:** Use table format with Flag, Environment Variable, Previous, New columns.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:35:47.194Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Version Control Agents needing automated changelog management capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要自动化变更日志管理功能的版本控制代理。","ja":"バージョン管理エージェントが自動化された変更ログ管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 변경 로그 관리 기능이 필요한 버전 제어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de control de versiones que necesitan capacidades de gestión de registros de cambios automatizados.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de contrôle de version ayant besoin de capacités de gestion de journaux de modifications automatisées.","de":"Ideal für Version-Control-Agents, die automatisierte Änderungsprotokoll-Verwaltungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Controle de Versão que necessitam de capacidades de gerenciamento de changelog automatizadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов контроля версий, требующих автоматизированных возможностей управления журналом изменений.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة الإصدارات الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات إدارة سجل التغييرات الآلية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to update changelogs by analyzing Git branch changes and editing target files such as `v{major}.md` and `.release-please-manifest.json`, utilizing `git diff` for detailed change analysis.","zh":"通过分析Git分支更改并编辑目标文件（如`v{major}.md`和`.release-please-manifest.json`）来赋予代理更新更改日志的能力，利用`git diff`进行详细的更改分析。","ja":"Gitブランチの変更を分析し、ターゲットファイル（例：`v{major}.md`および`.release-please-manifest.json`）を編集することで、エージェントが変更ログを更新できるようにし、`git diff`を使用して詳細な変更分析を実施します。","ko":"Git 브랜치 변경 사항을 분석하고 대상 파일(예: `v{major}.md` 및 `.release-please-manifest.json`)을 편집하여 에이전트가 변경 로그를 업데이트할 수 있도록 하며, `git diff`를 사용하여 자세한 변경 분석을 수행합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes actualizar los registros de cambios analizando los cambios de ramas de Git y editando archivos de destino como `v{major}.md` y `.release-please-manifest.json`, utilizando `git diff` para un análisis detallado de los cambios.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre à jour les journaux de modifications en analysant les modifications de branches Git et en éditant des fichiers cibles tels que `v{major}.md` et `.release-please-manifest.json`, en utilisant `git diff` pour une analyse détaillée des modifications.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Änderungsprotokolle zu aktualisieren, indem sie Änderungen an Git-Zweigen analysieren und Zieldateien wie `v{major}.md` und `.release-please-manifest.json` bearbeiten, wobei `git diff` für eine detaillierte Änderungsanalyse verwendet wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes atualizem os changelogs analisando alterações de branch do Git e editando arquivos de destino, como `v{major}.md` e `.release-please-manifest.json`, utilizando `git diff` para análise detalhada de alterações.","ru":"Позволяет агентам обновлять журналы изменений, анализируя изменения веток Git и редактируя целевые файлы, такие как `v{major}.md` и `.release-please-manifest.json`, используя `git diff` для детального анализа изменений.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تحديث سجلات التغييرات عن طريق تحليل تغييرات الفروع في جيت وتنقيح الملفات المستهدفة مثل `v{major}.md` و `.release-please-manifest.json` ، باستخدام `git diff` للتحليل المفصّل للتغييرات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating changelog updates for new releases","Analyzing Git branch changes for impact assessment","Editing version-specific documentation files like `v4.md`"],"zh":["自动更新新版本的变更日志","分析Git分支更改以评估影响","编辑版本特定文档文件，如`v4.md`"],"ja":["新しいリリースの変更ログを自動更新する","Gitブランチの変更を分析して影響を評価する","バージョン特定のドキュメントファイル（例：`v4.md`）を編集する"],"ko":["새 릴리스의 변경 로그를 자동으로 업데이트하는 것","Git 브랜치 변경 사항을 분석하여 영향 평가를 수행하는 것","버전 특정 문서 파일(예: `v4.md`)을 편집하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las actualizaciones de los registros de cambios para nuevos lanzamientos","Analizar los cambios de ramas de Git para la evaluación de impacto","Editar archivos de documentación específicos de la versión como `v4.md`"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour des journaux de modifications pour les nouveaux lancements","Analyser les modifications de branches Git pour l''évaluation de l''impact","Éditer des fichiers de documentation spécifiques à la version comme `v4.md`"],"de":["Automatisieren von Änderungsprotokoll-Aktualisierungen für neue Releases","Analysieren von Git-Zweig-Änderungen für die Auswirkungsabschätzung","Bearbeiten von versionspezifischen Dokumentationsdateien wie `v4.md`"],"pt":["Automatizar atualizações de changelog para novas versões","Analisar alterações de branch do Git para avaliação de impacto","Editar arquivos de documentação específicos da versão, como `v4.md`"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обновления журнала изменений для новых релизов","Анализировать изменения веток Git для оценки воздействия","Редактировать файлы документации, специфичные для версии, такие как `v4.md`"],"ar":["تحسين تحديثات سجلات التغييرات للأصدارات الجديدة","تحليل تغييرات الفروع في جيت لتقييم الأثر","تنقيح ملفات الوثائق الخاصة بالإصدار مثل `v4.md`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git repository access","Limited to specific file formats like `.release-please-manifest.json` and `v{major}.md`"],"zh":["需要Git存储库访问权限","仅限特定文件格式，如`.release-please-manifest.json`和`v{major}.md`"],"ja":["Gitリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","特定のファイル形式（例：`.release-please-manifest.json`および`v{major}.md`）に限定される"],"ko":["Git 저장소 액세스가 필요함","특정 파일 형식(예: `.release-please-manifest.json` 및 `v{major}.md`)으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de Git","Limitado a formatos de archivo específicos como `.release-please-manifest.json` y `v{major}.md`"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel Git","Limité à des formats de fichier spécifiques comme `.release-please-manifest.json` et `v{major}.md`"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Git-Repository","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Dateiformate wie `.release-please-manifest.json` und `v{major}.md`"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório Git","Limitado a formatos de arquivo específicos, como `.release-please-manifest.json` e `v{major}.md`"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию Git","Ограничен конкретными форматами файлов, такими как `.release-please-manifest.json` и `v{major}.md`"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع جيت","محدود بالتنسيقات المحددة للملفات مثل `.release-please-manifest.json` و `v{major}.md`"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('TypedDevs/bashunit/add-assertion', 'community', 'TypedDevs', 'bashunit', 'TypedDevs/bashunit', 'add-assertion', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z', '2026-02-18T03:36:40.478Z', NULL, '{"id":"TypedDevs/bashunit/add-assertion","name":"add-assertion","description":{"zh":"Add Assertion是一个用于Bash脚本的简单而强大的测试库，按照严格的TDD方法添加新的断言函数","ja":"Add AssertionはBashスクリプト用のシンプルながら強力なテストライブラリであり、TDDメソッドに従って新しいアサーション関数を追加する","ko":"Add Assertion은 Bash 스크립트를 위한 간단하면서 강력한 테스트 라이브러리로 TDD 방법을 따르는 새로운 assertions 함수를 추가한다","es":"La habilidad add-assertion permite agregar nuevas funciones de aserción a bashunit de forma sencilla y segura","fr":"La compétence add-assertion permet d''ajouter de nouvelles fonctions d''assertion à bashunit de manière simple et sécurisée","de":"Die Fähigkeit add-assertion ermöglicht es, neue Assertion-Funktionen zu bashunit auf einfache und sichere Weise hinzuzufügen","pt":"A biblioteca add-assertion é uma ferramenta simples, mas poderosa, para testar scripts Bash. Ela permite adicionar novas funções de assert ao framework bashunit.","ru":"Библиотека add-assertion - это простой, но мощный инструмент для тестирования скриптов Bash. Она позволяет добавлять новые функции assert к фреймворку bashunit.","ar":"مكتبة add-assertion هي أداة بسيطة ولكن قوية لاختبار سكريبتات Bash. تسمح بإضافة وظائف assert جديدة إلى إطار العمل bashunit.","en":"A simple yet powerfull testing library for bash scripts."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Bash脚本测试库 - Add Assertion","ja":"Bashスクリプトテストライブラリ - Add Assertion","ko":"Bash 스크립트 테스트 라이브러리 - Add Assertion","es":"Agregar aserción a bashunit","fr":"Ajouter une assertion à bashunit","de":"Assertion zu bashunit hinzufügen","pt":"Adicionar Assert - Biblioteca de Testes para Scripts Bash","ru":"Добавление Assert - Библиотека для тестирования скриптов ...","ar":"إضافة Assert - مكتبة اختبار للسكريبتات Bash","en":"add-assertion"},"description":{"zh":"Add Assertion是一个用于Bash脚本的简单而强大的测试库，按照严格的TDD方法添加新的断言函数","ja":"Add AssertionはBashスクリプト用のシンプルながら強力なテストライブラリであり、TDDメソッドに従って新しいアサーション関数を追加する","ko":"Add Assertion은 Bash 스크립트를 위한 간단하면서 강력한 테스트 라이브러리로 TDD 방법을 따르는 새로운 assertions 함수를 추가한다","es":"La habilidad add-assertion permite agregar nuevas funciones de aserción a bashunit de forma sencilla y segura","fr":"La compétence add-assertion permet d''ajouter de nouvelles fonctions d''assertion à bashunit de manière simple et sécurisée","de":"Die Fähigkeit add-assertion ermöglicht es, neue Assertion-Funktionen zu bashunit auf einfache und sichere Weise hinzuzufügen","pt":"A biblioteca add-assertion é uma ferramenta simples, mas poderosa, para testar scripts Bash. Ela permite adicionar novas funções de assert ao framework bashu...","ru":"Библиотека add-assertion - это простой, но мощный инструмент для тестирования скриптов Bash. Она позволяет добавлять новые функции assert к фреймворку bashunit.","ar":"مكتبة add-assertion هي أداة بسيطة ولكن قوية لاختبار سكريبتات Bash. تسمح بإضافة وظائف assert جديدة إلى إطار العمل bashunit.","en":"A simple yet powerfull testing library for bash scripts."},"definition":{"en":"A simple yet powerfull testing library for bash scripts."},"features":{"zh":["支持TDD方法","添加新的断言函数","提高测试效率","简单易用","强大的测试能力"],"ja":["TDDメソッドをサポート","新しいアサーション関数を追加","テストの効率を高める","シンプルで使いやすい","強力なテスト機能"],"ko":["TDD 방법 지원","새로운 assertions 함수 추가","테스트 효율을 높임","간단하고 사용하기 쉬움","강력한 테스트 기능"],"es":["Agregar nuevas funciones de aserción a bashunit","Seguir la metodología TDD","Crear un archivo de tarea","Estudiar los patrones de tests","Conocer los requisitos de la aserción"],"fr":["Ajouter de nouvelles fonctions d''assertion à bashunit","Suivre la méthodologie TDD","Créer un fichier de tâche","Étudier les modèles de tests","Connaître les exigences de l''assertion"],"de":["Neue Assertion-Funktionen zu bashunit hinzufügen","Die TDD-Methode befolgen","Ein Task-Datei erstellen","Die Testmuster studieren","Die Anforderungen der Assertion kennen"],"pt":["Adiciona novas funções de assert ao framework bashunit","Segue metodologia TDD estrita","Permite testar scripts Bash de forma eficaz","É simples e fácil de usar","Fornece capacidades de teste avançadas"],"ru":["Добавляет новые функции assert к фреймворку bashunit","Следует строгой методологии TDD","Позволяет тестировать скрипты Bash эффективно","Проста и легка в использовании","Предоставляет расширенные возможности тестирования"],"ar":["تضيف وظائف assert جديدة إلى إطار العمل bashunit","تتبع منهجية TDD الصارمة","تسمح باختبار سكريبتات Bash بفعالية","بسيطة وسهلة الاستخدام","توفر إمكانيات اختبار متقدمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Bash脚本测试","TDD方法","断言函数","测试库","BashUnit","Add Assertion"],"ja":["Bashスクリプトテスト","TDDメソッド","アサーション関数","テストライブラリ","BashUnit","Add Assertion"],"ko":["Bash 스크립트 테스트","TDD 방법","assertions 함수","테스트 라이브러리","BashUnit","Add Assertion"],"es":["bashunit","aserción","TDD","pruebas unitarias","desarrollo de software","herramientas de testing"],"fr":["bashunit","assertion","TDD","tests unitaires","développement de logiciels","outils de test"],"de":["bashunit","Assertion","TDD","Einheitstests","Softwareentwicklung","Testtools"],"pt":["add-assertion","biblioteca de testes","scripts Bash","framework bashunit","metodologia TDD","testes de unidade","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["add-assertion","библиотека для тестирования","скрипты Bash","фреймворк bashunit","методология TDD","юнит-тесты","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["add-assertion","مكتبة اختبار","سكريبتات Bash","إطار العمل bashunit","منهجية TDD","اختبارات الوحدة","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"TypedDevs","repo":"bashunit","repoPath":"TypedDevs/bashunit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"add-assertion","description":"Add new assertion function with comprehensive tests following TDD","bodyPreview":"# Add Assertion Skill\n\nAdd a new assertion function to bashunit following strict TDD methodology.\n\n## When to Use\n\nInvoke with `/add-assertion` when:\n- Adding a new assertion to the framework\n- User requests a new `assert_*` function\n- Enhancing existing assertion capabilities\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n1. **Task file must exist** - Create `.tasks/YYYY-MM-DD-add-assertion-name.md`\n2. **Understand patterns** - Study `tests/unit/assert_test.sh`\n3. **Know the requirement** - What should the assertion do?","body":"# Add Assertion Skill\n\nAdd a new assertion function to bashunit following strict TDD methodology.\n\n## When to Use\n\nInvoke with `/add-assertion` when:\n- Adding a new assertion to the framework\n- User requests a new `assert_*` function\n- Enhancing existing assertion capabilities\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n1. **Task file must exist** - Create `.tasks/YYYY-MM-DD-add-assertion-name.md`\n2. **Understand patterns** - Study `tests/unit/assert_test.sh`\n3. **Know the requirement** - What should the assertion do?\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Planning Phase\n\n**Ask user:**\n- What should the assertion check?\n- What should it be called? (e.g., `assert_json_contains`)\n- What parameters does it take?\n- What should success look like?\n- What should failure messages say?\n\n**Document in task file:**\n```markdown\n# Add assert_json_contains\n\n## Context\nNeed assertion to verify JSON contains a specific key-value pair.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Function validates JSON structure\n- [ ] Function checks for key existence\n- [ ] Function checks value matches\n- [ ] Clear error messages on failure\n- [ ] Works with nested JSON\n- [ ] Handles malformed JSON gracefully\n\n## Test Inventory\n### Unit Tests\n- [ ] test_assert_json_contains_should_pass_when_key_value_exists\n- [ ] test_assert_json_contains_should_fail_when_key_missing\n- [ ] test_assert_json_contains_should_fail_when_value_differs\n- [ ] test_assert_json_contains_should_handle_nested_keys\n- [ ] test_assert_json_contains_should_fail_on_malformed_json\n```\n\n### 2. Study Existing Patterns\n\n**Read assertion patterns:**\n```bash\n# Study how other assertions work\nRead tests/unit/assert_test.sh\nRead src/assertions.sh\n```\n\n**Identify pattern:**\n- Parameter validation\n- Assertion logic\n- Error message format\n- Success/failure return codes\n- Testing approach (including failure tests)\n\n### 3. TDD Cycle 1: Basic Success Case\n\n#### RED\n```bash\n# tests/unit/assert_json_contains_test.sh\n\nfunction test_assert_json_contains_should_pass_when_key_value_exists() {\n  local json=''{\"name\": \"bashunit\", \"version\": \"0.32.0\"}''\n\n  assert_json_contains \"name\" \"bashunit\" \"$json\"\n}\n```\n\nRun test - **MUST FAIL** (function doesn''t exist):\n```bash\n./bashunit tests/unit/assert_json_contains_test.sh\n```\n\n#### GREEN\n\n```bash\n# src/assert_json.sh (or add to src/assertions.sh)\n\nfunction assert_json_contains() {\n  local key=\"$1\"\n  local expected_value=\"$2\"\n  local json=\"$3\"\n\n  # Minimal implementation\n  local actual_value\n  actual_value=$(echo \"$json\" | grep -o \"\\\"$key\\\": *\\\"[^\\\"]*\\\"\" | cut -d''\"'' -f4)\n\n  if [[ \"$actual_value\" == \"$expected_value\" ]]; then\n    return 0\n  fi\n\n  echo \"Expected key ''$key'' to have value ''$expected_value'', got ''$actual_value''\" >&2\n  return 1\n}\n```\n\nRun test - **MUST PASS**:\n```bash\n./bashunit tests/unit/assert_json_contains_test.sh\n```\n\n#### REFACTOR\n\nImprove implementation:\n- Better JSON parsing\n- Error handling\n- Documentation\n\n### 4. TDD Cycle 2: Failure Case\n\n#### RED\n```bash\nfunction test_assert_json_contains_should_fail_when_key_missing() {\n  local json=''{\"name\": \"bashunit\"}''\n\n  # Use assert_fails to test that the assertion fails\n  assert_fails \\\n    \"assert_json_contains ''version'' ''0.32.0'' ''$json''\"\n}\n```\n\n#### GREEN\n\nUpdate implementation to handle missing keys:\n```bash\nfunction assert_json_contains() {\n  local key=\"$1\"\n  local expected_value=\"$2\"\n  local json=\"$3\"\n\n  # Check if key exists\n  if ! echo \"$json\" | grep -q \"\\\"$key\\\"\"; then\n    echo \"Key ''$key'' not found in JSON\" >&2\n    return 1\n  fi\n\n  local actual_value\n  actual_value=$(echo \"$json\" | grep -o \"\\\"$key\\\": *\\\"[^\\\"]*\\\"\" | cut -d''\"'' -f4)\n\n  if [[ \"$actual_value\" == \"$expected_value\" ]]; then\n    return 0\n  fi\n\n  echo \"Expected key ''$key'' to have value ''$expected_value'', got ''$actual_value''\" >&2\n  return 1\n}\n```\n\n#### REFACTOR\n\nContinue improving.\n\n### 5. TDD Cycle 3-N: Additional Cases\n\nContinue RED-GREEN-REFACTOR for:\n- Different value types (numbers, booleans)\n- Nested JSON objects\n- Malformed JSON handling\n- Edge cases (empty values, null, etc.)\n\n### 6. Documentation\n\nAdd function documentation:\n\n```bash\n##\n# Asserts that a JSON string contains a specific key-value pair\n#\n# Arguments:\n#   $1 - Key to search for\n#   $2 - Expected value\n#   $3 - JSON string\n#\n# Returns:\n#   0 if key exists with expected value\n#   1 if key missing or value differs\n#\n# Example:\n#   local json=''{\"name\": \"bashunit\"}''\n#   assert_json_contains \"name\" \"bashunit\" \"$json\"\n##\nfunction assert_json_contains() {\n  # Implementation\n}\n```\n\n### 7. Integration\n\n**If new file created:**\n- Source it in main `bashunit.sh`\n- Add to build process if needed\n\n**Update exports:**\n```bash\n# In src/bashunit.sh or relevant file\nexport -f assert_json_contains\n```\n\n### 8. Comprehensive Testing\n\n**Run all assertion tests:**\n```bash\n./bashunit tests/unit/assert*.sh\n```\n\n**Run full test suite:**\n```bash\n./bashunit tests/\n```\n\n**Quality checks:**\n```bash\nmake sa\nmake lint\nshfmt -w .\n```\n\n### 9. Documentation Updates\n\n**Update user-facing docs:**\n- Add to `docs/assertions.md` (or equivalent)\n- Add examples\n- Add to API reference\n- Update CHANGELOG\n\n**Example docs:**\n```markdown\n## assert_json_contains\n\nAsserts that a JSON string contains a specific key-value pair.\n\n### Usage\n\nbash\nassert_json_contains \"key\" \"expected_value\" \"$json_string\"\n\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `key` - The JSON key to look for\n- `expected_value` - The expected value for the key\n- `json_string` - The JSON to search\n\n### Examples\n\nbash\n# Simple object\nlocal user=''{\"name\": \"John\", \"age\": 30}''\nassert_json_contains \"name\" \"John\" \"$user\"\n\n# Nested object\nlocal data=''{\"user\": {\"name\": \"John\"}}''\nassert_json_contains \"user.name\" \"John\" \"$data\"\n\n```\n\n### 10. Final Verification\n\n**Complete checklist:**\n- [ ] All tests passing (RED-GREEN-REFACTOR for each)\n- [ ] Test both success and failure cases\n- [ ] Test edge cases\n- [ ] Function documented\n- [ ] Exported/integrated properly\n- [ ] User documentation updated\n- [ ] CHANGELOG updated\n- [ ] Code review ready\n- [ ] Task file completed\n\n## Testing Patterns for Assertions\n\n### Test Success\n```bash\nfunction test_should_pass_when_condition_met() {\n  assert_new_assertion \"input\"\n}\n```\n\n### Test Failure\n```bash\nfunction test_should_fail_when_condition_not_met() {\n  assert_fails \\\n    \"assert_new_assertion ''bad_input''\"\n}\n```\n\n### Test Error Message\n```bash\nfunction test_should_show_helpful_error_message() {\n  local output\n  output=$(assert_new_assertion \"bad_input\" 2>&1) || true\n\n  assert_contains \"Expected\" \"$output\"\n  assert_contains \"Got\" \"$output\"\n}\n```\n\n### Test Edge Cases\n```bash\nfunction test_should_handle_empty_input() {\n  assert_fails \\\n    \"assert_new_assertion ''''\"\n}\n\nfunction test_should_handle_special_characters() {\n  assert_new_assertion \"special$chars\"\n}\n```\n\n## Common Assertion Patterns\n\n### Parameter Validation\n```bash\nif [[ $# -lt 2 ]]; then\n  echo \"assert_name requires at least 2 arguments\" >&2\n  return 1\nfi\n```\n\n### Clear Error Messages\n```bash\necho \"Expected <expected>, but got <actual>\" >&2\necho \"  Expected: $expected\" >&2\necho \"  Actual: $actual\" >&2\n```\n\n### Consistent Return Codes\n```bash\nreturn 0  # Success\nreturn 1  # Assertion failed\n```\n\n## Related Assertions to Study\n\n- `assert_equals` - Basic comparison\n- `assert_contains` - String searching\n- `assert_matches` - Regex matching\n- `assert_file_exists` - File operations\n- `assert_array_contains` - Array operations\n\n## Output Format\n\nProvide progress updates:\n\n```\n📝 Planning: assert_json_contains function\n    - Parameters: key, expected_value, json_string\n    - Will validate JSON and check key-value\n\n🔴 RED: test_should_pass_when_key_value_exists\n    Test written and failing (function not found)\n\n🟢 GREEN: Minimal implementation added\n    Test now passing\n\n🔵 REFACTOR: Improved JSON parsing\n    All tests still passing\n\n✅ Completed: assert_json_contains\n    - 5 tests passing\n    - Documentation added\n    - Ready for review\n```\n\n## Quality Standards\n\n**All assertions must:**\n- Follow Bash 3.0+ compatibility (@.claude/rules/bash-style.md)\n- Have comprehensive tests (success, failure, edge cases)\n- Have clear, helpful error messages\n- Be documented with examples\n- Pass shellcheck and formatting\n- Work in parallel test execution\n\n## Related Files\n\n- Test patterns: @tests/unit/assert_test.sh\n- Assertion implementations: @src/assertions.sh\n- Testing rules: @.claude/rules/testing.md\n- TDD workflow: @.claude/rules/tdd-workflow.md\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:36:40.478Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Bash Scripting Agents needing advanced testing and validation capabilities through bashunit","zh":"非常适合需要通过bashunit进行高级测试和验证的Bash脚本代理","ja":"bashunitを使用した高度なテストと検証機能を必要とするBashスクリプトエージェントに最適","ko":"bashunit를 통해 고급 테스트 및 검증 기능이 필요한 Bash 스크립트 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Scripting de Bash que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de prueba y validación a través de bashunit","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Scripting Bash ayant besoin de capacités de test et de validation avancées via bashunit","de":"Perfekt für Bash-Scripting-Agenten, die erweiterte Test- und Validierungsfunktionen über bashunit benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de scripting Bash que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de teste e validação por meio do bashunit","ru":"Идеально для агентов скриптинга Bash, которым требуются продвинутые возможности тестирования и проверки через bashunit","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء سكريبتينج باش الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة للاختبار والتحقق من خلال bashunit"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create custom assertion functions using strict TDD methodology, enhancing testing capabilities with bashunit and leveraging bash scripts for robust validation, interacting with task files and unit tests like assert_test.sh","zh":"赋予代理创建自定义断言函数的能力，使用严格的TDD方法论，通过bashunit增强测试能力，并利用Bash脚本进行强大的验证，交互任务文件和单元测试，如assert_test.sh","ja":"エージェントがbashunitとタスクファイルや単体テスト（例：assert_test.sh）とやり取りしながら、厳密なTDD方法論を使用してカスタムのアサーション関数を作成する機能を提供し、Bashスクリプトを使用した堅牢な検証を可能にし、テスト機能を強化する","ko":"엄격한 TDD 방법론을 사용하여 커스텀 어서션 함수를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 bashunit를 통해 테스트 기능을 강화하고 Bash 스크립트를 사용하여 강력한 검증을 수행하며 작업 파일 및 단위 테스트(예: assert_test.sh)와 상호 작용","es":"Permite a los agentes crear funciones de aserción personalizadas utilizando la metodología TDD estricta, mejorando las capacidades de prueba con bashunit y aprovechando los scripts de bash para una validación robusta, interactuando con archivos de tarea y pruebas unitarias como assert_test.sh","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des fonctions d''assertion personnalisées en utilisant la méthodologie TDD stricte, améliorant les capacités de test avec bashunit et exploitant les scripts bash pour une validation robuste, en interaction avec les fichiers de tâche et les tests unitaires comme assert_test.sh","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, benutzerdefinierte Assertionsfunktionen unter Verwendung der strengen TDD-Methodik zu erstellen, die Testfunktionen mit bashunit zu verbessern und bash-Skripte für eine robuste Validierung zu nutzen, indem sie mit Aufgabendateien und Einheitstests wie assert_test.sh interagieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar funções de afirmação personalizadas usando metodologia TDD estrita, melhorando as capacidades de teste com bashunit e utilizando scripts de bash para validação robusta, interagindo com arquivos de tarefas e testes unitários como assert_test.sh","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать пользовательские функции утверждения с использованием строгой методологии TDD, повышая возможности тестирования с bashunit и используя скрипты bash для надежной проверки, взаимодействуя с файлами задач и юнит-тестами, такими как assert_test.sh","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء دوال تأكيد مخصصة باستخدام منهجية TDD الصارمة، وتحسين القدرات التجريبية مع bashunit وتحقيق التحقق المتماسك باستخدام سكريبتات باش، والتفاعل مع ملفات المهام والاختبارات الوحدوية مثل assert_test.sh"},"useCases":{"en":["Enhancing existing assertion capabilities in bashunit","Creating new assert_* functions for custom validation","Automating testing for bash scripts with custom assertions"],"zh":["增强bashunit中的现有断言功能","为自定义验证创建新的assert_*函数","使用自定义断言自动化Bash脚本的测试"],"ja":["bashunit内の既存のアサーション機能を強化する","カスタム検証用に新しいassert_*関数を作成する","カスタムアサーションを使用してBashスクリプトのテストを自動化する"],"ko":["bashunit의 기존 어서션 기능 강화","커스텀 검증을 위한 새로운 assert_* 함수 생성","커스텀 어서션을 사용하여 Bash 스크립트의 테스트 자동화"],"es":["Mejorar las capacidades de aserción existentes en bashunit","Crear nuevas funciones assert_* para una validación personalizada","Automatizar las pruebas para scripts de bash con aserciones personalizadas"],"fr":["Améliorer les capacités d''assertion existantes dans bashunit","Créer de nouvelles fonctions assert_* pour une validation personnalisée","Automatiser les tests pour les scripts bash avec des assertions personnalisées"],"de":["Vereinfachen der bestehenden Assertionsfunktionen in bashunit","Erstellen neuer assert_*-Funktionen für benutzerdefinierte Validierung","Automatisieren von Tests für bash-Skripte mit benutzerdefinierten Assertionen"],"pt":["Melhorar as capacidades de afirmação existentes no bashunit","Criar novas funções assert_* para validação personalizada","Automatizar testes para scripts de bash com afirmações personalizadas"],"ru":["Улучшить существующие возможности утверждения в bashunit","Создать новые функции assert_* для пользовательской проверки","Автоматизировать тестирование для скриптов bash с пользовательскими утверждениями"],"ar":["تحسين القدرات الحالية للتأكيد في bashunit","إنشاء دوال جديدة assert_* للتحقق المخصص","آليّة الاختبار لسكريبتات باش مع تأكيدات مخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires task file existence","Understanding of patterns in tests/unit/assert_test.sh","Knowledge of the specific assertion requirement"],"zh":["需要任务文件存在","需要理解tests/unit/assert_test.sh中的模式","需要了解特定的断言要求"],"ja":["タスクファイルの存在が必要","tests/unit/assert_test.sh内のパターンを理解する必要がある","特定のアサーション要件を理解する必要がある"],"ko":["작업 파일의 존재가 필요","tests/unit/assert_test.sh 내의 패턴을 이해해야 함","특정 어서션 요구 사항을 이해해야 함"],"es":["Requiere la existencia de un archivo de tarea","Comprensión de los patrones en las pruebas/unit/assert_test.sh","Conocimiento del requisito de aserción específico"],"fr":["Nécessite l''existence d''un fichier de tâche","Compréhension des modèles dans les tests/unit/assert_test.sh","Connaissance de l''exigence d''assertion spécifique"],"de":["Erfordert die Existenz einer Aufgabendatei","Verständnis der Muster in den Tests/unit/assert_test.sh","Kenntnis des spezifischen Assertionserfordernisses"],"pt":["Exigência da existência do arquivo de tarefa","Compreensão dos padrões nos testes/unit/assert_test.sh","Conhecimento do requisito de afirmação específico"],"ru":["Требуется существование файла задачи","Понимание шаблонов в тестах/unit/assert_test.sh","Знание конкретного требования к утверждению"],"ar":["الحاجة إلى وجود ملف المهمة","فهم الأنماط في الاختبارات/وحدة/ assert_test.sh","معرفة متطلبات التأكيد المحدد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('llama-farm/llamafarm/generate-subsystem-skills', 'community', 'llama-farm', 'llamafarm', 'llama-farm/llamafarm', 'generate-subsystem-skills', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z', '2026-02-18T03:36:50.550Z', NULL, '{"id":"llama-farm/llamafarm/generate-subsystem-skills","name":"generate-subsystem-skills","description":{"zh":"生成子系统技能可以快速部署AI模型、代理、数据库、RAG和管道，实现安全、高性能和语言特定最佳实践","ja":"サブシステムスキルの生成は、AIモデルの迅速な展開、エージェント、データベース、RAG、パイプラインをローカルまたはリモートで数分以内に実行","ko":"서브시스템 스킬 생성은 AI 모델, 에이전트, 데이터베이스, RAG 및 파이프라인을 로컬 또는 원격에서 몇 분 안에 배포","es":"Esta habilidad analiza cada subsistema en el monorepo de LlamaFarm y genera habilidades especializadas de Claude Code para seguridad, rendimiento y mejores prácticas específicas de lenguaje.","fr":"Cette compétence analyse chaque sous-système dans le monorepo de LlamaFarm et génère des compétences spécialisées de Claude Code pour la sécurité, les performances et les meilleures pratiques spécifiques au langage.","de":"Diese Fähigkeit analysiert jedes Subsystem im LlamaFarm-Monorepo und generiert spezialisierte Claude-Code-Fähigkeiten für Sicherheit, Leistung und sprachspezifische Best Practices.","pt":"A habilidade de geração de subsistemas analisa cada subsistema e gera habilidades especializadas para segurança e desempenho.","ru":"Навык генерации подсистемы анализирует каждую подсистему и генерирует специализированные навыки для безопасности и производительности.","ar":"مهارة توليد النظام الفرعي تحليل كل نظام فرعي وتوليد مهارات متخصصة لأمن الأداء.","en":"Deploy any AI model, agent, database, RAG, and pipeline locally or remotely in minutes"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"生成子系统技能 - AI模型快速部署","ja":"サブシステムスキルの生成 - AIモデルの迅速な展開","ko":"서브시스템 스킬 생성 - AI 모델 빠른 배포","es":"Generar Habilidades de Subsistemas","fr":"Générer des Compétences de Sous-Système","de":"Erzeugen von Subsystemfähigkeiten","pt":"Gereção de Habilidades de Subsistema - Desenvolvimento de IA","ru":"Генерация навыков подсистемы - разработка ИИ","ar":"توليد مهارات النظام الفرعي - تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"generate-subsystem-skills"},"description":{"zh":"生成子系统技能可以快速部署AI模型、代理、数据库、RAG和管道，实现安全、高性能和语言特定最佳实践","ja":"サブシステムスキルの生成は、AIモデルの迅速な展開、エージェント、データベース、RAG、パイプラインをローカルまたはリモートで数分以内に実行","ko":"서브시스템 스킬 생성은 AI 모델, 에이전트, 데이터베이스, RAG 및 파이프라인을 로컬 또는 원격에서 몇 분 안에 배포","es":"Esta habilidad analiza cada subsistema en el monorepo de LlamaFarm y genera habilidades especializadas de Claude Code para seguridad, rendimiento y mejores p...","fr":"Cette compétence analyse chaque sous-système dans le monorepo de LlamaFarm et génère des compétences spécialisées de Claude Code pour la sécurité, les perfor...","de":"Diese Fähigkeit analysiert jedes Subsystem im LlamaFarm-Monorepo und generiert spezialisierte Claude-Code-Fähigkeiten für Sicherheit, Leistung und sprachspez...","pt":"A habilidade de geração de subsistemas analisa cada subsistema e gera habilidades especializadas para segurança e desempenho.","ru":"Навык генерации подсистемы анализирует каждую подсистему и генерирует специализированные навыки для безопасности и производительности.","ar":"مهارة توليد النظام الفرعي تحليل كل نظام فرعي وتوليد مهارات متخصصة لأمن الأداء.","en":"Deploy any AI model, agent, database, RAG, and pipeline locally or remotely in minutes"},"definition":{"en":"Deploy any AI model, agent, database, RAG, and pipeline locally or remotely in minutes"},"features":{"zh":["快速部署AI模型","支持安全、高性能和语言特定最佳实践","支持多种编程语言","可以在本地或远程部署"],"ja":["AIモデルの迅速な展開","セキュリティ、高性能、言語特有のベストプラクティスをサポート","複数のプログラミング言語をサポート","ローカルまたはリモートで展開可能"],"ko":["AI 모델 빠른 배포","보안, 고성능, 언어 특정 최적화 지원","여러 프로그래밍 언어 지원","로컬 또는 원격에서 배포 가능"],"es":["Análisis de subsistemas en el monorepo de LlamaFarm","Generación de habilidades especializadas de Claude Code","Mejoras de seguridad y rendimiento","Soporte para múltiples lenguajes de programación","Despliegue local o remoto en minutos"],"fr":["Analyse des sous-systèmes dans le monorepo de LlamaFarm","Génération de compétences spécialisées de Claude Code","Améliorations de la sécurité et des performances","Prise en charge de plusieurs langages de programmation","Déploiement local ou à distance en quelques minutes"],"de":["Analyse von Subsystemen im LlamaFarm-Monorepo","Generierung spezialisierter Claude-Code-Fähigkeiten","Sicherheits- und Leistungsverbesserungen","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen","Bereitstellung lokal oder remote in Minuten"],"pt":["Geração de habilidades para segurança","Geração de habilidades para desempenho","Suporte a linguagens de programação múltiplas","Implementação local ou remota em minutos"],"ru":["Генерация навыков для безопасности","Генерация навыков для производительности","Поддержка нескольких языков программирования","Развертывание локально или удаленно за минуты"],"ar":["توليد مهارات للأمن","توليد مهارات للأداء","دعم لغات برمجة متعددة","نشر محلي أو عن بعد في دقائق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI模型部署","快速部署","安全","高性能","语言特定最佳实践","子系统技能"],"ja":["AIモデルの展開","迅速な展開","セキュリティ","高性能","言語特有のベストプラクティス","サブシステムスキル"],"ko":["AI 모델 배포","빠른 배포","보안","고성능","언어 특정 최적화","서브시스템 스킬"],"es":["generar habilidades de subsistema","despliegue de modelos de IA","seguridad y rendimiento","mejores prácticas de lenguaje","programación de subsistemas","LlamaFarm monorepo"],"fr":["générer des compétences de sous-système","déploiement de modèles d''IA","sécurité et performances","meilleures pratiques de langage","programmation de sous-systèmes","monorepo LlamaFarm"],"de":["erzeugen von subsystemfähigkeiten","bereitstellung von KI-modellen","sicherheit und leistung","sprachspezifische best practices","programmierung von subsystemen","LlamaFarm-monorepo"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de ia","geração de habilidades de subsistema","segurança de ia","desempenho de ia","linguagens de programação","implementação de ia"],"ru":["разработка ИИ","генерация навыков подсистемы","безопасность ИИ","производительность ИИ","языки программирования","развертывание ИИ"],"ar":["تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","توليد مهارات النظام الفرعي","أمن الذكاء الاصطناعي","أداء الذكاء الاصطناعي","لغات البرمجة","نشر الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"llama-farm","repo":"llamafarm","repoPath":"llama-farm/llamafarm","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"generate-subsystem-skills","description":"Generate specialized skills for each subsystem in the monorepo. Creates shared language skills and subsystem-specific checklists for high-quality AI code generation.","bodyPreview":"# Generate Subsystem Skills\n\nThis skill analyzes each subsystem in the LlamaFarm monorepo and generates specialized Claude Code skills for security, performance, and language-specific best practices.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/generate-subsystem-skills\n```\n\n---\n\n## What Gets Generated\n\n### Shared Language Skills (4)\n- `python-skills/` - Used by: server, rag, runtime, config, common\n- `go-skills/` - Used by: cli\n- `typescript-skills/` - Used by: designer, electron\n- `react-skills/` - Used by: designer\n\n###","body":"# Generate Subsystem Skills\n\nThis skill analyzes each subsystem in the LlamaFarm monorepo and generates specialized Claude Code skills for security, performance, and language-specific best practices.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\n/generate-subsystem-skills\n```\n\n---\n\n## What Gets Generated\n\n### Shared Language Skills (4)\n- `python-skills/` - Used by: server, rag, runtime, config, common\n- `go-skills/` - Used by: cli\n- `typescript-skills/` - Used by: designer, electron\n- `react-skills/` - Used by: designer\n\n### Subsystem-Specific Skills (8)\n- `cli-skills/` - Cobra, Bubbletea patterns\n- `server-skills/` - FastAPI, Celery, Pydantic patterns\n- `rag-skills/` - LlamaIndex, ChromaDB patterns\n- `runtime-skills/` - PyTorch, Transformers patterns\n- `designer-skills/` - TanStack Query, Tailwind, Radix patterns\n- `electron-skills/` - Electron IPC, security patterns\n- `config-skills/` - Pydantic, JSONSchema patterns\n- `common-skills/` - HuggingFace Hub patterns\n\n---\n\n## Generation Process\n\n### Step 1: Read Registry\n\nLoad subsystem definitions from [subsystem-registry.md](subsystem-registry.md).\n\n### Step 2: Generate Shared Language Skills\n\nLaunch sub-agents IN PARALLEL to generate:\n\n1. **Python Skills Agent** - Analyze Python subsystems (server, rag, runtime, config, common), identify ideal patterns, generate `python-skills/`\n\n2. **Go Skills Agent** - Analyze CLI subsystem, identify ideal Go patterns, generate `go-skills/`\n\n3. **TypeScript Skills Agent** - Analyze designer and electron, identify ideal TS patterns, generate `typescript-skills/`\n\n4. **React Skills Agent** - Analyze designer, identify ideal React 18 patterns, generate `react-skills/`\n\n### Step 3: Generate Subsystem Skills\n\nLaunch sub-agents IN PARALLEL for each subsystem:\n\nFor each subsystem, the agent should:\n1. Read the subsystem''s dependency files (package.json, pyproject.toml, go.mod)\n2. Analyze code patterns using Grep and Read\n3. Generate SKILL.md that links to shared language skills\n4. Generate framework-specific checklist files\n5. Write all files to `.claude/skills/{subsystem}-skills/`\n\n### Step 4: Report Summary\n\nAfter all agents complete, report:\n- Number of skills generated\n- Total files created\n- Any errors encountered\n\n---\n\n## Sub-Agent Prompt Templates\n\n### For Shared Language Skills\n\n```\nYou are generating a shared {LANGUAGE} skills directory for Claude Code.\n\nAnalyze these subsystems that use {LANGUAGE}:\n{SUBSYSTEM_PATHS}\n\nYour task:\n1. Read key files to understand patterns used\n2. When patterns vary, document the IDEAL approach (not inconsistencies)\n3. Reference industry best practices\n4. Generate files in .claude/skills/{LANGUAGE}-skills/\n\nFiles to generate:\n- SKILL.md (overview, ~100 lines)\n- patterns.md (idiomatic patterns)\n- error-handling.md\n- testing.md\n- security.md\n- {additional language-specific files}\n\nEach checklist item should have:\n- Description of what to check\n- Search pattern (grep command)\n- Pass/fail criteria\n- Severity level\n```\n\n### For Subsystem Skills\n\n```\nYou are generating subsystem-specific skills for {SUBSYSTEM} in Claude Code.\n\nDirectory: {PATH}\nTech Stack: {TECH_STACK}\nLinks to: {SHARED_SKILLS}\n\nYour task:\n1. Read dependency files and key source files\n2. Identify framework-specific patterns\n3. Generate SKILL.md that links to shared language skills\n4. Generate framework-specific checklists\n\nFiles to generate:\n- SKILL.md (overview with links to shared skills)\n- {framework}.md for each framework used\n- performance.md (subsystem-specific optimizations)\n\nRemember: Document IDEAL patterns, not existing inconsistencies.\n```\n\n---\n\n## Key Principle\n\n**Prescribe ideal patterns** - When the codebase has inconsistent patterns, the generated skills should document the BEST practice according to industry standards, not codify existing inconsistencies.\n\n---\n\n## Output Location\n\nAll skills are written to `.claude/skills/` with this structure:\n\n```\n.claude/skills/\n├── python-skills/      # Shared\n├── go-skills/          # Shared\n├── typescript-skills/  # Shared\n├── react-skills/       # Shared\n├── cli-skills/         # Subsystem\n├── server-skills/      # Subsystem\n├── rag-skills/         # Subsystem\n├── runtime-skills/     # Subsystem\n├── designer-skills/    # Subsystem\n├── electron-skills/    # Subsystem\n├── config-skills/      # Subsystem\n└── common-skills/      # Subsystem\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:36:50.550Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Multi-Language Agents requiring rapid deployment and integration of various AI models and databases","zh":"适用于需要快速部署和集成各种AI模型和数据库的多语言代理","ja":"さまざまなAIモデルの迅速な展開と統合を必要とするマルチ言語エージェントに最適","ko":"다양한 AI 모델 및 데이터베이스를 빠르게 배포하고 통합해야 하는 멀티언어 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de varios idiomas que requieren una implementación y integración rápidas de varios modelos y bases de datos de inteligencia artificial","fr":"Idéal pour les agents multilingues nécessitant un déploiement et une intégration rapides de divers modèles et bases de données d''IA","de":"Ideal für Multi-Language-Agents, die eine schnelle Bereitstellung und Integration verschiedener KI-Modelle und Datenbanken erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Multi-Língua que requerem implantação e integração rápidas de vários modelos de IA e bancos de dados","ru":"Идеально для многоязычных агентов, требующих быстрой развертки и интеграции различных моделей ИИ и баз данных","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المتعددين اللغات الذين يحتاجون إلى نشر سريع وتكامل للعديد من نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي والقواعد البيانية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy any AI model, agent, database, RAG, and pipeline locally or remotely in minutes, utilizing languages like Python, Go, TypeScript, and React, and adhering to security, performance, and language-specific best practices","zh":"赋予代理快速部署任何AI模型、代理、数据库、RAG和管道的能力，无论是本地还是远程，使用Python、Go、TypeScript和React等语言，并遵循安全、性能和语言特定最佳实践","ja":"Python、Go、TypeScript、Reactなどの言語を使用して、セキュリティ、パフォーマンス、言語固有のベストプラクティスに従い、エージェントがローカルまたはリモートでAIモデル、エージェント、データベース、RAG、パイプラインを数分で展開できるようにする","ko":"파이썬, 고, 타입스크립트, 리액트 등 언어를 사용하여 에이전트가 로컬 또는 원격에서 AI 모델, 에이전트, 데이터베이스, RAG, 파이프라인을 몇 분 안에 배포할 수 있게 하며, 보안, 성능 및 언어별 최선의 관행을 따름","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar cualquier modelo de IA, agente, base de datos, RAG y canalización de forma local o remota en minutos, utilizando lenguajes como Python, Go, TypeScript y React, y siguiendo las mejores prácticas de seguridad, rendimiento y lenguaje específico","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer n''importe quel modèle d''IA, agent, base de données, RAG et canalisation localement ou à distance en quelques minutes, en utilisant des langages tels que Python, Go, TypeScript et React, et en respectant les meilleures pratiques de sécurité, de performance et de langage spécifique","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, jedes KI-Modell, jeden Agenten, jede Datenbank, RAG und Pipeline lokal oder remote in Minuten bereitzustellen, indem es Sprachen wie Python, Go, TypeScript und React verwendet und die Sicherheits-, Leistungs- und sprachspezifischen Best Practices einhält","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar qualquer modelo de IA, agente, banco de dados, RAG e pipeline local ou remotamente em minutos, utilizando linguagens como Python, Go, TypeScript e React, e atendendo às melhores práticas de segurança, desempenho e linguagem específica","ru":"Позволяет агентам развертывать любую модель ИИ, агента, базу данных, RAG и конвейер локально или удаленно за минуты, используя языки như Python, Go, TypeScript и React, и соблюдая лучшие практики безопасности, производительности и языково-специфичные","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من نشر أي نموذج للذكاء الاصطناعي، أو وكيل، أو قاعدة بيانات، أو RAG، أو خط أنابيب محليا أو عن بُعد في دقائق، باستخدام لغات مثل Python، و Go، و TypeScript، و React، ومتوافقة مع أفضل الممارسات الأمنية والأدائية والملائمة للغة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating deployment of language-specific skills","Generating specialized Claude Code skills for enhanced security and performance","Streamlining integration of multiple AI models and databases"],"zh":["自动化语言特定技能的部署","生成专用Claude Code技能以增强安全性和性能","简化多个AI模型和数据库的集成"],"ja":["言語特定スキルの展開を自動化する","セキュリティとパフォーマンスを強化するための専用のClaude Codeスキルを生成する","複数のAIモデルとデータベースの統合を簡素化する"],"ko":["언어별 스킬의 배포를 자동화하는 것","보안 및 성능을 향상시키기 위한 전문 클라우드 코드 스킬 생성","다중 AI 모델 및 데이터베이스 통합을 간소화"],"es":["Automatización de la implementación de habilidades específicas del lenguaje","Generación de habilidades de código Claude especializadas para una mayor seguridad y rendimiento","Optimización de la integración de múltiples modelos y bases de datos de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["Automatisation du déploiement de compétences spécifiques au langage","Génération de compétences de code Claude spécialisées pour une sécurité et des performances accrues","Optimisation de l''intégration de plusieurs modèles et bases de données d''IA"],"de":["Automatisierung der Bereitstellung von sprachspezifischen Fähigkeiten","Generierung von spezialisierten Claude-Code-Fähigkeiten für erhöhte Sicherheit und Leistung","Optimierung der Integration mehrerer KI-Modelle und Datenbanken"],"pt":["Automatizar a implantação de habilidades específicas de língua","Gerar habilidades de código Claude especializadas para segurança e desempenho aprimorados","Otizar a integração de vários modelos de IA e bancos de dados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развертку языково-специфичных навыков","Генерировать специализированные навыки кода Claude для повышения безопасности и производительности","Оптимизировать интеграцию нескольких моделей ИИ и баз данных"],"ar":["تحسين نشر المهارات الخاصة باللغة","توليد مهارات كود كلود المتخصصة لتحسين الأمان والأداء","تبسيط دمج العديد من نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي والقواعد البيانية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the LlamaFarm monorepo","Limited to generating skills for specific languages and frameworks"],"zh":["需要访问LlamaFarm monorepo","仅限为特定语言和框架生成技能"],"ja":["LlamaFarmモノリポへのアクセスが必要","特定の言語とフレームワークのスキル生成のみ"],"ko":["롬파 فار름 모노 리포에 접근할 수 있어야 함","특정 언어 및 프레임워크에 대한 스킬 생성만 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso al monorepositorio LlamaFarm","Limitado a la generación de habilidades para lenguajes y frameworks específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au monorepositorio LlamaFarm","Limité à la génération de compétences pour des langages et des frameworks spécifiques"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das LlamaFarm-Monorepositorium","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von Fähigkeiten für bestimmte Sprachen und Frameworks"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao repositório monolítico LlamaFarm","Limitado a gerar habilidades para linguagens e estruturas específicas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к монорепозиторию LlamaFarm","Ограничен генерацией навыков для конкретных языков и фреймворков"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى المستودع الموحد LlamaFarm","محدود ب generating مهارات لغات و إطارات عمل محددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
