:"L''amélioration de la conception est un processus pour optimiser l''expérience utilisateur à travers des principes de design systématiques","de":"Die Design-Verbesserung ist ein Prozess, um die Benutzererfahrung durch systematische Designprinzipien zu optimieren","pt":"Otimização de design com melhorias sistemáticas para projetos de design","ru":"Оптимизация дизайна с помощью систематических улучшений для проектов дизайна","ar":"تحسين التصميم من خلال تحسينات منهجية لمشاريع التصميم","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["一致的设计风格","专业的设计体验","响应式设计支持","色彩一致性","品牌保护"],"ja":["一貫したデザインスタイル","プロフェッショナルなデザイン体験","レスポンシブデザイン対応","色彩の一貫性","ブランド保護"],"ko":["일관된 디자인 스타일","전문적인 디자인 경험","반응형 디자인 지원","색상 일관성","브랜드 보호"],"es":["Diseño responsivo","Paleta de colores consistente","Diseño móvil primero","Apariencia profesional","Optimización de la experiencia del usuario","Principios de diseño sistemáticos"],"fr":["Conception réactive","Palette de couleurs cohérente","Conception mobile d''abord","Apparence professionnelle","Optimisation de l''expérience utilisateur","Principes de design systématiques"],"de":["Responsives Design","Konsistente Farbpalette","Mobiles Design zuerst","Professionelles Aussehen","Optimierung der Benutzererfahrung","Systematische Designprinzipien"],"pt":["Consistência de paleta de cores","Design responsivo para dispositivos móveis","Aparência profissional","Prevenção de layouts quebrados","Cumprimento de princípios de design de projeto"],"ru":["Последовательность цветовой палитры","Отзывчивый дизайн для мобильных устройств","Профессиональный вид","Предотвращение сломанных макетов","Соблюдение принципов дизайна проекта"],"ar":["اتساق لوحة الألوان","تصميم مستجيب للهواتف المحمولة","مظهر احترافي","منع تصميمات مكسورة","الامتثال لمبادئ تصميم المشروع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["设计改进","设计优化","一致性设计","专业设计","响应式设计","色彩一致性","品牌保护"],"ja":["デザイン改善","設計最適化","一貫性デザイン","プロフェッショナルデザイン","レスポンシブデザイン","色彩の一貫性","ブランド保護"],"ko":["디자인 개선","디자인 최적화","일관성 디자인","전문적인 디자인","반응형 디자인","색상 일관성","브랜드 보호"],"es":["mejora de diseño","optimización de diseño web","principios de diseño","diseño responsivo","paleta de colores","diseño móvil","apariencia profesional","experiencia del usuario","desarrollo web"],"fr":["amélioration de la conception","optimisation du design web","principes de design","conception réactive","palette de couleurs","conception mobile","apparence professionnelle","expérience utilisateur","développement web"],"de":["Design-Verbesserung","Optimierung von Webdesign","Designprinzipien","responsives Design","Farbpalette","mobiles Design","professionelles Aussehen","Benutzererfahrung","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["otimização de design","melhorias sistemáticas","princípios de design","design responsivo","paleta de cores","aparência profissional"],"ru":["оптимизация дизайна","систематические улучшения","принципы дизайна","отзывчивый дизайн","цветовая палитра","профессиональный вид"],"ar":["تحسين التصميم","تحسينات منهجية","مبادئ التصميم","تصميم مستجيب","لوحة الألوان","مظهر احترافي"]}},"owner":"Youngger9765","repo":"young-personal-site","repoPath":"Youngger9765/young-personal-site","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"design-improvement","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Design Improvement Skill\n\n## Purpose\nStreamline design optimization with systematic improvements following project design principles.\n\n**Prevents**: Inconsistent design, broken responsive layouts, brand violations\n**Ensures**: Color palette consistency, mobile-first responsive design, professional appearance\n\n---\n\n## Design Principles\n\n### Color Palette\n```css\nPrimary:    slate-blue (#475569, #64748b)\nAccent:     coral-orange (#fb923c, #f97316)\nBackground: warm-cream (#fef3c7, #fef9c3)\nGradien","body":"# Design Improvement Skill\n\n## Purpose\nStreamline design optimization with systematic improvements following project design principles.\n\n**Prevents**: Inconsistent design, broken responsive layouts, brand violations\n**Ensures**: Color palette consistency, mobile-first responsive design, professional appearance\n\n---\n\n## Design Principles\n\n### Color Palette\n```css\nPrimary:    slate-blue (#475569, #64748b)\nAccent:     coral-orange (#fb923c, #f97316)\nBackground: warm-cream (#fef3c7, #fef9c3)\nGradients:  Smooth transitions for visual interest\n```\n\n### Typography\n```\nHierarchy: h1 > h2 > h3 > p (clear distinction)\nBody text: 16px+ for readability\nLine-height: Consistent spacing\nHero sections: Center-aligned\n```\n\n### Layout\n```\nApproach: Mobile-first responsive\nSpacing: Tailwind utilities (p-4, gap-6, etc.)\nAnimations: Framer Motion (smooth, not jarring)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Analyze Current Design\n\n```markdown\nIssues Checklist:\n- [ ] Color consistency problems?\n- [ ] Layout/alignment issues?\n- [ ] Typography hierarchy unclear?\n- [ ] Spacing inconsistent?\n- [ ] Responsive breakpoints broken?\n- [ ] Animations missing/excessive?\n```\n\n### 2. Propose Improvements (CARIO)\n\n```yaml\n📋 Context:\n  - Page: [Home/Projects/About/Speaking]\n  - Current state: [description]\n  - Issue: [what looks bad]\n\n❓ Problems:\n  1. [Color inconsistency]\n  2. [Poor spacing]\n  3. [Weak hierarchy]\n\n🎯 Options:\n  A. Minor tweaks (15 min, low impact)\n  B. Moderate redesign (30-45 min, medium impact)\n  C. Major overhaul (1-2 hours, high impact)\n\n💡 Recommendation: [Option B]\n  - Changes: [color X→Y, spacing p-4→p-6, add gradient]\n  - Reasoning: [balances improvement vs time]\n\n⚡ Impact:\n  - Files: [list]\n  - Testing: [responsive + visual]\n```\n\n### 3. Get User Confirmation\n\n```\nIdentified [N] design improvements for [Page] page:\n1. [Change 1]\n2. [Change 2]\n3. [Change 3]\n\nProceed with these improvements?\n```\n\n### 4. Implement Changes\n\n**Checklist**:\n- [ ] Update Tailwind classes\n- [ ] Ensure responsive (sm:, md:, lg: breakpoints)\n- [ ] Add/update Framer Motion animations\n- [ ] Maintain color palette\n- [ ] Follow typography hierarchy\n\n**Example**:\n```tsx\n// Before\n<div className=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n  <h1 className=\"text-2xl\">Title</h1>\n</div>\n\n// After\n<div className=\"p-6 md:p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-warm-cream to-white\">\n  <h1 className=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-700 text-center mb-6\">\n    Title\n  </h1>\n</div>\n```\n\n### 5. Test Responsive Design\n\n```bash\nnpm run dev\n# Test at: Mobile (375px), Tablet (768px), Desktop (1280px)\n```\n\n**Visual checklist**:\n- [ ] Mobile (< 640px): Readable, no overflow\n- [ ] Tablet (640-1024px): Proper spacing\n- [ ] Desktop (> 1024px): Optimal layout\n- [ ] Animations: Smooth (60fps)\n\n### 6. Commit and Deploy\n\n```bash\nnpm run build  # Verify\ngit add .\ngit commit -m \"style: improve [page] design with better spacing and colors\"\ngit push  # Auto-deploys to Vercel\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Improvements\n\n### Hero Section Enhancement\n```tsx\n// Before: Basic section\n<section className=\"py-12\">\n  <h1 className=\"text-3xl\">Welcome</h1>\n</section>\n\n// After: Enhanced with gradient + animation\n<section className=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-gradient-to-br from-warm-cream via-white to-blue-50\">\n  <motion.div initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }} animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}>\n    <h1 className=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-600 to-slate-800 bg-clip-text text-transparent mb-6\">\n      Welcome\n    </h1>\n  </motion.div>\n</section>\n```\n\n### Card Grid Optimization\n```tsx\n// Before: Fixed 3-column grid\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n  {projects.map(p => <Card {...p} />)}\n</div>\n\n// After: Responsive grid with hover animation\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8\">\n  {projects.map(p => (\n    <motion.div whileHover={{ scale: 1.03 }}>\n      <Card {...p} />\n    </motion.div>\n  ))}\n</div>\n```\n\n### Typography Hierarchy\n```tsx\n// Before: Flat hierarchy\n<h1>Title</h1>\n<p>Body text</p>\n\n// After: Clear hierarchy\n<h1 className=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-4 leading-tight\">\n  Title\n</h1>\n<p className=\"text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-prose\">\n  Body text\n</p>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quality Checklist\n\n**Before committing**:\n\n```markdown\nVisual:\n- [ ] Colors match palette (slate-blue, coral-orange, warm-cream)\n- [ ] Spacing consistent (4px increments: p-4, p-6, p-8)\n- [ ] Typography hierarchy clear\n- [ ] Contrast WCAG AA (4.5:1 for text)\n\nResponsive:\n- [ ] Mobile (< 640px): Works\n- [ ] Tablet (640-1024px): Optimized\n- [ ] Desktop (> 1024px): Polished\n- [ ] No horizontal scroll\n- [ ] Touch targets ≥ 44px (mobile)\n\nPerformance:\n- [ ] Animations smooth (60fps)\n- [ ] No layout shift (CLS < 0.1)\n- [ ] Next.js Image component used\n\nConsistency:\n- [ ] Matches existing pages'' style\n- [ ] Follows Tailwind conventions\n- [ ] Framer Motion patterns consistent\n- [ ] Bilingual support maintained\n```\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### ❌ Breaking Responsive\n```tsx\n// Bad: Fixed width\n<div className=\"w-[1200px]\">Content</div>\n\n// Good: Responsive width\n<div className=\"w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4\">Content</div>\n```\n\n### ❌ Inconsistent Colors\n```tsx\n// Bad: Random colors\n<div className=\"bg-red-500 text-purple-700\">Content</div>\n\n// Good: Follow palette\n<div className=\"bg-warm-cream text-slate-700\">Content</div>\n```\n\n### ❌ Poor Typography\n```tsx\n// Bad: Unreadable\n<p className=\"text-xs\">Important content</p>\n\n// Good: Readable\n<p className=\"text-base md:text-lg\">Important content</p>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Spacing Scale\n```\np-4  = 16px   p-8  = 32px\np-6  = 24px   p-12 = 48px\n```\n\n### Typography Scale\n```\ntext-base = 16px   text-2xl = 24px   text-4xl = 36px\ntext-lg   = 18px   text-3xl = 30px   text-5xl = 48px\n```\n\n### Responsive Breakpoints\n```\nsm: ≥ 640px (mobile landscape)\nmd: ≥ 768px (tablet)\nlg: ≥ 1024px (desktop)\nxl: ≥ 1280px (large desktop)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Integration\n\n- **content-update**: Content + design updates together\n- **deploy-check**: Pre-deployment design verification\n\n---\n\n**Version**: v1.1 | **Updated**: 2025-12-31\n**Project**: young-personal-site\n**Philosophy**: \"Design is not just what it looks like. Design is how it works.\" - Steve Jobs\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:36:33.670Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for UI/UX Agents needing systematic design optimization and responsive layout improvements.","zh":"非常适合需要系统设计优化和响应式布局改进的 UI/UX 代理","ja":"UI/UX エージェントが体系的な設計最適化とレスポンシブ レイアウトの改善を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"시스템적인 디자인 최적화와 반응형 레이아웃 개선을 필요로 하는 UI/UX 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para agentes de UI/UX que necesitan optimización de diseño sistemática y mejoras en la disposición receptiva.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents UI/UX ayant besoin d''une optimisation de conception systématique et d''améliorations de disposition réactive.","de":"Perfekt für UI/UX-Agenten, die eine systematische Designoptimierung und Verbesserungen der responsiven Layouts benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de UI/UX que necessitam de otimização de design sistemática e melhorias de layout responsivo.","ru":"Идеально для агентов UI/UX, которым необходима системная оптимизация дизайна и улучшение адаптивного макета.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم / الخبرة التي تحتاج إلى تحسين تصميم منهجي وتحسين تخطيط مستجيب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce color palette consistency, implement mobile-first responsive design, and ensure professional appearance using CSS and design principles like slate-blue and coral-orange accents.","zh":"赋予代理实施颜色调色板一致性、采用移动优先的响应式设计，并使用 CSS 和设计原则（如蓝灰和珊瑚橙色装饰）确保专业的外观","ja":"エージェントがカラーパレットの一貫性を実施し、モバイルファーストのレスポンシブ デザインを実装し、CSS と設計原則（スレートブルーとコーラルオレンジのアクセントなど）を使用してプロフェッショナルな外観を確保する","ko":"에이전트가 색상 팔레트 일관성을 적용하고, 모바일 우선의 반응형 디자인을 구현하며, CSS와 디자인 원칙(スレート 블루와 코랄 오렌지 액센트 등)을 사용하여 전문가적인 외관을 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar la coherencia de la paleta de colores, implementar un diseño receptivo de primera generación para dispositivos móviles y garantizar una apariencia profesional utilizando CSS y principios de diseño como acentos azul-pizarra y naranja-coral.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''imposer la cohérence de la palette de couleurs, de mettre en œuvre une conception réactive mobile-first et de garantir une apparence professionnelle en utilisant CSS et des principes de conception tels que des accents bleu-ardoise et corail-orange.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Farbpalette Konsistenz durchzusetzen, ein mobiles erstes responsives Design umzusetzen und ein professionelles Erscheinungsbild unter Verwendung von CSS und Designprinzipien wie Schieferblau- und Korallenorange-Akzenten sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor consistência de paleta de cores, implementar design responsivo para dispositivos móveis e garantir aparência profissional usando CSS e princípios de design como acentos slate-blue e coral-orange.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить согласованность цветовой палитры, реализовать адаптивный дизайн для мобильных устройств и гарантировать профессиональный вид с помощью CSS и принципов дизайна, таких как акценты slate-blue и coral-orange.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فرض الاتساق في لوحة الألوان وتنفيذ تصميم مستجيب للهواتف المحمولة وضمان المظهر المحترف باستخدام CSS ومبادئ التصميم مثل لمسات slate-blue وcoral-orange."},"useCases":{"en":["Streamlining design optimization with systematic improvements","Preventing inconsistent design and broken responsive layouts","Ensuring brand consistency across different platforms and devices"],"zh":["通过系统改进简化设计优化","防止设计不一致和破损的响应式布局","在不同平台和设备上确保品牌一致性"],"ja":["体系的な改善による設計最適化の簡素化","設計の一貫性のないこととレスポンシブ レイアウトの破損を防止","異なるプラットフォームとデバイスでブランドの一貫性を確保"],"ko":["체계적인 개선을 통해 디자인 최적화를 단순화","디자인 불일치와 반응형 레이아웃의 손상을 방지","다양한 플랫폼과 디바이스에서 브랜드 일관성을 보장"],"es":["Optimización de diseño con mejoras sistemáticas","Prevención de diseños inconsistentes y disposiciones receptivas rotas","Garantía de la coherencia de la marca en diferentes plataformas y dispositivos"],"fr":["Optimisation de la conception avec des améliorations systématiques","Prévention de conceptions incohérentes et de dispositions réactives cassées","Garantie de la cohérence de la marque sur différentes plateformes et appareils"],"de":["Optimierung des Designs mit systematischen Verbesserungen","Verhinderung inkonsistenter Designs und kaputter responsiver Layouts","Sicherstellung der Markenkontinuität auf verschiedenen Plattformen und Geräten"],"pt":["Otimizar a otimização de design com melhorias sistemáticas","Prevenir design inconsistente e layouts responsivos quebrados","Garantir a consistência da marca em diferentes plataformas e dispositivos"],"ru":["Оптимизировать оптимизацию дизайна с системными улучшениями","Предотвратить несогласованный дизайн и сломанные адаптивные макеты","Обеспечить согласованность бренда на разных платформах и устройствах"],"ar":["تحسين تحسين التصميم مع تحسينات منهجية","منع تصميم غير متماسك وتخطيطات مستجيبة مكسورة","ضمان اتساق العلامة التجارية عبر منصات وأجهزة مختلفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of CSS and design principles","Limited to visual design improvements, not functional or backend development"],"zh":["需要 CSS 和设计原则的知识","仅限视觉设计改进，不包括功能或后端开发"],"ja":["CSS と設計原則の知識が必要","視覚的な設計改善のみ、機能またはバックエンド開発は含まない"],"ko":["CSS와 디자인 원칙에 대한 지식이 필요","视覺的な 디자인 개선만, 기능 또는 백엔드 개발은 포함하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de CSS y principios de diseño","Limitado a mejoras de diseño visual, no de desarrollo funcionales o de backend"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en CSS et principes de conception","Limité aux améliorations de conception visuelle, et non au développement fonctionnel ou backend"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von CSS und Designprinzipien","Begrenzt auf visuelle Designverbesserungen, nicht auf funktionale oder Backend-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de CSS e princípios de design","Limitado a melhorias de design visual, não desenvolvimento funcional ou backend"],"ru":["Требует знания CSS и принципов дизайна","Ограничен улучшениями визуального дизайна, не функционального или бэкенд-разработки"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة CSS ومبادئ التصميم","محدود بتحسينات التصميم البصري ، وليس التطوير الوظيفي أو الخلفي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
