ر التلقائي","en":"dev-server"},"description":{"zh":"dev-server是管理开发服务器生命周期的最简单方式，确保后台模式下的平稳运行","ja":"dev-serverは開発サーバーのライフサイクルを管理する最も簡単な方法であり、バックグラウンドモードでのスムーズな動作を保証します","ko":"dev-server는 개발 서버 라이프사이클을 관리하는 가장 쉬운 방법으로, 백그라운드 모드에서 원활한 작동을 보장합니다","es":"El servidor de desarrollo más fácil de usar para ejecutar flujos de trabajo automatizados. Administre el ciclo de vida del servidor de desarrollo para una op...","fr":"Le serveur de développement le plus facile à utiliser pour exécuter des flux de travail automatisés. Gérez le cycle de vie du serveur de développement pour u...","de":"Der einfachste Entwicklungsserver zum Ausführen automatisierter Arbeitsabläufe. Verwalten Sie den Lebenszyklus des Entwicklungsservers für einen reibungslose...","pt":"O dev-server é uma ferramenta que permite executar fluxos de trabalho descritos em linguagem natural de forma automática, garantindo uma operação suave em mo...","ru":"Dev-server - это инструмент, который позволяет автоматически выполнять рабочие процессы, описанные в естественном языке, обеспечивая плавную работу в фоновом...","ar":"خادم التطوير هو أداة تمكنك من تشغيل العمليات الموضحة بلغة طبيعية بشكل تلقائي، وضمان تشغيل سلس في الوضع الخلفي","en":"the easiest way to run natural language-described workflows automatically"},"definition":{"en":"the easiest way to run natural language-described workflows automatically"},"features":{"zh":["自动化自然语言描述的工作流程","后台模式下的开发服务器管理","开发服务器日志查看和过滤","开发服务器认证管理","支持多种操作：start、stop、logs、auth"],"ja":["自然言語で記述されたワークフローの自動化","バックグラウンドモードでの開発サーバー管理","開発サーバーログの表示とフィルタリング","開発サーバーの認証管理","start、stop、logs、authなどの複数の操作をサポート"],"ko":["자연어로 설명된 워크플로의 자동화","백그라운드 모드下的 개발 서버 관리","개발 서버 로그查看과 필터링","개발 서버 인증 관리","start, stop, logs, auth 등의 여러 가지 연산을 지원"],"es":["Inicio automático del servidor de desarrollo","Parada del servidor de desarrollo en segundo plano","Visualización de registros del servidor de desarrollo","Autenticación con el servidor de desarrollo","Compatibilidad con aplicaciones web","Funcionamiento en segundo plano"],"fr":["Démarrage automatique du serveur de développement","Arrêt du serveur de développement en arrière-plan","Affichage des journaux du serveur de développement","Authentification avec le serveur de développement","Compatibilité avec les applications web","Fonctionnement en arrière-plan"],"de":["Automatischer Start des Entwicklungsservers","Beenden des Entwicklungsservers im Hintergrund","Anzeige der Protokolle des Entwicklungsservers","Authentifizierung mit dem Entwicklungsserver","Kompatibilität mit Webanwendungen","Hintergrundbetrieb"],"pt":["Iniciação do servidor de desenvolvimento em modo de fundo","Parada do servidor de desenvolvimento em modo de fundo","Visualização dos logs do servidor de desenvolvimento com filtro opcional","Autenticação com o servidor de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Запуск сервера разработки в фоновом режиме","Остановка сервера разработки в фоновом режиме","Просмотр логов сервера разработки с опциональным фильтром","Аутентификация с сервером разработки"],"ar":["تشغيل خادم التطوير في الوضع الخلفي","إيقاف خادم التطوير في الوضع الخلفي","عرض سجلات خادم التطوير مع مرشح اختياري","التحقق من هوية خادم التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["dev-server","自动化工作流","开发服务器管理","后台模式","开发服务器日志","开发服务器认证","start","stop","logs","auth"],"ja":["dev-server","自動化ワークフロー","開発サーバー管理","バックグラウンドモード","開発サーバーログ","開発サーバーの認証","start","stop","logs","auth"],"ko":["dev-server","자동화 워크플로","개발 서버 관리","백그라운드 모드","개발 서버 로그","개발 서버 인증","start","stop","logs","auth"],"es":["servidor de desarrollo","flujo de trabajo automático","desarrollo de aplicaciones","automatización de tareas","servidor de desarrollo en segundo plano","autenticación de servidor","registros del servidor","compatibilidad con aplicaciones web"],"fr":["serveur de développement","flux de travail automatisé","développement d''applications","automatisation de tâches","serveur de développement en arrière-plan","authentification de serveur","journaux du serveur","compatibilité avec les applications web"],"de":["Entwicklungsserver","automatisierter Arbeitsablauf","Anwendungsentwicklung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Entwicklungsserver im Hintergrund","Serverauthentifizierung","Serverprotokolle","Kompatibilität mit Webanwendungen"],"pt":["servidor de desenvolvimento","fluxos de trabalho automaticos","modo de fundo","linguagem natural","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["сервер разработки","автоматические рабочие процессы","фоновый режим","естественный язык","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["خادم التطوير","عمليات تلقائية","الوضع الخلفي","لغة طبيعية","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"vm0-ai","repo":"vm0","repoPath":"vm0-ai/vm0","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dev-server","description":"Development server lifecycle management for the vm0 project","bodyPreview":"You are a development server specialist for the vm0 project. Your role is to manage the development server lifecycle, ensuring smooth operation in background mode.\n\n## Operations\n\nParse the `args` parameter to determine which operation to perform:\n\n- **start**: Start the development server in background mode (tunnel is automatic for web app)\n- **stop**: Stop the background development server\n- **logs [pattern]**: View development server logs with optional filtering\n- **auth**: Authenticate with","body":"You are a development server specialist for the vm0 project. Your role is to manage the development server lifecycle, ensuring smooth operation in background mode.\n\n## Operations\n\nParse the `args` parameter to determine which operation to perform:\n\n- **start**: Start the development server in background mode (tunnel is automatic for web app)\n- **stop**: Stop the background development server\n- **logs [pattern]**: View development server logs with optional filtering\n- **auth**: Authenticate with local development server and get CLI token\n- **tunnel**: Full setup with tunnel and CLI authentication (for E2B testing)\n\nWhen invoked, check the args to determine the operation and execute accordingly.\n\n**Note**: As of issue #1726, the web app automatically starts a Cloudflare tunnel when running `pnpm dev`. The tunnel URL is displayed during startup and `VM0_API_URL` is set automatically.\n\n---\n\n# Operation: start\n\nStart the Turbo development server in background with stream UI mode.\n\n**Note**: The web app now automatically starts a Cloudflare tunnel during dev startup. This means `VM0_API_URL` is set automatically and E2B webhooks will work out of the box. The web app takes ~15 seconds longer to start than other packages due to tunnel setup.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Check if Dev Server is Already Running\n\nFirst, check if dev server is already accessible by testing the port:\n\n```bash\n# Test if dev server port is open\nif nc -z -w 3 localhost 3000 2>/dev/null || curl -k -s --connect-timeout 3 https://www.vm7.ai:8443/ > /dev/null 2>&1; then\n  echo \"✅ Dev server is already running at https://www.vm7.ai:8443\"\n  echo \"\"\n  echo \"To use with CLI, run /dev-auth to authenticate\"\n  exit 0\nfi\n```\n\nIf not accessible, proceed to stop any orphaned processes:\n\n```bash\n# Check and stop existing dev server processes\nif pgrep -f \"turbo.*dev\" > /dev/null; then\n  echo \"⚠️ Found existing dev server process, stopping it...\"\n  pkill -9 -f \"turbo.*dev\"\n  sleep 2\n  echo \"✅ Stopped existing dev server\"\nelse\n  echo \"✅ No existing dev server process found\"\nfi\n```\n\n### Step 2: Generate SSL Certificates if Needed\n\nEnsure SSL certificates exist before starting the server:\n\n```bash\n# Get project root dynamically\nPROJECT_ROOT=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\nCERT_DIR=\"$PROJECT_ROOT/.certs\"\n\n# Check if all required certificates exist\nif [ ! -f \"$CERT_DIR/www.vm7.ai.pem\" ] || \\\n   [ ! -f \"$CERT_DIR/docs.vm7.ai.pem\" ] || \\\n   [ ! -f \"$CERT_DIR/vm7.ai.pem\" ]; then\n  echo \"📜 Generating SSL certificates...\"\n  bash \"$PROJECT_ROOT/scripts/generate-certs.sh\"\nelse\n  echo \"✅ SSL certificates already exist\"\nfi\n```\n\n### Step 3: Start Dev Server in Background\n\nStart the server with non-interactive output using Bash tool with `run_in_background: true` parameter:\n\n```bash\nPROJECT_ROOT=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\ncd \"$PROJECT_ROOT/turbo\" && pnpm dev --ui=stream\n```\n\nThis will return a shell_id (task_id) for monitoring.\n\n### Step 4: Persist Shell ID\n\nSave the shell_id to a file for later use:\n\n```bash\necho \"<shell_id>\" > /tmp/dev-server-shell-id\n```\n\nAlso save the output file path:\n\n```bash\necho \"/tmp/claude/-workspaces-vm01/tasks/<shell_id>.output\" > /tmp/dev-server-output-file\n```\n\n### Step 5: Confirm Startup\n\nDisplay the shell ID for monitoring:\n\n```\n✅ Dev server started in background (shell_id: <id>)\n\nNext steps:\n- Use `/dev-logs` to view server output\n- Use `/dev-logs [pattern]` to filter logs (e.g., `/dev-logs error`)\n- Use `/dev-stop` to stop the server\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- The `--ui=stream` flag ensures non-interactive output suitable for background monitoring\n- This operation uses context fork for isolation - the main conversation won''t be polluted by server startup logs\n- Tool access is restricted to: Bash, KillShell, TaskOutput only\n\n---\n\n# Operation: stop\n\nStop the background development server gracefully.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Find the Dev Server Shell ID\n\nRead the saved shell_id from persistent storage:\n\n```bash\nif [ -f /tmp/dev-server-shell-id ]; then\n  SHELL_ID=$(cat /tmp/dev-server-shell-id)\n  echo \"Found shell_id: $SHELL_ID\"\nelse\n  echo \"No shell_id file found\"\nfi\n```\n\n### Step 2: Stop the Server\n\n**If shell_id was found**, use KillShell tool:\n\n```javascript\nKillShell({ shell_id: \"<shell-id>\" })\n```\n\n**If shell_id not found**, try force kill:\n\n```bash\npkill -9 -f \"turbo.*dev\"\n```\n\n### Step 3: Clean Up Persistent Files\n\nRemove the shell_id files:\n\n```bash\nrm -f /tmp/dev-server-shell-id\nrm -f /tmp/dev-server-output-file\n```\n\n### Step 4: Verify Stopped\n\nCheck if process still exists:\n\n```bash\npgrep -f \"turbo.*dev\"\n```\n\n### Step 5: Show Results\n\n**If stopped successfully**:\n```\n✅ Dev server stopped successfully\n\nYou can start it again with `/dev-start`\n```\n\n**If process still detected**:\n```\n⚠️ Warning: Dev server process still detected\n\nTry manual cleanup: pkill -f \"pnpm dev\"\n```\n\n**If no dev server was running**:\n```\nℹ️ No dev server is currently running\n\nUse `/dev-start` to start one\n```\n\n---\n\n# Operation: logs\n\nView development server output logs with optional filtering.\n\n## Arguments Format\n\n- `logs` - Show all new logs since last check\n- `logs [pattern]` - Show only logs matching the regex pattern\n\n## Examples\n\n- `logs error` - Show only error messages\n- `logs \"web|workspace\"` - Show logs from web or workspace packages\n- `logs \"compiled|ready\"` - Show compilation status\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Find the Dev Server Shell ID\n\nRead the saved shell_id from persistent storage:\n\n```bash\nif [ -f /tmp/dev-server-shell-id ]; then\n  cat /tmp/dev-server-shell-id\nelse\n  echo \"❌ No dev server shell_id found\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\nIf shell_id file doesn''t exist:\n```\n❌ No dev server is running. Please run `/dev-start` first.\n```\n\n### Step 2: Get Logs Using TaskOutput Tool\n\nUse the TaskOutput tool with the shell_id to retrieve logs:\n\n**If no filter pattern provided**:\n```javascript\nTaskOutput({\n  task_id: \"<shell-id>\",\n  block: false,\n  timeout: 5000\n})\n```\n\n**If filter pattern provided**:\n- First get all logs using TaskOutput\n- Then filter the output using the provided regex pattern\n- Display only matching lines\n\n### Step 3: Display Logs\n\nShow the output in readable format. If empty, mention that no new logs since last check.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Only shows **NEW** output since last time logs were checked\n- Filter parameter uses regex patterns\n- Non-blocking operation\n\n---\n\n# Operation: auth\n\nAuthenticate with local development server and get CLI token.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Dev server must be running (use `/dev-start` first)\n- Clerk test credentials must be configured in environment\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Check Dev Server Running\n\nFirst, check if dev server is accessible by testing the port:\n\n```bash\n# Test if dev server port is open\nif nc -z -w 3 localhost 3000 2>/dev/null || curl -k -s --connect-timeout 3 https://www.vm7.ai:8443/ > /dev/null 2>&1; then\n  echo \"✅ Dev server is accessible at https://www.vm7.ai:8443\"\nelse\n  echo \"❌ Dev server is not accessible\"\n  echo \"Please run /dev-start first or check if server is running\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\nOptionally, if you want to check logs from background server, read shell_id:\n\n```bash\nif [ -f /tmp/dev-server-shell-id ]; then\n  SHELL_ID=$(cat /tmp/dev-server-shell-id)\n  echo \"Found background server with shell_id: $SHELL_ID\"\nfi\n```\n\nIf shell_id exists, you can use TaskOutput to check logs:\n\n```javascript\nTaskOutput({\n  task_id: \"<shell-id>\",\n  block: false,\n  timeout: 5000\n})\n```\n\nBut the key indicator is **HTTP endpoint accessibility**, not just the shell_id.\n\n### Step 2: Check Required Environment Variables\n\nCheck and ensure all required environment variables are set in `turbo/apps/web/.env.local`:\n\n```bash\nPROJECT_ROOT=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\nENV_FILE=\"$PROJECT_ROOT/turbo/apps/web/.env.local\"\n\n# Check NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL\nif ! grep -q \"^NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=\" \"$ENV_FILE\" 2>/dev/null; then\n  echo \"⚠️ NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL not found, adding it...\"\n  echo \"NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000\" >> \"$ENV_FILE\"\n  echo \"✅ Added NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL to .env.local\"\n  echo \"⚠️ Note: Dev server needs restart to pick up this change\"\nfi\n\n# Check NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY\nif ! grep -q \"^NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=\" \"$ENV_FILE\" 2>/dev/null; then\n  echo \"❌ NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY not found in .env.local\"\n  echo \"Please run: script/sync-env.sh\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n\n# Check CLERK_SECRET_KEY\nif ! grep -q \"^CLERK_SECRET_KEY=\" \"$ENV_FILE\" 2>/dev/null; then\n  echo \"❌ CLERK_SECRET_KEY not found in .env.local\"\n  echo \"Please run: script/sync-env.sh\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n\necho \"✅ All required environment variables are present\"\n```\n\n### Step 3: Build and Install CLI Globally\n\nCheck dev server logs to see if CLI build was successful.\n\nFirst, get the shell_id:\n```bash\nSHELL_ID=$(cat /tmp/dev-server-shell-id)\n```\n\nThen use TaskOutput to check CLI build status:\n```javascript\nTaskOutput({\n  task_id: \"<shell-id>\",\n  block: false,\n  timeout: 5000\n})\n```\n\nLook for these indicators:\n- \"@vm0/cli:dev:\" messages\n- \"Build success\" or \"ESM Build success\" in CLI logs\n- No build errors or failures\n\n**If CLI build succeeded in dev mode**:\n```bash\nPROJECT_ROOT=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\ncd \"$PROJECT_ROOT/turbo/apps/cli\" && pnpm link --global\n```\n\n**If CLI build failed or not found in logs**:\n```bash\nPROJECT_ROOT=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\ncd \"$PROJECT_ROOT/turbo/apps/cli\" && pnpm build && pnpm link --global\n```\n\n### Step 4: Run Authentication Automation\n\n```bash\nPROJECT_ROOT=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\ncd \"$PROJECT_ROOT\" && npx tsx e2e/cli-auth-automation.ts http://localhost:3000\n```\n\nThis script:\n- Spawns `vm0 auth login` with `VM0_API_URL=http://localhost:3000`\n- Launches Playwright browser in headless mode\n- Logs in via Clerk using `e2e+clerk_test@vm0.ai`\n- Automatically enters the CLI device code\n- Clicks \"Authorize Device\" button\n- Saves token to `~/.vm0/config.json`\n\n### Step 5: Verify Authentication\n\n```bash\ncat ~/.vm0/config.json\n```\n\n### Step 6: Display Results\n\n```\n✅ CLI authentication successful!\n\nAuth token saved to: ~/.vm0/config.json\n\nYou can now use the CLI with local dev server:\n- vm0 auth status\n- vm0 project list\n```\n\n## Error Handling\n\nIf authentication fails:\n- Check dev server logs with `/dev-logs`\n- Verify Clerk credentials in `turbo/apps/web/.env.local`\n- Ensure Playwright browser is installed\n\n---\n\n# Operation: tunnel\n\nFull development environment setup with Cloudflare tunnel and CLI authentication. Useful for E2B webhook testing.\n\n**Note**: Since issue #1726, the web app automatically starts a Cloudflare tunnel when running `pnpm dev`. This operation is useful when you need the **complete setup** including CLI authentication.\n\n## What It Does\n\n- Installs dependencies and builds project\n- Starts dev server (tunnel is now automatic for web app)\n- Installs E2E dependencies and Playwright\n- Installs and authenticates CLI globally\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Install Dependencies\n\n```bash\nPROJECT_ROOT=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\ncd \"$PROJECT_ROOT/turbo\" && pnpm install\n```\n\n### Step 2: Build Project\n\n```bash\nPROJECT_ROOT=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\ncd \"$PROJECT_ROOT/turbo\" && pnpm build\n```\n\n### Step 3: Start Dev Server\n\nUse Bash tool with `run_in_background: true`:\n\n```bash\nPROJECT_ROOT=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\ncd \"$PROJECT_ROOT/turbo\" && pnpm dev --ui=stream\n```\n\nThis will return a shell_id for monitoring. The web app will automatically start a Cloudflare tunnel.\n\n### Step 4: Persist Shell ID\n\nSave the shell_id to a file for later use:\n\n```bash\necho \"<shell_id>\" > /tmp/dev-server-shell-id\n```\n\n### Step 5: Wait for Tunnel URL\n\nMonitor background shell output using TaskOutput until you see:\n- `[tunnel] Tunnel URL:` followed by the URL\n- `Ready in` (Next.js ready message)\n\n```javascript\nTaskOutput({\n  task_id: \"<shell-id>\",\n  block: false,\n  timeout: 60000\n})\n```\n\nExtract the tunnel URL from output (format: `https://*.trycloudflare.com`).\n\n### Step 6: Export VM0_API_URL\n\n```bash\nexport VM0_API_URL=<tunnel-url>\n```\n\n### Step 7: Install E2E Dependencies\n\n```bash\nPROJECT_ROOT=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\ncd \"$PROJECT_ROOT/e2e\" && pnpm install\n```\n\n### Step 8: Install Playwright Browser\n\n```bash\nPROJECT_ROOT=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\ncd \"$PROJECT_ROOT/e2e\" && npx playwright install chromium\n```\n\n### Step 9: Install CLI Globally\n\n```bash\nPROJECT_ROOT=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\ncd \"$PROJECT_ROOT/turbo/apps/cli\" && pnpm link --global\n```\n\n### Step 10: Run CLI Authentication\n\nRead Clerk credentials from `turbo/apps/web/.env.local`:\n- `NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY` → `CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY`\n- `CLERK_SECRET_KEY` → `CLERK_SECRET_KEY`\n\nThen run:\n```bash\nPROJECT_ROOT=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\ncd \"$PROJECT_ROOT/e2e\" && \\\nCLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=<publishable-key> \\\nCLERK_SECRET_KEY=<secret-key> \\\nnpx tsx cli-auth-automation.ts http://localhost:3000\n```\n\n### Step 11: Verify Authentication\n\n```bash\ncat ~/.vm0/config.json\n```\n\n### Step 12: Display Results\n\n```\n✅ Dev server with tunnel started!\n\nLocal:   http://localhost:3000\nTunnel:  <tunnel-url>\n\nVM0_API_URL exported to: <tunnel-url>\n\n✅ CLI authentication successful!\nAuth token saved to: ~/.vm0/config.json\n\nYou can now test E2B webhooks locally:\n  vm0 run <agent-name> \"<prompt>\"\n\nUse `/dev-stop` to stop the server.\n```\n\n## Technical Details\n\nThe web app''s dev script (`turbo/apps/web/scripts/dev.sh`):\n- Starts a Cloudflare tunnel using `cloudflared`\n- Exposes localhost:3000 to the internet\n- Sets `VM0_API_URL` environment variable\n- Starts Next.js dev server with Turbopack\n\n## Error Handling\n\nIf tunnel fails to start:\n- Check if `cloudflared` is installed\n- Check tunnel logs: `tail -f /tmp/cloudflared-dev.log`\n\nIf authentication fails:\n- Check dev server logs with `/dev-logs`\n- Verify Clerk credentials in `turbo/apps/web/.env.local`\n- Ensure Playwright browser is installed\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:36:52.412Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Server Agents requiring automated workflow management and background mode operation.","zh":"适用于需要自动化工作流管理和后台模式操作的开发服务器代理。","ja":"自動化ワークフローの管理とバックグラウンドモード操作を必要とする開発サーバーエージェントに適しています。","ko":"자동화된 워크플로우 관리 및 배경 모드 작동이 필요한 개발 서버 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Servidor de Desarrollo que requieren una gestión de flujo de trabajo automatizada y operación en modo de fondo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de serveur de développement nécessitant une gestion de workflow automatisée et un fonctionnement en mode d''arrière-plan.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsserver-Agents, die eine automatisierte Workflow-Verwaltung und einen Hintergrundbetrieb erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Servidor de Desenvolvimento que exigem gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho automatizado e operação em modo de segundo plano.","ru":"Идеально для агентов сервера разработки, требующих автоматизированного управления рабочим процессом и фоновым режимом работы.","ar":"مثالي لعميل خادم التطوير الذي يتطلب إدارة تدفق العمل التلقائي وعمليات وضع الخلفية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automatically run natural language-described workflows, manage development server lifecycles, and perform operations like start, stop, and logs filtering using command-line arguments and tunneling for web apps.","zh":"赋予代理自动运行自然语言描述的工作流、管理开发服务器生命周期，并使用命令行参数和隧道技术对网页应用程序执行操作，如启动、停止和日志过滤。","ja":"エージェントが自然言語で記述されたワークフローを自動的に実行し、開発サーバーのライフサイクルを管理し、コマンドライン引数とトンネリングを使用してWebアプリケーションに対して開始、停止、ログフィルタリングなどの操作を実行できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 자연어로 설명된 워크플로우를 자동으로 실행하고 개발 서버의 수명 주기를 관리하며 명령줄 인수 및 터널링을 사용하여 웹 애플리케이션에 대해 시작, 중지 및 로그 필터링 gibi 작업을 수행할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ejecutar flujos de trabajo descritos en lenguaje natural de forma automática, gestionar ciclos de vida de servidores de desarrollo y realizar operaciones como inicio, parada y filtrado de registros utilizando argumentos de línea de comandos y túneles para aplicaciones web.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exécuter automatiquement des flux de travail décrits en langage naturel, de gérer les cycles de vie des serveurs de développement et d''effectuer des opérations telles que le démarrage, l''arrêt et le filtrage des journaux à l''aide d''arguments de ligne de commande et de tunnels pour les applications web.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Workflows, die in natürlicher Sprache beschrieben sind, automatisch auszuführen, Entwicklungs-Server-Lebenszyklen zu verwalten und Operationen wie Start, Stopp und Log-Filterung mithilfe von Befehlszeilenargumenten und Tunneln für Web-Anwendungen durchzuführen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a executar fluxos de trabalho descritos em linguagem natural de forma automática, gerenciar ciclos de vida de servidores de desenvolvimento e realizar operações como iniciar, parar e filtrar logs usando argumentos de linha de comando e túneis para aplicativos web.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматически запускать рабочие процессы, описанные на естественном языке, управлять жизненным циклом серверов разработки и выполнять операции, такие как запуск, остановка и фильтрация журналов, используя командную строку и туннелирование для веб-приложений.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تشغيل تدفقات العمل الموصوفة باللغة الطبيعية تلقائيًا وإدارة دورة حياة خادم التطوير وتنفيذ عمليات مثل التشغيل والتوقف وتصفية السجلات باستخدام حجة سطر الأوامر والنفق عبر تطبيقات الويب."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating development server startup and shutdown","Debugging development server issues with log filtering","Authenticating with development servers for secure access"],"zh":["自动化开发服务器的启动和关闭","使用日志过滤调试开发服务器问题","通过开发服务器进行身份验证以实现安全访问"],"ja":["開発サーバーの起動とシャットダウンの自動化","ログフィルタリングを使用して開発サーバーの問題をデバッグする","開発サーバーを使用してセキュアなアクセスを実現するための認証"],"ko":["개발 서버의 시작 및 종료 자동화","로그 필터링을 사용하여 개발 서버 문제를 디버깅","개발 서버를 사용하여 보안 액세스를 위한 인증"],"es":["Automatización del inicio y apagado del servidor de desarrollo","Depuración de problemas del servidor de desarrollo con filtrado de registros","Autenticación con servidores de desarrollo para acceso seguro"],"fr":["Automatisation du démarrage et de l''arrêt du serveur de développement","Débogage des problèmes du serveur de développement avec filtrage des journaux","Authentification avec les serveurs de développement pour un accès sécurisé"],"de":["Automatisierung des Startens und Beenden des Entwicklungsservers","Fehlerbehebung bei Entwicklungsserver-Problemen mit Log-Filterung","Authentifizierung mit Entwicklungsservern für sicheren Zugriff"],"pt":["Automatizar a inicialização e desligamento do servidor de desenvolvimento","Depurar problemas do servidor de desenvolvimento com filtragem de logs","Autenticar com servidores de desenvolvimento para acesso seguro"],"ru":["Автоматизация запуска и остановки сервера разработки","Отладка проблем сервера разработки с фильтрацией журналов","Аутентификация с серверами разработки для безопасного доступа"],"ar":["تأتمتة تشغيل وإيقاف خادم التطوير","تصحيح أخطاء خادم التطوير مع تصفية السجلات","التحقق من هوية خادم التطوير للحصول على وصول آمن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires command-line interface for argument parsing","Background mode operation required for server management"],"zh":["需要命令行界面来解析参数","需要后台模式操作来管理服务器"],"ja":["コマンドラインインターフェイスが引数の解析に必要","サーバーの管理にはバックグラウンドモード操作が必要"],"ko":["인수 구문 분석에 명령줄 인터페이스가 필요","서버 관리를 위해 백그라운드 모드 작동이 필요"],"es":["Requiere interfaz de línea de comandos para análisis de argumentos","Se requiere el modo de fondo para la administración del servidor"],"fr":["Nécessite une interface de ligne de commande pour l''analyse des arguments","Le mode d''arrière-plan est requis pour la gestion du serveur"],"de":["Benötigt Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle für Argument Parsing","Hintergrundbetrieb ist für die Serververwaltung erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige interface de linha de comando para análise de argumentos","Operação em modo de segundo plano necessária para gerenciamento de servidor"],"ru":["Требует командной строки для разбора аргументов","Фоновой режим работы необходим для управления сервером"],"ar":["يتطلب واجهة سطر الأوامر لتحليل الحجج","عملية وضع الخلفية ضرورية لإدارة الخادم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('gadievron/raptor/github-archive', 'community', 'gadievron', 'raptor', 'gadievron/raptor', 'github-archive', 0, 0, 85, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z', '2026-02-18T03:36:47.718Z', NULL, '{"id":"gadievron/raptor/github-archive","name":"github-archive","description":{"zh":"GitHub 存档技能用于查询不可变的 GitHub 事件历史，提供安全调查的防篡改法医证据。它帮助开发者调查安全事件，构建威胁行为者属性文件和验证仓库活动主张","ja":"GitHub アーカイブ スキルは、変更できない GitHub イベント履歴を照会してセキュリティ調査のための改竄防止の法医学的証拠を提供します。開発者はセキュリティ インシデントを調査し、脅威行為者の属性プロファイルを構築し、リポジトリ アクティビティの主張を検証するのに役立ちます","ko":"GitHub 아카이브 스킬은 변경 불가능한 GitHub 이벤트 기록을 조회하여 보안 조사에 대한 위조 방지 법의학적 증거를 제공합니다. 개발자는 보안 이벤트를 조사하고, 위협 행위자의 속성 프로파일을 구축하고, 리포지토리 활동 주장을 검증하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"El archivo de GitHub permite consultar la historia de eventos inmutable de GitHub para obtener pruebas forenses para investigaciones de seguridad","fr":"L''archive GitHub permet de consulter l''historique des événements immuables de GitHub pour obtenir des preuves forenses pour les enquêtes de sécurité","de":"Das GitHub-Archiv ermöglicht die Abfrage der unveränderlichen GitHub-Ereignishistorie, um forensische Beweise für Sicherheitsuntersuchungen zu erhalten","pt":"O GitHub Archive fornece evidências forenses imutáveis para investigações de segurança, permitindo a reconstrução de timelines de ataques e a detecção de comprometimentos","ru":"GitHub Архив предоставляет неизменные судебные доказательства для расследований безопасности, позволяя восстанавливать временные шкалы атак и обнаруживать компрометации","ar":"أرشيف GitHub يوفر أدلة جنائية لا يمكن تغييرها لتحقيقات الأمن، مما يسمح بإعادة بناء جداول زمنية للهجمات واكتشاف الاستغلالات","en":"Raptor turns Claude Code into a general-purpose AI offensive/defensive security agent. By using Claude.md and creating rules, sub-agents, and skills, and orchestrating security tool usage, we configure the agent for adversaria