richten - Hyperlane","pt":"Investigue Mensagens Presas - Hyperlane","ru":"Изучение застрявших сообщений - Hyperlane","ar":"تحقيق الرسائل العالقة - Hyperlane","en":"investigate-stuck-messages"},"description":{"zh":"investigate-stuck-messages技能用于调查卡住的消息，包括重试次数和错误原因。它可以帮助开发者解决消息传递问题","ja":"investigate-stuck-messagesスキルは、詰まったメッセージのリトライ回数とエラーレーザンを調査するために使用されます。メッセージングの問題を解決するのに役立ちます","ko":"investigate-stuck-messages 스킬은 메시지, 재시도 횟수 및 오류 이유를 조사하여 메시지 전달 문제를 해결하는 데 도움이 됩니다","es":"Investiga mensajes atascados en Hyperlane mediante la consulta de la API de relayer. Obtiene información sobre los mensajes atascados, los recuentos de reint...","fr":"Enquêter sur les messages bloqués dans Hyperlane en interrogeant l''API de relayer. Obtenez des informations sur les messages bloqués, les comptes de réessai ...","de":"Untersuchen Sie feststeckende Nachrichten in Hyperlane, indem Sie die Relayer-API abfragen. Erhalten Sie Informationen über feststeckende Nachrichten, Wieder...","pt":"A investigação de mensagens presas permite que os desenvolvedores identifiquem e resolvam problemas de entrega de mensagens","ru":"Изучение застрявших сообщений позволяет разработчикам выявить и решить проблемы доставки сообщений","ar":"التحقيق في الرسائل العالقة يسمح للمطورين بالتعرف على مشاكل تسليم الرسائل وحلها","en":"The home for Hyperlane core contracts, sdk packages, and other infrastructure"},"definition":{"en":"The home for Hyperlane core contracts, sdk packages, and other infrastructure"},"features":{"zh":["查询卡住的消息","查看重试次数","查看错误原因","支持Alert-based触发器","支持用户请求触发器"],"ja":["詰まったメッセージの調査","リトライ回数の確認","エラーレーザンの確認","Alert-basedトリガーのサポート","ユーザー要求トリガーのサポート"],"ko":["메시지 조사","재시도 횟수 확인","오류 이유 확인","Alert-based 트리거 지원","사용자 요청 트리거 지원"],"es":["Consulta de la API de relayer para obtener información sobre mensajes atascados","Obtención de recuentos de reintento y razones de error","Resolución de problemas de mensajes atascados en Hyperlane","Soporte para alertas y solicitudes de usuarios","Análisis de colas de mensajes y errores"],"fr":["Interrogation de l''API de relayer pour obtenir des informations sur les messages bloqués","Obtention des comptes de réessai et des raisons d''erreur","Résolution de problèmes de messages bloqués dans Hyperlane","Prise en charge des alertes et des demandes des utilisateurs","Analyse des files d''attente de messages et des erreurs"],"de":["Abfragen der Relayer-API, um Informationen über feststeckende Nachrichten zu erhalten","Erhalt von Wiederholungszählern und Fehlergründen","Lösen von Problemen mit feststeckenden Nachrichten in Hyperlane","Unterstützung für Warnungen und Benutzeranfragen","Analyse von Nachrichtenwarteschlangen und Fehlern"],"pt":["Investigue mensagens presas na fila do relayer","Verifique contagens de retry e motivos de erro","Solucione problemas de entrega de mensagens","Monitore a fila do relayer para alertas","Verifique a saúde da aplicação"],"ru":["Изучите застрявшие сообщения в очереди релейера","Проверьте счетчики повторных попыток и причины ошибок","Решите проблемы доставки сообщений","Мониторьте очередь релейера для оповещений","Проверьте здоровье приложения"],"ar":["تحقق من الرسائل العالقة في صفة الرسول","تحقق من أعداد الإعادة ومسببات الأخطاء","حل مشاكل تسليم الرسائل","رصد صفة الرسول للتنبيهات","تحقق من صحة التطبيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["investigate-stuck-messages","消息调查","卡住的消息","重试次数","错误原因","Alert-based触发器","用户请求触发器"],"ja":["investigate-stuck-messages","メッセージの調査","詰まったメッセージ","リトライ回数","エラーレーザン","Alert-basedトリガー","ユーザー要求トリガー"],"ko":["investigate-stuck-messages","메시지 조사","메시지","재시도 횟수","오류 이유","Alert-based 트리거","사용자 요청 트리거"],"es":["mensajes atascados","Hyperlane","API de relayer","reintento","errores","alertas","solicitudes de usuarios","desarrollo de software","integración de API"],"fr":["messages bloqués","Hyperlane","API de relayer","réessai","erreurs","alertes","demandes des utilisateurs","développement de logiciels","intégration d''API"],"de":["feststeckende Nachrichten","Hyperlane","Relayer-API","Wiederholung","Fehler","Warnungen","Benutzeranfragen","Softwareentwicklung","API-Integration"],"pt":["investigar mensagens presas","Hyperlane","relayer","entrega de mensagens","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","solução de problemas","fila do relayer","contagens de retry","motivos de erro"],"ru":["изучение застрявших сообщений","Hyperlane","релейер","доставка сообщений","разработка приложений","решение проблем","очередь релейера","счетчики повторных попыток","причины ошибок"],"ar":["تحقيق الرسائل العالقة","Hyperlane","الرسول","تسليم الرسائل","تطوير التطبيقات","حل المشاكل","صفة الرسول","أعداد الإعادة","مسببات الأخطاء"]}},"owner":"hyperlane-xyz","repo":"hyperlane-monorepo","repoPath":"hyperlane-xyz/hyperlane-monorepo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"investigate-stuck-messages","description":"Investigate stuck messages in relayer queue. Use when alerts mention queue length > 0, to diagnose why messages are stuck, or to get message IDs for denylisting.","bodyPreview":"# Investigate Stuck Messages\n\nQuery the relayer API to investigate stuck messages, their retry counts, and error reasons.\n\n## When to Use\n\n1. **Alert-based triggers:**\n   - Alert: \"Known app context relayer queue length > 0 for 40m\"\n   - Any alert mentioning stuck messages in prepare queue\n   - High retry counts for specific app contexts\n\n2. **User request triggers:**\n   - \"Why are messages stuck for [app_context]?\"\n   - \"Investigate stuck messages on [chain]\"\n   - \"What''s causing the queue aler","body":"# Investigate Stuck Messages\n\nQuery the relayer API to investigate stuck messages, their retry counts, and error reasons.\n\n## When to Use\n\n1. **Alert-based triggers:**\n   - Alert: \"Known app context relayer queue length > 0 for 40m\"\n   - Any alert mentioning stuck messages in prepare queue\n   - High retry counts for specific app contexts\n\n2. **User request triggers:**\n   - \"Why are messages stuck for [app_context]?\"\n   - \"Investigate stuck messages on [chain]\"\n   - \"What''s causing the queue alert?\"\n   - Pasting a Grafana alert URL\n\n## Input Parameters\n\n**Option 1: Grafana Alert URL (recommended)**\n\n```\n/investigate-stuck-messages https://abacusworks.grafana.net/alerting/grafana/cdg1ro5hi4vswb/view?tab=instances\n```\n\n**Option 2: Manual specification**\n\n```\n/investigate-stuck-messages app_context=EZETH/renzo-prod remote=linea\n```\n\n| Parameter     | Required | Default    | Description                                                           |\n| ------------- | -------- | ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `alert_url`   | No       | -          | Grafana alert URL (extracts app_context/remote from firing instances) |\n| `app_context` | No\\*     | -          | The app context (e.g., `EZETH/renzo-prod`, `oUSDT/production`)        |\n| `remote`      | No\\*     | -          | Destination chain name (e.g., `linea`, `ethereum`, `arbitrum`)        |\n| `environment` | No       | `mainnet3` | Deployment environment                                                |\n\n\\*Either `alert_url` OR both `app_context` and `remote` must be provided.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Parse Input and Extract Alert Instances\n\n**If Grafana alert URL provided:**\n\n1. Extract the alert UID from the URL (e.g., `cdg1ro5hi4vswb` from `.../alerting/grafana/cdg1ro5hi4vswb/view`)\n\n2. Query Prometheus directly for firing instances using `mcp__grafana__query_prometheus`:\n\n   ```\n   sum by (app_context, remote)(\n       max_over_time(\n           hyperlane_submitter_queue_length{\n               queue_name=\"prepare_queue\",\n               app_context!~\"Unknown|merkly_eth|merkly_erc20|helloworld|velo_message_module\",\n               hyperlane_context!~\"rc|vanguard0|vanguard1|vanguard2|vanguard3|vanguard4|vanguard5\",\n               operation_status!~\"Retry\\\\(ApplicationReport\\\\(.*\\\\)\\\\)|FirstPrepareAttempt\",\n               hyperlane_deployment=\"mainnet3\",\n           }[2m]\n       )\n   ) > 0\n   ```\n\n3. Extract `app_context` and `remote` labels from each result.\n\n**If manual app_context/remote provided:**\n\nUse the provided values directly.\n\n### Step 2: Setup Port-Forward to Relayer\n\nCheck if port 9090 is already in use:\n\n```bash\nlsof -i :9090\n```\n\nIf not in use, start port-forward in background:\n\n```bash\nkubectl port-forward omniscient-relayer-hyperlane-agent-relayer-0 9090 -n mainnet3 &\n```\n\nWait a few seconds for the port-forward to establish.\n\n### Step 3: Get Domain IDs for Chains\n\nLook up domain IDs from the registry:\n\n```bash\ncat node_modules/.pnpm/@hyperlane-xyz+registry@*/node_modules/@hyperlane-xyz/registry/dist/chains/<chain>/metadata.json | jq ''.domainId''\n```\n\nCommon domain IDs:\n\n- ethereum: 1\n- optimism: 10\n- arbitrum: 42161\n- polygon: 137\n- base: 8453\n- unichain: 130\n- avalanche: 43114\n\n### Step 4: Query Relayer API\n\nFor each destination chain, query the relayer API:\n\n```bash\ncurl -s ''http://localhost:9090/list_operations?destination_domain=<DOMAIN_ID>'' > /tmp/<chain>.json\n```\n\nThe response contains operations with:\n\n- `id`: Message ID (H256)\n- `operation.message.sender`: Sender address\n- `operation.message.recipient`: Recipient address\n- `operation.num_retries`: Number of retries (higher = more stuck)\n- `operation.status`: Error status (e.g., `{\"Retry\": \"ErrorEstimatingGas\"}`)\n- `operation.message.origin`: Origin domain ID\n- `operation.message.destination`: Destination domain ID\n- `operation.app_context`: App context name\n\n### Step 5: Filter Messages by App Context\n\nLook up the `app_context` in `rust/main/app-contexts/mainnet_config.json`:\n\n```bash\njq ''.metricAppContexts[] | select(.name == \"<APP_CONTEXT>\")'' rust/main/app-contexts/mainnet_config.json\n```\n\nFilter API results to only include messages where:\n\n- `operation.message.recipient` matches one of the `recipientAddress` values for that destination domain\n\n**Important**: Addresses are padded to 32 bytes (H256 format).\n\n### Step 6: Query GCP Logs for Actual Errors\n\n**Calculate log freshness based on retry count:**\n\nThe relayer uses exponential backoff (see `calculate_msg_backoff` in `rust/main/agents/relayer/src/msg/pending_message.rs`):\n\n| Retries | Backoff/retry | Cumulative Time | Freshness Flag    |\n| ------- | ------------- | --------------- | ----------------- |\n| 1-4     | 5s-1min       | ~2min           | `--freshness=1h`  |\n| 5-24    | 3min          | ~1h             | `--freshness=3h`  |\n| 25-39   | 5-26min       | ~5h             | `--freshness=12h` |\n| 40-49   | 30min-1h      | ~12h            | `--freshness=24h` |\n| 50-60   | 2-22h         | ~35h            | `--freshness=3d`  |\n| 60+     | 22h+          | 35h+            | `--freshness=7d`  |\n\nFor each message ID, query GCP logs with calculated freshness:\n\n```bash\ngcloud logging read ''resource.type=k8s_container AND resource.labels.namespace_name=mainnet3 AND resource.labels.pod_name:omniscient-relayer AND jsonPayload.span.id:<MESSAGE_ID> AND jsonPayload.fields.error:*'' --project=abacus-labs-dev --limit=1 --format=''value(jsonPayload.fields.error)'' --freshness=<CALCULATED_FRESHNESS>\n```\n\nExtract the human-readable error from the response using `sed` (macOS compatible):\n\n```bash\necho \"$raw_error\" | sed -n ''s/.*execution reverted: \\([^\"]*\\)\".*/\\1/p'' | head -1\n```\n\nCommon error patterns:\n\n- `\"execution reverted: Nonce already used\"` → \"Nonce already used\"\n- `\"execution reverted: panic: arithmetic underflow\"` → \"Arithmetic underflow\"\n\n**Note**: Do not use `grep -P` as it''s not available on macOS.\n\n### Step 7: Present Investigation Results\n\nOutput a detailed summary table with **full message IDs** and **both error sources**:\n\n```\n## Investigation Results for [APP_CONTEXT]\n\n### Summary\n- Total stuck messages: X\n- Destinations affected: [list]\n- Reprepare reasons: ErrorEstimatingGas (N), CouldNotFetchMetadata (M)\n\n### Messages\n\n| Message ID | Retries | Reprepare Reason | Error | Origin |\n|------------|---------|------------------|-----------|--------|\n| `0xaa18ebc1c79345e6d24984a0b9a5ab66c968d128d46b2357b641e56e71b8d30c` | 47 | ErrorEstimatingGas | Nonce already used | optimism |\n| `0xd6aeef7c092a88aa23ad53227aeb834ae731d059b3ce749db8451e761f3f15ac` | 47 | ErrorEstimatingGas | Nonce already used | arbitrum |\n\n**Important**: Always show the full 66-character message ID (0x + 64 hex chars). Do not truncate.\n\n### Error Analysis\n[Explain based on the actual log errors found]\n\n### Next Steps\nTo denylist these messages, run:\n/denylist-stuck-messages <message_ids> app_context=APP_CONTEXT\n```\n\n**Column definitions:**\n\n- **Reprepare Reason**: From `operation.status` in relayer API (e.g., ErrorEstimatingGas, CouldNotFetchMetadata)\n- **Error**: Actual revert reason from GCP logs (e.g., \"Nonce already used\", \"Arithmetic underflow\")\n\n### Step 8: Output Denylist Command\n\nAt the end of the investigation results, output the full denylist command:\n\n```\n### Next Steps\nTo denylist, run:\n/denylist-stuck-messages 0xaa18ebc1c79345e6d24984a0b9a5ab66c968d128d46b2357b641e56e71b8d30c 0xd6aeef7c092a88aa23ad53227aeb834ae731d059b3ce749db8451e761f3f15ac app_context=APP_CONTEXT\n```\n\nAlways use full message IDs, never truncated.\n\n## Error Status Reference\n\n| Status                   | Meaning                                 | Action                                   |\n| ------------------------ | --------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `ErrorEstimatingGas`     | Gas estimation failed (contract revert) | Usually denylist - contract won''t accept |\n| `CouldNotFetchMetadata`  | Can''t get ISM metadata                  | Check validators, may resolve itself     |\n| `ApplicationReport(...)` | App-specific error                      | Check the specific error message         |\n| `GasPaymentNotFound`     | No IGP payment                          | May need manual relay with gas           |\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- **Port-forward fails**: Check kubectl context: `kubectl config current-context`\n- **No messages found**: Queue may have cleared; alert may be stale\n- **API returns error**: Check relayer pod: `kubectl get pods -n mainnet3 | grep relayer`\n- **App context not found**: May be new/custom; ask user for sender/recipient addresses\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- `kubectl` configured with access to mainnet cluster\n- Grafana MCP server connected (for alert URL parsing)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:37:35.898Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Relayer API Agents needing to debug stuck messages and optimize retry counts.","zh":"适用于需要调试卡住的消息和优化重试次数的Relayer API代理。","ja":"Relayer APIエージェントが詰まったメッセージをデバッグし、リトライ回数を最適化する必要がある場合に適しています。","ko":"Relayer API 에이전트가 걸린 메시지를 디버깅하고 재시도 횟수를 최적화해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de la API Relayer que necesitan depurar mensajes atascados y optimizar los recuentos de reintento.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de l''API Relayer qui ont besoin de déboguer les messages bloqués et d''optimiser les comptes de réessais.","de":"Ideal für Relayer-API-Agents, die feststeckende Nachrichten debuggen und Wiederholungszähler optimieren müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de API Relayer que precisam depurar mensagens presas e otimizar contagens de tentativas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Relayer API, которым необходимо отладить застрявшие сообщения и оптимизировать количество повторных попыток.","ar":"مثالي لعميل وسيط API الذي يحتاج إلى تصحيح أخطاء الرسائل العالقة وتحسين عدد المحاولات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to query the relayer API, investigate stuck messages, and analyze retry counts and error reasons using alert-based triggers and user request triggers, leveraging Hyperlane core contracts and SDK packages.","zh":"赋予代理查询中继API、调查卡住的消息并使用基于警报的触发器和用户请求触发器分析重试次数和错误原因，利用Hyperlane核心合约和SDK包。","ja":"エージェントにリレーアピを照会し、詰まったメッセージを調査し、アラートベースのトリガーとユーザー要求トリガーを使用してリトライ回数とエラーリーズンを分析する機能を提供し、HyperlaneコアコントラクトとSDKパッケージを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 중继 API를 쿼리하고, 걸린 메시지를 조사하고, 경고 기반 트리거와 사용자 요청 트리거를 사용하여 재시도 횟수와 오류 이유를 분석할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, Hyperlane 핵심 계약과 SDK 패키지를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a consultar la API de relayer, investigar mensajes atascados y analizar los recuentos de reintento y las razones de error utilizando disparadores basados en alertas y disparadores de solicitudes de usuario, aprovechando los contratos y paquetes de SDK de Hyperlane.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interroger l''API de relayer, d''enquêter sur les messages bloqués et d''analyser les comptes de réessais et les raisons d''erreur en utilisant des déclencheurs basés sur des alertes et des déclencheurs de requêtes utilisateur, en exploitant les contrats et les packages de SDK de Hyperlane.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, die Relayer-API abzufragen, feststeckende Nachrichten zu untersuchen und Wiederholungszähler und Fehlergründe mithilfe von alertbasierten Auslösern und Benutzeranforderungsauslösern zu analysieren, indem sie die Hyperlane-Kernverträge und SDK-Pakete nutzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes consultem a API do relayer, investiguem mensagens presas e analisem contagens de tentativas e motivos de erro usando gatilhos baseados em alertas e gatilhos de solicitação do usuário, aproveitando contratos principais Hyperlane e pacotes de SDK.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запросить API-реле, расследовать застрявшие сообщения и проанализировать количество повторных попыток и причины ошибок с помощью триггеров, основанных на оповещениях, и триггеров запроса пользователя, используя основные контракты Hyperlane и пакеты SDK.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من استفسار وسيط API ، والتحقيق في الرسائل العالقة ، وتحليل عدد المحاولات وأسباب الخطأ باستخدام أجهزة تنبيه قائمة على التنبيهات وأجهزة تنبيه طلب المستخدم ، واستخدام عقود Hyperlane الأساسية وحزم SDK."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging stuck messages in prepare queues","Analyzing retry counts for specific app contexts","Investigating error reasons for stuck messages on multiple chains"],"zh":["准备队列中卡住的消息调试","特定应用程序上下文的重试次数分析","多个链上卡住的消息的错误原因调查"],"ja":["準備キューに詰まったメッセージのデバッグ","特定のアプリケーションコンテキストのリトライ回数の分析","複数のチェーン上で詰まったメッセージのエラーリーズンの調査"],"ko":["준비 큐에서 걸린 메시지 디버깅","특정 애플리케이션 컨텍스트의 재시도 횟수 분석","여러 체인에서 걸린 메시지의 오류 이유 조사"],"es":["Depuración de mensajes atascados en colas de preparación","Análisis de recuentos de reintento para contextos de aplicaciones específicas","Investigación de razones de error para mensajes atascados en varias cadenas"],"fr":["Débogage de messages bloqués dans les files d''attente de préparation","Analyse des comptes de réessais pour des contextes d''applications spécifiques","Enquête sur les raisons d''erreur pour les messages bloqués sur plusieurs chaînes"],"de":["Debuggen von feststeckenden Nachrichten in Vorbereitungsqueues","Analyse von Wiederholungszählern für spezifische App-Kontexte","Untersuchung von Fehlergründen für feststeckende Nachrichten auf mehreren Ketten"],"pt":["Depuração de mensagens presas em filas de preparo","Análise de contagens de tentativas para contextos de aplicativos específicos","Investigação de motivos de erro para mensagens presas em várias correntes"],"ru":["Отладка застрявших сообщений в очередях подготовки","Анализ количества повторных попыток для конкретных контекстов приложений","Расследование причин ошибок для застрявших сообщений на нескольких цепочках"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء الرسائل العالقة في طوابير التحضير","تحليل عدد المحاولات لنطاقات تطبيق محددة","التحقيق في أسباب الأخطاء للرسائل العالقة على سلاسل متعددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to relayer API","Limited to Hyperlane core contracts and SDK packages","Dependent on alert-based triggers and user request triggers"],"zh":["需要访问中继API","仅限于Hyperlane核心合约和SDK包","依赖于基于警报的触发器和用户请求触发器"],"ja":["リレーアピへのアクセスが必要","HyperlaneコアコントラクトとSDKパッケージのみに限定される","アラートベースのトリガーとユーザー要求トリガーに依存する"],"ko":["중继 API에 대한 접근이 필요","Hyperlane 핵심 계약 및 SDK 패키지로만 제한","경고 기반 트리거 및 사용자 요청 트리거에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de relayer","Limitado a los contratos y paquetes de SDK de Hyperlane","Dependiente de disparadores basados en alertas y disparadores de solicitudes de usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API de relayer","Limité aux contrats et aux packages de SDK de Hyperlane","Dépendant des déclencheurs basés sur des alertes et des déclencheurs de requêtes utilisateur"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Relayer-API","Begrenzt auf Hyperlane-Kernverträge und SDK-Pakete","Abhängig von alertbasierten Auslösern und Benutzeranforderungsauslösern"],"pt":["Exige acesso à API do relayer","Limitado a contratos principais Hyperlane e pacotes de SDK","Dependente de gatilhos baseados em alertas e gatilhos de solicitação do usuário"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API-реле","Ограничен основными контрактами Hyperlane и пакетами SDK","Зависит от триггеров, основанных на оповещениях, и триггеров запроса пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى وسيط API","محدود بعقود Hyperlane الأساسية وحزم SDK","يعتمد على أجهزة تنبيه قائمة على التنبيهات وأجهزة تنبيه طلب المستخدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('pr-pm/prpm/agent-builder', 'community', 'pr-pm', 'prpm', 'pr-pm/prpm', 'agent-builder', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z', '2026-02-18T03:37:37.654Z', NULL, '{"id":"pr-pm/prpm/agent-builder","name":"agent-builder","description":{"zh":"Agent Builder 是一个通用注册表，用于 AI 编码工具。它提供了创建、改进或排除 Claude Code 子代理问题的专家指导","ja":"Agent Builder は、AI コーディング ツールのためのユニバーサル レジストリです。Claude Code サブエージェントを作成、改善、またはトラブルシューティングするための専門家のガイダンスを提供します","ko":"에이전트 빌더는 AI 코딩 도구를 위한 유니버설 레지스트리입니다. Claude Code 서브 에이전트를 생성, 개선 또는 문제 해결하는 데 전문가 지침을 제공합니다","es":"El constructor de agentes es una herramienta para crear, mejorar y solucionar problemas de subagentes de Claude Code, con orientación experta en diseño de agentes y configuración de sistemas","fr":"Le constructeur d''agents est un outil pour créer, améliorer et dépanner les sous-agents de Claude Code, avec une orientation experte en conception d''agents et en configuration de systèmes","de":"Der Agenten-Builder ist ein Tool zum Erstellen, Verbessern und Troubleshooten von Claude Code-Subagenten, mit Experten-Anleitung für Agenten-Design und Systemkonfiguration","pt":"O Construtor de Agentes é uma ferramenta de registro universal para ferramentas de codificação de IA, fornecendo orientação especializada em design de agente, engenharia de prompts de sistema e configuração de ferramentas.","ru":"Построитель агентов - это универсальный реестр для инструментов кодирования ИИ, предоставляющий экспертные рекомендации по проектированию агентов, инженерии системных подсказок и настройке инструментов.","ar":"بناء الوكيل هو سجل شامل للأدوات البرمجية الإصطناعية، يوفر توجيهًا متخصصًا في تصميم الوكيل، هندسة الإشارات النصية للنظام، وتكوين الأدوات.","en":"The universal registry for AI coding tools"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI Agent Builder - Claude Code 子代理专家","ja":"AI エージェント ビルダー - Claude Code サブエージェント