той запрос","ar":"موهبة FETCH البسيطة","en":"simple-fetch"},"description":{"zh":"Simple Fetch 技能演示了核心技能模式，包括接受 CLI 参数、调用 MCP 工具和返回结果","ja":"Simple Fetch スキルは、コア スキル パターンを示し、CLI パラメーターの受け取り、MCP ツールの呼び出し、結果の返却を実行します","ko":"Simple Fetch 스킬은 핵심 스킬 패턴을 보여주며 CLI 매개 변수 수신, MCP 도구 호출 및 결과 반환을 수행합니다","es":"La herramienta simple-fetch es un patrón de habilidad básico para desarrolladores que permite ejecutar código MCP y fetching de contenido de URL de manera ef...","fr":"L''outil simple-fetch est un modèle de compétence de base pour les développeurs qui permet d''exécuter du code MCP et de récupérer du contenu d''URL de manière ...","de":"Das simple-fetch-Tool ist ein grundlegendes Skill-Muster für Entwickler, mit dem MCP-Code ausgeführt und Inhalte von URLs effizient abgerufen werden können.","pt":"A habilidade Simple Fetch é um exemplo de habilidade básica que demonstra como buscar conteúdo de uma URL","ru":"Навык простого запроса является примером базового навыка, демонстрирующего извлечение контента из URL","ar":"موهبة FETCH البسيطة هي مثال على موهبة أساسية تظهر كيفية استرداد المحتوى من URL","en":"Enhanced MCP code execution. Agent framework-agnostic (optimized for Claude Code). Skills framework (99.6% token reduction), multi-transport, sandboxing"},"definition":{"en":"Enhanced MCP code execution. Agent framework-agnostic (optimized for Claude Code). Skills framework (99.6% token reduction), multi-transport, sandboxing"},"features":{"zh":["框架无关性","99.6% 令牌减少","多运输","沙盒化","CLI 参数支持"],"ja":["フレームワーク非依存","99.6% トークン削減","マルチ トランスポート","サンドボックス化","CLI パラメータ サポート"],"ko":["프레임워크 비의존성","99.6% 토큰 감소","멀티 트랜스ポート","샌드박스화","CLI 매개 변수 지원"],"es":["Ejecución de código MCP","Fetching de contenido de URL","Patrón de habilidad básico","Optimizado para Claude Code","Marco de habilidades framework-agnóstico"],"fr":["Exécution de code MCP","Récupération de contenu d''URL","Modèle de compétence de base","Optimisé pour Claude Code","Cadre de compétences framework-agnóstico"],"de":["Ausführung von MCP-Code","Abrufen von Inhalten von URLs","Grundlegendes Skill-Muster","Optimiert für Claude Code","Framework-agnostisches Skill-Framework"],"pt":["Execução de código MCP","Compatibilidade com Claude Code","Redução de tokens em 99,6%","Suporte a multi-transporte","Sandboxing"],"ru":["Выполнение кода MCP","Совместимость с Claude Code","Сокращение токенов на 99,6%","Поддержка мульти-транспорта","Безопасная среда"],"ar":["تنفيذ رمز MCP","التوافق مع Claude Code","تقليل الرموز بنسبة 99,6%","دعم النقل المتعدد","sandboxing"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Simple Fetch","URL 抓取","MCP 代码执行","CLI 参数","框架无关性","令牌减少"],"ja":["Simple Fetch","URL 取得","MCP コード実行","CLI パラメータ","フレームワーク非依存","トークン削減"],"ko":["Simple Fetch","URL 가져오기","MCP 코드 실행","CLI 매개 변수","프레임워크 비의존성","토큰 감소"],"es":["simple-fetch","código MCP","fetching de contenido","desarrollo de habilidades","Claude Code","framework-agnóstico"],"fr":["simple-fetch","code MCP","récupération de contenu","développement de compétences","Claude Code","framework-agnóstico"],"de":["simple-fetch","MCP-Code","Inhaltsabruf","Skill-Entwicklung","Claude Code","framework-agnostisches"],"pt":["habilidade simple fetch","busca de conteúdo","código MCP","Claude Code","redução de tokens","multi-transporte","sandboxing"],"ru":["навык простого запроса","извлечение контента","код MCP","Claude Code","сокращение токенов","мульти-транспорт","безопасная среда"],"ar":["موهبة FETCH البسيطة","استرداد المحتوى","رمز MCP","Claude Code","تقليل الرموز","النقل المتعدد","sandboxing"]}},"owner":"yoloshii","repo":"mcp-code-execution-enhanced","repoPath":"yoloshii/mcp-code-execution-enhanced","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"simple-fetch","description":"Basic MCP skill demonstrating CLI-based execution pattern for fetching URL content","bodyPreview":"# Simple Fetch Skill\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this Skill to:\n- Learn the basic skill pattern\n- Fetch content from a URL\n- Use as a template for creating custom skills\n\nThis is a **demonstration skill** showing the minimal CLI-based pattern.\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nDemonstrates the core skill pattern:\n1. Accept CLI arguments (--url)\n2. Call an MCP tool (fetch__fetch)\n3. Return result\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen you need to fetch content from a URL, execute:\n\n```bash\ncd /home/khitomer/Projects","body":"# Simple Fetch Skill\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this Skill to:\n- Learn the basic skill pattern\n- Fetch content from a URL\n- Use as a template for creating custom skills\n\nThis is a **demonstration skill** showing the minimal CLI-based pattern.\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\nDemonstrates the core skill pattern:\n1. Accept CLI arguments (--url)\n2. Call an MCP tool (fetch__fetch)\n3. Return result\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen you need to fetch content from a URL, execute:\n\n```bash\ncd /home/khitomer/Projects/mcp-code-execution-enhanced\n\nuv run python -m runtime.harness scripts/simple_fetch.py \\\n    --url \"https://example.com\"\n```\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `--url`: The URL to fetch (required)\n\n### Example Usage\n\n```bash\n# Fetch a webpage\nuv run python -m runtime.harness scripts/simple_fetch.py \\\n    --url \"https://docs.example.com/api\"\n\n# Fetch documentation\nuv run python -m runtime.harness scripts/simple_fetch.py \\\n    --url \"https://github.com/owner/repo/README.md\"\n```\n\n## Expected Output\n\nThe skill returns the fetched content and prints:\n- Success message with byte count\n- Or error message if fetch fails\n\n## MCP Servers Required\n\nConfigure a fetch-capable MCP server in `mcp_config.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"fetch\": {\n      \"type\": \"stdio\",\n      \"command\": \"uvx\",\n      \"args\": [\"mcp-server-fetch\"]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Technical Notes\n\n- **Pattern**: CLI args → MCP call → Result\n- **Token cost**: ~110 tokens (discover + read + execute)\n- **Time**: <10 seconds\n- **Immutable**: Parameters via CLI, no file editing needed\n\nThis skill demonstrates the foundation for creating more complex MCP workflows.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:38:21.020Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for CLI-based Agents requiring efficient content fetching from URLs, optimized for framework-agnostic execution with a focus on Claude Code compatibility.","zh":"适合需要从 URL 高效获取内容的基于 CLI 的代理，优化了框架无关的执行，重点关注 Claude Code 兼容性。","ja":"CLIベースのエージェントがURLからコンテンツを効率的に取得する必要がある場合に最適で、フレームワーク非依存の実行に最適化されており、Claude Codeの互換性に重点を置いています。","ko":"CLI 기반 에이전트가 URL에서 콘텐츠를 효율적으로 가져오는 데 필요한 경우에 적합하며, 프레임워크와 무관한 실행에 최적화되어 있으며 Claude Code 호환성에 중점을 두고 있습니다.","es":"Ideal for CLI-based Agents requiring efficient content fetching from URLs, optimized for framework-agnostic execution with a focus on Claude Code compatibility.","fr":"Ideal for CLI-based Agents requiring efficient content fetching from URLs, optimized for framework-agnostic execution with a focus on Claude Code compatibility.","de":"Ideal for CLI-based Agents requiring efficient content fetching from URLs, optimized for framework-agnostic execution with a focus on Claude Code compatibility.","pt":"Ideal para agentes baseados em CLI que requerem obtenção eficiente de conteúdo a partir de URLs, otimizados para execução independente de estrutura com foco na compatibilidade com Claude Code.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов на основе CLI, требующих эффективного извлечения контента из URL-адресов, оптимизирован для независимой от фреймворка работы с фокусом на совместимости с Claude Code.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة سطر الأوامر الذي يتطلب استرجاع محتوى فعال من عنوان URL، محسّن لتنفيذ غير معتمد على الإطار مع التركيز على توافق Claude Code."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch content from URLs using the MCP tool fetch__fetch, with a significant 99.6% token reduction, while supporting multi-transport and sandboxing protocols.","zh":"赋予代理使用MCP工具fetch__fetch从URL获取内容的能力，令牌减少了99.6%，同时支持多种传输和沙盒协议。","ja":"エージェントがMCPツールのfetch__fetchを使用してURLからコンテンツを取得する能力を提供し、トークンを99.6%削減しながら、さまざまなトランスポートとサンドボックスプロトコルをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 MCP 도구의 fetch__fetch를 사용하여 URL에서 콘텐츠를 가져올 수 있는 능력을 제공하며, 토큰을 99.6% 감소시키고 여러 가지 전송 및 샌드박스 프로토콜을 지원합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to fetch content from URLs using the MCP tool fetch__fetch, with a significant 99.6% token reduction, while supporting multi-transport and sandboxing protocols.","fr":"Empowers agents to fetch content from URLs using the MCP tool fetch__fetch, with a significant 99.6% token reduction, while supporting multi-transport and sandboxing protocols.","de":"Empowers agents to fetch content from URLs using the MCP tool fetch__fetch, with a significant 99.6% token reduction, while supporting multi-transport and sandboxing protocols.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a buscar conteúdo a partir de URLs usando a ferramenta MCP fetch__fetch, com uma redução significativa de 99,6% de tokens, ao mesmo tempo em que suporta protocolos de transporte múltiplo e arejamento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать контент из URL-адресов с помощью инструмента MCP fetch__fetch, с существенным сокращением на 99,6% токенов, при этом поддерживая много-транспортные и песочное протоколы.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استرجاع المحتوى من عناوين URL باستخدام أداة MCP fetch__fetch، مع تخفيض كبير بنسبة 99.6٪ من الرموز، مع دعم بروتوكولات النقل المتعددة وبروتوكولات الحماية."},"useCases":{"en":["Fetching content from public URLs for data analysis","Creating custom skills based on the simple-fetch template","Utilizing the skill''s sandboxing feature for secure content retrieval"],"zh":["从公共URL获取内容以进行数据分析","基于简单获取模板创建自定义技能","利用技能的沙盒功能安全地获取内容"],"ja":["データ分析のために公開URLからコンテンツを取得する","シンプルな取得テンプレートに基づいてカスタムスキルを作成する","スキルのサンドボックス機能を使用してコンテンツを安全に取得する"],"ko":["데이터 분석을 위해 공개 URL에서 콘텐츠를 가져오는 것","단순한 가져오기 템플릿을 기반으로 사용자 지정 스킬을 만드는 것","스킬의 샌드박스 기능을 사용하여 콘텐츠를 안전하게 가져오는 것"],"es":["Fetching content from public URLs for data analysis","Creating custom skills based on the simple-fetch template","Utilizing the skill''s sandboxing feature for secure content retrieval"],"fr":["Fetching content from public URLs for data analysis","Creating custom skills based on the simple-fetch template","Utilizing the skill''s sandboxing feature for secure content retrieval"],"de":["Fetching content from public URLs for data analysis","Creating custom skills based on the simple-fetch template","Utilizing the skill''s sandboxing feature for secure content retrieval"],"pt":["Buscar conteúdo a partir de URLs públicas para análise de dados","Criar habilidades personalizadas com base no modelo simple-fetch","Utilizar o recurso de arejamento da habilidade para recuperação segura de conteúdo"],"ru":["Извлечение контента из публичных URL-адресов для анализа данных","Создание пользовательских навыков на основе шаблона simple-fetch","Использование функции песочницы навыка для безопасного извлечения контента"],"ar":["استرجاع المحتوى من عناوين URL العامة لتحليل البيانات","إنشاء مهارات مخصصة باستخدام قالب simple-fetch","استخدام ميزة الحماية للمهارة لاسترجاع المحتوى بشكل آمن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires MCP tool compatibility","Optimized for Claude Code, may require adjustments for other frameworks"],"zh":["需要MCP工具兼容性","针对Claude Code进行优化，可能需要为其他框架进行调整"],"ja":["MCPツールの互換性が必要","Claude Codeに最適化されており、他のフレームワークでは調整が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["MCP 도구 호환성이 필요함","Claude Code에 최적화되어 있으므로 다른 프레임워크에서는 조정이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requires MCP tool compatibility","Optimized for Claude Code, may require adjustments for other frameworks"],"fr":["Requires MCP tool compatibility","Optimized for Claude Code, may require adjustments for other frameworks"],"de":["Requires MCP tool compatibility","Optimized for Claude Code, may require adjustments for other frameworks"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com a ferramenta MCP","Otimizado para Claude Code, pode requerer ajustes para outros frameworks"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с инструментом MCP","Оптимизирован для Claude Code, может потребовать корректировок для других фреймворков"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقاً مع أداة MCP","محسّن لتوافق Claude Code، قد يتطلب تعديلات لالإطارات الأخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
