산 엔진에서 사용하는 유형화된 모드 객체로 변환하고 템플릿 기반의 패턴 매칭을 지원합니다","es":"El analizador de mod convierte cadenas de mod raw en objetos Mod tipados para el motor de cálculo utilizando un sistema basado en plantillas","fr":"L''analyseur de mod convertit les chaînes de mod brutes en objets Mod typés pour le moteur de calcul en utilisant un système basé sur des modèles","de":"Der Mod-Parser wandelt rohe Mod-Zeichenfolgen in typisierte Mod-Objekte für den Berechnungsmotor mithilfe eines templatebasierten Systems um","pt":"O analisador de mod converte strings de mod brutos em objetos Mod tipados usados pelo mecanismo de cálculo","ru":"Парсер модов преобразует сырые строки модов в типизированные объекты Mod, используемые калькуляционным движком","ar":"محلل mods يحول السلاسل mods الخام إلى كائنات mod من نوع معين تستخدمها محرك الحساب","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持模板基于的模式匹配","将原始模数字符串转换为类型化的Mod对象","用于计算引擎","扩展现有的模数类型以处理新的变体","添加新的模数类型到引擎","提高代码的可读性和可维护性"],"ja":["テンプレートベースのパターンマッチングをサポート","生のモッド文字列を型付きModオブジェクトに変換","計算エンジン用","既存のモッドタイプを新しいバリアントを処理するために拡張","新しいモッドタイプをエンジンに追加","コードの可読性とメンテナンス性を向上"],"ko":["템플릿 기반의 패턴 매칭을 지원","원시 모드 문자열을 유형화된 모드 객체로 변환","계산 엔진용","기존의 모드 유형을 새로운 변형을 처리하기 위해 확장","新的 모드 유형을 엔진에 추가","코드의 가독성과 유지보수성을 향상"],"es":["Conversión de cadenas de mod raw en objetos Mod tipados","Sistema basado en plantillas para la coincidencia de patrones","Soporte para la adición de nuevos patrones de cadenas de mod","Extensión de los tipos de mod existentes para manejar nuevas variantes","Adición de nuevos tipos de mod al motor de cálculo"],"fr":["Conversion de chaînes de mod brutes en objets Mod typés","Système basé sur des modèles pour la correspondance de motifs","Prise en charge de l''ajout de nouveaux modèles de chaînes de mod","Extension des types de mod existants pour gérer de nouvelles variantes","Ajout de nouveaux types de mod au moteur de calcul"],"de":["Umwandlung von rohen Mod-Zeichenfolgen in typisierte Mod-Objekte","Templatebasiertes System für die Musterabgleich","Unterstützung für die Hinzufügung neuer Mod-Zeichenfolgenmuster","Erweiterung der vorhandenen Mod-Typen zur Verarbeitung neuer Varianten","Hinzufügen neuer Mod-Typen zum Berechnungsmotor"],"pt":["Suporte a novos padrões de strings de mod","Extensão de tipos de mod existentes","Adição de novos tipos de mod ao mecanismo de cálculo","Sistema baseado em modelos para correspondência de padrões","Definições de tipo de mod em src/tli/mod.ts"],"ru":["Поддержка новых шаблонов строк модов","Расширение существующих типов модов","Добавление новых типов модов в калькуляционный движок","Система, основанная на шаблонах, для сопоставления с образцом","Определения типа модов в src/tli/mod.ts"],"ar":["دعم لانماط جديدة من سلسلة mods","توسيع أنواع mods الحالية","إضافة أنواع mods جديدة إلى محرك الحساب","نظام يستند إلى القوالب لمطابقة النماط","تعريفات نوع mods في src/tli/mod.ts"]},"keywords":{"zh":["模数解析器","模板基于的模式匹配","类型化的Mod对象","计算引擎","模数字符串","代码可读性","代码维护性","模数类型","模数变体"],"ja":["モッドパーサー","テンプレートベースのパターンマッチング","型付きModオブジェクト","計算エンジン","モッド文字列","コードの可読性","コードのメンテナンス性","モッドタイプ","モッドバリアント"],"ko":["모드 파서","템플릿 기반의 패턴 매칭","유형화된 모드 객체","계산 엔진","모드 문자열","코드의 가독성","코드의 유지보수성","모드 유형","모드 변형"],"es":["analizador de mod","mod parser","cadenas de mod raw","objetos Mod tipados","motor de cálculo","patrones de mod","tipos de mod"],"fr":["analyseur de mod","mod parser","chaînes de mod brutes","objets Mod typés","moteur de calcul","modèles de mod","types de mod"],"de":["Mod-Parser","rohe Mod-Zeichenfolgen","typisierte Mod-Objekte","Berechnungsmotor","Mod-Muster","Mod-Typen","Templatebasiertes System"],"pt":["analisador de mod","adicionar suporte a novos padrões","extender tipos de mod","mecanismo de cálculo","sistema baseado em modelos","definições de tipo de mod"],"ru":["парсер модов","добавить поддержку новых шаблонов","расширить существующие типы модов","калькуляционный движок","система, основанная на шаблонах","определения типа модов"],"ar":["محلل mods","إضافة دعم لانماط جديدة","توسيع أنواع mods الحالية","محرك الحساب","نظام يستند إلى القوالب","تعريفات نوع mods"]}},"owner":"aclinia","repo":"torchlight-of-building","repoPath":"aclinia/torchlight-of-building","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"adding-mod-parsers","description":"Use when adding new mod parsers to convert game mod strings to typed Mod objects - guides the template-based parsing pattern (project)","bodyPreview":"# Adding Mod Parsers\n\n## Overview\n\nThe mod parser converts raw mod strings (e.g., `\"+10% all stats\"`) into typed `Mod` objects used by the calculation engine. It uses a **template-based** system for pattern matching.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Adding support for new mod string patterns\n- Extending existing mod types to handle new variants\n- Adding new mod types to the engine\n\n## Project File Locations\n\n| Purpose | File Path |\n|---------|-----------|\n| Mod type definitions | `src/tli/mod.ts` |\n| Parser t","body":"# Adding Mod Parsers\n\n## Overview\n\nThe mod parser converts raw mod strings (e.g., `\"+10% all stats\"`) into typed `Mod` objects used by the calculation engine. It uses a **template-based** system for pattern matching.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Adding support for new mod string patterns\n- Extending existing mod types to handle new variants\n- Adding new mod types to the engine\n\n## Project File Locations\n\n| Purpose | File Path |\n|---------|-----------|\n| Mod type definitions | `src/tli/mod.ts` |\n| Parser templates | `src/tli/mod-parser/templates.ts` |\n| Enum registrations | `src/tli/mod-parser/enums.ts` |\n| Calculation handlers | `src/tli/calcs/offense.ts` |\n| Tests | `src/tli/mod-parser.test.ts` |\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n\n### 1. Check if Mod Type Exists\n\nLook in `src/tli/mod.ts` under `ModDefinitions`. If the mod type doesn''t exist, add it:\n\n```typescript\ninterface ModDefinitions {\n  // ... existing types ...\n  NewModType: { value: number; someField: string };\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Add Template in `templates.ts`\n\nTemplates use a DSL for pattern matching. **Do not add comments to templates.ts** - the template string itself is self-documenting.\n\n```typescript\nt(\"{value:dec%} all stats\").output((c) => ({\n  type: \"StatPct\",\n  value: c.value,\n  statModType: \"all\",\n})),\nt(\"{value:dec%} {statModType:StatWord}\")\n  .enum(\"StatWord\", StatWordMapping)\n  .output((c) => ({ type: \"StatPct\", value: c.value, statModType: c.statModType })),\nt(\"{value:dec%} [additional] [{modType:DmgModType}] damage\").output((c) => ({\n  type: \"DmgPct\",\n  value: c.value,\n  dmgModType: c.modType ?? \"global\",\n  addn: c.additional !== undefined,\n})),\nt(\"{value:dec%} attack and cast speed\").outputMany([\n  spec((c) => ({ type: \"AspdPct\", value: c.value, addn: false })),\n  spec((c) => ({ type: \"CspdPct\", value: c.value, addn: false })),\n]),\n```\n\n**Template capture types:**\n\n| Type | Matches | Example Input → Output |\n|------|---------|------------------------|\n| `{name:int}` | Unsigned integer | `\"5\"` → `5` |\n| `{name:dec}` | Unsigned decimal | `\"21.5\"` → `21.5` |\n| `{name:int%}` | Unsigned integer percent | `\"30%\"` → `30` |\n| `{name:dec%}` | Unsigned decimal percent | `\"96%\"` → `96` |\n| `{name:+int}` | **Signed** integer (requires `+` or `-`) | `\"+5\"` → `5`, `\"-3\"` → `-3` |\n| `{name:+dec}` | **Signed** decimal (requires `+` or `-`) | `\"+21.5\"` → `21.5` |\n| `{name:+int%}` | **Signed** integer percent | `\"+30%\"` → `30`, `\"-15%\"` → `-15` |\n| `{name:+dec%}` | **Signed** decimal percent | `\"+96%\"` → `96` |\n| `{name:?int}` | **Optional-sign** integer (matches with or without `+`/`-`) | `\"5\"` → `5`, `\"+5\"` → `5`, `\"-3\"` → `-3` |\n| `{name:?dec}` | **Optional-sign** decimal | `\"21.5\"` → `21.5`, `\"+21.5\"` → `21.5` |\n| `{name:?int%}` | **Optional-sign** integer percent | `\"30%\"` → `30`, `\"+30%\"` → `30` |\n| `{name:?dec%}` | **Optional-sign** decimal percent | `\"96%\"` → `96`, `\"+96%\"` → `96` |\n| `{name:EnumType}` | Enum lookup | `{dmgType:DmgChunkType}` |\n\n**Signed vs Unsigned vs Optional-sign Types:**\n- Use **unsigned** (`dec%`, `int`) when input NEVER has `+` or `-` (e.g., `\"8% additional damage applied to Life\"`)\n- Use **signed** (`+dec%`, `+int`) when input ALWAYS has `+` or `-` (e.g., `\"+25% additional damage\"`)\n- Use **optional-sign** (`?dec%`, `?int`) when input MAY OR MAY NOT have a sign — this avoids needing two separate templates for signed/unsigned variants\n- Signed types will NOT match unsigned inputs, and unsigned will NOT match signed inputs\n- Prefer `?dec%` over two separate `dec%`/`+dec%` templates when the same mod can appear with or without a sign\n\n**Optional syntax:**\n- `[additional]` - Optional literal, sets `c.additional?: true`\n- `[{modType:DmgModType}]` - Optional capture, sets `c.modType?: DmgModType`\n- `{(effect|damage)}` - Alternation (regex-style)\n\n### 3. Add Enum Mapping (if needed)\n\nIf you need custom word → value mapping, add to `enums.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nexport const StatWordMapping: Record<string, string> = {\n  strength: \"str\",\n  dexterity: \"dex\",\n  intelligence: \"int\",\n};\n\nregisterEnum(\"StatWord\", [\"strength\", \"dexterity\", \"intelligence\"]);\n```\n\n### 4. Add Handler in `offense.ts` (if new mod type)\n\nIf you added a new mod type, add handling in `calculateOffense()` or relevant helper:\n\n```typescript\ncase \"NewModType\": {\n  break;\n}\n```\n\nFor existing mod types with new variants (like adding `statModType: \"all\"`), update existing handlers to also filter for the new variant:\n\n```typescript\nconst flat = sumByValue(\n  statMods.filter((m) => m.statModType === statType || m.statModType === \"all\"),\n);\n```\n\n### 5. Add Tests\n\nAdd test cases in `src/tli/mod_parser.test.ts`:\n\n```typescript\ntest(\"parse percentage all stats\", () => {\n  const result = parseMod(\"+10% all stats\");\n  expect(result).toEqual([\n    {\n      type: \"StatPct\",\n      statModType: \"all\",\n      value: 10,\n    },\n  ]);\n});\n```\n\n### 6. Verify\n\n```bash\npnpm test src/tli/mod_parser.test.ts\npnpm typecheck\npnpm check\n```\n\n## Template Ordering\n\n**IMPORTANT:** More specific patterns must come before generic ones in `allParsers` array.\n\n```typescript\n// Good: specific before generic\nt(\"{value:dec%} all stats\").output(...),           // Specific\nt(\"{value:dec%} {statModType:StatWord}\").output(...), // Generic\n\n// Bad: generic would match first and fail on \"all stats\"\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Simple Value Parser (Signed)\n\n**Input:** `\"+10% all stats\"` (starts with `+`)\n\n```typescript\nt(\"{value:+dec%} all stats\").output((c) => ({\n  type: \"StatPct\",\n  value: c.value,\n  statModType: \"all\",\n})),\n```\n\n### Simple Value Parser (Unsigned)\n\n**Input:** `\"8% additional damage applied to Life\"` (no sign)\n\n```typescript\nt(\"{value:dec%} additional damage applied to life\").output((c) => ({\n  type: \"DmgPct\",\n  value: c.value,\n  dmgModType: \"global\",\n  addn: true,\n})),\n```\n\n### Parser with Condition (Signed)\n\n**Input:** `\"+40% damage if you have Blocked recently\"`\n\n```typescript\nt(\"{value:+dec%} damage if you have blocked recently\").output((c) => ({\n  type: \"DmgPct\",\n  value: c.value,\n  dmgModType: \"global\",\n  addn: false,\n  cond: \"has_blocked_recently\",\n})),\n```\n\n### Parser with Per-Stackable (Signed in \"deals\" position)\n\n**Input:** `\"Deals +1% additional damage to an enemy for every 2 points of Frostbite Rating the enemy has\"`\n\nNote: The `+` appears AFTER \"deals\", so use `{value:+dec%}`:\n\n```typescript\nt(\"deals {value:+dec%} additional damage to an enemy for every {amt:int} points of frostbite rating the enemy has\")\n  .output((c) => ({\n    type: \"DmgPct\",\n    value: c.value,\n    dmgModType: \"global\",\n    addn: true,\n    per: { stackable: \"frostbite_rating\", amt: c.amt },\n  })),\n```\n\n### Multi-Output Parser (Signed)\n\n**Input:** `\"+6% attack and cast speed\"`\n\n```typescript\nt(\"{value:+dec%} [additional] attack and cast speed\").outputMany([\n  spec((c) => ({ type: \"AspdPct\", value: c.value, addn: c.additional !== undefined })),\n  spec((c) => ({ type: \"CspdPct\", value: c.value, addn: c.additional !== undefined })),\n]),\n```\n\n### Flat Stat Parser (Signed)\n\n**Input:** `\"+166 Max Mana\"`\n\n```typescript\nt(\"{value:+dec} max mana\").output((c) => ({ type: \"MaxMana\", value: c.value })),\n```\n\n### Optional-Sign Parser\n\n**Input:** `\"12.5% Sealed Mana Compensation for Spirit Magus Skills\"` OR `\"+12.5% Sealed Mana Compensation for Spirit Magus Skills\"`\n\nUse `?dec%` when the same mod string can appear with or without a `+`/`-` sign, avoiding the need for two separate templates:\n\n```typescript\nt(\"{value:?dec%} sealed mana compensation for spirit magus skills\").output(\n  (c) => ({ type: \"SealedManaCompPct\", value: c.value, addn: false, skillType: \"spirit_magus\" }),\n),\n```\n\n### No-Op Parser (Recognized but produces no mods)\n\n**Input:** `\"Energy Shield starts to Charge when Blocking\"`\n\nUse `outputNone()` when a mod string should be recognized (not flagged as unparsed) but has no effect on calculations:\n\n```typescript\nt(\"energy shield starts to charge when blocking\").outputNone(),\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Fix |\n|---------|-----|\n| Using `dec%` for input with `+` prefix | Use `+dec%` for inputs like `\"+25% damage\"`, or `?dec%` if sign is optional |\n| Using `+dec%` for input without sign | Use `dec%` for inputs like `\"8% damage applied to life\"`, or `?dec%` if sign is optional |\n| Two templates for signed/unsigned variants of the same mod | Use `?dec%` to match both in a single template |\n| Template doesn''t match input case | Templates are matched case-insensitively; input is normalized to lowercase |\n| Missing `type` field in output mapper | Include `type: \"ModType\"` in the returned object — contextual typing from the `Mod` discriminated union handles narrowing |\n| Handler doesn''t account for new variant | Update `offense.ts` to handle new values (e.g., `statModType === \"all\"`) |\n| Generic template before specific | Move specific templates earlier in `allParsers` array |\n\n## Data Flow\n\n```\nRaw string: \"+10% all stats\"\n    ↓ normalize (lowercase, trim)\n\"10% all stats\"\n    ↓ template matching (allParsers)\n{ type: \"StatPct\", value: 10, statModType: \"all\" }\n    ↓ calculateStats() in offense.ts\nApplied to str, dex, int calculations\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:39:11.708Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Calculation Engine Agents needing to parse and interpret complex game mod strings into structured data.","zh":"适合于需要解析和解释复杂游戏模组字符串以获取结构化数据的计算引擎代理。","ja":"計算エンジンエージェントが複雑なゲームモッド文字列を構造化データに解析および解釈する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"복잡한 게임 모드 문자열을 구조화된 데이터로 파싱하고 해석해야 하는 계산 엔진 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Motor de Cálculo que necesitan analizar e interpretar cadenas de modificación de juego complejas en datos estructurados.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Moteur de Calcul qui ont besoin d''analyser et d''interpréter des chaînes de modification de jeu complexes en données structurées.","de":"Ideal für Berechnungs-Engine-Agents, die komplexe Spiel-Mod-Strings in strukturierte Daten parsen und interpretieren müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Motor de Cálculo que precisam analisar e interpretar cadeias de caracteres de modificações de jogo complexas em dados estruturados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов двигателя расчета, которым необходимо парсить и интерпретировать сложные игровые модные строки в структурированные данные.","ar":"مثالي لعميل محرك الحساب الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل وتفسير سلاسل تعديل اللعبة المعقدة إلى بيانات منسقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to convert raw mod strings like ''+10% all stats'' into typed Mod objects using a template-based pattern matching system. This provides the foundational parsing capability required for stat calculation engines to process complex game modifications.","zh":"使代理能够使用基于模板的模式匹配系统将原始模组字符串（如''+10% 所有属性''）转换为类型化的Mod对象。这为状态计算引擎提供了处理复杂游戏修改所需的基础解析功能。","ja":"エージェントが生のモッド文字列（たとえば''+10% 全てのステータス''）を、テンプレートベースのパターンマッチングシステムを使用して型付けされたModオブジェクトに変換できるようにします。これは、ステータス計算エンジンが複雑なゲーム修正を処理するために必要な基本的な解析機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 원시 모드 문자열(''+10% 모든 속성''과 같은)을 템플릿 기반 패턴 매칭 시스템을 사용하여 유형이 지정된 모드 개체로 변환할 수 있도록 합니다. 이는 상태 계산 엔진이 복잡한 게임 수정을 처리하는 데 필요한 기본 파싱 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes convertir cadenas de modificación crudas como ''+10% todos los estadísticos'' en objetos Mod tipados utilizando un sistema de coincidencia de patrones basado en plantillas. Esto proporciona la capacidad de análisis fundamental requerida para que los motores de cálculo de estadísticas procesen modificaciones de juego complejas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des chaînes de modification brutes comme ''+10% toutes les statistiques'' en objets Mod typés en utilisant un système de correspondance de modèles basé sur des modèles. Cela fournit la capacité d''analyse fondamentale requise pour que les moteurs de calcul de statistiques traitent des modifications de jeu complexes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, rohe Mod-Strings wie ''+10% alle Statistiken'' in typisierte Mod-Objekte mithilfe eines templatebasierten Mustersystems umzuwandeln. Dies bietet die grundlegende Analysefähigkeit, die für die Verarbeitung komplexer Spielmodifikationen durch Statistikberechnungsmotoren erforderlich ist.","pt":"Permite que os agentes convertam cadeias de caracteres de modificações brutas como ''+10% todas as estatísticas'' em objetos Mod tipados usando um sistema de correspondência de padrões baseado em modelo. Isso fornece a capacidade de análise fundamental necessária para que os motores de cálculo de estatísticas processem modificações de jogo complexas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам преобразовывать сырые модные строки, такие как ''+10% все статы'', в типизированные объекты Mod, используя систему сопоставления шаблонов на основе шаблона. Это обеспечивает базовую функциональность парсинга, необходимую для того, чтобы двигатели расчета статистики обрабатывали сложные игровые модификации.","ar":"يسمح للعملاء بتحويل سلاسل تعديل اللعبة الخام مثل ''+10% جميع الإحصائيات'' إلى كائنات Mod من نوع معين باستخدام نظام مطابقة الأنماط القائم على القالب. يوفر ذلك القدرة الأساسية على التحليل المطلوبة لمحركات حساب الإحصائيات لمعالجة تعديلات اللعبة المعقدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Extending parser support for new mod string patterns","Adding new mod types to calculation engines","Handling variant parsing for existing mod types"],"zh":["扩展解析器以支持新的模组字符串模式","向计算引擎添加新的模组类型","处理现有模组类型的变体解析"],"ja":["新しいモッド文字列パターンの解析サポートを拡張する","計算エンジンに新しいモッドタイプを追加する","既存のモッドタイプの変体解析を処理する"],"ko":["새로운 모드 문자열 패턴에 대한 파서 지원 확장","계산 엔진에 새로운 모드 유형 추가","기존 모드 유형에 대한 변형 파싱 처리"],"es":["Ampliar el soporte del analizador para nuevos patrones de cadenas de modificación","Agregar nuevos tipos de modificación a los motores de cálculo","Controlar el análisis de variantes para los tipos de modificación existentes"],"fr":["Étendre la prise en charge de l''analyseur pour de nouveaux modèles de chaînes de modification","Ajouter de nouveaux types de modification aux moteurs de calcul","Gérer l''analyse de variantes pour les types de modification existants"],"de":["Erweitern der Analyse-Unterstützung für neue Muster von Mod-Strings","Hinzufügen neuer Mod-Typen zu den Berechnungsmotoren","Handhabung der Varianten-Analyse für bestehende Mod-Typen"],"pt":["Ampliar o suporte do analisador para novos padrões de cadeias de caracteres de modificações","Adicionar novos tipos de modificações aos motores de cálculo","Lidar com a análise de variantes para tipos de modificações existentes"],"ru":["Расширить поддержку парсера для новых шаблонов модных строк","Добавить новые типы модификаций в расчетные двигатели","Обработка варианта парсинга для существующих типов модификаций"],"ar":["توسيع دعم المُحلل لنمط سلاسل تعديل اللعبة الجديدة","إضافة أنواع تعديل جديدة إلى محركات الحساب","التعامل مع تحليل المتغيرات لأنواع تعديل اللعبة الحالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript/JavaScript environment","Depends on existing Mod type definitions in src/tli/mod.ts","Template-based system may require pattern updates for complex formats"],"zh":["需要TypeScript/JavaScript环境","依赖于src/tli/mod.ts中现有的Mod类型定义","基于模板的系统可能需要对复杂格式进行模式更新"],"ja":["TypeScript/JavaScript環境が必要","src/tli/mod.tsにある既存のModタイプ定義に依存する","テンプレートベースのシステムでは、複雑なフォーマットの場合にパターン更新が必要になる可能性がある"],"ko":["TypeScript/JavaScript 환경이 필요합니다.","src/tli/mod.ts에 있는 기존 모드 유형 정의에 종속됩니다.","템플릿 기반 시스템은 복잡한 형식의 경우 패턴 업데이트가 필요할 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere un entorno TypeScript/JavaScript","Depende de las definiciones de tipo de modificación existentes en src/tli/mod.ts","El sistema basado en plantillas puede requerir actualizaciones de patrones para formatos complejos"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement TypeScript/JavaScript","Dépend des définitions de type de modification existantes dans src/tli/mod.ts","Le système basé sur des modèles peut nécessiter des mises à jour de modèles pour des formats complexes"],"de":["Erfordert eine TypeScript/JavaScript-Umgebung","Hängt von den bestehenden Mod-Typdefinitionen in src/tli/mod.ts ab","Das templatebasierte System kann möglicherweise Muster-Updates für komplexe Formate erfordern"],"pt":["Exige ambiente TypeScript/JavaScript","Depende de definições de tipo de modificação existentes em src/tli/mod.ts","Sistema baseado em modelo pode exigir atualizações de padrão para formatos complexos"],"ru":["Требует среды TypeScript/JavaScript","Зависит от существующих определений типа модификации в src/tli/mod.ts","Система на основе шаблона может потребовать обновления шаблонов для сложных форматов"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة TypeScript/JavaScript","يعتمد على تعريفات أنواع تعديل اللعبة الحالية في src/tli/mod.ts","نظام قائم على القالب قد يتطلب تحديثات نمطية لأنماط معقدة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('EvanBacon/apple-health/expo-modules', 'community', 'EvanBacon', 'apple-health', 'EvanBacon/apple-health', 'expo-modules', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z', '2026-02-18T03:39:22.441Z', NULL, '{"id":"EvanBacon/apple-health/expo-modules","name":"expo-modules","description":{"zh":"Expo 模块为 Apple HealthKit 提供了绑定，允许开发者在 Expo 应用中使用 HealthKit 功能。该模块遵循现代 Web 模块标准，提供了简单易用的 API","ja":"Expo モジュールは Apple HealthKit にバインディングを提供し、開発者が Expo アプリで HealthKit 機能を使用できるようにします。このモジュールは、モダンな Web モジュールの標準に従い、シンプルで使いやすい API を提供します","ko":"Expo 모듈은 Apple HealthKit에 바인딩을 제공하여 개발자가 Expo 애플리케이션에서 HealthKit 기능을 사용할 수 있도록 합니다. 이 모듈은 현대적인 웹 모듈 표준을 따르며, 단순하고 사용하기 쉬운 API를 제공합니다","es":"Expo-modules es un conjunto de bindings para Apple HealthKit que permiten a los desarrolladores crear aplicaciones móviles con funcionalidades de salud y bienestar","fr":"Expo-modules est un ensemble de liaisons pour Apple HealthKit qui permettent aux développeurs de créer des applications mobiles avec des fonctionnalités de santé et de bien-être","de":"Expo-Module ist ein Satz von Bindings für Apple HealthKit, der es Entwicklern ermöglicht, mobile Anwendungen mit Gesundheits- und Wohlfahrtsfunktionen zu erstellen","pt":"Os módulos Expo para Apple HealthKit permitem o acesso a recursos de saúde em aplicativos móveis. Siga as melhores práticas para um desenvolvimento eficaz.","ru":"Модули Expo для Apple HealthKit позволяют получить доступ к функциям здоровья в мобильных приложениях. Следуйте лучшим практикам для эффективной разработки.","ar":"مكونات إكسبو لتطبيقات Apple HealthKit تسمح بالوصول إلى ميزات الصحة في تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول. اتبع أفضل الممارسات من أجل التطوير الفعال.","en":"Apple HealthKit bindings for Expo"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Expo 模块：Apple HealthKit 绑定","ja":"Expo モジュール：Apple HealthKit バインディング","ko":"Expo 모듈: Apple HealthKit 바인딩","es":"Módulos Expo para Apple HealthKit","fr":"Modules Expo pour Apple HealthKit","de":"Expo-Module für Apple HealthKit","pt":"Módulos Expo: Integração com Apple HealthKit","ru":"Модули Expo: Связь с Apple HealthKit","ar":"مكونات إكسبو: دمج مع Apple HealthKit","en":"expo-modules"},"description":{"zh":"Expo 模块为 Apple HealthKit 提供了绑定，允许开发者在 Expo 应用中使用 HealthKit 功能。该模块遵循现代 Web 模块标准，提供了简单易用的 API","ja":"Expo モジュールは Apple HealthKit にバインディングを提供し、開発者が Expo アプリで HealthKit 機能を使用できるようにします。このモジュールは、モダンな Web モジュールの標準に従い、シンプルで使いやすい API を提供します","ko":"Expo 모듈은 Apple HealthKit에 바인딩을 제공하여 개발자가 Expo 애플리케이션에서 HealthKit 기능을 사용할 수 있도록 합니다. 이 모듈은 현대적인 웹 모듈 표준을 따르며, 단순하고 사용하기 쉬운 API를 제공합니다","es":"Expo-modules es un conjunto de bindings para Apple HealthKit que permiten a los desarrolladores crear aplicaciones móviles con funcionalidades de salud y bie...","fr":"Expo-modules est un ensemble de liaisons pour Apple HealthKit qui permettent aux développeurs de créer des applications mobiles avec des fonctionnalités de s...","de":"Expo-Module ist ein Satz von Bindings für Apple HealthKit, der es Entwicklern ermöglicht, mobile Anwendungen mit Gesundheits- und Wohlfahrtsfunktionen zu ers...","pt":"Os módulos Expo para Apple HealthKit permitem o acesso a recursos de saúde em aplicativos móveis. Siga as melhores práticas para um desenvolvimento eficaz.","ru":"Модули Expo для Apple HealthKit позволяют получить доступ к функциям здоровья в мобильных приложениях. Следуйте лучшим практикам для эффективной разработки.","ar":"مكونات إكسبو لتطبيقات Apple HealthKit تسمح بالوصول إلى ميزات الصحة في تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول. اتبع أفضل الممارسات من أجل التطوير الفعال.","en":"Apple HealthKit bindings for Expo"},"definition":{"en":"Apple HealthKit bindings for Expo"},"features":{"zh":["提供 Apple HealthKit 的绑定","遵循现代 Web 模块标准","简单易用的 API","100% 向后兼容","提供单平台功能的逃生舱","直接暴露原生功能"],"ja":["Apple HealthKit のバインディングを提供","モダンな Web モジュールの標準に従う","シンプルで使いやすい API","100% 後方互換","シングルプラットフォーム機能のためのエスケープハッチを提供","ネイティブ機能を直接公開"],"ko":["Apple HealthKit의 바인딩을 제공","현대적인 웹 모듈 표준을 따름","단순하고 사용하기 쉬운 API","100% 후방 호환","단일 플랫폼 기능을 위한 탈출구를 제공","원生 기능을 직접 노출"],"es":["Diseño de APIs nativas inspiradas en los estándares web","Compatibilidad hacia atrás del 100% como en la web","Escape hatches para funcionalidades de plataforma única","Exposición directa de funcionalidades nativas","Métodos síncronos cuando sea posible"],"fr":["Conception d''API natives inspirées des normes web","Compatibilité vers l''arrière de 100% comme sur le web","Échappatoires pour les fonctionnalités de plateforme unique","Exposition directe des fonctionnalités natives","Méthodes synchrones lorsque cela est possible"],"de":["Design von nativen APIs inspiriert von Web-Standards","100% rückwärts kompatibel wie im Web","Fluchtwege für ein-Plattform-Funktionen","Direkte Exposition von nativen Funktionen","Synchrone Methoden wenn möglich"],"pt":["Acesso a recursos de saúde do Apple HealthKit","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis com funcionalidades de saúde","Compatibilidade com a plataforma Expo","Melhores práticas para desenvolvimento eficaz","Acesso a funcionalidades nativas do dispositivo","Suporte a desenvolvedores para solução de problemas"],"ru":["Доступ к функциям здоровья Apple HealthKit","Разработка мобильных приложений с функциями здоровья","Совместимость с платформой Expo","Лучшие практики для эффективной разработки","Доступ к родным функциям устройства","Поддержка разработчиков для решения проблем"],"ar":["الوصول إلى ميزات الصحة لتطبيقات Apple HealthKit","بناء تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول مع ميزات الصحة","التوافق مع منصة إكسبو","أفضل الممارسات من أجل التطوير الفعال","الوصول إلى ميزات الأجهزة الأصلية","دعم المطورين لحل المشكلات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Expo 模块","Apple HealthKit","移动应用开发","原生功能","现代 Web 模块","后向兼容","单平台功能","逃生舱","直接暴露"],"ja":["Expo モジュール","Apple HealthKit","モバイル アプリ開発","ネイティブ機能","モダンな Web モジュール","後方互換","シングルプラットフォーム機能","エスケープハッチ","直接公開"],"ko":["Expo 모듈","Apple HealthKit","모바일 애플리케이션 개발","원生 기능","현대적인 웹 모듈","후방 호환","단일 플랫폼 기능","탈출구","직접 노출"],"es":["expo-modules","Apple HealthKit","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","funcionalidades de salud","estándares web","compatibilidad hacia atrás"],"fr":["modules Expo","Apple HealthKit","développement d''applications mobiles","fonctionnalités de santé","normes web","compatibilité vers l''arrière"],"de":["Expo-Module","Apple HealthKit","Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen","Gesundheitsfunktionen","Web-Standards","Rückwärtskompatibilität"],"pt":["expo-modules","Apple HealthKit","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","recursos de saúde","compatibilidade com Expo","melhores práticas de desenvolvimento","funcionalidades nativas do dispositivo","suporte a desenvolvedores"],"ru":["expo-modules","Apple HealthKit","разработка мобильных приложений","функции здоровья","совместимость с Expo","лучшие практики разработки","родные функции устройства","поддержка разработчиков"],"ar":["مكونات إكسبو","تطبيقات Apple HealthKit","بناء تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول","ميزات الصحة","التوافق مع إكسبو","أفضل الممارسات للتطوير","ميزات الأجهزة الأصلية","دعم المطورين"]}},"owner":"EvanBacon","repo":"apple-health","repoPath":"EvanBacon/apple-health","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"expo-modules","description":"Building great Expo native modules for iOS and Android. Views, APIs, Marshalling, Shared Objects, Expo Documentation, Verifying Expo modules.","bodyPreview":"## Great module standards\n\n- Design native APIs as if you contributing W3C specs for the browser, take inspiration from modern web modules. eg `std:kv-storage`, `clipboard`.\n- Aim for 100% backwards compatibility like the web.\n- Create escape hatches for single-platform functionality.\n- Avoid extraneous abstractions. Directly expose native functionality.\n- Avoid unnecessary async methods. Use sync methods when possible.\n- Prefer string union types for API options instead of boolean flags, enums,","body":"## Great module standards\n\n- Design native APIs as if you contributing W3C specs for the browser, take inspiration from modern web modules. eg `std:kv-storage`, `clipboard`.\n- Aim for 100% backwards compatibility like the web.\n- Create escape hatches for single-platform functionality.\n- Avoid extraneous abstractions. Directly expose native functionality.\n- Avoid unnecessary async methods. Use sync methods when possible.\n- Prefer string union types for API options instead of boolean flags, enums, or multiple parameters. eg instead of `capture(options: { isHighQuality: boolean })`, use `capture(options: { quality: ''high'' | ''medium'' | ''low'' })`.\n- Marshalling is awesome for platform-specific APIs.\n- New Architecture only. NEVER support legacy React Native architecture.\n- ALWAYS use only Expo modules API.\n- Prefer Swift and Kotlin.\n- Use optionality for availability checks as opposed to extraneous `isAvailable` functions or constants. eg `snapshot.capture?.()` instead of `snapshot.isAvailable && snapshot.capture()`.\n- ALWAYS support the latest and greatest API features.\n\nExample of a GREAT Expo module:\n\n```ts\nimport { NativeModule } from \"expo\";\n\ndeclare class AppClipModule extends NativeModule<{}> {\n  prompt(): void;\n  isAppClip?: boolean;\n}\n\n// This call loads the native module object from the JSI.\nconst AppClipNative =\n  typeof expo !== \"undefined\"\n    ? (expo.modules.AppClip as AppClipModule) ?? {}\n    : {};\n\nif (AppClipNative?.isAppClip) {\n  navigator.appClip = {\n    prompt: AppClipNative.prompt,\n  };\n}\n\n// Add types for the global `navigator.appClip` object.\ndeclare global {\n  interface Navigator {\n    /**\n     * Only available in an App Clip context.\n     * @expo\n     */\n    appClip?: {\n      /** Open the SKOverlay */\n      prompt: () => void;\n    };\n  }\n}\n\nexport {};\n```\n\n- Simple web-style interface.\n- Global type augmentation for easy access.\n- Docs in the type definitions.\n- Optional availability checks instead of extraneous `isAvailable` methods.\n\nExample of a POOR Expo module:\n\n```ts\nimport { NativeModulesProxy } from \"expo-modules-core\";\nconst { ExpoAppClip } = NativeModulesProxy;\nexport default {\n  promptAppClip() {\n    return ExpoAppClip.promptAppClip();\n  },\n  isAppClipAvailable() {\n    return ExpoAppClip.isAppClipAvailable();\n  },\n};\n```\n\n## Great documentation\n\n- If you have a function like `isAvailable()`, explain why it exists in the docs. Research cases where it may return false such as in a simulator or particular OS version.\n- Document OS version availability for functions and constants in the type definitions.\n\n## BAD module standards\n\n- APIs that are hard to import, e.g. `import * as MediaLibrary from ''expo-media-library'';` instead of `import { MediaLibrary } from ''expo/media'';`\n- Extraneous abstractions over native functionality. The native module is installing on the global, do not wrap it in another layer for no reason.\n- Extraneous async methods when sync methods are possible.\n- Boolean flags instead of string union types for options.\n- Supporting legacy React Native architecture.\n\n## Views\n\nTake API inspiration from great web component libraries like BaseUI and Radix.\n\n- https://base-ui.com/react/components/progress\n- https://www.radix-ui.com/primitives/docs/components/progress\n\nConsider if you''re building a control or a display component. Controls should have more interactive APIs, while display components should be more declarative.\n\nPrefer functions on views instead of `useImperativeHandle` + `findNodeHandle`.\n\n```swift\nAsyncFunction(\"capture\") { (view, options: Options) -> Ref in\n  return try capture(self.appContext, view)\n}\n```\n\nRemember to export views in the module:\n\n```swift\nimport ExpoModulesCore\n\npublic class ExpoWebViewModule: Module {\n  public func definition() -> ModuleDefinition {\n    Name(\"ExpoWebView\")\n\n    View(ExpoWebView.self) {}\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Marshalling-style API\n\nConsider this example https://github.com/EvanBacon/expo-shared-objects-haptics-example/blob/be90e92f8dba9b0807009502ab25c423c57e640d/modules/my-module/ios/MyModule.swift#L1C1-L178C2\n\nUsing `@retroactive Convertible` and `AnyArgument` to convert between Swift types and dictionaries enables passing complex data structures across the boundary without writing custom serialization code for each type.\n\n```swift\nextension CHHapticEventParameter: @retroactive Convertible, AnyArgument {\n    public static func convert(from value: Any?, appContext: AppContext) throws -> Self {\n        guard let dict = value as? [String: Any],\n              let parameterIDRaw = dict[\"parameterID\"] as? String,\n              let value = dict[\"value\"] as? Double else {\n            throw NotADictionaryException()\n        }\n        return Self(parameterID: CHHapticEvent.ParameterID(rawValue: parameterIDRaw), value: Float(value))\n    }\n}\n\nextension CHHapticEvent: @retroactive Convertible, AnyArgument {\n    public static func convert(from value: Any?, appContext: AppContext) throws -> Self {\n        guard let dict = value as? [String: Any],\n              let eventTypeRaw = dict[\"eventType\"] as? String,\n              let relativeTime = dict[\"relativeTime\"] as? Double else {\n            throw NotADictionaryException()\n        }\n        let eventType = CHHapticEvent.EventType(rawValue: eventTypeRaw)\n        let parameters = (dict[\"parameters\"] as? [[String: Any]])?.compactMap { paramDict -> CHHapticEventParameter? in\n            try? CHHapticEventParameter.convert(from: paramDict, appContext: appContext)\n        } ?? []\n        return Self(eventType: eventType, parameters: parameters, relativeTime: relativeTime)\n    }\n}\n\nextension CHHapticDynamicParameter: @retroactive Convertible, AnyArgument {\n    public static func convert(from value: Any?, appContext: AppContext) throws -> Self {\n        guard let dict = value as? [String: Any],\n              let parameterIDRaw = dict[\"parameterID\"] as? String,\n              let value = dict[\"value\"] as? Double,\n              let relativeTime = dict[\"relativeTime\"] as? Double else {\n            throw NotADictionaryException()\n        }\n\n        return Self(parameterID: CHHapticDynamicParameter.ID(rawValue: parameterIDRaw), value: Float(value), relativeTime: relativeTime)\n    }\n}\n\nextension CHHapticPattern: @retroactive Convertible, AnyArgument {\n    public static func convert(from value: Any?, appContext: AppContext) throws -> Self {\n        guard let dict = value as? [String: Any],\n              let eventsArray = dict[\"events\"] as? [[String: Any]] else {\n            throw NotADictionaryException()\n        }\n        let events = try eventsArray.map { eventDict -> CHHapticEvent in\n            try CHHapticEvent.convert(from: eventDict, appContext: appContext)\n        }\n        let parameters = (dict[\"parameters\"] as? [[String: Any]])?.compactMap { paramDict -> CHHapticDynamicParameter? in\n            return try? CHHapticDynamicParameter.convert(from: paramDict, appContext: appContext)\n        } ?? []\n        return try Self(events: events, parameters: parameters)\n    }\n}\n\ninternal final class NotAnArrayException: Exception {\n    override var reason: String {\n        \"Given value is not an array\"\n    }\n}\n\ninternal final class IncorrectArraySizeException: GenericException<(expected: Int, actual: Int)> {\n    override var reason: String {\n        \"Given array has unexpected number of elements: \\(param.actual), expected: \\(param.expected)\"\n    }\n}\n\ninternal final class NotADictionaryException: Exception {\n    override var reason: String {\n        \"Given value is not a dictionary\"\n    }\n}\n\n```\n\nLater this can be used to implement methods that accept complex data structures as arguments.\n\n```swift\nFunction(\"playPattern\") { (pattern: CHHapticPattern) in\n    let player = try hapticEngine.makePlayer(with: pattern)\n    try player.start(atTime: 0)\n}\n```\n\nUse shorthand where possible, especially when the JS value matches the Swift value:\n\n```swift\nProperty(\"__typename\") { $0.__typename }\n```\n\n## Shared objects\n\nShared objects are long-lived native instances that are shared to JS. They can be used to keep heavy state objects, such as a decoded bitmap, alive across React components, rather than spinning up a new native instance every time a component mounts.\n\n- https://docs.expo.dev/modules/shared-objects/\n- https://expo.dev/blog/the-real-world-impact-of-shared-objects\n\n## Interacting with AppDelegate\n\nTo interact with HealthKit, the module may need to respond to app lifecycle events. This can be done by implementing the `ExpoAppDelegateSubscriber` protocol.\n\n```swift\nimport ExpoModulesCore\n\npublic class ExpoHeadAppDelegateSubscriber: ExpoAppDelegateSubscriber {\n\n// Any AppDelegate methods you want to implement\n  public func application(\n    _ application: UIApplication,\n    continue userActivity: NSUserActivity,\n    restorationHandler: @escaping ([UIUserActivityRestoring]?) -> Void\n  ) -> Bool {\n    launchedActivity = userActivity\n\n   // ...\n\n    return false\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThen add the subscriber to the `expo-module.config.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"platforms\": [\"apple\", \"android\", \"web\"],\n  \"apple\": {\n    \"modules\": [\"ExpoHeadModule\", ...],\n    \"appDelegateSubscribers\": [\"ExpoHeadAppDelegateSubscriber\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Expo ecosystem integration\n\n- Create a Config Plugin for setting up all permissions and entitlements.\n- Permissions APIs should follow Expo''s permission model and implement hooks.\n  - Ref: https://github.com/expo/expo/blob/843d5e108ff70539ac353721d3a7765a5d08d502/packages/expo-media-library/src/MediaLibrary.ts#L502-L519\n- Document when things don''t work in Expo Go and link to dev client instructions.\n- Consider creating Expo devtools plugins for interacting with native APIs. Optimize for Claude Code usage, e.g. a Bun CLI before a UI.\n  - Ref: https://docs.expo.dev/debugging/devtools-plugins\n- If any feature launches the app or could benefit from deep linking, add an Expo Router integration. A good example is `expo-quick-actions` which has a `expo-quick-actions/router` import for automatic deep linking. Other good examples are Expo notifications (open settings, redirect notifications), widgets, siri shortcuts.\n  - Ref: https://github.com/EvanBacon/expo-quick-actions\n\n## Verification\n\n- Run `yarn expo run:ios --no-bundler` in an Expo app to headlessly compile the module and verify there are no compilation errors.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:39:22.441Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Mobile Agents integrating Apple HealthKit functionality into Expo applications","zh":"适合于将 Apple HealthKit 功能集成到 Expo 应用程序中的移动代理","ja":"Expo アプリケーションに Apple HealthKit 機能を統合するモバイル エージェントに適している","ko":"Expo 애플리케이션에 Apple HealthKit 기능을 통합하는 모바일 에이전트에 적합함","es":"Ideal para agentes móviles que integran la funcionalidad de Apple HealthKit en aplicaciones Expo","fr":"Idéal pour les agents mobiles intégrant la fonctionnalité Apple HealthKit dans les applications Expo","de":"Ideal für Mobile Agents, die die Apple HealthKit-Funktionalität in Expo-Anwendungen integrieren","pt":"Ideial para Agentes Móveis que integram a funcionalidade do Apple HealthKit em aplicativos Expo","ru":"Идеально для мобильных агентов, интегрирующих функциональность Apple HealthKit в приложения Expo","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المحمولين الذين يدمجون وظيفة Apple HealthKit في تطبيقات Expo"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage native Apple HealthKit APIs, utilizing standards like W3C specs and modern web modules such as `std:kv-storage` and `clipboard`, to create seamless health and fitness experiences with direct exposure to native functionality and 100% backwards compatibility","zh":"赋予代理者利用原生 Apple HealthKit API 的能力，使用 W3C 规范和现代 Web 模块（如 `std:kv-storage` 和 `clipboard`），以创建无缝的健康和健身体验，并直接暴露原生功能，具有 100% 的向后兼容性","ja":"エージェントがネイティブの Apple HealthKit API を利用できるようにし、W3C 規格や `std:kv-storage`、`clipboard` などの最新の Web モジュールを使用して、シームレスなヘルスケアおよびフィットネス体験を作成し、ネイティブ機能に直接アクセスできるようにし、100% の下位互換性を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 네이티브 Apple HealthKit API를 활용할 수 있도록 하여, W3C 규격 및 `std:kv-storage` 및 `clipboard`와 같은 최신 웹 모듈을 사용하여無견한 건강 및 피트니스 경험을 만들고, 네이티브 기능에 직접 노출되며, 100%의 하위 호환성을 제공함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar las API nativas de Apple HealthKit, utilizando estándares como las especificaciones W3C y módulos web modernos como `std:kv-storage` y `clipboard`, para crear experiencias de salud y fitness sin problemas con exposición directa a la funcionalidad nativa y compatibilidad hacia atrás del 100%","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter les API natives Apple HealthKit, en utilisant des normes comme les spécifications W3C et des modules web modernes tels que `std:kv-storage` et `clipboard`, pour créer des expériences de santé et de fitness sans accroc avec une exposition directe à la fonctionnalité native et une compatibilité descendante de 100 %","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, native Apple HealthKit-APIs zu nutzen, indem sie Standards wie W3C-Spezifikationen und moderne Webmodule wie `std:kv-storage` und `clipboard` verwenden, um nahtlose Gesundheits- und Fitnesserlebnisse mit direktem Zugriff auf native Funktionalität und 100%ige Abwärtskompatibilität zu erstellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar as APIs nativas do Apple HealthKit, utilizando padrões como especificações da W3C e módulos da web modernos, como `std:kv-storage` e `clipboard`, para criar experiências de saúde e condicionamento físico sem interrupções com exposição direta à funcionalidade nativa e compatibilidade para trás de 100%","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать родные API Apple HealthKit, используя стандарты, такие как спецификации W3C и современные веб-модули, такие как `std:kv-storage` и `clipboard`, для создания бесперебойных опытов здоровья и фитнеса с прямым доступом к родной функциональности и 100% обратной совместимостью","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الأصلية لشركة Apple HealthKit، باستخدام معايير مثل مواصفات W3C ووحدات الويب الحديثة مثل `std:kv-storage` و `clipboard`، لإنشاء تجارب صحية ولياقة بدنية دون انقطاع مع التعرض المباشر للوظيفة الأصلية ومتوافقية خلفية بنسبة 100%"},"useCases":{"en":["Integrating health and fitness data into Expo apps","Utilizing native APIs for seamless user experiences","Creating escape hatches for single-platform functionality"],"zh":["将健康和健身数据集成到 Expo 应用程序中","利用原生 API 创建无缝的用户体验","为单平台功能创建逃生口"],"ja":["Expo アプリケーションにヘルスケアおよびフィットネス データを統合する","ネイティブ API を利用してシームレスなユーザー体験を作成する","シングルプラットフォーム機能用のエスケープハッチを作成する"],"ko":["Expo 애플리케이션에 건강 및 피트니스 데이터를 통합함","네이티브 API를 활용하여 무결점의 사용자 경험을 만들기","단일 플랫폼 기능을 위한 탈출구を作성하기"],"es":["Integrar datos de salud y fitness en aplicaciones Expo","Utilizar API nativas para experiencias de usuario sin problemas","Crear escapes para funcionalidad de plataforma única"],"fr":["Intégrer des données de santé et de fitness dans des applications Expo","Utiliser des API natives pour des expériences utilisateur sans accroc","Créer des échappatoires pour la fonctionnalité de plate-forme unique"],"de":["Gesundheits- und Fitnessdaten in Expo-Apps integrieren","Native APIs für nahtlose Benutzererlebnisse nutzen","Fluchtwege für Funktionalität einer einzelnen Plattform erstellen"],"pt":["Integrar dados de saúde e condicionamento físico em aplicativos Expo","Utilizar APIs nativas para experiências de usuário sem interrupções","Criar escotilhas para funcionalidade de plataforma única"],"ru":["Интегрировать данные о здоровье и фитнесе в приложения Expo","Использовать родные API для бесперебойных пользовательских опытов","Создавать люки для функциональности единственной платформы"],"ar":["دمج بيانات الصحة واللياقة البدنية في تطبيقات Expo","استخدام واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الأصلية لتجارب المستخدم دون انقطاع","إنشاء منافذ هروب للوظائف منصة واحدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Expo environment","Apple HealthKit compatibility only","Native functionality limitations apply"],"zh":["需要 Expo 环境","仅支持 Apple HealthKit 兼容性","原生功能的限制适用"],"ja":["Expo 環境が必要","Apple HealthKit との互換性のみをサポート","ネイティブ機能の制限が適用される"],"ko":["Expo 환경이 필요함","Apple HealthKit 호환성만 지원함","네이티브 기능의 제한 사항이 적용됨"],"es":["Requiere entorno Expo","Compatibilidad solo con Apple HealthKit","Se aplican limitaciones de funcionalidad nativa"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Expo","Compatibilité uniquement avec Apple HealthKit","Les limitations de fonctionnalité native s''appliquent"],"de":["Benötigt Expo-Umgebung","Kompatibilität nur mit Apple HealthKit","Einschränkungen der nativen Funktionalität gelten"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Expo","Compatibilidade apenas com Apple HealthKit","Limitações de funcionalidade nativa se aplicam"],"ru":["Требуется среда Expo","Совместимость только с Apple HealthKit","Применяются ограничения родной функциональности"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Expo","التوافق فقط مع Apple HealthKit","تطبق قيود الوظيفة الأصلية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('erichowens/some_claude_skills/design-system-creator', 'community', 'erichowens', 'some_claude_skills', 'erichowens/some_claude_skills', 'design-system-creator', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z', '2026-02-18T03:39:00.336Z', NULL, '{"id":"erichowens/some_claude_skills/design-system-creator","name":"design-system-creator","description":{"zh":"设计系统创建者是一种可以帮助开发者创建全面、可扩展的设计系统的技能，包括设计令牌、CSS自定义属性和组件库文档","ja":"デザインシステムクリエーターは、包括的でスケーラブルなデザインシステムを作成するために使用できるスキルです。デザイントークン、CSSカスタムプロパティ、アーキテクチャなど","ko":"디자인 시스템 생성기는 포괄적이고 확장 가능한 디자인 시스템을 생성하는 데 사용할 수 있는 스킬입니다. 디자인 토큰, CSS 사용자 지정 속성 및 구성 요소 라이브러리 문서 등","es":"El creador de sistemas de diseño es un experto en CSS que ayuda a crear sistemas de diseño escalables y personalizados.","fr":"Le créateur de systèmes de conception est un expert en CSS qui aide à créer des systèmes de conception évolutifs et personnalisés.","de":"Der Design-System-Ersteller ist ein CSS-Experte, der bei der Erstellung von skalierbaren und benutzerdefinierten Design-Systemen hilft.","pt":"O design-system-creator é um especialista em criar sistemas de design abrangentes e escaláveis","ru":"Создатель систем дизайна - это эксперт в создании комплексных и масштабируемых систем дизайна","ar":"مصمم أنظمة التصميم هو خبير في إنشاء أنظمة تصميم شاملة وقابلة للتوسيع","en":"Claude skills that make my life easier."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"设计系统创建者 - 设计系统架构和CSS专家","ja":"デザインシステムクリエーター - デザインシステムアーキテクトとCSS専門家","ko":"디자인 시스템 생성기 - 디자인 시스템 아키텍트 및 CSS 전문가","es":"Creador de Sistemas de Diseño","fr":"Créateur de Systèmes de Conception","de":"Design-System-Ersteller","pt":"Crie Sistemas de Design Compreensivos","ru":"Создатель Комплексных Систем Дизайна","ar":"مصمم أنظمة التصميم الشاملة","en":"design-system-creator"},"description":{"zh":"设计系统创建者是一种可以帮助开发者创建全面、可扩展的设计系统的技能，包括设计令牌、CSS自定义属性和组件库文档","ja":"デザインシステムクリエーターは、包