es de style","Établissement de conventions de nommage","Audit de CSS existant pour l''extraction de systèmes de conception"],"de":["Erstellung von Design-Tokens von Grund auf","Architektur von benutzerdefinierten CSS-Eigenschaften","Dokumentation von Komponentenbibliotheken mit Nutzungsrichtlinien","Erstellung von Design-Bibeln und Stilguides","Festlegung von Namenskonventionen","Prüfung von vorhandenem CSS für die Extraktion von Design-Systemen"],"pt":["Criação de tokens de design personalizados","Arquitetura de propriedades personalizadas CSS","Documentação de bibliotecas de componentes","Criação de bíblias de design e guias de estilo","Estabelecimento de convenções de nomenclatura","Auditoria de CSS existente para extração de sistema de design"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских токенов дизайна","Архитектура пользовательских свойств CSS","Документация библиотек компонентов","Создание библии дизайна и руководств по стилю","Установление соглашений об именах","Аудит существующего CSS для извлечения системы дизайна"],"ar":["إنشاء رموز تصميم مخصصة","هيكلة خصائص CSS المخصصة","توثيق مكتبات المكونات","إنشاء كتب تصميم ودلائل أسلوب","إنشاء اتفاقيات تسمية","مراجعة CSS الحالية لاستخراج نظام التصميم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["设计系统","CSS","设计令牌","组件库","设计圣经","样式指南","命名约定","BEM","OOCSS","SMACSS"],"ja":["デザインシステム","CSS","デザイントークン","コンポーネントライブラリ","デザインバイブル","スタイルガイド","命名規則","BEM","OOCSS","SMACSS"],"ko":["디자인 시스템","CSS","디자인 토큰","구성 요소 라이브러리","디자인 바이블","스타일 가이드","命名 규칙","BEM","OOCSS","SMACSS"],"es":["sistema de diseño","arquitectura de sistemas de diseño","CSS","tokens de diseño","bibliotecas de componentes","guías de estilo","convenciones de nomenclatura","auditoría de CSS"],"fr":["système de conception","architecture de systèmes de conception","CSS","jetons de conception","bibliothèques de composants","guides de style","conventions de nommage","audit de CSS"],"de":["Design-System","Design-System-Architektur","CSS","Design-Tokens","Komponentenbibliotheken","Stilguides","Namenskonventionen","CSS-Prüfung"],"pt":["sistema de design","design system creator","tokens de design","arquitetura css","bibliotecas de componentes","guias de estilo","convenções de nomenclatura","auditoria de css"],"ru":["система дизайна","создатель систем дизайна","токены дизайна","архитектура css","библиотеки компонентов","руководства по стилю","соглашения об именах","аудит css"],"ar":["نظام التصميم","مصمم أنظمة التصميم","رموز التصميم","هيكلة css","مكتبات المكونات","دلائل الأسلوب","اتفاقيات التسمية","مراجعة css"]}},"owner":"erichowens","repo":"some_claude_skills","repoPath":"erichowens/some_claude_skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"design-system-creator","description":"Builds comprehensive design systems and design bibles with production-ready CSS. Expert in design tokens, component libraries, CSS architecture. Use for design system creation, token architecture, component documentation, style guide generation. Activate on design system, design tokens, CSS architecture, component library, style guide, design bible. NOT for typography deep-dives (use typography-expert), color theory mathematics (use color-theory-palette-harmony-expert), brand identity strategy (use web-design-expert), or actual UI implementation (use web-design-expert or native-app-designer).","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Design System Creator\n\nDesign systems architect and CSS expert specializing in creating comprehensive, scalable design bibles.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n✅ **Use for:**\n- Creating design tokens from scratch (colors, spacing, typography scales)\n- Building CSS custom property architectures\n- Documenting component libraries with usage guidelines\n- Creating design bibles and style guides\n- Establishing naming conventions (BEM, OOCSS, SMACSS)\n- Auditing existing CSS for design system extraction\n-","body":"# Design System Creator\n\nDesign systems architect and CSS expert specializing in creating comprehensive, scalable design bibles.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n✅ **Use for:**\n- Creating design tokens from scratch (colors, spacing, typography scales)\n- Building CSS custom property architectures\n- Documenting component libraries with usage guidelines\n- Creating design bibles and style guides\n- Establishing naming conventions (BEM, OOCSS, SMACSS)\n- Auditing existing CSS for design system extraction\n- Theming and dark mode token systems\n- Multi-brand/white-label token structures\n\n❌ **Do NOT use for:**\n- Typography selection and pairing → **typography-expert**\n- Color theory and palette generation → **color-theory-palette-harmony-expert**\n- Brand identity and visual direction → **web-design-expert**\n- Actual component implementation → **web-design-expert** or **native-app-designer**\n- Icon design → **web-design-expert**\n- Motion design principles → **native-app-designer**\n\n## Three-Tier Token Architecture\n\nThe foundation of scalable design systems:\n\n```css\n:root {\n  /* 1. PRIMITIVE - Raw values (ALWAYS use OKLCH for colors) */\n  --color-blue-500: oklch(62.8% 0.195 252.5);\n  --space-4: 1rem;\n\n  /* 2. SEMANTIC - Purpose-driven */\n  --color-primary: var(--color-blue-500);\n  --space-component-padding: var(--space-4);\n\n  /* 3. COMPONENT - Specific usage */\n  --button-bg: var(--color-primary);\n  --button-padding: var(--space-component-padding);\n}\n```\n\n→ See `references/token-architecture.md` for dark mode, multi-brand, and complete examples.\n\n## OKLCH: The Modern Color Standard\n\n**⚠️ CRITICAL: Always use OKLCH for color tokens, not hex or HSL.**\n\nOKLCH is perceptually uniform - equal L values mean equal perceived lightness. This is essential for:\n- Generating harmonious color scales\n- Ensuring accessibility (L=50% is true middle gray)\n- Theming (adjust L for dark mode, C for brand intensity)\n\n```css\n:root {\n  /* OKLCH format: oklch(Lightness% Chroma Hue) */\n\n  /* Primary scale - same hue, varying lightness */\n  --color-primary-100: oklch(95% 0.05 252);\n  --color-primary-500: oklch(62% 0.19 252);\n  --color-primary-900: oklch(30% 0.15 252);\n\n  /* Dark mode: reduce L uniformly */\n  --color-bg-light: oklch(98% 0.01 252);\n  --color-bg-dark: oklch(15% 0.02 252);\n}\n```\n\n**Essential OKLCH Resources:**\n| Resource | Purpose |\n|----------|---------|\n| [oklch.com](https://oklch.com/) | Interactive OKLCH color picker |\n| [Evil Martians: Why Quit RGB/HSL](https://evilmartians.com/chronicles/oklch-in-css-why-quit-rgb-hsl) | Why OKLCH is the new standard |\n| [Harmonizer](https://harmonizer.evilmartians.com/) | Generate harmonious palettes in OKLCH |\n\n**OKLCH Benefits for Design Systems:**\n- **Perceptual uniformity**: L=70% always looks 70% light\n- **Better contrast**: APCA-ready lightness calculations\n- **Easier scaling**: Math operations work predictably\n- **Native CSS**: `oklch()` works in all modern browsers (2023+)\n\n## Design Bible Structure\n\n### 1. Foundation\n- Brand Identity, Design Principles\n- Color System, Typography Scale\n- Spacing Scale, Grid System\n\n### 2. Components\nFor each component document:\n- Purpose, Anatomy, Variants\n- States (default, hover, active, disabled, focus)\n- Responsive behavior\n- Accessibility (ARIA, keyboard, screen readers)\n- Code examples\n\n### 3. Patterns\n- Page Layouts, Navigation\n- Forms, Data Display\n- Feedback (alerts, toasts, modals)\n\n### 4. Guidelines\n- Writing (voice, tone)\n- Imagery, Motion, Accessibility\n\n→ See `references/component-documentation.md` for templates.\n\n## CSS Organization (ITCSS)\n\n```\nstyles/\n├── 0-settings/     # Tokens, custom properties\n├── 1-tools/        # Mixins, functions\n├── 2-generic/      # Reset, normalize\n├── 3-elements/     # Typography, forms (unclassed)\n├── 4-objects/      # Layout patterns\n├── 5-components/   # UI components\n├── 6-utilities/    # Helpers, overrides\n└── main.css        # Import all\n```\n\n→ See `references/css-organization.md` for BEM naming and full structure.\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n### 1. Token Explosion\n**What it looks like**: 500+ tokens with overlapping purposes\n**Why it''s wrong**: Defeats constraints; developers can''t choose\n**Fix**: Limit to 6-8 spacing tokens. If you need more, fix the scale.\n\n### 2. Missing Semantic Layer\n**What it looks like**: Components reference primitives directly\n**Why it''s wrong**: Can''t theme, can''t change brand without touching every component\n**Fix**: Three-tier tokens: Primitive → Semantic → Component\n\n### 3. Documentation Drift\n**What it looks like**: Design bible says one thing, CSS does another\n**Why it''s wrong**: Developers stop trusting documentation\n**Fix**: Generate docs from CSS comments, or use Storybook\n\n### 4. Utility Class Overload\n**What it looks like**: `class=\"p-4 m-2 bg-blue-500 text-white...\"`\n**Why it''s wrong**: HTML unreadable, design intent lost\n**Fix**: Use utilities sparingly; most styles in semantic component classes\n\n### 5. Breaking the Scale\n**What it looks like**: `padding: 13px;` (why 13?)\n**Why it''s wrong**: Every exception erodes the system\n**Fix**: If the scale doesn''t work, fix the scale\n\n### 6. No Version Control\n**What it looks like**: \"Which button is correct?\"\n**Why it''s wrong**: Multiple sources of truth\n**Fix**: Single source of truth with version numbers, deprecation warnings\n\n## Working Process\n\n1. **Audit**: Review existing patterns and inconsistencies\n2. **Define**: Establish tokens and foundational system\n3. **Build**: Create component library with documentation\n4. **Document**: Write comprehensive design bible\n5. **Test**: Validate accessibility and responsiveness\n6. **Deliver**: Package with examples and starter templates\n\n## MCP Integrations\n\n| MCP | Purpose |\n|-----|---------|\n| **21st.dev** | Scaffold components quickly with modern patterns |\n| **Storybook** | Extract existing component structure (when available) |\n| **Figma** | Sync design tokens from Figma variables (when available) |\n| **Stability AI** | Generate placeholder images for documentation |\n| **Firecrawl** | Research design system best practices |\n\n## Output Deliverables\n\n- **Design Bible Document**: Complete markdown/HTML with visual examples\n- **CSS Codebase**: Well-commented, modular, production-ready\n- **Component Library**: Interactive examples with all variants\n- **Quick Start Guide**: Getting started, customization, common recipes\n\n## References\n\n→ `references/token-architecture.md` - Three-tier tokens, dark mode, multi-brand\n→ `references/css-organization.md` - ITCSS, BEM, component file structure\n→ `references/component-documentation.md` - Doc templates, quick reference cards\n\n## Integrates With\n\n- **typography-expert** - Typography scale and font selection\n- **color-theory-palette-harmony-expert** - Color palette generation\n- **web-design-expert** - Brand identity and visual direction\n- **adhd-design-expert** - ADHD-friendly design tokens\n\n---\n\n*Remember: A design system is a living product that serves products.*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:39:00.336Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced CSS architecture and design system creation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级CSS架构和设计系统创建功能的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントが高度なCSSアーキテクチャとデザインシステム作成機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 CSS 아키텍처와 디자인 시스템 생성 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan arquitectura de CSS avanzada y capacidades de creación de sistemas de diseño.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''une architecture CSS avancée et de capacités de création de systèmes de conception.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte CSS-Architektur und System-Design-Erstellungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de arquitetura de CSS avançada e capacidades de criação de sistema de design.","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходимы продвинутая архитектура CSS и возможности создания системы дизайна.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى بنية CSS متقدمة وقدرات إنشاء نظام التصميم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive design bibles, build CSS custom property architectures, and establish naming conventions using BEM, OOCSS, or SMACSS, while documenting component libraries with usage guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理创建综合设计圣经、构建CSS自定义属性架构、使用BEM、OOCSS或SMACSS建立命名约定，并记录组件库的使用指南的能力。","ja":"エージェントが包括的なデザインバイブルを作成し、CSSカスタムプロパティアーキテクチャを構築し、BEM、OOCSS、またはSMACSSを使用して命名規則を確立し、コンポーネントライブラリを使用ガイドラインとともに文書化する能力を付与します。","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 디자인 바이블을 생성하고 CSS 커스텀 속성 아키텍처를 구축하며 BEM, OOCSS 또는 SMACSS를 사용하여命명 규칙을 설정하고 컴포넌트 라이브러리의 사용 지침과 함께 문서화할 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para crear biblias de diseño comprehensivas, construir arquitecturas de propiedades personalizadas de CSS y establecer convenciones de nomenclatura utilizando BEM, OOCSS o SMACSS, mientras documenta bibliotecas de componentes con pautas de uso.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des bibliques de conception complètes, de construire des architectures de propriétés personnalisées CSS et d''établir des conventions de nommage en utilisant BEM, OOCSS ou SMACSS, tout en documentant les bibliothèques de composants avec des lignes directrices d''utilisation.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Design-Bibeln zu erstellen, CSS-Eigenschaftsarchitekturen zu bauen und Namenskonventionen mit BEM, OOCSS oder SMACSS zu etablieren, während sie Komponentenbibliotheken mit Nutzungsrichtlinien dokumentieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar bíblias de design abrangentes, construir arquiteturas de propriedade personalizada de CSS e estabelecer convenções de nomenclatura usando BEM, OOCSS ou SMACSS, enquanto documenta bibliotecas de componentes com diretrizes de uso.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать всесторонние библии дизайна, строить архитектуры пользовательских свойств CSS и устанавливать соглашения об именах с использованием BEM, OOCSS или SMACSS, а также документировать библиотеки компонентов с правилами использования.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء كتب تصميم شاملة وبناء هياكل ملكية مخصصة ل CSS وتأسيس اتفاقيات التسمية باستخدام BEM أو OOCSS أو SMACSS، مع توثيق مكتبات المكونات مع إرشادات الاستخدام."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating design tokens from scratch for consistent branding","Auditing existing CSS for design system extraction and optimization","Building scalable design systems with documented component libraries"],"zh":["从头开始创建设计令牌以实现一致的品牌推广","审计现有的CSS以提取和优化设计系统","使用文档化的组件库构建可扩展的设计系统"],"ja":["一貫したブランド推進のためにスクラッチからデザイントークンを作成する","既存のCSSを調査してデザインシステムを抽出して最適化する","文書化されたコンポーネントライブラリを使用してスケーラブルなデザインシステムを構築する"],"ko":["일관된 브랜드 진흥을 위해 스크래치에서 디자인 토큰 생성","기존 CSS 감사 및 디자인 시스템 추출 및 최적화","문서화된 컴포넌트 라이브러리와 함께 확장 가능한 디자인 시스템 구축"],"es":["Crear tokens de diseño desde cero para una marca coherente","Auditar CSS existente para la extracción y optimización del sistema de diseño","Crear sistemas de diseño escalables con bibliotecas de componentes documentadas"],"fr":["Créer des jetons de conception à partir de zéro pour une marque cohérente","Auditer le CSS existant pour l''extraction et l''optimisation du système de conception","Construire des systèmes de conception évolutifs avec des bibliothèques de composants documentées"],"de":["Design-Tokens von Grund auf für eine konsistente Markenidentität erstellen","Vorhandenes CSS für die Extraktion und Optimierung des Design-Systems auditen","Skalierbare Design-Systeme mit dokumentierten Komponentenbibliotheken erstellen"],"pt":["Criar tokens de design do zero para marcação consistente","Auditar CSS existente para extração e otimização do sistema de design","Construir sistemas de design escaláveis com bibliotecas de componentes documentadas"],"ru":["Создание токенов дизайна с нуля для последовательного брендинга","Аудит существующего CSS для извлечения и оптимизации системы дизайна","Строительство масштабируемых систем дизайна с задокументированными библиотеками компонентов"],"ar":["إنشاء رموز التصميم من الصفر للتعريف الثابت","مراجعة CSS الحالية لاستخراج نظام التصميم وتحسينه","بناء أنظمة التصميم القابلة للتحجيم مع مكتبات المكونات الموثقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires CSS expertise","Limited to design system creation and auditing"],"zh":["需要CSS专业知识","仅限设计系统创建和审计"],"ja":["CSSの専門知識が必要","設計システムの作成と監査のみに限定される"],"ko":["CSS 전문 지식이 필요","디자인 시스템 생성 및 감사에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en CSS","Limitado a la creación y auditoría de sistemas de diseño"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en CSS","Limité à la création et l''audit de systèmes de conception"],"de":["Benötigt CSS-Expertise","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung und Überprüfung von Design-Systemen"],"pt":["Exige especialização em CSS","Limitado à criação e auditoria do sistema de design"],"ru":["Требует экспертизы в CSS","Ограничен созданием и аудитом системы дизайна"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في CSS","محدود بإنشاء نظام التصميم ومراجعته"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('erichowens/some_claude_skills/video-processing-editing', 'community', 'erichowens', 'some_claude_skills', 'erichowens/some_claude_skills', 'video-processing-editing', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z', '2026-02-18T03:39:41.022Z', NULL, '{"id":"erichowens/some_claude_skills/video-processing-editing","name":"video-processing-editing","description":{"zh":"专门从事FFmpeg基础的视频编辑、处理自动化和导出优化，为现代内容创作工作流提供解决方案","ja":"FFmpegベースのビデオ編集、処理自動化、エクスポート最適化を専門にし、最新のコンテンツ制作ワークフローに適応","ko":"FFmpeg 기반의 비디오 편집, 처리 자동화 및 내보내기 최적화를 전문으로 하여 최신 콘텐츠 생성 워크플로우에 최적화","es":"Experto en edición y procesamiento de video basado en FFmpeg para flujos de trabajo de creación de contenido modernos.","fr":"Expert en traitement et édition vidéo basés sur FFmpeg pour les flux de travail de création de contenu modernes.","de":"Experte für Videoverarbeitung und -bearbeitung basierend auf FFmpeg für moderne Inhalts-Erstellung-Workflows.","pt":"Automatize a edição de vídeo com FFmpeg e melhore a eficiência das suas workflows de criação de conteúdo","ru":"Автоматизируйте обработку видео с помощью FFmpeg и повысьте эффективность своих рабочих процессов создания контента","ar":"تلقين معالجة الفيديو باستخدام FFmpeg وطور من كفاءة سلاسل إنتاج المحتوى الخاصة بك","en":"Claude skills that make my life easier."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"视频处理编辑专家","ja":"ビデオ処理編集エキスパート","ko":"비디오 처리 편집 전문가","es":"Edición y Procesamiento de Video con FFmpeg","fr":"Traitement et Édition Vidéo avec FFmpeg","de":"Videoverarbeitung und -bearbeitung mit FFmpeg","pt":"Edição de Vídeo Automatizada com FFmpeg","ru":"Автоматическая обработка видео с помощью FFmpeg","ar":"معالجة الفيديو التلقائية باستخدام FFmpeg","en":"video-processing-editing"},"description":{"zh":"专门从事FFmpeg基础的视频编辑、处理自动化和导出优化，为现代内容创作工作流提供解决方案","ja":"FFmpegベースのビデオ編集、処理自動化、エクスポート最適化を専門にし、最新のコンテンツ制作ワークフローに適応","ko":"FFmpeg 기반의 비디오 편집, 처리 자동화 및 내보내기 최적화를 전문으로 하여 최신 콘텐츠 생성 워크플로우에 최적화","es":"Experto en edición y procesamiento de video basado en FFmpeg para flujos de trabajo de creación de contenido modernos.","fr":"Expert en traitement et édition vidéo basés sur FFmpeg pour les flux de travail de création de contenu modernes.","de":"Experte für Videoverarbeitung und -bearbeitung basierend auf FFmpeg für moderne Inhalts-Erstellung-Workflows.","pt":"Automatize a edição de vídeo com FFmpeg e melhore a eficiência das suas workflows de criação de conteúdo","ru":"Автоматизируйте обработку видео с помощью FFmpeg и повысьте эффективность своих рабочих процессов создания контента","ar":"تلقين معالجة الفيديو باستخدام FFmpeg وطور من كفاءة سلاسل إنتاج المحتوى الخاصة بك","en":"Claude skills that make my life easier."},"definition":{"en":"Claude skills that make my life easier."},"features":{"zh":["自动化视频编辑管道","视频剪切、修剪、连接","添加过渡、特效、覆盖","音频混合和归一化","字幕/标题处理"],"ja":["自動ビデオ編集パイプライン","ビデオカット、トリミング、連結","トランジション、エフェクト、オーバーレーの追加","オーディオミキシングと正規化","字幕/キャプション処理"],"ko":["자동화된 비디오 편집 파이프라인","비디오 자르기, 修剪, 연결","전환, 효과, 오버레이 추가","오디오 混合 및 정규화","자막/キャプション 처리"],"es":["Automatización de pipelines de edición de video","Corte, recorte y concatenación de clips","Adición de transiciones, efectos y superposiciones","Mezcla y normalización de audio","Manejo de subtítulos y leyendas"],"fr":["Automatisation des pipelines d''édition vidéo","Coupe, découpe et concaténation de clips","Ajout de transitions, d''effets et de superpositions","Mixage et normalisation audio","Gestion des sous-titres et des légendes"],"de":["Automatisierung von Videobearbeitungspipelines","Schnitt, Beschnitt und Verbindung von Clips","Hinzufügen von Übergängen, Effekten und Überlagerungen","Audio-Mischung und -Normalisierung","Untertitel- und Unterschrift-Verwaltung"],"pt":["Pipeline de edição de vídeo automatizada","Corte, recorte e concatenação de clipes","Adição de transições, efeitos e sobreposições","Mistura e normalização de áudio","Manipulação de legendas e legendas","Otimização de exportação para plataformas"],"ru":["Автоматизированная pipeline редактирования видео","Резка, обрезка и конкатенация клипов","Добавление переходов, эффектов и наложений","Смешивание и нормализация аудио","Обработка субтитров и титров","Оптимизация экспорта для платформ"],"ar":["تسلسل معالجة الفيديو التلقائي","قص وتنسيق وتشغيل مقاطع الفيديو","إضافة انتقالات وأثار وتلاعب","مزج وتعديل الصوت","تعامل مع العناوين والترجمات","تحسين التصدير للأطراف"]},"keywords":{"zh":["视频处理","视频编辑","FFmpeg","自动化","内容创作","视频优化"],"ja":["ビデオ処理","ビデオ編集","FFmpeg","自動化","コンテンツ制作","ビデオ最適化"],"ko":["비디오 처리","비디오 편집","FFmpeg","자동화","콘텐츠 생성","비디오 최적화"],"es":["edición de video","procesamiento de video","FFmpeg","automatización de video","exportación de video","mejora de video"],"fr":["édition vidéo","traitement vidéo","FFmpeg","automatisation vidéo","exportation vidéo","amélioration vidéo"],"de":["Videobearbeitung","Videoverarbeitung","FFmpeg","Videautomatisierung","Videoexport","Videoverbesserung"],"pt":["edição de vídeo automatizada","FFmpeg","pipeline de edição de vídeo","processamento de vídeo","otimização de exportação","criação de conteúdo","vídeo","edição de vídeo","automatização"],"ru":["автоматическая обработка видео","FFmpeg","pipeline редактирования видео","обработка видео","оптимизация экспорта","создание контента","видео","редактирование видео","автоматизация"],"ar":["معالجة الفيديو التلقائية","FFmpeg","تسلسل معالجة الفيديو","معالجة الفيديو","تحسين التصدير","ابتكار المحتوى","الفيديو","تحرير الفيديو","تلقين"]}},"owner":"erichowens","repo":"some_claude_skills","repoPath":"erichowens/some_claude_skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"video-processing-editing","description":"FFmpeg automation for cutting, trimming, concatenating videos. Audio mixing, timeline editing, transitions, effects. Export optimization for YouTube, social media. Subtitle handling, color grading, batch processing. Use for videogen projects, content creation, automated video production. Activate on video editing, FFmpeg, trim video, concatenate, transitions, export optimization. NOT for real-time video editing UI, 3D compositing, or motion graphics.","bodyPreview":"# Video Processing & Editing\n\nExpert in FFmpeg-based video editing, processing automation, and export optimization for modern content creation workflows.\n\n## When to Use\n\n✅ **Use for**:\n- Automated video editing pipelines (script-to-video)\n- Cutting, trimming, concatenating clips\n- Adding transitions, effects, overlays\n- Audio mixing and normalization\n- Subtitle/caption handling\n- Export optimization for platforms\n- Batch video processing\n- Color grading and correction\n\n❌ **NOT for**:\n- Real-tim","body":"# Video Processing & Editing\n\nExpert in FFmpeg-based video editing, processing automation, and export optimization for modern content creation workflows.\n\n## When to Use\n\n✅ **Use for**:\n- Automated video editing pipelines (script-to-video)\n- Cutting, trimming, concatenating clips\n- Adding transitions, effects, overlays\n- Audio mixing and normalization\n- Subtitle/caption handling\n- Export optimization for platforms\n- Batch video processing\n- Color grading and correction\n\n❌ **NOT for**:\n- Real-time video editing UI (use DaVinci Resolve/Premiere)\n- 3D compositing (use After Effects/Blender)\n- Motion graphics animation (use After Effects)\n- Basic screen recording (use OBS)\n\n---\n\n## Technology Selection\n\n### Video Editing Tools\n\n| Tool | Speed | Features | Use Case |\n|------|-------|----------|----------|\n| FFmpeg | Very Fast | CLI automation | Production pipelines |\n| MoviePy | Medium | Python API | Programmatic editing |\n| PyAV | Fast | Low-level control | Custom processing |\n| DaVinci Resolve | Slow | Full NLE | Manual editing |\n\n**Decision tree**:\n```\nNeed automation? → FFmpeg\nNeed Python API? → MoviePy\nNeed frame-level control? → PyAV\nNeed manual editing? → DaVinci Resolve\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Anti-Patterns\n\n### Anti-Pattern 1: Not Using Keyframe-Aligned Cuts\n\n**Novice thinking**: \"Just cut the video at any timestamp\"\n\n**Problem**: Causes artifacts, black frames, and playback issues.\n\n**Wrong approach**:\n```bash\n# ❌ Cut at arbitrary timestamp (not keyframe-aligned)\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -ss 00:01:23.456 -to 00:02:45.678 -c copy output.mp4\n\n# Result: Black frames, artifacts, sync issues\n```\n\n**Why wrong**:\n- Video codecs use keyframes (I-frames) every 2-10 seconds\n- Non-keyframe cuts require re-encoding\n- Using `-c copy` (stream copy) without keyframe alignment breaks playback\n- GOP (Group of Pictures) structure depends on keyframes\n\n**Correct approach 1**: Re-encode for precise cuts\n```bash\n# ✅ Re-encode for frame-accurate cutting\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -ss 00:01:23.456 -to 00:02:45.678 \\\n  -c:v libx264 -crf 18 -preset medium \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 192k \\\n  output.mp4\n\n# Frame-accurate, but slower (re-encoding)\n```\n\n**Correct approach 2**: Keyframe-aligned stream copy\n```bash\n# ✅ Fast cutting with keyframe alignment\n# Step 1: Find keyframes near cut points\nffprobe -select_streams v -show_frames -show_entries frame=pkt_pts_time,key_frame \\\n  -of csv input.mp4 | grep \",1$\" | awk -F'','' ''{print $2}''\n\n# Step 2: Cut at nearest keyframes (fast, no re-encoding)\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -ss 00:01:22.000 -to 00:02:46.000 -c copy output.mp4\n\n# Blazing fast, no quality loss, but not frame-accurate\n```\n\n**Correct approach 3**: Two-pass for best of both worlds\n```bash\n# ✅ Fast seek + precise cut\nffmpeg -ss 00:01:20.000 -i input.mp4 \\\n  -ss 00:00:03.456 -to 00:01:25.678 \\\n  -c:v libx264 -crf 18 -preset medium \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 192k \\\n  output.mp4\n\n# -ss BEFORE -i: Fast seek to keyframe (no decode)\n# -ss AFTER -i: Precise trim (only decode needed portion)\n```\n\n**Performance comparison**:\n| Method | Time (1-hour video) | Accuracy | Quality |\n|--------|---------------------|----------|---------|\n| Stream copy (arbitrary) | 2s | ❌ Broken | ❌ Artifacts |\n| Stream copy (keyframe) | 2s | ±2s | ✅ Perfect |\n| Re-encode (simple) | 15min | ✅ Frame | ⚠️ Quality loss |\n| Two-pass (optimal) | 3min | ✅ Frame | ✅ Perfect |\n\n**Timeline context**:\n- 2010: FFmpeg required full re-encoding for cuts\n- 2015: `-c copy` added for stream copying\n- 2020: Two-pass cutting became best practice\n- 2024: Hardware acceleration (NVENC) makes re-encoding viable\n\n---\n\n### Anti-Pattern 2: Re-encoding Unnecessarily\n\n**Novice thinking**: \"Apply all edits in one FFmpeg command\"\n\n**Problem**: Multiple re-encodings cause cumulative quality loss.\n\n**Wrong approach**:\n```bash\n# ❌ Re-encode for each operation (quality degradation)\n# Operation 1: Trim\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -ss 00:01:00 -to 00:05:00 \\\n  -c:v libx264 -crf 23 temp1.mp4\n\n# Operation 2: Add audio\nffmpeg -i temp1.mp4 -i audio.mp3 -c:v libx264 -crf 23 \\\n  -map 0:v -map 1:a temp2.mp4\n\n# Operation 3: Add subtitles\nffmpeg -i temp2.mp4 -vf subtitles=subs.srt \\\n  -c:v libx264 -crf 23 output.mp4\n\n# Result: 3x re-encoding = significant quality loss\n```\n\n**Why wrong**:\n- Each re-encode is lossy (even with high CRF)\n- Cumulative quality loss (generation loss)\n- 3x encoding time\n- Wasted disk I/O\n\n**Correct approach 1**: Chain operations in single command\n```bash\n# ✅ Single-pass encoding with all operations\nffmpeg -ss 00:01:00 -i input.mp4 -i audio.mp3 \\\n  -to 00:04:00 \\\n  -vf \"subtitles=subs.srt\" \\\n  -map 0:v -map 1:a \\\n  -c:v libx264 -crf 18 -preset medium \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 192k \\\n  output.mp4\n\n# Single re-encode, all operations applied at once\n```\n\n**Correct approach 2**: Use stream copy when possible\n```bash\n# ✅ Lossless operations with stream copy\n# Trim (stream copy)\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 -ss 00:01:00 -to 00:05:00 -c copy temp.mp4\n\n# Add audio (stream copy video, encode audio)\nffmpeg -i temp.mp4 -i audio.mp3 \\\n  -map 0:v -map 1:a \\\n  -c:v copy -c:a aac -b:a 192k \\\n  temp2.mp4\n\n# Burn subtitles (must re-encode video)\nffmpeg -i temp2.mp4 -vf subtitles=subs.srt \\\n  -c:v libx264 -crf 18 -preset medium \\\n  -c:a copy \\\n  output.mp4\n\n# Only 1 video re-encode (for subtitles)\n```\n\n**Quality comparison**:\n| Method | Encoding Passes | Quality (VMAF) | Time |\n|--------|-----------------|----------------|------|\n| 3x re-encode (CRF 23) | 3 | 82/100 | 45min |\n| Single pass (CRF 23) | 1 | 91/100 | 15min |\n| Stream copy + 1 encode | 1 | 95/100 | 18min |\n| All stream copy | 0 | 100/100 | 30s |\n\n---\n\n### Anti-Pattern 3: Ignoring Color Space Conversions\n\n**Novice thinking**: \"Just concatenate videos together\"\n\n**Problem**: Color shifts, mismatched brightness, broken playback.\n\n**Wrong approach**:\n```bash\n# ❌ Concatenate videos with different color spaces\n# clip1.mp4: BT.709 (HD), yuv420p\n# clip2.mp4: BT.601 (SD), yuvj420p (full range)\n# clip3.mp4: BT.2020 (HDR), yuv420p10le\n\n# Create concat list\necho \"file ''clip1.mp4''\" > list.txt\necho \"file ''clip2.mp4''\" >> list.txt\necho \"file ''clip3.mp4''\" >> list.txt\n\n# Concatenate without color normalization\nffmpeg -f concat -safe 0 -i list.txt -c copy output.mp4\n\n# Result: Color shifts between clips, broken HDR metadata\n```\n\n**Why wrong**:\n- Different color spaces (BT.601 vs BT.709 vs BT.2020)\n- Different pixel formats (yuv420p vs yuvj420p)\n- Different color ranges (limited vs full)\n- Metadata conflicts\n\n**Correct approach**:\n```bash\n# ✅ Normalize color space before concatenation\n\n# Step 1: Analyze color space of each clip\nffprobe -v error -select_streams v:0 \\\n  -show_entries stream=color_space,color_transfer,color_primaries,pix_fmt \\\n  -of default=noprint_wrappers=1 clip1.mp4\n\n# Step 2: Normalize all clips to common color space\n# Target: BT.709 (HD), yuv420p, limited range\n\n# Normalize clip1 (already BT.709)\nffmpeg -i clip1.mp4 -c copy clip1_normalized.mp4\n\n# Normalize clip2 (BT.601 SD → BT.709 HD)\nffmpeg -i clip2.mp4 \\\n  -vf \"scale=in_range=full:out_range=limited,colorspace=bt709:iall=bt601:fast=1\" \\\n  -color_primaries bt709 \\\n  -color_trc bt709 \\\n  -colorspace bt709 \\\n  -c:v libx264 -crf 18 -preset medium \\\n  -c:a copy \\\n  clip2_normalized.mp4\n\n# Normalize clip3 (BT.2020 HDR → BT.709 SDR)\nffmpeg -i clip3.mp4 \\\n  -vf \"zscale=t=linear:npl=100,format=gbrpf32le,zscale=p=bt709,tonemap=hable:desat=0,zscale=t=bt709:m=bt709:r=limited,format=yuv420p\" \\\n  -color_primaries bt709 \\\n  -color_trc bt709 \\\n  -colorspace bt709 \\\n  -c:v libx264 -crf 18 -preset medium \\\n  -c:a copy \\\n  clip3_normalized.mp4\n\n# Step 3: Concatenate normalized clips\necho \"file ''clip1_normalized.mp4''\" > list.txt\necho \"file ''clip2_normalized.mp4''\" >> list.txt\necho \"file ''clip3_normalized.mp4''\" >> list.txt\n\nffmpeg -f concat -safe 0 -i list.txt -c copy output.mp4\n```\n\n**Color space guide**:\n| Standard | Color Space | Transfer | Primaries | Use Case |\n|----------|-------------|----------|-----------|----------|\n| BT.601 | SD | bt470bg | bt470bg | Old SD content |\n| BT.709 | HD | bt709 | bt709 | Modern HD/FHD |\n| BT.2020 | UHD/HDR | smpte2084 | bt2020 | 4K HDR |\n| sRGB | Web | iec61966-2-1 | bt709 | Web delivery |\n\n---\n\n### Anti-Pattern 4: Poor Audio Sync\n\n**Novice thinking**: \"Video and audio are separate, just overlay them\"\n\n**Problem**: Lip sync issues, audio drift, broken playback.\n\n**Wrong approach**:\n```bash\n# ❌ Replace audio without sync consideration\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -i audio.mp3 \\\n  -map 0:v -map 1:a \\\n  -c:v copy -c:a copy \\\n  output.mp4\n\n# Problems:\n# - Audio duration ≠ video duration\n# - No audio stretching/compression\n# - Drift over time\n```\n\n**Why wrong**:\n- Audio and video have different durations\n- No timebase synchronization\n- No drift correction\n- Ignores original audio sync\n\n**Correct approach 1**: Stretch/compress audio to match video\n```bash\n# ✅ Adjust audio speed to match video duration\n\n# Get durations\nVIDEO_DUR=$(ffprobe -v error -show_entries format=duration \\\n  -of default=noprint_wrappers=1:nokey=1 video.mp4)\nAUDIO_DUR=$(ffprobe -v error -show_entries format=duration \\\n  -of default=noprint_wrappers=1:nokey=1 audio.mp3)\n\n# Calculate speed ratio\nRATIO=$(echo \"$VIDEO_DUR / $AUDIO_DUR\" | bc -l)\n\n# Stretch audio to match video (with pitch correction)\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -i audio.mp3 \\\n  -filter_complex \"[1:a]atempo=${RATIO}[a]\" \\\n  -map 0:v -map \"[a]\" \\\n  -c:v copy -c:a aac -b:a 192k \\\n  output.mp4\n```\n\n**Correct approach 2**: Precise offset and trim\n```bash\n# ✅ Sync audio with offset and trim\n\n# Audio starts 0.5s late, trim to match video\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -itsoffset 0.5 -i audio.mp3 \\\n  -map 0:v -map 1:a \\\n  -shortest \\\n  -c:v copy -c:a aac -b:a 192k \\\n  output.mp4\n\n# -itsoffset: Delay audio by 0.5s\n# -shortest: Trim to shortest stream\n```\n\n**Correct approach 3**: Mix multiple audio tracks with sync\n```bash\n# ✅ Mix dialogue, music, effects with precise timing\n\nffmpeg -i video.mp4 -i dialogue.wav -i music.mp3 -i sfx.wav \\\n  -filter_complex \"\n    [1:a]adelay=0|0[dlg];\n    [2:a]volume=0.3,adelay=500|500[mus];\n    [3:a]adelay=1200|1200[sfx];\n    [dlg][mus][sfx]amix=inputs=3:duration=first[a]\n  \" \\\n  -map 0:v -map \"[a]\" \\\n  -c:v copy -c:a aac -b:a 256k \\\n  output.mp4\n\n# adelay: Precise millisecond timing\n# amix: Mix multiple audio streams\n# volume: Normalize levels\n```\n\n**Audio sync checklist**:\n```\n□ Verify video and audio durations match\n□ Use -shortest to prevent excess audio\n□ Apply adelay for precise timing offsets\n□ Use atempo for speed adjustment (maintains pitch)\n□ Set audio bitrate appropriately (128k-256k)\n□ Test lip sync at beginning, middle, end\n```\n\n---\n\n### Anti-Pattern 5: Wrong Codec/Bitrate for Platform\n\n**Novice thinking**: \"One export settings for everything\"\n\n**Problem**: Wasted bandwidth, poor quality, rejected uploads, compatibility issues.\n\n**Wrong approach**:\n```bash\n# ❌ Export everything at 4K 50 Mbps\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 \\\n  -c:v libx264 -b:v 50M -s 3840x2160 \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 320k \\\n  output.mp4\n\n# For Instagram story: 2 GB file, rejected (max 100 MB)\n# For YouTube: Could use 10 Mbps and look identical\n# For Twitter: Exceeds bitrate limits\n```\n\n**Why wrong**:\n- Platform-specific size/bitrate limits\n- Over-encoding wastes bandwidth\n- Wrong resolution for platform\n- Incompatible codecs\n\n**Correct approach**: Platform-optimized exports\n\n**YouTube (recommended settings)**:\n```bash\n# ✅ YouTube 1080p upload\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 \\\n  -c:v libx264 -preset slow -crf 18 \\\n  -s 1920x1080 -r 30 \\\n  -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n  -color_primaries bt709 -color_trc bt709 -colorspace bt709 \\\n  -movflags +faststart \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 192k -ar 48000 \\\n  youtube_1080p.mp4\n\n# YouTube 4K upload\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 \\\n  -c:v libx264 -preset slow -crf 18 \\\n  -s 3840x2160 -r 60 \\\n  -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n  -movflags +faststart \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 256k -ar 48000 \\\n  youtube_4k.mp4\n```\n\n**Instagram (Stories, Reels, Feed)**:\n```bash\n# ✅ Instagram Story (9:16, max 100 MB, 15s)\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 \\\n  -c:v libx264 -preset medium -crf 23 \\\n  -s 1080x1920 -r 30 -t 15 \\\n  -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n  -movflags +faststart \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 128k \\\n  instagram_story.mp4\n\n# ✅ Instagram Reel (9:16, max 90s)\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 \\\n  -c:v libx264 -preset medium -crf 23 \\\n  -s 1080x1920 -r 30 -t 90 \\\n  -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n  -movflags +faststart \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 128k \\\n  instagram_reel.mp4\n\n# ✅ Instagram Feed (1:1 or 4:5)\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 \\\n  -c:v libx264 -preset medium -crf 23 \\\n  -s 1080x1080 -r 30 \\\n  -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n  -movflags +faststart \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 128k \\\n  instagram_feed.mp4\n```\n\n**Twitter/X**:\n```bash\n# ✅ Twitter video (max 512 MB, 2:20)\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 \\\n  -c:v libx264 -preset medium -crf 23 \\\n  -s 1280x720 -r 30 -t 140 \\\n  -maxrate 5000k -bufsize 10000k \\\n  -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n  -movflags +faststart \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 128k \\\n  twitter.mp4\n```\n\n**TikTok**:\n```bash\n# ✅ TikTok (9:16, max 287 MB, 10 min)\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 \\\n  -c:v libx264 -preset medium -crf 23 \\\n  -s 1080x1920 -r 30 -t 600 \\\n  -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n  -movflags +faststart \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 128k \\\n  tiktok.mp4\n```\n\n**Web (HTML5 video)**:\n```bash\n# ✅ Web optimized (fast load, broad compatibility)\nffmpeg -i input.mp4 \\\n  -c:v libx264 -preset medium -crf 23 \\\n  -s 1920x1080 -r 30 \\\n  -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n  -profile:v baseline -level 3.0 \\\n  -movflags +faststart \\\n  -c:a aac -b:a 128k -ar 48000 \\\n  web.mp4\n```\n\n**Platform specs table**:\n| Platform | Max Size | Max Duration | Resolution | FPS | Bitrate | Codec |\n|----------|----------|--------------|------------|-----|---------|-------|\n| YouTube | Unlimited | Unlimited | 8K | 60 | Auto | H.264/VP9 |\n| Instagram Story | 100 MB | 15s | 1080x1920 | 30 | ~5 Mbps | H.264 |\n| Instagram Reel | 1 GB | 90s | 1080x1920 | 30 | ~8 Mbps | H.264 |\n| Twitter | 512 MB | 2:20 | 1920x1080 | 60 | 5 Mbps | H.264 |\n| TikTok | 287 MB | 10min | 1080x1920 | 30 | ~4 Mbps | H.264 |\n| LinkedIn | 5 GB | 10min | 1920x1080 | 30 | 5 Mbps | H.264 |\n| Web | Varies | Varies | 1920x1080 | 30 | 2-5 Mbps | H.264 |\n\n**Export optimization checklist**:\n```\n□ Use -movflags +faststart for web (progressive download)\n□ Use -pix_fmt yuv420p for broad compatibility\n□ Set -r 30 for most platforms (avoid variable framerate)\n□ Use -preset slow for final exports (better quality)\n□ Use -preset ultrafast for drafts\n□ Apply -maxrate and -bufsize for streaming\n□ Test playback on target platform before bulk export\n```\n\n---\n\n## Production Checklist\n\n```\n□ Align cuts to keyframes (or two-pass seek)\n□ Chain operations in single FFmpeg command\n□ Normalize color spaces before concatenating\n□ Verify audio/video sync (test at multiple points)\n□ Use platform-specific export presets\n□ Apply -movflags +faststart for web delivery\n□ Set proper color metadata (bt709 for HD)\n□ Test output file on target platform\n□ Keep lossless intermediate files (ProRes, FFV1)\n□ Use hardware acceleration for batch jobs (NVENC, VideoToolbox)\n```\n\n---\n\n## When to Use vs Avoid\n\n| Scenario | Appropriate? |\n|----------|--------------|\n| Automated video pipeline (script → video) | ✅ Yes - FFmpeg automation |\n| Batch process 100 videos | ✅ Yes - parallel FFmpeg jobs |\n| Trim/cut clips programmatically | ✅ Yes - precise cutting |\n| Add subtitles to videos | ✅ Yes - burn or soft subs |\n| Color grade footage | ⚠️ Limited - basic only |\n| Multi-cam editing | ❌ No - use DaVinci Resolve |\n| Motion graphics | ❌ No - use After Effects |\n| Real-time preview editing | ❌ No - use Premiere/Resolve |\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- `/references/ffmpeg-guide.md` - Complete FFmpeg command reference\n- `/references/timeline-editing.md` - Timeline concepts, multi-track editing\n- `/references/export-optimization.md` - Platform-specific export settings\n\n## Scripts\n\n- `scripts/video_editor.py` - Cut, trim, concatenate, transitions, effects\n- `scripts/batch_processor.py` - Parallel batch video processing\n\n---\n\n**This skill guides**: Video editing | FFmpeg | Timeline editing | Transitions | Export optimization | Audio mixing | Color grading | Automated video production\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:39:41.022Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Content Creation Agents automating FFmpeg-based video editing pipelines and export optimization.","zh":"对于自动化基于FFmpeg的视频编辑管道和导出优化的内容创建代理至关重要。","ja":"FFmpegベースのビデオ編集パイプラインとエクスポートの最適化を自動化するコンテンツ作成エージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"FFmpeg 기반 비디오 편집 파이프라인 및 내보내기 최적화를 자동화하는 콘텐츠 생성 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para Agentes de Creación de Contenido que automatizan tuberías de edición de video basadas en FFmpeg y optimización de exportación.","fr":"Essentiel pour les Agents de Création de Contenu qui automatisent les flux de travail d''édition de vidéos basés sur FFmpeg et l''optimisation des exportations.","de":"Wesentlich für Content-Erstellung-Agenten, die FFmpeg-basierte Videobearbeitungspipelines und Exportoptimierung automatisieren.","pt":"Essential for Content Creation Agents automating FFmpeg-based video editing pipelines and export optimization.","ru":"Essential for Content Creation Agents automating FFmpeg-based video editing pipelines and export optimization.","ar":"Essential for Content Creation Agents automating FFmpeg-based video editing pipelines and export optimization."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated video editing workflows including cutting, trimming, concatenation, audio normalization, subtitle handling, and platform-specific export optimization using FFmpeg command generation. Provides batch processing capabilities for large-scale video operations and color grading automation.","zh":"实现自动化视频编辑工作流，包括剪切、修剪、连接、音频归一化、字幕处理和平台特定的导出优化，使用FFmpeg命令生成。提供批处理能力，用于大规模视频操作和色彩分级自动化。","ja":"FFmpegコマンド生成を使用して、カット、トリミング、結合、オーディオの正規化、字幕の処理、およびプラットフォームごとのエクスポートの最適化を含む自動ビデオ編集ワークフローを可能にします。大規模なビデオ操作とカラーグレーディングの自動化のためのバッチ処理機能を提供します。","ko":"FFmpeg 명령어 생성을 사용하여 자동 비디오 편집 워크플로우를 가능하게 하며, 이를 통해 컷팅, 트리밍, 연결, 오디오 정규화, 자막 처리 및 플랫폼별 내보내기 최적화가 포함됩니다. 대규모 비디오 작업 및 색상 그레이딩 자동화에 대한 배치 처리 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita flujos de trabajo de edición de video automatizados, incluyendo corte, recorte, concatenación, normalización de audio, manejo de subtítulos y optimización de exportación específica de la plataforma utilizando la generación de comandos FFmpeg. Proporciona capacidades de procesamiento por lotes para operaciones de video a gran escala y automatización de gradación de color.","fr":"Permet des flux de travail d''édition de vidéos automatisés, y compris le découpage, le rognage, la concaténation, la normalisation audio, la gestion des sous-titres et l''optimisation des exportations spécifiques à la plateforme en utilisant la génération de commandes FFmpeg. Fournit des capacités de traitement par lot pour les opérations vidéo à grande échelle et l''automatisation de la gradation de couleur.","de":"Ermöglicht automatisierte Videobearbeitungs-Workflows, einschließlich Schneiden, Beschneiden, Verkettung, Audio-Normalisierung, Untertitel-Handling und plattformspezifische Exportoptimierung mithilfe der FFmpeg-Befehlsgenerierung. Bietet Batch-Verarbeitungsfähigkeiten für groß angelegte Videobetriebe und Farbgrad-Automatisierung.","pt":"Enables automated video editing workflows including cutting, trimming, concatenation, audio normalization, subtitle handling, and platform-specific export optimization using FFmpeg command generation. Provides batch processing capabilities for large-scale video operations and color grading automation.","ru":"Enables automated video editing workflows including cutting, trimming, concatenation, audio normalization, subtitle handling, and platform-specific export optimization using FFmpeg command generation. Provides batch processing capabilities for large-scale video operations and color grading automation.","ar":"Enables automated video editing workflows including cutting, trimming, concatenation, audio normalization, subtitle handling, and platform-specific export optimization using FFmpeg command generation. Provides batch processing capabilities for large-scale video operations and color grading automation."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating script-to-video editing pipelines","Batch processing multiple video files with consistent effects","Optimizing exports for specific platforms (YouTube, TikTok, Instagram)","Adding transitions and overlays programmatically","Handling subtitle/caption synchronization and formatting"],"zh":["自动化脚本到视频编辑管道","批量处理多个视频文件以保持一致的效果","针对特定平台优化导出（YouTube、TikTok、Instagram）","以编程方式添加过渡和叠加层","处理字幕/字幕同步和格式化"],"ja":["スクリプトからビデオ編集パイプラインを自動化する","一貫した効果で複数のビデオファイルをバッチ処理する","特定のプラットフォーム（YouTube、TikTok、Instagram）向けにエクスポートを最適化する","プログラムによってトランジションとオーバーレイを追加する","字幕/字幕の同期とフォーマットを処理する"],"ko":["스크립트에서 비디오 편집 파이프라인을 자동화하는","일관된 효과로 여러 비디오 파일을 배치 처리","특정 플랫폼(YouTube, TikTok, Instagram)용 내보내기 최적화","프로그램으로 전환 및 오버레이 추가","자막/자막 동기화 및 형식 지정 처리"],"es":["Automatizar tuberías de edición de video de script a video","Procesar por lotes varios archivos de video con efectos consistentes","Optimizar exportaciones para plataformas específicas (YouTube, TikTok, Instagram)","Agregar transiciones y superposiciones de forma programática","Manejar la sincronización y el formato de subtítulos y subtítulos"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail d''édition de vidéos de script à vidéo","Traiter par lot plusieurs fichiers vidéo avec des effets cohérents","Optimiser les exportations pour des plateformes spécifiques (YouTube, TikTok, Instagram)","Ajouter des transitions et des superpositions de manière programmatique","Gérer la synchronisation et le formatage des sous-titres et des légendes"],"de":["Automatisieren von Skript-zu-Video-Bearbeitungspipelines","Mehrere Videodateien mit konsistenten Effekten in Batch-Verarbeitung verarbeiten","Exporte für bestimmte Plattformen (YouTube, TikTok, Instagram) optimieren","Übergänge und Überlagerungen programmgesteuert hinzufügen","Synchronisation und Formatierung von Untertiteln und Untertitel bearbeiten"],"pt":["Automating script-to-video editing pipelines","Batch processing multiple video files with consistent effects","Optimizing exports for specific platforms (YouTube, TikTok, Instagram)","Adding transitions and overlays programmatically","Handling subtitle/caption synchronization and formatting"],"ru":["Automating script-to-video editing pipelines","Batch processing multiple video files with consistent effects","Optimizing exports for specific platforms (YouTube, TikTok, Instagram)","Adding transitions and overlays programmatically","Handling subtitle/caption synchronization and formatting"],"ar":["Automating script-to-video editing pipelines","Batch processing multiple video files with consistent effects","Optimizing 