"en":"CLI Documentation Maintainer"},"description":{"zh":"CLI 文档维护工具确保 AILANG CLI 帮助系统是所有 CLI 功能的权威性和准确性来源","ja":"CLI ドキュメントメンテナーは、AILANG CLI ヘルプシステムがすべての CLI 機能の権威的かつ正確な情報源であることを保証する","ko":"CLI 문서 유지 보수 도구는 AILANG CLI 도움말 시스템이 모든 CLI 기능의 권위적이고 정확한 정보源임을 보장합니다","es":"El Mantenedor de Documentación de CLI garantiza que la ayuda del sistema CLI sea exacta y completa","fr":"L''Entreteneur de Documentation de Ligne de Commande garantit que le système d''aide de ligne de commande soit exact et complet","de":"Der CLI-Dokumentationswart stellt sicher, dass das CLI-Hilfesystem genau und vollständig ist","pt":"O CLI Documentation Maintainer é uma ferramenta que ajuda a manter a documentação da CLI precisa e atualizada, garantindo a descoberta de recursos de IA.","ru":"CLI Документация Поддержка - это инструмент, который помогает поддерживать документацию CLI в актуальном и точном состоянии, обеспечивая обнаружение возможно...","ar":"حفظ توثيق واجهة سطر الأوامر هو أداة تساعد في الحفاظ على توثيق واجهة سطر الأوامر دقيق ومحدث، مما يضمن اكتشاف موارد الذكاء الاصطناعي.","en":"For humans, a language is a tool for expression. For AIs, it''s a substrate for reasoning."},"definition":{"en":"For humans, a language is a tool for expression. For AIs, it''s a substrate for reasoning."},"features":{"zh":["审计帮助系统以确保准确性","检查环境变量的使用情况","建议帮助文档的改进","自动更新帮助文档","支持多语言"],"ja":["ヘルプシステムの精度を保証するための監査","環境変数の使用状況の確認","ヘルプドキュメントの改善提案","ヘルプドキュメントの自動更新","多言語対応"],"ko":["도움말 시스템의 정확성을 보장하기 위한 감사","환경 변수 사용 상황 확인","도움말 문서의 개선 제안","도움말 문서의 자동 업데이트","다국어 지원"],"es":["Auditoría de comandos","Verificación de variables de entorno","Sugerencias de mejora","Mantenimiento de documentación precisa","Compatibilidad con repositorios externos"],"fr":["Audit de commandes","Vérification de variables d''environnement","Suggestions d''amélioration","Maintenance de documentation précise","Compatibilité avec des référentiels externes"],"de":["Kommandoaufzeichnung","Überprüfung von Umgebungsvariablen","Vorschläge für Verbesserungen","Wartung von genauer Dokumentation","Kompatibilität mit externen Repositorys"],"pt":["Verificação de comandos ausentes","Verificação de variáveis de ambiente","Sugestões de melhoria","Manutenção da documentação da CLI","Suporte à descoberta de recursos de IA"],"ru":["Проверка отсутствующих команд","Проверка переменных окружения","Предложения по улучшению","Поддержание документации CLI","Поддержка обнаружения возможностей ИИ"],"ar":["فحص الأوامر الناقصة","فحص متغيرات البيئة","اقتراحات التحسين","صيانة توثيق واجهة سطر الأوامر","دعم اكتشاف موارد الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["CLI 文档维护","AILANG CLI","帮助系统","自动化工具","文档更新","环境变量","多语言支持"],"ja":["CLI ドキュメントメンテナンス","AILANG CLI","ヘルプシステム","自動化ツール","ドキュメント更新","環境変数","多言語対応"],"ko":["CLI 문서 유지 보수","AILANG CLI","도움말 시스템","자동화 도구","문서 업데이트","환경 변수","다국어 지원"],"es":["documentación de CLI","herramientas de desarrollo","IA","descubribilidad de AI","mantenimiento de documentación","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["documentation de ligne de commande","outils de développement","IA","découverte de l''IA","maintenance de documentation","développement de logiciels"],"de":["CLI-Dokumentation","Entwicklertools","KI","Entdeckbarkeit von KI","Dokumentationswartung","Softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["CLI Documentation Maintainer","manutenção de documentação","descoberta de recursos de IA","ferramenta de desenvolvimento","documentação da CLI","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["CLI Документация Поддержка","поддержание документации","обнаружение возможностей ИИ","инструмент разработчика","документация CLI","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["حفظ توثيق واجهة سطر الأوامر","صيانة التوثيق","اكتشاف موارد الذكاء الاصطناعي","أداة المطور","توثيق واجهة سطر الأوامر","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"sunholo-data","repo":"ailang","repoPath":"sunholo-data/ailang","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"CLI Documentation Maintainer","description":"Maintain AILANG CLI help as single source of truth. Use when: adding new commands, adding environment variables, updating command behavior, auditing CLI documentation, ensuring help.go matches codebase implementation, improving CLI discoverability for AIs.","bodyPreview":"# CLI Documentation Maintainer\n\nEnsure AILANG CLI help system (`ailang --help`) remains the authoritative, accurate, and complete source of truth for all CLI features. Critical for AI discoverability in external repositories where CLAUDE.md isn''t available.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Most common usage:**\n```bash\n# User says: \"I added a new command, update the help\"\n# This skill will:\n# 1. Audit help.go against main.go for missing commands\n# 2. Check environment variables usage\n# 3. Suggest improvements","body":"# CLI Documentation Maintainer\n\nEnsure AILANG CLI help system (`ailang --help`) remains the authoritative, accurate, and complete source of truth for all CLI features. Critical for AI discoverability in external repositories where CLAUDE.md isn''t available.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Most common usage:**\n```bash\n# User says: \"I added a new command, update the help\"\n# This skill will:\n# 1. Audit help.go against main.go for missing commands\n# 2. Check environment variables usage\n# 3. Suggest improvements to help text\n# 4. Validate all documented features exist\n# 5. Update help.go with new content\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when:\n- Adding new commands to cmd/ailang/main.go\n- Adding new environment variables (DEBUG_*, AILANG_*, etc.)\n- Updating command behavior or flags\n- Auditing CLI documentation for accuracy\n- Improving CLI discoverability for AIs\n- After adding new features (ensure they''re documented)\n- Quarterly CLI documentation review\n- **Proactively**: After implementing any user-facing CLI change\n\n## Available Scripts\n\n### `scripts/audit_commands.sh`\nCompare commands in main.go against help.go to find undocumented commands.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\nscripts/audit_commands.sh\n```\n\n**Output:**\n- Lists all commands in main.go\n- Highlights commands missing from help.go\n- Shows commands in help.go that don''t exist in main.go (stale)\n- Exit code 0 if synchronized, 1 if discrepancies found\n\n### `scripts/audit_env_vars.sh`\nFind environment variables used in codebase and compare against help.go documentation.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\nscripts/audit_env_vars.sh\n```\n\n**Output:**\n- Lists all DEBUG_* and AILANG_* variables found in internal/\n- Shows which are documented in help.go\n- Highlights undocumented variables\n- Flags documented variables that don''t exist in code (stale)\n- Exit code 0 if synchronized, 1 if discrepancies found\n\n### `scripts/suggest_improvements.sh`\nAnalyze help text organization and suggest improvements.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\nscripts/suggest_improvements.sh\n```\n\n**Output:**\n- Checks help text length (should be scannable)\n- Verifies examples are present\n- Suggests missing categories or groupings\n- Recommends cross-references between related commands\n- Flags verbose or unclear descriptions\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Audit Phase\n\nRun audit scripts to identify discrepancies:\n\n```bash\n# Check commands\n.claude/skills/cli-doc-maintainer/scripts/audit_commands.sh\n\n# Check environment variables\n.claude/skills/cli-doc-maintainer/scripts/audit_env_vars.sh\n```\n\n### 2. Analysis Phase\n\nFor each discrepancy found:\n- **Missing command**: Add to appropriate category in help.go\n- **Missing env var**: Document with clear purpose and example\n- **Stale documentation**: Remove or update\n- **New feature**: Add examples showing usage\n\n### 3. Update Phase\n\nUpdate [cmd/ailang/help.go](../../../cmd/ailang/help.go):\n- Add new commands in correct category\n- Document new flags/subcommands\n- Add environment variables with examples\n- Include practical usage examples\n- Maintain consistent formatting\n\n### 4. Validation Phase\n\n```bash\n# Rebuild binary\nmake quick-install\n\n# Test help output\nailang --help\n\n# Test specific command help\nailang <command> --help\n\n# Verify examples work\n# (copy examples from help and test them)\n```\n\n### 5. Documentation Phase\n\nUpdate supporting documentation:\n- CHANGELOG.md - Document CLI changes\n- This skill''s reference.md - Update best practices if needed\n- Website docs (docs/docs/) - Mirror critical CLI info\n\n## Resources\n\n### CLI Documentation Best Practices\nSee [resources/best_practices.md](resources/best_practices.md) for:\n- Formatting conventions\n- Category organization\n- Example writing guidelines\n- Environment variable naming conventions\n\n### Help Text Template\nSee [resources/help_template.md](resources/help_template.md) for:\n- Command entry templates\n- Category section templates\n- Environment variable documentation template\n- Example section templates\n\n## Progressive Disclosure\n\nThis skill loads information progressively:\n\n1. **Always loaded**: This SKILL.md file (YAML frontmatter + workflow overview)\n2. **Execute as needed**: Scripts in `scripts/` (audit, validate)\n3. **Load on demand**: `resources/best_practices.md`, `resources/help_template.md`\n\n## Design Principles\n\n1. **CLI as Source of Truth**: Help text is THE authoritative reference\n2. **AI-First**: Optimize for discoverability by AIs in external repos\n3. **Progressive Disclosure**: Main help scannable, detailed help via subcommands\n4. **Practical Examples**: Every major command has a working example\n5. **Accurate**: Zero stale documentation - audit regularly\n\n## Notes\n\n- Run audits after every CLI change (make it a habit)\n- Environment variables must be used in code before documenting\n- Commands must exist in main.go before adding to help.go\n- Keep main help.go under 250 lines (currently ~220)\n- Per-command help (e.g., `coordinator --help`) can be longer\n- Test examples actually work before documenting them\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:39:22.362Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing automated CLI documentation maintenance and validation.","zh":"非常适合像 Cursor、Windsurf 和 Claude Code 这样的 AI Agents，它们需要自动化的 CLI 文档维护和验证。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Code などの AI エージェントに最適で、自動化された CLI ドキュメントのメンテナンスと検証が必要です。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, 자동화된 CLI 문서 유지 관리 및 검증이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan mantenimiento y validación automatizados de la documentación de CLI.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code ayant besoin d''une maintenance et d''une validation automatiques de la documentation de CLI.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die ein automatisiertes Wartung und Validierung der CLI-Dokumentation benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de manutenção e validação automatizada de documentação de CLI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым требуется автоматизированное обслуживание и проверка документации CLI.","ar":"مثالي لعميلAI مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى صيانة وتحقق وثائق CLI آلي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain accurate and complete CLI help systems by auditing help files against implementation code, checking environment variable usage, and suggesting improvements using protocols like bash and file formats like .go.","zh":"赋予代理维护准确且完整的 CLI 帮助系统的能力，通过审计帮助文件与实现代码、检查环境变量的使用并使用诸如 bash 的协议和 .go 之类的文件格式提出改进建议。","ja":"エージェントが実装コードとヘルプファイルの監査、環境変数の使用の確認、bash や .go などのプロトコルやファイル形式を使用した改善提案を行うことで、正確で完全な CLI ヘルプシステムを維持できるようにします。","ko":"구현 코드와 도움말 파일을 감사하고, 환경 변수 사용을 확인하며, bash 또는 .go와 같은 프로토콜 및 파일 형식을 사용하여 개선 제안을 하는 등으로 정확하고 완전한 CLI 도움말 시스템을 유지할 수 있도록 에이전트에게 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener sistemas de ayuda de CLI precisos y completos mediante la auditoría de archivos de ayuda contra el código de implementación, la comprobación del uso de variables de entorno y la sugerencia de mejoras utilizando protocolos como bash y formatos de archivo como .go.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir des systèmes d''aide de CLI précis et complets en auditant les fichiers d''aide par rapport au code d''implémentation, en vérifiant l''utilisation des variables d''environnement et en suggérant des améliorations en utilisant des protocoles comme bash et des formats de fichiers comme .go.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, genaue und vollständige CLI-Hilfesysteme zu warten, indem sie Hilfedateien gegen Implementierungscode überprüfen, die Verwendung von Umgebungsvariablen prüfen und Verbesserungsvorschläge unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie bash und Dateiformaten wie .go unterbreiten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter sistemas de ajuda CLI precisos e completos, auditando arquivos de ajuda contra o código de implementação, verificando o uso de variáveis de ambiente e sugerindo melhorias usando protocolos como bash e formatos de arquivo como .go.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать точные и полные системы помощи CLI, проверяя файлы помощи против кода реализации, проверяя использование переменных среды и предлагая улучшения с использованием протоколов, таких как bash, и форматов файлов, таких как .go.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الحفاظ على أنظمة المساعدة الدقيقة والكاملة CLI ، من خلال فحص ملفات المساعدة مقابل رمز التنفيذ ، وفحص استخدام متغيرات البيئة ، ومقترح التحسينات باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل bash وتنسيقات الملفات مثل .go."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing CLI help files for missing commands","Validating environment variable usage in CLI implementations","Generating suggestions for improving CLI documentation"],"zh":["审计 CLI 帮助文件中缺失的命令","验证 CLI 实现中的环境变量使用","生成改进 CLI 文档的建议"],"ja":["CLI ヘルプファイルの未登録コマンドの監査","CLI 実装における環境変数の使用の検証","CLI ドキュメントの改善提案の生成"],"ko":["CLI 도움말 파일에서 누락된 명령어를 감사하는 것","CLI 구현에서 환경 변수 사용을 검증하는 것","CLI 문서를 개선하는 제안을 생성하는 것"],"es":["Auditoría de archivos de ayuda de CLI para comandos que faltan","Validación del uso de variables de entorno en implementaciones de CLI","Generación de sugerencias para mejorar la documentación de CLI"],"fr":["Audit des fichiers d''aide de CLI pour les commandes manquantes","Validation de l''utilisation des variables d''environnement dans les implémentations de CLI","Génération de suggestions pour améliorer la documentation de CLI"],"de":["Prüfung von CLI-Hilfedateien auf fehlende Befehle","Überprüfung der Verwendung von Umgebungsvariablen in CLI-Implementierungen","Erstellung von Vorschlägen zur Verbesserung der CLI-Dokumentation"],"pt":["Auditoria de arquivos de ajuda CLI para comandos ausentes","Validação do uso de variáveis de ambiente em implementações CLI","Geração de sugestões para melhorar a documentação CLI"],"ru":["Проверка файлов помощи CLI на отсутствующие команды","Проверка использования переменных среды в реализациях CLI","Генерация предложений для улучшения документации CLI"],"ar":["فحص ملفات المساعدة CLI للوصول إلى أوامر مفقودة","التحقق من استخدام متغيرات البيئة في تنفيذ CLI","توليد مقترحات لتحسين وثائق CLI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to CLI implementation code and help files","Limited to auditing and suggesting improvements, not generating new documentation from scratch"],"zh":["需要访问 CLI 实现代码和帮助文件","仅限于审计和改进建议，不生成全新的文档"],"ja":["CLI 実装コードとヘルプファイルへのアクセスが必要","監査と改善提案のみに限定され、スクラッチからの新規ドキュメントの生成は不可"],"ko":["CLI 구현 코드와 도움말 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","감사 및 개선 제안만 가능하며, 문서를 처음부터 생성하는 것은 불가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso al código de implementación de CLI y a los archivos de ayuda","Limitado a la auditoría y la sugerencia de mejoras, no a la generación de nueva documentación desde cero"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au code d''implémentation de CLI et aux fichiers d''aide","Limité à l''audit et à la suggestion d''améliorations, et non à la génération de nouvelle documentation à partir de zéro"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den CLI-Implementierungscode und die Hilfedateien","Begrenzt auf die Überprüfung und die Vorschlagstellung, nicht auf die Erstellung neuer Dokumentation von Grund auf"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao código de implementação CLI e arquivos de ajuda","Limitado à auditoria e sugestão de melhorias, não gera nova documentação do zero"],"ru":["Требует доступа к коду реализации CLI и файлам помощи","Ограничен проверкой и предложением улучшений, не генерирует новую документацию с нуля"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى رمز تنفيذ CLI وملفات المساعدة","محدود بالفحص والت建议 التحسينات ، وليس توليد وثائق جديدة من الصفر"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('SWUSTcyt/langchain-travel-agent/feature', 'community', 'SWUSTcyt', 'langchain-travel-agent', 'SWUSTcyt/langchain-travel-agent', 'feature', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z', '2026-02-18T03:40:06.575Z', NULL, '{"id":"SWUSTcyt/langchain-travel-agent/feature","name":"feature","description":{"zh":"该旅游规划Agent Demo支持并行调用高德地图相关工具，并具有中间件级别的城市约束和工具预算控制","ja":"旅行計画Agent Demoは、高德地図関連ツールの並列呼び出しをサポートし、中間ウェアレベルの都市制約やツール予算制御を備えています","ko":"여행 계획 에이전트 데모는 고도 지图 관련 도구의 병렬 호출을 지원하며, 중간웨어 수준의 도시 제약 및 도구 예산 제어를 갖추고 있습니다","es":"El agente de planificación turística es una aplicación basada en LangChain 1.0, Qwen y MCP que ofrece planificación de rutas, búsqueda de puntos de interés y consulta de clima","fr":"L''agent de planification touristique est une application basée sur LangChain 1.0, Qwen et MCP qui propose la planification d''itinéraires, la recherche de points d''intérêt et la consultation de la météo","de":"Der Touristenplanungs-Agent ist eine Anwendung basierend auf LangChain 1.0, Qwen und MCP, die Routenplanung, Suche nach Punkten von Interesse und Wetterabfrage anbietet","pt":"Um agente de planejamento de viagens em Python que utiliza LangChain 1.0, Qwen e MCP para fornecer uma experiência de planejamento personalizada.","ru":"Агент планирования путешествий на Python, использующий LangChain 1.0, Qwen и MCP для предоставления персонализированного опыта планирования.","ar":"وكيل تخطيط الرحلات بالبايثون يستخدم LangChain 1.0، Qwen و MCP لتقديم تجربة تخطيط رحلات مخصصة.","en":"一个基于 **LangChain 1.0**、**阿里通义 Qwen** 和 **MCP(amap-maps)** 的旅游规划 Agent Demo，支持：  - 并行调用高德地图相关工具（搜索 POI、路线规划、天气查询） - 中间件级别的城市约束、工具预算控制、输出城市安全检查 - Gradio 前端，支持流式对话与调试日志查看（开发者模式）"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"基于LangChain 1.0的旅游规划Agent Demo","ja":"LangChain 1.0を使用した旅行計画Agent Demo","ko":"LangChain 1.0 기반 여행 계획 에이전트 데모","es":"Desarrollo de Agentes de Planifica