efinierte Regeln","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Codebeispiele","detaillierte Dokumentation"],"pt":["Remotion","melhores práticas","conteúdo 3D","animações","Three.js","React Three Fiber","desenvolvimento web","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["Remotion","лучшие практики","3D-контент","анимации","Three.js","React Three Fiber","веб-разработка","инструменты разработки","оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["ريموشن","أفضل الممارسات","محتوى ثلاثي الأبعاد","الرسوم المتحركة","Three.js","React Three Fiber","تطوير الويب","أدوات التطوير","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"WeWriteApp","repo":"WeWrite","repoPath":"WeWriteApp/WeWrite","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:40:32.810Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for JavaScript Agents needing advanced video production capabilities with Remotion and React Three Fiber","zh":"非常适合需要使用Remotion和React Three Fiber进行高级视频制作的JavaScript代理","ja":"RemotionとReact Three Fiberを使用した高度なビデオ制作機能が必要なJavaScriptエージェントに最適","ko":"Remotion과 React Three Fiber를 사용한 고급 비디오 제작 기능이 필요한 JavaScript 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de JavaScript que necesitan capacidades de producción de video avanzadas con Remotion y React Three Fiber","fr":"Parfait pour les agents JavaScript qui ont besoin de capacités de production vidéo avancées avec Remotion et React Three Fiber","de":"Perfekt für JavaScript-Agents, die erweiterte Video-Produktionsfunktionen mit Remotion und React Three Fiber benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes JavaScript que necessitam de capacidades de produção de vídeo avançadas com Remotion e React Three Fiber","ru":"Идеально для агентов JavaScript, которым необходимы передовые возможности видеопроизводства с помощью Remotion и React Three Fiber","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء JavaScript الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات إنتاج فيديو متقدمة مع Remotion و React Three Fiber"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create complex 3D content, animations, and import various assets like images, videos, and fonts into Remotion projects using Three.js and React Three Fiber, enhancing their video generation capabilities","zh":"赋予代理创建复杂的3D内容、动画，并将各种资产（如图像、视频和字体）导入Remotion项目中，使用Three.js和React Three Fiber，增强其视频生成能力","ja":"エージェントに、Three.jsとReact Three Fiberを使用して、複雑な3Dコンテンツ、動画を作成し、Remotionプロジェクトに画像、ビデオ、フォントなどのさまざまなアセットをインポートする能力を付与し、ビデオ生成能力を強化する","ko":"에이전트가 Three.js와 React Three Fiber를 사용하여 복잡한 3D 콘텐츠, 애니메이션을 생성하고 Remotion 프로젝트에 이미지, 비디오, 글꼴 등의 다양한 자산을 가져올 수 있도록 해주어 비디오 생성 기능을 강화한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear contenido 3D complejo, animaciones e importar varios activos como imágenes, videos y fuentes en proyectos de Remotion utilizando Three.js y React Three Fiber, mejorando sus capacidades de generación de video","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer du contenu 3D complexe, des animations et d''importer divers actifs tels que des images, des vidéos et des polices dans les projets Remotion en utilisant Three.js et React Three Fiber, améliorant ainsi leurs capacités de génération de vidéos","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, komplexen 3D-Inhalt, Animationen und verschiedene Assets wie Bilder, Videos und Schriftarten in Remotion-Projekte mit Three.js und React Three Fiber zu importieren, wodurch ihre Videoerzeugungsfähigkeiten verbessert werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar conteúdo 3D complexo, animações e importar vários ativos, como imagens, vídeos e fontes para projetos Remotion usando Three.js e React Three Fiber, melhorando suas capacidades de geração de vídeo","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать сложный 3D-контент, анимации и импортировать различные активы, такие как изображения, видео и шрифты, в проекты Remotion с помощью Three.js и React Three Fiber, улучшая их возможности генерации видео","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء محتوى 3D معقد ورسوم متحركة واستيراد مختلف الأصول مثل الصور والفيديوهات والخطوط في مشاريع Remotion باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber، مما يعزز قدراتهم على توليد الفيديو"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D animations for social media","Importing custom fonts and audio into Remotion videos","Creating interactive video experiences with React Three Fiber"],"zh":["为社交媒体生成3D动画","将自定义字体和音频导入Remotion视频","使用React Three Fiber创建交互式视频体验"],"ja":["ソーシャルメディア向けの3Dアニメーションを生成する","カスタムフォントやオーディオをRemotionビデオにインポートする","React Three Fiberを使用してインタラクティブなビデオ体験を作成する"],"ko":["소셜 미디어를 위한 3D 애니메이션 생성","사용자 정의 글꼴 및 오디오를 Remotion 비디오에 가져오기","React Three Fiber를 사용하여 대화형 비디오 경험 생성"],"es":["Generar animaciones 3D para redes sociales","Importar fuentes y audio personalizadas en videos de Remotion","Crear experiencias de video interactivas con React Three Fiber"],"fr":["Générer des animations 3D pour les réseaux sociaux","Importer des polices et des audio personnalisés dans les vidéos Remotion","Créer des expériences de vidéo interactives avec React Three Fiber"],"de":["Erzeugen von 3D-Animationen für soziale Medien","Importieren von benutzerdefinierten Schriftarten und Audio in Remotion-Videos","Erstellen interaktiver Videoerlebnisse mit React Three Fiber"],"pt":["Geração de animações 3D para mídias sociais","Importação de fontes personalizadas e áudio para vídeos Remotion","Criação de experiências de vídeo interativas com React Three Fiber"],"ru":["Генерация 3D-анимаций для социальных сетей","Импорт пользовательских шрифтов и аудио в видео Remotion","Создание интерактивных видеоопытов с помощью React Three Fiber"],"ar":["إنشاء رسوم متحركة 3D لمواقع التواصل الاجتماعي","استيراد خطوط و صوت مخصصين إلى مقاطع فيديو Remotion","إنشاء تجارب فيديو تفاعلية باستخدام React Three Fiber"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion codebase access","Familiarity with JavaScript and React necessary"],"zh":["需要访问Remotion代码库","需要JavaScript和React的熟悉度"],"ja":["Remotionコードベースへのアクセスが必要","JavaScriptとReactの知識が必要"],"ko":["Remotion 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요","JavaScript 및 React에 대한 지식이 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso al código base de Remotion","Se requiere familiaridad con JavaScript y React"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au code source Remotion","Nécessite une connaissance de JavaScript et de React"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Remotion-Codebase","Benötigt Kenntnisse von JavaScript und React"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao código base Remotion","Necessidade de familiaridade com JavaScript e React"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к кодовой базе Remotion","Необходимо знание JavaScript и React"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة код Remotion","يتطلب معرفة بالجافا سكريبت و React"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Falkicon/Mechanic/s-research', 'community', 'Falkicon', 'Mechanic', 'Falkicon/Mechanic', 's-research', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z', '2026-02-18T03:40:05.134Z', NULL, '{"id":"Falkicon/Mechanic/s-research","name":"s-research","description":{"zh":"WoW API ","ja":"WoWAPI","ko":"WoW API ","es":"La habilidad s-research es un hub de desarrollo de juegos para desarrolladores de complementos de World of Warcraft","fr":"La compétence s-research est un hub de développement de jeux pour les développeurs de compléments World of Warcraft","de":"Die Fähigkeit s-research ist ein Spielentwicklungshub für Entwickler von World-of-Warcraft-Addons","pt":"O s-research é um hub de desenvolvimento de addons para World of Warcraft que centraliza depuração, testes e monitoramento de desempenho.","ru":"S-research - это хаб разработки аддонов для World of Warcraft, который централизует отладку, тестирование и мониторинг производительности.","ar":"s-research هو مركز تطوير إضافات لـ World of Warcraft يركز على التصحيح والأختبار ومراقبة الأداء.","en":"In-game development hub for World of Warcraft addon developers. Centralizes debugging, testing, error capture, and performance monitoring with universal copy support."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"WoW API ","ja":"WoWAPI","ko":"WoW API ","es":"Investigación de APIs de WoW","fr":"Recherche d''API WoW","de":"WoW-API-Recherche","pt":"Desenvolvimento de Addons WoW: s-research","ru":"Разработка аддонов WoW: s-research","ar":"تطوير إضافات WoW: s-research","en":"s-research"},"description":{"zh":"WoW API ","ja":"WoWAPI","ko":"WoW API ","es":"La habilidad s-research es un hub de desarrollo de juegos para desarrolladores de complementos de World of Warcraft","fr":"La compétence s-research est un hub de développement de jeux pour les développeurs de compléments World of Warcraft","de":"Die Fähigkeit s-research ist ein Spielentwicklungshub für Entwickler von World-of-Warcraft-Addons","pt":"O s-research é um hub de desenvolvimento de addons para World of Warcraft que centraliza depuração, testes e monitoramento de desempenho.","ru":"S-research - это хаб разработки аддонов для World of Warcraft, который централизует отладку, тестирование и мониторинг производительности.","ar":"s-research هو مركز تطوير إضافات لـ World of Warcraft يركز على التصحيح والأختبار ومراقبة الأداء.","en":"In-game development hub for World of Warcraft addon developers. Centralizes debugging, testing, error capture, and performance monitoring with universal copy..."},"definition":{"en":"In-game development hub for World of Warcraft addon developers. Centralizes debugging, testing, error capture, and performance monitoring with universal copy support."},"features":{"zh":["API","API","CLI","API","API"],"ja":["API","API","CLI","API","API"],"ko":["API ","API ","CLI","API ","API "],"es":["Búsqueda de APIs de WoW","Información de API","Depuración y prueba de complementos","Monitoreo de rendimiento","Soporte de copia universal"],"fr":["Recherche d''API WoW","Informations sur les API","Débogage et test de compléments","Surveillance des performances","Support de copie universel"],"de":["WoW-API-Suche","API-Informationen","Fehlersuche und -behebung von Addons","Leistungsüberwachung","Universelle Kopierunterstützung"],"pt":["Depuração centralizada","Testes e captura de erros","Monitoramento de desempenho","Suporte a cópia universal","Pesquisa de APIs offline"],"ru":["Централизованная отладка","Тестирование и захват ошибок","Мониторинг производительности","Универсальная поддержка копирования","Оффлайн-поиск API"],"ar":["التصحيح المركزي","الأختبار وتصحيح الأخطاء","مراقبة الأداء","دعم النسخ العالمي","البحث عن واجهات برمجة التطبيقات دون اتصال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WoW API","API","WoW","API","CLI","API"],"ja":["WoW API","API","WoW","API","CLI","API"],"ko":["WoW API","API ","WoW","API ","CLI","API "],"es":["desarrollo de complementos wow","API de World of Warcraft","depuración de juegos","monitoreo de rendimiento","investigación de APIs","desarrollo de juegos"],"fr":["développement de compléments wow","API de World of Warcraft","débogage de jeux","surveillance des performances","recherche d''API","développement de jeux"],"de":["Entwicklung von WoW-Addons","WoW-API","Spiel-Debugging","Leistungsüberwachung","API-Recherche","Spielentwicklung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de addons wow","s-research","depuração de addons","testes de addons","monitoramento de desempenho wow","api wow"],"ru":["разработка аддонов wow","s-research","отладка аддонов","тестирование аддонов","мониторинг производительности wow","api wow"],"ar":["تطوير إضافات wow","s-research","التصحيح الإضافات","الأختبار الإضافات","مراقبة الأداء wow","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات wow"]}},"owner":"Falkicon","repo":"Mechanic","repoPath":"Falkicon/Mechanic","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"s-research","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Researching WoW APIs\n\nExpert guidance for discovering and understanding World of Warcraft APIs and patterns.\n\n## Related Commands\n\n- [c-research](../../commands/c-research.md) - API research workflow\n\n## CLI Commands (Use These First)\n\n> **MANDATORY**: Always use CLI commands before manual exploration.\n\n| Task | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| Search APIs (Offline) | `mech call api.search -i ''{\"query\": \"*Spell*\"}''` |\n| API Info | `mech call api.info -i ''{\"api_name\": \"C_Spell.GetSpellInfo\"}''` |","body":"# Researching WoW APIs\n\nExpert guidance for discovering and understanding World of Warcraft APIs and patterns.\n\n## Related Commands\n\n- [c-research](../../commands/c-research.md) - API research workflow\n\n## CLI Commands (Use These First)\n\n> **MANDATORY**: Always use CLI commands before manual exploration.\n\n| Task | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| Search APIs (Offline) | `mech call api.search -i ''{\"query\": \"*Spell*\"}''` |\n| API Info | `mech call api.info -i ''{\"api_name\": \"C_Spell.GetSpellInfo\"}''` |\n| List by Namespace | `mech call api.list -i ''{\"namespace\": \"C_Spell\"}''` |\n| Search Icons | `mech call atlas.search -i ''{\"query\": \"sword\"}''` |\n| API Stats | `mech call api.stats` |\n\n## Capabilities\n\n1. **API Discovery** — Search 5000+ WoW APIs offline using static definitions\n2. **Blizzard UI Research** — Find patterns in Blizzard''s own Lua source code\n3. **Ace3 Patterns** — Guidance on using common addon libraries (AceDB, AceEvent, etc.)\n4. **Icon/Atlas Search** — Find UI assets and textures by name\n\n## Routing Logic\n\n| Request type | Load reference |\n|--------------|----------------|\n| Offline API lookup patterns | [references/api-research.md](references/api-research.md) |\n| Blizzard UI source patterns | [references/blizzard-ui.md](references/blizzard-ui.md) |\n| Ace3 library patterns | [references/ace3-patterns.md](references/ace3-patterns.md) |\n| CLI Reference | [../../docs/cli-reference.md](../../docs/cli-reference.md) |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Search WoW APIs\n```bash\nmech call api.search -i ''{\"query\": \"GetItem*\", \"namespace\": \"C_Item\"}''\n```\n\n### Get Detailed API Info\n```bash\nmech call api.info -i ''{\"api_name\": \"C_Spell.GetSpellInfo\"}''\n```\n\n### Search Icons\n```bash\nmech call atlas.search -i ''{\"query\": \"sword\", \"limit\": 10}''\n```\n\n### Best Practices\n- **Search First**: Use `api.search` before guessing API names.\n- **Audit Blizzard**: Use ripgrep on local wow-ui-source to see how Blizzard uses an API.\n- **Namespace Awareness**: Most modern APIs are in `C_` namespaces (e.g., `C_Timer`, `C_Spell`).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:40:05.134Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for WoW Addon Developer Agents needing centralized debugging and API research capabilities for World of Warcraft.","zh":"非常适合需要集中调试和API研究功能的魔兽世界插件开发代理。","ja":"World of Warcraftのアドオン開発者エージェントが中央集権的なデバッグとAPIの研究機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"월드 오브 워크래프트 애드온 개발자 에이전트가 중앙 집중식 디버깅 및 API 연구 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo de Addon de WoW que necesitan depuración centralizada y capacidades de investigación de API para World of Warcraft.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement d''addon WoW ayant besoin d''un débogage centralisé et de capacités de recherche d''API pour World of Warcraft.","de":"Perfekt für WoW-Addon-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine zentrale Fehlerbehebung und API-Recherche-Funktionen für World of Warcraft benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedores de Addons do WoW que necessitam de depuração centralizada e capacidades de pesquisa de API para World of Warcraft.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработчиков дополнений WoW, которым необходимы централизованные возможности отладки и исследования API для World of Warcraft.","ar":"مثالي لعميل وكلاء تطوير إضافة WoW الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات Debugging المركزية وبحث واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للعبة World of Warcraft."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently research and understand World of Warcraft APIs and patterns using CLI commands, facilitating tasks such as searching APIs offline and retrieving API information via commands like `mech call api.search` and `mech call api.info`.","zh":"赋予代理能够使用CLI命令高效地研究和理解魔兽世界的API和模式，促进任务如使用`mech call api.search`和`mech call api.info`命令离线搜索API和检索API信息。","ja":"CLIコマンドを使用して、エージェントがWorld of WarcraftのAPIとパターンを効率的に調査および理解できるようにし、`mech call api.search`や`mech call api.info`などのコマンドを使用してオフラインでAPIを検索したり、API情報をコマンドで取得したりするタスクを促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 CLI 명령을 사용하여 월드 오브 워크래프트의 API 및 패턴을 효율적으로 조사 및 이해할 수 있도록 하여, `mech call api.search` 및 `mech call api.info`와 같은 명령을 사용하여 오프라인에서 API를 검색하거나 명령으로 API 정보를 가져오는 작업을促進합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes investigar y comprender de manera eficiente las API y patrones de World of Warcraft utilizando comandos de CLI, facilitando tareas como la búsqueda de API sin conexión y la recuperación de información de API a través de comandos como `mech call api.search` y `mech call api.info`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rechercher et de comprendre efficacement les API et les modèles de World of Warcraft à l''aide de commandes CLI, facilitant des tâches telles que la recherche d''API hors ligne et la récupération d''informations d''API via des commandes comme `mech call api.search` et `mech call api.info`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, World of Warcraft-APIs und Muster effizient mit CLI-Befehlen zu recherchieren und zu verstehen, wodurch Aufgaben wie das Offline-Suchen von APIs und das Abrufen von API-Informationen über Befehle wie `mech call api.search` und `mech call api.info` erleichtert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a pesquisar e entender de forma eficiente as APIs e padrões do World of Warcraft usando comandos CLI, facilitando tarefas como pesquisar APIs offline e recuperar informações de API por meio de comandos como `mech call api.search` e `mech call api.info`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно исследовать и понимать API и шаблоны World of Warcraft с помощью команд CLI, облегчая задачи, такие как поиск API в автономном режиме и получение информации API с помощью команд, таких как `mech call api.search` и `mech call api.info`.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على البحث والفهم بفعالية APIs وأنماط World of Warcraft باستخدام أوامر CLI، وتسهيل المهام مثل البحث في APIs في وضع عدم الاتصال واسترجاع معلومات API من خلال أوامر مثل `mech call api.search` و `mech call api.info`."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging WoW addon performance issues","Researching WoW APIs for spell information using `mech call api.search`","Testing and validating WoW API integrations"],"zh":["调试魔兽世界插件性能问题","使用`mech call api.search`研究魔兽世界API的法术信息","测试和验证魔兽世界API集成"],"ja":["World of Warcraftアドオンのパフォーマンスの問題をデバッグする","`mech call api.search`を使用してWorld of Warcraft APIの呪文情報を調査する","World of Warcraft APIの統合をテストおよび検証する"],"ko":["월드 오브 워크래프트 애드온 성능 문제 디버깅","`mech call api.search`를 사용하여 월드 오브 워크래프트 API의 마법 정보 조사","월드 오브 워크래프트 API 통합 테스트 및 검증"],"es":["Depuración de problemas de rendimiento de addon de WoW","Investigación de APIs de WoW para obtener información de hechizos utilizando `mech call api.search`","Pruebas y validación de integraciones de API de WoW"],"fr":["Débogage des problèmes de performances d''addon WoW","Recherche d''API de WoW pour obtenir des informations de sorts en utilisant `mech call api.search`","Tests et validation des intégrations d''API de WoW"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung von WoW-Addon-Leistungsproblemen","Recherche von WoW-APIs für Zauberschlaginformationen unter Verwendung von `mech call api.search`","Testen und Validieren von WoW-API-Integrationen"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas de desempenho de addons do WoW","Pesquisa de APIs do WoW para informações de feitiçaria usando `mech call api.search`","Testar e validar integrações de API do WoW"],"ru":["Отладка проблем с производительностью дополнений WoW","Исследование API WoW для получения информации о заклинаниях с помощью `mech call api.search`","Тестирование и проверка интеграций API WoW"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء أداء إضافات WoW","البحث في APIs للعبة WoW لمعلومات السحر باستخدام `mech call api.search`","اختبار وتأكيد تكاملات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات WoW"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires WoW addon development environment setup","Limited to World of Warcraft API research and debugging"],"zh":["需要魔兽世界插件开发环境设置","仅限于魔兽世界API研究和调试"],"ja":["World of Warcraftアドオン開発環境の設定が必要","World of Warcraft APIの研究およびデバッグに限定される"],"ko":["월드 오브 워크래프트 애드온 개발 환경 설정 필요","월드 오브 워크래프트 API 연구 및 디버깅에 한정"],"es":["Requiere configuración del entorno de desarrollo de addon de WoW","Limitado a la investigación y depuración de la API de World of Warcraft"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration d''un environnement de développement d''addon WoW","Limité à la recherche et au débogage de l''API de World of Warcraft"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung einer WoW-Addon-Entwicklungsumgebung","Begrenzt auf die Recherche und Fehlersuche der World of Warcraft-API"],"pt":["Requer configuração de ambiente de desenvolvimento de addons do WoW","Limitado à pesquisa e depuração de API do World of Warcraft"],"ru":["Требует настройки среды разработки дополнений WoW","Ограничен исследованием и отладкой API World of Warcraft"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد بيئة تطوير إضافات WoW","محدود لبحث وتصحيح أخطاء واجهة برمجة التطبيقات World of Warcraft"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
