s retours d''expérience client pour identifier les besoins","Gestion de produit modulaire et évolutif","Identification des opportunités d''affaires","Priorisation des fonctionnalités et caractéristiques"],"de":["Transformation von Feature-Anfragen in handhabbare Chancen","Analyse von Kundenfeedback zur Identifizierung von Bedürfnissen","Modulares und skalierbares Produktmanagement","Identifizierung von Geschäftschancen","Priorisierung von Funktionen und Merkmalen"],"pt":["Transformação de feedback de clientes em oportunidades concretas","Identificação de necessidades dos clientes","Desenvolvimento de produtos personalizados","Priorização de recursos","Análise de mercado"],"ru":["Преобразование обратной связи клиентов в конкретные возможности","Выявление потребностей клиентов","Разработка индивидуальных продуктов","Приоритизация ресурсов","Анализ рынка"],"ar":["تحويل ملاحظات العملاء إلى فرص قابلة للتنفيذ","تحديد احتياجات العملاء","تطوير منتجات مخصصة","تحديد الأولويات للموارد","تحليل السوق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["机会框架","AI驱动的产品管理","客户需求分析","产品优先级排序","功能请求管理","客户反馈处理"],"ja":["オポチュニティフレーミング","AI支援の製品管理","顧客のニーズ分析","製品の優先順位付け","機能リクエスト管理","顧客フィードバックの処理"],"ko":["기회 프레임워크","AI 기반의 제품 관리","고객 요구 분석","제품 우선 순위 지정","기능 요청 관리","고객 피드백 처리"],"es":["enmarcado de oportunidades","gestión de producto","AI","análisis de retroalimentación del cliente","identificación de necesidades","priorización de características"],"fr":["cadre d''opportunités","gestion de produit","IA","analyse des retours d''expérience client","identification des besoins","priorisation des fonctionnalités"],"de":["Chancen-Rahmen","Produktmanagement","KI","Kundenfeedback-Analyse","Bedürfnisidentifizierung","Funktionen-Priorisierung"],"pt":["opportunity framing","gestão de produtos","requisitos de negócios","análise de mercado","desenvolvimento de produtos","priorização de recursos","feedback de clientes"],"ru":["фрейминг возможностей","управление продуктами","бизнес-требования","анализ рынка","разработка продуктов","приоритизация ресурсов","обратная связь клиентов"],"ar":["إطار الفرص","إدارة المنتجات","متطلبات الأعمال","تحليل السوق","تطوير المنتجات","تحديد الأولويات للموارد","ملاحظات العملاء"]}},"owner":"samarv","repo":"Shanon","repoPath":"samarv/Shanon","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"opportunity-framing","description":"Frame customer opportunities as unmet needs, pain points, and desires rather than solutions. Use when writing opportunities for an Opportunity Solution Tree, validating opportunity statements, or training teams to distinguish problems from solutions. CRITICAL for avoiding the #1 OST failure - 98% of people write opportunities as solutions (Teresa Torres). Triggers when user asks to frame opportunities, write opportunities, validate opportunity statements, or check if this is a need vs solution.","bodyPreview":"# Opportunity Framing\n\nTransform feature requests and customer feedback into actionable, specific opportunities that represent true customer needs.\n\n## Core Principle\n\n**Opportunities are needs, not solutions.**\n\nThe #1 failure mode: \"98% of people that write opportunities write them as solutions.\" - Teresa Torres\n\n## Good vs Bad Opportunities\n\n### Bad (Solutions Disguised as Needs)\n- \"We need a better login experience\"\n- \"We need voice input for passwords\"\n- \"I wish this was easier to use\"\n- \"A","body":"# Opportunity Framing\n\nTransform feature requests and customer feedback into actionable, specific opportunities that represent true customer needs.\n\n## Core Principle\n\n**Opportunities are needs, not solutions.**\n\nThe #1 failure mode: \"98% of people that write opportunities write them as solutions.\" - Teresa Torres\n\n## Good vs Bad Opportunities\n\n### Bad (Solutions Disguised as Needs)\n- \"We need a better login experience\"\n- \"We need voice input for passwords\"\n- \"I wish this was easier to use\"\n- \"Add a calendar view\"\n- \"Implement dark mode\"\n\n### Good (Specific Customer Needs)\n- \"It''s hard to enter my password - selecting specific letters on the screen with the Apple TV remote\"\n- \"I can''t see who''s in the cast before I start watching\"\n- \"I don''t know if this show is good without watching 3 episodes first\"\n- \"I lose track of where I was when switching between devices\"\n- \"I can''t tell if I''ve already watched this episode\"\n\n## Quality Tests\n\nApply ALL three tests to validate an opportunity:\n\n### Test 1: Is it specific and actionable?\n- Bad: \"Navigation is confusing\" (too vague)\n- Good: \"I can''t find the search button on the main screen\" (specific)\n\n### Test 2: Does it describe the problem, not the solution?\n- Bad: \"We need better filters\" (solution)\n- Good: \"I can''t narrow down results by release date\" (problem)\n\n### Test 3: Is it grounded in a real customer story?\n- Bad: \"Users want faster load times\" (assumption)\n- Good: \"I gave up waiting for the page to load and closed the app\" (story-based)\n\n## Framing Process\n\n### Step 1: Listen for the raw input\nCustomer says: \"I wish there was a way to skip the intro automatically.\"\n\n### Step 2: Strip away the solution language\nSolution words to remove: \"add\", \"implement\", \"build\", \"create\", \"should have\", \"I wish there was\"\n\n### Step 3: Find the underlying need\nAsk: \"What problem would that solution solve?\"\nAnswer: \"I waste time clicking ''skip intro'' for every episode when binge-watching\"\n\n### Step 4: Make it specific\nGeneric: \"Binge-watching is tedious\"\nSpecific: \"I have to click ''skip intro'' 6+ times per hour when binge-watching a series\"\n\n### Step 5: Validate with the story\nCan you trace this back to a real customer moment?\nYes: \"Tell me about the last time you binge-watched something...\"\n\n## Vertical Depth Pattern\n\nOpportunities should get smaller and more actionable as you move down the tree:\n\n**Level 1 (Big)**: \"I can''t decide what to watch\"\n\n**Level 2 (Smaller)**: \"I don''t know if this show is good\"\n\n**Level 3 (Actionable)**: \"I can''t see who''s in the cast\"\n\nEach level down should:\n- Be more specific than the level above\n- Be a contributing factor to the parent opportunity\n- Be actionable enough to generate multiple solution ideas\n\n## Red Flags\n\nWatch for these indicators that you''ve written a solution, not an opportunity:\n\n- Contains implementation language (\"add\", \"build\", \"implement\", \"create\")\n- Describes a feature name or UI pattern (\"dashboard\", \"calendar view\", \"notifications\")\n- Uses \"should/could/would have\" phrasing\n- Lacks specificity (could apply to any product)\n- Not traceable to a specific customer story\n- Describes HOW rather than WHY or WHAT\n\n## Transformation Examples\n\n### Example 1: E-commerce\n**Raw input**: \"We need product recommendations\"\n**Bad opportunity**: \"Users want personalized recommendations\"\n**Good opportunity**: \"I don''t know what else to buy after adding one item to my cart\"\n\n### Example 2: SaaS Tool\n**Raw input**: \"Add keyboard shortcuts\"\n**Bad opportunity**: \"Power users need keyboard shortcuts\"\n**Good opportunity**: \"I waste 5+ seconds per action reaching for my mouse when I''m in flow state\"\n\n### Example 3: Mobile App\n**Raw input**: \"Implement offline mode\"\n**Bad opportunity**: \"Users need offline access\"\n**Good opportunity**: \"I lose my work when I go through a tunnel on my commute\"\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Pattern: \"I wish there was...\"\nThis is ALWAYS a solution in disguise.\n1. Ask: \"What problem does that solve?\"\n2. Ask: \"Tell me about the last time you experienced that problem\"\n3. Write the opportunity from the story\n\n### Pattern: Stakeholder feature requests\n\"Build feature X\" → \"Why?\" → \"To solve Y\" → \"Tell me about Y\"\n\nExample:\n- Request: \"Build a calendar view\"\n- Why?: \"To help users see their schedule\"\n- Problem: \"I can''t tell if I''m double-booked without checking 3 different places\"\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\nBefore finalizing an opportunity, confirm:\n\n- [ ] Written as a customer need, not a solution\n- [ ] Specific and concrete (mentions actual UI, steps, or context)\n- [ ] Traceable to a real customer story/interview\n- [ ] Actionable (could generate 3+ different solution ideas)\n- [ ] At appropriate depth (not too broad, not too narrow)\n- [ ] No implementation language (add/build/implement/create)\n- [ ] Passes all 3 quality tests above\n\n## Working with Experience Maps\n\nOpportunities should be organized by the customer''s journey phases:\n\n**Netflix Example:**\n1. Trigger (deciding to watch something)\n   - \"I don''t know what I''m in the mood for\"\n   - \"I don''t have much time and need something short\"\n2. Choosing what to watch\n   - \"I can''t see who''s in the cast\"\n   - \"I don''t know if this matches my mood\"\n3. Evaluating if it''s good\n   - \"I can''t tell if it''s good without watching 3 episodes\"\n4. The viewing experience\n   - \"I have to click skip intro 6+ times per hour\"\n5. Post-viewing experience\n   - \"I forget what happened in previous seasons\"\n\nEach phase contains specific needs and pain points.\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n### \"I want\" vs \"I can''t\"\n- Bad: \"I want to customize my dashboard\" (expresses desire)\n- Good: \"I can''t see my most important metrics without scrolling\" (expresses problem)\n\n### Generic vs Specific\n- Bad: \"The app is slow\" (generic)\n- Good: \"The search results take 8+ seconds to load on my phone\" (specific)\n\n### Feature vs Need\n- Bad: \"Users need a dark mode\" (feature)\n- Good: \"The bright screen hurts my eyes when using the app at night\" (need)\n\n## Coaching Prompts\n\nWhen helping others frame opportunities, use these prompts:\n\n1. \"Can you tell me about a specific time when you experienced that?\"\n2. \"What happened? Walk me through it step by step.\"\n3. \"What were you trying to do?\"\n4. \"What made that difficult/frustrating?\"\n5. \"What did you do next?\"\n6. \"How did that feel?\"\n\n## Reference: Teresa Torres'' Quality Standard\n\n> \"I''ve seen blog posts written about how they''re using the opportunity solution tree, and I cry a little bit because their opportunity space is all solutions. I don''t want to knock down somebody''s blog post, but I also don''t want this bad example out there in the world.\"\n\nThe bar is high. When in doubt:\n1. Read the opportunity statement out loud\n2. Ask: \"Is this describing WHAT the customer is trying to do or HOW we might solve it?\"\n3. If there''s any trace of HOW, rewrite it\n\n## Output Format\n\nWhen framing opportunities, use this format:\n\n```\nOpportunity: [Customer need statement in first person]\nEvidence: [Quote or story from customer interview]\nContext: [Journey phase this belongs to]\nParent opportunity: [If this is a sub-opportunity]\nConfidence: [High/Medium/Low based on # of customer stories]\n```\n\nExample:\n```\nOpportunity: \"I can''t tell if I''m double-booked without checking 3 different places\"\nEvidence: \"Last week I showed up to two meetings at the same time because my work calendar, personal calendar, and the team''s shared calendar weren''t synced.\" - User Interview #7\nContext: Schedule management / Planning phase\nParent opportunity: \"I can''t manage my time effectively across multiple calendars\"\nConfidence: High (heard from 8/10 interview participants)\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:40:10.936Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Product Management Agents needing to transform vague customer feedback into structured opportunity statements.","zh":"非常适合需要将模糊客户反馈转化为结构化机会陈述的产品管理智能体。","ja":"曖昧な顧客フィードバックを構造化された機会声明に変換する必要があるプロダクトマネジメントエージェントに最適です。","ko":"모호한 고객 피드백을 구조화된 기회 설명으로 전환해야 하는 제품 관리 에이전트에 완벽하게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de productos que necesitan transformar comentarios de clientes vagos en declaraciones de oportunidad estructuradas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de produits ayant besoin de transformer les commentaires de clients vagues en déclarations d''opportunité structurées.","de":"Perfekt für Produktmanagement-Agenten, die vage Kundenfeedback in strukturierte Chancenaussagen umwandeln müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestão de Produto que precisam transformar feedbacks vagos dos clientes em declarações estruturadas de oportunidades.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления продуктом, которым необходимо преобразовать расплывчатые отзывы клиентов в структурированные формулировки возможностей.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء إدارة المنتج الذين يحتاجون إلى تحويل ملاحظات العملاء الغامضة إلى بيانات منظمة للفرص."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to systematically reframe solution-oriented requests into customer need statements using Teresa Torres'' opportunity framing methodology. It provides a structured framework to avoid the common failure mode of writing solutions disguised as needs.","zh":"使智能体能够使用Teresa Torres的机会框架方法，系统性地将面向解决方案的请求重新构建为客户需求陈述。它提供了一个结构化框架，以避免将解决方案伪装成需求这一常见失败模式。","ja":"テレサ・トーレスの機会フレーミング手法を用いて、解決策指向の要求を顧客ニーズ声明に体系的に組み直すことをエージェントに可能にします。解決策をニーズとして偽装する一般的な失敗モードを回避するための構造化されたフレームワークを提供します。","ko":"테레사 토레스(Teresa Torres)의 기회 프레이밍 방법론을 사용하여 솔루션 지향적인 요청을 체계적으로 고객 필요 설명으로 재구성할 수 있도록 에이전트를 지원합니다. 필요로 위장한 솔루션을 작성하는 일반적인 실패 모드를 피하기 위한 구조화된 프레임워크를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes reencuadrar sistemáticamente las solicitudes orientadas a soluciones en declaraciones de necesidades del cliente utilizando la metodología de encuadre de oportunidades de Teresa Torres. Proporciona un marco estructurado para evitar el modo de fallo común de escribir soluciones disfrazadas de necesidades.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réencadrer systématiquement les demandes orientées vers les solutions en déclarations de besoins des clients en utilisant la méthodologie de cadrage des opportunités de Teresa Torres. Fournit un cadre structuré pour éviter le mode de défaillance courant consistant à écrire des solutions déguisées en besoins.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Lösungsorientierte Anfragen systematisch in Kundenbedürfnisse umzuwandeln, indem sie die Opportunitäts-Rahmen-Methodik von Teresa Torres verwenden. Es bietet einen strukturierten Rahmen, um den häufigen Fehlmodus zu vermeiden, Lösungen als Bedürfnisse zu verfassen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes reformulem sistematicamente solicitações orientadas a soluções em declarações de necessidades do cliente usando a metodologia de enquadramento de oportunidades de Teresa Torres. Fornece uma estrutura estruturada para evitar o modo de falha comum de escrever soluções disfarçadas de necessidades.","ru":"Позволяет агентам систематически переформулировать ориентированные на решение запросы в утверждения о потребностях клиентов, используя методологию фрейминга возможностей Терезы Торрес. Это обеспечивает структурированную основу для избежания распространенного режима сбоя, при котором решения маскируются под потребности.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إعادة صياغة الطلبات الموجهة نحو الحل بشكل منهجي إلى بيانات احتياجات العملاء باستخدام منهجية Teresa Torres لتأطير الفرص. يوفر إطارًا منظمًا لتجنب وضع الفشل الشائع المتمثل في كتابة حلول متنكرة في شكل احتياجات."},"useCases":{"en":["Reframing feature requests into customer needs","Transforming customer feedback into actionable opportunities","Validating opportunity statements against solution bias","Generating specific opportunity statements from vague input"],"zh":["将功能请求重新构建为客户需求","将客户反馈转化为可操作的机遇","根据解决方案偏见验证机会陈述","从模糊输入生成具体的机会陈述"],"ja":["機能要求を顧客ニーズに組み直す","顧客フィードバックを実行可能な機会に変換する","解決策バイアスに対して機会声明を検証する","曖昧な入力から具体的な機会声明を生成する"],"ko":["기능 요청을 고객 필요로 재구성하기","고객 피드백을 실행 가능한 기회로 변환하기","솔루션 편향에 대해 기회 설명 검증하기","모호한 입력에서 구체적인 기회 설명 생성하기"],"es":["Reencuadrar solicitudes de características en necesidades del cliente","Transformar comentarios de clientes en oportunidades realizables","Validar declaraciones de oportunidad contra sesgo de solución","Generar declaraciones de oportunidad específicas a partir de entrada vaga"],"fr":["Réencadrer les demandes de fonctionnalités en besoins des clients","Transformer les commentaires des clients en opportunités réalisables","Valider les déclarations d''opportunité contre les préjugés de solution","Générer des déclarations d''opportunité spécifiques à partir d''une entrée vague"],"de":["Umformulierung von Funktionsanforderungen in Kundenbedürfnisse","Umwandlung von Kundenfeedback in umsetzbare Chancen","Validierung von Chancenaussagen gegen Lösungsfehlanfälligkeit","Erzeugung spezifischer Chancenaussagen aus vager Eingabe"],"pt":["Reformular solicitações de recurso em necessidades do cliente","Transformar feedback do cliente em oportunidades acionáveis","Validar declarações de oportunidade contra viés de solução","Gerar declarações de oportunidade específicas a partir de entradas vagas"],"ru":["Переформулирование запросов на функции в потребности клиентов","Преобразование отзывов клиентов в действенные возможности","Проверка утверждений о возможностях на предвзятость решений","Генерация конкретных утверждений о возможностях из расплывчатых входных данных"],"ar":["إعادة صياغة طلبات الميزات إلى احتياجات العملاء","تحويل ملاحظات العملاء إلى فرص قابلة للتنفيذ","التحقق من صحة بيانات الفرص ضد انحياز الحل","إنشاء بيانات فرص محددة من مدخلات غامضة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear input text to frame opportunities","Dependent on quality of source feedback","Focuses on framing rather than solution generation"],"zh":["需要清晰的输入文本来构建机会框架","依赖于源反馈的质量","侧重于框架构建而非解决方案生成"],"ja":["機会を枠組みするには明確な入力テキストが必要","元のフィードバックの品質に依存","解決策の生成ではなくフレーミングに焦点を当てている"],"ko":["기회를 프레이밍하기 위해 명확한 입력 텍스트가 필요함","원본 피드백의 품질에 의존함","솔루션 생성보다는 프레이밍에 중점을 둠"],"es":["Requiere texto de entrada claro para encuadrar oportunidades","Depende de la calidad de la retroalimentación de la fuente","Se centra en el encuadre en lugar de la generación de soluciones"],"fr":["Nécessite un texte d''entrée clair pour cadrer les opportunités","Dépend de la qualité de la rétroaction de la source","Se concentre sur le cadrage plutôt que sur la génération de solutions"],"de":["Benötigt klaren Eingabetext, um Chancen zu formulieren","Hängt von der Qualität des Quellen-Feedbacks ab","Konzentriert sich auf die Formulierung statt auf die Lösungsgenerierung"],"pt":["Requer texto de entrada claro para enquadrar oportunidades","Dependente da qualidade do feedback da fonte","Foca no enquadramento em vez da geração de soluções"],"ru":["Требует четкого входного текста для формулирования возможностей","Зависит от качества исходного отзыва","Сосредоточен на фрейминге, а не на генерации решений"],"ar":["يتطلب نص إدخال واضح لتأطير الفرص","يعتمد على جودة الملاحظات المصدر","يركز على التأطير بدلاً من إنشاء الحلول"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('HomericIntelligence/ProjectOdyssey/agent-hierarchy-diagram', 'community', 'HomericIntelligence', 'ProjectOdyssey', 'HomericIntelligence/ProjectOdyssey', 'agent-hierarchy-diagram', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z', '2026-02-18T03:41:14.749Z', NULL, '{"id":"HomericIntelligence/ProjectOdyssey/agent-hierarchy-diagram","name":"agent-hierarchy-diagram","description":{"zh":"Agent Hierarchy Diagram Mojo50-80","ja":"Agent Mojo50-80","ko":"Agent Mojo50-80","es":"El diagrama de jerarquía de agentes es una herramienta de visualización que muestra la estructura y relaciones del sistema de agentes.","fr":"Le schéma de hiérarchie d''agents est un outil de visualisation qui affiche la structure et les relations du système d''agents.","de":"Das Agenten-Hierarchie-Diagramm ist ein Visualisierungstool, das die Struktur und Beziehungen des Agentensystems anzeigt.","pt":"O diagrama de hierarquia de agentes é uma ferramenta para visualizar a estrutura e relações do sistema de agentes, escrita em Mojo.","ru":"Иерархическая диаграмма агентов - это инструмент для визуализации структуры и отношений системы агентов, написанный на Mojo.","ar":"مخطط هرمي للوكيل هو أداة لتصور هيكل نظام الوكيل والعلاقات، مكتوب بلغة Mojo.","en":"Training framework written in Mojo"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Agent Hierarchy Diagram - ","ja":"Agent ","ko":"Agent ","es":"Diagrama de Jerarquía de Agentes - Herramienta de Visuali...","fr":"Schéma de Hiérarchie d''Agents - Outil de Visualisation","de":"Agenten-Hierarchie-Diagramm - Visualisierungstool","pt":"Diagrama de Hierarquia de Agentes","ru":"Иерархическая Диаграмма Агентов","ar":"مخطط هرمي للوكيل","en":"agent-hierarchy-diagram"},"description":{"zh":"Agent Hierarchy Diagram Mojo50-80","ja":"Agent Mojo50-80","ko":"Agent Mojo50-80","es":"El diagrama de jerarquía de agentes es una herramienta de visualización que muestra la estructura y relaciones del sistema de agentes.","fr":"Le schéma de hiérarchie d''agents est un outil de visualisation qui affiche la structure et les relations du système d''agents.","de":"Das Agenten-Hierarchie-Diagramm ist ein Visualisierungstool, das die Struktur und Beziehungen des Agentensystems anzeigt.","pt":"O diagrama de hierarquia de agentes é uma ferramenta para visualizar a estrutura e relações do sistema de agentes, escrita em Mojo.","ru":"Иерархическая диаграмма агентов - это инструмент для визуализации структуры и отношений системы агентов, написанный на Mojo.","ar":"مخطط هرمي للوكيل هو أداة لتصور هيكل نظام الوكيل والعلاقات، مكتوب بلغة Mojo.","en":"Training framework written in Mojo"},"definition":{"en":"Training framework written in Mojo"},"features":{"zh":["Mojo","ASCII","Mermaid","Agent","Team","Onboarding"],"ja":["Mojo","ASCII","Mermaid","Agent","Team","Onboarding"],"ko":["Mojo","ASCII","Mermaid","Agent","Team","Onboarding"],"es":["Generación de diagramas de árbol ASCII","Generación de diagramas Mermaid","Guardar diagramas en la documentación","Visualización de la estructura del sistema de agentes","Ayuda para la documentación y las presentaciones"],"fr":["Génération de diagrammes d''arbre ASCII","Génération de diagrammes Mermaid","Enregistrement des diagrammes dans la documentation","Visualisation de la structure du système d''agents","Aide pour la documentation et les présentations"],"de":["Erstellung von ASCII-Baumdiagrammen","Erstellung von Mermaid-Diagrammen","Speichern von Diagrammen in der Dokumentation","Visualisierung der Struktur des Agentensystems","Hilfe für Dokumentation und Präsentationen"],"pt":["Geração de diagramas ASCII","Geração de diagramas Mermaid","Salvar diagramas para documentação","Entender a estrutura do sistema de agentes","Visualizar relações entre agentes","Fácil integração com o framework de treinamento em Mojo"],"ru":["Генерация диаграмм ASCII","Генерация диаграмм Mermaid","Сохранение диаграмм для документации","Понимание структуры системы агентов","Визуализация отношений между агентами","Лёгкая интеграция с фреймворком обучения на Mojo"],"ar":["إنشاء مخططات ASCII","إنشاء مخططات Mermaid","حفظ المخططات للتокументات","فهم هيكل نظام الوكيل","تصوير العلاقات بين الوكلاء","إضافة سهلة إلى إطار التدريب المكتوب بلغة Mojo"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Agent Hierarchy Diagram","Mojo","ASCII","Mermaid","Agent System","Team Collaboration","Onboarding","Technical Documentation","Developer Tools"],"ja":["Agent Hierarchy Diagram","Mojo","ASCII","Mermaid","Agent System","Team Collaboration","Onboarding","Technical Documentation","Developer Tools"],"ko":["Agent Hierarchy Diagram","Mojo","ASCII","Mermaid","Agent System","Team Collaboration","Onboarding","Technical Documentation","Developer Tools"],"es":["diagrama de jerarquía de agentes","visualización de agentes","sistema de agentes","documentación de agentes","presentaciones de agentes","herramienta de visualización"],"fr":["schéma de hiérarchie d''agents","visualisation d''agents","système d''agents","documentation d''agents","présentations d''agents","outil de visualisation"],"de":["Agenten-Hierarchie-Diagramm","Visualisierung von Agenten","Agentensystem","Dokumentation von Agenten","Präsentationen von Agenten","Visualisierungstool"],"pt":["diagrama de hierarquia de agentes","sistema de agentes","mojo","framework de treinamento","diagramas visuais","relações entre agentes","estrutura do sistema","documentação","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["иерархическая диаграмма агентов","система агентов","mojo","фреймворк обучения","визуальные диаграммы","отношения между агентами","структура системы","документация","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مخطط هرمي للوكيل","نظام الوكيل","mojo","إطار التدريب","مخططات بصرية","علاقات بين الوكلاء","هيكل النظام","التوثيق","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"HomericIntelligence","repo":"ProjectOdyssey","repoPath":"HomericIntelligence/ProjectOdyssey","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-hierarchy-diagram","description":"Generate visual hierarchy diagrams of agent system showing levels and delegation. Use for documentation or onboarding.","bodyPreview":"# Agent Hierarchy Diagram\n\nGenerate visual diagrams showing agent system structure and relationships.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Documenting agent system for team\n- Understanding delegation structure\n- Onboarding new contributors\n- Visualizing agent relationships for presentations\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```bash\n# Generate ASCII tree diagram\n./scripts/generate_hierarchy_diagram.sh\n\n# Generate Mermaid diagram\n./scripts/generate_mermaid_diagram.sh > hierarchy.mmd\n\n# Save to documentation\n./scripts/generate_h","body":"# Agent Hierarchy Diagram\n\nGenerate visual diagrams showing agent system structure and relationships.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Documenting agent system for team\n- Understanding delegation structure\n- Onboarding new contributors\n- Visualizing agent relationships for presentations\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```bash\n# Generate ASCII tree diagram\n./scripts/generate_hierarchy_diagram.sh\n\n# Generate Mermaid diagram\n./scripts/generate_mermaid_diagram.sh > hierarchy.mmd\n\n# Save to documentation\n./scripts/generate_hierarchy_diagram.sh > agents/hierarchy-visual.txt\n```\n\n## ASCII Tree Format\n\n```text\nChief Architect (L0)\n├── Foundation Orchestrator (L1)\n│   ├── Repository Design (L2)\n│   │   ├── Directory Specialist (L3)\n│   │   │   └── Junior Engineer (L5)\n│   │   └── Config Specialist (L3)\n│   └── Config Design (L2)\n├── Shared Library Orchestrator (L1)\n│   └── Tensor Module Design (L2)\n│       └── Tensor Specialist (L3)\n└── Tooling Orchestrator (L1)\n```\n\n## Mermaid Format\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n    A[Chief Architect L0] --> B[Foundation Orchestrator L1]\n    B --> C[Repository Design L2]\n    C --> D[Directory Specialist L3]\n    D --> E[Junior Engineer L5]\n```\n\n## Use Cases\n\n- Add to `/agents/hierarchy.md` for reference\n- Include in onboarding documentation\n- Create presentation materials\n- Understand delegation chains\n- Communicate structure to stakeholders\n\n## Output Formats\n\n**ASCII**: Human-readable in terminals, copy-pasteable in docs\n\n**Mermaid**: Renders in GitHub markdown, editable in Mermaid editor\n\n**GraphML**: Import into diagram tools (yEd, Graphviz)\n\n## References\n\n- `/agents/hierarchy.md` - Existing hierarchy documentation\n- `agent-test-delegation` - Validate diagram accuracy\n- `.claude/agents/` - Agent configuration source\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:41:14.749Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing visual representations of system structures, such as Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code, for enhanced team documentation and onboarding.","zh":"适合需要对系统结构进行可视化表示的AI代理，例如Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code，以增强团队文档和入职培训。","ja":"システム構造の視覚的な表現が必要なAIエージェントに適しています。たとえば、Cursor、Windsurf、またはClaude Codeなどを使用して、チームのドキュメントとオンボーディングを強化することができます。","ko":"시스템 구조의 시각적 표현이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 예를 들어, Cursor, Windsurf 또는 Claude Code를 사용하여 팀 문서 및 온보딩을 강화할 수 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan representaciones visuales de estructuras de sistema, como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code, para una mejor documentación y capacitación del equipo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA ayant besoin de représentations visuelles des structures de système, telles que Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, pour une meilleure documentation et formation d''équipe.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die visuelle Darstellungen von Systemstrukturen benötigen, wie z.B. Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code, für eine verbesserte Teamdokumentation und Einweisung.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de representações visuais de estruturas de sistema, como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code, para documentação e integração de equipes aprimoradas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым требуются визуальные представления системных структур, таких как Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code, для улучшения документации команды и интеграции.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى تمثيلات بصرية لهياكل النظام، مثل Cursor أو Windsurf أو Claude Code، لتحسين توثيق الفريق والتوجيه."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate visual diagrams showing agent system structure and relationships using ASCII tree diagrams and Mermaid notation, ideal for presentations and team collaboration, leveraging scripts like generate_hierarchy_diagram.sh and generate_mermaid_diagram.sh.","zh":"使代理能够生成显示代理系统结构和关系的视觉图表，使用ASCII树图和Mermaid表示法，适合演示文稿和团队协作，利用脚本如generate_hierarchy_diagram.sh和generate_mermaid_diagram.sh。","ja":"エージェントがエージェントシステム構造と関係を示す視覚的な図を生成できるようにし、ASCIIツリーダイアグラムとMermaid表記を使用して、プレゼンテーションとチームコラボレーションに最適化し、generate_hierarchy_diagram.shやgenerate_mermaid_diagram.shなどのスクリプトを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 에이전트 시스템 구조와 관계를 보여주는 시각적 다이어그램을 생성할 수 있도록 하여 ASCII 트리 다이어그램과 Mermaid 표기법을 사용하여 프레젠테이션과 팀 협력을 최적화하며 generate_hierarchy_diagram.sh 및 generate_mermaid_diagram.sh와 같은 스크립트를 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar diagramas visuales que muestran la estructura y las relaciones del sistema de agentes utilizando diagramas de árbol ASCII y notación Mermaid, ideales para presentaciones y colaboración en equipo, aprovechando scripts como generate_hierarchy_diagram.sh y generate_mermaid_diagram.sh.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des diagrammes visuels montrant la structure et les relations du système d''agent en utilisant des diagrammes d''arbre ASCII et la notation Mermaid, idéaux pour les présentations et la collaboration d''équipe, en exploitant des scripts tels que generate_hierarchy_diagram.sh et generate_mermaid_diagram.sh.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, visuelle Diagramme zu generieren, die die Struktur und Beziehungen des Agentensystems mithilfe von ASCII-Baumdiagrammen und Mermaid-Notation zeigen, ideal für Präsentationen und Teamzusammenarbeit, unter Ausnutzung von Skripten wie generate_hierarchy_diagram.sh und generate_mermaid_diagram.sh.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar diagramas visuais que mostram a estrutura do sistema de agentes e relações usando diagramas de árvore ASCII e notação Mermaid, ideais para apresentações e colaboração de equipe, utilizando scripts como generate_hierarchy_diagram.sh e generate_mermaid_diagram.sh.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать визуальные диаграммы, показывающие структуру системы агентов и отношения, используя диаграммы дерева ASCII и нотацию Mermaid, идеально подходящие для презентаций и командного сотрудничества, используя скрипты, такие как generate_hierarchy_diagram.sh и generate_mermaid_diagram.sh.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء توليد تمثيلات بصرية للعلاقات الهيكلية للنظام و العلاقات باستخدام مخططات شجرة ASCII و تدوين Mermaid، مثالية للعروض التقديمية و التعاون الفريق، و باستخدام سكريبتات مثل generate_hierarchy_diagram.sh و generate_mermaid_diagram.sh."},"useCases":{"en":["Documenting complex agent systems for team reference","Visualizing delegation structures for efficient task management","Onboarding new contributors with clear system overviews","Generating Mermaid diagrams for interactive presentations"],"zh":["记录复杂的代理系统以供团队参考","可视化委托结构以实现高效的任务管理","为新贡献者提供清晰的系统概述","生成Mermaid图表以进行交互式演示"],"ja":["チームの参照用に複雑なエージェントシステムを文書化する","タスク管理の効率化のために委任構造を視覚化する","新しい貢献者に明確なシステムの概要を提供する","インタラクティブなプレゼンテーションのためにMermaidダイアグラムを生成する"],"ko":["팀 참조를 위해 복잡한 에이전트 시스템을 문서화하는 것","효율적인 작업 관리를 위한 위임 구조 시각화","새로운 기여자에게 명확한 시스템 개요 제공","인터랙티브 프레젠테이션을 위한 Mermaid 다이어그램 생성"],"es":["Documentar sistemas de agentes complejos para la referencia del equipo","Visualizar estructuras de delegación para una gestión de tareas eficiente","Capacitar a nuevos colaboradores con vistas generales claras del sistema","Generar diagramas Mermaid para presentaciones interactivas"],"fr":["Documenter des systèmes d''agent complexes pour la référence de l''équipe","Visualiser les structures de délégation pour une gestion de tâches efficace","Former de nouveaux contributeurs avec