动的相似性架构，帮助开发者高效地计算MCU相似性","ja":"MCU類似性計算器スキルはメタデータ駆動の類似性アーキテクチャを提供し、開発者が効率的にMCUの類似性を計算できるようにします","ko":"MCU 유사성 계산기 스킬은 메타데이터 구동 유사성 아키텍처를 제공하여 개발자가 효율적으로 MCU의 유사성을 계산할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"La calculadora de similitud MCU es una herramienta para desarrolladores que permite comparar componentes electrónicos en la biblioteca lib-electronic-components","fr":"La calculatrice de similarité MCU est un outil pour les développeurs qui permet de comparer des composants électroniques dans la bibliothèque lib-electronic-...","de":"Der MCU-Ähnlichkeitsberechner ist ein Tool für Entwickler, das den Vergleich von elektronischen Bauelementen in der Bibliothek lib-electronic-components ermö...","pt":"Calculadora de similaridade MCU para arquitetura de metadados, com integração de perfis de similaridade e regras de tolerância","ru":"Калькулятор подобия MCU для метаданных-ориентированной архитектуры, с интеграцией профилей подобия и правил толерантности","ar":"حاسبة تشابه MCU للهندسة المعمارية للميتاداتا، مع دمج ملفات تعريف التشابه وقواعد التسامح","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["元数据驱动的相似性架构","SpecImportance级别支持","ToleranceRule类型支持","SimilarityProfile上下文支持","计算器集成模式和注意事项"],"ja":["メタデータ駆動の類似性アーキテクチャ","SpecImportanceレベル対応","ToleranceRuleタイプ対応","SimilarityProfileコンテキスト対応","計算機統合パターンと注意事項"],"ko":["메타데이터 구동 유사성 아키텍처","SpecImportance 레벨 지원","ToleranceRule 유형 지원","SimilarityProfile 컨텍스트 지원","계산기 통합 패턴과注意事項"],"es":["Calculadora de similitud para componentes electrónicos","Arquitectura de similitud basada en metadatos","Niveles de importancia de especificaciones","Tipos de reglas de tolerancia","Perfiles de similitud para diferentes contextos"],"fr":["Calculatrice de similarité pour les composants électroniques","Architecture de similarité basée sur les métadonnées","Niveaux d''importance des spécifications","Types de règles de tolérance","Profils de similarité pour différents contextes"],"de":["Ähnlichkeitsberechner für elektronische Bauelemente","Ähnlichkeitsarchitektur basierend auf Metadaten","Wichtigkeitsstufen für Spezifikationen","Arten von Toleranzregeln","Ähnlichkeitsprofile für verschiedene Kontexte"],"pt":["Arquitetura de metadados para similaridade","Integração de perfis de similaridade","Regras de tolerância personalizáveis","Padrões de integração de calculadora","Otimização de custo e design"],"ru":["Метаданных-ориентированная архитектура для подобия","Интеграция профилей подобия","Настраиваемые правила толерантности","Шаблоны интеграции калькулятора","Оптимизация стоимости и проектирования"],"ar":["هندسة معمارية للميتاداتا للتشابه","دمج ملفات تعريف التشابه","قواعد تسامح قابلة للتعديل","انماط دمج الحاسبة","تحسين التكلفة والتصميم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["MCU相似性计算器","元数据驱动的相似性架构","SpecImportance","ToleranceRule","SimilarityProfile","计算器集成"],"ja":["MCU類似性計算器","メタデータ駆動の類似性アーキテクチャ","SpecImportance","ToleranceRule","SimilarityProfile","計算機統合"],"ko":["MCU 유사성 계산기","메타데이터 구동 유사성 아키텍처","SpecImportance","ToleranceRule","SimilarityProfile","계산기 통합"],"es":["similitud MCU","calculadora de componentes electrónicos","arquitectura de similitud","metadatos","especificaciones","tolerancia"],"fr":["similarité MCU","calculatrice de composants électroniques","architecture de similarité","métadonnées","spécifications","tolérance"],"de":["MCU-Ähnlichkeit","Berechner für elektronische Bauelemente","Ähnlichkeitsarchitektur","Metadaten","Spezifikationen","Toleranz"],"pt":["calculadora de similaridade MCU","arquitetura de metadados","perfis de similaridade","regras de tolerância","componentes eletrônicos","otimização de custo"],"ru":["калькулятор подобия MCU","метаданных-ориентированная архитектура","профили подобия","правила толерантности","электронные компоненты","оптимизация стоимости"],"ar":["حاسبة تشابه MCU","هندسة معمارية للميتاداتا","ملفات تعريف التشابه","قواعد التسامح","المكونات الإلكترونية","تحسين التكلفة"]}},"owner":"Cantara","repo":"lib-electronic-components","repoPath":"Cantara/lib-electronic-components","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"similarity-mcu","description":"Use when working with MCU/microcontroller similarity calculations - comparing microcontroller MPNs, understanding family/series/feature matching, or MCU-specific similarity logic.","bodyPreview":"# MCU Similarity Calculator Skill\n\nGuidance for working with MCU similarity calculators in the lib-electronic-components library.\n\n---\n\n**For metadata-driven similarity architecture**, see `/similarity-metadata`:\n- SpecImportance levels (CRITICAL, HIGH, MEDIUM, LOW, OPTIONAL)\n- ToleranceRule types (exactMatch, percentageTolerance, minimumRequired, etc.)\n- SimilarityProfile contexts (DESIGN_PHASE, REPLACEMENT, COST_OPTIMIZATION, etc.)\n- Calculator integration patterns and gotchas\n\n---\n\n## Overvie","body":"# MCU Similarity Calculator Skill\n\nGuidance for working with MCU similarity calculators in the lib-electronic-components library.\n\n---\n\n**For metadata-driven similarity architecture**, see `/similarity-metadata`:\n- SpecImportance levels (CRITICAL, HIGH, MEDIUM, LOW, OPTIONAL)\n- ToleranceRule types (exactMatch, percentageTolerance, minimumRequired, etc.)\n- SimilarityProfile contexts (DESIGN_PHASE, REPLACEMENT, COST_OPTIMIZATION, etc.)\n- Calculator integration patterns and gotchas\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nThere are two MCU-related calculators:\n\n### MCUSimilarityCalculator (Simple Interface)\n- Implements `SimilarityCalculator`\n- Uses pattern matching for family/series/features\n- No PatternRegistry required\n\n### MicrocontrollerSimilarityCalculator (Component Interface)\n- Implements `ComponentSimilarityCalculator`\n- Uses manufacturer handlers for extraction\n- Requires PatternRegistry\n\n## Applicable Types (MicrocontrollerSimilarityCalculator)\n\n```java\nComponentType.MICROCONTROLLER\nComponentType.MICROCONTROLLER_ATMEL\nComponentType.MICROCONTROLLER_INFINEON\nComponentType.MICROCONTROLLER_ST\nComponentType.MCU_ATMEL\n```\n\n## Similarity Weights (MCUSimilarityCalculator)\n\n```java\nfamilySimilarity * 0.5   // Family is most important\nseriesSimilarity * 0.3   // Series number\nfeatureSimilarity * 0.2  // Feature codes (F, L, U, etc.)\n```\n\n## MCU Families\n\n### Family Groups\n| Group | Members |\n|-------|---------|\n| PIC | PIC16, PIC18, PIC24, PIC32 |\n| STM | STM8, STM32 |\n| ATM | ATMEGA, ATTINY, ATXMEGA |\n| MSP | MSP430, MSP432 |\n\n```java\n// Same family = 1.0 family similarity\ncalculator.calculateSimilarity(\"STM32F103\", \"STM32F407\");\n// High similarity (same STM32 family)\n\n// Related family = 0.8 family similarity\ncalculator.calculateSimilarity(\"PIC16F877\", \"PIC18F4550\");\n// Good similarity (both PIC family)\n```\n\n## Feature Codes\n\n| Code | Meaning |\n|------|---------|\n| F | Flash memory |\n| L | Low power |\n| U | USB capable |\n| W | Wireless |\n| R | ROM version |\n| T | Extended temperature |\n\n```java\n// Same feature codes contribute to similarity\ncalculator.calculateSimilarity(\"STM32F103\", \"STM32F407\");\n// Both have F (Flash) feature\n```\n\n## Series Similarity\n\nSeries numbers are compared numerically:\n- Same series = 1.0\n- Close numbers (within 100) = partial similarity\n- Far numbers = lower similarity\n\n```java\n// Same series\ncalculator.calculateSimilarity(\"ATMEGA328\", \"ATMEGA328P\");\n// Very high similarity\n\n// Close series\ncalculator.calculateSimilarity(\"ATMEGA328\", \"ATMEGA329\");\n// High similarity\n\n// Far series\ncalculator.calculateSimilarity(\"ATMEGA328\", \"ATMEGA2560\");\n// Lower similarity\n```\n\n## MicrocontrollerSimilarityCalculator Scoring\n\n| Condition | Score |\n|-----------|-------|\n| Same manufacturer, same series, same package | 1.0 |\n| Same manufacturer, same series, different package | 0.9 |\n| Official replacement parts | 0.8 |\n| Same series across manufacturers | 0.7 |\n| Both microcontrollers, different series | 0.5 |\n\n## Test Examples\n\n### MCUSimilarityCalculator\n```java\n// Identical MCU\ncalculator.calculateSimilarity(\"ATMEGA328P\", \"ATMEGA328P\");\n// Returns 1.0\n\n// Same family, different series\ncalculator.calculateSimilarity(\"STM32F103\", \"STM32F407\");\n// Returns > 0.5\n\n// Different families\ncalculator.calculateSimilarity(\"STM32F103\", \"ATMEGA328\");\n// Returns lower similarity\n```\n\n### MicrocontrollerSimilarityCalculator\n```java\n// Same part, different package\ncalculator.calculateSimilarity(\"ATMEGA328P-AU\", \"ATMEGA328P-PU\", registry);\n// Returns >= 0.5\n\n// Different MCUs\ncalculator.calculateSimilarity(\"ATMEGA328P\", \"STM32F103C8T6\", registry);\n// Returns 0.5 (base MCU similarity)\n```\n\n## Common MCU Patterns\n\n### Atmel/Microchip AVR\n```\nATMEGA 328 P -AU\n│      │   │  │\n│      │   │  └── Package (AU=TQFP)\n│      │   └───── Variant (P=Picopower)\n│      └───────── Series number\n└──────────────── Family\n```\n\n### STMicroelectronics STM32\n```\nSTM32 F 103 C8 T6\n│     │ │   │  │\n│     │ │   │  └── Package (T6=LQFP48)\n│     │ │   └───── Memory/pins\n│     │ └───────── Series\n│     └─────────── Type (F=Foundation)\n└───────────────── Family\n```\n\n### Microchip PIC\n```\nPIC16 F 877 A\n│     │ │   │\n│     │ │   └── Variant\n│     │ └────── Series\n│     └──────── Memory type (F=Flash)\n└────────────── Family\n```\n\n---\n\n## Learnings & Quirks\n\n### Family Detection\n- Regex `^([A-Z]+)\\d+` extracts family prefix\n- Empty family = 0.0 family similarity\n\n### Series Number Extraction\n- Extracts first numeric sequence\n- Compared as integers for proximity\n\n### Feature Code Position\n- Usually at end of part number\n- Regex `[A-Z]+$` extracts trailing letters\n\n### Package Codes\n- Vary significantly by manufacturer\n- Don''t affect core part equivalence\n- Same MCU in different package = HIGH similarity\n\n### Cross-Family Comparison\n- Different families get Levenshtein similarity\n- Never returns > 0.8 for different families\n\n<!-- Add new learnings above this line -->\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:41:18.963Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Electronic Component Analysis Agents needing advanced MCU similarity calculation capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级MCU相似度计算能力的电子元件分析代理","ja":"高度なMCUの類似度計算機能を必要とする電子部品分析エージェントに最適","ko":"고급 MCU 유사성 계산 기능이 필요한 전자 부품 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de componentes electrónicos que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de cálculo de similitud de MCU.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de composants électroniques ayant besoin de capacités de calcul avancées de similitude de MCU.","de":"Perfekt für elektronische Komponentenanalyse-Agenten, die erweiterte MCU-Ähnlichkeitsberechnungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Componentes Eletrônicos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de cálculo de similaridade de MCU.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа электронных компонентов, требующих продвинутых возможностей расчета сходства MCU.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل المكونات الإلكترونية الذي يحتاج إلىقدرات متقدمة لحساب تشابه MCU."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate with the lib-electronic-components library for metadata-driven similarity architecture, utilizing SpecImportance levels, ToleranceRule types, and SimilarityProfile contexts for precise calculations.","zh":"使代理能够集成lib-electronic-components库，利用SpecImportance级别、ToleranceRule类型和SimilarityProfile上下文实现精确的相似度计算","ja":"SpecImportanceレベル、ToleranceRuleタイプ、SimilarityProfileコンテキストを利用して精密な類似度計算を実現するためのlib-electronic-componentsライブラリとの統合を可能に","ko":"SpecImportance 수준, ToleranceRule 유형, SimilarityProfile 컨텍스트를 사용하여 정확한 유사성 계산을 구현하기 위한 lib-electronic-components 라이브러리와의 통합을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrarse con la biblioteca lib-electronic-components para una arquitectura de similitud basada en metadatos, utilizando niveles de SpecImportance, tipos de ToleranceRule y contextos de SimilarityProfile para cálculos precisos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer la bibliothèque lib-electronic-components pour une architecture de similitude basée sur des métadonnées, en utilisant des niveaux SpecImportance, des types ToleranceRule et des contextes SimilarityProfile pour des calculs précis.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, sich in die Bibliothek lib-electronic-components zu integrieren, um eine metadatenbasierte Ähnlichkeitsarchitektur zu nutzen, die SpecImportance-Levels, ToleranceRule-Typen und SimilarityProfile-Kontexte für präzise Berechnungen verwendet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a integrar-se com a biblioteca lib-electronic-components para arquitetura de similaridade baseada em metadados, utilizando níveis de SpecImportance, tipos de ToleranceRule e contextos de SimilarityProfile para cálculos precisos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам интегрироваться с библиотекой lib-electronic-components для архитектуры сходства на основе метаданных, используя уровни SpecImportance, типы ToleranceRule и контексты SimilarityProfile для точных расчетов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التكامل مع مكتبة lib-electronic-components من أجل هندسة تشابه تعتمد على البيانات الوصفية، مستخدمين مستويات SpecImportance وأصناف ToleranceRule وسياقات SimilarityProfile للحصول على حسابات دقيقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Calculating MCU similarities for design phase optimization","Automating replacement suggestions based on tolerance rules and similarity profiles","Generating cost optimization reports by analyzing MCU similarities and differences"],"zh":["计算MCU相似度以优化设计阶段","根据容差规则和相似性配置文件自动建议替换","通过分析MCU相似度和差异生成成本优化报告"],"ja":["設計段階の最適化のためのMCUの類似度の計算","許容ルールと類似性プロファイルに基づく自動的な置き換えの提案","MCUの類似度と差異の分析によるコスト最適化レポートの生成"],"ko":["설계 단계 최적화를 위한 MCU 유사성 계산","容差 규칙 및 유사성 프로파일을 기반으로 자동으로 대체 제안","MCU 유사성 및 차이 분석을 통한 비용 최적화 보고서 생성"],"es":["Cálculo de similitudes de MCU para la optimización de la fase de diseño","Automatización de sugerencias de reemplazo basadas en reglas de tolerancia y perfiles de similitud","Generación de informes de optimización de costos mediante el análisis de similitudes y diferencias de MCU"],"fr":["Calcul de similitudes de MCU pour l''optimisation de la phase de conception","Automatisation des suggestions de remplacement basées sur les règles de tolérance et les profils de similitude","Génération de rapports d''optimisation des coûts en analysant les similitudes et les différences de MCU"],"de":["Berechnung von MCU-Ähnlichkeiten für die Optimierung der Entwurfsphase","Automatisierung von Ersatzvorschlägen basierend auf Toleranzregeln und Ähnlichkeitsprofilen","Erstellung von Kostenoptimierungsberichten durch Analyse von MCU-Ähnlichkeiten und -Unterschieden"],"pt":["Cálculo de similaridades de MCU para otimização da fase de design","Automatização de sugestões de substituição com base em regras de tolerância e perfis de similaridade","Geração de relatórios de otimização de custos por análise de similaridades e diferenças de MCU"],"ru":["Расчет сходства MCU для оптимизации фазы проектирования","Автоматизация предложений по замене на основе правил допуска и профилей сходства","Генерация отчетов об оптимизации затрат путем анализа сходства и различий MCU"],"ar":["حساب تشابه MCU لتحسين مرحلة التصميم","تحويل اقتراحات الاستبدال تلقائيًا بناءً على قواعد التسامح وملفات تعريف التشابه","توليد تقارير تحسين التكلفة من خلال تحليل التشابه والاختلافات في MCU"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with lib-electronic-components library","Limited to metadata-driven similarity architecture"],"zh":["需要集成lib-electronic-components库","仅限于元数据驱动的相似度架构"],"ja":["lib-electronic-componentsライブラリとの統合が必要","メタデータ駆動の類似度アーキテクチャに限定"],"ko":["lib-electronic-components 라이브러리와의 통합이 필요","메타데이터 주도 유사성 아키텍처에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere integración con la biblioteca lib-electronic-components","Limitado a la arquitectura de similitud basada en metadatos"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec la bibliothèque lib-electronic-components","Limité à l''architecture de similitude basée sur des métadonnées"],"de":["Erfordert Integration in die Bibliothek lib-electronic-components","Begrenzt auf die metadatenbasierte Ähnlichkeitsarchitektur"],"pt":["Requer integração com a biblioteca lib-electronic-components","Limitado à arquitetura de similaridade baseada em metadados"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с библиотекой lib-electronic-components","Ограничен архитектурой сходства на основе метаданных"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع مكتبة lib-electronic-components","محدود بهندسة التشابه التي تعتمد على البيانات الوصفية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('vallafederico/webflow-dev-setup/webflow-editor-integration', 'community', 'vallafederico', 'webflow-dev-setup', 'vallafederico/webflow-dev-setup', 'webflow-editor-integration', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z', '2026-02-18T03:41:33.863Z', NULL, '{"id":"vallafederico/webflow-dev-setup/webflow-editor-integration","name":"webflow-editor-integration","description":{"zh":"本文介绍如何在 Webflow 中集成自定义代码，确保编辑器和发布站点的兼容性","ja":"この記事では、Webflow でカスタムコードを統合し、エディターと公開サイトの両方で正常に動作させる方法について説明します","ko":"이 문서는 Webflow 에서 커스텀 코드를 통합하여 에디터와 발행 사이트의 호환성을 보장하는 방법을 설명합니다","es":"Esta habilidad explica cómo garantizar que su código personalizado no interfiera con el Diseñador/Editor de Webflow","fr":"Cette compétence explique comment s''assurer que votre code personnalisé n''interfère pas avec le Concepteur/Éditeur Webflow","de":"Diese Fähigkeit erklärt, wie Sie sicherstellen, dass Ihr benutzerdefinierter Code nicht mit dem Webflow-Designer/Editor interferiert","pt":"A integração do Editor Webflow permite que você use código personalizado sem interferir no Designer. Aprenda a fazer isso com esta habilidade.","ru":"Интеграция редактора Webflow позволяет использовать собственный код без нарушения работы дизайнера. Узнайте, как это сделать с помощью этого навыка.","ar":"تكامل محرر Webflow يسمح لك باستخدام كود مخصص بدون التداخل مع مصمم. تعلم كيفية القيام بذلك بهذه المهارة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Webflow 编辑器集成 - 免费开发指南","ja":"Webflow エディター統合 - 開発者向けガイド","ko":"Webflow 에디터 통합 - 개발자 위한 가이드","es":"Integración de Editor de Webflow","fr":"Intégration de l''éditeur Webflow","de":"Webflow-Editor-Integration","pt":"Integração do Editor Webflow","ru":"Интеграция редактора Webflow","ar":"تكامل محرر Webflow","en":"webflow-editor-integration"},"description":{"zh":"本文介绍如何在 Webflow 中集成自定义代码，确保编辑器和发布站点的兼容性","ja":"この記事では、Webflow でカスタムコードを統合し、エディターと公開サイトの両方で正常に動作させる方法について説明します","ko":"이 문서는 Webflow 에서 커스텀 코드를 통합하여 에디터와 발행 사이트의 호환성을 보장하는 방법을 설명합니다","es":"Esta habilidad explica cómo garantizar que su código personalizado no interfiera con el Diseñador/Editor de Webflow","fr":"Cette compétence explique comment s''assurer que votre code personnalisé n''interfère pas avec le Concepteur/Éditeur Webflow","de":"Diese Fähigkeit erklärt, wie Sie sicherstellen, dass Ihr benutzerdefinierter Code nicht mit dem Webflow-Designer/Editor interferiert","pt":"A integração do Editor Webflow permite que você use código personalizado sem interferir no Designer. Aprenda a fazer isso com esta habilidade.","ru":"Интеграция редактора Webflow позволяет использовать собственный код без нарушения работы дизайнера. Узнайте, как это сделать с помощью этого навыка.","ar":"تكامل محرر Webflow يسمح لك باستخدام كود مخصص بدون التداخل مع مصمم. تعلم كيفية القيام بذلك بهذه المهارة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["编辑器检测","自定义代码集成","发布站点兼容性","无缝体验","Webflow Designer/Editor 支持"],"ja":["エディター検出","カスタムコード統合","公開サイトの互換性","シームレスな体験","Webflow デザイナー/エディターのサポート"],"ko":["에디터 감지","커스텀 코드 통합","발행 사이트 호환성","무결한 경험","Webflow 디자이너/에디터 지원"],"es":["Detección del Editor de Webflow","Desactivación de la interacción en el modo Diseñador","Uso de la biblioteca @webflow/detect-editor","Compatibilidad con el sitio publicado","Personalización del código para el Editor de Webflow"],"fr":["Détection de l''éditeur Webflow","Désactivation de l''interaction en mode Concepteur","Utilisation de la bibliothèque @webflow/detect-editor","Compatibilité avec le site publié","Personnalisation du code pour l''éditeur Webflow"],"de":["Erkennung des Webflow-Editors","Deaktivierung der Interaktion im Designer-Modus","Verwendung der Bibliothek @webflow/detect-editor","Kompatibilität mit der veröffentlichten Website","Anpassung des Codes für den Webflow-Editor"],"pt":["Detecção do Editor","Uso de código personalizado","Compatibilidade com o Designer","Funcionalidade completa no site publicado","Importação de bibliotecas","Suporte a TypeScript"],"ru":["Обнаружение редактора","Использование собственного кода","Совместимость с дизайнером","Полная функциональность на опубликованном сайте","Импорт библиотек","Поддержка TypeScript"],"ar":["كشف المحرر","استخدام الكود المخصص","التوافق مع المصمم","الوظيفة الكاملة على الموقع المنشور","استيراد المكتبات","دعم TypeScript"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Webflow","编辑器集成","自定义代码","发布站点","兼容性","无缝体验","Webflow Designer/Editor"],"ja":["Webflow","エディター統合","カスタムコード","公開サイト","互換性","シームレスな体験","Webflow デザイナー/エディター"],"ko":["Webflow","에디터 통합","커스텀 코드","발행 사이트","호환성","무결한 경험","Webflow 디자이너/에디터"],"es":["integración de editor de webflow","diseñador webflow","editor webflow","compatibilidad con webflow","personalización de código webflow","desarrollo web con webflow"],"fr":["intégration de l''éditeur webflow","concepteur webflow","éditeur webflow","compatibilité avec webflow","personnalisation de code webflow","développement web avec webflow"],"de":["webflow-editor-integration","webflow-designer","webflow-editor","kompatibilität mit webflow","code-anpassung für webflow","webentwicklung mit webflow"],"pt":["Integração do Editor Webflow","Código personalizado","Designer Webflow","Detecção do Editor","TypeScript","Desenvolvimento web","Webflow","Editor de código"],"ru":["Интеграция редактора Webflow","Собственный код","Дизайнер Webflow","Обнаружение редактора","TypeScript","Веб-разработка","Webflow","Редактор кода"],"ar":["تكامل محرر Webflow","الكود المخصص","مصمم Webflow","كشف المحرر","TypeScript","تطوير الويب","Webflow","محرر الكود"]}},"owner":"vallafederico","repo":"webflow-dev-setup","repoPath":"vallafederico/webflow-dev-setup","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"webflow-editor-integration","description":"Handle Webflow Designer/Editor mode vs Published site behavior. Use when detecting the editor, disabling custom animations in the designer, or managing features based on the environment.","bodyPreview":"# Webflow Editor Integration\n\nThis skill explains how to ensure your custom code doesn''t interfere with the Webflow Designer/Editor while providing full functionality on the published site.\n\n## Editor Detection\n\nImport `handleEditor` from `@webflow/detect-editor`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { handleEditor } from \"@webflow/detect-editor\";\n\nexport default function (element: HTMLElement, dataset: DOMStringMap) {\n  handleEditor((isEditor) => {\n    if (isEditor) {\n      // Designer Mode: disable interacti","body":"# Webflow Editor Integration\n\nThis skill explains how to ensure your custom code doesn''t interfere with the Webflow Designer/Editor while providing full functionality on the published site.\n\n## Editor Detection\n\nImport `handleEditor` from `@webflow/detect-editor`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { handleEditor } from \"@webflow/detect-editor\";\n\nexport default function (element: HTMLElement, dataset: DOMStringMap) {\n  handleEditor((isEditor) => {\n    if (isEditor) {\n      // Designer Mode: disable interactions, reset animations\n      element.style.pointerEvents = \"none\";\n      element.style.transform = \"none\";\n      element.style.opacity = \"1\";\n    } else {\n      // Published Mode: enable functionality\n      element.style.pointerEvents = \"auto\";\n    }\n  });\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:41:33.863Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing seamless Webflow Designer/Editor integration and published site functionality.","zh":"非常适合需要无缝集成Webflow Designer/Editor和已发布站点功能的前端代理。","ja":"Webflow Designer/Editorと公開サイトの機能をシームレスに統合する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"웹플로우 디자이너/에디터와 게시된 사이트 기능을无缝으로 통합해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan una integración sin problemas con Webflow Designer/Editor y funcionalidad de sitio publicado.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une intégration transparente de Webflow Designer/Editor et de fonctionnalités de site publié.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine nahtlose Integration von Webflow Designer/Editor und veröffentlichter Website benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de integração perfeita com o Webflow Designer/Editor e funcionalidade de site publicado.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходима бесшовная интеграция с Webflow Designer/Editor и функциональность опубликованного сайта.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج مثالي مع مصمم/محرر Webflow ووظيفة الموقع المنشور."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to detect and adapt to Webflow''s Designer/Editor mode using the @webflow/detect-editor library, ensuring custom code doesn''t interfere with the editor while providing full functionality on published sites via handleEditor and DOMStringMap.","zh":"赋予代理检测和适应Webflow的Designer/Editor模式的能力，使用@webflow/detect-editor库，确保自定义代码不会干扰编辑器，同时在发布的站点上提供完整的功能，通过handleEditor和DOMStringMap。","ja":"@webflow/detect-editorライブラリを使用して、Webflowのデザイナー/エディタモードを検出して適応する能力をエージェントに付与し、カスタムコードがエディタと干渉しないようにする同时、公開サイトではhandleEditorとDOMStringMapを介して完全な機能を提供する。","ko":"@webflow/detect-editor 라이브러리를 사용하여 웹플로우의 디자이너/에디터 모드를 탐지하고 적응할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여하여, 사용자 지정 코드가 편집기와 상호 작용하지 않도록 하면서, 게시된 사이트에서는 handleEditor와 DOMStringMap를 통해 완전한 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a detectar y adaptarse al modo Designer/Editor de Webflow mediante la biblioteca @webflow/detect-editor, asegurando que el código personalizado no interfiera con el editor mientras proporciona funcionalidad completa en sitios publicados a través de handleEditor y DOMStringMap.","fr":"Permet aux agents de détecter et de s''adapter au mode Designer/Editor de Webflow en utilisant la bibliothèque @webflow/detect-editor, garantissant que le code personnalisé n''interfère pas avec l''éditeur tout en fournissant une fonctionnalité complète sur les sites publiés via handleEditor et DOMStringMap.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, den Designer/Editor-Modus von Webflow mit der Bibliothek @webflow/detect-editor zu erkennen und anzupassen, sodass der benutzerdefinierte Code den Editor nicht stört und gleichzeitig die volle Funktionalität auf veröffentlichten Seiten über handleEditor und DOMStringMap bietet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a detectar e se adaptar ao modo do Designer/Editor do Webflow usando a biblioteca @webflow/detect-editor, garantindo que o código personalizado não interfira com o editor, enquanto fornece funcionalidade completa nos sites publicados via handleEditor e DOMStringMap.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать и адаптироваться к режиму Designer/Editor Webflow с помощью библиотеки @webflow/detect-editor, гарантируя, что пользовательский код не мешает редактору, обеспечивая при этом полную функциональность на опубликованных сайтах через handleEditor и DOMStringMap.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من اكتشاف وتكيف مع وضع مصمم/محرر Webflow باستخدام مكتبة @webflow/detect-editor، مما يضمن ألا يتداخل الكود المخصص مع المحرر، مع تقديم وظيفة كاملة على المواقع المنشورة عبر handleEditor وDOMStringMap."},"useCases":{"en":["Detecting Webflow Designer/Editor mode to disable interactions","Implementing conditional logic for published site functionality","Integrating custom code with Webflow''s editor using handleEditor"],"zh":["检测Webflow Designer/Editor模式以禁用交互","为发布的站点功能实现条件逻辑","使用handleEditor将自定义代码与Webflow编辑器集成"],"ja":["Webflowデザイナー/エディタモードを検出してインタラクションを無効にする","公開サイトの機能のための条件ロジックを実装する","handleEditorを使用してカスタムコードをWebflowエディタと統合する"],"ko":["웹플로우 디자이너/에디터 모드를 감지하여 상호 작용을 비활성화 하는 것","게시된 사이트의 기능을 위한 조건부 논리를 구현하는 것","handleEditor를 사용하여 사용자 지정 코드를 웹플로우 편집기와 통합하는 것"],"es":["Detección del modo Designer/Editor de Webflow para deshabilitar interacciones","Implementación de lógica condicional para funcionalidad de sitio publicado","Integración de código personalizado con el editor de Webflow mediante handleEditor"],"fr":["Détection du mode Designer/Editor de Webflow pour désactiver les interactions","Mise en œuvre de la logique conditionnelle pour les fonctionnalités de site publié","Intégration du code personnalisé avec l''éditeur de Webflow à l''aide de handleEditor"],"de":["Erkennung des Designer/Editor-Modus von Webflow, um Interaktionen zu deaktivieren","Implementierung von bedingter Logik für die Funktionalität von veröffentlichten Seiten","Integration von benutzerdefiniertem Code mit dem Webflow-Editor über handleEditor"],"pt":["Detecção do modo do Designer/Editor do Webflow para desabilitar interações","Implementação de lógica condicional para funcionalidade do site publicado","Integração de código personalizado com o editor do Webflow usando handleEditor"],"ru":["Обнаружение режима Designer/Editor Webflow для отключения взаимодействий","Реализация условной логики для функциональности опубликованного сайта","Интеграция пользовательского кода с редактором Webflow с помощью handleEditor"],"ar":["اكتشاف وضع مصمم/محرر Webflow لإلغاء تفاعلات","تنفيذ منطق شرطي لوظيفة الموقع المنشور","دمج الكود المخصص مع محرر Webflow باستخدام handleEditor"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires @webflow/detect-editor library import","Limited to Webflow Designer/Editor and published site environments"],"zh":["需要导入@webflow/detect-editor库","仅限于Webflow Designer/Editor和发布的站点环境"],"ja":["@webflow/detect-editorライブラリのインポートが必要","Webflowデザイナー/エディタと公開サイトの環境のみに限定される"],"ko":["@webflow/detect-editor 라이브러리를导入해야 함","웹플로우 디자이너/에디터 및 게시된 사이트 환경에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la importación de la biblioteca @webflow/detect-editor","Limitado a entornos de Webflow Designer/Editor y sitios publicados"],"fr":["Nécessite l''importation de la bibliothèque @webflow/detect-editor","Limité aux environnements de Webflow Designer/Editor et de sites publiés"],"de":["Benötigt die Importierung der Bibliothek @webflow/detect-editor","Begrenzt auf Webflow Designer/Editor- und veröffentlichte Website-Umgebungen"],"pt":["Requer importação da biblioteca @webflow/detect-editor","Limitado a ambientes do Webflow Designer/Editor e site publicado"],"ru":["Требует импорта библиотеки @webflow/detect-editor","Ограничен средами Designer/Editor Webflow и опубликованного сайта"],"ar":["يتطلب استيراد مكتبة @webflow/detect-editor","محدود ببيئات مصمم/محرر Webflow والموقع المنشور"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('ohare93/juggle/sandbox-setup', 'community', 'ohare93', 'juggle', 'ohare93/juggle', 'sandbox-setup', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z', '2026-02-18T03:40:43.087Z', NULL, '{"id":"ohare93/juggle/sandbox-setup","name":"sandbox-setup","description":{"zh":"Sandbox Setup 技术通过分析代码库和生成定制权限，实现代码自动化执行","ja":"サンドボックス設定スキルはコードベースを分析し、カスタマイズされた権限を生成してコード自動化を実行する","ko":"샌드박스 설정 기술은 코드베이스를 분석하고 맞춤형 권한을 생성하여 코드 자동화 실행을 구현합니다","es":"Esta skill CLI analiza automáticamente tu repositorio para detectar lenguajes de programación, gestores de paquetes y herramientas de build. Genera configuraciones de permisos optimizadas en .claude/settings.json para la ejecución autónoma de agentes IA con Ralph Loops.","fr":"Cette skill CLI analyse automatiquement votre dépôt pour détecter les langages de programation, gestionnaires de paquets et outils de build. Génère des configurations de permissions optimisées dans .claude/settings.json pour l''exécution autonome d''agents IA avec Ralph Loops.","de":"Dieser CLI-Skill analysiert automatisch Ihr Repository, um Programmiersprachen, Paketmanager und Build-Tools zu erkennen. Er generiert optimierte Berechtigungskonfigurationen in .claude/settings.json für die autonome Ausführung von KI-Agenten mit Ralph Loops.","pt":"O sandbox-setup é uma habilidade que configura o Claude Code para execução autônoma de agentes","ru":"Sandbox-setup - это навык, который настраивает Claude Code для автономного выполнения агентов","ar":"حماية الرمل هي مهارة لإعداد كلود كود لتنفيذ وكلاء ذاتي","en":"CLI Ralph Loops with Good UX"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Sandbox Setup 技术","ja":"サンドボックス設定スキル","ko":"샌드박스 설정 기술","es":"Configuración Sandbox CLI: Optimiza Ralph Loops para Agen...","fr":"Configuration Sandbox CLI : Optimisez Ralph Loops pour Ag...","de":"Sandbox-Setup CLI: Ralph Loops für autonome Agenten optim...","pt":"C