"Identification des serveurs de développement et leurs ports","Génération automatique de permissions personnalisées pour .claude/settings.json","Configuration optimisée pour l''exécution autonome d''agents IA"],"de":["Automatische Erkennung von Programmiersprachen (Go, Python, Node.js, Rust)","Identifikation von Paketmanagern (go mod, npm, pip, cargo)","Erkennung von Build-Tools und Test-Runnern","Identifikation von Entwicklungsservern und deren Ports","Automatische Generierung angepasster Berechtigungen für .claude/settings.json","Optimierte Konfiguration für autonome KI-Agenten Ausführung"],"pt":["Análise de código para detecção de linguagens de programação","Geração de permissões personalizadas para .claude/settings.json","Suporte a pacotes e gerenciadores de pacotes","Detecção de ferramentas de build e testes","Configuração de servidores de desenvolvimento e portas"],"ru":["Анализ кода для обнаружения языков программирования","Генерация индивидуальных разрешений для .claude/settings.json","Поддержка пакетов и менеджеров пакетов","Обнаружение инструментов сборки и тестирования","Настройка серверов разработки и портов"],"ar":["تحليل الكود لاكتشاف لغات البرمجة","توليد أذونات مخصصة ل .claude/settings.json","دعم الحزم ومديرات الحزم","اكتشاف أدوات البناء والاختبار","إعداد خادم التطوير والمنافذ"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Sandbox Setup","代码自动化","CLI Ralph Loops","开发体验优化","代码分析","定制权限"],"ja":["サンドボックス設定","コード自動化","CLI Ralph Loops","開発体験の最適化","コード分析","カスタマイズされた権限"],"ko":["샌드박스 설정","코드 자동화","CLI Ralph Loops","개발 경험 개선","코드 분석","맞춤형 권한"],"es":["cli ralph loops","sandbox setup skill","configuración agente autónomo",".claude/settings.json permisos","detección automática lenguajes programación","optimización ejecución agentes IA","herramientas desarrollo automáticas","configuración repositorio automática"],"fr":["cli ralph loops","sandbox setup skill","configuration agent autonome",".claude/settings.json permissions","détection automatique langages programmation","optimisation exécution agents IA","outils développement automatiques","configuration dépôt automatique"],"de":["cli ralph loops","sandbox setup skill","autonomer agent konfiguration",".claude/settings.json berechtigungen","automatische spracherkennung programmierung","optimierung ki-agenten ausführung","automatische entwicklungstools","automatische repository konfiguration"],"pt":["sandbox-setup","Claude Code","configuração de sandbox","execução autônoma de agentes","análise de código","permissões personalizadas","pacotes e gerenciadores de pacotes"],"ru":["sandbox-setup","Claude Code","настройка песочницы","автономное выполнение агентов","анализ кода","индивидуальные разрешения","пакеты и менеджеры пакетов"],"ar":["حماية الرمل","كلود كود","إعداد حماية الرمل","تنفيذ وكلاء ذاتي","تحليل الكود","أذونات مخصصة","حزم ومديرات الحزم"]}},"owner":"ohare93","repo":"juggle","repoPath":"ohare93/juggle","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.410Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sandbox-setup","description":"Configure Claude Code sandbox settings for this repository","bodyPreview":"# Sandbox Setup Skill\n\nConfigure Claude Code for optimal autonomous agent execution in this repository.\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes your codebase** to detect:\n   - Programming languages (Go, Python, Node.js, Rust, etc.)\n   - Package managers (go mod, npm, pip, cargo, etc.)\n   - Build tools and test runners\n   - Dev servers and their ports\n\n2. **Generates tailored permissions** for `.claude/settings.json`:\n   - Allow commands for detected tools\n   - Network access for package registri","body":"# Sandbox Setup Skill\n\nConfigure Claude Code for optimal autonomous agent execution in this repository.\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n1. **Analyzes your codebase** to detect:\n   - Programming languages (Go, Python, Node.js, Rust, etc.)\n   - Package managers (go mod, npm, pip, cargo, etc.)\n   - Build tools and test runners\n   - Dev servers and their ports\n\n2. **Generates tailored permissions** for `.claude/settings.json`:\n   - Allow commands for detected tools\n   - Network access for package registries\n   - File system permissions for build outputs\n\n3. **Preserves existing settings**:\n   - Merges with hooks configuration\n   - Keeps deny rules for secrets\n   - Maintains ask rules for git push\n\n## How to Use\n\nWhen invoked, I will:\n1. Scan the repository for configuration files (package.json, go.mod, Cargo.toml, requirements.txt, etc.)\n2. Ask clarifying questions about your workflow\n3. Present proposed settings for your approval\n4. Update .claude/settings.json\n\n## Detection Patterns\n\nI look for these files to detect your stack:\n- `go.mod` → Go (go build, go test, go mod)\n- `package.json` → Node.js (npm, yarn, pnpm, node)\n- `Cargo.toml` → Rust (cargo build, cargo test)\n- `requirements.txt` / `pyproject.toml` → Python (pip, python, pytest)\n- `Gemfile` → Ruby (bundle, ruby, rake)\n- `pom.xml` / `build.gradle` → Java (mvn, gradle)\n- `devbox.json` → Devbox (devbox run)\n\n## Settings Structure\n\nThe generated settings follow this structure:\n```json\n{\n  \"sandbox\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"autoAllowBashIfSandboxed\": true\n  },\n  \"permissions\": {\n    \"allow\": [\"Bash(detected-tools:*)\"],\n    \"deny\": [\"Read(./.env)\", \"Read(./secrets/**)\"],\n    \"ask\": [\"Bash(juggle agent:*)\", \"Bash(git push:*)\"]\n  },\n  \"hooks\": { ... }\n}\n```\n\n## Reference\n\nFor detailed sandbox configuration options, see:\nhttps://www.nathanonn.com/claude-code-sandbox-explained/\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:40:43.087Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous Agents like Claude Code needing streamlined sandbox environments with tailored permissions for optimal execution.","zh":"非常适合像Claude Code这样的自主代理，它们需要具有定制权限的简化沙盒环境以实现最佳执行。","ja":"Claude Codeのような自律エージェントに最適で、最適な実行のために調整されたパーミッションを持つ合理化されたサンドボックス環境を必要とします。","ko":"Claude Code와 같은 자율 에이전트에 완벽하게 적합하며, 최적의 실행을 위해 맞춤형 권한을 갖춘 간소화된 샌드박스 환경이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Autónomos como Claude Code que necesitan entornos de sandbox optimizados con permisos personalizados para una ejecución óptima.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents Autonomes comme Claude Code qui nécessitent des environnements de sandbox rationalisés avec des autorisations personnalisées pour une exécution optimale.","de":"Perfekt für autonome Agenten wie Claude Code, die optimierte Sandbox-Umgebungen mit maßgeschneiderten Berechtigungen für eine optimale Ausführung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Autônomos como Claude Code que necessitam de ambientes de sandbox otimizados com permissões personalizadas para execução ótima.","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов, таких как Claude Code, требующих оптимизированных песочниц с настраиваемыми разрешениями для оптимального выполнения.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مثل كلود كود الذي يحتاج إلى بيئات رملية محسنة مع أذونات مخصصة لتنفيذ مثالي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze codebases, detect programming languages, and generate permissions for .claude/settings.json, allowing seamless network access for package registries and enabling commands for detected tools like go mod, npm, and pip.","zh":"使代理能够分析代码库、检测编程语言并为.claude/settings.json生成权限，从而为软件包注册表提供无缝网络访问，并为检测到的工具（如go mod、npm和pip）启用命令。","ja":"エージェントがコードベースを分析し、プログラミング言語を検出し、.claude/settings.jsonのパーミッションを生成することを可能にし、パッケージレジストリへのシームレスなネットワークアクセスを提供し、go mod、npm、pipなどの検出されたツールのコマンドを有効にします。","ko":"에이전트가 코드베이스를 분석하고, 프로그래밍 언어를 감지하며, .claude/settings.json에 대한 권한을 생성할 수 있도록 하여, 패키지 레지스트리에 대한 원활한 네트워크 액세스를 제공하고, go mod, npm, pip와 같이 감지된 도구에 대한 명령을 활성화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes analizar bases de código, detectar lenguajes de programación y generar permisos para .claude/settings.json, lo que permite un acceso de red sin problemas a los registros de paquetes y habilita comandos para herramientas detectadas como go mod, npm y pip.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les bases de code, de détecter les langages de programmation et de générer des autorisations pour .claude/settings.json, ce qui permet un accès réseau sans problème aux registres de packages et active des commandes pour les outils détectés comme go mod, npm et pip.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Codebasen zu analysieren, Programmiersprachen zu erkennen und Berechtigungen für .claude/settings.json zu generieren, was einen reibungslosen Netzwerkzugriff auf Paketregister und die Aktivierung von Befehlen für erkannte Tools wie go mod, npm und pip ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar bases de código, detectar linguagens de programação e gerar permissões para .claude/settings.json, permitindo acesso de rede sem interrupções para registros de pacotes e habilitando comandos para ferramentas detectadas como go mod, npm e pip.","ru":"Позволяет агентам анализировать кодовые базы, обнаруживать языки программирования и генерировать разрешения для .claude/settings.json, обеспечивая беспрепятственный доступ к сетевым регистрам пакетов и включая команды для обнаруженных инструментов, таких как go mod, npm и pip.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحليل قواعد البيانات البرمجية، وكشف لغات البرمجة، وتوليد الأذونات لـ .claude/settings.json، مما يسمح بالوصول الشبكي دون عرقلة إلى سجلات حزم البرامج وتمكين أوامر لأدوات محددة مثل go mod و npm و pip."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating sandbox setup for autonomous agent execution","Generating tailored permissions for .claude/settings.json","Detecting programming languages and package managers in codebases"],"zh":["自动化自主代理执行的沙盒设置","为.claude/settings.json生成定制权限","检测代码库中的编程语言和包管理器"],"ja":["自律エージェント実行のためのサンドボックス設定の自動化",".claude/settings.jsonのための調整されたパーミッションの生成","コードベース内のプログラミング言語とパッケージマネージャーの検出"],"ko":["자율 에이전트 실행을 위한 샌드박스 설정 자동화",".claude/settings.json에 대한 맞춤형 권한 생성","코드베이스에서 프로그래밍 언어 및 패키지 관리자 감지"],"es":["Automatizar la configuración del sandbox para la ejecución de agentes autónomos","Generar permisos personalizados para .claude/settings.json","Detectar lenguajes de programación y administradores de paquetes en bases de código"],"fr":["Automatiser la configuration du sandbox pour l''exécution d''agents autonomes","Générer des autorisations personnalisées pour .claude/settings.json","Détecter les langages de programmation et les gestionnaires de packages dans les bases de code"],"de":["Automatisierung der Sandbox-Konfiguration für die Ausführung von autonomen Agenten","Generierung von maßgeschneiderten Berechtigungen für .claude/settings.json","Erkennung von Programmiersprachen und Paketmanagern in Codebasen"],"pt":["Automatizar configuração de sandbox para execução de agente autônomo","Gerar permissões personalizadas para .claude/settings.json","Detectar linguagens de programação e gerenciadores de pacotes em bases de código"],"ru":["Автоматизировать настройку песочницы для выполнения автономного агента","Генерировать настраиваемые разрешения для .claude/settings.json","Обнаруживать языки программирования и менеджеры пакетов в кодовых базах"],"ar":["تحسين إعدادات بيئة الرمل للعميل الذاتي","توليد أذونات مخصصة لـ .claude/settings.json","كشف لغات البرمجة وأدوات إدارة الحزم في قواعد البيانات البرمجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to codebase and package manager configurations","Limited to supported programming languages and package managers"],"zh":["需要访问代码库和包管理器配置","仅限于支持的编程语言和包管理器"],"ja":["コードベースおよびパッケージマネージャーの設定へのアクセスが必要","サポートされているプログラミング言語とパッケージマネージャーに限定される"],"ko":["코드베이스 및 패키지 관리자 구성에 대한 액세스 필요","지원되는 프로그래밍 언어 및 패키지 관리자로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la configuración de la base de código y del administrador de paquetes","Limitado a lenguajes de programación y administradores de paquetes compatibles"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la configuration de la base de code et du gestionnaire de packages","Limité aux langages de programmation et aux gestionnaires de packages pris en charge"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Codebase- und Paketmanager-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf unterstützte Programmiersprachen und Paketmanager"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código e configurações do gerenciador de pacotes","Limitado a linguagens de programação e gerenciadores de pacotes suportados"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовой базе и конфигурациям менеджера пакетов","Ограничен поддерживаемыми языками программирования и менеджерами пакетов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة البيانات البرمجية وإعدادات مدير الحزم","محدود باللغات البرمجية وأدوات إدارة الحزم المدعومة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Cantara/lib-electronic-components/st', 'community', 'Cantara', 'lib-electronic-components', 'Cantara/lib-electronic-components', 'st', 0, 0, 35, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z', '2026-02-18T03:41:39.068Z', NULL, '{"id":"Cantara/lib-electronic-components/st","name":"st","description":{"zh":"STMicroelectronics是一家领先的半导体制造商，提供 широк范围的组件，包括STM32、STM8、ST MOSFETs、L78/L79和运算放大器","ja":"STマイクロエレクトロニクスは、半導体製造のリーダーで、STM32、STM8、ST MOSFETs、L78/L79、オペアンプなどの幅広いコンポーネントを提供しています","ko":"ST 마이크로일렉트로닉스는 선도적인 반도체 제조업체로, STM32, STM8, ST MOSFETs, L78/L79, 오퍼앰프 등을 포함한 다양한 구성 요소를 제공합니다","es":"STMicroelectronics es un fabricante líder de componentes electrónicos, ofreciendo una amplia gama de productos, incluyendo microcontroladores, MOSFETs y reguladores de voltaje lineales","fr":"STMicroelectronics est un fabricant leader de composants électroniques, offrant une gamme étendue de produits, y compris des microcontrôleurs, des MOSFETs et des régulateurs de tension linéaires","de":"STMicroelectronics ist ein führender Hersteller von elektronischen Komponenten und bietet eine breite Palette von Produkten an, darunter Mikrocontroller, MOSFETs und lineare Spannungsregler","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"ST微电子（ST）制造商技能","ja":"STマイクロエレクトロニクス（ST）メーカースキル","ko":"ST 마이크로일렉트로닉스(ST) 제조업체 스킬","es":"STMicroelectronics: Componentes y Microcontroladores","fr":"STMicroelectronics: Composants et Microcontrôleurs","de":"STMicroelectronics: Komponenten und Mikrocontroller","en":"st"},"description":{"zh":"STMicroelectronics是一家领先的半导体制造商，提供 широк范围的组件，包括STM32、STM8、ST MOSFETs、L78/L79和运算放大器","ja":"STマイクロエレクトロニクスは、半導体製造のリーダーで、STM32、STM8、ST MOSFETs、L78/L79、オペアンプなどの幅広いコンポーネントを提供しています","ko":"ST 마이크로일렉트로닉스는 선도적인 반도체 제조업체로, STM32, STM8, ST MOSFETs, L78/L79, 오퍼앰프 등을 포함한 다양한 구성 요소를 제공합니다","es":"STMicroelectronics es un fabricante líder de componentes electrónicos, ofreciendo una amplia gama de productos, incluyendo microcontroladores, MOSFETs y regu...","fr":"STMicroelectronics est un fabricant leader de composants électroniques, offrant une gamme étendue de produits, y compris des microcontrôleurs, des MOSFETs et...","de":"STMicroelectronics ist ein führender Hersteller von elektronischen Komponenten und bietet eine breite Palette von Produkten an, darunter Mikrocontroller, MOS...","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["STM32 32位ARM Cortex-M微控制器","STM8 8位微控制器","ST MOSFETs 电源晶体管","L78/L79 线性电压调节器","运算放大器"],"ja":["STM32 32ビットARM Cortex-Mマイクロコントローラ","STM8 8ビットマイクロコントローラ","ST MOSFETs パワートランジスタ","L78/L79 リニア電圧レギュレータ","オペアンプ"],"ko":["STM32 32비트 ARM Cortex-M 마이크로컨트롤러","STM8 8비트 마이크로컨트롤러","ST MOSFETs 전력 트랜지스터","L78/L79 선형 전압 조정기","오퍼앰프"],"es":["Microcontroladores STM32 de 32 bits","Microcontroladores STM8 de 8 bits","MOSFETs de potencia","Reguladores de voltaje lineales L78/L79","Amplificadores operacionales"],"fr":["Microcontrôleurs STM32 32 bits","Microcontrôleurs STM8 8 bits","MOSFETs de puissance","Régulateurs de tension linéaires L78/L79","Amplificateurs opérationnels"],"de":["Mikrocontroller STM32 mit 32 Bit","Mikrocontroller STM8 mit 8 Bit","Leistungsmosfets","Lineare Spannungsregler L78/L79","Operationsverstärker"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ST微电子","STM32","STM8","ST MOSFETs","L78/L79","运算放大器","半导体制造","微控制器"],"ja":["STマイクロエレクトロニクス","STM32","STM8","ST MOSFETs","L78/L79","オペアンプ","半導体製造","マイクロコントローラ"],"ko":["ST 마이크로일렉트로닉스","STM32","STM8","ST MOSFETs","L78/L79","오퍼앰프","반도체 제조","마이크로컨트롤러"],"es":["STMicroelectronics","microcontroladores","MOSFETs","reguladores de voltaje","amplificadores operacionales","desarrollo de hardware","electrónica de potencia"],"fr":["STMicroelectronics","microcontrôleurs","MOSFETs","régulateurs de tension","amplificateurs opérationnels","développement de matériel","électronique de puissance"],"de":["STMicroelectronics","Mikrocontroller","MOSFETs","Spannungsregler","Operationsverstärker","Hardware-Entwicklung","Leistungselektronik"]}},"owner":"Cantara","repo":"lib-electronic-components","repoPath":"Cantara/lib-electronic-components","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"st","description":"STMicroelectronics MPN encoding patterns, suffix decoding, and handler guidance. Use when working with STM32, STM8, ST MOSFETs, or L78/L79 regulators.","bodyPreview":"# STMicroelectronics (ST) Manufacturer Skill\n\n## Product Families\n\nSTMicroelectronics produces a wide range of components:\n- **STM32** - 32-bit ARM Cortex-M microcontrollers\n- **STM8** - 8-bit microcontrollers\n- **ST MOSFETs** - Power transistors (STF, STP, STD, STB, STW)\n- **L78/L79** - Linear voltage regulators\n- **Op-amps** - Various analog ICs\n\n---\n\n## STM32 Microcontroller Naming\n\n### MPN Structure\n\n```\nSTM32 F 1 03 C 8 T 6\n  │   │ │  │ │ │ │ │\n  │   │ │  │ │ │ │ └── Temperature range (6 =","body":"# STMicroelectronics (ST) Manufacturer Skill\n\n## Product Families\n\nSTMicroelectronics produces a wide range of components:\n- **STM32** - 32-bit ARM Cortex-M microcontrollers\n- **STM8** - 8-bit microcontrollers\n- **ST MOSFETs** - Power transistors (STF, STP, STD, STB, STW)\n- **L78/L79** - Linear voltage regulators\n- **Op-amps** - Various analog ICs\n\n---\n\n## STM32 Microcontroller Naming\n\n### MPN Structure\n\n```\nSTM32 F 1 03 C 8 T 6\n  │   │ │  │ │ │ │ │\n  │   │ │  │ │ │ │ └── Temperature range (6 = -40 to 85°C)\n  │   │ │  │ │ │ └── Package (T = LQFP)\n  │   │ │  │ │ └── Flash size (8 = 64KB)\n  │   │ │  │ └── Pin count (C = 48 pins)\n  │   │ │  └── Line (03 = access line)\n  │   │ └── Core (1 = Cortex-M3)\n  │   └── Type (F = Mainstream)\n  └── Family (STM32)\n```\n\n### Type Letters (after STM32)\n\n| Letter | Type | Description |\n|--------|------|-------------|\n| F | Mainstream | General purpose, good balance |\n| L | Low-power | Ultra-low-power modes |\n| H | High-performance | High clock speeds, more features |\n| G | General-purpose | Newer mainstream series |\n| W | Wireless | Integrated radio (BLE, LoRa) |\n| U | Ultra-low-power | Next-gen low-power |\n\n### Core Digit\n\n| Digit | Core | Notes |\n|-------|------|-------|\n| 0 | Cortex-M0/M0+ | Entry level |\n| 1 | Cortex-M3 | Mainstream |\n| 2 | Cortex-M3 | Performance |\n| 3 | Cortex-M4 | DSP instructions |\n| 4 | Cortex-M4 | With FPU |\n| 7 | Cortex-M7 | High performance |\n\n### Pin Count Codes\n\n| Code | Pins | Notes |\n|------|------|-------|\n| F | 20 | Smallest |\n| G | 28 | |\n| K | 32 | |\n| T | 36 | |\n| S | 44 | |\n| C | 48 | Common |\n| R | 64-66 | Popular |\n| V | 100 | |\n| Z | 144 | |\n| I | 176 | Largest |\n\n### Flash Size Codes\n\n| Code | Size | Notes |\n|------|------|-------|\n| 4 | 16 KB | |\n| 6 | 32 KB | |\n| 8 | 64 KB | Common |\n| B | 128 KB | |\n| C | 256 KB | |\n| D | 384 KB | |\n| E | 512 KB | |\n| F | 768 KB | |\n| G | 1024 KB | |\n| H | 1536 KB | |\n| I | 2048 KB | Largest |\n\n### Package Codes\n\n| Code | Package | Description |\n|------|---------|-------------|\n| T | LQFP | Low-profile Quad Flat Pack |\n| H | BGA | Ball Grid Array |\n| U | VFQFPN | Very thin Fine-pitch QFN |\n| Y | WLCSP | Wafer Level Chip Scale |\n| P | TSSOP | Thin Shrink SOP |\n\n### Temperature Range\n\n| Code | Range | Application |\n|------|-------|-------------|\n| 6 | -40 to +85°C | Industrial |\n| 7 | -40 to +105°C | Extended |\n\n### Example Decoding\n\n```\nSTM32F103C8T6\n│     │  │││││\n│     │  ││││└── 6 = -40 to +85°C\n│     │  │││└── T = LQFP package\n│     │  ││└── 8 = 64KB Flash\n│     │  │└── C = 48 pins\n│     │  └── 03 = Access line (medium density)\n│     └── F1 = Mainstream Cortex-M3\n└── STM32 family\n\nResult: Mainstream M3 MCU, 48-pin LQFP, 64KB Flash, Industrial temp\nCommon Name: \"Blue Pill\" MCU\n```\n\n---\n\n## STM8 Microcontroller Naming\n\n### Structure\n\n```\nSTM8 S 003 F 3 P 6\n  │  │  │  │ │ │ │\n  │  │  │  │ │ │ └── Temperature range\n  │  │  │  │ │ └── Package\n  │  │  │  │ └── Flash size\n  │  │  │  └── Pin count\n  │  │  └── Line\n  │  └── Type (S=Standard, L=Low-power, A=Automotive)\n  └── STM8 family\n```\n\n---\n\n## ST Power MOSFET Naming\n\n### Package Prefix\n\n| Prefix | Package | Notes |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| STF | TO-220FP | Isolated tab |\n| STP | TO-220 | Standard |\n| STD | DPAK (TO-252) | Surface mount |\n| STB | D²PAK (TO-263) | High power SMD |\n| STW | TO-247 | High power through-hole |\n| VN | Various | N-channel series |\n| VP | Various | P-channel series |\n\n### Naming Pattern\n\n```\nST [Package] [Current] [Channel] [Voltage] [Suffix]\n│     │         │         │         │         │\n│     │         │         │         │         └── Technology (F, L, etc.)\n│     │         │         │         └── Voltage class (20=200V, 25=250V)\n│     │         │         └── Channel (N=N-ch, P=P-ch)\n│     │         └── Current rating (amps)\n│     └── Package code (F, P, D, B, W)\n└── ST prefix\n```\n\n### Example Decoding\n\n```\nSTF5N52U\n│││ │ ││\n│││ │ │└── U = technology suffix\n│││ │ └── 52 = 520V class\n│││ └── N = N-channel\n││└── 5 = ~5A rating\n│└── F = TO-220FP package\n└── ST prefix\n```\n\n---\n\n## L78/L79 Voltage Regulator Naming\n\n### Structure\n\n```\nL 78 [Voltage] [Grade] [Package]\n│  │     │        │        │\n│  │     │        │        └── Package suffix\n│  │     │        └── Temperature grade (optional)\n│  │     └── Output voltage (05=5V, 12=12V, etc.)\n│  └── 78=Positive, 79=Negative\n└── L prefix (ST designation)\n```\n\n### Package Suffixes\n\n| Suffix | Package | Description |\n|--------|---------|-------------|\n| CV | TO-220 | Standard through-hole |\n| V | TO-220 | Alternate |\n| CP | TO-220FP | Isolated tab |\n| P | TO-220FP | Alternate |\n| CD2T | D²PAK | High power SMD |\n| D2T | D²PAK | Alternate |\n| CDT | DPAK | SMD |\n| DT | DPAK | Alternate |\n\n### Grade Codes\n\n| Grade | Temperature | Notes |\n|-------|-------------|-------|\n| (none) | 0 to +125°C | Standard |\n| C | 0 to +125°C | Commercial |\n| A | -40 to +125°C | Extended |\n| AB | -40 to +125°C | Extended |\n| AC | 0 to +125°C | Standard |\n\n### Example Decoding\n\n```\nL7805CV\n│ ││ ││\n│ ││ │└── V = through-hole variant\n│ ││ └── C = Commercial grade\n│ │└── 05 = 5V output\n│ └── 78 = Positive regulator\n└── L prefix\n\nL7912ACD2T\n│ ││ │ │ │\n│ ││ │ │ └── T = tape packaging\n│ ││ │ └── D2 = D²PAK\n│ ││ └── AC = standard temp grade\n│ │└── 12 = -12V output\n│ └── 79 = Negative regulator\n└── L prefix\n```\n\n---\n\n## Handler Implementation Notes\n\n### STM32 Package Extraction (CRITICAL BUG)\n\nCurrent STHandler has a bug in `extractPackageCode()`:\n```java\n// WRONG - Tries to match last 2 chars as package+temp\nString lastTwo = upperMpn.substring(upperMpn.length() - 2);\n// For STM32F103C8T6: lastTwo = \"T6\"\n// Then validates: \"TUVRY\".indexOf(''T'') >= 0 && isDigit(''6'')\n// This passes but returns \"T6\" instead of just \"T\" (LQFP)\n```\n\n**Correct approach:**\n```java\n// STM32F103C8T6 → Package is second-to-last char: \"T\"\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STM32\") && upperMpn.length() >= 2) {\n    char packageChar = upperMpn.charAt(upperMpn.length() - 2);\n    return switch (packageChar) {\n        case ''T'' -> \"LQFP\";\n        case ''H'' -> \"BGA\";\n        case ''U'' -> \"VFQFPN\";\n        case ''Y'' -> \"WLCSP\";\n        case ''P'' -> \"TSSOP\";\n        default -> String.valueOf(packageChar);\n    };\n}\n```\n\n### MOSFET Package Extraction\n\n```java\n// Extract from prefix: STF = TO-220FP, STP = TO-220, STD = DPAK\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STF\")) return \"TO-220FP\";\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STP\")) return \"TO-220\";\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STD\")) return \"DPAK\";\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STB\")) return \"D2PAK\";\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STW\")) return \"TO-247\";\n```\n\n### Series Extraction\n\n```java\n// STM32F103C8T6 → Series: STM32F103 (or STM32F1)\n// For STM32: Extract up to and including line number\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STM32\")) {\n    // STM32 + Type + Core + Line = STM32F103\n    // Match pattern: STM32[A-Z][0-9]{1,3}\n    Pattern p = Pattern.compile(\"^(STM32[A-Z][0-9]{1,3})\");\n    Matcher m = p.matcher(upperMpn);\n    if (m.find()) return m.group(1);\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Related Files\n\n- Handler: `manufacturers/STHandler.java`\n- Component types: `MICROCONTROLLER_ST`, `MCU_ST`, `MOSFET_ST`, `VOLTAGE_REGULATOR_LINEAR_ST`\n- Test: `handlers/STHandlerTest.java` (72 tests)\n\n---\n\n## Handler Implementation Learnings (PR #81)\n\n### Fixed Issues\n\nAll issues discovered during analysis have been fixed:\n\n1. ~~HashSet in getSupportedTypes()~~ - Changed to `Set.of()`\n2. ~~Debug println statements~~ - Removed\n3. ~~Package extraction bug~~ - Now returns \"LQFP\" for STM32, \"TO-220\" for MOSFETs, etc.\n4. ~~Voltage regulator regex broken~~ - Fixed with proper prefix matching\n\n### Package Code Extraction (Fixed)\n\n```java\n// STM32/STM8: Package is second-to-last character\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STM32\") || upperMpn.startsWith(\"STM8\")) {\n    char packageChar = upperMpn.charAt(upperMpn.length() - 2);\n    return switch (packageChar) {\n        case ''T'' -> \"LQFP\";\n        case ''H'' -> \"BGA\";\n        case ''U'' -> \"VFQFPN\";\n        // ...\n    };\n}\n\n// MOSFETs: Package is in prefix\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STF\")) return \"TO-220FP\";\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"STP\")) return \"TO-220\";\n// ...\n\n// Voltage regulators: Strip prefix and grade, then match suffix\nString suffix = upperMpn.replaceFirst(\"^[LM]C?7[89]\\\\d{2}\", \"\")\n                       .replaceFirst(\"^[A-C]{1,2}\", \"\");\n// CV → TO-220, D2T → D2PAK, etc.\n```\n\n### Cross-Handler Pattern Matching Bug\n\nWhen handler A''s `matches()` falls through to `patterns.matches(mpn, type)`, it can accidentally match patterns registered by handler B.\n\n**Fix in AtmelHandler**: Don''t fall through to pattern matching for base `MICROCONTROLLER` type - return false if prefix check fails. This prevents AtmelHandler from matching STM32 MPNs.\n\n---\n\n## Learnings & Edge Cases\n\n- **STM32 package code is NOT last 2 chars** - It''s the second-to-last char only\n- **Temperature is the last digit** - 6 or 7, not part of package\n- **MOSFET package is in PREFIX** - Unlike most components where it''s suffix\n- **L78/L79 have multiple suffix styles** - CV, V, D2T, DT, etc.\n- **STM32F4 naming differs slightly** - Some devices don''t follow standard pattern\n- **Pattern registry is shared across handlers** - Must use explicit prefix checks for base types to avoid cross-matching\n\n---\n\n## Sources\n\n- [Understanding STM32 Naming Conventions - DigiKey](https://www.digikey.com/en/maker/tutorials/2020/understanding-stm32-naming-conventions)\n- [STM32 Naming Scheme - Ziutek](https://ziutek.github.io/2018/05/07/stm32_naming_scheme.html)\n- [L78 Datasheet - STMicroelectronics](https://www.st.com/resource/en/datasheet/l78.pdf)\n- [Power MOSFETs - STMicroelectronics](https://www.st.com/en/power-transistors/power-mosfets.html)\n\n<!-- Add new learnings above this line -->\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:41:39.068Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Electronics Agents requiring detailed knowledge of STMicroelectronics components and microcontrollers","zh":"适合需要详细了解意法半导体组件和微控制器的电子代理商","ja":"STMicroelectronicsコンポーネントおよびマイクロコントローラーの詳細な知識を必要とするエレクトロニクスエージェントに最適","ko":"STM마이크로일렉트로닉스 구성 요소 및 마이크로컨트롤러에 대한 자세한 지식을 필요로 하는 전자 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de electrónica que requieren conocimiento detallado de los componentes y microcontroladores de STMicroelectronics","fr":"Idéal pour les agents électroniques nécessitant une connaissance détaillée des composants et microcontrôleurs STMicroelectronics","de":"Ideal für Electronics-Agenten, die detaillte Kenntnisse über STMicroelectronics-Komponenten und -Mikrocontroller benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Eletrônica que exigem conhecimento detalhado dos componentes e microcontroladores da STMicroelectronics","ru":"Идеально для электронных агентов, требующих детального знания компонентов и микроконтроллеров STMicroelectronics","ar":"مثالي لعميل الإلكترونيات الذي يتطلب معرفة تفصيلية عن مكونات ومicrocontrollers من STMicroelectronics"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to navigate the complexities of STM32 and STM8 microcontrollers, utilizing ST MOSFETs, L78/L79 linear voltage regulators, and various op-amps, all while understanding the nuances of STM32 microcontroller naming conventions and MPN structures","zh":"赋予代理商导航STM32和STM8微控制器的复杂性，利用ST MOSFET、L78/L79线性电压调节器和各种运算放大器，同时理解STM32微控制器命名约定和MPN结构的细微差别","ja":"STM32およびSTM8マイクロコントローラーの複雑さをエージェントがナビゲートできるようにし、ST MOSFET、L78/L79線形電圧レギュレータ、およびさまざまなオペアンプを利用し、STM32マイクロコントローラーの命名規則およびMPN構造のニュアンスを理解","ko":"에이전트가 STM32 및 STM8 마이크로컨트롤러의 복잡성을 탐색할 수 있도록 하며, ST MOSFET, L78/L79 선형 전압 조정기 및 다양한 오퍼앰프를 활용하고, STM32 마이크로컨트롤러命명 규칙 및 MPN 구조의 미묘한 차이를 이해","es":"Permite a los agentes navegar por las complejidades de los microcontroladores STM32 y STM8, utilizando MOSFETs de ST, reguladores de voltaje lineales L78/L79 y varios amplificadores operacionales, todo mientras entienden las nuances de las convenciones de nomenclatura de microcontroladores STM32 y las estructuras de MPN","fr":"Permet aux agents de naviguer dans les complexités des microcontrôleurs STM32 et STM8, en utilisant les MOSFETs ST, les régulateurs de tension linéaires L78/L79 et divers amplificateurs opérationnels, tout en comprenant les nuances des conventions de nommage des microcontrôleurs STM32 et des structures MPN","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Komplexitäten der Mikrocontroller STM32 und STM8 zu navigieren, indem sie ST-MOSFETs, L78/L79-Linearspannungsregler und verschiedene Operationsverstärker verwenden, während sie die Nuancen der Benennungskonventionen der STM32-Mikrocontroller und der MPN-Strukturen verstehen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a navegar pelas complexidades dos microcontroladores STM32 e STM8, utilizando ST MOSFETs, reguladores de tensão linear L78/L79 e vários op-amps, ao mesmo tempo em que entende as nuances das convenções de nomenclatura de microcontroladores STM32 e estruturas de MPN","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью ориентироваться в сложностях микроконтроллеров STM32 и STM8, используя ST MOSFET, линейные стабилизаторы напряжения L78/L79 и различные операционные усилители, одновременно понимая нюансы соглашений об именовании микроконтроллеров STM32 и структуры MPN","ar":"يمنح الوكيل القدرة على التنقل في التعقيدات микروكونترولر STM32 وSTM8، مع استخدام MOSFETs من ST، ومنظمات الجهد الخطية L78 / L79، ودارات عمليات متعددة، وفي الوقت نفسه فهم دقة اتفاقيات تسمية microcontrollers STM32 وهياكل MPN"},"useCases":{"en":["Decoding STM32 microcontroller part numbers for component selection","Identifying suitable ST MOSFETs for power management applications","Exploring the capabilities of STM8 microcontrollers for 8-bit projects"],"zh":["解码STM32微控制器部件编号以进行组件选择","识别适合电源管理应用的ST MOSFET","探索STM8微控制器的8位项目功能"],"ja":["コンポーネントの選択のためにSTM32マイクロコントローラーのパーツ番号を解読する","電源管理アプリケーションに適したST MOSFETを識別する","8ビットプロジェクトのSTM8マイクロコントローラーの機能を探索する"],"ko":["구성 요소 선택을 위해 STM32 마이크로컨트롤러 부분 번호를 해독","전원 관리 응용 프로그램에 적합한 ST MOSFET 식별","8비트 프로젝트를 위한 STM8 마이크로컨트롤러의 기능 탐색"],"es":["Decodificar números de piezas de microcontroladores STM32 para la selección de componentes","Identificar MOSFETs de ST adecuados para aplicaciones de gestión de potencia","Explorar las capacidades de los microcontroladores STM8 para proyectos de 8 bits"],"fr":["Décoder les numéros de pièces des microcontrôleurs STM32 pour la sélection de composants","Identifier les MOSFETs ST appropriés pour les applications de gestion de puissance","Explorer les capacités des microcontrôleurs STM8 pour les projets 8 bits"],"de":["Decodieren von Teilenummern von STM32-Mikrocontrollern für die Auswahl von Komponenten","Ermitteln geeigneter ST-MOSFETs für Leistungsmanagement-Anwendungen","Erforschen der Fähigkeiten der STM8-Mikrocontroller für 8-Bit-Projekte"],"pt":["Decodificação de números de peça de microcontrolador STM32 para seleção de componentes","Identificação de MOSFETs ST adequados para aplicações de gerenciamento de energia","Explorando as capacidades dos microcontroladores STM8 para projetos de 8 bits"],"ru":["Декодирование номеров деталей микроконтроллера STM32 для выбора компонентов","Определение подходящих MOSFET от ST для приложений управления питанием","Изучение возможностей микроконтроллеров STM8 для проектов с 8-битными процессорами"],"ar":["فك شفرة أرقام قطع microcontrollers STM32 لتحديد المكونات","تحديد MOSFETs المناسبة من ST لتطبيقات إدارة الطاقة","استكشاف إمكانيات microcontrollers STM8 لمشاريع 8 بت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of electronics and microcontroller fundamentals","Focused exclusively on STMicroelectronics products"],"zh":["需要电子和微控制器基础知识","专注于意法半导体产品"],"ja":["電子およびマイクロコントローラーの基礎知識が必要","STマイクロエレクトロニクスの製品にのみ焦点を当てている"],"ko":["전자 및 마이크로컨트롤러 기초 지식이 필요","STM마이크로일렉트로닉스 제품에만 집중"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de fundamentos de electrónica y microcontroladores","Se centra exclusivamente en productos de STMicroelectronics"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des fondamentaux de l''électronique et des microcontrôleurs","Se concentre exclusivement sur les produits STMicroelectronics"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse über Grundlagen der Elektronik und Mikrocontroller","Konzentriert sich ausschließlich auf STMicroelectronics-Produkte"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de fundamentos de eletrônica e microcontroladores","Focado exclusivamente em produtos da STMicroelectronics"],"ru":["Требует знания основ электроники и микроконтроллеров","Сосредоточен исключительно на продуктах STMicroelectronics"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة أساسيات الإلكترونيات والميكروكونترولر","متاح حصريًا لمنتجات STMicroelectronics"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('crmagz/cdk-constructs-library/naming-conventions', 'community', 'crmagz', 'cdk-constructs-library', 'crmagz/cdk-constructs-library', 'naming-conventions', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z', '2026-02-18T03:41:38.865Z', NULL, '{"id":"crmagz/cdk-constructs-library/naming-conventions","name":"naming-conventions","description":{"zh":"AWS CDK 命名约定是一套用于提高代码可读性和可维护性的指南","ja":"AWS CDK のネーミング規約は、コードの可読性と維持性を向上させるためのガイドラインです","ko":"AWS CDK 명명 규칙은 코드의 가독성과 유지 보수성을 향상시키기 위한 지침입니다","es":"El kit de desarrollo de AWS Cloud (CDK) proporciona constructores y utilidades para aplicaciones de AWS, siguiendo convenciones de nomenclatura específicas.","fr":"Le kit de développement cloud d''AWS (CDK) fournit des constructeurs et des utilitaires pour les applications AWS, suivant des conventions de dénomination spécifiques.","de":"Das AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK) bietet Konstrukte und Utilities für AWS-Anwendungen, die bestimmte Namenskonventionen befolgen.","pt":"Conheça as convenções de nomenclatura para desenvolvedores de software e como elas podem melhorar a legibilidade do seu código","ru":"Ознакомьтесь с конвенциями именования для разработчиков программного обеспечения и узнайте, как они могут улучшить читаемость вашего кода","ar":"تعرف على اتفاقيات التسمية للمطورين واكتشف كيف يمكنها تحسين قراءة كودك","en":"A comprehensive AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK) library providing infrastructure-as-code constructs and utilities for AWS applications"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AWS CDK 命名约定","ja":"AWS CDK ネーミング規約","ko":"AWS CDK 명명 규칙","es":"Convenciones de nomenclatura para CDK de AWS","fr":"Conventions de dénomination pour CDK AWS","de":"Namenskonventionen für AWS CDK","pt":"Convenções de Nomenclatura para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Конвенции Именования для Разработчиков","ar":"اتفاقيات التسمية للمطورين","en":"naming-conventions"},"description":{"zh":"AWS CDK 命名约定是一套用于提高代码可读性和可维护性的指南","ja":"AWS CDK のネーミング規約は、コードの可読性と維持性を向上させるためのガイドラインです","ko":"AWS CDK 명명 규칙은 코드의 가독성과 유지 보수성을 향상시키기 위한 지침입니다","es":"El kit de desarrollo de AWS Cloud (CDK) proporciona constructores y utilidades para aplicaciones de AWS, siguiendo convenciones de nomenclatura específicas.","fr":"Le kit de développement cloud d''AWS (CDK) fournit des constructeurs et des utilitaires pour les applications AWS, suivant des conventions de dénomination spé...","de":"Das AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK) bietet Konstrukte und Utilities für AWS-Anwendungen, die bestimmte Namenskonventionen befolgen.","pt":"Conheça as convenções de nomenclatura para desenvolvedores de software e como elas podem melhorar a legibilidade do seu código","ru":"Ознакомьтесь с конвенциями именования для разработчиков программного обеспечения и узнайте, как они могут улучшить читаемость вашего кода","ar":"تعرف على اتفاقيات التسمية للمطورين واكتشف كيف يمكنها تحسين قراءة كودك","en":"A comprehensive AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK) library providing infrastructure-as-code constructs and utilities for AWS applications"},"definition":{"en":"A comprehensive AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK) library providing infrastructure-as-code constructs and utilities for AWS applications"},"features":{"zh":["使用 PascalCase 命名类型和枚举","使用 camelCase 命名函数和变量","提高代码可读性和可维护性","遵循类型驱动开发原则"],"ja":["型と列挙型は PascalCase を使用","関数と変数は camelCase を使用","コードの可読性と維持性を向上","型駆動開発の原則に従う"],"ko":["유형과 열거형은 PascalCase를 사용","함수와 변수는 camelCase를 사용","코드의 가독성과 유지 보수성을 향상","유형驱动 개발 원칙을 따름"],"es":["Convenciones de nomenclatura para tipos y enumerados","Uso de declaraciones de tipo en lugar de interfaces","Seguimiento de la convención PascalCase para tipos y enumerados","Uso de camelCase para funciones y variables"],"fr":["Conventions de dénomination pour les types et les énumérations","Utilisation de déclarations de type au lieu d''interfaces","Suivi de la convention PascalCase pour les types et les énumérations","Utilisation de camelCase pour les fonctions et les variables"],"de":["Namenskonventionen für Typen und Enumerations","Verwendung von Typdeklarationen anstelle von Schnittstellen","Befolgung der PascalCase-Konvention für Typen und Enumerations","Verwendung von camelCase für Funktionen und Variablen"],"pt":["Uso de type declarations em vez de interface","Nomenclatura em PascalCase para tipos e enums","Nomenclatura em camelCase para funções e variáveis","Melhoria da legibilidade do código","Padronização da nomenclatura"],"ru":["Использование объявлений типа вместо интерфейса","Именование в стиле PascalCase для типов и перечислений","Именование в стиле camelCase для функций и переменных","Улучшение читаемости кода","Стандартизация именования"],"ar":["استخدام إعلانات النوع بدلاً من الواجهة","تسمية بالحالة PascalCase لأنواع والعدد","تسمية بالحالة camelCase للدوال والمتغيرات","تحسين قراءة الكود","توحيد الاتفاقيات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AWS CDK","命名约定","类型驱动开发","PascalCase","camelCase","代码可读性","代码维护性"],"ja":["AWS CDK","ネーミング規約","型駆動開発","PascalCase","camelCase","コード可読性","コード維持性"],"ko":["AWS CDK","명명 규칙","유형驱动 개발","PascalCase","camelCase","코드 가독성","코드 유지 보수성"],"es":["convenciones de nomenclatura","desarrollo de infraestructura como código","AWS CDK","tipos y enumerados","declaraciones de tipo","camelCase"],"fr":["conventions de dénomination","développement d''infrastructures en tant que code","AWS CDK","types et énumérations","déclarations de type","camelCase"],"de":["Namenskonventionen","Entwicklung von Infrastruktur als Code","AWS CDK","Typen und Enumerations","Typdeklarationen","camelCase"],"pt":["convenções de nomenclatura","desenvolvimento de software","legibilidade do código","type declarations","PascalCase","camelCase","nomenclatura de variáveis","nomenclatura de funções"],"ru":["конвенции именования","разработка программного обеспечения","читаемость кода","объявления типа","PascalCase","camelCase","именование переменных","именование функций"],"ar":["اتفاقيات التسمية","تطوير البرمجيات","قراءة الكود","إعلانات النوع","PascalCase","camelCase","تسمية المتغيرات","تسمية الدوال"]}},"owner":"crmagz","repo":"cdk-constructs-library","repoPath":"crmagz/cdk-constructs-library","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"naming-conventions","description":"Naming conventions for types, functions, files, and resources. Use when creating new code or reviewing naming patterns. Emphasizes type-driven development.","bodyPreview":"# Naming Conventions\n\n## Type Naming\n\n**Use `type` declarations, not `interface`.** This codebase follows type-driven development.\n\n| Type                 | Convention           | Example                                                      |\n| -------------------- | -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Types, Enums         | PascalCase           | `EnvironmentConfig`, `CodeArtifactStackProps`, `BucketProps` |\n| Functions, Variables | camelCase","body":"# Naming Conventions\n\n## Type Naming\n\n**Use `type` declarations, not `interface`.** This codebase follows type-driven development.\n\n| Type                 | Convention           | Example                                                      |\n| -------------------- | -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Types, Enums         | PascalCase           | `EnvironmentConfig`, `CodeArtifactStackProps`, `BucketProps` |\n| Functions, Variables | camelCase            | `createBucket`, `bucketName`                                 |\n| AWS Resource Names   | kebab-case           | `my-bucket-dev-use1`                                         |\n| Enum Values          | SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE | `Account.PROD`, `Region.US_EAST_1`                           |\n\n**Type Naming Pattern:**\n\n```typescript\n// CORRECT - Use type declarations\nexport type BucketProps = {\n    bucketName: string;\n    env: EnvironmentConfig[''env''];\n};\n\nexport type EnvironmentConfig = {\n    name: string;\n    region: string;\n    account: string;\n};\n\n// INCORRECT - Don''t use interface\nexport interface BucketProps {\n    // ❌\n    bucketName: string;\n}\n```\n\n## Resource Naming Pattern\n\nInclude environment and region to prevent naming collisions:\n\n```typescript\n// Resource naming pattern\n`${resourceName}-${props.env.name}-${props.env.region}`\n// Examples\n`aurora-cluster-dev-use1``api-gateway-prod-use1``waf-acl-staging-use1`;\n```\n\n## Function Naming\n\nUse `verbNoun` pattern for function names:\n\n```typescript\n// CORRECT\nexport const createBucket = () => {};\nexport const getVpcConfig = () => {};\nexport const updateSecurityGroup = () => {};\n\n// INCORRECT\nexport const bucketCreate = () => {};\nexport const VpcConfigGet = () => {};\n```\n\n## File Naming\n\n- Constructs: `kebab-case.ts` (e.g., `api-gateway.ts`)\n- Types: `kebab-case-type.ts` or `kebab-case.ts` in types directory\n- Enums: `kebab-case-enum.ts` or `kebab-case.ts` in enum directory\n- Utilities: `kebab-case.ts` in util directory\n\n## Export Patterns\n\n- Each package exports from `src/index.ts`\n- Root package exports from `src/index.ts`\n- Use named exports, avoid default exports where possible\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:41:38.865Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Generation Agents needing consistent naming conventions in AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK) projects.","zh":"非常适合需要在AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK)项目中保持一致的命名约定的代码生成代理。","ja":"AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK) プロジェクトで一貫した命名規則を必要とするコード生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK) 프로젝트에서 일관된命명 규칙이 필요한 코드 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Generación de Código que necesitan convenciones de nomenclatura consistentes en proyectos de AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK).","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Génération de Code nécessitant des conventions de nommage cohérentes dans les projets de AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK).","de":"Perfekt für Code-Generierungsagenten, die konsistente Benennungskonventionen in AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK)-Projekten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Código que necessitam de convenções de nomenclatura consistentes em projetos do AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK).","ru":"Идеально для агентов генерации кода, которым необходимы последовательные соглашения об именовании в проектах AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK).","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يولدون الشفرة و kteří يحتاجون إلى اتفاقيات تسمية متسقة في مشاريعAWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce PascalCase for types and enums, and camelCase for functions and variables, ensuring consistency across infrastructure-as-code constructs and utilities for AWS applications using type declarations.","zh":"赋予代理人强制使用PascalCase对类型和枚举进行命名，并使用camelCase对函数和变量进行命名，确保在基础设施即代码构造和AWS应用程序使用类型声明的实用程序中保持一致性。","ja":"エージェントに、型と列挙型にはPascalCase、関数と変数にはcamelCaseを使用することを強制する権限を与え、AWSアプリケーションで型宣言を使用するインフラストラクチャ即コード構成およびユーティリティで一貫性を保証します。","ko":"에이전트에게 타입과 열거형에는 PascalCase를, 함수와 변수에는 camelCase를 사용하도록 강제하여, AWS 애플리케이션에서 타입 선언을 사용하는 인프라스트럭처 즉 코드 구성 및 유틸리티에서 일관성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar PascalCase para tipos y enumeraciones, y camelCase para funciones y variables, asegurando la coherencia en constructos y utilidades de infraestructura como código para aplicaciones de AWS que utilizan declaraciones de tipo.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer PascalCase pour les types et les énumérations, et camelCase pour les fonctions et les variables, assurant ainsi la cohérence dans les constructeurs et les utilitaires d''infrastructure comme code pour les applications AWS utilisant des déclarations de type.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, PascalCase für Typen und Enumerations und camelCase für Funktionen und Variablen zu erzwingen, um die Konsistenz über Infrastruktur-als-Code-Konstrukte und -Utilitys für AWS-Anwendungen mit Typdeklarationen hinweg zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor PascalCase para tipos e enums, e camelCase para funções e variáveis, garantindo a consistência em construtos e utilitários de infraestrutura-como-código para aplicações AWS que usam declarações de tipo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать использование PascalCase для типов и перечислений, и camelCase для функций и переменных, гарантируя последовательность во всех конструкциях и утилитах инфраструктуры-как-кода для приложений AWS, использующих объявления типов.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من فرض PascalCase للأنواع والقوائم المُعدة، وcamelCase للدوال والمتغيرات، مما يضمن الاتساق عبر بنية تحتية كود والبرامج المساعدة لتطبيقات AWS التي تستخدم الإعلانات النوع."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing consistent naming conventions in CDK projects","Generating type-driven development code with correct casing","Validating naming conventions for AWS application infrastructure"],"zh":["在CDK项目中强制保持一致的命名约定","使用正确的大写生成类型驱动开发代码","验证AWS应用程序基础设施的命名约定"],"ja":["CDKプロジェクトで一貫した命名規則を強制する","正しい大文字で型駆動開発コードを生成する","AWSアプリケーションのインフラストラクチャの命名規則を検証する"],"ko":["CDK 프로젝트에서 일관된命명 규칙을 강제합니다","올바른 대소문자로 타입 주도 개발 코드를 생성합니다","AWS 애플리케이션 인프라의命명 규칙을 검증합니다"],"es":["Aplicar convenciones de nomenclatura coherentes en proyectos de CDK","Generar código de desarrollo dirigido por tipos con mayúsculas y minúsculas correctas","Validar convenciones de nomenclatura para la infraestructura de aplicaciones de AWS"],"fr":["Appliquer des conventions de nommage cohérentes dans les projets de CDK","Générer du code de développement piloté par les types avec des majuscules et minuscules correctes","Valider les conventions de nommage pour l''infrastructure des applications AWS"],"de":["Konsistente Benennungskonventionen in CDK-Projekten durchsetzen","Typgetriebenen Entwicklungscodes mit korrekter Groß- und Kleinschreibung generieren","Benennungskonventionen für die Infrastruktur von AWS-Anwendungen validieren"],"pt":["Impor convenções de nomenclatura consistentes em projetos CDK","Gerar código de desenvolvimento orientado a tipos com caixa correta","Validar convenções de nomenclatura para infraestrutura de aplicações AWS"],"ru":["Обеспечить последовательные соглашения об именовании в проектах CDK","Генерировать код типо-ориентированного развития с правильным регистром","Проверить соглашения об именовании для инфраструктуры приложений AWS"],"ar":["فرض اتفاقيات تسمية متسقة في مشاريع CDK","توليد شفرة تطوير مدفوع بالنوع مع حالة صحيحة","تحقق من اتفاقيات التسمية للبنية التحتية لتطبيقات AWS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of type-driven development","Specific to AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK)"],"zh":["需要了解类型驱动开发","特定于AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK)"],"ja":["型駆動開発の理解が必要","AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK) に特有"],"ko":["타입 주도 개발에 대한 이해가 필요합니다","AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK) 에 특정"],"es":["Requiere comprensión del desarrollo dirigido por tipos","Específico de AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK)"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension du développement piloté par les types","Spécifique à AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK)"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis für typgetriebene Entwicklung","Spezifisch für AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK)"],"pt":["Exige compreensão do desenvolvimento orientado a tipos","Específico para o AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK)"],"ru":["Требует понимания типо-ориентированного развития","Конкретно для AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK)"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم التطوير الموجه للنوع","محدد ل AWS Cloud Development Kit (CDK)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
