","pt":"Conectores Sullins: Soluções de Conexão de Alta Qualidade","ru":"Разъемы Sullins: Надежные решения для подключения","ar":"مُوَصِّلات سولينز: حلول اتصالعالية الجودة","en":"sullins"},"description":{"zh":"Sullins 连接器解决方案提供了编码的 MPN 结构，包括 SBH/SFH 系列，用于快速识别产品规格","ja":"Sullins コネクタ ソリューションでは、符号化された MPN 構造を提供し、SBH/SFH シリーズを使用して製品仕様を迅速に識別します","ko":"Sullins 커넥터 솔루션은 인코딩된 MPN 구조를 제공하며 SBH/SFH 시리즈를 사용하여 제품 사양을 빠르게 식별합니다","es":"Sullins es un fabricante de conectores de alta calidad que ofrece soluciones innovadoras para la industria de la electrónica. Sus productos incluyen conector...","fr":"Sullins est un fabricant de connecteurs de haute qualité qui propose des solutions innovantes pour l''industrie de l''électronique. Ses produits comprennent de...","de":"Sullins ist ein Hersteller von hochwertigen Steckverbindern, der innovative Lösungen für die Elektronikindustrie anbietet. Zu seinen Produkten gehören Steckv...","pt":"Sullins é um fabricante de conectores que oferece soluções de conexão de alta qualidade, incluindo a série SBH/SFH com especificações codificadas","ru":"Sullins - производитель разъемов, предлагающий высококачественные решения для подключения, включая серию SBH/SFH с закодированными спецификациями","ar":"سولينز هي شركة مصنعة لموصلات تقدم حلول اتصالعالية الجودة، بما في ذلك سلسلة SBH/SFH ذات المواصفات المُشفرة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["编码的 MPN 结构","SBH/SFH 系列","快速识别产品规格","支持多种连接类型","高质量的连接器制造"],"ja":["符号化された MPN 構造","SBH/SFH シリーズ","製品仕様の迅速な識別","複数のコネクタ タイプをサポート","高品質のコネクタ製造"],"ko":["인코딩된 MPN 구조","SBH/SFH 시리즈","제품 사양의 빠른 식별","다양한 커넥터 유형 지원","고품질의 커넥터 제조"],"es":["Conectores de caja y conectores planos","Estructura de MPN con especificaciones codificadas","Series SBH/SFH con variaciones de contacto y montaje","Opciones de color y montaje personalizadas","Compatibilidad con aplicaciones de electrónica de consumo y industrial"],"fr":["Connecteurs de boîte et connecteurs plats","Structure de MPN avec spécifications codées","Séries SBH/SFH avec des variations de contact et de montage","Options de couleur et de montage personnalisées","Compatibilité avec des applications d''électronique de consommation et industrielle"],"de":["Steckverbinder und Flachsteckverbinder","MPN-Struktur mit codierten Spezifikationen","SBH/SFH-Serien mit Kontakt- und Montagevarianten","Farb- und Montageoptionen auf Kundenwunsch","Kompatibilität mit Anwendungen der Unterhaltselektronik und industriellen Elektronik"],"pt":["Série SBH/SFH com especificações codificadas","Conectores de alta qualidade para aplicações diversificadas","Opções de montagem flexíveis","Contato de fósforo de bronze e estanho","Variedades de pinos para diferentes necessidades","Opções de cor para diferentes ambientes"],"ru":["Серия SBH/SFH с закодированными спецификациями","Высококачественные разъемы для различных применений","Гибкие варианты монтажа","Контакты из фосфорного бронза и олова","Различные варианты пинов для разных нужд","Варианты цвета для разных сред"],"ar":["سلسلة SBH/SFH ذات المواصفات المُشفرة","موصلات عالية الجودة لتطبيقات متنوعة","خيارات تركيب مرنة","اتصال من البرونز الفوسفوري والقصدير","انواع من الدبابيس لاحتياجات مختلفة","خيارات الألوان لبيئات مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Sullins 连接器","MPN 结构","SBH/SFH 系列","连接器解决方案","编码规格","技术规格"],"ja":["Sullins コネクタ","MPN 構造","SBH/SFH シリーズ","コネクタ ソリューション","符号化規格","技術仕様"],"ko":["Sullins 커넥터","MPN 구조","SBH/SFH 시리즈","커넥터 솔루션","인코딩 규격","기술 사양"],"es":["conectores Sullins","soluciones de conectores","industria de la electrónica","conectores de caja","conectores planos","estructura de MPN","series SBH/SFH"],"fr":["connecteurs Sullins","solutions de connecteurs","industrie de l''électronique","connecteurs de boîte","connecteurs plats","structure de MPN","séries SBH/SFH"],"de":["Sullins-Stecker","Steckverbinder-Lösungen","Elektronikindustrie","Steckverbinder","Flachsteckverbinder","MPN-Struktur","SBH/SFH-Serien"],"pt":["conectores sullins","soluções de conexão","série SBH/SFH","especificações codificadas","conectores de alta qualidade","aplicações diversificadas","montagem flexível","contato de fósforo de bronze","variedades de pinos"],"ru":["разъемы sullins","решения для подключения","серия SBH/SFH","закодированные спецификации","высококачественные разъемы","различные применения","гибкий монтаж","контакты из фосфорного бронза","варианты пинов"],"ar":["موصلات سولينز","حلول اتصال","سلسلة SBH/SFH","مواصفات مشفرة","موصلات عالية الجودة","تطبيقات متنوعة","تركيب مرن","اتصال من البرونز الفوسفوري","انواع الدبابيس"]}},"owner":"Cantara","repo":"lib-electronic-components","repoPath":"Cantara/lib-electronic-components","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sullins","description":"Sullins Connector Solutions MPN encoding patterns, series decoding, and handler guidance. Use when working with Sullins connectors or SullinsHandler.","bodyPreview":"# Sullins Connector Solutions Manufacturer Skill\n\n## MPN Structure\n\nSullins uses letter-prefix series with encoded specifications:\n\n### SBH/SFH Series (Box Headers, FFC/FPC)\n\n```\nSBH11-PBPC-D10-ST-BK\n |  |   |   |   |  |\n |  |   |   |   |  +-- Color (BK=Black, GY=Gray)\n |  |   |   |   +-- Mount (ST=Straight, RA=Right Angle)\n |  |   |   +-- Pin count (D10 = Dual 10 = 20 total pins)\n |  |   +-- Contact type (PBPC=Phosphor Bronze, Tin)\n |  +-- Series variant (11, 21, etc.)\n +-- Series prefix (SBH=B","body":"# Sullins Connector Solutions Manufacturer Skill\n\n## MPN Structure\n\nSullins uses letter-prefix series with encoded specifications:\n\n### SBH/SFH Series (Box Headers, FFC/FPC)\n\n```\nSBH11-PBPC-D10-ST-BK\n |  |   |   |   |  |\n |  |   |   |   |  +-- Color (BK=Black, GY=Gray)\n |  |   |   |   +-- Mount (ST=Straight, RA=Right Angle)\n |  |   |   +-- Pin count (D10 = Dual 10 = 20 total pins)\n |  |   +-- Contact type (PBPC=Phosphor Bronze, Tin)\n |  +-- Series variant (11, 21, etc.)\n +-- Series prefix (SBH=Box Header, SFH=FFC/FPC)\n```\n\n### PPPC/PRPC/NPPN Series (Headers)\n\n```\nPRPC040SAAN-RC\n |   | ||| |  |\n |   | ||| |  +-- Mount suffix (RC=Through-Hole, SC=SMT)\n |   | ||| +-- Plating (N=Tin, etc.)\n |   | ||+-- Contact options\n |   | |+-- Contact type\n |   | +-- Row count (1=Single, 2=Dual)\n |   +-- Pin count (040 = 40 pins)\n +-- Series (PRPC=Male, PPPC=Female, NPPN=Pin)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Series Reference\n\n### SBH Series - Box Headers\n\n| Feature | Value |\n|---------|-------|\n| Type | Shrouded male header |\n| Pitch | 2.54mm |\n| Rated Current | 3.0A |\n| Row Config | Dual row |\n\nPattern: `^SBH[0-9]+-[A-Z]+-D[0-9]+.*`\n\n### PPPC Series - Female Headers\n\n| Feature | Value |\n|---------|-------|\n| Type | Female socket header |\n| Pitch | 2.54mm |\n| Rated Current | 3.0A |\n| Row Config | Single or dual |\n\nPattern: `^PPPC[0-9]+.*`\n\n### PRPC Series - Male Headers\n\n| Feature | Value |\n|---------|-------|\n| Type | Male pin header |\n| Pitch | 2.54mm |\n| Rated Current | 3.0A |\n| Row Config | Single or dual |\n\nPattern: `^PRPC[0-9]+.*`\n\n### NPPN Series - Pin Headers\n\n| Feature | Value |\n|---------|-------|\n| Type | Pin header |\n| Pitch | 2.54mm |\n| Rated Current | 3.0A |\n| Row Config | Configurable |\n\nPattern: `^NPPN[0-9]+.*`\n\n### SFH Series - FFC/FPC Connectors\n\n| Feature | Value |\n|---------|-------|\n| Type | Flat flex cable connector |\n| Pitch | 1.27mm |\n| Rated Current | 1.0A |\n| Row Config | Dual row |\n\nPattern: `^SFH[0-9]+-[A-Z]+-D[0-9]+.*`\n\n---\n\n## Pin Count Extraction\n\n### SBH/SFH Series\n\nPin count follows \"D\" prefix and is doubled for dual row:\n\n```java\n// SBH11-PBPC-D10-ST-BK -> 10 * 2 = 20 pins\nMatcher m = Pattern.compile(\"D([0-9]+)\").matcher(mpn);\nif (m.find()) {\n    return Integer.parseInt(m.group(1)) * 2;  // Dual row\n}\n```\n\n### PPPC/PRPC/NPPN Series\n\nPin count is first 2-3 digits after series prefix:\n\n```java\n// PRPC040SAAN-RC -> 40 pins\n// PPPC081LFBN-RC -> 8 pins\nPattern.compile(\"(PPPC|PRPC|NPPN)([0-9]+)\").matcher(mpn);\nreturn Integer.parseInt(m.group(2));\n```\n\n---\n\n## Mounting Type Codes\n\n### Suffix Codes\n\n| Code | Mounting Type |\n|------|---------------|\n| -RC | Through-Hole |\n| -SC | SMT |\n| ST | Straight (Through-Hole) |\n| RA | Right Angle (Through-Hole) |\n| SM | Surface Mount |\n\n### Detection Example\n\n```java\nString upper = mpn.toUpperCase();\nif (upper.contains(\"-RC\")) return \"Through-Hole\";\nif (upper.contains(\"-SC\")) return \"SMT\";\nif (upper.contains(\"-RA\")) return \"Through-Hole Right Angle\";\nif (upper.contains(\"-ST\")) return \"Through-Hole Straight\";\n```\n\n---\n\n## Gender Detection\n\n| Series | Gender |\n|--------|--------|\n| PPPC | Female (Socket) |\n| PRPC | Male (Pin) |\n| NPPN | Male (Pin) |\n| SBH | Male (Shrouded) |\n| SFH | Male (Shrouded) |\n\n---\n\n## Row Count Detection\n\n### SBH/SFH\n\nAlways dual row (indicated by \"D\" prefix before pin count).\n\n### PPPC/PRPC/NPPN\n\nDigit after pin count indicates rows:\n\n```java\n// PRPC040SAAN-RC\n//        ^ Row digit (S=Single, but position encoding varies)\n// Check the digit after the pin count digits\n\n// More reliable: Parse with regex\nPattern.compile(\"(PPPC|PRPC|NPPN)([0-9]+)([0-9])\").matcher(mpn);\nint rows = Integer.parseInt(m.group(3));  // 1=single, 2=dual\n```\n\n---\n\n## Contact Plating\n\n| Code | Plating Type |\n|------|--------------|\n| GN, G/ | Gold |\n| SN, T/ | Tin |\n| LF | Lead-Free Tin |\n\n---\n\n## Handler Implementation Notes\n\n### Series Extraction\n\n```java\n// Extract known series prefixes\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"SBH\")) return \"SBH\";\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"PPPC\")) return \"PPPC\";\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"PRPC\")) return \"PRPC\";\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"NPPN\")) return \"NPPN\";\nif (upperMpn.startsWith(\"SFH\")) return \"SFH\";\n\n// Generic extraction (3-4 letter prefix before digits)\nPattern.compile(\"^([A-Z]{3,4})[0-9]\").matcher(mpn);\n```\n\n### Package Code Extraction\n\n```java\n// SBH/SFH: Mount type is in dash-separated field\n// Example: SBH11-PBPC-D10-ST-BK -> ST = Straight\n\n// PPPC/PRPC/NPPN: Mount type is suffix\n// Example: PRPC040SAAN-RC -> RC = Through-Hole\n\n// Look for standard suffix codes\nif (upper.contains(\"-RC\")) return \"Through-Hole\";\nif (upper.contains(\"-SC\")) return \"SMT\";\n```\n\n### Replacement Compatibility\n\n```java\n// Compatible if:\n// 1. Same series\n// 2. Same pin count\n// 3. Compatible mounting type (both THT or both SMT)\n\nString series1 = extractSeries(mpn1);\nString series2 = extractSeries(mpn2);\nif (!series1.equals(series2)) return false;\n\nint pins1 = extractPinCount(mpn1);\nint pins2 = extractPinCount(mpn2);\nif (pins1 != pins2) return false;\n\nreturn areCompatibleMountingTypes(mpn1, mpn2);\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Part Numbers\n\n| MPN | Description |\n|-----|-------------|\n| PRPC040SAAN-RC | 40-pin male header, single row, through-hole |\n| PPPC081LFBN-RC | 8-pin female header, lead-free, through-hole |\n| SBH11-PBPC-D10-ST-BK | 20-pin box header (10x2), straight, black |\n| NPPN101BFCN-RC | 10-pin header, through-hole |\n\n---\n\n## Related Files\n\n- Handler: `manufacturers/SullinsHandler.java`\n- Supported types: `CONNECTOR`, `IC`\n- No manufacturer-specific ComponentType enum entries\n\n---\n\n## Learnings & Edge Cases\n\n- **Row count encoding**: For PPPC/PRPC/NPPN, the digit after the pin count indicates row count (1=single, 2=dual).\n- **SBH/SFH always dual**: Box headers and FFC connectors are always dual row. Pin count in MPN is per-row, multiply by 2.\n- **Pitch by series**: SBH/PPPC/PRPC/NPPN are 2.54mm pitch. SFH is 1.27mm pitch (fine pitch FFC).\n- **Right angle detection**: Look for \"RA\" in package code OR in the dash-separated fields. Beware: \"stRAight\" contains \"RA\".\n- **Color codes**: BK=Black, GY=Gray, WH=White, BL=Blue appear at the end of SBH/SFH MPNs.\n- **Dual connector type**: Handler registers both CONNECTOR and IC types.\n\n<!-- Add new learnings above this line -->\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:42:03.277Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Electronics Agents needing to decode and interpret Sullins connector part numbers.","zh":"非常适合需要解码和解释 Sullins 连接器零件号的电子设备代理。","ja":"Sullinsコネクタの部品番号を解読および解釈する必要があるエレクトロニクスエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Sullins 커넥터 부품 번호를 해독하고 해석해야 하는 전자 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de electrónica que necesitan decodificar e interpretar los números de pieza de conectores Sullins.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents en électronique qui ont besoin de décoder et d''interpréter les numéros de pièce des connecteurs Sullins.","de":"Perfekt für Elektronik-Agenten, die Sullins-Verbindernummern decodieren und interpretieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Eletrônica que precisam decodificar e interpretar números de peça de conectores Sullins.","ru":"Идеально для агентов электроники, которым необходимо декодировать и интерпретировать номера деталей разъемов Sullins.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإلكترونيين الذين يحتاجون إلى فك وتفسير أرقام قطع موصلات Sullins."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to decipher Sullins connector specifications using MPN structure, including series prefix, series variant, contact type, pin count, mount, and color, enabling precise component identification and procurement using SBH/SFH series formats.","zh":"使代理能够使用 MPN 结构（包括系列前缀、系列变体、接触类型、引脚数、安装方式和颜色）来解读 Sullins 连接器规格，从而利用 SBH/SFH 系列格式实现精确的组件识别和采购。","ja":"シリーズプレフィックス、シリーズバリアント、接触タイプ、ピン数、実装方法、色を含むMPN構造を使用してSullinsコネクタの仕様を解読する能力をエージェントに与え、SBH/SFHシリーズ形式を使用した正確なコンポーネントの識別と調達を可能にします。","ko":"시리즈 접두사, 시리즈 변형, 접점 유형, 핀 수, 장착 방식 및 색상을 포함한 MPN 구조를 사용하여 Sullins 커넥터 사양을 해독하여 SBH/SFH 시리즈 형식을 사용한 정확한 구성품 식별 및 조달을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Capacita a los agentes para descifrar las especificaciones de los conectores Sullins utilizando la estructura MPN, incluyendo el prefijo de serie, la variante de serie, el tipo de contacto, el número de pines, el montaje y el color, permitiendo una identificación y adquisición precisa de componentes utilizando los formatos de serie SBH/SFH.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déchiffrer les spécifications des connecteurs Sullins en utilisant la structure MPN, y compris le préfixe de série, la variante de série, le type de contact, le nombre de broches, le montage et la couleur, permettant une identification et un approvisionnement précis des composants en utilisant les formats de série SBH/SFH.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Sullins-Verbinderspezifikationen anhand der MPN-Struktur zu entschlüsseln, einschließlich Serienpräfix, Serienvariante, Kontakttyp, Pinanzahl, Montageart und Farbe, und ermöglicht so eine präzise Bauteilidentifikation und -beschaffung unter Verwendung der SBH/SFH-Serienformate.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a decifrar especificações de conectores Sullins usando a estrutura de MPN, incluindo prefixo de série, variante de série, tipo de contato, contagem de pinos, montagem e cor, permitindo a identificação precisa de componentes e aquisição usando formatos de série SBH/SFH.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью расшифровывать спецификации разъемов Sullins с использованием структуры MPN, включая префикс серии, вариант серии, тип контакта, количество контактов, тип монтажа и цвет, обеспечивая точную идентификацию компонентов и закупку с использованием форматов серий SBH/SFH.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من فك تشفير مواصفات موصلات Sullins باستخدام هيكل MPN، بما في ذلك بادئة السلسلة، ومتغير السلسلة، ونوع الاتصال، وعدد الدبوس، ونوع التركيب، واللون، مما يسمح بالتعرف الدقيق على المكونات وشرائها باستخدام صيغ السلسلة SBH/SFH."},"useCases":{"en":["Decoding Sullins part numbers for procurement purposes","Identifying specific connector characteristics such as pin count and mount type","Generating lists of compatible Sullins connectors based on given specifications"],"zh":["为采购目的解码 Sullins 零件号","识别特定连接器特性，例如引脚数和安装类型","根据给定规格生成兼容的 Sullins 连接器列表"],"ja":["調達目的でのSullins部品番号の解読","ピン数や実装タイプなどの特定のコネクタ特性の識別","与えられた仕様に基づいた互換性のあるSullinsコネクタのリスト生成"],"ko":["조달 목적으로 Sullins 부품 번호 해독","핀 수 및 장착 유형과 같은 특정 커넥터 특성 식별","주어진 사양에 따라 호환되는 Sullins 커넥터 목록 생성"],"es":["Decodificar números de pieza de Sullins para fines de adquisición","Identificar características específicas del conector, como el número de pines y el tipo de montaje","Generar listas de conectores Sullins compatibles basadas en especificaciones dadas"],"fr":["Décoder les numéros de pièce Sullins à des fins d''approvisionnement","Identifier les caractéristiques spécifiques du connecteur telles que le nombre de broches et le type de montage","Générer des listes de connecteurs Sullins compatibles sur la base de spécifications données"],"de":["Decodieren von Sullins-Teilenummern für Beschaffungszwecke","Identifizieren spezifischer Verbindereigenschaften wie Pinanzahl und Montagetyp","Erstellen von Listen kompatibler Sullins-Verbinder basierend auf gegebenen Spezifikationen"],"pt":["Decodificação de números de peça Sullins para fins de aquisição","Identificação de características específicas de conectores, como contagem de pinos e tipo de montagem","Geração de listas de conectores Sullins compatíveis com base em especificações dadas"],"ru":["Декодирование номеров деталей Sullins для целей закупки","Определение конкретных характеристик разъемов, таких как количество контактов и тип монтажа","Генерация списков совместимых разъемов Sullins на основе заданных спецификаций"],"ar":["فك تشفير أرقام قطع موصلات Sullins لغرض الشراء","التعرف على خصائص محددة للموصلات، مثل عدد الدبوس ونوع التركيب","توليد قوائم بموصلات Sullins المتوافقة بناءً على المواصفات المحددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to Sullins connector products","Requires knowledge of Sullins MPN structure","May not cover all possible Sullins product variations"],"zh":["仅限于 Sullins 连接器产品","需要了解 Sullins MPN 结构","可能无法涵盖所有可能的 Sullins 产品变体"],"ja":["Sullinsコネクタ製品に限定される","SullinsのMPN構造に関する知識が必要","すべての可能なSullins製品バリエーションをカバーしない可能性がある"],"ko":["Sullins 커넥터 제품으로 제한됨","Sullins MPN 구조에 대한 지식 필요","가능한 모든 Sullins 제품 변형을 다루지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Limitado a productos conectores de Sullins","Requiere conocimiento de la estructura MPN de Sullins","Puede no cubrir todas las posibles variaciones de productos Sullins"],"fr":["Limité aux produits connecteurs Sullins","Nécessite une connaissance de la structure MPN de Sullins","Peut ne pas couvrir toutes les variations possibles des produits Sullins"],"de":["Beschränkt auf Sullins-Verbinderprodukte","Erfordert Kenntnisse der Sullins-MPN-Struktur","Könnte nicht alle möglichen Sullins-Produktvarianten abdecken"],"pt":["Limitado a produtos de conectores Sullins","Exige conhecimento da estrutura de MPN da Sullins","Pode não cobrir todas as variações possíveis de produtos Sullins"],"ru":["Ограничен продукцией разъемов Sullins","Требует знания структуры MPN Sullins","Может не охватывать все возможные вариации продукции Sullins"],"ar":["محدود بموصلات Sullins","يتطلب معرفة هيكل MPN لشركة Sullins","قد لا يغطي جميع التباينات المحتملة لمنتجات Sullins"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
