es de alta calidad"],"fr":["créateur de compétences","meilleures pratiques pour Claude","modèles de compétences","automatisation des flux de travail","développement de compétences personnalisées","intégration avec Claude","outils de développement de compétences","optimisation de compétences","création de compétences de haute qualité"],"de":["Fähigkeits-creator","Best Practices für Claude","Vorlagen für Fähigkeiten","Automatisierung von Workflows","Entwicklung von individuellen Fähigkeiten","Integration mit Claude","Tools für die Entwicklung von Fähigkeiten","Optimierung von Fähigkeiten","Erstellung von hochwertigen Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["criador de habilidades","melhores práticas para Claude","modelos de habilidades","descoberta de habilidades","manutenção de habilidades","personalização de habilidades","integração com workflow","desenvolvimento de habilidades","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["создатель навыков","лучшие практики для Claude","шаблоны навыков","обнаружение навыков","поддержка навыков","настройка навыков","интеграция с рабочим процессом","разработка навыков","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["مبتكر المهارات","أفضل الممارسات ل Claude","نماذج المهارات","اكتشاف المهارات","صيانة المهارات","تخصيص المهارات","التكامل مع سير العمل","تطوير المهارات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"enuno","repo":"claude-command-and-control","repoPath":"enuno/claude-command-and-control","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill-creator","description":"","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Skill Creator\n\n## Description\nGuides the creation of high-quality Claude Skills following established best practices, ensuring discoverability, actionability, and maintainability from the start.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n- When the user says \"create a new skill\"\n- When asked to \"help me build a skill for [workflow]\"\n- When someone mentions \"skill template\" or \"skill scaffold\"\n- After identifying a repetitive workflow that should be automated\n\n## When NOT to Use This Skill\n- When creating one-","body":"# Skill Creator\n\n## Description\nGuides the creation of high-quality Claude Skills following established best practices, ensuring discoverability, actionability, and maintainability from the start.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n- When the user says \"create a new skill\"\n- When asked to \"help me build a skill for [workflow]\"\n- When someone mentions \"skill template\" or \"skill scaffold\"\n- After identifying a repetitive workflow that should be automated\n\n## When NOT to Use This Skill\n- When creating one-time commands (use command templates instead)\n- When configuring agents (use agent templates instead)\n- For simple prompts that don''t need reusability\n\n## Prerequisites\n- Clear understanding of the workflow to be automated\n- 2-5 concrete examples of the workflow in action\n- Identified trigger conditions for skill invocation\n- Decision: Is this skill simple (500-2K tokens), moderate (2K-8K), or complex (8K-20K)?\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Requirements Gathering\n\nAsk the user these critical questions:\n\n**Scoping Questions:**\n1. What workflow are you trying to automate?\n2. How often does this workflow repeat? (≥3x/week recommended for skill creation)\n3. What are the clear success criteria?\n4. Can you provide 3-5 concrete examples?\n5. Does it require specific domain knowledge or patterns?\n\n**Decision Point:**\n- If answers \"Yes\" to 3+ questions → Proceed to skill creation\n- If unclear requirements → Request clarification\n- If too broad → Suggest splitting into multiple focused skills\n\n### Step 2: Skill Scoping\n\nDetermine complexity tier:\n\n| Complexity | Indicators | Action |\n|-----------|-----------|--------|\n| **Simple** | Single-step, deterministic, <500 tokens | Use minimal template |\n| **Moderate** | Multi-step with decision points, 2K-8K tokens | Use standard template |\n| **Complex** | Multi-phase with feedback loops, 8K-20K tokens | Use comprehensive template |\n\nCreate `SKILL_SCOPING.md`:\n```\n\n\n# Skill Scoping: [Skill Name]\n\n## Workflow Description\n\n[1-2 paragraph description]\n\n## Complexity Tier\n\n[Simple | Moderate | Complex]\n\n## Token Budget Estimate\n\n[Estimated tokens needed]\n\n## Modularity Decision\n\n- Single skill? [Yes/No]\n- If splitting: List of separate skills to create\n\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n- Time saved per use: [X minutes]\n- Expected usage frequency: [N times per week]\n- Quality improvement target: [Specific metric]\n\n```\n\n### Step 3: Activation Trigger Definition\n\n**CRITICAL**: This determines invocation reliability.\n\nWork with user to define:\n\n**✅ Explicit Trigger Patterns:**\n```\n\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- When the user asks to \"[exact phrase]\"\n- When [specific context] needs [specific action]\n- When [explicit request pattern]\n\n```\n\n**✅ Negative Triggers (prevents false positives):**\n```\n\n\n## When NOT to Use This Skill\n\n- When [similar but different scenario] (use [other-skill] instead)\n- When [overlapping context] (use [alternative-tool] instead)\n\n```\n\n**Example - Good Triggers:**\n```\n\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- When user says \"create a pull request description\"\n- When code changes need to be summarized for review\n- When generating release notes from commit history\n\n\n## When NOT to Use This Skill\n\n- When writing individual commit messages (use commit-msg-skill instead)\n- When documenting architecture (use architect agent instead)\n\n```\n\n### Step 4: Generate Skill Structure\n\nBased on complexity tier, generate the appropriate template:\n\n**For Simple Skills** → Use Template 2 (Minimal Viable Skill)\n**For Moderate Skills** → Use Template 3 (Standard Skill)\n**For Complex Skills** → Use Template 4 (Comprehensive Skill)\n\nCreate file: `skills/[skill-name]/SKILL.md`\n\n### Step 5: Example Collection\n\nCollect 2-5 concrete examples covering:\n\n1. **Happy Path** (ideal scenario)\n2. **Edge Case** (unusual but valid)\n3. **Error Scenario** (what failure looks like)\n\nFormat each example:\n```\n\n\n### Example [N]: [Scenario Name]\n\n**Input:**\n[Concrete input data]\n\n**Expected Output:**\n[Expected result with actual content]\n\n**Rationale:**\n[Why this example matters]\n\n```\n\n### Step 6: Quality Validation\n\nRun through validation checklist:\n\n- [ ] Skill name follows `[domain]-[action]-[modifier]` convention\n- [ ] Description is 100-150 characters (UI-friendly)\n- [ ] \"When to Use\" has 3-5 explicit triggers\n- [ ] \"When NOT to Use\" prevents overlap with other skills\n- [ ] Prerequisites are clearly stated\n- [ ] Workflow steps use imperative language\n- [ ] 2-5 examples provided with actual content\n- [ ] Quality standards defined\n- [ ] Common pitfalls documented\n- [ ] All code fences use proper language identifiers\n\n### Step 7: Integration Planning\n\nDocument how this skill integrates with existing system:\n\n```\n\n\n## Integration with Command & Control System\n\n**Related Agents:**\n\n- [Agent Name]: [How they collaborate]\n\n**Related Commands:**\n\n- /[command]: [When to use vs. this skill]\n\n**MCP Dependencies:**\n\n- [MCP Server Name]: [What data/actions needed]\n\n**Orchestration Notes:**\n\n- Can be chained with: [other-skill-1], [other-skill-2]\n- Invoked by: [orchestrator-skill]\n\n```\n\n### Step 8: Testing Strategy\n\nCreate `skills/[skill-name]/TESTING.md`:\n\n```\n\n\n# Testing Strategy: [Skill Name]\n\n## Test Scenarios\n\n### Scenario 1: [Happy Path]\n\n**Input:** [Test input]\n**Expected:** [Expected output]\n**Pass Criteria:** [Specific criteria]\n\n### Scenario 2: [Edge Case]\n\n**Input:** [Test input]\n**Expected:** [Expected output]\n**Pass Criteria:** [Specific criteria]\n\n### Scenario 3: [Error Handling]\n\n**Input:** [Invalid input]\n**Expected:** [Error message]\n**Pass Criteria:** [Graceful failure]\n\n## Manual Testing Checklist\n\n- [ ] Skill invokes when expected\n- [ ] Skill doesn''t invoke when not expected\n- [ ] Output matches examples\n- [ ] Error handling works\n- [ ] Performance acceptable (<30s for simple, <5min for complex)\n\n```\n\n### Step 9: Deployment Preparation\n\nCreate metadata file: `skills/[skill-name]/metadata.json`\n\n```\n\n{\n\"name\": \"skill-name\",\n\"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n\"description\": \"Brief description for UI\",\n\"author\": \"team-name\",\n\"created\": \"2025-11-22\",\n\"last_updated\": \"2025-11-22\",\n\"status\": \"active\",\n\"complexity\": \"moderate\",\n\"category\": \"developer-productivity\",\n\"tags\": [\"tag1\", \"tag2\", \"tag3\"],\n\"token_budget\": \"5000\",\n\"usage_frequency_target\": \"10-per-week\",\n\"integrations\": {\n\"agents\": [\"builder\", \"validator\"],\n\"commands\": [\"/test\", \"/pr\"],\n\"mcp_servers\": [\"github\"]\n}\n}\n\n```\n\n### Step 10: Documentation\n\nGenerate README for the skill:\n\n`skills/[skill-name]/README.md`\n\n```\n\n\n# [Skill Name]\n\n**Version**: 1.0.0\n**Category**: [Category]\n**Complexity**: [Simple|Moderate|Complex]\n\n## Quick Start\n\nInvoke this skill by saying:\n\n```\n\"[Example trigger phrase]\"\n```\n\n\n## What This Skill Does\n\n[2-3 sentence description]\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- [Requirement 1]\n- [Requirement 2]\n\n\n## Examples\n\nSee `SKILL.md` for detailed examples.\n\n## Integration\n\n**Works with:**\n\n- Agents: [list]\n- Commands: [list]\n- MCP: [list]\n\n\n## Versioning\n\n- 1.0.0 (2025-11-22): Initial release\n\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Issue**: Skill doesn''t invoke\n**Solution**: Verify trigger phrase matches \"When to Use\" section\n\n**Issue**: Unexpected output\n**Solution**: Check examples in SKILL.md for expected format\n\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Creating a Code Review Skill\n\n**User Request:** \"I want a skill that helps me review pull requests systematically\"\n\n**Skill Creator Process:**\n\n1. **Requirements Gathering:**\n   - Workflow: Systematic PR review following team standards\n   - Frequency: 5-10 times per week\n   - Success: 90% of reviews catch critical issues\n   - Examples: 3 past PR reviews provided\n   - Domain knowledge: Team''s code review checklist\n\n2. **Scoping:**\n   - Complexity: Moderate (multi-step with decision points)\n   - Token budget: ~6K tokens\n   - Single skill: Yes\n\n3. **Trigger Definition:**\n```\n\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- When user says \"review this PR\"\n- When asked to \"code review pull request [number]\"\n- When someone requests \"systematic code review\"\n\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\n- When writing code (use builder agent instead)\n- When running tests (use validator agent instead)\n\n```\n\n4. **Generated Skill:** `skills/pr-reviewer/SKILL.md` (see Template 3 for structure)\n\n### Example 2: Creating a Documentation Generator Skill\n\n**User Request:** \"We need to automatically generate API documentation from code\"\n\n**Skill Creator Process:**\n\n1. **Requirements:**\n- Workflow: Parse code → Extract API signatures → Generate markdown docs\n- Frequency: Daily as code changes\n- Success: Docs 100% accurate with code\n- Examples: 5 API endpoints with desired doc format\n\n2. **Scoping:**\n- Complexity: Complex (multi-phase with validation loops)\n- Token budget: ~12K tokens\n- Single skill: Yes\n\n3. **Integration Planning:**\n```\n\n**Related Agents:**\n\n- Scribe Agent: Finalizes documentation formatting\n- Builder Agent: Provides updated code context\n\n**MCP Dependencies:**\n\n- File System: Read source code files\n- GitHub: Commit generated docs\n\n```\n\n4. **Generated Skill:** `skills/api-doc-generator/SKILL.md` (see Template 4 for structure)\n\n## Quality Standards\n\n**Every generated skill MUST have:**\n- [ ] Clear, action-oriented trigger phrases\n- [ ] 2-5 concrete examples with real content\n- [ ] Explicit prerequisites\n- [ ] Step-by-step workflow in imperative language\n- [ ] Quality acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Common pitfalls section\n- [ ] Integration notes with existing system\n- [ ] Testing strategy\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n❌ **Vague Triggers**\n```\n\n\n## When to Use\n\n- When working with code (too broad)\n\n```\n\n✅ **Explicit Triggers**\n```\n\n\n## When to Use\n\n- When user says \"review this pull request\"\n- When code changes need systematic quality assessment\n\n```\n\n❌ **Missing Examples**\n```\n\n\n## Examples\n\nSee general documentation for examples.\n\n```\n\n✅ **Concrete Examples**\n```\n\n\n### Example 1: Standard Feature PR\n\n**Input:**\nPR #123: Add user authentication\nFiles changed: auth.js, user.model.js, auth.test.js\n\n**Output:**\n\n## Code Review Summary\n\n**Architecture**: ✅ Follows auth pattern from ARCHITECTURE.md\n**Security**: ⚠️ Password hashing needs bcrypt rounds increase\n...\n\n```\n\n❌ **Generic Workflow**\n```\n\n1. Analyze the input\n2. Process it\n3. Generate output\n```\n\n✅ **Specific Steps**\n```\n\n\n### Step 1: Load PR Context\n\n```bash\ngh pr view [PR_NUMBER] --json files,title,body\n```\n\n\n### Step 2: Check Against Standards\n\nCompare changed files against:\n\n- ARCHITECTURE.md design patterns\n- SECURITY.md security checklist\n...\n\n```\n\n## Version History\n\n- 1.0.0 (2025-11-22): Initial release - supports simple, moderate, and complex skill creation\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Issue**: Created skill doesn''t invoke\n**Solution**: \n1. Check \"When to Use\" triggers are explicit and action-oriented\n2. Add \"When NOT to Use\" to prevent overlap\n3. Test trigger phrases match user''s natural language\n\n**Issue**: Skill too complex\n**Solution**: \n1. Re-run scoping step\n2. Consider splitting into multiple focused skills\n3. Use orchestrator pattern to chain skills\n\n**Issue**: Examples not helpful\n**Solution**:\n1. Ensure examples use real content, not placeholders\n2. Cover happy path, edge case, and error scenario\n3. Add \"Rationale\" explaining why each example matters\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:42:26.683Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing structured Claude Skill development and template-based workflow automation.","zh":"适合需要结构化的 Claude 技能开发和基于模板的工作流自动化的 AI 代理。","ja":"構造化された Claude スキルの開発とテンプレートベースのワークフローの自動化を必要とする AI エージェントに適しています。","ko":"구조화된 Claude 스킬 개발 및 템플릿 기반 워크플로 자동화가 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan un desarrollo de habilidades de Claude estructurado y una automatización de flujo de trabajo basada en plantillas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant un développement de compétences Claude structuré et une automatisation de workflow basée sur des modèles.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine strukturierte Claude-Fähigkeitsentwicklung und eine vorlagenbasierte Workflowautomatisierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de desenvolvimento de habilidades estruturadas do Claude e automação de fluxo de trabalho baseada em modelos.","ru":"Идеально для ИИ-агентов, которым необходима структурированное развитие навыков Claude и автоматизация рабочего процесса на основе шаблонов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير مهارات كلود المترابطة وتوضيح اتوماتيكية سير العمل المعتمدة على القوالب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-quality Claude Skills following best practices, ensuring discoverability, actionability, and maintainability through established templates and scaffolds, utilizing keywords like ''skill template'' and ''workflow automation''.","zh":"赋予代理创建高质量的 Claude 技能的能力，遵循最佳实践，确保可发现性、可操作性和可维护性，通过建立的模板和脚手架，利用关键词如 ''技能模板'' 和 ''工作流自动化''。","ja":"エージェントが、高品質の Claude スキルを作成できるようにし、ベストプラクティスに従って、発見可能性、操作可能性、保守可能性を確保するための、確立されたテンプレートやスキャフォールディングを利用し、''スキルテンプレート'' や ''ワークフローの自動化'' などのキーワードを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 최고의 실천법을 따르며, 발견 가능성, 조작 가능성, 유지 보수성을 보장하는 확립된 템플릿 및 스캐폴딩을 사용하여 고품질의 Claude 스킬을 생성할 수 있도록 하며, ''스킬 템플릿'' 및 ''워크플로 자동화''와 같은 키워드를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear habilidades de Claude de alta calidad siguiendo las mejores prácticas, garantizando la capacidad de descubrimiento, la capacidad de actuación y la mantenibilidad a través de plantillas y estructuras establecidas, utilizando palabras clave como ''plantilla de habilidad'' y ''automatización de flujo de trabajo''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des compétences Claude de haute qualité en suivant les meilleures pratiques, en garantissant la découverte, l''action et la maintenabilité grâce à des modèles et des échafaudages établis, en utilisant des mots clés comme ''modèle de compétence'' et ''automatisation de workflow''.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, hochwertige Claude-Fähigkeiten nach besten Praktiken zu erstellen, indem es die Entdeckbarkeit, Handhabbarkeit und Wartbarkeit durch etablierte Vorlagen und Gerüste sicherstellt, unter Verwendung von Schlüsselwörtern wie ''Fähigkeitsvorlage'' und ''Workflowautomatisierung''.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar habilidades de Claude de alta qualidade, seguindo as melhores práticas, garantindo a descoberta, a capacidade de ação e a manutenção por meio de modelos e estruturas estabelecidos, utilizando palavras-chave como ''modelo de habilidade'' e ''automação de fluxo de trabalho''.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать навыки Claude высокого качества, следуя лучшим практикам, обеспечивая обнаруживаемость, действенность и поддерживаемость посредством установленных шаблонов и каркасов, используя ключевые слова, такие как ''шаблон навыка'' и ''автоматизация рабочего процесса''.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء مهارات كلود عالية الجودة اتباعًا لأفضل الممارسات، مما يضمن اكتشافها وقابلية تنفيذها والصيانة من خلال القوالب والهياكل المكونة، باستخدام كلمات مفتاحية مثل ''قالب مهارة'' و ''توضيح سير العمل''."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating repetitive workflows","Generating skill templates for common tasks","Creating custom skills for specific user requests"],"zh":["自动化重复的工作流","为常见任务生成技能模板","为特定用户请求创建自定义技能"],"ja":["繰り返しのワークフローを自動化する","一般的なタスクのスキルテンプレートを生成する","特定のユーザー要求用にカスタムスキルを作成する"],"ko":["반복되는 워크플ロー 자동화","일반 작업을 위한 스킬 템플릿 생성","특정 사용자 요청을 위한 커스텀 스킬 생성"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo repetitivos","Generación de plantillas de habilidades para tareas comunes","Creación de habilidades personalizadas para solicitudes de usuarios específicas"],"fr":["Automatisation de flux de travail répétitifs","Génération de modèles de compétences pour tâches courantes","Création de compétences personnalisées pour des demandes d''utilisateurs spécifiques"],"de":["Automatisierung wiederkehrender Workflows","Erstellung von Fähigkeitsvorlagen für häufige Aufgaben","Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Fähigkeiten für spezifische Benutzeranfragen"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho repetitivos","Gerar modelos de habilidades para tarefas comuns","Criar habilidades personalizadas para solicitações de usuário específicas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать повторяющиеся рабочие процессы","Генерировать шаблоны навыков для общих задач","Создавать пользовательские навыки для конкретных запросов пользователей"],"ar":["توفير سير العمل المتكرر","إنشاء قوالب مهارات للمهام الشائعة","إنشاء مهارات مخصصة لطلبات المستخدمين المحددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Claude Command syntax","Limited to Claude Skill creation and automation"],"zh":["需要了解 Claude 命令语法","仅限 Claude 技能创建和自动化"],"ja":["Claude コマンドの構文を理解する必要がある","Claude スキルの作成と自動化のみ"],"ko":["Claude 명령 구문을 이해해야 함","Claude 스킬 생성 및 자동화에만 한정"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la sintaxis de comando de Claude","Limitado a la creación y automatización de habilidades de Claude"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de la syntaxe de commande de Claude","Limité à la création et à l''automatisation de compétences de Claude"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis der Befehlssyntax von Claude","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung und Automatisierung von Claude-Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Exige compreensão da sintaxe do Comando Claude","Limitado à criação e automação de habilidades do Claude"],"ru":["Требует понимания синтаксиса Команды Claude","Ограничен созданием и автоматизацией навыков Claude"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم بنية لغة أوامر كلود","محدود بإنشاء وتوضيح مهارات كلود"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":85}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sc30gsw/claude-code-customes/build-fix', 'community', 'sc30gsw', 'claude-code-customes', 'sc30gsw/claude-code-customes', 'build-fix', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z', '2026-02-18T03:42:29.799Z', NULL, '{"id":"sc30gsw/claude-code-customes/build-fix","name":"build-fix","description":{"zh":"build-fix 技能可以自动修复 TypeScript 和构建错误，提高开发效率。它可以解析错误输出，提出修复方案，并自动应用修复","ja":"build-fix スキルは、TypeScript とビルドエラーを自動修復し、開発効率を向上させます。エラー出力を解析し、修復案を提示し、自動的に修復を適用します","ko":"build-fix 기능은 TypeScript 및 빌드 오류를 자동으로 수정하여 개발 효율성을 높여줍니다. 오류 출력을分析하고 수정안을 제시하고 자동으로 수정을 적용합니다","es":"La herramienta build-fix corrige incrementalmente los errores de TypeScript y de compilación mediante un proceso automatizado","fr":"L''outil build-fix corrige de manière incrémentale les erreurs TypeScript et de compilation via un processus automatisé","de":"Das Tool build-fix korrigiert inkrementell TypeScript- und Kompilierungsfehler durch einen automatisierten Prozess","pt":"O skill build-fix permite corrigir erros de TypeScript de forma incremental, melhorando a produtividade dos desenvolvedores.","ru":"Навык build-fix позволяет исправлять ошибки TypeScript поэтапно, повышая производительность разработчиков.","ar":"تمكن مهارة build-fix من تصحيح أخطاء TypeScript بشكل متدرج، مما يحسن إنتاجية المطورين.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"构建和修复：TypeScript 和构建错误的自动修复","ja":"ビルドと修復：TypeScript とビルドエラーの自動修復","ko":"빌드 및 수정: TypeScript 및 빌드 오류 자동 수정","es":"Reparación incremental de errores de TypeScript","fr":"Correction incrémentale des erreurs TypeScript","de":"Inkrementelle Fehlerkorrektur für TypeScript","pt":"Construir e Corrigir Erros de TypeScript","ru":"Построение и исправление ошибок TypeScript","ar":"بناء وتصحيح أخطاء TypeScript","en":"build-fix"},"description":{"zh":"build-fix 技能可以自动修复 TypeScript 和构建错误，提高开发效率。它可以解析错误输出，提出修复方案，并自动应用修复","ja":"build-fix スキルは、TypeScript とビルドエラーを自動修復し、開発効率を向上させます。エラー出力を解析し、修復案を提示し、自動的に修復を適用します","ko":"build-fix 기능은 TypeScript 및 빌드 오류를 자동으로 수정하여 개발 효율성을 높여줍니다. 오류 출력을分析하고 수정안을 제시하고 자동으로 수정을 적용합니다","es":"La herramienta build-fix corrige incrementalmente los errores de TypeScript y de compilación mediante un proceso automatizado","fr":"L''outil build-fix corrige de manière incrémentale les erreurs TypeScript et de compilation via un processus automatisé","de":"Das Tool build-fix korrigiert inkrementell TypeScript- und Kompilierungsfehler durch einen automatisierten Prozess","pt":"O skill build-fix permite corrigir erros de TypeScript de forma incremental, melhorando a produtividade dos desenvolvedores.","ru":"Навык build-fix позволяет исправлять ошибки TypeScript поэтапно, повышая производительность разработчиков.","ar":"تمكن مهارة build-fix من تصحيح أخطاء TypeScript بشكل متدرج، مما يحسن إنتاجية المطورين.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["自动修复 TypeScript 和构建错误","解析错误输出","提出修复方案","自动应用修复","重复运行构建以验证修复","停止修复 wenn 修复引入新错误"],"ja":["TypeScript とビルドエラーの自動修復","エラー出力的解析","修復案の提示","自動的な修復の適用","修復の検証のためのビルドの再実行","修復の停止 wenn 修復が新しいエラーを導入する場合"],"ko":["TypeScript 및 빌드 오류 자동 수정","오류 출력 분석","수정안 제시","자동 수정 적용","수정 확인을 위한 빌드 재실행","수정이 새로운 오류를 유발하는 경우 수정 중지"],"es":["Corrección incremental de errores","Análisis de errores por archivo","Propuesta de soluciones para errores","Aplicación automática de soluciones","Verificación de errores resueltos"],"fr":["Correction incrémentale des erreurs","Analyse des erreurs par fichier","Proposition de solutions pour les erreurs","Application automatique des solutions","Vérification des erreurs résolues"],"de":["Inkrementelle Korrektur von Fehlern","Fehleranalyse pro Datei","Vorschlag von Lösungen für Fehler","Automatische Anwendung von Lösungen","Überprüfung der behobenen Fehler"],"pt":["Correção incremental de erros de TypeScript","Execução de build e parse de saída de erro","Proposta de soluções para erros","Aplicação de soluções e re-execução de build","Resumo de erros corrigidos e persistente"],"ru":["Постепенная коррекция ошибок TypeScript","Выполнение сборки и парсинг вывода ошибки","Предложение решений для ошибок","Применение решений и повторная сборка","Сводка исправленных и сохраняющихся ошибок"],"ar":["تصحيح متدرج لأخطاء TypeScript","تشغيل البناء وتحليل مخرجات الخطأ","اقتراح حلول لأخطاء","تطبيق الحلول وإعادة تشغيل البناء","ملخص للأخطاء المصلحة والمستمرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TypeScript","构建错误","自动修复","开发效率","build-fix","npm","pnpm"],"ja":["TypeScript","ビルドエラー","自動修復","開発効率","build-fix","npm","pnpm"],"ko":["TypeScript","빌드 오류","자동 수정","개발 효율성","build-fix","npm","pnpm"],"es":["corrección de errores","TypeScript","compilación","herramienta de reparación","desarrollo de software","automatización de pruebas"],"fr":["correction d''erreurs","TypeScript","compilation","outil de réparation","développement de logiciels","automatisation de tests"],"de":["Fehlerkorrektur","TypeScript","Kompilierung","Reparaturtool","Softwareentwicklung","Testautomatisierung"],"pt":["build-fix","TypeScript","correção de erros","desenvolvimento de software","produtividade de desenvolvedores","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["build-fix","TypeScript","исправление ошибок","разработка программного обеспечения","производительность разработчиков","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["build-fix","TypeScript","تصحيح أخطاء","تطوير البرمجيات","إنتاجية المطورين","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"sc30gsw","repo":"claude-code-customes","repoPath":"sc30gsw/claude-code-customes","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"build-fix","description":"Incrementally fixes TypeScript and build errors with verification and rollback capabilities","bodyPreview":"# Build and Fix\n\nIncrementally fix TypeScript and build errors:\n\n1. Run build: npm run build or pnpm build\n\n2. Parse error output:\n   - Group by file\n   - Sort by severity\n\n3. For each error:\n   - Show error context (5 lines before/after)\n   - Explain the issue\n   - Propose fix\n   - Apply fix\n   - Re-run build\n   - Verify error resolved\n\n4. Stop if:\n   - Fix introduces new errors\n   - Same error persists after 3 attempts\n   - User requests pause\n\n5. Show summary:\n   - Errors fixed\n   - Errors re","body":"# Build and Fix\n\nIncrementally fix TypeScript and build errors:\n\n1. Run build: npm run build or pnpm build\n\n2. Parse error output:\n   - Group by file\n   - Sort by severity\n\n3. For each error:\n   - Show error context (5 lines before/after)\n   - Explain the issue\n   - Propose fix\n   - Apply fix\n   - Re-run build\n   - Verify error resolved\n\n4. Stop if:\n   - Fix introduces new errors\n   - Same error persists after 3 attempts\n   - User requests pause\n\n5. Show summary:\n   - Errors fixed\n   - Errors remaining\n   - New errors introduced\n\nFix one error at a time for safety!\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:42:29.799Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for TypeScript-focused AI Agents needing automated build error resolution and code fixing capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要自动化构建错误解决和代码修复功能的TypeScript专注的AI代理。","ja":"TypeScriptに焦点を当てたAIエージェントが自動ビルドエラ解決およびコード修復機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 빌드 오류 해결 및 코드 수정 기능이 필요한 TypeScript 중심의 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA enfocados en TypeScript que necesitan una resolución automática de errores de compilación y capacidades de reparación de código.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur TypeScript nécessitant une résolution automatique des erreurs de construction et des capacités de correction de code.","de":"Ideal für TypeScript-fokussierte KI-Agents, die eine automatisierte Auflösung von Build-Fehlern und Code-Correction-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados em TypeScript que necessitam de resolução automatizada de erros de construção e capacidades de correção de código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на TypeScript, которым необходима автоматизированная обработка ошибок сборки и возможности исправления кода.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يركز على TypeScript والذي يحتاج إلى حل آلي لخطأ البناء وقدرات إصلاح الشفرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to incrementally fix TypeScript and build errors using npm or pnpm, parse error outputs, and apply fixes, leveraging protocols like npm run build and pnpm build, while providing detailed error context and explanations.","zh":"赋予代理逐步修复TypeScript和构建错误的能力，使用npm或pnpm，解析错误输出，并应用修复，利用诸如npm run build和pnpm build的协议，同时提供详细的错误上下文和解释。","ja":"エージェントにTypeScriptおよびビルドのエラーを逐次的に修正する能力を付与し、npmまたはpnpmを使用してエラー出力を解析し、修正を適用し、npm run buildやpnpm buildなどのプロトコルを利用しながら、詳細なエラーのコンテキストと説明を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 TypeScript 및 빌드 오류를逐步으로 수정할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 npm 또는 pnpm을 사용하여 오류 출력을 파싱하고 수정을 적용하며 npm run build 및 pnpm build와 같은 프로토콜을 활용하여 자세한 오류 컨텍스트 및 설명을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes solucionar incrementalmente los errores de TypeScript y de compilación utilizando npm o pnpm, analizar las salidas de error y aplicar soluciones, aprovechando protocolos como npm run build y pnpm build, mientras proporciona un contexto de error detallado y explicaciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de résoudre de manière incrémentale les erreurs de TypeScript et de construction en utilisant npm ou pnpm, analyser les sorties d''erreur et appliquer des correctifs, en exploitant des protocoles tels que npm run build et pnpm build, tout en fournissant un contexte d''erreur détaillé et des explications.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, TypeScript- und Build-Fehler schrittweise zu beheben, indem sie npm oder pnpm verwenden, Fehlerausgaben zu analysieren und Korrekturen anzuwenden, wobei Protokolle wie npm run build und pnpm build genutzt werden, während detaillierte Fehlerkontexte und Erklärungen bereitgestellt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a corrigir incrementalmente erros do TypeScript e de construção usando npm ou pnpm, analisar saídas de erros e aplicar correções, aproveitando protocolos como npm run build e pnpm build, ao mesmo tempo em que fornece contexto de erro detalhado e explicações.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью инкрементально исправлять ошибки TypeScript и сборки с помощью npm или pnpm, парсить выводы ошибок и применять исправления, используя протоколы như npm run build и pnpm build, а также обеспечивая подробный контекст ошибок и объяснения.","ar":"يمكن للعميل إصلاح الخطأ تدريجيا باستخدام npm أو pnpm ، وتنقيح مخرجات الخطأ وتطبيق الإصلاحات ، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل npm run build و pnpm build ، وفي الوقت نفسه تقديم سياق خطأ مفصل وشرح."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating TypeScript error resolution","Debugging build issues with npm or pnpm","Incrementally fixing code errors and verifying resolutions"],"zh":["自动化TypeScript错误解决","使用npm或pnpm调试构建问题","逐步修复代码错误并验证解决方案"],"ja":["TypeScriptエラーソリューションの自動化","npmまたはpnpmを使用したビルドの問題のデバッグ","コードエラーソリューションの逐次的な修正および解決の検証"],"ko":["TypeScript 오류 해결 자동화","npm 또는 pnpm을 사용한 빌드 문제 디버깅","코드 오류 수정 및 해결 검증의逐步 수행"],"es":["Automatización de la resolución de errores de TypeScript","Depuración de problemas de compilación con npm o pnpm","Corrección incremental de errores de código y verificación de soluciones"],"fr":["Automatisation de la résolution des erreurs de TypeScript","Débogage des problèmes de construction avec npm ou pnpm","Correction incrémentale des erreurs de code et vérification des solutions"],"de":["Automatisierung der Auflösung von TypeScript-Fehlern","Fehlerbehebung bei Build-Problemen mit npm oder pnpm","Schrittweise Korrektur von Code-Fehlern und Überprüfung der Lösungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a resolução de erros do TypeScript","Depurar problemas de construção com npm ou pnpm","Corrigir incrementalmente erros de código e verificar resoluções"],"ru":["Автоматизировать решение проблем TypeScript","Отлаживать проблемы сборки с помощью npm или pnpm","Постепенно исправлять ошибки кода и проверять решения"],"ar":["تأتمتة حل مشاكل TypeScript","تصحيح مشاكل البناء باستخدام npm أو pnpm","إصلاح الخطأ تدريجيا وتحقق من الحلول"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm or pnpm installation","TypeScript only","Fix attempts limited to 3 to prevent infinite loops"],"zh":["需要安装npm或pnpm","仅支持TypeScript","修复尝试限制为3次以防止无限循环"],"ja":["npmまたはpnpmのインストールが必要","TypeScriptのみ対応","修正の試行は無限ループを防ぐために3回に制限"],"ko":["npm 또는 pnpm 설치 필요","TypeScript만 지원","수정 시도는 무한 루프를 방지하기 위해 3회로 제한"],"es":["Requiere instalación de npm o pnpm","Solo TypeScript","Intentos de corrección limitados a 3 para evitar bucles infinitos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de npm ou pnpm","TypeScript uniquement","Tentatives de correction limitées à 3 pour éviter les boucles infinies"],"de":["Erfordert Installation von npm oder pnpm","Nur TypeScript","Korrekturversuche auf 3 begrenzt, um endlose Schleifen zu vermeiden"],"pt":["Requer instalação do npm ou pnpm","Apenas TypeScript","Tentativas de correção limitadas a 3 para evitar loops infinitos"],"ru":["Требуется установка npm или pnpm","Только TypeScript","Попытки исправления ограничены 3, чтобы предотвратить бесконечные циклы"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت npm أو pnpm","TypeScript فقط","محاولات الإصلاح محدودة بـ 3 لمنع الحلقات المتناهیة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
