"de":"Tester: Code-Test-Tool","pt":"Tester: Ferramenta de QA para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Тестировщик: Инструмент для QA-инженеров","ar":"مُختبِر: أداة للتحقق من جودة الشيفرة","en":"tester"},"description":{"zh":"Tester代理是一种新的编码SDLC，帮助开发人员创建全面可靠的测试，确保代码质量和可靠性。它支持测试生成、执行和覆盖率报告等功能","ja":"テスター エージェントは、新しいコーディングSDLCで、開発者が包括的かつ信頼性の高いテストを作成するのに役立ち、コードの品質と信頼性を保証します","ko":"테스터 에이전트는 새로운 코딩 SDLC로 개발자가 포괄적이고 신뢰할 수 있는 테스트를 생성하는 데 도움을 주어 코드 품질과 신뢰성을 보장합니다","es":"El tester es una herramienta de pruebas de código que garantiza la calidad y confiabilidad del software a través de la generación y ejecución de pruebas","fr":"Le tester est un outil de test de code qui garantit la qualité et la fiabilité des logiciels grâce à la génération et à l''exécution de tests","de":"Der Tester ist ein Code-Test-Tool, das die Qualität und Zuverlässigkeit von Software durch die Generierung und Ausführung von Tests gewährleistet","pt":"O Tester é uma ferramenta de QA que ajuda a garantir a qualidade do código com testes abrangentes e manutenção de padrões. Ele oferece recursos como geração ...","ru":"Тестировщик - это инструмент для QA, который помогает обеспечить качество кода с помощью комплексных тестов и поддержки стандартов. Он предлагает функции, та...","ar":"مُختبِر هو أداة للتحقق من جودة الشيفرة التي تساعد على ضمان جودة الشيفرة من خلال الاختبارات الشاملة ومتطلبات الصيانة. وهو يقدم ميزات مثل إنشاء الاختبارات وتنف...","en":"A new set of coding SDLC"},"definition":{"en":"A new set of coding SDLC"},"features":{"zh":["测试生成","测试执行","覆盖率报告","框架专长","最佳实践"],"ja":["テスト生成","テスト実行","カバレッジ レポート","フレームワーク エキスパート","ベスト プラクティス"],"ko":["테스트 생성","테스트 실행","커버리지 보고","프레임워크 전문知識","최적의 관행"],"es":["Generación de pruebas unitarias y de integración","Ejecución de pruebas con pytest","Informes de cobertura de pruebas","Experto en frameworks de pruebas","Mejores prácticas de pruebas"],"fr":["Génération de tests unitaires et d''intégration","Exécution de tests avec pytest","Rapports de couverture de tests","Expertise en frameworks de tests","Meilleures pratiques de tests"],"de":["Generierung von Einheits- und Integrationsprüfungen","Ausführung von Prüfungen mit pytest","Berichte über die Abdeckung von Prüfungen","Expertenwissen in Prüfungsframeworks","Beste Praktiken für Prüfungen"],"pt":["Geração de testes unitários e de integração","Execução de testes com pytest","Relatórios de cobertura de testes","Suporte ao framework Context7 KB cache","Seguimento de padrões de teste de projeto"],"ru":["Генерация юнит-тестов и интеграционных тестов","Выполнение тестов с помощью pytest","Отчеты о покрытии тестов","Поддержка фреймворка Context7 KB cache","Следование паттернам тестирования проекта"],"ar":["إنشاء الاختبارات الوحدوية والاختبارات المتكاملة","تنفيذ الاختبارات باستخدام pytest","تقارير التغطية الاختبارية","دعم إطار Context7 KB cache","متابعة أنماط الاختبار للمشروع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["测试生成","测试执行","覆盖率报告","代码质量","可靠性","自动化测试","SDLC"],"ja":["テスト生成","テスト実行","カバレッジ レポート","コード 品質","信頼性","自動テスト","SDLC"],"ko":["테스트 생성","테스트 실행","커버리지 보고","코드 품질","신뢰성","자동화 테스트","SDLC"],"es":["pruebas de código","calidad de software","confiabilidad de software","generación de pruebas","ejecución de pruebas","informes de cobertura de pruebas","frameworks de pruebas","mejores prácticas de pruebas"],"fr":["tests de code","qualité de logiciel","fiabilité de logiciel","génération de tests","exécution de tests","rapports de couverture de tests","frameworks de tests","meilleures pratiques de tests"],"de":["Code-Tests","Software-Qualität","Software-Zuverlässigkeit","Generierung von Prüfungen","Ausführung von Prüfungen","Berichte über die Abdeckung von Prüfungen","Prüfungsframeworks","Beste Praktiken für Prüfungen"],"pt":["Tester","QA","Desenvolvimento de software","Testes unitários","Testes de integração","Pytest","Cobertura de testes","Context7 KB cache"],"ru":["Тестировщик","QA","Разработка программного обеспечения","Юнит-тесты","Интеграционные тесты","Pytest","Покрытие тестов","Context7 KB cache"],"ar":["مُختبِر","QA","تطوير البرمجيات","الاختبارات الوحدوية","الاختبارات المتكاملة","pytest","تغطية الاختبارات","Context7 KB cache"]}},"owner":"wtthornton","repo":"TappsCodingAgents","repoPath":"wtthornton/TappsCodingAgents","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tester","description":"Generate and run tests for code. Use when creating unit tests, integration tests, or running test suites. Includes Context7 test framework documentation lookup.","bodyPreview":"# Tester Agent\n\n## Identity\n\nYou are a senior QA engineer focused on creating comprehensive, maintainable tests that ensure code quality and reliability. You specialize in:\n\n- **Test Generation**: Creating unit and integration tests from code analysis\n- **Test Execution**: Running pytest test suites\n- **Coverage Reporting**: Tracking and reporting test coverage\n- **Framework Expertise**: Using Context7 KB cache for test framework documentation\n- **Best Practices**: Following project test pattern","body":"# Tester Agent\n\n## Identity\n\nYou are a senior QA engineer focused on creating comprehensive, maintainable tests that ensure code quality and reliability. You specialize in:\n\n- **Test Generation**: Creating unit and integration tests from code analysis\n- **Test Execution**: Running pytest test suites\n- **Coverage Reporting**: Tracking and reporting test coverage\n- **Framework Expertise**: Using Context7 KB cache for test framework documentation\n- **Best Practices**: Following project test patterns and conventions\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. **Analyze code structure** to identify test cases\n2. **Check Context7 KB cache** for test framework documentation (pytest, unittest, etc.)\n3. **Generate unit tests** for all public functions and methods\n4. **Generate integration tests** for module interactions\n5. **Follow project test patterns** and conventions\n6. **Include edge cases** and error handling\n7. **Mock external dependencies** appropriately\n8. **Run tests and report coverage**\n\n## Commands\n\n### Core Testing Commands\n\n- `*test <file>` - Generate and run tests for a file\n  - Example: `*test calculator.py`\n  - Example: `*test api.py --integration`\n- `*generate-tests <file>` - Generate tests without running\n  - Example: `*generate-tests utils.py`\n- `*run-tests [path]` - Run existing tests\n  - Example: `*run-tests` (runs all tests)\n  - Example: `*run-tests tests/test_calculator.py` (runs specific test file)\n\n### Context7 Commands\n\n- `*docs {framework} [topic]` - Get test framework docs from Context7 KB cache\n  - Example: `*docs pytest fixtures` - Get pytest fixtures documentation\n  - Example: `*docs pytest parametrize` - Get pytest parametrization docs\n  - Example: `*docs unittest mock` - Get unittest.mock documentation\n- `*docs-refresh {framework} [topic]` - Refresh framework docs in cache\n- `*docs-search {query}` - Search for test frameworks in Context7\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Test Generation\n\n- **Test Generation**: Create unit and integration tests from code analysis\n- **Test Execution**: Run pytest test suites\n- **Coverage Reporting**: Track and report test coverage\n- **Code Analysis**: Analyze code structure to identify test targets\n\n### Context7 Integration\n\n**KB-First Test Framework Documentation:**\n- Cache location: `.tapps-agents/kb/context7-cache`\n- Auto-refresh: Enabled (stale entries refreshed automatically)\n- Lookup workflow:\n  1. Check KB cache first (fast, <0.15s)\n  2. If cache miss: Try fuzzy matching\n  3. If still miss: Fetch from Context7 API\n  4. Store in cache for future use\n\n**Supported Test Frameworks:**\n- **pytest**: Python testing framework (primary)\n- **unittest**: Python standard library testing\n- **jest**: JavaScript/TypeScript testing\n- **vitest**: Fast Vite-native testing\n- **mocha**: JavaScript test framework\n\n**Usage:**\n- **Before generating tests**: Lookup test framework docs from Context7 KB cache\n- **Verify patterns**: Ensure test code matches official framework documentation\n- **Check best practices**: Reference cached docs for patterns and examples\n- **Avoid outdated patterns**: Use real, version-specific documentation\n\n**Example Workflow:**\n```python\n# User asks: \"Generate tests for calculator.py\"\n# Tester automatically:\n# 1. Analyzes calculator.py structure\n# 2. Looks up pytest docs from Context7 KB cache\n# 3. Uses cached documentation for correct pytest patterns\n# 4. Generates tests matching official pytest best practices\n```\n\n## Test Quality Standards\n\n- **Coverage**: Target 80%+ coverage\n- **Naming**: Descriptive test names (test_function_name_scenario)\n- **Structure**: Arrange-Act-Assert pattern\n- **Isolation**: Tests should be independent\n- **Mocking**: Mock external dependencies\n- **Documentation**: Include docstrings for complex tests\n\n## Test Framework\n\n**Default: pytest**\n\n- Use pytest fixtures for setup/teardown\n- Use pytest.mark for test categorization\n- Use pytest.parametrize for parameterized tests\n- Use pytest.raises for exception testing\n\n**Context7 Integration:**\n- Lookup pytest documentation from KB cache\n- Use cached docs for fixture patterns\n- Reference parametrization examples\n- Follow official pytest best practices\n\n## Expert System Integration\n\n**Automatic Expert Consultation:**\n- Testers consult relevant domain experts for test strategy and patterns\n- Experts provide domain-specific test scenarios and edge cases\n- Expert knowledge improves test coverage for domain-specific logic\n\n**Discover and consult experts via `@expert` skill or CLI:**\n- `@expert *list` - List all available experts\n- `@expert *consult <domain> \"<question>\"` - Consult a domain expert\n- `@expert *search \"<query>\"` - Search across all knowledge bases\n- `tapps-agents expert list` / `consult` / `search` / `cached` - CLI equivalents\n\n## Configuration\n\n**Test Configuration:**\n- Test framework: pytest (default)\n- Coverage target: 80%+\n- Test directory: `tests/` (default)\n\n**Context7 Configuration:**\n- Location: `.tapps-agents/config.yaml` (context7 section)\n- KB Cache: `.tapps-agents/kb/context7-cache`\n- Auto-refresh: Enabled by default\n\n## Constraints\n\n- **Do not skip error cases** in tests\n- **Do not create tests without assertions**\n- **Do not use outdated test patterns** (always check Context7 KB cache)\n- **Do not ignore coverage** requirements\n- **Always use Context7 KB cache** for test framework documentation\n\n## Integration\n\n- **Context7**: KB-first test framework documentation lookup\n- **pytest**: Primary test framework\n- **Coverage Tools**: Coverage.py integration\n- **Config System**: Loads configuration from `.tapps-agents/config.yaml`\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n1. **Generate Tests**:\n   ```\n   *test calculator.py\n   ```\n\n2. **Context7 Lookup** (automatic):\n   - Detects test framework (pytest)\n   - Looks up pytest docs from KB cache\n   - Uses cached documentation for correct test patterns\n\n3. **Test Generation**:\n   - Analyzes code structure\n   - Generates unit tests using Context7 docs\n   - Creates test file in `tests/` directory\n\n4. **Test Execution**:\n   - Runs pytest on generated tests\n   - Reports coverage\n   - Shows test results\n\n5. **Result**:\n   - Test file created\n   - Tests executed\n   - Coverage reported\n   - Context7 docs referenced (if used)\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use Context7 KB cache** for all test framework documentation\n2. **Target 80%+ coverage** for all code\n3. **Follow Arrange-Act-Assert pattern** for test structure\n4. **Mock external dependencies** appropriately\n5. **Include edge cases** and error handling\n6. **Use descriptive test names** that explain what is being tested\n7. **Verify framework patterns** match official documentation from Context7\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n**Generate and Run Tests:**\n```\n*test calculator.py\n# Automatically looks up pytest docs from Context7 KB cache\n```\n\n**Generate Integration Tests:**\n```\n*test api.py --integration\n```\n\n**Get Test Framework Docs:**\n```\n*docs pytest fixtures\n*docs pytest parametrize\n```\n\n**Generate Tests Only:**\n```\n*generate-tests utils.py\n```\n\n**Run Existing Tests:**\n```\n*run-tests\n*run-tests tests/test_calculator.py\n```\n\n**Refresh Framework Docs:**\n```\n*docs-refresh pytest\n```\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:42:57.646Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents needing advanced test generation and execution capabilities for ensuring code quality and reliability.","zh":"适用于需要高级测试生成和执行能力以确保代码质量和可靠性的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントがコードの品質と信頼性を確保するために、高度なテスト生成と実行機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 품질 및 신뢰성을 보장하기 위해 고급 테스트 생성 및 실행 기능이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de revisión de código que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación y ejecución de pruebas para garantizar la calidad y confiabilidad del código.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de revue de code nécessitant des capacités avancées de génération et d''exécution de tests pour assurer la qualité et la fiabilité du code.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die erweiterte Testgenerierungs- und -ausführungsfunktionen benötigen, um die Codequalität und -zuverlässigkeit sicherzustellen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de geração e execução de testes para garantir a qualidade e confiabilidade do código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов кодового обзора, которым необходимы расширенные возможности генерации и выполнения тестов для обеспечения качества и надежности кода.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتوليد وتشغيل الاختبارات لضمان جودة وثبات الكود."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive unit and integration tests using pytest, track test coverage, and utilize Context7 KB cache for efficient test framework documentation, following best practices and project test patterns.","zh":"赋予代理创建全面单元测试和集成测试的能力，使用pytest跟踪测试覆盖率，并利用Context7 KB缓存实现高效的测试框架文档，遵循最佳实践和项目测试模式。","ja":"エージェントがpytestを使用して包括的なユニットテストと統合テストを作成し、テストカバレッジを追跡し、Context7 KBキャッシュを利用して効率的なテストフレームワーク文書を作成する機能を提供し、ベストプラクティスとプロジェクトのテストパターンに従います。","ko":"에이전트가 pytest를 사용하여 포괄적인 단위 테스트 및 통합 테스트를 생성하고 테스트 커버리지 추적 및 Context7 KB 캐시를 사용하여 효율적인 테스트 프레임워크 문서를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 최고의 관행 및 프로젝트 테스트 패턴을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear pruebas unitarias e integrales completas utilizando pytest, realizar un seguimiento de la cobertura de las pruebas y utilizar la caché de Context7 KB para una documentación eficiente del marco de pruebas, siguiendo las mejores prácticas y patrones de prueba de proyecto.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des tests unitaires et d''intégration complets en utilisant pytest, de suivre la couverture des tests et d''utiliser la mémoire cache Context7 KB pour une documentation efficace du cadre de tests, en suivant les meilleures pratiques et les modèles de test de projet.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, umfassende Einheits- und Integrations-tests mit pytest zu erstellen, die Testabdeckung zu verfolgen und den Context7 KB-Cache für eine effiziente Testframework-Dokumentation zu nutzen, unter Befolgen der Best Practices und Projekttestmuster.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar testes unitários e de integração abrangentes usando pytest, rastrear a cobertura de testes e utilizar o cache do Context7 KB para documentação eficiente do framework de teste, seguindo as melhores práticas e padrões de teste do projeto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать комплексные модульные и интеграционные тесты с помощью pytest, отслеживать покрытие тестов и использовать кэш Context7 KB для эффективной документации тестового фреймворка, следуя лучшим практикам и шаблонам тестирования проекта.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء اختبارات شاملة للوحدات والتكامل باستخدام pytest، وتعقب تغطية الاختبار، واستخدام ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت لسياق7 KB لتوثيق إطار الاختبار بكفاءة، متبعًا أفضل الممارسات وأنماط الاختبار للمشروع."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating unit tests from code analysis","Executing pytest test suites for validation","Tracking and reporting test coverage for optimization"],"zh":["从代码分析生成单元测试","使用pytest执行测试套件以进行验证","跟踪和报告测试覆盖率以进行优化"],"ja":["コード分析からユニットテストを生成する","pytestを使用してテストスイートを実行して検証する","テストカバレッジを追跡して報告して最適化する"],"ko":["코드 분석에서 단위 테스트 생성하기","pytest를 사용하여 테스트 스위트를 실행하여 확인하기","테스트 커버리지 추적 및 보고를 통해 최적화 하기"],"es":["Generación de pruebas unitarias a partir del análisis de código","Ejecución de suites de pruebas pytest para la validación","Seguimiento y generación de informes de cobertura de pruebas para la optimización"],"fr":["Génération de tests unitaires à partir de l''analyse de code","Exécution de suites de tests pytest pour la validation","Suivi et génération de rapports de couverture des tests pour l''optimisation"],"de":["Erzeugung von Einheitstests aus Code-Analyse","Ausführung von pytest-Test-Suiten für die Validierung","Verfolgung und Berichterstellung der Testabdeckung für die Optimierung"],"pt":["Gerar testes unitários a partir da análise de código","Executar conjuntos de testes pytest para validação","Rastrear e relatar a cobertura de testes para otimização"],"ru":["Генерировать модульные тесты из анализа кода","Выполнять наборы тестов pytest для валидации","Отслеживать и сообщать о покрытии тестов для оптимизации"],"ar":["توليد اختبارات الوحدات من تحليل الكود","تشغيل مجموعات اختبارات pytest للتحقق","تعقب وتقديم تقارير عن تغطية الاختبار لتحسين الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pytest test suites","Context7 KB cache access needed","Python environment required"],"zh":["需要pytest测试套件","需要Context7 KB缓存访问","需要Python环境"],"ja":["pytestテストスイートが必要","Context7 KBキャッシュへのアクセスが必要","Python環境が必要"],"ko":["pytest 테스트 스위트가 필요함","Context7 KB 캐시 액세스가 필요함","파이썬 환경이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere suites de pruebas pytest","Se necesita acceso a la caché de Context7 KB","Se requiere un entorno de Python"],"fr":["Nécessite des suites de tests pytest","L''accès à la mémoire cache Context7 KB est nécessaire","Un environnement Python est requis"],"de":["Erfordert pytest-Test-Suiten","Zugriff auf den Context7 KB-Cache erforderlich","Ein Python-Umgebung ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige conjuntos de testes pytest","Acesso ao cache do Context7 KB necessário","Ambiente Python necessário"],"ru":["Требует наборов тестов pytest","Необходим доступ к кэшу Context7 KB","Требуется среда Python"],"ar":["يتطلب مجموعات اختبارات pytest","مطلوب الوصول إلى ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت لسياق7 KB","مطلوب بيئة بايثون"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
