:"Blocage de Profil dans Spring WebFlux","de":"Profil-Blockierung in Spring WebFlux","pt":"Bloqueio de Perfil: Otimização de Desempenho em Spring We...","ru":"Блокировка Профилей: Оптимизация Производительности в Spr...","ar":"حظر الملف الشخصي: تحسين الأداء في Spring WebFlux","en":"profile-blocking"},"description":{"zh":"Profile Blocking 技术用于识别 Spring WebFlux 应用中的阻塞调用，优化性能，避免线程饥饿和死锁","ja":"プロファイルブロッキング技術は、Spring WebFluxアプリケーションの中のブロッキングコールを識別し、パフォーマンスを最適化し、スレッドスター バーションとデッドロックを回避","ko":"프로파일 블로킹 기술은 Spring WebFlux 애플리케이션의 블로킹 호출을 식별하여 성능을 최적화하고 스레드 기아와 데드락을 피하는 데 사용","es":"El bloqueo de perfil es una habilidad que ayuda a identificar llamadas bloqueantes en el código reactivo de Spring WebFlux, mejorando el rendimiento y evitan...","fr":"Le blocage de profil est une compétence qui aide à identifier les appels bloquants dans le code réactif Spring WebFlux, améliorant les performances et évitan...","de":"Die Profil-Blockierung ist eine Fähigkeit, die bei der Identifizierung von blockierenden Aufrufen im reaktiven Code von Spring WebFlux hilft, um die Leistung...","pt":"O bloqueio de perfil ajuda a identificar chamadas de bloqueio no código reativo, melhorando o desempenho em aplicações Spring WebFlux.","ru":"Блокировка профилей помогает выявлять блокирующие вызовы в реактивном коде, улучшая производительность в приложениях Spring WebFlux.","ar":"حظر الملف الشخصي يساعد في تحديد مكالمات الحظر في قاعدة الكود التفاعلية، مما يحسن الأداء في تطبيقات Spring WebFlux.","en":"🏄 kite spots database and weather forecast for kitesurfers on the web"},"definition":{"en":"🏄 kite spots database and weather forecast for kitesurfers on the web"},"features":{"zh":["识别阻塞调用","优化 Spring WebFlux 应用性能","避免线程饥饿和死锁","使用 Grep 搜索阻塞模式","支持 Mono/Flux 阻塞订阅"],"ja":["ブロッキングコールの識別","Spring WebFluxアプリケーションパフォーマンスの最適化","スレッドスター バーションとデッドロックの回避","Grep を使用してブロッキングパターンを検索","Mono/Flux ブロッキングサブスクリプションのサポート"],"ko":["블로킹 호출 식별","Spring WebFlux 애플리케이션 성능 최적화","스레드 기아와 데드락 피하기","Grep 사용하여 블로킹 패턴 검색","Mono/Flux 블로킹 구독 지원"],"es":["Identificación de llamadas bloqueantes","Mejora del rendimiento de Spring WebFlux","Evitación de problemas de concurrencia","Uso de Grep para buscar patrones de bloqueo","Soporte para Mono y Flux"],"fr":["Identification des appels bloquants","Amélioration des performances de Spring WebFlux","Évitement des problèmes de concurrence","Utilisation de Grep pour rechercher des modèles de blocage","Prise en charge de Mono et Flux"],"de":["Identifizierung von blockierenden Aufrufen","Leistungsverbesserung von Spring WebFlux","Vermeidung von Konkurrenzproblemen","Verwendung von Grep zur Suche nach Blockierungsmustern","Unterstützung für Mono und Flux"],"pt":["Identificação de chamadas de bloqueio","Melhoria do desempenho em aplicações Spring WebFlux","Prevenção de fome de threads e deadlocks","Otimização de desempenho","Análise de código reativo"],"ru":["Обнаружение блокирующих вызовов","Улучшение производительности в приложениях Spring WebFlux","Предотвращение голода потоков и тупиков","Оптимизация производительности","Анализ реактивного кода"],"ar":["تحديد مكالمات الحظر","تحسين الأداء في تطبيقات Spring WebFlux","منع جوع الخيوط وطواقم الحظر","تحسين الأداء","تحليل قاعدة الكود التفاعلية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Profile Blocking","Spring WebFlux","阻塞调用","性能优化","线程饥饿","死锁","Grep","Mono/Flux"],"ja":["プロファイルブロッキング","Spring WebFlux","ブロッキングコール","パフォーマンス最適化","スレッドスター バーション","デッドロック","Grep","Mono/Flux"],"ko":["프로파일 블로킹","Spring WebFlux","블로킹 호출","성능 최적화","스레드 기아","데드락","Grep","Mono/Flux"],"es":["bloqueo de perfil","Spring WebFlux","código reactivo","llamadas bloqueantes","rendimiento","concurrencia"],"fr":["blocage de profil","Spring WebFlux","code réactif","appels bloquants","performances","concurrence"],"de":["Profil-Blockierung","Spring WebFlux","reaktiver Code","blockierende Aufrufe","Leistung","Konkurrenz"],"pt":["bloqueio de perfil","Spring WebFlux","desempenho","otimização","código reativo","chamadas de bloqueio","fome de threads","deadlocks"],"ru":["блокировка профилей","Spring WebFlux","производительность","оптимизация","реактивный код","блокирующие вызовы","голод потоков","тупики"],"ar":["حظر الملف الشخصي","Spring WebFlux","الأداء","تحسين","قاعدة الكود التفاعلية","مكالمات الحظر","جوع الخيوط","طواقم الحظر"]}},"owner":"pwittchen","repo":"varun.surf","repoPath":"pwittchen/varun.surf","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"profile-blocking","description":"Find blocking calls in reactive WebFlux code that can cause performance issues and thread starvation","bodyPreview":"# Profile Blocking Skill\n\nIdentify blocking calls in the reactive codebase that can cause thread starvation, deadlocks, and performance degradation in Spring WebFlux applications.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Search for Blocking Patterns\n\nUse `Grep` to search for these blocking call patterns:\n\n#### Direct Blocking Calls\n```java\n.block()           // Mono/Flux blocking subscription\n.blockFirst()      // Flux blocking first element\n.blockLast()       // Flux blocking last element\n.blockOptional()   //","body":"# Profile Blocking Skill\n\nIdentify blocking calls in the reactive codebase that can cause thread starvation, deadlocks, and performance degradation in Spring WebFlux applications.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. Search for Blocking Patterns\n\nUse `Grep` to search for these blocking call patterns:\n\n#### Direct Blocking Calls\n```java\n.block()           // Mono/Flux blocking subscription\n.blockFirst()      // Flux blocking first element\n.blockLast()       // Flux blocking last element\n.blockOptional()   // Mono blocking to Optional\n.toFuture().get()  // CompletableFuture blocking\n.get()             // Future.get() blocking\n.join()            // CompletableFuture.join()\n```\n\n#### Thread Blocking\n```java\nThread.sleep(      // Thread sleep\nObject.wait(       // Object monitor wait\n.await(            // CountDownLatch, CyclicBarrier await\n.acquire(          // Semaphore blocking acquire\nsynchronized       // Synchronized blocks (potential)\nReentrantLock.lock // Explicit locking\n```\n\n#### Blocking I/O\n```java\nInputStream        // Blocking input streams\nOutputStream       // Blocking output streams\nFileInputStream    // File I/O\nFileOutputStream   // File I/O\nBufferedReader     // Blocking readers\nScanner            // Blocking scanner\nnew URL(           // URL.openStream() is blocking\nHttpURLConnection  // Blocking HTTP\n```\n\n#### JDBC/Database (if present)\n```java\nJdbcTemplate       // Blocking JDBC\nEntityManager      // Blocking JPA\n.save(             // Repository blocking save\n.findBy            // Repository blocking find\nDataSource         // Direct datasource access\n```\n\n### 2. Context-Aware Analysis\n\nFor each finding, determine if it''s:\n\n**Acceptable blocking**:\n- Inside `StructuredTaskScope` (this project uses Java 24 virtual threads)\n- In `@Scheduled` methods running on separate thread pool\n- In test code\n- Wrapped in `Mono.fromCallable()` with `.subscribeOn(Schedulers.boundedElastic())`\n- In startup/initialization code (non-request path)\n\n**Problematic blocking**:\n- In `@RestController` methods returning `Mono`/`Flux`\n- In reactive chain operators (map, flatMap, filter)\n- On Netty event loop threads\n- In `WebFilter` implementations\n- Inside `Mono.create()` or `Flux.create()` without scheduler\n\n### 3. Analyze Reactive Chains\n\nCheck for anti-patterns in reactive code:\n\n```java\n// BAD: Blocking in map\nmono.map(data -> {\n    blockingCall();  // Blocks event loop!\n    return result;\n})\n\n// BAD: Blocking in flatMap\nflux.flatMap(item -> {\n    var result = blockingService.call();  // Blocks!\n    return Mono.just(result);\n})\n\n// GOOD: Proper offloading\nmono.flatMap(data ->\n    Mono.fromCallable(() -> blockingCall())\n        .subscribeOn(Schedulers.boundedElastic())\n)\n```\n\n### 4. Check This Project''s Specific Patterns\n\n**Files to examine**:\n- `src/main/java/**/controller/*.java` - REST endpoints\n- `src/main/java/**/service/*.java` - Service layer\n- `src/main/java/**/strategy/*.java` - Strategy implementations\n- `src/main/java/**/config/*.java` - Configuration classes\n\n**Known acceptable patterns in this project**:\n- `StructuredTaskScope` usage in `AggregatorService` (virtual threads)\n- `.block()` inside virtual thread contexts\n- OkHttp calls (executed in separate thread pool)\n\n**Patterns to flag**:\n- `.block()` in controller methods\n- Blocking in `WebFilter` or `HandlerFilterFunction`\n- Synchronous HTTP calls without proper scheduling\n\n### 5. Virtual Thread Considerations\n\nThis project uses Java 24 with virtual threads. Check:\n\n```java\n// Virtual thread factory usage\nThread.ofVirtual().factory()\n\n// StructuredTaskScope usage (blocking is OK inside)\ntry (var scope = new StructuredTaskScope.ShutdownOnFailure()) {\n    scope.fork(() -> blockingCall());  // OK - virtual thread\n    scope.join();  // OK - virtual thread blocks, not platform thread\n}\n```\n\n### 6. HTTP Client Analysis\n\nCheck OkHttp usage patterns:\n\n```java\n// Synchronous call - check if on reactive thread\nResponse response = client.newCall(request).execute();\n\n// Better: Use async\nclient.newCall(request).enqueue(callback);\n\n// Or wrap properly\nMono.fromCallable(() -> client.newCall(request).execute())\n    .subscribeOn(Schedulers.boundedElastic())\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n## Blocking Call Analysis Report\n\n### Summary\n| Category | Count | Severity |\n|----------|-------|----------|\n| Direct .block() calls | X | High/Medium |\n| Thread.sleep() | X | High |\n| Blocking I/O | X | Medium |\n| Synchronized blocks | X | Low |\n| **Total potential issues** | **Y** | |\n\n### Critical Issues (Event Loop Blocking)\n\n#### [Issue Title]\n**File**: `path/to/file.java:line`\n**Pattern**: `.block()` in reactive chain\n**Context**: Inside @RestController endpoint\n**Risk**: Thread starvation, request timeouts\n```java\n// Current code\n@GetMapping(\"/data\")\npublic Mono<Data> getData() {\n    return service.fetchData()\n        .map(d -> blockingTransform(d));  // BLOCKS!\n}\n```\n**Fix**:\n```java\n@GetMapping(\"/data\")\npublic Mono<Data> getData() {\n    return service.fetchData()\n        .flatMap(d -> Mono.fromCallable(() -> blockingTransform(d))\n            .subscribeOn(Schedulers.boundedElastic()));\n}\n```\n\n### Medium Priority (Potential Issues)\n\n| File | Line | Pattern | Context | Verdict |\n|------|------|---------|---------|---------|\n| Service.java | 42 | .block() | Inside StructuredTaskScope | OK |\n| Handler.java | 78 | Thread.sleep | Test code | OK |\n\n### Acceptable Blocking (Verified Safe)\n\nThese blocking calls are in appropriate contexts:\n\n| File | Line | Pattern | Why It''s OK |\n|------|------|---------|-------------|\n| AggregatorService.java | 120 | .block() | Inside virtual thread scope |\n| ForecastService.java | 85 | OkHttp.execute() | Wrapped in fromCallable |\n\n### Patterns Found\n\n#### .block() Calls\n```\nsrc/main/java/.../Service.java:42  - response.block()\nsrc/main/java/.../Service.java:87  - result.blockFirst()\n```\n\n#### Thread Blocking\n```\nsrc/main/java/.../Worker.java:23   - Thread.sleep(1000)\n```\n\n#### Blocking I/O\n```\nsrc/main/java/.../Reader.java:15   - new FileInputStream()\n```\n\n### Recommendations\n\n1. **Immediate**: Move blocking call at `File.java:42` to bounded elastic scheduler\n2. **Review**: Verify StructuredTaskScope usage covers all blocking in AggregatorService\n3. **Consider**: Replace synchronous OkHttp with async calls or WebClient\n\n### Reactive Best Practices Checklist\n\n- [ ] No .block() in @RestController methods\n- [ ] No .block() in WebFilter implementations\n- [ ] Blocking I/O wrapped with boundedElastic scheduler\n- [ ] Thread.sleep() only in tests or scheduled tasks\n- [ ] Synchronized blocks minimized and not in hot paths\n- [ ] HTTP clients properly configured for async or offloaded\n```\n\n## Execution Steps\n\n1. Use `Grep` to find all `.block()` calls\n2. Use `Grep` to find `Thread.sleep`, `.await(`, `synchronized`\n3. Use `Grep` to find blocking I/O patterns\n4. Read each file to determine context (controller vs service vs test)\n5. Check if blocking is inside StructuredTaskScope or virtual thread\n6. Categorize findings by severity\n7. Generate report with fix recommendations\n\n## Notes\n\n- Virtual threads (Java 21+) change the blocking calculus - blocking is OK on virtual threads\n- This project uses StructuredTaskScope, so verify scope boundaries\n- OkHttp is blocking by default but may be acceptable if not on event loop\n- Focus on request-handling paths; scheduled tasks are lower priority\n- Some `.block()` in tests is normal and acceptable\n- Spring WebFlux Netty uses limited event loop threads - blocking them is critical\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:42:35.108Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Reactive Java Agents needing to identify performance degradation in Spring WebFlux applications.","zh":"适合需要识别Spring WebFlux应用程序性能降级的响应式Java代理。","ja":"Spring WebFluxアプリケーションのパフォーマンス低下を識別する必要があるReactive Javaエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Spring WebFlux 애플리케이션의 성능 저하를 식별해야 하는 리액티브 자바 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes Java Reactivos que necesitan identificar la degradación del rendimiento en aplicaciones Spring WebFlux.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Java réactifs ayant besoin d''identifier la dégradation des performances dans les applications Spring WebFlux.","de":"Perfekt für reaktive Java-Agents, die Leistungsverschlechterungen in Spring WebFlux-Anwendungen identifizieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Java Reativos que precisam identificar degradação de desempenho em aplicações Spring WebFlux.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Реактивных Java Агентов, которым необходимо выявлять ухудшение производительности в приложениях Spring WebFlux.","ar":"مثالي لعميل جافا التفاعلي الذي يحتاج إلى تحديد انخفاض أداء في تطبيقات Spring WebFlux."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to detect blocking calls causing thread starvation and deadlocks by scanning for patterns like .block(), .blockFirst(), and .blockLast() using Grep, enhancing their ability to optimize reactive codebases.","zh":"通过使用Grep扫描诸如.block()、.blockFirst()和.blockLast()等模式，赋予代理检测导致线程饥饿和死锁的阻塞调用，增强优化响应式代码库的能力。","ja":"Grepを使用して.block()、.blockFirst()、.blockLast()などのパターンをスキャンすることで、エージェントがスレッド枯渇とデッドロックの原因となるブロッキングコールを検出できるようにし、リアクティブコードベースを最適化する能力を向上させます。","ko":"Grep를 사용하여 .block(), .blockFirst(), .blockLast() 등의 패턴을 스캔하여 에이전트가 스레드 기아와 데드락을 유발하는 블로킹 호출을检测할 수 있도록 하여 리액티브 코드베이스를 최적화하는 능력을 향상시킵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes detectar llamadas de bloqueo que causan inanición de hilos y bloqueos mediante el escaneo de patrones como .block(), .blockFirst() y .blockLast() utilizando Grep, mejorando su capacidad para optimizar bases de código reactivas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de détecter les appels bloquants provoquant une famine de threads et des interblocages en analysant les modèles tels que .block(), .blockFirst() et .blockLast() à l''aide de Grep, améliorant ainsi leur capacité à optimiser les bases de code réactives.","de":"Ermöglicht Agents das Erkennen von blockierenden Aufrufen, die Thread-Starvation und Deadlocks verursachen, durch das Scannen nach Mustern wie .block(), .blockFirst() und .blockLast() mit Grep, und verbessert so ihre Fähigkeit, reaktive Codebasen zu optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a detectar chamadas de bloqueio que causam inanição de threads e deadlocks, pesquisando padrões como .block(), .blockFirst() e .blockLast() usando Grep, melhorando sua capacidade de otimizar repositórios de código reativo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обнаруживать блокирующие вызовы, вызывающие истощение потоков и тупики, сканируя шаблоны, такие как .block(), .blockFirst() и .blockLast(), используя Grep, повышая их способность оптимизировать реактивные кодовые базы.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من اكتشاف المكالمات المحظورة التي تسبب نقصًا في الخيوط وطُرق مسدودة من خلال مسح أنماط مثل .block() و .blockFirst() و .blockLast() باستخدام Grep، مما يحسّن قدرته على تحسين قواعد البيانات التفاعلية."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging thread starvation issues","Identifying deadlocks in reactive code","Optimizing Spring WebFlux application performance"],"zh":["调试线程饥饿问题","识别响应式代码中的死锁","优化Spring WebFlux应用程序性能"],"ja":["スレッド枯渇の問題をデバッグする","リアクティブコードのデッドロックを特定する","Spring WebFluxアプリケーションのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["스레드 기아 문제를 디버깅하는 것","리액티브 코드의 데드락을 식별하는 것","Spring WebFlux 애플리케이션의 성능을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Depuración de problemas de inanición de hilos","Identificación de bloqueos en código reactivo","Optimización del rendimiento de aplicaciones Spring WebFlux"],"fr":["Débogage des problèmes de famine de threads","Identification des interblocages dans le code réactif","Optimisation des performances des applications Spring WebFlux"],"de":["Debugging von Thread-Starvation-Problemen","Identifizierung von Deadlocks in reaktivem Code","Optimierung der Leistung von Spring WebFlux-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas de inanição de threads","Identificação de deadlocks em código reativo","Otimização do desempenho de aplicações Spring WebFlux"],"ru":["Отладка проблем с истощением потоков","Определение тупиков в реактивном коде","Оптимизация производительности приложений Spring WebFlux"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء نقص الخيوط","تحديد الطُرق المسدودة في الشفرة التفاعلية","تحسين أداء تطبيقات Spring WebFlux"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to reactive codebase","Specific to Spring WebFlux applications","Java-based"],"zh":["需要访问响应式代码库","仅适用于Spring WebFlux应用程序","基于Java"],"ja":["リアクティブコードベースへのアクセスが必要","Spring WebFluxアプリケーションにのみ適用","Javaベース"],"ko":["리액티브 코드베이스에 접근할 수 있어야 함","스프링 WebFlux 애플리케이션에만 적용됨","자바 기반"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código reactivo","Específico para aplicaciones Spring WebFlux","Basado en Java"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code réactive","Spécifique aux applications Spring WebFlux","Basé sur Java"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die reaktive Codebasis","Spezifisch für Spring WebFlux-Anwendungen","Java-basiert"],"pt":["Requer acesso à base de código reativo","Específico para aplicações Spring WebFlux","Baseado em Java"],"ru":["Требует доступа к реактивной кодовой базе","Специфичен для приложений Spring WebFlux","На основе Java"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة البيانات التفاعلية","محدد لتطبيقات Spring WebFlux","مبني على جافا"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('orient-bot/orient/dashboard-feature-implementation', 'community', 'orient-bot', 'orient', 'orient-bot/orient', 'dashboard-feature-implementation', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z', '2026-02-18T03:43:27.748Z', NULL, '{"id":"orient-bot/orient/dashboard-feature-implementation","name":"dashboard-feature-implementation","description":{"zh":"本文介绍如何在Orient AI Agent平台上实现仪表板功能，涵盖后端和前端开发","ja":"この記事では、Orient AI Agentプラットフォームでダッシュボード機能を実装する方法について説明します","ko":"본 문서는 Orient AI 에이전트 플랫폼에서 대시보드 기능을 구현하는 방법을介绍합니다","es":"Esta guía describe cómo implementar características en el dashboard de Orient, cubriendo la arquitectura backend y frontend.","fr":"Ce guide décrit comment mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités dans le tableau de bord d''Orient, couvrant l''architecture backend et frontend.","de":"Diese Anleitung beschreibt, wie man Funktionen im Orient-Dashboard implementiert, einschließlich der Backend- und Frontend-Architektur.","pt":"Guia de implementação de recursos para o painel de controle Orient, abordando backend e frontend","ru":"Руководство по реализации функций для панели управления Orient, охватывающее backend и frontend","ar":"دليل تنفيذ الميزات للوحة التحكم Orient، يشمل الخلفية والامامية","en":"Orient - AI Agent Platform"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"仪表板功能实现指南","ja":"ダッシュボード機能実装ガイド","ko":"대시보드 기능 구현 가이드","es":"Implementación de características de dashboard","fr":"Mise en œuvre des fonctionnalités de tableau de bord","de":"Dashboard-Funktionsimplementierung","pt":"Implementação de Recursos de Painel de Controle","ru":"Реализация функций панели управления","ar":"تنفيذ ميزات لوحة التحكم","en":"dashboard-feature-implementation"},"description":{"zh":"本文介绍如何在Orient AI Agent平台上实现仪表板功能，涵盖后端和前端开发","ja":"この記事では、Orient AI Agentプラットフォームでダッシュボード機能を実装する方法について説明します","ko":"본 문서는 Orient AI 에이전트 플랫폼에서 대시보드 기능을 구현하는 방법을介绍합니다","es":"Esta guía describe cómo implementar características en el dashboard de Orient, cubriendo la arquitectura backend y frontend.","fr":"Ce guide décrit comment mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités dans le tableau de bord d''Orient, couvrant l''architecture backend et frontend.","de":"Diese Anleitung beschreibt, wie man Funktionen im Orient-Dashboard implementiert, einschließlich der Backend- und Frontend-Architektur.","pt":"Guia de implementação de recursos para o painel de controle Orient, abordando backend e frontend","ru":"Руководство по реализации функций для панели управления Orient, охватывающее backend и frontend","ar":"دليل تنفيذ الميزات للوحة التحكم Orient، يشمل الخلفية والامامية","en":"Orient - AI Agent Platform"},"definition":{"en":"Orient - AI Agent Platform"},"features":{"zh":["后端业务逻辑实现","前端界面开发","Express路由配置","服务单例模式实现"],"ja":["バックエンドのビジネスロジックの実装","フロントエンドのインターフェース開発","Expressルーティングの設定","サービスシングルトンパターンの実装"],"ko":["백엔드 비즈니스 로직 구현","프론트엔드 인터페이스 개발","Express 라우팅 설정","서비스 싱글턴 패턴 구현"],"es":["Arquitectura backend con servicios y rutas de Express","Implementación de características con patrón de singleton","Integración con frontend para una experiencia de usuario fluida","Soporte para múltiples idiomas y configuraciones","Seguridad y autenticación para proteger los datos del usuario","Escalabilidad y flexibilidad para adaptarse a las necesidades del negocio"],"fr":["Architecture backend avec services et routes Express","Mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités avec patron de singleton","Intégration avec frontend pour une expérience utilisateur fluide","Support pour plusieurs langues et configurations","Sécurité et authentification pour protéger les données de l''utilisateur","Évolutivité et flexibilité pour s''adapter aux besoins de l''entreprise"],"de":["Backend-Architektur mit Diensten und Express-Routen","Implementierung von Funktionen mit Singleton-Muster","Integration mit Frontend für eine flüssige Benutzererfahrung","Unterstützung für mehrere Sprachen und Konfigurationen","Sicherheit und Authentifizierung zum Schutz der Benutzerdaten","Skalierbarkeit und Flexibilität zur Anpassung an die Geschäftsanforderungen"],"pt":["Arquitetura de backend com serviços e rotas","Implementação de recursos em frontend","Uso de padrão de singleton em serviços","Criação de rotas Express","Exportação de rotas","Integração com o painel de controle Orient"],"ru":["Архитектура бэкенда с сервисами и маршрутами","Реализация функций на frontend","Использование паттерна синглтона в сервисах","Создание маршрутов Express","Экспорт маршрутов","Интеграция с панелью управления Orient"],"ar":["هندسة الخلفية مع الخدمات والطرق","تنفيذ الميزات في الواجهة الأمامية","استخدام نمط Singleton في الخدمات","إنشاء طرق Express","تصدير الطرق","التكامل مع لوحة التحكم Orient"]},"keywords":{"zh":["仪表板功能实现","Orient AI Agent","后端开发","前端开发","Express","服务单例模式"],"ja":["ダッシュボード機能実装","Orient AI Agent","バックエンド開発","フロントエンド開発","Express","サービスシングルトンパターン"],"ko":["대시보드 기능 구현","Orient AI 에이전트","백엔드 개발","프론트엔드 개발","Express","서비스 싱글턴 패턴"],"es":["implementación de características de dashboard","arquitectura backend","frontend","patrón de singleton","Express","seguridad y autenticación","escalabilidad y flexibilidad","desarrollo de software","orient ai agent platform"],"fr":["mise en œuvre des fonctionnalités de tableau de bord","architecture backend","frontend","patron de singleton","Express","sécurité et authentification","évolutivité et flexibilité","développement de logiciels","orient ai agent platform"],"de":["implementierung von dashboard-funktionen","backend-architektur","frontend","singleton-muster","express","sicherheit und authentifizierung","skalierbarkeit und flexibilität","softwareentwicklung","orient ai agent platform"],"pt":["implementação de recursos de painel de controle","painel de controle Orient","backend","frontend","serviços","rotas","singleton","Express","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["реализация функций панели управления","панель управления Orient","бэкенд","фронтенд","сервисы","маршруты","синглтон","Express","веб-разработка"],"ar":["تنفيذ ميزات لوحة التحكم","لوحة التحكم Orient","الخلفية","الواجهة الأمامية","الخدمات","الطرق","Singleton","Express","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"orient-bot","repo":"orient","repoPath":"orient-bot/orient","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dashboard-feature-implementation","description":"Guide for implementing dashboard features in the Orient monorepo. Use when adding new tabs, views, pages, or components to the dashboard. Covers backend services, API routes, frontend components, navigation, routing, and command palette integration. Applicable when asked to add a dashboard feature, create a new tab, add a monitoring page, create storage view, add settings section, or any dashboard UI work requiring both backend and frontend changes.","bodyPreview":"# Dashboard Feature Implementation\n\nGuide for adding features to the Orient dashboard across backend and frontend.\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\npackages/dashboard/                    # Backend\n├── src/services/                      # Business logic\n│   └── <feature>Service.ts           # Service with singleton pattern\n└── src/server/routes/\n    ├── <feature>.routes.ts           # Express routes\n    └── index.ts                       # Route exports\n\npackages/dashboard-frontend/           # Fro","body":"# Dashboard Feature Implementation\n\nGuide for adding features to the Orient dashboard across backend and frontend.\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\n```\npackages/dashboard/                    # Backend\n├── src/services/                      # Business logic\n│   └── <feature>Service.ts           # Service with singleton pattern\n└── src/server/routes/\n    ├── <feature>.routes.ts           # Express routes\n    └── index.ts                       # Route exports\n\npackages/dashboard-frontend/           # Frontend\n├── src/api.ts                         # API types and functions\n├── src/routes.ts                      # Route definitions\n├── src/App.tsx                        # Main app with routing\n└── src/components/\n    ├── Layout/Sidebar.tsx             # Navigation\n    └── <FeatureName>Tab.tsx          # Tab component\n        └── <FeatureName>/            # Sub-components\n```\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n\n### Backend\n\n1. Create service in `packages/dashboard/src/services/<feature>Service.ts`\n2. Create routes in `packages/dashboard/src/server/routes/<feature>.routes.ts`\n3. Export routes in `packages/dashboard/src/server/routes/index.ts`\n4. Register routes in `packages/dashboard/src/server/routes.ts`\n\n### Frontend\n\n5. Add types and API functions in `packages/dashboard-frontend/src/api.ts`\n6. Update `GlobalView` type and routes in `packages/dashboard-frontend/src/routes.ts`\n7. Add navigation link in `packages/dashboard-frontend/src/components/Layout/Sidebar.tsx`\n8. Add route rendering and command in `packages/dashboard-frontend/src/App.tsx`\n9. Create main component `packages/dashboard-frontend/src/components/<Feature>Tab.tsx`\n10. Create sub-components in `packages/dashboard-frontend/src/components/<Feature>/`\n\n## Backend Patterns\n\n### Service Pattern (Singleton)\n\n```typescript\n// packages/dashboard/src/services/featureService.ts\nimport { createServiceLogger } from ''@orientbot/core'';\n\nconst logger = createServiceLogger(''feature-service'');\n\nexport class FeatureService {\n  constructor(private db: MessageDatabase) {}\n\n  async getData(): Promise<FeatureData> {\n    // Implementation\n  }\n}\n\nlet instance: FeatureService | null = null;\n\nexport function initFeatureService(db: MessageDatabase): FeatureService {\n  instance = new FeatureService(db);\n  return instance;\n}\n\nexport function getFeatureService(): FeatureService {\n  if (!instance) throw new Error(''Service not initialized'');\n  return instance;\n}\n```\n\n### Routes Pattern\n\n```typescript\n// packages/dashboard/src/server/routes/feature.routes.ts\nimport { Router, Request, Response } from ''express'';\nimport { createServiceLogger } from ''@orientbot/core'';\nimport { getFeatureService } from ''../../services/featureService.js'';\n\nconst logger = createServiceLogger(''feature-routes'');\n\nexport function createFeatureRoutes(\n  requireAuth: (req: Request, res: Response, next: () => void) => void\n): Router {\n  const router = Router();\n\n  router.get(''/data'', requireAuth, async (_req: Request, res: Response) => {\n    try {\n      const service = getFeatureService();\n      const data = await service.getData();\n      res.json(data);\n    } catch (error) {\n      logger.error(''Failed to get data'', { error: String(error) });\n      res.status(500).json({ error: ''Failed to get data'' });\n    }\n  });\n\n  return router;\n}\n```\n\n### Register Routes\n\n```typescript\n// In routes/index.ts - add export\nexport { createFeatureRoutes } from ''./feature.routes.js'';\n\n// In routes.ts - import and register\nimport { createFeatureRoutes } from ''./routes/index.js'';\nimport { initFeatureService } from ''../services/featureService.js'';\n\n// In setupApiRoutes function:\ninitFeatureService(db);\nrouter.use(''/feature'', createFeatureRoutes(requireAuth));\n```\n\n## Frontend Patterns\n\n### API Types and Functions\n\n```typescript\n// In packages/dashboard-frontend/src/api.ts\n\nexport interface FeatureData {\n  items: FeatureItem[];\n  total: number;\n}\n\nexport async function getFeatureData(): Promise<FeatureData> {\n  return apiRequest(''/feature/data'');\n}\n\nexport async function updateFeature(id: string, data: Partial<FeatureItem>): Promise<FeatureItem> {\n  return apiRequest(`/feature/${id}`, {\n    method: ''PUT'',\n    body: JSON.stringify(data),\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### Route Configuration\n\n```typescript\n// In packages/dashboard-frontend/src/routes.ts\n\n// 1. Add to GlobalView union type\nexport type GlobalView =\n  | ''billing''\n  | ''monitoring''\n  | ''feature''  // Add here\n  | ''settings'';\n\n// 2. Add to ROUTES constant\nexport const ROUTES = {\n  BILLING: ''/billing'',\n  MONITORING: ''/monitoring'',\n  FEATURE: ''/feature'',  // Add here\n  SETTINGS: ''/settings'',\n} as const;\n\n// 3. Add to getRouteState function\nif (pathname.startsWith(''/feature'')) {\n  return { ...defaultState, globalView: ''feature'' };\n}\n\n// 4. Add to getRoutePath function\ncase ''feature'':\n  return ROUTES.FEATURE;\n```\n\n### Sidebar Navigation\n\n```typescript\n// In Sidebar.tsx - add to GlobalView type and navigation links\n\n// Add icon + link after existing items:\n<Link\n  to={ROUTES.FEATURE}\n  className={`w-full flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium rounded-md transition-colors ${\n    isGlobalActive(''feature'')\n      ? ''bg-primary text-primary-foreground''\n      : ''text-muted-foreground hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground''\n  }`}\n>\n  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" strokeWidth=\"2\">\n    {/* Icon path */}\n  </svg>\n  Feature Name\n</Link>\n```\n\n### App.tsx Integration\n\n```typescript\n// Import component\nimport FeatureTab from ''./components/FeatureTab'';\n\n// Add rendering\n{globalView === ''feature'' && <FeatureTab />}\n\n// Add command palette entry\ncmds.push({\n  id: ''nav-feature'',\n  label: ''Feature Name'',\n  description: ''Feature description'',\n  category: ''navigation'',\n  keywords: [''keyword1'', ''keyword2''],\n  icon: (<svg>...</svg>),\n  action: () => navigate(ROUTES.FEATURE),\n});\n```\n\n### Tab Component Structure\n\n```typescript\n// packages/dashboard-frontend/src/components/FeatureTab.tsx\nimport { useState, useEffect, useCallback } from ''react'';\nimport { getFeatureData, type FeatureData } from ''../api'';\n\nexport default function FeatureTab() {\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n  const [error, setError] = useState<string | null>(null);\n  const [data, setData] = useState<FeatureData | null>(null);\n  const [autoRefresh, setAutoRefresh] = useState(false);\n\n  const fetchData = useCallback(async () => {\n    try {\n      setError(null);\n      const result = await getFeatureData();\n      setData(result);\n    } catch (err) {\n      setError(err instanceof Error ? err.message : ''Failed to load'');\n    } finally {\n      setLoading(false);\n    }\n  }, []);\n\n  useEffect(() => { fetchData(); }, [fetchData]);\n\n  // Auto-refresh effect\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!autoRefresh) return;\n    const interval = setInterval(fetchData, 30000);\n    return () => clearInterval(interval);\n  }, [autoRefresh, fetchData]);\n\n  if (loading) return <LoadingState />;\n  if (error) return <ErrorState error={error} onRetry={fetchData} />;\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"space-y-6 animate-fade-in\">\n      <Header autoRefresh={autoRefresh} onAutoRefreshChange={setAutoRefresh} onRefresh={fetchData} />\n      <SummaryCards data={data} />\n      <DetailCards data={data} />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## UI Patterns\n\n### Loading State\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"flex items-center justify-center py-12\">\n  <div className=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-3\">\n    <div className=\"spinner\" />\n    <p className=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Loading...</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Error State\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"card p-6\">\n  <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-destructive\">\n    <svg>...</svg>\n    <div>\n      <p className=\"font-medium\">Failed to load</p>\n      <p className=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">{error}</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <button onClick={onRetry} className=\"btn btn-secondary mt-4\">\n    Try Again\n  </button>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Card Components\n\n```tsx\n<div className=\"card p-5\">\n  <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\">\n    <div className=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 flex items-center justify-center\">\n      <svg className=\"w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\">...</svg>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <h3 className=\"font-semibold\">Card Title</h3>\n      <p className=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Subtitle</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  {/* Card content */}\n</div>\n```\n\n### Status Badges\n\n```tsx\n<span\n  className={`px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium rounded-full ${\n    status === ''success''\n      ? ''bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 dark:bg-emerald-900/30 dark:text-emerald-400''\n      : status === ''error''\n        ? ''bg-red-100 text-red-700 dark:bg-red-900/30 dark:text-red-400''\n        : ''bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-900/30 dark:text-gray-400''\n  }`}\n>\n  {statusLabel}\n</span>\n```\n\n## Common Sub-Tabs Pattern\n\nFor features with multiple views:\n\n```typescript\n// In routes.ts\nexport type FeatureView = ''overview'' | ''details'' | ''settings'';\n\nexport const ROUTES = {\n  FEATURE: ''/feature'',\n  FEATURE_OVERVIEW: ''/feature/overview'',\n  FEATURE_DETAILS: ''/feature/details'',\n  FEATURE_SETTINGS: ''/feature/settings'',\n};\n\n// In App.tsx - render sub-tabs\n{globalView === ''feature'' && (\n  <div className=\"flex gap-1 mb-6 p-1 bg-secondary rounded-lg w-fit border border-border\">\n    <Link to={ROUTES.FEATURE_OVERVIEW} className={...}>Overview</Link>\n    <Link to={ROUTES.FEATURE_DETAILS} className={...}>Details</Link>\n    <Link to={ROUTES.FEATURE_SETTINGS} className={...}>Settings</Link>\n  </div>\n)}\n```\n\n## Testing\n\n1. **Type check**: `pnpm exec tsc --project packages/dashboard/tsconfig.json --noEmit`\n2. **Lint**: `pnpm exec eslint packages/dashboard/src/... packages/dashboard-frontend/src/...`\n3. **Manual test**:\n   - Run backend: `pnpm --filter dashboard dev`\n   - Run frontend: `pnpm --filter dashboard-frontend dev`\n   - Test API: `curl http://localhost:3000/api/feature/data`\n   - Navigate to `/dashboard/feature` in browser\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:43:27.748Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full-Stack AI Agents needing advanced dashboard feature implementation across backend and frontend architectures.","zh":"适合需要在后端和前端架构中实现高级仪表板功能的全栈AI代理。","ja":"バックエンドとフロントエンドアーキテクチャの両方で高度なダッシュボード機能を実装する必要があるフルスタックAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"백엔드와 프론트엔드 아키텍처 모두에서 고급 대시보드 기능을 구현해야 하는 풀스택 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA de pila completa que necesitan una implementación avanzada de características de panel de control en arquitecturas backend y frontend.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA full-stack qui ont besoin d''une mise en œuvre avancée de fonctionnalités de tableau de bord sur les architectures backend et frontend.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Implementierung von Dashboard-Funktionen in Backend- und Frontend-Architekturen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Full-Stack que necessitam de implementação avançada de recursos de painel de controle em arquiteturas backend e frontend.","ru":"Идеально подходит для полнофункциональных агентов ИИ, которым требуются продвинутые функции панели управления на бэкенде и фронтенде.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الكامل الذي يحتاج إلى تنفيذ متقدم لميزات لوحة التحكم عبر الهياكل الخلفية والأمامية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement scalable dashboard features using Express routes, singleton pattern services, and TypeScript, facilitating seamless backend and frontend integration.","zh":"使代理能够使用Express路由、单例模式服务和TypeScript设计和实现可扩展的仪表板功能，从而实现后端和前端的无缝集成。","ja":"Expressルーティング、シングルトンパターンのサービス、TypeScriptを使用して、スケーラブルなダッシュボード機能を設計および実装できるようにエージェントをEmpowerし、バックエンドとフロントエンドの無縫な統合を促進します。","ko":"Express 라우팅, 싱글턴 패턴 서비스 및 TypeScript를 사용하여 확장 가능한 대시보드 기능을 설계 및 구현할 수 있도록 에이전트를 강화하여 백엔드와 프론트엔드의無縫な統合을 촉진합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar e implementar funciones de panel de control escalables utilizando rutas Express, servicios con patrón de singleton y TypeScript, lo que facilita una integración fluida entre el backend y el frontend.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités de tableau de bord évolutives en utilisant des routes Express, des services de motif singleton et TypeScript, ce qui facilite une intégration fluide entre le backend et le frontend.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, skalierbare Dashboard-Funktionen mithilfe von Express-Routen, Singleton-Muster-Diensten und TypeScript zu entwerfen und zu implementieren, was eine nahtlose Integration zwischen Backend und Frontend erleichtert.","pt":"Permite que os agentes projetem e implementem recursos de painel de controle escaláveis usando rotas Express, serviços de padrão de singleton e TypeScript, facilitando a integração transparente entre o backend e o frontend.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проектировать и реализовывать масштабируемые функции панели управления с использованием маршрутов Express, сервисов одиночных шаблонов и TypeScript, облегчая беспрепятственную интеграцию бэкенда и фронтенда.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تصميم وتنفيذ ميزات لوحة تحكم قابلة للتوسيع باستخدام طرق التعبير وخدمات نمط المنفرد ونظام TypeScript ، مما يسهل التكامل السلس بين البنية التحتية والبنية الأمامية."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing custom dashboard routes using Express","Creating reusable services with singleton patterns for business logic","Integrating frontend and backend components for feature implementation"],"zh":["使用Express实现自定义仪表板路由","使用单例模式创建可重用服务以进行业务逻辑","集成前端和后端组件以实现功能"],"ja":["Expressを使用してカスタムダッシュボードルートを実装する","シングルトンパターンを使用してビジネスロジックの再利用可能なサービスを作成する","機能の実装のためにフロントエンドとバックエンドコンポーネントを統合する"],"ko":["Express를 사용하여 사용자 지정 대시보드 라우트 구현","싱글턴 패턴을 사용하여 비즈니스 로직을 위한 재사용 가능한 서비스 생성","기능 구현을 위한 프론트엔드 및 백엔드 구성 요소 통합"],"es":["Implementar rutas personalizadas de panel de control con Express","Crear servicios reutilizables con patrones de singleton para la lógica empresarial","Integrar componentes frontend y backend para la implementación de funciones"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des routes de tableau de bord personnalisées avec Express","Créer des services réutilisables avec des modèles de singleton pour la logique métier","Intégrer les composants frontend et backend pour la mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités"],"de":["Implementieren benutzerdefinierter Dashboard-Routen mit Express","Erstellen wiederverwendbarer Dienste mit Singleton-Mustern für Geschäftslogik","Integrieren von Frontend- und Backend-Komponenten für die Implementierung von Funktionen"],"pt":["Implementar rotas personalizadas de painel de controle usando Express","Criar serviços reutilizáveis com padrões de singleton para lógica de negócios","Integrar componentes de frontend e backend para implementação de recursos"],"ru":["Реализация пользовательских маршрутов панели управления с помощью Express","Создание многоразовых сервисов с шаблонами одиночек для бизнес-логики","Интеграция компонентов фронтенда и бэкенда для реализации функций"],"ar":["تنفيذ طرق لوحة تحكم مخصصة باستخدام التعبير","إنشاء خدمات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام بنمط المنفرد للlogic التجارية","دمج مكونات البنية التحتية والبنية الأمامية لتنفيذ الميزات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of TypeScript and Express framework","Limited to dashboard feature implementation within the Orient AI Agent Platform"],"zh":["需要TypeScript和Express框架的知识","仅限于Orient AI Agent Platform内的仪表板功能实现"],"ja":["TypeScriptとExpressフレームワークの知識が必要","Orient AI Agent Platform内のダッシュボード機能の実装のみに限定"],"ko":["TypeScript 및 Express 프레임워크에 대한 지식이 필요","Orient AI 에이전트 플랫폼 내에서 대시보드 기능 구현만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de TypeScript y del marco Express","Limitado a la implementación de características de panel de control dentro de la plataforma de Agentes de IA Orient"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de TypeScript et du framework Express","Limité à la mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités de tableau de bord au sein de la plateforme d''agents IA Orient"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von TypeScript und dem Express-Framework","Begrenzt auf die Implementierung von Dashboard-Funktionen innerhalb der Orient-KI-Agent-Plattform"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de TypeScript e framework Express","Limitado à implementação de recursos de painel de controle dentro da Plataforma de Agente de IA Orient"],"ru":["Требуется знание TypeScript и фреймворка Express","Ограничен реализацией функций панели управления внутри платформы агента ИИ Orient"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بنظام TypeScript و إطار التعبير","محدود بتنفيذ ميزات لوحة التحكم داخل منصة عميل الذكاء الاصطناعي Orient"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('kettleofketchup/DraftForge/frontend-dev-guidelines', 'community', 'kettleofketchup', 'DraftForge', 'kettleofketchup/DraftForge', 'frontend-dev-guidelines', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z', '2026-02-18T03:43:03.738Z', NULL, '{"id":"kettleofketchup/DraftForge/frontend-dev-guidelines","name":"frontend-dev-guidelines","description":{"zh":"本指南提供现代React开发的综合指南，涵盖Suspense、lazy loading、文件组织和性能优化等","ja":"このガイドは、モダンなReact開発のための包括的なガイドです。Suspense、Lazy Loading、ファイル組織、パフォーマンス最適化など","ko":"이 가이드는 현대적인 React 개발을 위한 포괄적인 가이드를 제공하며 Suspense, 지연 로딩, 파일 조직 및 성능 최적화 등","es":"Guías de desarrollo frontend para crear aplicaciones React modernas y escalables","fr":"Guides de développement frontend pour créer des applications React modernes et évolutives","de":"Leitfäden für Frontend-Entwicklung, um moderne und skalierbare React-Anwendungen zu erstellen","pt":"Diretrizes abrangentes para desenvolvimento frontend moderno com React, enfatizando Suspense e otimização de desempenho","ru":"Всеобъемлющее руководство по современному frontend-разработке с React, подчеркивающее Suspense и оптимизацию производительности","ar":"دليل شامل لتطوير الواجهة الأمامية الحديثة مع React، يؤكد على Suspense و تحسين الأداء","en":"Dota 2 Event Coordinator"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"前端开发指南 - React Suspense与性能优化","ja":"フロントエンド開発ガイドライン - React Suspenseとパフォーマンス最適化","ko":"프론트엔드 개발 가이드라인 - React Suspense와 성능 최적화","es":"Guías de Desarrollo Frontend para React","fr":"Guides de Développement Frontend pour React","de":"Leitfaden für Frontend-Entwicklung mit React","pt":"Diretrizes de Desenvolvimento Frontend","ru":"Руководство по разработке frontend","ar":"إرشادات تطوير الواجهة الأمامية","en":"frontend-dev-guidelines"},"description":{"zh":"本指南提供现代React开发的综合指南，涵盖Suspense、lazy loading、文件组织和性能优化等","ja":"このガイドは、モダンなReact開発のための包括的なガイドです。Suspense、Lazy Loading、ファイル組織、パフォーマンス最適化など","ko":"이 가이드는 현대적인 React 개발을 위한 포괄적인 가이드를 제공하며 Suspense, 지연 로딩, 파일 조직 및 성능 최적화 등","es":"Guías de desarrollo frontend para crear aplicaciones React modernas y escalables","fr":"Guides de développement frontend pour créer des applications React modernes et évolutives","de":"Leitfäden für Frontend-Entwicklung, um moderne und skalierbare React-Anwendungen zu erstellen","pt":"Diretrizes abrangentes para desenvolvimento frontend moderno com React, enfatizando Suspense e otimização de desempenho","ru":"Всеобъемлющее руководство по современному frontend-разработке с React, подчеркивающее Suspense и оптимизацию производительности","ar":"دليل شامل لتطوير الواجهة الأمامية الحديثة مع React، يؤكد على Suspense و تحسين الأداء","en":"Dota 2 Event Coordinator"},"definition":{"en":"Dota 2 Event Coordinator"},"features":{"zh":["使用React Suspense进行数据获取","实现lazy loading","正确的文件组织","性能优化","使用TanStack Query进行数据获取","使用TanStack Router进行路由设置"],"ja":["React Suspenseを使用したデータ取得","Lazy Loadingの実装","適切なファイル組織","パフォーマンス最適化","TanStack Queryを使用したデータ取得","TanStack Routerを使用したルーティング設定"],"ko":["React Suspense를 사용한 데이터 가져오기","지연 로딩 구현","적절한 파일 조직","성능 최적화","TanStack Query를 사용한 데이터 가져오기","TanStack Router를 사용한 라우팅 설정"],"es":["Suspense para carga de datos","Carga diferida para mejorar el rendimiento","Organización de archivos y código","Optimización de rendimiento","Mejores prácticas para TypeScript","Integración con TanStack Query y Router"],"fr":["Suspense pour le chargement de données","Chargement différé pour améliorer les performances","Organisation de fichiers et de code","Optimisation des performances","Meilleures pratiques pour TypeScript","Intégration avec TanStack Query et Router"],"de":["Suspense für Datenladevorgänge","Lazy Loading für verbesserte Leistung","Datei- und Codeorganisation","Leistungsoptimierung","Best Practices für TypeScript","Integration mit TanStack Query und Router"],"pt":["Suspense para busca de dados","Carregamento lento com lazy loading","Organização de arquivos adequada","Otimização de desempenho","TypeScript para desenvolvimento seguro","Integração com TanStack Query e Router"],"ru":["Suspense для запроса данных","Ленивая загрузка с lazy loading","Правильная организация файлов","Оптимизация производительности","TypeScript для безопасного развития","Интеграция с TanStack Query и Router"],"ar":["Suspense لاسترجاع البيانات","تحميل بطيء مع lazy loading","تنظيم الملفات المناسب","تحسين الأداء","TypeScript لتطوير آمن","التكامل مع TanStack Query و Router"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Suspense","lazy loading","文件组织","性能优化","TanStack Query","TanStack Router","前端开发","React开发","现代React开发"],"ja":["React Suspense","Lazy Loading","ファイル組織","パフォーマンス最適化","TanStack Query","TanStack Router","フロントエンド開発","React開発","モダンなReact開発"],"ko":["React Suspense","지연 로딩","파일 조직","성능 최적화","TanStack Query","TanStack Router","프론트엔드 개발","React 개발","현대적인 React 개발"],"es":["desarrollo frontend","React","Suspense","carga diferida","optimización de rendimiento","TypeScript","TanStack Query","TanStack Router"],"fr":["développement frontend","React","Suspense","chargement différé","optimisation des performances","TypeScript","TanStack Query","TanStack Router"],"de":["Frontend-Entwicklung","React","Suspense","Lazy Loading","Leistungsoptimierung","TypeScript","TanStack Query","TanStack Router"],"pt":["desenvolvimento frontend","React","Suspense","otimização de desempenho","TypeScript","TanStack Query","TanStack Router","lazy loading","organização de arquivos"],"ru":["frontend-разработка","React","Suspense","оптимизация производительности","TypeScript","TanStack Query","TanStack Router","ленивая загрузка","организация файлов"],"ar":["تطوير الواجهة الأمامية","React","Suspense","تحسين الأداء","TypeScript","TanStack Query","TanStack Router","تحميل بطيء","تنظيم الملفات"]}},"owner":"kettleofketchup","repo":"DraftForge","repoPath":"kettleofketchup/DraftForge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"frontend-dev-guidelines","description":"Frontend development guidelines for React/TypeScript applications. Modern patterns including Suspense, lazy loading, useSuspenseQuery, file organization with features directory, MUI v7 styling, TanStack Router, performance optimization, and TypeScript best practices. Use when creating components, pages, features, fetching data, styling, routing, or working with frontend code.","bodyPreview":"# Frontend Development Guidelines\n\n## Purpose\n\nComprehensive guide for modern React development, emphasizing Suspense-based data fetching, lazy loading, proper file organization, and performance optimization.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating new components or pages\n- Building new features\n- Fetching data with TanStack Query\n- Setting up routing with TanStack Router\n- Styling components with MUI v7\n- Performance optimization\n- Organizing frontend code\n- TypeScript best practices\n\n---\n\n## Qu","body":"# Frontend Development Guidelines\n\n## Purpose\n\nComprehensive guide for modern React development, emphasizing Suspense-based data fetching, lazy loading, proper file organization, and performance optimization.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Creating new components or pages\n- Building new features\n- Fetching data with TanStack Query\n- Setting up routing with TanStack Router\n- Styling components with MUI v7\n- Performance optimization\n- Organizing frontend code\n- TypeScript best practices\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### New Component Checklist\n\nCreating a component? Follow this checklist:\n\n- [ ] Use `React.FC<Props>` pattern with TypeScript\n- [ ] Lazy load if heavy component: `React.lazy(() => import())`\n- [ ] Wrap in `<SuspenseLoader>` for loading states\n- [ ] Use `useSuspenseQuery` for data fetching\n- [ ] Import aliases: `@/`, `~types`, `~components`, `~features`\n- [ ] Styles: Inline if <100 lines, separate file if >100 lines\n- [ ] Use `useCallback` for event handlers passed to children\n- [ ] Default export at bottom\n- [ ] No early returns with loading spinners\n- [ ] Use `useMuiSnackbar` for user notifications\n\n### New Feature Checklist\n\nCreating a feature? Set up this structure:\n\n- [ ] Create `features/{feature-name}/` directory\n- [ ] Create subdirectories: `api/`, `components/`, `hooks/`, `helpers/`, `types/`\n- [ ] Create API service file: `api/{feature}Api.ts`\n- [ ] Set up TypeScript types in `types/`\n- [ ] Create route in `routes/{feature-name}/index.tsx`\n- [ ] Lazy load feature components\n- [ ] Use Suspense boundaries\n- [ ] Export public API from feature `index.ts`\n\n---\n\n## Import Aliases Quick Reference\n\n| Alias | Resolves To | Example |\n|-------|-------------|---------|\n| `@/` | `src/` | `import { apiClient } from ''@/lib/apiClient''` |\n| `~types` | `src/types` | `import type { User } from ''~types/user''` |\n| `~components` | `src/components` | `import { SuspenseLoader } from ''~components/SuspenseLoader''` |\n| `~features` | `src/features` | `import { authApi } from ''~features/auth''` |\n\nDefined in: [vite.config.ts](../../vite.config.ts) lines 180-185\n\n---\n\n## Common Imports Cheatsheet\n\n```typescript\n// React & Lazy Loading\nimport React, { useState, useCallback, useMemo } from ''react'';\nconst Heavy = React.lazy(() => import(''./Heavy''));\n\n// MUI Components\nimport { Box, Paper, Typography, Button, Grid } from ''@mui/material'';\nimport type { SxProps, Theme } from ''@mui/material'';\n\n// TanStack Query (Suspense)\nimport { useSuspenseQuery, useQueryClient } from ''@tanstack/react-query'';\n\n// TanStack Router\nimport { createFileRoute } from ''@tanstack/react-router'';\n\n// Project Components\nimport { SuspenseLoader } from ''~components/SuspenseLoader'';\n\n// Hooks\nimport { useAuth } from ''@/hooks/useAuth'';\nimport { useMuiSnackbar } from ''@/hooks/useMuiSnackbar'';\n\n// Types\nimport type { Post } from ''~types/post'';\n```\n\n---\n\n## Topic Guides\n\n### 🎨 Component Patterns\n\n**Modern React components use:**\n- `React.FC<Props>` for type safety\n- `React.lazy()` for code splitting\n- `SuspenseLoader` for loading states\n- Named const + default export pattern\n\n**Key Concepts:**\n- Lazy load heavy components (DataGrid, charts, editors)\n- Always wrap lazy components in Suspense\n- Use SuspenseLoader component (with fade animation)\n- Component structure: Props → Hooks → Handlers → Render → Export\n\n**[📖 Complete Guide: resources/component-patterns.md](resources/component-patterns.md)**\n\n---\n\n### 📊 Data Fetching\n\n**PRIMARY PATTERN: useSuspenseQuery**\n- Use with Suspense boundaries\n- Cache-first strategy (check grid cache before API)\n- Replaces `isLoading` checks\n- Type-safe with generics\n\n**API Service Layer:**\n- Create `features/{feature}/api/{feature}Api.ts`\n- Use `apiClient` axios instance\n- Centralized methods per feature\n- Route format: `/form/route` (NOT `/api/form/route`)\n\n**[📖 Complete Guide: resources/data-fetching.md](resources/data-fetching.md)**\n\n---\n\n### 📁 File Organization\n\n**features/ vs components/:**\n- `features/`: Domain-specific (posts, comments, auth)\n- `components/`: Truly reusable (SuspenseLoader, CustomAppBar)\n\n**Feature Subdirectories:**\n```\nfeatures/\n  my-feature/\n    api/          # API service layer\n    components/   # Feature components\n    hooks/        # Custom hooks\n    helpers/      # Utility functions\n    types/        # TypeScript types\n```\n\n**[📖 Complete Guide: resources/file-organization.md](resources/file-organization.md)**\n\n---\n\n### 🎨 Styling\n\n**Inline vs Separate:**\n- <100 lines: Inline `const styles: Record<string, SxProps<Theme>>`\n- >100 lines: Separate `.styles.ts` file\n\n**Primary Method:**\n- Use `sx` prop for MUI components\n- Type-safe with `SxProps<Theme>`\n- Theme access: `(theme) => theme.palette.primary.main`\n\n**MUI v7 Grid:**\n```typescript\n<Grid size={{ xs: 12, md: 6 }}>  // ✅ v7 syntax\n<Grid xs={12} md={6}>             // ❌ Old syntax\n```\n\n**[📖 Complete Guide: resources/styling-guide.md](resources/styling-guide.md)**\n\n---\n\n### 🛣️ Routing\n\n**TanStack Router - Folder-Based:**\n- Directory: `routes/my-route/index.tsx`\n- Lazy load components\n- Use `createFileRoute`\n- Breadcrumb data in loader\n\n**Example:**\n```typescript\nimport { createFileRoute } from ''@tanstack/react-router'';\nimport { lazy } from ''react'';\n\nconst MyPage = lazy(() => import(''@/features/my-feature/components/MyPage''));\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute(''/my-route/'')({\n    component: MyPage,\n    loader: () => ({ crumb: ''My Route'' }),\n});\n```\n\n**[📖 Complete Guide: resources/routing-guide.md](resources/routing-guide.md)**\n\n---\n\n### ⏳ Loading & Error States\n\n**CRITICAL RULE: No Early Returns**\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ NEVER - Causes layout shift\nif (isLoading) {\n    return <LoadingSpinner />;\n}\n\n// ✅ ALWAYS - Consistent layout\n<SuspenseLoader>\n    <Content />\n</SuspenseLoader>\n```\n\n**Why:** Prevents Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS), better UX\n\n**Error Handling:**\n- Use `useMuiSnackbar` for user feedback\n- NEVER `react-toastify`\n- TanStack Query `onError` callbacks\n\n**[📖 Complete Guide: resources/loading-and-error-states.md](resources/loading-and-error-states.md)**\n\n---\n\n### ⚡ Performance\n\n**Optimization Patterns:**\n- `useMemo`: Expensive computations (filter, sort, map)\n- `useCallback`: Event handlers passed to children\n- `React.memo`: Expensive components\n- Debounced search (300-500ms)\n- Memory leak prevention (cleanup in useEffect)\n\n**[📖 Complete Guide: resources/performance.md](resources/performance.md)**\n\n---\n\n### 📘 TypeScript\n\n**Standards:**\n- Strict mode, no `any` type\n- Explicit return types on functions\n- Type imports: `import type { User } from ''~types/user''`\n- Component prop interfaces with JSDoc\n\n**[📖 Complete Guide: resources/typescript-standards.md](resources/typescript-standards.md)**\n\n---\n\n### 🔧 Common Patterns\n\n**Covered Topics:**\n- React Hook Form with Zod validation\n- DataGrid wrapper contracts\n- Dialog component standards\n- `useAuth` hook for current user\n- Mutation patterns with cache invalidation\n\n**[📖 Complete Guide: resources/common-patterns.md](resources/common-patterns.md)**\n\n---\n\n### 👤 User Avatars\n\n**ALWAYS use `AvatarUrl` helper** for user avatars - handles empty strings, Discord IDs, and fallback generation.\n\n```typescript\nimport { AvatarUrl } from \"~/components/user/avatar\";\n<img src={AvatarUrl(user)} />\n```\n\n**[📖 Complete Guide: resources/user-avatar.md](resources/user-avatar.md)**\n\n---\n\n### 📚 Complete Examples\n\n**Full working examples:**\n- Modern component with all patterns\n- Complete feature structure\n- API service layer\n- Route with lazy loading\n- Suspense + useSuspenseQuery\n- Form with validation\n\n**[📖 Complete Guide: resources/complete-examples.md](resources/complete-examples.md)**\n\n---\n\n## Navigation Guide\n\n| Need to... | Read this resource |\n|------------|-------------------|\n| Create a component | [component-patterns.md](resources/component-patterns.md) |\n| Fetch data | [data-fetching.md](resources/data-fetching.md) |\n| Organize files/folders | [file-organization.md](resources/file-organization.md) |\n| Style components | [styling-guide.md](resources/styling-guide.md) |\n| Set up routing | [routing-guide.md](resources/routing-guide.md) |\n| Handle loading/errors | [loading-and-error-states.md](resources/loading-and-error-states.md) |\n| Optimize performance | [performance.md](resources/performance.md) |\n| TypeScript types | [typescript-standards.md](resources/typescript-standards.md) |\n| Forms/Auth/DataGrid | [common-patterns.md](resources/common-patterns.md) |\n| Display user avatars | [user-avatar.md](resources/user-avatar.md) |\n| See full examples | [complete-examples.md](resources/complete-examples.md) |\n\n---\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Lazy Load Everything Heavy**: Routes, DataGrid, charts, editors\n2. **Suspense for Loading**: Use SuspenseLoader, not early returns\n3. **useSuspenseQuery**: Primary data fetching pattern for new code\n4. **Features are Organized**: api/, components/, hooks/, helpers/ subdirs\n5. **Styles Based on Size**: <100 inline, >100 separate\n6. **Import Aliases**: Use @/, ~types, ~components, ~features\n7. **No Early Returns**: Prevents layout shift\n8. **useMuiSnackbar**: For all user notifications\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference: File Structure\n\n```\nsrc/\n  features/\n    my-feature/\n      api/\n        myFeatureApi.ts       # API service\n      components/\n        MyFeature.tsx         # Main component\n        SubComponent.tsx      # Related components\n      hooks/\n        useMyFeature.ts       # Custom hooks\n        useSuspenseMyFeature.ts  # Suspense hooks\n      helpers/\n        myFeatureHelpers.ts   # Utilities\n      types/\n        index.ts              # TypeScript types\n      index.ts                # Public exports\n\n  components/\n    SuspenseLoader/\n      SuspenseLoader.tsx      # Reusable loader\n    CustomAppBar/\n      CustomAppBar.tsx        # Reusable app bar\n\n  routes/\n    my-route/\n      index.tsx               # Route component\n      create/\n        index.tsx             # Nested route\n```\n\n---\n\n## Modern Component Template (Quick Copy)\n\n```typescript\nimport React, { useState, useCallback } from ''react'';\nimport { Box, Paper } from ''@mui/material'';\nimport { useSuspenseQuery } from ''@tanstack/react-query'';\nimport { featureApi } from ''../api/featureApi'';\nimport type { FeatureData } from ''~types/feature'';\n\ninterface MyComponentProps {\n    id: number;\n    onAction?: () => void;\n}\n\nexport const MyComponent: React.FC<MyComponentProps> = ({ id, onAction }) => {\n    const [state, setState] = useState<string>('''');\n\n    const { data } = useSuspenseQuery({\n        queryKey: [''feature'', id],\n        queryFn: () => featureApi.getFeature(id),\n    });\n\n    const handleAction = useCallback(() => {\n        setState(''updated'');\n        onAction?.();\n    }, [onAction]);\n\n    return (\n        <Box sx={{ p: 2 }}>\n            <Paper sx={{ p: 3 }}>\n                {/* Content */}\n            </Paper>\n        </Box>\n    );\n};\n\nexport default MyComponent;\n```\n\nFor complete examples, see [resources/complete-examples.md](resources/complete-examples.md)\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **error-tracking**: Error tracking with Sentry (applies to frontend too)\n- **backend-dev-guidelines**: Backend API patterns that frontend consumes\n\n---\n\n**Skill Status**: Modular structure with progressive loading for optimal context management\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:43:03.738Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Frontend Development Agents building modern React applications with Suspense-based architecture.","zh":"对于构建使用Suspense架构的现代React应用程序的前端开发代理来说是必不可少的。","ja":"Suspenseアーキテクチャを使用したモダンなReactアプリケーションを構築するフロントエンド開発エージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"서스펜스 아키텍처를 사용하는 모던한 리액트 애플리케이션을 구축하는 프론트엔드 개발 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para Agentes de Desarrollo Frontend que construyen aplicaciones modernas de React con arquitectura basada en Suspense.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de développement Frontend qui construisent des applications modernes React avec une architecture basée sur Suspense.","de":"Wesentlich für Frontend-Entwicklungsagenten, die moderne React-Anwendungen mit Suspense-basierter Architektur erstellen.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Frontend que constroem aplicações modernas React com arquitetura baseada em Suspense.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов разработки frontend, строящих современные приложения React с архитектурой, основанной на Suspense.","ar":"ضروري لعمليات تطوير الواجهة الأمامية التي تبني تطبيقات React الحديثة مع هندسة قائمة على Suspense."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to implement TanStack Query for Suspense-based data fetching, configure TanStack Router for routing, style with MUI v7, and optimize performance through lazy loading and proper file organization following TypeScript best practices.","zh":"使代理能够实现TanStack Query进行Suspense基础的数据获取，配置TanStack Router进行路由，使用MUI v7进行样式设置，并通过延迟加载和遵循TypeScript最佳实践的适当文件组织来优化性能。","ja":"エージェントがTanStack Queryを使用してSuspenseベースのデータ取得を実装し、TanStack Routerを使用してルーティングを設定し、MUI v7を使用してスタイリングを行い、TypeScriptのベストプラクティスに従った適切なファイル構成と遅延ローディングを通じてパフォーマンスを最適化できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 TanStack Query를 사용하여 서스펜스 기반 데이터 가져오기를 구현하고, TanStack Router를 사용하여 라우팅을 설정하고, MUI v7를 사용하여 스타일을 지정하고, 타입스크립트 최고의 관행을 따르는 적절한 파일 구성 및 지연 로딩을 통해 성능을 최적화 할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar TanStack Query para la recuperación de datos basada en Suspense, configurar TanStack Router para el enrutamiento, dar estilo con MUI v7 y optimizar el rendimiento a través de la carga diferida y la organización adecuada de archivos siguiendo las mejores prácticas de TypeScript.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''implémenter TanStack Query pour le chargement de données basé sur Suspense, de configurer TanStack Router pour le routage, de styler avec MUI v7 et d''optimiser les performances via le chargement différé et l''organisation appropriée des fichiers en suivant les meilleures pratiques de TypeScript.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, TanStack Query für Suspense-basiertes Datenabrufen zu implementieren, TanStack Router für das Routing zu konfigurieren, mit MUI v7 zu stylen und die Leistung durch Lazy Loading und ordnungsgemäße Dateiorganisation unter Einhaltung der besten TypeScript-Praktiken zu optimieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes implementem TanStack Query para busca de dados baseada em Suspense, configurem TanStack Router para roteamento, estilem com MUI v7 e otimizem o desempenho por meio de carregamento lento e organização adequada de arquivos seguindo as melhores práticas do TypeScript.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовать TanStack Query для извлечения данных на основе Suspense, настроить TanStack Router для маршрутизации, оформить с помощью MUI v7 и оптимизировать производительность за счет ленивой загрузки и правильной организации файлов в соответствии с лучшими практиками TypeScript.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتنفيذ TanStack Query للبحث عن البيانات القائمة على Suspense ، وتكوين TanStack Router للتحويل ، وتصميمه باستخدام MUI v7 ، وتحسين الأداء من خلال التحميل الكسول والتنظيم الصحيح للملفات اتباعًا لأفضل الممارسات لـ TypeScript."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Suspense-based data fetching patterns","Configuring lazy-loaded route components","Setting up MUI v7 theme systems","Organizing frontend code with standardized file structures","Optimizing React component performance"],"zh":["实现Suspense基础的数据获取模式","配置延迟加载的路由组件","设置MUI v7主题系统","使用标准化的文件结构组织前端代码","优化React组件性能"],"ja":["Suspenseベースのデータ取得パターンを実装する","遅延ローディングされたルートコンポーネントを設定する","MUI v7テーマシステムを設定する","標準化されたファイル構成を使用してフロントエンドコードを整理する","Reactコンポーネントのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":["서스펜스 기반 데이터 가져오기 패턴을 구현하는 것","지연 로딩된 라우트 컴포넌트를 설정하는 것","MUI v7 테마 시스템을 설정하는 것","표준화된 파일 구조를 사용하여 프론트엔드 코드를 조직하는 것","리액트 컴포넌트의 성능을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Implementar patrones de recuperación de datos basados en Suspense","Configurar componentes de rutas con carga diferida","Configurar sistemas de temas MUI v7","Organizar el código frontend con estructuras de archivos estandarizadas","Optimizar el rendimiento de los componentes de React"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des modèles de chargement de données basés sur Suspense","Configurer des composants de routes avec chargement différé","Configurer des systèmes de thèmes MUI v7","Organiser le code frontend avec des structures de fichiers standardisées","Optimiser les performances des composants React"],"de":["Implementierung von Suspense-basierten Datenabrufmustern","Konfigurieren von Routing-Komponenten mit Lazy Loading","Einrichten von MUI v7-Themesystemen","Organisation von Frontend-Code mit standardisierten Dateistrukturen","Optimierung der Leistung von React-Komponenten"],"pt":["Implementar padrões de busca de dados baseados em Suspense","Configurar componentes de rota carregados lentamente","Configurar sistemas de temas MUI v7","Organizar código frontend com estruturas de arquivos padronizadas","Otimizar o desempenho de componentes React"],"ru":["Реализация моделей извлечения данных на основе Suspense","Настройка компонентов маршрутов с ленивой загрузкой","Настройка систем тем MUI v7","Организация кода frontend с стандартизированными структурами файлов","Оптимизация производительности компонентов React"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنماط بحث البيانات القائمة على Suspense","تكوين مكونات المسار المحملة بطريقة متأخرة","ضبط أنظمة السمات MUI v7","تنظيم رمز الواجهة الأمامية مع هياكل ملفات معيارية","تحسين أداء مكونات React"]},"limitations":{"en":["React-specific framework only","Requires TanStack ecosystem knowledge","Assumes TypeScript implementation","Focuses on modern React patterns (Suspense/hooks)"],"zh":["仅适用于React框架","需要TanStack生态系统知识","假设TypeScript实现","关注现代React模式（Suspense/钩子）"],"ja":["Reactフレームワークのみに対応","TanStackエコシステムの知識が必要","TypeScriptの実装を前提とする","モダンなReactパターン（Suspense/フックス）に焦点を当てている"],"ko":["리액트 프레임워크만 해당","TanStack 에코시스템 지식이 필요","타입스크립트 구현을 가정","최신 리액트 패턴(서스펜스/훅)에 중점을 둠"],"es":["Marco de trabajo específico de React","Requiere conocimiento del ecosistema TanStack","Supone una implementación de TypeScript","Se centra en patrones de React modernos (Suspense/hooks)"],"fr":["Cadre de travail spécifique à React","Nécessite une connaissance de l''écosystème TanStack","Suppose une mise en œuvre de TypeScript","Se concentre sur les modèles React modernes (Suspense/hooks)"],"de":["React-spezifisches Framework","Benötigt Kenntnisse des TanStack-Ökosystems","Geht von einer TypeScript-Implementierung aus","Konzentriert sich auf moderne React-Muster (Suspense/Hooks)"],"pt":["Framework específico do React apenas","Exige conhecimento do ecossistema TanStack","Pressupõe implementação do TypeScript","Concentra-se em padrões React modernos (Suspense/hooks)"],"ru":["Только фреймворк React","Требуется знание экосистемы TanStack","Предполагает реализацию TypeScript","Сосредоточен на современных моделях React (Suspense/hooks)"],"ar":["إطار عمل React فقط","يتطلب معرفة ببيئة TanStack","يفترض تنفيذ TypeScript","يركز على الأنماط الحديثة من React (Suspense/hooks)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
