de bases de données","Architecture de logiciels avec modèle C4"],"de":["Erstellung von Flussdiagrammen","Erstellung von Sequenzdiagrammen","Darstellung von Objektstrukturen","Modellierung von Zustandsmaschinen","Entwurf von DatenbankSchemata","Software-Architektur mit C4-Modell"],"pt":["Geração de diagramas com sintaxe Mermaid","Renderização de diagramas em blocos de código Markdown","Suporte a vários tipos de diagramas, incluindo fluxogramas e diagramas de sequência","Integração com links de wiki estilo Zettelkasten","Suporte a documentação técnica"],"ru":["Генерация диаграмм с помощью синтаксиса Mermaid","Рендеринг диаграмм в блоках кода Markdown","Поддержка нескольких типов диаграмм, включая блок-схемы и диаграммы последовательности","Интеграция с wiki-ссылками в стиле Zettelkasten","Поддержка технической документации"],"ar":["إنشاء الرسومات باستخدام بناء الجملة ميرميد","عرض الرسومات في كتل الشفرة ماركداون","دعم أنواع متعددة من الرسومات، بما في ذلك الرسومات الانسيابية والرسومات المتسلسلة","التكامل مع روابط ويكي بأسلوب زيتيلكاستن","دعم الوثائق الفنية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Mermaid图表","流程图","序列图","类图","Zettelkasten","wiki链接","markdown代码块","图表渲染"],"ja":["Mermaidダイアグラム","フローチャート","シーケンス図","クラス図","Zettelkasten","wikiリンク","markdownコードブロック","図表レンダリング"],"ko":["Mermaid 다이어그램","흐름도","시퀀스도","클래스도","Zettelkasten","wiki 링크","markdown 코드 블록","다이어그램 렌더링"],"es":["mermaid","diagramas","sintaxis mermaid","documentación técnica","comunicación efectiva","generación de diagramas","lenguaje de marcado","diagramas de flujo","diagramas de secuencia"],"fr":["mermaid","diagrammes","syntaxe mermaid","documentation technique","communication efficace","génération de diagrammes","langage de balisage","diagrammes de flux","diagrammes de séquence"],"de":["mermaid","diagramme","mermaid-syntax","technische dokumentation","effektive kommunikation","erstellung von diagrammen","auszeichnungssprache","flussdiagramme","sequenzdiagramme"],"pt":["Mermaid","diagramas","sintaxe Mermaid","blocos de código Markdown","links de wiki","Zettelkasten","documentação técnica","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["Mermaid","диаграммы","синтаксис Mermaid","блоки кода Markdown","wiki-ссылки","Zettelkasten","техническая документация","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["ميرميد","الرسومات","بناء الجملة ميرميد","كتل الشفرة ماركداون","روابط ويكي","زيتيلكاستن","الوثائق الفنية","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"alexanderop","repo":"second-brain-nuxt","repoPath":"alexanderop/second-brain-nuxt","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mermaid-diagrams","description":"Generate Mermaid diagrams (flowcharts, sequence, class, state, ER, C4, mindmaps, gitgraph). Use when asked to create diagrams, visualize processes, document architecture, or explain systems visually. Triggers include diagram, flowchart, sequence diagram, class diagram, state diagram, ER diagram, C4, mindmap, gitgraph, visualize, draw.","bodyPreview":"# Mermaid Diagrams\n\nGenerate diagrams using Mermaid syntax. All diagrams render in markdown code blocks with `mermaid` language identifier.\n\n## Decision Guide\n\n| Use Case | Diagram Type |\n|----------|--------------|\n| Process flow, decision trees | Flowchart |\n| API calls, system interactions over time | Sequence |\n| OOP structure, domain models | Class |\n| State machines, workflows | State |\n| Database schemas, data relationships | ER |\n| Software architecture (C4 model) | C4 |\n| Brainstorming,","body":"# Mermaid Diagrams\n\nGenerate diagrams using Mermaid syntax. All diagrams render in markdown code blocks with `mermaid` language identifier.\n\n## Decision Guide\n\n| Use Case | Diagram Type |\n|----------|--------------|\n| Process flow, decision trees | Flowchart |\n| API calls, system interactions over time | Sequence |\n| OOP structure, domain models | Class |\n| State machines, workflows | State |\n| Database schemas, data relationships | ER |\n| Software architecture (C4 model) | C4 |\n| Brainstorming, hierarchical organization | Mindmap |\n| Git branching, commit history | GitGraph |\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Flowchart\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[Start] --> B{Decision}\n    B -->|Yes| C[Action 1]\n    B -->|No| D[Action 2]\n    C --> E[End]\n    D --> E\n```\n\n### Sequence\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant U as User\n    participant S as Server\n    U->>S: Request\n    S-->>U: Response\n```\n\n### Class\n```mermaid\nclassDiagram\n    Animal <|-- Dog\n    Animal : +String name\n    Animal : +makeSound()\n    Dog : +fetch()\n```\n\n### State\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --> Idle\n    Idle --> Processing: start\n    Processing --> Done: complete\n    Done --> [*]\n```\n\n### ER\n```mermaid\nerDiagram\n    CUSTOMER ||--o{ ORDER : places\n    ORDER ||--|{ LINE-ITEM : contains\n```\n\n### C4 Context\n```mermaid\nC4Context\n    Person(user, \"User\", \"End user\")\n    System(app, \"Application\", \"Main system\")\n    Rel(user, app, \"Uses\")\n```\n\n### Mindmap\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n  root((Topic))\n    Branch A\n      Leaf 1\n      Leaf 2\n    Branch B\n```\n\n### GitGraph\n```mermaid\ngitgraph\n    commit\n    branch feature\n    commit\n    checkout main\n    merge feature\n```\n\n---\n\n## Flowchart Reference\n\n**Directions:** `TD` (top-down), `LR` (left-right), `BT` (bottom-top), `RL` (right-left)\n\n### Node Shapes\n\n| Shape | Syntax | Example |\n|-------|--------|---------|\n| Rectangle | `[text]` | `A[Process]` |\n| Rounded | `(text)` | `A(Start)` |\n| Stadium | `([text])` | `A([Terminal])` |\n| Diamond | `{text}` | `A{Decision}` |\n| Circle | `((text))` | `A((Event))` |\n| Hexagon | `{{text}}` | `A{{Prepare}}` |\n| Cylinder | `[(text)]` | `A[(Database)]` |\n| Subroutine | `[[text]]` | `A[[Subprocess]]` |\n| Parallelogram | `[/text/]` | `A[/Input/]` |\n| Trapezoid | `[\\text\\]` | `A[\\Manual Op\\]` |\n\n### Link Types\n\n| Type | Syntax | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| Arrow | `-->` | Solid with arrowhead |\n| Open | `---` | Solid, no arrowhead |\n| Dotted arrow | `-.->` | Dotted with arrowhead |\n| Thick arrow | `==>` | Thick with arrowhead |\n| With text | `--\\|text\\|>` | Label on link |\n| Multi-length | `---->` | Longer link (more ranks) |\n\n### Subgraphs\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    subgraph Backend[\"Backend Services\"]\n        direction LR\n        API --> DB[(Database)]\n    end\n    Client --> API\n```\n\n### Styling\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[Node]:::highlight\n    classDef highlight fill:#ff9,stroke:#333\n    style A stroke-width:2px\n```\n\n---\n\n## Sequence Diagram Reference\n\n### Arrow Types\n\n| Syntax | Style |\n|--------|-------|\n| `->>` | Solid with arrowhead |\n| `-->>` | Dotted with arrowhead |\n| `-x` | Solid with cross |\n| `-)` | Async (open arrow) |\n| `<<->>` | Bidirectional |\n\n### Participants\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    actor User\n    participant API as API Server\n    participant DB as Database\n```\n\n### Activations\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    User->>+API: Request\n    API->>+DB: Query\n    DB-->>-API: Result\n    API-->>-User: Response\n```\n\n### Control Flow\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    alt Success\n        A->>B: OK\n    else Failure\n        A->>B: Error\n    end\n\n    loop Every 5s\n        A->>B: Ping\n    end\n\n    opt Optional\n        A->>B: Maybe\n    end\n```\n\n### Notes\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    Note right of A: Single note\n    Note over A,B: Spanning note\n```\n\n### Grouping with Boxes\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    box Blue Frontend\n        participant U as User\n        participant W as Web\n    end\n    box Green Backend\n        participant A as API\n    end\n```\n\n---\n\n## Class Diagram Reference\n\n### Visibility Modifiers\n\n| Symbol | Meaning |\n|--------|---------|\n| `+` | Public |\n| `-` | Private |\n| `#` | Protected |\n| `~` | Package |\n\n### Relationships\n\n| Type | Syntax | Meaning |\n|------|--------|---------|\n| Inheritance | `<\\|--` | Extends |\n| Composition | `*--` | Strong owns |\n| Aggregation | `o--` | Weak owns |\n| Association | `-->` | Uses |\n| Dependency | `..>` | Depends on |\n| Realization | `..\\|>` | Implements |\n\n### Full Example\n```mermaid\nclassDiagram\n    class Animal {\n        <<abstract>>\n        +String name\n        +int age\n        +makeSound()* void\n    }\n    class Dog {\n        +String breed\n        +fetch() void\n    }\n    Animal <|-- Dog\n    Dog \"1\" --> \"*\" Toy : plays with\n```\n\n### Generics\n```mermaid\nclassDiagram\n    class List~T~ {\n        +add(T item)\n        +T get(int index)\n    }\n```\n\n### Annotations\n- `<<interface>>` - Interface\n- `<<abstract>>` - Abstract class\n- `<<service>>` - Service class\n- `<<enumeration>>` - Enum\n\n---\n\n## State Diagram Reference\n\n### Basic Syntax\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --> State1\n    State1 --> State2: trigger\n    State2 --> [*]\n```\n\n### Composite States\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    state Active {\n        [*] --> Running\n        Running --> Paused: pause\n        Paused --> Running: resume\n    }\n    [*] --> Active\n    Active --> [*]: stop\n```\n\n### Fork and Join\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    state fork <<fork>>\n    state join <<join>>\n    [*] --> fork\n    fork --> Task1\n    fork --> Task2\n    Task1 --> join\n    Task2 --> join\n    join --> [*]\n```\n\n### Choice\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    state check <<choice>>\n    [*] --> check\n    check --> Success: valid\n    check --> Error: invalid\n```\n\n### Notes\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    State1\n    note right of State1\n        Description here\n    end note\n```\n\n---\n\n## ER Diagram Reference\n\n### Cardinality\n\n| Left | Right | Meaning |\n|------|-------|---------|\n| `\\|o` | `o\\|` | Zero or one |\n| `\\|\\|` | `\\|\\|` | Exactly one |\n| `}o` | `o{` | Zero or more |\n| `}\\|` | `\\|{` | One or more |\n\n### Relationship Types\n- `--` Identifying (solid line, child depends on parent)\n- `..` Non-identifying (dashed line, independent entities)\n\n### Attributes\n```mermaid\nerDiagram\n    USER {\n        int id PK\n        string email UK\n        string name\n        datetime created_at\n    }\n    POST {\n        int id PK\n        int user_id FK\n        string title\n        text content\n    }\n    USER ||--o{ POST : writes\n```\n\n---\n\n## C4 Diagram Reference\n\nC4 provides 4 levels of abstraction for architecture documentation.\n\n### Diagram Types\n- `C4Context` - System context (level 1)\n- `C4Container` - Container diagram (level 2)\n- `C4Component` - Component diagram (level 3)\n- `C4Dynamic` - Interaction sequences\n- `C4Deployment` - Infrastructure layout\n\n### Elements\n\n| Element | Syntax | Use |\n|---------|--------|-----|\n| Person | `Person(alias, label, desc)` | Users |\n| Person_Ext | `Person_Ext(...)` | External users |\n| System | `System(alias, label, desc)` | Software systems |\n| System_Ext | `System_Ext(...)` | External systems |\n| SystemDb | `SystemDb(...)` | Database systems |\n| Container | `Container(alias, label, tech, desc)` | Applications |\n| ContainerDb | `ContainerDb(...)` | Container databases |\n| Component | `Component(alias, label, tech, desc)` | Internal parts |\n\n### Boundaries\n```mermaid\nC4Container\n    System_Boundary(app, \"Application\") {\n        Container(web, \"Web App\", \"React\")\n        Container(api, \"API\", \"Node.js\")\n        ContainerDb(db, \"Database\", \"PostgreSQL\")\n    }\n    Rel(web, api, \"HTTP/JSON\")\n    Rel(api, db, \"SQL\")\n```\n\n### Relationships\n- `Rel(from, to, label)` - Standard relationship\n- `Rel_U/D/L/R(...)` - Directional hints\n- `BiRel(from, to, label)` - Bidirectional\n\n### Complete C4 Context Example\n```mermaid\nC4Context\n    Person(user, \"Customer\", \"Uses the system\")\n    System(app, \"E-Commerce\", \"Online store\")\n    System_Ext(payment, \"Payment Gateway\", \"Processes payments\")\n    System_Ext(shipping, \"Shipping API\", \"Handles delivery\")\n\n    Rel(user, app, \"Browses, orders\")\n    Rel(app, payment, \"Processes payments\")\n    Rel(app, shipping, \"Ships orders\")\n```\n\n---\n\n## Mindmap Reference\n\nUses indentation for hierarchy. Root node required.\n\n### Node Shapes\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n    root((Central Topic))\n        [Square]\n        (Rounded)\n        ))Cloud((\n        {{Hexagon}}\n```\n\n### With Icons\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n    root((Project))\n        Tasks ::icon(fa fa-tasks)\n        Team ::icon(fa fa-users)\n```\n\n### Styling\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n    root\n        Important:::urgent\n        Normal\n```\n\n---\n\n## GitGraph Reference\n\n### Basic Operations\n```mermaid\ngitgraph\n    commit id: \"initial\"\n    commit id: \"feature\"\n    branch develop\n    commit\n    checkout main\n    merge develop tag: \"v1.0\"\n```\n\n### Commit Types\n- `type: NORMAL` - Default\n- `type: HIGHLIGHT` - Emphasized\n- `type: REVERSE` - Reverted\n\n### Full Example\n```mermaid\ngitgraph\n    commit id: \"init\"\n    branch feature\n    commit id: \"add-login\"\n    commit id: \"add-logout\" type: HIGHLIGHT\n    checkout main\n    commit id: \"hotfix\" type: REVERSE\n    merge feature tag: \"v1.0\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### DO\n- Keep diagrams focused (one concept per diagram)\n- Use clear, descriptive labels\n- Add direction hints (`TD`, `LR`) explicitly\n- Use subgraphs/boundaries for grouping\n- Include legends for complex diagrams\n\n### DON''T\n- Overcrowd with too many nodes (>15-20)\n- Use cryptic single-letter IDs without labels\n- Mix multiple concerns in one diagram\n- Rely on auto-layout for complex diagrams\n\n### Layout Tips\n- **Flowchart**: `LR` for processes, `TD` for hierarchies\n- **Sequence**: Order participants by interaction frequency\n- **Class**: Group related classes with namespaces\n- **C4**: Start with Context, drill down to Container/Component\n- **ER**: Place central entities in the middle\n\n### Common Fixes\n| Problem | Solution |\n|---------|----------|\n| Nodes overlap | Reduce node count, use subgraphs |\n| Links cross confusingly | Reorder nodes, change direction |\n| Text truncated | Use aliases: `A[Long Name] as short` |\n| Diagram too wide | Switch `LR` to `TD` |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:43:17.284Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Knowledge Management Agents needing advanced diagramming capabilities with Mermaid syntax","zh":"非常适合需要高级图表功能的知识管理代理，特别是支持 Mermaid 语法","ja":"Mermaid 構文を使用した高度なダイアグラム作成機能を必要とするナレッジマネジメントエージェントに最適","ko":"Mermaid 구문과 함께 고급 도표 기능을 필요로 하는 지식 관리 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Gestión del Conocimiento que necesitan capacidades de diagramación avanzadas con sintaxis Mermaid","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion des connaissances ayant besoin de fonctionnalités de diagramme avancées avec la syntaxe Mermaid","de":"Perfekt für Wissensmanagement-Agenten, die erweiterte Diagrammfunktionen mit Mermaid-Syntax benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de Gerenciamento de Conhecimento que necessitam de capacidades de diagramação avançadas com sintaxe Mermaid","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления знаниями, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности диаграммирования с синтаксисом Mermaid","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة المعرفة التي تحتاج إلى امکانات رسم متقدمة باستخدام بناء جملة ميرميد"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate flowcharts, sequence diagrams, class diagrams, and more using markdown code blocks with the `mermaid` language identifier, supporting various use cases such as process flow, API calls, and software architecture visualization with C4 model","zh":"使代理能够使用带有 `mermaid` 语言标识符的 markdown 代码块生成流程图、序列图、类图等，支持各种用例，如过程流、API 调用和使用 C4 模型的软件架构可视化","ja":"`mermaid` 言語識別子を使用したマークダウンコードブロックで、フローチャート、シーケンス図、クラス図などを生成することができ、プロセスフロー、API 呼び出し、C4 モデルを使用したソフトウェアアーキテクチャの可視化などのさまざまなユースケースをサポート","ko":"에이전트가 `mermaid` 언어 식별자를 사용하는 마크다운 코드 블록으로 흐름图, 시퀀스图, 클래스图 등을 생성할 수 있으며, 프로세스 흐름, API 호출, C4 모델을 사용한 소프트웨어 아키텍처 시각화 등의 다양한 사용 사례를 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar diagramas de flujo, diagramas de secuencia, diagramas de clases y más utilizando bloques de código markdown con el identificador de lenguaje `mermaid`, que admite varios casos de uso como flujo de proceso, llamadas a API y visualización de arquitectura de software con el modelo C4","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des diagrammes de flux, des diagrammes de séquence, des diagrammes de classes et plus encore en utilisant des blocs de code markdown avec l''identifiant de langage `mermaid`, qui prend en charge divers cas d''utilisation tels que le flux de processus, les appels d''API et la visualisation de l''architecture logicielle avec le modèle C4","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Flussdiagramme, Sequenzdiagramme, Klassendiagramme und mehr zu erstellen, indem sie Markdown-Codeblöcke mit dem Sprachidentifikator `mermaid` verwenden, der verschiedene Anwendungsfälle wie Prozessfluss, API-Aufrufe und Software-Architektur-Visualisierung mit dem C4-Modell unterstützt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar fluxogramas, diagramas de sequência, diagramas de classe e muito mais usando blocos de código markdown com o identificador de linguagem `mermaid`, suportando vários casos de uso, como fluxo de processo, chamadas de API e visualização de arquitetura de software com modelo C4","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать блок-схемы, диаграммы последовательности, диаграммы классов и многое другое с помощью блоков кода markdown с идентификатором языка `mermaid`, поддерживая различные случаи использования, такие как поток процесса, вызовы API и визуализация программной архитектуры с моделью C4","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء إنشاء رسومات تدفق ورسومات تسلسل ورسومات فئات وأكثر من ذلك بكثير باستخدام كتل شفرة markdown مع معرّف اللغة `mermaid` ، ودعم حالات استخدام مختلفة مثل تدفق العملية واستدعاءات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات وتصوير هندسة البرمجيات بنموذج C4"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating flowcharts for process visualization","Creating sequence diagrams for API call interactions","Designing class diagrams for object-oriented programming structures"],"zh":["为过程可视化生成流程图","为 API 调用交互创建序列图","为面向对象编程结构设计类图"],"ja":["プロセス可視化のためのフローチャートの生成","API 呼び出し相互作用のためのシーケンス図の作成","オブジェクト指向プログラミング構造のためのクラス図の設計"],"ko":["프로세스 시각화를 위한 흐름图 생성","API 호출 상호작용을 위한 시퀀스图 생성","객체 지향 프로그래밍 구조를 위한 클래스图 설계"],"es":["Generar diagramas de flujo para la visualización de procesos","Crear diagramas de secuencia para las interacciones de llamadas a API","Diseñar diagramas de clases para estructuras de programación orientada a objetos"],"fr":["Générer des diagrammes de flux pour la visualisation de processus","Créer des diagrammes de séquence pour les interactions d''appels d''API","Concevoir des diagrammes de classes pour les structures de programmation orientée objet"],"de":["Erstellen von Flussdiagrammen für die Visualisierung von Prozessen","Erstellen von Sequenzdiagrammen für API-Aufruf-Interaktionen","Entwerfen von Klassendiagrammen für objektorientierte Programmierstrukturen"],"pt":["Gerar fluxogramas para visualização de processos","Criar diagramas de sequência para interações de chamadas de API","Projetar diagramas de classe para estruturas de programação orientada a objetos"],"ru":["Генерировать блок-схемы для визуализации процессов","Создавать диаграммы последовательности для взаимодействий вызовов API","Проектировать диаграммы классов для структур объектно-ориентированного программирования"],"ar":["إنشاء رسومات تدفق لتصوير العمليات","إنشاء رسومات تسلسل لتفاعلات استدعاءات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تصميم رسومات الفئات لهياكل البرمجة الموجهة بالكائنات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Mermaid syntax knowledge","Limited to diagram types supported by Mermaid (e.g., flowchart, sequence, class, state, ER, C4)"],"zh":["需要 Mermaid 语法知识","仅限于 Mermaid 支持的图表类型（例如，流程图、序列图、类图、状态图、ER 图、C4 图）"],"ja":["Mermaid 構文の知識が必要","Mermaid でサポートされているダイアグラムのタイプのみに限定される（例：フローチャート、シーケンス図、クラス図、状態図、ER 図、C4 図）"],"ko":["Mermaid 구문의 지식이 필요","Mermaid에서 지원하는 도표 유형으로만 제한된다(예: 흐름图, 시퀀스图, 클래스图, 상태图, ER图, C4图)"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la sintaxis Mermaid","Limitado a los tipos de diagramas compatibles con Mermaid (por ejemplo, diagrama de flujo, secuencia, clase, estado, ER, C4)"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en syntaxe Mermaid","Limité aux types de diagrammes pris en charge par Mermaid (par exemple, diagramme de flux, séquence, classe, état, ER, C4)"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in Mermaid-Syntax","Begrenzt auf die von Mermaid unterstützten Diagrammtypen (z. B. Flussdiagramm, Sequenz, Klasse, Zustand, ER, C4)"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de sintaxe Mermaid","Limitado a tipos de diagramas suportados pelo Mermaid (por exemplo, fluxograma, sequência, classe, estado, ER, C4)"],"ru":["Требует знания синтаксиса Mermaid","Ограничен типами диаграмм, поддерживаемыми Mermaid (например, блок-схема, последовательность, класс, состояние, ER, C4)"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بناء جملة ميرميد","محدود بنوعيات الرسومات المدعومة من قبل ميرميد (على سبيل المثال ، رسم تدفق ، رسم تسلسل ، رسم فئات ، حالة ، ER ، C4)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
