ие документов как HTML","ar":"أنماط HTTP: عرض المستندات كHTML","en":"http-patterns"},"description":{"zh":"HTTP Patterns是一个渲染代理，用于服务原始文档作为样式化HTML，基于Go 1.22+和项目特定约定","ja":"HTTP Patternsは、原始ドキュメントをスタイル化HTMLとして提供するレンダリングプロキシです。Go 1.22+とプロジェクト固有の規約に基づいています","ko":"HTTP Patterns는 원시 문서를 스타일링된 HTML로 제공하는 렌더링 프록시입니다. Go 1.22+와 프로젝트 특정 규약을 기반으로 합니다","es":"Los patrones HTTP permiten renderizar documentos como HTML con Go 1.22+ y convenciones de proyectos específicos. Aprende a utilizarlos.","fr":"Les modèles HTTP permettent de rendre des documents comme HTML avec Go 1.22+ et des conventions de projet spécifiques. Découvrez-les.","de":"HTTP-Muster ermöglichen das Rendern von Dokumenten als HTML mit Go 1.22+ und projektspezifischen Konventionen. Erfahren Sie mehr.","pt":"O http-patterns é uma biblioteca que permite renderizar documentos como HTML com facilidade. Com ele, você pode criar servidores HTTP personalizados com Go 1...","ru":"http-patterns - это библиотека, которая позволяет отображать документы как HTML легко. С ее помощью вы можете создавать пользовательские серверы HTTP с Go 1....","ar":"http-patterns هي مكتبة تتيح عرض المستندات كHTML بسهولة. يمكنك استخدامها لإنشاء خوادم HTTP مخصصة مع Go 1.22+.","en":"A rendering proxy that serves raw documents as styled HTML"},"definition":{"en":"A rendering proxy that serves raw documents as styled HTML"},"features":{"zh":["基于Go 1.22+的渲染代理","支持项目特定约定","使用HTTP verb前缀注册","支持路径参数"],"ja":["Go 1.22+ベースのレンダリングプロキシ","プロジェクト固有の規約をサポート","HTTP動詞プレフィックスを使用して登録","パスパラメータをサポート"],"ko":["Go 1.22+ 기반 렌더링 프록시","프로젝트 특정 규약 지원","HTTP 동사 접두사 사용 등록","경로 매개변수 지원"],"es":["Soporte para Go 1.22+","Enrutamiento de métodos con ServeMux","Parámetros de ruta personalizados","Compatibilidad con HTTP verb prefix","Renderizado de documentos como HTML"],"fr":["Prise en charge de Go 1.22+","Routeur de méthodes avec ServeMux","Paramètres de chemin personnalisés","Compatibilité avec le préfixe de verbe HTTP","Rendu de documents comme HTML"],"de":["Unterstützung für Go 1.22+","Methoden-Router mit ServeMux","Benutzerdefinierte Pfadparameter","Kompatibilität mit HTTP-Verb-Prefix","Rendern von Dokumenten als HTML"],"pt":["Renderização de documentos como HTML","Suporte a Go 1.22+","Uso de ServeMux para roteamento de métodos","Parâmetros de caminho personalizados","Registration de handlers HTTP com prefixo de verbo"],"ru":["Отображение документов как HTML","Поддержка Go 1.22+","Использование ServeMux для маршрутизации методов","Пользовательские параметры пути","Регистрация обработчиков HTTP с префиксом глагола"],"ar":["عرض المستندات كHTML","دعم Go 1.22+","استخدام ServeMux للتحكم في طرق HTTP","معاملات طريق مخصصة","تسجيل معالجات HTTP باستخدام بادئة الفعل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["HTTP Patterns","Go 1.22+","渲染代理","原始文档","样式化HTML","项目特定约定"],"ja":["HTTP Patterns","Go 1.22+","レンダリングプロキシ","原始ドキュメント","スタイル化HTML","プロジェクト固有の規約"],"ko":["HTTP Patterns","Go 1.22+","렌더링 프록시","원시 문서","스타일링된 HTML","프로젝트 특정 규약"],"es":["patrones http","go 1.22","serve mux","parámetros de ruta","renderizado de documentos","html","desarrollo web","programación"],"fr":["modèles http","go 1.22","serve mux","paramètres de chemin","rendu de documents","html","développement web","programmation"],"de":["http-muster","go 1.22","serve mux","pfadparameter","rendern von dokumenten","html","webentwicklung","programmierung"],"pt":["http-patterns","renderização de documentos","Go 1.22+","ServeMux","roteamento de métodos","parâmetros de caminho","handlers HTTP"],"ru":["http-patterns","отображение документов","Go 1.22+","ServeMux","маршрутизация методов","параметры пути","обработчики HTTP"],"ar":["http-patterns","عرض المستندات","Go 1.22+","ServeMux","التحكم في طرق HTTP","معاملات طريق","معالجات HTTP"]}},"owner":"air-gapped","repo":"cooked","repoPath":"air-gapped/cooked","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"http-patterns","description":"HTTP handler patterns for Go 1.22+. Method routing, middleware, graceful shutdown.","bodyPreview":"# HTTP Patterns\n\nGo 1.22+ patterns and project-specific conventions for HTTP handlers.\n\n---\n\n## Go 1.22: ServeMux Method Routing\n\nNo more manual method checks. Register with HTTP verb prefix:\n\n```go\nmux := http.NewServeMux()\nmux.HandleFunc(\"GET /healthz\", healthHandler)\nmux.HandleFunc(\"GET /_cooked/{path...}\", assetHandler)\nmux.HandleFunc(\"GET /{upstream...}\", renderHandler)\n```\n\n### Path Parameters\n\n```go\nfunc renderHandler(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    upstream := r.PathValue(\"","body":"# HTTP Patterns\n\nGo 1.22+ patterns and project-specific conventions for HTTP handlers.\n\n---\n\n## Go 1.22: ServeMux Method Routing\n\nNo more manual method checks. Register with HTTP verb prefix:\n\n```go\nmux := http.NewServeMux()\nmux.HandleFunc(\"GET /healthz\", healthHandler)\nmux.HandleFunc(\"GET /_cooked/{path...}\", assetHandler)\nmux.HandleFunc(\"GET /{upstream...}\", renderHandler)\n```\n\n### Path Parameters\n\n```go\nfunc renderHandler(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    upstream := r.PathValue(\"upstream\")  // NEW in Go 1.22\n    // ...\n}\n```\n\n### Special Patterns\n\n| Pattern | Matches |\n|---------|---------|\n| `/posts/{id}` | `/posts/123` (single segment) |\n| `/files/{path...}` | `/files/a/b/c` (remainder of path) |\n| `/posts/{$}` | `/posts/` only (not `/posts` or `/posts/x`) |\n\n### Precedence\n\nMore specific wins:\n- `/healthz` beats `/{upstream...}`\n- `GET /posts/{id}` beats `/posts/{id}`\n\n**Conflicting patterns panic at registration:**\n```go\nmux.HandleFunc(\"GET /posts/{id}\", h1)\nmux.HandleFunc(\"GET /{resource}/latest\", h2)  // PANIC - both match /posts/latest\n```\n\n### Automatic 405\n\nUnmatched methods return `405 Method Not Allowed` with `Allow` header.\n\n### go.mod Requirement\n\nGo 1.22+ patterns require `go 1.22` or later in `go.mod`. Without it, patterns are treated literally (braces aren''t wildcards).\n\nSources: [Go Blog: Routing Enhancements](https://go.dev/blog/routing-enhancements), [Eli Bendersky](https://eli.thegreenplace.net/2023/better-http-server-routing-in-go-122/)\n\n---\n\n## Middleware Pattern\n\nThis project uses the standard wrapper pattern:\n\n```go\nfunc RequestLogger(next http.Handler) http.Handler {\n    return http.HandlerFunc(func(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n        start := time.Now()\n        wrapped := &byteCountingWriter{ResponseWriter: w}\n        next.ServeHTTP(wrapped, r)\n        slog.Info(\"request\",\n            \"method\", r.Method,\n            \"path\", r.URL.Path,\n            \"status\", wrapped.statusCode,\n            \"bytes\", wrapped.bytes,\n            \"total_ms\", time.Since(start).Milliseconds(),\n        )\n    })\n}\n\n// Composable\nvar handler http.Handler = mux\nhandler = RequestLogger(handler)\nhandler = RecoveryMiddleware(handler)\n\nsrv := &http.Server{Handler: handler}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Request Context\n\nStore request-scoped values using typed keys:\n\n```go\n// Define typed key (prevents collisions)\ntype contextKey string\nconst loggerKey contextKey = \"logger\"\n\n// Set in middleware\nctx := context.WithValue(r.Context(), loggerKey, logger)\nnext.ServeHTTP(w, r.WithContext(ctx))\n\n// Retrieve in handlers\nfunc Logger(ctx context.Context) *slog.Logger {\n    if l, ok := ctx.Value(loggerKey).(*slog.Logger); ok {\n        return l\n    }\n    return slog.Default()\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## ResponseWriter Wrapping\n\nWrap to capture bytes and status:\n\n```go\ntype byteCountingWriter struct {\n    http.ResponseWriter\n    bytes      int64\n    statusCode int\n}\n\nfunc (w *byteCountingWriter) WriteHeader(code int) {\n    w.statusCode = code\n    w.ResponseWriter.WriteHeader(code)\n}\n\nfunc (w *byteCountingWriter) Write(b []byte) (int, error) {\n    if w.statusCode == 0 {\n        w.statusCode = 200  // Default if WriteHeader not called\n    }\n    n, err := w.ResponseWriter.Write(b)\n    w.bytes += int64(n)\n    return n, err\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Graceful Shutdown\n\n### Standard Pattern\n\n```go\nsrv := &http.Server{\n    Addr:    \":8080\",\n    Handler: mux,\n}\n\n// Start server\ngo func() {\n    if err := srv.ListenAndServe(); !errors.Is(err, http.ErrServerClosed) {\n        log.Fatal(err)\n    }\n}()\n\n// Wait for signal\n<-ctx.Done()\n\n// Graceful shutdown with timeout\nshutdownCtx, cancel := context.WithTimeout(context.Background(), 30*time.Second)\ndefer cancel()\n\nif err := srv.Shutdown(shutdownCtx); err != nil {\n    log.Printf(\"shutdown error: %v\", err)\n}\n```\n\n### What Shutdown() Does\n\n1. Stops accepting new connections immediately\n2. Closes idle connections\n3. Waits for active requests to complete\n4. Returns when all handlers finish OR context expires\n\n### Kubernetes Considerations\n\nAdd a health endpoint that fails during shutdown:\n\n```go\nhealthService.MarkShuttingDown()  // Called before Shutdown()\n// Readiness probe now returns 503\n```\n\nSources: [VictoriaMetrics](https://victoriametrics.com/blog/go-graceful-shutdown/), [DEV Community](https://dev.to/mokiat/proper-http-shutdown-in-go-3fji)\n\n---\n\n## Error Responses\n\ncooked returns HTML error pages, not JSON:\n\n```go\nfunc renderError(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request, status int, errType, message string) {\n    w.Header().Set(\"Content-Type\", \"text/html; charset=utf-8\")\n    w.WriteHeader(status)\n    // Render error template with same theming as content pages\n}\n```\n\nError pages use the same HTML template with:\n- Proper theming (respects user''s theme choice)\n- `#cooked-error` element with `data-error-type` and `data-status-code`\n- Direct link to the upstream URL\n\n---\n\n## Handler Naming\n\n| Pattern | Returns | Example |\n|---------|---------|---------|\n| `FeatureHandler(deps)` | `http.HandlerFunc` | `RenderHandler(deps)` |\n| `FeatureMiddleware(next)` | `http.Handler` | `RequestLogger(next)` |\n\n---\n\n## What NOT to Do\n\n| Don''t | Why |\n|-------|-----|\n| Check method with `if r.Method != \"GET\"` | Use Go 1.22+ method routing |\n| Call `w.Write` after handler returns | Causes panic or writes to wrong response |\n| Use `string` context keys | Collisions — use typed keys |\n| Ignore `http.ErrServerClosed` | It''s expected from `Shutdown()` |\n| Release resources before shutdown completes | Handlers may still be using them |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:43:40.231Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing streamlined HTTP handler management with Go 1.22+","zh":"非常适合需要简化HTTP处理程序管理的Web开发代理，支持Go 1.22+","ja":"Web開発エージェントがストリームライン化されたHTTPハンドラ管理を必要とする場合に最適で、Go 1.22+をサポート","ko":"스트림 라인化된 HTTP 핸들러 관리가 필요한 웹 개발 에이전트에게 적합하며 Go 1.22+를 지원합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan una gestión de controladores HTTP optimizada con Go 1.22+","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement web ayant besoin d''une gestion de gestionnaires HTTP rationalisée avec Go 1.22+","de":"Perfekt für Web-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine optimierte HTTP-Handler-Verwaltung mit Go 1.22+ benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que necessitam de gerenciamento de tratamento de HTTP simplificado com Go 1.22+","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, которым необходим упрощенный менеджмент обработчиков HTTP с Go 1.22+","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيق الويب الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة معالج HTTP مبسط مع Go 1.22+"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently register HTTP handlers with method-based routing, leveraging ServeMux and path parameter extraction for robust web applications using HTTP verb prefix and Go''s net/http package","zh":"赋予代理高效注册HTTP处理程序的能力，使用基于方法的路由、ServeMux和路径参数提取，打造强大的使用HTTP动词前缀和Go的net/http包的Web应用","ja":"エージェントがHTTPハンドラを効率的に登録できるようにし、メソッドベースのルーティング、ServeMux、パスパラメータ抽出を利用して、HTTP動詞プレフィックスとGoのnet/httpパッケージを使用した堅牢なWebアプリケーションを構築する","ko":"에이전트가 HTTP 핸들러를 효율적으로 등록할 수 있도록 하며, 메서드 기반 라우팅, ServeMux 및 경로 매개 변수 추출을 사용하여 HTTP 동사 접두사와 Go의 net/http 패키지를 사용한 강력한 웹 애플리케이션을 구축합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a registrar de manera eficiente controladores HTTP con enrutamiento basado en métodos, aprovechando ServeMux y la extracción de parámetros de ruta para aplicaciones web robustas utilizando el prefijo de verbo HTTP y el paquete net/http de Go","fr":"Permet aux agents de s''enregistrer efficacement des gestionnaires HTTP avec un routage basé sur les méthodes, en exploitant ServeMux et l''extraction de paramètres de chemin pour des applications web robustes utilisant le préfixe de verbe HTTP et le paquet net/http de Go","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, HTTP-Handler effizient mit methodebasiertem Routing zu registrieren, indem es ServeMux und Pfadparameterextraktion für robuste Webanwendungen unter Verwendung des HTTP-Verb-Prefix und des net/http-Pakets von Go nutzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a registrar tratadores de HTTP de forma eficiente com roteamento baseado em métodos, aproveitando o ServeMux e a extração de parâmetros de caminho para aplicações web robustas usando prefixo de verbo HTTP e o pacote net/http do Go","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно регистрировать обработчики HTTP с маршрутизацией на основе методов, используя ServeMux и извлечение параметров пути для надёжных веб-приложений, использующих префикс HTTP-глагола и пакет net/http в Go","ar":"يمكّن العميل من تسجيل معالجات HTTP بشكل فعال باستخدام التوجيه القائم على الطريقة، والاستفادة من ServeMux واستخراج معاملات المسار لتحقيق تطبيقات ويب قوية باستخدام بادئة الفعل HTTP و حزمة net/http من Go"},"useCases":{"en":["Registering handlers for specific HTTP methods","Extracting path parameters for dynamic routing","Simplifying ServeMux configuration for complex web applications"],"zh":["为特定HTTP方法注册处理程序","提取路径参数用于动态路由","简化ServeMux配置用于复杂的Web应用"],"ja":["特定のHTTPメソッドのハンドラを登録する","動的ルーティングのためのパスパラメータを抽出する","複雑なWebアプリケーションのためのServeMux構成を簡素化する"],"ko":["특정 HTTP 메서드에 대한 핸들러 등록","동적 라우팅을 위한 경로 매개 변수 추출","복잡한 웹 애플리케이션을 위한 ServeMux 구성简化"],"es":["Registrar controladores para métodos HTTP específicos","Extraer parámetros de ruta para enrutamiento dinámico","Simplificar la configuración de ServeMux para aplicaciones web complejas"],"fr":["Enregistrer des gestionnaires pour des méthodes HTTP spécifiques","Extraire des paramètres de chemin pour un routage dynamique","Simplifier la configuration de ServeMux pour des applications web complexes"],"de":["Registrieren von Handlern für spezifische HTTP-Methoden","Extrahieren von Pfadparametern für dynamisches Routing","Vereinfachen der ServeMux-Konfiguration für komplexe Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Registrar tratadores para métodos HTTP específicos","Extrair parâmetros de caminho para roteamento dinâmico","Simplificar a configuração do ServeMux para aplicações web complexas"],"ru":["Регистрация обработчиков для конкретных методов HTTP","Извлечение параметров пути для динамического маршрутизации","Упрощение конфигурации ServeMux для сложных веб-приложений"],"ar":["تسجيل معالجات لمETHODات HTTP محددة","استخراج معاملات المسار للتعريف الديناميكي","تبسيط إعدادات ServeMux لتطبيقات الويب المعقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Go 1.22 or later","Specific to HTTP handlers and ServeMux"],"zh":["需要Go 1.22或更高版本","仅限HTTP处理程序和ServeMux"],"ja":["Go 1.22またはそれ以降のバージョンが必要","HTTPハンドラとServeMuxにのみ特定"],"ko":["Go 1.22 또는 이후 버전이 필요","HTTP 핸들러 및 ServeMux에만 특정"],"es":["Requiere Go 1.22 o posterior","Específico para controladores HTTP y ServeMux"],"fr":["Nécessite Go 1.22 ou ultérieur","Spécifique aux gestionnaires HTTP et ServeMux"],"de":["Benötigt Go 1.22 oder höher","Spezifisch für HTTP-Handler und ServeMux"],"pt":["Exige Go 1.22 ou posterior","Específico para tratadores de HTTP e ServeMux"],"ru":["Требует Go 1.22 или позже","Относится конкретно к обработчикам HTTP и ServeMux"],"ar":["يتطلب Go 1.22 أو أحدث","محدد لمعالجات HTTP و ServeMux"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
