d del código","fr":"L''application des normes de codage Drupal est essentielle pour assurer la qualité et la maintenabilité du code","de":"Die Anwendung der Drupal-Codierungsstandards ist entscheidend für die Qualität und Wartbarkeit des Codes","pt":"O desenvolvimento Drupal requer a aplicação de padrões de código para garantir a qualidade e manutenção do projeto","ru":"Разработка на Drupal требует соблюдения стандартов кода для обеспечения качества и поддержки проекта","ar":"يتطلب تطوير دروبال تطبيق معايير الترميز لضمان جودة و صيانة المشروع","en":"SKILL Claude for Drupal development"},"definition":{"en":"SKILL Claude for Drupal development"},"features":{"zh":["遵循 Drupal 编码标准","使用 US 英文拼写","遵循 Boy Scout Rule","支持 PHP 开发","提供 Context Detection 和 Standard Loading"],"ja":["Drupal コーディングスタンダードに従う","US 英語のスペルを使用","Boy Scout Rule に従う","PHP 開発をサポート","コンテキスト検出とスタンダードロードを提供"],"ko":["드루팔 코딩 표준을 따름","US 영어拼写 사용","Boy Scout Rule을 따름","PHP 개발 지원","컨텍스트 감지 및 표준 로딩 제공"],"es":["Aplicación de estándares de codificación version-independientes","Uso de la ortografía en inglés estadounidense en comentarios y nombres","Seguimiento de la regla del boy scout para mejorar el código","Detección de contexto y carga de estándares para PHP","Desarrollo de módulos, servicios y plugins con estándares de codificación"],"fr":["Application des normes de codage version-indépendantes","Utilisation de l''orthographe en anglais américain dans les commentaires et les noms","Suivi de la règle du boy scout pour améliorer le code","Détection de contexte et chargement des normes pour PHP","Développement de modules, de services et de plugins avec des normes de codage"],"de":["Anwendung von version-unabhängigen Codierungsstandards","Verwendung der amerikanischen Englisch-Schreibweise in Kommentaren und Namen","Befolgen der Boy-Scout-Regel zur Verbesserung des Codes","Kontext-Erkennung und Ladevorgang für PHP-Entwicklung","Entwicklung von Modulen, Diensten und Plugins mit Codierungsstandards"],"pt":["Aplicação de padrões de código do Drupal","Uso de inglês americano em comentários e nomes","Seguimento do princípio do Boy Scout","Detecção de contexto e carregamento de padrões","Desenvolvimento PHP com padrões do Drupal"],"ru":["Применение стандартов кода Drupal","Использование американского английского в комментариях и именах","Соблюдение принципа скаута","Обнаружение контекста и загрузка стандартов","Разработка на PHP с стандартами Drupal"],"ar":["تطبيق معايير الترميز دروبال","استخدام اللغة الإنجليزية الأمريكية في التعليقات و الأسماء","التزم بمبدأ كشاف","اكتشاف السياق و تحميل المعايير","التطوير بلغة PHP مع معايير دروبال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Drupal 编码标准","Drupal 开发","PHP 开发","编码规范","Boy Scout Rule","US 英文拼写"],"ja":["Drupal コーディングスタンダード","Drupal 開発","PHP 開発","コードの書き方の規則","Boy Scout Rule","US 英語のスペル"],"ko":["드루팔 코딩 표준","드루팔 개발","PHP 개발","코드 작성 규칙","Boy Scout Rule","US 영어拼写"],"es":["estándares de codificación Drupal","desarrollo de Drupal","calidad del código","mantenibilidad del código","reglas de codificación","directrices de codificación"],"fr":["normes de codage Drupal","développement de Drupal","qualité du code","maintenabilité du code","règles de codage","directives de codage"],"de":["Drupal-Codierungsstandards","Drupal-Entwicklung","Code-Qualität","Code-Wartbarkeit","Codierungsregeln","Codierungsrichtlinien"],"pt":["desenvolvimento drupal","padrões de código","qualidade de código","manutenção de projeto","drupal coding standards","desenvolvimento php"],"ru":["разработка на drupal","стандарты кода","качество кода","поддержка проекта","drupal кодирование стандарты","разработка на php"],"ar":["تطوير دروبال","معايير الترميز","جودة الرمز","صيانة المشروع","معايير ترميز دروبال","تطوير بلغة php"]}},"owner":"nonzod","repo":"drupaldev-claude-skill","repoPath":"nonzod/drupaldev-claude-skill","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"drupal-standards","description":"Automatically applies Drupal coding standards when developing PHP modules, JavaScript, CSS, SQL queries, Twig templates, or YAML configs. Activates when creating/editing .php, .js, .css, .sql, .twig, .yml files or when user mentions module, query, template, form, or custom code.","bodyPreview":"# Drupal Coding Standards\n\nApply Drupal coding standards based on the development context.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nFrom `coding_standards/index.md`:\n- All code must follow Drupal coding standards (version-independent)\n- Use US English spelling in all comments and names\n- Standards are \"always-current\" and apply to all new code\n- Follow Boy Scout Rule: leave code better than you found it\n\n## Context Detection & Standard Loading\n\n### PHP Development (.php files, modules, services, plugins)\n\nWhen work","body":"# Drupal Coding Standards\n\nApply Drupal coding standards based on the development context.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nFrom `coding_standards/index.md`:\n- All code must follow Drupal coding standards (version-independent)\n- Use US English spelling in all comments and names\n- Standards are \"always-current\" and apply to all new code\n- Follow Boy Scout Rule: leave code better than you found it\n\n## Context Detection & Standard Loading\n\n### PHP Development (.php files, modules, services, plugins)\n\nWhen working with PHP code, **ALWAYS read these standards FIRST**:\n\n1. **Core Standards**: Read `coding_standards/php/coding.md`\n2. **Documentation**: Read `coding_standards/php/documentation.md`\n3. **Namespaces**: Read `coding_standards/php/namespaces.md`\n4. **PSR-4**: Read `coding_standards/php/psr4.md`\n\nAdditionally, based on specific needs:\n- Creating services → Read `coding_standards/php/naming-services.md`\n- Exception handling → Read `coding_standards/php/exceptions.md`\n- Using placeholders → Read `coding_standards/php/placeholders-delimiters.md`\n- Error handling → Read `coding_standards/php/e_all.md`\n- Documentation examples → Read `coding_standards/php/documentation-examples.md`\n\n### JavaScript Development (.js files)\n\n**ALWAYS read these standards FIRST**:\n\n1. **Core Standards**: Read `coding_standards/javascript/coding.md`\n2. **Documentation**: Read `coding_standards/javascript/documentation.md`\n3. **Best Practices**: Read `coding_standards/javascript/best-practice.md`\n4. **ESLint Config**: Read `coding_standards/javascript/eslint.md`\n\nIf using jQuery:\n- Read `coding_standards/javascript/jquery.md`\n\n### CSS Development (.css, .scss files, styling)\n\n**ALWAYS read these standards FIRST**:\n\n1. **Core Standards**: Read `coding_standards/css/coding.md`\n2. **Formatting**: Read `coding_standards/css/format.md`\n3. **File Organization**: Read `coding_standards/css/file-organization.md`\n4. **Architecture**: Read `coding_standards/css/architecture.md`\n\nFor tool configuration:\n- Read `coding_standards/css/csscomb.md`\n- Read `coding_standards/css/review.md`\n\n### SQL Queries (database operations)\n\n**ALWAYS read these standards FIRST**:\n\n1. **Conventions**: Read `coding_standards/sql/conventions.md`\n2. **Keywords**: Read `coding_standards/sql/keywords.md`\n3. **SELECT Queries**: Read `coding_standards/sql/select-from.md`\n\n### Twig Templates (.twig files)\n\n**ALWAYS read these standards**:\n\n1. **Twig Standards**: Read `coding_standards/twig/coding.md`\n2. **Markup Standards**: Read `coding_standards/markup/style.md`\n\n### YAML Configuration (.yml, .yaml files)\n\n**ALWAYS read**:\n- Read `coding_standards/yaml/configuration-files.md`\n\n### Composer Packages (composer.json)\n\n**ALWAYS read**:\n- Read `coding_standards/composer/package-name.md`\n\n### Accessibility (forms, UI components, interactive elements)\n\n**ALWAYS read**:\n- Read `coding_standards/accessibility/accessibility.md`\n\n### Spelling & General\n\n**ALWAYS apply**:\n- Read `coding_standards/spelling/spelling.md` (US English required)\n\n## Workflow\n\n```\n1. User requests development task\n   ↓\n2. Identify file types/context (PHP, JS, CSS, SQL, etc.)\n   ↓\n3. Read ALL relevant standard files from coding_standards/\n   ↓\n4. Apply standards while writing code\n   ↓\n5. Validate code against standards\n   ↓\n6. Complete task with compliant code\n```\n\n## Multi-Context Tasks\n\nFor tasks involving multiple file types, load **ALL** relevant standards:\n\n**Example: Creating a custom module**\n- PHP standards (module code)\n- JavaScript standards (if includes JS)\n- CSS standards (if includes styling)\n- Twig standards (if includes templates)\n- YAML standards (for .info.yml and config files)\n- Accessibility standards (if includes UI)\n\n## Application Rules\n\n1. **Read First, Write Second**: Always read relevant standards before generating code\n2. **No Assumptions**: Never assume standards—always verify from files\n3. **Exact Compliance**: Follow standards exactly as written\n4. **US English Only**: All comments, variable names, and documentation\n5. **Complete Coverage**: If working with multiple file types, apply all relevant standards\n6. **Validation**: Before completing, verify code against loaded standards\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Creating a PHP Service\n\n```\nUser: \"Create a service to handle user notifications\"\n\nActions:\n1. Identify: PHP service development\n2. Read standards:\n   - coding_standards/php/coding.md\n   - coding_standards/php/documentation.md\n   - coding_standards/php/namespaces.md\n   - coding_standards/php/naming-services.md\n3. Generate code following all standards\n4. Include proper docblocks, namespaces, service naming\n```\n\n### Example 2: Writing Database Query\n\n```\nUser: \"Write a query to get active users with roles\"\n\nActions:\n1. Identify: SQL query\n2. Read standards:\n   - coding_standards/sql/conventions.md\n   - coding_standards/sql/keywords.md\n   - coding_standards/sql/select-from.md\n3. Write query with proper keyword capitalization and formatting\n```\n\n### Example 3: Building an Accessible Form\n\n```\nUser: \"Create a contact form with validation\"\n\nActions:\n1. Identify: Multi-context (PHP form API, JavaScript validation, accessibility)\n2. Read standards:\n   - coding_standards/php/coding.md\n   - coding_standards/php/documentation.md\n   - coding_standards/javascript/coding.md\n   - coding_standards/markup/style.md\n   - coding_standards/accessibility/accessibility.md\n3. Build form with all standards applied\n4. Ensure full accessibility compliance\n```\n\n## Critical Reminders\n\n- **Never skip reading standards** - always load them before coding\n- **Standards override preferences** - follow Drupal standards exactly\n- **When uncertain** - read additional related standard files\n- **Multi-file tasks** - load standards for ALL file types involved\n- **US English spelling** - non-negotiable requirement\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:44:28.675Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Web Development Agents needing adherence to Drupal coding standards and best practices.","zh":"适用于需要遵循Drupal编码标准和最佳实践的Web开发代理。","ja":"Drupalのコーディング規約とベストプラクティスに従う必要があるWeb開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"드루팔 코딩 표준 및 모범 사례를 준수해야 하는 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web que necesitan adherirse a los estándares y mejores prácticas de codificación de Drupal.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Web nécessitant l''adhésion aux normes et aux meilleures pratiques de codage de Drupal.","de":"Perfekt für Webentwicklungsagenten, die die Einhaltung der Drupal-Codierungsstandards und -best Practices benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que necessitam aderir aos padrões e às melhores práticas de codificação do Drupal.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, требующих соблюдения стандартов кодирования Drupal и лучших практик.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى الامتثال لمعايير الترميز دروبال وأفضل الممارسات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce version-independent Drupal coding standards, utilizing US English spelling and context detection for PHP development, ensuring code quality and maintainability through the Boy Scout Rule.","zh":"赋予代理人执行版本无关的Drupal编码标准的能力，利用美式英语拼写和上下文检测用于PHP开发，通过男孩侦探规则确保代码质量和可维护性。","ja":"エージェントに、バージョンに依存しないDrupalのコーディング規約を適用する能力を与え、US英語のスペリングとコンテキスト検出を使用してPHP開発を行い、ボーイスカウト規則を通じてコード品質とメンテナンス性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 버전에 종속되지 않는 드루팔 코딩 표준을 강제할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 미국 영어拼写 및 컨텍스트 감지를 사용하여 PHP 개발을 수행하며, 소년 스카우트 규칙을 통해 코드 품질 및 유지 보수성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar estándares de codificación de Drupal independientes de la versión, utilizando la detección de ortografía en inglés estadounidense y de contexto para el desarrollo de PHP, garantizando la calidad y mantenibilidad del código a través de la regla del scout.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des normes de codage de Drupal indépendantes de la version, en utilisant la détection de l''orthographe en anglais américain et du contexte pour le développement PHP, garantissant la qualité et la maintenabilité du code via la règle du scout.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, versionenunabhängige Drupal-Codierungsstandards durchzusetzen, unter Verwendung der US-amerikanischen Rechtschreib- und Kontexterkennung für die PHP-Entwicklung, um die Codequalität und Wartbarkeit durch die Boy Scout-Regel zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor padrões de codificação do Drupal independentes de versão, utilizando o inglês americano e detecção de contexto para o desenvolvimento PHP, garantindo a qualidade e a manutenibilidade do código por meio da Regra do Escoteiro.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить соблюдение стандартов кодирования Drupal, независимых от версии, с использованием американского английского языка и обнаружения контекста для разработки на PHP, гарантируя качество и поддерживаемость кода посредством Правила скаута.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فرض معايير الترميز دروبال المستقلة عن الإصدار، باستخدام الإنجليزية الأمريكية واكتشاف السياق لتطوير PHP، مما يضمن جودة وصيانة الشفرة من خلال قاعدة الكشاف"},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing Drupal coding standards for PHP files and modules","Automating code reviews for Drupal services and plugins","Generating compliant code snippets for new Drupal projects"],"zh":["执行Drupal编码标准用于PHP文件和模块","自动化代码审查用于Drupal服务和插件","为新Drupal项目生成兼容代码片段"],"ja":["PHPファイルとモジュールのDrupalコーディング規約の適用","Drupalサービスとプラグインのコードレビューの自動化","新しいDrupalプロジェクトのための準拠コードスニペットの生成"],"ko":["PHP 파일 및 모듈을 위한 드루팔 코딩 표준 강제","드루팔 서비스 및 플러그인의 코드 리뷰 자동화","새로운 드루팔 프로젝트를 위한 호환 코드 스니펫 생성"],"es":["Aplicar los estándares de codificación de Drupal para archivos y módulos PHP","Automatizar las revisiones de código para servicios y complementos de Drupal","Generar fragmentos de código compatibles para nuevos proyectos de Drupal"],"fr":["Appliquer les normes de codage de Drupal pour les fichiers et les modules PHP","Automatiser les examens de code pour les services et les plugins de Drupal","Générer des extraits de code compatibles pour les nouveaux projets de Drupal"],"de":["Durchsetzen der Drupal-Codierungsstandards für PHP-Dateien und -Module","Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für Drupal-Dienste und -Plugins","Generieren von kompatiblen Code-Snippets für neue Drupal-Projekte"],"pt":["Impor padrões de codificação do Drupal para arquivos e módulos PHP","Automatizar revisões de código para serviços e plug-ins do Drupal","Gerar trechos de código compatíveis para novos projetos do Drupal"],"ru":["Обеспечить соблюдение стандартов кодирования Drupal для файлов и модулей PHP","Автоматизировать проверку кода для сервисов и плагинов Drupal","Генерировать фрагменты кода, соответствующие новым проектам Drupal"],"ar":["فرض معايير الترميز دروبال على الملفات والوحدات النمطية PHP","تأتمتيز مراجعة الشفرة لخدمات وأدوات الإضافة دروبال","توليد شفرة متوافقة لمشاريع دروبال جديدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Drupal development context","Applies to new code only","Version-independent standards may require updates for specific Drupal versions"],"zh":["需要了解Drupal开发上下文","仅适用于新代码","版本无关的标准可能需要针对特定Drupal版本进行更新"],"ja":["Drupal開発のコンテキストを理解する必要がある","新規コードのみに適用可能","バージョンに依存しない規約は、特定のDrupalバージョンに対して更新する必要がある"],"ko":["드루팔 개발 컨텍스트를 이해해야 함","새 코드에만 적용 가능","버전에 종속되지 않는 표준은 특정 드루팔 버전에 대해 업데이트가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del contexto de desarrollo de Drupal","Se aplica solo a nuevo código","Los estándares independientes de la versión pueden requerir actualizaciones para versiones específicas de Drupal"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances du contexte de développement de Drupal","S''applique uniquement au nouveau code","Les normes indépendantes de la version peuvent nécessiter des mises à jour pour des versions spécifiques de Drupal"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des Drupal-Entwicklungskontexts","Wird nur auf neuen Code angewendet","Versionenunabhängige Standards können für spezifische Drupal-Versionen aktualisiert werden müssen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento do contexto de desenvolvimento do Drupal","Aplica-se apenas a novo código","Padrões independentes de versão podem exigir atualizações para versões específicas do Drupal"],"ru":["Требует знания контекста разработки Drupal","Применяется только к новому коду","Стандарты, независимые от версии, могут требовать обновлений для конкретных версий Drupal"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة سياق تطوير دروبال","يتعلق بالشفرة الجديدة فقط","المعايير المستقلة عن الإصدار قد تتطلب تحديثات للإصدارات المحددة من دروبال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
