너"],"es":["Gestión de estado reactivo","Integración con React","Creación de contenedores estables para estado","Actualizaciones en tiempo real","Escalabilidad en aplicaciones"],"fr":["Gestion d''état réactive","Intégration avec React","Création de conteneurs stables pour l''état","Mises à jour en temps réel","Évolutivité des applications"],"de":["Reaktive Zustandsverwaltung","Integration mit React","Erstellung von stabilen Containern für Zustand","Echtzeit-Aktualisierungen","Skalierbarkeit von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de estado reativo","Integração com React","Atoms trabalham por referência","Suporte a múltiplos componentes","Atualizações em tempo real"],"ru":["Реактивное управление состоянием","Интеграция с React","Атомы работают по ссылке","Поддержка нескольких компонентов","Обновления в реальном времени"],"ar":["إدارة الحالة التفاعلية","التكامل مع React","العمل بالمرجع","دعم المكونات المتعددة","التحديثات في الوقت الفعلي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Atom-State","Effect-TS","实时股票交易","反应性状态管理","状态容器","多组件引用"],"ja":["Atom-State","Effect-TS","リアルタイム株取引","反応性状態管理","状態コンテナ","複数コンポーネント参照"],"ko":["Atom-State","Effect-TS","실시간 주식 거래","반응형 상태 관리","상태 컨테이너","다중 컴포넌트 참조"],"es":["Effect-TS","Gestión de estado","React","Estado reactivo","Bibliotecas de gestión de estado","Desarrollo de aplicaciones","Escalabilidad"],"fr":["Effect-TS","Gestion d''état","React","État réactif","Bibliothèques de gestion d''état","Développement d''applications","Évolutivité"],"de":["Effect-TS","Zustandsverwaltung","React","Reaktiver Zustand","Bibliotheken für Zustandsverwaltung","Anwendungsentwicklung","Skalierbarkeit"],"pt":["Atom State","Gerenciamento de estado","Effect","React","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Bibliotecas de gerenciamento de estado","Programação reativa"],"ru":["Atom State","Управление состоянием","Effect","React","Разработка приложений","Библиотеки управления состоянием","Реактивное программирование"],"ar":["Atom State","إدارة الحالة","Effect","React","تطوير التطبيقات","مكتبات إدارة الحالة","برمجة تفاعلية"]}},"owner":"front-depiction","repo":"cli-stock","repoPath":"front-depiction/cli-stock","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"atom-state","description":"Implement reactive state management with Effect Atom for React applications","bodyPreview":"# Effect Atom State Management\n\nEffect Atom is a reactive state management library for Effect that seamlessly integrates with React.\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### Atoms as References\n\nAtoms work **by reference** - they are stable containers for reactive state:\n\n```typescript\nimport * as Atom from \"@effect-atom/atom-react\"\n\n// Atoms are created once and referenced throughout the app\nexport const counterAtom = Atom.make(0)\n\n// Multiple components can reference the same atom\n// All update when the atom va","body":"# Effect Atom State Management\n\nEffect Atom is a reactive state management library for Effect that seamlessly integrates with React.\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### Atoms as References\n\nAtoms work **by reference** - they are stable containers for reactive state:\n\n```typescript\nimport * as Atom from \"@effect-atom/atom-react\"\n\n// Atoms are created once and referenced throughout the app\nexport const counterAtom = Atom.make(0)\n\n// Multiple components can reference the same atom\n// All update when the atom value changes\n```\n\n### Automatic Cleanup\n\nAtoms automatically reset when no subscribers remain (unless marked with `keepAlive`):\n\n```typescript\n// Resets when last subscriber unmounts\nexport const temporaryState = Atom.make(initialValue)\n\n// Persists across component lifecycles\nexport const persistentState = Atom.make(initialValue).pipe(Atom.keepAlive)\n```\n\n### Lazy Evaluation\n\nAtom values are computed on-demand when subscribers access them.\n\n## Pattern: Basic Atoms\n\n```typescript\nimport * as Atom from \"@effect-atom/atom-react\"\n\n// Simple atom\nexport const count = Atom.make(0)\n\n// Atom with object state\nexport interface CartState {\n  readonly items: ReadonlyArray<Item>\n  readonly total: number\n}\n\nexport const cart = Atom.make<CartState>({\n  items: [],\n  total: 0\n})\n```\n\n## Pattern: Derived Atoms\n\nUse `Atom.map` or computed atoms with the `get` parameter:\n\n```typescript\n// Derived via map\nexport const itemCount = Atom.map(cart, (c) => c.items.length)\nexport const isEmpty = Atom.map(cart, (c) => c.items.length === 0)\n\n// Computed atom accessing other atoms\nexport const cartSummary = Atom.make((get) => {\n  const cartData = get(cart)\n  const count = get(itemCount)\n\n  return {\n    itemCount: count,\n    total: cartData.total,\n    isEmpty: count === 0\n  }\n})\n```\n\n## Pattern: Atom Family (Dynamic Atoms)\n\nUse `Atom.family` for stable references to dynamically created atoms:\n\n```typescript\n// Create atoms per entity ID\nexport const userAtoms = Atom.family((userId: string) =>\n  Atom.make<User | null>(null).pipe(Atom.keepAlive)\n)\n\n// Usage - always returns the same atom for a given ID\nconst userAtom = userAtoms(userId)\n```\n\n## Pattern: Function Atoms (Side Effects)\n\nUse `Atom.fn` for operations with side effects:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Effect } from \"effect\"\n\n// Function atom for side effects\nexport const addItem = Atom.fn(\n  Effect.fnUntraced(function* (item: Item) {\n    const current = yield* Atom.get(cart)\n\n    yield* Atom.set(cart, {\n      items: [...current.items, item],\n      total: current.total + item.price\n    })\n  })\n)\n\n// Clear cart operation\nexport const clearCart = Atom.fn(\n  Effect.fnUntraced(function* () {\n    yield* Atom.set(cart, { items: [], total: 0 })\n  })\n)\n```\n\n## Pattern: Runtime with Services\n\nWrap Effect layers/services for use in atoms:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Layer } from \"effect\"\n\n// Create runtime with services\nexport const runtime = Atom.runtime(\n  Layer.mergeAll(\n    DatabaseService.Live,\n    LoggerService.Live,\n    ApiClient.Live\n  )\n)\n\n// Use services in function atoms\nexport const fetchUserData = runtime.fn(\n  Effect.fnUntraced(function* (userId: string) {\n    const db = yield* DatabaseService\n    const user = yield* db.getUser(userId)\n\n    yield* Atom.set(userAtoms(userId), user)\n    return user\n  })\n)\n```\n\n### Global Layers\n\nConfigure global layers once at app initialization:\n\n```typescript\n// App setup\nAtom.runtime.addGlobalLayer(\n  Layer.mergeAll(\n    Logger.Live,\n    Tracer.Live,\n    Config.Live\n  )\n)\n```\n\n## Pattern: Result Types (Error Handling)\n\nAtoms can return `Result` types for explicit error handling:\n\n```typescript\nimport * as Result from \"@effect-atom/atom/Result\"\n\nexport const userData = Atom.make<Result.Result<User, Error>>(\n  Result.initial\n)\n\n// In component\nconst result = useAtomValue(userData)\n\nResult.match(result, {\n  Initial: () => <Loading />,\n  Failure: (error) => <Error message={error.message} />,\n  Success: (user) => <UserProfile user={user} />\n})\n```\n\n## Pattern: Stream Integration\n\nConvert streams into atoms that capture the latest value:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Stream } from \"effect\"\n\n// Infinite stream becomes reactive atom\nexport const notifications = Atom.make(\n  Stream.fromEventListener(window, \"notification\").pipe(\n    Stream.map(parseNotification),\n    Stream.filter(isValid),\n    Stream.scan([], (acc, n) => [...acc, n].slice(-10))\n  )\n)\n```\n\n## Pattern: Pull Atoms (Pagination)\n\nUse `Atom.pull` for stream-based pagination:\n\n```typescript\nexport const pagedItems = Atom.pull(\n  Stream.fromIterable(itemsSource).pipe(\n    Stream.grouped(10) // Pages of 10 items\n  )\n)\n\n// In component - automatically fetches next page when called\nconst loadMore = useAtomSet(pagedItems)\n```\n\n## Pattern: Persistence\n\nUse `Atom.kvs` for persisted state:\n\n```typescript\nimport { BrowserKeyValueStore } from \"@effect/platform-browser\"\nimport * as Schema from \"effect/Schema\"\n\nexport const userSettings = Atom.kvs({\n  runtime: Atom.runtime(BrowserKeyValueStore.layerLocalStorage),\n  key: \"user-settings\",\n  schema: Schema.Struct({\n    theme: Schema.Literal(\"light\", \"dark\"),\n    notifications: Schema.Boolean,\n    language: Schema.String\n  }),\n  defaultValue: () => ({\n    theme: \"light\",\n    notifications: true,\n    language: \"en\"\n  })\n})\n```\n\n## React Integration\n\n### Hooks\n\n```typescript\nimport { useAtomValue, useAtomSet, useAtom, useAtomSetPromise } from \"@effect-atom/atom-react\"\n\nexport function CartView() {\n  // Read only\n  const cartData = useAtomValue(cart)\n  const isEmpty = useAtomValue(isEmpty)\n\n  // Write only\n  const addItem = useAtomSet(addItem)\n  const clearCart = useAtomSet(clearCart)\n\n  // Both read and write\n  const [count, setCount] = useAtom(counterAtom)\n\n  // For async function atoms\n  const fetchData = useAtomSetPromise(fetchUserData)\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      <div>Items: {cartData.items.length}</div>\n      <button onClick={() => addItem(newItem)}>Add</button>\n      <button onClick={() => clearCart()}>Clear</button>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Separation of Concerns\n\nDifferent components can read/write the same atom reactively:\n\n```typescript\n// Component A - reads state\nfunction CartDisplay() {\n  const cart = useAtomValue(cart)\n  return <div>Items: {cart.items.length}</div>\n}\n\n// Component B - modifies state\nfunction CartActions() {\n  const addItem = useAtomSet(addItem)\n  return <button onClick={() => addItem(item)}>Add</button>\n}\n\n// Both update reactively when atom changes\n```\n\n## Scoped Resources & Finalizers\n\nAtoms support scoped effects with automatic cleanup:\n\n```typescript\nexport const wsConnection = Atom.make(\n  Effect.gen(function* () {\n    // Acquire resource\n    const ws = yield* Effect.acquireRelease(\n      connectWebSocket(),\n      (ws) => Effect.sync(() => ws.close())\n    )\n\n    return ws\n  })\n)\n\n// Finalizer runs when atom rebuilds or becomes unused\n```\n\n## Key Principles\n\n1. **Reference Stability**: Use `Atom.family` for dynamically generated atom sets\n2. **Lazy Evaluation**: Values computed on-demand when accessed\n3. **Automatic Cleanup**: Atoms reset when unused (unless `keepAlive`)\n4. **Derive, Don''t Coordinate**: Use computed atoms to derive state\n5. **Result Types**: Handle errors explicitly with Result.match\n6. **Services in Runtime**: Wrap layers once, use in multiple atoms\n7. **Immutable Updates**: Always create new values, never mutate\n8. **Scoped Effects**: Leverage finalizers for resource cleanup\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Loading States\n\n```typescript\nexport const userDataAtom = Atom.make<Result.Result<User, Error>>(\n  Result.initial\n)\n\nexport const loadUser = runtime.fn(\n  Effect.fnUntraced(function* (id: string) {\n    yield* Atom.set(userDataAtom, Result.initial)\n\n    const result = yield* Effect.either(\n      userService.fetchUser(id)\n    )\n\n    yield* Atom.set(\n      userDataAtom,\n      result._tag === \"Right\"\n        ? Result.success(result.right)\n        : Result.failure(result.left)\n    )\n  })\n)\n```\n\n### Optimistic Updates\n\n```typescript\nexport const updateItem = runtime.fn(\n  Effect.fnUntraced(function* (id: string, updates: Partial<Item>) {\n    const current = yield* Atom.get(itemsAtom)\n\n    // Optimistic update\n    yield* Atom.set(\n      itemsAtom,\n      current.map(item => item.id === id ? { ...item, ...updates } : item)\n    )\n\n    // Persist to server\n    const result = yield* Effect.either(api.updateItem(id, updates))\n\n    // Revert on failure\n    if (result._tag === \"Left\") {\n      yield* Atom.set(itemsAtom, current)\n    }\n  })\n)\n```\n\n### Computed Queries\n\n```typescript\n// Filter atom accessing other atoms\nexport const filteredItems = Atom.make((get) => {\n  const items = get(itemsAtom)\n  const searchTerm = get(searchAtom)\n  const activeFilters = get(filtersAtom)\n\n  return items.filter(item =>\n    item.name.includes(searchTerm) &&\n    activeFilters.every(f => f.predicate(item))\n  )\n})\n```\n\nEffect Atom bridges Effect''s powerful type system with React''s rendering model, providing type-safe reactive state management with automatic cleanup and seamless Effect integration.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:44:20.738Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for TypeScript-based AI Agents requiring reactive state management and seamless integration with React, such as those built with Effect-TS and Claude Code.","zh":"适用于基于TypeScript的AI代理，需要反应性状态管理和与React的无缝集成，例如使用Effect-TS和Claude Code构建的代理。","ja":"TypeScriptベースのAIエージェントに適しており、反応性状態管理とReactとのシームレスな統合が必要です。たとえば、Effect-TSとClaude Codeで構築されたエージェントが該当します。","ko":"TypeScript 기반의 AI 에이전트에 적합하며 반응형 상태 관리 및 React와의 무결점 통합이 필요한 경우에 사용됩니다. 예를 들어, Effect-TS와 Claude Code로 구축된 에이전트가 해당됩니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA basados en TypeScript que requieren gestión de estado reactivo y una integración fluida con React, como aquellos construidos con Effect-TS y Claude Code.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''IA basés sur TypeScript nécessitant une gestion d''état réactive et une intégration fluide avec React, tels que ceux construits avec Effect-TS et Claude Code.","de":"Ideal für TypeScript-basierte KI-Agents, die eine reaktive Zustandsverwaltung und eine nahtlose Integration mit React erfordern, wie z.B. solche, die mit Effect-TS und Claude Code erstellt werden.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em TypeScript que exigem gerenciamento de estado reativo e integração perfeita com o React, como aqueles construídos com Effect-TS e Claude Code.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе TypeScript, требующих реактивного управления состоянием и бесшовной интеграции с React, таких как те, которые построены с использованием Effect-TS и Claude Code.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المستند إلى TypeScript الذي يتطلب إدارة الحالة التفاعلية والدمج السلس مع React، مثل تلك التي تم بناؤها باستخدام Effect-TS و Claude Code."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage reactive state by reference using Atoms, facilitating real-time updates across multiple components with libraries like @effect-atom/atom-react, and integrating with Effect for robust state handling.","zh":"赋予代理通过引用使用Atoms管理反应性状态的能力，实现使用@effect-atom/atom-react等库的多个组件之间的实时更新，并与Effect集成以实现强大的状态处理。","ja":"エージェントがAtomsを参照して反応性状態を管理する機能を提供し、@effect-atom/atom-reactなどのライブラリを使用して複数のコンポーネント間のリアルタイム更新を実現し、Effectと統合して堅牢な状態処理を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Atoms를 참조하여 반응형 상태를 관리할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, @effect-atom/atom-react와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 여러 구성 요소 간의 실시간 업데이트를 구현하며, Effect와 통합하여 강력한 상태 처리를 구현합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar el estado reactivo por referencia utilizando Átomos, facilitando actualizaciones en tiempo real en varios componentes con bibliotecas como @effect-atom/atom-react, e integrándose con Effect para un control de estado robusto.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''état réactif par référence en utilisant des Atomes, facilitant les mises à jour en temps réel à travers plusieurs composants avec des bibliothèques comme @effect-atom/atom-react, et s''intégrant avec Effect pour une gestion d''état robuste.","de":"Ermöglicht Agenten, den reaktiven Zustand durch Referenzierung mithilfe von Atomen zu verwalten, wodurch Echtzeit-Aktualisierungen über mehrere Komponenten hinweg mit Bibliotheken wie @effect-atom/atom-react erleichtert werden und eine nahtlose Integration mit Effect für eine robuste Zustandsverwaltung ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar o estado reativo por referência usando Átomos, facilitando atualizações em tempo real em vários componentes com bibliotecas como @effect-atom/atom-react e integrando com Effect para tratamento de estado robusto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять реактивным состоянием по ссылке с помощью Атомов, что облегчает обновления в реальном времени в нескольких компонентах с помощью библиотек như @effect-atom/atom-react и интегрирует с Effect для надежного обработки состояния.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إدارة الحالة التفاعلية عن طريق المرجع باستخدام الذرات، مما يسهل التحديثات في الوقت الفعلي عبر مكونات متعددة باستخدام مكتبات مثل @effect-atom/atom-react ويتكامل مع Effect للتعامل مع الحالة بشكل قوي."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing real-time stock trading apps","Managing reactive state across multiple React components","Creating scalable and performant state management systems with Effect-TS"],"zh":["实现实时股票交易应用","跨多个React组件管理反应性状态","使用Effect-TS创建可扩展且高性能的状态管理系统"],"ja":["リアルタイムの株式取引アプリの実装","複数のReactコンポーネント間の反応性状態の管理","Effect-TSを使用したスケーラブルで高性能な状態管理システムの作成"],"ko":["실시간 주식 거래 애플리케이션 구현","여러 React 구성 요소 간의 반응형 상태 관리","Effect-TS를 사용하여 확장 가능하고 고성능의 상태 관리 시스템 생성"],"es":["Implementación de aplicaciones de trading de acciones en tiempo real","Gestión de estado reactivo en varios componentes de React","Creación de sistemas de gestión de estado escalables y de alto rendimiento con Effect-TS"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre d''applications de trading d''actions en temps réel","Gestion de l''état réactif à travers plusieurs composants React","Création de systèmes de gestion d''état évolutifs et performants avec Effect-TS"],"de":["Implementierung von Echtzeit-Aktienhandels-Apps","Verwaltung des reaktiven Zustands über mehrere React-Komponenten hinweg","Erstellung von skalierbaren und leistungsstarken Zustandsverwaltungssystemen mit Effect-TS"],"pt":["Implementação de aplicativos de negociação de ações em tempo real","Gerenciamento de estado reativo em vários componentes React","Criação de sistemas de gerenciamento de estado escaláveis e de alto desempenho com Effect-TS"],"ru":["Реализация приложений для торговли акциями в реальном времени","Управление реактивным состоянием в нескольких компонентах React","Создание масштабируемых и высокопроизводительных систем управления состоянием с Effect-TS"],"ar":["تنفيذ تطبيقات التداول في الوقت الفعلي للأوراق المالية","إدارة الحالة التفاعلية عبر مكونات متعددة من React","إنشاء أنظمة إدارة الحالة القابلة للتوسيع والأداء العالي مع Effect-TS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Effect and React integration","TypeScript compatibility necessary","Dependent on @effect-atom/atom-react library"],"zh":["需要Effect和React集成","需要TypeScript兼容性","依赖@effect-atom/atom-react库"],"ja":["EffectとReactの統合が必要","TypeScriptの互換性が必要","@effect-atom/atom-reactライブラリに依存"],"ko":["Effect와 React 통합이 필요","TypeScript 호환성이 필요","@effect-atom/atom-react 라이브러리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere integración con Effect y React","Compatibilidad con TypeScript necesaria","Dependiente de la biblioteca @effect-atom/atom-react"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec Effect et React","Compatibilité avec TypeScript nécessaire","Dépend de la bibliothèque @effect-atom/atom-react"],"de":["Benötigt Integration mit Effect und React","TypeScript-Compatibilität erforderlich","Abhängig von der Bibliothek @effect-atom/atom-react"],"pt":["Exige integração com Effect e React","Compatibilidade com TypeScript necessária","Dependente da biblioteca @effect-atom/atom-react"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с Effect и React","Необходима совместимость с TypeScript","Зависит от библиотеки @effect-atom/atom-react"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع Effect و React","التوافق مع TypeScript ضروري","يعتمد على مكتبة @effect-atom/atom-react"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
