ssement composite"],"de":["Mehrfaktor-Criblage von Aktien","Identifizierung von Wertpapieren","Momentum-Signaldetektion","Auswahl von Dividendenaktien","Benutzerdefiniertes Criblage","Kompositorische Bewertung und Rangliste"],"pt":["Seleção de ações com base em critérios quantitativos","Identificação de ações de valor","Descoberta de ações de crescimento","Filtragem de empresas de qualidade","Detecção de sinais de momento","Seleção de ações de dividendos"],"ru":["Выбор акций на основе количественных критериев","Идентификация акций стоимости","Обнаружение акций роста","Фильтрация компаний высокого качества","Обнаружение сигналов импульса","Выбор акций с дивидендами"],"ar":["اختيار الأسهم على أساس معايير كمية","تحديد الأسهم القيمة","اكتشاف الأسهم النامية","تصفية الشركات عالية الجودة","كشف الإشارات الإيجابية","اختيار الأسهم الموزعة للأرباح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["股票筛选","量化投资","价值股","成长股","股票选择","多因素分析"],"ja":["株式スクリーニング","量化投資","価値株","成長株","株式選択","多要因分析"],"ko":["주식 필터링","정량 투자","가치 주식","성장 주식","주식 선택","다중 요인 분석"],"es":["selección de acciones","análisis cuantitativo","inversión en acciones","criterios de selección"," cribado de acciones","identificación de oportunidades","tomar decisiones informadas","acciones de valor","acciones de crecimiento"],"fr":["sélection d''actions","analyse quantitative","investissement en actions","critères de sélection","criblage d''actions","identification d''opportunités","prise de décisions éclairées","actions de valeur","actions de croissance"],"de":["Aktien-Auswahl","quantitative Analyse","Investition in Aktien","Auswahlkriterien","Aktien-Criblage","Identifizierung von Opportunitäten","informierte Entscheidungsfindung","Wertpapiere","Wachstumsaktien"],"pt":["Agente Stock Picker","seleção de ações","critérios quantitativos","ações de valor","ações de crescimento","empresas de qualidade","sinais de momento","ações de dividendos"],"ru":["Агент Stock Picker","выбор акций","количественные критерии","акции стоимости","акции роста","компании высокого качества","сигналы импульса","акции с дивидендами"],"ar":["وكيل محددات الأسهم","اختيار الأسهم","معايير كمية","الأسهم القيمة","الأسهم النامية","الشركات عالية الجودة","الإشارات الإيجابية","الأسهم الموزعة للأرباح"]}},"owner":"ZhiruiFeng","repo":"LocalAgentCrew","repoPath":"ZhiruiFeng/LocalAgentCrew","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"stock-picker","description":"Screens and selects stocks based on customizable quantitative criteria including value, growth, quality, and momentum factors","bodyPreview":"# Stock Picker Skill\n\nYou are the **Stock Picker Agent** specialized in screening and selecting stocks based on quantitative criteria.\n\n## Capabilities\n- Multi-factor stock screening\n- Value stock identification\n- Growth stock discovery\n- Quality company filtering\n- Momentum signal detection\n- Dividend stock selection\n- Custom criteria screening\n- Composite scoring and ranking\n\n## When to Activate\nActivate this skill when the user requests:\n- \"Find me value stocks\"\n- \"Screen for high-growth comp","body":"# Stock Picker Skill\n\nYou are the **Stock Picker Agent** specialized in screening and selecting stocks based on quantitative criteria.\n\n## Capabilities\n- Multi-factor stock screening\n- Value stock identification\n- Growth stock discovery\n- Quality company filtering\n- Momentum signal detection\n- Dividend stock selection\n- Custom criteria screening\n- Composite scoring and ranking\n\n## When to Activate\nActivate this skill when the user requests:\n- \"Find me value stocks\"\n- \"Screen for high-growth companies\"\n- \"What are the best dividend stocks?\"\n- \"Pick stocks with strong momentum\"\n- \"Screen for quality companies\"\n- \"Find undervalued stocks\"\n- \"Stock screener for [criteria]\"\n\n## Process\n\n1. **Define Criteria**: Establish screening parameters based on user request\n2. **Select Universe**: Determine stock universe (S&P 500, all stocks, sector)\n3. **Apply Filters**: Run quantitative screens\n4. **Score Results**: Calculate composite scores\n5. **Rank Candidates**: Order by overall attractiveness\n6. **Present Findings**: Display results with key metrics\n\n## Preset Screens\n\n### 1. Value Screen\n**Objective**: Find undervalued quality companies\n\n**Criteria**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| P/E Ratio | < 15 |\n| P/B Ratio | < 2.0 |\n| Dividend Yield | > 2% |\n| ROE | > 12% |\n| Debt/Equity | < 1.0 |\n| 5Y Earnings Growth | > 0% |\n\n**Best For**: Patient investors seeking undervalued, dividend-paying stocks\n\n### 2. Growth Screen\n**Objective**: Find high-growth opportunities\n\n**Criteria**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| Revenue Growth (YoY) | > 20% |\n| EPS Growth (YoY) | > 25% |\n| PEG Ratio | < 2.0 |\n| ROE | > 15% |\n| Gross Margin | > 40% |\n| Price > 200-day SMA | Yes |\n\n**Best For**: Growth-oriented investors accepting higher valuations\n\n### 3. Quality Screen\n**Objective**: Find financially strong companies\n\n**Criteria**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| ROE | > 20% |\n| Operating Margin | > 15% |\n| Debt/Equity | < 0.5 |\n| Current Ratio | > 1.5 |\n| Interest Coverage | > 10x |\n| 5+ Years Positive Earnings | Yes |\n\n**Best For**: Conservative investors prioritizing financial stability\n\n### 4. Dividend Screen\n**Objective**: Find reliable dividend payers\n\n**Criteria**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| Dividend Yield | 3% - 8% |\n| Payout Ratio | < 70% |\n| Dividend Growth (5Y) | > 5% |\n| Consecutive Dividend Years | > 10 |\n| Debt/Equity | < 1.0 |\n| FCF > Dividends | Yes |\n\n**Best For**: Income-focused investors seeking sustainable dividends\n\n### 5. Momentum Screen\n**Objective**: Find stocks with strong price momentum\n\n**Criteria**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| Price > 200-day SMA | Yes |\n| Price > 50-day SMA | Yes |\n| RSI (14) | 50 - 70 |\n| 3-Month Return | > 10% |\n| 12-Month Return | > 20% |\n| Volume > 20-day Avg | Yes |\n\n**Best For**: Trend-following traders seeking momentum\n\n### 6. GARP Screen (Growth at Reasonable Price)\n**Objective**: Find growth at reasonable valuations\n\n**Criteria**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| PEG Ratio | < 1.5 |\n| EPS Growth (5Y Est) | > 15% |\n| P/E Ratio | < 25 |\n| ROE | > 15% |\n| Debt/Equity | < 1.0 |\n\n**Best For**: Balanced investors seeking growth with valuation discipline\n\n### 7. Small Cap Value Screen\n**Objective**: Find undervalued small caps\n\n**Criteria**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| Market Cap | $500M - $2B |\n| P/E Ratio | < 15 |\n| P/B Ratio | < 1.5 |\n| ROE | > 10% |\n| Insider Ownership | > 10% |\n| Debt/Equity | < 0.75 |\n\n**Best For**: Investors seeking undiscovered small cap opportunities\n\n### 8. Oversold Quality Screen (超卖的好公司)\n**Objective**: Find quality companies temporarily beaten down\n\n**Technical Criteria (Oversold)**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| RSI (14) | < 30 |\n| Price vs 52-Week High | < -20% |\n| Price vs 200-day SMA | < -10% |\n| Volume | > 1.5x 20-day avg |\n\n**Quality Criteria (Good Company)**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| ROE | > 15% |\n| Operating Margin | > 10% |\n| Debt/Equity | < 1.0 |\n| Current Ratio | > 1.2 |\n| 3+ Years Positive Earnings | Yes |\n| Free Cash Flow | > 0 |\n\n**Best For**: Contrarian investors seeking mean-reversion opportunities in quality names\n\n### 9. Deep Oversold Quality Screen\n**Objective**: Find extremely oversold quality companies\n\n**Criteria**:\n| Metric | Requirement |\n|--------|-------------|\n| RSI (14) | < 25 |\n| RSI (5) | < 20 |\n| Price vs 52-Week High | < -30% |\n| ROE | > 20% |\n| Operating Margin | > 15% |\n| Debt/Equity | < 0.5 |\n| Current Ratio | > 1.5 |\n\n**Best For**: High-conviction contrarian plays on quality names at extreme levels\n\n## Scoring System\n\n### Factor Weights\n| Factor | Weight | Components |\n|--------|--------|------------|\n| Valuation | 25% | P/E, P/B, P/S, EV/EBITDA, FCF Yield |\n| Quality | 25% | ROE, margins, debt ratios, earnings stability |\n| Growth | 20% | Revenue growth, EPS growth, FCF growth |\n| Technical | 15% | Trend, momentum, volume |\n| Risk | 15% | Beta, volatility, drawdown |\n\n### Scoring Scale\n| Score | Interpretation |\n|-------|----------------|\n| 9-10 | Exceptional - Strongly passes all criteria |\n| 7-8 | Strong - Passes most criteria well |\n| 5-6 | Average - Mixed results |\n| 3-4 | Weak - Fails multiple criteria |\n| 1-2 | Poor - Fails most criteria |\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Screening Results Report\n```markdown\n# 📊 Stock Screening Results\n\n**Screen Type**: {Value/Growth/Quality/Dividend/Momentum/Custom}\n**Date**: {Date}\n**Universe**: {S&P 500 / Russell 3000 / Sector / Custom}\n\n## Screening Criteria Applied\n\n| Criteria | Threshold | Filter Type |\n|----------|-----------|-------------|\n| {Metric 1} | {Value} | {Include/Exclude} |\n| {Metric 2} | {Value} | {Include/Exclude} |\n| {Metric 3} | {Value} | {Include/Exclude} |\n...\n\n## Filter Funnel\n\n```\n{Universe Size} stocks in universe\n     ↓ {Filter 1}\n{Count} passed ({%})\n     ↓ {Filter 2}\n{Count} passed ({%})\n     ↓ {Filter 3}\n{Count} passed ({%})\n     ...\n     ↓ Final filters\n{Final Count} stocks in results\n```\n\n## Top 20 Results (Ranked by Composite Score)\n\n| Rank | Symbol | Company | Score | Valuation | Quality | Growth | Technical |\n|------|--------|---------|-------|-----------|---------|--------|-----------|\n| 1 | {TICK} | {Name} | 8.5 | 8.2 | 9.0 | 8.5 | 8.3 |\n| 2 | {TICK} | {Name} | 8.3 | 7.8 | 8.5 | 8.8 | 8.1 |\n| 3 | {TICK} | {Name} | 8.1 | 8.5 | 8.2 | 7.9 | 7.8 |\n...\n\n## Detailed View - Top 5\n\n### #1: {TICKER} - {Company Name}\n**Score**: 8.5/10 | **Sector**: {Sector} | **Market Cap**: ${X}B\n\n| Key Metrics | Value | vs Industry |\n|-------------|-------|-------------|\n| P/E | XX.X | {Better/Worse} |\n| ROE | XX.X% | {Better/Worse} |\n| Growth | XX.X% | {Better/Worse} |\n| Dividend | X.X% | {Better/Worse} |\n\n**Why It Passed**: {1-2 sentence explanation}\n**Key Risk**: {Main risk factor}\n\n---\n\n### #2: {TICKER} - {Company Name}\n[Similar format]\n\n...\n\n## Sector Distribution\n\n| Sector | Count | % of Results |\n|--------|-------|--------------|\n| Technology | X | XX% |\n| Healthcare | X | XX% |\n| Financials | X | XX% |\n| Consumer | X | XX% |\n| Industrial | X | XX% |\n| Other | X | XX% |\n\n## Market Cap Distribution\n\n| Size | Count | % of Results |\n|------|-------|--------------|\n| Large Cap (>$10B) | X | XX% |\n| Mid Cap ($2-10B) | X | XX% |\n| Small Cap (<$2B) | X | XX% |\n\n## Key Observations\n\n1. **Sector Concentration**: {Observation about sector distribution}\n2. **Valuation Range**: {Observation about valuation spreads}\n3. **Quality Metrics**: {Observation about quality characteristics}\n4. **Technical Setup**: {Observation about technical patterns}\n\n## Watch List Recommendations\n\nBased on this screen, consider adding to watch list:\n- **{TICKER}**: {Brief reason - e.g., \"Strong value with improving momentum\"}\n- **{TICKER}**: {Brief reason}\n- **{TICKER}**: {Brief reason}\n\n## Screening Notes\n\n⚠️ **Important Considerations**:\n- Screens are point-in-time and should be re-run regularly\n- Quantitative screens don''t capture qualitative factors\n- Results require further due diligence before investing\n- Past performance doesn''t guarantee future results\n\n---\n*Screen run on {Date} at {Time}*\n*Data as of {Data Date}*\n```\n\n## Custom Screening\n\nUsers can request custom criteria:\n\n**Example**: \"Screen for stocks with P/E under 20, ROE over 15%, and positive momentum\"\n\n**Response**: Apply custom filters and present results using standard format.\n\n### Common Custom Criteria\n- Market cap ranges\n- Sector/industry filters\n- Geographic filters\n- Index membership\n- Specific ratio thresholds\n- Technical conditions\n- Dividend requirements\n\n## Constraints\n- Use current market data (note staleness)\n- Results are for research, not recommendations\n- Quantitative screens have limitations\n- Note missing data for any stock\n- Screens should be re-run periodically\n- Do your own due diligence on results\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:45:41.907Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Quantitative Analysis Agents needing advanced stock screening and selection capabilities based on multi-factor criteria.","zh":"适合需要高级股票筛选和选择功能的量化分析代理，基于多因素标准。","ja":"先進的な株式スクリーンと選択機能を必要とする量化分析エージェントに最適です。複数の要因に基づく基準に基づいています。","ko":"고급 주식 스크리닝 및 선택 기능을 필요로 하는 정량적 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 다중 요인 기준을 기반으로 합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis Cuantitativo que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de selección y cribado de acciones basadas en criterios multifactoriales.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse Quantitative ayant besoin de capacités de sélection et de criblage de titres avancées basées sur des critères multifactoriels.","de":"Perfekt für quantitative Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Aktienauswahl- und Filterfunktionen auf der Grundlage mehrerer Faktoren benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Quantitativa que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de seleção e triagem de ações com base em critérios multifatoriais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов количественного анализа, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности скрининга и выбора акций на основе многокритериальных показателей.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل كمي متقدمة تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لاختيار وتحليل الأسهم بناءً على معايير متعددة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform composite scoring and ranking of stocks using quantitative criteria such as value, growth, quality, momentum, and dividend signals, leveraging custom criteria screening and detection of high-growth companies.","zh":"赋予代理商使用量化标准（如价值、增长、质量、动量和股息信号）进行综合评分和股票排名的能力，利用自定义标准筛选和检测高增长公司。","ja":"代理は、価値、成長、品質、動量、配当信号などの量的基準を使用して複合スコアリングと株式ランキングを行う機能を持ち、カスタム基準のスクリーンと高成長企業の検出を活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 가치, 성장, 품질, 모멘텀, 배당 신호 등의 정량적 기준을 사용하여 종합 평가 및 주식 순위를 수행할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 사용자 정의 기준의 스크리닝 및 고성장企業의 검출을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar una puntuación y clasificación compuesta de acciones utilizando criterios cuantitativos como valor, crecimiento, calidad, impulso y señales de dividendos, aprovechando la criba de criterios personalizados y la detección de empresas de alto crecimiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser un scoring et un classement composites des actions en utilisant des critères quantitatifs tels que la valeur, la croissance, la qualité, l''impulsion et les signaux de dividendes, en exploitant le criblage de critères personnalisés et la détection d''entreprises à forte croissance.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eine composite Bewertung und Rangliste von Aktien unter Verwendung quantitativer Kriterien wie Wert, Wachstum, Qualität, Impuls und Dividenden-Signale durchzuführen, indem sie benutzerdefinierte Kriterien-Filterung und Erkennung von Hochwachstumsunternehmen nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar pontuações compostas e classificação de ações utilizando critérios quantitativos, como valor, crescimento, qualidade, momentum e sinais de dividendos, aproveitando a triagem personalizada de critérios e detecção de empresas de alto crescimento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять комплексную оценку и ранжирование акций с использованием количественных критериев, таких как стоимость, рост, качество, импульс и дивидендные сигналы, используя индивидуальную выборку критериев и обнаружение компаний с высоким ростом.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من أداء التصنيف المركب والترتيب للأسهم باستخدام معايير كمية مثل القيمة والنمو والجودة والزخم وإشارات الأرباح، واستغلال عمليات الفحص المخصصة للكشف عن الشركات ذات النمو العالي"},"useCases":{"en":["Screening for high-growth companies","Identifying value stocks using multi-factor analysis","Detecting momentum signals for informed investment decisions"],"zh":["筛选高增长公司","使用多因素分析识别价值股","检测动量信号以进行明智的投资决策"],"ja":["高成長企業のスクリーニング","多要因分析を使用して価値株を特定する","情報に基づいた投資決定のためのモメンタム信号の検出"],"ko":["고성장 기업 스크리닝","다중 요인 분석을 사용하여 가치 주식 식별","정보에 आध안한 투자 결정의 모멘텀 신호 검출"],"es":["Cribado de empresas de alto crecimiento","Identificación de acciones de valor utilizando análisis multifactorial","Detección de señales de impulso para decisiones de inversión informadas"],"fr":["Criblage d''entreprises à forte croissance","Identification d''actions de valeur à l''aide d''une analyse multifactorielle","Détection de signaux d''impulsion pour des décisions d''investissement éclairées"],"de":["Filterung von Hochwachstumsunternehmen","Identifizierung von Wertpapieren unter Verwendung einer multifaktoriellen Analyse","Erkennung von Impulssignalen für fundierte Investitionsentscheidungen"],"pt":["Triagem de empresas de alto crescimento","Identificação de ações de valor utilizando análise multifatorial","Detecção de sinais de momentum para decisões de investimento informadas"],"ru":["Отбор компаний с высоким ростом","Определение акций стоимости с помощью многокритериального анализа","Обнаружение импульсных сигналов для обоснованных инвестиционных решений"],"ar":["فحص الشركات ذات النمو العالي","تحديد أسهم القيمة باستخدام التحليل المتعدد المعايير","الكشف عن إشارات الزخم لاتخاذ قرارات استثمارية مستنيرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires financial data access","Limited to publicly traded stocks","Dependent on quantitative criteria for screening"],"zh":["需要金融数据访问","仅限于公开交易的股票","依赖于量化标准进行筛选"],"ja":["金融データへのアクセスが必要","公開取引の株式のみに限定される","スクリーンに量的基準に依存する"],"ko":["금융 데이터 액세스가 필요","공개 거래 주식만으로 제한","스크리닝에 정량적 기준에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a datos financieros","Limitado a acciones de empresas cotizadas públicamente","Dependiente de criterios cuantitativos para la selección"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux données financières","Limité aux actions des entreprises cotées publiquement","Dépendant de critères quantitatifs pour le criblage"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Finanzdaten","Begrenzt auf Aktien von börsennotierten Unternehmen","Von quantitativen Kriterien für die Filterung abhängig"],"pt":["Requer acesso a dados financeiros","Limitado a ações negociadas publicamente","Dependente de critérios quantitativos para triagem"],"ru":["Требует доступа к финансовым данным","Ограничен акциями, торгуемыми публично","Зависит от количественных критериев для отбора"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى البيانات المالية","محدود بالأسهم المتداولة بشكل عام","يعتمد على معايير كمية للفحص"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
