ートする Markdown コンポーネント開発フレームワーク","ko":"Nuxt Content MDC는 Vue 컴포넌트를 지원하는 Markdown 컴포넌트 개발 프레임워크","es":"Nuxt Content es una herramienta para crear contenido dinámico en proyectos de Nuxt.js utilizando Markdown Components.","fr":"Nuxt Content est un outil pour créer du contenu dynamique dans les projets Nuxt.js en utilisant les Markdown Components.","de":"Nuxt Content ist ein Tool zur Erstellung von dynamischem Inhalt in Nuxt.js-Projekten mithilfe von Markdown-Komponenten.","pt":"Nuxt Content é uma ferramenta para criar conteúdo com Markdown e componentes Vue. Aprenda a usá-la com nossa guia","ru":"Nuxt Content — это инструмент для создания контента с помощью Markdown и компонентов Vue. Узнайте, как им пользоваться с нашей помощью","ar":"نكست كونتنت هي أداة لإنشاء المحتوى باستخدام Markdown ومكونات Vue. تعلم كيفية استخدامها مع دليلنا","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持 Vue 组件","提供 Markdown 语法扩展","支持 props 和 slot","支持变量绑定","支持 span 属性"],"ja":["Vue コンポーネントをサポート","Markdown 構文の拡張を提供","props と slot をサポート","変数バインドをサポート","span 属性をサポート"],"ko":["Vue 컴포넌트 지원","Markdown 구문 확장 제공","props 및 slot 지원","변수 바인딩 지원","span 속성 지원"],"es":["Soporte para componentes de Vue en Markdown","Sintaxis para componentes en bloque y en línea","Asignación de propiedades y variables","Compatibilidad con ranuras con nombre","Atributos personalizados para elementos Span"],"fr":["Prise en charge des composants Vue dans Markdown","Syntaxe pour les composants en bloc et en ligne","Affectation de propriétés et de variables","Compatibilité avec les emplacements nommés","Attributs personnalisés pour les éléments Span"],"de":["Unterstützung für Vue-Komponenten in Markdown","Syntax für Block- und Inline-Komponenten","Zuweisung von Eigenschaften und Variablen","Kompatibilität mit benannten Schlitz","Benutzerdefinierte Attribute für Span-Elemente"],"pt":["Suporte a componentes Vue em arquivos Markdown","Sintaxe de bloco e inline para componentes","Suporte a props e slots nomeados","Bind de variáveis com sintaxe de template","Suporte a atributos de span"],"ru":["Поддержка компонентов Vue в файлах Markdown","Синтаксис блока и инлайна для компонентов","Поддержка пропсов и именованных слотов","Привязка переменных с помощью синтаксиса шаблона","Поддержка атрибутов span"],"ar":["دعم مكونات Vue في ملفات Markdown","بنية الكتابة لمكونات البلوك والانلاين","دعم الخصائص والمواقع المسمى","ربط المتغيرات ببنية القوالب","دعم خصائص.span"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Nuxt Content MDC","Markdown 组件","Vue 组件","MDC 语法","前端开发","开发框架"],"ja":["Nuxt Content MDC","Markdown コンポーネント","Vue コンポーネント","MDC 構文","フロントエンド開発","開発フレームワーク"],"ko":["Nuxt Content MDC","Markdown 컴포넌트","Vue 컴포넌트","MDC 구문","프론트엔드 개발","개발 프레임워크"],"es":["Nuxt Content","Markdown Components","Vue.js","Nuxt.js","contenido dinámico","desarrollo web","SEO"],"fr":["Nuxt Content","Markdown Components","Vue.js","Nuxt.js","contenu dynamique","développement web","SEO"],"de":["Nuxt Content","Markdown-Komponenten","Vue.js","Nuxt.js","dynamischer Inhalt","Webentwicklung","SEO"],"pt":["Nuxt Content","Markdown Components","MDC","Vue.js","Desenvolvimento web","Front-end"," Conteúdo estático","Geração de sites","Desenvolvedores web"],"ru":["Nuxt Content","Компоненты Markdown","MDC","Vue.js","Веб-разработка","Фронтенд","Статический контент","Генерация сайтов","Веб-разработчики"],"ar":["نكست كونتنت","مكونات Markdown","MDC","Vue.js","تطوير الويب","الواجهة الأمامية","المحتوى الثابت","توليد المواقع","مطورو الويب"]}},"owner":"colinmollenhour","repo":"dotfiles","repoPath":"colinmollenhour/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.411Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nuxt-content","description":"Author Markdown content files for Nuxt Content using MDC syntax. Use when creating or editing .md files in content/ directories, writing documentation, blog posts, or any content that uses Vue components in Markdown. Triggers on content authoring, MDC syntax, Nuxt Content files.","bodyPreview":"# Nuxt Content MDC Authoring Guide\n\nMDC (Markdown Components) extends standard Markdown with Vue component support. Use this guide when authoring `.md` files for Nuxt Content.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Syntax | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `::component` | Block component |\n| `:component` | Inline component |\n| `{prop=\"value\"}` | Props |\n| `#slotname` | Named slot |\n| `[text]{.class}` | Span with attributes |\n| `{{ $doc.var }}` | Variable binding |\n\n## Frontmatter\n\nYAML metadata block at","body":"# Nuxt Content MDC Authoring Guide\n\nMDC (Markdown Components) extends standard Markdown with Vue component support. Use this guide when authoring `.md` files for Nuxt Content.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Syntax | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `::component` | Block component |\n| `:component` | Inline component |\n| `{prop=\"value\"}` | Props |\n| `#slotname` | Named slot |\n| `[text]{.class}` | Span with attributes |\n| `{{ $doc.var }}` | Variable binding |\n\n## Frontmatter\n\nYAML metadata block at the top of the file:\n\n```markdown\n---\ntitle: My Article\ndescription: A brief description\nauthor: John Doe\ndate: 2024-01-15\ntags:\n  - tutorial\n  - nuxt\ndraft: false\n---\n```\n\nAccess frontmatter values in content using `{{ $doc.propertyName }}`.\n\n## Block Components\n\nBlock components use `::` syntax and can contain Markdown content:\n\n```markdown\n::alert{type=\"warning\"}\nThis is a warning message with **Markdown** support.\n::\n```\n\n### Nested Components\n\n```markdown\n::card\n  ::card-header\n  Card Title\n  ::\n\n  Card body content here.\n\n  ::card-footer\n  Footer text\n  ::\n::\n```\n\n### Named Slots\n\nUse `#slotname` to define named slots:\n\n```markdown\n::card\nDefault slot content goes here.\n\n#header\nThis goes in the header slot.\n\n#footer\nThis goes in the footer slot.\n::\n```\n\n### Self-Closing Block Components\n\nFor components without content:\n\n```markdown\n::divider\n::\n```\n\n## Inline Components\n\nInline components use single `:` and flow with text:\n\n```markdown\nHere is an :icon{name=\"heroicons:star\"} icon inline.\n\nStatus: :badge[Active]{color=\"success\"}\n\nClick :button[Submit]{@click=\"handleSubmit\"} to continue.\n```\n\n### Inline Component with Content\n\nUse square brackets for default slot content:\n\n```markdown\n:badge[Premium]\n:button[Click Me]{variant=\"outline\"}\n```\n\n## Props\n\n### Inline Props\n\n```markdown\n::alert{type=\"info\" icon=\"heroicons:information-circle\"}\nContent here\n::\n\n:icon{name=\"heroicons:check\" class=\"text-green-500\" size=\"24\"}\n```\n\n### YAML Props Block\n\nFor complex props, use a YAML block after the component declaration:\n\n```markdown\n::card\n---\ntitle: My Card\nimage: /images/hero.jpg\ntags:\n  - featured\n  - new\n---\nCard content with complex props defined above.\n::\n```\n\n### JSON Props (Arrays/Objects)\n\nPrefix with `:` for JavaScript expressions:\n\n```markdown\n::dropdown{:items=''[\"Option A\", \"Option B\", \"Option C\"]''}\n::\n\n::chart{:data=''{\"labels\": [\"Jan\", \"Feb\"], \"values\": [10, 20]}''}\n::\n```\n\n### Boolean Props\n\n```markdown\n::modal{closable}       <!-- true -->\n::modal{:closable=\"false\"}  <!-- explicit false -->\n```\n\n### Dynamic Props\n\nBind to frontmatter variables:\n\n```markdown\n---\ncardTitle: Welcome\n---\n\n::card{:title=\"$doc.cardTitle\"}\n::\n```\n\n## Slots\n\n### Default Slot\n\nContent directly inside the component:\n\n```markdown\n::callout\nThis is the default slot content.\nIt supports **Markdown** formatting.\n::\n```\n\n### Named Slots\n\n```markdown\n::hero\n#title\nWelcome to Our Site\n\n#subtitle\nBuild amazing things with Nuxt\n\n#actions\n:button[Get Started]{to=\"/docs\"}\n:button[Learn More]{to=\"/about\" variant=\"outline\"}\n::\n```\n\n### Nested Slots\n\n```markdown\n::tabs\n  ::tab{label=\"Preview\"}\n  Preview content here.\n  ::\n\n  ::tab{label=\"Code\"}\n  ```ts\n  const example = ''code''\n  ```\n  ::\n::\n```\n\n## Spans & Attributes\n\nApply attributes to inline text using `[text]{attributes}`:\n\n```markdown\nThis is [highlighted text]{.text-primary}.\n\n[Custom styled]{.font-bold .text-lg #my-id style=\"color: red\"}\n\n[Link with class](/about){.nav-link}\n```\n\n### Attributes on Standard Markdown\n\n```markdown\n**bold text**{.text-red-500}\n\n*italic*{.text-sm}\n\n`inline code`{lang=\"ts\"}\n\n![image alt](/path/to/image.jpg){width=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"}\n```\n\n### Multiple Classes\n\n```markdown\n[styled text]{.class-one .class-two .class-three}\n```\n\n## Variable Binding\n\nInterpolate frontmatter values in content:\n\n```markdown\n---\nauthor: Jane Smith\npublishDate: 2024-01-15\nversion: 2.0.0\n---\n\n# {{ $doc.title }}\n\nWritten by {{ $doc.author }} on {{ $doc.publishDate }}.\n\nCurrent version: **{{ $doc.version }}**\n```\n\n## Code Blocks\n\n### Basic Syntax Highlighting\n\n```markdown\n```typescript\nconst greeting: string = ''Hello, World!''\nconsole.log(greeting)\n```\n```\n\n### Filename Display\n\n```markdown\n```ts [utils/helpers.ts]\nexport function formatDate(date: Date): string {\n  return date.toLocaleDateString()\n}\n```\n```\n\n### Line Highlighting\n\n```markdown\n```ts {2-4,6}\nfunction example() {\n  // Lines 2-4 highlighted\n  const a = 1\n  const b = 2\n  // Line 5 not highlighted\n  return a + b  // Line 6 highlighted\n}\n```\n```\n\n### Meta String\n\nCombine filename and highlighting:\n\n```markdown\n```vue [components/Button.vue] {3-5}\n<template>\n  <button\n    class=\"btn\"\n    :class=\"variant\"\n    @click=\"$emit(''click'')\"\n  >\n    <slot />\n  </button>\n</template>\n```\n```\n\n### Code Groups\n\n```markdown\n::code-group\n```bash [npm]\nnpm install @nuxt/content\n```\n\n```bash [pnpm]\npnpm add @nuxt/content\n```\n\n```bash [yarn]\nyarn add @nuxt/content\n```\n::\n```\n\n## Prose Components\n\nCustomize how standard Markdown elements render by creating components in `components/content/`:\n\n| Element | Component | Description |\n|---------|-----------|-------------|\n| `<p>` | `ProseP` | Paragraphs |\n| `<h1>` | `ProseH1` | Heading 1 |\n| `<h2>` | `ProseH2` | Heading 2 |\n| `<h3>` | `ProseH3` | Heading 3 |\n| `<a>` | `ProseA` | Links |\n| `<code>` | `ProseCode` | Inline code |\n| `<pre>` | `ProsePre` | Code blocks |\n| `<ul>` | `ProseUl` | Unordered lists |\n| `<ol>` | `ProseOl` | Ordered lists |\n| `<li>` | `ProseLi` | List items |\n| `<blockquote>` | `ProseBlockquote` | Blockquotes |\n| `<img>` | `ProseImg` | Images |\n| `<table>` | `ProseTable` | Tables |\n\n## Excerpts\n\nUse `<!--more-->` to define excerpt boundaries:\n\n```markdown\n---\ntitle: My Article\n---\n\nThis is the excerpt that appears in listings.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThis is the full article content that only shows on the detail page.\n```\n\n## Practical Component Examples\n\n### Alert/Callout\n\n```markdown\n::alert{type=\"info\"}\nThis is an informational message.\n::\n\n::alert{type=\"warning\" icon=\"heroicons:exclamation-triangle\"}\n**Warning:** Please read carefully before proceeding.\n::\n\n::alert{type=\"error\"}\nAn error occurred. Please try again.\n::\n\n::alert{type=\"success\"}\nOperation completed successfully!\n::\n```\n\n### Card with Slots\n\n```markdown\n::card{image=\"/images/feature.jpg\"}\n#header\nFeature Title\n\n#default\nThis card showcases a new feature with an image header and action buttons.\n\n#footer\n:button[Learn More]{to=\"/features\" variant=\"link\"}\n::\n```\n\n### Accordion/Collapsible\n\n```markdown\n::accordion\n  ::accordion-item{title=\"What is Nuxt Content?\"}\n  Nuxt Content is a file-based CMS for Nuxt applications.\n  ::\n\n  ::accordion-item{title=\"How do I install it?\"}\n  Run `npx nuxi module add content` to add it to your project.\n  ::\n::\n```\n\n### Tabs\n\n```markdown\n::tabs\n  ::tab{label=\"Vue\"}\n  ```vue\n  <template>\n    <div>Hello Vue!</div>\n  </template>\n  ```\n  ::\n\n  ::tab{label=\"React\"}\n  ```jsx\n  function Hello() {\n    return <div>Hello React!</div>\n  }\n  ```\n  ::\n::\n```\n\n### Badge/Tag\n\n```markdown\nStatus: :badge[Published]{color=\"success\"} :badge[Featured]{color=\"primary\"}\n\nTags: :tag[Vue] :tag[Nuxt] :tag[TypeScript]\n```\n\n### Icon\n\n```markdown\n:icon{name=\"heroicons:home\" class=\"w-5 h-5\"}\n:icon{name=\"lucide:github\" size=\"24\"}\n:icon{name=\"mdi:vuejs\" class=\"text-green-500\"}\n```\n\n### Callout with Icon\n\n```markdown\n::callout{icon=\"heroicons:light-bulb\"}\n#title\nPro Tip\n\n#default\nUse MDC syntax to create rich, interactive documentation with Vue components.\n::\n```\n\n## Creating Custom Components\n\nCreate Vue components in `components/content/` to use in MDC:\n\n```vue\n<!-- components/content/Alert.vue -->\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\ndefineProps<{\n  type?: ''info'' | ''warning'' | ''error'' | ''success''\n  icon?: string\n}>()\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div :class=\"[''alert'', `alert-${type}`]\">\n    <Icon v-if=\"icon\" :name=\"icon\" />\n    <slot />\n  </div>\n</template>\n```\n\nThen use in Markdown:\n\n```markdown\n::alert{type=\"info\" icon=\"heroicons:information-circle\"}\nCustom alert component content.\n::\n```\n\n## Routing Best Practices\n\n### Avoiding Route Ambiguity with Optional Catch-All Routes\nWhen creating a documentation section or any area using dynamic routes for content, avoid using optional catch-all routes like `[[...slug]].vue` if you also need to support the root path (e.g., `/docs`) and sub-paths (e.g., `/docs/getting-started`) reliably.\n\nNuxt/Vue Router can have trouble disambiguating the root path when using `[[...slug]].vue`.\n\n**Recommended Pattern:**\nSplit the implementation into two explicit files:\n\n1. `pages/docs/index.vue` - Handles the root `/docs` path\n   ```vue\n   <script setup>\n   const { data: page } = await useAsyncData(''docs-index'', () => \n     queryCollection(''docs'').path(''/docs'').first()\n   )\n   // ... handle page not found ...\n   </script>\n   ```\n\n2. `pages/docs/[...slug].vue` - Handles all nested paths (slug is required)\n   ```vue\n   <script setup>\n   const route = useRoute()\n   const slug = route.params.slug.join(''/'')\n   const { data: page } = await useAsyncData(`docs-${slug}`, () => \n     queryCollection(''docs'').path(`/docs/${slug}`).first()\n   )\n   // ... handle page not found ...\n   </script>\n   ```\n\nThis ensures predictable routing behavior and prevents 404 errors on the root path.\n\n## References\n\n- [ContentRenderer](https://content.nuxt.com/docs/components/content-renderer) - Render parsed content in templates\n- [Custom Components](https://content.nuxt.com/docs/getting-started/components) - Create MDC-compatible Vue components\n- [Collections](https://content.nuxt.com/docs/getting-started/collections) - Organize and query content\n- [Prose Components](https://content.nuxt.com/docs/components/prose) - Customize default HTML rendering\n- [MDC Module](https://github.com/nuxt-modules/mdc) - Underlying MDC parser and syntax\n- [Nuxt Content Docs](https://content.nuxt.com/) - Official documentation\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:45:18.241Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents specializing in web development and content creation, needing to leverage Markdown Components with Vue support in Nuxt Content.","zh":"适合专门从事 Web 开发和内容创作的 AI 代理，需要利用具有 Vue 支持的 Nuxt Content 中的 Markdown 组件。","ja":"Web 開発とコンテンツ作成を専門とする AI エージェントに適しています。Nuxt Content の Markdown コンポーネントを Vue で利用できるようにする必要があります。","ko":"웹 개발과 콘텐츠 제작을 전문으로 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. Nuxt Content의 마크다운 구성 요소를 Vue에서 활용할 수 있어야 합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que se especializan en el desarrollo web y la creación de contenido, y necesitan aprovechar los componentes de Markdown con soporte de Vue en Nuxt Content.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA spécialisés dans le développement web et la création de contenu, ayant besoin d''utiliser les composants Markdown avec prise en charge de Vue dans Nuxt Content.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents, die sich auf die Webentwicklung und die Erstellung von Inhalten spezialisieren und die Markdown-Komponenten mit Vue-Unterstützung in Nuxt Content nutzen müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA especializados em desenvolvimento web e criação de conteúdo, precisando aproveitar os Componentes Markdown com suporte ao Vue no Nuxt Content.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, специализирующихся на веб-разработке и создании контента, которым необходимо использовать компоненты Markdown с поддержкой Vue в Nuxt Content.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يختصون في تطوير الويب وإنشاء المحتوى، وهم بحاجة إلى الاستفادة من مكونات Markdown بدعم Vue في Nuxt Content."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to author and render dynamic content using MDC, supporting block and inline components, props, named slots, and variable binding, all within the Nuxt Content ecosystem, utilizing YAML frontmatter and Markdown syntax.","zh":"赋予代理创建和渲染动态内容的能力，使用 MDC 支持块和内联组件、属性、命名槽和变量绑定，所有这些都在 Nuxt Content 生态系统中使用 YAML 前置内容和 Markdown 语法。","ja":"MDC を使用してブロックとインライン コンポーネント、プロップ、名前付きスロット、変数バインドをサポートし、すべてを Nuxt Content エコシステム内で YAML フロントマターと Markdown 構文を使用して、エージェントが動的なコンテンツを作成してレンダリングできるようにします。","ko":"MDC를 사용하여 블록 및 인라인 구성 요소, 속성, 명명된 슬롯 및 변수 바인딩을 지원하며, 모두 Nuxt Content 생태계 내에서 YAML 전면 마터 및 마크다운 구문을 사용하여 에이전트가 동적 콘텐츠를 작성 및 렌더링할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y renderizar contenido dinámico utilizando MDC, que admite componentes de bloque y en línea, props, ranuras con nombre y enlaces de variable, todo dentro del ecosistema de Nuxt Content, utilizando frontmatter YAML y sintaxis de Markdown.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de rendre du contenu dynamique en utilisant MDC, qui prend en charge les composants de bloc et en ligne, les props, les emplacements nommés et les liaisons de variable, le tout dans l''écosystème de Nuxt Content, en utilisant le frontmatter YAML et la syntaxe de Markdown.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, dynamischen Inhalt zu erstellen und zu rendern, indem MDC verwendet wird, das Block- und Inline-Komponenten, Props, benannte Slots und Variable-Bindungen unterstützt, all dies innerhalb des Nuxt-Content-Ökosystems, unter Verwendung von YAML-Frontmatter und Markdown-Syntax.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e renderizar conteúdo dinâmico usando MDC, com suporte a componentes de bloco e inline, props, slots nomeados e vinculação de variáveis, tudo dentro do ecossistema Nuxt Content, utilizando frontmatter YAML e sintaxe Markdown.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и отображать динамический контент с помощью MDC, поддерживающего блоки и инлайн-компоненты, свойства, именованные слоты и привязку переменных, все в рамках экосистемы Nuxt Content, используя YAML-заголовки и синтаксис Markdown.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء وتحديث محتوى ديناميكي باستخدام MDC، مع دعم المكونات الكتلة والمتوافقة، والممتلكات، والفتحات المسمّاة، وربط المتغيرات، كل ذلك داخل نظام Nuxt Content، باستخدام YAML وتنسيق Markdown."},"useCases":{"en":["Authoring interactive .md files with Vue components","Generating dynamic content previews using Nuxt Content","Creating customizable content templates with MDC"],"zh":["使用 Vue 组件创建交互式 .md 文件","使用 Nuxt Content 生成动态内容预览","使用 MDC 创建可自定义的内容模板"],"ja":["Vue コンポーネントを使用してインタラクティブな .md ファイルを作成する","Nuxt Content を使用して動的なコンテンツ プレビューを生成する","MDC を使用してカスタマイズ可能なコンテンツ テンプレートを作成する"],"ko":["Vue 구성 요소를 사용하여 상호 작용형 .md 파일을 작성하는 것","Nuxt Content를 사용하여 동적 콘텐츠 미리 보기를 생성하는 것","MDC를 사용하여 사용자 지정 가능한 콘텐츠 템플릿을 만드는 것"],"es":["Creación de archivos .md interactivos con componentes de Vue","Generación de vistas previas de contenido dinámico con Nuxt Content","Creación de plantillas de contenido personalizables con MDC"],"fr":["Création de fichiers .md interactifs avec des composants Vue","Génération d''aperçus de contenu dynamique avec Nuxt Content","Création de modèles de contenu personnalisables avec MDC"],"de":["Erstellung interaktiver .md-Dateien mit Vue-Komponenten","Erzeugung von Vorschauen dynamischen Inhalts mit Nuxt Content","Erstellung von anpassbaren Inhaltsvorlagen mit MDC"],"pt":["Criação de arquivos .md interativos com componentes Vue","Geração de visualizações de conteúdo dinâmico usando Nuxt Content","Criação de modelos de conteúdo personalizáveis com MDC"],"ru":["Создание интерактивных файлов .md с компонентами Vue","Генерация предварительных просмотров динамического контента с помощью Nuxt Content","Создание настраиваемых шаблонов контента с помощью MDC"],"ar":["إنشاء ملفات .md متفاعلة مع مكونات Vue","توليد معاينة لمحتوى ديناميكي باستخدام Nuxt Content","إنشاء قوالب محتوى قابلة للتخصيص باستخدام MDC"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Nuxt Content setup","Limited to Markdown files (.md)","Dependent on Vue component compatibility"],"zh":["需要 Nuxt Content 设置","仅限于 Markdown 文件 (.md)","依赖于 Vue 组件兼容性"],"ja":["Nuxt Content の設定が必要","Markdown ファイル (.md) のみに限定される","Vue コンポーネントの互換性に依存する"],"ko":["Nuxt Content 설정이 필요합니다","마크다운 파일 (.md) 만 해당됩니다","Vue 구성 요소 호환성에 종속됩니다"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Nuxt Content","Limitado a archivos de Markdown (.md)","Dependiente de la compatibilidad de los componentes de Vue"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Nuxt Content","Limité aux fichiers Markdown (.md)","Dépend de la compatibilité des composants Vue"],"de":["Benötigt Nuxt-Content-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf Markdown-Dateien (.md)","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität der Vue-Komponenten"],"pt":["Exige configuração do Nuxt Content","Limitado a arquivos Markdown (.md)","Dependente da compatibilidade dos componentes Vue"],"ru":["Требует настройки Nuxt Content","Ограничен файлами Markdown (.md)","Зависит от совместимости компонентов Vue"],"ar":["يتطلب إعدادات Nuxt Content","محدود بملفات Markdown (.md)","يعتمد على توافق مكونات Vue"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
