die Refaktorierung von Code und Verbesserung der Struktur","Diskussion über Architektur und Entkopplung"],"pt":["Referência completa de padrões de design GoF","Orientação independente de linguagem","Exemplos de pseudocódigo","Melhoria da estrutura do código","Escolha entre padrões para problemas de design","Refatoração de código"],"ru":["Всесторонний справочник шаблонов проектирования GoF","Языково-независимое руководство","Примеры псевдокода","Улучшение структуры кода","Выбор между шаблонами для проблем проектирования","Рефакторинг кода"],"ar":["مرجع شامل لأنماط تصميم GoF","توجيه مستقل عن اللغة","أمثلة الكود النصي","تحسين هيكل الكود","اختيار بين الأنماط لمشاكل التصميم","إعادة هيكلة الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GoF 设计模式","软件设计","设计模式","数据结构","伪代码","结构改进"],"ja":["GoF デザインパターン","ソフトウェア設計","デザインパターン","データ構造","疑似コード","構造の改善"],"ko":["GoF 디자인 패턴","소프트웨어 설계","디자인 패턴","데이터 구조","의사 코드","구조 개선"],"es":["patrones de diseño GoF","programación orientada a objetos","diseño de software","refactorización de código","arquitectura de software","desacoplamiento"],"fr":["modèles de conception GoF","programmation orientée objet","conception de logiciels","réorganisation de code","architecture de logiciels","découplage"],"de":["GoF-Entwurfsmuster","objektorientierte Programmierung","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Refaktorierung","Software-Architektur","Entkopplung"],"pt":["padrões de design GoF","design de software","pseudocódigo","refatoração de código","melhoria da estrutura do código","escolha de padrões","análise de design","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["шаблоны проектирования GoF","проектирование программного обеспечения","псевдокод","рефакторинг кода","улучшение структуры кода","выбор шаблонов","анализ проектирования","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["أنماط تصميم GoF","تصميم البرمجيات","الكود النصي","إعادة هيكلة الكود","تحسين هيكل الكود","اختيار الأنماط","تحليل التصميم","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"grndlvl","repo":"software-patterns","repoPath":"grndlvl/software-patterns","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gof-patterns","description":"Gang of Four design patterns reference. Use this skill when implementing, discussing, or choosing object-oriented design patterns. Auto-activates for architecture decisions, refactoring, and decoupling concerns. Comprehensive coverage of all 23 GoF patterns with pseudocode examples.","bodyPreview":"# GoF Design Patterns Reference\n\nA comprehensive reference for the Gang of Four design patterns. This skill provides language-agnostic guidance with pseudocode examples that can be translated to any programming language.\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n\nThis skill automatically activates when you:\n- Ask about or need to implement a design pattern\n- Need to choose between patterns for a design problem\n- Are refactoring code and considering structural improvements\n- Discuss architecture, decoupling,","body":"# GoF Design Patterns Reference\n\nA comprehensive reference for the Gang of Four design patterns. This skill provides language-agnostic guidance with pseudocode examples that can be translated to any programming language.\n\n## When This Skill Activates\n\nThis skill automatically activates when you:\n- Ask about or need to implement a design pattern\n- Need to choose between patterns for a design problem\n- Are refactoring code and considering structural improvements\n- Discuss architecture, decoupling, or extensibility\n- Mention specific patterns: factory, singleton, observer, decorator, etc.\n\n## Quick Pattern Reference\n\n### Creational Patterns (Object Creation)\n| Pattern | Intent | Use When |\n|---------|--------|----------|\n| [Abstract Factory](gof-creational/abstract-factory.md) | Create families of related objects | Need platform/theme independence |\n| [Builder](gof-creational/builder.md) | Construct complex objects step-by-step | Object has many optional parts |\n| [Factory Method](gof-creational/factory-method.md) | Let subclasses decide which class to instantiate | Don''t know concrete types ahead of time |\n| [Prototype](gof-creational/prototype.md) | Clone existing objects | Object creation is expensive |\n| [Singleton](gof-creational/singleton.md) | Ensure single instance | Need exactly one shared instance |\n\n### Structural Patterns (Composition)\n| Pattern | Intent | Use When |\n|---------|--------|----------|\n| [Adapter](gof-structural/adapter.md) | Convert interface to expected interface | Integrating incompatible interfaces |\n| [Bridge](gof-structural/bridge.md) | Separate abstraction from implementation | Need to vary both independently |\n| [Composite](gof-structural/composite.md) | Treat individual and groups uniformly | Have tree structures |\n| [Decorator](gof-structural/decorator.md) | Add responsibilities dynamically | Need flexible extension |\n| [Facade](gof-structural/facade.md) | Simplified interface to subsystem | Complex subsystem needs simple API |\n| [Flyweight](gof-structural/flyweight.md) | Share common state efficiently | Many similar objects needed |\n| [Proxy](gof-structural/proxy.md) | Control access to object | Need lazy loading, access control, logging |\n\n### Behavioral Patterns (Communication)\n| Pattern | Intent | Use When |\n|---------|--------|----------|\n| [Chain of Responsibility](gof-behavioral/chain-of-responsibility.md) | Pass request along handler chain | Multiple handlers, unknown which handles |\n| [Command](gof-behavioral/command.md) | Encapsulate request as object | Need undo, queue, or log operations |\n| [Interpreter](gof-behavioral/interpreter.md) | Define grammar and interpret sentences | Have a simple language to parse |\n| [Iterator](gof-behavioral/iterator.md) | Sequential access without exposing internals | Need to traverse collections |\n| [Mediator](gof-behavioral/mediator.md) | Centralize complex communications | Many objects communicate in complex ways |\n| [Memento](gof-behavioral/memento.md) | Capture and restore object state | Need undo/snapshot functionality |\n| [Observer](gof-behavioral/observer.md) | Notify dependents of state changes | One-to-many dependency |\n| [State](gof-behavioral/state.md) | Alter behavior when state changes | Object behavior depends on state |\n| [Strategy](gof-behavioral/strategy.md) | Encapsulate interchangeable algorithms | Need to swap algorithms at runtime |\n| [Template Method](gof-behavioral/template-method.md) | Define skeleton, let subclasses fill in | Algorithm structure fixed, steps vary |\n| [Visitor](gof-behavioral/visitor.md) | Add operations without changing classes | Need to add many operations to stable structure |\n\n## Decision Guide\n\nSee [Pattern Selection Guide](pattern-selection.md) for help choosing the right pattern.\n\n## How to Use This Reference\n\n1. **Choosing a pattern**: Start with the decision guide or tables above\n2. **Learning a pattern**: Read the full documentation with examples\n3. **Quick reminder**: Use the tables above for at-a-glance reference\n4. **Implementation**: Follow the pseudocode, adapt to your language\n\n## Language Translation Notes\n\nThe pseudocode in this reference uses these conventions:\n- `class` for type definitions\n- `function` for methods/functions\n- `->` for method calls on objects\n- `//` for comments\n- Type hints shown as `name: Type`\n\nTranslate to your language:\n- **PHP**: `class`, `function`, `->`, `//`, type hints in docblocks or PHP 8+\n- **JavaScript/TypeScript**: `class`, `function`/arrow, `.`, `//`, TS types\n- **Python**: `class`, `def`, `.`, `#`, type hints\n- **Java/C#**: Direct mapping with `new`, generics\n\n---\n\n*Based on concepts from \"Design Patterns: Elements of Reusable Object-Oriented Software\" by Gamma, Helm, Johnson, and Vlissides (Gang of Four), 1994.*\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:45:58.908Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Generation Agents like Claude Code needing comprehensive guidance on Gang of Four design patterns and data structures","zh":"适用于Claude Code等需要对Gang of Four设计模式和数据结构进行全面指导的代码生成代理","ja":"Claude Codeのような、Gang of Fourデザインパターンとデータ構造に関する包括的なガイダンスが必要なコード生成エージェントに適しています","ko":"클로드 코드와 같은 갱 오브 포 디자인 패턴과 데이터 구조에 대한 포괄적인 지침이 필요한 코드 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de generación de código como Claude Code que necesitan una guía integral sobre patrones de diseño de Gang of Four y estructuras de datos","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de génération de code comme Claude Code nécessitant une orientation complète sur les modèles de conception de Gang of Four et les structures de données","de":"Ideal für Code-Generierungsagenten wie Claude Code, die eine umfassende Anleitung zu Gang-of-Four-Entwurfsmustern und Datenstrukturen benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Geração de Código, como Claude Code, que necessitam de orientação abrangente sobre padrões de design Gang of Four e estruturas de dados","ru":"Идеально для агентов генерации кода, таких как Claude Code, требующих всестороннего руководства по шаблонам проектирования Gang of Four и структурам данных","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يولدون الشفرة مثل Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات شاملة حول أنماط تصميم Gang of Four والهياكل البيانية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement language-agnostic design patterns using pseudocode examples, facilitating structural improvements and architecture discussions with protocols like decoupling","zh":"赋予代理使用伪代码示例实现语言无关的设计模式，促进结构改进和使用诸如解耦等协议的架构讨论","ja":"エージェントが疑似コードの例を使用して言語に依存しないデザインパターンを実装できるようにし、プロトコルsuchとしての結合を解除を使用した構造の改善とアーキテクチャに関するディスカッションを促進します","ko":"에이전트가 의사 코드 예를 사용하여 언어별이 아닌 디자인 패턴을 구현할 수 있도록 하여, 프로토콜과 같은 결합을 풀기 등을 사용한 구조 개선 및 아키텍처에 대한 논의를 촉진합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar patrones de diseño independientes del lenguaje utilizando ejemplos de pseudocódigo, lo que facilita mejoras estructurales y discusiones de arquitectura con protocolos como desacoplamiento","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des modèles de conception indépendants du langage en utilisant des exemples de pseudocode, ce qui facilite les améliorations structurelles et les discussions d''architecture avec des protocoles tels que le découplage","de":"Ermöglich es den Agenten, sprachunabhängige Entwurfsmuster mithilfe von Pseudocode-Beispielen umzusetzen, was strukturelle Verbesserungen und Architekturdiskussionen mit Protokollen wie Entkopplung erleichtert","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar padrões de design independentes de linguagem usando exemplos de pseudocódigo, facilitando melhorias estruturais e discussões de arquitetura com protocolos como desacoplamento","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать языково-независимые шаблоны проектирования с помощью примеров псевдокода, облегчая структурыальные улучшения и обсуждения архитектуры с протоколами, такими как декуплинг","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تنفيذ أنماط تصميم غير معتمدة على اللغة باستخدام أمثلة من البسودو كود، وتسهيل التحسينات الهيكلية ومناقشات الهندسة المعمارية مع بروتوكولات مثل الربط المتعدد"},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Singleton patterns for resource management","Refactoring code with Factory Method patterns for improved modularity","Choosing between Adapter and Bridge patterns for complex system integration"],"zh":["实现Singleton模式以进行资源管理","使用Factory Method模式重构代码以提高模块性","在复杂系统集成中选择Adapter和Bridge模式"],"ja":["Singletonパターンを実装してリソース管理を行う","Factory Methodパターンを使用してコードをリファクタリングしてモジュール性を向上させる","複雑なシステム統合の際にAdapterとBridgeパターンを選択する"],"ko":["Singleton 패턴을 구현하여 리소스 관리를 수행하는 것","Factory Method 패턴을 사용하여 코드를 리팩토링하여 모듈성을 향상시키는 것","복잡한 시스템 통합에서 어댑터 및 브리지 패턴을 선택하는 것"],"es":["Implementación de patrones Singleton para la administración de recursos","Reestructuración de código con patrones de método de fábrica para una mayor modularidad","Elección entre patrones Adapter y Bridge para la integración de sistemas complejos"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de modèles Singleton pour la gestion des ressources","Réorganisation de code avec des modèles de méthode de fabrique pour une meilleure modularité","Choix entre les modèles Adaptateur et Pont pour l''intégration de systèmes complexes"],"de":["Implementierung von Singleton-Mustern für die Ressourcenverwaltung","Neustrukturierung von Code mit Fabrikmethoden-Mustern für eine verbesserte Modularität","Wahl zwischen Adapter- und Bridge-Mustern für die Integration komplexer Systeme"],"pt":["Implementação de padrões Singleton para gerenciamento de recursos","Reestruturação de código com padrões de método de fábrica para modularidade aprimorada","Escolha entre padrões Adapter e Bridge para integração de sistemas complexos"],"ru":["Реализация шаблонов Singleton для управления ресурсами","Переструктуризация кода с помощью шаблонов метода фабрики для улучшения модульности","Выбор между шаблонами Adapter и Bridge для интеграции сложных систем"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنماط Singleton لإدارة الموارد","إعادة هيكلة الشفرة باستخدام أنماط طريقة المصنع لتحسين الوحدات","اختيار بين أنماط Adapter و Bridge لتكامل الأنظمة المعقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires programming language knowledge for pseudocode translation","Limited to Gang of Four design patterns"],"zh":["需要编程语言知识来翻译伪代码","仅限于Gang of Four设计模式"],"ja":["疑似コードの翻訳にプログラミング言語の知識が必要","Gang of Fourデザインパターンに限定される"],"ko":["의사 코드 번역을 위해 프로그래밍 언어 지식이 필요","갱 오브 포 디자인 패턴에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del lenguaje de programación para la traducción de pseudocódigo","Limitado a patrones de diseño de Gang of Four"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en langage de programmation pour la traduction de pseudocode","Limité aux modèles de conception de Gang of Four"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in der Programmiersprache für die Übersetzung von Pseudocode","Begrenzt auf Entwurfsmuster von Gang of Four"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de linguagem de programação para tradução de pseudocódigo","Limitado a padrões de design Gang of Four"],"ru":["Требует знания языка программирования для перевода псевдокода","Ограничен шаблонами проектирования Gang of Four"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة لغة البرمجة لترجمة البسودو كود","محدود لأنماط تصميم Gang of Four"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
