ode Virtuoso","ru":"Оркестратор кода: Claude Code Virtuoso","ar":"مؤلفو الشفرة: كلود كود فيرتوزو","en":"step-by-step"},"description":{"zh":"Claude 代码大师是一种 AI 编排工具，执行任务并遵循关键规则以确保高效的步骤执行","ja":"Claude コードマスターは、タスクを実行し重要なルールに従う AI オーケストレーションツールです","ko":"Claude 코드 가수는 작업을 실행하고 핵심 규칙을 따르는 AI 오케스트레이션 도구입니다","es":"Claude Code Virtuoso es una herramienta de orquestación AI que ejecuta tareas paso a paso con aprobación del usuario. Automatice tareas complejas con facilidad","fr":"Claude Code Virtuoso est un outil d''orchestration AI qui exécute des tâches étape par étape avec l''approbation de l''utilisateur. Automatisez des tâches compl...","de":"Claude Code Virtuoso ist ein AI-Orchestrierungstool, das Aufgaben schrittweise mit Benutzerzustimmung ausführt. Automatisieren Sie komplexe Aufgaben mit Leic...","pt":"O Claude Code Virtuoso é um orquestrador de código que executa tarefas de forma controlada, solicitando aprovação do usuário a cada passo.","ru":"Claude Code Virtuoso - это оркестратор кода, который выполняет задачи в контролируемом порядке, запрашивая одобрение пользователя на каждом шаге.","ar":"كلود كود فيرتوزو هو مؤلفو الشفرة الذي ينفذ المهام بطريقة مراقبة، يطلب موافقة المستخدم في كل خطوة.","en":"Claude Code Virtuoso - AI Orchestrator"},"definition":{"en":"Claude Code Virtuoso - AI Orchestrator"},"features":{"zh":["执行任务并遵循关键规则","使用 AskUserQuestion 工具进行用户交互","一步一步执行任务","需要用户明确批准","支持计划审批和错误恢复"],"ja":["タスクを実行し重要なルールに従う","AskUserQuestion ツールを使用してユーザーとやり取りする","一歩ずつタスクを実行する","ユーザーの明示的な承認が必要","プランの承認とエラーリカバリをサポート"],"ko":["작업을 실행하고 핵심 규칙을 따름","AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 사용자와 상호작용","一步一步으로 작업을 실행","사용자의 명시적인 승인이 필요","계획 승인 및 오류 복구 지원"],"es":["Ejecución de tareas paso a paso","Aprobación del usuario mediante AskUserQuestion","Orquestación de tareas complejas","Automatización de flujos de trabajo","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Exécution de tâches étape par étape","Approbation de l''utilisateur via AskUserQuestion","Orchestration de tâches complexes","Automatisation de flux de travail","Intégration avec des outils de développement"],"de":["Ausführung von Aufgaben schrittweise","Benutzerzustimmung über AskUserQuestion","Orchestrierung von komplexen Aufgaben","Automatisierung von Arbeitsabläufen","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Execução de tarefas passo a passo","Aprovação do usuário em cada etapa","Uso obrigatório da ferramenta AskUserQuestion","Recuperação de erros com aprovação do usuário","Planejamento e continuação de etapas com aprovação"],"ru":["Выполнение задач шаг за шагом","Одобрение пользователя на каждом этапе","Обязательное использование инструмента AskUserQuestion","Восстановление после ошибок с одобрения пользователя","Планирование и продолжение этапов с одобрения"],"ar":["تنفيذ المهام خطوة خطوة","موافقة المستخدم في كل مرحلة","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion إجباري","استعادة الخطأ مع موافقة المستخدم","التخطيط واستمرار المراحل مع الموافقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI 编排","代码大师","步骤执行","AskUserQuestion","计划审批","错误恢复","用户交互","任务执行"],"ja":["AI オーケストレーション","コードマスター","ステップ実行","AskUserQuestion","プランの承認","エラーリカバリ","ユーザーとやり取り","タスク実行"],"ko":["AI 오케스트레이션","코드 가수","스텝 실행","AskUserQuestion","계획 승인","오류 복구","사용자 상호작용","작업 실행"],"es":["orquestación AI","automatización de tareas","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","Claude Code Virtuoso","AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["orchestration AI","automatisation de tâches","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","Claude Code Virtuoso","AskUserQuestion"],"de":["AI-Orchestrierung","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Claude Code Virtuoso","AskUserQuestion"],"pt":["orquestrador de código","execução de tarefas","aprovação do usuário","ferramenta AskUserQuestion","recuperação de erros","planejamento de etapas","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["оркестратор кода","выполнение задач","одобрение пользователя","инструмент AskUserQuestion","восстановление после ошибок","планирование этапов","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مؤلفو الشفرة","تنفيذ المهام","موافقة المستخدم","أداة AskUserQuestion","استعادة الخطأ","تخطيط المراحل","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"emirrtopaloglu","repo":"claude-code-virtuoso","repoPath":"emirrtopaloglu/claude-code-virtuoso","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"step-by-step","description":"Execute a task one atomic step at a time, requiring approval for each.","bodyPreview":"You will execute the task: \"$ARGUMENTS\"\n\n**CRITICAL RULES:**\n1. Execute ONLY ONE step at a time\n2. **MANDATORY:** Use `AskUserQuestion` tool for ALL user interactions\n3. NEVER proceed without explicit user approval via `AskUserQuestion`\n\n# Mandatory Tool Usage\n\n**You MUST use `AskUserQuestion` for:**\n- Plan approval: \"Approve this plan? (Yes/No/Modify)\"\n- Step continuation: \"Continue to Step N? (Yes/No/Skip)\"\n- Clarifying questions: \"Which technology? (React/Vue/Angular)\"\n- Error recovery: \"Retr","body":"You will execute the task: \"$ARGUMENTS\"\n\n**CRITICAL RULES:**\n1. Execute ONLY ONE step at a time\n2. **MANDATORY:** Use `AskUserQuestion` tool for ALL user interactions\n3. NEVER proceed without explicit user approval via `AskUserQuestion`\n\n# Mandatory Tool Usage\n\n**You MUST use `AskUserQuestion` for:**\n- Plan approval: \"Approve this plan? (Yes/No/Modify)\"\n- Step continuation: \"Continue to Step N? (Yes/No/Skip)\"\n- Clarifying questions: \"Which technology? (React/Vue/Angular)\"\n- Error recovery: \"Retry/Skip/Abort?\"\n\n**DO NOT use plain text questions.** Always invoke `AskUserQuestion` tool.\n\n# Optional Agent Collaboration\n\nDepending on the task, you may need:\n- `@backend-architect` - For backend implementation\n- `@frontend-architect` - For UI implementation\n- `@mobile-architect` - For mobile implementation\n\n# Workflow\n\n1.  **Parse Task:** Understand \"$ARGUMENTS\"\n   - If empty: Error (see error handling)\n\n2.  **Create Plan:** Break task into 3-7 atomic steps\n   - Show full plan to user\n   - **USE `AskUserQuestion`:** \"Approve this plan? (Yes/No/Modify)\"\n\n3.  **Execute Step 1:**\n   - Show: \"📍 Step 1/N: [Description]\"\n   - Perform the action (create file, edit code, etc.)\n   - Show: \"✅ Step 1 completed: [What was done]\"\n\n4.  **Ask for Approval:**\n   - **USE `AskUserQuestion`:** \"Continue to Step 2? (Yes/No/Skip)\"\n   - If No: Stop and exit\n   - If Skip: Move to Step 3\n\n5.  **Repeat for Each Step**\n\n6.  **Final Summary:**\n   - Show all completed steps\n   - Suggest next action (e.g., \"Run /polish to clean up\")\n\n# Step Planning Guidelines\n\n**Good Steps (Atomic):**\n- ✅ \"Create user model in database schema\"\n- ✅ \"Add API endpoint GET /users/:id\"\n- ✅ \"Create UserProfile component\"\n\n**Bad Steps (Too broad):**\n- ❌ \"Implement the entire user system\"\n- ❌ \"Build the frontend\"\n\n# Example Flow\n\n```\nUser: /step-by-step \"Implement the login page\"\n\nAssistant:\n📋 Task Plan:\n1. Create Login.tsx component with email/password form\n2. Add form validation (email format, password length)\n3. Create POST /auth/login API endpoint\n4. Connect frontend form to API\n5. Add error handling and loading states\n6. Add \"Forgot Password?\" link\n\nApprove this plan? (Yes/No/Modify)\n\nUser: Yes\n\nAssistant:\n📍 Step 1/6: Create Login.tsx component with email/password form\n\n[Creates file with code]\n\n✅ Step 1 completed: Created src/components/Login.tsx with form structure\n\nContinue to Step 2? (Yes/No/Skip)\n```\n\n# Error Handling\n\n**If $ARGUMENTS is empty:**\n- Error: \"❌ No task provided. Usage: /step-by-step [task description]\"\n- Example: `/step-by-step \"Add user authentication\"`\n\n**If task is too vague:**\n- **USE `AskUserQuestion`:** Ask clarifying questions first\n- \"What technology should I use? (React/Vue/etc.)\"\n- \"Should this be frontend or backend?\"\n\n**If step fails (e.g., file creation error):**\n- Report error with details\n- **USE `AskUserQuestion`:** \"Retry this step? (Yes/Skip/Abort)\"\n- If Abort: Stop execution and summarize what was completed\n\n**If user says \"No\" to continue:**\n- Summarize completed steps\n- **USE `AskUserQuestion`:** \"Would you like to resume later or abort?\"\n- Save progress context if possible\n\n**If step limit exceeded (>20 steps):**\n- Warn: \"⚠️ This task has >20 steps. Consider breaking it into smaller tasks.\"\n- Ask: \"Continue anyway or split the task?\"\n\n# Success Criteria\n\n- [ ] Task broken into clear atomic steps\n- [ ] Each step executed only after approval\n- [ ] Progress visible at each stage\n- [ ] Final summary provided\n- [ ] User knows what to do next\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:46:09.346Z","qualityScore":40}');
