tion ou le débogage","Inspection des journaux de console du navigateur","Validation des soumissions de formulaires et des flux d''utilisateur","Vérification de la conception réactive sur différents points de vue"],"de":["Tests von Frontend-Funktionen","Debuggen von Webanwendungsproblemen","Bildschirmaufnahmen für Dokumentation oder Debuggen","Überprüfung der Browser-Konsole-Protokolle","Validierung von Formulareingaben und Benutzerflüssen","Überprüfung des responsiven Designs auf verschiedenen Ansichtsbreiten"],"pt":["Teste de funcionalidade frontend em um navegador real","Verificação de comportamento de UI e interações","Depuração de problemas de aplicativos web","Captura de telas para documentação ou depuração","Inspeção de logs de console do navegador","Validação de envio de formulários e fluxos de usuário"],"ru":["Тестирование функциональности frontend в реальном браузере","Проверка поведения UI и взаимодействий","Отладка проблем веб-приложений","Создание скриншотов для документации или отладки","Просмотр журналов консоли браузера","Валидация отправки форм и пользовательских потоков"],"ar":["اختبار الوظائف الأمامية في متصفح حقيقي","التحقق من سلوك الواجهة و التفاعلات","تصحيح مشاكل تطبيقات الويب","التقاط الشاشات لتوثيق أو تصحيح","فحص سجلات وحدة التحكم للمتصفح","التحقق من إرسال النماذج و تدفقات المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Web应用程序测试","Playwright自动化","前端功能测试","UI行为验证","Web应用程序调试","自动化测试"],"ja":["Webアプリケーションテスト","Playwright自動化","フロントエンド機能テスト","UIの動作検証","Webアプリケーションデバッグ","自動化テスト"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션 테스트","Playwright 자동화","프론트엔드 기능 테스트","UI 동작 확인","웹 애플리케이션 디버깅","자동화 테스트"],"es":["pruebas de aplicaciones web","playwright","automatización de pruebas","depuración de aplicaciones web","funcionalidades frontend","diseño responsivo","envíos de formularios","flujos de usuario"],"fr":["tests d''applications web","playwright","automatisation des tests","débogage d''applications web","fonctionnalités frontend","conception réactive","soumissions de formulaires","flux d''utilisateur"],"de":["webanwendungstests","playwright","automatisierung von tests","debuggen von webanwendungen","frontend-funktionen","responsives design","formulareingaben","benutzerflüsse"],"pt":["teste de aplicativos web","automatização de testes","playwright","desenvolvimento web","depuração de aplicativos web","testes de frontend","testes de UI","validação de formulários"],"ru":["тестирование веб-приложений","автоматизация тестирования","playwright","веб-разработка","отладка веб-приложений","тесты frontend","тесты UI","валидация форм"],"ar":["اختبار تطبيقات الويب","أتمتة الاختبارات","playwright","تطوير الويب","تصحيح تطبيقات الويب","اختبارات الواجهة الأمامية","اختبارات الواجهة","التحقق من النماذج"]}},"owner":"schuttpj","repo":"baseline-app","repoPath":"schuttpj/baseline-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"webapp-testing","description":"Toolkit for interacting with and testing local web applications using Playwright. Supports verifying frontend functionality, debugging UI behavior, capturing browser screenshots, and viewing browser logs.","bodyPreview":"# Web Application Testing\n\nThis skill enables comprehensive testing and debugging of local web applications using Playwright automation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Test frontend functionality in a real browser\n- Verify UI behavior and interactions\n- Debug web application issues\n- Capture screenshots for documentation or debugging\n- Inspect browser console logs\n- Validate form submissions and user flows\n- Check responsive design across viewports\n\n## Prerequisit","body":"# Web Application Testing\n\nThis skill enables comprehensive testing and debugging of local web applications using Playwright automation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Test frontend functionality in a real browser\n- Verify UI behavior and interactions\n- Debug web application issues\n- Capture screenshots for documentation or debugging\n- Inspect browser console logs\n- Validate form submissions and user flows\n- Check responsive design across viewports\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js installed on the system\n- A locally running web application (or accessible URL)\n- Playwright will be installed automatically if not present\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Browser Automation\n- Navigate to URLs\n- Click buttons and links\n- Fill form fields\n- Select dropdowns\n- Handle dialogs and alerts\n\n### 2. Verification\n- Assert element presence\n- Verify text content\n- Check element visibility\n- Validate URLs\n- Test responsive behavior\n\n### 3. Debugging\n- Capture screenshots\n- View console logs\n- Inspect network requests\n- Debug failed tests\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n### Example 1: Basic Navigation Test\n```javascript\n// Navigate to a page and verify title\nawait page.goto(''http://localhost:3000'');\nconst title = await page.title();\nconsole.log(''Page title:'', title);\n```\n\n### Example 2: Form Interaction\n```javascript\n// Fill out and submit a form\nawait page.fill(''#username'', ''testuser'');\nawait page.fill(''#password'', ''password123'');\nawait page.click(''button[type=\"submit\"]'');\nawait page.waitForURL(''**/dashboard'');\n```\n\n### Example 3: Screenshot Capture\n```javascript\n// Capture a screenshot for debugging\nawait page.screenshot({ path: ''debug.png'', fullPage: true });\n```\n\n## Guidelines\n\n1. **Always verify the app is running** - Check that the local server is accessible before running tests\n2. **Use explicit waits** - Wait for elements or navigation to complete before interacting\n3. **Capture screenshots on failure** - Take screenshots to help debug issues\n4. **Clean up resources** - Always close the browser when done\n5. **Handle timeouts gracefully** - Set reasonable timeouts for slow operations\n6. **Test incrementally** - Start with simple interactions before complex flows\n7. **Use selectors wisely** - Prefer data-testid or role-based selectors over CSS classes\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Pattern: Wait for Element\n```javascript\nawait page.waitForSelector(''#element-id'', { state: ''visible'' });\n```\n\n### Pattern: Check if Element Exists\n```javascript\nconst exists = await page.locator(''#element-id'').count() > 0;\n```\n\n### Pattern: Get Console Logs\n```javascript\npage.on(''console'', msg => console.log(''Browser log:'', msg.text()));\n```\n\n### Pattern: Handle Errors\n```javascript\ntry {\n  await page.click(''#button'');\n} catch (error) {\n  await page.screenshot({ path: ''error.png'' });\n  throw error;\n}\n```\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Requires Node.js environment\n- Cannot test native mobile apps (use React Native Testing Library instead)\n- May have issues with complex authentication flows\n- Some modern frameworks may require specific configuration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:46:21.129Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automation Agents requiring advanced web application testing capabilities with Playwright automation","zh":"适用于需要高级Web应用程序测试功能的自动化代理，使用Playwright自动化","ja":"Playwright自動化を使用した高度なWebアプリケーションテスト機能を必要とする自動化エージェントに適しています","ko":"Playwright 자동화를 사용하여 고급 웹 애플리케이션 테스트 기능이 필요한 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización que requieren capacidades avanzadas de prueba de aplicaciones web con automatización de Playwright","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation nécessitant des capacités avancées de test d''applications Web avec l''automatisation Playwright","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungsagenten, die erweiterte Funktionen zur Webanwendungstest mit Playwright-Automatisierung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação que requerem capacidades avançadas de teste de aplicativos web com automação Playwright","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации, требующих расширенных возможностей тестирования веб-приложений с помощью автоматизации Playwright","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين الذين يتطلبون قدرات متقدمة لاختبار التطبيقات الويب باستخدام أتمتة Playwright"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate frontend functionality testing in real browsers, validate UI behavior, and inspect browser console logs using Playwright, enabling comprehensive debugging and verification of web application issues","zh":"赋予代理自动化前端功能测试的能力，在真实浏览器中验证UI行为，并使用Playwright检查浏览器控制台日志，从而实现对Web应用程序问题的全面调试和验证","ja":"エージェントにPlaywrightを使用してフロントエンドの機能テストを自動化し、リアルブラウザでUIの動作を検証し、ブラウザのコンソールログを検査する能力を与え、Webアプリケーションの問題の包括的なデバッグと検証を可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 Playwright를 사용하여 프론트엔드 기능 테스트를 자동화하고 실제 브라우저에서 UI 동작을 검증하며 브라우저 콘솔 로그를 검사할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여 웹 애플리케이션 문제의 종합적인 디버깅 및 검증을 가능하게 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la prueba de funcionalidad del frontend en navegadores reales, validar el comportamiento de la interfaz de usuario y inspeccionar los registros de la consola del navegador utilizando Playwright, lo que permite una depuración y verificación exhaustivas de los problemas de la aplicación web","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tests de fonctionnalité du frontend dans des navigateurs réels, de valider le comportement de l''interface utilisateur et d''inspecter les journaux de la console du navigateur en utilisant Playwright, permettant ainsi un débogage et une vérification exhaustifs des problèmes d''application Web","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Funktionalität des Frontends in Echtbrowsern zu automatisieren, das Verhalten der Benutzeroberfläche zu überprüfen und die Browser-Konsole-Protokolle mit Playwright zu überprüfen, wodurch eine umfassende Fehlersuche und Überprüfung von Webanwendungsproblemen ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar testes de funcionalidade de frontend em navegadores reais, validar o comportamento da interface do usuário e inspecionar logs de console do navegador usando Playwright, permitindo depuração e verificação abrangentes de problemas de aplicativos web","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать тестирование функциональности frontend в реальных браузерах, проверять поведение пользовательского интерфейса и осматривать журналы консоли браузера с помощью Playwright, обеспечивая всестороннюю отладку и верификацию проблем веб-приложений","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تشغيل اختبارات وظيفية أمامية في المتصفحات الحقيقية، التحقق من سلوك واجهة المستخدم وتفتيش سجلات محطة التحكم في المتصفح باستخدام Playwright، مما يسمح بالتصحيح الشامل والتحقق من مشاكل تطبيقات الويب"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating frontend functionality tests","Debugging web application issues","Validating form submissions and user flows","Capturing screenshots for documentation"],"zh":["自动化前端功能测试","调试Web应用程序问题","验证表单提交和用户流程","捕获屏幕截图用于文档"],"ja":["フロントエンドの機能テストの自動化","Webアプリケーションの問題のデバッグ","フォームの提出とユーザーフローを検証する","ドキュメント用のスクリーンショットのキャプチャ"],"ko":["프론트엔드 기능 테스트 자동화","웹 애플리케이션 문제 디버깅","폼 제출 및 사용자 흐름 검증","문서용 스크린샷 캡처"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas de funcionalidad del frontend","Depuración de problemas de aplicaciones web","Validación de envíos de formularios y flujos de usuario","Captura de pantallas para documentación"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests de fonctionnalité du frontend","Débogage des problèmes d''applications Web","Validation des soumissions de formulaires et des flux d''utilisateurs","Capture d''écran pour la documentation"],"de":["Automatisierung von Frontend-Funktionalitätstests","Fehlersuche bei Webanwendungsproblemen","Überprüfung von Formulareingaben und Benutzerflüssen","Bildschirmaufnahme für die Dokumentation"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de funcionalidade de frontend","Depurar problemas de aplicativos web","Validar envios de formulários e fluxos de usuário","Capturar telas para documentação"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование функциональности frontend","Отладить проблемы веб-приложений","Проверить отправку форм и потоков пользователей","Сделать снимки экрана для документации"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبارات الوظائف الأمامية","تصحيح أخطاء تطبيقات الويب","التحقق من إرسال الاستمارات وتدفقات المستخدم","التقاط لقطات الشاشة للتوثيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Playwright automation setup","Limited to local web applications"],"zh":["需要Playwright自动化设置","仅限本地Web应用程序"],"ja":["Playwright自動化の設定が必要","ローカルWebアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["Playwright 자동화 설정이 필요","로컬 웹 애플리케이션으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración de automatización de Playwright","Limitado a aplicaciones web locales"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''automatisation Playwright","Limité aux applications Web locales"],"de":["Benötigt Playwright-Automatisierungseinrichtung","Begrenzt auf lokale Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Requer configuração de automação Playwright","Limitado a aplicativos web locais"],"ru":["Требует настройки автоматизации Playwright","Ограничен локальными веб-приложениями"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد أتمتة Playwright","محدود للتطبيقات الويب المحلية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
