onal ayuda a convertir ideas en diseños completos a través del diálogo colaborativo","fr":"L''agent de croissance personnelle aide à transformer les idées en conceptions complètes par le dialogue collaboratif","de":"Der Selbstwachstums-AI-Agent hilft dabei, Ideen in vollständige Designs durch kollaborativen Dialog umzuwandeln","pt":"O Brainstorming é uma ferramenta de crescimento pessoal que ajuda a transformar ideias em designs completos","ru":"Мозговой штурм - это инструмент саморазвития, помогающий превратить идеи в полноценные дизайны","ar":"العصف الذهني هو أداة نمو ذاتي تساعد على تحويل الأفكار إلى تصاميم كاملة","en":"A Self-Growth AI Agent"},"definition":{"en":"A Self-Growth AI Agent"},"features":{"zh":["自然对话协助","项目背景理解","逐步设计呈现","实时反馈检查","设计规范输出"],"ja":["自然な対話によるアシスト","プロジェクト背景の理解","ステップバイステップのデザイン提示","リアルタイムのフィードバックチェック","デザイン仕様の出力"],"ko":["자연스러운 대화로 의사소통","프로젝트 상황 이해","逐步 디자인 제공","실시간 피드백 확인","디자인 사양 출력"],"es":["Diálogo colaborativo para refinar ideas","Presentación de diseños en secciones pequeñas","Verificación continua para asegurar la precisión","Integración con el contexto del proyecto actual","Generación de especificaciones detalladas"],"fr":["Dialogue collaboratif pour affiner les idées","Présentation de conceptions en petites sections","Vérification continue pour assurer la précision","Intégration avec le contexte du projet actuel","Génération de spécifications détaillées"],"de":["Kollaborativer Dialog zur Verfeinerung von Ideen","Präsentation von Designs in kleinen Abschnitten","Kontinuierliche Überprüfung zur Sicherstellung der Genauigkeit","Integration mit dem aktuellen Projektzusammenhang","Generierung detaillierter Spezifikationen"],"pt":["Diálogo colaborativo natural","Refinamento de ideias por meio de perguntas","Apresentação de designs em seções","Verificação de progresso após cada seção","Integração com projetos atuais"],"ru":["Естественное сотрудничество","Уточнение идей с помощью вопросов","Представление дизайнов по секциям","Проверка прогресса после каждой секции","Интеграция с текущими проектами"],"ar":["حوار تعاوني طبيعي","تحسين الأفكار من خلال الأسئلة","عرض التصاميم في أقسام","التحقق من التقدم بعد كل قسم","التكامل مع المشاريع الحالية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI头脑风暴","自然对话协助","设计开发","项目管理","AI技术","软件开发","产品设计"],"ja":["ブレインストーミングAI","自然な対話アシスト","デザイン開発","プロジェクトマネジメント","AI技術","ソフトウェア開発","製品設計"],"ko":["브레인스토밍 AI","자연스러운 대화","디자인 개발","프로젝트 관리","AI 기술","소프트웨어 개발","제품 디자인"],"es":["brainstorming","diseño colaborativo","generación de diseños","diálogo colaborativo","desarrollo de proyectos","crecimiento personal","agentes de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["brainstorming","conception collaborative","génération de conceptions","dialogue collaboratif","développement de projets","croissance personnelle","agents d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["brainstorming","kollaboratives Design","Design-Generierung","kollaborativer Dialog","Projektentwicklung","Selbstwachstum","Künstliche Intelligenz-Agenten"],"pt":["brainstorming","desenvolvimento de ideias","design de produtos","colaboração em equipe","ferramentas de crescimento pessoal","tecnologia de diálogo natural"],"ru":["мозговой штурм","генерация идей","дизайн продукта","командное сотрудничество","инструменты саморазвития","технология естественного диалога"],"ar":["العصف الذهني","تطوير الأفكار","تصميم المنتجات","التعاون الفريق","أدوات النمو الذاتي","تكنولوجيا الحوار الطبيعي"]}},"owner":"BaqiF2","repo":"Synapse-Agent","repoPath":"BaqiF2/Synapse-Agent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"brainstorming","description":"You MUST use this before any creative work - creating features, building components, adding functionality, or modifying behavior. Explores user intent, requirements and design before implementation.","bodyPreview":"# Brainstorming Ideas Into Designs\n\n## Overview\n\nHelp turn ideas into fully formed designs and specs through natural collaborative dialogue.\n\nStart by understanding the current project context, then ask questions one at a time to refine the idea. Once you understand what you''re building, present the design in small sections (200-300 words), checking after each section whether it looks right so far.\n\n## The Process\n\n**Understanding the idea:**\n- Check out the current project state first (files, d","body":"# Brainstorming Ideas Into Designs\n\n## Overview\n\nHelp turn ideas into fully formed designs and specs through natural collaborative dialogue.\n\nStart by understanding the current project context, then ask questions one at a time to refine the idea. Once you understand what you''re building, present the design in small sections (200-300 words), checking after each section whether it looks right so far.\n\n## The Process\n\n**Understanding the idea:**\n- Check out the current project state first (files, docs, recent commits)\n- Ask questions one at a time to refine the idea\n- Prefer multiple choice questions when possible, but open-ended is fine too\n- Only one question per message - if a topic needs more exploration, break it into multiple questions\n- Focus on understanding: purpose, constraints, success criteria\n\n**Exploring approaches:**\n- Propose 2-3 different approaches with trade-offs\n- Present options conversationally with your recommendation and reasoning\n- Lead with your recommended option and explain why\n\n**Presenting the design:**\n- Once you believe you understand what you''re building, present the design\n- Break it into sections of 200-300 words\n- Ask after each section whether it looks right so far\n- Cover: architecture, components, data flow, error handling, state behavior, edge cases, testing\n- Be ready to go back and clarify if something doesn''t make sense\n\n**Validating for testability (BDD readiness check):**\n\nAfter the full design is presented and validated, run every design point through this checklist before finalizing:\n\n| Dimension | Question to verify |\n|---|---|\n| Input/Output format | Are the exact formats of inputs and outputs specified? (data types, structure, encoding) |\n| Error & exception scenarios | Is every failure mode explicitly described with its expected behavior? (not just the happy path) |\n| Boundary & priority rules | When ambiguity or conflict can arise, are the resolution rules defined? (precedence, fallback, default values) |\n| State behavior | Is it clear what state persists, what is isolated, and what resets? (sessions, variables, side effects) |\n| Verifiable granularity | Can each behavior be independently tested with concrete steps and a single expected outcome? |\n| Ambiguity check | Are there any implicit assumptions that different readers could interpret differently? |\n\n**How to use the checklist:**\n- For each design section, evaluate all 6 dimensions\n- Any dimension that fails → go back to the user with a targeted question to fill the gap\n- Do NOT silently assume defaults — if the PRD will be consumed downstream (e.g., converted to BDD test cases), ambiguity is a defect\n- Only proceed to documentation once all design points pass all 6 dimensions\n- Mark dimensions as \"N/A\" only when genuinely not applicable (e.g., stateless operations have no state behavior)\n\n## After the Design\n\n**Documentation:**\n- Write the validated design to `docs/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>-design.md`\n- Use elements-of-style:writing-clearly-and-concisely skill if available\n- Commit the design document to git\n\n**Implementation (if continuing):**\n- Ask: \"Ready to set up for implementation?\"\n- Use superpowers:using-git-worktrees to create isolated workspace\n- Use superpowers:writing-plans to create detailed implementation plan\n\n## Key Principles\n\n- **One question at a time** - Don''t overwhelm with multiple questions\n- **Multiple choice preferred** - Easier to answer than open-ended when possible\n- **YAGNI ruthlessly** - Remove unnecessary features from all designs\n- **Explore alternatives** - Always propose 2-3 approaches before settling\n- **Incremental validation** - Present design in sections, validate each\n- **Be flexible** - Go back and clarify when something doesn''t make sense"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:46:13.610Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Collaborative AI Agents like Claude Code and LangChain needing advanced natural language processing for idea refinement and design specification.","zh":"适合于Claude Code和LangChain等需要高级自然语言处理来完善想法和设计规范的协作AI代理。","ja":"Claude CodeやLangChainなどの、高度な自然言語処理を利用してアイデアを洗練し、設計仕様を定義する必要があるコラボレーションAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 자연어 처리를 사용하여 아이디어를 정제하고 설계 사양을 정의하는 Claude Code 및 LangChain과 같은 협력 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Colaborativos como Claude Code y LangChain que necesitan un procesamiento avanzado de lenguaje natural para la refinación de ideas y la especificación de diseños.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA collaboratifs comme Claude Code et LangChain nécessitant un traitement avancé du langage naturel pour l''affinement des idées et la spécification de conception.","de":"Ideal für kollaborative KI-Agents wie Claude Code und LangChain, die erweiterte Verarbeitung von natürlicher Sprache für die Verfeinerung von Ideen und die Designspezifikation benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA Colaborativos como Claude Code e LangChain que necessitam de processamento avançado de linguagem natural para refinamento de ideias e especificação de design.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Коллаборативных ИИ Агентов, таких как Claude Code и LangChain, требующих продвинутой обработки естественного языка для усовершенствования идей и спецификации дизайна.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء الذكية التعاونية مثل Claude Code و LangChain التي تحتاج إلى معالجة لغة طبيعية متقدمة لتحسين الأفكار وتصميم المواصفات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to engage in collaborative dialogue for refining ideas, presenting designs in sections, and iteratively checking for accuracy, utilizing natural language processing and collaborative protocols like human-agent dialogue management.","zh":"赋予代理人通过协作对话来完善想法、按章节呈现设计并迭代检查准确性的能力，利用自然语言处理和协作协议，如人机对话管理。","ja":"アイデアの洗練、設計のセクション別提示、精度の反復チェックを行うためのコラボレーション対話をエージェントに可能にし、自然言語処理や人間エージェント対話管理などのコラボレーションプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"아이디어를 정제하고 설계를 섹션별로 제시하며 정확도를 반복적으로 확인하는 협력 대화를 에이전트가 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 자연어 처리 및 인간-에이전트 대화 관리와 같은 협력 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a participar en diálogos colaborativos para refinar ideas, presentar diseños en secciones y comprobar iterativamente la precisión, utilizando el procesamiento de lenguaje natural y protocolos de colaboración como la gestión del diálogo entre humanos y agentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de s''engager dans un dialogue collaboratif pour affiner les idées, présenter des conceptions en sections et vérifier itérativement l''exactitude, en utilisant le traitement du langage naturel et les protocoles de collaboration tels que la gestion du dialogue humain-agent.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, an kollaborativen Dialogen teilzunehmen, um Ideen zu verfeinern, Entwürfe in Abschnitten vorzustellen und iterativ auf Genauigkeit zu überprüfen, unter Nutzung von natürlicher Sprachverarbeitung und kollaborativen Protokollen wie der Mensch-Agent-Dialogverwaltung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a se engajarem em diálogos colaborativos para refinar ideias, apresentar projetos em seções e verificar iterativamente a precisão, utilizando processamento de linguagem natural e protocolos colaborativos como gerenciamento de diálogo humano-agente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью участвовать в коллаборативном диалоге для усовершенствования идей, представления дизайнов в разделах и итеративной проверки точности, используя обработку естественного языка и коллаборативные протоколы, такие как управление диалогом между человеком и агентом.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من المشاركة في حوار تعاوني لتحسين الأفكار وطرح التصاميم في أقسام والتحقق المتكرر من الدقة، باستخدام معالجة اللغة الطبيعية والبروتوكولات التعاونية مثل إدارة الحوار بين الإنسان والوكيل."},"useCases":{"en":["Refining project ideas through iterative questioning","Generating detailed design specifications","Collaborating with humans to turn ideas into actionable plans"],"zh":["通过迭代提问来完善项目想法","生成详细的设计规范","与人类合作将想法转化为可执行的计划"],"ja":["反復質問によってプロジェクトアイデアを洗練する","詳細な設計仕様を生成する","人間と協力してアイデアを実行可能な計画に変換する"],"ko":["반복적인 질문을 통해 프로젝트 아이디어를 정제하는 것","詳細한 설계 사양을 생성하는 것","인간과 협력하여 아이디어를 실행 가능한 계획으로 전환하는 것"],"es":["Refinar ideas de proyecto a través de preguntas iterativas","Generar especificaciones de diseño detalladas","Colaborar con humanos para convertir ideas en planes de acción"],"fr":["Affiner les idées de projet par questions itératives","Générer des spécifications de conception détaillées","Collaborer avec des humains pour transformer les idées en plans d''action"],"de":["Projektideen durch iterative Fragen verfeinern","Detaillierte Designspezifikationen generieren","Mit Menschen zusammenarbeiten, um Ideen in handhabbare Pläne umzusetzen"],"pt":["Refinamento de ideias de projeto por meio de questionamento iterativo","Geração de especificações de design detalhadas","Colaboração com humanos para transformar ideias em planos de ação"],"ru":["Усовершенствование идей проекта посредством итеративного вопроса","Генерация детальных спецификаций дизайна","Сотрудничество с людьми для превращения идей в действенные планы"],"ar":["تحسين أفكار المشروع من خلال الاستفهام المتكرر","توليد مواصفات تصميم مفصلة","التعاون مع البشر لتحويل الأفكار إلى خطط عمل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires natural language understanding capabilities","Dependent on agent''s ability to engage in collaborative dialogue"],"zh":["需要自然语言理解能力","依赖于代理人的协作对话能力"],"ja":["自然言語理解能力が必要","エージェントのコラボレーション対話能力に依存する"],"ko":["자연어 이해 능력이 필요함","에이전트의 협력 대화 능력에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de comprensión del lenguaje natural","Depende de la capacidad del agente para participar en diálogos colaborativos"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités de compréhension du langage naturel","Dépend de la capacité de l''agent à s''engager dans des dialogues collaboratifs"],"de":["Benötigt Fähigkeiten zur Verständigung von natürlicher Sprache","Hängt von der Fähigkeit des Agents ab, an kollaborativen Dialogen teilzunehmen"],"pt":["Exige capacidades de compreensão de linguagem natural","Depende da capacidade do agente de se engajar em diálogo colaborativo"],"ru":["Требует возможностей понимания естественного языка","Зависит от способности агента участвовать в коллаборативном диалоге"],"ar":["يتطلب قدرات فهم اللغة الطبيعية","يعتمد على قدرة الوكيل على المشاركة في حوار تعاوني"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
