파일을 업데이트합니다","es":"Claude Docs es un agente que sincroniza la documentación con cambios de código, actualizando archivos como README.md y documentación de API.","fr":"Claude Docs est un agent qui synchronise la documentation avec les modifications de code, mettant à jour des fichiers tels que README.md et la documentation ...","de":"Claude Docs ist ein Agent, der die Dokumentation mit Codeänderungen synchronisiert und Dateien wie README.md und API-Dokumentation aktualisiert.","pt":"O agente Docs sincroniza documentação com alterações de código, atualizando arquivos como README e CLAUDE","ru":"Агент Docs синхронизирует документацию с изменениями кода, обновляя файлы, такие как README и CLAUDE","ar":"يزامن وكلاء الوثائق التوثيق مع تغييرات الشفرة، وتحديث الملفات مثل README و CLAUDE","en":"My personal Claude Code Configuration"},"definition":{"en":"My personal Claude Code Configuration"},"features":{"zh":["自动更新README和API文档","支持全仓库文档审计","可指定范围更新目标文档","适用于代码变更、API修改、配置更新等场景","简化文档维护流程"],"ja":["READMEやAPIドキュメントの自動更新","全リポジトリドキュメントオーディットをサポート","対象ドキュメントの更新範囲を指定可能","コードの変更、APIの修正、設定の更新などに適しています","ドキュメントのメンテナンスプロセスを簡素化"],"ko":["README 및 API 문서 자동 업데이트","전체 저장소 문서 감사를 지원","대상 문서의 업데이트 범위를 지정할 수 있음","코드 변경, API 수정, 구성 업데이트 등에 적합","문서 유지 관리 프로세스를 간소화"],"es":["Actualiza automáticamente archivos de documentación","Sincroniza cambios de código con la documentación","Soporta actualizaciones de README.md y documentación de API","Permite auditorías de documentación completas o específicas","Se integra con cambios de código y estructura de proyectos"],"fr":["Mette à jour automatiquement les fichiers de documentation","Synchronise les modifications de code avec la documentation","Prend en charge les mises à jour de README.md et de la documentation de l''API","Permet des audits de documentation complets ou spécifiques","S''intègre avec les modifications de code et la structure de projet"],"de":["Aktualisiert automatisch Dokumentationsdateien","Synchronisiert Codeänderungen mit der Dokumentation","Unterstützt Aktualisierungen von README.md und API-Dokumentation","Ermöglicht vollständige oder spezifische Dokumentationsaudits","Integriert sich mit Codeänderungen und Projektstruktur"],"pt":["Sincronização de documentação com alterações de código","Atualização automática de arquivos README e CLAUDE","Suporte a auditoria de documentação completa do repositório","Possibilidade de especificar escopo para documentação alvo","Integração com atualizações de dependências e reestruturação de arquivos"],"ru":["Синхронизация документации с изменениями кода","Автоматическое обновление файлов README и CLAUDE","Поддержка полной аудитории документации репозитория","Возможность указать объем для целевой документации","Интеграция с обновлениями зависимостей и переструктуризациями файлов"],"ar":["مزامنة التوثيق مع تغييرات الشفرة","تحديث تلقائي لملفات README و CLAUDE","دعم تدقيق التوثيق الكامل للمخزن","امكانية تحديد نطاق لتوثيق الهدف","التكامل مع تحديثات الإعتماد واعادة هيكلة الملفات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码文档同步","自动更新文档","README更新","API文档更新","代码变更","文档维护"],"ja":["コードドキュメント同期","自動ドキュメント更新","README更新","APIドキュメント更新","コードの変更","ドキュメントメンテナンス"],"ko":["코드 문서 동기화","자동 문서 업데이트","README 업데이트","API 문서 업데이트","코드 변경","문서 유지 관리"],"es":["documentación automatizada","Claude Docs","sincronización de código","actualización de documentación","README.md","documentación de API","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["documentation automatisée","Claude Docs","synchronisation de code","mise à jour de documentation","README.md","documentation de l''API","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["automatisierte Dokumentation","Claude Docs","Code-Synchronisation","Dokumentenaktualisierung","README.md","API-Dokumentation","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools"],"pt":["documentação de código","sincronização de documentação","README","CLAUDE","auditoria de documentação","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","gerenciamento de documentação"],"ru":["документация кода","синхронизация документации","README","CLAUDE","аудитория документации","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","управление документацией"],"ar":["توثيق الشفرة","مزامنة التوثيق","README","CLAUDE","تدقيق التوثيق","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","إدارة التوثيق"]}},"owner":"utkudarilmaz","repo":"claude-code-setup","repoPath":"utkudarilmaz/claude-code-setup","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"docs","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to update documentation, document this change, sync docs with code, audit documentation, restructure docs, update README, update CLAUDE.md, or /docs. Supports scoped, comprehensive (all), and restructuring (simplifier) modes.","bodyPreview":"# Docs\n\n## Overview\n\nDispatch the docs agent to synchronize documentation with code changes. The agent updates README.md, CLAUDE.md, API docs, and other documentation files.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- After implementing new features\n- After modifying APIs or endpoints\n- After changing configuration options\n- After restructuring files or directories\n- After updating dependencies\n- After any significant code modification\n- With \"all\" for full repository documentation audit\n- With specific scope for target","body":"# Docs\n\n## Overview\n\nDispatch the docs agent to synchronize documentation with code changes. The agent updates README.md, CLAUDE.md, API docs, and other documentation files.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- After implementing new features\n- After modifying APIs or endpoints\n- After changing configuration options\n- After restructuring files or directories\n- After updating dependencies\n- After any significant code modification\n- With \"all\" for full repository documentation audit\n- With specific scope for targeted documentation\n\n## Invocation Modes\n\n### Default: `/docs`\n\nDocuments current or recent changes. Agent identifies recently modified files and updates related documentation.\n\n```\nTask tool with subagent_type=\"docs\"\nprompt: \"Review recent code changes and update all affected documentation.\nIdentify modified files, update relevant docs.\"\n```\n\n### Scoped: `/docs <scope>`\n\nDocuments only the specified scope (file, module, feature).\n\n```\nTask tool with subagent_type=\"docs\"\nprompt: \"Review and update documentation for: [scope]\nFocus only on this area. Update all relevant documentation files.\"\n```\n\n**Scope examples:**\n- `/docs src/auth` - document authentication module\n- `/docs API` - document all API endpoints\n- `/docs README` - update only README.md\n- `/docs config` - document configuration options\n- `/docs UserService` - document specific class/service\n\n### Comprehensive: `/docs all`\n\nWhen invoked with `/docs all`, perform a **planned, modular documentation update** covering every aspect of the repository.\n\n**CRITICAL: Do not skip any aspect. Continue until ALL areas are reviewed.**\n\n### Execution Flow\n\n1. **Explore repository structure** - Identify all code areas requiring documentation\n2. **Create TodoWrite plan** - One todo item per documentation aspect\n3. **Process sequentially** - Complete each aspect before moving to next\n4. **Mark progress** - Update todos as each section completes\n\n### Documentation Aspects to Review\n\nProcess each area one-by-one:\n\n| Aspect | What to Document |\n|--------|------------------|\n| Project overview | README.md intro, badges, description |\n| Installation | Setup steps, prerequisites, dependencies |\n| Configuration | Environment variables, config files, options |\n| API reference | Endpoints, functions, parameters, responses |\n| Architecture | Directory structure, design patterns, data flow |\n| Components/Modules | Each major module''s purpose and usage |\n| Database/Models | Schema, relationships, migrations |\n| Authentication | Auth flows, permissions, security |\n| Testing | How to run tests, test structure, coverage |\n| Deployment | Build process, CI/CD, hosting |\n| Contributing | Code style, PR process, conventions |\n| CLAUDE.md | Codebase instructions for AI assistants |\n\n### Example: Full Audit\n\n```\n/docs all\n```\n\nCreates todos like:\n- [ ] Document project overview in README.md\n- [ ] Document installation and setup\n- [ ] Document configuration options\n- [ ] Document API endpoints\n- [ ] Document architecture and directory structure\n- [ ] Document each major module\n- [ ] Document database models\n- [ ] Document authentication flow\n- [ ] Document testing approach\n- [ ] Document deployment process\n- [ ] Update CLAUDE.md with codebase patterns\n\nThen dispatches docs agent for each aspect sequentially, marking complete as each finishes.\n\n### Simplifier Mode: `/docs simplifier`\n\nWhen invoked with `/docs simplifier`, perform a **documentation restructuring analysis and execution** to transform monolithic documentation into a modular structure.\n\n**Purpose:** Analyze existing documentation, identify files needing restructuring, propose a modular split plan, and execute with proper cross-linking.\n\n#### Execution Flow\n\n1. **Analyze Current Structure**\n   - Measure line counts of all documentation files\n   - Identify files exceeding 300 lines\n   - Map existing cross-references and links\n   - Detect logical sections that can be extracted\n\n2. **Create TodoWrite Plan** - One todo per restructuring action\n\n3. **Execute Restructuring**\n   - Create modular directory structure (docs/architecture/, docs/guides/, docs/api/)\n   - Extract sections to new files\n   - Add navigation breadcrumbs\n   - Update cross-references in original files\n\n4. **Report Summary**\n   - Files created/modified\n   - Links added\n   - Size reduction achieved\n\n#### Simplifier Analysis Checklist\n\n| Check | Threshold | Action |\n|-------|-----------|--------|\n| README.md length | >300 lines | Extract to docs/guides/ |\n| CLAUDE.md length | >200 lines | Extract examples to docs/ |\n| Single doc file | >300 lines | Split by H2 sections |\n| API documentation | >10 endpoints | Create docs/api/endpoints/ |\n| Architecture docs | >3 diagrams | Create docs/architecture/diagrams/ |\n\n#### Simplifier vs All Mode\n\n| Aspect | `/docs all` | `/docs simplifier` |\n|--------|-------------|-------------------|\n| **Purpose** | Comprehensive content audit | Structure optimization |\n| **Focus** | Documentation completeness | Documentation organization |\n| **Creates** | Missing documentation | Modular file structure |\n| **When to use** | Content gaps exist | Files too large/complex |\n\n## What the Agent Updates\n\n- README.md - project overview, setup, usage\n- CLAUDE.md - codebase instructions\n- API documentation\n- Configuration docs\n- Any docs/* files\n\n## Supported File Types\n\n| File Type | Extension | Purpose | Validation Rules |\n|-----------|-----------|---------|------------------|\n| Markdown | .md | Primary documentation | Valid markdown, working links |\n| Postman | .json | API testing collection | Valid JSON, camelCase fields |\n| Draw.io | .drawio | Architecture diagrams | Opens in draw.io, has export |\n| Images | .png, .svg | Diagram exports | Referenced in markdown |\n\n### Postman Collection Validation\n\nWhen updating `postman_collection.json`:\n- Validate JSON structure\n- Ensure all field names use camelCase\n- Add missing endpoints from codebase\n- Include realistic example data\n\n### Draw.io Diagram Guidelines\n\nWhen working with `.drawio` files:\n- Store in `docs/architecture/diagrams/`\n- Export PNG to same directory\n- Reference in markdown with relative paths\n\n## Examples\n\n**After adding a feature:**\n```\n/docs\n→ Reviews recent changes, updates affected documentation\n```\n\n**Document specific module:**\n```\n/docs src/services/payment\n→ Focuses only on payment service documentation\n```\n\n**Document API only:**\n```\n/docs API\n→ Updates only API-related documentation\n```\n\n**Full project audit:**\n```\n/docs all\n→ Creates plan, systematically documents every aspect\n```\n\n**Restructure large documentation:**\n```\n/docs simplifier\n→ Analyzes file sizes, proposes modular structure, executes split\n```\n\n**Document with diagram:**\n```\n/docs architecture\n→ Updates docs/architecture/, ensures .drawio files have exports\n```\n\n**Validate API collection:**\n```\n/docs postman\n→ Validates postman_collection.json, ensures camelCase\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:46:36.850Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Maintenance Agents requiring automated documentation synchronization with code changes","zh":"适合需要自动同步代码变更的代码维护代理","ja":"コードの変更に合わせたドキュメントの自動同期が必要なコードメンテナンスエージェントに最適","ko":"코드 변경에 따른 문서 자동 동기화가 필요한 코드 유지 보수 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de mantenimiento de código que requieren sincronización automatizada de la documentación con los cambios en el código","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de maintenance de code nécessitant une synchronisation automatisée de la documentation avec les modifications du code","de":"Ideal für Code-Wartungs-Agents, die eine automatisierte Synchronisierung der Dokumentation mit Codeänderungen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Manutenção de Código que exigem sincronização automática de documentação com alterações de código","ru":"Идеально для агентов по обслуживанию кода, требующих автоматической синхронизации документации с изменениями кода","ar":"مثالي لعميل صيانة الشفرة الذي يتطلب تنسيقا تلقائيا للوثائق مع تغييرات الشفرة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to update README.md, CLAUDE.md, API docs, and other documentation files using Markdown format, ensuring consistency and accuracy after significant code modifications, API changes, or dependency updates","zh":"赋予代理更新README.md、CLAUDE.md、API文档和其他使用Markdown格式的文档文件的能力，确保在代码修改、API更改或依赖更新后的一致性和准确性","ja":"README.md、CLAUDE.md、APIドキュメントなどのMarkdown形式のドキュメントファイルを更新する機能をエージェントに与え、コードの変更、APIの変更、または依存関係の更新後に一貫性と正確性を確保する","ko":"README.md, CLAUDE.md, API 문서 및 기타 Markdown 형식의 문서 파일을 업데이트하는 기능을 에이전트에 제공하여 코드 수정, API 변경 또는 의존성 업데이트 후的一致성 및 정확성을 보장","es":"Permite a los agentes actualizar README.md, CLAUDE.md, documentación de API y otros archivos de documentación utilizando formato Markdown, garantizando coherencia y precisión después de modificaciones significativas del código, cambios en la API o actualizaciones de dependencias","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre à jour README.md, CLAUDE.md, la documentation API et d''autres fichiers de documentation en utilisant le format Markdown, garantissant ainsi la cohérence et l''exactitude après des modifications importantes du code, des changements d''API ou des mises à jour de dépendances","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, README.md, CLAUDE.md, API-Dokumentationen und andere Dokumentationsdateien im Markdown-Format zu aktualisieren, wodurch Konsistenz und Genauigkeit nach signifikanten Codeänderungen, API-Änderungen oder Abhängigkeitsaktualisierungen gewährleistet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a atualizar arquivos README.md, CLAUDE.md, documentação de API e outros arquivos de documentação usando o formato Markdown, garantindo consistência e precisão após alterações significativas no código, mudanças de API ou atualizações de dependência","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обновлять файлы README.md, CLAUDE.md, документацию API и другие файлы документации, используя формат Markdown, обеспечивая последовательность и точность после значительных изменений кода, изменений API или обновлений зависимостей","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء تحديث ملفات README.md و CLAUDE.md ووثائق API والملفات الوثائقية الأخرى باستخدام تنسيق Markdown، مما يضمن الاتساق والدقة بعد تغييرات كبيرة في الشفرة أو تحديثات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات أو تحديثات الاعتماديات"},"useCases":{"en":["Synchronizing documentation after implementing new features","Updating API documentation after endpoint modifications","Performing full repository documentation audits"],"zh":["在实现新功能后同步文档","在端点修改后更新API文档","执行存储库的全部文档审核"],"ja":["新しい機能を実装した後にドキュメントを同期する","エンドポイントの変更後、APIドキュメントを更新する","リポジトリの全ドキュメントの監査を実行する"],"ko":["새로운 기능을 구현한 후에 문서를 동기화","엔드ポイント 수정 후 API 문서를 업데이트","리포지토리의 전체 문서 감사를 수행"],"es":["Sincronizar la documentación después de implementar nuevas funcionalidades","Actualizar la documentación de la API después de modificaciones en los endpoints","Realizar auditorías completas de la documentación del repositorio"],"fr":["Synchroniser la documentation après l''implémentation de nouvelles fonctionnalités","Mettre à jour la documentation API après des modifications d''endpoints","Effectuer des audits complets de la documentation du dépôt"],"de":["Synchronisieren der Dokumentation nach der Implementierung neuer Funktionen","Aktualisieren der API-Dokumentation nach Endpunktänderungen","Durchführung vollständiger Repository-Dokumentationsprüfungen"],"pt":["Sincronizar documentação após implementação de novos recursos","Atualizar documentação de API após modificações de endpoint","Realizar auditorias de documentação de repositório completo"],"ru":["Синхронизировать документацию после реализации новых функций","Обновить документацию API после изменений endpoint","Провести полную аудиторию документации репозитория"],"ar":["تماشاء الوثائق بعد تنفيذ ميزات جديدة","تحديث وثائق واجهة برمجة التطبيقات بعد تعديلات نقطة النهاية","إجراء تدقيق شامل لوثائق المستودع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to repository file system","Limited to Markdown-based documentation files","Needs to be triggered manually or through automation scripts after code changes"],"zh":["需要访问存储库文件系统","仅限于Markdown格式的文档文件","需要在代码更改后手动或通过自动化脚本触发"],"ja":["リポジトリのファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","Markdown形式のドキュメントファイルのみに限定される","コードの変更後、手動または自動化スクリプトを介してトリガーする必要がある"],"ko":["리포지토리의 파일 시스템에 접근할 수 있어야 함","Markdown 형식의 문서 파일만으로 제한","코드 변경 후 수동 또는 자동화 스크립트를 통해 트리거해야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos del repositorio","Limitado a archivos de documentación basados en Markdown","Debe activarse manualmente o mediante scripts de automatización después de cambios en el código"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers du dépôt","Limité aux fichiers de documentation basés sur Markdown","Doit être déclenché manuellement ou via des scripts d''automatisation après des modifications du code"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Repository-Dateisystem","Beschränkt auf Markdown-basierte Dokumentationsdateien","Muss manuell oder über Automatisierungsskripte nach Codeänderungen ausgelöst werden"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao sistema de arquivos do repositório","Limitado a arquivos de documentação baseados em Markdown","Precisa ser acionado manualmente ou por meio de scripts de automação após alterações de código"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файловой системе репозитория","Ограничен файлами документации на основе Markdown","Требует ручного или автоматического срабатывания через скрипты после изменений кода"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام ملفات المستودع","محدود بالملفات الوثائقية التي تعتمد على تنسيق Markdown","يحتاج إلى أن يُشغل يدويا أو من خلال سكريبتات أتمتة بعد تغييرات الشفرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
