 수 있습니다","es":"La estructura de Bellog define la organización de archivos y convenciones de nombramiento para el proyecto de blog.","fr":"La structure de Bellog définit l''organisation des fichiers et les conventions de nommage pour le projet de blog.","de":"Die Bellog-Struktur definiert die Dateiorganisation und Benennungskonventionen für das Blog-Projekt.","pt":"O Bellog é um projeto de blog personalizado com estrutura de arquivos e convenções de nomenclatura bem definidas.","ru":"Bellog - это проект блога с собственной структурой файлов и соглашениями об именовании.","ar":"بيلوج هو مشروع مدونة مخصص مع هيكل ملفات وتوافق تسمية محدد جيدًا.","en":"Castle Bell''s custom blog"},"definition":{"en":"Castle Bell''s custom blog"},"features":{"zh":["定义文件结构和组织模式","制定命名约定和规范","优化开发和维护效率","支持 Next.js 应用程序","提供清晰的项目结构和布局"],"ja":["ファイル構造と組織パターンを定義","命名規則と規範を定める","開発とメンテナンスの効率を最適化","Next.js アプリケーションをサポート","明確なプロジェクト構造とレイアウトを提供"],"ko":["파일 구조와 조직 패턴을 정의","명명 규칙과 규범을 설정","개발과 유지 보수를 최적화","Next.js 애플리케이션 지원","명확한 프로젝트 구조와 레이아웃 제공"],"es":["Organización de archivos y directorios","Convenciones de nombramiento de archivos y carpetas","Estructura de proyecto para Next.js","Implementación de layout y página de inicio","Uso de proveedores del lado del cliente"],"fr":["Organisation des fichiers et des répertoires","Conventions de nommage des fichiers et des dossiers","Structure de projet pour Next.js","Mise en œuvre de la disposition et de la page d''accueil","Utilisation de fournisseurs côté client"],"de":["Datei- und Verzeichnisorganisation","Benennungskonventionen für Dateien und Ordner","Projektstruktur für Next.js","Implementierung von Layout und Startseite","Verwendung von Client-seitigen Anbietern"],"pt":["Estrutura de arquivos organizada","Convenções de nomenclatura claras","Projeto de blog personalizado","Utiliza Next.js App Router","Inclui layout e metadata","Suporta transição de páginas"],"ru":["Организованная структура файлов","Ясные соглашения об именовании","Пользовательский проект блога","Использует Next.js App Router","Включает макет и метаданные","Поддерживает переход между страницами"],"ar":["هيكل ملفات منظم","توافق تسمية واضح","مشروع مدونة مخصص","يستخدم Next.js App Router","يشتمل على تصميم وبيانات وصفية","يدعم التحول بين الصفحات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Bellog 结构","自定义博客","文件组织","命名约定","Next.js","开发效率","维护效率"],"ja":["Bellog 構造","カスタムブログ","ファイル組織","命名規則","Next.js","開発効率","メンテナンス効率"],"ko":["Bellog 구조","맞춤형 블로그","파일 구성","명명 규칙","Next.js","개발 효율","유지 보수 효율"],"es":["estructura de archivos","convenciones de nombramiento","Next.js","desarrollo web","organización de proyectos","blog personalizado"],"fr":["structure de fichiers","conventions de nommage","Next.js","développement web","organisation de projets","blog personnalisé"],"de":["Dateistruktur","Benennungskonventionen","Next.js","Webentwicklung","Projektorganisation","benutzerdefinierter Blog"],"pt":["Estrutura de blog","Convenções de nomenclatura","Next.js","App Router","Layout","Metadata","Transição de páginas","Desenvolvimento web","Projeto de blog"],"ru":["Структура блога","Соглашения об именовании","Next.js","App Router","Макет","Метаданные","Переход между страницами","Веб-разработка","Проект блога"],"ar":["هيكل مدونة","توافق التسمية","Next.js","App Router","تصميم","بيانات وصفية","التحول بين الصفحات","تطوير الويب","مشروع مدونة"]}},"owner":"whddltjdwhd","repo":"bellog","repoPath":"whddltjdwhd/bellog","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bellog-structure","description":"Provides file organization and naming conventions for the Bellog project. Triggers when creating new files or reorganizing code.","bodyPreview":"# Bellog File Organization\n\nThis skill defines the file structure, naming conventions, and organization patterns for the Bellog blog project.\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\n/Users/castle_bell/Projects/bellog/\n├── src/\n│   ├── app/                    # Next.js App Router\n│   │   ├── layout.tsx          # Root layout with fonts & metadata\n│   │   ├── page.tsx            # Home page\n│   │   ├── template.tsx        # Page transition wrapper\n│   │   ├── providers.tsx       # Client-side providers\n│   │","body":"# Bellog File Organization\n\nThis skill defines the file structure, naming conventions, and organization patterns for the Bellog blog project.\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\n/Users/castle_bell/Projects/bellog/\n├── src/\n│   ├── app/                    # Next.js App Router\n│   │   ├── layout.tsx          # Root layout with fonts & metadata\n│   │   ├── page.tsx            # Home page\n│   │   ├── template.tsx        # Page transition wrapper\n│   │   ├── providers.tsx       # Client-side providers\n│   │   ├── posts/\n│   │   │   ├── page.tsx        # All posts page\n│   │   │   └── [slug]/\n│   │   │       └── page.tsx    # Individual post\n│   │   ├── api/\n│   │   │   └── revalidate/\n│   │   │       └── route.ts    # Cache revalidation endpoint\n│   │   ├── robots.ts           # SEO robots.txt\n│   │   └── sitemap.ts          # Dynamic sitemap\n│   │\n│   ├── components/\n│   │   ├── common/             # App-wide shared components\n│   │   │   ├── Navbar.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── Footer.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── Intro.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── Header.tsx\n│   │   │   └── ...\n│   │   ├── posts/              # Post-specific components\n│   │   │   ├── PostCard.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── PostList.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── PostRenderer.tsx\n│   │   │   ├── NotionToc.tsx\n│   │   │   └── ...\n│   │   └── ui/                 # Low-level UI primitives\n│   │       ├── Tag.tsx\n│   │       ├── ThemeToggle.tsx\n│   │       ├── switch.tsx\n│   │       └── ...\n│   │\n│   ├── hooks/                  # Custom React hooks\n│   │   ├── useScrollSpy.ts\n│   │   ├── useTocObserver.ts\n│   │   └── useHeadings.ts\n│   │\n│   ├── lib/                    # Business logic & utilities\n│   │   ├── notion.ts           # Notion API client\n│   │   ├── posts.ts            # Post data fetching\n│   │   ├── tags.ts             # Tag utilities\n│   │   └── utils.ts            # General utilities\n│   │\n│   ├── constants/              # Shared constants\n│   │   └── ui.ts               # UI-related constants\n│   │\n│   ├── types/                  # TypeScript types\n│   │   └── index.d.ts          # Global type definitions\n│   │\n│   └── styles/                 # Global styles\n│       └── global.css          # Theme variables + Tailwind\n│\n├── public/                     # Static assets\n├── .claude/                    # Claude Code configuration\n│   ├── agents/                 # Custom sub-agents\n│   └── skills/                 # Custom skills\n├── .github/                    # GitHub configuration\n│   └── PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md\n├── .husky/                     # Git hooks\n├── tailwind.config.ts          # Tailwind configuration\n├── tsconfig.json               # TypeScript configuration\n├── next.config.ts              # Next.js configuration\n├── package.json                # Dependencies & scripts\n├── commitlint.config.ts        # Commit message linting\n├── CLAUDE.md                   # Project guide\n└── README.md                   # Project documentation\n```\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\n### Components\n\n**Rule:** PascalCase\n\n```\n✅ Correct:\nPostCard.tsx\nNotionToc.tsx\nScrollToTop.tsx\nThemeToggle.tsx\n\n❌ Wrong:\npostCard.tsx\nnotion-toc.tsx\nscroll_to_top.tsx\n```\n\n### Hooks\n\n**Rule:** camelCase with `use` prefix\n\n```\n✅ Correct:\nuseScrollSpy.ts\nuseTocObserver.ts\nuseHeadings.ts\nuseScrollPosition.ts\n\n❌ Wrong:\nUseScrollSpy.ts\nscroll-spy-hook.ts\nscrollSpy.ts (missing use prefix)\n```\n\n### Utilities & Libraries\n\n**Rule:** camelCase\n\n```\n✅ Correct:\nnotion.ts\nposts.ts\ntags.ts\nutils.ts\n\n❌ Wrong:\nNotion.ts\nPosts.ts\ntag-utils.ts\n```\n\n### Types\n\n**Rule:** camelCase file, PascalCase exports\n\n```\n✅ Correct:\nFile: index.d.ts\nExport: interface Post { }\nExport: type PostStatus = ''published'' | ''draft'';\n\n❌ Wrong:\nFile: Post.d.ts\nExport: interface post { }\n```\n\n### Constants\n\n**Rule:** SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE for values, camelCase for file\n\n```\n✅ Correct:\nFile: ui.ts\nExports:\n  export const HEADER_OFFSET = 80;\n  export const SCROLL_SPY_OFFSET = 100;\n\n❌ Wrong:\nexport const headerOffset = 80;\nexport const header-offset = 80;\n```\n\n### API Routes\n\n**Rule:** camelCase folder, route.ts file\n\n```\n✅ Correct:\napp/api/revalidate/route.ts\n\n❌ Wrong:\napp/api/Revalidate/route.ts\napp/api/revalidate/revalidate.ts\n```\n\n## Where to Place Files\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n**Q: Is it a React component?**\n- Yes → `/src/components/`\n  - App-wide (Navbar, Footer) → `/src/components/common/`\n  - Post-specific (PostCard, NotionToc) → `/src/components/posts/`\n  - Reusable UI primitive (Tag, Button) → `/src/components/ui/`\n\n**Q: Is it a custom hook?**\n- Yes → `/src/hooks/use[Name].ts`\n\n**Q: Is it business logic or data fetching?**\n- Yes → `/src/lib/`\n  - Notion API → `/src/lib/notion.ts`\n  - Post data → `/src/lib/posts.ts`\n  - Utility functions → `/src/lib/utils.ts`\n\n**Q: Is it a constant value?**\n- Yes → `/src/constants/`\n  - UI-related → `/src/constants/ui.ts`\n  - API-related → `/src/constants/api.ts`\n\n**Q: Is it a TypeScript type?**\n- Yes → `/src/types/index.d.ts`\n\n**Q: Is it a page or route?**\n- Yes → `/src/app/[route]/page.tsx`\n\n**Q: Is it an API endpoint?**\n- Yes → `/src/app/api/[endpoint]/route.ts`\n\n## Component Organization\n\n### Common Components (`/src/components/common/`)\n\nComponents used across multiple pages:\n- Layout components (Navbar, Footer)\n- Page sections (Intro, Header)\n- Shared widgets (ProgressBar)\n\n**Examples:**\n- `Navbar.tsx` - Site navigation\n- `Footer.tsx` - Site footer\n- `Intro.tsx` - Hero section with animations\n- `ProgressBar.tsx` - Scroll progress indicator\n- `Header.tsx` - Page headers\n\n### Post Components (`/src/components/posts/`)\n\nComponents specific to blog posts:\n- Post rendering (PostRenderer)\n- Post navigation (NotionToc, PostNavigation)\n- Post lists (PostList, PostCard)\n\n**Examples:**\n- `PostCard.tsx` - Individual post preview\n- `PostList.tsx` - Grid of post cards\n- `PostRenderer.tsx` - Notion content renderer\n- `NotionToc.tsx` - Table of contents\n- `PostNavigation.tsx` - Previous/Next navigation\n- `GiscusComments.tsx` - Comment system\n\n### UI Components (`/src/components/ui/`)\n\nLow-level, reusable UI primitives:\n- Buttons, inputs, switches\n- Tags, badges\n- Shadcn/ui components\n\n**Examples:**\n- `Tag.tsx` - Tag display\n- `TagList.tsx` - Tag filtering\n- `ThemeToggle.tsx` - Dark/light mode toggle\n- `switch.tsx` - Radix UI switch (shadcn/ui)\n\n## File Templates\n\n### Component Template\n\n```typescript\n// For interactive components\n\"use client\";\n\nimport { useState } from ''react'';\nimport { motion } from ''framer-motion'';\n\ninterface ComponentNameProps {\n  // Props\n}\n\nexport function ComponentName({ }: ComponentNameProps) {\n  // Logic\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {/* JSX */}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Hook Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { useState, useEffect } from ''react'';\n\n/**\n * Brief description of what this hook does\n *\n * @example\n * const value = useHookName();\n */\nexport function useHookName() {\n  // Hook logic\n\n  return value;\n}\n```\n\n### Utility Template\n\n```typescript\n/**\n * Brief description of utility function\n *\n * @param paramName - Description\n * @returns Description\n */\nexport function utilityName(paramName: Type): ReturnType {\n  // Implementation\n}\n```\n\n### Type Definition Template\n\n```typescript\n// /src/types/index.d.ts\n\nexport interface Post {\n  id: string;\n  title: string;\n  slug: string;\n  date: string;\n  description: string;\n  tags: string[];\n  status: PostStatus;\n}\n\nexport type PostStatus = ''published'' | ''draft'' | ''archived'';\n```\n\n## Import Organization\n\n### Order\n\n```typescript\n// 1. React & Next.js\nimport { useState } from ''react'';\nimport Link from ''next/link'';\n\n// 2. Third-party libraries\nimport { motion } from ''framer-motion'';\nimport { Search } from ''lucide-react'';\n\n// 3. Internal imports (@/...)\nimport { Button } from ''@/components/ui/button'';\nimport { getAllPosts } from ''@/lib/posts'';\nimport { HEADER_OFFSET } from ''@/constants/ui'';\n\n// 4. Relative imports\nimport { helperFunction } from ''../utils'';\n\n// 5. Type imports (separate)\nimport type { Post } from ''@/types'';\n```\n\n### Path Aliases\n\nBellog uses `@/` for root imports:\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Correct\nimport { PostCard } from ''@/components/posts/PostCard'';\nimport { getAllPosts } from ''@/lib/posts'';\nimport { HEADER_OFFSET } from ''@/constants/ui'';\n\n// ❌ Wrong (no relative paths from root)\nimport { PostCard } from ''../../components/posts/PostCard'';\n```\n\n## Code Organization Patterns\n\n### Single Responsibility\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Good - Each file has one clear purpose\n// /src/lib/notion.ts - Notion API calls\n// /src/lib/posts.ts - Post data transformation\n// /src/lib/tags.ts - Tag utilities\n\n// ❌ Bad - Everything in one file\n// /src/lib/everything.ts\n```\n\n### Group Related Code\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Good - Related components together\n/src/components/posts/\n  PostCard.tsx\n  PostList.tsx\n  PostNavigation.tsx\n\n// ❌ Bad - All components flat\n/src/components/\n  PostCard.tsx\n  Navbar.tsx\n  PostList.tsx\n  Footer.tsx\n```\n\n### Constants Extraction\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Good - Constants in separate file\n// /src/constants/ui.ts\nexport const HEADER_OFFSET = 80;\nexport const SCROLL_SPY_OFFSET = 100;\n\n// Component uses constants\nimport { HEADER_OFFSET } from ''@/constants/ui'';\n\n// ❌ Bad - Magic numbers in component\nconst offset = 80; // What is this?\n```\n\n## File Size Guidelines\n\n**Components:** < 200 lines\n- If larger, consider splitting into smaller components\n\n**Hooks:** < 100 lines\n- If larger, consider extracting helper functions\n\n**Utils:** < 50 lines per function\n- If larger, break into smaller functions\n\n**Types:** No limit\n- Types can be long, that''s okay\n\n## Barrel Exports (Avoid)\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Avoid barrel exports (index.ts files)\n// /src/components/index.ts\nexport { PostCard } from ''./PostCard'';\nexport { PostList } from ''./PostList'';\n\n// ✅ Prefer direct imports\nimport { PostCard } from ''@/components/posts/PostCard'';\nimport { PostList } from ''@/components/posts/PostList'';\n```\n\n**Why:** Barrel exports slow down builds and complicate tree-shaking.\n\n## Environment Files\n\n```\n.env.local          # Local development secrets (gitignored)\n.env.example        # Template (committed to git)\n```\n\n**Never commit:**\n- `.env.local`\n- `.env`\n- Any file with actual secrets\n\n## Git Ignore Patterns\n\nEnsure these are in `.gitignore`:\n\n```\n# Dependencies\nnode_modules/\n.pnp\n.pnp.js\n\n# Next.js\n.next/\nout/\n\n# Environment\n.env.local\n.env\n\n# IDE\n.vscode/\n.idea/\n\n# OS\n.DS_Store\n```\n\n## Documentation Structure\n\n```\n/                           # Root\n├── README.md              # Project overview & setup\n├── CLAUDE.md              # Development guide (for AI)\n└── docs/                  # Detailed documentation (if needed)\n    ├── architecture.md\n    └── deployment.md\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```\nComponents:     PascalCase.tsx      /src/components/{common,posts,ui}/\nHooks:          useName.ts          /src/hooks/\nUtilities:      name.ts             /src/lib/\nConstants:      NAME                /src/constants/\nTypes:          name.d.ts           /src/types/\nPages:          page.tsx            /src/app/[route]/\nAPI:            route.ts            /src/app/api/[endpoint]/\n```\n\n## Checklist for New Files\n\n- [ ] File in correct directory\n- [ ] Naming convention followed (PascalCase / camelCase)\n- [ ] Imports organized by category\n- [ ] Using @ alias for imports (not relative from root)\n- [ ] TypeScript types defined\n- [ ] No magic numbers (use constants)\n- [ ] Single responsibility (one clear purpose)\n- [ ] File size reasonable (< 200 lines for components)\n\nRemember: Organization is about findability. When someone looks for a file, it should be obvious where it is.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:47:43.257Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Next.js Development Agents requiring structured project scaffolding and file organization.","zh":"适用于需要结构化项目脚手架和文件组织的 Next.js 开发代理。","ja":"Next.js 開発エージェントに構造化されたプロジェクトのスケルトンとファイルの組織化が必要な場合に不可欠です。","ko":"구조화된 프로젝트 스캐폴딩과 파일 조직이 필요한 Next.js 개발 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de desarrollo de Next.js que requieren una estructura de proyecto y organización de archivos estructuradas.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de développement Next.js nécessitant une structure de projet et une organisation de fichiers structurées.","de":"Wesentlich für Next.js-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine strukturierte Projektverzeichnisstruktur und Dateiorganisation benötigen.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Next.js que exigem estrutura de scaffolding de projeto e organização de arquivos.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов разработки Next.js, требующих структурированного каркаса проекта и организации файлов.","ar":"ضروري لعميل تطوير Next.js الذي يتطلب هيكلة مشروع منظمة وتنظيم الملفات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Provides standardized Next.js App Router structure with layout.tsx, page.tsx, template.tsx, and providers.tsx patterns, enabling consistent project navigation and component management.","zh":"提供标准化的 Next.js 应用程序路由器结构，包括 layout.tsx、page.tsx、template.tsx 和 providers.tsx 模式，实现一致的项目导航和组件管理。","ja":"標準化された Next.js アプリケーション ルーター構造を提供し、layout.tsx、page.tsx、template.tsx、providers.tsx パターンを実現し、プロジェクトのナビゲーションとコンポーネントの管理を一貫して実現します。","ko":"표준화된 Next.js 애플리케이션 라우터 구조를 제공하며, layout.tsx, page.tsx, template.tsx, providers.tsx 패턴을 통해 일관된 프로젝트 탐색과 컴포넌트 관리를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Proporciona una estructura de enrutador de aplicaciones Next.js estandarizada con patrones layout.tsx, page.tsx, template.tsx y providers.tsx, lo que permite una navegación de proyecto y gestión de componentes coherentes.","fr":"Fournit une structure d''application Next.js standardisée avec des modèles layout.tsx, page.tsx, template.tsx et providers.tsx, permettant une navigation de projet et une gestion de composants cohérentes.","de":"Bietet eine standardisierte Next.js-App-Router-Struktur mit layout.tsx-, page.tsx-, template.tsx- und providers.tsx-Mustern, die eine konsistente Projekt-navigation und Komponentenverwaltung ermöglichen.","pt":"Fornece estrutura de roteador de aplicativos Next.js padronizada com padrões layout.tsx, page.tsx, template.tsx e providers.tsx, permitindo navegação de projeto consistente e gerenciamento de componentes.","ru":"Предоставляет стандартизированную структуру маршрутизатора приложения Next.js с шаблонами layout.tsx, page.tsx, template.tsx и providers.tsx, обеспечивающую последовательную навигацию по проекту и управление компонентами.","ar":"توفر هيكلة موزع تطبيق Next.js معايير مع padrões layout.tsx و page.tsx و template.tsx و providers.tsx، مما يسمح بالتنقل المستمر في المشروع وإدارة المكونات."},"useCases":{"en":["Scaffolding new Next.js blog projects","Enforcing file naming conventions","Organizing App Router components","Maintaining project structure consistency"],"zh":["为新的 Next.js 博客项目创建脚手架","强制实施文件命名约定","组织应用程序路由器组件","维护项目结构的一致性"],"ja":["新しい Next.js ブログ プロジェクトのスケルトンを作成する","ファイル命名規約を適用する","アプリケーション ルーター コンポーネントを整理する","プロジェクト構造の一貫性を維持する"],"ko":["새로운 Next.js 블로그 프로젝트를 위한 스캐폴딩 생성","파일 명명 규칙 적용","애플리케이션 라우터 컴포넌트 조직화","프로젝트 구조 일관성 유지"],"es":["Creación de nuevos proyectos de blogs Next.js","Aplicación de convenciones de nomenclatura de archivos","Organización de componentes del enrutador de aplicaciones","Mantenimiento de la coherencia de la estructura del proyecto"],"fr":["Création de nouveaux projets de blogs Next.js","Application des conventions de nommage de fichiers","Organisation des composants du routeur d''applications","Maintenance de la cohérence de la structure de projet"],"de":["Erstellung neuer Next.js-Blog-Projekte","Durchsetzung von Dateibenennungskonventionen","Organisation von App-Router-Komponenten","Beibehaltung der Konsistenz der Projektstruktur"],"pt":["Criação de novos projetos de blog Next.js","Aplicação de convenções de nomenclatura de arquivos","Organização de componentes do roteador de aplicativos","Manutenção da consistência da estrutura do projeto"],"ru":["Создание новых проектов блогов Next.js","Применение соглашений об именовании файлов","Организация компонентов маршрутизатора приложения","Поддержание последовательности структуры проекта"],"ar":["إنشاء مشاريع مدونة جديدة Next.js","تطبيق اتفاقيات تسمية الملفات","تنظيم مكونات موزع التطبيق","الحفاظ على συνέفات هيكل المشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Next.js-specific implementation","Requires existing project directory","Limited to Bellog''s custom conventions"],"zh":["仅适用于 Next.js 的实现","需要现有的项目目录","仅限于 Bellog 的自定义约定"],"ja":["Next.js 専用実装","既存のプロジェクト ディレクトリが必要","Bellog のカスタム規約のみ"],"ko":["Next.js 전용 구현","既存의 프로젝트 디렉토리가 필요","Bellog의 사용자 정의 규칙만"],"es":["Implementación específica de Next.js","Requiere un directorio de proyecto existente","Limitado a las convenciones personalizadas de Bellog"],"fr":["Implémentation spécifique de Next.js","Nécessite un répertoire de projet existant","Limité aux conventions personnalisées de Bellog"],"de":["Next.js-spezifische Implementierung","Benötigt ein vorhandenes Projektverzeichnis","Begrenzt auf die benutzerdefinierten Konventionen von Bellog"],"pt":["Implementação específica do Next.js","Exige diretório de projeto existente","Limitado às convenções personalizadas do Bellog"],"ru":["Реализация, специфичная для Next.js","Требует существующего директория проекта","Ограниченная только собственной конвенцией Bellog"],"ar":["تنفيذ محدد ل Next.js","يتطلب وجود دليل مشروع","محدود بالاتفاقيات المخصصة ل Bellog"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('SpillwaveSolutions/agent_rulez/architect-agent', 'community', 'SpillwaveSolutions', 'agent_rulez', 'SpillwaveSolutions/agent_rulez', 'architect-agent', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z', '2026-02-18T03:47:41.660Z', NULL, '{"id":"SpillwaveSolutions/agent_rulez/architect-agent","name":"architect-agent","description":{"zh":"架构代理技能用于协调规划、委派和评估代码工作空间。快速开始使用预设模板","ja":"アーキテクトエージェントスキルは、コードワークスペースの計画、委任、評価を調整します。テンプレートベースのクイックセットアップを使用して開始","ko":"아키텍트 에이전트 스킬은 코드 작업 공간의 계획, 위임, 평가를 조정합니다. 템플릿 기반의 빠른 설정을 사용하여 시작","es":"El Agente de Arquitectura es una habilidad que coordina la planificación, delegación y evaluación en el flujo de trabajo de los agentes de código y arquitectura. Permite la automatización de tareas y el aumento de la productividad","fr":"L''Agent d''Architecture est une compétence qui coordonne la planification, la délégation et l''évaluation dans le flux de travail des agents de code et d''architecture. Il permet l''automatisation des tâches et l''augmentation de la productivité","de":"Der Architektur-Agent ist eine Fähigkeit, die die Planung, Delegation und Bewertung im Workflow der Code- und Architekturagenten koordiniert. Er ermöglicht die Automatisierung von Aufgaben und die Steigerung der Produktivität","pt":"O agente arquiteto é uma habilidade que coordena planejamento, delegação e avaliação em ambientes de trabalho de arquitetura e código.","ru":"Агент архитектора - это навык, который координирует планирование, делегирование и оценку в средах работы архитектуры и кода.","ar":"الوكيل المعماري هو مهارة تتنسيق التخطيط والتفويض والتقييم في بيئات العمل المعمارية والبرمجية.","en":"Agent Rulz"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"架构代理技能 - 协调规划和代码工作空间","ja":"アーキテクトエージェントスキル - 計画とコードワークスペースの調整","ko":"아키텍트 에이전트 스킬 - 계획 및 코드 작업 공간 조정","es":"Agente de Arquitectura: Automatiza el Flujo de Trabajo","fr":"Agent d''Architecture: Automatisez le Flux de Travail","de":"Architektur-Agent: Automatisieren Sie den Workflow","pt":"Arquiteto de Agentes: Automatize o Fluxo de Trabalho","ru":"Архитектор Агентов: Автоматизируйте Workflow","ar":"معماري الوكيل: أتمتة تدفق العمل","en":"architect-agent"},"description":{"zh":"架构代理技能用于协调规划、委派和评估代码工作空间。快速开始使用预设模板","ja":"アーキテクトエージェントスキルは、コードワークスペースの計画、委任、評価を調整します。テンプレートベースのクイックセットアップを使用して開始","ko":"아키텍트 에이전트 스킬은 코드 작업 공간의 계획, 위임, 평가를 조정합니다. 템플릿 기반의 빠른 설정을 사용하여 시작","es":"El Agente de Arquitectura es una habilidad que coordina la planificación, delegación y evaluación en el flujo de trabajo de los agentes de código y arquitect...","fr":"L''Agent d''Architecture est une compétence qui coordonne la planification, la délégation et l''évaluation dans le flux de travail des agents de code et d''archi...","de":"Der Architektur-Agent ist eine Fähigkeit, die die Planung, Delegation und Bewertung im Workflow der Code- und Architekturagenten koordiniert. Er ermöglicht d...","pt":"O agente arquiteto é uma habilidade que coordena planejamento, delegação e avaliação em ambientes de trabalho de arquitetura e código.","ru":"Агент архитектора - это навык, который координирует планирование, делегирование и оценку в средах работы архитектуры и кода.","ar":"الوكيل المعماري هو مهارة تتنسيق التخطيط والتفويض والتقييم في بيئات العمل المعمارية والبرمجية.","en":"Agent Rulz"},"definition":{"en":"Agent Rulz"},"features":{"zh":["Intent Classification","Decision Tree","Resource Loading Policy","Critical Protocol"],"ja":["インテント分類","デシジョンツリー","リソースロードポリシー","クリティカルプロトコル"],"ko":["인텐트 분류","결정 트리","리소스 로드 정책","임계 프로토콜"],"es":["Coordinación de la planificación y delegación de tareas","Automatización de la evaluación y retroalimentación","Integración con el flujo de trabajo de los agentes de código","Personalización de la configuración y el comportamiento","Soporte para la creación de instrucciones y plantillas","Análisis y visualización de los resultados"],"fr":["Coordination de la planification et de la délégation de tâches","Automatisation de l''évaluation et de la rétroaction","Intégration avec le flux de travail des agents de code","Personnalisation de la configuration et du comportement","Support pour la création d''instructions et de modèles","Analyse et visualisation des résultats"],"de":["Koordinierung der Planung und Delegation von Aufgaben","Automatisierung der Bewertung und Rückmeldung","Integration mit dem Workflow der Code-Agenten","Anpassung der Konfiguration und des Verhaltens","Unterstützung für die Erstellung von Anweisungen und Vorlagen","Analyse und Visualisierung der Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Coordenação de planejamento e delegação","Avaliação e controle de qualidade","Automatização de tarefas repetitivas","Integração com ambientes de trabalho de código","Otimização do fluxo de trabalho"],"ru":["Координация планирования и делегирования","Оценка и контроль качества","Автоматизация повторяющихся задач","Интеграция с средами работы кода","Оптимизация workflow"],"ar":["تنسيق التخطيط والتفويض","التقييم ومراقبة الجودة","أتمتة المهام المتكررة","التكامل مع بيئات العمل البرمجية","تحسين تدفق العمل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["架构代理技能","代码工作空间","规划","委派","评估","Intent Classification","Decision Tree"],"ja":["アーキテクトエージェントスキル","コードワークスペース","計画","委任","評価","インテント分類","デシジョンツリー"],"ko":["아키텍트 에이전트 스킬","코드 작업 공간","계획","위임","평가","인텐트 분류","결정 트리"],"es":["Agente de Arquitectura","Automatización de flujo de trabajo","Desarrollo de software","Productividad","Eficiencia","Tecnologías de automatización","Herramientas de desarrollo","Arquitectura de software"],"fr":["Agent d''Architecture","Automatisation du flux de travail","Développement de logiciels","Productivité","Efficacité","Technologies d''automatisation","Outils de développement","Architecture de logiciels"],"de":["Architektur-Agent","Automatisierung des Workflows","Software-Entwicklung","Produktivität","Effizienz","Automatisierungstechnologien","Entwicklungstools","Software-Architektur"],"pt":["agente arquiteto","automatização de workflow","coordenação de planejamento","delegação de tarefas","avaliação de qualidade","otimização de fluxo de trabalho","integração com código","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["агент архитектора","автоматизация workflow","координация планирования","делегирование задач","оценка качества","оптимизация workflow","интеграция с кодом","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["وكيل المعماري","أتمتة تدفق العمل","تنسيق التخطيط","تفويض المهام","تقييم الجودة","تحسين تدفق العمل","التكامل مع الكود","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"SpillwaveSolutions","repo":"agent_rulez","repoPath":"SpillwaveSolutions/agent_rulez","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"architect-agent","description":"Coordinates planning, delegation, and evaluation across architect and code agent workspaces. Use when asked to write instructions for code agent, initialize architect workspace, grade code agent work, send instructions, or verify code agent setup.","version":"3.1.0","bodyPreview":"# Architect Agent Workflow Skill\n\nCoordinate planning, delegation, and evaluation across architect and code agent workspaces.\n\n**Quick Start:** Say \"write instructions for code agent\", \"initialize workspace\", \"grade work\", or \"send instructions\". For automated setup, see [Quick Setup](#quick-setup-template-based).\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [Intent Classification](#intent-classification)\n- [Decision Tree](#decision-tree)\n- [Resource Loading Policy](#resource-loading-policy)\n- [Critical Protocol: F","body":"# Architect Agent Workflow Skill\n\nCoordinate planning, delegation, and evaluation across architect and code agent workspaces.\n\n**Quick Start:** Say \"write instructions for code agent\", \"initialize workspace\", \"grade work\", or \"send instructions\". For automated setup, see [Quick Setup](#quick-setup-template-based).\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [Intent Classification](#intent-classification)\n- [Decision Tree](#decision-tree)\n- [Resource Loading Policy](#resource-loading-policy)\n- [Critical Protocol: File Locations](#critical-protocol-file-locations)\n- [Quick Setup](#quick-setup-template-based)\n- [DO NOT Trigger For](#do-not-trigger-for)\n- [Reference Directory](#reference-directory)\n- [Guides Directory](#guides-directory)\n\n## Intent Classification\n\nRoute requests based on user intent:\n\n| Intent | Trigger Phrases | Action |\n|--------|-----------------|--------|\n| **Create Instructions** | \"write instructions\", \"create instructions\", \"delegate to code agent\" | → Load `guides/workflows/create-instructions.md` |\n| **Initialize Workspace** | \"set up architect agent\", \"initialize workspace\", \"new architect agent\" | → Load `guides/workflows/initialize-workspace.md` |\n| **Grade Work** | \"grade the work\", \"evaluate completed work\", \"review implementation\" | → Load `guides/workflows/grade-work.md` |\n| **Send Instructions** | \"send instructions\", \"send to code agent\" | → Load `guides/workflows/send-instructions.md` |\n| **Add OpenCode Support** | \"migrate to OpenCode\", \"add OpenCode support\" | → Load `references/opencode_integration_quickstart.md` |\n| **Verify Setup** | \"verify setup\", \"test hooks\", \"check logging\" | → Load `references/workspace_verification_protocol.md` |\n| **Setup Permissions** | \"set up permissions\", \"fix permission prompts\" | → Load `references/permissions_setup_protocol.md` |\n| **Upgrade Workspace** | \"upgrade workspace\", \"migrate to v3.0\" | → Load `references/upgrade.md` |\n\n## Decision Tree\n\n| User Intent | Pre-condition | Action |\n|-------------|---------------|--------|\n| \"write/create instructions\", \"delegate\" | `instructions/` exists | Load `guides/workflows/create-instructions.md` |\n| \"write/create instructions\", \"delegate\" | `instructions/` missing | Suggest workspace initialization first |\n| \"set up/initialize\" workspace | Directories don''t exist | Load `guides/workflows/initialize-workspace.md` |\n| \"set up/initialize\" workspace | Directories exist | Warn: already initialized |\n| \"grade\", \"evaluate\" work | `grades/` exists | Load `guides/workflows/grade-work.md` |\n| \"grade\", \"evaluate\" work | `grades/` missing | Suggest workspace initialization first |\n| \"send instructions\" | — | Load `guides/workflows/send-instructions.md` (bash copy, no agents) |\n| \"verify\", \"test hooks\" | — | Load `references/workspace_verification_protocol.md` |\n| \"OpenCode\", \"dual-mode\" | — | Load `references/opencode_integration_quickstart.md` |\n| \"permissions\" | — | Load `references/permissions_setup_protocol.md` |\n| \"upgrade\", \"migrate\" | — | Load `references/upgrade.md` |\n\n## Resource Loading Policy\n\n**Load ONLY when needed:**\n- Workflow guides: When intent is classified\n- Reference docs: When user needs detailed protocol\n- Templates: When creating workspace or files\n- Never load all references \"just in case\"\n\n**Core Resources by Intent:**\n\n| Intent | Primary Resource | Supporting Resources |\n|--------|-----------------|---------------------|\n| Create Instructions | `guides/workflows/create-instructions.md` | `references/instruction_structure.md`, `references/human_instruction_structure.md`, `references/file_naming.md` |\n| Initialize Workspace | `guides/workflows/initialize-workspace.md` | `references/workspace_setup_complete.md` |\n| Grade Work | `guides/workflows/grade-work.md` | `references/grading_rubrics.md`, `references/decision_types.md` |\n| Send Instructions | `guides/workflows/send-instructions.md` | (none - simple bash copy) |\n| Verify Setup | `references/workspace_verification_protocol.md` | `references/pre_work_checklist.md` |\n| Setup Permissions | `references/permissions_setup_protocol.md` | - |\n| OpenCode Support | `references/opencode_integration_quickstart.md` | `references/opencode_setup_guide.md` |\n\n## Critical Protocol: File Locations\n\n**The architect agent operates in its own workspace, NOT the code agent workspace.**\n\n| Artifact | Architect Writes To | Code Agent Location |\n|----------|--------------------|--------------------|\n| Instructions | `[ARCHITECT]/instructions/` | Reads from `debugging/instructions/` |\n| Human Instructions | `[ARCHITECT]/human/` | N/A (for manual execution) |\n| Grades | `[ARCHITECT]/grades/` | N/A |\n| Logs | N/A | Writes to `[CODE_AGENT]/debugging/logs/` |\n\n**Human Instructions = Executable Documentation** (not summaries!)\n\nHuman instructions must enable manual execution when code agents are unavailable. Include copy-pasteable commands, expected output, and troubleshooting. See `references/human_instruction_structure.md`.\n\n**Guard Rail:** If about to write to the code agent''s workspace, stop and verify the operation.\n\n## Quick Setup (Template-Based)\n\nFor fastest setup, use templates:\n\n```bash\ncd ~/.claude/skills/architect-agent/templates/\n\n# Create code agent workspace\n./setup-workspace.sh code-agent ~/projects/my-code-agent\n\n# Create architect workspace\n./setup-workspace.sh architect ~/projects/my-architect \\\n    --code-agent-path ~/projects/my-code-agent\n```\n\n**Time:** <5 minutes\n**See:** `templates/README.md`\n\n## DO NOT Trigger For\n\n- General architecture discussions\n- Brainstorming or exploration\n- Reading/analyzing existing code\n- Research tasks\n- Any work that isn''t explicit instruction creation, grading, or setup\n\n## Reference Directory\n\nAll detailed protocols are in `references/`. Load only what is needed for the current task.\n\n### Core References (Instruction & Grading)\n\n| Reference | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `instruction_structure.md` | Code agent instruction template |\n| `human_instruction_structure.md` | Human-executable instruction template |\n| `grading_rubrics.md` | 6-category grading criteria |\n| `instruction_grading_workflow.md` | Full grading workflow |\n| `decision_types.md` | decision, rationale, investigation, verification, deviation, milestone |\n| `file_naming.md` | Timestamp and naming conventions |\n\n### Setup & Configuration\n\n| Reference | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `installation.md` | Skill installation guide |\n| `quick_start.md` | Fast-track setup |\n| `workspace_setup_complete.md` | Full workspace initialization |\n| `workspace_verification_protocol.md` | Verify setup is correct |\n| `permissions_setup_protocol.md` | Cross-workspace permissions |\n| `upgrade.md` | Upgrade to latest version |\n\n### Logging & Debugging\n\n| Reference | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `logging_protocol.md` | Hybrid logging v2.0 |\n| `hybrid_logging_protocol.md` | Detailed hybrid logging spec |\n| `hook_configuration_critical.md` | Hook setup requirements |\n| `hook_logger_enhancements.md` | Hook logger improvements |\n| `pre_work_checklist.md` | Code agent pre-work verification |\n| `get_unstuck_protocol.md` | Recovery from blockers |\n| `resilience_protocol.md` | Error recovery patterns |\n| `testing_protocol.md` | Progressive testing requirements |\n\n### OpenCode Integration\n\n| Reference | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `opencode_integration_quickstart.md` | Dual-mode quick start |\n| `opencode_setup_guide.md` | Full OpenCode setup |\n| `opencode_migration_guide.md` | Migrate to OpenCode |\n| `opencode_logging_protocol.md` | OpenCode-specific logging |\n| `opencode_wrapper_setup.md` | Wrapper script setup |\n| `claude_vs_opencode_comparison.md` | Feature comparison |\n\n### Agent Configuration\n\n| Reference | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `agent_specialization.md` | Agent role configuration |\n| `code_agent_claude_template.md` | CLAUDE.md template for code agents |\n| `code_agent_agents_template.md` | AGENTS.md template for code agents |\n\n### Project Management\n\n| Reference | Purpose |\n|-----------|---------|\n| `git_pr_management.md` | Git and PR workflow |\n| `ticket_tracking_pr_management.md` | Ticket and PR tracking |\n\n## Guides Directory\n\nStep-by-step workflows in `guides/workflows/`:\n\n| Guide | Trigger |\n|-------|---------|\n| `create-instructions.md` | \"write instructions for code agent\" |\n| `grade-work.md` | \"grade the code agent''s work\" |\n| `send-instructions.md` | \"send instructions to code agent\" |\n| `initialize-workspace.md` | \"set up architect agent workspace\" |\n\n### Templates\n\nReady-to-use workspace templates in `templates/`:\n\n| Template | Purpose |\n|----------|---------|\n| `setup-workspace.sh` | Automated workspace creation script |\n| `architect-workspace/` | Complete architect agent workspace template |\n| `code-agent-workspace/` | Complete code agent workspace template |\n\n**See:** `templates/README.md` for usage instructions.\n\n---"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:47:41.660Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing advanced workflow coordination across architect and code agent workspaces.","zh":"适用于 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT 等需要高级工作流协调的 AI 代理，跨架构师和代码代理工作空间。","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの、建築家とコードエージェントのワークスペースを横断する高度なワークフロー調整が必要な AI エージェントに最適です。","ko":"클라우드 코드와 오토지피티 같은 고급 워크플로우 조정을 필요로 하는 인공지능 에이전트에게 적합하며, 아키텍트와 코드 에이전트 작업 공간을 가로지릅니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude Code y AutoGPT que necesitan una coordinación de flujo de trabajo avanzada en los espacios de trabajo de arquitectos y agentes de código.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant une coordination de workflow avancée à travers les espaces de travail d''architectes et d''agents de code.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die eine erweiterte Arbeitsablaufkoordination in den Arbeitsbereichen von Architekten und Code-Agents benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude Code e AutoGPT que necessitam de coordenação de fluxo de trabalho avançada entre espaços de trabalho de arquiteto e agente de código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, которым требуется продвинутая координация рабочего процесса между рабочими пространствами архитектора и агента кода.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذي يحتاج إلى تنسيق متقدم لتدفق العمل عبر مساحات عمل المعماري ووكيل الشفرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to coordinate planning, delegation, and evaluation using intent classification, decision trees, and resource loading policies, streamlining workspace initialization and grading work through critical protocols.","zh":"赋予代理人使用意图分类、决策树和资源加载策略来协调规划、委托和评估，通过关键协议简化工作空间初始化和评分工作。","ja":"意図分類、決定木、リソースロードポリシーを使用して、計画、委任、評価の調整を可能にし、重要なプロトコルを介してワークスペースの初期化と評価作業を合理化します。","ko":"의도 분류, 의사 결정 트리, 리소스 로드 정책을 사용하여 계획, 위임, 평가를 조정하며, 중요한 프로토콜을 통해 작업 공간 초기화와 평가 작업을 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a coordinar la planificación, la delegación y la evaluación utilizando la clasificación de intenciones, los árboles de decisión y las políticas de carga de recursos, simplificando la inicialización del espacio de trabajo y la calificación del trabajo a través de protocolos críticos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de coordonner la planification, la délégation et l''évaluation en utilisant la classification d''intention, les arbres de décision et les politiques de chargement de ressources, rationalisant l''initialisation de l''espace de travail et la notation du travail à travers des protocoles critiques.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Planung, Delegation und Bewertung mithilfe der Intent-Klassifizierung, Entscheidungsbäume und Ressourcenladepolitiken zu koordinieren, wodurch die Initialisierung des Arbeitsbereichs und die Bewertung der Arbeit durch kritische Protokolle rationalisiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a coordenar planejamento, delegação e avaliação usando classificação de intenção, árvores de decisão e políticas de carga de recursos, racionalizando a inicialização do espaço de trabalho e a avaliação do trabalho através de protocolos críticos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью координировать планирование, делегирование и оценку с использованием классификации намерений, деревьев решений и политики загрузки ресурсов, оптимизируя инициализацию рабочего пространства и оценку работы через критические протоколы.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تنسيق التخطيط والتفويض والتقييم باستخدام تصنيف النية وأشجار القرار وسياسات تحميل الموارد، ويرationalizes 初始化 مساحة العمل وتقييم العمل من خلال بروتوكولات حرجة."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing workspaces for collaborative projects","Delegating tasks to code agents using decision trees","Evaluating work quality through automated grading protocols"],"zh":["为协作项目初始化工作空间","使用决策树将任务委托给代码代理","通过自动评分协议评估工作质量"],"ja":["コラボレーションプロジェクトのワークスペースを初期化する","決定木を使用してタスクをコードエージェントに委任する","自動評価プロトコルを使用して作業の品質を評価する"],"ko":["협업 프로젝트를 위한 작업 공간 초기화","의사 결정 트리를 사용하여 코드 에이전트에 태스크를 위임","자동 평가 프로토콜을 통해 작업 품질 평가"],"es":["Inicialización de espacios de trabajo para proyectos colaborativos","Delegación de tareas a agentes de código utilizando árboles de decisión","Evaluación de la calidad del trabajo a través de protocolos de calificación automatizados"],"fr":["Initialisation d''espaces de travail pour des projets collaboratifs","Délégation de tâches à des agents de code en utilisant des arbres de décision","Évaluation de la qualité du travail à travers des protocoles de notation automatisés"],"de":["Initialisierung von Arbeitsbereichen für kollaborative Projekte","Delegierung von Aufgaben an Code-Agents unter Verwendung von Entscheidungsbäumen","Bewertung der Arbeitsqualität durch automatisierte Bewertungsprotokolle"],"pt":["Inicializar espaços de trabalho para projetos colaborativos","Delegar tarefas para agentes de código usando árvores de decisão","Avaliar a qualidade do trabalho por meio de protocolos de avaliação automatizados"],"ru":["Инициализация рабочих пространств для совместных проектов","Делегирование задач агентам кода с использованием деревьев решений","Оценка качества работы с помощью автоматизированных протоколов оценки"],"ar":["مبادرة مساحات العمل للمشاريع التعاونية","تفويض المهام إلى وكلاء الشفرة باستخدام أشجار القرار","تقييم جودة العمل من خلال بروتوكولات التقييم الآلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires specific quick setup template-based configuration","Dependent on agent''s ability to understand intent classification and resource loading policies"],"zh":["需要特定的快速设置模板配置","依赖于代理人理解意图分类和资源加载策略的能力"],"ja":["特定のクイックセットアップテンプレート構成が必要","エージェントが意図分類とリソースロードポリシーを理解する能力に依存する"],"ko":["특정한 빠른 설정 템플릿 구성이 필요","에이전트가 의도 분류와 리소스 로드 정책을 이해하는 능력에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una configuración específica basada en plantillas de instalación rápida","Depende de la capacidad del agente para entender la clasificación de intenciones y las políticas de carga de recursos"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration spécifique basée sur des modèles de configuration rapide","Dépend de la capacité de l''agent à comprendre la classification d''intention et les politiques de chargement de ressources"],"de":["Erfordert eine spezifische Konfiguration basierend auf Schnellinstallationsvorlagen","Hängt von der Fähigkeit des Agents ab, die Intent-Klassifizierung und die Ressourcenladepolitiken zu verstehen"],"pt":["Exige configuração baseada em modelo de configuração rápida específica","Dependente da capacidade do agente de entender classificação de intenção e políticas de carga de recursos"],"ru":["Требует конкретной конфигурации на основе быстрой настройки шаблона","Зависит от способности агента понимать классификацию намерений и политику загрузки ресурсов"],"ar":["يتطلب ضبطا خاصا مبنيا على نموذج الضبط السريع","يعتمد على قدرة العميل على فهم تصنيف النية وسياسات تحميل الموارد"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
