,"Escalabilidad automática","Seguridad y autenticación integradas"],"fr":["Développement d''applications serverless","Exécution de code en réponse à des événements","Intégration avec les services Azure","Prise en charge de plusieurs langages de programmation","Mise à l''échelle automatique","Sécurité et authentification intégrées"],"de":["Entwicklung von serverless-Anwendungen","Ausführung von Code als Reaktion auf Ereignisse","Integration mit Azure-Diensten","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen","Automatische Skalierung","Integrierte Sicherheit und Authentifizierung"],"pt":["Crie aplicações serverless escaláveis","Use triggers, bindings e orquestração","Desenvolva soluções personalizadas","Integre com outros serviços Azure","Aproveite a segurança e a confiabilidade do Azure"],"ru":["Создавайте масштабируемые серверные приложения","Используйте триггеры, привязки и оркестрацию","Разрабатывайте индивидуальные решения","Интегрируйте с другими сервисами Azure","Пользуйтесь безопасностью и надежностью Azure"],"ar":["انشئ تطبيقات بدون خادم قابلة للتوسع","استخدم الزنادات والربط والتنسيق","تطوير حلول مخصصة","ندمج مع خدمات أخرى من Azure","استفد من أمان وثقة Azure"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Azure Functions","服务器端应用","事件驱动计算"," timers 和队列触发","Durable Functions","函数绑定"],"ja":["Azure Functions","サーバーレス アプリケーション","イベント ドリブンの計算","タイマーとキューのトリガー","Durable Functions","関数バインディング"],"ko":["Azure Functions","서버리스 애플리케이션","이벤트 드리븐 컴퓨팅","타이머 및 큐 트리거","Durable Functions","함수 바인딩"],"es":["Azure Functions","aplicaciones serverless","computación en la nube","desarrollo de software","integración con Azure","escalabilidad automática","seguridad en la nube"],"fr":["Azure Functions","applications serverless","calcul cloud","développement de logiciels","intégration avec Azure","mise à l''échelle automatique","sécurité cloud"],"de":["Azure Functions","serverless-Anwendungen","Cloud-Computing","Software-Entwicklung","Integration mit Azure","automatische Skalierung","Cloud-Sicherheit"],"pt":["Azure Functions","aplicações serverless","computação de eventos","triggers","bindings","orquestração","desenvolvimento de aplicações","serviços Azure"],"ru":["Azure Functions","серверные приложения","событийные вычисления","триггеры","привязки","оркестрация","разработка приложений","сервисы Azure"],"ar":["وظائف Azure","تطبيقات بدون خادم","حوسبة الأحداث","الزنادات","الربط","التنسيق","تطوير التطبيقات","خدمات Azure"]}},"owner":"HouseGarofalo","repo":"claude-code-base","repoPath":"HouseGarofalo/claude-code-base","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-functions","description":"Build serverless applications with Azure Functions. Create HTTP triggers, queue processors, timer functions, and durable orchestrations. Use for event-driven computing, API backends, and serverless microservices on Azure.","bodyPreview":"# Azure Functions Skill\n\nBuild serverless applications with Azure Functions for event-driven computing.\n\n## Triggers\n\nUse this skill when you see:\n- azure functions, function app, serverless azure\n- http trigger, timer trigger, queue trigger\n- durable functions, orchestration\n- function binding, function.json\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Create Function App\n\n```bash\n# Create storage account (required)\naz storage account create \\\n    --name myfuncstorage \\\n    --resource-group mygroup \\\n    --location e","body":"# Azure Functions Skill\n\nBuild serverless applications with Azure Functions for event-driven computing.\n\n## Triggers\n\nUse this skill when you see:\n- azure functions, function app, serverless azure\n- http trigger, timer trigger, queue trigger\n- durable functions, orchestration\n- function binding, function.json\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Create Function App\n\n```bash\n# Create storage account (required)\naz storage account create \\\n    --name myfuncstorage \\\n    --resource-group mygroup \\\n    --location eastus \\\n    --sku Standard_LRS\n\n# Create Function App\naz functionapp create \\\n    --name myfuncapp \\\n    --resource-group mygroup \\\n    --storage-account myfuncstorage \\\n    --consumption-plan-location eastus \\\n    --runtime python \\\n    --runtime-version 3.11 \\\n    --functions-version 4\n\n# Create with Premium plan\naz functionapp plan create \\\n    --name mypremiumplan \\\n    --resource-group mygroup \\\n    --location eastus \\\n    --sku EP1\n\naz functionapp create \\\n    --name myfuncapp \\\n    --resource-group mygroup \\\n    --storage-account myfuncstorage \\\n    --plan mypremiumplan \\\n    --runtime node \\\n    --runtime-version 20 \\\n    --functions-version 4\n```\n\n### Python Functions (v2 Programming Model)\n\n#### HTTP Trigger\n\n```python\nimport azure.functions as func\nimport logging\nimport json\n\napp = func.FunctionApp(http_auth_level=func.AuthLevel.FUNCTION)\n\n@app.route(route=\"hello\")\ndef hello_http(req: func.HttpRequest) -> func.HttpResponse:\n    logging.info(''HTTP trigger function processed a request.'')\n\n    name = req.params.get(''name'')\n    if not name:\n        try:\n            req_body = req.get_json()\n            name = req_body.get(''name'')\n        except ValueError:\n            pass\n\n    if name:\n        return func.HttpResponse(f\"Hello, {name}!\")\n    else:\n        return func.HttpResponse(\n            \"Please pass a name on the query string or in the request body\",\n            status_code=400\n        )\n\n@app.route(route=\"users/{id}\", methods=[\"GET\"])\ndef get_user(req: func.HttpRequest) -> func.HttpResponse:\n    user_id = req.route_params.get(''id'')\n    # Fetch user from database\n    return func.HttpResponse(\n        json.dumps({\"id\": user_id, \"name\": \"John\"}),\n        mimetype=\"application/json\"\n    )\n```\n\n#### Timer Trigger\n\n```python\n@app.timer_trigger(schedule=\"0 */5 * * * *\", arg_name=\"timer\")\ndef timer_function(timer: func.TimerRequest) -> None:\n    if timer.past_due:\n        logging.info(''The timer is past due!'')\n\n    logging.info(''Timer trigger function executed.'')\n    # Run scheduled task\n```\n\n#### Queue Trigger\n\n```python\n@app.queue_trigger(arg_name=\"msg\", queue_name=\"myqueue\",\n                   connection=\"AzureWebJobsStorage\")\ndef queue_processor(msg: func.QueueMessage) -> None:\n    logging.info(f''Queue trigger processed: {msg.get_body().decode()}'')\n\n    data = json.loads(msg.get_body().decode())\n    process_message(data)\n\n# Output binding to queue\n@app.route(route=\"enqueue\")\n@app.queue_output(arg_name=\"msg\", queue_name=\"myqueue\",\n                  connection=\"AzureWebJobsStorage\")\ndef enqueue_message(req: func.HttpRequest, msg: func.Out[str]) -> func.HttpResponse:\n    message = req.get_json()\n    msg.set(json.dumps(message))\n    return func.HttpResponse(\"Message enqueued\", status_code=202)\n```\n\n#### Blob Trigger\n\n```python\n@app.blob_trigger(arg_name=\"blob\", path=\"container/{name}\",\n                  connection=\"AzureWebJobsStorage\")\ndef blob_processor(blob: func.InputStream) -> None:\n    logging.info(f''Blob trigger: {blob.name}, Size: {blob.length} bytes'')\n    content = blob.read()\n    process_blob(content)\n\n# Output binding to blob\n@app.route(route=\"upload\")\n@app.blob_output(arg_name=\"outputblob\", path=\"container/{rand-guid}.txt\",\n                 connection=\"AzureWebJobsStorage\")\ndef upload_blob(req: func.HttpRequest, outputblob: func.Out[str]) -> func.HttpResponse:\n    content = req.get_body().decode()\n    outputblob.set(content)\n    return func.HttpResponse(\"Blob created\", status_code=201)\n```\n\n#### Cosmos DB Trigger\n\n```python\n@app.cosmos_db_trigger(arg_name=\"documents\",\n                       container_name=\"items\",\n                       database_name=\"mydb\",\n                       connection=\"CosmosDBConnection\",\n                       lease_container_name=\"leases\",\n                       create_lease_container_if_not_exists=True)\ndef cosmos_trigger(documents: func.DocumentList) -> None:\n    for doc in documents:\n        logging.info(f''Document id: {doc[\"id\"]}'')\n        process_document(doc)\n```\n\n### TypeScript Functions (v4 Programming Model)\n\n```typescript\nimport { app, HttpRequest, HttpResponseInit, InvocationContext } from \"@azure/functions\";\n\n// HTTP trigger\napp.http(\"hello\", {\n  methods: [\"GET\", \"POST\"],\n  authLevel: \"function\",\n  handler: async (request: HttpRequest, context: InvocationContext): Promise<HttpResponseInit> => {\n    context.log(`Http function processed request for url \"${request.url}\"`);\n\n    const name = request.query.get(\"name\") || (await request.text()) || \"world\";\n\n    return {\n      body: `Hello, ${name}!`,\n    };\n  },\n});\n\n// Timer trigger\napp.timer(\"timerTrigger\", {\n  schedule: \"0 */5 * * * *\",\n  handler: async (timer: Timer, context: InvocationContext): Promise<void> => {\n    context.log(\"Timer trigger function executed\");\n  },\n});\n\n// Queue trigger with output binding\napp.storageQueue(\"queueTrigger\", {\n  queueName: \"myqueue\",\n  connection: \"AzureWebJobsStorage\",\n  handler: async (message: unknown, context: InvocationContext): Promise<void> => {\n    context.log(`Queue message: ${JSON.stringify(message)}`);\n  },\n});\n```\n\n### Durable Functions\n\n```python\nimport azure.functions as func\nimport azure.durable_functions as df\n\napp = func.FunctionApp(http_auth_level=func.AuthLevel.FUNCTION)\n\n# Orchestrator\n@app.orchestration_trigger(context_name=\"context\")\ndef orchestrator(context: df.DurableOrchestrationContext):\n    # Fan-out/fan-in pattern\n    tasks = []\n    for i in range(5):\n        tasks.append(context.call_activity(\"activity_function\", i))\n\n    results = yield context.task_all(tasks)\n\n    # Process results\n    total = sum(results)\n    return total\n\n# Activity\n@app.activity_trigger(input_name=\"input\")\ndef activity_function(input: int) -> int:\n    return input * 2\n\n# HTTP starter\n@app.route(route=\"orchestrators/{functionName}\")\n@app.durable_client_input(client_name=\"client\")\nasync def http_start(req: func.HttpRequest, client: df.DurableOrchestrationClient) -> func.HttpResponse:\n    function_name = req.route_params.get(''functionName'')\n    instance_id = await client.start_new(function_name)\n\n    return client.create_check_status_response(req, instance_id)\n```\n\n### Application Settings\n\n```bash\n# Set application settings\naz functionapp config appsettings set \\\n    --name myfuncapp \\\n    --resource-group mygroup \\\n    --settings \"DatabaseConnection=connection-string\" \\\n               \"ApiKey=your-api-key\"\n\n# Get application settings\naz functionapp config appsettings list \\\n    --name myfuncapp \\\n    --resource-group mygroup\n\n# Reference Key Vault secrets\naz functionapp config appsettings set \\\n    --name myfuncapp \\\n    --resource-group mygroup \\\n    --settings \"Secret=@Microsoft.KeyVault(SecretUri=https://myvault.vault.azure.net/secrets/mysecret/)\"\n```\n\n### Managed Identity\n\n```python\nfrom azure.identity import DefaultAzureCredential\nfrom azure.keyvault.secrets import SecretClient\n\n# Use managed identity\ncredential = DefaultAzureCredential()\nsecret_client = SecretClient(\n    vault_url=\"https://myvault.vault.azure.net\",\n    credential=credential\n)\n\nsecret = secret_client.get_secret(\"my-secret\")\n```\n\n### Deployment\n\n```bash\n# Deploy from local\nfunc azure functionapp publish myfuncapp\n\n# Deploy with zip\naz functionapp deployment source config-zip \\\n    --name myfuncapp \\\n    --resource-group mygroup \\\n    --src app.zip\n\n# Continuous deployment from GitHub\naz functionapp deployment source config \\\n    --name myfuncapp \\\n    --resource-group mygroup \\\n    --repo-url https://github.com/org/repo \\\n    --branch main \\\n    --manual-integration\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Cold Starts**: Use Premium plan for latency-sensitive apps\n2. **Bindings**: Use input/output bindings instead of SDK calls when possible\n3. **Secrets**: Use Key Vault references for sensitive settings\n4. **Logging**: Use structured logging with Application Insights\n5. **Scaling**: Configure host.json for optimal scaling\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### API Backend\n1. Create Function App with HTTP triggers\n2. Implement CRUD operations\n3. Add authentication (Azure AD, API keys)\n4. Configure CORS settings\n5. Enable Application Insights\n\n### Event Processing\n1. Set up queue/blob/Cosmos DB triggers\n2. Implement processing logic\n3. Configure dead-letter queues\n4. Add retry policies\n5. Monitor with alerts\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:47:34.424Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Cloud Automation Agents specializing in serverless Azure infrastructure deployment and management.","zh":"对于专注于无服务器Azure基础设施部署和管理的云自动化代理至关重要。","ja":"サーバーレスAzureインフラストラクチャの展開と管理に特化したクラウド自動化エージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"서버리스 Azure 인프라 배포 및 관리에 특화된 클라우드 자동화 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de automatización en la nube que se especializan en la implementación y administración de infraestructuras de Azure sin servidor.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents d''automatisation de cloud se spécialisant dans le déploiement et la gestion d''infrastructures Azure sans serveur.","de":"Wesentlich für Cloud-Automatisierungsagenten, die sich auf die Bereitstellung und Verwaltung von serverloser Azure-Infrastruktur spezialisieren.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Automação de Nuvem especializados em implantação e gerenciamento de infraestrutura do Azure sem servidor.","ru":"Необходим для агентов автоматизации облака, специализирующихся на развертывании и управлении инфраструктурой Azure без сервера.","ar":"ضروري لعميل تطبيق الويب الخاص بخدمة الأتمتة السحابية المتخصصة في تطبيق و إدارة البنية التحتية لآزور بدون خادم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to create and configure Azure Function Apps with comprehensive trigger support including HTTP endpoints, timer-based executions, and queue processing. Provides full infrastructure-as-code capabilities for serverless architectures using Azure CLI commands and function.json configuration.","zh":"使代理能够通过全面的触发器支持（包括HTTP端点、基于计时器的执行和队列处理）创建和配置Azure函数应用。通过Azure CLI命令和function.json配置，为无服务器架构提供完整的基础设施即代码功能。","ja":"HTTPエンドポイント、タイマーベースの実行、キュー処理を含む包括的なトリガーサポートでAzure Function Appを作成および設定できます。Azure CLIコマンドとfunction.json構成を使用し、サーバーレスアーキテクチャに完全なInfrastructure-as-Code機能を提供します。","ko":"HTTP 엔드포인트, 타이머 기반 실행, 큐 처리를 포함한 포괄적인 트리거 지원으로 Azure Function App을 생성 및 구성할 수 있게 합니다. Azure CLI 명령과 function.json 구성을 사용하여 서버리스 아키텍처에 대한 완전한 Infrastructure-as-Code 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear y configurar aplicaciones de Azure Function con un soporte de disparador integral que incluye puntos de conexión HTTP, ejecuciones basadas en temporizador y procesamiento de cola. Proporciona capacidades de infraestructura como código completas para arquitecturas sin servidor utilizando comandos de Azure CLI y configuración de function.json.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de configurer des applications de fonction Azure avec un support de déclencheur complet, y compris des points de terminaison HTTP, des exécutions basées sur minuterie et le traitement de files d''attente. Fournit des capacités d''infrastructure en tant que code complètes pour les architectures sans serveur en utilisant des commandes Azure CLI et une configuration function.json.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Azure-Funktions-Apps mit umfassender Trigger-Unterstützung zu erstellen und zu konfigurieren, einschließlich HTTP-Endpunkten, timerbasierten Ausführungen und Queues. Bietet vollständige Infrastruktur-als-Code-Fähigkeiten für serverlose Architekturen unter Verwendung von Azure-CLI-Befehlen und function.json-Konfiguration.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem e configurem Aplicativos de Funções do Azure com suporte de gatilho abrangente, incluindo pontos de extremidade HTTP, execuções baseadas em temporizador e processamento de filas. Fornece capacidades de infraestrutura como código completas para arquiteturas sem servidor usando comandos do Azure CLI e configuração function.json.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и настраивать приложения Azure Functions с полной поддержкой триггеров, включая конечные точки HTTP, выполнения на основе таймера и обработку очередей. Предоставляет полные возможности инфраструктуры как код для архитектур без сервера с помощью команд Azure CLI и конфигурации function.json.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء إنشاء وتكوين تطبيقات وظيفية لآزور مع دعم کامل للزناد ، بما في ذلك نقاط النهاية HTTP وتنفيذ الوقت و معالجة الرسائل. يوفر إمكانيات البنية التحتية كкод كاملة للعمارة بدون خادم باستخدام أوامر سطر الأوامر في آزور وتكوين function.json."},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying serverless HTTP API endpoints","Automating timer-triggered background tasks","Processing queue messages with queue triggers","Implementing durable function orchestrations"],"zh":["部署无服务器HTTP API端点","自动化基于计时器的后台任务","使用队列触发器处理队列消息","实现持久函数编排"],"ja":["サーバーレスHTTP APIエンドポイントの展開","タイマートリガーによるバックグラウンドタスクの自動化","キュートリガーを使用したキューメッセージの処理","Durable Functionオーケストレーションの実装"],"ko":["서버리스 HTTP API 엔드포인트 배포","타이머 트리거 백그라운드 작업 자동화","큐 트리거를 사용한 큐 메시지 처리","Durable Function 오케스트레이션 구현"],"es":["Implementar puntos de conexión de API HTTP sin servidor","Automatizar tareas en segundo plano desencadenadas por temporizador","Procesar mensajes de cola con desencadenadores de cola","Implementar orquestaciones de funciones duraderas"],"fr":["Déployer des points de terminaison d''API HTTP sans serveur","Automatiser des tâches en arrière-plan déclenchées par minuterie","Traiter des messages de file d''attente avec des déclencheurs de file d''attente","Mettre en œuvre des orchestrations de fonctions durables"],"de":["Bereitstellen von serverlosen HTTP-API-Endpunkten","Automatisieren von timerausgelösten Hintergrundaufgaben","Verarbeiten von Queuemeldungen mit Queuetriggern","Implementieren von dauerhaften Funktionsorchestrierungen"],"pt":["Implantação de pontos de extremidade de API HTTP sem servidor","Automação de tarefas em segundo plano acionadas por temporizador","Processamento de mensagens de fila com gatilhos de fila","Implementação de orquestrações de funções duráveis"],"ru":["Развертывание безсерверных конечных точек HTTP API","Автоматизация фоновых задач, запускаемых по таймеру","Обработка сообщений очереди с помощью триггеров очереди","Реализация устойчивых оркестраций функций"],"ar":["تطبيق نقاط نهاية واجهة برمجة التطبيقات HTTP بدون خادم","أتمتة المهام الخلفية التي تشتغل بالتنبيه الزمني","معالجة رسائل الصفوف بالزناد الصفوي","تطبيق تنسيق دوار للوظائف"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure CLI and active Azure subscription","Needs storage account pre-configuration","Azure-specific implementation only"],"zh":["需要Azure CLI和有效的Azure订阅","需要预先配置存储账户","仅限Azure特定实现"],"ja":["Azure CLIと有効なAzureサブスクリプションが必要","ストレージアカウントの事前構成が必要","Azure固有の実装に限定"],"ko":["Azure CLI 및 활성 Azure 구독 필요","스토리지 계정 사전 구성 필요","Azure 전용 구현만 가능"],"es":["Requiere Azure CLI y suscripción de Azure activa","Necesita una cuenta de almacenamiento preconfigurada","Implementación específica de Azure solo"],"fr":["Nécessite Azure CLI et abonnement Azure actif","Nécessite une configuration préalable d''un compte de stockage","Mise en œuvre spécifique à Azure uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt Azure CLI und aktives Azure-Abonnement","Benötigt eine vorherige Konfiguration eines Speicherkontos","Azure-spezifische Implementierung nur"],"pt":["Requer Azure CLI e assinatura ativa do Azure","Necessita de pré-configuração da conta de armazenamento","Implementação específica do Azure apenas"],"ru":["Требует Azure CLI и активной подписки Azure","Требует предварительной настройки учетной записи хранения","Только реализация, специфичная для Azure"],"ar":["يتطلب واجهة سطر الأوامر في آزور واشتراك آزور نشط","يحتاج إلى إعداد مسبق لحساب التخزين","تطبيق خاص لأزر فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
