:"Framer Motion을 사용하여 순조로운 애니메이션 및 모션 디자인을 생성하고 사용자 경험을 향상시키는 방법","es":"Aprende a crear animaciones y movimientos con Framer Motion para mejorar la experiencia del usuario","fr":"Apprenez à créer des animations et des mouvements avec Framer Motion pour améliorer l''expérience utilisateur","de":"Lernen Sie, wie Sie mit Framer Motion Animationen und Bewegungen erstellen, um die Benutzererfahrung zu verbessern","pt":"O template de projeto animation-motion oferece uma abordagem abrangente para criar animações suaves e funcionais","ru":"Шаблон проекта animation-motion предлагает комплексный подход к созданию плавных и функциональных анимаций","ar":"قالب مشروع animation-motion يقدم نهجًا شاملاً لإنشاء حركات متحركة سلسة ووظيفية","en":"Comprehensive Claude Code project template with 164 skills, 50 commands, and full configuration"},"definition":{"en":"Comprehensive Claude Code project template with 164 skills, 50 commands, and full configuration"},"features":{"zh":["使用Framer Motion创建流畅的动画","创建一致的运动语言","优化动画性能","尊重减少动画设置","创建简单的动画"],"ja":["Framer Motionを使用してスムーズなアニメーションを作成","一貫したモーション言語を作成","アニメーションのパフォーマンスを最適化","減少アニメーションの設定を尊重","シンプルなアニメーションを作成"],"ko":["Framer Motion을 사용하여 순조로운 애니메이션 생성","일관된 모션 언어 생성","애니메이션 성능 최적화","감소 애니메이션 설정 존중","간단한 애니메이션 생성"],"es":["Animaciones suaves y con propósito","Transiciones de UI personalizadas","Compatibilidad con preferencias de movimiento reducido","Optimización del rendimiento","Lenguaje de movimiento consistente"],"fr":["Animations fluides et intentionnelles","Transitions de l''interface utilisateur personnalisées","Compatibilité avec les préférences de mouvement réduit","Optimisation des performances","Langage de mouvement cohérent"],"de":["Flüssige und zweckmäßige Animationen","Benutzeroberflächen-Übergänge anpassen","Unterstützung für reduzierte Bewegungspräferenzen","Leistungsoptimierung","Konsistentes Bewegungssprache"],"pt":["Crie animações suaves e funcionais","Use o template de projeto Claude Code","Aprenda a respeitar as preferências de movimento reduzido","Otimizar o desempenho com transform e opacity","Use easing consistente para criar uma linguagem de movimento"],"ru":["Создайте плавные и функциональные анимации","Используйте шаблон проекта Claude Code","Узнайте, как уважать предпочтения уменьшенного движения","Оптимизируйте производительность с помощью transform и opacity","Используйте последовательное easing для создания языка движения"],"ar":["انشئ حركات متحركة سلسة ووظيفية","استخدم قالب مشروع Claude Code","تعلم كيفية احترام تفضيلات الحركة المختزلة","أقم تحسين الأداء باستخدام transform و opacity","استخدم easing متناسق لإنشاء لغة حركة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["动画与运动设计","Framer Motion","用户体验","动画性能","运动语言","减少动画设置"],"ja":["アニメーションとモーションデザイン","Framer Motion","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","アニメーションパフォーマンス","モーション言語","減少アニメーション設定"],"ko":["애니메이션 및 모션 디자인","Framer Motion","사용자 경험","애니메이션 성능","모션 언어","감소 애니메이션 설정"],"es":["animación y movimiento","diseño de animación","Framer Motion","experiencia del usuario","transiciones de UI","rendimiento","lenguaje de movimiento"],"fr":["conception d''animation et de mouvement","animation et mouvement","Framer Motion","expérience utilisateur","transitions de l''interface utilisateur","performances","langage de mouvement"],"de":["Animations- und Bewegungsdesign","Animation und Bewegung","Framer Motion","Benutzererfahrung","Benutzeroberflächen-Übergänge","Leistung","Bewegungssprache"],"pt":["animação","motion design","experiência do usuário","template de projeto"," Claude Code","animações suaves","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["анимация","дизайн движения","пользовательский опыт","шаблон проекта","Claude Code","плавные анимации","веб-разработка"],"ar":["الحركة المتحركة","تصميم الحركة","تجربة المستخدم","قالب مشروع","Claude Code","حركات متحركة سلسة","تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"HouseGarofalo","repo":"claude-code-base","repoPath":"HouseGarofalo/claude-code-base","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"animation-motion","description":"Create smooth animations and micro-interactions with Framer Motion and CSS. Covers enter/exit animations, gestures, scroll animations, loading states, and performance optimization. Use for polished UIs, interactive elements, and engaging user experiences.","bodyPreview":"# Animation & Motion Design\n\nCreate smooth, purposeful animations that enhance user experience.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. **Animate with purpose** - Every animation should serve a function\n2. **Keep it subtle** - 200-400ms for most UI transitions\n3. **Respect reduced motion** - Honor user preferences\n4. **Optimize performance** - Use transform and opacity\n5. **Use consistent easing** - Create a motion language\n\n## Framer Motion Basics\n\n### Simple Animations\n\n```tsx\nimport { motion } from ''framer-moti","body":"# Animation & Motion Design\n\nCreate smooth, purposeful animations that enhance user experience.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. **Animate with purpose** - Every animation should serve a function\n2. **Keep it subtle** - 200-400ms for most UI transitions\n3. **Respect reduced motion** - Honor user preferences\n4. **Optimize performance** - Use transform and opacity\n5. **Use consistent easing** - Create a motion language\n\n## Framer Motion Basics\n\n### Simple Animations\n\n```tsx\nimport { motion } from ''framer-motion'';\n\n// Fade in on mount\n<motion.div\n  initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\n  animate={{ opacity: 1 }}\n  transition={{ duration: 0.3 }}\n>\n  Content\n</motion.div>\n\n// Slide up with spring\n<motion.div\n  initial={{ y: 20, opacity: 0 }}\n  animate={{ y: 0, opacity: 1 }}\n  transition={{\n    type: ''spring'',\n    stiffness: 300,\n    damping: 30,\n  }}\n>\n  Content\n</motion.div>\n```\n\n### Exit Animations\n\n```tsx\nimport { AnimatePresence, motion } from ''framer-motion'';\n\nfunction Modal({ isOpen, onClose, children }) {\n  return (\n    <AnimatePresence>\n      {isOpen && (\n        <>\n          {/* Backdrop */}\n          <motion.div\n            className=\"fixed inset-0 bg-black/50\"\n            initial={{ opacity: 0 }}\n            animate={{ opacity: 1 }}\n            exit={{ opacity: 0 }}\n            onClick={onClose}\n          />\n\n          {/* Modal content */}\n          <motion.div\n            className=\"fixed inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\"\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.95 }}\n            animate={{ opacity: 1, scale: 1 }}\n            exit={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.95 }}\n            transition={{ duration: 0.2 }}\n          >\n            {children}\n          </motion.div>\n        </>\n      )}\n    </AnimatePresence>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Gesture Animations\n\n```tsx\nimport { motion } from ''framer-motion'';\n\n<motion.button\n  whileHover={{ scale: 1.05 }}\n  whileTap={{ scale: 0.95 }}\n  transition={{ type: ''spring'', stiffness: 400, damping: 17 }}\n>\n  Click me\n</motion.button>\n\n// Drag\n<motion.div\n  drag\n  dragConstraints={{ left: 0, right: 300, top: 0, bottom: 300 }}\n  dragElastic={0.1}\n  whileDrag={{ scale: 1.1 }}\n>\n  Drag me\n</motion.div>\n```\n\n### List Animations\n\n```tsx\nimport { motion } from ''framer-motion'';\n\nconst container = {\n  hidden: { opacity: 0 },\n  show: {\n    opacity: 1,\n    transition: {\n      staggerChildren: 0.1,\n    },\n  },\n};\n\nconst item = {\n  hidden: { opacity: 0, y: 20 },\n  show: { opacity: 1, y: 0 },\n};\n\nfunction List({ items }) {\n  return (\n    <motion.ul\n      variants={container}\n      initial=\"hidden\"\n      animate=\"show\"\n    >\n      {items.map((data) => (\n        <motion.li key={data.id} variants={item}>\n          {data.title}\n        </motion.li>\n      ))}\n    </motion.ul>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Layout Animations\n\n```tsx\nimport { motion, LayoutGroup } from ''framer-motion'';\n\nfunction Tabs({ tabs, activeTab, onTabChange }) {\n  return (\n    <LayoutGroup>\n      <div className=\"flex space-x-2\">\n        {tabs.map((tab) => (\n          <button\n            key={tab.id}\n            onClick={() => onTabChange(tab.id)}\n            className=\"relative px-4 py-2\"\n          >\n            {tab.label}\n            {activeTab === tab.id && (\n              <motion.div\n                layoutId=\"activeTab\"\n                className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-blue-100 rounded-lg\"\n                style={{ zIndex: -1 }}\n                transition={{ type: ''spring'', stiffness: 500, damping: 30 }}\n              />\n            )}\n          </button>\n        ))}\n      </div>\n    </LayoutGroup>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Scroll Animations\n\n```tsx\nimport { motion, useScroll, useTransform } from ''framer-motion'';\n\nfunction ParallaxHero() {\n  const { scrollY } = useScroll();\n  const y = useTransform(scrollY, [0, 500], [0, 150]);\n  const opacity = useTransform(scrollY, [0, 300], [1, 0]);\n\n  return (\n    <motion.div\n      style={{ y, opacity }}\n      className=\"h-screen flex items-center justify-center\"\n    >\n      <h1 className=\"text-6xl font-bold\">Welcome</h1>\n    </motion.div>\n  );\n}\n\n// Scroll-triggered animation\nimport { useInView } from ''framer-motion'';\n\nfunction FadeInSection({ children }) {\n  const ref = useRef(null);\n  const isInView = useInView(ref, { once: true, margin: ''-100px'' });\n\n  return (\n    <motion.div\n      ref={ref}\n      initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 50 }}\n      animate={isInView ? { opacity: 1, y: 0 } : { opacity: 0, y: 50 }}\n      transition={{ duration: 0.5 }}\n    >\n      {children}\n    </motion.div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## CSS Animations\n\n### Keyframe Animations\n\n```css\n/* Tailwind config */\nanimation: {\n  ''fade-in'': ''fadeIn 0.3s ease-out'',\n  ''slide-up'': ''slideUp 0.3s ease-out'',\n  ''spin-slow'': ''spin 3s linear infinite'',\n  ''pulse-subtle'': ''pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite'',\n},\nkeyframes: {\n  fadeIn: {\n    ''0%'': { opacity: ''0'' },\n    ''100%'': { opacity: ''1'' },\n  },\n  slideUp: {\n    ''0%'': { transform: ''translateY(10px)'', opacity: ''0'' },\n    ''100%'': { transform: ''translateY(0)'', opacity: ''1'' },\n  },\n}\n```\n\n### Transition Classes\n\n```tsx\n// Hover transitions\n<button className=\"\n  transition-all duration-200 ease-out\n  hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-lg\n  active:scale-95\n\">\n  Click me\n</button>\n\n// Color transitions\n<div className=\"\n  transition-colors duration-300\n  bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200\n  dark:bg-gray-800 dark:hover:bg-gray-700\n\">\n  Content\n</div>\n```\n\n## Loading States\n\n### Skeleton Loading\n\n```tsx\nfunction SkeletonCard() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"animate-pulse\">\n      <div className=\"h-48 bg-gray-200 rounded-lg\" />\n      <div className=\"mt-4 space-y-3\">\n        <div className=\"h-4 bg-gray-200 rounded w-3/4\" />\n        <div className=\"h-4 bg-gray-200 rounded w-1/2\" />\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Spinner Component\n\n```tsx\nfunction Spinner({ size = ''md'' }) {\n  const sizes = {\n    sm: ''w-4 h-4'',\n    md: ''w-6 h-6'',\n    lg: ''w-8 h-8'',\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <svg\n      className={`animate-spin ${sizes[size]} text-blue-600`}\n      xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n      fill=\"none\"\n      viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n    >\n      <circle\n        className=\"opacity-25\"\n        cx=\"12\"\n        cy=\"12\"\n        r=\"10\"\n        stroke=\"currentColor\"\n        strokeWidth=\"4\"\n      />\n      <path\n        className=\"opacity-75\"\n        fill=\"currentColor\"\n        d=\"M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4z\"\n      />\n    </svg>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Reduced Motion Support\n\n```tsx\nimport { useReducedMotion } from ''framer-motion'';\n\nfunction AnimatedComponent() {\n  const shouldReduceMotion = useReducedMotion();\n\n  return (\n    <motion.div\n      initial={{ opacity: 0, y: shouldReduceMotion ? 0 : 20 }}\n      animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\n      transition={{ duration: shouldReduceMotion ? 0 : 0.3 }}\n    >\n      Content\n    </motion.div>\n  );\n}\n\n// CSS approach\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  * {\n    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Performance Tips\n\n1. **Animate transform and opacity only** - GPU accelerated\n2. **Use `will-change` sparingly** - For complex animations\n3. **Avoid layout thrashing** - Don''t animate width/height\n4. **Use `AnimatePresence` mode=\"wait\"** - Prevent animation overlap\n5. **Lazy load animations** - For below-fold content\n\n```tsx\n// GPU-optimized animation\n<motion.div\n  animate={{ x: 100 }}  // Good: transform\n  // animate={{ left: 100 }}  // Bad: layout property\n/>\n\n// will-change for complex animations\n<div style={{ willChange: ''transform'' }}>\n  Heavy animation here\n</div>\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **200-400ms for transitions** - Feels responsive\n2. **Spring for interactive elements** - Natural feel\n3. **Ease-out for enter** - Elements arrive and settle\n4. **Ease-in for exit** - Elements accelerate away\n5. **Stagger lists** - 50-100ms between items\n6. **Match motion to meaning** - Slide for navigation, fade for content\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Page transitions and navigation\n- Modal and dialog animations\n- Loading and progress states\n- Micro-interactions and feedback\n- Scroll-driven effects\n- Interactive data visualizations\n\n## Notes\n\n- Test on lower-end devices\n- Always respect prefers-reduced-motion\n- Keep animations consistent across the app\n- Don''t animate everything - be selective\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:48:01.014Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced animation and motion design capabilities with Framer Motion","zh":"非常适合需要高级动画和运动设计能力的前端代理，特别是使用 Framer Motion","ja":"Framer Motionを使用するフロントエンドエージェントが高度なアニメーションとモーションデザイン機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"프레임 모션을 사용하는 프론트엔드 에이전트가 고급 애니메이션 및 모션 디자인 기능을 필요로 할 때 완벽한 선택","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de animación y diseño de movimiento avanzados con Framer Motion","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités de conception d''animation et de mouvement avancées avec Framer Motion","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Animations- und Bewegungsdesign-Fähigkeiten mit Framer Motion benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de animação e design de movimento com Framer Motion","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности анимации и дизайна движения с Framer Motion","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة للرسوم المتحركة وتصميم الحركة مع Framer Motion"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create smooth, purposeful animations using transform and opacity, while honoring user preferences for reduced motion and optimizing performance with consistent easing, all within a comprehensive Claude Code project template","zh":"赋予代理创建平滑、有目的的动画的能力，使用变换和不透明度，同时尊重用户对减少运动的偏好，并通过一致的缓动优化性能，所有这些都在一个综合的 Claude 代码项目模板中","ja":"エージェントが変換と不透明度を使用してスムーズで目的のあるアニメーションを作成する能力を付与し、減少した動きに対するユーザーの設定を尊重し、一貫したイージングでパフォーマンスを最適化する、すべてを包括的なClaudeコードプロジェクトテンプレート内で","ko":"에이전트가 변환과 투명도 등을 사용하여 부드럽고 의도적인 애니메이션을 만들 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 사용자의 감소된 움직임에 대한 설정을 존중하고, 일관된 이징으로 성능을 최적화하는 모든 것을 포괄적인 Claude 코드 프로젝트 템플릿 내에서","es":"Permite a los agentes crear animaciones suaves y con un propósito, utilizando transformaciones y opacidad, al tiempo que respeta las preferencias de los usuarios para reducir el movimiento y optimiza el rendimiento con un suavizado coherente, todo dentro de una plantilla de proyecto de Claude Code integral","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des animations fluides et intentionnelles en utilisant la transformation et l''opacité, tout en respectant les préférences des utilisateurs pour réduire le mouvement et en optimisant les performances avec un assouplissement cohérent, le tout dans un modèle de projet Claude Code complet","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, sanfte, zweckmäßige Animationen mit Transformation und Opazität zu erstellen, während sie die Benutzervorlieben für reduzierte Bewegung respektieren und die Leistung mit konsistentem Easing optimieren, all dies innerhalb einer umfassenden Claude-Code-Projektvorlage","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar animações suaves e propositais usando transform e opacidade, respeitando as preferências do usuário para reduzir o movimento e otimizar o desempenho com aceleração consistente, tudo dentro de um modelo de projeto Claude Code abrangente","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать плавные и осмысленные анимации с использованием трансформации и прозрачности, уважая предпочтения пользователей по уменьшению движения и оптимизации производительности с последовательным ускорением, все в рамках комплексного шаблона проекта Claude Code","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء حركات متحركة ملساء ومدروسة باستخدام التحويل والOpacity ، مع احترام تفضيلات المستخدم لتحسين الحركة وتحسين الأداء مع التعجيل المنتظم ، كل ذلك داخل قوالب مشروع Claude Code الشاملة"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating subtle UI transitions with 200-400ms duration","Creating motion languages with consistent easing for brand consistency","Optimizing animation performance for better user experience"],"zh":["生成持续时间为200-400ms的微妙UI过渡","创建具有一致缓动的运动语言以保持品牌一致性","优化动画性能以提高用户体验"],"ja":["200-400msの持続時間の微妙なUI遷移を生成する","一貫したイージングを持つモーション言語を作成してブランドの一貫性を保つ","アニメーションのパフォーマンスを最適化してユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させる"],"ko":["200-400ms 지속 시간의 미묘한 UI 전환 생성","일관된 이징을 갖춘 모션 언어 생성하여 브랜드 일관성 유지","애니메이션 성능 최적화하여 사용자 경험 향상"],"es":["Generar transiciones de interfaz de usuario sutiles con una duración de 200-400 ms","Crear lenguajes de movimiento con suavizado coherente para la coherencia de la marca","Optimizar el rendimiento de la animación para una mejor experiencia del usuario"],"fr":["Générer des transitions d''interface utilisateur subtiles avec une durée de 200-400 ms","Créer des langages de mouvement avec un assouplissement cohérent pour la cohérence de la marque","Optimiser les performances d''animation pour une meilleure expérience utilisateur"],"de":["Erzeugen von subtilen Benutzeroberflächenübergängen mit einer Dauer von 200-400 ms","Erstellen von Bewegungssprachen mit konsistentem Easing für Markenkontinuität","Optimieren der Animationsleistung für eine bessere Benutzererfahrung"],"pt":["Gerar transições de interface do usuário sutis com duração de 200-400ms","Criar linguagens de movimento com aceleração consistente para consistência da marca","Otimizar o desempenho da animação para melhorar a experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Генерировать тонкие переходы пользовательского интерфейса с продолжительностью 200-400мс","Создавать языки движения с последовательным ускорением для согласованности бренда","Оптимизировать производительность анимации для улучшения пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["إنشاء تحولات واجهة المستخدم اللطيفة مع مدة 200-400ms","إنشاء لغات الحركة مع تعجيل منتظم للتوافق مع علامة تجارية","تحسين أداء الرسوم المتحركة لتحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Framer Motion library integration","Respects reduced motion user preferences"],"zh":["需要集成Framer Motion库","尊重减少运动的用户设置"],"ja":["Framer Motionライブラリの統合が必要","減少した動きのユーザー設定を尊重"],"ko":["프레임 모션 라이브러리 통합이 필요","감소된 움직임에 대한 사용자 설정을 존중"],"es":["Requiere la integración de la biblioteca Framer Motion","Respeta las preferencias de los usuarios para reducir el movimiento"],"fr":["Nécessite l''intégration de la bibliothèque Framer Motion","Respecte les préférences des utilisateurs pour réduire le mouvement"],"de":["Erfordert die Integration der Framer-Motion-Bibliothek","Respektiert die Benutzervorlieben für reduzierte Bewegung"],"pt":["Requer integração da biblioteca Framer Motion","Respeita as preferências do usuário para reduzir o movimento"],"ru":["Требует интеграции библиотеки Framer Motion","Уважает предпочтения пользователя по уменьшению движения"],"ar":["يتطلب دمج مكتبة Framer Motion","يهتم بالاحترام لتفضيلات المستخدم لتحسين الحركة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('rebyteai-template/langchain-retrieval-agent/build-and-deploy', 'community', 'rebyteai-template', 'langchain-retrieval-agent', 'rebyteai-template/langchain-retrieval-agent', 'build-and-deploy', 0, 0, 45, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z', '2026-02-18T03:48:08.526Z', NULL, '{"id":"rebyteai-template/langchain-retrieval-agent/build-and-deploy","name":"build-and-deploy","description":{"zh":"LangChain.js, Supabase ","ja":"LangChain.js, Supabase ","ko":"LangChain.js, Supabase ","es":"El agente de recuperación de LangChain.js utiliza herramientas de recuperación y el SDK de Vercel AI para construir y desplegar aplicaciones de recuperación de información","fr":"L''agent de récupération LangChain.js utilise des outils de récupération et le SDK Vercel AI pour construire et déployer des applications de récupération d''informations","de":"Der LangChain.js-Retrieval-Agent verwendet Retrieval-Tools und das Vercel AI SDK, um Informationsabrufanwendungen zu erstellen und bereitzustellen","pt":"O agente de recuperação LangChain é uma combinação poderosa de LangGraph, Supabase e SDK de IA da Vercel. Aprenda a construí-lo e implantá-lo.","ru":"Агент поиска LangChain - это мощная комбинация LangGraph, Supabase и SDK ИИ Vercel. Узнайте, как его создать и развернуть.","ar":"وكيل استرجاع LangChain هو مزيج قوي من LangGraph و Supabase و SDK AI من Vercel. تعلم بناءه ونشره.","en":"LangChain.js agent with retrieval tool powered by LangGraph, Supabase vector store, and the Vercel AI SDK"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"LangChain.js ","ja":"LangChain.js","ko":"LangChain.js ","es":"Construir y desplegar agente de recuperación de LangChain","fr":"Construire et déployer un agent de récupération LangChain","de":"Build- und Deploy-Modus für LangChain-Retrieval-Agent","pt":"Construa e Implante Agentes LangChain com LangGraph e Vercel","ru":"Создание и развер