 eine fundierte Entscheidung zu treffen.","pt":"Aprenda a identificar padrões de alerta em empresas e descubra os indicadores de bandeiras vermelhas","ru":"Научитесь выявлять предупреждающие паттерны в компаниях и узнайте о красных флагах","ar":"تعلم كيفية تحديد انماط التحذير في الشركات واكتشف معايير علماء حمراء","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["注册地址异常","业务模式可疑","财务报表异常","管理层异常","行业风险高"],"ja":["登記住所の異常","事業モデルの可疑性","財務諸表の異常","経営陣の異常","業界リスクの高さ"],"ko":["등록 주소 비정상","사업 모델 의심","재무 보고서 비정상","경영진 비정상","산업 위험도 높음"],"es":["Identificación de empresas de fachada","Análisis de direcciones de agentes de formación","Clasificación de señales de alerta por color","Investigación de empresas con indicadores de fraude","Análisis de patrones de comportamiento empresarial"],"fr":["Identification d''entreprises-écrans","Analyse d''adresses d''agents de formation","Classification des signaux d''alarme par couleur","Enquête sur les entreprises avec des indicateurs de fraude","Analyse de modèles de comportement d''entreprise"],"de":["Identifizierung von Briefkastenfirmen","Analyse von Adressen von Gründungsagenten","Klassifizierung von Warnsignalen nach Farbe","Untersuchung von Unternehmen mit Betrugsindikatoren","Analyse von Unternehmensverhaltensmustern"],"pt":["Identificação de empresas de fachada","Análise de endereços de agências de formação","Detecção de padrões de alerta","Classificação de bandeiras por nível de preocupação","Investigação de empresas com múltiplos indicadores de alerta"],"ru":["Обнаружение фиктивных компаний","Анализ адресов агентств по созданию компаний","Обнаружение предупреждающих паттернов","Классификация красных флагов по уровню обеспокоенности","Расследование компаний с несколькими индикаторами предупреждения"],"ar":["اكتشاف الشركات الوهمية","تحليل عناوين وكالات التشكيل","كشف انماط التحذير","تصنيف علماء حمراء حسب مستوى القلق","التحقيق في الشركات مع عدة معايير تحذير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["公司调查","红旗指标","注册地址","业务模式","财务报表","管理层","行业风险"],"ja":["会社調査","レッドフラグ","登記住所","事業モデル","財務諸表","経営陣","業界リスク"],"ko":["회사 조사","적색 신호","등록 주소","사업 모델","재무 보고서","경영진","산업 위험"],"es":["señales de alerta para empresas","investigación de empresas","análisis de riesgos","indicadores de fraude","empresas de fachada","formación de empresas","due diligence"],"fr":["signaux d''alarme pour les entreprises","enquête sur les entreprises","analyse de risques","indicateurs de fraude","entreprises-écrans","formation d''entreprises","due diligence"],"de":["Unternehmenswarnflaggen","Untersuchung von Unternehmen","Risikoanalyse","Betrugsindikatoren","Briefkastenfirmen","Gründung von Unternehmen","due diligence"],"pt":["bandeiras vermelhas","investigação de empresas","empresas de fachada","análise de risco","padrões de alerta","classificação de bandeiras"],"ru":["красные флаги","расследование компаний","фиктивные компании","анализ риска","предупреждающие паттерны","классификация красных флагов"],"ar":["علماء حمراء","التحقيق في الشركات","الشركات الوهمية","تحليل المخاطر","انماط التحذير","تصنيف علماء حمراء"]}},"owner":"ste","repo":"sus","repoPath":"ste/sus","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"company-red-flags","description":"Knowledge base of red flags and suspicious patterns when investigating UK companies. Use when analysing companies, officers, PSCs, or corporate networks for signs of fraud, money laundering, shell companies, or other dodginess.","bodyPreview":"# Company Investigation Red Flags\n\nWhen investigating companies, look for the following patterns and flag them by colour:\n\n- **Red flag** — serious concern, warrants immediate attention\n- **Orange flag** — notable, worth investigating further\n- **Yellow flag** — minor concern, note but don''t overweight\n\n## Shell Company Indicators\n\n- **Registered at known formation agent addresses** (RED) — e.g., 20-22 Wenlock Road London N1 7GU, 71-75 Shelton Street London WC2H 9JQ, and other high-density regis","body":"# Company Investigation Red Flags\n\nWhen investigating companies, look for the following patterns and flag them by colour:\n\n- **Red flag** — serious concern, warrants immediate attention\n- **Orange flag** — notable, worth investigating further\n- **Yellow flag** — minor concern, note but don''t overweight\n\n## Shell Company Indicators\n\n- **Registered at known formation agent addresses** (RED) — e.g., 20-22 Wenlock Road London N1 7GU, 71-75 Shelton Street London WC2H 9JQ, and other high-density registered office addresses. If dozens/hundreds of companies share the same registered address, flag it.\n- **No employees reported** in confirmation statements (ORANGE)\n- **Dormant accounts filed** since incorporation or for extended periods (ORANGE)\n- **Vague SIC codes** (YELLOW-ORANGE) — especially 70229 (Management consultancy), 64209 (Activities of other holding companies), 82990 (Other business support activities)\n- **Incorporated shortly before a significant transaction** (RED) — suggests purpose-built vehicle\n- **Very low share capital** combined with high-value transactions (ORANGE)\n\n## Officer Red Flags\n\n- **Directors across unusually many companies** (ORANGE-RED) — especially if many are dissolved. Threshold: 10+ active directorships is notable, 20+ is suspicious, 50+ almost certainly a nominee/formation agent\n- **Rapid director turnover** (ORANGE) — multiple directors appointed and resigned within short periods\n- **Corporate directors** (ORANGE) — companies acting as directors of other companies. Legal but used to obscure beneficial ownership\n- **Officers with addresses in secrecy jurisdictions** (RED) — BVI, Cayman Islands, Panama, Seychelles, Marshall Islands, Belize\n- **Nominee director patterns** (RED) — same individual as director of many unrelated companies, especially combined with formation agent addresses\n- **Recently disqualified directors** still appearing on active companies (RED)\n\n## PSC / Ownership Red Flags\n\n- **PSC chains through offshore entities** (RED) — ownership via BVI, Cayman, Jersey, Guernsey, Isle of Man, Luxembourg, Netherlands (holding companies), Cyprus, Malta\n- **Ownership at reporting thresholds** (ORANGE) — \"25-50%\" brackets suggest structuring to minimise disclosure\n- **Multiple layers of corporate ownership** before reaching a natural person (RED)\n- **PSC exemptions claimed** without clear justification (ORANGE)\n- **No PSC registered** when one should exist (RED) — suggests deliberate concealment\n\n## Filing Pattern Red Flags\n\n- **Late filing penalties** (YELLOW-ORANGE) — one-off may be admin error, repeated is suspicious\n- **Accounts overdue** (ORANGE)\n- **Sudden changes in accounting reference date** (ORANGE) — can be used to delay disclosure\n- **Micro-entity accounts** used to minimise disclosure (YELLOW) — legitimate for small companies but reduces transparency\n- **No accounts filed despite trading** (RED)\n- **Abbreviated/filleted accounts** with minimal information (YELLOW)\n\n## Network Red Flags (for the spider agent)\n\n- **Circular ownership structures** (RED) — Company A owns Company B which owns Company A\n- **Same small group of individuals across many entities** (ORANGE-RED) — especially if companies are in different sectors\n- **Shared registered office + shared officers across unrelated sectors** (ORANGE)\n- **Dissolved companies that were briefly active** (ORANGE) — incorporated, used briefly, then dissolved\n- **Phoenix companies** (RED) — new company formed with same directors/address shortly after previous company dissolved/liquidated\n- **Layered structures with no apparent commercial rationale** (RED)\n\n## Investigation Methodology\n\n1. Start with the target company — get profile, officers, PSCs, filing history\n2. Map all current and recent officers — check their other directorships\n3. Map PSC chain — follow corporate owners to find natural persons\n4. Check the registered office — how many other companies use it?\n5. Look at the network — shared officers, shared addresses, shared PSCs\n6. Check filing patterns — late filings, dormant accounts, micro-entity accounts\n7. Cross-reference with known red flags above\n8. Score overall suspicion level based on accumulation of flags\n9. Generate network visualisation highlighting flagged entities\n10. Produce structured report with findings and evidence\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:48:32.197Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Investigative Agents needing advanced company investigation and red flag detection capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级公司调查和红旗检测功能的调查代理","ja":"高度な会社調査およびレッドフラグ検出機能を必要とする調査エージェントに最適","ko":"고급 회사 조사 및 적기 탐지 기능이 필요한 조사 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de investigación que necesitan capacidades de investigación de empresas avanzadas y detección de señales de alerta.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''enquête ayant besoin de capacités d''investigation d''entreprise avancées et de détection de signaux rouges.","de":"Perfekt für Ermittlungsagenten, die erweiterte Unternehmensuntersuchungen und Rotflaggen-Erkennungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Investigative Agents needing advanced company investigation and red flag detection capabilities.","ru":"Perfect for Investigative Agents needing advanced company investigation and red flag detection capabilities.","ar":"Perfect for Investigative Agents needing advanced company investigation and red flag detection capabilities."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify shell company indicators, flag suspicious patterns, and prioritize investigations using registered formation agent addresses, such as those in London, and categorize concerns by colour-coded flags, including red, orange, and yellow flags.","zh":"赋予代理识别壳公司指标、标记可疑模式、使用注册形成代理地址（如伦敦）优先调查，并通过颜色编码标志（包括红色、橙色和黄色标志）对问题进行分类","ja":"エージェントがシェル会社の指標を識別し、重大な懸念をレッドフラグでマークし、ロンドンなどの登録された形成代理アドレスを使用して調査を優先し、レッド、オレンジ、イエローのフラグなどのカラーコードで懸念を分類することを可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 셸 회사 지표를 식별하고 심각한 우려를 적색 깃발로 표시하고 런던과 같은 등록 된 형성 에이전트 주소를 사용하여 조사 우선순위를 지정하고 적색, 주황색, 노란색 깃발 등의 색상 코드로 우려를 분류 할 수있게합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar indicadores de empresas ficticias, señalizar patrones sospechosos y priorizar investigaciones utilizando direcciones de agentes de registro de formación registradas, como las de Londres, y categorizar preocupaciones por banderas codificadas por colores, incluyendo banderas rojas, naranjas y amarillas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les indicateurs de sociétés-écrans, de signaler des modèles suspects et de prioriser les enquêtes en utilisant des adresses d''agents de formation enregistrés, comme celles de Londres, et de catégoriser les préoccupations par des drapeaux codés par couleur, notamment des drapeaux rouges, orange et jaune.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Indikatoren für Scheinunternehmen zu identifizieren, verdächtige Muster zu kennzeichnen und Ermittlungen zu priorisieren, indem sie registrierte Anschriften von Gründungsagenten verwenden, wie z.B. die in London, und Bedenken nach farbcodierten Flaggen zu kategorisieren, einschließlich roter, oranger und gelber Flaggen.","pt":"Empowers agents to identify shell company indicators, flag suspicious patterns, and prioritize investigations using registered formation agent addresses, such as those in London, and categorize concerns by colour-coded flags, including red, orange, and yellow flags.","ru":"Empowers agents to identify shell company indicators, flag suspicious patterns, and prioritize investigations using registered formation agent addresses, such as those in London, and categorize concerns by colour-coded flags, including red, orange, and yellow flags.","ar":"Empowers agents to identify shell company indicators, flag suspicious patterns, and prioritize investigations using registered formation agent addresses, such as those in London, and categorize concerns by colour-coded flags, including red, orange, and yellow flags."},"useCases":{"en":["Identifying shell companies through registered addresses","Flagging serious concerns with red flags","Prioritizing investigations based on colour-coded flags"],"zh":["通过注册地址识别壳公司","使用红旗标记严重问题","基于颜色编码标志优先调查"],"ja":["登録アドレスを介してシェル会社を識別する","重大な問題をレッドフラグでマークする","カラーコードフラグに基づいて調査を優先する"],"ko":["등록 주소를 통해 셸 회사를 식별","적색 깃발로 심각한 문제를 표시","색상 코드 깃발을 기준으로 조사 우선순위 지정"],"es":["Identificar empresas ficticias a través de direcciones registradas","Señalizar preocupaciones graves con banderas rojas","Priorizar investigaciones en función de banderas codificadas por colores"],"fr":["Identifier les sociétés-écrans via des adresses enregistrées","Signaler des préoccupations graves avec des drapeaux rouges","Prioriser les enquêtes en fonction de drapeaux codés par couleur"],"de":["Scheinunternehmen durch registrierte Anschriften identifizieren","Schwere Bedenken mit roten Flaggen kennzeichnen","Ermittlungen nach farbcodierten Flaggen priorisieren"],"pt":["Identifying shell companies through registered addresses","Flagging serious concerns with red flags","Prioritizing investigations based on colour-coded flags"],"ru":["Identifying shell companies through registered addresses","Flagging serious concerns with red flags","Prioritizing investigations based on colour-coded flags"],"ar":["Identifying shell companies through registered addresses","Flagging serious concerns with red flags","Prioritizing investigations based on colour-coded flags"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to company registration data","Limited to investigating companies with known formation agent addresses"],"zh":["需要访问公司注册数据","仅限于调查具有已知形成代理地址的公司"],"ja":["会社登録データへのアクセスが必要","既知の形成代理アドレスを持つ会社の調査のみに限定"],"ko":["회사 등록 데이터에 대한 액세스가 필요","既知의 형성 에이전트 주소를 갖는 회사의 조사 만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso a datos de registro de empresas","Limitado a investigar empresas con direcciones de agentes de formación conocidas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux données d''enregistrement d''entreprise","Limité à l''enquête sur des entreprises avec des adresses d''agents de formation connues"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Unternehmensregistrierungsdaten","Begrenzt auf die Untersuchung von Unternehmen mit bekannten Gründungsagenten-Adressen"],"pt":["Requires access to company registration data","Limited to investigating companies with known formation agent addresses"],"ru":["Requires access to company registration data","Limited to investigating companies with known formation agent addresses"],"ar":["Requires access to company registration data","Limited to investigating companies with known formation agent addresses"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":20}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('miyakawa2449/KiroBookmark/mac-appstore-prep', 'community', 'miyakawa2449', 'KiroBookmark', 'miyakawa2449/KiroBookmark', 'mac-appstore-prep', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z', '2026-02-18T03:48:29.200Z', NULL, '{"id":"miyakawa2449/KiroBookmark/mac-appstore-prep","name":"mac-appstore-prep","description":{"zh":"本技能介绍了 Mac App Store 申請的准备工作，包括 Sandbox 和 Info.plist 设置等","ja":"本スキルでは、Mac App Store 申請の準備作業について説明します。Sandbox と Info.plist の設定などを含みます","ko":"본 스킬은 맥 앱 스토어 제출을 위한 준비 작업을介绍합니다. 샌드박스와 Info.plist 설정 등을 포함합니다","es":"Prepara tu aplicación para la Mac App Store con nuestra guía de verificación de requisitos y configuración","fr":"Préparez votre application pour la Mac App Store avec notre guide de vérification des exigences et de configuration","de":"Bereiten Sie Ihre App für den Mac App Store vor, mit unserer Anleitung zur Überprüfung der Anforderungen und Konfiguration","pt":"O skill ''mac-appstore-prep'' ajuda a preparar aplicativos para a Mac App Store, garantindo a conformidade com as políticas de segurança e configurações necessárias.","ru":"Навык ''mac-appstore-prep'' помогает подготовить приложения к Mac App Store, обеспечивая соответствие политикам безопасности и необходимым настройкам.","ar":"يُساعد مهارة ''mac-appstore-prep'' في تجهيز التطبيقات لمتجر تطبيقات ماك، مما يضمن مطابقة سياسات الأمان والإعدادات الضرورية.","en":"仕様駆動開発とテスト駆動開発で開発するBookmark ソフト"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Mac App Store 准备技能","ja":"Mac App Store 申請準備","ko":"맥 앱 스토어 준비 스킬","es":"Preparación para la Mac App Store","fr":"Préparation pour la Mac App Store","de":"Vorbereitung für den Mac App Store","pt":"Preparação para Mac App Store","ru":"Подготовка к Mac App Store","ar":"تجهيز متجر تطبيقات ماك","en":"mac-appstore-prep"},"description":{"zh":"本技能介绍了 Mac App Store 申請的准备工作，包括 Sandbox 和 Info.plist 设置等","ja":"本スキルでは、Mac App Store 申請の準備作業について説明します。Sandbox と Info.plist の設定などを含みます","ko":"본 스킬은 맥 앱 스토어 제출을 위한 준비 작업을介绍합니다. 샌드박스와 Info.plist 설정 등을 포함합니다","es":"Prepara tu aplicación para la Mac App Store con nuestra guía de verificación de requisitos y configuración","fr":"Préparez votre application pour la Mac App Store avec notre guide de vérification des exigences et de configuration","de":"Bereiten Sie Ihre App für den Mac App Store vor, mit unserer Anleitung zur Überprüfung der Anforderungen und Konfiguration","pt":"O skill ''mac-appstore-prep'' ajuda a preparar aplicativos para a Mac App Store, garantindo a conformidade com as políticas de segurança e configurações necess...","ru":"Навык ''mac-appstore-prep'' помогает подготовить приложения к Mac App Store, обеспечивая соответствие политикам безопасности и необходимым настройкам.","ar":"يُساعد مهارة ''mac-appstore-prep'' في تجهيز التطبيقات لمتجر تطبيقات ماك، مما يضمن مطابقة سياسات الأمان والإعدادات الضرورية.","en":"仕様駆動開発とテスト駆動開発で開発するBookmark ソフト"},"definition":{"en":"仕様駆動開発とテスト駆動開発で開発するBookmark ソフト"},"features":{"zh":["Sandbox 设置","Info.plist 配置","权限描述设置","Temporary Exception Entitlements 设置","应用程序配置和优化"],"ja":["Sandbox 設定","Info.plist 構成","権限説明設定","Temporary Exception Entitlements 設定","アプリケーション構成と最適化"],"ko":["샌드박스 설정","Info.plist 구성","권한 설명 설정","임시 예외 Entitlements 설정","애플리케이션 구성과 최적화"],"es":["Configuración de Sandbox","Eliminación de Entitlements innecesarios","Preparación de la descripción de Temporary Exception Entitlements","Configuración de Info.plist","Descripción de permisos para macOS"],"fr":["Configuration de Sandbox","Suppression des Entitlements inutiles","Préparation de la description des Entitlements d''exception temporaire","Configuration de Info.plist","Description des autorisations pour macOS"],"de":["Sandbox-Konfiguration","Entfernen unnötiger Entitlements","Vorbereitung der Beschreibung von Temporary Exception Entitlements","Info.plist-Konfiguration","Beschreibung der Berechtigungen für macOS"],"pt":["Verificação de sandbox","Configuração de Entitlements","Preparação de Temporary Exception Entitlements","Configuração de Info.plist","Definição de permissões de sistema"],"ru":["Проверка sandbox","Настройка Entitlements","Подготовка Temporary Exception Entitlements","Настройка Info.plist","Определение разрешений системы"],"ar":["التحقق من sandbox","إعداد Entitlements","إعداد Temporary Exception Entitlements","إعداد Info.plist","تعريف صلاحيات النظام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Mac App Store","Sandbox","Info.plist","权限描述","Temporary Exception Entitlements","应用程序配置","开发者工具","提交指南"],"ja":["Mac App Store","Sandbox","Info.plist","権限説明","Temporary Exception Entitlements","アプリケーション構成","開発者ツール","提出ガイド"],"ko":["맥 앱 스토어","샌드박스","Info.plist","권한 설명","임시 예외 Entitlements","애플리케이션 구성","개발자 도구","제출 가이드"],"es":["Mac App Store","preparación de aplicaciones","configuración de Sandbox","Entitlements","Info.plist","permisos de macOS","desarrollo de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Mac App Store","préparation d''applications","configuration de Sandbox","Entitlements","Info.plist","autorisations de macOS","développement d''applications"],"de":["Mac App Store","App-Vorbereitung","Sandbox-Konfiguration","Entitlements","Info.plist","macOS-Berechtigungen","App-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Mac App Store","preparação de aplicativos","segurança de aplicativos","configuração de sandbox","Entitlements","Info.plist"],"ru":["Mac App Store","подготовка приложений","безопасность приложений","настройка sandbox","Entitlements","Info.plist"],"ar":["متجر تطبيقات ماك","تجهيز التطبيقات","أمان التطبيقات","إعداد sandbox","Entitlements","Info.plist"]}},"owner":"miyakawa2449","repo":"KiroBookmark","repoPath":"miyakawa2449/KiroBookmark","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mac-appstore-prep","description":"Mac App Store申請前のチェックリスト。Sandbox必須、スクリーンショット、Notarization、権限説明を確認。Use when: Mac App Store、macOS申請、Mac審査 を依頼された時。","bodyPreview":"# Mac App Store 申請準備\n\n## 必須チェック項目\n\n### Sandbox 必須\n- [ ] com.apple.security.app-sandbox = true（Mac App Storeでは必須）\n- [ ] 不要な Entitlements を削除\n- [ ] Temporary Exception Entitlements の説明を準備（使用時）\n\n### Info.plist 権限説明（macOS固有）\n- [ ] NSCameraUsageDescription（カメラ使用時）\n- [ ] NSMicrophoneUsageDescription（マイク使用時）\n- [ ] NSAppleEventsUsageDescription（AppleScript使用時）\n- [ ] NSSystemAdministrationUsageDescription（管理者権限使用時）\n- [ ] NSDesktopFolderUsageDescription（デスクトップアクセス時）\n- [ ] NSDocumentsFolderUsageDescription","body":"# Mac App Store 申請準備\n\n## 必須チェック項目\n\n### Sandbox 必須\n- [ ] com.apple.security.app-sandbox = true（Mac App Storeでは必須）\n- [ ] 不要な Entitlements を削除\n- [ ] Temporary Exception Entitlements の説明を準備（使用時）\n\n### Info.plist 権限説明（macOS固有）\n- [ ] NSCameraUsageDescription（カメラ使用時）\n- [ ] NSMicrophoneUsageDescription（マイク使用時）\n- [ ] NSAppleEventsUsageDescription（AppleScript使用時）\n- [ ] NSSystemAdministrationUsageDescription（管理者権限使用時）\n- [ ] NSDesktopFolderUsageDescription（デスクトップアクセス時）\n- [ ] NSDocumentsFolderUsageDescription（書類フォルダアクセス時）\n- [ ] NSDownloadsFolderUsageDescription（ダウンロードフォルダアクセス時）\n\n### スクリーンショット要件\n| サイズ | 解像度 | 備考 |\n|--------|--------|------|\n| 1280 x 800 | 非Retina | 最小サイズ |\n| 1440 x 900 | 非Retina | 推奨 |\n| 2560 x 1600 | Retina | 推奨 |\n| 2880 x 1800 | Retina | 最大サイズ |\n\n※ 最低1枚、最大10枚\n\n### アセット\n- [ ] App Icon（1024x1024、角丸なし）\n- [ ] macOS用アイコンセット（16x16 〜 512x512@2x）\n\n### ビルド設定\n- [ ] Release 設定でビルド可能\n- [ ] Deployment Target が適切（最低サポートOS）\n- [ ] Architectures に arm64 と x86_64 を含む（Universal Binary推奨）\n\n## App Store Connect 設定\n\n### カテゴリ\n- [ ] 適切なカテゴリを選択\n- [ ] サブカテゴリの設定（該当時）\n\n### 価格と配信\n- [ ] 価格設定\n- [ ] 配信国/地域の設定\n\n### App Privacy\n- [ ] データ収集の回答\n- [ ] プライバシーポリシーURL\n\n## 審査対策\n\n### よくあるリジェクト理由（macOS固有）\n1. Sandbox 違反\n2. 不必要な Entitlements の使用\n3. プライベートAPIの使用\n4. 適切でない Temporary Exception の使用\n\n### テスト確認\n```bash\n# Sandbox テスト\nsandbox-exec -f /path/to/profile YourApp.app/Contents/MacOS/YourApp\n\n# Entitlements 確認\ncodesign -d --entitlements :- YourApp.app\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:48:29.200Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for macOS Agent Developers needing to ensure compliance with Mac App Store guidelines and sandbox requirements.","zh":"适用于需要确保符合Mac App Store指南和沙盒要求的macOS Agent开发人员的理想选择。","ja":"Mac App Storeのガイドラインおよびサンドボックス要件に準拠する必要があるmacOSエージェント開発者に最適です。","ko":"Mac App Store 지침 및 샌드박스 요구 사항을 준수해야 하는 macOS 에이전트 개발자를 위한 최적의 선택입니다.","es":"Ideal para desarrolladores de Agentes de macOS que necesitan asegurarse del cumplimiento de las directrices de la Mac App Store y los requisitos de sandbox.","fr":"Idéal pour les développeurs d''agents macOS ayant besoin de garantir la conformité aux directives de la Mac App Store et aux exigences de sandbox.","de":"Ideal für macOS-Agent-Entwickler, die die Einhaltung der Mac-App-Store-Richtlinien und der Sandbox-Anforderungen sicherstellen müssen.","pt":"Ideal para desenvolvedores de agentes macOS que precisam garantir a conformidade com as diretrizes da Mac App Store e os requisitos de sandbox.","ru":"Идеально подходит для разработчиков агентов macOS, которым необходимо обеспечить соответствие руководящим принципам Mac App Store и требованиям sandbox.","ar":"مثالي لمنشئي عميل macOS الذين يحتاجون إلى ضمان الامتثال لارشادات متجر تطبيقات Mac ومتطلبات Sandbox."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to prepare apps for Mac App Store submission by enforcing sandbox rules, configuring Info.plist permissions, and managing entitlements for camera, microphone, and system administration usage, ensuring seamless integration with macOS-specific features like AppleScript and desktop folder access.","zh":"赋予代理人准备应用程序以提交Mac App Store的能力，通过执行沙盒规则、配置Info.plist权限、管理摄像头、麦克风和系统管理使用的权限，确保与macOS特定功能（如AppleScript和桌面文件夹访问）无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントがMac App Storeにアプリを提出する準備を行うことを可能にし、サンドボックス規則の適用、Info.plistの権限設定、カメラ、マイク、システム管理使用の権限管理を行い、AppleScriptやデスクトップフォルダーアクセスなどのmacOS固有の機能とのシームレスな統合を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 Mac App Store에 애플리케이션을 제출할 수 있도록 준비할 수 있도록 하며, 샌드박스 규칙을 적용하고, Info.plist 권한을 구성하며, 카메라, 마이크, 시스템 관리 사용의 권한을 관리하여, AppleScript 및 데스크톱 폴더 액세스와 같은 macOS 고유 기능과 무제한으로 통합할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes preparar aplicaciones para la presentación en la Mac App Store mediante la aplicación de reglas de sandbox, la configuración de permisos de Info.plist y la administración de derechos para el uso de la cámara, el micrófono y la administración del sistema, lo que garantiza una integración sin problemas con las características específicas de macOS como AppleScript y acceso a la carpeta de escritorio.","fr":"Permet aux agents de préparer les applications pour la soumission à la Mac App Store en appliquant les règles de sandbox, en configurant les autorisations de Info.plist et en gérant les droits pour l''utilisation de l''appareil photo, du microphone et de l''administration système, garantissant ainsi une intégration sans problème avec les fonctionnalités spécifiques à macOS comme AppleScript et l''accès au dossier de bureau.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Apps für die Einreichung im Mac App Store vorzubereiten, indem es Sandbox-Regeln durchsetzt, Info.plist-Berechtigungen konfiguriert und Berechtigungen für die Verwendung von Kamera, Mikrofon und Systemadministration verwaltet, was eine nahtlose Integration mit macOS-spezifischen Funktionen wie AppleScript und Zugriff auf den Desktop-Ordner ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a preparar aplicativos para envio à Mac App Store, aplicando regras de sandbox, configurando permissões do Info.plist e gerenciando direitos para uso de câmera, microfone e administração do sistema, garantindo integração perfeita com recursos específicos do macOS, como AppleScript e acesso à pasta de área de trabalho.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью подготовить приложения для отправки в Mac App Store, обеспечивая соблюдение правил sandbox, настройку разрешений Info.plist и управление правами на использование камеры, микрофона и системного администрирования, обеспечивая бесперебойную интеграцию с функциями macOS, такими как AppleScript и доступ к папке рабочего стола.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إعداد التطبيقات لإرسالها إلى متجر تطبيقات Mac من خلال فرض قواعد Sandbox وتكوين أذونات Info.plist وإدارة الامتيازات لاستخدام الكاميرا والميكروفون وإدارة النظام، مما يضمن التكامل السلس مع الميزات الخاصة بmacOS مثل AppleScript وصول إلى مجلد سطح المكتب."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring sandbox environments for Mac App Store compliance","Generating Info.plist files with necessary usage descriptions for macOS","Validating entitlements for temporary exceptions and AppleScript usage"],"zh":["为Mac App Store合规性配置沙盒环境","为macOS生成包含必要使用描述的Info.plist文件","验证临时异常和AppleScript使用的权限"],"ja":["Mac App Storeのコンプライアンスのためにサンドボックス環境を構成する","macOS用のInfo.plistファイルを生成し、必要な使用説明を含める","一時的な例外およびAppleScript使用のエントイトルメントを検証する"],"ko":["Mac App Store 준수성을 위한 샌드박스 환경 구성","macOS용 Info.plist 파일 생성 및 필요한 사용 설명 포함","임시 예외 및 AppleScript 사용의 엔티틀먼트 검증"],"es":["Configuración de entornos de sandbox para el cumplimiento de la Mac App Store","Generación de archivos Info.plist con descripciones de uso necesarias para macOS","Validación de derechos para excepciones temporales y uso de AppleScript"],"fr":["Configuration des environnements de sandbox pour la conformité à la Mac App Store","Génération de fichiers Info.plist avec des descriptions d''utilisation nécessaires pour macOS","Validation des droits pour les exceptions temporaires et l''utilisation d''AppleScript"],"de":["Konfiguration von Sandbox-Umgebungen für die Einhaltung der Mac-App-Store-Richtlinien","Erzeugung von Info.plist-Dateien mit den erforderlichen Nutzungsbeschreibungen für macOS","Validierung von Berechtigungen für vorübergehende Ausnahmen und AppleScript-Nutzung"],"pt":["Configurando ambientes de sandbox para conformidade com a Mac App Store","Gerando arquivos Info.plist com descrições de uso necessárias para macOS","Validando direitos para exceções temporárias e uso do AppleScript"],"ru":["Настройка среды sandbox для соответствия Mac App Store","Генерация файлов Info.plist с необходимыми описаниями использования для macOS","Проверка прав на временные исключения и использование AppleScript"],"ar":["تكوين بيئات Sandbox للامتثال لمتجر تطبيقات Mac","إعداد ملفات Info.plist مع وصفات استخدام ضرورية لmacOS","التحقق من الامتيازات لاستثناءات مؤقتة واستخدام AppleScript"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of macOS-specific permissions and entitlements","Limited to Mac App Store submission process","Needs accurate configuration of com.apple.security.app-sandbox and Info.plist"],"zh":["需要macOS特定权限和权限的知识","仅限Mac App Store提交流程","需要准确配置com.apple.security.app-sandbox和Info.plist"],"ja":["macOS固有の権限およびエントイトルメントに関する知識が必要","Mac App Store提出プロセスのみ","com.apple.security.app-sandboxおよびInfo.plistの正確な構成が必要"],"ko":["macOS 고유의 권한 및 엔티틀먼트에 대한 지식이 필요함","Mac App Store 제출 프로세스에만 제한됨","com.apple.security.app-sandbox 및 Info.plist의 정확한 구성이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de permisos y derechos específicos de macOS","Limitado al proceso de presentación en la Mac App Store","Necesita una configuración precisa de com.apple.security.app-sandbox y Info.plist"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances sur les autorisations et les droits spécifiques à macOS","Limité au processus de soumission à la Mac App Store","Nécessite une configuration précise de com.apple.security.app-sandbox et Info.plist"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse über macOS-spezifische Berechtigungen und Rechte","Begrenzt auf den Einreichungsprozess im Mac App Store","Benötigt eine genaue Konfiguration von com.apple.security.app-sandbox und Info.plist"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de permissões e direitos específicos do macOS","Limitado ao processo de envio da Mac App Store","Necessita de configuração precisa de com.apple.security.app-sandbox e Info.plist"],"ru":["Требует знания разрешений и прав, специфичных для macOS","Ограничен процессом отправки в Mac App Store","Требует точной настройки com.apple.security.app-sandbox и Info.plist"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بأذونات وامتيازات محددة لmacOS","محدود لعملية إرسال إلى متجر تطبيقات Mac","يحتاج إلى تكوين دقيق لcom.apple.security.app-sandbox وInfo.plist"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
