les problèmes GitHub de manière efficace.","de":"Der GitHub Issue Triage-Skill hilft Entwicklern, GitHub-Probleme effizient zu verwalten und zu priorisieren.","pt":"O GitHub Issue Triage é uma ferramenta que monitora problemas abertos, os combina com documentos de design e identifica problemas que podem ser fechados","ru":"GitHub Issue Triage - это инструмент, который отслеживает открытые проблемы, сопоставляет их с документами по дизайну и определяет проблемы, которые можно за...","ar":"ترياج مشاكل جيثب هو أداة تراقب المشاكل المفتوحة، وتطابقها مع وثائق التصميم، وتحدد المشاكل التي يمكن إغلاقها","en":"For humans, a language is a tool for expression. For AIs, it''s a substrate for reasoning."},"definition":{"en":"For humans, a language is a tool for expression. For AIs, it''s a substrate for reasoning."},"features":{"zh":["GitHub","design docs","GitHub","GitHub","CLI"],"ja":["GitHub","design docs","GitHub","GitHub","CLI"],"ko":["GitHub","design docs","GitHub","GitHub","CLI"],"es":["Monitoreo de problemas abiertos en GitHub","Asignación de problemas a documentos de diseño","Identificación de problemas cerrables","Sincronización del seguimiento de problemas con el progreso real del desarrollo"],"fr":["Surveillance des problèmes ouverts sur GitHub","Association des problèmes à des documents de conception","Identification des problèmes pouvant être fermés","Synchronisation du suivi des problèmes avec le progrès réel du développement"],"de":["Überwachung offener Probleme in GitHub","Zuordnung von Problemen zu Designdokumenten","Identifizierung von schließbaren Problemen","Synchronisation des Problem-Trackings mit dem tatsächlichen Entwicklungsfortschritt"],"pt":["Monitoramento de problemas abertos","Combinação de problemas com documentos de design","Identificação de problemas que podem ser fechados","Sincronização do rastreador de problemas com o progresso real do desenvolvimento","Relatórios personalizados para problemas"],"ru":["Отслеживание открытых проблем","Сопоставле