progress.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Issue Triage\n\n**Monitor open GitHub issues, match them to design docs, identify closable issues, and keep the issue tracker synchronized with actual development progress.**\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Most common usage:**\n```bash\n# Full triage report - shows all issues, matches to design docs, suggests closures\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/triage_report.sh\n\n# Just list open issues with labels and age\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/list_open_issues.sh\n\n# Find issues that","body":"# GitHub Issue Triage\n\n**Monitor open GitHub issues, match them to design docs, identify closable issues, and keep the issue tracker synchronized with actual development progress.**\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Most common usage:**\n```bash\n# Full triage report - shows all issues, matches to design docs, suggests closures\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/triage_report.sh\n\n# Just list open issues with labels and age\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/list_open_issues.sh\n\n# Find issues that have been implemented (design docs in implemented/)\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/find_closable.sh\n\n# Match issues to planned design docs (shows what''s being worked on)\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/match_design_docs.sh --planned\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when:\n- User asks \"what issues are open?\", \"check our issues\", \"triage issues\"\n- Starting a new development cycle and need to understand backlog\n- After completing a release to identify closable issues\n- Periodic housekeeping to keep issue tracker clean\n- User wants to understand which issues are covered by design docs\n\n## Available Scripts\n\n### `scripts/check_auth.sh`\nVerify GitHub CLI authentication matches expected user.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/check_auth.sh\n```\n\n**What it checks:**\n1. `gh` CLI is installed\n2. User is authenticated to github.com\n3. Active account matches `github.expected_user` in config\n\n**Exit codes:**\n- `0` - Auth OK, correct user active\n- `1` - Auth failed or wrong user active\n\n### `scripts/list_open_issues.sh [--json] [--labels LABELS]`\nList all open GitHub issues with details.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/list_open_issues.sh\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/list_open_issues.sh --json\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/list_open_issues.sh --labels bug,enhancement\n```\n\n**Output includes:**\n- Issue number and title\n- Labels (bug, enhancement, etc.)\n- Age (days since creation)\n- Last updated date\n- Assignee (if any)\n\n### `scripts/match_design_docs.sh [--planned] [--implemented] [--all]`\nMatch open issues to design documents.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/match_design_docs.sh           # All matches\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/match_design_docs.sh --planned # Only planned docs\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/match_design_docs.sh --implemented # Only implemented\n```\n\n**Matching strategy:**\n1. Exact issue number references (`#123` in design doc)\n2. Title keyword matching (significant words from issue title)\n3. Bug ID matching (`M-BUG-XXX` patterns)\n\n**Output:**\n```\nIssue #29: Parser crash on empty input\n  Status: COVERED\n  Design doc: design_docs/planned/v0_6_1/m-bug-parser-crash.md\n  Match type: exact_reference (#29)\n\nIssue #31: Add async support\n  Status: NOT COVERED\n  No matching design doc found\n  Suggestion: Create design doc in design_docs/planned/v0_7_0/\n```\n\n### `scripts/find_closable.sh [--close] [--dry-run]`\nFind issues that have been implemented and can be closed.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/find_closable.sh           # Report only\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/find_closable.sh --dry-run # Preview close actions\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/find_closable.sh --close   # Actually close issues\n```\n\n**What it checks:**\n1. Issue referenced in `design_docs/implemented/` directory\n2. Issue mentioned in CHANGELOG.md\n3. Issue keywords match implemented features\n\n### `scripts/triage_report.sh [--output FILE]`\nGenerate a complete triage report combining all analysis.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/triage_report.sh\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/triage_report.sh --output /tmp/triage.md\n```\n\n**Report includes:**\n1. **Summary**: Total open, covered, closable, orphaned\n2. **Closable Issues**: Ready to close (implemented)\n3. **Covered Issues**: Have design docs (in progress)\n4. **Orphaned Issues**: No design doc coverage (need attention)\n5. **Stale Issues**: No activity in 30+ days\n6. **Recommendations**: Suggested actions\n\n## Triage Workflow\n\n### 1. Check Authentication\n\n**Always verify correct GitHub account:**\n```bash\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/check_auth.sh\n```\n\nIf wrong account:\n```bash\ngh auth switch --user MarkEdmondson1234\n```\n\n### 2. Generate Triage Report\n\n```bash\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/triage_report.sh\n```\n\n### 3. Handle Closable Issues\n\n**Review and close issues that have been implemented:**\n```bash\n# Preview what would be closed\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/find_closable.sh --dry-run\n\n# Close with proper comments\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/find_closable.sh --close\n```\n\n### 4. Review Orphaned Issues\n\n**For issues without design doc coverage:**\n1. Assess priority and feasibility\n2. Create design doc if work should proceed: `/design-doc-creator`\n3. Close with \"won''t fix\" if out of scope\n4. Add to backlog for future versions\n\n### 5. Handle Stale Issues\n\n**For issues with no activity in 30+ days:**\n1. Check if still relevant\n2. Add comment requesting update from reporter\n3. Close if no response after additional time\n\n## Bot User Integration (sunholo-voight-kampff)\n\n**Status: ACTIVE** - Bot is configured and ready to use.\n\n**Bot account:** https://github.com/sunholo-voight-kampff\n\n### What Uses the Bot\n\n| Tool | Uses Bot? |\n|------|-----------|\n| `gh issue close/comment` | Yes (via `gh auth`) |\n| `ailang messages send --github` | Yes (via config) |\n| `ailang messages import-github` | Yes (via config) |\n| Issue triage scripts | Yes (uses `gh` CLI) |\n\n### Current Configuration\n\nThe bot is configured in `~/.ailang/config.yaml`:\n```yaml\ngithub:\n  expected_user: sunholo-voight-kampff\n  default_repo: sunholo-data/ailang\n```\n\n### Switching Accounts\n\n```bash\n# Use bot (current)\ngh auth switch --user sunholo-voight-kampff\n\n# Use personal (update config too if using ailang messages --github)\ngh auth switch --user MarkEdmondson1234\n```\n\n### Benefits of Bot User\n\n- **Audit trail**: All automated actions attributed to bot\n- **Rate limits**: Separate from personal account limits\n- **Revocable access**: Easy to disable without affecting personal auth\n- **CI/CD integration**: Can use same token in automation\n- **Unified**: Both `gh` CLI and `ailang messages` use same account\n\nFor detailed setup and troubleshooting, see [`resources/bot_user_guide.md`](resources/bot_user_guide.md)\n\n## Configuration\n\nCurrent config in `~/.ailang/config.yaml`:\n\n```yaml\ngithub:\n  expected_user: sunholo-voight-kampff  # Bot account (active)\n  default_repo: sunholo-data/ailang\n```\n\n## Integration with Other Skills\n\n### With release-manager\n```bash\n# Before release: find issues to close\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/find_closable.sh\n\n# During release: close issues\n.claude/skills/release-manager/scripts/collect_closable_issues.sh 0.6.1 --close\n```\n\n### With design-doc-creator\n```bash\n# Find uncovered issues, then create design doc\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/match_design_docs.sh --planned\n# For uncovered issue #42:\n/design-doc-creator M-ISSUE-42 \"Fix for issue #42\"\n```\n\n### With sprint-planner\n```bash\n# Use triage report to inform sprint scope\n.claude/skills/github-issue-triage/scripts/triage_report.sh --output /tmp/triage.md\n# Include high-priority uncovered issues in sprint\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n### Bot User Guide\nSee [`resources/bot_user_guide.md`](resources/bot_user_guide.md) for complete bot account setup.\n\n### Triage Checklist\nSee [`resources/triage_checklist.md`](resources/triage_checklist.md) for step-by-step checklist.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- GitHub CLI (`gh`) installed and authenticated\n- Correct user active (`gh auth status`)\n- Repository access (`sunholo-data/ailang`)\n- `~/.ailang/config.yaml` with `github.expected_user`\n\n## Notes\n\n- All scripts check auth before making changes\n- Close operations add proper comments with release/commit references\n- Designed for AILANG repo but can be adapted for others\n- Works with existing `ailang messages` GitHub integration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:48:56.737Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring automated GitHub issue management and synchronization with design documents.","zh":"适用于需要自动化 GitHub 问题管理和与设计文档同步的开发代理。","ja":"GitHub の問題管理と設計ドキュメントとの同期を自動化する開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"GitHub 이슈 관리 및 설계 문서와의 동기화를 자동화해야 하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una gestión automatizada de problemas de GitHub y sincronización con documentos de diseño.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion automatisée des problèmes GitHub et une synchronisation avec les documents de conception.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte GitHub-Problemmeldungsverwaltung und Synchronisierung mit Designdokumenten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem gerenciamento automático de problemas do GitHub e sincronização com documentos de design.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих автоматизированного управления проблемами GitHub и синхронизации с документами дизайна.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النموزجيين الذين يتطلبون إدارة مسألة جيثب自動ية وتزامن مع وثائق التصميم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to monitor open GitHub issues, match them to design docs, identify closable issues, and keep the issue tracker synchronized with actual development progress using bash scripts and GitHub APIs.","zh":"赋予代理监控打开的 GitHub 问题、将其与设计文档匹配、识别可关闭的问题并使用 bash 脚本和 GitHub API 将问题跟踪器与实际开发进度同步。","ja":"エージェントにオープンの GitHub の問題を監視し、それを設計ドキュメントにマッチングし、クローズ可能な問題を識別し、bash スクリプトと GitHub API を使用して問題追跡ツールを実際の開発の進度と同期させる力を与えます。","ko":"에이전트가 오픈된 GitHub 이슈를 모니터링하고, 이를 설계 문서와 일치시키고, 종료 가능한 이슈를 식별하며, bash 스크립트와 GitHub API를 사용하여 이슈 트래커를 실제 개발 진행 상황과 동기화하도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a monitorear problemas de GitHub abiertos, emparejarlos con documentos de diseño, identificar problemas que se pueden cerrar y mantener el rastreador de problemas sincronizado con el progreso de desarrollo real utilizando scripts de bash y API de GitHub.","fr":"Permet aux agents de surveiller les problèmes GitHub ouverts, de les faire correspondre à des documents de conception, d''identifier les problèmes pouvant être fermés et de maintenir le suivi des problèmes synchronisé avec le progrès réel du développement en utilisant des scripts bash et des API GitHub.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, offene GitHub-Probleme zu überwachen, sie mit Designdokumenten abzugleichen, schließbare Probleme zu identifizieren und den Problemmelder mit dem tatsächlichen Entwicklungsfortschritt mithilfe von Bash-Skripten und GitHub-APIs zu synchronisieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a monitorar problemas abertos do GitHub, combiná-los com documentos de design, identificar problemas que podem ser fechados e manter o rastreador de problemas sincronizado com o progresso real do desenvolvimento usando scripts do bash e APIs do GitHub.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отслеживать открытые проблемы GitHub, сопоставлять их с документами дизайна, выявлять проблемы, которые можно закрыть, и поддерживать синхронизацию отслеживателя проблем с фактическим прогрессом разработки с помощью скриптов bash и API GitHub.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من مراقبة مسائل جيثب المفتوحة ومطابقتها مع وثائق التصميم وتحديد المسائل القابلة للإغلاق والحفاظ على متابعة المسائل متزامنة مع تقدم التطوير الفعلي باستخدام سكريبتات باش وواجهات برمجة تطبيقات جيثب."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue triage reports to identify closable issues","Generating lists of open issues with labels and age for prioritization","Synchronizing issue trackers with design documents for accurate development progress"],"zh":["自动生成问题分类报告以识别可关闭的问题","生成带有标签和年龄的打开问题列表以进行优先级排序","将问题跟踪器与设计文档同步以获得准确的开发进度"],"ja":["クローズ可能な問題を識別するための問題トリアージレポートの自動生成","優先順位付けのためのラベルと年齢のあるオープン問題の一覧の生成","設計ドキュメントとの問題追跡ツールの同期による正確な開発の進度"],"ko":["종료 가능한 이슈를 식별하기 위한 이슈 분류 보고서 자동 생성","우선순위 지정 위한 라벨 및 연령이 포함된 오픈 이슈 목록 생성","설계 문서와의 이슈 트래커 동기화를 통한 정확한 개발 진행 상황"],"es":["Automatizar informes de triaje de problemas para identificar problemas que se pueden cerrar","Generar listas de problemas abiertos con etiquetas y antigüedad para la priorización","Sincronizar los rastreadores de problemas con documentos de diseño para un progreso de desarrollo preciso"],"fr":["Automatiser les rapports de triage des problèmes pour identifier les problèmes pouvant être fermés","Générer des listes de problèmes ouverts avec des libellés et un âge pour la priorisation","Synchroniser les suiveurs de problèmes avec des documents de conception pour un progrès de développement précis"],"de":["Automatisierung von Problemtriage-Berichten, um schließbare Probleme zu identifizieren","Erstellung von Listen mit offenen Problemen mit Labels und Alter für die Priorisierung","Synchronisierung von Problemmeldern mit Designdokumenten für einen genauen Entwicklungsfortschritt"],"pt":["Automatizar relatórios de triagem de problemas para identificar problemas que podem ser fechados","Gerar listas de problemas abertos com rótulos e idade para priorização","Sincronizar rastreadores de problemas com documentos de design para progresso de desenvolvimento preciso"],"ru":["Автоматизировать отчеты о_triage проблем для выявления проблем, которые можно закрыть","Генерировать списки открытых проблем с метками и возрастом для приоритизации","Синхронизировать отслеживатели проблем с документами дизайна для точного прогресса разработки"],"ar":["تأتمتة تقارير فحص المسائل لتحديد المسائل القابلة للإغلاق","генерировать قوائم المسائل المفتوحة مع الملصقات والعمر لتحديد الأولوية","متزامنة متابعة المسائل مع وثائق التصميم لتقدم دقيق في التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub repository access","Limited to bash script execution","Dependent on design document availability"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 存储库访问权限","仅限 bash 脚本执行","依赖于设计文档的可用性"],"ja":["GitHub リポジトリへのアクセスが必要","bash スクリプトの実行に限定される","設計ドキュメントの可用性に依存する"],"ko":["GitHub 리포지토리 액세스 권한 필요","bash 스크립트 실행에만 제한됨","설계 문서의 가용성에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de GitHub","Limitado a la ejecución de scripts de bash","Dependiente de la disponibilidad de documentos de diseño"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel GitHub","Limité à l''exécution de scripts bash","Dépend de la disponibilité des documents de conception"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das GitHub-Repository","Begrenzt auf die Ausführung von Bash-Skripten","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit von Designdokumenten"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório do GitHub","Limitado à execução de scripts do bash","Dependente da disponibilidade de documentos de design"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию GitHub","Ограничен выполнением скриптов bash","Зависит от наличия документов дизайна"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع جيثب","محدود بتنفيذ سكريبتات الباش","يعتمد على توافر وثائق التصميم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Blurjp/ImagePrepMCP/adaptyv', 'community', 'Blurjp', 'ImagePrepMCP', 'Blurjp/ImagePrepMCP', 'adaptyv', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z', '2026-02-18T03:49:06.015Z', NULL, '{"id":"Blurjp/ImagePrepMCP/adaptyv","name":"adaptyv","description":{"zh":"Adaptyv是一款云实验室平台，提供自动化蛋白质测试和验证服务，帮助开发者提高效率","ja":"Adaptyvは自動化タンパク質検証サービスを提供するクラウドラボラトリー平台です","ko":"Adaptyv는 자동화 단백질 테스트 및 검증 서비스를 제공하는 클라우드 연구소 플랫폼입니다","es":"Adaptyv es una plataforma de laboratorio en la nube que ofrece servicios de prueba y validación de proteínas automatizados. Los desarrolladores pueden enviar secuencias de proteínas a través de API o interfaz web y recibir resultados experimentales en aproximadamente 21 días.","fr":"Adaptyv est une plateforme de laboratoire cloud qui propose des services de test et de validation de protéines automatisés. Les développeurs peuvent soumettre des séquences de protéines via API ou interface web et recevoir des résultats expérimentaux en environ 21 jours.","de":"Adaptyv ist eine Cloud-Laborplattform, die automatisierte Protein-Test- und Validierungsdienste bietet. Entwickler können Proteinnensequenzen über API oder Webinterface einreichen und experimentelle Ergebnisse in etwa 21 Tagen erhalten.","pt":"Adaptyv é uma plataforma de laboratório em nuvem que fornece serviços de teste e validação de proteínas automatizados. Envie sequências de proteínas via API ou interface web e receba resultados experimentais em aproximadamente 21 dias.","ru":"Adaptyv - это облачная лабораторная платформа, которая предоставляет автоматизированные услуги по тестированию и валидации белков. Отправляйте последовательности белков через API или веб-интерфейс и получайте экспериментальные результаты в течение примерно 21 дня.","ar":"أدابتيف هي منصة مختبرية سحابية توفرخدمات اختبار وتنقيح البروتينات أوتوماتيكيًا. أرسل تسلسلات البروتين عبر و