 integridade dos dados.","ru":"Глобальная валидация - это важнейший метод безопасности для защиты приложений от атак и обеспечения целостности данных.","ar":"التحقق العالمي هو تقنية أمنية أساسية لحماية التطبيقات من الهجمات وضمان سلامة البيانات.","en":"Equine care management platform for stables - track horses, vaccinations, worm tests, treatments, and automated notifications"},"definition":{"en":"Equine care management platform for stables - track horses, vaccinations, worm tests, treatments, and automated notifications"},"features":{"zh":["客户端表单验证","服务器端 API 端点验证","数据类型、格式、范围和必填字段验证","清晰的字段特定验证错误消息","防止 SQL 注入、XSS 和其他攻击"],"ja":["クライアント側フォーム検証","サーバー側 API エンドポイント検証","データタイプ、フォーマット、範囲、必須フィールドの検証","フィールド特定の検証エラーメッセージ","SQL インジェクション、XSS、その他の攻撃を防ぐ"],"ko":["클라이언트 측 폼 검증","서버 측 API 엔드포인트 검증","데이터 유형, 형식, 범위 및 필수 필드의 검증","필드 특정 검증 오류 메시지","SQL 인젝션, XSS 및 기타 공격을 방지"],"pt":["Validação de formulários no lado do cliente","Validação de API no lado do servidor","Verificação de tipos de dados e formatos","Mensagens de erro personalizadas","Proteção contra injeção de SQL e XSS"],"ru":["Валидация форм на стороне клиента","Валидация API на стороне сервера","Проверка типов данных и форматов","Индивидуальные сообщения об ошибках","Защита от внедрения SQL и XSS"],"ar":["التحقق من Forms على جانب العميل","التحقق من API على جانب الخادم","التحقق من أنواع البيانات والتنسيقات","رسائل الخطأ المخصصة","حماية من حقن SQL و XSS"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Global Validation","表单验证","数据安全","API 端点保护","客户端验证","服务器端验证","数据类型验证","必填字段验证"],"ja":["グローバルバリデーション","フォーム検証","データセキュリティ","APIエンドポイントの保護","クライアント側検証","サーバー側検証","データタイプ検証","必須フィールド検証"],"ko":["글로벌 유효성 검사","폼 검증","데이터 보안","API 엔드포인트 보호","클라이언트 측 검증","서버 측 검증","데이터 유형 검증","필수 필드 검증"],"pt":["validação global","segurança de aplicativos","proteção de dados","validação de formulários","validação de API","prevenção de ataques"],"ru":["глобальная валидация","безопасность приложений","защита данных","валидация форм","валидация API","предотвращение атак"],"ar":["التحقق العالمي","أمن التطبيقات","حماية البيانات","التحقق من Forms","التحقق من API","منع الهجمات"]}},"owner":"TorbenMerrald","repo":"StableManager","repoPath":"TorbenMerrald/StableManager","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Global Validation","description":"Implement comprehensive input validation on both client and server sides with clear error feedback. Use this skill when validating user input in forms, API endpoints, or data processing. Use this skill when implementing server-side validation to ensure data integrity and security. Use this skill when adding client-side validation for immediate user feedback. Use this skill when sanitizing input to prevent injection attacks. Use this skill when validating data types, formats, ranges, and business rules. Use this skill when providing specific, actionable error messages for validation failures. Use this skill when applying validation consistently across all application entry points.","bodyPreview":"# Global Validation\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- When implementing form validation on the client side\n- When implementing server-side validation for API endpoints or data processing\n- When validating data types, formats, ranges, and required fields\n- When providing clear, field-specific validation error messages\n- When sanitizing user input to prevent SQL injection, XSS, or other attacks\n- When using allowlists to define acceptable input rather than blocklists\n- When validating business rules l","body":"# Global Validation\n\n## When to use this skill\n\n- When implementing form validation on the client side\n- When implementing server-side validation for API endpoints or data processing\n- When validating data types, formats, ranges, and required fields\n- When providing clear, field-specific validation error messages\n- When sanitizing user input to prevent SQL injection, XSS, or other attacks\n- When using allowlists to define acceptable input rather than blocklists\n- When validating business rules like date constraints or balance requirements\n- When ensuring validation is applied consistently at all entry points\n- When failing early by rejecting invalid data before processing\n\nThis Skill provides Claude Code with specific guidance on how to adhere to coding standards as they relate to how it should handle global validation.\n\n## Instructions\n\nFor details, refer to the information provided in this file:\n[global validation](../../../agent-os/standards/global/validation.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:49:17.773Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing robust form validation and data sanitization capabilities","zh":"非常适合像 Cursor、Windsurf 和 Claude Code 这样的 AI 代理，这些代理需要强大的表单验证和数据清理能力","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Code などのロバストなフォーム検証およびデータサニタイジング機能を必要とする AI エージェントに最適","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 강력한 폼 검증 및 데이터 정제 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan capacidades robustas de validación de formularios y saneamiento de datos","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code nécessitant des capacités de validation de formulaire robustes et de nettoyage de données","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die robuste Formularvalidierungs- und Datensanierungs-Funktionen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de capacidades robustas de validação de formulários e sanitização de dados","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым необходимы надежные возможности валидации форм и санитарной обработки данных","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code التي تحتاج إلى قدرات صلبة للتأكد من صحة الاستمارة وتنقية البيانات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement server-side validation for API endpoints, validate data types and formats, and prevent SQL injection and XSS attacks using allowlists and clear validation error messages","zh":"赋予代理实现服务器端验证 API 端点、验证数据类型和格式，并使用白名单和清晰的验证错误消息防止 SQL 注入和 XSS 攻击的能力","ja":"エージェントが API エンドポイントのサーバーサイド検証を実装し、データ型と形式を検証し、許可リストと明確な検証エラーメッセージを使用して SQL インジェクションと XSS 攻撃を防ぐことを可能にします","ko":"에이전트가 API 엔드ポイント의 서버 측 유효성 검증을 구현하고 데이터 유형 및 형식을 유효성 검증하며 허용 목록 및 명확한 유효성 검증 오류 메시지를 사용하여 SQL 삽입 및 XSS 공격을 방지하는 기능을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar validación en el servidor para puntos de conexión de API, validar tipos y formatos de datos y prevenir ataques de inyección SQL y XSS utilizando listas de permitidos y mensajes de error de validación claros","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre une validation côté serveur pour les points de terminaison API, valider les types et les formats de données et prévenir les attaques d''injection SQL et XSS en utilisant des listes de permettres et des messages d''erreur de validation clairs","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Server-seitige Validierung für API-Endpunkte zu implementieren, Daten типen und -formate zu validieren und SQL-Injection- und XSS-Angriffe mithilfe von Erlaubnislisten und klaren Validierungsfehlermeldungen zu verhindern","pt":"Permite que os agentes implementem validação no lado do servidor para pontos de extremidade de API, validem tipos e formatos de dados e previnam ataques de injeção de SQL e XSS usando listas de permissões e mensagens de erro de validação claras","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовать валидацию на стороне сервера для конечных точек API, проверять типы и форматы данных и предотвращать атаки типа SQL-инъекция и XSS с помощью белых списков и четких сообщений об ошибках валидации","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتنفيذ التحقق من صحة على جانب الخادم لنقاط النهاية API والتحقق من أنواع البيانات وتنسيقاتها ومنع هجمات حقن SQL و XSS باستخدام قوائم السماح ورسائل خطأ التحقق من الصحة الواضحة"},"useCases":{"en":["Validating user input data for equine care management platforms","Implementing client-side form validation for web applications","Sanitizing user input to prevent common web attacks"],"zh":["验证马匹护理管理平台的用户输入数据","为 Web 应用程序实现客户端表单验证","清理用户输入以防止常见的 Web 攻击"],"ja":["馬のケア管理プラットフォームのユーザー入力データを検証する","Web アプリケーションにクライアント側のフォーム検証を実装する","一般的な Web 攻撃を防ぐためにユーザーの入力をサニタイズする"],"ko":["마료 관리 플랫폼의 사용자 입력 데이터를 검증","웹 애플리케이션에 클라이언트 측 폼 검증을 구현","일반적인 웹 공격을 방지하기 위해 사용자 입력을 정제"],"es":["Validar datos de entrada de usuario para plataformas de gestión de cuidado equino","Implementar validación de formularios en el cliente para aplicaciones web","Sanitizar la entrada de usuario para prevenir ataques web comunes"],"fr":["Valider les données de saisie utilisateur pour les plateformes de gestion des soins équins","Mettre en œuvre la validation des formulaires côté client pour les applications web","Nettoyer la saisie utilisateur pour prévenir les attaques web courantes"],"de":["Validieren von Benutzereingabedaten für Pferdepflege-Management-Plattformen","Implementieren von Client-seitiger Formularvalidierung für Webanwendungen","Säubern von Benutzereingaben, um häufige Webangriffe zu verhindern"],"pt":["Validar dados de entrada do usuário para plataformas de gerenciamento de cuidados equinos","Implementar validação de formulário no lado do cliente para aplicações web","Sanitizar a entrada do usuário para prevenir ataques comuns na web"],"ru":["Проверка вводимых пользователем данных для платформ управления лошадьми","Реализация клиентской валидации форм для веб-приложений","Очистка пользовательского ввода для предотвращения распространенных веб-атак"],"ar":["التحقق من صحة بيانات إدخال المستخدم لأنظمة إدارة الرعاية الخيل","تنفيذ التحقق من صحة الاستمارة على جانب العميل لتطبيقات الويب","تنقية إدخال المستخدم لمنع الهجمات الشائعة على الويب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with existing API endpoints or data processing pipelines","May require customization for specific business rules and validation logic"],"zh":["需要与现有的 API 端点或数据处理管道集成","可能需要根据特定的业务规则和验证逻辑进行自定义"],"ja":["既存の API エンドポイントまたはデータ処理パイプラインとの統合が必要","特定のビジネス ルールおよび検証ロジックに合わせてカスタマイズが必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["기존의 API 엔드ポイント 또는 데이터 처리 파이프라인과 통합이 필요","특정 비즈니스 규칙 및 유효성 검사 로직에 맞게 사용자 정의가 필요한 경우가 있다"],"es":["Requiere integración con puntos de conexión de API existentes o tuberías de procesamiento de datos","Puede requerir personalización para reglas de negocio y lógica de validación específicas"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec des points de terminaison API existants ou des pipelines de traitement de données","Peut nécessiter une personnalisation pour des règles métier et une logique de validation spécifiques"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit bestehenden API-Endpunkten oder Datenverarbeitungspipelines","Kann Anpassung für spezifische Geschäftsregeln und Validierungslogik erfordern"],"pt":["Requer integração com pontos de extremidade de API existentes ou pipelines de processamento de dados","Pode exigir personalização para regras de negócios específicas e lógica de validação"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с существующими конечными точками API или пайплайнами обработки данных","Может потребовать настройки для конкретных бизнес-правил и логики валидации"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع نقاط النهاية API الحالية أو خطوط أنابيب معالجة البيانات","يمكن أن يتطلب تخصيصًا لقواعد الأعمال والمنطق المحدد للتحقق من الصحة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('aaronbassett/paneful/init-local-tooling', 'community', 'aaronbassett', 'paneful', 'aaronbassett/paneful', 'init-local-tooling', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z', '2026-02-18T03:49:04.686Z', NULL, '{"id":"aaronbassett/paneful/init-local-tooling","name":"init-local-tooling","description":{"zh":"初始化本地工具，设置TypeScript、Rust和Python项目的linting、格式化、类型检查、测试、Git钩子、CI/CD和发布","ja":"ローカルツーリングを初期化し、TypeScript、Rust、Pythonプロジェクトのlinting、フォーマット、型チェック、テスト、Git hook、CI/CD、公開を設定します","ko":"로컬 툴링을 초기화하고 TypeScript, Rust 및 Python 프로젝트의 linting, 형식, 유형 확인, 테스트, Git hook, CI/CD 및 공개를 설정합니다","es":"Inicializa herramientas de desarrollo para proyectos TypeScript, Rust y Python con funcionalidades de linting y pruebas","fr":"Initialise les outils de développement pour les projets TypeScript, Rust et Python avec des fonctionnalités de linting et de tests","de":"Initialisiert Entwicklungstools für TypeScript-, Rust- und Python-Projekte mit Linting- und Testfunktionen","pt":"O init-local-tooling é uma ferramenta que inicializa o setup completo para projetos em TypeScript, Rust e Python","ru":"Инициализация местного инструментария - это инструмент, который initializes полную настройку для проектов на TypeScript, Rust и Python","ar":"ت.Initialize أدوات محلية هي أداة التي تهيئة الإعداد الكامل للمشاريع في TypeScript و Rust و Python","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"初始化本地工具","ja":"ローカルツーリングの初期化","ko":"로컬 툴링 초기화","es":"Inicialización de herramientas locales","fr":"Initialisation de l''outillage local","de":"Initialisierung der lokalen Tools","pt":"Inicialização de Ferramentas Locais","ru":"Инициализация Местного Инструментария","ar":"ت.Initialize أدوات محلية","en":"init-local-tooling"},"description":{"zh":"初始化本地工具，设置TypeScript、Rust和Python项目的linting、格式化、类型检查、测试、Git钩子、CI/CD和发布","ja":"ローカルツーリングを初期化し、TypeScript、Rust、Pythonプロジェクトのlinting、フォーマット、型チェック、テスト、Git hook、CI/CD、公開を設定します","ko":"로컬 툴링을 초기화하고 TypeScript, Rust 및 Python 프로젝트의 linting, 형식, 유형 확인, 테스트, Git hook, CI/CD 및 공개를 설정합니다","es":"Inicializa herramientas de desarrollo para proyectos TypeScript, Rust y Python con funcionalidades de linting y pruebas","fr":"Initialise les outils de développement pour les projets TypeScript, Rust et Python avec des fonctionnalités de linting et de tests","de":"Initialisiert Entwicklungstools für TypeScript-, Rust- und Python-Projekte mit Linting- und Testfunktionen","pt":"O init-local-tooling é uma ferramenta que inicializa o setup completo para projetos em TypeScript, Rust e Python","ru":"Инициализация местного инструментария - это инструмент, который initializes полную настройку для проектов на TypeScript, Rust и Python","ar":"ت.Initialize أدوات محلية هي أداة التي تهيئة الإعداد الكامل للمشاريع في TypeScript و Rust و Python","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["初始化TypeScript、Rust和Python项目工具","设置monorepo与Nx + pnpm workspaces","配置Git钩子与lefthook","添加GitHub Actions用于CI/CD","设置自动发布到npm和crat"],"ja":["TypeScript、Rust、Pythonプロジェクトのツールを初期化する","monorepoをNx + pnpm workspacesで設定する","Git hookをlefthookで設定する","GitHub ActionsをCI/CDに追加する","npmとcratへの自動公開を設定する"],"ko":["TypeScript, Rust 및 Python 프로젝트 툴을 초기화합니다","monorepo를 Nx + pnpm workspaces로 설정합니다","Git hook를 lefthook로 설정합니다","GitHub Actions를 CI/CD에 추가합니다","npm 및 crat에 자동으로 공개합니다"],"es":["Configuración de linting y formato","Implementación de pruebas y Git hooks","Configuración de CI/CD con GitHub Actions","Publicación automática en npm y crates","Compatibilidad con TypeScript, Rust y Python"],"fr":["Configuration du linting et du formatage","Mise en œuvre des tests et des hooks Git","Configuration du CI/CD avec GitHub Actions","Publication automatique sur npm et crates","Compatibilité avec TypeScript, Rust et Python"],"de":["Konfiguration von Linting und Formatierung","Implementierung von Tests und Git-Hooks","Konfiguration von CI/CD mit GitHub Actions","Automatisierte Veröffentlichung auf npm und crates","Kompatibilität mit TypeScript, Rust und Python"],"pt":["Inicialização de projetos em TypeScript, Rust e Python","Configuração de monorepo com Nx + pnpm workspaces","Instalação de hooks do Git com lefthook","Configuração de GitHub Actions para CI/CD","Publicação automática para npm e crat"],"ru":["Инициализация проектов на TypeScript, Rust и Python","Настройка монорепо с Nx + pnpm workspaces","Установка хуков Git с lefthook","Настройка GitHub Actions для CI/CD","Автоматическая публикация в npm и crat"],"ar":["ت.Initialize المشاريع في TypeScript و Rust و Python","تهيئة مونوريبو مع Nx + pnpm workspaces","تركيب hooks Git مع lefthook","تهيئة GitHub Actions ل CI/CD","نشر تلقائي إلى npm و crat"]},"keywords":{"zh":["初始化本地工具","TypeScript工具","Rust工具","Python工具","monorepo","Git钩子","CI/CD","自动发布"],"ja":["ローカルツーリングの初期化","TypeScriptツール","Rustツール","Pythonツール","monorepo","Git hook","CI/CD","自動公開"],"ko":["로컬 툴링 초기화","TypeScript 툴","Rust 툴","Python 툴","monorepo","Git hook","CI/CD","자동 공개"],"es":["herramientas de desarrollo","linting","formato","pruebas","Git hooks","CI/CD","npm","crates","TypeScript","Rust","Python"],"fr":["outils de développement","linting","formatage","tests","hooks Git","CI/CD","npm","crates","TypeScript","Rust","Python"],"de":["Entwicklungstools","Linting","Formatierung","Tests","Git-Hooks","CI/CD","npm","crates","TypeScript","Rust","Python"],"pt":["inicialização de projetos","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","TypeScript","Rust","Python","monorepo","GitHub Actions","CI/CD"],"ru":["инициализация проектов","инструменты разработки","TypeScript","Rust","Python","монорепо","GitHub Actions","CI/CD"],"ar":["ت.Initialize المشاريع","أدوات التطوير","TypeScript","Rust","Python","مونوريبو","GitHub Actions","CI/CD"]}},"owner":"aaronbassett","repo":"paneful","repoPath":"aaronbassett/paneful","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"init-local-tooling","description":"Initialize and configure local development tooling for TypeScript, Rust, and Python projects including monorepos. Use when setting up linting (ESLint, Biome, clippy, ruff), formatting (Prettier, rustfmt, ruff), type checking (tsc, mypy), testing (Vitest, Jest, cargo test, pytest), Git hooks (lefthook for commit-msg, pre-commit, pre-push), GitHub Actions workflows, package publishing (npm, crates.io, PyPI), version management (Changesets), and automated releases. Covers both single-language projects and multi-language monorepos using Nx + pnpm workspaces.","bodyPreview":"# Local Tooling Initialization\n\nComprehensive setup for linting, formatting, type checking, testing, Git hooks, CI/CD, and publishing across TypeScript, Rust, and Python projects.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Initialize tooling for a new TypeScript/Rust/Python project\n- Set up monorepo with Nx + pnpm workspaces\n- Configure Git hooks with lefthook (conventional commits, pre-commit, pre-push)\n- Add GitHub Actions for CI/CD\n- Set up automated publishing to npm/crat","body":"# Local Tooling Initialization\n\nComprehensive setup for linting, formatting, type checking, testing, Git hooks, CI/CD, and publishing across TypeScript, Rust, and Python projects.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Initialize tooling for a new TypeScript/Rust/Python project\n- Set up monorepo with Nx + pnpm workspaces\n- Configure Git hooks with lefthook (conventional commits, pre-commit, pre-push)\n- Add GitHub Actions for CI/CD\n- Set up automated publishing to npm/crates.io/PyPI\n- Configure version bumping and changelog generation with Changesets\n- Migrate from Husky to lefthook\n- Choose between ESLint+Prettier vs Biome for TypeScript\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### TypeScript Project\n\n**Automated setup:**\n```bash\n./scripts/init_typescript.sh\n```\n\n**Choose tooling:**\n- **Biome** (recommended) - Fast, all-in-one, modern\n- **ESLint + Prettier** - Traditional, highly configurable\n\n**What you get:**\n- Linting and formatting\n- TypeScript strict mode\n- Vitest for testing\n- Package.json scripts\n\n→ **See:** [references/typescript.md](references/typescript.md)\n\n### Rust Project\n\n**Manual setup (opinionated configs in assets/):**\n```bash\n# Tools come with Rust\nrustup component add rustfmt clippy\n\n# Optional: Enhanced tooling\nbrew install cargo-nextest cargo-deny\n\n# Copy configs from assets/configs/rust/\ncp assets/configs/rust/rustfmt.toml .\ncp assets/configs/rust/clippy.toml .\n```\n\n→ **See:** [references/rust.md](references/rust.md)\n\n### Python Project\n\n**Using uv (recommended):**\n```bash\n# Install uv\nbrew install uv\n\n# Create project\nuv init my-project\ncd my-project\n\n# Add dev dependencies\nuv add --dev ruff mypy pytest\n\n# Copy config from assets/\ncp assets/configs/python/pyproject.toml .\n```\n\n→ **See:** [references/python.md](references/python.md)\n\n### Monorepo Setup\n\n**Create Nx + pnpm monorepo:**\n```bash\n./scripts/init_monorepo.sh\n```\n\nOr manually:\n```bash\nnpx create-nx-workspace@latest my-monorepo\n# Choose: pnpm + integrated monorepo\n```\n\n→ **See:** [references/monorepo.md](references/monorepo.md)\n\n---\n\n## Workflow Decision Tree\n\n### 1. Choose Project Type\n\n**Single Language Project**\n→ Use language-specific init script or manual setup\n→ See Quick Start above\n\n**Monorepo (Multiple Packages)**\n→ Set up Nx + pnpm workspaces\n→ See [references/monorepo.md](references/monorepo.md)\n\n### 2. Configure Git Hooks\n\n**Automated setup:**\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_lefthook.sh\n```\n\nThis configures:\n- **commit-msg** - Conventional commits validation\n- **pre-commit** - Format and lint staged files\n- **pre-push** - Full validation (lint, type-check, test, build)\n\n→ **See:** [references/git-hooks.md](references/git-hooks.md)\n\n### 3. Set Up CI/CD\n\n**Copy workflow templates:**\n```bash\n# Basic CI\ncp assets/workflows/ci.yml .github/workflows/\n\n# Language-specific workflows available in assets/\n```\n\n→ **See:** [references/ci-cd.md](references/ci-cd.md)\n\n### 4. Configure Publishing (Optional)\n\n**For npm packages:**\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_changesets.sh\n```\n\nThen copy publishing workflows from `assets/workflows/`.\n\n→ **See:**\n- [references/version-management.md](references/version-management.md)\n- [references/publishing.md](references/publishing.md)\n\n---\n\n## Language-Specific Guides\n\n### TypeScript/JavaScript\n\n**Tooling options:**\n- **Biome** - Fast, opinionated, all-in-one (recommended for new projects)\n- **ESLint + Prettier** - Traditional, highly configurable (recommended for existing projects)\n\n**Testing:**\n- **Vitest** - Modern, fast, Vite-based (recommended)\n- **Jest** - Established, widely used\n\n**Key decisions:**\n- Choose Biome for speed and simplicity\n- Choose ESLint+Prettier for existing projects or specific plugins\n\n→ **Full guide:** [references/typescript.md](references/typescript.md)\n\n### Rust\n\n**Built-in tools:**\n- `rustfmt` - Code formatting\n- `clippy` - Linting\n- `cargo test` - Testing\n\n**Enhanced tools:**\n- `cargo-nextest` - Faster test runner\n- `cargo-deny` - Dependency security\n- `cargo-make` - Task runner\n\n→ **Full guide:** [references/rust.md](references/rust.md)\n\n### Python\n\n**Modern stack (recommended):**\n- **uv** - Fast package manager\n- **ruff** - Fast linting + formatting (replaces black, isort, flake8)\n- **mypy** - Type checking\n- **pytest** - Testing\n\n→ **Full guide:** [references/python.md](references/python.md)\n\n---\n\n## Git Hooks with lefthook\n\n### Why lefthook?\n\n- **Language-agnostic** - Works across TS, Rust, Python\n- **Fast** - Parallel execution, written in Go\n- **Simple** - Single YAML config\n- **Better than Husky** - Faster, works across languages\n\n### Setup\n\n**Automated:**\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_lefthook.sh\n```\n\n**Manual:**\n```bash\nbrew install lefthook\nlefthook install\n```\n\n### Configuration Example\n\n**lefthook.yml:**\n```yaml\ncommit-msg:\n  commands:\n    commitlint:\n      run: npx commitlint --edit {1}\n\npre-commit:\n  parallel: true\n  commands:\n    format:\n      glob: \"*.{ts,rs,py}\"\n      run: format-staged-files {staged_files}\n      stage_fixed: true\n\npre-push:\n  commands:\n    validate:\n      run: ./scripts/validate_all.sh\n```\n\n→ **Full guide:** [references/git-hooks.md](references/git-hooks.md)\n\n---\n\n## Monorepo Management\n\n### Nx + pnpm Workspaces\n\n**Key principle:** Nx builds on top of pnpm, doesn''t replace it.\n\n- **pnpm workspaces** - Dependency management\n- **Nx** - Task orchestration, caching, affected commands\n\n### Benefits\n\n- Run tasks only for affected packages\n- Intelligent caching\n- Parallel execution\n- Supports multiple languages\n\n### Common Commands\n\n```bash\n# Run target for all packages\nnx run-many --target=build --all\n\n# Run only for affected\nnx affected --target=test\n\n# Visualize dependencies\nnx graph\n```\n\n→ **Full guide:** [references/monorepo.md](references/monorepo.md)\n\n---\n\n## Version Management & Publishing\n\n### Changesets Workflow\n\n**Recommended for monorepos and npm packages.**\n\n1. **Add changeset:**\n```bash\npnpm changeset\n# Select packages, type (major/minor/patch), write summary\n```\n\n2. **Version packages:**\n```bash\npnpm changeset version\n# Updates package.json, generates CHANGELOG.md\n```\n\n3. **Publish:**\n```bash\npnpm changeset publish\ngit push --follow-tags\n```\n\n### Automated Publishing\n\nUse GitHub Actions to automate releases:\n\n**Copy workflow:**\n```bash\ncp assets/workflows/publish-changesets.yml .github/workflows/\n```\n\nThis creates \"Version Packages\" PR on main when changesets exist.\n\n→ **See:**\n- [references/version-management.md](references/version-management.md)\n- [references/publishing.md](references/publishing.md)\n\n---\n\n## CI/CD Setup\n\n### Match Local Validation\n\n**Best practice:** Run same checks in CI as local pre-push hook.\n\n**GitHub Actions templates:**\n- `ci.yml` - Basic linting, testing, building\n- `publish-npm.yml` - Automated npm publishing\n- `publish-crates.yml` - Automated crates.io publishing\n- `publish-pypi.yml` - Automated PyPI publishing\n\n### Matrix Testing\n\nTest across multiple versions:\n\n```yaml\nstrategy:\n  matrix:\n    node-version: [18, 20, 21]\n    os: [ubuntu-latest, macos-latest]\n```\n\n### Nx Monorepo CI\n\nUse affected commands to only test changed packages:\n\n```bash\nnx affected --target=test\nnx affected --target=build\n```\n\n→ **Full guide:** [references/ci-cd.md](references/ci-cd.md)\n\n---\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Initialize TypeScript Project\n\n**Automated:**\n```bash\n./scripts/init_typescript.sh --biome\n# or\n./scripts/init_typescript.sh --eslint-prettier\n```\n\n**Creates:**\n- tsconfig.json (strict mode)\n- Linting config (biome.json or eslint.config.js)\n- Formatting config (.prettierrc.json if ESLint)\n- Testing config (vitest.config.ts)\n- Package.json scripts\n\n### Set Up Git Hooks\n\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_lefthook.sh\n```\n\n**Configures:**\n- Conventional commits validation\n- Pre-commit: lint/format staged files\n- Pre-push: full validation\n\n### Configure Changesets\n\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_changesets.sh\n```\n\n**Sets up:**\n- .changeset/ directory\n- Package.json scripts\n- Public access configuration\n\n### Full Validation\n\n```bash\n./scripts/validate_all.sh\n```\n\n**Runs:**\n- Format checking\n- Linting\n- Type checking\n- Tests\n- Builds\n\n---\n\n## Bundled Resources\n\n### Scripts (`scripts/`)\n\n**Setup scripts:**\n- `init_typescript.sh` - Initialize TypeScript project\n- `setup_lefthook.sh` - Configure Git hooks\n- `setup_changesets.sh` - Set up version management\n- `validate_all.sh` - Run all checks (used by pre-push)\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n./scripts/script_name.sh\n```\n\nAll scripts check if tools are installed/up-to-date before proceeding.\n\n### Config Templates (`assets/configs/`)\n\n**TypeScript:**\n- `tsconfig.strict.json` - Strict TypeScript config\n- `biome.json` - Biome configuration\n- `eslint.config.js` - ESLint flat config\n- `.prettierrc.json` - Prettier configuration\n\n**Rust:**\n- `rustfmt.toml` - Rustfmt configuration\n- `clippy.toml` - Clippy lints\n- `deny.toml` - Cargo-deny configuration\n\n**Python:**\n- `pyproject.toml` - ruff, mypy, pytest config\n- `ruff.toml` - Standalone ruff config\n\n**Monorepo:**\n- `nx.json` - Nx configuration\n- `pnpm-workspace.yaml` - pnpm workspaces\n\n**Git Hooks:**\n- `lefthook.yml` - Complete lefthook config\n- `commitlint.config.js` - Conventional commits\n\n**GitHub Workflows:**\n- `ci.yml` - Basic CI\n- `publish-changesets.yml` - Automated releases\n- `publish-npm.yml` - npm publishing\n- `publish-crates.yml` - crates.io publishing\n- `publish-pypi.yml` - PyPI publishing\n\n### Reference Documentation (`references/`)\n\n**Language guides:**\n- `typescript.md` - ESLint+Prettier vs Biome, testing, monorepo\n- `rust.md` - rustfmt, clippy, cargo-nextest, cargo-deny\n- `python.md` - ruff, mypy, pytest, uv vs poetry\n\n**Infrastructure:**\n- `monorepo.md` - Nx + pnpm workspaces setup\n- `git-hooks.md` - lefthook configuration\n- `ci-cd.md` - GitHub Actions workflows\n- `publishing.md` - npm, crates.io, PyPI publishing\n- `version-management.md` - Changesets workflow\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use lefthook over Husky** - Faster, language-agnostic\n2. **Match CI and local** - Same checks in pre-push and CI\n3. **Choose Biome for new TS projects** - Faster, simpler\n4. **Use Nx affected commands** - Only test changed packages\n5. **Automate versioning** - Use Changesets for npm packages\n6. **Conventional commits** - Enables automated changelogs\n7. **Pre-commit: staged files** - Fast feedback\n8. **Pre-push: full validation** - Catch issues before pushing\n9. **Type-check everything** - TypeScript, mypy, clippy\n10. **Test before publish** - Always run tests in pre-publish\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Hooks Not Running\n\n**Check installation:**\n```bash\nlefthook install\nls -la .git/hooks/\n```\n\n**Test manually:**\n```bash\nlefthook run pre-commit\n```\n\n### Format Conflicts\n\n**ESLint + Prettier conflicts:**\n- Ensure `eslint-config-prettier` is last in config\n- Run Prettier separately from ESLint\n\n**Biome + Prettier conflicts:**\n- Don''t use both - choose one\n- Biome is drop-in Prettier replacement\n\n### CI Failures\n\n**Debugging:**\n1. Run `./scripts/validate_all.sh` locally\n2. Check CI runs same commands\n3. Verify Node/Rust/Python versions match\n4. Check caching is working\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Setup new TypeScript project:**\n```bash\n./scripts/init_typescript.sh\n```\n\n**Setup Git hooks:**\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_lefthook.sh\n```\n\n**Setup Changesets:**\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_changesets.sh\n```\n\n**Run full validation:**\n```bash\n./scripts/validate_all.sh\n```\n\n**Common commands:**\n```bash\n# TypeScript\nnpm run lint && npm run type-check && npm test\n\n# Rust\ncargo fmt -- --check && cargo clippy -- -D warnings && cargo test\n\n# Python\nruff check . && mypy . && pytest\n\n# Monorepo\nnx affected --target=test\nnx run-many --target=build --all\n\n# Changesets\npnpm changeset\npnpm changeset version\npnpm changeset publish\n```\n\n---\n\n## Getting Help\n\n- **TypeScript:** See [references/typescript.md](references/typescript.md)\n- **Rust:** See [references/rust.md](references/rust.md)\n- **Python:** See [references/python.md](references/python.md)\n- **Monorepo:** See [references/monorepo.md](references/monorepo.md)\n- **Git Hooks:** See [references/git-hooks.md](references/git-hooks.md)\n- **CI/CD:** See [references/ci-cd.md](references/ci-cd.md)\n- **Publishing:** See [references/publishing.md](references/publishing.md) and [references/version-management.md](references/version-management.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:49:04.686Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing comprehensive local tooling setup for TypeScript, Rust, and Python projects.","zh":"非常适合需要为 TypeScript、Rust 和 Python 项目设置全面本地工具的开发代理。","ja":"TypeScript、Rust、Python プロジェクトのための包括的なローカルツール設定が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"TypeScript, Rust 및 Python 프로젝트를 위한 완전한 로컬 툴 설정이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una configuración de herramientas locales integral para proyectos de TypeScript, Rust y Python.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une configuration d''outils locaux complète pour les projets TypeScript, Rust et Python.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine umfassende lokale Werkzeugkonfiguration für TypeScript-, Rust- und Python-Projekte benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de uma configuração de ferramentas locais abrangente para projetos TypeScript, Rust e Python.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется комплексная настройка локальных инструментов для проектов TypeScript, Rust и Python.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى إعداد أدوات محلية شاملة لمشاريع TypeScript و Rust و Python."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline project initialization with automated linting, formatting, type checking, and testing using Git hooks, lefthook, and GitHub Actions for CI/CD, while also enabling automated publishing to npm and crates.io.","zh":"赋予代理人使用 Git hooks、lefthook 和 GitHub Actions 进行 CI/CD 的项目初始化流程自动化能力，包括自动化的 linting、格式化、类型检查和测试，并且可以自动发布到 npm 和 crates.io。","ja":"Git hooks、lefthook、GitHub Actions を使用した CI/CD 向けのプロジェクト初期化の自動化をエージェントに可能にし、自動的な linting、フォーマット、タイプチェック、テストを行い、npm と crates.io への自動パブリッシュも可能にします。","ko":"Git hooks, lefthook 및 GitHub Actions를 사용하여 CI/CD를 위한 프로젝트 초기화의 자동화를 에이전트에게 가능하게 하며, 자동화된 linting, 포맷팅, 타입 체크 및 테스트를 수행하고, npm 및 crates.ioへの 자동 发布도 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes simplificar la inicialización del proyecto con linting automatizado, formato, comprobación de tipos y pruebas utilizando Git hooks, lefthook y GitHub Actions para CI/CD, y también permite la publicación automática en npm y crates.io.","fr":"Permet aux agents de simplifier l''initialisation du projet avec un linting automatisé, un formatage, une vérification de types et des tests en utilisant des hook Git, lefthook et GitHub Actions pour CI/CD, tout en permettant une publication automatisée sur npm et crates.io.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Projektinitialisierung mit automatisiertem Linting, Formatierung, Typüberprüfung und Tests mithilfe von Git-Hooks, Lefthook und GitHub-Actions für CI/CD zu rationalisieren und ermöglicht auch die automatisierte Veröffentlichung auf npm und crates.io.","pt":"Permite que os agentes racionalizem a inicialização do projeto com linting automatizado, formatação, verificação de tipo e teste usando hooks do Git, lefthook e GitHub Actions para CI/CD, além de permitir a publicação automatizada para npm e crates.io.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать инициализацию проекта с помощью автоматизированного linting, форматирования, проверки типов и тестирования с использованием хуков Git, lefthook и GitHub Actions для CI/CD, а также позволяет автоматизировать публикацию в npm и crates.io.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تمكين العميل من简ification عملية开始 المشروع باستخدام linting وتنسيق وفحص النوع واختبار آلي باستخدام hooks Git و lefthook و GitHub Actions ل CI/CD ، بالإضافة إلى تمكين النشر الآلي إلى npm و crates.io."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing monorepo with Nx and pnpm workspaces","Configuring Git hooks for conventional commits and pre-commit checks","Setting up automated CI/CD pipelines with GitHub Actions","Automating publishing to npm and crates.io"],"zh":["使用 Nx 和 pnpm workspaces 初始化 monorepo","配置 Git hooks 以实现符合惯例的提交和预提交检查","使用 GitHub Actions 设置自动化的 CI/CD 流水线","自动化发布到 npm 和 crates.io"],"ja":["Nx と pnpm workspaces を使用して monorepo を初期化する","Git hooks を設定して従来のコミットと事前コミットチェックを行う","GitHub Actions を使用して自動化された CI/CD パイプラインを設定する","npm と crates.io への自動パブリッシュ"],"ko":["Nx 및 pnpm workspaces를 사용하여 monorepo 초기화","Git hooks를 설정하여 규약에 맞는 커밋 및 事前 커밋 확인을 수행","GitHub Actions를 사용하여 자동화된 CI/CD 파이프라인 설정","npm 및 crates.ioへの 자동 발행"],"es":["Inicializar monorepo con Nx y espacios de trabajo pnpm","Configurar hook de Git para commits convencionales y verificaciones pre-commit","Configurar pipelines de CI/CD automatizadas con GitHub Actions","Automatizar la publicación en npm y crates.io"],"fr":["Initialiser un monorepo avec Nx et des espaces de travail pnpm","Configurer des hook Git pour des commits conventionnels et des vérifications pré-commit","Configurer des pipelines de CI/CD automatisées avec GitHub Actions","Automatiser la publication sur npm et crates.io"],"de":["Initialisieren eines Monorepos mit Nx und pnpm-Arbeitsbereichen","Konfigurieren von Git-Hooks für konventionelle Commits und Pre-Commit-Checks","Einrichten automatisierter CI/CD-Pipelines mit GitHub-Actions","Automatisieren der Veröffentlichung auf npm und crates.io"],"pt":["Inicializar monorepo com Nx e pnpm workspaces","Configurar hooks do Git para commits convencionais e verificações pré-commit","Configurar pipelines de CI/CD automatizadas com GitHub Actions","Automatizar a publicação para npm e crates.io"],"ru":["Инициализировать monorepo с помощью Nx и pnpm workspaces","Настроить хуки Git для конвенциональных коммитов и предкоммитных проверок","Настроить автоматические конвейеры CI/CD с помощью GitHub Actions","Автоматизировать публикацию в npm и crates.io"],"ar":["تχριي monorepo باستخدام Nx و pnpm workspaces","تكوين hooks Git لالتزامات تقليدية و فحص ما قبل الالتزام","ضبط خطوط أنابيب CI/CD الآلية باستخدام GitHub Actions","تأهيل النشر الآلي إلى npm و crates.io"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git and GitHub setup","Limited to TypeScript, Rust, and Python projects","Needs lefthook and GitHub Actions configuration"],"zh":["需要 Git 和 GitHub 设置","仅限于 TypeScript、Rust 和 Python 项目","需要 lefthook 和 GitHub Actions 配置"],"ja":["Git と GitHub の設定が必要","TypeScript、Rust、Python プロジェクトのみに限定","lefthook と GitHub Actions の設定が必要"],"ko":["Git 및 GitHub 설정이 필요","TypeScript, Rust 및 Python 프로젝트만 해당","lefthook 및 GitHub Actions 설정이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Git y GitHub","Limitado a proyectos de TypeScript, Rust y Python","Necesita configuración de lefthook y GitHub Actions"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Git et GitHub","Limité aux projets TypeScript, Rust et Python","Nécessite une configuration de lefthook et GitHub Actions"],"de":["Benötigt eine Git- und GitHub-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf TypeScript-, Rust- und Python-Projekte","Benötigt eine Konfiguration von Lefthook und GitHub-Actions"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Git e GitHub","Limitado a projetos TypeScript, Rust e Python","Necessita de configuração do lefthook e GitHub Actions"],"ru":["Требует настройки Git и GitHub","Ограничен проектами TypeScript, Rust и Python","Требует настройки lefthook и GitHub Actions"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Git و GitHub","محدود بمشاريع TypeScript و Rust و Python","يتطلب إعداد lefthook و GitHub Actions"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
