arrolladores","fr":"La recherche dans Alkana KPI repose sur des principes tels que YAGNI, KISS et DRY pour les développeurs","de":"Die Forschung in Alkana KPI basiert auf Prinzipien wie YAGNI, KISS und DRY für Entwickler","pt":"A pesquisa Alkana KPI segue os princípios YAGNI, KISS e DRY para fornecer resultados concisos e eficazes","ru":"Исследование Alkana KPI следует принципам YAGNI, KISS и DRY для предоставления лаконичных и эффективных результатов","ar":"يتبع البحث Alkana KPI مبادئ YAGNI و KISS و DRY لتقديم نتائج موجزة وفعالة","en":"Alkana KPI application"},"definition":{"en":"Alkana KPI application"},"features":{"zh":["范围定义","系统化信息收集","评估标准","研究深度界限","遵循 YAGNI、KISS 和 DRY 原则"],"ja":["スコープ定義","体系的な情報収集","評価基準","研究深度の境界","YAGNI、KISS、DRY 原則に従う"],"ko":["범위 정의","체계적인 정보 수집","평가 기준","연구 깊이 경계","YAGNI, KISS, DRY 원칙을 따름"],"es":["Definición del alcance de la investigación","Identificación de términos y conceptos clave","Establecimiento de criterios de evaluación de fuentes","Determinación de la profundidad de la investigación","Aplicación de principios YAGNI, KISS y DRY"],"fr":["Définition de la portée de la recherche","Identification des termes et des concepts clés","Établissement de critères d''évaluation des sources","Détermination de la profondeur de la recherche","Application des principes YAGNI, KISS et DRY"],"de":["Definition des Forschungsumfangs","Identifizierung von Schlüsselbegriffen und -konzepten","Festlegung von Bewertungskriterien für Quellen","Bestimmung der Forschungstiefe","Anwendung der Prinzipien YAGNI, KISS und DRY"],"pt":["Definição de escopo","Critérios de avaliação","Fontes de informação","Análise de dados","Relatórios personalizados"],"ru":["Определение объема","Критерии оценки","Источники информации","Анализ данных","Индивидуальные отчеты"],"ar":["تعريف النطاق","معايير التقييم","مصادر المعلومات","تحليل البيانات","التقارير المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["研究方法论","Alkana KPI","YAGNI","KISS","DRY","研究过程","效率","有效性"],"ja":["研究方法論","Alkana KPI","YAGNI","KISS","DRY","研究プロセス","効率","有効性"],"ko":["연구 방법론","Alkana KPI","YAGNI","KISS","DRY","연구 과정","효율","유효성"],"es":["investigación en Alkana KPI","metodología de investigación","YAGNI","KISS","DRY","desarrollo de software","investigación sistemática"],"fr":["recherche dans Alkana KPI","méthodologie de recherche","YAGNI","KISS","DRY","développement de logiciels","recherche systématique"],"de":["Forschung in Alkana KPI","Forschungsmethode","YAGNI","KISS","DRY","Softwareentwicklung","systematische Forschung"],"pt":["pesquisa alkana kpi","metodologia de pesquisa","yagni","kiss","dry","análise de dados","relatórios personalizados"],"ru":["исследование alkana kpi","методология исследования","yagni","kiss","dry","анализ данных","индивидуальные отчеты"],"ar":["البحث alkana kpi","منهجية البحث","yagni","kiss","dry","تحليل البيانات","التقارير المخصصة"]}},"owner":"hotriluan","repo":"alkana_kpi","repoPath":"hotriluan/alkana_kpi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"research","description":"Research technical solutions, analyze architectures, gather requirements thoroughly. Use for technology evaluation, best practices research, solution design, scalability/security/maintainability analysis.","bodyPreview":"# Research\n\n## Research Methodology\n\nAlways honoring **YAGNI**, **KISS**, and **DRY** principles.\n**Be honest, be brutal, straight to the point, and be concise.**\n\n### Phase 1: Scope Definition\n\nFirst, you will clearly define the research scope by:\n- Identifying key terms and concepts to investigate\n- Determining the recency requirements (how current must information be)\n- Establishing evaluation criteria for sources\n- Setting boundaries for the research depth\n\n### Phase 2: Systematic Informatio","body":"# Research\n\n## Research Methodology\n\nAlways honoring **YAGNI**, **KISS**, and **DRY** principles.\n**Be honest, be brutal, straight to the point, and be concise.**\n\n### Phase 1: Scope Definition\n\nFirst, you will clearly define the research scope by:\n- Identifying key terms and concepts to investigate\n- Determining the recency requirements (how current must information be)\n- Establishing evaluation criteria for sources\n- Setting boundaries for the research depth\n\n### Phase 2: Systematic Information Gathering\n\nYou will employ a multi-source research strategy:\n\n1. **Search Strategy**:\n   - **Gemini Toggle**: Check `.claude/.ck.json` (or `~/.claude/.ck.json`) for `skills.research.useGemini` (default: `true`). If `false`, skip Gemini and use WebSearch.\n   - **Gemini Model**: Read from `.claude/.ck.json`: `gemini.model` (default: `gemini-3.0-flash`)\n   - If `useGemini` is enabled and `gemini` bash command is available, execute `gemini -y -m <gemini.model> \"...your search prompt...\"` bash command (timeout: 10 minutes) and save the output using `Report:` path from `## Naming` section (including all citations).\n   - If `useGemini` is disabled or `gemini` bash command is not available, use `WebSearch` tool.\n   - Run multiple `gemini` bash commands or `WebSearch` tools in parallel to search for relevant information.\n   - Craft precise search queries with relevant keywords\n   - Include terms like \"best practices\", \"2024\", \"latest\", \"security\", \"performance\"\n   - Search for official documentation, GitHub repositories, and authoritative blogs\n   - Prioritize results from recognized authorities (official docs, major tech companies, respected developers)\n   - **IMPORTANT:** You are allowed to perform at most **5 researches (max 5 tool calls)**, user might request less than this amount, **strictly respect it**, think carefully based on the task before performing each related research topic.\n\n2. **Deep Content Analysis**:\n   - When you found a potential Github repository URL, use `docs-seeker` skill to find read it.\n   - Focus on official documentation, API references, and technical specifications\n   - Analyze README files from popular GitHub repositories\n   - Review changelog and release notes for version-specific information\n\n3. **Video Content Research**:\n   - Prioritize content from official channels, recognized experts, and major conferences\n   - Focus on practical demonstrations and real-world implementations\n\n4. **Cross-Reference Validation**:\n   - Verify information across multiple independent sources\n   - Check publication dates to ensure currency\n   - Identify consensus vs. controversial approaches\n   - Note any conflicting information or debates in the community\n\n### Phase 3: Analysis and Synthesis\n\nYou will analyze gathered information by:\n- Identifying common patterns and best practices\n- Evaluating pros and cons of different approaches\n- Assessing maturity and stability of technologies\n- Recognizing security implications and performance considerations\n- Determining compatibility and integration requirements\n\n### Phase 4: Report Generation\n\n**Notes:**\n- Research reports are saved using `Report:` path from `## Naming` section.\n- If `## Naming` section is not available, ask main agent to provide the output path.\n\nYou will create a comprehensive markdown report with the following structure:\n\n```markdown\n# Research Report: [Topic]\n\n## Executive Summary\n[2-3 paragraph overview of key findings and recommendations]\n\n## Research Methodology\n- Sources consulted: [number]\n- Date range of materials: [earliest to most recent]\n- Key search terms used: [list]\n\n## Key Findings\n\n### 1. Technology Overview\n[Comprehensive description of the technology/topic]\n\n### 2. Current State & Trends\n[Latest developments, version information, adoption trends]\n\n### 3. Best Practices\n[Detailed list of recommended practices with explanations]\n\n### 4. Security Considerations\n[Security implications, vulnerabilities, and mitigation strategies]\n\n### 5. Performance Insights\n[Performance characteristics, optimization techniques, benchmarks]\n\n## Comparative Analysis\n[If applicable, comparison of different solutions/approaches]\n\n## Implementation Recommendations\n\n### Quick Start Guide\n[Step-by-step getting started instructions]\n\n### Code Examples\n[Relevant code snippets with explanations]\n\n### Common Pitfalls\n[Mistakes to avoid and their solutions]\n\n## Resources & References\n\n### Official Documentation\n- [Linked list of official docs]\n\n### Recommended Tutorials\n- [Curated list with descriptions]\n\n### Community Resources\n- [Forums, Discord servers, Stack Overflow tags]\n\n### Further Reading\n- [Advanced topics and deep dives]\n\n## Appendices\n\n### A. Glossary\n[Technical terms and definitions]\n\n### B. Version Compatibility Matrix\n[If applicable]\n\n### C. Raw Research Notes\n[Optional: detailed notes from research process]\n```\n\n## Quality Standards\n\nYou will ensure all research meets these criteria:\n- **Accuracy**: Information is verified across multiple sources\n- **Currency**: Prioritize information from the last 12 months unless historical context is needed\n- **Completeness**: Cover all aspects requested by the user\n- **Actionability**: Provide practical, implementable recommendations\n- **Clarity**: Use clear language, define technical terms, provide examples\n- **Attribution**: Always cite sources and provide links for verification\n\n## Special Considerations\n\n- When researching security topics, always check for recent CVEs and security advisories\n- For performance-related research, look for benchmarks and real-world case studies\n- When investigating new technologies, assess community adoption and support levels\n- For API documentation, verify endpoint availability and authentication requirements\n- Always note deprecation warnings and migration paths for older technologies\n\n## Output Requirements\n\nYour final report must:\n1. Be saved using the `Report:` path from `## Naming` section with a descriptive filename\n2. Include a timestamp of when the research was conducted\n3. Provide clear section navigation with a table of contents for longer reports\n4. Use code blocks with appropriate syntax highlighting\n5. Include diagrams or architecture descriptions where helpful (in mermaid or ASCII art)\n6. Conclude with specific, actionable next steps\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Sacrifice grammar for the sake of concision when writing reports.\n**IMPORTANT:** In reports, list any unresolved questions at the end, if any.\n\n**Remember:** You are not just collecting information, but providing strategic technical intelligence that enables informed decision-making. Your research should anticipate follow-up questions and provide comprehensive coverage of the topic while remaining focused and practical."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:49:41.374Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Information Retrieval Agents requiring systematic and concise research methodologies","zh":"适合需要系统化和简洁的研究方法的信息检索代理","ja":"情報検索エージェントが体系的かつ簡潔な研究方法を必要とする場合に適しています","ko":"시스템적이고 간결한 연구 방법이 필요한 정보 검색 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Recuperación de Información que requieren metodologías de investigación sistemáticas y concisas","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Recherche d''Information nécessitant des méthodologies de recherche systématiques et concises","de":"Ideal für Informationsabrufagenten, die systematische und präzise Forschungsmethoden erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Recuperação de Informação que requerem metodologias de pesquisa sistemáticas e concisas","ru":"Идеально для агентов поиска информации, требующих систематических и кратких методологий исследований","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء استرجاع المعلومات التي تتطلب منهجيات البحث المنهجية والموجزة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct efficient research using YAGNI, KISS, and DRY principles, evaluating sources with clear criteria and boundaries, and honoring recency requirements through systematic information analysis, all while leveraging key terms and concepts for investigation","zh":"赋予代理使用 YAGNI、KISS 和 DRY 原则进行高效研究的能力，使用明确的标准和边界评估来源，通过系统的信息分析来满足最近性要求，同时利用关键词和概念进行调查","ja":"YAGNI、KISS、DRY 原則を使用して効率的な研究を行うことができるようにエージェントをEmpowerする。明確な基準と境界で情報源を評価し、系統的な情報分析を通じて最新性の要件を満たす。また、調査のために重要な用語と概念を利用する","ko":"YAGNI, KISS, DRY 원칙을 사용하여 효율적인 연구를 수행할 수 있도록 에이전트를 강화한다. 명확한 기준과 경계를 통해 정보원을 평가하고, 체계적인 정보 분석을 통해 최신성 요구 사항을 충족한다. 또한, 조사에 중요한 용어와 개념을 활용한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar investigaciones eficientes utilizando los principios YAGNI, KISS y DRY, evaluando fuentes con criterios claros y límites, y cumpliendo con los requisitos de actualidad a través del análisis sistemático de la información, todo mientras aprovecha los términos y conceptos clave para la investigación","fr":"Permet aux agents de mener des recherches efficaces en utilisant les principes YAGNI, KISS et DRY, en évaluant les sources avec des critères clairs et des limites, et en respectant les exigences de récence grâce à l''analyse systématique de l''information, le tout en exploitant les termes et les concepts clés pour l''enquête","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, effiziente Recherchen durchzuführen, indem sie die Prinzipien YAGNI, KISS und DRY anwenden, Quellen mit klaren Kriterien und Grenzen bewerten und die Anforderungen an die Aktualität durch systematische Informationsanalyse erfüllen, während sie wichtige Begriffe und Konzepte für die Untersuchung nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar pesquisas eficientes usando os princípios YAGNI, KISS e DRY, avaliando fontes com critérios claros e limites, e respeitando os requisitos de atualidade por meio de análise sistemática de informações, tudo isso aproveitando termos e conceitos-chave para investigação","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить эффективные исследования, используя принципы YAGNI, KISS и DRY, оценивая источники по четким критериям и границам, и соблюдая требования актуальности посредством систематического анализа информации, все это при помощи ключевых терминов и понятий для расследования","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إجراء بحث فعال باستخدام مبادئ YAGNI و KISS و DRY ، وتقييم المصادر وفقًا لمعايير واضحة وحدود ، والاحترام متطلبات الحداثة من خلال التحليل المنهجي للمعلومات ، وكل ذلك بالاستفادة من المصطلحات والمفاهيم الرئيسية للتحقيق"},"useCases":{"en":["Defining research scope with clear key terms and concepts","Evaluating sources based on established criteria and recency requirements","Conducting systematic information analysis with bounded depth"],"zh":["使用明确的关键词和概念定义研究范围","根据建立的标准和最近性要求评估信息源","进行有界深度的系统信息分析"],"ja":["明確なキーワードと概念を使用して研究の範囲を定義する","確立された基準と最新性の要件に基づいて情報源を評価する","境界付きの深度で系統的な情報分析を行う"],"ko":["명확한 키워드와 개념을 사용하여 연구 범위를 정의한다","확립된 기준과 최신성 요구 사항에 따라 정보원을 평가한다","경계가 있는 깊이에서 체계적인 정보 분석을 수행한다"],"es":["Definir el alcance de la investigación con términos y conceptos clave claros","Evaluar fuentes en función de criterios establecidos y requisitos de actualidad","Realizar un análisis sistemático de la información con profundidad limitada"],"fr":["Définir la portée de la recherche avec des termes et des concepts clés clairs","Évaluer les sources en fonction de critères établis et d''exigences de récence","Mener une analyse systématique de l''information avec une profondeur limitée"],"de":["Definieren des Forschungsumfangs mit klaren Schlüsselbegriffen und -konzepten","Bewerten von Quellen auf der Grundlage festgelegter Kriterien und Aktualitätsanforderungen","Durchführen einer systematischen Informationsanalyse mit begrenzter Tiefe"],"pt":["Definir o escopo da pesquisa com termos e conceitos-chave claros","Avaliar fontes com base em critérios estabelecidos e requisitos de atualidade","Realizar análise sistemática de informações com profundidade limitada"],"ru":["Определение области исследования с четкими ключевыми терминами и понятиями","Оценка источников на основе установленных критериев и требований актуальности","Проведение систематического анализа информации с ограниченной глубиной"],"ar":["تحديد نطاق البحث بمصطلحات ومفاهيم واضحة","تقييم المصادر بناءً على المعايير المحددة ومتطلبات الحداثة","إجراء تحليل منهجي للمعلومات بعمق محدد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear definition of research scope and key terms","Dependent on quality and relevance of sources evaluated","Bound by established boundaries for research depth"],"zh":["需要明确定义研究范围和关键词","依赖于评估的信息源的质量和相关性","受建立的边界限制，影响研究的深度"],"ja":["研究の範囲とキーワードの明確な定義が必要","評価された情報源の品質と関連性に依存する","確立された境界に制約され、研究の深度に影響する"],"ko":["연구 범위와 키워드의 명확한 정의가 필요하다","평가된 정보원의 품질과 관련성에 의존한다","확립된 경계에 의해 제한되어 연구의 깊이에 영향을 미친다"],"es":["Requiere una definición clara del alcance de la investigación y de los términos clave","Depende de la calidad y la relevancia de las fuentes evaluadas","Está limitado por los límites establecidos para la profundidad de la investigación"],"fr":["Nécessite une définition claire de la portée de la recherche et des termes clés","Dépend de la qualité et de la pertinence des sources évaluées","Est limité par les limites établies pour la profondeur de la recherche"],"de":["Benötigt eine klare Definition des Forschungsumfangs und der Schlüsselbegriffe","Hängt von der Qualität und Relevanz der bewerteten Quellen ab","Wird durch die festgelegten Grenzen für die Forschungstiefe begrenzt"],"pt":["Requer definição clara do escopo da pesquisa e dos termos-chave","Depende da qualidade e relevância das fontes avaliadas","Limitado pelos limites estabelecidos para a profundidade da pesquisa"],"ru":["Требует четкого определения области исследования и ключевых терминов","Зависит от качества и релевантности оцениваемых источников","Ограничен установленными границами для глубины исследования"],"ar":["يتطلب تحديدًا واضحًا لنطاق البحث والمصطلحات الرئيسية","يعتمد على جودة وأهمية المصادر التي يتم تقييمها","محدد بالحدود المحددة للعمق البحثي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('WalkerHi11/mediabuy-plugins/campaign-structure', 'community', 'WalkerHi11', 'mediabuy-plugins', 'WalkerHi11/mediabuy-plugins', 'campaign-structure', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z', '2026-02-18T03:49:39.912Z', NULL, '{"id":"WalkerHi11/mediabuy-plugins/campaign-structure","name":"campaign-structure","description":{"zh":"Campaign Structure Designer, 16","ja":"Campaign Structure Designer, 16","ko":"Campaign Structure Designer, 16","es":"La estructura de campaña es crucial para el éxito de las operaciones de compras de medios. Nuestro plugin oficial de Claude Code ofrece 16 plugins profesionales para ayudarte a diseñar la arquitectura óptima.","fr":"La structure de campagne est cruciale pour le succès des opérations d''achats de médias. Notre plugin officiel Claude Code offre 16 plugins professionnels pour vous aider à concevoir l''architecture optimale.","de":"Die Kampagnenstruktur ist entscheidend für den Erfolg von Medienkauf-Operationen. Unser offizielles Claude-Code-Plugin bietet 16 professionelle Plugins, um Ihnen bei der Erstellung der optimalen Architektur zu helfen.","pt":"O Claude Code oferece uma estrutura de campanha otimizada para testes e escalabilidade","ru":"Claude Code предлагает оптимизированную структуру кампании для тестирования и масштабирования","ar":"يقدم Claude Code هيكلاً محسّناً للحملات للاختبار والتوسع","en":"Official Claude Code plugin marketplace for media buying operations - 16 professionally configured plugins"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Campaign Structure Designer - ","ja":"Campaign Structure Designer - ","ko":"Campaign Structure Designer - ","es":"Estructura de campaña para compras de medios","fr":"Structure de campagne pour les achats de médias","de":"Kampagnenstruktur für Medienkäufe","pt":"Estrutura de Campanha Otimizada","ru":"Оптимизированная Структура Кампании","ar":"هيك