 d''achats de médias","Analyse du type d''offre et du budget","Allocation du budget quotidien pour les tests","Seuil de perte acceptable et délai de rentabilité"],"de":["Entwurf einer optimalen Kampagnenarchitektur","16 professionelle Plugins für Medienkauf-Operationen","Analyse des Angebots- und Budgettyps","Zuweisung des täglichen Testbudgets","Akzeptierbarer Verlustschwelle und Rentabilitätszeitraum"],"pt":["Avaliação do tipo de oferta","Alocação de orçamento","Definição de CPA/CPL alvo","Limiar de perda aceitável","Cronograma para rentabilidade"],"ru":["Оценка типа предложения","Распределение бюджета","Определение целевого CPA/CPL","Допустимый порог потерь","График прибыльности"],"ar":["تقييم نوع العرض","تخصيص الميزانية","تحديد معدل CPA/CPL المستهدف","عتبة الخسارة المقبولة","جدول زمني للربحية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Campaign Structure Designer","media buying operations","plugin marketplace","campaign architecture","testing and scaling","offer type assessment","budget allocation"],"ja":["Campaign Structure Designer","media buying operations","plugin marketplace","campaign architecture","testing and scaling","offer type assessment","budget allocation"],"ko":["Campaign Structure Designer","media buying operations","plugin marketplace","campaign architecture","testing and scaling","offer type assessment","budget allocation"],"es":["estructura de campaña","compras de medios","diseño de campaña","testing y escalado","presupuesto de campaña","análisis de oferta"," Claude Code plugin"],"fr":["structure de campagne","achats de médias","conception de campagne","test et mise à l''échelle","budget de campagne","analyse d''offre","plugin Claude Code"],"de":["Kampagnenstruktur","Medienkauf","Kampagnenentwurf","Testen und Skalieren","Kampagnenbudget","Angebotsanalyse","Claude-Code-Plugin"],"pt":["estrutura de campanha","otimização de campanha","testes de campanha","escalabilidade de campanha","Claude Code","ofertas de marketing"],"ru":["структура кампании","оптимизация кампании","тестирование кампании","масштабирование кампании","Claude Code","маркетинговые предложения"],"ar":["هيكل الحملة","تحسين الحملة","اختبار الحملة","توسيع الحملة","Claude Code","عروض التسويق"]}},"owner":"WalkerHi11","repo":"mediabuy-plugins","repoPath":"WalkerHi11/mediabuy-plugins","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"campaign-structure","description":"Design optimal Facebook/Meta campaign structure for testing including ABO vs CBO, ad set organization, targeting, and budget allocation. Use when setting up new campaigns, planning test structure, or optimizing account architecture.","bodyPreview":"# Campaign Structure Designer\r\n\r\nCreate optimal campaign architecture for testing and scaling.\r\n\r\n## Process\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Assess Offer and Budget\r\n\r\n**Offer Type Assessment**\r\n- VSL/long-form funnel → More controlled testing\r\n- Lead gen/simple funnel → Can be more aggressive\r\n- New offer → Need more testing budget\r\n- Proven offer → Can scale faster\r\n\r\n**Budget Allocation**\r\n- Daily testing budget\r\n- Target CPA/CPL\r\n- Acceptable loss threshold\r\n- Timeline to profitability\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Choose","body":"# Campaign Structure Designer\r\n\r\nCreate optimal campaign architecture for testing and scaling.\r\n\r\n## Process\r\n\r\n### Step 1: Assess Offer and Budget\r\n\r\n**Offer Type Assessment**\r\n- VSL/long-form funnel → More controlled testing\r\n- Lead gen/simple funnel → Can be more aggressive\r\n- New offer → Need more testing budget\r\n- Proven offer → Can scale faster\r\n\r\n**Budget Allocation**\r\n- Daily testing budget\r\n- Target CPA/CPL\r\n- Acceptable loss threshold\r\n- Timeline to profitability\r\n\r\n### Step 2: Choose Structure Type\r\n\r\n**ABO Testing Structure (Recommended for Testing)**\r\nUse when: Finding initial winners, testing new angles\r\n\r\n```\r\nCampaign: [Offer] Testing\r\n├── Ad Set 1: [Concept A] - $X/day\r\n│   ├── Ad 1: Hook variation 1\r\n│   ├── Ad 2: Hook variation 2\r\n│   └── Ad 3: Hook variation 3\r\n├── Ad Set 2: [Concept B] - $X/day\r\n│   ├── Ad 1...\r\n...\r\n```\r\n\r\n**CBO Scaling Structure**\r\nUse when: Scaling proven winners\r\n\r\n```\r\nCampaign: [Offer] Scale - $X/day CBO\r\n├── Ad Set 1: Winners Only\r\n│   ├── Winner Ad 1\r\n│   ├── Winner Ad 2\r\n│   └── Winner Ad 3\r\n```\r\n\r\n**2x2x3 Testing Method (Jason K)**\r\n- 2 Headlines\r\n- 2 Ad texts\r\n- 3 Images/faces\r\n= 12 ad variations testing copy combinations\r\n\r\n**Double Six Shooter (Jason K)**\r\n- 10-12 ad sets (different avatars)\r\n- Same 10-12 images per ad set\r\n- Large CBO with minimum spend per ad set\r\n- Let Facebook find winning avatar + image combos\r\n\r\n### Step 3: Set Targeting Parameters\r\n\r\n**Testing Phase**\r\n- 2% Lookalike audiences (Jason K recommends)\r\n- Mobile newsfeed only\r\n- WiFi only (for VSL)\r\n\r\n**Scaling Phase**\r\n- 10% Lookalike (Jason K)\r\n- All placements\r\n- Broader audiences\r\n\r\n**Audience Sources**\r\n- Purchase lookalikes\r\n- Add to cart lookalikes\r\n- Email list lookalikes\r\n- Page engagers (for exclusions)\r\n\r\n### Step 4: Define Budget Rules\r\n\r\n**Testing Budget**\r\n- Spend 1.5-2x target CPL before calling winner (Casto)\r\n- Use initiate checkout as leading indicator (3x purchase data)\r\n- Kill at threshold, don''t hold hoping\r\n\r\n**Winner Criteria (Jason K)**\r\n- Doesn''t lose more than once in 3 days\r\n- Doesn''t lose more than twice in 7 days\r\n- Consistent performance, not just spikes\r\n\r\n**Scaling Budget**\r\n- 20% increases (safe)\r\n- Can jump when hot, but risk breaking\r\n- Spread across multiple ad accounts\r\n\r\n### Step 5: Output Campaign Blueprint\r\n\r\n```\r\n## CAMPAIGN STRUCTURE: [Offer Name]\r\n\r\n### PHASE 1: INITIAL TESTING\r\n\r\n**Campaign: [Offer] - ABO Test**\r\n- Objective: Conversions\r\n- Budget: $[X]/day per ad set\r\n- Duration: [X] days minimum\r\n\r\n**Ad Set Structure:**\r\n| Ad Set | Concept | Targeting | Budget |\r\n|--------|---------|-----------|--------|\r\n| 1 | [Concept A] | 2% LAL | $X |\r\n| 2 | [Concept B] | 2% LAL | $X |\r\n| 3 | [Concept C] | 2% LAL | $X |\r\n\r\n**Per Ad Set:**\r\n- 5-10 ads per concept\r\n- Mix of hooks/variations\r\n- Mobile newsfeed only\r\n\r\n**Kill Criteria:**\r\n- CPL > [X] after $[spend]\r\n- CPA > [X] after [conversions]\r\n\r\n**Winner Criteria:**\r\n- CPL < [target]\r\n- Consistent 3+ days\r\n- Scalable volume\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### PHASE 2: WINNER VALIDATION\r\n\r\n**Campaign: [Offer] - CBO Scale**\r\n- Budget: $[X]/day CBO\r\n- Winners only (3-5 ads)\r\n- Scale in place initially\r\n\r\n**Expansion:**\r\n- Replicate to Ad Account 2\r\n- Replicate to Ad Account 3\r\n- De-risk across accounts\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### PHASE 3: FULL SCALE\r\n\r\n**Structure:**\r\n- Multiple CBOs across accounts\r\n- $10K max per CBO (avoid instability)\r\n- Weekend campaigns (separate)\r\n- Day-parting: 4AM-1PM Eastern (VSL)\r\n\r\n**Targeting Expansion:**\r\n- Move to 10% LAL\r\n- Test broad\r\n- All placements\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### CREATIVE TESTING CADENCE\r\n\r\n**Weekly:**\r\n- 50-100 new creative variations\r\n- New hooks on proven angles\r\n- New angles on proven offers\r\n\r\n**Monthly:**\r\n- New concept batches\r\n- Founder content refresh\r\n- Seasonal angles\r\n\r\n### TRACKING SETUP\r\n- UTM structure: [Define]\r\n- Conversion events: [List]\r\n- Attribution window: [Setting]\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Key Principles\r\n\r\n**From Casto:**\r\n- Broad targeting, let creative do targeting\r\n- Use bid caps/cost caps when margins thin\r\n- Spread across multiple ad accounts\r\n- Build internal tools for launch automation\r\n\r\n**From Jason K:**\r\n- 2% LAL for testing, 10% for scaling\r\n- Watch initiate checkouts (3x data)\r\n- Day-part for VSL (turn off afternoon)\r\n- Weekend campaigns with higher budgets\r\n- Large CBO of winners is end goal\r\n\r\nSource: Jason K, Casto (Meta-CastovsJasonK)\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:49:39.912Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Media Buying Agents needing structured campaign architecture and budget allocation strategies.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化广告架构和预算分配策略的媒体购买代理。","ja":"構造化されたキャンペーンアーキテクチャと予算配分戦略を必要とするメディアバイイングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 캠페인 아키텍처와 예산 할당 전략이 필요한 미디어 구매 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de compras de medios que necesitan una arquitectura de campaña estructurada y estrategias de asignación de presupuesto.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''achat de médias ayant besoin d''une architecture de campagne structurée et de stratégies d''allocation de budget.","de":"Perfekt für Media-Einkaufsagenten, die eine strukturierte Kampagnenarchitektur und Budgetzuweisungsstrategien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Compra de Mídia que necessitam de arquitetura de campanha estruturada e estratégias de alocação de orçamento.","ru":"Идеально для агентов по покупке СМИ, которым необходима структурированная архитектура кампаний и стратегии распределения бюджета.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الإعلام وكلاء الشراء الذين بحاجة إلى هيكل حملة منظم واستراتيجيات تخصيص الميزانية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design optimal campaign structures using offer type assessments, budget allocations, and CPA/CPL targeting, while leveraging daily testing budgets and acceptable loss thresholds for scalable media buying operations.","zh":"使代理能够通过报价类型评估、预算分配和CPA/CPL目标来设计最优广告结构，同时利用每日测试预算和可接受的损失阈值，实现可扩展的媒体购买操作。","ja":"オファータイプの評価、予算配分、CPA/CPLターゲティングを使用して最適なキャンペーン構造を設計し、日次テスト予算と許容損失閾値を活用してスケーラブルなメディアバイイング操作を実現します。","ko":"오퍼 유형 평가, 예산 할당 및 CPA/CPL 타겟팅을 사용하여 최적의 캠페인 구조를 설계하고, 확장 가능한 미디어 구매 운영을 위해 일일 테스트 예산과 허용 가능한 손실 임계값을 활용할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar estructuras de campaña óptimas utilizando evaluaciones de tipo de oferta, asignaciones de presupuesto y orientación CPA/CPL, mientras aprovecha los presupuestos de prueba diarios y los umbrales de pérdida aceptables para operaciones de compras de medios escalables.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des structures de campagne optimales en utilisant des évaluations de type d''offre, des allocations de budget et une cible CPA/CPL, tout en exploitant les budgets de test quotidiens et les seuils de perte acceptables pour des opérations d''achat de médias évolutives.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, optimale Kampagnenstrukturen zu entwerfen, indem sie Angebotstypbewertungen, Budgetzuweisungen und CPA/CPL-Zielsetzungen nutzen und gleichzeitig tägliche Testbudgets und akzeptable Verlustschwellen für skalierbare Media-Einkaufsoperationen ausschöpfen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem estruturas de campanha ótimas usando avaliações de tipos de ofertas, alocações de orçamento e direcionamento de CPA/CPL, aproveitando orçamentos de teste diários e limiares de perda aceitáveis para operações de compra de mídia escaláveis.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать оптимальные структуры кампаний с помощью оценок типов предложений, распределения бюджета и нацеливания на CPA/CPL, используя при этом ежедневные бюджеты тестирования и приемлемые пороги потерь для масштабируемых операций по покупке СМИ.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تصميم هياكل حملة مثالية باستخدام تقييمات أنواع العروض وتخصيص الميزانية والاستهداف CPA/CPL، مع الاستفادة من ميزانيات الاختبار اليومية وعوائق الفقد المقبولة لتشغيل شراء وسائل الإعلام القابلة للتوسيع."},"useCases":{"en":["Assessing offer types for controlled testing","Allocating daily testing budgets for target CPA/CPL","Scaling proven offers with aggressive funnel strategies"],"zh":["评估报价类型以进行受控测试","分配每日测试预算以实现目标CPA/CPL","采用激进的漏斗策略扩展已验证的报价"],"ja":["管理されたテストのためのオファータイプの評価","目標CPA/CPLのための日次テスト予算の配分","積極的なファネル戦略による実績あるオファーの拡大"],"ko":["통제된 테스트를 위한 오퍼 유형 평가","목표 CPA/CPL을 위한 일일 테스트 예산 할당","공격적인 퍼널 전략으로 입증된 오퍼 확장"],"es":["Evaluación de tipos de ofertas para pruebas controladas","Asignación de presupuestos de prueba diarios para CPA/CPL objetivo","Escalado de ofertas comprobadas con estrategias de embudo agresivas"],"fr":["Évaluation des types d''offres pour des tests contrôlés","Allocation des budgets de test quotidiens pour une cible CPA/CPL","Mise à l''échelle d''offres éprouvées avec des stratégies de tunnel agressives"],"de":["Bewertung von Angebotstypen für kontrollierte Tests","Zuweisung von täglichen Testbudgets für CPA/CPL-Ziel","Skalierung von bewährten Angeboten mit aggressiven Trichterstrategien"],"pt":["Avaliando tipos de ofertas para testes controlados","Alocando orçamentos de teste diários para CPA/CPL de destino","Dimensionando ofertas comprovadas com estratégias de funil agressivas"],"ru":["Оценка типов предложений для контролируемого тестирования","Распределение ежедневных бюджетов тестирования для целевого CPA/CPL","Масштабирование проверенных предложений с агрессивными стратегиями воронки"],"ar":["تقييم أنواع العروض للاختبار المراقب","تخصيص ميزانيات الاختبار اليومية لCPA/CPL المستهدفة","تمكين العروض المثبتة مع استراتيجيات قمع هجومية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code plugin marketplace integration","Limited to media buying operations"],"zh":["需要集成Claude Code插件市场","仅限于媒体购买操作"],"ja":["Claude Codeプラグインマーケットプレースとの連携が必要","メディアバイイング操作に限定される"],"ko":["Claude Code 플러그인 마켓플레이스 통합 필요","미디어 구매 작업으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere integración del marketplace de plugins de Claude Code","Limitado a operaciones de compras de medios"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration du marketplace de plugins Claude Code","Limité aux opérations d''achat de médias"],"de":["Benötigt eine Integration des Claude Code-Plugin-Marketplace","Begrenzt auf Media-Einkaufsoperationen"],"pt":["Exige integração com o marketplace de plugins Claude Code","Limitado a operações de compra de mídia"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с магазином плагинов Claude Code","Ограничен операциями по покупке СМИ"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع سوق البرامج الإضافية Claude Code","محدود بعمليات شراء وسائل الإعلام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
