car el código.","fr":"sd-review effectue une révision de code multifacette, produisant des rapports complets sans modifier le code.","de":"sd-review führt eine mehrperspektivische Code-Überprüfung durch und erstellt umfassende Berichte, ohne den Code zu ändern.","pt":"O sd-review é uma ferramenta de análise de código que executa uma revisão multi-perspectiva de um pacote ou caminho especificado, produzindo um relatório abr...","ru":"Sd-review — это инструмент анализа кода, который выполняет многосторонний обзор пакета или указанного пути, производя всесторонний отчет.","ar":"sd-review هو أداة لتحليل الكود تنفذ مراجعة متعددة المنظورات لPACKAGE أو مسار محدد، مما ينتج تقريرًا شاملاً.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["多角度代码审查","生成综合报告","无代码修改","支持多个子代理","并行执行代码审查"],"ja":["多角度からのコードレビュー","包括的なレポートの生成","コードの修正は行われません","複数のサブエージェントをサポート","コードレビューの並行実行"],"ko":["다각도 코드 리뷰","종합 보고서 생성","코드 수정 없음","다중 子代理 지원","코드 리뷰 병렬 실행"],"es":["Revisión de código multifacética","Análisis de código vía sd-explore","Ejecución de hasta 4 subagentes en paralelo","Verificación de resultados contra el código real","Generación de informes detallados"],"fr":["Révision de code multifacette","Analyse de code via sd-explore","Exécution de jusqu''à 4 sous-agents en parallèle","Vérification des résultats contre le code réel","Génération de rapports détaillés"],"de":["Mehrperspektivische Code-Überprüfung","Code-Analyse über sd-explore","Ausführung von bis zu 4 Subagenten in Parallelschaltung","Verifizierung der Ergebnisse gegen den tatsächlichen Code","Erstellung detaillierter Berichte"],"pt":["Análise de código multi-perspectiva","Relatórios abrangentes","Execução de subagentes em paralelo","Verificação de resultados contra o código real","Suporte a revisão de pacotes e caminhos especificados"],"ru":["Многосторонний анализ кода","Всесторонние отчеты","Параллельная работа подагентов","Проверка результатов против реального кода","Поддержка обзора пакетов и указанных путей"],"ar":["تحليل الكود متعددة المنظورات","تقريرات شاملة","تشغيل وكلاء فرعيين متوازيًا","التحقق من النتائج ضد الكود الفعلي","دعم مراجعة الحزم والمسارات المحددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["代码审查工具","代码审查报告","多角度代码审查","代码分析","代码优化","代码质量"],"ja":["コードレビューツール","コードレビューレポート","多角度からのコードレビュー","コード分析","コード最適化","コード品質"],"ko":["코드 리뷰 도구","코드 리뷰 보고서","다각도 코드 리뷰","코드 분석","코드 최적화","코드 품질"],"es":["revisión de código","análisis de código","informes de código","sd-review","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["révision de code","analyse de code","rapports de code","sd-review","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Code-Überprüfung","Code-Analyse","Code-Berichte","sd-review","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungs-Tools"],"pt":["análise de código","revisão de código","sd-review","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de código","relatórios de análise"],"ru":["анализ кода","обзор кода","sd-review","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","отчеты анализа"],"ar":["تحليل الكود","استعراض الكود","sd-review","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الكود","تقريرات التحليل"]}},"owner":"kslhunter","repo":"simplysm","repoPath":"kslhunter/simplysm","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sd-review","description":"Use when performing a comprehensive code review of a package or path for bugs, security issues, code quality, DX, and simplification opportunities","bodyPreview":"# sd-review\n\n## Overview\n\nPerform a multi-perspective code review of a package or specified path, producing a comprehensive report. **Analysis only — no code modifications.**\n\nAnalyzes code via the `sd-explore` skill, then runs up to 4 subagents in parallel for specialized review. Collects subagent results, verifies each finding against actual code, and writes the final report.\n\n## Usage\n\n- `/sd-review packages/solid` — review source code at the given path\n- `/sd-review` — if no argument, ask th","body":"# sd-review\n\n## Overview\n\nPerform a multi-perspective code review of a package or specified path, producing a comprehensive report. **Analysis only — no code modifications.**\n\nAnalyzes code via the `sd-explore` skill, then runs up to 4 subagents in parallel for specialized review. Collects subagent results, verifies each finding against actual code, and writes the final report.\n\n## Usage\n\n- `/sd-review packages/solid` — review source code at the given path\n- `/sd-review` — if no argument, ask the user for the target path\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Before merging major features or after significant refactoring\n- When assessing overall code quality of a package\n- When onboarding to unfamiliar code and want a quality overview\n\n**When NOT to use:**\n- Single-file or trivial changes (typo, config tweak)\n- When you need code modifications (sd-review is analysis-only)\n\n## Target Selection\n\n- With argument: `/sd-review packages/solid` — review source code at the given path\n- Without argument: ask the user for the target path\n\n**Important:** Review ALL source files under the target path. Do not use git status or git diff to limit scope.\n\n## Reviewer Agents\n\nRun subagents in parallel via the Task tool:\n\n| Agent Type               | Role | Condition |\n|--------------------------|------|-----------|\n| `sd-code-reviewer`       | Bugs, security, logic errors, convention issues | Always |\n| `sd-code-simplifier`     | Complexity, duplication, readability issues | Always |\n| `sd-api-reviewer`        | DX/usability, naming, type hints | Always |\n| `sd-security-reviewer`   | ORM SQL injection, input validation vulnerabilities | When target path contains ORM queries or service endpoints |\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Code Analysis via sd-explore\n\nInvoke the `sd-explore` skill via the Skill tool to analyze the target path:\n\n```\nSkill: sd-explore\n**Args:** <target-path>\n```\n\nThis runs in a **separate context**, so it does not consume the main context window. The analysis covers:\n\n- Feature Discovery: entry points, core files, module boundaries\n- Code Flow Tracing: call chains, data transformations, state changes\n- Architecture Analysis: abstraction layers, design patterns, dependency graph\n- Implementation Details: error handling, public API surface, performance\n\n### Step 2: Dispatch Analysis to Reviewers\n\nRun subagents **in parallel** via the Task tool. Include the sd-explore analysis results in each subagent''s prompt:\n\n- **sd-code-reviewer**: Based on the analysis, find bugs, security vulnerabilities, logic errors, and convention issues. Each finding must include **file:line** and **evidence**.\n- **sd-code-simplifier**: Based on the analysis, find unnecessary complexity, code duplication, and readability issues. Each finding must include **file:line** and **evidence**. **No code modifications.**\n- **sd-api-reviewer**: Based on the analysis, review API intuitiveness, naming consistency, type hints, error messages, and configuration complexity. Each finding must include **file:line** and **evidence**.\n- **sd-security-reviewer** *(conditional)*: If the sd-explore analysis reveals ORM queries (`orm-common`, `orm-node`, query builders, `expr.eq`, `.where()`, `.result()`) or service endpoints (`ServiceServer`, RPC handlers), also dispatch this agent. Based on the analysis, find SQL injection risks, missing input validation, and unvalidated user input reaching ORM queries. Each finding must include **file:line** and **evidence**.\n\n### Step 3: Verify Issues\n\nAfter collecting results from all 3 subagents, verify each issue against the actual code:\n\n- **Valid**: the issue is real → include in the report\n- **Invalid — already handled**: handled elsewhere in the codebase (provide evidence)\n- **Invalid — intentional pattern**: by-design architectural decision\n- **Invalid — misread**: the reviewer misinterpreted the code\n\n### Step 4: Final Report\n\nCompile only **verified findings** into a comprehensive report.\n\n### Report Structure\n\n| Section | Priority | Source |\n|---------|----------|--------|\n| **Architecture Summary** | — | sd-explore analysis |\n| **Critical Issues** | P0 | Bugs, security vulnerabilities |\n| **Security Issues** | P0 | SQL injection, input validation (when sd-security-reviewer ran) |\n| **Quality Issues** | P1 | Logic errors, missing error handling, performance |\n| **DX/Usability Issues** | P2 | API intuitiveness, naming, type hints |\n| **Simplification Opportunities** | P3 | Complexity removal, duplicate code, abstractions |\n| **Convention Issues** | P4 | Project convention mismatches |\n\nEach issue includes **file:line**, **description**, and **suggestion**.\n\nOptionally include an **Invalid Findings Summary** appendix showing which findings were filtered out and why.\n\n## Common Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Fix |\n|---------|-----|\n| Using git diff to limit review scope | Review ALL source files under target path |\n| Skipping verification step | Always verify subagent findings against actual code |\n| Reporting unverified issues | Only include verified findings in final report |\n\n## Completion Criteria\n\nPresent the comprehensive report to the user. No code modifications.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:49:55.648Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Review Agents requiring multi-perspective analysis and comprehensive reporting capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要多角度分析和全面的报告能力的代码审查代理。","ja":"マルチパースペクティブ分析と包括的なレポート作成機能を必要とするコードレビュー代理に最適です。","ko":"다각도 분석과 포괄적인 보고 기능을 필요로 하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de revisión de código que requieren un análisis de múltiples perspectivas y capacidades de informes exhaustivos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de révision de code nécessitant une analyse à multiples perspectives et des capacités de reporting exhaustives.","de":"Ideal für Code-Review-Agents, die eine Analyse aus mehreren Perspektiven und umfassende Berichtsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Revisão de Código que exigem análise de múltiplas perspectivas e capacidades de relatórios abrangentes.","ru":"Идеально для агентов кодового обзора, требующих многостороннего анализа и всесторонних возможностей отчетности.","ar":"مثالي لعميل مراجعة الكود الذي يتطلب تحليلًا متعدّد الأوجه وقدرات تقرير شاملة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform in-depth code analysis via the sd-explore skill, running up to 4 subagents in parallel for specialized review, and generating a final report that verifies findings against actual code, leveraging protocols like code verification and report generation.","zh":"通过sd-explore技能使代理能够进行深入的代码分析，通过并行运行最多4个子代理进行专用审查，并生成最终报告以验证实际代码中的发现，利用代码验证和报告生成等协议。","ja":"sd-exploreスキルを介して、エージェントが詳細なコード分析を実行できるようにし、最大4つのサブエージェントを並列して実行して専用のレビューを行い、コード検証やレポート生成などのプロトコルを利用して実際のコードに対する検出結果を検証する最終レポートを生成します。","ko":"sd-explore 스킬을 통해 에이전트가 코드의 심층 분석을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 최대 4개의 하위 에이전트를 병렬로 실행하여 전문적인 검토를 수행하고, 코드 검증 및 보고서 생성 등의 프로토콜을 활용하여 실제 코드에 대한 발견을 검증하는 최종 보고서를 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar un análisis de código en profundidad a través de la habilidad sd-explore, ejecutando hasta 4 subagentes en paralelo para una revisión especializada y generando un informe final que verifica los hallazgos contra el código real, aprovechando protocolos como la verificación de código y la generación de informes.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer une analyse de code en profondeur via la compétence sd-explore, exécutant jusqu''à 4 sous-agents en parallèle pour une révision spécialisée et générant un rapport final qui vérifie les résultats contre le code réel, en exploitant des protocoles tels que la vérification de code et la génération de rapports.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine tiefgehende Code-Analyse über die Fähigkeit sd-explore durchzuführen, bis zu 4 Subagenten parallel für eine spezialisierte Überprüfung auszuführen und einen abschließenden Bericht zu generieren, der die Ergebnisse gegen den tatsächlichen Code überprüft, indem Protokolle wie Code-Verifizierung und Berichtsgenerierung genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar análise de código aprofundada via a habilidade sd-explore, executando até 4 subagentes em paralelo para revisão especializada e gerando um relatório final que verifica as descobertas contra o código real, aproveitando protocolos como verificação de código e geração de relatórios.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить глубокий анализ кода через навык sd-explore, запуская до 4 субагентов параллельно для специализированного обзора и генерируя окончательный отчет, который проверяет результаты против фактического кода, используя протоколы, такие как проверка кода и генерация отчетов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إجراء تحليل متعمق للكود من خلال مهارة sd-explore، والتي تعمل حتى 4 وكلاء فرعيين متوازيين لمراجعة متخصصة وتوليد تقرير نهائي يتحقق من النتائج ضد الكود الفعلي، مستفيدا من بروتوكولات مثل التحقق من الكود وتوليد التقارير."},"useCases":{"en":["Conducting thorough code reviews of packages or specified paths","Generating comprehensive reports for code quality assessment","Analyzing code via multiple subagents for specialized review"],"zh":["对软件包或指定路径进行彻底的代码审查","生成代码质量评估的综合报告","通过多个子代理对代码进行专用审查"],"ja":["パッケージまたは指定されたパスに対する包括的なコードレビューの実施","コード品質評価のための包括的なレポートの生成","複数のサブエージェントを介してコードの専用レビューの実施"],"ko":["패키지 또는 지정된 경로에 대한 철저한 코드 리뷰 수행","코드 품질 평가를 위한 포괄적인 보고서 생성","다수의 하위 에이전트를 통해 코드의 전문적인 검토 수행"],"es":["Realizar revisiones de código exhaustivas de paquetes o rutas especificadas","Generar informes exhaustivos para la evaluación de la calidad del código","Analizar el código a través de múltiples subagentes para una revisión especializada"],"fr":["Réaliser des révisions de code exhaustives de packages ou de chemins spécifiés","Générer des rapports exhaustifs pour l''évaluation de la qualité du code","Analyser le code via plusieurs sous-agents pour une révision spécialisée"],"de":["Durchführung von gründlichen Code-Reviews von Paketen oder angegebenen Pfaden","Generierung von umfassenden Berichten für die Bewertung der Code-Qualität","Analyse des Codes über mehrere Subagenten für eine spezialisierte Überprüfung"],"pt":["Realizar revisões de código aprofundadas de pacotes ou caminhos especificados","Gerar relatórios abrangentes para avaliação da qualidade do código","Analizar código por meio de vários subagentes para revisão especializada"],"ru":["Проведение тщательных обзоров кода пакетов или указанных путей","Генерация всесторонних отчетов для оценки качества кода","Анализ кода через несколько субагентов для специализированного обзора"],"ar":["إجراء مراجعات شاملة للكود من حزم أو مسارات محددة","توليد تقارير شاملة لتقييم جودة الكود","تحليل الكود بواسطة وكلاء فرعيين متعددين لمراجعة متخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Analysis only, no code modifications allowed","Requires sd-explore skill for code analysis"],"zh":["仅限分析，不允许代码修改","需要sd-explore技能进行代码分析"],"ja":["分析のみ、コードの修正は許可されません","コード分析にはsd-exploreスキルが必要です"],"ko":["분석만 가능하며, 코드 수정은 허용되지 않음","코드 분석에는 sd-explore 스킬이 필요함"],"es":["Análisis solo, no se permiten modificaciones de código","Requiere la habilidad sd-explore para el análisis de código"],"fr":["Analyse uniquement, aucune modification de code n''est autorisée","Nécessite la compétence sd-explore pour l''analyse de code"],"de":["Nur Analyse, keine Code-Modifikationen erlaubt","Benötigt die Fähigkeit sd-explore für die Code-Analyse"],"pt":["Apenas análise, não são permitidas modificações de código","Exige a habilidade sd-explore para análise de código"],"ru":["Только анализ, изменения кода не допускаются","Требует навыка sd-explore для анализа кода"],"ar":["التحليل فقط، لا يسمح بتعديلات الكود","يتطلب مهارة sd-explore لتحليل الكود"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('mc-zuri/mineflayer-bedrock/skill-builder', 'community', 'mc-zuri', 'mineflayer-bedrock', 'mc-zuri/mineflayer-bedrock', 'skill-builder', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.412Z', '2026-02-18T03:50:34.777Z', NULL, '{"id":"mc-zuri/mineflayer-bedrock/skill-builder","name":"skill-builder","description":{"zh":"Claude Code 技能构建器帮助开发者创建结构良好的技能，按照最佳实践和代理技能规范","ja":"Claude Code スキルビルダーは、開発者がベストプラクティスとエージェントスキル仕様に従った構造化されたスキルを作成するのに役立ちます","ko":"클로드 코드 스킬 빌더는 개발자가 구조화된 스킬을 생성하고 최고의 관행 및 에이전트 스킬 사양을 따르도록 도와줍니다","es":"El constructor de habilidades de Claude Code te permite crear habilidades estructuradas con las mejores prácticas y la especificación de habilidades del agente","fr":"Le constructeur de compétences de Claude Code vous permet de créer des compétences structurées avec les meilleures pratiques et la spécification des compétences de l''agent","de":"Der Claude Code Fähigkeits-Builder ermöglicht es Ihnen, strukturierte Fähigkeiten mit den besten Praktiken und der Spezifikation der Agentenfähigkeiten zu erstellen","pt":"O construtor de habilidades Claude Code é uma ferramenta para criar habilidades bem estruturadas que seguem as melhores práticas.","ru":"Построитель навыков Claude Code - это инструмент для создания хорошо структурированных навыков, следующих лучшим практикам.","ar":"بناء مهارات كلود كود هو أداة لبناء مهارات منظمه باستخدام أفضل الممارسات.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Claude Code 技能构建器","ja":"Claude Code スキルビルダー","ko":"클로드 코드 스킬 빌더","es":"Constructor de habilidades de Claude Code","fr":"Constructeur de compétences Claude Code","de":"Claude Code Fähigkeits-Builder","pt":"Construtor de Habilidades Claude Code","ru":"Построитель навыков Claude Code","ar":"بناء مهارات كلود كود","en":"skill-builder"},"description":{"zh":"Claude Code 技能构建器帮助开发者创建结构良好的技能，按照最佳实践和代理技能规范","ja":"Claude Code スキルビルダーは、開発者がベストプラク