Ruby: Restrições e Limitações","ru":"Разработка PicoRuby: Ограничения и ограничения","ar":"تطوير PicoRuby: القيود والمعايير","en":"PicoRuby Development Constraints"},"description":{"zh":"PicoRuby开发约束包括内存限制和stdlib的限制，了解这些约束可以帮助开发者优化ESP32应用","ja":"PicoRuby開発の制約にはメモリ制約とstdlibの制限があり、これらを理解することで開発者はESP32アプリを最適化できます","ko":"PicoRuby 개발 제약에는 메모리 제약과 stdlib 제한이 포함되어 있습니다. 이러한 제약을 이해하면 개발자가 ESP32 애플리케이션을 최적화할 수 있습니다","es":"El desarrollo de PicoRuby en dispositivos ESP32 implica restricciones de memoria y límites de ejecución. Aprende a optimizar tu código","fr":"Le développement PicoRuby sur les appareils ESP32 implique des contraintes de mémoire et des limites d''exécution. Apprenez à optimiser votre code","de":"Die Entwicklung von PicoRuby auf ESP32-Geräten beinhaltet Speicherbeschränkungen und Laufzeitlimits. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie Ihren Code optimieren können","pt":"O PicoRuby é um kit de desenvolvimento para aplicações que executam no R2P2-ESP32 com microcontrolador ESP32, com restrições de memória e runtime.","ru":"PicoRuby - это набор для разработки приложений, работающих на R2P2-ESP32 с микроконтроллером ESP32, с ограничениями памяти и времени выполнения.","ar":"PicoRuby هو مجموعة تطوير لتطبيقات تعمل على R2P2-ESP32 مع مicrocontrolador ESP32، مع قيود الذاكرة والزمن التنفيذي.","en":"[WIP]Development Kit for PicoRuby Application running on R2P2-ESP32 with ESP32 Microcontroller Device"},"definition":{"en":"[WIP]Development Kit for PicoRuby Application running on R2P2-ESP32 with ESP32 Microcontroller Device"},"features":{"zh":["内存约束：520KB的总堆栈","避免深度递归，优先使用迭代解决方案","字符串处理：预分配内存，避免重复连接","数组：使用固定大小，尽量减少动态增长"],"ja":["メモリ制約：520KBの総ヒープ","深い再帰を避け、イテレーション解決策を優先する","文字列処理：事前にメモリを割り当て、繰り返し接続を避ける","配列：固定サイズを使用し、動的増加を最小限に抑える"],"ko":["메모리 제약: 520KB의 총 힙","깊은 재귀를 피하고, 반복 해석을 우선한다","문자열 처리: 메모리를 사전에 할당하고, 반복적인 연결을 피한다","배열: 고정 크기를 사용하고, 동적 증가를 최소화한다"],"es":["Restricciones de memoria de 520KB","Profundidad de anidación limitada","Manipulación de cadenas con preasignación","Arreglos de tamaño fijo para minimizar el crecimiento dinámico"],"fr":["Contraintes de mémoire de 520KB","Profondeur de nidification limitée","Manipulation de chaînes avec préaffectation","Tableaux de taille fixe pour minimiser la croissance dynamique"],"de":["Speicherbeschränkungen von 520KB","Begrenzte Nesting-Tiefe","Zeichenfolgenverarbeitung mit Vorbelegung","Feste Größen für Arrays, um dynamisches Wachstum zu minimieren"],"pt":["Restrições de memória de 520KB","Profundidade de aninhamento limitada","Manipulação de strings otimizada","Arrays de tamanho fixo","Limitações de runtime"],"ru":["Ограничения памяти 520КБ","Ограниченная глубина вложенности","Оптимизированная обработка строк","Массивы фиксированного размера","Ограничения времени выполнения"],"ar":["قيود الذاكرة 520KB","عمق التضمين المحدود","معالجة السلاسل المتوفرة","مصفوفات بحجم ثابت","قيود الزمن التنفيذي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PicoRuby","ESP32","开发约束","内存限制","stdlib限制","开发优化"],"ja":["PicoRuby","ESP32","開発の制約","メモリ制約","stdlibの制限","開発最適化"],"ko":["PicoRuby","ESP32","개발 제약","메모리 제한","stdlib 제한","개발 최적화"],"es":["PicoRuby","desarrollo de aplicaciones","dispositivos ESP32","microcontrolador","restricciones de memoria","límites de ejecución"],"fr":["PicoRuby","développement d''applications","appareils ESP32","microcontrôleur","contraintes de mémoire","limites d''exécution"],"de":["PicoRuby","Anwendungsentwicklung","ESP32-Geräte","Mikrocontroller","Speicherbeschränkungen","Laufzeitlimits"],"pt":["PicoRuby","Desenvolvimento de aplicações","ESP32","Restrições de memória","Runtime","Ruby","Microcontrolador","R2P2-ESP32"],"ru":["PicoRuby","Разработка приложений","ESP32","Ограничения памяти","Время выполнения","Ruby","Микроконтроллер","R2P2-ESP32"],"ar":["PicoRuby","تطوير التطبيقات","ESP32","قيود الذاكرة","الزمن التنفيذي","Ruby","مicrocontrolador","R2P2-ESP32"]}},"owner":"bash0C7","repo":"picotorokko","repoPath":"bash0C7/picotorokko","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"PicoRuby Development Constraints","description":"Documents memory limits and stdlib constraints for PicoRuby on ESP32. Use this when writing code that will run on ESP32 hardware or designing features for PicoRuby applications.","bodyPreview":"# PicoRuby Development Constraints\n\nMemory constraints and stdlib limitations for ESP32 PicoRuby development.\n\n## Memory & Runtime Limits\n\n- **Total heap**: 520KB (strict limit)\n- **Nesting depth**: Avoid deep recursion; prefer iterative solutions\n- **String handling**: Pre-allocate when possible; avoid repeated concatenation\n- **Arrays**: Use fixed-size when known; minimize dynamic growth during tight loops\n\n## PicoRuby vs CRuby\n\n| Feature | PicoRuby | CRuby |\n|---------|----------|-------|\n| G","body":"# PicoRuby Development Constraints\n\nMemory constraints and stdlib limitations for ESP32 PicoRuby development.\n\n## Memory & Runtime Limits\n\n- **Total heap**: 520KB (strict limit)\n- **Nesting depth**: Avoid deep recursion; prefer iterative solutions\n- **String handling**: Pre-allocate when possible; avoid repeated concatenation\n- **Arrays**: Use fixed-size when known; minimize dynamic growth during tight loops\n\n## PicoRuby vs CRuby\n\n| Feature | PicoRuby | CRuby |\n|---------|----------|-------|\n| Gems | ❌ No bundler/gems | ✅ Full ecosystem |\n| stdlib | Minimal (R2P2-ESP32 only) | Complete stdlib |\n| Memory | ~520KB heap | GB+ available |\n| GC | Simple mark-sweep | Complex generational |\n| Float math | ⚠️ Limited precision | Full IEEE 754 |\n\n## PicoRuby-safe stdlib\n\n**Available**:\n- `Array#each`, `#map`, `#select` (avoid `#each_with_index` in tight loops)\n- `Hash` (simple key-value)\n- `String` (basic methods, avoid regex for embedded)\n- `Time` (limited; ESP32 time depends on system clock)\n- `File` (via R2P2-ESP32 abstraction)\n\n**Unavailable**:\n- Regex (use string matching instead)\n- Threads (single-threaded runtime)\n- Fiber/Enumerator (complex control flow not needed)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:50:43.340Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Embedded Systems Agents requiring optimized memory management and stdlib utilization in PicoRuby applications","zh":"适用于需要优化内存管理和stdlib利用的嵌入式系统代理的PicoRuby应用","ja":"PicoRubyアプリケーションで最適化されたメモリ管理とstdlibの利用が必要な組み込みシステムエージェントに最適","ko":"최적화된 메모리 관리 및 stdlib 활용이 필요한 임베디드 시스템 에이전트를 위한 PicoRuby 애플리케이션에 적합","es":"Ideal for Embedded Systems Agents requiring optimized memory management and stdlib utilization in PicoRuby applications","fr":"Ideal for Embedded Systems Agents requiring optimized memory management and stdlib utilization in PicoRuby applications","de":"Ideal for Embedded Systems Agents requiring optimized memory management and stdlib utilization in PicoRuby applications","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Sistemas Incorporados que exigem gerenciamento de memória otimizado e utilização de stdlib em aplicações PicoRuby","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов встроенных систем, требующих оптимизированного управления памятью и использования stdlib в приложениях PicoRuby","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكلاء المضمنة التي تتطلب إدارة ذاكرة متقنة واستخدام stdlib في تطبيقات PicoRuby"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop efficient PicoRuby applications on ESP32 Microcontroller Devices by navigating strict memory constraints, such as 520KB total heap, and stdlib limitations, utilizing techniques like pre-allocating strings and minimizing dynamic array growth","zh":"使代理能够通过导航严格的内存约束（如520KB的总堆）和stdlib限制，使用预分配字符串和最小化动态数组增长等技术，开发出高效的PicoRuby应用程序，适用于ESP32微控制器设备","ja":"エージェントが、520KBの総ヒープなどの厳格なメモリ制約やstdlibの制限を回避し、文字列の事前割り当てや動的配列の成長の最小化などの手法を使用して、ESP32マイクロコントローラデバイス向けの効率的なPicoRubyアプリケーションを開発できるようにする","ko":"에이전트가 520KB의 총 힙과 같은 엄격한 메모리 제약 및 stdlib 제한을 피하고 문자열의 사전 할당 및 동적 배열의 성장 최소화 등의 기술을 사용하여 ESP32 마이크로컨트롤러 장치용 효율적인 PicoRuby 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to develop efficient PicoRuby applications on ESP32 Microcontroller Devices by navigating strict memory constraints, such as 520KB total heap, and stdlib limitations, utilizing techniques like pre-allocating strings and minimizing dynamic array growth","fr":"Empowers agents to develop efficient PicoRuby applications on ESP32 Microcontroller Devices by navigating strict memory constraints, such as 520KB total heap, and stdlib limitations, utilizing techniques like pre-allocating strings and minimizing dynamic array growth","de":"Empowers agents to develop efficient PicoRuby applications on ESP32 Microcontroller Devices by navigating strict memory constraints, such as 520KB total heap, and stdlib limitations, utilizing techniques like pre-allocating strings and minimizing dynamic array growth","pt":"Permite que os agentes desenvolvam aplicações PicoRuby eficientes em dispositivos de microcontrolador ESP32, navegando por restrições de memória estritas, como 520KB de heap total, e limitações de stdlib, utilizando técnicas como pré-alocação de strings e minimização do crescimento de arrays dinâmicos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать эффективные приложения PicoRuby на устройствах микроконтроллера ESP32, ориентируясь в строгих ограничениях памяти, таких как 520КБ общего кучи, и ограничениях stdlib, используя техники, такие как предварительное выделение строк и минимизация динамического роста массивов","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تطوير تطبيقات PicoRuby فعالة على أجهزة متحكم دقيقة ESP32 عن طريق التنقل عبر قيود ذاكرة صارمة، مثل 520KB من كومة إجمالية، وقيود stdlib، باستخدام تقنيات مثل تخصيص السلاسل مسبقًا وتقليل نمو المصفوفات الديناميكية"},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing PicoRuby code for ESP32 devices with limited memory","Debugging memory-related issues in PicoRuby applications","Developing iterative solutions to avoid deep recursion in PicoRuby"],"zh":["针对ESP32设备的有限内存优化PicoRuby代码","调试PicoRuby应用程序中的内存相关问题","开发迭代解决方案以避免PicoRuby中的深递归"],"ja":["メモリが限られているESP32デバイス向けのPicoRubyコードを最適化する","PicoRubyアプリケーションのメモリ関連の問題をデバッグする","PicoRubyでの深い再帰を避けるための反復解決策を開発する"],"ko":["ESP32 장치의 제한된 메모리를 위한 PicoRuby 코드 최적화","PicoRuby 애플리케이션의 메모리 관련 문제 디버깅","PicoRuby의 깊은 재귀를 피하는 반복적 해결책 개발"],"es":["Optimizing PicoRuby code for ESP32 devices with limited memory","Debugging memory-related issues in PicoRuby applications","Developing iterative solutions to avoid deep recursion in PicoRuby"],"fr":["Optimizing PicoRuby code for ESP32 devices with limited memory","Debugging memory-related issues in PicoRuby applications","Developing iterative solutions to avoid deep recursion in PicoRuby"],"de":["Optimizing PicoRuby code for ESP32 devices with limited memory","Debugging memory-related issues in PicoRuby applications","Developing iterative solutions to avoid deep recursion in PicoRuby"],"pt":["Otimizar o código PicoRuby para dispositivos ESP32 com memória limitada","Depurar problemas relacionados à memória em aplicações PicoRuby","Desenvolver soluções iterativas para evitar recursividade profunda em PicoRuby"],"ru":["Оптимизировать код PicoRuby для устройств ESP32 с ограниченной памятью","Отлаживать проблемы, связанные с памятью, в приложениях PicoRuby","Разрабатывать итеративные решения, чтобы избежать глубокой рекурсии в PicoRuby"],"ar":["تحسين код PicoRuby لتطبيقات أجهزة ESP32 ذات الذاكرة المحدودة","تصحيح أخطاء متعلقة بالذاكرة في تطبيقات PicoRuby","تطوير حلول تكرارية لتجنب التكرار العميق في PicoRuby"]},"limitations":{"en":["Total heap limited to 520KB","Avoids deep recursion due to nesting depth constraints","Requires careful string handling and array management"],"zh":["总堆大小限制为520KB","避免深递归由于嵌套深度约束","需要仔细的字符串处理和数组管理"],"ja":["総ヒープサイズが520KBに制限される","深い再帰を避けるためにネストの深さに制約がある","文字列と配列の管理が慎重に必要"],"ko":["총 힙 크기가 520KB로 제한됨","깊은 재귀를 피하기 위해 중첩 깊이 제약이 있음","문자열 및 배열 관리에 주의가 필요함"],"es":["Total heap limited to 520KB","Avoids deep recursion due to nesting depth constraints","Requires careful string handling and array management"],"fr":["Total heap limited to 520KB","Avoids deep recursion due to nesting depth constraints","Requires careful string handling and array management"],"de":["Total heap limited to 520KB","Avoids deep recursion due to nesting depth constraints","Requires careful string handling and array management"],"pt":["Heap total limitado a 520KB","Evita recursividade profunda devido a restrições de profundidade de aninhamento","Exige manipulação cuidadosa de strings e gerenciamento de arrays"],"ru":["Общий размер кучи ограничен 520КБ","Избегает глубокой рекурсии из-за ограничений глубины вложения","Требует осторожного обращения со строками и управления массивами"],"ar":["الكومة الإجمالية مقيدة بـ 520KB","يتجنب التكرار العميق بسبب قيود عمق التضمين","يتطلب التعامل الدقيق مع السلاسل وإدارة المصفوفات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
