enting test automation, performing manual testing, or analyzing test coverage.","bodyPreview":"# Senior Qa\r\n\r\nComplete toolkit for senior qa with modern tools and best practices.\r\n\r\n## Quick Start\r\n\r\n### Main Capabilities\r\n\r\nThis skill provides three core capabilities through automated scripts:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Script 1: Test Suite Generator\r\npython scripts/test_suite_generator.py [options]\r\n\r\n# Script 2: Coverage Analyzer\r\npython scripts/coverage_analyzer.py [options]\r\n\r\n# Script 3: E2E Test Scaffolder\r\npython scripts/e2e_test_scaffolder.py [options]\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Core Capabilities\r\n\r\n### 1. T","body":"# Senior Qa\r\n\r\nComplete toolkit for senior qa with modern tools and best practices.\r\n\r\n## Quick Start\r\n\r\n### Main Capabilities\r\n\r\nThis skill provides three core capabilities through automated scripts:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Script 1: Test Suite Generator\r\npython scripts/test_suite_generator.py [options]\r\n\r\n# Script 2: Coverage Analyzer\r\npython scripts/coverage_analyzer.py [options]\r\n\r\n# Script 3: E2E Test Scaffolder\r\npython scripts/e2e_test_scaffolder.py [options]\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Core Capabilities\r\n\r\n### 1. Test Suite Generator\r\n\r\nAutomated tool for test suite generator tasks.\r\n\r\n**Features:**\r\n- Automated scaffolding\r\n- Best practices built-in\r\n- Configurable templates\r\n- Quality checks\r\n\r\n**Usage:**\r\n```bash\r\npython scripts/test_suite_generator.py <project-path> [options]\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 2. Coverage Analyzer\r\n\r\nComprehensive analysis and optimization tool.\r\n\r\n**Features:**\r\n- Deep analysis\r\n- Performance metrics\r\n- Recommendations\r\n- Automated fixes\r\n\r\n**Usage:**\r\n```bash\r\npython scripts/coverage_analyzer.py <target-path> [--verbose]\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 3. E2E Test Scaffolder\r\n\r\nAdvanced tooling for specialized tasks.\r\n\r\n**Features:**\r\n- Expert-level automation\r\n- Custom configurations\r\n- Integration ready\r\n- Production-grade output\r\n\r\n**Usage:**\r\n```bash\r\npython scripts/e2e_test_scaffolder.py [arguments] [options]\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Reference Documentation\r\n\r\n### Testing Strategies\r\n\r\nComprehensive guide available in `references/testing_strategies.md`:\r\n\r\n- Detailed patterns and practices\r\n- Code examples\r\n- Best practices\r\n- Anti-patterns to avoid\r\n- Real-world scenarios\r\n\r\n### Test Automation Patterns\r\n\r\nComplete workflow documentation in `references/test_automation_patterns.md`:\r\n\r\n- Step-by-step processes\r\n- Optimization strategies\r\n- Tool integrations\r\n- Performance tuning\r\n- Troubleshooting guide\r\n\r\n### Qa Best Practices\r\n\r\nTechnical reference guide in `references/qa_best_practices.md`:\r\n\r\n- Technology stack details\r\n- Configuration examples\r\n- Integration patterns\r\n- Security considerations\r\n- Scalability guidelines\r\n\r\n## Tech Stack\r\n\r\n**Languages:** TypeScript, JavaScript, Python, Go, Swift, Kotlin\r\n**Frontend:** React, Next.js, React Native, Flutter\r\n**Backend:** Node.js, Express, GraphQL, REST APIs\r\n**Database:** PostgreSQL, Prisma, NeonDB, Supabase\r\n**DevOps:** Docker, Kubernetes, Terraform, GitHub Actions, CircleCI\r\n**Cloud:** AWS, GCP, Azure\r\n\r\n## Development Workflow\r\n\r\n### 1. Setup and Configuration\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Install dependencies\r\nnpm install\r\n# or\r\npip install -r requirements.txt\r\n\r\n# Configure environment\r\ncp .env.example .env\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 2. Run Quality Checks\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Use the analyzer script\r\npython scripts/coverage_analyzer.py .\r\n\r\n# Review recommendations\r\n# Apply fixes\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 3. Implement Best Practices\r\n\r\nFollow the patterns and practices documented in:\r\n- `references/testing_strategies.md`\r\n- `references/test_automation_patterns.md`\r\n- `references/qa_best_practices.md`\r\n\r\n## Best Practices Summary\r\n\r\n### Code Quality\r\n- Follow established patterns\r\n- Write comprehensive tests\r\n- Document decisions\r\n- Review regularly\r\n\r\n### Performance\r\n- Measure before optimizing\r\n- Use appropriate caching\r\n- Optimize critical paths\r\n- Monitor in production\r\n\r\n### Security\r\n- Validate all inputs\r\n- Use parameterized queries\r\n- Implement proper authentication\r\n- Keep dependencies updated\r\n\r\n### Maintainability\r\n- Write clear code\r\n- Use consistent naming\r\n- Add helpful comments\r\n- Keep it simple\r\n\r\n## Common Commands\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n# Development\r\nnpm run dev\r\nnpm run build\r\nnpm run test\r\nnpm run lint\r\n\r\n# Analysis\r\npython scripts/coverage_analyzer.py .\r\npython scripts/e2e_test_scaffolder.py --analyze\r\n\r\n# Deployment\r\ndocker build -t app:latest .\r\ndocker-compose up -d\r\nkubectl apply -f k8s/\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Troubleshooting\r\n\r\n### Common Issues\r\n\r\nCheck the comprehensive troubleshooting section in `references/qa_best_practices.md`.\r\n\r\n### Getting Help\r\n\r\n- Review reference documentation\r\n- Check script output messages\r\n- Consult tech stack documentation\r\n- Review error logs\r\n\r\n## Resources\r\n\r\n- Pattern Reference: `references/testing_strategies.md`\r\n- Workflow Guide: `references/test_automation_patterns.md`\r\n- Technical Guide: `references/qa_best_practices.md`\r\n- Tool Scripts: `scripts/` directory\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:50:21.599Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Quality Assurance Agents needing automated testing and coverage analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化测试和代码覆盖分析能力的质量保证代理。","ja":"自動テストおよびコードカバレッジ分析機能を必要とする品質保証エージェントに最適です。","ko":"자동화 된 테스트 및 코드 커버리지 분석 기능이 필요한 품질 보증 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Aseguramiento de la Calidad que necesitan capacidades de pruebas automatizadas y análisis de cobertura.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''assurance qualité ayant besoin de tests automatisés et d''analyse de couverture.","de":"Perfekt für Qualitäts-Sicherungsagenten, die automatisierte Test- und Abdeckungsanalysefunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Garantia de Qualidade que precisam de capacidades de teste automatizado e análise de cobertura.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по обеспечению качества, которым необходимы автоматизированное тестирование и анализ покрытия.","ar":"مثالي ل وكلاء ضمان الجودة الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات الاختبار الآلي وتحليل الغطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive test suites, analyze code coverage, and scaffold end-to-end tests using Python scripts, providing a robust toolkit for senior QA tasks with modern tools and best practices.","zh":"赋予代理生成全面的测试套件、分析代码覆盖率，并使用Python脚本搭建端到端测试，提供强大的工具包用于高级QA任务和现代工具及最佳实践。","ja":"エージェントが包括的なテストスイートを生成し、コードカバレッジを分析し、Pythonスクリプトを使用して端末間テストを構築することを可能にし、シニアQAタスクのための堅牢なツールキットと最新のツールおよびベストプラクティスを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 테스트套件을 생성하고 코드 커버리지 분석을 수행하며 Python 스크립트를 사용하여 종단 간 테스트를 구성 할 수 있도록하여, 고급 QA 작업 및 최신 도구 및 모범 사례를위한 강력한 툴킷을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar suites de pruebas completas, analizar la cobertura del código y crear estructuras para pruebas de extremo a extremo mediante scripts de Python, proporcionando una herramienta robusta para tareas de QA senior con herramientas y prácticas recomendadas modernas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des suites de tests complètes, d''analyser la couverture du code et de créer des structures pour les tests de bout en bout à l''aide de scripts Python, offrant un ensemble d''outils robuste pour les tâches de QA senior avec des outils et des pratiques modernes.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, umfassende Test-Suiten zu generieren, den Codeabdeckung zu analysieren und Gerüste für End-to-End-Tests mithilfe von Python-Skripten zu erstellen, wodurch eine robusteToolkit für Senior-QA-Aufgaben mit modernen Tools und Best Practices bereitgestellt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar conjuntos de testes abrangentes, analisar a cobertura de código e criar estruturas para testes de ponta a ponta usando scripts Python, fornecendo uma ferramenta robusta para tarefas de QA seniores com ferramentas modernas e melhores práticas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать комплексные наборы тестов, анализировать покрытие кода и создавать скелетные тесты от начала до конца с помощью скриптов Python, предоставляя прочный инструментарий для старших задач QA с современными инструментами и лучшими практиками.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء مجموعات اختبار شاملة وتحليل تغطية الكود وإنشاء إطار عمل للاختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية باستخدام سكريبتات بايثون، مما يوفر أداة قوية لمهام QA المتقدمة مع أدوات حديثة وأفضل الممارسات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating test suite generation","Analyzing code coverage with Python scripts","Scaffolding end-to-end tests for complex applications"],"zh":["自动化测试套件生成","使用Python脚本分析代码覆盖率","为复杂应用程序搭建端到端测试"],"ja":["テストスイートの自動生成","Pythonスクリプトを使用したコードカバレッジ分析","複雑なアプリケーションのための端末間テストの構築"],"ko":["테스트套件 자동 생성","Python 스크립트를 사용한 코드 커버리지 분석","복잡한 애플리케이션을 위한 종단 간 테스트 구성"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de suites de pruebas","Análisis de la cobertura del código con scripts de Python","Creación de estructuras para pruebas de extremo a extremo en aplicaciones complejas"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de suites de tests","Analyse de la couverture du code avec des scripts Python","Création de structures pour les tests de bout en bout pour des applications complexes"],"de":["Automatisierung der Test-Suite-Generierung","Analyse der Codeabdeckung mit Python-Skripten","Erstellung von Gerüsten für End-to-End-Tests in komplexen Anwendungen"],"pt":["Automação da geração de conjuntos de testes","Análise da cobertura de código com scripts Python","Criação de estruturas para testes de ponta a ponta para aplicações complexas"],"ru":["Автоматизация генерации наборов тестов","Анализ покрытия кода с помощью скриптов Python","Создание скелетных тестов от начала до конца для сложных приложений"],"ar":["تأتمة إنشاء مجموعات الاختبار","تحليل تغطية الكود باستخدام سكريبتات بايثون","إنشاء إطار عمل للاختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية للمتطلبات المعقدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Limited to Python-based testing frameworks"],"zh":["需要Python环境","仅限于基于Python的测试框架"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","Pythonベースのテストフレームワークのみに限定"],"ko":["Python 환경 필요","Python 기반 테스트 프레임워크에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Limitado a frameworks de pruebas basados en Python"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Limité aux frameworks de tests basés sur Python"],"de":["Benötigt eine Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Python-basierte Testframeworks"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Python","Limitado a estruturas de teste baseadas em Python"],"ru":["Требует среды Python","Ограничен только фреймворками тестирования на основе Python"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون","محدود بالإطارات الاختبارية القائمة على بايثون"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
