，帮助开发者分析捕获的数据包","ja":"create-analyzerスキルはMinecraft Bedrockパケットアナライザーを生成し、開発者が捕獲されたパケットを分析するのを支援","ko":"create-analyzer 스킬은 마인크래프트 베드락 패킷 분석기를 생성하여 개발자가 捕获한 패킷을 분석하는 것을 지원","es":"El analizador de paquetes de Minecraft Bedrock es una herramienta que permite analizar paquetes capturados y mejorar la experiencia de juego","fr":"L''analyseur de paquets Minecraft Bedrock est un outil qui permet d''analyser les paquets capturés et d''améliorer l''expérience de jeu","de":"Der Minecraft Bedrock Packet Analyzer ist ein Tool, das die Analyse von erfassten Paketen ermöglicht und die Spiel-Erfahrung verbessert","pt":"Este guia mostra como criar um analisador de pacotes Minecraft Bedrock personalizado para capturar e analisar pacotes","ru":"Это руководство показывает, как создать индивидуальный анализатор пакетов Minecraft Bedrock для захвата и анализа пакетов","ar":"يعرض هذا الدليل كيفية إنشاء محلل حزم ماين كرافت بيدروك مخصص لالتقاط وتحليل الحزم","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["生成域特定数据包分析器","支持捕获的Bedrock数据包分析","提供数据包分析模板","简化数据包分析流程","支持多种域分析","提高开发效率"],"ja":["ドメイン固有のパケットアナライザーを生成","捕獲されたBedrockパケットの分析をサポート","パケット分析テンプレートを提供","パケット分析プロセスを簡素化","複数のドメイン分析をサポート","開発効率を向上"],"ko":["도메인 특정 패킷 분석기를 생성"," 捕获한 베드락 패킷 분석을 지원","패킷 분석 템플릿을 제공","패킷 분석 프로세스를 간소화","複数의 도메인 분석을 지원","개발 효율을 향상"],"es":["Identificar dominios de paquetes","Buscar tipos de paquetes relevantes","Generar archivos de analizador","Exportar desde index.ts","Probar con registros capturados"],"fr":["Identifier les domaines de paquets","Rechercher les types de paquets pertinents","Générer des fichiers d''analyseur","Exporter à partir de index.ts","Tester avec des journaux capturés"],"de":["Paket-Domains identifizieren","Relevante Paket-Typen suchen","Analyzer-Dateien generieren","Aus index.ts exportieren","Mit erfassten Protokollen testen"],"pt":["Crie um analisador de pacotes personalizado","Capture e analise pacotes de rede","Entenda melhor o protocolo de rede do jogo","Melhore suas habilidades de desenvolvedor","Aprenda a trabalhar com pacotes de rede"],"ru":["Создайте индивидуальный анализатор пакетов","Захватите и проанализируйте сетевые пакеты","Лучше поймите сетевой протокол игры","Улучшите свои навыки разработчика","Научитесь работать с сетевыми пакетами"],"ar":["أنشئ محلل حزم مخصص","التقاط وتحليل حزم الشبكة","افهم بेहतर بروتوكول الشبكة الخاص باللعبة","تحسين مهاراتك كمتطوير","تعلم العمل مع حزم الشبكة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Minecraft Bedrock","数据包分析器","create-analyzer","捕获数据包","域特定分析","开发工具","游戏开发","网络协议"],"ja":["Minecraft Bedrock","パケットアナライザー","create-analyzer","捕獲パケット","ドメイン固有分析","開発ツール","ゲーム開発","ネットワークプロトコル"],"ko":["마인크래프트 베드락","패킷 분석기","create-analyzer"," 捕获 패킷","도메인 특정 분석","개발 도구","게임 개발","네트워크 프로토콜"],"es":["Minecraft Bedrock","analizador de paquetes","paquetes de datos","desarrollo de juegos","herramientas de desarrollo","programación de juegos"],"fr":["Minecraft Bedrock","analyseur de paquets","paquets de données","développement de jeux","outils de développement","programmation de jeux"],"de":["Minecraft Bedrock","Packet-Analyzer","Daten-Pakete","Spiel-Entwicklung","Entwicklungs-Tools","Spiel-Programmierung"],"pt":["analisador de pacotes","Minecraft Bedrock","desenvolvedor","pacotes de rede","protocolo de rede","jogo","ferramenta","capturar pacotes"],"ru":["анализатор пакетов","Minecraft Bedrock","разработчик","сетевые пакеты","сетевой протокол","игра","инструмент","захватить пакеты"],"ar":["محلل حزم","ماين كرافت بيدروك","متطوير","حزم الشبكة","بروتوكول الشبكة","اللعبة","أداة","التقاط حزم"]}},"owner":"mc-zuri","repo":"mineflayer-bedrock","repoPath":"mc-zuri/mineflayer-bedrock","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-analyzer","description":"Create a new packet analyzer for Minecraft Bedrock logs. Generates template code, provides documentation links, and guides testing workflow.","bodyPreview":"# Create Minecraft Bedrock Packet Analyzer\n\nGenerate a new domain-specific packet analyzer for analyzing captured Bedrock packets.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Identify the domain**: inventory, movement, entities, chat, blocks, etc.\n2. **Find relevant packets**: Search `protocol.d.ts` for packet types\n3. **Generate analyzer file** using template below\n4. **Export from index.ts**\n5. **Test with captured logs**\n\n## Analyzer Template\n\nCreate file at: `packages/minecraft-logs-analyzers/src/analyzers/{domai","body":"# Create Minecraft Bedrock Packet Analyzer\n\nGenerate a new domain-specific packet analyzer for analyzing captured Bedrock packets.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Identify the domain**: inventory, movement, entities, chat, blocks, etc.\n2. **Find relevant packets**: Search `protocol.d.ts` for packet types\n3. **Generate analyzer file** using template below\n4. **Export from index.ts**\n5. **Test with captured logs**\n\n## Analyzer Template\n\nCreate file at: `packages/minecraft-logs-analyzers/src/analyzers/{domain}.ts`\n\n```typescript\nimport { BaseAnalyzer } from \"../base-analyzer.ts\";\nimport type { Direction, LogEntry, AnalyzerConfig } from \"../types.ts\";\n\nconst PACKETS_TO_LOG = [\n  // Add packet names from protocol.d.ts\n];\n\n/**\n * Analyzer for {domain}-related packets.\n */\nexport class {Domain}Analyzer extends BaseAnalyzer {\n  readonly config: AnalyzerConfig = {\n    name: \"{domain}\",\n    packets: PACKETS_TO_LOG,\n  };\n\n  constructor(basePath: string, registry?: any) {\n    super(basePath);\n    if (registry) this.registry = registry;\n    this.init();\n  }\n\n  protected extractFields(\n    direction: Direction,\n    name: string,\n    packet: any\n  ): LogEntry | null {\n    const base = this.createBaseEntry(direction, name);\n\n    switch (name) {\n      // Add case for each packet type\n      // case \"packet_name\":\n      //   return { ...base, field: packet.field };\n\n      default:\n        return null;\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Registration\n\nAdd export to `packages/minecraft-logs-analyzers/src/index.ts`:\n\n```typescript\nexport { {Domain}Analyzer } from \"./analyzers/{domain}.ts\";\n```\n\n## Documentation Locations\n\n| Resource | Location |\n|----------|----------|\n| Protocol types | `packages/mineflayer-bedrock/src/protocol.d.ts` |\n| Existing analyzers | `packages/minecraft-logs-analyzers/src/analyzers/` |\n| Base class | `packages/minecraft-logs-analyzers/src/base-analyzer.ts` |\n| Types | `packages/minecraft-logs-analyzers/src/types.ts` |\n| Bedrock plugins | `packages/mineflayer/lib/bedrockPlugins/` |\n\n## Finding Relevant Packets\n\n```bash\n# Search protocol.d.ts for packet types\ngrep -n \"packet_\" packages/mineflayer-bedrock/src/protocol.d.ts | head -50\n\n# Find packets used by a specific plugin\ngrep -n \"client.on\" packages/mineflayer/lib/bedrockPlugins/*.mts\n\n# Search for specific packet handling\ngrep -rn \"move_player\" packages/mineflayer/lib/bedrockPlugins/\n```\n\n## Common Packet Domains\n\n| Domain | Key Packets |\n|--------|-------------|\n| Inventory | `inventory_slot`, `inventory_content`, `inventory_transaction`, `item_stack_request`, `item_stack_response`, `mob_equipment` |\n| Movement | `player_auth_input`, `move_player`, `set_actor_motion`, `move_actor_absolute`, `move_actor_delta` |\n| Entities | `add_entity`, `remove_entity`, `set_entity_data`, `set_entity_motion`, `add_player` |\n| Chat | `text`, `command_request`, `command_output` |\n| Blocks | `update_block`, `block_event`, `level_event`, `update_sub_chunk_blocks` |\n| Combat | `actor_event`, `hurt_armor`, `entity_fall`, `animate` |\n| World | `level_chunk`, `sub_chunk`, `network_chunk_publisher_update` |\n\n## Testing Workflow\n\n### 1. Capture Packets from Real Client\n\n**Critical**: Always capture from the real Minecraft client first to understand the exact packet format.\n\n```bash\n# Start capture proxy\nnpm run start --workspace=minecraft-logs-recorder -- -o ./test-logs\n\n# Connect Minecraft Bedrock to localhost:19150\n# Perform the exact action you want to implement (crafting, chest interaction, etc.)\n# Disconnect to save logs\n```\n\nThe `.jsonl` file contains processed packets, `.bin` contains raw data for replay.\n\n### 2. Analyze Captured Logs\n\n```bash\n# View first 20 packets\nhead -20 test-logs/*.jsonl\n\n# Count packets by type\ngrep -o ''\"p\":\"[^\"]*\"'' test-logs/*.jsonl | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn\n\n# Find specific packets\ngrep ''\"p\":\"move_player\"'' test-logs/*.jsonl | head -5\n```\n\n### 3. Test Your Analyzer\n\n```typescript\nimport { {Domain}Analyzer } from ''minecraft-logs-analyzers'';\nimport { createReplayClient } from ''minecraft-logs-recorder/replay'';\n\n// Attach analyzer to replay client\nconst analyzer = new {Domain}Analyzer(''test-output/replay'');\nconst client = createReplayClient(''test-logs/1.21.130-*.bin'');\n\n// Analyzer will log packets to test-output/replay-{domain}.jsonl\nanalyzer.attachToBot(client);\n\n// Check output\n// cat test-output/replay-{domain}.jsonl\n```\n\n### 4. Verify Output Format\n\n```bash\n# View analyzer output\ncat test-output/replay-{domain}.jsonl | head -10\n\n# Validate JSON\ncat test-output/replay-{domain}.jsonl | jq -c ''.'' | head -10\n```\n\n## BaseAnalyzer Methods\n\n| Method | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `createBaseEntry(direction, name)` | Create log entry with t, tick, d, p fields |\n| `updateTick(packet)` | Extract tick from packet.tick |\n| `itemName(item)` | Resolve item name from network_id |\n| `writeEntry(entry)` | Write entry to JSONL file |\n| `message(msg, data?)` | Log custom debug message |\n\n## Override Points\n\n| Method | When to Override |\n|--------|------------------|\n| `shouldLog(name, packet)` | Custom filtering (e.g., only log non-empty actions) |\n| `extractFields(direction, name, packet)` | Required - extract relevant fields |\n\n## IMPORTANT: Start with Full Packets\n\n**Always log full packet data initially**, not filtered/summarized data. This was critical for solving crafting implementation:\n\n```typescript\n// BAD: Filtering too early loses critical details\nprotected shouldLog(name: string, packet: unknown): boolean {\n  // Only log if it has crafting containers...  ❌\n  return hasCraftingContainer;\n}\n\n// GOOD: Log everything first, filter later\nprotected shouldLog(name: string, packet: unknown): boolean {\n  return true;  // ✅ See all packets first\n}\n\n// GOOD: Return full packet data in extractFields\nreturn {\n  ...base,\n  responses: p.responses,  // ✅ Full data, not summarized\n};\n```\n\nReal client packet captures revealed crucial details that were being filtered out:\n- `craft_recipe_auto` uses `hotbar_and_inventory` container, not `crafting_input`\n- `results_deprecated` action requires `result_items` array with full item data\n- Stack IDs use negative request_id for chained actions\n- `place` goes directly to inventory, not through cursor\n\n**Only add filtering after you fully understand the protocol.**\n\n## Example: Movement Analyzer\n\n```typescript\nimport { BaseAnalyzer } from \"../base-analyzer.ts\";\nimport type { Direction, LogEntry, AnalyzerConfig } from \"../types.ts\";\n\nconst PACKETS_TO_LOG = [\n  \"player_auth_input\",\n  \"move_player\",\n  \"set_actor_motion\",\n];\n\nexport class MovementAnalyzer extends BaseAnalyzer {\n  readonly config: AnalyzerConfig = {\n    name: \"movement\",\n    packets: PACKETS_TO_LOG,\n  };\n\n  constructor(basePath: string) {\n    super(basePath);\n    this.init();\n  }\n\n  protected extractFields(\n    direction: Direction,\n    name: string,\n    packet: any\n  ): LogEntry | null {\n    const base = this.createBaseEntry(direction, name);\n\n    switch (name) {\n      case \"player_auth_input\":\n        this.updateTick(packet);\n        return {\n          ...base,\n          tick: packet.tick,\n          pos: [packet.position?.x, packet.position?.y, packet.position?.z],\n          yaw: packet.yaw,\n          pitch: packet.pitch,\n        };\n\n      case \"move_player\":\n        return {\n          ...base,\n          pos: [packet.position?.x, packet.position?.y, packet.position?.z],\n          mode: packet.mode,\n          onGround: packet.on_ground,\n        };\n\n      case \"set_actor_motion\":\n        return {\n          ...base,\n          entityId: packet.runtime_entity_id,\n          velocity: [packet.velocity?.x, packet.velocity?.y, packet.velocity?.z],\n        };\n\n      default:\n        return null;\n    }\n  }\n}\n```"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:50:57.508Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Minecraft Analysis Agents needing advanced packet inspection and analysis capabilities for Bedrock protocol packets.","zh":"非常适合需要对基岩版协议数据包进行高级数据包检查和分析的Minecraft分析代理。","ja":"Minecraftの分析エージェントがベッドロックプロトコルパケットの高度なパケット検査および分析機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"베드락 프로토콜 패킷에 대한 고급 패킷 검사 및 분석 기능이 필요한 Minecraft 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de Minecraft que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de inspección y análisis de paquetes para paquetes del protocolo Bedrock.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse Minecraft nécessitant des capacités avancées d''inspection et d''analyse de paquets pour les paquets du protocole Bedrock.","de":"Perfekt für Minecraft-Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Paket-Inspektion- und Analysefunktionen für Bedrock-Protokollpakete benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise do Minecraft que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de inspeção e análise de pacotes para pacotes do protocolo Bedrock.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа Minecraft, которым требуются расширенные возможности инспекции и анализа пакетов для пакетов протокола Bedrock.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل ماين كرافت التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتفحص وتحليل حزم بروتوكول البيد روك."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate domain-specific packet analyzers for Minecraft Bedrock packets, utilizing protocol.d.ts for packet type discovery and creating custom analyzer files for in-depth log analysis.","zh":"赋予代理生成特定于领域的数据包分析器的能力，用于Minecraft基岩版数据包，利用protocol.d.ts进行数据包类型发现，并为深入日志分析创建自定义分析器文件。","ja":"エージェントがMinecraftのベッドロックパケット用にドメイン固有のパケットアナライザーを生成できるようにし、protocol.d.tsを使用してパケットの種類を発見し、詳細なログ分析のためのカスタムアナライザーファイルを作成します。","ko":"에이전트가 Minecraft 베드락 패킷을 위한 도메인 특정 패킷 분석기를 생성할 수 있도록 해주어, protocol.d.ts를 사용하여 패킷 유형을 발견하고, 자세한 로그 분석을 위한 사용자 정의 분석기 파일을 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar analizadores de paquetes específicos del dominio para paquetes de Minecraft Bedrock, utilizando protocol.d.ts para el descubrimiento de tipos de paquetes y creando archivos de analizador personalizados para un análisis de registros en profundidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des analyseurs de paquets spécifiques au domaine pour les paquets Minecraft Bedrock, en utilisant protocol.d.ts pour la découverte de types de paquets et en créant des fichiers d''analyseurs personnalisés pour une analyse de journaux en profondeur.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, domänenspezifische Paketanalysatoren für Minecraft-Bedrock-Pakete zu generieren, indem sie protocol.d.ts für die Pakettypenerkennung verwenden und benutzerdefinierte Analyzer-Dateien für eine tiefere Log-Analyse erstellen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem analisadores de pacotes específicos do domínio para pacotes do Minecraft Bedrock, utilizando protocol.d.ts para descoberta de tipos de pacotes e criando arquivos de analisador personalizados para análise de logs em profundidade.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать анализаторы пакетов, специфичные для области применения, для пакетов Minecraft Bedrock, используя protocol.d.ts для обнаружения типов пакетов и создания пользовательских файлов анализатора для детального анализа журналов.","ar":"تمكن العوامل من توليد محليلات حزمة محددة للنطاق لمجموعة بروتوكول ماين كرافت البيد روك، باستخدام بروتوكول.د.تس لاكتشاف نوع الحزمة وإنشاء ملفات محليلة مخصصة لتحليل سجلات متعمق."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Bedrock packet analysis for inventory and movement tracking","Generating custom analyzers for entity and chat packet inspection","Debugging issues with block placement and game state using captured logs"],"zh":["自动化基岩版数据包分析以跟踪库存和移动","生成自定义分析器以检查实体和聊天数据包","使用捕获的日志调试方块放置和游戏状态问题"],"ja":["ベッドロックパケットの分析を自動化してインベントリと移動を追跡する","エンティティとチャットパケットの検査用にカスタムアナライザーを生成する","キャプチャしたログを使用してブロックの配置とゲーム状態の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["베드락 패킷 분석 자동화하여 인벤토리 및 이동 추적","엔티티 및 채팅 패킷 검사用으로 사용자 정의 분석기 생성","캡처된 로그를 사용하여 블록 배치 및 게임 상태 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar el análisis de paquetes Bedrock para el seguimiento de inventario y movimiento","Generar analizadores personalizados para la inspección de paquetes de entidad y chat","Depurar problemas con la colocación de bloques y el estado del juego utilizando registros capturados"],"fr":["Automatiser l''analyse de paquets Bedrock pour le suivi de l''inventaire et du mouvement","Générer des analyseurs personnalisés pour l''inspection de paquets d''entité et de chat","Déboguer les problèmes de placement de blocs et d''état de jeu à l''aide de journaux capturés"],"de":["Automatisieren der Analyse von Bedrock-Paketen für die Nachverfolgung von Inventar und Bewegung","Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Analyse-Tools für die Inspektion von Entitäts- und Chat-Paketen","Beheben von Problemen mit der Blockplatzierung und dem Spielzustand mithilfe von aufgezeichneten Protokollen"],"pt":["Automatizar a análise de pacotes Bedrock para rastreamento de inventário e movimento","Gerar analisadores personalizados para inspeção de pacotes de entidade e bate-papo","Depurar problemas com colocação de blocos e estado do jogo usando logs capturados"],"ru":["Автоматизировать анализ пакетов Bedrock для отслеживания инвентаря и перемещения","Генерировать пользовательские анализаторы для инспекции пакетов сущностей и чата","Отладить проблемы с размещением блоков и состоянием игры с помощью захваченных журналов"],"ar":["تحسين تحليل حزم البيد روك لتتبع المخزون والحركة","توليد محليلات مخصصة لتفحص حزم الكائنات والدردشة","تصحيح أخطاء وضع الكتل وحالة اللعبة باستخدام سجلات المحتوى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to protocol.d.ts for packet type information","Limited to Minecraft Bedrock protocol packets","Needs captured logs for testing and analysis"],"zh":["需要访问protocol.d.ts以获取数据包类型信息","仅限于Minecraft基岩版协议数据包","需要捕获的日志用于测试和分析"],"ja":["パケットの種類情報を取得するためにprotocol.d.tsへのアクセスが必要","Minecraftのベッドロックプロトコルパケットのみに限定","テストおよび分析のためにキャプチャしたログが必要"],"ko":["패킷 유형 정보를 얻기 위해 protocol.d.ts에 대한 액세스가 필요","Minecraft 베드락 프로토콜 패킷에만 제한","테스트 및 분석을 위해 캡처된 로그가 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a protocol.d.ts para obtener información sobre los tipos de paquetes","Limitado a paquetes del protocolo Minecraft Bedrock","Necesita registros capturados para pruebas y análisis"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à protocol.d.ts pour obtenir des informations sur les types de paquets","Limité aux paquets du protocole Minecraft Bedrock","Nécessite des journaux capturés pour les tests et l''analyse"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf protocol.d.ts für Pakettypinformationen","Begrenzt auf Minecraft-Bedrock-Protokollpakete","Benötigt aufgezeichnete Protokolle für Tests und Analyse"],"pt":["Requer acesso a protocol.d.ts para informações de tipo de pacote","Limitado a pacotes do protocolo Minecraft Bedrock","Necessita de logs capturados para testes e análise"],"ru":["Требует доступа к protocol.d.ts для информации о типах пакетов","Ограничен пакетами протокола Minecraft Bedrock","Требует захваченных журналов для тестирования и анализа"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بروتوكول.د.تس لمعلومات نوع الحزمة","محدود بحزم بروتوكول ماين كرافت البيد روك","يحتاج إلى سجلات محتوى للاختبارات والتحليل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
