 de video","narración de voz","direcciones visuales","WhatsApp","Claude Code CLI","inteligencia artificial","agentes autónomos"],"fr":["script de vidéo","scénario de vidéo","narration vocale","directions visuelles","WhatsApp","Claude Code CLI","intelligence artificielle","agents autonomes"],"de":["Videoskript","Drehbuch für Videos","Voiceover-Erzählung","visuelle Anweisungen","WhatsApp","Claude Code CLI","künstliche Intelligenz","autonome Agenten"],"pt":["roteiro de vídeo","criar roteiro de vídeo","estrutura de roteiro de vídeo","narração de voz","direções visuais","Claude","vídeo-roteiro","automação de tarefas"],"ru":["видео-сценарий","создание видео-сценария","структура видео-сценария","голосовое сопровождение","визуальные указания","Claude","видео-сценарий","автоматизация задач"],"ar":["نص فيديو","إنشاء نص فيديو","هيكل نص فيديو","صوت","إرشادات بصرية","Claude","نص فيديو","التأثير التلقائي"]}},"owner":"az9713","repo":"whatsapp-claude-old","repoPath":"az9713/whatsapp-claude-old","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"video-script","description":"Write compelling video scripts with voiceover and visual directions","bodyPreview":"# Video Script Skill\n\nWrite professional video scripts with voiceover narration and visual directions.\n\n## Script Structure\n\n### Standard Video Script Format\n\n```markdown\n# {Video Title}\n\n**Duration**: {estimated length}\n**Style**: {educational/news/tutorial/entertainment}\n**Target Audience**: {who is this for}\n\n---\n\n## INTRO (0:00 - 0:15)\n\n### VISUAL\n{Description of what appears on screen}\n\n### VOICEOVER\n\"{What the narrator says}\"\n\n### NOTES\n{Any production notes}\n\n---\n\n## SECTION 1: {Title} (0","body":"# Video Script Skill\n\nWrite professional video scripts with voiceover narration and visual directions.\n\n## Script Structure\n\n### Standard Video Script Format\n\n```markdown\n# {Video Title}\n\n**Duration**: {estimated length}\n**Style**: {educational/news/tutorial/entertainment}\n**Target Audience**: {who is this for}\n\n---\n\n## INTRO (0:00 - 0:15)\n\n### VISUAL\n{Description of what appears on screen}\n\n### VOICEOVER\n\"{What the narrator says}\"\n\n### NOTES\n{Any production notes}\n\n---\n\n## SECTION 1: {Title} (0:15 - 0:45)\n\n### VISUAL\n{Visual description}\n\n### VOICEOVER\n\"{Narration}\"\n\n---\n```\n\n## Script Types\n\n### 1. News/Explainer Video\n\n```markdown\n# {Topic} Explained\n\n**Duration**: 60-90 seconds\n**Style**: News/Educational\n\n---\n\n## HOOK (0:00 - 0:05)\n\n### VISUAL\nBold text on screen: \"{Attention-grabbing statement}\"\nQuick cuts of relevant footage\n\n### VOICEOVER\n\"{One-liner that creates curiosity or states the significance}\"\n\n---\n\n## CONTEXT (0:05 - 0:20)\n\n### VISUAL\nBackground footage, screenshots, or B-roll related to topic\n\n### VOICEOVER\n\"{Brief background - what viewers need to know to understand this story}\"\n\n---\n\n## MAIN STORY (0:20 - 0:50)\n\n### VISUAL\n- Demo footage or screenshots\n- Key data/stats on screen\n- Expert quote overlay\n\n### VOICEOVER\n\"{The meat of the story - what happened, why it matters, key details}\"\n\n---\n\n## IMPLICATIONS (0:50 - 1:10)\n\n### VISUAL\nConceptual visuals showing impact\n\n### VOICEOVER\n\"{What this means for the viewer/industry/world}\"\n\n---\n\n## OUTRO (1:10 - 1:20)\n\n### VISUAL\nChannel branding, subscribe button\n\n### VOICEOVER\n\"{Call to action - like, subscribe, comment with thoughts}\"\n\n---\n```\n\n## Writing Tips\n\n### Voiceover Best Practices\n\n1. **Write for the ear**: Use conversational language\n2. **Short sentences**: 15-20 words max per sentence\n3. **Active voice**: \"The company launched\" not \"was launched by\"\n4. **Present tense**: Creates immediacy\n5. **Read aloud**: Test if it sounds natural\n6. **Pause points**: Use \"...\" for natural breathing pauses\n\n### Hook Formulas\n\n| Type | Example |\n|------|---------|\n| Curiosity | \"What if I told you...\" |\n| Stakes | \"This could change everything about...\" |\n| Contrast | \"Everyone thought X, but actually...\" |\n| Question | \"Have you ever wondered why...\" |\n| Bold claim | \"This is the biggest {thing} since...\" |\n\n### Pacing Guidelines\n\n| Section | % of Video | Purpose |\n|---------|------------|---------|\n| Hook | 5-10% | Grab attention |\n| Context | 15-20% | Set up understanding |\n| Main content | 50-60% | Deliver value |\n| Implications | 10-15% | Make it relevant |\n| CTA | 5-10% | Drive action |\n\n## Word Count to Duration\n\n| Words | Approx. Duration |\n|-------|------------------|\n| 50 | 15 seconds |\n| 100 | 30 seconds |\n| 150 | 45 seconds |\n| 200 | 60 seconds |\n| 300 | 90 seconds |\n| 400 | 2 minutes |\n\nSpeaking pace: ~150 words per minute\n\n## Script Output File\n\nSave completed scripts to: `output/scripts/{topic}_script.md`\n\nInclude metadata at top:\n```markdown\n---\ntitle: \"{Title}\"\nduration: \"{Estimated duration}\"\ncreated: \"{Date}\"\nstatus: \"draft|review|approved\"\n---\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:51:19.454Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Creation Agents needing structured video script generation with Markdown formatting and voiceover narration capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化视频脚本生成、Markdown 格式化和语音叙述功能的内容创作代理。","ja":"構造化動画スクリプト生成、マークダウン形式の書式設定、ナレーション機能を必要とするコンテンツ作成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 비디오 스크립트 생성, Markdown 형식 및 음성 설명 기능이 필요한 콘텐츠 생성 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Creación de Contenido que necesitan generación de guiones de video estructurados con formato Markdown y capacidades de narración de voz en off.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Création de Contenu ayant besoin de génération de scripts de vidéo structurés avec mise en forme Markdown et capacités de narration vocale.","de":"Perfekt für Content-Erstellung-Agenten, die strukturierte Videodrehbuch-Generierung mit Markdown-Formatierung und Voiceover-Erzählungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Criação de Conteúdo que necessitam de geração de roteiros de vídeo estruturados com formatação Markdown e capacidades de narração de voz","ru":"Идеально для агентов по созданию контента, которым необходима структурированная генерация сценариев видео с форматированием Markdown и возможностями голосового сопровождения","ar":"مثالي ليعملات إنشاء المحتوى التي تحتاج إلى إنشاء نصوص مقاطع الفيديو المنظمة مع تنسيق Markdown وقدرات السرد الصوتي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate professional video scripts with standardized formats, including estimated durations, styles, and target audience specifications, utilizing Markdown for formatting and organization, and integrating with WhatsApp-Claude for autonomous AI tasks.","zh":"赋予代理生成专业视频脚本的能力，包括标准化格式、预估时长、样式和目标受众规格，利用Markdown进行格式化和组织，并与WhatsApp-Claude集成以执行自主AI任务。","ja":"エージェントに、標準化された形式、推定時間、スタイル、ターゲットオーディエンスの仕様を含むプロフェッショナルな動画スクリプトを生成する能力を与え、マークダウンを使用して書式設定と組織を行い、WhatsApp-Claudeと統合して自律的なAIタスクを実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 프로페셔널한 비디오 스크립트를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 이는 표준화된 형식, 추정 시간, 스타일 및 대상 오디언스 사양을 포함하며, Markdown를 사용하여 서식과 조직을 수행하며, WhatsApp-Claude와의 통합을 통해 자율적인 AI 작업을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar guiones de video profesionales con formatos estandarizados, incluyendo duraciones estimadas, estilos y especificaciones de audiencia objetivo, utilizando Markdown para la formatización y organización, e integrándose con WhatsApp-Claude para tareas de inteligencia artificial autónomas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des scripts de vidéo professionnels avec des formats standardisés, y compris des durées estimées, des styles et des spécifications d''audience cible, en utilisant Markdown pour la mise en forme et l''organisation, et en s''intégrant à WhatsApp-Claude pour des tâches d''IA autonomes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, professionelle Videodrehbücher mit standardisierten Formaten zu generieren, einschließlich geschätzter Dauern, Stile und Zielgruppenspezifikationen, unter Verwendung von Markdown für die Formatierung und Organisation, und integriert sich mit WhatsApp-Claude für autonome KI-Aufgaben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar roteiros de vídeo profissionais com formatos padronizados, incluindo durações estimadas, estilos e especificações de público-alvo, utilizando Markdown para formatação e organização, e integrando com WhatsApp-Claude para tarefas de IA autônomas","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать профессиональные сценарии видео со стандартизированными форматами, включая оценочные продолжительности, стили и спецификации целевой аудитории, используя Markdown для форматирования и организации, и интегрируя с WhatsApp-Claude для автономных задач ИИ","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء نصوص مقاطع الفيديو الاحترافية ذات التنسيقات الموحدة، بما في ذلك المدد المقدرة والأساليب ومواصفات الجمهور المستهدف، باستخدام تنسيق Markdown للتنسيق والتنظيم، ودمجها مع WhatsApp-Claude لأداء مهام الذكاء الاصطناعي المستقلة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating video script creation for educational content","Generating engaging intro sequences with visual directions and voiceover narration","Creating tutorial scripts with production notes and style guidelines"],"zh":["自动化教育内容的视频脚本创建","生成带有视觉方向和语音叙述的吸引人介绍序列","创建带有制作注意事项和样式指南的教程脚本"],"ja":["教育コンテンツの動画スクリプトの自動生成","視覚的な指示とナレーションを含む魅力的なイントロシーケンスの生成","制作に関する注意事項とスタイルガイドラインを含むチュートリアルスクリプトの作成"],"ko":["교육 콘텐츠의 비디오 스크립트 자동 생성","시각적 지시와 음성 설명을 포함한 매력적인 소개 시퀀스 생성","제작 관련注意 사항 및 스타일 가이드ライン을 포함한 튜토리얼 스크립트 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de guiones de video para contenido educativo","Generación de secuencias de introducción atractivas con direcciones visuales y narración de voz en off","Creación de guiones de tutoriales con notas de producción y directrices de estilo"],"fr":["Automation de la création de scripts de vidéo pour le contenu éducatif","Génération de séquences d''introduction engageantes avec des directions visuelles et une narration vocale","Création de scripts de tutoriels avec des notes de production et des lignes direc