供快速的网页交互和自动化测试能力","ja":"agent-browser はブラウザ自動化ツールで、迅速な Web ページの操作と自動テスト機能を提供します","ko":"agent-browser는 브라우저 자동화 도구로 빠른 웹 페이지 상호작용과 자동화 테스트 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Agent-browser es una herramienta para automatizar tareas en el navegador. Permite interactuar con elementos web de forma fácil y eficiente.","fr":"Agent-browser est un outil pour automatiser des tâches dans le navigateur. Il permet d''interagir avec des éléments web de manière facile et efficace.","de":"Agent-browser ist ein Tool zur Automatisierung von Aufgaben im Browser. Es ermöglicht eine einfache und effiziente Interaktion mit Web-Elementen.","pt":"O agent-browser é uma ferramenta de automação de navegador que permite navegar, capturar e interagir com elementos da web de forma fácil e eficiente.","ru":"Agent-browser — это инструмент для автоматизации браузера, который позволяет навигировать, захватывать и взаимодействовать с веб-элементами легко и эффективно.","ar":"agent-browser هو أداة أتمتة المتصفح التي تمكنك من التنقل والتقاط والتفاعل مع عناصر الويب بسهولة وكفاءة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["快速导航","交互元素捕获","元素点击","表单填充","浏览器关闭"],"ja":["迅速なナビゲーション","インタラクティブ要素のキャプチャ","要素のクリック","フォームの入力","ブラウザのクローズ"],"ko":["빠른 네비게이션","상호작용 요소 캡처","요소 클릭","폼填充","브라우저 종료"],"es":["Automatización de tareas en el navegador","Interacción con elementos web","Captura de elementos interactivos","Relleno de formularios","Cierre del navegador"],"fr":["Automation de tâches dans le navigateur","Interaction avec des éléments web","Capture d''éléments interactifs","Remplissage de formulaires","Fermeture du navigateur"],"de":["Automatisierung von Aufgaben im Browser","Interaktion mit Web-Elementen","Erfassung interaktiver Elemente","Ausfüllen von Formularen","Schließen des Browsers"],"pt":["Navegação automática para URLs específicas","Captura de elementos interativos com referências","Clique em elementos por referência","Preenchimento de inputs por referência","Fechamento do navegador"],"ru":["Автоматическая навигация по конкретным URL-адресам","Захват интерактивных элементов с ссылками","Клик по элементам по ссылке","Заполнение входных данных по ссылке","Закрытие браузера"],"ar":["التنقل التلقائي إلى عناوين URL محددة","التقاط العناصر التفاعلية بإشارات مرجعية","النقر على العناصر بإشارات مرجعية","ملء المدخلات بإشارات مرجعية","إغلاق المتصفح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["浏览器自动化","agent-browser","自动化测试","网页交互","命令行工具"],"ja":["ブラウザ自動化","agent-browser","自動テスト","Web ページ操作","コマンドラインツール"],"ko":["브라우저 자동화","agent-browser","自動テスト","웹 페이지 상호작용","명령줄 도구"],"es":["automatización de navegador","agent-browser","interacción con elementos web","automatización de tareas","herramientas de automatización","desarrollo web"],"fr":["automation de navigateur","agent-browser","interaction avec des éléments web","automation de tâches","outils d''automation","développement web"],"de":["Browser-Automatisierung","agent-browser","Interaktion mit Web-Elementen","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Automatisierungstools","Webentwicklung"],"pt":["automação de navegador","agent-browser","navegação automática","captura de elementos","interação com elementos da web","desenvolvimento web","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["автоматизация браузера","agent-browser","автоматическая навигация","захват элементов","взаимодействие с веб-элементами","веб-разработка","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["أتمتة المتصفح","agent-browser","التنقل التلقائي","التقاط العناصر","التفاعل مع عناصر الويب","تطوير الويب","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"Kjdragan","repo":"universal_agent","repoPath":"Kjdragan/universal_agent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"agent-browser","description":"Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with web pages, fill forms, take screenshots, test web applications, or extract information from web pages.","bodyPreview":"# Browser Automation with agent-browser\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open <url>        # Navigate to page\nagent-browser snapshot -i       # Get interactive elements with refs\nagent-browser click @e1         # Click element by ref\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"   # Fill input by ref\nagent-browser close             # Close browser\n```\n\n## Core workflow\n\n1. Navigate: `agent-browser open <url>`\n2. Snapshot: `agent-browser snapshot -i` (returns elements with refs like `@e1`, `@e2`)\n3. Intera","body":"# Browser Automation with agent-browser\n\n## Quick start\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open <url>        # Navigate to page\nagent-browser snapshot -i       # Get interactive elements with refs\nagent-browser click @e1         # Click element by ref\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"   # Fill input by ref\nagent-browser close             # Close browser\n```\n\n## Core workflow\n\n1. Navigate: `agent-browser open <url>`\n2. Snapshot: `agent-browser snapshot -i` (returns elements with refs like `@e1`, `@e2`)\n3. Interact using refs from the snapshot\n4. Re-snapshot after navigation or significant DOM changes\n\n## Commands\n\n### Navigation\n```bash\nagent-browser open <url>      # Navigate to URL\nagent-browser back            # Go back\nagent-browser forward         # Go forward\nagent-browser reload          # Reload page\nagent-browser close           # Close browser\n```\n\n### Snapshot (page analysis)\n```bash\nagent-browser snapshot            # Full accessibility tree\nagent-browser snapshot -i         # Interactive elements only (recommended)\nagent-browser snapshot -c         # Compact output\nagent-browser snapshot -d 3       # Limit depth to 3\nagent-browser snapshot -s \"#main\" # Scope to CSS selector\n```\n\n### Interactions (use @refs from snapshot)\n```bash\nagent-browser click @e1           # Click\nagent-browser dblclick @e1        # Double-click\nagent-browser focus @e1           # Focus element\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"text\"     # Clear and type\nagent-browser type @e2 \"text\"     # Type without clearing\nagent-browser press Enter         # Press key\nagent-browser press Control+a     # Key combination\nagent-browser keydown Shift       # Hold key down\nagent-browser keyup Shift         # Release key\nagent-browser hover @e1           # Hover\nagent-browser check @e1           # Check checkbox\nagent-browser uncheck @e1         # Uncheck checkbox\nagent-browser select @e1 \"value\"  # Select dropdown\nagent-browser scroll down 500     # Scroll page\nagent-browser scrollintoview @e1  # Scroll element into view\nagent-browser drag @e1 @e2        # Drag and drop\nagent-browser upload @e1 file.pdf # Upload files\n```\n\n### Get information\n```bash\nagent-browser get text @e1        # Get element text\nagent-browser get html @e1        # Get innerHTML\nagent-browser get value @e1       # Get input value\nagent-browser get attr @e1 href   # Get attribute\nagent-browser get title           # Get page title\nagent-browser get url             # Get current URL\nagent-browser get count \".item\"   # Count matching elements\nagent-browser get box @e1         # Get bounding box\n```\n\n### Check state\n```bash\nagent-browser is visible @e1      # Check if visible\nagent-browser is enabled @e1      # Check if enabled\nagent-browser is checked @e1      # Check if checked\n```\n\n### Data Extraction Best Practices\n- **Prefer `innerText`**: Dynamic sites often obfuscate class names (e.g., `css-1234`). Use `document.body.innerText` to get all text and parse it with your LLM context.\n- **Use `snapshot -i`**: This uses the accessibility tree which is more stable than HTML structure, especially for interactive elements.\n- **Avoid complex selectors**: Selectors like `div > div:nth-child(3)` are brittle. If you must use JS, try robust queries like `document.querySelectorAll(''a[href*=\"showtime\"]'')`.\n- **Fallback**: If a JS extraction returns `[]`, immediately fallback to getting the whole page text.\n\n\n### Screenshots & PDF\n```bash\nagent-browser screenshot          # Screenshot to stdout\nagent-browser screenshot path.png # Save to file\nagent-browser screenshot --full   # Full page\nagent-browser pdf output.pdf      # Save as PDF\n```\n\n### Video recording\n```bash\nagent-browser record start ./demo.webm    # Start recording (uses current URL + state)\nagent-browser click @e1                   # Perform actions\nagent-browser record stop                 # Stop and save video\nagent-browser record restart ./take2.webm # Stop current + start new recording\n```\nRecording creates a fresh context but preserves cookies/storage from your session. If no URL is provided, it automatically returns to your current page. For smooth demos, explore first, then start recording.\n\n### Wait\n```bash\nagent-browser wait @e1                     # Wait for element\nagent-browser wait 2000                    # Wait milliseconds\nagent-browser wait --text \"Success\"        # Wait for text\nagent-browser wait --url \"**/dashboard\"    # Wait for URL pattern\nagent-browser wait --load networkidle      # Wait for network idle\nagent-browser wait --fn \"window.ready\"     # Wait for JS condition\n```\n\n### Mouse control\n```bash\nagent-browser mouse move 100 200      # Move mouse\nagent-browser mouse down left         # Press button\nagent-browser mouse up left           # Release button\nagent-browser mouse wheel 100         # Scroll wheel\n```\n\n### Semantic locators (alternative to refs)\n```bash\nagent-browser find role button click --name \"Submit\"\nagent-browser find text \"Sign In\" click\nagent-browser find label \"Email\" fill \"user@test.com\"\nagent-browser find first \".item\" click\nagent-browser find nth 2 \"a\" text\n```\n\n### Browser settings\n```bash\nagent-browser set viewport 1920 1080      # Set viewport size\nagent-browser set device \"iPhone 14\"      # Emulate device\nagent-browser set geo 37.7749 -122.4194   # Set geolocation\nagent-browser set offline on              # Toggle offline mode\nagent-browser set headers ''{\"X-Key\":\"v\"}'' # Extra HTTP headers\nagent-browser set credentials user pass   # HTTP basic auth\nagent-browser set media dark              # Emulate color scheme\n```\n\n### Cookies & Storage\n```bash\nagent-browser cookies                     # Get all cookies\nagent-browser cookies set name value      # Set cookie\nagent-browser cookies clear               # Clear cookies\nagent-browser storage local               # Get all localStorage\nagent-browser storage local key           # Get specific key\nagent-browser storage local set k v       # Set value\nagent-browser storage local clear         # Clear all\n```\n\n### Network\n```bash\nagent-browser network route <url>              # Intercept requests\nagent-browser network route <url> --abort      # Block requests\nagent-browser network route <url> --body ''{}''  # Mock response\nagent-browser network unroute [url]            # Remove routes\nagent-browser network requests                 # View tracked requests\nagent-browser network requests --filter api    # Filter requests\n```\n\n### Tabs & Windows\n```bash\nagent-browser tab                 # List tabs\nagent-browser tab new [url]       # New tab\nagent-browser tab 2               # Switch to tab\nagent-browser tab close           # Close tab\nagent-browser window new          # New window\n```\n\n### Frames\n```bash\nagent-browser frame \"#iframe\"     # Switch to iframe\nagent-browser frame main          # Back to main frame\n```\n\n### Dialogs\n```bash\nagent-browser dialog accept [text]  # Accept dialog\nagent-browser dialog dismiss        # Dismiss dialog\n```\n\n### JavaScript\n```bash\nagent-browser eval \"document.title\"   # Run JavaScript\n```\n\n## Example: Form submission\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open https://example.com/form\nagent-browser snapshot -i\n# Output shows: textbox \"Email\" [ref=e1], textbox \"Password\" [ref=e2], button \"Submit\" [ref=e3]\n\nagent-browser fill @e1 \"user@example.com\"\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"password123\"\nagent-browser click @e3\nagent-browser wait --load networkidle\nagent-browser snapshot -i  # Check result\n```\n\n## Example: Authentication with saved state\n\n```bash\n# Login once\nagent-browser open https://app.example.com/login\nagent-browser snapshot -i\nagent-browser fill @e1 \"username\"\nagent-browser fill @e2 \"password\"\nagent-browser click @e3\nagent-browser wait --url \"**/dashboard\"\nagent-browser state save auth.json\n\n# Later sessions: load saved state\nagent-browser state load auth.json\nagent-browser open https://app.example.com/dashboard\n```\n\n## Sessions (parallel browsers)\n\n```bash\nagent-browser --session test1 open site-a.com\nagent-browser --session test2 open site-b.com\nagent-browser session list\n```\n\n## JSON output (for parsing)\n\nAdd `--json` for machine-readable output:\n```bash\nagent-browser snapshot -i --json\nagent-browser get text @e1 --json\n```\n\n## Debugging\n\n```bash\nagent-browser open example.com --headed              # Show browser window\nagent-browser console                                # View console messages\nagent-browser errors                                 # View page errors\nagent-browser record start ./debug.webm   # Record from current page\nagent-browser record stop                            # Save recording\nagent-browser open example.com --headed  # Show browser window\nagent-browser --cdp 9222 snapshot        # Connect via CDP\nagent-browser console                    # View console messages\nagent-browser console --clear            # Clear console\nagent-browser errors                     # View page errors\nagent-browser errors --clear             # Clear errors\nagent-browser highlight @e1              # Highlight element\nagent-browser trace start                # Start recording trace\nagent-browser trace stop trace.zip       # Stop and save trace\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:51:51.633Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing interactive browser control capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要交互式浏览器控制功能的自动化代理。","ja":"対話型ブラウザ制御機能を必要とするオートメーションエージェントに最適です。","ko":"대화형 브라우저 제어 기능이 필요한 자동화 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización que necesitan capacidades de control de navegador interactivo.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Automatisation ayant besoin de capacités de contrôle de navigateur interactif.","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die interaktive Browser-Steuerungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que precisam de capacidades de controle de navegador interativo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, которым требуются возможности интерактивного управления браузером.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات التحكم في المتصفح التفاعلي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate browser interactions using refs, enabling seamless navigation, element clicking, and form filling via protocols like HTTP and HTML, with snapshot capabilities for interactive elements.","zh":"使代理能够使用引用（refs）自动化浏览器交互，通过HTTP和HTML等协议实现无缝导航、元素点击和表单填写，并具备对交互式元素的快照功能。","ja":"refsを使用してブラウザ操作を自動化し、HTTPやHTMLなどのプロトコルを通じてシームレスなナビゲーション、要素のクリック、フォーム入力を可能にし、対話要素のスナップショット機能を備えています。","ko":"refs를 사용하여 브라우저 상호 작용을 자동화함으로써, HTTP 및 HTML과 같은 프로토콜을 통해 원활한 탐색, 요소 클릭 및 양식 작성이 가능해지며, 대화형 요소에 대한 스냅샷 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las interacciones del navegador utilizando referencias, lo que permite una navegación fluida, hacer clic en elementos y rellenar formularios a través de protocolos como HTTP y HTML, con capacidades de instantánea para elementos interactivos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les interactions de navigateur à l''aide de références, permettant ainsi une navigation fluide, le clic sur des éléments et le remplissage de formulaires via des protocoles tels que HTTP et HTML, avec des fonctionnalités de capture d''écran pour les éléments interactifs.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Browser-Interaktionen mithilfe von Referenzen zu automatisieren, wodurch eine nahtlose Navigation, das Klicken auf Elemente und das Ausfüllen von Formularen über Protokolle wie HTTP und HTML ermöglicht wird, mit Momentaufnahmefunktionen für interaktive Elemente.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar interações do navegador usando referências, permitindo navegação contínua, clique de elementos e preenchimento de formulários por meio de protocolos como HTTP e HTML, com capacidades de captura de instantâneos para elementos interativos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать взаимодействия с браузером с помощью ссылок, обеспечивая бесшовную навигацию, клик элементов и заполнение форм через протоколы như HTTP и HTML, с возможностями создания снимков для интерактивных элементов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تعزيز التفاعلات المتصفح باستخدام المراجع، ممّا يتيح الملاحة المستمرة وضغط العناصر وملء الاستمارات من خلال بروتوكولات مثل HTTP و HTML، مع إمكانيات التقاط الصور للعناصر التفاعلية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating web scraping tasks","Generating interactive browser tests","Debugging web application workflows"],"zh":["自动化网页抓取任务","生成交互式浏览器测试","调试Web应用程序工作流程"],"ja":["ウェブスクレイピングタスクの自動化","対話型ブラウザテストの生成","Webアプリケーションワークフローのデバッグ"],"ko":["웹 스크래핑 작업 자동화","대화형 브라우저 테스트 생성","웹 애플리케이션 워크플로우 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar tareas de extracción web","Generar pruebas de navegador interactivas","Depurar flujos de trabajo de aplicaciones web"],"fr":["Automatiser les tâches d''extraction web","Générer des tests de navigateur interactifs","Déboguer les flux de travail d''applications web"],"de":["Automatisierung von Web-Scraping-Aufgaben","Erzeugen interaktiver Browser-Tests","Debuggen von Webanwendungs-Workflows"],"pt":["Automatizar tarefas de raspagem web","Gerar testes interativos de navegador","Depurar fluxos de trabalho de aplicativos web"],"ru":["Автоматизация задач веб-скрапинга","Генерация интерактивных тестов браузера","Отладка рабочих процессов веб-приложений"],"ar":["تأتميم مهام刮ة الويب","توليد اختبارات متصفح تفاعلية","تصحيح خطأ سير عمل تطبيقات الويب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires browser instance access","Limited to HTTP and HTML protocols"],"zh":["需要浏览器实例访问权限","仅限于HTTP和HTML协议"],"ja":["ブラウザインスタンスへのアクセスが必要","HTTPおよびHTMLプロトコルに限定"],"ko":["브라우저 인스턴스 접근 권한 필요","HTTP 및 HTML 프로토콜로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a instancias de navegador","Limitado a protocolos HTTP y HTML"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux instances de navigateur","Limité aux protocoles HTTP et HTML"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Browser-Instanzen","Begrenzt auf HTTP- und HTML-Protokolle"],"pt":["Requer acesso à instância do navegador","Limitado a protocolos HTTP e HTML"],"ru":["Требует доступа к экземпляру браузера","Ограничен протоколами HTTP и HTML"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مثيل المتصفح","محدود ببروتوكولات HTTP و HTML"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
