de regressão automatizados","Varreduras de parâmetros automatizadas","Coleta de resultados e teste de regressão","Suporte a hardware SDR (RTL-SDR, SDRplay, etc.)","Teste de modos de demodulação (FM, AM, SSB)","Comparação de configurações de AGC e filtros"],"ru":["Автоматизированное регрессионное тестирование","Автоматизированные параметрические сканирования","Сбор результатов и регрессионное тестирование","Поддержка аппаратного обеспечения SDR (RTL-SDR, SDRplay и т. д.)","Тестирование режимов демодуляции (FM, AM, SSB)","Сравнение настроек AGC и фильтров"],"ar":["اختبارات انحدار آلية","مسح المعاملات الآلي","جمع النتائج واختبار الانحدار","دعم الأجهزة SDR (RTL-SDR، SDRplay، إلخ)","اختبار أنماط التضمين (FM، AM، SSB)","مقارنة إعدادات AGC والمرشحات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WaveCap-SDR","测试工具","自动化测试","参数扫描","结果收集","回归测试","硬件测试"],"ja":["WaveCap-SDR","テストツール","自動テスト","パラメータスイープ","結果収集","回帰テスト","ハードウェアテスト"],"ko":["WaveCap-SDR","테스트 도구","자동 테스트","파라미터 스윕","결과 수집","회귀 테스트","하드웨어 테스트"],"es":["Harness Runner","WaveCap-SDR","pruebas automatizadas","regresión","validación de calidad de audio","SDR","demodulación","AGC","filtros"],"fr":["Harness Runner","WaveCap-SDR","tests automatisés","régression","validation de la qualité audio","SDR","démodulation","AGC","filtres"],"de":["Harness Runner","WaveCap-SDR","automatisierte Tests","Regressions-Tests","Validierung der Audioqualität","SDR","Demodulation","AGC","Filter"],"pt":["WaveCap-SDR","Harness Runner","Teste de regressão","Varredura de parâmetros","Coleta de resultados","SDR","RTL-SDR","SDRplay","Demodulação","AGC"],"ru":["WaveCap-SDR","Harness Runner","Регрессионное тестирование","Параметрические сканирования","Сбор результатов","SDR","RTL-SDR","SDRplay","Демодуляция","AGC"],"ar":["ويف كاب-إس دي آر","حارنيس رانر","اختبار الانحدار","مسح المعاملات","جمع النتائج","إس دي آر","آر تي إل-إس دي آر","إس دي آر بلاي","التضمين","إيه جي سي"]}},"owner":"TobiasWooldridge","repo":"WaveCap-SDR","repoPath":"TobiasWooldridge/WaveCap-SDR","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"harness-runner","description":"Run WaveCap-SDR test harness with automated parameter sweeps and validation. Use when regression testing, validating audio quality across configurations, testing SDR hardware, or benchmarking demodulation performance.","bodyPreview":"# Harness Runner for WaveCap-SDR\n\nThis skill helps run the WaveCap-SDR test harness with automated parameter sweeps, result collection, and regression testing.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Running regression tests after code changes\n- Validating audio quality across different configurations\n- Testing SDR hardware (RTL-SDR, SDRplay, etc.)\n- Benchmarking demodulation modes (FM, AM, SSB)\n- Comparing different AGC or filter settings\n- Testing with multiple frequencies or channe","body":"# Harness Runner for WaveCap-SDR\n\nThis skill helps run the WaveCap-SDR test harness with automated parameter sweeps, result collection, and regression testing.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Running regression tests after code changes\n- Validating audio quality across different configurations\n- Testing SDR hardware (RTL-SDR, SDRplay, etc.)\n- Benchmarking demodulation modes (FM, AM, SSB)\n- Comparing different AGC or filter settings\n- Testing with multiple frequencies or channels\n- Automated CI/CD testing\n- Generating test reports for documentation\n\n## How It Works\n\nThe WaveCap-SDR harness (`backend/wavecapsdr/harness.py`) is a production-ready test tool that:\n\n1. **Starts a server** (optional) with specified configuration\n2. **Creates a capture** with SDR device or fake driver\n3. **Adds channels** with specified demodulation settings\n4. **Captures audio** for a duration and measures quality metrics\n5. **Returns results** with RMS levels, peak levels, and pass/fail status\n\nThis skill wraps the harness for automated testing scenarios.\n\n## Usage Instructions\n\n### Basic Harness Usage\n\n**Test with Fake Driver (Offline Testing):**\n```bash\ncd backend\nPYTHONPATH=. .venv/bin/python -m wavecapsdr.harness \\\n  --start-server \\\n  --driver fake \\\n  --preset kexp \\\n  --duration 3\n```\n\n**Test with Real SDR (RTL-SDR):**\n```bash\ncd backend\nPYTHONPATH=. .venv/bin/python -m wavecapsdr.harness \\\n  --start-server \\\n  --driver soapy \\\n  --device-args \"driver=rtlsdr\" \\\n  --preset kexp \\\n  --duration 5 \\\n  --out harness_out\n```\n\n**Test with SDRplay:**\n```bash\ncd backend\nPYTHONPATH=. .venv/bin/python -m wavecapsdr.harness \\\n  --start-server \\\n  --driver soapy \\\n  --device-args \"driver=sdrplay,serial=240309F070\" \\\n  --preset marine \\\n  --duration 5\n```\n\n### Advanced: Parameter Sweeps\n\nUse the included script to run parameter sweeps:\n\n```bash\nPYTHONPATH=backend backend/.venv/bin/python .claude/skills/harness-runner/run_harness.py \\\n  --preset kexp \\\n  --duration 3 \\\n  --driver fake \\\n  --sweep gain --gain-values 10 20 30 40\n```\n\nParameters:\n- `--preset`: Preset name (kexp, marine, aviation, tone, etc.)\n- `--duration`: Seconds to capture per test (default: 3)\n- `--driver`: Driver to use (fake, soapy, rtl)\n- `--device-args`: Device selector string\n- `--output-dir`: Directory for results (default: harness_results)\n- `--sweep`: Parameter to sweep (gain, bandwidth, frequency)\n- `--gain-values`: List of gain values to test (for gain sweep)\n- `--bandwidth-values`: List of bandwidth values (for bandwidth sweep)\n- `--frequency-offsets`: List of frequency offsets (for frequency sweep)\n- `--parallel`: Run tests in parallel (default: sequential)\n- `--report`: Generate HTML/JSON report\n\n### Example Workflows\n\n**1. Regression Testing After Code Changes:**\n\n```bash\n# Run quick smoke test with fake driver\nPYTHONPATH=backend backend/.venv/bin/python .claude/skills/harness-runner/run_harness.py \\\n  --preset kexp \\\n  --duration 2 \\\n  --driver fake \\\n  --output-dir regression_test_$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S) \\\n  --report\n```\n\nExpected: All channels should have audio RMS > -40 dB (validates demodulation works)\n\n**2. Find Optimal Gain for SDR Device:**\n\n```bash\n# Sweep gain from 0 to 50 dB in 10 dB steps\nPYTHONPATH=backend backend/.venv/bin/python .claude/skills/harness-runner/run_harness.py \\\n  --preset kexp \\\n  --duration 5 \\\n  --driver soapy \\\n  --device-args \"driver=rtlsdr\" \\\n  --sweep gain \\\n  --gain-values 0 10 20 30 40 50 \\\n  --output-dir gain_sweep_kexp \\\n  --report\n```\n\nReview report to find gain with best audio level (typically -20 to -10 dB RMS)\n\n**3. Test All Presets with Fake Driver:**\n\n```bash\n# Test each preset to ensure they work\nfor preset in kexp marine aviation noaa tone; do\n  echo \"Testing preset: $preset\"\n  PYTHONPATH=backend backend/.venv/bin/python -m wavecapsdr.harness \\\n    --start-server \\\n    --driver fake \\\n    --preset $preset \\\n    --duration 3 \\\n    --out harness_out_$preset\ndone\n```\n\n**4. Compare FM Demodulation Quality:**\n\n```bash\n# Test FM demodulation with different configurations\n# (Requires modifying harness to support demod parameter sweep)\nPYTHONPATH=backend backend/.venv/bin/python .claude/skills/harness-runner/run_harness.py \\\n  --preset kexp \\\n  --driver fake \\\n  --duration 5 \\\n  --output-dir fm_demod_test \\\n  --report\n```\n\n**5. Hardware Stress Test:**\n\n```bash\n# Long-duration test to check for memory leaks or crashes\nPYTHONPATH=backend backend/.venv/bin/python -m wavecapsdr.harness \\\n  --start-server \\\n  --driver soapy \\\n  --device-args \"driver=rtlsdr\" \\\n  --preset kexp \\\n  --duration 300 \\\n  --out stress_test\n```\n\nMonitor server logs and system resources during test.\n\n## Interpreting Harness Results\n\nThe harness outputs JSON reports with channel statistics:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"captureId\": \"cap_abc123\",\n  \"channels\": [\n    {\n      \"channelId\": \"ch1\",\n      \"label\": \"KEXP 90.3 FM\",\n      \"offsetHz\": -600000,\n      \"rmsDb\": -18.5,\n      \"peakDb\": -6.2,\n      \"status\": \"PASS\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"channelId\": \"ch2\",\n      \"label\": \"KNHC 89.5 FM\",\n      \"offsetHz\": 800000,\n      \"rmsDb\": -65.2,\n      \"peakDb\": -58.1,\n      \"status\": \"FAIL\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Pass/Fail Criteria:**\n- **PASS**: RMS > -40 dB (audio is present and audible)\n- **FAIL**: RMS < -40 dB (silence, noise, or tuning issue)\n- **CLIP**: Peak > -0.5 dB (clipping detected, reduce gain)\n\n**Typical Good Audio Levels:**\n- RMS: -20 to -10 dB (strong, clear audio)\n- RMS: -30 to -20 dB (moderate audio, acceptable)\n- RMS: -40 to -30 dB (weak audio, may have noise)\n- RMS: < -40 dB (too quiet, indicates problem)\n\n## Common Presets\n\n**KEXP (FM Broadcast):**\n- Center: 90.3 MHz\n- Sample rate: 2 MHz\n- Channels: KEXP 90.3, KNHC 89.5\n- Use for: FM demodulation testing\n\n**Marine VHF:**\n- Center: 156.8 MHz (Channel 16)\n- Sample rate: 250 kHz\n- Channels: Ch 16, Ch 9, Ch 6\n- Use for: Narrowband FM testing\n\n**Aviation:**\n- Center: 118-137 MHz\n- Channels: Tower, ATIS, Ground\n- Use for: AM demodulation testing\n\n**NOAA Weather:**\n- Center: 162.550 MHz\n- Channels: WX1, WX2\n- Use for: Continuous broadcast testing\n\n**Tone (Test Signal):**\n- Fake driver generates 1 kHz test tone\n- Use for: Offline testing without SDR hardware\n\n## Harness Command-Line Options\n\n```\n--start-server       Start embedded server (required for offline testing)\n--driver             Driver: fake, soapy, rtl (default: soapy)\n--device-args        Device selector (e.g., \"driver=rtlsdr\")\n--preset             Preset name (kexp, marine, aviation, etc.)\n--center-hz          Override center frequency\n--sample-rate        Override sample rate\n--offset             Channel offset Hz (repeatable)\n--duration           Seconds to capture (default: 10)\n--gain               RF gain in dB\n--bandwidth          RF bandwidth in Hz\n--out                Output directory for WAV files\n--auto-gain          Auto-select optimal gain\n--probe-seconds      Seconds for auto-gain probing (default: 2)\n```\n\n## Integration with CI/CD\n\n**GitHub Actions Example:**\n\n```yaml\nname: Test Harness\non: [push, pull_request]\n\njobs:\n  harness:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v3\n      - name: Setup Python\n        uses: actions/setup-python@v4\n        with:\n          python-version: ''3.11''\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: |\n          cd backend\n          python -m venv .venv\n          .venv/bin/pip install -e .\n      - name: Run harness tests\n        run: |\n          cd backend\n          PYTHONPATH=. .venv/bin/python -m wavecapsdr.harness \\\n            --start-server \\\n            --driver fake \\\n            --preset kexp \\\n            --duration 3\n      - name: Check exit code\n        run: |\n          if [ $? -eq 0 ]; then\n            echo \"Harness tests PASSED\"\n          else\n            echo \"Harness tests FAILED\"\n            exit 1\n          fi\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Issue: Harness fails with \"No audio detected\"**\n- Check if preset exists in config: `cat backend/config/wavecapsdr.yaml | grep -A 10 \"preset-name\"`\n- Verify device connection: `SoapySDRUtil --find`\n- Check antenna is connected\n- Try fake driver first: `--driver fake`\n\n**Issue: RMS levels very low (< -60 dB)**\n- Increase gain: `--gain 30`\n- Use auto-gain: `--auto-gain`\n- Check if frequency is correct\n- Verify antenna tuned for frequency range\n\n**Issue: Clipping (peak > -0.5 dB)**\n- Reduce gain: `--gain 10`\n- Check for strong nearby signals\n- Use AGC in demodulation\n\n**Issue: Server port already in use**\n- Change port: `--port 8088`\n- Kill existing server: `pkill -f wavecapsdr`\n\n## Files in This Skill\n\n- `SKILL.md`: This file - instructions for using the skill\n- `run_harness.py`: Parameter sweep automation script\n\n## Notes\n\n- Harness always returns non-zero exit code if any channel fails\n- Use `--duration 3` for quick tests, `--duration 10+` for reliable results\n- Fake driver is deterministic (same output every time)\n- Real SDR results vary based on signal conditions\n- Save WAV files with `--out` for manual inspection\n- Auto-gain feature requires multiple iterations (slower but finds optimal gain)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:52:20.806Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Agents needing automated testing and validation of SDR hardware and configurations.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化测试和验证SDR硬件和配置的技术代理。","ja":"SDRハードウェアと構成の自動テストと検証を必要とするテクニカルエージェントに最適です。","ko":"SDR 하드웨어 및 구성의 자동화된 테스트 및 검증이 필요한 기술 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Técnicos que necesitan pruebas y validación automatizadas de hardware y configuraciones de SDR.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents techniques ayant besoin de tests et de validation automatisés de matériel et de configurations SDR.","de":"Perfekt für technische Agenten, die automatisierte Tests und Validierung von SDR-Hardware und -Konfigurationen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Técnicos que necessitam de testes e validação automatizados de hardware e configurações de SDR.","ru":"Идеально подходит для технических агентов, которым необходимы автоматизированные тестирование и проверка оборудования и конфигураций SDR.","ar":"مثالي لولاء الفنيين الذين يحتاجون إلى اختبارات وتحقق آليين لمكونات الأجهزة وتكوينات SDR."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate parameter sweeps, result collection, and regression testing for WaveCap-SDR using RTL-SDR, SDRplay, and other SDR hardware, while supporting demodulation modes like FM, AM, and SSB.","zh":"赋予代理自动化参数扫描、结果收集和WaveCap-SDR的回归测试的能力，支持使用RTL-SDR、SDRplay和其他SDR硬件，并支持FM、AM和SSB等解调模式。","ja":"エージェントに、RTL-SDR、SDRplay、その他のSDRハードウェアを使用して、WaveCap-SDRのパラメータスイープ、結果収集、回帰テストの自動化を可能にします。また、FM、AM、SSBなどの解調モードもサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 RTL-SDR, SDRplay 및 기타 SDR 하드웨어를 사용하여 WaveCap-SDR의 매개변수 스윕, 결과 수집 및 회귀 테스트를 자동화하고 FM, AM, SSB 등의 복조 모드를 지원할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar barridos de parámetros, recolección de resultados y pruebas de regresión para WaveCap-SDR utilizando RTL-SDR, SDRplay y otro hardware SDR, mientras admite modos de demodulación como FM, AM y SSB.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les balayages de paramètres, la collecte de résultats et les tests de régression pour WaveCap-SDR en utilisant RTL-SDR, SDRplay et d''autres matériel SDR, tout en prenant en charge les modes de démodulation tels que FM, AM et SSB.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Parameter-Sweeps, Ergebnissammlung und Regressions-Tests für WaveCap-SDR mit RTL-SDR, SDRplay und anderer SDR-Hardware zu automatisieren, während Demodulationsmodi wie FM, AM und SSB unterstützt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar varreduras de parâmetros, coleta de resultados e testes de regressão para WaveCap-SDR usando RTL-SDR, SDRplay e outros hardwares de SDR, além de suportar modos de demodulação como FM, AM e SSB.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать сканирование параметров, сбор результатов и регрессионное тестирование для WaveCap-SDR с использованием RTL-SDR, SDRplay и другого оборудования SDR, а также поддерживает режимы демодуляции, такие как FM, AM и SSB.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتوفير التخفيض التلقائي لمعاملات المسح وجمع النتائج واختبارات الانحدار لبرنامج WaveCap-SDR باستخدام برنامج RTL-SDR وبرنامج SDRplay وأجهزة SDR الأخرى، مع دعم أوضاع استخلاص الإشارات مثل FM و AM و SSB."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating regression tests after code changes","Validating audio quality across different SDR configurations","Benchmarking demodulation modes for optimal performance"],"zh":["代码更改后自动化回归测试","跨不同SDR配置验证音频质量","为最佳性能基准解调模式"],"ja":["コード変更後の自動回帰テスト","異なるSDR構成間でのオーディオ品質の検証","最適なパフォーマンスのための解調モードのベンチマーク"],"ko":["코드 변경 후 자동화된 회귀 테스트","다른 SDR 구성에서 오디오 품질을 검증","최적의 성능을 위한 복조 모드 벤치마크"],"es":["Automatizar pruebas de regresión después de cambios en el código","Validar la calidad de audio en diferentes configuraciones de SDR","Evaluar modos de demodulación para un rendimiento óptimo"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests de régression après des modifications de code","Valider la qualité audio sur différentes configurations SDR","Évaluer les modes de démodulation pour une performance optimale"],"de":["Automatisierung von Regressions-Tests nach Code-Änderungen","Validierung der Audio-Qualität über verschiedene SDR-Konfigurationen","Bewertung von Demodulationsmodi für optimale Leistung"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de regressão após alterações de código","Validar a qualidade de áudio em diferentes configurações de SDR","Testar desempenho de modos de demodulação para desempenho ótimo"],"ru":["Автоматизировать регрессионное тестирование после изменений кода","Проверять качество аудио в разных конфигурациях SDR","Тестировать производительность режимов демодуляции для оптимальной производительности"],"ar":["توفير الاختبارات الانحدارية بعد تغييرات الشفرة","تحقق جودة الصوت عبر تكوينات SDR المختلفة","اختبار أداء أوضاع استخلاص الإشارات لل أداء الأمثل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires WaveCap-SDR test harness setup","Limited to SDR hardware compatibility"],"zh":["需要WaveCap-SDR测试框架设置","仅限SDR硬件兼容性"],"ja":["WaveCap-SDRテストハーネスの設定が必要","SDRハードウェアの互換性に限界がある"],"ko":["WaveCap-SDR 테스트 하네스를 설정해야 함","SDR 하드웨어 호환성에 제한"],"es":["Requiere la configuración del arnés de prueba WaveCap-SDR","Limitado a la compatibilidad del hardware SDR"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration du harnais de test WaveCap-SDR","Limité à la compatibilité du matériel SDR"],"de":["Benötigt die Einrichtung des WaveCap-SDR-Test-Harness","Begrenzt auf die Kompatibilität der SDR-Hardware"],"pt":["Exige configuração do teste WaveCap-SDR","Limitado à compatibilidade de hardware de SDR"],"ru":["Требует настройки тестового каркаса WaveCap-SDR","Ограничен совместимостью оборудования SDR"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد هيكل اختبار WaveCap-SDR","محدود بالتوافق مع أجهزة SDR"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('smoreg/biLangGen/upload-prepare', 'community', 'smoreg', 'biLangGen', 'smoreg/biLangGen', 'upload-prepare', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z', '2026-02-18T03:52:21.413Z', NULL, '{"id":"smoreg/biLangGen/upload-prepare","name":"upload-prepare","description":{"zh":"upload-prepare 技能用于准备和验证 YouTube 上传，创建详细的检查清单以确保上传成功","ja":"upload-prepare スキルは、YouTube アップロードの準備と検証を行い、詳細なチェックリストを作成します","ko":"upload-prepare 기능은 YouTube 업로드를 준비하고 검증하며, 상세한 체크리스트를 생성하여 업로드 성공을 보장합니다","es":"El skill ''upload-prepare'' prepara y valida los videos para YouTube, creando una lista de verificación para la verificación del usuario.","fr":"Le skill ''upload-prepare'' prépare et valide les vidéos pour YouTube, créant une liste de vérification pour la vérification de l''utilisateur.","de":"Der ''upload-prepare''-Skill bereitet die Videos für YouTube vor und validiert sie, indem er eine Prüfliste für die Benutzerverifizierung erstellt.","pt":"O upload-prepare é uma ferramenta que prepara e valida tudo para o upload no YouTube sem realmente carregá-lo.","ru":"Upload-prepare - это инструмент, который готовит и проверяет все для загрузки на YouTube без фактического загрузки.","ar":"upload-prepare هو أداة تستعد و تحقق من كل شيء للتحميل على يوتيوب دون تحميله فعلا.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"YouTube 上传准备和验证","ja":"YouTube アップロード準備と検証","ko":"YouTube 업로드 준비 및 검증","es":"Preparación de subida para YouTube","fr":"Préparation de téléchargement pour YouTube","de":"Vorbereitung der Uploads für YouTube","pt":"Preparação de Upload para YouTube","ru":"Подготовка к загрузке на YouTube","ar":"استعداد التحميل لليوتيوب","en":"upload-prepare"},"description":{"zh":"upload-prepare 技能用于准备和验证 YouTube 上传，创建详细的检查清单以确保上传成功","ja":"upload-prepare スキルは、YouTube アップロードの準備と検証を行い、詳細なチェックリストを作成します","ko":"upload-prepare 기능은 YouTube 업로드를 준비하고 검증하며, 상세한 체크리스트를 생성하여 업로드 성공을 보장합니다","es":"El skill ''upload-prepare'' prepara y valida los videos para YouTube, creando una lista de verificación para la verificación del usuario.","fr":"Le skill ''upload-prepare'' prépare et valide les vidéos pour YouTube, créant une liste de vérification pour la vérification de l''utilisateur.","de":"Der ''upload-prepare''-Skill bereitet die Videos für YouTube vor und validiert sie, indem er eine Prüfliste für die Benutzerverifizierung erstellt.","pt":"O upload-prepare é uma ferramenta que prepara e valida tudo para o upload no YouTube sem realmente carregá-lo.","ru":"Upload-prepare - это инструмент, который готовит и проверяет все для загрузки на YouTube без фактического загрузки.","ar":"upload-prepare هو أداة تستعد و تحقق من كل شيء للتحميل على يوتيوب دون تحميله فعلا.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建详细的检查清单","验证 YouTube 上传准备","支持多语言","自动检测项目名称","生成检查清单以确保上传成功"],"ja":["詳細なチェックリストを作成","YouTube アップロードの準備を検証","多言語対応","プロジェクト名を自動で検出","チェックリストを生成してアップロード成功を保証"],"ko":["상세한 체크리스트 생성","YouTube 업로드 준비 검증","다중 언어 지원","프로젝트 이름 자동 검출","체크리스트 생성하여 업로드 성공 보장"],"es":["Preparación de videos para YouTube","Validación de contenido","Creación de lista de verificación","Verificación de proyectos","Detección de contexto"],"fr":["Préparation de vidéos pour YouTube","Validation de contenu","Création de liste de vérification","Vérification de projets","Détection de contexte"],"de":["Vorbereitung von Videos für YouTube","Inhaltsvalidierung","Erstellung einer Prüfliste","Projektverifizierung","Kontexterkennung"],"pt":["Preparação de upload de vídeos para o YouTube","Criação de lista de verificação abrangente","Verificação de projeto existente","Detecção de contexto do usuário","Suporte a vários gatilhos de ativação"],"ru":["Подготовка загрузки видео на YouTube","Создание всестороннего чек-листа","Проверка существующего проекта","Обнаружение контекста пользователя","Поддержка нескольких триггеров активации"],"ar":["استعداد تحميل الفيديوهات على يوتيوب","إنشاء قائمة مراجعة شاملة","التحقق من مشروع موجود","اكتشاف سياق المستخدم","دعم أiggers متعددة للتفعيل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["YouTube 上传准备","upload-prepare","YouTube 上传验证","检查清单","上传成功","多语言支持"],"ja":["YouTube アップロード準備","upload-prepare","YouTube アップロード検証","チェックリスト","アップロード成功","多言語対応"],"ko":["YouTube 업로드 준비","upload-prepare","YouTube 업로드 검증","체크리스트","업로드 성공","다중 언어 지원"],"es":["subida de videos","validación de contenido","lista de verificación","verificación de proyectos","detección de contexto","YouTube","upload prepare"],"fr":["téléchargement de vidéos","validation de contenu","liste de vérification","vérification de projets","détection de contexte","YouTube","upload prepare"],"de":["Video-Upload","Inhaltsvalidierung","Prüfliste","Projektverifizierung","Kontexterkennung","YouTube","upload prepare"],"pt":["upload de vídeos","preparação de upload","validação de upload","YouTube","ferramenta de upload","lista de verificação","projeto existente","detecção de contexto"],"ru":["загрузка видео","подготовка загрузки","проверка загрузки","YouTube","инструмент загрузки","чек-лист","существующий проект","обнаружение контекста"],"ar":["تحميل الفيديوهات","استعداد التحميل","التحقق من التحميل","يوتيوب","أداة التحميل","قائمة المراجعة","مشروع موجود","اكتشاف السياق"]}},"owner":"smoreg","repo":"biLangGen","repoPath":"smoreg/biLangGen","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upload-prepare","description":"Prepare YouTube upload for bilingual audiobook video. Runs youtube-metadata skill, builds upload command, validates all files, checks languages by reading translations from middle of book, verifies wordcards play, shows thumbnail/background/output. Does NOT upload - only preparation and checklist. Use when user wants to prepare upload, check before upload, or validate video for YouTube.","bodyPreview":"# Upload Prepare - YouTube Upload Preparation & Validation\n\n## Overview\n\nPrepare and validate everything for YouTube upload without actually uploading. Creates comprehensive checklist for user verification.\n\n## Activation Triggers\n\n- \"prepare upload\"\n- \"check before upload\"\n- \"validate for youtube\"\n- \"upload checklist\"\n- \"готовь к загрузке\"\n- \"проверь перед аплоадом\"\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Identify Project\n\n1. Get project name from user or detect from context\n2. Verify project exists in `proj","body":"# Upload Prepare - YouTube Upload Preparation & Validation\n\n## Overview\n\nPrepare and validate everything for YouTube upload without actually uploading. Creates comprehensive checklist for user verification.\n\n## Activation Triggers\n\n- \"prepare upload\"\n- \"check before upload\"\n- \"validate for youtube\"\n- \"upload checklist\"\n- \"готовь к загрузке\"\n- \"проверь перед аплоадом\"\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Identify Project\n\n1. Get project name from user or detect from context\n2. Verify project exists in `projects/` directory\n3. Load project metadata from SQLite database\n\n```bash\n# Check project exists\nls projects/{project_name}/\n\n# Get meta from DB\nsqlite3 projects/{project_name}/project.db \"SELECT key, value FROM meta;\"\n```\n\n### Step 2: Validate Languages\n\n1. Read source and target language from project meta\n2. Read 2-3 translations from MIDDLE of the book (not beginning!)\n3. Display translations for user to verify correct language\n\n```bash\n# Get total sentences\nsqlite3 projects/{project_name}/project.db \"SELECT value FROM meta WHERE key=''total_sentences'';\"\n\n# Read translations from middle (e.g., sentences 100-102)\nsqlite3 projects/{project_name}/project.db \"SELECT sentence_idx, text FROM sentences WHERE lang=''{target_lang}'' LIMIT 3 OFFSET 100;\"\n```\n\n### Step 3: Validate Files\n\nCheck all required files exist:\n\n```bash\n# Video output\nls -lh projects/{project_name}/video/output.mp4\n\n# Background image\nls -la projects/{project_name}/video/background.*\n\n# Timeline with wordcards\nhead -30 projects/{project_name}/audio/timeline.json | grep -E \"(wordcard_start|wordcard_duration)\"\n\n# Wordcard audio files\nls projects/{project_name}/audio/wordcards/ | head -5\n```\n\n### Step 4: Verify Wordcards\n\n1. Check timeline.json contains wordcard_start and wordcard_duration fields\n2. Play one wordcard audio from middle of book for verification\n\n```bash\n# Check timeline has wordcard data\ngrep -c \"wordcard_start\" projects/{project_name}/audio/timeline.json\n\n# Play wordcard from middle (user listens)\nafplay projects/{project_name}/audio/wordcards/0000100_combined.mp3\n```\n\n### Step 5: Find Thumbnail\n\n1. Determine language pair from project (e.g., ru_en, ru_es-latam)\n2. Check `thumbnails/{lang_pair}/` directory for matching thumbnail\n3. If not found, generate using thumbnail generator\n\n```bash\n# Find thumbnail in language-specific folder\n# Structure: thumbnails/ru_en/, thumbnails/ru_es-latam/\nls -la thumbnails/{source}_{target}/ | grep -i {project_base_name}\n```\n\n**If thumbnail NOT found, generate it:**\n\n```python\n# Quick one-liner to generate single thumbnail\npython3 -c \"\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom video.thumbnail_variants import prepare_background, variant_13, load_fonts\nfrom PIL import ImageDraw\n\nfonts = load_fonts()\nimg = prepare_background(Path(''txt_source/{book_name}.png''))\ndraw = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\n\n# For RU→EN use tgt_lang=''ENGLISH''\n# For RU→ES-LATAM use tgt_lang=''LATAM SPANISH''\nimg = variant_13(img, draw, fonts,\n    author_en=''{Author English}'',\n    title_en=''{Title English}'',\n    src_lang=''RUSSIAN'',\n    tgt_lang=''ENGLISH'',  # or ''LATAM SPANISH''\n    title_ru=''{Название}'',\n    author_ru=''{Автор}''\n)\nimg = img.convert(''RGB'')\nimg.save(''thumbnails/ru_en/{book_name}.png'', quality=95)\n\"\n```\n\n**Batch generation (all books):**\n```bash\n# Generate all thumbnails for specific language pair\npython3 scripts/generate_thumbnails.py thumbnails/ru_es-latam  # default LATAM SPANISH\n```\n\nTo add target language option to batch script, edit `generate_thumbnails.py`.\n\n### Step 6: Generate Metadata\n\nInvoke youtube-metadata skill to generate title, description, tags:\n\n```\nSkill(skill: \"youtube-metadata\")\n```\n\nFollow youtube-metadata workflow to generate proper metadata.\n\n### Step 7: Build Upload Command\n\nConstruct the upload command (do NOT execute):\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/youtube_upload.py upload {project_name} {thumbnail_path} --playlist \"{playlist_name}\"\n```\n\nPlaylist selection:\n- RU → EN: `--playlist \"RU - EN\"`\n- RU → ES-LATAM: `--playlist \"RU - ES (LATAM)\"`\n- Other: ask user\n\n### Step 8: Display Checklist\n\nOutput comprehensive checklist for user:\n\n```\n============================================================\nUPLOAD PREPARATION CHECKLIST\n============================================================\n\nPROJECT: {project_name}\nLANGUAGES: {SOURCE} → {TARGET}\n\n------------------------------------------------------------\nFILES (clickable paths)\n------------------------------------------------------------\n[✓/✗] Video:      file://{full_video_path} ({size})\n[✓/✗] Background: file://{full_background_path}\n[✓/✗] Thumbnail:  file://{full_thumbnail_path}\n[✓/✗] Timeline: {has wordcard data}\n[✓/✗] Wordcards: {count} files\n\n------------------------------------------------------------\nLANGUAGE VERIFICATION (from middle of book)\n------------------------------------------------------------\nSentence 100: \"{source_text}\"\nTranslation:  \"{target_text}\"\n\nSentence 101: \"{source_text}\"\nTranslation:  \"{target_text}\"\n\n>>> Verify translations are in {target_lang}! <<<\n\n------------------------------------------------------------\nWORDCARD AUDIO\n------------------------------------------------------------\n[✓/✗] Timeline has wordcard timing\n[✓/✗] Wordcard files exist\n[PLAYED] Wordcard sample from sentence 100\n\n------------------------------------------------------------\nMETADATA (use youtube-metadata skill format!)\n------------------------------------------------------------\nTitle: [Bilingual][{SOURCE}→{TARGET}] {Author} - {Title}\n\nDescription:\n🎧 AI-generated bilingual audio for passive language learning.\nEach sentence: first {source_language}, then {target_language}.\n\n⚠️ Neural TTS - minor errors possible. Premium voices coming soon.\n\n📩 Want other languages or texts? Drop a comment!\n\n#{hashtag1} #Bilingual #LanguageLearning #{hashtag2}\n\nTags: (from youtube-metadata skill, NO # symbols)\nPlaylist: {playlist}\n\n------------------------------------------------------------\nUPLOAD COMMAND (copy & run when ready)\n------------------------------------------------------------\npython3 scripts/youtube_upload.py upload {project_name} {thumbnail_path} \\\n  --title \"[Bilingual][{SOURCE}→{TARGET}] {Author} - {Title}\" \\\n  --playlist \"{playlist}\" \\\n  --privacy public\n\n============================================================\n```\n\n**Upload command flags:**\n- `--title` — REQUIRED! Title in youtube-metadata format\n- `--thumbnail` — path to thumbnail image (positional arg)\n- `--playlist` — playlist name (RU - EN, RU - ES (LATAM), etc.)\n- `--privacy` — private/unlisted/public (use public for immediate publish)\n- `--schedule` — optional: \"tomorrow\", \"tomorrow 14:00\", \"18:00\", \"+2h\", or ISO datetime\n- `--dry-run` — preview without uploading\n- `-y` — skip confirmation\n\n**Optimal premiere times for language learning content:**\n- Best days: Wednesday, Thursday, Friday\n- Best time: 10:00-14:00 (target audience timezone)\n- For RU→EN: 14:00 MSK (11:00 UTC) — catches both Russian and European learners\n- For RU→ES LATAM: 18:00 MSK (15:00 UTC, 12:00 Argentina) — catches LATAM afternoon\n\n**CRITICAL:** Metadata MUST follow youtube-metadata skill format exactly:\n- Title: `[Bilingual][{SOURCE}→{TARGET}] {Author} - {Title}`\n- Author and Title MUST be in ENGLISH\n- Description: standard template from youtube-metadata skill\n- Tags: from youtube-metadata skill (NO hashtag symbols)\n\n## Quality Checklist\n\nBefore showing final checklist, verify:\n\n- [ ] Video file exists and size > 10MB\n- [ ] Background image exists\n- [ ] Thumbnail exists\n- [ ] Timeline contains wordcard_start fields (if wordcards enabled)\n- [ ] Wordcard audio files exist (if wordcards enabled)\n- [ ] Translations are in correct target language\n- [ ] Metadata generated via youtube-metadata skill\n- [ ] Upload command is valid\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n- **Don''t** execute the upload command\n- **Don''t** skip language verification\n- **Don''t** use translations from beginning (use middle of book)\n- **Don''t** skip wordcard audio playback\n- **Don''t** generate metadata manually (use youtube-metadata skill)\n\n## Example Execution\n\n```\nUser: prepare upload nabokov_uzhas_ru_en\n\nClaude:\nStarting upload preparation for nabokov_uzhas_ru_en...\n\n[Validates project exists]\n[Reads meta: ru → en, 209 sentences]\n[Reads translations from middle - sentences 100-102]\n[Checks video: 192MB ✓] → file:///Users/.../video/output.mp4\n[Checks background ✓] → file:///Users/.../video/background.png\n[Checks thumbnail ✓] → file:///Users/.../thumbnails/ru_en/nabokov_uzhas.png\n[Checks timeline: has wordcard_start ✓]\n[Plays wordcard audio from sentence 100]\n[Invokes youtube-metadata skill]\n[Builds upload command]\n\n============================================================\nUPLOAD PREPARATION CHECKLIST\n============================================================\n[Full checklist output...]\n============================================================\n\nAll checks passed! Review the checklist and run the upload command when ready.\n```\n\n## Summary\n\nThis skill prepares everything for YouTube upload:\n1. Validates all files exist\n2. Verifies languages by checking translations from middle of book\n3. Confirms wordcards are included\n4. Generates metadata via youtube-metadata skill\n5. Builds upload command\n6. Displays comprehensive checklist\n\nUser makes final decision to upload.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:52:21.413Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Media Management Agents requiring pre-upload validation and checklist generation for YouTube uploads.","zh":"适用于需要预上传验证和检查列表生成的YouTube上传的媒体管理代理的理想选择。","ja":"プレアップロードのバリデーションとチェックリストの生成が必要なYouTubeアップロード用のメディア管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"프리업로드 검증 및 체크리스트 생성이 필요한 유튜브 업로드를 위한 미디어 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión de medios que requieren validación previa a la carga y generación de listas de verificación para subir a YouTube.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion des médias nécessitant une validation préalable au téléchargement et une génération de liste de contrôle pour les téléchargements YouTube.","de":"Ideal für Media-Management-Agents, die eine Vorabvalidierung und eine Checklisten-Generierung für YouTube-Uploads benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Mídia que exigem validação pré-upload e geração de lista de verificação para uploads do YouTube.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления медиа, требующих предварительной проверки и генерации контрольного списка для загрузки на YouTube.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة الوسائط التي تتطلب التحقق قبل التحميل وإنشاء قائمة التحقق لأعضاء يوتيوب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create comprehensive checklists for user verification, ensuring all necessary steps are taken before uploading to YouTube, utilizing activation triggers like ''prepare upload'' and ''validate for youtube'' to streamline the workflow.","zh":"赋予代理创建全面检查列表的能力，以便用户验证，确保在上传到YouTube之前采取所有必要步骤，利用激活触发器（如''准备上传''和''验证YouTube''）来简化工作流程。","ja":"エージェントがユーザーの検証のための包括的なチェックリストを作成する機能を提供し、YouTube にアップロードする前に必要なすべての手順を実行することを保証し、''アップロードの準備''や''YouTube の検証''などのアクティベーション トリガーを使用してワークフローを合理化します。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 확인을 위한 포괄적인 체크리스트를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 유튜브에 업로드하기 전에 모든 필요한 단계를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, ''업로드 준비'' 또는 ''유튜브 검증''과 같은 활성화 트리거를 사용하여 워크플ロー를 최적화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear listas de verificación exhaustivas para la verificación de usuarios, asegurando que se tomen todos los pasos necesarios antes de subir a YouTube, utilizando desencadenadores de activación como ''preparar carga'' y ''validar para youtube'' para optimizar el flujo de trabajo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des listes de contrôle exhaustives pour la vérification des utilisateurs, en garantissant que toutes les étapes nécessaires sont prises avant de télécharger sur YouTube, en utilisant des déclencheurs d''activation tels que ''préparer le téléchargement'' et ''valider pour youtube'' pour rationaliser le flux de travail.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Checklisten für die Benutzerverifizierung zu erstellen, um sicherzustellen, dass alle notwendigen Schritte vor dem Upload auf YouTube durchgeführt werden, indem Aktivierungstrigger wie ''Hochladen vorbereiten'' und ''Für YouTube validieren'' verwendet werden, um den Arbeitsablauf zu optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar listas de verificação abrangentes para verificação do usuário, garantindo que todas as etapas necessárias sejam realizadas antes de fazer upload para o YouTube, utilizando gatilhos de ativação como ''preparar upload'' e ''validar para youtube'' para otimizar o fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать всесторонние контрольные списки для проверки пользователя, гарантируя, что все необходимые шаги предпринимаются до загрузки на YouTube, используя триггеры активации, такие как ''подготовить загрузку'' и ''проверить для YouTube'', для оптимизации рабочего процесса.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إنشاء قائمة شاملة للتحقق من المستخدم، وضمان اتخاذ جميع الإجراءات اللازمة قبل تحميلها على يوتيوب، باستخدام أجهزة تحفيزية مثل ''إعداد التحميل'' و ''التحقق من يوتيوب'' لتحسين سير العمل."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating video metadata before upload","Generating pre-upload checklists for YouTube","Automating content preview for user verification"],"zh":["上传前验证视频元数据","为YouTube生成预上传检查列表","自动化内容预览以用于用户验证"],"ja":["アップロード前の動画メタデータの検証","YouTube 用のプレアップロード チェックリストの生成","ユーザーの検証用のコンテンツ プレビューの自動化"],"ko":["업로드 전 비디오 메타데이터 검증","유튜브 업로드용 프리업로드 체크리스트 생성","사용자 확인을 위한 콘텐츠 미리보기 자동화"],"es":["Validar metadatos de video antes de la carga","Generar listas de verificación previas a la carga para YouTube","Automatizar la vista previa de contenido para la verificación de usuarios"],"fr":["Valider les métadonnées vidéo avant le téléchargement","Générer des listes de contrôle avant le téléchargement pour YouTube","Automatiser l''aperçu de contenu pour la vérification des utilisateurs"],"de":["Video-Metadaten vor dem Upload validieren","Vorab-Checklisten für YouTube-Uploads generieren","Automatisieren der Inhaltsvorschau für die Benutzerverifizierung"],"pt":["Validar metadados de vídeo antes do upload","Gerar listas de verificação pré-upload para o YouTube","Automatizar a visualização de conteúdo para verificação do usuário"],"ru":["Проверка метаданных видео перед загрузкой","Генерация контрольных списков перед загрузкой на YouTube","Автоматизация предварительного просмотра контента для проверки пользователя"],"ar":["التحقق من بيانات الفيديو الوصفية قبل التحميل","إنشاء قائمة التحقق قبل التحميل على يوتيوب","تأتمة معاينة المحتوى للتحقق من المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires project name detection or user input","Limited to YouTube upload preparation"],"zh":["需要项目名称检测或用户输入","仅限YouTube上传准备"],"ja":["プロジェクト名の検出またはユーザー入力が必要","YouTube アップロードの準備のみ"],"ko":["프로젝트 이름 감지 또는 사용자 입력이 필요함","유튜브 업로드 준비에만 한정됨"],"es":["Requiere la detección del nombre del proyecto o la entrada del usuario","Limitado a la preparación de subida a YouTube"],"fr":["Nécessite la détection du nom du projet ou la saisie de l''utilisateur","Limité à la préparation du téléchargement sur YouTube"],"de":["Benötigt die Projektnamenerkennung oder die Benutzereingabe","Begrenzt auf die Vorbereitung des Uploads auf YouTube"],"pt":["Exige detecção de nome do projeto ou entrada do usuário","Limitado à preparação de upload do YouTube"],"ru":["Требует обнаружения имени проекта или ввода пользователя","Ограничен подготовкой загрузки на YouTube"],"ar":["يتطلب كشف اسم المشروع أو إدخال المستخدم","محدود بالتحضير لتحميل يوتيوب"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
