lot 评论并生成 markdown 报告的工具","ja":"GitHub Copilot PR コメントツールは、GitHub Copilot のコメントを抽出し markdown レポートを生成するツールです","ko":"GitHub Copilot PR 댓글 도구는 GitHub Copilot 댓글을 추출하고 markdown 보고서를 생성하는 도구입니다","es":"Herramienta para extraer comentarios de revisión de GitHub Copilot y generar informes en markdown","fr":"Outil pour extraire les commentaires de révision de GitHub Copilot et générer des rapports en markdown","de":"Werkzeug zum Extrahieren von GitHub Copilot-Überprüfungskommentaren und Erstellen von Markdown-Berichten","pt":"O GitHub Copilot PR Comments é uma ferramenta para extrair comentários de revisão do GitHub Copilot de uma PR e criar um relatório em markdown.","ru":"Комментарии PR GitHub Copilot - это инструмент для извлечения комментариев к ревью GitHub Copilot из PR и создания отчета в markdown.","ar":"تعليقات PR على GitHub Copilot هي أداة لاستخراج تعليقات مراجعة GitHub Copilot من طلب سحب وإنشاء تقرير بالتنسيق markdown","en":"A Versatile Compression Tool for Efficient Storage of Mass-Spectrometry Data"},"definition":{"en":"A Versatile Compression Tool for Efficient Storage of Mass-Spectrometry Data"},"features":{"zh":["提取 GitHub Copilot 评论","生成 markdown 报告","支持 gh CLI 和 jq","可自定义输出文件","支持多语言"],"ja":["GitHub Copilot のコメントを抽出","markdown レポートを生成","gh CLI と jq をサポート","出力ファイルをカスタマイズ","多言語をサポート"],"ko":["GitHub Copilot 댓글 추출","markdown 보고서 생성","gh CLI 및 jq 지원","출력 파일 맞춤설정","다국어 지원"],"es":["Extrae comentarios de revisión de GitHub Copilot","Genera informes en markdown","Utiliza la CLI de GitHub","Procesa JSON con jq","Soporta parámetros personalizables"],"fr":["Extrait les commentaires de révision de GitHub Copilot","Génère des rapports en markdown","Utilise la CLI de GitHub","Traite le JSON avec jq","Prend en charge les paramètres personnalisables"],"de":["Extrahiert GitHub Copilot-Überprüfungskommentare","Erstellt Markdown-Berichte","Verwendet die GitHub-CLI","Verarbeitet JSON mit jq","Unterstützt anpassbare Parameter"],"pt":["Extração de comentários de revisão do GitHub Copilot","Criação de relatório em markdown","Utilização do `gh` CLI","Autenticação com `gh auth login`","Processamento de JSON com `jq`"],"ru":["Извлечение комментариев к ревью GitHub Copilot","Создание отчета в markdown","Использование `gh` CLI","Аутентификация с `gh auth login`","Обработка JSON с `jq`"],"ar":["استخراج تعليقات مراجعة GitHub Copilot","إنشاء تقرير بالتنسيق markdown","استخدام `gh` CLI","التحقق من الصحة باستخدام `gh auth login`","معالجة JSON باستخدام `jq`"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub Copilot","PR 评论","markdown 报告","gh CLI","jq","命令行工具","开发工具","代码审查"],"ja":["GitHub Copilot","PR コメント","markdown レポート","gh CLI","jq","コマンドラインツール","開発ツール","コードレビュー"],"ko":["GitHub Copilot","PR 댓글","markdown 보고서","gh CLI","jq","명령줄 도구","개발 도구","코드 리뷰"],"es":["GitHub Copilot","comentarios de revisión","informes en markdown","CLI de GitHub","jq","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["GitHub Copilot","commentaires de révision","rapports en markdown","CLI de GitHub","jq","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["GitHub Copilot","Überprüfungskommentare","Markdown-Berichte","GitHub-CLI","jq","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklertools"],"pt":["GitHub Copilot","Comentários de PR","Relatório em markdown","Ferramenta de desenvolvimento","Extração de comentários","Revisão de código"],"ru":["GitHub Copilot","Комментарии PR","Отчет в markdown","Инструмент для разработчиков","Извлечение комментариев","Проверка кода"],"ar":["GitHub Copilot","تعليقات PR","تقرير بالتنسيق markdown","أداة تطوير","استخراج تعليقات","مراجعة الكود"]}},"owner":"chrisagrams","repo":"mscompress","repoPath":"chrisagrams/mscompress","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-copilot-pr-comments","description":"Fetch GitHub Copilot code review comments from a pull request and generate a structured markdown report with all suggestions, inline comments, and review summaries using the `gh` CLI. Use when the user wants to: (1) see what Copilot said about a PR, (2) extract Copilot suggestions from a pull request, (3) generate a report of Copilot review feedback, (4) collect AI code review comments into a document. Triggers on mentions of Copilot comments, Copilot review, Copilot suggestions, PR review by Copilot, or any request to get/extract/summarize GitHub Copilot feedback on a pull request.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Copilot PR Comments Skill\n\nExtract GitHub Copilot review comments from a PR and produce a markdown report using `gh` CLI.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- **`gh`** CLI installed and authenticated (`gh auth login`)\n- **`jq`** installed for JSON processing\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n./scripts/fetch_copilot_comments.sh <owner/repo> <pr_number> [output_file]\n```\n\n### Parameters\n\n| Param         | Required | Description                                    |\n|---------------|----------|---------------------------","body":"# GitHub Copilot PR Comments Skill\n\nExtract GitHub Copilot review comments from a PR and produce a markdown report using `gh` CLI.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- **`gh`** CLI installed and authenticated (`gh auth login`)\n- **`jq`** installed for JSON processing\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n./scripts/fetch_copilot_comments.sh <owner/repo> <pr_number> [output_file]\n```\n\n### Parameters\n\n| Param         | Required | Description                                    |\n|---------------|----------|------------------------------------------------|\n| `owner/repo`  | Yes      | Full repo identifier, e.g. `microsoft/vscode`  |\n| `pr_number`   | Yes      | PR number                                      |\n| `output_file` | No       | Output markdown path (default: `copilot_review.md`) |\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Ask the user for repo and PR number if not provided.\n2. Verify `gh` is authenticated (`gh auth status`). If not, instruct the user to run `gh auth login`.\n3. Run: `bash scripts/fetch_copilot_comments.sh <owner/repo> <pr_number> /home/claude/copilot_review.md`\n4. Copy output to `/mnt/user-data/outputs/copilot_review.md` and present to the user.\n\n## Output Format\n\nThe generated markdown includes:\n\n- **PR metadata** — title, author, link, creation date\n- **Summary** — total Copilot comments by type, files reviewed, suggestion count\n- **Review summaries** — top-level Copilot review bodies with approval state\n- **Inline code comments** — grouped by file with diff context, line numbers, and `suggestion` blocks\n- **General comments** — issue-level comments from Copilot\n\n## Copilot Detection\n\nComments are attributed to Copilot if the author login matches: `copilot`, `copilot[bot]`, `github-copilot`, `github-copilot[bot]`, `github-advanced-security[bot]`, or any bot user with \"copilot\" in the login."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:52:43.134Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated GitHub Copilot review comment extraction and reporting.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化 GitHub Copilot 评论提取和报告的开发代理。","ja":"GitHub Copilot のレビューコメントの自動抽出と報告が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub Copilot 리뷰 댓글 추출 및 보고서 자동화가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan la extracción automática de comentarios de revisión de GitHub Copilot y su informe.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une extraction automatique de commentaires de révision GitHub Copilot et de leur rapport.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Extraktion von GitHub Copilot-Review-Kommentaren und deren Berichterstellung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de extração automática de comentários de revisão do GitHub Copilot e relatórios.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется автоматическая выгрузка комментариев к обзору GitHub Copilot и отчетов.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى استخراج تلقائي لتعليقات مراجعة GitHub Copilot والتقرير."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently process GitHub Copilot comments using the `gh` CLI and `jq` for JSON processing, producing markdown reports for streamlined PR reviews.","zh":"使代理能够使用 `gh` CLI 和 `jq` 进行 JSON 处理，高效地处理 GitHub Copilot 评论，并生成 markdown 报告以简化 PR 审查。","ja":"`gh` CLI と `jq` を使用して JSON を処理することで、GitHub Copilot のコメントを効率的に処理し、PR のレビューを簡素化するための markdown レポートを生成します。","ko":"`gh` CLI와 `jq`를 사용하여 JSON을 처리하여 GitHub Copilot의 댓글을 효율적으로 처리하고 PR 리뷰를 간소화하기 위한 마크다운 보고서를 생성합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes procesar de manera eficiente los comentarios de GitHub Copilot utilizando la CLI `gh` y `jq` para el procesamiento de JSON, produciendo informes en markdown para revisiones de PR optimizadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traiter efficacement les commentaires GitHub Copilot en utilisant la CLI `gh` et `jq` pour le traitement JSON, produisant des rapports markdown pour des révisions de PR rationalisées.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, GitHub Copilot-Kommentare effizient mithilfe der `gh`-CLI und `jq` für JSON-Verarbeitung zu verarbeiten, um markdown-Berichte für optimierte PR-Überprüfungen zu erstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a processar com eficiência os comentários do GitHub Copilot usando a CLI `gh` e `jq` para processamento de JSON, produzindo relatórios em markdown para revisões de PR otimizadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно обрабатывать комментарии GitHub Copilot с помощью CLI `gh` и `jq` для обработки JSON, производя отчеты в markdown для оптимизированных обзоров PR.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على معالجة تعليقات GitHub Copilot بفعالية باستخدام CLI `gh` و `jq` لمعالجة JSON ، وإنتاج تقارير بالشكل النصي لمقارنة PR المُستَملة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating GitHub Copilot comment extraction for PRs","Generating markdown reports for code review summaries","Debugging PR comment issues using `jq` for JSON analysis"],"zh":["自动化 GitHub Copilot 评论提取用于 PR","生成 markdown 报告用于代码审查摘要","使用 `jq` 进行 JSON 分析来调试 PR 评论问题"],"ja":["PR 用の GitHub Copilot コメントの自動抽出","コードレビューリングサマリー用の markdown レポートの生成","PR コメントの問題をデバッグするために `jq` を使用した JSON 分析"],"ko":["PR용 GitHub Copilot 댓글 자동 추출","코드 리뷰 요약을 위한 마크다운 보고서 생성","PR 댓글 문제를 디버깅하기 위한 `jq`를 사용한 JSON 분석"],"es":["Automatización de la extracción de comentarios de GitHub Copilot para PR","Generación de informes en markdown para resúmenes de revisión de código","Depuración de problemas de comentarios de PR utilizando `jq` para análisis de JSON"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''extraction de commentaires GitHub Copilot pour les PR","Génération de rapports markdown pour les résumés de révision de code","Débogage des problèmes de commentaires de PR en utilisant `jq` pour l''analyse JSON"],"de":["Automatisierung der Extraktion von GitHub Copilot-Kommentaren für PR","Erstellung von markdown-Berichten für Code-Review-Zusammenfassungen","Fehlerbehebung bei PR-Kommentarproblemen unter Verwendung von `jq` für JSON-Analyse"],"pt":["Automatizar a extração de comentários do GitHub Copilot para PRs","Gerar relatórios em markdown para resumos de revisão de código","Depurar problemas de comentários de PR usando `jq` para análise de JSON"],"ru":["Автоматизировать выгрузку комментариев GitHub Copilot для PR","Генерировать отчеты в markdown для сводок обзора кода","Отлаживать проблемы с комментариями PR с помощью `jq` для анализа JSON"],"ar":["توفير آلي لاستخراج تعليقات GitHub Copilot لمراجعات PR","إنتاج تقارير بالشكل النصي لموجزات مراجعة الكود","تصحيح أخطاء تعليقات PR باستخدام `jq` لتحليل JSON"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `gh` CLI installed and authenticated","Requires `jq` installed for JSON processing","Limited to GitHub Copilot PR comments only"],"zh":["需要安装和认证 `gh` CLI","需要安装 `jq` 用于 JSON 处理","仅限 GitHub Copilot PR 评论"],"ja":["`gh` CLI がインストールされ、認証されている必要があります","JSON 処理のために `jq` がインストールされている必要があります","GitHub Copilot の PR コメントのみに制限されます"],"ko":["`gh` CLI가 설치되고 인증되어야 합니다","JSON 처리를 위해 `jq`가 설치되어야 합니다","GitHub Copilot의 PR 댓글만으로 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere la CLI `gh` instalada y autenticada","Requiere `jq` instalado para el procesamiento de JSON","Limitado a comentarios de PR de GitHub Copilot solo"],"fr":["Nécessite la CLI `gh` installée et authentifiée","Nécessite `jq` installé pour le traitement JSON","Limité aux commentaires de PR GitHub Copilot uniquement"],"de":["Benötigt die `gh`-CLI installiert und authentifiziert","Benötigt `jq` installiert für die JSON-Verarbeitung","Begrenzt auf GitHub Copilot-PR-Kommentare nur"],"pt":["Requer a CLI `gh` instalada e autenticada","Requer `jq` instalado para processamento de JSON","Limitado a comentários de PR do GitHub Copilot apenas"],"ru":["Требует установленной и аутентифицированной CLI `gh`","Требует установленного `jq` для обработки JSON","Ограничен только комментариями PR GitHub Copilot"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتصريح CLI `gh`","يتطلب تثبيت `jq` لمعالجة JSON","محدود بالتعليقات على PR من GitHub Copilot فقط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
