dotfiles: Настройка Neovim, Tmux и Zsh","ar":"تحرير dotfiles: إعداد Neovim و Tmux و Zsh","en":"dotfiles-editing"},"description":{"zh":"dotfiles 编辑工具提供了对 Neovim、tmux 和 zsh 的配置文件管理和编辑支持","ja":"dotfiles 編集ツールは、Neovim、tmux、zsh の設定ファイルの管理と編集をサポートします","ko":"dotfiles 편집 도구는 Neovim, tmux, zsh의 설정 파일 관리 및 편집을 지원합니다","es":"La edición de dotfiles es crucial para personalizar tu entorno de desarrollo. Aprende a configurar vim, tmux y zsh para mejorar tu productividad.","fr":"L''édition de dotfiles est cruciale pour personnaliser votre environnement de développement. Découvrez comment configurer vim, tmux et zsh pour améliorer votr...","de":"Die Bearbeitung von dotfiles ist entscheidend, um Ihre Entwicklungsumgebung zu personalisieren. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie vim, tmux und zsh konfigurieren, um Ihr...","pt":"A edição de dotfiles permite personalizar a configuração de Neovim, Tmux e Zsh. Saiba como editar e testar esses arquivos para melhorar sua produtividade.","ru":"Редактирование dotfiles позволяет настроить конфигурацию Neovim, Tmux и Zsh. Узнайте, как редактировать и тестировать эти файлы, чтобы повысить свою производ...","ar":"تحرير dotfiles يسمح بتخصيص إعدادات Neovim و Tmux و Zsh. تعلم كيفية تحرير واختبار هذه الملفات لتحسين إنتاجيتك.","en":"設定ファイル集"},"definition":{"en":"設定ファイル集"},"features":{"zh":["Neovim 配置文件管理","tmux 配置文件管理","zsh 配置文件管理","键盘映射编辑","代码片段管理"],"ja":["Neovim 設定ファイルの管理","tmux 設定ファイルの管理","zsh 設定ファイルの管理","キーマップの編集","コードスニペットの管理"],"ko":["Neovim 설정 파일 관리","tmux 설정 파일 관리","zsh 설정 파일 관리","키 매핑 편집","코드 스니펫 관리"],"es":["Configuración de vim","Configuración de tmux","Configuración de zsh","Edición de archivos de configuración","Personalización de la interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Configuration de vim","Configuration de tmux","Configuration de zsh","Édition de fichiers de configuration","Personnalisation de l''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Konfiguration von vim","Konfiguration von tmux","Konfiguration von zsh","Bearbeitung von Konfigurationsdateien","Anpassung der Benutzeroberfläche"],"pt":["Configuração de Neovim","Configuração de Tmux","Configuração de Zsh","Edição de arquivos de configuração","Teste de configurações","Personalização da experiência de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Настройка Neovim","Настройка Tmux","Настройка Zsh","Редактирование файлов конфигурации","Тестирование конфигураций","Настройка опыта разработки"],"ar":["تكوين Neovim","تكوين Tmux","تكوين Zsh","تحرير ملفات التكوين","اختبار الإعدادات","تخصيص تجربة التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["dotfiles","配置文件管理","Neovim","tmux","zsh","键盘映射","代码片段"],"ja":["dotfiles","設定ファイルの管理","Neovim","tmux","zsh","キーマップ","コードスニペット"],"ko":["dotfiles","설정 파일 관리","Neovim","tmux","zsh","키 매핑","코드 스니펫"],"es":["dotfiles","vim","tmux","zsh","configuración","edición","desarrollo","productividad","personalización"],"fr":["dotfiles","vim","tmux","zsh","configuration","édition","développement","productivité","personnalisation"],"de":["dotfiles","vim","tmux","zsh","konfiguration","bearbeitung","entwicklung","produktivität","anpassung"],"pt":["dotfiles","Neovim","Tmux","Zsh","configuração","edição","desenvolvimento","produtividade","personalização"],"ru":["dotfiles","Neovim","Tmux","Zsh","конфигурация","редактирование","разработка","производительность","настройка"],"ar":["dotfiles","Neovim","Tmux","Zsh","تكوين","تحرير","تطوير","إنتاجية","تخصيص"]}},"owner":"sgotand","repo":".dotfiles","repoPath":"sgotand/.dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dotfiles-editing","description":"Help editing vim/tmux/zsh configurations. Use when user mentions edit vim config, modify tmux, change zsh, add plugin, customize neovim, update alias, init.lua, vimrc, tmux.conf, zshrc, or configuration changes.","bodyPreview":"# dotfiles Configuration Editing\n\nvim/tmux/zsh設定の編集とテストを支援する。\n\n## File Structure Overview\n\n### Neovim\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `init.lua` | Main entry point |\n| `vim/lua/lazy-config.lua` | Plugin management (lazy.nvim) |\n| `vim/lua/map.lua` | Key mappings |\n| `vim/lua/edit.lua` | Editor settings |\n| `vim/ftplugin/*.vim` | Filetype-specific settings |\n| `vim/snippets/*.snip` | Custom snippets |\n\n### tmux\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `tmux.conf` | Main configuration |\n|","body":"# dotfiles Configuration Editing\n\nvim/tmux/zsh設定の編集とテストを支援する。\n\n## File Structure Overview\n\n### Neovim\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `init.lua` | Main entry point |\n| `vim/lua/lazy-config.lua` | Plugin management (lazy.nvim) |\n| `vim/lua/map.lua` | Key mappings |\n| `vim/lua/edit.lua` | Editor settings |\n| `vim/ftplugin/*.vim` | Filetype-specific settings |\n| `vim/snippets/*.snip` | Custom snippets |\n\n### tmux\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `tmux.conf` | Main configuration |\n| `tmux_readme.md` | Keybinding reference |\n\n### zsh\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `zshrc` | Main configuration |\n| `zshenv` | Environment variables |\n| `zsh/alias.zsh` | Shell aliases |\n| `zsh/zinit.zsh` | Plugin management |\n\nFor complete file structure, see [references/file-structure.md](references/file-structure.md).\n\n## Editing Guidelines\n\n### Add Neovim Plugin\n\nEdit `vim/lua/lazy-config.lua`:\n\n```lua\n{\n  \"author/plugin-name\",\n  config = function()\n    -- configuration\n  end,\n},\n```\n\n### Add tmux Plugin\n\nEdit `tmux.conf`:\n\n```\nset -g @plugin ''tmux-plugins/plugin-name''\n```\n\n### Add Shell Alias\n\nEdit `zsh/alias.zsh`:\n\n```bash\nalias name=''command''\n```\n\n### Add Environment Variable\n\nEdit `zshenv`:\n\n```bash\nexport VAR_NAME=\"value\"\n```\n\n## Testing Changes\n\nUse Docker sandbox to test:\n\n```bash\nmake shell\n# Inside container:\nsource ~/.zshrc              # zsh\ntmux source ~/.tmux.conf     # tmux\n:source $MYVIMRC             # neovim\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. Test changes in Docker before committing\n2. Add comments explaining configuration intent\n3. Make incremental changes, test each one\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:52:46.970Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing advanced configuration editing capabilities for vim, tmux, and zsh.","zh":"非常适合需要高级配置编辑功能的vim、tmux和zsh的开发者代理。","ja":"vim、tmux、zshの高度な設定編集機能を必要とする開発者エージェントに最適です。","ko":"vim, tmux, zsh의 고급 구성 편집 기능을 필요한 개발자 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan capacidades de edición de configuración avanzada para vim, tmux y zsh.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développeur ayant besoin de capacités de modification de configuration avancées pour vim, tmux et zsh.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte Konfigurationsbearbeitungsfunktionen für vim, tmux und zsh benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de edição de configuração para vim, tmux e zsh.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработчиков, которым необходимы расширенные возможности редактирования конфигурации для vim, tmux и zsh.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتحرير التكوين لبرامج vim و tmux و zsh."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Neovim configurations via init.lua and lazy.nvim, while also editing tmux.conf files for seamless terminal management, utilizing key mappings and filetype-specific settings.","zh":"赋予代理管理Neovim配置的能力，通过init.lua和lazy.nvim，同时也可以编辑tmux.conf文件以实现无缝的终端管理，利用按键映射和文件类型特定设置。","ja":"エージェントがNeovimの設定をinit.luaとlazy.nvim経由で管理できるようにし、同時にtmux.confファイルを編集してシームレスなターミナル管理を実現し、キーマッピングとファイルタイプ特有の設定を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Neovim 구성 관리를 init.lua 및 lazy.nvim을 통해 가능하게 하며,同時에 tmux.conf 파일을 편집하여 무결점 터미널 관리를 구현하며, 키 매핑 및 파일 유형별 설정을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar configuraciones de Neovim a través de init.lua y lazy.nvim, mientras también edita archivos tmux.conf para una gestión de terminal sin problemas, utilizando asignaciones de claves y configuraciones específicas de tipo de archivo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les configurations de Neovim via init.lua et lazy.nvim, tout en éditant les fichiers tmux.conf pour une gestion de terminal transparente, en utilisant des mappages de clés et des paramètres spécifiques au type de fichier.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Neovim-Konfigurationen über init.lua und lazy.nvim zu verwalten, während auch tmux.conf-Dateien für eine nahtlose Terminalverwaltung bearbeitet werden, unter Verwendung von Tastenzuweisungen und dateitypspezifischen Einstellungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar configurações do Neovim por meio do init.lua e do lazy.nvim, além de editar arquivos tmux.conf para gerenciamento de terminal sem interrupções, utilizando mapeamentos de teclas e configurações específicas de tipo de arquivo.","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять конфигурациями Neovim через init.lua и lazy.nvim, а также редактировать файлы tmux.conf для бесперебойного управления терминалом, используя сопоставления клавиш и настройки, специфичные для типа файла.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة تكوينات Neovim من خلال init.lua و lazy.nvim، بالإضافة إلى تحرير ملفات tmux.conf لتدبير محطة العمل دون انقطاع، باستخدام ترسبات المفاتيح وإعدادات محددة لنوع الملف."},"useCases":{"en":["Editing vim/lua/config.lua for plugin management","Customizing tmux.conf for personalized terminal layouts","Generating filetype-specific settings for efficient coding"],"zh":["编辑vim/lua/config.lua以管理插件","自定义tmux.conf以实现个性化终端布局","生成文件类型特定设置以实现高效编码"],"ja":["vim/lua/config.luaを編集してプラグインを管理する","tmux.confをカスタマイズしてパーソナライズされたターミナルレイアウトを実現する","ファイルタイプ特有の設定を生成して効率的なコーディングを実現する"],"ko":["vim/lua/config.lua 편집을 통해 플러그인 관리","tmux.conf를 사용자 지정하여 개인화된 터미널 레이아웃을 구현","파일 유형별 설정을 생성하여 효율적인 코딩을 구현"],"es":["Edición de vim/lua/config.lua para la gestión de complementos","Personalización de tmux.conf para diseños de terminal personalizados","Generación de configuraciones específicas de tipo de archivo para una codificación eficiente"],"fr":["Édition de vim/lua/config.lua pour la gestion de plugins","Personnalisation de tmux.conf pour des dispositions de terminal personnalisées","Génération de paramètres spécifiques au type de fichier pour une codification efficace"],"de":["Bearbeitung von vim/lua/config.lua für die Verwaltung von Plug-ins","Anpassung von tmux.conf für personalisierte Terminallayouts","Generierung von dateitypspezifischen Einstellungen für effizientes Codieren"],"pt":["Edição de vim/lua/config.lua para gerenciamento de plugins","Personalização de tmux.conf para layouts de terminal personalizados","Geração de configurações específicas de tipo de arquivo para codificação eficiente"],"ru":["Редактирование vim/lua/config.lua для управления плагинами","Настройка tmux.conf для индивидуальных макетов терминала","Генерация настроек, специфичных для типа файла, для эффективного кодирования"],"ar":["تحرير vim/lua/config.lua لإدارة الإضافات","تخصيص ملف tmux.conf لمخططات محطة العمل المُخصصة","توليد إعدادات محددة لنوع الملف من أجل الترميز الفعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires vim, tmux, and zsh installations","Limited to configuration file editing"],"zh":["需要vim、tmux和zsh的安装","仅限于配置文件编辑"],"ja":["vim、tmux、zshのインストールが必要","設定ファイルの編集のみ"],"ko":["vim, tmux, zsh 설치 필요","구성 파일 편집만 제한"],"es":["Requiere instalaciones de vim, tmux y zsh","Limitado a la edición de archivos de configuración"],"fr":["Nécessite des installations de vim, tmux et zsh","Limité à l''édition de fichiers de configuration"],"de":["Erfordert Installationen von vim, tmux und zsh","Begrenzt auf die Bearbeitung von Konfigurationsdateien"],"pt":["Requer instalações de vim, tmux e zsh","Limitado à edição de arquivos de configuração"],"ru":["Требует установки vim, tmux и zsh","Ограничен редактированием файлов конфигурации"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت برامج vim و tmux و zsh","محدود بتحرير ملفات التكوين"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('Embassy-of-the-Free-Mind/sourcelibrary-v2/batch-translate', 'community', 'Embassy-of-the-Free-Mind', 'sourcelibrary-v2', 'Embassy-of-the-Free-Mind/sourcelibrary-v2', 'batch-translate', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z', '2026-02-18T03:52:47.020Z', NULL, '{"id":"Embassy-of-the-Free-Mind/sourcelibrary-v2/batch-translate","name":"batch-translate","description":{"zh":"批量翻译技能，可以对书籍进行OCR和翻译处理，支持多语言","ja":"バッチ翻訳スキル、書籍のOCRと翻訳処理をサポート","ko":"배치 번역 기술, 책의 OCR 및 번역 처리를 지원","es":"La herramienta de traducción por lotes procesa libros a través de un flujo de trabajo completo: recorte, OCR y traducción","fr":"L''outil de traduction batch traite les livres à travers un flux de travail complet : découpage, OCR et traduction","de":"Das Batch-Übersetzungstool verarbeitet Bücher durch einen kompletten Workflow: Zuschneiden, OCR und Übersetzung","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho de tradução em lote processa livros antigos por meio de um pipeline completo: recorte, OCR e tradução","ru":"Поток пакетного перевода обрабатывает древние книги через полный конвейер: обрезка, OCR и перевод","ar":"تدفق عمل ترجمة دفعة من الكتب القديمة يعالج الكتب من خلال خط أنابيب كامل: قص و OCR وترجمة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"批量翻译技能","ja":"バッチ翻訳スキル","ko":"배치 번역 기술","es":"Traducción por lotes de libros","fr":"Traduction batch de livres","de":"Batch-Buchübersetzung","pt":"Tradução em Lote de Livros Antigos","ru":"Пакетный перевод древних книг","ar":"ترجمة دفعة من الكتب القديمة","en":"batch-translate"},"description":{"zh":"批量翻译技能，可以对书籍进行OCR和翻译处理，支持多语言","ja":"バッチ翻訳スキル、書籍のOCRと翻訳処理をサポート","ko":"배치 번역 기술, 책의 OCR 및 번역 처리를 지원","es":"La herramienta de traducción por lotes procesa libros a través de un flujo de trabajo completo: recorte, OCR y traducción","fr":"L''outil de traduction batch traite les livres à travers un flux de travail complet : découpage, OCR et traduction","de":"Das Batch-Übersetzungstool verarbeitet Bücher durch einen kompletten Workflow: Zuschneiden, OCR und Übersetzung","pt":"O fluxo de trabalho de tradução em lote processa livros antigos por meio de um pipeline completo: recorte, OCR e tradução","ru":"Поток пакетного перевода обрабатывает древние книги через полный конвейер: обрезка, OCR и перевод","ar":"تدفق عمل ترجمة دفعة من الكتب القديمة يعالج الكتب من خلال خط أنابيب كامل: قص و OCR وترجمة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["批量处理","OCR识别","多语言支持","自动化翻译","高效处理"],"ja":["バッチ処理","OCR認識","多言語対応","自動翻訳","効率的な処理"],"ko":["배치 처리","OCR 인식","다국어 지원","자동 번역","효율적인 처리"],"es":["Procesamiento de libros a través de un flujo de trabajo completo","Recorte y OCR para mejorar la calidad de la traducción","Priorización de la traducción según la lista de prioridades","Compatibilidad con múltiples formatos de libros","Integración con herramientas de traducción automática"],"fr":["Traitement de livres à travers un flux de travail complet","Découpage et OCR pour améliorer la qualité de la traduction","Priorisation de la traduction selon la liste de priorités","Compatibilité avec plusieurs formats de livres","Intégration avec des outils de traduction automatisée"],"de":["Verarbeitung von Büchern durch einen kompletten Workflow","Zuschneiden und OCR zur Verbesserung der Übersetzungsqualität","Priorisierung der Übersetzung nach der Prioritätenliste","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Buchformaten","Integration mit Tools für automatische Übersetzung"],"pt":["Processamento de livros antigos","Recorte e OCR de textos","Tradução para diferentes idiomas","Prioridade para livros não traduzidos","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de arquivos","Integração com pipelines de processamento de texto"],"ru":["Обработка древних книг","Обрезка и OCR текстов","Перевод на разные языки","Приоритет для не переведенных книг","Поддержка нескольких форматов файлов","Интеграция с конвейерами обработки текста"],"ar":["معالجة الكتب القديمة","قص و OCR من النصوص","ترجمة إلى لغات مختلفة","الاولوية للكتب غير المترجمة","دعم لمعايير الملفات المتعددة","التكامل مع خطوط أنابيب معالجة النص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["批量翻译","书籍翻译","OCR技术","自动化翻译","多语言支持","高效处理"],"ja":["バッチ翻訳","書籍翻訳","OCR技術","自動翻訳","多言語対応","効率的な処理"],"ko":["배치 번역","책 번역","OCR 기술","자동 번역","다국어 지원","효율적인 처리"],"es":["traducción por lotes","traducción automática","procesamiento de libros","OCR","recorte","priorización de la traducción","lista de prioridades","compatibilidad con formatos de libros","integración con herramientas de traducción"],"fr":["traduction batch","traduction automatisée","traitement de livres","OCR","découpage","priorisation de la traduction","liste de priorités","compatibilité avec les formats de livres","intégration avec les outils de traduction"],"de":["Batch-Übersetzung","automatische Übersetzung","Buchverarbeitung","OCR","Zuschneiden","Priorisierung der Übersetzung","Prioritätenliste","Kompatibilität mit Buchformaten","Integration mit Übersetzungstools"],"pt":["tradução em lote","livros antigos","recorte","OCR","tradução","processamento de texto","pipeline de tradução","idiomas","nlp"],"ru":["пакетный перевод","древние книги","обрезка","OCR","перевод","обработка текста","конвейер перевода","языки","nlp"],"ar":["ترجمة دفعة","الكتب القديمة","قص","OCR","ترجمة","معالجة النص","خط أنابيب الترجمة","اللغات","nlp"]}},"owner":"Embassy-of-the-Free-Mind","repo":"sourcelibrary-v2","repoPath":"Embassy-of-the-Free-Mind/sourcelibrary-v2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"batch-translate","description":"Batch process books through the complete pipeline - generate cropped images for split pages, OCR all pages, then translate with context. Use when asked to process, OCR, translate, or batch process one or more books.","bodyPreview":"# Batch Book Translation Workflow\n\nProcess books through the complete pipeline: Crop → OCR → Translate\n\n## Roadmap Reference\n\nSee `.claude/ROADMAP.md` for the translation priority list.\n\n**Priority 1 = UNTRANSLATED** - These are highest priority for processing:\n- Kircher encyclopedias (Oedipus, Musurgia, Ars Magna Lucis)\n- Fludd: Utriusque Cosmi Historia\n- Theatrum Chemicum, Musaeum Hermeticum\n- Cardano: De Subtilitate\n- Della Porta: Magia Naturalis\n- Lomazzo, Poliziano, Landino\n\n```bash\n# Get r","body":"# Batch Book Translation Workflow\n\nProcess books through the complete pipeline: Crop → OCR → Translate\n\n## Roadmap Reference\n\nSee `.claude/ROADMAP.md` for the translation priority list.\n\n**Priority 1 = UNTRANSLATED** - These are highest priority for processing:\n- Kircher encyclopedias (Oedipus, Musurgia, Ars Magna Lucis)\n- Fludd: Utriusque Cosmi Historia\n- Theatrum Chemicum, Musaeum Hermeticum\n- Cardano: De Subtilitate\n- Della Porta: Magia Naturalis\n- Lomazzo, Poliziano, Landino\n\n```bash\n# Get roadmap with priorities\ncurl -s \"https://sourcelibrary.org/api/books/roadmap\" | jq ''.books[] | select(.priority == 1) | {title, notes}''\n```\n\nRoadmap source: `src/app/api/books/roadmap/route.ts`\n\n## Overview\n\nThis workflow handles the full processing pipeline for historical book scans:\n1. **Generate Cropped Images** - For split two-page spreads, extract individual pages\n2. **OCR** - Extract text from page images using Gemini vision\n3. **Translate** - Translate OCR''d text with prior page context for continuity\n\n## API Endpoints\n\n| Endpoint | Purpose |\n|----------|---------|\n| `GET /api/books` | List all books |\n| `GET /api/books/BOOK_ID` | Get book with all pages |\n| `POST /api/jobs/queue-books` | Queue pages for Lambda worker processing (primary path) |\n| `GET /api/jobs` | List processing jobs |\n| `POST /api/jobs/JOB_ID/retry` | Retry failed pages in a job |\n| `POST /api/jobs/JOB_ID/cancel` | Cancel a running job |\n| `POST /api/books/BOOK_ID/batch-ocr-async` | Submit Gemini Batch API OCR job (50% cheaper, ~24h) |\n| `POST /api/books/BOOK_ID/batch-translate-async` | Submit Gemini Batch API translation job |\n\n## Processing Options\n\n### Option 1: Lambda Workers via Job System (Primary Path)\n\nThe primary processing path uses AWS Lambda workers via SQS queues. Each page is processed independently with automatic job tracking.\n\n```bash\n# Queue OCR for a book''s pages\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://sourcelibrary.org/api/jobs/queue-books\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"bookIds\": [\"BOOK_ID\"], \"action\": \"ocr\"}''\n\n# Queue translation\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://sourcelibrary.org/api/jobs/queue-books\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"bookIds\": [\"BOOK_ID\"], \"action\": \"translation\"}''\n\n# Queue image extraction\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://sourcelibrary.org/api/jobs/queue-books\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"bookIds\": [\"BOOK_ID\"], \"action\": \"image_extraction\"}''\n```\n\n**IMPORTANT: Always use `gemini-3-flash-preview` for all OCR and translation tasks. Do NOT use `gemini-2.5-flash`.**\n\n### Option 2: Gemini Batch API (50% Cheaper, Automated Pipeline)\n\nThe post-import-pipeline cron uses Gemini Batch API for automated processing of newly imported books. Results arrive in ~24 hours at 50% cost.\n\n| Job Type | API | Model | Cost |\n|----------|-----|-------|------|\n| Single page | Realtime (Lambda) | gemini-3-flash-preview | Full price |\n| batch_ocr | Batch API | gemini-3-flash-preview | **50% off** |\n| batch_translate | Batch API | gemini-3-flash-preview | **50% off** |\n\n## OCR Output Format\n\nOCR uses **Markdown output** with semantic tags:\n\n### Markdown Formatting\n- `# ## ###` for headings (bigger text = bigger heading)\n- `**bold**`, `*italic*` for emphasis\n- `->centered text<-` for centered lines (NOT for headings)\n- `> blockquotes` for quotes/prayers\n- `---` for dividers\n- Tables only for actual tabular data\n\n### Metadata Tags (hidden from readers)\n| Tag | Purpose |\n|-----|---------|\n| `<lang>X</lang>` | Detected language |\n| `<page-num>N</page-num>` | Page/folio number |\n| `<header>X</header>` | Running headers |\n| `<sig>X</sig>` | Printer''s marks (A2, B1) |\n| `<meta>X</meta>` | Hidden metadata |\n| `<warning>X</warning>` | Quality issues |\n| `<vocab>X</vocab>` | Key terms for indexing |\n\n### Inline Annotations (visible to readers)\n| Tag | Purpose |\n|-----|---------|\n| `<margin>X</margin>` | Marginal notes (before paragraph) |\n| `<gloss>X</gloss>` | Interlinear annotations |\n| `<insert>X</insert>` | Boxed text, additions |\n| `<unclear>X</unclear>` | Illegible readings |\n| `<note>X</note>` | Interpretive notes |\n| `<term>X</term>` | Technical vocabulary |\n| `<image-desc>X</image-desc>` | Describe illustrations |\n\n### Critical OCR Rules\n1. Preserve original spelling, capitalization, punctuation\n2. Page numbers/headers/signatures go in metadata tags only\n3. IGNORE partial text at edges (from facing page in spread)\n4. Describe images/diagrams with `<image-desc>`, never tables\n5. End with `<vocab>key terms, names, concepts</vocab>`\n\n## Step 1: Analyze Book Status\n\nFirst, check what work is needed for a book:\n\n```bash\n# Get book and analyze page status\ncurl -s \"https://sourcelibrary.org/api/books/BOOK_ID\" > /tmp/book.json\n\n# Count pages by status (IMPORTANT: check length > 0, not just existence - empty strings are truthy!)\njq ''{\n  title: .title,\n  total_pages: (.pages | length),\n  split_pages: [.pages[] | select(.crop)] | length,\n  needs_crop: [.pages[] | select(.crop) | select(.cropped_photo | not)] | length,\n  has_ocr: [.pages[] | select((.ocr.data // \"\") | length > 0)] | length,\n  needs_ocr: [.pages[] | select((.ocr.data // \"\") | length == 0)] | length,\n  has_translation: [.pages[] | select((.translation.data // \"\") | length > 0)] | length,\n  needs_translation: [.pages[] | select((.ocr.data // \"\") | length > 0) | select((.translation.data // \"\") | length == 0)] | length\n}'' /tmp/book.json\n```\n\n### Detecting Bad OCR\n\nPages that were OCR''d before cropped images were generated have incorrect OCR (contains both pages of the spread). Detect these:\n\n```bash\n# Find pages with crop data + OCR but missing cropped_photo at OCR time\n# These often contain \"two-page\" or \"spread\" in the OCR text\njq ''[.pages[] | select(.crop) | select(.ocr.data) |\n  select(.ocr.data | test(\"two-page|spread\"; \"i\"))] | length'' /tmp/book.json\n```\n\n## Step 2: Generate Cropped Images\n\nFor books with split two-page spreads, generate individual page images:\n\n```bash\n# Get page IDs needing crops\nCROP_IDS=$(jq ''[.pages[] | select(.crop) | select(.cropped_photo | not) | .id]'' /tmp/book.json)\n\n# Create crop job\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://sourcelibrary.org/api/jobs\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \"{\n    \\\"type\\\": \\\"generate_cropped_images\\\",\n    \\\"book_id\\\": \\\"BOOK_ID\\\",\n    \\\"book_title\\\": \\\"BOOK_TITLE\\\",\n    \\\"page_ids\\\": $CROP_IDS\n  }\"\n```\n\nProcess the job:\n\n```bash\n# Trigger processing (40 pages per request, auto-continues)\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://sourcelibrary.org/api/jobs/JOB_ID/process\"\n```\n\n## Step 3: OCR Pages\n\n### Option A: Using Job System (for large batches)\n\n```bash\n# Get page IDs needing OCR (check for empty strings, not just null)\nOCR_IDS=$(jq ''[.pages[] | select((.ocr.data // \"\") | length == 0) | .id]'' /tmp/book.json)\n\n# Create OCR job\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://sourcelibrary.org/api/jobs\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \"{\n    \\\"type\\\": \\\"batch_ocr\\\",\n    \\\"book_id\\\": \\\"BOOK_ID\\\",\n    \\\"book_title\\\": \\\"BOOK_TITLE\\\",\n    \\\"model\\\": \\\"gemini-3-flash-preview\\\",\n    \\\"language\\\": \\\"Latin\\\",\n    \\\"page_ids\\\": $OCR_IDS\n  }\"\n```\n\n### Option B: Using Lambda Workers with Page IDs\n\n```bash\n# OCR specific pages (including overwrite)\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://sourcelibrary.org/api/jobs/queue-books\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\n    \"bookIds\": [\"BOOK_ID\"],\n    \"action\": \"ocr\",\n    \"pageIds\": [\"PAGE_ID_1\", \"PAGE_ID_2\"],\n    \"overwrite\": true\n  }''\n```\n\nLambda workers automatically use `cropped_photo` when available.\n\n## Step 4: Translate Pages\n\n### Option A: Using Job System\n\n```bash\n# Get page IDs needing translation (must have OCR content, check for empty strings)\nTRANS_IDS=$(jq ''[.pages[] | select((.ocr.data // \"\") | length > 0) | select((.translation.data // \"\") | length == 0) | .id]'' /tmp/book.json)\n\n# Create translation job\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://sourcelibrary.org/api/jobs\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \"{\n    \\\"type\\\": \\\"batch_translate\\\",\n    \\\"book_id\\\": \\\"BOOK_ID\\\",\n    \\\"book_title\\\": \\\"BOOK_TITLE\\\",\n    \\\"model\\\": \\\"gemini-3-flash-preview\\\",\n    \\\"language\\\": \\\"Latin\\\",\n    \\\"page_ids\\\": $TRANS_IDS\n  }\"\n```\n\n### Option B: Using Lambda Workers (Recommended)\n\nLambda FIFO queue automatically provides previous page context for translation continuity:\n\n```bash\n# Queue translation for pages that have OCR but no translation\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://sourcelibrary.org/api/jobs/queue-books\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d ''{\"bookIds\": [\"BOOK_ID\"], \"action\": \"translation\"}''\n```\n\nThe translation Lambda worker processes pages sequentially via FIFO queue and fetches the previous page''s translation for context.\n\n## Complete Book Processing Script\n\nProcess a single book through the full pipeline using Lambda workers:\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nBOOK_ID=\"YOUR_BOOK_ID\"\nBASE_URL=\"https://sourcelibrary.org\"\n\n# 1. Fetch book data\necho \"Fetching book...\"\nBOOK=$(curl -s \"$BASE_URL/api/books/$BOOK_ID\")\nTITLE=$(echo \"$BOOK\" | jq -r ''.title[0:40]'')\necho \"Processing: $TITLE\"\n\n# 2. Queue OCR (Lambda workers handle all pages automatically)\nNEEDS_OCR=$(echo \"$BOOK\" | jq ''[.pages[] | select((.ocr.data // \"\") | length == 0)] | length'')\nif [ \"$NEEDS_OCR\" != \"0\" ]; then\n  echo \"Queueing OCR for $NEEDS_OCR pages...\"\n  curl -s -X POST \"$BASE_URL/api/jobs/queue-books\" \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    -d \"{\\\"bookIds\\\": [\\\"$BOOK_ID\\\"], \\\"action\\\": \\\"ocr\\\"}\"\n  echo \"OCR job queued!\"\nfi\n\n# 3. Queue translation (after OCR completes — check /jobs page)\nNEEDS_TRANS=$(echo \"$BOOK\" | jq ''[.pages[] | select((.ocr.data // \"\") | length > 0) | select((.translation.data // \"\") | length == 0)] | length'')\nif [ \"$NEEDS_TRANS\" != \"0\" ]; then\n  echo \"Queueing translation for $NEEDS_TRANS pages...\"\n  curl -s -X POST \"$BASE_URL/api/jobs/queue-books\" \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    -d \"{\\\"bookIds\\\": [\\\"$BOOK_ID\\\"], \\\"action\\\": \\\"translation\\\"}\"\n  echo \"Translation job queued!\"\nfi\n\necho \"Jobs queued! Monitor progress at $BASE_URL/jobs\"\n```\n\n## Fixing Bad OCR\n\nWhen pages were OCR''d before cropped images existed, they contain text from both pages. Fix with:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Generate cropped images first (Step 2 above)\n\n# 2. Find pages with bad OCR\nBAD_OCR_IDS=$(jq ''[.pages[] | select(.crop) | select(.ocr.data) |\n  select(.ocr.data | test(\"two-page|spread\"; \"i\")) | .id]'' /tmp/book.json)\n\n# 3. Re-OCR with overwrite via Lambda workers\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://sourcelibrary.org/api/jobs/queue-books\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \"{\\\"bookIds\\\": [\\\"BOOK_ID\\\"], \\\"action\\\": \\\"ocr\\\", \\\"pageIds\\\": $BAD_OCR_IDS, \\\"overwrite\\\": true}\"\n```\n\n## Processing All Books\n\nUse the Lambda worker job system for bulk processing:\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nBASE_URL=\"https://sourcelibrary.org\"\n\n# Get all book IDs\nBOOK_IDS=$(curl -s \"$BASE_URL/api/books\" | jq -r ''[.[].id]'')\n\n# Queue OCR for all books (Lambda workers handle parallelism and rate limiting)\ncurl -s -X POST \"$BASE_URL/api/jobs/queue-books\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \"{\\\"bookIds\\\": $BOOK_IDS, \\\"action\\\": \\\"ocr\\\"}\"\n\n# After OCR completes, queue translation\ncurl -s -X POST \"$BASE_URL/api/jobs/queue-books\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d \"{\\\"bookIds\\\": $BOOK_IDS, \\\"action\\\": \\\"translation\\\"}\"\n```\n\nMonitor progress at https://sourcelibrary.org/jobs\n\n## Monitoring Progress\n\nCheck overall library status:\n\n```bash\ncurl -s \"https://sourcelibrary.org/api/books\" | jq ''[.[] | {\n  title: .title[0:30],\n  pages: .pages_count,\n  ocr: .ocr_count,\n  translated: .translation_count\n}] | sort_by(-.pages)''\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Empty Strings vs Null (CRITICAL)\nIn jq, empty strings `\"\"` are truthy! This means:\n- `select(.ocr.data)` matches pages with `\"\"` (WRONG)\n- `select(.ocr.data | not)` does NOT match pages with `\"\"` (WRONG)\n- Use `select((.ocr.data // \"\") | length == 0)` to find missing/empty OCR\n- Use `select((.ocr.data // \"\") | length > 0)` to find pages WITH OCR content\n\n### Rate Limits (429 errors)\n\n#### Gemini API Tiers\n| Tier | RPM | How to Qualify |\n|------|-----|----------------|\n| Free | 15 | Default |\n| Tier 1 | 300 | Enable billing + $50 spend |\n| Tier 2 | 1000 | $250 spend |\n| Tier 3 | 2000 | $1000 spend |\n\n#### Optimal Sleep Times by Tier\n| Tier | Max RPM | Safe Sleep Time | Effective Rate |\n|------|---------|-----------------|----------------|\n| Free | 15 | 4.0s | ~15/min |\n| Tier 1 | 300 | 0.4s | ~150/min |\n| Tier 2 | 1000 | 0.12s | ~500/min |\n| Tier 3 | 2000 | 0.06s | ~1000/min |\n\n**Note:** Use ~50% of max rate to leave headroom for bursts.\n\n#### API Key Rotation\nThe system supports multiple API keys for higher throughput:\n- Set `GEMINI_API_KEY` (primary)\n- Set `GEMINI_API_KEY_2`, `GEMINI_API_KEY_3`, ... up to `GEMINI_API_KEY_10`\n- Keys rotate automatically with 60s cooldown after rate limit\n\nWith N keys at Tier 1, you get N × 300 RPM = N × 150 safe req/min\n\n### Function Timeouts\n- Jobs have `maxDuration=300s` for Vercel Pro\n- If hitting timeouts, reduce `CROP_CHUNK_SIZE` in job processing\n\n### Missing Cropped Photos\n- Check if crop job completed successfully\n- Verify page has `crop` data with `xStart` and `xEnd`\n- Re-run crop generation for specific pages\n\n### Bad OCR Detection\nLook for these patterns in OCR text indicating wrong image was used:\n- \"two-page spread\"\n- \"left page\" / \"right page\" descriptions\n- Duplicate text blocks\n- References to facing pages\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:52:47.020Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Language Agents requiring automated book translation workflows, particularly those handling historical texts in various formats","zh":"适用于需要自动化图书翻译工作流的语言代理，特别是处理各种格式的历史文本","ja":"自動化された本の翻訳ワークフローを必要とする言語エージェントに適しています。特に、さまざまな形式の歴史的なテキストを扱うもの","ko":"자동화 된 책 번역 워크플로가 필요한 언어 에이전트에 적합합니다. 특히 다양한 형식의 역사적인 텍스트를 처리하는 것","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Lenguaje que requieren flujos de trabajo de traducción de libros automatizados, particularmente aquellos que manejan textos históricos en varios formatos","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Langue nécessitant des flux de travail de traduction de livres automatisés, en particulier ceux qui gèrent des textes historiques dans différents formats","de":"Ideal für Sprachagenten, die automatisierte Workflows für die Übersetzung von Büchern erfordern, insbesondere solche, die historische Texte in verschiedenen Formaten verarbeiten","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Linguagem que exigem fluxos de trabalho de tradução de livros automatizados, particularmente aqueles que lidam com textos históricos em vários formatos","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, требующих автоматизированных рабочих процессов перевода книг, особенно тех, которые обрабатывают исторические тексты в различных форматах","ar":"مثالي لعميل اللغة الذي يتطلب سير عمل ترجمة كتاب آلي، ولا سيما أولئك الذين يتعاملون مع النصوص التاريخية في مختلف التنسيقات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to process books through a complete pipeline of Crop, OCR, and Translate functionalities, leveraging roadmap priorities and supporting formats like Kircher encyclopedias and Theatrum Chemicum, with protocols such as batch processing and content preview","zh":"赋予代理通过完整的裁剪、OCR和翻译功能管道来处理图书的能力，利用路线图优先级，并支持诸如基彻尔百科全书和化学剧场等格式，具有批处理和内容预览等协议","ja":"エージェントが、Crop、OCR、翻訳機能の完全なパイプラインを通じて本を処理する能力を付与します。ロードマップの優先順位を利用し、キルヒャー百科事典や化学劇場などのフォーマットをサポートします。バッチ処理やコンテンツプレビューなどのプロトコルもあります","ko":"에이전트가 완전한 파이프라인을 통해 책을 처리할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 로드맵 우선순위를 활용하고 키르허 백과사전 및 化学劇場 등의 형식을 지원하며 배치 처리 및 콘텐츠 미리 보기 등의 프로토콜을 사용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a procesar libros a través de un flujo de trabajo completo de recorte, OCR y funcionalidades de traducción, aprovechando las prioridades de la hoja de ruta y admitiendo formatos como enciclopedias de Kircher y Theatrum Chemicum, con protocolos como procesamiento por lotes y vista previa de contenido","fr":"Permet aux agents de traiter les livres à travers un flux de travail complet de rogner, OCR et fonctionnalités de traduction, en exploitant les priorités de la feuille de route et en prenant en charge des formats tels que les encyclopédies de Kircher et le Theatrum Chemicum, avec des protocoles tels que le traitement par lots et l''aperçu de contenu","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Bücher durch eine komplette Pipeline von Bildbearbeitung, OCR und Übersetzungsfunktionen zu verarbeiten, die Prioritäten der Roadmap nutzend und Formate wie Kircher-Enzyklopädien und Theatrum Chemicum unterstützend, mit Protokollen wie Batchverarbeitung und Inhaltsvorschau","pt":"Habilita os agentes a processar livros por meio de um pipeline completo de funcionalidades de Recorte, OCR e Tradução, aproveitando prioridades de roadmap e suportando formatos como enciclopédias Kircher e Theatrum Chemicum, com protocolos como processamento em lote e visualização de conteúdo","ru":"Позволяет агентам обрабатывать книги через полный конвейер функций Обрезки, OCR и Перевода, используя приоритеты дорожной карты и поддерживая форматы, такие как энциклопедии Кирхера и Theatrum Chemicum, с протоколами, такими как пакетная обработка и предварительный просмотр содержимого","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء معالجة الكتب من خلال خط أنابيب كامل من ميزات القص والتعرف الضوئي على الحروف والترجمة، مستفيدا من أولويات خارطة الطريق ودعم تنسيقات مثل الموسوعات كيركر ومسرح الكيمياء، مع بروتوكولات مثل المعالجة بالدفعة وتحديد مسبق للمحتوى"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating translation of historical books","Processing Kircher encyclopedias through OCR and translation","Prioritizing UNTRANSLATED texts like Fludd''s Utriusque Cosmi Historia for translation"],"zh":["自动翻译历史书籍","通过OCR和翻译处理基彻尔百科全书","优先翻译未翻译的文本，如弗拉德的宇宙历史"],"ja":["歴史的な本の自動翻訳","キルヒャー百科事典のOCRと翻訳の処理","翻訳されていないテキスト（例：フラッドの宇宙の歴史）を優先して翻訳"],"ko":["역사적인 책의 자동 번역","키르허 백과사전의 OCR 및 번역 처리","번역되지 않은 텍스트(예: 플러드의 우주 역사)를 번역 우선순위로 지정"],"es":["Automatizar la traducción de libros históricos","Procesar enciclopedias de Kircher a través de OCR y traducción","Priorizar textos NO TRADUCIDOS como la Utriusque Cosmi Historia de Fludd para la traducción"],"fr":["Automatiser la traduction de livres historiques","Traiter les encyclopédies de Kircher à travers l''OCR et la traduction","Donner la priorité aux textes NON TRADUITS comme l''Utriusque Cosmi Historia de Fludd pour la traduction"],"de":["Automatisieren der Übersetzung historischer Bücher","Verarbeiten von Kircher-Enzyklopädien durch OCR und Übersetzung","Priorisieren unübersetzter Texte wie Fludds Utriusque Cosmi Historia für die Übersetzung"],"pt":["Automatizar a tradução de livros históricos","Processar enciclopédias Kircher por meio de OCR e tradução","Dar prioridade a textos NÃO TRADUZIDOS, como a Utriusque Cosmi Historia de Fludd, para tradução"],"ru":["Автоматизировать перевод исторических книг","Обрабатывать энциклопедии Кирхера с помощью OCR и перевода","Придавать приоритет НЕПЕРЕВЕДЕННЫМ текстам, таким как Utriusque Cosmi Historia Флуда