ialité pour garantir la sécurité","Cadre de tests pour garantir la compatibilité avec ERC-4337","Meilleures pratiques de sécurité pour protéger les données de l''utilisateur","Fonctionnalité en chaîne pour les cas d''utilisation d''identité de véhicules et de données sensibles","Compatibilité avec les cas d''utilisation de données sensibles"],"de":["Smart-Contract-Vorlagen für Datenschutz-Wallets","Werkzeuge zur Validierung der Privatsphäre für die Sicherheitsgarantie","Testframework für die Gewährleistung der Kompatibilität mit ERC-4337","Sicherheitsbest-Practices zum Schutz der Benutzerdaten","Chain-Funktion für Fahrzeugidentitäts- und sensible Daten-Anwendungsfälle","Kompatibilität mit Anwendungsfällen für sensible Daten"],"pt":["Modelos de contrato inteligente","Quadro de teste","Ferramentas de validação de privacidade","Melhores práticas de segurança"],"ru":["Шаблоны умных контрактов","Тестовый фреймворк","Инструменты проверки приватности","Лучшие практики безопасности"],"ar":["قوالب العقد الذكي","إطار الاختبار","أدوات التحقق من الخصوصية","أفضل الممارسات الأمنية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ERC-4337","隐私保护钱包","去中心化身份验证","敏感数据保护","智能合约","测试框架"],"ja":["ERC-4337","プライバシーウォレット","分散化されたアイデンティティ検証","機密データ保護","スマートコントラクト","テストフレームワーク"],"ko":["ERC-4337","프라이버시 월렛","분산된身份 검증","민감한 데이터 보호","스마트 컨트랙트","테스트 프레임워크"],"es":["ERC-4337","billetera de privacidad","desarrollo de billeteras","identidad de vehículos","datos sensibles","seguridad en cadena","privacidad en blockchain","desarrollo de blockchain","contratos inteligentes"],"fr":["ERC-4337","portefeuille de confidentialité","développement de portefeuilles","identité de véhicules","données sensibles","sécurité en chaîne","confidentialité sur blockchain","développement de blockchain","contrats intelligents"],"de":["ERC-4337","Datenschutz-Wallet","Entwicklung von Wallets","Fahrzeugidentität","sensible Daten","Chain-Sicherheit","Datenschutz in Blockchain","Blockchain-Entwicklung","Smart-Contracts"],"pt":["carteira de privacidade","ERC-4337","abstração de contas","validação de privacidade","segurança","desenvolvimento de blockchain"],"ru":["кошелек приватности","ERC-4337","абстракция учетных записей","проверка приватности","безопасность","разработка блокчейна"],"ar":["محفظة الخصوصية","ERC-4337","تجريد الحسابات","التحقق من الخصوصية","الأمان","تطوير البلوكشين"]}},"owner":"mashharuki","repo":"car","repoPath":"mashharuki/car","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"erc4337-privacy-wallet","description":"Privacy-preserving ERC-4337 wallet development for vehicle identity and sensitive data protection. Use when implementing ERC-4337 account abstraction wallets that handle sensitive information (vehicle license plates, biometric data, personal IDs) requiring on-chain privacy. Triggers on requests like implement ERC-4337 wallet for vehicle, create privacy-protected account abstraction, build wallet with vehicle number privacy, develop ERC-4337 with ZK proof integration, or any smart contract wallet development requiring commitment schemes, deterministic address generation, and sensitive data protection.","bodyPreview":"# ERC-4337 Privacy-Protected Wallet\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive support for developing ERC-4337 compliant Account Abstraction wallets with privacy-preserving features, specifically designed for vehicle identity and other sensitive data use cases. It combines smart contract templates, testing frameworks, privacy validation tools, and security best practices to enable the secure implementation of wallets that protect user privacy while maintaining on-chain functionality.\n\n**Key","body":"# ERC-4337 Privacy-Protected Wallet\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive support for developing ERC-4337 compliant Account Abstraction wallets with privacy-preserving features, specifically designed for vehicle identity and other sensitive data use cases. It combines smart contract templates, testing frameworks, privacy validation tools, and security best practices to enable the secure implementation of wallets that protect user privacy while maintaining on-chain functionality.\n\n**Key Capabilities:**\n- Privacy-protected smart contract templates (PrivacyProtectedAccount, AccountFactory, VehicleRegistry)\n- Commitment scheme implementation for sensitive data (vehicle plates, personal info)\n- Deterministic address generation using CREATE2\n- Comprehensive test suites with privacy verification\n- Automated privacy validation tooling\n- Security and compliance checklists\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nInvoke this skill when you encounter requests involving:\n\n- **Vehicle Identity Wallets**: \"Create a wallet from vehicle license plate information\"\n- **ERC-4337 Implementation**: \"Implement account abstraction for privacy-protected accounts\"\n- **Sensitive Data Protection**: \"Build wallet that hides user''s personal identification\"\n- **Deterministic Address Generation**: \"Generate predictable wallet addresses from private data\"\n- **ZK Proof Integration**: \"Add zero-knowledge proof verification to ERC-4337 wallet\"\n- **Privacy Auditing**: \"Validate that my smart contract doesn''t leak sensitive information\"\n\n## Quick Start Guide\n\n### 1. Understand the Requirements\n\nAsk the user these key questions:\n- What sensitive data needs protection? (vehicle plate, biometric, etc.)\n- Is deterministic address generation required?\n- Are ZK proofs needed, or is commitment hashing sufficient?\n- What is the target blockchain/testnet?\n\n### 2. Set Up the Project\n\n```bash\n# Copy contract templates\ncp -r assets/contracts/* ./contracts/\n\n# Install dependencies\ncd contracts\nnpm install\n\n# Compile contracts\nnpm run compile\n```\n\n### 3. Customize for Your Use Case\n\n**For vehicle-based wallets:**\n```solidity\n// Off-chain: Compute vehicle commitment\nconst plateNumber = \"ABC-1234\";\nconst userSalt = ethers.id(\"user-secret-entropy\");\nconst commitment = ethers.keccak256(\n    ethers.solidityPacked([\"string\", \"bytes32\"], [plateNumber, userSalt])\n);\n\n// Deploy account with commitment\nconst account = await factory.createAccount(\n    ownerAddress,\n    commitment,\n    12345  // deployment salt\n);\n```\n\n**For biometric/other sensitive data:**\n```solidity\n// Replace plateNumber with your sensitive data\nconst biometricHash = computeHash(biometricData);\nconst commitment = ethers.keccak256(\n    ethers.solidityPacked([\"bytes32\", \"bytes32\"], [biometricHash, userSalt])\n);\n```\n\n### 4. Run Privacy Validation\n\n```bash\n# Validate that contracts don''t leak sensitive data\npython scripts/validate_privacy.py contracts/PrivacyProtectedAccount.sol\n```\n\n### 5. Run Tests\n\n```bash\n# Run comprehensive test suite\nnpm test\n\n# Run specific test file\nnpx hardhat test tests/PrivacyProtectedAccount.test.ts\n```\n\n## Core Components\n\n### 1. PrivacyProtectedAccount\n\nThe main account contract that implements ERC-4337''s `IAccount` interface with privacy features.\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Stores only commitment (hash) of sensitive data, never raw values\n- Deterministic address generation via CREATE2\n- ERC-4337 compliant UserOperation validation\n- Owner-based access control\n- Batch transaction execution\n\n**Usage:**\n```solidity\n// Deploy via factory\nconst account = await factory.createAccount(owner, vehicleCommitment, salt);\n\n// Verify ownership without revealing data\nconst isValid = await account.verifyVehicleOwnership(plateNumber, userSalt);\n\n// Execute transaction\nawait account.execute(targetAddress, value, calldata);\n```\n\n**Privacy Guarantee:**\n- Vehicle commitment is stored as `bytes32` hash\n- Raw plate number never touches blockchain\n- Verification is view-only (off-chain safe)\n\n### 2. AccountFactory\n\nFactory contract for deploying PrivacyProtectedAccount instances with deterministic addresses.\n\n**Key Features:**\n- CREATE2-based deterministic deployment\n- Counterfactual address computation\n- Batch account creation\n- Cross-chain address consistency\n\n**Usage:**\n```solidity\n// Compute address before deployment\nconst predictedAddress = await factory.getAddress(owner, commitment, salt);\n\n// Deploy account\nconst account = await factory.createAccount(owner, commitment, salt);\n\n// Address matches prediction\nassert(accountAddress === predictedAddress);\n```\n\n**Use Cases:**\n- Receive funds before account creation\n- Consistent addresses across multiple chains\n- Privacy-preserving wallet generation\n\n### 3. VehicleRegistry\n\nOptional registry contract for managing vehicle-to-wallet mappings with privacy.\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Maps commitments to wallet addresses\n- Authorized verifier system\n- Selective disclosure support\n- Batch registration\n\n**Usage:**\n```solidity\n// Register vehicle with commitment only\nawait registry.registerVehicle(commitment, walletAddress, metadataHash);\n\n// Verify registration (authorized only)\nconst isRegistered = await registry.verifyVehicleRegistration(commitment);\n\n// Update commitment (ownership transfer)\nawait registry.updateVehicleCommitment(oldCommitment, newCommitment);\n```\n\n## Implementation Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Define Privacy Model\n\nDetermine what needs privacy protection:\n\n**Example - Vehicle Wallet:**\n```\nSensitive: License plate number\nPublic: Wallet address, transaction history\nCommitment: keccak256(plateNumber + salt)\n```\n\n**Example - Biometric Wallet:**\n```\nSensitive: Fingerprint hash\nPublic: Wallet address\nCommitment: keccak256(fingerprintHash + salt)\n```\n\n### Step 2: Generate Commitment Off-Chain\n\n**CRITICAL: Never pass raw sensitive data to blockchain functions.**\n\n```javascript\n// Frontend/Backend - OFF-CHAIN computation\nimport { ethers } from ''ethers'';\n\nfunction generateCommitment(sensitiveData, userSecret) {\n    // Generate cryptographically secure salt\n    const salt = ethers.keccak256(\n        ethers.solidityPacked(\n            [''string'', ''uint256'', ''address''],\n            [userSecret, Date.now(), userAddress]\n        )\n    );\n\n    // Compute commitment\n    const commitment = ethers.keccak256(\n        ethers.solidityPacked([''string'', ''bytes32''], [sensitiveData, salt])\n    );\n\n    return { commitment, salt };\n}\n\n// Usage\nconst { commitment, salt } = generateCommitment(licensePlate, userSecret);\n// Store salt securely off-chain!\n// Send only commitment to blockchain\n```\n\n### Step 3: Deploy Account\n\n```javascript\n// Connect to factory\nconst factory = await ethers.getContractAt(''AccountFactory'', factoryAddress);\n\n// Optional: Predict address first\nconst predictedAddress = await factory.getAddress(\n    ownerAddress,\n    commitment,\n    deploymentSalt\n);\nconsole.log(''Account will be deployed at:'', predictedAddress);\n\n// Deploy account\nconst tx = await factory.createAccount(ownerAddress, commitment, deploymentSalt);\nawait tx.wait();\n\nconsole.log(''Account deployed at:'', predictedAddress);\n```\n\n### Step 4: Create and Submit UserOperation\n\n```javascript\nimport { ethers } from ''ethers'';\n\n// Build UserOperation\nconst userOp = {\n    sender: accountAddress,\n    nonce: await account.getNonce(),\n    initCode: ''0x'',  // Empty if account exists\n    callData: account.interface.encodeFunctionData(''execute'', [\n        targetAddress,\n        value,\n        data\n    ]),\n    accountGasLimits: ethers.solidityPacked(\n        [''uint128'', ''uint128''],\n        [verificationGasLimit, callGasLimit]\n    ),\n    preVerificationGas,\n    gasFees: ethers.solidityPacked(\n        [''uint128'', ''uint128''],\n        [maxPriorityFeePerGas, maxFeePerGas]\n    ),\n    paymasterAndData: ''0x'',  // Or paymaster address + data\n    signature: ''0x''  // Will be filled after signing\n};\n\n// Sign UserOperation\nconst userOpHash = await account.getUserOpHash(userOp);\nconst signature = await owner.signMessage(ethers.getBytes(userOpHash));\nuserOp.signature = signature;\n\n// Submit to bundler\nawait bundler.sendUserOperation(userOp);\n```\n\n### Step 5: Verify Privacy Protection\n\n```bash\n# Run automated privacy validation\npython scripts/validate_privacy.py contracts/YourContract.sol\n\n# Expected output:\n# ✅ PRIVACY VALIDATION PASSED\n# No privacy violations detected.\n```\n\n## Privacy Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Basic Commitment\n\n```solidity\n// Off-chain\nconst commitment = keccak256(abi.encodePacked(sensitiveData, salt));\n\n// On-chain\nbytes32 public dataCommitment;\n\nfunction initialize(bytes32 _commitment) external {\n    dataCommitment = _commitment;\n}\n\nfunction verify(string memory data, bytes32 salt) external view returns (bool) {\n    return keccak256(abi.encodePacked(data, salt)) == dataCommitment;\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Multi-Attribute Commitment\n\n```solidity\n// For vehicles with multiple attributes\nstruct VehicleData {\n    string plateNumber;\n    string model;\n    uint256 year;\n}\n\n// Off-chain\nconst commitment = keccak256(abi.encode(\n    vehicleData.plateNumber,\n    vehicleData.model,\n    vehicleData.year,\n    salt\n));\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: ZK Proof Integration\n\nFor advanced privacy (see `references/privacy-patterns.md` for full examples):\n\n```solidity\n// Verify ZK proof instead of revealing data\nfunction _validateSignature(\n    PackedUserOperation calldata userOp,\n    bytes32 userOpHash\n) internal override returns (uint256) {\n    (bytes memory proof, bytes memory publicInputs) =\n        abi.decode(userOp.signature, (bytes, bytes));\n\n    require(zkVerifier.verify(proof, publicInputs), \"Invalid proof\");\n    return SIG_VALIDATION_SUCCESS;\n}\n```\n\n## Testing Strategy\n\n### Privacy Tests\n\n```typescript\ndescribe(\"Privacy Protection\", () => {\n    it(\"should not store raw sensitive data\", async () => {\n        // Verify storage doesn''t contain plate number\n        for (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) {\n            const storage = await ethers.provider.getStorage(account.address, i);\n            expect(storage).to.not.include(ethers.hexlify(ethers.toUtf8Bytes(plateNumber)));\n        }\n    });\n\n    it(\"should verify with correct preimage\", async () => {\n        const isValid = await account.verifyVehicleOwnership(plateNumber, salt);\n        expect(isValid).to.be.true;\n    });\n\n    it(\"should reject wrong preimage\", async () => {\n        const isValid = await account.verifyVehicleOwnership(\"WRONG-PLATE\", salt);\n        expect(isValid).to.be.false;\n    });\n});\n```\n\n### ERC-4337 Tests\n\n```typescript\ndescribe(\"UserOperation Validation\", () => {\n    it(\"should validate correct signature\", async () => {\n        const userOp = buildUserOp({ sender: account.address });\n        const userOpHash = await entryPoint.getUserOpHash(userOp);\n        userOp.signature = await owner.signMessage(ethers.getBytes(userOpHash));\n\n        await expect(entryPoint.handleOps([userOp], bundler.address))\n            .to.not.be.reverted;\n    });\n});\n```\n\n## Security Checklist\n\nBefore deploying to mainnet, verify:\n\n- [ ] Run privacy validation: `python scripts/validate_privacy.py`\n- [ ] All tests passing: `npm test`\n- [ ] No raw sensitive data in storage or events\n- [ ] Commitment generation uses strong salt (≥256 bits entropy)\n- [ ] Verification functions are `view` or `pure`\n- [ ] Access control properly implemented\n- [ ] EntryPoint address is correct\n- [ ] Contracts verified on Etherscan\n- [ ] Professional security audit completed\n\nSee `references/security-checklist.md` for complete checklist.\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n### ❌ Storing Raw Sensitive Data\n\n```solidity\n// NEVER DO THIS\ncontract BadExample {\n    string public licensePlate;  // Publicly visible!\n}\n```\n\n### ✅ Correct Approach\n\n```solidity\n// DO THIS\ncontract GoodExample {\n    bytes32 public vehicleCommitment;  // Only hash stored\n}\n```\n\n### ❌ Weak Salt Generation\n\n```solidity\n// WEAK - predictable\nbytes32 salt = bytes32(block.timestamp);\n```\n\n### ✅ Strong Salt\n\n```solidity\n// STRONG - unique per user with high entropy\nbytes32 salt = keccak256(abi.encodePacked(\n    userSecret,\n    block.timestamp,\n    block.prevrandao,\n    msg.sender\n));\n```\n\n### ❌ Exposing Data in Events\n\n```solidity\n// NEVER DO THIS\nevent VehicleRegistered(string plateNumber);\n```\n\n### ✅ Events with Commitments\n\n```solidity\n// DO THIS\nevent VehicleRegistered(bytes32 indexed commitment);\n```\n\n## Advanced Topics\n\n### ZK-SNARK Integration\n\nFor zero-knowledge proof integration, see `references/privacy-patterns.md` section on ZK proofs.\n\n**High-level flow:**\n1. Generate ZK circuit for vehicle ownership\n2. Prove knowledge of plate number without revealing it\n3. Verify proof on-chain in `_validateSignature()`\n\n### Cross-Chain Deployment\n\n```bash\n# Deploy to multiple networks with same addresses\nnpx hardhat run scripts/deploy.ts --network sepolia\nnpx hardhat run scripts/deploy.ts --network polygonAmoy\n\n# Addresses match due to CREATE2 determinism\n```\n\n### Gasless Transactions with Paymaster\n\n```javascript\n// Add paymaster to UserOperation\nuserOp.paymasterAndData = ethers.solidityPacked(\n    [''address'', ''bytes''],\n    [paymasterAddress, paymasterData]\n);\n\n// User doesn''t pay gas - paymaster sponsors it\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n### Bundled Resources\n\n- **`assets/contracts/`**: Production-ready contract templates\n  - `PrivacyProtectedAccount.sol` - Main account contract\n  - `AccountFactory.sol` - Deterministic factory\n  - `VehicleRegistry.sol` - Optional registry\n  - `package.json`, `hardhat.config.ts` - Project setup\n\n- **`assets/tests/`**: Comprehensive test suites\n  - Privacy protection tests\n  - ERC-4337 compliance tests\n  - Gas optimization tests\n\n- **`scripts/validate_privacy.py`**: Automated privacy validation tool\n  - Scans for sensitive data leaks\n  - Validates commitment patterns\n  - Checks event safety\n\n- **`references/`**: In-depth documentation\n  - `erc4337-architecture.md` - ERC-4337 deep dive\n  - `privacy-patterns.md` - Privacy implementation patterns\n  - `security-checklist.md` - Comprehensive security guide\n\n### External Resources\n\n- [ERC-4337 Specification](https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4337)\n- [Account Abstraction Docs](https://docs.erc4337.io/)\n- [MynaWallet Reference](https://github.com/MynaWallet/monorepo)\n- [Toyota MON](https://www.toyota-blockchain-lab.org/)\n- [OpenZeppelin Contracts](https://docs.openzeppelin.com/contracts/)\n\n## Support and Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n**Issue: Gas estimation fails**\n```\nSolution: Ensure account has sufficient deposit in EntryPoint\nawait account.addDeposit({ value: ethers.parseEther(\"0.1\") });\n```\n\n**Issue: Signature validation fails**\n```\nSolution: Check that userOpHash is computed correctly\nconst userOpHash = await entryPoint.getUserOpHash(userOp);\n```\n\n**Issue: Privacy validation fails**\n```\nSolution: Review reported violations and fix\n- Remove string storage for sensitive data\n- Make verification functions view/pure\n- Use commitments instead of raw data\n```\n\n### Getting Help\n\n1. Check `references/` for detailed documentation\n2. Review test files for usage examples\n3. Run privacy validation for security issues\n4. Consult ERC-4337 documentation for protocol questions\n\n## 参考文献\n- [ETHGlobalTokyo上位チーム勝手に解説 Myna](https://zenn.dev/kozayupapa/scraps/782815787c5c33)\n- [a42inc/ETHGlobalTokyo2023](https://github.com/a42inc/ETHGlobalTokyo2023)\n- [マイナンバーカードの公開鍵からSmartAccountのアドレスを一意に導出する方法 Study](https://zenn.dev/kozayupapa/articles/b0025b213ed39f)\n- [マイナンバーカードで署名をするところを動かしてみよう:ERC-4337 (AccountAbstraction)](https://zenn.dev/kozayupapa/articles/3347b360712b12)\n- [MynaWallet/monorepo](https://github.com/MynaWallet/monorepo)\n- [【Account Abstraction】UserOperation周りの具体的な実装について](https://zenn.dev/pokena/articles/84e243cf91a2cf)\n- [マイナウォレットメモ](https://zenn.dev/pokena/scraps/c8d8189a1c6cb9)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:53:13.328Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Ethereum-focused AI Agents requiring advanced ERC-4337 compliant wallet development with integrated privacy features","zh":"适用于需要高级ERC-4337兼容钱包开发以及集成隐私功能的以太坊焦点人工智能代理","ja":"Ethereumに焦点を当てた、高度なERC-4337準拠のウォレット開発とプライバシー機能の統合を必要とするAIエージェントに最適","ko":"고급 ERC-4337 호환 월렛 개발 및 통합 개인 정보 보호 기능을 필요로 하는 이더리움 중심 인공 지능 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA centrados en Ethereum que requieren un desarrollo de billeteras avanzadas compatibles con ERC-4337 con características de privacidad integradas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur Ethereum nécessitant un développement de portefeuilles avancé compatible ERC-4337 avec des fonctionnalités de confidentialité intégrées","de":"Ideal für Ethereum-fokussierte KI-Agents, die ein fortschrittliches ERC-4337-kompatibles Wallet-Entwicklung mit integrierten Datenschutzfunktionen benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados em Ethereum que requerem desenvolvimento de carteiras avançadas compatíveis com ERC-4337 com recursos de privacidade integrados","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на Ethereum, требующих продвинутого развития кошельков, соответствующих ERC-4337, с интегрированными функциями конфиденциальности","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الموجه إلى إيثيريوم الذي يتطلب تطويرًا متقدمًا لمحفظة ERC-4337 مع ميزات الخصوصية المتكاملة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop secure and private Account Abstraction wallets using smart contract templates, testing frameworks, and privacy validation tools, enabling the protection of sensitive data such as vehicle identity while maintaining on-chain functionality through ERC-4337 protocols","zh":"赋予代理开发人员使用智能合约模板、测试框架和隐私验证工具来创建安全且私有的账户抽象钱包的能力，从而在保持ERC-4337协议的链上功能的同时保护诸如车辆身份等敏感数据","ja":"スマートコントラクトテンプレート、テストフレームワーク、プライバシー検証ツールを使用して、セキュアでプライベートなアカウント抽象化ウォレットを開発し、ERC-4337プロトコルのオンチェーン機能を維持しながら、車両IDなどの機密データを保護する能力をエージェントに与える","ko":"스마트 계약 템플릿, 테스트 프레임워크 및 개인 정보 보호 검증 도구를 사용하여 보안 및 개인 정보 보호 계정 추상화 월렛을 개발하여 ERC-4337 프로토콜의 체인 상 기능을 유지하면서 차량 ID 등의 민감한 데이터를 보호할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar billeteras de abstracción de cuentas seguras y privadas utilizando plantillas de contratos inteligentes, marcos de pruebas y herramientas de validación de privacidad, lo que permite la protección de datos sensibles como la identidad del vehículo mientras se mantiene la funcionalidad en la cadena a través de los protocolos ERC-4337","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des portefeuilles d''abstraction de comptes sécurisés et privés en utilisant des modèles de contrats intelligents, des cadres de tests et des outils de validation de confidentialité, permettant ainsi la protection des données sensibles telles que l''identité du véhicule tout en maintenant la fonctionnalité sur la chaîne via les protocoles ERC-4337","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, sichere und private Kontenabstraktions-Wallets unter Verwendung von Smart-Contract-Vorlagen, Testframeworks und Datenschutz-Validierungstools zu entwickeln, wodurch der Schutz sensibler Daten wie der Fahrzeugidentität ermöglicht wird, während die Funktionalität in der Kette durch ERC-4337-Protokolle aufrechterhalten wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver carteiras de Abstração de Conta seguras e privadas usando modelos de contrato inteligente, estruturas de teste e ferramentas de validação de privacidade, permitindo a proteção de dados sensíveis, como identidade de veículo, mantendo a funcionalidade na cadeia através dos protocolos ERC-4337","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разрабатывать безопасные и конфиденциальные кошельки Абстракции Аккаунта с помощью шаблонов умных контрактов, тестовых фреймворков и инструментов проверки конфиденциальности, обеспечивая защиту конфиденциальных данных, таких как идентификатор транспортного средства, при сохранении функциональности в цепи через протоколы ERC-4337","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من تطوير محافظ抽象 الحساب الآمنة والخاصة باستخدام قوالب العقد الذكي وأطر الاختبار وأدوات التحقق من الخصوصية، وتمكين حماية البيانات الحساسة مثل هوية السيارة مع الحفاظ على الوظائف على السلسلة من خلال بروتوكولات ERC-4337"},"useCases":{"en":["Developing privacy-preserving wallets for vehicle identity management","Implementing secure Account Abstraction wallets with smart contract templates","Validating privacy features in ERC-4337 compliant wallet applications"],"zh":["为车辆身份管理开发隐私保护钱包","使用智能合约模板实现安全的账户抽象钱包","验证ERC-4337兼容钱包应用中的隐私功能"],"ja":["車両ID管理のためのプライバシー保護ウォレットを開発する","スマートコントラクトテンプレートを使用してセキュアなアカウント抽象化ウォレットを実装する","ERC-4337準拠のウォレットアプリケーションにおけるプライバシー機能を検証する"],"ko":["차량 ID 관리를 위한 개인 정보 보호 월렛 개발","스마트 계약 템플릿을 사용하여 보안 계정 추상화 월렛 구현","ERC-4337 호환 월렛 애플리케이션의 개인 정보 보호 기능 검증"],"es":["Desarrollar billeteras que preservan la privacidad para la gestión de la identidad de los vehículos","Implementar billeteras de abstracción de cuentas seguras con plantillas de contratos inteligentes","Validar características de privacidad en aplicaciones de billeteras compatibles con ERC-4337"],"fr":["Développer des portefeuilles qui préservent la confidentialité pour la gestion de l''identité des véhicules","Mettre en œuvre des portefeuilles d''abstraction de comptes sécurisés avec des modèles de contrats intelligents","Valider les fonctionnalités de confidentialité dans les applications de portefeuilles compatibles ERC-4337"],"de":["Entwicklung von Datenschutz-Wallets für die Fahrzeugidentitätsverwaltung","Implementierung von sicheren Kontenabstraktions-Wallets mit Smart-Contract-Vorlagen","Validierung von Datenschutzfunktionen in ERC-4337-kompatiblen Wallet-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Desenvolver carteiras que preservam a privacidade para gerenciamento de identidade de veículo","Implementar carteiras de Abstração de Conta seguras com modelos de contrato inteligente","Validar recursos de privacidade em aplicações de carteira compatíveis com ERC-4337"],"ru":["Разработка кошельков, сохраняющих конфиденциальность, для управления идентификатором транспортного средства","Реализация безопасных кошельков Абстракции Аккаунта с помощью шаблонов умных контрактов","Проверка функций конфиденциальности в приложениях кошелька, соответствующих ERC-4337"],"ar":["تطوير محافظ تحافظ على الخصوصية لإدارة هوية السيارة","تنفيذ محافظ抽象 الحساب الآمنة باستخدام قوالب العقد الذكي","التحقق من ميزات الخصوصية في تطبيقات المحفظة المتوافقة مع ERC-4337"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Ethereum smart contracts and ERC-4337 standards","Limited to Ethereum blockchain and ERC-4337 compliant use cases"],"zh":["需要以太坊智能合约和ERC-4337标准的知识","仅限以太坊区块链和ERC-4337兼容用例"],"ja":["EthereumスマートコントラクトとERC-4337規格の知識が必要","EthereumブロックチェーンとERC-4337準拠のユースケースに限定される"],"ko":["이더리움 스마트 계약 및 ERC-4337 표준에 대한 지식 필요","이더리움 블록체인 및 ERC-4337 호환 사용 사례로 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de contratos inteligentes de Ethereum y estándares ERC-4337","Limitado a la blockchain de Ethereum y casos de uso compatibles con ERC-4337"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en contrats intelligents Ethereum et en normes ERC-4337","Limité à la blockchain Ethereum et aux cas d''utilisation compatibles ERC-4337"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Ethereum-Smart-Contracts und ERC-4337-Standards","Begrenzt auf die Ethereum-Blockchain und ERC-4337-kompatible Anwendungsfälle"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de contratos inteligentes Ethereum e padrões ERC-4337","Limitado à blockchain Ethereum e casos de uso compatíveis com ERC-4337"],"ru":["Требует знания умных контрактов Ethereum и стандартов ERC-4337","Ограничен блокчейном Ethereum и случаями использования, соответствующими ERC-4337"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة العقود الذكية إيثيريوم ومعايير ERC-4337","محدود بسلسلة الكتل إيثيريوم وحالات الاستخدام المتوافقة مع ERC-4337"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('yudame/research/notebooklm-audio', 'community', 'yudame', 'research', 'yudame/research', 'notebooklm-audio', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z', '2026-02-18T03:53:21.846Z', NULL, '{"id":"yudame/research/notebooklm-audio","name":"notebooklm-audio","description":{"zh":"NotebookLM Audio Skill API, .","ja":"NotebookLM API NotebookLM Audio Skill","ko":"NotebookLM Audio Skill API","es":"NotebookLM Audio es una herramienta para generar audio cuando la API de empresa no está disponible. Permite a los desarrolladores crear podcasts y materiales educativos de manera manual.","fr":"NotebookLM Audio est un outil pour générer de l''audio lorsque l''API d''entreprise est indisponible. Il permet aux développeurs de créer des podcasts et des matériaux éducatifs de manière manuelle.","de":"NotebookLM Audio ist ein Tool zum Erstellen von Audio, wenn die Unternehmens-API nicht verfügbar ist. Es ermöglicht Entwicklern, Podcasts und Bildungsmaterialien manuell zu erstellen.","pt":"O NotebookLM Audio é uma ferramenta de análise de evidências que gera podcasts, relatórios e materiais educacionais. Aprenda a usá-lo como fallback manual quando a API do NotebookLM Enterprise não estiver disponível.","ru":"NotebookLM Audio - это инструмент анализа доказательств, который генерирует подкасты, отчеты и образовательные материалы. Узнайте, как использовать его в качестве ручного резерва, когда API NotebookLM Enterprise недоступен.","ar":"NotebookLM Audio هو أداة تحليل الإثبات التي تولد بودكاستات وتقارير ومواد تعليمية. تعرف على كيفية استخدامها كallback يدوي عندما لا تكون واجهة برمجة التطبيقات NotebookLM Enterprise متاحة","en":"Research tools and frameworks for evidence-based analysis across technology, health, economics, and human performance. Outputs include podcasts, reports, and educational materials."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"NotebookLM Audio Skill","ja":"NotebookLM","ko":"NotebookLM","es":"Generación de Audio NotebookLM","fr":"Génération d''Audio NotebookLM","de":"NotebookLM Audio Erstellung","pt":"NotebookLM Audio: Ferramenta de Análise de Evidências","ru":"NotebookLM Audio: Инструмент доказательного анализа","ar":"NotebookLM Audio: أداة تحليل الإثبات","en":"notebooklm-audio"},"description":{"zh":"NotebookLM Audio Skill API, .","ja":"NotebookLM API NotebookLM Audio Skill","ko":"NotebookLM Audio Skill API","es":"NotebookLM Audio es una herramienta para generar audio cuando la API de empresa no está disponible. Permite a los desarrolladores crear podcasts y materiales...","fr":"NotebookLM Audio est un outil pour générer de l''audio lorsque l''API d''entreprise est indisponible. Il permet aux développeurs de créer des podcasts et des ma...","de":"NotebookLM Audio ist ein Tool zum Erstellen von Audio, wenn die Unternehmens-API nicht verfügbar ist. Es ermöglicht Entwicklern, Podcasts und Bildungsmateria...","pt":"O NotebookLM Audio é uma ferramenta de análise de evidências que gera podcasts, relatórios e materiais educacionais. Aprenda a usá-lo como fallback manual qu...","ru":"NotebookLM Audio - это инструмент анализа доказательств, который генерирует подкасты, отчеты и образовательные материалы. Узнайте, как использовать его в кач...","ar":"NotebookLM Audio هو أداة تحليل الإثبات التي تولد بودكاستات وتقارير ومواد تعليمية. تعرف على كيفية استخدامها كallback يدوي عندما لا تكون واجهة برمجة التطبيقات ...","en":"Research tools and frameworks for evidence-based analysis across technology, health, economics, and human performance. Outputs include podcasts, reports, and..."},"definition":{"en":"Research tools and frameworks for evidence-based analysis across technology, health, economics, and human performance. Outputs include podcasts, reports, and educational materials."},"features":{"zh":["NotebookLM API","API","Podcast","API","NotebookLM"],"ja":["NotebookLM API","API","Podcast","API","NotebookLM"],"ko":["NotebookLM Audio Skill","API","Podcast","API","NotebookLM"],"es":["Generación de audio manual","Compatible con la API de empresa de NotebookLM","Permite la creación de podcasts y materiales educativos","Script de Python para generar el prompt","Funciona cuando la API de empresa no está disponible"],"fr":["Génération d''audio manuelle","Compatible avec l''API d''entreprise de NotebookLM","Permet la création de podcasts et de matériaux éducatifs","Script Python pour générer le prompt","Fonctionne lorsque l''API d''entreprise est indisponible"],"de":["Manuelle Audioerstellung","Kompatibel mit der Unternehmens-API von NotebookLM","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von Podcasts und Bildungsmaterialien","Python-Skript zur Erstellung des Prompts","Funktioniert, wenn die Unternehmens-API nicht verfügbar ist"],"pt":["Geração de podcasts e relatórios","Análise de evidências em tecnologia, saúde e economia","Uso como fallback manual quando a API do NotebookLM Enterprise não estiver disponível","Geração de prompts para análise de evidências","Suporte a múltiplos idiomas"],"ru":["Генерация подкастов и отчетов","Анализ доказательств в технологиях, здравоохранении и экономике","Использование в качестве ручного резерва, когда API NotebookLM Enterprise недоступен","Генерация запросов для анализа доказательств","Поддержка нескольких языков"],"ar":["توليد بودكاستات وتقارير","تحليل الإثبات في التكنولوجيا والصحة والاقتصاد","استخدامها كallback يدوي عندما لا تكون واجهة برمجة التطبيقات NotebookLM Enterprise متاحة","توليد البرومت للتحليل الإثبات","دعم اللغات المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["NotebookLM Audio Skill","API","Podcast","NotebookLM API","API","NotebookLM"],"ja":["NotebookLM API","NotebookLM","API","Podcast","NotebookLM Audio Skill","API"],"ko":["NotebookLM Audio Skill","NotebookLM","API","Podcast","NotebookLM API","API"],"es":["generación de audio","NotebookLM","API de empresa","desarrollo de audio","podcasts","materiales educativos","script de Python","prompts de audio"],"fr":["génération d''audio","NotebookLM","API d''entreprise","développement d''audio","podcasts","matériaux éducatifs","script Python","prompts d''audio"],"de":["Audioerstellung","NotebookLM","Unternehmens-API","Audioentwicklung","Podcasts","Bildungsmaterialien","Python-Skript","Audio-Prompts"],"pt":["análise de evidências","NotebookLM Audio","ferramenta de análise","geração de podcasts","relatórios","tecnologia","saúde","economia"],"ru":["анализ доказательств","NotebookLM Audio","инструмент анализа","генерация подкастов","отчеты","технологии","здравоохранение","экономика"],"ar":["تحليل الإثبات","NotebookLM Audio","أداة تحليل","توليد بودكاستات","تقارير","التكنولوجيا","الصحة","الاقتصاد"]}},"owner":"yudame","repo":"research","repoPath":"yudame/research","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"notebooklm-audio","description":"LEGACY SKILL - Manual NotebookLM web interface workflow. The primary workflow now uses notebooklm-enterprise-api for automated audio generation. Use this skill only when the API is unavailable.","bodyPreview":"# NotebookLM Audio Generation (Manual Fallback)\n\n**Status:** Manual fallback - Use when NotebookLM Enterprise API is unavailable.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- NotebookLM Enterprise API is unavailable (no paid subscription)\n- API automation fails and fallback is needed\n- User explicitly requests manual workflow\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Generate the Prompt\n\n**CRITICAL:** Always use the script. Never fabricate or modify the prompt.\n\n```bash\ncd ~/src/research/podcast/tools\npython","body":"# NotebookLM Audio Generation (Manual Fallback)\n\n**Status:** Manual fallback - Use when NotebookLM Enterprise API is unavailable.\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- NotebookLM Enterprise API is unavailable (no paid subscription)\n- API automation fails and fallback is needed\n- User explicitly requests manual workflow\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Generate the Prompt\n\n**CRITICAL:** Always use the script. Never fabricate or modify the prompt.\n\n```bash\ncd ~/src/research/podcast/tools\npython notebooklm_prompt.py ../episodes/EPISODE_PATH/ --copy\n```\n\nThe script:\n- Auto-detects episode title and series name from content_plan.md\n- Verifies all 5 required files exist\n- Outputs the correct prompt with proper branding\n- Copies to clipboard with `--copy` flag (macOS)\n\n**Required files (5 total):**\n```\nepisode-directory/\n├── research/p1-brief.md      # Research brief\n├── research/p3-briefing.md   # Master briefing\n├── report.md                 # Narrative synthesis\n├── sources.md                # Validated sources\n└── content_plan.md           # Episode structure guide\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: Show User the Script Output\n\nRun the script and display its **complete output** to the user. The output includes:\n- Episode and series info (auto-detected)\n- File checklist with status (✓ or ✗ MISSING)\n- The ready-to-paste prompt\n- Settings reminder\n- NotebookLM link\n\nExample output:\n```\n============================================================\nNOTEBOOKLM MANUAL AUDIO GENERATION\n============================================================\n\nEpisode: Strategic Selection\nSeries: Algorithms for Life\nDirectory: ../episodes/algorithms-for-life/ep2-strategic-selection\n\n📁 Files to Upload (5/5 ready):\n  ✓ p1-brief.md\n  ✓ report.md\n  ✓ p3-briefing.md\n  ✓ sources.md\n  ✓ content_plan.md\n\n============================================================\n📋 NOTEBOOKLM PROMPT (copy-paste ready):\n============================================================\n\nCreate a two-host podcast episode on: Strategic Selection from our Algorithms for Life series\n...\n\n============================================================\n\n⚙️  Settings: Format: Deep Dive | Length: Long\n\n🔗 Open: https://notebooklm.google.com/\n\n✓ Prompt copied to clipboard!\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 3: User Completes Manual Workflow\n\nGuide user through these steps:\n\n1. **Go to** https://notebooklm.google.com/\n2. **Create new notebook**\n3. **Upload all 5 source files** (shown in the checklist)\n4. **Click \"Audio Overview\" → \"Customize\"**\n5. **Paste the prompt** (already on clipboard from `--copy`)\n6. **Settings:** Deep Dive format, Long length\n7. **Generate and download audio** (~10-15 minutes)\n8. **Save audio file** to episode directory\n\n---\n\n## Step 4: Process Audio\n\nAfter download, use the `podcast-audio-processing` skill:\n- Convert to mp3 if needed\n- Transcribe with local Whisper\n- Generate chapter markers\n- Embed chapters into mp3\n\n---\n\n## Prompt Template Reference\n\nThe prompt is defined in `podcast/tools/notebooklm_prompt.py` (single source of truth).\n\nKey elements:\n- **References content_plan.md** for structure, hooks, key terms\n- **Brand intro:** \"Welcome to Yuda Me Research from our [Series] series by Valor Engels...\"\n- **Brand outro:** \"research dot yuda dot me - that''s Y-U-D-A dot M-E\"\n- **Style:** Define terms, cite specifics, distinguish correlation/causation\n- **Avoids:** Undefined jargon, fabricated examples, over-hedging\n\n**DO NOT:**\n- Duplicate the template elsewhere\n- Manually substitute placeholders\n- Add episode-specific content arcs (content_plan.md handles this)\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| Script shows missing files | Complete earlier phases first |\n| Can''t auto-detect title/series | Use `--title` and `--series` flags |\n| Clipboard copy fails | Manually copy from terminal output |\n| Audio too short | Check all 5 files uploaded, use Long setting |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:53:21.846Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Research Agents needing evidence-based audio content generation across technology, health, economics, and human performance.","zh":"非常适合需要基于证据的音频内容生成的研究代理，涵盖技术、健康、经济和人类绩效等领域。","ja":"技術、ヘルスケア、経済、人間のパフォーマンスなどの分野で証拠に基づくオーディオコンテンツ生成を必要とする研究エージェントに最適です。","ko":"기술, 건강, 경제, 인간 성능 등 다양한 분야에서 증거 기반 오디오 콘텐츠 생성이 필요한 연구 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de investigación que necesitan generar contenido de audio basado en evidencia en tecnología, salud, economía y rendimiento humano.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de recherche ayant besoin de contenu audio basé sur des preuves dans les domaines de la technologie, de la santé, de l''économie et de la performance humaine.","de":"Perfekt für Forschungsagenten, die evidenzbasierte Audioinhalte in den Bereichen Technologie, Gesundheit, Wirtschaft und menschliche Leistung generieren müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Pesquisa que precisam de conteúdo de áudio baseado em evidências em tecnologia, saúde, economia e desempenho humano.","ru":"Идеально подходит для исследовательских агентов, которым требуется генерация аудиоконтента на основе доказательств в области технологий, здравоохранения, экономики и человеческой производительности.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البحثيين الذين يحتاجون إلى محتوى صوتي قائم على الأدلة عبر التكنولوجيا والصحة والاقتصاد والأداء البشري."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality podcasts, reports, and educational materials using Python scripts and manual fallbacks, ensuring consistent output even when the NotebookLM Enterprise API is unavailable, leveraging technologies like Python and audio generation protocols.","zh":"赋予代理生成高质量播客、报告和教育材料的能力，使用Python脚本和手动回退，确保即使NotebookLM Enterprise API不可用时也能保持一致的输出，利用Python和音频生成协议等技术。","ja":"Pythonスクリプトと手動フォールバックを使用して、高品質のポッドキャスト、レポート、教育資料を生成するエージェントの能力を提供し、NotebookLM Enterprise APIが利用できない場合でも一貫した出力を保証することで、Pythonやオーディオ生成プロトコルなどの技術を活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 고 품질의 팟캐스트, 보고서 및 교육 자료를 생성할 수 있도록 하는 기능을 제공하며, Python 스크립트와 수동 폴백을 사용하여 NotebookLM Enterprise API가 사용할 수 없는 경우에도 일관된 출력을 보장하며, Python 및 오디오 생성 프로토콜과 같은 기술을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar podcasts, informes y materiales educativos de alta calidad utilizando secuencias de comandos de Python y soluciones de respaldo manuales, garantizando una salida coherente incluso cuando la API de NotebookLM Enterprise no esté disponible, aprovechando tecnologías como Python y protocolos de generación de audio.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des podcasts, des rapports et des matériaux pédagogiques de haute qualité en utilisant des scripts Python et des sauvegardes manuelles, garantissant une sortie cohérente même lorsque l''API NotebookLM Enterprise n''est pas disponible, en exploitant des technologies comme Python et des protocoles de génération audio.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, hochwertige Podcasts, Berichte und Bildungsmaterialien mithilfe von Python-Skripten und manuellen Fallback-Lösungen zu generieren, wodurch eine konsistente Ausgabe gewährleistet ist, auch wenn die NotebookLM Enterprise-API nicht verfügbar ist, und Technologien wie Python und Audio-Generierungsprotokolle nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar podcasts, relatórios e materiais educacionais de alta qualidade usando scripts Python e fallbacks manuais, garantindo uma saída consistente mesmo quando a API Enterprise do NotebookLM não estiver disponível, aproveitando tecnologias como Python e protocolos de geração de áudio.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать высококачественные подкасты, отчеты и образовательные материалы с помощью скриптов Python и ручных запасных вариантов, обеспечивая последовательный вывод даже тогда, когда API Enterprise NotebookLM недоступна, используя технологии như Python и протоколы генерации аудио.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على生成 بودكاست و تقارير و مواد تعليمية عالية الجودة باستخدام سكريبتات بايثون و أساليب احتياطية يدوية، مما يضمن إخراجًا متسقًا حتى عندما تكون واجهة برمجة تطبيقات NotebookLM غير متوفرة، مستفيدًا من تقنيات مثل بايثون و بروتوكولات توليد الصوت."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating podcasts on latest research findings","Creating educational materials for health and economics","Producing reports on human performance optimization"],"zh":["生成最新研究发现的播客","为健康和经济创建教育材料","生产人类绩效优化报告"],"ja":["最新の研究成果のポッドキャストを生成する","ヘルスケアと経済のための教育資料を作成する","人間のパフォーマンス最適化のレポートを生成する"],"ko":["최신 연구 결과를 포함한 팟캐스트 생성","건강과 경제를 위한 교육 자료 생성","인간 성능 최적화 보고서 생성"],"es":["Generar podcasts sobre los últimos hallazgos de investigación","Crear materiales educativos para la salud y la economía","Producir informes sobre la optimización del rendimiento humano"],"fr":["Générer des podcasts sur les dernières découvertes de recherche","Créer des matériaux pédagogiques pour la santé et l''économie","Produire des rapports sur l''optimisation de la performance humaine"],"de":["Generieren von Podcasts über die neuesten Forschungsergebnisse","Erstellen von Bildungsmaterialien für Gesundheit und Wirtschaft","Erstellen von Berichten über die Optimierung der menschlichen Leistung"],"pt":["Geração de podcasts sobre os últimos achados de pesquisa","Criação de materiais educacionais para saúde e economia","Produção de relatórios sobre otimização do desempenho humano"],"ru":["Генерация подкастов о последних научных открытиях","Создание образовательных материалов по здравоохранению и экономике","Производство отчетов об оптимизации человеческой производительности"],"ar":["توليد بودكاست حول أحدث النتائج البحثية","إنشاء مواد تعليمية للصحة والاقتصاد","إنتاج تقارير حول تحسين الأداء البشري"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires NotebookLM Enterprise API or manual fallback","Python environment necessary","Limited to audio content generation"],"zh":["需要NotebookLM Enterprise API或手动回退","需要Python环境","仅限音频内容生成"],"ja":["NotebookLM Enterprise APIまたは手動フォールバックが必要","Python環境が必要","オーディオコンテンツ生成のみ"],"ko":["NotebookLM Enterprise API 또는 수동 폴백 필요","Python 환경 필요","오디오 콘텐츠 생성만 가능"],"es":["Requiere la API de NotebookLM Enterprise o una solución de respaldo manual","Entorno de Python necesario","Limitado a la generación de contenido de audio"],"fr":["Nécessite l''API NotebookLM Enterprise ou une sauvegarde manuelle","Environnement Python nécessaire","Limité à la génération de contenu audio"],"de":["Benötigt die NotebookLM Enterprise-API oder eine manuelle Fallback-Lösung","Python-Umgebung erforderlich","Begrenzt auf die Generierung von Audioinhalten"],"pt":["Requer a API Enterprise do NotebookLM ou fallback manual","Ambiente Python necessário","Limitado à geração de conteúdo de áudio"],"ru":["Требует API Enterprise NotebookLM или ручного запасного варианта","Необходимо окружение Python","Ограничен генерацией аудиоконтента"],"ar":["يتطلب واجهة برمجة تطبيقات NotebookLM أو طريقة احتياطية يدوية","بيئة بايثون ضرورية","محدود بتوليد محتوى الصوت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('pcortes/swarm-attack/backlog-champion', 'community', 'pcortes', 'swarm-attack', 'pcortes/swarm-attack', 'backlog-champion', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z', '2026-02-18T03:53:14.535Z', NULL, '{"id":"pcortes/swarm-attack/backlog-champion","name":"backlog-champion","description":{"zh":"Backlog Champion是产品待办优先级辩论中的产品冠军，负责为最大化团队速度和价值的机会辩护","ja":"バックログチャンピオンはバックログ優先順位の議論における製品チャンピオンであり、チームの速度と価値を最大化する機会を擁護します","ko":"백로그 챔피언은 백로그 우선순위 토론에서 제품의 우선순위를 결정하는 책임을 지는 역할입니다","es":"El Backlog Champion es un defensor del producto que prioriza oportunidades para maximizar la velocidad del equipo y entregar valor.","fr":"Le Champion de Backlog est un défenseur du produit qui priorise les opportunités pour maximiser la vitesse de l''équipe et livrer de la valeur.","de":"Der Backlog-Champion ist ein Produkt-Verfechter, der Chancen priorisiert, um das Team-Tempo zu maximieren und Wert zu liefern.","pt":"O Backlog Champion é um defensor do produto que prioriza oportunidades para maximizar a velocidade da equipe e entregar valor","ru":"Чемпион бэклога - это защитник продукта, который расставляет приоритеты в机会 для максимизации скорости команды и доставки ценности","ar":"البطل المرتقب هو منصّف المنتج الذي يركز على الأولويات للفرص لتحقيق أقصى قيمة","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"产品待办优先级冠军","ja":"バックログチャンピオン","ko":"백로그 챔피언","es":"Backlog Champion: Maximiza la Velocidad del Equipo","fr":"Champion de Backlog: Accélerez la Vitesse de l''Équipe","de":"Backlog-Champion: Maximieren Sie das Team-Tempo","pt":"Backlog Champion: Maximizando Velocidade de Equipe","ru":"Чемпион бэклога: максимизация скорости команды","ar":"البطل المرتقب: تحقيق أقصى قيمة للفريق","en":"backlog-champion"},"description":{"zh":"Backlog Champion是产品待办优先级辩论中的产品冠军，负责为最大化团队速度和价值的机会辩护","ja":"バックログチャンピオンはバックログ優先順位の議論における製品チャンピオンであり、チームの速度と価値を最大化する機会を擁護します","ko":"백로그 챔피언은 백로그 우선순위 토론에서 제품의 우선순위를 결정하는 책임을 지는 역할입니다","es":"El Backlog Champion es un defensor del producto que prioriza oportunidades para maximizar la velocidad del equipo y entregar valor.","fr":"Le Champion de Backlog est un défenseur du produit qui priorise les opportunités pour maximiser la vitesse de l''équipe et livrer de la valeur.","de":"Der Backlog-Champion ist ein Produkt-Verfechter, der Chancen priorisiert, um das Team-Tempo zu maximieren und Wert zu liefern.","pt":"O Backlog Champion é um defensor do produto que prioriza oportunidades para maximizar a velocidade da equipe e entregar valor","ru":"Чемпион бэклога - это защитник продукта, который расставляет приоритеты в机会 для максимизации скорости команды и доставки ценности","ar":"البطل المرتقب هو منصّف المنتج الذي يركز على الأولويات للفرص لتحقيق أقصى قيمة","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["产品待办优先级辩论","最大化团队速度","最大化价值","产品冠军","团队合作"],"ja":["バックログ優先順位の議論","チームの速度を最大化","価値を最大化","製品チャンピオン","チームワーク"],"ko":["백로그 우선순위 토론","팀 속도 최대화","가치 최대화","제품 챔피언","팀 협력"],"es":["Priorización de oportunidades","Maximización de la velocidad del equipo","Entrega de valor máximo","Debate de priorización con el equipo","Colaboración con el Critic y el Moderador","Representación de la perspectiva del producto"],"fr":["Priorisation des opportunités","Accélération de la vitesse de l''équipe","Livraison de valeur maximale","Débat de priorisation avec l''équipe","Collaboration avec le Critic et le Modérateur","Représentation de la perspective du produit"],"de":["Priorisierung von Chancen","Maximierung des Team-Tempos","Lieferung von maximalen Wert","Priorisierungsdebatte mit dem Team","Zusammenarbeit mit dem Critic und dem Moderator","Vertretung der Produkt-Perspektive"],"pt":["Priorização de oportunidades","Maximização da velocidade da equipe","Entrega de valor","Debate de priorização","Colaboração com a equipe"],"ru":["Расстановка приоритетов в机会","Максимизация скорости команды","Доставка ценности","Дебаты по приоритизации","Сотрудничество с командой"],"ar":["ترتيب الأولويات للفرص","تحقيق أقصى قيمة للفريق","توصيل القيمة","مناقشة الأولويات","التعاون مع الفريق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["产品待办优先级","团队速度","价值最大化","产品冠军","团队合作","优先级辩论"],"ja":["バックログ優先順位","チームの速度","価値を最大化","製品チャンピオン","チームワーク","優先順位の議論"],"ko":["백로그 우선순위","팀 속도","가치 최대화","제품 챔피언","팀 협력","우선순위 토론"],"es":["Backlog Champion","priorización de oportunidades","velocidad del equipo","entrega de valor","desarrollo de producto","debate de priorización","colaboración en equipo","perspectiva del producto"],"fr":["Champion de Backlog","priorisation des opportunités","vitesse de l''équipe","livraison de valeur","développement de produit","débat de priorisation","collaboration en équipe","perspective du produit"],"de":["Backlog-Champion","Priorisierung von Chancen","Team-Tempo","Wert-Lieferung","Produkt-Entwicklung","Priorisierungs-Debatte","Team-Zusammenarbeit","Produkt-Perspektive"],"pt":["backlog champion","priorização de oportunidades","velocidade da equipe","entrega de valor","desenvolvimento de produtos","gestão de equipe"],"ru":["чемпион бэклога","расстановка приоритетов в机会","скорость команды","доставка ценности","разработка продуктов","управление командой"],"ar":["البطل المرتقب","ترتيب الأولويات للفرص","تحقيق أقصى قيمة","توصيل القيمة","تطوير المنتجات","إدارة الفريق"]}},"owner":"pcortes","repo":"swarm-attack","repoPath":"pcortes/swarm-attack","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"backlog-champion","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Backlog Champion (Product Velocity Advocate)\n\nYou are a **Product Champion** in the backlog prioritization debate. Your job is to advocate for the opportunities that will maximize team velocity and deliver the most value.\n\n## Your Role\n\nIn the 3-agent debate system:\n- **You** (Champion): Argue for prioritizing the best opportunities\n- **Critic**: Challenge your rankings with engineering concerns\n- **Moderator**: Synthesize both views into final rankings\n\nYou represent the **product perspective","body":"# Backlog Champion (Product Velocity Advocate)\n\nYou are a **Product Champion** in the backlog prioritization debate. Your job is to advocate for the opportunities that will maximize team velocity and deliver the most value.\n\n## Your Role\n\nIn the 3-agent debate system:\n- **You** (Champion): Argue for prioritizing the best opportunities\n- **Critic**: Challenge your rankings with engineering concerns\n- **Moderator**: Synthesize both views into final rankings\n\nYou represent the **product perspective**: What should we build next to move fastest?\n\n## Startup Philosophy\n\n**We optimize for:**\n- **Velocity** - What unblocks the most work?\n- **Impact** - What delivers the most value to users?\n- **Momentum** - What keeps the team moving forward?\n- **Quick wins** - What can we ship today?\n\n**We avoid:**\n- Analysis paralysis\n- Perfectionism over progress\n- Large risky bets when small wins exist\n- Technical debt cleanup when features await\n\n## Input Format\n\nYou receive a list of discovered opportunities:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"opportunities\": [\n    {\n      \"opportunity_id\": \"opp-tf-20250115-abc123\",\n      \"title\": \"Fix test_login failing\",\n      \"type\": \"test_failure\",\n      \"actionability\": {\n        \"clarity\": 0.9,\n        \"evidence\": 0.85,\n        \"effort\": \"small\",\n        \"overall\": 0.9\n      },\n      \"affected_files\": [\"tests/test_auth.py\", \"src/auth.py\"],\n      \"description\": \"Test failure with clear assertion error\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"context\": {\n    \"current_feature\": \"user-dashboard\",\n    \"blocked_issues\": [],\n    \"recent_failures\": 3,\n    \"budget_remaining_usd\": 2.50\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Prioritization Criteria\n\n### Tier 1: Blockers (Always First)\n- Test failures blocking CI/CD\n- Issues blocking other developers\n- Critical bugs affecting users\n- Failing builds\n\n### Tier 2: Quick Wins (High ROI)\n- Small effort, high clarity opportunities\n- Type errors, import issues, simple fixes\n- Opportunities with actionability score > 0.8\n- < 30 minutes to fix\n\n### Tier 3: Momentum Builders\n- Related to current feature work\n- Build on recent changes\n- Keep developers in flow state\n\n### Tier 4: Technical Health\n- Coverage gaps in critical paths\n- Complexity hotspots (but only if severe)\n- Stalled work that''s almost done\n\n## Argumentation Strategy\n\n### Make Strong Claims\n\n**GOOD**: \"Fix test_login first because it blocks 3 other tests and takes 10 minutes\"\n**BAD**: \"Maybe we could consider looking at the test issues\"\n\n### Use Data\n\n**GOOD**: \"Actionability 0.95, effort small, blocks CI - clear winner\"\n**BAD**: \"This seems important\"\n\n### Acknowledge Trade-offs\n\n**GOOD**: \"Yes, the complexity fix is larger, but test_login unblocks the entire auth suite\"\n**BAD**: Ignore counter-arguments\n\n### Stay Practical\n\n**GOOD**: \"We can fix this in 15 minutes and move on\"\n**BAD**: \"We should design a comprehensive test strategy\"\n\n## Output Format\n\nOutput valid JSON only:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"champion_rankings\": [\n    {\n      \"rank\": 1,\n      \"opportunity_id\": \"opp-tf-20250115-abc123\",\n      \"argument\": \"Highest ROI: 10-minute fix unblocks CI and 3 dependent tests. Actionability 0.95 means we know exactly what to do.\",\n      \"estimated_time_minutes\": 10,\n      \"impact\": \"Unblocks CI, enables 3 other tests\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"rank\": 2,\n      \"opportunity_id\": \"opp-sw-20250115-def456\",\n      \"argument\": \"Stalled feature is 80% complete. 30 minutes to finish means we ship today instead of carrying debt.\",\n      \"estimated_time_minutes\": 30,\n      \"impact\": \"Completes user-dashboard feature\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"rationale\": \"Prioritizing CI health first, then completing in-progress work. Both are quick wins with clear paths.\",\n  \"deferred\": [\n    {\n      \"opportunity_id\": \"opp-cq-20250115-ghi789\",\n      \"reason\": \"Complexity refactor is large effort, low urgency. Defer until we have a dedicated cleanup sprint.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Debate Rules\n\n1. **Lead with your strongest case** - Put your best argument first\n2. **Quantify when possible** - \"10 minutes\" beats \"quick\"\n3. **Connect to team goals** - Why does this matter for what we''re building?\n4. **Acknowledge the critic''s valid points** - Then explain why you still prioritize differently\n5. **Stay focused on impact** - Not on technical elegance\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n- \"We should fix everything\" - Prioritization means choosing\n- \"Let''s do a deep analysis\" - We''re moving fast\n- \"The right way would be...\" - The fast way that works is right\n- \"Eventually we''ll need to...\" - Defer future concerns\n\n## Cost Awareness\n\nYou have a budget for this debate session. Keep arguments concise:\n- Round 1: Make your case clearly\n- Round 2: Respond to critic, sharpen if needed\n- Round 3 (if needed): Final synthesis\n\nDon''t pad arguments. Say what matters, move on.\n\n## Remember\n\n**You are the velocity advocate.** Your job is to argue for the opportunities that move the team forward fastest. The critic will push back on feasibility. The moderator will balance. Trust the process, make your case strongly.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:53:14.535Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced product prioritization and backlog management capabilities, such as Cursor, Windsurf, or Claude Code.","zh":"适合需要高级产品优先级和待办事项管理功能的AI代理，例如Cursor、Windsurf或Claude Code。","ja":"高度な製品の優先順位付けとバックログ管理機能を必要とするAIエージェント、たとえばCursor、Windsurf、またはClaude Codeに適しています。","ko":"고급 제품 우선순위 및 백로그 관리 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다. 예를 들어 Cursor, Windsurf 또는 Claude Code와 같은 에이전트입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de priorización de productos y gestión de backlog, como Cursor, Windsurf o Claude Code.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de capacités avancées de priorisation de produits et de gestion de backlog, tels que Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Produkt-Priorisierungs- und Backlog-Management-Funktionen benötigen, wie z.B. Cursor, Windsurf oder Claude Code.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de priorização de produtos e gestão de backlog, como Cursor, Windsurf ou Claude Code.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности приоритизации продуктов и управления бэклогом, такие как Cursor, Windsurf или Claude Code.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحديد أولويات المنتجات وإدارة قائمة الانتظار، مثل Cursor و Windsurf أو Claude Code."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to advocate for product velocity and deliver maximum value by prioritizing opportunities, leveraging debate systems, and synthesizing product perspectives with engineering concerns, utilizing protocols like the 3-agent debate system and representing the product perspective.","zh":"赋予代理优先考虑机会、利用辩论系统、并将产品观点与工程问题综合起来，从而实现产品速度并提供最大价值，利用诸如3代理辩论系统的协议，并代表产品观点。","ja":"エージェントに機会を優先し、議論システムを利用し、製品の観点とエンジニアリングの懸念を統合することで、製品の速度を実現し、最大の価値を提供することを可能にします。3エージェントの議論システムなどのプロトコルを利用し、製品の観点を表現します。","ko":"에이전트가 기회를 우선적으로 고려하고 토론 시스템을 활용하고 제품 관점과 엔지니어링 문제를 통합하여 제품 속도와 최대 가치를 제공할 수 있도록 합니다. 3개 에이전트 토론 시스템과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 제품 관점을 표현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a abogar por la velocidad del producto y entregar el máximo valor al priorizar oportunidades, aprovechar los sistemas de debate y sintetizar las perspectivas del producto con las preocupaciones de ingeniería, utilizando protocolos como el sistema de debate de 3 agentes y representando la perspectiva del producto.","fr":"Permet aux agents de plaider en faveur de la vitesse de produit et de livrer une valeur maximale en priorisant les opportunités, en exploitant les systèmes de débat et en synthétisant les perspectives de produit avec les préoccupations d''ingénierie, en utilisant des protocoles tels que le système de débat à 3 agents et en représentant la perspective de produit.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, für die Produktgeschwindigkeit einzutreten und den maximalen Wert zu liefern, indem sie Chancen priorisieren, Debattensysteme nutzen und Produktgesichtspunkte mit Ingenieursbedenken synthetisieren, unter Nutzung von Protokollen wie dem 3-Agenten-Debattensystem und unter Berücksichtigung der Produktgesichtspunkte.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a defender a velocidade do produto e entregar o máximo de valor, priorizando oportunidades, utilizando sistemas de debate e sintetizando perspectivas de produto com preocupações de engenharia, utilizando protocolos como o sistema de debate de 3 agentes e representando a perspectiva do produto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отстаивать скорость продукта и доставлять максимальную ценность, придавая приоритет возможностям, используя системы дебатов и синтезируя перспективы продукта с проблемами инженерии, используя протоколы, такие как система дебатов 3 агентов и представляя перспективу продукта.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الدفاع عن سرعة المنتج وتقديم القيمة القصوى من خلال تحديد أولويات الفرص، واستخدام أنظمة المناقشة، ودمج وجهات نظر المنتج مع القضايا الهندسية، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل نظام المناقشة لثلاثة وكلاء وتمثيل وجهة نظر المنتج."},"useCases":{"en":["Prioritizing product backlog items for maximum team velocity","Debating and negotiating with critics to resolve engineering concerns","Synthesizing product and engineering views into final rankings with moderators"],"zh":["为了最大化团队速度而优先考虑产品待办事项","与批评者辩论和谈判以解决工程问题","将产品和工程观点综合为最终排名，使用调解员"],"ja":["チームの速度を最大化するために製品のバックログアイテムを優先する","批評家と議論し交渉してエンジニアリングの懸念を解決する","製品とエンジニアリングの観点を最終ランキングに統合する、調停者を使用する"],"ko":["チーム 속도를 최대화하기 위해 제품 백로그 항목에 우선순위를 지정하는 기능","엔지니어링 문제를 해결하기 위해 비평가와 논의 및 협상을进行하는 기능","제품 및 엔지니어링 관점을 최종 순위로 통합하는 기능, 조정자를 사용하여"],"es":["Priorizar elementos de backlog de producto para una velocidad máxima del equipo","Debatir y negociar con críticos para resolver preocupaciones de ingeniería","Sintetizar puntos de vista de producto y de ingeniería en clasificaciones finales con moderadores"],"fr":["Prioriser les éléments de backlog de produit pour une vitesse d''équipe maximale","Débattre et négocier avec des critiques pour résoudre les préoccupations d''ingénierie","Synthétiser les points de vue de produit et d''ingénierie en classements finals avec des modérateurs"],"de":["Priorisierung von Produkt-Backlog-Elementen für maximale Teamgeschwindigkeit","Debattieren und Verhandeln mit Kritikern, um Ingenieursbedenken zu lösen","Synthese von Produkt- und Ingenieursgesichtspunkten in endgültige Ranglisten mit Moderatoren"],"pt":["Priorizar itens de backlog de produto para velocidade máxima da equipe","Debater e negociar com críticos para resolver preocupações de engenharia","Sintetizar vistas de produto e engenharia em classificações finais com moderadores"],"ru":["Приоритизировать элементы бэклога продукта для максимальной скорости команды","Вести дебаты и вести переговоры с критиками для решения проблем инженерии","Синтезировать перспективы продукта и инженерии в окончательные рейтинги с модераторами"],"ar":["تحديد أولويات عناصر قائمة الانتظار للمنتج لتحقيق أقصى سرعة للفريق","المناقشة والتفاوض مع النقاد لحل القضايا الهندسية","دمج وجهات نظر المنتج والهندسة في التصنيفات النهائية مع المُoderadores"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with a 3-agent debate system","Limited to product perspective representation","Dependent on effective communication with critics and moderators"],"zh":["需要与3代理辩论系统集成","仅限产品观点表示","依赖于与批评者和调解员的有效沟通"],"ja":["3エージェントの議論システムとの統合が必要","製品の観点の表現のみ","批評家や調停者との効果的なコミュニケーションに依存する"],"ko":["3개 에이전트 토론 시스템과 통합해야 함","제품 관점 표현만 가능","비평가 및 조정자와의 효과적인 의사소통에 의존"],"es":["Requiere integración con un sistema de debate de 3 agentes","Limitado a la representación de la perspectiva del producto","Dependiente de una comunicación efectiva con críticos y moderadores"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec un système de débat à 3 agents","Limité à la représentation de la perspective de produit","Dépendant d''une communication efficace avec des critiques et des modérateurs"],"de":["Erfordert Integration mit einem 3-Agenten-Debattensystem","Begrenzt auf die Darstellung der Produktgesichtspunkte","Abhängig von einer effektiven Kommunikation mit Kritikern und Moderatoren"],"pt":["Exige integração com um sistema de debate de 3 agentes","Limitado à representação da perspectiva do produto","Depende da comunicação eficaz com críticos e moderadores"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с системой дебатов 3 агентов","Ограничен представлением перспективы продукта","Зависит от эффективного общения с критиками и модераторами"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع نظام المناقشة لثلاثة وكلاء","محدود بتمثيل وجهة نظر المنتج","يعتمد على التواصل الفعال مع النقاد والمُoderadores"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
