ng","Hohe Auflösung (2000x1600)","Verwendung von Playwright für die Automatisierung"],"pt":["Captura de todas as páginas do visualizador de manuais","Verificação visual de traduções","Layout correto","Sem discrepâncias de conteúdo ou traduções ausentes"],"ru":["Захват всех страниц просмотрщика руководств","Визуальная проверка переводов","Правильный макет","Нет несоответствий содержания или отсутствующих переводов"],"ar":["التقاط جميع صفحات معرض الدليل","التحقق المرئي من الترجمات","التخطيط الصحيح","لا توجد اختلافات في المحتوى أو ترجمات مفقودة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["capture-all-pages","翻译验证","布局检查","内容不匹配","缺失翻译","高分辨率截图","手册查看器"],"ja":["capture-all-pages","翻訳検証","レイアウト確認","内容不一致","欠落翻訳","高解像度スクリーンショット","手動ビューアー"],"ko":["capture-all-pages","번역 검증","레이아웃 확인","내용 불일치","누락 번역","고해상도 스크린샷","수동 뷰어"],"es":["captura de páginas","verificación visual","traducciones","diseño","Playwright","automatización","visor de manual","alta resolución"],"fr":["capture de pages","vérification visuelle","traductions","mise en page","Playwright","automatisation","afficheur de manuel","haute résolution"],"de":["Erfassung von Seiten","visuelle Überprüfung","Übersetzungen","Layout","Playwright","Automatisierung","Handbuch-Viewer","hohe Auflösung"],"pt":["capturar páginas","verificação de traduções","visualizador de manuais","alta resolução","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de teste"],"ru":["захват страниц","проверка переводов","просмотрщик руководств","высокое разрешение","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты тестирования"],"ar":["التقاط صفحات","التحقق من الترجمات","معرض الدليل","دقة عالية","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الاختبار"]}},"owner":"Takazudo","repo":"takazudomodular-manuals","repoPath":"Takazudo/takazudomodular-manuals","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"capture-all-pages","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Capture All Pages\n\nCapture all pages of the manual viewer at high resolution (2000x1600) for visual verification of translations.\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill captures screenshots of all pages in the manual viewer to verify that:\n\n- Translations match the page images\n- Layout is correct\n- No content mismatches or missing translations\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n\n- Dev server running on port 3100 (`pnpm dev`)\n- Playwright installed globally or in project\n\n**Usage:**\n\n```bash\n# Capture all pa","body":"# Capture All Pages\n\nCapture all pages of the manual viewer at high resolution (2000x1600) for visual verification of translations.\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill captures screenshots of all pages in the manual viewer to verify that:\n\n- Translations match the page images\n- Layout is correct\n- No content mismatches or missing translations\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n\n- Dev server running on port 3100 (`pnpm dev`)\n- Playwright installed globally or in project\n\n**Usage:**\n\n```bash\n# Capture all pages (default: 30 pages)\nnode .claude/skills/capture-all-pages/scripts/capture.js\n\n# Capture specific number of pages\nnode .claude/skills/capture-all-pages/scripts/capture.js --pages 280\n\n# Custom base URL\nnode .claude/skills/capture-all-pages/scripts/capture.js --base-url http://zmanuals.localhost:3100/manuals/oxi-one-mk2/page\n```\n\n## Configuration\n\nThe capture script supports these options:\n\n- `--pages <number>` - Total pages to capture (default: 30)\n- `--base-url <url>` - Base URL for pages (default: http://zmanuals.localhost:3100/manuals/oxi-one-mk2/page)\n- `--output-dir <path>` - Custom output directory (default: __inbox/captures-{timestamp})\n\n**Default settings:**\n\n- Viewport: 2000x1600 (high resolution for detail)\n- Output: `__inbox/captures-{YYYYMMDD}-{HHMMSS}/`\n- Format: PNG files named `page-001.png` to `page-NNN.png`\n- Timeout: 15 seconds per page\n- Wait after load: 2 seconds\n\n## Execution Workflow\n\n1. **Verify dev server is running**\n\n   ```bash\n   curl -s -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" http://zmanuals.localhost:3100/manuals/oxi-one-mk2/page/1\n   # Should return 200\n   ```\n\n2. **Run capture script**\n\n   ```bash\n   node .claude/skills/capture-all-pages/scripts/capture.js\n   ```\n\n   The script will:\n\n   - Create timestamped output directory\n   - Launch headless browser\n   - Capture each page sequentially\n   - Report progress and errors\n   - Save summary.json with results\n\n3. **Check results**\n\n   ```bash\n   ls -lh __inbox/captures-*/page-*.png\n   ```\n\n## Output Structure\n\n```\n__inbox/captures-20260103-163245/\n├── page-001.png (2000x1600)\n├── page-002.png (2000x1600)\n├── page-003.png (2000x1600)\n...\n├── page-030.png (2000x1600)\n└── summary.json (capture results)\n```\n\n**summary.json contains:**\n\n- Timestamp and configuration\n- Success/failure counts\n- Error details for failed captures\n\n## Notes\n\n- All screenshots saved to project''s `__inbox/` directory (gitignored)\n- Session timestamp prevents overwriting previous captures\n- Script uses headless Chromium (no visible browser window)\n- Failed page captures are logged but don''t stop the script\n- High resolution (2000x1600) allows detailed inspection of translations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:53:39.995Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Visual Verification Agents requiring high-resolution screenshot capabilities for translation validation.","zh":"适用于需要高分辨率截图功能以验证翻译的视觉验证代理。","ja":"高解像度のスクリーンショット機能を使用して翻訳の検証を行う視覚検証エージェントに最適です。","ko":"번역 검증을 위해 고해상도 스크린샷 기능이 필요한 시각적 검증 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Verificación Visual que requieren capacidades de captura de pantalla de alta resolución para la validación de traducciones.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Vérification Visuelle nécessitant des capacités de capture d''écran à haute résolution pour la validation des traductions.","de":"Ideal für visuelle Überprüfungsagenten, die Funktionen für Screenshots in hoher Auflösung zur Validierung von Übersetzungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Verificação Visual que exigem capacidades de captura de tela em alta resolução para validação de traduções.","ru":"Идеально для Визуальных Верификационных Агентов, требующих высокоразрешающих возможностей скриншотов для проверки перевода.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء التأكيد المرئي الذين يتطلبون قدرات لقطة الشاشة عالية الدقة للتحقق من الترجمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture all pages of manual viewers at high resolution (2000x1600) using Playwright, enabling visual verification of translations, layout correctness, and content mismatches.","zh":"通过使用Playwright，能够以高分辨率（2000x1600）捕获手动查看器的所有页面，实现翻译的视觉验证、布局正确性以及内容不匹配的检测。","ja":"Playwrightを使用して、手動ビューアのすべてのページを高解像度（2000x1600）でキャプチャし、翻訳の視覚検証、レイアウトの正確性、およびコンテンツの不一致を検出できるようにします。","ko":"Playwright를 사용하여 수동 뷰어의 모든 페이지를 고해상도(2000x1600)로 캡처하여 번역의 시각적 검증, 레이아웃 정확성 및 컨텐츠 불일치를 감지할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes capturar todas las páginas de los visores manuales en alta resolución (2000x1600) utilizando Playwright, lo que permite la verificación visual de las traducciones, la corrección del diseño y las discrepancias de contenido.","fr":"Permet aux agents de capturer toutes les pages des visionneuses manuelles en haute résolution (2000x1600) en utilisant Playwright, ce qui permet la vérification visuelle des traductions, la correction de la mise en page et les discordances de contenu.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, alle Seiten von Manual-Viewern in hoher Auflösung (2000x1600) mithilfe von Playwright zu erfassen, was die visuelle Überprüfung von Übersetzungen, die Richtigkeit des Layouts und Inhaltsmängel ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a capturar todas as páginas de visualizadores manuais em alta resolução (2000x1600) usando Playwright, permitindo a verificação visual das traduções, a correção do layout e as discrepâncias de conteúdo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью захватить все страницы ручных просмотрщиков в высоком разрешении (2000x1600) с помощью Playwright, что позволяет проверить перевод визуально, правильность макета и несоответствия содержания.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التقاط جميع صفحات مشاهد اليدوية بدقة عالية (2000x1600) باستخدام Playwright، مما يتيح التحقق المرئي للترجمات وضبط التخطيط واختلافات المحتوى."},"useCases":{"en":["Capturing screenshots for translation validation","Verifying layout correctness across all pages","Detecting content mismatches or missing translations"],"zh":["捕获截图以验证翻译","验证所有页面的布局正确性","检测内容不匹配或缺失的翻译"],"ja":["翻訳の検証のためにスクリーンショットをキャプチャする","すべてのページのレイアウトの正確性を検証する","コンテンツの不一致または欠落した翻訳を検出する"],"ko":["번역 검증을 위해 스크린샷을 캡처하는 것","모든 페이지의 레이아웃 정확성을 검증하는 것","컨텐츠 불일치 또는 누락된 번역을 감지하는 것"],"es":["Captura de pantallas para la validación de traducciones","Verificación de la corrección del diseño en todas las páginas","Detección de discrepancias de contenido o traducciones que faltan"],"fr":["Capture d''écran pour la validation des traductions","Vérification de la correction de la mise en page sur toutes les pages","Détection des discordances de contenu ou des traductions manquantes"],"de":["Erfassung von Screenshots zur Validierung von Übersetzungen","Überprüfung der Layout-Richtigkeit auf allen Seiten","Erkennung von Inhaltsmängeln oder fehlenden Übersetzungen"],"pt":["Captura de telas para validação de traduções","Verificação da correção do layout em todas as páginas","Detecção de discrepâncias de conteúdo ou traduções ausentes"],"ru":["Захват скриншотов для проверки перевода","Проверка правильности макета на всех страницах","Обнаружение несоответствий содержания или пропущенных переводов"],"ar":["التقاط لقطات الشاشة للتحقق من الترجمة","التحقق من صحة تخطيط جميع الصفحات","كشف عن اختلافات المحتوى أو الترجمات المفقودة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires dev server running on port 3100","Playwright installation required globally or in project"],"zh":["需要开发服务器在端口3100上运行","需要全局或项目安装Playwright"],"ja":["ポート3100で動作する開発サーバーが必要","Playwrightをグローバルまたはプロジェクトにインストールする必要がある"],"ko":["포트 3100에서 실행되는 개발 서버가 필요합니다","Playwright를 전역 또는 프로젝트에 설치해야 합니다"],"es":["Requiere servidor de desarrollo en ejecución en el puerto 3100","Se requiere la instalación de Playwright de forma global o en el proyecto"],"fr":["Nécessite un serveur de développement en cours d''exécution sur le port 3100","L''installation de Playwright est requise de manière globale ou dans le projet"],"de":["Benötigt Entwicklungsserver, der auf Port 3100 läuft","Playwright-Installation ist global oder im Projekt erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer servidor de desenvolvimento em execução na porta 3100","Instalação do Playwright necessária globalmente ou no projeto"],"ru":["Требуется запущенный разработческий сервер на порту 3100","Требуется глобальная или проектная установка Playwright"],"ar":["يتطلب تشغيل خادم التطوير على منفذ 3100","تثبيت Playwright مطلوب على المستوى العالمي أو في المشروع"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
