ajo para administrar entornos virtuales de Python","fr":"Cette compétence fournit des outils et des flux de travail pour gérer des environnements virtuels Python","de":"Diese Fähigkeit bietet Tools und Workflows zur Verwaltung von Python-Virtualumgebungen","pt":"Gerencie ambientes Python com eficiência, criando e gerenciando dependências com uv, o instalador e resolve de pacotes Python rápido","ru":"Управляйте средами Python эффективно, создавая и управляя зависимостями с помощью uv, быстрого инсталлятора и решателя пакетов Python","ar":"إدارة بيئات بايثون بفعالية، إنشاء وإدارة الإعتماديات باستخدام uv، وهو مثبت وحل حزمة بايثون سريع","en":"Code for sentiment analysis and topic modeling of public perceptions toward sidewalk delivery robots using YouTube comments (TRR 2025)."},"definition":{"en":"Code for sentiment analysis and topic modeling of public perceptions toward sidewalk delivery robots using YouTube comments (TRR 2025)."},"features":{"zh":["快速包安装","依赖管理","虚拟环境创建","环境更新和清理","故障排除"],"ja":["迅速なパッケージインストール","依存関係管理","仮想環境の作成","環境の更新とクリーンアップ","トラブルシューティング"],"ko":["빠른 패키지 설치","의존성 관리","가상 환경 생성","환경 업데이트 및 클린업","트러블 슈팅"],"es":["Instalación de uv","Creación de entornos virtuales","Instalación de dependencias","Administración de entornos","Depuración de errores"],"fr":["Installation de uv","Création d''environnements virtuels","Installation de dépendances","Gestion d''environnements","Débogage d''erreurs"],"de":["Installation von uv","Erstellung von Virtualumgebungen","Installation von Abhängigkeiten","Verwaltung von Umgebungen","Fehlerbehebung"],"pt":["Criação de ambientes virtuais com uv","Instalação de dependências com requirements.txt ou pyproject.toml","Gerenciamento de dependências com update, freeze ou clean up","Resolução de problemas com uv","Suporte a desenvolvimento Python eficiente"],"ru":["Создание виртуальных сред с помощью uv","Установка зависимостей с помощью requirements.txt или pyproject.toml","Управление зависимостями с помощью update, freeze или clean up","Решение проблем с помощью uv","Поддержка эффективной разработки Python"],"ar":["إنشاء بيئات افتراضية مع uv","تثبيت الإعتماديات مع requirements.txt أو pyproject.toml","إدارة الإعتماديات مع تحديث أو تجميد أو تنظيف","حل المشكلات مع uv","دعم تطوير بايثون الفعال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Python环境管理","uv","虚拟环境","包安装","依赖管理","Python开发"],"ja":["Python環境管理","uv","仮想環境","パッケージインストール","依存関係管理","Python開発"],"ko":["파이썬 환경 관리","uv","가상 환경","패키지 설치","의존성 관리","파이썬 개발"],"es":["entornos virtuales python","gestión de entornos python","uv","instalador de paquetes","resolutor de paquetes","desarrollo de python"],"fr":["environnements virtuels python","gestion de l''environnement python","uv","installateur de paquets","résolveur de paquets","développement python"],"de":["python-virtualumgebungen","verwaltung von python-umgebungen","uv","paket-installer","paket-auflöser","python-entwicklung"],"pt":["gerenciamento de ambiente python","uv python","ambientes virtuais python","desenvolvimento python","gerenciamento de dependências","instalador de pacotes python"],"ru":["управление средой python","uv python","виртуальные среды python","разработка python","управление зависимостями","инсталлятор пакетов python"],"ar":["إدارة بيئة بايثون","uv بايثون","بيئات افتراضية بايثون","تطوير بايثون","إدارة الإعتماديات","مثبت حزم بايثون"]}},"owner":"dudusoar","repo":"sdr-sentiment-analysis","repoPath":"dudusoar/sdr-sentiment-analysis","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"manage-python-env","description":"Python virtual environment management using uv for fast and reliable environment setup. Create, maintain, and manage Python virtual environments with dependency management. Use uv for environment creation, package installation, dependency resolution, and project configuration. Use when setting up new Python projects, managing dependencies, troubleshooting environment issues, or ensuring reproducible development environments.","bodyPreview":"# Python Environment Management Skill\n\nThis skill provides tools and workflows for managing Python virtual environments using uv, a fast Python package installer and resolver.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Install uv**: Ensure uv is installed on your system\n2. **Create environment**: Use uv to create a new virtual environment\n3. **Install dependencies**: Add packages from requirements.txt or pyproject.toml\n4. **Manage environment**: Update, freeze, or clean up dependencies\n5. **Troubleshoot**: Resolve c","body":"# Python Environment Management Skill\n\nThis skill provides tools and workflows for managing Python virtual environments using uv, a fast Python package installer and resolver.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n1. **Install uv**: Ensure uv is installed on your system\n2. **Create environment**: Use uv to create a new virtual environment\n3. **Install dependencies**: Add packages from requirements.txt or pyproject.toml\n4. **Manage environment**: Update, freeze, or clean up dependencies\n5. **Troubleshoot**: Resolve common environment issues\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n### 1. Environment Setup\n```bash\n# Initialize project with uv\nuv init project-name\ncd project-name\n\n# Create virtual environment\nuv venv\n\n# Activate environment\n# On Windows:\n.venv\\Scripts\\activate\n# On Unix/Mac:\nsource .venv/bin/activate\n```\n\n### 2. Dependency Management\n```bash\n# Install packages\nuv add package-name\nuv add \"package-name>=1.0.0\"\nuv add \"package-name[extra]\"\n\n# Install from requirements.txt\nuv pip install -r requirements.txt\n\n# Install with development dependencies\nuv add --dev pytest black\n```\n\n### 3. Project Configuration\n```bash\n# Generate requirements.txt\nuv pip freeze > requirements.txt\n\n# Sync environment\nuv sync\n\n# Update packages\nuv update\nuv update package-name\n```\n\n## uv vs Traditional Tools\n\n### Advantages of uv\n- **Speed**: 10-100x faster than pip\n- **Reliability**: Better dependency resolution\n- **Unified tool**: Replaces pip, venv, pip-tools\n- **Cross-platform**: Consistent behavior across systems\n- **Modern features**: Built-in virtual environments, lock files\n\n### Command Comparison\n| Task | uv Command | Traditional Command |\n|------|------------|---------------------|\n| Create venv | `uv venv` | `python -m venv .venv` |\n| Install package | `uv add package` | `pip install package` |\n| Install dev package | `uv add --dev package` | `pip install package` |\n| Freeze deps | `uv pip freeze` | `pip freeze` |\n| Sync env | `uv sync` | `pip install -r requirements.txt` |\n| Update package | `uv update package` | `pip install --upgrade package` |\n\n## Environment Types\n\n### Development Environment\n```bash\n# Complete development setup\nuv venv\nuv add --dev pytest black flake8 mypy\nuv add pandas numpy matplotlib\nuv sync\n```\n\n### Production Environment\n```bash\n# Production-ready with pinned versions\nuv venv --python 3.11\nuv add \"package==1.2.3\"  # Pin exact versions\nuv pip compile requirements.in -o requirements.txt\n```\n\n### CI/CD Environment\n```bash\n# Minimal environment for CI\nuv venv --python 3.11\nuv add --no-dev package-name\nuv sync --frozen\n```\n\n## Project Structure\n\n### Recommended Layout\n```\nproject/\n├── .venv/                 # Virtual environment (gitignored)\n├── src/                   # Source code\n├── tests/                 # Test files\n├── pyproject.toml         # Project configuration\n├── requirements.txt       # Pinned dependencies\n├── requirements-dev.txt   # Development dependencies\n└── .python-version       # Python version specification\n```\n\n### Configuration Files\n\n#### pyproject.toml\n```toml\n[project]\nname = \"my-project\"\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\ndescription = \"My project description\"\nrequires-python = \">=3.8\"\ndependencies = [\n    \"requests>=2.28.0\",\n    \"pandas>=1.5.0\",\n]\n\n[project.optional-dependencies]\ndev = [\n    \"pytest>=7.0.0\",\n    \"black>=23.0.0\",\n    \"flake8>=6.0.0\",\n]\n\n[tool.uv]\n# uv-specific settings\n```\n\n#### requirements.txt\n```\n# Pinned dependencies\nrequests==2.28.2\npandas==1.5.3\nnumpy==1.24.3\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### New Project Setup\n```bash\n# 1. Create project directory\nmkdir my-project && cd my-project\n\n# 2. Initialize with uv\nuv init\n\n# 3. Create virtual environment\nuv venv\n\n# 4. Activate environment\nsource .venv/bin/activate  # or .venv\\Scripts\\activate on Windows\n\n# 5. Add initial dependencies\nuv add requests pandas\nuv add --dev pytest black\n\n# 6. Create basic project structure\nmkdir src tests\ntouch src/__init__.py tests/__init__.py\n\n# 7. Create .gitignore\necho \".venv/\" >> .gitignore\necho \"__pycache__/\" >> .gitignore\necho \"*.pyc\" >> .gitignore\n```\n\n### Existing Project Setup\n```bash\n# 1. Clone repository\ngit clone https://github.com/user/project.git\ncd project\n\n# 2. Create environment with specific Python version\nuv venv --python 3.11\n\n# 3. Install dependencies\nuv sync\n\n# 4. Activate environment\nsource .venv/bin/activate\n```\n\n**Real-world example**: The YouTube-SC project includes complete setup scripts (`setup-environment.bat` and `setup-environment.sh`) and a comprehensive `requirements.txt` file. See `examples/youtube-sc/` for details.\n\n### Dependency Updates\n```bash\n# Check for updates\nuv update --outdated\n\n# Update all packages\nuv update\n\n# Update specific package\nuv update package-name\n\n# Update with constraints\nuv update --pre  # Include pre-release versions\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n#### 1. Environment Activation Fails\n**Symptoms**: `source .venv/bin/activate` doesn''t work\n**Solutions**:\n```bash\n# Check if .venv exists\nls -la .venv/\n\n# Try alternative activation\n. .venv/bin/activate  # Note the space after the dot\n\n# On Windows, use:\n.venv\\Scripts\\activate\n```\n\n#### 2. Package Installation Failures\n**Symptoms**: `uv add package` fails with errors\n**Solutions**:\n```bash\n# Clear uv cache\nuv cache clean\n\n# Try with verbose output\nuv add package -v\n\n# Check Python version compatibility\npython --version\n\n# Try different package version\nuv add \"package>=1.0.0,<2.0.0\"\n```\n\n#### 3. Dependency Conflicts\n**Symptoms**: `uv sync` fails with resolution errors\n**Solutions**:\n```bash\n# Use resolution strategy\nuv sync --resolution=highest\nuv sync --resolution=lowest-direct\n\n# Check existing dependencies\nuv pip list\n\n# Remove conflicting package\nuv remove conflicting-package\n```\n\n#### 4. Slow Package Installation\n**Symptoms**: uv is slow (unusual)\n**Solutions**:\n```bash\n# Use uv''s native resolver (already fast)\n# Check network connection\n\n# Use mirror or local cache\nuv config set global.index-url \"https://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple\"\n\n# Pre-download packages\nuv pip download package -d ./packages\n```\n\n## Advanced Features\n\n### Lock Files\n```bash\n# Generate lock file\nuv pip compile requirements.in -o requirements.txt\n\n# Install from lock file\nuv sync --frozen\n```\n\n### Multiple Python Versions\n```bash\n# Create environment with specific Python version\nuv venv --python 3.11\nuv venv --python 3.10\nuv venv --python 3.9\n\n# List available Python versions\nuv python list\n```\n\n### Environment Isolation\n```bash\n# Create isolated environment\nuv venv --isolated\n\n# Copy existing environment\nuv venv --copies\n```\n\n### Cross-Platform Compatibility\n```bash\n# Generate platform-specific requirements\nuv pip compile requirements.in --platform linux --platform macos --platform windows\n\n# Install platform-specific packages\nuv add \"package; sys_platform == ''linux''\"\n```\n\n## Integration with Other Tools\n\n### IDE Integration\n**VS Code**: Add to settings.json:\n```json\n{\n    \"python.defaultInterpreterPath\": \".venv/bin/python\",\n    \"terminal.integrated.env.windows\": {\n        \"VIRTUAL_ENV\": \"${workspaceFolder}/.venv\"\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**PyCharm**: \n- File → Settings → Project → Python Interpreter\n- Add → Existing environment → Select .venv/bin/python\n\n### Docker Integration\n```dockerfile\nFROM python:3.11-slim\n\n# Install uv\nRUN pip install uv\n\n# Copy project files\nCOPY . /app\nWORKDIR /app\n\n# Create virtual environment and install dependencies\nRUN uv venv && uv sync --frozen\n\n# Use the virtual environment\nENV PATH=\"/app/.venv/bin:$PATH\"\n\nCMD [\"python\", \"main.py\"]\n```\n\n### CI/CD Integration\n```yaml\n# GitHub Actions example\njobs:\n  test:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: astral-sh/setup-uv@v3\n      - run: uv sync --frozen\n      - run: uv run pytest\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### 1. Version Pinning\n- Pin exact versions in production (`==`)\n- Use ranges in development (`>=`)\n- Maintain separate requirements files for dev/prod\n\n### 2. Environment Management\n- Keep `.venv` in project directory (not global)\n- Include `.venv` in `.gitignore`\n- Document Python version requirement\n\n### 3. Dependency Hygiene\n- Regularly update dependencies\n- Remove unused packages\n- Audit for security vulnerabilities\n\n### 4. Reproducibility\n- Use lock files for exact reproducibility\n- Document environment setup in README\n- Test across Python versions\n\n## Resources\n\n- **uv Documentation**: See `references/uv-docs.md` for complete uv reference\n- **Common Recipes**: See `references/recipes.md` for common environment setups\n- **Troubleshooting Guide**: See `references/troubleshooting.md` for solving common issues\n- **Migration Guide**: See `references/migration.md` for migrating from pip/venv\n- **Project Examples**: See `examples/youtube-sc/` for real-world configuration files from the YouTube-SC project\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n\n- Setting up new Python projects\n- Managing dependencies for existing projects\n- Troubleshooting environment issues\n- Creating reproducible environments\n- Migrating from pip/venv to uv\n- Setting up CI/CD pipelines\n- Managing multiple Python versions\n- Ensuring cross-platform compatibility"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:53:29.543Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Development Agents needing efficient virtual environment management and dependency resolution.","zh":"非常适合需要高效的虚拟环境管理和依赖解析的Python开发代理。","ja":"Python開発エージェントが効率的な仮想環境管理と依存関係解決を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"효율적인 가상 환경 관리와 의존성 해석이 필요한 파이썬 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Python que necesitan una gestión eficiente de entornos virtuales y resolución de dependencias.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Python nécessitant une gestion efficace des environnements virtuels et une résolution de dépendances.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine effiziente Verwaltung virtueller Umgebungen und eine Auflösung von Abhängigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Python que necessitam de gerenciamento eficiente de ambientes virtuais e resolução de dependências.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Python, которым требуется эффективное управление виртуальными средами и разрешение зависимостей.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة بيئة افتراضية فعالة وحل للإعتماديات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Python virtual environments using uv, a fast Python package installer and resolver, streamlining dependency installation, updates, and troubleshooting with requirements.txt or pyproject.toml files.","zh":"赋予代理使用uv（快速的Python包安装器和解析器）管理Python虚拟环境的能力，从而简化依赖安装、更新和使用requirements.txt或pyproject.toml文件进行故障排除。","ja":"エージェントがuv（高速Pythonパッケージインストーラーと解決者）を使用してPython仮想環境を管理できるようにし、requirements.txtまたはpyproject.tomlファイルを使用した依存関係のインストール、更新、およびトラブルシューティングを効率化します。","ko":"에이전트가 uv（빠른 파이썬 패키지 설치자 및 해결자)를 사용하여 파이썬 가상 환경을 관리할 수 있도록 하여 dependencies.txt 또는 pyproject.toml 파일을 사용한 의존성 설치, 업데이트 및 문제 해결을 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar entornos virtuales de Python utilizando uv, un instalador y resolutor de paquetes de Python rápido, que simplifica la instalación, actualización y solución de problemas de dependencias con archivos requirements.txt o pyproject.toml.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les environnements virtuels Python en utilisant uv, un installateur et résolveur de packages Python rapide, qui simplifie l''installation, la mise à jour et la résolution des problèmes de dépendances avec des fichiers requirements.txt ou pyproject.toml.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Python-Virtualumgebungen mithilfe von uv, einem schnellen Python-Paket-Installer und -Resolver, zu verwalten, was die Installation, Aktualisierung und Fehlerbehebung von Abhängigkeiten mit Dateien requirements.txt oder pyproject.toml vereinfacht.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar ambientes virtuais Python usando uv, um instalador e resolutor de pacotes Python rápido, simplificando a instalação de dependências, atualizações e solução de problemas com arquivos requirements.txt ou pyproject.toml.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять виртуальными средами Python с помощью uv, быстрого инсталлятора и разрешающего пакетов Python, что упрощает установку зависимостей, обновления и устранение неполадок с файлами requirements.txt или pyproject.toml.","ar":"يُمنح الوكيل القدرة على إدارة البيئات الافتراضية لبايثون باستخدام uv، وهو مثبت وحل حزم بايثون سريع، وبذلك يُبسّط عملية تثبيت الإعتماديات وعمليات التحديث ومعالجة المشاكل مع الملفات requirements.txt أو pyproject.toml."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating isolated environments for sentiment analysis and topic modeling projects","Automating dependency updates and freezes for reproducible results","Troubleshooting environment issues with uv''s resolver"],"zh":["为情感分析和主题建模项目创建隔离环境","自动化依赖更新和冻结以获得可复制的结果","使用uv的解析器解决环境问题"],"ja":["感情分析とトピックモデリングプロジェクトのための隔離環境の作成","再現可能な結果を得るための依存関係の更新と凍結の自動化","uvの解決者を使用した環境の問題のトラブルシューティング"],"ko":["감성 분석 및 주제 모델링 프로젝트를 위한 격리 환경 생성","재현 가능한 결과를 얻기 위한 의존성 업데이트와 동결 자동화","uv의 해결자를 사용한 환경 문제 해결"],"es":["Crear entornos aislados para proyectos de análisis de sentimiento y modelado de temas","Automatizar actualizaciones y congelaciones de dependencias para resultados reproducibles","Solucionar problemas de entorno con el resolutor de uv"],"fr":["Créer des environnements isolés pour les projets d''analyse de sentiments et de modélisation de sujets","Automatiser les mises à jour et les gel des dépendances pour des résultats reproductibles","Résoudre les problèmes d''environnement avec le résolveur de uv"],"de":["Erstellen von isolierten Umgebungen für Projekte zur Sentimentanalyse und Themamodellierung","Automatisieren von Abhängigkeits-Updates und -Einfrierungen für reproduzierbare Ergebnisse","Beheben von Umgebungsproblemen mit dem Resolver von uv"],"pt":["Criar ambientes isolados para projetos de análise de sentimento e modelagem de tópicos","Automatizar atualizações e congelamento de dependências para resultados reproduzíveis","Solucionar problemas de ambiente com o resolutor uv"],"ru":["Создание изолированных сред для проектов анализа настроений и моделирования тем","Автоматизация обновлений и заморозки зависимостей для воспроизводимых результатов","Устранение неполадок среды с помощью разрешающего uv"],"ar":["إنشاء بيئات معزولة لمشاريع تحليل المشاعر ونمذجة المواضيع","تأتميم تحديثات وتجميد الإعتماديات للحصول على نتائج قابلة للتكرار","معالجة مشاكل البيئة باستخدام حل uv"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires uv installation","Python virtual environment management only","Limited to uv-compatible package installers and resolvers"],"zh":["需要uv安装","仅限Python虚拟环境管理","仅限uv兼容的包安装器和解析器"],"ja":["uvのインストールが必要","Python仮想環境管理のみ","uvと互換性のあるパッケージインストーラーと解決者のみ"],"ko":["uv 설치 필요","파이썬 가상 환경 관리만","uv와 호환되는 패키지 설치자 및 해결자만"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de uv","Gestión de entornos virtuales de Python solo","Limitado a instaladores y resolutores de paquetes compatibles con uv"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de uv","Gestion des environnements virtuels Python uniquement","Limité aux installateurs et résolveurs de packages compatibles avec uv"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von uv","Verwaltung von Python-Virtualumgebungen nur","Begrenzt auf uv-kompatible Paket-Installer und -Resolver"],"pt":["Requer instalação uv","Gerenciamento de ambiente virtual Python apenas","Limitado a instaladores e resolutores de pacotes compatíveis com uv"],"ru":["Требуется установка uv","Управление только виртуальными средами Python","Ограничен до инсталляторов и разрешающих пакетов, совместимых с uv"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت uv","إدارة بيئة افتراضية بايثون فقط","محدود بالمثبتين وحل الحزم المتوافقين مع uv"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
