"Next.js App Router: Современные шаблоны","ar":"Next.js App Router: أنماط حديثة","en":"nextjs-app-router"},"description":{"zh":"Next.js App Router提供现代化的应用路由解决方案，包括服务器组件、客户端组件、服务器操作和数据获取","ja":"Next.js App Routerはモダンなアプリケーションルーティングソリューションを提供します。サーバーコンポーネント、クライアントコンポーネント、サーバーアクション、データ取得など","ko":"Next.js App Router는 최신 애플리케이션 라우팅 솔루션을 제공합니다. 서버 컴포넌트, 클라이언트 컴포넌트, 서버 액션, 데이터 패칭 등","es":"El Next.js App Router ofrece patrones modernos para el desarrollo web. Aprende sobre componentes del servidor, componentes del cliente y estrategias de caché.","fr":"Le Next.js App Router propose des modèles modernes pour le développement web. Découvrez les composants serveur, les composants client et les stratégies de ca...","de":"Das Next.js App Router bietet moderne Muster für die Web-Entwicklung. Erfahren Sie mehr über Server-Komponenten, Client-Komponenten und Caching-Strategien.","pt":"O Next.js App Router é uma funcionalidade poderosa que permite criar aplicações web modernas e escaláveis. Aprenda a utilizá-lo com nossa guia","ru":"Next.js App Router — это мощная функция, которая позволяет создавать современные и масштабируемые веб-приложения. Узнайте, как ее использовать с нашей докуме...","ar":"Next.js App Router هو ميزة قوية تسمح بإنشاء تطبيقات ويب حديثة وقابلة للتوسيع. تعلم كيفية استخدامها مع دليلنا","en":"whatever"},"definition":{"en":"whatever"},"features":{"zh":["服务器组件","客户端组件","服务器操作","数据获取","路由管理"],"ja":["サーバーコンポーネント","クライアントコンポーネント","サーバーアクション","データ取得","ルーティング管理"],"ko":["서버 컴포넌트","클라이언트 컴포넌트","서버 액션","데이터 패칭","라우팅 관리"],"es":["Componentes del servidor por defecto","Componentes del cliente para interfaces de usuario interactivas","Acciones del servidor para mutaciones de formularios y actualizaciones de datos","Estrategias de caché y revalidación","Enrutamiento con diseños y límites de error"],"fr":["Composants serveur par défaut","Composants client pour des interfaces utilisateur interactives","Actions serveur pour les mutations de formulaire et les mises à jour de données","Stratégies de cache et de révalidation","Routing avec des dispositions et des limites d''erreur"],"de":["Server-Komponenten standardmäßig","Client-Komponenten für interaktive Benutzeroberflächen","Server-Aktionen für Formularmutationen und Datenaktualisierungen","Caching- und Revalidierungsstrategien","Routing mit Layouts und Fehlern"],"pt":["Server Components","Client Components","Server Actions","Data Fetching","Caching e revalidação","Routing e layouts"],"ru":["Server Components","Client Components","Server Actions","Data Fetching","Кеширование и переопределение","Маршрутизация и макеты"],"ar":["Server Components","Client Components","Server Actions","Data Fetching","التخزين المؤقت و إعادة التحقق","التوجيه و التصاميم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Next.js","App Router","服务器组件","客户端组件","服务器操作","数据获取","路由管理"],"ja":["Next.js","App Router","サーバーコンポーネント","クライアントコンポーネント","サーバーアクション","データ取得","ルーティング管理"],"ko":["Next.js","App Router","서버 컴포넌트","클라이언트 컴포넌트","서버 액션","데이터 패칭","라우팅 관리"],"es":["Next.js App Router","componentes del servidor","componentes del cliente","acciones del servidor","caché","revalidación","enrutamiento","desarrollo web"],"fr":["Next.js App Router","composants serveur","composants client","actions serveur","cache","révalidation","routing","développement web"],"de":["Next.js App Router","Server-Komponenten","Client-Komponenten","Server-Aktionen","Caching","Revalidierung","Routing","Web-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Next.js App Router","Server Components","Client Components","Desenvolvimento web","React","JavaScript","Caching","Routing"],"ru":["Next.js App Router","Server Components","Client Components","Веб-разработка","React","JavaScript","Кеширование","Маршрутизация"],"ar":["Next.js App Router","Server Components","Client Components","تطوير ويب","React","JavaScript","التخزين المؤقت","التوجيه"]}},"owner":"LimaTechnologies","repo":"admin-telegram-bot","repoPath":"LimaTechnologies/admin-telegram-bot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.413Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nextjs-app-router","description":"Next.js 15 App Router patterns. Server/Client components, Server Actions, data fetching, caching, layouts, routing. Use when implementing Next.js features.","bodyPreview":"# Next.js App Router - Modern Patterns\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert guidance for Next.js 15 App Router:\n\n- **Server Components** - Default rendering strategy\n- **Client Components** - Interactive UI patterns\n- **Server Actions** - Form mutations & data updates\n- **Data Fetching** - Caching & revalidation strategies\n- **Routing** - Layouts, loading, error boundaries\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### 1. Server Components (Default)\n\n> Components are Server Components by default. Only add `''use client''` when need","body":"# Next.js App Router - Modern Patterns\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert guidance for Next.js 15 App Router:\n\n- **Server Components** - Default rendering strategy\n- **Client Components** - Interactive UI patterns\n- **Server Actions** - Form mutations & data updates\n- **Data Fetching** - Caching & revalidation strategies\n- **Routing** - Layouts, loading, error boundaries\n\n---\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### 1. Server Components (Default)\n\n> Components are Server Components by default. Only add `''use client''` when needed.\n\n```tsx\n// Server Component (default) - can access DB directly\nasync function UserProfile({ userId }: { userId: string }) {\n\tconst user = await db.user.findUnique({ where: { id: userId } });\n\treturn <div>{user.name}</div>;\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Client Components (Interactive Only)\n\n> Only use `''use client''` for interactivity (hooks, events, browser APIs).\n\n```tsx\n''use client'';\n\nimport { useState } from ''react'';\n\nexport function Counter() {\n\tconst [count, setCount] = useState(0);\n\treturn <button onClick={() => setCount(count + 1)}>{count}</button>;\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Server Actions (Mutations)\n\n> Use Server Actions for form submissions and data mutations.\n\n```tsx\n// app/actions.ts\n''use server'';\n\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\nimport { revalidatePath } from ''next/cache'';\n\nconst createUserSchema = z.object({\n\tname: z.string().min(2),\n\temail: z.string().email(),\n});\n\nexport async function createUser(formData: FormData) {\n\tconst data = createUserSchema.parse({\n\t\tname: formData.get(''name''),\n\t\temail: formData.get(''email''),\n\t});\n\n\tawait db.user.create({ data });\n\trevalidatePath(''/users'');\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## File Structure\n\n```\napp/\n├── layout.tsx           # Root layout (required)\n├── page.tsx            # Home page\n├── loading.tsx         # Loading UI\n├── error.tsx           # Error boundary\n├── not-found.tsx       # 404 page\n├── (auth)/             # Route group (no URL segment)\n│   ├── login/page.tsx\n│   └── register/page.tsx\n├── dashboard/\n│   ├── layout.tsx      # Nested layout\n│   ├── page.tsx\n│   └── [id]/           # Dynamic route\n│       └── page.tsx\n└── api/\n    └── trpc/[trpc]/route.ts\n```\n\n---\n\n## Data Fetching Patterns\n\n### Static Data (Default)\n\n```tsx\n// Cached at build time\nasync function getProducts() {\n\tconst res = await fetch(''https://api.example.com/products'');\n\treturn res.json();\n}\n```\n\n### Dynamic Data\n\n```tsx\n// Always fresh\nasync function getUser(id: string) {\n\tconst res = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/users/${id}`, {\n\t\tcache: ''no-store'',\n\t});\n\treturn res.json();\n}\n```\n\n### Revalidate on Interval\n\n```tsx\n// Revalidate every 60 seconds\nasync function getPosts() {\n\tconst res = await fetch(''https://api.example.com/posts'', {\n\t\tnext: { revalidate: 60 },\n\t});\n\treturn res.json();\n}\n```\n\n### On-Demand Revalidation\n\n```tsx\n''use server'';\n\nimport { revalidatePath, revalidateTag } from ''next/cache'';\n\nexport async function updatePost(id: string) {\n  await db.post.update({ where: { id }, data: { ... } });\n\n  revalidatePath(''/posts'');           // Revalidate path\n  revalidateTag(''posts'');             // Revalidate tag\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Loading & Error States\n\n### Loading UI\n\n```tsx\n// app/dashboard/loading.tsx\nexport default function Loading() {\n\treturn <DashboardSkeleton />;\n}\n```\n\n### Error Boundary\n\n```tsx\n// app/dashboard/error.tsx\n''use client'';\n\nexport default function Error({ error, reset }: { error: Error; reset: () => void }) {\n\treturn (\n\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<h2>Something went wrong!</h2>\n\t\t\t<button onClick={() => reset()}>Try again</button>\n\t\t</div>\n\t);\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Metadata & SEO\n\n### Static Metadata\n\n```tsx\n// app/page.tsx\nimport type { Metadata } from ''next'';\n\nexport const metadata: Metadata = {\n\ttitle: ''Home | MyApp'',\n\tdescription: ''Welcome to MyApp'',\n};\n```\n\n### Dynamic Metadata\n\n```tsx\n// app/products/[id]/page.tsx\nimport type { Metadata } from ''next'';\n\nexport async function generateMetadata({ params }: { params: { id: string } }): Promise<Metadata> {\n\tconst product = await getProduct(params.id);\n\treturn {\n\t\ttitle: product.name,\n\t\tdescription: product.description,\n\t};\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Route Handlers (API)\n\n```tsx\n// app/api/users/route.ts\nimport { NextResponse } from ''next/server'';\n\nexport async function GET() {\n\tconst users = await db.user.findMany();\n\treturn NextResponse.json(users);\n}\n\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n\tconst body = await request.json();\n\tconst user = await db.user.create({ data: body });\n\treturn NextResponse.json(user, { status: 201 });\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Middleware\n\n```tsx\n// middleware.ts (root)\nimport { NextResponse } from ''next/server'';\nimport type { NextRequest } from ''next/server'';\n\nexport function middleware(request: NextRequest) {\n\t// Check auth\n\tconst token = request.cookies.get(''token'');\n\n\tif (!token && request.nextUrl.pathname.startsWith(''/dashboard'')) {\n\t\treturn NextResponse.redirect(new URL(''/login'', request.url));\n\t}\n\n\treturn NextResponse.next();\n}\n\nexport const config = {\n\tmatcher: [''/dashboard/:path*''],\n};\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Parallel Data Fetching\n\n```tsx\nasync function Dashboard() {\n\t// Fetch in parallel\n\tconst [user, posts, notifications] = await Promise.all([\n\t\tgetUser(),\n\t\tgetPosts(),\n\t\tgetNotifications(),\n\t]);\n\n\treturn (\n\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<UserCard user={user} />\n\t\t\t<PostList posts={posts} />\n\t\t\t<NotificationBell count={notifications.length} />\n\t\t</div>\n\t);\n}\n```\n\n### Streaming with Suspense\n\n```tsx\nimport { Suspense } from ''react'';\n\nexport default function Page() {\n\treturn (\n\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<h1>Dashboard</h1>\n\t\t\t<Suspense fallback={<UserSkeleton />}>\n\t\t\t\t<UserProfile />\n\t\t\t</Suspense>\n\t\t\t<Suspense fallback={<PostsSkeleton />}>\n\t\t\t\t<RecentPosts />\n\t\t\t</Suspense>\n\t\t</div>\n\t);\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Agent Integration\n\nThis skill is used by:\n\n- **nextjs-expert** subagent\n- **orchestrator** for routing Next.js tasks\n- **ui-mobile/tablet/desktop** for platform-specific pages\n\n---\n\n## FORBIDDEN\n\n1. **''use client'' without reason** - Default is server\n2. **useEffect for data fetching** - Use async components\n3. **getServerSideProps/getStaticProps** - App Router uses async components\n4. **API routes for internal data** - Use Server Components directly\n5. **Client-side auth checks only** - Use middleware\n\n---\n\n## Version\n\n- **v1.0.0** - Initial implementation based on Next.js 15 patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:53:42.688Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced Next.js 15 App Router patterns and optimized routing strategies.","zh":"适用于需要高级 Next.js 15 App Router 模式和优化路由策略的前端代理。","ja":"Next.js 15 App Router の高度なパターンと最適化されたルーティング戦略を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 Next.js 15 App Router 패턴 및 최적화된 라우팅 전략이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan patrones de enrutamiento avanzados de Next.js 15 App Router y estrategias de enrutamiento optimizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de modèles de routage avancés de Next.js 15 App Router et de stratégies de routage optimisées.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Next.js 15 App Router-Muster und optimierte Routing-Strategien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de padrões avançados de Next.js 15 App Router e estratégias de roteamento otimizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым требуются продвинутые шаблоны Next.js 15 App Router и оптимизированные стратегии маршрутизации.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى أنماط متقدمة من Next.js 15 App Router واستراتيجيات التوجيه المتميزة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Server Components for default rendering, Client Components for interactive UI, and Server Actions for form mutations, while optimizing data fetching with caching and revalidation strategies using Next.js 15 App Router.","zh":"赋予代理使用服务器组件进行默认渲染、客户端组件进行交互式 UI 以及服务器操作进行表单变异，同时使用 Next.js 15 App Router 优化数据获取和缓存、重新验证策略。","ja":"デフォルトのレンダリングにサーバーコンポーネント、インタラクティブな UI にクライアントコンポーネント、フォームの変異にサーバーアクションを使用することをエージェントに可能にし、Next.js 15 App Router を使用してデータの取得とキャッシュ、再検証戦略を最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 기본 렌더링을 위한 서버 컴포넌트, 상호작용형 UI를 위한 클라이언트 컴포넌트 및 양식 변형을 위한 서버 액션을 사용할 수 있도록 하며, Next.js 15 App Router를 사용하여 데이터 가져오기 및 캐싱, 재검증 전략을 최적화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar los componentes del servidor para la renderización predeterminada, los componentes del cliente para la interfaz de usuario interactiva y las acciones del servidor para las mutaciones de formularios, al mismo tiempo que optimiza la recuperación de datos con estrategias de caché y revalidación utilizando Next.js 15 App Router.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser les composants serveur pour le rendu par défaut, les composants client pour l''interface utilisateur interactive et les actions serveur pour les mutations de formulaire, tout en optimisant la récupération de données avec des stratégies de cache et de révalidation à l''aide de Next.js 15 App Router.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Server-Komponenten für die Standardrendering, Client-Komponenten für interaktive Benutzeroberflächen und Server-Aktionen für Formularmutationen zu nutzen, während gleichzeitig die Datenabfrage mit Cache- und Revalidierungsstrategien mithilfe von Next.js 15 App Router optimiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar Componentes do Servidor para renderização padrão, Componentes do Cliente para interface do usuário interativa e Ações do Servidor para mutações de formulário, ao mesmo tempo em que otimiza a captura de dados com estratégias de cache e revalidação usando Next.js 15 App Router.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать компоненты сервера для стандартного рендеринга, компоненты клиента для интерактивного пользовательского интерфейса и действия сервера для мутаций формы, а также оптимизировать получение данных с помощью стратегий кэширования и переоценки с использованием Next.js 15 App Router.","ar":"يُمكّن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من مكونات الخادم لترndering الافتراضي، ومكونات العميل لواجهة المستخدم التفاعلية، وأفعال الخادم لتحويلات النموذج، وفي الوقت نفسه تحسين استرجاع البيانات باستخدام استراتيجيات التخزين المؤقت وإعادة التحقق باستخدام Next.js 15 App Router."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Server Components for default rendering","Optimizing data fetching with caching and revalidation strategies","Creating interactive UI patterns with Client Components","Handling form mutations and data updates with Server Actions"],"zh":["实现服务器组件的默认渲染","使用缓存和重新验证策略优化数据获取","使用客户端组件创建交互式 UI 模式","使用服务器操作处理表单变异和数据更新"],"ja":["デフォルトのレンダリングのためのサーバーコンポーネントの実装","キャッシュと再検証戦略を使用したデータの取得の最適化","クライアントコンポーネントを使用したインタラクティブな UI パターンの作成","サーバーアクションを使用したフォームの変異とデータの更新の処理"],"ko":["기본 렌더링을 위한 서버 컴포넌트 구현","캐싱 및 재검증 전략을 사용한 데이터 가져오기 최적화","클라이언트 컴포넌트를 사용한 상호작용형 UI 패턴 생성","서버 액션을 사용한 양식 변형 및 데이터 업데이트 처리"],"es":["Implementar componentes del servidor para la renderización predeterminada","Optimizar la recuperación de datos con estrategias de caché y revalidación","Crear patrones de interfaz de usuario interactiva con componentes del cliente","Controlar las mutaciones de formularios y las actualizaciones de datos con acciones del servidor"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des composants serveur pour le rendu par défaut","Optimiser la récupération de données avec des stratégies de cache et de révalidation","Créer des modèles d''interface utilisateur interactive avec des composants client","Gérer les mutations de formulaire et les mises à jour de données avec des actions serveur"],"de":["Server-Komponenten für die Standardrendering implementieren","Datenabfrage mit Cache- und Revalidierungsstrategien optimieren","Interaktive Benutzeroberflächenmuster mit Client-Komponenten erstellen","Formularmutationen und Datenaktualisierungen mit Server-Aktionen verwalten"],"pt":["Implementação de Componentes do Servidor para renderização padrão","Otimização da captura de dados com estratégias de cache e revalidação","Criação de padrões de interface do usuário interativa com Componentes do Cliente","Manipulação de mutações de formulário e atualizações de dados com Ações do Servidor"],"ru":["Реализация компонентов сервера для стандартного рендеринга","Оптимизация получения данных с помощью стратегий кэширования и переоценки","Создание интерактивных шаблонов пользовательского интерфейса с помощью компонентов клиента","Обработка мутаций формы и обновлений данных с помощью действий сервера"],"ar":["تنفيذ مكونات الخادم لترndering الافتراضي","تحسين استرجاع البيانات باستخدام استراتيجيات التخزين المؤقت وإعادة التحقق","إنشاء أنماط واجهة المستخدم التفاعلية باستخدام مكونات العميل","معالجة تحويلات النموذج وتحديثات البيانات بأفعال الخادم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Next.js 15 or higher","Limited to React-based applications"],"zh":["需要 Next.js 15 或更高版本","仅限于基于 React 的应用程序"],"ja":["Next.js 15 またはそれ以上のバージョンが必要","React ベースのアプリケーションに限定"],"ko":["Next.js 15 또는更高 버전이 필요","리액트 기반 애플리케이션에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere Next.js 15 o superior","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en React"],"fr":["Nécessite Next.js 15 ou supérieur","Limité aux applications basées sur React"],"de":["Benötigt Next.js 15 oder höher","Begrenzt auf React-basierte Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer Next.js 15 ou superior","Limitado a aplicações baseadas em React"],"ru":["Требуется Next.js 15 или выше","Ограничен для приложений на основе React"],"ar":["يتطلب Next.js 15 أو أعلى","محدود للتطبيقات المبنية على React"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
