 지원","Parcel 지원","Tailwind CSS 지원"],"es":["Inicialización del repositorio frontend con scripts/init-artifact.sh","Desarrollo de artefactos con React, TypeScript y Vite","Empaquetado de código en un solo archivo HTML con scripts/bundle-artifact.sh","Visualización de artefactos para el usuario","Pruebas opcionales de artefactos"],"fr":["Initialisation du référentiel frontend avec scripts/init-artifact.sh","Développement d''artefacts avec React, TypeScript et Vite","Empaquetage de code en un seul fichier HTML avec scripts/bundle-artifact.sh","Affichage d''artefacts pour l''utilisateur","Tests optionnels d''artefacts"],"de":["Initialisierung des Frontend-Repositorys mit scripts/init-artifact.sh","Entwicklung von Artefakten mit React, TypeScript und Vite","Bündelung von Code in eine einzelne HTML-Datei mit scripts/bundle-artifact.sh","Anzeige von Artefakten für den Benutzer","Optionale Tests von Artefakten"],"pt":["Inicialização do repositório frontend com script personalizado","Desenvolvimento de artefatos com React e TypeScript","Empacotamento de código em um arquivo HTML único","Exibição de artefatos para o usuário","Opcional: teste de artefatos"],"ru":["Инициализация репозитория frontend с помощью скрипта","Разработка артефактов с помощью React и TypeScript","Упаковка кода в один файл HTML","Отображение артефактов для пользователя","Опционально: тестирование артефактов"],"ar":["تهيئة مستودع الواجهة الأمامية باستخدام سكريبت مخصص","تطوير المكونات باستخدام React و TypeScript","تحزيم الكود في ملف HTML واحد","عرض المكونات للمستخدم","اختياري: اختبار المكونات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["前端构建工具","Claude.ai","React 18","TypeScript","Vite","Parcel","Tailwind CSS"],"ja":["フロントエンドビルダー","Claude.ai","React 18","TypeScript","Vite","Parcel","Tailwind CSS"],"ko":["프론트엔드 빌더도구","Claude.ai","React 18","TypeScript","Vite","Parcel","Tailwind CSS"],"es":["generador de artefactos web","React","TypeScript","Vite","empaquetado de código","visualización de artefactos","pruebas de artefactos","desarrollo de artefactos web"],"fr":["construireur d''artefacts web","React","TypeScript","Vite","empaquetage de code","affichage d''artefacts","tests d''artefacts","développement d''artefacts web"],"de":["Ersteller von Web-Artefakten","React","TypeScript","Vite","Bündelung von Code","Anzeige von Artefakten","Tests von Artefakten","Entwicklung von Web-Artefakten"],"pt":["construtor de artefatos web","react","typescript","vite","desenvolvimento web","artefatos web personalizados","tecnologias web","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["построитель веб-артефактов","react","typescript","vite","веб-разработка","индивидуальные веб-артефакты","веб-технологии","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["بناء المكونات الإلكترونية","react","typescript","vite","تطوير الويب","مكونات إلكترونية مخصصة","تقنيات الويب","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"slavochek2","repo":"claritypledge","repoPath":"slavochek2/claritypledge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"awesome:web-artifacts-builder","description":"Suite of tools for creating elaborate, multi-component claude.ai HTML artifacts using modern frontend web technologies (React, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui). Use for complex artifacts requiring state management, routing, or shadcn/ui components - not for simple single-file HTML/JSX artifacts.","bodyPreview":"# Web Artifacts Builder\n\nTo build powerful frontend claude.ai artifacts, follow these steps:\n1. Initialize the frontend repo using `scripts/init-artifact.sh`\n2. Develop your artifact by editing the generated code\n3. Bundle all code into a single HTML file using `scripts/bundle-artifact.sh`\n4. Display artifact to user\n5. (Optional) Test the artifact\n\n**Stack**: React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + Parcel (bundling) + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui\n\n## Design & Style Guidelines\n\nVERY IMPORTANT: To avoid what","body":"# Web Artifacts Builder\n\nTo build powerful frontend claude.ai artifacts, follow these steps:\n1. Initialize the frontend repo using `scripts/init-artifact.sh`\n2. Develop your artifact by editing the generated code\n3. Bundle all code into a single HTML file using `scripts/bundle-artifact.sh`\n4. Display artifact to user\n5. (Optional) Test the artifact\n\n**Stack**: React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + Parcel (bundling) + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui\n\n## Design & Style Guidelines\n\nVERY IMPORTANT: To avoid what is often referred to as \"AI slop\", avoid using excessive centered layouts, purple gradients, uniform rounded corners, and Inter font.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Step 1: Initialize Project\n\nRun the initialization script to create a new React project:\n```bash\nbash scripts/init-artifact.sh <project-name>\ncd <project-name>\n```\n\nThis creates a fully configured project with:\n- ✅ React + TypeScript (via Vite)\n- ✅ Tailwind CSS 3.4.1 with shadcn/ui theming system\n- ✅ Path aliases (`@/`) configured\n- ✅ 40+ shadcn/ui components pre-installed\n- ✅ All Radix UI dependencies included\n- ✅ Parcel configured for bundling (via .parcelrc)\n- ✅ Node 18+ compatibility (auto-detects and pins Vite version)\n\n### Step 2: Develop Your Artifact\n\nTo build the artifact, edit the generated files. See **Common Development Tasks** below for guidance.\n\n### Step 3: Bundle to Single HTML File\n\nTo bundle the React app into a single HTML artifact:\n```bash\nbash scripts/bundle-artifact.sh\n```\n\nThis creates `bundle.html` - a self-contained artifact with all JavaScript, CSS, and dependencies inlined. This file can be directly shared in Claude conversations as an artifact.\n\n**Requirements**: Your project must have an `index.html` in the root directory.\n\n**What the script does**:\n- Installs bundling dependencies (parcel, @parcel/config-default, parcel-resolver-tspaths, html-inline)\n- Creates `.parcelrc` config with path alias support\n- Builds with Parcel (no source maps)\n- Inlines all assets into single HTML using html-inline\n\n### Step 4: Share Artifact with User\n\nFinally, share the bundled HTML file in conversation with the user so they can view it as an artifact.\n\n### Step 5: Testing/Visualizing the Artifact (Optional)\n\nNote: This is a completely optional step. Only perform if necessary or requested.\n\nTo test/visualize the artifact, use available tools (including other Skills or built-in tools like Playwright or Puppeteer). In general, avoid testing the artifact upfront as it adds latency between the request and when the finished artifact can be seen. Test later, after presenting the artifact, if requested or if issues arise.\n\n## Reference\n\n- **shadcn/ui components**: https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:55:23.328Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced web artifact development capabilities with React, TypeScript, and Vite.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Web工件开发能力的前端代理，支持React、TypeScript和Vite。","ja":"React、TypeScript、Viteを使用した高度なWebアーティファクト開発機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"React, TypeScript, Vite를 사용한 고급 웹 아티팩트 개발 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de desarrollo de artefactos web con React, TypeScript y Vite.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend qui nécessitent des capacités de développement d''artefacts web avancées avec React, TypeScript et Vite.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Web-Artifact-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten mit React, TypeScript und Vite benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento de artefatos web com React, TypeScript e Vite.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым требуются продвинутые возможности разработки веб-артефактов с использованием React, TypeScript и Vite.","ar":"مثالي لعمال الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتطوير مكونات الويب باستخدام React و TypeScript و Vite."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build powerful frontend artifacts using React 18, TypeScript, Vite, and Tailwind CSS, with seamless bundling using Parcel, and styling with shadcn/ui, to create interactive web experiences.","zh":"赋予代理构建强大的前端工件的能力，使用React 18、TypeScript、Vite和Tailwind CSS，并使用Parcel进行无缝打包，使用shadcn/ui进行样式设计，从而创建交互式的Web体验。","ja":"React 18、TypeScript、Vite、Tailwind CSSを使用して強力なフロントエンドアーティファクトを構築し、Parcelを使用してシームレスにバンドルし、shadcn/uiを使用してスタイリングを行い、インタラクティブなWeb体験を作成する能力をエージェントに与えます。","ko":"React 18, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 강력한 프론트엔드 아티팩트를 구축하고, Parcel을 사용하여 無縫 배포하고, shadcn/ui를 사용하여 스타일을 지정하여 상호 작용형 웹 경험을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir artefactos frontend potentes utilizando React 18, TypeScript, Vite y Tailwind CSS, con empaquetado sin problemas utilizando Parcel, y estilos con shadcn/ui, para crear experiencias web interactivas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des artefacts frontend puissants en utilisant React 18, TypeScript, Vite et Tailwind CSS, avec un empaquetage sans problème en utilisant Parcel, et un style avec shadcn/ui, pour créer des expériences web interactives.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, leistungsstarke Frontend-Artefakte mit React 18, TypeScript, Vite und Tailwind CSS zu erstellen, mit nahtlosem Bündeln mit Parcel und Stil mit shadcn/ui, um interaktive Web-Erfahrungen zu schaffen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir artefatos poderosos de frontend usando React 18, TypeScript, Vite e Tailwind CSS, com empacotamento sem problemas usando Parcel e estilização com shadcn/ui, para criar experiências interativas da web.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать мощные артефакты frontend с использованием React 18, TypeScript, Vite и Tailwind CSS, с бесшовной сборкой с помощью Parcel и стилизацией с shadcn/ui, для создания интерактивных веб-опытов.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء بناء مكونات قوية للموقع باستخدام React 18 و TypeScript و Vite و Tailwind CSS، مع حزمة بدون مشاكل باستخدام Parcel و تنسيق باستخدام shadcn/ui، لإنشاء تجارب الويب التفاعلية."},"useCases":{"en":["Building custom web artifacts with React and TypeScript","Creating interactive frontend components with Vite and Tailwind CSS","Bundling web applications into single HTML files using Parcel"],"zh":["使用React和TypeScript构建自定义Web工件","使用Vite和Tailwind CSS创建交互式前端组件","使用Parcel将Web应用程序打包成单个HTML文件"],"ja":["ReactとTypeScriptを使用してカスタムWebアーティファクトを構築する","ViteとTailwind CSSを使用してインタラクティブなフロントエンドコンポーネントを作成する","Parcelを使用してWebアプリケーションを単一のHTMLファイルにバンドルする"],"ko":["React와 TypeScript를 사용하여 사용자 지정 웹 아티팩트를 구축하는 것","Vite와 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 상호 작용형 프론트엔드 구성 요소를 생성하는 것","Parcel을 사용하여 웹 애플리케이션을 단일 HTML 파일로 묶는 것"],"es":["Construir artefactos web personalizados con React y TypeScript","Crear componentes frontend interactivos con Vite y Tailwind CSS","Empaquetar aplicaciones web en archivos HTML individuales con Parcel"],"fr":["Créer des artefacts web personnalisés avec React et TypeScript","Créer des composants frontend interactifs avec Vite et Tailwind CSS","Empaqueter des applications web en fichiers HTML individuels avec Parcel"],"de":["Erstellen von benutzerdefinierten Web-Artefakten mit React und TypeScript","Erstellen von interaktiven Frontend-Komponenten mit Vite und Tailwind CSS","Bündeln von Webanwendungen in einzelne HTML-Dateien mit Parcel"],"pt":["Construir artefatos web personalizados com React e TypeScript","Criar componentes de frontend interativos com Vite e Tailwind CSS","Empacotar aplicações web em arquivos HTML únicos usando Parcel"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских веб-артефактов с использованием React и TypeScript","Создание интерактивных компонентов frontend с использованием Vite и Tailwind CSS","Упаковка веб-приложений в единицы HTML-файлов с помощью Parcel"],"ar":["بناء مكونات الويب المخصصة باستخدام React و TypeScript","إنشاء مكونات الواجهة الأمامية التفاعلية باستخدام Vite و Tailwind CSS","حزمة التطبيقات الويب في ملفات HTML منفردة باستخدام Parcel"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires initialization using scripts/init-artifact.sh","Limited to frontend development with specified stack (React, TypeScript, Vite, Parcel, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui)"],"zh":["需要使用脚本/init-artifact.sh进行初始化","仅限于使用指定的技术栈（React、TypeScript、Vite、Parcel、Tailwind CSS、shadcn/ui）进行前端开发"],"ja":["scripts/init-artifact.shを使用して初期化する必要がある","指定されたスタック（React、TypeScript、Vite、Parcel、Tailwind CSS、shadcn/ui）のみを使用したフロントエンド開発に限定される"],"ko":["스크립트/init-artifact.sh를 사용하여 초기화하는 것이 필요하다.","지정된 기술 스택(React, TypeScript, Vite, Parcel, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui)만을 사용한 프론트엔드 개발에 한정된다."],"es":["Requiere inicialización utilizando scripts/init-artifact.sh","Limitado al desarrollo frontend con la pila especificada (React, TypeScript, Vite, Parcel, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui)"],"fr":["Nécessite une initialisation en utilisant scripts/init-artifact.sh","Limité au développement frontend avec la pile spécifiée (React, TypeScript, Vite, Parcel, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui)"],"de":["Benötigt Initialisierung unter Verwendung von scripts/init-artifact.sh","Begrenzt auf Frontend-Entwicklung mit der angegebenen Stack (React, TypeScript, Vite, Parcel, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui)"],"pt":["Exige inicialização usando scripts/init-artifact.sh","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de frontend com pilha especificada (React, TypeScript, Vite, Parcel, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui)"],"ru":["Требует инициализации с помощью scripts/init-artifact.sh","Ограничен разработкой frontend с указанной стэком (React, TypeScript, Vite, Parcel, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui)"],"ar":["يتطلب تهيئة باستخدام scripts/init-artifact.sh","محدود بتطوير الواجهة الأمامية مع مجموعة محددة (React و TypeScript و Vite و Parcel و Tailwind CSS و shadcn/ui)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
