que mejoran la colaboración y el orden en tus proyectos","fr":"Normes Git pour Orchestrator qui améliorent la collaboration et l''organisation dans vos projets","de":"Git-Standards für Orchestrator, die die Zusammenarbeit und Ordnung in Ihren Projekten verbessern","pt":"Os Padrões Git do Orchestrator são um conjunto de diretrizes para melhorar a organização e a colaboração no desenvolvimento de software","ru":"Стандарты Git Orchestrator представляют собой набор руководств для улучшения организации и сотрудничества в разработке программного обеспечения","ar":"معايير جيت أوركسترатор هي مجموعة من الإرشادات لتحسين التنظيم والتعاون في تطوير البرمجيات","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["标准化的分支命名","规范的提交消息","清晰的历史记录","提高项目开发效率","增强项目可维护性"],"ja":["標準化されたブランチ名","規範のコミットメッセージ","クリアな履歴","プロジェクト開発効率の向上","プロジェクトメンテナンス性の向上"],"ko":["표준화된 브랜치 이름","규칙적인 커밋 메시지","명확한 기록","프로젝트 개발 효율성 향상","프로젝트 유지보수성 향상"],"es":["Ramas convencionales","Commits convencionales","Historial de cambios limpio","Organización de flujo de trabajo","Seguimiento de estándares de proyecto"],"fr":["Branches conventionnelles","Commits conventionnels","Historique de modifications propres","Organisation du flux de travail","Suivi des normes de projet"],"de":["Konventionelle Branches","Konventionelle Commits","Sauberer Änderungsverlauf","Organisation des Arbeitsflusses","Einhalten von Projektnormen"],"pt":["Nomes de branch convencionais","Commits convencionais","Histórico de Git limpo","Organização de workflow de desenvolvimento","Padrões de Git para projetos","Melhoria da colaboração em equipe"],"ru":["Унифицированные имена веток","Унифицированные коммиты","Чистая история Git","Организация процесса разработки","Стандарты Git для проектов","Улучшение командной работы"],"ar":["أسماء فرع متوافقة","التزامات متوافقة","سجل جيت نظيف","تنظيم سير عمل التطوير","معايير جيت للمشاريع","تحسين العمل الجماعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Git 标准","Orchestrator Git","项目开发流程","Git 工作流","分支命名规范","提交消息规范"],"ja":["Git 標準","Orchestrator Git","プロジェクト開発フロー","Git ワークフロー","ブランチ名規範","コミットメッセージ規範"],"ko":["Git 표준","오케스트레이터 Git","프로젝트 개발 프로세스","Git 워크플로우","브랜치 이름 규칙","커밋 메시지 규칙"],"es":["estándares Git","Orchestrator","ramas convencionales","commits convencionales","flujo de trabajo","colaboración en equipo","proyectos de desarrollo"],"fr":["normes Git","Orchestrator","branches conventionnelles","commits conventionnels","flux de travail","travail d''équipe","projets de développement"],"de":["Git-Standards","Orchestrator","konventionelle Branches","konventionelle Commits","Arbeitsfluss","Teamarbeit","Entwicklungsprojekte"],"pt":["padrões git","desenvolvimento de software","organização de workflow","colaboração em equipe","noms de branch","commits","histórico de git","git standards","orchestrator git"],"ru":["стандарты git","разработка программного обеспечения","организация процесса разработки","командная работа","унифицированные имена веток","унифицированные коммиты","чистая история git","git стандарты","orchestrator git"],"ar":["معايير جيت","تطوير البرمجيات","تنظيم سير عمل التطوير","العمل الجماعي","أسماء فرع متوافقة","التزامات متوافقة","سجل جيت نظيف","معايير جيت","أوركسترатор جيت"]}},"owner":"GolferGeek","repo":"orchestrator-ai","repoPath":"GolferGeek/orchestrator-ai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Orchestrator Git Standards","description":"Orchestrator AI-specific Git conventions and standards. Branch naming, commit workflow, repository organization. CRITICAL: Follow conventional branch names, use conventional commits, maintain clean git history.","bodyPreview":"# Orchestrator Git Standards Skill\n\n**CRITICAL**: Follow Orchestrator AI Git standards: conventional branch names, conventional commits, clean history.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Creating branches\n- Making commits\n- Organizing git workflow\n- Following project Git standards\n\n## Branch Naming Standards\n\n### ✅ CORRECT\n\n```bash\nfeature/user-authentication\nfeature/add-api-endpoint\nfix/login-bug\nfix/memory-leak\nchore/update-dependencies\nchore/refactor-service\ndocs/update-readme","body":"# Orchestrator Git Standards Skill\n\n**CRITICAL**: Follow Orchestrator AI Git standards: conventional branch names, conventional commits, clean history.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Creating branches\n- Making commits\n- Organizing git workflow\n- Following project Git standards\n\n## Branch Naming Standards\n\n### ✅ CORRECT\n\n```bash\nfeature/user-authentication\nfeature/add-api-endpoint\nfix/login-bug\nfix/memory-leak\nchore/update-dependencies\nchore/refactor-service\ndocs/update-readme\ntest/add-unit-tests\nrefactor/auth-service\n```\n\n### ❌ WRONG\n\n```bash\n❌ my-feature\n❌ bugfix\n❌ update\n❌ feature_branch\n❌ FEATURE-BRANCH\n❌ feature/user authentication (spaces)\n```\n\n## Commit Message Standards\n\nSee **Conventional Commits Skill** for complete format. Quick reference:\n\n```bash\n# Format\n<type>(<scope>): <description>\n\n# Examples\nfeat(auth): add user authentication\nfix(api): resolve memory leak\nchore(deps): update dependencies\ndocs(readme): update installation guide\ntest(auth): add unit tests for auth service\nrefactor(api): restructure service layer\n```\n\n## Git Workflow Pattern\n\n### 1. Create Branch\n\n```bash\n# From main\ngit checkout main\ngit pull\n\n# Create feature branch\ngit checkout -b feature/user-authentication\n```\n\n### 2. Make Changes\n\n```bash\n# Edit files\nvim apps/api/src/auth/auth.service.ts\n\n# Stage changes\ngit add .\n\n# Commit with conventional format\ngit commit -m \"feat(auth): add user authentication service\"\n```\n\n### 3. Push and PR\n\n```bash\n# Push branch\ngit push origin feature/user-authentication\n\n# Open PR on GitHub\n# Follow PR process (see GitHub Workflow Skill)\n```\n\n### 4. Update Branch\n\n```bash\n# If main has new commits\ngit checkout main\ngit pull\ngit checkout feature/user-authentication\ngit rebase main  # or git merge main\n```\n\n## Commit Types\n\n| Type | Purpose | Example |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| `feat` | New feature | `feat(auth): add login` |\n| `fix` | Bug fix | `fix(api): resolve memory leak` |\n| `chore` | Maintenance | `chore(deps): update packages` |\n| `docs` | Documentation | `docs(readme): update install` |\n| `test` | Tests | `test(auth): add unit tests` |\n| `refactor` | Refactoring | `refactor(api): restructure` |\n| `style` | Formatting | `style: format code` |\n| `perf` | Performance | `perf(api): optimize query` |\n\n## Scope Guidelines\n\nScopes should match affected areas:\n\n```bash\n# API scopes\nfeat(api): add endpoint\nfix(api): resolve bug\n\n# Module scopes\nfeat(auth): add authentication\nfix(llm): resolve provider issue\n\n# Feature scopes\nfeat(agents): add new agent type\nfix(webhooks): resolve status tracking\n```\n\n## Git History Best Practices\n\n### ✅ DO\n\n- Keep commits focused (one logical change per commit)\n- Use descriptive commit messages\n- Write clear commit descriptions\n- Rebase before PR (clean history)\n- Squash commits in PR if needed\n\n### ❌ DON''T\n\n- Don''t commit unrelated changes together\n- Don''t use vague commit messages\n- Don''t force push to shared branches\n- Don''t commit broken code\n- Don''t commit secrets or credentials\n\n## Commit Message Examples\n\n### ✅ Good Commit Messages\n\n```bash\nfeat(auth): add JWT token authentication\n\n- Implement JWT token generation\n- Add token validation middleware\n- Update auth service with token logic\n\nfix(api): resolve memory leak in service\n\nThe service was holding references to completed requests.\nNow properly cleans up after request completion.\n\nchore(deps): update NestJS to v10\n\n- Update @nestjs/core to 10.0.0\n- Update @nestjs/common to 10.0.0\n- Resolve breaking changes\n```\n\n### ❌ Bad Commit Messages\n\n```bash\n❌ fix stuff\n❌ update\n❌ changes\n❌ WIP\n❌ asdf\n❌ fixed bug\n```\n\n## Branch Organization\n\n### Main Branches\n\n- `main` - Production-ready code\n- `develop` - Integration branch (if used)\n\n### Feature Branches\n\n```bash\nfeature/<feature-name>\n# Examples:\nfeature/user-authentication\nfeature/add-metrics-dashboard\n```\n\n### Fix Branches\n\n```bash\nfix/<fix-name>\n# Examples:\nfix/login-error\nfix/memory-leak\n```\n\n### Chore Branches\n\n```bash\nchore/<chore-name>\n# Examples:\nchore/update-dependencies\nchore/refactor-service-layer\n```\n\n## Git Commands Reference\n\n### Common Commands\n\n```bash\n# Create branch\ngit checkout -b feature/my-feature\n\n# Stage changes\ngit add .\n\n# Commit\ngit commit -m \"feat(module): description\"\n\n# Push\ngit push origin feature/my-feature\n\n# Update from main\ngit checkout main\ngit pull\ngit checkout feature/my-feature\ngit rebase main\n\n# View status\ngit status\n\n# View log\ngit log --oneline\n\n# View changes\ngit diff\n```\n\n## Repository Organization\n\n### Directory Structure\n\n```\norchestrator-ai/\n├── apps/\n│   ├── api/          # NestJS backend\n│   ├── web/          # Vue frontend\n│   └── n8n/          # N8N workflows\n├── storage/          # Database snapshots\n├── scripts/          # Utility scripts\n└── .github/          # GitHub workflows\n```\n\n### Ignore Patterns\n\n`.gitignore` should include:\n- `node_modules/`\n- `.env`\n- `dist/`\n- `*.log`\n- `.DS_Store`\n\n## Checklist for Git Standards\n\nWhen working with Git:\n\n- [ ] Branch name follows convention (`feature/`, `fix/`, etc.)\n- [ ] Commit message follows conventional format\n- [ ] Commit is focused (one logical change)\n- [ ] Commit message is descriptive\n- [ ] No secrets or credentials committed\n- [ ] Code quality gates pass before commit\n- [ ] Git history is clean (rebase if needed)\n\n## Related Documentation\n\n- **Conventional Commits**: See Conventional Commits Skill\n- **GitHub Workflow**: See GitHub Workflow Skill\n- **Quality Gates**: See Quality Gates Skill\n- **Worktree Lifecycle**: See Worktree Lifecycle Skill\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:56:00.201Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing standardized Git workflows and conventional commit management.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化 Git 工作流和传统提交管理的开发代理。","ja":"標準化されたGitワークフローと従来のコミット管理を必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"표준화된 Git 워크플ロー와 전통적인 커밋 관리가 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 이상적입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan flujos de trabajo de Git estandarizados y gestión de commits convencionales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui ont besoin de flux de travail Git standardisés et de gestion de commit conventionnelle.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die standardisierte Git-Arbeitsabläufe und konventionelle Commit-Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho Git padronizados e gerenciamento de commits convencionais.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым требуются стандартизированные рабочие процессы Git и управление коммитами.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى سير عمل جيت معياري وإدارة الالتزامات التقليدية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain clean Git histories, utilize conventional branch names, and enforce project-specific Git standards through adherence to conventional commits and organized workflow management using protocols like Git.","zh":"赋予代理维护干净的 Git 历史记录、使用传统的分支名称，并通过遵循传统的提交和组织化的工作流管理来执行项目特定的 Git 标准，使用像 Git 的协议。","ja":"エージェントがクリーンなGit履歴を維持し、従来のブランチ名を使用し、従来のコミットと組織化されたワークフローマネジメントに従ってプロジェクト固有のGit規範を適用することができます。Gitなどのプロトコルを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 깨끗한 Git 기록을 유지하고 전통적인 브랜치 이름을 사용하며 프로젝트 특有的 Git 표준을 적용하기 위해従来의 커밋과 조직화된 워크플로우 관리를 따르도록 해줍니다. Git과 같은 프로토콜을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener historiales de Git limpios, utilizar nombres de ramas convencionales y hacer cumplir los estándares de Git específicos del proyecto a través del cumplimiento de commits convencionales y la gestión de flujos de trabajo organizada utilizando protocolos como Git.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir des historiques Git propres, d''utiliser des noms de branches conventionnels et de faire respecter les normes Git spécifiques au projet grâce au respect des commits conventionnels et à la gestion de flux de travail organisée en utilisant des protocoles comme Git.","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, saubere Git-Historien beizubehalten, konventionelle Branch-Namen zu verwenden und projektspezifische Git-Standards durch die Einhaltung konventioneller Commits und organisierte Arbeitsablaufverwaltung unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie Git durchzusetzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter históricos de Git limpos, utilizar nomes de branch convencionais e impor padrões de Git específicos do projeto por meio da adesão a commits convencionais e gestão de fluxo de trabalho organizada usando protocolos como Git.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать чистые истории Git, использовать конвенциональные имена веток и обеспечивать проектные стандарты Git посредством соблюдения конвенциональных коммитов и организованного управления рабочим процессом с использованием протоколов типа Git.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على الحفاظ على سجلات جيت نظيفة، واستخدام أسماء الفروع التقليدية، وفرض معايير جيت محددة للمشروع من خلال الالتزام بالالتزامات التقليدية وإدارة سير العمل المنظمة باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل جيت."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating standardized feature branches","Managing commit histories with conventional commit messages","Organizing Git workflows for collaborative projects"],"zh":["创建标准化的功能分支","使用传统的提交消息管理提交历史记录","为协作项目组织化 Git 工作流"],"ja":["標準化された機能ブランチの作成","従来のコミットメッセージを使用したコミット履歴の管理","共同プロジェクトのためのGitワークフローの整理"],"ko":["표준화된 기능 브랜치 생성","전통적인 커밋 메시지를 사용한 커밋 기록 관리","협력 프로젝트를 위한 Git 워크플로우 조직화"],"es":["Creación de ramas de características estandarizadas","Gestión de historiales de commits con mensajes de commit convencionales","Organización de flujos de trabajo de Git para proyectos colaborativos"],"fr":["Création de branches de fonctionnalités standardisées","Gestion des historiques de commit avec des messages de commit conventionnels","Organisation des flux de travail Git pour les projets collaboratifs"],"de":["Erstellung standardisierter Funktionszweigstellen","Verwaltung von Commit-Historien mit konventionellen Commit-Nachrichten","Organisation von Git-Arbeitsabläufen für kollaborative Projekte"],"pt":["Criação de branches de funcionalidades padronizadas","Gerenciamento de históricos de commits com mensagens de commit convencionais","Organização de fluxos de trabalho Git para projetos colaborativos"],"ru":["Создание стандартизированных функциональных веток","Управление историями коммитов с конвенциональными сообщениями коммитов","Организация рабочих процессов Git для совместных проектов"],"ar":["إنشاء فروع ميزات معيارية","إدارة سجلات الالتزامات بمessages الالتزام التقليدية","تنظيم سير عمل جيت للمشاريع التعاونية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to conventional commit standards","Limited to Git version control systems"],"zh":["需要遵守传统的提交标准","仅限于 Git 版本控制系统"],"ja":["従来のコミット規範への準拠が必要","Gitバージョン管理システムに限定される"],"ko":["전통적인 커밋 표준을 준수해야 함","Git 버전 관리 시스템에만 국한됨"],"es":["Requiere el cumplimiento de los estándares de commit convencionales","Limitado a sistemas de control de versiones Git"],"fr":["Nécessite le respect des normes de commit conventionnelles","Limité aux systèmes de contrôle de version Git"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung konventioneller Commit-Standards","Begrenzt auf Git-Versionierungssysteme"],"pt":["Exige adesão a padrões de commit convencionais","Limitado a sistemas de controle de versão Git"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения конвенциональных стандартов коммитов","Ограничен системами контроля версий Git"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام بمعايير الالتزام التقليدية","محدود بنظمات التحكم في الإصدار جيت"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('The1Studio/theone-training-skills/ui-ux-pro-max', 'community', 'The1Studio', 'theone-training-skills', 'The1Studio/theone-training-skills', 'ui-ux-pro-max', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z', '2026-02-18T03:56:55.887Z', NULL, '{"id":"The1Studio/theone-training-skills/ui-ux-pro-max","name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max, Unity, VContainer, SignalBus, ","ja":"UI/UX Pro Max, Unity, VContainer, SignalBus, ","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max, Unity, VContainer, SignalBus, ","pt":"O UI/UX Pro Max é uma habilidade de design inteligente que fornece uma base de dados pesquisável de estilos de UI, paletas de cores, combinações de fontes e mais.","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max — это навык интеллектуального дизайна, который предоставляет поисковую базу данных стилей UI, цветовых палитр, комбинаций шрифтов и многое другое.","ar":"UI/UX برو ماكس هو مهارة تصميم ذكية توفر قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث من أنماط واجهة المستخدم وألوان وتركيبات خطوط وغيرها.","en":"Claude Code skills for training Unity engineers at TheOne Studio - Enforce VContainer, SignalBus, concise C# patterns, and code quality standards"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max - Unity ","ja":"UI/UX Pro Max - Unity","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max - Unity ","pt":"UI/UX Pro Max: Otimização de Design para Desenvolvedores","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max: Оптимизация Дизайна для Разработчиков","ar":"UI/UX برو ماكس: تحسين تصميم الواجهة للمطورين","en":"ui-ux-pro-max"},"description":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max, Unity, VContainer, SignalBus, ","ja":"UI/UX Pro Max, Unity, VContainer, SignalBus, ","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max, Unity, VContainer, SignalBus, ","pt":"O UI/UX Pro Max é uma habilidade de design inteligente que fornece uma base de dados pesquisável de estilos de UI, paletas de cores, combinações de fontes e ...","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max — это навык интеллектуального дизайна, который предоставляет поисковую базу данных стилей UI, цветовых палитр, комбинаций шрифтов и многое другое.","ar":"UI/UX برو ماكس هو مهارة تصميم ذكية توفر قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث من أنماط واجهة المستخدم وألوان وتركيبات خطوط وغيرها.","en":"Claude Code skills for training Unity engineers at TheOne Studio - Enforce VContainer, SignalBus, concise C# patterns, and code quality standards"},"definition":{"en":"Claude Code skills for training Unity engineers at TheOne Studio - Enforce VContainer, SignalBus, concise C# patterns, and code quality standards"},"features":{"zh":["VContainer","SignalBus","C#","UI/UX","Unity"],"ja":["VContainer","SignalBus","C#","UI/UX","Unity"],"ko":["VContainer","SignalBus","C#","UI/UX","Unity"],"pt":["Base de dados pesquisável de estilos de UI","Paletas de cores e combinações de fontes","Dicas e melhores práticas para desenvolvedores","Otimização de design para interfaces de usuário","Compatibilidade com diferentes plataformas"],"ru":["Поисковая база данных стилей UI","Цветовые палитры и комбинации шрифтов","Советы и лучшие практики для разработчиков","Оптимизация дизайна для пользовательских интерфейсов","Совместимость с разными платформами"],"ar":["قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث من أنماط واجهة المستخدم","ألوان وتركيبات خطوط","نصائح وأفضل الممارسات للمطورين","تحسين تصميم واجهة المستخدم","توافق مع منصات مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Unity","UI/UX","VContainer","SignalBus","C#","Unity","UI/UX Pro Max"],"ja":["Unity","UI/UX","VContainer","SignalBus","C#","Unity","UI/UX Pro Max"],"ko":["Unity","UI/UX","VContainer","SignalBus","C#","Unity","UI/UX Pro Max"],"pt":["UI/UX","design de interface","desenvolvedores","otimização de design","ferramentas de design","interfaces de usuário","estilos de UI","paletas de cores","combinações de fontes"],"ru":["UI/UX","дизайн интерфейса","разработчики","оптимизация дизайна","инструменты дизайна","пользовательские интерфейсы","стили UI","цветовые палитры","комбинации шрифтов"],"ar":["UI/UX","تصميم واجهة","مطورين","تحسين تصميم","أدوات تصميم","واجهات مستخدم","أنماط واجهة المستخدم","ألوان","تركيبات خطوط"]}},"owner":"The1Studio","repo":"theone-training-skills","repoPath":"The1Studio/theone-training-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"Frontend UI/UX design intelligence - activate FIRST when user requests beautiful, stunning, gorgeous, or aesthetic interfaces. The primary skill for design decisions before implementation. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 8 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check frontend UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nSearchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, product recommendations, UX guidelines, and stack-specific best practices.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nSearchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, product recommendations, UX guidelines, and stack-specific best practices.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\n```\n\n---\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\n\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\n\nExtract key information from user request:\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\n\n### Step 2: Search Relevant Domains\n\nUse `search.py` multiple times to gather comprehensive information. Search until you have enough context.\n\n```bash\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\n```\n\n**Recommended search order:**\n\n1. **Product** - Get style recommendations for product type\n2. **Style** - Get detailed style guide (colors, effects, frameworks)\n3. **Typography** - Get font pairings with Google Fonts imports\n4. **Color** - Get color palette (Primary, Secondary, CTA, Background, Text, Border)\n5. **Landing** - Get page structure (if landing page)\n6. **Chart** - Get chart recommendations (if dashboard/analytics)\n7. **UX** - Get best practices and anti-patterns\n8. **Stack** - Get stack-specific guidelines (default: html-tailwind)\n\n### Step 3: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\n\nIf user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\n\n```bash\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`\n\n---\n\n## Search Reference\n\n### Available Domains\n\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\n|--------|---------|------------------|\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\n\n### Available Stacks\n\n| Stack | Focus |\n|-------|-------|\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\n\n---\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\n\n**AI should:**\n\n```bash\n# 1. Search product type\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --domain product\n\n# 2. Search style (based on industry: beauty, elegant)\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant minimal soft\" --domain style\n\n# 3. Search typography\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury\" --domain typography\n\n# 4. Search color palette\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness\" --domain color\n\n# 5. Search landing page structure\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"hero-centric social-proof\" --domain landing\n\n# 6. Search UX guidelines\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation\" --domain ux\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"accessibility\" --domain ux\n\n# 7. Search stack guidelines (default: html-tailwind)\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\n**Then:** Synthesize all search results and implement the design.\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Better Results\n\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\n\n---\n\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\n\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\n\n### Icons & Visual Elements\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\n\n### Interaction & Cursor\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\n\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\n\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\n\n### Visual Quality\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\n- [ ] Brand logos are correct (verified from Simple Icons)\n- [ ] Hover states don''t cause layout shift\n\n### Interaction\n- [ ] All clickable elements have `cursor-pointer`\n- [ ] Hover states provide clear visual feedback\n- [ ] Transitions are smooth (150-300ms)\n- [ ] Focus states visible for keyboard navigation\n\n### Light/Dark Mode\n- [ ] Light mode text has sufficient contrast (4.5:1 minimum)\n- [ ] Glass/transparent elements visible in light mode\n- [ ] Borders visible in both modes\n- [ ] Test both modes before delivery\n\n### Layout\n- [ ] Floating elements have proper spacing from edges\n- [ ] No content hidden behind fixed navbars\n- [ ] Responsive at 320px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px\n- [ ] No horizontal scroll on mobile\n\n### Accessibility\n- [ ] All images have alt text\n- [ ] Form inputs have labels\n- [ ] Color is not the only indicator\n- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` respected\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:56:55.887Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Unity Engineer Agents needing advanced UI/UX design intelligence and concise C# patterns","zh":"非常适合需要高级UI/UX设计智能和简洁C#模式的Unity Engineer Agents","ja":"Unityエンジニアエージェントが高度なUI/UXデザインの知能と簡潔なC#パターンを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"고급 UI/UX 디자인 지능과 간결한 C# 패턴이 필요한 Unity 엔지니어 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de ingenieros de Unity que necesitan inteligencia de diseño de UI/UX avanzada y patrones de C# concisos","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''ingénieurs Unity ayant besoin d''une intelligence de conception UI/UX avancée et de modèles de C# concis","de":"Perfekt für Unity-Engineer-Agenten, die erweiterte UI/UX-Design-Intelligenz und präzise C#-Muster benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Engenharia Unity que precisam de inteligência de design de UI/UX avançada e padrões de C# concisos","ru":"Идеально подходит для Unity Engineer Agents, которым необходима продвинутая интеллект UI/UX дизайна и краткие шаблоны C#","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء مهندسي Unity الذين يحتاجون إلى تصميم ذكاء UI/UX متقدم وأنماط C# متراصة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce VContainer, SignalBus, and code quality standards, providing access to a searchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, and UX guidelines, all while utilizing Python for installation and setup","zh":"赋予代理人执行VContainer、SignalBus和代码质量标准的能力，提供可搜索的UI样式、颜色调色板、字体配对和UX指南数据库，同时利用Python进行安装和设置","ja":"VContainer、SignalBus、コード品質標準を実施するエージェントの能力を付与し、UIスタイル、色のパレット、フォントのペア、UXガイドラインの検索可能なデータベースへのアクセスを提供し、同時にPythonを使用してインストールと設定を行う","ko":"VContainer, SignalBus 및 코드 품질 표준을 시행할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하고, UI 스타일, 색상 팔레트, 글꼴 페어 및 UX 가이드ライン의 검색 가능한 데이터베이스에 대한 액세스를 제공하며,同時に Python을 사용하여 설치 및 설정을 수행","es":"Habilita a los agentes a hacer cumplir VContainer, SignalBus y estándares de calidad d