t","Zählung der Gesamtfehler","Erkennung von Fehlermustern","Kompatibilität mit RaspberryServer und RaspberryScanner"],"pt":["Análise de logs do servidor IQRight","Identificação de erros de código","Categorização de erros por tipo","Contagem de linhas de erro","Análise de padrões de erro"],"ru":["Анализ логов сервера IQRight","Выявление ошибок кода","Категоризация ошибок по типу","Счетчик строк ошибок","Анализ шаблонов ошибок"],"ar":["تحليل سجلات خادم IQRight","تحديد أخطاء الكود","تصنيف الأخطاء حسب النوع","عرض خطوط الأخطاء","تحليل أنماط الأخطاء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["错误报告","RaspberryServer","RaspberryScanner","错误日志分析","错误分类","系统稳定性","性能优化","开发者工具"],"ja":["エラーレポート","RaspberryServer","RaspberryScanner","エラーログ分析","エラーカテゴライズ","システム安定性","パフォーマンス最適化","開発者ツール"],"ko":["오류 보고","RaspberryServer","RaspberryScanner","오류 로그 분석","오류 분류","시스템 안정성","성능 최적화","개발자 도구"],"es":["informe de errores","análisis de errores","RaspberryServer","RaspberryScanner","registros de servidor","categorización de errores","recuento de errores"],"fr":["rapport d''erreurs","analyse d''erreurs","RaspberryServer","RaspberryScanner","journaux de serveur","catégorisation des erreurs","compte des erreurs"],"de":["Fehlerbericht","Fehleranalyse","RaspberryServer","RaspberryScanner","Serverlogs","Kategorisierung von Fehlern","Zählung der Fehler"],"pt":["relatório de erros","análise de logs","servidor IQRight","erros de código","otimização de código","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["отчет об ошибках","анализ логов","сервер IQRight","ошибки кода","оптимизация кода","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تقرير الأخطاء","تحليل السجلات","خادم IQRight","أخطاء الكود","تحسين الكود","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"fulviomanente","repo":"IQRight_Local","repoPath":"fulviomanente/IQRight_Local","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"error-report","description":"Generate a categorized error summary from server logs. Shows whats failing, frequency, severity, and recommendations. Use when troubleshooting system failures or before go-live checks.","bodyPreview":"# Error Report\n\nAnalyze all ERROR messages in the IQRight server logs.\n\n## Step 1: Error Count\n\nCount total ERROR lines in `logs/IQRight_Daemon.debug` and any rotated logs.\n\n## Step 2: Categorize by Type\n\nSearch for ERROR lines and group by message pattern. The known error categories are:\n\n### LoRa Errors\n- `Error in sendDataScanner` - Failed to send response to scanner\n- `''LoRaTransceiver'' object has no attribute ''create_packet''` - Method name bug (should be `create_data_packet`)\n- `Failed to s","body":"# Error Report\n\nAnalyze all ERROR messages in the IQRight server logs.\n\n## Step 1: Error Count\n\nCount total ERROR lines in `logs/IQRight_Daemon.debug` and any rotated logs.\n\n## Step 2: Categorize by Type\n\nSearch for ERROR lines and group by message pattern. The known error categories are:\n\n### LoRa Errors\n- `Error in sendDataScanner` - Failed to send response to scanner\n- `''LoRaTransceiver'' object has no attribute ''create_packet''` - Method name bug (should be `create_data_packet`)\n- `Failed to send DATA` / `FAILED to send data to Scanner` - LoRa TX failure\n\n### API Errors\n- `Connection reset by peer` - API server unreachable\n- `Server disconnected` - API connection dropped mid-request\n- `API call timed out` - API timeout exceeded\n- `Client error during API call` - General HTTP client error\n- `API getUserAccess request failed on getting secrets` - Credential retrieval failure\n\n### MQTT Errors\n- `MQTT-TX.*FAILED.*Status=7` - Broker connection lost during publish\n- `MQTT ERROR publishing data` - Data publish failed after all retries\n- `MQTT ERROR publishing command ACK` - Command ACK publish failed\n\n### Data/Lookup Errors\n- `Couldn''t find Code: {code} locally` - Code not in local database\n- `No data found for code {code}` - Neither API nor local found the code\n- `Invalid DATA packet format` - Corrupted LoRa payload structure\n- `Invalid UTF-8 String` - Binary corruption in packet payload\n\n### Handshake Errors\n- `Failed to send HELLO_ACK` - Could not respond to scanner handshake\n- `Invalid HELLO packet format` - Malformed HELLO payload\n\n## Step 3: Severity Classification\n\n**CRITICAL** (blocks user-facing operations):\n- LoRa send failures (scanner gets no response)\n- MQTT publish failures (web UI gets no data)\n- `create_packet` attribute errors (code bug)\n\n**WARNING** (degrades but doesn''t block):\n- API connection failures (local fallback works)\n- QR code corruption / lookup failures (~10% expected)\n- MQTT Status=7 with successful retry\n\n**INFO** (normal/expected):\n- `own_packet_looped` discards (repeater forwarding back - normal)\n- Duplicate packet discards (normal if < 5% of traffic)\n\n## Step 4: Recent Examples\n\nShow the last 10-15 ERROR lines with timestamps and full messages.\n\n## Step 5: Summary\n\nPresent a report with:\n- Total error count and percentage of log lines\n- Top 5 error types ranked by frequency\n- Severity of each type\n- Whether each is a known pattern (reference PATTERN-001 through PATTERN-004) or new\n- Actionable recommendations for each critical/warning error\n\nReference: See `docs/LOG_ANALYSIS_SKILLS.md` section 5 for known bugs and section 6 for alerting thresholds."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:56:11.009Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Log Analysis Agents needing advanced error reporting and categorization capabilities in RaspberryServer and RaspberryScanner environments.","zh":"非常适合需要在RaspberryServer和RaspberryScanner环境中进行高级错误报告和分类的日志分析代理。","ja":"RaspberryServerとRaspberryScanner環境で高度なエラーレポートと分類機能を必要とするログ分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"RaspberryServer와 RaspberryScanner 환경에서 고급 오류 보고 및 분류 기능이 필요한 로그 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Registros que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de informes de errores y categorización en entornos RaspberryServer y RaspberryScanner.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Journaux nécessitant des fonctionnalités avancées de rapport d''erreurs et de catégorisation dans les environnements RaspberryServer et RaspberryScanner.","de":"Perfekt für Log-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte Fehlerberichts- und Kategorisierungsfunktionen in RaspberryServer- und RaspberryScanner-Umgebungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Log que necessitam de recursos avançados de relatórios de erros e capacidades de categorização em ambientes RaspberryServer e RaspberryScanner.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа журналов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности отчетов об ошибках и категоризации в средах RaspberryServer и RaspberryScanner.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل السجل الذي يحتاج إلى تقارير متقدمة عن الأخطاء وقدرات تصنيف في بيئات RaspberryServer و RaspberryScanner."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze ERROR messages in IQRight server logs, providing error count and categorization by type, including LoRa Errors, and supporting log rotation and pattern-based error grouping using techniques like regular expressions.","zh":"赋予代理分析IQRight服务器日志中的ERROR消息的能力，提供错误计数和按类型分类，包括LoRa错误，并支持日志轮换和基于模式的错误分组，使用正则表达式等技术。","ja":"エージェントにIQRightサーバーログのERRORメッセージを分析する機能を与え、エラーカウントとタイプ別の分類を提供し、LoRaエラーを含み、ログのローテーションと正規表現などの技術を使用したパターンベースのエラーグループ化をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 IQRight 서버 로그의 ERROR 메시지를 분석할 수 있도록 하며, 오류 수와 유형별 분류를 제공하고, LoRa 오류를 포함하며, 로그 회전과 정규 표현식 등 기술을 사용한 패턴 기반 오류 그룹화를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar mensajes de ERROR en registros del servidor IQRight, proporcionando recuento de errores y categorización por tipo, incluidos errores LoRa, y admitiendo rotación de registros y agrupación de errores basada en patrones utilizando técnicas como expresiones regulares.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les messages d''ERREUR dans les journaux du serveur IQRight, en fournissant un décompte d''erreurs et une catégorisation par type, y compris les erreurs LoRa, et en prenant en charge la rotation des journaux et le regroupement des erreurs basé sur des modèles en utilisant des techniques comme les expressions régulières.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, ERROR-Meldungen in IQRight-Server-Protokollen zu analysieren und eine Fehlerzählung und Kategorisierung nach Typ bereitzustellen, einschließlich LoRa-Fehler, und unterstützt Protokollrotation und fehlerbasierte Gruppierung mithilfe von Techniken wie regulären Ausdrücken.","pt":"Permite que os agentes analisem mensagens de ERRO nos logs do servidor IQRight, fornecendo contagem de erros e categorização por tipo, incluindo erros LoRa, e suportando rotação de logs e agrupamento de erros baseado em padrões usando técnicas como expressões regulares.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать сообщения об ОШИБКАХ в журналах сервера IQRight, предоставляя счетчик ошибок и категоризацию по типу, включая ошибки LoRa, и поддерживая ротацию журналов и группировку ошибок на основе шаблонов с использованием техник, таких как регулярные выражения.","ar":"يمكن للعميل تحليل رسائل الخطأ في سجلات خادم IQRight، وتوفير عدد الخطأ وتصنيفه حسب النوع، بما في ذلك أخطاء LoRa، ودعم دوران السجلات وتصنيف الخطأ حسب النمط باستخدام تقنيات مثل التعبيرات العادية."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating error report generation for IQRight server logs","Categorizing errors by message pattern for efficient debugging","Debugging LoRa Errors in RaspberryServer and RaspberryScanner"],"zh":["为IQRight服务器日志自动生成错误报告","通过消息模式对错误进行分类以实现高效调试","在RaspberryServer和RaspberryScanner中调试LoRa错误"],"ja":["IQRightサーバーログの自動エラーレポート生成","メッセージパターンによるエラーの分類による効率的なデバッグ","RaspberryServerとRaspberryScannerでのLoRaエラーのデバッグ"],"ko":["IQRight 서버 로그의 자동 오류 보고서 생성","메시지 패턴에 의한 오류 분류를 통한 효율적인 디버깅","RaspberryServer와 RaspberryScanner에서의 LoRa 오류 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de informes de errores para registros del servidor IQRight","Categorizar errores por patrón de mensaje para un depuración eficiente","Depurar errores LoRa en RaspberryServer y RaspberryScanner"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération de rapports d''erreurs pour les journaux du serveur IQRight","Catégoriser les erreurs par motif de message pour un débogage efficace","Déboguer les erreurs LoRa dans RaspberryServer et RaspberryScanner"],"de":["Automatisieren der Fehlerberichterstellung für IQRight-Server-Protokolle","Fehler nach Meldungsmuster kategorisieren für effizientes Debugging","LoRa-Fehler in RaspberryServer und RaspberryScanner debuggen"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de relatórios de erros para logs do servidor IQRight","Categorizar erros por padrão de mensagem para depuração eficiente","Depurar erros LoRa em RaspberryServer e RaspberryScanner"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию отчетов об ошибках для журналов сервера IQRight","Категоризировать ошибки по шаблону сообщения для эффективной отладки","Отладить ошибки LoRa в RaspberryServer и RaspberryScanner"],"ar":["تأتمتة إنشاء تقارير الأخطاء لسجلات خادم IQRight","تصنيف الأخطاء حسب نمط الرسالة من أجل تصحيح عيوب فعال","تصحيح أخطاء LoRa في RaspberryServer و RaspberryScanner"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to IQRight server logs","Limited to ERROR messages in logs","RaspberryServer and RaspberryScanner environment specific"],"zh":["需要访问IQRight服务器日志","仅限日志中的ERROR消息","特定于RaspberryServer和RaspberryScanner环境"],"ja":["IQRightサーバーログへのアクセスが必要","ログ内のERRORメッセージのみ","RaspberryServerとRaspberryScanner環境専用"],"ko":["IQRight 서버 로그에 대한 액세스가 필요함","로그 내의 ERROR 메시지만 해당됨","RaspberryServer와 RaspberryScanner 환경 전용"],"es":["Requiere acceso a registros del servidor IQRight","Limitado a mensajes de ERROR en registros","Específico del entorno RaspberryServer y RaspberryScanner"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux journaux du serveur IQRight","Limité aux messages d''ERREUR dans les journaux","Spécifique à l''environnement RaspberryServer et RaspberryScanner"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf IQRight-Server-Protokolle","Begrenzt auf ERROR-Meldungen in Protokollen","Spezifisch für die Umgebung RaspberryServer und RaspberryScanner"],"pt":["Requer acesso aos logs do servidor IQRight","Limitado a mensagens de ERRO nos logs","Especifico para ambientes RaspberryServer e RaspberryScanner"],"ru":["Требует доступа к журналам сервера IQRight","Ограничен сообщениями об ОШИБКАХ в журналах","Спецефичен для сред RaspberryServer и RaspberryScanner"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى سجلات خادم IQRight","محدود برسائل الخطأ في السجلات","محدد لبيئات RaspberryServer و RaspberryScanner"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('JasonPaff/head-shakers/e2e-testing', 'community', 'JasonPaff', 'head-shakers', 'JasonPaff/head-shakers', 'e2e-testing', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z', '2026-02-18T03:55:57.397Z', NULL, '{"id":"JasonPaff/head-shakers/e2e-testing","name":"e2e-testing","description":{"zh":"E2E测试技能提供使用Playwright的端到端测试约定，用于验证完整的用户流程","ja":"E2Eテストスキルは、Playwrightを使用したエンドツーエンドテストの規約を提供し、完全なユーザーフローを検証します","ko":"E2E 테스트 스킬은 Playwright를 사용한 엔드투엔드 테스트 규약을 제공하여 완전한 사용자 흐름을 검증합니다","es":"Este skill proporciona convenciones de pruebas E2E usando Playwright para validar flujos de usuario completos","fr":"Ce skill fournit des conventions de tests E2E en utilisant Playwright pour valider les flux d''utilisateurs complets","de":"Dieses Skill bietet E2E-Testkonventionen mit Playwright, um komplette Benutzerflüsse zu überprüfen","pt":"O skill de testes E2E fornece convenções de testes com Playwright para validar fluxos de usuário completos","ru":"Навык тестирования E2E предоставляет конвенции тестирования с Playwright для проверки полных потоков пользователей","ar":"مهارة اختبارات E2E توفر اتفاقيات اختبار مع Playwright للتحقق من تدفقات المستخدم الكاملة","en":"Website for Bobblehead Collectors"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"E2E测试技能：使用Playwright进行端到端测试","ja":"E2Eテストスキル：Playwrightを使用したエンドツーエンドテスト","ko":"E2E 테스트 스킬: Playwright를 사용한 엔드투엔드 테스트","es":"Pruebas E2E con Playwright","fr":"Tests E2E avec Playwright","de":"E2E-Tests mit Playwright","pt":"Testes E2E para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Тестирование E2E для Разработчиков","ar":"اختبارات E2E للمانحين","en":"e2e-testing"},"description":{"zh":"E2E测试技能提供使用Playwright的端到端测试约定，用于验证完整的用户流程","ja":"E2Eテストスキルは、Playwrightを使用したエンドツーエンドテストの規約を提供し、完全なユーザーフローを検証します","ko":"E2E 테스트 스킬은 Playwright를 사용한 엔드투엔드 테스트 규약을 제공하여 완전한 사용자 흐름을 검증합니다","es":"Este skill proporciona convenciones de pruebas E2E usando Playwright para validar flujos de usuario completos","fr":"Ce skill fournit des conventions de tests E2E en utilisant Playwright pour valider les flux d''utilisateurs complets","de":"Dieses Skill bietet E2E-Testkonventionen mit Playwright, um komplette Benutzerflüsse zu überprüfen","pt":"O skill de testes E2E fornece convenções de testes com Playwright para validar fluxos de usuário completos","ru":"Навык тестирования E2E предоставляет конвенции тестирования с Playwright для проверки полных потоков пользователей","ar":"مهارة اختبارات E2E توفر اتفاقيات اختبار مع Playwright للتحقق من تدفقات المستخدم الكاملة","en":"Website for Bobblehead Collectors"},"definition":{"en":"Website for Bobblehead Collectors"},"features":{"zh":["使用Playwright进行端到端测试","自动化浏览器测试","验证完整的用户流程","支持Page Object Model类","支持认证上下文"],"ja":["Playwrightを使用したエンドツーエンドテスト","ブラウザテストの自動化","完全なユーザーフローの検証","Page Object Modelクラスのサポート","認証コンテキストのサポート"],"ko":["Playwright를 사용한 엔드투엔드 테스트","브라우저 테스트 자동화","완전한 사용자 흐름 검증","Page Object Model 클래스 지원","인증 컨텍스트 지원"],"es":["Pruebas E2E con Playwright","Validación de flujos de usuario completos","Automatización de navegador","Compatibilidad con Page Object Model","Soporte para contextos de autenticación"],"fr":["Tests E2E avec Playwright","Validation des flux d''utilisateurs complets","Automatisation de navigateur","Compatibilité avec Page Object Model","Support pour les contextes d''authentification"],"de":["E2E-Tests mit Playwright","Überprüfung von kompletten Benutzerflüssen","Browser-Automatisierung","Kompatibilität mit Page Object Model","Unterstützung für Authentifizierungskontexte"],"pt":["Validação de fluxos de usuário completos","Automação de navegador com Playwright","Criação de classes de modelo de página","Trabalho com contextos de autenticação","Suporte a arquivos de teste E2E","Integração com Page Object Model"],"ru":["Проверка полных потоков пользователей","Автоматизация браузера с Playwright","Создание классов модели страницы","Работа с контекстами аутентификации","Поддержка файлов тестирования E2E","Интеграция с Page Object Model"],"ar":["التحقق من تدفقات المستخدم الكاملة","أتمتة المتصفح مع Playwright","إنشاء فئات نموذج الصفحة","العمل مع سياقات التحقق","دعم ملفات اختبار E2E","التكامل مع Page Object Model"]},"keywords":{"zh":["E2E测试","Playwright","端到端测试","自动化浏览器测试","用户流程","Page Object Model"],"ja":["E2Eテスト","Playwright","エンドツーエンドテスト","ブラウザテストの自動化","ユーザーフロー","Page Object Model"],"ko":["E2E 테스트","Playwright","엔드투엔드 테스트","브라우저 테스트 자동화","사용자 흐름","Page Object Model"],"es":["pruebas E2E","Playwright","automatización de navegador","Page Object Model","autenticación","desarrollo web","testing"],"fr":["tests E2E","Playwright","automatisation de navigateur","Page Object Model","authentification","développement web","testing"],"de":["E2E-Tests","Playwright","Browser-Automatisierung","Page Object Model","Authentifizierung","Webentwicklung","Testing"],"pt":["testes E2E","Playwright","automação de navegador","fluxos de usuário","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de código","testes automatizados","Page Object Model"],"ru":["тестирование E2E","Playwright","автоматизация браузера","потоки пользователей","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","автоматизированное тестирование","Page Object Model"],"ar":["اختبارات E2E","Playwright","أتمتة المتصفح","تدفقات المستخدم","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الكود","اختبارات أوتوماتيكية","Page Object Model"]}},"owner":"JasonPaff","repo":"head-shakers","repoPath":"JasonPaff/head-shakers","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"e2e-testing","description":"Enforces project E2E testing conventions using Playwright with custom fixtures, Page Object Model, and authentication contexts.","bodyPreview":"# E2E Testing Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill provides end-to-end testing conventions using Playwright. E2E tests validate complete user flows with browser automation.\n\n## Activation\n\nThis skill activates when:\n\n- Creating or modifying files in `tests/e2e/specs/`\n- Testing complete user flows\n- Working with Playwright\n- Creating or modifying Page Object Model classes\n- Working with authentication contexts\n\n## File Patterns\n\n- `tests/e2e/specs/**/*.spec.ts`\n- `tests/e2e/pages/**/*.page.ts`\n\n## Work","body":"# E2E Testing Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill provides end-to-end testing conventions using Playwright. E2E tests validate complete user flows with browser automation.\n\n## Activation\n\nThis skill activates when:\n\n- Creating or modifying files in `tests/e2e/specs/`\n- Testing complete user flows\n- Working with Playwright\n- Creating or modifying Page Object Model classes\n- Working with authentication contexts\n\n## File Patterns\n\n- `tests/e2e/specs/**/*.spec.ts`\n- `tests/e2e/pages/**/*.page.ts`\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Detect E2E test work (file path contains `tests/e2e/`)\n2. Load `references/E2E-Testing-Conventions.md`\n3. Also load `testing-base` skill for shared conventions\n4. Apply Playwright patterns with custom fixtures\n5. Use Page Object Model for reusable interactions\n\n## Key Patterns (REQUIRED)\n\n### Custom Fixtures\n\n- Use fixtures from `tests/e2e/fixtures/base.fixture.ts`\n- Available: `adminPage`, `userPage`, `newUserPage` (authenticated contexts)\n- Available: `adminFinder`, `userFinder`, `newUserFinder` (ComponentFinder instances)\n\n### Page Object Model\n\n- Extend `BasePage` class for page objects\n- Define `url` property for navigation\n- Use `byTestId` helper for data-testid lookups\n\n### ComponentFinder\n\n- Use for standardized `data-testid` lookups\n- Methods: `feature()`, `form()`, `ui()`, `layout()`, `tableCell()`\n\n### Test Organization\n\n- Place in appropriate `tests/e2e/specs/{category}/` folder\n- Categories: smoke, public, user, admin, onboarding\n\n## References\n\n- `references/E2E-Testing-Conventions.md` - Complete E2E testing conventions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:55:57.397Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automated Testing Agents requiring end-to-end testing capabilities with Playwright","zh":"适用于需要使用Playwright进行端到端测试的自动化测试代理","ja":"Playwrightを使用したエンドツーエンドテスト機能を必要とする自動テストエージェントに最適","ko":"Playwright를 사용하여 엔드 투 엔드 테스트 기능을 필요로 하는 자동화 테스트 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de prueba automatizados que requieren capacidades de prueba de extremo a extremo con Playwright","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de test automatisés nécessitant des capacités de test de bout en bout avec Playwright","de":"Ideal für automatisierte Testagenten, die End-to-End-Testfunktionen mit Playwright benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Teste Automatizado que requerem capacidades de teste de ponta a ponta com Playwright","ru":"Идеально подходит для автоматизированных агентов тестирования, требующих сквозных возможностей тестирования с Playwright","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الاختبار الآلي الذين يتطلبون قدرات اختبار من البداية إلى النهاية باستخدام Playwright"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate complete user flows using browser automation, validate user interactions with Page Object Model classes, and handle authentication contexts with Playwright, supporting file patterns like `tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts` and `tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`","zh":"赋予代理使用浏览器自动化来自动化完成的用户流程，使用页面对象模型类来验证用户交互，并使用Playwright来处理身份验证上下文，支持诸如`tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts`和`tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`的文件模式","ja":"エージェントにブラウザ自動化を使用して完全なユーザーフローを自動化する能力を与え、ページオブジェクトモデルクラスを使用してユーザーインタラクションを検証し、Playwrightを使用して認証コンテキストを処理することを可能にし、`tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts`や`tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`などのファイルパターンをサポート","ko":"에이전트가 브라우저 자동화를 사용하여 완전한 사용자 흐름을 자동화 할 수 있도록 함으로써, 페이지 객체 모델 클래스를 사용하여 사용자 상호 작용을 검증하며, Playwright를 사용하여 인증 컨텍스트를 처리하며, `tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts` 및 `tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`와 같은 파일 패턴을 지원","es":"Permite a los agentes automatizar flujos de usuario completos utilizando la automatización del navegador, validar las interacciones del usuario con clases de modelo de objeto de página y controlar los contextos de autenticación con Playwright, admitiendo patrones de archivo como `tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts` y `tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les flux d''utilisateurs complets en utilisant l''automatisation du navigateur, valider les interactions utilisateur avec des classes de modèle d''objet de page et gérer les contextes d''authentification avec Playwright, en prenant en charge des modèles de fichiers tels que `tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts` et `tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Benutzerflüsse mithilfe der Browserautomatisierung zu automatisieren, Benutzerinteraktionen mit Page-Object-Model-Klassen zu validieren und Authentifizierungskontexte mit Playwright zu verwalten, wobei Dateimuster wie `tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts` und `tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts` unterstützt werden","pt":"Capacita os agentes a automatizar fluxos de usuário completos usando automação de navegador, validar interações do usuário com classes do Page Object Model e gerenciar contextos de autenticação com o Playwright, suportando padrões de arquivo como `tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts` e `tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать полные пользовательские потоки с помощью автоматизации браузера, проверять взаимодействие с пользователем с помощью классов Page Object Model и управлять контекстами аутентификации с Playwright, поддерживая шаблоны файлов, такие как `tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts` и `tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من أتمتة مسارات المستخدم الكاملة باستخدام أتمتة المتصفح، والتحقق من تفاعلات المستخدم مع فئات نموذج كائن الصفحة، وإدارة سياقات المصادقة باستخدام Playwright، مع دعم أنماط الملفات مثل `tests/e2e/specs*.spec.ts` و `tests/e2e/pages*.page.ts`"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating user flow testing for website interactions","Validating authentication contexts in e2e tests","Creating and modifying Page Object Model classes for reusable test components","Debugging end-to-end tests with Playwright"],"zh":["自动化网站交互的用户流测试","在端到端测试中验证身份验证上下文","创建和修改页面对象模型类以实现可重用测试组件","使用Playwright调试端到端测试"],"ja":["Webサイトのインタラクションのユーザーフローを自動化するためのテスト","エンドツーエンドテストで認証コンテキストを検証する","再利用可能なテストコンポーネントを作成および変更するためのページオブジェクトモデルクラス","Playwrightを使用してエンドツーエンドテストをデバッグする"],"ko":["웹사이트 상호 작용을 위한 사용자 흐름 테스트 자동화","엔드 투 엔드 테스트에서 인증 컨텍스트를 검증","재사용 가능한 테스트 구성 요소를 위한 페이지 객체 모델 클래스 생성 및 수정","Playwright를 사용하여 엔드 투 엔드 테스트 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la prueba de flujos de usuario para interacciones de sitios web","Validar contextos de autenticación en pruebas de extremo a extremo","Crear y modificar clases de modelo de objeto de página para componentes de prueba reutilizables","Depurar pruebas de extremo a extremo con Playwright"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests de flux d''utilisateurs pour les interactions de site Web","Valider les contextes d''authentification dans les tests de bout en bout","Créer et modifier des classes de modèle d''objet de page pour des composants de test réutilisables","Déboguer les tests de bout en bout avec Playwright"],"de":["Automatisieren von Benutzerfluss-Tests für Webseiten-Interaktionen","Validieren von Authentifizierungskontexten in End-to-End-Tests","Erstellen und Modifizieren von Page-Object-Model-Klassen für wiederverwendbare Testkomponenten","Debuggen von End-to-End-Tests mit Playwright"],"pt":["Automatização de testes de fluxo de usuário para interações com sites","Validação de contextos de autenticação em testes de ponta a ponta","Criação e modificação de classes do Page Object Model para componentes de teste reutilizáveis","Depuração de testes de ponta a ponta com Playwright"],"ru":["Автоматизация тестирования пользовательских потоков для взаимодействия с веб-сайтами","Проверка контекстов аутентификации в сквозных тестах","Создание и изменение классов Page Object Model для повторно используемых компонентов тестов","Отладка сквозных тестов с помощью Playwright"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار مسار المستخدم لتفاعلات موقع الويب","التحقق من سياقات المصادقة في اختبارات من البداية إلى النهاية","إنشاء وتعديل فئات نموذج كائن الصفحة لمكونات اختبار قابلة لإع