n","UX-Richtlinien und Best Practices pro Stack"],"pt":["Base de dados pesquisável de estilos de UI","Paletas de cores personalizadas","Combinações de fontes recomendadas","Práticas recomendadas de UX","Recomendações de produtos personalizadas","Melhores práticas para pilhas específicas"],"ru":["Поисковая база данных стилей UI","Настраиваемые цветовые палитры","Рекомендуемые комбинации шрифтов","Рекомендации по UX","Персонализированные рекомендации продуктов","Лучшие практики для конкретных стеков"],"ar":["قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث من أنماط واجهة المستخدم","_palettes الألوان المخصصة","تركيبات الخطوط الموصى بها","أفضل الممارسات لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","توصيات المنتجات المخصصة","أفضل الممارسات للرزم المحددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI/UX设计","设计智能","用户界面","用户体验","可搜索的UI样式","色彩调色板","字体配对","UX指南"],"ja":["UI/UXデザイン","デザインインテリジェンス","ユーザーインターフェイス","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","検索可能なUIスタイル","色彩パレット","フォントのペア","UXガイドライン"],"ko":["UI/UX 디자인","디자인 인텔리전스","사용자 인터페이스","사용자 경험","검색 가능한 UI 스타일","색상 팔레트","글꼴 페어","UX 가이드라인"],"es":["diseño de UI","experiencia de usuario","desarrollo de software","bases de datos de estilos","paletas de colores","parejas de fuentes","tipos de gráficos","recomendaciones de productos"],"fr":["conception d''UI","expérience utilisateur","développement de logiciels","bases de données de styles","palettes de couleurs","paires de polices","types de graphiques","recommandations de produits"],"de":["UI-Design","Benutzererfahrung","Software-Entwicklung","Stil-Datenbanken","Farbpaletten","Schriftartenpaare","Chart-Typen","Produkt-Empfehlungen"],"pt":["ui/ux design","design inteligente","interfaces de usuário","experiências de usuário","estilos de ui","paletas de cores","combinações de fontes","práticas recomendadas de ux"],"ru":["ui/ux дизайн","интеллектуальный дизайн","интерфейсы пользователя","пользовательские trải nghiệm","стили ui","цветовые палитры","комбинации шрифтов","рекомендации по ux"],"ar":["تصميم واجهة المستخدم","تصميم ذكاء","واجهات المستخدم","تجارب المستخدم","أنماط واجهة المستخدم","_palettes الألوان","تركيبات الخطوط","أفضل الممارسات لتحسين تجربة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"mthienDev","repo":"cipher-talk","repoPath":"mthienDev/cipher-talk","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"Frontend UI/UX design intelligence - activate FIRST when user requests beautiful, stunning, gorgeous, or aesthetic interfaces. The primary skill for design decisions before implementation. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 8 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check frontend UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nSearchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, product recommendations, UX guidelines, and stack-specific best practices.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nSearchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, product recommendations, UX guidelines, and stack-specific best practices.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\n```\n\n---\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\n\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\n\nExtract key information from user request:\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\n\n### Step 2: Search Relevant Domains\n\nUse `search.py` multiple times to gather comprehensive information. Search until you have enough context.\n\n```bash\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\n```\n\n**Recommended search order:**\n\n1. **Product** - Get style recommendations for product type\n2. **Style** - Get detailed style guide (colors, effects, frameworks)\n3. **Typography** - Get font pairings with Google Fonts imports\n4. **Color** - Get color palette (Primary, Secondary, CTA, Background, Text, Border)\n5. **Landing** - Get page structure (if landing page)\n6. **Chart** - Get chart recommendations (if dashboard/analytics)\n7. **UX** - Get best practices and anti-patterns\n8. **Stack** - Get stack-specific guidelines (default: html-tailwind)\n\n### Step 3: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\n\nIf user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\n\n```bash\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`\n\n---\n\n## Search Reference\n\n### Available Domains\n\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\n|--------|---------|------------------|\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\n\n### Available Stacks\n\n| Stack | Focus |\n|-------|-------|\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\n\n---\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\n\n**AI should:**\n\n```bash\n# 1. Search product type\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --domain product\n\n# 2. Search style (based on industry: beauty, elegant)\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant minimal soft\" --domain style\n\n# 3. Search typography\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury\" --domain typography\n\n# 4. Search color palette\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness\" --domain color\n\n# 5. Search landing page structure\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"hero-centric social-proof\" --domain landing\n\n# 6. Search UX guidelines\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation\" --domain ux\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"accessibility\" --domain ux\n\n# 7. Search stack guidelines (default: html-tailwind)\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\n**Then:** Synthesize all search results and implement the design.\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Better Results\n\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\n\n---\n\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\n\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\n\n### Icons & Visual Elements\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\n\n### Interaction & Cursor\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\n\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\n\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\n\n### Visual Quality\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\n- [ ] Brand logos are correct (verified from Simple Icons)\n- [ ] Hover states don''t cause layout shift\n\n### Interaction\n- [ ] All clickable elements have `cursor-pointer`\n- [ ] Hover states provide clear visual feedback\n- [ ] Transitions are smooth (150-300ms)\n- [ ] Focus states visible for keyboard navigation\n\n### Light/Dark Mode\n- [ ] Light mode text has sufficient contrast (4.5:1 minimum)\n- [ ] Glass/transparent elements visible in light mode\n- [ ] Borders visible in both modes\n- [ ] Test both modes before delivery\n\n### Layout\n- [ ] Floating elements have proper spacing from edges\n- [ ] No content hidden behind fixed navbars\n- [ ] Responsive at 320px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px\n- [ ] No horizontal scroll on mobile\n\n### Accessibility\n- [ ] All images have alt text\n- [ ] Form inputs have labels\n- [ ] Color is not the only indicator\n- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` respected\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:56:37.035Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Design Agents needing advanced UI/UX design intelligence and Python-based automation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 UI/UX 设计智能和 Python 基础自动化能力的设计代理。","ja":"高度な UI/UX デザインの知能と Python ベースの自動化機能を必要とするデザイン エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 UI/UX 디자인 인텔리전스와 Python 기반 자동화 기능이 필요한 디자인 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de diseño que necesitan inteligencia de diseño de interfaz de usuario/UX avanzada y capacidades de automatización basadas en Python.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de conception nécessitant une intelligence de conception UI/UX avancée et des capacités d''automatisation basées sur Python.","de":"Perfekt für Designagenten, die erweiterte UI/UX-Designintelligenz und Python-basierte Automatisierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Design que necessitam de inteligência de design de UI/UX avançada e capacidades de automação baseadas em Python.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов дизайна, которым необходима продвинутая интеллект дизайна UI/UX и возможности автоматизации на основе Python.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التصميم الذين يحتاجون إلى ذكاء تصميم UI/UX متقدم وقدرات أتمتة قائمة على Python."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage a searchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, and UX guidelines, utilizing Python for seamless integration and automation of design workflows, including chart types and product recommendations.","zh":"使代理能够利用可搜索的 UI 风格、颜色调色板、字体配对和 UX 指南数据库，利用 Python 实现设计工作流的无缝集成和自动化，包括图表类型和产品推荐。","ja":"エージェントが検索可能な UI スタイル、色のパレット、フォントのペア、UX ガイドラインのデータベースを利用できるようにし、Python を使用してデザイン ワークフローのシームレスな統合と自動化を実現します。チャート タイプや製品の推奨などが含まれます。","ko":"에이전트가 검색 가능한 UI 스타일, 색상 팔레트, 글꼴 페어 및 UX 가이드라인 데이터베이스를 활용할 수 있도록 하며, Python을 사용하여 디자인 워크플로의 無縫な統合 및 자동화를 구현합니다. 차트 유형 및 제품 추천 등이 포함됩니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar una base de datos searchable de estilos de interfaz de usuario, paletas de colores, combinaciones de fuentes y pautas de UX, utilizando Python para una integración y automatización sin problemas de los flujos de trabajo de diseño, incluyendo tipos de gráficos y recomendaciones de productos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tirer parti d''une base de données de styles d''interface utilisateur, de palettes de couleurs, de combinaisons de polices et de lignes directrices d''UX, en utilisant Python pour une intégration et une automatisation transparentes des flux de travail de conception, y compris les types de graphiques et les recommandations de produits.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eine durchsuchbare Datenbank von Benutzeroberflächenstilen, Farbpaletten, Schriftkombinationen und UX-Richtlinien zu nutzen, wobei Python für eine nahtlose Integration und Automatisierung von Designworkflows verwendet wird, einschließlich Charttypen und Produktempfehlungen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes utilizem um banco de dados pesquisável de estilos de UI, paletas de cores, combinações de fontes e diretrizes de UX, utilizando Python para integração e automação sem interrupção de fluxos de trabalho de design, incluindo tipos de gráficos e recomendações de produtos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать поисковую базу данных стилей UI, цветовых палитр, пар(font) шрифтов и руководств по UX, используя Python для бесшовной интеграции и автоматизации рабочих процессов дизайна, включая типы графиков и рекомендации продуктов.","ar":"تمكن العميل من استخدام قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث من أنماط UI ولوحات الألوان وتركيبات الخطوط وإرشادات UX، باستخدام Python من أجل التكامل السلس والتنفيذ الآلي لتدفقات عمل التصميم، بما في ذلك أنواع الرسوم البيانية وتوصيات المنتجات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating UI design decisions with data-driven insights","Generating consistent brand styles across products","Debugging UX issues with stack-specific best practices"],"zh":["使用数据驱动的洞察力自动化 UI 设计决策","在产品中生成一致的品牌风格","使用堆栈特定最佳实践调试 UX 问题"],"ja":["データ駆動の洞察を使用して UI デザインの決定を自動化する","製品全体で一貫したブランド スタイルを生成する","スタック固有のベスト プラクティスを使用して UX の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["데이터 주도적인 통찰력을 통해 UI 디자인 결정을 자동화하는 것","제품 전반에 일관된 브랜드 스타일을 생성하는 것","스택 특정 최선의 방법을 사용하여 UX 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar las decisiones de diseño de interfaz de usuario con información basada en datos","Generar estilos de marca coherentes en todos los productos","Depurar problemas de UX con las mejores prácticas específicas de la pila"],"fr":["Automatiser les décisions de conception d''interface utilisateur avec des informations basées sur les données","Générer des styles de marque cohérents sur tous les produits","Déboguer les problèmes d''UX avec les meilleures pratiques spécifiques à la pile"],"de":["Automatisieren von UI-Designentscheidungen mit datengetriebenen Erkenntnissen","Erzeugen von konsistenten Markenstilen über Produkte hinweg","Debuggen von UX-Problemen mit stapelspezifischen Best Practices"],"pt":["Automatizar decisões de design de UI com insights baseados em dados","Gerar estilos de marca consistentes em produtos","Depurar problemas de UX com as melhores práticas específicas de pilha"],"ru":["Автоматизировать решения по дизайну UI с помощью данных","Генерировать последовательные стили бренда на продуктах","Отладка проблем UX с помощью лучших практик, специфичных для стека"],"ar":["أتمتة قرارات تصميم UI باستخدام رؤى قائمة على البيانات","генерировать أساليب العلامة التجارية الثابتة عبر المنتجات","تصحيح أخطاء UX باستخدام أفضل الممارسات المحددة للكود"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python installation (3.x)","Dependent on user''s OS for Python installation (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"zh":["需要 Python 安装 (3.x)","依赖于用户的操作系统进行 Python 安装 (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"ja":["Python のインストール (3.x) が必要","Python のインストールにはユーザーの OS (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows) 依存する"],"ko":["Python 설치 필요 (3.x)","Python 설치는 사용자의 OS (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)에 따라 달라진다."],"es":["Requiere instalación de Python (3.x)","Depende del sistema operativo del usuario para la instalación de Python (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation de Python (3.x)","Dépend du système d''exploitation de l''utilisateur pour l''installation de Python (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Installation (3.x)","Hängt vom Betriebssystem des Benutzers für die Python-Installation ab (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Python (3.x)","Dependente do sistema operacional do usuário para instalação do Python (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"ru":["Требуется установка Python (3.x)","Зависит от операционной системы пользователя для установки Python (macOS, Ubuntu/Debian, Windows)"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Python (3.x)","يعتمد على نظام التشغيل للمستخدم لتثبيت Python (macOS، Ubuntu/Debian، Windows)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
