 Pro Max: Разработка Интерфейсов","ar":"UI/UX Pro Max: تصميم الواجهات","en":"ui-ux-pro-max"},"description":{"zh":"UI/UX Pro Max, ","ja":"UI/UX Pro Max, ","ko":"UI/UX Pro Max, ","es":"UI/UX Pro Max es una herramienta de diseño inteligente que ofrece una base de datos de estilos UI, paletas de colores y recomendaciones de productos para mej...","fr":"UI/UX Pro Max est un outil de design intelligent qui propose une base de données de styles UI, de palettes de couleurs et de recommandations de produits pour...","de":"UI/UX Pro Max ist ein Werkzeug für Design-Intelligenz, das eine Datenbank von UI-Stilen, Farbpaletten und Produkt-Empfehlungen zur Verbesserung der Benutzere...","pt":"UI/UX Pro Max é uma ferramenta para desenvolvedores que busca melhorar a experiência do usuário. Fornece uma base de dados de estilos de interface, paletas d...","ru":"UI/UX Pro Max — это инструмент для разработчиков, который направлен на улучшение пользовательского опыта. Предоставляет базу данных стилей интерфейса, цветов...","ar":"UI/UX Pro Max هي أداة للمطورين تسعى لتحسين تجربة المستخدم. توفر قاعدة بيانات لأسلوب الواجهة وتصميم الألوان والمزيد.","en":"Website for Corgi Hub Marketplace"},"definition":{"en":"Website for Corgi Hub Marketplace"},"features":{"zh":["UI","UX","Python","UI/UX","UI/UX","UI/UX"],"ja":["UI","UX","Python","UI/UX","UI/UX","UI/UX"],"ko":["UI","UX","Python","UI/UX","UI/UX","UI/UX"],"es":["Base de datos de estilos UI","Paletas de colores personalizables","Recomendaciones de productos","Guías de UX","Mejores prácticas para pilas específicas"],"fr":["Base de données de styles UI","Palettes de couleurs personnalisables","Recommandations de produits","Guides de UX","Meilleures pratiques pour les piles spécifiques"],"de":["Datenbank von UI-Stilen","Anpassbare Farbpaletten","Produkt-Empfehlungen","UX-Richtlinien","Best Practices für spezifische Stacks"],"pt":["Base de dados de estilos de interface","Paletas de cores personalizadas","Pares de fontes recomendados","Tipos de gráficos variados","Diretrizes de UX","Melhores práticas para pilhas específicas"],"ru":["База данных стилей интерфейса","Пользовательские цветовые палитры","Рекомендуемые пары шрифтов","Различные типы графиков","Руководства по UX","Лучшие практики для конкретных стеков"],"ar":["قاعدة بيانات لأسلوب الواجهة","تصميم ألوان مخصص","أزواج خطوط موصى بها","أنواع مخططات متنوعة","إرشادات تجربة المستخدم","أفضل الممارسات للواجهات المحددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI/UX Pro Max","UI/UX","Python","UI","UX","Corgi Hub Marketplace"],"ja":["UI/UX Pro Max","UI/UX","Python","UI","UX","Corgi Hub Marketplace"],"ko":["UI/UX Pro Max","UI/UX","Python","UI","UX","Corgi Hub Marketplace"],"es":["diseño de interfaz de usuario","experiencia de usuario","estilos UI","paletas de colores","recomendaciones de productos","guías de UX","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de software","diseño inteligente"],"fr":["conception d''interface utilisateur","expérience utilisateur","styles UI","palettes de couleurs","recommandations de produits","guides de UX","meilleures pratiques","développement de logiciels","conception intelligente"],"de":["Benutzeroberflächendesign","Benutzererfahrung","UI-Stile","Farbpaletten","Produkt-Empfehlungen","UX-Richtlinien","Best Practices","Software-Entwicklung","Design-Intelligenz"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de interfaces","ui/ux","design inteligente","estilos de interface","paletas de cores","fontes recomendadas","gráficos","ux guidelines","melhores práticas"],"ru":["разработка интерфейсов","ui/ux","разумный дизайн","стили интерфейса","цветовые палитры","рекомендуемые шрифты","графики","руководства по ux","лучшие практики"],"ar":["تصميم الواجهات","ui/ux","تصميم ذكي","أسلوب الواجهة","تصميم الألوان","أزواج خطوط موصى بها","مخططات","إرشادات تجربة المستخدم","أفضل الممارسات"]}},"owner":"captain-corgi","repo":"marketplace-website","repoPath":"captain-corgi/marketplace-website","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"Frontend UI/UX design intelligence - activate FIRST when user requests beautiful, stunning, gorgeous, or aesthetic interfaces. The primary skill for design decisions before implementation. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 8 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check frontend UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nSearchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, product recommendations, UX guidelines, and stack-specific best practices.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nSearchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, product recommendations, UX guidelines, and stack-specific best practices.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\n```\n\n---\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\n\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\n\nExtract key information from user request:\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\n\n### Step 2: Search Relevant Domains\n\nUse `search.py` multiple times to gather comprehensive information. Search until you have enough context.\n\n```bash\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\n```\n\n**Recommended search order:**\n\n1. **Product** - Get style recommendations for product type\n2. **Style** - Get detailed style guide (colors, effects, frameworks)\n3. **Typography** - Get font pairings with Google Fonts imports\n4. **Color** - Get color palette (Primary, Secondary, CTA, Background, Text, Border)\n5. **Landing** - Get page structure (if landing page)\n6. **Chart** - Get chart recommendations (if dashboard/analytics)\n7. **UX** - Get best practices and anti-patterns\n8. **Stack** - Get stack-specific guidelines (default: html-tailwind)\n\n### Step 3: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\n\nIf user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\n\n```bash\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`\n\n---\n\n## Search Reference\n\n### Available Domains\n\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\n|--------|---------|------------------|\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\n\n### Available Stacks\n\n| Stack | Focus |\n|-------|-------|\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\n\n---\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\n\n**AI should:**\n\n```bash\n# 1. Search product type\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --domain product\n\n# 2. Search style (based on industry: beauty, elegant)\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant minimal soft\" --domain style\n\n# 3. Search typography\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury\" --domain typography\n\n# 4. Search color palette\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness\" --domain color\n\n# 5. Search landing page structure\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"hero-centric social-proof\" --domain landing\n\n# 6. Search UX guidelines\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation\" --domain ux\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"accessibility\" --domain ux\n\n# 7. Search stack guidelines (default: html-tailwind)\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\n**Then:** Synthesize all search results and implement the design.\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Better Results\n\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\n\n---\n\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\n\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\n\n### Icons & Visual Elements\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\n\n### Interaction & Cursor\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\n\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\n\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\n\n### Visual Quality\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\n- [ ] Brand logos are correct (verified from Simple Icons)\n- [ ] Hover states don''t cause layout shift\n\n### Interaction\n- [ ] All clickable elements have `cursor-pointer`\n- [ ] Hover states provide clear visual feedback\n- [ ] Transitions are smooth (150-300ms)\n- [ ] Focus states visible for keyboard navigation\n\n### Light/Dark Mode\n- [ ] Light mode text has sufficient contrast (4.5:1 minimum)\n- [ ] Glass/transparent elements visible in light mode\n- [ ] Borders visible in both modes\n- [ ] Test both modes before delivery\n\n### Layout\n- [ ] Floating elements have proper spacing from edges\n- [ ] No content hidden behind fixed navbars\n- [ ] Responsive at 320px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px\n- [ ] No horizontal scroll on mobile\n\n### Accessibility\n- [ ] All images have alt text\n- [ ] Form inputs have labels\n- [ ] Color is not the only indicator\n- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` respected\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:56:27.283Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Design-oriented Agents needing advanced UI/UX intelligence with searchable databases of styles, palettes, and guidelines.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 UI/UX 智能的面向设计的代理，具有可搜索的样式、调色板和指南数据库。","ja":"デザイン志向のエージェントに最適で、検索可能なスタイル、パレット、ガイドラインのデータベースを備えた高度な UI/UX インテリジェンスが必要です。","ko":"고급 UI/UX 인텔리전스를 필요로하는 디자인 중심 에이전트에게 적합하며, 검색 가능한 스타일, 팔레트 및 가이드라인 데이터베이스를 제공합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes orientados al diseño que necesitan inteligencia avanzada de UI/UX con bases de datos de estilos, paletas y pautas de búsqueda.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents orientés conception nécessitant une intelligence UI/UX avancée avec des bases de données de styles, de palettes et de lignes directrices recherchables.","de":"Perfekt für designorientierte Agenten, die erweiterte UI/UX-Intelligenz mit durchsuchbaren Datenbanken von Stilen, Paletten und Richtlinien benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes orientados ao Design que necessitam de inteligência avançada de UI/UX com bancos de dados pesquisáveis de estilos, paletas e diretrizes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов, ориентированных на дизайн, которым требуются продвинутые возможности UI/UX с поисковыми базами данных стилей, палитр и руководств.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تصميم الوكيل التي تحتاج إلى ذكاء متقدم ل واجهة المستخدم / تجربة المستخدم مع قواعد بيانات قابلة للبحث من الأنماط وال_palettes والإرشادات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage a vast database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, and UX guidelines, utilizing Python for seamless integration and analysis, including stack-specific best practices and product recommendations.","zh":"赋予代理利用大量的 UI 风格、颜色调色板、字体配对和 UX 指南数据库的能力，使用 Python 实现无缝集成和分析，包括特定栈的最佳实践和产品推荐。","ja":"エージェントが大量の UI スタイル、カラーパレット、フォントのペア、UX ガイドラインのデータベースを利用できるようにし、Python を使用してシームレスな統合と分析を行い、スタック固有のベストプラクティスと製品の推奨事項を含みます。","ko":"에이전트가大量의 UI 스타일, 색상 팔레트, 글꼴 페어 및 UX 가이드라인 데이터베이스를 활용할 수 있도록 해주며, Python을 사용하여 무縫한 통합 및 분석을 수행하며, 스택 별 최적의 방법 및 제품 추천을 포함합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar una vasta base de datos de estilos de UI, paletas de colores, emparejamientos de fuentes y pautas de UX, utilizando Python para una integración y análisis sin problemas, incluyendo las mejores prácticas específicas de la pila y recomendaciones de productos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter une vaste base de données de styles d''UI, de palettes de couleurs, d''appariements de polices et de lignes directrices d''UX, en utilisant Python pour une intégration et une analyse sans problème, y compris les meilleures pratiques spécifiques à la pile et les recommandations de produits.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eine umfangreiche Datenbank von UI-Stilen, Farbpaletten, Schriftartenkombinationen und UX-Richtlinien zu nutzen, wobei Python für eine nahtlose Integration und Analyse verwendet wird, einschließlich stapelspezifischer Best Practices und Produktempfehlungen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes usem uma vasta base de dados de estilos de interface do usuário, paletas de cores, combinações de fontes e diretrizes de experiência do usuário, utilizando Python para integração e análise sem problemas, incluindo as melhores práticas específicas de pilha e recomendações de produtos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать огромную базу данных стилей интерфейса пользователя, палитр цветов, пар fontов и руководств по пользовательскому опыту, используя Python для бесшовной интеграции и анализа, включая лучшие практики, специфичные для стека, и рекомендации продуктов.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من استخدام قاعدة بيانات ضخمة من أنماط واجهة المستخدم و_palettes الألوان وتركيبات الخطوط والإرشادات لتجربة المستخدم ، باستخدام Python من أجل التكامل السلس والتحليل ، بما في ذلك أفضل الممارسات المحددة للحزمة وتوصيات المنتجات."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating consistent UI designs across multiple product lines","Automating the creation of accessible color palettes for web applications","Debugging UX issues with data-driven insights from the guideline database"],"zh":["跨多个产品线生成一致的 UI 设计","为 Web 应用程序自动创建可访问的颜色调色板","使用指南数据库的数据驱动的洞察力调试 UX 问题"],"ja":["複数の製品ラインにわたる一貫性のある UI デザインの生成","Web アプリケーションのためのアクセシブルなカラーパレットの自動生成","ガイドラインデータベースからのデータ駆動型の洞察を使用した UX 問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["여러 제품 라인에 걸쳐 일관된 UI 디자인 생성","웹 애플리케이션을 위한 접근 가능한 색상 팔레트 자동 생성","가이드라인 데이터베이스의 데이터 주도형 인사이트를 사용한 UX 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Generar diseños de UI coherentes en varias líneas de productos","Automatizar la creación de paletas de colores accesibles para aplicaciones web","Depurar problemas de UX con información basada en datos de la base de datos de pautas"],"fr":["Générer des conceptions d''UI cohérentes sur plusieurs lignes de produits","Automatiser la création de palettes de couleurs accessibles pour les applications Web","Déboguer les problèmes d''UX avec des informations basées sur les données de la base de données de lignes directrices"],"de":["Erzeugen von konsistenten UI-Designs über mehrere Produktlinien hinweg","Automatisieren der Erstellung von zugänglichen Farbpaletten für Webanwendungen","Fehlerbehebung von UX-Problemen mit datengetriebenen Erkenntnissen aus der Richtliniendatenbank"],"pt":["Geração de projetos de interface do usuário consistentes em várias linhas de produtos","Automatização da criação de paletas de cores acessíveis para aplicações web","Depuração de problemas de experiência do usuário com insights baseados em dados do banco de dados de diretrizes"],"ru":["Генерация последовательных проектов интерфейса пользователя на нескольких линиях продуктов","Автоматизация создания доступных палитр цветов для веб-приложений","Отладка проблем пользовательского опыта с данными, основанными на инсайтах из базы данных руководств"],"ar":["توليد تصاميم واجهة المستخدم المتسقة عبر خطوط المنتجات المتعددة","أتمتة إنشاء _palettes الألوان القابلة للوصول لتطبيقات الويب","تصحيح أخطاء تجربة المستخدم باستخدام رؤى مدعومة بالبيانات من قاعدة بيانات الإرشادات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3 installation","Limited to design intelligence within the database scope"],"zh":["需要 Python 3 安装","仅限于数据库范围内的设计智能"],"ja":["Python 3 のインストールが必要","データベースの範囲内でのデザイン インテリジェンスに限定される"],"ko":["Python 3 설치가 필요함","데이터베이스 범위 내의 디자인 인텔리전스에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Python 3","Limitado a la inteligencia de diseño dentro del alcance de la base de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation de Python 3","Limité à l''intelligence de conception dans la portée de la base de données"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3-Installation","Begrenzt auf Design-Intelligenz im Umfang der Datenbank"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Python 3","Limitado à inteligência de design dentro do escopo do banco de dados"],"ru":["Требуется установка Python 3","Ограниченная интеллект дизайна в пределах базы данных"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Python 3","محدود بالذكاء التصميمي في نطاق قاعدة البيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
