phiques et recommandations de produits","Lignes directrices de UX et meilleures pratiques spécifiques à la pile"],"de":["Durchsuchbare Datenbank von UI-Stilen","Anpassbare Farbpaletten","Empfohlene Schriftkombinationen","Diagrammtypen und Produkt-Empfehlungen","UX-Richtlinien und stack-spezifische Best Practices"],"pt":["Base de dados pesquisável de estilos de UI","Paletas de cores e combinações de fontes","Melhores práticas para desenvolvedores","Recomendações de produtos e diretrizes de UX","Suporte a múltiplos sistemas operacionais"],"ru":["Поисковая база данных стилей UI","Цветовые палитры и парные шрифты","Лучшие практики для разработчиков","Рекомендации продуктов и руководства по UX","Поддержка нескольких операционных систем"],"ar":["قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث لأسلوب واجهة المستخدم","ألوان وتركيبات الخطوط","أفضل الممارسات للمطورين","توصيات المنتجات وإرشادات تجربة المستخدم","دعم أنظمة التشغيل المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["UI设计","UX设计","设计智能","开发者工具","设计资源","Python"],"ja":["UIデザイン","UXデザイン","デザインインテリジェンス","開発者ツール","デザインリソース","Python"],"ko":["UI 디자인","UX 디자인","디자인 인텔리전스","개발자 도구","디자인 리소스","Python"],"es":["diseño ui","experiencia de usuario","desarrollo de software","herramientas de diseño","estilos ui","paletas de colores","emparejamientos de fuentes","tipos de gráficos"],"fr":["conception ui","expérience utilisateur","développement de logiciels","outils de conception","styles ui","palettes de couleurs","combinaisons de polices","types de graphiques"],"de":["ui-design","benutzererfahrung","software-entwicklung","design-tools","ui-styles","farbpaletten","schriftkombinationen","diagrammtypen"],"pt":["UI/UX","design inteligente","desenvolvimento de software","experiência do usuário","estilos de UI","paletas de cores","combinações de fontes"],"ru":["UI/UX","интеллектуальная система дизайна","разработка программного обеспечения","пользовательский опыт","стили UI","цветовые палитры","парные шрифты"],"ar":["UI/UX","ذكاء التصميم","تطوير البرمجيات","تجربة المستخدم","أسلوب واجهة المستخدم","ألوان","تركيبات الخطوط"]}},"owner":"hotriluan","repo":"ai-command-center","repoPath":"hotriluan/ai-command-center","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ui-ux-pro-max","description":"Frontend UI/UX design intelligence - activate FIRST when user requests beautiful, stunning, gorgeous, or aesthetic interfaces. The primary skill for design decisions before implementation. 50 styles, 21 palettes, 50 font pairings, 20 charts, 8 stacks (React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, SwiftUI, React Native, Flutter, Tailwind). Actions: plan, build, create, design, implement, review, fix, improve, optimize, enhance, refactor, check frontend UI/UX code. Projects: website, landing page, dashboard, admin panel, e-commerce, SaaS, portfolio, blog, mobile app, .html, .tsx, .vue, .svelte. Elements: button, modal, navbar, sidebar, card, table, form, chart. Styles: glassmorphism, claymorphism, minimalism, brutalism, neumorphism, bento grid, dark mode, responsive, skeuomorphism, flat design. Topics: color palette, accessibility, animation, layout, typography, font pairing, spacing, hover, shadow, gradient.","bodyPreview":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nSearchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, product recommendations, UX guidelines, and stack-specific best practices.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell","body":"# UI/UX Pro Max - Design Intelligence\n\nSearchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, product recommendations, UX guidelines, and stack-specific best practices.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\nIf Python is not installed, install it based on user''s OS:\n\n**macOS:**\n```bash\nbrew install python3\n```\n\n**Ubuntu/Debian:**\n```bash\nsudo apt update && sudo apt install python3\n```\n\n**Windows:**\n```powershell\nwinget install Python.Python.3.12\n```\n\n---\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\nWhen user requests UI/UX work (design, build, create, implement, review, fix, improve), follow this workflow:\n\n### Step 1: Analyze User Requirements\n\nExtract key information from user request:\n- **Product type**: SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, dashboard, landing page, etc.\n- **Style keywords**: minimal, playful, professional, elegant, dark mode, etc.\n- **Industry**: healthcare, fintech, gaming, education, etc.\n- **Stack**: React, Vue, Next.js, or default to `html-tailwind`\n\n### Step 2: Search Relevant Domains\n\nUse `search.py` multiple times to gather comprehensive information. Search until you have enough context.\n\n```bash\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --domain <domain> [-n <max_results>]\n```\n\n**Recommended search order:**\n\n1. **Product** - Get style recommendations for product type\n2. **Style** - Get detailed style guide (colors, effects, frameworks)\n3. **Typography** - Get font pairings with Google Fonts imports\n4. **Color** - Get color palette (Primary, Secondary, CTA, Background, Text, Border)\n5. **Landing** - Get page structure (if landing page)\n6. **Chart** - Get chart recommendations (if dashboard/analytics)\n7. **UX** - Get best practices and anti-patterns\n8. **Stack** - Get stack-specific guidelines (default: html-tailwind)\n\n### Step 3: Stack Guidelines (Default: html-tailwind)\n\nIf user doesn''t specify a stack, **default to `html-tailwind`**.\n\n```bash\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"<keyword>\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\nAvailable stacks: `html-tailwind`, `react`, `nextjs`, `vue`, `svelte`, `swiftui`, `react-native`, `flutter`\n\n---\n\n## Search Reference\n\n### Available Domains\n\n| Domain | Use For | Example Keywords |\n|--------|---------|------------------|\n| `product` | Product type recommendations | SaaS, e-commerce, portfolio, healthcare, beauty, service |\n| `style` | UI styles, colors, effects | glassmorphism, minimalism, dark mode, brutalism |\n| `typography` | Font pairings, Google Fonts | elegant, playful, professional, modern |\n| `color` | Color palettes by product type | saas, ecommerce, healthcare, beauty, fintech, service |\n| `landing` | Page structure, CTA strategies | hero, hero-centric, testimonial, pricing, social-proof |\n| `chart` | Chart types, library recommendations | trend, comparison, timeline, funnel, pie |\n| `ux` | Best practices, anti-patterns | animation, accessibility, z-index, loading |\n| `prompt` | AI prompts, CSS keywords | (style name) |\n\n### Available Stacks\n\n| Stack | Focus |\n|-------|-------|\n| `html-tailwind` | Tailwind utilities, responsive, a11y (DEFAULT) |\n| `react` | State, hooks, performance, patterns |\n| `nextjs` | SSR, routing, images, API routes |\n| `vue` | Composition API, Pinia, Vue Router |\n| `svelte` | Runes, stores, SvelteKit |\n| `swiftui` | Views, State, Navigation, Animation |\n| `react-native` | Components, Navigation, Lists |\n| `flutter` | Widgets, State, Layout, Theming |\n\n---\n\n## Example Workflow\n\n**User request:** \"Làm landing page cho dịch vụ chăm sóc da chuyên nghiệp\"\n\n**AI should:**\n\n```bash\n# 1. Search product type\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness service\" --domain product\n\n# 2. Search style (based on industry: beauty, elegant)\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant minimal soft\" --domain style\n\n# 3. Search typography\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"elegant luxury\" --domain typography\n\n# 4. Search color palette\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"beauty spa wellness\" --domain color\n\n# 5. Search landing page structure\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"hero-centric social-proof\" --domain landing\n\n# 6. Search UX guidelines\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"animation\" --domain ux\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"accessibility\" --domain ux\n\n# 7. Search stack guidelines (default: html-tailwind)\npython3 .claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py \"layout responsive\" --stack html-tailwind\n```\n\n**Then:** Synthesize all search results and implement the design.\n\n---\n\n## Tips for Better Results\n\n1. **Be specific with keywords** - \"healthcare SaaS dashboard\" > \"app\"\n2. **Search multiple times** - Different keywords reveal different insights\n3. **Combine domains** - Style + Typography + Color = Complete design system\n4. **Always check UX** - Search \"animation\", \"z-index\", \"accessibility\" for common issues\n5. **Use stack flag** - Get implementation-specific best practices\n6. **Iterate** - If first search doesn''t match, try different keywords\n\n---\n\n## Common Rules for Professional UI\n\nThese are frequently overlooked issues that make UI look unprofessional:\n\n### Icons & Visual Elements\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **No emoji icons** | Use SVG icons (Heroicons, Lucide, Simple Icons) | Use emojis like 🎨 🚀 ⚙️ as UI icons |\n| **Stable hover states** | Use color/opacity transitions on hover | Use scale transforms that shift layout |\n| **Correct brand logos** | Research official SVG from Simple Icons | Guess or use incorrect logo paths |\n| **Consistent icon sizing** | Use fixed viewBox (24x24) with w-6 h-6 | Mix different icon sizes randomly |\n\n### Interaction & Cursor\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Cursor pointer** | Add `cursor-pointer` to all clickable/hoverable cards | Leave default cursor on interactive elements |\n| **Hover feedback** | Provide visual feedback (color, shadow, border) | No indication element is interactive |\n| **Smooth transitions** | Use `transition-colors duration-200` | Instant state changes or too slow (>500ms) |\n\n### Light/Dark Mode Contrast\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Glass card light mode** | Use `bg-white/80` or higher opacity | Use `bg-white/10` (too transparent) |\n| **Text contrast light** | Use `#0F172A` (slate-900) for text | Use `#94A3B8` (slate-400) for body text |\n| **Muted text light** | Use `#475569` (slate-600) minimum | Use gray-400 or lighter |\n| **Border visibility** | Use `border-gray-200` in light mode | Use `border-white/10` (invisible) |\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n\n| Rule | Do | Don''t |\n|------|----|----- |\n| **Floating navbar** | Add `top-4 left-4 right-4` spacing | Stick navbar to `top-0 left-0 right-0` |\n| **Content padding** | Account for fixed navbar height | Let content hide behind fixed elements |\n| **Consistent max-width** | Use same `max-w-6xl` or `max-w-7xl` | Mix different container widths |\n\n---\n\n## Pre-Delivery Checklist\n\nBefore delivering UI code, verify these items:\n\n### Visual Quality\n- [ ] No emojis used as icons (use SVG instead)\n- [ ] All icons from consistent icon set (Heroicons/Lucide)\n- [ ] Brand logos are correct (verified from Simple Icons)\n- [ ] Hover states don''t cause layout shift\n\n### Interaction\n- [ ] All clickable elements have `cursor-pointer`\n- [ ] Hover states provide clear visual feedback\n- [ ] Transitions are smooth (150-300ms)\n- [ ] Focus states visible for keyboard navigation\n\n### Light/Dark Mode\n- [ ] Light mode text has sufficient contrast (4.5:1 minimum)\n- [ ] Glass/transparent elements visible in light mode\n- [ ] Borders visible in both modes\n- [ ] Test both modes before delivery\n\n### Layout\n- [ ] Floating elements have proper spacing from edges\n- [ ] No content hidden behind fixed navbars\n- [ ] Responsive at 320px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px\n- [ ] No horizontal scroll on mobile\n\n### Accessibility\n- [ ] All images have alt text\n- [ ] Form inputs have labels\n- [ ] Color is not the only indicator\n- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` respected\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:56:50.787Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Design Intelligence Agents needing instant access to comprehensive UI/UX databases and best practices.","zh":"非常适合需要即时访问综合UI/UX数据库和最佳实践的设计智能代理。","ja":"設計インテリジェンスエージェントが包括的なUI/UXデータベースやベストプラクティスに即時アクセスする必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"포괄적인 UI/UX 데이터베이스 및 모범 사례에 즉시 액세스해야 하는 디자인 인텔리전스 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Inteligencia de Diseño que necesitan acceso instantáneo a bases de datos y mejores prácticas de UI/UX comprehensivas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Intelligence de Conception nécessitant un accès instantané à des bases de données et des meilleures pratiques de UI/UX complètes.","de":"Perfekt für Design-Intelligenz-Agenten, die sofortigen Zugriff auf umfassende UI/UX-Datenbanken und Best Practices benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Inteligência de Design que precisam de acesso instantâneo a bases de dados abrangentes de UI/UX e às melhores práticas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов дизайна интеллекта, которым требуется мгновенный доступ к всесторонним базам данных UI/UX и передовому опыту.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيلات تصميم الذكاء التي تحتاج إلى الوصول الفوري إلى قواعد بيانات شاملة لوي/يو إكس وأفضل الممارسات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Provides direct access to a searchable database of UI styles, color palettes, font pairings, chart types, and stack-specific UX guidelines, enabling rapid design recommendations and compliance checks.","zh":"提供直接访问可搜索的UI样式、颜色调色板、字体配对、图表类型和特定于堆栈的UX指南数据库，实现快速的设计建议和合规性检查。","ja":"検索可能なUIスタイル、カラーパレット、フォントのペア、チャートの種類、スタック固有のUXガイドラインのデータベースに直接アクセスできるため、迅速な設計の提案とコンプライアンスチェックを可能にします。","ko":"검색 가능한 UI 스타일, 색상 팔레트, 글꼴 페어, 차트 유형 및 스택별 UX 가이드라인 데이터베이스에 직접 액세스할 수 있으므로 빠른 디자인 제안 및 규정 준수 확인을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Proporciona acceso directo a una base de datos searchable de estilos de UI, paletas de colores, combinaciones de fuentes, tipos de gráficos y pautas de UX específicas de la pila, lo que permite recomendaciones de diseño rápidas y controles de cumplimiento.","fr":"Fournit un accès direct à une base de données recherchable de styles d''UI, de palettes de couleurs, de combinaisons de polices, de types de graphiques et de lignes directrices d''UX spécifiques à la pile, permettant ainsi des recommandations de conception rapides et des contrôles de conformité.","de":"Bietet direkten Zugriff auf eine durchsuchbare Datenbank von UI-Stilen, Farbpaletten, Schriftkombinationen, Charttypen und stack-spezifischen UX-Richtlinien, wodurch schnelle Designempfehlungen und Konformitätsprüfungen ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Fornece acesso direto a uma base de dados pesquisável de estilos de UI, paletas de cores, combinações de fontes, tipos de gráficos e diretrizes de UX específicas de pilha, permitindo recomendações de design rápidas e verificações de conformidade.","ru":"Предоставляет прямой доступ к базе данных, в которой можно найти стили интерфейса пользователя, палитры цветов, комбинации шрифтов, типы графиков и рекомендации по опыту пользователя, специфичные для стека, что позволяет быстро генерировать рекомендации по дизайну и проверять соответствие.","ar":"يوفر الوصول المباشر إلى قاعدة بيانات قابلة للبحث من أنماط واجهة المستخدم ولوحات الألوان وأزواج الخطوط وأنواع الرسوم البيانية وإرشادات تجربة المستخدم المحددة بالكد، مما يتيح التوصيات السريعة بالتصميم والتحقق من المطابقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating color palette recommendations","Identifying font pairing combinations","Recommending chart types for data visualization","Validating designs against stack-specific best practices","Searching UI styles for inspiration"],"zh":["生成颜色调色板建议","识别字体配对组合","推荐数据可视化的图表类型","验证设计是否符合特定于堆栈的最佳实践","搜索UI样式以获取灵感"],"ja":["カラーパレットの提案を生成する","フォントのペアの組み合わせを特定する","データ視覚化のためのチャートの種類を提案する","設計がスタック固有のベストプラクティスに準拠していることを検証する","インスピレーションを得るためのUIスタイルを検索する"],"ko":["색상 팔레트 제안 생성","글꼴 페어 조합 식별","데이터 시각화에 대한 차트 유형 추천","디자인을 스택별 모범 사례와 비교하여 확인","영감을 얻기 위한 UI 스타일 검색"],"es":["Generar recomendaciones de paletas de colores","Identificar combinaciones de fuentes","Recomendar tipos de gráficos para la visualización de datos","Validar diseños contra las mejores prácticas específicas de la pila","Buscar estilos de UI para la inspiración"],"fr":["Générer des recommandations de palettes de couleurs","Identifier des combinaisons de polices","Recommander des types de graphiques pour la visualisation de données","Valider les conceptions contre les meilleures pratiques spécifiques à la pile","Rechercher des styles d''UI pour l''inspiration"],"de":["Farbpaletten-Empfehlungen generieren","Schriftkombinationen identifizieren","Charttypen für die Datenvisualisierung empfehlen","Entwürfe gegen stack-spezifische Best Practices überprüfen","UI-Stile für die Inspiration suchen"],"pt":["Geração de recomendações de paleta de cores","Identificação de combinações de par de fontes","Recomendação de tipos de gráficos para visualização de dados","Validação de designs contra as melhores práticas específicas de pilha","Pesquisa de estilos de UI para inspiração"],"ru":["Генерация рекомендаций по палитрам цветов","Определение комбинаций пар шрифтов","Рекомендация типов графиков для визуализации данных","Проверка дизайна на соответствие передовому опыту, специфичному для стека","Поиск стилей интерфейса пользователя для вдохновения"],"ar":["توليد توصيات لوحات الألوان","تحديد组ات أزواج الخطوط","توصية بأنواع الرسوم البيانية للرؤية البيانية للبيانات","التحقق من صحة التصاميم ضد أفضل الممارسات المحددة بالكد","بحث أنماط واجهة المستخدم للإلهام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python installation","OS-specific installation requirements (macOS/Ubuntu/Windows)","Database access dependent on local implementation"],"zh":["需要Python安装","操作系统特定的安装要求（macOS/Ubuntu/Windows）","数据库访问取决于本地实现"],"ja":["Pythonのインストールが必要","OS特有のインストール要件（macOS/Ubuntu/Windows）","データベースへのアクセスはローカル実装に依存する"],"ko":["Python 설치가 필요함","운영 체제별 설치 요구 사항(macos/Ubuntu/Windows)","데이터베이스 액세스는 로컬 구현에 종속됨"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Python","Requisitos de instalación específicos del sistema operativo (macOS/Ubuntu/Windows)","El acceso a la base de datos depende de la implementación local"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation de Python","Exigences d''installation spécifiques du système d''exploitation (macOS/Ubuntu/Windows)","L''accès à la base de données dépend de la mise en œuvre locale"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Installation","Betriebssystem-spezifische Installationsanforderungen (macOS/Ubuntu/Windows)","Datenbankzugriff hängt von der lokalen Implementierung ab"],"pt":["Exige instalação do Python","Requisitos de instalação específicos do sistema operacional (macOS/Ubuntu/Windows)","Acesso à base de dados dependente da implementação local"],"ru":["Требует установки Python","Операционные требования к установке (macOS/Ubuntu/Windows)","Доступ к базе данных зависит от локальной реализации"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت بايثون","متطلبات تثبيت محددة بنظام التشغيل (macOS/Ubuntu/Windows)","الوصول إلى قاعدة البيانات يعتمد على التنفيذ المحلي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('manavkushwaha10/apple-health/expo-modules', 'community', 'manavkushwaha10', 'apple-health', 'manavkushwaha10/apple-health', 'expo-modules', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z', '2026-02-18T03:56:53.563Z', NULL, '{"id":"manavkushwaha10/apple-health/expo-modules","name":"expo-modules","description":{"zh":"Expo 模块为开发者提供了与 Apple HealthKit 交互的简单方式，支持多种健康指标和锻炼","ja":"Expo モジュールは、開発者が Apple HealthKit と簡単にやり取りできるようにします","ko":"Expo 모듈은 개발자가 Apple HealthKit과 쉽게 상호 작용할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Expo-modules te permite interactuar con Apple HealthKit en iOS de manera sencilla. Lee, escribe y suscríbete a datos de salud con soporte rico para diversas métricas de salud y entrenamientos.","fr":"Expo-modules vous permet d''interagir avec Apple HealthKit sur iOS de manière simple. Lisez, écrivez et abonnez-vous aux données de santé avec un support riche pour diverses métriques de santé et entraînements.","de":"Expo-Module ermöglicht es Ihnen, mit Apple HealthKit auf iOS auf einfache Weise zu interagieren. Lesen, schreiben und abonnieren Sie Gesundheitsdaten mit reicher Unterstützung für verschiedene Gesundheitsmetriken und Trainings.","pt":"Os módulos Expo permitem interagir com o Apple HealthKit no iOS, fornecendo suporte rico para métricas e treinos de saúde.","ru":"Модули Expo позволяют взаимодействовать с Apple HealthKit на iOS, предоставляя богатую поддержку метрик и тренировок по здоровью.","ar":"مكتبات إكسبو تسمح بالتفاعل مع تطبيق أبل هيلث كيت على نظام آي أو إس، وتوفر دعمًا غنيًا لمقاييس وتمارين الصحة.","en":"🍏 Interact with Apple HealthKit on iOS: read, write, and subscribe to health data effortlessly with rich support for diverse health metrics and workouts."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Expo 模块：轻松与 Apple HealthKit 交互","ja":"Expo モジュール：Apple HealthKit と簡単にやり取り","ko":"Expo 모듈: Apple HealthKit과 쉽게 상호 작용","es":"Módulos Expo: Interactúa con Apple HealthKit","fr":"Modules Expo : Interagir avec Apple HealthKit","de":"Expo-Module: Interaktion mit Apple HealthKit","pt":"Módulos Expo: Integração com Apple HealthKit","ru":"Модули Expo: Интеграция с Apple HealthKit","ar":"مكتبات إكسبو: تكامل مع أبل هيلث كيت","en":"expo-modules"},"description":{"zh":"Expo 模块为开发者提供了与 Apple HealthKit 交互的简单方式，支持多种健康指标和锻炼","ja":"Expo モジュールは、開発者が Apple HealthKit と簡単にやり取りできるようにします","ko":"Expo 모듈은 개발자가 Apple HealthKit과 쉽게 상호 작용할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Expo-modules te permite interactuar con Apple HealthKit en iOS de manera sencilla. Lee, escribe y suscríbete a datos de salud con soporte rico para diversas ...","fr":"Expo-modules vous permet d''interagir avec Apple HealthKit sur iOS de manière simple. Lisez, écrivez et abonnez-vous aux données de santé avec un support rich...","de":"Expo-Module ermöglicht es Ihnen, mit Apple HealthKit auf iOS auf einfache Weise zu interagieren. Lesen, schreiben und abonnieren Sie Gesundheitsdaten mit rei...","pt":"Os módulos Expo permitem interagir com o Apple HealthKit no iOS, fornecendo suporte rico para métricas e treinos de saúde.","ru":"Модули Expo позволяют взаимодействовать с Apple HealthKit на iOS, предоставляя богатую поддержку метрик и тренировок по здоровью.","ar":"مكتبات إكسبو تسمح بالتفاعل مع تطبيق أبل هيلث كيت على نظام آي أو إس، وتوفر دعمًا غنيًا لمقاييس وتمارين الصحة.","en":"🍏 Interact with Apple HealthKit on iOS: read, write, and subscribe to health data effortlessly with rich support for diverse health metrics and workouts."},"definition":{"en":"🍏 Interact with Apple HealthKit on iOS: read, write, and subscribe to health data effortlessly with rich support for diverse health metrics and workouts."},"features":{"zh":["与 Apple HealthKit 数据交互","支持多种健康指标","支持锻炼和健身追踪","100% 向后兼容","直接暴露原生功能"],"ja":["Apple HealthKit のデータとやり取り","多様なヘルスメトリクスをサポート","ワークアウトとフィットネストラッキングをサポート","100% 後方互換性","ネイティブ機能を直接公開"],"ko":["Apple HealthKit 데이터와 상호 작용","다양한 건강 지표 지원","운동 및 피트니스 추적 지원","100% 後方 호환성","네이티브 기능 직접 노출"],"es":["Lectura y escritura de datos de salud","Suscripción a datos de salud","Soporte para diversas métricas de salud","Soporte para entrenamientos","Diseño de API nativas como si se contribuyera a las especificaciones de la W3C","Compatibilidad hacia atrás del 100%"],"fr":["Lecture et écriture de données de santé","Abonnement aux données de santé","Prise en charge de diverses métriques de santé","Prise en charge des entraînements","Conception d''API natives comme si on contribuait aux spécifications de la W3C","Compatibilité vers l''arrière de 100 %"],"de":["Lesen und Schreiben von Gesundheitsdaten","Abonnieren von Gesundheitsdaten","Unterstützung für verschiedene Gesundheitsmetriken","Unterstützung für Trainings","Entwurf von nativen APIs wie bei der Mitarbeit an W3C-Spezifikationen","100% rückwärts kompatibel"],"pt":["Leitura e escrita de dados de saúde","Assinatura de dados de saúde","Suporte a métricas de saúde diversificadas","Suporte a treinos de saúde","Design de APIs nativas inspirado nos padrões da web","Compatibilidade backwards de 100%"],"ru":["Чтение и запись данных о здоровье","Подписка на данные о здоровье","Поддержка разнообразных метрик здоровья","Поддержка тренировок по здоровью","Дизайн родных API, вдохновленный веб-стандартами","Обратная совместимость 100%"],"ar":["قراءة وكتابة بيانات الصحة","الاشتراك في بيانات الصحة","دعم لمقاييس الصحة المتنوعة","دعم لتمارين الصحة","تصميم واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الأصلية مستوحى من معايير الويب","التوافق العكسي بنسبة 100%"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Expo 模块","Apple HealthKit","健康指标","锻炼追踪","移动开发","原生功能","后方兼容"],"ja":["Expo モジュール","Apple HealthKit","ヘルスメトリクス","ワークアウト トラッキング","モバイル開発","ネイティブ機能","後方互換性"],"ko":["Expo 모듈","Apple HealthKit","건강 지표","운동 추적","모바일 개발","네이티브 기능","후방 호환성"],"es":["expo-modules","Apple HealthKit","iOS","datos de salud","métricas de salud","entrenamientos","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","API nativas"],"fr":["expo-modules","Apple HealthKit","iOS","données de santé","métriques de santé","entraînements","développement d''applications mobiles","API natives"],"de":["expo-module","Apple HealthKit","iOS","Gesundheitsdaten","Gesundheitsmetriken","Trainings","Mobile-App-Entwicklung","native APIs"],"pt":["módulos Expo","Apple HealthKit","iOS","saúde","métricas de saúde","treinos de saúde","APIs nativas","compatibilidade backwards"],"ru":["модули Expo","Apple HealthKit","iOS","здоровье","метрики здоровья","тренировки по здоровью","родные API","обратная совместимость"],"ar":["مكتبات إكسبو","أبل هيلث كيت","نظام آي أو إس","الصحة","مقاييس الصحة","تمارين الصحة","واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الأصلية","التوافق العكسي"]}},"owner":"manavkushwaha10","repo":"apple-health","repoPath":"manavkushwaha10/apple-health","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"expo-modules","description":"Building great Expo native modules for iOS and Android. Views, APIs, Marshalling, Shared Objects, Expo Documentation, Verifying Expo modules.","bodyPreview":"## Great module standards\n\n- Design native APIs as if you contributing W3C specs for the browser, take inspiration from modern web modules. eg `std:kv-storage`, `clipboard`.\n- Aim for 100% backwards compatibility like the web.\n- Create escape hatches for single-platform functionality.\n- Avoid extraneous abstractions. Directly expose native functionality.\n- Avoid unnecessary async methods. Use sync methods when possible.\n- Prefer string union types for API options instead of boolean flags, enums,","body":"## Great module standards\n\n- Design native APIs as if you contributing W3C specs for the browser, take inspiration from modern web modules. eg `std:kv-storage`, `clipboard`.\n- Aim for 100% backwards compatibility like the web.\n- Create escape hatches for single-platform functionality.\n- Avoid extraneous abstractions. Directly expose native functionality.\n- Avoid unnecessary async methods. Use sync methods when possible.\n- Prefer string union types for API options instead of boolean flags, enums, or multiple parameters. eg instead of `capture(options: { isHighQuality: boolean })`, use `capture(options: { quality: ''high'' | ''medium'' | ''low'' })`.\n- Marshalling is awesome for platform-specific APIs.\n- New Architecture only. NEVER support legacy React Native architecture.\n- ALWAYS use only Expo modules API.\n- Prefer Swift and Kotlin.\n- Use optionality for availability checks as opposed to extraneous `isAvailable` functions or constants. eg `snapshot.capture?.()` instead of `snapshot.isAvailable && snapshot.capture()`.\n- ALWAYS support the latest and greatest API features.\n\nExample of a GREAT Expo module:\n\n```ts\nimport { NativeModule } from \"expo\";\n\ndeclare class AppClipModule extends NativeModule<{}> {\n  prompt(): void;\n  isAppClip?: boolean;\n}\n\n// This call loads the native module object from the JSI.\nconst AppClipNative =\n  typeof expo !== \"undefined\"\n    ? (expo.modules.AppClip as AppClipModule) ?? {}\n    : {};\n\nif (AppClipNative?.isAppClip) {\n  navigator.appClip = {\n    prompt: AppClipNative.prompt,\n  };\n}\n\n// Add types for the global `navigator.appClip` object.\ndeclare global {\n  interface Navigator {\n    /**\n     * Only available in an App Clip context.\n     * @expo\n     */\n    appClip?: {\n      /** Open the SKOverlay */\n      prompt: () => void;\n    };\n  }\n}\n\nexport {};\n```\n\n- Simple web-style interface.\n- Global type augmentation for easy access.\n- Docs in the type definitions.\n- Optional availability checks instead of extraneous `isAvailable` methods.\n\nExample of a POOR Expo module:\n\n```ts\nimport { NativeModulesProxy } from \"expo-modules-core\";\nconst { ExpoAppClip } = NativeModulesProxy;\nexport default {\n  promptAppClip() {\n    return ExpoAppClip.promptAppClip();\n  },\n  isAppClipAvailable() {\n    return ExpoAppClip.isAppClipAvailable();\n  },\n};\n```\n\n## Great documentation\n\n- If you have a function like `isAvailable()`, explain why it exists in the docs. Research cases where it may return false such as in a simulator or particular OS version.\n- Document OS version availability for functions and constants in the type definitions.\n\n## BAD module standards\n\n- APIs that are hard to import, e.g. `import * as MediaLibrary from ''expo-media-library'';` instead of `import { MediaLibrary } from ''expo/media'';`\n- Extraneous abstractions over native functionality. The native module is installing on the global, do not wrap it in another layer for no reason.\n- Extraneous async methods when sync methods are possible.\n- Boolean flags instead of string union types for options.\n- Supporting legacy React Native architecture.\n\n## Views\n\nTake API inspiration from great web component libraries like BaseUI and Radix.\n\n- https://base-ui.com/react/components/progress\n- https://www.radix-ui.com/primitives/docs/components/progress\n\nConsider if you''re building a control or a display component. Controls should have more interactive APIs, while display components should be more declarative.\n\nPrefer functions on views instead of `useImperativeHandle` + `findNodeHandle`.\n\n```swift\nAsyncFunction(\"capture\") { (view, options: Options) -> Ref in\n  return try capture(self.appContext, view)\n}\n```\n\nRemember to export views in the module:\n\n```swift\nimport ExpoModulesCore\n\npublic class ExpoWebViewModule: Module {\n  public func definition() -> ModuleDefinition {\n    Name(\"ExpoWebView\")\n\n    View(ExpoWebView.self) {}\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Marshalling-style API\n\nConsider this example https://github.com/EvanBacon/expo-shared-objects-haptics-example/blob/be90e92f8dba9b0807009502ab25c423c57e640d/modules/my-module/ios/MyModule.swift#L1C1-L178C2\n\nUsing `@retroactive Convertible` and `AnyArgument` to convert between Swift types and dictionaries enables passing complex data structures across the boundary without writing custom serialization code for each type.\n\n```swift\nextension CHHapticEventParameter: @retroactive Convertible, AnyArgument {\n    public static func convert(from value: Any?, appContext: AppContext) throws -> Self {\n        guard let dict = value as? [String: Any],\n              let parameterIDRaw = dict[\"parameterID\"] as? String,\n              let value = dict[\"value\"] as? Double else {\n            throw NotADictionaryException()\n        }\n        return Self(parameterID: CHHapticEvent.ParameterID(rawValue: parameterIDRaw), value: Float(value))\n    }\n}\n\nextension CHHapticEvent: @retroactive Convertible, AnyArgument {\n    public static func convert(from value: Any?, appContext: AppContext) throws -> Self {\n        guard let dict = value as? [String: Any],\n              let eventTypeRaw = dict[\"eventType\"] as? String,\n              let relativeTime = dict[\"relativeTime\"] as? Double else {\n            throw NotADictionaryException()\n        }\n        let eventType = CHHapticEvent.EventType(rawValue: eventTypeRaw)\n        let parameters = (dict[\"parameters\"] as? [[String: Any]])?.compactMap { paramDict -> CHHapticEventParameter? in\n            try? CHHapticEventParameter.convert(from: paramDict, appContext: appContext)\n        } ?? []\n        return Self(eventType: eventType, parameters: parameters, relativeTime: relativeTime)\n    }\n}\n\nextension CHHapticDynamicParameter: @retroactive Convertible, AnyArgument {\n    public static func convert(from value: Any?, appContext: AppContext) throws -> Self {\n        guard let dict = value as? [String: Any],\n              let parameterIDRaw = dict[\"parameterID\"] as? String,\n              let value = dict[\"value\"] as? Double,\n              let relativeTime = dict[\"relativeTime\"] as? Double else {\n            throw NotADictionaryException()\n        }\n\n        return Self(parameterID: CHHapticDynamicParameter.ID(rawValue: parameterIDRaw), value: Float(value), relativeTime: relativeTime)\n    }\n}\n\nextension CHHapticPattern: @retroactive Convertible, AnyArgument {\n    public static func convert(from value: Any?, appContext: AppContext) throws -> Self {\n        guard let dict = value as? [String: Any],\n              let eventsArray = dict[\"events\"] as? [[String: Any]] else {\n            throw NotADictionaryException()\n        }\n        let events = try eventsArray.map { eventDict -> CHHapticEvent in\n            try CHHapticEvent.convert(from: eventDict, appContext: appContext)\n        }\n        let parameters = (dict[\"parameters\"] as? [[String: Any]])?.compactMap { paramDict -> CHHapticDynamicParameter? in\n            return try? CHHapticDynamicParameter.convert(from: paramDict, appContext: appContext)\n        } ?? []\n        return try Self(events: events, parameters: parameters)\n    }\n}\n\ninternal final class NotAnArrayException: Exception {\n    override var reason: String {\n        \"Given value is not an array\"\n    }\n}\n\ninternal final class IncorrectArraySizeException: GenericException<(expected: Int, actual: Int)> {\n    override var reason: String {\n        \"Given array has unexpected number of elements: \\(param.actual), expected: \\(param.expected)\"\n    }\n}\n\ninternal final class NotADictionaryException: Exception {\n    override var reason: String {\n        \"Given value is not a dictionary\"\n    }\n}\n\n```\n\nLater this can be used to implement methods that accept complex data structures as arguments.\n\n```swift\nFunction(\"playPattern\") { (pattern: CHHapticPattern) in\n    let player = try hapticEngine.makePlayer(with: pattern)\n    try player.start(atTime: 0)\n}\n```\n\nUse shorthand where possible, especially when the JS value matches the Swift value:\n\n```swift\nProperty(\"__typename\") { $0.__typename }\n```\n\n## Shared objects\n\nShared objects are long-lived native instances that are shared to JS. They can be used to keep heavy state objects, such as a decoded bitmap, alive across React components, rather than spinning up a new native instance every time a component mounts.\n\n- https://docs.expo.dev/modules/shared-objects/\n- https://expo.dev/blog/the-real-world-impact-of-shared-objects\n\n## Interacting with AppDelegate\n\nTo interact with HealthKit, the module may need to respond to app lifecycle events. This can be done by implementing the `ExpoAppDelegateSubscriber` protocol.\n\n```swift\nimport ExpoModulesCore\n\npublic class ExpoHeadAppDelegateSubscriber: ExpoAppDelegateSubscriber {\n\n// Any AppDelegate methods you want to implement\n  public func application(\n    _ application: UIApplication,\n    continue userActivity: NSUserActivity,\n    restorationHandler: @escaping ([UIUserActivityRestoring]?) -> Void\n  ) -> Bool {\n    launchedActivity = userActivity\n\n   // ...\n\n    return false\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThen add the subscriber to the `expo-module.config.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"platforms\": [\"apple\", \"android\", \"web\"],\n  \"apple\": {\n    \"modules\": [\"ExpoHeadModule\", ...],\n    \"appDelegateSubscribers\": [\"ExpoHeadAppDelegateSubscriber\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Expo ecosystem integration\n\n- Create a Config Plugin for setting up all permissions and entitlements.\n- Permissions APIs should follow Expo''s permission model and implement hooks.\n  - Ref: https://github.com/expo/expo/blob/843d5e108ff70539ac353721d3a7765a5d08d502/packages/expo-media-library/src/MediaLibrary.ts#L502-L519\n- Document when things don''t work in Expo Go and link to dev client instructions.\n- Consider creating Expo devtools plugins for interacting with native APIs. Optimize for Claude Code usage, e.g. a Bun CLI before a UI.\n  - Ref: https://docs.expo.dev/debugging/devtools-plugins\n- If any feature launches the app or could benefit from deep linking, add an Expo Router integration. A good example is `expo-quick-actions` which has a `expo-quick-actions/router` import for automatic deep linking. Other good examples are Expo notifications (open settings, redirect notifications), widgets, siri shortcuts.\n  - Ref: https://github.com/EvanBacon/expo-quick-actions\n\n## Verification\n\n- Run `yarn expo run:ios --no-bundler` in an Expo app to headlessly compile the module and verify there are no compilation errors.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:56:53.563Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Mobile Agents interacting with iOS devices, needing seamless integration with Apple HealthKit for health data management.","zh":"适用于需要与iOS设备交互的移动代理，需要与Apple HealthKit实现无缝集成以管理健康数据。","ja":"iOSデバイスとのやり取りが必要で、ヘルスデータ管理のためにApple HealthKitとのシームレスな統合が必要なモバイルエージェントに最適です。","ko":"iOS 디바이스와 상호 작용해야 하며, 건강 데이터 관리를 위해 Apple HealthKit과 無縫な 통합이 필요한 모바일 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes móviles que interactúan con dispositivos iOS, necesitando una integración sin problemas con Apple HealthKit para la gestión de datos de salud.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents mobiles interactuant avec les appareils iOS, nécessitant une intégration transparente avec Apple HealthKit pour la gestion des données de santé.","de":"Ideal für Mobile Agents, die mit iOS-Geräten interagieren und eine nahtlose Integration mit Apple HealthKit für das Gesundheitsdatenmanagement benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Móveis que interagem com dispositivos iOS, necessitando de integração sem interrupções com o Apple HealthKit para gerenciamento de dados de saúde.","ru":"Идеально подходит для мобильных агентов, взаимодействующих с устройствами iOS, требующих бесшовной интеграции с Apple HealthKit для управления данными о здоровье.","ar":"مثالية لعميل المحمول التفاعل مع أجهزة iOS، تحتاج إلى التكامل دون انقطاع مع Apple HealthKit لإدارة بيانات الصحة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to read, write, and subscribe to diverse health metrics and workouts using native HealthKit APIs, with support for rich data types and escape hatches for single-platform functionality, all while maintaining 100% backwards compatibility.","zh":"赋予代理读取、写入和订阅各种健康指标和锻炼的能力，使用原生HealthKit API，并支持丰富的数据类型和单平台功能的逃生舱，同时保持100%的向后兼容性。","ja":"エージェントに、ネイティブのHealthKit APIを使用して、様々なヘルスメトリクスとワークアウトを読み取り、書き込み、購読する機能を提供し、豊富なデータ型とシングルプラットフォーム機能のためのエスケープハッチをサポートし、100%の下位互換性を維持します。","ko":"에이전트가 네이티브 HealthKit API를 사용하여 다양한 건강 지표와 운동을 읽고, 쓰고, 구독할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 풍부한 데이터 타입과 단일 플랫폼 기능을 위한 탈출구를 지원하며, 100%의 하위 호환성을 유지합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a leer, escribir y suscribirse a diversos métricas de salud y entrenamientos utilizando APIs nativas de HealthKit, con soporte para tipos de datos ricos y escapes para funcionalidad de plataforma única, manteniendo al mismo tiempo la compatibilidad hacia atrás del 100%.","fr":"Permet aux agents de lire, d''écrire et de s''abonner à diverses métriques de santé et d''entraînements en utilisant les API natives de HealthKit, avec un support pour les types de données riches et des échappatoires pour la fonctionnalité de plate-forme unique, tout en maintenant une compatibilité descendante de 100%.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, diverse Gesundheitsmetriken und Trainings zu lesen, zu schreiben und zu abonnieren, indem sie native HealthKit-APIs verwenden, mit Unterstützung für reiche Datentypen und Ausnahmen für Einzelplattformfunktionen, während sie gleichzeitig eine 100%ige Abwärtskompatibilität aufrechterhalten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a ler, escrever e se inscrever em diversas métricas de saúde e treinos usando APIs nativas do HealthKit, com suporte a tipos de dados ricos e escapes para funcionalidades de plataforma única, mantendo sempre a compatibilidade de 100% para trás.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью читать, записывать и подписываться на различные показатели здоровья и тренировки, используя родные API HealthKit, с поддержкой богатых типов данных и возможностью обхода для функциональности единой платформы, сохраняя при этом 100% обратную совместимость.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من قراءة وكتابة والاشتراك في معايير صحية متنوعة ومهام التدريب باستخدام واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الأصلية لـ HealthKit، مع دعم أنواع بيانات غنية وفرص هروب للوظائف منصة واحدة، مع الحفاظ على توافق خلفي بنسبة 100% في جميع الأوقات."},"useCases":{"en":["Interacting with Apple HealthKit on iOS","Subscribing to health data updates","Writing workout data to Apple HealthKit"],"zh":["在iOS上与Apple HealthKit交互","订阅健康数据更新","将锻炼数据写入Apple HealthKit"],"ja":["iOS上でApple HealthKitとやり取りする","ヘルスデータの更新を購読する","ワークアウトデータをApple HealthKitに書き込む"],"ko":["iOS에서 Apple HealthKit와 상호 작용하기","건강 데이터 업데이트를 구독하기","운동 데이터를 Apple HealthKit에 기록하기"],"es":["Interactuar con Apple HealthKit en iOS","Suscribirse a actualizaciones de datos de salud","Escribir datos de entrenamiento en Apple HealthKit"],"fr":["Interagir avec Apple HealthKit sur iOS","S''abonner aux mises à jour des données de santé","Écrire des données d''entraînement dans Apple HealthKit"],"de":["Mit Apple HealthKit auf iOS interagieren","Sich für Gesundheitsdaten-Updates abonnieren","Trainingsdaten in Apple HealthKit schreiben"],"pt":["Interação com o Apple HealthKit no iOS","Assinatura de atualizações de dados de saúde","Gravação de dados de treino no Apple HealthKit"],"ru":["Взаимодействие с Apple HealthKit на iOS","Подписка на обновления данных о здоровье","Запись данных тренировок в Apple HealthKit"],"ar":["التفاعل مع Apple HealthKit على iOS","الاشتراك في تحديثات بيانات الصحة","كتابة بيانات التدريب في Apple HealthKit"]},"limitations":{"en":["iOS only","Requires native HealthKit integration","No support for web-based health data management"],"zh":["仅限iOS","需要原生HealthKit集成","不支持基于Web的健康数据管理"],"ja":["iOSのみ","ネイティブのHealthKit統合が必要","ウェブベースのヘルスデータ管理はサポートされていません"],"ko":["iOS만 해당","네이티브 HealthKit 통합이 필요","웹 기반 건강 데이터 관리는 지원되지 않음"],"es":["Solo iOS","Requiere integración nativa de HealthKit","No admite la gestión de datos de salud basada en web"],"fr":["Uniquement iOS","Nécessite une intégration native de HealthKit","Ne prend pas en charge la gestion des données de santé basée sur le web"],"de":["Nur iOS","Benötigt native HealthKit-Integration","Unterstützt keine webbasierte Gesundheitsdatenverwaltung"],"pt":["Apenas iOS","Requer integração nativa com o HealthKit","Sem suporte par