,"Импортируйте изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты","Узнайте, как использовать Remotion для создания персонализированных видеороликов","Понимайте лучшие практики для работы с Remotion"],"ar":["أنشئ محتوى 3D باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber","طور مهارات الرسوم المتحركة الأساسية","استورد الصور والفيديوهات والصوت والخطوط","تعرف على كيفية استخدام ريموشن لإنشاء فيديوهات مخصصة","فهم أفضل الممارسات للعمل مع ريموشن"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Remotion","最佳实践","视频编辑","3D 内容","动画技能","资产导入","音频支持"],"ja":["Remotion","ベストプラクティス","ビデオ編集","3D コンテンツ","アニメーションスキル","アセットインポート","オーディオサポート"],"ko":["Remotion","최적화 가이드","비디오 편집","3D 콘텐츠","애니메이션 스킬","자산导入","오디오 지원"],"es":["Remotion","desarrollo de video","animaciones","Three.js","React Three Fiber","mejores prácticas","creación de contenido 3D","importación de assets"],"fr":["Remotion","développement de vidéos","animations","Three.js","React Three Fiber","bonnes pratiques","création de contenu 3D","importation de ressources"],"de":["Remotion","Videoprogrammierung","Animationen","Three.js","React Three Fiber","beste Praktiken","Erstellung von 3D-Inhalten","Importieren von Ressourcen"],"pt":["Remotion","melhores práticas","3D","animações","importação de ativos","vídeos personalizados","desenvolvimento de vídeo","plataforma de código aberto"],"ru":["Remotion","лучшие практики","3D","анимации","импорт активов","персонализированные видеоролики","разработка видео","открытая платформа"],"ar":["ريموشن","أفضل الممارسات","3D","الرسوم المتحركة","استيراد الموارد","فيديوهات مخصصة","تطوير الفيديو","منصة مفتوحة المصدر"]}},"owner":"mcfwalker","repo":"qwkshot","repoPath":"mcfwalker/qwkshot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:56:57.848Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Video Generation Agents needing advanced Remotion code optimization and best practices.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Remotion代码优化和最佳实践的视频生成代理。","ja":"Remotionのコード最適化とベストプラクティスに熟練したビデオ生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Remotion 코드 최적화 및 모범 사례가 필요한 비디오 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de generación de vídeo que necesiten optimización avanzada de código Remotion y mejores prácticas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération vidéo ayant besoin d''une optimisation avancée du code Remotion et de bonnes pratiques.","de":"Ideal für Video-Generierungs-Agents, die eine fortgeschrittene Optimierung von Remotion-Code und Best Practices benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Vídeo que precisam de otimização avançada de código Remotion e melhores práticas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации видео, которым необходима продвинутая оптимизация кода Remotion и лучшие практики.","ar":"مثالي لعميل генераية الفيديو الذين يحتاجون إلى تحسين متقدم للرموتيون وافضل الممارسات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-quality video content using Remotion, leveraging libraries like Three.js and React Three Fiber for 3D animations and importing various assets such as images, videos, audio, and fonts.","zh":"赋予代理创建高质量视频内容的能力，利用Remotion，并利用Three.js和React Three Fiber等库进行3D动画，以及导入图像、视频、音频和字体等各种资产。","ja":"Three.jsやReact Three Fiberなどのライブラリを利用して3Dアニメーションを作成し、画像、ビデオ、オーディオ、フォントなどの様々なアセットをインポートすることで、高品質のビデオコンテンツを作成するエージェントの能力を高めます。","ko":"에이전트가 Remotion을 사용하여 고품질의 비디오 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, Three.js 및 React Three Fiber와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 3D 애니메이션을 생성하고 이미지, 비디오, 오디오 및 글꼴과 같은 다양한 자산을 가져옵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear contenido de vídeo de alta calidad utilizando Remotion, aprovechando bibliotecas como Three.js y React Three Fiber para animaciones 3D e importando diversos recursos como imágenes, vídeos, audio y fuentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer du contenu vidéo de haute qualité en utilisant Remotion, en tirant parti de bibliothèques comme Three.js et React Three Fiber pour les animations 3D et en important divers assets tels que des images, des vidéos, de l''audio et des polices.","de":"Ermöglicht Agents die Erstellung hochwertiger Videoinhalte mit Remotion unter Verwendung von Bibliotheken wie Three.js und React Three Fiber für 3D-Animationen und dem Import verschiedener Assets wie Bilder, Videos, Audio und Schriftarten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar conteúdo de vídeo de alta qualidade usando Remotion, aproveitando bibliotecas como Three.js e React Three Fiber para animações 3D e importando vários ativos, como imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать контент высокого качества с использованием Remotion, используя библиотеки như Three.js и React Three Fiber для 3D-анимаций и импорта различных активов, таких как изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء محتوى فيديو عالي الجودة باستخدام الرموتيون، واستخدام المكتبات مثل ثري جيه اس وري액ت ثري فايبر لإنشاء رسومات ثلاثية الأبعاد واستيراد مختلف الأصول مثل الصور والفيديوهات والصوت والخطوط."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing Remotion code for 3D content rendering","Generating smooth animations using fundamental animation skills","Importing and managing assets like images, videos, and audio files"],"zh":["为3D内容渲染优化Remotion代码","使用基本动画技能生成平滑动画","导入和管理图像、视频和音频文件等资产"],"ja":["3DコンテンツレンダリングのためのRemotionコードの最適化","基本的なアニメーションスキルを使用してスムーズなアニメーションを生成","画像、ビデオ、オーディオファイルなどのアセットをインポートして管理"],"ko":["3D 콘텐츠 렌더링을 위한 Remotion 코드 최적화","기본 애니메이션 기술을 사용하여 부드러운 애니메이션 생성","이미지, 비디오, 오디오 파일 등 자산을 가져오고 관리"],"es":["Optimizar código Remotion para la renderización de contenido 3D","Generar animaciones fluidas utilizando habilidades fundamentales de animación","Importar y gestionar recursos como imágenes, vídeos y archivos de audio"],"fr":["Optimiser le code Remotion pour le rendu de contenu 3D","Générer des animations fluides en utilisant des compétences fondamentales en animation","Importer et gérer des assets tels que des images, des vidéos et des fichiers audio"],"de":["O