, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:57:10.927Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing expert Remotion code optimization and accessibility features","zh":"非常适合需要Remotion代码优化和无障碍功能的前端代理","ja":"Remotionコードの最適化とアクセシビリティ機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"Remotion 코드 최적화 및 액세스 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan una optimización de código Remotion experta y características de accesibilidad","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''une optimisation de code Remotion experte et de fonctionnalités d''accessibilité","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine expertenmäßige Remotion-Code-Optimierung und Zugänglichkeitsfunktionen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de otimização de código Remotion especializado e recursos de acessibilidade","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым необходима экспертная оптимизация кода Remotion и функции доступности","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى تحسين رمز Remotion الخبير وميزات سهولة الوصول"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to inject accessible ARIA labels in real-time using Gemini''s multimodal reasoning, while leveraging Remotion''s capabilities with Three.js and React Three Fiber for 3D content and animations, and importing various assets such as images, videos, audio, and fonts","zh":"赋予代理在实时中使用Gemini的多模态推理注入无障碍ARIA标签的能力，同时利用Remotion的Three.js和React Three Fiber的能力来处理3D内容和动画，并导入诸如图像、视频、音频和字体等各种资产","ja":"Geminiの多模態推論を使用してリアルタイムにアクセシブルなARIAラベルを注入できるエージェントをEmpowerし、RemotionのThree.jsとReact Three Fiberの機能を使用して3Dコンテンツとアニメーションを処理し、画像、ビデオ、オーディオ、フォントなどのさまざまなアセットをインポートする","ko":"Gemini의 다중 모드 推論을 사용하여 실시간으로 접근 가능한 ARIA 레이블을 주입 할 수있는 에이전트를 Empower 하며 Remotion의 Three.js 및 React Three Fiber 기능을 사용하여 3D 콘텐츠 및 애니메이션을 처리하고 이미지, 비디오, 오디오, 글꼴 등의 다양한 자산을 가져옵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a inyectar etiquetas ARIA accesibles en tiempo real utilizando la razonamiento multimodal de Gemini, al mismo tiempo que aprovecha las capacidades de Remotion con Three.js y React Three Fiber para contenido y animaciones 3D, e importar varios activos como imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes","fr":"Permet aux agents d''injecter des libellés ARIA accessibles en temps réel en utilisant le raisonnement multimodal de Gemini, tout en exploitant les capacités de Remotion avec Three.js et React Three Fiber pour le contenu et les animations 3D, et en important divers actifs tels que des images, des vidéos, de l''audio et des polices","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, zugängliche ARIA-Labels in Echtzeit mithilfe von Geminis multimodalem Reasoning zu injizieren, während sie gleichzeitig Remotions Fähigkeiten mit Three.js und React Three Fiber für 3D-Inhalte und -Animationen nutzen und verschiedene Assets wie Bilder, Videos, Audio und Schriftarten importieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a injetar rótulos ARIA acessíveis em tempo real usando o raciocínio multimodal da Gemini, aproveitando as capacidades do Remotion com Three.js e React Three Fiber para conteúdo e animações 3D, e importando vários ativos, como imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью внедрять доступные метки ARIA в режиме реального времени с использованием многомодального рассуждения Gemini, используя возможности Remotion с Three.js и React Three Fiber для 3D-контента и анимаций, а также импортируя различные активы, такие как изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من حقن علامات ARIA القابلة للوصول في الوقت الفعلي باستخدام المنطق المتعدد الوضعيات لجيميني، واستخدام قدرات ريموشن مع Three.js و React Three Fiber للمحتوى والرسوم المتحركة ثلاثية الأبعاد، واستيراد مختلفة الأصول مثل الصور وال비ديوهات والصوت والخطوط"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating accessibility audits for Remotion projects","Generating optimized 3D animations using Three.js and React Three Fiber","Debugging Remotion code for compatibility with assistive technologies"],"zh":["为Remotion项目自动执行无障碍审计","使用Three.js和React Three Fiber生成优化的3D动画","调试Remotion代码以与辅助技术兼容"],"ja":["Remotionプロジェクトのアクセシビリティ監査を自動化する","Three.jsとReact Three Fiberを使用して最適化された3Dアニメーションを生成する","Remotionコードをアシスタントテクノロジーと互換性のあるようにデバッグする"],"ko":["Remotion 프로젝트의 접근성 감사를 자동화하는 것","Three.js 및 React Three Fiber를 사용하여 최적화된 3D 애니메이션을 생성하는 것","Remotion 코드를 보조 기술과 호환되는ように 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar auditorías de accesibilidad para proyectos Remotion","Generar animaciones 3D optimizadas utilizando Three.js y React Three Fiber","Depurar código Remotion para la compatibilidad con tecnologías asistivas"],"fr":["Automatiser les audits d''accessibilité pour les projets Remotion","Générer des animations 3D optimisées à l''aide de Three.js et React Three Fiber","Déboguer le code Remotion pour la compatibilité avec les technologies d''assistance"],"de":["Automatisieren von Zugänglichkeitsaudits für Remotion-Projekte","Erzeugen optimierter 3D-Animationen mit Three.js und React Three Fiber","Debuggen von Remotion-Code für die Kompatibilität mit Assistenztechnologien"],"pt":["Automatizar auditorias de acessibilidade para projetos Remotion","Gerar animações 3D otimizadas usando Three.js e React Three Fiber","Depurar código Remotion para compatibilidade com tecnologias assistivas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать аудиты доступности для проектов Remotion","Генерировать оптимизированные 3D-анимации с использованием Three.js и React Three Fiber","Отладить код Remotion для совместимости с вспомогательными технологиями"],"ar":["تأتمتة تدقيق سهولة الوصول لمشاريع ريموشن","جعل الرسوم المتحركة ثلاثية الأبعاد المثالية باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber","تصحيح أخطاء رمز ريموشن للتوافق مع التكنولوجيا المساعدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion codebase","Limited to Chrome extension WebIlluminator","Dependent on Gemini''s multimodal reasoning capabilities"],"zh":["需要Remotion代码库","仅限Chrome扩展WebIlluminator","依赖于Gemini的多模态推理能力"],"ja":["Remotionコードベースが必要","Chrome拡張機能WebIlluminatorに限定される","Geminiの多模態推論機能に依存する"],"ko":["Remotion 코드베이스가 필요합니다.","Chrome 확장 프로그램 WebIlluminator로 제한됩니다.","Gemini의 다중 모드 推論 기능에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere base de código Remotion","Limitado a la extensión de Chrome WebIlluminator","Dependiente de las capacidades de razonamiento multimodal de Gemini"],"fr":["Nécessite une base de code Remotion","Limité à l''extension Chrome WebIlluminator","Dépendant des capacités de raisonnement multimodal de Gemini"],"de":["Benötigt Remotion-Codebasis","Begrenzt auf die Chrome-Erweiterung WebIlluminator","Abhängig von Geminis multimodalen Reasoning-Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Exige base de código Remotion","Limitado à extensão do Chrome WebIlluminator","Dependente das capacidades de raciocínio multimodal da Gemini"],"ru":["Требует базы кода Remotion","Ограничен расширением Chrome WebIlluminator","Зависит от возможностей многомодального рассуждения Gemini"],"ar":["يتطلب قاعدة رمز ريموشن","محدود إلى ملحق Chrome WebIlluminator","يعتمد على قدرات المنطق المتعدد الوضعيات لجيميني"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
