a Remotion","Aprenda a trabalhar com áudio em Remotion","Domine as melhores práticas para Remotion"],"ru":["Создавайте 3D-контент с помощью Three.js и React Three Fiber","Разрабатывайте фундаментальные навыки анимации","Импортируйте изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты в Remotion","Узнайте, как работать с аудио в Remotion","Освойте лучшие практики для Remotion"],"ar":["أنشئ محتوى 3D باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber","طور مهارات الرسوم المتحركة الأساسية","استورد الصور والفيديوهات والصوت والخطوط إلى ريموشن","تعلم كيفية العمل مع الصوت في ريموشن","تسيد أفضل الممارسات لريموشن"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Remotion","最佳实践","代码质量","开发效率","3D内容","动画技能"],"ja":["Remotion","ベストプラクティス","コード品質","開発効率","3Dコンテンツ","アニメーションスキル"],"ko":["Remotion","최상의 실践","코드 품질","개발 효율","3D 콘텐츠","애니메이션 스킬"],"es":["Remotion","mejores prácticas","desarrollo de video","contenido personalizado","Three.js","React Three Fiber","animación","importación de activos"],"fr":["Remotion","bonnes pratiques","développement de vidéo","contenu personnalisé","Three.js","React Three Fiber","animation","importation de ressources"],"de":["Remotion","Best Practices","Videoentwicklung","personalisierter Inhalt","Three.js","React Three Fiber","Animation","Importieren von Ressourcen"],"pt":["Remotion","melhores práticas","3D","animações","importação de ativos","vídeo personalizado","desenvolvimento web","JavaScript","Three.js","React Three Fiber"],"ru":["Remotion","лучшие практики","3D","анимации","импорт активов","индивидуальное видео","веб-разработка","JavaScript","Three.js","React Three Fiber"],"ar":["ريموشن","أفضل الممارسات","3D","الرسوم المتحركة","استيراد الأصول","فيديو مخصص","تطوير الويب","جافاسكريبت","Three.js","React Three Fiber"]}},"owner":"jay6697117","repo":"remotion-demo","repoPath":"jay6697117/remotion-demo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:57:32.473Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Video Generation Agents needing advanced Remotion capabilities and domain-specific knowledge.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Remotion功能和特定领域知识的视频生成代理。","ja":"高度なRemotion機能とドメイン固有の知識を必要とするビデオ生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Remotion 기능과 특정 도메인 지식을 필요로 하는 비디오 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Generación de Video que necesitan capacidades de Remotion avanzadas y conocimientos específicos de dominio.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Génération de Vidéo ayant besoin de capacités de Remotion avancées et de connaissances spécifiques de domaine.","de":"Perfekt für Video-Generierungsagenten, die erweiterte Remotion-Fähigkeiten und domänen-spezifisches Wissen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Vídeo que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de Remotion e conhecimento específico de domínio.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации видео, которым необходимы расширенные возможности Remotion и домен-специфические знания.","ar":"مثالي لعميل生成 الفيديو الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة من Remotion ومعرفة محددة بالمجال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create complex 3D content using Three.js and React Three Fiber, while mastering fundamental animation skills and efficiently importing various assets such as images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion projects.","zh":"赋予代理创建使用Three.js和React Three Fiber的复杂3D内容的能力，同时掌握基本的动画技能，并高效地将图像、视频、音频和字体等各种资产导入Remotion项目。","ja":"Three.jsとReact Three Fiberを使用した複雑な3Dコンテンツの作成能力をエージェントに与え、基本的なアニメーションスキルをマスターし、画像、ビデオ、オーディオ、フォントなどのさまざまなアセットをRemotionプロジェクトに効率的にインポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 Three.js와 React Three Fiber를 사용하여 복잡한 3D 컨텐츠를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, 기본적인 애니메이션 스킬을 마스터하며, 이미지, 비디오, 오디오, 글꼴 등 다양한 자산을 Remotion 프로젝트에 효율적으로 가져옵니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear contenido 3D complejo utilizando Three.js y React Three Fiber, mientras dominan habilidades de animación fundamentales e importan de forma eficiente varios activos como imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes en proyectos de Remotion.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer du contenu 3D complexe en utilisant Three.js et React Three Fiber, tout en maîtrisant les compétences d''animation fondamentales et en important efficacement divers actifs tels que des images, des vidéos, de l''audio et des polices dans les projets Remotion.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, komplexen 3D-Inhalt mit Three.js und React Three Fiber zu erstellen, während sie grundlegende Animationsfähigkeiten beherrschen und verschiedene Assets wie Bilder, Videos, Audio und Schriftarten in Remotion-Projekte effizient importieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar conteúdo 3D complexo usando Three.js e React Three Fiber, dominando habilidades de animação fundamentais e importando eficientemente vários ativos, como imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes para projetos Remotion.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать сложный 3D-контент с использованием Three.js и React Three Fiber, осваивая фундаментальные навыки анимации и эффективно импортируя различные активы, такие как изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты в проекты Remotion.","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من إنشاء محتوى 3D معقد باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber، وتطوير مهارات الرسوم المتحركة الأساسية واستيراد الموارد المختلفة بكفاءة، مثل الصور والفيديوهات والصوت والخطوط في مشاريع Remotion."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D animations for explainer videos","Optimizing video asset imports for faster rendering","Debugging Remotion projects for better performance"],"zh":["为解释视频生成3D动画","优化视频资产导入以实现更快的渲染","调试Remotion项目以获得更好的性能"],"ja":["解説動画用の3Dアニメーション生成","ビデオアセットのインポートを最適化してレンダリングを高速化","Remotionプロジェクトをデバッグしてパフォーマンスを向上させる"],"ko":["설명 비디오를 위한 3D 애니메이션 생성","비디오 자산 가져오기를 최적화하여 렌더링을 더 빠르게 함","Remotion 프로젝트를 디버깅하여 성능 개선"],"es":["Generar animaciones 3D para videos explicativos","Optimizar las importaciones de activos de video para un renderizado más rápido","Depurar proyectos de Remotion para un mejor rendimiento"],"fr":["Générer des animations 3D pour des vidéos explicatives","Optimiser les importations d''actifs vidéo pour un rendu plus rapide","Déboguer les projets Remotion pour de meilleures performances"],"de":["Erstellen von 3D-Animationen für Erklärvideos","Optimieren von Video-Asset-Importen für ein schnelleres Rendern","Debuggen von Remotion-Projekten für bessere Leistung"],"pt":["Geração de animações 3D para vídeos explicativos","Otimização da importação de ativos de vídeo para renderização mais rápida","Depuração de projetos Remotion para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["Генерация 3D-анимаций для видеороликов","Оптимизация импорта видеоактивов для более быстрого рендеринга","Отладка проектов Remotion для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["إنشاء رسوم متحركة 3D لأفلام الفيديو التوضيحية","تحسين استيراد موارد الفيديو لتقديم تقديم أسرع","تصحيح مشاريع Remotion لتحسين الأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion codebase access","Familiarity with Three.js and React Three Fiber recommended"],"zh":["需要Remotion代码库访问权限","推荐熟悉Three.js和React Three Fiber"],"ja":["Remotionコードベースへのアクセスが必要","Three.jsとReact Three Fiberの知識が推奨される"],"ko":["Remotion 코드베이스에 대한 접근 권한 필요","Three.js 및 React Three Fiber에 대한 지식이 권장됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código de Remotion","Se recomienda familiaridad con Three.js y React Three Fiber"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code Remotion","Familiarité avec Three.js et React Three Fiber recommandée"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Remotion-Codebasis","Vertrautheit mit Three.js und React Three Fiber wird empfohlen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao código base Remotion","Recomenda-se familiaridade com Three.js e React Three Fiber"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к кодовой базе Remotion","Рекомендуется знакомство с Three.js и React Three Fiber"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الكود Remotion","ينصح بالاطلاع على Three.js و React Three Fiber"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
