ommunity","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:57:36.177Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents leveraging Remotion for video production and animation, particularly those utilizing Three.js and React Three Fiber for 3D content.","zh":"适用于利用Remotion进行视频制作和动画的前端代理，特别是那些使用Three.js和React Three Fiber进行3D内容的代理。","ja":"Remotionを使用したビデオ制作およびアニメーションに最適化されたフロントエンドエージェント、特にThree.jsおよびReact Three Fiberを使用した3Dコンテンツを利用するエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Remotion을 사용한 비디오 제작 및 애니메이션을 위한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 특히 Three.js 및 React Three Fiber를 사용한 3D 콘텐츠를 활용하는 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend que utilizan Remotion para la producción y animación de video, particularmente aquellos que utilizan Three.js y React Three Fiber para contenido 3D.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de frontend utilisant Remotion pour la production et l''animation de vidéos, en particulier ceux utilisant Three.js et React Three Fiber pour le contenu 3D.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die Remotion für die Videoproduktion und -animation nutzen, insbesondere solche, die Three.js und React Three Fiber für 3D-Inhalte verwenden.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que utilizam Remotion para produção de vídeo e animação, particularmente aqueles que utilizam Three.js e React Three Fiber para conteúdo 3D.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, использующих Remotion для производства видео и анимации, особенно тех, кто использует Three.js и React Three Fiber для контента 3D.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يستخدمون Remotion لإنتاج الفيديو والرسوم المتحركة، خاصة أولئك الذين يستخدمون Three.js و React Three Fiber للمحتوى ثلاثي الأبعاد."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create high-quality video content by following best practices for 3D rendering, animations, and asset management in Remotion, utilizing libraries like Three.js and React Three Fiber, and handling various file formats such as images, videos, and fonts.","zh":"使代理能够通过遵循Remotion中3D渲染、动画和资产管理的最佳实践，利用像Three.js和React Three Fiber这样的库，并处理诸如图像、视频和字体等各种文件格式来创建高质量的视频内容。","ja":"エージェントがRemotionにおける3Dレンダリング、動画、資産管理のベストプラクティスに従い、Three.jsやReact Three Fiberなどのライブラリを利用し、画像、動画、フォントなどの様々なファイル形式を処理することで、高品質のビデオコンテンツを作成できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 Remotion에서 3D 렌더링, 애니메이션, 자산 관리의 최선의 관행을 따르고, Three.js 및 React Three Fiber와 같은 라이브러리를 활용하며, 이미지, 비디오, 글꼴 등의 다양한 파일 형식을 처리함으로써 고품질의 비디오 콘텐츠를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear contenido de video de alta calidad siguiendo las mejores prácticas para la representación 3D, las animaciones y la gestión de activos en Remotion, utilizando bibliotecas como Three.js y React Three Fiber, y manejando varios formatos de archivo como imágenes, videos y fuentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer du contenu vidéo de haute qualité en suivant les meilleures pratiques pour le rendu 3D, les animations et la gestion des actifs dans Remotion, en utilisant des bibliothèques comme Three.js et React Three Fiber, et en gérant différents formats de fichiers tels que des images, des vidéos et des polices.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten zur Erstellung von hochwertigem Video-Inhalt durch Befolgen der bewährten Verfahren für die 3D-Darstellung, Animationen und Vermögensverwaltung in Remotion, unter Nutzung von Bibliotheken wie Three.js und React Three Fiber sowie der Handhabung verschiedener Dateiformate wie Bilder, Videos und Schriftarten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar conteúdo de vídeo de alta qualidade seguindo as melhores práticas para renderização 3D, animações e gerenciamento de ativos em Remotion, utilizando bibliotecas como Three.js e React Three Fiber, e lidando com vários formatos de arquivo, como imagens, vídeos e fontes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать контент видео высокого качества, следуя лучшим практикам для рендеринга 3D, анимаций и управления активами в Remotion, используя библиотеки seperti Three.js и React Three Fiber, и обрабатывая различные форматы файлов, такие как изображения, видео и шрифты.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء محتوى فيديو عالي الجودة باتباع أفضل الممارسات لتصيير 3D والرسوم المتحركة وإدارة الأصول في Remotion، باستخدام مكتبات مثل Three.js و React Three Fiber، ومعالجة تنسيقات الملفات المختلفة مثل الصور والفيديوهات والخطوط."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D animations with Remotion and Three.js","Optimizing video asset imports for better performance","Creating engaging video content with fundamental animation skills"],"zh":["使用Remotion和Three.js生成3D动画","优化视频资产导入以提高性能","使用基本动画技能创建吸引人的视频内容"],"ja":["RemotionとThree.jsを使用した3Dアニメーションの生成","ビデオアセットのインポートを最適化してパフォーマンスを向上させる","基本的なアニメーションスキルを使用して魅力的なビデオコンテンツを作成する"],"ko":["Remotion과 Three.js를 사용한 3D 애니메이션 생성","비디오 자산 가져오기를 최적화하여 성능을 개선하는 것","기본적인 애니메이션 스킬을 사용하여 매력적인 비디오 콘텐츠를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Generar animaciones 3D con Remotion y Three.js","Optimizar las importaciones de activos de video para un mejor rendimiento","Crear contenido de video atractivo con habilidades de animación fundamentales"],"fr":["Générer des animations 3D avec Remotion et Three.js","Optimiser les imports d''actifs vidéo pour de meilleures performances","Créer du contenu vidéo engageant avec des compétences d''animation de base"],"de":["Erzeugen von 3D-Animationen mit Remotion und Three.js","Optimieren von Video-Asset-Importen für bessere Leistung","Erstellen von ansprechendem Video-Inhalt mit grundlegenden Animationsfähigkeiten"],"pt":["Geração de animações 3D com Remotion e Three.js","Otimização de imports de ativos de vídeo para melhor desempenho","Criação de conteúdo de vídeo atraente com habilidades de animação fundamentais"],"ru":["Генерация 3D-анимаций с помощью Remotion и Three.js","Оптимизация импорта видео-активов для лучшей производительности","Создание привлекательного видео-контента с помощью базовых навыков анимации"],"ar":["إنشاء الرسوم المتحركة ثلاثية الأبعاد باستخدام Remotion و Three.js","تحسين استيراد أصول الفيديو لتحقيق أداء أفضل","إنشاء محتوى فيديو جذاب باستخدام مهارات الرسوم المتحركة الأساسية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion codebase access","Specific to Remotion video production ecosystem"],"zh":["需要Remotion代码库访问","特定于Remotion视频生产生态系统"],"ja":["Remotionコードベースへのアクセスが必要","Remotionビデオ制作エコシステムに特有"],"ko":["Remotion 코드베이스 액세스가 필요","Remotion 비디오 제작 에코시스템에 특정"],"es":["Requiere acceso al código base de Remotion","Específico del ecosistema de producción de video Remotion"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès au code base de Remotion","Spécifique à l''écosystème de production de vidéos Remotion"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Remotion-Codebase","Spezifisch für das Remotion-Video-Produktions-Ökosystem"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao código base do Remotion","Específico para o ecossistema de produção de vídeo Remotion"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовой базе Remotion","Специфичен для экосистемы производства видео Remotion"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة التعليمات البرمجية ل Remotion","محدد لبيئة إنتاج الفيديو في Remotion"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('g1331/AutoRouter/openspec-continue-change', 'community', 'g1331', 'AutoRouter', 'g1331/AutoRouter', 'openspec-continue-change', 0, 0, 50, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z', '2026-02-18T03:57:58.114Z', NULL, '{"id":"g1331/AutoRouter/openspec-continue-change","name":"openspec-continue-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-continue-change 是一个极简的多上游 AI API 代理，用于继续更改工作。它可以创建下一个工件，并支持从对话上下文中推断更改名称","ja":"openspec-continue-change はシンプルなマルチアップストリーム AI API エージェントです。次のアーティファクトを作成し、変更名を会話のコンテキストから推測することができます","ko":"openspec-continue-change는 간단한 멀티 업스트림 AI API 에이전트로, 다음 아티팩트를 생성하고 대화의 contexto에서 변경 이름을 추론할 수 있습니다","es":"openspec-continue-change es una herramienta de API minimalista que permite a los desarrolladores continuar trabajando en cambios. Permite la selección de cambios y la creación de artefactos.","fr":"openspec-continue-change est un outil d''API minimaliste qui permet aux développeurs de continuer à travailler sur des modifications. Il permet la sélection de modifications et la création d''artefacts.","de":"openspec-continue-change ist ein minimalistisches API-Tool, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, Änderungen fortzusetzen. Es ermöglicht die Auswahl von Änderungen und die Erstellung von Artefakten.","pt":"O Openspec Continue Change é um proxy de API AI minimalista que permite continuar trabalhando em alterações criando o próximo artefato","ru":"Openspec Continue Change — минималистичный прокси API AI, который позволяет продолжать работу над изменениями, создавая следующий артефакт","ar":"Openspec Continue Change هو وسيط API AI البسيط الذي يسمح بمواصلة العمل على التعديلات من خلال إنشاء الملف التالي","en":"一个极简的多上游 AI API 代理。"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-continue-change API 代理","ja":"openspec-continue-change API エージェント","ko":"openspec-continue-change API 에이전트","es":"Continúa cambios con openspec-continue-change","fr":"Continuez les modifications avec openspec-continue-change","de":"Änderungen fortsetzen mit openspec-continue-change","pt":"Openspec Continue Change: Proxy de API AI Minimalista","ru":"Openspec Continue Change: Минималистичный прокси API AI","ar":"Openspec Continue Change: وسيط API AI البسيط","en":"openspec-continue-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-continue-change 是一个极简的多上游 AI API 代理，用于继续更改工作。它可以创建下一个工件，并支持从对话上下文中推断更改名称","ja":"openspec-continue-change はシンプルなマルチアップストリーム AI API エージェントです。次のアーティファクトを作成し、変更名を会話のコンテキストから推測することができます","ko":"openspec-continue-change는 간단한 멀티 업스트림 AI API 에이전트로, 다음 아티팩트를 생성하고 대화의 contexto에서 변경 이름을 추론할 수 있습니다","es":"openspec-continue-change es una herramienta de API minimalista que permite a los desarrolladores continuar trabajando en cambios. Permite la selección de cam...","fr":"openspec-continue-change est un outil d''API minimaliste qui permet aux développeurs de continuer à travailler sur des modifications. Il permet la sélection d...","de":"openspec-continue-change ist ein minimalistisches API-Tool, das es Entwicklern ermöglicht, Änderungen fortzusetzen. Es ermöglicht die Auswahl von Änderungen ...","pt":"O Openspec Continue Change é um proxy de API AI minimalista que permite continuar trabalhando em alterações criando o próximo artefato","ru":"Openspec Continue Change — минималистичный прокси API AI, который позволяет продолжать работу над изменениями, создавая следующий артефакт","ar":"Openspec Continue Change هو وسيط API AI البسيط الذي يسمح بمواصلة العمل على التعديلات من خلال إنشاء الملف التالي","en":"一个极简的多上游 AI API 代理。"},"definition":{"en":"一个极简的多上游 AI API 代理。"},"features":{"zh":["支持从对话上下文中推断更改名称","可以创建下一个工件","支持多上游 AI API","使用 AskUserQuestion 工具让用户选择更改","运行 openspec list --json 获取可用更改","支持对话式交互"],"ja":["会話のコンテキストから変更名を推測することができます","次のアーティファクトを作成することができます","マルチアップストリーム AI API をサポート","AskUserQuestion ツールを使用してユーザーに変更を選択させる","openspec list --json を実行して利用可能な変更を取得","会話式のインタラクションをサポート"],"ko":["대화의 contexto에서 변경 이름을 추론할 수 있습니다","다음 아티팩트를 생성할 수 있습니다","멀티 업스트림 AI API를 지원","AskUserQuestion 툴을 사용하여 사용자에게 변경을 선택하도록 함","openspec list --json을 실행하여 사용 가능한 변경을 가져옴","대화식 상호 작용을 지원"],"es":["Selección de cambios","Creación de artefactos","Integración con openspec list","Uso de la herramienta AskUserQuestion","Compatibilidad con conversaciones"],"fr":["Sélection de modifications","Création d''artefacts","Intégration avec openspec list","Utilisation de l''outil AskUserQuestion","Compatibilité avec les conversations"],"de":["Auswahl von Änderungen","Erstellung von Artefakten","Integration mit openspec list","Verwendung des Tools AskUserQuestion","Kompatibilität mit Konversationen"],"pt":["Proxy de API AI minimalista","Permite continuar trabalhando em alterações","Criação do próximo artefato","Suporte à seleção de alterações","Integração com a ferramenta AskUserQuestion"],"ru":["Минималистичный прокси API AI","Позволяет продолжать работу над изменениями","Создание следующего артефакта","Поддержка выбора изменений","Интеграция с инструментом AskUserQuestion"],"ar":["وسيط API AI البسيط","يمكّن الاستمرار في العمل على التعديلات","إنشاء الملف التالي","دعم اختيار التعديلات","التكامل مع أداة AskUserQuestion"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI API 代理","多上游 AI API","继续更改工作","会话式交互","AskUserQuestion","openspec list","工件创建","改变名称推断"],"ja":["AI API エージェント","マルチアップストリーム AI API","変更作業の継続","会話式インタラクション","AskUserQuestion","openspec list","アーティファクトの作成","変更名の推測"],"ko":["AI API 에이전트","멀티 업스트림 AI API","변경 작업의 연속","대화식 상호 작용","AskUserQuestion","openspec list","아티팩트의 생성","변경 이름의 추론"],"es":["openspec-continue-change","API minimalista","desarrollo de software","gestión de cambios","creación de artefactos","integración con openspec list","herramienta AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["openspec-continue-change","API minimaliste","développement de logiciels","gestion de modifications","création d''artefacts","intégration avec openspec list","outil AskUserQuestion"],"de":["openspec-continue-change","minimalistisches API","Softwareentwicklung","Änderungsmanagement","Erstellung von Artefakten","Integration mit openspec list","Tool AskUserQuestion"],"pt":["Openspec Continue Change","Proxy de API AI","Desenvolvimento de software","Alterações de projeto","Ferramenta AskUserQuestion","API AI minimalista"],"ru":["Openspec Continue Change","Минималистичный прокси API AI","Разработка программного обеспечения","Изменения проекта","Инструмент AskUserQuestion","API AI минималистичный"],"ar":["Openspec Continue Change","وسيط API AI البسيط","تطوير البرمجيات","تعديلات المشروع","أداة AskUserQuestion","API AI البسيط"]}},"owner":"g1331","repo":"AutoRouter","repoPath":"g1331/AutoRouter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-continue-change","description":"Continue working on an OpenSpec change by creating the next artifact. Use when the user wants to progress their change, create the next artifact, or continue their workflow.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-","body":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-4 most recently modified changes as options, showing:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema (from `schema` field if present, otherwise \"spec-driven\")\n   - Status (e.g., \"0/5 tasks\", \"complete\", \"no tasks\")\n   - How recently it was modified (from `lastModified` field)\n\n   Mark the most recently modified change as \"(Recommended)\" since it''s likely what the user wants to continue.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check current status**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand current state. The response includes:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow schema being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - `artifacts`: Array of artifacts with their status (\"done\", \"ready\", \"blocked\")\n   - `isComplete`: Boolean indicating if all artifacts are complete\n\n3. **Act based on status**:\n\n   ***\n\n   **If all artifacts are complete (`isComplete: true`)**:\n   - Congratulate the user\n   - Show final status including the schema used\n   - Suggest: \"All artifacts created! You can now implement this change or archive it.\"\n   - STOP\n\n   ***\n\n   **If artifacts are ready to create** (status shows artifacts with `status: \"ready\"`):\n   - Pick the FIRST artifact with `status: \"ready\"` from the status output\n   - Get its instructions:\n     ```bash\n     openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n     ```\n   - Parse the JSON. The key fields are:\n     - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n     - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance\n     - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n     - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n   - **Create the artifact file**:\n     - Read any completed dependency files for context\n     - Use `template` as the structure - fill in its sections\n     - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints when writing - but do NOT copy them into the file\n     - Write to the output path specified in instructions\n   - Show what was created and what''s now unlocked\n   - STOP after creating ONE artifact\n\n   ***\n\n   **If no artifacts are ready (all blocked)**:\n   - This shouldn''t happen with a valid schema\n   - Show status and suggest checking for issues\n\n4. **After creating an artifact, show progress**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter each invocation, show:\n\n- Which artifact was created\n- Schema workflow being used\n- Current progress (N/M complete)\n- What artifacts are now unlocked\n- Prompt: \"Want to continue? Just ask me to continue or tell me what to do next.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\nThe artifact types and their purpose depend on the schema. Use the `instruction` field from the instructions output to understand what to create.\n\nCommon artifact patterns:\n\n**spec-driven schema** (proposal → specs → design → tasks):\n\n- **proposal.md**: Ask user about the change if not clear. Fill in Why, What Changes, Capabilities, Impact.\n  - The Capabilities section is critical - each capability listed will need a spec file.\n- **specs/<capability>/spec.md**: Create one spec per capability listed in the proposal''s Capabilities section (use the capability name, not the change name).\n- **design.md**: Document technical decisions, architecture, and implementation approach.\n- **tasks.md**: Break down implementation into checkboxed tasks.\n\nFor other schemas, follow the `instruction` field from the CLI output.\n\n**Guardrails**\n\n- Create ONE artifact per invocation\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- Never skip artifacts or create out of order\n- If context is unclear, ask the user before creating\n- Verify the artifact file exists after writing before marking progress\n- Use the schema''s artifact sequence, don''t assume specific artifact names\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:57:58.114Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring seamless integration with openspec for continuous change management.","zh":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring seamless integration with openspec for continuous change management.","ja":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring seamless integration with openspec for continuous change management.","ko":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring seamless integration with openspec for continuous change management.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una integración perfecta con openspec para la gestión continua de cambios.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une intégration transparente avec openspec pour la gestion continue des modifications.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsschritte, die eine nahtlose Integration mit openspec für das kontinuierliche Änderungsmanagement erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que requerem integração sem interrupções com openspec para gerenciamento de alterações contínuas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих бесшовной интеграции с openspec для непрерывного управления изменениями.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التطوير التي تتطلب التكامل السلس مع openspec لإدارة التغييرات المستمرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create the next artifact in a change by running `openspec list --json` and utilizing the AskUserQuestion tool for user selection, leveraging JSON data and command-line interfaces for efficient workflow management.","zh":"Empowers agents to create the next artifact in a change by running `openspec list --json` and utilizing the AskUserQuestion tool for user selection, leveraging JSON data and command-line interfaces for efficient workflow management.","ja":"Empowers agents to create the next artifact in a change by running `openspec list --json` and utilizing the AskUserQuestion tool for user selection, leveraging JSON data and command-line interfaces for efficient workflow management.","ko":"Empowers agents to create the next artifact in a change by running `openspec list --json` and utilizing the AskUserQuestion tool for user selection, leveraging JSON data and command-line interfaces for efficient workflow management.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear el próximo artefacto en un cambio ejecutando `openspec list --json` y utilizando la herramienta AskUserQuestion para la selección del usuario, aprovechando los datos JSON y las interfaces de línea de comandos para una gestión de flujo de trabajo eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer le prochain artefact dans un changement en exécutant `openspec list --json` et en utilisant l''outil AskUserQuestion pour la sélection de l''utilisateur, en exploitant les données JSON et les interfaces de ligne de commande pour une gestion de flux de travail efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, das nächste Artefakt in einer Änderung durch Ausführen von `openspec list --json` und Nutzung des Tools AskUserQuestion für die Benutzerauswahl zu erstellen, wobei JSON-Daten und Kommandozeilen-Schnittstellen für eine effiziente Workflow-Verwaltung genutzt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem o próximo artefato em uma alteração executando `openspec list --json` e utilizando a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para seleção de usuário, aproveitando dados JSON e interfaces de linha de comando para gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать следующий артефакт в изменении, выполняя `openspec list --json` и используя инструмент AskUserQuestion для выбора пользователя, используя данные JSON и командные интерфейсы для эффективного управления рабочим процессом.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء الملف القادم في التغيير من خلال تشغيل `openspec list --json` واستخدام أداة AskUserQuestion لاختيار المستخدم، واستخدام بيانات JSON وواجهات سطر الأوامر لإدارة تدفق العمل بالكفاءة."},"useCases":{"en":["Continuing work on a recently modified change","Prompting users to select from available changes","Automating the process of creating the next artifact in a change"],"zh":["Continuing work on a recently modified change","Prompting users to select from available changes","Automating the process of creating the next artifact in a change"],"ja":["Continuing work on a recently modified change","Prompting users to select from available changes","Automating the process of creating the next artifact in a change"],"ko":["Continuing work on a recently modified change","Prompting users to select from available changes","Automating the process of creating the next artifact in a change"],"es":["Continuar el trabajo en un cambio recientemente modificado","Solicitar a los usuarios que seleccionen entre los cambios disponibles","Automatizar el proceso de creación del próximo artefacto en un cambio"],"fr":["Poursuivre le travail sur un changement récemment modifié","Inciter les utilisateurs à sélectionner parmi les changements disponibles","Automatiser le processus de création du prochain artefact dans un changement"],"de":["Weiterarbeit an einem kürzlich geänderten Änderung","Benutzer auffordern, aus den verfügbaren Änderungen auszuwählen","Automatisieren des Prozesses zur Erstellung des nächsten Artefakts in einer Änderung"],"pt":["Continuar o trabalho em uma alteração recentemente modificada","Solicitar que os usuários selecione entre as alterações disponíveis","Automatizar o processo de criar o próximo artefato em uma alteração"],"ru":["Продолжить работу над недавно измененной изменением","Предложить пользователям выбрать из доступных изменений","Автоматизировать процесс создания следующего артефакта в изменении"],"ar":["استمرار العمل على تغيير تم تعديله مؤخرًا","تحفيز المستخدمين على اختيار التغييرات المتاحة","تأتمتة عملية إنشاء الملف التالي في التغيير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec installation and configuration","Depends on conversation context for change name inference","Limited to top 3 changes for user selection"],"zh":["Requires openspec installation and configuration","Depends on conversation context for change name inference","Limited to top 3 changes for user selection"],"ja":["Requires openspec installation and configuration","Depends on conversation context for change name inference","Limited to top 3 changes for user selection"],"ko":["Requires openspec installation and configuration","Depends on conversation context for change name inference","Limited to top 3 changes for user selection"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de openspec","Depende del contexto de conversación para la inferencia del nombre de cambio","Limitado a los 3 primeros cambios para la selección del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration d''openspec","Dépend du contexte de conversation pour l''inférence du nom de changement","Limité aux 3 premiers changements pour la sélection de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation und Konfiguration von openspec","Hängt vom Gesprächskontext für die Ableitung des Änderungsnamens ab","Begrenzt auf die ersten 3 Änderungen für die Benutzerauswahl"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do openspec","Depende do contexto da conversa para inferência do nome da alteração","Limitado aos 3 principais alterações para seleção do usuário"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации openspec","Зависит от контекста разговора для вывода имени изменения","Ограничен первыми 3 изменениями для выбора пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين openspec","يعتمد على سياق المحادثة لاستنتاج اسم التغيير","محدود بالتغييرات الثلاث الأولى لاختيار المستخدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
