المتاحة","قائمة التغييرات المتاحة بالترتيب الزمني للموضوع","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion لاختيار التغييرات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-continue-change","AI技能","继续工作中的更改","创建下一个工件","开发效率","会话上下文","更改名称"],"ja":["openspec-continue-change","AIスキル","作業中の変更を続行","次のアーティファクトを作成","開発効率","会話のコンテキスト","変更名"],"ko":["openspec-continue-change","AI스킬","작업 중인 변경을 계속","다음 아티팩트를 생성","개발 효율성","会话 contexto","변경 이름"],"es":["openspec-continue-change","desarrollo de software","gestión de cambios","eficiencia en el desarrollo","herramientas de desarrollo","AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["openspec-continue-change","développement de logiciels","gestion de modifications","efficacité dans le développement","outils de développement","AskUserQuestion"],"de":["openspec-continue-change","Software-Entwicklung","Änderungsmanagement","Effizienz im Entwicklungsprozess","Entwicklungstools","AskUserQuestion"],"pt":["openspec-continue-change","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","alterações de código","trabalho em equipe","colaboração de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["openspec-continue-change","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","изменения кода","командная работа","сотрудничество в разработке"],"ar":["openspec-continue-change","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","تغييرات الكود","العمل الجماعي","التعاون في التطوير"]}},"owner":"ruan-cat","repo":"11comm","repoPath":"ruan-cat/11comm","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-continue-change","description":"Continue working on an OpenSpec change by creating the next artifact. Use when the user wants to progress their change, create the next artifact, or continue their workflow.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-","body":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-4 most recently modified changes as options, showing:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema (from `schema` field if present, otherwise \"spec-driven\")\n   - Status (e.g., \"0/5 tasks\", \"complete\", \"no tasks\")\n   - How recently it was modified (from `lastModified` field)\n\n   Mark the most recently modified change as \"(Recommended)\" since it''s likely what the user wants to continue.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check current status**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand current state. The response includes:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow schema being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - `artifacts`: Array of artifacts with their status (\"done\", \"ready\", \"blocked\")\n   - `isComplete`: Boolean indicating if all artifacts are complete\n\n3. **Act based on status**:\n\n   ***\n\n   **If all artifacts are complete (`isComplete: true`)**:\n   - Congratulate the user\n   - Show final status including the schema used\n   - Suggest: \"All artifacts created! You can now implement this change or archive it.\"\n   - STOP\n\n   ***\n\n   **If artifacts are ready to create** (status shows artifacts with `status: \"ready\"`):\n   - Pick the FIRST artifact with `status: \"ready\"` from the status output\n   - Get its instructions:\n     ```bash\n     openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n     ```\n   - Parse the JSON. The key fields are:\n     - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n     - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance\n     - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n     - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n   - **Create the artifact file**:\n     - Read any completed dependency files for context\n     - Use `template` as the structure - fill in its sections\n     - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints when writing - but do NOT copy them into the file\n     - Write to the output path specified in instructions\n   - Show what was created and what''s now unlocked\n   - STOP after creating ONE artifact\n\n   ***\n\n   **If no artifacts are ready (all blocked)**:\n   - This shouldn''t happen with a valid schema\n   - Show status and suggest checking for issues\n\n4. **After creating an artifact, show progress**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter each invocation, show:\n\n- Which artifact was created\n- Schema workflow being used\n- Current progress (N/M complete)\n- What artifacts are now unlocked\n- Prompt: \"Want to continue? Just ask me to continue or tell me what to do next.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\nThe artifact types and their purpose depend on the schema. Use the `instruction` field from the instructions output to understand what to create.\n\nCommon artifact patterns:\n\n**spec-driven schema** (proposal → specs → design → tasks):\n\n- **proposal.md**: Ask user about the change if not clear. Fill in Why, What Changes, Capabilities, Impact.\n  - The Capabilities section is critical - each capability listed will need a spec file.\n- **specs/<capability>/spec.md**: Create one spec per capability listed in the proposal''s Capabilities section (use the capability name, not the change name).\n- **design.md**: Document technical decisions, architecture, and implementation approach.\n- **tasks.md**: Break down implementation into checkboxed tasks.\n\nFor other schemas, follow the `instruction` field from the CLI output.\n\n**Guardrails**\n\n- Create ONE artifact per invocation\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- Never skip artifacts or create out of order\n- If context is unclear, ask the user before creating\n- Verify the artifact file exists after writing before marking progress\n- Use the schema''s artifact sequence, don''t assume specific artifact names\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:57:57.073Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring version control and project management capabilities, particularly those utilizing the openspec framework.","zh":"适用于需要版本控制和项目管理功能的开发代理，特别是那些使用openspec框架的代理。","ja":"バージョン管理およびプロジェクト管理機能を必要とする開発エージェントに適しています。特に、openspecフレームワークを使用するエージェントに適しています。","ko":"버전 제어 및 프로젝트 관리 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합하며, 특히 openspec 프레임워크를 사용하는 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren control de versiones y capacidades de gestión de proyectos, particularmente aquellos que utilizan el marco de trabajo openspec.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant un contrôle de version et des capacités de gestion de projet, en particulier ceux qui utilisent le cadre openspec.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die Versionierung und Projektmanagementfunktionen erfordern, insbesondere solche, die das openspec-Framework verwenden.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que requerem controle de versão e capacidades de gerenciamento de projetos, particularmente aqueles que utilizam o framework openspec.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих контроля версий и возможностей управления проектами, особенно тех, кто использует фреймворк openspec.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب التحكم في الإصدار وإدارة المشروع، خاصة تلك التي تستخدم إطار العمل openspec."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to seamlessly continue working on changes by creating the next artifact, leveraging the openspec list command and AskUserQuestion tool to infer or select changes, and facilitating efficient project progression through JSON-formatted data.","zh":"使代理能够通过创建下一个工件、利用openspec列表命令和AskUserQuestion工具来推断或选择更改，并通过JSON格式的数据来实现高效的项目进展。","ja":"エージェントが次のアーティファクトを作成することで、openspecリストコマンドとAskUserQuestionツールを利用して変更を推測または選択し、JSON形式のデータを通じて効率的なプロジェクトの進捗を促進することができます。","ko":"에이전트가 다음 아티팩트를 생성함으로써, openspec 목록 명령 및 AskUserQuestion 도구를 사용하여 변경 사항을 추론하거나 선택하고, JSON 형식의 데이터를 통해 효율적인 프로젝트 진행을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes continuar trabajando en cambios de manera fluida creando el siguiente artefacto, aprovechando el comando de lista openspec y la herramienta AskUserQuestion para inferir o seleccionar cambios, y facilitando la progresión eficiente del proyecto a través de datos con formato JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents de continuer à travailler sur les modifications de manière fluide en créant le prochain artefact, en exploitant la commande de liste openspec et l''outil AskUserQuestion pour inférer ou sélectionner les modifications, et en facilitant la progression efficace du projet via des données au format JSON.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, nahtlos an Änderungen zu arbeiten, indem sie das nächste Artefakt erstellen, die openspec-Listenbefehle und das Tool AskUserQuestion nutzen, um Änderungen abzuleiten oder auszuwählen, und eine effiziente Projektfortschritt durch JSON-formatierte Daten zu erleichtern.","pt":"Permite que os agentes continuem trabalhando em alterações de forma contínua, criando o próximo artefato, utilizando o comando de lista openspec e a ferramenta AskUserQuestion para inferir ou selecionar alterações e facilitar o progresso eficiente do projeto por meio de dados no formato JSON.","ru":"Позволяет агентам беспрепятственно продолжать работать над изменениями, создавая следующий артефакт, используя команду списка openspec и инструмент AskUserQuestion для вывода или выбора изменений и облегчая эффективный прогресс проекта посредством данных в формате JSON.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء الاستمرار في العمل على التغييرات بشكل متواصل من خلال إنشاء الملف التالي، واستخدام أمر قائمة openspec وأداة AskUserQuestion لتخمن أو اختيار التغييرات، وتسهيل التقدم الفعال للمشروع من خلال البيانات المنسقة في JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Continuing stalled projects by selecting the most recently modified change","Automating the process of creating new artifacts in ongoing projects","Streamlining project management by interactively selecting changes to work on"],"zh":["通过选择最近修改的更改来继续停滞的项目","自动创建正在进行的项目中的新工件","通过交互式选择更改来简化项目管理"],"ja":["最近変更した変更を選択することで停滞したプロジェクトを続行する","進行中のプロジェクトで新しいアーティファクトを作成する自動化","変更をインタラクティブに選択することでプロジェクト管理を簡素化する"],"ko":["최근 수정한 변경 사항을 선택하여 중단된 프로젝트를 계속 진행하는 것","진행 중인 프로젝트에서 새로운 아티팩트를 자동 생성하는 것","변경 사항을 상호 작용하여 선택함으로써 프로젝트 관리를 간소화하는 것"],"es":["Continuar proyectos detenidos seleccionando el cambio más recientemente modificado","Automatizar el proceso de creación de nuevos artefactos en proyectos en curso","Optimizar la gestión de proyectos seleccionando interactivamente los cambios en los que se trabaja"],"fr":["Continuer les projets bloqués en sélectionnant le changement le plus récemment modifié","Automatiser le processus de création de nouveaux artefacts dans les projets en cours","Optimiser la gestion de projet en sélectionnant de manière interactive les changements sur lesquels travailler"],"de":["Fortsetzen von gestoppten Projekten, indem der zuletzt geänderte Change ausgewählt wird","Automatisieren des Prozesses zur Erstellung neuer Artefakte in laufenden Projekten","Optimieren des Projektmanagements, indem interaktiv die Änderungen ausgewählt werden, an denen gearbeitet wird"],"pt":["Continuar projetos paralisados, selecionando a alteração mais recentemente modificada","Automatizar o processo de criação de novos artefatos em projetos em andamento","Otimizar a gestão de projetos, interativamente selecionando alterações para trabalhar"],"ru":["Продолжить приостановленные проекты, выбрав наиболее недавно измененное изменение","Автоматизировать процесс создания новых артефактов в текущих проектах","Оптимизировать управление проектами, интерактивно выбирая изменения для работы"],"ar":["استكمال المشاريع المحجوزة، باختيار أحدث تغيير تم تعديله","تأتمة عملية إنشاء ملفات جديدة في المشاريع الجارية","تطوير إدارة المشاريع، باختيار التغييرات للعمل عليها بشكل تفاعلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires openspec framework installation and configuration","Needs access to conversation context or user input for change selection","Limited to openspec-compatible projects and workflows"],"zh":["需要openspec框架的安装和配置","需要会话上下文或用户输入来选择更改","仅限openspec兼容的项目和工作流"],"ja":["openspecフレームワークのインストールと設定が必要","変更の選択には会話のコンテキストまたはユーザー入力が必要","openspecと互換性のあるプロジェクトとワークフローに限定される"],"ko":["openspec 프레임워크의 설치 및 구성이 필요함","변경 사항을 선택하기 위해 대화 상호 작용 또는 사용자 입력이 필요함","openspec와 호환되는 프로젝트 및 워크플로에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración del marco de trabajo openspec","Necesita acceso al contexto de conversación o a la entrada del usuario para la selección de cambios","Limitado a proyectos y flujos de trabajo compatibles con openspec"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration du cadre openspec","A besoin d''un accès au contexte de conversation ou à l''entrée de l''utilisateur pour la sélection des modifications","Limité aux projets et flux de travail compatibles openspec"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation und Konfiguration des openspec-Frameworks","Benötigt Zugriff auf den Konversationskontext oder die Benutzereingabe für die Änderungsauswahl","Begrenzt auf openspec-kompatible Projekte und Arbeitsabläufe"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do framework openspec","Necessita acesso ao contexto de conversa ou entrada do usuário para seleção de alterações","Limitado a projetos e fluxos de trabalho compatíveis com openspec"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки фреймворка openspec","Требует доступа к контексту разговора или ввода пользователя для выбора изменений","Ограничен проектами и рабочими процессами, совместимыми с openspec"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين إطار العمل openspec","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى سياق المحادثة أو إدخال المستخدم لاختيار التغييرات","محدود للمشاريع والعمليات المتوافقة مع إطار العمل openspec"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('kunish/wheel/openspec-continue-change', 'community', 'kunish', 'wheel', 'kunish/wheel', 'openspec-continue-change', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z', '2026-02-18T03:57:51.814Z', NULL, '{"id":"kunish/wheel/openspec-continue-change","name":"openspec-continue-change","description":{"zh":"openspec-continue-change 技术允许开发者继续工作于变更，通过创建下一个文物来实现自动化工作流","ja":"openspec-continue-change 技術により、開発者は変更を続行し、自動化されたワークフローを作成できます","ko":"openspec-continue-change 기술을 통해 개발자는 변경 작업을 계속하고 자동화된 워크플로를 생성할 수 있습니다","es":"Openspec Continue Change permite a los desarrolladores continuar trabajando en un cambio creando el siguiente artefacto. Soporta la inferencia de nombres de cambios y la selección del usuario.","fr":"Openspec Continue Change permet aux développeurs de continuer à travailler sur un changement en créant le prochain artefact. Il prend en charge l''inférence des noms de changements et la sélection de l''utilisateur.","de":"Openspec Continue Change ermöglicht es Entwicklern, an einer Änderung weiterzuarbeiten, indem sie das nächste Artefakt erstellen. Es unterstützt die Inferenz von Änderungsnamen und die Benutzerauswahl.","pt":"O OpenSpec permite continuar trabalhando em uma mudança, criando o próximo artefato e gerenciando alterações de forma eficiente.","ru":"OpenSpec позволяет продолжить работу над изменением, создавая следующий артефакт и управляя изменениями эффективно.","ar":"يسمح OpenSpec بمواصلة العمل على تغيير، من خلال إنشاء الملف القادم وإدارة التغييرات بفعالية.","en":"Wheel. LLM API Gateway — Aggregate, Balance, Observe."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"openspec-continue-change 技术文档","ja":"openspec-continue-change デベロッパーガイド","ko":"openspec-continue-change 개발자 가이드","es":"Openspec Continue Change: Continúa trabajando en cambios","fr":"Openspec Continue Change: Continuez à travailler sur des ...","de":"Openspec Continue Change: Fortsetzen Sie die Arbeit an Än...","pt":"Continue Change com OpenSpec","ru":"Продолжить изменение с OpenSpec","ar":"استمرار التغيير مع OpenSpec","en":"openspec-continue-change"},"description":{"zh":"openspec-continue-change 技术允许开发者继续工作于变更，通过创建下一个文物来实现自动化工作流","ja":"openspec-continue-change 技術により、開発者は変更を続行し、自動化されたワークフローを作成できます","ko":"openspec-continue-change 기술을 통해 개발자는 변경 작업을 계속하고 자동화된 워크플로를 생성할 수 있습니다","es":"Openspec Continue Change permite a los desarrolladores continuar trabajando en un cambio creando el siguiente artefacto. Soporta la inferencia de nombres de ...","fr":"Openspec Continue Change permet aux développeurs de continuer à travailler sur un changement en créant le prochain artefact. Il prend en charge l''inférence d...","de":"Openspec Continue Change ermöglicht es Entwicklern, an einer Änderung weiterzuarbeiten, indem sie das nächste Artefakt erstellen. Es unterstützt die Inferenz...","pt":"O OpenSpec permite continuar trabalhando em uma mudança, criando o próximo artefato e gerenciando alterações de forma eficiente.","ru":"OpenSpec позволяет продолжить работу над изменением, создавая следующий артефакт и управляя изменениями эффективно.","ar":"يسمح OpenSpec بمواصلة العمل على تغيير، من خلال إنشاء الملف القادم وإدارة التغييرات بفعالية.","en":"Wheel. LLM API Gateway — Aggregate, Balance, Observe."},"definition":{"en":"Wheel. LLM API Gateway — Aggregate, Balance, Observe."},"features":{"zh":["自动化工作流","创建下一个文物","开发者工具集成","工作流优化","变更管理"],"ja":["自動化されたワークフロー","次のアーティファクトの作成","開発者ツールの統合","ワークフローの最適化","変更管理"],"ko":["자동화된 워크플로","다음 아티팩트 생성","개발자 도구 통합","워크플로우 최적화","변경 관리"],"es":["Creación del siguiente artefacto en un cambio","Inferencia de nombres de cambios","Selección del usuario","Integración con Openspec list","Soporte para la herramienta AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["Création du prochain artefact dans un changement","Inférence des noms de changements","Sélection de l''utilisateur","Intégration avec Openspec list","Prise en charge de l''outil AskUserQuestion"],"de":["Erstellung des nächsten Artefakt in einer Änderung","Inferenz von Änderungsnamen","Benutzerauswahl","Integration mit Openspec list","Unterstützung der AskUserQuestion-Tool"],"pt":["Criação do próximo artefato","Gerenciamento de alterações","Integração com o LLM API Gateway","Suporte à seleção de mudanças","Utilização do AskUserQuestion tool"],"ru":["Создание следующего артефакта","Управление изменениями","Интеграция с LLM API Gateway","Поддержка выбора изменений","Использование инструмента AskUserQuestion"],"ar":["إنشاء الملف القادم","إدارة التغييرات","التكامل مع بوابة LLM API","دعم اختيار التغييرات","استخدام أداة AskUserQuestion"]},"keywords":{"zh":["openspec-continue-change","自动化工作流","开发者工具","变更管理","工作流优化","LLM API Gateway"],"ja":["openspec-continue-change","自動化されたワークフロー","開発者ツール","変更管理","ワークフローの最適化","LLM API Gateway"],"ko":["openspec-continue-change","자동화된 워크플로","개발자 도구","변경 관리","워크플로우 최적화","LLM API Gateway"],"es":["Openspec Continue Change","desarrollo de software","gestión de cambios","creación de artefactos","inferencia de nombres","selección del usuario"],"fr":["Openspec Continue Change","développement de logiciels","gestion de changements","création d''artefacts","inférence de noms","sélection de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Openspec Continue Change","Software-Entwicklung","Änderungsmanagement","Erstellung von Artefakten","Inferenz von Namen","Benutzerauswahl"],"pt":["OpenSpec","continuar mudança","criar artefato","gerenciar alterações","LLM API Gateway","AskUserQuestion tool","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["OpenSpec","продолжить изменение","создать артефакт","управлять изменениями","LLM API Gateway","инструмент AskUserQuestion","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["OpenSpec","مواصلة التغيير","إنشاء الملف","إدارة التغييرات","بوابة LLM API","أداة AskUserQuestion","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"kunish","repo":"wheel","repoPath":"kunish/wheel","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openspec-continue-change","description":"Continue working on an OpenSpec change by creating the next artifact. Use when the user wants to progress their change, create the next artifact, or continue their workflow.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-","body":"Continue working on a change by creating the next artifact.\n\n**Input**: Optionally specify a change name. If omitted, check if it can be inferred from conversation context. If vague or ambiguous you MUST prompt for available changes.\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. **If no change name provided, prompt for selection**\n\n   Run `openspec list --json` to get available changes sorted by most recently modified. Then use the **AskUserQuestion tool** to let the user select which change to work on.\n\n   Present the top 3-4 most recently modified changes as options, showing:\n   - Change name\n   - Schema (from `schema` field if present, otherwise \"spec-driven\")\n   - Status (e.g., \"0/5 tasks\", \"complete\", \"no tasks\")\n   - How recently it was modified (from `lastModified` field)\n\n   Mark the most recently modified change as \"(Recommended)\" since it''s likely what the user wants to continue.\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: Do NOT guess or auto-select a change. Always let the user choose.\n\n2. **Check current status**\n\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\" --json\n   ```\n\n   Parse the JSON to understand current state. The response includes:\n   - `schemaName`: The workflow schema being used (e.g., \"spec-driven\")\n   - `artifacts`: Array of artifacts with their status (\"done\", \"ready\", \"blocked\")\n   - `isComplete`: Boolean indicating if all artifacts are complete\n\n3. **Act based on status**:\n\n   ***\n\n   **If all artifacts are complete (`isComplete: true`)**:\n   - Congratulate the user\n   - Show final status including the schema used\n   - Suggest: \"All artifacts created! You can now implement this change or archive it.\"\n   - STOP\n\n   ***\n\n   **If artifacts are ready to create** (status shows artifacts with `status: \"ready\"`):\n   - Pick the FIRST artifact with `status: \"ready\"` from the status output\n   - Get its instructions:\n     ```bash\n     openspec instructions <artifact-id> --change \"<name>\" --json\n     ```\n   - Parse the JSON. The key fields are:\n     - `context`: Project background (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `rules`: Artifact-specific rules (constraints for you - do NOT include in output)\n     - `template`: The structure to use for your output file\n     - `instruction`: Schema-specific guidance\n     - `outputPath`: Where to write the artifact\n     - `dependencies`: Completed artifacts to read for context\n   - **Create the artifact file**:\n     - Read any completed dependency files for context\n     - Use `template` as the structure - fill in its sections\n     - Apply `context` and `rules` as constraints when writing - but do NOT copy them into the file\n     - Write to the output path specified in instructions\n   - Show what was created and what''s now unlocked\n   - STOP after creating ONE artifact\n\n   ***\n\n   **If no artifacts are ready (all blocked)**:\n   - This shouldn''t happen with a valid schema\n   - Show status and suggest checking for issues\n\n4. **After creating an artifact, show progress**\n   ```bash\n   openspec status --change \"<name>\"\n   ```\n\n**Output**\n\nAfter each invocation, show:\n\n- Which artifact was created\n- Schema workflow being used\n- Current progress (N/M complete)\n- What artifacts are now unlocked\n- Prompt: \"Want to continue? Just ask me to continue or tell me what to do next.\"\n\n**Artifact Creation Guidelines**\n\nThe artifact types and their purpose depend on the schema. Use the `instruction` field from the instructions output to understand what to create.\n\nCommon artifact patterns:\n\n**spec-driven schema** (proposal → specs → design → tasks):\n\n- **proposal.md**: Ask user about the change if not clear. Fill in Why, What Changes, Capabilities, Impact.\n  - The Capabilities section is critical - each capability listed will need a spec file.\n- **specs/<capability>/spec.md**: Create one spec per capability listed in the proposal''s Capabilities section (use the capability name, not the change name).\n- **design.md**: Document technical decisions, architecture, and implementation approach.\n- **tasks.md**: Break down implementation into checkboxed tasks.\n\nFor other schemas, follow the `instruction` field from the CLI output.\n\n**Guardrails**\n\n- Create ONE artifact per invocation\n- Always read dependency artifacts before creating a new one\n- Never skip artifacts or create out of order\n- If context is unclear, ask the user before creating\n- Verify the artifact file exists after writing before marking progress\n- Use the schema''s artifact sequence, don''t assume specific artifact names\n- **IMPORTANT**: `context` and `rules` are constraints for YOU, not content for the file\n  - Do NOT copy `<context>`, `<rules>`, `<project_context>` blocks into the artifact\n  - These guide what you write, but should never appear in the output\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:57:51.814Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring advanced change management and LLM API Gateway integration.","zh":"适用于需要高级变更管理和LLM API Gateway集成的开发代理。","ja":"高度な変更管理とLLM API Gatewayの統合を必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 변경 관리 및 LLM API Gateway 통합을 필요로 하는 개발 에이전트에게 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren un cambio de gestión avanzado y la integración de la puerta de enlace de API de LLM.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion de changement avancée et une intégration de la passerelle API LLM.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsagenten, die eine erweiterte Änderungsverwaltung und LLM-API-Gateway-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem gerenciamento de alterações avançado e integração do Gateway de API LLM.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих продвинутого управления изменениями и интеграции шлюза API LLM.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يتطلبون إدارة متقدمة للتغييرات وتكامل بوابة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات LLM."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to aggregate, balance, and observe changes using the openspec list command and AskUserQuestion tool, facilitating seamless continuation of changes via the LLM API Gateway, with support for JSON output and user selection prompts.","zh":"赋予代理聚合、平衡和观察更改的能力，使用openspec列表命令和AskUserQuestion工具，通过LLM API Gateway实现无缝的更改继续，并支持JSON输出和用户选择提示。","ja":"エージェントに、openspecリストコマンドとAskUserQuestionツールを使用して、変更を集約、バランス、および観察する能力を与え、LLM API Gatewayを介して変更を無停止で続行し、JSON出力とユーザー選択プロンプトをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트에게 openspec 목록 명령과 AskUserQuestion 툴을 사용하여 변경을 집계, 균형 및 관찰할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, LLM API Gateway를 통해 변경을 무중단으로 계속 진행하며, JSON 출력 및 사용자 선택 프롬프트를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a agregar, equilibrar y observar cambios utilizando el comando de lista openspec y la herramienta AskUserQuestion, facilitando la continuación sin problemas de los cambios a través de la puerta de enlace de API de LLM, con soporte para salida JSON y promtps de selección de usuario.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''agréger, d''équilibrer et d''observer les modifications en utilisant la commande de liste openspec et l''outil AskUserQuestion, facilitant la poursuite sans heurts des modifications via la passerelle API LLM, avec un support pour la sortie JSON et les invites de sélection utilisateur.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Änderungen mithilfe des openspec-Listenbefehls und des AskUserQuestion-Tools zu aggregieren, auszugleichen und zu beobachten, wodurch eine nahtlose Fortsetzung der Änderungen über das LLM-API-Gateway ermöglicht wird, mit Unterstützung für JSON-Ausgabe und Benutzerauswahlprompts.","pt":"Permite que os agentes agreguem, equilibrem e observem alterações usando o comando openspec list e a ferramenta AskUserQuestion, facilitando a continuação sem interrupções das alterações via o Gateway de API LLM, com suporte a saída JSON e prompts de seleção de usuário.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью агрегировать, балансировать и отслеживать изменения с помощью команды openspec list и инструмента AskUserQuestion, обеспечивая бесперебойное продолжение изменений через шлюз API LLM, с поддержкой вывода JSON и запросов на выбор пользователя.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تجميع وتحقيق التوازن ورصد التغييرات باستخدام أمر openspec list وأداة AskUserQuestion، ويسهم في استمرار التغييرات دون انقطاع من خلال بوابة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات LLM، مع دعم الإخراج JSON وطرائق اختيار المستخدم."},"useCases":{"en":["Continuing work on a change by creating the next artifact","Aggregating and balancing changes using the openspec list command","Prompting users to select a change to work on using the AskUserQuestion tool"],"zh":["通过创建下一个工件继续更改工作","使用openspec列表命令聚合和平衡更改","使用AskUserQuestion工具提示用户选择要处理的更改"],"ja":["次のアーティファクトを作成して変更作業を続行する","openspecリストコマンドを使用して変更を集約およびバランスする","AskUserQuestionツールを使用して、ユーザーが作業する変更を選択するようにプロンプトする"],"ko":["다음 아티팩트를 생성하여 변경 작업을 계속 진행하는 것","openspec 목록 명령을 사용하여 변경을 집계 및 균형하는 것","AskUserQuestion 툴을 사용하여 사용자가 작업할 변경을 선택하도록 프롬프트하는 것"],"es":["Continuar trabajando en un cambio creando el próximo artefacto","Aggregar y equilibrar cambios utilizando el comando de lista openspec","Solicitar a los usuarios que seleccionen un cambio para trabajar utilizando la herramienta AskUserQuestion"],"fr":["Poursuivre un travail sur un changement en créant le prochain artefact","Agréger et équilibrer les modifications en utilisant la commande de liste openspec","Inviter les utilisateurs à sélectionner un changement à traiter en utilisant l''outil AskUserQuestion"],"de":["Arbeit an einer Änderung fortsetzen, indem das nächste Artefakt erstellt wird","Änderungen mithilfe des openspec-Listenbefehls aggregieren und ausgleichen","Benutzer auffordern, eine Änderung zum Arbeiten auszuwählen, indem das AskUserQuestion-Tool verwendet wird"],"pt":["Continuar trabalhando em uma alteração criando a próxima artefato","Aggregar e equilibrar alterações usando o comando openspec list","Solicitar aos usuários que selecione uma alteração para trabalhar usando a ferramenta AskUserQuestion"],"ru":["Продолжить работу над изменением, создав следующий артефакт","Агрегировать и балансировать изменения, используя команду openspec list","Предложить пользователям выбрать изменение для работы, используя инструмент AskUserQuestion"],"ar":["استمرار العمل على تغيير من خلال إنشاء الملف القادم","تجميع والتسوية التغييرات باستخدام أمر openspec list","طلب من المستخدمين اختيار تغيير للعمل عليه باستخدام أداة AskUserQuestion"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires LLM API Gateway access","Needs openspec list command functionality","May prompt for user input if change name is vague or ambiguous"],"zh":["需要LLM API Gateway访问","需要openspec列表命令功能","如果更改名称模糊或不明确，可能会提示用户输入"],"ja":["LLM API Gatewayへのアクセスが必要","openspecリストコマンドの機能が必要","変更名が曖昧または不明確な場合、ユーザー入力を求めることがある"],"ko":["LLM API Gateway에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","openspec 목록 명령의 기능이 필요합니다.","변경 이름이 모호하거나 불분명한 경우 사용자 입력을 요구할 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere acceso a la puerta de enlace de API de LLM","Necesita funcionalidad del comando de lista openspec","Puede solicitar la entrada del usuario si el nombre del cambio es vago o ambiguo"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la passerelle API LLM","A besoin de la fonctionnalité de la commande de liste openspec","Peut inviter l''utilisateur à entrer des données si le nom du changement est vague ou ambigu"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das LLM-API-Gateway","Benötigt Funktionalität des openspec-Listenbefehls","Kann die Eingabe des Benutzers anfordern, wenn der Änderungsname vage oder mehrdeutig ist"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao Gateway de API LLM","Necessita da funcionalidade do comando openspec list","Pode solicitar entrada de usuário se o nome da alteração for vago ou ambíguo"],"ru":["Требует доступа к шлюзу API LLM","Требует функциональности команды openspec list","Может запросить ввод пользователя, если имя изменения неоднозначно или двусмысленно"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بوابة واجهة برمجة التطبيقات LLM","يحتاج إلى وظيفة أمر openspec list","يمكن أن يطلب إدخال المستخدم إذا كان اسم التغيير غامض أو مزدوج الدلالة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('lawless-m/Earwig/Reverse Proxy Deployment', 'community', 'lawless-m', 'Earwig', 'lawless-m/Earwig', 'Reverse Proxy Deployment', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z', '2026-02-18T03:57:56.490Z', NULL, '{"id":"lawless-m/Earwig/Reverse Proxy Deployment","name":"Reverse Proxy Deployment","description":{"zh":"本指南介绍如何在Apache反向代理服务器后部署Web应用程序，涵盖前端相对URL模式和Apache ProxyPass配置","ja":"このガイドでは、Apacheリバースプロキシサーバーの後ろにWebアプリケーションをデプロイする方法を紹介します。フロントエンドの相対URLパターンとApache ProxyPassの設定を含みます","ko":"이 가이드는 아파치 리버스 프록시 서버 뒤에 웹 애플리케이션을 배포하는 방법을介绍합니다. 프론트엔드 상대 URL 패턴과 아파치 ProxyPass 구성 포함","es":"Guía para implementar aplicaciones web detrás de un proxy inverso de Apache. Cubre patrones de URL relativos y configuración de ProxyPass.","fr":"Guide pour déployer des applications web derrière un proxy inverse Apache. Couvre les modèles d''URL relatifs et la configuration de ProxyPass.","de":"Anleitung zur Implementierung von Webanwendungen hinter einem Apache-Reverse-Proxy. Behandelt relative URL-Muster und ProxyPass-Konfiguration.","pt":"Este guia fornece instruções para implantar aplicações web por trás do proxy reverso Apache em rivsprod01, incluindo configuração de URLs relativas e ProxyPass","ru":"Это руководство предоставляет инструкции по развертыванию веб-приложений за обратным прокси Apache на rivsprod01, включая настройку относительных URL и ProxyPass","ar":"هذا الدليل يوفر إرشادات لتطبيق تطبيقات الويب خلف وكيل ال_proxy العكسي Apache على rivsprod01، بما في ذلك cấufigur URLs النسبية و ProxyPass","en":"Voice note recorder"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"反向代理部署指南","ja":"リバースプロキシデプロイメントガイド","ko":"리버스 프록시 배포 가이드","es":"Implementación de Proxy Inverso: Guía para Desarrolladores","fr":"Déploiement de Proxy Inverse : Guide pour les Développeurs","de":"Reverse-Proxy-Implementierung: Anleitung für Entwickler","pt":"Implantação de Proxy Reverso: Guia de Desenvolvedores","ru":"Развертывание обратного прокси: Руководство для разработч...","ar":"تطبيق وكيل ال_proxy العكسي: دليل المطورين","en":"Reverse Proxy Deployment"},"description":{"zh":"本指南介绍如何在Apache反向代理服务器后部署Web应用程序，涵盖前端相对URL模式和Apache ProxyPass配置","ja":"このガイドでは、Apacheリバースプロキシサーバーの後ろにWebアプリケーションをデプロイする方法を紹介します。フロントエンドの相対URLパターンとApache ProxyPassの設定を含みます","ko":"이 가이드는 아파치 리버스 프록시 서버 뒤에 웹 애플리케이션을 배포하는 방법을介绍합니다. 프론트엔드 상대 URL 패턴과 아파치 ProxyPass 구성 포함","es":"Guía para implementar aplicaciones web detrás de un proxy inverso de Apache. Cubre patrones de URL relativos y configuración de ProxyPass.","fr":"Guide pour déployer des applications web derrière un proxy inverse Apache. Couvre les modèles d''URL relatifs et la configuration de ProxyPass.","de":"Anleitung zur Implementierung von Webanwendungen hinter einem Apache-Reverse-Proxy. Behandelt relative URL-Muster und ProxyPass-Konfiguration.","pt":"Este guia fornece instruções para implantar aplicações web por trás do proxy reverso Apache em rivsprod01, incluindo configuração de URLs relativas e ProxyPass","ru":"Это руководство предоставляет инструкции по развертыванию веб-приложений за обратным прокси Apache на rivsprod01, включая настройку относительных URL и Proxy...","ar":"هذا الدليل يوفر إرشادات لتطبيق تطبيقات الويب خلف وكيل ال_proxy العكسي Apache على rivsprod01، بما في ذلك cấufigur URLs النسبية و ProxyPass","en":"Voice note recorder"},"definition":{"en":"Voice note recorder"},"features":{"zh":["前端相对URL模式","Apache ProxyPass配置","支持多种Web应用程序","提高安全性和性能","易于配置和维护"],"ja":["フロントエンドの相対URLパターン","Apache ProxyPassの設定","複数のWebアプリケーションをサポート","セキュリティとパフォーマンスの向上","簡単な設定とメンテナンス"],"ko":["프론트엔드 상대 URL 패턴","아파치 ProxyPass 구성","여러 웹 애플리케이션 지원","보안 및 성능 향상","쉽게 구성 및 유지 관리"],"es":["Implementación de URL relativos","Configuración de ProxyPass en Apache","Mejora de la seguridad y el rendimiento","Compatibilidad con aplicaciones web detrás de un proxy inverso","Guía paso a paso para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Implémentation d''URL relatifs","Configuration de ProxyPass dans Apache","Amélioration de la sécurité et des performances","Compatibilité avec des applications web derrière un proxy inverse","Guide étape par étape pour les développeurs"],"de":["Implementierung relativer URLs","Konfiguration von ProxyPass in Apache","Verbesserung der Sicherheit und Leistung","Kompatibilität mit Webanwendungen hinter einem Reverse-Proxy","Schritt-für-Schritt-Anleitung für Entwickler"],"pt":["Uso de URLs relativas","Configuração de ProxyPass no Apache","Implantação de aplicações web por trás do proxy reverso","Suporte a padrões de URL relativos","Configuração de rivsprod01"],"ru":["Использование относительных URL","Настройка ProxyPass в Apache","Развертывание веб-приложений за обратным прокси","Поддержка относительных шаблонов URL","Настройка rivsprod01"],"ar":["استخدام URLs النسبية","تكوين ProxyPass في Apache","تطبيق تطبيقات الويب خلف وكيل ال_proxy العكسي","دعم أنماط URL النسبية","تكوين rivsprod01"]},"keywords":{"zh":["反向代理部署","Apache反向代理","Web应用程序部署","前端相对URL模式","ProxyPass配置","安全性和性能"],"ja":["リバースプロキシデプロイメント","Apacheリバースプロキシ","Webアプリケーションデプロイ","フロントエンドの相対URLパターン","ProxyPassの設定","セキュリティとパフォーマンス"],"ko":["리버스 프록시 배포","아파치 리버스 프록시","웹 애플리케이션 배포","프론트엔드 상대 URL 패턴","ProxyPass 구성","보안 및 성능"],"es":["proxy inverso","apache","desarrollo web","seguridad","rendimiento","url relativos","proxy pass","guía para desarrolladores"],"fr":["proxy inverse","apache","développement web","sécurité","performances","url relatifs","proxy pass","guide pour les développeurs"],"de":["reverse-proxy","apache","webentwicklung","sicherheit","leistung","relative urls","proxy pass","anleitung für entwickler"],"pt":["proxy reverso","apache","urls relativas","proxypass","desenvolvimento web","implantação de aplicações","rivsprod01","configuração de servidor"],"ru":["обратный прокси","apache","относительные url","proxypass","веб-разработка","развертывание приложений","rivsprod01","настройка сервера"],"ar":["وكيل ال_proxy العكسي","apache","urls النسبية","proxypass","تطوير الويب","تطبيق التطبيقات","rivsprod01","تكوين الخادم"]}},"owner":"lawless-m","repo":"Earwig","repoPath":"lawless-m/Earwig","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Reverse Proxy Deployment","description":"Deploy web applications behind Apache reverse proxy on rivsprod01 with relative URLs and proper path configuration","bodyPreview":"# Reverse Proxy Deployment\n\nGuide for deploying web applications behind the Apache reverse proxy on rivsprod01 (dw.ramsden-international.com). Covers frontend relative URL patterns and Apache ProxyPass configuration.\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen deploying a web application that will be accessed through the reverse proxy:\n\n1. **Use Relative URLs**: Frontend code must use relative URLs (not absolute localhost URLs) to work behind the proxy\n2. **Configure ProxyPass on rivsprod01**: Create Apache config i","body":"# Reverse Proxy Deployment\n\nGuide for deploying web applications behind the Apache reverse proxy on rivsprod01 (dw.ramsden-international.com). Covers frontend relative URL patterns and Apache ProxyPass configuration.\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen deploying a web application that will be accessed through the reverse proxy:\n\n1. **Use Relative URLs**: Frontend code must use relative URLs (not absolute localhost URLs) to work behind the proxy\n2. **Configure ProxyPass on rivsprod01**: Create Apache config in `/etc/apache2/proxy-conf.d/` with proper path stripping\n3. **Order Matters**: More specific paths must come before general paths in Apache config\n4. **Test Locally First**: Verify services are accessible from rivsprod01 before configuring proxy\n5. **Use Trailing Slashes**: Both source and target URLs need trailing slashes for path stripping to work\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Deploy Web Application with API Backend\n\n```\nUser: I have a web app with frontend on port 9273 and API on port 8765. Deploy it behind the proxy at /myapp/\n\nClaude: I''ll set up your application for reverse proxy deployment:\n\n1. **Update Frontend URLs**: Change API calls to use relative URLs\n   - Before: `fetch(''http://localhost:8765/api/status'')`\n   - After: `fetch(''api/status'')`  // Relative to current path\n\n2. **Create Apache Config**: SSH to rivsprod01 and create `/etc/apache2/proxy-conf.d/myapp.conf`\n   - API path: `/myapp/api/` → backend on port 8765\n   - Frontend path: `/myapp/` → frontend on port 9273\n   - API location must come FIRST (more specific)\n\n3. **Reload Apache**: `sudo systemctl reload apache2`\n\n[Provides implementation using the ProxyPass Configuration pattern below]\n```\n\n### Example 2: Frontend Uses Absolute URLs\n\n```\nUser: My frontend has `fetch(''http://localhost:3000/api/data'')` hardcoded. How do I make it work behind a proxy?\n\nClaude: Absolute URLs won''t work behind a reverse proxy. You need to update the frontend to use relative URLs:\n\n**Options:**\n1. **Best: Use relative URLs** - `fetch(''api/data'')` - works anywhere\n2. **Alternative: Use base path** - Store base path in config, prepend to all API calls\n3. **Hidden input method** - Store proxy path in HTML, read in JavaScript\n\nFor option 1 (recommended):\n- Replace all `http://localhost:3000/api/` with `api/`\n- The browser resolves relative to current page path\n- If page is at `/myapp/`, API call goes to `/myapp/api/`\n\n[Shows the Relative URL Pattern implementation below]\n```\n\n### Example 3: Multiple Services on Same Machine\n\n```\nUser: I have 3 services running on ports 8001, 8002, 8003. Deploy all at /service1/, /service2/, /service3/\n\nClaude: I''ll configure all three services in a single Apache config file:\n\n1. **Create single config file**: `/etc/apache2/proxy-conf.d/services.conf`\n2. **Add ProxyPass for each**: More specific paths first (doesn''t matter here since no overlap)\n3. **Each service gets clean URLs**: Paths are stripped before forwarding\n4. **Reload once**: All services go live together\n\n[Provides implementation using the Multi-Service Configuration pattern below]\n```\n\n### Example 4: API Calls Return 404\n\n```\nUser: My frontend loads but API calls return 404. Frontend is at /rabbit/, API should be at /rabbit/api/\n\nClaude: The issue is likely ProxyPass configuration. Let me check:\n\n1. **Verify services are reachable**: From rivsprod01, can you curl the backend directly?\n   - `curl http://10.99.0.3:8765/status` should work\n\n2. **Check ProxyPass order**: API location must come BEFORE frontend location\n   - Wrong order: frontend `/rabbit/` catches `/rabbit/api/` requests\n   - Right order: API `/rabbit/api/` catches first, then frontend `/rabbit/`\n\n3. **Verify trailing slashes**: Both paths need trailing slashes for stripping\n   - `ProxyPass /rabbit/api/ http://10.99.0.3:8765/`\n   - Without trailing slash, path isn''t stripped properly\n\n[Shows debugging steps from Troubleshooting section below]\n```\n\n---\n\n# Reference Implementation Details\n\nThe sections below contain proven working configurations from production deployments.\n\n**Reference Files in This Folder**:\n- `rabbit.conf` - Example Apache config from Invoice OCR deployment\n\n## Relative URL Pattern\n\n**Purpose**: Make frontend work behind any reverse proxy path without hardcoding URLs\n\n### HTML Method (Recommended for Simple Cases)\n\n```html\n<!-- Hidden input stores the API base path -->\n<input type=\"hidden\" id=\"serverUrl\" value=\"api\">\n\n<script>\nfunction getServerUrl() {\n    return document.getElementById(''serverUrl'').value.trim();\n}\n\n// Use in fetch calls\nasync function checkStatus() {\n    const res = await fetch(`${getServerUrl()}/status`);\n    const data = await res.json();\n    // ...\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n**Key Points**:\n- Value is `\"api\"` (relative) not `\"http://localhost:8765\"` (absolute)\n- Browser resolves `api/status` relative to current page\n- If page is at `https://example.com/rabbit/`, request goes to `https://example.com/rabbit/api/status`\n- Proxy strips `/rabbit/` and forwards to backend\n\n### JavaScript Config Method (For Complex Applications)\n\n```javascript\n// config.js\nconst CONFIG = {\n    API_BASE: ''api'',  // Relative to current path\n    WS_BASE: ''ws''     // WebSocket endpoint if needed\n};\n\n// Use throughout app\nfetch(`${CONFIG.API_BASE}/endpoint`)\n```\n\n**When to use**:\n- Multiple API endpoints\n- Different base paths for dev/staging/prod\n- Need to change paths without editing HTML\n\n## ProxyPass Configuration Pattern\n\n**Purpose**: Configure Apache to forward requests from public path to internal service\n\n### Basic Single-Service Configuration\n\n**File**: `/etc/apache2/proxy-conf.d/myservice.conf`\n\n```apache\n# Single service on custom path\nProxyPass /myservice/ http://10.99.0.3:8080/\nProxyPassReverse /myservice/ http://10.99.0.3:8080/\n```\n\n**Key Points**:\n- Simple ProxyPass directives (no `<Location>` blocks needed)\n- Trailing slashes on both source and target strip the path prefix\n- Request to `/myservice/page` becomes `/page` at backend\n- `ProxyPassReverse` rewrites response headers (redirects, etc.)\n\n### API + Frontend Configuration\n\n**File**: `/etc/apache2/proxy-conf.d/service-with-api.conf`\n\n```apache\n# Backend API - Must come FIRST (more specific path)\nProxyPass /rabbit/api/ http://10.99.0.3:8765/\nProxyPassReverse /rabbit/api/ http://10.99.0.3:8765/\n\n# Frontend - Comes SECOND (less specific path)\nProxyPass /rabbit/ http://10.99.0.3:9273/\nProxyPassReverse /rabbit/ http://10.99.0.3:9273/\n```\n\n**Key Points**:\n- API location MUST be listed first (more specific)\n- If frontend is listed first, it catches API requests → 404\n- Both locations strip their prefix before forwarding\n- Request flow:\n  - `GET /rabbit/api/status` → matches first rule → `GET /status` to port 8765\n  - `GET /rabbit/index.html` → matches second rule → `GET /index.html` to port 9273\n\n### Large File Upload Configuration\n\n```apache\n# Service that handles file uploads (PDFs, images, etc.)\nProxyPass /uploads/ http://10.99.0.3:7000/\nProxyPassReverse /uploads/ http://10.99.0.3:7000/\n\n# Important for large PDF uploads\n<Location /uploads/>\n    ProxyPass http://10.99.0.3:7000/\n    ProxyPassReverse http://10.99.0.3:7000/\n\n    # Allow 50MB uploads\n    LimitRequestBody 52428800\n</Location>\n```\n\n**When to use**:\n- File upload services\n- PDF/image processing\n- Any endpoint that receives large request bodies\n\n## Multi-Service Configuration Pattern\n\n**Purpose**: Deploy multiple independent services in one config file\n\n**File**: `/etc/apache2/proxy-conf.d/all-services.conf`\n\n```apache\n# Service 1: API Gateway\nProxyPass /api/ http://10.99.0.3:8001/\nProxyPassReverse /api/ http://10.99.0.3:8001/\n\n# Service 2: Admin Dashboard\nProxyPass /admin/ http://10.99.0.3:8002/\nProxyPassReverse /admin/ http://10.99.0.3:8002/\n\n# Service 3: Public Website\nProxyPass /site/ http://10.99.0.3:8003/\nProxyPassReverse /site/ http://10.99.0.3:8003/\n```\n\n**Key Points**:\n- Each service is completely independent\n- Order doesn''t matter if paths don''t overlap\n- All go live together when Apache reloads\n- Can comment out individual services to disable temporarily\n\n## Deployment Workflow\n\n**Standard deployment process for new service:**\n\n### 1. Verify Local Service Accessibility\n\n```bash\n# From local machine where service runs\ncurl http://10.99.0.3:8765/status  # Test your port\n\n# From rivsprod01 (SSH in)\nssh rivsprod01 \"curl -s http://10.99.0.3:8765/status\"\n```\n\n**Expected**: JSON response or HTML, not connection refused\n\n### 2. Create Apache Configuration\n\n```bash\n# SSH to rivsprod01\nssh rivsprod01\n\n# Create config file (as root or with sudo)\nsudo nano /etc/apache2/proxy-conf.d/myservice.conf\n\n# Add ProxyPass configuration (see patterns above)\n\n# Verify syntax (optional, but recommended)\n# apache2ctl configtest   # May not be available\n# Just proceed to reload if command not found\n```\n\n### 3. Reload Apache\n\n```bash\nsudo systemctl reload apache2\n\n# Verify Apache is still running\nsudo systemctl status apache2\n```\n\n### 4. Test Public Access\n\n```bash\n# From any machine\ncurl https://dw.ramsden-international.com/myservice/\n\n# Or open in browser\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### 404 Not Found - Service Works Locally\n\n**Cause**: ProxyPass configuration issue\n\n**Diagnostic Steps**:\n1. Verify service is accessible from rivsprod01:\n   ```bash\n   ssh rivsprod01 \"curl -s http://10.99.0.3:PORT/endpoint\"\n   ```\n\n2. Check Apache config order:\n   ```bash\n   ssh rivsprod01 \"cat /etc/apache2/proxy-conf.d/myservice.conf\"\n   ```\n   - API paths must come before frontend paths\n   - Verify trailing slashes on both source and target\n\n3. Check Apache error logs:\n   ```bash\n   ssh rivsprod01 \"sudo tail -50 /var/log/apache2/error.log | grep myservice\"\n   ```\n\n**Solution**:\n- Fix ProxyPass order (more specific first)\n- Add missing trailing slashes\n- Reload Apache: `sudo systemctl reload apache2`\n\n### 404 on API Calls, Frontend Works\n\n**Cause**: Frontend path is catching API requests\n\n**Example of Wrong Configuration**:\n```apache\n# WRONG - Frontend catches everything\nProxyPass /app/ http://10.99.0.3:9000/\nProxyPass /app/api/ http://10.99.0.3:8000/\n```\n\n**Solution - Put API First**:\n```apache\n# CORRECT - API catches specific path first\nProxyPass /app/api/ http://10.99.0.3:8000/\nProxyPass /app/ http://10.99.0.3:9000/\n```\n\n### Connection Refused from rivsprod01\n\n**Cause**: Service not listening on accessible IP\n\n**Diagnostic**:\n```bash\n# On machine running service\nnetstat -tlnp | grep PORT\n# or\nss -tlnp | grep PORT\n```\n\n**Look for**:\n- `127.0.0.1:PORT` - Only listening on localhost (wrong)\n- `10.99.0.3:PORT` - Listening on network IP (correct)\n- `0.0.0.0:PORT` - Listening on all interfaces (also correct)\n\n**Solution**: Configure service to bind to `0.0.0.0` or specific IP `10.99.0.3`\n\n### Service Stops Working After Apache Reload\n\n**Cause**: Configuration syntax error\n\n**Diagnostic**:\n```bash\nssh rivsprod01 \"sudo systemctl status apache2\"\n```\n\n**Solution**:\n1. Check for typos in ProxyPass URLs\n2. Verify no missing quotes or slashes\n3. Look at error log: `sudo tail /var/log/apache2/error.log`\n4. Fix config and reload again\n\n### CORS Errors in Browser Console\n\n**Cause**: Backend not configured for CORS, or wrong origin\n\n**Solution (Backend)**: Enable CORS in your service\n\n```python\n# FastAPI example\nfrom fastapi.middleware.cors import CORSMiddleware\n\napp.add_middleware(\n    CORSMiddleware,\n    allow_origins=[\"*\"],  # Or specific domain\n    allow_credentials=True,\n    allow_methods=[\"*\"],\n    allow_headers=[\"*\"],\n)\n```\n\n**Note**: Proxy handles forwarding; backend sees requests from proxy IP, not client\n\n## IP Addresses Reference\n\n| Hostname | IP Address | Purpose |\n|----------|-----------|---------|\n| rivsprod01 | 10.99.0.2 | Reverse proxy server (Apache) |\n| pogs (local) | 10.99.0.3 | Development machine running services |\n\n**Service Configuration**:\n- Services should bind to `10.99.0.3` or `0.0.0.0` to be accessible from rivsprod01\n- Use `http://10.99.0.3:PORT` in ProxyPass target URLs\n- Never use `localhost` or `127.0.0.1` in ProxyPass targets\n\n## File Locations on rivsprod01\n\n| Path | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `/etc/apache2/proxy-conf.d/*.conf` | Proxy configurations (add yours here) |\n| `/etc/apache2/sites-available/default-ssl.conf` | Main SSL site config (includes proxy-conf.d) |\n| `/var/log/apache2/error.log` | Apache error log |\n| `/var/log/apache2/access.log` | Access log (if needed) |\n\n**Important**: Configs in `/etc/apache2/proxy-conf.d/` are automatically included by the SSL site configuration.\n\n## Best Practices Summary\n\n1. **Always use relative URLs** in frontend code for proxy compatibility\n2. **Test service accessibility** from rivsprod01 before configuring proxy\n3. **Put specific paths first** in Apache config (API before frontend)\n4. **Use trailing slashes** on both ProxyPass source and target for path stripping\n5. **Reload Apache** after config changes: `sudo systemctl reload apache2`\n6. **Keep configs organized** - one file per application or related service group\n7. **Document your paths** - add comments explaining what each ProxyPass does\n8. **Test both frontend and API** after deployment to verify routing\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:57:56.490Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Web Development Agents requiring secure and efficient reverse proxy configuration using Apache ProxyPass.","zh":"适用于需要使用Apache ProxyPass进行安全高效反向代理配置的Web开发代理。","ja":"Apache ProxyPassを使用したセキュアで効率的なリバースプロキシ設定が必要なWeb開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"Apache ProxyPass를 사용하여 보안이 높은 효율적인 역방향 프록시 구성이 필요한 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo Web que requieren una configuración de proxy inverso segura y eficiente utilizando Apache ProxyPass.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Web nécessitant une configuration de proxy inversé sécurisée et efficace à l''aide d''Apache ProxyPass.","de":"Ideal für Webentwicklungsagenten, die eine sichere und effiziente Konfiguration des Reverse-Proxy mit Apache ProxyPass erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que exigem configuração de proxy reverso segura e eficiente usando Apache ProxyPass.","ru":"Идеально для агентов веб-разработки, требующих безопасной и эффективной конфигурации обратного прокси с помощью Apache ProxyPass.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطوير الويب الذين يتطلبون تكوين بروكسي عكسي آمن وفعّال باستخدام Apache ProxyPass."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy web applications behind the Apache reverse proxy, leveraging relative URL patterns and Apache ProxyPass configuration for secure and seamless access, utilizing protocols like HTTP and HTTPS.","zh":"赋予代理部署Web应用程序在Apache反向代理后面的能力，利用相对URL模式和Apache ProxyPass配置实现安全无缝访问，使用HTTP和HTTPS等协议。","ja":"エージェントにApacheのリバースプロキシの後ろにWebアプリケーションをデプロイする能力を付与し、相対URLパターンとApache ProxyPass構成を利用してセキュアでシームレスなアクセスを実現し、HTTPやHTTPSなどのプロトコルを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Apache 역방향 프록시 뒤에 웹 애플리케이션을 배포할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 상대 URL 패턴 및 Apache ProxyPass 구성으로 보안이 높은無縫アクセス 를 구현하며, HTTP 및 HTTPS 등의 프로토콜을 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar aplicaciones web detrás del proxy inverso de Apache, aprovechando patrones de URL relativos y la configuración de Apache ProxyPass para un acceso seguro y sin problemas, utilizando protocolos como HTTP y HTTPS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer des applications Web derrière le proxy inversé Apache, en exploitant les modèles d''URL relatifs et la configuration d''Apache ProxyPass pour un accès sécurisé et sans rupture, en utilisant des protocoles tels que HTTP et HTTPS.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Webanwendungen hinter dem Apache-Reverse-Proxy bereitzustellen, indem relative URL-Muster und die Apache-ProxyPass-Konfiguration für einen sicheren und nahtlosen Zugriff genutzt werden, wobei Protokolle wie HTTP und HTTPS verwendet werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes implantem aplicações web atrás do proxy reverso do Apache, utilizando padrões de URL relativos e configuração do Apache ProxyPass para acesso seguro e sem interrupções, utilizando protocolos como HTTP e HTTPS.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность развертывать веб-приложения за обратным прокси Apache, используя относительные шаблоны URL и конфигурацию Apache ProxyPass для безопасного и бесшовного доступа, используя протоколы, такие как HTTP и HTTPS.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على نشر تطبيقات الويب خلف بروكسي عكسي Apache، مع استخدام أنماط URL النسبية وتكوين Apache ProxyPass للوصول الآمن دون انقطاع، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTP و HTTPS."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring Apache ProxyPass for secure web application deployment","Deploying web applications with relative URL patterns for proxy compatibility","Troubleshooting reverse proxy issues with Apache configuration"],"zh":["为安全的Web应用程序部署配置Apache ProxyPass","使用相对URL模式以实现代理兼容性来部署Web应用程序","使用Apache配置解决反向代理问题"],"ja":["セキュアなWebアプリケーションのデプロイのためにApache ProxyPassを設定する","プロキシ互換性のために相対URLパターンを使用してWebアプリケーションをデプロイする","Apacheの設定を使用してリバースプロキシの問題をトラブルシューティングする"],"ko":["보안이 높은 웹 애플리케이션 배포를 위한 Apache ProxyPass 구성","프록시 호환성을 위해 상대 URL 패턴을 사용하여 웹 애플리케이션 배포","Apache 구성으로 역방향 프록시 문제 해결"],"es":["Configuración de Apache ProxyPass para la implementación segura de aplicaciones web","Implementación de aplicaciones web con patrones de URL relativos para la compatibilidad con el proxy","Solución de problemas de proxy inverso con la configuración de Apache"],"fr":["Configuration d''Apache ProxyPass pour le déploiement sécurisé d''applications Web","Déploiement d''applications Web avec des modèles d''URL relatifs pour la compatibilité du proxy","Dépannage des problèmes de proxy inversé avec la configuration d''Apache"],"de":["Konfiguration von Apache ProxyPass für die sichere Bereitstellung von Webanwendungen","Bereitstellung von Webanwendungen mit relativen URL-Mustern für die Proxy-Kompatibilität","Fehlerbehebung bei Reverse-Proxy-Problemen mit der Apache-Konfiguration"],"pt":["Configurando Apache ProxyPass para implantação segura de aplicações web","Implantando aplicações web com padrões de URL relativos para compatibilidade de proxy","Solucionando problemas de proxy reverso com configuração do Apache"],"ru":["Настройка Apache ProxyPass для безопасного развертывания веб-приложений","Развертывание веб-приложений с относительными шаблонами URL для совместимости прокси","Устранение неполадок с обратным прокси с помощью конфигурации Apache"],"ar":["تكوين Apache ProxyPass لنشر تطبيقات الويب بشكل آمن","نشر تطبيقات الويب مع أنماط URL النسبية للتوافق مع بروكسي","معالجة مشاكل بروكسي عكسي باستخدام تكوين Apache"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Apache configuration access","Limited to web applications using relative URLs","Specific to Apache reverse proxy deployment on rivsprod01 (dw.ramsden-international.com)"],"zh":["需要Apache配置访问权限","仅限于使用相对URL的Web应用程序","特定于rivsprod01（dw.ramsden-international.com）上的Apache反向代理部署"],"ja":["Apacheの設定アクセスが必要","相対URLを使用するWebアプリケーションに限定される","rivsprod01（dw.ramsden-international.com）でのApacheリバースプロキシのデプロイに特定される"],"ko":["Apache 구성 액세스 권한이 필요","상대 URL을 사용하는 웹 애플리케이션으로 제한","rivsprod01（dw.ramsden-international.com）에서 Apache 역방향 프록시 배포에 특정"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la configuración de Apache","Limitado a aplicaciones web que utilizan URLs relativos","Específico para la implementación de proxy inverso de Apache en rivsprod01 (dw.ramsden-international.com)"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la configuration d''Apache","Limité aux applications Web utilisant des URL relatifs","Spécifique au déploiement du proxy inversé Apache sur rivsprod01 (dw.ramsden-international.com)"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Apache-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf Webanwendungen, die relative URLs verwenden","Spezifisch für die Bereitstellung des Apache-Reverse-Proxy auf rivsprod01 (dw.ramsden-international.com)"],"pt":["Exige acesso à configuração do Apache","Limitado a aplicações web que usam URLs relativos","Específico para implantação de proxy reverso do Apache em rivsprod01 (dw.ramsden-international.com)"],"ru":["Требует доступа к конфигурации Apache","Ограничен веб-приложениями, использующими относительные URL","Конкретно для развертывания обратного прокси Apache на rivsprod01 (dw.ramsden-international.com)"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى تكوين Apache","محدود بتطبيقات الويب التي تستخدم URLs النسبية","محدد لنشر بروكسي عكسي Apache على rivsprod01 (dw.ramsden-international.com)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
