:"Инициализация Местного Инструментария","ar":"تثبيت أدوات محلية","en":"init-local-tooling"},"description":{"zh":"初始化本地工具，支持TypeScript、Rust和Python项目，包括linting、格式化、类型检查、测试、Git钩子、CI/CD和发布","ja":"ローカルツールを初期化し、TypeScript、Rust、Pythonプロジェクトをサポートします。linting、フォーマット、型チェック、テスト、Git hook、CI/CD、パブリッシュが含まれます","ko":"로컬 툴링을 초기화하여 TypeScript, Rust, Python 프로젝트를 지원합니다. 린팅, 포맷팅, 타입 체킹, 테스트, Git 훅, CI/CD, 배포 등 포함","es":"El skill init-local-tooling ofrece una configuración integral para proyectos de TypeScript, Rust y Python, incluyendo linting, formato y pruebas","fr":"Le skill init-local-tooling propose une configuration complète pour les projets TypeScript, Rust et Python, y compris le linting, le formatage et les tests","de":"Der Skill init-local-tooling bietet eine umfassende Konfiguration für TypeScript-, Rust- und Python-Projekte, einschließlich Linting, Formatierung und Tests","pt":"O skill init-local-tooling oferece uma configuração abrangente para projetos TypeScript, Rust e Python, incluindo linting, formatação e teste.","ru":"Умение init-local-tooling предоставляет комплексную настройку для проектов TypeScript, Rust и Python, включая линтинг, форматирование и тестирование.","ar":"تمكّن مهارة init-local-tooling من توفير إعداد شامل لمشاريع TypeScript وRust وPython، بما في ذلك لينتينج وتنسيق واختبار.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["支持TypeScript、Rust和Python项目","初始化linting、格式化、类型检查和测试","配置Git钩子和CI/CD","支持自动发布到npm和crate","支持monorepo和Nx + pnpm workspaces"],"ja":["TypeScript、Rust、Pythonプロジェクトをサポート","linting、フォーマット、型チェック、テストの初期化","Git hookとCI/CDの設定","npmとcrateへの自動パブリッシュ","monorepoとNx + pnpm workspacesのサポート"],"ko":["TypeScript, Rust, Python 프로젝트 지원","린팅, 포맷팅, 타입 체킹, 테스트 초기화","Git 훅과 CI/CD 설정","npm과 crate로의 자동 배포","monorepo와 Nx + pnpm workspaces 지원"],"es":["Configuración de linting y formato","Verificación de tipos y pruebas","Configuración de Git hooks con lefthook","Integración con GitHub Actions para CI/CD","Publicación automática en npm y crates.io"],"fr":["Configuration du linting et du formatage","Vérification de types et tests","Configuration des hooks Git avec lefthook","Intégration avec GitHub Actions pour CI/CD","Publication automatique sur npm et crates.io"],"de":["Konfiguration von Linting und Formatierung","Typüberprüfung und Tests","Konfiguration von Git-Hooks mit lefthook","Integration mit GitHub Actions für CI/CD","Automatische Veröffentlichung auf npm und crates.io"],"pt":["Inicialização de ferramentas para novos projetos","Configuração de monorepo com Nx + pnpm workspaces","Instalação de hooks do Git com lefthook","Adição de ações do GitHub para CI/CD","Configuração de publicação automática para npm/crat"],"ru":["Инициализация инструментов для новых проектов","Настройка моноре포 с Nx + pnpm workspaces","Установка хуков Git с lefthook","Добавление действий GitHub для CI/CD","Настройка автоматической публикации в npm/crat"],"ar":["تثبيت أدوات لمشاريع جديدة","إعداد مونوريبو مع Nx + pnpm workspaces","تثبيت hooks Git مع lefthook","إضافة إجراءات GitHub لCI/CD","إعداد نشر تلقائي إلى npm/crat"]},"keywords":{"zh":["初始化本地工具","TypeScript","Rust","Python","linting","格式化","类型检查","测试","Git钩子","CI/CD","自动发布"],"ja":["ローカルツール初期化","TypeScript","Rust","Python","linting","フォーマット","型チェック","テスト","Git hook","CI/CD","自動パブリッシュ"],"ko":["로컬 툴링 초기화","TypeScript","Rust","Python","린팅","포맷팅","타입 체킹","테스트","Git 훅","CI/CD","자동 배포"],"es":["herramientas locales","TypeScript","Rust","Python","linting","formato","verificación de tipos","pruebas","Git hooks","CI/CD"],"fr":["outils locaux","TypeScript","Rust","Python","linting","formatage","vérification de types","tests","hooks Git","CI/CD"],"de":["lokale Tools","TypeScript","Rust","Python","Linting","Formatierung","Typüberprüfung","Tests","Git-Hooks","CI/CD"],"pt":["inicialização de ferramentas locais","desenvolvimento de software","TypeScript","Rust","Python","linting","formatação","teste","Git hooks","CI/CD"],"ru":["инициализация местного инструментария","разработка программного обеспечения","TypeScript","Rust","Python","линтинг","форматирование","тестирование","хуки Git","CI/CD"],"ar":["تثبيت أدوات محلية","تطوير البرمجيات","TypeScript","Rust","Python","لينتينج","تنسيق","اختبار","hooks Git","CI/CD"]}},"owner":"aaronbassett","repo":"claude-bell","repoPath":"aaronbassett/claude-bell","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"init-local-tooling","description":"Initialize and configure local development tooling for TypeScript, Rust, and Python projects including monorepos. Use when setting up linting (ESLint, Biome, clippy, ruff), formatting (Prettier, rustfmt, ruff), type checking (tsc, mypy), testing (Vitest, Jest, cargo test, pytest), Git hooks (lefthook for commit-msg, pre-commit, pre-push), GitHub Actions workflows, package publishing (npm, crates.io, PyPI), version management (Changesets), and automated releases. Covers both single-language projects and multi-language monorepos using Nx + pnpm workspaces.","bodyPreview":"# Local Tooling Initialization\n\nComprehensive setup for linting, formatting, type checking, testing, Git hooks, CI/CD, and publishing across TypeScript, Rust, and Python projects.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Initialize tooling for a new TypeScript/Rust/Python project\n- Set up monorepo with Nx + pnpm workspaces\n- Configure Git hooks with lefthook (conventional commits, pre-commit, pre-push)\n- Add GitHub Actions for CI/CD\n- Set up automated publishing to npm/crat","body":"# Local Tooling Initialization\n\nComprehensive setup for linting, formatting, type checking, testing, Git hooks, CI/CD, and publishing across TypeScript, Rust, and Python projects.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Initialize tooling for a new TypeScript/Rust/Python project\n- Set up monorepo with Nx + pnpm workspaces\n- Configure Git hooks with lefthook (conventional commits, pre-commit, pre-push)\n- Add GitHub Actions for CI/CD\n- Set up automated publishing to npm/crates.io/PyPI\n- Configure version bumping and changelog generation with Changesets\n- Migrate from Husky to lefthook\n- Choose between ESLint+Prettier vs Biome for TypeScript\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### TypeScript Project\n\n**Automated setup:**\n```bash\n./scripts/init_typescript.sh\n```\n\n**Choose tooling:**\n- **Biome** (recommended) - Fast, all-in-one, modern\n- **ESLint + Prettier** - Traditional, highly configurable\n\n**What you get:**\n- Linting and formatting\n- TypeScript strict mode\n- Vitest for testing\n- Package.json scripts\n\n→ **See:** [references/typescript.md](references/typescript.md)\n\n### Rust Project\n\n**Manual setup (opinionated configs in assets/):**\n```bash\n# Tools come with Rust\nrustup component add rustfmt clippy\n\n# Optional: Enhanced tooling\nbrew install cargo-nextest cargo-deny\n\n# Copy configs from assets/configs/rust/\ncp assets/configs/rust/rustfmt.toml .\ncp assets/configs/rust/clippy.toml .\n```\n\n→ **See:** [references/rust.md](references/rust.md)\n\n### Python Project\n\n**Using uv (recommended):**\n```bash\n# Install uv\nbrew install uv\n\n# Create project\nuv init my-project\ncd my-project\n\n# Add dev dependencies\nuv add --dev ruff mypy pytest\n\n# Copy config from assets/\ncp assets/configs/python/pyproject.toml .\n```\n\n→ **See:** [references/python.md](references/python.md)\n\n### Monorepo Setup\n\n**Create Nx + pnpm monorepo:**\n```bash\n./scripts/init_monorepo.sh\n```\n\nOr manually:\n```bash\nnpx create-nx-workspace@latest my-monorepo\n# Choose: pnpm + integrated monorepo\n```\n\n→ **See:** [references/monorepo.md](references/monorepo.md)\n\n---\n\n## Workflow Decision Tree\n\n### 1. Choose Project Type\n\n**Single Language Project**\n→ Use language-specific init script or manual setup\n→ See Quick Start above\n\n**Monorepo (Multiple Packages)**\n→ Set up Nx + pnpm workspaces\n→ See [references/monorepo.md](references/monorepo.md)\n\n### 2. Configure Git Hooks\n\n**Automated setup:**\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_lefthook.sh\n```\n\nThis configures:\n- **commit-msg** - Conventional commits validation\n- **pre-commit** - Format and lint staged files\n- **pre-push** - Full validation (lint, type-check, test, build)\n\n→ **See:** [references/git-hooks.md](references/git-hooks.md)\n\n### 3. Set Up CI/CD\n\n**Copy workflow templates:**\n```bash\n# Basic CI\ncp assets/workflows/ci.yml .github/workflows/\n\n# Language-specific workflows available in assets/\n```\n\n→ **See:** [references/ci-cd.md](references/ci-cd.md)\n\n### 4. Configure Publishing (Optional)\n\n**For npm packages:**\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_changesets.sh\n```\n\nThen copy publishing workflows from `assets/workflows/`.\n\n→ **See:**\n- [references/version-management.md](references/version-management.md)\n- [references/publishing.md](references/publishing.md)\n\n---\n\n## Language-Specific Guides\n\n### TypeScript/JavaScript\n\n**Tooling options:**\n- **Biome** - Fast, opinionated, all-in-one (recommended for new projects)\n- **ESLint + Prettier** - Traditional, highly configurable (recommended for existing projects)\n\n**Testing:**\n- **Vitest** - Modern, fast, Vite-based (recommended)\n- **Jest** - Established, widely used\n\n**Key decisions:**\n- Choose Biome for speed and simplicity\n- Choose ESLint+Prettier for existing projects or specific plugins\n\n→ **Full guide:** [references/typescript.md](references/typescript.md)\n\n### Rust\n\n**Built-in tools:**\n- `rustfmt` - Code formatting\n- `clippy` - Linting\n- `cargo test` - Testing\n\n**Enhanced tools:**\n- `cargo-nextest` - Faster test runner\n- `cargo-deny` - Dependency security\n- `cargo-make` - Task runner\n\n→ **Full guide:** [references/rust.md](references/rust.md)\n\n### Python\n\n**Modern stack (recommended):**\n- **uv** - Fast package manager\n- **ruff** - Fast linting + formatting (replaces black, isort, flake8)\n- **mypy** - Type checking\n- **pytest** - Testing\n\n→ **Full guide:** [references/python.md](references/python.md)\n\n---\n\n## Git Hooks with lefthook\n\n### Why lefthook?\n\n- **Language-agnostic** - Works across TS, Rust, Python\n- **Fast** - Parallel execution, written in Go\n- **Simple** - Single YAML config\n- **Better than Husky** - Faster, works across languages\n\n### Setup\n\n**Automated:**\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_lefthook.sh\n```\n\n**Manual:**\n```bash\nbrew install lefthook\nlefthook install\n```\n\n### Configuration Example\n\n**lefthook.yml:**\n```yaml\ncommit-msg:\n  commands:\n    commitlint:\n      run: npx commitlint --edit {1}\n\npre-commit:\n  parallel: true\n  commands:\n    format:\n      glob: \"*.{ts,rs,py}\"\n      run: format-staged-files {staged_files}\n      stage_fixed: true\n\npre-push:\n  commands:\n    validate:\n      run: ./scripts/validate_all.sh\n```\n\n→ **Full guide:** [references/git-hooks.md](references/git-hooks.md)\n\n---\n\n## Monorepo Management\n\n### Nx + pnpm Workspaces\n\n**Key principle:** Nx builds on top of pnpm, doesn''t replace it.\n\n- **pnpm workspaces** - Dependency management\n- **Nx** - Task orchestration, caching, affected commands\n\n### Benefits\n\n- Run tasks only for affected packages\n- Intelligent caching\n- Parallel execution\n- Supports multiple languages\n\n### Common Commands\n\n```bash\n# Run target for all packages\nnx run-many --target=build --all\n\n# Run only for affected\nnx affected --target=test\n\n# Visualize dependencies\nnx graph\n```\n\n→ **Full guide:** [references/monorepo.md](references/monorepo.md)\n\n---\n\n## Version Management & Publishing\n\n### Changesets Workflow\n\n**Recommended for monorepos and npm packages.**\n\n1. **Add changeset:**\n```bash\npnpm changeset\n# Select packages, type (major/minor/patch), write summary\n```\n\n2. **Version packages:**\n```bash\npnpm changeset version\n# Updates package.json, generates CHANGELOG.md\n```\n\n3. **Publish:**\n```bash\npnpm changeset publish\ngit push --follow-tags\n```\n\n### Automated Publishing\n\nUse GitHub Actions to automate releases:\n\n**Copy workflow:**\n```bash\ncp assets/workflows/publish-changesets.yml .github/workflows/\n```\n\nThis creates \"Version Packages\" PR on main when changesets exist.\n\n→ **See:**\n- [references/version-management.md](references/version-management.md)\n- [references/publishing.md](references/publishing.md)\n\n---\n\n## CI/CD Setup\n\n### Match Local Validation\n\n**Best practice:** Run same checks in CI as local pre-push hook.\n\n**GitHub Actions templates:**\n- `ci.yml` - Basic linting, testing, building\n- `publish-npm.yml` - Automated npm publishing\n- `publish-crates.yml` - Automated crates.io publishing\n- `publish-pypi.yml` - Automated PyPI publishing\n\n### Matrix Testing\n\nTest across multiple versions:\n\n```yaml\nstrategy:\n  matrix:\n    node-version: [18, 20, 21]\n    os: [ubuntu-latest, macos-latest]\n```\n\n### Nx Monorepo CI\n\nUse affected commands to only test changed packages:\n\n```bash\nnx affected --target=test\nnx affected --target=build\n```\n\n→ **Full guide:** [references/ci-cd.md](references/ci-cd.md)\n\n---\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Initialize TypeScript Project\n\n**Automated:**\n```bash\n./scripts/init_typescript.sh --biome\n# or\n./scripts/init_typescript.sh --eslint-prettier\n```\n\n**Creates:**\n- tsconfig.json (strict mode)\n- Linting config (biome.json or eslint.config.js)\n- Formatting config (.prettierrc.json if ESLint)\n- Testing config (vitest.config.ts)\n- Package.json scripts\n\n### Set Up Git Hooks\n\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_lefthook.sh\n```\n\n**Configures:**\n- Conventional commits validation\n- Pre-commit: lint/format staged files\n- Pre-push: full validation\n\n### Configure Changesets\n\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_changesets.sh\n```\n\n**Sets up:**\n- .changeset/ directory\n- Package.json scripts\n- Public access configuration\n\n### Full Validation\n\n```bash\n./scripts/validate_all.sh\n```\n\n**Runs:**\n- Format checking\n- Linting\n- Type checking\n- Tests\n- Builds\n\n---\n\n## Bundled Resources\n\n### Scripts (`scripts/`)\n\n**Setup scripts:**\n- `init_typescript.sh` - Initialize TypeScript project\n- `setup_lefthook.sh` - Configure Git hooks\n- `setup_changesets.sh` - Set up version management\n- `validate_all.sh` - Run all checks (used by pre-push)\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n./scripts/script_name.sh\n```\n\nAll scripts check if tools are installed/up-to-date before proceeding.\n\n### Config Templates (`assets/configs/`)\n\n**TypeScript:**\n- `tsconfig.strict.json` - Strict TypeScript config\n- `biome.json` - Biome configuration\n- `eslint.config.js` - ESLint flat config\n- `.prettierrc.json` - Prettier configuration\n\n**Rust:**\n- `rustfmt.toml` - Rustfmt configuration\n- `clippy.toml` - Clippy lints\n- `deny.toml` - Cargo-deny configuration\n\n**Python:**\n- `pyproject.toml` - ruff, mypy, pytest config\n- `ruff.toml` - Standalone ruff config\n\n**Monorepo:**\n- `nx.json` - Nx configuration\n- `pnpm-workspace.yaml` - pnpm workspaces\n\n**Git Hooks:**\n- `lefthook.yml` - Complete lefthook config\n- `commitlint.config.js` - Conventional commits\n\n**GitHub Workflows:**\n- `ci.yml` - Basic CI\n- `publish-changesets.yml` - Automated releases\n- `publish-npm.yml` - npm publishing\n- `publish-crates.yml` - crates.io publishing\n- `publish-pypi.yml` - PyPI publishing\n\n### Reference Documentation (`references/`)\n\n**Language guides:**\n- `typescript.md` - ESLint+Prettier vs Biome, testing, monorepo\n- `rust.md` - rustfmt, clippy, cargo-nextest, cargo-deny\n- `python.md` - ruff, mypy, pytest, uv vs poetry\n\n**Infrastructure:**\n- `monorepo.md` - Nx + pnpm workspaces setup\n- `git-hooks.md` - lefthook configuration\n- `ci-cd.md` - GitHub Actions workflows\n- `publishing.md` - npm, crates.io, PyPI publishing\n- `version-management.md` - Changesets workflow\n\n---\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use lefthook over Husky** - Faster, language-agnostic\n2. **Match CI and local** - Same checks in pre-push and CI\n3. **Choose Biome for new TS projects** - Faster, simpler\n4. **Use Nx affected commands** - Only test changed packages\n5. **Automate versioning** - Use Changesets for npm packages\n6. **Conventional commits** - Enables automated changelogs\n7. **Pre-commit: staged files** - Fast feedback\n8. **Pre-push: full validation** - Catch issues before pushing\n9. **Type-check everything** - TypeScript, mypy, clippy\n10. **Test before publish** - Always run tests in pre-publish\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Hooks Not Running\n\n**Check installation:**\n```bash\nlefthook install\nls -la .git/hooks/\n```\n\n**Test manually:**\n```bash\nlefthook run pre-commit\n```\n\n### Format Conflicts\n\n**ESLint + Prettier conflicts:**\n- Ensure `eslint-config-prettier` is last in config\n- Run Prettier separately from ESLint\n\n**Biome + Prettier conflicts:**\n- Don''t use both - choose one\n- Biome is drop-in Prettier replacement\n\n### CI Failures\n\n**Debugging:**\n1. Run `./scripts/validate_all.sh` locally\n2. Check CI runs same commands\n3. Verify Node/Rust/Python versions match\n4. Check caching is working\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Setup new TypeScript project:**\n```bash\n./scripts/init_typescript.sh\n```\n\n**Setup Git hooks:**\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_lefthook.sh\n```\n\n**Setup Changesets:**\n```bash\n./scripts/setup_changesets.sh\n```\n\n**Run full validation:**\n```bash\n./scripts/validate_all.sh\n```\n\n**Common commands:**\n```bash\n# TypeScript\nnpm run lint && npm run type-check && npm test\n\n# Rust\ncargo fmt -- --check && cargo clippy -- -D warnings && cargo test\n\n# Python\nruff check . && mypy . && pytest\n\n# Monorepo\nnx affected --target=test\nnx run-many --target=build --all\n\n# Changesets\npnpm changeset\npnpm changeset version\npnpm changeset publish\n```\n\n---\n\n## Getting Help\n\n- **TypeScript:** See [references/typescript.md](references/typescript.md)\n- **Rust:** See [references/rust.md](references/rust.md)\n- **Python:** See [references/python.md](references/python.md)\n- **Monorepo:** See [references/monorepo.md](references/monorepo.md)\n- **Git Hooks:** See [references/git-hooks.md](references/git-hooks.md)\n- **CI/CD:** See [references/ci-cd.md](references/ci-cd.md)\n- **Publishing:** See [references/publishing.md](references/publishing.md) and [references/version-management.md](references/version-management.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:58:47.899Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing comprehensive project initialization with linting, formatting, and CI/CD pipeline setup.","zh":"非常适合需要全面项目初始化的开发代理，包括linting、格式化和CI/CD pipeline设置。","ja":"開発エージェントが包括的なプロジェクト初期化を必要とする場合に最適です。linting、フォーマット、およびCI/CDパイプラインの設定が含まれます。","ko":"개발 에이전트가 포괄적인 프로젝트 초기화가 필요한 경우에 적합합니다. 린팅, 형식 지정 및 CI/CD 파이프라인 설정이 포함됩니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una inicialización de proyecto integral con linting, formato y configuración de la canalización de CI/CD.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant une initialisation de projet complète avec du linting, un formatage et une configuration de pipeline CI/CD.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine umfassende Projektinitialisierung mit Linting, Formatierung und CI/CD-Pipeline-Setup benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de inicialização de projeto abrangente com linting, formatação e configuração de pipeline CI/CD.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходима комплексная инициализация проекта с проверкой кода, форматированием и настройкой конвейера CI/CD.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تهيئة مشروع شاملة مع linting وتنسيق وضبط трубة CI/CD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline project setup with automated Git hooks using lefthook, GitHub Actions for CI/CD, and publishing to npm/crat, while supporting TypeScript, Rust, and Python projects with Nx + pnpm workspaces.","zh":"赋予代理人使用lefthook实现自动化Git钩子、GitHub Actions实现CI/CD、并发布到npm/crat的能力，同时支持使用Nx + pnpm工作区的TypeScript、Rust和Python项目。","ja":"lefthookを使用した自動Gitフック、GitHub Actionsを使用したCI/CD、npm/cratへのパブリッシュを可能にし、Nx + pnpmワークスペースを使用したTypeScript、Rust、Pythonプロジェクトをサポートします。","ko":"lefthook를 사용한 자동화된 Git 훅, GitHub Actions를 사용한 CI/CD, npm/crat에 대한 게시를 가능하게 하며, Nx + pnpm 워크스페이스를 사용한 TypeScript, Rust, Python 프로젝트를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a simplificar la configuración del proyecto con ganchos de Git automatizados utilizando lefthook, GitHub Actions para CI/CD y publicación en npm/crat, mientras admite proyectos de TypeScript, Rust y Python con Nx + pnpm workspaces.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rationaliser la configuration du projet avec des crochets Git automatisés en utilisant lefthook, GitHub Actions pour CI/CD et publication sur npm/crat, tout en prenant en charge des projets TypeScript, Rust et Python avec Nx + pnpm workspaces.","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, die Projektkonfiguration mit automatisierten Git-Hooks unter Verwendung von lefthook, GitHub Actions für CI/CD und Veröffentlichung auf npm/crat zu rationalisieren, während es Projekte in TypeScript, Rust und Python mit Nx + pnpm-Arbeitsbereichen unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a simplificar a configuração do projeto com ganchos automatizados do Git usando lefthook, GitHub Actions para CI/CD e publicação para npm/crat, ao mesmo tempo em que suporta projetos TypeScript, Rust e Python com Nx + pnpm workspaces.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью упростить настройку проекта с помощью автоматических хуков Git с использованием lefthook, GitHub Actions для CI/CD и публикации в npm/crat, при этом поддерживая проекты TypeScript, Rust и Python с Nx + pnpm workspaces.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تبسيط إعداد المشروع باستخدام-hooks تلقائي ل-Git باستخدام lefthook و-actions GitHub من أجل CI/CD ونشر إلى npm/crat، مع دعم مشاريع TypeScript و-Rust و-Python مع Nx + pnpm workspaces."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing monorepo projects with Nx and pnpm workspaces","Configuring automated testing and linting for TypeScript, Rust, and Python","Setting up CI/CD pipelines with GitHub Actions for streamlined project deployment"],"zh":["使用Nx和pnpm工作区初始化monorepo项目","为TypeScript、Rust和Python配置自动化测试和linting","使用GitHub Actions设置CI/CD管道以实现流畅的项目部署"],"ja":["Nxとpnpmワークスペースを使用したmonorepoプロジェクトの初期化","TypeScript、Rust、Pythonの自動テストとlintingの構成","GitHub Actionsを使用したCI/CDパイプラインの設定によるプロジェクトのスムーズなデプロイ"],"ko":["Nx와 pnpm 워크스페이스를 사용한 모노레포 프로젝트 초기화","TypeScript, Rust, Python을 위한 자동화된 테스트 및 린팅 구성","GitHub Actions를 사용한 CI/CD 파이프라인 설정을 통한 프로젝트의 원활한 배포"],"es":["Inicialización de proyectos monorepo con Nx y pnpm workspaces","Configuración de pruebas y linting automatizadas para TypeScript, Rust y Python","Configuración de canalizaciones de CI/CD con GitHub Actions para una implementación de proyecto simplificada"],"fr":["Initialisation de projets monorepo avec Nx et pnpm workspaces","Configuration de tests et de linting automatisés pour TypeScript, Rust et Python","Configuration de pipelines CI/CD avec GitHub Actions pour un déploiement de projet rationalisé"],"de":["Initialisierung von Monorepo-Projekten mit Nx und pnpm-Arbeitsbereichen","Konfiguration von automatisiertem Testen und Linting für TypeScript, Rust und Python","Einrichtung von CI/CD-Pipelines mit GitHub Actions für eine rationalisierte Projektbereitstellung"],"pt":["Inicializando projetos monorepo com Nx e pnpm workspaces","Configurando testes automatizados e linting para TypeScript, Rust e Python","Configurando pipelines CI/CD com GitHub Actions para implantação de projeto simplificada"],"ru":["Инициализация проектов монорепозитория с помощью Nx и pnpm workspaces","Настройка автоматизированного тестирования и проверки кода для TypeScript, Rust и Python","Настройка конвейеров CI/CD с помощью GitHub Actions для упрощенного развертывания проекта"],"ar":["تهيئة مشاريع monorepo مع Nx و pnpm workspaces","تهيئة الاختبارات التلقائية و-linting لمشاريع TypeScript و-Rust و-Python","تهيئة труб CI/CD مع actions GitHub من أجل نشر مشروع مبسط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git and GitHub Actions setup","Limited to TypeScript, Rust, and Python projects","Needs pnpm and Nx for monorepo support"],"zh":["需要Git和GitHub Actions设置","仅限TypeScript、Rust和Python项目","需要pnpm和Nx以支持monorepo"],"ja":["GitとGitHub Actionsの設定が必要","TypeScript、Rust、Pythonプロジェクトのみ対応","monorepoをサポートするためにpnpmとNxが必要"],"ko":["Git 및 GitHub Actions 설정이 필요","TypeScript, Rust, Python 프로젝트만 해당","모노레포를 지원하기 위해 pnpm 및 Nx가 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Git y GitHub Actions","Limitado a proyectos de TypeScript, Rust y Python","Necesita pnpm y Nx para compatibilidad con monorepo"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Git et de GitHub Actions","Limité aux projets TypeScript, Rust et Python","Nécessite pnpm et Nx pour la prise en charge de monorepo"],"de":["Erfordert Git- und GitHub-Actions-Setup","Begrenzt auf TypeScript-, Rust- und Python-Projekte","Benötigt pnpm und Nx für Monorepo-Unterstützung"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Git e GitHub Actions","Limitado a projetos TypeScript, Rust e Python","Necessita pnpm e Nx para suporte a monorepo"],"ru":["Требует настройки Git и GitHub Actions","Ограничен проектами TypeScript, Rust и Python","Требует pnpm и Nx для поддержки монорепозитория"],"ar":["يتطلب تهيئة Git و-actions GitHub","محدود بمشاريع TypeScript و-Rust و-Python","يحتاج إلى pnpm و-Nx لدعم monorepo"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
