nd","проверка UI","создание скриншотов","осмотр журналов"],"ar":["تجربة تطبيقات الويب","playwright","أتمتة الاختبارات","تحديد الأخطاء في تطبيقات الويب","اختبار واجهة المستخدم","التحقق من سلوك واجهة المستخدم","التقاط الشاشات","فحص سجلات وحدة التحكم"]}},"owner":"schuttpj","repo":"next15-template-pjs","repoPath":"schuttpj/next15-template-pjs","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.414Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"webapp-testing","description":"Toolkit for interacting with and testing local web applications using Playwright. Supports verifying frontend functionality, debugging UI behavior, capturing browser screenshots, and viewing browser logs.","bodyPreview":"# Web Application Testing\n\nThis skill enables comprehensive testing and debugging of local web applications using Playwright automation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Test frontend functionality in a real browser\n- Verify UI behavior and interactions\n- Debug web application issues\n- Capture screenshots for documentation or debugging\n- Inspect browser console logs\n- Validate form submissions and user flows\n- Check responsive design across viewports\n\n## Prerequisit","body":"# Web Application Testing\n\nThis skill enables comprehensive testing and debugging of local web applications using Playwright automation.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Test frontend functionality in a real browser\n- Verify UI behavior and interactions\n- Debug web application issues\n- Capture screenshots for documentation or debugging\n- Inspect browser console logs\n- Validate form submissions and user flows\n- Check responsive design across viewports\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Node.js installed on the system\n- A locally running web application (or accessible URL)\n- Playwright will be installed automatically if not present\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n### 1. Browser Automation\n- Navigate to URLs\n- Click buttons and links\n- Fill form fields\n- Select dropdowns\n- Handle dialogs and alerts\n\n### 2. Verification\n- Assert element presence\n- Verify text content\n- Check element visibility\n- Validate URLs\n- Test responsive behavior\n\n### 3. Debugging\n- Capture screenshots\n- View console logs\n- Inspect network requests\n- Debug failed tests\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n### Example 1: Basic Navigation Test\n```javascript\n// Navigate to a page and verify title\nawait page.goto(''http://localhost:3000'');\nconst title = await page.title();\nconsole.log(''Page title:'', title);\n```\n\n### Example 2: Form Interaction\n```javascript\n// Fill out and submit a form\nawait page.fill(''#username'', ''testuser'');\nawait page.fill(''#password'', ''password123'');\nawait page.click(''button[type=\"submit\"]'');\nawait page.waitForURL(''**/dashboard'');\n```\n\n### Example 3: Screenshot Capture\n```javascript\n// Capture a screenshot for debugging\nawait page.screenshot({ path: ''debug.png'', fullPage: true });\n```\n\n## Guidelines\n\n1. **Always verify the app is running** - Check that the local server is accessible before running tests\n2. **Use explicit waits** - Wait for elements or navigation to complete before interacting\n3. **Capture screenshots on failure** - Take screenshots to help debug issues\n4. **Clean up resources** - Always close the browser when done\n5. **Handle timeouts gracefully** - Set reasonable timeouts for slow operations\n6. **Test incrementally** - Start with simple interactions before complex flows\n7. **Use selectors wisely** - Prefer data-testid or role-based selectors over CSS classes\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Pattern: Wait for Element\n```javascript\nawait page.waitForSelector(''#element-id'', { state: ''visible'' });\n```\n\n### Pattern: Check if Element Exists\n```javascript\nconst exists = await page.locator(''#element-id'').count() > 0;\n```\n\n### Pattern: Get Console Logs\n```javascript\npage.on(''console'', msg => console.log(''Browser log:'', msg.text()));\n```\n\n### Pattern: Handle Errors\n```javascript\ntry {\n  await page.click(''#button'');\n} catch (error) {\n  await page.screenshot({ path: ''error.png'' });\n  throw error;\n}\n```\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Requires Node.js environment\n- Cannot test native mobile apps (use React Native Testing Library instead)\n- May have issues with complex authentication flows\n- Some modern frameworks may require specific configuration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:58:44.598Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for QA Automation Agents needing browser-based testing and debugging capabilities for web applications.","zh":"非常适合需要基于浏览器的测试和调试功能的QA自动化代理，用于测试Web应用程序。","ja":"Webアプリケーションに対するブラウザベースのテストおよびデバッグ機能を必要とするQA自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"웹 애플리케이션에 대한 브라우저 기반 테스트 및 디버깅 기능이 필요한 QA 자동화 에이전트에게 최적입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de automatización de QA que necesitan capacidades de prueba y depuración basadas en navegador para aplicaciones web.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''automatisation de QA ayant besoin de capacités de test et de débogage basées sur le navigateur pour les applications Web.","de":"Perfekt für QA-Automatisierungsagenten, die Browser-basierte Test- und Debugging-Funktionen für Webanwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for QA Automation Agents needing browser-based testing and debugging capabilities for web applications.","ru":"Perfect for QA Automation Agents needing browser-based testing and debugging capabilities for web applications.","ar":"Perfect for QA Automation Agents needing browser-based testing and debugging capabilities for web applications."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables comprehensive end-to-end testing of local web applications using Playwright automation, providing real browser interaction, UI behavior verification, and detailed debugging through console log inspection and screenshot capture.","zh":"通过Playwright自动化提供对本地Web应用程序的全面端到端测试，实现真正的浏览器交互、UI行为验证以及通过控制台日志检查和截图捕获的详细调试。","ja":"Playwright自動化を使用して、ローカルWebアプリケーションに対する包括的なエンドツーエンドテストを提供し、実際のブラウザ相互作用、UI動作の検証、およびコンソールログの検査とスクリーンショットのキャプチャを介した詳細なデバッグを実現します。","ko":"Playwright 자동화를 통해 로컬 웹 애플리케이션에 대한 종합적인 엔드 투 엔드 테스트를 제공하며, 실제 브라우저 상호 작용, UI 동작 검증 및 콘솔 로그 검사와 스크린샷 캡처를 통해 자세한 디버깅을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite pruebas integrales de extremo a extremo de aplicaciones web locales mediante la automatización de Playwright, proporcionando interacción real del navegador, verificación del comportamiento de la interfaz de usuario y depuración detallada a través de la inspección del registro de la consola y la captura de pantallas.","fr":"Permet des tests complets de bout en bout d''applications Web locales à l''aide de l''automatisation Playwright, fournissant une interaction réelle du navigateur, une vérification du comportement de l''interface utilisateur et un débogage détaillé via l''inspection du journal de la console et la capture d''écran.","de":"Ermöglicht umfassende End-to-End-Tests lokaler Webanwendungen mithilfe der Playwright-Automatisierung, die eine reale Browserinteraktion, Überprüfung des Benutzeroberflächenverhaltens und detaillierte Fehlersuche durch Konsolenlog-Inspektion und Screenshot-Erfassung bietet.","pt":"Enables comprehensive end-to-end testing of local web applications using Playwright automation, providing real browser interaction, UI behavior verification, and detailed debugging through console log inspection and screenshot capture.","ru":"Enables comprehensive end-to-end testing of local web applications using Playwright automation, providing real browser interaction, UI behavior verification, and detailed debugging through console log inspection and screenshot capture.","ar":"Enables comprehensive end-to-end testing of local web applications using Playwright automation, providing real browser interaction, UI behavior verification, and detailed debugging through console log inspection and screenshot capture."},"useCases":{"en":["Testing frontend functionality in real browsers","Debugging web application issues through console logs","Validating form submissions and user flows","Capturing screenshots for documentation","Checking responsive design across multiple viewports"],"zh":["在真实浏览器中测试前端功能","通过控制台日志调试Web应用程序问题","验证表单提交和用户流程","捕获截图用于文档记录","检查多个视口中的响应式设计"],"ja":["実際のブラウザでフロントエンド機能をテストする","コンソールログを使用してWebアプリケーションの問題をデバッグする","フォームの提出とユーザーフローを検証する","ドキュメント記録用のスクリーンショットをキャプチャする","複数のビューポートでのレスポンシブデザインを確認する"],"ko":["실제 브라우저에서 프론트엔드 기능을 테스트한다","콘솔 로그를 통해 웹 애플리케이션 문제를 디버깅한다","폼 제출 및 사용자 흐름을 검증한다","문서화에 사용할 스크린샷을 캡처한다","여러 뷰포트에서 반응형 디자인을 확인한다"],"es":["Prueba de funcionalidad del frontend en navegadores reales","Depuración de problemas de aplicaciones web a través de registros de consola","Validación de envíos de formularios y flujos de usuario","Captura de pantallas para documentación","Comprobación de diseño receptivo en varios puntos de vista"],"fr":["Test de la fonctionnalité du frontend dans des navigateurs réels","Débogage des problèmes d''applications Web via les journaux de la console","Validation des envois de formulaires et des flux d''utilisateurs","Capture d''écran pour la documentation","Vérification de la conception réactive sur plusieurs points de vue"],"de":["Testen der Frontend-Funktionalität in realen Browsern","Fehlersuche bei Webanwendungsproblemen über Konsolenlogs","Validierung von Formulareingaben und Benutzerflüssen","Erfassung von Screenshots für die Dokumentation","Überprüfung des responsiven Designs auf verschiedenen Ansichtsbereichen"],"pt":["Testing frontend functionality in real browsers","Debugging web application issues through console logs","Validating form submissions and user flows","Capturing screenshots for documentation","Checking responsive design across multiple viewports"],"ru":["Testing frontend functionality in real browsers","Debugging web application issues through console logs","Validating form submissions and user flows","Capturing screenshots for documentation","Checking responsive design across multiple viewports"],"ar":["Testing frontend functionality in real browsers","Debugging web application issues through console logs","Validating form submissions and user flows","Capturing screenshots for documentation","Checking responsive design across multiple viewports"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires local web application access","Limited to Playwright automation framework","Needs browser environment for execution"],"zh":["需要本地Web应用程序访问","仅限Playwright自动化框架","需要浏览器环境进行执行"],"ja":["ローカルWebアプリケーションへのアクセスが必要","Playwright自動化フレームワークのみ","実行にはブラウザ環境が必要"],"ko":["로컬 웹 애플리케이션에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","Playwright 자동화 프레임워크만 해당","실행을 위해 브라우저 환경이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la aplicación web local","Limitado al marco de automatización de Playwright","Necesita un entorno de navegador para la ejecución"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''application Web locale","Limité au cadre d''automatisation Playwright","Nécessite un environnement de navigateur pour l''exécution"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die lokale Webanwendung","Begrenzt auf das Playwright-Automatisierungsframework","Benötigt eine Browserumgebung für die Ausführung"],"pt":["Requires local web application access","Limited to Playwright automation framework","Needs browser environment for execution"],"ru":["Requires local web application access","Limited to Playwright automation framework","Needs browser environment for execution"],"ar":["Requires local web application access","Limited to Playwright automation framework","Needs browser environment for execution"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
