ие: Методология Исследования","ar":"البحث الفعال: منهجية البحث","en":"research"},"description":{"zh":"研究技能是指能够高效、有效地进行研究的能力，涉及研究方法、范围定义和信息评估","ja":"研究スキルとは、効率的且つ効果的に研究を行う能力を指し、研究方法、範囲の定義、情報の評価を含む","ko":"연구 스킬은 효율적이고 효과적으로 연구를 수행하는 능력을 뜻하며, 연구 방법, 범위 정의 및 정보 평가를 포함","es":"Un agente de IA especializado en investigación técnica para desarrolladores. Opera bajo los principios YAGNI, KISS y DRY, ejecutando una metodología sistemát...","fr":"Un agent IA spécialisé dans la recherche technique pour développeurs. Il opère selon les principes YAGNI, KISS et DRY, exécutant une méthodologie systématiqu...","de":"Ein KI-Agent für technische Recherche, spezialisiert auf Entwickler. Er arbeitet nach den Prinzipien YAGNI, KISS und DRY und führt eine systematische Zwei-Ph...","pt":"Nossa metodologia de pesquisa é baseada em YAGNI, KISS e DRY, garantindo uma abordagem eficiente e concisa.","ru":"Наша методология исследования основана на YAGNI, KISS и DRY, обеспечивая эффективный и краткий подход.","ar":"منهجية البحث الخاصة بنا تستند إلى YAGNI و KISS و DRY، مما يضمن نهجًا فعالًا وملخصًا.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["研究方法","范围定义","信息评估","效率提高","效果保证"],"ja":["研究方法","範囲の定義","情報の評価","効率の向上","効果の保証"],"ko":["연구 방법","범위 정의","정보 평가","효율 향상","효과 보장"],"es":["Metodología de investigación basada en principios YAGNI, KISS y DRY","Definición sistemática del alcance del proyecto","Evaluación crítica de fuentes de información técnicas","Entrega de hallazgos brutales y concisos","Enfoque en recencia y relevancia para devs","Proceso en dos fases: Definición y Recopilación"],"fr":["Méthodologie de recherche basée sur les principes YAGNI, KISS et DRY","Définition systématique du périmètre du projet","Évaluation critique des sources d''information techniques","Livraison de résultats brutaux et concis","Focus sur l''actualité et la pertinence pour les devs","Processus en deux phases : Définition et Collecte"],"de":["Forschungsmethodik basierend auf YAGNI-, KISS- und DRY-Prinzipien","Systematische Definition des Projektumfangs","Kritische Bewertung technischer Informationsquellen","Lieferung brutaler und prägnanter Ergebnisse","Fokus auf Aktualität und Relevanz für Entwickler","Zweiphasiger Prozess: Definition und Sammlung"],"pt":["Definição de escopo de pesquisa","Identificação de termos e conceitos-chave","Determinação dos requisitos de recência","Estabelecimento de critérios de avaliação de fontes","Definição de limites para a profundidade da pesquisa"],"ru":["Определение области исследования","Определение ключевых терминов и концепций","Определение требований к актуальности","Установление критериев оценки источников","Определение границ глубины исследования"],"ar":["تحديد نطاق البحث","تحديد المصطلحات والمفاهيم الرئيسية","تحديد متطلبات الحداثة","تحديد معايير تقييم المصادر","تحديد حدود عمق البحث"]},"keywords":{"zh":["研究技能","研究方法","范围定义","信息评估","效率提高","效果保证","研究工具"],"ja":["研究スキル","研究方法","範囲の定義","情報の評価","効率の向上","効果の保証","研究ツール"],"ko":["연구 스킬","연구 방법","범위 정의","정보 평가","효율 향상","효과 보장","연구 도구"],"es":["skill ia investigación técnica","metodología investigación desarrolladores","principios yagni kiss dry","definir alcance proyecto técnico","evaluar fuentes información dev","investigación concisa para devs","agente ai para programadores","recopilación información sistemática"],"fr":["skill ia recherche technique","méthodologie recherche développeurs","principes yagni kiss dry","définir périmètre projet technique","évaluer sources information dev","recherche concise pour devs","agent ai pour programmeurs","collecte information systématique"],"de":["ki skill technische recherche","forschungsmethodik entwickler","prinzipien yagni kiss dry","projektumfang definieren technisch","informationsquellen bewerten dev","prägnante recherche für entwickler","ai agent für programmierer","systematische informationsbeschaffung"],"pt":["pesquisa eficiente","metodologia de pesquisa","YAGNI","KISS","DRY","desenvolvimento de pesquisa","análise de informações"],"ru":["эффективное исследование","методология исследования","YAGNI","KISS","DRY","разработка исследования","анализ информации"],"ar":["البحث الفعال","منهجية البحث","YAGNI","KISS","DRY","تطوير البحث","تحليل المعلومات"]}},"owner":"hoanghd218","repo":"tranvanhoang.com","repoPath":"hoanghd218/tranvanhoang.com","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"research","description":"Research technical solutions, analyze architectures, gather requirements thoroughly. Use for technology evaluation, best practices research, solution design, scalability/security/maintainability analysis.","bodyPreview":"# Research\n\n## Research Methodology\n\nAlways honoring **YAGNI**, **KISS**, and **DRY** principles.\n**Be honest, be brutal, straight to the point, and be concise.**\n\n### Phase 1: Scope Definition\n\nFirst, you will clearly define the research scope by:\n- Identifying key terms and concepts to investigate\n- Determining the recency requirements (how current must information be)\n- Establishing evaluation criteria for sources\n- Setting boundaries for the research depth\n\n### Phase 2: Systematic Informatio","body":"# Research\n\n## Research Methodology\n\nAlways honoring **YAGNI**, **KISS**, and **DRY** principles.\n**Be honest, be brutal, straight to the point, and be concise.**\n\n### Phase 1: Scope Definition\n\nFirst, you will clearly define the research scope by:\n- Identifying key terms and concepts to investigate\n- Determining the recency requirements (how current must information be)\n- Establishing evaluation criteria for sources\n- Setting boundaries for the research depth\n\n### Phase 2: Systematic Information Gathering\n\nYou will employ a multi-source research strategy:\n\n1. **Search Strategy**:\n   - **Gemini Toggle**: Check `.claude/.ck.json` (or `~/.claude/.ck.json`) for `skills.research.useGemini` (default: `true`). If `false`, skip Gemini and use WebSearch.\n   - **Gemini Model**: Read from `.claude/.ck.json`: `gemini.model` (default: `gemini-3.0-flash`)\n   - If `useGemini` is enabled and `gemini` bash command is available, execute `gemini -y -m <gemini.model> \"...your search prompt...\"` bash command (timeout: 10 minutes) and save the output using `Report:` path from `## Naming` section (including all citations).\n   - If `useGemini` is disabled or `gemini` bash command is not available, use `WebSearch` tool.\n   - Run multiple `gemini` bash commands or `WebSearch` tools in parallel to search for relevant information.\n   - Craft precise search queries with relevant keywords\n   - Include terms like \"best practices\", \"2024\", \"latest\", \"security\", \"performance\"\n   - Search for official documentation, GitHub repositories, and authoritative blogs\n   - Prioritize results from recognized authorities (official docs, major tech companies, respected developers)\n   - **IMPORTANT:** You are allowed to perform at most **5 researches (max 5 tool calls)**, user might request less than this amount, **strictly respect it**, think carefully based on the task before performing each related research topic.\n\n2. **Deep Content Analysis**:\n   - When you found a potential Github repository URL, use `docs-seeker` skill to find read it.\n   - Focus on official documentation, API references, and technical specifications\n   - Analyze README files from popular GitHub repositories\n   - Review changelog and release notes for version-specific information\n\n3. **Video Content Research**:\n   - Prioritize content from official channels, recognized experts, and major conferences\n   - Focus on practical demonstrations and real-world implementations\n\n4. **Cross-Reference Validation**:\n   - Verify information across multiple independent sources\n   - Check publication dates to ensure currency\n   - Identify consensus vs. controversial approaches\n   - Note any conflicting information or debates in the community\n\n### Phase 3: Analysis and Synthesis\n\nYou will analyze gathered information by:\n- Identifying common patterns and best practices\n- Evaluating pros and cons of different approaches\n- Assessing maturity and stability of technologies\n- Recognizing security implications and performance considerations\n- Determining compatibility and integration requirements\n\n### Phase 4: Report Generation\n\n**Notes:**\n- Research reports are saved using `Report:` path from `## Naming` section.\n- If `## Naming` section is not available, ask main agent to provide the output path.\n\nYou will create a comprehensive markdown report with the following structure:\n\n```markdown\n# Research Report: [Topic]\n\n## Executive Summary\n[2-3 paragraph overview of key findings and recommendations]\n\n## Research Methodology\n- Sources consulted: [number]\n- Date range of materials: [earliest to most recent]\n- Key search terms used: [list]\n\n## Key Findings\n\n### 1. Technology Overview\n[Comprehensive description of the technology/topic]\n\n### 2. Current State & Trends\n[Latest developments, version information, adoption trends]\n\n### 3. Best Practices\n[Detailed list of recommended practices with explanations]\n\n### 4. Security Considerations\n[Security implications, vulnerabilities, and mitigation strategies]\n\n### 5. Performance Insights\n[Performance characteristics, optimization techniques, benchmarks]\n\n## Comparative Analysis\n[If applicable, comparison of different solutions/approaches]\n\n## Implementation Recommendations\n\n### Quick Start Guide\n[Step-by-step getting started instructions]\n\n### Code Examples\n[Relevant code snippets with explanations]\n\n### Common Pitfalls\n[Mistakes to avoid and their solutions]\n\n## Resources & References\n\n### Official Documentation\n- [Linked list of official docs]\n\n### Recommended Tutorials\n- [Curated list with descriptions]\n\n### Community Resources\n- [Forums, Discord servers, Stack Overflow tags]\n\n### Further Reading\n- [Advanced topics and deep dives]\n\n## Appendices\n\n### A. Glossary\n[Technical terms and definitions]\n\n### B. Version Compatibility Matrix\n[If applicable]\n\n### C. Raw Research Notes\n[Optional: detailed notes from research process]\n```\n\n## Quality Standards\n\nYou will ensure all research meets these criteria:\n- **Accuracy**: Information is verified across multiple sources\n- **Currency**: Prioritize information from the last 12 months unless historical context is needed\n- **Completeness**: Cover all aspects requested by the user\n- **Actionability**: Provide practical, implementable recommendations\n- **Clarity**: Use clear language, define technical terms, provide examples\n- **Attribution**: Always cite sources and provide links for verification\n\n## Special Considerations\n\n- When researching security topics, always check for recent CVEs and security advisories\n- For performance-related research, look for benchmarks and real-world case studies\n- When investigating new technologies, assess community adoption and support levels\n- For API documentation, verify endpoint availability and authentication requirements\n- Always note deprecation warnings and migration paths for older technologies\n\n## Output Requirements\n\nYour final report must:\n1. Be saved using the `Report:` path from `## Naming` section with a descriptive filename\n2. Include a timestamp of when the research was conducted\n3. Provide clear section navigation with a table of contents for longer reports\n4. Use code blocks with appropriate syntax highlighting\n5. Include diagrams or architecture descriptions where helpful (in mermaid or ASCII art)\n6. Conclude with specific, actionable next steps\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Sacrifice grammar for the sake of concision when writing reports.\n**IMPORTANT:** In reports, list any unresolved questions at the end, if any.\n\n**Remember:** You are not just collecting information, but providing strategic technical intelligence that enables informed decision-making. Your research should anticipate follow-up questions and provide comprehensive coverage of the topic while remaining focused and practical."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:59:04.905Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Knowledge Agents needing structured information gathering and analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化信息收集和分析能力的知识代理。","ja":"構造化された情報の収集と分析能力が必要なナレッジエージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 정보 수집 및 분석 기능이 필요한 지식 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Conocimiento que necesitan capacidades de recopilación y análisis de información estructurada.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Connaissance ayant besoin de capacités de collecte et d''analyse d''informations structurées.","de":"Perfekt für Wissensagenten, die strukturierte Informationsbeschaffungs- und Analysefähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conhecimento que necessitam de capacidades de coleta e análise de informações estruturadas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов знаний, которым необходимы возможности структурированного сбора и анализа информации.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المعرفيين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات جمع ومحللات المعلومات المنظمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct systematic research using YAGNI, KISS, and DRY principles, evaluating sources based on recency requirements and predefined criteria, and analyzing information with concise and honest insights.","zh":"赋予代理进行系统化研究的能力，使用YAGNI、KISS和DRY原则，根据最近性要求和预定义标准评估来源，并以简洁和诚实的见解分析信息。","ja":"YAGNI、KISS、DRY原則を使用して、最近性の要件や事前の基準に基づいて情報源を評価し、簡潔で誠実な洞察で情報を分析するための体系的なリサーチを行うエージェントの能力を実現します。","ko":"YAGNI, KISS, DRY 원칙을 사용하여 최근성 요구 사항 및 사전 정의된 기준에 따라 정보원을 평가하고, 간결하고誠實한 통찰력으로 정보를 분석하여 체계적인 연구를 수행할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar investigaciones sistemáticas utilizando los principios YAGNI, KISS y DRY, evaluando fuentes en función de los requisitos de actualidad y criterios preestablecidos, y analizando la información con conocimientos concisos y honestos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mener des recherches systématiques en utilisant les principes YAGNI, KISS et DRY, en évaluant les sources en fonction des exigences de récence et des critères prédéfinis, et en analysant les informations avec des connaissances concises et honnêtes.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, systematische Recherchen unter Verwendung der YAGNI-, KISS- und DRY-Prinzipien durchzuführen, Quellen basierend auf Aktualitätsanforderungen und vordefinierten Kriterien zu bewerten und Informationen mit präzisen und ehrlichen Erkenntnissen zu analysieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar pesquisas sistemáticas usando os princípios YAGNI, KISS e DRY, avaliando fontes com base em requisitos de recência e critérios pré-definidos, e analisando informações com insights concisos e honestos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить систематические исследования, используя принципы YAGNI, KISS и DRY, оценивая источники на основе требований к актуальности и предопределенных критериев, и анализируя информацию с краткими и честными выводами.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إجراء بحوث منهجية باستخدام مبادئ YAGNI و KISS و DRY، وتقييم المصادر بناءً على متطلبات الحداثة والمعايير المحددة مسبقًا، وتحليل المعلومات مع رؤى موجزة وصدق."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining research scopes for key terms and concepts","Evaluating source credibility based on recency and criteria","Conducting phased research with clear boundaries and depth"],"zh":["定义关键词和概念的研究范围","根据最近性和标准评估信息源的可信度","进行有明确边界和深度的阶段性研究"],"ja":["重要な用語や概念のリサーチスコープを定義する","最近性や基準に基づいて情報源の信頼性を評価する","明確な境界や深度を持った段階的なリサーチを行う"],"ko":["중요한 용어 및 개념의 연구 범위 정의","최근성 및 기준에 따른 정보원의 신뢰도 평가","明確한 경계 및 깊이를 갖춘 단계적인 연구 수행"],"es":["Definir alcances de investigación para términos y conceptos clave","Evaluar la credibilidad de las fuentes en función de la actualidad y los criterios","Realizar investigaciones por fases con límites y profundidad claros"],"fr":["Définir les périmètres de recherche pour les termes et les concepts clés","Évaluer la crédibilité des sources en fonction de la récence et des critères","Mener des recherches par phases avec des limites et une profondeur claires"],"de":["Forschungsumfänge für Schlüsselbegriffe und Konzepte definieren","Bewerten der Quellen aufgrund von Aktualität und Kriterien","Durchführen von Phasenforschung mit klaren Grenzen und Tiefe"],"pt":["Definir escopos de pesquisa para termos e conceitos-chave","Avaliar a credibilidade das fontes com base na recência e nos critérios","Realizar pesquisas faseadas com limites e profundidade claros"],"ru":["Определение объемов исследований для ключевых терминов и понятий","Оценка достоверности источников на основе актуальности и критериев","Проведение фазовых исследований с четкими границами и глубиной"],"ar":["تحديد نطاق البحث لمصطلحات ومفاهيم رئيسية","تقييم مصداقية المصادر بناءً على الحداثة والمعايير","إجراء بحث مرحلي مع حدود وعمق واضحين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear definition of research scope and boundaries","Dependent on quality and availability of sources"],"zh":["需要明确的研究范围和边界定义","依赖于信息源的质量和可用性"],"ja":["研究のスコープと境界の明確な定義が必要","情報源の品質や可用性に依存する"],"ko":["연구 범위 및 경계의 명확한 정의가 필요","정보원의 품질 및 가용성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una definición clara del alcance y los límites de la investigación","Depende de la calidad y disponibilidad de las fuentes"],"fr":["Nécessite une définition claire du périmètre et des limites de la recherche","Dépend de la qualité et de la disponibilité des sources"],"de":["Benötigt eine klare Definition des Forschungsumfangs und der Grenzen","Hängt von der Qualität und Verfügbarkeit der Quellen ab"],"pt":["Exige definição clara do escopo e limites da pesquisa","Depende da qualidade e disponibilidade das fontes"],"ru":["Требует четкого определения объема и границ исследований","Зависит от качества и доступности источников"],"ar":["يتطلب تعريفًا واضحًا للنطاق والحدود البحثية","يعتمد على جودة ومتاحية المصادر"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
