es y la aplicación de principios como YAGNI, KISS y DRY","fr":"Notre guide de recherche couvre la définition de la portée, l''évaluation des sources et l''application de principes tels que YAGNI, KISS et DRY","de":"Unser Forschungsleitfaden behandelt die Definition des Umfangs, die Bewertung von Quellen und die Anwendung von Prinzipien wie YAGNI, KISS und DRY","pt":"Nossa técnica de pesquisa é baseada em princípios de eficiência e simplicidade, garantindo resultados precisos e rápidos.","ru":"Наш исследовательский метод основан на принципах эффективности и простоты, гарантируя точные и быстрые результаты.","ar":"تقنية بحثنا تقوم على مبادئ الفعالية والبساطة، مما يضمن نتائج دقيقة وسريعة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["定义研究范围","系统化信息收集","评估信息来源","设定研究深度","遵循YAGNI、KISS、DRY原则"],"ja":["研究範囲の定義","体系的な情報収集","情報源の評価","研究深度の設定","YAGNI、KISS、DRY原則の遵守"],"ko":["연구 범위 정의","체계적인 정보 수집","정보 출처 평가","연구 깊이 설정","YAGNI, KISS, DRY 원칙 준수"],"es":["Definición del alcance de la investigación","Evaluación de fuentes y recencia de la información","Aplicación de principios como YAGNI, KISS y DRY","Establecimiento de criterios de evaluación","Determinación de la profundidad de la investigación"],"fr":["Définition de la portée de la recherche","Évaluation des sources et de la récence de l''information","Application de principes tels que YAGNI, KISS et DRY","Établissement de critères d''évaluation","Détermination de la profondeur de la recherche"],"de":["Definition des Umfangs der Forschung","Bewertung von Quellen und Aktualität der Informationen","Anwendung von Prinzipien wie YAGNI, KISS und DRY","Festlegung von Bewertungskriterien","Bestimmung der Tiefe der Forschung"],"pt":["Definição de escopo de pesquisa claro","Identificação de termos e conceitos-chave","Avaliação de fontes com critérios estabelecidos","Determinação da profundidade da pesquisa","Aplicação dos princípios YAGNI, KISS e DRY"],"ru":["Ясное определение области исследования","Определение ключевых терминов и понятий","Оценка источников по установленным критериям","Определение глубины исследования","Применение принципов YAGNI, KISS и DRY"],"ar":["تحديد نطاق البحث بوضوح","تحديد المصطلحات والمفاهيم الرئيسية","تقييم المصادر وفقًا للمعايير المحددة","تحديد عمق البحث","تطبيق مبادئ YAGNI و KISS و DRY"]},"keywords":{"zh":["研究技能","高效研究","研究方法","信息收集","信息评估","YAGNI","KISS","DRY"],"ja":["リサーチスキル","効率的な研究","研究方法","情報収集","情報評価","YAGNI","KISS","DRY"],"ko":["연구 스킬","효율적인 연구","연구 방법","정보 수집","정보 평가","YAGNI","KISS","DRY"],"es":["investigación efectiva","técnicas de investigación","YAGNI","KISS","DRY","evaluación de fuentes","recencia de la información"],"fr":["recherche efficace","méthodes de recherche","YAGNI","KISS","DRY","évaluation des sources","récence de l''information"],"de":["effektive Forschung","Forschungsmethoden","YAGNI","KISS","DRY","Bewertung von Quellen","Aktualität der Informationen"],"pt":["pesquisa eficiente","método de pesquisa","YAGNI","KISS","DRY","desenvolvimento de pesquisa","técnicas de pesquisa","análise de informações"],"ru":["эффективное исследование","метод исследования","YAGNI","KISS","DRY","разработка исследования","техники исследования","анализ информации"],"ar":["بحث فعال","منهج البحث","YAGNI","KISS","DRY","تنمية البحث","تقنيات البحث","تحليل المعلومات"]}},"owner":"hoanghd218","repo":"human-interior-a-Ninh","repoPath":"hoanghd218/human-interior-a-Ninh","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"research","description":"Research technical solutions, analyze architectures, gather requirements thoroughly. Use for technology evaluation, best practices research, solution design, scalability/security/maintainability analysis.","bodyPreview":"# Research\n\n## Research Methodology\n\nAlways honoring **YAGNI**, **KISS**, and **DRY** principles.\n**Be honest, be brutal, straight to the point, and be concise.**\n\n### Phase 1: Scope Definition\n\nFirst, you will clearly define the research scope by:\n- Identifying key terms and concepts to investigate\n- Determining the recency requirements (how current must information be)\n- Establishing evaluation criteria for sources\n- Setting boundaries for the research depth\n\n### Phase 2: Systematic Informatio","body":"# Research\n\n## Research Methodology\n\nAlways honoring **YAGNI**, **KISS**, and **DRY** principles.\n**Be honest, be brutal, straight to the point, and be concise.**\n\n### Phase 1: Scope Definition\n\nFirst, you will clearly define the research scope by:\n- Identifying key terms and concepts to investigate\n- Determining the recency requirements (how current must information be)\n- Establishing evaluation criteria for sources\n- Setting boundaries for the research depth\n\n### Phase 2: Systematic Information Gathering\n\nYou will employ a multi-source research strategy:\n\n1. **Search Strategy**:\n   - **Gemini Toggle**: Check `.claude/.ck.json` (or `~/.claude/.ck.json`) for `skills.research.useGemini` (default: `true`). If `false`, skip Gemini and use WebSearch.\n   - **Gemini Model**: Read from `.claude/.ck.json`: `gemini.model` (default: `gemini-3.0-flash`)\n   - If `useGemini` is enabled and `gemini` bash command is available, execute `gemini -y -m <gemini.model> \"...your search prompt...\"` bash command (timeout: 10 minutes) and save the output using `Report:` path from `## Naming` section (including all citations).\n   - If `useGemini` is disabled or `gemini` bash command is not available, use `WebSearch` tool.\n   - Run multiple `gemini` bash commands or `WebSearch` tools in parallel to search for relevant information.\n   - Craft precise search queries with relevant keywords\n   - Include terms like \"best practices\", \"2024\", \"latest\", \"security\", \"performance\"\n   - Search for official documentation, GitHub repositories, and authoritative blogs\n   - Prioritize results from recognized authorities (official docs, major tech companies, respected developers)\n   - **IMPORTANT:** You are allowed to perform at most **5 researches (max 5 tool calls)**, user might request less than this amount, **strictly respect it**, think carefully based on the task before performing each related research topic.\n\n2. **Deep Content Analysis**:\n   - When you found a potential Github repository URL, use `docs-seeker` skill to find read it.\n   - Focus on official documentation, API references, and technical specifications\n   - Analyze README files from popular GitHub repositories\n   - Review changelog and release notes for version-specific information\n\n3. **Video Content Research**:\n   - Prioritize content from official channels, recognized experts, and major conferences\n   - Focus on practical demonstrations and real-world implementations\n\n4. **Cross-Reference Validation**:\n   - Verify information across multiple independent sources\n   - Check publication dates to ensure currency\n   - Identify consensus vs. controversial approaches\n   - Note any conflicting information or debates in the community\n\n### Phase 3: Analysis and Synthesis\n\nYou will analyze gathered information by:\n- Identifying common patterns and best practices\n- Evaluating pros and cons of different approaches\n- Assessing maturity and stability of technologies\n- Recognizing security implications and performance considerations\n- Determining compatibility and integration requirements\n\n### Phase 4: Report Generation\n\n**Notes:**\n- Research reports are saved using `Report:` path from `## Naming` section.\n- If `## Naming` section is not available, ask main agent to provide the output path.\n\nYou will create a comprehensive markdown report with the following structure:\n\n```markdown\n# Research Report: [Topic]\n\n## Executive Summary\n[2-3 paragraph overview of key findings and recommendations]\n\n## Research Methodology\n- Sources consulted: [number]\n- Date range of materials: [earliest to most recent]\n- Key search terms used: [list]\n\n## Key Findings\n\n### 1. Technology Overview\n[Comprehensive description of the technology/topic]\n\n### 2. Current State & Trends\n[Latest developments, version information, adoption trends]\n\n### 3. Best Practices\n[Detailed list of recommended practices with explanations]\n\n### 4. Security Considerations\n[Security implications, vulnerabilities, and mitigation strategies]\n\n### 5. Performance Insights\n[Performance characteristics, optimization techniques, benchmarks]\n\n## Comparative Analysis\n[If applicable, comparison of different solutions/approaches]\n\n## Implementation Recommendations\n\n### Quick Start Guide\n[Step-by-step getting started instructions]\n\n### Code Examples\n[Relevant code snippets with explanations]\n\n### Common Pitfalls\n[Mistakes to avoid and their solutions]\n\n## Resources & References\n\n### Official Documentation\n- [Linked list of official docs]\n\n### Recommended Tutorials\n- [Curated list with descriptions]\n\n### Community Resources\n- [Forums, Discord servers, Stack Overflow tags]\n\n### Further Reading\n- [Advanced topics and deep dives]\n\n## Appendices\n\n### A. Glossary\n[Technical terms and definitions]\n\n### B. Version Compatibility Matrix\n[If applicable]\n\n### C. Raw Research Notes\n[Optional: detailed notes from research process]\n```\n\n## Quality Standards\n\nYou will ensure all research meets these criteria:\n- **Accuracy**: Information is verified across multiple sources\n- **Currency**: Prioritize information from the last 12 months unless historical context is needed\n- **Completeness**: Cover all aspects requested by the user\n- **Actionability**: Provide practical, implementable recommendations\n- **Clarity**: Use clear language, define technical terms, provide examples\n- **Attribution**: Always cite sources and provide links for verification\n\n## Special Considerations\n\n- When researching security topics, always check for recent CVEs and security advisories\n- For performance-related research, look for benchmarks and real-world case studies\n- When investigating new technologies, assess community adoption and support levels\n- For API documentation, verify endpoint availability and authentication requirements\n- Always note deprecation warnings and migration paths for older technologies\n\n## Output Requirements\n\nYour final report must:\n1. Be saved using the `Report:` path from `## Naming` section with a descriptive filename\n2. Include a timestamp of when the research was conducted\n3. Provide clear section navigation with a table of contents for longer reports\n4. Use code blocks with appropriate syntax highlighting\n5. Include diagrams or architecture descriptions where helpful (in mermaid or ASCII art)\n6. Conclude with specific, actionable next steps\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Sacrifice grammar for the sake of concision when writing reports.\n**IMPORTANT:** In reports, list any unresolved questions at the end, if any.\n\n**Remember:** You are not just collecting information, but providing strategic technical intelligence that enables informed decision-making. Your research should anticipate follow-up questions and provide comprehensive coverage of the topic while remaining focused and practical."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T03:59:03.608Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Knowledge Agents needing systematic information analysis and concise reporting.","zh":"非常适合需要系统信息分析和简明报告的知识代理。","ja":"知識エージェントが体系的な情報分析と簡潔な報告書を作成する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"시스템적인 정보 분석과 간결한 보고서가 필요한 지식 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Conocimiento que necesitan análisis de información sistemático y presentación de informes concisos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Connaissance ayant besoin d''une analyse d''information systématique et de rapports concis.","de":"Perfekt für Wissensagenten, die systematische Informationsanalyse und präzise Berichterstattung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conhecimento que necessitam de análise de informações sistemática e relatórios concisos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов знаний, которым необходим систематический анализ информации и краткие отчеты.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المعرفة الذي يحتاج إلى تحليل المعلومات المتسق والتقارير الموجزة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define research scopes, evaluate sources, and apply YAGNI, KISS, and DRY principles for efficient information gathering, utilizing systematic methodologies and recency requirements for accurate data.","zh":"赋予代理定义研究范围、评估来源、并应用 YAGNI、KISS 和 DRY 原则以高效地收集信息，利用系统的方法和最新要求获取准确的数据。","ja":"エージェントが研究の範囲を定義し、情報源を評価し、YAGNI、KISS、DRY の原則を適用して効率的な情報収集を行い、体系的な方法と最新の要件を使用して正確なデータを取得できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 연구 범위를 정의하고 정보 출처를 평가하며 YAGNI, KISS, DRY 원칙을 적용하여 효율적인 정보 수집을 수행하고 체계적인 방법과 최신 요구 사항을 사용하여 정확한 데이터를 얻을 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir alcances de investigación, evaluar fuentes y aplicar los principios YAGNI, KISS y DRY para una recopilación eficiente de información, utilizando metodologías sistemáticas y requisitos de actualidad para datos precisos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir les limites de la recherche, d''évaluer les sources et d''appliquer les principes YAGNI, KISS et DRY pour une collecte d''informations efficace, en utilisant des méthodologies systématiques et des exigences de récence pour des données précises.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Forschungsumfänge zu definieren, Quellen zu bewerten und die Prinzipien YAGNI, KISS und DRY für eine effiziente Informationsbeschaffung anzuwenden, unter Nutzung systematischer Methoden und Aktualitätsanforderungen für genaue Daten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir escopos de pesquisa, avaliar fontes e aplicar os princípios YAGNI, KISS e DRY para coleta eficiente de informações, utilizando metodologias sistemáticas e requisitos de atualidade para dados precisos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью определять объемы исследований, оценивать источники и применять принципы YAGNI, KISS и DRY для эффективного сбора информации, используя системные методологии и требования новизны для точных данных.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحديد نطاق البحث وتقييم المصادر وتطبيق مبادئ YAGNI و KISS و DRY للجمع الفعال للمعلومات، باستخدام منهجيات 系统ية ومتطلبات الحداثة لبيانات دقيقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining research boundaries for complex topics","Evaluating source credibility for fact-checking","Applying YAGNI principle for concise reporting"],"zh":["为复杂主题定义研究边界","评估来源可信度以进行事实核查","应用 YAGNI 原则进行简明报告"],"ja":["複雑なトピックの研究境界を定義する","事実検証のための情報源の信頼性を評価する","簡潔な報告書のための YAGNI 原則を適用する"],"ko":["복잡한 주제를 위한 연구 범위 정의","사실 확인을 위한 출처 신뢰도 평가","간결한 보고서를 위한 YAGNI 원칙 적용"],"es":["Definir límites de investigación para temas complejos","Evaluar la credibilidad de las fuentes para verificación de hechos","Aplicar el principio YAGNI para presentación de informes concisos"],"fr":["Définir les limites de la recherche pour des sujets complexes","Évaluer la crédibilité des sources pour la vérification des faits","Appliquer le principe YAGNI pour des rapports concis"],"de":["Forschungsgrenzen für komplexe Themen definieren","Glaubwürdigkeit von Quellen für Faktenüberprüfung bewerten","YAGNI-Prinzip für präzise Berichterstattung anwenden"],"pt":["Definir limites de pesquisa para tópicos complexos","Avaliar a credibilidade das fontes para verificação de fatos","Aplicar o princípio YAGNI para relatórios concisos"],"ru":["Определение границ исследований для сложных тем","Оценка достоверности источников для проверки фактов","Применение принципа YAGNI для кратких отчетов"],"ar":["تحديد حدود البحث للمواضيع المعقدة","تقييم مصداقية المصادر للتحقق من الحقائق","تطبيق مبدأ YAGNI للتقارير الموجزة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear research objectives","Dependent on quality of source materials","May require additional tools for in-depth data analysis"],"zh":["需要明确的研究目标","依赖于来源材料的质量","可能需要额外的工具进行深入的数据分析"],"ja":["明確な研究目標が必要","情報源の質に依存する","詳細なデータ分析のために追加のツールが必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["明确한 연구 목표가 필요","출처 자료의 품질에 의존","깊은 데이터 분석을 위해 추가 도구가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere objetivos de investigación claros","Depende de la calidad de los materiales de fuente","Puede requerir herramientas adicionales para análisis de datos en profundidad"],"fr":["Nécessite des objectifs de recherche clairs","Dépend de la qualité des matériaux de source","Peut nécessiter des outils supplémentaires pour une analyse de données approfondie"],"de":["Benötigt klare Forschungsziele","Hängt von der Qualität der Quellenmaterialien ab","Kann zusätzliche Tools für eine tiefere Datenanalyse erfordern"],"pt":["Exige objetivos de pesquisa claros","Depende da qualidade dos materiais de fonte","Pode exigir ferramentas adicionais para análise de dados aprofundada"],"ru":["Требует четких исследовательских целей","Зависит от качества источниковых материалов","Может требовать дополнительных инструментов для глубокого анализа данных"],"ar":["يتطلب أهداف بحث واضحة","يعتمد على جودة مواد المصدر","يمكن أن يتطلب أدوات إضافية للتحليل العميق للبيانات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
