enho","Erros","Integração","Padrões de configuração"],"ru":["Elasticache Config","AWS","Конфигурация","Автоматизация","Производительность","Ошибки","Интеграция","Шаблоны конфигурации"],"ar":["إعداد Elasticache","AWS","إعداد","تلقيم","أداء","أخطاء","تكامل","أنماط الإعداد"]}},"owner":"jeremylongshore","repo":"claude-code-plugins-plus-skills","repoPath":"jeremylongshore/claude-code-plugins-plus-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"elasticache-config","description":"|","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Elasticache Config\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for elasticache config tasks within the AWS Skills domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"elasticache config\" in your request\n- Ask about elasticache config patterns or best practices\n- Need help with amazon web services skills covering compute, storage, networking, serverless, and aws-specific best practices.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step guidance for elasticache co","body":"# Elasticache Config\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides automated assistance for elasticache config tasks within the AWS Skills domain.\n\n## When to Use\n\nThis skill activates automatically when you:\n- Mention \"elasticache config\" in your request\n- Ask about elasticache config patterns or best practices\n- Need help with amazon web services skills covering compute, storage, networking, serverless, and aws-specific best practices.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Provides step-by-step guidance for elasticache config\n2. Follows industry best practices and patterns\n3. Generates production-ready code and configurations\n4. Validates outputs against common standards\n\n## Examples\n\n**Example: Basic Usage**\nRequest: \"Help me with elasticache config\"\nResult: Provides step-by-step guidance and generates appropriate configurations\n\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Relevant development environment configured\n- Access to necessary tools and services\n- Basic understanding of aws skills concepts\n\n\n## Output\n\n- Generated configurations and code\n- Best practice recommendations\n- Validation results\n\n\n## Error Handling\n\n| Error | Cause | Solution |\n|-------|-------|----------|\n| Configuration invalid | Missing required fields | Check documentation for required parameters |\n| Tool not found | Dependency not installed | Install required tools per prerequisites |\n| Permission denied | Insufficient access | Verify credentials and permissions |\n\n\n## Resources\n\n- Official documentation for related tools\n- Best practices guides\n- Community examples and tutorials\n\n## Related Skills\n\nPart of the **AWS Skills** skill category.\nTags: aws, lambda, s3, ec2, cloudformation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:01:40.973Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Agents specializing in Amazon Web Services (AWS) and needing automated Elasticache configuration management.","zh":"适合专门从事Amazon Web Services（AWS）并需要自动化Elasticache配置管理的云代理。","ja":"Amazon Web Services（AWS）を専門とし、Elasticacheの構成管理を自動化する必要があるクラウドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Amazon Web Services(AWS)를 전문으로 하며 Elasticache 구성 관리를 자동화해야 하는 클라우드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes en la Nube especializados en Amazon Web Services (AWS) y que necesitan una gestión automatizada de la configuración de Elasticache.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloud spécialisés dans les services Amazon Web (AWS) et ayant besoin d''une gestion automatisée de la configuration d''Elasticache.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Agents, die auf Amazon Web Services (AWS) spezialisiert sind und eine automatisierte Elasticache-Konfigurationsverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Nuvem especializados em Amazon Web Services (AWS) e que necessitam de gerenciamento de configuração automatizado do Elasticache.","ru":"Идеально для облачных агентов, специализирующихся на Amazon Web Services (AWS) и требующих автоматизированного управления конфигурацией Elasticache.","ar":"مثالية لعميل السحابة المتخصص في خدمات أمازون الويب (AWS) والذي يحتاج إلى إدارة تكوين إLASTICACHE أوتوماتيكياً."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Elasticache config tasks, providing step-by-step guidance for Elasticache configuration patterns and best practices, utilizing AWS Skills domain expertise and interactive Jupyter notebooks for production orchestration.","zh":"赋予代理自动执行Elasticache配置任务的能力，提供有关Elasticache配置模式和最佳实践的分步指南，利用AWS Skills领域的专业知识和交互式Jupyter笔记本进行生产编排。","ja":"エージェントがElasticacheの構成タスクを自動化できるようにし、Elasticacheの構成パターンとベストプラクティスのステップバイステップガイダンスを提供し、AWS Skillsドメインの専門知識とインタラクティブなJupyterノートブックを使用して生産のオーケストレーションを行う。","ko":"에이전트가 Elasticache 구성 태스크를 자동화할 수 있도록 하며 Elasticache 구성 패턴 및 모범 사례에 대한 단계별 지침을 제공하고 AWS Skills 도메인 전문 지식 및 상호 작용형 Jupyter 노트북을 사용하여 생산 오케스트레이션을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar tareas de configuración de Elasticache, proporcionando una guía paso a paso para patrones de configuración de Elasticache y mejores prácticas, utilizando la experiencia en el dominio de habilidades de AWS y cuadernos interactivos de Jupyter para la orquestación de producción.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tâches de configuration d''Elasticache, en fournissant un guide étape par étape pour les modèles de configuration d''Elasticache et les meilleures pratiques, en utilisant l''expertise du domaine des compétences AWS et des cahiers interactifs Jupyter pour l''orchestration de production.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Elasticache-Konfigurationsaufgaben zu automatisieren und bietet eine Schritt-für-Schritt-Anleitung für Elasticache-Konfigurationsmuster und Best Practices, indem es die Domänenexpertise von AWS-Fähigkeiten und interaktive Jupyter-Notebooks für die Produktionsorchestrierung nutzt.","pt":"Habilita agentes a automatizar tarefas de configuração do Elasticache, fornecendo orientação passo a passo para padrões de configuração do Elasticache e melhores 