èles de données prédéfinis","Prise en charge des tests et des snapshots","Intégration avec des sources de données externes"],"de":["Muster für Analytics-Engineering","Anpassbare Projektstruktur","Vordefinierte Datenmodelle","Unterstützung für Tests und Snapshots","Integration mit externen Datenquellen"],"pt":["Padrões de modelagem de dados","Estrutura de projeto organizada","Escalabilidade","Integração com fontes de dados","Suporte a testes e snapshots"],"ru":["Шаблоны моделирования данных","Организованная структура проекта","Масштабируемость","Интеграция с источниками данных","Поддержка тестов и снимков"],"ar":["أنماط نمذجة البيانات","هيكل مشروع منظم","توسعة","دمج مع مصادر البيانات","دعم الاختبارات والصور الثابتة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["dbt 技术","数据建模","分析工程","数据处理","数据分析","数据仓库","数据湖"],"ja":["dbt スキル","データモデリング","分析エンジニアリング","データ処理","データ分析","データウェアハウス","データレイク"],"ko":["dbt 기술","데이터 모델링","분석 엔지니어링","데이터 처리","데이터 분석","데이터 웨어하우스","데이터 레이크"],"es":["dbt","ingeniería analítica","desarrollo de datos","modelos de datos","pruebas de datos","snapshots de datos"],"fr":["dbt","ingénierie analytique","développement de données","modèles de données","tests de données","snapshots de données"],"de":["dbt","Analytics-Engineering","Datenentwicklung","Datenmodelle","Datenprüfungen","Daten-Snapshots"],"pt":["dbt","engenharia de análise de dados","modelagem de dados","estrutura de projeto","escalabilidade","integração de dados","testes de dados","snapshots de dados"],"ru":["dbt","инженерия аналитических данных","моделирование данных","структура проекта","масштабируемость","интеграция данных","тесты данных","снимки данных"],"ar":["dbt","هندسة تحليل البيانات","نمذجة البيانات","هيكل المشروع","توسعة","دمج البيانات","اختبارات البيانات","صور ثابتة للبيانات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dbt","description":"dbt (data build tool) patterns for data transformation and analytics engineering. Use when building data models, implementing data quality tests, or managing data transformation pipelines.","bodyPreview":"# dbt Skill\n\nThis skill provides dbt patterns for analytics engineering.\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\ndbt_project/\n├── dbt_project.yml\n├── models/\n│   ├── staging/\n│   │   └── stg_customers.sql\n│   ├── intermediate/\n│   │   └── int_customer_orders.sql\n│   └── marts/\n│       └── fct_orders.sql\n├── seeds/\n├── macros/\n├── tests/\n└── snapshots/\n```\n\n## Model Patterns\n\n### Staging Models\n```sql\n-- models/staging/stg_customers.sql\nwith source as (\n    select * from {{ source(''raw'', ''customers'') }}\n),\n\nr","body":"# dbt Skill\n\nThis skill provides dbt patterns for analytics engineering.\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\ndbt_project/\n├── dbt_project.yml\n├── models/\n│   ├── staging/\n│   │   └── stg_customers.sql\n│   ├── intermediate/\n│   │   └── int_customer_orders.sql\n│   └── marts/\n│       └── fct_orders.sql\n├── seeds/\n├── macros/\n├── tests/\n└── snapshots/\n```\n\n## Model Patterns\n\n### Staging Models\n```sql\n-- models/staging/stg_customers.sql\nwith source as (\n    select * from {{ source(''raw'', ''customers'') }}\n),\n\nrenamed as (\n    select\n        id as customer_id,\n        lower(email) as email,\n        created_at\n    from source\n)\n\nselect * from renamed\n```\n\n### Incremental Models\n```sql\n-- models/marts/fct_orders.sql\n{{\n    config(\n        materialized=''incremental'',\n        unique_key=''order_id''\n    )\n}}\n\nselect *\nfrom {{ ref(''stg_orders'') }}\n{% if is_incremental() %}\nwhere updated_at > (select max(updated_at) from {{ this }})\n{% endif %}\n```\n\n## Testing\n\n```yaml\n# models/schema.yml\nmodels:\n  - name: stg_customers\n    columns:\n      - name: customer_id\n        tests:\n          - unique\n          - not_null\n      - name: email\n        tests:\n          - unique\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Use staging → intermediate → marts pattern\n- Source all raw data with `source()`\n- Reference models with `ref()`\n- Add documentation and tests\n- Use incremental models for large datasets\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:03:18.114Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Analytics Agents needing advanced data transformation and modeling capabilities with dbt","zh":"非常适合需要使用dbt进行高级数据转换和建模的分析代理","ja":"dbtを使用した高度なデータ変換とモデリング機能を必要とする分析エージェントに最適","ko":"dbt를 사용한 고급 데이터 변환 및 모델링 기능이 필요한 분석 에이전트에게 理想的","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de transformación y modelado de datos con dbt","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse nécessitant des capacités de transformation et de modélisation de données avancées avec dbt","de":"Perfekt für Analytics-Agents, die erweiterte Datentransformations- und Modellierfunktionen mit dbt benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de transformação e modelagem de dados com dbt","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Аналитики, которым требуются продвинутые возможности преобразования и моделирования данных с dbt","ar":"مثالي لعميل التحليلات الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لتحويل ونمذجة البيانات مع dbt"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create robust data pipelines using dbt patterns, allowing for efficient data modeling and analytics engineering with SQL, while leveraging project structures like staging, intermediate, and marts","zh":"赋予代理创建强大的数据管道的能力，使用dbt模式，允许高效的数据建模和分析工程使用SQL，同时利用项目结构，如暂存、中间和商店","ja":"エージェントがdbtパターンを使用して堅牢なデータパイプラインを作成する機能を提供し、SQLを使用した効率的なデータモデリングと分析エンジニアリングを可能にし、ステージング、 Intermediate、 MARTなどのプロジェクト構造を利用","ko":"에이전트가 dbt 패턴을 사용하여 강력한 데이터 파이프라인을 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, SQL을 사용한 효율적인 데이터 모델링 및 분석 엔지니어링을 가능하게 하며, 스테이징, 중간, 마트 등의 프로젝트 구조를 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear tuberías de datos robustas utilizando patrones dbt, lo que permite un modelado y una ingeniería de análisis de datos eficientes con SQL, aprovechando estructuras de proyecto como staging, intermedia e intermediate y marts","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des pipelines de données robustes en utilisant des modèles dbt, permettant un modelage et une ingénierie d''analyse de données efficaces avec SQL, tout en exploitant des structures de projet comme staging, intermédiaire et marts","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, robuste Datenpipelines mit dbt-Mustern zu erstellen, wodurch effizientes Datenmodellieren und Analytics-Engineering mit SQL ermöglicht wird, während Projektstrukturen wie Staging, Zwischen- und Marts-Tabellen genutzt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar pipelines de dados robustos usando padrões dbt, permitindo modelagem de dados eficiente e engenharia de análise com SQL, aproveitando estruturas de projeto como staging, intermediário e marts","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать прочные конвейеры данных, используя шаблоны dbt, что позволяет эффективно моделировать данные и инженерную аналитику с SQL, используя структуры проекта, такие как staging, промежуточные и marts","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء خطوط أنابيب بيانات قوية باستخدام أنماط dbt، مما يسمح بنمذجة بيانات كفؤة وهندسة تحليلية باستخدام SQL، مع الاستفادة من هياكل المشروع مثل التثبيت والمتوسطة ومحلات"},"useCases":{"en":["Building data warehouses with dbt models","Creating reusable data transformation templates","Testing and validating data pipelines with dbt tests"],"zh":["使用dbt模型构建数据仓库","创建可重用的数据转换模板","使用dbt测试测试和验证数据管道"],"ja":["dbtモデルを使用したデータウェアハウスの構築","再利用可能なデータ変換テンプレートの作成","dbtテストを使用したデータパイプラインのテストと検証"],"ko":["dbt 모델을 사용한 데이터 웨어하우스 구축","재사용 가능한 데이터 변환 템플릿 생성","dbt 테스트를 사용한 데이터 파이프라인 테스트 및 검증"],"es":["Construir almacenes de datos con modelos dbt","Crear plantillas de transformación de datos reutilizables","Probar y validar tuberías de datos con pruebas dbt"],"fr":["Créer des entrepôts de données avec des modèles dbt","Créer des modèles de transformation de données réutilisables","Tester et valider les pipelines de données avec des tests dbt"],"de":["Datenbanken mit dbt-Modellen erstellen","Wiederverwendbare Daten-Transformationsvorlagen erstellen","Datenpipelines mit dbt-Tests testen und validieren"],"pt":["Construir armazéns de dados com modelos dbt","Criar modelos de transformação de dados reutilizáveis","Testar e validar pipelines de dados com testes dbt"],"ru":["Построение хранилищ данных с моделями dbt","Создание повторно используемых шаблонов преобразования данных","Тестирование и проверка конвейеров данных с помощью тестов dbt"],"ar":["بناء مستودعات البيانات مع نماذج dbt","إنشاء قوالب تحويل البيانات القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","اختبار وتحقق خطوط أنابيب البيانات باستخدام اختبارات dbt"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires dbt installation and configuration","SQL knowledge required for model development"],"zh":["需要dbt安装和配置","模型开发需要SQL知识"],"ja":["dbtのインストールとコンフィギュレーションが必要","モデル開発にはSQLの知識が必要"],"ko":["dbt 설치 및 구성이 필요","모델 개발을 위한 SQL 지식이 필요"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de dbt","Se requiere conocimiento de SQL para el desarrollo de modelos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de dbt","Connaissances SQL requises pour le développement de modèles"],"de":["Benötigt dbt-Installation und -Konfiguration","SQL-Kenntnisse erforderlich für die Modellentwicklung"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do dbt","Conhecimento de SQL necessário para desenvolvimento de modelos"],"ru":["Требуется установка и конфигурация dbt","Необходимо знание SQL для разработки моделей"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين dbt","مطلوب معرفة SQL لتطوير النماذج"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/ship', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'ship', 0, 0, 60, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z', '2026-02-18T04:03:25.307Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/ship","name":"ship","description":{"zh":"Ship是一个AI驱动的Git自动化技能，可快速执行git add、commit和push操作。它能检查仓库状态，处理提交消息，并简化代码推送流程，专为开发者优化版本控制工作流。","ja":"ShipはAI駆動のGit自動化スキルで、git add、commit、push操作を迅速に実行します。リポジトリ状態を確認し、コミットメッセージを処理し、コードプッシュ流程を簡素化し、開発者のバージョン管理ワークフローを最適化します。","ko":"Ship은 AI 기반 Git 자동화 스킬로, git add, commit, push 작업을 신속하게 수행합니다. 저장소 상태를 확인하고 커밋 메시지를 처리하며 코드 푸시 과정을 간소화하여 개발자의 버전 관리 워크플로우를 최적화합니다.","es":"Ship es una habilidad de Claude Code que permite agregar, confirmar y push de cambios en la rama actual de Git de forma rápida y sencilla.","fr":"Ship est une compétence Claude Code qui permet d''ajouter, de valider et de push des modifications sur la branche actuelle de Git de manière rapide et simple.","de":"Ship ist eine Fähigkeit von Claude Code, die es ermöglicht, Änderungen in der aktuellen Git-Zweig schnell und einfach hinzuzufügen, zu bestätigen und zu pushen.","pt":"A ferramenta Ship é uma solução para desenvolvedores que precisam adicionar, commitar e pushar alterações no branch atual de forma rápida e eficiente","ru":"Инструмент Ship - это решение для разработчиков, которые нуждаются в быстром добавлении, коммите и пуше изменений в текущей ветке","ar":"أداة Ship هي حل للمطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى إضافة والالتزام والدفع للتغييرات في الفرع الحالي بسرعة وفعالية","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Ship技能：快速Git添加、提交和推送更改","ja":"Shipスキル：Gitの変更を迅速に追加、コミット、プッシュ","ko":"Ship 스킬: Git 변경 사항 빠르게 추가, 커밋 및 푸시","es":"Ship: automatiza commits y pushes en Git","fr":"Ship: automatez les commits et les pushes Git","de":"Ship: Automatisieren Sie Commits und Pushes in Git","pt":"Ship: Ferramenta de Commit e Push para Desenvolvedores","ru":"Ship: Инструмент для коммита и пуша для разработчиков","ar":"Ship: أداة الالتزام والدفع للמطورين","en":"ship"},"description":{"zh":"Ship是一个AI驱动的Git自动化技能，可快速执行git add、commit和push操作。它能检查仓库状态，处理提交消息，并简化代码推送流程，专为开发者优化版本控制工作流。","ja":"ShipはAI駆動のGit自動化スキルで、git add、commit、push操作を迅速に実行します。リポジトリ状態を確認し、コミットメッセージを処理し、コードプッシュ流程を簡素化し、開発者のバージョン管理ワークフローを最適化します。","ko":"Ship은 AI 기반 Git 자동화 스킬로, git add, commit, push 작업을 신속하게 수행합니다. 저장소 상태를 확인하고 커밋 메시지를 처리하며 코드 푸시 과정을 간소화하여 개발자의 버전 관리 워크플로우를 최적화합니다.","es":"Ship es una habilidad de Claude Code que permite agregar, confirmar y push de cambios en la rama actual de Git de forma rápida y sencilla.","fr":"Ship est une compétence Claude Code qui permet d''ajouter, de valider et de push des modifications sur la branche actuelle de Git de manière rapide et simple.","de":"Ship ist eine Fähigkeit von Claude Code, die es ermöglicht, Änderungen in der aktuellen Git-Zweig schnell und einfach hinzuzufügen, zu bestätigen und zu pushen.","pt":"A ferramenta Ship é uma solução para desenvolvedores que precisam adicionar, commitar e pushar alterações no branch atual de forma rápida e eficiente","ru":"Инструмент Ship - это решение для разработчиков, которые нуждаются в быстром добавлении, коммите и пуше изменений в текущей ветке","ar":"أداة Ship هي حل للمطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى إضافة والالتزام والدفع للتغييرات في الفرع الحالي بسرعة وفعالية","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["自动运行git status检查仓库状态","支持可选提交消息参数(-m或--message)","无更改时自动通知用户并退出","处理带引号的提交消息","完整的git add/commit/push流程自动化","与Claude代码技能注册表集成"],"ja":["git statusの自動実行によるリポジトリ状態チェック","オプションのコミットメッセージ引数対応(-mまたは--message)","変更がない場合のユーザー通知と自動終了","引用符付きコミットメッセージの処理","完全なgit add/commit/push流程の自動化","Claudeコードスキルレジストリとの統合"],"ko":["git status 자동 실행으로 저장소 상태 확인","선택적 커밋 메시지 인수 지원(-m 또는 --message)","변경 사항 없을 시 사용자 알림 및 자동 종료","따옴표가 있는 커밋 메시지 처리","완전한 git add/commit/push 프로세스 자동화","Claude 코드 스킬 레지스트리 통합"],"es":["Agregar cambios a la rama actual","Confirmar cambios con un mensaje personalizado","Push de cambios a la rama actual","Soporte para mensajes de confirmación opcionales","Integración con Git para un flujo de trabajo suave"],"fr":["Ajouter des modifications à la branche actuelle","Valider des modifications avec un message personnalisé","Push des modifications à la branche actuelle","Prise en charge de messages de validation facultatifs","Intégration avec Git pour un flux de travail fluide"],"de":["Änderungen zur aktuellen Zweig hinzufügen","Änderungen mit einer benutzerdefinierten Nachricht bestätigen","Änderungen zur aktuellen Zweig pushen","Unterstützung für optionale Bestätigungsnachrichten","Integration mit Git für einen reibungslosen Workflow"],"pt":["Adiciona, commita e pusha alterações no branch atual","Permite especificar mensagem de commit","Verifica o estado do repositório antes de commitar","Trata a mensagem de commit como um argumento","Suporta flags -m e --message para extrair a mensagem de commit"],"ru":["Добавляет, коммитит и пушит изменения в текущей ветке","Позволяет указать сообщение коммита","Проверяет состояние репозитория перед коммитом","Обрабатывает сообщение коммита как аргумент","Поддерживает флаги -m и --message для извлечения сообщения коммита"],"ar":["تضيف والالتزام والدفع للتغييرات في الفرع الحالي","تمكنك من تحديد رسالة الالتزام","تتحقق من حالة المستودع قبل الالتزام","تتعامل مع رسالة الالتزام كحجة","تدعم الأعلام -m و --message لاستخراج رسالة الالتزام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["git自动化技能","claude代码技能","git快速提交","自动化git推送","开发者工具","版本控制自动化","git工作流优化","AI代码助手"],"ja":["git自動化スキル","claudeコードスキル","git高速コミット","自動gitプッシュ","開発者ツール","バージョン管理自動化","gitワークフロー最適化","AIコードアシスタント"],"ko":["git 자동화 스킬","claude 코드 스킬","git 빠른 커밋","자동 git 푸시","개발자 도구","버전 관리 자동화","git 워크플로우 최적화","AI 코드 어시스턴트"],"es":["ship","git","automatización","commit","push","rama actual","mensaje de confirmación","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["ship","git","automatisation","commit","push","branche actuelle","message de validation","développement de logiciels"],"de":["ship","git","automatisierung","commit","push","aktuelle zweig","bestätigungsnachricht","softwareentwicklung"],"pt":["ship","git","commit","push","desenvolvedores","ferramenta de commit","ferramenta de push","automatização de commit","automatização de push"],"ru":["ship","git","коммит","пуш","разработчики","инструмент коммита","инструмент пуша","автоматизация коммита","автоматизация пуша"],"ar":["ship","git","الالتزام","الدفع","المطورين","أداة الالتزام","أداة الدفع","تأتمتة الالتزام","تأتمتة الدفع"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ship","description":"Quickly add, commit, and push changes to the current branch","bodyPreview":"# ship\n\nQuickly add, commit, and push changes to the current branch.\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `message` (optional): Commit message. If not provided, will prompt the user for one.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Run `git status` to check the current state of the repository\n2. If there are no changes to commit, inform the user and exit\n3. Parse the commit message from args:\n   - If args starts with `-m ` or `--message `, extract the message after the flag (removing quotes if present)\n   - Otherwise, treat the entire","body":"# ship\n\nQuickly add, commit, and push changes to the current branch.\n\n## Arguments\n\n- `message` (optional): Commit message. If not provided, will prompt the user for one.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Run `git status` to check the current state of the repository\n2. If there are no changes to commit, inform the user and exit\n3. Parse the commit message from args:\n   - If args starts with `-m ` or `--message `, extract the message after the flag (removing quotes if present)\n   - Otherwise, treat the entire args string as the message (removing surrounding quotes if present)\n   - If args is empty or just whitespace, ask the user for a commit message using AskUserQuestion\n4. Run `git add .` to stage all changes\n5. Create a commit with the message using the git commit protocol from the system instructions:\n   - Format the message properly with a Co-Authored-By line at the end\n   - Use a heredoc for proper formatting: `git commit -m \"$(cat <<''EOF''\\n[message]\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\nEOF\\n)\"`\n6. Run `git push` to push the changes to the remote\n7. Confirm success to the user with a summary of what was pushed (include commit message and branch)\n\n## Example Usage\n\n```\n/ship \"Add new printer case study\"\n/ship -m \"Fix typography issues\"\n/ship\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Always follow git safety protocols\n- Show git status before committing\n- Confirm successful push with the user\n- If push fails, report the error clearly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:03:25.307Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Version Control Agents requiring streamlined Git workflows.","zh":"适合需要简化 Git 工作流的版本控制代理。","ja":"Git ワークフローを簡素化するバージョン管理エージェントに最適。","ko":"간소화된 Git 워크플ロー가 필요한 버전 제어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de control de versiones que requieren flujos de trabajo de Git optimizados.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de contrôle de version nécessitant des flux de travail Git rationalisés.","de":"Ideal für Version Control Agents, die optimierte Git-Arbeitsabläufe erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de controle de versão que necessitam de fluxos de trabalho Git otimizados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов контроля версий, требующих оптимизированных рабочих процессов Git.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التحكم في الإصدار الذي يتطلب تيارات عمل Git المنظمة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage Git repositories by adding, committing, and pushing changes with customizable commit messages using Git protocols and commands like `git status`.","zh":"使代理能够通过添加、提交和推送更改（使用自定义提交消息、Git 协议和命令，如 `git status`）来高效地管理 Git 存储库。","ja":"エージェントがカスタマイズ可能なコミットメッセージ、Git プロトコル、およびコマンド（例: `git status`）を使用して変更を追加、コミット、およびプッシュすることで Git リポジトリを効率的に管理できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 커스터마이즈 가능한 커밋 메시지, Git 프로토콜 및 명령어(`git status` 등)를 사용하여 변경 사항을 추가, 커밋 및 푸시함으로써 Git 저장소를 효율적으로 관리하도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar de forma eficiente los repositorios de Git agregando, confirmando y enviando cambios con mensajes de confirmación personalizables utilizando protocolos y comandos de Git como `git status`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement les référentiels Git en ajoutant, en validant et en envoyant des modifications avec des messages de validation personnalisables en utilisant des protocoles et des commandes Git comme `git status`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Git-Repositorys effizient zu verwalten, indem sie Änderungen hinzufügen, bestätigen und mit anpassbaren Commit-Nachrichten mithilfe von Git-Protokollen und -Befehlen wie `git status` übertragen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem eficientemente repositórios Git adicionando, comprometendo e enviando alterações com mensagens de compromisso personalizadas usando protocolos e comandos Git, como `git status`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам эффективно управлять репозиториями Git, добавляя, фиксируя и отправляя изменения с настраиваемыми сообщениями фиксации, используя протоколы и команды Git, такие как `git status`.","ar":"يمنح الوكيل الإمكانية لإدارة مستودعات Git بفعالية من خلال إضافة والتزام وتحديث التغييرات مع رسائل الالتزام المخصصة باستخدام بروتوكولات وأوامر Git مثل `git status`."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit and push operations","Streamlining repository updates with meaningful commit messages","Simplifying Git workflows for collaborative projects"],"zh":["自动化提交和推送操作","使用有意义的提交消息简化存储库更新","简化协作项目的 Git 工作流"],"ja":["コミットおよびプッシュ操作の自動化","意味のあるコミットメッセージを使用したリポジトリの更新の簡素化","コラボレーションプロジェクトの Git ワークフローの簡素化"],"ko":["커밋 및 푸시 동작의 자동화","의미 있는 커밋 메시지를 사용한 저장소 업데이트의 간소화","협업 프로젝트를 위한 Git 워크플로의 간소화"],"es":["Automatizar operaciones de confirmación y envío","Optimizar actualizaciones de repositorio con mensajes de confirmación significativos","Simplificar flujos de trabajo de Git para proyectos colaborativos"],"fr":["Automatiser les opérations de validation et d''envoi","Optimiser les mises à jour de référentiel avec des messages de validation significatifs","Simplifier les flux de travail Git pour les projets collaboratifs"],"de":["Automatisieren von Commit- und Push-Vorgängen","Optimieren von Repository-Aktualisierungen mit sinnvollen Commit-Nachrichten","Vereinfachen von Git-Arbeitsabläufen für kollaborative Projekte"],"pt":["Automatizar operações de compromisso e envio","Otimizar atualizações de repositório com mensagens de compromisso significativas","Simplificar fluxos de trabalho Git para projetos colaborativos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать операции фиксации и отправки","Оптимизировать обновления репозитория с осмысленными сообщениями фиксации","Упростить рабочие процессы Git для совместных проектов"],"ar":["تأتمة عمليات الالتزام والإرسال","تبسيط تحديثات المستودع مع رسائل الالتزام المهمة","تسهيل تيارات عمل Git لمشاريع تعاونية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Limited to current branch operations"],"zh":["需要 Git 安装和配置","仅限当前分支操作"],"ja":["Git のインストールと構成が必要","現在のブランチ操作のみ"],"ko":["Git 설치 및 구성이 필요","현재 분기 작업만 가능"],"es":["Requiere instalación y configuración de Git","Limitado a operaciones en la rama actual"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Git","Limité aux opérations sur la branche actuelle"],"de":["Benötigt Git-Installation und -Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf Operationen im aktuellen Branch"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do Git","Limitado a operações de branch atual"],"ru":["Требует установки и конфигурации Git","Ограничен операциями текущей ветки"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين Git","محدود لعمليات الفرع الحالي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":60}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/nuke', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'nuke', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z', '2026-02-18T04:03:31.113Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/nuke","name":"nuke","description":{"zh":"Nuke Shell状态终止是一个可终止所有Shell进程和可选清除状态的功能","ja":"Nuke Shell状態の終了は、すべてのShellプロセスを終了し、状態をオプションでクリアする機能です","ko":"Nuke Shell 상태 종료는 모든 Shell 프로세스를 종료하고 상태를 선택적으로 삭제하는 기능입니다","es":"Nuke Shella es una herramienta para eliminar procesos y estado de forma destructiva","fr":"Nuke Shella est un outil pour supprimer les processus et l''état de manière destructive","de":"Nuke Shella ist ein Tool zum Löschen von Prozessen und Zustand auf destruktive Weise","pt":"O Nuke Shella é uma ferramenta poderosa para matar processos e limpar o estado. Ele mata todos os processos nas portas 47100-47200 e opcionalmente exclui o registro de estado.","ru":"Nuke Shella - это мощный инструмент для убийства процессов и очистки состояния. Он убивает все процессы на портах 47100-47200 и опционально удаляет реестр состояния.","ar":"نوك شيلا هو أداة قوية لقتل العمليات وامسح الحالة. يقتل جميع العمليات على منافذ 47100-47200 ويمسح سجل الحالة بشكل اختياري.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Nuke Shell状态终止","ja":"Nuke Shell状態の終了","ko":"Nuke Shell 상태 종료","es":"Nuke Shella: Elimina procesos y estado","fr":"Nuke Shella : Supprimer les processus et l''état","de":"Nuke Shella: Prozesse und Zustand löschen","pt":"Nuke Shella: Mate os Processos e Limpe o Estado","ru":"Nuke Shella: Убить Процессы и Очистить Состояние","ar":"نوك شيلا: اقتل العمليات وامسح الحالة","en":"nuke"},"description":{"zh":"Nuke Shell状态终止是一个可终止所有Shell进程和可选清除状态的功能","ja":"Nuke Shell状態の終了は、すべてのShellプロセスを終了し、状態をオプションでクリアする機能です","ko":"Nuke Shell 상태 종료는 모든 Shell 프로세스를 종료하고 상태를 선택적으로 삭제하는 기능입니다","es":"Nuke Shella es una herramienta para eliminar procesos y estado de forma destructiva","fr":"Nuke Shella est un outil pour supprimer les processus et l''état de manière destructive","de":"Nuke Shella ist ein Tool zum Löschen von Prozessen und Zustand auf destruktive Weise","pt":"O Nuke Shella é uma ferramenta poderosa para matar processos e limpar o estado. Ele mata todos os processos nas portas 47100-47200 e opcionalmente exclui o r...","ru":"Nuke Shella - это мощный инструмент для убийства процессов и очистки состояния. Он убивает все процессы на портах 47100-47200 и опционально удаляет реестр со...","ar":"نوك شيلا هو أداة قوية لقتل العمليات وامسح الحالة. يقتل جميع العمليات على منافذ 47100-47200 ويمسح سجل الحالة بشكل اختياري.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["终止所有Shell进程","可选清除状态","仅在明确请求时运行","支持多个端口","自动杀死剩余进程"],"ja":["すべてのShellプロセスを終了","状態をオプションでクリア","明示的に要求された場合のみ実行","複数のポートをサポート","自動的に残りのプロセスを終了"],"ko":["모든 Shell 프로세스를 종료","상태를 선택적으로 삭제","명시적으로 요청된 경우에만 실행","다중 포트 지원","자동으로 남은 프로세스를 종료"],"es":["Elimina procesos en los puertos 47100-47200","Elimina el estado del registro","Confirma con el usuario antes de proceder","Utiliza comandos de línea de comandos para eliminar procesos","Soporta la eliminación de procesos relacionados con Node"],"fr":["Supprime les processus sur les ports 47100-47200","Supprime l''état du registre","Confirme avec l''utilisateur avant de procéder","Utilise des commandes de ligne de commande pour supprimer les processus","Prend en charge la suppression des processus liés à Node"],"de":["Löscht Prozesse auf den Ports 47100-47200","Löscht den Zustand des Registrierungsverzeichnisses","Bestätigt mit dem Benutzer vor dem Fortfahren","Verwendet Befehlszeilenbefehle zum Löschen von Prozessen","Unterstützt das Löschen von Prozessen im Zusammenhang mit Node"],"pt":["Mata todos os processos nas portas 47100-47200","Exclui o registro de estado opcionalmente","Confirma com o usuário antes de proceder","Kill processos relacionados ao shella","Otimiza o desempenho e evita perdas de dados"],"ru":["Убивает все процессы на портах 47100-47200","Опционально удаляет реестр состояния","Подтверждает с пользователем перед продолжением","Убивает процессы, связанные с shella","Оптимизирует производительность и предотвращает потерю данных"],"ar":["يقتل جميع العمليات على منافذ 47100-47200","يمسح سجل الحالة بشكل اختياري","يتأكد من المستخدم قبل المتابعة","يقتل العمليات المتعلقة بشيلا","يحسن الأداء ويمنع فقدان البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Nuke Shell","终止进程","清除状态","Shell脚本","命令行工具","开发者工具"],"ja":["Nuke Shell","プロセスを終了","状態をクリア","Shellスクリプト","コマンドラインツール","開発者ツール"],"ko":["Nuke Shell","프로세스 종료","상태 삭제","Shell 스크립트","명령줄 도구","개발자 도구"],"es":["Nuke Shella","eliminar procesos","estado del registro","comandos de línea de comandos","procesos de Node","seguridad","control de procesos"],"fr":["Nuke Shella","supprimer les processus","état du registre","commandes de ligne de commande","processus de Node","sécurité","contrôle des processus"],"de":["Nuke Shella","Prozesse löschen","Zustand des Registrierungsverzeichnisses","Befehlszeilenbefehle","Prozesse von Node","Sicherheit","Prozesskontrolle"],"pt":["Nuke Shella","matar processos","limpar estado","ferramenta de linha de comando","otimizar desempenho","evitar perdas de dados","shella","processos","estado"],"ru":["Nuke Shella","убить процессы","очистить состояние","утилита командной строки","оптимизировать производительность","предотвратить потерю данных","shella","процессы","состояние"],"ar":["نوك شيلا","قتل العمليات","امسح الحالة","أداة سطر أوامر","تحسين الأداء","منع فقدان البيانات","شيلا","عمليات","حالة"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nuke","description":"Kill all shella processes and reset state. Nuclear option when things are broken. Use with caution.","bodyPreview":"# Nuke Shella State\n\nKill all shella processes and optionally clear state. This is destructive - only run when explicitly requested.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. **Confirm with user** before proceeding. This will:\n   - Kill all processes on ports 47100-47200\n   - Optionally delete registry.json (layout and instance state)\n\n2. **Kill processes on shella ports**:\n   ```bash\n   lsof -i :47100-47200 -P -n -t 2>/dev/null | xargs -r kill -9\n   ```\n\n3. **Kill any remaining shella-related node processes** (if needed):","body":"# Nuke Shella State\n\nKill all shella processes and optionally clear state. This is destructive - only run when explicitly requested.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. **Confirm with user** before proceeding. This will:\n   - Kill all processes on ports 47100-47200\n   - Optionally delete registry.json (layout and instance state)\n\n2. **Kill processes on shella ports**:\n   ```bash\n   lsof -i :47100-47200 -P -n -t 2>/dev/null | xargs -r kill -9\n   ```\n\n3. **Kill any remaining shella-related node processes** (if needed):\n   ```bash\n   pkill -f \"shella\" 2>/dev/null || true\n   ```\n\n4. **Optionally clear state** (ask user first):\n   ```bash\n   rm -f ~/.local/state/shella/registry.json\n   rm -f ~/.local/state/shella/dev.log\n   ```\n\n5. **Verify clean**:\n   ```bash\n   lsof -i :47100-47200 -P -n 2>/dev/null | grep LISTEN\n   ```\n   Should return nothing.\n\n## After Nuking\n\nTell the user to restart with:\n```bash\nnpm run dt dev daemon\n```\n\nOr for full stack:\n```bash\nnpm run dt dev all\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:03:31.113Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for System Maintenance Agents needing forceful process termination capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要强制进程终止能力的系统维护代理。","ja":"強制プロセスターミネーション機能を必要とするシステムメンテナンスエージェントに最適です。","ko":"강제 프로세스 종료 기능이 필요한 시스템 유지 보수 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Mantenimiento de Sistema que necesitan capacidades de terminación de proceso forzosa.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Maintenance de Système nécessitant des capacités de termination de processus forcé.","de":"Perfekt für Systemwartungsagenten, die eine gewaltsame Prozessbeendigung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Manutenção de Sistema que necessitam de capacidades de término de processo forçado.","ru":"Идеально для агентов обслуживания системы, требующих принудительного завершения процесса.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الصيانة النظامية التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات إنهاء عملية قسرية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to kill all shella processes on ports 47100-47200 and optionally delete registry.json, utilizing bash commands like lsof and xargs for process management.","zh":"赋予代理杀死端口47100-47200上所有shella进程的能力，并可选地删除registry.json，利用bash命令如lsof和xargs进行进程管理。","ja":"エージェントに、ポート47100-47200上のすべてのshellaプロセスを終了し、registry.jsonを削除するオプションを提供し、プロセス管理のためにlsofやxargsなどのbashコマンドを利用します。","ko":"에이전트에게 47100-47200 포트에서 모든 shella 프로세스를 종료하고 registry.json을 삭제하는 옵션을 제공하며, 프로세스 관리를 위해 lsof 및 xargs와 같은 bash 명령어를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a matar todos los procesos shella en los puertos 47100-47200 y, opcionalmente, eliminar registry.json, utilizando comandos bash como lsof y xargs para la administración de procesos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de tuer tous les processus shella sur les ports 47100-47200 et, facultativement, supprimer registry.json, en utilisant des commandes bash comme lsof et xargs pour la gestion des processus.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, alle shella-Prozesse auf den Ports 47100-47200 zu beenden und optional registry.json zu löschen, indem bash-Befehle wie lsof und xargs für die Prozessverwaltung verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a matar todos os processos shella nas portas 47100-47200 e opcionalmente excluir registry.json, utilizando comandos bash como lsof e xargs para gerenciamento de processos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью убивать все процессы shella на портах 47100-47200 и опционально удалять registry.json, используя команды bash, такие как lsof и xargs, для управления процессами.","ar":"تمكين العوامل من إنهاء جميع عمليات شيلا على المنافذ 47100-47200 وإلغاء التسجيل optional.json، باستخدام أوامر bash مثل lsof و xargs لإدارة العمليات."},"useCases":{"en":["Forcing termination of unresponsive shella processes","Resetting shella state by deleting registry.json","Automating system cleanup after shella usage"],"zh":["强制终止无响应的shella进程","通过删除registry.json重置shella状态","自动化系统清理后shella使用"],"ja":["応答しないshellaプロセスの強制終了","registry.jsonを削除してshella状態をリセット","shella使用後のシステムクリーンアップの自動化"],"ko":["응답하지 않는 shella 프로세스의 강제 종료","registry.json을 삭제하여 shella 상태를 재설정","shella 사용 후 시스템 정리 자동화"],"es":["Forzar la terminación de procesos shella no responsivos","Restablecer el estado de shella eliminando registry.json","Automatizar la limpieza del sistema después del uso de shella"],"fr":["Forcer la termination de processus shella non réactifs","Réinitialiser l''état de shella en supprimant registry.json","Automatiser le nettoyage du système après utilisation de shella"],"de":["Zwangsbefehl für nicht reagierende shella-Prozesse","Zurücksetzen des shella-Zustands durch Löschen von registry.json","Automatisierung der Systemreinigung nach shella-Nutzung"],"pt":["Forçar a terminação de processos shella não responsivos","Reinicializar o estado shella excluindo registry.json","Automatizar a limpeza do sistema após o uso de shella"],"ru":["Принудительное завершение некооперативных процессов shella","Сброс состояния shella путем удаления registry.json","Автоматизация очистки системы после использования shella"],"ar":["إجبار إنهاء عمليات شيلا غير المستجيبة","إعادة تعيين حالة شيلا بإلغاء registry.json","تأتمة تنظيف النظام بعد استخدام شيلا"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires root access for process termination","Destructive - use with caution","Limited to shella processes on specific ports"],"zh":["需要root访问权限进行进程终止","具有破坏性 -谨慎使用","仅限于特定端口上的shella进程"],"ja":["プロセスターミネーションのためにrootアクセスが必要","破壊的 -注意して使用","特定のポートでのみshellaプロセスに限定"],"ko":["프로세스 종료를 위해 루트 접근 권한이 필요","파괴적이므로 주의하여 사용","특정 포트의 shella 프로세스에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere acceso root para la terminación de procesos","Es destructivo - use con precaución","Limitado a procesos shella en puertos específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès root pour la termination de processus","Est destructif - utilisez avec précaution","Limité aux processus shella sur des ports spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Root-Zugriff für die Prozessbeendigung","Ist destruktiv - verwenden Sie mit Vorsicht","Begrenzt auf shella-Prozesse auf bestimmten Ports"],"pt":["Requer acesso root para término de processo","Destrutivo - use com cautela","Limitado a processos shella em portas específicas"],"ru":["Требует доступа root для завершения процесса","Разрушительный - использовать с осторожностью","Ограничен процессами shella на определенных портах"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول الجذري لإنهاء العملية","مدمر - استخدم بحذر","محدود بعملية شيلا على منافذ محددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/secops-hunt', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'secops-hunt', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z', '2026-02-18T04:03:40.306Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/secops-hunt","name":"secops-hunt","description":{"zh":"SecOps-hunt 技术是用于识别和应对未检测到的威胁，提高安全运维能力的综合解决方案","ja":"セキュリティ オペレーションのためのハンター技術は、未検知の脅威を特定して対処するための包括的なソリューションです","ko":"SecOps-hunt 기술은 미검출 위협을 식별하고 대응하여 보안 운영 능력을 향상시키는 종합 솔루션입니다","es":"SecOps-Hunt es una habilidad de caza de amenazas que ayuda a identificar amenazas no detectadas en el entorno","fr":"SecOps-Hunt est une compétence de chasse aux menaces qui aide à identifier les menaces non détectées dans l''environnement","de":"SecOps-Hunt ist eine Bedrohungs-Jagd-Fähigkeit, die bei der Identifizierung nicht erkannter Bedrohungen in der Umgebung hilft","pt":"A habilidade secops-hunt permite identificar proativamente ameaças ocultas no ambiente. Utilize ferramentas de segurança para proteger seu ambiente.","ru":"Навык secops-hunt позволяет проактивно выявлять скрытые угрозы в среде. Используйте инструменты безопасности для защиты вашей среды.","ar":"القدرة secops-hunt تمكنك من تحديد التهديدات المخفية في البيئة. استخدم أدوات الأمن لحماية بيئتك.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"SecOps Threat Hunter 技术","ja":"セキュリティ オペレーション ハンター","ko":"SecOps 위협 사냥꾼 기술","es":"Caza de Amenazas con SecOps-Hunt","fr":"Chasse aux Menaces avec SecOps-Hunt","de":"Bedrohungs-Jagd mit SecOps-Hunt","pt":"Caça de Ameaças: Ferramentas de Segurança","ru":"Охота за угрозами: инструменты безопасности","ar":"صيد التهديدات: أدوات الأمن","en":"secops-hunt"},"description":{"zh":"SecOps-hunt 技术是用于识别和应对未检测到的威胁，提高安全运维能力的综合解决方案","ja":"セキュリティ オペレーションのためのハンター技術は、未検知の脅威を特定して対処するための包括的なソリューションです","ko":"SecOps-hunt 기술은 미검출 위협을 식별하고 대응하여 보안 운영 능력을 향상시키는 종합 솔루션입니다","es":"SecOps-Hunt es una habilidad de caza de amenazas que ayuda a identificar amenazas no detectadas en el entorno","fr":"SecOps-Hunt est une compétence de chasse aux menaces qui aide à identifier les menaces non détectées dans l''environnement","de":"SecOps-Hunt ist eine Bedrohungs-Jagd-Fähigkeit, die bei der Identifizierung nicht erkannter Bedrohungen in der Umgebung hilft","pt":"A habilidade secops-hunt permite identificar proativamente ameaças ocultas no ambiente. Utilize ferramentas de segurança para proteger seu ambiente.","ru":"Навык secops-hunt позволяет проактивно выявлять скрытые угрозы в среде. Используйте инструменты безопасности для защиты вашей среды.","ar":"القدرة secops-hunt تمكنك من تحديد التهديدات المخفية في البيئة. استخدم أدوات الأمن لحماية بيئتك.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["远程工具支持","本地工具支持","威胁识别和应对","安全运维能力提高","综合解决方案"],"ja":["リモートツールのサポート","ローカルツールのサポート","脅威の特定と対処","セキュリティ運用能力の向上","包括的なソリューション"],"ko":["원격 도구 지원","로컬 도구 지원","위협 식별 및 대응","보안 운영 능력 향상","종합 솔루션"],"es":["Identificación de amenazas no detectadas","Selección de herramientas de caza de amenazas","Uso de herramientas remotas y locales","Referencia de asignación de extensiones","Integración con herramientas de seguridad"],"fr":["Identification de menaces non détectées","Sélection d''outils de chasse aux menaces","Utilisation d''outils distants et locaux","Référence de mappage d''extensions","Intégration avec des outils de sécurité"],"de":["Identifizierung nicht erkannter Bedrohungen","Auswahl von Bedrohungs-Jagd-Tools","Verwendung von Remote- und Local-Tools","Referenz-Mapping von Erweiterungen","Integration mit Sicherheits-Tools"],"pt":["Identificação de ameaças ocultas","Utilização de ferramentas de segurança","Análise de eventos de segurança","Verificação de disponibilidade de ferramentas","Mapeamento de referências"],"ru":["Выявление скрытых угроз","Использование инструментов безопасности","Анализ событий безопасности","Проверка доступности инструментов","Сопоставление ссылок"],"ar":["تحديد التهديدات المخفية","استخدام أدوات الأمن","تحليل أحداث الأمن","التحقق من توافر الأدوات","تعيين المراجع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SecOps","威胁识别","安全运维","综合解决方案","远程工具","本地工具","安全技术"],"ja":["セキュリティ オペレーション","脅威の特定","セキュリティ運用","包括的なソリューション","リモートツール","ローカルツール","セキュリティ技術"],"ko":["SecOps","위협 식별","보안 운영","종합 솔루션","원격 도구","로컬 도구","보안 기술"],"es":["caza de amenazas","seguridad operativa","herramientas de caza de amenazas","identificación de amenazas","seguridad informática","secops"],"fr":["chasse aux menaces","sécurité opérationnelle","outils de chasse aux menaces","identification de menaces","sécurité informatique","secops"],"de":["Bedrohungs-Jagd","Sicherheits-Operationen","Bedrohungs-Jagd-Tools","Identifizierung von Bedrohungen","IT-Sicherheit","secops"],"pt":["segurança cibernética","caça de ameaças","ferramentas de segurança","análise de eventos","proteção de ambiente","segurança de rede"],"ru":["кибербезопасность","охота за угрозами","инструменты безопасности","анализ событий","защита среды","сетевая безопасность"],"ar":["أمن السيبراني","صيد التهديدات","أدوات الأمن","تحليل الأحداث","حماية البيئة","أمن الشبكة"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"secops-hunt","description":"Expert guidance for proactive threat hunting. Use this when the user asks to hunt for threads, IOCs, or specific TTPs.","bodyPreview":"# Threat Hunter\n\nYou are an expert Threat Hunter. Your goal is to proactively identify undetected threats in the environment.\n\n## Tool Selection & Availability\n\n**CRITICAL**: Before executing any step, determine which tools are available in the current environment.\n1.  **Check Availability**: Look for Remote tools (e.g., `udm_search`, `get_ioc_match`) first. If unavailable, use Local tools (e.g., `search_security_events`, `get_ioc_matches`).\n2.  **Reference Mapping**: Use `extensions/google-seco","body":"# Threat Hunter\n\nYou are an expert Threat Hunter. Your goal is to proactively identify undetected threats in the environment.\n\n## Tool Selection & Availability\n\n**CRITICAL**: Before executing any step, determine which tools are available in the current environment.\n1.  **Check Availability**: Look for Remote tools (e.g., `udm_search`, `get_ioc_match`) first. If unavailable, use Local tools (e.g., `search_security_events`, `get_ioc_matches`).\n2.  **Reference Mapping**: Use `extensions/google-secops/TOOL_MAPPING.md` to find the correct tool for each capability.\n3.  **Adapt Workflow**: If using Remote tools for Natural Language Search, perform `translate_udm_query` then `udm_search`. If using Local tools, use `search_security_events` directly.\n\n## Procedures\n\nSelect the most appropriate procedure from the options below.\n\n### Proactive Threat Hunting based on GTI Campaign/Actor\n\n**Objective**: Given a GTI Campaign or Threat Actor Collection ID (`${GTI_COLLECTION_ID}`), proactively search the local environment (SIEM) for related IOCs and TTPs.\n\n**Workflow**:\n\n1.  **Analyst Input**: Hunt for Campaign/Actor: `${GTI_COLLECTION_ID}`\n2.  **IOC Gathering**: Ask user for list of IOCs (files, domains, ips, urls) associated with the campaign/actor.\n3.  **Initial Scan**:\n    *   **Action**: Check for recent hits against these indicators.\n    *   **Remote**: `get_ioc_match`.\n    *   **Local**: `get_ioc_matches`.\n4.  **Phase 1 Lookup (Iterative SIEM Search)**:\n    *   For each prioritized IOC, construct and execute the appropriate UDM query:\n    *   **IP**: `principal.ip = \"IOC\" OR target.ip = \"IOC\" OR network.ip = \"IOC\"`\n    *   **Domain**: `principal.hostname = \"IOC\" OR target.hostname = \"IOC\" OR network.dns.questions.name = \"IOC\"`\n    *   **Hash**: `target.file.sha256 = \"IOC\" OR target.file.md5 = \"IOC\" OR target.file.sha1 = \"IOC\"`\n    *   **URL**: `target.url = \"IOC\"`\n    *   **Tool**: `udm_search` (Remote/Local).\n5.  **Phase 2 Deep Investigation (Confirmed IOCs)**:\n    *   **Action**: Search SIEM events for confirmed IOCs to understand context (e.g. process execution, network connections).\n    *   **Action**: Check for related cases (`list_cases`).\n6.  **Synthesis**: Synthesize all findings.\n7.  **Output**: Ask user to Create Case, Update Case, or Generate Report.\n    *   If **Report**: Generate a markdown report file using `write_file`.\n    *   If **Case**: Post a comment to SOAR.\n\n### Guided TTP Hunt (Example: Credential Access)\n\n**Objective**: Proactively hunt for evidence of specific MITRE ATT&CK Credential Access techniques (e.g., OS Credential Dumping T1003, Credentials from Password Stores T1555).\n\n**Inputs**:\n*   `${TECHNIQUE_IDS}`: List of MITRE IDs (e.g., \"T1003.001\").\n*   `${TIME_FRAME_HOURS}`: Lookback (default 72).\n*   `${TARGET_SCOPE_QUERY}`: Optional scope filter.\n\n**Workflow**:\n\n1.  **Research**: Review MITRE ATT&CK techniques or ask user for TTP details.\n2.  **Hunt Loop**:\n    *   **Develop Queries**: Formulate UDM queries for `udm_search` (e.g., specific process names, command lines).\n    *   **Execute**: Run the searches using `udm_search`.\n    *   **Analyze**: Review for anomalies. Does this match the hypothesis? Is it noise?\n    *   **Refine**: If too noisy, add filters. If no results, broaden query.\n    *   **Repeat**: Iterate until exhausted or leads found.\n3.  **Enrich**: Lookup suspicious entities found during the loop.\n    *   **Remote**: `summarize_entity`.\n    *   **Local**: `lookup_entity`.\n4.  **Document**: Post findings to a SOAR case or create a report.\n5.  **Escalate**: Identify if a new incident needs to be raised.\n\n## Common Procedures\n\n### Find Relevant SOAR Case\n\n**Objective**: Identify existing SOAR cases that are potentially relevant to the current investigation based on specific indicators.\n\n**Inputs**:\n*   `${SEARCH_TERMS}`: List of values to search (IOCs, etc.).\n\n**Steps**:\n1.  **Search**: Use `list_cases` with a filter for the search terms.\n2.  **Refine**: Optionally use `get_case` (Remote) or `get_case_full_details` (Local) to verify relevance.\n3.  **Output**: Return list of relevant `${RELEVANT_CASE_IDS}`."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:03:40.306Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Threat Detection Agents requiring proactive threat hunting capabilities with tools like udm_search and get_ioc_match.","zh":"适合需要主动威胁狩猎能力的高级威胁检测代理，使用诸如udm_search和get_ioc_match等工具。","ja":"プロアクティブな脅威ハンティング機能を必要とする高度な脅威検出エージェントに適しています。udm_searchやget_ioc_matchなどのツールを使用します。","ko":"프로액티브한 위협 사냥 능력을 필요로 하는 고급 위협 탐지 에이전트에 적합합니다. udm_search와 get_ioc_match와 같은 도구를 사용합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de detección de amenazas avanzadas que requieren capacidades de caza de amenazas proactivas con herramientas como udm_search y get_ioc_match.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de détection de menaces avancées nécessitant des capacités de chasse de menaces proactives avec des outils comme udm_search et get_ioc_match.","de":"Ideal für Advanced Threat Detection Agents, die proaktive Bedrohungsjagd-Funktionen mit Tools wie udm_search und get_ioc_match erfordern.","pt":"Ideal for Advanced Threat Detection Agents requiring proactive threat hunting capabilities with tools like udm_search and get_ioc_match.","ru":"Ideal for Advanced Threat Detection Agents requiring proactive threat hunting capabilities with tools like udm_search and get_ioc_match.","ar":"Ideal for Advanced Threat Detection Agents requiring proactive threat hunting capabilities with tools like udm_search and get_ioc_match."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to proactively identify undetected threats in the environment using Remote tools like udm_search and Local tools like search_security_events, leveraging extensions such as google-seco for reference mapping and IOC matching via get_ioc_matches.","zh":"赋予代理主动识别环境中未检测到的威胁的能力，使用诸如udm_search的远程工具和诸如search_security_events的本地工具，利用诸如google-seco的扩展进行参考映射和IOC匹配通过get_ioc_matches。","ja":"エージェントが環境内の未検出の脅威をプロアクティブに識別できるようにします。udm_searchなどのリモートツールやsearch_security_eventsなどのローカルツールを使用し、google-secoなどの拡張機能を使用してリファレンスマッピングとIOCマッチングをget_ioc_matchesで実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 환경 내에서检测되지 않은 위협을 프로액티브하게 식별할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다. udm_search와 같은 원격 도구와 search_security_events와 같은 로컬 도구를 사용하고, google-seco와 같은 확장을 사용하여 참조 매핑과 IOC 매칭을 get_ioc_matches를 통해 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar proactivamente amenazas no detectadas en el entorno utilizando herramientas remotas como udm_search y herramientas locales como search_security_events, aprovechando extensiones como google-seco para el mapeo de referencia y la coincidencia de IOC a través de get_ioc_matches.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier de manière proactive les menaces non détectées dans l''environnement en utilisant des outils à distance comme udm_search et des outils locaux comme search_security_events, en exploitant des extensions comme google-seco pour la cartographie de référence et la correspondance des IOC via get_ioc_matches.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, unerkannte Bedrohungen in der Umgebung proaktiv zu identifizieren, indem sie Remote-Tools wie udm_search und lokale Tools wie search_security_events verwenden, wobei Erweiterungen wie google-seco für die Referenzabbildung und die IOC-Abgleichung über get_ioc_matches genutzt werden.","pt":"Empowers agents to proactively identify undetected threats in the environment using Remote tools like udm_search and Local tools like search_security_events, leveraging extensions such as google-seco for reference mapping and IOC matching via get_ioc_matches.","ru":"Empowers agents to proactively identify undetected threats in the environment using Remote tools like udm_search and Local tools like search_security_events, leveraging extensions such as google-seco for reference mapping and IOC matching via get_ioc_matches.","ar":"Empowers agents to proactively identify undetected threats in the environment using Remote tools like udm_search and Local tools like search_security_events, leveraging extensions such as google-seco for reference mapping and IOC matching via get_ioc_matches."},"useCases":{"en":["Proactively hunting undetected threats in the environment","Executing remote searches with udm_search for threat detection","Utilizing local tools like search_security_events for comprehensive threat analysis"],"zh":["主动狩猎环境中未检测到的威胁","使用udm_search执行远程搜索以进行威胁检测","使用诸如search_security_events的本地工具进行全面威胁分析"],"ja":["環境内の未検出の脅威をプロアクティブに狩猎する","udm_searchを使用してリモート検索を実行して脅威を検出する","search_security_eventsなどのローカルツールを使用して包括的な脅威分析を実行する"],"ko":["환경 내에서检测되지 않은 위협을 프로액티브하게 사냥한다","udm_search를 사용하여 원격 검색을 수행하여 위협을 탐지한다","search_security_events와 같은 로컬 도구를 사용하여 포괄적인 위협 분석을 수행한다"],"es":["Cazar proactivamente amenazas no detectadas en el entorno","Ejecutar búsquedas remotas con udm_search para la detección de amenazas","Utilizar herramientas locales como search_security_events para un análisis de amenazas integral"],"fr":["Chasser de manière proactive les menaces non détectées dans l''environnement","Exécuter des recherches à distance avec udm_search pour la détection des menaces","Utiliser des outils locaux comme search_security_events pour une analyse de menaces complète"],"de":["Proaktiv unerkannte Bedrohungen in der Umgebung jagen","Remote-Suchen mit udm_search für die Bedrohungserkennung ausführen","Lokale Tools wie search_security_events für eine umfassende Bedrohungsanalyse nutzen"],"pt":["Proactively hunting undetected threats in the environment","Executing remote searches with udm_search for threat detection","Utilizing local tools like search_security_events for comprehensive threat analysis"],"ru":["Proactively hunting undetected threats in the environment","Executing remote searches with udm_search for threat detection","Utilizing local tools like search_security_events for comprehensive threat analysis"],"ar":["Proactively hunting undetected threats in the environment","Executing remote searches with udm_search for threat detection","Utilizing local tools like search_security_events for comprehensive threat analysis"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires availability of specific tools (udm_search, get_ioc_match, search_security_events, get_ioc_matches)","Dependent on environment''s tool selection and availability"],"zh":["需要特定工具（udm_search、get_ioc_match、search_security_events、get_ioc_matches）的可用性","依赖于环境的工具选择和可用性"],"ja":["特定ツール（udm_search、get_ioc_match、search_security_events、get_ioc_matches）の可用性が必要","環境のツール選択と可用性に依存する"],"ko":["특정 도구（udm_search, get_ioc_match, search_security_events, get_ioc_matches）的 가용성이 필요함","환경의 도구 선택과 가용성에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere la disponibilidad de herramientas específicas (udm_search, get_ioc_match, search_security_events, get_ioc_matches)","Depende de la selección y disponibilidad de herramientas del entorno"],"fr":["Nécessite la disponibilité d''outils spécifiques (udm_search, get_ioc_match, search_security_events, get_ioc_matches)","Dépend de la sélection et de la disponibilité des outils de l''environnement"],"de":["Erfordert die Verfügbarkeit spezifischer Tools (udm_search, get_ioc_match, search_security_events, get_ioc_matches)","Hängt von der Auswahl und Verfügbarkeit von Tools in der Umgebung ab"],"pt":["Requires availability of specific tools (udm_search, get_ioc_match, search_security_events, get_ioc_matches)","Dependent on environment''s tool selection and availability"],"ru":["Requires availability of specific tools (udm_search, get_ioc_match, search_security_events, get_ioc_matches)","Dependent on environment''s tool selection and availability"],"ar":["Requires availability of specific tools (udm_search, get_ioc_match, search_security_events, get_ioc_matches)","Dependent on environment''s tool selection and availability"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/cli', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'cli', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z', '2026-02-18T04:03:31.787Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/cli","name":"cli","description":{"zh":"CLI ","ja":"CLI","ko":"CLI ","es":"La CLI de plyrfm permite a los desarrolladores subir y gestionar pistas de audio de manera programática. Con ella, pueden automatizar tareas y mejorar su flujo de trabajo","fr":"La CLI plyrfm permet aux développeurs de télécharger et de gérer des pistes audio de manière programmée. Avec cela, ils peuvent automatiser des tâches et améliorer leur flux de travail","de":"Die plyrfm CLI ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Musiktracks programmgesteuert hochzuladen und zu verwalten. Damit können sie Aufgaben automatisieren und ihren Arbeitsablauf verbessern","pt":"O CLI PlyrFM é uma ferramenta de linha de comando para interagir com o servidor MCP. Ele permite uploads, buscas e gerenciamento de faixas musicais de forma eficiente.","ru":"CLI PlyrFM - это инструмент командной строки для взаимодействия с сервером MCP. Он позволяет загружать, искать и управлять музыкальными треками эффективно.","ar":"CLI PlyrFM هو أداة سطر الأوامر للتفاعل مع خادم MCP. يسمح بتحميل و بحث و إدارة المسارات الموسيقية بفعالية.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"CLI ","ja":"CLI","ko":"CLI","es":"CLI de plyrfm: subir y gestionar pistas de audio","fr":"CLI plyrfm : télécharger et gérer des pistes audio","de":"plyrfm CLI: Musiktracks hochladen und verwalten","pt":"CLI PlyrFM: Ferramentas de Linha de Comando para Desenvol...","ru":"CLI PlyrFM: Инструменты командной строки для разработчиков","ar":"CLI PlyrFM: أدوات سطر الأوامر للاطلاع","en":"