egos y optimización de rendimiento","fr":"Expert en développement de jeux Unity avec C# et connaissance approfondie de l''architecture de jeux et d''optimisation des performances","de":"Experte für Unity-Spielentwicklung mit C# und tiefem Wissen über Spielarchitektur und Leistungsoptimierung","pt":"Unity é uma plataforma de desenvolvimento de jogos que utiliza C# e oferece recursos para criar jogos de alta qualidade","ru":"Unity - это платформа для разработки игр, которая использует C# и предлагает функции для создания игр высокого качества","ar":"یونیتی هي منصة لتطوير الألعاب التي تستخدم سي شارب وتوفر ميزات لإنشاء ألعاب عالية الجودة","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["Unity游戏开发","C#编程","游戏架构","性能优化","组件化架构"],"ja":["Unityゲーム開発","C#プログラミング","ゲームアーキテクチャ","パフォーマンス最適化","コンポーネントアーキテクチャ"],"ko":["유니티 게임 개발","C# 프로그래밍","게임 아키텍처","성능 최적화","컴포넌트 아키텍처"],"es":["Desarrollo de juegos con Unity y C#","Arquitectura de juegos modular con componentes","Optimización de rendimiento y escalabilidad","Conocimientos profundos de MonoBehaviour y GameObject","Priorización de la mantenibilidad y la escalabilidad","Uso de características integradas de Unity"],"fr":["Développement de jeux avec Unity et C#","Architecture de jeux modulaire avec des composants","Optimisation des performances et de la scalabilité","Connaissances approfondies de MonoBehaviour et GameObject","Priorisation de la maintenabilité et de la scalabilité","Utilisation des fonctionnalités intégrées de Unity"],"de":["Spielentwicklung mit Unity und C#","Modulare Spielarchitektur mit Komponenten","Leistungs- und Skalierungsoptimierung","Tiefes Wissen über MonoBehaviour und GameObject","Priorisierung von Wartbarkeit und Skalierbarkeit","Verwendung von integrierten Unity-Funktionen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de jogos 2D e 3D","Uso de C# para programação","Arquitetura de jogos modular","Otimização de desempenho","Recursos de física e animação","Integração com outras plataformas"],"ru":["Разработка игр 2D и 3D","Использование C# для программирования","Модульная архитектура игр","Оптимизация производительности","Функции физики и анимации","Интеграция с другими платформами"],"ar":["تطوير ألعاب 2D و 3D","استخدام سي شارب للبرمجة","هندسة الألعاب الموديلار","تحسين الأداء","ميزات الفيزياء والرسوم المتحركة","التكامل مع منصات أخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Unity游戏开发","C#编程","游戏架构","性能优化","组件化架构","游戏开发引擎"],"ja":["Unityゲーム開発","C#プログラミング","ゲームアーキテクチャ","パフォーマンス最適化","コンポーネントアーキテクチャ","ゲーム開発エンジン"],"ko":["유니티 게임 개발","C# 프로그래밍","게임 아키텍처","성능 최적화","컴포넌트 아키텍처","게임 개발 엔진"],"es":["desarrollo de juegos Unity","C# en Unity","arquitectura de juegos","optimización de rendimiento","MonBehaviour","GameObject","componentes","escalabilidad","mantenibilidad"],"fr":["développement de jeux Unity","C# dans Unity","architecture de jeux","optimisation des performances","MonBehaviour","GameObject","composants","scalabilité","maintenabilité"],"de":["Unity-Spielentwicklung","C# in Unity","Spielarchitektur","Leistungsoptimierung","MonBehaviour","GameObject","Komponenten","Skalierbarkeit","Wartbarkeit"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de jogos","Unity","C#","arquitetura de jogos","otimização de desempenho","jogos 2D","jogos 3D","física","animação"],"ru":["разработка игр","Unity","C#","архитектура игр","оптимизация производительности","игры 2D","игры 3D","физика","анимация"],"ar":["تطوير الألعاب","یونیتی","سي شارب","هندسة الألعاب","تحسين الأداء","ألعاب 2D","ألعاب 3D","فيزياء","رسوم متحركة"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"unity","description":"Expert in Unity and C# game development with performance optimization patterns","bodyPreview":"# Unity\n\nYou are an expert in Unity game development and C# with deep knowledge of game architecture and performance optimization.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n- Write clear, technical responses with precise C# and Unity examples\n- Leverage built-in features and prioritize maintainability following C# conventions\n- Structure projects modularly using component-based architecture\n- Prioritize performance, scalability, and maintainability in architecture\n\n## C# Standards\n\n- Employ MonoBehaviour for GameObj","body":"# Unity\n\nYou are an expert in Unity game development and C# with deep knowledge of game architecture and performance optimization.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n- Write clear, technical responses with precise C# and Unity examples\n- Leverage built-in features and prioritize maintainability following C# conventions\n- Structure projects modularly using component-based architecture\n- Prioritize performance, scalability, and maintainability in architecture\n\n## C# Standards\n\n- Employ MonoBehaviour for GameObject components\n- Use ScriptableObjects for data containers and data-driven design\n- Use TryGetComponent to avoid null references\n- Prefer direct references over GameObject.Find()\n- Always use TextMeshPro for text rendering\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\n- PascalCase for public members\n- camelCase for private members\n- Variables: `m_VariableName`\n- Constants: `c_ConstantName`\n- Statics: `s_StaticName`\n\n## Game Systems\n\n- Utilize physics engine for physical interactions\n- Use Input System for player controls\n- Implement UI system for user interfaces\n- Apply state machines for complex behaviors\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n- Implement object pooling for frequently instantiated objects\n- Optimize draw calls through batching\n- Implement LOD (Level of Detail) systems\n- Use profiler to identify bottlenecks\n- Cache component references\n- Minimize garbage collection\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- Implement error handling via try-catch blocks\n- Use Debug class for logging\n- Handle null references gracefully\n- Implement proper exception handling\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Use component-based design\n- Implement proper separation of concerns\n- Write modular, reusable code\n- Document public APIs and complex logic\n- Follow Unity''s recommended project structure\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:03:39.766Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Game Development Agents needing advanced Unity game development and C# capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Unity游戏开发和C#功能的游戏开发代理。","ja":"Unityゲーム開発とC#の高度な機能を必要とするゲーム開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Unity 게임 개발 및 C# 기능이 필요한 게임 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de juegos que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo de juegos avanzados de Unity y C#.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement de jeux ayant besoin de capacités de développement de jeux Unity avancées et de fonctionnalités C#.","de":"Perfekt für Game-Development-Agents, die erweiterte Unity-Spielentwicklungsfähigkeiten und C#-Fähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Jogos que necessitam de capacidades avançadas em desenvolvimento de jogos Unity e C#.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки игр, которым требуются продвинутые возможности разработки игр на Unity и знания C#.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تطوير الألعاب الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة في تطوير ألعاب Unity و C#."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to structure projects modularly using component-based architecture, leveraging built-in Unity features and prioritizing maintainability following C# conventions, while utilizing MonoBehaviour for GameObjects.","zh":"赋予代理将项目模块化地结构化，使用基于组件的架构，利用Unity的内置功能，优先考虑可维护性，遵循C#惯例，同时使用MonoBehaviour为游戏对象。","ja":"エージェントがプロジェクトをモジュラーに構造化できるようにし、コンポーネントベースのアーキテクチャを使用し、Unityのビルトイン機能を活用し、C#の規則に従って保守性を優先し、GameObject用にMonoBehaviourを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 프로젝트를 모듈식으로 구조화할 수 있도록 하며, 구성 요소 기반 아키텍처를 사용하며, Unity의 내장 기능을 활용하며, C# 규칙을 따르며, 유지 보수성을 우선하며, GameObject용 MonoBehaviour를 사용합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para estructurar proyectos de forma modular utilizando arquitectura basada en componentes, aprovechando las características integradas de Unity y priorizando la mantenibilidad siguiendo las convenciones de C#, mientras utiliza MonoBehaviour para objetos GameObject.","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour structurer les projets de manière modulaire en utilisant une architecture basée sur les composants, en exploitant les fonctionnalités intégrées d''Unity et en donnant la priorité à la maintainabilité en suivant les conventions C#, tout en utilisant MonoBehaviour pour les objets GameObject.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Projekte modular zu strukturieren, indem sie eine komponentenbasierte Architektur verwenden, integrierte Unity-Features nutzen und die Wartbarkeit unter Berücksichtigung der C#-Konventionen priorisieren, während sie MonoBehaviour für GameObjects verwenden.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a estruturar projetos modularmente usando arquitetura baseada em componentes, aproveitando os recursos internos do Unity e priorizando a maintainabilidade seguindo as convenções do C#, enquanto utiliza MonoBehaviour para GameObjects.","ru":"Позволяет агентам модульно структурировать проекты, используя компонентно-ориентированную архитектуру, задействуя встроенные функции Unity и уделяя приоритетное внимание сопровождаемости в соответствии с соглашениями C#, при этом используя MonoBehaviour для GameObject.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من هيكلة المشاريع بشكل معياري باستخدام بنية قائمة على المكونات، والاستفادة من الميزات المضمنة في Unity، ووضع قابلية الصيانة كأولوية باتباع اصطلاحات C#، مع استخدام MonoBehaviour للكائنات GameObject."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing game performance using Unity''s built-in features","Generating modular game architectures with C#","Debugging Unity projects using C#"],"zh":["使用Unity的内置功能优化游戏性能","使用C#生成模块化的游戏架构","使用C#调试Unity项目"],"ja":["Unityのビルトイン機能を使用してゲームパフォーマンスを最適化する","C#を使用してモジュラーなゲームアーキテクチャを生成する","C#を使用してUnityプロジェクトをデバッグする"],"ko":["Unity의 내장 기능을 사용하여 게임 성능을 최적화하는 것","C#를 사용하여 모듈식 게임 아키텍처를 생성하는 것","C#를 사용하여 Unity 프로젝트를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento del juego utilizando las características integradas de Unity","Generar arquitecturas de juego modulares con C#","Depurar proyectos de Unity utilizando C#"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances du jeu en utilisant les fonctionnalités intégrées d''Unity","Générer des architectures de jeu modulaires avec C#","Déboguer les projets Unity en utilisant C#"],"de":["Die Leistung des Spiels mit den integrierten Unity-Features optimieren","Modulare Spielarchitekturen mit C# generieren","Unity-Projekte mit C# debuggen"],"pt":["Otimizar o desempenho do jogo usando os recursos internos do Unity","Gerar arquiteturas de jogo modulares com C#","Depurar projetos Unity usando C#"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности игры с использованием встроенных функций Unity","Создание модульных игровых архитектур с помощью C#","Отладка проектов Unity с использованием C#"],"ar":["تحسين أداء اللعبة باستخدام الميزات المضمنة في Unity","إنشاء بنى ألعاب معيارية باستخدام C#","تصحيح مشاريع Unity باستخدام C#"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Unity game development environment","C# programming language only","Component-based architecture"],"zh":["需要Unity游戏开发环境","仅支持C#编程语言","基于组件的架构"],"ja":["Unityゲーム開発環境が必要","C#プログラミング言語のみをサポート","コンポーネントベースのアーキテクチャ"],"ko":["Unity 게임 개발 환경이 필요함","C# 프로그래밍 언어만 지원함","구성 요소 기반 아키텍처"],"es":["Requiere entorno de desarrollo de juegos de Unity","Lenguaje de programación C# solo","Arquitectura basada en componentes"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de développement de jeux Unity","Langage de programmation C# uniquement","Architecture basée sur les composants"],"de":["Benötigt Unity-Game-Development-Umgebung","Nur C#-Programmiersprache","Komponentenbasierte Architektur"],"pt":["Requer o ambiente de desenvolvimento de jogos Unity","Apenas a linguagem de programação C#","Arquitetura baseada em componentes"],"ru":["Требует среду разработки игр Unity","Только язык программирования C#","Компонентно-ориентированная архитектура"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تطوير ألعاب Unity","لغة البرمجة C# فقط","بنية قائمة على المكونات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/tuist', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'tuist', 0, 0, 0, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z', '2026-02-18T04:03:48.081Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/tuist","name":"tuist","description":{"zh":"Tuist 是一个项目生成和构建工具，支持生成项目、声明目标和构建设置","ja":"Tuist はプロジェクト生成とビルドツールで、プロジェクトの生成、ターゲットの宣言、ビルド設定をサポートします","ko":"Tuist는 프로젝트 생성 및 빌드 도구로 프로젝트 생성, 대상 선언, 빌드 설정을 지원합니다","es":"Tuist es una herramienta de desarrollo que permite generar proyectos y compilar código de manera eficiente","fr":"Tuist est un outil de développement qui permet de générer des projets et de compiler du code de manière efficace","de":"Tuist ist ein Entwicklungstool, das die Erstellung von Projekten und die Kompilierung von Code ermöglicht","pt":"O Tuist é uma ferramenta que permite gerar projetos sem abrir o Xcode, melhorando a produtividade do desenvolvimento de aplicativos.","ru":"Tuist - это инструмент, который позволяет генерировать проекты без открытия Xcode, улучшая производительность разработки приложений.","ar":"Tuist هو أداة يسمح بتوليد المشاريع دون فتح Xcode، مما يحسن إنتاجية تطوير التطبيقات.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Tuist 项目生成和构建工具","ja":"Tuist プロジェクト生成とビルドツール","ko":"Tuist 프로젝트 생성 및 빌드 도구","es":"Tuist: Generación de Proyectos y Compilación de Código","fr":"Tuist : Génération de Projets et Compilation de Code","de":"Tuist: Projektgenerierung und Codekompilierung","pt":"Tuist: Ferramenta de Geração de Projetos para Desenvolved...","ru":"Tuist: Инструмент для генерации проектов для разработчиков","ar":"Tuist: أداة توليد المشاريع للمانحين","en":"tuist"},"description":{"zh":"Tuist 是一个项目生成和构建工具，支持生成项目、声明目标和构建设置","ja":"Tuist はプロジェクト生成とビルドツールで、プロジェクトの生成、ターゲットの宣言、ビルド設定をサポートします","ko":"Tuist는 프로젝트 생성 및 빌드 도구로 프로젝트 생성, 대상 선언, 빌드 설정을 지원합니다","es":"Tuist es una herramienta de desarrollo que permite generar proyectos y compilar código de manera eficiente","fr":"Tuist est un outil de développement qui permet de générer des projets et de compiler du code de manière efficace","de":"Tuist ist ein Entwicklungstool, das die Erstellung von Projekten und die Kompilierung von Code ermöglicht","pt":"O Tuist é uma ferramenta que permite gerar projetos sem abrir o Xcode, melhorando a produtividade do desenvolvimento de aplicativos.","ru":"Tuist - это инструмент, который позволяет генерировать проекты без открытия Xcode, улучшая производительность разработки приложений.","ar":"Tuist هو أداة يسمح بتوليد المشاريع دون فتح Xcode، مما يحسن إنتاجية تطوير التطبيقات.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["生成项目无需打开 Xcode","声明目标时使用 buildableFolders","支持使用 xcodebuild 进行构建","启用缓存和改进构建设置","支持 Swift 语言","支持多平台构建"],"ja":["Xcode を開くことなくプロジェクトを生成","ターゲットを宣言するときに buildableFolders を使用","xcodebuild を使用したビルドをサポート","キャッシュを有効にしてビルド設定を改善","Swift 言語をサポート","複数のプラットフォームをサポートしたビルド"],"ko":["Xcode를 열지 않고 프로젝트를 생성","대상을 선언할 때 buildableFolders를 사용","xcodebuild를 사용한 빌드를 지원","캐시를 활성화하고 빌드 설정을 개선","Swift 언어를 지원","다중 플랫폼 빌드를 지원"],"es":["Generación de proyectos sin abrir Xcode","Declaración de objetivos con buildableFolders","Compilación con xcodebuild y caché","Mejora del rendimiento de compilación","Compatibilidad con Swift y otros lenguajes"],"fr":["Génération de projets sans ouvrir Xcode","Déclaration d''objectifs avec buildableFolders","Compilation avec xcodebuild et cache","Amélioration des performances de compilation","Compatibilité avec Swift et d''autres langages"],"de":["Projektgenerierung ohne Xcode","Zieldeklaration mit buildableFolders","Kompilierung mit xcodebuild und Cache","Leistungsverbesserung bei der Kompilierung","Kompatibilität mit Swift und anderen Sprachen"],"pt":["Geração de projetos sem abrir o Xcode","Declaração de targets com buildableFolders","Construção com xcodebuild e cache","Melhoria da produtividade do desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Suporte a múltiplos destinos e produtos"],"ru":["Генерация проектов без открытия Xcode","Декларация целевых объектов с buildableFolders","Строительство с xcodebuild и кэшем","Улучшение производительности разработки приложений","Поддержка нескольких мест назначения и продуктов"],"ar":["توليد المشاريع بدون فتح Xcode","إعلان الأهداف مع buildableFolders","بناء مع xcodebuild و ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت","تحسين إنتاجية تطوير التطبيقات","دعم عدة وجهات و منتجات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tuist","项目生成","构建工具","Xcode","Swift","buildableFolders","xcodebuild","缓存","构建设置"],"ja":["Tuist","プロジェクト生成","ビルドツール","Xcode","Swift","buildableFolders","xcodebuild","キャッシュ","ビルド設定"],"ko":["Tuist","프로젝트 생성","빌드 도구","Xcode","Swift","buildableFolders","xcodebuild","캐시","빌드 설정"],"es":["Tuist","generación de proyectos","compilación de código","desarrollo de software","Xcode","Swift","buildableFolders","xcodebuild"],"fr":["Tuist","génération de projets","compilation de code","développement de logiciels","Xcode","Swift","buildableFolders","xcodebuild"],"de":["Tuist","Projektgenerierung","Codekompilierung","Softwareentwicklung","Xcode","Swift","buildableFolders","xcodebuild"],"pt":["Tuist","Geração de projetos","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Xcode","xcodebuild","BuildableFolders","Produtividade","Desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Tuist","Генерация проектов","Разработка приложений","Xcode","xcodebuild","BuildableFolders","Производительность","Разработчики"],"ar":["Tuist","توليد المشاريع","تطوير التطبيقات","Xcode","xcodebuild","buildableFolders","الإنتاجية","المانحين"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tuist","description":"Best practices for Tuist projects. Use when working with Tuist manifests, generating projects, or building with xcodebuild in Tuist projects.","bodyPreview":"# Tuist\n\n## Project Generation\n\nGenerate projects without opening Xcode:\n\n```bash\ntuist generate --no-open\n```\n\n## Target Declaration\n\nUse `buildableFolders` when declaring targets to avoid regenerating projects on file changes:\n\n```swift\nlet target = Target(\n    name: \"MyApp\",\n    destinations: [.iPhone],\n    product: .app,\n    bundleId: \"com.example.app\",\n    buildableFolders: [\"Sources/\", \"Resources/\"]\n)\n```\n\n## Building with xcodebuild\n\nPass these build settings to enable caching and improve","body":"# Tuist\n\n## Project Generation\n\nGenerate projects without opening Xcode:\n\n```bash\ntuist generate --no-open\n```\n\n## Target Declaration\n\nUse `buildableFolders` when declaring targets to avoid regenerating projects on file changes:\n\n```swift\nlet target = Target(\n    name: \"MyApp\",\n    destinations: [.iPhone],\n    product: .app,\n    bundleId: \"com.example.app\",\n    buildableFolders: [\"Sources/\", \"Resources/\"]\n)\n```\n\n## Building with xcodebuild\n\nPass these build settings to enable caching and improve build performance:\n\n```bash\nxcodebuild build \\\n  -scheme MyScheme \\\n  COMPILATION_CACHE_ENABLE_CACHING=YES \\\n  CLANG_ENABLE_COMPILE_CACHE=YES \\\n  SWIFT_ENABLE_EXPLICIT_MODULES=YES \\\n  SWIFT_USE_INTEGRATED_DRIVER=YES\n```\n\n## Disable Signing for CI/Agent Builds\n\nWhen building through an agent or CI, disable code signing:\n\n```bash\nxcodebuild build \\\n  -scheme MyScheme \\\n  CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY=\"\"\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:03:48.081Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for iOS Development Agents automating Xcode project generation and build optimization.","zh":"对于自动化 Xcode 项目生成和构建优化的 iOS 开发代理而言至关重要。","ja":"Xcodeプロジェクトの生成とビルド最適化を自動化するiOS開発エージェントにとって必須です。","ko":"Xcode 프로젝트 생성 및 빌드 최적화를 자동화하는 iOS 개발 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de desarrollo iOS que automatizan la generación de proyectos de Xcode y la optimización de compilación.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de développement iOS automatisant la génération de projets Xcode et l''optimisation des builds.","de":"Essenziell für iOS-Entwicklungs-Agents, die die Xcode-Projekterstellung und Build-Optimierung automatisieren.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do iOS que automatizam a geração de projetos do Xcode e a otimização da compilação.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов разработки iOS, автоматизирующих генерацию проектов Xcode и оптимизацию сборки.","ar":"ضروري ل وكلاء تطوير iOS الذين يؤتمرون إنشاء مشاريع Xcode وتحسين البناء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to programmatically generate Xcode projects without manual intervention, leveraging `buildableFolders` to prevent unnecessary regeneration on file changes and integrating with `xcodebuild` for caching-enabled builds.","zh":"使代理能够以编程方式生成 Xcode 项目而无需手动干预，利用 `buildableFolders` 防止文件更改时不必要的重新生成，并与 `xcodebuild` 集成以实现支持缓存的构建。","ja":"エージェントが手動介入なしでプログラム的にXcodeプロジェクトを生成できるようにし、`buildableFolders`を活用してファイル変更時の不要な再生成を防止し、キャッシュ対応ビルドのために`xcodebuild`と統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 수동 개입 없이 프로그래밍 방식으로 Xcode 프로젝트를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, `buildableFolders`를 활용하여 파일 변경 시 불필요한 재생성을 방지하고 캐시 사용 빌드를 위해 `xcodebuild`와 통합합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar proyectos de Xcode mediante programación sin intervención manual, aprovechando `buildableFolders` para evitar regeneraciones innecesarias ante cambios de archivos e integrándose con `xcodebuild` para builds con caché habilitada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer programmatiquement des projets Xcode sans intervention manuelle, en tirant parti de `buildableFolders` pour éviter une régénération inutile lors des modifications de fichiers et en s''intégrant à `xcodebuild` pour des builds avec cache activé.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Xcode-Projekte programmgesteuert ohne manuelles Eingreifen zu generieren, nutzt `buildableFolders`, um unnötige Neugenerierung bei Dateiänderungen zu verhindern, und integriert sich mit `xcodebuild` für Cache-fähige Builds.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem projetos do Xcode programaticamente sem intervenção manual, utilizando `buildableFolders` para evitar regeneração desnecessária em alterações de arquivos e integrando com `xcodebuild` para compilações com cache habilitado.","ru":"Позволяет агентам программно генерировать проекты Xcode без ручного вмешательства, используя `buildableFolders` для предотвращения ненужного повторного создания при изменении файлов и интегрируя с `xcodebuild` для кэшируемых сборок.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بإنشاء مشاريع Xcode برمجيًا دون تدخل يدوي، باستخدام `buildableFolders` لمنع إعادة إنشاء غير ضرورية عند تغيير الملفات وتكامل مع `xcodebuild` لتشغيل ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Xcode project generation in CI/CD pipelines","Optimizing build times through cache-friendly project configuration","Managing multi-target iOS projects without manual Xcode setup"],"zh":["在 CI/CD 流水线中自动化 Xcode 项目生成","通过缓存友好的项目配置优化构建时间","无需手动 Xcode 设置即可管理多目标 iOS 项目"],"ja":["CI/CDパイプラインでのXcodeプロジェクト生成の自動化","キャッシュフレンドリーなプロジェクト構成によるビルド時間の最適化","手動のXcode設定なしでのマルチターゲットiOSプロジェクトの管理"],"ko":["CI/CD 파이프라인에서 Xcode 프로젝트 생성 자동화","캐시 친화적인 프로젝트 구성을 통한 빌드 시간 최적화","수동 Xcode 설정 없이 다중 타겟 iOS 프로젝트 관리"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de proyectos de Xcode en pipelines de CI/CD","Optimización de tiempos de compilación mediante configuración de proyectos compatible con caché","Gestión de proyectos iOS multi-target sin configuración manual de Xcode"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de projets Xcode dans les pipelines CI/CD","Optimisation des temps de build via une configuration de projet compatible avec le cache","Gestion de projets iOS multi-cibles sans configuration manuelle de Xcode"],"de":["Automatisierung der Xcode-Projekterstellung in CI/CD-Pipelines","Optimierung der Build-Zeiten durch Cache-freundliche Projektkonfiguration","Verwaltung von iOS-Projekten mit mehreren Targets ohne manuelle Xcode-Einrichtung"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de projetos do Xcode em pipelines de CI/CD","Otimizar tempos de compilação por meio de configuração de projeto amigável ao cache","Gerenciar projetos iOS multi-alvo sem configuração manual do Xcode"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию проектов Xcode в конвейерах CI/CD","Оптимизировать время сборки за счет конфигурации проекта, дружественной к кэшу","Управлять многоцелевыми проектами iOS без ручной настройки Xcode"],"ar":["توفير آلي لإنشاء مشاريع Xcode في أنابيب CI/CD","تحسين أوقات البناء من خلال تكوين مشروع ذكي للذاكرة المؤقتة","إدارة مشاريع iOS متعددة الأهداف بدون إعداد يدوي لبرنامج Xcode"]},"limitations":{"en":["Xcode projects only (iOS/macOS ecosystem)","Requires tuist CLI installation on host system","Dependent on xcodebuild for final compilation"],"zh":["仅限 Xcode 项目（iOS/macOS 生态系统）","需要在主机系统上安装 tuist CLI","最终编译依赖于 xcodebuild"],"ja":["Xcodeプロジェクトのみ（iOS/macOSエコシステム）","ホストシステムへのtuist CLIのインストールが必要","最終コンパイルはxcodebuildに依存"],"ko":["Xcode 프로젝트 전용 (iOS/macOS 생태계)","호스트 시스템에 tuist CLI 설치 필요","최종 컴파일은 xcodebuild에 의존"],"es":["Solo proyectos de Xcode (ecosistema iOS/macOS)","Requiere la instalación de la CLI de tuist en el sistema host","Depende de xcodebuild para la compilación final"],"fr":["Projets Xcode uniquement (écosystème iOS/macOS)","Nécessite l''installation de l''interface CLI de tuist sur le système hôte","Dépend de xcodebuild pour la compilation finale"],"de":["Nur Xcode-Projekte (iOS/macOS-Ökosystem)","Erfordert die Installation der tuist-CLI auf dem Host-System","Abhängig von xcodebuild für die endgültige Kompilierung"],"pt":["Apenas projetos do Xcode (ecossistema iOS/macOS)","Requer instalação do tuist CLI no sistema host","Dependente do xcodebuild para compilação final"],"ru":["Только проекты Xcode (экосистема iOS/macOS)","Требуется установка tuist CLI на хост-системе","Зависит от xcodebuild для окончательной компиляции"],"ar":["مشاريع Xcode فقط (نظام iOS/macOS)","يتطلب تثبيت واجهة命令 tuist على نظام المضيف","يعتمد على xcodebuild للترجمة النهائية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":0}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/boltz', 'community', 'majiayu000', 'claude-skill-registry', 'majiayu000/claude-skill-registry', 'boltz', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z', '2026-02-18T04:04:17.571Z', NULL, '{"id":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry/boltz","name":"boltz","description":{"zh":"Boltz是一种用于蛋白质结构预测的工具，需要特定的环境配置","ja":"Boltzは蛋白質構造予測ツールであり、特定の環境設定が必要です","ko":"Boltz는 단백질 구조 예측을 위한 도구로 특정 환경 설정이 필요합니다","es":"Boltz es una herramienta de predicción de estructuras de proteínas que requiere Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ y una tarjeta gráfica con al menos 24GB de VRAM.","fr":"Boltz est un outil de prédiction de structures de protéines qui nécessite Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ et une carte graphique avec au moins 24GB de VRAM.","de":"Boltz ist ein Tool zur Vorhersage von Proteinstrukturen, das Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ und eine Grafikkarte mit mindestens 24GB VRAM erfordert.","pt":"Boltz é uma ferramenta de previsão de estrutura de proteínas que utiliza Claude Code. Requer Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ e GPU VRAM 24GB.","ru":"Boltz - это инструмент для предсказания структуры белков, использующий Claude Code. Требует Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ и GPU VRAM 24GB.","ar":"Boltz 是一种预测蛋白质结构的工具，使用 Claude Code。需要 Python 3.10+、CUDA 12.0+ 和 GPU VRAM 24GB。","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Boltz结构预测","ja":"Boltz構造予測","ko":"Boltz 구조 예측","es":"Boltz: Predicción de Estructuras de Proteínas","fr":"Boltz: Prédiction de Structures de Protéines","de":"Boltz: Proteinstrukturvorhersage","pt":"Boltz: Previsão de Estrutura de Proteínas com Claude Code","ru":"Boltz: Предсказание Структуры Белков с Claude Code","ar":"Boltz: 预测蛋白质结构与 Claude Code","en":"boltz"},"description":{"zh":"Boltz是一种用于蛋白质结构预测的工具，需要特定的环境配置","ja":"Boltzは蛋白質構造予測ツールであり、特定の環境設定が必要です","ko":"Boltz는 단백질 구조 예측을 위한 도구로 특정 환경 설정이 필요합니다","es":"Boltz es una herramienta de predicción de estructuras de proteínas que requiere Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ y una tarjeta gráfica con al menos 24GB de VRAM.","fr":"Boltz est un outil de prédiction de structures de protéines qui nécessite Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ et une carte graphique avec au moins 24GB de VRAM.","de":"Boltz ist ein Tool zur Vorhersage von Proteinstrukturen, das Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ und eine Grafikkarte mit mindestens 24GB VRAM erfordert.","pt":"Boltz é uma ferramenta de previsão de estrutura de proteínas que utiliza Claude Code. Requer Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ e GPU VRAM 24GB.","ru":"Boltz - это инструмент для предсказания структуры белков, использующий Claude Code. Требует Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ и GPU VRAM 24GB.","ar":"Boltz 是一种预测蛋白质结构的工具，使用 Claude Code。需要 Python 3.10+、CUDA 12.0+ 和 GPU VRAM 24GB。","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["支持Python 3.10+","需要CUDA 12.0+","至少24GB GPU VRAM","支持Modal和biomodals","可以预测蛋白质结构"],"ja":["Python 3.10+をサポート","CUDA 12.0+が必要","24GBのGPU VRAM以上","Modalとbiomodalsをサポート","蛋白質構造を予測可能"],"ko":["Python 3.10+ 지원","CUDA 12.0+ 필요","24GB GPU VRAM 이상","Modal과 biomodals 지원","단백질 구조 예측 가능"],"es":["Predicción de estructuras de proteínas","Requiere Python 3.10+ y CUDA 12.0+","Necesita una tarjeta gráfica con al menos 24GB de VRAM","Compatibilidad con GPU L40S","Requiere al menos 32GB de RAM"],"fr":["Prédiction de structures de protéines","Nécessite Python 3.10+ et CUDA 12.0+","Nécessite une carte graphique avec au moins 24GB de VRAM","Compatibilité avec GPU L40S","Nécessite au moins 32GB de RAM"],"de":["Vorhersage von Proteinstrukturen","Benötigt Python 3.10+ und CUDA 12.0+","Benötigt eine Grafikkarte mit mindestens 24GB VRAM","Kompatibilität mit GPU L40S","Benötigt mindestens 32GB RAM"],"pt":["Previsão de estrutura de proteínas","Utiliza Claude Code","Requer Python 3.10+","Requer CUDA 12.0+","Requer GPU VRAM 24GB"],"ru":["Предсказание структуры белков","Использует Claude Code","Требует Python 3.10+","Требует CUDA 12.0+","Требует GPU VRAM 24GB"],"ar":["预测蛋白质结构","使用 Claude Code","需要 Python 3.10+","需要 CUDA 12.0+","需要 GPU VRAM 24GB"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Boltz","蛋白质结构预测","Python","CUDA","GPU VRAM","Modal","biomodals"],"ja":["Boltz","蛋白質構造予測","Python","CUDA","GPU VRAM","Modal","biomodals"],"ko":["Boltz","단백질 구조 예측","Python","CUDA","GPU VRAM","Modal","biomodals"],"es":["predicción de estructuras de proteínas","Boltz","Claude Code","Python 3.10+","CUDA 12.0+","GPU L40S","proteómica","biología computacional"],"fr":["prédiction de structures de protéines","Boltz","Claude Code","Python 3.10+","CUDA 12.0+","GPU L40S","protéomique","biologie computationnelle"],"de":["Vorhersage von Proteinstrukturen","Boltz","Claude Code","Python 3.10+","CUDA 12.0+","GPU L40S","Proteomik","Computational Biologie"],"pt":["Boltz","Claude Code","previsão de estrutura de proteínas","Python","CUDA","GPU VRAM","biologia computacional"],"ru":["Boltz","Claude Code","предсказание структуры белков","Python","CUDA","GPU VRAM","компьютерная биология"],"ar":["Boltz","Claude Code","预测蛋白质结构","Python","CUDA","GPU VRAM","计算生物学"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"boltz","description":">","tags":["structure-prediction","validation","open-source"],"bodyPreview":"# Boltz Structure Prediction\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n| Requirement | Minimum | Recommended |\n|-------------|---------|-------------|\n| Python | 3.10+ | 3.11 |\n| CUDA | 12.0+ | 12.1+ |\n| GPU VRAM | 24GB | 48GB (L40S) |\n| RAM | 32GB | 64GB |\n\n## How to run\n\n> **First time?** See [Installation Guide](../../docs/installation.md) to set up Modal and biomodals.\n\n### Option 1: Modal\n```bash\ncd biomodals\nmodal run modal_boltz.py \\\n  --input-faa complex.fasta \\\n  --out-dir predictions/\n```\n\n**GPU**: L40S (48G","body":"# Boltz Structure Prediction\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n| Requirement | Minimum | Recommended |\n|-------------|---------|-------------|\n| Python | 3.10+ | 3.11 |\n| CUDA | 12.0+ | 12.1+ |\n| GPU VRAM | 24GB | 48GB (L40S) |\n| RAM | 32GB | 64GB |\n\n## How to run\n\n> **First time?** See [Installation Guide](../../docs/installation.md) to set up Modal and biomodals.\n\n### Option 1: Modal\n```bash\ncd biomodals\nmodal run modal_boltz.py \\\n  --input-faa complex.fasta \\\n  --out-dir predictions/\n```\n\n**GPU**: L40S (48GB) | **Timeout**: 1800s default\n\n### Option 2: Local installation\n```bash\npip install boltz\n\nboltz predict \\\n  --fasta complex.fasta \\\n  --output predictions/\n```\n\n## Key parameters\n\n| Parameter | Default | Range | Description |\n|-----------|---------|-------|-------------|\n| `--recycling_steps` | 3 | 1-10 | Recycling iterations |\n| `--sampling_steps` | 200 | 50-500 | Diffusion steps |\n| `--use_msa_server` | true | bool | Use MSA server |\n\n## FASTA Format\n\n```\n>protein_A\nMKTAYIAKQRQISFVK...\n>protein_B\nMVLSPADKTNVKAAWG...\n```\n\n## Output format\n\n```\npredictions/\n├── model_0.cif       # Best model (CIF format)\n├── confidence.json   # pLDDT, pTM, ipTM\n└── pae.npy          # PAE matrix\n```\n\n**Note**: Boltz outputs CIF format. Convert to PDB if needed:\n```python\nfrom Bio.PDB import MMCIFParser, PDBIO\nparser = MMCIFParser()\nstructure = parser.get_structure(\"model\", \"model_0.cif\")\nio = PDBIO()\nio.set_structure(structure)\nio.save(\"model_0.pdb\")\n```\n\n## Comparison\n\n| Feature | Boltz-1 | Boltz-2 | AF2-Multimer |\n|---------|---------|---------|--------------|\n| MSA-free mode | Yes | Yes | No |\n| Diffusion | Yes | Yes | No |\n| Speed | Fast | Faster | Slower |\n| Open source | Yes | Yes | Yes |\n\n## Sample output\n\n### Successful run\n```\n$ boltz predict --fasta complex.fasta --output predictions/\n[INFO] Loading Boltz-1 weights...\n[INFO] Predicting structure...\n[INFO] Saved model to predictions/model_0.cif\n\npredictions/confidence.json:\n{\n  \"ptm\": 0.78,\n  \"iptm\": 0.65,\n  \"plddt\": 0.81\n}\n```\n\n**What good output looks like:**\n- pTM: > 0.7 (confident global structure)\n- ipTM: > 0.5 (confident interface)\n- pLDDT: > 0.7 (confident per-residue)\n- CIF file: ~100-500 KB for typical complex\n\n## Decision tree\n\n```\nShould I use Boltz?\n│\n├─ What are you predicting?\n│  ├─ Protein-protein complex → Boltz ✓ or Chai or ColabFold\n│  ├─ Protein + ligand → Boltz ✓ or Chai\n│  └─ Single protein → Use ESMFold (faster)\n│\n├─ Need MSA?\n│  ├─ No / want speed → Boltz ✓\n│  └─ Yes / maximum accuracy → ColabFold\n│\n└─ Why Boltz over Chai?\n   ├─ Open weights preference → Boltz ✓\n   ├─ Boltz-2 speed → Boltz ✓\n   └─ DNA/RNA support → Consider Chai\n```\n\n## Typical performance\n\n| Campaign Size | Time (L40S) | Cost (Modal) | Notes |\n|---------------|-------------|--------------|-------|\n| 100 complexes | 30-45 min | ~$8 | Standard validation |\n| 500 complexes | 2-3h | ~$35 | Large campaign |\n| 1000 complexes | 4-6h | ~$70 | Comprehensive |\n\n**Per-complex**: ~15-30s for typical binder-target complex.\n\n---\n\n## Verify\n\n```bash\nfind predictions -name \"*.cif\" | wc -l  # Should match input count\n```\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Low confidence**: Increase recycling_steps\n**OOM errors**: Use MSA-free mode or A100-80GB\n**Slow prediction**: Reduce sampling_steps\n\n### Error interpretation\n\n| Error | Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| `RuntimeError: CUDA out of memory` | Complex too large | Use `--use_msa_server false` or larger GPU |\n| `KeyError: ''iptm''` | Single chain only | Ensure FASTA has 2+ chains |\n| `FileNotFoundError: weights` | Missing model | Run `boltz download` first |\n| `ValueError: invalid residue` | Non-standard AA | Check for modified residues in sequence |\n\n### Boltz-1 vs Boltz-2\n\n| Aspect | Boltz-1 | Boltz-2 |\n|--------|---------|---------|\n| Speed | Fast | ~2x faster |\n| Accuracy | Good | Improved |\n| Ligands | Basic | Better support |\n| Release | 2024 | Late 2024 |\n\n---\n\n**Next**: `protein-qc` for filtering and ranking.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:04:17.571Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Computational Biology Agents requiring GPU-accelerated protein structure prediction.","zh":"适合需要GPU加速的蛋白质结构预测的计算生物学代理。","ja":"GPUアクセラレーションを必要とする計算生物学エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GPU 가속을 필요로 하는 계산 생물학 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de Biología Computacional que requieren predicción de estructuras de proteínas acelerada por GPU.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de biologie computationnelle nécessitant une prédiction de structure de protéine accélérée par GPU.","de":"Ideal für Agenten der computergestützten Biologie, die eine GPU-beschleunigte Vorhersage von Proteinstrukturen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Biologia Computacional que requerem previsão de estrutura de proteínas acelerada por GPU.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов компьютерной биологии, требующих прогнозирования структуры белка с ускорением GPU.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيلات الأحياء الحاسوبية التي تتطلب تنبؤًا بتركيب البروتين بمساعدة وحدة معالجة الرسومات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables high-performance biomolecular structure prediction using Modal''s cloud infrastructure with CUDA 12.0+ and L40S GPUs. Directly processes FASTA files for complex structure analysis through the biomodals framework.","zh":"使用Modal的云基础设施和CUDA 12.0+以及L40S GPU实现高性能的生物分子结构预测。直接处理FASTA文件，通过生物模态框架进行复杂结构分析。","ja":"ModalのクラウドインフラストラクチャとCUDA 12.0+およびL40S GPUを使用して、高パフォーマンスの生物分子構造予測を実現します。FASTAファイルを直接処理し、バイオモーダルフレームワークを介して複雑な構造分析を実行します。","ko":"Modal의 클라우드 인프라스트럭처와 CUDA 12.0+ 및 L40S GPU를 사용하여 고성능의 생체 분자 구조 예측을 가능하게 합니다. FASTA 파일을 직접 처리하여 바이오모달 프레임워크를 통해 복잡한 구조 분석을 수행합니다.","es":"Permite la predicción de estructuras biomoleculares de alto rendimiento utilizando la infraestructura en la nube de Modal con CUDA 12.0+ y GPUs L40S. Procesa directamente archivos FASTA para análisis de estructuras complejas a través del marco biomodals.","fr":"Permet une prédiction de structure biomoléculaire haute performance en utilisant l''infrastructure cloud de Modal avec CUDA 12.0+ et des GPU L40S. Traite directement les fichiers FASTA pour l''analyse de structures complexes via le framework biomodals.","de":"Ermöglicht eine hochleistungsstarke Vorhersage biomolekularer Strukturen unter Verwendung der Cloud-Infrastruktur von Modal mit CUDA 12.0+ und L40S-GPUs. Verarbeitet direkt FASTA-Dateien für die Analyse komplexer Strukturen über das biomodals-Framework.","pt":"Permite a previsão de estrutura biomolecular de alto desempenho usando a infraestrutura em nuvem da Modal com CUDA 12.0+ e GPUs L40S. Processa diretamente arquivos FASTA para análise de estrutura complexa por meio do framework biomodals.","ru":"Позволяет выполнять прогнозирование биомолекулярной структуры с высокими показателями производительности, используя инфраструктуру Modal в облаке с CUDA 12.0+ и GPU L40S. Прямо обрабатывает файлы FASTA для сложного анализа структуры через фреймворк biomodals.","ar":"يمكّن التنبؤ بتركيب الجزيئات الحيوية بأداء عالي باستخدام بنية Modal السحابية مع CUDA 12.0+ ووحدات معالجة الرسومات L40S. يقوم بمعالجة ملفات FASTA مباشرةً لتحليل الهياكل المعقدة من خلال إطار عمل biomodals."},"useCases":{"en":["Predicting protein complex structures from FASTA inputs","Running large-scale biomolecular simulations on cloud GPUs","Generating structural predictions for computational biology research"],"zh":["预测FASTA输入的蛋白质复合结构","在云GPU上运行大规模生物分子模拟","为计算生物学研究生成结构预测"],"ja":["FASTA入力からのタンパク質複合体構造の予測","クラウドGPU上での大規模な生物分子シミュレーションの実行","計算生物学研究のための構造予測の生成"],"ko":["FASTA 입력의 단백질 복합체 구조 예측","클라우드 GPU에서 대규모 생체 분자 시뮬레이션 실행","계산 생물학 연구를 위한 구조 예측 생성"],"es":["Predecir estructuras de complejos de proteínas a partir de entradas FASTA","Ejecutar simulaciones biomoleculares a gran escala en GPUs en la nube","Generar predicciones estructurales para la investigación en biología computacional"],"fr":["Prédir les structures de complexes de protéines à partir d''entrées FASTA","Exécuter des simulations biomoléculaires à grande échelle sur des GPU cloud","Générer des prédictions structurelles pour la recherche en biologie computationnelle"],"de":["Vorhersage von Proteinkomplexstrukturen aus FASTA-Eingaben","Durchführung großer biomolekularer Simulationsläufe auf Cloud-GPUs","Erzeugung von Strukturvorhersagen für die Forschung in der computergestützten Biologie"],"pt":["Prever estruturas de complexos de proteínas a partir de entradas FASTA","Executar simulações biomoleculares em grande escala em GPUs em nuvem","Gerar previsões estruturais para pesquisas de biologia computacional"],"ru":["Прогнозирование структуры белковых комплексов из входных данных FASTA","Запуск крупномасштабных биомолекулярных симуляций на облачных GPU","Генерация структурных прогнозов для исследований компьютерной биологии"],"ar":["تنبؤ بتركيب مركبات البروتين من مدخلات FASTA","تشغيل محاكاة جزيئية حيوية على نطاق كبير على وحدات معالجة الرسومات السحابية","إنتاج تنبؤات هيكلية لأبحاث الأحياء الحاسوبية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.10+ and CUDA 12.0+","Needs substantial GPU VRAM (24GB minimum, 48GB recommended)","Dependent on Modal infrastructure and biomodals setup","Requires specific L40S GPU hardware for optimal performance"],"zh":["需要Python 3.10+和CUDA 12.0+","需要大量的GPU VRAM（至少24GB，推荐48GB）","依赖于Modal基础设施和生物模态设置","需要特定的L40S GPU硬件以实现最佳性能"],"ja":["Python 3.10+とCUDA 12.0+が必要","大量のGPU VRAM（24GB以上、48GB推奨）が必要","Modalのインフラストラクチャとバイオモーダル設定に依存","最適なパフォーマンスを実現するために、特定のL40S GPUハードウェアが必要"],"ko":["Python 3.10+와 CUDA 12.0+가 필요합니다.","大量의 GPU VRAM(최소 24GB, 권장 48GB)가 필요합니다.","Modal 인프라스트럭처와 바이오모달 설정에 의존합니다.","최적의 성능을 달성하기 위해 특정한 L40S GPU 하드웨어가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere Python 3.10+ y CUDA 12.0+","Necesita una cantidad sustancial de VRAM de GPU (24GB mínimo, 48GB recomendado)","Depende de la infraestructura de Modal y la configuración de biomodals","Requiere hardware de GPU L40S específico para un rendimiento óptimo"],"fr":["Nécessite Python 3.10+ et CUDA 12.0+","Nécessite une quantité substantielle de VRAM de GPU (24GB minimum, 48GB recommandé)","Dépend de l''infrastructure de Modal et de la configuration de biomodals","Nécessite un matériel de GPU L40S spécifique pour des performances optimales"],"de":["Erfordert Python 3.10+ und CUDA 12.0+","Benötigt eine erhebliche Menge an GPU-VRAM (24GB Mindestanforderung, 48GB empfohlen)","Hängt von der Modal-Infrastruktur und der biomodals-Konfiguration ab","Benötigt spezifische L40S-GPU-Hardware für optimale Leistung"],"pt":["Exige Python 3.10+ e CUDA 12.0+","Necessita de VRAM de GPU substancial (24GB mínimo, 48GB recomendado)","Depende da infraestrutura da Modal e configuração do biomodals","Exige hardware de GPU L40S específico para desempenho ótimo"],"ru":["Требует Python 3.10+ и CUDA 12.0+","Требует значительного объема видеопамяти GPU (минимум 24 ГБ, рекомендуемый 48 ГБ)","Зависит от инфраструктуры Modal и настройки biomodals","Требует конкретного оборудования GPU L40S для оптимальной производительности"],"ar":["يتطلب Python 3.10+ و CUDA 12.0+","يحتاج إلى كمية كبيرة من ذاكرة الفيديو الرسومية (أدنى حد 24 غيغابايت، يوصى بـ 48 غيغابايت)","يعتمد على بنية Modal وإعداد biomodals","يتطلب عتادًا محددًا لوحدة معالجة الرسومات L40S للحصول على أداء مثالي"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
