","fr":"Pijul: Contrôle de Version avec Théorie de Patchs Commuta...","de":"Pijul: Versionskontrolle mit kommutativer Patchtheorie","pt":"Pijul: Controle de Versão Baseado em Patch","ru":"Pijul: Версия контроля на основе патчей","ar":"Pijul: التحكم في الإصدار القائم على الباتش","en":"pijul"},"description":{"zh":"Pijul是一种分布式VCS，采用数学上的补丁理论，实现了补丁之间的可交换性和冲突解决的新方法","ja":"Pijulは、数学的なパッチ理論を採用した分散型VCSで、パッチ間の可換性とコンフリクト解決の新しいアプローチを実現しています","ko":"Pijul은 수학적인 패치 이론을 채택한 분산형 VCS로, 패치 간의 교환 가능성과 충돌 해결의 새로운 방법을 구현합니다","es":"Pijul es un sistema de control de versiones distribuido que utiliza parches como ciudadanos de primera clase, permitiendo la verificación y fusión de cambios...","fr":"Pijul est un système de contrôle de version distribué qui utilise des patchs comme citoyens de première classe, permettant la vérification et la fusion des m...","de":"Pijul ist ein verteiltes Versionskontrollsystem, das Patches als erste-Klasse-Bürger verwendet, um Änderungen auf mathematisch sichere Weise zu überprüfen un...","pt":"Pijul é um sistema de controle de versão distribuído que usa patches como cidadãos de primeira classe, com teoria de patches comutativos matematicamente sólida.","ru":"Pijul — распределенная система контроля версий, которая использует патчи как граждан первого класса, с математически прочной теорией коммутативных патчей.","ar":"Pijul هو نظام التحكم في الإصدار الموزع الذي يستخدم الباتشات كمواطنين من الدرجة الأولى، مع نظرية الباتشات المتوافقة toánياً","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["基于数学的补丁理论","分布式VCS","补丁之间的可交换性","冲突解决的新方法","GF(3)技能推导链","稀疏性保存"],"ja":["数学的に厳密なパッチ理論","分散型VCS","パッチ間の可換性","コンフリクト解決の新しいアプローチ","GF(3)スキル導出チェーン","スパース性保存"],"ko":["수학적으로 엄밀한 패치 이론","분산형 VCS","패치 간의 교환 가능성","충돌 해결의 새로운 방법","GF(3)스킬 유도 체인","희소성 보존"],"es":["Teoría de parches comutativa","Parches como ciudadanos de primera clase","Verificación y fusión de cambios","Semántica categorial para la resolución de conflictos","Preservación de la escasez de cambios"],"fr":["Théorie des patchs commutatifs","Patchs comme citoyens de première classe","Vérification et fusion des modifications","Sémantique categorielle pour la résolution des conflits","Préservation de la rareté des modifications"],"de":["Kommutative Patchtheorie","Patches als erste-Klasse-Bürger","Überprüfung und Zusammenführung von Änderungen","Kategorische Semantik für die Konfliktlösung","Erhaltung der Änderungssparsamkeit"],"pt":["Controle de versão baseado em patch","Teoria de patches comutativos matematicamente sólida","GF(3) skill derivation chains","Pushouts = merges","Sparsity preservation"],"ru":["Контроль версий на основе патчей","Математически прочная теория коммутативных патчей","GF(3) skill derivation chains","Pushouts = merges","Сохранение разреженности"],"ar":["التحكم في الإصدار القائم على الباتش","نظرية الباتشات المتوافقة toánياً","GF(3) skill derivation chains","Pushouts = merges","الحفاظ على النُدرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Pijul","补丁版本控制","分布式VCS","数学的补丁理论","冲突解决","GF(3)技能推导链","稀疏性保存","版本管理"],"ja":["Pijul","パッチベースのバージョン管理","分散型VCS","数学的に厳密なパッチ理論","コンフリクト解決","GF(3)スキル導出チェーン","スパース性保存","バージョン管理"],"ko":["Pijul","패치 기반 버전 관리","분산형 VCS","수학적으로 엄밀한 패치 이론","충돌 해결","GF(3)스킬 유도 체인","희소성 보존","버전 관리"],"es":["Pijul","control de versiones","teoría de parches comutativa","sistema de control de versiones distribuido","verificación de cambios","fusión de cambios","semántica categorial","preservación de la escasez de cambios"],"fr":["Pijul","contrôle de version","théorie des patchs commutatifs","système de contrôle de version distribué","vérification des modifications","fusion des modifications","sémantique categorielle","préservation de la rareté des modifications"],"de":["Pijul","Versionskontrolle","kommutative Patchtheorie","verteiltes Versionskontrollsystem","Überprüfung von Änderungen","Zusammenführung von Änderungen","kategorische Semantik","Erhaltung der Änderungssparsamkeit"],"pt":["Pijul","Controle de versão","Patch","Teoria de patches comutativos","GF(3) skill derivation chains","Pushouts","Sparsity preservation"],"ru":["Pijul","Контроль версий","Патчи","Теория коммутативных патчей","GF(3) skill derivation chains","Pushouts","Сохранение разреженности"],"ar":["Pijul","التحكم في الإصدار","الباتش","نظرية الباتشات المتوافقة","GF(3) skill derivation chains","Pushouts","الحفاظ على النُدرة"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pijul","description":"Pijul patch-based VCS with categorical patch theory for skill versioning","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# pijul\n\nPatch-based version control with mathematically sound commutative patch theory.\n\n**Trit**: -1 (MINUS) - Validator role for patch verification and merge correctness\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nPijul is a distributed VCS where patches are first-class citizens that commute when independent. This maps directly to:\n- **GF(3) skill derivation chains**: patches as morphisms between skill states\n- **Pushouts = merges**: categorical semantics for conflict resolution\n- **Sparsity preservation**: changes s","body":"# pijul\n\nPatch-based version control with mathematically sound commutative patch theory.\n\n**Trit**: -1 (MINUS) - Validator role for patch verification and merge correctness\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nPijul is a distributed VCS where patches are first-class citizens that commute when independent. This maps directly to:\n- **GF(3) skill derivation chains**: patches as morphisms between skill states\n- **Pushouts = merges**: categorical semantics for conflict resolution\n- **Sparsity preservation**: changes stored as morphisms, not materialized states\n\n---\n\n## Installation via flox-mcp\n\n```bash\n# Using flox CLI\nflox install pijul\n\n# Via MCP (flox_install tool)\n{\"name\": \"flox_install\", \"arguments\": {\"package\": \"pijul\"}}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Core Commands\n\n### Repository Operations\n\n```bash\n# Initialize\npijul init\n\n# Clone (partial clone supported!)\npijul clone https://nest.pijul.com/user/repo\npijul clone --partial https://nest.pijul.com/user/repo  # sparse clone\n\n# Record changes (creates patch)\npijul record -m \"Add feature\"\n\n# Push/Pull\npijul push\npijul pull\n```\n\n### Patch Operations\n\n```bash\n# List patches (changes)\npijul log\n\n# Show patch contents\npijul diff\n\n# Apply specific patch\npijul apply <hash>\n\n# Unapply (revert) patch\npijul unrecord <hash>\n\n# Fork (branch)\npijul fork <name>\n\n# Switch channel (branch)\npijul channel switch <name>\n```\n\n### Sparse Operations\n\n```bash\n# Partial clone - only fetch needed patches\npijul clone --partial <url>\n\n# Fetch specific patches\npijul pull --from-channel <channel>\n\n# Lazy evaluation - patches fetched on demand\npijul reset --lazy\n```\n\n---\n\n## Categorical Patch Theory\n\n### Patches as Morphisms\n\n```\nState_A --patch_1--> State_B --patch_2--> State_C\n                                    \nIf patch_1 ⊥ patch_2 (independent):\n  patch_1 ; patch_2 = patch_2 ; patch_1\n```\n\n### Pushout for Merges\n\n```\n     State_A\n      /   \\\n   p_1     p_2\n    /       \\\nState_B    State_C\n    \\       /\n     p_2''  p_1''\n      \\   /\n     State_D (pushout)\n```\n\nWhen patches are independent, their pushout is unique and well-defined.\n\n---\n\n## GF(3) Integration\n\n### Sparse Mode (Default)\n\n```\ntrit == -1 or +1: Store as morphism (patch)\n  - No materialization\n  - Lazy evaluation\n  - Minimal storage\n```\n\n### Projection Mode (ERGODIC Gate)\n\n```\ntrit == 0: Force materialization\n  - Coordination point\n  - Full state snapshot\n  - Archive checkpoint\n```\n\n### Projection Triggers\n\n1. `--materialize` flag explicit\n2. `trit == 0` (ERGODIC coordination)\n3. Explicit archive command\n4. Conflict resolution requiring full state\n\n---\n\n## Skill Versioning Pattern\n\n### Record Skill Change\n\n```bash\ncd .agents/skills/my-skill\npijul record -m \"Add GF(3) frontmatter\"\n```\n\n### Sync with Upstream\n\n```bash\n# Sparse pull - only new patches\npijul pull --partial\n\n# Check for conflicts\npijul log --pending\n```\n\n### Fork for Experimentation\n\n```bash\npijul fork experiment\npijul channel switch experiment\n# ... make changes ...\npijul record -m \"Experimental patch\"\n\n# Merge back if successful\npijul channel switch main\npijul pull --from-channel experiment\n```\n\n---\n\n## Integration with flox\n\n### Install via flox Environment\n\n```toml\n# manifest.toml\n[install]\npijul.pkg-path = \"pijul\"\n```\n\n### Activate and Use\n\n```bash\nflox activate\npijul --version\n```\n\n### MCP Tool Call\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"flox_install\",\n  \"arguments\": {\"package\": \"pijul\"}\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [Pijul Manual](https://pijul.org/manual/)\n- [Nest (Pijul Forge)](https://nest.pijul.com)\n- Mimram/Di Giusto: Categorical Patch Theory\n- Delta-State CRDTs / Merkle Search Trees\n- [flox-mcp skill](../flox-mcp/SKILL.md)\n- [structured-decomp skill](../structured-decomp/SKILL.md)\n\n---\n\n## Triadic Composition\n\n```\npijul (-1)  + flox-mcp (0)  + skill-creator (+1) = 0 ✓\nValidator     Coordinator     Generator\n```\n\nPijul validates patch correctness, flox-mcp coordinates environment, skill-creator generates new skills."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:04:26.331Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Version Control Agents requiring mathematically sound commutative patch theory and patch-based version control","zh":"适用于需要数学严谨的可交换补丁理论和基于补丁的版本控制的版本控制代理","ja":"数学的に厳密な可換パッチ理論とパッチベースのバージョン管理が必要なバージョン管理エージェントに適しています","ko":"수학적으로 엄밀한 교환 법칙 패치 이론과 패치 기반 버전 관리가 필요한 버전 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Control de Versiones que requieren una teoría de parches conmutativa sólidamente fundamentada en matemáticas y control de versiones basado en parches","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de contrôle de version nécessitant une théorie des patchs commutatifs mathématiquement solide et un contrôle de version basé sur les patchs","de":"Ideal für Version Control Agents, die eine mathematisch solide kommutative Patchtheorie und patchbasiertes Version Control erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Controle de Versão que exigem uma teoria de patches comutativa matematicamente sólida e controle de versão baseado em patches","ru":"Идеально для агентов контроля версий, требующих математически обоснованной коммутативной теории патчей и патч-ориентированного контроля версий","ar":"مثالي لعمليات مراقبة الإصدار التي تتطلب نظرية باتش رياضية صحيحة وتحكم إصدار قائم على الباتش"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage distributed version control systems with patches as first-class citizens, utilizing commutative patch theory for conflict resolution and merge correctness through GF(3) skill derivation chains and pushouts","zh":"赋予代理管理分布式版本控制系统的能力，使用补丁作为第一类公民，并利用可交换补丁理论进行冲突解决和合并正确性，通过GF(3)技能推导链和推出","ja":"エージェントに分散バージョン管理システムを管理する能力を与え、パッチを第一級市民として利用し、可換パッチ理論を用いてコンフリクト解決とマージの正しさを実現し、GF(3)スキル導出チェーンとプッシュアウトを利用する","ko":"에이전트에게 분산 버전 관리 시스템을 관리하는 능력을 부여하며, 패치를 1차 시민으로 사용하고, 교환 법칙 패치 이론을 사용하여 충돌 해결과 병합의 올바름을 실현하며, GF(3) 스킬 유도 체인과 푸시 아웃을 활용함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar sistemas de control de versiones distribuidos con parches como ciudadanos de primera clase, utilizando la teoría de parches conmutativos para la resolución de conflictos y la corrección de fusiones a través de cadenas de derivación de habilidades GF(3) y pushouts","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les systèmes de contrôle de version distribués avec des patchs en tant que citoyens de première classe, en utilisant la théorie des patchs commutatifs pour la résolution des conflits et la correction des fusions via des chaînes de dérivation de compétences GF(3) et des pushouts","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, verteilte Version Control Systeme mit Patches als Erstklassbürger zu verwalten, indem sie die kommutative Patchtheorie zur Konfliktlösung und Merge-Korrektheit durch GF(3)-Fähigkeitsableitungsketten und Pushouts nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar sistemas de controle de versão distribuídos com patches como cidadãos de primeira classe, utilizando a teoria de patches comutativa para resolução de conflitos e correção de mesclagem por meio de cadeias de derivação de habilidades GF(3) e pushouts","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять распределенными системами контроля версий с патчами как первоклассными гражданами, используя коммутативную теорию патчей для разрешения конфликтов и обеспечения корректности слияния через цепочки производных навыков GF(3) и пушауты","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة أنظمة مراقبة الإصدار الموزعة مع باتشات كمواطنين من الدرجة الأولى، باستخدام نظرية الباتشات القابلة للتبادل لحل النزاعات وضمان دقة الدمج من خلال سلاسل اشتقاق المهارات GF(3) وعمليات الدفع"},"useCases":{"en":["Verifying patch correctness with Trit validator role","Resolving conflicts using categorical semantics for pushouts and merges","Preserving sparsity in version control systems"],"zh":["使用Trit验证者角色验证补丁的正确性","使用范畴语义学解决冲突和合并","在版本控制系统中保持稀疏性"],"ja":["Tritバリデーター役割を使用してパッチの正しさを検証する","分類的意味論を使用してコンフリクトを解決し、マージする","バージョン管理システムで疎性を保持する"],"ko":["Trit 검증자 역할을 사용하여 패치의 올바름을 검증함","분류적 의미론을 사용하여 충돌을 해결하고 병합함","버전 관리 시스템에서 희소성을 유지함"],"es":["Verificar la corrección de los parches con el rol de validador Trit","Resolver conflictos utilizando semántica categorial para pushouts y fusiones","Preservar la escasez en los sistemas de control de versiones"],"fr":["Vérifier la correction des patchs avec le rôle de validateur Trit","Résoudre les conflits en utilisant une sémantique catégorielle pour les pushouts et les fusions","Préserver la parcimonie dans les systèmes de contrôle de version"],"de":["Überprüfen der Korrektheit von Patches mit der Trit-Validator-Rolle","Auflösen von Konflikten unter Verwendung kategorialer Semantik für Pushouts und Merges","Erhalt der Sparsamkeit in Version Control Systemen"],"pt":["Verificar a correção do patch com o papel de validador Trit","Resolver conflitos usando semântica categórica para pushouts e mesclagens","Preservar a rarefação em sistemas de controle de versão"],"ru":["Проверка правильности патча с помощью роли валидатора Trit","Разрешение конфликтов с помощью категориальной семантики для пушаутов и слияний","Сохранение разреженности в системах контроля версий"],"ar":["التحقق من صحة الباتش بدور Trit المحقق","حل النزاعات باستخدام الدلالات التصنيفية للعمليات الدفعية والدمج","الحفاظ على الندرة في أنظمة مراقبة الإصدار"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of mathematical concepts like commutative patch theory and GF(3) skill derivation chains","Specific to distributed version control systems with patch-based architecture"],"zh":["需要了解可交换补丁理论和GF(3)技能推导链等数学概念","仅适用于具有基于补丁的架构的分布式版本控制系统"],"ja":["可換パッチ理論やGF(3)スキル導出チェーンなどの数学的概念を理解する必要がある","パッチベースのアーキテクチャを持つ分散バージョン管理システムにのみ適用可能"],"ko":["교환 법칙 패치 이론 및 GF(3) 스킬 유도 체인과 같은 수학적 개념을 이해해야 함","패치 기반 아키텍처를 가진 분산 버전 관리 시스템에만 적용 가능"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de conceptos matemáticos como la teoría de parches conmutativa y las cadenas de derivación de habilidades GF(3)","Específico para sistemas de control de versiones distribuidos con arquitectura basada en parches"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des concepts mathématiques tels que la théorie des patchs commutatifs et les chaînes de dérivation de compétences GF(3)","Spécifique aux systèmes de contrôle de version distribués avec une architecture basée sur les patchs"],"de":["Erfordert das Verständnis mathematischer Konzepte wie der kommutativen Patchtheorie und der GF(3)-Fähigkeitsableitungsketten","Spezifisch für verteilte Version Control Systeme mit patchbasierter Architektur"],"pt":["Exige compreensão de conceitos matemáticos como teoria de patches comutativa e cadeias de derivação de habilidades GF(3)","Específico para sistemas de controle de versão distribuídos com arquitetura baseada em patches"],"ru":["Требует понимания математических концепций, таких как коммутативная теория патчей и цепочки производных навыков GF(3)","Спецефичен для распределенных систем контроля версий с патч-ориентированной архитектурой"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم المفاهيم الرياضية مثل نظرية الباتشات القابلة للتبادل وسلاسل اشتقاق المهارات GF(3)","محدد لأنظمة مراقبة الإصدار الموزعة ذات الهيكل القائم على الباتشات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
