,"fr":["Guides de meilleures pratiques pour l''écriture de Bicep","Découverte de types de ressources Azure","Récupération de schémas pour les types de ressources","Modules Azure vérifiés"],"de":["Leitfäden für Best Practices bei der Erstellung von Bicep","Entdeckung von Azure-Ressourcentypen","Abruf von Schemata für Ressourcentypen","Überprüfte Azure-Module"],"pt":["Melhores práticas de autorias de Bicep","Descoberta de tipos de recursos do Azure","Recuperação de esquemas para tipos de recursos","Módulos verificados do Azure"],"ru":["Лучшие практики авторинга Bicep","Обнаружение типов ресурсов Azure","Получение схем для типов ресурсов","Проверенные модули Azure"],"ar":["أفضل الممارسات لكتابة بايسب","اكتشاف أنواع الموارد في azure","استرجاع مخططات لأنواع الموارد","وحدات azure المعتمدة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Bicep","Azure基础设施即代码","最佳实践","资源类型发现","模式检索","Azure验证模块"],"ja":["Bicep","Azureインフラストラクチャasコード","ベストプラクティス","リソースの種類の検出","スキーマの取得","Azure Verified Modules"],"ko":["Bicep","Azure 인프라스트럭처 즉 코드","모범 사례","리소스 유형 발견","스키마 검색","Azure 확인 모듈"],"es":["Bicep","Azure","Infraestructura como código","Desarrollo de infraestructura","Mejores prácticas","Módulos verificados","Tipos de recursos de Azure"],"fr":["Bicep","Azure","Infrastructure en tant que code","Développement d''infrastructure","Meilleures pratiques","Modules vérifiés","Types de ressources Azure"],"de":["Bicep","Azure","Infrastruktur-als-Code","Infrastruktur-Entwicklung","Best Practices","Überprüfte Module","Azure-Ressourcentypen"],"pt":["Bicep","Infraestrutura como código","Desenvolvimento de infraestrutura","Azure","Melhores práticas de Bicep","Tipos de recursos do Azure","Módulos verificados do Azure"],"ru":["Bicep","Инфраструктура как код","Разработка инфраструктуры","Azure","Лучшие практики Bicep","Типы ресурсов Azure","Проверенные модули Azure"],"ar":["بايسب","بنية تحتية كود","تطوير البنية التحتية","azure","أفضل الممارسات لكتابة بايسب","أنواع الموارد في azure","وحدات azure المعتمدة"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bicep","description":"Expert assistance for Azure Bicep infrastructure-as-code. Provides best practices for authoring Bicep templates, Azure resource type discovery with API versions, resource schema retrieval, and Azure Verified Modules (AVM) guidance. Use when writing Bicep files, deploying Azure resources, looking up resource types/schemas, or working with AVM modules.","bodyPreview":"# Bicep Expert Assistant\n\nExpert guidance for Azure Bicep infrastructure-as-code development, including best practices, resource type discovery, schema retrieval, and Azure Verified Modules.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\nThis skill provides four main functions equivalent to the Bicep MCP Server:\n\n1. **Best Practices** - Comprehensive Bicep authoring guidelines\n2. **Resource Type Discovery** - List Azure resource types with API versions\n3. **Schema Retrieval** - Get detailed schemas for resource types\n4","body":"# Bicep Expert Assistant\n\nExpert guidance for Azure Bicep infrastructure-as-code development, including best practices, resource type discovery, schema retrieval, and Azure Verified Modules.\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\nThis skill provides four main functions equivalent to the Bicep MCP Server:\n\n1. **Best Practices** - Comprehensive Bicep authoring guidelines\n2. **Resource Type Discovery** - List Azure resource types with API versions\n3. **Schema Retrieval** - Get detailed schemas for resource types\n4. **AVM Metadata** - Azure Verified Modules information\n\n## Instructions\n\n### When User Asks About Bicep Best Practices\n\nProvide guidance from the comprehensive best practices below. Focus on the specific area they''re asking about (parameters, variables, resources, modules, naming, security, etc.).\n\n### When User Needs Resource Types for a Provider\n\nRun the helper script to list resource types:\n\n```bash\n# PowerShell\n./scripts/get-resource-types.ps1 -Provider \"Microsoft.Storage\"\n\n# Bash\n./scripts/get-resource-types.sh \"Microsoft.Storage\"\n```\n\nOr use Azure CLI directly:\n```bash\naz provider show --namespace Microsoft.Storage --query \"resourceTypes[].{Type:resourceType,ApiVersions:apiVersions[0]}\" -o table\n```\n\n### When User Needs a Resource Schema\n\nUse Bicep CLI to get the schema:\n```bash\nbicep build-params --stdout <<< \"param resourceType string = ''Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts@2023-05-01''\"\n```\n\nOr reference the helper script in `scripts/get-resource-schema.ps1`\n\n### When User Asks About Azure Verified Modules\n\nProvide AVM guidance and help them find appropriate modules from the Bicep Public Registry.\n\n---\n\n## Bicep Best Practices Reference\n\n### Parameters\n\n1. **Use descriptive names**: Parameters should have clear, meaningful names that indicate their purpose\n   ```bicep\n   // Good\n   param storageAccountName string\n   param enableHttpsTrafficOnly bool = true\n\n   // Avoid\n   param san string\n   param flag bool\n   ```\n\n2. **Provide descriptions**: Always add `@description()` decorator\n   ```bicep\n   @description(''The name of the storage account. Must be globally unique.'')\n   param storageAccountName string\n   ```\n\n3. **Set safe defaults**: Default values should be secure and cost-effective\n   ```bicep\n   @description(''The SKU for the storage account'')\n   @allowed([''Standard_LRS'', ''Standard_GRS'', ''Standard_ZRS'', ''Premium_LRS''])\n   param storageAccountSku string = ''Standard_LRS''\n   ```\n\n4. **Use constraints wisely**: Apply `@minLength()`, `@maxLength()`, `@minValue()`, `@maxValue()`\n   ```bicep\n   @minLength(3)\n   @maxLength(24)\n   param storageAccountName string\n   ```\n\n5. **Use `@allowed` sparingly**: Overly restrictive lists block valid deployments as Azure adds new SKUs\n\n6. **Secure sensitive parameters**: Use `@secure()` for secrets\n   ```bicep\n   @secure()\n   param adminPassword string\n   ```\n\n### Variables\n\n1. **Use for computed values**: Variables simplify complex expressions\n   ```bicep\n   var storageAccountName = ''${prefix}${uniqueString(resourceGroup().id)}''\n   ```\n\n2. **Use for repeated values**: Define once, use multiple times\n   ```bicep\n   var commonTags = {\n     environment: environment\n     project: projectName\n     deployedBy: ''Bicep''\n   }\n   ```\n\n3. **Typed variables** (Bicep 0.26+): Add types for clarity\n   ```bicep\n   var instanceCount int = environment == ''prod'' ? 5 : 2\n   ```\n\n### Resources\n\n1. **Use symbolic names without ''name'' suffix**:\n   ```bicep\n   // Good\n   resource storageAccount ''Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts@2023-05-01'' = {\n\n   // Avoid\n   resource storageAccountName ''Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts@2023-05-01'' = {\n   ```\n\n2. **Use latest stable API versions**: Check for the most recent stable API version\n\n3. **Leverage implicit dependencies**: Bicep automatically handles dependencies when you reference resources\n   ```bicep\n   resource storageAccount ''Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts@2023-05-01'' = {\n     name: storageAccountName\n     // ...\n   }\n\n   resource blobService ''Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/blobServices@2023-05-01'' = {\n     parent: storageAccount  // Implicit dependency\n     name: ''default''\n   }\n   ```\n\n4. **Use `existing` keyword for references**:\n   ```bicep\n   resource existingVnet ''Microsoft.Network/virtualNetworks@2023-09-01'' existing = {\n     name: vnetName\n   }\n   ```\n\n### Child Resources\n\n1. **Use nested declaration** (preferred):\n   ```bicep\n   resource storageAccount ''Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts@2023-05-01'' = {\n     name: storageAccountName\n     // ...\n\n     resource blobService ''blobServices'' = {\n       name: ''default''\n     }\n   }\n   ```\n\n2. **Or use parent property**:\n   ```bicep\n   resource blobService ''Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/blobServices@2023-05-01'' = {\n     parent: storageAccount\n     name: ''default''\n   }\n   ```\n\n### Modules\n\n1. **Use modules for reusability**: Break large templates into focused modules\n   ```bicep\n   module storageModule ''modules/storage.bicep'' = {\n     name: ''storageDeployment''\n     params: {\n       storageAccountName: storageAccountName\n       location: location\n     }\n   }\n   ```\n\n2. **Use Azure Verified Modules**: Leverage pre-built, tested modules from the Bicep Registry\n   ```bicep\n   module storage ''br/public:avm/res/storage/storage-account:0.9.0'' = {\n     name: ''storageDeployment''\n     params: {\n       name: storageAccountName\n       location: location\n     }\n   }\n   ```\n\n3. **Version your modules**: Always pin to specific versions\n\n### Naming Conventions\n\n1. **Use camelCase** for parameters, variables, and symbolic names\n2. **Use `uniqueString()` for unique names**:\n   ```bicep\n   var storageAccountName = ''st${uniqueString(resourceGroup().id)}''\n   ```\n3. **Add prefixes for context**: Include environment, project, or region prefixes\n4. **Follow Azure naming constraints**: Check character limits and allowed characters\n\n### Outputs\n\n1. **Expose essential values**: Output what consumers need\n   ```bicep\n   output storageAccountId string = storageAccount.id\n   output primaryEndpoints object = storageAccount.properties.primaryEndpoints\n   ```\n\n2. **Never output secrets**: Use Key Vault references instead\n   ```bicep\n   // WRONG - Never do this\n   output connectionString string = storageAccount.listKeys().keys[0].value\n   ```\n\n### Security Best Practices\n\n1. **Use managed identities** instead of credentials where possible\n2. **Enable HTTPS/TLS** for all services\n3. **Use private endpoints** for sensitive resources\n4. **Apply least privilege** with RBAC assignments\n5. **Enable diagnostic logging** and monitoring\n6. **Use Key Vault** for secrets management\n7. **Enable encryption** at rest and in transit\n\n### Code Organization\n\n1. **File structure**:\n   ```\n   project/\n   ├── main.bicep           # Entry point\n   ├── main.bicepparam      # Parameters file\n   ├── modules/\n   │   ├── networking.bicep\n   │   ├── storage.bicep\n   │   └── compute.bicep\n   └── tests/\n       └── main.tests.bicep\n   ```\n\n2. **Order of elements in files**:\n   - Target scope (if not resourceGroup)\n   - Parameters\n   - Variables\n   - Resources\n   - Modules\n   - Outputs\n\n3. **Comments**: Use `//` for single-line, `/* */` for multi-line\n\n---\n\n## Azure Verified Modules (AVM)\n\n### What is AVM?\n\nAzure Verified Modules are pre-built, tested Bicep modules maintained by Microsoft that follow best practices and the Well-Architected Framework.\n\n### Using AVM Modules\n\n```bicep\n// Reference from Bicep Public Registry\nmodule storage ''br/public:avm/res/storage/storage-account:0.9.0'' = {\n  name: ''storageDeployment''\n  params: {\n    name: ''mystorageaccount''\n    location: location\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Finding AVM Modules\n\n1. Browse: https://azure.github.io/Azure-Verified-Modules/indexes/bicep/\n2. GitHub: https://github.com/Azure/bicep-registry-modules\n3. Registry: `mcr.microsoft.com` for container images\n\n### Module Types\n\n- **Resource Modules (`avm/res/`)**: Single Azure resource with all configurations\n- **Pattern Modules (`avm/ptn/`)**: Multi-resource patterns for common scenarios\n- **Utility Modules (`avm/utl/`)**: Helper types and functions\n\n---\n\n## Common Resource Type Examples\n\n### Storage Account\n```bicep\nresource storageAccount ''Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts@2023-05-01'' = {\n  name: storageAccountName\n  location: location\n  sku: {\n    name: ''Standard_LRS''\n  }\n  kind: ''StorageV2''\n  properties: {\n    accessTier: ''Hot''\n    supportsHttpsTrafficOnly: true\n    minimumTls  }\n}\n```\n\n### Virtual Network\n```bicep\nresource vnet ''Microsoft.Network/virtualNetworks@2023-09-01'' = {\n  name: vnetName\n  location: location\n  properties: {\n    addressSpace: {\n      addressPrefixes: [''10.0.0.0/16'']\n    }\n    subnets: [\n      {\n        name: ''default''\n        properties: {\n          addressPrefix: ''10.0.1.0/24''\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Key Vault\n```bicep\nresource keyVault ''Microsoft.KeyVault/vaults@2023-07-01'' = {\n  name: keyVaultName\n  location: location\n  properties: {\n    tenantId: subscription().tenantId\n    sku: {\n      family: ''A''\n      name: ''standard''\n    }\n    enableRbacAuthorization: true\n    enableSoftDelete: true\n    softDeleteRetentionInDays: 90\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing or reviewing Bicep templates\n- Looking up Azure resource types and API versions\n- Finding the correct schema for a resource type\n- Using Azure Verified Modules\n- Applying Bicep best practices\n- Deploying Azure infrastructure with IaC\n\n## Keywords\n\nbicep, azure, arm, infrastructure as code, iac, resource manager, deployment, template, module, avm, azure verified modules, resource type, schema, api version, storage account, virtual network, key vault, best practices\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:04:32.815Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Infrastructure Agents requiring expertise in Azure Bicep infrastructure-as-code development","zh":"适用于需要Azure Bicep基础设施即代码开发专业知识的云基础设施代理","ja":"Azure Bicepインフラストラクチャ即コード開発の専門知識を必要とするクラウドインフラストラクチャエージェントに最適","ko":"Azure Bicep 인프라スト럭처 즉 코드 개발 전문 지식이 필요한 클라우드 인프라 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Infraestructura en la Nube que requieren experiencia en desarrollo de infraestructura como código con Azure Bicep","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''infrastructure cloud nécessitant une expertise dans le développement d''infrastructure en tant que code avec Azure Bicep","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Infrastruktur-Agents, die Expertenwissen in der Entwicklung von Infrastruktur-as-Code mit Azure Bicep erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Infraestrutura em Nuvem que exigem especialização no desenvolvimento de infraestrutura como código do Azure Bicep","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов инфраструктуры облака, требующих экспертизы в разработке инфраструктуры как код Azure Bicep","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البنية السحابية الذين يحتاجون إلى الخبرة في تطوير البنية كود أزر من النوع Bicep"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to author Azure Bicep templates with best practices, discover resource types with API versions, retrieve detailed schemas, and leverage Azure Verified Modules for secure deployments using infrastructure-as-code protocols","zh":"赋予代理创建遵循最佳实践的Azure Bicep模板的能力，发现带有API版本的资源类型，检索详细的schema，并利用Azure已验证模块以使用基础设施即代码协议进行安全部署","ja":"エージェントがベストプラクティスに従ったAzure Bicepテンプレートを作成する能力を付与し、APIバージョンを使用したリソースタイプの発見、詳細なスキーマの取得、およびインフラストラクチャ即コードプロトコルを使用したセキュアなデプロイメントにAzureVerifiedモジュールを活用する","ko":"에이전트가 최고의實踐을 따르는 Azure Bicep 템플릿을 작성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, API 버전을 사용한 리소스 유형의 발견, 자세한 스키마의 검색, 및 인프라스트럭처 즉 코드 프로토콜을 사용한 보안 배포에 Azure 확인된 모듈을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear plantillas de Azure Bicep con las mejores prácticas, descubrir tipos de recursos con versiones de API, recuperar esquemas detallados y aprovechar los módulos verificados de Azure para implementaciones seguras utilizando protocolos de infraestructura como código","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des modèles Azure Bicep avec les meilleures pratiques, de découvrir des types de ressources avec des versions d''API, de récupérer des schémas détaillés et d''utiliser les modules Azure vérifiés pour des déploiements sécurisés à l''aide de protocoles d''infrastructure en tant que code","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Azure Bicep-Vorlagen mit Best Practices zu erstellen, Ressourcentypen mit API-Versionen zu entdecken, detaillierte Schemata abzurufen und Azure-Verifizierte-Module für sichere Bereitstellungen unter Verwendung von Infrastruktur-als-Code-Protokollen zu nutzen","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem modelos do Azure Bicep com as melhores práticas, descubram tipos de recursos com versões de API, recuperem esquemas detalhados e utilizem módulos verificados do Azure para implantações seguras usando protocolos de infraestrutura como código","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать шаблоны Azure Bicep с лучшими практиками, обнаруживать типы ресурсов с версиями API, получать подробные схемы и использовать проверенные модули Azure для безопасных развертываний с использованием протоколов инфраструктуры как код","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء إنشاء قوالب أزر من النوع Bicep مع أفضل الممارسات، واكتشاف أنواع الموارد مع إصدارات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات، واسترجاع مخططات مفصلة، وتحقيق مكونات أزر المعتمدة لتنفيذ آمن باستخدام بروتوكولات البنية كود"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Azure resource provisioning","Generating Bicep templates with best practices","Debugging infrastructure-as-code deployments with schema retrieval"],"zh":["自动化Azure资源提供","使用最佳实践生成Bicep模板","使用schema检索调试基础设施即代码部署"],"ja":["Azureリソースのプロビジョニングの自動化","ベストプラクティスに従ったBicepテンプレートの生成","スキーマの取得を使用したインフラストラクチャ即コードデプロイメントのデバッグ"],"ko":["Azure 리소스의 프로비저닝 자동화","최적의 관행을 따르는 Bicep 템플릿 생성","스키마 검색을 사용한 인프라스트럭처 즉 코드 배포 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la provisión de recursos de Azure","Generación de plantillas de Bicep con las mejores prácticas","Depuración de implementaciones de infraestructura como código con recuperación de esquemas"],"fr":["Automatisation de la provision de ressources Azure","Génération de modèles Bicep avec les meilleures pratiques","Débogage des déploiements d''infrastructure en tant que code avec récupération de schémas"],"de":["Automatisierung der Bereitstellung von Azure-Ressourcen","Erstellung von Bicep-Vorlagen mit Best Practices","Fehlerbehebung von Infrastruktur-als-Code-Bereitstellungen mit Schemaabruf"],"pt":["Automatizar a provisionamento de recursos do Azure","Gerar modelos Bicep com as melhores práticas","Depurar implantações de infraestrutura como código com recuperação de esquemas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обеспечение ресурсов Azure","Генерировать шаблоны Bicep с лучшими практиками","Отладить развертывания инфраструктуры как код с помощью получения схем"],"ar":["أتمتة توفير موارد أزر","генерировать قوالب Bicep مع أفضل الممارسات","تصحيح أخطاء عمليات النشر البنية كود مع استرجاع المخططات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Azure environment setup","Azure Bicep expertise recommended"],"zh":["需要Azure环境设置","建议Azure Bicep专业知识"],"ja":["Azure環境の設定が必要","Azure Bicepの専門知識が推奨される"],"ko":["Azure 환경 설정이 필요","Azure Bicep 전문 지식이 권장"],"es":["Requiere configuración de entorno de Azure","Se recomienda experiencia en Azure Bicep"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''environnement Azure","Une expertise en Azure Bicep est recommandée"],"de":["Erfordert Azure-Umgebungskonfiguration","Azure Bicep-Expertenwissen wird empfohlen"],"pt":["Exige configuração de ambiente do Azure","Recomenda-se especialização em Azure Bicep"],"ru":["Требует настройки среды Azure","Рекомендуется экспертиза в Azure Bicep"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد بيئة أزر","يوصى بالتخصص في أزر من النوع Bicep"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
