 avec des scripts personnalisés","Exécution de scripts dans le répertoire `scripts/`","Remplacement de variables dans les scripts"],"de":["Veröffentlichen von Text, Bildern, Videos und langen Artikeln auf X","Verwendung eines echten Chrome-Browsers, um die Bot-Erkennung zu umgehen","Kompatibilität mit benutzerdefinierten Skripten","Ausführung von Skripten im Verzeichnis `scripts/`","Ersetzen von Variablen in den Skripten"],"pt":["Publicação de texto, imagens, vídeos e artigos longos em X","Uso de navegador Chrome real para evitar detecção anti-bot","Execução de scripts personalizados para automação de tarefas","Suporte a várias mídias sociais","Flexibilidade na configuração de parâmetros de publicação"],"ru":["Публикация текста, изображений, видео и длинных статей в X","Использование реального браузера Chrome для избежания обнаружения анти-ботов","Выполнение пользовательских скриптов для автоматизации задач","Поддержка нескольких социальных сетей","Гибкость в настройке параметров публикации"],"ar":["نشر النصوص، الصور، الفيديوهات، و المقالات الطويلة في X","استخدام متصفح Chrome الحقيقي لتجاوز اكتشاف البرامج الضارة","تنفيذ سكريبتات مخصصة لتحسين مهام الأتمتة","دعم العديد من وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية","مرونة في إعداد معايير النشر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["baoyu-post-to-x","Twitter","Chrome","anti-bot","text","images","videos","SEO"],"ja":["baoyu-post-to-x","Twitter","Chrome","anti-bot","text","images","videos","SEO"],"ko":["baoyu-post-to-x","Twitter","Chrome","anti-bot","text","images","videos","SEO"],"es":["baoyu-post-to-x","publicar en X","publicar en Twitter","evadir detección de bots","navegador Chrome real","scripts personalizados","desarrollo de habilidades"],"fr":["baoyu-post-to-x","publier sur X","publier sur Twitter","éviter la détection des bots","navigateur Chrome réel","scripts personnalisés","développement de compétences"],"de":["baoyu-post-to-x","veröffentlichen auf X","veröffentlichen auf Twitter","Bot-Erkennung umgehen","echter Chrome-Browser","benutzerdefinierte Skripte","Fähigkeitsentwicklung"],"pt":["publicação em X","integração de mídia social","navegador Chrome","anti-bot","automação de tarefas","skript personalizados","mídia social","publicação de conteúdo"],"ru":["публикация в X","интеграция социальных сетей","браузер Chrome","анти-бот","автоматизация задач","пользовательские скрипты","социальные сети","публикация контента"],"ar":["نشر في X","دمج وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية","متصفح Chrome","برامج مضادة","أتمتة المهام","سكريبتات مخصصة","وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية","نشر المحتوى"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-post-to-x","description":"Posts content and articles to X (Twitter). Supports regular posts with images/videos and X Articles (long-form Markdown). Uses real Chrome with CDP to bypass anti-automation. Use when user asks to post to X, tweet, publish to Twitter, or share on X.","bodyPreview":"# Post to X (Twitter)\n\nPosts text, images, videos, and long-form articles to X via real Chrome browser (bypasses anti-bot detection).\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | P","body":"# Post to X (Twitter)\n\nPosts text, images, videos, and long-form articles to X via real Chrome browser (bypasses anti-bot detection).\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/x-browser.ts` | Regular posts (text + images) |\n| `scripts/x-video.ts` | Video posts (text + video) |\n| `scripts/x-quote.ts` | Quote tweet with comment |\n| `scripts/x-article.ts` | Long-form article publishing (Markdown) |\n| `scripts/md-to-html.ts` | Markdown → HTML conversion |\n| `scripts/copy-to-clipboard.ts` | Copy content to clipboard |\n| `scripts/paste-from-clipboard.ts` | Send real paste keystroke |\n\n## Preferences (EXTEND.md)\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                       Path                       │     Location      │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md          │ Project directory │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md    │ User home         │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                  Action                                   │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, apply settings                                               │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ Use defaults                                                              │\n└───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Default Chrome profile | Auto-submit preference\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Google Chrome or Chromium\n- `bun` runtime\n- First run: log in to X manually (session saved)\n\n## References\n\n- **Regular Posts**: See `references/regular-posts.md` for manual workflow, troubleshooting, and technical details\n- **X Articles**: See `references/articles.md` for long-form article publishing guide\n\n---\n\n## Regular Posts\n\nText + up to 4 images.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-browser.ts \"Hello!\" --image ./photo.png          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-browser.ts \"Hello!\" --image ./photo.png --submit  # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<text>` | Post content (positional) |\n| `--image <path>` | Image file (repeatable, max 4) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n---\n\n## Video Posts\n\nText + video file.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-video.ts \"Check this out!\" --video ./clip.mp4          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-video.ts \"Amazing content\" --video ./demo.mp4 --submit  # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<text>` | Post content (positional) |\n| `--video <path>` | Video file (MP4, MOV, WebM) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n**Limits**: Regular 140s max, Premium 60min. Processing: 30-60s.\n\n---\n\n## Quote Tweets\n\nQuote an existing tweet with comment.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-quote.ts https://x.com/user/status/123 \"Great insight!\"          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-quote.ts https://x.com/user/status/123 \"I agree!\" --submit       # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<tweet-url>` | URL to quote (positional) |\n| `<comment>` | Comment text (positional, optional) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n---\n\n## X Articles\n\nLong-form Markdown articles (requires X Premium).\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md                        # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md --cover ./cover.jpg    # With cover\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md --submit               # Publish\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<markdown>` | Markdown file (positional) |\n| `--cover <path>` | Cover image |\n| `--title <text>` | Override title |\n| `--submit` | Publish (default: preview) |\n\n**Frontmatter**: `title`, `cover_image` supported in YAML front matter.\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- First run: manual login required (session persists)\n- Always preview before `--submit`\n- Cross-platform: macOS, Linux, Windows\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Preferences** section for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:05:21.038Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Social Media Agents requiring automated posting capabilities to bypass anti-bot detection on Twitter","zh":"适用于需要自动化在Twitter上发布内容以绕过反机器人检测的社交媒体代理","ja":"Twitterでの反ボット検出を回避する自動投稿機能を必要とするソーシャルメディアエージェントに最適","ko":"트위터에서 반 자동화 탐지를 우회하는 자동 게시 기능이 필요한 소셜 미디어 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de medios sociales que requieren capacidades de publicación automatizada para evitar la detección de bots en Twitter","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de médias sociaux nécessitant des capacités de publication automatisée pour contourner la détection de bots sur Twitter","de":"Ideal für Social-Media-Agents, die eine automatisierte Postfunktion benötigen, um die Bot-Erkennung auf Twitter zu umgehen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Mídia Social que requerem capacidades de postagem automatizada para contornar a detecção anti-bot no Twitter","ru":"Идеально для Социальных Медиа Агентов, требующих автоматических возможностей публикации для обхода обнаружения анти-ботов в Twitter","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإعلاميين الاجتماعيين الذين يتطلبون قدرات منشورة آليّة لتجاوز الكشف المضاد للبوتات على تويتر"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to post text, images, videos, and long-form articles to Twitter via a real Chrome browser, leveraging TypeScript scripts to bypass anti-bot detection and ensuring seamless content sharing using protocols like HTTPS","zh":"赋予代理发布文本、图像、视频和长篇文章到Twitter的能力，通过真实的Chrome浏览器，并利用TypeScript脚本绕过反机器人检测，确保使用HTTPS等协议进行无缝内容分享","ja":"エージェントがテキスト、画像、動画、長文記事をTwitterに投稿できる機能を提供し、実際のChromeブラウザを利用してTypeScriptスクリプトで反ボット検出を回避し、HTTPSなどのプロトコルを使用した無邪気なコンテンツ共有を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 텍스트, 이미지, 비디오 및 장문 기사를 트위터에 게시할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 실제 Chrome 브라우저를 사용하여 TypeScript 스크립트로 반 자동화 탐지를 우회하고 HTTPS 등 프로토콜을 사용한 무제한 콘텐츠 공유를 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a publicar texto, imágenes, videos y artículos de larga extensión en Twitter a través de un navegador Chrome real, utilizando scripts de TypeScript para evitar la detección de bots y garantizar una compartición de contenido fluida utilizando protocolos como HTTPS","fr":"Permet aux agents de publier du texte, des images, des vidéos et des articles de longue forme sur Twitter via un navigateur Chrome réel, en utilisant des scripts TypeScript pour contourner la détection de bots et en assurant un partage de contenu fluide en utilisant des protocoles comme HTTPS","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Text, Bilder, Videos und Langartikel auf Twitter über einen echten Chrome-Browser zu posten, indem TypeScript-Skripte zur Umgehung der Bot-Erkennung verwendet werden und eine nahtlose Inhaltsfreigabe unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie HTTPS gewährleistet wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a postar texto, imagens, vídeos e artigos de longa forma no Twitter por meio de um navegador Chrome real, utilizando scripts TypeScript para contornar a detecção anti-bot e garantir a partilha de conteúdo sem problemas usando protocolos como HTTPS","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью публиковать текст, изображения, видео и статьи длинного формата в Twitter через реальный браузер Chrome, используя скрипты TypeScript для обхода обнаружения анти-ботов и обеспечения бесперебойного обмена контентом с использованием протоколов như HTTPS","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على نشر النصوص والصور وملفات الفيديو والمقالات الشاملة على تويتر عبر متصفح كروم حقيقي، باستخدام نصوص تا입سكريبت لتجاوز الكشف المضاد للبوتات وضمان مشاركة المحتوى بسلاسة باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل HTTPS"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Twitter posts for marketing campaigns","Posting long-form articles to Twitter threads","Uploading videos to Twitter using a Chrome browser"],"zh":["自动化Twitter帖子用于营销活动","将长篇文章发布到Twitter线程","使用Chrome浏览器将视频上传到Twitter"],"ja":["マーケティングキャンペーン用のTwitter投稿の自動化","長文記事をTwitterスレッドに投稿する","Chromeブラウザを使用して動画をTwitterにアップロードする"],"ko":["마케팅 캠페인용 트위터 게시 자동화","장문 기사를 트위터 스레드로 게시","Chrome 브라우저를 사용하여 비디오를 트위터에 업로드"],"es":["Automatizar publicaciones de Twitter para campañas de marketing","Publicar artículos de larga extensión en hilos de Twitter","Subir videos a Twitter utilizando un navegador Chrome"],"fr":["Automatiser les publications Twitter pour les campagnes de marketing","Publier des articles de longue forme sur les threads Twitter","Télécharger des vidéos sur Twitter en utilisant un navigateur Chrome"],"de":["Automatisierung von Twitter-Beiträgen für Marketing-Kampagnen","Veröffentlichen von Langartikeln in Twitter-Threads","Hochladen von Videos auf Twitter mithilfe eines Chrome-Browsers"],"pt":["Automatizar postagens do Twitter para campanhas de marketing","Publicar artigos de longa forma em threads do Twitter","Fazer upload de vídeos para o Twitter usando um navegador Chrome"],"ru":["Автоматизация публикаций в Twitter для маркетинговых кампаний","Публикация статей длинного формата в нитях Twitter","Загрузка видео в Twitter с помощью браузера Chrome"],"ar":["توفير منشور