t":["baoyu-post-to-x","publicação automática","twitter","navegador chrome","detecção anti-bot","scripts personalizados","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["baoyu-post-to-x","автоматическая публикация","twitter","браузер chrome","анти-бот детекция","пользовательские скрипты","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["baoyu-post-to-x","نشر 自动","تويتر","متصفح كروم","كشف البوتات","سكربتات مخصصة","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"openclaw","repo":"skills","repoPath":"openclaw/skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.415Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-post-to-x","description":"Posts content and articles to X (Twitter). Supports regular posts with images/videos and X Articles (long-form Markdown). Uses real Chrome with CDP to bypass anti-automation. Use when user asks to post to X, tweet, publish to Twitter, or share on X.","bodyPreview":"# Post to X (Twitter)\n\nPosts text, images, videos, and long-form articles to X via real Chrome browser (bypasses anti-bot detection).\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | P","body":"# Post to X (Twitter)\n\nPosts text, images, videos, and long-form articles to X via real Chrome browser (bypasses anti-bot detection).\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/x-browser.ts` | Regular posts (text + images) |\n| `scripts/x-video.ts` | Video posts (text + video) |\n| `scripts/x-quote.ts` | Quote tweet with comment |\n| `scripts/x-article.ts` | Long-form article publishing (Markdown) |\n| `scripts/md-to-html.ts` | Markdown → HTML conversion |\n| `scripts/copy-to-clipboard.ts` | Copy content to clipboard |\n| `scripts/paste-from-clipboard.ts` | Send real paste keystroke |\n\n## Preferences (EXTEND.md)\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                       Path                       │     Location      │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md          │ Project directory │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md    │ User home         │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                  Action                                   │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, apply settings                                               │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ Use defaults                                                              │\n└───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Default Chrome profile | Auto-submit preference\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Google Chrome or Chromium\n- `bun` runtime\n- First run: log in to X manually (session saved)\n\n## References\n\n- **Regular Posts**: See `references/regular-posts.md` for manual workflow, troubleshooting, and technical details\n- **X Articles**: See `references/articles.md` for long-form article publishing guide\n\n---\n\n## Regular Posts\n\nText + up to 4 images.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-browser.ts \"Hello!\" --image ./photo.png          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-browser.ts \"Hello!\" --image ./photo.png --submit  # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<text>` | Post content (positional) |\n| `--image <path>` | Image file (repeatable, max 4) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n---\n\n## Video Posts\n\nText + video file.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-video.ts \"Check this out!\" --video ./clip.mp4          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-video.ts \"Amazing content\" --video ./demo.mp4 --submit  # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<text>` | Post content (positional) |\n| `--video <path>` | Video file (MP4, MOV, WebM) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n**Limits**: Regular 140s max, Premium 60min. Processing: 30-60s.\n\n---\n\n## Quote Tweets\n\nQuote an existing tweet with comment.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-quote.ts https://x.com/user/status/123 \"Great insight!\"          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-quote.ts https://x.com/user/status/123 \"I agree!\" --submit       # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<tweet-url>` | URL to quote (positional) |\n| `<comment>` | Comment text (positional, optional) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n---\n\n## X Articles\n\nLong-form Markdown articles (requires X Premium).\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md                        # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md --cover ./cover.jpg    # With cover\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md --submit               # Publish\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<markdown>` | Markdown file (positional) |\n| `--cover <path>` | Cover image |\n| `--title <text>` | Override title |\n| `--submit` | Publish (default: preview) |\n\n**Frontmatter**: `title`, `cover_image` supported in YAML front matter.\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- First run: manual login required (session persists)\n- Always preview before `--submit`\n- Cross-platform: macOS, Linux, Windows\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Preferences** section for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:05:19.823Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Social Media Agents requiring automated posting capabilities to Twitter via a real Chrome browser, bypassing anti-bot detection.","zh":"适用于需要通过真实Chrome浏览器自动发布推文到Twitter的社交媒体代理，绕过反 bot 检测。","ja":"Twitterへの自動投稿機能を必要とするソーシャルメディアエージェントに最適です。実際のChromeブラウザを使用して反bot検出を回避します。","ko":"자동으로 트위터에 게시물을 게시해야 하는 소셜 미디어 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 실제 크롬 브라우저를 통해 반_bot_ 검출을 우회합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Redes Sociales que requieren capacidades de publicación automatizada en Twitter a través de un navegador Chrome real, evitando la detección anti-bot.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Médias Sociaux nécessitant des capacités de publication automatisée sur Twitter via un navigateur Chrome réel, contournant la détection anti-robot.","de":"Ideal für Social-Media-Agents, die automatisierte Postfunktionen auf Twitter über einen echten Chrome-Browser benötigen, um die Anti-Bot-Erkennung zu umgehen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Mídia Social que exigem capacidades de postagem automatizada para o Twitter via um navegador Chrome real, contornando a detecção anti-bot.","ru":"Идеально для социальных медиа-агентов, требующих автоматических возможностей публикации в Twitter через реальный браузер Chrome, обходя антибот детекцию.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوسائط الاجتماعية التي تتطلب قدرات منشورة آليّة إلى تويتر عبر متصفح كروم حقيقي، وتجاوز كشف المنع للبوتات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to post text, images, videos, and long-form articles to Twitter, leveraging a real Chrome browser to evade anti-bot measures, utilizing TypeScript scripts for execution.","zh":"赋予代理发布文本、图像、视频和长篇文章到Twitter的能力，利用实际的Chrome浏览器来规避反bot措施，使用TypeScript脚本来执行。","ja":"エージェントがテキスト、画像、動画、長文記事をTwitterに投稿できるようにし、実際のChromeブラウザを使用して反bot対策を回避し、TypeScriptスクリプトを使用して実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 텍스트, 이미지, 동영상, 장문 기사를 트위터에 게시할 수 있게 하며, 실제 크롬 브라우저를 사용하여 반_bot_ 대책을 우회하며, TypeScript 스크립트를 사용하여 실행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a publicar texto, imágenes, videos y artículos de larga extensión en Twitter, aprovechando un navegador Chrome real para evadir las medidas anti-robot, utilizando scripts de TypeScript para la ejecución.","fr":"Permet aux agents de publier du texte, des images, des vidéos et des articles de longue forme sur Twitter, en exploitant un navigateur Chrome réel pour éviter les mesures anti-robot, en utilisant des scripts TypeScript pour l''exécution.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Text, Bilder, Videos und Langartikel auf Twitter zu posten, indem sie einen echten Chrome-Browser nutzen, um Anti-Bot-Maßnahmen zu umgehen, und TypeScript-Skripte für die Ausführung verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a postar texto, imagens, vídeos e artigos de longa forma no Twitter, utilizando um navegador Chrome real para evitar medidas anti-bot, utilizando scripts TypeScript para execução.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью публиковать текст, изображения, видео и статьи большой длины в Twitter, используя реальный браузер Chrome для обхода антибот мер, используя скрипты TypeScript для выполнения.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على نشر النصوص والصور والفيديوهات والمقالات الشاملة على تويتر، مستخدمين متصفح كروم حقيقي لتجاوز إجراءات منع البوتات، باستخدام سكريبتات تایبسكريبت للتشغيل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Twitter posts with multimedia content","Bypassing anti-bot detection for social media automation","Publishing long-form articles directly to Twitter"],"zh":["自动发布包含多媒体内容的Twitter帖子","规避反bot检测以实现社交媒体自动化","直接将长篇文章发布到Twitter"],"ja":["マルチメディアコンテンツを含むTwitter投稿の自動化","反bot検出を回避したソーシャルメディア自動化","長文記事を直接Twitterに投稿"],"ko":["멀티미디어 콘텐츠가 포함된 트위터 게시물 자동화","반_bot_ 검출을 우회한 소셜 미디어 자동화","장문 기사를 직접 트위터에 게시"],"es":["Automatizar publicaciones de Twitter con contenido multimedia","Evitar la detección anti-bot para la automatización de redes sociales","Publicar artículos de larga extensión directamente en Twitter"],"fr":["Automatiser les publications Twitter avec du contenu multimédia","Contourner la détection anti-robot pour l''automatisation des médias sociaux","Publier des articles de longue forme directement sur Twitter"],"de":["Automatisierung von Twitter-Beiträgen mit Multimedia-Inhalten","Umgehung der Anti-Bot-Erkennung für die Automatisierung von sozialen Medien","Veröffentlichung von Langartikeln direkt auf Twitter"],"pt":["Automatizar postagens do Twitter com conteúdo multimídia","Contornar a detecção anti-bot para automação de mídia social","Publicar artigos de longa forma diretamente no Twitter"],"ru":["Автоматизация публикаций в Twitter с мультимедийным контентом","Обход антибот детекции для автоматизации социальных медиа","Публикация статей большой длины непосредственно в Twitter"],"ar":["توفير آلي للنشرات على تويتر مع المحتوى المتعدد","تجاوز كشف المنع للبوتات لأتمتة الوسائط الاجتماعية","نشر المقالات الشاملة مباشرة إلى تويتر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Twitter","Dependent on real Chrome browser functionality","Script execution limited to TypeScript (.ts) files"],"zh":["需要访问Twitter","依赖于实际的Chrome浏览器功能","脚本执行仅限于TypeScript (.ts) 文件"],"ja":["Twitterへのアクセスが必要","実際のChromeブラウザーの機能に依存","スクリプトの実行はTypeScript (.ts) ファイルのみ"],"ko":["트위터에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","실제 크롬 브라우저의 기능에 의존","스크립트 실행은 TypeScript (.ts) 파일만 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso a Twitter","Dependiente de la funcionalidad del navegador Chrome real","La ejecución de scripts está limitada a archivos TypeScript (.ts)"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à Twitter","Dépend de la fonctionnalité du navigateur Chrome réel","L''exécution de scripts est limitée aux fichiers TypeScript (.ts)"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Twitter","Abhängig von der Funktionalität des echten Chrome-Browsers","Die Skriptausführung ist auf TypeScript-Dateien (.ts) beschränkt"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao Twitter","Dependente da funcionalidade do navegador Chrome real","Execução de script limitada a arquivos TypeScript (.ts)"],"ru":["Требует доступа к Twitter","Зависит от функциональности реального браузера Chrome","Выполнение скрипта ограничено файлами TypeScript (.ts)"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى تويتر","يعتمد على أداء متصفح كروم الحقيقي","تشغيل السكريبتات مقيد بملفات تایبسكريبت (.ts)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
