مع TypeScript","دعم السكريبتات المخصصة","التكامل مع أدوات الطرف الثالث"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TypeScript AI","自动化帖子发布","Twitter","AI 助手框架","复杂任务处理","超轻量级","可扩展"],"ja":["TypeScript AI","自動投稿","Twitter","AI アシスタンフレームワーク","複雑なタスクの処理","超軽量級","拡張可能"],"ko":["TypeScript AI","자동 게시물 게시","Twitter","AI 도우미 프레임워크","복잡한 작업 처리","초경량","확장 가능"],"es":["asistente personal AI","publicar en X","framework ultra ligero","TypeScript","navegador Chrome","detección de bots","integración de herramientas","sistema de memoria","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["assistant personnel AI","publier sur X","cadre ultra léger","TypeScript","navigateur Chrome","détection de bots","intégration d''outils","système de mémoire","développement de logiciels"],"de":["persönlicher KI-Assistent","Veröffentlichen auf X","ultra-leichtes Framework","TypeScript","Chrome-Browser","Bot-Erkennung","Tool-Integration","Speichersystem","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Baoyu Post para X","framework de assistente AI","TypeScript","publicação de conteúdo","bypassar detecção de bots","navegador Chrome"],"ru":["Baoyu Пост в X","фреймворк AI","TypeScript","публикация контента","обход обнаружения ботов","браузер Chrome"],"ar":["باою بوست إلى إكس","إطار عمل مساعد آي آي","TypeScript","نشر المحتوى","تجاوز اكتشاف البوتات","متصفح كروم"]}},"owner":"chengyihua","repo":"nanobot-ts","repoPath":"chengyihua/nanobot-ts","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-post-to-x","description":"Posts content and articles to X (Twitter). Supports regular posts with images/videos and X Articles (long-form Markdown). Uses real Chrome with CDP to bypass anti-automation. Use when user asks to post to X, tweet, publish to Twitter, or share on X.","bodyPreview":"# Post to X (Twitter)\n\nPosts text, images, videos, and long-form articles to X via real Chrome browser (bypasses anti-bot detection).\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | P","body":"# Post to X (Twitter)\n\nPosts text, images, videos, and long-form articles to X via real Chrome browser (bypasses anti-bot detection).\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/x-browser.ts` | Regular posts (text + images) |\n| `scripts/x-video.ts` | Video posts (text + video) |\n| `scripts/x-quote.ts` | Quote tweet with comment |\n| `scripts/x-article.ts` | Long-form article publishing (Markdown) |\n| `scripts/md-to-html.ts` | Markdown → HTML conversion |\n| `scripts/copy-to-clipboard.ts` | Copy content to clipboard |\n| `scripts/paste-from-clipboard.ts` | Send real paste keystroke |\n\n## Preferences (EXTEND.md)\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                       Path                       │     Location      │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md          │ Project directory │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md    │ User home         │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                  Action                                   │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, apply settings                                               │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ Use defaults                                                              │\n└───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Default Chrome profile | Auto-submit preference\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Google Chrome or Chromium\n- `bun` runtime\n- First run: log in to X manually (session saved)\n\n## References\n\n- **Regular Posts**: See `references/regular-posts.md` for manual workflow, troubleshooting, and technical details\n- **X Articles**: See `references/articles.md` for long-form article publishing guide\n\n---\n\n## Regular Posts\n\nText + up to 4 images.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-browser.ts \"Hello!\" --image ./photo.png          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-browser.ts \"Hello!\" --image ./photo.png --submit  # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<text>` | Post content (positional) |\n| `--image <path>` | Image file (repeatable, max 4) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n---\n\n## Video Posts\n\nText + video file.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-video.ts \"Check this out!\" --video ./clip.mp4          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-video.ts \"Amazing content\" --video ./demo.mp4 --submit  # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<text>` | Post content (positional) |\n| `--video <path>` | Video file (MP4, MOV, WebM) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n**Limits**: Regular 140s max, Premium 60min. Processing: 30-60s.\n\n---\n\n## Quote Tweets\n\nQuote an existing tweet with comment.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-quote.ts https://x.com/user/status/123 \"Great insight!\"          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-quote.ts https://x.com/user/status/123 \"I agree!\" --submit       # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<tweet-url>` | URL to quote (positional) |\n| `<comment>` | Comment text (positional, optional) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n---\n\n## X Articles\n\nLong-form Markdown articles (requires X Premium).\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md                        # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md --cover ./cover.jpg    # With cover\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md --submit               # Publish\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<markdown>` | Markdown file (positional) |\n| `--cover <path>` | Cover image |\n| `--title <text>` | Override title |\n| `--submit` | Publish (default: preview) |\n\n**Frontmatter**: `title`, `cover_image` supported in YAML front matter.\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- First run: manual login required (session persists)\n- Always preview before `--submit`\n- Cross-platform: macOS, Linux, Windows\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Preferences** section for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:05:18.317Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Social Media Agents requiring automated posting capabilities to Twitter via a real Chrome browser, bypassing anti-bot detection.","zh":"适用于需要通过真实Chrome浏览器自动发布推文到Twitter的社交媒体代理，绕过反bot检测。","ja":"Twitterへの自動投稿機能を必要とするソーシャルメディアエージェントに最適です。実際のChromeブラウザを使用して反ボット検出を回避します。","ko":"Twitter에 자동으로 게시하는 기능이 필요한 소셜 미디어 에이전트에게 이상적입니다. 실제 Chrome 브라우저를 사용하여 반-bot 탐지를 피합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de medios sociales que requieren capacidades de publicación automatizada en Twitter a través de un navegador Chrome real, evitando la detección anti-bot.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents des médias sociaux nécessitant des capacités de publication automatisée sur Twitter via un navigateur Chrome réel, contournant la détection anti-robot.","de":"Ideal für Social-Media-Agents, die automatisierte Postfunktionen auf Twitter über einen echten Chrome-Browser erfordern, um die Anti-Bot-Erkennung zu umgehen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Mídia Social que exigem capacidades de postagem automatizada para o Twitter por meio de um navegador Chrome real, contornando a detecção anti-bot.","ru":"Идеально для Социальных Медиа Агентов, требующих автоматизированных возможностей для публикации в Twitter через реальный браузер Chrome, обходя обнаружение анти-ботов.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية الذين يطلبون إمكانيات منشورات مؤتمتة على تويتر من خلال متصفح كروم حقيقي ، وتجاوز اكتشاف المضادات الروبوتية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to post text, images, videos, and long-form articles to Twitter using TypeScript, leveraging a robust agent loop, memory system, and tool integration, while utilizing a real Chrome browser to evade anti-bot measures.","zh":"赋予代理发布文本、图像、视频和长篇文章到Twitter的能力，使用TypeScript，利用强大的代理循环、内存系统和工具集成，同时使用实际的Chrome浏览器来规避反bot措施。","ja":"TypeScriptを使用して、エージェントがテキスト、画像、動画、長文記事をTwitterに投稿できるようにし、強力なエージェントループ、メモリーシステム、ツール統合を活用しながら、実際のChromeブラウザを使用して反ボット対策を回避します。","ko":"에이전트가 텍스트, 이미지, 비디오 및 장문 기사를 TypeScript를 사용하여 Twitter에 게시할 수 있도록 하며, 강력한 에이전트 루프, 메모리 시스템 및 도구 통합을 활용하면서 실제 Chrome 브라우저를 사용하여 반-bot 대책을 피합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a publicar texto, imágenes, videos y artículos de largo formato en Twitter utilizando TypeScript, aprovechando un bucle de agente robusto, un sistema de memoria y una integración de herramientas, mientras utiliza un navegador Chrome real para evadir las medidas anti-bot.","fr":"Permet aux agents de publier du texte, des images, des vidéos et des articles de long format sur Twitter en utilisant TypeScript, en exploitant une boucle d''agent robuste, un système de mémoire et une intégration d''outils, tout en utilisant un navigateur Chrome réel pour éviter les mesures anti-robot.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Text, Bilder, Videos und Langformartikel auf Twitter mit TypeScript zu posten, indem es einen robusten Agentenloop, ein Memoriesystem und eine Toolintegration nutzt, während es einen echten Chrome-Browser zur Umgehung von Anti-Bot-Maßnahmen verwendet.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a postar texto, imagens, vídeos e artigos de longa forma no Twitter usando TypeScript, aproveitando um loop de agente robusto, sistema de memória e integração de ferramentas, enquanto utiliza um navegador Chrome real para evitar medidas anti-bot.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью публиковать текст, изображения, видео и статьи длинной формы в Twitter с помощью TypeScript, используя прочный цикл агента, систему памяти и интеграцию инструментов, а также используя реальный браузер Chrome для обхода анти-бот мер.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على نشر النصوص والصور وملفات الفيديو والمقالات ذات الشكل الطويل على تويتر باستخدام TypeScript ، مستفيدا من حلقة وكيل قوية ونظام ذاكرة وتكامل أدوات ، في حين يستخدم متصفح كروم حقيقي لتجنب إجراءات مضادات الروبوت."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Twitter posts with multimedia content","Posting long-form articles to Twitter via a Chrome browser","Bypassing anti-bot detection for Twitter posting"],"zh":["使用多媒体内容自动发布Twitter帖子","通过Chrome浏览器将长篇文章发布到Twitter","绕过反bot检测发布Twitter帖子"],"ja":["マルチメディアコンテンツを使用したTwitter投稿の自動化","Chromeブラウザを使用して長文記事をTwitterに投稿する","反ボット検出を回避したTwitter投稿"],"ko":["멀티미디어 콘텐츠를 사용한 자동화된 Twitter 게시물","Chrome 브라우저를 통해 장문 기사를 Twitter에 게시","반-bot 탐지를 피한 Twitter 게시물"],"es":["Automatizar publicaciones de Twitter con contenido multimedia","Publicar artículos de largo formato en Twitter a través de un navegador Chrome","Evitar la detección anti-bot para publicaciones de Twitter"],"fr":["Automatiser les publications Twitter avec du contenu multimédia","Publier des articles de long format sur Twitter via un navigateur Chrome","Contourner la détection anti-robot pour les publications Twitter"],"de":["Automatisierung von Twitter-Beiträgen mit Multimedia-Inhalten","Veröffentlichung von Langformartikeln auf Twitter über einen Chrome-Browser","Umgehung der Anti-Bot-Erkennung für Twitter-Beiträge"],"pt":["Automatizar postagens do Twitter com conteúdo multimídia","Publicar artigos de longa forma no Twitter por meio de um navegador Chrome","Contornar a detecção anti-bot para postagens do Twitter"],"ru":["Автоматизировать публикацию в Twitter с мультимедийным контентом","Публиковать статьи длинной формы в Twitter через браузер Chrome","Обходить обнаружение анти-ботов для публикации в Twitter"],"ar":["تأتمتة منشورات تويتر مع المحتوى المتعدد الوسائط","نشر المقالات ذات الشكل الطويل على تويتر عبر متصفح كروم","التجاوز اكتشاف مضادات الروبوتات لمنشورات تويتر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to a Twitter account","Dependent on Chrome browser functionality","TypeScript environment necessary"],"zh":["需要访问Twitter账户","依赖于Chrome浏览器的功能","需要TypeScript环境"],"ja":["Twitterアカウントへのアクセスが必要","Chromeブラウザの機能に依存する","TypeScript環境が必要"],"ko":["Twitter 계정에 접근할 수 있어야 함","Chrome 브라우저의 기능에 의존","TypeScript 환경이 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a una cuenta de Twitter","Dependiente de la funcionalidad del navegador Chrome","Entorno de TypeScript necesario"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à un compte Twitter","Dépend de la fonctionnalité du navigateur Chrome","Environnement TypeScript nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf ein Twitter-Konto","Abhängig von der Funktionali