de scripts"],"de":["Veröffentlichung von Text, Bildern, Videos und langen Artikeln auf X","Verwendung eines echten Chrome-Browsers, um die Bot-Erkennung zu vermeiden","Einbindung von Skripten für eine flexible Ausführung","Kompatibilität mit dem Langartikel-Format","Ausführung über das Skriptverzeichnis"],"pt":["Publicação de textos, imagens, vídeos e artigos longos","Uso de navegador Chrome real para evitar detecção anti-bot","Suporte a scripts personalizados","Execução de scripts via terminal","Integração com o X","Compatibilidade com diferentes formatos de mídia"],"ru":["Публикация текста, изображений, видео и длинных статей","Использование реального браузера Chrome для обхода анти-бот детекции","Поддержка пользовательских скриптов","Выполнение скриптов через терминал","Интеграция с X","Совместимость с разными форматами медиа"],"ar":["نشر النصوص والصور والفيديوهات والمقالات الطويلة","استخدام متصفح Chrome الحقيقي لتجاوز كشف البوتات","دعم البرامج النصية المخصصة","تشغيل البرامج النصية عبر الطرفية","التكامل مع X","توافق مع صيغ وسائط مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["baoyu-post-to-x","Twitter","post to x","twitter api","chrome browser","anti-bot detection"],"ja":["baoyu-post-to-x","Twitter","post to x","twitter api","chrome browser","anti-bot detection"],"ko":["baoyu-post-to-x","Twitter","post to x","twitter api","chrome browser","anti-bot detection"],"es":["publicar en X","publicar en Twitter","baoyu-post-to-x","evitar detección de bots","navegador Chrome real","scripts de publicación","contenido en X","publicación automática","integración con X"],"fr":["publier sur X","publier sur Twitter","baoyu-post-to-x","éviter la détection des bots","navigateur Chrome réel","scripts de publication","contenu sur X","publication automatique","intégration avec X"],"de":["veröffentlichen auf X","veröffentlichen auf Twitter","baoyu-post-to-x","Bot-Erkennung vermeiden","echter Chrome-Browser","Skripte für Veröffentlichung","Inhalt auf X","automatische Veröffentlichung","Integration mit X"],"pt":["baoyu-post-to-x","publicação de conteúdo","navegador Chrome real","detecção anti-bot","scripts personalizados","integração com X","mídia social","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologia de publicação"],"ru":["baoyu-post-to-x","публикация контента","реальный браузер Chrome","анти-бот детекция","пользовательские скрипты","интеграция с X","социальные медиа","разработка программного обеспечения","технология публикации"],"ar":["baoyu-post-to-x","نشر المحتوى","متصفح Chrome الحقيقي","كشف البوتات","البرامج النصية المخصصة","التكامل مع X","وسائط اجتماعية","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا النشر"]}},"owner":"kbarbel640-del","repo":"skills","repoPath":"kbarbel640-del/skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-post-to-x","description":"Posts content and articles to X (Twitter). Supports regular posts with images/videos and X Articles (long-form Markdown). Uses real Chrome with CDP to bypass anti-automation. Use when user asks to post to X, tweet, publish to Twitter, or share on X.","bodyPreview":"# Post to X (Twitter)\n\nPosts text, images, videos, and long-form articles to X via real Chrome browser (bypasses anti-bot detection).\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | P","body":"# Post to X (Twitter)\n\nPosts text, images, videos, and long-form articles to X via real Chrome browser (bypasses anti-bot detection).\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/x-browser.ts` | Regular posts (text + images) |\n| `scripts/x-video.ts` | Video posts (text + video) |\n| `scripts/x-quote.ts` | Quote tweet with comment |\n| `scripts/x-article.ts` | Long-form article publishing (Markdown) |\n| `scripts/md-to-html.ts` | Markdown → HTML conversion |\n| `scripts/copy-to-clipboard.ts` | Copy content to clipboard |\n| `scripts/paste-from-clipboard.ts` | Send real paste keystroke |\n\n## Preferences (EXTEND.md)\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                       Path                       │     Location      │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md          │ Project directory │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-post-to-x/EXTEND.md    │ User home         │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                  Action                                   │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, apply settings                                               │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ Use defaults                                                              │\n└───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Default Chrome profile | Auto-submit preference\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Google Chrome or Chromium\n- `bun` runtime\n- First run: log in to X manually (session saved)\n\n## References\n\n- **Regular Posts**: See `references/regular-posts.md` for manual workflow, troubleshooting, and technical details\n- **X Articles**: See `references/articles.md` for long-form article publishing guide\n\n---\n\n## Regular Posts\n\nText + up to 4 images.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-browser.ts \"Hello!\" --image ./photo.png          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-browser.ts \"Hello!\" --image ./photo.png --submit  # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<text>` | Post content (positional) |\n| `--image <path>` | Image file (repeatable, max 4) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n---\n\n## Video Posts\n\nText + video file.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-video.ts \"Check this out!\" --video ./clip.mp4          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-video.ts \"Amazing content\" --video ./demo.mp4 --submit  # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<text>` | Post content (positional) |\n| `--video <path>` | Video file (MP4, MOV, WebM) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n**Limits**: Regular 140s max, Premium 60min. Processing: 30-60s.\n\n---\n\n## Quote Tweets\n\nQuote an existing tweet with comment.\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-quote.ts https://x.com/user/status/123 \"Great insight!\"          # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-quote.ts https://x.com/user/status/123 \"I agree!\" --submit       # Post\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<tweet-url>` | URL to quote (positional) |\n| `<comment>` | Comment text (positional, optional) |\n| `--submit` | Post (default: preview) |\n| `--profile <dir>` | Custom Chrome profile |\n\n---\n\n## X Articles\n\nLong-form Markdown articles (requires X Premium).\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md                        # Preview\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md --cover ./cover.jpg    # With cover\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/x-article.ts article.md --submit               # Publish\n```\n\n**Parameters**:\n| Parameter | Description |\n|-----------|-------------|\n| `<markdown>` | Markdown file (positional) |\n| `--cover <path>` | Cover image |\n| `--title <text>` | Override title |\n| `--submit` | Publish (default: preview) |\n\n**Frontmatter**: `title`, `cover_image` supported in YAML front matter.\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- First run: manual login required (session persists)\n- Always preview before `--submit`\n- Cross-platform: macOS, Linux, Windows\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Preferences** section for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:05:27.565Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Social Media Agents requiring automated posting capabilities to Twitter via a real Chrome browser, bypassing anti-bot detection.","zh":"适用于需要通过真实 Chrome 浏览器自动化在 Twitter 发帖的社交媒体代理，绕过反 bot 检测。","ja":"Twitter への投稿の自動化を実現し、反ボット検出を回避するために実際の Chrome ブラウザを使用するソーシャルメディアエージェントに最適です。","ko":"트위터에 자동으로 게시하는 기능이 필요한 소셜 미디어 에이전트에게 적합하며, 실제 크롬 브라우저를 통해 반_bot 감지를 피합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de medios sociales que requieren capacidades de publicación automatizada en Twitter a través de un navegador Chrome real, evitando la detección anti-bot.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents des médias sociaux nécessitant des capacités de publication automatisée sur Twitter via un navigateur Chrome réel, contournant la détection anti-bot.","de":"Ideal für Social-Media-Agents, die automatisierte Postfunktionen auf Twitter über einen echten Chrome-Browser erfordern, um die Anti-Bot-Erkennung zu umgehen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Mídia Social que requerem capacidades de postagem automatizada para o Twitter via um navegador Chrome real, contornando a detecção anti-bot.","ru":"Идеально для социальных медиа-агентов, требующих автоматизированных возможностей публикации в Twitter через реальный браузер Chrome, обходя обнаружение анти-ботов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الوسائط الاجتماعية الذي يتطلب إمكانيات نشر آلي إلى تويتر من خلال متصفح كروم حقيقي، وتجاوز كشف البوتات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to post a variety of content including text, images, videos, and long-form articles to Twitter, leveraging a real Chrome browser to evade anti-bot measures, utilizing TypeScript scripts for execution.","zh":"赋予代理发布到 Twitter 的各种内容的能力，包括文本、图像、视频和长篇文章，利用真实的 Chrome 浏览器来规避反 bot 措施，使用 TypeScript 脚本执行。","ja":"テキスト、画像、動画、長文記事などの様々なコンテンツを Twitter に投稿する機能をエージェントに与え、実際の Chrome ブラウザを使用して反ボット対策を回避し、TypeScript スクリプトを使用して実行します。","ko":"에이전트가 텍스트, 이미지, 비디오, 장문 기사를 트위터에 게시할 수 있는 능력을 제공하며, 실제 크롬 브라우저를 사용하여 반_bot 대책을 피하고, TypeScript 스크립트를 사용하여 실행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para publicar una variedad de contenido, incluyendo texto, imágenes, videos y artículos de larga forma en Twitter, utilizando un navegador Chrome real para evadir las medidas anti-bot, utilizando scripts de TypeScript para la ejecución.","fr":"Permet aux agents de publier une variété de contenu, y compris du texte, des images, des vidéos et des articles de longue forme sur Twitter, en utilisant un navigateur Chrome réel pour contourner les mesures anti-bot, en utilisant des scripts TypeScript pour l''exécution.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, eine Vielzahl von Inhalten, einschließlich Text, Bildern, Videos und langen Artikeln auf Twitter zu posten, indem sie einen echten Chrome-Browser nutzen, um Anti-Bot-Maßnahmen zu umgehen, und TypeScript-Skripte für die Ausführung verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a publicar uma variedade de conteúdos, incluindo texto, imagens, vídeos e artigos de longa forma no Twitter, utilizando um navegador Chrome real para evitar medidas anti-bot, utilizando scripts TypeScript para execução.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью публиковать разнообразный контент, включая текст, изображения, видео и статьи большой длины в Twitter, используя реальный браузер Chrome для обхода анти-бот мер, используя скрипты TypeScript для выполнения.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على نشر مجموعة متنوعة من المحتوى، بما في ذلك النصوص والصور والفيديوهات والمقالات الطويلة في تويتر، باستخدام متصفح كروم حقيقي لتجاوز إجراءات مكافحة البوتات، باستخدام سكريبتات TypeScript للتنفيذ."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Twitter posts with multimedia content","Bypassing anti-bot detection for secure social media engagement","Publishing long-form articles directly to Twitter"],"zh":["使用多媒体内容自动化 Twitter 发帖","绕过反 bot 检测以实现安全的社交媒体互动","直接将长篇文章发布到 Twitter"],"ja":["マルチメディアコンテンツを使用した Twitter 投稿の自動化","反ボット検出を回避した安全なソーシャルメディアのやり取り","長文記事を直接 Twitter に投稿"],"ko":["멀티미디어 컨텐츠를 사용한 트위터 게시 자동화","반_bot 감지를 피한 보안 소셜 미디어 상호작용","장문 기사를 직접 트위터에 게시"],"es":["Automatizar publicaciones de Twitter con contenido multimedia","Evitar la detección anti-bot para un compromiso seguro con los medios sociales","Publicar artículos de larga forma directamente en Twitter"],"fr":["Automatiser les publications Twitter avec du contenu multimédia","Contourner la détection anti-bot pour un engagement sécurisé avec les médias sociaux","Publier des articles de longue forme directement sur Twitter"],"de":["Automatisierung von Twitter-Beiträgen mit Multimedia-Inhalten","Umgehung der Anti-Bot-Erkennung für sichere soziale Medien-Interaktion","Veröffentlichung von Langartikeln direkt auf Twitter"],"pt":["Automatizar postagens do Twitter com conteúdo multimídia","Contornar a detecção anti-bot para engajamento seguro em mídias sociais","Publicar artigos de longa forma diretamente no Twitter"],"ru":["Автоматизация публикаций в Twitter с мультимедийным контентом","Обход обнаружения анти-ботов для безопасного взаимодействия в социальных медиа","Публикация статей большой длины напрямую в Twitter"],"ar":["تأتمتة منشورات تويتر مع المحتوى المتعدد الوسائط","تجاوز كشف البوتات من أجل التفاعل الآمن في الوسائط الاجتماعية","نشر المقالات الطويلة مباشرة على تويتر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to Twitter","Dependent on Chrome browser functionality","Scripts must be located in the scripts/ subdirectory"],"zh":["需要访问 Twitter","依赖于 Chrome 浏览器的功能","脚本必须位于 scripts/ 子目录中"],"ja":["Twitter へのアクセスが必要","Chrome ブラウザの機能に依存","スクリプトは scripts/ サブディレクトリに配置する必要がある"],"ko":["트위터에 접근할 수 있어야 함","크롬 브라우저의 기능에 의존함","스크립트는 scripts/ 하위 디렉토리에 위치해야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a Twitter","Dependiente de la funcionalidad del navegador Chrome","Los scripts deben estar ubicados en el subdirectorio scripts/"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à Twitter","Dépend de la fonctionnalité du navigateur Chrome","Les scripts doivent être situés dans le sous-répertoire scripts/"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Twitter","Abhängig von der Funktionalität des Chrome-Browsers","Skripte müssen im Unterverzeichnis scripts/ liegen"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao Twitter","Dependente da funcionalidade do navegador Chrome","Os scripts devem estar localizados no subdiretório scripts/"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к Twitter","Зависит от функциональности браузера Chrome","Скрипты должны находиться в подкаталоге scripts/"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى تويتر","يعتمد على وظائف متصفح كروم","يجب أن تكون السكريبتات موجودة في thư mục فرعية scripts/"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('chengyihua/nanobot-ts/baoyu-xhs-images', 'community', 'chengyihua', 'nanobot-ts', 'chengyihua/nanobot-ts', 'baoyu-xhs-images', 0, 0, 80, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z', '2026-02-18T04:05:24.186Z', NULL, '{"id":"chengyihua/nanobot-ts/baoyu-xhs-images","name":"baoyu-xhs-images","description":{"zh":"baoyu-xhs-imagesTypeScript","ja":"baoyu-xhs-TypeScript","ko":"baoyu-xhs-TypeScript","es":"El marco de asistente personal AI baoyu-xhs-images genera infografías para Xiaohongshu","fr":"Le framework d''assistant personnel AI baoyu-xhs-images génère des infographies pour Xiaohongshu","de":"Das persönliche AI-Assistenten-Framework baoyu-xhs-images generiert Infografiken für Xiaohongshu","pt":"O baoyu-xhs-images é um framework de assistente pessoal AI leve e extensível, projetado para criar séries de infográficos para Xiaohongshu.","ru":"Baoyu-xhs-images - это超легкий и расширяемый фреймворк личного помощника AI, предназначенный для создания серий инфографики для Xiaohongshu.","ar":"baoyu-xhs-images هو إطار مساعد شخصي خفيف ومتجاوب، مصمم لإنشاء سلسلة من الرسومات المعلوماتية ل Xiaohongshu.","en":"An ultra-lightweight, extensible personal AI assistant framework built with TypeScript. Nanobot TS is designed to be your personal companion, capable of handling complex tasks through a robust agent loop, memory system, and tool integration."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"baoyu-xhs-images","ja":"baoyu-xhs-","ko":"baoyu-xhs-","es":"Generador de infografías Xiaohongshu","fr":"Générateur d''infographies Xiaohongshu","de":"Xiaohongshu-Infografik-Generator","pt":"Gerador de Séries de Infográficos Xiaohongshu","ru":"Генератор инфографики Xiaohongshu","ar":"مولد سلسلة المعلومات المصورة Xiaohongshu","en":"baoyu-xhs-images"},"description":{"zh":"baoyu-xhs-imagesTypeScript","ja":"baoyu-xhs-TypeScript","ko":"baoyu-xhs-TypeScript","es":"El marco de asistente personal AI baoyu-xhs-images genera infografías para Xiaohongshu","fr":"Le framework d''assistant personnel AI baoyu-xhs-images génère des infographies pour Xiaohongshu","de":"Das persönliche AI-Assistenten-Framework baoyu-xhs-images generiert Infografiken für Xiaohongshu","pt":"O baoyu-xhs-images é um framework de assistente pessoal AI leve e extensível, projetado para criar séries de infográficos para Xiaohongshu.","ru":"Baoyu-xhs-images - это超легкий и расширяемый фреймворк личного помощника AI, предназначенный для создания серий инфографики для Xiaohongshu.","ar":"baoyu-xhs-images هو إطار مساعد شخصي خفيف ومتجاوب، مصمم لإنشاء سلسلة من الرسومات المعلوماتية ل Xiaohongshu.","en":"An ultra-lightweight, extensible personal AI assistant framework built with TypeScript. Nanobot TS is designed to be your personal companion, capable of hand..."},"definition":{"en":"An ultra-lightweight, extensible personal AI assistant framework built with TypeScript. Nanobot TS is designed to be your personal companion, capable of handling complex tasks through a robust agent loop, memory system, and tool integration."},"features":{"zh":["TypeScript","Xiaohongshu","",""],"ja":["TypeScript","Xiaohongshu","",""],"ko":["TypeScript","Xiaohongshu","",""],"es":["Generación de infografías para Xiaohongshu","Múltiples opciones de estilo","Diseño personalizable","Compatibilidad con diferentes formatos de archivo","Integración con herramientas de AI"],"fr":["Génération d''infographies pour Xiaohongshu","Plusieurs options de style","Conception personalisable","Compatibilité avec différents formats de fichiers","Intégration avec des outils d''AI"],"de":["Generierung von Infografiken für Xiaohongshu","Mehrere Stiloptionen","Anpassbares Design","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Dateiformaten","Integration mit AI-Tools"],"pt":["Geração de infográficos em série para Xiaohongshu","Múltiplas opções de estilo e layout","Integração com ferramentas de criação de conteúdo","Compatibilidade com diferentes formatos de arquivo","Personalização de estilos e layouts"],"ru":["Генерация серий инфографики для Xiaohongshu","Несколько вариантов стиля и компоновки","Интеграция с инструментами создания контента","Совместимость с разными форматами файлов","Настройка стилей и компоновок"],"ar":["إنشاء سلسلة من الرسومات المعلوماتية ل Xiaohongshu","خيارات متعددة للنمط والتنسيق","التكامل مع أدوات إنشاء المحتوى","التوافق مع صيغ الملفات المختلفة","تخصيص الأنماط والتنسيقات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["baoyu-xhs-images","TypeScript","Xiaohongshu","",""],"ja":["baoyu-xhs-","TypeScript","Xiaohongshu","",""],"ko":["baoyu-xhs-","TypeScript","Xiaohongshu","",""],"es":["infografías Xiaohongshu","asistente personal AI","generador de infografías","herramientas de AI","diseño personalizable","formatos de archivo compatibles"],"fr":["infographies Xiaohongshu","assistant personnel AI","générateur d''infographies","outils d''AI","conception personalisable","formats de fichiers compatibles"],"de":["Xiaohongshu-Infografiken","persönlicher AI-Assistent","Infografik-Generator","AI-Tools","anpassbares Design","kompatible Dateiformate"],"pt":["baoyu-xhs-images","assistente pessoal AI","infográficos Xiaohongshu","gerador de infográficos","ferramentas de criação de conteúdo","desenvolvimento de software","TypeScript"],"ru":["baoyu-xhs-images","личный помощник AI","инфографика Xiaohongshu","генератор инфографики","инструменты создания контента","разработка программного обеспечения","TypeScript"],"ar":["baoyu-xhs-images","مساعد شخصي خفيف","رسومات معلومات Xiaohongshu","مولد رسومات معلومات","أدوات إنشاء المحتوى","تطوير البرمجيات","TypeScript"]}},"owner":"chengyihua","repo":"nanobot-ts","repoPath":"chengyihua/nanobot-ts","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-xhs-images","description":"Generates Xiaohongshu (Little Red Book) infographic series with 10 visual styles and 8 layouts. Breaks content into 1-10 cartoon-style images optimized for XHS engagement. Use when user mentions 小红书图片, XHS images, RedNote infographics, 小红书种草, or wants social media infographics for Chinese platforms.","bodyPreview":"# Xiaohongshu Infographic Series Generator\n\nBreak down complex content into eye-catching infographic series for Xiaohongshu with multiple style options.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n# Auto-select style and layout based on content\n/baoyu-xhs-images posts/ai-future/article.md\n\n# Specify style\n/baoyu-xhs-images posts/ai-future/article.md --style notion\n\n# Specify layout\n/baoyu-xhs-images posts/ai-future/article.md --layout dense\n\n# Combine style and layout\n/baoyu-xhs-images posts/ai-future/article.md --style","body":"# Xiaohongshu Infographic Series Generator\n\nBreak down complex content into eye-catching infographic series for Xiaohongshu with multiple style options.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n# Auto-select style and layout based on content\n/baoyu-xhs-images posts/ai-future/article.md\n\n# Specify style\n/baoyu-xhs-images posts/ai-future/article.md --style notion\n\n# Specify layout\n/baoyu-xhs-images posts/ai-future/article.md --layout dense\n\n# Combine style and layout\n/baoyu-xhs-images posts/ai-future/article.md --style notion --layout list\n\n# Direct content input\n/baoyu-xhs-images\n[paste content]\n\n# Direct input with options\n/baoyu-xhs-images --style bold --layout comparison\n[paste content]\n```\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--style <name>` | Visual style (see Style Gallery) |\n| `--layout <name>` | Information layout (see Layout Gallery) |\n\n## Two Dimensions\n\n| Dimension | Controls | Options |\n|-----------|----------|---------|\n| **Style** | Visual aesthetics: colors, lines, decorations | cute, fresh, warm, bold, minimal, retro, pop, notion, chalkboard, study-notes |\n| **Layout** | Information structure: density, arrangement | sparse, balanced, dense, list, comparison, flow, mindmap, quadrant |\n\nStyle × Layout can be freely combined. Example: `--style notion --layout dense` creates an intellectual-looking knowledge card with high information density.\n\n## Style Gallery\n\n| Style | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `cute` (Default) | Sweet, adorable, girly - classic Xiaohongshu aesthetic |\n| `fresh` | Clean, refreshing, natural |\n| `warm` | Cozy, friendly, approachable |\n| `bold` | High impact, attention-grabbing |\n| `minimal` | Ultra-clean, sophisticated |\n| `retro` | Vintage, nostalgic, trendy |\n| `pop` | Vibrant, energetic, eye-catching |\n| `notion` | Minimalist hand-drawn line art, intellectual |\n| `chalkboard` | Colorful chalk on black board, educational |\n| `study-notes` | Realistic handwritten photo style, blue pen + red annotations + yellow highlighter |\n\nDetailed style definitions: `references/presets/<style>.md`\n\n## Layout Gallery\n\n| Layout | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `sparse` (Default) | Minimal information, maximum impact (1-2 points) |\n| `balanced` | Standard content layout (3-4 points) |\n| `dense` | High information density, knowledge card style (5-8 points) |\n| `list` | Enumeration and ranking format (4-7 items) |\n| `comparison` | Side-by-side contrast layout |\n| `flow` | Process and timeline layout (3-6 steps) |\n| `mindmap` | Center radial mind map layout (4-8 branches) |\n| `quadrant` | Four-quadrant / circular section layout |\n\nDetailed layout definitions: `references/elements/canvas.md`\n\n## Auto Selection\n\n| Content Signals | Style | Layout |\n|-----------------|-------|--------|\n| Beauty, fashion, cute, girl, pink | `cute` | sparse/balanced |\n| Health, nature, clean, fresh, organic | `fresh` | balanced/flow |\n| Life, story, emotion, feeling, warm | `warm` | balanced |\n| Warning, important, must, critical | `bold` | list/comparison |\n| Professional, business, elegant, simple | `minimal` | sparse/balanced |\n| Classic, vintage, old, traditional | `retro` | balanced |\n| Fun, exciting, wow, amazing | `pop` | sparse/list |\n| Knowledge, concept, productivity, SaaS | `notion` | dense/list |\n| Education, tutorial, learning, teaching, classroom | `chalkboard` | balanced/dense |\n| Notes, handwritten, study guide, knowledge, realistic, photo | `study-notes` | dense/list/mindmap |\n\n## Outline Strategies\n\nThree differentiated outline strategies for different content goals:\n\n### Strategy A: Story-Driven (故事驱动型)\n\n| Aspect | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| **Concept** | Personal experience as main thread, emotional resonance first |\n| **Features** | Start from pain point, show before/after change, strong authenticity |\n| **Best for** | Reviews, personal shares, transformation stories |\n| **Structure** | Hook → Problem → Discovery → Experience → Conclusion |\n\n### Strategy B: Information-Dense (信息密集型)\n\n| Aspect | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| **Concept** | Value-first, efficient information delivery |\n| **Features** | Clear structure, explicit points, professional credibility |\n| **Best for** | Tutorials, comparisons, product reviews, checklists |\n| **Structure** | Core conclusion → Info card → Pros/Cons → Recommendation |\n\n### Strategy C: Visual-First (视觉优先型)\n\n| Aspect | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| **Concept** | Visual impact as core, minimal text |\n| **Features** | Large images, atmospheric, instant appeal |\n| **Best for** | High-aesthetic products, lifestyle, mood-based content |\n| **Structure** | Hero image → Detail shots → Lifestyle scene → CTA |\n\n## File Structure\n\nEach session creates an independent directory named by content slug:\n\n```\nxhs-images/{topic-slug}/\n├── source-{slug}.{ext}             # Source files (text, images, etc.)\n├── analysis.md                     # Deep analysis + questions asked\n├── outline-strategy-a.md           # Strategy A: Story-driven\n├── outline-strategy-b.md           # Strategy B: Information-dense\n├── outline-strategy-c.md           # Strategy C: Visual-first\n├── outline.md                      # Final selected/merged outline\n├── prompts/\n│   ├── 01-cover-[slug].md\n│   ├── 02-content-[slug].md\n│   └── ...\n├── 01-cover-[slug].png\n├── 02-content-[slug].png\n└── NN-ending-[slug].png\n```\n\n**Slug Generation**:\n1. Extract main topic from content (2-4 words, kebab-case)\n2. Example: \"AI工具推荐\" → `ai-tools-recommend`\n\n**Conflict Resolution**:\nIf `xhs-images/{topic-slug}/` already exists:\n- Append timestamp: `{topic-slug}-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS`\n- Example: `ai-tools` exists → `ai-tools-20260118-143052`\n\n**Source Files**:\nCopy all sources with naming `source-{slug}.{ext}`:\n- `source-article.md`, `source-photo.jpg`, etc.\n- Multiple sources supported: text, images, files from conversation\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Progress Checklist\n\nCopy and track progress:\n\n```\nXHS Infographic Progress:\n- [ ] Step 0: Check preferences (EXTEND.md) ⛔ BLOCKING\n  - [ ] Found → load preferences → continue\n  - [ ] Not found → run first-time setup → MUST complete before Step 1\n- [ ] Step 1: Analyze content → analysis.md\n- [ ] Step 2: Confirmation 1 - Content understanding ⚠️ REQUIRED\n- [ ] Step 3: Generate 3 outline + style variants\n- [ ] Step 4: Confirmation 2 - Outline & style & elements selection ⚠️ REQUIRED\n- [ ] Step 5: Generate images (sequential)\n- [ ] Step 6: Completion report\n```\n\n### Flow\n\n```\nInput → [Step 0: Preferences] ─┬─ Found → Continue\n                               │\n                               └─ Not found → First-Time Setup ⛔ BLOCKING\n                                              │\n                                              └─ Complete setup → Save EXTEND.md → Continue\n                                                                                      │\n        ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n        ↓\nAnalyze → [Confirm 1] → 3 Outlines → [Confirm 2: Outline + Style + Elements] → Generate → Complete\n```\n\n### Step 0: Load Preferences (EXTEND.md) ⛔ BLOCKING\n\n**Purpose**: Load user preferences or run first-time setup.\n\n**CRITICAL**: If EXTEND.md not found, MUST complete first-time setup before ANY other questions or steps. Do NOT proceed to content analysis, do NOT ask about style, do NOT ask about layout — ONLY complete the preferences setup first.\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-xhs-images/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-xhs-images/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                        Path                        │     Location      │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-xhs-images/EXTEND.md           │ Project directory │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-xhs-images/EXTEND.md     │ User home         │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                              Action                                              │\n├───────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, display summary → Continue to Step 1                                                 │\n├───────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ ⛔ BLOCKING: Run first-time setup ONLY (see below) → Complete and save EXTEND.md → Then Step 1    │\n└───────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**First-Time Setup** (when EXTEND.md not found):\n\n**Language**: Use user''s input language or saved language preference.\n\nUse AskUserQuestion with ALL questions in ONE call. See `references/config/first-time-setup.md` for question details.\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Watermark | Preferred style/layout | Custom style definitions | Language preference\n\nSchema: `references/config/preferences-schema.md`\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Content → `analysis.md`\n\nRead source content, save it if needed, and perform deep analysis.\n\n**Actions**:\n1. **Save source content** (if not already a file):\n   - If user provides a file path: use as-is\n   - If user pastes content: save to `source.md` in target directory\n   - **Backup rule**: If `source.md` exists, rename to `source-backup-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.md`\n2. Read source content\n3. **Deep analysis** following `references/workflows/analysis-framework.md`:\n   - Content type classification (种草/干货/测评/教程/避坑...)\n   - Hook analysis (爆款标题潜力)\n   - Target audience identification\n   - Engagement potential (收藏/分享/评论)\n   - Visual opportunity mapping\n   - Swipe flow design\n4. Detect source language\n5. Determine recommended image count (2-10)\n6. **Generate clarifying questions** (see Step 2)\n7. **Save to `analysis.md`**\n\n### Step 2: Confirmation 1 - Content Understanding ⚠️\n\n**Purpose**: Validate understanding + collect missing info. **Do NOT skip.**\n\n**Display summary**:\n- Content type + topic identified\n- Key points extracted\n- Tone detected\n- Source images count\n\n**Use AskUserQuestion** for:\n1. Core selling point (multiSelect: true)\n2. Target audience\n3. Style preference: Authentic sharing / Professional review / Aesthetic mood / Auto\n4. Additional context (optional)\n\n**After response**: Update `analysis.md` → Step 3\n\n### Step 3: Generate 3 Outline + Style Variants\n\nBased on analysis + user context, create three distinct strategy variants. Each variant includes both **outline structure** and **visual style recommendation**.\n\n**For each strategy**:\n\n| Strategy | Filename | Outline | Recommended Style |\n|----------|----------|---------|-------------------|\n| A | `outline-strategy-a.md` | Story-driven: emotional, before/after | warm, cute, fresh |\n| B | `outline-strategy-b.md` | Information-dense: structured, factual | notion, minimal, chalkboard |\n| C | `outline-strategy-c.md` | Visual-first: atmospheric, minimal text | bold, pop, retro |\n\n**Outline format** (YAML front matter + content):\n```yaml\n---\nstrategy: a  # a, b, or c\nname: Story-Driven\nstyle: warm  # recommended style for this strategy\nstyle_reason: \"Warm tones enhance emotional storytelling and personal connection\"\nelements:  # from style preset, can be customized in Step 4\n  background: solid-pastel\n  decorations: [clouds, stars-sparkles]\n  emphasis: star-burst\n  typography: highlight\nlayout: balanced  # primary layout\nimage_count: 5\n---\n\n## P1 Cover\n**Type**: cover\n**Hook**: \"入冬后脸不干了🥹终于找到对的面霜\"\n**Visual**: Product hero shot with cozy winter atmosphere\n**Layout**: sparse\n\n## P2 Problem\n**Type**: pain-point\n**Message**: Previous struggles with dry skin\n**Visual**: Before state, relatable scenario\n**Layout**: balanced\n\n...\n```\n\n**Differentiation requirements**:\n- Each strategy MUST have different outline structure AND different recommended style\n- Adapt page count: A typically 4-6, B typically 3-5, C typically 3-4\n- Include `style_reason` explaining why this style fits the strategy\n- Consider user''s style preference from Step 2\n\nReference: `references/workflows/outline-template.md`\n\n### Step 4: Confirmation 2 - Outline & Style & Elements Selection ⚠️\n\n**Purpose**: User chooses outline strategy, confirms visual style, and customizes elements. **Do NOT skip.**\n\n**Display each strategy**:\n- Strategy name + page count + recommended style\n- Page-by-page summary (P1 → P2 → P3...)\n\n**Use AskUserQuestion** with three questions:\n\n**Question 1: Outline Strategy**\n- Strategy A (Recommended if \"authentic sharing\")\n- Strategy B (Recommended if \"professional review\")\n- Strategy C (Recommended if \"aesthetic mood\")\n- Combine: specify pages from each\n\n**Question 2: Visual Style**\n- Use strategy''s recommended style (show which style)\n- Or select from: cute / fresh / warm / bold / minimal / retro / pop / notion / chalkboard\n- Or type custom style description\n\n**Question 3: Visual Elements** (show after style selection)\nDisplay the selected style''s default elements from preset, then ask:\n- Use style defaults (Recommended) - show preview: background, decorations, emphasis\n- Adjust background - options: solid-pastel / solid-saturated / gradient-linear / gradient-radial / paper-texture / grid\n- Adjust decorations - options: hearts / stars-sparkles / flowers / clouds / leaves / confetti\n- Type custom element preferences\n\n**After response**:\n- Single strategy → copy to `outline.md` with confirmed style\n- Combination → merge specified pages with confirmed style\n- Custom request → regenerate based on feedback\n- Style defaults → use preset''s Element Combination as-is\n- Background adjustment → update elements.background with user choice\n- Decorations adjustment → update elements.decorations with user choice\n- Custom elements → parse user''s preferences into elements fields\n- Update `outline.md` frontmatter with final style and elements\n\n### Step 5: Generate Images\n\nWith confirmed outline + style + layout:\n\n**For each image (cover + content + ending)**:\n1. Save prompt to `prompts/NN-{type}-[slug].md` (in user''s preferred language)\n   - **Backup rule**: If prompt file exists, rename to `prompts/NN-{type}-[slug]-backup-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.md`\n2. Generate image using confirmed style and layout\n   - **Backup rule**: If image file exists, rename to `NN-{type}-[slug]-backup-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.png`\n3. Report progress after each generation\n\n**Watermark Application** (if enabled in preferences):\nAdd to each image generation prompt:\n```\nInclude a subtle watermark \"[content]\" positioned at [position].\nThe watermark should be legible but not distracting from the main content.\n```\nReference: `references/config/watermark-guide.md`\n\n**Image Generation Skill Selection**:\n- Check available image generation skills\n- If multiple skills available, ask user preference\n\n**Session Management**:\nIf image generation skill supports `--sessionId`:\n1. Generate unique session ID: `xhs-{topic-slug}-{timestamp}`\n2. Use same session ID for all images\n3. Ensures visual consistency across generated images\n\n### Step 6: Completion Report\n\n```\nXiaohongshu Infographic Series Complete!\n\nTopic: [topic]\nStrategy: [A/B/C/Combined]\nStyle: [style name]\nLayout: [layout name or \"varies\"]\nLocation: [directory path]\nImages: N total\n\n✓ analysis.md\n✓ outline-strategy-a.md\n✓ outline-strategy-b.md\n✓ outline-strategy-c.md\n✓ outline.md (selected: [strategy])\n\nFiles:\n- 01-cover-[slug].png ✓ Cover (sparse)\n- 02-content-[slug].png ✓ Content (balanced)\n- 03-content-[slug].png ✓ Content (dense)\n- 04-ending-[slug].png ✓ Ending (sparse)\n```\n\n## Image Modification\n\n| Action | Steps |\n|--------|-------|\n| **Edit** | **Update prompt file FIRST** → Regenerate with same session ID |\n| **Add** | Specify position → Create prompt → Generate → Renumber subsequent files (NN+1) → Update outline |\n| **Delete** | Remove files → Renumber subsequent (NN-1) → Update outline |\n\n**IMPORTANT**: When updating images, ALWAYS update the prompt file (`prompts/NN-{type}-[slug].md`) FIRST before regenerating. This ensures changes are documented and reproducible.\n\n## Content Breakdown Principles\n\n1. **Cover (Image 1)**: Hook + visual impact → `sparse` layout\n2. **Content (Middle)**: Core value per image → `balanced`/`dense`/`list`/`comparison`/`flow`\n3. **Ending (Last)**: CTA / summary → `sparse` or `balanced`\n\n**Style × Layout Matrix** (✓✓ = highly recommended, ✓ = works well):\n\n| | sparse | balanced | dense | list | comparison | flow | mindmap | quadrant |\n|---|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n| cute | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| fresh | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| warm | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| bold | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓✓ |\n| minimal | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| retro | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| pop | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |\n| notion | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ |\n| chalkboard | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ |\n| study-notes | ✗ | ✓ | ✓✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ | ✓ | ✓✓ | ✓ |\n\n## References\n\nDetailed templates in `references/` directory:\n\n**Elements** (Visual building blocks):\n- `elements/canvas.md` - Aspect ratios, safe zones, grid layouts\n- `elements/image-effects.md` - Cutout, stroke, filters\n- `elements/typography.md` - Decorated text (花字), tags, text direction\n- `elements/decorations.md` - Emphasis marks, backgrounds, doodles, frames\n\n**Presets** (Style presets):\n- `presets/<name>.md` - Element combination definitions (cute, notion, warm...)\n\n**Workflows** (Process guides):\n- `workflows/analysis-framework.md` - Content analysis framework\n- `workflows/outline-template.md` - Outline template with layout guide\n- `workflows/prompt-assembly.md` - Prompt assembly guide\n\n**Config** (Settings):\n- `config/preferences-schema.md` - EXTEND.md schema\n- `config/first-time-setup.md` - First-time setup flow\n- `config/watermark-guide.md` - Watermark configuration\n\n## Notes\n\n- Auto-retry once on failure | Cartoon alternatives for sensitive figures\n- Use confirmed language preference | Maintain style consistency\n- **Two confirmation points required** (Steps 2 & 4) - do not skip\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Step 0** for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:05:24.186Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Visual Content Agents needing advanced infographic generation capabilities for Xiaohongshu","zh":"非常适合需要为 Xiaohongshu 提供高级信息图表生成功能的视觉内容代理","ja":"Xiaohongshu 向けの高度なインフォグラフィック生成機能を必要とするビジュアルコンテンツエージェントに最適","ko":"샤오홍수에게 고급 정보 그래픽 생성 기능을 제공해야 하는 시각적 콘텐츠 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de contenido visual que necesitan capacidades de generación de infografías avanzadas para Xiaohongshu","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de contenu visuel nécessitant des capacités de génération d''infographies avancées pour Xiaohongshu","de":"Perfekt für visuelle Inhaltsagenten, die erweiterte Infografik-Generierungsfunktionen für Xiaohongshu benötigen","pt":"Perfeita para Agentes de Conteúdo Visual que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de geração de infográficos para Xiaohongshu","ru":"Идеальна для Визуальных Контент-агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности генерации инфографики для Xiaohongshu","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء المحتوى المرئي الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة لإنشاء رسومات توضيحية لموقع Xiaohongshu"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate eye-catching infographic series using TypeScript, with multiple style options such as Notion, and layouts like dense, leveraging markdown files like article.md","zh":"使代理能够使用 TypeScript 生成吸引眼球的信息图表系列，具有多种样式选项，例如 Notion，并且具有密集等布局，利用 article.md 等 markdown 文件","ja":"TypeScript を使用して、Notion など複数のスタイルオプションと、dense などのレイアウトを利用して、article.md などの Markdown ファイルを使用して目立つインフォグラフィックシリーズを生成できるようにエージェントをEmpowerする","ko":"에이전트가 타입스크립트를 사용하여 노션 등 여러 스타일 옵션과 밀도 등 레이아웃을 활용하여 article.md 등 마크다운 파일을 사용하여 눈에 띄는 정보 그래픽 시리즈를 생성할 수 있도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar series de infografías llamativas usando TypeScript, con múltiples opciones de estilo como Notion y diseños como denso, aprovechando archivos markdown como article.md","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des séries d''infographies accrocheuses en utilisant TypeScript, avec plusieurs options de style telles que Notion et des dispositions comme dense, en exploitant des fichiers markdown comme article.md","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, auffällige Infografik-Serien mit TypeScript zu generieren, mit mehreren Stiloptionen wie Notion und Layouts wie dicht, unter Nutzung von Markdown-Dateien wie article.md","pt":"Habilita agentes a gerar séries de infográficos atraentes usando TypeScript, com múltiplas opções de estilo, como Notion, e layouts como densos, aproveitando arquivos markdown como article.md","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать привлекательные серии инфографики, используя TypeScript, с несколькими вариантами стилей, такими как Notion, и макетами, такими как плотные, используя файлы markdown, такие как article.md","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء سلسلة من الرسومات التوضيحية الجذابة باستخدام TypeScript، مع عدة خيارات للأسلوب مثل Notion، والتنسيقات مثل الكثيفة، واستغلال ملفات markdown مثل article.md"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating infographic series creation for Xiaohongshu posts","Generating visual content with customizable styles and layouts","Breaking down complex content into engaging infographic series"],"zh":["自动化 Xiaohongshu 文章的信息图表系列创建","生成可自定义样式和布局的视觉内容","将复杂内容分解为吸引人的信息图表系列"],"ja":["Xiaohongshu の投稿のインフォグラフィックシリーズの作成を自動化する","スタイルとレイアウトをカスタマイズできるビジュアルコンテンツを生成する","複雑なコンテンツを魅力的であるインフォグラフィックシリーズに分解する"],"ko":["샤오홍수 게시물의 정보 그래픽 시리즈 생성 자동화","스타일과 레이아웃을 사용자 정의할 수 있는 시각적 콘텐츠 생성","복잡한 콘텐츠를 매력적인 정보 그래픽 시리즈로 분해"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de series de infografías para publicaciones de Xiaohongshu","Generar contenido visual con estilos y diseños personalizables","Desglosar contenido complejo en series de infografías atractivas"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de séries d''infographies pour les publications Xiaohongshu","Générer du contenu visuel avec des styles et des dispositions personnalisables","Décomposer du contenu complexe en séries d''infographies engageantes"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung von Infografik-Serien für Xiaohongshu-Beiträge","Generieren von visuellem Inhalt mit anpassbaren Stilen und Layouts","Aufteilen von komplexem Inhalt in ansprechende Infografik-Serien"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de séries de infográficos para posts do Xiaohongshu","Gerar conteúdo visual com estilos e layouts personalizáveis","Dividir conteúdo complexo em séries de infográficos atraentes"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание серий инфографики для постов Xiaohongshu","Генерировать визуальный контент с настраиваемыми стилями и макетами","Разбивать сложный контент на привлекательные серии инфографики"],"ar":["أتمتة إنشاء سلسلة من الرسومات التوضيحية لمشاركات Xiaohongshu","إنشاء محتوى مرئي مع أساليب وتنسيقات قابلة للتخصيص","تقسيم المحتوى المعقد إلى سلسلة من الرسومات التوضيحية الجذابة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires markdown files as input","Limited to Xiaohongshu platform","Dependent on TypeScript and specific style and layout options"],"zh":["需要 markdown 文件作为输入","仅限 Xiaohongshu 平台","依赖于 TypeScript 和特定的样式和布局选项"],"ja":["入力として Markdown ファイルが必要","Xiaohongshu プラットフォームのみ","TypeScript と特定のスタイルとレイアウトオプションに依存"],"ko":["입력으로 마크다운 파일이 필요","샤오홍수 플랫폼만 해당","타입스크립트와 특정 스타일 및 레이아웃 옵션에 의존"],"es":["Requiere archivos markdown como entrada","Limitado a la plataforma Xiaohongshu","Dependiente de TypeScript y de opciones de estilo y diseño específicas"],"fr":["Nécessite des fichiers markdown comme entrée","Limité à la plateforme Xiaohongshu","Dépendant de TypeScript et d''options de style et de disposition spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Markdown-Dateien als Eingabe","Begrenzt auf die Xiaohongshu-Plattform","Abhängig von TypeScript und spezifischen Stil- und Layout-Optionen"],"pt":["Requer arquivos markdown como entrada","Limitado à plataforma Xiaohongshu","Dependente de TypeScript e opções de estilo e layout específicas"],"ru":["Требует файлов markdown в качестве входных данных","Ограничен платформой Xiaohongshu","Зависит от TypeScript и конкретных вариантов стиля и макета"],"ar":["يتطلب ملفات markdown كمدخلات","محدود منصة Xiaohongshu","يعتمد على TypeScript وخيارات الأسلوب والتنسيق المحددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
