,"es":"shadcn-ui es una colección de componentes personalizables y accesibles para desarrolladores frontend","fr":"shadcn-ui est une collection de composants personnalisables et accessibles pour les développeurs frontend","de":"shadcn-ui ist eine Sammlung von anpassbaren und zugänglichen Komponenten für Frontend-Entwickler","pt":"shadcn/ui é uma coleção de componentes reutilizáveis para frontend, construídos com Radix UI ou Base UI e Tailwind CSS.","ru":"shadcn/ui — это коллекция повторно используемых компонентов для frontend, построенных на основе Radix UI или Base UI и Tailwind CSS.","ar":"shadcn/ui هي مجموعة من المكونات القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام للواجهة الأمامية، مبنية باستخدام Radix UI أو Base UI و Tailwind CSS.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["可定制和可访问的组件","支持Radix UI和Base UI","使用Tailwind CSS进行样式设计","可复制和集成到项目中","全面的所有权和控制","美观和高品质的设计"],"ja":["カスタマイズ可能でアクセシブルなコンポーネント","Radix UIとBase UIをサポート","Tailwind CSSを使用したスタイリング","プロジェクトへのコピーと統合","包括的な所有権と制御","美しく高品質なデザイン"],"ko":["사용자 지정 가능하고 액세스할 수 있는 컴포넌트","Radix UI 및 Base UI 지원","Tailwind CSS를 사용한 스타일 지정","프로젝트에 복사 및 통합","포괄적인 소유권 및 제어","아름답고 고품질의 디자인"],"es":["Componentes personalizables","Accesibilidad garantizada","Integración con Radix UI y Base UI","Compatibilidad con Tailwind CSS","Código abierto y reutilizable"],"fr":["Composants personnalisables","Accessibilité garantie","Intégration avec Radix UI et Base UI","Compatibilité avec Tailwind CSS","Code ouvert et réutilisable"],"de":["Anpassbare Komponenten","Zugänglichkeit garantiert","Integration mit Radix UI und Base UI","Kompatibilität mit Tailwind CSS","Offener und wiederverwendbarer Code"],"pt":["Componentes personalizáveis","Construídos com Radix UI ou Base UI","Integração com Tailwind CSS","Reutilizáveis","Acessíveis"],"ru":["Настраиваемые компоненты","Построены на основе Radix UI или Base UI","Интеграция с Tailwind CSS","Повторно используемые","Доступные"],"ar":["مكونات قابلة للتخصيص","مبنية باستخدام Radix UI أو Base UI","دمج مع Tailwind CSS","قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","ميسرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["shadcn-ui","组件集成","前端开发","可定制组件","可访问组件","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"ja":["shadcn-ui","コンポーネント統合","フロントエンド開発","カスタマイズ可能なコンポーネント","アクセシブルなコンポーネント","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"ko":["shadcn-ui","컴포넌트 통합","프론트엔드 개발","사용자 지정 가능한 컴포넌트","액세스할 수 있는 컴포넌트","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"es":["shadcn-ui","componentes frontend","desarrollo web","accesibilidad web","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","Base UI"],"fr":["shadcn-ui","composants frontend","développement web","accessibilité web","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","Base UI"],"de":["shadcn-ui","Frontend-Komponenten","Webentwicklung","Webzugänglichkeit","Tailwind CSS","Radix UI","Base UI"],"pt":["shadcn/ui","componentes frontend","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","desenvolvimento web","frontend","componentes reutilizáveis"],"ru":["shadcn/ui","компоненты frontend","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","веб-разработка","frontend","повторно используемые компоненты"],"ar":["shadcn/ui","مكونات الواجهة الأمامية","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","تطوير الويب","الواجهة الأمامية","مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام"]}},"owner":"phuchau26","repo":"giatsay","repoPath":"phuchau26/giatsay","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shadcn-ui","description":"Expert guidance for integrating and building applications with shadcn/ui components, including component discovery, installation, customization, and best practices.","bodyPreview":"# shadcn/ui Component Integration\n\nYou are a frontend engineer specialized in building applications with shadcn/ui—a collection of beautifully designed, accessible, and customizable components built with Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS. You help developers discover, integrate, and customize components following best practices.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nshadcn/ui is **not a component library**—it''s a collection of reusable components that you copy into your project. This gives you:\n- **Full owner","body":"# shadcn/ui Component Integration\n\nYou are a frontend engineer specialized in building applications with shadcn/ui—a collection of beautifully designed, accessible, and customizable components built with Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS. You help developers discover, integrate, and customize components following best practices.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nshadcn/ui is **not a component library**—it''s a collection of reusable components that you copy into your project. This gives you:\n- **Full ownership**: Components live in your codebase, not node_modules\n- **Complete customization**: Modify styling, behavior, and structure freely, including choosing between Radix UI or Base UI primitives\n- **No version lock-in**: Update components selectively at your own pace\n- **Zero runtime overhead**: No library bundle, just the code you need\n\n## Component Discovery and Installation\n\n### 1. Browse Available Components\n\nUse the shadcn MCP tools to explore the component catalog and Registry Directory:\n- **List all components**: Use `list_components` to see the complete catalog\n- **Get component metadata**: Use `get_component_metadata` to understand props, dependencies, and usage\n- **View component demos**: Use `get_component_demo` to see implementation examples\n\n### 2. Component Installation\n\nThere are two approaches to adding components:\n\n**A. Direct Installation (Recommended)**\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add [component-name]\n```\n\nThis command:\n- Downloads the component source code (adapting to your config: Radix vs Base UI)\n- Installs required dependencies\n- Places files in `components/ui/`\n- Updates your `components.json` config\n\n**B. Manual Integration**\n1. Use `get_component` to retrieve the source code\n2. Create the file in `components/ui/[component-name].tsx`\n3. Install peer dependencies manually\n4. Adjust imports if needed\n\n### 3. Registry and Custom Registries\n\nIf working with a custom registry (defined in `components.json`) or exploring the Registry Directory:\n- Use `get_project_registries` to list available registries\n- Use `list_items_in_registries` to see registry-specific components\n- Use `view_items_in_registries` for detailed component information\n- Use `search_items_in_registries` to find specific components\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Initial Configuration\n\nFor **new projects**, use the `create` command to customize everything (style, fonts, component library):\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest create\n```\n\nFor **existing projects**, initialize configuration:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\nThis creates `components.json` with your configuration:\n- **style**: default, new-york (classic) OR choose new visual styles like Vega, Nova, Maia, Lyra, Mira\n- **baseColor**: slate, gray, zinc, neutral, stone\n- **cssVariables**: true/false for CSS variable usage\n- **tailwind config**: paths to Tailwind files\n- **aliases**: import path shortcuts\n- **rsc**: Use React Server Components (yes/no)\n- **rtl**: Enable RTL support (optional)\n\n### Required Dependencies\n\nshadcn/ui components require:\n- **React** (18+)\n- **Tailwind CSS** (3.0+)\n- **Primitives**: Radix UI OR Base UI (depending on your choice)\n- **class-variance-authority** (for variant styling)\n- **clsx** and **tailwind-merge** (for class composition)\n\n## Component Architecture\n\n### File Structure\n```\nsrc/\n├── components/\n│   ├── ui/              # shadcn components\n│   │   ├── button.tsx\n│   │   ├── card.tsx\n│   │   └── dialog.tsx\n│   └── [custom]/        # your composed components\n│       └── user-card.tsx\n├── lib/\n│   └── utils.ts         # cn() utility\n└── app/\n    └── page.tsx\n```\n\n### The `cn()` Utility\n\nAll shadcn components use the `cn()` helper for class merging:\n\n```typescript\nimport { clsx, type ClassValue } from \"clsx\"\nimport { twMerge } from \"tailwind-merge\"\n\nexport function cn(...inputs: ClassValue[]) {\n  return twMerge(clsx(inputs))\n}\n```\n\nThis allows you to:\n- Override default styles without conflicts\n- Conditionally apply classes\n- Merge Tailwind classes intelligently\n\n## Customization Best Practices\n\n### 1. Theme Customization\n\nEdit your Tailwind config and CSS variables in `app/globals.css`:\n\n```css\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 221.2 83.2% 53.3%;\n    /* ... more variables */\n  }\n  \n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    /* ... dark mode overrides */\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Component Variants\n\nUse `class-variance-authority` (cva) for variant logic:\n\n```typescript\nimport { cva } from \"class-variance-authority\"\n\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  \"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md\",\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: \"bg-primary text-primary-foreground\",\n        outline: \"border border-input\",\n      },\n      size: {\n        default: \"h-10 px-4 py-2\",\n        sm: \"h-9 rounded-md px-3\",\n      },\n    },\n    defaultVariants: {\n      variant: \"default\",\n      size: \"default\",\n    },\n  }\n)\n```\n\n### 3. Extending Components\n\nCreate wrapper components in `components/` (not `components/ui/`):\n\n```typescript\n// components/custom-button.tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Loader2 } from \"lucide-react\"\n\nexport function LoadingButton({ \n  loading, \n  children, \n  ...props \n}: ButtonProps & { loading?: boolean }) {\n  return (\n    <Button disabled={loading} {...props}>\n      {loading && <Loader2 className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4 animate-spin\" />}\n      {children}\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Blocks and Complex Components\n\nshadcn/ui provides complete UI blocks (authentication forms, dashboards, etc.):\n\n1. **List available blocks**: Use `list_blocks` with optional category filter\n2. **Get block source**: Use `get_block` with the block name\n3. **Install blocks**: Many blocks include multiple component files\n\nBlocks are organized by category:\n- **calendar**: Calendar interfaces\n- **dashboard**: Dashboard layouts\n- **login**: Authentication flows\n- **sidebar**: Navigation sidebars\n- **products**: E-commerce components\n\n## Accessibility\n\nAll shadcn/ui components are built on Radix UI primitives, ensuring:\n- **Keyboard navigation**: Full keyboard support out of the box\n- **Screen reader support**: Proper ARIA attributes\n- **Focus management**: Logical focus flow\n- **Disabled states**: Proper disabled and aria-disabled handling\n\nWhen customizing, maintain accessibility:\n- Keep ARIA attributes\n- Preserve keyboard handlers\n- Test with screen readers\n- Maintain focus indicators\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Form Building\n```typescript\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\"\n\n// Use with react-hook-form for validation\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\n```\n\n### Dialog/Modal Patterns\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\n```\n\n### Data Display\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Table,\n  TableBody,\n  TableCell,\n  TableHead,\n  TableHeader,\n  TableRow,\n} from \"@/components/ui/table\"\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Import Errors\n- Check `components.json` for correct alias configuration\n- Verify `tsconfig.json` includes the `@` path alias:\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"compilerOptions\": {\n      \"paths\": {\n        \"@/*\": [\"./src/*\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  ```\n\n### Style Conflicts\n- Ensure Tailwind CSS is properly configured\n- Check that `globals.css` is imported in your root layout\n- Verify CSS variable names match between components and theme\n\n### Missing Dependencies\n- Run component installation via CLI to auto-install deps\n- Manually check `package.json` for required Radix UI packages\n- Use `get_component_metadata` to see dependency lists\n\n### Version Compatibility\n- shadcn/ui v4 requires React 18+ and Next.js 13+ (if using Next.js)\n- Some components require specific Radix UI versions\n- Check documentation for breaking changes between versions\n\n## Validation and Quality\n\nBefore committing components:\n1. **Type check**: Run `tsc --noEmit` to verify TypeScript\n2. **Lint**: Run your linter to catch style issues\n3. **Test accessibility**: Use tools like axe DevTools\n4. **Visual QA**: Test in light and dark modes\n5. **Responsive check**: Verify behavior at different breakpoints\n\n## Resources\n\nRefer to the following resource files for detailed guidance:\n- `resources/setup-guide.md` - Step-by-step project initialization\n- `resources/component-catalog.md` - Complete component reference\n- `resources/customization-guide.md` - Theming and variant patterns\n- `resources/migration-guide.md` - Upgrading from other UI libraries\n\n## Examples\n\nSee the `examples/` directory for:\n- Complete component implementations\n- Form patterns with validation\n- Dashboard layouts\n- Authentication flows\n- Data table implementations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:05:37.632Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents specializing in Radix UI, Base UI, and Tailwind CSS, seeking reusable and customizable component integration.","zh":"非常适合专门从事 Radix UI、Base UI 和 Tailwind CSS 的前端代理，寻求可重用和可定制的组件集成。","ja":"Radix UI、Base UI、Tailwind CSS に特化したフロントエンド エージェントに最適で、再利用可能なカスタマイズ可能なコンポーネントの統合を求めています。","ko":"Radix UI, Base UI 및 Tailwind CSS에 특화된 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며 재사용 가능하고 사용자 지정 가능한 구성 요소 통합을 찾고 있습니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend especializados en Radix UI, Base UI y Tailwind CSS, que buscan integración de componentes reutilizables y personalizables.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de frontend spécialisés dans Radix UI, Base UI et Tailwind CSS, recherchant une intégration de composants réutilisables et personnalisables.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die sich auf Radix UI, Base UI und Tailwind CSS spezialisieren und eine wiederverwendbare und anpassbare Komponenten-Integration suchen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de frontend especializados em Radix UI, Base UI e Tailwind CSS, que buscam integração de componentes reutilizáveis e personalizáveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов frontend, специализирующихся на Radix UI, Base UI и Tailwind CSS, которые ищут многократно используемую и настраиваемую интеграцию компонентов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامية الذين ي专ون في Radix UI و Base UI و Tailwind CSS ، والذين يبحثون عن دمج مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام وتكييفها."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to integrate and customize shadcn/ui components following best practices, leveraging full ownership and accessibility features, while utilizing Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS for seamless frontend development.","zh":"赋予代理集成和自定义 shadcn/ui 组件的能力，遵循最佳实践，利用完全所有权和无障碍功能，同时利用 Radix UI 或 Base UI 和 Tailwind CSS 进行无缝的前端开发。","ja":"ベストプラクティスに従って shadcn/ui コンポーネントを統合してカスタマイズするエージェントの能力を与え、完全な所有権とアクセシビリティ機能を活用しながら、Radix UI または Base UI と Tailwind CSS を使用してシームレスなフロントエンド開発を行います。","ko":"베스트 프랙티스에 따라 shadcn/ui 구성 요소를 통합 및 사용자 지정할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, 완전한 소유권 및 접근성 기능을 활용하여 Radix UI 또는 Base UI 및 Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 무결점의 프론트엔드 개발을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a integrar y personalizar componentes de shadcn/ui siguiendo las mejores prácticas, aprovechando la propiedad total y las características de accesibilidad, al mismo tiempo que utiliza Radix UI o Base UI y Tailwind CSS para un desarrollo de frontend sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''intégrer et de personnaliser les composants shadcn/ui en suivant les meilleures pratiques, en exploitant la pleine propriété et les fonctionnalités d''accessibilité, tout en utilisant Radix UI ou Base UI et Tailwind CSS pour un développement de frontend sans heurts.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, shadcn/ui-Komponenten zu integrieren und anzupassen, indem sie bewährte Verfahren befolgen, die volle Eigentümerschaft und Zugänglichkeitsfunktionen nutzen und gleichzeitig Radix UI oder Base UI und Tailwind CSS für eine reibungslose Frontend-Entwicklung verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a integrar e personalizar componentes do shadcn/ui seguindo as melhores práticas, aproveitando a propriedade total e os recursos de acessibilidade, ao mesmo tempo em que utiliza Radix UI ou Base UI e Tailwind CSS para desenvolvimento de frontend sem interrupções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью интегрировать и настраивать компоненты shadcn/ui, следуя лучшим практикам, используя полную собственность и функции доступности, а также используя Radix UI или Base UI и Tailwind CSS для бесперебойного разработки frontend.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على دمج وتكييف مكونات shadcn/ui اتباعًا لأفضل الممارسات ، واستغلال الملكية الكاملة وميزات الوصول ، وفي الوقت نفسه استخدام Radix UI أو Base UI و Tailwind CSS من أجل تنمية frontend بدون انقطاع."},"useCases":{"en":["Integrating accessible and customizable UI components into existing projects","Customizing shadcn/ui components for tailored application design","Optimizing application development with reusable and accessible UI elements"],"zh":["将无障碍且可定制的 UI 组件集成到现有项目中","为定制的应用程序设计而自定义 shadcn/ui 组件","使用可重用且无障碍的 UI 元素优化应用程序开发"],"ja":["既存のプロジェクトにアクセシブルでカスタマイズ可能な UI コンポーネントを統合する","カスタマイズされたアプリケーションデザインのために shadcn/ui コンポーネントをカスタマイズする","再利用可能でアクセシブルな UI 要素を使用してアプリケーションの開発を最適化する"],"ko":["기존 프로젝트에 접근성 및 사용자 지정 가능한 UI 구성 요소를 통합하는 것","사용자 지정된 애플리케이션 디자인을 위해 shadcn/ui 구성 요소를 사용자 지정하는 것","재사용 가능하고 접근성 있는 UI 요소를 사용하여 애플리케이션 개발을 최적화하는 것"],"es":["Integrar componentes de UI accesibles y personalizables en proyectos existentes","Personalizar componentes de shadcn/ui para un diseño de aplicación adaptado","Optimizar el desarrollo de aplicaciones con elementos de UI reutilizables y accesibles"],"fr":["Intégrer des composants d''UI accessibles et personnalisables dans des projets existants","Personnaliser les composants shadcn/ui pour une conception d''application sur mesure","Optimiser le développement d''applications avec des éléments d''UI réutilisables et accessibles"],"de":["Integrieren von zugänglichen und anpassbaren UI-Komponenten in bestehende Projekte","Anpassen von shadcn/ui-Komponenten für einen maßgeschneiderten Anwendungsdesign","Optimieren der Anwendungsentwicklung mit wiederverwendbaren und zugänglichen UI-Elementen"],"pt":["Integrar componentes de UI acessíveis e personalizáveis em projetos existentes","Personalizar componentes do shadcn/ui para design de aplicação personalizado","Otimizar o desenvolvimento de aplicações com elementos de UI reutilizáveis e acessíveis"],"ru":["Интегрировать доступные и настраиваемые компоненты UI в существующие проекты","Настроить компоненты shadcn/ui для индивидуального дизайна приложения","Оптимизировать разработку приложений с помощью многократно используемых и доступных элементов UI"],"ar":["دمج مكونات واجهة المستخدم القابلة للوصول وتكييفها في المشاريع الحالية","تكييف مكونات shadcn/ui لتصميم تطبيقات مخصص","تحسين تطوير التطبيقات باستخدام عناصر واجهة المستخدم قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام وقابلة للوصول"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires manual component copying into projects, as shadcn/ui is not a traditional component library","Dependent on compatibility with Radix UI, Base UI, and Tailwind CSS"],"zh":["需要手动将组件复制到项目中，因为 shadcn/ui 不是传统的组件库","依赖于 Radix UI、Base UI 和 Tailwind CSS 的兼容性"],"ja":["shadcn/ui は тради的なコンポーネント ライブラリではないため、コンポーネントをプロジェクトに手動でコピーする必要がある","Radix UI、Base UI、Tailwind CSS との互換性に依存する"],"ko":["shadcn/ui는 전통적인 구성 요소 라이브러리가 아니므로 구성 요소를 프로젝트에 수동으로 복사해야 함","Radix UI, Base UI 및 Tailwind CSS와의 호환성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere copia manual de componentes en proyectos, ya que shadcn/ui no es una biblioteca de componentes tradicional","Dependiente de la compatibilidad con Radix UI, Base UI y Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["Nécessite une copie manuelle des composants dans les projets, car shadcn/ui n''est pas une bibliothèque de composants traditionnelle","Dépendante de la compatibilité avec Radix UI, Base UI et Tailwind CSS"],"de":["Benötigt manuelles Kopieren von Komponenten in Projekte, da shadcn/ui keine traditionelle Komponentenbibliothek ist","Abhängig von der Kompatibilität mit Radix UI, Base UI und Tailwind CSS"],"pt":["Exige cópia manual de componentes para projetos, pois o shadcn/ui não é uma biblioteca de componentes tradicional","Dependente da compatibilidade com Radix UI, Base UI e Tailwind CSS"],"ru":["Требует ручной копии компонентов в проекты, поскольку shadcn/ui не является традиционной библиотекой компонентов","Зависит от совместимости с Radix UI, Base UI и Tailwind CSS"],"ar":["يتطلب نسخة يدوية للمكونات إلى المشاريع ، لأن shadcn/ui ليس مكتبة مكونات تقليدية","يعتمد على التوافق مع Radix UI و Base UI و Tailwind CSS"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":70}');
