 npm o Homebrew","Compatibilidad con Arc/Brave","Opción de autenticación mediante token"],"fr":["Authentification basée sur les cookies","Prise en charge de GraphQL","Installation facile via npm ou Homebrew","Compatibilité avec Arc/Brave","Option d''authentification via token"],"de":["Cookie-basierten Authentifizierung","GraphQL-Unterstützung","Einfache Installation über npm oder Homebrew","Kompatibilität mit Arc/Brave","Authentifizierungsoption über Token"],"pt":["Autenticação de cookie","Suporte a GraphQL","Instalação via npm ou Homebrew","Suporte a autenticação de um só uso","Verificação de autenticação ativa"],"ru":["Аутентификация по cookie","Поддержка GraphQL","Установка через npm или Homebrew","Поддержка одноразовой аутентификации","Проверка активной аутентификации"],"ar":["مصادقة الكوكيز","دعم GraphQL","التثبيت عبر npm أو Homebrew","دعم المصادقة لمرة واحدة","فحص المصادقة النشطة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Twitter GraphQL API","Bird CLI工具","cookie认证","命令行界面","npm","pnpm","bun","Homebrew"],"ja":["Twitter GraphQL API","Bird CLIツール","Cookie認証","コマンドラインインターフェース","npm","pnpm","bun","Homebrew"],"ko":["Twitter GraphQL API","Bird CLI 도구","쿠키 인증","명령줄 인터페이스","npm","pnpm","bun","Homebrew"],"es":["Bird CLI","Twitter API","autenticación basada en cookies","GraphQL","desarrollo de software","herramientas de línea de comandos","Twitter para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Bird CLI","Twitter API","authentification basée sur les cookies","GraphQL","développement de logiciels","outils de ligne de commande","Twitter pour les développeurs"],"de":["Bird CLI","Twitter API","Cookie-basierten Authentifizierung","GraphQL","Softwareentwicklung","Kommandozeilen-Tools","Twitter für Entwickler"],"pt":["CLI do Twitter","autenticação de cookie","GraphQL","linha de comando","ferramenta de desenvolvimento","API do Twitter"],"ru":["Twitter CLI","аутентификация по cookie","GraphQL","командная строка","инструмент для разработчиков","API Twitter"],"ar":["واجهة سطر أوامر تويتر","مصادقة الكوكيز","GraphQL","سطر الأوامر","أداة تطوير","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات تويتر"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bird","description":"X/Twitter CLI for reading, searching, posting, and engagement via cookies.","bodyPreview":"# bird 🐦\n\nFast X/Twitter CLI using GraphQL + cookie auth.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\n# npm/pnpm/bun\nnpm install -g @steipete/bird\n\n# Homebrew (macOS, prebuilt binary)\nbrew install steipete/tap/bird\n\n# One-shot (no install)\nbunx @steipete/bird whoami\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n`bird` uses cookie-based auth.\n\nUse `--auth-token` / `--ct0` to pass cookies directly, or `--cookie-source` for browser cookies.\n\nRun `bird check` to see which source is active. For Arc/Brave, use `--chrome-profile-dir <path>`.\n\n##","body":"# bird 🐦\n\nFast X/Twitter CLI using GraphQL + cookie auth.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\n# npm/pnpm/bun\nnpm install -g @steipete/bird\n\n# Homebrew (macOS, prebuilt binary)\nbrew install steipete/tap/bird\n\n# One-shot (no install)\nbunx @steipete/bird whoami\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n`bird` uses cookie-based auth.\n\nUse `--auth-token` / `--ct0` to pass cookies directly, or `--cookie-source` for browser cookies.\n\nRun `bird check` to see which source is active. For Arc/Brave, use `--chrome-profile-dir <path>`.\n\n## Commands\n\n### Account & Auth\n\n```bash\nbird whoami                    # Show logged-in account\nbird check                     # Show credential sources\nbird query-ids --fresh         # Refresh GraphQL query ID cache\n```\n\n### Reading Tweets\n\n```bash\nbird read <url-or-id>          # Read a single tweet\nbird <url-or-id>               # Shorthand for read\nbird thread <url-or-id>        # Full conversation thread\nbird replies <url-or-id>       # List replies to a tweet\n```\n\n### Timelines\n\n```bash\nbird home                      # Home timeline (For You)\nbird home --following          # Following timeline\nbird user-tweets @handle -n 20 # User''s profile timeline\nbird mentions                  # Tweets mentioning you\nbird mentions --user @handle   # Mentions of another user\n```\n\n### Search\n\n```bash\nbird search \"query\" -n 10\nbird search \"from:steipete\" --all --max-pages 3\n```\n\n### News & Trending\n\n```bash\nbird news -n 10                # AI-curated from Explore tabs\nbird news --ai-only            # Filter to AI-curated only\nbird news --sports             # Sports tab\nbird news --with-tweets        # Include related tweets\nbird trending                  # Alias for news\n```\n\n### Lists\n\n```bash\nbird lists                     # Your lists\nbird lists --member-of         # Lists you''re a member of\nbird list-timeline <id> -n 20  # Tweets from a list\n```\n\n### Bookmarks & Likes\n\n```bash\nbird bookmarks -n 10\nbird bookmarks --folder-id <id>           # Specific folder\nbird bookmarks --include-parent           # Include parent tweet\nbird bookmarks --author-chain             # Author''s self-reply chain\nbird bookmarks --full-chain-only          # Full reply chain\nbird unbookmark <url-or-id>\nbird likes -n 10\n```\n\n### Social Graph\n\n```bash\nbird following -n 20           # Users you follow\nbird followers -n 20           # Users following you\nbird following --user <id>     # Another user''s following\nbird about @handle             # Account origin/location info\n```\n\n### Engagement Actions\n\n```bash\nbird follow @handle            # Follow a user\nbird unfollow @handle          # Unfollow a user\n```\n\n### Posting\n\n```bash\nbird tweet \"hello world\"\nbird reply <url-or-id> \"nice thread!\"\nbird tweet \"check this out\" --media image.png --alt \"description\"\n```\n\n**⚠️ Posting risks**: Posting is more likely to be rate limited; if blocked, use the browser tool instead.\n\n## Media Uploads\n\n```bash\nbird tweet \"hi\" --media img.png --alt \"description\"\nbird tweet \"pics\" --media a.jpg --media b.jpg  # Up to 4 images\nbird tweet \"video\" --media clip.mp4            # Or 1 video\n```\n\n## Pagination\n\nCommands supporting pagination: `replies`, `thread`, `search`, `bookmarks`, `likes`, `list-timeline`, `following`, `followers`, `user-tweets`\n\n```bash\nbird bookmarks --all                    # Fetch all pages\nbird bookmarks --max-pages 3            # Limit pages\nbird bookmarks --cursor <cursor>        # Resume from cursor\nbird replies <id> --all --delay 1000    # Delay between pages (ms)\n```\n\n## Output Options\n\n```bash\n--json          # JSON output\n--json-full     # JSON with raw API response\n--plain         # No emoji, no color (script-friendly)\n--no-emoji      # Disable emoji\n--no-color      # Disable ANSI colors (or set NO_COLOR=1)\n--quote-depth n # Max quoted tweet depth in JSON (default: 1)\n```\n\n## Global Options\n\n```bash\n--auth-token <token>       # Set auth_token cookie\n--ct0 <token>              # Set ct0 cookie\n--cookie-source <source>   # Cookie source for browser cookies (repeatable)\n--chrome-profile <name>    # Chrome profile name\n--chrome-profile-dir <path> # Chrome/Chromium profile dir or cookie DB path\n--firefox-profile <name>   # Firefox profile\n--timeout <ms>             # Request timeout\n--cookie-timeout <ms>      # Cookie extraction timeout\n```\n\n## Config File\n\n`~/.config/bird/config.json5` (global) or `./.birdrc.json5` (project):\n\n```json5\n{\n  cookieSource: [\"chrome\"],\n  chromeProfileDir: \"/path/to/Arc/Profile\",\n  timeoutMs: 20000,\n  quoteDepth: 1,\n}\n```\n\nEnvironment variables: `BIRD_TIMEOUT_MS`, `BIRD_COOKIE_TIMEOUT_MS`, `BIRD_QUOTE_DEPTH`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Query IDs stale (404 errors)\n\n```bash\nbird query-ids --fresh\n```\n\n### Cookie extraction fails\n\n- Check browser is logged into X\n- Try different `--cookie-source`\n- For Arc/Brave: use `--chrome-profile-dir`\n\n---\n\n**TL;DR**: Read/search/engage with CLI. Post carefully or use browser. 🐦\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:06:05.380Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Social Media Analysis Agents needing direct Twitter/X API access bypassing official rate limits.","zh":"非常适合需要直接访问Twitter/X API并绕过官方速率限制的社交媒体分析代理。","ja":"Twitter/X APIへの直接アクセスが必要で、公式のレート制限を回避する必要があるソーシャルメディア分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"공식 속도 제한을 우회하여 Twitter/X API에 직접 액세스해야 하는 소셜 미디어 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Medios Sociales que necesitan acceso directo a la API de Twitter/X evitando los límites de velocidad oficiales.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse des Médias Sociaux ayant besoin d''un accès direct à l''API Twitter/X en contournant les limites de débit officielles.","de":"Perfekt für Social Media Analyse-Agenten, die direkten Zugriff auf die Twitter/X-API benötigen und dabei offizielle Rate Limits umgehen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Mídia Social que precisam de acesso direto à API do Twitter/X, contornando os limites de taxa oficiais.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов Анализа Социальных Медиа, требующих прямого доступа к API Twitter/X, обходя официальные ограничения скорости.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية التي تحتاج إلى الوصول المباشر إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات Twitter/X مع تجاوز حدود سرعة الشبكة الرسمية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct GraphQL API access to Twitter/X with cookie-based authentication, providing real-time data retrieval without official API constraints. Supports multiple authentication sources including browser cookies from Chrome profiles like Arc/Brave.","zh":"启用使用基于Cookie的身份验证的Twitter/X的直接GraphQL API访问，提供实时数据检索，而无需受官方API限制。支持包括来自Chrome配置文件（如Arc/Brave）浏览器Cookie在内的多个身份验证源。","ja":"クッキーベースの認証を使用したTwitter/Xの直接GraphQL APIアクセスを可能にし、公式APIの制約を受けずにリアルタイムのデータ取得を提供します。Chromeのプロファイル（例： Arc/Brave）からのブラウザーコッキーを含む複数の認証ソースをサポートしています。","ko":"쿠키 기반 인증을 사용하여 Twitter/X의 직접 GraphQL API 액세스를 가능하게 하여 공식 API 제한 없이 실시간 데이터检索를 제공합니다. 크롬 프로필(Arc/Brave 등)에서 브라우저 쿠키를 포함한 여러 인증 소스를 지원합니다.","es":"Permite el acceso directo a la API de GraphQL de Twitter/X con autenticación basada en cookies, proporcionando la recuperación de datos en tiempo real sin las restricciones de la API oficial. Admite múltiples fuentes de autenticación, incluyendo cookies de navegador de perfiles de Chrome como Arc/Brave.","fr":"Permet l''accès direct à l''API GraphQL de Twitter/X avec une authentification basée sur les cookies, fournissant une récupération de données en temps réel sans les contraintes de l''API officielle. Prend en charge plusieurs sources d''authentification, y compris les cookies de navigateur de profils Chrome tels que Arc/Brave.","de":"Ermöglicht den direkten Zugriff auf die Twitter/X-GraphQL-API mit cookie-basierter Authentifizierung, wodurch Echtzeit-Datenabruf ohne offizielle API-Einschränkungen möglich ist. Unterstützt mehrere Authentifizierungsquellen, einschließlich Browser-Cookies von Chrome-Profilen wie Arc/Brave.","pt":"Permite acesso direto à API GraphQL do Twitter/X com autenticação baseada em cookies, fornecendo recuperação de dados em tempo real sem as restrições da API oficial. Suporta várias fontes de autenticação, incluindo cookies de navegador do Chrome de perfis como Arc/Brave.","ru":"Предоставляет прямой доступ к API GraphQL Twitter/X с аутентификацией на основе cookie, обеспечивая получение данных в режиме реального времени без ограничений официального API. Поддерживает несколько источников аутентификации, включая cookie браузера Chrome из профилей, таких как Arc/Brave.","ar":"تمكن من الوصول المباشر إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GraphQL Twitter/X باستخدام مصادقة القائمة على ملفات تعريف الارتباط، وتوفير استرجاع البيانات في الوقت الفعلي دون قيود واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الرسمية. يدعم مصادر مصادقة متعددة، بما في ذلك ملفات تعريف الارتباط الخاصة بمتصفح Chrome من الملفات الشخصية مثل Arc/Brave."},"useCases":{"en":["Monitoring real-time Twitter trends","Extracting user engagement metrics","Automating social media presence checks","Gathering competitor intelligence data"],"zh":["监测实时Twitter趋势","提取用户参与度指标","自动化社交媒体存在检查","收集竞争对手情报数据"],"ja":["リアルタイムのTwitterトレンドを監視する","ユーザー参与度メトリクスを抽出する","ソーシャルメディア存在チェックを自動化する","競合他社インテリジェンスデータを収集する"],"ko":["실시간 트위터 트렌드를 모니터링","사용자 참여 지표 추출","소셜 미디어 존재 확인 자동화","경쟁사 인텔리전스 데이터 수집"],"es":["Monitorear tendencias de Twitter en tiempo real","Extraer métricas de participación del usuario","Automatizar comprobaciones de presencia en los medios sociales","Recopilar datos de inteligencia de competidores"],"fr":["Surveiller les tendances Twitter en temps réel","Extraire des métriques d''engagement utilisateur","Automatiser les vérifications de présence sur les médias sociaux","Rassembler des données d''intelligence concurrentielle"],"de":["Echtzeit-Twitter-Trends überwachen","Benutzerverhaltensmetriken extrahieren","Soziale Medien-Präsenzkontrollen automatisieren","Wettbewerbsdaten sammeln"],"pt":["Monitorar tendências do Twitter em tempo real","Extrair métricas de engajamento do usuário","Automatizar verificações de presença nas mídias sociais","Coletar dados de inteligência de concorrentes"],"ru":["Мониторинг реальных тенденций Twitter","Извлечение метрик вовлеченности пользователей","Автоматизация проверок присутствия в социальных медиа","Сбор данных о конкурентах"],"ar":["مراقبة اتجاهات تويتر في الوقت الفعلي","استخراج مقاييس المشاركة للمستخدم","توفير عمليات تلقائية لتحقق من الحضور على وسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية","جمع بيانات استخباراتية عن المنافسين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires active cookie authentication","Dependent on Twitter''s GraphQL endpoint stability","Needs browser cookie access or manual token/ct0 parameters"],"zh":["需要活动Cookie身份验证","依赖Twitter的GraphQL端点稳定性","需要浏览器Cookie访问或手动令牌/ct0参数"],"ja":["アクティブなクッキー認証が必要","TwitterのGraphQLエンドポイントの安定性に依存する","ブラウザーコッキーへのアクセスまたは手動トークン/ct0パラメーターが必要"],"ko":["액티브 쿠키 인증 필요","트위터의 GraphQL 엔드포인트 안정성 의존","브라우저 쿠키 액세스 또는 수동 토큰/ct0 매개 변수 필요"],"es":["Requiere autenticación de cookie activa","Depende de la estabilidad del punto final de GraphQL de Twitter","Necesita acceso a cookies de navegador o parámetros de token/ct0 manuales"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification de cookie active","Dépend de la stabilité du point de terminaison GraphQL de Twitter","Nécessite un accès aux cookies de navigateur ou des paramètres de jeton/ct0 manuels"],"de":["Erfordert aktive Cookie-Authentifizierung","Hängt von der Stabilität des Twitter-GraphQL-Endpunkts ab","Benötigt Zugriff auf Browser-Cookies oder manuelle Token/ct0-Parameter"],"pt":["Requer autenticação ativa por cookie","Depende da estabilidade do endpoint GraphQL do Twitter","Necessita acesso a cookies de navegador ou parâmetros de token/ct0 manuais"],"ru":["Требует активной аутентификации по cookie","Зависит от стабильности конечной точки GraphQL Twitter","Требует доступа к cookie браузера или ручных параметров токена/ct0"],"ar":["يتطلب مصادقة نشطة بواسطة ملف تعريف الارتباط","يعتمد على استقرار نقطة نهاية واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GraphQL Twitter","يحتاج إلى وصول إلى ملفات تعريف الارتباط الخاصة بالمتصفح أو معلمات التوكين/ct0 اليدوية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('chengyihua/nanobot-ts/baoyu-cover-image', 'community', 'chengyihua', 'nanobot-ts', 'chengyihua/nanobot-ts', 'baoyu-cover-image', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z', '2026-02-18T04:06:06.156Z', NULL, '{"id":"chengyihua/nanobot-ts/baoyu-cover-image","name":"baoyu-cover-image","description":{"zh":"BAOYU封面图像生成器是一款轻量级、可扩展的个人AI助手框架，用于生成个性化文章封面","ja":"BAOYUカバーアイメージジェネレーターは、カスタマイズ可能な記事カバーを生成するための超軽量の個人用AIアシスタントフレームワークです","ko":"BAOYU 커버 이미지 생성기는 개인화된 기사 커버를 생성하기 위한 초경량 개인용 AI 보조 프레임워크입니다","es":"Baoyu es un generador de imágenes de portada ultra ligero y extensible, construido con TypeScript","fr":"Baoyu est un générateur d''images de couverture ultra léger et extensible, construit avec TypeScript","de":"Baoyu ist ein ultraleichter und erweiterbarer Cover-Bild-Generator, der mit TypeScript erstellt wurde","pt":"O baoyu-cover-image é um framework leve para geração de imagens de capa personalizadas.","ru":"Baoyu-cover-image - это легкий фреймворк для создания персонализированных обложек.","ar":"baoyu-cover-image هو إطار عمل خفيف لإنشاء غلاف مخصص.","en":"An ultra-lightweight, extensible personal AI assistant framework built with TypeScript. Nanobot TS is designed to be your personal companion, capable of handling complex tasks through a robust agent loop, memory system, and tool integration."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"BAOYU封面图像生成器 - 个性化文章封面","ja":"BAOYUカバーアイメージジェネレーター - カスタマイズ可能な記事カバー","ko":"BAOYU 커버 이미지 생성기 - 개인화된 기사 커버","es":"Generador de Imágenes de Portada Baoyu","fr":"Générateur d''Images de Couverture Baoyu","de":"Baoyu Cover Bild Generator","pt":"Gerador de Imagens de Capa Baoyu","ru":"Генератор обложек Baoyu","ar":"مولد غلاف باою","en":"baoyu-cover-image"},"description":{"zh":"BAOYU封面图像生成器是一款轻量级、可扩展的个人AI助手框架，用于生成个性化文章封面","ja":"BAOYUカバーアイメージジェネレーターは、カスタマイズ可能な記事カバーを生成するための超軽量の個人用AIアシスタントフレームワークです","ko":"BAOYU 커버 이