дустановки стилей","Интеграция с инструментами"],"ar":["إنشاء غلاف مخصص","تخصيص 5D","أوضاع استخدام مرنة","إعدادات نمط مسبقة","إدماج مع الأدوات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["封面图像生成","个性化文章封面","AI助手","轻量级框架","可扩展","5维定制"],"ja":["カバーアイメージ生成","カスタマイズ可能な記事カバー","AIアシスタント","超軽量フレームワーク","拡張可能","5次元カスタマイズ"],"ko":["커버 이미지 생성","개인화된 기사 커버","AI 보조","초경량 프레임워크","확장 가능","5차원 맞춤형"],"es":["generador de imágenes de portada","TypeScript","asistente de inteligencia artificial","personalización de imágenes","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["générateur d''images de couverture","TypeScript","assistant d''intelligence artificielle","personnalisation d''images","développement de logiciels","outils de développement"],"de":["Cover-Bild-Generator","TypeScript","künstlicher Intelligenz-Assistent","Anpassung von Bildern","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["gerador de imagens de capa","baoyu-cover-image","personalização 5D","geração de imagens","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["генератор обложек","baoyu-cover-image","5D-персонализация","создание обложек","инструменты разработки","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مولد صور الغلاف","baoyu-cover-image","تخصيص 5D","إنشاء صور الغلاف","أدوات التطوير","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"chengyihua","repo":"nanobot-ts","repoPath":"chengyihua/nanobot-ts","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-cover-image","description":"Generates article cover images with 5 dimensions (type, palette, rendering, text, mood) combining 9 color palettes and 6 rendering styles. Supports cinematic (2.35:1), widescreen (16:9), and square (1:1) aspects. Use when user asks to generate cover image, create article cover, or make cover.","bodyPreview":"# Cover Image Generator\n\nGenerate elegant cover images for articles with 5-dimensional customization.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n# Auto-select dimensions based on content\n/baoyu-cover-image path/to/article.md\n\n# Quick mode: skip confirmation\n/baoyu-cover-image article.md --quick\n\n# Specify dimensions\n/baoyu-cover-image article.md --type conceptual --palette warm --rendering flat-vector\n\n# Style presets (shorthand for palette + rendering)\n/baoyu-cover-image article.md --style blueprint\n\n# With reference","body":"# Cover Image Generator\n\nGenerate elegant cover images for articles with 5-dimensional customization.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n# Auto-select dimensions based on content\n/baoyu-cover-image path/to/article.md\n\n# Quick mode: skip confirmation\n/baoyu-cover-image article.md --quick\n\n# Specify dimensions\n/baoyu-cover-image article.md --type conceptual --palette warm --rendering flat-vector\n\n# Style presets (shorthand for palette + rendering)\n/baoyu-cover-image article.md --style blueprint\n\n# With reference images\n/baoyu-cover-image article.md --ref style-ref.png\n\n# Direct content input\n/baoyu-cover-image --palette mono --aspect 1:1 --quick\n[paste content]\n```\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--type <name>` | hero, conceptual, typography, metaphor, scene, minimal |\n| `--palette <name>` | warm, elegant, cool, dark, earth, vivid, pastel, mono, retro |\n| `--rendering <name>` | flat-vector, hand-drawn, painterly, digital, pixel, chalk |\n| `--style <name>` | Preset shorthand (see [Style Presets](references/style-presets.md)) |\n| `--text <level>` | none, title-only, title-subtitle, text-rich |\n| `--mood <level>` | subtle, balanced, bold |\n| `--font <name>` | clean, handwritten, serif, display |\n| `--aspect <ratio>` | 16:9 (default), 2.35:1, 4:3, 3:2, 1:1, 3:4 |\n| `--lang <code>` | Title language (en, zh, ja, etc.) |\n| `--no-title` | Alias for `--text none` |\n| `--quick` | Skip confirmation, use auto-selection |\n| `--ref <files...>` | Reference images for style/composition guidance |\n\n## Five Dimensions\n\n| Dimension | Values | Default |\n|-----------|--------|---------|\n| **Type** | hero, conceptual, typography, metaphor, scene, minimal | auto |\n| **Palette** | warm, elegant, cool, dark, earth, vivid, pastel, mono, retro | auto |\n| **Rendering** | flat-vector, hand-drawn, painterly, digital, pixel, chalk | auto |\n| **Text** | none, title-only, title-subtitle, text-rich | title-only |\n| **Mood** | subtle, balanced, bold | balanced |\n| **Font** | clean, handwritten, serif, display | clean |\n\nAuto-selection rules: [references/auto-selection.md](references/auto-selection.md)\n\n## Galleries\n\n**Types**: hero, conceptual, typography, metaphor, scene, minimal\n→ Details: [references/types.md](references/types.md)\n\n**Palettes**: warm, elegant, cool, dark, earth, vivid, pastel, mono, retro\n→ Details: [references/palettes/](references/palettes/)\n\n**Renderings**: flat-vector, hand-drawn, painterly, digital, pixel, chalk\n→ Details: [references/renderings/](references/renderings/)\n\n**Text Levels**: none (pure visual) | title-only (default) | title-subtitle | text-rich (with tags)\n→ Details: [references/dimensions/text.md](references/dimensions/text.md)\n\n**Mood Levels**: subtle (low contrast) | balanced (default) | bold (high contrast)\n→ Details: [references/dimensions/mood.md](references/dimensions/mood.md)\n\n**Fonts**: clean (sans-serif) | handwritten | serif | display (bold decorative)\n→ Details: [references/dimensions/font.md](references/dimensions/font.md)\n\n## File Structure\n\nOutput directory per `default_output_dir` preference:\n- `same-dir`: `{article-dir}/`\n- `imgs-subdir`: `{article-dir}/imgs/`\n- `independent` (default): `cover-image/{topic-slug}/`\n\n```\n<output-dir>/\n├── source-{slug}.{ext}    # Source files\n├── refs/                  # Reference images (if provided)\n│   ├── ref-01-{slug}.{ext}\n│   └── ref-01-{slug}.md   # Description file\n├── prompts/cover.md       # Generation prompt\n└── cover.png              # Output image\n```\n\n**Slug**: 2-4 words, kebab-case. Conflict: append `-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS`\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Progress Checklist\n\n```\nCover Image Progress:\n- [ ] Step 0: Check preferences (EXTEND.md) ⛔ BLOCKING\n- [ ] Step 1: Analyze content + save refs + determine output dir\n- [ ] Step 2: Confirm options (6 dimensions) ⚠️ unless --quick\n- [ ] Step 3: Create prompt\n- [ ] Step 4: Generate image\n- [ ] Step 5: Completion report\n```\n\n### Flow\n\n```\nInput → [Step 0: Preferences] ─┬─ Found → Continue\n                               └─ Not found → First-Time Setup ⛔ BLOCKING → Save EXTEND.md → Continue\n        ↓\nAnalyze + Save Refs → [Output Dir] → [Confirm: 6 Dimensions] → Prompt → Generate → Complete\n                                              ↓\n                                     (skip if --quick or all specified)\n```\n\n### Step 0: Load Preferences ⛔ BLOCKING\n\nCheck EXTEND.md existence (priority: project → user):\n```bash\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-cover-image/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-cover-image/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n| Result | Action |\n|--------|--------|\n| Found | Load, display summary → Continue |\n| Not found | ⛔ Run first-time setup ([references/config/first-time-setup.md](references/config/first-time-setup.md)) → Save → Continue |\n\n**CRITICAL**: If not found, complete setup BEFORE any other steps or questions.\n\n### Step 1: Analyze Content\n\n1. **Save reference images** (if provided) → [references/workflow/reference-images.md](references/workflow/reference-images.md)\n2. **Save source content** (if pasted, save to `source.md`)\n3. **Analyze content**: topic, tone, keywords, visual metaphors\n4. **Deep analyze references** ⚠️: Extract specific, concrete elements (see reference-images.md)\n5. **Detect language**: Compare source, user input, EXTEND.md preference\n6. **Determine output directory**: Per File Structure rules\n\n### Step 2: Confirm Options ⚠️\n\nFull confirmation flow: [references/workflow/confirm-options.md](references/workflow/confirm-options.md)\n\n| Condition | Skipped | Still Asked |\n|-----------|---------|-------------|\n| `--quick` or `quick_mode: true` | 6 dimensions | Aspect ratio (unless `--aspect`) |\n| All 6 + `--aspect` specified | All | None |\n\n### Step 3: Create Prompt\n\nSave to `prompts/cover.md`. Template: [references/workflow/prompt-template.md](references/workflow/prompt-template.md)\n\n**CRITICAL - References in Frontmatter**:\n- Files saved to `refs/` → Add to frontmatter `references` list\n- Style extracted verbally (no file) → Omit `references`, describe in body\n- Before writing → Verify: `test -f refs/ref-NN-{slug}.{ext}`\n\n**Reference elements in body** MUST be detailed, prefixed with \"MUST\"/\"REQUIRED\", with integration approach.\n\n### Step 4: Generate Image\n\n1. **Backup existing** `cover.png` if regenerating\n2. **Check image generation skills**; if multiple, ask preference\n3. **Process references** from prompt frontmatter:\n   - `direct` usage → pass via `--ref` (use ref-capable backend)\n   - `style`/`palette` → extract traits, append to prompt\n4. **Generate**: Call skill with prompt file, output path, aspect ratio\n5. On failure: auto-retry once\n\n### Step 5: Completion Report\n\n```\nCover Generated!\n\nTopic: [topic]\nType: [type] | Palette: [palette] | Rendering: [rendering]\nText: [text] | Mood: [mood] | Font: [font] | Aspect: [ratio]\nTitle: [title or \"visual only\"]\nLanguage: [lang] | Watermark: [enabled/disabled]\nReferences: [N images or \"extracted style\" or \"none\"]\nLocation: [directory path]\n\nFiles:\n✓ source-{slug}.{ext}\n✓ prompts/cover.md\n✓ cover.png\n```\n\n## Image Modification\n\n| Action | Steps |\n|--------|-------|\n| **Regenerate** | Backup → Update prompt file FIRST → Regenerate |\n| **Change dimension** | Backup → Confirm new value → Update prompt → Regenerate |\n\n## Composition Principles\n\n- **Whitespace**: 40-60% breathing room\n- **Visual anchor**: Main element centered or offset left\n- **Characters**: Simplified silhouettes; NO realistic humans\n- **Title**: Use exact title from user/source; never invent\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Step 0** for paths.\n\nSupports: Watermark | Preferred dimensions | Default aspect/output | Quick mode | Custom palettes | Language\n\nSchema: [references/config/preferences-schema.md](references/config/preferences-schema.md)\n\n## References\n\n**Dimensions**: [text.md](references/dimensions/text.md) | [mood.md](references/dimensions/mood.md) | [font.md](references/dimensions/font.md)\n**Palettes**: [references/palettes/](references/palettes/)\n**Renderings**: [references/renderings/](references/renderings/)\n**Types**: [references/types.md](references/types.md)\n**Auto-Selection**: [references/auto-selection.md](references/auto-selection.md)\n**Style Presets**: [references/style-presets.md](references/style-presets.md)\n**Compatibility**: [references/compatibility.md](references/compatibility.md)\n**Visual Elements**: [references/visual-elements.md](references/visual-elements.md)\n**Workflow**: [confirm-options.md](references/workflow/confirm-options.md) | [prompt-template.md](references/workflow/prompt-template.md) | [reference-images.md](references/workflow/reference-images.md)\n**Config**: [preferences-schema.md](references/config/preferences-schema.md) | [first-time-setup.md](references/config/first-time-setup.md) | [watermark-guide.md](references/config/watermark-guide.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:06:06.156Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Creation Agents needing automated, dimension-aware article cover image generation.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化、维度感知的文章封面图像生成的内容创作代理。","ja":"自動化された、次元認識のある記事のカバー画像の生成が必要なコンテンツ作成エージェントに最適。","ko":"자동화된 차원 인식 기사 커버 이미지 생성이 필요한 콘텐츠 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de creación de contenido que necesitan la generación automática de imágenes de portada de artículos con conciencia de dimensión.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de création de contenu ayant besoin d''une génération automatisée d''images de couverture d''articles avec prise en compte des dimensions.","de":"Perfekt für Content-Erstellung-Agenten, die eine automatisierte, dimensionsbewusste Erstellung von Artikel-Cover-Bildern benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de criação de conteúdo que precisam de geração automática de imagens de capa de artigos com conscientização de dimensão.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по созданию контента, которым требуется автоматизированная генерация изображений обложек статей с учетом размеров.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إنشاء المحتوى الذي يحتاج إلى генера génération تلقائي لصور غلاف المقال مع إدراك البعد."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate elegant cover images with 5-dimensional customization including type, palette, and rendering style. Supports deterministic output through style presets like ''blueprint'' and handles both auto-selection based on content analysis and explicit parameter specification.","zh":"使代理能够生成优雅的封面图像，具有5维度的自定义，包括类型、调色板和渲染样式。支持通过样式预设（如''blueprint''）进行确定性输出，并且既支持基于内容分析的自动选择，也支持显式参数指定。","ja":"エージェントが、タイプ、パレット、レンダリングスタイルを含む5次元のカスタマイズを備えた優雅なカバー画像を生成できるようにします。スタイルプリセット（例：''blueprint''）を介した決定的な出力をサポートし、コンテンツ分析に基づく自動選択と明示的なパラメータ指定の両方を処理します。","ko":"에이전트가 유형, 팔레트 및 렌더링 스타일을 포함한 5차원 사용자 지정과 함께 우아한 커버 이미지를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. 스타일 프리셋(예: ''blueprint'')을 통한 결정적 출력을 지원하며 콘텐츠 분석 기반 자동 선택 및 명시적 매개 변수 지정 모두를 처리합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar imágenes de portada elegantes con personalización de 5 dimensiones, incluyendo tipo, paleta y estilo de renderizado. Admite una salida determinista a través de preajustes de estilo como ''blueprint'' y maneja tanto la selección automática basada en el análisis de contenido como la especificación explícita de parámetros.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des images de couverture élégantes avec une personnalisation 5 dimensions, y compris le type, la palette et le style de rendu. Prend en charge une sortie déterministe via des préréglages de style comme ''blueprint'' et gère à la fois la sélection automatique basée sur l''analyse de contenu et la spécification explicite de paramètres.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, ansprechende Cover-Bilder mit 5-dimensionalen Anpassungsmöglichkeiten, einschließlich Typ, Palette und Rendernstil, zu generieren. Unterstützt deterministische Ausgaben durch Stilvorgaben wie ''blueprint'' und ermöglicht sowohl die automatische Auswahl basierend auf Inhaltanalyse als auch die explizite Parametrierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar imagens de capa elegantes com personalização de 5 dimensões, incluindo tipo, paleta e estilo de renderização. Suporta saída determinística por meio de presets de estilo, como ''blueprint'', e lida com seleção automática com base na análise de conteúdo e especificação explícita de parâmetros.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать элегантные изображения обложек с 5-мерной настройкой, включая тип, палитру и стиль рендеринга. Поддерживает детерминированный вывод через пресеты стилей, такие как ''blueprint'', и обрабатывает как автоматический выбор на основе анализа контента, так и явное указание параметров.","ar":"يُمَكِّن العميل من إنشاء صور غلاف أنيقة مع تخصيص 5 أبعاد، بما في ذلك النوع واللون وأسلوب العرض. يدعم الإخراج المتحديد من خلال مسوّغات أسلوب مثل ''blueprint'' ويتعامل مع التحديد التلقائي بناءً على تحليل المحتوى والتحديد الصريح للمعاملات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating cover image generation for blog post publication workflows","Generating multiple style variants for A/B testing article thumbnails","Creating branded cover images using predefined palette and rendering combinations"],"zh":["自动化博客文章发布工作流程的封面图像生成","生成用于A/B测试文章缩略图的多样式变体","使用预定义的调色板和渲染组合创建品牌封面图像"],"ja":["ブログ投稿の公開ワークフローにおけるカバー画像の生成の自動化","A/Bテストの記事サムネイル用に多様なスタイルのバリアントを生成","事前に定義されたパレットとレンダリングの組み合わせを使用してブランドのカバー画像を作成"],"ko":["블로그 게시물 발행 워크플로우에 대한 커버 이미지 생성 자동화","A/B 테스트용 기사 썸네일을 위한 다중 스타일 변형체 생성","사전 정의된 팔레트 및 렌더링 조합을 사용하여 브랜드 커버 이미지 생성"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de imágenes de portada para flujos de trabajo de publicación de entradas de blog","Generar variantes de estilo múltiples para pruebas A/B de miniaturas de artículos","Crear imágenes de portada de marca utilizando combinaciones predefinidas de paleta y renderizado"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération d''images de couverture pour les flux de travail de publication de billets de blog","Générer des variantes de style multiples pour des tests A/B de miniatures d''articles","Créer des images de couverture de marque en utilisant des combinaisons prédéfinies de palette et de rendu"],"de":["Automatisieren der Cover-Bild-Generierung für Blog-Beitrag-Veröffentlichungs-Workflows","Erzeugen von Stil-Varianten für A/B-Tests von Artikel-Vorschaubildern","Erstellen von Marken-Cover-Bildern unter Verwendung von vordefinierten Paletten- und Rendern-Kombinationen"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de imagens de capa para fluxos de trabalho de publicação de posts de blog","Gerar variantes de estilo múltiplo para testes A/B de miniaturas de artigos","Criar imagens de capa personalizadas usando combinações predefinidas de paleta e renderização"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию изображений обложек для рабочих процессов публикации блог-постов","Генерировать множественные варианты стиля для тестирования A/B миниатюр статей","Создавать брендированные изображения обложек, используя предварительно определенные комбинации палитры и рендеринга"],"ar":["تتمة генера génération تلقائي لصور غلاف المقال لتدفقات العمل لنشر منشورات المدونة","إنشاء متغيرات متعددة للأسلوب لاختبار A/B لصور مصغرة للمقال","إنشاء صور غلاف مُخصَصة باستخدام مجموعات محددة مسبقًا من الألوان وتحويل العرض"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires article markdown file as input","Depends on external image generation services or libraries","Style presets may limit customization flexibility"],"zh":["需要文章markdown文件作为输入","依赖于外部图像生成服务或库","样式预设可能会限制自定义的灵活性"],"ja":["入力として記事のMarkdownファイルが必要","外部の画像生成サービスまたはライブラリに依存","スタイルプリセットではカスタマイズの柔軟性が制限される可能性がある"],"ko":["입력으로 기사 markdown 파일이 필요합니다","외부 이미지 생성 서비스 또는 라이브러리에 의존합니다","스타일 프리셋은 사용자 定義의 유연성을 제한할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere un archivo markdown de artículo como entrada","Depende de servicios o bibliotecas de generación de imágenes externas","Los preajustes de estilo pueden limitar la flexibilidad de personalización"],"fr":["Nécessite un fichier markdown d''article comme entrée","Dépend de services ou de bibliothèques de génération d''images externes","Les préréglages de style peuvent limiter la flexibilité de personnalisation"],"de":["Benötigt eine Artikel-Markdown-Datei als Eingabe","Hängt von externen Bildgenerierungsdiensten oder -bibliotheken ab","Stilvorgaben können die Anpassungsflexibilität einschränken"],"pt":["Exige arquivo markdown do artigo como entrada","Depende de serviços ou bibliotecas de geração de imagens externas","Presets de estilo podem limitar a flexibilidade de personalização"],"ru":["Требует файла markdown статьи в качестве входных данных","Зависит от внешних сервисов или библиотек генерации изображений","Пресеты стилей могут ограничить гибкость настройки"],"ar":["يتطلب ملف markdown للمقال كمدخلات","يعتمد على خدمات أو مكتبات外 generación تلقائي لصور外","مسوّغات الأسلوب قد تقيد مرونة التخصيص"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('wepee/openclaw-railway/bird', 'community', 'wepee', 'openclaw-railway', 'wepee/openclaw-railway', 'bird', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z', '2026-02-18T04:06:20.301Z', NULL, '{"id":"wepee/openclaw-railway/bird","name":"bird","description":{"zh":"Bird 是一个快速的 X/Twitter 命令行界面，使用 GraphQL 和 cookie 身份验证","ja":"Bird は、GraphQL と Cookie 認証を使用する高速の X/Twitter コマンドラインインターフェイスです","ko":"Bird는 GraphQL 및 쿠키 인증을 사용하는 빠른 X/Twitter 명령줄 인터페이스입니다","es":"Bird es una CLI de Twitter rápida y segura que utiliza autenticación de cookie y GraphQL para interactuar con la plataforma.","fr":"Bird est une CLI Twitter rapide et sécurisée qui utilise l''authentification par cookie et GraphQL pour interagir avec la plateforme.","de":"Bird ist eine schnelle und sichere Twitter-CLI, die Cookie-Authentifizierung und GraphQL zur Interaktion mit der Plattform verwendet.","pt":"Bird é uma CLI do Twitter que utiliza autenticação de cookie e GraphQL para interagir com a plataforma. Ela oferece uma forma rápida e fácil de usar a API do Twitter","ru":"Bird - это Twitter CLI, использующая аутентификацию по cookie и GraphQL для взаимодействия с платформой. Она предоставляет быстрый и простой способ использования API Twitter","ar":"Bird هي واجهة سطر الأوامر ل تويتر التي تستخدم مصادقة الكوكيز و GraphQL للتفاعل مع المنصة. توفر طريقة سريعة وسهلة لاستخدام API تويتر","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Bird AI 技术：快速的 X/Twitter 命令行界面","ja":"Bird AI 技術：高速の X/Twitter コマンドラインインターフェイス","ko":"Bird AI 기술: 빠른 X/Twitter 명령줄 인터페이스","es":"Bird: CLI de Twitter con autenticación de cookie","fr":"Bird : CLI Twitter avec authentification par cookie","de":"Bird: Twitter-CLI mit Cookie-Authentifizierung","pt":"Bird: CLI do Twitter com Autenticação de Cookie","ru":"Bird: Twitter CLI с аутентификацией по cookie","ar":"鳥: واجهة سطر الأوامر ل تويتر باستخدام مصادقة الكوكيز","en":"bird"},"description":{"zh":"Bird 是一个快速的 X/Twitter 命令行界面，使用 GraphQL 和 cookie 身份验证","ja":"Bird は、GraphQL と Cookie 認証を使用する高速の X/Twitter コマンドラインインターフェイスです","ko":"Bird는 GraphQL 및 쿠키 인증을 사용하는 빠른 X/Twitter 명령줄 인터페이스입니다","es":"Bird es una CLI de Twitter rápida y segura que utiliza autenticación de cookie y GraphQL para interactuar con la plataforma.","fr":"Bird est une CLI Twitter rapide et sécurisée qui utilise l''authentification par cookie et GraphQL pour interagir avec la plateforme.","de":"Bird ist eine schnelle und sichere Twitter-CLI, die Cookie-Authentifizierung und GraphQL zur Interaktion mit der Plattform verwendet.","pt":"Bird é uma CLI do Twitter que utiliza autenticação de cookie e GraphQL para interagir com a plataforma. Ela oferece uma forma rápida e fácil de usar a API do...","ru":"Bird - это Twitter CLI, использующая аутентификацию по cookie и GraphQL для взаимодействия с платформой. Она предоставляет быстрый и простой способ использов...","ar":"Bird هي واجهة سطر الأوامر ل تويتر التي تستخدم مصادقة الكوكيز و GraphQL للتفاعل مع المنصة. توفر طريقة سريعة وسهلة لاستخدام API تويتر","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["快速的 X/Twitter 命令行界面","支持 GraphQL","支持 cookie 身份验证","简单易用的安装过程","支持多种操作系统"],"ja":["高速の X/Twitter コマンドラインインターフェイス","GraphQL サポート","Cookie 認証サポート","簡単なインストールプロセス","複数のオペレーティングシステムをサポート"],"ko":["빠른 X/Twitter 명령줄 인터페이스","GraphQL 지원","쿠키 인증 지원","간단한 설치 프로세스","다중 운영 체제 지원"],"es":["Autenticación de cookie","Soporte para GraphQL","Instalación mediante npm o Homebrew","Autenticación mediante token o fuente de cookies","Compatibilidad con Arc/Brave"],"fr":["Authentification par cookie","Prise en charge de GraphQL","Installation via npm ou Homebrew","Authentification via token ou source de cookies","Compatibilité avec Arc/Brave"],"de":["Cookie-Authentifizierung","GraphQL-Unterstützung","Installation über npm oder Homebrew","Authentifizierung über Token oder Cookie-Quelle","Kompatibilität mit Arc/Brave"],"pt":["Autenticação de cookie","Suporte a GraphQL","Instalação via npm ou Homebrew","Uso de cookies do navegador","Comando de verificação de autenticação"],"ru":["Аутентификация по cookie","Поддержка GraphQL","Установка через npm или Homebrew","Использование cookie браузера","Команда проверки аутентификации"],"ar":["مصادقة الكوكيز","دعم GraphQL","التثبيت عبر npm أو Homebrew","استخدام كوكيز المتصفح","أمر التحقق من المصادقة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Bird AI","X/Twitter 命令行界面","GraphQL","cookie 身份验证","命令行工具","开发者工具"],"ja":["Bird AI","X/Twitter コマンドラインインターフェイス","GraphQL","Cookie 認証","コマンドラインツール","開発者ツール"],"ko":["Bird AI","X/Twitter 명령줄 인터페이스","GraphQL","쿠키 인증","명령줄 도구","개발자 도구"],"es":["CLI de Twitter","autenticación de cookie","GraphQL","desarrollo de Twitter","herramientas de desarrollo","Bird CLI"],"fr":["CLI Twitter","authentification par cookie","GraphQL","développement Twitter","outils de développement","Bird CLI"],"de":["Twitter-CLI","Cookie-Authentifizierung","GraphQL","Twitter-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Bird-CLI"],"pt":["twitter cli","autenticação de cookie","graphql","api twitter","ferramenta de linha de comando","desenvolvimento de software","integração com twitter"],"ru":["twitter cli","аутентификация по cookie","graphql","api twitter","инструмент командной строки","разработка программного обеспечения","интеграция с twitter"],"ar":["واجهة سطر الأوامر تويتر","مصادقة الكوكيز","graphql","api تويتر","أداة سطر الأوامر","تطوير البرمجيات","التكامل مع تويتر"]}},"owner":"wepee","repo":"openclaw-railway","repoPath":"wepee/openclaw-railway","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bird","description":"X/Twitter CLI for reading, searching, posting, and engagement via cookies.","bodyPreview":"# bird 🐦\n\nFast X/Twitter CLI using GraphQL + cookie auth.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\n# npm/pnpm/bun\nnpm install -g @steipete/bird\n\n# Homebrew (macOS, prebuilt binary)\nbrew install steipete/tap/bird\n\n# One-shot (no install)\nbunx @steipete/bird whoami\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n`bird` uses cookie-based auth.\n\nUse `--auth-token` / `--ct0` to pass cookies directly, or `--cookie-source` for browser cookies.\n\nRun `bird check` to see which source is active. For Arc/Brave, use `--chrome-profile-dir <path>`.\n\n##","body":"# bird 🐦\n\nFast X/Twitter CLI using GraphQL + cookie auth.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\n# npm/pnpm/bun\nnpm install -g @steipete/bird\n\n# Homebrew (macOS, prebuilt binary)\nbrew install steipete/tap/bird\n\n# One-shot (no install)\nbunx @steipete/bird whoami\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n`bird` uses cookie-based auth.\n\nUse `--auth-token` / `--ct0` to pass cookies directly, or `--cookie-source` for browser cookies.\n\nRun `bird check` to see which source is active. For Arc/Brave, use `--chrome-profile-dir <path>`.\n\n## Commands\n\n### Account & Auth\n\n```bash\nbird whoami                    # Show logged-in account\nbird check                     # Show credential sources\nbird query-ids --fresh         # Refresh GraphQL query ID cache\n```\n\n### Reading Tweets\n\n```bash\nbird read <url-or-id>          # Read a single tweet\nbird <url-or-id>               # Shorthand for read\nbird thread <url-or-id>        # Full conversation thread\nbird replies <url-or-id>       # List replies to a tweet\n```\n\n### Timelines\n\n```bash\nbird home                      # Home timeline (For You)\nbird home --following          # Following timeline\nbird user-tweets @handle -n 20 # User''s profile timeline\nbird mentions                  # Tweets mentioning you\nbird mentions --user @handle   # Mentions of another user\n```\n\n### Search\n\n```bash\nbird search \"query\" -n 10\nbird search \"from:steipete\" --all --max-pages 3\n```\n\n### News & Trending\n\n```bash\nbird news -n 10                # AI-curated from Explore tabs\nbird news --ai-only            # Filter to AI-curated only\nbird news --sports             # Sports tab\nbird news --with-tweets        # Include related tweets\nbird trending                  # Alias for news\n```\n\n### Lists\n\n```bash\nbird lists                     # Your lists\nbird lists --member-of         # Lists you''re a member of\nbird list-timeline <id> -n 20  # Tweets from a list\n```\n\n### Bookmarks & Likes\n\n```bash\nbird bookmarks -n 10\nbird bookmarks --folder-id <id>           # Specific folder\nbird bookmarks --include-parent           # Include parent tweet\nbird bookmarks --author-chain             # Author''s self-reply chain\nbird bookmarks --full-chain-only          # Full reply chain\nbird unbookmark <url-or-id>\nbird likes -n 10\n```\n\n### Social Graph\n\n```bash\nbird following -n 20           # Users you follow\nbird followers -n 20           # Users following you\nbird following --user <id>     # Another user''s following\nbird about @handle             # Account origin/location info\n```\n\n### Engagement Actions\n\n```bash\nbird follow @handle            # Follow a user\nbird unfollow @handle          # Unfollow a user\n```\n\n### Posting\n\n```bash\nbird tweet \"hello world\"\nbird reply <url-or-id> \"nice thread!\"\nbird tweet \"check this out\" --media image.png --alt \"description\"\n```\n\n**⚠️ Posting risks**: Posting is more likely to be rate limited; if blocked, use the browser tool instead.\n\n## Media Uploads\n\n```bash\nbird tweet \"hi\" --media img.png --alt \"description\"\nbird tweet \"pics\" --media a.jpg --media b.jpg  # Up to 4 images\nbird tweet \"video\" --media clip.mp4            # Or 1 video\n```\n\n## Pagination\n\nCommands supporting pagination: `replies`, `thread`, `search`, `bookmarks`, `likes`, `list-timeline`, `following`, `followers`, `user-tweets`\n\n```bash\nbird bookmarks --all                    # Fetch all pages\nbird bookmarks --max-pages 3            # Limit pages\nbird bookmarks --cursor <cursor>        # Resume from cursor\nbird replies <id> --all --delay 1000    # Delay between pages (ms)\n```\n\n## Output Options\n\n```bash\n--json          # JSON output\n--json-full     # JSON with raw API response\n--plain         # No emoji, no color (script-friendly)\n--no-emoji      # Disable emoji\n--no-color      # Disable ANSI colors (or set NO_COLOR=1)\n--quote-depth n # Max quoted tweet depth in JSON (default: 1)\n```\n\n## Global Options\n\n```bash\n--auth-token <token>       # Set auth_token cookie\n--ct0 <token>              # Set ct0 cookie\n--cookie-source <source>   # Cookie source for browser cookies (repeatable)\n--chrome-profile <name>    # Chrome profile name\n--chrome-profile-dir <path> # Chrome/Chromium profile dir or cookie DB path\n--firefox-profile <name>   # Firefox profile\n--timeout <ms>             # Request timeout\n--cookie-timeout <ms>      # Cookie extraction timeout\n```\n\n## Config File\n\n`~/.config/bird/config.json5` (global) or `./.birdrc.json5` (project):\n\n```json5\n{\n  cookieSource: [\"chrome\"],\n  chromeProfileDir: \"/path/to/Arc/Profile\",\n  timeoutMs: 20000,\n  quoteDepth: 1,\n}\n```\n\nEnvironment variables: `BIRD_TIMEOUT_MS`, `BIRD_COOKIE_TIMEOUT_MS`, `BIRD_QUOTE_DEPTH`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Query IDs stale (404 errors)\n\n```bash\nbird query-ids --fresh\n```\n\n### Cookie extraction fails\n\n- Check browser is logged into X\n- Try different `--cookie-source`\n- For Arc/Brave: use `--chrome-profile-dir`\n\n---\n\n**TL;DR**: Read/search/engage with CLI. Post carefully or use browser. 🐦\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:06:20.301Z","qualityScore":70}');
