Radix UI e Base UI","Compatibilidade com Tailwind CSS","Mais de 80 ferramentas disponíveis","Sistema de habilidades integrado"],"ru":["Настраиваемые компоненты","Гарантированная доступность","Интеграция с Radix UI и Base UI","Совместимость с Tailwind CSS","Более 80 инструментов доступно","Интегрированная система навыков"],"ar":["مكونات قابلة للتخصيص","إمكانية الوصول garantida","التكامل مع Radix UI و Base UI","التوافق مع Tailwind CSS","أكثر من 80 أداة متاحة","نظام مهارات متكامل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["shadcn-ui","MCP 服务器","LM Studio","组件集成","前端开发","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"ja":["shadcn-ui","MCPサーバー","LM Studio","コンポーネント統合","フロントエンド開発","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"ko":["shadcn-ui","MCP 서버","LM Studio","컴포넌트 통합","프론트엔드 개발","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"es":["shadcn-ui","componentes personalizables","desarrollo web","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","herramientas para desarrolladores"],"fr":["shadcn-ui","composants personnalisables","développement web","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","outils pour les développeurs"],"de":["shadcn-ui","anpassbare Komponenten","Webentwicklung","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS","Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["shadcn-ui","componentes de interface do usuário","desenvolvimento de aplicações","acessibilidade","personalização","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"ru":["shadcn-ui","компоненты пользовательского интерфейса","разработка приложений","доступность","настраиваемость","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"],"ar":["shadcn-ui","مكونات واجهة المستخدم","تطوير التطبيقات","إمكانية الوصول","التخصيص","Radix UI","Base UI","Tailwind CSS"]}},"owner":"marduk191","repo":"qwen3_mcp","repoPath":"marduk191/qwen3_mcp","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"shadcn-ui","description":"Expert guidance for integrating and building applications with shadcn/ui components, including component discovery, installation, customization, and best practices.","bodyPreview":"# shadcn/ui Component Integration\n\nYou are a frontend engineer specialized in building applications with shadcn/ui—a collection of beautifully designed, accessible, and customizable components built with Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS. You help developers discover, integrate, and customize components following best practices.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nshadcn/ui is **not a component library**—it''s a collection of reusable components that you copy into your project. This gives you:\n- **Full owner","body":"# shadcn/ui Component Integration\n\nYou are a frontend engineer specialized in building applications with shadcn/ui—a collection of beautifully designed, accessible, and customizable components built with Radix UI or Base UI and Tailwind CSS. You help developers discover, integrate, and customize components following best practices.\n\n## Core Principles\n\nshadcn/ui is **not a component library**—it''s a collection of reusable components that you copy into your project. This gives you:\n- **Full ownership**: Components live in your codebase, not node_modules\n- **Complete customization**: Modify styling, behavior, and structure freely, including choosing between Radix UI or Base UI primitives\n- **No version lock-in**: Update components selectively at your own pace\n- **Zero runtime overhead**: No library bundle, just the code you need\n\n## Component Discovery and Installation\n\n### 1. Browse Available Components\n\nUse the shadcn MCP tools to explore the component catalog and Registry Directory:\n- **List all components**: Use `list_components` to see the complete catalog\n- **Get component metadata**: Use `get_component_metadata` to understand props, dependencies, and usage\n- **View component demos**: Use `get_component_demo` to see implementation examples\n\n### 2. Component Installation\n\nThere are two approaches to adding components:\n\n**A. Direct Installation (Recommended)**\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add [component-name]\n```\n\nThis command:\n- Downloads the component source code (adapting to your config: Radix vs Base UI)\n- Installs required dependencies\n- Places files in `components/ui/`\n- Updates your `components.json` config\n\n**B. Manual Integration**\n1. Use `get_component` to retrieve the source code\n2. Create the file in `components/ui/[component-name].tsx`\n3. Install peer dependencies manually\n4. Adjust imports if needed\n\n### 3. Registry and Custom Registries\n\nIf working with a custom registry (defined in `components.json`) or exploring the Registry Directory:\n- Use `get_project_registries` to list available registries\n- Use `list_items_in_registries` to see registry-specific components\n- Use `view_items_in_registries` for detailed component information\n- Use `search_items_in_registries` to find specific components\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Initial Configuration\n\nFor **new projects**, use the `create` command to customize everything (style, fonts, component library):\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest create\n```\n\nFor **existing projects**, initialize configuration:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\nThis creates `components.json` with your configuration:\n- **style**: default, new-york (classic) OR choose new visual styles like Vega, Nova, Maia, Lyra, Mira\n- **baseColor**: slate, gray, zinc, neutral, stone\n- **cssVariables**: true/false for CSS variable usage\n- **tailwind config**: paths to Tailwind files\n- **aliases**: import path shortcuts\n- **rsc**: Use React Server Components (yes/no)\n- **rtl**: Enable RTL support (optional)\n\n### Required Dependencies\n\nshadcn/ui components require:\n- **React** (18+)\n- **Tailwind CSS** (3.0+)\n- **Primitives**: Radix UI OR Base UI (depending on your choice)\n- **class-variance-authority** (for variant styling)\n- **clsx** and **tailwind-merge** (for class composition)\n\n## Component Architecture\n\n### File Structure\n```\nsrc/\n├── components/\n│   ├── ui/              # shadcn components\n│   │   ├── button.tsx\n│   │   ├── card.tsx\n│   │   └── dialog.tsx\n│   └── [custom]/        # your composed components\n│       └── user-card.tsx\n├── lib/\n│   └── utils.ts         # cn() utility\n└── app/\n    └── page.tsx\n```\n\n### The `cn()` Utility\n\nAll shadcn components use the `cn()` helper for class merging:\n\n```typescript\nimport { clsx, type ClassValue } from \"clsx\"\nimport { twMerge } from \"tailwind-merge\"\n\nexport function cn(...inputs: ClassValue[]) {\n  return twMerge(clsx(inputs))\n}\n```\n\nThis allows you to:\n- Override default styles without conflicts\n- Conditionally apply classes\n- Merge Tailwind classes intelligently\n\n## Customization Best Practices\n\n### 1. Theme Customization\n\nEdit your Tailwind config and CSS variables in `app/globals.css`:\n\n```css\n@layer base {\n  :root {\n    --background: 0 0% 100%;\n    --foreground: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --primary: 221.2 83.2% 53.3%;\n    /* ... more variables */\n  }\n  \n  .dark {\n    --background: 222.2 84% 4.9%;\n    --foreground: 210 40% 98%;\n    /* ... dark mode overrides */\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Component Variants\n\nUse `class-variance-authority` (cva) for variant logic:\n\n```typescript\nimport { cva } from \"class-variance-authority\"\n\nconst buttonVariants = cva(\n  \"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md\",\n  {\n    variants: {\n      variant: {\n        default: \"bg-primary text-primary-foreground\",\n        outline: \"border border-input\",\n      },\n      size: {\n        default: \"h-10 px-4 py-2\",\n        sm: \"h-9 rounded-md px-3\",\n      },\n    },\n    defaultVariants: {\n      variant: \"default\",\n      size: \"default\",\n    },\n  }\n)\n```\n\n### 3. Extending Components\n\nCreate wrapper components in `components/` (not `components/ui/`):\n\n```typescript\n// components/custom-button.tsx\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Loader2 } from \"lucide-react\"\n\nexport function LoadingButton({ \n  loading, \n  children, \n  ...props \n}: ButtonProps & { loading?: boolean }) {\n  return (\n    <Button disabled={loading} {...props}>\n      {loading && <Loader2 className=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4 animate-spin\" />}\n      {children}\n    </Button>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Blocks and Complex Components\n\nshadcn/ui provides complete UI blocks (authentication forms, dashboards, etc.):\n\n1. **List available blocks**: Use `list_blocks` with optional category filter\n2. **Get block source**: Use `get_block` with the block name\n3. **Install blocks**: Many blocks include multiple component files\n\nBlocks are organized by category:\n- **calendar**: Calendar interfaces\n- **dashboard**: Dashboard layouts\n- **login**: Authentication flows\n- **sidebar**: Navigation sidebars\n- **products**: E-commerce components\n\n## Accessibility\n\nAll shadcn/ui components are built on Radix UI primitives, ensuring:\n- **Keyboard navigation**: Full keyboard support out of the box\n- **Screen reader support**: Proper ARIA attributes\n- **Focus management**: Logical focus flow\n- **Disabled states**: Proper disabled and aria-disabled handling\n\nWhen customizing, maintain accessibility:\n- Keep ARIA attributes\n- Preserve keyboard handlers\n- Test with screen readers\n- Maintain focus indicators\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Form Building\n```typescript\nimport { Button } from \"@/components/ui/button\"\nimport { Input } from \"@/components/ui/input\"\nimport { Label } from \"@/components/ui/label\"\n\n// Use with react-hook-form for validation\nimport { useForm } from \"react-hook-form\"\n```\n\n### Dialog/Modal Patterns\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\n```\n\n### Data Display\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Table,\n  TableBody,\n  TableCell,\n  TableHead,\n  TableHeader,\n  TableRow,\n} from \"@/components/ui/table\"\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Import Errors\n- Check `components.json` for correct alias configuration\n- Verify `tsconfig.json` includes the `@` path alias:\n  ```json\n  {\n    \"compilerOptions\": {\n      \"paths\": {\n        \"@/*\": [\"./src/*\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  ```\n\n### Style Conflicts\n- Ensure Tailwind CSS is properly configured\n- Check that `globals.css` is imported in your root layout\n- Verify CSS variable names match between components and theme\n\n### Missing Dependencies\n- Run component installation via CLI to auto-install deps\n- Manually check `package.json` for required Radix UI packages\n- Use `get_component_metadata` to see dependency lists\n\n### Version Compatibility\n- shadcn/ui v4 requires React 18+ and Next.js 13+ (if using Next.js)\n- Some components require specific Radix UI versions\n- Check documentation for breaking changes between versions\n\n## Validation and Quality\n\nBefore committing components:\n1. **Type check**: Run `tsc --noEmit` to verify TypeScript\n2. **Lint**: Run your linter to catch style issues\n3. **Test accessibility**: Use tools like axe DevTools\n4. **Visual QA**: Test in light and dark modes\n5. **Responsive check**: Verify behavior at different breakpoints\n\n## Resources\n\nRefer to the following resource files for detailed guidance:\n- `resources/setup-guide.md` - Step-by-step project initialization\n- `resources/component-catalog.md` - Complete component reference\n- `resources/customization-guide.md` - Theming and variant patterns\n- `resources/migration-guide.md` - Upgrading from other UI libraries\n\n## Examples\n\nSee the `examples/` directory for:\n- Complete component implementations\n- Form patterns with validation\n- Dashboard layouts\n- Authentication flows\n- Data table implementations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:05:28.139Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents specializing in UI component integration with Radix UI, Base UI, and Tailwind CSS","zh":"适合专门从事 Radix UI、Base UI 和 Tailwind CSS UI 组件集成的前端代理","ja":"Radix UI、Base UI、Tailwind CSS の UI コンポーネント統合を専門とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"Radix UI, Base UI 및 Tailwind CSS의 UI 컴포넌트 통합을 전문으로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend especializados en la integración de componentes de interfaz de usuario con Radix UI, Base UI y Tailwind CSS","fr":"Idéal pour les agents frontend spécialisés dans l''intégration de composants d''interface utilisateur avec Radix UI, Base UI et Tailwind CSS","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die sich auf die Integration von Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit Radix UI, Base UI und Tailwind CSS spezialisieren","pt":"Ideal para agentes de frontend especializados em integração de componentes de interface do usuário com Radix UI, Base UI e Tailwind CSS","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов frontend, специализирующихся на интеграции компонентов пользовательского интерфейса с Radix UI, Base UI и Tailwind CSS","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم المتخصصة في دمج مكونات واجهة المستخدم مع Radix UI و Base UI و Tailwind CSS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to discover, integrate, and customize accessible components following best practices, leveraging a collection of 80+ tools including file operations, git, web search, and skills system, all within the MCP server for LM Studio","zh":"赋予代理发现、集成和定制可访问组件的能力，遵循最佳实践，利用包括文件操作、git、网页搜索和技能系统在内的 80+ 工具，所有这些都在 MCP 服务器的 LM Studio 中","ja":"エージェントに、ベストプラクティスに従ってアクセシブルなコンポーネントを検出、統合、カスタマイズする能力を与え、ファイル操作、Git、Web検索、スキルシステムなど80以上のツールを利用し、MCPサーバーのLM Studio内で","ko":"에이전트가 액세스할 수 있는 구성 요소를 발견, 통합 및 사용자 지정할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 파일 작업, 깃, 웹 검색, 스킬 시스템 등을 포함한 80개 이상의 도구를 활용하여 최선의 방법을 따르며, MCP 서버의 LM 스튜디오 내에서","es":"Permite a los agentes descubrir, integrar y personalizar componentes accesibles siguiendo las mejores prácticas, aprovechando una colección de más de 80 herramientas, incluyendo operaciones de archivo, git, búsqueda web y sistema de habilidades, todo dentro del servidor MCP para LM Studio","fr":"Permet aux agents de découvrir, d''intégrer et de personnaliser des composants accessibles en suivant les meilleures pratiques, en exploitant une collection de plus de 80 outils, notamment des opérations de fichiers, git, recherche web et système de compétences, le tout au sein du serveur MCP pour LM Studio","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, zugängliche Komponenten zu entdecken, zu integrieren und anzupassen, indem sie bewährte Verfahren anwenden und eine Sammlung von über 80 Tools nutzen, darunter Dateivorgänge, Git, Web-Suche und Fertigkeitensystem, alles innerhalb des MCP-Servers für LM Studio","pt":"Permite que os agentes descubram, integrem e personalizem componentes acessíveis seguindo as melhores práticas, aproveitando uma coleção de 80+ ferramentas, incluindo operações de arquivo, git, pesquisa na web e sistema de habilidades, todas dentro do servidor MCP para LM Studio","ru":"Позволяет агентам обнаруживать, интегрировать и настраивать доступные компоненты, следуя лучшим практикам, используя коллекцию из 80+ инструментов, включая файловые операции, git, поиск в Интернете и систему навыков, все trong сервере MCP для LM Studio","ar":"يتمكن الوكيل من اكتشاف دمج مكونات وصول سهلة اتباعا لأفضل الممارسات، والاستفادة من مجموعة من أدوات 80+ بما في ذلك عمليات الملفات وجيت و بحث الويب ونظام المهارات، كل ذلك داخل خادم MCP لمكتب LM"},"useCases":{"en":["Integrating shadcn/ui components into existing projects for enhanced accessibility","Customizing UI components with Tailwind CSS for personalized branding","Utilizing the skills system for streamlined workflow management"],"zh":["将 shadcn/ui 组件集成到现有项目中以增强可访问性","使用 Tailwind CSS 自定义 UI 组件以实现个性化品牌化","利用技能系统实现工作流管理的简化"],"ja":["既存のプロジェクトに shadcn/ui コンポーネントを統合してアクセシビリティを高める","Tailwind CSS を使用して UI コンポーネントをカスタマイズしてブランド化をパーソナライズする","スキルシステムを使用してワークフローの管理をストリームライン化する"],"ko":["기존 프로젝트에 shadcn/ui 구성 요소를 통합하여 접근성을 향상시키는 것","Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 UI 구성 요소를 사용자 지정하여 브랜드를 개인화하는 것","스킬 시스템을 사용하여 워크플로우 관리를 간소화하는 것"],"es":["Integrar componentes de shadcn/ui en proyectos existentes para mejorar la accesibilidad","Personalizar componentes de interfaz de usuario con Tailwind CSS para una marca personalizada","Utilizar el sistema de habilidades para una gestión de flujo de trabajo optimizada"],"fr":["Intégrer des composants shadcn/ui dans des projets existants pour améliorer l''accessibilité","Personnaliser des composants d''interface utilisateur avec Tailwind CSS pour une marque personnalisée","Utiliser le système de compétences pour une gestion de flux de travail optimisée"],"de":["shadcn/ui-Komponenten in bestehende Projekte integrieren, um die Zugänglichkeit zu verbessern","Benutzeroberflächenkomponenten mit Tailwind CSS anpassen, um eine personalisierte Marke zu erstellen","Das Fertigkeitensystem nutzen, um die Workflow-Verwaltung zu optimieren"],"pt":["Integrar componentes shadcn/ui em projetos existentes para melhorar a acessibilidade","Personalizar componentes de interface do usuário com Tailwind CSS para marca pessoal","Utilizar o sistema de habilidades para gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho otimizado"],"ru":["Интегрировать компоненты shadcn/ui в существующие проекты для улучшения доступности","Настроить компоненты пользовательского интерфейса с помощью Tailwind CSS для персональной марки","Использовать систему навыков для оптимизированного управления рабочим процессом"],"ar":["دمج مكونات shadcn/ui في مشاريع موجودة لتحسين سهولة الوصول","تخصيص مكونات واجهة المستخدم باستخدام Tailwind CSS للعلامة التجارية الشخصية","استخدام نظام المهارات لإدارة تدفق العمل المُثلى"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires frontend development expertise","Not a traditional component library, but rather a collection of reusable components"],"zh":["需要前端开发专业知识","不是传统的组件库，而是一组可重用的组件"],"ja":["フロントエンド開発の専門知識が必要"," тради的なコンポーネントライブラリではなく、再利用可能なコンポーネントのコレクション"],"ko":["프론트엔드 개발 전문 지식이 필요","전통적인 컴포넌트 라이브러리가 아니라 재사용 가능한 컴포넌트의 컬렉션"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en desarrollo frontend","No es una biblioteca de componentes tradicional, sino más bien una colección de componentes reutilizables"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en développement frontend","Ne pas être une bibliothèque de composants traditionnelle, mais plutôt une collection de composants réutilisables"],"de":["Benötigt Expertenwissen im Bereich Frontend-Entwicklung","Keine herkömmliche Komponentenbibliothek, sondern eher eine Sammlung wiederverwendbarer Komponenten"],"pt":["Exige especialização em desenvolvimento frontend","Não é uma biblioteca de componentes tradicional, mas sim uma coleção de componentes reutilizáveis"],"ru":["Требует специализации в разработке frontend","Не является традиционной библиотекой компонентов, а скорее коллекцией повторно используемых компонентов"],"ar":["يتطلب تخصصا في تطوير واجهة المستخدم الأمامية","ليست مكتبة مكونات تقليدية، ولكن مجموعة من المكونات القابلة لإعادة الاستخدام"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
