 analiza problemas y publica en Confluence","fr":"Génère des rapports d''état de projet automatiquement, analyse les problèmes et publie sur Confluence","de":"Erstellt Projektstatusberichte automatisch, analysiert Probleme und veröffentlicht in Confluence","pt":"O skill de relatório de status gera relatórios de projeto automaticamente, consultando o Jira e publicando no Confluence.","ru":"Навык отчета о статусе генерирует автоматические отчеты о проекте, запрашивая Jira и публикуя в Confluence.","ar":"مهارة تقرير الحالة تلقائي генерирует تقارير المشروع، استعلام جيرا ونشر في كونفلونس","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["自动查询Jira项目状态","分析问题和阻塞","生成格式化的状态报告","发布报告到Confluence","支持交互式报告生成","可自定义报告范围和受众"],"ja":["Jiraのプロジェクトステータスを自動的に照会","問題とブロッカーを分析","整形式のステータス報告を生成","報告をConfluenceに公開","インタラクティブな報告生成をサポート","報告の範囲と対象をカスタマイズ可能"],"ko":["Jira 프로젝트 상태를 자동으로 조회","문제와 블로커를 분석","형식화된 상태 보고서를 생성","보고서를 Confluence에 발행","인터랙티브한 보고서 생성을 지원","보고서 범위와 대상자를 커스터마이징 가능"],"es":["Consulta automática de Jira para obtener el estado del proyecto","Análisis de problemas y generación de informes formateados","Publicación en Confluence","Personalización del alcance y la audiencia","Integración con Jira y Confluence"],"fr":["Interrogation automatique de Jira pour obtenir l''état du projet","Analyse des problèmes et génération de rapports formatés","Publication sur Confluence","Personnalisation de la portée et du public","Intégration à Jira et Confluence"],"de":["Automatische Abfrage von Jira für den Projektstatus","Analyse von Problemen und Erstellung formatierter Berichte","Veröffentlichung in Confluence","Anpassung des Umfangs und der Zielgruppe","Integration mit Jira und Confluence"],"pt":["Geração automática de relatórios de status","Integração com Jira para obtenção de informações","Publicação de relatórios no Confluence","Análise de problemas e bloqueios","Atualização de progresso do projeto","Personalização do escopo do relatório"],"ru":["Автоматическая генерация отчетов о статусе","Интеграция с Jira для получения информации","Публикация отчетов в Confluence","Анализ проблем и блокировок","Обновление прогресса проекта","Настройка объема отчета"],"ar":["توليد تقارير حالة تلقائي","التكامل مع جيرا للحصول على المعلومات","نشر التقارير في كونفلونس","تحليل المشاكل والحواجز","تحديث تقدم المشروع","تخصيص نطاق التقرير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["项目状态报告","Jira报告","Confluence报告","自动报告生成","交互式报告","项目进度跟踪","问题跟踪","阻塞跟踪"],"ja":["プロジェクトステータス報告","Jira報告","Confluence報告","自動報告生成","インタラクティブな報告","プロジェクト進捗追跡","問題追跡","ブロッカー追跡"],"ko":["프로젝트 상태 보고서","Jira 보고서","Confluence 보고서","자동 보고서 생성","인터랙티브한 보고서","프로젝트 진행 상황 추적","문제 추적","블로커 추적"],"es":["informe de estado del proyecto","proyecto de gestión de proyectos","Jira","Confluence","automatización de informes","generación de informes","análisis de problemas","progreso del proyecto","bloqueos del proyecto"],"fr":["rapport d''état de projet","gestion de projet","Jira","Confluence","automatisation de rapports","génération de rapports","analyse de problèmes","progrès du projet","blocages du projet"],"de":["Projektstatusbericht","Projektmanagement","Jira","Confluence","Automatisierung von Berichten","Erstellung von Berichten","Analyse von Problemen","Fortschritt des Projekts","Blockierungen des Projekts"],"pt":["relatório de status","projeto de status","atualização semanal","reunião diária","relatório do jira","resumo do projeto","bloqueios","atualização de progresso","relatório do confluence","relatório de sprint"],"ru":["отчет о статусе","проектный статус","недельный обзор","ежедневная встреча","отчет jira","обзор проекта","блокировки","обновление прогресса","отчет confluence","отчет спринта"],"ar":["تقرير الحالة","حالة المشروع","التحديث الأسبوعي","اللقاء اليومي","تقرير جيرا","ملخص المشروع","الحواجز","تحديث التقدم","تقرير كونفلونس","تقرير سبورنت"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"generate-status-report","description":"Generate project status reports from Jira issues and publish to Confluence. When Claude needs to: (1) Create a status report for a project, (2) Summarize project progress or updates, (3) Generate weekly/daily reports from Jira, (4) Publish status summaries to Confluence, or (5) Analyze project blockers and completion. Queries Jira issues, categorizes by status/priority, and creates formatted reports for delivery managers and executives.","bodyPreview":"# Generate Status Report\n\n## Keywords\nstatus report, project status, weekly update, daily standup, Jira report, project summary, blockers, progress update, Confluence report, sprint report, project update, publish to Confluence, write to Confluence, post report\n\nAutomatically query Jira for project status, analyze issues, and generate formatted status reports published to Confluence.\n\n**CRITICAL**: This skill should be **interactive**. Always clarify scope (time period, audience, Confluence dest","body":"# Generate Status Report\n\n## Keywords\nstatus report, project status, weekly update, daily standup, Jira report, project summary, blockers, progress update, Confluence report, sprint report, project update, publish to Confluence, write to Confluence, post report\n\nAutomatically query Jira for project status, analyze issues, and generate formatted status reports published to Confluence.\n\n**CRITICAL**: This skill should be **interactive**. Always clarify scope (time period, audience, Confluence destination) with the user before or after generating the report. Do not silently skip Confluence publishing—always offer it.\n\n## Workflow\n\nGenerating a status report follows these steps:\n\n1. **Identify scope** - Determine project, time period, and target audience\n2. **Query Jira** - Fetch relevant issues using JQL queries\n3. **Analyze data** - Categorize issues and identify key insights\n4. **Format report** - Structure content based on audience and purpose\n5. **Publish to Confluence** - Create or update a page with the report\n\n## Step 1: Identify Scope\n\n**IMPORTANT**: If the user''s request is missing key information, ASK before proceeding with queries. Do not assume defaults without confirmation for Confluence publishing.\n\nClarify these details:\n\n**Project identification:**\n- Which Jira project key? (e.g., \"PROJ\", \"ENG\", \"MKTG\")\n- If the user mentions a project by name but not key, search Jira to find the project key\n\n**Time period:**\n- If not specified, ask: \"What time period should this report cover? (default: last 7 days)\"\n- Options: Weekly (7 days), Daily (24 hours), Sprint-based (2 weeks), Custom period\n\n**Target audience:**\n- If not specified, ask: \"Who is this report for? (Executives/Delivery Managers, Team-level, or Daily standup)\"\n- **Executives/Delivery Managers**: High-level summary with key metrics and blockers\n- **Team-level**: Detailed breakdown with issue-by-issue status  \n- **Daily standup**: Brief update on yesterday/today/blockers\n\n**Report destination:**\n- **ALWAYS ASK** if not specified: \"Would you like me to publish this report to Confluence? If so, which space should I use?\"\n- If user says yes: Ask for space name or offer to list available spaces\n- Determine: New page or update existing page?\n- Ask about parent page if creating under a specific section\n\n## Step 2: Query Jira\n\nUse the `searchJiraIssuesUsingJql` tool to fetch issues. Build JQL queries based on report needs.\n\n### Common Query Patterns\n\nFor comprehensive queries, use the `scripts/jql_builder.py` utility to programmatically build JQL strings. For quick queries, reference `references/jql-patterns.md` for examples.\n\n**All open issues in project:**\n```jql\nproject = \"PROJECT_KEY\" AND status != Done ORDER BY priority DESC, updated DESC\n```\n\n**Issues updated in last week:**\n```jql\nproject = \"PROJECT_KEY\" AND updated >= -7d ORDER BY priority DESC\n```\n\n**High priority and blocked issues:**\n```jql\nproject = \"PROJECT_KEY\" AND (priority IN (Highest, High) OR status = Blocked) AND status != Done ORDER BY priority DESC\n```\n\n**Completed in reporting period:**\n```jql\nproject = \"PROJECT_KEY\" AND status = Done AND resolved >= -7d ORDER BY resolved DESC\n```\n\n### Query Strategy\n\nFor most reports, execute multiple targeted queries rather than one large query:\n\n1. **Completed issues**: Get recently resolved tickets\n2. **In-progress issues**: Get active work items\n3. **Blocked issues**: Get blockers requiring attention\n4. **High priority open**: Get critical upcoming work\n\nUse `maxResults: 100` for initial queries. If pagination is needed, use `nextPageToken` from results.\n\n### Data to Extract\n\nFor each issue, capture:\n- `key` (e.g., \"PROJ-123\")\n- `summary` (issue title)\n- `status` (current state)\n- `priority` (importance level)\n- `assignee` (who''s working on it)\n- `created` / `updated` / `resolved` dates\n- `description` (if needed for context on blockers)\n\n## Step 3: Analyze Data\n\nProcess the retrieved issues to identify:\n\n**Metrics:**\n- Total issues by status (Done, In Progress, Blocked, etc.)\n- Completion rate (if historical data available)\n- Number of high priority items\n- Unassigned issue count\n\n**Key insights:**\n- Major accomplishments (recently completed high-value items)\n- Critical blockers (blocked high priority issues)\n- At-risk items (overdue or stuck in progress)\n- Resource bottlenecks (one assignee with many issues)\n\n**Categorization:**\nGroup issues logically:\n- By status (Done, In Progress, Blocked)\n- By priority (Highest → Low)\n- By assignee or team\n- By component or epic (if relevant)\n\n## Step 4: Format Report\n\nSelect the appropriate template based on audience. Templates are in `references/report-templates.md`.\n\n### For Executives and Delivery Managers\n\nUse **Executive Summary Format**:\n- Brief overall status (🟢 On Track / 🟡 At Risk / 🔴 Blocked)\n- Key metrics (total, completed, in progress, blocked)\n- Top 3 highlights (major accomplishments)\n- Critical blockers with impact\n- Upcoming priorities\n\n**Keep it concise** - 1-2 pages maximum. Focus on what matters to decision-makers.\n\n### For Team-Level Reports\n\nUse **Detailed Technical Format**:\n- Completed issues listed with keys\n- In-progress issues with assignee and priority\n- Blocked issues with blocker description and action needed\n- Risks and dependencies\n- Next period priorities\n\n**Include more detail** - Team needs issue-level visibility.\n\n### For Daily Updates\n\nUse **Daily Standup Format**:\n- What was completed yesterday\n- What''s planned for today\n- Current blockers\n- Brief notes\n\n**Keep it brief** - This is a quick sync, not comprehensive analysis.\n\n## Step 5: Publish to Confluence\n\n**After generating the report, ALWAYS offer to publish to Confluence** (unless user explicitly said not to).\n\nIf user hasn''t specified Confluence details yet, ask:\n- \"Would you like me to publish this report to Confluence?\"\n- \"Which Confluence space should I use?\"\n- \"Should this be nested under a specific parent page?\"\n\nUse the `createConfluencePage` tool to publish the report.\n\n**Page creation:**\n```\ncreateConfluencePage(\n    cloudId=\"[obtained from getConfluenceSpaces or URL]\",\n    spaceId=\"[numerical space ID]\",\n    title=\"[Project Name] - Status Report - [Date]\",\n    body=\"[formatted report in Markdown]\",\n    contentFormat=\"markdown\",\n    parentId=\"[optional - parent page ID if nesting under another page]\"\n)\n```\n\n**Title format examples:**\n- \"Project Phoenix - Weekly Status - Dec 3, 2025\"\n- \"Engineering Sprint 23 - Status Report\"\n- \"Q4 Initiatives - Status Update - Week 49\"\n\n**Body formatting:**\nWrite the report content in Markdown. The tool will convert it to Confluence format. Use:\n- Headers (`#`, `##`, `###`) for structure\n- Bullet points for lists\n- Bold (`**text**`) for emphasis\n- Tables for metrics if needed\n- Links to Jira issues: `[PROJ-123](https://yourinstance.atlassian.net/browse/PROJ-123)`\n\n**Best practices:**\n- Include the report date prominently\n- Link directly to relevant Jira issues\n- Use consistent naming conventions for recurring reports\n- Consider creating under a \"Status Reports\" parent page for organization\n\n### Finding the Right Space\n\nIf the user doesn''t specify a Confluence space:\n\n1. Use `getConfluenceSpaces` to list available spaces\n2. Look for spaces related to the project (matching project name or key)\n3. If unsure, ask the user which space to use\n4. Default to creating in the most relevant team or project space\n\n### Updating Existing Reports\n\nIf updating an existing page instead of creating new:\n\n1. Get the current page content:\n```\ngetConfluencePage(\n    cloudId=\"...\",\n    pageId=\"123456\",\n    contentFormat=\"markdown\"\n)\n```\n\n2. Update the page with new content:\n```\nupdateConfluencePage(\n    cloudId=\"...\",\n    pageId=\"123456\",\n    body=\"[updated report content]\",\n    contentFormat=\"markdown\",\n    versionMessage=\"Updated with latest status - Dec 8, 2025\"\n)\n```\n\n## Complete Example Workflow\n\n**User request:** \"Generate a status report for Project Phoenix and publish it to Confluence\"\n\n**Step 1 - Identify scope:**\n- Project: Phoenix (need to find project key)\n- Time period: Last week (default)\n- Audience: Not specified, assume executive level\n- Destination: Confluence, need to find appropriate space\n\n**Step 2 - Query Jira:**\n```python\n# Find project key first\nsearchJiraIssuesUsingJql(\n    cloudId=\"...\",\n    jql=''project = \"PHOENIX\" OR project = \"PHX\"'',\n    maxResults=1\n)\n\n# Query completed issues\nsearchJiraIssuesUsingJql(\n    cloudId=\"...\",\n    jql=''project = \"PHX\" AND status = Done AND resolved >= -7d'',\n    maxResults=50\n)\n\n# Query blocked issues\nsearchJiraIssuesUsingJql(\n    cloudId=\"...\",\n    jql=''project = \"PHX\" AND status = Blocked'',\n    maxResults=50\n)\n\n# Query in-progress high priority\nsearchJiraIssuesUsingJql(\n    cloudId=\"...\",\n    jql=''project = \"PHX\" AND status IN (\"In Progress\", \"In Review\") AND priority IN (Highest, High)'',\n    maxResults=50\n)\n```\n\n**Step 3 - Analyze:**\n- 15 issues completed (metrics)\n- 3 critical blockers (key insight)\n- Major accomplishment: API integration completed (highlight)\n\n**Step 4 - Format:**\nUse Executive Summary Format from templates. Create concise report with metrics, highlights, and blockers.\n\n**Step 5 - Publish:**\n```python\n# Find appropriate space\ngetConfluenceSpaces(cloudId=\"...\")\n\n# Create page\ncreateConfluencePage(\n    cloudId=\"...\",\n    spaceId=\"12345\",\n    title=\"Project Phoenix - Weekly Status - Dec 3, 2025\",\n    body=\"[formatted markdown report]\",\n    contentFormat=\"markdown\"\n)\n```\n\n## Tips for Quality Reports\n\n**Be data-driven:**\n- Include specific numbers and metrics\n- Reference issue keys directly\n- Show trends when possible (e.g., \"completed 15 vs 12 last week\")\n\n**Highlight what matters:**\n- Lead with the most important information\n- Flag blockers prominently\n- Celebrate significant wins\n\n**Make it actionable:**\n- For blockers, state what action is needed and from whom\n- For risks, provide mitigation options\n- For priorities, be specific about next steps\n\n**Keep it consistent:**\n- Use the same format for recurring reports\n- Maintain predictable structure\n- Include comparable metrics week-over-week\n\n**Provide context:**\n- Link to Jira for details\n- Explain the impact of blockers\n- Connect work to business objectives when possible\n\n## Resources\n\n### scripts/jql_builder.py\nPython utility for programmatically building JQL queries. Use this when you need to construct complex or dynamic queries. Import and use the helper functions rather than manually concatenating JQL strings.\n\n### references/jql-patterns.md\nQuick reference of common JQL query patterns for status reports. Use this for standard queries or as a starting point for custom queries.\n\n### references/report-templates.md\nDetailed templates for different report types and audiences. Reference this to select the appropriate format and structure for your report.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:06:08.919Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Project Management Agents automating Jira data extraction and Confluence reporting workflows.","zh":"适用于项目管理代理自动化Jira数据提取和Confluence报告工作流。","ja":"Jiraデータ抽出とConfluenceレポートワークフローの自動化に適したプロジェクト管理エージェントです。","ko":"Jira 데이터 추출 및 Confluence 보고서 워크플로 자동화를 위한 프로젝트 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión de proyectos que automatizan la extracción de datos de Jira y los flujos de trabajo de informes de Confluence.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de projet automatisant l''extraction de données Jira et les flux de travail de reporting Confluence.","de":"Ideal für Projektmanagement-Agenten, die die Jira-Datenausgabe und Confluence-Berichtsworkflows automatisieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos automatizando a extração de dados do Jira e fluxos de trabalho de relatórios do Confluence.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления проектами, автоматизирующих извлечение данных Jira и рабочие процессы отчетности Confluence.","ar":"مثالي لعمیلات إدارة المشاريع التي تتم أتمتة استخراج بيانات Jira وعمليات تقارير Confluence."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated querying of Jira APIs for project status data, analysis of issue metrics, and generation of formatted reports published directly to Confluence with interactive scope clarification.","zh":"实现自动查询Jira API以获取项目状态数据、分析问题指标并生成直接发布到Confluence的格式化报告，具有交互式范围澄清功能。","ja":"Jira APIの自動照会を可能にし、プロジェクトのステータスデータを取得し、問題メトリクスを分析し、Confluenceに直接公開するフォーマット済みのレポートを生成し、対話形式の範囲の明確化を行う。","ko":"Jira API의 자동 쿼리를 가능하게 하여 프로젝트 상태 데이터를 가져오고 문제 메트릭스를 분석하고 Confluence에 직접 게시하는 형식화된 보고서를 생성하며 상호 작용 형태의 범위 명확화를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la consulta automática de las API de Jira para obtener datos de estado del proyecto, análisis de métricas de problemas y generación de informes formateados publicados directamente en Confluence con aclaración de alcance interactiva.","fr":"Permet la requête automatisée des API Jira pour les données de statut de projet, l''analyse des métriques de problèmes et la génération de rapports formatés publiés directement sur Confluence avec une clarification de portée interactive.","de":"Ermöglicht die automatisierte Abfrage der Jira-APIs für Projektstatusdaten, Analyse von Issues-Metriken und Generierung von formatierten Berichten, die direkt in Confluence veröffentlicht werden, mit interaktiver Klärung des Umfangs.","pt":"Permite a consulta automatizada das APIs do Jira para dados de status do projeto, análise de métricas de problemas e geração de relatórios formatados publicados diretamente no Confluence com esclarecimento de escopo interativo.","ru":"Позволяет автоматически запрашивать API Jira для данных статуса проекта, анализировать метрики проблем и генерировать форматированные отчеты, публикуемые直接 в Confluence с интерактивным уточнением объема.","ar":"يمكّن الاستفسار التلقائي لواجهات برمجة التطبيقات Jira لبيانات حالة المشروع وتحليل مقاييس المشكلات وإنشاء تقارير معالجة منشورة مباشرة إلى Confluence مع توضيح نطاق تفاعلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating weekly project status reports","Generating daily standup summaries from Jira data","Publishing sprint reports to Confluence","Identifying and reporting project blockers"],"zh":["自动化每周项目状态报告","从Jira数据生成每日站立汇总","将冲刺报告发布到Confluence","识别和报告项目阻塞器"],"ja":["週次プロジェクトステータスレポートの自動化","Jiraデータから毎日スタンドアップサマリーを生成","スプリントレポートをConfluenceに公開","プロジェクトのブロッカーを特定し、報告"],"ko":["주간 프로젝트 상태 보고서 자동화","Jira 데이터에서 일일 스탠드업 요약 생성","스프린트 보고서를 Confluence에 게시","프로젝트 블로커 식별 및 보고"],"es":["Automatización de informes semanales de estado del proyecto","Generación de resúmenes diarios de standup a partir de datos de Jira","Publicación de informes de sprint en Confluence","Identificación y notificación de bloqueadores de proyecto"],"fr":["Automatisation des rapports hebdomadaires de statut de projet","Génération de résumés quotidiens de standup à partir de données Jira","Publication de rapports de sprint sur Confluence","Identification et signalement des bloqueurs de projet"],"de":["Automatisierung von wöchentlichen Projektstatusberichten","Erstellung von täglichen Standup-Zusammenfassungen aus Jira-Daten","Veröffentlichung von Sprint-Berichten in Confluence","Identifizierung und Meldung von Projektblockierern"],"pt":["Automatizar relatórios semanais de status do projeto","Gerar resumos diários de reuniões a partir de dados do Jira","Publicar relatórios de sprint no Confluence","Identificar e relatar bloqueadores de projeto"],"ru":["Автоматизировать еженедельные отчеты о статусе проекта","Генерировать ежедневные сводки стояний из данных Jira","Публиковать отчеты о спринте в Confluence","Определить и отчитаться о блокировках проекта"],"ar":["أتمتة تقارير حالة المشروع الأسبوعية","توليد ملخصات يومية للعرض من بيانات Jira","نشر تقارير السبرينت في Confluence","تحديد وتقديم تقارير عن معوقات المشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Jira API access and credentials","Needs Confluence publishing permissions","Interactive scope clarification mandatory before execution"],"zh":["需要Jira API访问和凭据","需要Confluence发布权限","执行前交互式范围澄清是必需的"],"ja":["Jira APIへのアクセスと資格情報が必要","Confluenceへの公開権限が必要","実行前に対話形式の範囲の明確化が必須"],"ko":["Jira API 액세스 및 자격 증명이 필요","Confluence 게시 권한이 필요","실행 전 상호 작용 형태의 범위 명확화가 필수"],"es":["Requiere acceso y credenciales a la API de Jira","Necesita permisos de publicación en Confluence","La aclaración de alcance interactiva es obligatoria antes de la ejecución"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès et des informations d''identification pour l''API Jira","Nécessite des autorisations de publication sur Confluence","La clarification de portée interactive est obligatoire avant l''exécution"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff und Anmeldeinformationen für die Jira-API","Benötigt Veröffentlichungsberechtigungen in Confluence","Die interaktive Klärung des Umfangs ist vor der Ausführung obligatorisch"],"pt":["Requer acesso e credenciais à API do Jira","Necessita permissões de publicação do Confluence","Esclarecimento de escopo interativo obrigatório antes da execução"],"ru":["Требует доступа и учетных данных к API Jira","Требует разрешений на публикацию в Confluence","Интерактивное уточнение объема обязательно перед выполнением"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات Jira وأصولها","يحتاج إلى صلاحيات نشر في Confluence","التوضيح التفاعلي للنطاق إلزامي قبل التنفيذ"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('monris92/opencla/bird', 'community', 'monris92', 'opencla', 'monris92/opencla', 'bird', 0, 0, 70, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z', '2026-02-18T04:06:41.367Z', NULL, '{"id":"monris92/opencla/bird","name":"bird","description":{"es":"Bird es una CLI de Twitter que utiliza GraphQL y autenticación de cookies para proporcionar una experiencia de desarrollo rápida y segura","fr":"Bird est une CLI Twitter qui utilise GraphQL et l''authentification par cookies pour offrir une expérience de développement rapide et sécurisée","de":"Bird ist eine Twitter-CLI, die GraphQL und Cookie-Authentifizierung verwendet, um eine schnelle und sichere Entwicklungserfahrung zu bieten","pt":"O Bird é uma CLI do Twitter que utiliza autenticação por cookie e GraphQL para interagir com a plataforma de forma rápida e eficiente.","ru":"Bird - это CLI для Twitter, которая использует аутентификацию по cookie и GraphQL для взаимодействия с платформой быстро и эффективно.","ar":"Bird هو واجهة سطر أوامر تويتر يستخدم التحقق من الهوية بواسطة ملفات تعريف الارتباط و GraphQL للتفاعل مع المنصة بسرعة وكفاءة.","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"es":"Bird: CLI de Twitter con GraphQL y autenticación de cookies","fr":"Bird : CLI Twitter avec GraphQL et authentification par c...","de":"Bird: Twitter-CLI mit GraphQL und Cookie-Authentifizierung","pt":"Bird: CLI do Twitter com Autenticação por Cookie","ru":"Bird: CLI для Twitter с аутентификацией по cookie","ar":"鳥: واجهة سطر أوامر تويتر باستخدام تحقق الهوية بواسطة ملفا...","en":"bird"},"description":{"es":"Bird es una CLI de Twitter que utiliza GraphQL y autenticación de cookies para proporcionar una experiencia de desarrollo rápida y segura","fr":"Bird est une CLI Twitter qui utilise GraphQL et l''authentification par cookies pour offrir une expérience de développement rapide et sécurisée","de":"Bird ist eine Twitter-CLI, die GraphQL und Cookie-Authentifizierung verwendet, um eine schnelle und sichere Entwicklungserfahrung zu bieten","pt":"O Bird é uma CLI do Twitter que utiliza autenticação por cookie e GraphQL para interagir com a plataforma de forma rápida e eficiente.","ru":"Bird - это CLI для Twitter, которая использует аутентификацию по cookie и GraphQL для взаимодействия с платформой быстро и эффективно.","ar":"Bird هو واجهة سطر أوامر تويتر يستخدم التحقق من الهوية بواسطة ملفات تعريف الارتباط و GraphQL للتفاعل مع المنصة بسرعة وكفاءة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"es":["Utiliza GraphQL para una mayor eficiencia","Autenticación de cookies para una mayor seguridad","Instalación fácil mediante npm o Homebrew","Soporte para autenticación de navegador","Comandos personalizables para una mayor flexibilidad","Soporte para perfiles de Chrome personalizados"],"fr":["Utilise GraphQL pour une plus grande efficacité","Authentification par cookies pour une plus grande sécurité","Installation facile via npm ou Homebrew","Prise en charge de l''authentification du navigateur","Commandes personnalisables pour une plus grande flexibilité","Prise en charge des profils Chrome personnalisés"],"de":["Verwendet GraphQL für eine höhere Effizienz","Cookie-Authentifizierung für eine höhere Sicherheit","Einfache Installation über npm oder Homebrew","Unterstützung für Browser-Authentifizierung","Anpassbare Befehle für eine höhere Flexibilität","Unterstützung für benutzerdefinierte Chrome-Profile"],"pt":["Autenticação por cookie","Acesso ao Twitter via GraphQL","Instalação via npm ou Homebrew","Uso de token de autenticação","Suporte a perfis do Chrome","Comando de verificação de autenticação"],"ru":["Аутентификация по cookie","Доступ к Twitter через GraphQL","Установка через npm или Homebrew","Использование токена аутентификации","Поддержка профилей Chrome","Команда проверки аутентификации"],"ar":["التحقق من الهوية بواسطة ملفات تعريف الارتباط","الوصول إلى تويتر عبر GraphQL","التثبيت عبر npm أو Homebrew","استخدام رمز التحقق من الهوية","دعم ملفات تعريف الارتباط لبرنامج Chrome","أمر التحقق من التحقق من الهوية"]},"keywords":{"es":["CLI de Twitter","GraphQL","autenticación de cookies","desarrollo de Twitter","herramientas de desarrollo","Twitter API","autenticación de navegador","perfiles de Chrome personalizados"],"fr":["CLI Twitter","GraphQL","authentification par cookies","développement Twitter","outils de développement","API Twitter","authentification du navigateur","profils Chrome personnalisés"],"de":["Twitter-CLI","GraphQL","Cookie-Authentifizierung","Twitter-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Twitter-API","Browser-Authentifizierung","benutzerdefinierte Chrome-Profile"],"pt":["CLI do Twitter","Autenticação por cookie","GraphQL","Desenvolvimento de software","Ferramentas de linha de comando","Acesso ao Twitter","Token de autenticação","Perfis do Chrome"],"ru":["CLI для Twitter","Аутентификация по cookie","GraphQL","Разработка программного обеспечения","Инструменты командной строки","Доступ к Twitter","Токен аутентификации","Профили Chrome"],"ar":["واجهة سطر أوامر تويتر","التحقق من الهوية بواسطة ملفات تعريف الارتباط","GraphQL","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات سطر الأوامر","الوصول إلى تويتر","رمز التحقق من الهوية","ملفات تعريف الارتباط لبرنامج Chrome"]}},"owner":"monris92","repo":"opencla","repoPath":"monris92/opencla","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bird","description":"X/Twitter CLI for reading, searching, posting, and engagement via cookies.","bodyPreview":"# bird 🐦\n\nFast X/Twitter CLI using GraphQL + cookie auth.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\n# npm/pnpm/bun\nnpm install -g @steipete/bird\n\n# Homebrew (macOS, prebuilt binary)\nbrew install steipete/tap/bird\n\n# One-shot (no install)\nbunx @steipete/bird whoami\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n`bird` uses cookie-based auth.\n\nUse `--auth-token` / `--ct0` to pass cookies directly, or `--cookie-source` for browser cookies.\n\nRun `bird check` to see which source is active. For Arc/Brave, use `--chrome-profile-dir <path>`.\n\n##","body":"# bird 🐦\n\nFast X/Twitter CLI using GraphQL + cookie auth.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\n# npm/pnpm/bun\nnpm install -g @steipete/bird\n\n# Homebrew (macOS, prebuilt binary)\nbrew install steipete/tap/bird\n\n# One-shot (no install)\nbunx @steipete/bird whoami\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n`bird` uses cookie-based auth.\n\nUse `--auth-token` / `--ct0` to pass cookies directly, or `--cookie-source` for browser cookies.\n\nRun `bird check` to see which source is active. For Arc/Brave, use `--chrome-profile-dir <path>`.\n\n## Commands\n\n### Account & Auth\n\n```bash\nbird whoami                    # Show logged-in account\nbird check                     # Show credential sources\nbird query-ids --fresh         # Refresh GraphQL query ID cache\n```\n\n### Reading Tweets\n\n```bash\nbird read <url-or-id>          # Read a single tweet\nbird <url-or-id>               # Shorthand for read\nbird thread <url-or-id>        # Full conversation thread\nbird replies <url-or-id>       # List replies to a tweet\n```\n\n### Timelines\n\n```bash\nbird home                      # Home timeline (For You)\nbird home --following          # Following timeline\nbird user-tweets @handle -n 20 # User''s profile timeline\nbird mentions                  # Tweets mentioning you\nbird mentions --user @handle   # Mentions of another user\n```\n\n### Search\n\n```bash\nbird search \"query\" -n 10\nbird search \"from:steipete\" --all --max-pages 3\n```\n\n### News & Trending\n\n```bash\nbird news -n 10                # AI-curated from Explore tabs\nbird news --ai-only            # Filter to AI-curated only\nbird news --sports             # Sports tab\nbird news --with-tweets        # Include related tweets\nbird trending                  # Alias for news\n```\n\n### Lists\n\n```bash\nbird lists                     # Your lists\nbird lists --member-of         # Lists you''re a member of\nbird list-timeline <id> -n 20  # Tweets from a list\n```\n\n### Bookmarks & Likes\n\n```bash\nbird bookmarks -n 10\nbird bookmarks --folder-id <id>           # Specific folder\nbird bookmarks --include-parent           # Include parent tweet\nbird bookmarks --author-chain             # Author''s self-reply chain\nbird bookmarks --full-chain-only          # Full reply chain\nbird unbookmark <url-or-id>\nbird likes -n 10\n```\n\n### Social Graph\n\n```bash\nbird following -n 20           # Users you follow\nbird followers -n 20           # Users following you\nbird following --user <id>     # Another user''s following\nbird about @handle             # Account origin/location info\n```\n\n### Engagement Actions\n\n```bash\nbird follow @handle            # Follow a user\nbird unfollow @handle          # Unfollow a user\n```\n\n### Posting\n\n```bash\nbird tweet \"hello world\"\nbird reply <url-or-id> \"nice thread!\"\nbird tweet \"check this out\" --media image.png --alt \"description\"\n```\n\n**⚠️ Posting risks**: Posting is more likely to be rate limited; if blocked, use the browser tool instead.\n\n## Media Uploads\n\n```bash\nbird tweet \"hi\" --media img.png --alt \"description\"\nbird tweet \"pics\" --media a.jpg --media b.jpg  # Up to 4 images\nbird tweet \"video\" --media clip.mp4            # Or 1 video\n```\n\n## Pagination\n\nCommands supporting pagination: `replies`, `thread`, `search`, `bookmarks`, `likes`, `list-timeline`, `following`, `followers`, `user-tweets`\n\n```bash\nbird bookmarks --all                    # Fetch all pages\nbird bookmarks --max-pages 3            # Limit pages\nbird bookmarks --cursor <cursor>        # Resume from cursor\nbird replies <id> --all --delay 1000    # Delay between pages (ms)\n```\n\n## Output Options\n\n```bash\n--json          # JSON output\n--json-full     # JSON with raw API response\n--plain         # No emoji, no color (script-friendly)\n--no-emoji      # Disable emoji\n--no-color      # Disable ANSI colors (or set NO_COLOR=1)\n--quote-depth n # Max quoted tweet depth in JSON (default: 1)\n```\n\n## Global Options\n\n```bash\n--auth-token <token>       # Set auth_token cookie\n--ct0 <token>              # Set ct0 cookie\n--cookie-source <source>   # Cookie source for browser cookies (repeatable)\n--chrome-profile <name>    # Chrome profile name\n--chrome-profile-dir <path> # Chrome/Chromium profile dir or cookie DB path\n--firefox-profile <name>   # Firefox profile\n--timeout <ms>             # Request timeout\n--cookie-timeout <ms>      # Cookie extraction timeout\n```\n\n## Config File\n\n`~/.config/bird/config.json5` (global) or `./.birdrc.json5` (project):\n\n```json5\n{\n  cookieSource: [\"chrome\"],\n  chromeProfileDir: \"/path/to/Arc/Profile\",\n  timeoutMs: 20000,\n  quoteDepth: 1,\n}\n```\n\nEnvironment variables: `BIRD_TIMEOUT_MS`, `BIRD_COOKIE_TIMEOUT_MS`, `BIRD_QUOTE_DEPTH`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Query IDs stale (404 errors)\n\n```bash\nbird query-ids --fresh\n```\n\n### Cookie extraction fails\n\n- Check browser is logged into X\n- Try different `--cookie-source`\n- For Arc/Brave: use `--chrome-profile-dir`\n\n---\n\n**TL;DR**: Read/search/engage with CLI. Post carefully or use browser. 🐦\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:06:41.367Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Twitter-focused AI Agents seeking streamlined CLI interactions via GraphQL and cookie-based authentication.","zh":"适用于专注于Twitter的AI代理，通过GraphQL和基于Cookie的身份验证实现简化的CLI交互。","ja":"Twitterに特化したAIエージェントが、GraphQLとCookieベースの認証を使用してストリーミングCLIインタラクションを実現するのに最適です。","ko":"트위터에 중점을 둔 AI 에이전트가 GraphQL 및 쿠키 기반 인증을 통해 스트리밍 CLI 상호 작용을 구현하기에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de AI centrados en Twitter que buscan interacciones de CLI optimizadas a través de GraphQL y autenticación basada en cookies.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur Twitter qui recherchent des interactions de CLI optimisées via GraphQL et une authentification basée sur les cookies.","de":"Ideal für Twitter-fokussierte KI-Agents, die gestreamte CLI-Interaktionen über GraphQL und cookie-basierte Authentifizierung suchen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA com foco no Twitter que buscam interações de CLI simplificadas via GraphQL e autenticação baseada em cookies.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на Twitter, которые ищут упрощенное взаимодействие с CLI через GraphQL и аутентификацию на основе файлов cookie.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي ذي التركيز على تويتر الذي يسعى إلى تفاعلات واجهة سطر الأوامر المبسطة عبر GraphQL والتحقق من الهوية القائم على ملفات تعريف الارتباط."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage GraphQL for efficient Twitter data retrieval, utilizing cookie auth for secure and personalized interactions, and supports various installation methods including npm, Homebrew, and one-shot executions with bunx.","zh":"赋予代理使用GraphQL高效地检索Twitter数据的能力，利用Cookie身份验证实现安全和个性化的交互，并支持包括npm、Homebrew和使用bunx的一键式执行在内的各种安装方法。","ja":"エージェントがGraphQLを使用してTwitterデータを効率的に取得し、Cookie認証を使用してセキュアでパーソナライズされたインタラクションを実現する機能を提供し、npm、Homebrew、およびbunxを使用した一時的な実行を含むさまざまなインストール方法をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 GraphQL을 사용하여 트위터 데이터를 효율적으로 가져오고 쿠키 인증을 사용하여 보안 및 개인화 된 상호 작용을 구현할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며 npm, Homebrew 및 bunx를 사용한 일회성 실행을 포함한 다양한 설치 방법을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar GraphQL para una recuperación eficiente de datos de Twitter, utilizando la autenticación de cookies para interacciones seguras y personalizadas, y admite varios métodos de instalación, incluyendo npm, Homebrew y ejecuciones de un solo disparo con bunx.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter GraphQL pour une récupération efficace des données Twitter, en utilisant l''authentification par cookie pour des interactions sécurisées et personnalisées, et prend en charge différentes méthodes d''installation, notamment npm, Homebrew et des exécutions à shot unique avec bunx.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, GraphQL für eine effiziente Twitter-Datenabfrage zu nutzen, wobei die Authentifizierung über Cookies für sichere und personalisierte Interaktionen erfolgt, und unterstützt verschiedene Installationsmethoden, einschließlich npm, Homebrew und Einmal-Ausführungen mit bunx.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar o GraphQL para recuperação eficiente de dados do Twitter, utilizando a autenticação por cookie para interações seguras e personalizadas, e suporta vários métodos de instalação, incluindo npm, Homebrew e execuções de um único disparo com bunx.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность использовать GraphQL для эффективного получения данных Twitter, используя аутентификацию на основе файлов cookie для безопасных и персонализированных взаимодействий, и поддерживает различные методы установки, включая npm, Homebrew и одноразовые выполнения с bunx.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من الاستفادة من GraphQL لاسترجاع بيانات تويتر بكفاءة، باستخدام التحقق من الهوية القائم على ملفات تعريف الارتباط للتفاعلات الآمنة والمخصّصة، ودعم طرق تثبيت مختلفة بما في ذلك npm و Homebrew والتنفيذات من جهة واحدة مع bunx."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Twitter profile management using cookie-based authentication","Generating custom Twitter CLI commands with GraphQL support","Debugging Twitter API issues with bird''s authentication and cookie management features"],"zh":["使用基于Cookie的身份验证自动执行Twitter个人资料管理","使用GraphQL支持生成自定义Twitter CLI命令","使用Bird的身份验证和Cookie管理功能调试Twitter API问题"],"ja":["Cookieベースの認証を使用してTwitterプロファイル管理を自動化する","GraphQLサポートを使用してカスタムTwitter CLIコマンドを生成する","Birdの認証およびCookie管理機能を使用してTwitter APIの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["쿠키 기반 인증을 사용하여 트위터 프로필 관리를 자동화합니다.","GraphQL 지원을 사용하여 사용자 지정 트위터 CLI 명령을 생성합니다.","Bird의 인증 및 쿠키 관리 기능을 사용하여 트위터 API 문제를 디버깅합니다."],"es":["Automatización de la gestión de perfiles de Twitter mediante autenticación basada en cookies","Generación de comandos personalizados de CLI de Twitter con soporte GraphQL","Depuración de problemas de la API de Twitter con características de autenticación y administración de cookies de bird"],"fr":["Automatisation de la gestion de profils Twitter à l''aide d''une authentification 