de":["Identifiziert duplizierte oder ähnliche Fälle","Ermöglicht die Konfiguration der Anzahl der Tage für die Suche","Schließt oder schließt offene oder geschlossene Fälle ein","Erhält die ID des Falls und die Identifikatoren der Alert-Gruppe als Eingabe","Führt eine Ähnlichkeitssuche im Fallregister durch"],"pt":["Identificação de casos duplicados ou semelhantes","Análise de casos antes da análise profunda","Parâmetros personalizáveis para busca de casos","Inclusão de casos abertos ou fechados","Definição de período de busca personalizado"],"ru":["Выявление дубликатов или аналогичных дел","Анализ дел до глубокого анализа","Параметры настройки поиска дел","Включение открытых или закрытых дел","Определение пользовательского периода поиска"],"ar":["تحديد الحالات المكررة أو الشبيهة","تحليل الحالات قبل التحليل العميق","معلمات قابلة للتعديل للبحث عن الحالات","إضافة الحالات المفتوحة أو المغلقة","تحديد فترة بحث مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["检查重复项","案例分析","重复案例检测","分析时间优化","CASE_ID","ALERT_GROUP_IDENTIFIERS"],"ja":["重複チェック","ケース分析","重複ケース検出","分析時間最適化","CASE_ID","ALERT_GROUP_IDENTIFIERS"],"ko":["중복 확인","케이스 분석","중복 케이스 탐지","분석 시간 최적화","CASE_ID","ALERT_GROUP_IDENTIFIERS"],"es":["detección de duplicados","identificación de casos similares","análisis de casos","registros de casos","búsqueda de similitud","desarrollo de software","ingeniería de software"],"fr":["détection de doublons","identification de cas similaires","analyse de cas","registres de cas","recherche de similitude","développement de logiciels","ingénierie de logiciels"],"de":["Dopplikate Erkennung","Identifizierung ähnlicher Fälle","Fallanalyse","Fallregister","Ähnlichkeitssuche","Softwareentwicklung","Softwareingenieurwesen"],"pt":["verificar duplicatas","identificar casos semelhantes","análise de casos","habilidade check-duplicates","desenvolvimento de software","tecnologia de informação"],"ru":["проверка дубликатов","выявление аналогичных дел","анализ дел","навык check-duplicates","разработка программного обеспечения","информационные технологии"],"ar":["التحقق من نسخ مكررة","تحديد الحالات الشبيهة","تحليل الحالات","مهارة check-duplicates","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا المعلومات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"check-duplicates","description":"Check for duplicate or similar cases. Use before deep analysis to avoid investigating the same incident twice. Takes a CASE_ID and returns list of similar cases.","bodyPreview":"# Check Duplicates Skill\n\nIdentify potentially duplicate or similar existing cases before starting deep analysis.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `CASE_ID` - The ID of the current case to check\n- `ALERT_GROUP_IDENTIFIERS` - Alert group identifiers for the case\n- *(Optional)* `DAYS_BACK` - How many days to search back (default: 7)\n- *(Optional)* `INCLUDE_OPEN` - Include open cases (default: true)\n- *(Optional)* `INCLUDE_CLOSED` - Include closed cases (default: false)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Execute Similarity Ch","body":"# Check Duplicates Skill\n\nIdentify potentially duplicate or similar existing cases before starting deep analysis.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- `CASE_ID` - The ID of the current case to check\n- `ALERT_GROUP_IDENTIFIERS` - Alert group identifiers for the case\n- *(Optional)* `DAYS_BACK` - How many days to search back (default: 7)\n- *(Optional)* `INCLUDE_OPEN` - Include open cases (default: true)\n- *(Optional)* `INCLUDE_CLOSED` - Include closed cases (default: false)\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Execute Similarity Check\n\n```\nsecops-soar.siemplify_get_similar_cases(\n    case_id=CASE_ID,\n    alert_group_identifiers=ALERT_GROUP_IDENTIFIERS,\n    days_back=DAYS_BACK,\n    include_open_cases=INCLUDE_OPEN,\n    include_closed_cases=INCLUDE_CLOSED\n)\n```\n\n### Step 2: Process Results\n\nExtract the list of similar case IDs from the response.\n\n## Outputs\n\n| Output | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `SIMILAR_CASE_IDS` | List of case IDs identified as potentially similar/duplicate |\n| `SIMILARITY_CHECK_STATUS` | Success/failure status of the check |\n\n## Usage Pattern\n\n```\n1. Check duplicates BEFORE enrichment\n2. If duplicates found:\n   - Review similar case(s)\n   - If confirmed duplicate: close as duplicate\n   - If related but distinct: note correlation, continue\n3. If no duplicates: proceed with analysis\n```\n\n## When Duplicates Are Found\n\nIf `SIMILAR_CASE_IDS` is not empty:\n\n1. Document: \"Closing as duplicate of [Similar Case ID]\"\n2. Close with:\n   - Reason: `NOT_MALICIOUS`\n   - Root cause: `Similar case is already under investigation`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:06:38.981Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Investigative Agents needing duplicate case detection and analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要重复案件检测和分析功能的调查代理","ja":"調査エージェントが重複するケースを検出および分析する機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"중복 사례 감지 및 분석 기능이 필요한 조사 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de investigación que necesitan capacidades de detección y análisis de casos duplicados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''enquête ayant besoin de capacités de détection et d''analyse de cas en double.","de":"Perfekt für Ermittlungsagenten, die Funktionen zur Erkennung und Analyse von doppelten Fällen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Investigação que necessitam de detecção e análise de casos duplicados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов-расследователей, которым необходимы возможности обнаружения и анализа дубликатов дел.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الاستقصائيين الذين يحتاجون إلى كشف و تحليل الحالات المكررة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify potentially duplicate or similar existing cases using alert group identifiers and customizable search parameters, including days back and case status filters, leveraging similarity checks for efficient analysis.","zh":"使代理能够使用警报组标识符和可自定义的搜索参数（包括天数和案例状态过滤器）识别潜在的重复或类似案例，并利用相似性检查进行高效分析","ja":"警報グループ識別子やカスタマイズ可能な検索パラメータ（日数やケースのステータスフィルタなど）を使用して、エージェントが潜在的な重複または類似の既存ケースを特定できるようにし、効率的な分析のための類似性チェックを活用","ko":"알림 그룹 식별자 및 사용자 정의 가능한 검색 매개 변수(일 수 및 사례 상태 필터 등)를 사용하여 에이전트가 잠재적으로 중복되거나 유사한 기존 사례를 식별할 수 있도록 하며, 효율적인 분석을 위한 유사성 확인을 활용","es":"Permite a los agentes identificar casos potencialmente duplicados o similares existentes mediante identificadores de grupos de alertas y parámetros de búsqueda personalizables, incluyendo filtros de días hacia atrás y estado del caso, aprovechando controles de similitud para un análisis eficiente.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier des cas potentielllement en double ou similaires existants à l''aide d''identificateurs de groupes d''alertes et de paramètres de recherche personnalisables, notamment des filtres de jours précédents et d''état de cas, en exploitant les vérifications de similitude pour une analyse efficace.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, potenziell doppelte oder ähnliche bestehende Fälle mithilfe von Alert-Gruppen-Identifikatoren und anpassbaren Suchparametern zu identifizieren, einschließlich Filtern für Tage zurück und Fallstatus, und nutzt Ähnlichkeitsprüfungen für eine effiziente Analyse.","pt":"Permite que os agentes identifiquem casos potencialmente duplicados ou semelhantes existentes usando identificadores de grupo de alertas e parâmetros de pesquisa personalizáveis, incluindo filtros de dias anteriores e status do caso, aproveitando verificações de semelhança para uma análise eficiente.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выявлять потенциально дублирующие или похожие существующие дела, используя идентификаторы группы оповещений и настраиваемые параметры поиска, включая фильтры за предыдущие дни и статус дела, используя проверки на подобие для эффективного анализа.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تحديد الحالات المحتملة المكررة أو المشابهة الحالية باستخدام معرّفات مجموعة التنبيهات و معايير البحث القابلة للتعديل، بما في ذلك مرشحات الأيام السابقة ومرشحات حالة الحالة، واستخدام فحوصات التشابه للتحليل الفعال."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating duplicate case detection for efficient analysis","Filtering similar cases based on alert group identifiers and time frames","Streamlining investigative workflows by excluding closed or open cases as needed"],"zh":["自动化重复案件检测以进行高效分析","基于警报组标识符和时间范围筛选类似案例","通过排除关闭或打开案例（如有需要）来简化调查工作流"],"ja":["効率的な分析のための重複ケースの自動検出","警報グループ識別子や時間枠に基づいて類似ケースをフィルタリング","調査ワークフローをストリームライン化するために、必要に応じて閉じたまたは開いたケースを除外"],"ko":["효율적인 분석을 위한 중복 사례 자동 감지","알림 그룹 식별자 및 시간 프레임을 기준으로 유사한 사례 필터링","조사 워크플ロー 최적화를 위해 필요한 경우 개방 또는 폐쇄 사례를 제외"],"es":["Automatizar la detección de casos duplicados para un análisis eficiente","Filtrar casos similares en función de identificadores de grupo de alertas y marcos temporales","Optimizar los flujos de trabajo de investigación excluyendo casos cerrados o abiertos según sea necesario"],"fr":["Automatiser la détection de cas en double pour une analyse efficace","Filtrer les cas similaires en fonction des identificateurs de groupe d''alertes et des trames temporaires","Optimiser les flux de travail d''enquête en excluant les cas fermés ou ouverts selon les besoins"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erkennung von doppelten Fällen für eine effiziente Analyse","Filtern ähnlicher Fälle basierend auf Alert-Gruppen-Identifikatoren und Zeitrahmen","Optimieren der Ermittlungsworkflows durch Ausschluss von geschlossenen oder offenen Fällen nach Bedarf"],"pt":["Automatizar a detecção de casos duplicados para análise eficiente","Filtrar casos semelhantes com base em identificadores de grupo de alertas e quadros de tempo","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de investigação excluindo casos fechados ou abertos conforme necessário"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обнаружение дубликатов дел для эффективного анализа","Фильтровать подобные дела на основе идентификаторов группы оповещений и временных рамок","Оптимизировать рабочие процессы расследований, исключая закрытые или открытые дела по мере необходимости"],"ar":["تحويل كشف الحالات المكررة إلى عملية آلية من أجل التحليل الفعال","تصفية الحالات المشابهة根据 معرّفات مجموعة التنبيهات وأطر الزمن","تحسين سير عمل التحقيقات باستثناء الحالات المغلقة أو المفتوحة حسب الحاجة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires case ID and alert group identifiers as inputs","Default search range limited to 7 days back without customization","Includes open cases by default, which may require adjustment based on specific use cases"],"zh":["需要案例 ID 和警报组标识符作为输入","默认搜索范围仅限于 7 天，不支持自定义","默认包含打开的案例，可能需要根据具体使用场景进行调整"],"ja":["ケースIDおよび警報グループ識別子が入力として必要","デフォルトの検索範囲はカスタマイズなしで7日まで","デフォルトで開いたケースを含むため、特定のユースケースに基づいて調整する必要がある"],"ko":["사례 ID 및 알림 그룹 식별자가 입력으로 필요","기본 검색 범위는 사용자 정의 없이 7일로 제한","기본적으로 열린 사례를 포함하므로 특정 사용 사례에 따라 조정을 요구"],"es":["Requiere ID de caso y identificadores de grupo de alertas como entradas","El rango de búsqueda predeterminado está limitado a 7 días hacia atrás sin personalización","Incluye casos abiertos de forma predeterminada, lo que puede requerir ajustes según los casos de uso específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''ID de cas et les identificateurs de groupe d''alertes comme entrées","La plage de recherche par défaut est limitée à 7 jours précédents sans personnalisation","Inclut les cas ouverts par défaut, ce qui peut nécessiter des ajustements en fonction des cas d''utilisation spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Case-ID und Alert-Gruppen-Identifikatoren als Eingaben","Der Standard-Suchbereich ist auf 7 Tage zurück ohne Anpassung beschränkt","Enthält standardmäßig offene Fälle, was je nach spezifischem Anwendungsfall eine Anpassung erfordern kann"],"pt":["Exige ID do caso e identificadores de grupo de alertas como entradas","Intervalo de pesquisa padrão limitado a 7 dias anteriores sem personalização","Inclui casos abertos por padrão, o que pode exigir ajustes com base em casos de uso específicos"],"ru":["Требует ID дела и идентификаторов группы оповещений в качестве входных данных","Стандартный диапазон поиска ограничен 7 предыдущими днями без настройки","Включает открытые дела по умолчанию, что может потребовать корректировки на основе конкретных случаев использования"],"ar":["يتطلب معرف الحالة ومعرّفات مجموعة التنبيهات كمدخلات","نطاق البحث الافتراضي مقيد ب 7 أيام سابقة دون تخصيص","ي含 الحالات المفتوحة افتراضيًا، مما قد يتطلب تعديلات بناءً على حالات استخدام محددة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('openai/skills/openai-docs', 'community', 'openai', 'skills', 'openai/skills', 'openai-docs', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z', '2026-02-18T04:07:10.698Z', NULL, '{"id":"openai/skills/openai-docs","name":"openai-docs","description":{"zh":"OpenAI 文档搜索技能提供来自开发者文档的权威指南","ja":"OpenAI ドキュメント検索スキルは、開発者向けドキュメントから権威あるガイドを提供","ko":"OpenAI 문서 검색 스킬은 개발자 문서에서 권위 있는 가이드를 제공합니다","es":"OpenAI Docs proporciona orientación actualizada y autorizada para desarrolladores, directamente desde los documentos oficiales de OpenAI.","fr":"OpenAI Docs fournit des conseils actualisés et autorisés pour les développeurs, directement à partir des documents officiels d''OpenAI.","de":"OpenAI-Docs bietet aktuelle und autorisierte Anleitungen für Entwickler, direkt aus den offiziellen OpenAI-Dokumenten.","pt":"Acesse a documentação oficial da OpenAI para desenvolvedores e obtenha ajuda para suas dúvidas","ru":"Доступ к официальной документации OpenAI для разработчиков и помощь в решении вопросов","ar":"استفد من وثائق OpenAI الرسمية للمطورين وحل أسئلتك","en":"Skills Catalog for Codex"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"OpenAI 文档搜索","ja":"OpenAI ドキュメント検索","ko":"OpenAI 문서 검색","es":"OpenAI Docs: Guía oficial para desarrolladores","fr":"OpenAI Docs : Guide officiel pour les développeurs","de":"OpenAI-Docs: Offizielles Handbuch für Entwickler","pt":"OpenAI Docs: Guia de Desenvolvedores","ru":"Документация OpenAI: Руководство для разработчиков","ar":"وثائق OpenAI: دليل المطورين","en":"openai-docs"},"description":{"zh":"OpenAI 文档搜索技能提供来自开发者文档的权威指南","ja":"OpenAI ドキュメント検索スキルは、開発者向けドキュメントから権威あるガイドを提供","ko":"OpenAI 문서 검색 스킬은 개발자 문서에서 권위 있는 가이드를 제공합니다","es":"OpenAI Docs proporciona orientación actualizada y autorizada para desarrolladores, directamente desde los documentos oficiales de OpenAI.","fr":"OpenAI Docs fournit des conseils actualisés et autorisés pour les développeurs, directement à partir des documents officiels d''OpenAI.","de":"OpenAI-Docs bietet aktuelle und autorisierte Anleitungen für Entwickler, direkt aus den offiziellen OpenAI-Dokumenten.","pt":"Acesse a documentação oficial da OpenAI para desenvolvedores e obtenha ajuda para suas dúvidas","ru":"Доступ к официальной документации OpenAI для разработчиков и помощь в решении вопросов","ar":"استفد من وثائق OpenAI الرسمية للمطورين وحل أسئلتك","en":"Skills Catalog for Codex"},"definition":{"en":"Skills Catalog for Codex"},"features":{"zh":["提供最新的开发者文档","支持 MCP 服务器搜索","支持 Web 搜索fallback","使用 mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs 搜索文档","使用 mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc 获取具体章节"],"ja":["最新の開発者向けドキュメントを提供","MCP サーバー検索をサポート","Web 検索の fallback をサポート","mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs を使用してドキュメントを検索","mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc を使用して具体のセクションを取得"],"ko":["최신 개발자 문서 제공","MCP 서버 검색 지원","웹 검색 fallback 지원","mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs 사용하여 문서 검색","mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc 사용하여 구체적인 섹션 가져오기"],"es":["Búsqueda de documentos oficiales de OpenAI","Acceso a las últimas guías y herramientas","Priorización de los documentos de MCP sobre la búsqueda web","Compatibilidad con MCP y web.run"],"fr":["Recherche de documents officiels OpenAI","Accès aux dernières guides et outils","Priorisation des documents MCP sur la recherche web","Compatibilité avec MCP et web.run"],"de":["Suche nach offiziellen OpenAI-Dokumenten","Zugriff auf die neuesten Anleitungen und Tools","Priorisierung der MCP-Dokumente gegenüber der Web-Suche","Kompatibilität mit MCP und web.run"],"pt":["Busca avançada na documentação da OpenAI","Acesso a páginas de documentação relevantes","Ferramentas de desenvolvedor para resolver problemas","Integração com o servidor MCP","Prioridade à documentação oficial da OpenAI"],"ru":["Расширенный поиск в документации OpenAI","Доступ к релевантным страницам документации","Инструменты разработчика для решения проблем","Интеграция с сервером MCP","Приоритет официальной документации OpenAI"],"ar":["بحث متقدم في وثائق OpenAI","الوصول إلى صفحات الوثائق ذات الصلة","أدوات المطور لحل المشكلات","التكامل مع خادم MCP","الآلية لتوثيق OpenAI الرسمية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OpenAI 文档搜索","开发者文档","MCP 服务器","Web 搜索","mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs","mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc"],"ja":["OpenAI ドキュメント検索","開発者向けドキュメント","MCP サーバー","Web 検索","mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs","mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc"],"ko":["OpenAI 문서 검색","개발자 문서","MCP 서버","웹 검색","mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs","mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc"],"es":["OpenAI","documentación oficial","desarrolladores","MCP","web.run","búsqueda de documentos","guías de desarrollador"],"fr":["OpenAI","documentation officielle","développeurs","MCP","web.run","recherche de documents","guides de développeur"],"de":["OpenAI","offizielle Dokumentation","Entwickler","MCP","web.run","Dokumentensuche","Entwicklerhandbuch"],"pt":["OpenAI","documentação de desenvolvedores","desenvolvedores","MCP","busca avançada","ferramentas de desenvolvedor","solução de problemas"],"ru":["OpenAI","документация разработчиков","разработчики","MCP","расширенный поиск","инструменты разработчика","решение проблем"],"ar":["OpenAI","وثائق المطورين","المطورين","MCP","بحث متقدم","أدوات المطور","حل المشكلات"]}},"owner":"openai","repo":"skills","repoPath":"openai/skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openai-docs","description":"Use when the user asks how to build with OpenAI products or APIs and needs up-to-date official documentation with citations (for example: Codex, Responses API, Chat Completions, Apps SDK, Agents SDK, Realtime, model capabilities or limits); prioritize OpenAI docs MCP tools and restrict any fallback browsing to official OpenAI domains.","bodyPreview":"# OpenAI Docs\n\nProvide authoritative, current guidance from OpenAI developer docs using the developers.openai.com MCP server. Always prioritize the developer docs MCP tools over web.run for OpenAI-related questions. Only if the MCP server is installed and returns no meaningful results should you fall back to web search.\n\n## Quick start\n\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` to find the most relevant doc pages.\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` to pull exact sectio","body":"# OpenAI Docs\n\nProvide authoritative, current guidance from OpenAI developer docs using the developers.openai.com MCP server. Always prioritize the developer docs MCP tools over web.run for OpenAI-related questions. Only if the MCP server is installed and returns no meaningful results should you fall back to web search.\n\n## Quick start\n\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` to find the most relevant doc pages.\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` to pull exact sections and quote/paraphrase accurately.\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__list_openai_docs` only when you need to browse or discover pages without a clear query.\n\n## OpenAI product snapshots\n\n1. Apps SDK: Build ChatGPT apps by providing a web component UI and an MCP server that exposes your app''s tools to ChatGPT.\n2. Responses API: A unified endpoint designed for stateful, multimodal, tool-using interactions in agentic workflows.\n3. Chat Completions API: Generate a model response from a list of messages comprising a conversation.\n4. Codex: OpenAI''s coding agent for software development that can write, understand, review, and debug code.\n5. gpt-oss: Open-weight OpenAI reasoning models (gpt-oss-120b and gpt-oss-20b) released under the Apache 2.0 license.\n6. Realtime API: Build low-latency, multimodal experiences including natural speech-to-speech conversations.\n7. Agents SDK: A toolkit for building agentic apps where a model can use tools and context, hand off to other agents, stream partial results, and keep a full trace.\n\n## If MCP server is missing\n\nIf MCP tools fail or no OpenAI docs resources are available:\n\n1. Run the install command yourself: `codex mcp add openaiDeveloperDocs --url https://developers.openai.com/mcp`\n2. If it fails due to permissions/sandboxing, immediately retry the same command with escalated permissions and include a 1-sentence justification for approval. Do not ask the user to run it yet.\n3. Only if the escalated attempt fails, ask the user to run the install command.\n4. Ask the user to restart Codex.\n5. Re-run the doc search/fetch after restart.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Clarify the product scope (Codex, OpenAI API, or ChatGPT Apps SDK) and the task.\n2. Search docs with a precise query.\n3. Fetch the best page and the specific section needed (use `anchor` when possible).\n4. Answer with concise guidance and cite the doc source.\n5. Provide code snippets only when the docs support them.\n\n## Quality rules\n\n- Treat OpenAI docs as the source of truth; avoid speculation.\n- Keep quotes short and within policy limits; prefer paraphrase with citations.\n- If multiple pages differ, call out the difference and cite both.\n- If docs do not cover the user’s need, say so and offer next steps.\n\n## Tooling notes\n\n- Always use MCP doc tools before any web search for OpenAI-related questions.\n- If the MCP server is installed but returns no meaningful results, then use web search as a fallback.\n- When falling back to web search, restrict to official OpenAI domains (developers.openai.com, platform.openai.com) and cite sources.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:07:10.698Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for AI coding agents requiring authoritative OpenAI API documentation integration.","zh":"适用于需要集成权威OpenAI API文档的AI编码代理的必备条件。","ja":"OpenAI APIの公式ドキュメントを統合する必要があるAIコーディングエージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"권위적인 OpenAI API 문서 통합이 필요한 AI 코딩 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de codificación de IA que requieren una integración de documentación de la API de OpenAI autorizada.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de codage IA nécessitant une intégration de documentation d''API OpenAI autorisée.","de":"Wesentlich für AI-Coding-Agenten, die eine autorisierte OpenAI-API-Dokumentation-Integration erfordern.","pt":"Essencial para agentes de codificação de IA que exigem integração de documentação de API OpenAI autorizada.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов кодирования ИИ, требующих интеграции официальной документации API OpenAI.","ar":"ضروري لمحاثر الترميز الإصطناعي التي تتطلب دمج وثائق API OpenAI المعتمدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Directly accesses the official OpenAI developer documentation MCP server, prioritizing precise `search_openai_docs` and `fetch_openai_doc` tools over generic web search results for accurate API guidance and implementation details.","zh":"直接访问官方OpenAI开发者文档MCP服务器，优先使用精确的`search_openai_docs`和`fetch_openai_doc`工具而不是通用的网页搜索结果，以获得准确的API指导和实现细节。","ja":"公式のOpenAIデベロッパードキュメントMCPサーバーに直接アクセスし、正確な`search_openai_docs`と`fetch_openai_doc`ツールを優先して、網羅的なWeb検索結果ではなく、正確なAPIガイダンスと実装詳細を提供します。","ko":"공식 OpenAI 개발자 문서 MCP 서버에 직접 액세스하여 정확한 `search_openai_docs` 및 `fetch_openai_doc` 도구를 사용하여 웹 검색 결과보다 정확한 API 가이드 및 구현 세부 정보를 제공합니다.","es":"Accede directamente al servidor de documentación de desarrolladores de OpenAI oficial MCP, priorizando las herramientas precisas `search_openai_docs` y `fetch_openai_doc` sobre los resultados de búsqueda web genéricos para obtener una guía API precisa y detalles de implementación.","fr":"Accède directement au serveur de documentation de développeurs OpenAI officiel MCP, priorisant les outils précis `search_openai_docs` et `fetch_openai_doc` par rapport aux résultats de recherche web génériques pour obtenir des conseils d''API précis et des détails d''implémentation.","de":"Greift direkt auf den offiziellen OpenAI-Entwicklerdokumentations-MCP-Server zu, priorisiert präzise `search_openai_docs`- und `fetch_openai_doc`-Tools gegenüber generischen Web-Suchergebnissen für genaue API-Anleitungen und Implementierungsdetails.","pt":"Acessa diretamente o servidor de documentação do desenvolvedor oficial da OpenAI MCP, priorizando as ferramentas precisas `search_openai_docs` e `fetch_openai_doc` sobre os resultados de pesquisa genérica da web para orientação de API precisa e detalhes de implementação.","ru":"Непосредственно доступ к официальному серверу документации разработчика OpenAI MCP, отдающий приоритет точным инструментам `search_openai_docs` и `fetch_openai_doc` над результатами общего веб-поиска для точного руководства API и деталей реализации.","ar":"يصل مباشرة إلى خادم وثائق المطور الرسمي من OpenAI MCP، يفضل أدوات `search_openai_docs` و `fetch_openai_doc` الدقيقة على نتائج البحث الويب العامة للحصول على إرشادات دقيقة لبروتوكول اتصال التطبيقات و تفاصيل التنفيذ."},"useCases":{"en":["Resolving OpenAI API parameter conflicts","Implementing Assistants API workflows","Debugging chat completion formatting issues","Validating model compatibility requirements"],"zh":["解决OpenAI API参数冲突","实现Assistants API工作流程","调试聊天完成格式问题","验证模型兼容性要求"],"ja":["OpenAI APIパラメーターの衝突を解決する","Assistants APIワークフローを実装する","チャット完了フォーマットの問題をデバッグする","モデル互換性要件を検証する"],"ko":["OpenAI API 매개 변수 충돌 해결","Assistants API 워크플로 구현","채팅 완료 형식 문제 디버깅","모델 호환성 요구 사항 검증"],"es":["Resolver conflictos de parámetros de la API de OpenAI","Implementar flujos de trabajo de la API de Asistentes","Depurar problemas de formato de finalización de chat","Validar requisitos de compatibilidad de modelos"],"fr":["Résoudre les conflits de paramètres de l''API OpenAI","Mettre en œuvre des flux de travail d''API d''Assistants","Déboguer les problèmes de formatage de complétion de chat","Valider les exigences de compatibilité des modèles"],"de":["Auflösen von OpenAI-API-Parameterkonflikten","Implementieren von Assistenten-API-Workflows","Beheben von Chat-Vervollständigungsformatierungsproblemen","Überprüfen von Modellkompatibilitätsanforderungen"],"pt":["Resolução de conflitos de parâmetros da API OpenAI","Implementação de fluxos de trabalho da API Assistants","Depuração de problemas de formatação de conclusão de chat","Validação de requisitos de compatibilidade de modelo"],"ru":["Разрешение конфликтов параметров API OpenAI","Реализация рабочих процессов API Assistants","Отладка проблем форматирования завершения чата","Проверка требований к совместимости модели"],"ar":["حل النزاعات في معلمات API OpenAI","تنفيذ سير عمل API Assistants","تصحيح أخطاء تنسيق إكمال الدردشة","التحقق من متطلبات توافق النموذج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires MCP server installation","Dependent on developers.openai.com availability","Falls back to web search only when MCP returns no results"],"zh":["需要MCP服务器安装","依赖于developers.openai.com的可用性","仅在MCP返回无结果时退回到网页搜索"],"ja":["MCPサーバーのインストールが必要","developers.openai.comの可用性に依存している","MCPが結果を返さない場合にのみWeb検索にフォールバック"],"ko":["MCP 서버 설치 필요","developers.openai.com 가용성에 의존","MCP가 결과를 반환하지 않을 경우에만 웹 검색으로 돌아감"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del servidor MCP","Depende de la disponibilidad de developers.openai.com","Vuelve a la búsqueda web solo cuando MCP no devuelve resultados"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du serveur MCP","Dépend de la disponibilité de developers.openai.com","Reviens à la recherche web uniquement lorsque MCP ne renvoie pas de résultats"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation des MCP-Servers","Hängt von der Verfügbarkeit von developers.openai.com ab","Fällt auf die Web-Suche zurück, wenn MCP keine Ergebnisse zurückgibt"],"pt":["Exige instalação do servidor MCP","Depende da disponibilidade de developers.openai.com","Volta para a pesquisa na web apenas quando o MCP não retorna resultados"],"ru":["Требует установки сервера MCP","Зависит от доступности developers.openai.com","Переходит к веб-поиску только когда MCP не возвращает результатов"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت خادم MCP","يعتمد على توافر developers.openai.com","يعود إلى البحث على الويب فقط عندما لا يعيد MCP نتائج"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('adaptyvbio/protein-design-skills/boltz', 'community', 'adaptyvbio', 'protein-design-skills', 'adaptyvbio/protein-design-skills', 'boltz', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z', '2026-02-18T04:06:36.927Z', NULL, '{"id":"adaptyvbio/protein-design-skills/boltz","name":"boltz","description":{"zh":"Boltz是一种蛋白质设计技能，使用Claude Code进行结构预测","ja":"Boltzは、Claude Codeを使用したタンパク質設計スキルです","ko":"Boltz는 Claude Code를 사용하여 단백질 구조를 예측하는 단백질 설계 기술입니다","es":"boltz es una herramienta de diseño de proteínas que utiliza Claude Code para predecir estructuras de proteínas. Requiere Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ y 24GB de VRAM de GPU.","fr":"boltz est un outil de conception de protéines qui utilise Claude Code pour prédire les structures de protéines. Il nécessite Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ et 24GB de VRAM de GPU.","de":"boltz ist ein Werkzeug für Proteindesign, das Claude Code verwendet, um Proteinstrukturen vorherzusagen. Es benötigt Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ und 24GB GPU-VRAM.","pt":"A ferramenta Boltz é utilizada para prever a estrutura de proteínas com Claude Code. Ela requer Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ e GPU VRAM de 24GB.","ru":"Инструмент Boltz используется для предсказания структуры белков с Claude Code. Он требует Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ и GPU VRAM 24GB.","ar":"تستخدم أداة Boltz للتنبؤ بتركيب البروتين مع Claude Code. تتطلب Python 3.10+ و CUDA 12.0+ وذاكرة GPU VRAM 24GB.","en":"Claude Code skills for protein design"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Boltz蛋白质设计技能","ja":"Boltzタンパク質設計スキル","ko":"Boltz 단백질 설계 기술","es":"boltz: Predicción de Estructuras de Proteínas con Claude ...","fr":"boltz : Prédiction de Structures de Protéines avec Claude...","de":"boltz: Proteinstrukturvorhersage mit Claude Code","pt":"Boltz: Ferramenta de Previsão de Estrutura de Proteínas","ru":"Boltz: Инструмент предсказания структуры белков","ar":"boltz: أداة للتنبؤ بتركيب البروتين","en":"boltz"},"description":{"zh":"Boltz是一种蛋白质设计技能，使用Claude Code进行结构预测","ja":"Boltzは、Claude Codeを使用したタンパク質設計スキルです","ko":"Boltz는 Claude Code를 사용하여 단백질 구조를 예측하는 단백질 설계 기술입니다","es":"boltz es una herramienta de diseño de proteínas que utiliza Claude Code para predecir estructuras de proteínas. Requiere Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ y 24GB de V...","fr":"boltz est un outil de conception de protéines qui utilise Claude Code pour prédire les structures de protéines. Il nécessite Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ et 24GB...","de":"boltz ist ein Werkzeug für Proteindesign, das Claude Code verwendet, um Proteinstrukturen vorherzusagen. Es benötigt Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ und 24GB GPU-VRAM.","pt":"A ferramenta Boltz é utilizada para prever a estrutura de proteínas com Claude Code. Ela requer Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ e GPU VRAM de 24GB.","ru":"Инструмент Boltz используется для предсказания структуры белков с Claude Code. Он требует Python 3.10+, CUDA 12.0+ и GPU VRAM 24GB.","ar":"تستخدم أداة Boltz للتنبؤ بتركيب البروتين مع Claude Code. تتطلب Python 3.10+ و CUDA 12.0+ وذاكرة GPU VRAM 24GB.","en":"Claude Code skills for protein design"},"definition":{"en":"Claude Code skills for protein design"},"features":{"zh":["使用Claude Code进行蛋白质结构预测","支持Python 3.10+和CUDA 12.0+","需要24GB以上的GPU VRAM","需要32GB以上的RAM","支持 Modal 和 biomodals"],"ja":["Claude Codeを使用したタンパク質構造予測","Python 3.10+とCUDA 12.0+をサポート","24GB以上のGPU VRAMが必要","32GB以上のRAMが必要","Modalとbiomodalsをサポート"],"ko":["Claude Code를 사용하여 단백질 구조를 예측","Python 3.10+와 CUDA 12.0+ 지원","24GB 이상의 GPU VRAM 필요","32GB 이상의 RAM 필요","Modal과 biomodals 지원"],"es":["Predicción de estructuras de proteínas","Utiliza Claude Code","Requiere Python 3.10+ y CUDA 12.0+","24GB de VRAM de GPU mínimo","Compatibilidad con GPU L40S","Facilidad de uso con Modal y biomodals"],"fr":["Prédiction de structures de protéines","Utilise Claude Code","Nécessite Python 3.10+ et CUDA 12.0+","24GB de VRAM de GPU minimum","Compatibilité avec GPU L40S","Facilité d''utilisation avec Modal et biomodals"],"de":["Proteinstrukturvorhersage","Verwendet Claude Code","Benötigt Python 3.10+ und CUDA 12.0+","24GB GPU-VRAM Minimum","Kompatibilität mit GPU L40S","Einfache Bedienung mit Modal und biomodals"],"pt":["Previsão de estrutura de proteínas","Utiliza Claude Code","Requer Python 3.10+","Requer CUDA 12.0+","Requer GPU VRAM de 24GB","Execução via Modal"],"ru":["Предсказание структуры белков","Использует Claude Code","Требует Python 3.10+","Требует CUDA 12.0+","Требует GPU VRAM 24GB","Выполнение через Modal"],"ar":["التنبؤ بتركيب البروتين","تستخدم Claude Code","تتطلب Python 3.10+","تتطلب CUDA 12.0+","تتطلب ذاكرة GPU VRAM 24GB","التشغيل من خلال Modal"]},"keywords":{"zh":["蛋白质设计","结构预测","Claude Code","Python","CUDA","GPU","RAM","Modal","biomodals"],"ja":["タンパク質設計","構造予測","Claude Code","Python","CUDA","GPU","RAM","Modal","biomodals"],"ko":["단백질 설계","구조 예측","Claude Code","Python","CUDA","GPU","RAM","Modal","biomodals"],"es":["diseño de proteínas","predicción de estructuras de proteínas","Claude Code","Python","CUDA","GPU","biomodals","Modal","proteómica"],"fr":["conception de protéines","prédiction de structures de protéines","Claude Code","Python","CUDA","GPU","biomodals","Modal","protéomique"],"de":["Proteindesign","Proteinstrukturvorhersage","Claude Code","Python","CUDA","GPU","biomodals","Modal","Proteomik"],"pt":["previsão de estrutura de proteínas","Claude Code","desenvolvimento de proteínas","biologia computacional","Python","CUDA","GPU VRAM","Modal","biomodals"],"ru":["предсказание структуры белков","Claude Code","разработка белков","компьютерная биология","Python","CUDA","GPU VRAM","Modal","biomodals"],"ar":["التنبؤ بتركيب البروتين","Claude Code","تطوير البروتين","علم الأحياء الحاسوبي","Python","CUDA","ذاكرة GPU VRAM","Modal","biomodals"]}},"owner":"adaptyvbio","repo":"protein-design-skills","repoPath":"adaptyvbio/protein-design-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"boltz","description":">","tags":["structure-prediction","validation","open-source"],"bodyPreview":"# Boltz Structure Prediction\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n| Requirement | Minimum | Recommended |\n|-------------|---------|-------------|\n| Python | 3.10+ | 3.11 |\n| CUDA | 12.0+ | 12.1+ |\n| GPU VRAM | 24GB | 48GB (L40S) |\n| RAM | 32GB | 64GB |\n\n## How to run\n\n> **First time?** See [Installation Guide](../../docs/installation.md) to set up Modal and biomodals.\n\n### Option 1: Modal\n```bash\ncd biomodals\nmodal run modal_boltz.py \\\n  --input-faa complex.fasta \\\n  --out-dir predictions/\n```\n\n**GPU**: L40S (48G","body":"# Boltz Structure Prediction\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n| Requirement | Minimum | Recommended |\n|-------------|---------|-------------|\n| Python | 3.10+ | 3.11 |\n| CUDA | 12.0+ | 12.1+ |\n| GPU VRAM | 24GB | 48GB (L40S) |\n| RAM | 32GB | 64GB |\n\n## How to run\n\n> **First time?** See [Installation Guide](../../docs/installation.md) to set up Modal and biomodals.\n\n### Option 1: Modal\n```bash\ncd biomodals\nmodal run modal_boltz.py \\\n  --input-faa complex.fasta \\\n  --out-dir predictions/\n```\n\n**GPU**: L40S (48GB) | **Timeout**: 1800s default\n\n### Option 2: Local installation\n```bash\npip install boltz\n\nboltz predict \\\n  --fasta complex.fasta \\\n  --output predictions/\n```\n\n## Key parameters\n\n| Parameter | Default | Range | Description |\n|-----------|---------|-------|-------------|\n| `--recycling_steps` | 3 | 1-10 | Recycling iterations |\n| `--sampling_steps` | 200 | 50-500 | Diffusion steps |\n| `--use_msa_server` | true | bool | Use MSA server |\n\n## FASTA Format\n\n```\n>protein_A\nMKTAYIAKQRQISFVK...\n>protein_B\nMVLSPADKTNVKAAWG...\n```\n\n## Output format\n\n```\npredictions/\n├── model_0.cif       # Best model (CIF format)\n├── confidence.json   # pLDDT, pTM, ipTM\n└── pae.npy          # PAE matrix\n```\n\n**Note**: Boltz outputs CIF format. Convert to PDB if needed:\n```python\nfrom Bio.PDB import MMCIFParser, PDBIO\nparser = MMCIFParser()\nstructure = parser.get_structure(\"model\", \"model_0.cif\")\nio = PDBIO()\nio.set_structure(structure)\nio.save(\"model_0.pdb\")\n```\n\n## Comparison\n\n| Feature | Boltz-1 | Boltz-2 | AF2-Multimer |\n|---------|---------|---------|--------------|\n| MSA-free mode | Yes | Yes | No |\n| Diffusion | Yes | Yes | No |\n| Speed | Fast | Faster | Slower |\n| Open source | Yes | Yes | Yes |\n\n## Sample output\n\n### Successful run\n```\n$ boltz predict --fasta complex.fasta --output predictions/\n[INFO] Loading Boltz-1 weights...\n[INFO] Predicting structure...\n[INFO] Saved model to predictions/model_0.cif\n\npredictions/confidence.json:\n{\n  \"ptm\": 0.78,\n  \"iptm\": 0.65,\n  \"plddt\": 0.81\n}\n```\n\n**What good output looks like:**\n- pTM: > 0.7 (confident global structure)\n- ipTM: > 0.5 (confident interface)\n- pLDDT: > 0.7 (confident per-residue)\n- CIF file: ~100-500 KB for typical complex\n\n## Decision tree\n\n```\nShould I use Boltz?\n│\n├─ What are you predicting?\n│  ├─ Protein-protein complex → Boltz ✓ or Chai or ColabFold\n│  ├─ Protein + ligand → Boltz ✓ or Chai\n│  └─ Single protein → Use ESMFold (faster)\n│\n├─ Need MSA?\n│  ├─ No / want speed → Boltz ✓\n│  └─ Yes / maximum accuracy → ColabFold\n│\n└─ Why Boltz over Chai?\n   ├─ Open weights preference → Boltz ✓\n   ├─ Boltz-2 speed → Boltz ✓\n   └─ DNA/RNA support → Consider Chai\n```\n\n## Typical performance\n\n| Campaign Size | Time (L40S) | Cost (Modal) | Notes |\n|---------------|-------------|--------------|-------|\n| 100 complexes | 30-45 min | ~$8 | Standard validation |\n| 500 complexes | 2-3h | ~$35 | Large campaign |\n| 1000 complexes | 4-6h | ~$70 | Comprehensive |\n\n**Per-complex**: ~15-30s for typical binder-target complex.\n\n---\n\n## Verify\n\n```bash\nfind predictions -name \"*.cif\" | wc -l  # Should match input count\n```\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Low confidence**: Increase recycling_steps\n**OOM errors**: Use MSA-free mode or A100-80GB\n**Slow prediction**: Reduce sampling_steps\n\n### Error interpretation\n\n| Error | Cause | Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----|\n| `RuntimeError: CUDA out of memory` | Complex too large | Use `--use_msa_server false` or larger GPU |\n| `KeyError: ''iptm''` | Single chain only | Ensure FASTA has 2+ chains |\n| `FileNotFoundError: weights` | Missing model | Run `boltz download` first |\n| `ValueError: invalid residue` | Non-standard AA | Check for modified residues in sequence |\n\n### Boltz-1 vs Boltz-2\n\n| Aspect | Boltz-1 | Boltz-2 |\n|--------|---------|---------|\n| Speed | Fast | ~2x faster |\n| Accuracy | Good | Improved |\n| Ligands | Basic | Better support |\n| Release | 2024 | Late 2024 |\n\n---\n\n**Next**: `protein-qc` for filtering and ranking.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:06:36.927Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Bioinformatics Agents needing advanced protein structure prediction capabilities with CUDA acceleration.","zh":"非常适合需要具备CUDA加速的高级蛋白质结构预测能力的生物信息学智能体。","ja":"CUDAアクセラレーションを備えた高度なタンパク質構造予測機能を必要とするバイオインフォマティクスエージェントに最適です。","ko":"CUDA 가속 기능을 갖춘 고급 단백질 구조 예측 기능이 필요한 생물정보학 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de bioinformática que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de predicción de estructuras de proteínas con aceleración CUDA.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de bioinformatique qui ont besoin de capacités de prédiction avancées de structures de protéines avec accélération CUDA.","de":"Perfekt für Bioinformatik-Agenten, die erweiterte Proteinstrukturvorhersagefähigkeiten mit CUDA-Beschleunigung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Bioinformática que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de previsão de estrutura de proteínas com aceleração CUDA.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов биоинформатики, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности прогнозирования структуры белков с ускорением CUDA.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المعلومات الحيوية الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لتوقع هيكل البروتين مع تسريع CUDA."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to predict protein structures using Boltz, leveraging CUDA 12.0+ for accelerated computations and Python 3.10+ for seamless integration, while generating predictions in specified output directories.","zh":"使智能体能够使用Boltz预测蛋白质结构，利用CUDA 12.0+进行加速计算，并使用Python 3.10+实现无缝集成，同时在指定的输出目录中生成预测结果。","ja":"エージェントがBoltzを使用してタンパク質構造を予測することを可能にし、CUDA 12.0+を活用した高速計算とPython 3.10+によるシームレスな統合を実現し、指定された出力ディレクトリに予測を生成します。","ko":"에이전트가 Boltz를 사용하여 단백질 구조를 예측할 수 있도록 하며, 가속 계산을 위해 CUDA 12.0+를 활용하고 원활한 통합을 위해 Python 3.10+를 사용하며 지정된 출력 디렉토리에 예측을 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a predecir estructuras de proteínas utilizando Boltz, aprovechando CUDA 12.0+ para cálculos acelerados y Python 3.10+ para una integración sin problemas, mientras genera predicciones en directorios de salida especificados.","fr":"Permet aux agents de prédire les structures de protéines en utilisant Boltz, en exploitant CUDA 12.0+ pour des calculs accélérés et Python 3.10+ pour une intégration transparente, tout en générant des prédictions dans des répertoires de sortie spécifiés.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Proteinstrukturen mit Boltz vorherzusagen, indem CUDA 12.0+ für beschleunigte Berechnungen und Python 3.10+ für eine nahtlose Integration genutzt wird, während Vorhersagen in bestimmten Ausgabeverzeichnissen generiert werden.","pt":"Habilita agentes a preverem estruturas de proteínas usando Boltz, aproveitando CUDA 12.0+ para cálculos acelerados e Python 3.10+ para integração transparente, enquanto gera previsões em diretórios de saída especificados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью прогнозировать структуры белков с помощью Boltz, используя CUDA 12.0+ для ускоренных вычислений и Python 3.10+ для бесшовной интеграции, а также генерирует прогнозы в указанных директориях вывода.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على توقع هياكل البروتين باستخدام Boltz، مستفيدا من CUDA 12.0+ للحسابات المعززة و Python 3.10+ للإدماج السلس، مع توليد التنبؤات في الدلائل المحددة للإخراج."},"useCases":{"en":["Predicting complex protein structures with Modal","Accelerating structure predictions using GPU VRAM","Generating protein structure predictions for research purposes"],"zh":["使用Modal预测复杂的蛋白质结构","利用GPU显存加速结构预测","为研究目的生成蛋白质结构预测"],"ja":["Modalを使用した複雑なタンパク質構造の予測","GPU VRAMを使用した構造予測の加速","研究目的でのタンパク質構造予測の生成"],"ko":["Modal을 사용한 복잡한 단백질 구조 예측","GPU VRAM을 사용한 구조 예측 가속화","연구 목적으로 단백질 구조 예측 생성"],"es":["Predecir estructuras de proteínas complejas con Modal","Acelerar predicciones de estructuras utilizando VRAM de GPU","Generar predicciones de estructuras de proteínas para fines de investigación"],"fr":["Prédire des structures de protéines complexes avec Modal","Accélérer les prédictions de structures en utilisant la VRAM de la GPU","Générer des prédictions de structures de protéines à des fins de recherche"],"de":["Komplexe Proteinstrukturen mit Modal vorhersagen","Strukturvorhersagen mithilfe von GPU-VRAM beschleunigen","Proteinstrukturvorhersagen für Forschungszwecke generieren"],"pt":["Prever estruturas de proteínas complexas com Modal","Acelerar previsões de estrutura usando VRAM da GPU","Gerar previsões de estrutura de proteínas para fins de pesquisa"],"ru":["Прогнозирование сложных структур белков с помощью Modal","Ускорение прогнозирования структуры с помощью VRAM GPU","Генерация прогнозов структуры белков для исследовательских целей"],"ar":["توقع هياكل البروتين المعقدة مع Modal","تعزيز توقعات الهيكل باستخدام VRAM GPU","توليد توقعات هيكل البروتين لأغراض البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.10+","CUDA 12.0+ required","Minimum 24GB GPU VRAM","64GB RAM recommended"],"zh":["需要Python 3.10+","需要CUDA 12.0+","最低需要24GB GPU显存","推荐64GB内存"],"ja":["Python 3.10+が必要","CUDA 12.0+が必要","最低24GBのGPU VRAMが必要","64GBのRAMを推奨"],"ko":["Python 3.10+ 필요","CUDA 12.0+ 필요","최소 24GB GPU VRAM 필요","64GB RAM 권장"],"es":["Se requiere Python 3.10+","Se requiere CUDA 12.0+","Mínimo 24GB de VRAM de GPU","Se recomienda 64GB de RAM"],"fr":["Python 3.10+ requis","CUDA 12.0+ requis","Minimum 24Go de VRAM de GPU","64Go de RAM recommandés"],"de":["Python 3.10+ erforderlich","CUDA 12.0+ erforderlich","Mindestens 24GB GPU-VRAM","64GB RAM empfohlen"],"pt":["Requer Python 3.10+","CUDA 12.0+ é necessário","Mínimo 24GB de VRAM da GPU","64GB de RAM recomendado"],"ru":["Требуется Python 3.10+","CUDA 12.0+ требуется","Минимум 24GB VRAM GPU","64GB ОЗУ рекомендуется"],"ar":["يتطلب Python 3.10+","CUDA 12.0+ مطلوب","أدنى حد 24GB من VRAM GPU","64GB من RAM مفضل"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
