N Canvas Spec 1.0","用于Obsidian和其他应用程序","灵活的文件结构","易于使用和集成"],"ja":["有効なJSONキャンバスファイルを作成および編集","JSON Canvas Spec 1.0をサポート","Obsidianおよびその他のアプリケーションで使用","柔軟なファイル構造","簡単に使用および統合"],"ko":["유효한 JSON 캔버스 파일을 생성하고 편집","JSON Canvas Spec 1.0을 지원","Obsidian 및 기타 애플리케이션에서 사용","유연한 파일 구조","쉽게 사용하고 통합"],"es":["Creación y edición de archivos JSON Canvas","Compatibilidad con Obsidian y otras aplicaciones","Estructura de archivo basada en JSON","Soporte para nodos y aristas","Seguimiento de la especificación JSON Canvas 1.0"],"fr":["Création et édition de fichiers JSON Canvas","Compatibilité avec Obsidian et d''autres applications","Structure de fichier basée sur JSON","Prise en charge des nœuds et des arêtes","Suivi de la spécification JSON Canvas 1.0"],"de":["Erstellung und Bearbeitung von JSON-Canvas-Dateien","Kompatibilität mit Obsidian und anderen Anwendungen","Dateistruktur basierend auf JSON","Unterstützung für Knoten und Kanten","Einhaltung der JSON-Canvas-Spezifikation 1.0"],"pt":["Criação e edição de arquivos JSON Canvas","Compatibilidade com Obsidian e outras aplicações","Estrutura de arquivo com nodes e edges","Suporte à especificação JSON Canvas 1.0","Capacidade de resolver problemas complexos de forma sistemática"],"ru":["Создание и редактирование файлов JSON Canvas","Совместимость с Obsidian и другими приложениями","Структура файла с узлами и ребрами","Поддержка спецификации JSON Canvas 1.0","Способность решать сложные проблемы систематически"],"ar":["إنشاء وتحرير ملفات JSON Canvas","التأثير مع Obsidian وتطبيقات أخرى","هيكل الملف مع العقد والهوامش","دعم مواصفات JSON Canvas 1.0","القدرة على حل المشكلات المعقدة بشكل منهجي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["JSON画布技能","JSON画布文件","Obsidian","JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","开发者工具","文件编辑"],"ja":["JSONキャンバススキル","JSONキャンバスファイル","Obsidian","JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","開発者ツール","ファイル編集"],"ko":["JSON 캔버스 스킬","JSON 캔버스 파일","Obsidian","JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","개발자 도구","파일 편집"],"es":["JSON Canvas","archivos de canvas","formato de archivo abierto","datos de canvas infinito","Obsidian","desarrollo de software","programación"],"fr":["JSON Canvas","fichiers de canvas","format de fichier ouvert","données de canvas infini","Obsidian","développement de logiciels","programmation"],"de":["JSON Canvas","Canvas-Dateien","offenes Dateiformat","infinite Canvas-Daten","Obsidian","Software-Entwicklung","Programmierung"],"pt":["JSON Canvas","arquivos JSON Canvas","Obsidian","desenvolvimento full-stack","lógica complexa","processamento de multimídia","Skills de agente"],"ru":["JSON Canvas","файлы JSON Canvas","Obsidian","разработка полного стека","сложная логика","обработка мультимедиа","Навыки агента"],"ar":["JSON Canvas","ملفات JSON Canvas","Obsidian","تطوير بSTACK كامل","منطق معقد","معالجة الوسائط المتعددة","مهارات الوكيل"]}},"owner":"guanyang","repo":"antigravity-skills","repoPath":"guanyang/antigravity-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"json-canvas","description":"Create and edit JSON Canvas files (.canvas) with nodes, edges, groups, and connections. Use when working with .canvas files, creating visual canvases, mind maps, flowcharts, or when the user mentions Canvas files in Obsidian.","bodyPreview":"# JSON Canvas Skill\n\nThis skill enables skills-compatible agents to create and edit valid JSON Canvas files (`.canvas`) used in Obsidian and other applications.\n\n## Overview\n\nJSON Canvas is an open file format for infinite canvas data. Canvas files use the `.canvas` extension and contain valid JSON following the [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/).\n\n## File Structure\n\nA canvas file contains two top-level arrays:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n- `nodes` (optio","body":"# JSON Canvas Skill\n\nThis skill enables skills-compatible agents to create and edit valid JSON Canvas files (`.canvas`) used in Obsidian and other applications.\n\n## Overview\n\nJSON Canvas is an open file format for infinite canvas data. Canvas files use the `.canvas` extension and contain valid JSON following the [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/).\n\n## File Structure\n\nA canvas file contains two top-level arrays:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n- `nodes` (optional): Array of node objects\n- `edges` (optional): Array of edge objects connecting nodes\n\n## Nodes\n\nNodes are objects placed on the canvas. There are four node types:\n- `text` - Text content with Markdown\n- `file` - Reference to files/attachments\n- `link` - External URL\n- `group` - Visual container for other nodes\n\n### Z-Index Ordering\n\nNodes are ordered by z-index in the array:\n- First node = bottom layer (displayed below others)\n- Last node = top layer (displayed above others)\n\n### Generic Node Attributes\n\nAll nodes share these attributes:\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `id` | Yes | string | Unique identifier for the node |\n| `type` | Yes | string | Node type: `text`, `file`, `link`, or `group` |\n| `x` | Yes | integer | X position in pixels |\n| `y` | Yes | integer | Y position in pixels |\n| `width` | Yes | integer | Width in pixels |\n| `height` | Yes | integer | Height in pixels |\n| `color` | No | canvasColor | Node color (see Color section) |\n\n### Text Nodes\n\nText nodes contain Markdown content.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"type\": \"text\",\n  \"x\": 0,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 200,\n  \"text\": \"# Hello World\\n\\nThis is **Markdown** content.\"\n}\n```\n\n#### Newline Escaping (Common Pitfall)\n\nIn JSON, newline characters inside strings **must** be represented as `\\n`. Do **not** use the literal sequence `\\\\n` in a `.canvas` file—Obsidian will render it as the characters `\\` and `n` instead of a line break.\n\nExamples:\n\n```json\n{ \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Line 1\\nLine 2\" }\n```\n\n```json\n{ \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Line 1\\\\nLine 2\" }\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `text` | Yes | string | Plain text with Markdown syntax |\n\n### File Nodes\n\nFile nodes reference files or attachments (images, videos, PDFs, notes, etc.).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4e5f67890\",\n  \"type\": \"file\",\n  \"x\": 500,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 300,\n  \"file\": \"Attachments/diagram.png\"\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"b2c3d4e5f6789012\",\n  \"type\": \"file\",\n  \"x\": 500,\n  \"y\": 400,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 300,\n  \"file\": \"Notes/Project Overview.md\",\n  \"subpath\": \"#Implementation\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `file` | Yes | string | Path to file within the system |\n| `subpath` | No | string | Link to heading or block (starts with `#`) |\n\n### Link Nodes\n\nLink nodes display external URLs.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"c3d4e5f678901234\",\n  \"type\": \"link\",\n  \"x\": 1000,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 200,\n  \"url\": \"https://obsidian.md\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `url` | Yes | string | External URL |\n\n### Group Nodes\n\nGroup nodes are visual containers for organizing other nodes.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"d4e5f6789012345a\",\n  \"type\": \"group\",\n  \"x\": -50,\n  \"y\": -50,\n  \"width\": 1000,\n  \"height\": 600,\n  \"label\": \"Project Overview\",\n  \"color\": \"4\"\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"e5f67890123456ab\",\n  \"type\": \"group\",\n  \"x\": 0,\n  \"y\": 700,\n  \"width\": 800,\n  \"height\": 500,\n  \"label\": \"Resources\",\n  \"background\": \"Attachments/background.png\",\n  \"backgroundStyle\": \"cover\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `label` | No | string | Text label for the group |\n| `background` | No | string | Path to background image |\n| `backgroundStyle` | No | string | Background rendering style |\n\n#### Background Styles\n\n| Value | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `cover` | Fills entire width and height of node |\n| `ratio` | Maintains aspect ratio of background image |\n| `repeat` | Repeats image as pattern in both directions |\n\n## Edges\n\nEdges are lines connecting nodes.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"f67890123456789a\",\n  \"fromNode\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"toNode\": \"a1b2c3d4e5f67890\"\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"0123456789abcdef\",\n  \"fromNode\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n  \"fromEnd\": \"none\",\n  \"toNode\": \"b2c3d4e5f6789012\",\n  \"toSide\": \"left\",\n  \"toEnd\": \"arrow\",\n  \"color\": \"1\",\n  \"label\": \"leads to\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Default | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|---------|-------------|\n| `id` | Yes | string | - | Unique identifier for the edge |\n| `fromNode` | Yes | string | - | Node ID where connection starts |\n| `fromSide` | No | string | - | Side where edge starts |\n| `fromEnd` | No | string | `none` | Shape at edge start |\n| `toNode` | Yes | string | - | Node ID where connection ends |\n| `toSide` | No | string | - | Side where edge ends |\n| `toEnd` | No | string | `arrow` | Shape at edge end |\n| `color` | No | canvasColor | - | Line color |\n| `label` | No | string | - | Text label for the edge |\n\n### Side Values\n\n| Value | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `top` | Top edge of node |\n| `right` | Right edge of node |\n| `bottom` | Bottom edge of node |\n| `left` | Left edge of node |\n\n### End Shapes\n\n| Value | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `none` | No endpoint shape |\n| `arrow` | Arrow endpoint |\n\n## Colors\n\nThe `canvasColor` type can be specified in two ways:\n\n### Hex Colors\n\n```json\n{\n  \"color\": \"#FF0000\"\n}\n```\n\n### Preset Colors\n\n```json\n{\n  \"color\": \"1\"\n}\n```\n\n| Preset | Color |\n|--------|-------|\n| `\"1\"` | Red |\n| `\"2\"` | Orange |\n| `\"3\"` | Yellow |\n| `\"4\"` | Green |\n| `\"5\"` | Cyan |\n| `\"6\"` | Purple |\n\nNote: Specific color values for presets are intentionally undefined, allowing applications to use their own brand colors.\n\n## Complete Examples\n\n### Simple Canvas with Text and Connections\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 150,\n      \"text\": \"# Main Idea\\n\\nThis is the central concept.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": -100,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"text\": \"## Supporting Point A\\n\\nDetails here.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": 100,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"text\": \"## Supporting Point B\\n\\nMore details.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Project Board with Groups\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f\",\n      \"type\": \"group\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 500,\n      \"label\": \"To Do\",\n      \"color\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a\",\n      \"type\": \"group\",\n      \"x\": 350,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 500,\n      \"label\": \"In Progress\",\n      \"color\": \"3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b\",\n      \"type\": \"group\",\n      \"x\": 700,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 500,\n      \"label\": \"Done\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 20,\n      \"y\": 50,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"## Task 1\\n\\nImplement feature X\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 370,\n      \"y\": 50,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"## Task 2\\n\\nReview PR #123\",\n      \"color\": \"2\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"0d1e2f3a4b5c6d7e\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 720,\n      \"y\": 50,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"## Task 3\\n\\n~~Setup CI/CD~~\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n### Research Canvas with Files and Links\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 300,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 400,\n      \"height\": 200,\n      \"text\": \"# Research Topic\\n\\n## Key Questions\\n\\n- How does X affect Y?\\n- What are the implications?\",\n      \"color\": \"5\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"2f3a4b5c6d7e8f9a\",\n      \"type\": \"file\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 150,\n      \"file\": \"Literature/Paper A.pdf\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3a4b5c6d7e8f9a0b\",\n      \"type\": \"file\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 150,\n      \"file\": \"Notes/Meeting Notes.md\",\n      \"subpath\": \"#Key Insights\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"4b5c6d7e8f9a0b1c\",\n      \"type\": \"link\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 400,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"url\": \"https://example.com/research\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"5c6d7e8f9a0b1c2d\",\n      \"type\": \"file\",\n      \"x\": 750,\n      \"y\": 150,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 250,\n      \"file\": \"Attachments/diagram.png\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"6d7e8f9a0b1c2d3e\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"2f3a4b5c6d7e8f9a\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"supports\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"7e8f9a0b1c2d3e4f\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"3a4b5c6d7e8f9a0b\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"informs\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8f9a0b1c2d3e4f5a\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"4b5c6d7e8f9a0b1c\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"toEnd\": \"arrow\",\n      \"color\": \"6\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"9a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"5c6d7e8f9a0b1c2d\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"visualized by\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Flowchart\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b7\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 200,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"**Start**\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 200,\n      \"y\": 100,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"Step 1:\\nGather data\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 200,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"**Decision**\\n\\nIs data valid?\",\n      \"color\": \"3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"Process data\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"Request new data\",\n      \"color\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"f5a6b7c8d9e0f1a2\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": 320,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"**End**\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"a6b7c8d9e0f1a2b3\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b7\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"bottom\",\n      \"toNode\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"toSide\": \"top\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b7c8d9e0f1a2b3c4\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"bottom\",\n      \"toNode\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"toSide\": \"top\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"c8d9e0f1a2b3c4d5\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"Yes\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"d9e0f1a2b3c4d5e6\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"left\",\n      \"toNode\": \"e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1\",\n      \"toSide\": \"right\",\n      \"label\": \"No\",\n      \"color\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"e0f1a2b3c4d5e6f7\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"top\",\n      \"fromEnd\": \"none\",\n      \"toNode\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"toEnd\": \"arrow\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"bottom\",\n      \"toNode\": \"f5a6b7c8d9e0f1a2\",\n      \"toSide\": \"top\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## ID Generation\n\nNode and edge IDs must be unique strings. Obsidian generates 16-character hexadecimal IDs:\n\n```json\n\"id\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\"\n\"id\": \"a3b2c1d0e9f8g7h6\"\n\"id\": \"1234567890abcdef\"\n```\n\nThis format is a 16-character lowercase hex string (64-bit random value).\n\n## Layout Guidelines\n\n### Positioning\n\n- Coordinates can be negative (canvas extends infinitely)\n- `x` increases to the right\n- `y` increases downward\n- Position refers to top-left corner of node\n\n### Recommended Sizes\n\n| Node Type | Suggested Width | Suggested Height |\n|-----------|-----------------|------------------|\n| Small text | 200-300 | 80-150 |\n| Medium text | 300-450 | 150-300 |\n| Large text | 400-600 | 300-500 |\n| File preview | 300-500 | 200-400 |\n| Link preview | 250-400 | 100-200 |\n| Group | Varies | Varies |\n\n### Spacing\n\n- Leave 20-50px padding inside groups\n- Space nodes 50-100px apart for readability\n- Align nodes to grid (multiples of 10 or 20) for cleaner layouts\n\n## Validation Rules\n\n1. All `id` values must be unique across nodes and edges\n2. `fromNode` and `toNode` must reference existing node IDs\n3. Required fields must be present for each node type\n4. `type` must be one of: `text`, `file`, `link`, `group`\n5. `backgroundStyle` must be one of: `cover`, `ratio`, `repeat`\n6. `fromSide`, `toSide` must be one of: `top`, `right`, `bottom`, `left`\n7. `fromEnd`, `toEnd` must be one of: `none`, `arrow`\n8. Color presets must be `\"1\"` through `\"6\"` or valid hex color\n\n## References\n\n- [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/)\n- [JSON Canvas GitHub](https://github.com/obsidianmd/jsoncanvas)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:07:20.089Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing advanced JSON data visualization and editing capabilities in Obsidian and other applications.","zh":"非常适合需要在 Obsidian 和其他应用程序中高级 JSON 数据可视化和编辑功能的开发代理。","ja":"Obsidian やその他のアプリケーションで高度な JSON データの視覚化と編集機能を必要とする開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Obsidian 및 기타 응용 프로그램에서 고급 JSON 데이터 시각화 및 편집 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de visualización y edición de datos JSON en Obsidian y otras aplicaciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de capacités avancées de visualisation et de modification de données JSON dans Obsidian et d''autres applications.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die erweiterte JSON-Datenvisualisierungs- und -bearbeitungsfunktionen in Obsidian und anderen Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de visualização e edição de dados JSON no Obsidian e em outras aplicações.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности визуализации и редактирования данных JSON в Obsidian и других приложениях.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتصور بيانات JSON وتحريرها في Obsidian وتطبيقات أخرى."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and edit valid JSON Canvas files (.canvas) following the JSON Canvas Spec 1.0, enabling systematic problem-solving for complex data visualization tasks through modular skills definitions, and leveraging top-level arrays such as nodes and edges.","zh":"赋予代理创建和编辑有效的 JSON 画布文件（.canvas），遵循 JSON 画布规范 1.0，通过模块化技能定义实现复杂数据视觉化任务的系统化问题解决，并利用顶级数组，如节点和边。","ja":"エージェントに、JSON Canvas Spec 1.0 に準拠した有効な JSON Canvas ファイル (.canvas) を作成および編集する機能を提供し、モジュラーなスキル定義を通じて複雑なデータ視覚化タスクの体系的な問題解決を可能にし、ノードやエッジなどのトップレベルの配列を活用します。","ko":"에이전트가 JSON Canvas Spec 1.0을 준수하는 유효한 JSON Canvas 파일(.canvas)을 생성 및 편집할 수 있도록 하여, 모듈식 스킬 정의를 통해 복잡한 데이터 시각화 작업의 체계적인 문제 해결을 가능하게 하고, 노드 및 엣지와 같은 최상위 배열을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y editar archivos JSON Canvas válidos (.canvas) siguiendo la especificación JSON Canvas 1.0, permitiendo la resolución sistemática de problemas para tareas de visualización de datos complejos a través de definiciones de habilidades modulares, y aprovechando matrices de nivel superior como nodos y bordes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de modifier des fichiers JSON Canvas valides (.canvas) suivant la spécification JSON Canvas 1.0, permettant une résolution systématique des problèmes pour des tâches de visualisation de données complexes via des définitions de compétences modulaires, et exploitant des tableaux de niveau supérieur tels que des nœuds et des arêtes.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, gültige JSON-Canvas-Dateien (.canvas) gemäß der JSON-Canvas-Spezifikation 1.0 zu erstellen und zu bearbeiten, wodurch systematische Problemlösungen für komplexe Datenvisualisierungsaufgaben durch modulare Fähigkeitsdefinitionen ermöglicht werden und Top-Level-Arrays wie Knoten und Kanten genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar e editar arquivos JSON Canvas válidos (.canvas) seguindo a Especificação JSON Canvas 1.0, permitindo a resolução sistemática de problemas para tarefas de visualização de dados complexos por meio de definições de habilidades modulares, e aproveitando matrizes de nível superior, como nodes e edges.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и редактировать действительные файлы JSON Canvas (.canvas) в соответствии со спецификацией JSON Canvas 1.0, позволяя систематически решать проблемы для сложных задач визуализации данных посредством модульных определений навыков и использования верхнеуровневых массивов, таких как nodes и edges.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء وتحرير ملفات JSON Canvas صالحة (.canvas) بالاعتماد على مواصفات JSON Canvas 1.0، وتمكين حل المشكلات بنظام لتمثيل بيانات معقدة من خلال تعريفات المهارات المتواصلة، وامتلاك مصفوفات من المستوى الأعلى مثل العقد والزوايا."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating valid JSON Canvas files for Obsidian","Editing existing .canvas files for data visualization","Creating modular skills definitions for systematic problem-solving"],"zh":["为 Obsidian 生成有效的 JSON 画布文件","编辑现有的 .canvas 文件以进行数据视觉化","创建模块化技能定义以进行系统化问题解决"],"ja":["Obsidian 用の有効な JSON Canvas ファイルを生成する","既存の .canvas ファイルを編集してデータ視覚化を行う","体系的な問題解決のためのモジュラーなスキル定義を作成する"],"ko":["Obsidian을 위한 유효한 JSON Canvas 파일 생성","기존의 .canvas 파일 편집을 통한 데이터 시각화","체계적인 문제 해결을 위한 모듈식 스킬 정의 생성"],"es":["Generar archivos JSON Canvas válidos para Obsidian","Editar archivos .canvas existentes para la visualización de datos","Crear definiciones de habilidades modulares para la resolución sistemática de problemas"],"fr":["Générer des fichiers JSON Canvas valides pour Obsidian","Modifier des fichiers .canvas existants pour la visualisation de données","Créer des définitions de compétences modulaires pour la résolution systématique des problèmes"],"de":["Erstellen von gültigen JSON-Canvas-Dateien für Obsidian","Bearbeiten von vorhandenen .canvas-Dateien für die Datenvisualisierung","Erstellen von modularen Fähigkeitsdefinitionen für die systematische Problemlösung"],"pt":["Geração de arquivos JSON Canvas válidos para Obsidian","Edição de arquivos .canvas existentes para visualização de dados","Criação de definições de habilidades modulares para resolução sistemática de problemas"],"ru":["Генерация действительных файлов JSON Canvas для Obsidian","Редактирование существующих файлов .canvas для визуализации данных","Создание модульных определений навыков для систематического решения проблем"],"ar":["генерация ملفات JSON Canvas صالحة لبرنامج Obsidian","تحرير ملفات .canvas الحالية لتصور البيانات","إنشاء تعريفات مهارات متواصلة لحل المشكلات بنظام"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires compatibility with JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","Limited to .canvas file format"],"zh":["需要与 JSON Canvas Spec 1.0 兼容","仅限 .canvas 文件格式"],"ja":["JSON Canvas Spec 1.0 との互換性が必要",".canvas ファイル形式のみに限定される"],"ko":["JSON Canvas Spec 1.0과 호환성이 필요",".canvas 파일 형식만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con la especificación JSON Canvas 1.0","Limitado al formato de archivo .canvas"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec la spécification JSON Canvas 1.0","Limité au format de fichier .canvas"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit der JSON-Canvas-Spezifikation 1.0","Begrenzt auf das Dateiformat .canvas"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com a Especificação JSON Canvas 1.0","Limitado ao formato de arquivo .canvas"],"ru":["Требует совместимости со спецификацией JSON Canvas 1.0","Ограничен форматом файла .canvas"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع مواصفات JSON Canvas 1.0","محدود بتنسيق ملف .canvas"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('prowler-cloud/prowler/skill-creator', 'community', 'prowler-cloud', 'prowler', 'prowler-cloud/prowler', 'skill-creator', 0, 0, 85, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z', '2026-02-18T04:07:12.055Z', NULL, '{"id":"prowler-cloud/prowler/skill-creator","name":"skill-creator","description":{"zh":"Prowler 是一款开源云安全平台，帮助开发者自动化安全和合规。创建技能可以指导 AI 复杂的工作流程","ja":"Prowler はオープンソースのクラウドセキュリティプラットフォームで、開発者がセキュリティとコンプライアンスを自動化するのに役立ちます。スキルを作成すると、AI が複雑なワークフローを実行するのをサポートできます","ko":"Prowler는 개발자가 보안과 컴플라이언스를 자동화하도록 도와주는 오픈소스 클라우드 보안 플랫폼입니다. 스킬을 생성하여 AI가 복잡한 워크플로우를 처리하도록 지원할 수 있습니다","es":"El skill-creator es una herramienta para crear habilidades personalizadas que automatizan la seguridad y el cumplimiento en entornos de nube. Ayuda a los desarrolladores a crear patrones y flujos de trabajo personalizados","fr":"Le skill-creator est un outil pour créer des compétences personnalisées qui automatisent la sécurité et la conformité dans les environnements cloud. Il aide les développeurs à créer des modèles et des flux de travail personnalisés","de":"Der skill-creator ist ein Tool zum Erstellen benutzerdefinierter Fähigkeiten, die die Sicherheit und Compliance in Cloud-Umgebungen automatisieren. Es hilft Entwicklern, benutzerdefinierte Muster und Workflows zu erstellen","pt":"O criador de habilidades ajuda a automatizar segurança e conformidade em nuvem, permitindo que os desenvolvedores criem habilidades personalizadas para suas necessidades específicas","ru":"Создатель навыков помогает автоматизировать безопасность и соответствие требованиям в облаке, позволяя разработчикам создавать пользовательские навыки для своих конкретных потребностей","ar":"مبدع المهارات يساعد على تحسين أمان السحابة والامتثال، مما يسمح للمطورين بإنشاء مهارات مخصصة لاحتياجاتهم الخاصة","en":"Prowler is the world’s most widely used open-source cloud security platform that automates security and compliance across any cloud environment."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"技能创建器：云安全自动化","ja":"スキルクリエーター：クラウドセキュリティの自動化","ko":"스킬 생성기: 클라우드 보안 자동화","es":"Crea habilidades personalizadas con skill-creator","fr":"Créez des compétences personnalisées avec skill-creator","de":"Erstellen Sie benutzerdefinierte Fähigkeiten mit skill-cr...","pt":"Criador de Habilidades: Automatize Segurança em Nuvem","ru":"Создатель Навыков: Автоматизируйте Облачную Безопасность","ar":"مبدع المهارات: أتمتة أمن السحابة","en":"skill-creator"},"description":{"zh":"Prowler 是一款开源云安全平台，帮助开发者自动化安全和合规。创建技能可以指导 AI 复杂的工作流程","ja":"Prowler はオープンソースのクラウドセキュリティプラットフォームで、開発者がセキュリティとコンプライアンスを自動化するのに役立ちます。スキルを作成すると、AI が複雑なワークフローを実行するのをサポートできます","ko":"Prowler는 개발자가 보안과 컴플라이언스를 자동화하도록 도와주는 오픈소스 클라우드 보안 플랫폼입니다. 스킬을 생성하여 AI가 복잡한 워크플로우를 처리하도록 지원할 수 있습니다","es":"El skill-creator es una herramienta para crear habilidades personalizadas que automatizan la seguridad y el cumplimiento en entornos de nube. Ayuda a los des...","fr":"Le skill-creator est un outil pour créer des compétences personnalisées qui automatisent la sécurité et la conformité dans les environnements cloud. Il aide ...","de":"Der skill-creator ist ein Tool zum Erstellen benutzerdefinierter Fähigkeiten, die die Sicherheit und Compliance in Cloud-Umgebungen automatisieren. Es hilft ...","pt":"O criador de habilidades ajuda a automatizar segurança e conformidade em nuvem, permitindo que os desenvolvedores criem habilidades personalizadas para suas ...","ru":"Создатель навыков помогает автоматизировать безопасность и соответствие требованиям в облаке, позволяя разработчикам создавать пользовательские навыки для св...","ar":"مبدع المهارات يساعد على تحسين أمان السحابة والامتثال، مما يسمح للمطورين بإنشاء مهارات مخصصة لاحتياجاتهم الخاصة","en":"Prowler is the world’s most widely used open-source cloud security platform that automates security and compliance across any cloud environment."},"definition":{"en":"Prowler is the world’s most widely used open-source cloud security platform that automates security and compliance across any cloud environment."},"features":{"zh":["自动化安全和合规","指导 AI 复杂工作流程","支持项目特定约定","提供决策树","创建技能结构"],"ja":["セキュリティとコンプライアンスの自動化","AI の複雑なワークフローをサポート","プロジェクト特有の約定をサポート","決定ツリーを提供","スキルの構造を作成"],"ko":["보안과 컴플라이언스의 자동화","AI의 복잡한 워크플로우 지원","프로젝트 특정 규약 지원","결정 트리 제공","스킬 구조 생성"],"es":["Automatización de seguridad y cumplimiento","Creación de patrones y flujos de trabajo personalizados","Integración con entornos de nube","Compatibilidad con Prowler","Documentación y referencias personalizadas"],"fr":["Automatisation de la sécurité et de la conformité","Création de modèles et de flux de travail personnalisés","Intégration avec les environnements cloud","Compatibilité avec Prowler","Documentation et références personnalisées"],"de":["Automatisierung von Sicherheit und Compliance","Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Muster und Workflows","Integration mit Cloud-Umgebungen","Kompatibilität mit Prowler","Benutzerdefinierte Dokumentation und Referenzen"],"pt":["Automação de segurança em nuvem","Criação de habilidades personalizadas","Integração com o Prowler","Suporte a workflows complexos","Decisão de árvores para escolher a abordagem certa"],"ru":["Автоматизация безопасности в облаке","Создание пользовательских навыков","Интеграция с Prowler","Поддержка сложных рабочих процессов","Деревья решений для выбора правильного подхода"],"ar":["أتمتة أمان السحابة","إنشاء مهارات مخصصة","التكامل مع Prowler","دعم سير العمل المعقدة","شجرة القرار لاختيار النهج الصحيح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["云安全","自动化","合规性","AI","工作流程","决策树","技能创建","Prowler"],"ja":["クラウドセキュリティ","自動化","コンプライアンス","AI","ワークフロー","決定ツリー","スキル作成","Prowler"],"ko":["클라우드 보안","자동화","컴플라이언스","AI","워크플로우","결정 트리","스킬 생성","Prowler"],"es":["skill-creator","automatización de seguridad","cumplimiento en la nube","Prowler","desarrollo de habilidades personalizadas","seguridad en la nube","compliance en la nube"],"fr":["skill-creator","automatisation de la sécurité","conformité dans le cloud","Prowler","développement de compétences personnalisées","sécurité dans le cloud","conformité dans le cloud"],"de":["skill-creator","Automatisierung von Sicherheit","Compliance in der Cloud","Prowler","Entwicklung benutzerdefinierter Fähigkeiten","Sicherheit in der Cloud","Compliance in der Cloud"],"pt":["segurança em nuvem","conformidade em nuvem","automação de segurança","criador de habilidades","Prowler","desenvolvimento de habilidades","segurança de nuvem personalizada"],"ru":["облачная безопасность","соответствие требованиям в облаке","автоматизация безопасности","создатель навыков","Prowler","разработка навыков","пользовательская облачная безопасность"],"ar":["أمان السحابة","الامتثال للسحابة","أتمتة الأمان","مبدع المهارات","Prowler","تطوير المهارات","أمان السحابة المخصص"]}},"owner":"prowler-cloud","repo":"prowler","repoPath":"prowler-cloud/prowler","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill-creator","description":">","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"## When to Create a Skill\n\nCreate a skill when:\n- A pattern is used repeatedly and AI needs guidance\n- Project-specific conventions differ from generic best practices\n- Complex workflows need step-by-step instructions\n- Decision trees help AI choose the right approach\n\n**Don''t create a skill when:**\n- Documentation already exists (create a reference instead)\n- Pattern is trivial or self-explanatory\n- It''s a one-off task\n\n---\n\n## Skill Structure\n\n```\nskills/{skill-name}/\n├── SKILL.md","body":"## When to Create a Skill\n\nCreate a skill when:\n- A pattern is used repeatedly and AI needs guidance\n- Project-specific conventions differ from generic best practices\n- Complex workflows need step-by-step instructions\n- Decision trees help AI choose the right approach\n\n**Don''t create a skill when:**\n- Documentation already exists (create a reference instead)\n- Pattern is trivial or self-explanatory\n- It''s a one-off task\n\n---\n\n## Skill Structure\n\n```\nskills/{skill-name}/\n├── SKILL.md              # Required - main skill file\n├── assets/               # Optional - templates, schemas, examples\n│   ├── template.py\n│   └── schema.json\n└── references/           # Optional - links to local docs\n    └── docs.md           # Points to docs/developer-guide/*.mdx\n```\n\n---\n\n## SKILL.md Template\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: {skill-name}\ndescription: >\n  {One-line description of what this skill does}.\n  Trigger: {When the AI should load this skill}.\nlicense: Apache-2.0\nmetadata:\n  author: prowler-cloud\n  version: \"1.0\"\n---\n\n## When to Use\n\n{Bullet points of when to use this skill}\n\n## Critical Patterns\n\n{The most important rules - what AI MUST know}\n\n## Code Examples\n\n{Minimal, focused examples}\n\n## Commands\n\n```bash\n{Common commands}\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **Templates**: See [assets/](assets/) for {description}\n- **Documentation**: See [references/](references/) for local docs\n```\n\n---\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\n| Type | Pattern | Examples |\n|------|---------|----------|\n| Generic skill | `{technology}` | `pytest`, `playwright`, `typescript` |\n| Prowler-specific | `prowler-{component}` | `prowler-api`, `prowler-ui`, `prowler-sdk-check` |\n| Testing skill | `prowler-test-{component}` | `prowler-test-sdk`, `prowler-test-api` |\n| Workflow skill | `{action}-{target}` | `skill-creator`, `jira-task` |\n\n---\n\n## Decision: assets/ vs references/\n\n```\nNeed code templates?        → assets/\nNeed JSON schemas?          → assets/\nNeed example configs?       → assets/\nLink to existing docs?      → references/\nLink to external guides?    → references/ (with local path)\n```\n\n**Key Rule**: `references/` should point to LOCAL files (`docs/developer-guide/*.mdx`), not web URLs.\n\n---\n\n## Decision: Prowler-Specific vs Generic\n\n```\nPatterns apply to ANY project?     → Generic skill (e.g., pytest, typescript)\nPatterns are Prowler-specific?     → prowler-{name} skill\nGeneric skill needs Prowler info?  → Add references/ pointing to Prowler docs\n```\n\n---\n\n## Frontmatter Fields\n\n| Field | Required | Description |\n|-------|----------|-------------|\n| `name` | Yes | Skill identifier (lowercase, hyphens) |\n| `description` | Yes | What + Trigger in one block |\n| `license` | Yes | Always `Apache-2.0` for Prowler |\n| `metadata.author` | Yes | `prowler-cloud` |\n| `metadata.version` | Yes | Semantic version as string |\n\n---\n\n## Content Guidelines\n\n### DO\n- Start with the most critical patterns\n- Use tables for decision trees\n- Keep code examples minimal and focused\n- Include Commands section with copy-paste commands\n\n### DON''T\n- Add Keywords section (agent searches frontmatter, not body)\n- Duplicate content from existing docs (reference instead)\n- Include lengthy explanations (link to docs)\n- Add troubleshooting sections (keep focused)\n- Use web URLs in references (use local paths)\n\n---\n\n## Registering the Skill\n\nAfter creating the skill, add it to `AGENTS.md`:\n\n```markdown\n| `{skill-name}` | {Description} | [SKILL.md](skills/{skill-name}/SKILL.md) |\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist Before Creating\n\n- [ ] Skill doesn''t already exist (check `skills/`)\n- [ ] Pattern is reusable (not one-off)\n- [ ] Name follows conventions\n- [ ] Frontmatter is complete (description includes trigger keywords)\n- [ ] Critical patterns are clear\n- [ ] Code examples are minimal\n- [ ] Commands section exists\n- [ ] Added to AGENTS.md\n\n## Resources\n\n- **Templates**: See [assets/](assets/) for SKILL.md template\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:07:12.055Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing structured guidance on creating reusable skills for automating security and compliance workflows","zh":"非常适合像 Cursor、Windsurf 和 Claude Code 这样的 AI Agent，它们需要结构化的指导来创建可重用的技能，以自动化安全和合规工作流","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude Code などの AI エージェントに適しています。これらは、セキュリティとコンプライアンスのワークフローを自動化するための再利用可能なスキルの作成に関する構造化されたガイダンスが必要です","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 이들은 보안 및 규정 준수 워크플로를 자동화하기 위한 재사용 가능한 기술을 만들기 위한 구조화된 지침이 필요합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan orientación estructurada para crear habilidades reutilizables para automatizar flujos de trabajo de seguridad y cumplimiento","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code ayant besoin d''une orientation structurée pour créer des compétences réutilisables pour automatiser les flux de travail de sécurité et de conformité","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die strukturierte Anleitung für die Erstellung wiederverwendbarer Fähigkeiten zur Automatisierung von Sicherheits- und Compliance-Workflows benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de orientação estruturada para criar habilidades reutilizáveis para automatizar fluxos de trabalho de segurança e conformidade","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым требуется структурированное руководство для создания многократно используемых навыков для автоматизации рабочих процессов безопасности и соответствия требованиям","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى توجيه منظم لإنشاء مهارات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لتحسين سير عمل الأمان والامتثال"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate complex workflows using decision trees and step-by-step instructions, leveraging patterns and project-specific conventions to guide AI decision-making, and integrating with cloud security platforms like Prowler","zh":"赋予代理自动化复杂的工作流的能力，使用决策树和步骤式指令，利用模式和项目特定的约定来指导 AI 决策，并与 Prowler 等云安全平台集成","ja":"エージェントに、決定木とステップバイステップの指示を使用して複雑なワークフローを自動化する能力を付与し、パターンとプロジェクト固有の約定を利用して AI の意思決定を導き、Prowler などのクラウドセキュリティプラットフォームと統合する","ko":"에이전트가 결정 트리와 단계별 지침을 사용하여 복잡한 워크플로를 자동화할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 패턴과 프로젝트 특정 규칙을 활용하여 AI 의사 결정을 안내하며, Prowler와 같은 클라우드 보안 플랫폼과 통합합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar flujos de trabajo complejos utilizando árboles de decisión e instrucciones paso a paso, aprovechando patrones y convenciones específicas de proyectos para guiar la toma de decisiones de la IA, e integrándose con plataformas de seguridad en la nube como Prowler","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser des flux de travail complexes en utilisant des arbres de décision et des instructions étape par étape, en exploitant des modèles et des conventions spécifiques aux projets pour guider la prise de décision de l''IA, et en s''intégrant avec des plateformes de sécurité cloud comme Prowler","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, komplexe Workflows mithilfe von Entscheidungsbäumen und schrittweisen Anweisungen zu automatisieren, indem sie Muster und projektspezifische Konventionen nutzen, um die Entscheidungsfindung der KI zu steuern, und sich in Cloud-Sicherheitsplattformen wie Prowler integrieren","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar fluxos de trabalho complexos usando árvores de decisão e instruções passo a passo, aproveitando padrões e convenções específicas de projeto para orientar a tomada de decisões de IA e integrar com plataformas de segurança em nuvem como Prowler","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность автоматизировать сложные рабочие процессы с помощью деревьев решений и пошаговых инструкций, используя закономерности и проектные соглашения для руководства процессом принятия решений ИИ и интеграции с облачными платформами безопасности, такими как Prowler","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من توفير سير عمل معقدة تلقائيًا باستخدام أشجار القرار والتعليمات خطوة بخطوة، واستخدام النمط والاتفاقيات المحددة للمشروع لتوجيه عملية اتخاذ قرارات الذكاء الاصطناعي، ودمجها مع منصات الأمان السحابي مثل Prowler"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating security audits","Generating compliance reports","Creating custom skill templates for cloud environments"],"zh":["自动化安全审计","生成合规报告","为云环境创建自定义技能模板"],"ja":["セキュリティ監査の自動化","コンプライアンスレポートの生成","クラウド環境用のカスタムスキルテンプレートの作成"],"ko":["보안 감사의 자동화","준수 보고서 생성","클라우드 환경을 위한 사용자 정의 스킬 템플릿 생성"],"es":["Automatizar auditorías de seguridad","Generar informes de cumplimiento","Crear plantillas de habilidades personalizadas para entornos en la nube"],"fr":["Automatiser les audits de sécurité","Générer des rapports de conformité","Créer des modèles de compétences personnalisés pour les environnements cloud"],"de":["Sicherheitsaudits automatisieren","Konformitätsberichte generieren","Benutzerdefinierte Fähigkeitsvorlagen für Cloud-Umgebungen erstellen"],"pt":["Automatizar auditorias de segurança","Gerar relatórios de conformidade","Criar modelos de habilidades personalizadas para ambientes de nuvem"],"ru":["Автоматизация аудита безопасности","Генерация отчетов о соответствии требованиям","Создание пользовательских шаблонов навыков для облачных сред"],"ar":["تحسين عمليات التدقيق الأمني","توليد تقارير الامتثال","إنشاء قوالب مهارات مخصصة لبيئات السحاب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of cloud security and compliance","Limited to automating repetitive patterns and workflows","May not be suitable for one-off tasks or trivial patterns"],"zh":["需要云安全和合规知识","仅限自动化重复模式和工作流","可能不适合一次性任务或琐碎模式"],"ja":["クラウドセキュリティとコンプライアンスの知識が必要","繰り返しのパターンとワークフローを自動化することのみに限定される","一時的なタスクやささいなパターンには適さない可能性がある"],"ko":["클라우드 보안 및 규정 준수 지식이 필요합니다","반복되는 패턴 및 워크플로 자동화에만 제한됩니다","일회성 작업 또는 사소한 패턴에는 적합하지 않을 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de seguridad en la nube y cumplimiento","Limitado a la automatización de patrones y flujos de trabajo repetitivos","Puede no ser adecuado para tareas de una sola vez o patrones triviales"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en matière de sécurité cloud et de conformité","Limité à l''automatisation de modèles et de flux de travail répétitifs","Peut ne pas être adapté aux tâches ponctuelles ou aux modèles triviaux"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Cloud-Sicherheit und Compliance","Begrenzt auf die Automatisierung wiederkehrender Muster und Workflows","Kann für Einmal-Aufgaben oder triviale Muster nicht geeignet sein"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de segurança em nuvem e conformidade","Limitado à automação de padrões e fluxos de trabalho repetitivos","Pode não ser adequado para tarefas de uma vez ou padrões triviais"],"ru":["Требует знания облачной безопасности и соответствия требованиям","Ограничен автоматизацией повторяющихся закономерностей и рабочих процессов","Может быть не подходит для одноразовых задач или тривиальных закономерностей"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بأمان السحاب والامتثال","محدود بتحسين الأنماط والعمليات المتكررة","لا يناسب المهام المنفردة أو الأنماط التافهة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":85}');
