 publicidad mediante la API o la automatización del navegador","fr":"La compétence Google Ads permet aux développeurs de gérer des comptes publicitaires via l''API ou l''automatisation du navigateur","de":"Die Google Ads Fähigkeit ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Werbekonten über die API oder die Browser-Automatisierung zu verwalten","pt":"O skill de Google Ads permite gerenciar contas via API ou automação de navegador. Escolha o modo de uso certo para o seu projeto","ru":"Навык Google Ads позволяет управлять аккаунтами через API или автоматизацию браузера. Выберите правильный режим использования для вашего проекта","ar":"تمكن مهارة جوجل أدس من إدارة الحسابات عبر واجهة برمجة التطبيقات أو تلقيم المتصفح. اختر الطريقة الصحيحة لاستخدامها في مشروعك","en":"A collection of AI agent skills for Clawdbot, Claude Code, Codex"},"definition":{"en":"A collection of AI agent skills for Clawdbot, Claude Code, Codex"},"features":{"zh":["API","Browser","Google Ads API","API","Browser","Google Ads"],"ja":["API","Browser","Google Ads API","API","Browser","Google Ads"],"ko":["API","Browser","Google Ads API","API","Browser","Google Ads"],"es":["Gestión de cuentas de Google Ads mediante la API","Automatización del navegador para tareas de publicidad","Selección de modo de operación según las necesidades del usuario","Verificación de configuración de la API","Soporte para variables de entorno"],"fr":["Gestion des comptes Google Ads via l''API","Automatisation du navigateur pour les tâches publicitaires","Sélection du mode d''opération en fonction des besoins de l''utilisateur","Vérification de la configuration de l''API","Prise en charge des variables d''environnement"],"de":["Verwaltung von Google Ads-Konten über die API","Browser-Automatisierung für Werbeaufgaben","Modus-Auswahl basierend auf den Bedürfnissen des Benutzers","Überprüfung der API-Konfiguration","Unterstützung für Umgebungsvariablen"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de contas do Google Ads via API","Automação de navegador para contas do Google Ads","Modos de uso flexíveis para projetos diferentes","Integração com o Clawdbot, Claude Code e Codex","Suporte a variáveis de ambiente e configuração de arquivo"],"ru":["Управление аккаунтами Google Ads через API","Автоматизация браузера для аккаунтов Google Ads","Гибкие режимы использования для разных проектов","Интеграция с Clawdbot, Claude Code и Codex","Поддержка переменных окружения и конфигурации файла"],"ar":["إدارة حسابات جوجل أدس عبر واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تلقيم المتصفح لحسابات جوجل أدس","أوضاع استخدام مرنة لمشاريع مختلفة","التكامل مع Clawdbot و Claude Code و Codex","دعم متغيرات البيئة وتكوين الملف"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Google Ads Skill","Google Ads API","API","Browser","Google Ads","API"],"ja":["Google Ads","Google Ads API","API","Browser","Google Ads","API"],"ko":["Google Ads ","Google Ads API","API","Browser","Google Ads","API"],"es":["google ads api","automatización de publicidad","gestión de cuentas de google ads","desarrollo de publicidad en línea","integración de google ads","publicidad en línea"],"fr":["google ads api","automatisation de la publicité","gestion des comptes google ads","développement de la publicité en ligne","intégration de google ads","publicité en ligne"],"de":["google ads api","automatisierung von werbung","verwaltung von google ads-konten","entwicklung von online-werbung","integration von google ads","online-werbung"],"pt":["google ads api","gerenciamento de contas google ads","automação de navegador","clawdbot","claude code","codex","desenvolvimento de software","ia para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["google ads api","управление аккаунтами google ads","автоматизация браузера","clawdbot","claude code","codex","разработка программного обеспечения","ии для разработчиков"],"ar":["جوجل أدس api","إدارة حسابات جوجل أدس","تلقيم المتصفح","clawdbot","claude code","codex","تطوير البرمجيات","الذكاء الاصطناعي لمطوري البرامج"]}},"owner":"jdrhyne","repo":"agent-skills","repoPath":"jdrhyne/agent-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"google-ads","description":"Query, audit, and optimize Google Ads campaigns. Supports two modes: (1) API mode for bulk operations with google-ads Python SDK, (2) Browser automation mode for users without API access - just attach a browser tab to ads.google.com. Use when asked to check ad performance, pause campaigns/keywords, find wasted spend, audit conversion tracking, or optimize Google Ads accounts.","bodyPreview":"# Google Ads Skill\n\nManage Google Ads accounts via API or browser automation.\n\n## Mode Selection\n\n**Check which mode to use:**\n\n1. **API Mode** - If user has `google-ads.yaml` configured or `GOOGLE_ADS_*` env vars\n2. **Browser Mode** - If user says \"I don''t have API access\" or just wants quick checks\n\n```bash\n# Check for API config\nls ~/.google-ads.yaml 2>/dev/null || ls google-ads.yaml 2>/dev/null\n```\n\nIf no config found, ask: \"Do you have Google Ads API credentials, or should I use browser aut","body":"# Google Ads Skill\n\nManage Google Ads accounts via API or browser automation.\n\n## Mode Selection\n\n**Check which mode to use:**\n\n1. **API Mode** - If user has `google-ads.yaml` configured or `GOOGLE_ADS_*` env vars\n2. **Browser Mode** - If user says \"I don''t have API access\" or just wants quick checks\n\n```bash\n# Check for API config\nls ~/.google-ads.yaml 2>/dev/null || ls google-ads.yaml 2>/dev/null\n```\n\nIf no config found, ask: \"Do you have Google Ads API credentials, or should I use browser automation?\"\n\n---\n\n## Browser Automation Mode (Universal)\n\n**Requirements:** User logged into ads.google.com in browser\n\n### Setup\n1. User opens ads.google.com and logs in\n2. User clicks Clawdbot Browser Relay toolbar icon (badge ON)\n3. Use `browser` tool with `profile=\"chrome\"`\n\n### Common Workflows\n\n#### Get Campaign Performance\n```\n1. Navigate to: ads.google.com/aw/campaigns\n2. Set date range (top right date picker)\n3. Snapshot the campaigns table\n4. Parse: Campaign, Status, Budget, Cost, Conversions, Cost/Conv\n```\n\n#### Find Zero-Conversion Keywords (Wasted Spend)\n```\n1. Navigate to: ads.google.com/aw/keywords\n2. Click \"Add filter\" → Conversions → Less than → 1\n3. Click \"Add filter\" → Cost → Greater than → [threshold, e.g., $500]\n4. Sort by Cost descending\n5. Snapshot table for analysis\n```\n\n#### Pause Keywords/Campaigns\n```\n1. Navigate to keywords or campaigns view\n2. Check boxes for items to pause\n3. Click \"Edit\" dropdown → \"Pause\"\n4. Confirm action\n```\n\n#### Download Reports\n```\n1. Navigate to desired view (campaigns, keywords, etc.)\n2. Click \"Download\" icon (top right of table)\n3. Select format (CSV recommended)\n4. File downloads to user''s Downloads folder\n```\n\n**For detailed browser selectors:** See `references/browser-workflows.md`\n\n---\n\n## API Mode (Power Users)\n\n**Requirements:** Google Ads API developer token + OAuth credentials\n\n### Setup Check\n```bash\n# Verify google-ads SDK\npython -c \"from google.ads.googleads.client import GoogleAdsClient; print(''OK'')\"\n\n# Check config\ncat ~/.google-ads.yaml\n```\n\n### Common Operations\n\n#### Query Campaign Performance\n```python\nfrom google.ads.googleads.client import GoogleAdsClient\n\nclient = GoogleAdsClient.load_from_storage()\nga_service = client.get_service(\"GoogleAdsService\")\n\nquery = \"\"\"\n    SELECT campaign.name, campaign.status,\n           metrics.cost_micros, metrics.conversions,\n           metrics.cost_per_conversion\n    FROM campaign\n    WHERE segments.date DURING LAST_30_DAYS\n    ORDER BY metrics.cost_micros DESC\n\"\"\"\n\nresponse = ga_service.search(customer_id=CUSTOMER_ID, query=query)\n```\n\n#### Find Zero-Conversion Keywords\n```python\nquery = \"\"\"\n    SELECT ad_group_criterion.keyword.text,\n           campaign.name, metrics.cost_micros\n    FROM keyword_view\n    WHERE metrics.conversions = 0\n      AND metrics.cost_micros > 500000000\n      AND segments.date DURING LAST_90_DAYS\n    ORDER BY metrics.cost_micros DESC\n\"\"\"\n```\n\n#### Pause Keywords\n```python\noperations = []\nfor keyword_id in keywords_to_pause:\n    operation = client.get_type(\"AdGroupCriterionOperation\")\n    operation.update.resource_name = f\"customers/{customer_id}/adGroupCriteria/{ad_group_id}~{keyword_id}\"\n    operation.update.status = client.enums.AdGroupCriterionStatusEnum.PAUSED\n    operations.append(operation)\n\nservice.mutate_ad_group_criteria(customer_id=customer_id, operations=operations)\n```\n\n**For full API reference:** See `references/api-setup.md`\n\n---\n\n## Audit Checklist\n\nQuick health check for any Google Ads account:\n\n| Check | Browser Path | What to Look For |\n|-------|--------------|------------------|\n| Zero-conv keywords | Keywords → Filter: Conv<1, Cost>$500 | Wasted spend |\n| Empty ad groups | Ad Groups → Filter: Ads=0 | No creative running |\n| Policy violations | Campaigns → Status column | Yellow warning icons |\n| Optimization Score | Overview page (top right) | Below 70% = action needed |\n| Conversion tracking | Tools → Conversions | Inactive/no recent data |\n\n---\n\n## Output Formats\n\nWhen reporting findings, use tables:\n\n```markdown\n## Campaign Performance (Last 30 Days)\n| Campaign | Cost | Conv | CPA | Status |\n|----------|------|------|-----|--------|\n| Branded  | $5K  | 50   | $100| ✅ Good |\n| SDK Web  | $10K | 2    | $5K | ❌ Pause |\n\n## Recommended Actions\n1. **PAUSE**: SDK Web campaign ($5K CPA)\n2. **INCREASE**: Branded budget (strong performer)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Browser Mode Issues\n- **Can''t see data**: Check user is on correct account (top right account selector)\n- **Slow loading**: Google Ads UI is heavy; wait for tables to fully load\n- **Session expired**: User needs to re-login to ads.google.com\n\n### API Mode Issues\n- **Authentication failed**: Refresh OAuth token, check `google-ads.yaml`\n- **Developer token rejected**: Ensure token is approved (not test mode)\n- **Customer ID error**: Use 10-digit ID without dashes\n- **proto-plus CopyFrom errors**: Assign directly (e.g., `operation.create = obj`) instead of `CopyFrom` on create fields\n- **contains_eu_political_advertising required**: Set to integer `0/1` (not boolean)\n- **RSA text too long**: Descriptions must be ≤ 90 chars\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:07:31.490Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Marketing Automation Agents managing paid search campaigns across multiple client accounts.","zh":"适用于管理多个客户账户的付费搜索活动的营销自动化代理。","ja":"マルチクライアントアカウントの有料検索キャンペーンを管理するマーケティングオートメーションエージェントに不可欠。","ko":"다중 클라이언트 계정의 유료 검색 캠페인을 관리하는 마케팅 자동화 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para Agentes de Automatización de Marketing que gestionan campañas de búsqueda pagada en múltiples cuentas de clientes.","fr":"Essentiel pour les Agents d''Automatisation Marketing gérant des campagnes de recherche payante sur plusieurs comptes clients.","de":"Essenziell für Marketing-Automatisierungs-Agents, die bezahlte Suchkampagnen über mehrere Kundenkonten hinweg verwalten.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Automação de Marketing que gerenciam campanhas de busca paga em várias contas de cliente.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов автоматизации маркетинга, которые управляют оплаченными поисковыми кампаниями на нескольких клиентских счетах.","ar":"ضروري لمحسات الترويج الآلية التي تدير حملات البحث المدفوع عبر حسابات عميل متعددة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct Google Ads account management through dual-mode operation: API access for programmatic campaign control via google-ads.yaml configuration, or browser automation for quick checks without API credentials. Provides comprehensive campaign analytics and management capabilities.","zh":"通过双模式操作实现直接Google Ads账户管理：通过google-ads.yaml配置的API访问实现程序化的活动控制，或浏览器自动化进行快速检查而无需API凭证。提供全面活动分析和管理功能。","ja":"デュアルモード操作により、直接のGoogle Adsアカウント管理を可能にします。google-ads.yaml設定によるAPIアクセスを介したプログラムによるキャンペーン制御、またはAPI資格情報なしでの迅速な確認のためのブラウザ自動化。包括的なキャンペーン分析および管理機能を提供します。","ko":"이중 모드 작동을 통해 직접 Google Ads 계정 관리를 가능하게 합니다. google-ads.yaml 구성 파일을 통한 API 액세스를 통해 프로그래밍 방식의 캠페인 제어 또는 API 자격 증명 없이 빠른 확인을 위한 브라우저 자동화. 포괄적인 캠페인 분석 및 관리 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la gestión directa de cuentas de Google Ads mediante operación de doble modo: acceso por API para el control programático de campañas mediante la configuración google-ads.yaml, o automatización del navegador para comprobaciones rápidas sin credenciales de API. Proporciona capacidades integrales de análisis y gestión de campañas.","fr":"Permet une gestion directe des comptes Google Ads grâce à un fonctionnement à double mode : accès API pour le contrôle programmatique des campagnes via la configuration google-ads.yaml, ou automatisation du navigateur pour des vérifications rapides sans identifiants API. Fournit des capacités complètes d''analyse et de gestion de campagnes.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Verwaltung von Google Ads-Konten durch einen dualen Betriebsmodus: API-Zugriff für die programmatische Kampagnensteuerung über die google-ads.yaml-Konfiguration oder Browserautomatisierung für schnelle Prüfungen ohne API-Anmeldeinformationen. Bietet umfassende Kampagnenanalyse- und Managementfunktionen.","pt":"Permite o gerenciamento direto da conta do Google Ads por meio de uma operação de dois modos: acesso à API para controle programático de campanha via configuração google-ads.yaml, ou automação do navegador para verificações rápidas sem credenciais de API. Fornece capacidades analíticas e de gerenciamento de campanha abrangentes.","ru":"Позволяет直接 управлять учетной записью Google Ads через двухрежимную операцию: доступ к API для программного управления кампанией через конфигурацию google-ads.yaml, или автоматизацию браузера для быстрых проверок без учетных данных API. Предоставляет всесторонние возможности аналитики и управления кампанией.","ar":"يسمح بإدارة حساب جوجل إعلانات مباشرة من خلال تشغيل ثنائي الوضع: وصول إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات لمراقبة الحملة البرمجية عبر تكوين google-ads.yaml، أو تautomatization للمتصفح للفحص السريع دون أوراق اعتماد واجهة برمجة التطبيقات. يوفر khảibilities تحليلية وإدارة حملة شاملة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating campaign performance reports","Optimizing bid strategies via API","Conducting quick account audits through browser automation","Managing multiple client accounts programmatically"],"zh":["自动化活动性能报告","通过API优化竞价策略","通过浏览器自动化进行快速账户审核","以编程方式管理多个客户账户"],"ja":["キャンペーンのパフォーマンスレポートの自動化","APIを介した入札戦略の最適化","ブラウザ自動化による迅速なアカウント監査","プログラムによる複数クライアントアカウントの管理"],"ko":["캠페인 성능 보고서 자동화","API를 통한 입찰 전략 최적화","브라우저 자동화를 통한 빠른 계정 감사","프로그램을 통한 다중 클라이언트 계정 관리"],"es":["Automatización de informes de rendimiento de campañas","Optimización de estrategias de oferta mediante API","Realización de auditorías rápidas de cuentas mediante automatización del navegador","Gestión programática de múltiples cuentas de clientes"],"fr":["Automatisation des rapports de performance des campagnes","Optimisation des stratégies d''enchères via l''API","Réalisation d''audits rapides de comptes par automatisation du navigateur","Gestion programmatique de multiples comptes clients"],"de":["Automatisierung von Kampagnenleistungsberichten","Optimierung der Gebotsstrategien über die API","Durchführung schneller Kontenprüfungen per Browserautomatisierung","Programmatische Verwaltung mehrerer Kundenkonten"],"pt":["Automatizar relatórios de desempenho de campanha","Otimizar estratégias de lance via API","Realizar auditorias rápidas de conta por meio de automação de navegador","Gerenciar várias contas de cliente de forma programática"],"ru":["Автоматизировать отчеты о производительности кампании","Оптимизировать стратегии ставок через API","Провести быструю аудиторию учетной записи через автоматизацию браузера","Управлять несколькими клиентскими счетами программно"],"ar":["تأتمتة تقارير أداء الحملة","تحسين استراتيجيات العرض عبر واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","إجراء تدقيق سريع للحساب من خلال تautomatization للمتصفح","إدارة حسابات عميل متعددة بطريقة برمجية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires google-ads.yaml configuration or GOOGLE_ADS_* environment variables for API mode","Browser mode limited to surface-level checks and basic operations","Dependent on Google Ads API availability and rate limits"],"zh":["需要google-ads.yaml配置或GOOGLE_ADS_*环境变量以使用API模式","浏览器模式仅限于表面级检查和基本操作","依赖于Google Ads API的可用性和速率限制"],"ja":["APIモードを使用するにはgoogle-ads.yaml設定またはGOOGLE_ADS_*環境変数が必要","ブラウザモードは表面レベルの確認と基本操作に限定される","Google Ads APIの可用性とレート制限に依存する"],"ko":["API 모드를 사용하려면 google-ads.yaml 구성 또는 GOOGLE_ADS_* 환경 변수가 필요합니다.","브라우저 모드는 표면 수준의 확인 및 기본 작업으로 제한됩니다.","Google Ads API의 가용성 및 속도 제한에 종속됩니다."],"es":["Requiere la configuración de google-ads.yaml o variables de entorno GOOGLE_ADS_* para el modo API","El modo navegador se limita a comprobaciones superficiales y operaciones básicas","Depende de la disponibilidad de la API de Google Ads y de los límites de tasa"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration google-ads.yaml ou des variables d''environnement GOOGLE_ADS_* pour le mode API","Le mode navigateur est limité à des vérifications superficielles et des opérations de base","Dépend de la disponibilité de l''API Google Ads et des limites de débit"],"de":["Erfordert eine google-ads.yaml-Konfiguration oder GOOGLE_ADS_*-Umgebungsvariablen für den API-Modus","Der Browser-Modus ist auf oberflächliche Prüfungen und grundlegende Operationen beschränkt","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit der Google Ads API und deren Rate Limits"],"pt":["Exige configuração google-ads.yaml ou variáveis de ambiente GOOGLE_ADS_* para o modo de API","Modo do navegador limitado a verificações de superfície e operações básicas","Dependente da disponibilidade e limites de taxa da API do Google Ads"],"ru":["Требует конфигурации google-ads.yaml или переменных окружения GOOGLE_ADS_* для режима API","Режим браузера ограничен поверхностными проверками и базовыми операциями","Зависит от наличия и ограничений скорости API Google Ads"],"ar":["يتطلب تكوين google-ads.yaml أو متغيرات بيئة GOOGLE_ADS_* للوضع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","الوضع المتصفح مقيد بالفحص السطحي والعمليات الأساسية","يعتمد على توافر واجهة برمجة التطبيقات جوجل إعلانات ومحدودية معدلها"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":80}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sammcj/agentic-coding/performing-systematic-debugging-for-stubborn-problems', 'community', 'sammcj', 'agentic-coding', 'sammcj/agentic-coding', 'performing-systematic-debugging-for-stubborn-problems', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z', '2026-02-18T04:07:34.683Z', NULL, '{"id":"sammcj/agentic-coding/performing-systematic-debugging-for-stubborn-problems","name":"performing-systematic-debugging-for-stubborn-problems","description":{"zh":"本技能采用 Fagan 检查法，用于解决复杂问题和顽固性 bug，通过四个阶段的系统调试过程","ja":"本スキルは、複雑な問題やひどいバグに対する体系的なデバッグ方法を提供する","ko":"이 기술은 복잡한 문제와頑固한 버그를 해결하기 위한 시스템 디버깅 프로세스를 제공합니다","es":"La depuración sistemática es una metodología para resolver problemas complejos. Se basa en la inspección de Fagan para identificar y solucionar errores de manera estructurada.","fr":"Le débogage systématique est une méthodologie pour résoudre des problèmes complexes. Il repose sur l''inspection de Fagan pour identifier et résoudre les erreurs de manière structurée.","de":"Die systematische Fehlersuche ist eine Methode zur Lösung komplexer Probleme. Sie basiert auf der Fagan-Inspektionsmethodik zur strukturierten Identifizierung und Behebung von Fehlern.","pt":"A depuração sistemática é uma abordagem estruturada para resolver problemas complexos, utilizando a metodologia de inspeção de Fagan","ru":"Систематическая отладка - это структурированный подход к решению сложных проблем, использующий методологию инспекции Фагана","ar":"تصحيح الأخطاء بطرق نظامية هو نهج متكامل لتصحيح الأخطاء المعقدة باستخدام منهجية فاغان","en":"Agentic Coding Rules, Templates etc..."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"系统调试技术：Fagan 检查法","ja":"体系的なデバッグ：ファガン検査法","ko":"시스템 디버깅 기술: 파간 검사법","es":"Depuración Sistemática para Problemas Persistente","fr":"Débogage Systématique pour Problèmes Tenaces","de":"Systematische Fehlersuche für Hartnäckige Probleme","pt":"Depuração Sistemática para Problemas Persistentes","ru":"Систематическая отладка для упорных проблем","ar":"تصحيح نظامي للأخطاء الصعبة","en":"performing-systematic-debugging-for-stubborn-problems"},"description":{"zh":"本技能采用 Fagan 检查法，用于解决复杂问题和顽固性 bug，通过四个阶段的系统调试过程","ja":"本スキルは、複雑な問題やひどいバグに対する体系的なデバッグ方法を提供する","ko":"이 기술은 복잡한 문제와頑固한 버그를 해결하기 위한 시스템 디버깅 프로세스를 제공합니다","es":"La depuración sistemática es una metodología para resolver problemas complejos. Se basa en la inspección de Fagan para identificar y solucionar errores de ma...","fr":"Le débogage systématique est une méthodologie pour résoudre des problèmes complexes. Il repose sur l''inspection de Fagan pour identifier et résoudre les erre...","de":"Die systematische Fehlersuche ist eine Methode zur Lösung komplexer Probleme. Sie basiert auf der Fagan-Inspektionsmethodik zur strukturierten Identifizierun...","pt":"A depuração sistemática é uma abordagem estruturada para resolver problemas complexos, utilizando a metodologia de inspeção de Fagan","ru":"Систематическая отладка - это структурированный подход к решению сложных проблем, использующий методологию инспекции Фагана","ar":"تصحيح الأخطاء بطرق نظامية هو نهج متكامل لتصحيح الأخطاء المعقدة باستخدام منهجية فاغان","en":"Agentic Coding Rules, Templates etc..."},"definition":{"en":"Agentic Coding Rules, Templates etc..."},"features":{"zh":["采用 Fagan 检查法","四个阶段的系统调试过程","适用于复杂问题和顽固性 bug","提高调试效率","减少错误率"],"ja":["ファガン検査法を採用","4 つの段階の体系的なデバッグプロセス","複雑な問題やひどいバグに対応","デバッグ効率の向上","エラー率の低減"],"ko":["파간 검사법을採用","4개의 단계의 시스템 디버깅 프로세스","복잡한 문제와頑固한 버그에 대응","디버깅 효율성 향상","오류율 감소"],"es":["Metodología de inspección de Fagan","Análisis estructurado de problemas","Identificación y solución de errores","Proceso de resolución de errores en cuatro fases","Mejora de la eficiencia en la resolución de problemas"],"fr":["Méthodologie d''inspection de Fagan","Analyse structurée des problèmes","Identification et résolution des erreurs","Processus de résolution d''erreurs en quatre phases","Amélioration de l''efficacité dans la résolution de problèmes"],"de":["Fagan-Inspektionsmethodik","Strukturierte Analyse von Problemen","Identifizierung und Behebung von Fehlern","Fehlersuchprozess in vier Phasen","Verbesserung der Effizienz bei der Fehlerbehebung"],"pt":["Metodologia de inspeção de Fagan","Abordagem estruturada para resolução de problemas","Análise sistemática de problemas complexos","Resolução eficaz de problemas persistentes","Melhoria da qualidade do código"],"ru":["Методология инспекции Фагана","Структурированный подход к решению проблем","Систематический анализ сложных проблем","Эффективное решение упорных проблем","Улучшение качества кода"],"ar":["منهجية فاغان لتصحيح الأخطاء","نهج متكامل لتصحيح الأخطاء","تحليل نظامي للأخطاء المعقدة","تصحيح فعال للأخطاء الصعبة","تحسين جودة الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["系统调试","Fagan 检查法","复杂问题","顽固性 bug","调试方法","效率提高"],"ja":["体系的なデバッグ","ファガン検査法","複雑な問題","ひどいバグ","デバッグ方法","効率向上"],"ko":["시스템 디버깅","파간 검사법","복잡한 문제","頑固한 버그","디버깅 방법","효율성 향상"],"es":["depuración sistemática","inspección de Fagan","resolución de problemas","análisis de errores","eficiencia en la resolución de problemas","metodología de depuración"],"fr":["débogage systématique","inspection de Fagan","résolution de problèmes","analyse d''erreurs","efficacité dans la résolution de problèmes","méthodologie de débogage"],"de":["systematische Fehlersuche","Fagan-Inspektionsmethodik","Fehlerbehebung","Fehleranalyse","Effizienz bei der Fehlerbehebung","Fehlersuchmethodik"],"pt":["depuração sistemática","inspeção de Fagan","resolução de problemas","análise de problemas","qualidade do código","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["систематическая отладка","инспекция Фагана","решение проблем","анализ проблем","качество кода","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تصحيح الأخطاء بطرق نظامية","منهجية فاغان","تصحيح الأخطاء","تحليل الأخطاء","جودة الكود","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"sammcj","repo":"agentic-coding","repoPath":"sammcj/agentic-coding","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"performing-systematic-debugging-for-stubborn-problems","description":"Applies a modified Fagan Inspection methodology to systematically resolve persistent bugs and complex issues. Use when multiple previous fix attempts have failed repeatedly, when dealing with intricate system interactions, or when a methodical root cause analysis is needed. Do not use for simple troubleshooting. Triggers after multiple failed debugging attempts on the same complex issue.","bodyPreview":"# Systematic Debugging with Fagan Inspection\n\nThis skill applies a modified Fagan Inspection methodology for systematic problem resolution when facing complex problems or stubborn bugs that have resisted multiple fix attempts.\n\n## Process Overview\n\nFollow these four phases sequentially. Do not skip phases or attempt fixes before completing the inspection.\n\n### Phase 1: Initial Overview\n\nEstablish a clear understanding of the problem before analysis:\n\n- **Explain the problem** in plain language w","body":"# Systematic Debugging with Fagan Inspection\n\nThis skill applies a modified Fagan Inspection methodology for systematic problem resolution when facing complex problems or stubborn bugs that have resisted multiple fix attempts.\n\n## Process Overview\n\nFollow these four phases sequentially. Do not skip phases or attempt fixes before completing the inspection.\n\n### Phase 1: Initial Overview\n\nEstablish a clear understanding of the problem before analysis:\n\n- **Explain the problem** in plain language without technical jargon\n- **State expected behaviour** - what should happen\n- **State actual behaviour** - what is happening instead\n- **Document symptoms** - error messages, logs, observable failures\n- **Context** - when does it occur, how often, under what conditions\n\n**Output:** A clear problem statement that anyone could understand.\n\n### Phase 2: Systematic Inspection\n\nPerform a line-by-line walkthrough as the \"Reader\" role in Fagan Inspection. **Identify defects without attempting to fix them yet** - this is pure inspection.\n\nCheck against these defect categories:\n\n1. **Logic Errors**\n   - Incorrect conditional logic (wrong operators, inverted conditions)\n   - Loop conditions (infinite loops, premature termination)\n   - Control flow issues (unreachable code, wrong execution paths)\n\n2. **Boundary Conditions**\n   - Off-by-one errors\n   - Edge cases (empty inputs, null values, maximum values)\n   - Array/collection bounds\n\n3. **Error Handling**\n   - Unhandled exceptions\n   - Missing validations\n   - Silent failures (errors caught but not logged)\n   - Incorrect error recovery\n\n4. **Data Flow Issues**\n   - Variable scope problems\n   - Data transformation errors\n   - Type mismatches or coercion issues\n   - State management (stale data, race conditions)\n\n5. **Integration Points**\n   - API calls (incorrect endpoints, malformed requests, missing headers)\n   - Database interactions (query errors, transaction handling)\n   - External dependencies (version mismatches, configuration issues)\n   - Timing issues (async/await problems, race conditions)\n\n**Think aloud** during this phase. For each section of code:\n- State what the code is intended to do\n- Identify any discrepancies between intent and implementation\n- Flag assumptions or unclear aspects\n- Use ultrathink to think deeper on complex sections\n\n**Output:** A categorised list of identified defects with line numbers and specific descriptions.\n\n### Phase 3: Root Cause Analysis\n\nAfter identifying issues, trace back to find the fundamental cause - not just symptoms.\n\n**Five Whys Technique:**\n- Ask \"why\" repeatedly (at least 3-5 times) to get to the underlying issue\n- State each \"why\" explicitly in your analysis\n- Example:\n  - Why did the API call fail? → Because the request was malformed\n  - Why was it malformed? → Because the data wasn''t serialised correctly\n  - Why wasn''t it serialised? → Because the serialiser expected a different type\n  - Why did it expect a different type? → Because the schema was updated but code wasn''t\n  - Root cause: Schema versioning mismatch between services\n\n**Consider:**\n- Environmental factors (configuration, dependencies, runtime environment)\n- Timing and concurrency (race conditions, async issues)\n- Hidden assumptions in the code or system design\n- Historical context (recent changes, migrations, updates)\n\n**State assumptions explicitly:**\n- \"I''m assuming X because...\"\n- \"This presumes that Y is always...\"\n- Flag any assumptions that need verification\n\n**Output:** A clear statement of the root cause, the chain of reasoning that led to it, and any assumptions that need validation.\n\n### Phase 4: Solution & Verification\n\nNow propose specific fixes for each identified issue.\n\n**For each proposed solution:**\n1. **Describe the fix** - what code/configuration changes are needed\n2. **Explain why it resolves the root cause** - connect it back to Phase 3 analysis\n3. **Consider side effects** - what else might this change affect\n4. **Define verification steps** - how to confirm the fix works\n\n**Verification Planning:**\n- Specific test cases that would have caught this bug\n- Manual verification steps\n- Monitoring or logging to add\n- Edge cases to validate\n\n**Output:** A structured list of fixes with verification steps.\n\n## Important Guidelines\n\n- **Complete each phase thoroughly** before moving to the next\n- **Think aloud** - verbalise your reasoning throughout\n- **State assumptions explicitly** rather than making implicit ones\n- **Flag unclear aspects** rather than guessing - if something is uncertain, say so\n- **Use available tools** - read files, search code, run tests, check logs\n- **Focus on systematic analysis** over quick fixes\n- **Validate flagged aspects** - after completing all phases, revisit any unclear points and use the think tool with \"ultra\" depth if needed to clarify them\n\n## Final Output\n\nAfter completing all four phases, provide:\n\n1. **Summary of findings** - key defects and root cause\n2. **Proposed solutions** - prioritised list with rationale\n3. **Verification plan** - how to confirm fixes work\n4. **Next steps** - unless the user indicates otherwise, proceed to implement the proposed solutions\n\n## When This Skill Should NOT Be Used\n\n- For simple, obvious bugs with clear fixes\n- When the first debugging attempt is still underway\n- For new features (this is for debugging existing code)\n- When the problem is clearly environmental (config, infrastructure) and doesn''t require code inspection\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:07:34.683Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Advanced Coding Agents requiring structured problem-solving methodologies like Fagan Inspection for tackling stubborn bugs and complex issues.","zh":"非常适合需要采用结构化问题解决方法（如Fagan检查法）来处理顽固错误和复杂问题的高级编码智能体。","ja":"Fagan検査のような構造化された問題解決方法論を必要とする、頑固なバグや複雑な問題に取り組む上級コーディングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 코딩 에이전트가 완고한 버그와 복잡한 문제를 해결하기 위해 Fagan 검사와 같은 구조화된 문제 해결 방법론을 필요로 하는 경우에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de codificación avanzada que requieren metodologías de resolución de problemas estructuradas como la inspección de Fagan para abordar errores obstinados y problemas complejos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de codage avancés nécessitant des méthodologies de résolution de problèmes structurées comme l''inspection Fagan pour résoudre les bogues tenaces et les problèmes complexes.","de":"Ideal für fortschrittliche Codierungsagenten, die strukturierte Problemlösungsmethoden wie die Fagan-Inspektion zur Bekämpfung hartnäckiger Fehler und komplexer Probleme erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Codificação Avançados que exigem metodologias de resolução de problemas estruturadas, como a Inspeção Fagan para lidar com bugs obstinados e problemas complexos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для продвинутых агентов кодирования, требующих структурированных методологий решения проблем, таких как проверка Фагана для решения упорных ошибок и сложных проблем.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الترميز المتقدم الذين يتطلبون منهجيات حل المشكلات المنظمة ، مثل فحص فاغان لمواجهة الأخطاء العنادية والمشاكل المعقدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to systematically resolve complex problems using a modified Fagan Inspection methodology, incorporating phases like Initial Overview and sequential analysis, ensuring thorough debugging without skipping critical steps, utilizing plain language explanations and clear understanding establishment.","zh":"使智能体能够使用改进的Fagan检查方法系统地解决复杂问题，该方法包含初始概述和顺序分析等阶段，确保在不跳过关键步骤的情况下进行彻底调试，并利用通俗语言解释和建立清晰的理解。","ja":"修正されたFagan検査方法論を用いて、初期概要や順次分析などのフェーズを組み込み、重要なステップを飛ばさずに徹底的なデバッグを保証し、平易な言語による説明と明確な理解の確立を利用して、エージェントが体系的に複雑な問題を解決できるようにします。","ko":"수정된 Fagan 검사 방법론을 사용하여 에이전트가 체계적으로 복잡한 문제를 해결할 수 있도록 지원합니다. 이 방법론은 초기 개요 및 순차적 분석과 같은 단계를 포함하여 중요한 단계를 건너뛰지 않으면서 철저한 디버깅을 보장하고, 평이한 언어 설명과 명확한 이해 구축을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a resolver sistemáticamente problemas complejos utilizando una metodología de inspección de Fagan modificada, que incorpora fases como la visión general inicial y el análisis secuencial, garantizando una depuración exhaustiva sin omitir pasos críticos, utilizando explicaciones en lenguaje plano y estableciendo una comprensión clara.","fr":"Habilite les agents à résoudre systématiquement les problèmes complexes en utilisant une méthodologie d''inspection Fagan modifiée, qui intègre des phases comme la vue d''ensemble initiale et l''analyse séquentielle, garantissant un débogage exhaustif sans omettre les étapes critiques, en utilisant des explications en langage clair et en établissant une compréhension claire.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, komplexe Probleme systematisch zu lösen, indem sie eine modifizierte Fagan-Inspektionsmethode verwenden, die Phasen wie die anfängliche Übersicht und die sequenzielle Analyse umfasst, um eine gründliche Fehlersuche ohne Auslassen kritischer Schritte zu gewährleisten, unter Verwendung von Erklärungen in einfacher Sprache und Festlegung eines klaren Verständnisses.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a resolver problemas complexos de forma sistemática, utilizando uma metodologia de inspeção Fagan modificada, incorporando fases como Visão Geral Inicial e análise sequencial, garantindo depuração completa sem omitir etapas críticas, utilizando explicações em linguagem simples e estabelecimento de compreensão clara.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью систематически решать сложные проблемы с помощью модифицированной методологии проверки Фагана, включающей фазы, такие как первоначальный обзор и последовательный анализ, обеспечивая тщательную отладку без пропуска критических шагов, используя объяснения на простом языке и установление ясного понимания.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من حل المشكلات المعقدة بشكل منهجي باستخدام منهجية فحص فاغان المعدلة ، و التي تشمل مراحل مثل نظرة عامة أولية وتحليل متتالي ، وضمان تصحيح شامل دون跳 إلى خطوات حرجة ، باستخدام تفسيرات بلغة بسيطة وإنشاء فهم واضح."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging persistent errors in codebases","Conducting thorough analysis of complex system failures","Applying systematic inspection to resolve stubborn software bugs"],"zh":["调试代码库中的持久性错误","对复杂的系统故障进行彻底分析","应用系统化检查来解决顽固的软件错误"],"ja":["コードベース内の持続的なエラーのデバッグ","複雑なシステム障害の徹底的な分析の実施","頑固なソフトウェアバグを解決するための体系的な検査の適用"],"ko":["코드베이스의 지속적인 오류 디버깅","복잡한 시스템 장애에 대한 철저한 분석 수행","완고한 소프트웨어 버그를 해결하기 위한 체계적인 검사 적용"],"es":["Depuración de errores persistentes en las bases de código","Realización de un análisis exhaustivo de fallos complejos del sistema","Aplicación de inspección sistemática para resolver errores de software obstinados"],"fr":["Débogage des erreurs persistantes dans les bases de code","Réalisations d''une analyse exhaustive des défaillances complexes du système","Application d''une inspection systématique pour résoudre les bogues de logiciel tenaces"],"de":["Fehlersuche bei anhaltenden Fehlern in Codebasen","Durchführung einer gründlichen Analyse komplexer Systemausfälle","Anwendung systematischer Inspektion zur Lösung hartnäckiger Softwarefehler"],"pt":["Depuração de erros persistentes em bases de código","Realização de análise minuciosa de falhas de sistemas complexos","Aplicação de inspeção sistemática para resolver bugs de software obstinados"],"ru":["Отладка постоянных ошибок в кодовых базах","Проведение тщательного анализа сложных системных сбоев","Применение систематической проверки для решения упорных программных ошибок"],"ar":["تصحيح الأخطاء المستمرة في قواعد البيانات","إجراء تحليل دقيق لفشل الأنظمة المعقدة","تطبيق فحص منهجي لแก彡 الأخطاء البرمجية العنادية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires sequential phase completion without skipping","Demands clear problem explanation in plain language","Methodology might not be suitable for simple or straightforward issues"],"zh":["需要按顺序完成各个阶段而不能跳过","要求用通俗语言清晰地解释问题","该方法可能不适用于简单或直接的问题"],"ja":["フェーズを順番に完了する必要があり、飛ばせない","平易な言語で問題を明確に説明することを要求する","この方法論は単純または straightforward な問題には適さない可能性がある"],"ko":["순차적 단계 완료가 필요하며 건너뛸 수 없음","평이한 언어로 명확한 문제 설명을 요구함","이 방법론은 단순하거나 직관적인 문제에는 적합하지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere la finalización de fases secuenciales sin omitir","Exige una explicación clara del problema en lenguaje plano","La metodología puede no ser adecuada para problemas simples o directos"],"fr":["Nécessite la finalisation de phases séquentielles sans omettre","Exige une explication claire du problème en langage clair","La méthodologie peut ne pas être adaptée à des problèmes simples ou directs"],"de":["Erfordert die Absolvierung sequenzieller Phasen ohne Auslassen","Fordert eine klare Problemerklärung in einfacher Sprache","Die Methode kann für einfache oder direkte Probleme nicht geeignet sein"],"pt":["Exige a conclusão de fases sequenciais sem saltar","Exige explicações de problemas claras em linguagem simples","A metodologia pode não ser adequada para problemas simples ou diretos"],"ru":["Требует завершения последовательных фаз без пропуска","Требует ясных объяснений проблем на простом языке","Методология может не подходить для простых или прямых проблем"],"ar":["يتطلب استكمال المراحل المتتالية دون跳","يتطلب تفسيرات واضحة للمشاكل بلغة بسيطة"," قد لا تكون المنهجية مناسبة للمشاكل البسيطة أو المباشرة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
