npm","Sprache: TypeScript (strenger Modus)","Modul-System: ESM (\"type\": \"module\")","Linter und Formater: @antfu/eslint-config (ohne Prettier)","Tests: Vitest","Git-Hooks: simple-git-hooks + lint-staged"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de pacotes com pnpm","Linguagem TypeScript com modo estrito","Sistema de módulos ESM","Linting e formatação com @antfu/eslint-config","Testes com Vitest","Ganchos de Git com simple-git-hooks + lint-staged"],"ru":["Управление пакетами с помощью pnpm","Язык TypeScript в строгом режиме","Система модулей ESM","Форматирование кода и linting с @antfu/eslint-config","Тестирование с Vitest","Гуки Git с simple-git-hooks + lint-staged"],"ar":["إدارة الحزم مع pnpm","لغة TypeScript في الوضع الصارم","نظام الوحدات ESM","تنسيق الشفرة والتنقيح مع @antfu/eslint-config","اختبارات مع Vitest","hooks Git مع simple-git-hooks + lint-staged"]},"keywords":{"zh":["antfu","安全审计","质量验证","Web 开发","pnpm","TypeScript","Vitest"],"ja":["antfu","セキュリティ監査","品質検証","Web 開発","pnpm","TypeScript","Vitest"],"ko":["antfu","보안 감사","품질 검증","웹 개발","pnpm","TypeScript","Vitest"],"es":["desarrollo web","herramientas de desarrollo","seguridad","pnpm","TypeScript","ESM","Vitest","simple-git-hooks"],"fr":["développement web","outils de développement","sécurité","pnpm","TypeScript","ESM","Vitest","simple-git-hooks"],"de":["Web-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Sicherheit","pnpm","TypeScript","ESM","Vitest","simple-git-hooks"],"pt":["desenvolvimento web","segurança","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","pnpm","TypeScript","ESM","linting","formatação","Vitest","Git Hooks"],"ru":["веб-разработка","безопасность","инструменты для разработки","pnpm","TypeScript","ESM","форматирование кода","linting","Vitest","Гуки Git"],"ar":["تطوير الويب","الأمان","أدوات التطوير","pnpm","TypeScript","ESM","تنسيق الشفرة","linting","Vitest","hooks Git"]}},"owner":"aiskillstore","repo":"marketplace","repoPath":"aiskillstore/marketplace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"antfu","description":"Anthony Fus {Opinionated} preferences and best practices for web development","version":"2026.1.28","bodyPreview":"# Anthony Fu''s Preferences\n\nThis skill covers Anthony Fu''s preferred tooling, configurations, and best practices for web development. This skill is opinionated.\n\n## Quick Summary\n\n| Category | Preference |\n|----------|------------|\n| Package Manager | pnpm |\n| Language | TypeScript (strict mode) |\n| Module System | ESM (`\"type\": \"module\"`) |\n| Linting & Formatting | @antfu/eslint-config (no Prettier) |\n| Testing | Vitest |\n| Git Hooks | simple-git-hooks + lint-staged |\n| Documentation | VitePres","body":"# Anthony Fu''s Preferences\n\nThis skill covers Anthony Fu''s preferred tooling, configurations, and best practices for web development. This skill is opinionated.\n\n## Quick Summary\n\n| Category | Preference |\n|----------|------------|\n| Package Manager | pnpm |\n| Language | TypeScript (strict mode) |\n| Module System | ESM (`\"type\": \"module\"`) |\n| Linting & Formatting | @antfu/eslint-config (no Prettier) |\n| Testing | Vitest |\n| Git Hooks | simple-git-hooks + lint-staged |\n| Documentation | VitePress (in `docs/`) |\n\n---\n\n## Core Stack\n\n### Package Manager (pnpm)\n\nUse pnpm as the package manager.\n\nFor monorepo setups, use pnpm workspaces:\n\n```yaml\n# pnpm-workspace.yaml\npackages:\n  - ''packages/*''\n```\n\n\nUse pnpm named catalogs in `pnpm-workspace.yaml` to manage dependency versions:\n\n| Catalog | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| `prod` | Production dependencies |\n| `inlined` | Dependencies inlined by bundler |\n| `dev` | Development tools (linter, bundler, testing, dev-server) |\n| `frontend` | Frontend libraries bundled into frontend |\n\nCatalog names are not limited to the above and can be adjusted based on needs. Avoid using default catalog.\n\n#### @antfu/ni\n\nUse `@antfu/ni` for unified package manager commands. It auto-detects the package manager (pnpm/npm/yarn/bun) based on lockfile.\n\n| Command | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| `ni` | Install dependencies |\n| `ni <pkg>` | Add dependency |\n| `ni -D <pkg>` | Add dev dependency |\n| `nr <script>` | Run script |\n| `nu` | Upgrade dependencies |\n| `nun <pkg>` | Uninstall dependency |\n| `nci` | Clean install (like `pnpm i --frozen-lockfile`) |\n| `nlx <pkg>` | Execute package (like `npx`) |\n\nInstall globally with `pnpm i -g @antfu/ni` if the commands are not found.\n\n### TypeScript (Strict Mode)\n\nAlways use TypeScript with strict mode enabled.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true,\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### ESM (ECMAScript Modules)\n\nAlways work in ESM mode. Set `\"type\": \"module\"` in `package.json`.\n\n---\n\n## Code Quality\n\n### ESLint (@antfu/eslint-config)\n\nUse `@antfu/eslint-config` for both formatting and linting. This eliminates the need for Prettier.\n\nCreate `eslint.config.js` with `// @ts-check` comment:\n\n```js\n// @ts-check\nimport antfu from ''@antfu/eslint-config''\n\nexport default antfu()\n```\n\nAdd script to `package.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"lint\": \"eslint .\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nWhen getting linting errors, try to fix them with `nr lint --fix`. Don''t add `lint:fix` script.\n\n### Git Hooks (simple-git-hooks + lint-staged)\n\nUse `simple-git-hooks` with `lint-staged` for pre-commit linting:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"simple-git-hooks\": {\n    \"pre-commit\": \"pnpm i --frozen-lockfile --ignore-scripts --offline && npx lint-staged\"\n  },\n  \"lint-staged\": {\n    \"*\": \"eslint --fix\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"prepare\": \"npx simple-git-hooks\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Unit Testing (Vitest)\n\nUse Vitest for unit testing.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"vitest\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Conventions:**\n\n- Place test files next to source files: `foo.ts` → `foo.test.ts` (same directory)\n- High-level tests go in `tests/` directory in each package\n- Use `describe` and `it` API (not `test`)\n- Use `expect` API for assertions\n- Use `assert` only for TypeScript null assertions\n- Use `toMatchSnapshot` for complex output assertions\n- Use `toMatchFileSnapshot` with explicit file path and extension for language-specific output (exclude those files from linting)\n\n---\n\n## Project Setup\n\n### Publishing (Library Projects)\n\nFor library projects, publish through GitHub Releases triggered by `bumpp`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"release\": \"bumpp -r\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Documentation (VitePress)\n\nUse VitePress for documentation. Place docs under `docs/` directory.\n\n```\ndocs/\n├── .vitepress/\n│   └── config.ts\n├── index.md\n└── guide/\n    └── getting-started.md\n```\n\nAdd script to `package.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"docs:dev\": \"vitepress dev docs\",\n    \"docs:build\": \"vitepress build docs\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n### Project Setup\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| @antfu/eslint-config | ESLint flat config for formatting and linting | [antfu-eslint-config](references/antfu-eslint-config.md) |\n| GitHub Actions | Preferred workflows using sxzz/workflows | [github-actions](references/github-actions.md) |\n| .gitignore | Preferred .gitignore for JS/TS projects | [gitignore](references/gitignore.md) |\n| VS Code Extensions | Recommended extensions for development | [vscode-extensions](references/vscode-extensions.md) |\n\n### Development\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| App Development | Preferences for Vue/Vite/Nuxt/UnoCSS web applications | [app-development](references/app-development.md) |\n| Library Development | Preferences for bundling and publishing TypeScript libraries | [library-development](references/library-development.md) |\n| Monorepo | pnpm workspaces, centralized alias, Turborepo | [monorepo](references/monorepo.md) |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:08:07.479Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Web Development Agents requiring opinionated configurations and best practices with TypeScript, ESM, and Vitest.","zh":"适用于需要 TypeScript、ESM 和 Vitest 观点配置和最佳实践的 Web 开发代理。","ja":"TypeScript、ESM、Vitest における意見のある構成とベストプラクティスを必要とする Web 開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"TypeScript, ESM 및 Vitest의 의견이 있는 구성 및 모범 사례가 필요한 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo web que requieren configuraciones opinadas y mejores prácticas con TypeScript, ESM y Vitest.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement web nécessitant des configurations avisées et des meilleures pratiques avec TypeScript, ESM et Vitest.","de":"Ideal für Webentwicklungsagenten, die vorkonfigurierte Einstellungen und Best Practices mit TypeScript, ESM und Vitest erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web que requerem configurações opinativas e melhores práticas com TypeScript, ESM e Vitest.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки, требующих мнительных конфигураций и лучших практик с TypeScript, ESM и Vitest.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الوب الذي يتطلب تكوينات ذات آراء وأفضل الممارسات مع TypeScript و ESM و Vitest."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop secure and maintainable web applications using pnpm, @antfu/eslint-config, and simple-git-hooks, while following Anthony Fu''s preferred tooling and configurations, including strict TypeScript mode and ESM module system.","zh":"赋予代理开发人员使用 pnpm、@antfu/eslint-config 和 simple-git-hooks 等工具开发安全且可维护的 Web 应用程序的能力，同时遵循 Anthony Fu 的首选工具和配置，包括严格的 TypeScript 模式和 ESM 模块系统。","ja":"pnpm、@antfu/eslint-config、simple-git-hooks などを使用して、安全でメンテナンスが容易な Web アプリケーションを開発するためにエージェントをエンパワーメントし、Anthony Fu の推奨ツールと構成、厳格な TypeScript モードや ESM モジュールシステムに従う。","ko":"pnpm, @antfu/eslint-config 및 simple-git-hooks를 사용하여 보안이 강화되고 유지 보수가 쉬운 웹 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있는 에이전트의 역량을 강화하고, Anthony Fu의 선호도 있는 툴링 및 구성, 엄격한 TypeScript 모드 및 ESM 모듈 시스템을 따름으로써","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar aplicaciones web seguras y mantenibles utilizando pnpm, @antfu/eslint-config y simple-git-hooks, siguiendo las herramientas y configuraciones preferidas de Anthony Fu, incluyendo el modo estricto de TypeScript y el sistema de módulos ESM.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des applications web sécurisées et maintenables en utilisant pnpm, @antfu/eslint-config et simple-git-hooks, en suivant les outils et les configurations préférés d''Anthony Fu, notamment le mode strict de TypeScript et le système de modules ESM.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, sichere und wartbare Webanwendungen mit pnpm, @antfu/eslint-config und simple-git-hooks zu entwickeln, wobei sie die bevorzugten Werkzeuge und Konfigurationen von Anthony Fu befolgen, einschließlich des strengen TypeScript-Modus und des ESM-Modulsystems.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver aplicações web seguras e mantidas usando pnpm, @antfu/eslint-config e simple-git-hooks, seguindo as ferramentas e configurações preferidas de Anthony Fu, incluindo o modo estrito do TypeScript e o sistema de módulos ESM.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разрабатывать безопасные и поддерживаемые веб-приложения, используя pnpm, @antfu/eslint-config и simple-git-hooks, следуя предпочитаемым инструментам и конфигурациям Anthony Fu, включая строгий режим TypeScript и систему модулей ESM.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تطوير تطبيقات ويب آمنة وقابلة للصيانة باستخدام pnpm و @antfu/eslint-config و simple-git-hooks ، متبعًا الأدوات والتكوينات المفضلة لديه أنتوني فو ، بما في ذلك وضع TypeScript الصارم ونظام الوحدات ESM."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring web projects with one-click installation of security-audited dependencies","Enforcing coding standards with @antfu/eslint-config and lint-staged","Streamlining testing workflows with Vitest and simple-git-hooks"],"zh":["使用一键安装安全审计的依赖项配置 Web 项目","使用 @antfu/eslint-config 和 lint-staged 强制执行编码标准","使用 Vitest 和 simple-git-hooks 优化测试工作流"],"ja":["セキュリティ監査済みの依存関係の一括インストールで Web プロジェクトを構成する","@antfu/eslint-config と lint-staged を使用してコーディング規約を強制する","Vitest と simple-git-hooks を使用してテストワークフローを最適化する"],"ko":["보안 감사된 의존성을 일括 설치하여 웹 프로젝트를 구성","@antfu/eslint-config 및 lint-staged를 사용하여 코딩 표준을 강제 적용","Vitest 및 simple-git-hooks를 사용하여 테스트 워크플로우를 최적화"],"es":["Configuración de proyectos web con instalación de un solo clic de dependencias auditadas de seguridad","Aplicación de normas de codificación con @antfu/eslint-config y lint-staged","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de pruebas con Vitest y simple-git-hooks"],"fr":["Configuration de projets web avec installation d''un seul clic de dépendances auditées pour la sécurité","Application de normes de codage avec @antfu/eslint-config et lint-staged","Optimisation des flux de travail de test avec Vitest et simple-git-hooks"],"de":["Konfiguration von Webprojekten mit einer Klick-Installation von sicherheitsgeprüften Abhängigkeiten","Durchsetzung von Codierungsstandards mit @antfu/eslint-config und lint-staged","Optimierung von Testworkflows mit Vitest und simple-git-hooks"],"pt":["Configurando projetos web com instalação de dependências auditadas de segurança em um clique","Aplicando padrões de codificação com @antfu/eslint-config e lint-staged","Otimizando fluxos de trabalho de teste com Vitest e simple-git-hooks"],"ru":["Настройка веб-проектов с однократной установкой зависимостей, проверенных на безопасность","Применение стандартов кодирования с помощью @antfu/eslint-config и lint-staged","Оптимизация рабочих процессов тестирования с Vitest и simple-git-hooks"],"ar":["تهيئة مشاريع الويب مع تثبيت التبعيات المُراجعة أمنيًا في نقرة واحدة","تنفيذ معايير التشفير باستخدام @antfu/eslint-config و lint-staged","تحسين سير عمل الاختبار باستخدام Vitest و simple-git-hooks"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires compatibility with Clau