ente"],"fr":["Crée des compétences personnalisées pour les sites web de réclamations","Améliore l''expérience utilisateur avec des instructions étape par étape","Permet la création d''arbres de décision pour choisir l''approche correcte","S''intègre avec des projets spécifiques et des conventions","Permet la création de références pour la documentation existante"],"de":["Erstellt benutzerdefinierte Fähigkeiten für Beschwerde-Websites","Verbessert die Benutzererfahrung mit schrittweisen Anweisungen","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von Entscheidungsbäumen, um den richtigen Ansatz zu wählen","Integriert sich mit projektspezifischen Konventionen","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von Referenzen für vorhandene Dokumentation"],"pt":["Criação de habilidades AI personalizadas","Melhoria da eficiência do projeto","Suporte a padrões de desenvolvimento","Integração com fluxos de trabalho complexos","Suporte a árvores de decisão"],"ru":["Создание индивидуальных навыков AI","Повышение эффективности проекта","Поддержка конвенций разработки","Интеграция с сложными рабочими процессами","Поддержка деревьев решений"],"ar":["إنشاء مهارات الذكاء الاصطناعي المخصصة","تحسين كفاءة المشروع","دعم اتفاقيات التطوير","التكامل مع سلاسل العمل المعقدة","دعم أشجار القرار"]},"keywords":{"zh":["技能创建者","AI任务","个性化技能","开发者工具","复杂工作流","决策树","开发者向け","AI开发"],"ja":["スキルクリエイター","AIタスク","カスタムスキル","開発者ツール","複雑なワークフロー","決定木","開発者向け","AI開発"],"ko":["스킬 크리에이터","AI 작업","맞춤형 스킬","개발자 도구","복잡한 작업 흐름","결정 트리","개발자를 위한","AI 개발"],"es":["creador de habilidades","sitio web de quejas","experiencia del usuario","árboles de decisión","proyectos específicos","convenciones","documentación","referencias"],"fr":["créateur de compétences","site web de réclamations","expérience utilisateur","arbres de décision","projets spécifiques","conventions","documentation","références"],"de":["Fähigkeitscreator","Beschwerde-Website","Benutzererfahrung","Entscheidungsbäume","projektspezifische Konventionen","Dokumentation","Referenzen","Entwickler-Tools"],"pt":["skill-creator","habilidades AI","desenvolvimento de software","eficiência do projeto","padrões de desenvolvimento","fluxos de trabalho complexos","árvores de decisão"],"ru":["создатель навыков AI","навыки AI","разработка программного обеспечения","эффективность проекта","конвенции разработки","сложные рабочие процессы","деревья решений"],"ar":["مبدع مهارات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مهارات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","كفاءة المشروع","اتفاقيات التطوير","سلاسل العمل المعقدة","أشجار القرار"]}},"owner":"carlos-ASG","repo":"tu-voz-en-ruta","repoPath":"carlos-ASG/tu-voz-en-ruta","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.416Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill-creator","description":">","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"## When to Create a Skill\n\nCreate a skill when:\n- A pattern is used repeatedly and AI needs guidance\n- Project-specific conventions differ from generic best practices\n- Complex workflows need step-by-step instructions\n- Decision trees help AI choose the right approach\n\n**Don''t create a skill when:**\n- Documentation already exists (create a reference instead)\n- Pattern is trivial or self-explanatory\n- It''s a one-off task\n\n---\n\n## Skill Structure\n\n```\nskills/{skill-name}/\n├── SKILL.md","body":"## When to Create a Skill\n\nCreate a skill when:\n- A pattern is used repeatedly and AI needs guidance\n- Project-specific conventions differ from generic best practices\n- Complex workflows need step-by-step instructions\n- Decision trees help AI choose the right approach\n\n**Don''t create a skill when:**\n- Documentation already exists (create a reference instead)\n- Pattern is trivial or self-explanatory\n- It''s a one-off task\n\n---\n\n## Skill Structure\n\n```\nskills/{skill-name}/\n├── SKILL.md              # Required - main skill file\n├── assets/               # Optional - templates, schemas, examples\n│   ├── template.py\n│   └── schema.json\n└── references/           # Optional - links to local docs\n    └── docs.md           # Points to docs/developer-guide/*.mdx\n```\n\n---\n\n## SKILL.md Template\n\n```markdown\n---\nname: {skill-name}\ndescription: >\n  {One-line description of what this skill does}.\n  Trigger: {When the AI should load this skill}.\nlicense: Apache-2.0\nmetadata:\n  author: prowler-cloud\n  version: \"1.0\"\n---\n\n## When to Use\n\n{Bullet points of when to use this skill}\n\n## Critical Patterns\n\n{The most important rules - what AI MUST know}\n\n## Code Examples\n\n{Minimal, focused examples}\n\n## Commands\n\n```bash\n{Common commands}\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **Templates**: See [assets/](assets/) for {description}\n- **Documentation**: See [references/](references/) for local docs\n```\n\n---\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\n| Type | Pattern | Examples |\n|------|---------|----------|\n| Generic skill | `{technology}` | `pytest`, `playwright`, `typescript` |\n| Prowler-specific | `prowler-{component}` | `prowler-api`, `prowler-ui`, `prowler-sdk-check` |\n| Testing skill | `prowler-test-{component}` | `prowler-test-sdk`, `prowler-test-api` |\n| Workflow skill | `{action}-{target}` | `skill-creator`, `jira-task` |\n\n---\n\n## Decision: assets/ vs references/\n\n```\nNeed code templates?        → assets/\nNeed JSON schemas?          → assets/\nNeed example configs?       → assets/\nLink to existing docs?      → references/\nLink to external guides?    → references/ (with local path)\n```\n\n**Key Rule**: `references/` should point to LOCAL files (`docs/developer-guide/*.mdx`), not web URLs.\n\n---\n\n## Decision: Prowler-Specific vs Generic\n\n```\nPatterns apply to ANY project?     → Generic skill (e.g., pytest, typescript)\nPatterns are Prowler-specific?     → prowler-{name} skill\nGeneric skill needs Prowler info?  → Add references/ pointing to Prowler docs\n```\n\n---\n\n## Frontmatter Fields\n\n| Field | Required | Description |\n|-------|----------|-------------|\n| `name` | Yes | Skill identifier (lowercase, hyphens) |\n| `description` | Yes | What + Trigger in one block |\n| `license` | Yes | Always `Apache-2.0` for Prowler |\n| `metadata.author` | Yes | `prowler-cloud` |\n| `metadata.version` | Yes | Semantic version as string |\n\n---\n\n## Content Guidelines\n\n### DO\n- Start with the most critical patterns\n- Use tables for decision trees\n- Keep code examples minimal and focused\n- Include Commands section with copy-paste commands\n\n### DON''T\n- Add Keywords section (agent searches frontmatter, not body)\n- Duplicate content from existing docs (reference instead)\n- Include lengthy explanations (link to docs)\n- Add troubleshooting sections (keep focused)\n- Use web URLs in references (use local paths)\n\n---\n\n## Registering the Skill\n\nAfter creating the skill, add it to `AGENTS.md`:\n\n```markdown\n| `{skill-name}` | {Description} | [SKILL.md](skills/{skill-name}/SKILL.md) |\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist Before Creating\n\n- [ ] Skill doesn''t already exist (check `skills/`)\n- [ ] Pattern is reusable (not one-off)\n- [ ] Name follows conventions\n- [ ] Frontmatter is complete (description includes trigger keywords)\n- [ ] Critical patterns are clear\n- [ ] Code examples are minimal\n- [ ] Commands section exists\n- [ ] Added to AGENTS.md\n\n## Resources\n\n- **Templates**: See [assets/](assets/) for SKILL.md template\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:08:31.197Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Documentation Automation Agents that specialize in creating reusable AI instruction patterns.","zh":"非常适合专门创建可重用 AI 指令模式的文档自动化代理。","ja":"再利用可能なAI指令パターンを作成することに特化した文書自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"재사용 가능한 AI 명령 패턴을 생성하는 데 전문적인 문서 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización de Documentación que se especializan en crear patrones de instrucciones de IA reutilizables.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Automatisation de Documentation qui se spécialisent dans la création de modèles d''instructions d''IA réutilisables.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentationsautomationsagenten, die sich auf die Erstellung wiederverwendbarer AI-Anweisungsmuster spezialisieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação de Documentação que se especializam em criar padrões de instruções de IA reutilizáveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по автоматизации документации, специализирующихся на создании повторно используемых шаблонов инструкций ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعميل ت 自动化 الوثائق التي تختص في إنشاء أنماط تعليمات ذكاء اصطناعي قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to systematically generate standardized skill documentation with structured markdown templates, ensuring consistent formatting and comprehensive coverage of when-to-use guidelines, skill structures, and implementation patterns.","zh":"使代理能够系统地生成标准化的技能文档，具有结构化的 Markdown 模板，确保一致的格式和全面覆盖何时使用指南、技能结构和实现模式。","ja":"エージェントが、構造化されたMarkdownテンプレートを使用して標準化されたスキル文書を体系的に生成できるようにし、フォーマットの一貫性と、いつ使用するかに関するガイドライン、スキル構造、実装パターンの包括的なカバーを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 구조화된 Markdown 템플릿을 사용하여 표준화된 스킬 문서를 체계적으로 생성할 수 있도록하여 포맷의 일관성과 언제 사용하는지에 대한 가이드라인, 스킬 구조 및 구현 패턴의 포괄적인 커버를 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar sistemáticamente documentación de habilidades estandarizada con plantillas de markdown estructuradas, lo que garantiza un formato coherente y una cobertura integral de las pautas de cuándo usar, las estructuras de habilidades y los patrones de implementación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer systématiquement une documentation de compétences standardisée avec des modèles de markdown structurés, garantissant un formatage cohérent et une couverture complète des lignes directrices de quand utiliser, des structures de compétences et des modèles de mise en œuvre.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, systematisch standardisierte Fähigkeitsdokumentationen mit strukturierten Markdown-Vorlagen zu generieren, was ein konsistentes Format und eine umfassende Abdeckung der Richtlinien für die Verwendung, Fähigkeitsstrukturen und Implementierungsmuster gewährleistet.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem sistematicamente documentação de habilidades padronizada com modelos de markdown estruturados, garantindo formatação consistente e cobertura abrangente das diretrizes de quando usar, estruturas de habilidades e padrões de implementação.","ru":"Позволяет агентам систематически генерировать стандартизированную документацию навыков с помощью структурированных шаблонов markdown, обеспечивая последовательное форматирование и полное освещение рекомендаций по использованию, структур навыков и шаблонов реализации.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بتوليد وثائق موحدة لقدراتهم باستخدام قوالب ماركداون منظمّة، مما يضمن تنسيقًا متسقًا وتغطية شاملة للارشادات حول متى استخدامها، وهيكل القدرات وأنماط التنفيذ."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating skill documentation generation for AI agent ecosystems","Creating standardized templates for project-specific AI conventions","Generating reusable workflow instructions for complex AI tasks","Building decision trees for AI pattern selection"],"zh":["自动化 AI 代理生态系统的技能文档生成","为项目特定的 AI 约定创建标准化模板","为复杂 AI 任务生成可重用工作流指令","为 AI 模式选择构建决策树"],"ja":["AIエージェントエコシステムのスキル文書の自動生成","プロジェクト固有のAI規約用の標準テンプレートを作成","複雑なAIタスク用の再利用可能なワークフローの指示を生成","AIパターンの選択のための決定木を構築"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 생태계의 스킬 문서 자동 생성","프로젝트 특정 AI 규칙을 위한 표준 템플릿 생성","복잡한 AI 태스크를 위한 재사용 가능한 워크플로우 지침 생성","AI 패턴 선택을 위한 의사 결정 트리 구축"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de documentación de habilidades para ecosistemas de agentes de IA","Creación de plantillas estandarizadas para convenciones de IA específicas de proyectos","Generación de instrucciones de flujo de trabajo reutilizables para tareas de IA complejas","Creación de árboles de decisión para la selección de patrones de IA"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de documentation de compétences pour les écosystèmes d''agents d''IA","Création de modèles standardisés pour les conventions d''IA spécifiques aux projets","Génération d''instructions de workflow réutilisables pour les tâches d''IA complexes","Création d''arbres de décision pour la sélection de modèles d''IA"],"de":["Automatisierung der Generierung von Fähigkeitsdokumentationen für IA-Agenten-Ökosysteme","Erstellung standardisierter Vorlagen für projektspezifische IA-Konventionen","Generierung wiederverwendbarer Workflow-Anweisungen für komplexe IA-Aufgaben","Erstellung von Entscheidungsbäumen für die Auswahl von IA-Mustern"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de documentação de habilidades para ecossistemas de agentes de IA","Criar modelos padronizados para convenções de IA específicas de projetos","Gerar instruções de fluxo de trabalho reutilizáveis para tarefas de IA complexas","Construir árvores de decisão para seleção de padrões de IA"],"ru":["Автоматизировать генерацию документации навыков для экосистем агентов ИИ","Создавать стандартизированные шаблоны для проектных конвенций ИИ","Генерировать повторно используемые инструкции по рабочему процессу для сложных задач ИИ","Строить деревья решений для выбора шаблонов ИИ"],"ar":["توفير آلي لإنشاء وثائق القدرات لبيئات عميل الذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء قوالب موحدة لاتفاقيات الذكاء الاصطناعي الخاصة بالمشاريع","توليد تعليمات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لتدفقات العمل المعقدة للذكاء الاصطناعي","بناء أشجار القرار لانتقاء أنماط الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of markdown syntax","Limited to skill creation patterns only","Depends on clear pattern recognition capabilities"],"zh":["需要理解 Markdown 语法","仅限于技能创建模式","依赖于清晰的模式识别能力"],"ja":["Markdown構文の理解が必要","スキル作成パターンのみに限定","明確なパターン認識能力に依存"],"ko":["Markdown 구문 이해가 필요","스킬 생성 패턴만 제한","명확한 패턴 인식 능력에 의존"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la sintaxis markdown","Limitado a patrones de creación de habilidades solo","Depende de capacidades de reconocimiento de patrones claras"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de la syntaxe markdown","Limité aux modèles de création de compétences uniquement","Dépend de capacités de reconnaissance de modèles claires"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis der Markdown-Syntax","Begrenzt auf Fähigkeits-Erstellungsmuster nur","Hängt von klaren Mustererkennungsfähigkeiten ab"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da sintaxe markdown","Limitado apenas a padrões de criação de habilidades","Depende de capacidades de reconhecimento de padrões claras"],"ru":["Требует понимания синтаксиса markdown","Ограничен только шаблонами создания навыков","Зависит от четких возможностей распознавания шаблонов"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا للتنسيق النصي لماركداون","محدود فقط بنماط إنشاء القدرات","يعتمد على قدرات واضحة لتحليل الأنماط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":85}');
