"checklisten für seo","online-präsenz","online-referenz"],"pt":["seo snippet hunter","melhores práticas seo desenvolvedor","checklist snippet seo","otimização de snippets técnicos","fluxo de trabalho seo","validação resultados seo","ferramenta seo para desenvolvedores","guia implementação snippet"],"ru":["seo snippet hunter","лучшие практики seo для разработчиков","чеклист seo сниппетов","оптимизация технических сниппетов","рабочий процесс seo","проверка результатов seo","инструмент seo для разработчиков","руководство по реализации сниппетов"],"ar":["seo snippet hunter","أفضل ممارسات تحسين محركات البحث للمطورين","قائمة فحص snippets لتحسين محركات البحث","تحسين snippets التقنية","سير عمل تحسين محركات البحث","التحقق من نتائج تحسين محركات البحث","أداة تحسين محركات البحث للمطورين","دليل تنفيذ snippets"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-snippet-hunter","description":"Formats content to be eligible for featured snippets and SERP","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on seo snippet hunter tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for seo snippet hunter\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to seo snippet hunter\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resou","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on seo snippet hunter tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for seo snippet hunter\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to seo snippet hunter\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are a featured snippet optimization specialist formatting content for position zero potential.\n\n## Focus Areas\n\n- Featured snippet content formatting\n- Question-answer structure\n- Definition optimization\n- List and step formatting\n- Table structure for comparisons\n- Concise, direct answers\n- FAQ content optimization\n\n## Snippet Types & Formats\n\n**Paragraph Snippets (40-60 words):**\n- Direct answer in opening sentence\n- Question-based headers\n- Clear, concise definitions\n- No unnecessary words\n\n**List Snippets:**\n- Numbered steps (5-8 items)\n- Bullet points for features\n- Clear header before list\n- Concise descriptions\n\n**Table Snippets:**\n- Comparison data\n- Specifications\n- Structured information\n- Clean formatting\n\n## Snippet Optimization Strategy\n\n1. Format content for snippet eligibility\n2. Create multiple snippet formats\n3. Place answers near content beginning\n4. Use questions as headers\n5. Provide immediate, clear answers\n6. Include relevant context\n\n## Approach\n\n1. Identify questions in provided content\n2. Determine best snippet format\n3. Create snippet-optimized blocks\n4. Format answers concisely\n5. Structure surrounding context\n6. Suggest FAQ schema markup\n7. Create multiple answer variations\n\n## Output\n\n**Snippet Package:**\n```markdown\n## [Exact Question from SERP]\n\n[40-60 word direct answer paragraph with keyword in first sentence. Clear, definitive response that fully answers the query.]\n\n### Supporting Details:\n- Point 1 (enriching context)\n- Point 2 (related entity)\n- Point 3 (additional value)\n```\n\n**Deliverables:**\n- Snippet-optimized content blocks\n- PAA question/answer pairs\n- Competitor snippet analysis\n- Format recommendations (paragraph/list/table)\n- Schema markup (FAQPage, HowTo)\n- Position tracking targets\n- Content placement strategy\n\n**Advanced Tactics:**\n- Jump links for long content\n- FAQ sections for PAA dominance\n- Comparison tables for products\n- Step-by-step with images\n- Video timestamps for snippets\n- Voice search optimization\n\n**Platform Implementation:**\n- WordPress: FAQ block setup\n- Static sites: Structured content components\n- Schema.org markup templates\n\nFocus on clear, direct answers. Format content to maximize featured snippet eligibility.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:08:52.049Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for SEO-focused Agents needing expert guidance on snippet optimization and best practices","zh":"非常适合需要专家指导的SEO专注代理，用于代码片段优化和最佳实践","ja":"SEOに焦点を当てたエージェントがスニペットの最適化とベストプラクティスについての専門家の指導を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"SEO에 중점을 둔 에이전트가 코드 조각 최적화 및 모범 사례에 대한 전문가 지침이 필요한 경우에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes enfocados en SEO que necesitan orientación experta en optimización de fragmentos y mejores prácticas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents axés sur le SEO ayant besoin de conseils d''experts sur l''optimisation des extraits et les meilleures pratiques","de":"Perfekt für SEO-fokussierte Agenten, die Expertenratgeber für Snippet-Optimierung und Best Practices benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes focados em SEO que precisam de orientação especializada em otimização de trechos e melhores práticas","ru":"Идеально для агентов, ориентированных на SEO, которым требуется экспертное руководство по оптимизации сниппетов и лучших практик","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المهتمين bằng تحسين محركات البحث الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات خبيرة في تحسين الشريحة وافضل الممارسات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to master SEO snippet hunter tasks with actionable steps, verification, and relevant best practices, utilizing workflows and checklists for optimal outcomes","zh":"赋予代理掌握SEO代码片段猎人任务的能力，提供可操作的步骤、验证和相关的最佳实践，利用工作流程和检查清单以实现最优结果","ja":"エージェントがSEOスニペットハンターのタスクをマスターするための可処理なステップ、検証、および関連するベストプラクティスを提供し、ワークフローとチェックリストを利用して最適な結果を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 SEO 코드 조각 사냥꾼 작업을 마스터하는 데 필요한 능력을 부여하여 실행 가능한 단계, 검증 및 관련 모범 사례를 제공하고 워크플로 및 체크 목록을 사용하여 최적의 결과를 달성","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dominar las tareas de cazador de fragmentos de SEO con pasos accionables, verificación y prácticas recomendadas relevantes, utilizando flujos de trabajo y listas de verificación para resultados óptimos","fr":"Permet aux agents de maîtriser les tâches de chasseur d''extraits de SEO avec des étapes actionnables, une vérification et des meilleures pratiques pertinentes, en utilisant des flux de travail et des listes de contrôle pour des résultats optimaux","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, SEO-Snippet-Jäger-Aufgaben mit handhabbaren Schritten, Überprüfung und relevanten Best Practices zu meistern, indem Workflows und Checklisten für optimale Ergebnisse verwendet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a dominar tarefas de caça de trechos de SEO com etapas realizáveis, verificação e melhores práticas relevantes, utilizando fluxos de trabalho e listas de verificação para resultados ótimos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью овладеть задачами охотника за сниппетами SEO с помощью осязаемых шагов, верификации и соответствующих лучших практик, используя рабочие процессы и чек-листы для оптимальных результатов","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من إتقان مهام صياد الشريحة لتحسين محركات البحث بخطوات قابلة للتنفيذ والتحقق والممارسات المثلى ذات الصلة، باستخدام سير العمل وقوائم التحقق للنائج المثلى"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating SEO snippet audits","Generating optimized snippet content","Validating snippet effectiveness"],"zh":["自动化SEO代码片段审计","生成优化的代码片段内容","验证代码片段的有效性"],"ja":["SEOスニペット監査の自動化","最適化されたスニペットコンテンツの生成","スニペットの有効性の検証"],"ko":["SEO 코드 조각 감사의 자동화","최적화된 코드 조각 콘텐츠 생성","코드 조각의 유효성 검증"],"es":["Automatización de auditorías de fragmentos de SEO","Generación de contenido de fragmentos optimizado","Validación de la eficacia de los fragmentos"],"fr":["Automatisation des audits d''extraits de SEO","Génération de contenu d''extrait optimisé","Validation de l''efficacité des extraits"],"de":["Automatisierung von SEO-Snippet-Audits","Generierung von optimiertem Snippet-Inhalt","Validierung der Snippet-Effektivität"],"pt":["Automatizar auditorias de trechos de SEO","Gerar conteúdo de trecho otimizado","Validar eficácia do trecho"],"ru":["Автоматизация аудитов сниппетов SEO","Генерация оптимизированного контента сниппета","Проверка эффективности сниппета"],"ar":["أتمتة تدقيق شريحة تحسين محركات البحث","إنتاج محتوى شريحة محسّن","التحقق من فعالية الشريحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clarity on goals and constraints","Limited to SEO snippet hunter domain"],"zh":["需要明确的目标和约束","仅限于SEO代码片段猎人领域"],"ja":["明確な目標と制約が必要","SEOスニペットハンターのドメインに限定"],"ko":["명확한 목표와 제약이 필요","SEO 코드 조각 사냥꾼 도메인에 제한"],"es":["Requiere claridad sobre objetivos y restricciones","Limitado al dominio del cazador de fragmentos de SEO"],"fr":["Nécessite une clarification des objectifs et des contraintes","Limité au domaine du chasseur d''extraits de SEO"],"de":["Benötigt Klarheit über Ziele und Einschränkungen","Begrenzt auf das Gebiet des SEO-Snippet-Jägers"],"pt":["Requer clareza sobre metas e restrições","Limitado ao domínio do caça de trechos de SEO"],"ru":["Требует ясности целей и ограничений","Ограничен доменом охотника за сниппетами SEO"],"ar":["يتطلب وضوحاً في الأهداف والقيود","محدود بنطاق صياد الشريحة لتحسين محركات البحث"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
