Business API-Konto","Steigert die Effizienz und Produktivität"],"pt":["Integração com Rube MCP","Automação de operações do WhatsApp Business","Uso do toolkit da Composio","Requisitos de conexão ativa com o WhatsApp","Necessidade de conta de API do WhatsApp Business"],"ru":["Интеграция с Rube MCP","Автоматизация операций WhatsApp Business","Использование инструмента Composio","Требования активного подключения к WhatsApp","Необходимость учетной записи API WhatsApp Business"],"ar":["دمج مع Rube MCP","أتمتة عمليات عمل واتساب","استخدام أداة Composio","متطلبات الاتصال الفعّال مع واتساب","الحاجة إلى حساب واجهة برمجة تطبيقات واتساب للأعمال"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WhatsApp ","Rube MCP","WhatsApp API","WhatsApp ","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","WhatsApp ","WhatsApp "],"ja":["WhatsApp ","Rube MCP","WhatsApp API","WhatsApp ","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","WhatsApp ","WhatsApp "],"ko":["WhatsApp ","Rube MCP","WhatsApp API","WhatsApp ","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","WhatsApp ","WhatsApp "],"es":["automatización de WhatsApp Business","Rube MCP","Composio","WhatsApp Business API","automatización de tareas","eficiencia y productividad"],"fr":["automatisation de WhatsApp Business","Rube MCP","Composio","WhatsApp Business API","automatisation de tâches","efficacité et productivité"],"de":["Automatisierung von WhatsApp Business","Rube MCP","Composio","WhatsApp Business API","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Effizienz und Produktivität"],"pt":["automação do whatsapp business","rube mcp","composio","whatsapp business api","integração de ferramentas","otimização de operações","desenvolvimento de software","automatização de processos"],"ru":["автоматизация whatsapp business","rube mcp","composio","whatsapp business api","интеграция инструментов","оптимизация операций","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматизация процессов"],"ar":["أتمتة عمل واتساب","rube mcp","composio","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات واتساب للأعمال","دمج أدوات","تحسين عمليات","تطوير البرمجيات","أتمتة العمليات"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"whatsapp-automation","description":"Automate WhatsApp Business tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): send messages, manage templates, upload media, and handle contacts. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# WhatsApp Business Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate WhatsApp Business operations through Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active WhatsApp connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `whatsapp`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- WhatsApp Business API account required (not regular WhatsApp)\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server i","body":"# WhatsApp Business Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate WhatsApp Business operations through Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active WhatsApp connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `whatsapp`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- WhatsApp Business API account required (not regular WhatsApp)\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `whatsapp`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete WhatsApp Business setup\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. Send a Text Message\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send a text message to a WhatsApp contact\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS` - List available business phone numbers [Prerequisite]\n2. `WHATSAPP_SEND_MESSAGE` - Send a text message [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `to`: Recipient phone number in international format (e.g., ''+14155551234'')\n- `body`: Message text content\n- `phone_number_id`: Business phone number ID to send from\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Phone numbers must be in international E.164 format with country code\n- Messages outside the 24-hour window require approved templates\n- The 24-hour window starts when the customer last messaged you\n- Business-initiated conversations require template messages first\n\n### 2. Send Template Messages\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send pre-approved template messages for outbound communication\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_GET_MESSAGE_TEMPLATES` - List available templates [Prerequisite]\n2. `WHATSAPP_GET_TEMPLATE_STATUS` - Check template approval status [Optional]\n3. `WHATSAPP_SEND_TEMPLATE_MESSAGE` - Send the template message [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `template_name`: Name of the approved template\n- `language_code`: Template language (e.g., ''en_US'')\n- `to`: Recipient phone number\n- `components`: Template variable values and parameters\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Templates must be approved by Meta before use\n- Template variables must match the expected count and format\n- Sending unapproved or rejected templates returns errors\n- Language code must match an approved translation of the template\n\n### 3. Send Media Messages\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send images, documents, or other media\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_UPLOAD_MEDIA` - Upload media to WhatsApp servers [Required]\n2. `WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID` - Send media using the uploaded media ID [Required]\n   OR\n3. `WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA` - Send media using a public URL [Alternative]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `media_url`: Public URL of the media (for SEND_MEDIA)\n- `media_id`: ID from upload response (for SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID)\n- `type`: Media type (''image'', ''document'', ''audio'', ''video'', ''sticker'')\n- `caption`: Optional caption for the media\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Uploaded media IDs are temporary and expire after a period\n- Media size limits vary by type (images: 5MB, videos: 16MB, documents: 100MB)\n- Supported formats: images (JPEG, PNG), videos (MP4, 3GPP), documents (PDF, etc.)\n- SEND_MEDIA requires a publicly accessible HTTPS URL\n\n### 4. Reply to Messages\n\n**When to use**: User wants to reply to an incoming WhatsApp message\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_SEND_REPLY` - Send a reply to a specific message [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `message_id`: ID of the message being replied to\n- `to`: Recipient phone number\n- `body`: Reply text content\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- message_id must be from a message received within the 24-hour window\n- Replies appear as quoted messages in the conversation\n- The original message must still exist (not deleted) for the quote to display\n\n### 5. Manage Business Profile and Templates\n\n**When to use**: User wants to view or manage their WhatsApp Business profile\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_GET_BUSINESS_PROFILE` - Get business profile details [Optional]\n2. `WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS` - List registered phone numbers [Optional]\n3. `WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBER` - Get details for a specific number [Optional]\n4. `WHATSAPP_CREATE_MESSAGE_TEMPLATE` - Create a new template [Optional]\n5. `WHATSAPP_GET_MESSAGE_TEMPLATES` - List all templates [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `phone_number_id`: Business phone number ID\n- `template_name`: Name for the new template\n- `category`: Template category (MARKETING, UTILITY, AUTHENTICATION)\n- `language`: Template language code\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- New templates require Meta review before they can be used\n- Template names must be lowercase with underscores (no spaces)\n- Category affects pricing and approval criteria\n- Templates have specific formatting requirements for headers, body, and buttons\n\n### 6. Share Contacts\n\n**When to use**: User wants to send contact information via WhatsApp\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `WHATSAPP_SEND_CONTACTS` - Send contact cards [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `to`: Recipient phone number\n- `contacts`: Array of contact objects with name, phone, email details\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Contact objects must follow the WhatsApp Business API contact schema\n- At least a name field is required for each contact\n- Phone numbers in contacts should include country codes\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### 24-Hour Messaging Window\n\n- Customers must message you first to open a conversation window\n- Within 24 hours of their last message, you can send free-form messages\n- After 24 hours, only approved template messages can be sent\n- Template messages can re-open the conversation window\n\n### Phone Number Resolution\n\n```\n1. Call WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS\n2. Extract phone_number_id for your business number\n3. Use phone_number_id in all send operations\n```\n\n### Media Upload Flow\n\n```\n1. Call WHATSAPP_UPLOAD_MEDIA with the file\n2. Extract media_id from response\n3. Call WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID with media_id\n4. OR use WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA with a public URL directly\n```\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**Phone Number Format**:\n- Always use E.164 format: +[country code][number] (e.g., ''+14155551234'')\n- Do not include dashes, spaces, or parentheses\n- Country code is required; local numbers without it will fail\n\n**Messaging Restrictions**:\n- Business-initiated messages require templates outside the 24-hour window\n- Template messages cost money per conversation\n- Rate limits apply per phone number and per account\n\n**Media Handling**:\n- Uploaded media expires; use promptly after upload\n- Media URLs must be publicly accessible HTTPS\n- Stickers have specific requirements (WebP format, 512x512 pixels)\n\n**Template Management**:\n- Template review can take up to 24 hours\n- Rejected templates need to be fixed and resubmitted\n- Template variables use double curly braces: {{1}}, {{2}}, etc.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| Send message | WHATSAPP_SEND_MESSAGE | to, body |\n| Send template | WHATSAPP_SEND_TEMPLATE_MESSAGE | template_name, to, language_code |\n| Upload media | WHATSAPP_UPLOAD_MEDIA | (file params) |\n| Send media by ID | WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA_BY_ID | media_id, to, type |\n| Send media by URL | WHATSAPP_SEND_MEDIA | media_url, to, type |\n| Reply to message | WHATSAPP_SEND_REPLY | message_id, to, body |\n| Send contacts | WHATSAPP_SEND_CONTACTS | to, contacts |\n| Get media | WHATSAPP_GET_MEDIA | media_id |\n| List phone numbers | WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBERS | (none) |\n| Get phone number | WHATSAPP_GET_PHONE_NUMBER | phone_number_id |\n| Get business profile | WHATSAPP_GET_BUSINESS_PROFILE | phone_number_id |\n| Create template | WHATSAPP_CREATE_MESSAGE_TEMPLATE | template_name, category, language |\n| List templates | WHATSAPP_GET_MESSAGE_TEMPLATES | (none) |\n| Check template status | WHATSAPP_GET_TEMPLATE_STATUS | template_id |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:09:13.002Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Business Automation Agents requiring WhatsApp Business API integration via Rube MCP.","zh":"适用于需要通过 Rube MCP 集成 WhatsApp Business API 的商业自动化代理。","ja":"Rube MCP 経由で WhatsApp Business API を統合する必要があるビジネス オートメーション エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Rube MCP를 통해 WhatsApp Business API를 통합해야 하는 비즈니스 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización Empresarial que requieren integración con la API de WhatsApp Business a través de Rube MCP.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation d''entreprise nécessitant une intégration à l''API WhatsApp Business via Rube MCP.","de":"Ideal für Geschäftautomatisierungsagenten, die eine Integration mit der WhatsApp Business API über Rube MCP erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Negócios que exigem integração com a API do WhatsApp Business via Rube MCP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов бизнес-автоматизации, требующих интеграции с API WhatsApp Business через Rube MCP.","ar":"مثالي لعميل أتمتة الأعمال الذي يتطلب دمج واجهة برمجة تطبيقات WhatsApp Business عبر Rube MCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct automation of WhatsApp Business operations through Composio''s WhatsApp toolkit integrated with Rube MCP. Provides access to WhatsApp Business API functionality for messaging and customer engagement workflows. Requires RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS availability for schema discovery.","zh":"通过 Composio 的 WhatsApp 工具包与 Rube MCP 集成，实现 WhatsApp 商业操作的直接自动化。为消息和客户参与工作流提供对 WhatsApp 商业 API 功能的访问。需要 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 可用性以进行模式发现。","ja":"Composio の WhatsApp ツールキットと Rube MCP の統合により、WhatsApp ビジネス操作の直接的な自動化を可能にします。メッセージングとカスタマー エンゲージメント ワークフローに対する WhatsApp ビジネス API 機能へのアクセスを提供します。スキーマの検出には、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS の可用性が必要です。","ko":"Composio의 WhatsApp 툴킷과 Rube MCP를 통합하여 WhatsApp 비즈니스 오퍼레이션의 직접 자동화를 가능하게 합니다. 메시징 및 고객 참여 워크플로우에서 WhatsApp 비즈니스 API 기능에 대한 액세스를 제공합니다. 스키마 검색을 위해 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 가용성이 필요합니다.","es":"Permite la automatización directa de las operaciones de WhatsApp Business a través de la herramienta de WhatsApp de Composio integrada con Rube MCP. Proporciona acceso a la funcionalidad de la API de WhatsApp Business para flujos de trabajo de mensajería y participación del cliente. Requiere la disponibilidad de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para el descubrimiento de esquemas.","fr":"Permet l''automatisation directe des opérations WhatsApp Business via l''outil WhatsApp de Composio intégré à Rube MCP. Fournit l''accès à la fonctionnalité de l''API WhatsApp Business pour les flux de travail de messagerie et d''engagement client. Nécessite la disponibilité de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS pour la découverte de schémas.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Automatisierung von WhatsApp Business-Operationen über das WhatsApp-Toolkit von Composio, das in Rube MCP integriert ist. Bietet Zugang zur Funktionalität der WhatsApp Business API für Messaging- und Kundenbindung-Workflows. Erfordert die Verfügbarkeit von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS für die Schemenentdeckung.","pt":"Permite a automação direta das operações do WhatsApp Business por meio da ferramenta do WhatsApp da Composio integrada com o Rube MCP. Fornece acesso à funcionalidade da API do WhatsApp Business para fluxos de trabalho de mensagens e engajamento do cliente. Exige a disponibilidade das ferramentas de pesquisa RUBE para descoberta de esquema.","ru":"Позволяет直接 автоматизировать операции WhatsApp Business через интегрированный с Rube MCP инструментарий WhatsApp от Composio. Предоставляет доступ к функциональности API WhatsApp Business для рабочих процессов обмена сообщениями и вовлечения клиентов. Требует наличия инструментов поиска RUBE для обнаружения схемы.","ar":"يسمح بالتأتمت المباشر لعمليات WhatsApp Business من خلال أداة WhatsApp المدمجة في Composio مع Rube MCP. يوفر الوصول إلى وظائف واجهة برمجة تطبيقات WhatsApp Business لتدفقات العمل المتعلقة بالرسائل والتفاعل مع العملاء. يتطلب توافر أدوات البحث RUBE لاكتشاف مخطط."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating customer support message responses","Sending bulk promotional messages via WhatsApp Business","Managing WhatsApp connection configurations through RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"zh":["自动化客户支持消息响应","通过 WhatsApp 商业发送批量促销消息","通过 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 管理 WhatsApp 连接配置"],"ja":["カスタマー サポート メッセージの自動応答","WhatsApp ビジネス経由でバルク プロモーション メッセージを送信する","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 経由で WhatsApp 接続構成を管理する"],"ko":["고객 지원 메시지 응답 자동화","WhatsApp 비즈니스 통해 대량 프로모션 메시지 보내기","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 통해 WhatsApp 연결 구성 관리"],"es":["Automatización de respuestas de mensajes de soporte al cliente","Envío de mensajes promocionales masivos a través de WhatsApp Business","Administración de configuraciones de conexión de WhatsApp a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"fr":["Automatisation des réponses de messages de support client","Envoi de messages promotionnels en masse via WhatsApp Business","Gestion des configurations de connexion WhatsApp via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"de":["Automatisierung von Kunden-Support-Nachrichten-Antworten","Versand von Massen-Promotionsnachrichten über WhatsApp Business","Verwaltung von WhatsApp-Verbindungs-Konfigurationen über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"pt":["Automatizar respostas de mensagens de suporte ao cliente","Enviar mensagens promocionais em massa via WhatsApp Business","Gerenciar configurações de conexão do WhatsApp por meio de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ru":["Автоматизировать ответы на сообщения поддержки клиентов","Отправлять массовые промо-сообщения через WhatsApp Business","Управлять настройками подключения WhatsApp через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ar":["أتمتة استجابة رسائل الدعم للعملاء","إرسال رسائل ترويجية بالجملة عبر WhatsApp Business","إدارة إعدادات الاتصال بالواتساب من خلال RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP server connection (https://rube.app/mcp)","Needs active WhatsApp Business API account (not regular WhatsApp)","Dependent on RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS availability for schema discovery"],"zh":["需要 Rube MCP 服务器连接 (https://rube.app/mcp)","需要有效的 WhatsApp 商业 API 账户 (不是普通的 WhatsApp)","依赖于 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 的可用性以进行模式发现"],"ja":["Rube MCP サーバー接続 (https://rube.app/mcp) が必要","有効な WhatsApp ビジネス API アカウント (通常の WhatsApp ではありません) が必要","スキーマの検出には RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS の可用性に依存します"],"ko":["Rube MCP 서버 연결이 필요합니다 (https://rube.app/mcp)","유효한 WhatsApp 비즈니스 API 계정이 필요합니다 (정규 WhatsApp가 아님)","스키마 검색을 위해 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS 가용성에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere conexión al servidor Rube MCP (https://rube.app/mcp)","Necesita una cuenta activa de API de WhatsApp Business (no regular WhatsApp)","Depende de la disponibilidad de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para el descubrimiento de esquemas"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion au serveur Rube MCP (https://rube.app/mcp)","Nécessite un compte actif d''API WhatsApp Business (et non WhatsApp régulier)","Dépend de la disponibilité de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS pour la découverte de schémas"],"de":["Erfordert eine Verbindung zum Rube MCP-Server (https://rube.app/mcp)","Benötigt ein aktives WhatsApp Business API-Konto (nicht reguläres WhatsApp)","Hängt von der Verfügbarkeit von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS für die Schemenentdeckung ab"],"pt":["Exige conexão com o servidor Rube MCP (https://rube.app/mcp)","Necessita de uma conta ativa da API do WhatsApp Business (não o WhatsApp regular)","Depende da disponibilidade das ferramentas de pesquisa RUBE para descoberta de esquema"],"ru":["Требует подключения к серверу Rube MCP (https://rube.app/mcp)","Требует активного аккаунта API WhatsApp Business (не обычный WhatsApp)","Зависит от наличия инструментов поиска RUBE для обнаружения схемы"],"ar":["يتطلب الاتصال بخادم Rube MCP (https://rube.app/mcp)","يحتاج إلى حساب نشط لواجهة برمجة تطبيقات WhatsApp Business (ليس WhatsApp العادي)","يعتمد على توافر أدوات البحث RUBE لاكتشاف مخطط"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
