endly: Ferramentas de Agendamento","ru":"Автоматизация Calendly: Инструменты для планирования","ar":"أتمتة كالندلي: أدوات جدولة","en":"calendly-automation"},"description":{"zh":"Calendly 自动化集成允许开发者自动化事件列表、邀请管理、安排链接创建等操作","ja":"Calendly オートメーション統合により、開発者はイベントリスト、招待管理、スケジュールリンク作成などの操作を自動化できます","ko":"Calendly 자동화 연동을 통해 개발자는 이벤트 목록, 초대 관리, 예약 링크 생성 등 운영을 자동화할 수 있습니다","es":"La automatización de Calendly permite a los desarrolladores administrar eventos y programaciones de manera eficiente. Conecta con Composio para empezar.","fr":"L''automatisation de Calendly permet aux développeurs de gérer les événements et les planifications de manière efficace. Connectez-vous à Composio pour commen...","de":"Die Automatisierung von Calendly ermöglicht es Entwicklern, Ereignisse und Terminplanungen effizient zu verwalten. Verbinden Sie sich mit Composio, um loszul...","pt":"A automação do Calendly permite agendar reuniões e gerenciar convidados de forma eficiente. Aprenda a usar a ferramenta Composio para automatizar operações d...","ru":"Автоматизация Calendly позволяет планировать встречи и управлять приглашенными в эффективном порядке. Узнайте, как использовать инструмент Composio для автом...","ar":"أتمتة كالندلي تسمح بجدولة الاجتماعات وإدارة المشاركين بفعالية. تعلم كيفية استخدام أداة كومبوسيو لأتمتة عمليات كالندلي.","en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"definition":{"en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"features":{"zh":["事件列表自动化","邀请管理自动化","安排链接创建自动化","可用性查询自动化","组织管理自动化"],"ja":["イベントリストの自動化","招待管理の自動化","スケジュールリンク作成の自動化","利用可能性の問い合わせの自動化","組織管理の自動化"],"ko":["이벤트 목록 자동화","초대 관리 자동화","예약 링크 생성 자동화","가용성 조회 자동화","조직 관리 자동화"],"es":["Conexión a Calendly a través de Composio","Administración de eventos y programaciones","Creación de enlaces de programación","Consulta de disponibilidad","Administración de organizaciones"],"fr":["Connexion à Calendly via Composio","Gestion des événements et des planifications","Création de liens de planification","Recherche de disponibilité","Gestion des organisations"],"de":["Verbindung zu Calendly über Composio","Verwaltung von Ereignissen und Terminplanungen","Erstellung von Terminierungslinks","Abfrage von Verfügbarkeit","Verwaltung von Organisationen"],"pt":["Criação de links de agendamento","Gerenciamento de convidados","Consulta de disponibilidade","Administração de organização"],"ru":["Создание ссылок для планирования","Управление приглашенными","Запрос наличия","Администрирование организации"],"ar":["إنشاء روابط جدولة","إدارة المشاركين","استعلام عن التوفر","إدارة المنظمة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Calendly 自动化","Composio 工具包","事件列表自动化","邀请管理自动化","安排链接创建自动化","可用性查询自动化"],"ja":["Calendly オートメーション","Composio ツールキット","イベントリストの自動化","招待管理の自動化","スケジュールリンク作成の自動化","利用可能性の問い合わせの自動化"],"ko":["Calendly 자동화","Composio 툴킷","이벤트 목록 자동화","초대 관리 자동화","예약 링크 생성 자동화","가용성 조회 자동화"],"es":["automatización de Calendly","desarrollo de Calendly","herramientas de Calendly","API de Calendly","programación de eventos","gestión de invitados"],"fr":["automatisation de Calendly","développement de Calendly","outils de Calendly","API de Calendly","planification d''événements","gestion des invités"],"de":["Automatisierung von Calendly","Entwicklung von Calendly","Tools von Calendly","API von Calendly","Terminplanung von Ereignissen","Verwaltung von Gästen"],"pt":["automação do calendly","ferramentas de agendamento","gerenciamento de convidados","consulta de disponibilidade","administração de organização","calendly api","integração com calendly"],"ru":["автоматизация calendly","инструменты для планирования","управление приглашенными","запрос наличия","администрирование организации","calendly api","интеграция с calendly"],"ar":["أتمتة كالندلي","أدوات جدولة","إدارة المشاركين","استعلام عن التوفر","إدارة المنظمة","كالندلي api","التكامل مع كالندلي"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"calendly-automation","description":"Automate Calendly scheduling, event management, invitee tracking, availability checks, and organization administration via Rube MCP (Composio). Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Calendly Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Calendly operations including event listing, invitee management, scheduling link creation, availability queries, and organization administration through Composio''s Calendly toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Calendly connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- Many operations require the user''s Calendl","body":"# Calendly Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Calendly operations including event listing, invitee management, scheduling link creation, availability queries, and organization administration through Composio''s Calendly toolkit.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Calendly connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n- Many operations require the user''s Calendly URI, obtained via `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER`\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `calendly`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Calendly OAuth\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and View Scheduled Events\n\n**When to use**: User wants to see their upcoming, past, or filtered Calendly events\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get authenticated user URI and organization URI [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - List events scoped by user, organization, or group [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` - Get detailed info for a specific event by UUID [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `user`: Full Calendly API URI (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`) - NOT `\"me\"`\n- `organization`: Full organization URI for org-scoped queries\n- `status`: `\"active\"` or `\"canceled\"`\n- `min_start_time` / `max_start_time`: UTC timestamps (e.g., `2024-01-01T00:00:00.000000Z`)\n- `invitee_email`: Filter events by invitee email (filter only, not a scope)\n- `sort`: `\"start_time:asc\"` or `\"start_time:desc\"`\n- `count`: Results per page (default 20)\n- `page_token`: Pagination token from previous response\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Exactly ONE of `user`, `organization`, or `group` must be provided - omitting or combining scopes fails\n- The `user` parameter requires the full API URI, not `\"me\"` - use `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` first\n- `invitee_email` is a filter, not a scope; you still need one of user/organization/group\n- Pagination uses `count` + `page_token`; loop until `page_token` is absent for complete results\n- Admin rights may be needed for organization or group scope queries\n\n### 2. Manage Event Invitees\n\n**When to use**: User wants to see who is booked for events or get invitee details\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - Find the target event(s) [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` - List all invitees for a specific event [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_INVITEE` - Get detailed info for a single invitee [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Event UUID (for `LIST_EVENT_INVITEES`)\n- `event_uuid` + `invitee_uuid`: Both required for `GET_EVENT_INVITEE`\n- `email`: Filter invitees by email address\n- `status`: `\"active\"` or `\"canceled\"`\n- `sort`: `\"created_at:asc\"` or `\"created_at:desc\"`\n- `count`: Results per page (default 20)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- The `uuid` parameter for `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` is the event UUID, not the invitee UUID\n- Paginate using `page_token` until absent for complete invitee lists\n- Canceled invitees are excluded by default; use `status: \"canceled\"` to see them\n\n### 3. Create Scheduling Links and Check Availability\n\n**When to use**: User wants to generate a booking link or check available time slots\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get user URI [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` - List available event types [Required]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` - Check available slots for an event type [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` - Generate a single-use scheduling link [Required]\n5. `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_AVAILABILITY_SCHEDULES` - View user''s availability schedules [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `owner`: Event type URI (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/event_types/{uuid}`)\n- `owner_type`: `\"EventType\"` (default)\n- `max_event_count`: Must be exactly `1` for single-use links\n- `start_time` / `end_time`: UTC timestamps for availability queries (max 7-day range)\n- `active`: Boolean to filter active/inactive event types\n- `user`: User URI for event type listing\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` can return 403 if token lacks rights or owner URI is invalid\n- `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` requires UTC timestamps and max 7-day range; split longer searches\n- Available times results are NOT paginated - all results returned in one response\n- Event type URIs must be full API URIs (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/event_types/...`)\n\n### 4. Cancel Events\n\n**When to use**: User wants to cancel a scheduled Calendly event\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` - Find the event to cancel [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` - Confirm event details before cancellation [Prerequisite]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` - Check who will be affected [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT` - Cancel the event [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Event UUID to cancel\n- `reason`: Optional cancellation reason (may be included in notification to invitees)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Cancellation is IRREVERSIBLE - always confirm with the user before calling\n- Cancellation may trigger notifications to invitees\n- Only active events can be canceled; already-canceled events return errors\n- Get explicit user confirmation before executing `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT`\n\n### 5. Manage Organization and Invitations\n\n**When to use**: User wants to invite members, manage organization, or handle org invitations\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` - Get user and organization context [Prerequisite]\n2. `CALENDLY_GET_ORGANIZATION` - Get organization details [Optional]\n3. `CALENDLY_LIST_ORGANIZATION_INVITATIONS` - Check existing invitations [Optional]\n4. `CALENDLY_CREATE_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` - Send an org invitation [Required]\n5. `CALENDLY_REVOKE_USER_S_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` - Revoke a pending invitation [Optional]\n6. `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION` - Remove a member [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `uuid`: Organization UUID\n- `email`: Email address of user to invite\n- `status`: Filter invitations by `\"pending\"`, `\"accepted\"`, or `\"declined\"`\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Only org owners/admins can manage invitations and removals; others get authorization errors\n- Duplicate active invitations for the same email are rejected - check existing invitations first\n- Organization owners cannot be removed via `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION`\n- Invitation statuses include pending, accepted, declined, and revoked - handle each appropriately\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### ID Resolution\nCalendly uses full API URIs as identifiers, not simple IDs:\n- **Current user URI**: `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` returns `resource.uri` (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`)\n- **Organization URI**: Found in current user response at `resource.current_organization`\n- **Event UUID**: Extract from event URI or list responses\n- **Event type URI**: From `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` response\n\nImportant: Never use `\"me\"` as a user parameter in list/filter endpoints. Always resolve to the full URI first.\n\n### Pagination\nMost Calendly list endpoints use token-based pagination:\n- Set `count` for page size (default 20)\n- Follow `page_token` from `pagination.next_page_token` until absent\n- Sort with `field:direction` format (e.g., `start_time:asc`, `created_at:desc`)\n\n### Time Handling\n- All timestamps must be in UTC format: `yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ss.ffffffZ`\n- Use `min_start_time` / `max_start_time` for date range filtering on events\n- Available times queries have a maximum 7-day range; split longer searches into multiple calls\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n### URI Formats\n- All entity references use full Calendly API URIs (e.g., `https://api.calendly.com/users/{uuid}`)\n- Never pass bare UUIDs where URIs are expected, and never pass `\"me\"` to list endpoints\n- Extract UUIDs from URIs when tools expect UUID parameters (e.g., `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT`)\n\n### Scope Requirements\n- `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` requires exactly one scope (user, organization, or group) - no more, no less\n- Organization/group scoped queries may require admin privileges\n- Token scope determines which operations are available; 403 errors indicate insufficient permissions\n\n### Data Relationships\n- Events have invitees (attendees who booked)\n- Event types define scheduling pages (duration, availability rules)\n- Organizations contain users and groups\n- Scheduling links are tied to event types, not directly to events\n\n### Rate Limits\n- Calendly API has rate limits; avoid tight loops over large datasets\n- Paginate responsibly and add delays for batch operations\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| Get current user | `CALENDLY_GET_CURRENT_USER` | (none) |\n| Get user by UUID | `CALENDLY_GET_USER` | `uuid` |\n| List events | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENTS` | `user`, `status`, `min_start_time` |\n| Get event details | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT` | `uuid` |\n| Cancel event | `CALENDLY_CANCEL_EVENT` | `uuid`, `reason` |\n| List invitees | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_INVITEES` | `uuid`, `status`, `email` |\n| Get invitee | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_INVITEE` | `event_uuid`, `invitee_uuid` |\n| List event types | `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_S_EVENT_TYPES` | `user`, `active` |\n| Get event type | `CALENDLY_GET_EVENT_TYPE` | `uuid` |\n| Check availability | `CALENDLY_LIST_EVENT_TYPE_AVAILABLE_TIMES` | event type URI, `start_time`, `end_time` |\n| Create scheduling link | `CALENDLY_CREATE_SCHEDULING_LINK` | `owner`, `max_event_count` |\n| List availability schedules | `CALENDLY_LIST_USER_AVAILABILITY_SCHEDULES` | user URI |\n| Get organization | `CALENDLY_GET_ORGANIZATION` | `uuid` |\n| Invite to org | `CALENDLY_CREATE_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` | `uuid`, `email` |\n| List org invitations | `CALENDLY_LIST_ORGANIZATION_INVITATIONS` | `uuid`, `status` |\n| Revoke org invitation | `CALENDLY_REVOKE_USER_S_ORGANIZATION_INVITATION` | org UUID, invitation UUID |\n| Remove from org | `CALENDLY_REMOVE_USER_FROM_ORGANIZATION` | membership UUID |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:09:31.702Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for AI scheduling agents that automate client booking and calendar management workflows.","zh":"适用于自动客户预约和日历管理工作流的 AI 排班代理。","ja":"クライアントの予約とカレンダー管理ワークフローを自動化する AI スケジューリング エージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"클라이언트 예약 및 달력 관리 워크플로를 자동화하는 AI 스케줄링 에이전트에 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para agentes de programación de IA que automatizan los flujos de trabajo de reserva de clientes y administración de calendarios.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de planification d''IA qui automatisent les flux de travail de réservation de clients et de gestion de calendriers.","de":"Wesentlich für AI-Scheduling-Agents, die Client-Buchung und Kalendermanagement-Workflows automatisieren.","pt":"Essencial para agentes de programação de IA que automatizam fluxos de trabalho de reserva de clientes e gerenciamento de calendário.","ru":"Необходим для агентов планирования ИИ, которые автоматизируют рабочие процессы бронирования клиентов и управления календарем.","ar":"ضروري لعمليات جدولة الإدارة الذكية التي تتم.AutoScaleDimensions تلقائيًا لإدارة جداول العملاء وحفظها."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct integration with Calendly''s API for comprehensive event management, including listing events, managing invitees, creating scheduling links, querying availability, and performing organization administration through Composio''s toolkit.","zh":"通过 Composio 的工具包实现与 Calendly API 的直接集成，实现全面事件管理，包括列出事件、管理受邀者、创建排班链接、查询可用性以及执行组织管理。","ja":"Composio のツールキットを使用して Calendly API との直接統合を可能にし、イベントのリスト表示、受邀者管理、スケジューリング リンクの作成、可用性の照会、および組織管理の実行など、包括的なイベント管理を実現します。","ko":"Composio의 툴킷을 사용하여 Calendly API와의 직접 통합을 구현하여 이벤트 목록 표시, 초대자 관리, 예약 링크 생성, 가용성 查询 및 조직 관리 등의 포괄적인 이벤트 관리를 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite la integración directa con la API de Calendly para una gestión de eventos integral, incluyendo la lista de eventos, la gestión de invitados, la creación de enlaces de programación, la consulta de disponibilidad y la administración de la organización a través de la herramienta de Composio.","fr":"Permet l''intégration directe avec l''API de Calendly pour une gestion d''événements complète, y compris la liste des événements, la gestion des invités, la création de liens de planification, l''interrogation de la disponibilité et l''administration de l''organisation via l''outil Composio.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Integration mit der Calendly-API für eine umfassende Ereignisverwaltung, einschließlich Ereignisauflistung, Verwaltung von Teilnehmern, Erstellung von Terminverknüpfungen, Abfrage von Verfügbarkeit und Organisation der Verwaltung über das Composio-Toolkit.","pt":"Permite integração direta com a API do Calendly para gerenciamento de eventos abrangente, incluindo listagem de eventos, gerenciamento de convidados, criação de links de agendamento, consulta de disponibilidade e realização de administração de organização por meio da toolkit do Composio.","ru":"Позволяет直接 интегрироваться с API Calendly для всестороннего управления событиями, включая перечисление событий, управление приглашенными, создание ссылок на планирование, запрос наличия и выполнение административных задач организации с помощью набора инструментов Composio.","ar":"يمكن التكامل المباشر مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات كالندي لإدارة الأحداث الشاملة، بما في ذلك قائمة الأحداث وإدارة المشاركين وإنشاء روابط جدولة واستفسار عن التوفر وتنفيذ إدارة المنظمة من خلال أدوات كومبوσιο."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating event creation and scheduling link generation","Managing invitee responses and event updates","Querying real-time availability across organizations","Administering Calendly organization settings and members"],"zh":["自动创建事件和生成排班链接","管理受邀者响应和事件更新","实时查询组织可用性","管理 Calendly 组织设置和成员"],"ja":["イベントの自動作成とスケジューリング リンクの生成","受邀者応答とイベント更新の管理","組織のリアルタイム可用性の照会","Calendly 組織設定とメンバーの管理"],"ko":["이벤트 자동 생성 및 예약 링크 생성","초대자 응답 및 이벤트 업데이트 관리","조직의 실시간 가용성 查询","Calendly 조직 설정 및 구성원 관리"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de eventos y generación de enlaces de programación","Gestión de respuestas de invitados y actualizaciones de eventos","Consulta de disponibilidad en tiempo real en varias organizaciones","Administración de la configuración de la organización de Calendly y sus miembros"],"fr":["Automation de la création d''événements et de la génération de liens de planification","Gestion des réponses des invités et des mises à jour d''événements","Interrogation de la disponibilité en temps réel à travers plusieurs organisations","Administration des paramètres d''organisation de Calendly et de ses membres"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Ereignissen und der Generierung von Terminverknüpfungen","Verwaltung von Teilnehmerantworten und Ereignisaktualisierungen","Abfrage von Echtzeitverfügbarkeit über mehrere Organisationen hinweg","Verwaltung der Calendly-Organisationseinstellungen und -mitglieder"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de eventos e geração de links de agendamento","Gerenciar respostas de convidados e atualizações de eventos","Consultar disponibilidade em tempo real em organizações","Administrar configurações e membros da organização do Calendly"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание событий и генерацию ссылок на планирование","Управлять ответами приглашенных и обновлениями событий","Запрашивать наличие в режиме реального времени в организациях","Администрировать настройки и членов организации Calendly"],"ar":["توفير自動 لإنشاء الأحداث وتوليد روابط الجدولة","إدارة استجابات المشاركين وتحديثات الأحداث","استفسار عن التوفر في الوقت الفعلي عبر المنظمات","إدارة إعدادات وأعضاء منظمة كالندي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection with RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Needs active Calendly connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Many operations require user''s Calendly organization URI"],"zh":["需要 Rube MCP 连接和 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","需要通过 RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS 的活跃 Calendly 连接","许多操作需要用户的 Calendly 组织 URI"],"ja":["Rube MCP 接続と RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS が必要","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS によるアクティブな Calendly 接続が必要","多くの操作ではユーザーの Calendly 組織 URI が必要"],"ko":["Rube MCP 연결 및 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS가 필요합니다.","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 통한 활성 Calendly 연결이 필요합니다.","많은 작업에는 사용자의 Calendly 조직 URI가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere conexión Rube MCP con RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Necesita conexión activa de Calendly a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Muchas operaciones requieren la URI de la organización de Calendly del usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP avec RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Nécessite une connexion active Calendly via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","De nombreuses opérations nécessitent l''URI de l''organisation Calendly de l''utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt Rube-MCP-Verbindung mit RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Benötigt aktive Calendly-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Viele Operationen erfordern die Calendly-Organisations-URI des Benutzers"],"pt":["Requer conexão Rube MCP com RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Necessita conexão ativa do Calendly via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Muitas operações requerem URI da organização do Calendly do usuário"],"ru":["Требует подключения Rube MCP с RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","Требует активного подключения к Calendly через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Многие операции требуют URI организации Calendly пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب الاتصال روبي إم سي بي مع أدوات البحث روبي","يحتاج إلى اتصال نشط من كالندي من خلال إدارة الاتصالات روبي","تتطلب العديد من العمليات معرف URI منظمة كالندي للمستخدم"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
