n"},"description":{"zh":"Freshservice 自动化集成使开发者能够自动化 IT 服务管理操作，提高效率","ja":"Freshservice オートメーションは開発者が IT サービス管理操作を自動化できるようにし、効率を向上","ko":"Freshservice 자동화는 개발자가 IT 서비스 관리 작업을 자동화할 수 있도록 해주어 효율을 높입니다","es":"La automatización de Freshservice con Rube MCP permite a los desarrolladores automatizar operaciones de gestión de servicios de IT de manera eficiente","fr":"L''automatisation de Freshservice avec Rube MCP permet aux développeurs d''automatiser les opérations de gestion de services de TI de manière efficace","de":"Die Automatisierung von Freshservice mit Rube MCP ermöglicht es Entwicklern, IT-Service-Management-Operationen effizient zu automatisieren","pt":"Automação de operações de gerenciamento de serviços de TI com o toolkit Freshservice via Rube MCP.","ru":"Автоматизация операций по управлению услугами ИТ с помощью инструмента Freshservice через Rube MCP.","ar":"تأتيير عمليات إدارة الخدمات التقنية باستخدام أداة Freshservice عبر Rube MCP.","en":"Drop-in skill pack that turns any AI coding agent into a full engineering team."},"definition":{"en":"Drop-in skill pack that turns any AI coding agent into a full engineering team."},"features":{"zh":["自动化 Freshservice IT 服务管理操作","通过 Rube MCP 实现集成","简化开发流程","提高效率","支持多种工具和服务","易于设置和使用"],"ja":["Freshservice IT サービス管理操作の自動化","Rube MCP を使用した統合","開発プロセスの簡素化","効率の向上","多種多様なツールとサービスをサポート","設定と使用が容易"],"ko":["Freshservice IT 서비스 관리 작업 자동화","Rube MCP를 사용한 통합","개발 프로세스 간소화","효율성 향상","다양한 도구와 서비스 지원","설정과 사용이 쉽습니다"],"es":["Conexión a Freshservice mediante Rube MCP","Automatización de operaciones de gestión de servicios de IT","Uso de la herramienta de Freshservice de Composio","Configuración de la conexión de Freshservice mediante RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Uso de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS para obtener esquemas de herramientas actuales"],"fr":["Connexion à Freshservice via Rube MCP","Automatisation des opérations de gestion de services de TI","Utilisation de l''outil Freshservice de Composio","Configuration de la connexion Freshservice via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Utilisation de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS pour obtenir les schémas d''outils actuels"],"de":["Verbindung zu Freshservice über Rube MCP","Automatisierung von IT-Service-Management-Operationen","Verwendung des Freshservice-Tools von Composio","Konfiguration der Freshservice-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS","Verwendung von RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS, um aktuelle Tool-Schemas zu erhalten"],"pt":["Automação de operações de gerenciamento de serviços de TI","Integração com o toolkit Freshservice","Uso de Rube MCP para automatizar tarefas","Sem necessidade de chaves de API","Configuração simples e rápida"],"ru":["Автоматизация операций по управлению услугами ИТ","Интеграция с инструментом Freshservice","Использование Rube MCP для автоматизации задач","Не требуется ключи API","Простая и быстрая настройка"],"ar":["تأتيير عمليات إدارة الخدمات التقنية","التكامل مع أداة Freshservice","استخدام Rube MCP لتأتيير المهام","لا حاجة لمفاتيح API","إعداد بسيط وسريع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Freshservice 自动化","Rube MCP","IT 服务管理","自动化解决方案","开发效率","集成工具","Freshservice 集成","自动化开发","IT 服务管理自动化"],"ja":["Freshservice オートメーション","Rube MCP","IT サービス管理","自動化ソリューション","開発効率","統合ツール","Freshservice 統合","自動化開発","IT サービス管理自動化"],"ko":["Freshservice 자동화","Rube MCP","IT 서비스 관리","자동화 솔루션","개발 효율","통합 도구","Freshservice 통합","자동화 개발","IT 서비스 관리 자동화"],"es":["automatización de Freshservice","Rube MCP","gestión de servicios de IT","Composio","Freshservice toolkit","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"fr":["automatisation de Freshservice","Rube MCP","gestion de services de TI","Composio","outil Freshservice","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"de":["Freshservice-Automatisierung","Rube MCP","IT-Service-Management","Composio","Freshservice-Tool","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"pt":["automação freshservice","gerenciamento de serviços de ti","rube mcp","ferramentas de automação","integração com freshservice","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["автоматизация freshservice","управление услугами ит","rube mcp","инструменты автоматизации","интеграция с freshservice","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تأتيير خدمة freshservice","إدارة الخدمات التقنية","rube mcp","أدوات التأتيير","التكامل مع freshservice","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"SamarthaKV29","repo":"antigravity-god-mode","repoPath":"SamarthaKV29/antigravity-god-mode","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"freshservice-automation","description":"Automate Freshservice ITSM tasks via Rube MCP (Composio): create/update tickets, bulk operations, service requests, and outbound emails. Always search tools first for current schemas.","bodyPreview":"# Freshservice Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Freshservice IT Service Management operations through Composio''s Freshservice toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Freshservice connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `freshservice`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys","body":"# Freshservice Automation via Rube MCP\n\nAutomate Freshservice IT Service Management operations through Composio''s Freshservice toolkit via Rube MCP.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Rube MCP must be connected (RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS available)\n- Active Freshservice connection via `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `freshservice`\n- Always call `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` first to get current tool schemas\n\n## Setup\n\n**Get Rube MCP**: Add `https://rube.app/mcp` as an MCP server in your client configuration. No API keys needed — just add the endpoint and it works.\n\n\n1. Verify Rube MCP is available by confirming `RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS` responds\n2. Call `RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS` with toolkit `freshservice`\n3. If connection is not ACTIVE, follow the returned auth link to complete Freshservice authentication\n4. Confirm connection status shows ACTIVE before running any workflows\n\n## Core Workflows\n\n### 1. List and Search Tickets\n\n**When to use**: User wants to find, list, or search for tickets\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS` - List tickets with optional filtering and pagination [Required]\n2. `FRESHSERVICE_GET_TICKET` - Get detailed information for a specific ticket [Optional]\n\n**Key parameters for listing**:\n- `filter`: Predefined filter (''all_tickets'', ''deleted'', ''spam'', ''watching'')\n- `updated_since`: ISO 8601 timestamp to get tickets updated after this time\n- `order_by`: Sort field (''created_at'', ''updated_at'', ''status'', ''priority'')\n- `order_type`: Sort direction (''asc'' or ''desc'')\n- `page`: Page number (1-indexed)\n- `per_page`: Results per page (1-100, default 30)\n- `include`: Additional fields (''requester'', ''stats'', ''description'', ''conversations'', ''assets'')\n\n**Key parameters for get**:\n- `ticket_id`: Unique ticket ID or display_id\n- `include`: Additional fields to include\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- By default, only tickets created within the past 30 days are returned\n- Use `updated_since` to retrieve older tickets\n- Each `include` value consumes additional API credits\n- `page` is 1-indexed; minimum value is 1\n- `per_page` max is 100; default is 30\n- Ticket IDs can be the internal ID or the display_id shown in the UI\n\n### 2. Create a Ticket\n\n**When to use**: User wants to log a new incident or request\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET` - Create a new ticket [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `subject`: Ticket subject line (required)\n- `description`: HTML description of the ticket (required)\n- `status`: Ticket status - 2 (Open), 3 (Pending), 4 (Resolved), 5 (Closed) (required)\n- `priority`: Ticket priority - 1 (Low), 2 (Medium), 3 (High), 4 (Urgent) (required)\n- `email`: Requester''s email address (provide either email or requester_id)\n- `requester_id`: User ID of the requester\n- `type`: Ticket type (''Incident'' or ''Service Request'')\n- `source`: Channel - 1 (Email), 2 (Portal), 3 (Phone), 4 (Chat), 5 (Twitter), 6 (Facebook)\n- `impact`: Impact level - 1 (Low), 2 (Medium), 3 (High)\n- `urgency`: Urgency level - 1 (Low), 2 (Medium), 3 (High), 4 (Critical)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `subject`, `description`, `status`, and `priority` are all required\n- Either `email` or `requester_id` must be provided to identify the requester\n- Status and priority use numeric codes, not string names\n- Description supports HTML formatting\n- If email does not match an existing contact, a new contact is created\n\n### 3. Bulk Update Tickets\n\n**When to use**: User wants to update multiple tickets at once\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS` - Find tickets to update [Prerequisite]\n2. `FRESHSERVICE_BULK_UPDATE_TICKETS` - Update multiple tickets [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `ids`: Array of ticket IDs to update (required)\n- `update_fields`: Dictionary of fields to update (required)\n  - Allowed keys: ''subject'', ''description'', ''status'', ''priority'', ''responder_id'', ''group_id'', ''type'', ''tags'', ''custom_fields''\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- Bulk update performs sequential updates internally; large batches may take time\n- All specified tickets receive the same field updates\n- If one ticket update fails, others may still succeed; check response for individual results\n- Cannot selectively update different fields per ticket in a single call\n- Custom fields must use their internal field names, not display names\n\n### 4. Create Ticket via Outbound Email\n\n**When to use**: User wants to create a ticket by sending an outbound email notification\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET_OUTBOUND_EMAIL` - Create ticket with email notification [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `email`: Requester''s email address (required)\n- `subject`: Email subject / ticket subject (required)\n- `description`: HTML email body content\n- `status`: Ticket status (2=Open, 3=Pending, 4=Resolved, 5=Closed)\n- `priority`: Ticket priority (1=Low, 2=Medium, 3=High, 4=Urgent)\n- `cc_emails`: Array of CC email addresses\n- `email_config_id`: Email configuration ID for the sender address\n- `name`: Requester name\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- This creates a standard ticket via the /api/v2/tickets endpoint while sending an email\n- If the email does not match an existing contact, a new contact is created with the provided name\n- `email_config_id` determines which email address the notification appears to come from\n\n### 5. Create Service Requests\n\n**When to use**: User wants to submit a service catalog request\n\n**Tool sequence**:\n1. `FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_SERVICE_REQUEST` - Create a service request for a catalog item [Required]\n\n**Key parameters**:\n- `item_display_id`: Display ID of the catalog item (required)\n- `email`: Requester''s email address\n- `quantity`: Number of items to request (default: 1)\n- `custom_fields`: Custom field values for the service item form\n- `parent_ticket_id`: Display ID of a parent ticket (for child requests)\n\n**Pitfalls**:\n- `item_display_id` can be found in Admin > Service Catalog > item URL (e.g., /service_catalog/items/1)\n- Custom fields keys must match the service item form field names\n- Quantity defaults to 1 if not specified\n- Service requests follow the approval workflow defined for the catalog item\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Status Code Reference\n\n| Code | Status |\n|------|--------|\n| 2 | Open |\n| 3 | Pending |\n| 4 | Resolved |\n| 5 | Closed |\n\n### Priority Code Reference\n\n| Code | Priority |\n|------|----------|\n| 1 | Low |\n| 2 | Medium |\n| 3 | High |\n| 4 | Urgent |\n\n### Pagination\n\n- Use `page` (1-indexed) and `per_page` (max 100) parameters\n- Increment `page` by 1 each request\n- Continue until returned results count < `per_page`\n- Default page size is 30\n\n### Finding Tickets by Date Range\n\n```\n1. Call FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS with updated_since=''2024-01-01T00:00:00Z''\n2. Optionally add order_by=''updated_at'' and order_type=''desc''\n3. Paginate through results\n```\n\n## Known Pitfalls\n\n**Numeric Codes**:\n- Status and priority use numeric values, not strings\n- Source channel uses numeric codes (1-6)\n- Impact and urgency use numeric codes (1-3 or 1-4)\n\n**Date Filtering**:\n- Default returns only tickets from the last 30 days\n- Use `updated_since` parameter for older tickets\n- Date format is ISO 8601 (e.g., ''2024-01-01T00:00:00Z'')\n\n**Rate Limits**:\n- Freshservice API has per-account rate limits\n- Each `include` option consumes additional API credits\n- Implement backoff on 429 responses\n\n**Response Parsing**:\n- Response data may be nested under `data` or `data.data`\n- Parse defensively with fallback patterns\n- Ticket IDs are numeric integers\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Tool Slug | Key Params |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| List tickets | FRESHSERVICE_LIST_TICKETS | filter, updated_since, page, per_page |\n| Get ticket | FRESHSERVICE_GET_TICKET | ticket_id, include |\n| Create ticket | FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET | subject, description, status, priority, email |\n| Bulk update | FRESHSERVICE_BULK_UPDATE_TICKETS | ids, update_fields |\n| Outbound email ticket | FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_TICKET_OUTBOUND_EMAIL | email, subject, description |\n| Service request | FRESHSERVICE_CREATE_SERVICE_REQUEST | item_display_id, email, quantity |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:09:47.168Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for IT Service Management Agents requiring automation of Freshservice operations via Rube MCP","zh":"适用于需要通过Rube MCP自动化Freshservice操作的IT服务管理代理","ja":"Rube MCPを介してFreshservice操作の自動化を必要とするITサービス管理エージェントに最適","ko":"Rube MCP를 통해 Freshservice 작업을 자동화해야 하는 IT 서비스 관리 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de gestión de servicios de TI que requieren la automatización de operaciones de Freshservice a través de Rube MCP","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion de services informatiques nécessitant l''automatisation des opérations Freshservice via Rube MCP","de":"Ideal für IT-Service-Management-Agents, die eine Automatisierung von Freshservice-Operationen über Rube MCP benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Serviços de TI que exigem automação de operações do Freshservice via Rube MCP","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению сервисами ИТ, требующих автоматизации операций Freshservice через Rube MCP","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة الخدمات التكنولوجية المعلوماتية التي تتطلب آليّة تشغيل عمليات Freshservice من خلال Rube MCP"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Freshservice IT Service Management operations through Composio''s Freshservice toolkit, utilizing Rube MCP for streamlined connections and management, and enabling features like automated tool schema retrieval via RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","zh":"通过Composio的Freshservice工具包，利用Rube MCP实现流线化的连接和管理，并支持通过RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS实现工具架构的自动检索，从而使得代理能够自动化Freshservice IT服务管理操作","ja":"ComposioのFreshserviceツールキットを使用して、Rube MCPを介したストリームライン化された接続と管理を実現し、RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSを使用してツールスキーマの自動取得などの機能を可能にし、エージェントがFreshservice ITサービス管理操作の自動化を実現できるようにする","ko":"Composio의 Freshservice 툴킷을 사용하여 Rube MCP를 통해 스트리밍된 연결 및 관리를 구현하고, RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS를 사용하여 도구 스키마 자동 수신 등의 기능을 가능하게 하여 에이전트가 Freshservice IT 서비스 관리 작업을 자동화할 수 있도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las operaciones de gestión de servicios de TI de Freshservice a través de la herramienta de Freshservice de Composio, utilizando Rube MCP para conexiones y gestión optimizadas, y habilitando características como la recuperación automática de esquemas de herramientas a través de RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les opérations de gestion de services informatiques Freshservice via la boîte à outils Freshservice de Composio, en utilisant Rube MCP pour des connexions et une gestion optimisées, et en activant des fonctionnalités comme la récupération automatique de schémas d''outils via RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Freshservice-IT-Service-Management-Operationen über das Composio-Freshservice-Toolkit zu automatisieren, indem Rube MCP für optimierte Verbindungen und Verwaltung verwendet wird und Funktionen wie die automatische Schemaabfrage von Tools über RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS aktiviert","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar as operações de Gerenciamento de Serviços de TI do Freshservice por meio da caixa de ferramentas do Freshservice da Composio, utilizando o Rube MCP para conexões e gerenciamento otimizados, e habilitando recursos como a recuperação automática do esquema de ferramentas via RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать операции по управлению сервисами ИТ Freshservice с помощью инструмента Freshservice от Composio, используя Rube MCP для оптимизированных соединений и управления, и предоставляя функции, такие как автоматическое получение схемы инструмента через RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من آليّة عمليات إدارة الخدمات التكنولوجية المعلوماتية من Freshservice بواسطة أدوات Freshservice من Composio، واستخدام Rube MCP لتحقيق الاتصالات والإدارة المُتطورة، وتمكين الميزات مثل استرجاع مخططات الأدوات آليّاً عبر RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Freshservice ticket management","Streamlining IT service desk operations via Rube MCP","Integrating Freshservice with other tools using RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"zh":["自动化Freshservice工单管理","通过Rube MCP优化IT服务台操作","使用RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS将Freshservice与其他工具集成"],"ja":["Freshserviceチケット管理の自動化","Rube MCPを介したITサービスデスク操作のストリームライン化","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを使用したFreshserviceと他のツールの統合"],"ko":["Freshservice 티켓 관리 자동화","Rube MCP를 통해 IT 서비스 데스크 작동을 최적화","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 사용하여 Freshservice와 다른 도구를 통합"],"es":["Automatización de la gestión de tickets de Freshservice","Optimización de las operaciones de escritorio de servicio de TI a través de Rube MCP","Integración de Freshservice con otras herramientas utilizando RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"fr":["Automatisation de la gestion des tickets Freshservice","Optimisation des opérations de bureau de service informatique via Rube MCP","Intégration de Freshservice avec d''autres outils en utilisant RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"de":["Automatisierung der Freshservice-Ticketverwaltung","Optimierung der IT-Service-Desk-Operationen über Rube MCP","Integration von Freshservice mit anderen Tools unter Verwendung von RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"pt":["Automatizar o gerenciamento de tickets do Freshservice","Otimizar as operações da mesa de serviço de TI via Rube MCP","Integrar o Freshservice com outras ferramentas usando RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ru":["Автоматизация управления тикетами Freshservice","Оптимизация операций сервисной стойки ИТ через Rube MCP","Интеграция Freshservice с другими инструментами с помощью RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"],"ar":["آليّة إدارة التذاكر في Freshservice","تطوير عمليات مكتب الخدمات التكنولوجية المعلوماتية عبر Rube MCP","دمج Freshservice مع أدوات أخرى باستخدام RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rube MCP connection","Active Freshservice connection via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessary","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS must be called first to retrieve current tool schemas"],"zh":["需要Rube MCP连接","需要通过RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS的活跃Freshservice连接","必须首先调用RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS来检索当前工具架构"],"ja":["Rube MCP接続の必要性","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONSを介したアクティブなFreshservice接続の必要性","現在のツールスキーマの取得にはRUBE_SEARCH_TOOLSの呼び出しが必要"],"ko":["Rube MCP 연결이 필요","RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS를 통해 활성화된 Freshservice 연결이 필요","현재 도구 스키마를 수신하려면 RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS를 먼저 호출해야 함"],"es":["Requiere conexión de Rube MCP","Conexión activa de Freshservice a través de RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necesaria","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS debe llamarse primero para recuperar los esquemas de herramientas actuales"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion Rube MCP","Connexion active Freshservice via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS nécessaire","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS doit être appelé en premier pour récupérer les schémas d''outils actuels"],"de":["Benötigt Rube-MCP-Verbindung","Aktive Freshservice-Verbindung über RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS erforderlich","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS muss zuerst aufgerufen werden, um die aktuellen Toolschemata abzurufen"],"pt":["Exige conexão com o Rube MCP","Conexão ativa com o Freshservice via RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS necessária","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS deve ser chamado primeiro para recuperar os esquemas de ferramentas atuais"],"ru":["Требует подключения к Rube MCP","Активное подключение к Freshservice через RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS необходимо","RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS должен быть вызван первым для получения текущих схем инструментов"],"ar":["يتطلب الاتصال ب Rube MCP","الاتصال النشط ب Freshservice عبر RUBE_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS ضروري","يجب استدعاء RUBE_SEARCH_TOOLS أولاً لاسترجاع مخططات الأدوات الحالية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('YPYT1/All-skills/tdd-workflows-tdd-red', 'community', 'YPYT1', 'All-skills', 'YPYT1/All-skills', 'tdd-workflows-tdd-red', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z', '2026-02-18T04:09:40.906Z', NULL, '{"id":"YPYT1/All-skills/tdd-workflows-tdd-red","name":"tdd-workflows-tdd-red","description":{"zh":"TDD 工作流中的红色阶段生成失败测试，确保代码行为的预期结果","ja":"TDD ワークフローのレッドフェーズで失敗テストを生成し、コードの動作の期待結果を確保する","ko":"TDD 워크플로우의 레드 단계에서 실패 테스트를 생성하여 코드 동작의 예상 결과를 보장합니다","es":"Esta habilidad de agente de pruebas automatizadas sigue los principios de la fase roja de TDD para generar pruebas exhaustivas que capturan el comportamiento esperado. Ideal para desarrolladores que buscan mejorar sus habilidades de prueba y desarrollo","fr":"Cette compétence d''agent de test automatisé suit les principes de la phase rouge de TDD pour générer des tests exhaustifs qui capturent le comportement attendu. Idéal pour les développeurs qui cherchent à améliorer leurs compétences de test et de développement","de":"Diese Testagentenfähigkeit folgt den Grundsätzen der roten Phase von TDD, um umfassende Tests zu erstellen, die das erwartete Verhalten erfassen. Ideal für Entwickler, die ihre Test- und Entwicklungsfähigkeiten verbessern möchten","pt":"O skill tdd-workflows-tdd-red é uma ferramenta para escrever testes de falha abrangentes seguindo os princípios da fase vermelha do TDD.","ru":"Навык tdd-workflows-tdd-red - это инструмент для написания комплексных тестов на отказ, следующий принципам красного этапа TDD.","ar":"المهارة tdd-workflows-tdd-red هي أداة لكتابة الاختبارات الشاملة للفشل ตาม مبادئ الطور الأحمر من TDD.","en":"集合了所有的openclaw,claudecode,open等各个平台所有的skills"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"TDD 工作流 - 生成失败测试","ja":"TDD ワークフロー - 失敗テストの生成","ko":"TDD 워크플로우 - 실패 테스트 생성","es":"Flujos de trabajo TDD: red de pruebas automatizadas","fr":"Workflows TDD: réseaux de tes