ción de secciones exactas de documentos","Guías actualizadas para desarrolladores","Herramientas de MCP para desarrolladores","Acceso a la documentación oficial de OpenAI"],"fr":["Recherche de documents OpenAI avec MCP","Récupération de sections exactes de documents","Guides à jour pour les développeurs","Outils MCP pour les développeurs","Accès à la documentation officielle d''OpenAI"],"de":["Dokumentensuche von OpenAI mit MCP","Abruf exakter Abschnitte von Dokumenten","Aktuelle Anleitungen für Entwickler","MCP-Tools für Entwickler","Zugriff auf die offizielle OpenAI-Dokumentation"],"pt":["Acesso a documentos oficiais do OpenAI","Ferramentas MCP para desenvolvedores","Orientações atualizadas sobre como usar as ferramentas MCP","Pesquisa de documentos relevantes com `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs`","Recuperação de seções exatas de documentos com `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`"],"ru":["Доступ к официальным документам OpenAI","Инструменты MCP для разработчиков","Актуальные рекомендации по использованию инструментов MCP","Поиск релевантных документов с помощью `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs`","Получение точных разделов документов с помощью `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`"],"ar":["الوصول إلى الوثائق الرسمية لمطور OpenAI","أدوات MCP للمطورين","إرشادات محدثة حول كيفية استخدام أدوات MCP","البحث عن وثائق ذات صلة باستخدام `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs`","استرجاع أقسام دقيقة من الوثائق باستخدام `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OpenAI 文档搜索","MCP 服务器","开发者文档","快速搜索","文档检索","OpenAI 开发"],"ja":["OpenAI ドキュメント検索","MCP サーバー","開発者ドキュメント","迅速検索","ドキュメント検索","OpenAI 開発"],"ko":["OpenAI 문서 검색","MCP 서버","개발자 문서","빠른 검색","문서 검색","OpenAI 개발"],"es":["documentación de OpenAI","desarrolladores OpenAI","herramientas de MCP","búsqueda de documentos","guías para desarrolladores","OpenAI para desarrolladores"],"fr":["documentation d''OpenAI","développeurs OpenAI","outils MCP","recherche de documents","guides pour les développeurs","OpenAI pour les développeurs"],"de":["OpenAI-Dokumentation","Entwickler OpenAI","MCP-Tools","Dokumentensuche","Anleitungen für Entwickler","OpenAI für Entwickler"],"pt":["OpenAI","Documentos do desenvolvedor","Ferramentas MCP","Desenvolvedores","Inteligência artificial","Aprendizado de máquina","Desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["OpenAI","Документы разработчика","Инструменты MCP","Разработчики","Искусственный интеллект","Машинное обучение","Разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["OpenAI","وثائق المطور","أدوات MCP","المطورين","الذكاء الاصطناعي","تعلم الآلة","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openai-docs","description":"Use when the user asks how to build with OpenAI products or APIs and needs up-to-date official documentation with citations (for example: Codex, Responses API, Chat Completions, Apps SDK, Agents SDK, Realtime, model capabilities or limits); prioritize OpenAI docs MCP tools and restrict any fallback browsing to official OpenAI domains.","bodyPreview":"# OpenAI Docs\n\nProvide authoritative, current guidance from OpenAI developer docs using the developers.openai.com MCP server. Always prioritize the developer docs MCP tools over web.run for OpenAI-related questions. Only if the MCP server is installed and returns no meaningful results should you fall back to web search.\n\n## Quick start\n\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` to find the most relevant doc pages.\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` to pull exact sectio","body":"# OpenAI Docs\n\nProvide authoritative, current guidance from OpenAI developer docs using the developers.openai.com MCP server. Always prioritize the developer docs MCP tools over web.run for OpenAI-related questions. Only if the MCP server is installed and returns no meaningful results should you fall back to web search.\n\n## Quick start\n\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` to find the most relevant doc pages.\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` to pull exact sections and quote/paraphrase accurately.\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__list_openai_docs` only when you need to browse or discover pages without a clear query.\n\n## OpenAI product snapshots\n\n1. Apps SDK: Build ChatGPT apps by providing a web component UI and an MCP server that exposes your app''s tools to ChatGPT.\n2. Responses API: A unified endpoint designed for stateful, multimodal, tool-using interactions in agentic workflows.\n3. Chat Completions API: Generate a model response from a list of messages comprising a conversation.\n4. Codex: OpenAI''s coding agent for software development that can write, understand, review, and debug code.\n5. gpt-oss: Open-weight OpenAI reasoning models (gpt-oss-120b and gpt-oss-20b) released under the Apache 2.0 license.\n6. Realtime API: Build low-latency, multimodal experiences including natural speech-to-speech conversations.\n7. Agents SDK: A toolkit for building agentic apps where a model can use tools and context, hand off to other agents, stream partial results, and keep a full trace.\n\n## If MCP server is missing\n\nIf MCP tools fail or no OpenAI docs resources are available:\n\n1. Run the install command yourself: `codex mcp add openaiDeveloperDocs --url https://developers.openai.com/mcp`\n2. If it fails due to permissions/sandboxing, immediately retry the same command with escalated permissions and include a 1-sentence justification for approval. Do not ask the user to run it yet.\n3. Only if the escalated attempt fails, ask the user to run the install command.\n4. Ask the user to restart Codex.\n5. Re-run the doc search/fetch after restart.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Clarify the product scope (Codex, OpenAI API, or ChatGPT Apps SDK) and the task.\n2. Search docs with a precise query.\n3. Fetch the best page and the specific section needed (use `anchor` when possible).\n4. Answer with concise guidance and cite the doc source.\n5. Provide code snippets only when the docs support them.\n\n## Quality rules\n\n- Treat OpenAI docs as the source of truth; avoid speculation.\n- Keep quotes short and within policy limits; prefer paraphrase with citations.\n- If multiple pages differ, call out the difference and cite both.\n- If docs do not cover the user’s need, say so and offer next steps.\n\n## Tooling notes\n\n- Always use MCP doc tools before any web search for OpenAI-related questions.\n- If the MCP server is installed but returns no meaningful results, then use web search as a fallback.\n- When falling back to web search, restrict to official OpenAI domains (developers.openai.com, platform.openai.com) and cite sources.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:10:26.679Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing authoritative OpenAI developer documentation and guidance","zh":"非常适合需要权威OpenAI开发者文档和指导的AI智能体","ja":"OpenAI開発者向けドキュメントとガイダンスを必要とするAIエージェントに最適","ko":"권위 있는 OpenAI 개발자 문서와 지침이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 완벽함","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA que necesitan documentación y orientación autorizada para desarrolladores de OpenAI","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA ayant besoin d''une documentation et de conseils officiels pour les développeurs OpenAI","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agenten, die autoritative OpenAI-Entwicklerdokumentation und -anleitungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de documentação e orientação autorizativa de desenvolvedores da OpenAI","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, которым необходима авторитетная документация и руководство разработчиков OpenAI","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى توثيق وتوجيه مطورين OpenAI موثوق به"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch exact sections from OpenAI developer docs using the MCP server, providing current guidance and prioritizing developer docs MCP tools over web search for OpenAI-related questions, utilizing tools like `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` and `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`","zh":"使智能体能够通过MCP服务器从OpenAI开发者文档中获取确切章节，提供最新指导，并在处理OpenAI相关问题时优先使用开发者文档MCP工具而非网络搜索，利用诸如`mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs`和`mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`等工具","ja":"MCPサーバーを使用してOpenAI開発者ドキュメントから正確なセクションを取得する機能をエージェントに提供し、最新のガイダンスを提供。OpenAI関連の質問に対してはウェブ検索よりも開発者ドキュメントMCPツールを優先し、`mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs`や`mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`などのツールを利用","ko":"MCP 서버를 사용하여 OpenAI 개발자 문서에서 정확한 섹션을 가져오는 기능으로 에이전트를 강화하며, 최신 지침을 제공하고 OpenAI 관련 질문에 대해 웹 검색보다 개발자 문서 MCP 도구를 우선시함. `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` 및 `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`과 같은 도구 활용","es":"Permite a los agentes recuperar secciones exactas de la documentación para desarrolladores de OpenAI utilizando el servidor MCP, proporcionando orientación actualizada y priorizando las herramientas MCP de documentación para desarrolladores sobre la búsqueda web para preguntas relacionadas con OpenAI, utilizando herramientas como `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` y `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`","fr":"Permet aux agents de récupérer des sections précises de la documentation pour développeurs OpenAI en utilisant le serveur MCP, fournissant des conseils à jour et priorisant les outils MCP de documentation pour développeurs par rapport à la recherche web pour les questions liées à OpenAI, en utilisant des outils tels que `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` et `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, mithilfe des MCP-Servers exakte Abschnitte aus der OpenAI-Entwicklerdokumentation abzurufen, liefert aktuelle Anleitungen und priorisiert MCP-Tools für Entwicklerdokumentation gegenüber Websuchen für OpenAI-bezogene Fragen unter Verwendung von Tools wie `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` und `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`","pt":"Habilita os agentes a buscar seções exatas da documentação de desenvolvedores da OpenAI usando o servidor MCP, fornecendo orientação atual e priorizando as ferramentas de documentação de desenvolvedores do MCP sobre a pesquisa na web para perguntas relacionadas à OpenAI, utilizando ferramentas como `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` e `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность извлекать точные разделы из документации разработчиков OpenAI с помощью сервера MCP, обеспечивая актуальное руководство и отдавая приоритет инструментам документации разработчиков MCP над поиском в Интернете для вопросов, связанных с OpenAI, используя инструменты như `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` и `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من استرجاع أقسام محددة من وثائق مطورين OpenAI باستخدام خادم MCP، وتقديم إرشادات حالية وتجاوز أدوات وثائق مطورين MCP على نتائج البحث على الويب للأسئلة المتعلقة ب OpenAI، باستخدام أدوات مثل `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` و `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`"},"useCases":{"en":["Searching OpenAI developer documentation for specific topics","Fetching exact sections from OpenAI docs for precise guidance","Providing authoritative answers to OpenAI-related questions by leveraging the MCP server"],"zh":["搜索OpenAI开发者文档中的特定主题","从OpenAI文档中获取确切章节以提供精确指导","利用MCP服务器为OpenAI相关问题提供权威答案"],"ja":["特定のトピックについてOpenAI開発者ドキュメントを検索","正確なガイダンスのためにOpenAIドキュメントから正確なセクションを取得","MCPサーバーを活用してOpenAI関連の質問に権威ある回答を提供"],"ko":["특정 주제에 대한 OpenAI 개발자 문서 검색","정확한 지침을 위해 OpenAI 문서에서 정확한 섹션 가져오기","MCP 서버를 활용하여 OpenAI 관련 질문에 대한 권위 있는 답변 제공"],"es":["Buscar en la documentación para desarrolladores de OpenAI temas específicos","Recuperar secciones exactas de la documentación de OpenAI para una orientación precisa","Proporcionar respuestas autorizadas a preguntas relacionadas con OpenAI mediante el uso del servidor MCP"],"fr":["Recherche dans la documentation pour développeurs OpenAI sur des sujets spécifiques","Récupération de sections précises de la documentation OpenAI pour des conseils exacts","Fourniture de réponses officielles aux questions liées à OpenAI en exploitant le serveur MCP"],"de":["Durchsuchen der OpenAI-Entwicklerdokumentation nach spezifischen Themen","Abrufen exakter Abschnitte aus der OpenAI-Dokumentation für präzise Anleitungen","Bereitstellung autoritativer Antworten auf OpenAI-bezogene Fragen durch Nutzung des MCP-Servers"],"pt":["Pesquisar documentação de desenvolvedores da OpenAI por tópicos específicos","Buscar seções exatas da documentação da OpenAI para orientação precisa","Fornecer respostas autorizativas para perguntas relacionadas à OpenAI, aproveitando o servidor MCP"],"ru":["Поиск документации разработчиков OpenAI по конкретным темам","Извлечение точных разделов из документации OpenAI для точного руководства","Предоставление авторитетных ответов на вопросы, связанные с OpenAI, используя сервер MCP"],"ar":["البحث في وثائق مطورين OpenAI لمواضيع محددة","استرجاع أقسام محددة من وثائق OpenAI لإرشادات دقيقة","تقديم إجابات موثوقة للأسئلة المتعلقة ب OpenAI، مستفيداً من خادم MCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires MCP server installation","Dependent on developer docs MCP tools for optimal functionality","Falls back to web search if MCP server returns no meaningful results"],"zh":["需要安装MCP服务器","依赖开发者文档MCP工具以实现最佳功能","如果MCP服务器未返回有意义的结果，则回退到网络搜索"],"ja":["MCPサーバーのインストールが必要","最適な機能性のために開発者ドキュメントMCPツールに依存","MCPサーバーが意味のある結果を返さない場合はウェブ検索にフォールバック"],"ko":["MCP 서버 설치 필요","최적의 기능성을 위해 개발자 문서 MCP 도구에 의존","MCP 서버가 의미 있는 결과를 반환하지 않으면 웹 검색으로 대체됨"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de un servidor MCP","Depende de las herramientas MCP de documentación para desarrolladores para un funcionamiento óptimo","Recurre a la búsqueda web si el servidor MCP no devuelve resultados significativos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation d''un serveur MCP","Dépend des outils MCP de documentation pour développeurs pour une fonctionnalité optimale","Retombe sur la recherche web si le serveur MCP ne renvoie aucun résultat significatif"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation eines MCP-Servers","Ist für optimale Funktionalität von MCP-Tools für Entwicklerdokumentation abhängig","Greift auf Websuche zurück, wenn der MCP-Server keine aussagekräftigen Ergebnisse liefert"],"pt":["Requer instalação do servidor MCP","Dependente das ferramentas de documentação de desenvolvedores do MCP para funcionalidade ótima","Volta à pesquisa na web se o servidor MCP não retornar resultados significativos"],"ru":["Требует установки сервера MCP","Зависит от инструментов документации разработчиков MCP для оптимальной функциональности","Переходит к поиску в Интернете, если сервер MCP не возвращает осмысленные результаты"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت خادم MCP","يعتمد على أدوات وثائق مطورين MCP للوظائف المثلى","يعود إلى نتائج البحث على الويب إذا لم يُرجع خادم MCP نتائج ذات معنى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
