mentation OpenAI","Accès à la documentation officielle d''OpenAI","Outils de développement pour intégrer l''IA","Guide de démarrage rapide pour les développeurs","Prise en charge de plusieurs langages de programmation"],"de":["Suche nach OpenAI-Dokumentation","Zugriff auf die offizielle OpenAI-Dokumentation","Entwicklungstools zur Integration von KI","Schnellstartanleitung für Entwickler","Unterstützung für mehrere Programmiersprachen"],"pt":["Acesso à documentação oficial do OpenAI","Criação de agentes de IA de produção em Go","Uso do framework PipeOps","Busca e recuperação de documentos relevantes","Priorização das ferramentas MCP sobre a busca na web"],"ru":["Доступ к официальной документации OpenAI","Создание агентов ИИ в производстве на Go","Использование фреймворка PipeOps","Поиск и извлечение релевантных документов","Приоритет инструментов MCP над веб-поиском"],"ar":["الدخول إلى وثائق OpenAI الرسمية","بناء وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي في الإنتاج باستخدام Go","استخدام إطار PipeOps","البحث واسترجاع الوثائق ذات الصلة","الأولوية للأدوات MCP على البحث على الويب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OpenAI 文档搜索","开发者指南","MCP 服务器","web 搜索","开发效率","OpenAI 开发者文档"],"ja":["OpenAI ドキュメント検索","デベロッパーガイド","MCP サーバー","Web 検索","開発効率","OpenAI デベロッパー ドキュメント"],"ko":["OpenAI 문서 검색","개발자 가이드","MCP 서버","웹 검색","개발 효율성","OpenAI 개발자 문서"],"es":["documentación de OpenAI","desarrollo de IA","integración de inteligencia artificial","herramientas de desarrollo","guía de inicio rápido","OpenAI para desarrolladores"],"fr":["documentation OpenAI","développement d''IA","intégration d''intelligence artificielle","outils de développement","guide de démarrage rapide","OpenAI pour les développeurs"],"de":["OpenAI-Dokumentation","KI-Entwicklung","Integration von künstlicher Intelligenz","Entwicklungstools","Schnellstartanleitung","OpenAI für Entwickler"],"pt":["OpenAI","documentação oficial","desenvolvedores","agentes de IA","produção","Go","PipeOps","ferramentas MCP"],"ru":["OpenAI","официальная документация","разработчики","агенты ИИ","производство","Go","PipeOps","инструменты MCP"],"ar":["OpenAI","وثائق رسمية","مطورين","وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي","الإنتاج","Go","PipeOps","أدوات MCP"]}},"owner":"PipeOpsHQ","repo":"agent-sdk-go","repoPath":"PipeOpsHQ/agent-sdk-go","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openai-docs","description":"Use when the user asks how to build with OpenAI products or APIs and needs up-to-date official documentation with citations (for example: Codex, Responses API, Chat Completions, Apps SDK, Agents SDK, Realtime, model capabilities or limits); prioritize OpenAI docs MCP tools and restrict any fallback browsing to official OpenAI domains.","bodyPreview":"# OpenAI Docs\n\nProvide authoritative, current guidance from OpenAI developer docs using the developers.openai.com MCP server. Always prioritize the developer docs MCP tools over web.run for OpenAI-related questions. Only if the MCP server is installed and returns no meaningful results should you fall back to web search.\n\n## Quick start\n\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` to find the most relevant doc pages.\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` to pull exact sectio","body":"# OpenAI Docs\n\nProvide authoritative, current guidance from OpenAI developer docs using the developers.openai.com MCP server. Always prioritize the developer docs MCP tools over web.run for OpenAI-related questions. Only if the MCP server is installed and returns no meaningful results should you fall back to web search.\n\n## Quick start\n\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` to find the most relevant doc pages.\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` to pull exact sections and quote/paraphrase accurately.\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__list_openai_docs` only when you need to browse or discover pages without a clear query.\n\n## OpenAI product snapshots\n\n1. Apps SDK: Build ChatGPT apps by providing a web component UI and an MCP server that exposes your app''s tools to ChatGPT.\n2. Responses API: A unified endpoint designed for stateful, multimodal, tool-using interactions in agentic workflows.\n3. Chat Completions API: Generate a model response from a list of messages comprising a conversation.\n4. Codex: OpenAI''s coding agent for software development that can write, understand, review, and debug code.\n5. gpt-oss: Open-weight OpenAI reasoning models (gpt-oss-120b and gpt-oss-20b) released under the Apache 2.0 license.\n6. Realtime API: Build low-latency, multimodal experiences including natural speech-to-speech conversations.\n7. Agents SDK: A toolkit for building agentic apps where a model can use tools and context, hand off to other agents, stream partial results, and keep a full trace.\n\n## If MCP server is missing\n\nIf MCP tools fail or no OpenAI docs resources are available:\n\n1. Run the install command yourself: `codex mcp add openaiDeveloperDocs --url https://developers.openai.com/mcp`\n2. If it fails due to permissions/sandboxing, immediately retry the same command with escalated permissions and include a 1-sentence justification for approval. Do not ask the user to run it yet.\n3. Only if the escalated attempt fails, ask the user to run the install command.\n4. Ask the user to restart Codex.\n5. Re-run the doc search/fetch after restart.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Clarify the product scope (Codex, OpenAI API, or ChatGPT Apps SDK) and the task.\n2. Search docs with a precise query.\n3. Fetch the best page and the specific section needed (use `anchor` when possible).\n4. Answer with concise guidance and cite the doc source.\n5. Provide code snippets only when the docs support them.\n\n## Quality rules\n\n- Treat OpenAI docs as the source of truth; avoid speculation.\n- Keep quotes short and within policy limits; prefer paraphrase with citations.\n- If multiple pages differ, call out the difference and cite both.\n- If docs do not cover the user’s need, say so and offer next steps.\n\n## Tooling notes\n\n- Always use MCP doc tools before any web search for OpenAI-related questions.\n- If the MCP server is installed but returns no meaningful results, then use web search as a fallback.\n- When falling back to web search, restrict to official OpenAI domains (developers.openai.com, platform.openai.com) and cite sources.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:10:40.619Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents requiring direct access to authoritative OpenAI documentation and developer tools","zh":"非常适合需要直接访问权威OpenAI文档和开发者工具的AI智能体","ja":"権威あるOpenAIのドキュメントと開発者ツールへの直接アクセスを必要とするAIエージェントに最適です","ko":"권위 있는 OpenAI 문서 및 개발자 도구에 대한 직접 액세스가 필요한 AI 에이전트에 완벽합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que requieren acceso directo a la documentación autorizada de OpenAI y herramientas de desarrollador","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant un accès direct à la documentation officielle d''OpenAI et aux outils de développement","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die direkten Zugriff auf autorisierte OpenAI-Dokumentation und Entwickler-Tools benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que requerem acesso direto à documentação autoritativa da OpenAI e às ferramentas de desenvolvedor","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, требующих прямого доступа к авторитетной документации OpenAI и инструментам разработчика","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى الوصول المباشر إلى توثيق OpenAI الحصري وأدوات المطور"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch exact sections of OpenAI documentation using the MCP server, prioritizing developer docs over web searches, and leveraging tools like `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` and `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` for precise information retrieval","zh":"使智能体能够使用MCP服务器获取OpenAI文档的确切章节，优先使用开发者文档而非网络搜索，并利用`mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs`和`mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`等工具进行精确的信息检索","ja":"MCPサーバーを使用してOpenAIドキュメントの正確なセクションを取得する機能をエージェントに提供し、Web検索よりも開発者向けドキュメントを優先し、`mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs`や`mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`などのツールを活用して正確な情報検索を実現します","ko":"MCP 서버를 사용하여 OpenAI 문서의 정확한 섹션을 가져오는 기능을 에이전트에 부여하며, 웹 검색보다 개발자 문서를 우선시하고, `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` 및 `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc`과 같은 도구를 활용하여 정확한 정보 검색을 가능하게 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a buscar secciones exactas de la documentación de OpenAI utilizando el servidor MCP, priorizando la documentación de desarrolladores sobre búsquedas web, y aprovechando herramientas como `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` y `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` para la recuperación precisa de información","fr":"Permet aux agents de rechercher des sections exactes de la documentation d''OpenAI en utilisant le serveur MCP, en donnant la priorité à la documentation des développeurs par rapport aux recherches web, et en exploitant des outils tels que `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` et `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` pour un retrait d''informations précis","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, exakte Abschnitte der OpenAI-Dokumentation mithilfe des MCP-Servers abzurufen, Entwicklerdokumentationen bei der Suche vor Web-Suchen zu priorisieren und Werkzeuge wie `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` und `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` für präzise Informationsabruf zu nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a buscar seções exatas da documentação da OpenAI usando o servidor MCP, priorizando a documentação do desenvolvedor sobre as pesquisas na web, e utilizando ferramentas como `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` e `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` para recuperação precisa de informações","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать точные разделы документации OpenAI с помощью сервера MCP, отдаючи приоритет документации разработчика над веб-поиском, и используя такие инструменты, как `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` и `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` для точного извлечения информации","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استخراج أقسام دقيقة من توثيق OpenAI باستخدام خادم MCP، وأعطاء الأولوية لتوثيق المطور على عمليات البحث على الويب، واستخدام أدوات مثل `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` و `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` لاسترجاع المعلومات بدقة"},"useCases":{"en":["Searching OpenAI developer documentation for specific API guidance","Fetching exact sections of documentation for integration into agent responses","Debugging OpenAI-related issues by consulting the most current developer documentation"],"zh":["搜索OpenAI开发者文档以获取特定的API指南","获取文档的确切章节以集成到智能体响应中","通过查阅最新的开发者文档来调试与OpenAI相关的问题"],"ja":["特定のAPIガイダンスのためにOpenAI開発者向けドキュメントを検索する","エージェントの応答に統合するためにドキュメントの正確なセクションを取得する","最新の開発者向けドキュメントを参照してOpenAI関連の問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["특정 API 지침을 위해 OpenAI 개발자 문서 검색","에이전트 응답에 통합하기 위해 문서의 정확한 섹션 가져오기","가장 최신의 개발자 문서를 참조하여 OpenAI 관련 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Buscar documentación de desarrollador de OpenAI para orientación de API específica","Recuperar secciones exactas de la documentación para integrarlas en las respuestas del agente","Depurar problemas relacionados con OpenAI consultando la documentación de desarrollador más actualizada"],"fr":["Rechercher la documentation de développeur d''OpenAI pour des conseils d''API spécifiques","Récupérer des sections exactes de la documentation pour les intégrer dans les réponses de l''agent","Déboguer les problèmes liés à OpenAI en consultant la documentation de développeur la plus à jour"],"de":["OpenAI-Entwicklerdokumentation für spezifische API-Anleitungen suchen","Exakte Abschnitte der Dokumentation abrufen, um sie in die Antworten des Agents zu integrieren","OpenAI-bezogene Probleme durch die Konsultation der aktuellsten Entwicklerdokumentation debuggen"],"pt":["Pesquisar a documentação do desenvolvedor da OpenAI para orientação de API específica","Buscar seções exatas da documentação para integração nas respostas do agente","Depurar problemas relacionados à OpenAI consultando a documentação mais atual do desenvolvedor"],"ru":["Поиск документации разработчика OpenAI для получения конкретных рекомендаций по API","Извлечение точных разделов документации для интеграции в ответы агента","Отладка проблем, связанных с OpenAI, консультируясь с самой актуальной документацией разработчика"],"ar":["البحث في توثيق المطور من OpenAI للحصول على إرشادات API محددة","استخراج أقسام دقيقة من التوثيق لتích إلى استجابات الوكلاء","تصحيح الأخطاء المتعلقة بـ OpenAI عن طريق الاستشارة بأحدث توثيق المطور"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires the MCP server to be installed for optimal functionality","Falls back to web search if the MCP server returns no meaningful results"],"zh":["需要安装MCP服务器以实现最佳功能","如果MCP服务器未返回有意义的结果，则回退到网络搜索"],"ja":["最適な機能にはMCPサーバーのインストールが必要です","MCPサーバーが意味のある結果を返さない場合はWeb検索にフォールバックします"],"ko":["최적의 기능을 위해 MCP 서버 설치가 필요합니다","MCP 서버가 의미 있는 결과를 반환하지 않으면 웹 검색으로 대체됩니다"],"es":["Requiere que el servidor MCP esté instalado para una funcionalidad óptima","Vuelve a la búsqueda web si el servidor MCP no devuelve resultados significativos"],"fr":["Nécessite que le serveur MCP soit installé pour une fonctionnalité optimale","Revertit à la recherche web si le serveur MCP ne retourne pas de résultats significatifs"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation des MCP-Servers für eine optimale Funktionalität","Fällt auf die Web-Suche zurück, wenn der MCP-Server keine sinnvollen Ergebnisse zurückgibt"],"pt":["Requer que o servidor MCP seja instalado para funcionalidade ótima","Volta à pesquisa na web se o servidor MCP não retornar resultados significativos"],"ru":["Требует установки сервера MCP для оптимальной функциональности","Переходит к веб-поиску, если сервер MCP не возвращает значимых результатов"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت خادم MCP للوظائف المثلى","يعود إلى البحث على الويب إذا لم يُرجع خادم MCP نتائج ملائمة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('raivitor/config-codex/openai-docs', 'community', 'raivitor', 'config-codex', 'raivitor/config-codex', 'openai-docs', 0, 0, 30, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z', '2026-02-18T04:11:08.291Z', NULL, '{"id":"raivitor/config-codex/openai-docs","name":"openai-docs","description":{"zh":"OpenAI Docs API OpenAI.","ja":"OpenAI Docs API OpenAI.","ko":"OpenAI Docs API OpenAI.","pt":"Acesse os documentos oficiais do OpenAI para desenvolvedores e encontre respostas para suas perguntas técnicas","ru":"Доступ к официальным документам OpenAI для разработчиков и найдите ответы на ваши технические вопросы","ar":"أクセس إلى وثائق OpenAI الرسمية للمطورين واعثر على إجابات للأسئلة الفنية","en":""},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"OpenAI Docs API","ja":"OpenAI Docs API","ko":"OpenAI Docs API","pt":"OpenAI Docs: Guia Oficial para Desenvolvedores","ru":"OpenAI Документы: Официальное Руководство для Разработчиков","ar":"وثائق OpenAI: دليل رسمي للمطورين","en":"openai-docs"},"description":{"zh":"OpenAI Docs API OpenAI.","ja":"OpenAI Docs API OpenAI.","ko":"OpenAI Docs API OpenAI.","pt":"Acesse os documentos oficiais do OpenAI para desenvolvedores e encontre respostas para suas perguntas técnicas","ru":"Доступ к официальным документам OpenAI для разработчиков и найдите ответы на ваши технические вопросы","ar":"أクセس إلى وثائق OpenAI الرسمية للمطورين واعثر على إجابات للأسئلة الفنية","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["OpenAI Docs API","MCP","OpenAI","API","OpenAI Docs"],"ja":["OpenAI Docs API","MCP","OpenAI","API","OpenAI Docs"],"ko":["OpenAI Docs API","MCP","OpenAI","API","OpenAI Docs"],"pt":["Busca por documentos oficiais do OpenAI","Acesso a seções específicas dos documentos","Priorização dos documentos do MCP sobre a busca na web","Fallback para busca na web se o MCP não retornar resultados significativos","Uso de comandos específicos para busca e recuperação de documentos"],"ru":["Поиск по официальным документам OpenAI","Доступ к конкретным разделам документов","Приоритет документов MCP над поиском в Интернете","Переход к поиску в Интернете, если MCP не возвращает значимых результатов","Использование специальных команд для поиска и получения документов"],"ar":["بحث في وثائق OpenAI الرسمية","الوصول إلى أقسام محددة من الوثائق","الأولوية للوثائق MCP على البحث على الويب","الرجوع إلى البحث على الويب إذا لم يكن هناك نتائج معنوية من MCP","استخدام أوامر محددة للبحث والاسترجاع الوثائق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["OpenAI Docs API","OpenAI","MCP","API","OpenAI Docs","OpenAI API"],"ja":["OpenAI Docs API","OpenAI","MCP","API","OpenAI Docs","OpenAI API"],"ko":["OpenAI Docs API","OpenAI","MCP","API","OpenAI Docs","OpenAI API"],"pt":["OpenAI","documentos oficiais","desenvolvedores","MCP","busca na web","comandos de busca","recuperação de documentos"],"ru":["OpenAI","официальные документы","разработчики","MCP","поиск в Интернете","команды поиска","получение документов"],"ar":["OpenAI","وثائق رسمية","مطورين","MCP","بحث على الويب","أوامر البحث","استرجاع الوثائق"]}},"owner":"raivitor","repo":"config-codex","repoPath":"raivitor/config-codex","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"openai-docs","description":"Use when the user asks how to build with OpenAI products or APIs and needs up-to-date official documentation with citations (for example: Codex, Responses API, Chat Completions, Apps SDK, Agents SDK, Realtime, model capabilities or limits); prioritize OpenAI docs MCP tools and restrict any fallback browsing to official OpenAI domains.","bodyPreview":"# OpenAI Docs\n\nProvide authoritative, current guidance from OpenAI developer docs using the developers.openai.com MCP server. Always prioritize the developer docs MCP tools over web.run for OpenAI-related questions. Only if the MCP server is installed and returns no meaningful results should you fall back to web search.\n\n## Quick start\n\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` to find the most relevant doc pages.\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` to pull exact sectio","body":"# OpenAI Docs\n\nProvide authoritative, current guidance from OpenAI developer docs using the developers.openai.com MCP server. Always prioritize the developer docs MCP tools over web.run for OpenAI-related questions. Only if the MCP server is installed and returns no meaningful results should you fall back to web search.\n\n## Quick start\n\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs` to find the most relevant doc pages.\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc` to pull exact sections and quote/paraphrase accurately.\n- Use `mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__list_openai_docs` only when you need to browse or discover pages without a clear query.\n\n## OpenAI product snapshots\n\n1. Apps SDK: Build ChatGPT apps by providing a web component UI and an MCP server that exposes your app''s tools to ChatGPT.\n2. Responses API: A unified endpoint designed for stateful, multimodal, tool-using interactions in agentic workflows.\n3. Chat Completions API: Generate a model response from a list of messages comprising a conversation.\n4. Codex: OpenAI''s coding agent for software development that can write, understand, review, and debug code.\n5. gpt-oss: Open-weight OpenAI reasoning models (gpt-oss-120b and gpt-oss-20b) released under the Apache 2.0 license.\n6. Realtime API: Build low-latency, multimodal experiences including natural speech-to-speech conversations.\n7. Agents SDK: A toolkit for building agentic apps where a model can use tools and context, hand off to other agents, stream partial results, and keep a full trace.\n\n## If MCP server is missing\n\nIf MCP tools fail or no OpenAI docs resources are available:\n\n1. Run the install command yourself: `codex mcp add openaiDeveloperDocs --url https://developers.openai.com/mcp`\n2. If it fails due to permissions/sandboxing, immediately retry the same command with escalated permissions and include a 1-sentence justification for approval. Do not ask the user to run it yet.\n3. Only if the escalated attempt fails, ask the user to run the install command.\n4. Ask the user to restart Codex.\n5. Re-run the doc search/fetch after restart.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Clarify the product scope (Codex, OpenAI API, or ChatGPT Apps SDK) and the task.\n2. Search docs with a precise query.\n3. Fetch the best page and the specific section needed (use `anchor` when possible).\n4. Answer with concise guidance and cite the doc source.\n5. Provide code snippets only when the docs support them.\n\n## Quality rules\n\n- Treat OpenAI docs as the source of truth; avoid speculation.\n- Keep quotes short and within policy limits; prefer paraphrase with citations.\n- If multiple pages differ, call out the difference and cite both.\n- If docs do not cover the user’s need, say so and offer next steps.\n\n## Tooling notes\n\n- Always use MCP doc tools before any web search for OpenAI-related questions.\n- If the MCP server is installed but returns no meaningful results, then use web search as a fallback.\n- When falling back to web search, restrict to official OpenAI domains (developers.openai.com, platform.openai.com) and cite sources.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:11:08.291Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for AI Coding Agents requiring authoritative OpenAI API documentation without web search noise.","zh":"对于需要权威的 OpenAI API 文档而不需要网络搜索噪音的 AI 编码代理来说是必不可少的。","ja":"OpenAI API の公式ドキュメントを Web 検索のノイズなしで必要とする AI コーディング エージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"웹 검색 노이즈가 없는 권위 있는 OpenAI API 문서가 필요한 AI 코딩 에이전트에 필수입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de codificación de IA que requieren documentación autorizada de la API de OpenAI sin ruido de búsqueda web.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de codage IA nécessitant une documentation officielle de l''API OpenAI sans bruit de recherche web.","de":"Wesentlich für AI-Coding-Agents, die eine autoritative OpenAI-API-Dokumentation ohne Web-Suchenrauschen benötigen.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Codificação de IA que exigem documentação autorizada da API OpenAI sem ruído de pesquisa na web.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов кодирования ИИ, требующих авторитетную документацию API OpenAI без шума поиска в интернете.","ar":"ضروري لموكلات الترميز الإصطناعي التي تتطلب توثيقًا موثوقًا لـ API OpenAI دون ضوضاء البحث على الويب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Provides direct access to the official OpenAI developer documentation through MCP server integration, prioritizing mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs and mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc tools over generic web search results for accurate API guidance.","zh":"通过 MCP 服务器集成，提供直接访问官方 OpenAI 开发者文档的途径，优先使用 mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs 和 mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc 工具而不是通用 Web 搜索结果，以获得准确的 API 指导。","ja":"MCP サーバー統合を通じて、公式 OpenAI 開発者ドキュメントへの直接アクセスを提供し、一般的な Web 検索結果よりも mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs および mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc ツールを優先し、正確な API ガイダンスを提供します。","ko":"MCP 서버 통합을 통해 공식 OpenAI 개발자 문서에 직접 액세스할 수 있도록 제공하며, 일반적인 웹 검색 결과보다 mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs 및 mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc 도구를 우선하여 정확한 API 지침을 제공합니다.","es":"Proporciona acceso directo a la documentación oficial de desarrolladores de OpenAI a través de la integración del servidor MCP, priorizando las herramientas mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs y mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc sobre los resultados de búsqueda web genéricos para una guía de API precisa.","fr":"Fournit un accès direct à la documentation officielle des développeurs OpenAI via l''intégration du serveur MCP, en donnant la priorité aux outils mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs et mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc par rapport aux résultats de recherche web génériques pour une guidance d''API précise.","de":"Bietet direkten Zugriff auf die offizielle OpenAI-Entwicklerdokumentation durch die MCP-Server-Integration, wobei die Tools mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs und mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc gegenüber generischen Web-Suchergebnissen für eine genaue API-Anleitung priorisiert werden.","pt":"Fornece acesso direto à documentação oficial do desenvolvedor OpenAI por meio da integração do servidor MCP, priorizando as ferramentas mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs e mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc sobre os resultados de pesquisa genéricos da web para orientação de API precisa.","ru":"Предоставляет прямой доступ к официальной документации разработчика OpenAI через интеграцию сервера MCP, отдающий приоритет инструментам mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs и mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc над результатами общего веб-поиска для точного руководства по API.","ar":"توفر وصولاً مباشراً إلى توثيق مطور OpenAI الرسمي من خلال دمج خادم MCP، مع تقديم أدوات mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__search_openai_docs و mcp__openaiDeveloperDocs__fetch_openai_doc لأعلى من نتائج البحث الويب العام من أجل إرشادات دقيقة لبروتوكول التطبيق."},"useCases":{"en":["Resolving OpenAI API integration issues","Implementing correct API parameter configurations","Troubleshooting authentication errors","Applying best practices for model usage"],"zh":["解决 OpenAI API 集成问题","实现正确的 API 参数配置","排查身份验证错误","应用模型使用的最佳实践"],"ja":["OpenAI API 統合の問題を解決する","正しい API パラメータ設定を実装する","認証エラーをトラブルシューティングする","モデル使用のベストプラクティスを適用する"],"ko":["OpenAI API 통합 문제 해결","正しい API 파라미터 구성 구현","인증 오류 해결","모델 사용 모범 사례 적용"],"es":["Resolver problemas de integración de la API de OpenAI","Implementar configuraciones de parámetros de API correctas","Depurar errores de autenticación","Aplicar las mejores prácticas para el uso de modelos"],"fr":["Résoudre les problèmes d''intégration de l''API OpenAI","Mettre en œuvre des configurations de paramètres d''API correctes","Déboguer les erreurs d''authentification","Appliquer les meilleures pratiques pour l''utilisation de modèles"],"de":["Probleme bei der OpenAI-API-Integration lösen","Korrekte API-Parameterkonfigurationen implementieren","Authentifizierungsfehler beheben","Best Practices für die Modellnutzung anwenden"],"pt":["Resolução de problemas de integração da API OpenAI","Implementação de configurações de parâmetros de API corretas","Depuração de erros de autenticação","Aplicação de práticas recomendadas para uso de modelo"],"ru":["Решение проблем интеграции API OpenAI","Реализация правильных конфигураций параметров API","Устранение ошибок аутентификации","Применение рекомендованных практик использования модели"],"ar":["حل مشاكل دمج واجهة برمجة التطبيقات OpenAI","تنفيذ تكوينات معلمات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات الصحيحة","تصحيح أخطاء المصادقة","تطبيق أفضل الممارسات لاستخدام النموذج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires MCP server installation","Fallback to web.run only when MCP returns no results","Limited to developers.openai.com documentation scope"],"zh":["需要 MCP 服务器安装","仅当 MCP 返回无结果时才回退到 web.run","仅限于 developers.openai.com 文档范围"],"ja":["MCP サーバーのインストールが必要","MCP が結果を返さない場合にのみ web.run にフォールバック","developers.openai.com ドキュメントの範囲のみ"],"ko":["MCP 서버 설치 필요","MCP가 결과를 반환하지 않는 경우에만 web.run으로回退","developers.openai.com 문서 범위만"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del servidor MCP","Recurso a web.run solo cuando MCP no devuelve resultados","Limitado al alcance de la documentación de developers.openai.com"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du serveur MCP","Recours à web.run uniquement lorsque MCP ne retourne pas de résultats","Limité à la portée de la documentation de developers.openai.com"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation des MCP-Servers","Zurückfallen auf web.run nur, wenn MCP keine Ergebnisse zurückgibt","Begrenzt auf den Umfang der Dokumentation von developers.openai.com"],"pt":["Exige instalação do servidor MCP","Retornar para web.run apenas quando o MCP não retorna resultados","Limitado ao escopo da documentação developers.openai.com"],"ru":["Требует установки сервера MCP","Переход к web.run только когда MCP не возвращает результатов","Ограничен сферой документации developers.openai.com"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت خادم MCP","العودة إلى تشغيل الويب فقط عند عدم إرجاع MCP نتائج","محدود بنطاق توثيق developers.openai.com"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":30}');
