emory system, and tool integration."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"baoyu-danger-gemini-web: TypeScript ","ja":"baoyu-danger-gemini-web: TypeScript","ko":"baoyu-danger-gemini-web: TypeScript ","es":"Gemini Web: Marco de Asistente AI Personal","fr":"Gemini Web: Cadre d''Assistant AI Personnel","de":"Gemini Web: Framework für persönlichen AI-Assistenten","pt":"Gemini Web Client: Geração de Texto/Imagem com TypeScript","ru":"Gemini Web Client: Генерация текста и изображений на Type...","ar":"Gemini Web Client: إنشاء النصوص والصور باستخدام TypeScript","en":"baoyu-danger-gemini-web"},"description":{"zh":"baoyu-danger-gemini-web, TypeScript,","ja":"baoyu-danger-gemini-web, TypeScript,","ko":"baoyu-danger-gemini-web, TypeScript,","es":"Gemini Web es un marco de asistente AI personal construido con TypeScript, diseñado para manejar tareas complejas con un bucle de agente robusto y sistema de...","fr":"Gemini Web est un cadre d''assistant AI personnel construit avec TypeScript, conçu pour gérer des tâches complexes avec une boucle d''agent robuste et un systè...","de":"Gemini Web ist ein Framework für persönliche AI-Assistenten, entwickelt mit TypeScript, das für die Verwaltung komplexer Aufgaben mit einer robusten Agenten-...","pt":"Um cliente TypeScript para a API Gemini Web que permite gerar texto e imagens. Suporta conversas multi-turno e o uso de imagens como referência, sendo parte ...","ru":"Клиент TypeScript для Gemini Web API, позволяющий генерировать текст и изображения. Поддерживает многоповторные диалоги и использование эталонных изображений...","ar":"عميل TypeScript لواجهة برمجة تطبيقات Gemini Web يتيح إنشاء النصوص والصور. يدعم المحادثات متعددة الجولات واستخدام الصور كمرجع، وهو جزء من إطار عمل المساعد الش...","en":"An ultra-lightweight, extensible personal AI assistant framework built with TypeScript. Nanobot TS is designed to be your personal companion, capable of hand..."},"definition":{"en":"An ultra-lightweight, extensible personal AI assistant framework built with TypeScript. Nanobot TS is designed to be your personal companion, capable of handling complex tasks through a robust agent loop, memory system, and tool integration."},"features":{"zh":["TypeScript","Gemini Web API","","API"],"ja":["TypeScript","Gemini Web API","","API"],"ko":["TypeScript","Gemini Web API","","API"],"es":["Marco de asistente AI personal ultra ligero","Construido con TypeScript","Bucle de agente robusto","Sistema de memoria","Integración de herramientas","Compatibilidad con imágenes de referencia y conversaciones de varias vueltas"],"fr":["Cadre d''assistant AI personnel ultra léger","Construit avec TypeScript","Boucle d''agent robuste","Système de mémoire","Intégration d''outils","Compatibilité avec des images de référence et des conversations à plusieurs tours"],"de":["Ultra-leichtes Framework für persönliche AI-Assistenten","Entwickelt mit TypeScript","Robuste Agenten-Schleife","Speichersystem","Werkzeugintegration","Unterstützung für Referenzbilder und Mehrfachgespräche"],"pt":["Integração com a API Gemini Web para geração de texto","Geração de imagens através da API","Suporte a imagens de referência para contexto","Conversas multi-turno (multi-turn conversations)","Scripts TypeScript localizados em diretório dedicado","Parte do framework extensível Nanobot TS"],"ru":["Интеграция с Gemini Web API для генерации текста","Генерация изображений через API","Поддержка эталонных изображений для контекста","Многоповторные диалоги (multi-turn conversations)","Скрипты TypeScript, расположенные в выделенном каталоге","Часть расширяемого фреймворка Nanobot TS"],"ar":["التكامل مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Gemini Web لإنشاء النصوص","إنشاء الصور عبر واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","دعم الصور المرجعية لتوفير السياق","محادثات متعددة الجولات (Multi-turn conversations)","نصوص Typescript موجودة في دليل مخصص","جزء من إطار عمل Nanobot TS القابل للتوسيع"]},"keywords":{"zh":["baoyu-danger-gemini-web","TypeScript","AI","Gemini Web API","","API"],"ja":["baoyu-danger-gemini-web","TypeScript","AI","Gemini Web API","","API"],"ko":["baoyu-danger-gemini-web","TypeScript","AI","Gemini Web API","","API"],"es":["asistente AI personal","Marco de asistente AI","TypeScript","desarrollo de asistentes","AI personalizado","integración de herramientas","conversaciones de varias vueltas"],"fr":["assistant AI personnel","Cadre d''assistant AI","TypeScript","développement d''assistants","AI personnalisé","intégration d''outils","conversations à plusieurs tours"],"de":["persönlicher AI-Assistent","Framework für AI-Assistenten","TypeScript","Entwicklung von Assistenten","benutzerdefinierter AI","Werkzeugintegration","Mehrfachgespräche"],"pt":["gemini api typescript","geração de texto com gemini","nanobot ts framework","cliente web gemini","assistente pessoal ai","typescript ai agent","conversas multi-turno"],"ru":["gemini api typescript","генерация текста gemini","фреймворк nanobot ts","веб-клиент gemini","персональный ассистент ai","typescript ai агент","многоповторные диалоги"],"ar":["gemini api typescript","إنشاء النصوص باستخدام gemini","إطار عمل nanobot ts","عميل ويب gemini","مساعد شخصي بالذكاء الاصطناعي","وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي typescript","محادثات متعددة الجولات"]}},"owner":"chengyihua","repo":"nanobot-ts","repoPath":"chengyihua/nanobot-ts","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-danger-gemini-web","description":"Generates images and text via reverse-engineered Gemini Web API. Supports text generation, image generation from prompts, reference images for vision input, and multi-turn conversations. Use when other skills need image generation backend, or when user requests generate image with Gemini, Gemini text generation, or needs vision-capable AI generation.","bodyPreview":"# Gemini Web Client\n\nText/image generation via Gemini Web API. Supports reference images and multi-turn conversations.\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|-----","body":"# Gemini Web Client\n\nText/image generation via Gemini Web API. Supports reference images and multi-turn conversations.\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Important**: All scripts are located in the `scripts/` subdirectory of this skill.\n\n**Agent Execution Instructions**:\n1. Determine this SKILL.md file''s directory path as `SKILL_DIR`\n2. Script path = `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<script-name>.ts`\n3. Replace all `${SKILL_DIR}` in this document with the actual path\n\n**Script Reference**:\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/main.ts` | CLI entry point for text/image generation |\n| `scripts/gemini-webapi/*` | TypeScript port of `gemini_webapi` (GeminiClient, types, utils) |\n\n## Consent Check (REQUIRED)\n\nBefore first use, verify user consent for reverse-engineered API usage.\n\n**Consent file locations**:\n- macOS: `~/Library/Application Support/baoyu-skills/gemini-web/consent.json`\n- Linux: `~/.local/share/baoyu-skills/gemini-web/consent.json`\n- Windows: `%APPDATA%\\baoyu-skills\\gemini-web\\consent.json`\n\n**Flow**:\n1. Check if consent file exists with `accepted: true` and `disclaimerVersion: \"1.0\"`\n2. If valid consent exists → print warning with `acceptedAt` date, proceed\n3. If no consent → show disclaimer, ask user via `AskUserQuestion`:\n   - \"Yes, I accept\" → create consent file with ISO timestamp, proceed\n   - \"No, I decline\" → output decline message, stop\n4. Consent file format: `{\"version\":1,\"accepted\":true,\"acceptedAt\":\"<ISO>\",\"disclaimerVersion\":\"1.0\"}`\n\n---\n\n## Preferences (EXTEND.md)\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-danger-gemini-web/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-danger-gemini-web/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                           Path                           │     Location      │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-danger-gemini-web/EXTEND.md          │ Project directory │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-danger-gemini-web/EXTEND.md    │ User home         │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                  Action                                   │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, apply settings                                               │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ Use defaults                                                              │\n└───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Default model | Proxy settings | Custom data directory\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\n# Text generation\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts \"Your prompt\"\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts --prompt \"Your prompt\" --model gemini-2.5-pro\n\n# Image generation\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts --prompt \"A cute cat\" --image cat.png\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts --promptfiles system.md content.md --image out.png\n\n# Vision input (reference images)\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts --prompt \"Describe this\" --reference image.png\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts --prompt \"Create variation\" --reference a.png --image out.png\n\n# Multi-turn conversation\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts \"Remember: 42\" --sessionId session-abc\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts \"What number?\" --sessionId session-abc\n\n# JSON output\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts \"Hello\" --json\n```\n\n## Options\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--prompt`, `-p` | Prompt text |\n| `--promptfiles` | Read prompt from files (concatenated) |\n| `--model`, `-m` | Model: gemini-3-pro (default), gemini-2.5-pro, gemini-2.5-flash |\n| `--image [path]` | Generate image (default: generated.png) |\n| `--reference`, `--ref` | Reference images for vision input |\n| `--sessionId` | Session ID for multi-turn conversation |\n| `--list-sessions` | List saved sessions |\n| `--json` | Output as JSON |\n| `--login` | Refresh cookies, then exit |\n| `--cookie-path` | Custom cookie file path |\n| `--profile-dir` | Chrome profile directory |\n\n## Models\n\n| Model | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `gemini-3-pro` | Default, latest |\n| `gemini-2.5-pro` | Previous pro |\n| `gemini-2.5-flash` | Fast, lightweight |\n\n## Authentication\n\nFirst run opens browser for Google auth. Cookies cached automatically.\n\nSupported browsers (auto-detected): Chrome, Chrome Canary/Beta, Chromium, Edge.\n\nForce refresh: `--login` flag. Override browser: `GEMINI_WEB_CHROME_PATH` env var.\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n| Variable | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `GEMINI_WEB_DATA_DIR` | Data directory |\n| `GEMINI_WEB_COOKIE_PATH` | Cookie file path |\n| `GEMINI_WEB_CHROME_PROFILE_DIR` | Chrome profile directory |\n| `GEMINI_WEB_CHROME_PATH` | Chrome executable path |\n| `HTTP_PROXY`, `HTTPS_PROXY` | Proxy for Google access (set inline with command) |\n\n## Sessions\n\nSession files stored in data directory under `sessions/<id>.json`.\n\nContains: `id`, `metadata` (Gemini chat state), `messages` array, timestamps.\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Preferences** section for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:10:55.774Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for TypeScript-based AI Agents requiring lightweight multimodal interaction with Google''s Gemini API.","zh":"非常适合基于TypeScript的AI代理，需要与Google的Gemini API进行轻量级多模态交互。","ja":"TypeScriptベースのAIエージェントに最適で、GoogleのGemini APIとの軽量なマルチモーダルインタラクションを必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"TypeScript 기반 AI 에이전트에 이상적이며, Google의 Gemini API와의 경량 다중 모달 상호작용이 필요한 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en TypeScript que requieren interacción multimodal ligera con la API Gemini de Google.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur TypeScript nécessitant une interaction multimodale légère avec l''API Gemini de Google.","de":"Ideal für TypeScript-basierte KI-Agents, die eine leichte multimodale Interaktion mit der Google Gemini-API erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em TypeScript que requerem interação multimodal leve com a API Gemini do Google.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе TypeScript, требующих легкого многомодального взаимодействия с API Gemini от Google.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يعتمد على TypeScript والذي يتطلب تفاعلاً متعدد الوضعيات خفيفًا مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Gemini من جوجل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct text and image generation through Gemini Web API with multi-turn conversation support and reference image handling. Integrates seamlessly with Nanobot TS framework''s agent loop and memory system for complex task handling.","zh":"通过Gemini Web API支持多轮对话和参考图像处理，实现直接的文本和图像生成。与Nanobot TS框架的代理循环和内存系统无缝集成，以处理复杂任务。","ja":"Gemini Web APIを通じて、マルチターン会話のサポートと参照画像の処理により、直接的なテキストおよび画像生成を可能にします。複雑なタスク処理のために、Nanobot TSフレームワークのエージェントループおよびメモリシステムとシームレスに統合します。","ko":"Gemini Web API를 통해 다중 턴 대화 지원 및 참조 이미지 처리를 통한 직접적인 텍스트 및 이미지 생성을 가능하게 합니다. 복잡한 작업 처리를 위해 Nanobot TS 프레임워크의 에이전트 루프 및 메모리 시스템과 원활하게 통합됩니다.","es":"Permite la generación directa de texto e imágenes a través de la API web Gemini con soporte de conversación multivuelta y manejo de imágenes de referencia. Se integra perfectamente con el marco de agente y sistema de memoria de Nanobot TS para el manejo de tareas complejas.","fr":"Permet la génération directe de texte et d''images via l''API Web Gemini avec un support de conversation multivu et une gestion d''images de référence. S''intègre sans problème avec la boucle d''agent et le système de mémoire du framework Nanobot TS pour la gestion de tâches complexes.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Generierung von Text und Bildern über die Gemini-Web-API mit Unterstützung für Multivu-Konversationen und Referenzbild-Verwaltung. Integriert sich nahtlos in den Agenten-Loop und das Speichersystem des Nanobot-TS-Frameworks für die Verarbeitung komplexer Aufgaben.","pt":"Permite geração direta de texto e imagem por meio da API Web Gemini com suporte a conversas de várias voltas e manipulação de imagens de referência. Integra-se perfeitamente com o framework do agente de loop e sistema de memória Nanobot TS para tratamento de tarefas complexas.","ru":"Позволяет напрямую генерировать текст и изображения через веб-API Gemini с поддержкой разговоров с несколькими ходами и обработкой ссылочных изображений. Интегрируется без проблем с агентским циклом и системой памяти фреймворка Nanobot TS для обработки сложных задач.","ar":"يمكنه توليد نصوص وصور مباشرة من خلال واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Gemini على الويب مع دعم للحوارات متعددة الدورات ومعالجة الصور المرجعية. يتكامل بشكل متجانس مع حلقة وكيل إطار العمل Nanobot TS ونظام الذاكرة لمعالجة المهام المعقدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating multimodal content with image references","Maintaining contextual conversations through memory integration","Processing visual inputs alongside text prompts","Extending agent capabilities with Gemini web API tools"],"zh":["通过图像参考生成多模态内容","通过内存集成维护上下