CSS"],"ja":["Markdown を HTML に","baoyu-markdown-to-html","TypeScript","WeChat 公式アカウント","HTML 変換","インライン CSS"],"ko":["Markdown 를 HTML 로","baoyu-markdown-to-html","TypeScript","WeChat 공식 계정","HTML 변환","인라인 CSS"],"es":["convertidor markdown","markdown a html","css incrustado","wechat official account","typescript","framework de asistente personal ai"],"fr":["convertisseur markdown","markdown en html","css intégré","wechat official account","typescript","framework d''assistant personnel ai"],"de":["markdown konverter","markdown zu html","css eingebettet","wechat official account","typescript","framework für persönlichen ai-assistenten"],"pt":["conversor markdown html","css inline wechat","nanobot typescript","skill agente ia","markdown para html","publicação wechat","framework extensível","typescript developer"],"ru":["конвертер markdown html","inline css wechat","nanobot typescript","скилл ia агента","markdown в html","публикация wechat","расширяемый фреймворк","typescript разработчик"],"ar":["محول markdown إلى html","css مضمن wechat","nanobot typescript","مهارة وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","markdown إلى html","النشر على wechat","إطار عمل قابل للتوسعة","مطور typescript"]}},"owner":"chengyihua","repo":"nanobot-ts","repoPath":"chengyihua/nanobot-ts","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baoyu-markdown-to-html","description":"Converts Markdown to styled HTML with WeChat-compatible themes. Supports code highlighting, math, PlantUML, footnotes, alerts, and infographics. Use when user asks for markdown to html, convert md to html, md转html, or needs styled HTML output from markdown.","bodyPreview":"# Markdown to HTML Converter\n\nConverts Markdown files to beautifully styled HTML with inline CSS, optimized for WeChat Official Account and other platforms.\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Agent Execution**: Determine this SKILL.md directory as `SKILL_DIR`, then use `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<name>.ts`.\n\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/main.ts` | Main entry point |\n\n## Preferences (EXTEND.md)\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\nt","body":"# Markdown to HTML Converter\n\nConverts Markdown files to beautifully styled HTML with inline CSS, optimized for WeChat Official Account and other platforms.\n\n## Script Directory\n\n**Agent Execution**: Determine this SKILL.md directory as `SKILL_DIR`, then use `${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/<name>.ts`.\n\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/main.ts` | Main entry point |\n\n## Preferences (EXTEND.md)\n\nUse Bash to check EXTEND.md existence (priority order):\n\n```bash\n# Check project-level first\ntest -f .baoyu-skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/EXTEND.md && echo \"project\"\n\n# Then user-level (cross-platform: $HOME works on macOS/Linux/WSL)\ntest -f \"$HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/EXTEND.md\" && echo \"user\"\n```\n\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┐\n│                             Path                             │     Location      │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ .baoyu-skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/EXTEND.md               │ Project directory │\n├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┤\n│ $HOME/.baoyu-skills/baoyu-markdown-to-html/EXTEND.md         │ User home         │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────┘\n\n┌───────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  Result   │                                  Action                                   │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Found     │ Read, parse, apply settings                                               │\n├───────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ Not found │ Use defaults                                                              │\n└───────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\n**EXTEND.md Supports**: Default theme | Custom CSS variables | Code block style\n\n## Workflow\n\n### Step 0: Pre-check (Chinese Content)\n\n**Condition**: Only execute if input file contains Chinese text.\n\n**Detection**:\n1. Read input markdown file\n2. Check if content contains CJK characters (Chinese/Japanese/Korean)\n3. If no CJK content → skip to Step 1\n\n**Format Suggestion**:\n\nIf CJK content detected AND `baoyu-format-markdown` skill is available:\n\nUse `AskUserQuestion` to ask whether to format first. Formatting can fix:\n- Bold markers with punctuation inside causing `**` parse failures\n- CJK/English spacing issues\n\n**If user agrees**: Invoke `baoyu-format-markdown` skill to format the file, then use formatted file as input.\n\n**If user declines**: Continue with original file.\n\n### Step 1: Confirm Theme\n\nBefore converting, use AskUserQuestion to confirm the theme (unless user already specified):\n\n| Theme | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `default` (Recommended) | 经典主题 - 传统排版，标题居中带底边，二级标题白字彩底 |\n| `grace` | 优雅主题 - 文字阴影，圆角卡片，精致引用块 |\n| `simple` | 简洁主题 - 现代极简风，不对称圆角，清爽留白 |\n\n### Step 2: Convert\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts <markdown_file> --theme <theme>\n```\n\n### Step 3: Report Result\n\nDisplay the output path from JSON result. If backup was created, mention it.\n\n## Usage\n\n```bash\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts <markdown_file> [options]\n```\n\n**Options:**\n\n| Option | Description | Default |\n|--------|-------------|---------|\n| `--theme <name>` | Theme name (default, grace, simple) | default |\n| `--title <title>` | Override title from frontmatter | |\n| `--keep-title` | Keep the first heading in content | false (removed) |\n| `--help` | Show help | |\n\n**Examples:**\n\n```bash\n# Basic conversion (uses default theme, removes first heading)\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts article.md\n\n# With specific theme\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts article.md --theme grace\n\n# Keep the first heading in content\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts article.md --keep-title\n\n# Override title\nnpx -y bun ${SKILL_DIR}/scripts/main.ts article.md --title \"My Article\"\n```\n\n## Output\n\n**File location**: Same directory as input markdown file.\n- Input: `/path/to/article.md`\n- Output: `/path/to/article.html`\n\n**Conflict handling**: If HTML file already exists, it will be backed up first:\n- Backup: `/path/to/article.html.bak-YYYYMMDDHHMMSS`\n\n**JSON output to stdout:**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"title\": \"Article Title\",\n  \"author\": \"Author Name\",\n  \"summary\": \"Article summary...\",\n  \"htmlPath\": \"/path/to/article.html\",\n  \"backupPath\": \"/path/to/article.html.bak-20260128180000\",\n  \"contentImages\": [\n    {\n      \"placeholder\": \"MDTOHTMLIMGPH_1\",\n      \"localPath\": \"/path/to/img.png\",\n      \"originalPath\": \"imgs/image.png\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## Themes\n\n| Theme | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `default` | 经典主题 - 传统排版，标题居中带底边，二级标题白字彩底 |\n| `grace` | 优雅主题 - 文字阴影，圆角卡片，精致引用块 (by @brzhang) |\n| `simple` | 简洁主题 - 现代极简风，不对称圆角，清爽留白 (by @okooo5km) |\n\n## Supported Markdown Features\n\n| Feature | Syntax |\n|---------|--------|\n| Headings | `# H1` to `###### H6` |\n| Bold/Italic | `**bold**`, `*italic*` |\n| Code blocks | ` ```lang ` with syntax highlighting |\n| Inline code | `` `code` `` |\n| Tables | GitHub-flavored markdown tables |\n| Images | `![alt](src)` |\n| Links | `[text](url)` with footnote references |\n| Blockquotes | `> quote` |\n| Lists | `-` unordered, `1.` ordered |\n| Alerts | `> [!NOTE]`, `> [!WARNING]`, etc. |\n| Footnotes | `[^1]` references |\n| Ruby text | `{base|annotation}` |\n| Mermaid | ` ```mermaid ` diagrams |\n| PlantUML | ` ```plantuml ` diagrams |\n\n## Frontmatter\n\nSupports YAML frontmatter for metadata:\n\n```yaml\n---\ntitle: Article Title\nauthor: Author Name\ndescription: Article summary\n---\n```\n\nIf no title is found, extracts from first H1/H2 heading or uses filename.\n\n## Extension Support\n\nCustom configurations via EXTEND.md. See **Preferences** section for paths and supported options.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:10:59.932Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Content Generation Agents needing Markdown to HTML conversion capabilities with inline CSS styling.","zh":"非常适合需要将 Markdown 转换为 HTML 并带有内联 CSS 样式的内容生成代理。","ja":"Markdown を HTML に変換し、インライン CSS スタイル機能を必要とするコンテンツ生成エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Markdown 를 HTML 로 변환하고 인라인 CSS 스타일 기능을 필요로 하는 콘텐츠 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de generación de contenido que necesitan capacidades de conversión de Markdown a HTML con estilos CSS en línea.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de génération de contenu ayant besoin de capacités de conversion de Markdown en HTML avec des styles CSS en ligne.","de":"Perfekt für Content-Generation-Agents, die Markdown-zu-HTML-Konvertierungsfunktionen mit inline-CSS-Styling benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Geração de Conteúdo que necessitam de capacidades de conversão de Markdown para HTML com estilização CSS inline.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации контента, которым необходимы возможности преобразования Markdown в HTML с возможностью инлайн-стилизации CSS.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء مولد المحتوى الذين بحاجة إلى قدرات تحويل Markdown إلى HTML مع أسلوب CSS داخل الخط"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert Markdown files to beautifully styled HTML, optimized for WeChat Official Account and other platforms, using TypeScript and robust agent loop integration with tools like Nanobot TS.","zh":"赋予代理将 Markdown 文件转换为美丽的样式化 HTML 的能力，针对微信公众号和其他平台进行优化，使用 TypeScript 和强大的代理循环集成工具，如 Nanobot TS。","ja":"エージェントが Markdown ファイルを美しくスタイル化された HTML に変換できるようにし、WeChat 公式アカウントやその他のプラットフォーム向けに最適化し、TypeScript と強力なエージェント ループ統合ツール such as Nanobot TS を使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 마크다운 파일을 아름답게 스타일링된 HTML로 변환할 수 있도록 하여, WeChat 공식 계정 및 기타 플랫폼을 최적화하고, TypeScript 및 강력한 에이전트 루프 통합 도구 such as Nanobot TS를 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes convertir archivos Markdown a HTML con estilos hermosos, optimizados para la cuenta oficial de WeChat y otras plataformas, utilizando TypeScript y una integración sólida de lazo de agente con herramientas como Nanobot TS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des fichiers Markdown en HTML avec des styles beaux, optimisés pour le compte officiel de WeChat et d''autres plates-formes, en utilisant TypeScript et une intégration solide de la boucle d''agent avec des outils comme Nanobot TS.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Markdown-Dateien in schön gestalteten HTML umzuwandeln, optimiert für das offizielle WeChat-Konto und andere Plattformen, unter Verwendung von TypeScript und einer robusten Agenten-Loop-Integration mit Tools wie Nanobot TS.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter arquivos Markdown em HTML estilizados de forma bonita, otimizados para Conta Oficial do WeChat e outras plataformas, utilizando TypeScript e integração robusta de loop de agente com ferramentas como Nanobot TS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать файлы Markdown в красиво оформленный HTML, оптимизированный для официального аккаунта WeChat и других платформ, с использованием TypeScript и прочной интеграции цикла агента с инструментами như Nanobot TS.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحويل ملفات Markdown إلى HTML مصممة بشكل جميل، ومحسنة لتحقق الحساب الرسمي لشركة WeChat ومنصات أخرى، باستخدام TypeScript والدمج القوي للحلقة الوكيل مع أدوات مثل Nanobot TS."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting Markdown files to HTML for web publication","Generating styled HTML content for WeChat Official Accounts","Automating document conversion workflows with TypeScript"],"zh":["将 Markdown 文件转换为 HTML 以便网页发布","为微信公众号生成样式化的 HTML 内容","使用 TypeScript 自动化文档转换工作流"],"ja":["Web 発行のために Markdown ファイルを HTML に変換する","WeChat 公式アカウント用にスタイル化された HTML コンテンツを生成する","TypeScript を使用してドキュメント変換ワークフローを自動化する"],"ko":["웹 발행을 위해 마크다운 파일을 HTML로 변환하는 것","WeChat 공식 계정용으로 스타일링된 HTML 콘텐츠를 생성하는 것","TypeScript를 사용하여 문서 변환 워크플로를 자동화하는 것"],"es":["Conversión de archivos Markdown a HTML para publicación web","Generación de contenido HTML con estilos para cuentas oficiales de WeChat","Automatización de flujos de trabajo de conversión de documentos con TypeScript"],"fr":["Conversion de fichiers Markdown en HTML pour publication web","Génération de contenu HTML avec styles pour les comptes officiels de WeChat","Automatisation des flux de travail de conversion de documents avec TypeScript"],"de":["Konvertierung von Markdown-Dateien in HTML für die Web-Veröffentlichung","Erzeugung von gestaltetem HTML-Inhalt für offizielle WeChat-Konten","Automatisierung von Dokumentenkonvertierungs-Workflows mit TypeScript"],"pt":["Converte arquivos Markdown para HTML para publicação na web","Gera conteúdo HTML estilizado para Contas Oficiais do WeChat","Automatiza fluxos de trabalho de conversão de documentos com TypeScript"],"ru":["Преобразует файлы Markdown в HTML для публикации в Интернете","Генерирует стилизованный HTML-контент для официальных аккаунтов WeChat","Автоматизирует рабочие процессы преобразования документов с помощью TypeScript"],"ar":["يحول ملفات Markdown إلى HTML للنشر على الويب","ينشئ محتوى HTML مصمماً للتحقق من حسابات WeChat الرسمية","يؤتم работу تحويل المستندات باستخدام TypeScript"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript environment","Limited to Markdown to HTML conversion"],"zh":["需要 TypeScript 环境","仅限 Markdown 到 HTML 转换"],"ja":["TypeScript 環境が必要","Markdown から HTML への変換のみ"],"ko":["TypeScript 환경이 필요합니다","마크다운에서 HTML로의 변환만 가능합니다"],"es":["Requiere entorno de TypeScript","Limitado a la conversión de Markdown a HTML"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement TypeScript","Limité à la conversion de Markdown en HTML"],"de":["Benötigt eine TypeScript-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Konvertierung von Markdown in HTML"],"pt":["Requer ambiente TypeScript","Limitado à conversão de Markdown para HTML"],"ru":["Требует среды TypeScript","Ограничен преобразованием Markdown в HTML"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة TypeScript","محدود بالتحويل من Markdown إلى HTML"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
