habilidad JSON Canvas permite a los agentes compatibles crear y editar archivos JSON Canvas válidos para Obsidian y otras aplicaciones","fr":"La compétence JSON Canvas permet aux agents compatibles de créer et d''éditer des fichiers JSON Canvas valides pour Obsidian et d''autres applications","de":"Die Fähigkeit JSON Canvas ermöglicht es kompatiblen Agenten, gültige JSON-Canvas-Dateien für Obsidian und andere Anwendungen zu erstellen und zu bearbeiten","pt":"O JSON Canvas é um formato de arquivo aberto para dados de canvas infinito, permitindo a criação e edição de arquivos de canvas.","ru":"JSON Канвас - это открытый формат файла для бесконечных данных канваса, позволяющий создавать и редактировать файлы канваса.","ar":"JSON Canvas هو تنسيق ملف مفتوح للبيانات الكanvas غير المحدودة، مما يسمح بإنشاء وحرر ملفات الكanvas.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["JSON 1.0","JSON","nodes","edges","JSON","Obsidian"],"ja":["JSON 1.0","JSON","nodes","edges","JSON","Obsidian"],"ko":["JSON 1.0","JSON","nodes","edges","JSON","Obsidian"],"es":["Creación de archivos JSON Canvas válidos","Edición de archivos JSON Canvas existentes","Compatibilidad con Obsidian y otras aplicaciones","Estructura de archivo basada en JSON","Soporte para nodos y aristas"],"fr":["Création de fichiers JSON Canvas valides","Édition de fichiers JSON Canvas existants","Compatibilité avec Obsidian et d''autres applications","Structure de fichier basée sur JSON","Prise en charge des nœuds et des arêtes"],"de":["Erstellung von gültigen JSON-Canvas-Dateien","Bearbeitung von bestehenden JSON-Canvas-Dateien","Kompatibilität mit Obsidian und anderen Anwendungen","Dateistruktur basierend auf JSON","Unterstützung für Knoten und Kanten"],"pt":["Criação e edição de arquivos de canvas","Suporte a dados de canvas infinito","Formatação em JSON","Compatibilidade com Obsidian e outras aplicações","Estrutura de arquivo simples e flexível"],"ru":["Создание и редактирование файлов канваса","Поддержка бесконечных данных канваса","Форматирование в JSON","Совместимость с Obsidian и другими приложениями","Простая и гибкая структура файла"],"ar":["إنشاء وحرر ملفات الكanvas","دعم البيانات الكanvas غير المحدودة","تنسيق JSON","التوافق مع Obsidian وتطبيقات أخرى","هيكل ملف بسيط وممكن"]},"keywords":{"zh":["JSON","JSON 1.0","JSON","Obsidian","JSON","nodes","edges","JSON"],"ja":["JSON","JSON 1.0","JSON","Obsidian","JSON","nodes","edges","JSON"],"ko":["JSON","JSON 1.0","JSON","Obsidian","JSON","nodes","edges","JSON"],"es":["JSON Canvas","archivos de lienzo","Obsidian","formato de archivo abierto","dados de lienzo infinito","creación de archivos","edición de archivos"],"fr":["JSON Canvas","fichiers de canevas","Obsidian","format de fichier ouvert","données de canevas infini","création de fichiers","édition de fichiers"],"de":["JSON Canvas","Canvas-Dateien","Obsidian","offenes Dateiformat","infinite Canvas-Daten","Erstellung von Dateien","Bearbeitung von Dateien"],"pt":["json canvas","arquivo de canvas","dados de canvas infinito","formato de arquivo aberto","criação de arquivos de canvas","edição de arquivos de canvas"],"ru":["json канвас","файл канваса","бесконечные данные канваса","открытый формат файла","создание файлов канваса","редактирование файлов канваса"],"ar":["json كanvas","ملف الكanvas","بيانات الكanvas غير المحدودة","تنسيق ملف مفتوح","إنشاء ملفات الكanvas","حرر ملفات الكanvas"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"json-canvas","description":"Create and edit JSON Canvas files (.canvas) with nodes, edges, groups, and connections. Use when working with .canvas files, creating visual canvases, mind maps, flowcharts, or when the user mentions Canvas files in Obsidian.","bodyPreview":"# JSON Canvas Skill\n\nThis skill enables skills-compatible agents to create and edit valid JSON Canvas files (`.canvas`) used in Obsidian and other applications.\n\n## Overview\n\nJSON Canvas is an open file format for infinite canvas data. Canvas files use the `.canvas` extension and contain valid JSON following the [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/).\n\n## File Structure\n\nA canvas file contains two top-level arrays:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n- `nodes` (optio","body":"# JSON Canvas Skill\n\nThis skill enables skills-compatible agents to create and edit valid JSON Canvas files (`.canvas`) used in Obsidian and other applications.\n\n## Overview\n\nJSON Canvas is an open file format for infinite canvas data. Canvas files use the `.canvas` extension and contain valid JSON following the [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/).\n\n## File Structure\n\nA canvas file contains two top-level arrays:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n- `nodes` (optional): Array of node objects\n- `edges` (optional): Array of edge objects connecting nodes\n\n## Nodes\n\nNodes are objects placed on the canvas. There are four node types:\n- `text` - Text content with Markdown\n- `file` - Reference to files/attachments\n- `link` - External URL\n- `group` - Visual container for other nodes\n\n### Z-Index Ordering\n\nNodes are ordered by z-index in the array:\n- First node = bottom layer (displayed below others)\n- Last node = top layer (displayed above others)\n\n### Generic Node Attributes\n\nAll nodes share these attributes:\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `id` | Yes | string | Unique identifier for the node |\n| `type` | Yes | string | Node type: `text`, `file`, `link`, or `group` |\n| `x` | Yes | integer | X position in pixels |\n| `y` | Yes | integer | Y position in pixels |\n| `width` | Yes | integer | Width in pixels |\n| `height` | Yes | integer | Height in pixels |\n| `color` | No | canvasColor | Node color (see Color section) |\n\n### Text Nodes\n\nText nodes contain Markdown content.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"type\": \"text\",\n  \"x\": 0,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 200,\n  \"text\": \"# Hello World\\n\\nThis is **Markdown** content.\"\n}\n```\n\n#### Newline Escaping (Common Pitfall)\n\nIn JSON, newline characters inside strings **must** be represented as `\\n`. Do **not** use the literal sequence `\\\\n` in a `.canvas` file—Obsidian will render it as the characters `\\` and `n` instead of a line break.\n\nExamples:\n\n```json\n{ \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Line 1\\nLine 2\" }\n```\n\n```json\n{ \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Line 1\\\\nLine 2\" }\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `text` | Yes | string | Plain text with Markdown syntax |\n\n### File Nodes\n\nFile nodes reference files or attachments (images, videos, PDFs, notes, etc.).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4e5f67890\",\n  \"type\": \"file\",\n  \"x\": 500,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 300,\n  \"file\": \"Attachments/diagram.png\"\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"b2c3d4e5f6789012\",\n  \"type\": \"file\",\n  \"x\": 500,\n  \"y\": 400,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 300,\n  \"file\": \"Notes/Project Overview.md\",\n  \"subpath\": \"#Implementation\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `file` | Yes | string | Path to file within the system |\n| `subpath` | No | string | Link to heading or block (starts with `#`) |\n\n### Link Nodes\n\nLink nodes display external URLs.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"c3d4e5f678901234\",\n  \"type\": \"link\",\n  \"x\": 1000,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 200,\n  \"url\": \"https://obsidian.md\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `url` | Yes | string | External URL |\n\n### Group Nodes\n\nGroup nodes are visual containers for organizing other nodes.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"d4e5f6789012345a\",\n  \"type\": \"group\",\n  \"x\": -50,\n  \"y\": -50,\n  \"width\": 1000,\n  \"height\": 600,\n  \"label\": \"Project Overview\",\n  \"color\": \"4\"\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"e5f67890123456ab\",\n  \"type\": \"group\",\n  \"x\": 0,\n  \"y\": 700,\n  \"width\": 800,\n  \"height\": 500,\n  \"label\": \"Resources\",\n  \"background\": \"Attachments/background.png\",\n  \"backgroundStyle\": \"cover\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `label` | No | string | Text label for the group |\n| `background` | No | string | Path to background image |\n| `backgroundStyle` | No | string | Background rendering style |\n\n#### Background Styles\n\n| Value | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `cover` | Fills entire width and height of node |\n| `ratio` | Maintains aspect ratio of background image |\n| `repeat` | Repeats image as pattern in both directions |\n\n## Edges\n\nEdges are lines connecting nodes.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"f67890123456789a\",\n  \"fromNode\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"toNode\": \"a1b2c3d4e5f67890\"\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"0123456789abcdef\",\n  \"fromNode\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n  \"fromEnd\": \"none\",\n  \"toNode\": \"b2c3d4e5f6789012\",\n  \"toSide\": \"left\",\n  \"toEnd\": \"arrow\",\n  \"color\": \"1\",\n  \"label\": \"leads to\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Default | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|---------|-------------|\n| `id` | Yes | string | - | Unique identifier for the edge |\n| `fromNode` | Yes | string | - | Node ID where connection starts |\n| `fromSide` | No | string | - | Side where edge starts |\n| `fromEnd` | No | string | `none` | Shape at edge start |\n| `toNode` | Yes | string | - | Node ID where connection ends |\n| `toSide` | No | string | - | Side where edge ends |\n| `toEnd` | No | string | `arrow` | Shape at edge end |\n| `color` | No | canvasColor | - | Line color |\n| `label` | No | string | - | Text label for the edge |\n\n### Side Values\n\n| Value | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `top` | Top edge of node |\n| `right` | Right edge of node |\n| `bottom` | Bottom edge of node |\n| `left` | Left edge of node |\n\n### End Shapes\n\n| Value | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `none` | No endpoint shape |\n| `arrow` | Arrow endpoint |\n\n## Colors\n\nThe `canvasColor` type can be specified in two ways:\n\n### Hex Colors\n\n```json\n{\n  \"color\": \"#FF0000\"\n}\n```\n\n### Preset Colors\n\n```json\n{\n  \"color\": \"1\"\n}\n```\n\n| Preset | Color |\n|--------|-------|\n| `\"1\"` | Red |\n| `\"2\"` | Orange |\n| `\"3\"` | Yellow |\n| `\"4\"` | Green |\n| `\"5\"` | Cyan |\n| `\"6\"` | Purple |\n\nNote: Specific color values for presets are intentionally undefined, allowing applications to use their own brand colors.\n\n## Complete Examples\n\n### Simple Canvas with Text and Connections\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 150,\n      \"text\": \"# Main Idea\\n\\nThis is the central concept.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": -100,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"text\": \"## Supporting Point A\\n\\nDetails here.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": 100,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"text\": \"## Supporting Point B\\n\\nMore details.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Project Board with Groups\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f\",\n      \"type\": \"group\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 500,\n      \"label\": \"To Do\",\n      \"color\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a\",\n      \"type\": \"group\",\n      \"x\": 350,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 500,\n      \"label\": \"In Progress\",\n      \"color\": \"3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b\",\n      \"type\": \"group\",\n      \"x\": 700,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 500,\n      \"label\": \"Done\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 20,\n      \"y\": 50,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"## Task 1\\n\\nImplement feature X\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 370,\n      \"y\": 50,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"## Task 2\\n\\nReview PR #123\",\n      \"color\": \"2\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"0d1e2f3a4b5c6d7e\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 720,\n      \"y\": 50,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"## Task 3\\n\\n~~Setup CI/CD~~\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n### Research Canvas with Files and Links\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 300,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 400,\n      \"height\": 200,\n      \"text\": \"# Research Topic\\n\\n## Key Questions\\n\\n- How does X affect Y?\\n- What are the implications?\",\n      \"color\": \"5\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"2f3a4b5c6d7e8f9a\",\n      \"type\": \"file\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 150,\n      \"file\": \"Literature/Paper A.pdf\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3a4b5c6d7e8f9a0b\",\n      \"type\": \"file\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 150,\n      \"file\": \"Notes/Meeting Notes.md\",\n      \"subpath\": \"#Key Insights\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"4b5c6d7e8f9a0b1c\",\n      \"type\": \"link\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 400,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"url\": \"https://example.com/research\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"5c6d7e8f9a0b1c2d\",\n      \"type\": \"file\",\n      \"x\": 750,\n      \"y\": 150,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 250,\n      \"file\": \"Attachments/diagram.png\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"6d7e8f9a0b1c2d3e\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"2f3a4b5c6d7e8f9a\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"supports\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"7e8f9a0b1c2d3e4f\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"3a4b5c6d7e8f9a0b\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"informs\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8f9a0b1c2d3e4f5a\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"4b5c6d7e8f9a0b1c\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"toEnd\": \"arrow\",\n      \"color\": \"6\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"9a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"5c6d7e8f9a0b1c2d\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"visualized by\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Flowchart\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b7\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 200,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"**Start**\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 200,\n      \"y\": 100,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"Step 1:\\nGather data\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 200,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"**Decision**\\n\\nIs data valid?\",\n      \"color\": \"3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"Process data\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"Request new data\",\n      \"color\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"f5a6b7c8d9e0f1a2\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": 320,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"**End**\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"a6b7c8d9e0f1a2b3\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b7\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"bottom\",\n      \"toNode\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"toSide\": \"top\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b7c8d9e0f1a2b3c4\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"bottom\",\n      \"toNode\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"toSide\": \"top\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"c8d9e0f1a2b3c4d5\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"Yes\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"d9e0f1a2b3c4d5e6\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"left\",\n      \"toNode\": \"e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1\",\n      \"toSide\": \"right\",\n      \"label\": \"No\",\n      \"color\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"e0f1a2b3c4d5e6f7\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"top\",\n      \"fromEnd\": \"none\",\n      \"toNode\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"toEnd\": \"arrow\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"bottom\",\n      \"toNode\": \"f5a6b7c8d9e0f1a2\",\n      \"toSide\": \"top\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## ID Generation\n\nNode and edge IDs must be unique strings. Obsidian generates 16-character hexadecimal IDs:\n\n```json\n\"id\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\"\n\"id\": \"a3b2c1d0e9f8g7h6\"\n\"id\": \"1234567890abcdef\"\n```\n\nThis format is a 16-character lowercase hex string (64-bit random value).\n\n## Layout Guidelines\n\n### Positioning\n\n- Coordinates can be negative (canvas extends infinitely)\n- `x` increases to the right\n- `y` increases downward\n- Position refers to top-left corner of node\n\n### Recommended Sizes\n\n| Node Type | Suggested Width | Suggested Height |\n|-----------|-----------------|------------------|\n| Small text | 200-300 | 80-150 |\n| Medium text | 300-450 | 150-300 |\n| Large text | 400-600 | 300-500 |\n| File preview | 300-500 | 200-400 |\n| Link preview | 250-400 | 100-200 |\n| Group | Varies | Varies |\n\n### Spacing\n\n- Leave 20-50px padding inside groups\n- Space nodes 50-100px apart for readability\n- Align nodes to grid (multiples of 10 or 20) for cleaner layouts\n\n## Validation Rules\n\n1. All `id` values must be unique across nodes and edges\n2. `fromNode` and `toNode` must reference existing node IDs\n3. Required fields must be present for each node type\n4. `type` must be one of: `text`, `file`, `link`, `group`\n5. `backgroundStyle` must be one of: `cover`, `ratio`, `repeat`\n6. `fromSide`, `toSide` must be one of: `top`, `right`, `bottom`, `left`\n7. `fromEnd`, `toEnd` must be one of: `none`, `arrow`\n8. Color presets must be `\"1\"` through `\"6\"` or valid hex color\n\n## References\n\n- [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/)\n- [JSON Canvas GitHub](https://github.com/obsidianmd/jsoncanvas)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:11:38.172Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Visualization Agents needing to create and edit infinite canvas data in JSON format.","zh":"非常适合需要创建和编辑无限画布数据的JSON格式的数据可视化代理。","ja":"JSON形式の無限キャンバスデータを作成および編集する必要があるデータ可視化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"JSON 형식의 무한 캔버스 데이터를 생성하고 편집해야 하는 데이터 시각화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Visualización de Datos que necesitan crear y editar datos de lienzo infinito en formato JSON.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Visualisation de Données ayant besoin de créer et de modifier des données de toile infinie au format JSON.","de":"Ideal für Datenvisualisierungs-Agenten, die unendliche Canvas-Daten im JSON-Format erstellen und bearbeiten müssen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Visualização de Dados que necessitam criar e editar dados de canvas infinito em formato JSON.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов визуализации данных, которым необходимо создавать и редактировать данные бесконечного холста в формате JSON.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تصور البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء وتحرير بيانات لوحة لا نهائية بتنسيق JSON."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and manipulate valid JSON Canvas files (.canvas) following the JSON Canvas Spec 1.0, enabling seamless integration with Obsidian and other compatible applications through the manipulation of nodes and edges in the JSON structure.","zh":"赋予代理生成和操作符合JSON画布规范1.0的有效JSON画布文件（.canvas），通过在JSON结构中操作节点和边缘，实现与Obsidian和其他兼容应用程序的无缝集成。","ja":"JSON Canvas Spec 1.0に準拠した有効なJSON Canvasファイル（.canvas）を生成および操作する機能をエージェントに付与し、JSON構造内でノードとエッジを操作することで、Obsidianおよびその他の互換性のあるアプリケーションとのシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"JSON 캔버스 사양 1.0에 맞는 유효한 JSON 캔버스 파일(.canvas)을 생성하고 조작할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여하여 JSON 구조 내에서 노드와 에지를 조작함으로써 Obsidian 및 다른 호환되는 응용 프로그램과 원활한 통합을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar y manipular archivos válidos de JSON Canvas (.canvas) siguiendo la Especificación JSON Canvas 1.0, lo que permite una integración perfecta con Obsidian y otras aplicaciones compatibles mediante la manipulación de nodos y bordes en la estructura JSON.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et de manipuler des fichiers JSON Canvas valides (.canvas) conformes à la Spécification JSON Canvas 1.0, permettant une intégration transparente avec Obsidian et d''autres applications compatibles grâce à la manipulation des nœuds et des arêtes dans la structure JSON.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, gültige JSON Canvas-Dateien (.canvas) gemäß der JSON Canvas Spec 1.0 zu generieren und zu manipulieren, was eine nahtlose Integration mit Obsidian und anderen kompatiblen Anwendungen durch die Manipulation von Knoten und Kanten in der JSON-Struktur ermöglicht.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a gerar e manipular ficheiros JSON Canvas válidos (.canvas) seguindo a Especificação JSON Canvas 1.0, permitindo uma integração perfeita com o Obsidian e outras aplicações compatíveis através da manipulação de nós e arestas na estrutura JSON.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать и манипулировать действительными файлами JSON Canvas (.canvas) в соответствии со спецификацией JSON Canvas Spec 1.0, обеспечивая бесшовную интеграцию с Obsidian и другими совместимыми приложениями путем манипулирования узлами и связями в структуре JSON.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء ومعالجة ملفات JSON Canvas صالحة (.canvas) بموجب مواصفات JSON Canvas Spec 1.0، مما يمكن التكامل السلس مع Obsidian والتطبيقات المتوافقة الأخرى من خلال معالجة العقد والحواف في بنية JSON."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating interactive mind maps","Editing infinite canvas data for knowledge graphs","Generating JSON Canvas files for Obsidian plugins"],"zh":["创建交互式思维导图","编辑无限画布数据以用于知识图谱","为Obsidian插件生成JSON画布文件"],"ja":["インタラクティブなマインドマップの作成","知識グラフのための無限キャンバスデータの編集","ObsidianプラグインのためのJSON Canvasファイルの生成"],"ko":["대화형 마인드 맵 생성","지식 그래프를 위한 무한 캔버스 데이터 편집","Obsidian 플러그인용 JSON 캔버스 파일 생성"],"es":["Crear mapas mentales interactivos","Editar datos de lienzo infinito para grafos de conocimiento","Generar archivos JSON Canvas para plugins de Obsidian"],"fr":["Créer des cartes mentales interactives","Modifier des données de toile infinie pour des graphes de connaissances","Générer des fichiers JSON Canvas pour les plugins Obsidian"],"de":["Erstellen interaktiver Mind Maps","Bearbeiten von unendlichen Canvas-Daten für Wissensgraphen","Generieren von JSON Canvas-Dateien für Obsidian-Plugins"],"pt":["Criação de mapas mentais interativos","Edição de dados de canvas infinito para grafos de conhecimento","Geração de ficheiros JSON Canvas para plugins do Obsidian"],"ru":["Создание интерактивных ментальных карт","Редактирование данных бесконечного холста для графов знаний","Генерация файлов JSON Canvas для плагинов Obsidian"],"ar":["إنشاء خرائط ذهنية تفاعلية","تحرير بيانات لوحة لا نهائية لرسوم المعرفة","إنشاء ملفات JSON Canvas لإضافات Obsidian"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires compatibility with JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","Limited to applications supporting .canvas files"],"zh":["需要与JSON画布规范1.0兼容","仅限支持.canvas文件的应用程序"],"ja":["JSON Canvas Spec 1.0との互換性が必要",".canvasファイルをサポートするアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["JSON 캔버스 사양 1.0과 호환성이 필요함",".canvas 파일을 지원하는 응용 프로그램으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con la Especificación JSON Canvas 1.0","Limitado a aplicaciones que admiten archivos .canvas"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec la Spécification JSON Canvas 1.0","Limité aux applications prenant en charge les fichiers .canvas"],"de":["Erfordert Kompatibilität mit der JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","Beschränkt auf Anwendungen, die .canvas-Dateien unterstützen"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com a Especificação JSON Canvas 1.0","Limitado a aplicações que suportam ficheiros .canvas"],"ru":["Требуется совместимость со спецификацией JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","Ограничено приложениями, поддерживающими файлы .canvas"],"ar":["يتطلب التوافق مع مواصفات JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","مقتصر على التطبيقات التي تدعم ملفات .canvas"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
