:{"zh":"JSON Canvas 技术允许开发人员创建和编辑遵循 JSON Canvas Spec 1.0 的有效 JSON Canvas 文件","ja":"JSON Canvas スキルは、開発者が JSON Canvas Spec 1.0 に準拠した有効な JSON Canvas ファイルを作成および編集できるようにします","ko":"JSON Canvas 기술은 개발자가 JSON Canvas Spec 1.0을 준수하는有效한 JSON Canvas 파일을 생성하고 편집할 수 있게 해줍니다","es":"JSON Canvas es un formato de archivo abierto para datos de lienzo infinito, compatible con Obsidian y otras aplicaciones","fr":"JSON Canvas est un format de fichier ouvert pour les données de canevas infini, compatible avec Obsidian et d''autres applications","de":"JSON Canvas ist ein offenes Dateiformat für unendliche Canvas-Daten, kompatibel mit Obsidian und anderen Anwendungen","pt":"O JSON Canvas é um formato de arquivo aberto para dados de canvas infinito, permitindo a criação e edição de arquivos de canvas válidos.","ru":"JSON Canvas — это открытый формат файла для бесконечных данных холста, позволяющий создавать и редактировать действительные файлы холста.","ar":"JSON Canvas هو تنسيق ملف مفتوح للبيانات الشبكية غير المحدودة، يسمح بإنشاء وتحرير ملفات الشبكة سليمة.","en":""},"definition":{"en":""},"features":{"zh":["创建和编辑有效的 JSON Canvas 文件","支持 Obsidian 和其他应用程序","遵循 JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","包含 nodes 和 edges 两种顶级数组","用于存储无限画布数据"],"ja":["有効な JSON Canvas ファイルの作成および編集","Obsidian およびその他のアプリケーションをサポート","JSON Canvas Spec 1.0 に準拠","2 つのトップレベル配列 (nodes と edges) を含む","無限キャンバスデータの格納に使用"],"ko":["유효한 JSON Canvas 파일 생성 및 편집","Obsidian 및 기타 응용 프로그램 지원","JSON Canvas Spec 1.0 준수","두 개의 최상위 배열 (노드 및 에지) 포함","무한 캔버스 데이터 저장에 사용"],"es":["Creación y edición de archivos JSON Canvas","Compatibilidad con Obsidian y otras aplicaciones","Estructura de archivo basada en JSON","Soporte para nodos y aristas","Seguimiento de la especificación JSON Canvas 1.0"],"fr":["Création et édition de fichiers JSON Canvas","Compatibilité avec Obsidian et d''autres applications","Structure de fichier basée sur JSON","Prise en charge des nœuds et des arêtes","Suivi de la spécification JSON Canvas 1.0"],"de":["Erstellung und Bearbeitung von JSON-Canvas-Dateien","Kompatibilität mit Obsidian und anderen Anwendungen","Dateistruktur basierend auf JSON","Unterstützung für Knoten und Kanten","Einhaltung der JSON-Canvas-Spezifikation 1.0"],"pt":["Criação e edição de arquivos de canvas válidos","Suporte ao formato de arquivo .canvas","Compatibilidade com aplicativos como o Obsidian","Estrutura de arquivo baseada em JSON","Arrays de nodes e edges para representação de dados"],"ru":["Создание и редактирование действительных файлов холста","Поддержка формата файла .canvas","Совместимость с приложениями, такими как Obsidian","Структура файла на основе JSON","Массивы узлов и ребер для представления данных"],"ar":["إنشاء وتحرير ملفات الشبكة سليمة","دعم تنسيق الملف .canvas","التوافق مع التطبيقات مثل Obsidian","هيكل الملف dựa على JSON","مصفوفات العقد والحدود لتمثيل البيانات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["JSON Canvas","无限画布数据","Obsidian","JSON 文件","开发人员工具","数据存储"],"ja":["JSON Canvas","無限キャンバスデータ","Obsidian","JSON ファイル","開発者ツール","データストレージ"],"ko":["JSON Canvas","무한 캔버스 데이터","Obsidian","JSON 파일","개발자 도구","데이터 저장"],"es":["JSON Canvas","Obsidian","lienzo infinito","archivo JSON","edición de archivos","formato de archivo abierto","datos de lienzo","desarrollo de software"],"fr":["JSON Canvas","Obsidian","canevas infini","fichier JSON","édition de fichiers","format de fichier ouvert","données de canevas","développement de logiciels"],"de":["JSON Canvas","Obsidian","unendliches Canvas","JSON-Datei","Dateibearbeitung","offenes Dateiformat","Canvas-Daten","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["JSON Canvas","arquivo de canvas","formato de arquivo aberto","dados de canvas infinito","criação de arquivos de canvas","edição de arquivos de canvas","Obsidian","JSON"],"ru":["JSON Canvas","файл холста","открытый формат файла","бесконечные данные холста","создание файлов холста","редактирование файлов холста","Obsidian","JSON"],"ar":["JSON Canvas","ملف الشبكة","تنسيق ملف مفتوح","بيانات الشبكة غير المحدودة","إنشاء ملفات الشبكة","تحرير ملفات الشبكة","Obsidian","JSON"]}},"owner":"MrZhang123","repo":"ai-workspace","repoPath":"MrZhang123/ai-workspace","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"json-canvas","description":"Create and edit JSON Canvas files (.canvas) with nodes, edges, groups, and connections. Use when working with .canvas files, creating visual canvases, mind maps, flowcharts, or when the user mentions Canvas files in Obsidian.","bodyPreview":"# JSON Canvas Skill\n\nThis skill enables skills-compatible agents to create and edit valid JSON Canvas files (`.canvas`) used in Obsidian and other applications.\n\n## Overview\n\nJSON Canvas is an open file format for infinite canvas data. Canvas files use the `.canvas` extension and contain valid JSON following the [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/).\n\n## File Structure\n\nA canvas file contains two top-level arrays:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n- `nodes` (optio","body":"# JSON Canvas Skill\n\nThis skill enables skills-compatible agents to create and edit valid JSON Canvas files (`.canvas`) used in Obsidian and other applications.\n\n## Overview\n\nJSON Canvas is an open file format for infinite canvas data. Canvas files use the `.canvas` extension and contain valid JSON following the [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/).\n\n## File Structure\n\nA canvas file contains two top-level arrays:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n- `nodes` (optional): Array of node objects\n- `edges` (optional): Array of edge objects connecting nodes\n\n## Nodes\n\nNodes are objects placed on the canvas. There are four node types:\n- `text` - Text content with Markdown\n- `file` - Reference to files/attachments\n- `link` - External URL\n- `group` - Visual container for other nodes\n\n### Z-Index Ordering\n\nNodes are ordered by z-index in the array:\n- First node = bottom layer (displayed below others)\n- Last node = top layer (displayed above others)\n\n### Generic Node Attributes\n\nAll nodes share these attributes:\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `id` | Yes | string | Unique identifier for the node |\n| `type` | Yes | string | Node type: `text`, `file`, `link`, or `group` |\n| `x` | Yes | integer | X position in pixels |\n| `y` | Yes | integer | Y position in pixels |\n| `width` | Yes | integer | Width in pixels |\n| `height` | Yes | integer | Height in pixels |\n| `color` | No | canvasColor | Node color (see Color section) |\n\n### Text Nodes\n\nText nodes contain Markdown content.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"type\": \"text\",\n  \"x\": 0,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 200,\n  \"text\": \"# Hello World\\n\\nThis is **Markdown** content.\"\n}\n```\n\n#### Newline Escaping (Common Pitfall)\n\nIn JSON, newline characters inside strings **must** be represented as `\\n`. Do **not** use the literal sequence `\\\\n` in a `.canvas` file—Obsidian will render it as the characters `\\` and `n` instead of a line break.\n\nExamples:\n\n```json\n{ \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Line 1\\nLine 2\" }\n```\n\n```json\n{ \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Line 1\\\\nLine 2\" }\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `text` | Yes | string | Plain text with Markdown syntax |\n\n### File Nodes\n\nFile nodes reference files or attachments (images, videos, PDFs, notes, etc.).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4e5f67890\",\n  \"type\": \"file\",\n  \"x\": 500,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 300,\n  \"file\": \"Attachments/diagram.png\"\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"b2c3d4e5f6789012\",\n  \"type\": \"file\",\n  \"x\": 500,\n  \"y\": 400,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 300,\n  \"file\": \"Notes/Project Overview.md\",\n  \"subpath\": \"#Implementation\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `file` | Yes | string | Path to file within the system |\n| `subpath` | No | string | Link to heading or block (starts with `#`) |\n\n### Link Nodes\n\nLink nodes display external URLs.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"c3d4e5f678901234\",\n  \"type\": \"link\",\n  \"x\": 1000,\n  \"y\": 0,\n  \"width\": 400,\n  \"height\": 200,\n  \"url\": \"https://obsidian.md\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `url` | Yes | string | External URL |\n\n### Group Nodes\n\nGroup nodes are visual containers for organizing other nodes.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"d4e5f6789012345a\",\n  \"type\": \"group\",\n  \"x\": -50,\n  \"y\": -50,\n  \"width\": 1000,\n  \"height\": 600,\n  \"label\": \"Project Overview\",\n  \"color\": \"4\"\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"e5f67890123456ab\",\n  \"type\": \"group\",\n  \"x\": 0,\n  \"y\": 700,\n  \"width\": 800,\n  \"height\": 500,\n  \"label\": \"Resources\",\n  \"background\": \"Attachments/background.png\",\n  \"backgroundStyle\": \"cover\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|-------------|\n| `label` | No | string | Text label for the group |\n| `background` | No | string | Path to background image |\n| `backgroundStyle` | No | string | Background rendering style |\n\n#### Background Styles\n\n| Value | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `cover` | Fills entire width and height of node |\n| `ratio` | Maintains aspect ratio of background image |\n| `repeat` | Repeats image as pattern in both directions |\n\n## Edges\n\nEdges are lines connecting nodes.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"f67890123456789a\",\n  \"fromNode\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"toNode\": \"a1b2c3d4e5f67890\"\n}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"0123456789abcdef\",\n  \"fromNode\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\",\n  \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n  \"fromEnd\": \"none\",\n  \"toNode\": \"b2c3d4e5f6789012\",\n  \"toSide\": \"left\",\n  \"toEnd\": \"arrow\",\n  \"color\": \"1\",\n  \"label\": \"leads to\"\n}\n```\n\n| Attribute | Required | Type | Default | Description |\n|-----------|----------|------|---------|-------------|\n| `id` | Yes | string | - | Unique identifier for the edge |\n| `fromNode` | Yes | string | - | Node ID where connection starts |\n| `fromSide` | No | string | - | Side where edge starts |\n| `fromEnd` | No | string | `none` | Shape at edge start |\n| `toNode` | Yes | string | - | Node ID where connection ends |\n| `toSide` | No | string | - | Side where edge ends |\n| `toEnd` | No | string | `arrow` | Shape at edge end |\n| `color` | No | canvasColor | - | Line color |\n| `label` | No | string | - | Text label for the edge |\n\n### Side Values\n\n| Value | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `top` | Top edge of node |\n| `right` | Right edge of node |\n| `bottom` | Bottom edge of node |\n| `left` | Left edge of node |\n\n### End Shapes\n\n| Value | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `none` | No endpoint shape |\n| `arrow` | Arrow endpoint |\n\n## Colors\n\nThe `canvasColor` type can be specified in two ways:\n\n### Hex Colors\n\n```json\n{\n  \"color\": \"#FF0000\"\n}\n```\n\n### Preset Colors\n\n```json\n{\n  \"color\": \"1\"\n}\n```\n\n| Preset | Color |\n|--------|-------|\n| `\"1\"` | Red |\n| `\"2\"` | Orange |\n| `\"3\"` | Yellow |\n| `\"4\"` | Green |\n| `\"5\"` | Cyan |\n| `\"6\"` | Purple |\n\nNote: Specific color values for presets are intentionally undefined, allowing applications to use their own brand colors.\n\n## Complete Examples\n\n### Simple Canvas with Text and Connections\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 150,\n      \"text\": \"# Main Idea\\n\\nThis is the central concept.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": -100,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"text\": \"## Supporting Point A\\n\\nDetails here.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": 100,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"text\": \"## Supporting Point B\\n\\nMore details.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"8a9b0c1d2e3f4a5b\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Project Board with Groups\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f\",\n      \"type\": \"group\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 500,\n      \"label\": \"To Do\",\n      \"color\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a\",\n      \"type\": \"group\",\n      \"x\": 350,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 500,\n      \"label\": \"In Progress\",\n      \"color\": \"3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b\",\n      \"type\": \"group\",\n      \"x\": 700,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 500,\n      \"label\": \"Done\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 20,\n      \"y\": 50,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"## Task 1\\n\\nImplement feature X\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 370,\n      \"y\": 50,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"## Task 2\\n\\nReview PR #123\",\n      \"color\": \"2\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"0d1e2f3a4b5c6d7e\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 720,\n      \"y\": 50,\n      \"width\": 260,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"## Task 3\\n\\n~~Setup CI/CD~~\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": []\n}\n```\n\n### Research Canvas with Files and Links\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 300,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 400,\n      \"height\": 200,\n      \"text\": \"# Research Topic\\n\\n## Key Questions\\n\\n- How does X affect Y?\\n- What are the implications?\",\n      \"color\": \"5\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"2f3a4b5c6d7e8f9a\",\n      \"type\": \"file\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 150,\n      \"file\": \"Literature/Paper A.pdf\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"3a4b5c6d7e8f9a0b\",\n      \"type\": \"file\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 150,\n      \"file\": \"Notes/Meeting Notes.md\",\n      \"subpath\": \"#Key Insights\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"4b5c6d7e8f9a0b1c\",\n      \"type\": \"link\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 400,\n      \"width\": 250,\n      \"height\": 100,\n      \"url\": \"https://example.com/research\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"5c6d7e8f9a0b1c2d\",\n      \"type\": \"file\",\n      \"x\": 750,\n      \"y\": 150,\n      \"width\": 300,\n      \"height\": 250,\n      \"file\": \"Attachments/diagram.png\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"6d7e8f9a0b1c2d3e\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"2f3a4b5c6d7e8f9a\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"supports\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"7e8f9a0b1c2d3e4f\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"3a4b5c6d7e8f9a0b\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"informs\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"8f9a0b1c2d3e4f5a\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"4b5c6d7e8f9a0b1c\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"toEnd\": \"arrow\",\n      \"color\": \"6\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"9a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"5c6d7e8f9a0b1c2d\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"visualized by\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Flowchart\n\n```json\n{\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b7\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 200,\n      \"y\": 0,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"**Start**\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 200,\n      \"y\": 100,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"Step 1:\\nGather data\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 200,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 80,\n      \"text\": \"**Decision**\\n\\nIs data valid?\",\n      \"color\": \"3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"Process data\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 0,\n      \"y\": 200,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"Request new data\",\n      \"color\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"f5a6b7c8d9e0f1a2\",\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"x\": 400,\n      \"y\": 320,\n      \"width\": 150,\n      \"height\": 60,\n      \"text\": \"**End**\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"edges\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"a6b7c8d9e0f1a2b3\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"a0b1c2d3e4f5a6b7\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"bottom\",\n      \"toNode\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"toSide\": \"top\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"b7c8d9e0f1a2b3c4\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"bottom\",\n      \"toNode\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"toSide\": \"top\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"c8d9e0f1a2b3c4d5\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"right\",\n      \"toNode\": \"d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"label\": \"Yes\",\n      \"color\": \"4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"d9e0f1a2b3c4d5e6\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"c2d3e4f5a6b7c8d9\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"left\",\n      \"toNode\": \"e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1\",\n      \"toSide\": \"right\",\n      \"label\": \"No\",\n      \"color\": \"1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"e0f1a2b3c4d5e6f7\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"e4f5a6b7c8d9e0f1\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"top\",\n      \"fromEnd\": \"none\",\n      \"toNode\": \"b1c2d3e4f5a6b7c8\",\n      \"toSide\": \"left\",\n      \"toEnd\": \"arrow\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8\",\n      \"fromNode\": \"d3e4f5a6b7c8d9e0\",\n      \"fromSide\": \"bottom\",\n      \"toNode\": \"f5a6b7c8d9e0f1a2\",\n      \"toSide\": \"top\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n## ID Generation\n\nNode and edge IDs must be unique strings. Obsidian generates 16-character hexadecimal IDs:\n\n```json\n\"id\": \"6f0ad84f44ce9c17\"\n\"id\": \"a3b2c1d0e9f8g7h6\"\n\"id\": \"1234567890abcdef\"\n```\n\nThis format is a 16-character lowercase hex string (64-bit random value).\n\n## Layout Guidelines\n\n### Positioning\n\n- Coordinates can be negative (canvas extends infinitely)\n- `x` increases to the right\n- `y` increases downward\n- Position refers to top-left corner of node\n\n### Recommended Sizes\n\n| Node Type | Suggested Width | Suggested Height |\n|-----------|-----------------|------------------|\n| Small text | 200-300 | 80-150 |\n| Medium text | 300-450 | 150-300 |\n| Large text | 400-600 | 300-500 |\n| File preview | 300-500 | 200-400 |\n| Link preview | 250-400 | 100-200 |\n| Group | Varies | Varies |\n\n### Spacing\n\n- Leave 20-50px padding inside groups\n- Space nodes 50-100px apart for readability\n- Align nodes to grid (multiples of 10 or 20) for cleaner layouts\n\n## Validation Rules\n\n1. All `id` values must be unique across nodes and edges\n2. `fromNode` and `toNode` must reference existing node IDs\n3. Required fields must be present for each node type\n4. `type` must be one of: `text`, `file`, `link`, `group`\n5. `backgroundStyle` must be one of: `cover`, `ratio`, `repeat`\n6. `fromSide`, `toSide` must be one of: `top`, `right`, `bottom`, `left`\n7. `fromEnd`, `toEnd` must be one of: `none`, `arrow`\n8. Color presets must be `\"1\"` through `\"6\"` or valid hex color\n\n## References\n\n- [JSON Canvas Spec 1.0](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/)\n- [JSON Canvas GitHub](https://github.com/obsidianmd/jsoncanvas)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:11:39.609Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Visualization Agents needing to create and edit infinite canvas data in JSON Canvas format.","zh":"非常适合需要创建和编辑无限画布数据的JSON画布格式的数据可视化代理。","ja":"無限キャンバスデータをJSONキャンバス形式で作成および編集する必要があるデータ可視化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"무한 캔버스 데이터를 JSON 캔버스 형식으로 생성 및 편집해야 하는 데이터 시각화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de visualización de datos que necesitan crear y editar datos de lienzo infinito en formato JSON Canvas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de visualisation de données ayant besoin de créer et de modifier des données de canevas infini au format JSON Canvas.","de":"Perfekt für Data-Visualisierungs-Agents, die unendliche Canvas-Daten im JSON-Canvas-Format erstellen und bearbeiten müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Visualização de Dados que precisam criar e editar dados de canvas infinito no formato JSON Canvas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов визуализации данных, которым необходимо создавать и редактировать данные бесконечного холста в формате JSON Canvas.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المرئيين للبيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء وتحرير بيانات الشبكة غير المنتهية بالتنسيق JSON Canvas."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate and manipulate valid JSON Canvas files (.canvas) following the JSON Canvas Spec 1.0, enabling advanced data visualization and editing capabilities with top-level arrays for nodes and edges.","zh":"赋予代理生成和操作符合JSON画布规格1.0的有效JSON画布文件（.canvas），实现高级数据可视化和编辑功能，包括节点和边的顶级数组。","ja":"JSONキャンバス仕様1.0に準拠した有効なJSONキャンバスファイル（.canvas）を生成および操作するエージェントを可能にし、高度なデータ可視化および編集機能を実現します。ノードとエッジのトップレベル配列を提供します。","ko":"JSON 캔버스 사양 1.0에 준수하는 유효한 JSON 캔버스 파일(.canvas)을 생성 및 조작할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, 노드 및 에지의 최상위 배열을 통해 고급 데이터 시각화 및 편집 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar y manipular archivos JSON Canvas válidos (.canvas) siguiendo la especificación JSON Canvas 1.0, lo que permite capacidades avanzadas de visualización y edición de datos con matrices de nivel superior para nodos y aristas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer et de manipuler des fichiers JSON Canvas valides (.canvas) suivant la spécification JSON Canvas 1.0, permettant ainsi des capacités avancées de visualisation et de modification de données avec des tableaux de niveau supérieur pour les nœuds et les arêtes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, gültige JSON-Canvas-Dateien (.canvas) gemäß der JSON-Canvas-Spezifikation 1.0 zu generieren und zu manipulieren, wodurch erweiterte Datenvisualisierungs- und Bearbeitungsfunktionen mit Top-Level-Arrays für Knoten und Kanten ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar e manipular arquivos JSON Canvas válidos (.canvas) seguindo a Especificação JSON Canvas 1.0, possibilitando capacidades avançadas de visualização e edição de dados com matrizes de nível superior para nodos e arestas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать и манипулировать действительными файлами JSON Canvas (.canvas) в соответствии со спецификацией JSON Canvas 1.0, обеспечивая расширенные возможности визуализации и редактирования данных с верхнеуровневыми массивами для узлов и ребер.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على إنشاء وتحويل ملفات JSON Canvas صالحة (.canvas) اتباعًا لمواصفات JSON Canvas 1.0، ممّا يمكّن من إمكانيات متقدمة لمرئية البيانات وتحريرها باستخدام مصفوفات المستوى الأعلى للعقد والزوايا."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating interactive canvas visualizations","Editing existing JSON Canvas files for Obsidian and other applications","Generating nodes and edges for custom canvas data"],"zh":["创建交互式画布可视化","编辑现有的JSON画布文件，用于Obsidian和其他应用程序","生成自定义画布数据的节点和边"],"ja":["インタラクティブなキャンバス可視化を作成する","Obsidianおよびその他のアプリケーション用の既存のJSONキャンバスファイルを編集する","カスタムキャンバスデータのノードとエッジを生成する"],"ko":["대화형 캔버스 시각화를 생성","Obsidian 및 기타 애플리케이션용 기존 JSON 캔버스 파일 편집","사용자 지정 캔버스 데이터의 노드 및 에지 생성"],"es":["Creación de visualizaciones de lienzo interactivas","Edición de archivos JSON Canvas existentes para Obsidian y otras aplicaciones","Generación de nodos y aristas para datos de lienzo personalizados"],"fr":["Création de visualisations de canevas interactives","Édition de fichiers JSON Canvas existants pour Obsidian et d''autres applications","Génération de nœuds et d''arêtes pour des données de canevas personnalisées"],"de":["Erstellung interaktiver Canvas-Visualisierungen","Bearbeitung vorhandener JSON-Canvas-Dateien für Obsidian und andere Anwendungen","Generierung von Knoten und Kanten für benutzerdefinierte Canvas-Daten"],"pt":["Criar visualizações interativas de canvas","Editar arquivos JSON Canvas existentes para Obsidian e outras aplicações","Gerar nodos e arestas para dados de canvas personalizados"],"ru":["Создание интерактивных визуализаций холста","Редактирование существующих файлов JSON Canvas для Obsidian и других приложений","Генерация узлов и ребер для пользовательских данных холста"],"ar":["إنشاء مرئيات تفاعلية للشبكة","تحرير ملفات JSON Canvas الحالية للواجهة الحجرية والمؤسسات الأخرى","إنشاء العقد والزوايا لبيانات الشبكة المخصصة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires compatibility with JSON Canvas Spec 1.0","Limited to .canvas file format"],"zh":["需要兼容JSON画布规格1.0","仅限于.canvas文件格式"],"ja":["JSONキャンバス仕様1.0との互換性が必要",".canvasファイル形式に限定される"],"ko":["JSON 캔버스 사양 1.0과 호환성이 필요",".canvas 파일 형식으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con la especificación JSON Canvas 1.0","Limitado al formato de archivo .canvas"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec la spécification JSON Canvas 1.0","Limité au format de fichier .canvas"],"de":["Benötigt Kompatibilität mit der JSON-Canvas-Spezifikation 1.0","Begrenzt auf das Dateiformat .canvas"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com a Especificação JSON Canvas 1.0","Limitado ao formato de arquivo .canvas"],"ru":["Требует совместимости со спецификацией JSON Canvas 1.0","Ограничен форматом файла .canvas"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع مواصفات JSON Canvas 1.0","محدود بتنسيق ملف .canvas"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
