für die Datenspeicherung","Tool-Integration für die Erweiterung der Funktionalität","Best Practices für die Ergebnisvalidierung"],"pt":["Integração de agentes e cadeias","Uso de memória para processamento de dados","Integração de ferramentas para tarefas específicas","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos LLM personalizados","Otimização de desempenho e escalabilidade"],"ru":["Интеграция агентов и цепочек","Использование памяти для обработки данных","Интеграция инструментов для конкретных задач","Разработка индивидуальных приложений LLM","Оптимизация производительности и масштабируемости"],"ar":["دمج العوامل و السلاسل","استخدام الذاكرة لمعالجة البيانات","دمج الأدوات لمهام محددة","تطوير تطبيقات LLM مخصصة","تحسين الأداء و القابلية للتنمو"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LangChain","LLM","代理","链","内存","工具集成","高级应用"],"ja":["LangChain","LLM","エージェント","チェーン","メモリ","ツールの統合","高度なアプリケーション"],"ko":["LangChain","LLM","에이전트","체인","메모리","도구 통합","고급 애플리케이션"],"es":["LangChain","aplicaciones LLM","desarrollo de software","agentes personalizados","cadenas de procesamiento","integración de herramientas","validación de resultados","prácticas recomendadas"],"fr":["LangChain","applications LLM","développement de logiciels","agents personnalisés","chaînes de traitement","intégration d''outils","validation des résultats","bonnes pratiques"],"de":["LangChain","LLM-Anwendungen","Software-Entwicklung","benutzerdefinierte Agenten","Verarbeitungsketten","Tool-Integration","Ergebnisvalidierung","Best Practices"],"pt":["arquitetura LangChain","desenvolvimento de aplicativos LLM","integração de agentes","processamento de dados","otimização de desempenho","escalabilidade de aplicativos"],"ru":["архитектура LangChain","разработка приложений LLM","интеграция агентов","обработка данных","оптимизация производительности","масштабируемость приложений"],"ar":["هندسة لانغ تشين","تطوير تطبيقات LLM","دمج العوامل","معالجة البيانات","تحسين الأداء","قابلية التوسع لتطبيقات"]}},"owner":"pCruvinel","repo":"antig","repoPath":"pCruvinel/antig","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"langchain-architecture","description":"Design LLM applications using the LangChain framework with agents, memory, and tool integration patterns. Use when building LangChain applications, implementing AI agents, or creating complex LLM workflows.","bodyPreview":"# LangChain Architecture\n\nMaster the LangChain framework for building sophisticated LLM applications with agents, chains, memory, and tool integration.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to langchain architecture\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, ope","body":"# LangChain Architecture\n\nMaster the LangChain framework for building sophisticated LLM applications with agents, chains, memory, and tool integration.\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to langchain architecture\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\n## Use this skill when\n\n- Building autonomous AI agents with tool access\n- Implementing complex multi-step LLM workflows\n- Managing conversation memory and state\n- Integrating LLMs with external data sources and APIs\n- Creating modular, reusable LLM application components\n- Implementing document processing pipelines\n- Building production-grade LLM applications\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Agents\nAutonomous systems that use LLMs to decide which actions to take.\n\n**Agent Types:**\n- **ReAct**: Reasoning + Acting in interleaved manner\n- **OpenAI Functions**: Leverages function calling API\n- **Structured Chat**: Handles multi-input tools\n- **Conversational**: Optimized for chat interfaces\n- **Self-Ask with Search**: Decomposes complex queries\n\n### 2. Chains\nSequences of calls to LLMs or other utilities.\n\n**Chain Types:**\n- **LLMChain**: Basic prompt + LLM combination\n- **SequentialChain**: Multiple chains in sequence\n- **RouterChain**: Routes inputs to specialized chains\n- **TransformChain**: Data transformations between steps\n- **MapReduceChain**: Parallel processing with aggregation\n\n### 3. Memory\nSystems for maintaining context across interactions.\n\n**Memory Types:**\n- **ConversationBufferMemory**: Stores all messages\n- **ConversationSummaryMemory**: Summarizes older messages\n- **ConversationBufferWindowMemory**: Keeps last N messages\n- **EntityMemory**: Tracks information about entities\n- **VectorStoreMemory**: Semantic similarity retrieval\n\n### 4. Document Processing\nLoading, transforming, and storing documents for retrieval.\n\n**Components:**\n- **Document Loaders**: Load from various sources\n- **Text Splitters**: Chunk documents intelligently\n- **Vector Stores**: Store and retrieve embeddings\n- **Retrievers**: Fetch relevant documents\n- **Indexes**: Organize documents for efficient access\n\n### 5. Callbacks\nHooks for logging, monitoring, and debugging.\n\n**Use Cases:**\n- Request/response logging\n- Token usage tracking\n- Latency monitoring\n- Error handling\n- Custom metrics collection\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom langchain.agents import AgentType, initialize_agent, load_tools\nfrom langchain.llms import OpenAI\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationBufferMemory\n\n# Initialize LLM\nllm = OpenAI(temperature=0)\n\n# Load tools\ntools = load_tools([\"serpapi\", \"llm-math\"], llm=llm)\n\n# Add memory\nmemory = ConversationBufferMemory(memory_key=\"chat_history\")\n\n# Create agent\nagent = initialize_agent(\n    tools,\n    llm,\n    agent=AgentType.CONVERSATIONAL_REACT_DESCRIPTION,\n    memory=memory,\n    verbose=True\n)\n\n# Run agent\nresult = agent.run(\"What''s the weather in SF? Then calculate 25 * 4\")\n```\n\n## Architecture Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: RAG with LangChain\n```python\nfrom langchain.chains import RetrievalQA\nfrom langchain.document_loaders import TextLoader\nfrom langchain.text_splitter import CharacterTextSplitter\nfrom langchain.vectorstores import Chroma\nfrom langchain.embeddings import OpenAIEmbeddings\n\n# Load and process documents\nloader = TextLoader(''documents.txt'')\ndocuments = loader.load()\n\ntext_splitter = CharacterTextSplitter(chunk_size=1000, chunk_overlap=200)\ntexts = text_splitter.split_documents(documents)\n\n# Create vector store\nembeddings = OpenAIEmbeddings()\nvectorstore = Chroma.from_documents(texts, embeddings)\n\n# Create retrieval chain\nqa_chain = RetrievalQA.from_chain_type(\n    llm=llm,\n    chain_type=\"stuff\",\n    retriever=vectorstore.as_retriever(),\n    return_source_documents=True\n)\n\n# Query\nresult = qa_chain({\"query\": \"What is the main topic?\"})\n```\n\n### Pattern 2: Custom Agent with Tools\n```python\nfrom langchain.agents import Tool, AgentExecutor\nfrom langchain.agents.react.base import ReActDocstoreAgent\nfrom langchain.tools import tool\n\n@tool\ndef search_database(query: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Search internal database for information.\"\"\"\n    # Your database search logic\n    return f\"Results for: {query}\"\n\n@tool\ndef send_email(recipient: str, content: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Send an email to specified recipient.\"\"\"\n    # Email sending logic\n    return f\"Email sent to {recipient}\"\n\ntools = [search_database, send_email]\n\nagent = initialize_agent(\n    tools,\n    llm,\n    agent=AgentType.ZERO_SHOT_REACT_DESCRIPTION,\n    verbose=True\n)\n```\n\n### Pattern 3: Multi-Step Chain\n```python\nfrom langchain.chains import LLMChain, SequentialChain\nfrom langchain.prompts import PromptTemplate\n\n# Step 1: Extract key information\nextract_prompt = PromptTemplate(\n    input_variables=[\"text\"],\n    template=\"Extract key entities from: {text}\\n\\nEntities:\"\n)\nextract_chain = LLMChain(llm=llm, prompt=extract_prompt, output_key=\"entities\")\n\n# Step 2: Analyze entities\nanalyze_prompt = PromptTemplate(\n    input_variables=[\"entities\"],\n    template=\"Analyze these entities: {entities}\\n\\nAnalysis:\"\n)\nanalyze_chain = LLMChain(llm=llm, prompt=analyze_prompt, output_key=\"analysis\")\n\n# Step 3: Generate summary\nsummary_prompt = PromptTemplate(\n    input_variables=[\"entities\", \"analysis\"],\n    template=\"Summarize:\\nEntities: {entities}\\nAnalysis: {analysis}\\n\\nSummary:\"\n)\nsummary_chain = LLMChain(llm=llm, prompt=summary_prompt, output_key=\"summary\")\n\n# Combine into sequential chain\noverall_chain = SequentialChain(\n    chains=[extract_chain, analyze_chain, summary_chain],\n    input_variables=[\"text\"],\n    output_variables=[\"entities\", \"analysis\", \"summary\"],\n    verbose=True\n)\n```\n\n## Memory Management Best Practices\n\n### Choosing the Right Memory Type\n```python\n# For short conversations (< 10 messages)\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationBufferMemory\nmemory = ConversationBufferMemory()\n\n# For long conversations (summarize old messages)\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationSummaryMemory\nmemory = ConversationSummaryMemory(llm=llm)\n\n# For sliding window (last N messages)\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationBufferWindowMemory\nmemory = ConversationBufferWindowMemory(k=5)\n\n# For entity tracking\nfrom langchain.memory import ConversationEntityMemory\nmemory = ConversationEntityMemory(llm=llm)\n\n# For semantic retrieval of relevant history\nfrom langchain.memory import VectorStoreRetrieverMemory\nmemory = VectorStoreRetrieverMemory(retriever=retriever)\n```\n\n## Callback System\n\n### Custom Callback Handler\n```python\nfrom langchain.callbacks.base import BaseCallbackHandler\n\nclass CustomCallbackHandler(BaseCallbackHandler):\n    def on_llm_start(self, serialized, prompts, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"LLM started with prompts: {prompts}\")\n\n    def on_llm_end(self, response, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"LLM ended with response: {response}\")\n\n    def on_llm_error(self, error, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"LLM error: {error}\")\n\n    def on_chain_start(self, serialized, inputs, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"Chain started with inputs: {inputs}\")\n\n    def on_agent_action(self, action, **kwargs):\n        print(f\"Agent taking action: {action}\")\n\n# Use callback\nagent.run(\"query\", callbacks=[CustomCallbackHandler()])\n```\n\n## Testing Strategies\n\n```python\nimport pytest\nfrom unittest.mock import Mock\n\ndef test_agent_tool_selection():\n    # Mock LLM to return specific tool selection\n    mock_llm = Mock()\n    mock_llm.predict.return_value = \"Action: search_database\\nAction Input: test query\"\n\n    agent = initialize_agent(tools, mock_llm, agent=AgentType.ZERO_SHOT_REACT_DESCRIPTION)\n\n    result = agent.run(\"test query\")\n\n    # Verify correct tool was selected\n    assert \"search_database\" in str(mock_llm.predict.call_args)\n\ndef test_memory_persistence():\n    memory = ConversationBufferMemory()\n\n    memory.save_context({\"input\": \"Hi\"}, {\"output\": \"Hello!\"})\n\n    assert \"Hi\" in memory.load_memory_variables({})[''history'']\n    assert \"Hello!\" in memory.load_memory_variables({})[''history'']\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### 1. Caching\n```python\nfrom langchain.cache import InMemoryCache\nimport langchain\n\nlangchain.llm_cache = InMemoryCache()\n```\n\n### 2. Batch Processing\n```python\n# Process multiple documents in parallel\nfrom langchain.document_loaders import DirectoryLoader\nfrom concurrent.futures import ThreadPoolExecutor\n\nloader = DirectoryLoader(''./docs'')\ndocs = loader.load()\n\ndef process_doc(doc):\n    return text_splitter.split_documents([doc])\n\nwith ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=4) as executor:\n    split_docs = list(executor.map(process_doc, docs))\n```\n\n### 3. Streaming Responses\n```python\nfrom langchain.callbacks.streaming_stdout import StreamingStdOutCallbackHandler\n\nllm = OpenAI(streaming=True, callbacks=[StreamingStdOutCallbackHandler()])\n```\n\n## Resources\n\n- **references/agents.md**: Deep dive on agent architectures\n- **references/memory.md**: Memory system patterns\n- **references/chains.md**: Chain composition strategies\n- **references/document-processing.md**: Document loading and indexing\n- **references/callbacks.md**: Monitoring and observability\n- **assets/agent-template.py**: Production-ready agent template\n- **assets/memory-config.yaml**: Memory configuration examples\n- **assets/chain-example.py**: Complex chain examples\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Memory Overflow**: Not managing conversation history length\n2. **Tool Selection Errors**: Poor tool descriptions confuse agents\n3. **Context Window Exceeded**: Exceeding LLM token limits\n4. **No Error Handling**: Not catching and handling agent failures\n5. **Inefficient Retrieval**: Not optimizing vector store queries\n\n## Production Checklist\n\n- [ ] Implement proper error handling\n- [ ] Add request/response logging\n- [ ] Monitor token usage and costs\n- [ ] Set timeout limits for agent execution\n- [ ] Implement rate limiting\n- [ ] Add input validation\n- [ ] Test with edge cases\n- [ ] Set up observability (callbacks)\n- [ ] Implement fallback strategies\n- [ ] Version control prompts and configurations\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:12:27.263Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for LLM Application Developers building sophisticated agent systems with chains, memory, and tool integration.","zh":"适用于LLM应用开发人员构建具有链、内存和工具集成的复杂代理系统。","ja":"LLMアプリケーション開発者がチェーン、メモリ、ツール統合を備えた複雑なエージェントシステムを構築するために不可欠です。","ko":"체인, 메모리 및 툴 통합을 갖춘 복잡한 에이전트 시스템을 구축하는 LLM 애플리케이션 개발자에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los desarrolladores de aplicaciones LLM que crean sistemas de agentes sofisticados con cadenas, memoria y integración de herramientas.","fr":"Essentiel pour les développeurs d''applications LLM qui créent des systèmes d''agents sophistiqués avec des chaînes, une mémoire et une intégration d''outils.","de":"Wesentlich für LLM-Anwendungs-Entwickler, die komplexe Agentsysteme mit Ketten, Speicher und Werkzeugintegration erstellen.","pt":"Essencial para desenvolvedores de aplicações LLM que constroem sistemas de agentes sofisticados com cadeias, memória e integração de ferramentas.","ru":"Необходим для разработчиков приложений LLM, создающих сложные системы агентов с цепочками, памятью и интеграцией инструментов.","ar":"ضروري لمطوري تطبيقات LLM الذين يبنين أنظمة وكلاء متقدمة مع سلاسل وذاكرة وتكامل أدوات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables building complex LLM applications with structured agent workflows, memory persistence, and external tool orchestration using LangChain''s modular architecture for production-ready solutions.","zh":"能够使用LangChain的模块化架构构建具有结构化代理工作流、内存持久性和外部工具编排的复杂LLM应用程序，以实现生产就绪的解决方案。","ja":"LangChainのモジュラーなアーキテクチャを使用して、構造化されたエージェントワークフロー、メモリ永続化、および外部ツールのオーケストレーションを備えた複雑なLLMアプリケーションを構築し、プロダクションレディのソリューションを実現します。","ko":"LangChain의 모듈식 아키텍처를 사용하여 구조화된 에이전트 워크플로, 메모리 지속성 및 외부 툴 오케스트레이션을 갖춘 복잡한 LLM 애플리케이션을 구축하여 프로덕션 준비 솔루션을 달성합니다.","es":"Permite la creación de aplicaciones LLM complejas con flujos de trabajo de agentes estructurados, persistencia de memoria y orquestación de herramientas externas utilizando la arquitectura modular de LangChain para soluciones listas para producción.","fr":"Permet de créer des applications LLM complexes avec des flux de travail d''agents structurés, une persistance de mémoire et une orchestration d''outils externes en utilisant l''architecture modulaire de LangChain pour des solutions prêtes pour la production.","de":"Ermöglicht den Bau komplexer LLM-Anwendungen mit strukturierten Agenten-Workflows, Speicherpersistenz und externer Werkzeugorchestrierung unter Verwendung der modularen Architektur von LangChain für produktionsreife Lösungen.","pt":"Permite a construção de aplicações LLM complexas com fluxos de trabalho de agente estruturados, persistência de memória e orquestração de ferramentas externas usando a arquitetura modular do LangChain para soluções prontas para produção.","ru":"Позволяет создавать сложные приложения LLM с структурированными рабочими потоками агентов, сохранением памяти и оркестровкой внешних инструментов с использованием модульной архитектуры LangChain для готовых к производству решений.","ar":"يسمح ببناء تطبيقات LLM معقدة مع تدفقات عمل وكلاء مهيكلة وثبات السياق وتنسيق أدوات خارجية باستخدام هندسة LangChain الموديلارية للحلول الجاهزة للانتاج."},"useCases":{"en":["Architecting multi-step agent workflows with tool selection","Implementing conversational memory for persistent context","Integrating external APIs and data sources with LLMs","Optimizing chain execution for complex reasoning tasks","Debugging and tracing LangChain agent execution flows"],"zh":["架构具有工具选择的多步骤代理工作流","实现具有持久上下文的会话内存","将外部API和数据源与LLM集成","优化链执行以进行复杂的推理任务","调试和跟踪LangChain代理执行流"],"ja":["ツールの選択を備えたマルチステップエージェントワークフローをアーキテクチャ化する","永続的なコンテキストを備えた会話メモリを実装する","外部APIとデータソースをLLMと統合する","複雑な推論タスクのためにチェーンの実行を最適化する","LangChainエージェントの実行フローをデバッグしてトレースする"],"ko":["도구 선택을 갖춘 다단계 에이전트 워크플로 아키텍처","지속적인 컨텍스트를 갖춘 대화 메모리 구현","외부 API 및 데이터 소스를 LLM과 통합","복잡한 추론 작업을 위한 체인 실행 최적화","LangChain 에이전트 실행 흐름 디버깅 및 추적"],"es":["Diseñar flujos de trabajo de agentes multi-paso con selección de herramientas","Implementar memoria conversacional para contexto persistente","Integrar API externas y fuentes de datos con LLM","Optimizar la ejecución de cadenas para tareas de razonamiento complejas","Depurar y rastrear flujos de ejecución de agentes de LangChain"],"fr":["Concevoir des flux de travail d''agents multi-étapes avec sélection d''outils","Mettre en œuvre une mémoire conversationnelle pour un contexte persistant","Intégrer des API externes et des sources de données avec des LLM","Optimiser l''exécution de chaînes pour des tâches de raisonnement complexes","Déboguer et tracer les flux d''exécution d''agents de LangChain"],"de":["Mehrschrittige Agenten-Workflows mit Werkzeugauswahl entwerfen","Konversationsspeicher für persistierenden Kontext implementieren","Externe APIs und Datenquellen in LLM integrieren","Kettenausführung für komplexe Denkaufgaben optimieren","LangChain-Ausführungsflüsse von Agenten debuggen und nachverfolgen"],"pt":["Arquitetar fluxos de trabalho de agente multi-etapa com seleção de ferramentas","Implementar memória conversacional para contexto persistente","Integrar APIs e fontes de dados externas com LLMs","Otimizar a execução de cadeias para tarefas de raciocínio complexas","Depurar e rastrear fluxos de execução de agentes LangChain"],"ru":["Проектировать многоступенчатые рабочие потоки агентов с выбором инструментов","Реализовывать разговорную память для постоянного контекста","Интегрировать внешние API и источники данных с LLM","Оптимизировать выполнение цепочек для сложных задач рассуждения","Отлаживать и отслеживать потоки выполнения агентов LangChain"],"ar":["تصميم تدفقات عمل وكلاء متعددة المراحل مع اختيار أدوات","تنفيذ ذاكرة محادثة للسياق المستدام","دمج واجهات برمجة التطبيقات ومصادر البيانات الخارجية مع LLM","تحسين تشغيل السلاسل لل任务 المعقدة","تصحيح الأخطاء وتحديد تدفقات تنفيذ وكلاء LangChain"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment with LangChain installation","Needs API keys for LLM providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, etc.)","Limited to LangChain framework architecture patterns"],"zh":["需要具有LangChain安装的Python环境","需要LLM提供商（OpenAI、Anthropic等）的API密钥","仅限于LangChain框架架构模式"],"ja":["LangChainのインストールを備えたPython環境が必要","LLM提供者（OpenAI、Anthropicなど）のAPIキーが必要","LangChainフレームワークのアーキテクチャパターンに制限される"],"ko":["LangChain 설치가 포함된 Python 환경이 필요","LLM 공급자(OpenAI, Anthropic 등)의 API 키가 필요","LangChain 프레임워크 아키텍처 패턴으로 제한"],"es":["Requiere un entorno Python con instalación de LangChain","Necesita claves de API p