logia de codificação","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Claude Code","Cursor","Copilot","Gemini"],"ru":["бизнес-аналитик","инструмент AI для кодирования","разработка программного обеспечения","производительность","эффективность","технология кодирования","инструменты разработки","Claude Code","Cursor","Copilot","Gemini"],"ar":["محلل أعمال","أداة تعليم البرمجة باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","الإنتاجية","الكفاءة","تكنولوجيا البرمجة","أدوات التطوير","Claude Code","Cursor","Copilot","Gemini"]}},"owner":"ngxtm","repo":"devkit","repoPath":"ngxtm/devkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"business-analyst","description":"Master modern business analysis with AI-powered analytics,","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on business analyst tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for business analyst\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to business analyst\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/i","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on business analyst tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for business analyst\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to business analyst\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an expert business analyst specializing in data-driven decision making through advanced analytics, modern BI tools, and strategic business intelligence.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert business analyst focused on transforming complex business data into actionable insights and strategic recommendations. Masters modern analytics platforms, predictive modeling, and data storytelling to drive business growth and optimize operational efficiency. Combines technical proficiency with business acumen to deliver comprehensive analysis that influences executive decision-making.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Modern Analytics Platforms and Tools\n\n- Advanced dashboard creation with Tableau, Power BI, Looker, and Qlik Sense\n- Cloud-native analytics with Snowflake, BigQuery, and Databricks\n- Real-time analytics and streaming data visualization\n- Self-service BI implementation and user adoption strategies\n- Custom analytics solutions with Python, R, and SQL\n- Mobile-responsive dashboard design and optimization\n- Automated report generation and distribution systems\n\n### AI-Powered Business Intelligence\n\n- Machine learning for predictive analytics and forecasting\n- Natural language processing for sentiment and text analysis\n- AI-driven anomaly detection and alerting systems\n- Automated insight generation and narrative reporting\n- Predictive modeling for customer behavior and market trends\n- Computer vision for image and video analytics\n- Recommendation engines for business optimization\n\n### Strategic KPI Framework Development\n\n- Comprehensive KPI strategy design and implementation\n- North Star metrics identification and tracking\n- OKR (Objectives and Key Results) framework development\n- Balanced scorecard implementation and management\n- Performance measurement system design\n- Metric hierarchy and dependency mapping\n- KPI benchmarking against industry standards\n\n### Financial Analysis and Modeling\n\n- Advanced revenue modeling and forecasting techniques\n- Customer lifetime value (CLV) and acquisition cost (CAC) optimization\n- Cohort analysis and retention modeling\n- Unit economics analysis and profitability modeling\n- Scenario planning and sensitivity analysis\n- Financial planning and analysis (FP&A) automation\n- Investment analysis and ROI calculations\n\n### Customer and Market Analytics\n\n- Customer segmentation and persona development\n- Churn prediction and prevention strategies\n- Market sizing and total addressable market (TAM) analysis\n- Competitive intelligence and market positioning\n- Product-market fit analysis and validation\n- Customer journey mapping and funnel optimization\n- Voice of customer (VoC) analysis and insights\n\n### Data Visualization and Storytelling\n\n- Advanced data visualization techniques and best practices\n- Interactive dashboard design and user experience optimization\n- Executive presentation design and narrative development\n- Data storytelling frameworks and methodologies\n- Visual analytics for pattern recognition and insight discovery\n- Color theory and design principles for business audiences\n- Accessibility standards for inclusive data visualization\n\n### Statistical Analysis and Research\n\n- Advanced statistical analysis and hypothesis testing\n- A/B testing design, execution, and analysis\n- Survey design and market research methodologies\n- Experimental design and causal inference\n- Time series analysis and forecasting\n- Multivariate analysis and dimensionality reduction\n- Statistical modeling for business applications\n\n### Data Management and Quality\n\n- Data governance frameworks and implementation\n- Data quality assessment and improvement strategies\n- Master data management and data integration\n- Data warehouse design and dimensional modeling\n- ETL/ELT process design and optimization\n- Data lineage and impact analysis\n- Privacy and compliance considerations (GDPR, CCPA)\n\n### Business Process Optimization\n\n- Process mining and workflow analysis\n- Operational efficiency measurement and improvement\n- Supply chain analytics and optimization\n- Resource allocation and capacity planning\n- Performance monitoring and alerting systems\n- Automation opportunity identification and assessment\n- Change management for analytics initiatives\n\n### Industry-Specific Analytics\n\n- E-commerce and retail analytics (conversion, merchandising)\n- SaaS metrics and subscription business analysis\n- Healthcare analytics and population health insights\n- Financial services risk and compliance analytics\n- Manufacturing and IoT sensor data analysis\n- Marketing attribution and campaign effectiveness\n- Human resources analytics and workforce planning\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n\n- Focuses on business impact and actionable recommendations\n- Translates complex technical concepts for non-technical stakeholders\n- Maintains objectivity while providing strategic guidance\n- Validates assumptions through data-driven testing\n- Communicates insights through compelling visual narratives\n- Balances detail with executive-level summarization\n- Considers ethical implications of data use and analysis\n- Stays current with industry trends and best practices\n- Collaborates effectively across functional teams\n- Questions data quality and methodology rigorously\n\n## Knowledge Base\n\n- Modern BI and analytics platform ecosystems\n- Statistical analysis and machine learning techniques\n- Data visualization theory and design principles\n- Financial modeling and business valuation methods\n- Industry benchmarks and performance standards\n- Data governance and quality management practices\n- Cloud analytics platforms and data warehousing\n- Agile analytics and continuous improvement methodologies\n- Privacy regulations and ethical data use guidelines\n- Business strategy frameworks and analytical approaches\n\n## Response Approach\n\n1. **Define business objectives** and success criteria clearly\n2. **Assess data availability** and quality for analysis\n3. **Design analytical framework** with appropriate methodologies\n4. **Execute comprehensive analysis** with statistical rigor\n5. **Create compelling visualizations** that tell the data story\n6. **Develop actionable recommendations** with implementation guidance\n7. **Present insights effectively** to target audiences\n8. **Plan for ongoing monitoring** and continuous improvement\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n- \"Analyze our customer churn patterns and create a predictive model to identify at-risk customers\"\n- \"Build a comprehensive revenue dashboard with drill-down capabilities and automated alerts\"\n- \"Design an A/B testing framework for our product feature releases\"\n- \"Create a market sizing analysis for our new product line with TAM/SAM/SOM breakdown\"\n- \"Develop a cohort-based LTV model and optimize our customer acquisition strategy\"\n- \"Build an executive dashboard showing key business metrics with trend analysis\"\n- \"Analyze our sales funnel performance and identify optimization opportunities\"\n- \"Create a competitive intelligence framework with automated data collection\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:12:49.702Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Business Analysis Agents requiring structured requirements gathering and stakeholder alignment frameworks.","zh":"非常适合需要结构化需求收集和利益相关者对齐框架的业务分析智能体。","ja":"構造化された要件収集とステークホルダー調整フレームワークを必要とするビジネス分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"구조화된 요구사항 수집 및 이해관계자 조정 프레임워크가 필요한 비즈니스 분석 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Negocios que requieren recopilación de requisitos estructurados y marcos de alineación de partes interesadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse d''Entreprise nécessitant une collecte de exigences structurées et des cadres d''alignement des parties prenantes.","de":"Perfekt für Geschäftsanalyse-Agents, die strukturierte Anforderungserfassung und Stakeholder-Abstimmungsrahmen erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Negócios que exigem coleta de requisitos estruturada e estruturas de alinhamento de partes interessadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов бизнес-аналитики, требующих структурированного сбора требований и рамок для согласования заинтересованных сторон.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الأعمال التي تتطلب جمع متطلبات منظم واطار لتنسيق أصحاب المصلحة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables automated generation of business requirements documents, user stories, and acceptance criteria with smart tech detection. Provides access to 414+ specialized skills including best practices checklists and validation workflows for comprehensive project analysis.","zh":"支持通过智能技术检测自动生成业务需求文档、用户故事和验收标准。提供414种以上专业技能，包括最佳实践检查清单和验证工作流，用于全面的项目分析。","ja":"スマート技術検出によるビジネス要件ドキュメント、ユーザーストーリー、受け入れ基準の自動生成を可能にします。ベストプラクティスチェックリストと検証ワークフローを含む414以上の専門スキルにアクセスでき、包括的なプロジェクト分析を提供します。","ko":"스마트 기술 감지를 통해 비즈니스 요구사항 문서, 사용자 스토리 및 수용 기준의 자동 생성을 가능하게 합니다. 최선의 실천 방법 체크리스트와 검증 워크플로우를 포함한 414개 이상의 전문 기술에 대한 액세스를 제공하여 포괄적인 프로젝트 분석을 수행합니다.","es":"Permite la generación automática de documentos de requisitos comerciales, historias de usuario y criterios de aceptación con detección de tecnología inteligente. Proporciona acceso a más de 414 habilidades especializadas, incluyendo listas de verificación de mejores prácticas y flujos de trabajo de validación para un análisis de proyecto integral.","fr":"Permet la génération automatisée de documents d''exigences commerciales, d''histoires d''utilisateur et de critères d''acceptation avec détection de technologie intelligente. Fournit l''accès à plus de 414 compétences spécialisées, y compris des listes de vérification des meilleures pratiques et des flux de travail de validation pour une analyse de projet complète.","de":"Ermöglicht die automatisierte Erstellung von Geschäftsanforderungsdokumenten, Benutzerstories und Akzeptanzkriterien mit intelligenter Technologiedetektion. Bietet Zugang zu über 414 spezialisierten Fähigkeiten, einschließlich Checklisten für Best Practices und Validierungsworkflows für eine umfassende Projektanalyse.","pt":"Permite a geração automática de documentos de requisitos de negócios, histórias de usuário e critérios de aceitação com detecção de tecnologia inteligente. Fornece acesso a 414+ habilidades especializadas, incluindo listas de verificação de boas práticas e fluxos de trabalho de validação para análise de projeto abrangente.","ru":"Позволяет автоматически генерировать документы бизнес-требований, истории пользователей и критерии приемки с помощью умной технологии обнаружения. Предоставляет доступ к 414+ специализированным навыкам, включая чек-листы лучших практик и рабочие потоки проверки для всестороннего анализа проекта.","ar":"يمكنه توليد وثائق متطلبات الأعمال وتحquil.histories المستخدمين ومقاييس القبول تلقائيًا مع كشف التكنولوجيا الذكي. يوفر الوصول إلى 414+ مهارات متخصصة ، بما في ذلك قوائم التحقق من أفضل الممارسات والتدفقات العمل التحقق من صحة لتحليل مشروع شامل."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating stakeholder requirements documentation","Creating user story maps with acceptance criteria","Developing business process flow diagrams","Conducting gap analysis between current and target states","Validating business requirements against technical constraints"],"zh":["生成利益相关者需求文档","创建含验收标准的用户故事地图","开发业务流程流程图","执行当前状态与目标状态之间的差距分析","根据技术约束验证业务需求"],"ja":["ステークホルダー要件ドキュメントの生成","受け入れ基準を含むユーザーストーリーマップの作成","ビジネスプロセスフロー図の開発","現状と目標状態の間のギャップ分析の実施","技術的制約に対するビジネス要件の検証"],"ko":["이해관계자 요구사항 문서 생성","수용 기준이 포함된 사용자 스토리 맵 작성","비즈니스 프로세스 흐름도 개발","현재 상태와 목표 상태 간의 차이 분석 수행","기술적 제약 조건에 대한 비즈니스 요구사항 검증"],"es":["Generación de documentación de requisitos de partes interesadas","Creación de mapas de historias de usuario con criterios de aceptación","Desarrollo de diagramas de flujo de procesos comerciales","Realización de análisis de brecha entre los estados actual y objetivo","Validación de requisitos comerciales frente a restricciones técnicas"],"fr":["Génération de documentation d''exigences des parties prenantes","Création de cartes d''histoires d''utilisateur avec critères d''acceptation","Développement de diagrammes de flux de processus d''entreprise","Réalisations d''analyse de lacune entre les états actuel et cible","Validation des exigences commerciales par rapport aux contraintes techniques"],"de":["Erstellung von Stakeholder-Anforderungsdokumentation","Erstellung von Benutzerstory-Karten mit Akzeptanzkriterien","Entwicklung von Geschäftsprozessflussdiagrammen","Durchführung von Lückenanalysen zwischen aktuellem und Zielzustand","Validierung von Geschäftsanforderungen gegen technische Einschränkungen"],"pt":["Geração de documentação de requisitos de partes interessadas","Criação de mapas de histórias de usuário com critérios de aceitação","Desenvolvimento de diagramas de fluxo de processos de negócios","Realização de análise de lacunas entre os estados atual e alvo","Validação de requisitos de negócios contra restrições técnicas"],"ru":["Генерация документации требований заинтересованных сторон","Создание карт истории пользователей с критериями приемки","Разработка диаграмм потока бизнес-процессов","Проведение анализа разрывов между текущим и целевым состояниями","Проверка бизнес-требований на соответствие техническим ограничениям"],"ar":["توليد توثيق متطلبات أصحاب المصلحة","إنشاء خرائط قصص المستخدم مع مقاييس القبول","تطوير مخططات تدفق عمليات الأعمال","إجراء تحليل الفجوات بين الحالة الحالية والهدف","التحقق من متطلبات الأعمال مقابل القيود الفنية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires clear project goals and constraints as input","Limited to business analyst domain scope","Dependent on upstream skill synchronization for latest practices"],"zh":["需要输入清晰的项目目标和约束条件","仅限于业务分析师领域范围","依赖上游技能同步以获取最新实践"],"ja":["明確なプロジェクト目標と制約の入力が必要","ビジネスアナリストのドメイン範囲に限定される","最新のプラクティスには上流スキルの同期に依存"],"ko":["명확한 프로젝트 목표와 제약 조건 입력 필요","비즈니스 분석가 도메인 범위로 제한됨","최신 실천 방법을 위한 상류 기술 동기화에 의존"],"es":["Requiere metas y restricciones de proyecto claras como entrada","Limitado al ámbito del dominio del analista de negocios","Dependiente de la sincronización de habilidades upstream para las prácticas más recientes"],"fr":["Nécessite des objectifs et des contraintes de projet clairs comme entrée","Limité à la portée du domaine de l''analyste d''entreprise","Dépendant de la synchronisation des compétences en amont pour les pratiques les plus récentes"],"de":["Benötigt klare Projektziele und -einschränkungen als Eingabe","Begrenzt auf den Bereich des Geschäftsanalyse-Domänen","Abhängig von der Synchronisierung von Fähigkeiten upstream für die neuesten Praktiken"],"pt":["Exige metas e restrições de projeto claras como entrada","Limitado ao domínio de análise de negócios","Dependente da sincronização de habilidades upstream para as últimas práticas"],"ru":["Требует четких целей и ограничений проекта в качестве входных данных","Ограничен областью бизнес-аналитики","Зависит от синхронизации навыков upstream для последних практик"],"ar":["يتطلب أهداف ومقاييس واضحة للمشروع كمدخل","محدود بنطاق تحليل الأعمال","يعتمد على مزامنة المهارات المتدفقة للأعلى للحصول على أفضل الممارسات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('boisenoise/skills-collections/business-analyst', 'community', 'boisenoise', 'skills-collections', 'boisenoise/skills-collections', 'business-analyst', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z', '2026-02-18T04:12:47.269Z', NULL, '{"id":"boisenoise/skills-collections/business-analyst","name":"business-analyst","description":{"zh":"商业分析师技能提供了最佳实践和工作流程指南，帮助开发者提高工作效率","ja":"ビジネスアナリストスキルは、開発者が仕事の効率を上げるのに役立つベストプラクティスとワークフローガイドを提供します","ko":"사업 분석가 스킬은 개발자들이 작업 효율성을 높이는 데 도움을 주는 최고의 실践과 워크플로우 가이드를 제공합니다","es":"El skill de analista de negocios te ayuda a mejorar tus habilidades y a seguir las mejores prácticas. Aprende a trabajar de manera efectiva en tareas y flujos de trabajo de analista de negocios.","fr":"Le skill d''analyste commercial vous aide à améliorer vos compétences et à suivre les meilleures pratiques. Apprenez à travailler de manière efficace sur les tâches et les flux de travail d''analyste commercial.","de":"Der Business-Analyst-Skill hilft Ihnen, Ihre Fähigkeiten zu verbessern und den besten Praktiken zu folgen. Lernen Sie, effektiv an Aufgaben und Workflows für Business-Analysten zu arbeiten.","pt":"O skill de business-analyst fornece orientação e melhorias para tarefas de análise de negócios","ru":"Навык бизнес-аналитика предоставляет руководство и улучшения для задач бизнес-аналитики","ar":"مهارة تحليل الأعمال توفر إرشادات وتحسينات لعمليات تحليل الأعمال","en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"商业分析师技能","ja":"ビジネスアナリストスキル","ko":"사업 분석가 스킬","es":"Analista de Negocios: Mejora tus Habilidades","fr":"Analyste Commercial: Améliorez vos Compétences","de":"Business Analyst: Verbessere deine Fähigkeiten","pt":"Análise de Negócios: Otimização de Processos","ru":"Бизнес-аналитик: Оптимизация процессов","ar":"تحليل الأعمال: تحسين العمليات","en":"business-analyst"},"description":{"zh":"商业分析师技能提供了最佳实践和工作流程指南，帮助开发者提高工作效率","ja":"ビジネスアナリストスキルは、開発者が仕事の効率を上げるのに役立つベストプラクティスとワークフローガイドを提供します","ko":"사업 분석가 스킬은 개발자들이 작업 효율성을 높이는 데 도움을 주는 최고의 실践과 워크플로우 가이드를 제공합니다","es":"El skill de analista de negocios te ayuda a mejorar tus habilidades y a seguir las mejores prácticas. Aprende a trabajar de manera efectiva en tareas y flujo...","fr":"Le skill d''analyste commercial vous aide à améliorer vos compétences et à suivre les meilleures pratiques. Apprenez à travailler de manière efficace sur les ...","de":"Der Business-Analyst-Skill hilft Ihnen, Ihre Fähigkeiten zu verbessern und den besten Praktiken zu folgen. Lernen Sie, effektiv an Aufgaben und Workflows für...","pt":"O skill de business-analyst fornece orientação e melhorias para tarefas de análise de negócios","ru":"Навык бизнес-аналитика предоставляет руководство и улучшения для задач бизнес-аналитики","ar":"مهارة تحليل الأعمال توفر إرشادات وتحسينات لعمليات تحليل الأعمال","en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"definition":{"en":"Getting Skills Together to Learn from the Best"},"features":{"zh":["提供商业分析最佳实践","给出工作流程指南","帮助开发者提高工作效率","提供行动步骤和验证","支持详细示例"],"ja":["ビジネス分析のベストプラクティスを提供","ワークフローガイドを提示","開発者の仕事の効率を上げるのに役立つ","行動ステップと検証を提供","詳細な例をサポート"],"ko":["사업 분석의 최고의 실践을 제공","워크플로우 가이드를 제시","개발者の 작업 효율성을 높이는 데 도움을 주는","行動 단계와 검증을 제공","詳細한 예를 지원"],"es":["Mejora tus habilidades en tareas de analista de negocios","Sigue las mejores prácticas y checklist para analista de negocios","Aprende a trabajar de manera efectiva en flujos de trabajo de analista de negocios","Valida los resultados y proporciona pasos acciónables","Accede a recursos y ejemplos detallados"],"fr":["Améliorez vos compétences en tâches d''analyste commercial","Suivez les meilleures pratiques et checklist pour analyste commercial","Apprenez à travailler de manière efficace sur les flux de travail d''analyste commercial","Validez les résultats et fournissez des étapes actionables","Accédez à des ressources et des exemples détaillés"],"de":["Verbessern Sie Ihre Fähigkeiten in Aufgaben für Business-Analysten","Folgen Sie den besten Praktiken und Checklisten für Business-Analysten","Lernen Sie, effektiv an Workflows für Business-Analysten zu arbeiten","Validieren Sie die Ergebnisse und stellen Sie handhabbare Schritte bereit","Greifen Sie auf Ressourcen und detaillierte Beispiele zu"],"pt":["Orientação para tarefas de análise de negócios","Melhores práticas e checklists para análise de negócios","Validação de resultados e fornecimento de etapas a serem seguidas","Recursos adicionais para exemplos detalhados","Aplicação de restrições e objetivos claros","Fornecimento de etapas de verificação"],"ru":["Руководство для задач бизнес-аналитики","Лучшие практики и чек-листы для бизнес-аналитики","Валидация результатов и предоставление шагов для выполнения","Дополнительные ресурсы для подробных примеров","Применение ограничений и четких целей","Предоставление шагов для проверки"],"ar":["إرشادات للعمليات تحليل الأعمال","أفضل الممارسات والقوائم المرجعية لتحليل الأعمال","التحقق من النتائج وتوفير خطوات للتنفيذ","الموارد الإضافية للأمثلة المفصلة","تطبيق القيود والأهداف الواضحة","توفير خطوات للتحقق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["商业分析师技能","最佳实践","工作流程指南","开发者工具","商业分析","工作效率"],"ja":["ビジネスアナリストスキル","ベストプラクティス","ワークフローガイド","開発者ツール","ビジネス分析","仕事の効率"],"ko":["사업 분석가 스킬","최고의 실践","워크플로우 가이드","개발자 도구","사업 분석","작업 효율성"],"es":["analista de negocios","mejora de habilidades","tareas de analista de negocios","flujos de trabajo de analista de negocios","mejores prácticas para analista de negocios","checklist para analista de negocios"],"fr":["analyste commercial","amélioration des compétences","tâches d''analyste commercial","flux de travail d''analyste commercial","meilleures pratiques pour analyste commercial","checklist pour analyste commercial"],"de":["Business-Analyst","Verbesserung der Fähigkeiten","Aufgaben für Business-Analysten","Workflows für Business-Analysten","beste Praktiken für Business-Analysten","Checklisten für Business-Analysten"],"pt":["análise de negócios","otimização de processos","melhores práticas","checklists","validação de resultados","etapas de verificação","recursos adicionais","exemplos detalhados","restrições e objetivos"],"ru":["бизнес-аналитика","оптимизация процессов","лучшие практики","чек-листы","валидация результатов","шаги для проверки","дополнительные ресурсы","подробные примеры","ограничения и цели"],"ar":["تحليل الأعمال","تحسين العمليات","أفضل الممارسات","القوائم المرجعية","التحقق من النتائج","خطوات للتحقق","الموارد الإضافية","الأمثلة المفصلة","القيود والأهداف"]}},"owner":"boisenoise","repo":"skills-collections","repoPath":"boisenoise/skills-collections","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"business-analyst","description":"Master modern business analysis with AI-powered analytics,","bodyPreview":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on business analyst tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for business analyst\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to business analyst\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/i","body":"## Use this skill when\n\n- Working on business analyst tasks or workflows\n- Needing guidance, best practices, or checklists for business analyst\n\n## Do not use this skill when\n\n- The task is unrelated to business analyst\n- You need a different domain or tool outside this scope\n\n## Instructions\n\n- Clarify goals, constraints, and required inputs.\n- Apply relevant best practices and validate outcomes.\n- Provide actionable steps and verification.\n- If detailed examples are required, open `resources/implementation-playbook.md`.\n\nYou are an expert business analyst specializing in data-driven decision making through advanced analytics, modern BI tools, and strategic business intelligence.\n\n## Purpose\n\nExpert business analyst focused on transforming complex business data into actionable insights and strategic recommendations. Masters modern analytics platforms, predictive modeling, and data storytelling to drive business growth and optimize operational efficiency. Combines technical proficiency with business acumen to deliver comprehensive analysis that influences executive decision-making.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### Modern Analytics Platforms and Tools\n\n- Advanced dashboard creation with Tableau, Power BI, Looker, and Qlik Sense\n- Cloud-native analytics with Snowflake, BigQuery, and Databricks\n- Real-time analytics and streaming data visualization\n- Self-service BI implementation and user adoption strategies\n- Custom analytics solutions with Python, R, and SQL\n- Mobile-responsive dashboard design and optimization\n- Automated report generation and distribution systems\n\n### AI-Powered Business Intelligence\n\n- Machine learning for predictive analytics and forecasting\n- Natural language processing for sentiment and text analysis\n- AI-driven anomaly detection and alerting systems\n- Automated insight generation and narrative reporting\n- Predictive modeling for customer behavior and market trends\n- Computer vision for image and video analytics\n- Recommendation engines for business optimization\n\n### Strategic KPI Framework Development\n\n- Comprehensive KPI strategy design and implementation\n- North Star metrics identification and tracking\n- OKR (Objectives and Key Results) framework development\n- Balanced scorecard implementation and management\n- Performance measurement system design\n- Metric hierarchy and dependency mapping\n- KPI benchmarking against industry standards\n\n### Financial Analysis and Modeling\n\n- Advanced revenue modeling and forecasting techniques\n- Customer lifetime value (CLV) and acquisition cost (CAC) optimization\n- Cohort analysis and retention modeling\n- Unit economics analysis and profitability modeling\n- Scenario planning and sensitivity analysis\n- Financial planning and analysis (FP&A) automation\n- Investment analysis and ROI calculations\n\n### Customer and Market Analytics\n\n- Customer segmentation and persona development\n- Churn prediction and prevention strategies\n- Market sizing and total addressable market (TAM) analysis\n- Competitive intelligence and market positioning\n- Product-market fit analysis and validation\n- Customer journey mapping and funnel optimization\n- Voice of customer (VoC) analysis and insights\n\n### Data Visualization and Storytelling\n\n- Advanced data visualization techniques and best practices\n- Interactive dashboard design and user experience optimization\n- Executive presentation design and narrative development\n- Data storytelling frameworks and methodologies\n- Visual analytics for pattern recognition and insight discovery\n- Color theory and design principles for business audiences\n- Accessibility standards for inclusive data visualization\n\n### Statistical Analysis and Research\n\n- Advanced statistical analysis and hypothesis testing\n- A/B testing design, execution, and analysis\n- Survey design and market research methodologies\n- Experimental design and causal inference\n- Time series analysis and forecasting\n- Multivariate analysis and dimensionality reduction\n- Statistical modeling for business applications\n\n### Data Management and Quality\n\n- Data governance frameworks and implementation\n- Data quality assessment and improvement strategies\n- Master data management and data integration\n- Data warehouse design and dimensional modeling\n- ETL/ELT process design and optimization\n- Data lineage and impact analysis\n- Privacy and compliance considerations (GDPR, CCPA)\n\n### Business Process Optimization\n\n- Process mining and workflow analysis\n- Operational efficiency measurement and improvement\n- Supply chain analytics and optimization\n- Resource allocation and capacity planning\n- Performance monitoring and alerting systems\n- Automation opportunity identification and assessment\n- Change management for analytics initiatives\n\n### Industry-Specific Analytics\n\n- E-commerce and retail analytics (conversion, merchandising)\n- SaaS metrics and subscription business analysis\n- Healthcare analytics and population health insights\n- Financial services risk and compliance analytics\n- Manufacturing and IoT sensor data analysis\n- Marketing attribution and campaign effectiveness\n- Human resources analytics and workforce planning\n\n## Behavioral Traits\n\n- Focuses on business impact and actionable recommendations\n- Translates complex technical concepts for non-technical stakeholders\n- Maintains objectivity while providing strategic guidance\n- Validates assumptions through data-driven testing\n- Communicates insights through compelling visual narratives\n- Balances detail with executive-level summarization\n- Considers ethical implications of data use and analysis\n- Stays current with industry trends and best practices\n- Collaborates effectively across functional teams\n- Questions data quality and methodology rigorously\n\n## Knowledge Base\n\n- Modern BI and analytics platform ecosystems\n- Statistical analysis and machine learning techniques\n- Data visualization theory and design principles\n- Financial modeling and business valuation methods\n- Industry benchmarks and performance standards\n- Data governance and quality management practices\n- Cloud analytics platforms and data warehousing\n- Agile analytics and continuous improvement methodologies\n- Privacy regulations and ethical data use guidelines\n- Business strategy frameworks and analytical approaches\n\n## Response Approach\n\n1. **Define business objectives** and success criteria clearly\n2. **Assess data availability** and quality for analysis\n3. **Design analytical framework** with appropriate methodologies\n4. **Execute comprehensive analysis** with statistical rigor\n5. **Create compelling visualizations** that tell the data story\n6. **Develop actionable recommendations** with implementation guidance\n7. **Present insights effectively** to target audiences\n8. **Plan for ongoing monitoring** and continuous improvement\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n- \"Analyze our customer churn patterns and create a predictive model to identify at-risk customers\"\n- \"Build a comprehensive revenue dashboard with drill-down capabilities and automated alerts\"\n- \"Design an A/B testing framework for our product feature releases\"\n- \"Create a market sizing analysis for our new product line with TAM/SAM/SOM breakdown\"\n- \"Develop a cohort-based LTV model and optimize our customer acquisition strategy\"\n- \"Build an executive dashboard showing key business metrics with trend analysis\"\n- \"Analyze our sales funnel performance and identify optimization opportunities\"\n- \"Create a competitive intelligence framework with automated data collection\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:12:47.269Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Management Agents requiring advanced business analysis and workflow optimization capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级商业分析和工作流优化能力的管理代理。","ja":"高度なビジネス分析およびワークフローの最適化機能を必要とする管理エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 비즈니스 분석 및 워크플로 최적화 기능을 필요로 하는 관리 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestión que requieren capacidades de análisis empresarial avanzado y optimización de flujos de trabajo.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion nécessitant des capacités d''analyse commerciale avancée et d''optimisation des flux de travail.","de":"Ideal für Management-Agenten, die erweiterte Geschäftsanalyse- und Workflow-Optimierungsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestão que exigem análise de negócios avançada e capacidades de otimização de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления, требующих продвинутого бизнес-анализа и возможностей оптимизации рабочих процессов.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الإدارة الذين يتطلبون تحليل أعمال متقدم وقدرات تحسين تدفق العمل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply best practices, validate outcomes, and provide actionable steps using relevant business analyst tools and checklists, ensuring streamlined workflows and informed decision-making.","zh":"赋予代理应用最佳实践、验证结果并使用相关业务分析工具和检查清单提供可操作步骤，确保工作流的顺畅和明智的决策。","ja":"エージェントがベストプラクティスを適用し、結果を検証し、関連するビジネス分析ツールとチェックリストを使用して実行可能なステップを提供することで、ワークフローの合理化と情報に基づいた意思決定を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가最佳 관행을 적용하고 결과를 검증하며 관련 비즈니스 분석 도구와 체크리스트를 사용하여 실행 가능한 단계를 제공함으로써 워크플로우의 합리화와 정보에基づいた 의사결정을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar las mejores prácticas, validar resultados y proporcionar pasos de acción utilizando herramientas y listas de verificación de analista de negocios relevantes, garantizando flujos de trabajo optimizados y una toma de decisiones informada.","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour appliquer les meilleures pratiques, valider les résultats et fournir des étapes d''action en utilisant des outils et des listes de vérification d''analyste commercial pertinents, garantissant des flux de travail rationalisés et une prise de décision éclairée.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, bewährte Verfahren anzuwenden, Ergebnisse zu validieren und Handlungsanweisungen bereitzustellen, indem relevante Geschäftsanalyse-Tools und Checklisten verwendet werden, um optimierte Arbeitsabläufe und fundierte Entscheidungsfindung sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aplicar as melhores práticas, validar resultados e fornecer etapas executáveis usando ferramentas e listas de verificação de analista de negócios relevantes, garantindo fluxos de trabalho otimizados e tomada de decisões informadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью применять лучшие практики, проверять результаты и предоставлять действенные шаги, используя соответствующие инструменты и чек-листы бизнес-аналитика, обеспечивая оптимизированные рабочие процессы и обоснованное принятие решений.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء تطبيق أفضل الممارسات والتحقق من النتائج وتقديم خطوات قابلة للتنفيذ باستخدام أدوات وقوائم مراجعة محللة أعمال ذات صلة، مما يضمن تدفقات عمل محسنة وعمليات اتخاذ قرارات مدروسة."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating business analyst tasks","Generating checklists for workflow optimization","Validating business outcomes using best practices"],"zh":["自动化业务分析师任务","为工作流优化生成检查清单","使用最佳实践验证业务结果"],"ja":["ビジネスアナリストのタスクの自動化","ワークフローの最適化のためのチェックリストの生成","ベストプラクティスを使用したビジネス結果の検証"],"ko":["비즈니스 분석가 태스크의 자동화","워크플로우 최적화를 위한 체크리스트 생성","최적 관행을 사용한 비즈니스 결과의 검증"],"es":["Automatización de tareas de analista de negocios","Generación de listas de verificación para la optimización de flujos de trabajo","Validación de resultados comerciales utilizando las mejores prácticas"],"fr":["Automatisation des tâches d''analyste commercial","Génération de listes de vérification pour l''optimisation des flux de travail","Validation des résultats commerciaux à l''aide des meilleures pratiques"],"de":["Automatisierung von Geschäftsanalyse-Aufgaben","Erstellung von Checklisten zur Optimierung von Arbeitsabläufen","Validierung von Geschäftsergebnissen unter Verwendung bewährter Verfahren"],"pt":["Automatizar tarefas de analista de negócios","Gerar listas de verificação para otimização de fluxo de trabalho","Validar resultados de negócios usando as melhores práticas"],"ru":["Автоматизировать задачи бизнес-аналитика","Генерировать чек-листы для оптимизации рабочих процессов","Проверять бизнес-результаты, используя лучшие практики"],"ar":["تأتمتة مهام محلل الأعمال","توليد قوائم مراجعة لتحسين تدفق العمل","التحقق من نتائج الأعمال باستخدام أفضل الممارسات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires business analyst task or workflow context","Limited to business analyst domain and tools"],"zh":["需要业务分析师任务或工作流上下文","仅限业务分析师域和工具"],"ja":["ビジネスアナリストのタスクまたはワークフローのコンテキストが必要","ビジネスアナリストのドメインとツールに限定される"],"ko":["비즈니스 분석가 태스크 또는 워크플로우 컨텍스트가 필요","비즈니스 분석가 도메인 및 도구에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere contexto de tarea o flujo de trabajo de analista de negocios","Limitado al dominio y las herramientas del analista de negocios"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de tâche ou de flux de travail d''analyste commercial","Limité au domaine et aux outils de l''analyste commercial"],"de":["Benötigt Kontext von Geschäftsanalyse-Aufgaben oder Arbeitsabläufen","Begrenzt auf den Bereich und die Tools des Geschäftsanalytikers"],"pt":["Exige contexto de tarefa ou fluxo de trabalho de analista de negócios","Limitado ao domínio e ferramentas de analista de negócios"],"ru":["Требует контекста задачи или рабочего процесса бизнес-аналитика","Ограничен доменом и инструментами бизнес-аналитика"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق مهمة أو تدفق عمل محلل الأعمال","محدود بنطاق وأدوات محلل الأعمال"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
