 de execução flexíveis","comandos de linha de comando personalizáveis"],"ru":["местное развитие","отладка приложений LLM","мониторинг приложений LLM","всестороннее трассировки","готовые к производству панели","гибкие режимы выполнения","настраиваемые команды командной строки"],"ar":["التطوير المحلي","تصحيح الأخطاء لتطبيقات LLM","مراقبة تطبيقات LLM","ميزات التتبع الشامل","الوحات الجاهزة للإنتاج","أوضاع التشغيل المرنة","أوامر سطر الأوامر القابلة للتخصيص"]}},"owner":"comet-ml","repo":"opik","repoPath":"comet-ml/opik","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"local-dev","description":"Local development environment setup and commands. Use when helping with dev server, Docker, or local testing.","bodyPreview":"# Local Development\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n./scripts/dev-runner.sh --restart   # First time / full rebuild\n./scripts/dev-runner.sh --start     # Daily start (no rebuild)\n./scripts/dev-runner.sh --stop      # Stop everything\n./scripts/dev-runner.sh --verify    # Check status\n```\n\n## Modes\n\n| Mode | Command | Frontend | Use When |\n|------|---------|----------|----------|\n| Standard | `--restart` | localhost:5174 | Frontend work, full-stack |\n| BE-only | `--be-only-restart` | localhost:5173 | Bac","body":"# Local Development\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\n./scripts/dev-runner.sh --restart   # First time / full rebuild\n./scripts/dev-runner.sh --start     # Daily start (no rebuild)\n./scripts/dev-runner.sh --stop      # Stop everything\n./scripts/dev-runner.sh --verify    # Check status\n```\n\n## Modes\n\n| Mode | Command | Frontend | Use When |\n|------|---------|----------|----------|\n| Standard | `--restart` | localhost:5174 | Frontend work, full-stack |\n| BE-only | `--be-only-restart` | localhost:5173 | Backend-focused, faster rebuilds |\n\n## URLs\n\n- **Frontend**: localhost:5174 (standard) / localhost:5173 (BE-only)\n- **Backend API**: localhost:8080\n- **Health**: http://localhost:8080/health-check?name=all\n\n## Build Commands\n\n```bash\n./scripts/dev-runner.sh --build-be   # Backend only\n./scripts/dev-runner.sh --build-fe   # Frontend only\n./scripts/dev-runner.sh --lint-be    # Spotless\n./scripts/dev-runner.sh --lint-fe    # ESLint\n./scripts/dev-runner.sh --migrate    # DB migrations\n```\n\n## Logs\n\n```bash\ntail -f /tmp/opik-backend.log        # Backend\ntail -f /tmp/opik-frontend.log       # Frontend (standard)\ndocker logs -f opik-frontend-1       # Frontend (BE-only)\n```\n\n## SDK Config\n\n```bash\nexport OPIK_URL_OVERRIDE=''http://localhost:8080''\nexport OPIK_WORKSPACE=''default''\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Won''t start:**\n```bash\n./scripts/dev-runner.sh --verify\nlsof -i :8080                        # Port conflict?\n./scripts/dev-runner.sh --stop && ./scripts/dev-runner.sh --restart\n```\n\n**Build fails:**\n```bash\ncd apps/opik-backend && mvn clean install -DskipTests\ncd apps/opik-frontend && rm -rf node_modules && npm install\n```\n\n**Database issues:**\n```bash\n./scripts/dev-runner.sh --stop\n./opik.sh --clean                    # WARNING: deletes data\n./scripts/dev-runner.sh --restart\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:13:52.643Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for LLM and RAG system developers needing comprehensive tracing and automated evaluation for their applications","zh":"非常适合需要对其应用程序进行全面追踪和自动评估的LLM和RAG系统开发人员","ja":"LLMおよびRAGシステム開発者が自分のアプリケーションに詳細な追跡および自動評価を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"자신의 애플리케이션에 대한 포괄적인 추적 및 자동 평가가 필요한 LLM 및 RAG 시스템 개발자에게 적합","es":"Ideal para desarrolladores de sistemas LLM y RAG que necesitan un seguimiento integral y una evaluación automatizada para sus aplicaciones","fr":"Parfait pour les développeurs de systèmes LLM et RAG ayant besoin d''un suivi complet et d''une évaluation automatique pour leurs applications","de":"Perfekt für Entwickler von LLM- und RAG-Systemen, die eine umfassende Nachverfolgung und eine automatisierte Bewertung für ihre Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para desenvolvedores de sistemas LLM e RAG que necessitam de rastreamento abrangente e avaliação automatizada para suas aplicações","ru":"Идеально подходит для разработчиков систем LLM и RAG, которым необходим полный трассировка и автоматическая оценка для своих приложений","ar":"مثالي لمنطقيي تطوير أنظمة LLM و RAG الذين يحتاجون إلى تتبع شامل وتقييم آلي لأنظمتهم التطبيقية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to debug, evaluate, and monitor their applications with production-ready dashboards, utilizing scripts like dev-runner.sh for seamless restarts and verifications, and supporting modes such as Standard and BE-only for tailored development needs","zh":"赋予代理调试、评估和监控其应用程序的能力，具有生产就绪的仪表盘，利用dev-runner.sh等脚本实现无缝重启和验证，并支持标准和BE-only等模式以满足个性化的开发需求","ja":"エージェントに、dev-runner.shなどのスクリプトを使用してシームレスに再起動および検証を行い、StandardやBE-onlyなどのモードをサポートすることで、ターゲットに合わせた開発ニーズに対応するプロダクションレディのダッシュボードを利用して、アプリケーションをデバッグ、評価、監視する能力を付与する","ko":"dev-runner.sh와 같은 스크립트를 사용하여 無중단 재시작 및 검증을 수행하고 표준 및 BE 전용 등의 모드를 지원하여 맞춤형 개발需求에 대응하는 프로덕션 준비된 대시보드를 사용하여 에이전트가 애플리케이션을 디버깅, 평가 및 모니터링 할 수 있는 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a depurar, evaluar y supervisar sus aplicaciones con paneles de control listos para producción, utilizando scripts como dev-runner.sh para reinicios y verificaciones sin problemas, y admitiendo modos como Estándar y solo BE para necesidades de desarrollo personalizadas","fr":"Permet aux agents de déboguer, d''évaluer et de surveiller leurs applications avec des tableaux de bord prêts pour la production, en utilisant des scripts comme dev-runner.sh pour des redémarrages et des vérifications sans interruption, et en prenant en charge des modes tels que Standard et BE-only pour des besoins de développement sur mesure","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, ihre Anwendungen mit produktionsreifen Dashboards zu debuggen, zu bewerten und zu überwachen, indem sie Skripte wie dev-runner.sh für nahtlose Neustarts und Überprüfungen verwenden und Modi wie Standard und nur BE für maßge