のサポート","perfetto protobuf形式の出力","使いやすいコマンドラインインターフェース"],"ko":["빠른 러스트 기반 자바스크립트 번들링","sftrace를 사용한 성능 분석","LLVM XRay 지원","perfetto protobuf 형식 출력","사용하기 쉬운 명령줄 인터페이스"],"es":["Análisis de rendimiento rápido y preciso","Compatibilidad con Webpack","Trazado de llamadas a funciones de Rust","Conversión a formato perfetto protobuf","Depuración y análisis de rendimiento"],"fr":["Analyse de performance rapide et précise","Compatibilité avec Webpack","Traçage des appels de fonctions Rust","Conversion au format perfetto protobuf","Débogage et analyse des performances"],"de":["Schnelle und präzise Leistungsanalyse","Kompatibilität mit Webpack","Verfolgung von Rust-Funktionenaufrufen","Umwandlung in das perfetto-Protobuf-Format","Leistungsanalyse und -debugging"],"pt":["Otimização de desempenho para aplicativos JavaScript","API compatível com webpack","Uso de Rust para melhorar a eficiência","Rastreamento de funções Rust","Conversão para formato perfetto protobuf"],"ru":["Оптимизация производительности для приложений JavaScript","API, совместимый с webpack","Использование Rust для улучшения эффективности","Трассировка функций Rust","Преобразование в формат perfetto protobuf"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات JavaScript","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات المتوافقة مع webpack","استخدام روست لتحسين الكفاءة","تتبع دوال روست","تحويل إلى تنسيق perfetto protobuf"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Rspack","Sftrace","Rust","JavaScript","性能分析","故障诊断","LLVM XRay","perfetto"],"ja":["Rspack","Sftrace","Rust","JavaScript","パフォーマンス分析","トラブルシューティング","LLVM XRay","perfetto"],"ko":["Rspack","Sftrace","Rust","JavaScript","성능 분석","문제 해결","LLVM XRay","perfetto"],"es":["Rspack Sftrace","análisis de rendimiento","Webpack","Rust","sftrace","perfetto","protobuf","depuración","optimización"],"fr":["Rspack Sftrace","analyse de performance","Webpack","Rust","sftrace","perfetto","protobuf","débogage","optimisation"],"de":["Rspack Sftrace","Leistungsanalyse","Webpack","Rust","sftrace","perfetto","protobuf","Leistungsdebugging","Optimierung"],"pt":["rspack sftrace","otimização de desempenho","aplicativos JavaScript","API compatível com webpack","Rust","rastreamento de desempenho"],"ru":["rspack sftrace","оптимизация производительности","приложения JavaScript","API, совместимый с webpack","Rust","трассировка производительности"],"ar":["rspack sftrace","تحسين الأداء","تطبيقات JavaScript","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات المتوافقة مع webpack","روست","تتبع الأداء"]}},"owner":"web-infra-dev","repo":"rspack","repoPath":"web-infra-dev/rspack","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rspack-sftrace","description":"Use sftrace, which is based on LLVM Xray instrumentation, to trace all Rust function calls. This can be used for performance analysis and troubleshooting.","bodyPreview":"# Rspack Sftrace\n\n## Overview\n\nUse sftrace (LLVM XRay) to trace rspack''s Rust function calls and convert them to perfetto protobuf format for performance analysis and troubleshooting.\n\nDefault workflow: run inside the target example directory (for example `examples/react`) and store all trace artifacts in that directory (not `/tmp`).\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Build sftrace tools\n\n```sh\ngit clone https://github.com/quininer/sftrace\ncd sftrace\ncargo build --release\nmkdir \"$(./target/release/sftrace rec","body":"# Rspack Sftrace\n\n## Overview\n\nUse sftrace (LLVM XRay) to trace rspack''s Rust function calls and convert them to perfetto protobuf format for performance analysis and troubleshooting.\n\nDefault workflow: run inside the target example directory (for example `examples/react`) and store all trace artifacts in that directory (not `/tmp`).\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Build sftrace tools\n\n```sh\ngit clone https://github.com/quininer/sftrace\ncd sftrace\ncargo build --release\nmkdir \"$(./target/release/sftrace record --print-solib-install-dir)\"\ncp ./target/release/libsftrace.so \"$(./target/release/sftrace record --print-solib-install-dir)/\"\n```\n\n### 2) Build sftrace-enabled profiling binding (once per code change)\n\n```sh\nSFTRACE=1 pnpm build:binding:profiling\n```\n\n### 3) Optional: Generate a filter file from symbols\n\n`sftrace filter` works on function symbols from an object file (for rspack, the binding `.node` file).\n\n```sh\n# Enter the target example directory first\ncd examples/react\n\n# Prefer the locally built profiling binding from the monorepo\nBINDING_NODE=\"$(realpath ../../crates/node_binding/rspack.linux-x64-gnu.node)\"\n\n# Regex mode\nsftrace filter -p \"$BINDING_NODE\" -r ''finish_modules|FlagDependencyExportsPlugin'' -o sftrace.filter\n\n# List mode (one regex per line)\n# sftrace filter -p \"$BINDING_NODE\" --list symbols.list -o sftrace.filter\n```\n\nIf your binding file name differs by platform, replace the `.node` path accordingly.\n\n### 4) Record sftrace (example: build in `examples/react`)\n\nRun from the target example directory and keep outputs local to that example.\n\n```sh\ncd examples/react\n\nTRACE_DIR=\"sftrace-$(date +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S)\"\nmkdir -p \"$TRACE_DIR\"\n\n# Full trace\nsftrace record -o \"$TRACE_DIR/sf.log\" -- pnpm build\n\n# Filtered trace (requires sftrace.filter from step 3)\nsftrace record -f sftrace.filter -o \"$TRACE_DIR/sf.filtered.log\" -- pnpm build\n```\n\n### 5) Analyze sf.log\n\nConvert sftrace log to perfetto protobuf format.\n\n```sh\ncd examples/react\nTRACE_DIR=\"sftrace-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS\" # replace with your run directory\nsftrace convert \"$TRACE_DIR/sf.filtered.log\" -o \"$TRACE_DIR/sf.filtered.pb.gz\"\n```\n\n### 6) Optional: Visualization using [viztracer](https://github.com/gaogaotiantian/viztracer)\n\n```sh\nvizviewer --use_external_processor \"$TRACE_DIR/sf.filtered.pb.gz\"\n```\n\nUse this only for visualization.\n\n## Filtering Notes\n\n- `sftrace filter` matches function symbols by regex/list. It is not a first-class crate-path/module-path filter.\n- Filtering does not automatically keep all descendants. If a child function symbol does not match your filter, it may disappear from the trace.\n- Cross-thread relationships (for example via rayon) are not reconstructed as a single uninterrupted call chain.\n- For complete call stacks, record without filter (or with a broad filter) and narrow down during analysis.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:13:34.883Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Performance Optimization Agents needing advanced Rust-based JavaScript bundling and tracing capabilities with LLVM XRay and perfetto protobuf format support.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Rust 基础的 JavaScript 打包和跟踪功能的性能优化代理，支持 LLVM XRay 和 perfetto protobuf 格式。","ja":"パフォーマンス最適化エージェント向けに、RustベースのJavaScriptバンドルとトレーシング機能を必要とする場合に最適です。LLVM XRayとperfettoプロトコルバッファ形式をサポートしています。","ko":"성능 최적화 에이전트에게 적합하며, 고급 Rust 기반의 JavaScript 번들링 및 추적 기능과 LLVM XRay 및 perfetto 프로토콜 버퍼 형식 지원이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de optimización de rendimiento que necesitan capacidades de empaquetado y trazado avanzadas basadas en Rust para JavaScript, con soporte para LLVM XRay y formato de protocolo de datos perfetto.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''optimisation de performances nécessitant des capacités de regroupement et de traçage avancées basées sur Rust pour JavaScript, avec prise en charge de LLVM XRay et du format de protocole de données perfetto.","de":"Perfekt für Leistungs-Optimierungs-Agents, die erweiterte Rust-basierte JavaScript-Bündel- und Tracing-Funktionen mit Unterstützung für LLVM XRay und perfetto-Protobuf-Format benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de Desempenho que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de empacotamento de JavaScript baseado em Rust e de rastreamento com suporte ao LLVM XRay e ao formato de protocolo protobuf perfetto.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации производительности, требующих продвинутых возможностей пакетирования JavaScript на основе Rust и функций трассировки с поддержкой LLVM XRay и формата протобуф perfetto.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحسين الأداء التي تحتاج إلى możliwości متقدمة لتحزيم JavaScript باستخدام Rust ووظائف التتبع مع دعم LLVM XRay وتنسيق بروتوكول perfetto."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to trace rspack''s Rust function calls, convert them to perfetto protobuf format, and analyze performance using sftrace and webpack-compatible API, leveraging cargo build and LLVM XRay for in-depth troubleshooting.","zh":"赋予代理跟踪 rspack 的 Rust 函数调用、将其转换为 perfetto protobuf 格式并使用 sftrace 和 webpack 兼容 API 进行性能分析的能力，同时利用 cargo 构建和 LLVM XRay 进行深入故障排除。","ja":"エージェントに、rspack の Rust 関数呼び出しをトレースし、それを perfetto プロトコルバッファ形式に変換し、sftrace と webpack 互換 API を使用してパフォーマンスを分析する機能を提供します。また、cargo ビルドと LLVM XRay を使用した詳細なトラブルシューティングも可能です。","ko":"에이전트가 rspack의 Rust 함수 호출을 추적하고 이를 perfetto 프로토콜 버퍼 형식으로 변환하여 sftrace와 webpack 호환 API를 사용하여 성능을 분석할 수 있도록 합니다. 또한 cargo 빌드와 LLVM XRay를 사용하여 심층적인 문제 해결을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a rastrear las llamadas a funciones de Rust de rspack, convertirlas al formato de protocolo de datos perfetto y analizar el rendimiento utilizando sftrace y una API compatible con webpack, aprovechando cargo build y LLVM XRay para una depuración en profundidad.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traçer les appels de fonctions Rust de rspack, de les convertir au format de protocole de données perfetto et d''analyser les performances en utilisant sftrace et une API compatible avec webpack, en exploitant cargo build et LLVM XRay pour un débogage en profondeur.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, rspacks Rust-Funktionaufrufe zu verfolgen, sie in perfetto-Protobuf-Format umzuwandeln und die Leistung mit sftrace und einer webpack-kompatiblen API zu analysieren, indem cargo build und LLVM XRay für eine tiefere Fehlersuche genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a rastrear chamadas de funções Rust do rspack, convertê-las para o formato de protocolo protobuf perfetto e analisar o desempenho usando a API sftrace e compatível com webpack, aproveitando o cargo build e o LLVM XRay para solução de problemas em profundidade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отслеживать вызовы функций Rust в rspack, преобразовывать их в формат протобуф perfetto и анализировать производительность с помощью API sftrace и совместимой с webpack, используя cargo build и LLVM XRay для углубленной отладки.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تتبع呼فات دالة روست ل rspack، وتحويلها إلى تنسيق بروتوكول perfetto، وتحليل الأداء باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات sftrace و متوافقة مع webpack، واستخدام cargo build و LLVM XRay للتصحيح العميق."},"useCases":{"en":["Tracing Rust function calls for performance optimization","Converting trace artifacts to perfetto protobuf format for analysis","Debugging rspack builds using sftrace and LLVM XRay"],"zh":["用于性能优化的 Rust 函数调用跟踪","将跟踪工件转换为 perfetto protobuf 格式以进行分析","使用 sftrace 和 LLVM XRay 调试 rspack 构建"],"ja":["パフォーマンス最適化のためのRust関数呼び出しのトレース","トレース・アーティファクトをperfettoプロトコルバッファ形式に変換して分析する","sftraceとLLVM XRayを使用したrspackビルドのデバッグ"],"ko":["성능 최적화를 위한 Rust 함수 호출 추적","추적 아티팩트를 perfetto 프로토콜 버퍼 형식으로 변환하여 분석","sftrace와 LLVM XRay를 사용한 rspack 빌드 디버깅"],"es":["Rastrear llamadas a funciones de Rust para la optimización del rendimiento","Convertir artefactos de trazado al formato de protocolo de datos perfetto para el análisis","Depurar compilaciones de rspack utilizando sftrace y LLVM XRay"],"fr":["Traçer les appels de fonctions Rust pour l''optimisation des performances","Convertir les artefacts de traçage au format de protocole de données perfetto pour l''analyse","Déboguer les compilations de rspack en utilisant sftrace et LLVM XRay"],"de":["Verfolgen von Rust-Funktionaufrufen zur Leistungs-Optimierung","Konvertieren von Tracing-Artefakten in perfetto-Protobuf-Format für die Analyse","Fehlerbehebung bei rspack-Kompilierungen mit sftrace und LLVM XRay"],"pt":["Rastrear chamadas de funções Rust para otimização de desempenho","Converter artefatos de rastreamento para o formato de protocolo protobuf perfetto para análise","Depurar compilações do rspack usando sftrace e LLVM XRay"],"ru":["Отслеживать вызовы функций Rust для оптимизации производительности","Преобразовывать артефакты трассировки в формат протобуф perfetto для анализа","Отлаживать сборки rspack с помощью sftrace и LLVM XRay"],"ar":["تتبع呼فات دالة روست لتحسين الأداء","تحويل مصنّفات التتبع إلى تنسيق بروتوكول perfetto للتحليل","تصحيح أخطاء تحزيم rspack باستخدام sftrace و LLVM XRay"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust and cargo build setup","Limited to tracing rspack''s Rust function calls","Stores trace artifacts in the target example directory"],"zh":["需要 Rust 和 cargo 构建设置","仅限跟踪 rspack 的 Rust 函数调用","将跟踪工件存储在目标示例目录中"],"ja":["Rustとcargoビルドの設定が必要","rspackのRust関数呼び出しのトレースのみ","トレース・アーティファクトをターゲット例ディレクトリに保存"],"ko":["Rust와 cargo 빌드 설정이 필요","rspack의 Rust 함수 호출만 추적","추적 아티팩트를 대상 예제 디렉토리에 저장"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Rust y cargo build","Limitado al trazado de llamadas a funciones de Rust de rspack","Almacena los artefactos de trazado en el directorio de ejemplo de destino"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Rust et cargo build","Limité au traçage des appels de fonctions Rust de rspack","Stocke les artefacts de traçage dans le répertoire d''exemple cible"],"de":["Benötigt Rust- und cargo-Build-Setup","Begrenzt auf das Tracing von rspacks Rust-Funktionaufrufen","Speichert Tracing-Artefakte im Ziel-Beispiel-Verzeichnis"],"pt":["Exige configuração de Rust e cargo build","Limitado ao rastreamento de chamadas de funções Rust do rspack","Armazena artefatos de rastreamento no diretório de exemplo de destino"],"ru":["Требует настройки Rust и cargo build","Ограничен отслеживанием вызовов функций Rust в rspack","Хранит артефакты трассировки в целевом примере директории"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد روست و cargo build","محدود بتتبع呼فات دالة روست ل rspack","يخزن مصنّفات التتبع في دليل المثال المستهدف"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":40}');
