а соглашений","ar":"استعراض اتفاقية النДА: أداة لتحليل الاتفاقيات","en":"nda-review-jamie-tso"},"description":{"es":"El playbook de revisión de NDA es una herramienta para analizar y proporcionar recomendaciones para acuerdos comerciales. Soporta perspectivas de receptor o ...","fr":"Le playbook de révision de NDA est un outil pour analyser et fournir des recommandations pour les accords commerciaux. Prend en charge les perspectives de de...","de":"Das NDA-Überprüfungs-Playbook ist ein Tool zur Analyse und Empfehlung von Geschäftsvereinbarungen. Unterstützt die Perspektiven von Empfänger oder Offenlegung","pt":"A Revisão de NDA é uma ferramenta de análise de acordos que identifica riscos e questões legais em acordos comerciais. Ela fornece um resumo executivo e orie...","ru":"Проверка НДА - это инструмент для анализа соглашений, который выявляет риски и юридические проблемы в коммерческих соглашениях. Он предоставляет сводку руков...","ar":"استعراض اتفاقية النДА هي أداة لتحليل الاتفاقيات التي تحدد المخاطر والقضايا القانونية في الاتفاقيات التجارية. توفر ملخصًا تنفيذيًا وتوجيهات حول وضع العلامات ع...","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"es":["Análisis de acuerdos de no divulgación","Recomendaciones para acuerdos comerciales","Soporte para perspectivas de receptor o divulgador","Resumen ejecutivo y orientación de markup por cláusula","No garantiza la aplicabilidad jurisdiccional"],"fr":["Analyse des accords de non-divulgation","Recommandations pour les accords commerciaux","Prise en charge des perspectives de destinataire ou de divulgateur","Résumé exécutif et orientation de markup par clause","Ne garantit pas l''applicabilité juridictionnelle"],"de":["Analyse von Geheimhaltungsvereinbarungen","Empfehlungen für Geschäftsvereinbarungen","Unterstützung für die Perspektiven von Empfänger oder Offenlegung","Zusammenfassung und Markup-Anleitung pro Klausel","Garantiert keine jurisdiktionelle Anwendbarkeit"],"pt":["Revisão de acordos de não divulgação","Identificação de riscos e questões legais","Resumo executivo","Orientação de marcação de cláusulas","Suporte a perspectivas de receptor ou divulgador"],"ru":["Проверка соглашений о неразглашении информации","Выявление рисков и юридических проблем","Сводка руководства","Рекомендации по маркировке пунктов","Поддержка точек зрения получателя или раскрытия"],"ar":["استعراض اتفاقيات عدم الإفصاح عن المعلومات","تحديد المخاطر والقضايا القانونية","ملخص تنفيذي","توجيهات حول وضع العلامات على البنود","دعم وجهات نظر المستلم أو الكاشف"]},"keywords":{"es":["revisión de NDA","análisis de acuerdos","acuerdos comerciales","no divulgación","playbook de revisión","desarrollo de software","gestión de proyectos"],"fr":["révision de NDA","analyse des accords","accords commerciaux","non-divulgation","playbook de révision","développement de logiciels","gestion de projets"],"de":["NDA-Überprüfung","Analyse von Vereinbarungen","Geschäftsvereinbarungen","Geheimhaltung","Überprüfungs-Playbook","Software-Entwicklung","Projektmanagement"],"pt":["Revisão de NDA","Análise de acordos","Riscos legais","Questões legais","Acordos comerciais","NDA","Não divulgação"],"ru":["Проверка НДА","Анализ соглашений","Юридические риски","Юридические проблемы","Коммерческие соглашения","НДА","Неразглашение информации"],"ar":["استعراض اتفاقية النДА","تحليل الاتفاقيات","المخاطر القانونية","القضايا القانونية","الاتفاقيات التجارية","اتفاقية النДА","عدم الإفصاح عن المعلومات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.417Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nda-review-jamie-tso","description":"Guide to review incoming one-way (unilateral) commercial NDAs in a jurisdiction-agnostic way, from either a Recipient or Discloser perspective (user-selected), producing a clause-by-clause issue log with preferred redlines, fallbacks, rationales, owners, and deadlines.","version":"2025.12.30","bodyPreview":"# NDA Review Playbook (Commercial, Jurisdiction-Agnostic)\n\n## Overview\n\n| What this skill does | What it does not do |\n|---|---|\n| Reviews an NDA and outputs issues, risks, and suggested redlines | Provide jurisdiction-specific legal conclusions |\n| Supports *Recipient* or *Discloser* perspectives (user-chosen) | Guarantee enforceability |\n| Produces an executive summary + clause-by-clause markup guidance | Replace counsel for complex deals |\n\n**Scope limitation (important):** this playbook supp","body":"# NDA Review Playbook (Commercial, Jurisdiction-Agnostic)\n\n## Overview\n\n| What this skill does | What it does not do |\n|---|---|\n| Reviews an NDA and outputs issues, risks, and suggested redlines | Provide jurisdiction-specific legal conclusions |\n| Supports *Recipient* or *Discloser* perspectives (user-chosen) | Guarantee enforceability |\n| Produces an executive summary + clause-by-clause markup guidance | Replace counsel for complex deals |\n\n**Scope limitation (important):** this playbook supports **one-way (unilateral) commercial NDAs only**.\n\nIf the NDA is **mutual**, stop: this playbook is **out of scope** and you should escalate to counsel or use a separate mutual-NDA review approach.\n\n> **Variation callouts** appear throughout:\n> - **M&A / Due diligence**\n> - **Employment / contractor**\n> - **Investor / VC**\n\n## LEGAL DISCLAIMER\n\n**THIS IS NOT LEGAL ADVICE.** This skill is provided for informational and educational purposes only. Laws vary by jurisdiction and individual circumstances, and only a licensed attorney can provide advice tailored to your specific situation. When the NDA is high-risk, high-value, cross-border, or otherwise sensitive, escalate to qualified counsel.\n\n**Remember:** All outputs from this skill must be reviewed by a qualified legal professional before being used for any legal purposes.\n\n---\n\n## Inputs to collect (ask before reviewing)\n\n### A. Role and deal context (required)\n- [ ] Are we reviewing as **Recipient** (we receive confidential info) or **Discloser** (we disclose confidential info)?\n- [ ] Confirm the NDA is **one-way (unilateral)**. If it is **mutual**, stop: this playbook cannot be used.\n- [ ] What is the **purpose** / permitted use (e.g., evaluation of partnership, vendor RFP, diligence)?\n- [ ] What are the **parties** (legal names) and any **affiliates** that should be covered?\n- [ ] What information types are expected (tech, pricing, customer data, product roadmap, source code)?\n- [ ] Desired **timeline**: when do we need to sign?\n\n### B. Practical constraints (recommended)\n- [ ] Do we need to share with **affiliates**, advisors, contractors, auditors, or potential acquirers?\n- [ ] Will we need to **export** data across borders or store in cloud tools?\n- [ ] Will any **personal data** be shared? If yes, are there separate data-processing terms?\n\n> **Jurisdiction-agnostic note:** avoid asserting “this clause is invalid” without the governing law details; focus on *commercial risk*, *operational feasibility*, and *market norms*.\n\n## Deliverables (output format)\n\n### Quick start (default output template)\n\nALWAYS output:\n1) **Executive summary**\n2) **Clause-by-clause issue log** (single table)\n\n### A. Executive summary (1 page)\n- [ ] Party role (Recipient or Discloser) and confirmation it is one-way (unilateral)\n- [ ] Top 5 negotiation points (ranked)\n- [ ] “Sign as-is” / “Sign with changes” / “Escalate” recommendation\n\n### B. Clause-by-clause issue log (lawyer-style, thorough)\nUse a single table so counsel and business owners can track issues, owners, and deadlines.\n\n| Clause | Issue (1 line) | Risk (H/M/L) | Preferred redline | Fallback | Rationale (1–2 sentences) | Owner | Deadline |\n|---|---|---:|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Definition | Overbroad; includes unmarked info with no reasonableness |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Term & survival | Perpetual confidentiality for all information |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Use restriction | Purpose too broad; blocks internal evaluation |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Disclosures | Representatives undefined; strict liability |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Return/destruction | No backup carve-out |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Remedies | One-way fees + automatic injunction |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Liability | Indemnity + unlimited consequential damages |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Boilerplate | Assignment prohibits change of control |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n\n### Example (compact)\n\n**Executive summary (example skeleton):**\n- Role: Recipient (one-way NDA)\n- Recommendation: Sign with changes\n- Top 5 points: definition scope; term/survival; representatives; backup carve-out; remedies/fees\n\n**Issue log (example rows):**\n\n| Clause | Issue (1 line) | Risk (H/M/L) | Preferred redline | Fallback | Rationale (1–2 sentences) | Owner | Deadline |\n|---|---|---:|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Term & survival | Perpetual confidentiality for all information | H | Add 2–5 year survival; trade secret carve-out only | 5-year survival for all | Reduces indefinite operational burden while protecting truly sensitive info | Legal | Before signature |\n| Return/destruction | No backup carve-out | M | Add backup/legal hold exception + continued confidentiality | Allow retention in immutable backups only | Required for standard IT operations; avoids impossible compliance | Security + Legal | Before signature |\n\n## 5-step workflow\n\n### Step 1 — Identify stance (Recipient vs Discloser)\n- [ ] Confirm which side we are on for *this specific NDA* (titles are often misleading).\n- [ ] Confirm the NDA is **one-way (unilateral)**. If it is mutual, stop (out of scope).\n\n**Quick heuristic:**\n- If we are being asked to keep their info secret → we are **Recipient**.\n- If we are sharing our sensitive info → we are **Discloser** (if the NDA is mutual, stop: out of scope).\n\n### Step 2 — Triage the NDA (fast risk scan)\nFlag these immediately:\n- [ ] **Perpetual** confidentiality for *all* information (no trade secret distinction)\n- [ ] **Residuals clause** allowing use of “memory” or generalized knowledge\n- [ ] **Injunctive relief** + **attorneys’ fees** one-way against Recipient\n- [ ] **Indemnity** for breach or broad third-party claims\n- [ ] **No carve-outs** for compelled disclosure or prior knowledge\n- [ ] **Overbroad definition**: “all information, whether marked or not” with no reasonableness\n- [ ] **Affiliate coverage** missing when we must share internally\n\n> If any are present and the NDA matters, proceed with full review and consider escalation.\n\n### Step 3 — Clause-by-clause review (use the reference modules)\nUse these references while reviewing:\n- [Key clauses](references/KEY_CLAUSES.md)\n- [Party obligations](references/PARTY_OBLIGATIONS.md)\n- [Duration & scope](references/DURATION_SCOPE.md)\n- [Remedies & liability](references/REMEDIES_LIABILITY.md)\n- [Standard exceptions](references/STANDARD_EXCEPTIONS.md)\n\n### Step 4 — Draft redlines and negotiation positions\nFor each issue, produce:\n- **Preferred redline** (best risk outcome)\n- **Fallback position** (acceptable compromise)\n- **Rationale** (1–2 sentences: business + operational feasibility)\n- **Owner** (who needs to approve / negotiate: Legal, Sales, Security, Product)\n- **Deadline** (by when the counterparty needs the change)\n\n**Negotiation discipline:** do not propose 20 changes. Focus on the 5–10 that materially change risk.\n\n### Step 5 — Finalize the package\n- [ ] Ensure consistency (definitions used the same way everywhere)\n- [ ] Confirm operational feasibility (can we actually comply?)\n- [ ] Re-scan the Step 2 triage list and ensure each flagged item is represented in the issue log\n- [ ] Provide a short “what we changed and why” summary\n\n## Perspective-specific checklists\n\n### A. Recipient checklist (incoming NDA — typical case)\n\n| Topic | Red flags | Typical ask |\n|---|---|---|\n| Definition of Confidential Information | Overbroad; includes independently developed info; no marking/identification standard | Add reasonableness + identification standard; add exclusions |\n| Purpose / Permitted Use | Any use restriction beyond evaluation; bans on internal sharing | Tie to stated purpose; allow internal need-to-know |\n| Representatives | We are liable for any representative breach without control | Limit to those under written confidentiality; commercially reasonable care |\n| Term & survival | Perpetual for everything; unclear start date | Fixed term; longer only for trade secrets |\n| Return / destruction | Requires deletion of backups immediately | Add practical backup carve-out |\n| Remedies | One-way fees + broad injunction language | Mutuality or reasonableness; clarify equitable relief scope |\n| Liability / indemnity | Indemnity; unlimited damages; consequential damages | Cap or exclude categories; remove indemnity |\n| Residuals | Allows use of “retained in memory” | Delete or narrow heavily |\n\n> **M&A / Due diligence:** ensure diligence sharing (advisors, financing, affiliates) is permitted and that data room exports/notes are covered.\n\n### B. Discloser checklist (when we are sharing sensitive info)\n\n| Topic | Red flags | Typical ask |\n|---|---|---|\n| Definition | Too narrow; requires marking only; excludes oral disclosures | Add oral confirmation mechanism; broaden categories reasonably |\n| Security standard | Only “reasonable” with no baseline | Add minimum safeguards, or align with internal policy |\n| Exclusions | Too broad (e.g., “independently developed” with no proof) | Require written evidence of prior knowledge/independent development |\n| Term & survival | Too short | Extend for sensitive categories; trade secret survival |\n| Remedies | No equitable relief, no fees | Add equitable relief and/or fees (carefully) |\n\n> **Investor / VC:** watch for standstill, solicitation, and “no contact” provisions—these are not standard in plain NDAs and may need separate agreement.\n\n## Risk rating guide\n\n| Rating | Meaning | Example |\n|---:|---|---|\n| High | Creates material, uncapped, or operationally impossible risk | Broad indemnity + unlimited damages for any breach |\n| Medium | Risk is real but manageable with process controls | Strict notice deadlines for compelled disclosure |\n| Low | Mostly cosmetic or market-standard | Minor notice method issues |\n\n## Common pitfalls (issue → risk → fix)\n\n| Issue | Risk | Suggested fix |\n|---|---|---|\n| “All information is confidential forever” | Operational burden; unfair risk allocation | Add fixed term + trade secret carve-out |\n| No compelled disclosure carve-out | Breach if subpoenaed | Add “required by law” disclosure path |\n| Return/destruction requires purge of backups | Impossible to comply | Add backup and system integrity exception |\n| Recipient indemnifies discloser | Open-ended exposure | Remove indemnity; use direct damages only |\n| Residuals clause | Allows de facto use of confidential info | Delete or restrict to non-trade-secret, non-source-code |\n\n## Review prompts (copy/paste)\n\n### A. Minimal prompt (fast)\n- Role: Recipient/Discloser\n- NDA type: one-way (unilateral)\n- Purpose: …\n- Please produce (1) exec summary, (2) clause-by-clause issue log table with: Clause, Issue, Risk, Preferred redline, Fallback, Rationale, Owner, Deadline, (3) top 5 negotiation points.\n\n### B. Deep prompt (recommended)\n- Add constraints: affiliates, advisors, contractors, cross-border sharing, personal data, cloud tools.\n- Ask for: preferred redline + fallback + rationale per issue.\n\n## Ownership & timing defaults (if the user does not specify)\n\nUse these defaults to populate **Owner** and **Deadline** in the issue log:\n\n| Topic | Default owner | Default deadline |\n|---|---|---|\n| Confidentiality scope/definition, exceptions, term/survival | Legal | Before signature |\n| Security standards / audit rights | Security + Legal | Before signature |\n| Return/destruction and backups | Security + IT + Legal | Before signature |\n| Liability cap / damages / indemnity / fees | Legal + Finance | Before signature |\n| Operational constraints (representatives, affiliates, tooling) | Legal + Business owner | Before signature |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:13:30.557Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Contract Analysis Agents needing comprehensive NDA review capabilities with executive summaries and clause-by-clause markup guidance.","zh":"非常适合需要全面NDA审查功能的合同分析代理，包括执行摘要和逐条标记指导。","ja":"包括執行要約と条項ごとのマークアップガイダンスを含む、包括的なNDAレビュー機能を必要とする契約分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"포괄적인 NDA 검토 기능과 실행 요약 및 조항별 표시 지침이 필요한 계약 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de contratos que necesitan capacidades de revisión de NDA completas con resúmenes ejecutivos y orientación de marcaje clause por clause.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de contrats ayant besoin de capacités de révision de NDA complètes avec des résumés exécutifs et des conseils de marquage article par article.","de":"Perfekt für Vertragsanalyseagenten, die umfassende NDA-Überprüfungsfunktionen mit Executive-Zusammenfassungen und Klausel-für-Klausel-Markup-Anleitungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Contratos que necessitam de capacidades de revisão de NDA abrangentes com resumos executivos e orientação de marcação de cláusulas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа контрактов, которым необходимы всесторонние возможности проверки НДА с резюме и рекомендациями по маркировке пунктов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل العقود التي تحتاج إلى قدرات مراجعة شاملة لاتفاقيات النية مع ملخصات تنفيذية وتوجيهات تحديد البنود"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to review NDAs from both Recipient and Discloser perspectives, outputting issues, risks, and suggested redlines, utilizing jurisdiction-agnostic legal analysis and supporting commercial contract review protocols.","zh":"赋予代理审查NDA的能力，既可以从接收者也可以从披露者的角度进行，输出问题、风险和建议的修订线，利用管辖权不可知的法律分析并支持商业合同审查协议。","ja":"エージェントがNDAをレビューする能力を付与します。受取者と開示者の両方の視点から、問題、リスク、および提案された修正線を出力します。管轄区域不可知の法律分析を利用し、商用契約のレビュー・プロトコルをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 NDA를 검토할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여 수신자와 공개자의 관점에서 문제, 리스크 및 제안된 수정선을 출력하며, 관할 구역에 따라 달라지는 법적 분석을 사용하고 상업 계약 검토 프로토콜을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a revisar los NDA desde las perspectivas de destinatario y divulgador, generando cuestiones, riesgos y líneas rojas sugeridas, utilizando análisis jurídico agnóstico de jurisdicción y protocolos de revisión de contratos comerciales.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réviser les NDA du point de vue du destinataire et du divulgateur, produisant des questions, des risques et des lignes rouges suggérées, en utilisant une analyse juridique agnostique de la juridiction et des protocoles de révision de contrats commerciaux.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, NDA aus den Perspektiven von Empfänger und Offenlegungspartei zu überprüfen, und gibt Probleme, Risiken und vorgeschlagene rote Linien aus, unter Verwendung jurisdiktionsagnostischer Rechtsanalyse und Unterstützung kommerzieller Vertragsprüfprotokolle.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a revisar NDA''s tanto da perspectiva do Recipient quanto do Discloser, produzindo questões, riscos e sugestões de alterações, utilizando análise jurídica agnóstica de jurisdição e apoiando protocolos de revisão de contratos comerciais.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проверять НДА с точки зрения как получателя, так и раскрытия, выводя проблемы, риски и предлагаемые исправления, используя юрисдикционно-агностический юридический анализ и поддержку коммерческих протоколов проверки контрактов.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من مراجعة اتفاقيات النية من وجهة نظر كلا الطرفين، وإخراج القضايا والأخطار والتعديلات المقترحة، باستخدام تحليل قانوني غير محدد الولاية ودعم بروتوكولات مراجعة العقود التجارية"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating NDA reviews for commercial contracts","Generating executive summaries for contract negotiations","Identifying potential risks and issues in NDAs"],"zh":["商业合同的NDA自动审查","为合同谈判生成执行摘要","在NDA中识别潜在风险和问题"],"ja":["商用契約のNDA自動レビュー","契約交渉のための実行要約の生成","NDA内での潜在的なリスクと問題の特定"],"ko":["상업 계약의 NDA 자동 검토","계약 협상의 실행 요약 생성","NDA 내의 잠재적 리스크 및 문제 식별"],"es":["Automatización de revisiones de NDA para contratos comerciales","Generación de resúmenes ejecutivos para negociaciones de contratos","Identificación de posibles riesgos y cuestiones en los NDA"],"fr":["Automatisation des révisions de NDA pour les contrats commerciaux","Génération de résumés exécutifs pour les négociations de contrats","Identification de risques et de questions potentiels dans les NDA"],"de":["Automatisierung von NDA-Überprüfungen für Handelsverträge","Generierung von Executive-Zusammenfassungen für Vertragsverhandlungen","Identifizierung potenzieller Risiken und Fragen in NDA"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de NDA para contratos comerciais","Gerar resumos executivos para negociações de contratos","Identificar riscos e questões potenciais em NDA''s"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку НДА для коммерческих контрактов","Генерировать резюме для переговоров по контрактам","Определить потенциальные риски и проблемы в НДА"],"ar":["تأتمتية مراجعة اتفاقيات النية للعقود التجارية","generando ملخصات تنفيذية لمفاوضات العقود","تحديد المخاطر والمسائل المحتملة في اتفاقيات النية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Does not provide jurisdiction-specific legal conclusions","Does not guarantee enforceability of contracts","Should not replace counsel for complex deals"],"zh":["不提供管辖区域特定的法律结论","不保证合同的可强制执行性","不应替代复杂交易中的法律顾问"],"ja":["管轄区域特有の法律的結論を提供しない","契約の強制可能性を保証しない","複雑な取引では法律顧問に置き換えるべきでない"],"ko":["관할 구역 특有的 법적 결론을 제공하지 않음","계약의 강제 가능성을 보장하지 않음","복잡한 거래에서는 법률 자문을 대신해서는 안됨"],"es":["No proporciona conclusiones jurídicas específicas de la jurisdicción","No garantiza la ejecución de los contratos","No debe reemplazar el asesoramiento para tratos complejos"],"fr":["Ne fournit pas de conclusions juridiques spécifiques à la juridiction","Ne garantit pas l''exécution des contrats","Ne doit pas remplacer les conseils pour les affaires complexes"],"de":["Stellt keine jurisdiktionspezifischen Rechtsfolgen bereit","Garantiert nicht die Durchsetzbarkeit von Verträgen","Sollte nicht den Rechtsrat für komplexe Deals ersetzen"],"pt":["Não fornece conclusões jurídicas específicas da jurisdição","Não garante a executoriedade dos contratos","Não deve substituir o aconselhamento para negócios complexos"],"ru":["Не предоставляет юрисдикционно-специфические юридические выводы","Не гарантирует исполнимость контрактов","Не должен заменять консультации для сложных сделок"],"ar":["لا يوفر استنتاجات قانونية محددة للولاية","لا يضمن تنفيذ العقود","لا ينبغي أن يحل محل الاستشارة للصفقات المعقدة"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
