リバンドラーで、高速なビルドと自動型宣言の生成を提供する","ko":"tsdown은 Rolldown과 Oxc를 기반으로 하는 차세대 TypeScript 라이브러리 번들러로, 빠른 빌드와 자동 유형 선언 생성을 제공합니다","es":"tsdown es una biblioteca de TypeScript para Next.js que ofrece compilaciones rápidas y generación automática de .d.ts","fr":"tsdown est une bibliothèque TypeScript pour Next.js qui offre des compilations rapides et une génération automatique de .d.ts","de":"tsdown ist eine TypeScript-Bibliothek für Next.js, die schnelle Kompilierungen und automatische Generierung von .d.ts bietet","pt":"O tsdown é uma biblioteca de build de próxima geração para Next.js, oferecendo compilações rápidas e gerenciamento de dependências inteligente","ru":"Tsdown - это библиотека сборки следующего поколения для Next.js, предлагающая быстрые сборки и умное управление зависимостями","ar":"تسدن هي مكتبة بناء الجيل التالي لمشاريع Next.js، توفر عمليات بناء سريعة وتحكم ذكي في الإعتماديات","en":"Sanity toolkit for Next.js"},"definition":{"en":"Sanity toolkit for Next.js"},"features":{"zh":["快速的构建","自动化类型声明生成","无缝迁移 từ tsup","支持Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin插件","智能的依赖处理"],"ja":["高速なビルド","自動型宣言の生成","tsupからのシームレスな移行","Rolldown/Rollup/Unpluginプラグインのサポート","スマートな依存関係の処理"],"ko":["빠른 빌드","자동 유형 선언 생성","tsup으로부터의 무縫 이주","Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin 플러그인 지원","智能한 의존성 처리"],"es":["Compilaciones rápidas","Generación automática de .d.ts","Migración sin problemas desde tsup","Soporte para plugins de Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin","Manejo inteligente de dependencias","Opción de exports para paquetes auto-generados"],"fr":["Compilations rapides","Génération automatique de .d.ts","Migration sans problème depuis tsup","Support pour les plugins de Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin","Gestion intelligente des dépendances","Option d''exports pour les paquets auto-générés"],"de":["Schnelle Kompilierungen","Automatische Generierung von .d.ts","Reibungslose Migration von tsup","Unterstützung für Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin-Plugins","Intelligente Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Exports-Option für auto-generierte Pakete"],"pt":["Compilações rápidas","Geração automática de arquivos .d.ts","Migração suave do tsup","Suporte a plugins do Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin","Gerenciamento de dependências inteligente"],"ru":["Быстрые сборки","Автоматическая генерация файлов .d.ts","Плавная миграция из tsup","Поддержка плагинов Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin","Умное управление зависимостями"],"ar":["عمليات بناء سريعة","توليد تلقائي لملفات .d.ts","هجرة سهلة من tsup","دعم ملحقات Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin","تحكم ذكي في الإعتماديات"]},"keywords":{"zh":["TypeScript","库打包","自动化类型声明","Rolldown","Oxc","tsup","Next.js"],"ja":["TypeScript","ライブラリバンドル","自動型宣言","Rolldown","Oxc","tsup","Next.js"],"ko":["TypeScript","라이브러리 번들링","자동 유형 선언","Rolldown","Oxc","tsup","Next.js"],"es":["tsdown","Next.js","TypeScript","compilación","generación de tipos"," Sanity","Rolldown","Rollup","Unplugin"],"fr":["tsdown","Next.js","TypeScript","compilation","génération de types","Sanity","Rolldown","Rollup","Unplugin"],"de":["tsdown","Next.js","TypeScript","Kompilierung","Generierung von Typen","Sanity","Rolldown","Rollup","Unplugin"],"pt":["tsdown","Next.js","build","compilação","gerenciamento de dependências","TypeScript","Rolldown","Rollup","Unplugin"],"ru":["tsdown","Next.js","сборка","компиляция","управление зависимостями","TypeScript","Rolldown","Rollup","Unplugin"],"ar":["تسدن","Next.js","بناء","تجميع","إدارة الإعتماديات","TypeScript","Rolldown","Rollup","Unplugin"]}},"owner":"sanity-io","repo":"next-sanity","repoPath":"sanity-io/next-sanity","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tsdown","description":"tsdown fast TypeScript library bundler powered by Rolldown and Oxc. Use when bundling TypeScript libraries, configuring entry points, or generating .d.ts declaration files.","version":"2026.1.28","bodyPreview":"tsdown is a next-generation TypeScript library bundler built on Rolldown and Oxc. It provides blazing-fast builds, automatic `.d.ts` generation, and seamless migration from tsup. Supports Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin plugins and features smart dependency handling.\n\n> The skill is based on tsdown v0.20.1, generated at 2026-01-28.\n\n**Anthony''s Preferences:**\n\n- Build pure-ESM packages, avoid CJS\n- Always enable `dts` option for type declarations\n- Enable `exports` option for auto-generated package exp","body":"tsdown is a next-generation TypeScript library bundler built on Rolldown and Oxc. It provides blazing-fast builds, automatic `.d.ts` generation, and seamless migration from tsup. Supports Rolldown/Rollup/Unplugin plugins and features smart dependency handling.\n\n> The skill is based on tsdown v0.20.1, generated at 2026-01-28.\n\n**Anthony''s Preferences:**\n\n- Build pure-ESM packages, avoid CJS\n- Always enable `dts` option for type declarations\n- Enable `exports` option for auto-generated package exports\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic         | Description                                       | Reference                                |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| Configuration | Config file setup, defineConfig, multiple configs | [core-config](references/core-config.md) |\n| CLI           | Command-line interface and options                | [core-cli](references/core-cli.md)       |\n| Entry Points  | Entry files, aliases, glob patterns               | [core-entry](references/core-entry.md)   |\n\n## Build Options\n\n| Topic             | Description                                            | Reference                                                        |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Output            | Format (ESM/CJS/IIFE/UMD), directory, target, platform | [options-output](references/options-output.md)                   |\n| Declaration Files | .d.ts generation, isolatedDeclarations, sourcemaps     | [options-dts](references/options-dts.md)                         |\n| Dependencies      | External, noExternal, dependency bundling              | [options-dependencies](references/options-dependencies.md)       |\n| Package Exports   | Auto-generating exports, main, module fields           | [options-package-exports](references/options-package-exports.md) |\n\n## Features\n\n| Topic         | Description                            | Reference                                                    |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Optimization  | Tree shaking, minification, sourcemaps | [features-optimization](references/features-optimization.md) |\n| Shims         | CJS/ESM compatibility shims            | [features-shims](references/features-shims.md)               |\n| Unbundle Mode | Bundleless transpile-only builds       | [features-unbundle](references/features-unbundle.md)         |\n| Watch Mode    | Auto-rebuild on file changes           | [features-watch](references/features-watch.md)               |\n\n## Advanced\n\n| Topic            | Description                                | Reference                                                            |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Plugins          | Rolldown, Unplugin, Rollup, Vite plugins   | [advanced-plugins](references/advanced-plugins.md)                   |\n| Hooks            | Build lifecycle hooks                      | [advanced-hooks](references/advanced-hooks.md)                       |\n| Programmatic API | Using tsdown from code                     | [advanced-programmatic](references/advanced-programmatic.md)         |\n| Rolldown Options | Customizing inputOptions and outputOptions | [advanced-rolldown-options](references/advanced-rolldown-options.md) |\n\n## Recipes\n\n| Topic             | Description                    | Reference                                              |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Framework Support | Vue and React library bundling | [recipes-frameworks](references/recipes-frameworks.md) |\n| Migration         | Migrating from tsup            | [recipes-migration](references/recipes-migration.md)   |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:13:40.674Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Next.js Development Agents needing blazing-fast TypeScript builds and seamless migration from tsup.","zh":"非常适合需要超快 TypeScript 构建和从 tsup 无缝迁移的 Next.js 开发代理。","ja":"Next.js 開発エージェント向けに、超高速な TypeScript ビルドと tsup からのシームレスな移行に最適。","ko":"blazing-fast TypeScript 빌드와 tsup에서無결점 마이그레이션을 필요로 하는 Next.js 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Next.js que necesitan compilaciones de TypeScript extremadamente rápidas y una migración sin problemas desde tsup.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Next.js ayant besoin de compilations TypeScript extrêmement rapides et d''une migration en douceur depuis tsup.","de":"Perfekt für Next.js-Entwicklungsagenten, die blitzschnelle TypeScript-Builds und eine nahtlose Migration von tsup benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de desenvolvimento do Next.js que necessitam de compilações de TypeScript extremamente rápidas e de migração sem problemas do tsup.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Next.js, которым требуются быстрые сборки TypeScript и бесшовная миграция из tsup.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى تجميعات TypeScript سريعة للغاية وانتقال بدون مشاكل من tsup لتصميم Next.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate pure-ESM packages with automatic `.d.ts` generation and smart dependency handling using Rolldown and Oxc, while enabling auto-generated package exports with the `exports` option.","zh":"赋予代理生成纯 ESM 包的能力，具有自动 `.d.ts` 生成和智能依赖处理使用 Rolldown 和 Oxc，同时通过 `exports` 选项启用自动生成的包导出。","ja":"Rolldown と Oxc を使用して、自動 `.d.ts` 生成とスマートな依存関係の処理を可能にし、`exports` オプションを使用して自動生成されたパッケージのエクスポートを有効にすることで、エージェントが純 ESM パッケージを生成できるようにします。","ko":"Rolldown과 Oxc를 사용하여 자동 `.d.ts` 생성 및 스마트한 의존성 처리를 가능하게 하며 `exports` 옵션을 사용하여 자동 생성된 패키지 내보내기 기능을 활성화하여 에이전트가 순수한 ESM 패키지를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar paquetes puros ESM con generación automática de `.d.ts` y gestión de dependencias inteligente utilizando Rolldown y Oxc, al mismo tiempo que permite exportaciones de paquetes autogeneradas con la opción `exports`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des paquets ESM purs avec une génération automatique de `.d.ts` et une gestion de dépendances intelligente à l''aide de Rolldown et Oxc, tout en permettant des exportations de paquets auto-générées avec l''option `exports`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, reine ESM-Pakete mit automatischer `.d.ts`-Generierung und intelligenter Abhängigkeitsverwaltung unter Verwendung von Rolldown und Oxc zu generieren, während gleichzeitig autogenerierte Paketexporte mit der `exports`-Option ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar pacotes puros-ESM com geração automática de `.d.ts` e tratamento inteligente de dependências usando Rolldown e Oxc, além de permitir exportações de pacotes auto-geradas com a opção `exports`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать чистые пакеты ESM с автоматической генерацией `.d.ts` и умным управлением зависимостями с помощью Rolldown и Oxc, а также включает автоматически сгенерированные экспорты пакетов с помощью опции `exports`.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من توليد حزم ESM نقية مع توليد تلقائي للبيان النمطي `.d.ts` وتحديد التبعيات الذكية باستخدام Rolldown و Oxc، بالإضافة إلى تمكين تصدير الحزم التلقائي باستخدام خيار `exports`."},"useCases":{"en":["Building high-performance Next.js applications with tsdown''s blazing-fast builds","Migrating existing tsup projects to tsdown for improved dependency handling","Generating type declarations automatically with the `dts` option"],"zh":["使用 tsdown 的超快构建构建高性能 Next.js 应用程序","将现有的 tsup 项目迁移到 tsdown 以改善依赖处理","使用 `dts` 选项自动生成类型声明"],"ja":["tsdown の超高速ビルドを使用して高パフォーマンスの Next.js アプリケーションを構築する","既存の tsup プロジェクトを tsdown に移行して依存関係の処理を改善する","`dts` オプションを使用して型宣言を自動生成する"],"ko":["tsdown의 블레이징 빠른 빌드를 사용하여 고성능 Next.js 애플리케이션을 빌드하는 것","기존의 tsup 프로젝트를 tsdown으로 마이그레이션하여 의존성 처리를 개선하는 것","`dts` 옵션을 사용하여 타입 선언을 자동 생성하는 것"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones de alto rendimiento de Next.js con compilaciones rápidas de tsdown","Migración de proyectos existentes de tsup a tsdown para una mejor gestión de dependencias","Generación automática de declaraciones de tipo con la opción `dts`"],"fr":["Création d''applications Next.js haute performance avec des compilations rapides de tsdown","Migration de projets existants de tsup vers tsdown pour une meilleure gestion des dépendances","Génération automatique de déclarations de type avec l''option `dts`"],"de":["Erstellung von Hochleistungs-Next.js-Anwendungen mit tsdowns blitzschnellen Builds","Migration von bestehenden tsup-Projekten zu tsdown für eine verbesserte Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Automatische Generierung von Typdeklarationen mit der `dts`-Option"],"pt":["Construir aplicações de alto desempenho do Next.js com compilações rápidas do tsdown","Migrar projetos existentes do tsup para o tsdown para melhorar o tratamento de dependências","Gerar declarações de tipo automaticamente com a opção `dts`"],"ru":["Создание высокопроизводительных приложений Next.js с быстрыми сборками tsdown","Миграция существующих проектов tsup в tsdown для улучшения обработки зависимостей","Автоматическое генерирование объявлений типов с помощью опции `dts`"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات Next.js عالية الأداء باستخدام تجميعات tsdown السريعة","نقل مشاريع tsup الحالية إلى tsdown لتحسين التعامل مع التبعيات","توليد إعلانات النمط تلقائيًا باستخدام خيار `dts`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires tsdown v0.20.1 or compatible version","Limited to TypeScript library bundling","Dependent on Rolldown and Oxc for core functionality"],"zh":["需要 tsdown v0.20.1 或兼容版本","仅限于 TypeScript 库打包","依赖于 Rolldown 和 Oxc 的核心功能"],"ja":["tsdown v0.20.1 または互換バージョンが必要","TypeScript ライブラリのバンドルに限定される","Rolldown と Oxc のコア機能に依存する"],"ko":["tsdown v0.20.1 또는 호환 버전이 필요합니다.","TypeScript 라이브러리 번들링에만 제한됩니다.","Rolldown 및 Oxc의 핵심 기능에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere tsdown v0.20.1 o una versión compatible","Limitado a la creación de bibliotecas de TypeScript","Dependiente de Rolldown y Oxc para la funcionalidad principal"],"fr":["Nécessite tsdown v0.20.1 ou une version compatible","Limité à la création de bibliothèques TypeScript","Dépendant de Rolldown et Oxc pour la fonctionnalité principale"],"de":["Benötigt tsdown v0.20.1 oder eine kompatible Version","Begrenzt auf die Erstellung von TypeScript-Bibliotheken","Abhängig von Rolldown und Oxc für die Kernfunktionalität"],"pt":["Exige o tsdown v0.20.1 ou versão compatível","Limitado ao empacotamento de bibliotecas TypeScript","Dependente do Rolldown e Oxc para funcionalidade principal"],"ru":["Требует tsdown v0.20.1 или совместимой версии","Ограничен упаковкой библиотек TypeScript","Зависит от Rolldown и Oxc для основных функций"],"ar":["يتطلب tsdown الإصدار 0.20.1 أو إصدارًا متوافقًا","محدود بالحزم المكتبية لTypeScript","يعتمد على Rolldown و Oxc للوظائف الأساسية"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
