ação de interface para prevenir problemas de consistência","Suporte a 22+ formatos de arquivo","Uso de Tailwind CSS defaults para espacamento, raio e sombras","Revisão de arquivos contra restrições e sugestões de correção","Integração com o servidor MCP"],"ru":["Стандартизация интерфейса для предотвращения проблем согласованности","Поддержка 22+ форматов файлов","Использование Tailwind CSS defaults для间距, радиуса и теней","Проверка файлов против ограничений и предложения исправления","Интеграция с сервером MCP"],"ar":["معايير واجهة المستخدم لمنع مشاكل في الاتساق","دعم 22+ صيغة ملف","استخدام Tailwind CSS defaults لفراغ، نصف قطر وظلال","مراجعة الملفات ضد القيود واقتراحات لتصحيح","التكامل مع خادم MCP"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Baseline UI","标准化 UI","Tailwind CSS","开发效率","用户体验","开源平台"],"ja":["Baseline UI","標準化 UI","Tailwind CSS","開発効率","ユーザーエクスペリエンス","オープンソースプラットフォーム"],"ko":["Baseline UI","표준화 UI","Tailwind CSS","개발 효율성","사용자 경험","오픈소스 플랫폼"],"es":["Baseline UI","estándar de interfaz de usuario","Tailwind CSS","interfaz de usuario","desarrollo de software","IA","interfaz de línea de comandos","corrección de errores","calidad de software"],"fr":["Baseline UI","standard d''interface utilisateur","Tailwind CSS","interface utilisateur","développement de logiciels","IA","interface de ligne de commande","correction d''erreurs","qualité de logiciels"],"de":["Baseline UI","Benutzeroberflächen-Standard","Tailwind CSS","Benutzeroberfläche","Software-Entwicklung","IA","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle","Fehlerkorrektur","Software-Qualität"],"pt":["Baseline UI","padronização de interface","desenvolvimento de software","consistência de código","Tailwind CSS","MCP servidor","arquivos de configuração"],"ru":["Baseline UI","стандартизация интерфейса","разработка программного обеспечения","согласованность кода","Tailwind CSS","MCP сервер","файлы конфигурации"],"ar":["Baseline UI","معايير واجهة المستخدم","تطوير البرمجيات","اتساق الكود","Tailwind CSS","خادم MCP","ملفات التكوين"]}},"owner":"agentset-ai","repo":"agentset","repoPath":"agentset-ai/agentset","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baseline-ui","description":"Enforces an opinionated UI baseline to prevent AI-generated interface slop.","bodyPreview":"# Baseline UI\n\nEnforces an opinionated UI baseline to prevent AI-generated interface slop.\n\n## How to use\n\n- `/baseline-ui`\n  Apply these constraints to any UI work in this conversation.\n\n- `/baseline-ui <file>`\n  Review the file against all constraints below and output:\n  - violations (quote the exact line/snippet)\n  - why it matters (1 short sentence)\n  - a concrete fix (code-level suggestion)\n\n## Stack\n\n- MUST use Tailwind CSS defaults (spacing, radius, shadows) before custom values\n- MUST us","body":"# Baseline UI\n\nEnforces an opinionated UI baseline to prevent AI-generated interface slop.\n\n## How to use\n\n- `/baseline-ui`\n  Apply these constraints to any UI work in this conversation.\n\n- `/baseline-ui <file>`\n  Review the file against all constraints below and output:\n  - violations (quote the exact line/snippet)\n  - why it matters (1 short sentence)\n  - a concrete fix (code-level suggestion)\n\n## Stack\n\n- MUST use Tailwind CSS defaults (spacing, radius, shadows) before custom values\n- MUST use `motion/react` (formerly `framer-motion`) when JavaScript animation is required\n- SHOULD use `tw-animate-css` for entrance and micro-animations in Tailwind CSS\n- MUST use `cn` utility (`clsx` + `tailwind-merge`) for class logic\n\n## Components\n\n- MUST use accessible component primitives for anything with keyboard or focus behavior (`Radix`)\n- MUST use the project’s existing component primitives first\n- NEVER mix primitive systems within the same interaction surface\n- MUST add an `aria-label` to icon-only buttons\n- NEVER rebuild keyboard or focus behavior by hand unless explicitly requested\n- MUST use `isLoading` prop on the `Button` component when indicating loading state\n- NEVER use `ml-x` or `mr-x` when styling an icon inside a button, since spacing will be given to it automatically\n- NEVER explicitly set border color to `border-border` since this is the default border color\n\n## Interaction\n\n- MUST use an `AlertDialog` for destructive or irreversible actions\n- SHOULD use structural skeletons for loading states\n- NEVER use `h-screen`, use `h-dvh`\n- MUST respect `safe-area-inset` for fixed elements\n- MUST show errors next to where the action happens\n- NEVER block paste in `input` or `textarea` elements\n\n## Animation\n\n- NEVER add animation unless it is explicitly requested\n- MUST animate only compositor props (`transform`, `opacity`)\n- NEVER animate layout properties (`width`, `height`, `top`, `left`, `margin`, `padding`)\n- SHOULD avoid animating paint properties (`background`, `color`) except for small, local UI (text, icons)\n- SHOULD use `ease-out` on entrance\n- NEVER exceed `200ms` for interaction feedback\n- MUST pause looping animations when off-screen\n- MUST respect `prefers-reduced-motion`\n- NEVER introduce custom easing curves unless explicitly requested\n- SHOULD avoid animating large images or full-screen surfaces\n\n## Typography\n\n- MUST use `text-balance` for headings and `text-pretty` for body/paragraphs\n- MUST use `tabular-nums` for data\n- SHOULD use `truncate` or `line-clamp` for dense UI\n- NEVER modify `letter-spacing` (`tracking-`) unless explicitly requested\n\n## Layout\n\n- MUST use a fixed `z-index` scale (no arbitrary `z-x`)\n- SHOULD use `size-x` for square elements instead of `w-x` + `h-x`\n- SHOULD use `gap-*` for spacing between elements instead of `space-x-*` or `space-y-*` (with appropriate `flex` and `flex-direction` classes)\n\n## Performance\n\n- NEVER animate large `blur()` or `backdrop-filter` surfaces\n- NEVER apply `will-change` outside an active animation\n- NEVER use `useEffect` for anything that can be expressed as render logic\n\n## Design\n\n- NEVER use gradients unless explicitly requested\n- NEVER use purple or multicolor gradients\n- NEVER use glow effects as primary affordances\n- SHOULD use Tailwind CSS default shadow scale unless explicitly requested\n- MUST give empty states one clear next action\n- SHOULD limit accent color usage to one per view\n- SHOULD use existing theme or Tailwind CSS color tokens before introducing new ones\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:14:37.012Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for UI-focused AI Agents that generate frontend code and need to enforce consistent design standards.","zh":"对于专注于生成前端代码并需要强制执行一致性设计标准的UI导向型AI代理至关重要。","ja":"フロントエンドコードを生成し、一貫性のあるデザイン基準を強制する必要があるUI重視のAIエージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"프론트엔드 코드를 생성하고 일관된 디자인 기준을 적용해야 하는 UI 중심 AI 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de IA centrados en la interfaz de usuario que generan código de frontend y necesitan hacer cumplir estándares de diseño consistentes.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents IA axés sur l''interface utilisateur qui génèrent du code frontend et doivent faire respecter des normes de conception cohérentes.","de":"Wesentlich für UI-fokussierte KI-Agents, die Frontend-Code generieren und konsistente Designstandards durchsetzen müssen.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de IA com foco em UI que geram código de frontend e precisam impor padrões de design consistentes.","ru":"Необходимо для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на UI, которые генерируют код frontend и должны обеспечивать соблюдение единых стандартов дизайна.","ar":"ضروري لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يركز على واجهة المستخدم التي يولد فيها رمز واجهة المستخدم وأيضًا يحتاج إلى فرض معايير التصميم المتناسقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enforces opinionated UI constraints using Tailwind CSS defaults for spacing, radius, and shadows before custom values, preventing AI-generated interface inconsistencies and ensuring design system compliance across generated components.","zh":"在应用自定义值之前，先使用Tailwind CSS默认的间距、圆角和阴影设置来强制执行规范化的UI约束，从而防止AI生成的界面出现不一致性，并确保生成的组件符合设计系统规范。","ja":"カスタム値を適用する前に、間隔、半径、影に関してTailwind CSSのデフォルトを使用して規範的なUI制約を強制し、AIが生成したインターフェースの不整合を防止し、生成されたコンポーネント全体でデザインシステムのコンプライアンスを保証します。","ko":"사용자 정의 값 적용 전에 간격, 반경 및 그림자에 대해 Tailwind CSS 기본값을 사용하여 강력한 UI 제약 조건을 적용하여 AI 생성 인터페이스의 불일치를 방지하고 생성된 컴포넌트 전반에 걸쳐 디자인 시스템 준수를 보장합니다.","es":"Hace cumplir restricciones de interfaz de usuario opinadas utilizando los valores predeterminados de Tailwind CSS para espaciado, radio y sombras antes de los valores personalizados, lo que evita las inconsistencias de la interfaz generada por IA y garantiza el cumplimiento del sistema de diseño en los componentes generados.","fr":"Fait respecter les contraintes d''interface utilisateur avisées en utilisant les valeurs par défaut de Tailwind CSS pour l''espacement, le rayon et les ombres avant les valeurs personnalisées, ce qui empêche les incohérences d''interface générées par l''IA et assure le respect du système de conception dans les composants générés.","de":"Zwingt vorgegebene UI-Beschränkungen durch die Verwendung von Tailwind-CSS-Standardwerten für Abstand, Radius und Schatten vor benutzerdefinierten Werten, was Inkonsistenzen in der von KI generierten Schnittstelle verhindert und die Einhaltung des Designsystems in den generierten Komponenten sicherstellt.","pt":"Impõe restrições de UI opinativas usando os padrões do Tailwind CSS para espaçamento, raio e sombras antes dos valores personalizados, prevenindo inconsistências de interface geradas por IA e garantindo a conformidade do sistema de design em componentes gerados.","ru":"Принудительно устанавливает ограничения UI с помощью значений по умолчанию Tailwind CSS для интервала, радиуса и теней до пользовательских значений, предотвращая несоответствия интерфейса, сгенерированного ИИ, и обеспечивая соблюдение системы дизайна в сгенерированных компонентах.","ar":"فرض قيود واجهة المستخدم الموجهة باستخدام إعدادات Tailwind CSS الافتراضية للتسلسل والنصف قطر والظلال قبل القيم المخصصة، ومنع عدم انتظام في واجهة المستخدم التي تم إنشاؤها بواسطة الذكاء الاصطناعي وضمان اتباع نظام التصميم عبر المكونات التي تم إنشاؤها."},"useCases":{"en":["Reviewing code files for Tailwind CSS compliance","Applying baseline UI constraints to generated interfaces","Identifying and fixing design system violations in frontend code"],"zh":["审查代码文件以确保符合Tailwind CSS规范","对生成的界面应用基线UI约束","识别并修复前端代码中的设计系统违规问题"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS準拠のためのコードファイルのレビュー","生成されたインターフェースへのベースラインUI制約の適用","フロントエンドコードにおけるデザインシステム違反の特定と修正"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS 준수를 위한 코드 파일 검토","생성된 인터페이스에 기준 UI 제약 조건 적용","프론트엔드 코드에서 디자인 시스템 위반 사항 식별 및 수정"],"es":["Revisar archivos de código para la compatibilidad con Tailwind CSS","Aplicar restricciones de interfaz de usuario de base a interfaces generadas","Identificar y corregir violaciones del sistema de diseño en el código de frontend"],"fr":["Réviser les fichiers de code pour la compatibilité avec Tailwind CSS","Appliquer des contraintes d''interface utilisateur de base aux interfaces générées","Identifier et corriger les violations du système de conception dans le code frontend"],"de":["Code-Dateien auf Tailwind-CSS-Kompatibilität überprüfen","Basis-UI-Beschränkungen auf generierte Schnittstellen anwenden","Designsystem-Verletzungen im Frontend-Code identifizieren und korrigieren"],"pt":["Revisar arquivos de código para garantir a conformidade com o Tailwind CSS","Aplicar restrições de UI de linha de base a interfaces geradas","Identificar e corrigir violações do sistema de design em código frontend"],"ru":["Просмотр файлов кода на соответствие Tailwind CSS","Применение базовых ограничений UI к сгенерированным интерфейсам","Определение и исправление нарушений системы дизайна в коде frontend"],"ar":["استعراض ملفات التعليمات البرمجية لضمان مطابقتها لـ Tailwind CSS","تطبيق قيود واجهة المستخدم الأساسية إلى واجهات تم إنشاؤها","تحديد وإصلاح انتهاكات نظام التصميم في رمز واجهة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Tailwind CSS usage","Limited to UI/design constraint enforcement","File-based analysis requires explicit path specification"],"zh":["需要使用Tailwind CSS","仅限于UI/设计约束的强制执行","基于文件的分析需要明确指定路径"],"ja":["Tailwind CSSの使用が必要","UI/デザイン制約の強制に限定される","ファイルベースの分析には明示的なパス指定が必要"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS 사용이 필요함","UI/디자인 제약 조건 적용으로 제한됨","파일 기반 분석은 명시적 경로 지정이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere el uso de Tailwind CSS","Limitado a la aplicación de restricciones de diseño/interfaz de usuario","El análisis basado en archivos requiere la especificación explícita de la ruta"],"fr":["Nécessite l''utilisation de Tailwind CSS","Limité à l''application de contraintes de conception/interface utilisateur","L''analyse basée sur les fichiers nécessite la spécification explicite du chemin"],"de":["Erfordert die Verwendung von Tailwind CSS","Begrenzt auf die Durchsetzung von Design-/UI-Beschränkungen","Dateibasierte Analyse erfordert die explizite Pfadspezifikation"],"pt":["Requer o uso do Tailwind CSS","Limitado à aplicação de restrições de design/UI","Análise baseada em arquivos requer especificação de caminho explícito"],"ru":["Требует использования Tailwind CSS","Ограничен обеспечением соблюдения ограничений дизайна/интерфейса","Анализ на основе файлов требует явного указания пути"],"ar":["يتطلب استخدام Tailwind CSS","محدود بالتحقق من قيود التصميم / واجهة المستخدم","تحليل الملفات يتطلب تحديد مسار صريح"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":35}');
