ra análisis de código y depuración","fr":"Créez des outils personnalisés avec LLVM/Clang pour l''analyse de code et le débogage","de":"Erstellen Sie benutzerdefinierte Tools mit LLVM/Clang für Code-Analyse und Debugging","pt":"O LLVM é uma infraestrutura de compilação que permite a criação de ferramentas personalizadas para análise de código e depuração","ru":"LLVM — это инфраструктура компиляции, которая позволяет создавать индивидуальные инструменты для анализа кода и отладки","ar":"LLVM هي بنية تحويل البرمجيات التي تمكن من إنشاء أدوات مخصصة لتحليل الشفرة وتصحيح الأخطاء","en":"LLVM fork with explicit compatibility with MSVC 2022 features."},"definition":{"en":"LLVM fork with explicit compatibility with MSVC 2022 features."},"features":{"zh":["Clang插件开发","LLVM/Clang基础设施应用","源代码分析","调试","IDE集成"],"ja":["Clangプラグイン開発","LLVM/Clangインフラストラクチャの活用","ソースコード分析","デバッグ","IDE統合"],"ko":["Clang 플러그인 개발","LLVM/Clang 인프라 활용","소스 코드 분석","디버깅","IDE 통합"],"es":["Desarrollo de plugins de Clang","Análisis de código fuente","Depuración y solución de problemas","Integración con IDE","Compatibilidad con MSVC 2022"],"fr":["Développement de plugins Clang","Analyse de code source","Débogage et résolution de problèmes","Intégration avec les IDE","Compatibilité avec MSVC 2022"],"de":["Entwicklung von Clang-Plugins","Quellcode-Analyse","Debugging und Fehlerbehebung","Integration mit IDE","Kompatibilität mit MSVC 2022"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de plugins Clang","Análise de código-fonte","Depuração de aplicativos","Integração com IDEs","Compatibilidade com MSVC 2022"],"ru":["Разработка плагинов Clang","Анализ исходного кода","Отладка приложений","Интеграция с IDE","Совместимость с MSVC 2022"],"ar":["تطوير ملحقات Clang","تحليل الشفرة المصدر","تصحيح أخطاء التطبيقات","التكامل مع بيئات التطوير","التوافق مع MSVC 2022"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LLVM","Clang","插件开发","源代码分析","调试","IDE集成","LLVM工具","Clang插件"],"ja":["LLVM","Clang","プラグイン開発","ソースコード分析","デバッグ","IDE統合","LLVMツール","Clangプラグイン"],"ko":["LLVM","Clang","플러그인 개발","소스 코드 분석","디버깅","IDE 통합","LLVM 툴","Clang 플러그인"],"es":["LLVM","Clang","análisis de código","depuración","desarrollo de plugins","integración con IDE","MSVC 2022"],"fr":["LLVM","Clang","analyse de code","débogage","développement de plugins","intégration avec les IDE","MSVC 2022"],"de":["LLVM","Clang","Code-Analyse","Debugging","Plugin-Entwicklung","Integration mit IDE","MSVC 2022"],"pt":["LLVM","Clang","análise de código","depuração","plugins Clang","MSVC 2022","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["LLVM","Clang","анализ кода","отладка","плагины Clang","MSVC 2022","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["LLVM","Clang","تحليل الشفرة","تصحيح الأخطاء","ملحقات Clang","MSVC 2022","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"backengineering","repo":"llvm-msvc","repoPath":"backengineering/llvm-msvc","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"llvm-tooling","description":"Expertise in LLVM tooling development including Clang plugins, LLDB debugger extensions, Clangd/LSP, and LibTooling. Use this skill when building source code analysis tools, refactoring tools, debugger extensions, or IDE integrations.","bodyPreview":"# LLVM Tooling Skill\n\nThis skill covers development of tools using LLVM/Clang infrastructure for source code analysis, debugging, and IDE integration.\n\n## Clang Plugin Development\n\n### Plugin Architecture\nClang plugins are dynamically loaded libraries that extend Clang''s functionality during compilation.\n\n```cpp\n#include \"clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry.h\"\n#include \"clang/AST/ASTConsumer.h\"\n#include \"clang/AST/RecursiveASTVisitor.h\"\n\nclass MyVisitor : public clang::RecursiveASTVisitor<MyVi","body":"# LLVM Tooling Skill\n\nThis skill covers development of tools using LLVM/Clang infrastructure for source code analysis, debugging, and IDE integration.\n\n## Clang Plugin Development\n\n### Plugin Architecture\nClang plugins are dynamically loaded libraries that extend Clang''s functionality during compilation.\n\n```cpp\n#include \"clang/Frontend/FrontendPluginRegistry.h\"\n#include \"clang/AST/ASTConsumer.h\"\n#include \"clang/AST/RecursiveASTVisitor.h\"\n\nclass MyVisitor : public clang::RecursiveASTVisitor<MyVisitor> {\npublic:\n    bool VisitFunctionDecl(clang::FunctionDecl *FD) {\n        llvm::outs() << \"Found function: \" << FD->getName() << \"\\n\";\n        return true;\n    }\n};\n\nclass MyConsumer : public clang::ASTConsumer {\n    MyVisitor Visitor;\npublic:\n    void HandleTranslationUnit(clang::ASTContext &Context) override {\n        Visitor.TraverseDecl(Context.getTranslationUnitDecl());\n    }\n};\n\nclass MyPlugin : public clang::PluginASTAction {\nprotected:\n    std::unique_ptr<clang::ASTConsumer> CreateASTConsumer(\n        clang::CompilerInstance &CI, llvm::StringRef) override {\n        return std::make_unique<MyConsumer>();\n    }\n    \n    bool ParseArgs(const clang::CompilerInstance &CI,\n                   const std::vector<std::string> &args) override {\n        return true;\n    }\n};\n\nstatic clang::FrontendPluginRegistry::Add<MyPlugin>\n    X(\"my-plugin\", \"My custom plugin description\");\n```\n\n### Running Clang Plugins\n```bash\n# Build plugin\nclang++ -shared -fPIC -o MyPlugin.so MyPlugin.cpp \\\n    $(llvm-config --cxxflags --ldflags)\n\n# Run plugin\nclang -Xclang -load -Xclang ./MyPlugin.so \\\n      -Xclang -plugin -Xclang my-plugin \\\n      source.cpp\n```\n\n## LibTooling\n\n### Standalone Tools\n```cpp\n#include \"clang/Tooling/CommonOptionsParser.h\"\n#include \"clang/Tooling/Tooling.h\"\n#include \"clang/ASTMatchers/ASTMatchFinder.h\"\n\nusing namespace clang::tooling;\nusing namespace clang::ast_matchers;\n\n// Define matcher\nauto functionMatcher = functionDecl(hasName(\"targetFunction\")).bind(\"func\");\n\n// Callback handler\nclass FunctionCallback : public MatchFinder::MatchCallback {\npublic:\n    void run(const MatchFinder::MatchResult &Result) override {\n        if (auto *FD = Result.Nodes.getNodeAs<FunctionDecl>(\"func\")) {\n            llvm::outs() << \"Found: \" << FD->getQualifiedNameAsString() << \"\\n\";\n        }\n    }\n};\n\nint main(int argc, const char **argv) {\n    auto ExpectedParser = CommonOptionsParser::create(argc, argv, MyCategory);\n    ClangTool Tool(ExpectedParser->getCompilations(),\n                   ExpectedParser->getSourcePathList());\n    \n    FunctionCallback Callback;\n    MatchFinder Finder;\n    Finder.addMatcher(functionMatcher, &Callback);\n    \n    return Tool.run(newFrontendActionFactory(&Finder).get());\n}\n```\n\n### AST Matchers Reference\n```cpp\n// Declaration matchers\nfunctionDecl()           // Match function declarations\nvarDecl()               // Match variable declarations\nrecordDecl()            // Match struct/class/union\nfieldDecl()             // Match class fields\ncxxMethodDecl()         // Match C++ methods\ncxxConstructorDecl()    // Match constructors\n\n// Expression matchers\ncallExpr()              // Match function calls\nbinaryOperator()        // Match binary operators\nunaryOperator()         // Match unary operators\nmemberExpr()            // Match member access\n\n// Narrowing matchers\nhasName(\"name\")         // Filter by name\nhasType(asString(\"int\")) // Filter by type\nisPublic()              // Filter by access specifier\nhasAnyParameter(...)    // Match parameters\n\n// Traversal matchers\nhasDescendant(...)      // Match anywhere in subtree\nhasAncestor(...)        // Match in parent chain\nhas(...)                // Match direct children\nforEach(...)            // Match all children\n```\n\n## LLDB Extension Development\n\n### Python Commands\n```python\nimport lldb\n\ndef my_command(debugger, command, result, internal_dict):\n    \"\"\"Custom LLDB command implementation\"\"\"\n    target = debugger.GetSelectedTarget()\n    process = target.GetProcess()\n    thread = process.GetSelectedThread()\n    frame = thread.GetSelectedFrame()\n    \n    # Get variable value\n    var = frame.FindVariable(\"my_var\")\n    result.AppendMessage(f\"my_var = {var.GetValue()}\")\n\ndef __lldb_init_module(debugger, internal_dict):\n    debugger.HandleCommand(\n        ''command script add -f my_module.my_command my_cmd'')\n```\n\n### Scripted Process\n```python\nclass MyScriptedProcess(lldb.SBScriptedProcess):\n    def __init__(self, target, args):\n        super().__init__(target, args)\n        \n    def get_thread_with_id(self, tid):\n        # Return thread info\n        pass\n    \n    def get_registers_for_thread(self, tid):\n        # Return register context\n        pass\n    \n    def read_memory_at_address(self, addr, size):\n        # Read memory\n        pass\n```\n\n### LLDB GUI Extensions\n- **visual-lldb**: GUI frontend for LLDB\n- **vegvisir**: Browser-based LLDB GUI\n- **lldbg**: Lightweight native GUI\n- **CodeLLDB**: VSCode debugger extension\n\n## Clangd / Language Server Protocol\n\n### Custom LSP Extensions\n```cpp\n// Implementing custom code actions\nclass MyCodeActionProvider {\npublic:\n    std::vector<CodeAction> getCodeActions(\n        const TextDocumentIdentifier &File,\n        const Range &Range,\n        const CodeActionContext &Context) {\n        \n        std::vector<CodeAction> Actions;\n        \n        // Add custom refactoring action\n        CodeAction Action;\n        Action.title = \"Extract to function\";\n        Action.kind = \"refactor.extract\";\n        \n        // Define workspace edits\n        WorkspaceEdit Edit;\n        // ... populate edits\n        Action.edit = Edit;\n        \n        Actions.push_back(Action);\n        return Actions;\n    }\n};\n```\n\n### Clangd Configuration\n```yaml\n# .clangd configuration file\nCompileFlags:\n  Add: [-xc++, -std=c++17]\n  Remove: [-W*]\n\nDiagnostics:\n  ClangTidy:\n    Add: [modernize-*, performance-*]\n    Remove: [modernize-use-trailing-return-type]\n\nIndex:\n  Background: Build\n```\n\n## Source-to-Source Transformation\n\n### Clang Rewriter\n```cpp\n#include \"clang/Rewrite/Core/Rewriter.h\"\n\nclass MyRewriter : public RecursiveASTVisitor<MyRewriter> {\n    Rewriter &R;\n    \npublic:\n    MyRewriter(Rewriter &R) : R(R) {}\n    \n    bool VisitFunctionDecl(FunctionDecl *FD) {\n        // Add comment before function\n        R.InsertTextBefore(FD->getBeginLoc(), \"// Auto-generated\\n\");\n        \n        // Replace function name\n        R.ReplaceText(FD->getLocation(), \n                      FD->getName().size(), \"new_name\");\n        \n        return true;\n    }\n};\n```\n\n### RefactoringTool\n```cpp\n#include \"clang/Tooling/Refactoring.h\"\n\nclass MyRefactoring : public RefactoringCallback {\npublic:\n    void run(const MatchFinder::MatchResult &Result) override {\n        // Generate replacements\n        Replacement Rep(\n            *Result.SourceManager,\n            CharSourceRange::getTokenRange(Range),\n            \"new_text\");\n        \n        Replacements.insert(Rep);\n    }\n};\n```\n\n## Notable Tools Built with LLVM Tooling\n\n### Analysis Tools\n- **cppinsights**: C++ template instantiation visualization\n- **ClangBuildAnalyzer**: Build time analysis\n- **clazy**: Qt-specific static analysis\n\n### Refactoring Tools\n- **clang-rename**: Symbol renaming\n- **clang-tidy**: Linting and auto-fixes\n- **include-what-you-use**: Include optimization\n\n### Code Generation\n- **classgen**: Extract type info for IDA\n- **constexpr-everything**: Auto-apply constexpr\n- **clang-expand**: Inline function expansion\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Use AST Matchers**: More readable than manual traversal\n2. **Preserve Formatting**: Use Rewriter carefully to maintain style\n3. **Handle Macros**: Be aware of macro expansion locations\n4. **Test Thoroughly**: Edge cases in C++ are numerous\n5. **Provide Good Diagnostics**: Clear error messages improve usability\n\n## Resources\n\nSee Clang Plugins, Clangd/Language Server, and LLDB sections in README.md for comprehensive tool listings.\n\n## Getting Detailed Information\n\nWhen you need detailed and up-to-date resource links, tool lists, or project references, fetch the latest data from:\n\n```\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/gmh5225/awesome-llvm-security/refs/heads/main/README.md\n```\n\nThis README contains comprehensive curated lists of:\n- Clang plugins and extensions (Clang Plugins section)\n- Language server implementations (Clangd/Language Server section)\n- LLDB debugger tools and GUIs (LLDB section)\n- Static analysis and refactoring tools\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:14:35.492Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing advanced Clang plugin development and MSVC 2022 compatibility.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Clang 插件开发和 MSVC 2022 兼容性的代码分析代理。","ja":"コード分析エージェントが Clang プラグインの高度な開発と MSVC 2022 との互換性を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 Clang 플러그인 개발 및 MSVC 2022 호환성을 필요로 하는 코드 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de código que necesitan desarrollo de plugin avanzado de Clang y compatibilidad con MSVC 2022.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant un développement de plugin Clang avancé et une compatibilité avec MSVC 2022.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die eine erweiterte Clang-Plugin-Entwicklung und MSVC 2022-Kompatibilität benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de desenvolvimento avançado de plugins do Clang e compatibilidade com o MSVC 2022.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, которым требуется продвинутая разработка плагинов Clang и совместимость с MSVC 2022.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل الشفرة الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير متقدم من إضافات Clang ومتوافق مع MSVC 2022."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extend Clang''s functionality during compilation using dynamically loaded libraries, leveraging clang::RecursiveASTVisitor and clang::ASTConsumer for source code analysis and debugging, while ensuring compatibility with MSVC 2022 features.","zh":"赋予代理在编译过程中使用动态加载的库来扩展 Clang 的功能，利用 clang::RecursiveASTVisitor 和 clang::ASTConsumer 进行源代码分析和调试，同时确保与 MSVC 2022 功能的兼容性。","ja":"エージェントが動的にロードされるライブラリを使用してコンパイル中に Clang の機能を拡張できるようにし、clang::RecursiveASTVisitor と clang::ASTConsumer を使用してソースコードを分析およびデバッグし、MSVC 2022 機能との互換性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 동적으로 로드되는 라이브러리를 사용하여 컴파일 중에 Clang의 기능을 확장할 수 있도록 하며, clang::RecursiveASTVisitor 및 clang::ASTConsumer를 사용하여 소스 코드를 분석 및 디버깅하면서 MSVC 2022 기능과의 호환성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a ampliar la funcionalidad de Clang durante la compilación mediante bibliotecas cargadas dinámicamente, aprovechando clang::RecursiveASTVisitor y clang::ASTConsumer para el análisis y depuración de código fuente, garantizando al mismo tiempo la compatibilidad con las características de MSVC 2022.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''étendre les fonctionnalités de Clang pendant la compilation à l''aide de bibliothèques chargées dynamiquement, en exploitant clang::RecursiveASTVisitor et clang::ASTConsumer pour l''analyse et le débogage du code source, tout en assurant la compatibilité avec les fonctionnalités de MSVC 2022.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Funktionalität von Clang während der Kompilierung durch dynamisch geladene Bibliotheken zu erweitern, indem clang::RecursiveASTVisitor und clang::ASTConsumer für die Quellcode-Analyse und -Fehlersuche genutzt werden, während gleichzeitig die Kompatibilität mit den Funktionen von MSVC 2022 gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estender a funcionalidade do Clang durante a compilação usando bibliotecas carregadas dinamicamente, aproveitando clang::RecursiveASTVisitor e clang::ASTConsumer para análise e depuração de código-fonte, garantindo compatibilidade com os recursos do MSVC 2022.","ru":"Позволяет агентам расширять функциональность Clang во время компиляции с помощью динамически загружаемых библиотек, используя clang::RecursiveASTVisitor и clang::ASTConsumer для анализа и отладки исходного кода, обеспечивая совместимость с функциями MSVC 2022.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من توسيع 기능ية Clang أثناء الترجمة باستخدام المكتبات المحملة ديناميكيًا، واستخدام clang::RecursiveASTVisitor وclang::ASTConsumer لتحليل الشفرة وتصحيح الأخطاء، مع ضمان التوافق مع ميزات MSVC 2022."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing custom Clang plugins for source code optimization","Debugging complex C++ codebases using clang::ASTConsumer","Integrating LLVM tooling with IDEs for enhanced code analysis"],"zh":["为源代码优化开发自定义 Clang 插件","使用 clang::ASTConsumer 调试复杂的 C++ 代码库","将 LLVM 工具集成到 IDE 中以增强代码分析"],"ja":["ソースコードの最適化のためのカスタム Clang プラグインの開発","clang::ASTConsumer を使用した複雑な C++ コードベースのデバッグ","LLVM ツールを IDE に統合してコード分析を強化する"],"ko":["소스 코드 최적화를 위한 사용자 정의 Clang 플러그인 개발","clang::ASTConsumer를 사용한 복잡한 C++ 코드베이스 디버깅","LLVM 툴을 IDE에 통합하여 코드 분석 강화"],"es":["Desarrollar plugins personalizados de Clang para la optimización del código fuente","Depurar código C++ complejo utilizando clang::ASTConsumer","Integrar herramientas de LLVM con IDE para un análisis de código mejorado"],"fr":["Développer des plugins Clang personnalisés pour l''optimisation du code source","Déboguer des bases de code C++ complexes à l''aide de clang::ASTConsumer","Intégrer les outils LLVM avec les IDE pour une analyse de code améliorée"],"de":["Entwicklung benutzerdefinierter Clang-Plugins für die Optimierung von Quellcode","Fehlersuche in komplexen C++-Codebasen mit clang::ASTConsumer","Integration von LLVM-Tools mit IDEs für eine verbesserte Code-Analyse"],"pt":["Desenvolver plugins personalizados do Clang para otimização de código-fonte","Depurar código-fonte C++ complexo usando clang::ASTConsumer","Integrar ferramentas LLVM com IDEs para análise de código aprimorada"],"ru":["Разработка собственных плагинов Clang для оптимизации исходного кода","Отладка сложных баз кода C++ с помощью clang::ASTConsumer","Интеграция инструментов LLVM с IDE для расширенного анализа кода"],"ar":["تطوير إضافات Clang مخصصة لتحسين الشفرة المصدرية","تصحيح أخطاء الشفرة المصدرية C++ المعقدة باستخدام clang::ASTConsumer","دمج أدوات LLVM مع بيئات التطوير المتكاملة لتحليل الشفرة المعزز"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires LLVM/Clang infrastructure","MSVC 2022 compatibility limitations apply","C++ programming knowledge necessary"],"zh":["需要 LLVM/Clang 基础设施","MSVC 2022 兼容性限制适用","需要 C++ 编程知识"],"ja":["LLVM/Clang インフラストラクチャが必要","MSVC 2022 互換性の制限が適用される","C++ プログラミングの知識が必要"],"ko":["LLVM/Clang 인프라STRUCTURE가 필요함","MSVC 2022 호환성 제한이 적용됨","C++ 프로그래밍 지식이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere infraestructura LLVM/Clang","Se aplican limitaciones de compatibilidad con MSVC 2022","Conocimientos de programación en C++ necesarios"],"fr":["Nécessite une infrastructure LLVM/Clang","Les limitations de compatibilité avec MSVC 2022 s''appliquent","Connaissances de programmation en C++ nécessaires"],"de":["Benötigt LLVM/Clang-Infrastruktur","MSVC 2022-Kompatibilitätseinschränkungen gelten","C++-Programmierkenntnisse erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer infraestrutura LLVM/Clang","Se aplicam limitações de compatibilidade com o MSVC 2022","Conhecimento de programação C++ necessário"],"ru":["Требуется инфраструктура LLVM/Clang","Применяются ограничения совместимости с MSVC 2022","Необходимо знание программирования на C++"],"ar":["يتطلب بنية تحتية LLVM/Clang","تطبق قيود التوافق مع MSVC 2022","مطلوب معرفة بالبرمجة بلغة C++"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('backengineering/llvm-msvc/llvm-security', 'community', 'backengineering', 'llvm-msvc', 'backengineering/llvm-msvc', 'llvm-security', 0, 0, 40, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z', '2026-02-18T04:14:41.233Z', NULL, '{"id":"backengineering/llvm-msvc/llvm-security","name":"llvm-security","description":{"zh":"LLVM 安全性功能提供了一系列的安全功能和实践，包括 AddressSanitizer 和内存错误检测","ja":"LLVM セキュリティ機能は、AddressSanitizer やメモリエラーチェックなどのセキュリティ機能やプラクティスを提供します","ko":"LLVM 보안 기능은 AddressSanitizer 및 메모리 오류检测 등을 포함한 보안 기능과 실천을 제공합니다","es":"LLVM Security es un conjunto de características y prácticas de desarrollo para garantizar la seguridad del software","fr":"LLVM Sécurité est un ensemble de fonctionnalités et de pratiques de développement pour assurer la sécurité des logiciels","de":"LLVM Sicherheit ist eine Sammlung von Funktionen und Entwicklungspraktiken zur Gewährleistung der Softwaresicherheit","pt":"O LLVM Security é um fork do LLVM com recursos de segurança explícitos, incluindo sanitizadores e mecanismos de endurecimento para desenvolvimento de software seguro","ru":"LLVM Безопасность - это форк LLVM с явными функциями безопасности, включая санитизаторы и механизмы укрепления для безопасной разработки программного обеспечения","ar":"LLVM أمان هو نسخة مُعدّلة من LLVM مع ميزات أمان صريحة، بما في ذلك محسّنات التأمين وآليات التأمين لتطوير البرمجيات الآمنة","en":"LLVM fork with explicit compatibility with MSVC 2022 features."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"LLVM 安全性功能","ja":"LLVM セキュリティ機能","ko":"LLVM 보안 기능","es":"LLVM Seguridad: Características y Practicas de Desarrollo","fr":"LLVM Sécurité : Fonctionnalités et Pratiques de Développe...","de":"LLVM Sicherheit: Funktionen und Entwicklungspraktiken","pt":"LLVM Segurança: Recursos de Segurança e Sanitizadores","ru":"LLVM Безопасность: Механизмы Безопасности и Санитизаторы","ar":"LLVM أمان: ميزات الأمان ومحسّنات التأمين","en":"llvm-security"},"description":{"zh":"LLVM 安全性功能提供了一系列的安全功能和实践，包括 AddressSanitizer 和内存错误检测","ja":"LLVM セキュリティ機能は、AddressSanitizer やメモリエラーチェックなどのセキュリティ機能やプラクティスを提供します","ko":"LLVM 보안 기능은 AddressSanitizer 및 메모리 오류检测 등을 포함한 보안 기능과 실천을 제공합니다","es":"LLVM Security es un conjunto de características y prácticas de desarrollo para garantizar la seguridad del software","fr":"LLVM Sécurité est un ensemble de fonctionnalités et de pratiques de développement pour assurer la sécurité des logiciels","de":"LLVM Sicherheit ist eine Sammlung von Funktionen und Entwicklungspraktiken zur Gewährleistung der Softwaresicherheit","pt":"O LLVM Security é um fork do LLVM com recursos de segurança explícitos, incluindo sanitizadores e mecanismos de endurecimento para desenvolvimento de softwar...","ru":"LLVM Безопасность - это форк LLVM с явными функциями безопасности, включая санитизаторы и механизмы укрепления для безопасной разработки программного обеспеч...","ar":"LLVM أمان هو نسخة مُعدّلة من LLVM مع ميزات أمان صريحة، بما في ذلك محسّنات التأمين وآليات التأمين لتطوير البرمجيات الآمنة","en":"LLVM fork with explicit compatibility with MSVC 2022 features."},"definition":{"en":"LLVM fork with explicit compatibility with MSVC 2022 features."},"features":{"zh":["AddressSanitizer","内存错误检测","堆缓冲区溢出检测","栈缓冲区溢出检测","用后释放检测","内存泄漏检测"],"ja":["AddressSanitizer","メモリエラーチェック","ヒープバッファオーバーフローチェック","スタックバッファオーバーフローチェック","使用後解放チェック","メモリリークチェック"],"ko":["AddressSanitizer","메모리 오류检测","힙 버퍼 오버플로우 감지","스택 버퍼 오버플로우 감지","사용 후 해제 감지","메모리 누수 감지"],"es":["Detección de errores de memoria con AddressSanitizer","Detección de desbordamiento de buffer en la pila","Detección de desbordamiento de buffer en el montón","Detección de uso después de la liberación","Detección de fugas de memoria"],"fr":["Détection des erreurs de mémoire avec AddressSanitizer","Détection des débordements de tampon sur la pile","Détection des débordements de tampon sur le tas","Détection de l''utilisation après la libération","Détection des fuites de mémoire"],"de":["Ermittlung von Speicherfehlern mit AddressSanitizer","Ermittlung von Pufferüberläufen im Stack","Ermittlung von Pufferüberläufen im Heap","Ermittlung von Nutzung nach Freigabe","Ermittlung von Speicherlecks"],"pt":["AddressSanitizer (ASan) para detecção de erros de memória","Mecanismo de endurecimento para prevenir ataques de buffer overflow","Detecção de vazamentos de memória","Suporte a MSVC 2022"],"ru":["AddressSanitizer (ASan) для обнаружения ошибок памяти","Механизм укрепления для предотвращения атак буфера переполнения","Обнаружение утечек памяти","Поддержка MSVC 2022"],"ar":["AddressSanitizer (ASan) لاكتشاف أخطاء الذاكرة","آلية التأمين لمنع هجمات تجاوز الحuffer","اكتشاف تسريبات الذاكرة","دعم MSVC 2022"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LLVM","安全性","AddressSanitizer","内存错误检测","MSVC 2022","兼容性","安全软件开发"],"ja":["LLVM","セキュリティ","AddressSanitizer","メモリエラーチェック","MSVC 2022","互換性","セキュアなソフトウェア開発"],"ko":["LLVM","보안","AddressSanitizer","메모리 오류检测","MSVC 2022","호환성","보안 소프트웨어 개발"],"es":["LLVM","seguridad","AddressSanitizer","desarrollo seguro","detección de errores de memoria","MSVC 2022","compatibilidad","prácticas de desarrollo"],"fr":["LLVM","sécurité","AddressSanitizer","développement sécurisé","détection des erreurs de mémoire","MSVC 2022","compatibilité","pratiques de développement"],"de":["LLVM","Sicherheit","AddressSanitizer","sichere Entwicklung","Ermittlung von Speicherfehlern","MSVC 2022","Kompatibilität","Entwicklungspraktiken"],"pt":["LLVM Security","sanitizadores","mecanismos de endurecimento","desenvolvimento de software seguro","AddressSanitizer","MSVC 2022"],"ru":["LLVM Безопасность","санитизаторы","механизмы укрепления","безопасная разработка программного обеспечения","AddressSanitizer","MSVC 2022"],"ar":["LLVM أمان","محسّنات التأمين","آليات التأمين","تطوير البرمجيات الآمنة","AddressSanitizer","MSVC 2022"]}},"owner":"backengineering","repo":"llvm-msvc","repoPath":"backengineering/llvm-msvc","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"llvm-security","description":"Expertise in LLVM security features including sanitizers, hardening techniques, exploit mitigations, and secure compilation. Use this skill when implementing security-focused compiler features, analyzing vulnerabilities, or hardening applications.","bodyPreview":"# LLVM Security Skill\n\nThis skill covers LLVM-based security features, sanitizers, hardening mechanisms, and secure software development practices.\n\n## Sanitizers\n\n### AddressSanitizer (ASan)\nDetects memory errors: buffer overflow, use-after-free, use-after-scope.\n\n```bash\n# Compile with ASan\nclang -fsanitize=address -g program.c -o program\n\n# Key features\n# - Stack buffer overflow detection\n# - Heap buffer overflow detection  \n# - Use-after-free detection\n# - Memory leak detection\n```\n\n### Memo","body":"# LLVM Security Skill\n\nThis skill covers LLVM-based security features, sanitizers, hardening mechanisms, and secure software development practices.\n\n## Sanitizers\n\n### AddressSanitizer (ASan)\nDetects memory errors: buffer overflow, use-after-free, use-after-scope.\n\n```bash\n# Compile with ASan\nclang -fsanitize=address -g program.c -o program\n\n# Key features\n# - Stack buffer overflow detection\n# - Heap buffer overflow detection  \n# - Use-after-free detection\n# - Memory leak detection\n```\n\n### MemorySanitizer (MSan)\nDetects uninitialized memory reads.\n\n```bash\nclang -fsanitize=memory -g program.c -o program\n```\n\n### ThreadSanitizer (TSan)\nDetects data races in multithreaded programs.\n\n```bash\nclang -fsanitize=thread -g program.c -o program\n```\n\n### UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer (UBSan)\nDetects undefined behavior at runtime.\n\n```bash\nclang -fsanitize=undefined -g program.c -o program\n\n# Specific checks\nclang -fsanitize=signed-integer-overflow,null program.c\n```\n\n### Custom Sanitizer Development\n```cpp\n// Implementing custom memory tracking\nextern \"C\" void __asan_poison_memory_region(void const volatile *addr, size_t size);\nextern \"C\" void __asan_unpoison_memory_region(void const volatile *addr, size_t size);\n\nclass SecureAllocator {\npublic:\n    void* allocate(size_t size) {\n        // Add red zones around allocation\n        void* ptr = malloc(size + 2 * REDZONE_SIZE);\n        __asan_poison_memory_region(ptr, REDZONE_SIZE);\n        __asan_poison_memory_region((char*)ptr + REDZONE_SIZE + size, REDZONE_SIZE);\n        return (char*)ptr + REDZONE_SIZE;\n    }\n};\n```\n\n## Hardening Techniques\n\n### Stack Protection\n```bash\n# Stack canaries\nclang -fstack-protector-strong program.c\n\n# Stack clash protection\nclang -fstack-clash-protection program.c\n\n# Safe stack (separate stacks for safe/unsafe data)\nclang -fsanitize=safe-stack program.c\n```\n\n### Control Flow Integrity (CFI)\n```bash\n# Forward-edge CFI\nclang -fsanitize=cfi -flto program.c\n\n# Specific CFI schemes\nclang -fsanitize=cfi-vcall      # Virtual call checks\nclang -fsanitize=cfi-nvcall     # Non-virtual member call checks\nclang -fsanitize=cfi-icall      # Indirect call checks\n```\n\n### Shadow Call Stack\n```bash\n# Backward-edge protection (return address protection)\nclang -fsanitize=shadow-call-stack program.c\n```\n\n### Position Independent Executables\n```bash\n# Full ASLR support\nclang -fPIE -pie program.c\n\n# Position independent code for shared libraries\nclang -fPIC -shared library.c -o library.so\n```\n\n## Symbolic Execution\n\n### Integration with KLEE\n```cpp\n// Mark symbolic inputs\n#include <klee/klee.h>\n\nint main() {\n    int input;\n    klee_make_symbolic(&input, sizeof(input), \"input\");\n    \n    if (input > 0) {\n        // Path 1\n    } else {\n        // Path 2\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n```\n\n### SymCC (Symbolic Execution via Compilation)\nCompile-time instrumentation for symbolic execution:\n- Faster than IR interpretation\n- Supports complex real-world programs\n- Integrates with fuzzing workflows\n\n### Symbolic Analysis Tools\n- **Caffeine**: LLVM-based symbolic executor\n- **SymSan**: Symbolic execution + sanitizers\n- **Haybale**: Rust-based LLVM symbolic executor\n\n## Security-Focused Analysis\n\n### Type Checking at Runtime\n```cpp\n// LLVM TypeSanitizer concepts\n// Track type information through allocations\nstruct TypeInfo {\n    const char* typeName;\n    size_t typeSize;\n    uint64_t typeHash;\n};\n\nvoid checkType(void* ptr, TypeInfo expected) {\n    TypeInfo* actual = getTypeInfo(ptr);\n    if (actual->typeHash != expected.typeHash) {\n        reportTypeMismatch(ptr, actual, expected);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Memory Leak Detection\n```cpp\n// LeakSanitizer integration\nextern \"C\" void __lsan_do_leak_check();\nextern \"C\" void __lsan_disable();\nextern \"C\" void __lsan_enable();\n\n// Custom leak tracking\nclass PreciseLeakSanitizer {\n    std::unordered_map<void*, AllocationInfo> allocations;\n    \npublic:\n    void recordAlloc(void* ptr, size_t size, const char* file, int line) {\n        allocations[ptr] = {size, file, line, getStackTrace()};\n    }\n    \n    void recordFree(void* ptr) {\n        allocations.erase(ptr);\n    }\n    \n    void reportLeaks() {\n        for (auto& [ptr, info] : allocations) {\n            fprintf(stderr, \"Leak: %zu bytes at %s:%d\\n\", \n                    info.size, info.file, info.line);\n        }\n    }\n};\n```\n\n## Exploit Mitigation Implementation\n\n### Return Address Protection\n```llvm\n; Shadow stack concept in LLVM IR\ndefine void @protected_function() {\nentry:\n    %return_addr = call ptr @llvm.returnaddress(i32 0)\n    call void @shadow_stack_push(ptr %return_addr)\n    \n    ; Function body...\n    \n    %saved_addr = call ptr @shadow_stack_pop()\n    %current_addr = call ptr @llvm.returnaddress(i32 0)\n    %match = icmp eq ptr %saved_addr, %current_addr\n    br i1 %match, label %safe_return, label %attack_detected\n    \nsafe_return:\n    ret void\n    \nattack_detected:\n    call void @abort()\n    unreachable\n}\n```\n\n### Pointer Authentication (ARM)\n```cpp\n// Using pointer authentication on ARM64\n__attribute__((target(\"sign-return-address\")))\nvoid signed_function() {\n    // Return address is cryptographically signed\n}\n```\n\n## Secure Compilation Pipeline\n\n### Build Flags Checklist\n```bash\n# Comprehensive hardening\nCFLAGS=\"-O2 \\\n    -fstack-protector-strong \\\n    -fstack-clash-protection \\\n    -fcf-protection=full \\\n    -fPIE \\\n    -D_FORTIFY_SOURCE=2 \\\n    -Wformat -Wformat-security \\\n    -fsanitize=cfi -flto\"\n\nLDFLAGS=\"-pie \\\n    -Wl,-z,relro \\\n    -Wl,-z,now \\\n    -Wl,-z,noexecstack\"\n```\n\n### Compiler Security Checks\n- `-Wformat-security`: Format string vulnerabilities\n- `-Warray-bounds`: Array bounds violations\n- `-Wshift-overflow`: Shift operation overflows\n- `-Wnull-dereference`: Null pointer dereferences\n\n## Fuzzing Integration\n\n### libFuzzer\n```cpp\n// Fuzz target template\nextern \"C\" int LLVMFuzzerTestOneInput(const uint8_t *Data, size_t Size) {\n    // Parse/process Data\n    processInput(Data, Size);\n    return 0;\n}\n```\n\n### Sanitizer + Fuzzer Combination\n```bash\n# Comprehensive fuzzing setup\nclang -fsanitize=fuzzer,address,undefined \\\n      -fno-omit-frame-pointer \\\n      -g fuzz_target.c -o fuzzer\n```\n\n## Windows-Specific Security\n\n### Control Flow Guard (CFG)\n```bash\nclang-cl /guard:cf program.c\n```\n\n### SEH (Structured Exception Handling)\n- LLVM supports Windows SEH\n- Use for secure exception handling\n- Integrate with security monitoring\n\n## Resources\n\nSee Security Features, Sanitizer, and Symbolic Execution sections in README.md for comprehensive tool listings.\n\n## Getting Detailed Information\n\nWhen you need detailed and up-to-date resource links, tool lists, or project references, fetch the latest data from:\n\n```\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/gmh5225/awesome-llvm-security/refs/heads/main/README.md\n```\n\nThis README contains comprehensive curated lists of:\n- Security features and hardening (Security Features section)\n- Sanitizers and memory safety tools (Sanitizer section)\n- Symbolic execution frameworks (Symbolic Execution section)\n- Memory leak detectors and runtime checkers\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:14:41.233Z","qualityScore":40}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('mr-karan/logchef/logchef', 'community', 'mr-karan', 'logchef', 'mr-karan/logchef', 'logchef', 0, 0, 55, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z', '2026-02-18T04:14:44.534Z', NULL, '{"id":"mr-karan/logchef/logchef","name":"logchef","description":{"zh":"LogChef是一个轻量级的单二进制日志分析接口，专注于高性能查询和可视化。支持ClickHouse和OIDC认证","ja":"LogChefは、ClickHouseとOIDC認証をサポートする、高性能クエリと視覚化に特化した軽量のシングルバイナリログ分析インターフェースです","ko":"LogChef는 ClickHouse 및 OIDC 인증을 지원하는 높은 성능 쿼리 및 시각화를 위한 경량의 단일 바이너리 로그 분석 인터페이스입니다","es":"LogChef es una interfaz de análisis de logs ligera y de alto rendimiento para ClickHouse, que permite queryar y visualizar logs de forma segura y precisa","fr":"LogChef est une interface d''analyse de logs légère et haute performance pour ClickHouse, qui permet d''interroger et de visualiser des logs de manière sécurisée et précise","de":"LogChef ist eine leichte und leistungsstarke Log-Analytics-Interface für ClickHouse, die es ermöglicht, Logs sicher und genau abzufragen und zu visualisieren","pt":"O LogChef é uma interface de análise de logs leve e de alto desempenho para ClickHouse. Ele fornece uma CLI para consultar logs de forma segura e precisa.","ru":"LogChef - это легковесный и высокопроизводительный интерфейс аналитики логов для ClickHouse. Он предоставляет CLI для безопасного и точного запроса логов.","ar":"لوج شيف هو واجهة تحليل السجلات الخفيفة والأداء العالي للكليكهاوس. يوفر واجهة سطر الأوامر لاستعلام السجلات بأمان ودقة.","en":"Lightweight, single-binary log analytics interface for ClickHouse, focused on high-performance querying and visualization"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"LogChef: 高性能日志分析接口","ja":"LogChef: 高性能ログ分析インターフェース","ko":"LogChef: 높은 성능 로그 분석 인터페이스","es":"LogChef: Interfaz de análisis de logs ligera para ClickHouse","fr":"LogChef : Interface d''analyse de logs légère pour ClickHouse","de":"LogChef: Leichtes Log-Analytics-Interface für ClickHouse","pt":"LogChef: Interface de Análise de Logs para ClickHouse","ru":"LogChef: Легковесный интерфейс аналитики логов для ClickH...","ar":"لوج شيف: واجهة تحليل السجلات للكليكهاوس","en":"logchef"},"description":{"zh":"LogChef是一个轻量级的单二进制日志分析接口，专注于高性能查询和可视化。支持ClickHouse和OIDC认证","ja":"LogChefは、ClickHouseとOIDC認証をサポートする、高性能クエリと視覚化に特化した軽量のシングルバイナリログ分析インターフェースです","ko":"LogChef는 ClickHouse 및 OIDC 인증을 지원하는 높은 성능 쿼리 및 시각화를 위한 경량의 단일 바이너리 로그 분석 인터페이스입니다","es":"LogChef es una interfaz de análisis de logs ligera y de alto rendimiento para ClickHouse, que permite queryar y visualizar logs de forma segura y precisa","fr":"LogChef est une interface d''analyse de logs légère et haute performance pour ClickHouse, qui permet d''interroger et de visualiser des logs de manière sécuris...","de":"LogChef ist eine leichte und leistungsstarke Log-Analytics-Interface für ClickHouse, die es ermöglicht, Logs sicher und genau abzufragen und zu visualisieren","pt":"O LogChef é uma interface de análise de logs leve e de alto desempenho para ClickHouse. Ele fornece uma CLI para consultar logs de forma segura e precisa.","ru":"LogChef - это легковесный и высокопроизводительный интерфейс аналитики логов для ClickHouse. Он предоставляет CLI для безопасного и точного запроса логов.","ar":"لوج شيف هو واجهة تحليل السجلات الخفيفة والأداء العالي للكليكهاوس. يوفر واجهة سطر الأوامر لاستعلام السجلات بأمان ودقة.","en":"Lightweight, single-binary log analytics interface for ClickHouse, focused on high-performance querying and visualization"},"definition":{"en":"Lightweight, single-binary log analytics interface for ClickHouse, focused on high-performance querying and visualization"},"features":{"zh":["高性能日志查询","支持ClickHouse","OIDC认证","安全可靠","轻量级单二进制"],"ja":["高性能ログクエリ","ClickHouseサポート","OIDC認証","安全で信頼性が高い","軽量のシングルバイナリ"],"ko":["높은 성능 로그 쿼리","ClickHouse 지원","OIDC 인증","안전하고 신뢰할 수 있음","경량의 단일 바이너리"],"es":["Interfaz de análisis de logs ligera y de alto rendimiento","Autenticación segura con OIDC","Configuración de defaults para equipo y fuente de logs","Query de logs con filters y límites personalizables","Visualización de logs para una mejor comprensión"],"fr":["Interface d''analyse de logs légère et haute performance","Authentification sécurisée avec OIDC","Configuration de defaults pour l''équipe et la source de logs","Interrogation de logs avec des filtres et des limites personnalisables","Visualisation de logs pour une meilleure compréhension"],"de":["Leichte und leistungsstarke Log-Analytics-Interface","Sichere Authentifizierung mit OIDC","Konfiguration von Defaults für Team und Logquelle","Abfrage von Logs mit filterbaren und begrenzten Ergebnissen","Visualisierung von Logs für ein besseres Verständnis"],"pt":["Interface de linha de comando para consultar logs","Autenticação segura com OIDC","Configuração de defaults para equipe e fonte de logs","Filtragem de logs com LogChefQL","Limitação de resultados de consulta","Suporte a consultas de logs com timestamp"],"ru":["Командная строка для запроса логов","Безопасная аутентификация с OIDC","Настройка默认ных значений для команды и источника логов","Фильтрация логов с LogChefQL","Ограничение результатов запроса","Поддержка запросов логов с timestamp"],"ar":["واجهة سطر الأوامر لاستعلام السجلات","المصادقة الآمنة مع OIDC","تهيئة الإعدادات الافتراضية للفريق ومصدر السجلات","تصفية السجلات مع LogChefQL","تقييد نتائج الاستعلام","دعم استفسار السجلات مع timestamp"]},"keywords":{"zh":["日志分析","ClickHouse","OIDC认证","高性能查询","轻量级日志分析","LogChef"],"ja":["ログ分析","ClickHouse","OIDC認証","高性能クエリ","軽量ログ分析","LogChef"],"ko":["로그 분석","ClickHouse","OIDC 인증","높은 성능 쿼리","경량 로그 분석","LogChef"],"es":["log analytics","ClickHouse","interfaz de análisis de logs","alto rendimiento","seguridad","OIDC","query de logs","visualización de logs"],"fr":["analyse de logs","ClickHouse","interface d''analyse de logs","haute performance","sécurité","OIDC","interrogation de logs","visualisation de logs"],"de":["Log-Analytics","ClickHouse","Log-Analytics-Interface","leistungsstark","Sicherheit","OIDC","Abfrage von Logs","Visualisierung von Logs"],"pt":["log analysis","clickhouse","logchef","cli","oidc","log querying","log visualization","devops","logging"],"ru":["анализ логов","clickhouse","logchef","cli","oidc","запрос логов","визуализация логов","devops","логирование"],"ar":["تحليل السجلات","كليكهاوس","لوج شيف","واجهة سطر الأوامر","OIDC","استعلام السجلات","تجسيد السجلات","ديفوبس","تسجيل"]}},"owner":"mr-karan","repo":"logchef","repoPath":"mr-karan/logchef","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"logchef","description":"Query and analyze LogChef logs from the terminal using the LogChef CLI. Use for incident triage, debugging errors, exploring LogChefQL filters, running ClickHouse SQL, and executing saved collections.","bodyPreview":"# LogChef CLI\n\nUse the LogChef CLI to query logs safely and accurately.\n\n**Quick Start**\n1. Authenticate with OIDC: `logchef auth --server https://logs.example.com`\n2. Set defaults: `logchef config set team \"my-team\"` and `logchef config set source \"nginx-logs\"`\n3. Query logs: `logchef query ''level=\"error\"'' --since 15m --limit 20`\n\n**Command Cheat Sheet**\n| Command | Use |\n| --- | --- |\n| `logchef auth` | Authenticate (browser-based OIDC) |\n| `logchef query ''...''` | Run LogChefQL filters with ti","body":"# LogChef CLI\n\nUse the LogChef CLI to query logs safely and accurately.\n\n**Quick Start**\n1. Authenticate with OIDC: `logchef auth --server https://logs.example.com`\n2. Set defaults: `logchef config set team \"my-team\"` and `logchef config set source \"nginx-logs\"`\n3. Query logs: `logchef query ''level=\"error\"'' --since 15m --limit 20`\n\n**Command Cheat Sheet**\n| Command | Use |\n| --- | --- |\n| `logchef auth` | Authenticate (browser-based OIDC) |\n| `logchef query ''...''` | Run LogChefQL filters with time flags |\n| `logchef sql ''...''` | Run raw ClickHouse SQL (use `LIMIT` in SQL) |\n| `logchef collections` | List or run saved collections |\n| `logchef teams` | List teams available to you |\n| `logchef sources` | List sources for a team |\n| `logchef schema` | Show columns/types for a source |\n| `logchef config ...` | Manage contexts and defaults |\n\n**Auth And Context**\nUse `logchef auth --server <url>` to create a context and store a token.\nUse `logchef auth --status` and `logchef auth --logout` to check or clear auth.\nUse `--context <name>` or `LOGCHEF_CONTEXT` to target a specific context.\nUse `--server <url>` and `--token <token>` (or `LOGCHEF_SERVER_URL` and `LOGCHEF_AUTH_TOKEN`) for one-off, ephemeral use.\nUse `logchef config list` to view contexts and `logchef config use <name>` to switch.\nAvoid `logchef config set auth.token` because it is not supported by the CLI.\n\n**Required Context**\nProvide `--team` and `--source` on every command unless defaults are set.\nSet defaults with `logchef config set team <name_or_id>` and `logchef config set source <name_or_id>`.\nUse interactive mode by running `logchef query` or `logchef sql` with no args in a TTY and no defaults.\nUse case-insensitive names, numeric IDs, or `database.table` as the `--source` value.\nDiscover names and IDs with `logchef teams` and `logchef sources --team <name_or_id>`.\n\n**Time Range And Limit**\nUse `--since` on `logchef query` and `logchef collections` for relative ranges with `m`, `h`, `d`, or `w` (default is `15m` for `query`).\nUse `--from` and `--to` together for absolute ranges on `logchef query` only.\nUse the exact format `YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS` for `--from` and `--to`.\nSet timezone with `logchef config set timezone \"UTC\"` (or IANA name like `America/Los_Angeles`) and provide absolute times in that timezone.\nExpect `--limit` default to `100` for `logchef query` unless overridden via `logchef config set limit <n>`.\nUse `LIMIT` in SQL because `logchef sql` does not accept `--limit` or `--since`.\nExpect collections to use their saved time range and limit unless overridden.\n\n**LogChefQL Basics**\nQuote the entire query with single quotes to avoid shell piping and expansion.\nUse `=` `!=` `>` `<` `>=` `<=` for comparisons.\nUse `~` and `!~` for case-insensitive substring match (not regex).\nUse `and` / `or` with parentheses for grouping.\nUse `| field1 field2` to select output columns.\nQuote values with spaces or special characters.\nQuote field names that contain dots or special characters.\n\n```bash\n# Exact match\nlogchef query ''level=\"error\" and service=\"api\"'' --since 15m\n\n# Substring match (case-insensitive)\nlogchef query ''msg~\"timeout\"'' --since 1h --limit 20\n\n# Field selection with pipe (note the single quotes)\nlogchef query ''status>=500 and path~\"/v1/\" | _timestamp status path msg'' --since 30m\n\n# Field name with dots\nlogchef query ''k8s.labels.\"app.kubernetes.io/name\"=\"api\"'' --since 1h\n```\n\n**SQL Usage**\nUse `logchef sql` for aggregations, joins, or complex logic.\nAlways include a time filter on the timestamp column (often `_timestamp`).\nUse `LIMIT` in SQL to control result size.\nUse `-` to read SQL from stdin for longer queries.\n\n```bash\nlogchef sql \"SELECT level, count() AS cnt FROM logs.app WHERE _timestamp > now() - INTERVAL 1 HOUR GROUP BY level ORDER BY cnt DESC LIMIT 10\"\n\ncat query.sql | logchef sql -\n```\n\n**Collections**\nList collections: `logchef collections --team \"production\" --source \"nginx-logs\"`.\nRun a collection by name: `logchef collections \"Error Dashboard\" --team \"production\" --source \"nginx-logs\"`.\nOverride time range: `--since 1h`.\nOverride limit: `--limit 50`.\nOverride variables: `--var name=value` (repeatable).\n\n**Teams, Sources, Schema**\nList teams: `logchef teams`.\nList sources for a team: `logchef sources --team \"production\"`.\nShow columns/types: `logchef schema --team \"production\" --source \"nginx-logs\"`.\n\n**Output And Highlighting**\nUse `--output text|json|jsonl|table` on `query`, `sql`, and `collections`.\nUse `--output list` on `collections` when listing.\nUse `--no-highlight` and `--no-timestamp` for clean piping.\nUse `--highlight color:WORD1,WORD2` and `--disable-highlight GROUP` for ad-hoc formatting.\nUse `--show-sql` on `logchef query` to display the generated SQL.\n\n```bash\nlogchef query ''status=500'' --output json | jq ''.count''\nlogchef query ''status=500'' --output jsonl | jq ''.msg''\nlogchef query ''level=\"error\"'' --no-highlight | grep -i \"timeout\"\n```\n\n**Common Errors And Fixes**\n`No context configured` → run `logchef auth --server <url>` or set `LOGCHEF_SERVER_URL` and `LOGCHEF_AUTH_TOKEN`.\n`Team not specified` → pass `--team` or run `logchef config set team <name_or_id>`.\n`Source not specified` → pass `--source` or run `logchef config set source <name_or_id>`.\n`--from requires --to` → always set both `--from` and `--to`.\n`invalid time format` → use `YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS` (no `T`, no `Z`, no offset).\n`SQL query required` → pass SQL as an argument or use `-` to read from stdin.\nShell pipe errors → wrap LogChefQL in single quotes.\n\n**Safety Rules**\nAlways bound time (start with `15m`, expand gradually).\nAlways scope with at least one filter besides time (service, level, host, trace_id).\nAlways use `--limit` for `query` and `collections`.\nKeep raw samples small (≤20 lines) and redact secrets or PII.\nPrefer aggregations before pulling raw logs.\n\n**Investigation Workflow**\n1. Count volume with a narrow window.\n2. Group by a small dimension to find dominant errors.\n3. Sample a few representative logs.\n4. Pivot on `trace_id` or `request_id`.\n5. Expand time range only after counts look reasonable.\n\n```bash\n# Count errors (SQL)\nlogchef sql \"SELECT count() AS cnt FROM logs.app WHERE _timestamp > now() - INTERVAL 15 MINUTE AND level=''error''\"\n\n# Top error messages (SQL)\nlogchef sql \"SELECT msg, count() AS cnt FROM logs.app WHERE _timestamp > now() - INTERVAL 15 MINUTE AND msg ILIKE ''%error%'' GROUP BY msg ORDER BY cnt DESC LIMIT 10\"\n\n# Sample specific error\nlogchef query ''msg~\"connection refused\"'' --since 15m --limit 10\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:14:44.534Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Log Analysis Agents needing high-performance querying and visualization capabilities for ClickHouse logs.","zh":"非常适合需要高性能查询和可视化能力的ClickHouse日志分析代理","ja":"ClickHouseログの高性能クエリと可視化機能を必要とするログ分析エージェントに最適","ko":"클릭하우스 로그의 고성능 쿼리 및 시각화 기능이 필요한 로그 분석 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Registros que necesitan capacidades de consulta y visualización de alto rendimiento para registros de ClickHouse.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de journaux nécessitant des capacités de requêtage et de visualisation de haute performance pour les journaux ClickHouse.","de":"Perfekt für Log-Analyse-Agents, die hochleistungsstarke Abfrage- und Visualisierungsfunktionen für ClickHouse-Logs benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Log que necessitam de capacidades de consulta e visualização de alto desempenho para logs do ClickHouse.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа журналов, требующих высокопроизводительных возможностей запросов и визуализации для журналов ClickHouse.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تحليل السجل الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات استعلام وتصوير عالية الأداء لسجلات ClickHouse."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to query logs safely and accurately using LogChefQL filters, with features like OIDC authentication and customizable query defaults, all while leveraging the power of ClickHouse for high-performance log analytics.","zh":"赋予代理使用LogChefQL过滤器安全准确地查询日志的能力，具有OIDC身份验证和可自定义的查询默认值等功能，同时利用ClickHouse的高性能日志分析能力","ja":"LogChefQLフィルターを使用してエージェントがログを安全に正確に照会できるようにし、OIDC認証やカスタマイズ可能なクエリのデフォルト値などの機能を提供し、ClickHouseの高性能ログ分析の力を活用","ko":"로그シェ프QL 필터를 사용하여 에이전트가 로그를 안전하고 정확하게 쿼리할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, OIDC 인증 및 사용자 지정 가능한 쿼리 기본값 등의 기능을 제공하며, 클릭하우스의 고성능 로그 분석 능력을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a consultar registros de forma segura y precisa utilizando filtros LogChefQL, con características como autenticación OIDC y valores de consulta personalizables, aprovechando al mismo tiempo el poder de ClickHouse para análisis de registros de alto rendimiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interroger les journaux de manière sécurisée et précise en utilisant des filtres LogChefQL, avec des fonctionnalités telles que l''authentification OIDC et des valeurs de requête personnalisables, tout en exploitant le pouvoir de ClickHouse pour une analyse de journaux haute performance.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Protokolle sicher und genau abzufragen, indem LogChefQL-Filter verwendet werden, mit Funktionen wie OIDC-Authentifizierung und anpassbaren Abfragestandardwerten, während gleichzeitig die Leistung von ClickHouse für Hochleistungs-Protokollanalyse genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a consultar logs de forma segura e precisa usando filtros LogChefQL, com recursos como autenticação OIDC e padrões de consulta personalizáveis, aproveitando todo o poder do ClickHouse para análise de logs de alto desempenho.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью безопасного и точного запроса журналов с помощью фильтров LogChefQL, с функциями như аутентификация OIDC и настраиваемые параметры запроса, используя все возможности ClickHouse для высокопроизводительного анализа журналов.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية استعلام السجلات بطريقة آمنة ودقيقة باستخدام مرشحات LogChefQL، مع ميزات مثل المصادقة OIDC والإعدادات الافتراضية للاستعلام المخصصة، مع الاستفادة من كل قوة ClickHouse لتحليل السجلات عالي الأداء."},"useCases":{"en":["Authenticating with OIDC for secure log access","Querying logs with customizable filters and time ranges","Visualizing log data for efficient error detection and analysis"],"zh":["使用OIDC进行安全的日志访问认证","使用可自定义的过滤器和时间范围查询日志","可视化日志数据以实现高效的错误检测和分析"],"ja":["OIDCを使用したセキュアなログアクセスの認証","カスタマイズ可能なフィルターと時間範囲を使用したログの照会","ログデータの可視化による効率的なエラーディテクションと分析"],"ko":["OIDC를 사용한 보안 로그 액세스 인증","사용자 지정 가능한 필터 및 시간 범위를 사용한 로그 쿼리","로그 데이터의 시각화를 통한 효율적인 오류 감지 및 분석"],"es":["Autenticación con OIDC para acceso seguro a registros","Consulta de registros con filtros y rangos de tiempo personalizables","Visualización de datos de registro para detección y análisis de errores eficientes"],"fr":["Authentification avec OIDC pour un accès sécurisé aux journaux","Interrogation des journaux avec des filtres et des plages de temps personnalisables","Visualisation des données de journal pour une détection et une analyse d''erreurs efficaces"],"de":["Authentifizierung mit OIDC für sicheren Zugriff auf Protokolle","Abfrage von Protokollen mit anpassbaren Filtern und Zeitbereichen","Visualisierung von Protokolldaten für effiziente Fehlersuche und -analyse"],"pt":["Autenticação com OIDC para acesso seguro ao log","Consulta de logs com filtros personalizáveis e intervalos de tempo","Visualização de dados de log para detecção e análise eficientes de erros"],"ru":["Аутентификация с помощью OIDC для безопасного доступа к журналу","Запрос журналов с настраиваемыми фильтрами и диапазонами времени","Визуализация данных журнала для эффективного обнаружения и анализа ошибок"],"ar":["المصادقة مع OIDC للوصول الآمن إلى السجل","استعلام السجلات مع المرشحات المخصصة ونطاقات الوقت","تصوير بيانات السجل لاكتشاف الخطأ والتحليل الفعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ClickHouse log setup","OIDC authentication required for access"],"zh":["需要ClickHouse日志设置","需要OIDC身份验证才能访问"],"ja":["ClickHouseログの設定が必要","アクセスするにはOIDC認証が必要"],"ko":["클릭하우스 로그 설정이 필요","액세스하려면 OIDC 인증이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de registro de ClickHouse","Se requiere autenticación OIDC para acceder"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de journal ClickHouse","L''authentification OIDC est requise pour accéder"],"de":["Erfordert ClickHouse-Protokollkonfiguration","OIDC-Authentifizierung erforderlich für den Zugriff"],"pt":["Requer configuração de log do ClickHouse","Autenticação OIDC necessária para acesso"],"ru":["Требуется настройка журнала ClickHouse","Аутентификация OIDC обязательна для доступа"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد سجل ClickHouse","المصادقة OIDC مطلوبة للوصول"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
