, 컴파일러 개발의 학습 리소스와 학습 경로를 제공","es":"El skill de aprendizaje de LLVM proporciona recursos y tutoriales para dominar LLVM, Clang y el desarrollo de compiladores","fr":"Le skill d''apprentissage LLVM fournit des ressources et des tutoriels pour maîtriser LLVM, Clang et le développement de compilateurs","de":"Das LLVM-Lernskill bietet Ressourcen und Anleitungen, um LLVM, Clang und Compiler-Entwicklung zu meistern","pt":"O skill de aprendizado de LLVM fornece caminhos de aprendizado e recursos para dominar LLVM, Clang e desenvolvimento de compiladores.","ru":"Навык обучения LLVM предоставляет кураторские материалы и ресурсы для освоения LLVM, Clang и разработки компиляторов.","ar":"مهارة تعلم LLVM توفر مسارات تعلم و موارد لتحقيق الإتقان في LLVM و Clang و تطوير المجمّعات","en":"LLVM fork with explicit compatibility with MSVC 2022 features."},"definition":{"en":"LLVM fork with explicit compatibility with MSVC 2022 features."},"features":{"zh":["提供学习LLVM、Clang和编译器开发的资源","包含官方LLVM教程和Kaleidoscope语言","支持自定义IR转换和优化","兼容MSVC 2022功能","提供学习路径和资源","支持编译器开发"],"ja":["LLVM、Clang、コンパイラ開発の学習リソースを提供","公式LLVMチュートリアルとKaleidoscope言語を含む","カスタムIR変換と最適化をサポート","MSVC 2022機能と互換性","学習パスとリソースを提供","コンパイラ開発をサポート"],"ko":["LLVM, Clang, 컴파일러 개발의 학습 리소스를 제공","공식 LLVM 튜토리얼과 Kaleidoscope 언어를 포함","사용자 정의 IR 변환과 최적화를 지원","MSVC 2022 기능과 호환","학습 경로와 리소스를 제공","컴파일러 개발을 지원"],"es":["Recursos de aprendizaje personalizados para desarrolladores","Tutoriales de Kaleidoscope y LLVM IR","Pases personalizados para transformar IR","Integración con Clang y MSVC 2022","Optimización y desarrollo de compiladores"],"fr":["Ressources d''apprentissage personnalisées pour les développeurs","Tutoriels de Kaleidoscope et LLVM IR","Passe personnalisés pour transformer IR","Intégration avec Clang et MSVC 2022","Optimisation et développement de compilateurs"],"de":["Maßgeschneiderte Lernressourcen für Entwickler","Kaleidoscope- und LLVM-IR-Tutorials","Benutzerdefinierte Pässe zur IR-Transformation","Integration mit Clang und MSVC 2022","Optimierung und Compiler-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Caminhos de aprendizado personalizados","Recursos para dominar LLVM e Clang","Desenvolvimento de compiladores","Otimização de código","Transformação de IR com passes personalizados","Entendimento do frontend C/C++"],"ru":["Индивидуальные учебные пути","Ресурсы для освоения LLVM и Clang","Разработка компиляторов","Оптимизация кода","Преобразование IR с помощью пользовательских проходов","Понимание frontend C/C++"],"ar":["مسارات تعلم محددة","موارد لتحقيق الإتقان في LLVM و Clang","تطوير المجمّعات","تحسين الكود","تحويل IR باستخدام تمريرات مخصصة","فهم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات C/C++"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LLVM","Clang","编译器开发","Kaleidoscope","IR转换","优化","MSVC 2022","LLVM fork","编译器开发工具"],"ja":["LLVM","Clang","コンパイラ開発","Kaleidoscope","IR変換","最適化","MSVC 2022","LLVM fork","コンパイラ開発ツール"],"ko":["LLVM","Clang","컴파일러 개발","Kaleidoscope","IR 변환","최적화","MSVC 2022","LLVM fork","컴파일러 개발 도구"],"es":["LLVM","Clang","compilador","desarrollo de compiladores","MSVC 2022","optimización","Kaleidoscope","LLVM IR","pases personalizados"],"fr":["LLVM","Clang","compilateur","développement de compilateurs","MSVC 2022","optimisation","Kaleidoscope","LLVM IR","passe personnalisés"],"de":["LLVM","Clang","Compiler","Compiler-Entwicklung","MSVC 2022","Optimierung","Kaleidoscope","LLVM-IR","benutzerdefinierte Pässe"],"pt":["LLVM","Clang","desenvolvimento de compiladores","otimização de código","transformação de IR","frontend C/C++","caminhos de aprendizado","recursos de aprendizado","desenvolvedores"],"ru":["LLVM","Clang","разработка компиляторов","оптимизация кода","преобразование IR","frontend C/C++","учебные пути","ресурсы обучения","разработчики"],"ar":["LLVM","Clang","تطوير المجمّعات","تحسين الكود","تحويل IR","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات C/C++","مسارات التعلم","موارد التعلم","المطورين"]}},"owner":"backengineering","repo":"llvm-msvc","repoPath":"backengineering/llvm-msvc","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"llvm-learning","description":"Comprehensive learning resources and tutorials for LLVM, Clang, and compiler development. Use this skill when helping users learn LLVM internals, find educational resources, or understand compiler concepts.","bodyPreview":"# LLVM Learning Skill\n\nThis skill provides curated learning paths and resources for mastering LLVM, Clang, and compiler development.\n\n## Learning Paths\n\n### Beginner Path\n1. **Start with Kaleidoscope**: Official LLVM tutorial building a simple language\n2. **Understand LLVM IR**: Learn the intermediate representation\n3. **Write Simple Passes**: Transform IR with custom passes\n4. **Explore Clang**: Understand C/C++ frontend\n\n### Intermediate Path\n1. **Deep Dive into Optimization**: Study built-in","body":"# LLVM Learning Skill\n\nThis skill provides curated learning paths and resources for mastering LLVM, Clang, and compiler development.\n\n## Learning Paths\n\n### Beginner Path\n1. **Start with Kaleidoscope**: Official LLVM tutorial building a simple language\n2. **Understand LLVM IR**: Learn the intermediate representation\n3. **Write Simple Passes**: Transform IR with custom passes\n4. **Explore Clang**: Understand C/C++ frontend\n\n### Intermediate Path\n1. **Deep Dive into Optimization**: Study built-in optimization passes\n2. **Backend Development**: Target code generation\n3. **Analysis Frameworks**: Pointer analysis, dataflow\n4. **Clang Tooling**: LibTooling, AST matchers\n\n### Advanced Path\n1. **MLIR**: Multi-level IR for domain-specific compilation\n2. **JIT Compilation**: ORC JIT framework\n3. **Security Features**: Sanitizers, CFI implementation\n4. **Contribute to LLVM**: Patches, reviews, community\n\n## Official Resources\n\n### Documentation\n- **LLVM Docs**: https://llvm.org/docs\n- **Clang Docs**: https://clang.llvm.org/docs\n- **LLVM Language Reference**: Complete IR specification\n- **Programmer''s Manual**: Core APIs and usage\n\n### Tutorials\n- **Kaleidoscope**: https://llvm.org/docs/tutorial/MyFirstLanguageFrontend/index.html\n- **Writing an LLVM Pass**: https://llvm.org/docs/WritingAnLLVMPass.html\n- **Building LLVM**: https://llvm.org/docs/GettingStarted.html\n\n## Community Resources\n\n### Books and Guides\n- **Learn LLVM 12** by Kai Nacke: Comprehensive practical guide\n- **LLVM Techniques, Tips, and Best Practices**: Advanced patterns\n- **Getting Started with LLVM Core Libraries**: Foundation concepts\n- **LLVM Essentials**: Quick start guide\n\n### Video Resources\n- **LLVM Developer Meetings**: Recorded talks on YouTube\n- **LLVM Weekly**: Newsletter with latest developments\n- **EuroLLVM/US LLVM**: Conference recordings\n\n### GitHub Learning Projects\n```\n# Highly recommended starter projects\nbanach-space/llvm-tutor     # Comprehensive pass examples\nhunterzju/llvm-tutorial     # Step-by-step tutorials\njauhien/iron-kaleidoscope   # Kaleidoscope in Rust\nbigconvience/llvm-ir-in-action  # IR examples\n```\n\n## LLVM IR Essentials\n\n### Basic Structure\n```llvm\n; Module level\n@global_var = global i32 42\n\n; Function definition\ndefine i32 @add(i32 %a, i32 %b) {\nentry:\n    %sum = add i32 %a, %b\n    ret i32 %sum\n}\n\n; External declaration\ndeclare i32 @printf(i8*, ...)\n```\n\n### Common Instructions\n```llvm\n; Arithmetic\n%result = add i32 %a, %b\n%result = sub i32 %a, %b\n%result = mul i32 %a, %b\n\n; Memory\n%ptr = alloca i32\nstore i32 %value, i32* %ptr\n%loaded = load i32, i32* %ptr\n\n; Control flow\nbr i1 %cond, label %then, label %else\nbr label %next\n\n; Function calls\n%retval = call i32 @function(i32 %arg)\n```\n\n### Type System\n```llvm\n; Integer types: i1, i8, i16, i32, i64, i128\n; Floating point: half, float, double\n; Pointers: i32*, [10 x i32]*, { i32, i64 }*\n; Arrays: [10 x i32]\n; Structs: { i32, i64, i8* }\n; Vectors: <4 x i32>\n```\n\n## Writing LLVM Passes\n\n### New Pass Manager (Recommended)\n```cpp\n#include \"llvm/Passes/PassPlugin.h\"\n#include \"llvm/Passes/PassBuilder.h\"\n\nstruct MyPass : public llvm::PassInfoMixin<MyPass> {\n    llvm::PreservedAnalyses run(llvm::Function &F,\n                                 llvm::FunctionAnalysisManager &FAM) {\n        for (auto &BB : F) {\n            for (auto &I : BB) {\n                llvm::errs() << I << \"\\n\";\n            }\n        }\n        return llvm::PreservedAnalyses::all();\n    }\n};\n\n// Plugin registration\nextern \"C\" LLVM_ATTRIBUTE_WEAK ::llvm::PassPluginLibraryInfo\nllvmGetPassPluginInfo() {\n    return {LLVM_PLUGIN_API_VERSION, \"MyPass\", LLVM_VERSION_STRING,\n            [](llvm::PassBuilder &PB) {\n                PB.registerPipelineParsingCallback(\n                    [](llvm::StringRef Name, llvm::FunctionPassManager &FPM,\n                       llvm::ArrayRef<llvm::PassBuilder::PipelineElement>) {\n                        if (Name == \"my-pass\") {\n                            FPM.addPass(MyPass());\n                            return true;\n                        }\n                        return false;\n                    });\n            }};\n}\n```\n\n### Running Custom Passes\n```bash\n# Build as shared library\nclang++ -shared -fPIC -o MyPass.so MyPass.cpp `llvm-config --cxxflags --ldflags`\n\n# Run with opt\nopt -load-pass-plugin=./MyPass.so -passes=\"my-pass\" input.ll -o output.ll\n```\n\n## Clang Development\n\n### AST Exploration\n```bash\n# Dump AST\nclang -Xclang -ast-dump -fsyntax-only source.cpp\n\n# AST as JSON\nclang -Xclang -ast-dump=json -fsyntax-only source.cpp\n```\n\n### LibTooling Basics\n```cpp\n#include \"clang/Tooling/Tooling.h\"\n#include \"clang/ASTMatchers/ASTMatchers.h\"\n#include \"clang/ASTMatchers/ASTMatchFinder.h\"\n\nusing namespace clang::ast_matchers;\n\n// Match all function declarations\nauto matcher = functionDecl().bind(\"func\");\n\nclass Callback : public MatchFinder::MatchCallback {\n    void run(const MatchFinder::MatchResult &Result) override {\n        if (auto *FD = Result.Nodes.getNodeAs<FunctionDecl>(\"func\")) {\n            llvm::outs() << \"Found: \" << FD->getName() << \"\\n\";\n        }\n    }\n};\n```\n\n### AST Matchers Reference\n```cpp\n// Common matchers\nfunctionDecl()               // Match function declarations\nvarDecl()                    // Match variable declarations\nbinaryOperator()             // Match binary operators\ncallExpr()                   // Match function calls\nifStmt()                     // Match if statements\n\n// Narrowing matchers\nhasName(\"foo\")               // Match by name\nhasType(asString(\"int\"))     // Match by type\nisPrivate()                  // Match private members\n\n// Traversal matchers\nhasDescendant(...)           // Match in subtree\nhasAncestor(...)             // Match in parent tree\nhasBody(...)                 // Match function body\n```\n\n## Development Tools\n\n### Essential Commands\n```bash\n# Compile to LLVM IR\nclang -S -emit-llvm source.c -o source.ll\n\n# Optimize IR\nopt -O2 source.ll -o optimized.ll\n\n# Disassemble bitcode\nllvm-dis source.bc -o source.ll\n\n# Assemble to bitcode\nllvm-as source.ll -o source.bc\n\n# Generate native code\nllc source.ll -o source.s\n\n# View CFG\nopt -passes=view-cfg source.ll\n```\n\n### Debugging LLVM IR\n```bash\n# With debug info\nclang -g -S -emit-llvm source.c\n\n# Debug IR transformation\nopt -debug-pass=Structure -O2 source.ll\n\n# Verify IR validity\nopt -passes=verify source.ll\n```\n\n## Common Analysis APIs\n\n```cpp\n// Dominator Tree\n#include \"llvm/Analysis/Dominators.h\"\nDominatorTree &DT = FAM.getResult<DominatorTreeAnalysis>(F);\nif (DT.dominates(BB1, BB2)) { /* BB1 dominates BB2 */ }\n\n// Loop Analysis\n#include \"llvm/Analysis/LoopInfo.h\"\nLoopInfo &LI = FAM.getResult<LoopAnalysis>(F);\nfor (Loop *L : LI) { /* process loops */ }\n\n// Alias Analysis\n#include \"llvm/Analysis/AliasAnalysis.h\"\nAAResults &AA = FAM.getResult<AAManager>(F);\nAliasResult R = AA.alias(Ptr1, Ptr2);\n\n// Call Graph\n#include \"llvm/Analysis/CallGraph.h\"\nCallGraph &CG = MAM.getResult<CallGraphAnalysis>(M);\n```\n\n## Practice Projects\n\n### Beginner\n1. Instruction counter pass\n2. Function call logger\n3. Dead code finder\n\n### Intermediate\n1. Simple constant propagation\n2. Branch probability estimator\n3. Memory access pattern analyzer\n\n### Advanced\n1. Custom optimization pass\n2. Security vulnerability detector\n3. Domain-specific language frontend\n\n## Community\n\n### Getting Help\n- **LLVM Discourse**: https://discourse.llvm.org\n- **LLVM Discord**: Real-time chat\n- **LLVM Mailing Lists**: llvm-dev, cfe-dev\n\n### Contributing\n- **Phabricator**: Code reviews (being migrated to GitHub)\n- **GitHub**: https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project\n- **Bug Tracker**: https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/issues\n\n## Resources Index\n\nFor a comprehensive list of tutorials, books, and example projects, see the LLVM Tutorial and Clang Tutorial sections in the main README.md.\n\n## Getting Detailed Information\n\nWhen you need detailed and up-to-date resource links, tutorials, or learning materials, fetch the latest data from:\n\n```\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/gmh5225/awesome-llvm-security/refs/heads/main/README.md\n```\n\nThis README contains comprehensive curated lists of:\n- LLVM tutorials and learning resources (LLVM Tutorial section)\n- Clang tutorials and AST guides (Clang Tutorial section)\n- C++ modern programming guides (CPP Tutorial section)\n- Compiler and security books\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:14:47.148Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Compiler Development Agents needing mastery of LLVM, Clang, and intermediate representation (IR) manipulation.","zh":"非常适合需要掌握LLVM、Clang和中间表示（IR）操作的编译器开发代理。","ja":"LLVM、Clang、そして中間表現（IR）操作のマスターが必要なコンパイラ開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"LLVM, Clang 및 중간 표현(IR) 조작을 마스터해야 하는 컴파일러 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de compiladores que necesitan dominar LLVM, Clang y manipulación de representación intermedia (IR).","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement de compilateurs ayant besoin de maîtriser LLVM, Clang et la manipulation de la représentation intermédiaire (IR).","de":"Perfekt für Compiler-Entwicklungsagenten, die die Beherrschung von LLVM, Clang und der Manipulation der Zwischenrepräsentation (IR) benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Compiladores que necessitam de domínio do LLVM, Clang e manipulação de representação intermediária (IR).","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки компиляторов, которым требуется мастерство LLVM, Clang и манипуляция промежуточным представлением (IR).","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطوير المترجمات الذين يحتاجون إلى إتقان LLVM و Clang وتصريف التمثيل الوسيط (IR)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform LLVM IR with custom passes, leveraging MSVC 2022 features and exploring Clang''s C/C++ frontend, while deep diving into optimization techniques and understanding intermediate representation.","zh":"赋予代理使用自定义传递转换LLVM IR的能力，利用MSVC 2022的功能并探索Clang的C/C++前端，同时深入研究优化技术和理解中间表示。","ja":"エージェントにカスタムパスのLLVM IRを変換する機能を与え、MSVC 2022の機能を活用し、ClangのC/C++フロントエンドを探索し、同時に最適化技術と中間表現の理解を深めることを可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 지정 전달을 사용하여 LLVM IR를 변환할 수 있는 기능을 부여하여 MSVC 2022의 기능을 활용하고 Clang의 C/C++ 프론트엔드를 탐색同时 최적화 기술과 중간 표현을 이해하는 것을 깊이 있게 연구합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a transformar el IR de LLVM con pasos personalizados, aprovechando las características de MSVC 2022 y explorando el frontend de C/C++ de Clang, mientras se sumerge profundamente en técnicas de optimización y comprensión de la representación intermedia.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer le IR LLVM avec des passes personnalisées, en exploitant les fonctionnalités de MSVC 2022 et en explorant le frontend C/C++ de Clang, tout en plongeant profondément dans les techniques d''optimisation et la compréhension de la représentation intermédiaire.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, LLVM-IR mit benutzerdefinierten Passes zu transformieren, MSVC 2022-Features zu nutzen und Clangs C/C++-Frontend zu erkunden, während sie tief in Optimierungstechniken und das Verständnis der Zwischenrepräsentation eintauchen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar o IR do LLVM com passes personalizados, aproveitando os recursos do MSVC 2022 e explorando a interface de programação de aplicativos C/C++ do Clang, enquanto mergulha fundo em técnicas de otimização e compreensão da representação intermediária.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать IR LLVM с помощью пользовательских проходов, используя возможности MSVC 2022 и изучая frontend C/C++ Clang, а также глубоко изучая методы оптимизации и понимание промежуточного представления.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحويل تمثيل LLVM الوسيط باستخدام مرور مخصص، واستخدام ميزات MSVC 2022 واستكشاف واجهة برمجة التطبيقات C/C++ من Clang، مع الغوص العميق في تقنيات التحسين وفهم التمثيل الوسيط."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging complex compiler pipelines using Kaleidoscope","Generating optimized LLVM IR for performance-critical code","Developing custom compiler passes for domain-specific languages"],"zh":["使用Kaleidoscope调试复杂的编译器管道","为性能关键代码生成优化的LLVM IR","为特定领域语言开发自定义编译器传递"],"ja":["Kaleidoscopeを使用して複雑なコンパイラパイプラインをデバッグする","パフォーマンスクリティカルコード用に最適化されたLLVM IRを生成する","特定のドメイン言語用にカスタムコンパイラパスを開発する"],"ko":["Kaleidoscope를 사용하여 복잡한 컴파일러 파이프라인을 디버깅합니다","성능 关键 코드를 위한 최적화된 LLVM IR를 생성합니다","특정 도메인 언어를 위한 사용자 지정 컴파일러 전달을 개발합니다"],"es":["Depuración de canalizaciones de compilador complejas con Kaleidoscope","Generación de IR de LLVM optimizado para código crítico de rendimiento","Desarrollo de pasos de compilador personalizados para lenguajes de dominio específico"],"fr":["Débogage de pipelines de compilation complexes avec Kaleidoscope","Génération de IR LLVM optimisé pour du code critique de performance","Développement de passes de compilation personnalisées pour des langages de domaine spécifique"],"de":["Debuggen komplexer Compiler-Pipelines mit Kaleidoscope","Erzeugen von optimiertem LLVM-IR für leistungskritischen Code","Entwicklung benutzerdefinierter Compiler-Pässe für domänenspezifische Sprachen"],"pt":["Depuração de pipelines de compilação complexos usando Kaleidoscope","Geração de IR do LLVM otimizado para código crítico de desempenho","Desenvolvimento de passes de compilação personalizados para linguagens específicas de domínio"],"ru":["Отладка сложных конвейеров компиляции с помощью Kaleidoscope","Генерация оптимизированного IR LLVM для критического по производительности кода","Разработка пользовательских проходов компиляции для языков конкретных областей"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء خطوط أنابيب الترجمة المعقدة باستخدام Kaleidoscope","توليد تمثيل LLVM الوسيط المُحسّن لأكواد حرجة للأداء","تطوير مرور مخصصة للمترجمات للغة محددة النطاق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires familiarity with compiler development concepts","MSVC 2022 compatibility limitations may apply","Focus on LLVM and Clang, not other compiler frameworks"],"zh":["需要编译器开发概念的熟悉度","可能存在MSVC 2022兼容性限制","关注点在LLVM和Clang上，而不是其他编译器框架"],"ja":["コンパイラ開発概念の熟練度が必要","MSVC 2022の互換性制限が適用される場合がある","LLVMとClangに焦点を当てているため、他のコンパイラフレームワークには対応していない"],"ko":["컴파일러 개발 개념의熟練도가 필요합니다","MSVC 2022 호환성 제한이 적용될 수 있습니다","LLVM과 Clang에 중점을 둔 것으로 다른 컴파일러 프레임워크에는対応하지 않습니다"],"es":["Requiere familiaridad con conceptos de desarrollo de compiladores","Pueden aplicarse limitaciones de compatibilidad de MSVC 2022","Enfocado en LLVM y Clang, no en otros marcos de compilador"],"fr":["Nécessite une familiarité avec les concepts de développement de compilateurs","Les limitations de compatibilité de MSVC 2022 peuvent s''appliquer","Axé sur LLVM et Clang, et non sur d''autres cadres de compilation"],"de":["Erfordert Vertrautheit mit Compiler-Entwicklungskonzepten","MSVC 2022-Kompatibilitätsbeschränkungen können gelten","Fokussiert auf LLVM und Clang, nicht auf andere Compiler-Frameworks"],"pt":["Exige familiaridade com conceitos de desenvolvimento de compiladores","Limitações de compatibilidade do MSVC 2022 podem se aplicar","Foco no LLVM e Clang, não em outros frameworks de compilação"],"ru":["Требует знакомства с концепциями разработки компиляторов","Ограничения совместимости MSVC 2022 могут применяться","Фокус на LLVM и Clang, а не на других фреймворках компиляции"],"ar":["يتطلب إلمامًا بمفاهيم تطوير المترجمات","قد تنطبق قيود التوافق مع MSVC 2022","التركيز على LLVM و Clang، وليس على إطارات عمل المترجمات الأخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":55}');
