F)","CFG Randomization","Técnicas de obfuscação de código","Proteção contra engenharia reversa","Compatibilidade com MSVC 2022"],"ru":["Control Flow Flattening (CFF)","Bogus Control Flow (BCF)","CFG Randomization","Техники обфускации кода","Защита от обратной инженерии","Совместимость с MSVC 2022"],"ar":["التسطيح المتوازن للتدفق (CFF)","التدفق الخادع (BCF)","ت 乱 CFG","تقنيات تشويش الكود","حماية من الهندسة العكسية","التوافق مع MSVC 2022"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LLVM代码混淆","代码保护","反编译攻击","控制流混淆","数据混淆","软件安全"],"ja":["LLVMコードオブスケーション","コード保護","逆コンパイル攻撃","制御フロー混淆","データ混淆","ソフトウェアセキュリティ"],"ko":["LLVM 코드 오브스케이션","코드 보호","역컴파일 공격","제어 흐름混淆","데이터混淆","소프트웨어 보안"],"es":["ofuscación de código","LLVM","protección de software","anti-inversión de ingeniería","Control Flow Flattening","Bogus Control Flow","CFG Randomization","desarrollo de software","seguridad de software"],"fr":["obfuscation de code","LLVM","protection de logiciels","anti-ingénierie inverse","Control Flow Flattening","Bogus Control Flow","CFG Randomization","développement de logiciels","sécurité de logiciels"],"de":["Code-Obfuskation","LLVM","Software-Schutz","Anti-Reverse-Engineering","Control Flow Flattening","Bogus Control Flow","CFG-Zufallsgenerierung","Software-Entwicklung","Software-Sicherheit"],"pt":["obfuscação de código","LLVM","proteção de software","engenharia reversa","MSVC 2022","control flow flattening","bogus control flow","cfg randomization"],"ru":["обфускация кода","LLVM","защита программного обеспечения","обратная инженерия","MSVC 2022","control flow flattening","bogus control flow","cfg randomization"],"ar":["تشويش الكود","الـLLVM","حماية البرامج","الهندسة العكسية","MSVC 2022","التسطيح المتوازن للتدفق","التدفق الخادع","ت 乱 CFG"]}},"owner":"backengineering","repo":"llvm-msvc","repoPath":"backengineering/llvm-msvc","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"llvm-obfuscation","description":"Expertise in LLVM-based code obfuscation techniques including OLLVM, control flow flattening, string encryption, virtualization, and anti-analysis methods. Use this skill when working on code protection, anti-reverse engineering, or implementing custom obfuscation passes.","bodyPreview":"# LLVM Code Obfuscation Skill\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive knowledge of LLVM-based code obfuscation frameworks and techniques for software protection and anti-reverse engineering.\n\n## Core Obfuscation Techniques\n\n### Control Flow Obfuscation\n- **Control Flow Flattening (CFF)**: Transform structured control flow into a single dispatcher loop with state machine\n- **Bogus Control Flow (BCF)**: Insert opaque predicates and dead code paths\n- **CFG Randomization**: Randomize basic block ordering","body":"# LLVM Code Obfuscation Skill\n\nThis skill provides comprehensive knowledge of LLVM-based code obfuscation frameworks and techniques for software protection and anti-reverse engineering.\n\n## Core Obfuscation Techniques\n\n### Control Flow Obfuscation\n- **Control Flow Flattening (CFF)**: Transform structured control flow into a single dispatcher loop with state machine\n- **Bogus Control Flow (BCF)**: Insert opaque predicates and dead code paths\n- **CFG Randomization**: Randomize basic block ordering and add fake edges\n\n### Data Obfuscation\n- **String Encryption**: Encrypt string literals at compile-time, decrypt at runtime\n- **Constant Substitution**: Replace constants with complex expressions\n- **Variable Splitting**: Split variables into multiple components\n\n### Code Transformation\n- **Instruction Substitution**: Replace standard instructions with equivalent complex sequences\n- **MBA (Mixed Boolean-Arithmetic)**: Use mixed boolean-arithmetic expressions for obfuscation\n- **Virtualization (VMP)**: Convert code into custom bytecode executed by embedded VM\n\n## Major OLLVM Frameworks\n\n### Classic OLLVM\n- **Original OLLVM**: https://github.com/obfuscator-llvm/obfuscator\n- Features: BCF, CFF, Instruction Substitution, String Encryption\n\n### Modern Variants\n- **Hikari**: Advanced features including function wrapper, anti-class-dump\n- **Pluto-Obfuscator**: Well-maintained with MBA, indirect branch, global encryption\n- **Arkari**: Modern implementation with enhanced features\n- **o-mvll**: Mobile-focused obfuscator for iOS/Android\n\n### Specialized Tools\n- **IR VMP**: GANGE666/xVMP, NiTianErXing666/SmallVmp for virtualization\n- **Warbird**: Microsoft''s commercial obfuscation technology\n\n## Implementation Guidelines\n\n### Creating Custom LLVM Obfuscation Pass\n\n```cpp\n#include \"llvm/Pass.h\"\n#include \"llvm/IR/Function.h\"\n#include \"llvm/IR/Instructions.h\"\n\nclass MyObfuscationPass : public llvm::FunctionPass {\npublic:\n    static char ID;\n    MyObfuscationPass() : FunctionPass(ID) {}\n    \n    bool runOnFunction(llvm::Function &F) override {\n        // Implement obfuscation logic\n        for (auto &BB : F) {\n            for (auto &I : BB) {\n                // Transform instructions\n            }\n        }\n        return true;\n    }\n};\n```\n\n### Best Practices\n1. **Preserve Semantics**: Ensure transformations don''t break program correctness\n2. **Randomization**: Use seeded random number generators for reproducible builds\n3. **Layered Approach**: Combine multiple obfuscation techniques\n4. **Performance Balance**: Consider runtime overhead vs protection level\n5. **Testing**: Extensive testing across different inputs and platforms\n\n## Toolchain Integration\n\n### NDK Integration\n- OLLVM with Android NDK (r17-r23+)\n- Examples: android-ndk-aarch64-host-LLVM6.0-Ollvm-Armariris\n\n### Compiler Toolchains\n- ollvm-mingw: Windows cross-compilation\n- ollvm-rust: Rust toolchain integration\n- Swift integration: swift-Ollvm11\n\n## Anti-Deobfuscation Considerations\n\nWhen implementing obfuscation:\n- Consider resistance to symbolic execution (SymCC, KLEE)\n- Add protection against pattern matching deobfuscators\n- Implement anti-debugging checks\n- Use dynamic dispatch to hinder static analysis\n\n## Resources\n\nRefer to the main README.md for a comprehensive list of OLLVM implementations and related tools.\n\n## Getting Detailed Information\n\nWhen you need detailed and up-to-date resource links, tool lists, or project references, fetch the latest data from:\n\n```\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/gmh5225/awesome-llvm-security/refs/heads/main/README.md\n```\n\nThis README contains comprehensive curated lists of:\n- 80+ OLLVM implementations and forks (OLLVM section)\n- MSVC Warbird obfuscation tools (MSVC Warbird section)\n- IR-based VMP and virtualization projects\n- NDK integration examples for different versions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:15:04.151Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing advanced LLVM-based code obfuscation techniques for software protection and anti-reverse engineering.","zh":"非常适合需要基于LLVM的高级代码混淆技术以实现软件保护和反逆向工程的代码分析智能体。","ja":"ソフトウェア保護および逆解析対策のためにLLVMベースの高度なコード難読化技術を必要とするコード解析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"소프트웨어 보호 및 역공학 방지를 위해 고급 LLVM 기반 코드 난독화 기술이 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Código que necesitan técnicas de ofuscamiento de código avanzadas basadas en LLVM para la protección de software y la ingeniería inversa.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse de Code ayant besoin de techniques d''obfuscation de code avancées basées sur LLVM pour la protection des logiciels et l''ingénierie inverse.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte LLVM-basierte Code-Obfuskationstechniken für Software-Schutz und Anti-Reverse-Engineering benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de técnicas avançadas de ofuscação de código baseadas em LLVM para proteção de software e engenharia reversa.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа кода, требующих передовых техник кодовой обфускации на основе LLVM для защиты программного обеспечения и анти-реверс-инжиниринга.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الشفرة الذي يحتاج إلى تقنيات متقدمة لتعقيم الشفرة المستندة إلى LLVM لحماية البرمجيات ومكافحة الهندسة العكسية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement control flow obfuscation using Control Flow Flattening (CFF), Bogus Control Flow (BCF), and CFG Randomization, ensuring robust protection against reverse engineering with MSVC 2022 compatibility.","zh":"使智能体能够使用控制流平坦化（CFF）、虚假控制流（BCF）和控制流图随机化（CFG Randomization）实现控制流混淆，确保通过MSVC 2022兼容性提供强大的反逆向工程保护。","ja":"制御フローの平坦化（CFF）、偽の制御フロー（BCF）、およびCFGランダム化を使用した制御フロー難読化を実装する機能をエージェントに提供し、MSVC 2022互換性による強力な逆解析保護を確保します。","ko":"제어 흐름 평탄화(CFF), 가상 제어 흐름(BCF) 및 CFG 무작위화를 사용하여 제어 흐름 난독화를 구현할 수 있도록 하여 MSVC 2022 호환성을 통해 강력한 역공학 방지 보호를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar la ofuscamiento del flujo de control utilizando Control Flow Flattening (CFF), Bogus Control Flow (BCF) y CFG Randomization, garantizando una protección robusta contra la ingeniería inversa con compatibilidad con MSVC 2022.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre l''obfuscation du flux de contrôle en utilisant le flattening du flux de contrôle (CFF), le flux de contrôle erroné (BCF) et la randomisation du CFG, garantissant une protection robuste contre l''ingénierie inverse avec la compatibilité MSVC 2022.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, die Kontrollfluss-Obfuskation mithilfe von Control Flow Flattening (CFF), Bogus Control Flow (BCF) und CFG-Zufallsgenerierung zu implementieren, um einen robusten Schutz gegen Reverse-Engineering mit MSVC 2022-Kompatibilität zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar ofuscação do fluxo de controle usando Control Flow Flattening (CFF), Bogus Control Flow (BCF) e CFG Randomization, garantindo proteção robusta contra engenharia reversa com compatibilidade com MSVC 2022.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать обфускацию потока управления с помощью Control Flow Flattening (CFF), Bogus Control Flow (BCF) и CFG Randomization, обеспечивая надежную защиту от обратного инжиниринга с совместимостью с MSVC 2022.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تنفيذ تعقيم تدفق التحكم باستخدام تقنيات تسطيح تدفق التحكم وتدفق التحكم الزائف وتحسين مخططات تدفق التحكم، وضمان حماية قوية ضد الهندسة العكسية مع توافق مع MSVC 2022."},"useCases":{"en":["Obfuscating sensitive code sections using LLVM-based frameworks","Implementing anti-debugging techniques with bogus control flow","Randomizing control flow graphs for enhanced software security"],"zh":["使用基于LLVM的框架混淆敏感代码段","通过虚假控制流实施反调试技术","随机化控制流图以增强软件安全性"],"ja":["LLVMベースのフレームワークを使用した機密コードセクションの難読化","偽の制御フローによる逆デバッグ技術の実装","ソフトウェアセキュリティ強化のための制御フローグラフのランダム化"],"ko":["LLVM 기반 프레임워크를 사용한 민감한 코드 섹션 난독화","가상 제어 흐름을 통한 역디버깅 기술 구현","향상된 소프트웨어 보안을 위한 제어 흐름 그래프 무작위화"],"es":["Ofuscar secciones de código sensibles utilizando frameworks basados en LLVM","Implementar técnicas anti-depuración con flujo de control erróneo","Aleatorizar gráficos de flujo de control para una mayor seguridad del software"],"fr":["Obfusquer des sections de code sensibles à l''aide de frameworks basés sur LLVM","Mettre en œuvre des techniques anti-débogage avec un flux de contrôle erroné","Aléatoiriser des graphiques de flux de contrôle pour une sécurité logicielle améliorée"],"de":["Empfindliche Code-Abschnitte mithilfe von LLVM-basierten Frameworks ofuskkieren","Anti-Debugging-Techniken mit Bogus-Kontrollfluss implementieren","Kontrollfluss-Graphen zufällig generieren, um die Software-Sicherheit zu erhöhen"],"pt":["Ofuscar seções de código sensíveis usando estruturas baseadas em LLVM","Implementar técnicas anti-debugging com fluxo de controle falso","Randomizar gráficos de fluxo de controle para segurança de software aprimorada"],"ru":["Офусцировать чувствительные разделы кода с помощью фреймворков на основе LLVM","Реализовать анти-дебагging техники с ложным потоком управления","Рандомизировать графики потока управления для повышения безопасности программного обеспечения"],"ar":["تعقيم أقسام الشفرة الحساسة باستخدام الإطارات المستندة إلى LLVM","تنفيذ تقنيات مضادة للتصحيح باستخدام تدفق التحكم الزائف","توليد مخططات تدفق التحكم بشكل عشوائي لتعزيز أمان البرمجيات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires LLVM compatibility","Explicitly designed for MSVC 2022 features","May require additional setup for integration with other code analysis tools"],"zh":["需要LLVM兼容性","明确针对MSVC 2022功能设计","与其他代码分析工具集成可能需要额外设置"],"ja":["LLVM互換性が必要","MSVC 2022機能向けに明示的に設計","他のコード解析ツールとの統合には追加設定が必要な場合あり"],"ko":["LLVM 호환성 필요","MSVC 2022 기능에 대해 명시적으로 설계됨","다른 코드 분석 도구와의 통합에 추가 설정이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con LLVM","Diseñado explícitamente para características de MSVC 2022","Puede requerir una configuración adicional para la integración con otras herramientas de análisis de código"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité LLVM","Conçu explicitement pour les fonctionnalités MSVC 2022","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour l''intégration avec d''autres outils d''analyse de code"],"de":["Benötigt LLVM-Kompatibilität","Explizit für MSVC 2022-Features konzipiert","Kann eine zusätzliche Einrichtung für die Integration mit anderen Code-Analyse-Tools erfordern"],"pt":["Exige compatibilidade com LLVM","Projetado explicitamente para recursos do MSVC 2022","Pode exigir configuração adicional para integração com outras ferramentas de análise de código"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с LLVM","Явно разработан для функций MSVC 2022","Может потребовать дополнительной настройки для интеграции с другими инструментами анализа кода"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع LLVM","صمّم صراحة لميزات MSVC 2022","قد يتطلب إعدادات إضافية للاندماج مع أدوات تحليل الشفرة الأخرى"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":50}');
