he und dynamische Analyse","Entofusfikation und Schwachstellenforschung","Neukompilierung und Optimierung von Code","Kompatibilität mit MSVC 2022","Unterstützung für LLVM IR"],"pt":["Análise estática e dinâmica de binários","Desofuscação e pesquisa de vulnerabilidades","Recompilação e otimização de código","Compatibilidade com MSVC 2022","Suporte a LLVM IR"],"ru":["Статический и динамический анализ бинарных файлов","Деофускация и исследование уязвимостей","Пересборка и оптимизация кода","Совместимость с MSVC 2022","Поддержка LLVM IR"],"ar":["التحليل الساكن والتحريك للثنائيات","فك التشفير والبحث عن الثغرات","إعادة 编译 وتحسين الكود","التوافق مع MSVC 2022","دعم LLVM IR"]},"keywords":{"zh":["二进制提升","LLVM IR","机器代码","静态分析","动态分析","代码去混淆","漏洞研究","代码重新编译","优化","MSVC 2022"],"ja":["バイナリーリフティング","LLVM IR","機械語","静的分析","動的分析","コードの脱混淆","脆弱性の研究","コードの再コンパイル","最適化","MSVC 2022"],"ko":["바이너리 리프팅","LLVM IR","기계 코드","정적 분석","동적 분석","코드 탈混淆","취약점 연구","코드 재컴파일","최적화","MSVC 2022"],"es":["elevación binaria","LLVM IR","análisis de código","optimización de código","desofusificación","investigación de vulnerabilidades","recompilación de código"],"fr":["élévation binaire","LLVM IR","analyse de code","optimisation de code","désofuscation","recherche de vulnérabilités","recompilation de code"],"de":["binäres Anheben","LLVM IR","Code-Analyse","Code-Optimierung","Entofusfikation","Schwachstellenforschung","Neukompilierung von Code"],"pt":["binary lifting","análise de binários","LLVM IR","desofuscação","vulnerabilidades","recompilação","otimização"],"ru":["бинарное подъем","анализ бинарных файлов","LLVM IR","деофускация","уязвимости","пересборка","оптимизация"],"ar":["رفع الثنائي","تحليل الثنائيات","LLVM IR","فك التشفير","الثغرات","إعادة 编译","تحسين"]}},"owner":"backengineering","repo":"llvm-msvc","repoPath":"backengineering/llvm-msvc","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"binary-lifting","description":"Expertise in binary lifting techniques - converting machine code to LLVM IR for analysis, decompilation, and recompilation. Use this skill when working on reverse engineering, binary analysis, deobfuscation, or converting binaries to higher-level representations.","bodyPreview":"# Binary Lifting Skill\n\nThis skill covers techniques and tools for lifting binary executables to LLVM IR, enabling advanced analysis, transformation, and recompilation of existing binaries.\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### What is Binary Lifting?\nBinary lifting is the process of translating low-level machine code (x86, ARM, etc.) into a higher-level intermediate representation (LLVM IR), enabling:\n- Static and dynamic analysis\n- Deobfuscation and vulnerability research\n- Code recompilation and optimizatio","body":"# Binary Lifting Skill\n\nThis skill covers techniques and tools for lifting binary executables to LLVM IR, enabling advanced analysis, transformation, and recompilation of existing binaries.\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### What is Binary Lifting?\nBinary lifting is the process of translating low-level machine code (x86, ARM, etc.) into a higher-level intermediate representation (LLVM IR), enabling:\n- Static and dynamic analysis\n- Deobfuscation and vulnerability research\n- Code recompilation and optimization\n- Cross-architecture translation\n\n### Lifting Pipeline\n```\nBinary → Disassembly → IR Generation → Optimization → Analysis/Recompilation\n```\n\n## Major Lifting Frameworks\n\n### Production-Grade Tools\n- **RetDec** (Avast): Full decompiler with C output, multi-architecture support\n- **McSema** (Trail of Bits): x86/x64 to LLVM IR, function recovery\n- **revng**: Based on QEMU, supports multiple architectures\n- **reopt** (Galois): Focus on correctness and formal methods\n\n### Research/Specialized Tools\n- **Rellume**: Fast x86-64 to LLVM lifting for JIT scenarios\n- **fcd**: Pattern-based decompiler with optimization passes\n- **bin2llvm**: QEMU-based binary to LLVM translator\n- **llvm-mctoll**: Microsoft''s machine code to LLVM lifter\n\n### Language-Specific Lifters\n- **llvm2c/IR->C**: Convert LLVM IR back to C code\n- **llvm2cranelift**: LLVM IR to Cranelift IR\n- **Leaven**: LLVM IR to Go language\n- **masxinlingvonta**: JVM bytecode to LLVM IR\n\n## Implementation Techniques\n\n### Instruction Semantics Translation\n\n```cpp\n// Example: Translating x86 ADD to LLVM IR\nValue* translateADD(IRBuilder<> &builder, Value* op1, Value* op2) {\n    Value* result = builder.CreateAdd(op1, op2, \"add_result\");\n    \n    // Update flags (CF, OF, SF, ZF, etc.)\n    updateCarryFlag(builder, op1, op2, result);\n    updateOverflowFlag(builder, op1, op2, result);\n    updateSignFlag(builder, result);\n    updateZeroFlag(builder, result);\n    \n    return result;\n}\n```\n\n### Control Flow Recovery\n1. **Linear Sweep**: Simple but misses code with embedded data\n2. **Recursive Descent**: Follow control flow, better coverage\n3. **Speculative Disassembly**: Handle indirect jumps/calls\n4. **Machine Learning**: Use ML to identify function boundaries\n\n### Handling Indirect Control Flow\n- Value Set Analysis (VSA)\n- Symbolic execution for jump target resolution\n- Type recovery for virtual table reconstruction\n\n## Triton Integration\n\nTriton symbolic execution engine can be used with lifting:\n\n```python\nfrom triton import TritonContext, ARCH, Instruction\n\nctx = TritonContext(ARCH.X86_64)\n\n# Symbolically execute and extract AST\ninst = Instruction(b\"\\x48\\x01\\xd8\")  # add rax, rbx\nctx.processing(inst)\n\n# Convert Triton AST to LLVM IR\nast = ctx.getRegisterAst(ctx.registers.rax)\nllvm_ir = triton_ast_to_llvm(ast)\n```\n\n## Deobfuscation via Lifting\n\n### Approach\n1. Lift obfuscated binary to LLVM IR\n2. Apply optimization passes to simplify\n3. Use custom passes for specific obfuscation patterns\n4. Re-emit cleaned code\n\n### Useful Optimization Passes\n- Dead Store Elimination (DSE)\n- Global Value Numbering (GVN)\n- Constant Propagation\n- Instruction Combining\n- Loop Simplification\n\n### VMP/VM Handler Recovery\n- Identify dispatcher patterns\n- Extract VM bytecode semantics\n- Convert handlers to native IR\n- Example: TicklingVMProtect for VMProtect analysis\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Architecture Support**: Handle endianness, calling conventions, ABI differences\n2. **Memory Modeling**: Accurate memory layout for global/stack variables\n3. **External Dependencies**: Handle library calls and system calls\n4. **Validation**: Compare execution traces of original vs lifted code\n5. **Incremental Lifting**: Support partial program analysis\n\n## Dynamic Binary Lifting\n\n### Runtime Translation\n- **Instrew**: Fast instrumentation through LLVM\n- **QBDI**: QuarkslaB Dynamic Binary Instrumentation\n- **binopt**: Runtime optimization of binary code\n\n### JIT Recompilation\nLift frequently executed code paths for runtime optimization:\n- Profile-guided lifting\n- Hot path detection\n- Speculative optimization\n\n## Resources\n\nFor a complete list of lifting tools and research papers, refer to the LIFT section in the main README.md.\n\n## Getting Detailed Information\n\nWhen you need detailed and up-to-date resource links, tool lists, or project references, fetch the latest data from:\n\n```\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.com/gmh5225/awesome-llvm-security/refs/heads/main/README.md\n```\n\nThis README contains comprehensive curated lists of:\n- Binary lifting frameworks and tools (LIFT section)\n- Related research papers and documentation\n- Implementation examples and tutorials\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:14:57.881Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Reverse Engineering Agents requiring deep binary analysis and transformation capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要深入二进制分析和转换能力的反向工程代理。","ja":"逆コンパイルエージェントが深いバイナリ分析および変換機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"심층 바이너리 분석 및 변환 기능이 필요한 역공학 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de ingeniería inversa que requieren capacidades de análisis y transformación de binarios profundos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''ingénierie inverse nécessitant des capacités d''analyse et de transformation de binaires profondes.","de":"Ideal für Reverse-Engineering-Agents, die tiefe Binär-Analyse- und Transformationsfunktionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Engenharia Reversa que exigem análise binária profunda e capacidades de transformação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов обратного инжиниринга, требующих глубокого бинарного анализа и возможностей трансформации.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الهندسي العكسي الذين يتطلبون تحليلًا ثنائيًا عميقًا وقدرات تحويل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to translate x86 and ARM machine code into LLVM IR, unlocking advanced static/dynamic analysis, deobfuscation, and code recompilation workflows. Provides explicit compatibility with MSVC 2022 features for Windows binary analysis.","zh":"使代理能够将 x86 和 ARM 机器代码翻译成 LLVM IR，从而解锁高级静态/动态分析、去混淆和代码重新编译工作流。为 Windows 二进制分析提供了对 MSVC 2022 功能的明确兼容性。","ja":"エージェントがx86およびARMマシンコードをLLVM IRに翻訳できるようにし、高度な静的/動的分析、デオブフスケーション、コードの再コンパイルワークフローを解除します。Windowsバイナリ分析用のMSVC 2022機能との互換性を提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 x86 및 ARM 기계 코드를 LLVM IR로 번역할 수 있도록 해주어 고급 정적/동적 분석, 디오브프스케이션 및 코드 재컴파일 워크플로를 잠금 해제합니다. Windows 바이너리 분석을 위한 MSVC 2022 기능과 명시적인 호환성을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes traducir el código de máquina x86 y ARM a LLVM IR, lo que desbloquea flujos de trabajo de análisis estático/dinámico avanzados, desofuscarización y recompilación de código. Proporciona compatibilidad explícita con las características de MSVC 2022 para el análisis de binarios de Windows.","fr":"Permet aux agents de traduire le code machine x86 et ARM en LLVM IR, débloquant ainsi des flux de travail d''analyse statique/dynamique avancés, de désofuscation et de recompilation de code. Fournit une compatibilité explicite avec les fonctionnalités de MSVC 2022 pour l''analyse de binaires Windows.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, x86- und ARM-Maschinencode in LLVM IR zu übersetzen, was erweiterte statische/dynamische Analyse-, Entschleierung- und Code-Neukompilierungs-Workflows freischaltet. Bietet explizite Kompatibilität mit MSVC 2022-Features für die Windows-Binär-Analyse.","pt":"Permite que os agentes traduzam código de máquina x86 e ARM para LLVM IR, desbloqueando fluxos de trabalho avançados de análise estática/dinâmica, desofuscação e recompilação de código. Fornece compatibilidade explícita com recursos do MSVC 2022 para análise de binários do Windows.","ru":"Позволяет агентам переводить машинный код x86 и ARM в LLVM IR, открывая передовые потоки работ статического/динамического анализа, деофускации и перекомпиляции кода. Обеспечивает явную совместимость с функциями MSVC 2022 для анализа бинарных файлов Windows.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من ترجمة كود الآلة x86 و ARM إلى LLVM IR ، مما يفتح تدفقات عمل متقدمة للتحليل الثابت / الديناميكي ، وإلغاء العبوس ، وإعادة 编译 الكود. يوفر التوافق الصريح مع ميزات MSVC 2022 للتحليل الثنائي لنظام Windows."},"useCases":{"en":["Deobfuscating protected malware binaries","Performing vulnerability research on compiled executables","Recompiling binaries with LLVM-based optimizations","Conducting static analysis on legacy x86/ARM code"],"zh":["去混淆受保护的恶意软件二进制文件","对编译后的可执行文件进行漏洞研究","使用LLVM优化重新编译二进制文件","对遗产x86/ARM代码进行静态分析"],"ja":["保護されたマルウェアバイナリをデオブフスケーションする","コンパイルされた実行可能ファイルに対する脆弱性研究を実行する","LLVMベースの最適化でバイナリを再コンパイルする","レガシx86/ARMコードに対する静的分析を実行する"],"ko":["보호된 악성 코드 바이너리를 디오브프스케이션하는 것","컴파일된 실행 파일에 대한 취약점 연구를 수행하는 것","LLVM 기반 최적화를 사용하여 바이너리를 재컴파일하는 것","레거시 x86/ARM 코드에 대한 정적 분석을 수행하는 것"],"es":["Desofuscar binarios de malware protegidos","Realizar investigaciones de vulnerabilidades en ejecutables compilados","Recompilar binarios con optimizaciones basadas en LLVM","Realizar análisis estáticos en código legado x86/ARM"],"fr":["Désosfuscater des binaires de malware protégés","Effectuer des recherches de vulnérabilités sur des exécutables compilés","Recompiler des binaires avec des optimisations basées sur LLVM","Effectuer une analyse statique sur du code hérité x86/ARM"],"de":["Geschützte Malware-Binaries entschleiern","Verwundbarkeitsforschung an kompilierten Executables durchführen","Binaries mit LLVM-basierten Optimierungen neu kompilieren","Statische Analyse auf Legacy-x86/ARM-Code durchführen"],"pt":["Desofuscar binários de malware protegidos","Realizar pesquisas de vulnerabilidades em executáveis compilados","Recompilar binários com otimizações baseadas em LLVM","Realizar análise estática em código legado x86/ARM"],"ru":["Деофускация защищенных бинарных файлов вредоносного ПО","Проведение исследований уязвимостей в скомпилированных исполняемых файлах","Перекомпиляция бинарных файлов с оптимизациями на основе LLVM","Проведение статического анализа устаревшего кода x86/ARM"],"ar":["إلغاء العبوس الثنائي لبرامج الفايروسات المحمية","إجراء أبحاث حول نقاط الضعف في الملفات التنفيذية المجمعة","إعادة 编译 الملفات الثنائية مع تحسينات قائمة على LLVM","إجراء تحليل ثابت للكود التقليدية x86/ARM"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires LLVM toolchain infrastructure","MSVC 2022 compatibility specific to Windows targets","Dependent on binary architecture support (x86/ARM)"],"zh":["需要LLVM工具链基础设施","MSVC 2022兼容性仅限于Windows目标","依赖于二进制架构支持（x86/ARM）"],"ja":["LLVMツールチェーンインフラストラクチャが必要","MSVC 2022の互換性はWindowsターゲットに限定される","バイナリアーキテクチャのサポート（x86/ARM）に依存する"],"ko":["LLVM 툴체인 인프라가 필요함","MSVC 2022 호환성은 Windows 대상에만 국한됨","바이너리 아키텍처 지원(x86/ARM)에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere infraestructura de herramientas LLVM","Compatibilidad con MSVC 2022 específica para objetivos de Windows","Dependiente del soporte de arquitectura de binarios (x86/ARM)"],"fr":["Nécessite une infrastructure d''outils LLVM","Compatibilité avec MSVC 2022 spécifique aux cibles Windows","Dépendant du support d''architecture de binaires (x86/ARM)"],"de":["Benötigt LLVM-Toolchain-Infrastruktur","MSVC 2022-Kompatibilität spezifisch für Windows-Ziele","Abhängig von Binär-Architektur-Unterstützung (x86/ARM)"],"pt":["Exige infraestrutura de ferramentas LLVM","Compatibilidade com MSVC 2022 específica para alvos do Windows","Dependente do suporte à arquitetura binária (x86/ARM)"],"ru":["Требует инфраструктуры инструментов LLVM","Совместимость с MSVC 2022 специфична для целевых систем Windows","Зависит от поддержки бинарной архитектуры (x86/ARM)"],"ar":["يتطلب بنية أدوات LLVM","التوافق مع MSVC 2022 محدد لأنظمة الهدف Windows","يعتمد على دعم البنية الثنائية (x86/ARM)"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":45}');
