dAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pdf-analyzer","description":"Analyze PDF, DOCX, and spreadsheet documents using vision models. Converts documents to images and extracts insights with layout preservation. Uses VT Codes native document processor (no container skills required).","version":"1.0.0","tags":["document","pdf","docx","excel","vision","vtcode-native"],"bodyPreview":"# PDF/DOCX/Spreadsheet Analyzer\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides OpenAI-style document processing capabilities, converting PDFs, Word documents, and spreadsheets into rendered images for vision model analysis. This approach preserves layout, formatting, tables, and visual elements that would be lost in traditional text extraction.\n\n**Inspired by:** OpenAI''s implementation in ChatGPT''s Code Interpreter (per Simon Willison''s blog post, Dec 2025)\n\n## Supported Formats\n\n- **PDF**: Multi-page docume","body":"# PDF/DOCX/Spreadsheet Analyzer\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides OpenAI-style document processing capabilities, converting PDFs, Word documents, and spreadsheets into rendered images for vision model analysis. This approach preserves layout, formatting, tables, and visual elements that would be lost in traditional text extraction.\n\n**Inspired by:** OpenAI''s implementation in ChatGPT''s Code Interpreter (per Simon Willison''s blog post, Dec 2025)\n\n## Supported Formats\n\n- **PDF**: Multi-page documents, converted page-by-page to PNGs\n- **DOCX/DOC**: Word documents with full formatting preservation\n- **XLSX/XLS/CSV**: Spreadsheets rendered as visual tables\n- **Images**: Direct analysis (PNG, JPG, JPEG, GIF, BMP, TIFF)\n\n## Usage in VT Code\n\n### Basic Document Analysis\n\n```bash\n# List available skills\nvtcode list-skills\n\n# Load the skill\nvtcode skills load pdf-analyzer\n\n# In VT Code chat:\n/skills load pdf-analyzer\n```\n\n### Analyzing Documents\n\n```\nUser: Analyze this PDF report and summarize the key findings\nAssistant: I''ll use the PDF analyzer skill to process this document with vision-based analysis.\n\n[Skill processes document, converts to images, analyzes with vision model]\n\nThe document contains:\n1. Executive summary on page 1 highlighting Q3 revenue growth\n2. Detailed financial tables on pages 3-4 showing 15% YoY growth\n3. Charts illustrating market expansion opportunities\n4. Risk assessment section on page 7\n\nKey insights:\n- Revenue increased from $2.1M to $2.4M (14.3% growth)\n- New customer acquisition up 23%\n- Challenges noted in supply chain efficiency\n```\n\n### Processing Spreadsheets\n\n```\nUser: Review this Excel file and identify any anomalies in the sales data\nAssistant: Let me analyze the spreadsheet using vision-based processing to preserve the table structure and formatting.\n\n[Skill renders spreadsheet as image, detects structure, analyzes values]\n\nFindings:\n- Row 42: Sales amount of $50,000 with no corresponding customer ID (potential data entry error)\n- Column E: Several negative values that may indicate returns or refunds\n- Week of 2025-03-15: Unusual 300% spike in orders (verify with sales team)\n- Conditional formatting shows 12 overdue payments highlighted in red\n```\n\n### Document Comparison\n\n```\nUser: Compare these two contract versions and highlight the changes\nAssistant: I''ll process both documents using vision analysis to detect textual and formatting changes.\n\n[Skill processes both documents, compares rendered pages]\n\nDifferences detected:\n- Section 3.2: Payment terms changed from \"Net 30\" to \"Net 15\"\n- Clause 7.1: Liability cap increased from $100k to $250k\n- Page 5: New confidentiality provision added\n- Header formatting: Company logo position adjusted\n```\n\n## Technical Implementation\n\n### Architecture\n\n```\nDocument → Renderer → PNG Images → Vision Model → Analysis → Insights\n```\n\n1. **Document Loading**: Supports PDF, DOCX, XLSX, CSV, and image formats\n2. **Rendering**: Converts pages/sheets to high-quality PNG images (150 DPI default)\n3. **Vision Processing**: Sends images to vision-enabled LLM for analysis\n4. **Text Extraction**: Optionally runs OCR for searchable text layer\n5. **Insight Generation**: Combines visual analysis with extracted content\n\n### Key Features\n\n**Layout Preservation:**\n- Tables maintain row/column structure\n- Charts and graphs remain visually intact\n- Formatting (bold, italic, colors) is preserved\n- Page structure and flow are maintained\n\n**Multi-page Processing:**\n- Automatic pagination for long documents\n- Cross-page context awareness\n- Page number references in analysis\n\n**Vision Model Integration:**\n- Sends rendered images to Gemini/Claude/GPT-4 vision models\n- Maintains spatial relationships in analysis\n- Extracts both textual and visual information\n\n### Token Efficiency\n\n- Images compressed to optimal size for vision models\n- Smart page selection for long documents\n- Caching of rendered pages\n- Configurable DPI (75/150/300) based on detail requirements\n\n## Configuration\n\n### Environment Variables\n\n```bash\n# Document processing\nexport VT_CODE_DOC_DPI=150          # Rendering DPI (default: 150)\nexport VT_CODE_DOC_MAX_PAGES=50     # Max pages per document (default: 50)\nexport VT_CODE_DOC_ENABLE_OCR=true  # Enable OCR fallback (default: true)\n\n# Vision model selection\nexport VT_CODE_VISION_MODEL=gemini-2.5-pro  # Model for document analysis\n```\n\n### VTCode Configuration\n\n```toml\n[skills.pdf-analyzer]\nenabled = true\ndpi = 150\nmax_pages = 50\nenable_ocr = true\nvision_model = \"gemini-2.5-pro\"\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Financial Report Analysis\n\n```\nUser: Analyze Q3_Financial_Report.pdf and give me the key metrics\n\nAssistant: Processing the financial report using vision-based analysis...\n\nKey Metrics Extracted:\n• Total Revenue: $2.4M (Q3 2025)\n• Gross Margin: 68%\n• Operating Expenses: $1.2M\n• Net Income: $432K (18% margin)\n• Cash Flow: +$156K from operations\n\nTrends:\n• Revenue up 14.3% vs Q2\n• Margin improvement of 2.1 percentage points\n• Customer acquisition cost decreased 8%\n\n[Tables and charts referenced by page number]\n```\n\n### Example 2: Contract Review\n\n```\nUser: Review this NDA and highlight any unusual clauses\n\nAssistant: Analyzing the Non-Disclosure Agreement...\n\nContract Review Summary:\n✓ Standard confidentiality provisions\n✓ Reasonable duration (2 years)\n⚠️  Unusual clause found: Section 5.3 - \"Perpetual confidentiality for trade secrets\"\n⚠️  Geographic scope: Worldwide (typical, but confirm if appropriate)\n✓ Standard exclusions for public information\n\nRecommendation: The perpetual trade secret clause is enforceable but consider:\n- Defining \"trade secrets\" more specifically\n- Adding a severability provision\n```\n\n### Example 3: Research Paper Analysis\n\n```\nUser: Summarize this research paper and extract the methodology\n\nAssistant: Processing the research paper with vision analysis...\n\nPaper Summary:\n\"Advanced Techniques in Machine Learning Optimization\"\nAuthors: Smith et al. (2025)\n\nAbstract Summary:\nThe paper presents a novel optimization algorithm that improves convergence\nspeed by 40% compared to Adam optimizer...\n\nMethodology (from pages 3-5):\n1. Dataset: CIFAR-10, ImageNet, and custom benchmarks\n2. Architecture: ResNet-50, ViT-B/16\n3. Hyperparameters: Learning rate 1e-3, batch size 256\n4. Novel contribution: Adaptive momentum scheduling\n\nResults (pages 6-7):\n• 40% faster convergence vs baseline\n• 2.3% accuracy improvement on ImageNet\n• Robust to hyperparameter variations\n\n[Referenced figures: Fig 2 (convergence curve), Fig 4 (accuracy comparison)]\n```\n\n## Advanced Usage\n\n### Batch Processing\n\n```bash\n# Process multiple documents\nfor doc in *.pdf; do\n  vtcode ask \"Analyze $doc and save summary to ${doc%.pdf}_summary.txt\"\ndone\n```\n\n### Integration with CLI\n\n```bash\n# Process document and extract specific information\nvtcode skills load pdf-analyzer\nvtcode ask \"Extract all email addresses from contract.pdf\"\n```\n\n### Custom Vision Prompts\n\n```\nUser: Analyze this document focusing only on financial data and risks\n\nAssistant: I''ll use a custom vision prompt to focus specifically on financial information and risk factors...\n\n[Custom prompt guides model to focus on specific elements]\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Common Issues\n\n**Document too large:**\n```\nError: Document exceeds maximum page limit (50 pages)\nSolution: Split document or increase VT_CODE_DOC_MAX_PAGES\n```\n\n**Vision model unavailable:**\n```\nError: Vision model not configured\nSolution: Set VT_CODE_VISION_MODEL or use default Gemini vision model\n```\n\n**Rendering fails:**\n```\nError: Unable to render document\nSolution: Verify file format is supported and not corrupted\n```\n\n### Debug Mode\n\n```bash\nexport VT_CODE_DEBUG_DOCUMENTS=true\nvtcode skills load pdf-analyzer\nvtcode ask \"Analyze document.pdf\"\n# Will show detailed rendering and processing logs\n```\n\n## Performance Tips\n\n1. **Use appropriate DPI**: 150 DPI is good for most documents\n2. **Limit page range**: Process only relevant pages for large documents\n3. **Batch processing**: Process multiple documents in parallel\n4. **Cache results**: Reuse processed documents when possible\n5. **Choose efficient vision models**: Gemini 2.5 Flash for speed, Pro for detail\n\n## Security Considerations\n\n- Documents processed locally, not sent to external services\n- Vision model calls use standard LLM APIs with encryption\n- Temporary files cleaned up after processing\n- No document content stored permanently\n\n## License\n\nMIT License - See VTCode main repository for details."},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:15:11.519Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Analysis Agents needing advanced document processing capabilities for PDF, DOCX, and spreadsheet formats.","zh":"适用于需要高级文档处理能力的AI分析代理，特别是支持PDF、DOCX和表格格式的文档。","ja":"PDF、DOCX、スプレッドシート形式の高度な文書処理機能を必要とするAI分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 문서 처리 기능이 필요한 AI 분석 에이전트에게 적합하며, PDF, DOCX 및 스프레드시트 형식을 지원합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de IA que necesitan capacidades de procesamiento de documentos avanzados para formatos PDF, DOCX y hojas de cálculo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse d''IA nécessitant des capacités de traitement de documents avancées pour les formats PDF, DOCX et tableurs.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Analyse-Agenten, die erweiterte Dokumentenverarbeitungsfunktionen für PDF-, DOCX- und Tabellenkalkulationsformate benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de IA que precisam de capacidades avançadas de processamento de documentos para formatos PDF, DOCX e planilhas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа ИИ, которым необходимы расширенные возможности обработки документов для форматов PDF, DOCX и электронных таблиц.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لمعالجة المستندات لتنسيقات PDF و DOCX والجداول."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert PDFs, Word documents, and spreadsheets into rendered images for vision model analysis, preserving layout, formatting, tables, and visual elements using OpenAI-style document processing capabilities.","zh":"赋予代理将PDF、Word文档和表格转换为渲染图像以进行视觉模型分析的能力，保留布局、格式、表格和视觉元素，使用OpenAI风格的文档处理功能。","ja":"エージェントがPDF、ワード文書、スプレッドシートをレンダリングされた画像に変換して視覚モデル分析を実行できるようにし、レイアウト、書式、表、視覚要素を保存します。OpenAIスタイルの文書処理機能を使用。","ko":"에이전트가 PDF, 워드 문서 및 스프레드시트를 렌더링된 이미지로 변환하여 비전 모델 분석을 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 레이아웃, 형식, 표 및 시각적 요소를 보존합니다. OpenAI 스타일의 문서 처리 기능을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir PDF, documentos de Word y hojas de cálculo en imágenes renderizadas para análisis de modelos de visión, preservando el diseño, formato, tablas y elementos visuales utilizando capacidades de procesamiento de documentos de estilo OpenAI.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des PDF, des documents Word et des tableurs en images rendues pour l''analyse de modèles de vision, en préservant la mise en page, le format, les tableaux et les éléments visuels en utilisant des capacités de traitement de documents de style OpenAI.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, PDF-, Word-Dokumente und Tabellenkalkulationen in gerenderte Bilder für die Analyse von Sichtmodellen umzuwandeln, wobei Layout, Formatierung, Tabellen und visuelle Elemente unter Verwendung von OpenAI-ähnlichen Dokumentenverarbeitungsfunktionen erhalten bleiben.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter PDFs, documentos do Word e planilhas em imagens renderizadas para análise de modelos de visão, preservando o layout, formatação, tabelas e elementos visuais usando capacidades de processamento de documentos no estilo OpenAI.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью конвертировать PDF, документы Word и электронные таблицы в отображаемые изображения для анализа моделей зрения, сохраняя макет, форматирование, таблицы и визуальные элементы с использованием возможностей обработки документов в стиле OpenAI.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تحويل ملفات PDF ووثائق وورد والجداول إلى صور معالَجة للتحليل بنموذج الرؤية، مع الحفاظ على التصميم والتنسيق والجداول والعناصر المرئية باستخدام إمكانيات معالجة المستندات على نمط OpenAI."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing multi-page PDF documents","Converting Word documents into vision model-compatible formats","Processing spreadsheets for data visualization and analysis"],"zh":["分析多页PDF文档","将Word文档转换为视觉模型兼容格式","处理表格以进行数据可视化和分析"],"ja":["複数ページのPDF文書を分析する","ワード文書を視覚モデルと互換性のある形式に変換する","データの視覚化と分析のためにスプレッドシートを処理する"],"ko":["다중 페이지 PDF 문서 분석","워드 문서를 비전 모델 호환 형식으로 변환","데이터 시각화 및 분석을 위한 스프레드시트 처리"],"es":["Análisis de documentos PDF de varias páginas","Conversión de documentos de Word en formatos compatibles con el modelo de visión","Procesamiento de hojas de cálculo para visualización y análisis de datos"],"fr":["Analyse de documents PDF à plusieurs pages","Conversion de documents Word en formats compatibles avec le modèle de vision","Traitement de tableurs pour la visualisation et l''analyse de données"],"de":["Analyse von PDF-Dokumenten mit mehreren Seiten","Umwandlung von Word-Dokumenten in Formate, die mit dem Sichtmodell kompatibel sind","Verarbeitung von Tabellenkalkulationen für Datenvisualisierung und -analyse"],"pt":["Analisar documentos PDF de várias páginas","Converter documentos do Word em formatos compatíveis com o modelo de visão","Processar planilhas para visualização e análise de dados"],"ru":["Анализировать многостраничные документы PDF","Преобразовывать документы Word в форматы, совместимые с моделью зрения","Обрабатывать электронные таблицы для визуализации и анализа данных"],"ar":["تحليل مستندات PDF متعددة الصفحات","تحويل وثائق وورد إلى صيغ متوافقة مع نموذج الرؤية","معالجة الجداول من أجل تحليل وتصوير البيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires support for image rendering and vision model analysis","Limited to PDF, DOCX, and spreadsheet formats"],"zh":["需要图像渲染和视觉模型分析的支持","仅限于PDF、DOCX和表格格式"],"ja":["画像レンダリングと視覚モデル分析のサポートが必要","PDF、DOCX、スプレッドシート形式のみ"],"ko":["이미지 렌더링 및 비전 모델 분석 지원이 필요","PDF, DOCX, 스프레드시트 형식만 지원"],"es":["Requiere soporte para renderizado de imágenes y análisis de modelos de visión","Limitado a formatos PDF, DOCX y hojas de cálculo"],"fr":["Nécessite un support pour le rendu d''images et l''analyse de modèles de vision","Limité aux formats PDF, DOCX et tableurs"],"de":["Benötigt Unterstützung für Bildrendering und Sichtmodellanalyse","Begrenzt auf PDF-, DOCX- und Tabellenkalkulationsformate"],"pt":["Requer suporte para renderização de imagens e análise de modelos de visão","Limitado a formatos PDF, DOCX e planilhas"],"ru":["Требует поддержки отображения изображений и анализа моделей зрения","Ограничен форматами PDF, DOCX и электронными таблицами"],"ar":["يتطلب دعمًا لتصيير الصور وتحليل نموذج الرؤية","محدود بتنسيقات PDF و DOCX والجداول"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('cartridge-gg/controller/codegen', 'community', 'cartridge-gg', 'controller', 'cartridge-gg/controller', 'codegen', 0, 0, 65, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z', '2026-02-18T04:15:28.322Z', NULL, '{"id":"cartridge-gg/controller/codegen","name":"codegen","description":{"zh":"CodeGen 技术提供自托管嵌入式账户，实现区块链游戏的无缝体验。通过自动生成 GraphQL 类型，确保 API 调用准确性和安全性","ja":"CodeGen スキルはセルフカストディアルエンベデッドアカウントを提供し、オンチェーンゲームのシームレスな実行を可能にします。GraphQL タイプを自動生成して API 呼び出しの正確性とセキュリティを確保します","ko":"CodeGen 기술은 자체 보관 임베디드 계정을 제공하여 온체인 게임의 무장애 환경을 구현합니다. GraphQL类型을 자동 생성하여 API 호출의 정확성과 보안성을 보장합니다","es":"CodeGen es una herramienta que regenera tipos GraphQL desde el esquema de la API, simplificando el proceso de desarrollo","fr":"CodeGen est un outil qui régénère les types GraphQL à partir du schéma de l''API, simplifiant ainsi le processus de développement","de":"CodeGen ist ein Tool, das GraphQL-Typen aus dem API-Schema regeneriert und somit den Entwicklungsprozess vereinfacht","pt":"O codegen é uma habilidade que regenera tipos GraphQL de esquemas de API para jogos on-chain, garantindo a consistência e a precisão.","ru":"codegen — это навык, который регенерирует типы GraphQL из схем API для игр на блокчейне, обеспечивая согласованность и точность.","ar":"codegen هو مهارة ت重新 إنشاء أنواع GraphQL من مخططات API للألعاب على السلسلة، مما يضمن الاتساق والدقة.","en":"A self custodial embedded account to seamlessly play onchain games"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"CodeGen 技术：自托管嵌入式账户，玩转区块链游戏","ja":"CodeGen スキル：セルフカストディアルエンベデッドアカウントによるオンチェーンゲームの実行","ko":"CodeGen 기술: 자체 보관 임베디드 계정, 온체인 게임을 위한 무장애 환경","es":"CodeGen: Herramienta de Regeneración de Tipos GraphQL","fr":"CodeGen : Outil de Régénération de Types GraphQL","de":"CodeGen: Werkzeug für die Regenerierung von GraphQL-Typen","pt":"codegen: Gereação de Tipos GraphQL para Jogos On-Chain","ru":"codegen: Генерация Типов GraphQL для Игр на Блокчейне","ar":"codegen: генерація أنواع GraphQL للألعاب على السلسلة","en":"codegen"},"description":{"zh":"CodeGen 技术提供自托管嵌入式账户，实现区块链游戏的无缝体验。通过自动生成 GraphQL 类型，确保 API 调用准确性和安全性","ja":"CodeGen スキルはセルフカストディアルエンベデッドアカウントを提供し、オンチェーンゲームのシームレスな実行を可能にします。GraphQL タイプを自動生成して API 呼び出しの正確性とセキュリティを確保します","ko":"CodeGen 기술은 자체 보관 임베디드 계정을 제공하여 온체인 게임의 무장애 환경을 구현합니다. GraphQL类型을 자동 생성하여 API 호출의 정확성과 보안성을 보장합니다","es":"CodeGen es una herramienta que regenera tipos GraphQL desde el esquema de la API, simplificando el proceso de desarrollo","fr":"CodeGen est un outil qui régénère les types GraphQL à partir du schéma de l''API, simplifiant ainsi le processus de développement","de":"CodeGen ist ein Tool, das GraphQL-Typen aus dem API-Schema regeneriert und somit den Entwicklungsprozess vereinfacht","pt":"O codegen é uma habilidade que regenera tipos GraphQL de esquemas de API para jogos on-chain, garantindo a consistência e a precisão.","ru":"codegen — это навык, который регенерирует типы GraphQL из схем API для игр на блокчейне, обеспечивая согласованность и точность.","ar":"codegen هو مهارة ت重新 إنشاء أنواع GraphQL من مخططات API للألعاب على السلسلة، مما يضمن الاتساق والدقة.","en":"A self custodial embedded account to seamlessly play onchain games"},"definition":{"en":"A self custodial embedded account to seamlessly play onchain games"},"features":{"zh":["自动生成 GraphQL 类型","确保 API 调用准确性和安全性","支持区块链游戏开发","提供自托管嵌入式账户","实现无缝的游戏体验"],"ja":["GraphQL タイプを自動生成","API 呼び出しの正確性とセキュリティを確保","オンチェーンゲーム開発をサポート","セルフカストディアルエンベデッドアカウントを提供","シームレスなゲーム実行を実現"],"ko":["GraphQL类型을 자동 생성","API 호출의 정확성과 보안성을 보장","온체인 게임 개발을 지원","자체 보관 임베디드 계정을 제공","무장애 게임 환경을 구현"],"es":["Regeneración automática de tipos GraphQL","Simplificación del proceso de desarrollo","Compatibilidad con GraphQL y TypeScript","Verificación de errores de tipo en las llamadas a la API","Integración con pnpm y testing"],"fr":["Régénération automatique des types GraphQL","Simplification du processus de développement","Compatibilité avec GraphQL et TypeScript","Vérification des erreurs de type dans les appels d''API","Intégration avec pnpm et testing"],"de":["Automatische Regenerierung von GraphQL-Typen","Vereinfachung des Entwicklungsprozesses","Kompatibilität mit GraphQL und TypeScript","Überprüfung von Typfehlern in API-Aufrufen","Integration mit pnpm und Testing"],"pt":["Regeneração de tipos GraphQL de esquemas de API","Suporte a jogos on-chain","Integração com o GraphQL","Verificação de erros de tipo","Execução de testes automatizados"],"ru":["Регенерация типов GraphQL из схем API","Поддержка игр на блокчейне","Интеграция с GraphQL","Проверка ошибок типа","Выполнение автоматических тестов"],"ar":["إعادة إنشاء أنواع GraphQL من مخططات API","دعم الألعاب على السلسلة","التكامل مع GraphQL","التحقق من أخطاء النوع","تشغيل الاختبارات الآلية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["CodeGen","GraphQL","区块链游戏","自托管嵌入式账户","API 调用","安全性","准确性"],"ja":["CodeGen","GraphQL","オンチェーンゲーム","セルフカストディアルエンベデッドアカウント","API 呼び出し","セキュリティ","正確性"],"ko":["CodeGen","GraphQL","온체인 게임","자체 보관 임베디드 계정","API 호출","보안성","정확성"],"es":["CodeGen","GraphQL","Tipos GraphQL","Desarrollo de software","Herramientas de desarrollo","API","TypeScript","pnpm","Testing"],"fr":["CodeGen","GraphQL","Types GraphQL","Développement de logiciels","Outils de développement","API","TypeScript","pnpm","Testing"],"de":["CodeGen","GraphQL","GraphQL-Typen","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","API","TypeScript","pnpm","Testing"],"pt":["codegen","GraphQL","jogos on-chain","desenvolvimento de jogos","tipos GraphQL","esquemas de API","regeneração de tipos"],"ru":["codegen","GraphQL","игры на блокчейне","разработка игр","типы GraphQL","схемы API","регенерация типов"],"ar":["codegen","GraphQL","الألعاب على السلسلة","تطوير الألعاب","أنواع GraphQL","مخططات API","إعادة إنشاء أنواع"]}},"owner":"cartridge-gg","repo":"controller","repoPath":"cartridge-gg/controller","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"codegen","description":"Regenerate GraphQL types from API schema. Use when API schema has changed, GraphQL queries/mutations added or modified, or type errors in API calls.","bodyPreview":"# GraphQL Codegen Skill\n\nRegenerate GraphQL types from API schema.\n\n## Usage\n\nRun when:\n- API schema has changed\n- GraphQL queries/mutations added or modified\n- Type errors in API calls\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Run `pnpm --filter @cartridge/keychain codegen`\n2. Verify generated types in `packages/keychain/src/utils/api/graphql.ts`\n3. Check for any TypeScript errors in files using the API\n4. Run `pnpm test` to ensure tests still pass\n\n## Configuration\n\n- Schema source: https://api.cartridge.gg/query\n- Confi","body":"# GraphQL Codegen Skill\n\nRegenerate GraphQL types from API schema.\n\n## Usage\n\nRun when:\n- API schema has changed\n- GraphQL queries/mutations added or modified\n- Type errors in API calls\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Run `pnpm --filter @cartridge/keychain codegen`\n2. Verify generated types in `packages/keychain/src/utils/api/graphql.ts`\n3. Check for any TypeScript errors in files using the API\n4. Run `pnpm test` to ensure tests still pass\n\n## Configuration\n\n- Schema source: https://api.cartridge.gg/query\n- Config: `packages/keychain/src/utils/api/codegen.yaml`\n- Auto-runs during build process\n\n## Notes\n\n- Codegen is also triggered automatically during `pnpm build`\n- Generated files should not be manually edited\n- Commit generated changes with schema updates\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:15:28.322Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for TypeScript-based AI Agents requiring automated GraphQL schema regeneration and type safety","zh":"适用于需要自动化 GraphQL 模式再生和类型安全的 TypeScript 基础 AI 代理","ja":"TypeScript ベースの AI エージェントが自動 GraphQL スキーマ再生成と型セーフティを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"자동화된 GraphQL 스키마 재생성 및 타입 안전성이 필요한 TypeScript 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en TypeScript que requieren regeneración automática de esquemas de GraphQL y seguridad de tipos","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur TypeScript nécessitant une régénération automatique de schémas GraphQL et une sécurité de types","de":"Ideal für TypeScript-basierte KI-Agents, die eine automatische Regenerierung von GraphQL-Schemata und Typsicherheit erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA baseados em TypeScript que exigem regeneração automática de esquema GraphQL e segurança de tipo","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе TypeScript, требующих автоматического возрождения схемы GraphQL и безопасности типов","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المبني على TypeScript الذي يتطلب إعادة إنشاء مخطط GraphQL آلي وتأمين النوع"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to regenerate GraphQL types from API schema using pnpm and TypeScript, ensuring seamless interaction with on-chain games via GraphQL queries and mutations over HTTPS","zh":"使代理能够使用 pnpm 和 TypeScript 从 API 模式重新生成 GraphQL 类型，确保通过 HTTPS 的 GraphQL 查询和变异与链上游戏的无缝交互","ja":"pnpm と TypeScript を使用して API スキーマから GraphQL タイプを再生成できるようにエージェントを有効にし、HTTPS 経由の GraphQL クエリとミューテーションを使用したオンチェーン ゲームとのシームレスなやりとりを保証","ko":"pnpm과 TypeScript를 사용하여 API 스키마에서 GraphQL 类型을 재생성할 수 있도록 에이전트를 활성화하여 HTTPS를 통해 GraphQL 쿼리와 변이로 온체인 게임과 무결한 상호 작용을 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a regenerar tipos de GraphQL desde el esquema de la API utilizando pnpm y TypeScript, asegurando una interacción sin problemas con juegos en cadena a través de consultas y mutaciones de GraphQL sobre HTTPS","fr":"Permet aux agents de régénérer les types GraphQL à partir du schéma d''API en utilisant pnpm et TypeScript, garantissant une interaction sans problème avec les jeux en chaîne via des requêtes et des mutations GraphQL sur HTTPS","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, GraphQL-Typen aus dem API-Schema mithilfe von pnpm und TypeScript zu regenerieren, um eine nahtlose Interaktion mit On-Chain-Spielen über GraphQL-Abfragen und -Mutationen über HTTPS zu gewährleisten","pt":"Permite que os agentes regenerem tipos GraphQL a partir do esquema da API usando pnpm e TypeScript, garantindo interação sem problemas com jogos em cadeia por meio de consultas e mutações GraphQL via HTTPS","ru":"Позволяет агентам возрождать типы GraphQL из схемы API с помощью pnpm и TypeScript, обеспечивая бесперебойное взаимодействие с играми в цепи через запросы и мутации GraphQL по HTTPS","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء إعادة إنشاء أنواع GraphQL من مخطط واجهة برمجة التطبيقات باستخدام pnpm وTypeScript، مما يضمن التفاعل السلس مع الألعاب على السلسلة من خلال استفسارات ومطابقات GraphQL عبر HTTPS"},"useCases":{"en":["Regenerating GraphQL types after API schema changes","Resolving type errors in API calls","Automating GraphQL schema updates for on-chain games"],"zh":["API 模式更改后重新生成 GraphQL 类型","解决 API 调用中的类型错误","自动为链上游戏更新 GraphQL 模式"],"ja":["API スキーマの変更後、GraphQL タイプを再生成する","API 呼び出しのタイプ エラーを解決する","オンチェーン ゲーム用の GraphQL スキーマを自動更新する"],"ko":["API 스키마 변경 후 GraphQL 类型을 재생성","API 호출의 타입 오류를 해결","온체인 게임을 위한 GraphQL 스키마 자동 업데이트"],"es":["Regenerar tipos de GraphQL después de cambios en el esquema de la API","Resolver errores de tipo en llamadas a la API","Automatizar actualizaciones de esquemas de GraphQL para juegos en cadena"],"fr":["Régénérer les types GraphQL après des modifications du schéma d''API","Résoudre les erreurs de type dans les appels d''API","Automatiser les mises à jour des schémas GraphQL pour les jeux en chaîne"],"de":["GraphQL-Typen nach Änderungen des API-Schemas regenerieren","Typfehler in API-Aufrufen lösen","Automatisieren von GraphQL-Schema-Aktualisierungen für On-Chain-Spiele"],"pt":["Regenerar tipos GraphQL após alterações no esquema da API","Resolver erros de tipo em chamadas de API","Automatizar atualizações de esquema GraphQL para jogos em cadeia"],"ru":["Возрождение типов GraphQL после изменений в схеме API","Разрешение ошибок типов в вызовах API","Автоматизация обновлений схемы GraphQL для игр в цепи"],"ar":["إعادة إنشاء أنواع GraphQL بعد التغييرات على مخطط واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","حل أخطاء النوع في مكالمات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","توفير تحديثات مخطط GraphQL آليًا للألعاب على السلسلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pnpm installation","TypeScript compatibility required","Dependent on API schema source availability"],"zh":["需要 pnpm 安装","需要 TypeScript 兼容性","依赖于 API 模式源的可用性"],"ja":["pnpm のインストールが必要","TypeScript の互換性が必要","API スキーマ ソースの可用性に依存"],"ko":["pnpm 설치가 필요","TypeScript 호환성이 필요","API 스키마 소스의 가용성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere instalación de pnpm","Se requiere compatibilidad con TypeScript","Dependiente de la disponibilidad de la fuente del esquema de la API"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de pnpm","La compatibilité TypeScript est requise","Dépend de la disponibilité de la source du schéma d''API"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von pnpm","TypeScript-Kompatibilität erforderlich","Abhängig von der Verfügbarkeit der API-Schema-Quelle"],"pt":["Exige instalação do pnpm","Compatibilidade com TypeScript necessária","Dependente da disponibilidade da fonte do esquema da API"],"ru":["Требует установки pnpm","Требуется совместимость с TypeScript","Зависит от доступности источника схемы API"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت pnpm","مطلوب توافق مع TypeScript","يعتمد على توافر مصدر مخطط واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":65}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop/prd', 'community', 'YougLin-dev', 'Aha-Loop', 'YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop', 'prd', 0, 0, 75, '2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z', '2026-02-18T04:15:33.433Z', NULL, '{"id":"YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop/prd","name":"prd","description":{"zh":"Aha Loop PRD 生成器是一种自动化的 AI 开发系统，用于创建详细的产品需求文档。它可以接收用户的功能描述，提出clarifying问题，并生成结构化的 PRD。","ja":"Aha Loop PRD ジェネレーターは、自動化された AI 開発システムで、詳細な製品要件文書を作成します。ユーザーの機能説明を受け取り、clarifying 質問を提出し、構造化された PRD を生成します。","ko":"Aha Loop PRD 생성기는 자동화된 AI 개발 시스템으로,詳細한 제품 요구사항 문서를 생성합니다. 사용자의 기능 설명을 받고,clarifying 질문을 제시하며, 구조화된 PRD를 생성합니다.","es":"El generador de PRD de Aha Loop es una herramienta autónoma que crea documentos de requisitos de producto claros y precisos. Recibe una descripción de función del usuario y genera un PRD estructurado","fr":"Le générateur de PRD d''Aha Loop est un outil autonome qui crée des documents de spécifications de produit clairs et précis. Il reçoit une description de fonction de l''utilisateur et génère un PRD structuré","de":"Der PRD-Generator von Aha Loop ist ein autonomes Tool, das detaillierte und präzise Produktanforderungsdokumente erstellt. Es erhält eine Funktionsbeschreibung vom Benutzer und generiert ein strukturiertes PRD","pt":"O gerador de PRD da Aha Loop cria documentos de requisitos de produto detalhados e executáveis. Ele recebe descrições de recursos e gera PRDs estruturados.","ru":"Генератор PRD от Aha Loop создает подробные и выполнимые документы требований продукта. Он получает описания функций и генерирует структурированные PRD.","ar":"مولد مواصفات المنتج من Aha Loop يولد وثائق متطلبات المنتج المفصلة والقابلة للتنفيذ. يقوم باستلاموصاف الميزات وتوليد مواصفات منتج منظم","en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI development framework with planning capabilities, research abilities, and oversight mechanisms."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Aha Loop PRD 生成器：自动创建产品需求文档","ja":"Aha Loop PRD ジェネレーター：自動で製品要件文書を作成","ko":"Aha Loop PRD 생성기: 자동으로 제품 요구사항 문서 생성","es":"Generador de PRD: Crea documentos de requisitos de produc...","fr":"Générateur de PRD: Créez des documents de spécifications ...","de":"PRD-Generator: Erstelle detaillierte Produktanforderungsd...","pt":"Gerador de PRD: Crie Documentos de Requisitos de Produto","ru":"Генератор PRD: Создавайте Документы Требований Продукта","ar":"مولد مواصفات المنتج: قم بإنشاء وثائق متطلبات المنتج","en":"prd"},"description":{"zh":"Aha Loop PRD 生成器是一种自动化的 AI 开发系统，用于创建详细的产品需求文档。它可以接收用户的功能描述，提出clarifying问题，并生成结构化的 PRD。","ja":"Aha Loop PRD ジェネレーターは、自動化された AI 開発システムで、詳細な製品要件文書を作成します。ユーザーの機能説明を受け取り、clarifying 質問を提出し、構造化された PRD を生成します。","ko":"Aha Loop PRD 생성기는 자동화된 AI 개발 시스템으로,詳細한 제품 요구사항 문서를 생성합니다. 사용자의 기능 설명을 받고,clarifying 질문을 제시하며, 구조화된 PRD를 생성합니다.","es":"El generador de PRD de Aha Loop es una herramienta autónoma que crea documentos de requisitos de producto claros y precisos. Recibe una descripción de funció...","fr":"Le générateur de PRD d''Aha Loop est un outil autonome qui crée des documents de spécifications de produit clairs et précis. Il reçoit une description de fonc...","de":"Der PRD-Generator von Aha Loop ist ein autonomes Tool, das detaillierte und präzise Produktanforderungsdokumente erstellt. Es erhält eine Funktionsbeschreibu...","pt":"O gerador de PRD da Aha Loop cria documentos de requisitos de produto detalhados e executáveis. Ele recebe descrições de recursos e gera PRDs estruturados.","ru":"Генератор PRD от Aha Loop создает подробные и выполнимые документы требований продукта. Он получает описания функций и генерирует структурированные PRD.","ar":"مولد مواصفات المنتج من Aha Loop يولد وثائق متطلبات المنتج المفصلة والقابلة للتنفيذ. يقوم باستلاموصاف الميزات وتوليد مواصفات منتج منظم","en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI devel..."},"definition":{"en":"[MVP] Aha Loop is a fully autonomous AI development system, extended from the core ideas of Ralph. It''s not just an execution engine, but a complete AI development framework with planning capabilities, research abilities, and oversight mechanisms."},"features":{"zh":["自动创建产品需求文档","接收用户功能描述并提出clarifying问题","生成结构化的 PRD","支持 Workspace 模式","自动保存 PRD 到指定目录"],"ja":["製品要件文書の自動生成","ユーザーの機能説明を受け取り、clarifying 質問を提出","構造化された PRD の生成","Workspace モードのサポート","PRD を指定ディレクトリに自動保存"],"ko":["제품 요구사항 문서의 자동 생성","사용자의 기능 설명을 받고 clarifying 질문을 제시","구조화된 PRD의 생성","Workspace 모드 지원","PRD를 지정 디렉토리에 자동 저장"],"es":["Crea documentos de requisitos de producto claros y precisos","Recibe descripciones de función del usuario y genera PRD estructurados","Preguntas de aclaración esenciales para garantizar la precisión","Compatibilidad con modo de espacio de trabajo para una integración fluida","Genera PRD en formato estructurado para una fácil implementación"],"fr":["Crée des documents de spécifications de produit clairs et précis","Reçoit des descriptions de fonction de l''utilisateur et génère des PRD structurés","Questions de clarification essentielles pour garantir la précision","Compatibilité avec le mode d''espace de travail pour une intégration fluide","Génère des PRD au format structuré pour une mise en œuvre facile"],"de":["Erstellt detaillierte und präzise Produktanforderungsdokumente","Erhält Funktionsbeschreibungen vom Benutzer und generiert strukturierte PRD","Wesentliche Klarstellungsfragen für eine genaue Ausführung","Kompatibilität mit Arbeitsbereichsmodus für eine nahtlose Integration","Generiert PRD im strukturierten Format für eine einfache Umsetzung"],"pt":["Criação de PRDs detalhados","Recebe descrições de recursos do usuário","Gera PRDs estruturados","Salva PRDs em `.aha-loop/tasks/`","Integração com o orchestrador"],"ru":["Создание подробных PRD","Получение описаний функций от пользователя","Генерация структурированных PRD","Сохранение PRD в `.aha-loop/tasks/`","Интеграция с оркестратором"],"ar":["إنشاء مواصفات منتج مفصلة","استلام وصف الميزات من المستخدم","توليد مواصفات منتج منظم","حفظ مواصفات المنتج في `.aha-loop/tasks/`","التكامل مع المنسق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Aha Loop PRD 生成器","自动化 AI 开发","产品需求文档","PRD 生成","Workspace 模式","AI 开发工具"],"ja":["Aha Loop PRD ジェネレーター","自動化された AI 開発","製品要件文書","PRD 生成","Workspace モード","AI 開発ツール"],"ko":["Aha Loop PRD 생성기","자동화된 AI 개발","제품 요구사항 문서","PRD 생성","Workspace 모드","AI 개발 도구"],"es":["generador de PRD","documentos de requisitos de producto","desarrollo de software","equipo de desarrollo","proceso de desarrollo de productos","herramientas de desarrollo de productos"],"fr":["générateur de PRD","documents de spécifications de produit","développement de logiciels","équipe de développement","processus de développement de produits","outils de développement de produits"],"de":["PRD-Generator","Produktanforderungsdokumente","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungsteam","Produktentwicklungsprozess","Produktentwicklungstools"],"pt":["gerador de PRD","documentos de requisitos de produto","desenvolvimento de produtos","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Aha Loop","PRD","requisitos de produto"],"ru":["генератор PRD","документы требований продукта","разработка продуктов","инструменты разработки","Aha Loop","PRD","требования продукта"],"ar":["مولد مواصفات المنتج","وثائق متطلبات المنتج","تطوير المنتجات","أدوات التطوير","Aha Loop","مواصفات المنتج","متطلبات المنتج"]}},"owner":"YougLin-dev","repo":"Aha-Loop","repoPath":"YougLin-dev/Aha-Loop","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T01:08:43.418Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"prd","description":"Generates Product Requirements Documents (PRD) for new features. Use when planning features or starting projects. Triggers on: create prd, write prd, plan feature, requirements, spec out.","bodyPreview":"# PRD Generator\n\nCreate detailed Product Requirements Documents that are clear, actionable, and suitable for implementation.\n\n## Workspace Mode Note\n\nWhen running in workspace mode, save PRDs to `.aha-loop/tasks/` instead of `tasks/`.\nThe orchestrator will provide the actual paths in the prompt context.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Receive a feature description from the user\n2. Ask 3-5 essential clarifying questions (with lettered options)\n3. Generate a structured PRD based on answers\n4. Save to `tasks/","body":"# PRD Generator\n\nCreate detailed Product Requirements Documents that are clear, actionable, and suitable for implementation.\n\n## Workspace Mode Note\n\nWhen running in workspace mode, save PRDs to `.aha-loop/tasks/` instead of `tasks/`.\nThe orchestrator will provide the actual paths in the prompt context.\n\n---\n\n## The Job\n\n1. Receive a feature description from the user\n2. Ask 3-5 essential clarifying questions (with lettered options)\n3. Generate a structured PRD based on answers\n4. Save to `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`\n\n**Important:** Do NOT start implementing. Just create the PRD.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Clarifying Questions\n\nAsk only critical questions where the initial prompt is ambiguous. Focus on:\n\n- **Problem/Goal:** What problem does this solve?\n- **Core Functionality:** What are the key actions?\n- **Scope/Boundaries:** What should it NOT do?\n- **Success Criteria:** How do we know it''s done?\n\n### Format Questions Like This:\n\n```\n1. What is the primary goal of this feature?\n   A. Improve user onboarding experience\n   B. Increase user retention\n   C. Reduce support burden\n   D. Other: [please specify]\n\n2. Who is the target user?\n   A. New users only\n   B. Existing users only\n   C. All users\n   D. Admin users only\n\n3. What is the scope?\n   A. Minimal viable version\n   B. Full-featured implementation\n   C. Just the backend/API\n   D. Just the UI\n```\n\nThis lets users respond with \"1A, 2C, 3B\" for quick iteration.\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: PRD Structure\n\nGenerate the PRD with these sections:\n\n### 1. Introduction/Overview\nBrief description of the feature and the problem it solves.\n\n### 2. Goals\nSpecific, measurable objectives (bullet list).\n\n### 3. User Stories\nEach story needs:\n- **Title:** Short descriptive name\n- **Description:** \"As a [user], I want [feature] so that [benefit]\"\n- **Acceptance Criteria:** Verifiable checklist of what \"done\" means\n- **Research Topics:** Questions to investigate before implementation (for complex stories)\n\nEach story should be small enough to implement in one focused session.\n\n**Format:**\n```markdown\n### US-001: [Title]\n**Description:** As a [user], I want [feature] so that [benefit].\n\n**Research Topics:** (optional, for complex stories)\n- [ ] Question about technology choice or best practice\n- [ ] Question about existing patterns in codebase\n- [ ] Question about third-party library usage\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Specific verifiable criterion\n- [ ] Another criterion\n- [ ] Typecheck/lint passes\n- [ ] **[UI stories only]** Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n```\n\n**Important:** \n- Acceptance criteria must be verifiable, not vague. \"Works correctly\" is bad. \"Button shows confirmation dialog before deleting\" is good.\n- **For any story with UI changes:** Always include \"Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\" as acceptance criteria. This ensures visual verification of frontend work.\n- **Research Topics** help the research phase focus on the right questions. Include them when:\n  - Using an unfamiliar third-party library\n  - Multiple implementation approaches exist\n  - Performance or scalability concerns\n  - Complex integration with existing systems\n\n### 4. Functional Requirements\nNumbered list of specific functionalities:\n- \"FR-1: The system must allow users to...\"\n- \"FR-2: When a user clicks X, the system must...\"\n\nBe explicit and unambiguous.\n\n### 5. Non-Goals (Out of Scope)\nWhat this feature will NOT include. Critical for managing scope.\n\n### 6. Design Considerations (Optional)\n- UI/UX requirements\n- Link to mockups if available\n- Relevant existing components to reuse\n\n### 7. Technical Considerations (Optional)\n- Known constraints or dependencies\n- Integration points with existing systems\n- Performance requirements\n\n### 8. Success Metrics\nHow will success be measured?\n- \"Reduce time to complete X by 50%\"\n- \"Increase conversion rate by 10%\"\n\n### 9. Open Questions\nRemaining questions or areas needing clarification.\n\n---\n\n## Writing for Junior Developers\n\nThe PRD reader may be a junior developer or AI agent. Therefore:\n\n- Be explicit and unambiguous\n- Avoid jargon or explain it\n- Provide enough detail to understand purpose and core logic\n- Number requirements for easy reference\n- Use concrete examples where helpful\n\n---\n\n## Output\n\n- **Format:** Markdown (`.md`)\n- **Location:** `tasks/`\n- **Filename:** `prd-[feature-name].md` (kebab-case)\n\n---\n\n## Example PRD\n\n```markdown\n# PRD: Task Priority System\n\n## Introduction\n\nAdd priority levels to tasks so users can focus on what matters most. Tasks can be marked as high, medium, or low priority, with visual indicators and filtering to help users manage their workload effectively.\n\n## Goals\n\n- Allow assigning priority (high/medium/low) to any task\n- Provide clear visual differentiation between priority levels\n- Enable filtering and sorting by priority\n- Default new tasks to medium priority\n\n## User Stories\n\n### US-001: Add priority field to database\n**Description:** As a developer, I need to store task priority so it persists across sessions.\n\n**Research Topics:**\n- [ ] Best practices for database enum fields in this stack\n- [ ] Migration rollback strategies for schema changes\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Add priority column to tasks table: ''high'' | ''medium'' | ''low'' (default ''medium'')\n- [ ] Generate and run migration successfully\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n\n### US-002: Display priority indicator on task cards\n**Description:** As a user, I want to see task priority at a glance so I know what needs attention first.\n\n**Research Topics:**\n- [ ] Accessible color schemes for priority indicators (WCAG compliance)\n- [ ] Existing badge/tag components in codebase to reuse\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Each task card shows colored priority badge (red=high, yellow=medium, gray=low)\n- [ ] Priority visible without hovering or clicking\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n### US-003: Add priority selector to task edit\n**Description:** As a user, I want to change a task''s priority when editing it.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Priority dropdown in task edit modal\n- [ ] Shows current priority as selected\n- [ ] Saves immediately on selection change\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n### US-004: Filter tasks by priority\n**Description:** As a user, I want to filter the task list to see only high-priority items when I''m focused.\n\n**Research Topics:**\n- [ ] URL state management patterns in this codebase\n- [ ] Existing filter implementations to follow as pattern\n\n**Acceptance Criteria:**\n- [ ] Filter dropdown with options: All | High | Medium | Low\n- [ ] Filter persists in URL params\n- [ ] Empty state message when no tasks match filter\n- [ ] Typecheck passes\n- [ ] Verify in browser using dev-browser skill\n\n## Functional Requirements\n\n- FR-1: Add `priority` field to tasks table (''high'' | ''medium'' | ''low'', default ''medium'')\n- FR-2: Display colored priority badge on each task card\n- FR-3: Include priority selector in task edit modal\n- FR-4: Add priority filter dropdown to task list header\n- FR-5: Sort by priority within each status column (high to medium to low)\n\n## Non-Goals\n\n- No priority-based notifications or reminders\n- No automatic priority assignment based on due date\n- No priority inheritance for subtasks\n\n## Technical Considerations\n\n- Reuse existing badge component with color variants\n- Filter state managed via URL search params\n- Priority stored in database, not computed\n\n## Success Metrics\n\n- Users can change priority in under 2 clicks\n- High-priority tasks immediately visible at top of lists\n- No regression in task list performance\n\n## Open Questions\n\n- Should priority affect task ordering within a column?\n- Should we add keyboard shortcuts for priority changes?\n```\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\nBefore saving the PRD:\n\n- [ ] Asked clarifying questions with lettered options\n- [ ] Incorporated user''s answers\n- [ ] User stories are small and specific\n- [ ] Complex stories have research topics defined\n- [ ] Functional requirements are numbered and unambiguous\n- [ ] Non-goals section defines clear boundaries\n- [ ] Saved to `tasks/prd-[feature-name].md`\n\n## Research Topics Guidelines\n\nWhen adding research topics, consider:\n\n**Good research topics:**\n- \"How does library X handle Y?\" (specific, answerable)\n- \"What existing patterns does this codebase use for Z?\"\n- \"Performance implications of approach A vs B\"\n- \"Best practices for implementing feature X\"\n\n**Bad research topics:**\n- \"How to code this\" (too vague)\n- \"Make it work\" (not a question)\n- \"Everything about library X\" (too broad)\n\n**When to include research topics:**\n- First time using a library in this project\n- Multiple valid approaches exist\n- Performance-sensitive implementation\n- Security-sensitive implementation\n- Complex integration with external systems\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-18T04:15:33.433Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for AI Development Agents requiring structured planning and requirements documentation capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要结构化规划和需求文档能力的AI开发代理。","ja":"構造化計画と要件文書化能力を必要とするAI開発エージェントに不可欠です。","ko":"구조화된 계획 및 요구사항 문서화 기능을 필요로 하는 AI 개발 에이전트에게 필수적입니다.","es":"Esencial para los agentes de desarrollo de IA que requieren capacidad de planificación estructurada y documentación de requisitos.","fr":"Essentiel pour les agents de développement d''IA nécessitant une planification structurée et des capacités de documentation de exigences.","de":"Wesentlich für AI-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine strukturierte Planung und Funktionalitäten für die Dokumentation von Anforderungen erfordern.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de IA que requerem planejamento estruturado e capacidades de documentação de requisitos.","ru":"Необходим для агентов разработки ИИ, требующих структурированного планирования и возможностей документации требований.","ar":"ضروري لعمليات تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تتطلب التخطيط المنظم وقدرات توثيق المتطلبات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Generates comprehensive Product Requirements Documents with built-in clarification workflows, featuring 3-5 essential clarifying questions with lettered options before producing actionable specifications. Integrates directly with Aha Loop''s autonomous development framework through workspace mode support (.aha-loop/tasks/ directory structure).","zh":"生成具有内置澄清工作流的综合产品需求文档，采用3-5个基本澄清问题和字母选项，然后生成可执行的规格。通过工作空间模式支持直接与Aha Loop的自主开发框架集成（.aha-loop/tasks/目录结构）。","ja":"内蔵の明確化ワークフローを備えた包括的な製品要件文書を生成する。3～5の基本的な明確化質問と文字オプションを使用して、アクション可能な仕様を生成する。ワークスペースモードのサポートを通じて、Aha Loopの自律開発フレームワーク（.aha-loop/tasks/ディレクトリ構造）と直接統合する。","ko":"내장澄清 워크플로를 갖춘 포괄적인 제품 요구사항 문서를 생성하며, 3-5개의 기본적인澄清 질문과 문자 옵션을 사용하여 실행 가능한 사양을 생성한다. 작업공간 모드 지원을 통해 Aha Loop의 자율 개발 프레임워크(.aha-loop/tasks/ 디렉토리 구조)와 직접 통합된다.","es":"Genera documentos de requisitos de producto integrales con flujos de trabajo de clarificación integrados, que presentan 3-5 preguntas esenciales de clarificación con opciones con letras antes de producir especificaciones accionables. Se integra directamente con el marco de desarrollo autónomo de Aha Loop a través del soporte de modo de espacio de trabajo (estructura de directorio .aha-loop/tareas/).","fr":"Génère des documents de spécifications de produit complets avec des flux de travail de clarification intégrés, présentant 3-5 questions de clarification essentielles avec des options lettées avant de produire des spécifications actionnables. S''intègre directement avec le cadre de développement autonome d''Aha Loop via le support du mode d''espace de travail (structure de répertoire .aha-loop/tâches/).","de":"Erzeugt umfassende Produktspezifikationsdokumente mit integrierten Klärungsworkflows, die 3-5 wesentliche Klärungsfragen mit Buchstabenoptionen vor der Erzeugung von ausführbaren Spezifikationen enthalten. Integriert sich direkt in das autonome Entwicklungsfachwerk von Aha Loop durch Arbeitsraummodus-Unterstützung (Verzeichnisstruktur .aha-loop/aufgaben/).","pt":"Gera documentos abrangentes de Requisitos do Produto com fluxos de esclarecimento integrados, apresentando 3-5 perguntas essenciais de esclarecimento com opções em letras antes de produzir especificações executáveis. Integra-se diretamente com o framework de desenvolvimento autônomo da Aha Loop por meio do suporte ao modo de espaço de trabalho (estrutura de diretório .aha-loop/tasks/).","ru":"Генерирует всесторонние документы требований продукта с встроенными рабочими процессами разъяснения, в которых представлены 3-5 основных вопросов разъяснения с буквенными вариантами ответов до создания выполнимых спецификаций. Интегрируется напрямую с автономным фреймворком разработки Aha Loop через поддержку режима рабочего пространства (структура директории .aha-loop/tasks/).","ar":"يتوفر على وثائق شاملة لمتطلبات المنتج مع سير عمل توضيحية مدمجة، وتقدم 3-5 أسئلة توضيحية أساسية مع خيارات محددة بحروف قبل إنتاج مواصفات قابلة للتنفيذ. يتكامل مباشرة مع إطار عمل التطوير المستقل من Aha Loop من خلال دعم وضع مساحة العمل (هيكل دليل .aha-loop/tasks/)."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating PRD creation for feature development cycles","Generating structured requirements with built-in validation questions","Integrating documentation into autonomous AI development workflows","Creating implementation-ready specifications for development teams"],"zh":["自动化PRD创建用于功能开发周期","生成具有内置验证问题的结构化需求","将文档集成到自主AI开发工作流中","为开发团队创建可实施的规格"],"ja":["機能開発サイクル用のPRD作成の自動化","内蔵の検証質問を備えた構造化要件の生成","文書化を自律的AI開発ワークフローに統合する","開発チーム用の実装可能な仕様の作成"],"ko":["기능 개발 주기용 PRD 생성 자동화","내장 유효성 검사 질문을 갖춘 구조화된 요구사항 생성","문서화를 자율적 AI 개발 워크플로에 통합","개발 팀을 위한 구현 가능한 사양 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de PRD para ciclos de desarrollo de funciones","Generación de requisitos estructurados con preguntas de validación integradas","Integración de la documentación en flujos de trabajo de desarrollo de IA autónomos","Creación de especificaciones listas para la implementación para equipos de desarrollo"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de PRD pour les cycles de développement de fonctionnalités","Génération de spécifications structurées avec des questions de validation intégrées","Intégration de la documentation dans les flux de travail de développement d''IA autonome","Création de spécifications prêtes à l''implémentation pour les équipes de développement"],"de":["Automatisierung der PRD-Erstellung für Funktionsentwicklungszyklen","Erzeugung von strukturierten Anforderungen mit integrierten Überprüfungsfragen","Integration der Dokumentation in autonome AI-Entwicklungsworkflows","Erstellung von implementierungsreifen Spezifikationen für Entwicklerteams"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de PRD para ciclos de desenvolvimento de recursos","Gerar requisitos estruturados com perguntas de validação integradas","Integrar a documentação em fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento de IA autônoma","Criar especificações prontas para implementação para equipes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание PRD для циклов разработки функций","Генерировать структурированные требования с встроенными вопросами валидации","Интегрировать документацию в автономные рабочие процессы разработки ИИ","Создавать готовые к реализации спецификации для команд разработки"],"ar":["تحويل processo من إنشاء وثائق متطلبات المنتج تلقائيًا لدورات تطوير الميزات","توليد متطلبات منظمة مع أسئلة التحقق المدمجة","دمج الوثائق في سير عمل تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي المستقلة","إنشاء مواصفات جاهزة للتطبيق لفريق التطوير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires workspace mode for Aha Loop integration","Dependent on user responses to clarification questions","Output directory structure specific to Aha Loop framework"],"zh":["需要工作空间模式来集成Aha Loop","依赖于用户对澄清问题的响应","输出目录结构特定于Aha Loop框架"],"ja":["Aha Loop統合のためにワークスペースモードが必要","明確化質問へのユーザーの応答に依存する","出力ディレクトリ構造はAha Loopフレームワークに特有"],"ko":["Aha Loop 통합을 위해 작업공간 모드 필요","澄명 질문에 대한 사용자 응답에 의존","출력 디렉토리 구조는 Aha Loop 프레임워크에 특정"],"es":["Requiere el modo de espacio de trabajo para la integración con Aha Loop","Dependiente de las respuestas del usuario a las preguntas de clarificación","Estructura de directorio de salida específica del marco de Aha Loop"],"fr":["Nécessite le mode d''espace de travail pour l''intégration avec Aha Loop","Dépend des réponses de l''utilisateur aux questions de clarification","Structure de répertoire de sortie spécifique au cadre d''Aha Loop"],"de":["Benötigt den Arbeitsraummodus für die Integration mit Aha Loop","Abhängig von den Benutzerantworten auf Klärungsfragen","Ausgabeverzeichnisstruktur spezifisch für das Aha-Loop-Framework"],"pt":["Exige o modo de espaço de trabalho para integração com a Aha Loop","Dependente das respostas do usuário às perguntas de esclarecimento","Estrutura de diretório de saída específica do framework da Aha Loop"],"ru":["Требует режима рабочего пространства для интеграции с Aha Loop","Зависит от ответов пользователя на вопросы разъяснения","Структура выходного директория специфична для фреймворка Aha Loop"],"ar":["يتطلب وضع مساحة العمل لتكامل مع Aha Loop","يعتمد على استجابات المستخدم للأسئلة التوضيحية","هيكل دليل الإخراج محدد بإطار عمل Aha Loop"]},"version":3},"qualityScore":75}');
